INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 1, 1, 1, 'Chapter 1 God’s Purpose For Man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 1, 2, 1, 'God had a great purpose when He made man. When we turn to the first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 1, 3, 1, 'chapter in the Bible, we see how God made animals and man on the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 1, 4, 1, 'day. Many of us know that man was created on the sixth day, but it was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 1, 5, 1, 'on the same day that He made the animals as well and there was a reason');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 1, 6, 1, 'why God did that. He made the animals on the first part of the sixth day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 1, 7, 1, 'and then He made man on the second part of the sixth day (Genesis');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 1, 8, 1, '1:24-25). The previous day, He made the birds and fish and all. There is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 1, 9, 1, 'quite a bit of a difference between birds and fishes and human beings.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 1, 10, 1, 'But when you look at the physical constitution of animals, there''s a lot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 1, 11, 1, 'of similarity between animals and men. Both animals and men have eyes,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 1, 12, 1, 'legs, internal organs made of the same dust. But there is one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 1, 13, 1, 'significant difference and that is what makes the difference between');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 1, 14, 1, 'animals and human beings. If we don''t recognize that, then man sinks to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 1, 15, 1, 'the level of animals. That was the message which God was trying to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 1, 16, 1, 'convey to man by creating him on the same day as the animals. God made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 1, 17, 1, 'man and animals from the same dust and both have very similar internal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 1, 18, 1, 'organs and external limbs but yet with one significant difference; God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 1, 19, 1, 'breathed into man and man became a living soul. That''s because God gave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 1, 20, 1, 'him a spirit. In 1 Thessalonians 5:23, we read that man is spirit, soul');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 1, 21, 1, 'and body whereas an animal does not have a spirit. An animal has got a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 1, 22, 1, 'mind; it can think and has feelings. The dogs have got feelings just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 1, 23, 1, 'like human beings, but they don''t have a spirit. God breathed into man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 1, 24, 1, 'and man got a part of Him which animals don''t have. If man does not give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 1, 25, 1, 'prominence to that part of his being which animals don''t have, he very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 1, 26, 1, 'soon sinks to the level of animals. That’s what we see in the world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 1, 27, 1, 'around us. When a person gives his life to Christ, God seeks to bring');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 1, 28, 1, 'him back to that place where Adam was when he was created with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 2, 1, 1, 'spirit having preeminence and the most important part in his life before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 2, 2, 1, 'sin came.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 2, 3, 1, 'When sin came, man''s spirit died. His contact with God died. When man''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 2, 4, 1, 'spirit is dead, he begins to live just like an animal because that most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 2, 5, 1, 'important part of his being is dead because of sin. Christ comes to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 2, 6, 1, 'revive that and to bring life into that spirit and that''s what happens');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 2, 7, 1, 'when a person is born again. When God puts His Holy Spirit within man,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 2, 8, 1, 'that innermost part of us gets revived and it becomes alive. It''s like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 2, 9, 1, 'resurrection and that''s why Christians are commanded to be baptized');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 2, 10, 1, 'because in baptism we''re testifying that a resurrection has taken place');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 2, 11, 1, 'within our spirit. Once the Spirit has become alive in us, we constantly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 2, 12, 1, 'find ourselves with a choice now to live by this spirit, this breath of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 2, 13, 1, 'God within us or to live according to the passions of this body of dust');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 2, 14, 1, 'just like the animals. So, we find ourselves in between two pulls. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 2, 15, 1, 'all know that there are desires and passions in this body that pull us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 2, 16, 1, 'downward to the things of earth all the time to do many things which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 2, 17, 1, 'lead us into sin, and which lead us even to destroy this wonderful body');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 2, 18, 1, 'that God has created. At the same time, when Christ comes into us and we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 2, 19, 1, 'open our beings to God''s Holy Spirit, we find another pull within us. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 2, 20, 1, 'you are a true Christian, you have experienced that pull calling you to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 2, 21, 1, 'overcome these passions and to live for the things that are eternal and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 2, 22, 1, 'for the things of heaven and of God. No animal ever feels that pull.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 2, 23, 1, 'So, we see here in Genesis 1 that when God created man, He said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 2, 24, 1, 'something. When He created all the other animals, He did not describe a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 2, 25, 1, 'purpose that He had for them in connection with Himself but when He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 2, 26, 1, 'going to create man, He said these words in Genesis 1:26, “Let Us make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 2, 27, 1, 'man in our image.” Here is a statement of purpose before man is created.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 2, 28, 1, 'Whereas all the other bits of creation we read off from verse 3 onwards');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 3, 1, 1, 'of Genesis 1 is just God speaking and bringing things to life. God spoke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 3, 2, 1, 'something and then the dry land appeared, and God said something else');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 3, 3, 1, 'and the sun and the moon appeared. God said something then the fish and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 3, 4, 1, 'the birds appeared. Similar as for the animals, He did the same thing by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 3, 5, 1, 'saying, “Let the earth bring forth living creatures” (Genesis 1:24). But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 3, 6, 1, 'God did not say, “Let there be a man and let there be a woman” like He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 3, 7, 1, 'said for all the rest of creation. Man was to be special, more important');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 3, 8, 1, 'than everything else that God had created because He was going to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 3, 9, 1, 'made in the image of God which even the angels in heaven do not have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 3, 10, 1, 'that privilege. So, we read in Genesis 1:26 that God said, “Let Us make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 3, 11, 1, 'man in our image according to our likeness” and when man lives according');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 3, 12, 1, 'to that and reflects God''s image, he has authority. Think of the phrase');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 3, 13, 1, 'used in verse 26, “Let them rule.” Man and woman were created by God to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 3, 14, 1, 'be kings and queens to rule over their passions, to rule over everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 3, 15, 1, 'on this earth. They were to be kings but see what happens in Genesis');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 3, 16, 1, 'Chapter 3 when man sins. He immediately becomes a slave. The king has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 3, 17, 1, 'descended to becoming a slave in a moment just by one act of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 3, 18, 1, 'disobedience.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 3, 19, 1, 'Here is how Adam and Eve sinned in the Garden of Eden: there was the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 3, 20, 1, 'voice of God within his spirit saying that he should not take part of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 3, 21, 1, 'that tree that God had forbidden, but he didn''t listen to that voice. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 3, 22, 1, 'responded to the pull of the dust part of him. You and I also have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 3, 23, 1, 'dust part of us and a spirit part of us; the spirit part is that which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 3, 24, 1, 'pulls us upward toward God and the dust part is that which pulls us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 3, 25, 1, 'downward to the things of earth. It''s not that we can''t use the things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 3, 26, 1, 'of earth because when God sent Adam and Eve into that garden, they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 3, 27, 1, 'thousands of wonderful trees there and God is the one who had created');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 3, 28, 1, 'Adam with a desire for food. Hunger is something that God is placed in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 4, 1, 1, 'the human body and the desire for food is not something evil or sinful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 4, 2, 1, 'It is when it is used in a wrong way that it becomes sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 4, 3, 1, 'God didn''t say to Adam, “You shouldn''t need anything, deny yourself and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 4, 4, 1, 'be an ascetic and fast” No, He said you can go in there and eat anything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 4, 5, 1, 'you want but here''s something that you shouldn''t eat. When Adam and Eve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 4, 6, 1, 'stood before that tree, they were faced with two options; the pull of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 4, 7, 1, 'the voice of God telling them to live by His standards and here was the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 4, 8, 1, 'pull of the body pulling them towards that very attractive fruit. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 4, 9, 1, 'fact, it says in Genesis 3:6 that the woman saw something in the tree');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 4, 10, 1, 'with her eyes. it was good for food and it was a delight to her eyes;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 4, 11, 1, 'the fruit of the tree appealed to her body. It’s good to keep this in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 4, 12, 1, 'mind because we live in a world where there are so many things that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 4, 13, 1, 'appeal to our senses, and there are things that God has created which we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 4, 14, 1, 'can enjoy, and that also things that God is forbidden. If we allow our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 4, 15, 1, 'senses to respond to things that God has forbidden, and we allow this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 4, 16, 1, 'dust part of us to pull us downward and we live for that and do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 4, 17, 1, 'respond to the voice of conscience within us pulling us upward over a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 4, 18, 1, 'period of time we gradually become like the animals. You know when Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 4, 19, 1, 'picked up a little child, He said that child was the closest thing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 4, 20, 1, 'heaven on the face of the earth. When the disciples asked Him, who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 4, 21, 1, 'the greatest in God''s kingdom, He picked up a child and said this is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 4, 22, 1, 'greatest one in God''s kingdom. A little baby is perhaps the closest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 4, 23, 1, 'thing to heaven that we can see on the face of the earth. If you look');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 4, 24, 1, 'into the eyes of a little baby, you see the purest eyes. They are purest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 4, 25, 1, 'thing that we can see on earth closest to heaven. But as that little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 4, 26, 1, 'child grows up and responds to the dust part of it, it gradually becomes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 4, 27, 1, 'more and more like an animal and unless that child responds to the call');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 4, 28, 1, 'of Christ at some time in its life and allows God to revive its spirit,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 5, 1, 1, 'it''ll just sink lower and lower. You see how many human beings around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 5, 2, 1, 'the world do some abominable things which even animals don''t do.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 5, 3, 1, 'So, when God created man, He breathed into him and his purpose was that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 5, 4, 1, 'man and woman should rule. Man should not be a slave. I want to say to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 5, 5, 1, 'you in Jesus name that God never intended you to be a slave. You are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 5, 6, 1, 'meant to be a slave to guilt, to fear, to discouragement, to sin, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 5, 7, 1, 'your passions, to the fear of men or any such thing. God wants you to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 5, 8, 1, 'an overcomer; to rule over everything. The only way to do that is if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 5, 9, 1, 'respond to the upward call of God all the time and ask for His power to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 5, 10, 1, 'deny the pull-downwards.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 5, 11, 1, 'So, what was God''s purpose when He created man? It says here to reflect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 5, 12, 1, 'His image. Man was supposed to be God''s representative on earth and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 5, 13, 1, 'that''s where he failed miserably. The apostle Paul uses the word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 5, 14, 1, '“ambassador” in 2 Corinthians 5. We are ambassadors for Christ (2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 5, 15, 1, 'Corinthians 5:20). Now you know that an ambassador of a nation is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 5, 16, 1, 'representing that nation. The ambassador of Thailand will represent the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 5, 17, 1, 'country Thailand. The ambassador of Australia will represent the country');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 5, 18, 1, 'Australia. An ambassador of Christ is to represent Christ by his conduct');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 5, 19, 1, 'and his behavior. That’s what we see here in Genesis 1 when God said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 5, 20, 1, '“Let us make man in our image.” There were already millions and millions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 5, 21, 1, 'of angels that God had created but none of them could be His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 5, 22, 1, 'ambassadors; they could be His servants and they could do a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 5, 23, 1, 'things that God told them to do. Those angels have some supernatural');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 5, 24, 1, 'powers, but they cannot represent Him. In fact, in all of creation there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 5, 25, 1, 'was nothing that could represent God. It was finally when God made man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 5, 26, 1, 'that He had a representative. He finally had a man who could reflect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 5, 27, 1, 'what He was like. It’s because God made man with that in His image that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 5, 28, 1, 'man has the capacity to fellowship with God. There is a part inside us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 6, 1, 1, 'which will never be satisfied till it''s occupied by God Himself and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 6, 2, 1, 'that''s why man is restless. That is also why a lot of people commit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 6, 3, 1, 'suicide; they are frustrated. Even people who have a lot of money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 6, 4, 1, 'finally end up committing suicide. A lot of people think in this world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 6, 5, 1, 'that if you have plenty of money, all your problems are solved but there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 6, 6, 1, 'are so many cases of people who have made a lot of money finally commit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 6, 7, 1, 'suicide. Why? Because there is this, we can say a God-shaped vacuum');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 6, 8, 1, 'inside us which cannot be satisfied with money or sex or any other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 6, 9, 1, 'earthly pleasure. You can have position, you can have honor, you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 6, 10, 1, 'have wealth, you can have everything, but this can only be satisfied');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 6, 11, 1, 'when the Creator who created man for Himself is given that rightful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 6, 12, 1, 'place within.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 6, 13, 1, 'So, what was God''s purpose for man? It was that man should be a ruler');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 6, 14, 1, 'and that man should represent Him. He also said that man must be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 6, 15, 1, 'fruitful and multiply (Genesis 1:28). God did not want just one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 6, 16, 1, 'representative representing Him on the earth; not just Adam and Eve but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 6, 17, 1, 'many others. He wanted them to have children who would also represent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 6, 18, 1, 'Him. So, when we see God''s original purpose for man, we see how terribly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 6, 19, 1, 'man has failed. Even many who claim to be Christians and who say they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 6, 20, 1, 'have received Christ are not representing Him. We can ask ourselves. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 6, 21, 1, 'and I can ask ourselves, are we representing Christ correctly? Do the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 6, 22, 1, 'people around us see something of what God is like? Unless we see this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 6, 23, 1, 'as the purpose of our life, we''re not going to be able to fulfill it. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 6, 24, 1, 'can''t fulfill a purpose until we see what that purpose is. A lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 6, 25, 1, 'Christians haven''t seen clearly what God''s purpose is. They don''t seem');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 6, 26, 1, 'to recognize that when they sin or do something un-Christlike, they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 6, 27, 1, 'failing God miserably and failing terribly in the purpose with which God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 6, 28, 1, 'has placed them on the earth. We''re not here just to go to church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 7, 1, 1, 'services, study the Bible and increase in the knowledge of God and once');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 7, 2, 1, 'in a week and go and sing and worship God. All that is good, but the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 7, 3, 1, 'ultimate purpose of all of that is that every single day of our life and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 7, 4, 1, 'every single moment of our lives, we''re reflecting the nature of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 7, 5, 1, 'Under the Old Testament, this was just not possible. it''s only possible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 7, 6, 1, 'after the day of Pentecost. The Holy Spirit has come in order to fulfill');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 7, 7, 1, 'that original purpose which God had for man which was frustrated by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 7, 8, 1, 'devil coming in and making Adam sin spoiling God''s purpose and which was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 7, 9, 1, 'once again restored when Christ came and lifted men back up to the place');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 7, 10, 1, 'where the original purpose could be fulfilled. So, if we were to draw a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 7, 11, 1, 'graph of God''s purpose for man, it would be a straight line that God had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 7, 12, 1, 'in mind for Adam. It would be upward line because God''s purpose for Adam');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 7, 13, 1, 'was that he should grow into a knowledge of God, but very soon he fell.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 7, 14, 1, 'So, in that graph, you have a big dip downwards and from here Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 7, 15, 1, 'came to lift us back up to the original purpose of God for Adam. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 7, 16, 1, 'draw the original purpose of God as a straight graph line going upwards');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 7, 17, 1, 'and right at the beginning, there''s a serious dip because of man''s fall.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 7, 18, 1, 'Now we''re here at the bottom and when Christ saves us and gives as a new');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 7, 19, 1, 'birth, we''re brought back up to that line which God originally purposed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 7, 20, 1, 'for Adam. We are not to get stuck there, but we are to move along that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 7, 21, 1, 'original purpose by knowing Him and partaking of His nature.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 7, 22, 1, 'Many Christians don''t understand this and they think salvation is just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 7, 23, 1, 'being brought up from the pit up to this level and then remaining there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 7, 24, 1, 'forever and then they think perhaps God''s purpose is now I must go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 7, 25, 1, 'around sharing this with other people and telling other people about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 7, 26, 1, 'Christ dying for our sins and get other people to come over there. All');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 7, 27, 1, 'that is wonderful, but the whole purpose of God bringing us back up to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 7, 28, 1, 'that top of the straight line is to fulfill God''s original purpose and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 8, 1, 1, 'if that''s not being fulfilled then we can say a major part of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 8, 2, 1, 'purpose of our redemption is not being fulfilled. If all that we receive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 8, 3, 1, 'is the forgiveness of our sins and the cleansing of our heart and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 8, 4, 1, 'conscience from sin, then we haven''t understood all of God''s purpose. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 8, 5, 1, 'you have a cup in your dining room and you wash it nicely and clean it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 8, 6, 1, 'what''s the purpose of cleaning and washing a cup. It''s not for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 8, 7, 1, 'decoration. We don''t keep cups for decoration. A cup is meant to hold');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 8, 8, 1, 'some liquid which we drink. It could be milk, it could be water, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 8, 9, 1, 'could be a cup of coffee or tea, but the whole purpose of cleaning that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 8, 10, 1, 'cup is so that it can be filled with something. In the same way, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 8, 11, 1, 'whole purpose of Christ''s coming and bringing us back and cleansing our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 8, 12, 1, 'heart is so that He can finally bring us back to that place where the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 8, 13, 1, 'original purpose of God can be fulfilled in our life which is described');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 8, 14, 1, 'here, “Let us make man in our image.” That''s where Adam failed. Now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 8, 15, 1, 'Christ has brought me back to that place where I''m supposed to reflect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 8, 16, 1, 'the image of God. I’m supposed to be an ambassador of Jesus Christ. I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 8, 17, 1, 'supposed to show other people what Christ is like. If I see that is my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 8, 18, 1, 'calling, anytime I fail and slip up in that calling, I repent for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 8, 19, 1, 'failing God terribly. It’s a serious matter that I have failed God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 8, 20, 1, 'terribly and I need to come back to that original purpose and fulfill');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 8, 21, 1, 'it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 8, 22, 1, 'So, as I said in the beginning, there are these two pulls; the pull');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 8, 23, 1, 'downward because of our body made of dust, and the pull upward, which we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 8, 24, 1, 'all who are born again experience, the voice of the Spirit in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 8, 25, 1, 'conscience lifting us up to the things of heaven. Here is where I need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 8, 26, 1, 'the power of the Holy Spirit if I''m to keep responding to this upward');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 8, 27, 1, 'pull. Paul once said that he wanted to lay hold of that for which Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 8, 28, 1, 'had laid hold of him (Philippians 3:13). He knew that Christ had laid');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 9, 1, 1, 'hold of him with a purpose. Now I want to tell you God''s purpose for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 9, 2, 1, 'Paul was not just that he should save souls and build churches. God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 9, 3, 1, 'purpose for Paul was that he might reflect God''s image and he might be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 9, 4, 1, 'ruler. From that position, he was to serve God by saving souls and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 9, 5, 1, 'building churches. When God created Adam, it''s not because He needed a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 9, 6, 1, 'servant. No, He already had millions of Angels. He didn''t say, “Well,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 9, 7, 1, 'we''ve got a garden here and we need somebody to look after that garden.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 9, 8, 1, 'No. That''s not why He created Adam. He created Adam to have fellowship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 9, 9, 1, 'with him. That''s why as soon as He created Adam, the very first day that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 9, 10, 1, 'Adam existed was a holiday for him. It was a Sabbath, the seventh day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 9, 11, 1, 'for God but the first day for Adam and he had fellowship with God. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 9, 12, 1, 'was trying to tell Adam that the most important thing I want in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 9, 13, 1, 'life is fellowship. He was saying to Adam, “I want to fellowship with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 9, 14, 1, 'you and it''s only then that you can reflect my nature.” It’s something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 9, 15, 1, 'like electricity. If you want a bulb to burn, it''s got to be plugged');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 9, 16, 1, 'into the socket and when man is in connection with God then God''s nature');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 9, 17, 1, 'comes through.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 9, 18, 1, 'A man is like a bulb. We have the capacity to reflect God''s nature but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 9, 19, 1, 'cannot produce that on our own. A bulb cannot burn on its own; it''s got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 9, 20, 1, 'the capacity to burn and give a lot of light, but on its own it cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 9, 21, 1, 'give that light. It is only when it''s plugged into a socket and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 9, 22, 1, 'electric power flows in that it burns. This is a beautiful picture of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 9, 23, 1, 'the way God wanted Adam and Eve to live connected to Him with the life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 9, 24, 1, 'of God flowing into them and being manifested through them and that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 9, 25, 1, 'where he failed. So, God''s not asking us to overcome these passions on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 9, 26, 1, 'our own. Every one of us has desires pulling us down—what we call sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 9, 27, 1, 'God says, “Just be connected to Me. Allow My Spirit to come and fill');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 9, 28, 1, 'your heart.” And then just like that bulb burns almost effortlessly, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 10, 1, 1, 'Holy Spirit will be able to give us that power to live the type of life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 10, 2, 1, 'God wanted Adam to live, and that He wants you to live.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 10, 3, 2, 'Chapter 2 God’s Provision For Man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 10, 4, 2, 'In our last study, we were looking at the purpose with which God created');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 10, 5, 2, 'man. We saw that man was created to reflect God''s image and to be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 10, 6, 2, 'ruler. He was created with a body made of dust but a spirit which could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 10, 7, 2, 'respond to God. Whether we fulfill the purpose with which God created us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 10, 8, 2, 'or not depends on which of these pulls we respond to. An animal responds');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 10, 9, 2, 'only to the pull of his body; all its interested in is food, sleep, sex');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 10, 10, 2, 'and perhaps take care of the little ones when they are born. When a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 10, 11, 2, 'is interested only in food, sleep, sex and to take care of his family,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 10, 12, 2, 'such a man is not doing anything more than any animal does for its');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 10, 13, 2, 'family. It''s when a man responds to the Spirit, to the voice of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 10, 14, 2, 'speaking in his conscience that he rises above the level of animals and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 10, 15, 2, 'lives as the son of God as God intended him to be. Why is it that so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 10, 16, 2, 'many Christians don''t respond to the call of God in their life and to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 10, 17, 2, 'what God wants them to be and to surrender their lives to Him? It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 10, 18, 2, 'because they feel that if they do their own will and please themselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 10, 19, 2, 'and respond just to the desires of the body, they can live a happier');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 10, 20, 2, 'life. This is the great deception of Satan. He has portrayed God as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 10, 21, 2, 'someone who''s come to spoil our lives like a spoilsport who doesn''t want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 10, 22, 2, 'us to have any fun or enjoyment which is not true.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 10, 23, 2, 'Jesus tried to remove that wrong image of God from the people in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 10, 24, 2, 'time. Throughout history, one of Satan''s greatest weapons has been to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 10, 25, 2, 'portray a wrong image of God before people so that they will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 10, 26, 2, 'surrender their life to Him but will hold back. And if God can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 10, 27, 2, 'portrayed as someone who''s out to make your life unhappy or miserable');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 10, 28, 2, 'then the devil has succeeded in preventing man from surrendering himself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 11, 1, 2, 'to such a God. Most Christians that I''ve met, and this is true even in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 11, 2, 2, 'people in other religions have a feeling that God is not someone you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 11, 3, 2, 'be very friendly with. They feel God is not someone who''s out to do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 11, 4, 2, 'good, He''s out to make your life miserable and this is a lie. When we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 11, 5, 2, 'are called to be ambassadors of Christ, part of our calling is to show');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 11, 6, 2, 'forth this lie of the devil. God intends the very best for you; whenever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 11, 7, 2, 'He tells you not to do something, it’s for your good even though we may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 11, 8, 2, 'not realize it. A little one-year-old child or two-year-old child');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 11, 9, 2, 'doesn''t understand why you tell him not to play around with a snake or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 11, 10, 2, 'with a knife or with fire. We know that''s harmful for that child. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 11, 11, 2, 'doesn''t know how to use a knife or a fire, they can hurt themselves. Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 11, 12, 2, 'you think those little children understand it? They disobey and burn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 11, 13, 2, 'themselves in the fire or they cut themselves with a blade or a knife.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 11, 14, 2, 'Man is exactly like that. When God tells us not to do something, it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 11, 15, 2, 'because He knows that particular thing will destroy us. There may be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 11, 16, 2, 'temporary pleasure out of doing it but in the long run, it destroys us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 11, 17, 2, 'and that''s why He tells us not to do something and that''s why God told');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 11, 18, 2, 'Adam in Genesis 2 not to eat from a particular tree.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 11, 19, 2, 'Now there''s more than one reason for that which we can look at. In one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 11, 20, 2, 'way, God was testing him. God was testing Adam to see whether he would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 11, 21, 2, 'respond to God. God can never make a man holy without that person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 11, 22, 2, 'choosing to be holy. God doesn''t force us to be holy. He was not going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 11, 23, 2, 'to force Adam to be holy if he didn''t want to be holy; Adam had to make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 11, 24, 2, 'that choice. So, if God had sent Adam into the Garden of Eden and said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 11, 25, 2, '“you do whatever you like, eat whatever you like. I''m not going to place');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 11, 26, 2, 'any restrictions on you,” there would be no opportunity for Adam to make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 11, 27, 2, 'a choice. When he doesn''t have to make a choice, he cannot be holy. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 11, 28, 2, 'when God gives us the opportunity to choose that we can become holy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 12, 1, 2, 'What was the choice that confronted Adam? It is very similar to what we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 12, 2, 2, 'were considering in our last chapter. There was something God had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 12, 3, 2, 'created; a very beautiful tree with very beautiful fruit and that was on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 12, 4, 2, 'one side. On the other side was God Himself and His command not to take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 12, 5, 2, 'part of that. So, when Adam and Eve stood before that tree, they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 12, 6, 2, 'standing between that which was created and the Creator. They had to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 12, 7, 2, 'make a choice: which do you want now? Do you want what''s created or do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 12, 8, 2, 'you want God Himself? And you know what Adam chose — he chose what was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 12, 9, 2, 'created and that was the origin of sin in the human race. The devil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 12, 10, 2, 'tempted him just to choose that was just created. The devil didn''t tempt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 12, 11, 2, 'Eve to kill her husband or slap him or any such thing or even be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 12, 12, 2, 'un-submissive to him, he just tempted her to choose that which was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 12, 13, 2, 'created over the Creator; he knew that that would be enough to destroy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 12, 14, 2, 'her. When she offered the fruit to Adam, he also faced that choice:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 12, 15, 2, 'shall I choose the one who created me, or shall I choose this lovely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 12, 16, 2, 'thing that He''s created? Adam chose the lovely thing that was created,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 12, 17, 2, 'and he destroyed his life too. Now today every one of us face the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 12, 18, 2, 'choice - there are many attractive things that God has created but some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 12, 19, 2, 'of those things are also forbidden.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 12, 20, 2, 'For example, God has not given every woman for you to lust after or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 12, 21, 2, 'commit adultery with or to have sex with. He gives you a wife, but when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 12, 22, 2, 'you want something which God has forbidden, someone other than your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 12, 23, 2, 'wife, and you want to in a wrong way enjoy her sexually, you''re choosing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 12, 24, 2, 'something created, and rejecting the commandment of God. It''s exactly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 12, 25, 2, 'the same choice that Eve made when she chose something attractive God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 12, 26, 2, 'had created and rejected God. It could be money. Money is something very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 12, 27, 2, 'attractive God has created but He never intended that man should live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 12, 28, 2, 'for it or worship it or choose that above God. Do you know the number of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 13, 1, 2, 'people even among believers, preachers, pastors who have chosen money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 13, 2, 2, 'above God? There is a tremendous attractiveness in wealth. Why has God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 13, 3, 2, 'made it so attractive? Why did God make the tree of knowledge of good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 13, 4, 2, 'and evil so attractive? If all that God wanted was to prevent Adam from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 13, 5, 2, 'ever partaking of that tree, all He had to do was make the tree very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 13, 6, 2, 'ugly, repulsive, smelly, full of thorns or something like that and Adam');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 13, 7, 2, 'and Eve would never have gone anywhere near it. But then they wouldn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 13, 8, 2, 'have been tested. If something God has created is ugly and repulsive and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 13, 9, 2, 'smelly, the fact that you reject that and choose God doesn''t prove');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 13, 10, 2, 'anything. The test is when God makes something that is really attractive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 13, 11, 2, 'and your whole being rises up in response to that attraction and when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 13, 12, 2, 'you say “no” to that and you choose God, then you are on the pathway of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 13, 13, 2, 'holiness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 13, 14, 2, 'No man can be holy without his making the choice that I want my Creator');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 13, 15, 2, 'more than what He created. You know even a man like Abraham had to make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 13, 16, 2, 'that choice 50 years after God first called him. When God first called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 13, 17, 2, 'him, this man was 75 years old and was living comfortably in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 13, 18, 2, 'hometown of Ur of the Chaldeans (Genesis 12). God called him to leave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 13, 19, 2, 'that comfort and security and the enjoyment of the city he had grown up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 13, 20, 2, 'in. He had to leave house, lands and everything he had to follow the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 13, 21, 2, 'Lord. What was the choice Abraham had to make? All this attractive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 13, 22, 2, 'created things or God; what do you want? Abraham obeyed, that''s why you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 13, 23, 2, 'read of him in the book. If he had not obeyed and had said like Eve,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 13, 24, 2, '“No, I would rather choose this created thing than you,” you''ve never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 13, 25, 2, 'heard of Abraham. God would have chosen somebody else. 50 years after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 13, 26, 2, 'that, the Bible says in Genesis 22 that God tested him again. In fact,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 13, 27, 2, 'He tested him numerous times but always the test was a choice between');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 13, 28, 2, 'what God had created and God Himself. We read in Genesis 13 of a time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 14, 1, 2, 'when there was a conflict between Abraham''s servants and Lot’s servants.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 14, 2, 2, 'The conflict was over property and pasture for that sheep. Those are the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 14, 3, 2, 'things they valued in those days because their wealth was in cattle and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 14, 4, 2, 'sheep and they needed pasture. God was watching what is going to be the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 14, 5, 2, 'attitude that Lot is going to take in this situation and what''s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 14, 6, 2, 'attitude that Abraham is going to take. There you see how these two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 14, 7, 2, 'people responded in completely different ways. The choice before them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 14, 8, 2, 'was God or all this attractive thing that He''s created. We read there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 14, 9, 2, 'that Lot lifted up his eyes and looked at Sodom which was a very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 14, 10, 2, 'attractive place and he chose that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 14, 11, 2, 'He wanted this attractive thing even though the people there were living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 14, 12, 2, 'in sin. It was well known that there were all types of sinful things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 14, 13, 2, 'that were going on there and here was Lot taking his family to go and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 14, 14, 2, 'live in that sinful surrounding. It was a place where he could make a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 14, 15, 2, 'lot of money, so he chose to go there. The result was that he lost his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 14, 16, 2, 'wife, his children and he almost lost his own life. Abraham on the other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 14, 17, 2, 'hand allowed Lot to choose first even though he was the senior of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 14, 18, 2, 'two. Abraham essentially said, “I want God. God will choose for me; I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 14, 19, 2, 'will not choose for myself.” So, he told Lot, “You choose for yourself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 14, 20, 2, 'If you go left, I’ll go to the right and if you got the right, I’ll go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 14, 21, 2, 'to the left.” The Bible says Lot chose for himself. What did he choose?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 14, 22, 2, 'Just like Eve and Adam, he chose that which was just created but Abraham');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 14, 23, 2, 'chose God. And you know because he chose God he didn''t lose out. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 14, 24, 2, 'said, “Abraham, I''ve seen what you have chosen; you''ve chosen me and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 14, 25, 2, 'because you''ve done that, I will give you all this land including what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 14, 26, 2, 'Lot chose.” You know when you honor God and seek Him, you don''t lose out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 14, 27, 2, 'even materially.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 14, 28, 2, 'Jesus Himself said that; If you seek God first, His kingdom and His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 15, 1, 2, 'righteousness, even these earthly things that you need will be added to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 15, 2, 2, 'you at the right time and in the right quantity; not too much to destroy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 15, 3, 2, 'you and not too little to starve you but just the right amount. Whether');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 15, 4, 2, 'it''s money or comfort or house or anything. God provides everything but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 15, 5, 2, 'he wants us to choose Him. That''s what He wanted Adam to do; that''s what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 15, 6, 2, 'He created him for. Will you choose Me above everything created? That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 15, 7, 2, 'what He expected from Abraham. Now I want to say to you dear friends');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 15, 8, 2, 'that''s what He''s expecting from you. Every day of your life you''re going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 15, 9, 2, 'to make a choice; you''re going to make a choice between that which is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 15, 10, 2, 'created and the creator Himself. Was Adam going to lose out on something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 15, 11, 2, 'if He chose God? What does man look for? In young people as they grow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 15, 12, 2, 'up, they want a job, they want a home and they want a marriage partner.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 15, 13, 2, 'These are the main things young people look for as they grow up and get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 15, 14, 2, 'into their 20s. Think of Adam; did God make some provision for Adam in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 15, 15, 2, 'these three areas? He certainly did! We read there that before God made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 15, 16, 2, 'Adam, He had already made this beautiful garden as a home. God had made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 15, 17, 2, 'a wonderful home called the Garden of Eden and then He made men. What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 15, 18, 2, 'about employment? God had already planned an employment for Adam as the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 15, 19, 2, 'gardener in this garden. What about a marriage partner? God had already');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 15, 20, 2, 'planned to create a woman to be his wife. Adam didn''t even have to go to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 15, 21, 2, 'God and tell Him, “I need something here.” That''s what we see right at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 15, 22, 2, 'the beginning of the Bible, that God knew Adam’s need and provided for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 15, 23, 2, 'it even before Adam asked Him. God provided a home for him; He provided');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 15, 24, 2, 'a job for him and He provided a marriage partner for him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 15, 25, 2, 'God is a good God! He''s just the same today and He provides for His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 15, 26, 2, 'children in exactly the same way today if we trust Him and what He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 15, 27, 2, 'provides is absolutely the best. The Bible says that when God wanted to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 15, 28, 2, 'provide a partner for Adam, He said, “I want to make someone suitable');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 16, 1, 2, 'for him” (Genesis 2:18). I''ll make him a helper suitable for him. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 16, 2, 2, 'means something that exactly fits with his temperament and his nature,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 16, 3, 2, 'according to his need. I will create a wife who will be exactly suited');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 16, 4, 2, 'for him. Now do you believe that God loves you just as much as He loved');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 16, 5, 2, 'Adam. I believed that with all my heart. I believed that as a young man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 16, 6, 2, 'and I believe that God would in His great love for me provide me a wife');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 16, 7, 2, 'who would be exactly suited for me, according to my temperament, my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 16, 8, 2, 'need, my ministry that God had planned for me etc. Now we''ve been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 16, 9, 2, 'married over 50 years and I can tell you that''s absolutely true. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 16, 10, 2, 'provided exactly what was right for me. If you honor God, you seek Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 16, 11, 2, 'and choose the Creator above the created, and don''t grab for yourself,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 16, 12, 2, 'you''ll find that He does that for you as well. He will provide you a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 16, 13, 2, 'house, He’ll provides you a job, He''ll provide you a partner exactly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 16, 14, 2, 'suited for you. You couldn''t find a better one yourself: a better job or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 16, 15, 2, 'a better house or a better partner. So that''s what we see here; God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 16, 16, 2, 'intends to provide man his needs. The Bible says my God will supply all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 16, 17, 2, 'your need. In Philippians 4:19, we read that my “God will supply all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 16, 18, 2, 'your need according to His riches in glory in Christ Jesus.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 16, 19, 2, 'He doesn''t give us all that we want. Only a foolish father would give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 16, 20, 2, 'his children everything they asked for. You think it’s wise to give our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 16, 21, 2, 'children everything they asked for? That will destroy them. A wise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 16, 22, 2, 'father gives his children everything they need; he doesn''t give them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 16, 23, 2, 'everything they ask for. God is a much wiser Father; He doesn''t give us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 16, 24, 2, 'everything we ask for. A lot of prayers He doesn''t grant them. His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 16, 25, 2, 'answer is “no”. Just like a good father many times has to tell its');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 16, 26, 2, 'children, “Oh I''m sorry my son, my girl, I can''t give you that. I won''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 16, 27, 2, 'permit that.” Everything that Adam needed, God had already made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 16, 28, 2, 'provision for before He created Him. That''s the wonderful thing. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 17, 1, 2, 'not that He created him and then He said, “Hey, we got to look around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 17, 2, 2, 'for a place for him to stay and we got to look around and make a wife');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 17, 3, 2, 'for him.” The wife that God had planned for Adam was planned before He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 17, 4, 2, 'created Adam. Eve was created later but she was planned even before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 17, 5, 2, 'because before God made Adam itself, He says, “Let Us make man in Our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 17, 6, 2, 'image and according to Our likeness.” Adam and Eve were planned before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 17, 7, 2, 'they were created. So, we see there that God had planned everything for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 17, 8, 2, 'Adam before He was created. It''s a wonderful thing to believe that. Many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 17, 9, 2, 'a time, we face situations in life where we can wonder if God has made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 17, 10, 2, 'some provision for this particular situation that I''m facing right now.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 17, 11, 2, 'It’s wonderful to go back to Genesis and to see there that before a need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 17, 12, 2, 'arises, God has already made a plan for it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 17, 13, 2, 'It''s a very wonderful thing to be a child of God. I found that for 58');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 17, 14, 2, 'years now. It''s a very wonderful thing to be a child of God because God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 17, 15, 2, 'provides everything that we need, whether it is spiritual, physical or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 17, 16, 2, 'material. Every single person on earth should be a child of God. Why is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 17, 17, 2, 'it that people don''t want this wonderful life? Because the devil has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 17, 18, 2, 'somehow portrayed before people that God is a hard, demanding');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 17, 19, 2, 'taskmaster. Satan says to people, “Don''t yield your life to God, you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 17, 20, 2, 'be a much happier person if you live on your own.” That''s a lie and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 17, 21, 2, 'believe that''s one of the things that we need to emphasize to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 17, 22, 2, 'Christians. It''s a lie to imagine that you can live a better life out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 17, 23, 2, 'there on your own without consulting God about His will. The happiest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 17, 24, 2, 'Christians on earth are the ones who''ve decided I don''t want to plan my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 17, 25, 2, 'own life. I want God to plan my life and I want to fulfill His will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 17, 26, 2, 'exactly. Now if you know God''s nature as a loving Father who cares for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 17, 27, 2, 'you, you gladly say that. I can say that after 58 years. When I was 21');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 17, 28, 2, 'years old, I was gripped by the fact that God had a plan for my life. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 18, 1, 2, 'began to think, and I say, “Is it possible for me with all my limited');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 18, 2, 2, 'knowledge and my ignorance as a human being to make a better plan than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 18, 3, 2, 'my Creator has made for me?” You got to be off your head and crazy to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 18, 4, 2, 'think that’s true! Definitely God can make a better plan for our lives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 18, 5, 2, 'because He knows the whole future.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 18, 6, 2, 'He knows all my temperaments, what I''m like and the dangers there are,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 18, 7, 2, 'and He plans the best for me. I cannot think of a better plan than that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 18, 8, 2, 'Recognition of this fact is faith. Faith is to believe that God''s wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 18, 9, 2, 'is greater than yours. It''s really not difficult to have faith. Is it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 18, 10, 2, 'difficult to believe that God''s wisdom is superior to yours? Is it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 18, 11, 2, 'difficult to believe that God loves you so perfectly? Is it difficult to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 18, 12, 2, 'believe that He''s Almighty and He can control all the factors in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 18, 13, 2, 'life? Faith is just to believe that and that’s why I choose what You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 18, 14, 2, 'have planned rather than my own. That''s what we need to learn from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 18, 15, 2, 'first two or three chapters of the book of Genesis. Now the reason I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 18, 16, 2, 'beginning there is because I found that a lot of Christians, their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 18, 17, 2, 'problem arises from the fact that they don''t understand God''s purpose.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 18, 18, 2, 'They don''t believe that God''s plan is better than anything that they can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 18, 19, 2, 'make for themselves. They don''t believe that God has made provision for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 18, 20, 2, 'every single need that can ever arise in their life. Did you hear what I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 18, 21, 2, 'said? Every single need that can ever arise in your entire life, there''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 18, 22, 2, 'some provision God has made to meet that need. That just excites me to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 18, 23, 2, 'know that! Whatever I may face in the future, I don''t know what it is, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 18, 24, 2, 'don''t know what I''m going to face next week, next month, but I know one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 18, 25, 2, 'thing; whatever it is, God has made provision for it already. There''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 18, 26, 2, 'very lovely word in Psalm 112 that reads like this, “How blessed is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 18, 27, 2, 'man is who only wants to obey God (or fears the Lord), who greatly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 18, 28, 2, 'delights in His commandments and obey them.” One of the things it says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 19, 1, 2, 'in verse 7 of Psalm 112 is, “He is not afraid of bad news.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 19, 2, 2, 'Now as long as we live on this earth, sometimes we may get some news');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 19, 3, 2, 'which doesn''t sound right. Why are we not afraid? Because God has made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 19, 4, 2, 'provision for something to solve that problem. Isn’t that wonderful to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 19, 5, 2, 'live on earth like that; to say from now till the end of my life on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 19, 6, 2, 'earth, “I don''t know what''s going to come in my way. But I know one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 19, 7, 2, 'thing, whatever I face, God has made some provision for it.” I learned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 19, 8, 2, 'that from Genesis 2. God made provision for every need of Adam’s and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 19, 9, 2, 'teach me right at the beginning of the Bible that He knows my need and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 19, 10, 2, 'He has made provision for it completely. So, let''s get rid of this wrong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 19, 11, 2, 'concept of God that the devil''s portrayed before people and let''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 19, 12, 2, 'recognize He wants the very best for you my friend. Surrender to Him and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 19, 13, 2, 'say Lord I want Your will for my life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 19, 14, 3, 'Chapter 3 Satan’s Tactics');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 19, 15, 3, 'In our last two studies, we were considering what God''s purpose for man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 19, 16, 3, 'was when He first created him and how He made him different from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 19, 17, 3, 'animals and how He had made provision for all his need. If we understand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 19, 18, 3, 'these basic concepts, we will open our whole being to let God have His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 19, 19, 3, 'way in us all the time in every area. It’s because we don''t understand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 19, 20, 3, 'or accept or believe these clear teachings right in the beginning of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 19, 21, 3, 'scripture, we don''t see them. The devil has blinded our eyes to them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 19, 22, 3, 'that we find our Christian life so unsatisfactory. The average');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 19, 23, 3, 'born-again believer, if you were to ask him and if he were to give you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 19, 24, 3, 'an honest reply, he would admit that this Christian life is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 19, 25, 3, 'satisfying. And yet God intends our life to be satisfying but it will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 19, 26, 3, 'never be satisfying until we believe that total surrender to God is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 19, 27, 3, 'best for us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 19, 28, 3, 'Now we want to look at the origin of sin in the human race as it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 20, 1, 3, 'described in the third chapter of Genesis. In those first few chapters');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 20, 2, 3, 'of Genesis, we get certain basic concepts concerning a number of things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 20, 3, 3, 'in man''s relationship with God which help us to know how it should be in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 20, 4, 3, 'our lives too. In Genesis 3 for example, we see a number of things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 20, 5, 3, 'related to temptation. If you look and meditate on this, I believe it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 20, 6, 3, 'can give us some insight into the tactics of Satan so that we are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 20, 7, 3, 'deceived in the same way. Here we read that the first thing that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 20, 8, 3, 'devil did was to come to Eve and make her question the Word of God. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 20, 9, 3, 'is how he comes today too- is this really God''s Word? Has God really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 20, 10, 3, 'said this? Is it necessary to do what God has said? Is it dangerous to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 20, 11, 3, 'disobey God? And the devil tries to take away that foundation from our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 20, 12, 3, 'lives of God''s Word so that we''re like the man who built his house on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 20, 13, 3, 'sand and it collapsed. That''s what he did with Eve — he came and said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 20, 14, 3, '“Has God really said?” Through the centuries, the devil''s always been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 20, 15, 3, 'questioning God''s Word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 20, 16, 3, 'The Bible says faith comes by hearing and hearing by the word of Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 20, 17, 3, '(Romans 10:17). So, if the devil succeeds in removing the word of Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 20, 18, 3, 'from underneath your life, you''re not going to have any basis for faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 20, 19, 3, 'at all. The opposite of faith is fear and that''s why you find the world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 20, 20, 3, 'full of people with fear. Their life is built on sand and it crumbles.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 20, 21, 3, 'In this you see another thing and that is Satan is trying to tell Eve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 20, 22, 3, 'that it''s not so serious if you disobey God. Satan was implying as it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 20, 23, 3, 'were that God is such a loving good God and He’s not going to let you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 20, 24, 3, 'suffer and be cast out just because you disobeyed Him once in one area.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 20, 25, 3, 'The devil says, “Oh no, God will ignore one disobedience; He is the God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 20, 26, 3, 'of love and even though He said you will die if you disobey and partake');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 20, 27, 3, 'of this tree, you won''t die. Don''t worry.” Sin came when the woman');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 20, 28, 3, 'decided to believe what the devil said rather than what God said. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 21, 1, 3, 'is the origin of sin. This is what happens when we begin to believe what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 21, 2, 3, 'the devil says rather than what God says.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 21, 3, 3, 'What are the things the devil says? He says, “sin is not serious. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 21, 4, 3, 'will not be punished if you do wrong and there is no such thing as hell.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 21, 5, 3, 'There is no such thing as eternal death.” These are some of the lies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 21, 6, 3, 'which the devil''s been feeding humanity with. “You surely shall not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 21, 7, 3, 'die”, he says in Genesis 3:4. Apply this to the Christian life today:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 21, 8, 3, 'what will happen to a Christian who lives according to his flesh? I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 21, 9, 3, 'talking about a born-again Christian who''s not careful about his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 21, 10, 3, 'Christian life but who continues to live according to the desires of his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 21, 11, 3, 'flesh. In Romans 8, we read these words written to born-again believers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 21, 12, 3, 'Is very clear because it says “brethren” in Romans 8:12; He''s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 21, 13, 3, 'talking to non-Christians. There He says, “Dear brethren, we are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 21, 14, 3, 'under obligation to the flesh to live according to the flesh. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 21, 15, 3, 'live according to the flesh, you will surely die. But if through the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 21, 16, 3, 'spirit you put to death the deeds of the body, you will live” (Romans');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 21, 17, 3, '8:13). What is He saying to born-again believers? If you believers live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 21, 18, 3, 'according to the flesh, the desires and passions of the sinful nature in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 21, 19, 3, 'our body, you must die. This is just like God told Adam, “you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 21, 20, 3, 'surely die if you eat of the tree.” And what did the devil come and tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 21, 21, 3, 'Eve— you will not surely die. This is what is being preached to many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 21, 22, 3, 'believers by many preachers today. They say if you''re born again, if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 21, 23, 3, 'you''re once accepted Christ and you happen to live according to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 21, 24, 3, 'flesh, you will not die. You are eternally secure. Isn''t it the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 21, 25, 3, 'language of the devil? Compare these two verses: God told Adam, “if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 21, 26, 3, 'eat of this tree of knowledge of good and evil, you will surely die.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 21, 27, 3, 'God says today in Romans 8:13, “Brethren, if you live according to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 21, 28, 3, 'flesh, you will surely die.” The devil took that word of God in Genesis');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 22, 1, 3, 'and said you will not die. Today, the devil takes this word of God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 22, 2, 3, 'says, “If you live according the flesh, you will not die because you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 22, 3, 3, 'accepted Christ once. How can you die? it is impossible.” Do you know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 22, 4, 3, 'the number of millions and millions of believers whom the devil has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 22, 5, 3, 'fooled by making them believe that once they''ve accepted Christ, it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 22, 6, 3, 'not possible for them to die!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 22, 7, 3, 'The Bible says in Luke 3:38, that Adam was a son of God. Adam was a son');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 22, 8, 3, 'of God, but he died; he was eternally lost finally because he disobeyed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 22, 9, 3, 'What about today when a son of God decides to live according to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 22, 10, 3, 'flesh? Is God''s Word in Romans 8:13 going to be fulfilled that you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 22, 11, 3, 'surely die? It will! But the devil questions God''s Word. The devil’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 22, 12, 3, 'whole purpose is to deceive man and make him live in sin so that finally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 22, 13, 3, 'he spends eternity with the devil in hell. That''s the devil’s aim. Paul');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 22, 14, 3, 'once said in one of his letters in 2nd Corinthians 2:11, “We''re not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 22, 15, 3, 'ignorant of Satan''s schemes.” Satan has tactics and schemes and we must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 22, 16, 3, 'not be ignorant of them. We need not be ignorant to them if we read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 22, 17, 3, 'scripture because all his tactics are the same, he used once before.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 22, 18, 3, 'Here is one example; to make you question God''s Word and just negate it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 22, 19, 3, 'or cancel it by saying it will not happen. So that''s the first thing we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 22, 20, 3, 'can learn and take a warning from in Genesis 3. If you want to live as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 22, 21, 3, 'God wants you to live, you better accept God''s Word exactly as it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 22, 22, 3, 'written.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 22, 23, 3, 'The second thing I want you to see here is when the devil communicated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 22, 24, 3, 'with Eve, he says to her something which implies that God doesn''t really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 22, 25, 3, 'love you as you think He does. Satan implies that God doesn''t really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 22, 26, 3, 'have your best in mind. He''s trying to withhold something from you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 22, 27, 3, 'Notice what it says in Genesis 3:5: Satan said, “God knows that in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 22, 28, 3, 'day you eat from this, your eyes will be opened and you''ll be like God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 23, 1, 3, 'knowing good and evil (and of course He doesn''t want you to be like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 23, 2, 3, 'Him).” What a lie and it’s amazing how the devil succeeded in making Eve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 23, 3, 3, 'believe that. It''s amazing to see how the devil succeeded today in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 23, 4, 3, 'making a lot of people believe a lie as if God is trying to withhold');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 23, 5, 3, 'something that''s good for you. How can that be? Did God create man in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 23, 6, 3, 'order to withhold from him? He need not have created him at all!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 23, 7, 3, 'The whole purpose with which God created men was to bless him and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 23, 8, 3, 'give him all that He had to make him partake of His nature and to make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 23, 9, 3, 'him rule over all of His creation, but the devil portrayed another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 23, 10, 3, 'picture of God. He portrayed God as a hard taskmaster and One who didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 23, 11, 3, 'love and One who''s trying to withhold something from man and so he told');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 23, 12, 3, 'man you better fend for yourself. You better take care of yourself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 23, 13, 3, 'because God is not going to care for you. What a lie! When God had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 23, 14, 3, 'created man with the very purpose of blessing and providing for him, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 23, 15, 3, 'devil convinced him that that was not true. We find the same today. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 23, 16, 3, 'devil is out there convincing believers that God doesn''t really care for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 23, 17, 3, 'them, that''s why He didn''t grant them this request. He implies, “Why did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 23, 18, 3, 'God allow your child to die? Why did He allow that sickness to continue?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 23, 19, 3, 'That proves God doesn''t love you.” And there are lots of believers who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 23, 20, 3, 'believe that and when they believe that, it leads to depression,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 23, 21, 3, 'discouragement, anger at God which also leads to sickness in the body');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 23, 22, 3, 'and many other problems. If the devil can succeed in making you believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 23, 23, 3, 'this lie that God doesn''t love you, that God doesn''t care for you, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 23, 24, 3, 'God’s not going to provide all your need, he would have succeeded in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 23, 25, 3, 'making you take the first step towards sin. The first step to a defeated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 23, 26, 3, 'life is to believe that God doesn''t love you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 23, 27, 3, 'The New Testament speaks a lot about faith. Faith is to believe that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 23, 28, 3, 'loves me. That''s more important than even not falling. When Peter was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 24, 1, 3, 'about to deny Jesus three times, the Lord warned him, “you''re going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 24, 2, 3, 'deny me three times Peter but I''m not praying that you won''t deny me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 24, 3, 3, 'That''s probably needed to break your pride but I am praying that after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 24, 4, 3, 'you have denied me and you''ve let me down and the devil''s got ahold of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 24, 5, 3, 'you and you reach the bottom, I want you to remember there that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 24, 6, 3, 'still loves you. That''s what I''m praying for you that your faith will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 24, 7, 3, 'not fail.” The Lord told Peter that He was praying that his faith will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 24, 8, 3, 'not fail meaning that when you come to the end of yourself, I want you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 24, 9, 3, 'to believe right there that God loves you still. He still loves you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 24, 10, 3, 'That is faith; to believe that even though I''ve made a mess of my life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 24, 11, 3, 'even though I''ve done something wrong, God still loves me. How much more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 24, 12, 3, 'when I''m trying to please Him. When we were sinners, He loved us. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 24, 13, 3, 'we were His enemies, He loved us. How much more now that we''re His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 24, 14, 3, 'children. One of the things we learned right from the beginning of man''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 24, 15, 3, 'creation and man''s fall is that the aim of the devil is to make us doubt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 24, 16, 3, 'God''s Word and to doubt God''s love. If the devil succeeds in those two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 24, 17, 3, 'areas in your life, I want to tell you right now that you''re doomed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 24, 18, 3, 'because you''ll definitely fall. He doesn''t lead us to fall straightaway.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 24, 19, 3, 'He removes our foundation and then we just fall on our own. We get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 24, 20, 3, 'discouraged and say, “if God doesn''t love me, if He is not going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 24, 21, 3, 'answer my prayer, what hope is there for me.” We get discouraged, then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 24, 22, 3, 'the devil leads us into more sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 24, 23, 3, 'The other thing I want you to notice further down is the woman trusted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 24, 24, 3, 'her senses. She saw with her eyes that the tree was good for food. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 24, 25, 3, 'know the other thing we need to learn from this passage is that we can''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 24, 26, 3, 'trust our senses. If you trust your senses, you''ll be deceived, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 24, 27, 3, 'you’ll go astray. You can''t trust your senses. For example, if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 24, 28, 3, 'trusted your senses, you would think that the sun goes around the earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 25, 1, 3, 'because every day you see the sun rise and set in the west. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 25, 2, 3, 'trusted your senses, you''d say the sun is moving! It''s not moving, it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 25, 3, 3, 'an appearance. It''s the earth revolving on its own axis that gives you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 25, 4, 3, 'the impression that that stationary sun is moving. God has put it there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 25, 5, 3, 'to teach us every day not to trust your senses. Don''t trust what you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 25, 6, 3, 'see. The we know from geography that the Earth revolves around its own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 25, 7, 3, 'axis at a speed of about 1000 miles an hour and when we look down at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 25, 8, 3, 'earth, we don''t feel it moving at all. The earth looks very stable and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 25, 9, 3, 'stationary and yet the earth under your feet is revolving at 1600 km/hr.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 25, 10, 3, 'That''s how fast the earth is spinning and yet you don''t feel it. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 25, 11, 3, 'can''t trust your senses, that''s the message that comes through from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 25, 12, 3, 'that. If you go by your senses, you''ll be deceived. The woman saw; she');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 25, 13, 3, 'went by her senses. It appears good to her, but it was not good for her.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 25, 14, 3, 'Look at the people who take alcohol and cigarettes and harmful drugs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 25, 15, 3, 'today. They look at it and they say that appears to be good for me, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 25, 16, 3, 'get a kick out of it. It''ll destroy your body. So that''s the other thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 25, 17, 3, 'that we see here.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 25, 18, 3, 'When man falls like this, what did God expect from Adam and Eve? Just to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 25, 19, 3, 'trust Him. Believe that I love you even though you may not know the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 25, 20, 3, 'reason why I have forbidden you from eating this tree. It''s very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 25, 21, 3, 'interesting to see that God never gave Adam and Eve a reason. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 25, 22, 3, 'obey after you get an explanation why you should obey, that''s not really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 25, 23, 3, 'the obedience of faith. The highest form of obedience is the obedience');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 25, 24, 3, 'of faith — that is the way for maximum spiritual growth. If you obey God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 25, 25, 3, 'because you know the reason, well that''s good that you obey God but it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 25, 26, 3, 'not the best form of obedience. In Romans chapter 1 and chapter 16, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 25, 27, 3, 'read this expression: the obedience of faith. What is the opposite of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 25, 28, 3, 'the obedience of faith? Is the obedience of reason. That means I know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 26, 1, 3, 'why I need to do this therefore I do it. What if you don''t know the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 26, 2, 3, 'reason, that''s a higher level of obedience.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 26, 3, 3, 'When God gave Adam a command saying, “don''t eat of the tree of knowledge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 26, 4, 3, 'of good and evil,” He never gave my reason. He never told him. God could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 26, 5, 3, 'have easily given 25 reasons why Adam shouldn''t eat of it. He just said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 26, 6, 3, '“Don''t eat it. if you eat it, you''ll die,” but He never gave him a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 26, 7, 3, 'reason. Now today because God''s given us the Holy Spirit, we know the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 26, 8, 3, 'reason. The essential difference between the tree of knowledge of good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 26, 9, 3, 'and evil and the tree of life is that in one, Adam could choose a life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 26, 10, 3, 'centered in himself. That means if I want to know what''s good and what''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 26, 11, 3, 'evil, I don''t have to go to God. I know it myself; I can consult my own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 26, 12, 3, 'reason and decide what''s good and what''s evil. That''s the way of death.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 26, 13, 3, 'The other tree was the tree of life symbolizing God Himself in the power');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 26, 14, 3, 'of His Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 26, 15, 3, 'If I choose to live by that tree, what I''m saying is, “Lord, I want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 26, 16, 3, 'live in dependence on you every time. I want to know what''s good and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 26, 17, 3, 'what''s evil. I’m not going to trust my own reason. I’m going to come to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 26, 18, 3, 'you and say, ‘Lord is this good for me to do.’” It''s a life of constant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 26, 19, 3, 'dependence upon God for wisdom, for life every day. The fact that I''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 26, 20, 3, 'got so many years of experience doesn''t make a difference. Think of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 26, 21, 3, 'branch in a tree, maybe it''s had 50 years of experience bearing fruit,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 26, 22, 3, 'but it still needs to abide in the tree if it is to bear fruit now. So,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 26, 23, 3, 'it''s constant dependence. That new branch has to abide in the tree to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 26, 24, 3, 'produce fruit as much as this other branch that has been producing fruit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 26, 25, 3, 'in it for 50 years. It doesn''t make a difference how many years of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 26, 26, 3, 'experience you have. Jesus said, “Apart from me you cannot bear fruit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 26, 27, 3, 'You can do nothing” (John 15:5). The tree of life symbolized a life of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 26, 28, 3, 'dependence upon God. That''s the meaning of living by faith. It is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 27, 1, 3, 'Lord telling me what is good or evil and it''s a moment-by-moment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 27, 2, 3, 'revelation from God that keeps me from what He shows me is evil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 27, 3, 3, 'That''s how Jesus lived and that''s how God wants you and me to live. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 27, 4, 3, 'other is the tree of knowledge of good and evil where I don''t need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 27, 5, 3, 'consult God at all and that''s how all human beings in the world live. Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 27, 6, 3, 'you think everybody in the world is living evil lives? No. A lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 27, 7, 3, 'people do a lot of good things, but they don''t live in dependence upon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 27, 8, 3, 'God. God has not created us just to do good things. He''s created us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 27, 9, 3, 'be dependent on Him. He said go and live by that tree of life, not by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 27, 10, 3, 'the tree of knowledge and evil where you depend on yourself. There is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 27, 11, 3, 'way that seems right to a man but the end of it leads to death (Proverbs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 27, 12, 3, '14:12, 16:25). Proverbs 3:5-6 says, “Trust in the Lord with all your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 27, 13, 3, 'heart and do not lean upon your own reason, your own understanding. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 27, 14, 3, 'all your ways acknowledge Him, then He will direct your paths.” We see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 27, 15, 3, 'here in that verse that the enemy of faith is our reason. If I depend on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 27, 16, 3, 'my reason, I''m going to go astray and so it says trust in the Lord and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 27, 17, 3, 'don''t lean upon your reason. Leaning upon reason is partaking of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 27, 18, 3, 'tree of knowledge of good and evil. My reason tells me what''s good, I do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 27, 19, 3, 'that. My reason tells me what''s evil, I don''t do that. I don''t need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 27, 20, 3, 'pray. I don''t need to consult God about anything. When you live your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 27, 21, 3, 'Christian life without seeking the will of God as to what is good for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 27, 22, 3, 'you, you choose yourself what''s good for you, you''re living according');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 27, 23, 3, 'the principle of good and evil which Adam chose and we''ve all got that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 27, 24, 3, 'infection.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 27, 25, 3, 'I have expanded this passage in Genesis to show you how sin has come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 27, 26, 3, 'into the human race. It came by living according to our own reason. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 27, 27, 3, 'ourselves deciding what''s good for us. Now what is the obedience of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 27, 28, 3, 'faith? The devil said to Eve, “The reason why God is not allowing you to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 28, 1, 3, 'partake of this tree is because He knows that you''ll be like Him and He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 28, 2, 3, 'doesn''t want you to be like Him.” Supposing Eve had said in response,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 28, 3, 3, '“Well, I don''t know all the reasons but one thing I know is that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 28, 4, 3, 'loves me and because He loves me, He cannot possibly withhold from me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 28, 5, 3, 'anything that''s good for me. I can''t understand why God has forbidden');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 28, 6, 3, 'this, it looks as if God should give it to me, but He hasn’t, but I know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 28, 7, 3, 'God loves me and so even though I can''t understand why He has forbidden');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 28, 8, 3, 'it, I’m going to obey Him.” What a different story it would have been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 28, 9, 3, 'and what a different story it could be in your life when you face a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 28, 10, 3, 'situation that you can''t understand and you say, “Well, I can''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 28, 11, 3, 'understand this. I don''t have the explanation for it all, but I know God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 28, 12, 3, 'is a good God and His wisdom is greater than mine and I''ll do what He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 28, 13, 3, 'says.” It can make all the difference in your life so let''s learn from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 28, 14, 3, 'this passage and learn to live by dependence upon God for wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 28, 15, 3, 'concerning what is good for us and what is evil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 28, 16, 4, 'Chapter 4 The Fall Of Man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 28, 17, 4, 'In our previous studies, we''ve been looking at the early chapters of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 28, 18, 4, 'Genesis to try and understand something of God''s original purpose for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 28, 19, 4, 'man and how man fell into sin and how the devil deceived them so that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 28, 20, 4, 'can learn for our own life. God''s purpose for us is the same as it was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 28, 21, 4, 'for Adam. Where Adam failed, we can fulfill that purpose. If we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 28, 22, 4, 'understand from the Scriptures how the devil tripped up Adam and Eve, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 28, 23, 4, 'can learn lessons for ourselves. All Scripture is given so that the man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 28, 24, 4, 'of God may be perfect and so that we can know about the schemes of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 28, 25, 4, 'Satan. So, we continue our study in Genesis 3 about how man fell into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 28, 26, 4, 'sin and what was the result of that and how God wanted man to live by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 28, 27, 4, 'faith and dependence on Him rather than in dependence on oneself. Now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 28, 28, 4, 'what happened as soon as Adam sinned, and Eve sinned? The first thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 29, 1, 4, 'they do is hide from each other and seek to hide from God. This is one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 29, 2, 4, 'of the results of sin; we want to hide. It says that they both hid among');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 29, 3, 4, 'the trees of the garden. Can you imagine anything more stupid than that?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 29, 4, 4, 'To think you can go behind a tree and God won''t see you. Sin makes man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 29, 5, 4, 'pretty foolish and here is one example of that — Adam trying to go hide');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 29, 6, 4, 'behind the tree and think that he can hide from God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 29, 7, 4, 'The other thing is his making fig leaves. They both made fig leaves it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 29, 8, 4, 'says in verse 7 because they suddenly realized they were naked, and they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 29, 9, 4, 'were not willing to accept each other like that; they were ashamed now.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 29, 10, 4, 'Earlier on before sin came, it says in Genesis 2:25 that the man and his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 29, 11, 4, 'wife were naked, and they were not ashamed. Where there is no sin,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 29, 12, 4, 'there''s no need to be ashamed. We see each other. Now apply this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 29, 13, 4, 'spiritually and that''s the way I want to apply this wearing of fig');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 29, 14, 4, 'leaves. Why did Adam and Eve wear fig leaves? Who are they hiding from?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 29, 15, 4, 'There were no others in the garden to see their nakedness. I mean we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 29, 16, 4, 'wouldn''t mind being naked in the presence of animals. If there''s a cat');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 29, 17, 4, 'in your house, you wouldn''t be ashamed to be naked in front of that cat.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 29, 18, 4, 'Who were they hiding from? Who were they covering themselves from with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 29, 19, 4, 'these fig leaves? From each other! Adam didn''t want his wife to see his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 29, 20, 4, 'nakedness and she didn''t want Adam to see her nakedness. It''s amazing!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 29, 21, 4, 'Applying this spiritually, we see how man is trying to hide himself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 29, 22, 4, 'because of sin. There are parts in his life he doesn''t want other people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 29, 23, 4, 'to see. We are ashamed to let other people see us as we really are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 29, 24, 4, 'because we fear that they will not accept us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 29, 25, 4, 'We hide from God because we think He will not accept us as we are, so we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 29, 26, 4, 'try to cover ourselves. That''s the meaning of the fig leaves. The end');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 29, 27, 4, 'result is all human beings go through life wearing a mask, pretending to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 29, 28, 4, 'be spiritual, pretending to be happy when inwardly things are very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 30, 1, 4, 'different. Pretending that everything is okay when everything is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 30, 2, 4, 'okay because they fear that God will not accept them as they are. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 30, 3, 4, 'know all the works that man does. This whole religion of works is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 30, 4, 4, 'symbolized in those fig leaves. When we try to do something to make up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 30, 5, 4, 'for our sin and our failure, that''s the meaning of those fig leaves. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 30, 6, 4, 'make some sacrifice for God, maybe I go on some pilgrimage, maybe I do a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 30, 7, 4, 'kind deed to others, maybe I give money to the beggars to earn my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 30, 8, 4, 'salvation, to earn forgiveness from God because I''m aware of a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 30, 9, 4, 'wrong things I''ve done. These are the fig leaves that man has today to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 30, 10, 4, 'try and win his acceptance before God because he feels God will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 30, 11, 4, 'accept him as he is. This is what Jesus came to disprove. He came to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 30, 12, 4, 'show man that God loved him so much that He would accept him just as he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 30, 13, 4, 'is. God doesn''t want to leave man as he is. God loves us too much for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 30, 14, 4, 'that, He wants to accept us as we are and then change us, but we don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 30, 15, 4, 'have to hide from God. We don''t have to pretend that we are something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 30, 16, 4, 'and this is true even in marriage today. Husband and wife go around with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 30, 17, 4, 'a mask not being open with each other because they feel if my partner');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 30, 18, 4, 'sees me as I really am and sees all the weaknesses in me, he won''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 30, 19, 4, 'accept me. She feels he won''t accept me, so I''ve got to hide some parts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 30, 20, 4, 'of my life from my partner so that he accepts me. We have a desperate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 30, 21, 4, 'desire, a tremendous desire to be accepted and it''s because we want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 30, 22, 4, 'be accepted by our fellow human beings that we wear masks and we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 30, 23, 4, 'pretend.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 30, 24, 4, 'What is the solution for all this? Jesus came to provide a solution for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 30, 25, 4, 'the entire failure of Adam and Eve which has come down to us today and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 30, 26, 4, 'the solution is to find acceptance before God. When we know that God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 30, 27, 4, 'accepted us totally and we have become his children even though there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 30, 28, 4, 'are so many imperfections still in us, it solves this problem. He''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 31, 1, 4, 'accepted us and when we are sure of that, we are finished with seeking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 31, 2, 4, 'for acceptance from men. That''s the answer! We seek for acceptance from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 31, 3, 4, 'men only because we''re not sure that God''s accepted us. I want to say to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 31, 4, 4, 'you my friend, when you''re absolutely sure God''s accepted you, you''ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 31, 5, 4, 'never again seek for acceptance before men. All of us human beings, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 31, 6, 4, 'grow up insecure in our relationship with God and that''s the root cause');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 31, 7, 4, 'of so many sins. That''s what produces competition even among believers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 31, 8, 4, 'That''s what produces jealousy when God seems to have blessed somebody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 31, 9, 4, 'with things that you don''t have, and all this comes from an insecure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 31, 10, 4, 'relationship with God. Many are insecure because they are not sure that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 31, 11, 4, 'God is happy with them. A lot of preachers add to this by preaching a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 31, 12, 4, 'message that brings guilt upon people. Guilt is the way by which many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 31, 13, 4, 'cult leaders control people by making them feel guilty. When a person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 31, 14, 4, 'feels guilty, he is weak, and you can control and manipulate them. A lot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 31, 15, 4, 'of preaching today is to make people feel guilty. Why don''t you do this,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 31, 16, 4, 'and fellow feels guilty and he does it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 31, 17, 4, 'This is what the Bible calls the dead work. It is not done out of love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 31, 18, 4, 'for the Lord. It''s not done spontaneously; it is done under the pressure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 31, 19, 4, 'of guilt. I want to say to you that God doesn''t want you to serve Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 31, 20, 4, 'like that. He doesn''t want you to do anything out of a sense of guilt.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 31, 21, 4, 'Jesus said, “If you love me, keep my commandments” (John 14:15). He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 31, 22, 4, 'didn’t say, “If you feel guilty, keep My commandments.” The solution');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 31, 23, 4, 'comes back to not hiding from God. Don''t go behind trees or go behind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 31, 24, 4, 'anything but come straight before Him. That is what Adam should have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 31, 25, 4, 'done as soon as he sinned. He should have run up to God and say, “Oh');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 31, 26, 4, 'God, I’m sorry. I slipped up. Please forgive me.” He would have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 31, 27, 4, 'discovered that God loves him and accepts him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 31, 28, 4, 'Now when Adam tried to hide from God, one of the results was that he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 32, 1, 4, 'begins to accuse his wife. When a man''s relationship with God is broken,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 32, 2, 4, 'it immediately breaks his relationship with other people and that''s why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 32, 3, 4, 'the Bible says we can test our relationship with God by our relationship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 32, 4, 4, 'with other people. I can imagine that I love God tremendously, but John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 32, 5, 4, 'says, “If you can''t love a brother whom you can see, don''t imagine that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 32, 6, 4, 'you can love a God whom you cannot see” (1 John 4:20). How can you love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 32, 7, 4, 'a God whom you cannot see when you can''t love this brother whom you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 32, 8, 4, 'see with your own eyes? That’s impossible. We see the same thing here.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 32, 9, 4, 'As soon as Adam’s relationship with the Lord was broken, his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 32, 10, 4, 'relationship with Eve was broken too. Their relationship was not only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 32, 11, 4, 'broken, but he also begins to accuse her. You see that there when the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 32, 12, 4, 'Lord came to Adam and asked him, “Where are you, Adam? Did you eat of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 32, 13, 4, 'the tree?” Adam replies, “I was naked, and I hid myself.” The Lord said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 32, 14, 4, '“Who told you that you were naked? Did you eat of the tree which I told');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 32, 15, 4, 'you not to eat?” (Genesis 3:11). Now the answer to that question was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 32, 16, 4, '“yes or no” and the answer in this particular case was just “yes.” All');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 32, 17, 4, 'Adam had to say was “Yes Lord, I''m sorry I did that.” But notice Adam');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 32, 18, 4, 'doesn''t say that. Sin has corrupted him immediately. See how quickly sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 32, 19, 4, 'does a work in a human being. He who loved his wife so intensely, who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 32, 20, 4, 'said earlier in Genesis 2:23 when he saw Eve, “This is what I’ve been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 32, 21, 4, 'waiting for. This is now bone of my bone and flesh of my flesh.” This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 32, 22, 4, 'part of me. He was so excited with his wife and rejoiced with his wife.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 32, 23, 4, 'As soon as one sin came in his life, his whole attitude to his wife');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 32, 24, 4, 'changes. He turns to God and accuses his wife. God asked him, “Did you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 32, 25, 4, 'eat of that tree” to which he should have said, “Yes Lord.” He doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 32, 26, 4, 'say that. He says, “Well Lord, this woman is the one who gave me this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 32, 27, 4, 'fruit to eat and remember, You are the one who gave this woman to me to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 32, 28, 4, 'be my wife.” He was implying that God was a bit to blame for giving him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 33, 1, 4, 'such a wife. This tendency to blame others for our fault, we see it in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 33, 2, 4, 'children. I did this mommy because he did that, or she did that. You see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 33, 3, 4, 'it began with Adam.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 33, 4, 4, 'Now do you know the number of believers with this attitude. Now I can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 33, 5, 4, 'understand unbelievers have that nature. They''ve got it from Adam. Let''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 33, 6, 4, 'talk about those who claim to be born again. Do you find this attitude');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 33, 7, 4, 'in yourself? How much of a salvation have you experienced then?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 33, 8, 4, 'Salvation is to be saved from all the wretched things that the devil put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 33, 9, 4, 'upon Adam and which has come into the human race. That is real');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 33, 10, 4, 'salvation. Here is one of the wretched things that the devil put upon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 33, 11, 4, 'Adam as soon as he sinned and that is blame somebody else. He accused');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 33, 12, 4, 'somebody else and found fault with somebody else. He found fault with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 33, 13, 4, 'God as to why He allowed that to happen in his life. Haven''t you heard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 33, 14, 4, 'believers talking like that? That proves how little they have been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 33, 15, 4, 'saved. That proves that they don''t even see that such an attitude is sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 33, 16, 4, 'and it proves that perhaps they''re not really born again at all. When we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 33, 17, 4, 'are born again, we''re not perfect. It may take ages before we get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 33, 18, 4, 'anywhere near perfection. But one thing does happen when a person is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 33, 19, 4, 'really born again; he suddenly becomes sensitive to sin. He may not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 33, 20, 4, 'overcome sins for many years but when he slips up and falls, he knows it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 33, 21, 4, 'and he doesn''t blame anybody else; he blames himself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 33, 22, 4, 'I believe one of the reasons why many Christians don''t come to a life of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 33, 23, 4, 'victory over sin is because they have not taken the blame themselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 33, 24, 4, 'They blame somebody else and as long as we are blaming other people, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 33, 25, 4, 'will never be free. It’s like that story of the king who went to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 33, 26, 4, 'prison on his birthday to release all of the prisoners as a goodwill');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 33, 27, 4, 'gesture. Before releasing them, he decided to go to the prison and talk');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 33, 28, 4, 'to these people and find out why they were in there. So, he went to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 34, 1, 4, 'first cell and asked the person why he was in jail. The prisoner said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 34, 2, 4, '“It’s not really my fault. I got accused falsely and I couldn''t defend');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 34, 3, 4, 'myself and here I am.” The King went to the second cell and that fellow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 34, 4, 4, 'had an excuse too. He said, “The criminal’s face looked like mine and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 34, 5, 4, 'they caught me instead.” Another prison said, “The judge had a prejudice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 34, 6, 4, 'against me.” Everybody had an excuse. They were all good people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 34, 7, 4, 'according in their own minds. They told the king they didn’t deserve to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 34, 8, 4, 'be here. When the king came to the last cell, the prisoner in that cell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 34, 9, 4, 'said, “I did wrong. I was bad and I did a lot of wrong things and that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 34, 10, 4, 'why I got caught and I''m here. I deserve to be here.” Then the king told');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 34, 11, 4, 'the jailer in a very sarcastic way with a sense of humor, “You seem to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 34, 12, 4, 'have a lot of good people here in this jail. A lot of people who have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 34, 13, 4, 'done nothing wrong and they''re all here but there''s the only one man who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 34, 14, 4, 'says he''s bad. Now we don''t want to keep this bad person in the midst of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 34, 15, 4, 'all these good people so let''s release him. Let him go so he doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 34, 16, 4, 'spoil all these good people.” So he released that man. Why was he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 34, 17, 4, 'released? The principle is because he acknowledged that he had failed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 34, 18, 4, 'Adam could not. When the Lord asked Eve, “Did you do this?” She also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 34, 19, 4, 'does not take the blame but rather blames the serpent. Remember this—as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 34, 20, 4, 'long as you have this habit of blaming circumstances, blaming your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 34, 21, 4, 'upbringing, blaming your parents, blaming somebody else for your failure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 34, 22, 4, 'and not willing to take the blame yourself, you will never experience a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 34, 23, 4, 'full salvation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 34, 24, 4, 'In the 58 years that I''ve been a believer, I''ve met very few believers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 34, 25, 4, 'who have the habit of taking the blame themselves. I met numerous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 34, 26, 4, 'believers blaming other people instead of themselves. Think of the thief');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 34, 27, 4, 'who hung on the cross next to Jesus Christ. What was it that took him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 34, 28, 4, 'into God''s kingdom? It was just one thing; he took the blame for his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 35, 1, 4, 'sins. Crucifixion was the worst type of punishment that the Romans would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 35, 2, 4, 'give to anyone. It was reserved for the absolutely worst criminals for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 35, 3, 4, 'whom there was no hope. Other criminals would be given lesser punishment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 35, 4, 4, 'like been jailed for so many years, but the really bad ones were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 35, 5, 4, 'crucified. When these thieves were hanging on the cross, one of them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 35, 6, 4, 'turned to the Lord and said, “Save yourself and save us” (Luke 23:39).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 35, 7, 4, 'He was saying, “Save me, I don''t deserve to be here. I have done a few');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 35, 8, 4, 'bad things but certainly not crucifixion.” But the other thief said how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 35, 9, 4, 'can you speak like this. He said, “This man has done nothing wrong, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 35, 10, 4, 'we are getting what we deserve for our deed” (Luke 23:41). You see how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 35, 11, 4, 'he was the opposite of Adam. Whereas the other thief was just like Adam');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 35, 12, 4, 'because he wouldn’t take the blame. He didn’t believe that he deserve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 35, 13, 4, 'punishment. The repentant thief believed that he deserved to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 35, 14, 4, 'crucified because he was such a terrible criminal. You know what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 35, 15, 4, 'happened to him? He went to paradise that day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 35, 16, 4, 'Paradise is made by God for those who''ve learned to take the blame');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 35, 17, 4, 'themselves. Adam was kicked out of because he wouldn''t take the blame.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 35, 18, 4, 'The thief went into paradise because he took the blame. You remember the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 35, 19, 4, 'story of the Pharisee and the Publican in Luke chapter 18. The Pharisee');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 35, 20, 4, 'appeared as if there is nothing wrong with him. He said “I’m a good man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 35, 21, 4, 'I’m not doing all the wrong things that other people do. He blames');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 35, 22, 4, 'others. That fellow''s an adulterer and that follow is the thief and that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 35, 23, 4, 'fellow is like this and look at this fellow praying over here; he''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 35, 24, 4, 'another cheat. But I do a lot of good things. I fast and I pray and I do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 35, 25, 4, 'all that.” There was another sinner standing there and he wouldn''t even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 35, 26, 4, 'lift up his head to heaven. He said, “Oh God, I got nothing to say. I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 35, 27, 4, 'just a sinner. I''m 100% to blame, I don''t blame my wife, I don''t blame');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 35, 28, 4, 'anybody else, it''s me.” Jesus said that man went to his house justified');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 36, 1, 4, 'just like the thief went to paradise. The other person who thought he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 36, 2, 4, 'was better than everybody else and looked down on others and trusted in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 36, 3, 4, 'himself that he was righteous got rejected. So that''s one of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 36, 4, 4, 'important lessons that we can learn from Genesis 3.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 36, 5, 4, 'One more thing we can learn from there is the tremendous power of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 36, 6, 4, 'fellowship. I personally believe if Adam and Eve had stood together when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 36, 7, 4, 'the devil was talking to them and Adam replied to the devil as Eve''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 36, 8, 4, 'head, they would not have sinned. There is strength in unity. Two are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 36, 9, 4, 'better than one, it says in Ecclesiastes 4. If one falls, the other can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 36, 10, 4, 'pick him up. When the enemy comes, if two are together, they can resist');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 36, 11, 4, 'him and overcome him. That''s the other lesson we learned from Genesis 3.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 36, 12, 4, 'There''s a value in fellowship. Seek to build fellowship with others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 36, 13, 4, 'because Jesus said, “When two or three are gathered together in my name,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 36, 14, 4, 'there I am in the midst” (Matthew 18:20). The presence of the Lord is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 36, 15, 4, 'mightily manifest, wherever two believers are united in spirit without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 36, 16, 4, 'anything in their hearts against each other. God can do amazing things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 36, 17, 4, 'through two believers who are united like that. That is why the devil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 36, 18, 4, 'fights against unity among believers. He says you got to wait till you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 36, 19, 4, 'agree on every little thing before you''re united. That''s not true. My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 36, 20, 4, 'unity with people is not based on some doctrinal agreement. It''s based');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 36, 21, 4, 'on a common love and loyalty to Jesus Christ our Lord and our Savior.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 36, 22, 4, 'If Adam and Eve had been together, there they would not have fallen.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 36, 23, 4, 'When he was talking to Satan, Adam could have said “Hang on, don''t you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 36, 24, 4, 'remember God told us we shouldn''t eat from that tree.” If they had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 36, 25, 4, 'reminded one another, they could have protected themselves from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 36, 26, 4, 'attack of Satan. Think of a husband and wife really seek to be one and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 36, 27, 4, 'to remind one another, to warn one another about Satan. What a fantastic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 36, 28, 4, 'power they''ll be in that home, but the devil is determined to make sure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 37, 1, 4, 'it doesn''t happen. So, we see here that that is how failure came and we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 37, 2, 4, 'notice here that the Lord cursed the serpent. He cursed the ground and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 37, 3, 4, 'He cursed the serpent, but He did not curse Adam and Eve. God made a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 37, 4, 4, 'provision for the failure of His children. That''s a wonderful thing we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 37, 5, 4, 'learned there; God''s tremendous care even where man had failed. Before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 37, 6, 4, 'He sent Adam and Eve out of the garden, He gave them one piece of good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 37, 7, 4, 'news. God made a provision for their salvation; the woman will give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 37, 8, 4, 'birth one day to a Son and He will crush the head of the serpent who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 37, 9, 4, 'deceived them. That’s what happened when Christ came so we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 37, 10, 4, 'experience a salvation from all the effects of Adam''s sin, but we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 37, 11, 4, 'learn lessons from Genesis 3 that even where we have failed, if we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 37, 12, 4, 'honest, God can lift us up from there. He’s made a provision for our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 37, 13, 4, 'failure before we failed because He knew that we would fail. What a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 37, 14, 4, 'wonderful salvation!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 37, 15, 5, 'Chapter 5 Free Will And The Conscience');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 37, 16, 5, 'We want to continue looking at some of the foundational principles that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 37, 17, 5, 'we can learn from the early chapters of the Bible, particularly the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 37, 18, 5, 'first four chapters of Genesis. We want to understand what man’s basic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 37, 19, 5, 'problem is. That''s what we''ve been considering over the last four');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 37, 20, 5, 'chapters and in this chapter, we want to again look at some of those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 37, 21, 5, 'things that are hidden as it were and that the Spirit seeks to reveal to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 37, 22, 5, 'us which can help us to identify man''s problem. Then we can look at what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 37, 23, 5, 'the solution that God has made to deal with our problem. We looked at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 37, 24, 5, 'God''s purpose for man, His provision for him, Satan''s tactics and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 37, 25, 5, 'fall of man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 37, 26, 5, 'I want to say a few words today about free will. One of the greatest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 37, 27, 5, 'gifts that God gave to man was freedom of choice. God did not give that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 37, 28, 5, 'freedom of choice to the planets, the stars, the trees etc. They have no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 38, 1, 5, 'choice. The planets have been obeying God automatically for thousands of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 38, 2, 5, 'years. They have never disobeyed God even for a split second. If all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 38, 3, 5, 'that God wanted was obedience from man, God could have made man like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 38, 4, 5, 'those stars and planets without free will. He could have made man of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 38, 5, 5, 'flesh and blood but programmed inwardly like a robot. You know there are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 38, 6, 5, 'computerized robots today that can be programmed to do almost anything.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 38, 7, 5, 'God Almighty could have created man like a robot and programmed to obey');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 38, 8, 5, 'Him exactly. He would never have gone anywhere near the tree of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 38, 9, 5, 'knowledge of good and evil because he was programmed not to go there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 38, 10, 5, 'like a computer that''s programmed to do whatever we teach it to do.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 38, 11, 5, 'In the same way, God could have made Adam and Eve like that and they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 38, 12, 5, 'would have obeyed 100% but God did not want just obedience. He''s got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 38, 13, 5, 'obedience from the planets and the stars and the trees and the seeds');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 38, 14, 5, 'that obeys God''s laws in creation and many other things. For man, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 38, 15, 5, 'wanted obedience that was voluntary. This is so important because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 38, 16, 5, 'without voluntary obedience there can be no holiness. God is holy and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 38, 17, 5, 'man can never be holy unless he chooses to obey. That''s why free will is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 38, 18, 5, 'the most important requirement for a man to be holy and God never takes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 38, 19, 5, 'it away. When a man is born again and becomes a Christian, God doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 38, 20, 5, 'take away his free will. When a man is filled with the Holy Spirit, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 38, 21, 5, 'doesn''t take away his free will. He still has complete control over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 38, 22, 5, 'himself. In fact, when a man is filled with the Holy Spirit, he has a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 38, 23, 5, 'better control over himself because the Bible says the fruit of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 38, 24, 5, 'Spirit is self-control (Galatians 5:23). So, you got to view with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 38, 25, 5, 'suspicion anyone who says that when he got filled with the Spirit, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 38, 26, 5, 'was thrown from one end of the room to the other or he couldn''t stop');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 38, 27, 5, 'speaking in tongues or he couldn''t have any control over himself. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 38, 28, 5, 'always makes me suspicious because I''ve seen in the scriptures that it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 39, 1, 5, 'demons who take away a man''s control over himself. Demon-possessed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 39, 2, 5, 'people have no control over themselves and I''ve personally seen many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 39, 3, 5, 'cases of demon-possessed people who have no control over themselves. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 39, 4, 5, 'devil is out to control man. God doesn''t want to control man like that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 39, 5, 5, 'to the point where He takes away his free will. The devil on the other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 39, 6, 5, 'hand seeks to take away man''s free will. I’ve seen demon-possessed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 39, 7, 5, 'people who have no control over themselves and that''s why you read in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 39, 8, 5, 'the Bible about demon possession, but you never read in the Bible about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 39, 9, 5, 'Holy Spirit possession. What you read in the Bible is Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 39, 10, 5, 'filling. What is the difference between filling and possession? The Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 39, 11, 5, 'Spirit fills, demons possess. Possess means total control and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 39, 12, 5, 'demon-possessed person will not know what he''s talking and what he''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 39, 13, 5, 'doing. They do all types of foolish things, but a man filled with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 39, 14, 5, 'Holy Spirit is in complete 100% control of his faculties all the time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 39, 15, 5, 'It says in 1 Corinthians 14:32 that the spirit of the prophets is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 39, 16, 5, 'subject to the prophets. That''s a very important verse. It that means if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 39, 17, 5, 'the Holy Spirit fills me and I exercise a gift of the Holy Spirit, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 39, 18, 5, 'will have complete control over my faculties. It could be prophesying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 39, 19, 5, 'it could be teaching, it could be speaking in tongues. Whatever it is, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 39, 20, 5, 'have complete control over my faculties, and I can start and stop when I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 39, 21, 5, 'want to. The spirit of the prophets is subject to the prophets. Every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 39, 22, 5, 'gift of the Holy Spirit given to us if is for us to exercise according');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 39, 23, 5, 'to our own choice. If God gives a man a gift of teaching, the man has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 39, 24, 5, 'control of when to use it. God has given me a gift of teaching. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 39, 25, 5, 'wake me up at 3 o''clock in the middle of the night and tell me to speak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 39, 26, 5, 'for one hour or 10 minutes, I can teach because the gift has been given');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 39, 27, 5, 'to me and my spirit is subject to me. So free will is something God gave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 39, 28, 5, 'Adam and God needed Adam to make a choice in order to be holy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 40, 1, 5, 'That’s why when he sent him into the Garden of Eden, he didn''t tell him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 40, 2, 5, 'to do whatever he likes. How would you know whether he''s exercising his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 40, 3, 5, 'will on the side of God? So, God said, “There are 10,000 trees there or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 40, 4, 5, 'more than that but there''s one tree I don''t want you to take part off.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 40, 5, 5, 'Now it''s not a difficult command if you''re permitted to do 10,000 things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 40, 6, 5, 'in a room but only one thing you should avoid. You can''t say that''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 40, 7, 5, 'difficult command; that''s the easiest thing in the world. If God on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 40, 8, 5, 'other hand, had told Adam, “There are 10,000 trees there. You shouldn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 40, 9, 5, 'touch any of them. you''re only permitted to eat of this one tree”, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 40, 10, 5, 'would have been difficult, but it wasn''t like that. God''s commands are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 40, 11, 5, 'not burdensome. His commands are easy (1 John 5). It is the devil who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 40, 12, 5, 'tells us that God''s commands are heavy and a burden. Jesus said, “My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 40, 13, 5, 'yoke is easy, and my burden is light” (Matthew 11:29-30). Take my yoke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 40, 14, 5, 'upon you because it''s easy but the yoke of the devil is heavy. The yoke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 40, 15, 5, 'where you choose your own way in life is a heavy one. So, we see here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 40, 16, 5, 'that free will is something God never takes away till the end of your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 40, 17, 5, 'life. You can be the most Spirit-filled person on earth, and you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 40, 18, 5, 'complete control of your faculties and you can choose till the end of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 40, 19, 5, 'your life whether you want to follow the Lord or not.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 40, 20, 5, 'God is not going to hold you in such a way as if to say, “Well now, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 40, 21, 5, 'have to go to heaven whether you like it or not. “Some people teach that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 40, 22, 5, 'once you’ve given your life to Christ, God holds you in such a way that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 40, 23, 5, 'you have no freedom now. You have to go to heaven whether you want to or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 40, 24, 5, 'not. They say once your saved, you are saved forever whether you like it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 40, 25, 5, 'or not. How could that be because that would mean that man''s free will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 40, 26, 5, 'has been taken away. Now Jesus said, “My sheep hear my voice and they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 40, 27, 5, 'follow Me, and I give them eternal life, and no one will pluck them out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 40, 28, 5, 'of My hand. My Father who has given them to Me is greater than all and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 41, 1, 5, 'no one is able to pluck them out of His hand” (John 10:27-29). We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 41, 2, 5, 'believe with all our heart that Jesus is Almighty, God the Father is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 41, 3, 5, 'Almighty and if we are in their hands, no power on earth and this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 41, 4, 5, 'universe can pluck us out of Jesus hands or the Father''s hands. But we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 41, 5, 5, 'can jump out ourselves. That''s the thing that makes us lose our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 41, 6, 5, 'salvation where we decide I don''t want to follow the Lord anymore. Just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 41, 7, 5, 'like a man can divorce his wife, he can divorce Christ and say, “I’ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 41, 8, 5, 'had it now. I don''t want to go this way” and people have done that. Now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 41, 9, 5, 'if God were to take away a man''s free will and possess a person like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 41, 10, 5, 'demons possess a person, then of course the man would never be lost.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 41, 11, 5, 'He''d be like a robot from that moment onwards and there are some people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 41, 12, 5, 'who teach something very similar to that by saying, “When a man accepts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 41, 13, 5, 'Christ, he becomes like a robot and he can never be lost again.” It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 41, 14, 5, 'ridiculous. They are implying that a man filled with the Holy Spirit has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 41, 15, 5, 'no control over himself. There are all types of wrong teachings because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 41, 16, 5, 'people have not understood the importance of free will in holiness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 41, 17, 5, 'Now apply this to yourself. You have to choose whether you want to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 41, 18, 5, 'holy or not. Like someone has said, “Every man is as holy as he wants to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 41, 19, 5, 'be.” You may not realize the truth of that statement but it''s absolutely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 41, 20, 5, 'true. If you are not more holy today, the real reason is because you did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 41, 21, 5, 'not want to be more holy. You''re not interested in more holiness than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 41, 22, 5, 'you actually have. If you were, you would be more holy. You would have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 41, 23, 5, 'made those choices in life that made you more holy, but you haven''t made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 41, 24, 5, 'those choices because you''re not interested in more holiness. Everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 41, 25, 5, 'depends on choice and the decisions you make determine what you''ll be 10');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 41, 26, 5, 'years later. For example, Jesus said in Luke 9:23, “If anyone hears my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 41, 27, 5, 'voice (if anyone wants to follow me), let him take up his cross daily.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 41, 28, 5, 'Only then can he be My disciple. No one can be my disciple if he does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 42, 1, 5, 'not deny himself and take up his cross every day.” What does that mean?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 42, 2, 5, 'That means every day I''m faced with choices. In those choices, I have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 42, 3, 5, 'say “no” to my own will and say “yes” to the will of God. That is what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 42, 4, 5, 'it means to deny myself and take up the cross. That means put my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 42, 5, 5, 'self-will to death and do the will of God. Now think of two people who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 42, 6, 5, 'are converted on the same day, going to the same church with the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 42, 7, 5, 'opportunities and they attend the same meetings. 10 years later, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 42, 8, 5, 'find one is way ahead of the other person spiritually even though they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 42, 9, 5, 'both attended the same number of meetings, attended the same church read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 42, 10, 5, 'the same Bible and had the same opportunities. Why? Because in those 10');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 42, 11, 5, 'years, in all the different situations that these two men faced and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 42, 12, 5, 'choices they made, one brother denied himself frequently and chose the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 42, 13, 5, 'will of God. The other one was more careless and indulged himself more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 42, 14, 5, 'often. The result is the first brother is miles ahead of the other one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 42, 15, 5, 'spiritually even though they both started at the same point. What is it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 42, 16, 5, 'that made the difference? The choices they made. Free will determines');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 42, 17, 5, 'how holy you''re going to be. Free will is going to determine what your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 42, 18, 5, 'reward will be in heaven. Your choices are going to determine how close');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 42, 19, 5, 'you''ll be to Jesus in heaven. That is the greatest reward God offers to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 42, 20, 5, 'men.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 42, 21, 5, 'So, we see the free will that God gave to Adam is a very precious gift.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 42, 22, 5, 'One of the greatest characteristics of God which I really appreciate and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 42, 23, 5, 'have learned to value is the fact that He allows me freedom to choose.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 42, 24, 5, 'Now when you are gripped by this, it produces a result in your life. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 42, 25, 5, 'become like the God we worship. If the God you worship is unholy, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 42, 26, 5, 'become unholy. If the God you worship is holy, you become holy. In Psalm');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 42, 27, 5, '115:8, it says that a man who makes idols ends up becoming like him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 42, 28, 5, 'Those who make idols become like them. We become like the God we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 43, 1, 5, 'worship. If the God I worship, the true God is one who gives me complete');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 43, 2, 5, 'freedom to choose, it''s going to make me like that in relation to my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 43, 3, 5, 'coworkers and those who work with me or under me. I will give them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 43, 4, 5, 'complete freedom. I will give my brothers in the church where I am an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 43, 5, 5, 'elder freedom to choose and I will not sort of sit on them and control');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 43, 6, 5, 'them like the cults do. The people in the cults do that because they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 43, 7, 5, 'don''t know the true God. They worship a false god and they may call him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 43, 8, 5, 'Jesus, but it is another Jesus. Anyone who seeks to control your life in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 43, 9, 5, 'any way has not understood the first thing about God. He''s only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 43, 10, 5, 'understood the devil''s way because demons possess. Cult leaders try to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 43, 11, 5, 'possess your mind and your emotions and your will, but godly men will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 43, 12, 5, 'give you the freedom that Almighty God Himself gives. This is such an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 43, 13, 5, 'important principle and if you don''t understand it, you can be a prey to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 43, 14, 5, 'pastors and leaders and Christian leaders and preachers who want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 43, 15, 5, 'control your life. Don''t ever yield to them. That''s the way of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 43, 16, 5, 'devil. The Bible says in 1 Corinthians 7:23, “You are bought with a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 43, 17, 5, 'price; do not become the slaves of men.” It’s very important to remember');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 43, 18, 5, 'that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 43, 19, 5, 'The other great gift God is given to man is a conscience. This is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 43, 20, 5, 'tremendous gift. Conscience is what tells us when we do something wrong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 43, 21, 5, 'immediately. Or when you''re about to do something wrong, your conscience');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 43, 22, 5, 'will tell you that''s wrong and shouldn''t be doing that. It is conscience');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 43, 23, 5, 'that keeps us on the way of spiritual life. The conscience is compared');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 43, 24, 5, 'with the eye. Jesus said if a man''s eye is clear, his whole body is full');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 43, 25, 5, 'of light. If you want to know what blindness is, just shut your eyes for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 43, 26, 5, '15 seconds. Blindness is a terrible thing to have. Because we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 43, 27, 5, 'vision, the light that falls on objects outside comes into our brain and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 43, 28, 5, 'we can see objects and we can see people. If our eyes are spoiled by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 44, 1, 5, 'cataract, by blindness, by sickness, all that light stops coming in and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 44, 2, 5, 'we''re not able to see anything. This is what happens when a man is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 44, 3, 5, 'careless with this conscience. All of us will recognize that eyesight is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 44, 4, 5, 'a very precious gift. We got two eyes even though one is good enough for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 44, 5, 5, 'a lot of things, but we don''t want to lose even one eye. We want to use');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 44, 6, 5, 'both eyes because we get three-dimensional vision with two eyes. Why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 44, 7, 5, 'then are so many people careless with their conscience? The conscience');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 44, 8, 5, 'is to our spirit exactly what the eyes are to our body. Jesus said the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 44, 9, 5, 'lamp of the body is the eye. He said, “If your eyes are clear, your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 44, 10, 5, 'whole body will be full of light. Be careful that your eye does not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 44, 11, 5, 'become darkness” (Luke 11:34).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 44, 12, 5, 'So how does this apply to our conscience? What do you do when you get a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 44, 13, 5, 'speck in your eye? Dust gets into your eyes sometimes and it irritates');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 44, 14, 5, 'your eye. You eye keeps blinking frequently and even if you''re doing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 44, 15, 5, 'some very important work, you''ll stop it, go to a wash basin and wash');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 44, 16, 5, 'off that dust. If you don''t wash it off, gradually if dust keeps on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 44, 17, 5, 'accumulating in your eye, your can become blind. People with leprosy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 44, 18, 5, 'sometimes are not able to close their eyelids and if the eyelids remain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 44, 19, 5, 'open all the time, dust keeps accumulating there and they become blind.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 44, 20, 5, 'It''s not the leprosy that causes the blindness, it is the dust');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 44, 21, 5, 'accumulating on the eye and they are not able to close their eyelids');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 44, 22, 5, 'because of leprosy having killed those the muscles that control the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 44, 23, 5, 'eyelids.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 44, 24, 5, 'And so just like we are careful with our eyesight, we need to be careful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 44, 25, 5, 'our conscience. Think if for example, you have done something wrong.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 44, 26, 5, 'It''s like dust on your conscience and you don''t cleanse it away. Then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 44, 27, 5, 'you do another thing that''s wrong, you allow dust to accumulate on your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 44, 28, 5, 'conscience over a period of time. It''s just like allowing dust to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 45, 1, 5, 'accumulate on your eyes. Now what will happen? After some time, you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 45, 2, 5, 'become spiritually blind. You won''t be able to see. When you read the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 45, 3, 5, 'Bible, you won''t get anything out of it. You won''t be able to see the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 45, 4, 5, 'reality of God. You won''t be able to see spiritual truths; you won''t be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 45, 5, 5, 'able to get divine revelation to enable you to live life on this earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 45, 6, 5, 'You have many problems if you are not careful with your conscience to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 45, 7, 5, 'preserve it pure. That''s why I recommend to people, just like we would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 45, 8, 5, 'do with our eyes as soon as your conscience convicts you of something,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 45, 9, 5, 'cleanse it away. Go to God in repentance and confess it and say, “Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 45, 10, 5, 'I’m sorry, please forgive me. I did this.” Take the blame and don''t put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 45, 11, 5, 'the blame on other people like Adam. Then the blood of Christ cleanses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 45, 12, 5, 'us from all sin. The Bible says if we confess our sin, God is faithful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 45, 13, 5, 'and just and righteous to forgive us our sins and to cleanse us from all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 45, 14, 5, 'unrighteousness (1 John 1:9). “If we walk in the light as He is in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 45, 15, 5, 'light, we have fellowship with one with another and the blood of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 45, 16, 5, 'Christ His Son cleanses us from all sin” (1 John 1:7). Conscience is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 45, 17, 5, 'very important part of our spirit - the most important part of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 45, 18, 5, 'being. You must preserve it just like you preserve your eyes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 45, 19, 5, 'Let me use one more illustration. The prick of conscience is like pain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 45, 20, 5, 'in our body. When a thorn pokes your foot, immediately you feel pain.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 45, 21, 5, 'That pain is a blessing because if you didn''t feel that pain, the thorn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 45, 22, 5, 'would remain in your foot. You won''t even know there''s a thorn there.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 45, 23, 5, 'Your foot would get infected and it''ll become full of pus and you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 45, 24, 5, 'wouldn''t know it because you don''t feel any pain and it''s at the bottom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 45, 25, 5, 'side of your foot. Finally, your foot becomes gangrenous and has to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 45, 26, 5, 'cut off. What is it that saves our feet from being cut off? Pain. Do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 45, 27, 5, 'know that pain is one of the greatest blessings that God has given us in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 45, 28, 5, 'our body? Pain when you have a stomach ache. Supposing you have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 46, 1, 5, 'repeated stomach ache. That would cause you concern. It may indicate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 46, 2, 5, 'there''s something wrong with your body. That pain makes you go to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 46, 3, 5, 'doctor and the doctor looks at your body confirms that you got a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 46, 4, 5, 'sickness and gives you medicine to cure your problem. But you detected');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 46, 5, 5, 'the problem by pain. Now think if you did not have pain and something''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 46, 6, 5, 'wrong inside your body. You wouldn’t have a stomach ache. You think life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 46, 7, 5, 'is great because you never get some stomach aches and you never get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 46, 8, 5, 'headaches. But without pain, you don''t feel it, but the damage is still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 46, 9, 5, 'taking place and your body''s being destroyed but you don''t feel it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 46, 10, 5, 'Thank God for the gift of pain by which you feel things. If you didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 46, 11, 5, 'have it, your body would die very soon. Pain is what protects us from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 46, 12, 5, 'sickness. Now conscience is like that. When your conscience convicts you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 46, 13, 5, 'that you did that thing wrong, it’s painful. If you ignore it, you kill');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 46, 14, 5, 'it. You kill it by rejecting it. After some time, you will not hear the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 46, 15, 5, 'voice of conscience anymore.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 46, 16, 5, 'I''ll illustrate that for you. Think of a two-year-old trying to tell a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 46, 17, 5, 'lie to his mother. His mother asked him, “Son, did you do this?” The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 46, 18, 5, 'little boy looks up and he says, “No mommy, I didn''t do it,” but you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 46, 19, 5, 'see in the way he says it that he is lying. All over his face, it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 46, 20, 5, 'written “I am telling you a lie” because he''s not very clever at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 46, 21, 5, 'concealing his lie. The way he says the lie itself gives it away because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 46, 22, 5, 'his conscience is convicting him that he did wrong. Now you see that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 46, 23, 5, 'same child after 20 years, he''s told so many lies. By the time he is 25.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 46, 24, 5, 'he can tell you a lie with such a straight face that you''ll believe it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 46, 25, 5, 'He can tell you, “Oh I didn''t know what you are talking about” in such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 46, 26, 5, 'way that you believe this absolute lie. Men are good actors and you and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 46, 27, 5, 'I know how easy it is for us to act and tell a lie about something. How');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 46, 28, 5, 'have we come to this place? Because we have killed the voice of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 47, 1, 5, 'conscience for many, many years and we have destroyed ourselves in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 47, 2, 5, 'process. This is the reason why many people can never become spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 47, 3, 5, 'because they''ve killed the voice of conscience in area after area after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 47, 4, 5, 'area. They have lusted and lusted sexually with their eyes and all types');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 47, 5, 5, 'of forbidden ways till conscience has been killed and it is almost');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 47, 6, 5, 'impossible for them to be pure now. But there is hope. If we open our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 47, 7, 5, 'beings to God''s Holy Spirit, He can re-sensitize our conscience and make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 47, 8, 5, 'it little by little more and more sensitive over a period of time that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 47, 9, 5, 'we can once again become spiritual. This is the good news of the gospel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 47, 10, 5, 'and it''s available for you to come to Jesus Christ and say, “Lord, I’m a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 47, 11, 5, 'sinner. Forgive me, cleanse me and fill me with your Spirit. He''ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 47, 12, 5, 'answer you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 47, 13, 6, 'Chapter 6 Grace And Faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 47, 14, 6, 'In the last couple of studies, we looked at some basic principles that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 47, 15, 6, 'the Word of God teaches about the way God made man and what God expects');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 47, 16, 6, 'from man. In our last study, we saw the importance of free will and of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 47, 17, 6, 'listening to the promptings of conscience and not suppressing the voice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 47, 18, 6, 'of conscience. Now we have to face the reality of the fact that all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 47, 19, 6, 'human beings have sinned. The Bible says in Romans 3:23 that all have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 47, 20, 6, 'sinned and come short of the glory of God. So, in God''s eyes, it doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 47, 21, 6, 'make a difference what religion you belong to. Think of a baby that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 47, 22, 6, 'born into any religious family, whatever religion it is or an atheist');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 47, 23, 6, 'family. You look at that baby, it looks like any other baby; there isn’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 47, 24, 6, 'a difference. Now as those babies grow up and become little children and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 47, 25, 6, 'they''re in a school, they all fight, they all quarrel, they all grab,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 47, 26, 6, 'they''re all selfish, they all are proud and want to exalt themselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 47, 27, 6, 'Every characteristic of Adam''s nature is found equally in all those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 47, 28, 6, 'children. What difference does it make that one belongs to one religion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 48, 1, 6, 'and another belongs to another? Maybe externally, there could be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 48, 2, 6, 'difference; one child goes to a church, another goes to a temple,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 48, 3, 6, 'another goes to a mosque and another goes nowhere and watches television');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 48, 4, 6, 'on Sunday morning. But wherever they may go on Sunday, when they come to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 48, 5, 6, 'school on Monday, they all behave just as selfishly as everybody else.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 48, 6, 6, 'So, the change is only external and even where their parents may teach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 48, 7, 6, 'them to be cultured and to say, “thank you” and “sorry”, it''s all on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 48, 8, 6, 'outside. They may teach them to be unselfish on the outside but there''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 48, 9, 6, 'no change of nature within. God treats all human beings on the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 48, 10, 6, 'level. You''re not a child of God because you''re born into any particular');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 48, 11, 6, 'religion. You have to choose yourself when you come to an age of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 48, 12, 6, 'understanding. That goes back to what we said in our last study about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 48, 13, 6, 'the importance of choice; you''re not forced to become a child of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 48, 14, 6, 'just because you were born into a Christian family. You have to make a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 48, 15, 6, 'personal choice that you want to receive Jesus Christ as your Lord and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 48, 16, 6, 'your Savior. All human beings have sinned; every single person has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 48, 17, 6, 'committed numerous sins and has come short of God''s standard.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 48, 18, 6, 'It''s like a vessel; whether the vessel has got one hole or a thousand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 48, 19, 6, 'holes, the water leaks out. After a little while there''s no water in any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 48, 20, 6, 'of the vessels. The vessel may have one hole, ten holes or a thousand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 48, 21, 6, 'holes, the end result is that all the water leaks out. Sin is like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 48, 22, 6, 'The Bible says if you committed one sin or a thousand sins, you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 48, 23, 6, 'guilty. It’s just like how one germ is enough to pollute something that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 48, 24, 6, 'has been sterilized in a surgical theater. The gloves and the equipment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 48, 25, 6, 'are all sterilized. You don''t need a thousand germs to make it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 48, 26, 6, 'unsterile; one is enough. Sin is like that; one sin is enough to corrupt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 48, 27, 6, 'a person and make him unfit for God''s presence. There''s no difference as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 48, 28, 6, 'far as coming into God''s presence is concerned. The man who''s committed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 49, 1, 6, 'one sin and the man who''s coming to the thousand sins are both unfit to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 49, 2, 6, 'come to God’s presence. That''s why the Bible says all have come short of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 49, 3, 6, 'the glory of God; they''ve come short of God''s perfect standard. God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 49, 4, 6, 'perfect standard is 100% and the man who gets 99% fails and the man will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 49, 5, 6, 'get 0% also fails.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 49, 6, 6, 'Once we recognize that, it''s important to see that the first thing that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 49, 7, 6, 'God needed to do to restore man''s fellowship with Him is to find some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 49, 8, 6, 'way to remove his guilt and to get his sins to be forgiven. God has to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 49, 9, 6, 'find a way to remove the guilt of all the things that man has done from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 49, 10, 6, 'his childhood. Now we need to see on what basis does God forgive us our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 49, 11, 6, 'sins. Some people say God is a loving God and therefore if I go to Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 49, 12, 6, 'and say, “I’m sorry”, He should forgive me. The thing is God has got a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 49, 13, 6, 'dual responsibility not only as a loving Father but also as the Judge of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 49, 14, 6, 'the universe. The universe is established on certain laws. God is moral');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 49, 15, 6, 'and upright; there are certain things God cannot do. For example, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 49, 16, 6, 'cannot tell a lie and He cannot violate His Own principles of justice.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 49, 17, 6, 'One example of it would be if I have committed a crime for which the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 49, 18, 6, 'punishment is some large fine and if I am taken to court and if my own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 49, 19, 6, 'father is the judge there. However, much he may love me, he cannot let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 49, 20, 6, 'me go. Even if I say, “Dad, I''m really sorry for what I did and I''ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 49, 21, 6, 'never do it again”, he cannot let me go. If he does let me go, he''d lose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 49, 22, 6, 'his job. He''d be violating the principles of justice which he as a judge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 49, 23, 6, 'is supposed to uphold. Now our standard of justice is so small compared');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 49, 24, 6, 'to God''s infinite standard of justice. If a human judge cannot let the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 49, 25, 6, 'son whom he loves to go but has to punish him, how much more God. So,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 49, 26, 6, 'God can''t let you go just because you say you''re sorry just like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 49, 27, 6, 'judge who is my dad can’t let me go in the court just because I say I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 49, 28, 6, 'sorry. I may be sincere, but I still need to be punished for the crime I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 50, 1, 6, 'committed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 50, 2, 6, 'The good news is that there''s something else that my dad as a judge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 50, 3, 6, 'could do and still uphold the principles of justice. Let''s say the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 50, 4, 6, 'punishment for my crime is a million rupees. My father who is the judge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 50, 5, 6, 'writes the verdict of a million rupees fine or you go to jail if you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 50, 6, 6, 'unable to pay it. Now it looks to me as though my dad is being very hard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 50, 7, 6, 'on me, but he isn’t. He is just upholding the principles of justice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 50, 8, 6, 'which he has to do as a judge. That''s what God has to do - but once he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 50, 9, 6, 'is convicted me and declared the fine that I have to pay, he can step');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 50, 10, 6, 'down from that chair take off his judge’s robes and come to me as my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 50, 11, 6, 'father, take out his own personal checkbook and sign a check for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 50, 12, 6, 'million rupees and give it to me to pay the fine. You see what he''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 50, 13, 6, 'done; he has upheld the principles of justice and nobody can accuse him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 50, 14, 6, 'of showing any partiality to me. He has fined me the highest penalty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 50, 15, 6, 'that the law demanded, and I can''t accuse him of saying he doesn''t love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 50, 16, 6, 'me because he paid the penalty himself. What a huge price he paid in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 50, 17, 6, 'order that I might be free. That makes me love him tremendously.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 50, 18, 6, 'Now this is what God has really done. He says the wages of sin is death.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 50, 19, 6, 'That''s the punishment you deserve. Not just physical death. Physical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 50, 20, 6, 'death is only one part of all that God calls death. Man is spirit, soul');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 50, 21, 6, 'and body and everything dies; it''s being cut off and separated from God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 50, 22, 6, 'for eternity. That''s what death means, and the Lord has to punish us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 50, 23, 6, 'with that punishment the law demands. The amazing thing is that God then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 50, 24, 6, 'came down in the form of man and be known as Jesus Christ and took that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 50, 25, 6, 'punishment on Himself. Not only physical death on the cross but when He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 50, 26, 6, 'died on the cross, He was forsaken by His Father for 3 hours and He took');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 50, 27, 6, 'that spiritual punishment too - now I can be free. This is the basis of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 50, 28, 6, 'God''s forgiveness and this is why the message of the Christian gospel is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 51, 1, 6, 'so unique because of these two things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 51, 2, 6, 'How do we know that God accepted the sacrifice of His Son on the cross?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 51, 3, 6, 'One proof is that after Jesus was buried, on the third day He rose from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 51, 4, 6, 'the dead. That was the proof that God gave to man by raising His Son');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 51, 5, 6, 'from the dead that He has accepted that sacrifice. If Christ had not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 51, 6, 6, 'risen from the dead, then we would have no proof that God the Father had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 51, 7, 6, 'accepted that sacrifice. The fact that God raised Him from the dead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 51, 8, 6, 'after three days is the clearest proof that God''s accepted His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 51, 9, 6, 'sacrifice. The basis of God''s forgiveness is the unique message of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 51, 10, 6, 'Christian gospel. Two things; one is that Christ died for our sins on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 51, 11, 6, 'the cross and second is that He rose up from the dead after three days.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 51, 12, 6, 'The Christian faith is founded on these two unchangeable facts and in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 51, 13, 6, 'these two areas, Christ is unique. There is no religion in the world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 51, 14, 6, 'where any leader has ever even claimed to die for the sins of the world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 51, 15, 6, 'There have been many religions and many religious leaders in the world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 51, 16, 6, 'but none of them have ever claimed to be dying for the sins of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 51, 17, 6, 'world. Secondly, none of them ever rose from the dead. When they died,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 51, 18, 6, 'that was it and they never came out of the grave. Death is man''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 51, 19, 6, 'greatest enemy. No one has ever been able to conquer it. So that is why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 51, 20, 6, 'we believe that this is the true gospel and the good news because of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 51, 21, 6, 'these two very important facts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 51, 22, 6, 'The Christian faith is not a religion of do good, be kind, don''t harm');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 51, 23, 6, 'anybody, don''t tell lies. That''s not the foundation of the Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 51, 24, 6, 'life. The foundation of the Christian life is that Christ died for our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 51, 25, 6, 'sins and He rose again from the dead. A building is got a foundation and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 51, 26, 6, 'the superstructure; we need both to complete a building. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 51, 27, 6, 'superstructure is the many teachings of Jesus, which maybe other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 51, 28, 6, 'religious leaders also say, like don''t harm anybody, do to others as you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 52, 1, 6, 'would want them to do to you, speak the truth, be humble, respect others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 52, 2, 6, 'etc. There are many good things that the Bible teaches but that is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 52, 3, 6, 'the superstructure; don''t confuse the superstructure with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 52, 4, 6, 'foundation. You can have windows and doors in a superstructure, but you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 52, 5, 6, 'don''t have them in the foundation. The foundation is made of something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 52, 6, 6, 'completely different from what you see in the superstructure and that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 52, 7, 6, 'the mistake that so many people make when they say all religions lead to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 52, 8, 6, 'one God. Is that really true? In which religion did somebody die for my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 52, 9, 6, 'sins and to take away the punishment of my sin? My biggest problem is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 52, 10, 6, 'that I''m guilty before God and how can I get rid of this guilt? In which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 52, 11, 6, 'religion did someone rise from the dead and prove that he was indeed who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 52, 12, 6, 'he claimed to be; God manifest in the flesh? Only Jesus made that claim');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 52, 13, 6, 'and proved it. That''s why Jesus says in John 14:6, “I am the way; no one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 52, 14, 6, 'comes to the Father but by me.” It''s a pretty bold claim but that is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 52, 15, 6, 'truth. People say that we are narrow-minded when we say something like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 52, 16, 6, 'that. Well, that''s not my opinion. If it''s my opinion, you can reject');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 52, 17, 6, 'it. These are the exact words of Jesus in John 14:6: “I am the way the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 52, 18, 6, 'truth and the life no one comes to the Father but through me.” No one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 52, 19, 6, 'can come to God the Father except through Jesus Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 52, 20, 6, 'Doesn''t that sound very narrow, but it is the truth. The truth is narrow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 52, 21, 6, 'minded. Being broad minded is not necessarily an indication of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 52, 22, 6, 'truthfulness. For example, 2+2 = 4; that''s pretty narrow-minded.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 52, 23, 6, 'Somebody may say why can''t we be a little more broad-minded and accept');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 52, 24, 6, '4.1 also. Why not allow a little on the other side also and say 2+2 =');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 52, 25, 6, '3.9 according to another person? Someone says 2+2 = 3; why not be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 52, 26, 6, 'broad-minded and accept that as well. Somebody else has 2+2 = 100, be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 52, 27, 6, 'broad-minded and accept that is well. Can you imagine the confusion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 52, 28, 6, 'there will be in everything on earth if he began to be broad-minded');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 53, 1, 6, 'about even a simple thing like addition? Truth is very narrow-minded;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 53, 2, 6, '2+2 is not even 4.00001, it 4. There''s no other answer. It''s something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 53, 3, 6, 'like that when Jesus said, “I’m the truth, I’m the way, no one comes to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 53, 4, 6, 'the Father but by me.” Why? because no one else died for the sins of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 53, 5, 6, 'world and no one else was raised from the dead proving thereby that He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 53, 6, 6, 'was who He claimed to be; the Son of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 53, 7, 6, 'This is the basis on which God forgives us. God can be just now, He can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 53, 8, 6, 'be righteous just like my father can be righteous in telling me you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 53, 9, 6, 'don''t have to go to jail, just take this check and go and pay your fine.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 53, 10, 6, 'But there is one thing I have to do. It''s a gift, I don''t have to work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 53, 11, 6, 'to get that check from my dad to pay my fine, I don''t have to spend a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 53, 12, 6, 'single day in jail, I don''t have to earn one cent of that, but I do need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 53, 13, 6, 'to do one thing. I need to receive what my father gives me. The check');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 53, 14, 6, 'that my father gives me, I have to receive it and say thank you. We can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 53, 15, 6, 'say that my father giving me the check to pay my fine is a picture of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 53, 16, 6, 'grace and my stretching my hand to take the check from his hand is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 53, 17, 6, 'picture of faith. When the Bible says by grace through faith you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 53, 18, 6, 'saved, this is what it means. In Ephesians 2:8, both these wonderful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 53, 19, 6, 'words are brought together: “By grace you have been saved through faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 53, 20, 6, 'and that not of yourselves; it is the gift of God, not of works so that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 53, 21, 6, 'no one should boast.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 53, 22, 6, 'Our salvation is by grace through faith. “By grace”, is my father giving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 53, 23, 6, 'me the check for me to pay the fine, and “through faith” is me receiving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 53, 24, 6, 'the check from my dad and saying thank you and paying the fine to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 53, 25, 6, 'law of God and then I''m free. Everything in the Christian life is “by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 53, 26, 6, 'grace, through faith”. It''s not just at the beginning of my Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 53, 27, 6, 'life. Our entire Christian life, we are to live, “by grace, through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 53, 28, 6, 'faith”. That means God is constantly offering us whatever we need.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 54, 1, 6, 'There’s a verse in 2nd Corinthians 12 which says, “My grace is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 54, 2, 6, 'sufficient for you.” The Lord told this to Paul when he was facing a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 54, 3, 6, 'particular problem and the problem wasn''t removed. God could have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 54, 4, 6, 'removed it, but He did not remove it. It was a sickness that Paul, most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 54, 5, 6, 'probably had. He prayed three times that God would heal him, and he was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 54, 6, 6, 'not healed. The greatest apostle in the Christian Church was not healed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 54, 7, 6, 'He who had even raised the dead, healed the sick and cast out demons was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 54, 8, 6, 'not healed himself. Why did God not heal him? Because Paul was in danger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 54, 9, 6, 'of becoming proud and pride is worse than any sickness you can ever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 54, 10, 6, 'have. If you become proud, God will have to resist you. That''s a law;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 54, 11, 6, 'God resists the proud gives grace to the humble (1 Peter 5:5-6, James');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 54, 12, 6, '4:6-7). Paul was in tremendous danger of being proud because he had been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 54, 13, 6, 'used so much by the Lord. Paul had planted churches, raised the dead,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 54, 14, 6, 'cast out demons, written scripture and even been taken up to the third');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 54, 15, 6, 'heaven. He had seen and heard unspeakable things and therefore was in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 54, 16, 6, 'great danger of spiritual pride. The best way God could keep him humble');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 54, 17, 6, 'was by allowing him to have this sickness permanently till the end of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 54, 18, 6, 'his life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 54, 19, 6, 'Paul calls the sickness a gift of God; that''s what he says there in 2nd');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 54, 20, 6, 'Corinthians 12:7, was given to me means, it was a gift. When he realized');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 54, 21, 6, 'the reason why God allowed him to have this thorn in the flesh, this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 54, 22, 6, 'messenger of Satan to harass and trouble him all the time, he was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 54, 23, 6, 'content with it (2 Corinthians 12:10). Paul said, “I am content with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 54, 24, 6, 'weakness, with the way people insult me, with persecutions, with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 54, 25, 6, 'difficulties because these make me weak and, in my weakness, I can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 54, 26, 6, 'experience God’s grace.” My grace is sufficient for you means in every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 54, 27, 6, 'situation in life, every trial you face, every temptation, God will give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 54, 28, 6, 'you enough grace to overcome it. The promise of God is that His check is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 55, 1, 6, 'enough to pay the bill; whatever the amount is. But we need to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 55, 2, 6, 'something if we are to pay the bill. Our Dad is giving us the check and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 55, 3, 6, 'we have to receive it and say, “Thank you.” That is faith. The Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 55, 4, 6, 'life is a series of trials, tests, struggles and in every one of those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 55, 5, 6, 'situations, God says, “My grace is enough for you.” Every day, there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 55, 6, 6, 'a check to pay the bill for the day. God’s grace is sufficient according');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 55, 7, 6, 'to our present need. We''re not going to be able to live on this earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 55, 8, 6, 'without facing needs. God allows us to face numerous needs, but the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 55, 9, 6, 'purpose of them all is to drive us to Himself so that we come to Him and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 55, 10, 6, 'say, “Lord, this is my bill; give me a check. I need some grace for this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 55, 11, 6, 'particular problem.” God never refuses when we acknowledge our need in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 55, 12, 6, 'humility. Only a humble person will acknowledge his need. A proud person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 55, 13, 6, 'says, “I don''t need God. I can handle all that myself.” A humble person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 55, 14, 6, 'comes to God and says, “God, I can''t handle this this. This bill is too');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 55, 15, 6, 'much for me. You got to pay it for me.” Lord says, “Sure; here is a free');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 55, 16, 6, 'gift.” I then take it with thanks.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 55, 17, 6, 'The promises of God in Scripture are meant to give us His grace. So many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 55, 18, 6, 'wonderful promises but none of them will be mine unless I take them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 55, 19, 6, 'Unless I cash those checks, I won’t receive the grace He intends to give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 55, 20, 6, 'to me. For example, if someone sends you a check and all you do is frame');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 55, 21, 6, 'it up and hang it up on the wall, you get nothing. But if you sign your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 55, 22, 6, 'name on the reverse and give it into the bank, you get the entire amount');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 55, 23, 6, 'of money. That''s exactly how God seeks to deal with us. He offers us His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 55, 24, 6, 'promises but those promises being in the Bible or hanging in our wall');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 55, 25, 6, 'don''t help us. We’ve got to take those promises to the bank of heaven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 55, 26, 6, 'and say in Jesus name, “I’m cashing this with my Amen.” Then I can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 55, 27, 6, 'receive everything beginning with forgiveness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 55, 28, 6, 'Everything is based on Christ having died for us on the cross and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 56, 1, 6, 'through His death, having purchased for us every single spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 56, 2, 6, 'blessing in heaven; there is no curse for us now. Galatians 3:13 says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 56, 3, 6, '“Christ has redeemed us from the curse of the law having become a curse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 56, 4, 6, 'for us.” Why did He become a curse for us? So that in Christ Jesus the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 56, 5, 6, 'blessing of Abraham might come upon us Gentiles. God blessed Abraham');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 56, 6, 6, 'four thousand years ago and promised to bless him and make him a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 56, 7, 6, 'blessing to all the families of the earth. Now it says here that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 56, 8, 6, 'blessing is today for everybody. It''s not just for that one man. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 56, 9, 6, 'for you, it''s for everybody and this is why it says here in Galatians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 56, 10, 6, '3:14 that God gives us the Holy Spirit. Through the Holy Spirit, I can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 56, 11, 6, 'receive all of God''s blessings. Ephesians 1:3 says, “He''s blessed me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 56, 12, 6, 'with every blessing of the Holy Spirit in the heavenly places in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 56, 13, 6, 'Christ.” I can take it all, and through me, those blessings can flow out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 56, 14, 6, 'to others. It all begins with forgiveness. God cleans the cup, fills it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 56, 15, 6, 'up with this blessing that I can pour it out to others. What a wonderful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 56, 16, 6, 'salvation and it''s open to all regardless of your religion. We got to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 56, 17, 6, 'humble ourselves and accept the gift from the Lord Jesus Christ and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 56, 18, 6, 'thank Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 56, 19, 7, 'Chapter 7 Two Types Of Sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 56, 20, 7, 'We''ve been looking in these past sessions on some foundational');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 56, 21, 7, 'principles that we are trying to learn from the first chapters of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 56, 22, 7, 'Bible. The Bible is the only book in the entire world that''s written by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 56, 23, 7, 'Almighty God through men. Many Christians claim to believe that but if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 56, 24, 7, 'they really believed it, they would study it. They would try to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 56, 25, 7, 'understand what God is saying to them. It''s inconsistent for a Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 56, 26, 7, 'to say that there is only one book in the whole world inspired by God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 56, 27, 7, 'and then not spend time trying to understand it or study it. God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 56, 28, 7, 'written the Scriptures in a special way and it''s not written like any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 57, 1, 7, 'other book. The Bible says in Proverbs 25:1 that is the glory of God to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 57, 2, 7, 'conceal a matter and it''s the glory of Kings to search out the matter.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 57, 3, 7, 'God in His glory has concealed a number of truths and divine revelation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 57, 4, 7, 'within the pages of Scripture and if you are a king in Christ, it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 57, 5, 7, 'your glory to search them out and find them. There are certain truths');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 57, 6, 7, 'that you can find on the surface of the Bible just like there are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 57, 7, 7, 'certain things you can find on the surface of the earth. But the most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 57, 8, 7, 'valuable things on the earth are not found on the surface, they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 57, 9, 7, 'found deep down in mines like gold, diamonds etc.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 57, 10, 7, 'It''s the same with Scripture. Men sometimes have to dig 10,000 feet into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 57, 11, 7, 'the ground to get some of those treasures out, but people are willing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 57, 12, 7, 'take the pains to do that to get a diamond or a gold out of there. Why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 57, 13, 7, 'aren''t Christian''s more eager to dig into God''s Word to find out what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 57, 14, 7, 'God is hidden here. It''s because there''s an inconsistency in their life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 57, 15, 7, 'They say they believe this is God''s Word, but they don''t treat it as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 57, 16, 7, 'such. It is not enough to study this book like we study some book on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 57, 17, 7, 'history or chemistry. For understanding this book, what we need is not a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 57, 18, 7, 'clever mind, but a pure heart. That''s why Jesus said in Matthew 11:25,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 57, 19, 7, '“I thank You Father that You have hidden these things from the clever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 57, 20, 7, 'and the intelligent and revealed them to babes.” Is there any book in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 57, 21, 7, 'the world that only babes can understand, and clever people can''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 57, 22, 7, 'understand? Only one and that''s the Bible. What do babes have which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 57, 23, 7, 'clever and intelligent people don''t have? A pure heart! Clever,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 57, 24, 7, 'intelligent people have a high IQ, but the heart may not be pure. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 57, 25, 7, 'those words of Jesus, we discover that God''s revelations are given to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 57, 26, 7, 'those whose hearts are pure. It is your heart condition that is more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 57, 27, 7, 'important than your head condition when you come to the scriptures.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 57, 28, 7, 'We’ve been trying to look into the depths of some of these passages of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 58, 1, 7, 'Scripture to try and find these treasures that God has given us. First');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 58, 2, 7, 'of all, we saw what God''s purpose for man was, the provision He makes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 58, 3, 7, 'for all our needs, Satan''s tactics to try and trip man up. We also saw');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 58, 4, 7, 'and the fall of man where he began to accuse his wife and his fellowship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 58, 5, 7, 'with God was broken and his fellowship with man was broken. We want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 58, 6, 7, 'look a little more at Genesis 3 and 4. We see something significant here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 58, 7, 7, 'in Genesis 3; we read that when God came and met Adam and asked him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 58, 8, 7, 'about his sin, Adam did not confess his sin except indirectly blamed his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 58, 9, 7, 'wife and the wife blamed the serpent. We find the word “cursed” coming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 58, 10, 7, 'twice. God''s punishment was a curse, but the curse was not upon Adam and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 58, 11, 7, 'Eve. It''s very important for us to notice that when Adam and Eve sinned,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 58, 12, 7, 'God did not curse them. God cursed the serpent, and that is the serpent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 58, 13, 7, 'who was possessed by the devil. God was cursing the devil there and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 58, 14, 7, 'serpent in whom the devil came in (Genesis 3:14).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 58, 15, 7, 'He says, “cursed are you more than all the cattle and every beast of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 58, 16, 7, 'field” and the second curse was on the ground” (Genesis 3:17). Now it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 58, 17, 7, 'very interesting that the Lord said to Adam, “you have listened to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 58, 18, 7, 'voice of your wife,” which was wrong on Adam’s part. God had made him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 58, 19, 7, 'the head of his wife and instead of being the head of his wife and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 58, 20, 7, 'encouraging his wife to obey God, he allowed his wife who was standing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 58, 21, 7, 'next to him to listen to the devil and obey him. A husband has the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 58, 22, 7, 'responsibility as the head of the home, and as God''s appointed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 58, 23, 7, 'representative in the home, to make sure that the devil doesn''t take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 58, 24, 7, 'over the house. You shouldn''t allow your children or your wife to let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 58, 25, 7, 'the devil run the house. If you''re the head of your house, God expects');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 58, 26, 7, 'you to fulfill your divine responsibility and ensure that as God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 58, 27, 7, 'representative in your house, the devil has no place in it. He told Adam');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 58, 28, 7, 'that because you''ve listened to the voice of your wife and you also ate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 59, 1, 7, 'from the tree which I commanded you not to eat, the ground is cursed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 59, 2, 7, 'Now strictly speaking, we would think that God would punish him and say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 59, 3, 7, '“you are cursed because of your sin” but He doesn''t say it. God doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 59, 4, 7, 'curse the woman and He doesn''t curse the man; He cursed the ground. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 59, 5, 7, 'see that the devil was cursed and the ground was cursed, but man was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 59, 6, 7, 'cursed. Man was only told that he would have to work very hard now in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 59, 7, 7, 'future. He will have to perspire, thorns and thistles would come forth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 59, 8, 7, 'in the ground, the animals would become wild and he would not find it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 59, 9, 7, 'easy to get his bread from the ground. The wife would also have painful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 59, 10, 7, 'labor in giving birth (Genesis 3:16). Another thing we see here is that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 59, 11, 7, 'God did not curse at Adam, but He actually give them a promise that He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 59, 12, 7, 'will provide a solution for their failure. That''s a wonderful thing we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 59, 13, 7, 'see about God and it''s very important for us to know something about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 59, 14, 7, 'God''s character Here. The devil comes to condemn us, to discourage us,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 59, 15, 7, 'to make us feel useless, rotten, good-for-nothing but God never speaks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 59, 16, 7, 'to us like that. If you hear a voice in your heart saying you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 59, 17, 7, 'useless, you''re good for nothing, you''ll never be able to make it in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 59, 18, 7, 'life and that you are hopeless, you can be 100% sure that, that is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 59, 19, 7, 'the voice of God, but the voice of the devil. The devil is always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 59, 20, 7, 'interested in discouraging you, scolding you, blaming you, and very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 59, 21, 7, 'often compelling you to act.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 59, 22, 7, 'God is not like that. You can distinguish the voice of God and the voice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 59, 23, 7, 'of the devil. God doesn''t condemn, He convicts. There''s a difference');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 59, 24, 7, 'between conviction and condemnation. God did not come to Adam tell him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 59, 25, 7, 'he was useless and good for nothing. God told him specifically what his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 59, 26, 7, 'sin was in that he listened to the voice of his wife and ate of the tree');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 59, 27, 7, 'that He commanded them not to eat off. God did not stop there, but also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 59, 28, 7, 'provided a solution for this problem. If your little son was doing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 60, 1, 7, 'arithmetic and he did not know how to solve a particular problem, what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 60, 2, 7, 'do you do? If you''re a bad father, you''ll turn around to your son and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 60, 3, 7, 'say you''re good for nothing, you''re useless, nothing good will ever come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 60, 4, 7, 'out of you and call him some bad names. But if you''re a good father, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 60, 5, 7, 'won''t just ignore his mistake and let it go. You''ll show him exactly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 60, 6, 7, 'where he made mistake and show him how to correct the problem. That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 60, 7, 7, 'the way you distinguish a good father from a bad one. It is also the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 60, 8, 7, 'you distinguish the voice of God and the voice of the devil. The voice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 60, 9, 7, 'of the devil is always condemnatory, accusatory, blaming us and saying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 60, 10, 7, 'nothing good will come out of us. But when God came to Adam, He told him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 60, 11, 7, 'specifically what he had done wrong and then also He told the serpent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 60, 12, 7, 'that one day his head would be crushed by a seed that came out of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 60, 13, 7, 'woman. That''s referring to Christ (Genesis 3:15). It’s very interesting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 60, 14, 7, 'also to see that God speaks about the solution before He speaks to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 60, 15, 7, 'woman and the man about their sin. Otherwise, they''d have been so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 60, 16, 7, 'discouraged. Isn''t that so wonderful to see that the solution is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 60, 17, 7, 'mentioned first and then God speaks to the woman and convicts her and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 60, 18, 7, 'tells her about how she''s going to be punished for her sin and then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 60, 19, 7, 'tells the man how he''s going to be punished for his sin. It''s very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 60, 20, 7, 'interesting to see God''s way; He does not scold us; He doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 60, 21, 7, 'discourage us, and this is a great example for fathers. It''s like God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 60, 22, 7, 'coming and saying, “listen Adam and Eve, I''ve provided a solution for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 60, 23, 7, 'this problem. My Son is going to come and crush the head of this devil,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 60, 24, 7, 'but I have to deal with both of you and this is what you did wrong and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 60, 25, 7, 'therefore you''re going to be punished.” God told both Adam and Eve what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 60, 26, 7, 'they did wrong and how they were going to be punished, but neither of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 60, 27, 7, 'them was cursed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 60, 28, 7, 'Now when you come to the next chapter, we find Cain, the first child');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 61, 1, 7, 'born to Adam and Eve is cursed by God (Genesis 4:11). Do you see the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 61, 2, 7, 'difference? Why didn’t He say those words to Adam and Eve? Why did He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 61, 3, 7, 'say that to Cain? What was Cain’s sin which made it worse than the sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 61, 4, 7, 'that Adam and Eve committed? It was so much worse that God in one case');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 61, 5, 7, 'cursed the ground and the serpent but, in this case, He curses the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 61, 6, 7, 'person himself. It’s very important to see the sin in Genesis 3 and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 61, 7, 7, 'sin in Genesis 4. We can learn something for ourselves and understand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 61, 8, 7, 'God’s principles by looking at the difference between these two types of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 61, 9, 7, 'sins. Why are we talking so much about sin? Because all the problems');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 61, 10, 7, 'that have come in the world are basically due to sin. For example, there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 61, 11, 7, 'are a lot of people preaching today about material financial prosperity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 61, 12, 7, 'They say a poor man needs material prosperity first and that God will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 61, 13, 7, 'make you prosperous. Then there are a lot of people who speak about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 61, 14, 7, 'physical healing and that is the most important thing a sick person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 61, 15, 7, 'needs. But do you know what the cause of all this financial distress and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 61, 16, 7, 'sickness is? it''s ultimately at the root a sin issue. If you merely cut');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 61, 17, 7, 'off the fruit and don''t deal with the root, you''re not going to solve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 61, 18, 7, 'the problem. Maybe you solve two problems of health and poverty but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 61, 19, 7, 'there are 101 other problems that come from this root of sin. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 61, 20, 7, 'why the Bible does not begin with telling us how sickness and poverty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 61, 21, 7, 'came into the world but how sin came into the world. Those are the first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 61, 22, 7, 'chapters of the Old Testament and in the first chapter of the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 61, 23, 7, 'Testament, we find the solution in the first promise in the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 61, 24, 7, 'Testament.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 61, 25, 7, 'The angel tells Joseph in Matthew 1:21, “You shall call His name Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 61, 26, 7, 'because He will save His people from their sins.” So, the name Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 61, 27, 7, 'means One who’s come to save us from our sins. Not from poverty and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 61, 28, 7, 'disease first of all, but to deal with the root like John the Baptist');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 62, 1, 7, 'said in Matthew 3 that the axe is laid to the root. Jesus didn’t come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 62, 2, 7, 'with a pair of scissors to cut off the problems of poverty and sickness,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 62, 3, 7, 'He come with an axe to deal with the root of the problem which is right');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 62, 4, 7, 'down at the bottom of the tree and that is sin. That’s why we need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 62, 5, 7, 'see the origin of sin because from that root has come all of man’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 62, 6, 7, 'problems, all the fights and quarrels and divorces and wars and famines');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 62, 7, 7, 'and earthquakes and every wretched thing that you can think of on this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 62, 8, 7, 'earth. What is the root cause? Man’s sin, and if that is not dealt with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 62, 9, 7, 'in your life, you can have a temporary solution to certain problems, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 62, 10, 7, 'end up eternally separated from God. It''s true that God blesses us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 62, 11, 7, 'physically, materially but if you only deal with those things and you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 62, 12, 7, 'haven''t dealt with the root. It doesn''t really solve your problem');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 62, 13, 7, 'basically and you can still be blessed in these ways and be eternally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 62, 14, 7, 'separated from God in hell. You can be blessed with prosperity and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 62, 15, 7, 'health and still go to hell but you if you''re saved from sin you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 62, 16, 7, 'never go to hell even if you''re poor and even if you''re sick. Elijah was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 62, 17, 7, 'sick and died of the sickness that he was sick off (2 Kings 13). The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 62, 18, 7, 'great prophet went to heaven because he had dealt with sin in his life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 62, 19, 7, 'And so, we see here two types of sins in Genesis 3 and Genesis 4. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 62, 20, 7, 'need to try and understand the difference between the two so that we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 62, 21, 7, 'see why one is more serious than the other. The difference is this; when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 62, 22, 7, 'Eve sinned, she hurt only herself. Her contact with God was gone, her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 62, 23, 7, 'body began to decay, her spirit died, and her soul became dark. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 62, 24, 7, 'Adam sinned, he also sinned against himself, his spirit died, the mind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 62, 25, 7, 'became dark and his body started to decay and contact with God was gone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 62, 26, 7, 'That is the Genesis 3 type of sin; sins where you hurt only yourself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 62, 27, 7, 'For example, you get drunk or you''re a drug addict or you smoke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 62, 28, 7, 'cigarettes, or you watch pornographic movies, you hurt yourself. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 63, 1, 7, 'those acts, you are not hurting anyone else. As a result of those acts,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 63, 2, 7, 'you may go and hurt others but the act itself only hurts you. On the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 63, 3, 7, 'other hand, there are other sins and that''s the type we read in Genesis');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 63, 4, 7, '4 where you hurt somebody else. Cain was jealous of his brother Abel and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 63, 5, 7, 'did something to harm him. These are two types of sins. Let me make it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 63, 6, 7, 'clear once again. The Genesis 3 sin is where you hurt only yourself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 63, 7, 7, 'Genesis 4 sins are where you hurt other people. It says here that Cain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 63, 8, 7, 'was angry with Abel. God tried to warn him by telling him to be careful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 63, 9, 7, 'because sin was crouching the door of his heart, but he had to master it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 63, 10, 7, '(Genesis 4:7). Do you know that way back in the beginning as soon as man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 63, 11, 7, 'sinned in Genesis 3, the very next words almost in Genesis 4 from God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 63, 12, 7, 'you must conquer sin? In the New Testament in Romans 6:14, it says sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 63, 13, 7, 'shall not be master over you because you''re not under law but under');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 63, 14, 7, 'grace. That was God''s desire described in Genesis 4:7.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 63, 15, 7, 'Do you know what''s God''s desire is for you my friend? That you should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 63, 16, 7, 'master sin. That you should conquer it and that''s not a New Testament');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 63, 17, 7, 'message, it''s in Genesis 4:7. You must master it; sin is crouching at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 63, 18, 7, 'your door waiting to possess you like a tiger sitting outside your door.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 63, 19, 7, 'Its desire is to have you, but you must master it. Of course, under the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 63, 20, 7, 'Old Covenant, they could not master it because the Holy Spirit had not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 63, 21, 7, 'come to dwell within man. It is impossible to master sin till the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 63, 22, 7, 'Spirit comes to dwell within man and that happened only on the day of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 63, 23, 7, 'Pentecost. That''s when grace came through Jesus Christ that enables us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 63, 24, 7, 'to overcome but the desire to overcome is described by God way back');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 63, 25, 7, 'there in Genesis 4:7. Cain didn''t listen to the warning. He didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 63, 26, 7, 'respond and he got angry and anger was seen on his face. You know man''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 63, 27, 7, 'heart is very often visible on his face. The first question the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 63, 28, 7, 'asks Cain is why are you angry? Why is your face fallen? (Genesis 4:6).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 64, 1, 7, 'Why is your face dark? Why isn''t it bright. If your heart is clear, your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 64, 2, 7, 'face will be bright, but something is wrong. You''ve got a wrong attitude');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 64, 3, 7, 'towards your brother and the Lord said be careful because if you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 64, 4, 7, 'watch this, it is going to go from bad to worse.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 64, 5, 7, 'It was already bad because of Cain’s heart attitude towards Abel. It was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 64, 6, 7, 'going to get worse if he didn’t deal with it because sin wants to master');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 64, 7, 7, 'him. Cain didn’t listen and went and killed Abel and the Lord asked him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 64, 8, 7, 'again where his brother was. Listen to the way he responded to God. Cain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 64, 9, 7, 'said, “I don’t know. Am I my brother’s keeper?” He goes and tells a lie');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 64, 10, 7, 'to God and God says the voice of your brother’s blood is crying to me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 64, 11, 7, 'from the ground. When you hurt somebody, that injury is crying out to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 64, 12, 7, 'God. Now we know that blood is not able to speak. If your blood spills');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 64, 13, 7, 'on the ground, the blood cannot speak in language that man can hear but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 64, 14, 7, 'the blood can speak in a language that God can hear. That’s what we read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 64, 15, 7, 'here in Genesis 4. We read in verse 10, the Lord says to Cain, “The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 64, 16, 7, 'voice of your brother’s blood is crying to me from the ground.” When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 64, 17, 7, 'Cain smashed Abel''s head and all his blood spilled on the ground, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 64, 18, 7, 'blood was crying out to God saying, “God, take vengeance on me. I''m an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 64, 19, 7, 'innocent man. I''m a righteous man and this man has come and hurt me. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 64, 20, 7, 'never did anything to him, he came and hurt me.” Do you know that when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 64, 21, 7, 'you hurt somebody in some way, whether you spill his blood or not, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 64, 22, 7, 'injury cries out to God? The injured person may be very merciful and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 64, 23, 7, 'forgive you, but he can only forgive you in the horizontal direction. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 64, 24, 7, 'can’t forgive that vertical dimension of your sin against God. When you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 64, 25, 7, 'hurt somebody, there are two dimensions to your sin; one is vertical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 64, 26, 7, 'where you sin against Almighty God. Every sin is against God but here,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 64, 27, 7, 'you’ve also sinned against your brother. When Adam sinned, there was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 64, 28, 7, 'only a vertical dimension to that sin. Adam and Eve sinned against God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 65, 1, 7, 'but Cain’s sin consisted of a vertical dimension against his brother and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 65, 2, 7, 'a horizontal direction against God. That is why a man whom you have hurt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 65, 3, 7, 'in some way may forgive you, but he can only forgive that horizontal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 65, 4, 7, 'dimension. The vertical dimension you still have to answer for by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 65, 5, 7, 'personal repentance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 65, 6, 7, 'When Jesus died on the cross, He forgave that horizontal dimension to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 65, 7, 7, 'those who crucified Him saying, “Father, forgive them for they don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 65, 8, 7, 'know what they do.“ (Luke 23:34) But they still had to answer to God for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 65, 9, 7, 'that vertical dimension and one day they''ll be pulled up at the judgment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 65, 10, 7, 'seat of God for what they did to Christ; that part is not dealt with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 65, 11, 7, 'because they didn''t repent. So, we see here the Lord cursed Cain. It’s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 65, 12, 7, 'much more serious thing to commit a sin where you injure somebody else');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 65, 13, 7, 'in some way. Now let me ask you a question; if you know a Christian who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 65, 14, 7, 'gets drunk or who''s a drug addict, would that shock you more or than a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 65, 15, 7, 'brother who backed bites against another person or tells bad stories');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 65, 16, 7, 'about somebody else? Now generally speaking, I found that Christians are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 65, 17, 7, 'more horrified if they heard a brother was a drug addict then if they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 65, 18, 7, 'heard some brothers speaking evil about another behind their back. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 65, 19, 7, 'is because most believers do that in any case. But which is the Genesis');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 65, 20, 7, '3 sin, and which is the Genesis 4 sin? If you''re a drug addict, you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 65, 21, 7, 'harming yourself and that''s a sin, but it''s Genesis 3 type of sin where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 65, 22, 7, 'you hurt only yourself. When you speak evil about somebody else, you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 65, 23, 7, 'hurting another person and are robbing him of his reputation. You are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 65, 24, 7, 'hurting him just like Cain hurt Abel; that is more serious. Since a lot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 65, 25, 7, 'people haven’t studied the Bible, they don''t think of gossiping and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 65, 26, 7, 'backbiting and evil speaking as sin. They don''t think of accusation as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 65, 27, 7, 'sin, they don''t think of taking people to court as a sin, they don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 65, 28, 7, 'think of anything that hurts another person as a sin. Believers are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 66, 1, 7, 'tremendously guilty of committing sins where they hurt others. I tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 66, 2, 7, 'you; the drug addict is a thousand times better than you who backbites');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 66, 3, 7, 'and gossips and speak evils of others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 66, 4, 7, 'There''s a curse on those who harm others and that''s the reason a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 66, 5, 7, 'believers don''t grow spiritually because they have sinned against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 66, 6, 7, 'somebody else and they keep on doing it. They think murder and adultery');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 66, 7, 7, 'are serious against others. Absolutely right but many Christians don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 66, 8, 7, 'think of evil speaking and hurting other people in that way as a serious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 66, 9, 7, 'thing. So, let''s try and understand the seriousness of sins whereby we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 66, 10, 7, 'hurt other people. What is the result? Cain was cursed and he became a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 66, 11, 7, 'wanderer. The Lord told him you are going to be a wanderer; you''re going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 66, 12, 7, 'to be a lonely person. Those who live in sin, there''s a spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 66, 13, 7, 'loneliness in their life. They''re lonely because God is not with them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 66, 14, 7, 'Godly people are not with them. They may have friends at the same time;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 66, 15, 7, 'there are gangs of murderers who are friends with each other but there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 66, 16, 7, 'will be a loneliness in the sense that God is not with them and godly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 66, 17, 7, 'people are not with them. We also see that Cain''s children went astray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 66, 18, 7, 'from God. Just like Cain became a murderer, one of his descendants');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 66, 19, 7, 'became a murder and they drifted away from God (Geneses 4:23). So, there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 66, 20, 7, 'are tremendous consequences when this curse of God comes upon a person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 66, 21, 7, 'So, let''s keep this in mind; sins where we harm ourselves are serious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 66, 22, 7, 'but as not as serious as sins that we harm other people. Jesus came to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 66, 23, 7, 'deliver us from both; let''s seek for deliverance from both.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 66, 24, 8, 'Chapter 8 True Repentance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 66, 25, 8, 'God''s grace is sufficient for our every need. God has promised for His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 66, 26, 8, 'children in 1 Corinthians 10:13 that He will never allow us to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 66, 27, 8, 'tempted or tested beyond our ability to bear but with every trial or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 66, 28, 8, 'temptation, He will make a way to escape so that we can endure it. First');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 67, 1, 8, 'of all, why does God allow trial and temptation to come into our life?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 67, 2, 8, 'It''s something like our subjecting our physical muscles to resistance to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 67, 3, 8, 'make our muscles strong. All muscles in the human body are strengthened');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 67, 4, 8, 'or developed through being subject to resistance. When people lift');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 67, 5, 8, 'weights, or when they run or use expandable springs or any such thing,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 67, 6, 8, 'the principle is to subject your muscles to resistance and as a result');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 67, 7, 8, 'the muscles become strong. If you don''t subject your muscles to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 67, 8, 8, 'resistance, you''ll never become strong, you just become fat. Eating food');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 67, 9, 8, 'by itself does not make a person strong, it just makes them fat and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 67, 10, 8, 'there''s a world of difference between a fat person and a strong person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 67, 11, 8, 'Now apply this spiritually; getting a lot of Bible knowledge just makes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 67, 12, 8, 'you spiritually fat and fat people are actually weaker than thin people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 67, 13, 8, 'A lot of people with a lot of Bible knowledge are pretty weak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 67, 14, 8, 'spiritually, they still lose their temper, they still lust with their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 67, 15, 8, 'eyes and commit many other sins despite all their Bible knowledge. Are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 67, 16, 8, 'they strong? Certainly not. They are fat but God allows us to face trial');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 67, 17, 8, 'and temptation so that we can become strong and He has promised us that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 67, 18, 8, 'He will never allow us to be tested beyond our ability to bear. That''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 67, 19, 8, 'wonderful promise. That means if I face a particular trial coming into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 67, 20, 8, 'my life, I need never say to myself, “Oh no, this is too much for me.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 67, 21, 8, 'Nothing is too much for me. it''s within my ability to bear it. if I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 67, 22, 8, 'don''t believe that then I''m accusing God of having less sense than an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 67, 23, 8, 'ordinary school teacher and I''ll tell you why.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 67, 24, 8, 'If a student is studying in the fifth standard, the school teacher in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 67, 25, 8, 'this class will not give him and a seventh standard question paper. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 67, 26, 8, 'school teacher has got wisdom to give that child a fifth standard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 67, 27, 8, 'question paper because that teacher knows that this student is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 67, 28, 8, 'capable of answering a seventh standard question paper. It’s the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 68, 1, 8, 'with trial. God will not allow you to face a seventh standard trial if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 68, 2, 8, 'you are in the fifth standard right now. Therefore, when you face a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 68, 3, 8, 'trial, if you say this is too much for me, you''re actually accusing God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 68, 4, 8, 'of having less sense than a school teacher. It is the devil who makes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 68, 5, 8, 'you think like that because the moment you think like that you''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 68, 6, 8, 'already failed. You’ve programmed yourself for failure by saying this is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 68, 7, 8, 'too much for me. No trial is too much for you if you''re a child of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 68, 8, 8, 'God determines what type of question paper you get, and He will only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 68, 9, 8, 'give you something according to the level of your spiritual development');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 68, 10, 8, 'in life. Now this is a great comfort for me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 68, 11, 8, 'Supposing for example, the devil has got some massive temptation lined');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 68, 12, 8, 'up for me to face tomorrow which is too much for me. I''m not strong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 68, 13, 8, 'enough to bear it but the devil''s got to get permission from God before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 68, 14, 8, 'he sends that temptation into my life and he asks God, “Can I send this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 68, 15, 8, 'temptation to Zac.” God says, “No, I''m not going to let you do it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 68, 16, 8, 'because he''s not strong enough to face it.” Then after a month, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 68, 17, 8, 'devil says, “Can I send it to him now.” God says, “No, he''s still not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 68, 18, 8, 'strong enough.” Maybe after a year, God says to him, “Now you can tempt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 68, 19, 8, 'Zac with that temptation, he''s strong enough now. He''s developed in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 68, 20, 8, 'last one year and now he''s strong enough to face it.” That''s when the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 68, 21, 8, 'temptation will come to me and by the power of the Holy Spirit, I can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 68, 22, 8, 'overcome it. It''s like when I get to the 7th standard then I get the 7');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 68, 23, 8, 'standard question paper. I won''t get it in the 5th standard; this is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 68, 24, 8, 'tremendous comfort for me to know because this applies all the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 68, 25, 8, 'through life right up to the end of my life or till Christ comes again.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 68, 26, 8, 'I will never get a question paper that''s too tough. That means every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 68, 27, 8, 'temptation I face can be overcome because none of it will be too strong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 68, 28, 8, 'for me. There are students who got a 100% in mathematics in 1st, 2nd,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 69, 1, 8, '3rd, 4th and 5th standard because they work hard every year but if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 69, 2, 8, 'had given him a 7th standard question paper when he was in the 5th');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 69, 3, 8, 'standard, he would not have gotten a 100%; he''d have probably got 25% or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 69, 4, 8, '30%. It''s possible for us to get victory over sin all the time just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 69, 5, 8, 'because of this one promise in 1 Corinthians 10:13, “God will not allow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 69, 6, 8, 'you to be tested beyond your ability.” We must believe that! You can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 69, 7, 8, 'never overcome if you don’t believe that. You can never overcome without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 69, 8, 8, 'that faith. God is faithful to do what He says in 1 Corinthians 10:13.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 69, 9, 8, 'God is faithful, and His promise is faithful not to allow you to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 69, 10, 8, 'tempted beyond your ability to bear.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 69, 11, 8, 'The Bible speaks about repentance and faith as the two things necessary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 69, 12, 8, 'for us to receive all that the gospel offers. Jesus preached repentance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 69, 13, 8, 'and faith, Peter preached repentance and faith and the Apostle Paul');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 69, 14, 8, 'brings them all together in Acts 20:21 when He''s talking to the elders');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 69, 15, 8, 'in Ephesus. He says I''ve been preaching to you for 3 years and what have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 69, 16, 8, 'I preached to you for all these 3 years? I have solemnly testified to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 69, 17, 8, 'everybody that they must repent towards God and have faith in the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 69, 18, 8, 'Jesus Christ. These are two things that God has joined together,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 69, 19, 8, 'repentance and faith and the Bible says what God has joined together, no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 69, 20, 8, 'one should separate. Now when you combine two atoms of hydrogen with one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 69, 21, 8, 'atom of oxygen, you get water. When you separate it, it is no longer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 69, 22, 8, 'water. You put one atom of sodium with one atom of chlorine, you get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 69, 23, 8, 'sodium chloride which is common salt. You separate them, it’s not common');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 69, 24, 8, 'salt, it is sodium and chloride. Repentance and faith are the only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 69, 25, 8, 'appropriate response to the gospel of Jesus Christ. You separate them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 69, 26, 8, 'it''s no longer the correct response to the gospel of Jesus Christ. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 69, 27, 8, 'will not produce the result that the gospel is supposed to produce.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 69, 28, 8, 'Unfortunately, a lot of preaching today emphasizes only faith; It’s like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 70, 1, 8, 'saying we need oxygen in water and neglecting the hydrogen. We need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 70, 2, 8, 'oxygen but we need hydrogen too. You need to have two atoms of hydrogen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 70, 3, 8, 'with one atom of oxygen and then you get water. If you keep on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 70, 4, 8, 'emphasizing oxygen, what you get is oxygen not water. If you keep on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 70, 5, 8, 'emphasizing faith, you''re not going to get a correct response to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 70, 6, 8, 'gospel and people will not experience what the gospel offers, and this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 70, 7, 8, 'is the tragedy in Christendom today. Many people are not experiencing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 70, 8, 8, 'the wonderful blessings and privileges of the gospel because preachers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 70, 9, 8, 'have separated what God has joined together. Repentance is not a very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 70, 10, 8, 'popular message to preach because it''s dealing with sin and so people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 70, 11, 8, 'emphasize faith because that sounds more positive. Repentance sounds a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 70, 12, 8, 'bit negative and preachers like to preach something positive, but you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 70, 13, 8, 'need the positive and the negative just like in electricity. You can''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 70, 14, 8, 'have just a positive, you need a positive end and a negative end for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 70, 15, 8, 'current to flow. You can''t have all positive because no current will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 70, 16, 8, 'flow that way. It''s the same way with repentance; it is a negative');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 70, 17, 8, '(turning away from sin) and faith is the positive (putting our trust in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 70, 18, 8, 'the Lord Jesus Christ). If you don''t have both, you cannot experience');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 70, 19, 8, 'the gospel of Jesus Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 70, 20, 8, 'We can say that a lot of Christians today do not have a proper');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 70, 21, 8, 'experience of the gospel, that''s why their lives are so unsatisfying.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 70, 22, 8, 'Most Christians will admit if you ask them honestly that they are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 70, 23, 8, 'satisfied with their Christian experience. And that’s because they''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 70, 24, 8, 'been fed with an incomplete message; they’ve been taught faith without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 70, 25, 8, 'being taught repentance. Repentance is the primary step before you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 70, 26, 8, 'come to faith. Repentance means turning away from everything other than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 70, 27, 8, 'God to God Himself. One of the clearest definitions of it is found in 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 70, 28, 8, 'Thessalonians 9: You turned to God from idols. Notice there you turn to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 71, 1, 8, 'God from idols. What is an idol? The clearest definition of an idol is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 71, 2, 8, 'something that takes the place that God should have in your life. It’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 71, 3, 8, 'not just an object of wood and stone, those are external idols are more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 71, 4, 8, 'easily identified and it’s much easier to get rid of anything external.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 71, 5, 8, 'It is the idols inside the heart that are more difficult to get rid of.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 71, 6, 8, 'There''s a verse in the Old Testament (Ezekiel 14:3) where the Lord told');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 71, 7, 8, 'the nation of Israel through one of his prophets about the idols in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 71, 8, 8, 'their hearts. Ezekiel was a prophet to the backslidden Israelites in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 71, 9, 8, 'land of Babylon. They were sent to Babylon because of their sin and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 71, 10, 8, 'Lord said to Ezekiel saying, “Listen to me Son of man; these men have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 71, 11, 8, 'set up their idols in their hearts. Should I be consulted by them? Am I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 71, 12, 8, 'going to answer these fellows who got idols in their hearts?” So, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 71, 13, 8, 'find that an idol is not something that you just have outside of you. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 71, 14, 8, 'goes on to say in Ezekiel 14:4, “Therefore speak to them and tell them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 71, 15, 8, '‘For any man who sets up his idol in his heart and then comes to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 71, 16, 8, 'prophet, I the Lord will be brought to give him an answer in view of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 71, 17, 8, 'multitude of his idols.’”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 71, 18, 8, 'The Israelites had many idols in their hearts and it''s the same with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 71, 19, 8, 'Christians today. Anything that takes the place of God in your life; it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 71, 20, 8, 'could be your business, your house, your girlfriend, it could be a boy,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 71, 21, 8, 'it could be your bank account, stocks and shares etc. Anything that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 71, 22, 8, 'takes a place of God in your life and if you want to find out what is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 71, 23, 8, 'taking the place of God in your life, ask yourself what is it that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 71, 24, 8, 'think about the most when you have some free time. Now when we go to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 71, 25, 8, 'work, whether it''s in an office or a factory or anywhere you have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 71, 26, 8, 'concentrate on your work out of necessity to earn your living. A student');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 71, 27, 8, 'going to school or college is to concentrate on their studies and that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 71, 28, 8, 'is the right thing to do. But when you have finished with your school or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 72, 1, 8, 'college or office work and you are free to think about whatever you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 72, 2, 8, 'like, what do you think about? Most of the time, that is your idol. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 72, 3, 8, 'could be sports, music etc. Some of these legitimate idols are much more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 72, 4, 8, 'serious than the illegitimate ones because they don''t look like idols.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 72, 5, 8, 'So, repentance means turning away from everything that''s coming between');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 72, 6, 8, 'me and God. We are turning our back on everything that comes between us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 72, 7, 8, 'and God. The word repentance means a change of mind and one of the best');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 72, 8, 8, 'ways to describe it is the military about-turn where a person turns');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 72, 9, 8, 'around 180 degrees from his old position. My old way of life was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 72, 10, 8, 'following after sin, I turn away from that, put my back to sin and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 72, 11, 8, 'anything that took the place of God in my life and put my front to God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 72, 12, 8, 'If you haven''t done that, your repentance is only partial. You may have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 72, 13, 8, 'turned your back on certain things but not on everything. Then your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 72, 14, 8, 'repentance is partial, and your experience of the gospel will also be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 72, 15, 8, 'partial. For example, if I want to travel from Bangalore to Bombay, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 72, 16, 8, 'turned my back on Bangalore. If instead of turning a 180 towards Bombay,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 72, 17, 8, 'I turn say 135 degrees, I''ll end up in Goa, not in Bombay. A lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 72, 18, 8, 'Christians end up where they''re not supposed to end up because they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 72, 19, 8, 'didn''t turn around from sin 180 degrees. They did turn but not fully.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 72, 20, 8, 'This is the reason why many people don''t progress in their Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 72, 21, 8, 'life. That repentance is not total, they have not turned from everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 72, 22, 8, 'they know to be sin in their life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 72, 23, 8, 'Let me tell you something more about repentance. Repentance is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 72, 24, 8, 'something you do once for all when you''re beginning your Christian life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 72, 25, 8, 'it''s a continuous attitude of turning from every known sin because as we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 72, 26, 8, 'grow in the Christian life, we will discover newer and newer sins which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 72, 27, 8, 'earlier on we did not think were sins. That''s been my discovery over the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 72, 28, 8, 'last 30 years. I have been constantly discovering sin in my life. What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 73, 1, 8, 'do I mean by sin? In the Bible there are many definitions of sin. Let me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 73, 2, 8, 'list a couple of them: Sin is lawlessness (1 John 3:4). Violating the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 73, 3, 8, 'command of God or doing something that you know in your conscience is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 73, 4, 8, 'wrong. That''s a sin of commission; a sin that you commit. Another type');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 73, 5, 8, 'of sin which many people don''t think about is the sin of omission. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 73, 6, 8, 'means something you are supposed to do but you didn''t do. That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 73, 7, 8, 'described in James 4:17, “The one who knows the right thing to do but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 73, 8, 8, 'does not do it, it''s sin.” In the story of the Good Samaritan, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 73, 9, 8, 'Levite and the priests who walk by the beaten man on the road from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 73, 10, 8, 'Jerusalem to Jericho committed a sin of omission. What was their sins?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 73, 11, 8, 'They didn''t kick the man, they didn''t spit on him, they didn''t call him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 73, 12, 8, 'any bad words, they just ignored him and walked on the other side. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 73, 13, 8, 'sinned the sin of omission. If they had kicked him and called him bad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 73, 14, 8, 'names, that would have been a sin of commission. They did not do what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 73, 15, 8, 'they were supposed to do to the helpless man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 73, 16, 8, 'Do you know the number of sins of omission that you have done in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 73, 17, 8, 'life that you''ve never even thought of? Normally speaking, we confess');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 73, 18, 8, 'only sins that we commit. Lord I did this wrong thing, I did that wrong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 73, 19, 8, 'thing, I did that other wrong thing. Can you think of a time when you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 73, 20, 8, 'have confessed something like this to the Lord,” Lord, I should have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 73, 21, 8, 'helped him, but I didn''t do it? I should have spoken a kind word there,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 73, 22, 8, 'but I didn''t speak it. Forgive me Lord. I should have prayed there, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 73, 23, 8, 'I didn''t pray. I should have sought some fellowship with you in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 73, 24, 8, 'scriptures, but I didn''t seek it.” There are many sins of omission and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 73, 25, 8, 'when we come into the presence of God, we get light on them. When we get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 73, 26, 8, 'light on these things, we can turn from it. The closer and closer and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 73, 27, 8, 'closer we come to God, the more and more we get light on what is sin and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 73, 28, 8, 'what is not sin. As we discover new areas of sin in our life, we turn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 74, 1, 8, 'from that and then next year, I get light on something more that is sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 74, 2, 8, 'in my life, and I turn from that. If I''m walking with the Lord, my whole');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 74, 3, 8, 'life will be one of repentance. I''m turning and turning from the new');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 74, 4, 8, 'things I''m discovering to be sin in my life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 74, 5, 8, 'So, what is the clear definition of sin? Here we saw two of them:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 74, 6, 8, 'violating the law and going beyond the line God is drawn. The other is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 74, 7, 8, 'not coming up to the mark and not doing what I should have done. Now let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 74, 8, 8, 'me turn to what is the best definition of sin altogether that I found in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 74, 9, 8, 'the scriptures. In Romans 3:23, it says, “all have sinned and come short');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 74, 10, 8, 'of the glory of God.” Sin is coming short of God''s glory. That means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 74, 11, 8, 'God''s standard is 100% and I come below that for anything and at any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 74, 12, 8, 'time then I''m sinning. What is the definition of the glory of God? In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 74, 13, 8, 'John 1:14, it says that we beheld the glory of God in Jesus Christ, full');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 74, 14, 8, 'of grace and truth. The glory of God was seen in the earthly life of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 74, 15, 8, 'Jesus Christ. As I look at the earthly life of Jesus Christ, I see what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 74, 16, 8, 'holiness is. Anything less than that and anything contrary to that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 74, 17, 8, 'spirit is coming short of the glory of God and that is sin. So now we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 74, 18, 8, 'get a very helpful definition of sin: anything un-Christlike in my life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 74, 19, 8, 'is sin. The Holy Spirit will show my un-Christlike areas and attitudes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 74, 20, 8, 'in my life. As He shows me, I see it, and I turn from it. I say, “Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 74, 21, 8, 'I want to be like you.” That is repentance. It’s not reaching the goal.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 74, 22, 8, 'It may take me 10 years to be like Him, but I''ve begun. I’ve turned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 74, 23, 8, 'around and I say. “Lord Jesus, I want to turn to you.” That''s repentance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 74, 24, 8, 'and then our faith becomes useful to join together and we progress in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 74, 25, 8, 'the Christian life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 74, 26, 9, 'Chapter 9 Repentance From All Sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 74, 27, 9, 'In our last study, we were looking at what repentance really means. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 74, 28, 9, 'is a turning around, a change of mind concerning sin. Our former');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 75, 1, 9, 'attitude toward sin was that we loved it and indulged in it and did it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 75, 2, 9, 'Now, we''ve decided to turn from it. We''re not saying we have overcome;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 75, 3, 9, 'we''re just saying we''ve changed our attitude towards it. For example, if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 75, 4, 9, 'you have a problem with your anger, the repentance doesn''t mean that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 75, 5, 9, 'you''ll never get angry again, but it does mean that you don''t want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 75, 6, 9, 'get angry again. It means you don''t want to lust with your eyes again.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 75, 7, 9, 'It doesn''t mean you’ve got victory. There''s a lot of difference between');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 75, 8, 9, 'repentance and victory over sin. Repentance is the first step towards');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 75, 9, 9, 'victory, but it is not victory. We have to persist in going a certain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 75, 10, 9, 'way. That constant choosing makes us strong. That''s why we need to have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 75, 11, 9, 'continuous repentance. In Revelation 2 and 3, the Lord speaks to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 75, 12, 9, 'elders of seven churches. Now these are the leaders and yet five of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 75, 13, 9, 'those leaders and churches were so much in sin that the Lord told them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 75, 14, 9, 'to take His words seriously and repent. That means to turn from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 75, 15, 9, 'wrong that He had pointed out to them. There were things in their life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 75, 16, 9, 'that were not glorifying to God. The Lord Jesus pointed it out to them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 75, 17, 9, 'and they were to turn from it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 75, 18, 9, 'The Lord told them to repent and those are messages to Christians. Those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 75, 19, 9, 'are the last messages of Jesus to the church in Revelation. So, what is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 75, 20, 9, 'the last message of Jesus to His church in the book of Revelation?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 75, 21, 9, 'Repent and be an overcomer. That''s the first message He preached in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 75, 22, 9, 'Matthew 4 and He began His ministry and it''s the last message that He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 75, 23, 9, 'gives to the church in Revelation 2 and 3. Repent and Turn. How is it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 75, 24, 9, 'such an important subject is hardly ever spoken of in the Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 75, 25, 9, 'Church today? The message of repentance is missing; we have today');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 75, 26, 9, 'another gospel, a gospel without repentance and that''s a false gospel.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 75, 27, 9, 'It''s a counterfeit gospel which encourages you to believe without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 75, 28, 9, 'repentance. A gospel without repentance is a counterfeit gospel. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 76, 1, 9, 'fact, some theologians have gone as far as to say that man cannot repent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 76, 2, 9, 'because he''s so corrupt that he''s not able to repent. Did God make a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 76, 3, 9, 'mistake then in urging people to repent? Did Jesus make a mistake when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 76, 4, 9, 'He told those elders to repent? Did Peter make a mistake when he told');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 76, 5, 9, 'the unbelievers in the day of Pentecost to repent? No, he didn’t. Don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 76, 6, 9, 'you believe all these theologians who will lead you astray from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 76, 7, 9, 'Bible. Jesus said you shall know the truth and the truth shall make you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 76, 8, 9, 'free. The truth is that which will set you free from the power of sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 76, 9, 9, 'Remember that if something does not set you free from the power of sin,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 76, 10, 9, 'however good it may sound, it’s not the truth of the gospel.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 76, 11, 9, 'Remember this - that God never asks us to turn away from something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 76, 12, 9, 'that''s good for us. God is a good God and everything He wants to give us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 76, 13, 9, 'is for our good. If He asks us to give up something, it''s something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 76, 14, 9, 'which is bad for us. Think of an earthly father; what does he tell his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 76, 15, 9, 'children to give up? He''ll never tell his children to give up something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 76, 16, 9, 'that''s good for them. He’ll never tell them to stop eating good food,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 76, 17, 9, 'He''ll never tell them to stop going to school. No, he may tell them to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 76, 18, 9, 'give up their bad friendships and certain bad habits. A good father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 76, 19, 9, 'would never ask his children to give up something which is good for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 76, 20, 9, 'them, only that which is bad. What is God, who''s a much better father,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 76, 21, 9, 'going to tell us? He will tell us to turn from things that can harm us,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 76, 22, 9, 'things that can hinder us from developing to our full potential as human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 76, 23, 9, 'beings. If you want to see the full potential to which God wanted a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 76, 24, 9, 'human being to rise up to and live, you see it in the earthly life of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 76, 25, 9, 'Jesus Christ. Jesus Christ is the example of how God wants you and me to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 76, 26, 9, 'live. When we see Christ as our example, we cry out to the Lord to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 76, 27, 9, 'like Him. We want to turn and follow Him. That is to repent from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 76, 28, 9, 'everything that I discover in my life which is not like that. I want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 77, 1, 9, 'live by the principles that Jesus lived by and I want to turn from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 77, 2, 9, 'everything that is contrary to the principles of Jesus’ life - that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 77, 3, 9, 'repentance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 77, 4, 9, 'As we walk with the Lord, we get more and more light on what we need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 77, 5, 9, 'turn away from and as we turn away. We can receive from God — that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 77, 6, 9, 'faith. Repentance is turning around; faith is receiving from God all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 77, 7, 9, 'that God has for us. That''s how we are to begin our Christian life and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 77, 8, 9, 'that''s how we are to keep on growing in the Christian life because as I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 77, 9, 9, 'said repentance is something continuous because as long as there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 77, 10, 9, 'something un-Christlike in you, you need to repent. And we all have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 77, 11, 9, 'acknowledge that none of us have become perfectly like Christ yet. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 77, 12, 9, 'that''s the case, then we all need to keep on repenting. This is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 77, 13, 9, 'meaning of 1 John 3:2 in relation to the second coming of Christ. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 77, 14, 9, 'speaks here about a certain hope that we have. Now for many Christians,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 77, 15, 9, 'if you ask them what the blessed hope is, they would say it is that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 77, 16, 9, 'Christ will come back. But that''s not all; that''s only a half of it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 77, 17, 9, 'Notice what it says in 1 John 3:2, “We know that when Christ appears, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 77, 18, 9, 'shall be like Him.” Notice two things here: He appears, and we shall be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 77, 19, 9, 'like Him. It says in the next verse that this is the hope. There are two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 77, 20, 9, 'parts to this hope: one is that Christ will return, and the second half');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 77, 21, 9, 'of that hope is I''ll be like Him when He returns. Did you know that? It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 77, 22, 9, 'is ignorance of the truth that prevents us from freedom. The truth is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 77, 23, 9, 'the blessed hope that Christ will come back, and I will be like Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 77, 24, 9, 'Now it says in 1 John 3:3, if this is the hope you really have then you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 77, 25, 9, 'will purify yourself just as Jesus is pure. In other words, you''ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 77, 26, 9, 'purify yourself until you reach the standard of His holiness. We saw in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 77, 27, 9, 'our last study that the clearest definition of sin is anything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 77, 28, 9, 'un-Christlike that you can see in your life. God only asks us to deal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 78, 1, 9, 'with conscious sin. I told you that repentance is something to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 78, 2, 9, 'continuous in our life. Let me illustrate this: 90% of our inner life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 78, 3, 9, 'we cannot see. We have wrong attitudes which we are ignorant of. We have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 78, 4, 9, 'things in our life which are against God''s will, but we are ignorant of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 78, 5, 9, 'all those things, so we can label as unconscious sin. 90% of our life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 78, 6, 9, 'we don''t see. What we see is only 10% and, in that area, when we sin, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 78, 7, 9, 'can say that is conscious sin. The rest of the 90%, we do it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 78, 8, 9, 'unconsciously. When the Bible speaks about victory over sin, it is only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 78, 9, 9, 'in that 10% area where we have light. It is impossible to get victory');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 78, 10, 9, 'over unconscious sin until it becomes conscious. How can I overcome');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 78, 11, 9, 'something which I don''t even know is wrong in my life? I cannot, so we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 78, 12, 9, 'need to distinguish between these two things; conscious sin and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 78, 13, 9, 'unconscious sin. This is also why it''s so wrong to judge other people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 78, 14, 9, 'If you know only 10% of your own life, how much do you think you know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 78, 15, 9, 'about other people whom you see once in a while? Probably less than 1%!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 78, 16, 9, 'Do you see the foolishness there of knowing 1% of a person''s life and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 78, 17, 9, 'passing a judgement on him? That would be something like a judge being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 78, 18, 9, 'given a hundred pages of documents on a very important case and he reads');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 78, 19, 9, 'the just the first page and passes a judgement. Such a judge should be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 78, 20, 9, 'thrown out from the bench and yet that''s what many Christians are doing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 78, 21, 9, 'You don''t know more than 1% of anybody''s life. Have you judged people?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 78, 22, 9, 'Well, you''ve judged people whose life you know 1%. You''ve just seen the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 78, 23, 9, 'first of a hundred pages of his life and you pass the judgement. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 78, 24, 9, 'shows what an evil wicked person you are. So, it''s best to stop judging');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 78, 25, 9, 'other people but there''s one person about whom you know at least 10% and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 78, 26, 9, 'that''s yourself so you can start with judging yourself. 1 Peter 4:17');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 78, 27, 9, 'implies that when you judge yourself, that is the proof that you are a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 78, 28, 9, 'part of God''s house. It says there, “Judgment must begin at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 79, 1, 9, 'household of God and if it begins with us first, what''s going to be the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 79, 2, 9, 'condition of those who do not obey the gospel.” (1 Peter 4:17).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 79, 3, 9, 'To use an illustration, if you put a cube of ice in a glass of orange');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 79, 4, 9, 'juice, you can see only 10% of that piece of ice which is the part that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 79, 5, 9, 'is above the surface. 90% of that cube of ice is below the surface. Now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 79, 6, 9, 'if you take a knife and you slice off that top 10% of that cube of ice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 79, 7, 9, 'and throw it away, what will happen to the cube of ice? A little bit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 79, 8, 9, 'the 90% underneath will come up. 10% of that 90% will come up above the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 79, 9, 9, 'surface. Now you take a knife and slice that also, some more will come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 79, 10, 9, 'up. That is how God gives us light on areas of our life that are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 79, 11, 9, 'initially hidden. If I deal with the areas of my life that I know are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 79, 12, 9, 'wrong, then God will give me life on the areas of my life where I don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 79, 13, 9, 'have any understanding of what is Christlike. That is spiritual growth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 79, 14, 9, 'It is this cube of ice getting smaller and smaller and smaller. Nobody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 79, 15, 9, 'has ever got rid of the cube of ice fully on this earth. Nobody''s ever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 79, 16, 9, 'become completely Christlike on this earth; not even the Apostle Paul.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 79, 17, 9, 'But I''m sure the cube of ice in his life had become pretty thin as he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 79, 18, 9, 'had responded to whatever light God gave him. In Acts 24:16, he says, “I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 79, 19, 9, 'do my best to keep my conscience absolutely clear with God and with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 79, 20, 9, 'man.” It was one of the great secrets of his life. As he got light on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 79, 21, 9, 'some new area, he repented of it and sought cleansing. Constant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 79, 22, 9, 'repentance is the way of spiritual growth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 79, 23, 9, 'The other thing I want to say about repentance is that repentance should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 79, 24, 9, 'primarily deal with inward sin. One big difference between the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 79, 25, 9, 'Testament and the New Testament is this- the Old Testament emphasized');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 79, 26, 9, 'everything external whereas the New Testament emphasizes everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 79, 27, 9, 'internal. For example, in the Old Testament, the sacrifices were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 79, 28, 9, 'external on the altar. In the New Testament, the sacrifices are internal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 80, 1, 9, 'or inward. In the Old Testament, the temple was outside in Jerusalem. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 80, 2, 9, 'the New Testament, the temple is inside; God lives in our body. Our body');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 80, 3, 9, 'is the temple of God (1 Cor 6:19). In the Old Testament, the ten');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 80, 4, 9, 'commandments dealt primarily with sin which was on the outside. In the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 80, 5, 9, 'New Testament, Jesus spoke about the sin which is on the inside (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 80, 6, 9, '5 and 6). That''s one of the big differences between the Old Covenant and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 80, 7, 9, 'the New Covenant. In the Old Covenant, they were holy on the outside. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 80, 8, 9, 'the New Covenant, God wants us to be holy on the inside. Out of the Ten');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 80, 9, 9, 'Commandments in the Old Covenant, nine of them dealt with the outside.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 80, 10, 9, 'It''s all listed in Exodus 20:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 80, 11, 9, '1. We are not to have any other gods.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 80, 12, 9, '2. We''re not to make idols');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 80, 13, 9, '3. We are not to take the Lord''s name in vain.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 80, 14, 9, '4. We''ll keep the Sabbath day holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 80, 15, 9, '5. Honor your father and mother');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 80, 16, 9, '6. Don''t murder');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 80, 17, 9, '7. Don''t commit adultery');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 80, 18, 9, '8. Don''t steal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 80, 19, 9, '9. Don’t bear false witness against your neighbor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 80, 20, 9, '10. You shall not desire your neighbor’s wife.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 80, 21, 9, 'The 9th commandment doesn''t say don''t tell a lie. There''s no commandment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 80, 22, 9, 'in the Old Testament like that, it was too high a standard. Their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 80, 23, 9, 'standard was not to tell a lie under oath in court and bear false');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 80, 24, 9, 'witness against their neighbor. A lie is a sin, but they couldn''t get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 80, 25, 9, 'victory over it in the Old Covenant. It''s a sad thing that many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 80, 26, 9, 'Christians don’t get victory over it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 80, 27, 9, 'Notice all these nine commandments were relating to the external life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 80, 28, 9, 'but when it came to the tenth one, it was internal. God put one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 81, 1, 9, 'commandment right at the end to test how many people would be sincere');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 81, 2, 9, 'and honest. That commandment said you shall not desire your neighbor''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 81, 3, 9, 'wife. It is not talking about grabbing your neighbor''s wife. No, you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 81, 4, 9, 'not touching her, you''re just sitting in your home and thinking about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 81, 5, 9, 'her and desiring something that belongs to your neighbor that''s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 81, 6, 9, 'yours. It could be your neighbor''s wife, it could be a neighbor''s house,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 81, 7, 9, 'it could be your neighbor''s daughter. Every woman on this earth is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 81, 8, 9, 'either your neighbor''s wife or your neighbor''s daughter. The Bible says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 81, 9, 9, 'you''re not to lust after a woman that''s not your wife. Here is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 81, 10, 9, 'command which no man could keep: You shall not lust. Nobody could keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 81, 11, 9, 'it. The Apostle Paul in one place says according to the righteousness in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 81, 12, 9, 'the law, I was blameless ( Philippians 3 ) but the same man says in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 81, 13, 9, '(Romans 7) that when it came to the last commandment saying, “thou shalt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 81, 14, 9, 'not covet or thou shalt not lust”, I found all types of lusting and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 81, 15, 9, 'coveting in my heart. He was just being honest. That''s the difference');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 81, 16, 9, 'between Paul and many Christians. Paul was absolutely honest. He said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 81, 17, 9, '“I found all types of coveting in my heart and I couldn''t overcome it.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 81, 18, 9, '(Romans 7:8). He cried out, ‘Oh wretched man that I am’” (Romans 7:24).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 81, 19, 9, 'Why did God put that tenth commandment there which He knew that nobody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 81, 20, 9, 'could keep? Because He wanted to see whether people would be proud like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 81, 21, 9, 'the Pharisee after they had kept only nine commandments and say, “Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 81, 22, 9, 'I thank you I''m not like other men” or whether they''d be humble like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 81, 23, 9, 'Paul and say, “Lord, I just am NOT able to keep this tenth Commandment.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 81, 24, 9, 'I’m lusting and coveting and lusting and coveting all the time. Oh,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 81, 25, 9, 'wretched man that I am. Who shall set me free.” It''s quite a different');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 81, 26, 9, 'spirit from the spirit of the Pharisee, and these are the ones whom God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 81, 27, 9, 'sees crying out in defeat of the tenth commandment, whom the Lord will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 81, 28, 9, 'lead into something higher, which is the New Covenant - a life of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 82, 1, 9, 'victory over sin. So that''s the reason why the tenth commandment was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 82, 2, 9, 'kept there. Remember when the Lord spoke to the rich young ruler, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 82, 3, 9, 'told him only about the commandments up to the ninth commandment. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 82, 4, 9, 'never told him the tenth one. The first four commandments in The Ten');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 82, 5, 9, 'Commandments dealt with God. The remaining six dealt with man. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 82, 6, 9, 'took the ones dealing with man and just listed five of them: don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 82, 7, 9, 'murder, don''t commit adultery, don''t steal, don''t bear false witness and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 82, 8, 9, 'honor your father and mother (Mark 10:19). The ruler said, “I’ve kept');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 82, 9, 9, 'all of these” and then the Lord spoke about the tenth one. He told the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 82, 10, 9, 'rich young ruler to go and sell everything that he had. Give it to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 82, 11, 9, 'poor and then come and follow me. Then we discovered that he didn''t want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 82, 12, 9, 'to keep the tenth commandment.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 82, 13, 9, 'So, the Lord kept the tenth commandment there to test people''s sincerity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 82, 14, 9, 'and honesty. Paul was sincere and honest and admitted that he couldn’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 82, 15, 9, 'keep it. Paul cried out, “Wretched man that I am. Who shall deliver me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 82, 16, 9, 'from the body of this death? Thanks be to God through the Lord Jesus.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 82, 17, 9, 'He goes on to describe in Romans 8 how the law of the spirit of life set');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 82, 18, 9, 'him free from the law of sin and death. So as Paul got light, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 82, 19, 9, 'repented. As he discovered some new area of lust in his heart, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 82, 20, 9, 'confessed it to God and cried out for deliverance from that sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 82, 21, 9, 'Wherever God sees a person sincerely acknowledging a sin and taking it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 82, 22, 9, 'seriously and wanting to be free from it, crying out to God for grace to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 82, 23, 9, 'be protected, he gets victory. Such a person gets the power of the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 82, 24, 9, 'Spirit to be an overcomer. True repentance leads to an overcoming life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 82, 25, 9, 'It says about Jesus in Hebrews 4:15 that He who never sinned was still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 82, 26, 9, 'tempted as we are in every point. How did He overcome sin? He is an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 82, 27, 9, 'example for us. Hebrews 5:7 says, He cried out with loud cries and tears');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 82, 28, 9, 'and prayed to the Father to save Him from death which is to save Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 83, 1, 9, 'from spiritual death and sin, and He was heard. His prayers were heard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 83, 2, 9, 'because of His godly fear. That is the way for us too. Jesus never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 83, 3, 9, 'sinned because He was so serious about fighting temptation and praying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 83, 4, 9, 'with loud crying in tears. If we pray in the same way and cry out to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 83, 5, 9, 'God, we will experience the same victory that He experienced. If you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 83, 6, 9, 'defeated, it''s because we haven''t taken sin seriously. May God help us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 83, 7, 9, 'all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 83, 8, 10, 'Chapter 10 God’s Two-Fold Provision');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 83, 9, 10, 'We’ve been looking at the principles that are taught in the early');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 83, 10, 10, 'chapters of the Bible concerning God''s purpose for man and how God wants');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 83, 11, 10, 'man to respond to Him. We saw how sin originated, the basis on which God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 83, 12, 10, 'forgives us our sin — through the death of Christ on the cross our guilt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 83, 13, 10, 'is removed. Unfortunately for many Christians that is all that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 83, 14, 10, 'know— that their guilt has been taken away by Christ''s death on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 83, 15, 10, 'cross. Removal of guilt is like the cleaning of a cup. Now in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 83, 16, 10, 'dining table when you clean a cup and put it there, it''s not meant to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 83, 17, 10, 'a decoration. You clean the cup in order to fill it with something to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 83, 18, 10, 'drink. So why does God cleanse our heart? It''s not just to keep it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 83, 19, 10, 'clean. No, our heart is like a vessel that needs to be filled or like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 83, 20, 10, 'channel through which when it is clean, God can pass on the water of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 83, 21, 10, 'life to other people. So that is why God''s provision for our salvation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 83, 22, 10, 'not only deals with the guilt of our past but also the future. There''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 83, 23, 10, 'grace sufficient for our need in the past and there''s grace sufficient');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 83, 24, 10, 'for us to be able to bless other people in the future as well. Our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 83, 25, 10, 'problem is basically twofold. One, we have this guilt of many years and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 83, 26, 10, 'years in which we have lived in sin and then even if God forgives us, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 83, 27, 10, 'have another problem of a nature that we have inherited from our parents');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 83, 28, 10, 'all the way from Adam which keeps on producing sin. How are we supposed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 84, 1, 10, 'to deal with that?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 84, 2, 10, 'If the gospel which is the good news of Christ only deals with problem');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 84, 3, 10, 'number one and does not deal with problem number two, it''s not really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 84, 4, 10, 'good news at all. It would be partial good news but it''s not fully good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 84, 5, 10, 'news. I''ve heard the story that in a certain lunatic asylum when they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 84, 6, 10, 'want to find out if a person has come to his senses, they give him a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 84, 7, 10, 'very simple test. They send him into a room with a bucket and a mop and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 84, 8, 10, 'in that room. The tap is open and the water is flowing in the room. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 84, 9, 10, 'then asked him to mop the room and make it dry. Now if he starts using');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 84, 10, 10, 'the mop to wipe the floor dry without closing the tap, then they know he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 84, 11, 10, 'has not come to his senses yet because a man who''s got some sense will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 84, 12, 10, 'close the tap and then mop the floor. Otherwise, he''ll never finish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 84, 13, 10, 'because the more he mops the floor, the more water is flowing from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 84, 14, 10, 'tap.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 84, 15, 10, 'Now this is the experience of many Christians. They sin, they ask Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 84, 16, 10, 'to cleanse them from their sin, but sin is continuously flowing from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 84, 17, 10, 'their lives. They sin some more, and this tap is constantly putting out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 84, 18, 10, 'sin and there they are in an endless job of trying to mop it all up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 84, 19, 10, 'confessing it and asking the Lord to forgive them and cleanse them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 84, 20, 10, 'again. And they go through this endless cycle of committing the same old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 84, 21, 10, 'sins and not overcoming. This is not good news at all. God has not given');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 84, 22, 10, 'us only this one part of the good news. This second part of the good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 84, 23, 10, 'news is what the devil has hidden from the minds of many Christians. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 84, 24, 10, 'Bible says we have forgiveness of sins through the riches of His grace.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 84, 25, 10, 'That''s the first thing that the grace of God does for us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 84, 26, 10, 'We read in Ephesians 1:7 that we have forgiveness of our sins according');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 84, 27, 10, 'to the riches of God''s grace. But there''s something more that the grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 84, 28, 10, 'of God does for us. In Romans 6:14, it says now that you have come under');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 85, 1, 10, 'grace, sin which ruled your life till now will not rule your life any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 85, 2, 10, 'more. So, my second problem is also dealt with by the grace of God. Now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 85, 3, 10, 'in the Old Testament when people did not have grace, they could not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 85, 4, 10, 'experience this until Christ came. We read in John 1:17 that Moses only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 85, 5, 10, 'brought the law, but Jesus Christ came with grace. Grace is God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 85, 6, 10, 'supernatural power that deals with the guilt of our past and enables us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 85, 7, 10, 'to overcome this sinful nature that we are all born with. This is God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 85, 8, 10, 'double provision for our double problem. What does He expect from us? To');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 85, 9, 10, 'receive His grace! When someone gives us a gift, we have to accept it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 85, 10, 10, 'and take it. If your father gave you a check to pay your fine in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 85, 11, 10, 'court and you don''t receive it, you''re not going to be free. You have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 85, 12, 10, 'receive it. God gives us something, we have to receive it. He gives us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 85, 13, 10, 'forgiveness; we say thank you Lord and we take it. He gives us power and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 85, 14, 10, 'we have to receive it in the same way. Forgiveness and power are the two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 85, 15, 10, 'gifts that God gives us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 85, 16, 10, 'On the day of Pentecost when Peter was preaching the first gospel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 85, 17, 10, 'sermon, he preached about Christ lifted up and a lot of people who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 85, 18, 10, 'convicted in their heart (Acts 2:37) .They said to Peter and the others,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 85, 19, 10, '“Brethren, what shall we do” and Peter said, “repent and be baptized in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 85, 20, 10, 'the name of Jesus Christ and you will receive two gifts: forgiveness of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 85, 21, 10, 'your sins and a gift of the Holy Spirit.” One is pardon and the other is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 85, 22, 10, 'power. We need both If you have to live the Christian life the way God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 85, 23, 10, 'wants us to live it. Not just pardon and not just power because you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 85, 24, 10, 'can’t get power before you get pardon. Let''s just think of that for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 85, 25, 10, 'moment. When I come to Christ and I acknowledge my sin and that''s all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 85, 26, 10, 'God asks me to do. Acknowledge your sin. Only acknowledge your sin,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 85, 27, 10, 'that''s all. You can''t do anything about it. Christ has already paid for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 85, 28, 10, 'it. When I acknowledge my sin, God not only cleanses me but does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 86, 1, 10, 'something else that’s wonderful. There is something wonderful in the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 86, 2, 10, 'God deals with our past; there is a word in the New Testament called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 86, 3, 10, 'justification. A lot of Christians haven''t understood the meaning of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 86, 4, 10, 'that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 86, 5, 10, 'When the Bible says in Romans 3:24 that God justifies us, we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 86, 6, 10, 'justified as a gift by His grace. The grace of God forgives us as we saw');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 86, 7, 10, 'that in Ephesians 1 and we are justified by His grace. Now justification');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 86, 8, 10, 'is more than forgiveness. Forgiveness means God looks at all the wrong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 86, 9, 10, 'things I have done and in His great mercy, He doesn’t hold it against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 86, 10, 10, 'me. That itself is wonderful. I''m extremely happy that I''m forgiven,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 86, 11, 10, 'though I''ve got to hang my head in shame because I''m a forgiven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 86, 12, 10, 'criminal. Justification is even more than. When God forgives me, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 86, 13, 10, 'means He has blotted out your past. Hebrews 8:12 says, “I will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 86, 14, 10, 'remember your sins anymore.” They''re all gone, and from now on God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 86, 15, 10, 'going to look at us as though we have never committed a sin in our whole');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 86, 16, 10, 'life. Think of that for a second. Almighty God, the pure holy God in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 86, 17, 10, 'whose presence angels tremble and they''re afraid says He will look at me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 86, 18, 10, 'as though I''ve never committed a sin in my whole life. That''s absolutely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 86, 19, 10, 'exciting that I can stand before a holy God just as if I''d never sinned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 86, 20, 10, 'in my whole life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 86, 21, 10, 'Can you imagine if you had actually never sinned in your whole life? How');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 86, 22, 10, 'you would feel? Wouldn''t you have a tremendous boldness to stand before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 86, 23, 10, 'God? Wouldn''t you have a tremendous boldness to confront Satan and say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 86, 24, 10, '“Satan, you can''t touch me. I’ve never sinned in my whole life there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 86, 25, 10, 'no sin there''s no spot in me.” It would give us tremendous boldness. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 86, 26, 10, 'feel so inferior and insecure and weak because of the memory of sin in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 86, 27, 10, 'the past. All of us feel insecure and weak and guilty because of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 86, 28, 10, 'memory of many things that we have done in the past which we know are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 87, 1, 10, 'wrong. It robs us of our boldness when we even try to share the gospel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 87, 2, 10, 'with others until we know the truth of being justified freely by His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 87, 3, 10, 'grace. Romans 3:24 which means God looks at me as though I had never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 87, 4, 10, 'sinned in my life. Romans 5:9 says it''s because I''m justified by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 87, 5, 10, 'blood of Jesus Christ. The blood that Jesus shed on the cross is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 87, 6, 10, 'complete atonement to God for all my sin so if I were to use a picture');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 87, 7, 10, 'language, that blood cleanses out my entire past life so thoroughly that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 87, 8, 10, 'when I look back there''s nothing there; it''s a pure life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 87, 9, 10, 'So justification means God says, “This guy is not a criminal, he''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 87, 10, 10, 'righteous man.” Forgiveness means “This guy''s a criminal but I''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 87, 11, 10, 'forgiven him.” Now which would you prefer? To be known as a criminal but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 87, 12, 10, 'you''ve been forgiven or to be known as a righteous man who''s not a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 87, 13, 10, 'criminal at all. We would all prefer the later that is what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 87, 14, 10, 'justification does. Let me repeat again. Forgiveness means God looks at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 87, 15, 10, 'me and says you''re a criminal, but you''re forgiven completely.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 87, 16, 10, 'Justification means God declares me righteous and say this person is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 87, 17, 10, 'a criminal; he is a righteous man. Think of the difference that makes in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 87, 18, 10, 'my attitude that Almighty God now doesn''t call me a forgiven criminal,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 87, 19, 10, 'He calls me a righteous man and says this person has never sinned in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 87, 20, 10, 'whole life. That is the mighty power of the blood of Jesus Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 87, 21, 10, 'cleansing my past. There''s no virtue in saying, “Oh Lord but I''m such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 87, 22, 10, 'sinner.” To keep saying that you''re a sinner when God has blotted it all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 87, 23, 10, 'out through the blood of Christ is to insult God. That''s not humility,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 87, 24, 10, 'that''s unbelief.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 87, 25, 10, 'When God says something, if I say the same thing as God says, then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 87, 26, 10, 'that''s faith. But if I don''t say the same thing that God says then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 87, 27, 10, 'that’s unbelief, not humility. When God declares you righteous and you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 87, 28, 10, 'say no, I’m such an unrighteous person; that''s not humility, that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 88, 1, 10, 'insulting God and I''m not going to do it. Personally, I’m just going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 88, 2, 10, 'accept the fact that God has declared me to be righteous. He''s dealt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 88, 3, 10, 'with my past completely; so thoroughly that He''s not only forgiven me,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 88, 4, 10, 'He’s justified me. Now if you believe that and you accept these truths');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 88, 5, 10, 'mentioned in Romans 3:24 and Romans 5:9, you will feel so confident when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 88, 6, 10, 'you stand before your Father. You won''t always feel that God looks at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 88, 7, 10, 'you as though He’s angry with you. You won’t feel as though you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 88, 8, 10, 'never good enough for Him and He won''t accept you as you are. When you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 88, 9, 10, 'feel that way, the result is you don''t accept other people as they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 88, 10, 10, 'also. Many husbands find fault with their wives. Many wives find fault');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 88, 11, 10, 'with their husbands. It''s all because they have not understood what it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 88, 12, 10, 'means to be justified freely. When God declares me as though I''ve never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 88, 13, 10, 'sinned in my life, it becomes very easy for me to look at other people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 88, 14, 10, 'and be merciful to them for all their faults. The lack of mercy that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 88, 15, 10, 'found in many a Christian is because they themselves have not understood');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 88, 16, 10, 'what it is to be justified freely by God''s grace. If you don''t believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 88, 17, 10, 'it, start trusting God for these promises. Take by faith what God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 88, 18, 10, 'offering as a gift. Justification is as a gift, but it''ll never be yours');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 88, 19, 10, 'till you receive it (Romans 3:24).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 88, 20, 10, 'We are justified by faith; through faith; through the blood of Christ,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 88, 21, 10, '(Romans 5:1) and by grace through the redemption which is in Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 88, 22, 10, 'Jesus (Romans 3:24). What God gives by grace, I need to take by faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 88, 23, 10, 'and accept that I''m declared righteous. I’m standing before God as if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 88, 24, 10, 'I''ve never sinned in my life and I can face the devil and say he has got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 88, 25, 10, 'no power over me. God looks at me as one who has never sinned my whole');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 88, 26, 10, 'life; God delights in me. That is the tremendous power of the blood of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 88, 27, 10, 'Christ having taken care of my past. I need to emphasize this because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 88, 28, 10, 'this is the problem with so many believers; they never seem to get rid');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 89, 1, 10, 'of the guilt of the past. The devil keeps on harassing them because they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 89, 2, 10, 'don''t understand justification. If it’s not a clearly laid foundation in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 89, 3, 10, 'your life and you start trying to build your Christian life, your house');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 89, 4, 10, 'is going to shake and one day it''ll collapse. Nobody taught me this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 89, 5, 10, 'clearly when I got converted. I wish somebody had taught me. The result');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 89, 6, 10, 'was my Christian life was shaky till I went to God''s Word and found');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 89, 7, 10, 'these things out for myself. God has declared me righteous and I am free');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 89, 8, 10, 'from the guilt of the past. I don''t have to remember any of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 89, 9, 10, 'thousands of things I did wrong in my past life, and you don''t have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 89, 10, 10, 'either. There I laid a foundation and when that foundation was laid, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 89, 11, 10, 'could start building my Christian life. In construction, we start');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 89, 12, 10, 'building after we have laid the foundation. We don''t build before the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 89, 13, 10, 'foundation is complete and if you have not got the foundation of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 89, 14, 10, 'justification clear in your life and you try to build your Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 89, 15, 10, 'life, you will collapse. That''s the reason why you tend to fall down. So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 89, 16, 10, 'once the foundation is laid, we can go to the next step. The next step');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 89, 17, 10, 'is our second problem which is the lack of power to overcome this nature');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 89, 18, 10, 'of ours and for that God gives us the mighty power of His Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 89, 19, 10, 'In the Old Testament, people could not receive the Holy Spirit to live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 89, 20, 10, 'inside them. Why? Because their hearts were not clean, and the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 89, 21, 10, 'Spirit can never come and live in an unclean heart. He could come upon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 89, 22, 10, 'people and equip them to do certain jobs for Him like Samson. He could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 89, 23, 10, 'give Samson power to kill hundreds of Philistines single-handedly, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 89, 24, 10, 'could give people power to preach, power to heal the sick and power to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 89, 25, 10, 'do a lot of external things. Many Old Testament prophets and others had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 89, 26, 10, 'power, but He could not live inside and make a person pure till Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 89, 27, 10, 'Christ came and died for the sins of the world. That provided the means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 89, 28, 10, 'by which a man''s heart could be pure then the Holy Spirit could come and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 90, 1, 10, 'live inside. That''s the significance of the day of Pentecost when the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 90, 2, 10, 'Holy Spirit was poured out. That could not happen before Christ died on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 90, 3, 10, 'the cross. Calvary had to precede Pentecost. So, when Christ died on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 90, 4, 10, 'cross, that made provision for my sins to be cleansed and my heart could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 90, 5, 10, 'be clean. Now the Holy Spirit can come and dwell there and give me this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 90, 6, 10, 'power to live the Christian life the way it should be lived. Now you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 90, 7, 10, 'know many of us who are sincere Christians may have tried and tried to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 90, 8, 10, 'overcome sin in our life. Trying to overcome sin is like a big struggle.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 90, 9, 10, 'We try and try and then for some time we are victorious and then we give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 90, 10, 10, 'up. It''s too much of a problem. Imagine if you had not known anything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 90, 11, 10, 'about electricity and you see a ceiling fan and they tell you that when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 90, 12, 10, 'this fan rotates, you can get some breeze and it can make the room cool.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 90, 13, 10, 'So, you tie a rope to that one of the blades of that fan and you keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 90, 14, 10, 'turning it and turning it and you get some breeze but how long can you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 90, 15, 10, 'go on like that? You get tired after some time and you give up. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 90, 16, 10, 'the experience of many Christians; they try and try to live this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 90, 17, 10, 'Christian life and they have to admit they failed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 90, 18, 10, 'This is what it means to live under the law. Under the law, it was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 90, 19, 10, 'turning the fan on your own and struggling. After some time, you''d give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 90, 20, 10, 'up because you''re just tired and exhausted but then somebody sees you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 90, 21, 10, 'and says, “Hey, that''s not the way the fan is supposed to run. Put on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 90, 22, 10, 'the switch and let the electricity flow.” When the electricity flows,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 90, 23, 10, 'you don''t need a rope; the power comes in to the fan and it goes around,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 90, 24, 10, 'and you never get tired. It can run for a long time by the flow of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 90, 25, 10, 'electricity. Until electricity was discovered, people couldn''t have fans');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 90, 26, 10, 'running like that. When you don''t understand grace, you cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 90, 27, 10, 'experience this power. You''re trying to live the Christian life like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 90, 28, 10, 'man tying a rope to the blade and you naturally get tired. Soon enough,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 91, 1, 10, 'you give up and you keep doing those sinful things which you''re not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 91, 2, 10, 'supposed to do. But once you understand that God''s way is to give you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 91, 3, 10, 'the power of His Holy Spirit, it''s exactly like electricity and you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 91, 4, 10, 'suddenly get a power.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 91, 5, 10, 'Let’s take another illustration. A bulb can never burn by itself. It has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 91, 6, 10, 'the capacity to give light, but it can’t give light till electricity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 91, 7, 10, 'comes in. That''s a picture of man; man has got the capacity like a bulb');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 91, 8, 10, 'to reflect the image of God, but he doesn''t have the power. When the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 91, 9, 10, 'Holy Spirit comes in, it''s exactly like electricity coming into a light');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 91, 10, 10, 'and it burns. How much effort does a light bulb need to have in order to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 91, 11, 10, 'burn? If it just submits to the electricity coming in, it burns');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 91, 12, 10, 'effortlessly. Christian life is something like that; you allow the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 91, 13, 10, 'Spirit to come and fill you to give you grace, and it solves this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 91, 14, 10, 'problem of your other nature seeking to drag you down into sin. So, this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 91, 15, 10, 'is God''s dual provision for our dual problem for our past failure;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 91, 16, 10, 'forgiveness and justification.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 91, 17, 10, 'For our evil nature which the Bible calls the flesh, the corrupt nature');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 91, 18, 10, 'that we have inherited from Adam, God has given us the power of His Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 91, 19, 10, 'Spirit to fight against the flesh. There is one difference between the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 91, 20, 10, 'bulb and us. The bulb doesn''t have a choice of its own; it''s just a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 91, 21, 10, 'lifeless object. It’s a lifeless thing that electricity goes in and it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 91, 22, 10, 'just submits there and the light burns, but in our case, we have to make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 91, 23, 10, 'a choice. If we don''t make a choice, we''re not going to be able to have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 91, 24, 10, 'this flow continuously. That''s why we need to make a choice every day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 91, 25, 10, 'Lord, I want this power to flow into me. It could be in different');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 91, 26, 10, 'situations where I have to make a choice. Yes, I want God''s power to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 91, 27, 10, 'flow into me to overcome this problem. Do you find it difficult, for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 91, 28, 10, 'example because of your corrupt nature to forgive somebody who hurt you?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 92, 1, 10, 'That''s a big problem for many Christians; they find it very difficult to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 92, 2, 10, 'forgive others. It’s exactly like you''re finding it difficult to keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 92, 3, 10, 'turning that fan with your hand. Naturally you find it difficult, but if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 92, 4, 10, 'God can give you the electric power to run that fan, would you be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 92, 5, 10, 'willing to receive that? If God is willing to give you the supernatural');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 92, 6, 10, 'love for a man who hurt you, are you willing to receive it to forgive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 92, 7, 10, 'that person? If you''re willing for that, you can receive. Everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 92, 8, 10, 'depends on your willingness. Do you want to be forgiven of your past?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 92, 9, 10, 'God''s willing to forgive you. Do you want power to overcome this corrupt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 92, 10, 10, 'nature that you got from Adam? God''s willing to give it to you. You must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 92, 11, 10, 'be willing to receive. All you have to say is, “Lord, forgive me my sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 92, 12, 10, 'and please fill me with your Holy Spirit. I want to live a life that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 92, 13, 10, 'pleases you.” That is how God makes a provision for man''s dual problem.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 92, 14, 11, 'Chapter 11 God Is A God Of Love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 92, 15, 11, 'We have been looking at certain foundational principles in God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 92, 16, 11, 'relationship with man. We must remember that the Bible teaches that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 92, 17, 11, 'is perfect love. We cannot even understand on earth what that type of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 92, 18, 11, 'love means. It''s way beyond the highest expression of love that this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 92, 19, 11, 'world can think of. When God wants to compare his love for man with a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 92, 20, 11, 'human illustration in Isaiah 49:15, He compares it with the love of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 92, 21, 11, 'mother for a newborn child. There are a lot of things that we call love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 92, 22, 11, 'on earth. For example, the love between boy and a girl has influenced');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 92, 23, 11, 'our thinking. A lot our thinking is influenced by what we have read in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 92, 24, 11, 'romantic stories or by the cinema but that is not the greatest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 92, 25, 11, 'expression of love on the face of the earth. A boy or a girl will not be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 92, 26, 11, 'willing to sacrifice for each other what a mother is willing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 92, 27, 11, 'sacrifice for her newborn child. When God speaks about His love, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 92, 28, 11, 'speaks about His love as the love of a mother for a newborn child,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 93, 1, 11, 'especially when it is first born. A mother''s love for that baby is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 93, 2, 11, 'intense even though the mother knows that this baby is going to be very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 93, 3, 11, 'demanding in terms of time and she will have to make a lot of sacrifices');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 93, 4, 11, 'for the baby. She''s still willing to do it and that is only a small');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 93, 5, 11, 'picture of the tremendous love that God has for man. If we don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 93, 6, 11, 'understand this, we will get a wrong concept of God and a wrong concept');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 93, 7, 11, 'of the true Christian faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 93, 8, 11, 'Almost all religions in the world proclaim a God who is like a strict');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 93, 9, 11, 'judge. Many people think of God as a severe judge or a policeman who''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 93, 10, 11, 'out to catch them for some wrong thing that they did. But the true');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 93, 11, 11, 'revelation of God in the Bible, and particularly that which came through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 93, 12, 11, 'Jesus Christ when He came to this earth, is one of a God who loves us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 93, 13, 11, 'intensely. Jesus constantly tried to explain to His disciples that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 93, 14, 11, 'was a Father, one who cared for His children, much more than the best');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 93, 15, 11, 'earthly father cared for his child. Jesus used this expression in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 93, 16, 11, 'Matthew 7, “If you, being evil know how to give good gifts to your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 93, 17, 11, 'children, how much more shall your heavenly Father give good gifts to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 93, 18, 11, 'those who ask Him.” Jesus said that the best earthly father was evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 93, 19, 11, 'compared to God. That''s the meaning of that statement in Matthew 7. You,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 93, 20, 11, 'being evil means, the best earthly father you can think of compared to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 93, 21, 11, 'God, is evil. It doesn''t mean that that a father is evil, but in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 93, 22, 11, 'comparison to God, he is. It''s something like the light of the star');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 93, 23, 11, 'compared to the light of the sun is almost like darkness. That''s why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 93, 24, 11, 'when the sun rises in the sky, the stars disappear. They don''t disappear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 93, 25, 11, 'really, the lights are there but the light of the sun is so bright, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 93, 26, 11, 'blots out the light of the stars and it almost becomes like darkness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 93, 27, 11, 'That''s what Jesus meant when He said that the best earthly father''s love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 93, 28, 11, 'would disappear and become darkness compared to the love of God. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 94, 1, 11, 'foundational to our coming into any relationship with God. Many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 94, 2, 11, 'Christians because they don''t have this clear understanding of God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 94, 3, 11, 'love in their heart, end up with insecurity, fear, sense of guilt, a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 94, 4, 11, 'feeling that God is always telling them you''re not good enough and this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 94, 5, 11, 'leads to relationship problems with others in families and with other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 94, 6, 11, 'Christians and others in the world. The root cause of all these problems');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 94, 7, 11, 'is a lack of understanding of what the New Testament reveals so clearly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 94, 8, 11, 'that God loves us intensely. Everything that God has planned for us and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 94, 9, 11, 'everything that God teaches in His word must be understood in the light');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 94, 10, 11, 'of His love. Otherwise, we''ll get it all wrong when He tells us to give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 94, 11, 11, 'up sin. It''s because He loves us. It is just like a father would tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 94, 12, 11, 'his children not to go to certain places that are dangerous, not to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 94, 13, 11, 'indulge in certain activities that are harmful, not to associate with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 94, 14, 11, 'certain people who would cause problems for them. But if a child doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 94, 15, 11, 'trust his father, which is very often the case with a lot of teenagers,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 94, 16, 11, 'then they go and do those things that their parents have forbidden them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 94, 17, 11, 'from doing and reap the consequences. They get into a lot of problems');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 94, 18, 11, 'and that''s what we see in the human race as well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 94, 19, 11, 'Men all over the world disobey God''s Word and His commandments thinking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 94, 20, 11, 'they know better. That''s the cause of all the problems there are in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 94, 21, 11, 'world. So, when God tells us to turn in repentance, it is for our good.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 94, 22, 11, 'When He tells us to trust Him that He will lead us in the path that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 94, 23, 11, 'best for us, that''s for our good. Faith means a dependence upon God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 94, 24, 11, 'a confidence in Him. I’m saying to God, “Lord, I trust you completely. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 94, 25, 11, 'can depend on you 100%. I have confidence in you.” Faith is also a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 94, 26, 11, 'leaning upon God for strength and power to live this Christian life. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 94, 27, 11, 'could describe faith like this: the leaning of the human personality');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 94, 28, 11, 'upon God in total confidence in His almighty power, His perfect wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 95, 1, 11, 'and His perfect love for us. That is what faith is. It is confidence in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 95, 2, 11, 'Him, and leaning upon Him, just like Jesus said of a branch abiding in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 95, 3, 11, 'tree. A branch abides in a tree and as a result of that abiding, the sap');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 95, 4, 11, 'of the tree flows into the branch and produces fruit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 95, 5, 11, 'This is the only way in which God expects us to do good or anything.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 95, 6, 11, 'There are a lot of things that God asks us to do which we may not have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 95, 7, 11, 'the strength to do. For example, the Bible says that we must forgive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 95, 8, 11, 'everybody. Now there may be someone who''s done you such tremendous harm');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 95, 9, 11, 'beyond what I can think of that you find it very difficult to forgive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 95, 10, 11, 'him. Well what does God expect you to do then? You don''t have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 95, 11, 11, 'struggle and struggle to try and forgive him. You need to go to God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 95, 12, 11, 'say, “God, just like the branch cannot produce fruit except it abides in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 95, 13, 11, 'the tree, I find myself unable to forgive this person even though I want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 95, 14, 11, 'to but if I abide in you just like the sap flows into the branch, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 95, 15, 11, 'power of your Holy Spirit can flow into me. The same Spirit that was in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 95, 16, 11, 'Jesus Christ when He hung upon the cross and forgave people who did the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 95, 17, 11, 'worst possible thing that any man could do to another person. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 95, 18, 11, 'said, “Father, forgive them for they don''t know what they''re doing.” He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 95, 19, 11, 'said it from His heart. He loved them. This same Spirit, when it flows');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 95, 20, 11, 'into my heart is going to produce exactly the same attitude. So true');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 95, 21, 11, 'Christianity is not trying to live up to a certain standard. The Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 95, 22, 11, 'says that in the Old Testament period when God was dealing with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 95, 23, 11, 'nation of Israel, He gave them Ten Commandments and certain laws.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 95, 24, 11, 'That entire period of fifteen hundred years described in the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 95, 25, 11, 'Testament is called a period of the law. During that period, this supply');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 95, 26, 11, 'of power to obey God''s commandments was not given. Man was left to fend');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 95, 27, 11, 'for himself. He had to do God''s commandments with his own ability, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 95, 28, 11, 'he could keep these external commandments like not worshipping idols,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 96, 1, 11, 'honoring father and mother, keeping the Sabbath, not murdering, not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 96, 2, 11, 'committing adultery etc. Some of these things man was capable of keeping');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 96, 3, 11, 'even without any supernatural power. There are many people in the world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 96, 4, 11, 'who are atheists and are very upright in all these matters of external');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 96, 5, 11, 'morality but when it came to the inner life, they are unable to keep it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 96, 6, 11, 'The last commandment was you shall not lust. When it came to that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 96, 7, 11, 'commandment, Paul says in Romans 7 that he just couldn''t keep it. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 96, 8, 11, 'could keep all the other nine, but he couldn''t keep this one. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 96, 9, 11, 'purpose with which God gave the law was to teach man over a period of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 96, 10, 11, '1,500 years that you can never keep my commandments up to my standards');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 96, 11, 11, 'with your own ability. You''ll be able to keep them externally and live a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 96, 12, 11, 'good moral life, but I require truth in the inward parts. There is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 96, 13, 11, 'lovely verse in Psalm 51 where David says, “Lord, you require truth in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 96, 14, 11, 'the innermost being.” God is not interested in our merely having a moral');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 96, 15, 11, 'life. If you show love to a person on the outside and you hate him in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 96, 16, 11, 'your heart, that doesn''t measure up to God''s standards.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 96, 17, 11, 'God wants your love to flow from within and this was just not possible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 96, 18, 11, 'in the Old Testament because man did not have the power. One of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 96, 19, 11, 'things that came as a result of Christ''s death and resurrection was that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 96, 20, 11, 'when He went up to heaven after His resurrection, He sent the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 96, 21, 11, 'Spirit to the earth to come and live within us to give us this power so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 96, 22, 11, 'that we can live according to the standards of God. That is why in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 96, 23, 11, 'New Testament period from Acts 2 from the day of Pentecost onwards,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 96, 24, 11, 'Christians now have the power if they will open themselves up to that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 96, 25, 11, 'power to be able to keep all of God''s commandments from within which was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 96, 26, 11, 'impossible even for the greatest men in Old Testament times. Once when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 96, 27, 11, 'Jesus was talking about John the Baptist to his own disciples, He said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 96, 28, 11, 'in Matthew 11:11 that the greatest man ever born of women thus far (from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 97, 1, 11, 'the time of Adam to Christ) was John the Baptist. And He also added that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 97, 2, 11, 'the least person in this new kingdom of the kingdom of heaven is going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 97, 3, 11, 'to be greater than even John the Baptist. In other words, now a new era');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 97, 4, 11, 'is beginning in which man will be able to rise much higher than the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 97, 5, 11, 'greatest men in the Old Covenant (the entire period from Adam to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 97, 6, 11, 'Christ). We need to recognize this. That we have the potential and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 97, 7, 11, 'ability and the resources to rise higher than any who lived prior to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 97, 8, 11, 'Christ''s coming to earth. This is unique. This is what the Bible calls a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 97, 9, 11, 'New Covenant.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 97, 10, 11, 'Now a lot of Christians don''t know about this because the devil has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 97, 11, 11, 'blinded their eyes and so a lot of Christians lived just according to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 97, 12, 11, 'the standards of the Old Covenant. In fact, they live even lower than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 97, 13, 11, 'the level of Old Covenant people. Think of some of the godly men who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 97, 14, 11, 'lived in Old Testament times like Moses, Elijah, John the Baptist and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 97, 15, 11, 'all these people. Can you say that Christians live at a higher standard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 97, 16, 11, 'than them? No, because they have not understood what the New Covenant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 97, 17, 11, 'can lead them into. God does not only give us forgiveness for our sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 97, 18, 11, 'as we considered earlier. He also gives us strength to overcome sin in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 97, 19, 11, 'our life. Strength to do every single thing that He commanded. God is on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 97, 20, 11, 'our side against our passions which are sinful, against the lusts in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 97, 21, 11, 'flesh, against the devil, against everything that will prevent us from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 97, 22, 11, 'becoming the type of person He wants us to become. God has got a plan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 97, 23, 11, 'for your life. He wants to make you like His Son Jesus Christ in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 97, 24, 11, 'character and it is to fulfill that purpose in your life that He has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 97, 25, 11, 'sent the Holy Spirit. But like we considered in an earlier study, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 97, 26, 11, 'doesn''t force anyone into anything. He will do in your life and my life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 97, 27, 11, 'only up to the measure that we yield to Him. You know if you can think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 97, 28, 11, 'of your heart like a huge hotel building with many floors and a thousand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 98, 1, 11, 'rooms in it. You''re looking at this building from a distance at night');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 98, 2, 11, 'and you see light in one room. You can say there is light in that hotel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 98, 3, 11, 'but it''s only in one room. Many people when they receive Christ into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 98, 4, 11, 'their life it''s like that, they''ve allowed Him to occupy one room in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 98, 5, 11, 'their life. Think of every one of those hotel rooms are lit up with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 98, 6, 11, 'light then you can say the whole hotel is full of light otherwise if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 98, 7, 11, 'it''s only one room that''s lit up. You can say that there is light in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 98, 8, 11, 'that hotel but it''s only in one room, so this is the difference between');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 98, 9, 11, 'just receiving Christ into your life to forgive your sins and allowing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 98, 10, 11, 'Him to fill you with His Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 98, 11, 11, 'When you receive Christ into your life, ask Him to forgive your sins,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 98, 12, 11, 'you can say that Christ is there, the light of the world is dwelling in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 98, 13, 11, 'you. What you''re saying is right, but you''re not filled with light,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 98, 14, 11, 'you''re not filled with the Holy Spirit. For that, you have to open up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 98, 15, 11, 'every door of every room for Him to occupy, then He will fill the whole');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 98, 16, 11, 'being, your whole inner personality with His Holy Spirit and you will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 98, 17, 11, 'what the Bible refers to in Acts of the Apostles about certain people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 98, 18, 11, 'full of the Spirit. You may have read that expression when you go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 98, 19, 11, 'through the Acts of the Apostles; certain men were full of the Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 98, 20, 11, 'This is what it means - there are people who out of gratitude');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 98, 21, 11, 'surrendered to the Lord every area of their life and the result was the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 98, 22, 11, 'Holy Spirit filled every area that they surrendered to Him. The Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 98, 23, 11, 'Spirit will not enter an area of your life which you don''t surrender to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 98, 24, 11, 'Him and you will continue to have problems in your life in every area');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 98, 25, 11, 'that''s un-surrendered. Every area that you don''t surrender to the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 98, 26, 11, 'Spirit; to Jesus Christ, will be an area of darkness, and that will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 98, 27, 11, 'an area of your life over which the devil will have some power. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 98, 28, 11, 'much better to yield it all to Christ; your finances, your business,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 99, 1, 11, 'your house, your family, your children, everything. He can take much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 99, 2, 11, 'better care of all these things than you can. Why is it then most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 99, 3, 11, 'Christians don''t surrender everything; though they do open up one room');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 99, 4, 11, 'in their heart to Christ?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 99, 5, 11, 'It''s because they feel that God is a spoilsport. They feel that God will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 99, 6, 11, 'not allow them to enjoy life. That God will make life miserable for them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 99, 7, 11, 'or that God will expect them to do certain things which they may not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 99, 8, 11, 'want to do; which are not good for them. That''s why I said right at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 99, 9, 11, 'beginning, we need to be very clear in our understanding that God is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 99, 10, 11, 'God of perfect love. He will never ask us to do anything which is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 99, 11, 11, 'for our very best. Not just for our good but for our very best. In fact,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 99, 12, 11, 'the Bible says that God makes everything around us work together in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 99, 13, 11, 'order to accomplish the very best for us. It says in Romans 8:28 that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 99, 14, 11, 'God works all things for our very best to those who love God and who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 99, 15, 11, 'called according to His purpose. That is externally in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 99, 16, 11, 'circumstances, inwardly He works in us through the Holy Spirit to do the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 99, 17, 11, 'very best for us within. So here we have a wonderful situation where the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 99, 18, 11, 'Holy Spirit is working within us to do what is the very best for us and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 99, 19, 11, 'working outside of us also; God the Father is working through His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 99, 20, 11, 'sovereignty; working everything for our very best. A Christian is a very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 99, 21, 11, 'blessed person. There is no situation in his life, if he has surrendered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 99, 22, 11, 'everything to God, where he needs ever worry that things won''t work out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 99, 23, 11, 'as God has planned. God may take his children through some difficult');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 99, 24, 11, 'path. Sure, don''t we want our children to become tough and strong? We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 99, 25, 11, 'don''t want our children to have an easy way through life because they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 99, 26, 11, 'won''t be fit to face the world. God also allows His children to go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 99, 27, 11, 'through difficult paths, but it''s all planned in love. Once we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 99, 28, 11, 'understand that, we will not hesitate to surrender everything to Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 100, 1, 11, 'Now we hear a lot of preachers telling Christians to surrender');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 100, 2, 11, 'everything to Christ and a lot of Christians hear that and agree with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 100, 3, 11, 'it. They nod and say that''s right, but they don''t surrender all because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 100, 4, 11, 'they''re not so sure whether it''s going to work out for the very best if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 100, 5, 11, 'they surrender everything to Christ. That''s why it''s very important for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 100, 6, 11, 'us to be gripped by what Jesus tried to emphasize to his disciples that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 100, 7, 11, 'their heavenly Father was interested in the very best for them. He used');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 100, 8, 11, 'so many illustrations to explain this great truth. He said they never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 100, 9, 11, 'need have any fear because the Father who feeds the birds would feed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 100, 10, 11, 'them. The one who clothes the grass of the field would clothe them and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 100, 11, 11, 'take care of all their needs. There''s a wonderful promise in Philippians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 100, 12, 11, '4:19 which says my God will supply all your need according to His riches');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 100, 13, 11, 'in glory by Christ Jesus. That means God doesn''t give us everything we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 100, 14, 11, 'want. Thank God He doesn''t do that. His love is the love of a father who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 100, 15, 11, 'desires the very best for his children and a good father will not give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 100, 16, 11, 'his children everything they want but he will give us children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 100, 17, 11, 'everything they need and that is how God is.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 100, 18, 11, 'The promise in Philippians 4:19 is God will supply all your need. Think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 100, 19, 11, 'of that. The pictures that we''ve considered of God is a very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 100, 20, 11, 'compassionate mother and a very loving father. A combination of both as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 100, 21, 11, 'a parent interested in the very best for their child. A true child of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 100, 22, 11, 'God, one who surrendered everything to Christ is the most blessed man on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 100, 23, 11, 'the face of the earth. And it is this blessedness that the devil wants');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 100, 24, 11, 'to deprive you of by warning you and telling you not to surrender this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 100, 25, 11, 'part of your life or not to surrender that part of your life, and that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 100, 26, 11, 'the part of your life which is going to be under the control of Satan.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 100, 27, 11, 'That’s the area where he''s going to have power and that''s the area of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 100, 28, 11, 'your life that''s going to cause problems for you forever. So isn''t it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 101, 1, 11, 'wonderful to be able to give all like it says in Romans 12:1. I beseech');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 101, 2, 11, 'you brethren, Paul says in view of all the mercies of God, present your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 101, 3, 11, 'bodies a living sacrifice to God which is your reasonable service');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 101, 4, 11, '(spiritual service) of worship. It means the least that you can do to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 101, 5, 11, 'express your gratitude to God for all that He has done for you is to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 101, 6, 11, 'surrender your body to him and say, “Lord, I want you to fulfill your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 101, 7, 11, 'plan in this body.” Proverbs 3:6 says in all your ways acknowledge Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 101, 8, 11, 'and He will direct your paths. That means in every single area of my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 101, 9, 11, 'life, if I say Lord, I want to acknowledge you. You are going to be Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 101, 10, 11, 'of my life in every single area. I want you to guide me and lead me,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 101, 11, 11, 'then He will ensure that everything works out for the very best, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 101, 12, 11, 'every single area of your life. In all your ways acknowledge Him and He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 101, 13, 11, 'will direct your paths.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 101, 14, 12, 'Chapter 12 The Power Of God’s Word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 101, 15, 12, 'We want to look at the importance of the word of God in our Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 101, 16, 12, 'life. Right from the very first chapter of the Bible, you find the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 101, 17, 12, 'importance of God''s word. The Bible is essentially God’s word detailing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 101, 18, 12, 'His purpose for man. In the very first chapter, we read of God speaking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 101, 19, 12, 'many words and the spoken words of God immediately bearing fruit. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 101, 20, 12, 'He said, “Let there be light”, there was light immediately (Genesis');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 101, 21, 12, '1:3). When God said, “Let there be an expanse in the midst of the waters');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 101, 22, 12, 'and let it separate the waters below from the waters above”, it came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 101, 23, 12, 'about that the heavens were created (Genesis 1:6-7). When He said, “Let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 101, 24, 12, 'the waters below the heavens be gathered into one place, and let the dry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 101, 25, 12, 'land appear”, it was so (Genesis 1:9). Like that you find this earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 101, 26, 12, 'that had been ruined by sin due to Satan’s fall between Genesis 1:1 and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 101, 27, 12, 'Genesis 1:2 was now being remade by God. This remaking was being done');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 101, 28, 12, 'through His spoken word and through the operation of the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 102, 1, 12, '(Genesis 1:2). So right from the first chapter of the Bible, you find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 102, 2, 12, 'the power of God''s spoken word and that''s why it''s so important for us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 102, 3, 12, 'to open our beings to God''s spoken word, which we have in the Bible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 102, 4, 12, 'When you come to the last chapter of the Bible in the book of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 102, 5, 12, 'Revelation, again you find a tremendous importance given to the word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 102, 6, 12, 'God. It speaks about our attitude to the words of this book;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 102, 7, 12, 'particularly referring to Revelation but it applies to the whole Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 102, 8, 12, 'as well. The Holy Spirit warns us not to add or subtract from His words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 102, 9, 12, '(Revelation 22:18-19). Those who add to God’s word will find added to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 102, 10, 12, 'them the plagues written in this book and those who subtract from it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 102, 11, 12, 'will find God take away their part from the tree of life. So we find a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 102, 12, 12, 'tremendous importance given to God’s word in the first and last chapter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 102, 13, 12, 'of the Bible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 102, 14, 12, 'In the earthly ministry of Jesus Christ, we find that one of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 102, 15, 12, 'earliest instances in His life shows how seriously He took the word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 102, 16, 12, 'God. We read in Luke 2.46 that at the age of twelve, He was in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 102, 17, 12, 'temple sitting and talking with all the scholars and discussing the word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 102, 18, 12, 'of God with them. He was sitting there in the midst of all the teachers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 102, 19, 12, 'of the law and listening to them and asking questions from God’s word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 102, 20, 12, 'Right from the beginning, the very picture you have of Jesus as a young');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 102, 21, 12, 'boy is centered on the word of God. It goes on to say that all those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 102, 22, 12, 'heard Him were amazed at His understanding of the word and the answers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 102, 23, 12, 'He gave (Luke 2:47). Jesus Christ from His childhood was a very careful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 102, 24, 12, 'student of the Bible, which was just the Old Testament in those days. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 102, 25, 12, 'must also remember He never had a written bounded Bible like we do in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 102, 26, 12, 'our homes. In those days, there were very few copies of the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 102, 27, 12, 'Testament written on parchments and very expensive to own, so usually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 102, 28, 12, 'only the synagogues will have them. The children would be taught in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 103, 1, 12, 'schools and there they would have an opportunity to hear the word of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 103, 2, 12, 'and that’s all the opportunity Jesus had in all those twelve years.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 103, 3, 12, 'Jesus got to know the Scriptures by listening very carefully and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 103, 4, 12, 'absorbing it during those limited opportunities. No doubt He also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 103, 5, 12, 'continued that practice all through His life. Furthermore, we also see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 103, 6, 12, 'the importance He gives to God’s word at the beginning of His ministry.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 103, 7, 12, 'As soon as His baptism is over, He goes into the wilderness to fast and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 103, 8, 12, 'pray for forty days and at the end of that period, the devil comes to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 103, 9, 12, 'tempt Him. This was all part of God’s plan for His Son on earth. How did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 103, 10, 12, 'Jesus overcome the different temptations of the devil? Without getting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 103, 11, 12, 'into an argument with the devil, He quotes the word of God. This is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 103, 12, 12, 'answer for you and me in our battle against the devil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 103, 13, 12, 'In the first temptation, Satan recognized that Jesus was hungry after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 103, 14, 12, 'not eating for 40 days. Seeing this, he tempts Jesus to turn the stones');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 103, 15, 12, 'into bread. Jesus replied by quoting from the word of God in Deuteronomy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 103, 16, 12, '8:3 which says, “Man shall not live by bread alone, but every word that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 103, 17, 12, 'proceeds from God’s mouth.” In other words, if I miss something of what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 103, 18, 12, 'God wants to speak to me, in that measure I’m not going to have the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 103, 19, 12, 'fullness of life that God wants me to have. This is one reason why many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 103, 20, 12, 'Christians have shallow lives—they do not know their privilege as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 103, 21, 12, 'Christians. They live in fear, insecurity, are defeated by sin; there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 103, 22, 12, 'so much confusion in their homes with their children going astray. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 103, 23, 12, 'reason is because many Christians do not take the study of God’s word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 103, 24, 12, 'seriously and are not receiving His word regularly. In fact, Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 103, 25, 12, 'compared God’s word to food. We need food in order to be strong and for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 103, 26, 12, 'our life to continue on this earth. In the same way, we need to live by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 103, 27, 12, 'the word of God to be spiritually fit and healthy. When the devil saw');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 103, 28, 12, 'that Jesus was a person who would quote God’s word, he decides to quote');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 104, 1, 12, 'God’s word out of context to lead Jesus astray. He tells Jesus to jump');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 104, 2, 12, 'out of the pinnacle of the temple by quoting Psalm 91:11-12. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 104, 3, 12, 'counteracts by quoting God’s word in saying “You shall not put the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 104, 4, 12, 'your God to the test” (Deuteronomy 6:16). The lesson here for us is that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 104, 5, 12, 'we need to know the scriptures accurately because the devil may tempt us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 104, 6, 12, 'by taking a verse of scripture out of its context. Christendom in 2000');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 104, 7, 12, 'years is full of examples of cults and groups who produce all types of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 104, 8, 12, 'strange teaching through taking a verse out of context and building a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 104, 9, 12, 'doctrine and a denomination around that wrong doctrine. They don’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 104, 10, 12, 'realize it is the devil who is quoting that verse to them. The whole');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 104, 11, 12, 'truth of God is not only found in the phrase it is written but it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 104, 12, 12, 'also written. In other words, we’ve got to compare scripture with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 104, 13, 12, 'scripture in order to understand the whole counsel of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 104, 14, 12, 'We need to study the Scriptures carefully if we want to make progress');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 104, 15, 12, 'spiritually. In 2 Timothy 3:16, we read that all scripture is inspired');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 104, 16, 12, '(or breathed) by God. There is something special about the 66 books that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 104, 17, 12, 'make up the Bible. These are not just words, but God breathed words.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 104, 18, 12, 'When God made Adam, He took some mud and made the shape of him, but man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 104, 19, 12, 'did not come to life until He breathed into his nostrils the breath of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 104, 20, 12, 'life (Genesis 2:7). Adam got the breath of God in him and became alive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 104, 21, 12, 'just like Jesus breathed on His disciples after the resurrection and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 104, 22, 12, 'told them to receive the Holy Spirit. According to 2 Timothy 3:16, God’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 104, 23, 12, 'word is also something He has breathed into—there is life in these words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 104, 24, 12, 'if we allow the Holy Spirit to reveal it to us. The words in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 104, 25, 12, 'scripture are not just stories and empty words; if there is a promise in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 104, 26, 12, 'Scripture for us, then there is a tremendous power in that word because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 104, 27, 12, 'God doesn’t lie. In fact, in Hebrews 4:12, it says there that “God’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 104, 28, 12, 'word is living and active and shaper than any two-edged sword and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 105, 1, 12, 'piercing as far as the division of soul and spirit, of both joints and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 105, 2, 12, 'marrow and able to judge the thoughts and intentions of the heart”. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 105, 3, 12, 'word of God is like a searchlight scanning into the depths of heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 105, 4, 12, 'Just like a medical device can scan our bodies and tell us what’s wrong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 105, 5, 12, 'with us, God’s word goes with into the depths of our heart and shows the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 105, 6, 12, 'areas where we are wrong. Therefore, a person who constantly exposes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 105, 7, 12, 'himself to the light of God’s word is going to discover a whole lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 105, 8, 12, 'things in his life that needs to be set right, and God will strengthen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 105, 9, 12, 'him in that area.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 105, 10, 12, '2 Timothy 3:16 goes on to say that Scripture, which is inspired by God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 105, 11, 12, 'is profitable for teaching, for reproof, for correction, for training in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 105, 12, 12, 'righteousness. God uses His word to correct, teach, train and lead us in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 105, 13, 12, 'the paths of righteousness with the ultimate goal that we as men and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 105, 14, 12, 'women will be perfectly equipped for everything that God wants us to do.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 105, 15, 12, 'We’ll be adequate, strong and capable for every work the Lord has for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 105, 16, 12, 'us. Just as God’s word is like food, it is also like a sword in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 105, 17, 12, 'conflict with Satan. The greatest example is Jesus Himself—In the three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 105, 18, 12, 'temptations described in Matthew 4:1-11, we find that He used no other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 105, 19, 12, 'weapon except the written word of God. If we know the written word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 105, 20, 12, 'God, we can drive Satan away every time he comes to us with any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 105, 21, 12, 'temptation. If on the other hand, you don’t know the word of God, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 105, 22, 12, 'will be helpless against the devil. In Ephesians 6:17, we are told that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 105, 23, 12, 'God’s word is the sword of the Spirit. It is the sword of the Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 105, 24, 12, 'with which we can fight Satan. In those days, a soldier would never go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 105, 25, 12, 'to battle without a sword since it is one of the most important parts of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 105, 26, 12, 'their equipment to attack. All the others equipment described such as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 105, 27, 12, 'the breastplate, helmet and shoes are all for defense. So, God’s word is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 105, 28, 12, 'the sword of the Spirit that can drive Satan away. Jesus had a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 106, 1, 12, 'particular word for each temptation to fight the devil. How did He get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 106, 2, 12, 'that word? It was not because He was God. Remember that when Jesus came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 106, 3, 12, 'to earth, He voluntarily gave up the abilities He had of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 106, 4, 12, '(Philippians 2:6-7). He was still God in His personality and He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 106, 5, 12, 'sinless, but He gave up the resources God has. For example, when Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 106, 6, 12, 'was on earth, He didn’t even know the date of His second coming. Why?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 106, 7, 12, 'Because while He was on earth as a man, He gave up that resource of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 106, 8, 12, 'knowing everything so that He could be like us and be an example for us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 106, 9, 12, 'When He came to earth, there was nothing in His mind of God’s word just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 106, 10, 12, 'like every baby is born into the world doesn’t have any data of God’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 106, 11, 12, 'word in their mind. That baby will have to acquire knowledge as he grows');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 106, 12, 12, 'up by reading or hearing God’s word. So Jesus filled His mind with God’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 106, 13, 12, 'word through the years on earth and from that database of many verses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 106, 14, 12, 'that He had stored in His mind, the Holy Spirit could pick out one which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 106, 15, 12, 'was appropriate for the first temptation and another one which was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 106, 16, 12, 'appropriate for the second temptation and another one which was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 106, 17, 12, 'appropriate for the third temptation. Now this is exactly what the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 106, 18, 12, 'Spirit wants to do for us in every circumstance we face. In the 47 years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 106, 19, 12, 'as a born-again believer, I have experienced and found that in so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 106, 20, 12, 'different complicated situation and difficulties, the Holy Spirit picks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 106, 21, 12, 'out a Scripture and gives it to me. Where does He pick it out from? He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 106, 22, 12, 'gets it from His word in the Bible that I have stored in my mind as I’ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 106, 23, 12, 'read through the years. We build a database of Scripture in our mind as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 106, 24, 12, 'we read it and because our memory isn’t perfect, we need to read it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 106, 25, 12, 'again and again to refresh our memory.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 106, 26, 12, 'The other reason why it is good to reread the Scriptures is, that from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 106, 27, 12, 'the very same verse, God may give us something new. I found this many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 106, 28, 12, 'times reading the same verse for the 20th or 50th time, I see something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 107, 1, 12, 'new there. Books that contain man’s word like a chemistry book are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 107, 2, 12, 'limited. You study and understand a topic and then you move on to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 107, 3, 12, 'higher standard. God''s word on the other hand is like an unending well —');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 107, 4, 12, 'a spring of water that never ceases. As we read and mediate on God’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 107, 5, 12, 'word, the Holy Spirit will take, at the appropriate time, the right word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 107, 6, 12, 'from all that we have stored in our mind and give it to us, and it will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 107, 7, 12, 'be exactly suited for our need in that situation. Now many Christians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 107, 8, 12, 'never experienced this in their whole life because they don''t study');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 107, 9, 12, 'God''s word carefully.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 107, 10, 12, 'In Psalm 1, David writes how blessed is the man who mediates and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 107, 11, 12, 'delights in the law of the Lord. In those days, there was just the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 107, 12, 12, 'Testament Scriptures, which contained the Law of Moses (the first five');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 107, 13, 12, 'books of the Bible) and other books that were before David’s time. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 107, 14, 12, 'says you are blessed if you not only read but delights and mediates on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 107, 15, 12, 'God’s words day and night. In the synagogues, such a person would listen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 107, 16, 12, 'to it and then mediate on it throughout the day. Such a person will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 107, 17, 12, 'like a tree planted by the streams of water, which always yields fruit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 107, 18, 12, 'in its season and whose leaf never withers and whatever he does will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 107, 19, 12, 'prosper. What a beautiful picture of a tree that never dries and is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 107, 20, 12, 'always green! It is a picture of freshness and this verse teaches us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 107, 21, 12, 'that the way to freshness is by mediating on scripture, and I have found');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 107, 22, 12, 'that through the years the more I mediate on God’s word, my life is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 107, 23, 12, 'fresh, and I am never dry. God gives me a word not only to help me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 107, 24, 12, 'overcome temptation like Jesus, but He gives me a word to give to other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 107, 25, 12, 'people when they face trials and temptations. It’s not just because I’m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 107, 26, 12, 'a preacher. You may never stand up in the pulpit and speak for some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 107, 27, 12, 'length of time because that’s a gift, but He may give you a word to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 107, 28, 12, 'speak to somebody who is in need. It may be just one sentence perhaps');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 108, 1, 12, 'from scripture or to write a verse of scripture to someone who is facing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 108, 2, 12, 'a particular problem. The Holy Spirit can pick out a word from all that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 108, 3, 12, 'you stored in your database and pick out the right word not only for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 108, 4, 12, 'yourself but for other people as well. It is a tremendous blessing of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 108, 5, 12, 'being fresh yourself and giving fruit for others to be blessed by. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 108, 6, 12, 'tree does not produce fruit for itself but for others. This is exactly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 108, 7, 12, 'what God wants to do for us every day of the year, but we have to work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 108, 8, 12, 'with Him and mediate on His word. God wants us to open our being to read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 108, 9, 12, 'His word and meditate on it. We can use His word to fight the devil as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 108, 10, 12, 'sword, to feed on it as our spiritual food and to drink of it like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 108, 11, 12, 'tree sap sucks in the water from the river and is always fresh. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 108, 12, 12, 'river here is God''s word, which flows into this tree through the roots');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 108, 13, 12, 'and keeps that tree fresh all the time and produces fruit through the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 108, 14, 12, 'sap in its branches so that other people can be blessed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 108, 15, 12, 'In Jeremiah 23.20, we also read that God''s word is like a fire and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 108, 16, 12, 'hammer that shatters a rock. He speaks there of false prophets who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 108, 17, 12, 'prophesy falsely in His name. He says the difference between the words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 108, 18, 12, 'of a true prophet and a false is like the difference between chaff and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 108, 19, 12, 'wheat. God’s word is like a fire and a hammer producing results when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 108, 20, 12, 'used. It can destroy and break whatever that is hindering our progress.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 108, 21, 12, 'Like a fire, it keeps us burning in our devotion to Jesus Christ. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 108, 22, 12, 'are many pictures like this used of God''s word in the Bible to show us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 108, 23, 12, 'its tremendous power to refresh us, to feed us, to give us the ability');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 108, 24, 12, 'to fight Satan, to produce fruit through us to bless other people and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 108, 25, 12, 'also to keep us on fire in our devotion to Christ. It is also used as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 108, 26, 12, 'hammer to break every rock or mountain that stands in our way so that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 108, 27, 12, 'can go through to fulfill God''s purpose for our lives. God''s Will is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 108, 28, 12, 'that you fulfill His plan for your life and for that you need the word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 109, 1, 12, 'of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 109, 2, 13, 'Chapter 13 How Satan Became Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 109, 3, 13, 'We want to look at the origin of evil in a universe created by God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 109, 4, 13, 'There would have been no evil in this universe if God had not given');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 109, 5, 13, 'freedom of will to any of His created beings. The planets for example');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 109, 6, 13, 'are incapable of doing evil. The trees that grow automatically according');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 109, 7, 13, 'to God''s laws are incapable of doing evil. But then the planets and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 109, 8, 13, 'trees are incapable of doing any moral good either because they have no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 109, 9, 13, 'moral nature. If God had made the universe full of created beings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 109, 10, 13, 'without freedom of choice, then there would be no good or evil in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 109, 11, 13, 'universe and it would have been pretty boring. Imagine a universe where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 109, 12, 13, 'it''s just the Father, the Son and the Holy Spirit and just a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 109, 13, 13, 'planets and stars and galaxies floating around in space. It would be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 109, 14, 13, 'like a billionaire who’s got a lot of property but no children or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 109, 15, 13, 'workers, just machines doing everything. God in his great wisdom created');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 109, 16, 13, 'beings with freedom of will. Long before He created the first man and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 109, 17, 13, 'woman, He created millions of angels. The man and woman whom He created');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 109, 18, 13, 'were superior to the angels in the sense that they had the ability to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 109, 19, 13, 'able to receive God''s nature and manifest His image. We don''t know too');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 109, 20, 13, 'many details about the angels, but we do know they have freedom of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 109, 21, 13, 'choice and they are created to be servants to do God''s will as He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 109, 22, 13, 'commands them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 109, 23, 13, 'One of the angels —whom we don’t know his name since it’s not clearly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 109, 24, 13, 'mentioned though - he''s commonly known as Lucifer. Lucifer means a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 109, 25, 13, 'shining being, but that was not his actual name. We do know that he was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 109, 26, 13, 'the leader of the angels. He was the one who led the angels in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 109, 27, 13, 'worship of God and very soon he decided that he wanted people to worship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 109, 28, 13, 'Him. He was the highest created being in the universe leading the angels');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 110, 1, 13, 'in the worship of God but because he had freedom of choice he could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 110, 2, 13, 'choose to obey or disobey God. He was tremendously gifted as God had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 110, 3, 13, 'given him numerous abilities and gifts more than what man has and this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 110, 4, 13, 'made him puffed up. He was puffed up because of his wisdom,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 110, 5, 13, 'intelligence, his beauty and his position. We first read of the devil in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 110, 6, 13, 'Genesis 3, when he comes to tempt Adam and Eve. That doesn’t mean he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 110, 7, 13, 'started to exist from nothing there. He was obviously created because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 110, 8, 13, 'there is nothing in this universe that is not created. God the Father,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 110, 9, 13, 'the Son Jesus and the Holy Spirit existed from all eternity. God created');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 110, 10, 13, 'everything else including the all the angels. Satan’s fall is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 110, 11, 13, 'described in the early chapters of Genesis because the Bible was written');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 110, 12, 13, 'to describe man''s history. This is why Genesis begins with man’s history');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 110, 13, 13, 'and not the devil. God revealed this truth about Satan and how he became');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 110, 14, 13, 'the devil to two of his prophets later on in Ezekiel and Isaiah (Ezekiel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 110, 15, 13, '28 and Isaiah 14). There are certain lessons we can learn for ourselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 110, 16, 13, 'when we examine how this perfect angel became a devil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 110, 17, 13, 'In Ezekiel 28:11-19, we read of the ruler of Tyre. Satan is the ruler of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 110, 18, 13, 'all the heathen kings of the earth and so he was the real ruler behind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 110, 19, 13, 'the human ruler of Tyre. Here, we see God speaking at times to the human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 110, 20, 13, 'ruler of Tyre and at times to Satan who indwelt him. This is similar to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 110, 21, 13, 'what we do when dealing with a demon-possessed person - at times we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 110, 22, 13, 'speak to the person and at times to the demon possessing him. God says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 110, 23, 13, 'to the king of Tyre that he had the seal of perfection, full of wisdom,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 110, 24, 13, 'perfect in beauty and he was in the Garden of Eden. Obviously, no king');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 110, 25, 13, 'of Tyre was ever in Eden and no human king had a seal of perfection and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 110, 26, 13, 'perfect in beauty, so he was referring to the devil that indwelt him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 110, 27, 13, 'What we learn here is that this angel was in the original Garden of Eden');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 110, 28, 13, '(verse 13). This was the Eden that existed before the destruction of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 111, 1, 13, 'earth mentioned in Genesis 1:2 and is different from the re-created Eden');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 111, 2, 13, 'that we read of in Genesis 3. We read in Genesis 1:2 that the earth was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 111, 3, 13, '"formless" ("tohu" - Hebrew). But we read in Isaiah 45:18 that the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 111, 4, 13, '"did not create the earth as a waste place" ("tohu" - Hebrew). Since');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 111, 5, 13, 'God''s word clearly states here that the earth was not created "tohu", it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 111, 6, 13, 'must therefore have become "tohu" in Genesis 1:2. God never creates');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 111, 7, 13, 'anything imperfect, or in evolutionary stages. The earth was not created');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 111, 8, 13, 'as a shapeless mass at first and then perfected by God, as some say. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 111, 9, 13, 'makes everything perfect as soon as He creates anything (James 1:17).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 111, 10, 13, 'The earth was created perfect. To believe that God first created a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 111, 11, 13, 'shapeless mass that was dark and ugly and then made it beautiful over a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 111, 12, 13, 'period of time is to believe in the evolution of the earth. That type of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 111, 13, 13, '"evolutionary theory" is as wrong as any other theory of evolution!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 111, 14, 13, 'So in the original garden of Eden, between Genesis 1:1 and Genesis 1:2,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 111, 15, 13, 'there was the head of the angels, perfect in beauty, anointed, placed on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 111, 16, 13, 'the holy mountain of God, blameless in every way from the day he was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 111, 17, 13, 'created until unrighteousness was found in him and he sinned (Ezekiel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 111, 18, 13, '28:12-16). As a result of his sin, he was cast down from the mountain of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 111, 19, 13, 'God. The reason for his sin was because his heart was lifted up and he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 111, 20, 13, 'became proud because of his beauty and wisdom. So here we see that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 111, 21, 13, 'first sin that raised its ugly head in this beautiful universe God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 111, 22, 13, 'created was pride. Pride is the root of all other sins that came later');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 111, 23, 13, 'in the universe and it is the root of every sin. Whenever you give a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 111, 24, 13, 'person freedom of choice, there is always the possibility that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 111, 25, 13, 'person can become proud or commit any other crime. Free will means a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 111, 26, 13, 'person has the freedom of choice to either obey or disobey God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 111, 27, 13, 'Isaiah 14 is another passage of scripture that deal with Satan. There we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 111, 28, 13, 'read about certain other details that are not mentioned in Ezekiel. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 112, 1, 13, 'Isaiah 14:12, he is called the star of the morning, the son of the dawn.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 112, 2, 13, 'This is probably where the Latin word Lucifer comes from. He said in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 112, 3, 13, 'heart that he will ascend to heaven and raise my throne above the stars');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 112, 4, 13, 'of God, and I will sit on the mount of assembly. He goes on to say He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 112, 5, 13, 'will make himself like the Most High (Isaiah 14:14). He wanted to become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 112, 6, 13, 'like God and exalt himself above even God. That’s why he was cast down');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 112, 7, 13, 'and he will finally end up in the lake of fire (Rev 20:10). Sin came to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 112, 8, 13, 'the universe because a created being was not satisfied with the position');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 112, 9, 13, 'God had given him. There is a boundary God had drawn around him and he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 112, 10, 13, 'wanted to go outside that boundary. Along with pride, it was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 112, 11, 13, 'discontentment with the position he had and wanted something more. Pride');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 112, 12, 13, 'and discontentment can turn an angel into a devil in a moment and it can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 112, 13, 13, 'ruin a person even today in exactly the same way. Why was he discontent?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 112, 14, 13, 'He was unhappy with the boundary God had drawn around him although it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 112, 15, 13, 'was a huge boundary because all the angles were subjected to him, as he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 112, 16, 13, 'was the head of the angels. He had beauty, wisdom, the anointing,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 112, 17, 13, 'position and he was still discontent even with the tremendous amount of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 112, 18, 13, 'things God had given him. What we learned here is that discontentment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 112, 19, 13, 'can also make a beautiful angel into a devil in a moment. If you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 112, 20, 13, 'proud or discontented with what God has given you, you are in danger of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 112, 21, 13, 'falling.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 112, 22, 13, 'We find human beings all over the world discontent with what they have,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 112, 23, 13, 'their financial resources, their looks, their houses, their wife,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 112, 24, 13, 'husband, job etc. The world is full of discontented people and that’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 112, 25, 13, 'the reason why they are so miserable; they have got this character of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 112, 26, 13, 'the devil all over them even though God has blessed them in so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 112, 27, 13, 'ways. They are unhappy with something or the other and that’s what makes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 112, 28, 13, 'angels into devils, and good men like devils. Pride and discontentment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 113, 1, 13, 'ruined this beautiful angel and can ruin you. When he said I’m going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 113, 2, 13, 'exalt myself above the throne of God, immediately God pushed him right');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 113, 3, 13, 'down. This is the law of God and we see this in the New Testament that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 113, 4, 13, 'God lifts up those who humble themselves and push down those who exalt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 113, 5, 13, 'themselves (1 Peter 5:5-6). The first example of that was Lucifer, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 113, 6, 13, 'head of the angels.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 113, 7, 13, 'Our Lord Jesus Christ, on the other hand brought salvation to us through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 113, 8, 13, 'humility. What a contrast! We see Jesus Christ, the Son of God giving up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 113, 9, 13, 'that position of equality of God and coming to earth as man and becoming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 113, 10, 13, 'an ordinary person, Even after humbling Himself to become a man, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 113, 11, 13, 'humbled Himself even more by being a servant to everybody. In the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 113, 12, 13, 'gospels, we see Him even washing His disciples’ feet. It was because of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 113, 13, 13, 'His humility that God exalted Him to the highest position in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 113, 14, 13, 'universe. It was not because He was the Son of God; though He had every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 113, 15, 13, 'right for that position. It was because as a man, Jesus Christ humbled');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 113, 16, 13, 'Himself and took the low place (Philippians 2:5-11). So here we have the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 113, 17, 13, 'operation of two spirits— one is the spirit of Satan that''s always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 113, 18, 13, 'trying to go up and God keeps pushing it down, and the other is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 113, 19, 13, 'spirit of Jesus Christ that is always seeking to go down and God exalts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 113, 20, 13, 'that spirit. Now every human being in the world is influenced by one of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 113, 21, 13, 'these spirits. Christendom is full of people who are influenced by one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 113, 22, 13, 'of these spirits. If every Christian went the way of Jesus in humbling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 113, 23, 13, 'themselves, every Christian will be spiritual, and every Church will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 113, 24, 13, 'a spiritual Church. Every single problem that has come in every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 113, 25, 13, 'Christian’s life, in every family, in every home, in every church, has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 113, 26, 13, 'its root and origin in pride — wanting to lift oneself up.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 113, 27, 13, 'We see that same thing with Adam and Eve. God drew a boundary around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 113, 28, 13, 'Adam and Eve in the Garden of Eden and said every tree here you can eat');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 114, 1, 13, 'from; all except one. They had a lot of trees to choose from and only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 114, 2, 13, 'one tree not to eat from. God gave them a huge boundary, which even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 114, 3, 13, 'consisted of the best tree in the garden. The had the opportunity to eat');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 114, 4, 13, 'from the tree of life yet they were discontent with the boundary God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 114, 5, 13, 'drew around them and went for the tree of knowledge of good and evil. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 114, 6, 13, 'see that same sin of discontentment that ruined the devil is that same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 114, 7, 13, 'sin that made man a sinner. This is another reason why grumbling and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 114, 8, 13, 'complaining is so serious; because it is an expression of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 114, 9, 13, 'discontentment. You can call yourself a born-again Christian, but if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 114, 10, 13, 'are discontent with what God has given you, you are going to be like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 114, 11, 13, 'devil in your character and behavior. And if you continue like that, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 114, 12, 13, 'are going to end up with the devil for all eternity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 114, 13, 13, 'The other poison Satan infected Adam and Eve was pride. Adam and Eve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 114, 14, 13, 'were proud to think that they could defy God and escape without facing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 114, 15, 13, 'the consequences God had told them. They were shaking their fist at God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 114, 16, 13, 'as to say we are going to eat of this tree even if you don’t approve. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 114, 17, 13, 'is like the arrogance some children show to their parents and when they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 114, 18, 13, 'do exactly what they have been told not to do. We could also say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 114, 19, 13, 'rebellion against authority led to their downfall. Lucifer did not want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 114, 20, 13, 'any authority over him and rebelled against the only authority he had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 114, 21, 13, 'over him and so did Adam and Eve.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 114, 22, 13, 'It is so important to teach our children to submit to authority because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 114, 23, 13, 'if they don’t learn that lesson, the poison of the devil is going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 114, 24, 13, 'destroy them all through life. Parents should teach their children to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 114, 25, 13, 'listen to them because it is very serious thing when a child does not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 114, 26, 13, 'listen to their father and mother at home. If it is not corrected');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 114, 27, 13, 'earlier on, they will grow up to disobey their teachers at school and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 114, 28, 13, 'their bosses at work when they grow up. This is why is it important to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 115, 1, 13, 'recognize these sins that made an angel into the devil. Pride,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 115, 2, 13, 'discontentment and rebellion against authority are three of the more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 115, 3, 13, 'serious sins. This is why when Jesus came; He did exactly the opposite');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 115, 4, 13, 'by humbling Himself throughout His 33 years on earth. He was always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 115, 5, 13, 'content with His lot in life. When He had no place to lay His head');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 115, 6, 13, 'during the 3-1/2 years of ministry, He never had a complaint (John 8:1).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 115, 7, 13, 'When everyone went to their house, Jesus went to the Mount of Olives and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 115, 8, 13, 'slept there. Jesus was a man with no complaints; He was content to live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 115, 9, 13, 'in a very poor home, submitting to the imperfect parents (Luke 2:51).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 115, 10, 13, 'Lucifer could not submit to the perfect authority of God whereas Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 115, 11, 13, 'could submit to the imperfect authority of His parents. Salvation came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 115, 12, 13, 'by Jesus countering every one of these evil that the devil brought into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 115, 13, 13, 'the universe. If you want to follow Jesus, you have to follow Him in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 115, 14, 13, 'these areas. Humble yourself in every situation, be content with what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 115, 15, 13, 'God has given and every situation submit to the legitimate authority');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 115, 16, 13, 'over you. That is the way to follow in the footsteps of Christ. Every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 115, 17, 13, 'other way contrary to that will make you like the devil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 115, 18, 14, 'Chapter 14 Salvation From Sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 115, 19, 14, 'Today we want to look at the work of salvation that Jesus came to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 115, 20, 14, 'accomplish. We''ve considered man''s fall into sin and we have seen how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 115, 21, 14, 'God has allowed the devil to exist and how he became the devil. We want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 115, 22, 14, 'to see something about the work of salvation. First of all, let''s look');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 115, 23, 14, 'at Matthew 1:21 for the first promise in the New Testament and it says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 115, 24, 14, 'here that “You shall call His name Jesus because He will save His people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 115, 25, 14, 'from their sins”. So, the meaning of the name Jesus is one who saves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 115, 26, 14, 'people from their sins. Now this is very important for us to recognize');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 115, 27, 14, 'right at the outset because many people today are preaching about Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 115, 28, 14, 'doing a lot of other things. Now, it''s true that the Lord does many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 116, 1, 14, 'things for His people. He blesses us materially, physically and does so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 116, 2, 14, 'many other things but the great danger I find today in a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 116, 3, 14, 'Christian preaching is that the emphasis has shifted from that which is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 116, 4, 14, 'major to that which is minor. The end result of that is that Christians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 116, 5, 14, 'are not experiencing the full blessing of what Christ primarily came for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 116, 6, 14, 'and did for them on the cross.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 116, 7, 14, 'What exactly did Jesus do for us on the cross? Why did He die on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 116, 8, 14, 'cross and why was He raised up from the dead? It was not to bless us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 116, 9, 14, 'with material things and to heal our sicknesses as if those were the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 116, 10, 14, 'greatest problems we have. Now if those were man''s greatest problems,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 116, 11, 14, 'certainly the Lord would deal with those primarily, but in the very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 116, 12, 14, 'first promise in the New Testament, we read that you will call His name');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 116, 13, 14, 'Jesus because He is going to save His people from their sins. Sin as we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 116, 14, 14, 'have seen is man''s biggest problem and Jesus came to save us from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 116, 15, 14, 'biggest problem and when the biggest problem was solved, those other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 116, 16, 14, 'problems take care of themselves. In the Old Testament, we see an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 116, 17, 14, 'example of this where David confronted Goliath, the giant of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 116, 18, 14, 'Philistines. David there is the picture of Christ who is called the Son');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 116, 19, 14, 'of David and Goliath there we could say is a picture of Satan, or is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 116, 20, 14, 'picture of sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 116, 21, 14, 'In 1 Samuel 17:51, we read that when Goliath was defeated, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 116, 22, 14, 'Philistines fled when they saw that their champion was dead. When their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 116, 23, 14, 'champion was defeated, all the Philistines ran away. When the major');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 116, 24, 14, 'problem was taken care of, the minor problems were solved. On the other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 116, 25, 14, 'hand, if David had concentrated on fighting the smaller Philistines and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 116, 26, 14, 'not Goliath, the problem would not have been solved. Goliath would still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 116, 27, 14, 'have been hale and hearty, defying the Israelites even though the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 116, 28, 14, 'smaller Philistines would have been killed. The problem would not have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 117, 1, 14, 'been solved. That''s a picture of how if you look at man''s problems and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 117, 2, 14, 'deal with the minor ones first, the major one still stands there like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 117, 3, 14, 'Goliath. Sin is the root cause of all the other problems, and it has to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 117, 4, 14, 'be dealt with first. We could say that if man has some sickness within');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 117, 5, 14, 'his body and which manifests itself in sores on his skin you can give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 117, 6, 14, 'him a tube of ointment that deals with the sore on the affected part of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 117, 7, 14, 'the body. But once he begins to treat that part of his skin and gets rid');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 117, 8, 14, 'of the sore, it will manifest itself on another part of his body. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 117, 9, 14, 'gets rid of the sore on his hands, but it comes back on his legs. Then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 117, 10, 14, 'one day the doctor tells him there''s a new antibiotic that''s been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 117, 11, 14, 'discovered. You take this antibiotic internally and it will deal with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 117, 12, 14, 'the root of the problem inside your body. Now with the antibiotic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 117, 13, 14, 'dealing with the root cause, the other things are taken care of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 117, 14, 14, 'automatically you won''t get any sores.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 117, 15, 14, 'Sin is actually like that and the salvation of Christ is like an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 117, 16, 14, 'antibiotic that deals with the root of man''s problem within and not with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 117, 17, 14, 'the minor things outside. It is not like an ointment to remove the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 117, 18, 14, 'sores, but like an antibiotic that goes inside and deals with the root');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 117, 19, 14, 'problem so that these other minor problems get solved automatically. Sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 117, 20, 14, 'is man''s root problem that''s why the very first promise in the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 117, 21, 14, 'Testament says, “You shall call his name Jesus because he''s going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 117, 22, 14, 'save His people from their sins”. There is a difference between being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 117, 23, 14, 'saved from sin and having our sin forgiven. All believers — if they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 117, 24, 14, 'really born again — have their sins forgiven but you can''t say that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 117, 25, 14, 'have been saved from their sin. For example, if I get angry that''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 117, 26, 14, 'sin. If I lust with my eyes or I’m bitter against somebody, that''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 117, 27, 14, 'sin. I can confess these sins to God and say “Lord, I''m sorry I got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 117, 28, 14, 'angry, I’m sorry that I lusted with my eyes, I’m sorry that I got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 118, 1, 14, 'bitter, please forgive me.” I’m forgiven but I''m not saved because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 118, 2, 14, 'tomorrow if I go and do the same things again, how can I say I''m saved?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 118, 3, 14, 'I''m still inside the prison of sin because I have not been rescued or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 118, 4, 14, 'delivered. The promise is that “You shall call His name Jesus because He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 118, 5, 14, 'will save his people from their sins”. We can''t save ourselves from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 118, 6, 14, 'penalty of sin, we cannot save ourselves from the power of sin and we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 118, 7, 14, 'cannot save ourselves from the presence of sin. Everything has to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 118, 8, 14, 'done by Christ and when He died upon the cross, He saved us from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 118, 9, 14, 'penalty of sin. Even more than that, He also made a way when He died for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 118, 10, 14, 'us to be delivered from the power of sin. If this is also not preached,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 118, 11, 14, 'we can say that half the gospel is not preached. The gospel has two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 118, 12, 14, 'parts to it and both are included in the first promise in the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 118, 13, 14, 'Testament. We can see them combined in the words of Jesus to the woman');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 118, 14, 14, 'caught in adultery.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 118, 15, 14, 'In John 8:3, we read that there was a woman caught in the terrible sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 118, 16, 14, 'of adultery and she was brought before Jesus for a verdict. Jesus told');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 118, 17, 14, 'the Pharisees who wanted to stone her saying “He who is without sin,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 118, 18, 14, 'throw the first stone” All her accusers went away and then Jesus looks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 118, 19, 14, 'at this woman and says, “Where are they? Did no one condemn you?” She');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 118, 20, 14, 'replies by saying “No one, Lord”. Jesus that tells her the gospel in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 118, 21, 14, 'verse 12 when He says “I do not condemn you, either. Go and sin no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 118, 22, 14, 'more.” In this statement we see the two parts of the gospel. The first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 118, 23, 14, 'part is that I do not condemn you and the second part is “Go and sin no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 118, 24, 14, 'more”. That is exactly what the Lord tells us today because He died on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 118, 25, 14, 'the cross for us so we can receive the forgiveness. He also tells us He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 118, 26, 14, 'can save us from our sins, so we don’t keep falling into it. It’s like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 118, 27, 14, 'two sides of the same coin. If you get a coin with only one side printed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 118, 28, 14, 'it''s a counterfeit; you need both.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 119, 1, 14, 'Therefore, when it says in Matthew 1:21 that Jesus has come to save us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 119, 2, 14, 'from our sins, it is to save us from the power of sin in our day-to-day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 119, 3, 14, 'life and one day when he comes back in glory, He will save us from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 119, 4, 14, 'very presence of sin. So, salvation of sin consists of three tenses:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 119, 5, 14, 'past, present and future tense. In the past, He saved us from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 119, 6, 14, 'penalty of sin if you received Christ as your Savior. In the present, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 119, 7, 14, 'wants to save you from the power of sin every day and then one day in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 119, 8, 14, 'the future He will save you from the presence of sin. So, it''s very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 119, 9, 14, 'important to see that the Gospel message is primarily dealing with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 119, 10, 14, 'root problem and unfortunately in today''s preaching, the preachers have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 119, 11, 14, 'got taken up with the results the symptoms of the sickness rather than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 119, 12, 14, 'the sickness itself and that''s foolish. A man can have tuberculosis and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 119, 13, 14, 'one of the symptoms of that may be fever in the evenings. If the doctor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 119, 14, 14, 'just gives him some medicine to take care of his fever, it wouldn’t cure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 119, 15, 14, 'his tuberculosis, but only deal with the fever symptom. No doubt, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 119, 16, 14, 'gets a relief from the fever, but the disease is not healed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 119, 17, 14, 'It is exactly the same approach that many take with sin. Sin can make a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 119, 18, 14, 'man sick or he can be in some financial difficulty and you deal only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 119, 19, 14, 'with the sickness and the financial difficulty, the real problem of sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 119, 20, 14, 'still remains. it''s like giving a man treatment for his headache when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 119, 21, 14, 'his real sickness is tuberculosis and so the same problem remains. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 119, 22, 14, 'man still lives in sin but maybe he''s healed of a sickness or his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 119, 23, 14, 'financial problem, but it does not solve the root cause of the problem');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 119, 24, 14, 'and if he''s not saved from sin no matter how much he is blessed with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 119, 25, 14, 'physical healing or material prosperity he finally goes to hell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 119, 26, 14, 'separated from God. We have to be very careful of this counterfeit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 119, 27, 14, 'gospel being preached today in many places, which does not deal with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 119, 28, 14, 'root problem of sin. Jesus came to save us from our sins. Let me repeat,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 120, 1, 14, 'Jesus came not just to forgive us but also to save us from our sins. Let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 120, 2, 14, 'me use an illustration. Supposing I have a five-year-old boy at home,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 120, 3, 14, 'and I tell say to him “Son, don''t go outside the gate because the road');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 120, 4, 14, 'crew are digging the road there and there''s a deep pit there and if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 120, 5, 14, 'go there, you''ll fall into that pit”. He disobeys me and goes near there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 120, 6, 14, 'to watch these men and when they go away after working, he falls into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 120, 7, 14, 'the pit. From the inside of the pit, he cries out and I go there and say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 120, 8, 14, 'what happened son? He says, “Dad, I''m sorry I disobeyed you and here I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 120, 9, 14, 'am at the bottom of this pit. Please forgive me” I say to him “Okay son,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 120, 10, 14, 'you''re forgiven. Goodbye”. Have I forgiven him? I certainly have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 120, 11, 14, 'forgiven him for disobeying me. Have I saved him? No, he''s still in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 120, 12, 14, 'pit! Is that all Jesus has come to do for us? That we keep going to him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 120, 13, 14, 'saying I’m sorry and having our sins forgiven with no help to overcome?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 120, 14, 14, 'That would be a very poor gospel. The gospel means good news! Would my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 120, 15, 14, 'son think it is good news if I have forgiven him for his disobedience');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 120, 16, 14, 'but left him in the pit? Certainly not! That is not good news, that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 120, 17, 14, 'bad news for him. The good news of the gospel is that I not only forgive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 120, 18, 14, 'him, but I reach out and pull him out of the pit and save him. We must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 120, 19, 14, 'remember that Christ came to save us from our sins and that was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 120, 20, 14, 'possible in the Old Testament.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 120, 21, 14, 'There was not a single person in the Old Testament who could say “Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 120, 22, 14, 'thank you for saving me from my sins”. The Old Testament did not go so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 120, 23, 14, 'far to give the promise of salvation from sin; it only had the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 120, 24, 14, 'forgiveness of sins as we read in Psalm 103. David says in Psalm 103');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 120, 25, 14, 'that Lord pardons all your iniquities, heals all your diseases and he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 120, 26, 14, 'redeems your life from hell. David in the Old Testament experienced');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 120, 27, 14, 'forgiveness from all his sins. He also says in Psalm 32 “How blessed is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 120, 28, 14, 'the man whose transgression is forgiven; whose sin is covered. Blessed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 121, 1, 14, 'is the man to whom the Lord does not impute iniquity.” Forgiveness of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 121, 2, 14, 'sins is mentioned a number of times in the Old Testament as something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 121, 3, 14, 'that they actually experienced a thousand years before Christ came but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 121, 4, 14, 'not a single one of those people could ever say “Thank you Lord for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 121, 5, 14, 'saving me from my sin.” They were forgiven like I forgave my son who''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 121, 6, 14, 'lying in that pit, but I didn''t save him. That was the Old Covenant and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 121, 7, 14, 'the mark of people living under the Old Covenant is their sins are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 121, 8, 14, 'forgiven but they are still in the pit and they''re not saved from their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 121, 9, 14, 'sins. This is why the New Covenant is so glorious because Jesus not only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 121, 10, 14, 'forgives us but also saves us from the very thing that held us as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 121, 11, 14, 'slaves. In 2 Corinthians 3, the Apostle Paul writes about the glory of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 121, 12, 14, 'the New Covenant compared to the Old Covenant. It says there that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 121, 13, 14, 'Old Covenant was a ministry of condemnation, but the New Covenant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 121, 14, 14, 'ministry is one of righteousness (2 Cor 3:9). There is a greater glory');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 121, 15, 14, 'in the New Covenant ministry than in the Old Covenant ministry because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 121, 16, 14, 'the preaching of the law in the Old Covenant only resulted in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 121, 17, 14, 'condemnation even though their sins were forgiven. The more they heard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 121, 18, 14, 'the law, the more they felt condemned that they couldn''t keep it. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 121, 19, 14, 'couldn''t come up to God''s standard, so all the preaching only condemned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 121, 20, 14, 'them. When we preach today in a way that people feel condemned, we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 121, 21, 14, 'actually preaching in the spirit of the Old Covenant. Under the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 121, 22, 14, 'Covenant, it''s a ministry of actual righteousness. Righteousness is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 121, 23, 14, 'opposite of sin. When we are saved from sin, we come to a righteous life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 121, 24, 14, 'and that is what the New Covenant offers. That is what Jesus Christ has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 121, 25, 14, 'come to offer us— a salvation from sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 121, 26, 14, 'Think of wonderful promises like this: The Lord is able to keep you from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 121, 27, 14, 'falling (Jude 24). It doesn''t say you can keep yourself from falling.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 121, 28, 14, 'You can''t and you don''t have the ability to forgive your own sin or to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 122, 1, 14, 'be saved from your sin. None of us have that, but if you allow the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 122, 2, 14, 'and receive Him, He will forgive us, and He will save us by keeping us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 122, 3, 14, 'from falling. This is another life altogether. Let me show you another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 122, 4, 14, 'verse that shows us the distinctive New Covenant promises. In Romans');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 122, 5, 14, '8:2, it speaks of the law of the Holy Spirit as different from the Law');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 122, 6, 14, 'of Moses. The Law of Moses was the Ten Commandments in addition to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 122, 7, 14, 'others, which consisted of a lot of rules. For example, you shall do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 122, 8, 14, 'this, and shall not do this. People tried to keep it, but they couldn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 122, 9, 14, 'keep it entirely and they felt condemned. Here in contrast to the Law of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 122, 10, 14, 'Moses is the law of the Holy Spirit, and the law of the Holy Spirit is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 122, 11, 14, 'described as not a list of commandments but a life in Christ Jesus (Rom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 122, 12, 14, '8:2). This law is great and when I receive this life, it sets me free');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 122, 13, 14, 'from the law of sin and death. There is another law called the law of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 122, 14, 14, 'sin and death, which is just like the law of gravity. The law of gravity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 122, 15, 14, 'keeps pulling people down and down. Even the Bible operates under the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 122, 16, 14, 'law of gravity. If I hold a book in my hand, the moment I let it go, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 122, 17, 14, 'law of gravity pulls it down and it falls. Since there is life in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 122, 18, 14, 'body, if I allow this life to hold this book up then we can say the law');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 122, 19, 14, 'of life in my body has set this book free from the law of gravity. Now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 122, 20, 14, 'do you see how this is a picture of what is described in Romans 8:2. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 122, 21, 14, 'law of life in my body has set this book free from the law of gravity so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 122, 22, 14, 'that this book is not falling down because I am keeping it from falling.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 122, 23, 14, 'Now think of the book as a picture of you; the law of sin just keeps on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 122, 24, 14, 'working in your life and keeps on pulling you down you just go down. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 122, 25, 14, 'can''t stay up without sinning even a moment. Some of those things are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 122, 26, 14, 'serious and some of those sins we don’t even know. We commit sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 122, 27, 14, 'consciously, but they are many others sins which we commit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 122, 28, 14, 'unconsciously. But if I allow the life of Jesus to come into me, it can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 123, 1, 14, 'keep me from falling. The life of Christ Jesus will set me free from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 123, 2, 14, 'law of sin and death. That is the law of the Holy Spirit and it wasn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 123, 3, 14, 'possible for a man to experience that under the Old Covenant. Under the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 123, 4, 14, 'Old Covenant, the Holy Spirit did operate on certain people, but it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 123, 5, 14, 'only on the outside. It could work in a Samson to make him kill a lion,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 123, 6, 14, 'but it could not help him to overcome the lion of lust inside His body.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 123, 7, 14, 'Samson was defeated by the lion of lust inside his body even though he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 123, 8, 14, 'could tear a physical lion to pieces. Which is stronger, that physical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 123, 9, 14, 'roaring lion that comes out of the forest or the lion of lust within a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 123, 10, 14, 'heart? We are terrified of a physical lion. If you were in the forest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 123, 11, 14, 'and a lion came jumping at you, you''d be scared, and I''d be scared. Why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 123, 12, 14, 'are we not so scared when the lion of lust comes up? It''s actually much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 123, 13, 14, 'more dangerous and much more powerful. A physical lion can''t send you to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 123, 14, 14, 'hell, it can only send you to the grave. The lion of lust within you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 123, 15, 14, 'send you to hell. In the Old Testament, there was no way by which a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 123, 16, 14, 'could be saved from the lion of lust. The Holy Spirit could give a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 123, 17, 14, 'power to tear an external lion to pieces but because the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 123, 18, 14, 'could not live inside man in Old Testament times, they could not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 123, 19, 14, 'overcome internally. The Holy Spirit could only operate on a man on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 123, 20, 14, 'outside and help him to be free externally. He gave certain people power');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 123, 21, 14, 'externally to do various things in the Old Testament. We read of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 123, 22, 14, 'Spirit coming upon people and clothing them. Just like I wear a shirt,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 123, 23, 14, 'the Holy Spirit clothed people on the outside.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 123, 24, 14, 'The distinctive blessing of the New Testament is that the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 123, 25, 14, 'can now come inside and fill me and control every part of my being and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 123, 26, 14, 'give me power within to kill the lions inside of anger, lust, bitterness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 123, 27, 14, 'and every other wretched lion. So that what Samson did to lions on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 123, 28, 14, 'outside, I can do the lions on the inside. Jesus never killed any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 124, 1, 14, 'external lion, but He overcame every temptation that He ever faced, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 124, 2, 14, 'He tells us to follow Him in this way. This is the message of the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 124, 3, 14, 'Testament; Jesus came to save us from our sins. Many of us may have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 124, 4, 14, 'problems with sickness, financial difficulties, difficulties in the home');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 124, 5, 14, 'and many other difficulties but remember this, every problem arises out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 124, 6, 14, 'of the root problem of sin. If the root problem of sin is dealt with, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 124, 7, 14, 'can hope for a solution to many of these other problems. We may not get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 124, 8, 14, 'cured of every sickness. They are many reasons why God allows sickness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 124, 9, 14, 'to still existing on earth - I don''t have time to mention all of them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 124, 10, 14, 'right now but when the root problem of sin is solved, many other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 124, 11, 14, 'problems in our life will disappear. Concentrate on the root problem by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 124, 12, 14, 'letting the Holy Spirit deal with thing within our hearts. In other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 124, 13, 14, 'words, when you slip up inside take it seriously. Don''t just take it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 124, 14, 14, 'seriously only when you slip up on the outside. Whenever you slip up on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 124, 15, 14, 'the inside with your thoughts, attitudes towards others go to the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 124, 16, 14, 'and confess it and ask Him to free you from that sin. If I take sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 124, 17, 14, 'inside seriously, the Lord will help me to be free from the root of sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 124, 18, 14, 'within. On the other hand, if the Lord sees that I''m only interested in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 124, 19, 14, 'avoiding sin on the outside because I don''t want to lose my testimony');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 124, 20, 14, 'before others, He will not be able to help me. If I’m quite happy that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 124, 21, 14, 'other people see that I''m a holy person but it doesn''t matter if I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 124, 22, 14, 'filthy inside, then the Lord sees I''m not interested in real holiness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 124, 23, 14, 'I’m only interested in just having an appearance of holiness before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 124, 24, 14, 'people and you never get free from sin within. You''ve got to show God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 124, 25, 14, 'that you''re really serious about being delivered from sin within. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 124, 26, 14, 'are really serious about getting rid of this disease within, the only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 124, 27, 14, 'way you can prove that to God is when you sin in secret in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 124, 28, 14, 'thoughts, your attitudes, you cry out to God and say “Lord, forgive me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 125, 1, 14, 'Nobody saw me there, but I sinned against You, I want to be free.” If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 125, 2, 14, 'God sees that attitude, I can guarantee that you will come to experience');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 125, 3, 14, 'deliverance from this bit of sin very quickly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 125, 4, 15, 'Chapter 15 Jesus Our Forerunner');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 125, 5, 15, 'We''ve been looking at the fact that Jesus came to save us from our sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 125, 6, 15, 'and not just to forgive us our sins. He wants to lead us beyond');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 125, 7, 15, 'forgiveness to salvation. We saw in our last study that salvation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 125, 8, 15, 'actually has got three tenses – past, present, and future. We have to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 125, 9, 15, 'saved from the penalty of our sin because of all the sins we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 125, 10, 15, 'committed in our life. The next thing is to be saved in the present');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 125, 11, 15, 'tense from the power of sin and in the future when Christ comes again,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 125, 12, 15, 'we will be saved from the very presence of sin. God has made provision');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 125, 13, 15, 'for this as I said in our last study by giving us His Holy Spirit who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 125, 14, 15, 'can now live within us and give us the power to overcome. More than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 125, 15, 15, 'that, our God has given us His own Son not only to die for us as our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 125, 16, 15, 'substitute on the cross but also to be an example for us as we look at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 125, 17, 15, 'His life on earth. There is a title of Jesus which is not very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 125, 18, 15, 'well-known among Christians. Majority of us know Jesus as Savior, Good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 125, 19, 15, 'Shepherd, the Way, the Truth and the Light, the light of the world, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 125, 20, 15, 'door, the resurrection and the life, the bread of life etc., but many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 125, 21, 15, 'don’t know His title as a Forerunner.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 125, 22, 15, 'This title is found in the book of Hebrews which is the one book that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 125, 23, 15, 'describes the humanity of Jesus Christ more than any other book in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 125, 24, 15, 'New Testament. This is one reason why the devil won''t want you to read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 125, 25, 15, 'Hebrews too much. I found that Hebrews is not a very popular book with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 125, 26, 15, 'many believers and that''s not surprising because the devil knows if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 125, 27, 15, 'read and study it, you will come to a life of victory and he doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 125, 28, 15, 'want you to get victory. The book of Hebrews which emphasizes the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 126, 1, 15, 'humanity of Christ and it doesn''t take away from His deity. Whenever we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 126, 2, 15, 'speak about the humanity of Christ, we have to be very careful to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 126, 3, 15, 'emphasize the fact that we are not denying that He is God. The writer to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 126, 4, 15, 'the Hebrews was given a burden from the Holy Spirit to emphasize the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 126, 5, 15, 'fact that Jesus was a man 100% and therefore he begins in the first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 126, 6, 15, 'chapter by emphasizing that Jesus was 100% God. In fact, there''s hardly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 126, 7, 15, 'a book in the New Testament that emphasizes the deity of Christ as much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 126, 8, 15, 'as the first chapter of Hebrews because he wants to move on from there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 126, 9, 15, 'to show that Jesus was not only 100% God, but He was also 100% man. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 126, 10, 15, 'Jesus was living on earth, He was 100% God and a 100% man, but most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 126, 11, 15, 'people could not recognize that He was God. They thought He was just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 126, 12, 15, 'another man and they found it difficult to acknowledge that He was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 126, 13, 15, '100% God except a few people like Peter who got revelation on that from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 126, 14, 15, 'the Father that this person was not just a man, He was God Almighty -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 126, 15, 15, 'the second person of the Trinity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 126, 16, 15, 'Many Christians accept Jesus Christ as God; there are some strange cults');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 126, 17, 15, 'that don''t accept him as God, but the majority of Christians accept him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 126, 18, 15, 'as God. The problem today is the reverse of what it was in the days when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 126, 19, 15, 'Jesus was on earth. Today the problem is that many Christians can''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 126, 20, 15, 'accept the fact that he was a 100% man, which for them is a heresy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 126, 21, 15, 'Supposing someone believed that Jesus was 100% man but not 100% God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 126, 22, 15, 'Would you call that heresy? Sure, it is a heresy. What about the other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 126, 23, 15, 'way around? Supposing a person says I believe Jesus Christ 100% God, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 126, 24, 15, 'He was not 100% man. That is as much of a heresy as believing He wasn’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 126, 25, 15, 'completely God. What does it mean for Jesus to be 100% man? It doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 126, 26, 15, 'mean that Jesus was sinful because God didn’t create man with sin. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 126, 27, 15, 'was completely like us, made like his brothers in all things as it says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 126, 28, 15, 'in Hebrews 2:17. He was tempted like us in all things, yet without sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 127, 1, 15, '(Hebrews 4:15). He was completely separate from sin; He was pure and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 127, 2, 15, 'Holy and undefiled; He was born Holy because He was born of the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 127, 3, 15, 'Spirit. He was a man like us in every way, tempted like us in every way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 127, 4, 15, 'because He voluntarily chose not to use His resources as God when He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 127, 5, 15, 'on earth therefore, He could be an example for us. In Hebrews 6:20, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 127, 6, 15, 'is called our forerunner which means someone who runs in front of us in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 127, 7, 15, 'exactly the same track that we have to run. If He ran on another track,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 127, 8, 15, 'He would not be our forerunner but because He ran in the same track we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 127, 9, 15, 'have to run in, He is called our forerunner. Later on, in Hebrews');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 127, 10, 15, '12:1-2, we are told to run this race looking unto Jesus, the author and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 127, 11, 15, 'perfecter or the author and finisher of our faith. So how can we look at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 127, 12, 15, 'Jesus and run this race if He is not running in front of us. If He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 127, 13, 15, 'hasn''t run the same race in front of us, we cannot look at Him and run');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 127, 14, 15, 'if He’s running somewhere else on some other track. This is what it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 127, 15, 15, 'means to believe that He was 100% human. He had to face the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 127, 16, 15, 'temptations that you and I face, and He had no more resources than you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 127, 17, 15, 'and I have because He was made like His brothers in all things. Only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 127, 18, 15, 'then could He become our high priest (Hebrews 2:17).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 127, 19, 15, 'So, what does this mean in practical terms? You see, we make an excuse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 127, 20, 15, 'for our sin by saying we''re only human as if being human means we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 127, 21, 15, 'to sin. If we are without the power of the Holy Spirit, then that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 127, 22, 15, 'right; we will keep on sinning forever and ever and ever. But Jesus was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 127, 23, 15, 'also human; how did He not sin then? Immediately you begin to think it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 127, 24, 15, 'was because He was God. Now the question arises when He was on earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 127, 25, 15, 'did, He use His resources as God. If He did, then of course He cannot be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 127, 26, 15, 'an example for us completely and He cannot say to any of us, “Follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 127, 27, 15, 'Me”. I''ll say, “Lord, I can''t follow You. You were God and I''m a man.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 127, 28, 15, 'Yet Jesus kept on telling people to follow Him and Paul says in 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 128, 1, 15, 'Corinthians 11:1, “Follow me as I follow Christ.” Paul was following');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 128, 2, 15, 'Christ and in Philippians 3:17, he says, “make me an example and make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 128, 3, 15, 'others an example who are following Christ.” He says, “follow our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 128, 4, 15, 'example; we are following Christ.” It is possible for us to follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 128, 5, 15, 'Christ because Christ was human just exactly like us except that there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 128, 6, 15, 'was no sin in Him. He was tempted exactly like us; He felt the pull of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 128, 7, 15, 'temptation that you and I feel; if He did not feel the pull of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 128, 8, 15, 'temptation then you cannot say He was tempted. If there is no pull,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 128, 9, 15, 'there is no temptation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 128, 10, 15, 'The meaning of temptation is a pull downwards of sin. When Jesus walked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 128, 11, 15, 'on the water in Matthew 14 on the Sea of Galilee, did He feel the law of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 128, 12, 15, 'gravity pulling Him down like we all feel? Or do you believe that since');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 128, 13, 15, 'He is God, He doesn''t feel the pull of gravity? If that were the case,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 128, 14, 15, 'then there''s no miracle in His walking on the water. That’s not a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 128, 15, 15, 'miracle at all; Almighty God walking on the water. He can fly across the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 128, 16, 15, 'water, that''s no miracle. It''s a miracle because Jesus was 100% man and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 128, 17, 15, 'felt the pull of gravity and overcame it and walked on the water and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 128, 18, 15, 'then told Peter, “If you look at Me, you can also experience this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 128, 19, 15, 'miracle” and Peter walked on the water. Jesus was a man like us and felt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 128, 20, 15, 'the pull, this time not of the law of gravity, but the law of sin and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 128, 21, 15, 'death. He felt that pulled of temptation and did not sin. if He had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 128, 22, 15, 'sinned, it would have led Him to death, but He didn''t sin. He felt the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 128, 23, 15, 'pull and He overcame it. You know many people degrade Jesus by saying He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 128, 24, 15, 'didn''t feel any pull. Well then, it''s not a great thing if He faced');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 128, 25, 15, 'temptation. For example, when the devil told Him to turn stones to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 128, 26, 15, 'bread, was it possible for Jesus to turn stones to bread or not? If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 128, 27, 15, 'say it was possible then you''re actually saying it was possible for Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 128, 28, 15, 'to sin, but He didn’t. If it was impossible for Him to turn the stones');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 129, 1, 15, 'into bread, then there''s no temptation. Temptation exists only if there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 129, 2, 15, 'is a possibility of committing sin. Without such a possibility,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 129, 3, 15, 'temptation isn’t there. When the devil told Jesus to jump from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 129, 4, 15, 'temple, was it possible for Jesus to jump? What do you think? I say yes,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 129, 5, 15, 'He could certainly have jumped but he didn’t. If He had jumped, He would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 129, 6, 15, 'have sinned, and He would have died but He didn’t. We need to see that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 129, 7, 15, 'Jesus faced temptation and He wasn''t play-acting. In drama, a person can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 129, 8, 15, 'act as though he''s being tempted. Don’t accuse Jesus of acting as though');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 129, 9, 15, 'He was being tempted and not really being tempted. it''s an insult and a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 129, 10, 15, 'lot of Christians insult Christ by saying He was not really tempted like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 129, 11, 15, 'us. Then what was He doing? Play-acting?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 129, 12, 15, 'We must honor Christ by saying He was no play actor. He faced temptation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 129, 13, 15, 'really and overcame it. Now the devil doesn''t want you to know that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 129, 14, 15, 'because if you know it, you''ll get victory over sin and he doesn''t want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 129, 15, 15, 'you to get victory over sin. He wants you to be defeated all your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 129, 16, 15, 'I know in my own life, after I was born again for 16 years, I was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 129, 17, 15, 'defeated. After I was born again and baptized in water, baptized in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 129, 18, 15, 'Holy Spirit, I was defeated by sin just like a lot of other Christians.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 129, 19, 15, 'I was no different and yet I saw in the Word of God that if I came under');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 129, 20, 15, 'grace, sin would not have power over me (Romans 6:14). How did sin have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 129, 21, 15, 'power over me then? Because I did not understand what it meant to come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 129, 22, 15, 'under God''s grace. I knew God''s grace in terms of forgiveness of sins,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 129, 23, 15, 'but I never knew the experience of a further level of grace where sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 129, 24, 15, 'would not have dominion over me (Romans 6:14). My excuse always was that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 129, 25, 15, 'I''m human but the day I saw that Jesus was like me and He came in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 129, 26, 15, 'flesh like me, He was tempted like me. The day I saw that, two things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 129, 27, 15, 'happen in my life; I had no more excuse for my sin. Till then, my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 129, 28, 15, 'excuses were that Jesus was God. Now I couldn''t say that because though');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 130, 1, 15, 'He was God, He didn''t use the resources of God. That’s what I saw when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 130, 2, 15, 'it says in Philippians 2:5 that He emptied Himself. What did He empty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 130, 3, 15, 'Himself off when He came to this earth? He did not empty Himself of His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 130, 4, 15, 'deity because He was God Almighty. God cannot ever cease being God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 130, 5, 15, 'Jesus accepted worship; He forgave people''s sins, but He did empty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 130, 6, 15, 'Himself of the resources of deity. For example, God knows everything but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 130, 7, 15, 'Jesus when He lived on earth refused to use that power. He could have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 130, 8, 15, 'used it, but He didn''t use it. He emptied Himself; that''s why He did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 130, 9, 15, 'know whether there was fruit on a fig tree. He had to come there just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 130, 10, 15, 'like other human beings have to come near a tree to find out it has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 130, 11, 15, 'fruit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 130, 12, 15, 'He also did not know that date of His own second coming to the earth. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 130, 13, 15, 'says that in the Gospel of Mark; the Son of Man does not know, only the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 130, 14, 15, 'Father knows the day. Why was that? Because He had limited Himself. Now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 130, 15, 15, 'He knows the date because He’s back up in heaven but when He was on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 130, 16, 15, 'earth, He limited Himself. God is never tired. Psalm 121 says God never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 130, 17, 15, 'slumbers or sleeps but Jesus slept in the boat because He had limited');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 130, 18, 15, 'Himself. He did not use that resource of God who never slumbers or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 130, 19, 15, 'sleeps. If He had not limited Himself, He could not be our example');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 130, 20, 15, 'because we have so many limitations. Secondly if He had used resources');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 130, 21, 15, 'that I have no access to gain, He could not be my example. To be my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 130, 22, 15, 'example, He had to use only those resources which I also have access to-');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 130, 23, 15, 'that is the power of the Holy Spirit. That’s all He used to overcome sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 130, 24, 15, 'and He offers that same resource to us fully. Two things happened to me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 130, 25, 15, 'as I said. One was that I had no more excuse for sin because I could not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 130, 26, 15, 'say, “Oh I''m human so I have to sin.” Jesus was one human who did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 130, 27, 15, 'sin. The second thing that happened to me was I had faith that if one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 130, 28, 15, 'human could do it so can I.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 131, 1, 15, 'Let me use an illustration. Supposing there was some island somewhere in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 131, 2, 15, 'this earth where the people who lived there had been cut off from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 131, 3, 15, 'rest of civilization from the beginning of the human race or whenever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 131, 4, 15, 'people went to that island. In the middle of that island there''s a river');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 131, 5, 15, 'but nobody ever has learned to swim on that island and generation after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 131, 6, 15, 'generation nobody has learned to swim, and everybody feels if you get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 131, 7, 15, 'into the water, you''ll drown because man''s body is heavier than water.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 131, 8, 15, 'When you get into the water, you''ll sink, and they''ve seen people sink');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 131, 9, 15, 'and they say it is impossible to float on water. So, generation after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 131, 10, 15, 'generation, nobody gets into the water because they are afraid of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 131, 11, 15, 'drowning. Now one man comes from the civilized world and tells them you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 131, 12, 15, 'can swim across the river. They reply to him by saying it’s impossible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 131, 13, 15, 'to float on the water because your body is heavier than water. He tells');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 131, 14, 15, 'them if you make a little effort, you can swim, and they ask him to show');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 131, 15, 15, 'them. He jumps in the river and swims across to the other side and they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 131, 16, 15, 'are absolutely amazed. They think perhaps his body is of a different');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 131, 17, 15, 'type than theirs and they examine him and confirm that he has the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 131, 18, 15, 'body they do. Now they get the faith that they can also overcome gravity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 131, 19, 15, 'and swim because they saw one man do it. That’s what happened to me when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 131, 20, 15, 'I saw that Jesus was tempted like me and did not sin. The law of sin and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 131, 21, 15, 'temptation pulled Him down, but He did not yield, He overcame. When I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 131, 22, 15, 'saw this man swim as it were without sinking, it gave me faith that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 131, 23, 15, 'can also overcome. That’s the faith the devil doesn''t want you to have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 131, 24, 15, 'because you''ll be an overcomer. Do you think the devil wants you to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 131, 25, 15, 'an overcomer? No, he wants you to be defeated like you''ve been defeated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 131, 26, 15, 'all your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 131, 27, 15, 'How many Christians can stand up and testify that God has given them the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 131, 28, 15, 'grace to get victory over their anger, the lust of their eyes, over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 132, 1, 15, 'bitterness, over jealousy etc. They are so rare. You''d be lucky if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 132, 2, 15, 'find one believer in a thousand who can testify to that. Why? Because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 132, 3, 15, 'the devil has blinded them to the truth that Jesus became like them and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 132, 4, 15, 'was tempted like them. He’s blinded you to that truth, but you need not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 132, 5, 15, 'be blind anymore. Let me use another illustration. Supposing an angel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 132, 6, 15, 'from heaven came to earth to teach you how to swim in a swimming pool');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 132, 7, 15, 'and he flies across the swimming pool with his wings and says follow me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 132, 8, 15, 'What will you say to him? You''ll say, “I can''t follow you angel. I can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 132, 9, 15, 'admire you, but I can''t follow you because you''re not subject to the law');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 132, 10, 15, 'of gravity that I''m subject to. If you want to teach me to swim, get rid');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 132, 11, 15, 'of your wings and take a body like mine.” If the angel takes a body like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 132, 12, 15, 'mine and gets rid of his wings, then he can jump into the pool and teach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 132, 13, 15, 'me to swim and say, “Follow me.” Otherwise, he can only say, “Admire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 132, 14, 15, 'me.” So, if Jesus was not like us, all He can say to us, “Admire how I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 132, 15, 15, 'overcome sin, but you can''t follow me because you are not like me.” But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 132, 16, 15, 'He never said that. Jesus is our Forerunner, the author and finisher of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 132, 17, 15, 'our faith. Let us run the race looking unto Jesus, the author and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 132, 18, 15, 'finisher of our faith (Hebrews 12:2).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 132, 19, 15, 'Illustrations help us to understand this truth more clearly. Now I want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 132, 20, 15, 'to use one more illustration. Think if a very rich billionaire from some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 132, 21, 15, 'Western country comes to India to help the poor people who live in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 132, 22, 15, 'slums of India to teach them how to live without getting into debt with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 132, 23, 15, 'the limited amount of money they earn every month. He wants to teach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 132, 24, 15, 'them how to keep their little huts in the slum clean with a limited');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 132, 25, 15, 'amount of money they earn. This man is a billionaire and he''s got a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 132, 26, 15, 'credit card. He can go to any ATM machine and draw thousands of dollars');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 132, 27, 15, 'if he wants but he comes here, and he tells these people in the slum I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 132, 28, 15, 'will work just like you. I will be carrying bricks or whatever it is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 133, 1, 15, 'some construction site and earning a thousand rupees a month. I will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 133, 2, 15, 'earn more than you. I will be just like you and I will build a little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 133, 3, 15, 'hut here just like you built, and I will show you how I can live with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 133, 4, 15, 'keeping the hut clean and not get into debt and live a clean life here.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 133, 5, 15, 'They watch him and if he secretly goes to some ATM machine every now and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 133, 6, 15, 'then and puts in his credit card and draws money, he will be cheating.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 133, 7, 15, 'When they see that, they say, “Hey, you can do that because you''re a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 133, 8, 15, 'billionaire. You got a credit card. We don''t have that.” But he says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 133, 9, 15, '“No, I''ll never go to an ATM machine. I got a credit card with a billion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 133, 10, 15, 'dollars, but I won''t use it. I refuse to use my resources in the country');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 133, 11, 15, 'I come from and I will limit myself only to the resources you have.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 133, 12, 15, 'Now he is true to his word. He never uses his credit card; he lives and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 133, 13, 15, 'works and earns just like anybody else in that slum. Such a man can say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 133, 14, 15, 'to the others, follow me. He cannot say, “follow me” if he keeps using');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 133, 15, 15, 'his credit card now and then. Jesus came to earth just like this man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 133, 16, 15, 'This man was a billionaire when he was living in the slum. That didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 133, 17, 15, 'change. He had billions in his bank account back in the United States or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 133, 18, 15, 'wherever he came from, but he didn''t live as a billionaire in India. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 133, 19, 15, 'didn''t use this credit card here. That is a picture of how Jesus came to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 133, 20, 15, 'this earth. He never used his heavenly credit card - His resources as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 133, 21, 15, 'God though He was God. He lived using the resources we are offered and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 133, 22, 15, 'so He could say to us, “Follow me.” When we see this wonderful truth, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 133, 23, 15, 'come to a godly life. It says in 1 Timothy 3:16 that God was manifest in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 133, 24, 15, 'the flesh. That is the secret of godliness. The secret of godliness is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 133, 25, 15, 'that He came and was pure in His spirit. How can a man live in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 133, 26, 15, 'flesh and be pure in his spirit? Jesus demonstrated how. So, it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 133, 27, 15, 'possible for us to live a life of victory even though we have this flesh');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 133, 28, 15, 'because the power of the Holy Spirit is greater than the power of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 134, 1, 15, 'flesh.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 134, 2, 15, 'You know in the Old Testament, there was a time when the children of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 134, 3, 15, 'Israel reached the borders of the land of Canaan and the Lord said, “Go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 134, 4, 15, 'into the land and occupy the land”, but they looked at the giants and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 134, 5, 15, 'they said, “No, we can''t overcome. These people are so mighty and so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 134, 6, 15, 'powerful.” The Lord told them to can go in and they said, “No that''s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 134, 7, 15, 'possible.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 134, 8, 15, 'Only two people, Joshua and Caleb said we can do it and they are the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 134, 9, 15, 'only ones who went in. Was it because their muscles were stronger? No,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 134, 10, 15, 'they trusted in God. That''s why they possessed the land. You can look at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 134, 11, 15, 'some sin in your life and the devil says you can never overcome that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 134, 12, 15, 'It''s like a giant in your life. Now it''s a question of whether you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 134, 13, 15, 'follow the Israelites and say, “We can''t overcome these giants; they''ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 134, 14, 15, 'always rule us” or whether you follow Joshua and Caleb’s example and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 134, 15, 15, 'say, “We can overcome.” That’s the message of the Bible. You can be an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 134, 16, 15, 'overcomer. You don''t have to be defeated. Jesus was an overcomer, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 134, 17, 15, 'lived on earth and demonstrated how we can overcome but if you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 134, 18, 15, 'follow His example in the way He sought to live an overcoming life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 134, 19, 15, 'you''ll never get there. Notice for example in Hebrews 5:7, what it says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 134, 20, 15, 'about Jesus. In the days when He was on this earth in the flesh, it says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 134, 21, 15, 'He prayed with loud crying and tears. This is not referring to the one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 134, 22, 15, 'day when He was in Gethsemane. No, in the days of His flesh means in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 134, 23, 15, 'days when He lived on this earth for 33-1/2 years. What did He do? He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 134, 24, 15, 'prayed with loud crying and tears to be saved from death. Now there are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 134, 25, 15, 'two types of death the Bible speaks of the New Testament; physical death');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 134, 26, 15, 'and spiritual death. Which of these two deaths was Jesus praying to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 134, 27, 15, 'saved from? Certainly not physical death. Even the martyrs didn''t pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 134, 28, 15, 'to be saved from that. The only death Jesus was afraid of and didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 135, 1, 15, 'want was spiritual death. He prayed, “Father, don''t let spiritual death');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 135, 2, 15, 'touch Me. Let there be no smell of spiritual death in me.” In other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 135, 3, 15, 'words, there should be no smell of sin in my life. When I''m tempted, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 135, 4, 15, 'must come out of temptation without even the smell of sin or spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 135, 5, 15, 'death and He was heard. The Bible says He was heard which proves it was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 135, 6, 15, 'not physical death because He died of physical death, not spiritual. So,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 135, 7, 15, 'we see that Jesus overcame by crying out to the Father. He recognized');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 135, 8, 15, 'that His flesh was weak and so He cried out for help from the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 135, 9, 15, 'Spirit and He overcame. You can overcome - if you will trust in the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 135, 10, 15, 'and cry out for salvation from the power of sin like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 135, 11, 16, 'Chapter 16 Why Satan Was Not Destroyed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 135, 12, 16, 'In our last study, we were looking at how Satan became Satan and how he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 135, 13, 16, 'was cast down from God''s presence because of rebellion, pride and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 135, 14, 16, 'discontentment. It was when that happened that the earth became like it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 135, 15, 16, 'is described in Genesis 1:2 which was originally created perfect in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 135, 16, 16, 'Genesis 1:1. Everything God creates is perfect in the beginning. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 135, 17, 16, 'created the heaven and earth as it says in Genesis 1:1. The next words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 135, 18, 16, 'say the earth was formless without shape, empty and dark. God never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 135, 19, 16, 'creates anything shapeless, empty and dark so it''s very clear that it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 135, 20, 16, 'became like that and it was because of Satan''s fall. We know when Adam');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 135, 21, 16, 'fell, there were so many results of that on the perfect earth in which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 135, 22, 16, 'he lived. For example, the animals became wild. Similarly, the earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 135, 23, 16, 'became formless without shape, empty and dark when Satan fell. The earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 135, 24, 16, 'and heaven were probably created long ago. It could be even millions of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 135, 25, 16, 'years before Adam, but we don''t know. Adam himself existed probably only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 135, 26, 16, 'six thousand years ago but the earth itself, the heaven and earth were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 135, 27, 16, 'created long before that. We don''t know how many years were there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 135, 28, 16, 'between Genesis 1:1 and Genesis 1:2 but when Satan fell, the earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 136, 1, 16, 'became like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 136, 2, 16, 'Now we could ask ourselves a question as to why God didn’t destroy Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 136, 3, 16, 'at that point so that he would cease to exist. As far as we know, when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 136, 4, 16, 'Satan fell and was cast down, a number of the angels also apparently');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 136, 5, 16, 'joined him in that rebellion against God. We don''t know the exact');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 136, 6, 16, 'details about this, but we could get a little picture of this without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 136, 7, 16, 'being dogmatic about it when we read in Revelation 12 that the great red');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 136, 8, 16, 'dragon, the devil swept away one-third of all the stars of heaven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 136, 9, 16, '(Revelation 12:4). In the book of Job, the angels are called stars. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 136, 10, 16, 'symbolic language, when the dragon sweeps away one-third of the stars');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 136, 11, 16, 'down from heaven, it''s referring probably to the angels who joined him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 136, 12, 16, 'in his rebellion and who are today the demons that are roaming around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 136, 13, 16, 'the earth and that sometimes possess human beings. Now it''s very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 136, 14, 16, 'important to know that the devil was not cast down to earth. He was cast');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 136, 15, 16, 'down from the third heaven, the immediate presence of God. In 2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 136, 16, 16, 'Corinthians 12, we read of three heavens. Paul says he was caught up to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 136, 17, 16, 'the third heaven. In the Psalms, we read of the heavens being the work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 136, 18, 16, 'of God''s fingers and that refers to the visible universe. So that''s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 136, 19, 16, 'first heaven and God''s throne is in the third heaven. There must be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 136, 20, 16, 'second heaven in between and we presume that is where the devil was cast');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 136, 21, 16, 'down because we read in the book of Job that he could talk to God from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 136, 22, 16, 'there. He couldn''t go back to the third heaven, but from the second');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 136, 23, 16, 'heaven he could speak to God. He is called also in Ephesians 6, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 136, 24, 16, 'principalities and powers in the heavenly places. We read in Ephesians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 136, 25, 16, '6:12 about the devil and his demons and he is called the prince of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 136, 26, 16, 'power of the air and his dwelling is said to be in the heavenly places.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 136, 27, 16, 'Obviously not in the third heaven, but it must be in the second heaven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 136, 28, 16, 'and there we are in spiritual conflict with him. When we seek to commune');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 137, 1, 16, 'with God, it''s through the second heaven and there''s a lot of resistance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 137, 2, 16, 'to prayer and praise. So here we see that the devil is being cast out to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 137, 3, 16, 'the second heaven and in the book of Revelation, we read of a time when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 137, 4, 16, 'he''s thrown down from the second heaven to the earth in Revelation 12');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 137, 5, 16, 'and then finally from the earth in Revelation 22 to the bottomless pit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 137, 6, 16, 'for a thousand years and then pulled out of the bottomless pit and cast');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 137, 7, 16, 'into the lake of fire in Revelation 20. So that''s just by the way, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 137, 8, 16, 'history of the geographical location of Satan. When people say that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 137, 9, 16, 'Satan is in hell, it''s not true. He is never in hell; he was cast down');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 137, 10, 16, 'from the third heaven to the second heaven. One day, he will be cast');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 137, 11, 16, 'down from there to the earth and one day from the earth to a bottomless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 137, 12, 16, 'pit and then pulled out of the bottomless pit and thrown into the lake');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 137, 13, 16, 'of fire where hell will also be cast into one day. That''s just a brief');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 137, 14, 16, 'history of Satan.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 137, 15, 16, 'Why did God not destroy Satan and the demons who rebelled right at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 137, 16, 16, 'outset? Now we don''t understand fully all the reasons why God does many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 137, 17, 16, 'things and we must be humble enough to acknowledge that our limited');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 137, 18, 16, 'understanding and our mind is incapable of answering many questions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 137, 19, 16, 'about life on this earth. Why do babies get AIDS? Why is there so much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 137, 20, 16, 'poverty? Why is there so much injustice? Why do poor innocent girls get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 137, 21, 16, 'raped all over the world? Why does God allow evil dictators to live so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 137, 22, 16, 'long? Why has God allowed so many false religions to lead people astray?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 137, 23, 16, 'Why has God allowed cults to come up to separate children from parents');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 137, 24, 16, 'and make life miserable for so many? There are thousands of questions to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 137, 25, 16, 'which we don''t know the full answer and the reason for that is that our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 137, 26, 16, 'mind has got a very limited capacity. God''s wisdom is like an ocean and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 137, 27, 16, 'you can''t pour an ocean into a cup. A cup can contain only a little bit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 137, 28, 16, 'of the water in the ocean and so our mind can contain only a little bit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 138, 1, 16, 'of God''s wisdom. Everything that we need to know concerning life on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 138, 2, 16, 'earth and how to live a godly life has clearly been revealed by God but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 138, 3, 16, 'beyond that there are so many questions concerning which we don''t know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 138, 4, 16, 'the final answer. This is one of those things we don''t know the complete');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 138, 5, 16, 'answer as to why God didn''t destroy the devil. One thing we know is God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 138, 6, 16, 'allows everything to take place for the good of the maximum number of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 138, 7, 16, 'people to fulfill His purposes so there must have been some way in which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 138, 8, 16, 'God decided that now that the devil has rebelled, He is going to use');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 138, 9, 16, 'this rebellious person to fulfill His purposes. There is a greater glory');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 138, 10, 16, 'when God uses a rebel and an enemy to fulfill His purposes then when He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 138, 11, 16, 'uses a submissive son of His.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 138, 12, 16, 'There is a lovely verse quoted in Romans 9 which is actually a quotation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 138, 13, 16, 'from Exodus. In Romans 9:17, it says, “The scripture says to Pharaoh,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 138, 14, 16, '‘For this very purpose, I raised you up to demonstrate my power in you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 138, 15, 16, 'that My name might be proclaimed throughout the whole earth.’” Now one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 138, 16, 16, 'would have thought that God would have said that to somebody like Moses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 138, 17, 16, 'but here we read that these are words that the Lord told Pharaoh. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 138, 18, 16, 'a quotation from Exodus 9:16 where the Lord told Pharaoh, “You have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 138, 19, 16, 'rebelled against me. You are proud you''re exactly like the devil and I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 138, 20, 16, 'going to use you to manifest My power.” Whatever Pharaoh did, God turned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 138, 21, 16, 'the tables on him and protected the Israelites who were slaves in Egypt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 138, 22, 16, 'and so there’s a glory that comes to God when His enemy accomplishes His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 138, 23, 16, 'purposes. So that''s the reason why God has allowed Satan to exist. I''ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 138, 24, 16, 'give you one example of that from the New Testament where we read of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 138, 25, 16, 'Apostle Paul who had such tremendous revelations. He was caught up to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 138, 26, 16, 'the third heaven and there was a great danger that he would become proud');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 138, 27, 16, 'of his accomplishments. He had done a great work for God on the earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 138, 28, 16, 'and he had all these revelations and to protect him from pride, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 139, 1, 16, 'allowed the devil to trouble Paul in some way by giving him a thorn in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 139, 2, 16, 'the flesh which Paul himself calls a messenger of Satan. Now if the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 139, 3, 16, 'devil were not there, who would give Paul that thorn in the flesh and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 139, 4, 16, 'did that thorn in the flesh accomplish something good? it certainly did!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 139, 5, 16, 'It was a messenger of Satan meant to trouble Paul and that would make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 139, 6, 16, 'Paul cling to God and would keep him humble and dependent on God. So,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 139, 7, 16, 'you see there in 2 Corinthians 12 a way in which we could say God used');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 139, 8, 16, 'Satan to keep His servant Paul humble which is a very good thing. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 139, 9, 16, 'gives his grace only to the humble and He resists the proud. If Paul');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 139, 10, 16, 'become proud, God would have had to resist him, but Paul remained humble');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 139, 11, 16, 'because of the messenger of Satan. Satan troubled him with a thorn in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 139, 12, 16, 'the flesh, so Paul remained humble. This is an example of how God used');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 139, 13, 16, 'the devil to keep Paul humble. We have another example in the book of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 139, 14, 16, 'Job where God allowed Satan to harass Job by destroying all his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 139, 15, 16, 'property, killing his children and nagging him through his wife');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 139, 16, 16, 'irritating him and even through three preachers. The devil used so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 139, 17, 16, 'agents to trouble Job. It wasn''t just the loss of property and children.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 139, 18, 16, 'Notice in Job 2, the devil used Job’s wife to harass him and then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 139, 19, 16, 'throughout that book, the devil used at least three preachers to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 139, 20, 16, 'irritate Job and accuse him and charge him with so many things which are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 139, 21, 16, 'not true. The devil is an accuser and he sometimes use preachers to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 139, 22, 16, 'accuse others but through it all, we can say it was like a fire in which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 139, 23, 16, 'Job was put in and he came out of it a pure a man. He came out a humbler');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 139, 24, 16, 'man because Job also had the same problem that Paul was in danger of.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 139, 25, 16, 'Job was such an upright, righteous man and he was a rich man. He also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 139, 26, 16, 'brought up all his ten children in a very good way that he became proud.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 139, 27, 16, 'We know whenever a man accomplishes something like that and he''s better');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 139, 28, 16, 'than the people around him, he tends to be proud and Job was proud of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 140, 1, 16, 'his righteousness. God wanted Job to become more perfect and one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 140, 2, 16, 'requirement that he needed was humility. He needed humility and the only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 140, 3, 16, 'way to bring Job to humility was by allowing Satan to trouble him and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 140, 4, 16, 'harass him just like God allowed Satan to trouble Paul to make him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 140, 5, 16, 'humble. So Job was harassed by the devil in so many ways and the end');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 140, 6, 16, 'result was that by the end of the book, you find Job is still a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 140, 7, 16, 'righteous man and still a perfect man but in addition he gets another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 140, 8, 16, 'quality in his character which he didn''t have when he started out and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 140, 9, 16, 'that was humility. He says in Job 40:4, “I am insignificant” and then he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 140, 10, 16, 'says in chapter 42, “I repent, and I’ll never open my mouth again. Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 140, 11, 16, 'I put my hand on my mouth because I''m a nobody.” Who accomplished that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 140, 12, 16, 'work in Job? the devil. There we have examples of how God allows the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 140, 13, 16, 'devil to harass, trouble, irritate and thereby makes His servants');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 140, 14, 16, 'better.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 140, 15, 16, 'We find that even the temptations the devil uses to bring to God’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 140, 16, 16, 'children makes them stronger. Even Jesus was tempted by Satan and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 140, 17, 16, 'through those temptations, God proves and tests us to see whether we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 140, 18, 16, 'qualify for His service. The Bible says in the last days, there is going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 140, 19, 16, 'to be a flood of deceiving spirits that are going to come upon this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 140, 20, 16, 'earth. Now God could stop them, but He doesn’t. Why doesn''t He stop');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 140, 21, 16, 'these deceiving spirits from coming into the midst of the church and in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 140, 22, 16, 'the midst of the world? Because it''s through these deceiving spirits');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 140, 23, 16, 'that God is going to test many people including His own children to see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 140, 24, 16, 'what they are really seeking for. Think of the story in the Garden of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 140, 25, 16, 'Eden. God could have stopped Satan from coming into that garden very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 140, 26, 16, 'easily, but He didn''t because Satan came in. When Adam and Eve were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 140, 27, 16, 'tested, it was Satan who came and invited Eve to take part of that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 140, 28, 16, 'forbidden tree. If he were not there, it''s possible that Adam and Eve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 141, 1, 16, 'may have just gone past it but because Satan came through the snake and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 141, 2, 16, 'put certain suggestions into Eve''s mind and made her doubt God''s love.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 141, 3, 16, 'That''s what made her finally fall and eat of that tree. God didn’t stop');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 141, 4, 16, 'Satan because He wanted Adam and Eve to be tested because man cannot be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 141, 5, 16, 'holy without being tested and choosing God above created thing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 141, 6, 16, 'We can only go by scripture, but here are some examples that show us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 141, 7, 16, 'that God uses Satan to accomplish His purposes and He turns the tables');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 141, 8, 16, 'on Satan. We see examples of that throughout Scripture. For example,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 141, 9, 16, 'when Joseph was ill-treated by his own brothers and they wanted to sell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 141, 10, 16, 'him off to Egypt. They were inspired by the devil without a doubt to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 141, 11, 16, 'sell him to these Ishmaelite traders and send him off to Egypt so they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 141, 12, 16, 'will never see him again. That was the work of the devil. The devil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 141, 13, 16, 'doesn''t know the future, so he doesn''t know what he''s doing when he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 141, 14, 16, 'sends Joseph to Egypt. He doesn''t realize that that is only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 141, 15, 16, 'accomplishing God''s purpose because God wanted Joseph to be the ruler in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 141, 16, 16, 'Egypt next to Pharaoh, but He uses the devil to use Joseph''s brothers to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 141, 17, 16, 'send him to Egypt. Another interesting part of the story is when Joseph');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 141, 18, 16, 'goes to Egypt and works in the house of a man called Potiphar. The devil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 141, 19, 16, 'uses Potiphar’s wife to tempt Joseph and Joseph refuses to yield and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 141, 20, 16, 'thereby he manifests his integrity. He is tested and he overcomes, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 141, 21, 16, 'he becomes stronger. Every time you pass a test, you become stronger.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 141, 22, 16, 'Joseph became stronger when the devil tempted him every day through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 141, 23, 16, 'Potiphar’s wife. He refused to yield, and he became a strong person and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 141, 24, 16, 'then the devil accused Joseph falsely through Potiphar''s wife. She told');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 141, 25, 16, 'a lie to her husband and the devil succeeds in putting Joseph in a jail.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 141, 26, 16, 'It''s there in the jail that he meets Pharaoh''s butler and thus gets an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 141, 27, 16, 'opportunity to come before Pharaoh. He wouldn''t have met Pharaoh''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 141, 28, 16, 'butler if he hadn''t gone to that jail. Who put him in the jail? The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 142, 1, 16, 'devil. What did it accomplish? God''s purposes. He finally got contact');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 142, 2, 16, 'with Pharaoh''s butler and through that to Pharaoh and became the second');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 142, 3, 16, 'ruler in Egypt. Whatever the devil did to Joseph, whether it''s through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 142, 4, 16, 'his brothers or through that evil woman, Potiphar''s wife, it only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 142, 5, 16, 'succeeded in fulfilling God''s purpose. We can say in that example that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 142, 6, 16, 'God turned the tables on Satan.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 142, 7, 16, 'You see another example in the book of Esther where Satan inspires a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 142, 8, 16, 'called Haman and his wife to kill all the Jews and to turn against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 142, 9, 16, 'Mordecai who is one of the prominent Jews. As you read that story, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 142, 10, 16, 'find how God turned the tables on Satan. Haman made a huge gallow which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 142, 11, 16, 'is more than 70 feet high in order to hang Mordecai. You only need a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 142, 12, 16, 'gallows ten feet high to hang a man. Why did he make one 70 feet high?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 142, 13, 16, 'What a nuisance it must have been to build such a huge gallow, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 142, 14, 16, 'height of a seven-story building. He wanted the whole nation to see this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 142, 15, 16, 'guy hanging here to humiliate him. At the end of the story, you find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 142, 16, 16, 'Haman himself is hanging on it. What a classic example of the God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 142, 17, 16, 'turning the tables on the devil. God is glorified when His people see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 142, 18, 16, 'how all the efforts of Satan are frustrated. We find that again and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 142, 19, 16, 'again. The Bible is full of stories from Genesis to Revelation of how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 142, 20, 16, 'God uses Satan to fulfill His purposes and how God turns the tables upon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 142, 21, 16, 'Satan and frustrates his purposes and even more after Jesus died on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 142, 22, 16, 'cross of Calvary. Satan has been defeated completely on the cross.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 142, 23, 16, 'Satan’s armor has been taken away and he has got no power over any of us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 142, 24, 16, '(Colossians 2:15). We see here that now our position is even more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 142, 25, 16, 'blessed than Joseph, Job and Mordecai. We come to the position that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 142, 26, 16, 'Jesus was in— one of total triumph when Satan was defeated on the cross.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 142, 27, 16, 'We read in Colossians 2:15 that God took away from Satan all his armor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 142, 28, 16, 'when Christ died on the cross. One of the most important truths that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 143, 1, 16, 'need to recognize is that Satan was defeated completely on the cross of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 143, 2, 16, 'Calvary when Jesus died. Just like all Christians know that Christ died');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 143, 3, 16, 'to take away all our sins on the cross but even more, it is also equally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 143, 4, 16, 'true that He took away Satan''s armor on the cross so that Satan has no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 143, 5, 16, 'weapons to fight against us now.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 143, 6, 16, 'That''s why today the Bible says in James 4:7 to submit to God and resist');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 143, 7, 16, 'the devil and he will flee from you. There is no such verse in the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 143, 8, 16, 'Testament. No matter how much you submitted to God in the Old Testament,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 143, 9, 16, 'you couldn''t resist the devil and make him flee. That’s why God never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 143, 10, 16, 'gave such a command to His people. People could resist the Philistines');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 143, 11, 16, 'and make them flee or resist the Moabites, the Amorites, or the Hittites');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 143, 12, 16, 'and make them flee but they could not make the devil flee in the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 143, 13, 16, 'Testament. Now that Jesus Christ has defeated Satan on the cross, we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 143, 14, 16, 'commanded to resist the devil in the name of Jesus Christ, and he will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 143, 15, 16, 'flee. Now many Christians have a picture of themselves running away from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 143, 16, 16, 'the devil and somehow escaping his grip. This is not the picture that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 143, 17, 16, 'see in the New Testament. In the New Testament, we see the devil running');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 143, 18, 16, 'away from us and that''s the picture that we need to have in our mind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 143, 19, 16, 'always. This is the position of the born-again believer; one of victory');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 143, 20, 16, 'and one of authority. Satan has to obey a command given to him in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 143, 21, 16, 'name of Jesus Christ. Every demon has to obey a command given in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 143, 22, 16, 'name of Jesus Christ because they''ve all been defeated on the cross of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 143, 23, 16, 'Calvary. Every demon has been defeated and that''s why the Apostles or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 143, 24, 16, 'even any believer today can command a demon-possessed person in the name');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 143, 25, 16, 'of Jesus to leave and the demon has to leave the person. This applies to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 143, 26, 16, 'anybody who is possessed, it''s not a question of how spiritual you are.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 143, 27, 16, 'It''s a question of whether you use the authority of the name of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 143, 28, 16, 'Christ or not. It''s like you can have ten massive trucks coming down a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 144, 1, 16, 'road and one little policeman stands up and holds his hand and all those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 144, 2, 16, 'ten trucks stop. That policeman represents the authority of the state.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 144, 3, 16, 'He may be a small man, but it doesn''t make a difference. It is in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 144, 4, 16, 'authority that God has given us through Jesus Christ over Satan and over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 144, 5, 16, 'all his power and it''s important for us to exercise it. We need not live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 144, 6, 16, 'in fear of the devil anymore. The devil can try so many things. Through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 144, 7, 16, 'the years, he''s sought to harass Christians in so many ways but he''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 144, 8, 16, 'defeated foe and everything that he does; whether persecution or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 144, 9, 16, 'deception or anything is only going to further God''s purposes for man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 144, 10, 16, 'The Bible says the devil comes like a lion trying to harass and frighten');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 144, 11, 16, 'and persecute Christians. Most of the time, he doesn''t succeed because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 144, 12, 16, 'persecution leads to the church flourishing and numbers increasing, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 144, 13, 16, 'believers becoming more spiritual. He also comes as a serpent deceiving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 144, 14, 16, 'and there very often, he succeeds but even that we can be overcome');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 144, 15, 16, 'because whether persecution or deception, the devil''s power and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 144, 16, 16, 'authority have been taken away from him completely on the cross and we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 144, 17, 16, 'must take our stand on that always. Jesus Christ defeated Satan on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 144, 18, 16, 'cross and he has no authority over us anymore.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 144, 19, 17, 'Chapter 17 Transformation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 144, 20, 17, 'In the well-known Sermon on the Mount which we read in Matthew 5-7,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 144, 21, 17, 'Jesus concluded with these words in Matthew 7:15. He spoke about the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 144, 22, 17, 'gate that led to life being small and the way that led to life being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 144, 23, 17, 'narrow. A gate is something you enter in a moment and the way is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 144, 24, 17, 'something that we have to walk right through our life but at the end of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 144, 25, 17, 'the way is our destination. We considered in our last study about God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 144, 26, 17, 'having predestined us not to go to heaven but to become like Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 144, 27, 17, 'Christ. Predestination means a destination determined beforehand. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 144, 28, 17, 'like when you get into a train or a plane, your ticket shows you your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 145, 1, 17, 'destination. You have a destination marked on your ticket and the train');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 145, 2, 17, 'or the plane may make many stops on the way and some of those places may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 145, 3, 17, 'be interesting places along the way, but you still don''t get out because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 145, 4, 17, 'you have a destination you want to reach. Anyone who gets onto a train');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 145, 5, 17, 'or a plane would be very eager to reach his destination very soon. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 145, 6, 17, 'can see that in the impatience in passengers when a train or plane is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 145, 7, 17, 'delayed. Why is that? Everybody wants to get to their destination as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 145, 8, 17, 'soon as possible and if everybody could afford traveling by plane, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 145, 9, 17, 'would all travel by plane because you get to your destination much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 145, 10, 17, 'quicker.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 145, 11, 17, 'It’s very rare to find Christians who are very eager to get to their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 145, 12, 17, 'destination of becoming like Christ quickly. That possibly indicates');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 145, 13, 17, 'that they don''t know what their destination is, which is true of many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 145, 14, 17, 'Christians. If you ask most Christians, I would say 99% of them would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 145, 15, 17, 'probably tell you that their destination is heaven and yet there''s not a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 145, 16, 17, 'verse in scripture that makes such a statement. The destination');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 145, 17, 17, 'determined by God is likeness to Christ. Heaven is a byproduct of that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 145, 18, 17, 'It''s not a physical geographical place that God is interested in taking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 145, 19, 17, 'us to, but a transformed character. That''s what God is taking us to and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 145, 20, 17, 'if we haven''t seen this, we haven''t seen the goal of the Christian life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 145, 21, 17, 'It also means we haven''t seen the full purpose with which Christ came to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 145, 22, 17, 'earth. He did not come as many Christians think to save us from hell and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 145, 23, 17, 'to take us to heaven like many preachers preach. He came to save us from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 145, 24, 17, 'sin and all of Adam''s nature describes sin. He came to make us holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 145, 25, 17, 'which is to make us like Himself. We saw that in an earlier study, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 145, 26, 17, 'first promise in the New Testament is, “His name shall be called Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 145, 27, 17, 'because He will save His people not from Hell, not from sickness, not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 145, 28, 17, 'from poverty, but from sin.” The Christian gospel has turned from that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 146, 1, 17, 'first promise in Matthew 1:21 into something which looks good like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 146, 2, 17, 'salvation from hell, salvation from sickness, salvation from poverty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 146, 3, 17, 'etc. Salvation from being illiterate perhaps, salvation from being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 146, 4, 17, 'ignorant and many other things but the true gospel is that Jesus came to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 146, 5, 17, 'save us from sin and to make us like Himself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 146, 6, 17, 'Our starting point was in sin and we come to Christ through the narrow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 146, 7, 17, 'gate which is to be born again to become a new creature in Christ. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 146, 8, 17, 'can''t enter into the way without going through the gate. Jesus said that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 146, 9, 17, 'He is the door in John 10:7. He said if anyone tries to enter by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 146, 10, 17, 'climbing up some other way is a thief and a robber (John 10:1). He says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 146, 11, 17, 'in John 10:9, “I am the door. If anyone enters through Me, he''ll be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 146, 12, 17, 'saved, and he will come in go in and out and find pasture”. If anyone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 146, 13, 17, 'tries to come some other way or tries to join the way without going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 146, 14, 17, 'through the door, he''s going to be disqualified. You can''t enter a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 146, 15, 17, 'marathon race somewhere along the way. You got to start it at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 146, 16, 17, 'starting line. You can run along with the marathon runners on the road');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 146, 17, 17, 'if you want but when you reach the end, you''ll be disqualified because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 146, 18, 17, 'you never came to the starting line. The Christian life has got a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 146, 19, 17, 'starting point like every race. The Christian life is called a race in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 146, 20, 17, 'Hebrews 12:1-2 and that starting point is not being born into a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 146, 21, 17, 'Christian family nor is it being baptized or christened in water. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 146, 22, 17, 'being born again like Jesus told Nicodemus who was a bishop. Even a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 146, 23, 17, 'bishop needs to be born again. He told Nicodemus in John 3 that unless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 146, 24, 17, 'you''re born again, you cannot enter the kingdom of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 146, 25, 17, 'The new birth is becoming a new creature where Christ cuts us off from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 146, 26, 17, 'that Adamic tree and grafts us into Himself. That is the new birth where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 146, 27, 17, 'we are grafted into Christ. This represents us coming through the gate,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 146, 28, 17, 'but there is a long way that leads to our final destination of becoming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 147, 1, 17, 'totally like Christ. That long narrow way is called a way of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 147, 2, 17, 'sanctification— becoming more and more like Christ and being separated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 147, 3, 17, 'more and more from this Adamic nature which we carry around with us. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 147, 4, 17, 'Bible calls it the flesh and that is just another word for our Adamic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 147, 5, 17, 'nature which makes us behave like all the other unbelievers in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 147, 6, 17, 'world. Christ came to deliver us from that and to save us from sin and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 147, 7, 17, 'to make us like Himself. The way He does it is through the Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 147, 8, 17, 'In the Old Testament, He gave the people a law to try and live according');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 147, 9, 17, 'to, but nobody could make it. They could keep some of the commandments');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 147, 10, 17, 'but not all of them. and even if they did keep all the commands, it was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 147, 11, 17, 'still only external. They couldn''t do anything about the corrupt nature');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 147, 12, 17, 'within their own hearts no matter how much they tried. Paul, who was one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 147, 13, 17, 'of the finest of the people in Israel, a God-fearing man who said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 147, 14, 17, 'according to the righteousness in the law, he was absolutely blameless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 147, 15, 17, '(Philippians 3:6). That means according to the external requirements of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 147, 16, 17, 'the law, he had kept everything just like the rich young ruler who came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 147, 17, 17, 'to Jesus (Mark 10:20). When Jesus told him the commandments, he said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 147, 18, 17, 'I''ve kept all of them for my youth and Jesus didn''t challenge that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 147, 19, 17, 'There were many God-fearing people in Jesus time among the Jewish people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 147, 20, 17, 'who had kept all the commandments externally. They had kept the law and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 147, 21, 17, 'according to the righteous requirement of the law, they were absolutely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 147, 22, 17, 'without blame, but they did not have an atom of God''s nature, it was all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 147, 23, 17, 'external refinement.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 147, 24, 17, 'Jesus said, “You have cleaned the outside of the cup, but the inside is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 147, 25, 17, 'dirty, and you don''t care about that.” Christ came to clean the inside.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 147, 26, 17, 'When the inside is clean, the outside automatically takes care of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 147, 27, 17, 'itself. It''s like when the disease is hit at the root with an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 147, 28, 17, 'antibiotic, the external manifestation of that disease disappears.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 148, 1, 17, 'Whatever that disease, whether it''s in the form of a fever or a sore or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 148, 2, 17, 'anything, when the root of it is hit with an antibiotic inside our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 148, 3, 17, 'system, the manifestation goes. Jesus came with an axe to the root.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 148, 4, 17, 'That''s what John the Baptist said. He didn''t come with a pair of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 148, 5, 17, 'scissors to snip off all the bad fruit that''s coming from our lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 148, 6, 17, 'Many people''s Christianity is just snipping off the bad fruit; looking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 148, 7, 17, 'nice before people, behaving in a nice, cultured, civilized way. There''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 148, 8, 17, 'a lot of difference between true Christianity and civilization. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 148, 9, 17, 'didn''t just come to make us nice people, He came to transform us and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 148, 10, 17, 'make us new creatures; completely new within, not just refined. There is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 148, 11, 17, 'a lot of difference between a refined, well behaved dog and a little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 148, 12, 17, 'baby who may not be refined or cultured and may mess up the floor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 148, 13, 17, 'There''s a world of difference there. That baby has the potential to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 148, 14, 17, 'become a man. The dog, no matter how much you refine will never be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 148, 15, 17, 'human being. In the same way, this old creation, the old man that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 148, 16, 17, 'were in Adam — that is the way we are all born. Any amount of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 148, 17, 17, 'refinement, cultural improvement can never change that person into a son');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 148, 18, 17, 'of God. It''s like saying you can try as hard as you like, you can''t make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 148, 19, 17, 'a dog into a human being. You can make it behave very well, obey very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 148, 20, 17, 'well but it will not become a human being. You can take a child of Adam');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 148, 21, 17, 'and teach it everything under the sun, make him religious but he will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 148, 22, 17, 'not become a child of God. That has to be a supernatural work within,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 148, 23, 17, 'where God brings this person to experience a spiritual birth within.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 148, 24, 17, 'That is called the narrow gate. Many people don''t come through this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 148, 25, 17, 'gate, they try to get into the narrow way around the side. They jump');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 148, 26, 17, 'over the wall like Jesus said and they will be disqualified at the end');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 148, 27, 17, 'because you cannot enter this way except through the gate. Once you come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 148, 28, 17, 'through the gate, the other mistake a lot of Christians make is they all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 149, 1, 17, 'congregate at the gate. There''s a big crowd of Christians, millions of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 149, 2, 17, 'them crowding around the gate when they should be walking the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 149, 3, 17, 'towards their destination and that is where we need to yield to the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 149, 4, 17, 'Spirit every single day of our life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 149, 5, 17, 'In 1 John 3:2, we read that when Christ comes, we will be like Him. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 149, 6, 17, 'would reach our destination. The last part of the verse says, “we know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 149, 7, 17, 'that when He appears, we shall be like Him because we shall see Him as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 149, 8, 17, 'He is.” The next verse goes on to say that this is the hope of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 149, 9, 17, 'Christian. Again, if you were to ask Christians what your hope is, 99%');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 149, 10, 17, 'of them would reply, “My hope is that Christ coming again.” But that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 149, 11, 17, 'only half of the whole. The other half is that when He comes again, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 149, 12, 17, 'will become like Him. That''s very important and in the next verse it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 149, 13, 17, 'says everyone who has this hope - not just the blessed hope of Christ''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 149, 14, 17, 'returning but also the hope of being like Him will purify himself (1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 149, 15, 17, 'John 3:3). If you have this hope, then during your entire earthly life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 149, 16, 17, 'you''ll be purifying yourself just as God is pure. Now a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 149, 17, 17, 'Christians because they haven''t read the Bible carefully, the only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 149, 18, 17, 'purification they know of is God cleansing them through the blood of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 149, 19, 17, 'Jesus Christ. The Bible speaks about two types of cleansing. One is what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 149, 20, 17, 'God does and the other is what we do ourselves. 1 John 1:7 says, “The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 149, 21, 17, 'blood of Jesus cleanses us from all sin.” That''s God''s work. 1 John 1:9');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 149, 22, 17, 'says, “He is faithful to cleanse us from all unrighteousness.” That also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 149, 23, 17, 'is God''s work, but 1 John 3:3 is speaking about us cleansing ourselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 149, 24, 17, 'You read that also in 2 Corinthians 7:1 where we are told that having');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 149, 25, 17, 'such wonderful promises, beloved, let us cleanse ourselves from all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 149, 26, 17, 'filthiness or defilement of flesh and spirit. Cleanse ourselves! The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 149, 27, 17, 'same thing we read in 2 Timothy 2:2, “If a man cleanses himself, he will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 149, 28, 17, 'be a vessel unto honor”. In these verses, you find two types of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 150, 1, 17, 'cleansing: what God does and what we got to do ourselves. God can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 150, 2, 17, 'trusted to do His part if we fulfill the conditions. If we confess our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 150, 3, 17, 'sins, He is faithful and just to cleanse us from all unrighteousness,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 150, 4, 17, 'forgive our sin, blotted out and never to remember it anymore (1 John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 150, 5, 17, '1:9, Hebrews 8:12). He also justifies us by the blood of Christ (Romans');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 150, 6, 17, '5:9). That means He declare us righteous and God will do that for us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 150, 7, 17, 'But what does this cleansing ourselves mean? This is the narrow way,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 150, 8, 17, 'this is the way of sanctification, this is the way of transformation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 150, 9, 17, 'into the likeness of Christ and it is progressive. The baptism in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 150, 10, 17, 'Holy Spirit is a crisis. It''s like entering through a gate but it must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 150, 11, 17, 'be something which must be renewed all the time. We need to be filled');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 150, 12, 17, 'with the Holy Spirit continuously. Ephesians 5:18 speaks to those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 150, 13, 17, 'are already baptized in the Holy Spirit and says be being filled with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 150, 14, 17, 'the Spirit or be being immersed in the Holy Spirit. Baptism just means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 150, 15, 17, 'immersion. We stand under the waterfall of the Spirit falling from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 150, 16, 17, 'heaven. I''m drenched, baptized in the Spirit but I need to live under');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 150, 17, 17, 'that waterfall continuously to experience this fullness of the Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 150, 18, 17, 'As my own capacity in my heart increases to experience more and more of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 150, 19, 17, 'the fullness of the Spirit in my life, thereby being conformed more and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 150, 20, 17, 'more into the likeness of Christ. I cannot change myself into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 150, 21, 17, 'likeness of Christ. It is the Holy Spirit''s job to make me like Christ,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 150, 22, 17, 'but I need to cooperate with Him by cleansing myself. That means when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 150, 23, 17, 'the Holy Spirit points out something in me which is displeasing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 150, 24, 17, 'Christ, I get rid of it. He''s not going to get rid of it for me. For');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 150, 25, 17, 'example, if you''re watching a television program which has got some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 150, 26, 17, 'impurity in it, some immorality, some scene which is defiling your mind,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 150, 27, 17, 'the Holy Spirit is not going to use the remote to change the channel.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 150, 28, 17, 'No. He wants you to do that. He will tell you this is not something that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 151, 1, 17, 'Christ would watch, but if you want to see that dirty movie, that''s up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 151, 2, 17, 'to you, but you''re not going to walk the narrow way and become like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 151, 3, 17, 'Christ if you continue watching that. You have to use the remote to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 151, 4, 17, 'change the channel. That''s just one example.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 151, 5, 17, 'You could be on the internet in a computer and you could be tempted to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 151, 6, 17, 'go to a site which is sexually provocative. The Holy Spirit won''t stop');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 151, 7, 17, 'you from clicking the mouse to go there. He will tell you that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 151, 8, 17, 'shouldn''t go there by prompting you in your spirit, but you have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 151, 9, 17, 'cleanse yourself. You have to refuse the temptation to sin in that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 151, 10, 17, 'moment. You have to say; “Lord I''m going to get rid of that habit from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 151, 11, 17, 'my life.” The Holy Spirit is testing you in all these situations to see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 151, 12, 17, 'whether you really want to be like Christ or not and when He sees that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 151, 13, 17, 'you''re really serious about wanting to be like Christ, He will transform');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 151, 14, 17, 'you. Let''s understand this clearly. Let me repeat it. You cannot conform');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 151, 15, 17, 'yourself into the likeness of Christ. You cannot produce the divine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 151, 16, 17, 'nature no matter how much you try. You try for a million years; you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 151, 17, 17, 'cannot produce even a little bit of the divine nature. The divine nature');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 151, 18, 17, 'is something God has to give you and impart to you, communicate to you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 151, 19, 17, 'but you got to remove the blockage in the channel which prevents Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 151, 20, 17, 'from communicating that nature to you. You got to get rid of that which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 151, 21, 17, 'is hindering God from giving you His nature. So that is the meaning of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 151, 22, 17, 'cleansing ourselves. I get rid of from my life that which the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 151, 23, 17, 'Spirit tells me to get rid of, not what people say. That''s why I don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 151, 24, 17, 'tell people to get rid of this and get rid of that, I will only suggest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 151, 25, 17, 'to them: Hey, this is harmful for you and there are certain things which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 151, 26, 17, 'a person may take time to see. For example, I may not wear any jewelry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 151, 27, 17, 'or ornaments. My wife and I don''t wear it, but I will not tell another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 151, 28, 17, 'person to do that because they may not have light on this. These are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 152, 1, 17, 'sinful things, there are things like this which I personally have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 152, 2, 17, 'conviction of, and I don''t want to do it. Paul once said in 1 Corinthian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 152, 3, 17, '6:12 that even among all the lawful things, he will not be mastered by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 152, 4, 17, 'them. There were lawful things that he wouldn’t do. A really spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 152, 5, 17, 'man does not only get rid of sinful things, he also gets rid of certain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 152, 6, 17, 'things that are lawful because they are a hindrance to his goal. In 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 152, 7, 17, 'Corinthians 9:24, Paul says about an athlete running a race to win.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 152, 8, 17, 'There are a lot of lawful things an athlete can eat but if he eats all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 152, 9, 17, 'of them, he''ll never win the prize. He has got to discipline himself in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 152, 10, 17, 'what he eats and what he doesn''t eat. An athlete can lawfully sleep till');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 152, 11, 17, '9 o''clock in the morning but if he doesn''t get up early morning to go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 152, 12, 17, 'for a run, he''s unlikely to win the medal. There are a lot of lawful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 152, 13, 17, 'things that an athlete gives up for the sake of getting a medal in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 152, 14, 17, 'Olympic Games. In the same way, when we speak about cleansing ourselves,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 152, 15, 17, 'it is not just from things that are sinful, it''s from things which don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 152, 16, 17, 'help me to win the crown and to press on and become like Christ. It may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 152, 17, 17, 'be lawful, and I don''t judge another person who does those things, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 152, 18, 17, 'uses those things, but I have decided not to use them, or to give them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 152, 19, 17, 'up, because I want to reach my goal sooner. When the Holy Spirit sees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 152, 20, 17, 'that we are serious about this, He will give us more and more grace to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 152, 21, 17, 'partake of the divine nature, and He does this by changing our way of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 152, 22, 17, 'thinking.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 152, 23, 17, 'We looked at this verse in Philippians 2:5 which says, “Let this mind be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 152, 24, 17, 'in you which was in Christ Jesus.” In Romans 12, we read these words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 152, 25, 17, 'concerning the mind. It''s very important to see the power of the mind,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 152, 26, 17, 'the function of the mind in the Christian life. Romans 12:2 says, “Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 152, 27, 17, 'not be conformed to this world but be transformed by the renewing of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 152, 28, 17, 'your mind.” Transformation takes place by the renewing of our mind.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 153, 1, 17, 'Conformity to the world also takes place within our mind. We got to read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 153, 2, 17, 'that verse like this: Don''t think like the world thinks in your mind,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 153, 3, 17, 'don''t let the world squeeze you into its shape and mold. That''s one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 153, 4, 17, 'paraphrase of that verse. Allow the Holy Spirit to change your way of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 153, 5, 17, 'thinking so that you begin to think like Christ thinks. You look at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 153, 6, 17, 'people, things, circumstances the way Christ looks at them. We see here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 153, 7, 17, 'this takes place in our mind first of all. In other words, the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 153, 8, 17, 'Spirit wants to change my way of thinking because before you can change');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 153, 9, 17, 'my character, you have to change my mind. That''s why the mind is so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 153, 10, 17, 'important. We must allow the Holy Spirit freedom to change our way of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 153, 11, 17, 'thinking, to change our value system. For example, in the world, money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 153, 12, 17, 'is considered perhaps the most important thing along with honor,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 153, 13, 17, 'position, power, popularity, pleasure and comfort. These are things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 153, 14, 17, 'which are considered of worth and very important in different degrees;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 153, 15, 17, 'worth giving up many things for in order to get them. Most people spend');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 153, 16, 17, 'their life in the pursuit of these things. But Jesus Christ did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 153, 17, 17, 'spend His life in the pursuit of money or pleasure or power or comfort');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 153, 18, 17, 'or ease or any such thing. He spent His life in the pursuit of doing the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 153, 19, 17, 'will of His Father and in that pursuit, He had to give up some of these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 153, 20, 17, 'things. In one place, it says that He didn''t even have time to eat food.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 153, 21, 17, 'Now is there anything wrong in eating food? No, but He didn''t have time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 153, 22, 17, 'for it because there was something more important, more pressing that He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 153, 23, 17, 'wanted to do. You find that the serious Christians, the one who wants');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 153, 24, 17, 'his mind to be conformed to the likeness of Christ will have a different');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 153, 25, 17, 'set of priorities to the worldly person or the worldly Christian who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 153, 26, 17, 'trying to get the best of both worlds.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 153, 27, 17, 'Most Christians I''ve met, are trying to get the best of both worlds and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 153, 28, 17, 'they''ve got their feet in two boats, and they never get anywhere. One');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 154, 1, 17, 'boat going in one direction, the other boat going in a different');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 154, 2, 17, 'direction and they''ve got their feet in two boats, and they never get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 154, 3, 17, 'anywhere; whereas Jesus Christ was completely set on doing the will of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 154, 4, 17, 'His Father. In Jesus’s earthly life, we find that the Father showed us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 154, 5, 17, 'how He wants man to live. If you want to know how He wanted Adam to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 154, 6, 17, 'live, here''s the answer— the way Jesus lived on the earth. Not in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 154, 7, 17, 'physical circumstances of the Garden of Eden, or Nazareth or in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 154, 8, 17, 'case, it may be Chennai or Trivandrum or Delhi wherever. It doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 154, 9, 17, 'matter. The physical location, circumstances are unimportant. It''s not a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 154, 10, 17, 'question of whether you travel by a scooter or a car or you walk like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 154, 11, 17, 'Jesus did. That''s not the point. It''s a question of a value system. What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 154, 12, 17, 'are the things that Jesus values? If the Holy Spirit can make me get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 154, 13, 17, 'Jesus’s value system, I''ll become a spiritual man. So that''s the meaning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 154, 14, 17, 'of the renewing of our mind where my mind begins to think like Jesus. My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 154, 15, 17, 'values in my mind are the values Jesus had in His life, and therefore I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 154, 16, 17, 'gradually become like Him. In the same way, worldliness is also in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 154, 17, 17, 'mind. A lot of people among Christians think that worldliness is in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 154, 18, 17, 'way you dress. A woman may be dressed very immodestly. The worldliness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 154, 19, 17, 'is not in a dress, it''s in her mind. It''s that way of thinking she has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 154, 20, 17, 'in her mind which makes her dress in an immodest way. You can change a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 154, 21, 17, 'dress, but you won''t stop her from being worldly just like that. You can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 154, 22, 17, 'dress up a dog in a suit and tie, but it is still a dog; it doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 154, 23, 17, 'change anything. You can compel a woman to dress modestly, it doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 154, 24, 17, 'change her way of thinking. Worldliness is in the mind just like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 154, 25, 17, 'sanctification begins in the mind. It''s very important for us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 154, 26, 17, 'understand this. Then we will open our beings and open our minds,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 154, 27, 17, 'especially to allow the Holy Spirit through God''s Word, as we read it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 154, 28, 17, 'to show us the nature of God and conform us to that likeness. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 155, 1, 17, 'should be your goal.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 155, 2, 18, 'Chapter 18 The Humanity Of Jesus Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 155, 3, 18, 'We have been considering in these sessions what God''s purpose for man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 155, 4, 18, 'really was when He created man. Progressively, we been looking at God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 155, 5, 18, 'purpose, God’s provision and now that man has fallen, how God made a way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 155, 6, 18, 'for man to be restored to that original purpose by sending Christ,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 155, 7, 18, 'giving us the Holy Spirit to dwell within. I have repeatedly stressed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 155, 8, 18, 'how a lot of people are missing out on God''s provision. Jesus said you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 155, 9, 18, 'will know the truth and the truth will set you free. If we don''t know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 155, 10, 18, 'the truth, we will remain in bondage. That is the condition of many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 155, 11, 18, 'Christians. Because they are ignorant, they are bound. I could say Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 155, 12, 18, 'is implying if you remain ignorant of the truth, you will remain in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 155, 13, 18, 'slavery and bound but if you know the truth, the truth will set you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 155, 14, 18, 'free. It will set you free from sin and free from all the hang-ups you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 155, 15, 18, 'have in your personality because of tragedies you faced in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 155, 16, 18, 'childhood or problems caused to you by others. You can be set free from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 155, 17, 18, 'everything. There is not a single problem in your life that God cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 155, 18, 18, 'solve. There is no hangover from the past that God cannot deal with.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 155, 19, 18, 'This is the wonderful message of the gospel. it doesn''t matter what your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 155, 20, 18, 'background is, where you came from, how you were brought up. God can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 155, 21, 18, 'solve everything and make you a glorious Christian and make you like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 155, 22, 18, 'Christ increasingly if you are willing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 155, 23, 18, 'Jesus once used these words in Matthew 11:29; He said, “Take my yoke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 155, 24, 18, 'upon you and learn from me for I am gentle and humble in heart.” Now in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 155, 25, 18, 'an earlier study, we saw the exhortation in Philippians 2:5 saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 155, 26, 18, '“Have this mind in you which was also in Christ Jesus.” Have this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 155, 27, 18, 'attitude in you which is in Christ. Now Jesus is saying the same thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 155, 28, 18, 'here. Learn from me, He says. Not just from a book. Do you know one big');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 156, 1, 18, 'difference between the Old Testament and the New Testament is this; that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 156, 2, 18, 'in the Old Testament, they only had a book. No man could stand up in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 156, 3, 18, 'Old Testament and say follow me, look at me, learn from me. But in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 156, 4, 18, 'New Testament, we don''t only have a book, we have a person. The person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 156, 5, 18, 'of Jesus Christ, dead and risen; and the Holy Spirit to show us what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 156, 6, 18, 'Christ is like and to make us like Him. Now which do you think is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 156, 7, 18, 'easier; to learn swimming on a blackboard or to learn swimming by a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 156, 8, 18, 'person jumping into the river and showing you what to do. You know the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 156, 9, 18, 'answer. From a book, you can have all the theory of swimming explained');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 156, 10, 18, 'there, but you never learn it. You still go and jump in the river and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 156, 11, 18, 'you will drown. But if you have a person who''s got into the river and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 156, 12, 18, 'says see what I''m doing and follow me, it is so much easier. That is one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 156, 13, 18, 'of the big differences between the Old Covenant and the New Covenant.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 156, 14, 18, 'The Old Covenant, they had the book of the law. In the New Covenant, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 156, 15, 18, 'have the word, not written down but the Word made flesh. When we look at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 156, 16, 18, 'the written word, our purpose is through the written word of Scripture');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 156, 17, 18, 'to see the Living Word, Jesus Christ Himself. He says, “Take my yoke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 156, 18, 18, 'upon you and learn of Me.” How can I learn from Christ? It''s not like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 156, 19, 18, 'you study chemistry or physics sitting in a classroom and listening to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 156, 20, 18, 'lecture. You can learn chemistry, mathematics, physics every subject in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 156, 21, 18, 'the world, you can learn by sitting in a classroom, but you can''t learn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 156, 22, 18, 'swimming sitting in a classroom. You can''t learn horse riding sitting in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 156, 23, 18, 'a classroom. You can''t learn to drive a car sitting in a classroom. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 156, 24, 18, 'needs hands-on experience and to become like Christ, to learn from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 156, 25, 18, 'Christ, you need experience in daily life. For that He says, “Take My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 156, 26, 18, 'yoke upon you.” Now in our villages, everybody knows what a yoke is. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 156, 27, 18, 'fields are plowed with two oxen plowing together with a yoke upon their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 156, 28, 18, 'necks and they pull the plough together and that''s how the field is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 157, 1, 18, 'plowed. When one of those bullocks dies and they get a new bullock; who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 157, 2, 18, 'doesn''t know head or tail about plowing, and doesn''t know how to plow a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 157, 3, 18, 'straight furrow, they yoke that new junior bullock with an experienced');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 157, 4, 18, 'senior bullock. The senior bullock tells the junior bullock, “Take my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 157, 5, 18, 'yoke upon you and learn from me. Just walk at the pace I''m walking. Walk');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 157, 6, 18, 'in the direction I''m walking, and, in a few weeks, you’ll be able to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 157, 7, 18, 'plow a straight furrow; you''d have learned from me.” It''s not a vocal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 157, 8, 18, 'communication like, do this or do that. It a hands-on experience and so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 157, 9, 18, 'when Jesus says take my yoke upon you, He''s saying come into a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 157, 10, 18, 'partnership with me, into a fellowship with me and let me teach you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 157, 11, 18, 'something. Learn from me, from My life, from the way I live, look at my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 157, 12, 18, 'earthly life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 157, 13, 18, 'How do I take this yoke? First of all, submit to the authority of Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 157, 14, 18, 'completely. In the Old Testament, to be under the yoke meant to be under');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 157, 15, 18, 'someone''s authority. We read in the Old Testament of the yoke of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 157, 16, 18, 'king of Babylon. The Israelites came under that yoke. Now Jesus invites');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 157, 17, 18, 'us to a very pleasant yoke because later on Matthew 11, He says, My yoke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 157, 18, 18, 'is easy, it''s very kind and pleasant type of yoke. It''s not a heavy yoke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 157, 19, 18, 'like the yoke of the king of Babylon on the Israelites. No, it''s an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 157, 20, 18, 'easy, pleasant yoke and my load is light. The Lord does not force us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 157, 21, 18, 'do something. Anything forced, if you do it even if it''s a good thing,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 157, 22, 18, 'becomes a dead work. In the Old Testament, they only had good works and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 157, 23, 18, 'evil works. In the New Testament, you read about good works, evil works');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 157, 24, 18, 'and dead works (Hebrews 6:1). In Hebrews 9:14, you read about dead works');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 157, 25, 18, 'and it says we got to repent of dead works. We must have dead works');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 157, 26, 18, 'cleansed in the blood of Christ. What are dead works? In a very simple');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 157, 27, 18, 'way, dead works are good works done with the wrong motive. I could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 157, 28, 18, 'preach. Is that a good work? Sure, but if I preach for money, it''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 158, 1, 18, 'dead work. I can sing a song in a church, but if it''s sung in order to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 158, 2, 18, 'get some honor for myself, it''s a dead work. I can give money for God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 158, 3, 18, 'work that''s a good thing. But if I give that money because I want to get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 158, 4, 18, 'some honor for myself or I want my name to be published somewhere, it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 158, 5, 18, 'a dead work immediately. My good work has become a dead work. Sinful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 158, 6, 18, 'works are already dead, but the great tragedy is where good works become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 158, 7, 18, 'dead works.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 158, 8, 18, 'You read about that even in the Old Testament. In the book of Exodus,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 158, 9, 18, 'the Lord spoke to Moses concerning the dress of Aaron. One of the things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 158, 10, 18, 'He said was that Aaron has got to have a plate on his forehead saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 158, 11, 18, '“Holy to the Lord” and the purpose of that was to take away the sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 158, 12, 18, 'there is in the Holy things that Israel consecrates (Exodus 28:38).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 158, 13, 18, 'There is sin in the Holy things and that is dead works. The meaning here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 158, 14, 18, 'is we don''t just mechanically do something written in scripture because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 158, 15, 18, 'it will be a dead work. You can take a verse of scripture and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 158, 16, 18, 'mechanically obey it and force other people to obey it mechanically');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 158, 17, 18, 'according to the letter of the law. 2 Corinthians 3:6 says the letter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 158, 18, 18, 'kills. You can follow the letter of Scripture and it will kill. You can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 158, 19, 18, 'take that letter of Scripture and preach it to other people in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 158, 20, 18, 'church, it''ll kill them. That''s not the way to learn. The way to learn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 158, 21, 18, 'is to take the yoke of Jesus upon us and to learn from Him, to look at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 158, 22, 18, 'His example. In 2 Corinthians 3:6, after it says that the letter kills,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 158, 23, 18, 'it says in contrast that the Holy Spirit gives life. How does the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 158, 24, 18, 'Spirit give life? By showing us when we read scripture, not a verse or a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 158, 25, 18, 'commandment, but the glory of Jesus Christ. In other words, when I look');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 158, 26, 18, 'at Scripture, I have to see Jesus there. With an unveiled face, I look');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 158, 27, 18, 'into this mirror of God’s word and what do I see there? I see the glory');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 158, 28, 18, 'of Jesus Christ there and little by little, the Holy Spirit changes me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 159, 1, 18, 'into that likeness (2 Corinthians 3:18). The whole purpose with which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 159, 2, 18, 'God has given us the scriptures is not just for us to follow the letter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 159, 3, 18, 'of the law. It will make you a Pharisee. The Pharisees who killed Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 159, 4, 18, 'Christ were people who followed the letter of the law and they kept on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 159, 5, 18, 'trying to fault with people. They would catch a woman in adultery and go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 159, 6, 18, 'to the letter of the law and want to stone her to death. Jesus would set');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 159, 7, 18, 'her free because they didn’t understand the heart of God. They kept the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 159, 8, 18, 'letter of the law and they wanted to punish and kill people whereas God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 159, 9, 18, 'was always interested in redeeming people. If God sees a man in sin, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 159, 10, 18, 'wants to save that man. When the Pharisees saw a man in sin, they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 159, 11, 18, 'considering which verse to use to put him out of the church. You find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 159, 12, 18, 'there are people like that even today. When they see a person in sin,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 159, 13, 18, 'they want to find which verse is there to condemn him but when God sees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 159, 14, 18, 'a man in sin, He wants to see how He can save him. So that’s an example');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 159, 15, 18, 'of how the letter kills but the Spirit gives life. You go to the letter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 159, 16, 18, 'of the law and you’ll find a verse to hit somebody on the head with,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 159, 17, 18, 'whereas if you go the Holy Spirit, He’ll show you the glory of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 159, 18, 18, 'there. If you want life, you’ve got to see Jesus right through Scripture');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 159, 19, 18, 'and say, “Lord, help me understand Your nature!”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 159, 20, 18, 'He says to us, “Learn from me, take my yoke upon you and learn from me.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 159, 21, 18, 'We are to look at the humility of Jesus Christ. The world can see the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 159, 22, 18, 'glory of God in creation, the stars, the planets and all the wonders');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 159, 23, 18, 'there are in the universe. To the disciple of Jesus, the glory of God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 159, 24, 18, 'not seen in creation primarily, but in the character and person of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 159, 25, 18, 'Christ in His humility and in the way He lived on this earth. When we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 159, 26, 18, 'think of the very fact that He did not consider equality with God as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 159, 27, 18, 'something to hold on to and grasped, but came down and became a man,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 159, 28, 18, 'that in itself is a tremendous step in humility! Just picture this; if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 160, 1, 18, 'you as a dignified human being want to help a worm, a wretched worm');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 160, 2, 18, 'crawling on the ground and you love that worm so much because it doesn’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 160, 3, 18, 'know how to conduct itself. If you go down as a man, that worm will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 160, 4, 18, 'terrified. So, you become a worm in order to communicate to that worm');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 160, 5, 18, 'and lead it to a higher life. This is a picture of what Jesus Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 160, 6, 18, 'did. The difference between God and man is much greater than the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 160, 7, 18, 'difference between man and a little worm that crawls on the ground. For');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 160, 8, 18, 'us to become a worm would be a tremendous step in humility if we wanted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 160, 9, 18, 'to help that worm. For God to become a man is a million times greater');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 160, 10, 18, 'step in humility. If we don''t see that, we have not seen the glory of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 160, 11, 18, 'Jesus Christ. This is why I''m against all these people who say that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 160, 12, 18, 'Jesus was a great prophet or a philosopher a religious leader. No, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 160, 13, 18, 'was not. He was the Son of God who came in human form. He was God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 160, 14, 18, 'manifest in the flesh. He was not just one of the many incarnations of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 160, 15, 18, 'God. No, He was the only incarnation of God on the face of this earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 160, 16, 18, 'If you say anything other than that, you robbed Him of His glory. He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 160, 17, 18, 'God manifest in the flesh and there we see His humility in the very fact');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 160, 18, 18, 'that He became a man. Even if He came to earth as an emperor to rule');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 160, 19, 18, 'this earth, that would have been humility. For God Almighty to come to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 160, 20, 18, 'this earth as an emperor would have been a fantastic step down but the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 160, 21, 18, 'wonderful thing is that when He came to earth, He did not choose to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 160, 22, 18, 'an emperor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 160, 23, 18, 'The wise men who came hearing of the birth of Jesus looked for Him in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 160, 24, 18, 'the wrong place. They followed the star and when they came to Jerusalem,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 160, 25, 18, 'decided not to follow the star anymore because they reasoned that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 160, 26, 18, 'king of the Jews should be born in a palace. (Matthew 2:1-2). They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 160, 27, 18, 'stopped following the star and that''s where those wise men became');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 160, 28, 18, 'foolish and they went to the palace to find where the king of the Jews');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 161, 1, 18, 'was born and the people in the palace did not have a clue that the king');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 161, 2, 18, 'of the Jews was even born. These people from way down in the east came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 161, 3, 18, 'looking for Him and the people who had the Bible they didn''t even know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 161, 4, 18, 'the King of the Jews was born. Then King Herod goes to the chief priests');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 161, 5, 18, 'and scribes to inquire of them where the Messiah was to be born. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 161, 6, 18, 'tell him He is going to be born in Bethlehem according to the book of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 161, 7, 18, 'Micah, but they couldn''t care less about going to Bethlehem. So, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 161, 8, 18, 'wise men came out and what did they do? They became wise again and they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 161, 9, 18, 'followed the star. When they followed the star, they get the surprise of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 161, 10, 18, 'their life that this One who was the King of the Jews is in a little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 161, 11, 18, 'house. They didn''t come in time for the birth. If they had come in time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 161, 12, 18, 'for the birth, they would have seen Him in a stable with the cows and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 161, 13, 18, 'the donkeys. They came a little late. Perhaps they were held up because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 161, 14, 18, 'they stopped following the star and deviated to Herod''s Palace instead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 161, 15, 18, 'of going straight to Bethlehem. If you had come to Bethlehem, they''d');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 161, 16, 18, 'have seen that wonderful sight of the Son of God born in a stable, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 161, 17, 18, 'they missed that. By the time they came, He’d moved out of the stable');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 161, 18, 18, 'and was living in a house. It says they came and saw Him in the house');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 161, 19, 18, 'but what I want to say is that even when He came to earth, He further');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 161, 20, 18, 'humbled Himself. How much did He humble Himself there? Not just a little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 161, 21, 18, 'bit. I mean if He was born in a middle-class family that itself would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 161, 22, 18, 'have been humility. If He had been born in a servant''s home that would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 161, 23, 18, 'have been even a greater humility but think of this; He was born in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 161, 24, 18, 'cowshed. In my entire life I have never heard of anyone who was so poor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 161, 25, 18, 'that his child was born in a cowshed with the cows and donkeys. I don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 161, 26, 18, 'know if there was any human being on the face of the earth who was so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 161, 27, 18, 'poor that his mother could deliver Him only in a cowshed. That''s where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 161, 28, 18, 'the Lord Jesus Christ is unique. Why did He go from the highest place in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 162, 1, 18, 'heaven to the lowest place on earth in a cowshed with donkeys? Because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 162, 2, 18, 'He wanted to save people. He came underneath everybody in order to lift');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 162, 3, 18, 'everybody up. How can you lift people up if you don''t go underneath');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 162, 4, 18, 'them? You can''t sit on top of them as a ruler and expect to lift them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 162, 5, 18, 'up. You can give orders to them if you sit as a ruler but if you want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 162, 6, 18, 'lift them up, you got to go underneath them. He was determined to go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 162, 7, 18, 'underneath every single human being that ever lived and that''s why He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 162, 8, 18, 'was born in a cowshed. The lowest possible place to be born in, He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 162, 9, 18, 'born there and there we see His humility. Now the wonderful thing is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 162, 10, 18, 'that this was not accidental. You may have been born at home or in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 162, 11, 18, 'hospital, but you never had a choice in where you were to be born. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 162, 12, 18, 'didn''t choose the country you are to be born in or the family you are to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 162, 13, 18, 'be born in because you were just conceived in your mother''s womb and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 162, 14, 18, 'depending on your parent’s social status, that''s where you were born.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 162, 15, 18, 'You could have been born in an air-conditioned room in a hospital or in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 162, 16, 18, 'a room in a house. You didn''t choose where to be born. There was only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 162, 17, 18, 'one person who was born on this earth who chose where He wanted to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 162, 18, 18, 'born and that was Jesus Christ our Lord because He planned His birth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 162, 19, 18, 'from heaven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 162, 20, 18, 'He planned His birth for thousands of years. The seed of the woman was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 162, 21, 18, 'promised in Genesis 3:15. From the time that promised was given there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 162, 22, 18, 'are 4,000 years but He knew about that birth even before. Supposing you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 162, 23, 18, 'were to plan your own birth on earth. Which family would you choose?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 162, 24, 18, 'Which town would you choose? Which place would you choose to be born?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 162, 25, 18, 'Would you choose a place like Nazareth which Nathaniel said, “Can any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 162, 26, 18, 'good thing come out of Nazareth”? It had such a bad reputation. Would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 162, 27, 18, 'you choose a town with a bad reputation to be born in? Would you choose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 162, 28, 18, 'a poor carpenter''s family to be born in or would you choose some rich');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 163, 1, 18, 'man''s home? Where would you choose to be born? Would you choose a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 163, 2, 18, 'despised slave nation like Israel which was under the Romans? And which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 163, 3, 18, 'location would you choose? Would you choose a cowshed? Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 163, 4, 18, 'deliberately chose all these places, and not only that, you see his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 163, 5, 18, 'humility in His genealogy mentioned in Matthew 1. Generally speaking,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 163, 6, 18, 'when the Jewish people wrote their genealogies, they never mentioned any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 163, 7, 18, 'women''s names. It was a male-dominated society. In this genealogy of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 163, 8, 18, 'Jesus which goes all the way up to Joseph who''s the husband of Mary, His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 163, 9, 18, 'mother, we read the names of four women and three of them are in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 163, 10, 18, 'physical ancestry of Jesus Christ. The first one is Tamar (Matthew 1:3)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 163, 11, 18, 'who produced a son called Perez, and the interesting thing there, if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 163, 12, 18, 'read way back in Genesis 38, this woman Tamar was actually Judah’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 163, 13, 18, 'daughter-in-law. It was incest in the family— father-in-law and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 163, 14, 18, 'daughter-in-law had sex and they had a child and that child''s name was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 163, 15, 18, 'Perez. Jesus from heaven chooses that line to come through. Would you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 163, 16, 18, 'like to choose a line for your ancestry which involves incest? Would you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 163, 17, 18, 'even want that, or would you avoid it completely? He could have avoided');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 163, 18, 18, 'it and chosen a pure line, but He chose that. The second woman mentioned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 163, 19, 18, 'here is Rahab (Matthew 1:5). Rahab was the most well-known prostitute in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 163, 20, 18, 'Jericho. She was not even a Jewish person, she belonged to the land of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 163, 21, 18, 'Jericho, probably of a Canaanite family. She was a prostitute who earned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 163, 22, 18, 'her money by selling her body for sex. Would you want everybody to know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 163, 23, 18, 'that your grandmother was a prostitute in the city? Would you choose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 163, 24, 18, 'such a line if you had the choice and even if it was, would you put it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 163, 25, 18, 'on the first page of your biography? This is the very first page of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 163, 26, 18, 'Jesus’s biography. The third woman mentioned here is Ruth. Ruth is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 163, 27, 18, 'called here the wife of Boaz and Ruth was a Moabite. That means she');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 163, 28, 18, 'descended from Moab. Moab was one of the sons of Lot born through his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 164, 1, 18, 'incest with his own daughter. Here''s another line of incest. The fourth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 164, 2, 18, 'woman was Bathsheba (Matthew 1:6) who David committed adultery with. She');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 164, 3, 18, 'was not in the physical ancestry of Mary but was in the physical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 164, 4, 18, 'ancestry of Joseph. It''s very interesting that all these four women were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 164, 5, 18, 'involved with some type of sexual deviation and sin in their ancestry.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 164, 6, 18, 'Ruth through her ancestor Moab, Rahab directly, Tamar directly and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 164, 7, 18, 'Bathsheba directly. Why did Jesus choose such a line saturated with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 164, 8, 18, 'sinful people? Because He came to save sinners. He wanted people to know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 164, 9, 18, 'that He had identified Himself with a sinful line. There is no sin in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 164, 10, 18, 'Him, but He identified Himself totally with a terribly sinful line so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 164, 11, 18, 'that He could save people who have been involved in incest, in adultery,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 164, 12, 18, 'who''ve been prostitutes, it doesn''t matter who. He came to save sinners');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 164, 13, 18, 'and in order to save sinners, He didn''t care what people thought about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 164, 14, 18, 'Him. His humility was so total. He identified Himself completely with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 164, 15, 18, 'the human race. There we see His tremendous Humility, and there when we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 164, 16, 18, 'compare our own pride, it''s so foolish. May God help us to learn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 164, 17, 18, 'something from the humility of Jesus. If the Holy Spirit is to make us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 164, 18, 18, 'like Jesus, He must bring us to the place where we don''t despise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 164, 19, 18, 'sinners. We recognize that we are sinners ourselves and we are willing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 164, 20, 18, 'to identify with them even if you are free from sin in order to save');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 164, 21, 18, 'them from their wretched condition. There we see the glory of Jesus’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 164, 22, 18, 'humility. The Holy Spirit wants to make you like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 164, 23, 19, 'Chapter 19 Likeness To Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 164, 24, 19, 'Today, we want to look at the reason why God sent His Son to this earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 164, 25, 19, 'It is more than merely to die for our sins even though that was our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 164, 26, 19, 'primary need. Jesus Himself said in John 6:38 the purpose with which He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 164, 27, 19, 'came from heaven in these words, “I have come down from heaven, not to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 164, 28, 19, 'do My own will but the will of Him who sent Me.” It''s quite an amazing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 165, 1, 19, 'statement when you come to think of it because when Jesus was in heaven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 165, 2, 19, 'from all eternity as the second person of the Trinity, there was no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 165, 3, 19, 'conflict between His will and His Father''s will. In heaven for eternal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 165, 4, 19, 'ages, He could say I do My own will because it is the same as My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 165, 5, 19, 'Father''s will. But the moment He came to earth and became like us, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 165, 6, 19, 'if He had to be like us, then He had to have a free will. All human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 165, 7, 19, 'beings have a free will. Our children have a free will; they can disobey');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 165, 8, 19, 'us if they want. If Jesus was not to be a robot; and we know He was not;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 165, 9, 19, 'then He had to have a free will.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 165, 10, 19, 'Jesus had the freedom of choice because He came as a human being. We saw');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 165, 11, 19, 'earlier that Jesus was 100% God and 100% man. It is the 100%-man aspect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 165, 12, 19, 'of His personality which is a problem to most; both God and man in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 165, 13, 19, 'same one person; He wasn''t two persons. It''s this part which is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 165, 14, 19, 'sufficiently understood or emphasized or even accepted by many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 165, 15, 19, 'born-again Christians. They think they degrade Jesus by emphasizing His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 165, 16, 19, 'humanity. Actually, they degrade Him by not emphasizing His humanity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 165, 17, 19, 'They think that if we say He was just like us, we make Him sinful. No,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 165, 18, 19, 'man was not created sinful and there was no sin in Jesus at all, but He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 165, 19, 19, 'was like us and therefore He had a will. If He was to please His Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 165, 20, 19, 'as a man, then He had to say no to His own will and that''s what He says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 165, 21, 19, 'here, “I have come from heaven not to do My will but the will of Him who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 165, 22, 19, 'sent Me.” This is a verse in His own words which proves His humanity and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 165, 23, 19, 'we should be proud and delighted by the fact that He became one like us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 165, 24, 19, 'Jesus once described His coming to earth and being a man by comparing it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 165, 25, 19, 'with the ladder that Jacob saw ascending up to heaven. He said that in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 165, 26, 19, 'John 1:51 to Nathaniel, “Truly, truly, I say to you, you shall see the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 165, 27, 19, 'heavens open and the angels of God ascending and descending on the Son');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 165, 28, 19, 'of Man.” He was referring to the dream that Jacob had way back in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 166, 1, 19, 'Old Testament where he saw a ladder going from earth to heaven and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 166, 2, 19, 'angels of God descending and ascending on that ladder. Jesus applies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 166, 3, 19, 'this to Himself; He is that ladder. He is the Son of Man who connects');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 166, 4, 19, 'heaven to earth, and the point is, if the last rung of that ladder did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 166, 5, 19, 'not touch the earth, it could not connect us to heaven. He did not come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 166, 6, 19, 'and stay a little bit above us; He came all the way down. The bottom of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 166, 7, 19, 'the ladder touched the earth. He was like us and therefore He denied His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 166, 8, 19, 'own will, and that''s what encourages us to believe that we can follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 166, 9, 19, 'Him too. In the Father''s will for Jesus on earth, He was not only to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 166, 10, 19, 'our substitute; our Savior dying on the cross, but He was also to be our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 166, 11, 19, 'example, as we considered in our last study. We are called not only to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 166, 12, 19, 'believe in Him for our salvation and for the forgiveness of our sins,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 166, 13, 19, 'but also to follow Him, and that''s what He asked us to do constantly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 166, 14, 19, 'There is a very lovely verse in Philippians 2:5 most Christians are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 166, 15, 19, 'familiar with. It says, “Have this attitude in yourself which was in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 166, 16, 19, 'Christ Jesus or let this mind be in you which was in Christ Jesus, who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 166, 17, 19, 'although He existed in the form of God did not regard equality with God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 166, 18, 19, 'as something to be grasped but emptied Himself, taking the form of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 166, 19, 19, 'bondservant and being made in the likeness of men.” We see very clearly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 166, 20, 19, 'that He emptied Himself of those rights and resources He had as God when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 166, 21, 19, 'He came to earth; though in His Person, He continued to be God. Now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 166, 22, 19, 'because He was a man like us on this earth, the Word of God challenges');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 166, 23, 19, 'us to have the same mind that He had, and to have the same attitude');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 166, 24, 19, 'towards people, circumstances, material things, towards trial,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 166, 25, 19, 'temptation; towards everything. The secret of true Christianity is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 166, 26, 19, 'this verse; if you want to be a disciple of Jesus, this is what you need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 166, 27, 19, 'to do. Allow your mind to be transformed into the likeness of the mind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 166, 28, 19, 'of Christ. Now this was not possible in the Old Testament times, for one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 167, 1, 19, 'reason, that the Holy Spirit did not dwell within man. You know the most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 167, 2, 19, 'significant event that took place after the resurrection of Christ and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 167, 3, 19, 'Christ going to heaven, is the coming of the Holy Spirit. That''s as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 167, 4, 19, 'important as the coming of Jesus Christ to earth. A lot of Christians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 167, 5, 19, 'appreciate the fact that Christ came to earth, but they haven''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 167, 6, 19, 'sufficiently understood the implications and the blessing of the third');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 167, 7, 19, 'Person of the Trinity, the Holy Spirit coming to us as well. Why did He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 167, 8, 19, 'come to earth? He occasionally visited people in the Old Testament but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 167, 9, 19, 'now He came to indwell people, to come within, to make this body His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 167, 10, 19, 'temple. This is the true temple of God now. When I receive Christ into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 167, 11, 19, 'my life and open my being to His Holy Spirit, He makes my body the house');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 167, 12, 19, 'of God. In the Old Testament, the house of God was in Jerusalem as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 167, 13, 19, 'physical building. Today there is no physical building which is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 167, 14, 19, 'house of God. 1 Corinthians 3:16 and 1 Corinthians 6:19 teach that this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 167, 15, 19, 'body is the temple of the Holy Spirit and He has come inside the body to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 167, 16, 19, 'give us the strength to control the passions in our body, and also to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 167, 17, 19, 'renew our mind. What does that mean? Our mind has a certain way of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 167, 18, 19, 'thinking, we have a certain value system in our mind and that value');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 167, 19, 19, 'system was acquired as we grew up from childhood, from our surroundings,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 167, 20, 19, 'from people and from the Adamic nature that we were all born with.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 167, 21, 19, 'That''s what makes all human beings, (whatever religion they may call');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 167, 22, 19, 'themselves), selfish, proud, often jealous of others, lovers of money,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 167, 23, 19, 'lovers of pleasure, comfort, seeking one''s own and numerous things which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 167, 24, 19, 'are characteristic of the entire human race irrespective of religion.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 167, 25, 19, 'The purpose of God is that when Christ comes into our life, and we open');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 167, 26, 19, 'our beings to be filled with the Holy Spirit; not just to receive the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 167, 27, 19, 'forgiveness that Christ offers us on the cross, but beyond that when we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 167, 28, 19, 'open our beings to allow the Holy Spirit to control us, what will happen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 168, 1, 19, 'is, He will change our way of thinking. He will change our value system;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 168, 2, 19, 'He will make us think more like how Jesus thought in His earthly days as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 168, 3, 19, 'a man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 168, 4, 19, 'Do you think that is happening with most Christians? Unfortunately, not.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 168, 5, 19, 'How many Christians do you find who are serious about looking at things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 168, 6, 19, 'the way Jesus looked at them? How many Christians are seeking with all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 168, 7, 19, 'their heart, even if they don''t attain it, at least seeking with all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 168, 8, 19, 'their heart to climb this mountain with the power of the Holy Spirit; to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 168, 9, 19, 'look at people and things and circumstances the way Jesus looked at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 168, 10, 19, 'them. That is the meaning of this commandment. This is not a suggestion.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 168, 11, 19, 'Inspired by the Holy Spirit, Paul says in Philippians 2:5, “You must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 168, 12, 19, 'have the mind of Christ, you must have the same attitude that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 168, 13, 19, 'had.” That means we are to look at people the way Jesus looked at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 168, 14, 19, 'people. We must look at women the way Jesus looked at women with purity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 168, 15, 19, 'We must look at material things the way Jesus looked at them; not in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 168, 16, 19, 'covetous, greedy way, seeking to grab as much as possible for ourselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 168, 17, 19, 'but being content with what God has given us and when we have more than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 168, 18, 19, 'enough for ourselves, to use it to bless other people who are needy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 168, 19, 19, 'Jesus didn''t grab all the money that people gave Him and keep it all for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 168, 20, 19, 'Himself. No, He would give to the poor. You read that in John 13:29, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 168, 21, 19, 'Himself was so poor that He had no place to lay His head, but whenever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 168, 22, 19, 'people gave Him some money, He gave to the poor, as well as to those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 168, 23, 19, 'around who were needy. At the same time, we read in the same verse John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 168, 24, 19, '13:29 that He bought what was needed. There is nothing wrong in using');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 168, 25, 19, 'our money to buy what we need but very often we have to say that most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 168, 26, 19, 'Christians have not changed their attitude to money because they have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 168, 27, 19, 'not allowed the Holy Spirit to renew their way of thinking.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 168, 28, 19, 'Transformation into the likeness of Christ is God''s goal for us. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 169, 1, 19, 'Romans 8:29, we read a word called predestined. The subject of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 169, 2, 19, 'predestination has been discussed by so many Bible scholars and they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 169, 3, 19, 'have different interpretations and there are people who talk about some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 169, 4, 19, 'human beings being predestined to go to hell and some human beings being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 169, 5, 19, 'predestined to go to heaven. I don''t know where they get all these ideas');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 169, 6, 19, 'from. Certainly not from the Bible because there''s not a single verse in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 169, 7, 19, 'the Bible that says anybody was predestined to go to heaven or hell. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 169, 8, 19, 'word predestination in the Bible is not connected with heaven or hell.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 169, 9, 19, 'That is not the destination God has predetermined for us. Predestination');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 169, 10, 19, 'means, the destination was determined beforehand. God has determined the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 169, 11, 19, 'destination for us who are His children, and I want to say to you, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 169, 12, 19, 'this may surprise you; it is not heaven. Where is it then? That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 169, 13, 19, 'destination is according to Romans 8:29 is conformity to the likeness of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 169, 14, 19, 'Jesus Christ. It says here He predestined them; those whom He called and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 169, 15, 19, 'chose, whom He knew beforehand. When it says He foreknew them that means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 169, 16, 19, 'He knew beforehand that certain people would respond to the call of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 169, 17, 19, 'Christ, so He made a plan for them before they were even born. I mean He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 169, 18, 19, 'knew who all would respond to the call of Christ before He created the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 169, 19, 19, 'world. That''s why He could put their names in the book of life. He knew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 169, 20, 19, 'who all would endure faithfully till the end trusting Christ. Their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 169, 21, 19, 'names were put in the book of life and He prepared a destination for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 169, 22, 19, 'them which is what the Bible calls predestination and that destination');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 169, 23, 19, 'is total conformity to the likeness of Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 169, 24, 19, 'If you ask me what God’s ultimate plan for me is and what is my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 169, 25, 19, 'predestination, I am very clear in my own mind that in my personality, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 169, 26, 19, 'will be totally like Jesus Christ; in my attitude to people, to material');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 169, 27, 19, 'things, to serving others and in everything else. That is a far greater');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 169, 28, 19, 'goal than going to heaven. Desire to go to heaven can be a very selfish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 170, 1, 19, 'desire. The desire to escape hell can be a very selfish desire. Even a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 170, 2, 19, 'fool doesn''t want to go to hell. Nobody wants to go there, only a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 170, 3, 19, 'who doesn''t understand what hell is, or is off his head would talk');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 170, 4, 19, 'lightly about hell. Apart from that, no sensible person would want to go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 170, 5, 19, 'there, not even a fool. But to choose heaven doesn''t mean you''re a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 170, 6, 19, 'spiritual person. Would you choose a mansion or a hut to live in? If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 170, 7, 19, 'choose a mansion, it doesn''t mean you''re spiritual. So, It can be a very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 170, 8, 19, 'selfish desire to choose heaven. The goal is not heaven or hell; it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 170, 9, 19, 'conformity to Jesus Christ and that process starts right now. As soon as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 170, 10, 19, 'Christ comes into our life and the Holy Spirit fills us, God begins the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 170, 11, 19, 'work in us. That work is called sanctification and the word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 170, 12, 19, 'sanctification means being separated from everything un-Christlike and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 170, 13, 19, 'everything Adamic. We have got a lot of the nature of Adam within us and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 170, 14, 19, 'that nature is basically selfish and proud. We think only about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 170, 15, 19, 'ourselves and we look down on others as though they are beneath us. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 170, 16, 19, 'Jesus came to earth, He never did anything like that. He never looked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 170, 17, 19, 'down on any human being; the lowest beggar was just as important to him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 170, 18, 19, 'as King Herod or Pilate or anyone. All were equal like all human beings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 170, 19, 19, 'are equal before God and He never thought only of Himself. The very fact');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 170, 20, 19, 'that He came to earth shows that He was totally unselfish. Why did He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 170, 21, 19, 'come to earth from heaven? It was not to get anything for Himself. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 170, 22, 19, 'may do Christian service or social-service to get some satisfaction for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 170, 23, 19, 'ourselves that we''re doing something for God. Jesus didn''t come to earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 170, 24, 19, 'to get some satisfaction that He was doing something for His Father. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 170, 25, 19, 'came with the purely unselfish loving motive of bringing us to where He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 170, 26, 19, 'is, taking us out of the pit that we are in, and bringing us to where He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 170, 27, 19, 'is to enjoy everything He enjoyed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 170, 28, 19, 'His desire was that we should enjoy what He has. That is total');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 171, 1, 19, 'unselfishness; a good mother and father will want their children to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 171, 2, 19, 'enjoy what they''re enjoying and to enjoy even more. The most unselfish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 171, 3, 19, 'manifestation of love that we see on the face of this earth is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 171, 4, 19, 'mother''s love for her little child. She is willing to sacrifice so much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 171, 5, 19, 'so that her child may be comfortable. This is the purest form of love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 171, 6, 19, 'you can see on this earth. Multiply a mother’s love by a million and you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 171, 7, 19, 'understand God''s love; it''s totally unselfish. Christ came to earth to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 171, 8, 19, 'change us. We cannot change ourselves; it is impossible. No matter how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 171, 9, 19, 'much we try, we may, on the surface appear to be, or pretend to be kind,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 171, 10, 19, 'and unselfish, because we get honor and a good reputation for that. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 171, 11, 19, 'getting a reputation for ourselves while our nature hasn’t changed isn’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 171, 12, 19, 'Christianity. Christianity is where our inner life is changed; where we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 171, 13, 19, 'are the same within. When Jesus said, “I am the way, the truth and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 171, 14, 19, 'life”, what did He mean by the word truth? The opposite of truth is lie.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 171, 15, 19, 'What He meant was there is no lie in Me; I''m not pretending, I''m not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 171, 16, 19, 'acting out something on the outside which I''m not inside. Truth means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 171, 17, 19, 'reality and Jesus was saying I''m real. Christians must be real; you must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 171, 18, 19, 'appear to be on the outside what you are genuinely inside.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 171, 19, 19, 'Now in the beginning that''s not true. We are all hypocrites, actors and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 171, 20, 19, 'pretenders. The Adamic nature that we have inherited from childhood has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 171, 21, 19, 'taught us to pretend, to act, to do what other people will accept.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 171, 22, 19, 'Christ came to change us on the inside, and when we see that as the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 171, 23, 19, 'destination that God Himself has planned for us, we can be pretty sure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 171, 24, 19, 'that He will do everything to take us to that destination. We read in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 171, 25, 19, 'Romans 8:28 that God makes everything around us to work together for our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 171, 26, 19, 'good. That good is mentioned in the next verse; to make us like Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 171, 27, 19, 'God has a goal in His dealings with us and that goal is to conform us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 171, 28, 19, 'the likeness of Christ completely. All the events and circumstances, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 172, 1, 19, 'things that happen around us, are planned by God to bring us to that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 172, 2, 19, 'goal, where we become like Christ. God is very serious about this and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 172, 3, 19, 'He''s determined to bring us there at any cost. If we also cooperate with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 172, 4, 19, 'Him, we''ll get there pretty quickly, but if we don''t cooperate with Him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 172, 5, 19, 'He is certainly not going to drag us, because God respects a man''s free');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 172, 6, 19, 'will. The clearest proof of that is, if a person wants to go to hell,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 172, 7, 19, 'God Almighty doesn''t stop him. Isn''t that amazing; that every day there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 172, 8, 19, 'are millions of people dying in sin going to an eternal hell separated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 172, 9, 19, 'from God and God doesn''t stop them. If they want to go there, they''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 172, 10, 19, 'welcome to go there. Why is that? Even though God knows it’s terrible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 172, 11, 19, 'for them if they choose to go there, He will not interfere. He will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 172, 12, 19, 'force man to come into His presence; He won''t catch a man by the neck');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 172, 13, 19, 'and say you got to come to heaven. He gives us freedom of choice even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 172, 14, 19, 'after we have received Christ as our Savior and the Holy Spirit has come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 172, 15, 19, 'in, He still respects our freedom of choice.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 172, 16, 19, 'He tells us if you want to reach this destination of becoming like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 172, 17, 19, 'Christ, you''re welcome but if you don''t want to reach there, I''m not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 172, 18, 19, 'going to force you. That’s the reason why millions of born-again');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 172, 19, 19, 'believers do not seem to grow spiritually into the likeness of Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 172, 20, 19, 'They are still selfish, proud, jealous, angry and bitter even after 20,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 172, 21, 19, '30 years of being born again. There''s hardly any difference between');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 172, 22, 19, 'these so-called born-again Christians and those who are atheists.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 172, 23, 19, 'Sometimes those atheists behave much better. What is the reason? One');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 172, 24, 19, 'reason could be these people have not been genuinely born again. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 172, 25, 19, 'probably have just gone through a formula taught to them by some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 172, 26, 19, 'preacher to say these magic words: Lord Jesus come into my heart like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 172, 27, 19, 'some type of mantra which they thought would change them. There was no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 172, 28, 19, 'sincerity in their heart, there was no repentance, there was no turning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 173, 1, 19, 'from sin, there was no recognition of what Christ had done for them and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 173, 2, 19, 'the price He had paid for them and so they respond in a selfish way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 173, 3, 19, 'because they want to go to heaven. They are threatened that they''ll go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 173, 4, 19, 'to hell if they don''t believe and so they believe.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 173, 5, 19, 'That''s one category of persons and the other is those who may have been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 173, 6, 19, 'genuinely born-again but have not understood that God has made provision');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 173, 7, 19, 'for them to have their whole mind controlled by the Holy Spirit so that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 173, 8, 19, 'they can be transformed into the likeness of Christ. The power of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 173, 9, 19, 'Holy Spirit is like electricity; we''re like bulbs. It''s only when the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 173, 10, 19, 'electricity flows into the bulb that the light shines. Otherwise, it has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 173, 11, 19, 'the capacity to shine, but it doesn''t shine. God''s desire is that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 173, 12, 19, 'open our being; He''s not telling us to shine on our own. No, He knows we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 173, 13, 19, 'can''t do it. He''s telling us to open our beings to His power, the power');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 173, 14, 19, 'of His Holy Spirit. The Christian life is really very simple. it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 173, 15, 19, 'actually very exciting because He doesn''t expect us to do anything on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 173, 16, 19, 'our own. “Open your being,” God says to you, “by the power of my Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 173, 17, 19, 'Spirit I will change you.” The responsibility to change us is God’s. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 173, 18, 19, 'destination determined is by Him, and He works out things through our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 173, 19, 19, 'circumstances, and He works inside us to make us like Christ. When you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 173, 20, 19, 'have a command saying have this attitude which is in Christ, He is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 173, 21, 19, 'one who is willing to produce that in us if we are willing to change.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 173, 22, 19, 'Isn''t that a wonderful message? It takes the responsibility off us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 173, 23, 19, 'completely to be transformed. All we need to do is to be willing. Are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 173, 24, 19, 'you willing? It''s all God wants from you. Tell Him that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 173, 25, 20, 'Chapter 20 Holiness Of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 173, 26, 20, 'We have been looking at the fact that God our Father sent His Son in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 173, 27, 20, 'human form to die for our sins and also to be an example for us. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 173, 28, 20, 'reason why I find it necessary to emphasize the fact of this being an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 174, 1, 20, 'example is because in evangelical Christendom, the fact of Jesus being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 174, 2, 20, 'our Savior and dying for our sins on the cross is emphasized widely but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 174, 3, 20, 'the other side of truth that He is our example is hardly emphasized.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 174, 4, 20, 'It''s very rare to find evangelical Christian preachers preaching much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 174, 5, 20, 'about it and explaining in practical terms what it actually means. Among');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 174, 6, 20, 'liberal Christians, there is an emphasis on the humanity of Christ which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 174, 7, 20, 'leads them to talk about improving social conditions and helping the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 174, 8, 20, 'poor etc. in practical ways on this earth but not in terms of character');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 174, 9, 20, 'of the individual Christian which is what the New Testament emphasizes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 174, 10, 20, 'The New Testament doesn''t tell us how to deliver people from oppressive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 174, 11, 20, 'dictators or how to teach them to dig better wells or grow better crops');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 174, 12, 20, 'or even about setting up schools and hospitals. All these are good, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 174, 13, 20, 'that''s not what the New Testament speaks about. When the New Testament');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 174, 14, 20, 'speaks about following Jesus, it''s not about delivering people from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 174, 15, 20, 'dictatorships or teaching them to dig better wells or grow better crops');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 174, 16, 20, 'but transforming them into the likeness of Christ in character');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 174, 17, 20, 'individually. It begins with the individual, not with society in general');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 174, 18, 20, 'and here is where there has been a tremendous lack of emphasis in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 174, 19, 20, 'evangelical Christendom and partly because most preachers are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 174, 20, 20, 'willing to pay the price to follow Jesus in their personal life and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 174, 21, 20, 'walk the way of humility, purity, love and compassion that He walked and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 174, 22, 20, 'therefore they don''t have the moral authority to speak about His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 174, 23, 20, 'character. In a day and age where many people are seeking for position');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 174, 24, 20, 'and titles and honor in Christendom, here was Jesus who lived without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 174, 25, 20, 'any titles; He told people don''t let anybody call you rabbi, father,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 174, 26, 20, 'leader because you are all brothers and you''re all servants. That''s what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 174, 27, 20, 'He said, but it''s so rare to find in Christendom people who want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 174, 28, 20, 'follow Jesus in this area. That''s part of his humility, He never wanted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 175, 1, 20, 'to exalt Himself above any other human being; He was down at their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 175, 2, 20, 'level. He made Himself like His brethren in all things. The first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 175, 3, 20, 'principle of successful Christian ministry is to become like the people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 175, 4, 20, 'you minister to and if you want to be a successful and useful servant of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 175, 5, 20, 'God the way Jesus was, the first principle is to become like the others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 175, 6, 20, 'Don''t seek in any way to exalt yourself above the others. Don''t seek a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 175, 7, 20, 'title, honor, position or anything above the others. People may respect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 175, 8, 20, 'you as a very godly man, but you make sure that you don''t exalt yourself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 175, 9, 20, 'by anything above them, in any way. Live at their level and seek to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 175, 10, 20, 'like them. I believe that Jesus dressed like the people around Him and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 175, 11, 20, 'His whole conduct was just like everybody else''s in terms of the way He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 175, 12, 20, 'lived. But in the midst of such a world, He lived in purity and a spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 175, 13, 20, 'which was completely the opposite of that of everybody else in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 175, 14, 20, 'world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 175, 15, 20, 'Now we want to look today at His purity. We have seen His humility and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 175, 16, 20, 'now we want to see something about His Holiness. The holiness of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 175, 17, 20, 'was not something He automatically had without a battle. If it were so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 175, 18, 20, 'then there would be nothing great about it. You know the difference');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 175, 19, 20, 'between an earned doctorate and an honorary doctorate. An honorary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 175, 20, 20, 'doctorate you don''t study for, you just get it. A doctorate, you work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 175, 21, 20, 'hard for it and get a degree. Was the holiness of Jesus something given');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 175, 22, 20, 'to Him on a platter for which He had to do nothing; He just took it?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 175, 23, 20, 'Certainly, your holiness and mine is not like that; we are tempted so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 175, 24, 20, 'severely. We face such severe temptations that it''s difficult for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 175, 25, 20, 'Christian to live even one day without sinning in thought or word or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 175, 26, 20, 'deed or attitude or motive. You and I have to confess that; temptation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 175, 27, 20, 'is so strong and so pressing on every side and we are so weak that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 175, 28, 20, 'slip and fall every day consciously and much more unconsciously. Very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 176, 1, 20, 'often we are aware of a fall only after we have fallen; after we had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 176, 2, 20, 'that wrong attitude for a moment towards somebody else. Now a thought');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 176, 3, 20, 'itself may not be sin because it could only be a temptation flashed into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 176, 4, 20, 'your mind by the devil, but if you reject it immediately that''s not sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 176, 5, 20, 'Let me clarify that so that people don''t get into condemnation. You need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 176, 6, 20, 'to distinguish between temptation and sin. Temptation is a thought');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 176, 7, 20, 'flashed into your mind by the devil. The devil flashed the thought into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 176, 8, 20, 'Jesus’ mind; turn the stones into bread. He said no. He didn''t sin even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 176, 9, 20, 'though that thought came into His mind. A thought that comes into your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 176, 10, 20, 'mind is like someone speaking a word to you. You don’t sin by having');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 176, 11, 20, 'heard something that someone told you. So when your flesh (or the devil)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 176, 12, 20, 'puts a sinful thought into your mind, you have not sinned thereby.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 176, 13, 20, 'Reject it immediately.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 176, 14, 20, 'You must distinguish between temptation and sin. It is when your mind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 176, 15, 20, 'agrees to that thought that is flashed into your mind that you sin. it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 176, 16, 20, 'like a man and a woman joining together; a conception takes place and a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 176, 17, 20, 'child is born. See James 1:15. So whenever you are tempted, you should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 176, 18, 20, 'immediately ask God for grace to help you reject it – and then reject');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 176, 19, 20, 'it. “Let us draw near with confidence to the throne of grace, so that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 176, 20, 20, 'may find grace to help in time of need (that is, when we are tempted)”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 176, 21, 20, '(Heb.4:16). If your mind does not agree to that temptation, there is no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 176, 22, 20, 'sin. 10,000 thoughts may flash through your mind, but if you reject them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 176, 23, 20, 'all, you don''t sin at all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 176, 24, 20, 'Jesus was tempted like us with thoughts flashed into His mind, but He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 176, 25, 20, 'refused at every point. Every honest Christian will admit it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 176, 26, 20, 'difficult to even live one single day— morning till night without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 176, 27, 20, 'sinning in thoughts. Maybe in words and actions, we can control');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 176, 28, 20, 'ourselves, but it is almost impossible to not sin in thoughts, attitudes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 177, 1, 20, 'and motives. This is because we''re so weak and when we see how easy it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 177, 2, 20, 'is to sin in these areas then we see what a miracle it was that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 177, 3, 20, 'lived 33-1/2 years without sinning once in any area. Now if you say that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 177, 4, 20, 'He lived like that because He had a holiness which was given to Him and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 177, 5, 20, 'it was impossible for Him to sin then and of course, He is no example');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 177, 6, 20, 'for us because you and I don''t have that type of thing. Then He can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 177, 7, 20, 'never say to any of us, “Follow Me.” He has to say to us, “Admire Me.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 177, 8, 20, 'He has to say to us; “You fellows can never follow Me, don''t even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 177, 9, 20, 'attempt because you won''t be able to do it”. But you will never be able');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 177, 10, 20, 'to read a verse like this in Scripture!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 177, 11, 20, 'In 1 Peter 2:21, Peter says, “Christ suffered for you, leaving you an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 177, 12, 20, 'example for you to follow in His steps who committed no sin nor was any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 177, 13, 20, 'deceit found in His mouth.” Did you read those verses together? He has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 177, 14, 20, 'given you an example to follow in His steps who committed no sin. As you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 177, 15, 20, 'look at the steps of Jesus, there was never a step into some sinful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 177, 16, 20, 'area; it was always holiness, humility, love and never did He step into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 177, 17, 20, 'some area that was sinful. He says you must follow in His steps who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 177, 18, 20, 'never committed a sin. Now if Peter were preaching that today, most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 177, 19, 20, 'evangelical Christians would turn around and call him a heretic and a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 177, 20, 20, 'false teacher for teaching such things, but they don''t know what to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 177, 21, 20, 'when it''s written in their Bible. They can''t call this heresy; they say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 177, 22, 20, 'this is the Word of God, but they don''t take it seriously. I''m sure many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 177, 23, 20, 'of you who listen to me have never taken this seriously in your life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 177, 24, 20, 'because immediately the devil tells you that is impossible. What God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 177, 25, 20, 'says is possible, you say it''s impossible. With men, it is impossible;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 177, 26, 20, 'it’s absolutely impossible, but with God, Jesus said all things are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 177, 27, 20, 'possible. It''s like the disciples once came to Jesus and said who then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 177, 28, 20, 'can be saved. He said with men it is impossible, but with God all things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 178, 1, 20, 'are possible (Matthew 19:26). So, we need to see that Jesus was tempted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 178, 2, 20, 'like us. Hebrews 4:15 clearly says He was tempted like us in all things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 178, 3, 20, 'and that is why He can sympathize with our struggles and our weakness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 178, 4, 20, 'He knows our weakness when we are tempted. It doesn''t mean that He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 178, 5, 20, 'condones our sin. There''s not a single verse anywhere in the Bible that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 178, 6, 20, 'says God condones our sin. He sympathized with us; He recognizes our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 178, 7, 20, 'weakness, but He doesn''t condone our sin. He''s been tempted like us, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 178, 8, 20, 'He was without sin and therefore it says in the next verse we can also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 178, 9, 20, 'draw near and get the same grace that He received from His Father to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 178, 10, 20, 'overcome sin. Romans 6:14 says sin shall not have dominion over you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 178, 11, 20, 'because you are under grace. If the grace of God is upon me, I cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 178, 12, 20, 'sin. That grace keeps me from sinning. Without grace, it''s impossible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 178, 13, 20, 'It''s like when the electricity is flowing through the bulb, it shines');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 178, 14, 20, 'but if the electricity stops, it stops shining immediately. When grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 178, 15, 20, 'departs from my life, I fall into sin immediately but as long as grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 178, 16, 20, 'is there, it''s like the electricity flowing and the bulb shining. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 178, 17, 20, 'not some great credit to the bulb, it''s because of the flow of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 178, 18, 20, 'electricity which is continuous and if the flow of grace comes upon me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 178, 19, 20, 'and it does come upon everyone who humbles himself, sin cannot rule over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 178, 20, 20, 'me; it is impossible. I mean if I can keep a book held up like against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 178, 21, 20, 'the law of gravity so that it doesn''t fall, do you think Jesus cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 178, 22, 20, 'keep holding me up so that I don''t fall into sin? Of course, He can, if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 178, 23, 20, 'I trust Him. Everything is dependent on faith. If you don''t believe that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 178, 24, 20, 'Jesus can do that for you, then of course He won''t be able to do it for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 178, 25, 20, 'you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 178, 26, 20, 'A blind man once came to Jesus and said, “Lord, I want my eyes to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 178, 27, 20, 'open” and Jesus asked him, “Do you believe I can do this for you?”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 178, 28, 20, 'Supposing he said, “Oh I''m not so sure”, he wouldn''t have been healed or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 179, 1, 20, 'supposing he said “Well, I think you can open one eye”, he would have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 179, 2, 20, 'got only one eye open because Jesus said, “According to your faith, be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 179, 3, 20, 'it unto you” . Not according to my faith but according to your faith. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 179, 4, 20, 'you come to Jesus and say, “Lord, can you forgive my sins.” He says, “Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 179, 5, 20, 'you believe I can do this for you” You say, “Yes Lord, I believe you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 179, 6, 20, 'forgive my sins.” According to your faith, be it unto you; You''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 179, 7, 20, 'forgiven immediately. Now you go to Him and say, “Lord, Can you give me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 179, 8, 20, 'victory over sin” and the Lord says, “Do you believe I can do this for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 179, 9, 20, 'you.” You say “Well, I''m not so sure. I''m sure you can forgive me but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 179, 10, 20, 'I''m not so sure whether you can give me victory over sin.” The Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 179, 11, 20, 'says, “According to your faith, be it unto you.” You''ll never get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 179, 12, 20, 'victory over sin because it''s according to your faith. Do you believe I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 179, 13, 20, 'can do this for you? Not do you believe that you can do it yourself;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 179, 14, 20, 'that of course the answer is always no. But do you believe the Lord can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 179, 15, 20, 'do this for you. Do you believe the Lord can keep you from falling like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 179, 16, 20, 'it says in the book of Jude 24? You say, “No Lord, I don''t believe you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 179, 17, 20, 'can keep me from falling.” According to your faith, be it unto you;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 179, 18, 20, 'you''ll keep on falling every day of your life, even fifty years from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 179, 19, 20, 'now. The reason why most Christians have not experienced the promise of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 179, 20, 20, 'God is because they do not believe.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 179, 21, 20, 'They believe for all types of other things which are not written in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 179, 22, 20, 'scripture like getting a better house or a better car or something like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 179, 23, 20, 'that but the most important thing you need in your life is not a better');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 179, 24, 20, 'house or a better car, it''s freedom from sin, from anger and from lust');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 179, 25, 20, 'and from telling lies and from all the other wretched things that are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 179, 26, 20, 'defiling you and corrupting you and making you useless in God''s service');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 179, 27, 20, 'and could one day take you to hell. You can go to heaven living in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 179, 28, 20, 'small house and riding a bicycle and you can go to hell with a big house');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 180, 1, 20, 'and a big car. So those are not the things we should be pursuing; those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 180, 2, 20, 'are added bonuses that God throws in. Our main aim in life must be to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 180, 3, 20, 'pursue His righteousness. Jesus said, “Seek first the kingdom of God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 180, 4, 20, 'His righteousness first, and all these things will be added to you”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 180, 5, 20, '(Matthew 6:33). That means seek to be holy and don''t seek after material');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 180, 6, 20, 'things; these are the things God will add to you as He sees fit and as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 180, 7, 20, 'He sees you need it. We have a Christendom today that has stopped');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 180, 8, 20, 'seeking God''s kingdom and His righteousness and is seeking after all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 180, 9, 20, 'these other things; exactly what Jesus told them not to seek for and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 180, 10, 20, 'there are preachers who teach them to seek that. These are false');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 180, 11, 20, 'prophets and there are plenty of them in Christendom today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 180, 12, 20, 'When we turn to Luke 2, you see there some amazing words. Do you know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 180, 13, 20, 'who was the first human being upon whom the grace of God rested? The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 180, 14, 20, 'answer is Jesus. When He came as a human being, He gave up those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 180, 15, 20, 'resources He had as God, though He was God Himself. He lived as a human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 180, 16, 20, 'being and human beings need grace and so we read in Luke 2:40, these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 180, 17, 20, 'amazing words about Jesus right from the time He was a child. It says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 180, 18, 20, 'the grace of God was upon Him and Romans 6:14 says when the grace of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 180, 19, 20, 'is upon someone, He gets victory over sin. In Luke 2:40, when it says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 180, 20, 20, 'the grace of God was upon Jesus, it kept Him from sinning all through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 180, 21, 20, 'His life. That''s how He overcame sin and we need to see that. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 180, 22, 20, 'trouble with a lot of Christians is that they''ve already formed an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 180, 23, 20, 'opinion in their mind concerning what''s right. Every group of Christians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 180, 24, 20, 'has an inherited tradition from what they have learned from their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 180, 25, 20, 'pastors and leaders in their churches and they are unwilling to change');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 180, 26, 20, 'it. They read a verse and they pour it into their preconceived theology;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 180, 27, 20, 'the result is they live defeated lives constantly. If you want to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 180, 28, 20, 'free, you must be willing to let God break those traditions and teach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 181, 1, 20, 'you the truth. The truth will set you free and the truth is that because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 181, 2, 20, 'Jesus was tempted in all points as we are and did not sin (Hebrews');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 181, 3, 20, '4:15). There the next verse (v16), says let us also go and get this same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 181, 4, 20, 'grace to help us in the time of our need from the throne of grace. Which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 181, 5, 20, 'grace? The same grace that Jesus received. Did He receive grace? Well it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 181, 6, 20, 'says here from the time He was a child; the grace of God was upon Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 181, 7, 20, 'and up to the time of His death. We read in Hebrews 2:9 that it was by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 181, 8, 20, 'the grace of God that He tasted death. He could not have gone to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 181, 9, 20, 'cross if the grace of God did not help Him to go there. From childhood');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 181, 10, 20, 'we read in Luke 2:40 to his death in Hebrews 2:9, what was it that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 181, 11, 20, 'carried Jesus through? Grace!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 181, 12, 20, 'Grace is not God''s unmerited favor (as some people teach). That is an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 181, 13, 20, 'unscriptural definition. Unmerited favor is something that every human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 181, 14, 20, 'being on earth gets – even godless people and terrorists get it. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 181, 15, 20, 'gives everyone food, health, children and other material and physical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 181, 16, 20, 'blessings – all of which are undeserved by anyone. God showers such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 181, 17, 20, 'blessings on all types of people – and it is all unmerited. But that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 181, 18, 20, 'not grace. The Jewish people in Old Testament times also got unmerited');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 181, 19, 20, 'favor. But John 1:17 says that grace became available to man only after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 181, 20, 20, 'Christ came to earth. Jesus Christ was the first person who experienced');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 181, 21, 20, 'grace (See Luke 2:40). Because the grace of God was upon Him, He could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 181, 22, 20, 'overcome sin. On the day of Pentecost the Spirit of grace was poured out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 181, 23, 20, '– that all of us can receive.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 181, 24, 20, 'Jesus had to be an example for us in holiness. Holiness means freedom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 181, 25, 20, 'from sin and it is impossible to come to that life without grace. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 181, 26, 20, 'need to know the distinction between mercy and grace. In Hebrews 4:15,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 181, 27, 20, 'we saw that wonderful verse which says Jesus was tempted in all points');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 181, 28, 20, 'exactly like us, but He did not sin. Therefore, what shall we do? Is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 182, 1, 20, 'that just something we are to admire and say, “Oh, that''s wonderful that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 182, 2, 20, 'He did not sin. Oh, it''s wonderful that He came in our flesh.” No, it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 182, 3, 20, 'not just something to be admired. There must be a result from that;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 182, 4, 20, 'there must be something which we do because of that and that''s what it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 182, 5, 20, 'says in the next verse with the phrase “Therefore”.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 182, 6, 20, 'Therefore, what shall we do? We shall also go to the throne of grace and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 182, 7, 20, 'when we go to the throne of grace, we receive mercy first of all. All of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 182, 8, 20, 'us need mercy but Jesus never needed mercy. Mercy refers to forgiveness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 182, 9, 20, 'for our past failures; we''ve all failed so badly that we need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 182, 10, 20, 'forgiveness and that''s called mercy. There''s plenty verses of about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 182, 11, 20, 'mercy in the Old Testament; the mercy of the Lord endures forever, His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 182, 12, 20, 'mercy is from generation to generation etc. but you never find in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 182, 13, 20, 'Old Testament that God gave grace to people, He give them mercy. Today');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 182, 14, 20, 'we can get the same mercy because we have fallen so many times, but God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 182, 15, 20, 'wants to give us something more than mercy and that is grace. Grace is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 182, 16, 20, 'God''s power to help us in that time of need (Hebrews 4:16). Our time of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 182, 17, 20, 'need is when we are tempted to fall and that is a thousand times worse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 182, 18, 20, 'than poverty or physical sickness. We''re tempted to fall and at that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 182, 19, 20, 'time we need grace to help us to stand. Let us go to the throne of grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 182, 20, 20, 'and get it just like Jesus prayed and got from the Father, we can also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 182, 21, 20, 'go to the Father and get grace.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 182, 22, 20, 'To use an illustration, we can picture ourselves like mountain climbers,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 182, 23, 20, 'climbing up a mountain and say in one place you slip and you''re about to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 182, 24, 20, 'fall. You''re hanging on by your fingers but you''re too proud to ask for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 182, 25, 20, 'help and you slip and you fall and you break your bones and you''re lying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 182, 26, 20, 'at the bottom and then you ask for help and the ambulance comes along');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 182, 27, 20, 'picks you up takes you to the hospital; that''s mercy. That is help after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 182, 28, 20, 'you have fallen coming to forgive your sin, to cleanse you and restore');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 183, 1, 20, 'you to fellowship with God. Although it’s good that you ask for help,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 183, 2, 20, 'its second best. The best is while you''re hanging there by your fingers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 183, 3, 20, 'about the slip and fall, you cry out to God for grace. You cry out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 183, 4, 20, 'saying, “Lord, I''m weak, I acknowledge my weakness. I need help, please');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 183, 5, 20, 'come and help me now.” Then you find amazingly that grace lifts you up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 183, 6, 20, 'and puts you on top of that rock from which you are about to slip and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 183, 7, 20, 'fall. Then you don''t need the ambulance because you didn''t fall. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 183, 8, 20, 'grace to help us in our time of need. Now this is not just a beautiful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 183, 9, 20, 'illustration, it''s practical and real.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 183, 10, 20, 'If you don''t believe that, you can try it out next time. Do this next');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 183, 11, 20, 'time when you are tempted. Instead of being proud and saying I can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 183, 12, 20, 'resist that on my own and I can manage on that on my own, humble');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 183, 13, 20, 'yourself and say, “I can''t manage on my own. I''m not able to get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 183, 14, 20, 'victory; this temptation is too strong for me.” Whatever your temptation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 183, 15, 20, 'is, and you know what it is in your life. Will you humble yourself and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 183, 16, 20, 'go to God and say, “Lord, this is too strong for me. I cannot get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 183, 17, 20, 'victory, but I believe you can help me to overcome it. I''m coming to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 183, 18, 20, 'your throne of grace. Please forgive me for all the years when I''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 183, 19, 20, 'fallen into this sin but now, I have learnt the secret, I''m going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 183, 20, 20, 'come to you and ask you for grace before I fall. When I''m slipping and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 183, 21, 20, 'find the pressure too much, I''m going to ask you Lord to give me grace.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 183, 22, 20, 'For example, let''s take a practical case; supposing you''re being tempted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 183, 23, 20, 'to get angry or you''re tempted to watch pornography or some dirty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 183, 24, 20, 'thoughts and you find you''re slipping and about to fall from the cliff.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 183, 25, 20, 'Ask God, say “Lord, will you give me grace right now that I can stand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 183, 26, 20, 'and don''t fall.” You will be amazed to find how a power comes to lift');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 183, 27, 20, 'you up and make you stand on the rock without falling. God helps you so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 183, 28, 20, 'that you don''t fall; that is the will of God for you and me. I want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 184, 1, 20, 'say to you that Jesus received help from His Father because He cried out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 184, 2, 20, 'with loud crying and tears (Hebrews 5:7). God helped Him to stand and He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 184, 3, 20, 'can help us as well. He says to us, “Follow Me.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 184, 4, 21, 'Chapter 21 Jesus’s Attitude To Money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 184, 5, 21, 'We have been looking at the earthly life of Jesus Christ our Lord as our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 184, 6, 21, 'example. God sent Him to earth not only to die for our sins but to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 184, 7, 21, 'demonstrate to man how God wants man to live. He came to earth to show');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 184, 8, 21, 'that and primarily, He showed it by His life of humility. We have been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 184, 9, 21, 'looking at the fact that He was also tempted like us in all points and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 184, 10, 21, 'overcame every temptation that man can ever face. The earthly life of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 184, 11, 21, 'Jesus was something in which the Father allowed Him to face all types of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 184, 12, 21, 'difficult circumstances in situations in which He was exposed to every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 184, 13, 21, 'single temptation that human beings would ever face. He did not face all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 184, 14, 21, 'the circumstances we face; that would be impossible but in different');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 184, 15, 21, 'circumstances, He faced the same temptations that we faced. For example,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 184, 16, 21, 'temptations to irritability, to anger, bitterness, to jealousy, to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 184, 17, 21, 'love of money, sexual temptation and every single thing that we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 184, 18, 21, 'tempted by. He was tempted and He overcame and that is why the Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 184, 19, 21, 'says that He can sympathize with us. Right from the beginning of time,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 184, 20, 21, 'Satan has always told man that God''s commands are difficult to obey, if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 184, 21, 21, 'not impossible. The earthly life of Christ was a proof that every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 184, 22, 21, 'command of God can be obeyed. Now if Jesus proved that in His person as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 184, 23, 21, 'God, then it would not disprove the devil''s lie; it would only confirm');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 184, 24, 21, 'it by saying, “Well only someone who is God can keep those commandments');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 184, 25, 21, 'and live up to those standards but an ordinary man with the resources he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 184, 26, 21, 'has can never live up to those standards.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 184, 27, 21, 'A lot of Christians believe that Jesus Christ did not overcome as a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 184, 28, 21, 'but as God and they don''t realize that they''re just endorsing the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 185, 1, 21, 'devil''s lie that God''s commands are impossible for man to obey. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 185, 2, 21, 'read the scriptures carefully and you come to it with an unprejudiced');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 185, 3, 21, 'mind, you will see the scripture is very clear that Christ was tempted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 185, 4, 21, 'like us in every point and yet never sinned thereby proving that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 185, 5, 21, 'devil is a liar when he says God''s commands are impossible to keep.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 185, 6, 21, 'Every command of God can be kept by the grace that He supplies to us as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 185, 7, 21, 'men. That is the testimony that we need to see in the earthly life of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 185, 8, 21, 'Jesus Christ by which we can have faith. When the Bible says in Hebrews');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 185, 9, 21, '12:2 that Jesus is the author and finisher (or perfecter) of our faith,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 185, 10, 21, 'it is by looking at Jesus that we find that faith coming in to us that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 185, 11, 21, 'we too can live the type of life He lived. In our earthly life, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 185, 12, 21, 'considered once before that God made man of the dust of the ground and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 185, 13, 21, 'breathed into him the breath of life. So, he has two pulls; one downward');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 185, 14, 21, 'and one upward. When Jesus came to earth in a human body, He felt that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 185, 15, 21, 'downward pull, but He never yielded to it. For example, material things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 185, 16, 21, 'attracted Him. If they did not attract Him like they attract us, then He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 185, 17, 21, 'could not have been tempted like us. A lot of our temptations come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 185, 18, 21, 'through material things around us. In fact, the very first temptation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 185, 19, 21, 'that is mentioned in relation to Jesus at the end of the 40 days in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 185, 20, 21, 'wilderness concerns material things. He was tempted throughout the 40');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 185, 21, 21, 'days but at the end of it, He faced three temptations. The first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 185, 22, 21, 'concerns material things— food for the body and what we see there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 185, 23, 21, 'that He was hungry just like any man would be hungry after fasting for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 185, 24, 21, '40 days but He would not yield to the downward pull of His body if the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 185, 25, 21, 'Father did not give Him permission to use that God given power to turn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 185, 26, 21, 'stones into bread. Jesus would never use a God given power for personal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 185, 27, 21, 'benefit and here even though His body demanded it, He said “No”. His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 185, 28, 21, 'attitude to material things is an example for us because so many of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 186, 1, 21, 'temptations come in this realm of the pulls that come upon our body.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 186, 2, 21, 'Paul says in 1 Corinthians 9:25-27 that is possible for even someone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 186, 3, 21, 'like him who preached such a high standard of God''s Word to run in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 186, 4, 21, 'race meaning preach and encourage others and yet be disqualified if he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 186, 5, 21, 'doesn''t keep the rules of the race. He says there are people who compete');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 186, 6, 21, 'in races and get disqualified at the end because they haven''t kept the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 186, 7, 21, 'rules and he''s speaking particularly about the passions in the body. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 186, 8, 21, 'person can do so many things for the Lord; he can be very active and do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 186, 9, 21, 'a lot of Christian work but if he does not overcome the desires within');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 186, 10, 21, 'his body, it says he will be disqualified. Let me read to you 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 186, 11, 21, 'Corinthians 9:25: “Everyone who competes in (athletic) games exercises');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 186, 12, 21, 'self-control in all things. They do it to receive a perishable wreath,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 186, 13, 21, 'but we are imperishable. Therefore, I run in such a way, as not without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 186, 14, 21, 'aim; I box in such a way, as not beating the air; but I discipline my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 186, 15, 21, 'body and make it my slave, so that, after I have preached to others, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 186, 16, 21, 'myself will not be disqualified.” Paul made his body his slave by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 186, 17, 21, 'telling it what it should do, and he does not yield to its demands as to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 186, 18, 21, 'what it should do. Otherwise, if a person does not make his body and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 186, 19, 21, 'bodily passions his slave, even if he preaches to others, he will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 186, 20, 21, 'finally disqualified. It''s a very high standard that God expects from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 186, 21, 21, 'those who preach his word and that is why it is important that those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 186, 22, 21, 'preach the word and of course all Christians need to keep their bodily');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 186, 23, 21, 'passions under control, and that also relates to their attitude to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 186, 24, 21, 'material things like money. The Lord Jesus said very clearly in Luke 16');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 186, 25, 21, 'about the dangers of loving money. He said in Luke 16:13, that no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 186, 26, 21, 'servant can serve two masters. Our holiness is tested very practically');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 186, 27, 21, 'when it comes to our attitude to material things and the desires of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 186, 28, 21, 'body. The Bible says everything in the world, the desires in the flesh');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 187, 1, 21, 'and the lust of the eyes and the boastful pride of life is not from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 187, 2, 21, 'Father. The lust of the eyes is paraphrased in one translation as the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 187, 3, 21, 'desire to buy everything that we see. Don''t you find that desire is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 187, 4, 21, 'there in the human body to buy whatever we see. We think we need it even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 187, 5, 21, 'if we don’t. Jesus said you can''t serve two masters. Now we would think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 187, 6, 21, 'the two masters are God and the devil, but that''s not what He says here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 187, 7, 21, 'in Luke 16:13. He says the two masters are God and Mammon. He was saying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 187, 8, 21, 'you must choose whom you want to serve, you can''t love both. You got to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 187, 9, 21, 'hate one to love the other. You got to despise one to hold on to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 187, 10, 21, 'other. What He means is if you love money, you hate God. Have you ever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 187, 11, 21, 'heard anyone say that? Jesus said it in Luke 16:13 and that’s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 187, 12, 21, 'meaning. If you are clinging and holding on and attached to money and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 187, 13, 21, 'earthly things, you''re actually despising God whereas if you cling on to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 187, 14, 21, 'God, you won''t hold on to money so tightly. If you love God with all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 187, 15, 21, 'your heart, you won''t be attached to money; that''s the point here.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 187, 16, 21, 'There are only two masters and when Jesus came to earth, He recognized');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 187, 17, 21, 'that. It''s very important for us to understand how Jesus handled money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 187, 18, 21, 'first as a carpenter and then as a full-time worker. The Lord Jesus had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 187, 19, 21, 'to be an example for us in both these areas because most Christians are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 187, 20, 21, 'actually in secular work and then there are Christians who are in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 187, 21, 21, 'full-time work and Christ is an example to both. Look first at His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 187, 22, 21, 'example as a as a carpenter; He worked up to the age of 30 earning His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 187, 23, 21, 'living. He had four younger brothers and at least two younger sisters');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 187, 24, 21, 'and a mother. Joseph was probably dead by that time since we don''t hear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 187, 25, 21, 'of him which means Jesus as the eldest son had the responsibility for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 187, 26, 21, 'these seven other members in His eight-member family. Maybe the other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 187, 27, 21, 'brothers worked too but Jesus was the elder brother and He had to work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 187, 28, 21, 'as a carpenter to earn His living and support that family. Obviously, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 188, 1, 21, 'had to learn the discipline as a carpenter to keep family expenses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 188, 2, 21, 'within the limits of what He could earn. His aim as a carpenter was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 188, 3, 21, 'certainly not to be the richest carpenter in Nazareth; I''m sure He would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 188, 4, 21, 'do many acts of kindness and goodness to poor people and widows, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 188, 5, 21, 'probably make things freely for some of them so that He wouldn''t take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 188, 6, 21, 'money from some who couldn''t afford it. You can imagine that if He did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 188, 7, 21, 'His business like that, He was certainly not going to be the richest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 188, 8, 21, 'carpenter of Nazareth. Being the richest carpenter wasn’t His goal. His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 188, 9, 21, 'job was a means of earning a living. God gives us a job as a means of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 188, 10, 21, 'earning a living. Jesus didn''t have ambitions to be well-known as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 188, 11, 21, 'carpenter or any such thing. A wholehearted disciple of Jesus uses his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 188, 12, 21, 'profession as a means of earning a living to support Himself and His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 188, 13, 21, 'family and I''m absolutely sure that He steered clear of debt. He didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 188, 14, 21, 'want to expand this business by borrowing money. There are many things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 188, 15, 21, 'that we can learn from the earthly life of Jesus from his attitude');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 188, 16, 21, 'towards his work. The Bible says in Romans 13:8, “owe nothing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 188, 17, 21, 'anyone.” We are to not be in debt to anybody. If borrowing is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 188, 18, 21, 'necessitated in a certain situation, then owe no man anything means that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 188, 19, 21, 'as soon as possible, clear that debt. There may be situations where you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 188, 20, 21, 'need to borrow money in an emergency. The Bible doesn''t say don''t get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 188, 21, 21, 'into debt, but it says owe no man anything, meaning that as soon as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 188, 22, 21, 'possible, clear it; don''t live owing people anything.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 188, 23, 21, 'Jesus also taught in relation to money to render to Caesar what is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 188, 24, 21, 'Caesar''s and render to God what is God’s. In other words, don’t ever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 188, 25, 21, 'hold back from the government money that''s due to the government. Caesar');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 188, 26, 21, 'is the government or any other human being. We''re not to cheat the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 188, 27, 21, 'government of taxes and we''re not to cheat any human being of money that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 188, 28, 21, 'rightfully belongs to them. We''re not to borrow money and then give that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 189, 1, 21, 'to God. No, Jesus said, “Give to Caesar what is Caesar''s and give to God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 189, 2, 21, 'what is God’s.” This is part of righteousness and holiness. It’s so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 189, 3, 21, 'important for us to have a clear attitude in this area of money if we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 189, 4, 21, 'want to be genuinely holy because a lot of Christians who appear to have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 189, 5, 21, 'an interest in holiness in many other areas, when it comes to the area');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 189, 6, 21, 'of mammon and material things, they fail completely. That’s the area');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 189, 7, 21, 'where our holiness is very often tested and particularly as a Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 189, 8, 21, 'worker. When Jesus Christ was in full-time work for three and a half');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 189, 9, 21, 'years, He was tested in money even more because now He was not earning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 189, 10, 21, 'and was dependent on others. Now in the New Testament, we read about two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 189, 11, 21, 'ways in which Christian workers supported themselves. One demonstrated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 189, 12, 21, 'by the Apostle Paul who because his job was a tentmaker, he could carry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 189, 13, 21, 'his needle around everywhere and stitch dents and earn a living and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 189, 14, 21, 'support himself. He didn’t do that everywhere and we read that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 189, 15, 21, 'church in Philippi would support him financially and he would receive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 189, 16, 21, 'it, but in a number of other places like Ephesus and Thessalonica and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 189, 17, 21, 'Corinth, He never took any money from the people he served. Paul didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 189, 18, 21, 'live by a rule, he lived by being sensitive to the Holy Spirit to see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 189, 19, 21, 'whether it was appropriate or wrong to take in this situation and in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 189, 20, 21, 'many cases he wouldn’t and supported himself. Then there are others like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 189, 21, 21, 'Peter who were fishermen. They couldn''t carry their boats everywhere or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 189, 22, 21, 'fish everywhere. They were supported financially by believers and Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 189, 23, 21, 'was this like that - He was a carpenter and He was supported by people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 189, 24, 21, 'who gave Him gifts. In Luke 8:2-3, It says some of the those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 189, 25, 21, 'followed Jesus where women. Among them were some rich women like Joanna');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 189, 26, 21, 'the wife of Chuza, Herod’s steward, and Susanna and many others who were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 189, 27, 21, 'contributing to their support out of their private means. So, there were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 189, 28, 21, 'numerous people who were supporting Jesus’ band of twelve apostles and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 190, 1, 21, 'Himself and other people in the team financially. For example, Herod’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 190, 2, 21, 'steward must have been earning quite a big salary and he probably give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 190, 3, 21, 'large sums of money to his wife. That''s why they needed a treasurer and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 190, 4, 21, 'that''s why Judas Iscariot carried a bag with him where all this money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 190, 5, 21, 'that people were giving for Jesus’ ministry was kept. Now there are a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 190, 6, 21, 'number of things that we can see from the attitude that Jesus had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 190, 7, 21, 'towards this money, and it''s very important for all those who are in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 190, 8, 21, 'full-time Christian work, if they really say they''re following Jesus’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 190, 9, 21, 'example in this area, because God has given us an example on earth of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 190, 10, 21, 'how a man should live who is in full-time Christian work. He''s given us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 190, 11, 21, 'an example in Jesus earning His living as a carpenter in how a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 190, 12, 21, 'should live in a secular job, and He’s given us an example again in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 190, 13, 21, 'Christ as a full-time worker in how a Christian worker should live in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 190, 14, 21, 'relation to money. Jesus never received a salary from anyone. He never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 190, 15, 21, 'offered a salary to His disciples. He never mentioned His needs to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 190, 16, 21, 'anyone. He had a Father in heaven, and He would tell His needs only to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 190, 17, 21, 'His Father. He never encouraged His disciples to advertise their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 190, 18, 21, 'financial needs; that would be insulting their Father in heaven. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 190, 19, 21, 'were to trust their Father to provide their needs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 190, 20, 21, 'We never find anywhere in the New Testament anyone asking people to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 190, 21, 21, 'support them in the ministry. Paul was very eager to urge people to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 190, 22, 21, 'support others who were in need and that''s right. Jesus Himself urged');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 190, 23, 21, 'people to give money to the poor. But in relation to themselves, they''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 190, 24, 21, 'trusted their Heavenly Father to take care of them. This is the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 190, 25, 21, 'Testament way. Christianity has unfortunately lowered those standards.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 190, 26, 21, 'John 13:27 gives us an indication in the way in which Jesus used money.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 190, 27, 21, 'When Judas Iscariot was going to betray the Lord, nobody knew at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 190, 28, 21, 'table what Jesus meant when Jesus told him, “What you do, do quickly.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 191, 1, 21, 'It says none of those who were sitting there at the table knew why Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 191, 2, 21, 'said this and some of them who were sitting there were supposing that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 191, 3, 21, 'because Judas had the money box, Jesus was telling him to buy the things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 191, 4, 21, 'we have need off for the feasts or give something to the poor. Two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 191, 5, 21, 'things; buy the things we need or give to the poor. So there in those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 191, 6, 21, 'two statements, we have Jesus telling us what His attitude to material');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 191, 7, 21, 'things was. What are we supposed to use the money for that we earn or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 191, 8, 21, 'that we receive as gifts from others? Buy what we need; there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 191, 9, 21, 'absolutely nothing wrong with that. We don''t have to be hermits or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 191, 10, 21, 'sannyasis living in the forest. How shall we determine what we need?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 191, 11, 21, 'There is an area where each person must be faithful before God and we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 191, 12, 21, 'are not to judge other people. We know that people live at different');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 191, 13, 21, 'standards of living and we are not called to decide what another person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 191, 14, 21, 'needs. The world is unfortunately full of Christians who judge other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 191, 15, 21, 'people for their standard of living. Jesus never did that and anyone who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 191, 16, 21, 'does that is following Satan, the accuser of the brethren rather than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 191, 17, 21, 'Jesus Christ. You need to judge yourself to see whether you are spending');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 191, 18, 21, 'your money for what you need. Another person may decide he needs a car');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 191, 19, 21, 'or two cars or even three in some countries. It''s none of my business to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 191, 20, 21, 'judge them; you don''t know their situation. One person may decide he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 191, 21, 21, 'needs a three-bedroom house, another person may say a one-bedroom house');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 191, 22, 21, 'is enough for them. That is their business; the Bible says don''t be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 191, 23, 21, 'busybody in other people''s matters (1 Timothy 5:14; 2 Thessalonians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 191, 24, 21, '2:11). You have to decide yourself what you need. Spend your money in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 191, 25, 21, 'buying what you need. There could be numerous things that we need for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 191, 26, 21, 'making life easier. For example, there are many gadgets available');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 191, 27, 21, 'nowadays for making life easier at home and there are many advantages in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 191, 28, 21, 'having them at home because it saves time. You can spend more time in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 192, 1, 21, 'studying the word and in prayer and helping other people if you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 192, 2, 21, 'those gadgets rather than if you do them all by hand like people used to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 192, 3, 21, 'do in the olden days. So, is that gadget a necessity? That''s for that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 192, 4, 21, 'person to decide. You need to decide for yourself. If we follow the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 192, 5, 21, 'simple rule, I’m going to decide for myself only what I need and I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 192, 6, 21, 'never going to judge another person whether what he has bought is needed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 192, 7, 21, 'or not, you will be saved from a lot of problems and you will probably');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 192, 8, 21, 'grow much more spiritually too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 192, 9, 21, 'The second thing is giving something to the poor. Now Jesus himself was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 192, 10, 21, 'so poor that He had no place to lay His head. In fact, in one place it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 192, 11, 21, 'says that everybody went to his own house, but Jesus went to the Mount');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 192, 12, 21, 'of Olives because He didn''t have any house to go to in Judea (John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 192, 13, 21, '7:53). He had a home in Capernaum, but He didn''t have anyone in that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 192, 14, 21, 'area and so He went to the Mount of Olives and slept there overnight');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 192, 15, 21, 'under the trees. That''s why He said the Son of Man has no place to lay');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 192, 16, 21, 'His head. Even the foxes have got holes and the birds have nests. So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 192, 17, 21, 'even though He was so poor, yet out of what He got, He gave to people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 192, 18, 21, 'who were poorer than Him. For example, blind Bartimaeus was probably');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 192, 19, 21, 'poorer than Him. There were people in Jewish society who were poorer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 192, 20, 21, 'than even Jesus. A lot of people who think they''re very poor don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 192, 21, 21, 'realize that there are other people in the church who are much poorer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 192, 22, 21, 'than them. All these people who just wait for somebody to give them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 192, 23, 21, 'gifts and handout because they think they''re so poor, they''re not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 192, 24, 21, 'following Jesus at all. So, you see a tremendous example here in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 192, 25, 21, 'fact that even though He was poor, He had a concern for the poor. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 192, 26, 21, 'also see that Jesus Christ was faithful in this area of money and was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 192, 27, 21, 'not attached to it. In John 12, Judas Iscariot said concerning Mary of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 192, 28, 21, 'Bethany pouring out the perfume that it could have been sold and given');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 193, 1, 21, 'to the poor. It says that he was a thief and he used to take the money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 193, 2, 21, 'which is in the box and pilfer it (John 12:6). He used to steal that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 193, 3, 21, 'money. Now Jesus knew very well that Judas Iscariot was stealing the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 193, 4, 21, 'money, but it didn''t disturb Him. He just left that with His Father and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 193, 5, 21, 'that''s wonderful to be able to have that type of detachment from money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 193, 6, 21, 'that we''re not going to fight with people over money. If somebody steals');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 193, 7, 21, 'it, we will be more careful next time. If somebody stole your money, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 193, 8, 21, 'don''t go fighting with people over it. We find this detached attitude in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 193, 9, 21, 'Jesus Christ towards material things and that''s a very important area');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 193, 10, 21, 'for all of us if we are to follow the Lord. We are to be careful in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 193, 11, 21, 'use of material things, but we''re not to be attached to material things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 193, 12, 21, 'This is what it means to be a disciple. This is what Jesus meant when He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 193, 13, 21, 'said if anyone wants to be My disciple like Me, he''s got to forsake his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 193, 14, 21, 'possessive attitude towards material things. That''s the meaning of Luke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 193, 15, 21, '14:33. He must not possess them. He can have them, but he must not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 193, 16, 21, 'possess them. We can have many things in the world but once we possess');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 193, 17, 21, 'them, we can no longer be His disciples. May God help us to have that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 193, 18, 21, 'attitude.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 193, 19, 22, 'Chapter 22 Examples Of Humility');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 193, 20, 22, 'We were considering in our last study how God has given us His Son as an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 193, 21, 22, 'example for us to follow in the area of humility. Sin came into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 193, 22, 22, 'universe originally through the pride of Lucifer who became Satan and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 193, 23, 22, 'salvation came through the opposite of that through Jesus humbling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 193, 24, 22, 'Himself. Now we may not realize how important pride and humility are,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 193, 25, 22, 'but the Bible does not say that God is opposed to the adulterers, or the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 193, 26, 22, 'murderers or the thieves or those who are jealous or liars, but it does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 193, 27, 22, 'say God opposes the proud. If there''s one group of people on earth whom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 193, 28, 22, 'God opposes the maximum, it is those who are proud, and you see that in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 194, 1, 22, 'the attitude of Jesus to people whom He met on the earth. You''ll never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 194, 2, 22, 'find Him condemning the woman caught in adultery. He said to her, “I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 194, 3, 22, 'don''t condemn you go and sin no more.” There was a man at the pool of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 194, 4, 22, 'Bethesda who had sinned and as a result became sick and lame for 38');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 194, 5, 22, 'years. Jesus didn''t condemn him, he healed him and said to him in John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 194, 6, 22, '5:14 later on, “Don''t sin anymore because otherwise something worse will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 194, 7, 22, 'happen to you than what happened now,” but he didn''t condemn him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 194, 8, 22, 'There was a thief on the cross who had probably been a murderer and a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 194, 9, 22, 'dacoit and thief for so many years. Jesus didn''t condemn him, He said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 194, 10, 22, '“Sure, I’ll take you to paradise today because I see you''ve repented');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 194, 11, 22, '(paraphrase).” Here is another case of a woman in Samaria who was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 194, 12, 22, 'divorced five times and who was now living with a man, not even married');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 194, 13, 22, 'to him. What would you do with such a woman? Would you ever think that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 194, 14, 22, 'God could use such a woman and yet what you read in John 4 is that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 194, 15, 22, 'sat patiently with this woman and talked to her about worshipping God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 194, 16, 22, 'He won her heart and I''m sure He drew her away from that life of sin by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 194, 17, 22, 'showing sympathy and compassion for her which she never experienced from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 194, 18, 22, 'anybody else in Samaria. Why do you think she came to draw water at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 194, 19, 22, 'noon? Nobody in villages goes to draw water at noon; the women go to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 194, 20, 22, 'well early in the morning because they need water for the whole day. At');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 194, 21, 22, 'noon, nobody goes there, and Jesus was all alone at the well at noontime');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 194, 22, 22, 'prompted by the Holy Spirit to sit there. This woman comes along at noon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 194, 23, 22, 'because she had been the butt of endless ridicule by all people in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 194, 24, 22, 'Samaria that she did not want to go to the well when all the other women');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 194, 25, 22, 'were there. She wanted to go when nobody was there, and she was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 194, 26, 22, 'surprised to find Jesus. Jesus never condemned her but encouraged her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 194, 27, 22, 'and drew her away from her life of sin and sent her back into the city');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 194, 28, 22, 'of Samaria to bring about the greatest revival that''s described in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 195, 1, 22, 'gospels through the ministry of anyone other than Jesus. None of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 195, 2, 22, 'apostles could produce such a revival as this five-time divorced woman');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 195, 3, 22, 'produced in the city of Samaria. So many people came to Jesus and said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 195, 4, 22, 'they believed in Him and it says there they believed in Him because of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 195, 5, 22, 'the testimony of this woman.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 195, 6, 22, 'This is how Jesus was; He never condemned any of these people but now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 195, 7, 22, 'look at the way He spoke about the proud Pharisees. The Pharisees were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 195, 8, 22, 'the people who when they went to pray, they would look down others who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 195, 9, 22, 'they felt were not as good as them, like many Christians today who look');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 195, 10, 22, 'down on people in other denominations, and look down at other believers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 195, 11, 22, 'who they think are not as spiritual as they are because they''ve got some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 195, 12, 22, 'understanding of some experience which those other Christians don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 195, 13, 22, 'have. Christendom is filled with such arrogant, conceited snobs who call');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 195, 14, 22, 'themselves Christians who are actually closer to the devil than they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 195, 15, 22, 'to Jesus Christ because of their pride. In the days of Jesus, such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 195, 16, 22, 'people were called Pharisees (self-righteous, proud, and looking down on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 195, 17, 22, 'others) and Jesus had the strongest words of rebuke for them. He called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 195, 18, 22, 'them a generation of vipers, snakes, full of dead men''s bones covered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 195, 19, 22, 'over with a beautiful tomb. He said, “You''re like a person who''s got a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 195, 20, 22, 'cup all clean on the outside but dirty inside.” He said, “How will you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 195, 21, 22, 'escape the damnation of hell?” Jesus spoke such words to people who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 195, 22, 22, 'religious, who went to the synagogue every Saturday, who knew their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 195, 23, 22, 'Bibles, prayed, fasted, tithed, but they had one big serious problem and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 195, 24, 22, 'that was the sin of pride. God opposes the proud, but He gives grace to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 195, 25, 22, 'the humble. Pride and humility are very serious. Humility is the ground');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 195, 26, 22, 'from which all the other virtues of Christ can grow. Have you noticed in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 195, 27, 22, 'Galatians 5:22 - 23, where the fruit of the Spirit is described,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 195, 28, 22, 'humility is not even mentioned there. Isn''t that surprising? The fruit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 196, 1, 22, 'of the Spirit is love, joy, peace, long-suffering, gentleness, goodness,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 196, 2, 22, 'faithfulness, meekness, and self-control. Humility is not mention there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 196, 3, 22, 'at all because humility is the ground on which this fruit grows. Grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 196, 4, 22, 'is like the rain that falls on this ground to produce the fruit of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 196, 5, 22, 'Spirit. You can''t get that rain of grace unless you are humble. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 196, 6, 22, 'gives grace only to the humble. This is so important because this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 196, 7, 22, 'primary message of the New Covenant is that we can overcome sin. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 196, 8, 22, 'came into the world to save people from their sins. Why is it then the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 196, 9, 22, 'vast majority of Christians are still defeated by sin? Why is it the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 196, 10, 22, 'vast majority of Christians, if they''re honest, they''ll tell you they''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 196, 11, 22, 'still defeated by anger, they still lust with their eyes, they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 196, 12, 22, 'occasionally jealous, they still love money. Many of them are bitter and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 196, 13, 22, 'they have bad moods and they''re discouraged and condemn themselves and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 196, 14, 22, 'all types of things. Why is that? I will give you the answer in one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 196, 15, 22, 'sentence; they do not receive grace. They have received grace for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 196, 16, 22, 'forgiveness of sins, but they stop there. The rain is not falling on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 196, 17, 22, 'ground and so the fruit is not being produced. The rain is not falling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 196, 18, 22, 'on the ground because God gives us grace only to the humble and there''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 196, 19, 22, 'some pride in the lives of these Christians that is preventing them from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 196, 20, 22, 'getting grace. Perhaps, they look down on other people. So, you see that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 196, 21, 22, 'humility is very important; it’s fundamental and it''s very easy to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 196, 22, 22, 'proud. One of the easiest things in our life is to be puffed up, to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 196, 23, 22, 'proud of something God has given us, or God has done for us. Maybe God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 196, 24, 22, 'given you a good-looking face that''s enough to make you proud. God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 196, 25, 22, 'given you intelligence more than other people, that''s enough to make you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 196, 26, 22, 'proud. Or He has given you a better job, or your family is a wealthy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 196, 27, 22, 'family, or in a high position that makes you look down at others, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 196, 28, 22, 'God is the enemy of all such people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 197, 1, 22, 'Nowhere in the Bible does it say God is the enemy of murderers and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 197, 2, 22, 'thieves and adulterers, but He is the enemy of the proud. It says 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 197, 3, 22, 'Peter 5:5 that God is opposed to the proud, but He gives grace to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 197, 4, 22, 'humble. The picture I get is that if you are humble, God will get behind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 197, 5, 22, 'you and push you forward. He will get underneath you and push you up but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 197, 6, 22, 'if you are proud, God will come in front of you and push you back and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 197, 7, 22, 'come on top of you and push you down. There''s no hope for you if God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 197, 8, 22, 'pushing you back and God is pushing you down. It''s better to have God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 197, 9, 22, 'pushing us up and pushing us forward and He will do that for those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 197, 10, 22, 'are humble by giving them grace. The Bible says in Romans 6:14 that when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 197, 11, 22, 'grace comes upon him, he overcomes sin. So, whenever you are defeated by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 197, 12, 22, 'any sin; whether anger, lust of the eyes, bitterness jealousy, love of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 197, 13, 22, 'money or anything, you can be absolutely sure the reason for that is you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 197, 14, 22, 'did not get grace. If you got grace, sin would not have dominion over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 197, 15, 22, 'you. Romans 6:14 is very clear; it''s as clear as 2+2 = 4. It is not 3.9');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 197, 16, 22, 'or 4.1, it is 4. If grace comes upon you, you will have victory over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 197, 17, 22, 'sin; nothing can stop it. Then why didn''t you get victory over sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 197, 18, 22, 'because you didn''t get grace. Go one step further back; why didn''t you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 197, 19, 22, 'get grace? Because you were proud. That is the only reason why people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 197, 20, 22, 'are defeated by sin. Every Christian in the world who is defeated by any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 197, 21, 22, 'sin has to face up to the fact that some pride in him which prevented');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 197, 22, 22, 'God from giving him grace, and that''s why he''s defeated. So, he needs to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 197, 23, 22, 'go before God and say, “God, please give me some light on the pride in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 197, 24, 22, 'me which I probably don''t even see”. I think a lot of Christians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 197, 25, 22, 'genuinely do not see the pride in them. They think they''re pretty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 197, 26, 22, 'humble; some very proud people think they''re quite humble. They are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 197, 27, 22, 'proud of their humility or what they think is their humility. You can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 197, 28, 22, 'proud of your Bible knowledge. A lot of Christians are proud of their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 198, 1, 22, 'Bible knowledge, they''re proud of the gifts of the Spirit God has given');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 198, 2, 22, 'them. Any type of pride; pride in a spiritual gift, pride in Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 198, 3, 22, 'knowledge, pride in the work you''ve done for God, pride in a ministry,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 198, 4, 22, 'any pride in what you''ve accomplished will always bring upon you the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 198, 5, 22, 'opposition of God. He will fight you tooth-and-nail because He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 198, 6, 22, 'opposed to the proud and He gives grace to the humble. That is why Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 198, 7, 22, 'became Satan when he was immediately cast out.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 198, 8, 22, 'We need to see the glory of Jesus first of all in His humility. His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 198, 9, 22, 'becoming a man, and as a man becoming a servant of everybody. His whole');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 198, 10, 22, 'attitude to people was, “I’m your servant, I''m here to serve you.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 198, 11, 22, 'That''s why at the Last Supper, Jesus washed the feet of the disciples.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 198, 12, 22, 'They had the custom in those lands at that time to wash people''s feet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 198, 13, 22, 'whenever they came to the house because the roads were dusty. People did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 198, 14, 22, 'not wear shoes, they wore sandals and having trudged through dusty roads');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 198, 15, 22, 'with sandals, their feet would get dirty. Those homes had a bucket of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 198, 16, 22, 'water by the door, a towel, a basin, and a slave in the rich homes would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 198, 17, 22, 'wash the feet of all the people who came in before they went in to have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 198, 18, 22, 'a meal. In this particular home, there wasn’t a slave present because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 198, 19, 22, 'Jesus wanted to have the Last Supper privately with only His disciples.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 198, 20, 22, 'Some kind person had offered the house and arranged for everything for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 198, 21, 22, 'the night. When the disciples and Jesus came with their dusty feet into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 198, 22, 22, 'the house, they all saw the bucket of water, and they knew that somebody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 198, 23, 22, 'needs to wash people’s feet but there was no slave around. They were all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 198, 24, 22, 'too proud to do it themselves because every person was important in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 198, 25, 22, 'own way. Peter thinks I''m the leader of the apostles, and Matthew says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 198, 26, 22, '“I''m a chartered accountant” and John says, “I''m known to the high');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 198, 27, 22, 'priests and I can''t stoop to these undignified things.” Everybody had a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 198, 28, 22, 'reason; they were either too clever, important or big in their own eyes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 199, 1, 22, 'So ultimately Jesus goes and takes the bucket and says this is my job. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 199, 2, 22, 'came to earth to be a servant and He takes the bucket and washes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 199, 3, 22, 'people''s feet and they all feel ashamed. This is the way Jesus ended His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 199, 4, 22, 'life; so many people in Christian work when they come to the last day of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 199, 5, 22, 'their life on earth, they want some title, they want some position, they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 199, 6, 22, 'want some honor, they want to be the head of some organization, they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 199, 7, 22, 'want to be right on top and be a director or something like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 199, 8, 22, 'Jesus was no director; He was a servant and He was a slave. On the last');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 199, 9, 22, 'day of His earthly life, we find Him washing the disciples’ feet. I want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 199, 10, 22, 'to ask you whether that is your greatest goal in life. Is it your aim');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 199, 11, 22, 'that when you come to the end of your life, after having served the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 199, 12, 22, 'faithfully for 50, 60 years, on the last day of your earthly life, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 199, 13, 22, 'want to be found at the feet of the disciples of Jesus washing their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 199, 14, 22, 'feet, cleaning away the dirt. Oh, how rare to find even among those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 199, 15, 22, 'preach holiness and sanctification and all that to find this spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 199, 16, 22, 'because people have not seen the glory of Jesus’ humility. They have not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 199, 17, 22, 'seen His humility in the way He humbled Himself and went down all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 199, 18, 22, 'way from heaven, all the way down to earth, and all the way down to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 199, 19, 22, 'feet of the disciples. While all this was going on, they were discussing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 199, 20, 22, 'who’s going to be the leader. It’s amazing so see such a contrast in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 199, 21, 22, 'spirit of Jesus washing the disciples’ feet and the disciples sitting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 199, 22, 22, 'around the table discussing who among them is the greatest and who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 199, 23, 22, 'the most important among them. In the midst of such a discussion, Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 199, 24, 22, 'turned and corrected His disciples and told them, “The kings of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 199, 25, 22, 'Gentiles lord it over them; and those who have authority over them are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 199, 26, 22, 'called ‘Benefactors.’ But it is not this way with you, but the one who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 199, 27, 22, 'is the greatest among you must become like the youngest, and the leader');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 199, 28, 22, 'like the servant. For who is greater, the one who reclines at the table');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 200, 1, 22, 'or the one who serves? Is it not the one who reclines at the table? But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 200, 2, 22, 'I am among you as the one who serves.” He didn’t just speak words, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 200, 3, 22, 'set an example for them. As I said in the previous chapter, the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 200, 4, 22, 'Covenant had teachings about humility but here in the New Covenant, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 200, 5, 22, 'have an example. Jesus invites us to follow Him and do what He did. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 200, 6, 22, 'need to see the glory of Jesus’ humility.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 200, 7, 22, 'Let’s look at another example of the humility of Jesus. In the Gospel of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 200, 8, 22, 'Matthew, we read about a time when Jesus cast out demons from a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 200, 9, 22, 'demon-possessed person who was brought to him (Matthew 12:22). This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 200, 10, 22, 'person was blind and mute and as soon as Jesus saw him, He knew it was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 200, 11, 22, 'demon and He cast out the demon. After casting out the demon, the man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 200, 12, 22, 'could see and speak so the people were amazed and said, “This man cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 200, 13, 22, 'be the Son of David (the promised Messiah), can He?” The Pharisees were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 200, 14, 22, 'jealous, they couldn’t cast out any demon or heal anyone, so their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 200, 15, 22, 'jealousy made them accuse Jesus so that people would not be attracted to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 200, 16, 22, 'Him. They said that Jesus was casting out demons through the power of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 200, 17, 22, 'Beelzebul, the ruler of the demons (Matthew 12:24). You find the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 200, 18, 22, 'spirit even today in people whenever they see somebody who is more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 200, 19, 22, 'gifted than them, they want to say something to tear that person down.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 200, 20, 22, 'That is the spirit of the Pharisees. They called Jesus, Beelzebul and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 200, 21, 22, 'you know what Jesus said?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 200, 22, 22, 'He said to them that every sin and blasphemy can be forgiven but not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 200, 23, 22, 'blasphemy against the Holy Spirit and if you have spoken a word against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 200, 24, 22, 'Me, the Son of Man, it will be forgiven. When people called Him the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 200, 25, 22, 'Prince of Devils, He forgave them (Matt 12:31-32). This is different');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 200, 26, 22, 'from the spirit under the Old Covenant. In the Old Covenant we read in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 200, 27, 22, 'Numbers 12 about an incident where the brother (Aaron) and sister');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 200, 28, 22, '(Miriam) of Moses speaking against him. Miriam was probably 10- 12 years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 201, 1, 22, 'older than Moses. She was the one who saw the daughter of Pharaoh');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 201, 2, 22, 'picking up the little baby Moses in a basket, so she felt she had some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 201, 3, 22, 'authority over her younger brother. Aaron was also older to Moses and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 201, 4, 22, 'they speak against Moses for a small thing like marrying a Cushite');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 201, 5, 22, 'woman. It is none of their business whom Moses married, and Moses didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 201, 6, 22, 'disobey any commandment by marrying a Cushite woman because was no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 201, 7, 22, 'commandment in those days about such things. The law was given much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 201, 8, 22, 'later through Moses himself. Now when Moses heard this, he didn''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 201, 9, 22, 'any bitterness against these people, but God said this is serious, how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 201, 10, 22, 'dare you speak against my servant. Immediately, Miriam got leprosy and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 201, 11, 22, 'her face became white as snow. Leprosy usually comes very slowly, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 201, 12, 22, 'she became a leper immediately for saying a word against Moses. Speaking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 201, 13, 22, 'against a servant of God is serious and God judged her by giving her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 201, 14, 22, 'leprosy for seven days. So, when somebody spoke against Moses, they got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 201, 15, 22, 'leprosy but when somebody spoke against Jesus and called Him something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 201, 16, 22, 'much worse, they got forgiveness. Have you seen the difference between');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 201, 17, 22, 'Moses and Jesus, the difference in the age of the law and the age of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 201, 18, 22, 'grace?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 201, 19, 22, 'There you see the humility of Jesus. He says in Matthew 12:32, “You have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 201, 20, 22, 'spoken a word against Me, I’m just an ordinary man, you''re forgiven.” He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 201, 21, 22, 'was not an ordinary man; He was the Son of God. He was eternal Almighty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 201, 22, 22, 'God equal with this Father from all eternity, but He lived on earth as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 201, 23, 22, 'an ordinary man. He called Himself the Son of Man. He chose to be called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 201, 24, 22, 'by that name and He said you''re forgiven and not only that, He said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 201, 25, 22, 'whoever speaks a word against me, it is forgiven. Think of all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 201, 26, 22, 'things that people have said against Jesus in the last 2,000 years. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 201, 27, 22, 'have said that He is an illegitimate child, that He is a homosexual,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 201, 28, 22, 'that He got married to Mary Magdalene, they have told all types of lies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 202, 1, 22, 'and insulted Him. Think of His humility that He does not pronounce');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 202, 2, 22, 'judgement on them from heaven. He could make them full of cancer,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 202, 3, 22, 'leprosy, AIDs and all these judgments, but He doesn’t do it. We see His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 202, 4, 22, 'humility in willing to accepting insult. When they spat on Him, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 202, 5, 22, 'didn’t say anything. When they slapped Him, He only said, “Why do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 202, 6, 22, 'slap me if I’ve said what’s right” but when they slapped Him again, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 202, 7, 22, 'just kept quiet. When they made Him suffer, it says He did not threaten');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 202, 8, 22, 'or revile in return (1 Peter 2:23). He did not say, “Wait and see what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 202, 9, 22, 'I’ll do to you when I come back as the judge of the earth.” He never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 202, 10, 22, 'threatened anybody. Proud people threaten others, they threaten those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 202, 11, 22, 'who work under them in their offices, they threaten their servants,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 202, 12, 22, 'children, neighbor and people all around by their position or authority.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 202, 13, 22, 'Jesus never behaved like that, He never said, “You don’t know who I am,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 202, 14, 22, 'I’ll teach you a lesson.” He never did any of these things. Only proud');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 202, 15, 22, 'people talk like that to those who are lower than them in society. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 202, 16, 22, 'considered Himself the lowest of all, and forgave no matter what people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 202, 17, 22, 'said against Him. See how rare it is to find the humility of Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 202, 18, 22, 'among Christians today. Why is it that Christians fight and quarrel so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 202, 19, 22, 'much even with each other and with others? It’s only one reason; they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 202, 20, 22, 'are proud because they have not seen the glory of the humility of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 202, 21, 22, 'Christ. They’ve not mediated on the Scriptures to see that glory. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 202, 22, 22, 'they have seen it, it would have changed their life completely.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 202, 23, 22, 'The Bible says the Holy Spirit can change us into the likeness Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 202, 24, 22, 'only after we see it. It is only after He shows it to us. If you refuse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 202, 25, 22, 'to let the Holy Spirit show you the glory of Jesus in Scripture, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 202, 26, 22, 'will never be like Him. 2 Corinthians 3:18 is the clearest verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 202, 27, 22, 'describing the ministry of the Holy Spirit and what it says there is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 202, 28, 22, 'Holy Spirit shows us the glory of Jesus Christ and then changes us into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 203, 1, 22, 'that likeness. Be encouraged and let the Holy Spirit show you the glory');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 203, 2, 22, 'of Jesus Christ in the Scriptures. A good place to start is to see His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 203, 3, 22, 'humility in these different circumstances when you read the gospels.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 203, 4, 22, 'Don''t just read them as stories but seek to see the glory of Jesus and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 203, 5, 22, 'the way Jesus reacted to different people in different situations. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 203, 6, 22, 'way He reacted to the insults that people gave Him. May God help you to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 203, 7, 22, 'see that and may God help you and me to follow in His footsteps and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 203, 8, 22, 'become like Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 203, 9, 23, 'Chapter 23 Satan Has Been Defeated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 203, 10, 23, 'Today, we want to look at a work that Christ accomplished on the cross');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 203, 11, 23, 'when He died which is not known to most Christians. When Christ died on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 203, 12, 23, 'the cross, a number of things were accomplished. He used these words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 203, 13, 23, 'towards the end of His 6 hours on the cross; “It is finished” (John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 203, 14, 23, '19:30). What was finished? First of all, the work of salvation was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 203, 15, 23, 'finished. The payment for the price for the sins of man was paid. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 203, 16, 23, 'payment for the guilt of man, the debt that man owed to the law of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 203, 17, 23, 'was paid. The certificate of debt was cancelled and torn out. That’s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 203, 18, 23, 'first and most important thing. It says in Colossians 2:14 that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 203, 19, 23, 'Christ cancelled the certificate of debt consisting of decrees against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 203, 20, 23, 'us. Every sin that we commit in thought, word, deed, attitude, motive is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 203, 21, 23, 'a debt we owe to the law of God and we are guilty, but Christ died and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 203, 22, 23, 'paid the debt. He took the punishment we need to face for our sins from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 203, 23, 23, 'a holy God who cannot let us go just because He loves us. Why doesn’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 203, 24, 23, 'God let us go when we repent and say sorry? Because that would destroy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 203, 25, 23, 'the foundations of justice in the universe. If a judge let his son who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 203, 26, 23, 'has committed a crime go because he loves him, he will be an unrighteous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 203, 27, 23, 'judge. But a judge can punish his son with a fine and then pay the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 203, 28, 23, 'punishment himself as a father. That’s what God did; He passed a verdict');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 204, 1, 23, 'that man is guilty of death - being separated from God forever. Then He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 204, 2, 23, 'came in the form of man and took that punishment Himself. Jesus Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 204, 3, 23, 'died and when He hung on the cross for 3 hours, He was separated from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 204, 4, 23, 'the Father. His fellowship which He had for all eternity was broken and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 204, 5, 23, 'Christ cried out, “My God, My God, Why have you forsaken Me.” He never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 204, 6, 23, 'addressed His Father as God at any time, He always called Him Father.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 204, 7, 23, 'But now He was facing Him as the judge of the universe as He took your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 204, 8, 23, 'sin and mine upon Him, paid the punishment and was forsaken for 3 hours.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 204, 9, 23, 'Because Christ is an eternal being, in three hours, He could face the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 204, 10, 23, 'concentrated punishment of all humanity in hell for eternity in that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 204, 11, 23, 'short period. It was a concentrated time of punishment and that’s why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 204, 12, 23, 'the heavens became dark, the sun would not give its light and the earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 204, 13, 23, 'shook because the creator of the universe was taking the punishment for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 204, 14, 23, 'man’s sin. That’s the first thing that Christ accomplished on the cross');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 204, 15, 23, 'when He said, “It is finished.” The punishment for sin was taken and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 204, 16, 23, 'then He could address God as Father again when He said, “Father, into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 204, 17, 23, 'Your Hands I commit My Spirit” and He went to paradise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 204, 18, 23, 'There was also another thing that was accomplished on the cross as well');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 204, 19, 23, 'at the same time. In the next verse of Colossians 2:15, we read that He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 204, 20, 23, 'disarmed the rulers and principalities who had got possession of man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 204, 21, 23, 'The devil had made man his slave in the Garden of Eden. This happened');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 204, 22, 23, 'when Adam bowed down to the devil. What the devil told Eve was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 204, 23, 23, 'essentially, “Will you bow down to me instead of bowing down to God. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 204, 24, 23, 'has told you not to eat of the tree and I’m telling you to eat of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 204, 25, 23, 'tree. Who are you going to bow down and make your king?” Adam and Eve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 204, 26, 23, 'failed the temptation and from that time, the human race accepted the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 204, 27, 23, 'devil as their ruler and see the mess he created in the human race in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 204, 28, 23, 'all these thousands of years. When Jesus comes, He''s coming to claim');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 205, 1, 23, 'back that position of authority and kingship that God created man to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 205, 2, 23, 'have in relation to God Himself. So, Jesus had to destroy the authority');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 205, 3, 23, 'that this other false ruler, the devil had over man. When Jesus died on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 205, 4, 23, 'the cross, He also defeated Satan''s power. Colossians 2:15 says He took');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 205, 5, 23, 'away his armor and all the weapons that Satan had to harm man. Hebrews');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 205, 6, 23, '2:14 says Jesus died so that He might make the devil powerless. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 205, 7, 23, 'devil is alive and is not destroyed, but his armor has been taken away');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 205, 8, 23, 'and was made powerless. Satan had the power of death, but he no longer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 205, 9, 23, 'does. It says that the power of death which the devil had up until the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 205, 10, 23, 'moment, Jesus died and broke that power. The devil has no more power');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 205, 11, 23, 'over any man who chooses to accept Christ. If you don’t accept Christ as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 205, 12, 23, 'king over your life, then the devil remains king in your life. He will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 205, 13, 23, 'have power over you, your family, your business and everything else. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 205, 14, 23, 'may not ruin your business; he may actually prosper your business so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 205, 15, 23, 'that you don’t have time for God. Satan’s aim is not to make your poor,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 205, 16, 23, 'his aim is to keep you away from God one way or the other. If he can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 205, 17, 23, 'keep you away from God by prospering your business, then he’ll prosper');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 205, 18, 23, 'your business. If he can keep you away from God by giving you plenty of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 205, 19, 23, 'good health, then he’ll allow you to have good health and never put any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 205, 20, 23, 'sickness on you because sickness tends to drive people close to God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 205, 21, 23, 'Poverty also tends to drive people close to God so don’t think the devil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 205, 22, 23, 'is going to come and make you poor or sick because he’s afraid you may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 205, 23, 23, 'turn to God. He wants to rule your life and he wants to make sure that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 205, 24, 23, 'you’ll spend eternity with him in the lake of fire. Satan’s aim is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 205, 25, 23, 'to prevent you from having a comfortable life, his aim is to prevent you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 205, 26, 23, 'from coming close to God. If you don’t choose Christ as King over your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 205, 27, 23, 'life, the devil will remain king. It is important for us to see that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 205, 28, 23, 'Jesus not only paid the punishment for our sins on the cross, but He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 206, 1, 23, 'also destroyed the devil’s power over those who choose Christ as Lord on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 206, 2, 23, 'their lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 206, 3, 23, 'In the Old Testament, you never read of anybody confronting Satan. Right');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 206, 4, 23, 'from the first righteous man Abel all the way to John the Baptist,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 206, 5, 23, 'nobody confronted Satan. All the enemies they confronted were human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 206, 6, 23, 'enemies like the Philistines, the Amorites, the Midianites etc., but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 206, 7, 23, 'moment Jesus came, you find that He is in constant confrontation with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 206, 8, 23, 'Satan. There were demon-possessed people in the synagogues who got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 206, 9, 23, 'disturbed when Jesus came. These demons sat comfortably for so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 206, 10, 23, 'years when the Pharisees were preaching but as soon as Jesus came and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 206, 11, 23, 'preached in the synagogue, those demon-possessed people suddenly got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 206, 12, 23, 'disturbed because someone had come to disturb that kingdom. These demons');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 206, 13, 23, 'knew that the Pharisees were not there to disturb that kingdom so they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 206, 14, 23, 'didn''t disturb the services when the Pharisees around but as soon as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 206, 15, 23, 'Jesus came, they would start creating a problem in the service in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 206, 16, 23, 'synagogue. You also find that every now and then, Jesus came across a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 206, 17, 23, 'demon-possessed person and He was in direct confrontation with Satan and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 206, 18, 23, 'He cast out demons. Jesus says in Matthew 12:28, “If I cast out demons');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 206, 19, 23, 'by the Spirit of God, then the kingdom of God has come upon you.” We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 206, 20, 23, 'need to recognize Jesus exercised His ministry as a man. He overcame');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 206, 21, 23, 'temptation as a man, and He exercised His ministry as a man. He cast out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 206, 22, 23, 'demons not with His inherent power as God, but with the power of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 206, 23, 23, 'Holy Spirit. Jesus was anointed with the Holy Spirit and He cast of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 206, 24, 23, 'demons with the power of the Holy Spirit and that proved that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 206, 25, 23, 'kingdom of God had come to earth. Until then, the kingdom of God had not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 206, 26, 23, 'come to earth. It was an earthly kingdom that the Israelis had in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 206, 27, 23, 'land of Canaan; they could not defeat the devil, they could only defeat');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 206, 28, 23, 'their enemies like the Canaanites and the Philistines but when Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 207, 1, 23, 'came, He brought the kingdom of God down to those who wanted it and that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 207, 2, 23, 'brought a direct conflict with the kingdom of the devil and demons were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 207, 3, 23, 'cast out by the power of the Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 207, 4, 23, 'Jesus has ascended up into heaven, but He has another body here on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 207, 5, 23, 'earth. He had a physical body in the days when He was walking in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 207, 6, 23, 'Galilee, now He has a spiritual body which is the church, the body of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 207, 7, 23, 'people who trust in Him and who have made Him Lord of their lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 207, 8, 23, 'Through this spiritual body, Christ wants to do exactly the same thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 207, 9, 23, 'that He did through His physical body— this is the ministry of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 207, 10, 23, 'church. When Luke is writing the Acts of the Apostles (Acts 1:1), he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 207, 11, 23, 'refers back to the gospel that he wrote (Gospel of Luke) and he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 207, 12, 23, 'describes the book as all that Jesus began to do and to teach. So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 207, 13, 23, 'obviously what he is writing now is all that Jesus continued to do and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 207, 14, 23, 'to teach, not in His physically body, but now with a spiritual body that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 207, 15, 23, 'is formed on the day of Pentecost. So, we can say this book called the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 207, 16, 23, 'Acts of the Apostles is the acts of Jesus Christ through His spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 207, 17, 23, 'body whereas the Gospel of Luke is the acts of Jesus Christ in His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 207, 18, 23, 'physical body. So, the Gospel of Luke is what Jesus began to do and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 207, 19, 23, 'teach and the Acts of the Apostles is what Jesus continued to do and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 207, 20, 23, 'teach. So, what does the Lord want to do through His church in relation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 207, 21, 23, 'to demons? When demons oppress people and where they come across the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 207, 22, 23, 'people of the church, those demons are to be cast out. Wherever the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 207, 23, 23, 'kingdom of God is coming, and demons come to confront that, those demons');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 207, 24, 23, 'cannot stand because Satan has been defeated on the cross. Now Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 207, 25, 23, 'doesn''t want you to know that he''s been defeated on the cross. He wants');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 207, 26, 23, 'you to think that he still has power over you, he keeps you ignorant so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 207, 27, 23, 'that he can keep you in bondage. That’s why it''s important for us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 207, 28, 23, 'know the scriptures that teach us that Satan was defeated on the cross.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 208, 1, 23, 'It says in James 4:7, “If you submit to God and then resist the devil,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 208, 2, 23, 'he will flee from you.” In other words, if my whole life is submitted to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 208, 3, 23, 'the Lord Jesus Christ under His headship and I stand against a demon or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 208, 4, 23, 'the devil in the name of Jesus Christ, he will flee if I believe that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 208, 5, 23, 'Christ defeated him on the cross and my conscience is clear. But if I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 208, 6, 23, 'have allowed sin in my life, if I allow conscious sin in any area of my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 208, 7, 23, 'life, if there is some sin that is unsettled in my life, then the devil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 208, 8, 23, 'has got a foothold in my life and I can''t resist him. If you open the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 208, 9, 23, 'door of sin in your life, the devil puts his foot through that small');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 208, 10, 23, 'opening in the door and he is in. You have no authority over the devil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 208, 11, 23, 'if your sins are not confessed and set right because then the devil got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 208, 12, 23, 'a foothold right in your heart and you can''t resist it. No matter how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 208, 13, 23, 'much you resist him and say ‘in the name of Jesus’, he will still stay');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 208, 14, 23, 'there. But if your conscience is clear and you have yielded everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 208, 15, 23, 'to Jesus, then when you resist the devil in Jesus’ name, he has to flee.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 208, 16, 23, 'Having a clear conscience means that you have settled everything with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 208, 17, 23, 'God and man, and the blood of Christ has cleansed you from all sin. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 208, 18, 23, 'means you have asked forgiveness from all those whom you hurt on earth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 208, 19, 23, 'you have returned things that you have taken wrongfully from people and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 208, 20, 23, 'set all matters right. Satan was defeated on the cross, and if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 208, 21, 23, 'believe that, and your conscience is clear, then it doesn’t matter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 208, 22, 23, 'whoever you are, even if you are the youngest believer reading this, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 208, 23, 23, 'have authority over Satan in the name of Jesus Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 208, 24, 23, 'The devil does not like to hear you telling him that he was defeated on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 208, 25, 23, 'the cross. In Revelation 12, we read about Satan coming down to earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 208, 26, 23, 'and a certain people overcoming him. We need to know how they overcame');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 208, 27, 23, 'him so we can follow their example. It says in Revelation 12:11, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 208, 28, 23, 'they overcame him by the blood of the Lamb and because of the word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 209, 1, 23, 'their testimony, and they did not love their life even when faced with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 209, 2, 23, 'death. They overcame first of all by the blood of the Jesus Christ that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 209, 3, 23, 'was shed on the cross. You cannot overcome the accusations that Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 209, 4, 23, 'puts into your mind concerning your past failure and sin except you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 209, 5, 23, 'believe that when Christ died and shed his blood, His blood atoned for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 209, 6, 23, 'all the sins you ever committed. They are gone and unless you believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 209, 7, 23, 'that you won''t be able to overcome the accusations of Satan. You can’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 209, 8, 23, 'just tell him you aren’t going to commit that sin, because you still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 209, 9, 23, 'have your past to deal with it. But the blood of Christ has cleansed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 209, 10, 23, 'you, blotted it out and you are declared righteous before God, and if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 209, 11, 23, 'you believe that, you have boldness before Satan. The other thing it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 209, 12, 23, 'says here in Revelation 12:11 is that they overcame him by the word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 209, 13, 23, 'their testimony. Now there is a place for us to give our testimony in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 209, 14, 23, 'the church before people. That is to be a witness of Christ. Jesus said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 209, 15, 23, 'we must be witnesses for Him even to the uttermost parts of the earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 209, 16, 23, 'But when we read Revelation 12:11 in its context, the word of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 209, 17, 23, 'testimony means speaking about the word of our testimony to Satan. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 209, 18, 23, 'have to tell Satan with your mouth because he can hear you. You can’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 209, 19, 23, 'speak to the devil in your thoughts because he can''t hear your thoughts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 209, 20, 23, 'Only God can hear your thoughts. Even the angels can’t hear your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 209, 21, 23, 'thoughts, your fellow human beings can''t hear your thoughts and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 209, 22, 23, 'devil can''t hear your thoughts. The demons can''t hear your thoughts when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 209, 23, 23, 'you pray in your thoughts. The devil can''t hear you if you say something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 209, 24, 23, 'to the devil in your thoughts. The devil can put thoughts into your mind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 209, 25, 23, 'just like a human being can put thoughts into your mind by saying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 209, 26, 23, 'something to you, but he cannot hear your thoughts. It is very clear in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 209, 27, 23, '1 Corinthians 2:11 that only the spirit within a man knows his thoughts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 209, 28, 23, 'God of course knows all things. He knows what a man is thinking because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 210, 1, 23, 'He looks at a man’s heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 210, 2, 23, 'So, it is important for us to speak the word of our testimony to Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 210, 3, 23, 'with our months saying, “You were defeated on the cross of Calvary”. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 210, 4, 23, 'always encourage every person whom I lead to Christ when I ask them to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 210, 5, 23, 'confess their sins and to receive Christ as their Savior and Lord, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 210, 6, 23, 'always encourage them also to speak to the devil and tell him straight');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 210, 7, 23, 'to his face that he was defeated on the cross. I remember one incident');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 210, 8, 23, 'where I was sharing with a lady who had come to our home. My wife and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 210, 9, 23, 'were sitting and talking to her and telling her to accept Christ as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 210, 10, 23, 'their Savior and then I told her say to the devil, “You were defeated on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 210, 11, 23, 'the cross.” All of a sudden, she turned around to me with a changed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 210, 12, 23, 'expression on her face and her voice changed and said, “I was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 210, 13, 23, 'defeated on the cross.” She was demon-possessed, and I never knew that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 210, 14, 23, 'When you confront a demon then you speak to the demon, so I spoke to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 210, 15, 23, 'demon inside that woman and said, “You were defeated on the cross,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 210, 16, 23, 'Satan. You demon, you were defeated on the cross. Get out of her in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 210, 17, 23, 'Jesus’ name.” And of course, demons have got to respond to the name of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 210, 18, 23, 'Jesus if you believe and you speak in faith, they go, and that demon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 210, 19, 23, 'went out immediately. Then I told this lady, now tell the devil, “You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 210, 20, 23, 'were defeated on the cross by Jesus Christ.” She said it and she was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 210, 21, 23, 'free, but that day I learned something, and that was, that the devil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 210, 22, 23, 'does not like to hear that he was defeated on the cross. Do you like to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 210, 23, 23, 'hear stories of games in which you were defeated? No. You like to hear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 210, 24, 23, 'the stories of cricket matches that you won, not cricket matches and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 210, 25, 23, 'football matches where you were defeated. Well, the devil doesn''t like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 210, 26, 23, 'to hear that either but it''s important that we tell him that; that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 210, 27, 23, 'strengthens our own life and it''s important that we teach all of God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 210, 28, 23, 'children this wonderful truth that when Jesus said on the cross, “It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 211, 1, 23, 'finished”, the devil''s kingdom was finished for those who accept it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 211, 2, 23, 'It''s not for every Tom, Dick and Harry. if you don''t submit to God, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 211, 3, 23, 'you don''t make Jesus your King, then the devil is your king. But if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 211, 4, 23, 'have decided to make Jesus the King of your life, the Lord of your life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 211, 5, 23, 'then the devil is no longer king of your life; he can be the lord of all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 211, 6, 23, 'those other people but not you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 211, 7, 23, 'You need to know your position in Christ that you can be completely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 211, 8, 23, 'free. It speaks in Hebrews 2:14 about the fear of death that the devil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 211, 9, 23, 'seeks to bring upon people. The fear of death is one of the great fears');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 211, 10, 23, 'people have and every other fear is inferior to the fear of death. All');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 211, 11, 23, 'the other fears, the fear of the future, the fear of poverty, the fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 211, 12, 23, 'of sickness, the fear of everything else comes beneath that and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 211, 13, 23, 'devil is always seeking to bring fear into your hearts so that he can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 211, 14, 23, 'control your life. If you allow fear to come in your heart concerning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 211, 15, 23, 'anything, you can be pretty sure that the devil got a little hold in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 211, 16, 23, 'your life. That’s why it''s very important that we never allow fear to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 211, 17, 23, 'come into our heart because fear is the opposite of faith. When I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 211, 18, 23, 'faith in God, that Almighty God is my Father and I believe that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 211, 19, 23, 'Christ has defeated Satan on the cross and is surrounding me and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 211, 20, 23, 'protecting me, it is impossible for me to be afraid of anything. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 211, 21, 23, 'impossible for me to have anxiety, tension, doubt concerning anything;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 211, 22, 23, 'the Lord takes care of everything. But if I allow fear to come into my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 211, 23, 23, 'heart, then the devil gets a foothold there. The Bible says here in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 211, 24, 23, 'Hebrews 2:15 that Jesus came to deliver us from fear because fear brings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 211, 25, 23, 'us into slavery. Anyone who is afraid is in slavery. What can the devil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 211, 26, 23, 'do to you if he was defeated on the cross and his armor was taken away?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 211, 27, 23, 'The devil is the greatest terrorist around. People are afraid of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 211, 28, 23, 'terrorists only because of their weapons, but if their weapons are taken');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 212, 1, 23, 'away, what can the terrorists do? They are helpless. This is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 212, 2, 23, 'position we need to see the devil in; defeated on the cross when Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 212, 3, 23, 'died and rose up triumphant over death, hell, the grave, Satan, sin;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 212, 4, 23, 'everything and He ascended up to heaven. Ephesians 1:22 says God has put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 212, 5, 23, 'everything under the feet of Jesus Christ and He’s given Christ as head');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 212, 6, 23, 'to us who are His body. And if we are the body of Christ and the devil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 212, 7, 23, 'and all demons are under the feet of Christ, then you can be pretty sure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 212, 8, 23, 'he''s under our feet because we are the body. That’s why it says in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 212, 9, 23, 'Romans 16:20 that the God of peace will soon crush Satan under your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 212, 10, 23, 'feet. He is going to be crushed; he''s already been defeated on the cross');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 212, 11, 23, '2000 years ago and now he''s going to be crushed. All his power is going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 212, 12, 23, 'to be taken away from you; he will not even be able to threaten you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 212, 13, 23, 'frighten you and do anything. He is going to be crushed, the devil''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 212, 14, 23, 'place is under our feet. That is the place that God has ordained for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 212, 15, 23, 'devil and I must keep him there; he''s not supposed to sit on my head or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 212, 16, 23, 'do anything like that to me. Take that position in Christ and you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 212, 17, 23, 'never live in fear anymore.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 212, 18, 24, 'Chapter 24 Faith Results In Praise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 212, 19, 24, 'What should be our attitude when we have recognized that Christ has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 212, 20, 24, 'finished the work of our salvation and redemption on the cross. When He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 212, 21, 24, 'said, “It is finished,” our sins were paid for completely. He paid the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 212, 22, 24, 'punishment for our sin and also Satan was defeated on that cross. What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 212, 23, 24, 'should be our attitude now? Psalm 106:12 says, “When the people believed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 212, 24, 24, 'God''s words, they sang His praise.” One of the clearest ways in which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 212, 25, 24, 'you can know that you believe what God is said is that you praise Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 212, 26, 24, 'For example, if you''re a student in a college and you need some money to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 212, 27, 24, 'pay your fees. You ring up your father and your father calls you back');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 212, 28, 24, 'and says I have transferred the amount of two thousand rupees to your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 213, 1, 24, 'account. If you believe his words, you don’t have to check your account');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 213, 2, 24, 'at all. You say, “Well, Thank God I can pay my fees. I’ve got the money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 213, 3, 24, 'to pay it.” When you believe something, the proof of it is you’re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 213, 4, 24, 'thankful. If you don’t believe, then you’re not thankful. So as long as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 213, 5, 24, 'we don’t praise God, we can be pretty sure that we haven’t believed His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 213, 6, 24, 'words. If you believe that when Christ said, “It is finished,” your sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 213, 7, 24, 'were finished and the devil’s kingdom was finished, you will praise God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 213, 8, 24, 'because it’s such a tremendous deliverance. Think if you were down with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 213, 9, 24, 'a serious case of cancer and the best doctor gave up hope, but one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 213, 10, 24, 'doctor said, “Listen, let me do some surgery and see if I can help you.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 213, 11, 24, 'After doing the surgery, the tests show that there is not a trace of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 213, 12, 24, 'cancer in your body. Are you going to be thankful or not? You are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 213, 13, 24, 'going to go back to that hospital looking miserable-unless you don’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 213, 14, 24, 'believe the doctors words. You may say, “Well, he may be just saying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 213, 15, 24, 'things to please me and it’s not true. I may still have the cancer and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 213, 16, 24, 'it may be spread all over my body and he doesn’t want to tell me the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 213, 17, 24, 'truth.” If you don’t believe his words, you will look miserable but if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 213, 18, 24, 'you believe his words, you will go out jumping for joy. If he’s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 213, 19, 24, 'truthful doctor, then he is speaking the truth and you’re free. There’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 213, 20, 24, 'a basis for your happiness now.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 213, 21, 24, 'When God says something, there is no need to doubt it at all. When He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 213, 22, 24, 'says, “Your sins and iniquities, I’ll remember no more,” He means it. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 213, 23, 24, 'will not remember our sins and iniquities anymore. When He says that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 213, 24, 24, 'devil’s power has been defeated so that you don’t have to live in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 213, 25, 24, 'slavery to fear anymore, we believe it. Praise is a very important part');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 213, 26, 24, 'in our deliverance. It’s important that God wants us to express our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 213, 27, 24, 'faith with our words. Faith is not found in the words, but we have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 213, 28, 24, 'express it. In Romans 10:9, it says that “If you confess with your mouth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 214, 1, 24, 'Jesus as Lord and believe in your heart that God raised Him from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 214, 2, 24, 'dead, you will be saved…” Deliverance or salvation comes through faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 214, 3, 24, 'in the heart. Faith is not in the mouth. Faith is in the heart and we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 214, 4, 24, 'confess it with our mouths. So, because we believe in our hearts the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 214, 5, 24, 'truth of God’s word, we tell the devil that he has been defeated on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 214, 6, 24, 'cross. We testify to the devil and say to him, “the blood of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 214, 7, 24, 'Christ has cleansed me from all sins.” We are only following the example');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 214, 8, 24, 'of Jesus Christ Himself. When the devil came to Him with temptation,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 214, 9, 24, 'Jesus spoke a word to Him. He didn’t just think a thought, He spoke a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 214, 10, 24, 'word and said to Satan, “it is written.” When the devil came a second');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 214, 11, 24, 'time to tempt Him again, Jesus said again that, “it is written.” He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 214, 12, 24, 'spoke a word and it was that spoken word that drove the devil away. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 214, 13, 24, 'Satan came a third time, Jesus said the same thing, “it is written…get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 214, 14, 24, 'behind me Satan” (Matthew 4:10). That is the example we need to follow.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 214, 15, 24, 'Jesus spoke from His mouth what He believed in His heart; what is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 214, 16, 24, 'promised in the word of God. Now we can’t say something with our mouth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 214, 17, 24, 'which is not promised in the Bible. I may like to have a head full of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 214, 18, 24, 'hair, but there is no promise for that in the Word. So, I can’t confess');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 214, 19, 24, 'that I will get it. One day when Christ returns, I will have my hair');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 214, 20, 24, 'back, but not before, since there’s is no promise in the Word. Likewise,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 214, 21, 24, 'there isn’t a word that God will give me a bigger house or a better car');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 214, 22, 24, 'or something like that. I can’t confess these things. There is this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 214, 23, 24, 'new-age teaching where you visualize something, and you pretend that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 214, 24, 24, 'you’re going to get it. They say shut your eyes and imagine that you got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 214, 25, 24, 'it and then say what is your heart’s desire (mostly for material');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 214, 26, 24, 'things). This is the false gospel being preached today telling you to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 214, 27, 24, 'that. You won''t find any of the apostles or Jesus teaching that. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 214, 28, 24, 'false gospel is to satisfy covetous people who love material things and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 215, 1, 24, 'whose kingdom is of the earth. Those who have come into the kingdom of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 215, 2, 24, 'God know that if they seek God''s kingdom first and His righteousness,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 215, 3, 24, 'all these other material things God will add them without them having to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 215, 4, 24, 'confess anything (Matthew 5:33).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 215, 5, 24, 'We need to confess to the devil that he has been defeated on the cross.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 215, 6, 24, 'Our warfare is not with flesh and blood, but with principalities and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 215, 7, 24, 'powers. We praise God for that which He has done and if God has said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 215, 8, 24, 'that He will do something, we can praise Him for that too. It’s very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 215, 9, 24, 'important that we don’t go around confessing lies thinking that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 215, 10, 24, 'faith. That is another type of teaching going on today where people are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 215, 11, 24, 'asked to confess something which is not true. In Mark 8:22, we read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 215, 12, 24, 'about a blind man who has brought to Jesus at Bethsaida. Jesus took the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 215, 13, 24, 'blind man outside the village to heal him. He normally never did that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 215, 14, 24, 'and would pray for the person right there, but this was such an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 215, 15, 24, 'unbelieving atmosphere in the village that He took the man right outside');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 215, 16, 24, 'the village and then He spat on his eyes and laid His hands on him. Then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 215, 17, 24, 'Jesus asked him, “Do you see anything?” And he looked up and said, “I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 215, 18, 24, 'see men, for I see them like trees, walking around.” Now if it were one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 215, 19, 24, 'of today’s preachers, he would have told this man, “No, no, you must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 215, 20, 24, 'confess that you are healed. We prayed for you, just confess that ‘by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 215, 21, 24, 'His stripes you are healed’. Just say I can see everything perfectly and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 215, 22, 24, 'then everything will be perfect.” But that’s not what Jesus said. How');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 215, 23, 24, 'could Jesus ask a man to tell a lie but that’s what a lot of preachers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 215, 24, 24, 'tell you to say. They ask you to tell a lie that you are healed, and you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 215, 25, 24, 'are still sick. Jesus never taught that. When this man could not see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 215, 26, 24, 'properly, Jesus wanted him to be honest and Jesus appreciated that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 215, 27, 24, 'honestly. Jesus laid His hands on his eyes; and he looked intently and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 215, 28, 24, 'was restored. This is the one time we read of a two-step healing in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 216, 1, 24, 'Jesus’ ministry. Why did Jesus Christ need to lay his hands upon a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 216, 2, 24, 'person a second time to heal that person? I believe he did that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 216, 3, 24, 'deliberately to teach us in the 21st century that we shouldn''t believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 216, 4, 24, 'this type of deception. This one incident is written in Scripture to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 216, 5, 24, 'teach us that you don''t have to confess that you can see when you cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 216, 6, 24, 'see. You don''t have to confess that you can see clearly when you cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 216, 7, 24, 'see clearly. You don''t have to confess that you''re healed when you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 216, 8, 24, 'sick. You don''t have to confess that you are fully healed when you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 216, 9, 24, 'only partially healed. This guy was certainly partially healed. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 216, 10, 24, 'wasn''t fully healed. Why should he confess that he''s fully healed when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 216, 11, 24, 'he was only partially healed? He spoke the truth and I want to say to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 216, 12, 24, 'you in Jesus’ name, don''t let any preacher tell you that you got to tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 216, 13, 24, 'a lie. God hates lies; all liars go to hell (Revelation 22:15). If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 216, 14, 24, 'you''re going to tell a lie that you''re healed when you''re sick, God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 216, 15, 24, 'not going to appreciate it. The devil will certainly appreciate that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 216, 16, 24, 'because the devil is the father of all lies (John 8:44). This man was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 216, 17, 24, 'certainly not going to let the devil tell a lie through him. He spoke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 216, 18, 24, 'the truth and because he spoke the truth, the Lord touched him a second');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 216, 19, 24, 'time. Now it''s very easy for us to be deceived in this area by people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 216, 20, 24, 'quoting all types of scripture. Some misquote Abraham and say that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 216, 21, 24, 'should follow his example. Abraham believed he was going to have a son,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 216, 22, 24, 'but he did not get up and confess he had a son when he didn’t have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 216, 23, 24, 'son. That would be a lie. When Isaac was not born, he did not say I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 216, 24, 24, 'got Isaac. No, he believed that one day, God would give Isaac, but he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 216, 25, 24, 'didn’t confess a lie. It''s very important that we understand what faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 216, 26, 24, 'is. Faith is not confessing a lie. Remember that this man did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 216, 27, 24, 'confess a lie and that''s why he got a complete healing. He came to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 216, 28, 24, 'Lord a second time and the Lord touched him and then he began to see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 217, 1, 24, 'everything clearly. So, that is the word of caution in the midst of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 217, 2, 24, 'lot of preaching about faith that''s going on today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 217, 3, 24, 'I want to show you an Old Testament classic example about the power of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 217, 4, 24, 'praise. In 2 Chronicles 20, we read of the story of king Jehoshaphat');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 217, 5, 24, 'when enemies of Judah came to attack it. It’s a great story which we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 217, 6, 24, 'learn a spiritual lesson from. When King Jehoshaphat heard that news');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 217, 7, 24, 'that a great multitude was coming against him to fight Judah, he was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 217, 8, 24, 'afraid and sought the Lord which is the right thing to do. He turned his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 217, 9, 24, 'attention to seek the Lord and proclaimed a fast throughout the land.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 217, 10, 24, 'It’s a very good thing to fast and seek the Lord when something serious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 217, 11, 24, 'happens in your life. When you have a problem or many problems and they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 217, 12, 24, 'all seem to come together against you, seek the Lord with prayer and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 217, 13, 24, 'fasting. So, he gathered other people together and they began to seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 217, 14, 24, 'the Lord. He prayed and confessed with his mouth the truths of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 217, 15, 24, 'scripture; how God had made a covenant with them and finally they stood');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 217, 16, 24, 'before the Lord and said these three things which we also can confess in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 217, 17, 24, 'a difficult situation (2 Chronicles 20:12)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 217, 18, 24, 'In every situation where you find yourself in a tight corner, you need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 217, 19, 24, 'to confess those three things to the Lord; I don''t have strength to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 217, 20, 24, 'handle this, I don''t have wisdom to know what to do in this situation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 217, 21, 24, 'but I''m trusting you. That last statement is very important and then it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 217, 22, 24, 'says the Lord sent a message. In those days it was through a prophet and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 217, 23, 24, 'the Lord sent a message when the Spirit of the Lord came upon one of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 217, 24, 24, 'prophets there and he said, “Don''t be afraid, the battle is not yours');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 217, 25, 24, 'but God’s. You don''t need to fight in this battle at all. The Lord will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 217, 26, 24, 'fight for you. Go out tomorrow and believe in the Lord and He will fight');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 217, 27, 24, 'for you.” That''s all and Jehoshaphat did not look at the big army and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 217, 28, 24, 'doubt the word of the Lord. It doesn’t matter how big the problem is,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 218, 1, 24, 'the Lord is on your side against the enemy, the Lord is on your side');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 218, 2, 24, 'against the devil. So, Jehoshaphat bowed down and worshiped the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 218, 3, 24, 'The next day, instead of sending solders in the front of the army to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 218, 4, 24, 'fight against the enemy, it says that he appointed people right in front');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 218, 5, 24, 'of the army to praise the Lord. He put people right up in front who went');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 218, 6, 24, 'forward praising the Lord saying, “Glory to God and give thanks to Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 218, 7, 24, 'became His lovingkindness is everlasting.” Previously, they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 218, 8, 24, 'praying. When God spoke an answer to that prayer then they started');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 218, 9, 24, 'praising. When they believed the words of God, they praised Him. So, as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 218, 10, 24, 'soon as they began singing and praising, the Lord defeated all those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 218, 11, 24, 'enemies and they got the wealth of their enemies and they became rich.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 218, 12, 24, 'This is the principle we need to learn. They got victory not through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 218, 13, 24, 'fighting but through praising the Lord because they believed what God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 218, 14, 24, 'had spoken. If God has not spoken, then of course we cannot believe. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 218, 15, 24, 'when the Lord tells us the devil has been defeated, and we believe that,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 218, 16, 24, 'then we praise the Lord for that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 218, 17, 24, 'We cannot believe where the Lord has not spoken. When the Lord had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 218, 18, 24, 'spoken and told Abraham, “You''ll have a son,” then you can believe. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 218, 19, 24, 'if the Lord has not told you that and you''re a barren woman, you can''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 218, 20, 24, 'believe that. We can''t just shut our eyes and visualize and believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 218, 21, 24, 'whatever we want. That''s what a lot of people are teaching today and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 218, 22, 24, 'that''s not Scripture. Faith comes by hearing and hearing by the word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 218, 23, 24, 'Christ (Romans 10:7). The Lord has to speak a word before we can have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 218, 24, 24, 'faith. There can be verses in Scripture but for you to have faith in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 218, 25, 24, 'that, it has to become living to you. There are multitudes of people who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 218, 26, 24, 'believe in their head that Christ died for their sins, but majority of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 218, 27, 24, 'them are not born again. They are what we call nominal Christians. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 218, 28, 24, 'believe in their heads that Christ died for their sins and rose from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 219, 1, 24, 'dead, but 90% of them are not born again. They believe what’s written');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 219, 2, 24, 'but it has not produced faith in their hearts. In the same way, somebody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 219, 3, 24, 'can quote a scripture to you, but if it has not brought faith in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 219, 4, 24, 'heart, you cannot act on that. Don''t be deceived in this area. You can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 219, 5, 24, 'act on the word that has brought faith in your heart. You praise the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 219, 6, 24, 'Lord and the proof of it will be the results. If the result doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 219, 7, 24, 'come, then obviously you didn''t have faith; it''s just your imagination');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 219, 8, 24, 'or your visualization. So many people are being thoroughly deceived by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 219, 9, 24, 'this today in the name of faith. That''s not faith, that is imagination,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 219, 10, 24, 'it''s presumption. The devil tries to fool people like that; he even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 219, 11, 24, 'tried to fool Jesus by saying, “it''s written, have faith in this. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 219, 12, 24, 'will give His angels charge over you to keep you from dashing your foot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 219, 13, 24, 'against the stones,” but Jesus wouldn''t jump. That wouldn''t have been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 219, 14, 24, 'faith, that would have been presumption. If He had jumped, no angel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 219, 15, 24, 'would have protected Him. He''d have fallen down and broken his legs, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 219, 16, 24, 'He didn’t listen to the devil. Don''t you listen to the devil either,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 219, 17, 24, 'even if he comes through a preacher telling you to believe some word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 219, 18, 24, 'Scripture without seeing other scriptures that balance out. That''s why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 219, 19, 24, 'Jesus said, “It''s also written. Don''t tempt the Lord your God.” That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 219, 20, 24, 'a word that many Christians need to hear today. Do not tempt the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 219, 21, 24, 'your God by doing stupid things in the name of faith and saying I trust');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 219, 22, 24, 'God and I''m going to praise Him. Faith is not a technique, praising God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 219, 23, 24, 'is not a technique. Praising God is the result of a genuine faith that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 219, 24, 24, 'born in our heart on the basis of what God has spoken and what God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 219, 25, 24, 'done. Certainly, we can praise God for things which are definitely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 219, 26, 24, 'written in Scripture like our sins are forgiven, the devil has been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 219, 27, 24, 'defeated. These things are clear.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 219, 28, 24, 'Let me show you another example in the Book of Jonah. Jonah was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 220, 1, 24, 'prophet who ran away when God wanted him to go to Nineveh. He ran away');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 220, 2, 24, 'and when he got into a boat to go in another direction, there was a big');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 220, 3, 24, 'storm and the people realized that Jonah was the cause of it, and they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 220, 4, 24, 'threw him overboard. When he was thrown overboard, God cared for him and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 220, 5, 24, 'arranged for a big fish to swallow him and Jonah was in the stomach of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 220, 6, 24, 'this fish for three days and three nights (Jonah 1:17). Now what was he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 220, 7, 24, 'doing for three days and three nights? I have a feeling that he was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 220, 8, 24, 'trying to crawl out of the fish''s belly. He tried and tried for three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 220, 9, 24, 'days and three nights without success. Then after three days and three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 220, 10, 24, 'nights of trying, he began to pray. He didn’t pray for three days and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 220, 11, 24, 'nights but only after. That’s usually our way too. We get into a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 220, 12, 24, 'difficult situation (fish’s belly), every often due to our own sin or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 220, 13, 24, 'foolishness like Jonah and we try for days on end to get out of it and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 220, 14, 24, 'we are not able to get out of it. Then finally as a last resort, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 220, 15, 24, 'pray. That’s what Jonah did. He prayed and nothing happened. So, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 220, 16, 24, 'continued praying (verse 2-6) and finally he stopped praying and he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 220, 17, 24, 'started thanking the Lord. He said, “I will sacrifice to You with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 220, 18, 24, 'voice of thanksgiving. That which I have vowed I will pay. Salvation is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 220, 19, 24, 'from the Lord.” His attitude was that one of praise regardless of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 220, 20, 24, 'circumstance because God was on the throne. Then the Lord commanded the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 220, 21, 24, 'fish and he vomited him up. Lord said, “this man started praising Me,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 220, 22, 24, 'send him out.” He got delivered when he started praising.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 220, 23, 24, 'Psalm 50:23 says, “He who offers a sacrifice of thanksgiving honors Me;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 220, 24, 24, 'and to him who orders his way aright, I shall show the salvation of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 220, 25, 24, 'God.” Another paraphrase of that verse reads, “The one who offers a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 220, 26, 24, 'sacrifice of thanksgiving thereby makes a way for Me to show him My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 220, 27, 24, 'deliverance or salvation from that situation.” A sacrifice is something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 220, 28, 24, 'painful. We can praise God when things are going smoothly, that''s easy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 221, 1, 24, 'and that''s not a sacrifice of thanksgiving. A sacrifice of thanksgiving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 221, 2, 24, 'is when praise Him for He is on the throne despite the problem not being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 221, 3, 24, 'solved. There are a lot of things we can praise God for even if a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 221, 4, 24, 'problem is not solved. I don''t have to tell a lie and say, “God, thank');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 221, 5, 24, 'you for solving the problem” when the problem is still there. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 221, 6, 24, 'enemies are still there, but you''ve set a table before me in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 221, 7, 24, 'presence of my enemies (Psalm 23:5). I don''t pretend they''re not there,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 221, 8, 24, 'but I praise the Lord because He''s on the throne, the devil''s been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 221, 9, 24, 'defeated, my sins are forgiven, all things work together for good to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 221, 10, 24, 'those who love God, He will not allow me to be tempted beyond my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 221, 11, 24, 'ability. All these things are true even though the problem is still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 221, 12, 24, 'there. I don''t have to confess a lie, but I can praise God for those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 221, 13, 24, 'eternal truths which never change. It''s painful for me to confess these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 221, 14, 24, 'eternal truths; it''s a sacrifice because I''m facing problems. My enemies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 221, 15, 24, 'are still there, but I believe the Lord set a table before me in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 221, 16, 24, 'presence of my enemies and I praise God. And when I do that, God makes a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 221, 17, 24, 'way for me to come out of that. That is how we can be free from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 221, 18, 24, 'discouragement. You need never be discouraged if you learn in those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 221, 19, 24, 'situations to thank God and praise Him for the truths that never change');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 221, 20, 24, 'like God is on the throne. He is still on the throne, all authority in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 221, 21, 24, 'heaven and earth belong to Christ, Satan''s been defeated, your sins are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 221, 22, 24, 'forgiven, He will not allow you to be tested beyond your ability etc.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 221, 23, 24, 'Think of the life we can live of overcoming if we will praise Him in all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 221, 24, 24, 'situations.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 221, 25, 25, 'Chapter 25 The New Covenant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 221, 26, 25, 'We want to look at something that Jesus established through His death');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 221, 27, 25, 'and resurrection and that is what the Bible calls the New Covenant. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 221, 28, 25, 'Hebrews 13, we read that the blood He shed on the cross is called the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 222, 1, 25, 'blood of the eternal covenant. Covenant is a word which means an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 222, 2, 25, 'agreement. The Bible is divided into two testaments; Old Testament and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 222, 3, 25, 'the New Testament. The Old Testament is the old agreement God made with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 222, 4, 25, 'man and the New Testament is the new agreement God made with man. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 222, 5, 25, 'Old Testament refers to history from the time of creation right up to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 222, 6, 25, 'the end of the period just before Christ comes. The New Testament begins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 222, 7, 25, 'with the birth of Christ and thereafter. It is divided like this because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 222, 8, 25, 'in the Old Testament, for 1,500 years before Christ, God dealt with man,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 222, 9, 25, 'particularly the nation of Israel on the basis of what is called the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 222, 10, 25, 'Covenant or Old Agreement.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 222, 11, 25, 'That agreement was basically God giving the nation of Israel a number of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 222, 12, 25, 'commandments and if they obeyed them, He blessed them, their families,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 222, 13, 25, 'their business and their nation. If they didn’t obey His commandments,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 222, 14, 25, 'then He punished them, allowed sickness into their land, famine and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 222, 15, 25, 'other nations to rule over them. This agreement is described more fully');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 222, 16, 25, 'in Deuteronomy 28. There, we read of two sections of the agreement. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 222, 17, 25, 'first section (verses 1-14), the Lord told them if they obeyed His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 222, 18, 25, 'commandments, He will set them high above all the other nations of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 222, 19, 25, 'earth and He will bless them. Some of the blessings included blessings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 222, 20, 25, 'in city, in the country, their enemies will be defeated, the offspring');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 222, 21, 25, 'of their body and the produce of their ground and the offspring of their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 222, 22, 25, 'animals will be blessed, blessings of their fields, barns and rain in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 222, 23, 25, 'its season, the work of their hands will be blessed and they will never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 222, 24, 25, 'be in debt and have plenty of money to lend to others. It was a promise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 222, 25, 25, 'of material earthy prosperity; physical health and healing if they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 222, 26, 25, 'obeyed God’s commandments. On the other hand, if they didn’t obey His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 222, 27, 25, 'word, then they were going to suffer a long list of punishments (verses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 222, 28, 25, '15-68). That is a total of 54 verses of all types of punishment and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 223, 1, 25, 'problems they would face if they disobeyed God. It is very similar to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 223, 2, 25, 'the way we make our children obey us. I call it “the chocolate and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 223, 3, 25, 'stick” method. We promise them, if you obey us as your parents, we’ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 223, 4, 25, 'give you a reward. I will buy something for you or take you out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 223, 5, 25, 'somewhere. But if you don’t obey me, I’ll punish you and will use the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 223, 6, 25, 'stick on you. That’s how we bring up our children everywhere because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 223, 7, 25, 'they respond well to the threat of punishment or the hope of a reward.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 223, 8, 25, 'Now we don’t expect our 25-year-old son or daughter to respect and obey');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 223, 9, 25, 'us out of the threat of punishment or the hope of reward. We want them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 223, 10, 25, 'to obey us because they love us and know that our commandments are for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 223, 11, 25, 'their good. That is the difference between the old agreement and the new');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 223, 12, 25, 'agreement. In the old agreement, God treated people like little children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 223, 13, 25, 'who didn’t have a sense of responsibility or understanding of what was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 223, 14, 25, 'good from them. Every commandment a good parent tells their child is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 223, 15, 25, 'good for that child, but the child doesn’t know that and that’s why the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 223, 16, 25, 'child is hesitant to obey. Once the child knows that what the parents');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 223, 17, 25, 'say is good, he or she will have no hesitation to obey.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 223, 18, 25, 'In the old covenant, man did not have an understanding that whatever God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 223, 19, 25, 'said was good for him. So, we find throughout the Old Testament period,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 223, 20, 25, 'Israel constantly disobeyed God. Even when the Lord told them not to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 223, 21, 25, 'have any idols because He was their God and they shouldn’t represent Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 223, 22, 25, 'with any physical object, they still went around worshipping idols and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 223, 23, 25, 'making physical objects and imagining that there were many gods up there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 223, 24, 25, 'running the universe. They were punished and suffered the consequences');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 223, 25, 25, 'of their disobedience. The Bible describes all those 1500 years as the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 223, 26, 25, 'law. All the law did was reveal to man his sin and his inability to live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 223, 27, 25, 'up to God’s standards and that was necessary. We need to learn our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 223, 28, 25, 'inability to live up to God’s standards before we can enter into the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 224, 1, 25, 'Covenant where we can live up to those standards. One of the most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 224, 2, 25, 'difficult things for God to do is shatter our confidence in ourselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 224, 3, 25, 'One of the rites that God gave Abraham in the Old Testament is the rite');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 224, 4, 25, 'of circumcision. He told Abraham that all the males must be circumcised');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 224, 5, 25, 'and that is the sign of the covenant between me and your children.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 224, 6, 25, 'Everything that God does has a meaning. Circumcision was the cutting off');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 224, 7, 25, 'of the flesh and casting it off and it symbolized a casting off of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 224, 8, 25, 'confidence in the flesh or confidence in our own ability (Phil 3:3).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 224, 9, 25, 'That is the place to which God wants to bring us; the casting off of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 224, 10, 25, 'confidence in our own ability. He wants to show us that within');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 224, 11, 25, 'ourselves, we are incapable of obeying his commandments then only we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 224, 12, 25, 'will come to Him and ask Him to help us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 224, 13, 25, 'Many of the miracles that Jesus did was to demonstrate this truth. For');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 224, 14, 25, 'example, the disciples spending a whole night once trying to catch fish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 224, 15, 25, 'and not able to catch it. What was He trying to teach them? Their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 224, 16, 25, 'inability to do things apart from Him and if they would depend on Him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 224, 17, 25, 'the problem would be solved. That’s what we see at the end of that story');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 224, 18, 25, 'in John 21 that when the Lord came and told them what to do, immediately');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 224, 19, 25, 'their boat is full of fish. One of the great lessons that Jesus tried to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 224, 20, 25, 'teach His disciples through all those years that He was with them was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 224, 21, 25, 'the simple truth, “Without me, you can do nothing. They could do nothing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 224, 22, 25, 'without Him and if they learned that lesson, they were spiritually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 224, 23, 25, 'circumcised. Then they would lean upon God. The New Testament speaks a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 224, 24, 25, 'lot about faith. Faith is actually just a life of dependence on God. I’m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 224, 25, 25, 'trusting God to do the work in me and that is the life to which God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 224, 26, 25, 'wants to lead every one of us- a life of faith, a life of dependence');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 224, 27, 25, 'upon God. To bring us to that place, He has to first show us a total');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 224, 28, 25, 'inability to be able to live up to his standards. We may live up to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 225, 1, 25, 'human standards but completely come short of God''s standards. God kept');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 225, 2, 25, 'Israel under the law for 1500 years and the end result of that was they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 225, 3, 25, 'discovered they could not come up to God’s standards. That is why it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 225, 4, 25, 'says in Romans 3:23, “All have come short of the glory of God.” Every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 225, 5, 25, 'single human being has come short of God’s standard and that’s why we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 225, 6, 25, 'need salvation freely through the death of Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 225, 7, 25, 'In the New Covenant, the new agreement which Jesus arranged between God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 225, 8, 25, 'and man is completely different and is based on better promises. First,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 225, 9, 25, 'Jesus is called a mediator between God and man; He is the one who stands');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 225, 10, 25, 'between God and man (1 Timothy 2:5). This new agreement is not like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 225, 11, 25, 'old where it was based on the threat of punishment or the hope of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 225, 12, 25, 'reward. Jesus isn’t saying “I will bless you if you obey Me and punish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 225, 13, 25, 'you if you don’t.” This new agreement that we read in Hebrews 8:10-12 is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 225, 14, 25, 'based on better promises. Here they are:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 225, 15, 25, 'I WILL BE MERCIFUL TO ALL THIER INIQUITIES AND WILL REMEMBER THIER SINS');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 225, 16, 25, 'NO MORE');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 225, 17, 25, 'We need to start there because all of us have committed a lot of crimes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 225, 18, 25, 'We are guilty of a lot of wrong things and we want to have it all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 225, 19, 25, 'cleansed and removed and forgiven. That is our first and basic need. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 225, 20, 25, 'the Old Covenant, there was no removal of sin like that. Sin was covered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 225, 21, 25, 'in the Old Testament times (Psalm 32:1). Now that Jesus has shed His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 225, 22, 25, 'blood, all of our sins are permanently blotted out and there is no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 225, 23, 25, 'memory of it anymore if we confess our sins. That is one of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 225, 24, 25, 'wonderful blessings of the New Covenant, we don’t have to live a single');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 225, 25, 25, 'moment with a guilt of the past weighing upon our minds. Not even for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 225, 26, 25, 'moment because the Lord says, “I will not remember it anymore.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 225, 27, 25, 'THEY WILL NOT TEACH EVERYONE HIS FELLOW CITIZEN AND EVERYONE HIS BROTHER');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 225, 28, 25, 'SAYING “KNOW THE LORD”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 226, 1, 25, 'The second thing which the Lord says here in the New Covenant is they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 226, 2, 25, 'will not teach everyone his fellow citizen, and everyone his brother');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 226, 3, 25, 'saying “know the Lord” like it was in the Old Covenant because all shall');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 226, 4, 25, 'know Me personally, from the least to the greatest. In the Old Covenant,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 226, 5, 25, 'the Holy Spirit was not indwelling each person, but came upon only a few');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 226, 6, 25, 'prophets. If anybody wanted to know something about the Lord or know the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 226, 7, 25, 'will of God, they had to go to that prophet and find out from him what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 226, 8, 25, 'God wanted them to do. They couldn’t find out themselves, they had to go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 226, 9, 25, 'to the prophet and find out. The prophet would find out because the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 226, 10, 25, 'Spirit was upon him so he could communicate with God and tell others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 226, 11, 25, 'They were dependent on someone else to communicate God''s will to them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 226, 12, 25, 'They could not go to God directly but that''s all changed in the new');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 226, 13, 25, 'agreement. In the New Covenant, they will not have to teach their each');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 226, 14, 25, 'one their fellow citizen or their brothers saying “know the Lord”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 226, 15, 25, 'because all shall know me personally from the least to the greatest.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 226, 16, 25, 'That means the godly person who has been walking with God for 50 years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 226, 17, 25, 'and the newly born-again believer can know Him. The relationship now in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 226, 18, 25, 'the New Covenant like a father and his children unlike in the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 226, 19, 25, 'Covenant where it was like a multitude of servants and a master. That’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 226, 20, 25, 'a very big difference.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 226, 21, 25, 'In the Old Covenant, the relationship between the Israelites and God was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 226, 22, 25, 'like servants to a master. Something like if you''re a factory worker you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 226, 23, 25, 'could work a whole lifetime in a factory and never once meet the chief');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 226, 24, 25, 'executive officer (CEO). It''s only those who are senior workers like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 226, 25, 25, 'vice-president of the company or general manager who can contact the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 226, 26, 25, 'chief executive (CEO). The junior workers can only send a message across');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 226, 27, 25, 'to the top boss through someone else, they couldn’t talk to him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 226, 28, 25, 'directly. But it''s different for a child, the moment he is born, he has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 227, 1, 25, 'a relationship with the father. He can talk to the father every day. No');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 227, 2, 25, 'longer does God want us to have a relationship with Him where He is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 227, 3, 25, 'master and we are servants, but like children to a father. In a home,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 227, 4, 25, 'the youngest child and the oldest child have equal access to the father.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 227, 5, 25, 'Notice the order in verse 11, it says from the least to the greatest. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 227, 6, 25, 'the factory, the order is from the greatest to the least. Why the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 227, 7, 25, 'difference? Because in a home, parents generally tend to pay more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 227, 8, 25, 'attention to the smaller children more than the older ones. The older');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 227, 9, 25, 'ones can take care of themselves and if a ten-year-old wants to talk and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 227, 10, 25, 'a two-year-old wants to talk to his dad, it’s more likely that the dad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 227, 11, 25, 'would first let the 2-year-old talk and then later on listen to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 227, 12, 25, '10-year-old. It''s from the least to the greatest which is the exact');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 227, 13, 25, 'opposite of the factory.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 227, 14, 25, 'This is the New Covenant, it''s so much more wonderful to have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 227, 15, 25, 'relationship with God which is like a child to a father. Now many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 227, 16, 25, 'Christians do not enter into this relationship even though it is their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 227, 17, 25, 'privilege because the devil has kept them ignorant about the terms of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 227, 18, 25, 'the New Covenant just like many Christians live with a tremendous sense');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 227, 19, 25, 'of guilt which is unnecessary if you have confessed your sin. Jesus has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 227, 20, 25, 'removed it, for He says, “I will not remember your sin anymore.” But if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 227, 21, 25, 'you don''t believe that then you live with your guilt. In the same way,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 227, 22, 25, 'the second condition of the New Covenant is also something which many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 227, 23, 25, 'Christians don''t seem to live in because when they feel God won’t speak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 227, 24, 25, 'to them because of their spiritual age when they want to find His will.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 227, 25, 25, 'Can’t a two-year-old ask his dad what his dad wants him to do and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 227, 26, 25, 'wouldn’t the dad talk to a two-year-old son or daughter? He certainly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 227, 27, 25, 'will because he loves that two-year-old son and daughter and will answer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 227, 28, 25, 'him or her. This is the faith we need to have when we go to God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 228, 1, 25, 'Christians whether old or young should not go to a pastor or a prophet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 228, 2, 25, 'to find God’s will for their lives. That is going back to the old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 228, 3, 25, 'agreement and it will seriously handicap your Christian life. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 228, 4, 25, 'the reason many Christians don’t grow, because they don’t go to God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 228, 5, 25, 'directly. Jesus is the only mediator between God and men, so you can go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 228, 6, 25, 'to the Father through Him (1 Timothy 2:4-5). Jesus Christ doesn’t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 228, 7, 25, 'any secretaries; you never read of anyone in the Bible that someone met');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 228, 8, 25, 'Jesus through a secretary. He was the most important person on earth at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 228, 9, 25, 'that time in God’s eyes and He had the most important ministry that any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 228, 10, 25, 'human being has ever had and yet He never had a secretary. There are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 228, 11, 25, 'Christians who have less than 1% of His ministry who have secretaries to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 228, 12, 25, 'keep people away from them. It’s one thing to have someone to help you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 228, 13, 25, 'with your work by distributing the work and delegating it, but Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 228, 14, 25, 'Christ was accessible. A lot of Christian workers today are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 228, 15, 25, 'inaccessible; they''re not like Christ. Christ is accessible to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 228, 16, 25, 'everybody.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 228, 17, 25, 'Some Christians make the excuse of saying, “Well, I’m so busy in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 228, 18, 25, 'ministry.” Well, you can’t be busier than Jesus Christ, can you? He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 228, 19, 25, 'accessible and even today He is accessible; you don''t have to go to Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 228, 20, 25, 'through a pastor or through His mother or through anybody. You go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 228, 21, 25, 'directly to Him and He reveals the Father to you directly even if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 228, 22, 25, 'are a newborn Christian. If you accepted Christ today, you can go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 228, 23, 25, 'directly to your Father. This is a tremendous privilege and if you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 228, 24, 25, 'live according to this privilege, you will be manipulated and exploited');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 228, 25, 25, 'by so-called prophets and pastors who just take advantage of your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 228, 26, 25, 'ignorance. They will tell you, “We’ll find out God''s will for you.” It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 228, 27, 25, 'a lot of rubbish that somebody else will find out God’s will for you in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 228, 28, 25, 'the New Covenant. You may say then, “Why has God appointed shepherds and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 229, 1, 25, 'teachers and evangelists?” That is to fulfill a ministry. Even though');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 229, 2, 25, 'you can come to God directly, it doesn’t mean that you know everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 229, 3, 25, 'in the Bible. God appoints teachers to teach us what is in the Bible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 229, 4, 25, 'Till the end of the church age, there will be teachers, evangelists,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 229, 5, 25, 'shepherds to care for the little ones but everyone can access God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 229, 6, 25, 'directly through Jesus Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 229, 7, 25, 'I WILL PUT MY LAWS INTO THIER MINDS AND I WILL WRITE THEM UPON THIER');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 229, 8, 25, 'HEARTS.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 229, 9, 25, 'The third term of the New Covenant, the Lord promises to put His laws');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 229, 10, 25, 'into our minds and write them upon our hearts. In the Old Testament, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 229, 11, 25, 'wrote those laws on tablets of stone. It was outside of man, he looked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 229, 12, 25, 'at it and tried to keep but couldn’t keep it. They couldn''t keep the Ten');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 229, 13, 25, 'Commandments. There is not a man in the history of the world who''s been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 229, 14, 25, 'able to keep all Ten Commandments, particularly the tenth one which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 229, 15, 25, 'said, “You shall not lust or covet or desire.” Nobody could keep it, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 229, 16, 25, 'now God doesn’t give us a list of commandments to keep. He says, “I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 229, 17, 25, 'Myself will put My laws into your mind and write them in your heart.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 229, 18, 25, 'The meaning is I will give you a knowledge of My will in your mind and a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 229, 19, 25, 'desire to do it. He is going to give us a mind that wants to do God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 229, 20, 25, 'will. God is going to write His laws in our minds so that we will know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 229, 21, 25, 'what He wants us to do and give us a desire to accomplish it. Next, He’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 229, 22, 25, 'going to write it in my heart. That means He''s going to give me the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 229, 23, 25, 'ability to do His will. I don''t need only the desire, I need the ability');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 229, 24, 25, 'after He has given me the knowledge of God''s will. I need to have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 229, 25, 25, 'desire to do it and I need the ability to do it so God says,” I’ll take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 229, 26, 25, 'care of all that; I''ll give you a knowledge of My will, a desire to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 229, 27, 25, 'it, and I will give you the ability to do it.” That is the New Covenant.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 229, 28, 25, 'In the Old Covenant, there was no such promise. God just gave them a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 230, 1, 25, 'list of commandments and told them to keep it. They could know His will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 230, 2, 25, 'and some of them had a desire. But even those who had a desire couldn’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 230, 3, 25, 'keep His commandments. For example, David said in Psalm 40:8, “I delight');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 230, 4, 25, 'to do thy will, O my God; Your Law is within my heart.” In the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 230, 5, 25, 'Covenant, the same quotation is slightly different. The same quotation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 230, 6, 25, 'in Hebrews 10:7 and 9 says, “I come to do thy will, O God.” There is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 230, 7, 25, 'difference between saying “I delight to do Your will” and “I come to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 230, 8, 25, 'Your will.” One is just the desire; the other is the ability to do His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 230, 9, 25, 'will. This is what God gives us in the New Covenant.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 230, 10, 25, 'In Philippines 2:13, Both these things are combined. It says, “God is at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 230, 11, 25, 'work in you, both to will and to work for HIs good pleasure.” Isn''t this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 230, 12, 25, 'wonderful to be in the New Covenant! This is the ministry of the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 230, 13, 25, 'Spirit. The Holy Spirit does all three things mentioned in Hebrews');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 230, 14, 25, '8:10-12: He assures us that all our sins are blotted. God doesn’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 230, 15, 25, 'remember them against us. Second, He assures us that God is now our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 230, 16, 25, 'Father. We can have a direct relationship with Him. We can contact Him;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 230, 17, 25, 'we can speak to Him and He can speak to us. Third, The Holy Spirit works');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 230, 18, 25, 'in our mind and our heart to give us a desire to do the will of God in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 230, 19, 25, 'every area and the ability or the power to do that will. This is the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 230, 20, 25, 'Covenant. This is why Christ died and rose again and sent the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 230, 21, 25, 'Spirit. Many Christians have not understood this New Covenant; the devil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 230, 22, 25, 'has blinded their eyes to see these simple truths. They still go back to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 230, 23, 25, 'the Old Covenant and live according to that standard. They feel they can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 230, 24, 25, 'have no direct relationship with God, they feel guilty about their past');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 230, 25, 25, 'and they say they are not able to do God''s will. God has promised to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 230, 26, 25, 'write His law in your heart. It’s His business; He doesn’t tell us to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 230, 27, 25, 'it with our own strength, He says, “allow Me to put that desire and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 230, 28, 25, 'ability in you and you will do it.” I will put My Spirit within you and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 231, 1, 25, 'cause you to walk in My statutes, and you will be careful to observe My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 231, 2, 25, 'ordinances (Ezekiel 36:27). Enter into this New Covenant by faith in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 231, 3, 25, 'name of Jesus Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 231, 4, 26, 'Chapter 26 Escaping Deception');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 231, 5, 26, 'In one of our earlier studies, we considered the fact that Jesus Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 231, 6, 26, 'defeated Satan completely when He died on the cross, but He has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 231, 7, 26, 'permitted Satan still to be alive to be active in the world. Look at all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 231, 8, 26, 'the confusion he''s causing in the world. Satan was active in Jesus time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 231, 9, 26, 'as well but the child of God who submitted to God will not be overcome;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 231, 10, 26, 'he will overcome Satan in whatever way Satan may come. The Bible speaks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 231, 11, 26, 'about Satan coming as a lion persecuting, harassing and frightening the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 231, 12, 26, 'Christians. The Christians will overcome Satan when he comes as a lion.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 231, 13, 26, 'The Bible also speaks about Satan coming as a serpent deceiving and this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 231, 14, 26, 'is more dangerous. We may think that persecution is more dangerous but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 231, 15, 26, 'in the history of Christianity teaches that persecution has never killed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 231, 16, 26, 'a church; persecution has made the church flourish. Like someone has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 231, 17, 26, 'said, “The blood of the martyrs becomes the seed of the church.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 231, 18, 26, 'Throughout 2,000 years of church history, we find that wherever there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 231, 19, 26, 'has been persecution, many people have come to the faith. But when the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 231, 20, 26, 'devil comes as a serpent deceiving, he has succeeded in destroying many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 231, 21, 26, 'Christians’ lives. Now we can ask why does God allow this? Why did God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 231, 22, 26, 'allow Satan to come inside the Garden of Eden? Satan didn''t come as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 231, 23, 26, 'lion terrorizing Adam and Eve; he came as a serpent deceiving by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 231, 24, 26, 'pretending to be Eve''s friend. Why didn''t God stop Satan from entering');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 231, 25, 26, 'that garden? If Satan had been stopped, Adam and Eve would never have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 231, 26, 26, 'gone near that tree but then they would not have been tested either. So,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 231, 27, 26, 'we learned from Genesis 3 the reason why God allowed Satan to enter that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 231, 28, 26, 'paradise of the Garden of Eden.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 232, 1, 26, 'If Satan could enter Eden, he can certainly enter your church. Your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 232, 2, 26, 'church is not as pure as Eden. If Satan could enter there and God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 232, 3, 26, 'permitted it, He will certainly permit Satan to come into your church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 232, 4, 26, 'and try and deceive people. Why does God do it? For the same reason that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 232, 5, 26, 'He permitted Eve to enter the Garden of Eden— to test man. Man needs to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 232, 6, 26, 'be tested to see whether He will value God in His Word or whether he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 232, 7, 26, 'will go according to his own reason and cleverness. That''s what Eve did.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 232, 8, 26, 'Eve depended on her own reasoning and ability and so fell away and there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 232, 9, 26, 'are many people today who ignore the Word of God and are led astray. Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 232, 10, 26, 'you know what God was testing with Adam and Eve in the Garden of Eden');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 232, 11, 26, 'when He allowed Satan to try and deceive them? Just one simple thing;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 232, 12, 26, 'will you trust My word and go strictly according to what I have said, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 232, 13, 26, 'will you use your reason and discuss and argue back and forth with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 232, 14, 26, 'Satan. Sadly, they failed and fell. God allowed Satan to try and deceive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 232, 15, 26, 'Jesus Christ by tempting Him to turn the stones into bread, but Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 232, 16, 26, 'would not be deceived into doing something. Jesus overcame by quoting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 232, 17, 26, 'Scripture, He stuck to the written word of God. Adam and Eve did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 232, 18, 26, 'stick to the written word of God, but Jesus stuck to the written word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 232, 19, 26, 'God three times in the temptation in the wilderness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 232, 20, 26, 'It’s clear now we have a choice of going these two ways; the way of Adam');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 232, 21, 26, 'and Eve discussing things back and forth and ignoring God''s Word or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 232, 22, 26, 'sticking completely to God''s Word. We must stick to God’s Word even in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 232, 23, 26, 'little thing like turning the stones into bread because the Bible says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 232, 24, 26, '“Man shall not live by bread alone, but by every word that proceeds from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 232, 25, 26, 'the mouth of God.” and God has not told Me to turn the stones into bread');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 232, 26, 26, 'so I''m not going to do it. It’s amazing how exact Jesus was with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 232, 27, 26, 'Scripture. If you are exact with Scripture, I can give you a written');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 232, 28, 26, 'guarantee that you will not be deceived. If you accept the New Testament');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 233, 1, 26, 'teaching, the example of Jesus, the teaching of Jesus, the Holy Spirit''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 233, 2, 26, 'teaching in the Epistles to guide you, and to be your only guide and you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 233, 3, 26, 'accept nothing else outside of that, you will never be deceived. But if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 233, 4, 26, 'you take things outside of that because it sounds reasonable, I can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 233, 5, 26, 'guarantee you equally that you will be deceived. The Bible says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 233, 6, 26, 'specifically when Jesus was asked by His disciples in Matthew 24 about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 233, 7, 26, 'the sign of the last days and His return, Jesus mentioned wars, rumors');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 233, 8, 26, 'of wars, famines, earthquakes, persecution, etc. but notice what He said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 233, 9, 26, 'first and what He repeated more than once. The first thing He said was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 233, 10, 26, 'in verse 4, “See to it that no one deceives you.” Deception is the first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 233, 11, 26, 'thing that He mentioned in relation to the last days and further down He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 233, 12, 26, 'said again, “there will be many false Christs and false prophets” (verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 233, 13, 26, '24). You know what these false prophets are going to do? They will show');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 233, 14, 26, 'great signs and wonders in the name of Jesus so as to deceive, if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 233, 15, 26, 'possible, even the elect. In other words, these signs and wonders are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 233, 16, 26, 'going to be done in such a way that even the elect could be deceived.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 233, 17, 26, 'The elect are God''s people. Can you imagine the elect being prone to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 233, 18, 26, 'deception if this man is doing wonders in the name of some other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 233, 19, 26, 'religion or some other God? No, impossible! There is the danger of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 233, 20, 26, 'elect being deceived because he comes in the name of Jesus; he''s a wolf');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 233, 21, 26, 'but he comes in sheep''s clothing. Sheep''s clothing means evangelical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 233, 22, 26, 'doctrine. He brings the Bible, he doesn''t bring some other holy book, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 233, 23, 26, 'doesn''t use the name of some other God, he uses the name of Jesus but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 233, 24, 26, 'he''s a deceiver because Satan comes as an angel of light and his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 233, 25, 26, 'servants come as ministers of righteousness (2 Corinthians 11:14-15).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 233, 26, 26, 'These false prophets will talk about righteousness etc. but you got to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 233, 27, 26, 'be watchful because they will preach another Jesus, offer you another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 233, 28, 26, 'spirit, preach another gospel to lead you astray (2 Corinthians 11:3).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 234, 1, 26, 'Let me show you another verse in 1 Timothy 4. It says in the last days,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 234, 2, 26, 'the Holy Spirit has specifically said that some will fall away from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 234, 3, 26, 'faith. Now this is not talking about unbelievers; these are people who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 234, 4, 26, 'have come to the faith and they fall away because they pay attention to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 234, 5, 26, 'deceitful spirits. They pay attention to deceitful spirits and they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 234, 6, 26, 'didn’t stick to the Word of God. Jesus said that in the last day, when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 234, 7, 26, 'the day of judgment comes, many (perhaps hundreds and thousands of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 234, 8, 26, 'preachers) will say to Him, “Lord, Lord, we prophesied in the name of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 234, 9, 26, 'Jesus, we cast out demons in the name of Jesus, we did miracles in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 234, 10, 26, 'name of Jesus,” and the Lord says, “I will turn to them and declare to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 234, 11, 26, 'them, I never knew you, I never had a personal relationship with you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 234, 12, 26, 'You lived in sin, depart from me,” and they are sent to hell (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 234, 13, 26, '7:22). Can you believe that people who did miracles in the name of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 234, 14, 26, 'are sent to hell finally? That all depends on whether you believe the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 234, 15, 26, 'Bible or not. Jesus said, “heaven and earth will pass away, but my words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 234, 16, 26, 'will not pass away.” I would rather believe the words of Jesus than your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 234, 17, 26, 'reason and my reason. My understanding and your understanding can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 234, 18, 26, 'faulty. There are many things we can be deceived by, but I will not be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 234, 19, 26, 'deceived because I believe the words of Jesus. I will not accept every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 234, 20, 26, 'man who does a miracle in the name of Jesus, I will not accept every man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 234, 21, 26, 'who prophesies in the name of Jesus, I will not accept every man who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 234, 22, 26, 'casts out demons in the name of Jesus because of Jesus warning. What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 234, 23, 26, 'will I look for? The same things Jesus looked for in these people. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 234, 24, 26, 'looked for holiness. He says, “you lived in sin.” They never preached');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 234, 25, 26, 'against sin. They lived in and practiced sin and they did miracles. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 234, 26, 26, 'know I''m safe when I seek to fellowship with someone who has the Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 234, 27, 26, 'of Christ who leads me away from iniquity and sin because that''s what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 234, 28, 26, 'Jesus came to save us from.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 235, 1, 26, 'The other mark of false prophets is that they come in sheep’s clothing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 235, 2, 26, 'with evangelical doctrine but inwardly they are ravenous wolves (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 235, 3, 26, '7:15). A wolf is one who comes covering himself with the sheep''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 235, 4, 26, 'clothing in the midst of the sheep. He hasn''t come to bless the sheep;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 235, 5, 26, 'he pretends to be one of them, but his aim is to get something for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 235, 6, 26, 'himself. A wolf comes into the midst of sheep only to get something for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 235, 7, 26, 'himself. He wants to bite off whatever he can from the sheep’s meat to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 235, 8, 26, 'feed himself. In other words, he is greedy and ravenous. That''s one mark');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 235, 9, 26, 'of a false prophet. How shall we detect a false prophet? Not by his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 235, 10, 26, 'doctrine. He may preach the right doctrine, he may do miracles, he may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 235, 11, 26, 'heal in Jesus name, he may cast out demons in Jesus name, he may preach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 235, 12, 26, 'in Jesus name, he may be a very eloquent speaker, but you will find in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 235, 13, 26, 'him a greedy desire to eat up whatever is yours and take it for himself;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 235, 14, 26, 'primarily your money or your possessions. That is one of the ways to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 235, 15, 26, 'identify a false prophet. If you only go by doctrine (the sheep''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 235, 16, 26, 'clothing), you''ll be deceived. You have got to look underneath that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 235, 17, 26, 'doctrine, underneath that sheep''s clothing to find what he is after. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 235, 18, 26, 'will find out that he is after your money and he will even quote');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 235, 19, 26, 'scripture to get your money. He talks about the need; he talks about the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 235, 20, 26, 'laborer being worthy of his hire, but you never see Jesus asking people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 235, 21, 26, 'for their money. There''s not a single instance of Jesus asking people to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 235, 22, 26, 'support him or his ministry. People gave voluntarily, cheerfully and He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 235, 23, 26, 'accepted it. It’s true that Jesus said, “the laborer is worthy of his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 235, 24, 26, 'hire,” but the laborer doesn''t have to go around asking people for it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 235, 25, 26, 'Whose laborer, is he? The laborer should ask the one who sent him. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 235, 26, 26, 'you work for company A, do you go and ask for your salary from Company');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 235, 27, 26, 'B? No. You get your salary from company A and if you don''t get it from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 235, 28, 26, 'company A because they forgot to give it, you go to the boss in company');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 236, 1, 26, 'A and ask for it. You can''t go to the man on the street and say give me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 236, 2, 26, 'my money, you didn''t work for him. If you''re a servant of the Lord, whom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 236, 3, 26, 'should you go to for your needs? To man? Then you''re a servant of man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 236, 4, 26, 'I''ve been a servant of the Lord for 50 years and I''ve never gone to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 236, 5, 26, 'single man for any need of mine. Because I''m serving the Lord, I go to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 236, 6, 26, 'the one I serve, the Master but I''ve never had to go to Him because He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 236, 7, 26, 'always takes care of my need even before I go. He''s more faithful than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 236, 8, 26, 'any company A, B or C or X, Y or Z. Remember this; beware of ravenous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 236, 9, 26, 'wolves who are eager to bite off what you have. They''re not interested');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 236, 10, 26, 'in your welfare. They''re interested in getting from you what you have.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 236, 11, 26, 'The other thing Jesus said is, “You will know them by their fruits.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 236, 12, 26, 'Grapes are not gathered from thorn bushes nor figs from thistles, are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 236, 13, 26, 'they?” (Matthew 7:16). Don’t be impressed by a man''s gifts. People can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 236, 14, 26, 'have the fruit of the Spirit and the gift of the Spirit. If you look for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 236, 15, 26, 'the gifts, you will be deceived but if you look for the fruits then you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 236, 16, 26, 'will not be deceived. What are you looking for in a prophet? I''m looking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 236, 17, 26, 'for the fruit not the gift because Jesus said you will not know them by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 236, 18, 26, 'their gifts, but by their fruits. Later on, He speaks about the gifts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 236, 19, 26, 'they have (miracles, prophecy, casting out demons) but He says they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 236, 20, 26, 'not even His servants and are actually going to hell (Matthew 7:22).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 236, 21, 26, 'Remember, these are warnings to protect you from deception. If you look');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 236, 22, 26, 'for gifts in a man, you''ll be deceived. Instead look for the fruit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 236, 23, 26, 'the Spirit of Christ. First, look to see if this man is humble. See if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 236, 24, 26, 'this man is drawing you to Christ or drawing you to himself. See if he''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 236, 25, 26, 'got the Spirit of Christ which was totally free from the love of money.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 236, 26, 26, 'There wasn’t even an atom of the love of money in Jesus Christ. Look for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 236, 27, 26, 'that in a man and you will not be deceived.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 236, 28, 26, 'One of the earliest Christian writings that has come down to us from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 237, 1, 26, 'second century is a little booklet called “Didache, Teaching of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 237, 2, 26, 'Twelve Apostles.” It''s a very interesting booklet. I don''t know who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 237, 3, 26, 'wrote it, but it certainly has come down from those ancient times more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 237, 4, 26, 'than 19 centuries ago. People didn’t have Bible in those days. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 237, 5, 26, 'were some copies of Paul’s writing here and there. Most churches did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 237, 6, 26, 'have even an Old Testament and there was a lot of wandering preachers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 237, 7, 26, 'going around claiming to be apostles and prophets. Can you image what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 237, 8, 26, 'deception was going on in those days? Much worse than today when we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 237, 9, 26, 'a Bible. Since people were being deceived in those days because they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 237, 10, 26, 'didn’t have a Bible, the apostles gave them a simple rule to protect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 237, 11, 26, 'them which everybody could get and be protected by. They said that if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 237, 12, 26, 'anyone comes to you and asks you for money for himself, he''s a false');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 237, 13, 26, 'prophet. If he asks you money for his ministry, he''s a false prophet. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 237, 14, 26, 'certainly ask people to give money for the needs of others but not for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 237, 15, 26, 'ourselves. That is how they protected those people in those days from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 237, 16, 26, 'deception. So, listen very carefully, when you find ravenous wolves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 237, 17, 26, 'coming with all their gifts, what are they asking your money for? Is it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 237, 18, 26, 'in the spirit of 2 Corinthians 8 and 9 where they are telling you about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 237, 19, 26, 'other poor people whom they are going to bless and they themselves live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 237, 20, 26, 'very simply? Or is it for them to live in grand style where they build');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 237, 21, 26, 'big houses for themselves and buy expensive vehicles and etc.? Those are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 237, 22, 26, 'ravenous wolves, be careful. Now in spite of the Lord''s warnings, if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 237, 23, 26, 'still don''t pay attention then you deserve to be deceived by these false');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 237, 24, 26, 'prophets. There are many ways in which the devil seeks to take advantage');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 237, 25, 26, 'of God''s people. What is God trying to test through all this? Exactly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 237, 26, 26, 'what He tested in Adam and Eve in the Garden of Eden. Will you take My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 237, 27, 26, 'word as it is, will you take my warnings, or will you ignore my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 237, 28, 26, 'warnings?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 238, 1, 26, 'In the Bible, we read of people who fell down before the Lord with their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 238, 2, 26, 'head down to the ground and worshiped Him. That is how everybody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 238, 3, 26, 'worships the Lord God from Genesis to Revelation. We know in our Indian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 238, 4, 26, 'society what it means to show our feet to somebody. If you lift up your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 238, 5, 26, 'feet and show the bottom of the soles of your shoes to someone, it is an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 238, 6, 26, 'insult. Whereas falling down before a person and bowing down before him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 238, 7, 26, 'with your head to the ground is worship. What do you think of people who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 238, 8, 26, 'fall down to their head down before God? They are worshipping Him. What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 238, 9, 26, 'do you think of people who fall backwards and show their feet to God?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 238, 10, 26, 'They are insulting God. Yet that goes on today with so many preachers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 238, 11, 26, 'claiming to be a manifestation of the power of God and of the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 238, 12, 26, 'Spirit. Does the Holy Spirit make people insult God like that to show');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 238, 13, 26, 'their feet to God? Not at all! It''s sinners who fall backward in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 238, 14, 26, 'presence of Christ. It’s demons who throw people down. I''ve seen demons');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 238, 15, 26, 'throw people down myself and you read in the Bible about demons throwing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 238, 16, 26, 'people down but never the Holy Spirit. Jesus always lifted people up and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 238, 17, 26, 'if people fell down before the Lord, it was with their head down to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 238, 18, 26, 'worship Him not showing Him their feet. I’m just giving you an example');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 238, 19, 26, 'of the amount of deception that''s going on and the multitudes of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 238, 20, 26, 'Christians who look at all this and say it’s the power of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 238, 21, 26, 'Do you know that there were people like that even in the Acts of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 238, 22, 26, 'Apostles who were deceived? We read in Acts 8 that in Samaria where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 238, 23, 26, 'Philip went to preach, there was a magician called Simon who did amazing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 238, 24, 26, 'things before people, all types of magic, astonishing the people with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 238, 25, 26, 'all his magic and do you know what they called this man? They called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 238, 26, 26, 'this man Simon, the great power of God (Acts 8:10). That''s what they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 238, 27, 26, 'called him, and they were paying attention to him because for a long');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 238, 28, 26, 'time, he astonished them with his magic arts. There are followers of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 239, 1, 26, 'Simon today who are also being called a great power of God. How are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 239, 2, 26, 'believers deceived by that? For the simple reason that they won''t accept');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 239, 3, 26, 'God''s Word. They see clearly in the Bible that Jesus never pushed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 239, 4, 26, 'anybody down, but they ignore that. They see clearly in the Bible that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 239, 5, 26, 'the apostles never pushed anybody down, but they don''t care for God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 239, 6, 26, 'word. They say like the people in Samaria, “Oh this Simon is the great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 239, 7, 26, 'power of God.” Well, if you want to be deceived, you can be deceived.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 239, 8, 26, 'God won''t stop you; He didn''t stop Adam and Eve from being deceived. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 239, 9, 26, 'has not stopped thousands of people from being deceived, millions of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 239, 10, 26, 'people in all these 2000 years. He''s not going to stop you if you ignore');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 239, 11, 26, 'the Bible. God''s Word is clear and if you ignore the example of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 239, 12, 26, 'and the example of the apostles then you deserve to be deceived and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 239, 13, 26, 'be led astray and to ruin your Christianity and your life. Jesus often');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 239, 14, 26, 'used to say, “He who has ears to hear, let him hear” teaching us that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 239, 15, 26, 'not everybody has an ear to hear the truth. It''s the same thing today,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 239, 16, 26, 'many people can’t hear these things even though it''s clear in Scripture.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 239, 17, 26, 'The Lord is able to keep us from falling, He doesn''t make us fall. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 239, 18, 26, 'Lord is able to keep us from falling (Jude 24). Psalm 91:7 says, “A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 239, 19, 26, 'thousand may fall on your side and ten thousand in their right hand but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 239, 20, 26, 'it won''t come near you.” God is not in the business of making people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 239, 21, 26, 'fall; He''s in the business of making people stand. Jesus wants people to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 239, 22, 26, 'rise up and walk not fall down and lie there and show Him their feet.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 239, 23, 26, 'Dear brothers and sisters, don''t be deceived in these days. Don''t be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 239, 24, 26, 'deceived by these ravenous wolves who are after your money showing you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 239, 25, 26, 'their magic arts in the name of Jesus in order to lead you astray.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 239, 26, 26, 'Follow a person who''s got the Spirit of Christ who is seeking to lead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 239, 27, 26, 'you to godliness, seeking to lead you to be free from your sin. That’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 239, 28, 26, 'the thing that will help you in this life and help you in eternity. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 240, 1, 26, 'the last days, there will be deceiving spirits, people will go from bad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 240, 2, 26, 'to worse, people will be lovers of money more than lovers of God (2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 240, 3, 26, 'Timothy 3). Let us be careful in the days in which we live because these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 240, 4, 26, 'are days of tremendous deception. 2 Thessalonians 2:10-11 warns us very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 240, 5, 26, 'clearly that all those who don''t receive the love of the truth will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 240, 6, 26, 'deceived. God Himself will allow them to be deceived because they don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 240, 7, 26, 'receive the love of the truth and it says there that they will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 240, 8, 26, 'deceived by the false signs and wonders that Satan is going to manifest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 240, 9, 26, '(2 Thessalonians 2:9). It looks as if some good is being done by some of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 240, 10, 26, 'these things, but the question is where does it finally lead you? To');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 240, 11, 26, 'Christ, to the real Jesus or to another Jesus? To follow God''s Word or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 240, 12, 26, 'to be deceived? May God help you to hear these words and be saved and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 240, 13, 26, 'protected.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 240, 14, 27, 'Chapter 27 The Right Way To Pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 240, 15, 27, 'One of the practices found in all religions is prayer. There''s no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 240, 16, 27, 'religion that doesn''t teach prayer whether it is some type of chanting,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 240, 17, 27, 'some type of repetition, some type of appealing to God. Usually, it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 240, 18, 27, 'for help. Jesus also practiced and preached on prayer. Sometimes He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 240, 19, 27, 'would spend all night in prayer. Frequently, He would slip away and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 240, 20, 27, 'pray. Particularly in the Gospel of Luke (Chapters 4, 5, 6) you read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 240, 21, 27, 'instances when He would get alone. Now we need to understand this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 240, 22, 27, 'clearly from the Lord''s own mouth to find out how He prayed because when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 240, 23, 27, 'He prayed, His disciples heard Him once and said to Him, “Lord, teach us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 240, 24, 27, 'to pray. We have never heard anyone pray like You.” There was an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 240, 25, 27, 'intimacy in the way Jesus prayed. So many prayers that people make are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 240, 26, 27, 'so formal. Have you heard the way Christian leaders sometimes pray from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 240, 27, 27, 'the pulpit; they change their voice and they become so artificial. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 240, 28, 27, 'like a formal lecture they are giving to God and that''s the type of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 241, 1, 27, 'prayer that the disciples had heard the Pharisees pray in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 241, 2, 27, 'synagogues. They give formal lectures to God like you know people would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 241, 3, 27, 'in the olden days before kings and bow down and read out some statement,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 241, 4, 27, 'but that''s not the way Jesus prayed. He prayed like a child talking to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 241, 5, 27, 'father and He taught us to pray in the same way. The best way to pray is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 241, 6, 27, 'to pray like your children talk to you as parents. They don''t put on an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 241, 7, 27, 'artificial voice. They respect you, but they speak freely. It''s intimacy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 241, 8, 27, 'that is important in this matter of prayer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 241, 9, 27, 'Let’s look at what Jesus Himself taught on this subject because the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 241, 10, 27, 'He taught us to pray could mean that we have to make some radical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 241, 11, 27, 'changes in the way we pray if we want our prayers to be effective.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 241, 12, 27, 'There''s a wonderful verse in James 5:16-18 where we read there that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 241, 13, 27, 'effectual, fervent prayer of a righteous man can accomplish much. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 241, 14, 27, 'are righteous in your life as we have been considering in our last');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 241, 15, 27, 'sessions, that is not enough. We also need persistent prayer and if we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 241, 16, 27, 'are fervent in prayer and we are righteous in our life, it''s going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 241, 17, 27, 'make a lot of difference. In fact, the one thing that Jesus said we must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 241, 18, 27, 'do always was pray. In Luke 18:1, He said, “Men should always pray and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 241, 19, 27, 'never give up.” Jesus taught two parables in relation to prayer. One was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 241, 20, 27, 'about a man who had a friend coming to him at midnight and needing food,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 241, 21, 27, 'and his going to his neighbor’s house and knocking and asking for food');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 241, 22, 27, 'persistently until he got it (Luke 11). The other parable is of a widow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 241, 23, 27, 'who went to the judge asking for justice until she got it (Luke 18).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 241, 24, 27, 'Both the parables teach one lesson and that is you must not give up. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 241, 25, 27, 'must be persistent even though it looks as if no answer is immediately');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 241, 26, 27, 'coming. It''s only your faith being tested. We may wonder why God asks us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 241, 27, 27, 'to pray again and again and again. Isn’t praying once enough; hasn’t He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 241, 28, 27, 'heard our request once? Well, as a matter of fact, God knows our need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 242, 1, 27, 'even before we make one request. You don''t even have to mention it at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 242, 2, 27, 'all, leave alone once. Jesus Himself said in Matthew 6:8, “Your heavenly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 242, 3, 27, 'Father knows what you need even before you ask Him.” There''s no need for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 242, 4, 27, 'you to ask in a sense. Prayer is not in order to inform God about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 242, 5, 27, 'something He didn''t know about. Prayer is not trying to make Him have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 242, 6, 27, 'compassion on somebody who''s in need for whom you think you have more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 242, 7, 27, 'compassion. God has more compassion; He sent His Son to die for their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 242, 8, 27, 'sins; you didn’t, and I didn’t. So, it''s not to move God''s heart towards');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 242, 9, 27, 'them or to inform him about anything. Prayer is primarily to bring us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 242, 10, 27, 'into communication with God and it does a lot more in us then it does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 242, 11, 27, 'externally. God asks us to keep on praying and to persist in it because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 242, 12, 27, 'it does something in us. For example, you like your children to come and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 242, 13, 27, 'talk to you. Which father doesn’t like his children to come and talk to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 242, 14, 27, 'him? God also wants His children to come and talk to Him. I’ve heard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 242, 15, 27, 'numerous complaints of parents who say my teenage children don’t seem to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 242, 16, 27, 'be interested in talking to me. I think our heavenly Father has the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 242, 17, 27, 'complaint too; a lot of God’s children don’t seem to be interested in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 242, 18, 27, 'talking to their heavenly Father, they want His blessings but don’t seem');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 242, 19, 27, 'interested in talking to Him. They just come and say, “give me this,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 242, 20, 27, 'give me that, give me the other thing and go away.” What would you think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 242, 21, 27, 'of your children if all the conversation they wanted to have with you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 242, 22, 27, 'was, “Give me this, give me that, give me the other thing.”? Wouldn’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 242, 23, 27, 'you be disappointed with your children? It’s the same with God. God is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 242, 24, 27, 'Father; He wants us to fellowship with Him and it does a lot more good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 242, 25, 27, 'to us then it does to Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 242, 26, 27, 'In Matthew 6, Jesus taught us about prayer very clearly. First of all,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 242, 27, 27, 'He told us how not to pray. It’s very important to learn first of all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 242, 28, 27, 'how not to pray before we start to learn how to pray. In Jesus’ time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 243, 1, 27, 'also, there were all these religious people who were in the synagogue');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 243, 2, 27, 'praying just like religious people pray in all denominations of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 243, 3, 27, 'Christendom today with formal lectures to God. Jesus told us not to pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 243, 4, 27, 'like them because they were not actually praying to God, they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 243, 5, 27, 'praying in order to be heard by many and to impress them. He said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 243, 6, 27, '“Don’t be like the hypocrites because they love to stand and pray in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 243, 7, 27, 'synagogues and on the street corners to be seen by men.” (Matthew 6:5).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 243, 8, 27, 'Most of the prayers I have heard in my life in whichever denomination in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 243, 9, 27, 'Christendom have been prayers prayed to impress the audience;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 243, 10, 27, 'particularly if you ask somebody to open a meeting in prayer and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 243, 11, 27, 'crowd is a large crowd. Boy, he’s really interested in impressing that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 243, 12, 27, 'crowd with his prayer. Sometimes, he comes with a written statement. Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 243, 13, 27, 'your children ever come with a written statement to read out to you?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 243, 14, 27, 'Well, they come out with a written statement and they call it prayer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 243, 15, 27, 'It’s not a prayer, they are preaching to the congregation, and for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 243, 16, 27, 'namesake, they call it a prayer. We see a lot of this that Jesus warned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 243, 17, 27, 'against. Hypocrite means an actor; don’t be an actor when you pray.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 243, 18, 27, 'Don’t act a part. In a drama, an actor gets up and says certain thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 243, 19, 27, 'which he has rehearsed over and over to give a nice presentation. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 243, 20, 27, 'your children come to talk to you normally, they don’t rehearse what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 243, 21, 27, 'they are going to say. They come and open up their heart to you. That’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 243, 22, 27, 'exactly how you and I are supposed to pray to our Heavenly Father. A lot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 243, 23, 27, 'of prayers (I believe that more than 90%) prayed in Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 243, 24, 27, 'congregations by born-again believers are not even heard by God. Why?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 243, 25, 27, 'Because He knows these fellows are just acting and He knows that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 243, 26, 27, 'are just trying to impress the audience how well they can pray or how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 243, 27, 27, 'emotionally they can pray. Some of them put a tremor in their voice when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 243, 28, 27, 'they pray just to impress people. God is not fooled by all that because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 244, 1, 27, 'He sees through all that hypocrisy and humbug and these people pray like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 244, 2, 27, 'that because they haven’t read Matthew 6:5. They disobey by doing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 244, 3, 27, 'exactly what Jesus told us not to do when we pray. You need to ask');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 244, 4, 27, 'yourself even if you are not a Christian leader and you have ever prayed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 244, 5, 27, 'in public, ask yourself whether you don’t pray like that. When you pray,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 244, 6, 27, 'are you conscious that so and so is listening and I must say something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 244, 7, 27, 'to move him and if two or three people say “Hallelujah,” you get all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 244, 8, 27, 'excited which proves that you’re not really praying to God at all. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 244, 9, 27, 'are praying for people to be moved emotionally by your prayer. You are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 244, 10, 27, 'not talking to God, but to people; then you should expect an answer from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 244, 11, 27, 'those people so don’t be surprised if you don’t get an answer from God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 244, 12, 27, 'Sincere prayers that Christians pray are when they are all alone. Even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 244, 13, 27, 'then, a lot of it could be formal but the most likelihood of a sincere');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 244, 14, 27, 'prayer is when you are all alone in your room and there is nobody around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 244, 15, 27, 'and you are praying to God. You kneel beside your bed and you pour out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 244, 16, 27, 'your heart to Him. Likelihood is that your prayer is much more sincere');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 244, 17, 27, 'than when you are standing in public. But we have to fight this battle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 244, 18, 27, 'of acting before God in public prayer. We have to get rid of pretending');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 244, 19, 27, 'when we talk to God when we are really only trying to impress people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 244, 20, 27, 'It’s a battle and you won’t overcome it in one day, but we have to keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 244, 21, 27, 'fighting it. I know I''ve gone through it myself. I prayed to impress');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 244, 22, 27, 'people and I''ve gone back and repented before God and said, “Lord, help');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 244, 23, 27, 'me, help me” and it''s been a battle and over a period of years, I''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 244, 24, 27, 'gradually broken free from trying to impress people with prayer. Yet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 244, 25, 27, 'even now in some new surroundings, I may still be tempted to do that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 244, 26, 27, 'With constant battle I believe we can come to the place where we will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 244, 27, 27, 'never again pray to impress anyone. When we shut our eyes and we pray,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 244, 28, 27, 'it will be to our Father in heaven; and that should be our goal. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 245, 1, 27, 'a very important statement: Don’t ever pray to impress people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 245, 2, 27, 'The other thing Jesus said about prayer we''re not to do is meaningless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 245, 3, 27, 'repetition. He didn''t say repetition is wrong because we read in Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 245, 4, 27, '26 that in the Garden of Gethsemane, He prayed for maybe a couple of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 245, 5, 27, 'hours the same thing. He went three times and prayed to the Father the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 245, 6, 27, 'same thing; it was repetition. He told us to persist in prayer in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 245, 7, 27, 'two parables, it was repetition. The widow said, “Give me justice, give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 245, 8, 27, 'me justice.” The man who went to his neighbor said, “Give me food, give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 245, 9, 27, 'me food.” Both of them used repetition but it was not meaningless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 245, 10, 27, 'repetition. Many Christians are involved in meaningless repetition.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 245, 11, 27, 'People say “hallelujahs” meaninglessly very often, it''s become a habit,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 245, 12, 27, 'a tradition or ritual. People say “praise the Lord” or whatever is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 245, 13, 27, 'equivalent in your language meaninglessly as a repetition and Jesus said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 245, 14, 27, 'don''t do that. You can repeat something a hundred times a day if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 245, 15, 27, 'mean it every time. When you talk to people, do you say meaningless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 245, 16, 27, 'things? I hope you don’t. Certainly, we should not say meaningless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 245, 17, 27, 'things to our heavenly Father. We shouldn''t repeat things in our prayer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 245, 18, 27, 'for the sake of repeating them. It''s all right to say a hallelujah in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 245, 19, 27, 'prayer but I hope you mean it. What does hallelujah mean? Hallelujah');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 245, 20, 27, 'means I want to praise you, Lord. It not wrong to do that but mean it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 245, 21, 27, 'every single time you do it. There must be a reason behind your saying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 245, 22, 27, 'it and not just a time filler. When people don’t know what to say when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 245, 23, 27, 'they are praying, they fill up the time by saying a few hallelujahs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 245, 24, 27, 'That’s trying to play the fool with God, it''s better to pause. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 245, 25, 27, 'you''re talking to someone and you don''t know what to say next, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 245, 26, 27, 'pause. There is nothing wrong with pausing when we don’t know what to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 245, 27, 27, 'say next, but it is wrong to fill up the time by saying meaningless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 245, 28, 27, 'things. All of this meaningless repetition is because people don''t fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 246, 1, 27, 'or reverence God. God wants us to talk to Him like a father and not give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 246, 2, 27, 'Him a lecture.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 246, 3, 27, 'The other thing Jesus said was that we should not use meaningless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 246, 4, 27, 'repetition as the heathens do thinking they will be heard because of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 246, 5, 27, 'their many words (Matthew 6:7). Don’t think that God will hear you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 246, 6, 27, 'because you prayed for one hour. I remember in the early days when I was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 246, 7, 27, 'trying to understand how to pray and I said, “well, Jesus prayed all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 246, 8, 27, 'night and I want to pray all night” and I knelt down beside my bed and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 246, 9, 27, 'was enduring trying to pray all night. I was constantly looking at my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 246, 10, 27, 'watch hoping that morning would come soon because it was quite an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 246, 11, 27, 'endurance test and finally when morning came, I had accomplished the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 246, 12, 27, 'feat. Do you think that was all-night prayer? No. It was just a form of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 246, 13, 27, 'asceticism which accomplished nothing, and I believe that there is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 246, 14, 27, 'place for all night prayer if a man has a burden.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 246, 15, 27, 'Burden is the essential part of prayer. If you don''t have a burden, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 246, 16, 27, 'can''t really pray. Prayer is like a circle; it begins with God coming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 246, 17, 27, 'and putting a burden in our heart—that''s half the circle. My praying it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 246, 18, 27, 'back to God is the completing of the circle and I know it will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 246, 19, 27, 'answered because the burden came from God. Things you pray for, where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 246, 20, 27, 'the burden comes from God, you can be absolutely sure He will answer it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 246, 21, 27, 'But if it’s just your own opinion or idea, you can’t be sure that you’ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 246, 22, 27, 'get anything from God as a result of that. So, these are the warnings He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 246, 23, 27, 'gave about praying and then He said you must believe and have faith that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 246, 24, 27, 'your Father in heaven knows what you need before you ask Him. Having');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 246, 25, 27, 'this faith is very important thing in prayer. So, before Jesus taught us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 246, 26, 27, 'what is known as the Lord’s Prayer, He introduced it by saying, “Your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 246, 27, 27, 'Father knows what you need before you ask Him.” Remember that when you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 246, 28, 27, 'pray; everything that you’re asking for, He already knows you need it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 247, 1, 27, 'and why is He asking you to pray? He wants you to express your need and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 247, 2, 27, 'He wants to have fellowship with you. He wants you to have the joy of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 247, 3, 27, 'knowing that you asked for something and got it. James 4 says, “You do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 247, 4, 27, 'not have because you do not ask”. Jesus said, “How much more will your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 247, 5, 27, 'heavenly Father give good things to those who ask Him.” (Matthew 7:11).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 247, 6, 27, 'In Luke 11:13, He say, “How much more will your heavenly Father give the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 247, 7, 27, 'Holy Spirit to those who ask Him.” People are not going to be baptized');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 247, 8, 27, 'in the Holy Spirit without asking for it. There are some rare cases like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 247, 9, 27, 'Cornelius who in their ignorance God meets with them, but they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 247, 10, 27, 'praying for other things to God even before He met with them. No one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 247, 11, 27, 'ever receives anything valuable from God without asking for it. God does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 247, 12, 27, 'give health and money and a lot of other things required for life on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 247, 13, 27, 'earth to people who don’t ask and even to those who deny His Name. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 247, 14, 27, 'the really valuable things of eternity in heaven, you have to ask for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 247, 15, 27, 'it. For example, you have to ask for forgiveness of sins, you have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 247, 16, 27, 'ask for the baptism in the Holy Spirit, you have to ask for spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 247, 17, 27, 'growth, spiritual riches etc. It’s good to learn to ask our Father in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 247, 18, 27, 'heaven for that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 247, 19, 27, 'Now we need to look at how we should ask. Jesus said pray in this way,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 247, 20, 27, 'He didn’t say meaninglessly repeat the Lord’s Prayer. In fact, He said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 247, 21, 27, 'earlier as we saw that we shouldn’t meaninglessly repeat anything and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 247, 22, 27, 'yet many people take this Lord''s Prayer and meaninglessly repeat it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 247, 23, 27, 'every day. I think I used to in my younger days repeat it every day, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 247, 24, 27, 'I didn''t know what else to say in my prayer, so I just repeated it. Now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 247, 25, 27, 'there''s nothing wrong with repeating it if you mean every sentence. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 247, 26, 27, 'can repeat it twice a day every day of your life if you mean every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 247, 27, 27, 'sentence. The Lord is not against repetition, but He is against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 247, 28, 27, 'meaningless repetition where you''re saying something and it''s just like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 248, 1, 27, 'a tape recorder playing a tape or a parrot just repeating something. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 248, 2, 27, 'can memorize the Lord’s prayer in our mind after praying so often that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 248, 3, 27, 'we can automatically repeat it even when we are half asleep and we may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 248, 4, 27, 'not even be meaning a single sentence of what this prayer is. So, what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 248, 5, 27, 'Jesus said was all our prayers must be in this way or in this pattern.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 248, 6, 27, 'Jesus was not putting words into our mouth saying just repeat this, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 248, 7, 27, 'was laying down a pattern for prayer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 248, 8, 27, 'Many of you have repeated the Lord’s prayer but have you ever noticed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 248, 9, 27, 'that the words, “I, Me and Mine” are not found in this prayer at all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 248, 10, 27, 'Not a single time do you find in this prayer saying, “give me this” or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 248, 11, 27, '“give me that” or “Lord, I want this.” The words “I, Me, Mine” are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 248, 12, 27, 'here because the Lord is trying to deliver us from this self-centered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 248, 13, 27, '“I, Me, Mine” type of life we got from Adam. One of the first things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 248, 14, 27, 'that happen after Adam and Eve sinned was that they got separated from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 248, 15, 27, 'each other inwardly. Adam began to accuse Eve saying she is the one who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 248, 16, 27, 'gave me the fruit and Eve began to blame the serpent. Adam and Eve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 248, 17, 27, 'became individuals. Each became “I, me, mine.” It''s one of the results');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 248, 18, 27, 'of sin and notice here also that as soon as we begin to pray, Jesus said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 248, 19, 27, 'we are to address God as our Father in heaven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 248, 20, 27, 'Now this is very important so we should stop here for a moment and think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 248, 21, 27, 'about it. Why did He say, “When you pray, say ‘Our Father who art in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 248, 22, 27, 'Heaven’?” You see, most people in the world do not know God as a Father.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 248, 23, 27, 'They think of Him as a great terrible judge who’s there to punish them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 248, 24, 27, 'In fact, all the greatest men of God in the entire Old Testament could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 248, 25, 27, 'never call God, “Father.” They could only talk about the great and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 248, 26, 27, 'terrible and mighty God out there who they could pray to. Jesus was the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 248, 27, 27, 'first Person who came and said “Father.” God was His Father and through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 248, 28, 27, 'His death and resurrection and especially the gift of the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 249, 1, 27, 'coming into us, He becomes our Father - God is our Father. In fact, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 249, 2, 27, 'says in Romans 8:16 that when the Holy Spirit comes within, He cries out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 249, 3, 27, 'saying, “Abba Father.” Abba is a Hebrew word and the literal translation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 249, 4, 27, 'of it into English would be “Daddy.” The Holy Spirit comes within us and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 249, 5, 27, 'cries out to the Father in heaven - God in heaven saying “daddy.” Do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 249, 6, 27, 'believe that you can talk to God like that? He''s not a general manager');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 249, 7, 27, 'of a company you''re talking to, it''s your own Father. That''s how we''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 249, 8, 27, 'supposed to talk to Him. That''s the first thing that Jesus said in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 249, 9, 27, 'relation to prayer; you must recognize whom you''re talking to. If Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 249, 10, 27, 'is Lord of your life, you have trusted Him for your salvation and ask');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 249, 11, 27, 'Him to forgive your sins, confess your sins, repented and believe that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 249, 12, 27, 'He rose up from the dead and is living, you can come through Him to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 249, 13, 27, 'Father. In Jesus name, you can come straight to God and He is your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 249, 14, 27, 'Father. Father means you know His love for you. His wisdom is far');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 249, 15, 27, 'superior to yours, His love for you is intense proved by the fact that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 249, 16, 27, 'He sent His Son to die for your sins and mine and that''s what we need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 249, 17, 27, 'recognize before we pray. I’m praying to someone who loves me so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 249, 18, 27, 'intensely and like it says in Romans 8:32, “If He did not spare His own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 249, 19, 27, 'Son, but gave Him freely for us all, how will He not with Him also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 249, 20, 27, 'freely give us everything else?” He certainly will! We just need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 249, 21, 27, 'trust Him. So that first sentence is to produce faith in our heart. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 249, 22, 27, 'whole purpose of saying our Father in heaven meaningfully is so that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 249, 23, 27, 'faith comes in our heart that I am praying to someone who loves me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 249, 24, 27, 'intensely, whose wisdom is perfect and who''s interested in helping me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 249, 25, 27, 'out, solving my problem and blessing me in whatever way possible. Now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 249, 26, 27, 'that''s not all; Jesus also said when you pray, you must pray saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 249, 27, 27, '“Our Father who art in heaven.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 249, 28, 27, 'Earthly fathers may love us a lot and may have a lot of wisdom but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 250, 1, 27, 'they''re not almighty. Your father on earth can''t solve all your problems');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 250, 2, 27, 'however much he may love you and however much wisdom he may have. So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 250, 3, 27, 'that''s the second thing that Jesus said. When you pray, remember you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 250, 4, 27, 'praying to a Father who is in heaven, who runs this universe. Look out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 250, 5, 27, 'at the night sky and see the stars and if you have studied a little bit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 250, 6, 27, 'of geography, you know those stars are millions and millions and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 250, 7, 27, 'millions of miles away and light-years away and earth is a little speck');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 250, 8, 27, 'of dust in this universe. Planet Earth is like a grain of sand and on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 250, 9, 27, 'this grain of sand is a still smaller speck called you or me and we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 250, 10, 27, 'praying to this Almighty God who runs this universe. A Father who art in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 250, 11, 27, 'heaven beyond this universe; is there anything He cannot do? Faith rises');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 250, 12, 27, 'in my heart as I realize whom I''m talking to. It''s very important for me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 250, 13, 27, 'to be focused in remembering that I''m praying to my Father who is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 250, 14, 27, 'heaven, who runs this universe, one who loves me intensely, one whose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 250, 15, 27, 'wisdom is perfect and one who has almighty power unlike my earthly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 250, 16, 27, 'father. The assurance of His love for me and wisdom comes because He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 250, 17, 27, 'my Father. The assurance of His almighty power because He''s in heaven is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 250, 18, 27, 'the basis for faith. Because faith is the leaning of the human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 250, 19, 27, 'personality upon God in total confidence, in His perfect love, perfect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 250, 20, 27, 'wisdom and almighty power. Those are the three things on which faith is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 250, 21, 27, 'based; God''s love for me is perfect, His wisdom and planning my life is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 250, 22, 27, 'perfect and His power is almighty. That''s what we find in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 250, 23, 27, 'expression, “Our Father who art in heaven.” There we find a basis for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 250, 24, 27, 'prayer and all prayer must come out of that. Thereafter, we shall look');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 250, 25, 27, 'in our next study about the rest of that prayer; how He taught us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 250, 26, 27, 'pray concerning God''s needs first and then our needs. Let''s learn how to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 250, 27, 27, 'pray.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 250, 28, 28, 'Chapter 28 God Centered Prayer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 251, 1, 28, 'In our last study, we were considering Jesus’ teaching on prayer in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 251, 2, 28, 'Matthew 6 and how Jesus taught us first of all how not to pray (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 251, 3, 28, '6:5-7). We are to pray in secret, not trying to impress people. He also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 251, 4, 28, 'taught us when we are praying to begin with getting a foundation that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 251, 5, 28, 'will produce faith in our heart. We are to pray to our Father who is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 251, 6, 28, 'heaven - a Father who loves us perfectly and whose wisdom is perfect and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 251, 7, 28, 'who is in heaven proving that He is Almighty. Once we understand that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 251, 8, 28, 'God loves us perfectly and that His wisdom is perfect, His power is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 251, 9, 28, 'Almighty and can solve every problem, there''s nothing He cannot handle,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 251, 10, 28, 'He’s got everything under His control, we can pray in faith. Once we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 251, 11, 28, 'come there, we can look at this prayer itself. There are six requests in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 251, 12, 28, 'the Lord’s Prayer and it''s very interesting to see as that the words “I,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 251, 13, 28, 'me and mine” are just not found in this prayer at all. The requests are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 251, 14, 28, 'first of all concerning God: hallowed be thy name, thy kingdom come, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 251, 15, 28, 'thy will be done. Then our requests: give us this day our daily bread,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 251, 16, 28, 'forgive us our sins and lead us not into temptation but deliver us from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 251, 17, 28, 'evil. So here are three requests concerning God; His kingdom, His name');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 251, 18, 28, 'and His will, then three requests not concerning me but concerning me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 251, 19, 28, 'and my fellow believers who are also God''s children. That''s why you find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 251, 20, 28, 'it is not give me, but give us etc.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 251, 21, 28, 'First of all, let''s look at the three requests He prays in relation to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 251, 22, 28, 'God''s glory and His name etc. Prayer is to come from a heart and not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 251, 23, 28, 'just from our lips. If prayer comes from our lips, we are merely actors');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 251, 24, 28, 'rehearsing a part and repeating it. True prayer must come from our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 251, 25, 28, 'heart, from our innermost being. What shall we pray to God? We are to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 251, 26, 28, 'say Lord, the deepest burden in my heart and my number one request is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 251, 27, 28, 'that your name should be respected and treated as holy. You name should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 251, 28, 28, 'be glorified on earth especially in the land, country, and town which I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 252, 1, 28, 'live. My dear brothers and sisters, if you will only change the way you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 252, 2, 28, 'pray from today to put the glory of God''s name first in everything and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 252, 3, 28, 'that is the deepest burden of your heart, you will find your whole life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 252, 4, 28, 'will change because your prayer will be now God centered. All prayers of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 252, 5, 28, 'most people in the world, of all religions, is man centered. We have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 252, 6, 28, 'man centered gospel today which is not the true gospel. The true gospel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 252, 7, 28, 'is God centered, God wants something from us and when we seek His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 252, 8, 28, 'kingdom and His righteousness first, other things are added to us. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 252, 9, 28, 'gospel that teaches you to seek for these other things first is a false');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 252, 10, 28, 'gospel and if you seek those other things, you naturally will be praying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 252, 11, 28, 'for a car and a house and so many other things. Health is a good thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 252, 12, 28, 'but even that should not be first. Never mind that people drag our name');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 252, 13, 28, 'in the dust. Be concerned that the name of Jesus is being dishonored in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 252, 14, 28, 'your city and your country. Let the burden of your heart be, ‘O God, My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 252, 15, 28, 'Father’, never mind my backache and never mind my poverty and never mind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 252, 16, 28, 'that these little struggles I''m going through. Let your name be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 252, 17, 28, 'glorified at any cost.” Such a man will find his backache gets healed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 252, 18, 28, 'and many other problems get solved because God is trying to make us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 252, 19, 28, 'stand on our feet.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 252, 20, 28, 'The whole world is full of people who are upside down and God is trying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 252, 21, 28, 'to make us stand on our feet. God didn''t create Adam to walk on his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 252, 22, 28, 'head. Spiritually speaking, the whole world is upside down. They put God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 252, 23, 28, 'down there and their own needs on top. That''s what I mean by upside');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 252, 24, 28, 'down; their feet are on top. The Bible says the head of every man is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 252, 25, 28, 'Christ. Christ, the head should be on top. Isn''t that how you walk?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 252, 26, 28, 'Christ and His kingdom should be uppermost in our life, but is it?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 252, 27, 28, 'Sadly, it’s the other way around where the least important things are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 252, 28, 28, 'uppermost. Man’s walking with his feet in the air and his head on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 253, 1, 28, 'ground and all that God is saying is, “listen, that''s not the way I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 253, 2, 28, 'created you to walk. Straighten up!” And when we straighten up, we''ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 253, 3, 28, 'find we can make much more progress. You can walk a lot faster on your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 253, 4, 28, 'feet than on your head however much of a juggler you maybe. You can walk');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 253, 5, 28, 'much faster on your feet when you put Christ first and uppermost in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 253, 6, 28, 'life, you''ll find that your spiritual progress becomes amazing. It’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 253, 7, 28, 'true, I''ve experienced it. Be concerned about God''s name first of all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 253, 8, 28, 'Let God’s name be glorified. Think of the way the name of Jesus is being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 253, 9, 28, 'dishonored today by all the false things people say about Him. Think of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 253, 10, 28, 'all the movies that are produced to dishonor His name to say He was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 253, 11, 28, 'homosexual or to say that He was married, and all types of lies being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 253, 12, 28, 'told. His name is being dishonored; are you concerned about it or are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 253, 13, 28, 'you only concerned when your own name been dishonored. That''s the reason');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 253, 14, 28, 'why we are so slow in our spiritual growth. Be concerned from today');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 253, 15, 28, 'onwards that the name of Jesus must be honored. “Hallowed be thy name in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 253, 16, 28, 'my land. Lord, let the heathen know that Jesus Christ is Lord. Let them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 253, 17, 28, 'tremble at that name. Let them throw away all other gods and trust in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 253, 18, 28, 'You Lord Jesus. Let Your name be glorified and honored.” That is our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 253, 19, 28, 'prayer, that people will know the truth and know God. We don''t force');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 253, 20, 28, 'anyone. A lot of people talk about forcing people to be converted.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 253, 21, 28, 'There''s no such thing. If you force somebody to be converted, that''s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 253, 22, 28, 'a conversion. Not at all. God Almighty who''s much more powerful than all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 253, 23, 28, 'of us doesn''t force anybody. He allows everybody to go according to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 253, 24, 28, 'whatever religion he wants. What we do is we offer Christ. Those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 253, 25, 28, 'voluntarily, joyfully, cheerfully want to accept Christ without any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 253, 26, 28, 'incentive, without giving them money or gifts or any such thing are the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 253, 27, 28, 'ones whom God wants. They should receive Christ into their lives because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 253, 28, 28, 'Christ died for their sins. Anything forced where we urge a man to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 254, 1, 28, 'receive Christ because of some type of bribery is dishonoring to God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 254, 2, 28, 'completely. Those who do that are not representatives of Jesus Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 254, 3, 28, 'We urge people to pray, “Jesus Christ, let Your name be glorified. Our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 254, 4, 28, 'Father, Who art in heaven, hallowed be Thy name.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 254, 5, 28, 'The second prayer is, “Thy kingdom come.” All the corruption and evil on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 254, 6, 28, 'this earth is because this earth is not being ruled by God. It’s being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 254, 7, 28, 'ruled by the devil and that''s why there is bribery, corruption,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 254, 8, 28, 'immorality and all types of evil and men are suffering. Little children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 254, 9, 28, 'are suffering. What should we pray? When will you come back Lord Jesus,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 254, 10, 28, 'and establish Your kingdom on this earth? That''s the second thing we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 254, 11, 28, 'need to be concerned about and the church is supposed to manifest to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 254, 12, 28, 'people what the kingdom of God is like. By church, I don''t mean the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 254, 13, 28, 'physical building being called a church, or a denomination being called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 254, 14, 28, 'the church, but the group of people who call themselves Christians. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 254, 15, 28, 'the church, the fellowship of God''s people, are supposed to show others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 254, 16, 28, 'what God''s kingdom is like. It should be a taste that we give to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 254, 17, 28, 'world about what God''s kingdom is like. But there again, we find most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 254, 18, 28, 'Christians are a great failure when it comes to demonstrating the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 254, 19, 28, 'principles and values of God''s kingdom. So, we need to repent of that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 254, 20, 28, 'and say, “Lord, we really want Your kingdom to come here on this earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 254, 21, 28, 'We really long first of all that in these little pockets where you’ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 254, 22, 28, 'established Christians coming together, let them manifest the principles');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 254, 23, 28, 'of your kingdom properly. Lord, come from heaven and set up your kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 254, 24, 28, 'on this earth soon and relieve the pain of suffering humanity.” We will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 254, 25, 28, 'continue to do our best for suffering humanity and help people in every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 254, 26, 28, 'way. We will do our best to help the orphans, the widows, the poor, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 254, 27, 28, 'suffering, the sick and everybody else, but whatever we may do, it will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 254, 28, 28, 'be a drop in the bucket because the need is so vast. The ultimate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 255, 1, 28, 'solution for this world is the return of Jesus Christ from heaven when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 255, 2, 28, 'He establishes His kingdom of peace on the earth. We should have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 255, 3, 28, 'burden that God’s Kingdom should come soon.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 255, 4, 28, 'The third prayer is, “Lord, Thy will be done on earth as it is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 255, 5, 28, 'heaven.” God’s will should be done in our own lives first. It''s no use');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 255, 6, 28, 'asking for God''s will to be done on earth if you don''t want it to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 255, 7, 28, 'done in your own life. If you''re not serious about reading the Bible to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 255, 8, 28, 'find out what God''s will is, how can you have God''s will done on earth;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 255, 9, 28, 'if it''s not being done in your own life first of all? So, let''s pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 255, 10, 28, 'that God''s will be done in our life. “Lord, I want your will to be done');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 255, 11, 28, 'in my life as it is done in heaven.” How is God''s will done in heaven?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 255, 12, 28, 'The angels don''t go running around doing something or the other for God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 255, 13, 28, 'Sometimes Christians are told to go and do something for God. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 255, 14, 28, 'doesn''t want you to do that. What does the angel Gabriel do? He waits');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 255, 15, 28, 'before God as it were in prayer. He waits before God and says, “Almighty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 255, 16, 28, 'God, what do you want me to do.” In some of these big offices, you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 255, 17, 28, 'a person who''s sits as servant or watchman outside the door of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 255, 18, 28, 'managing director. We call him a peon and when the manager inside rings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 255, 19, 28, 'the bell, he opens the door and says, “What shall I do, sir.” The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 255, 20, 28, 'manager says go and take this file to another office and he does that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 255, 21, 28, 'and comes back and sits on his chair. That''s how God wants us to wait on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 255, 22, 28, 'Him. “Thy will be done on earth as it is done in heaven.” Lord, I''ve got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 255, 23, 28, 'many things to do on earth. I''ve got my family to look after. I''ve got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 255, 24, 28, 'to work and earn my living but in the midst of all that, in my inner');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 255, 25, 28, 'heart, I''m always waiting before you with the attitude of what do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 255, 26, 28, 'want me to do. I’m always available for you Lord to hear you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 255, 27, 28, 'It’s like these policemen who walk around with a walkie-talkie. It’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 255, 28, 28, 'always on but they are not always talking on it. These policemen are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 256, 1, 28, 'going about doing their work, but they are always listening for a call');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 256, 2, 28, 'from the headquarters. If a call comes to them in the middle of the day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 256, 3, 28, 'or multiple times a day, they respond immediately. When headquarters');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 256, 4, 28, 'gives them a call on their walkie-talkie, they''ve got to drop everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 256, 5, 28, 'and go. That''s how it must be with us. That''s how the angels are; always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 256, 6, 28, 'ready and when God tells them to do something, they do it immediately.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 256, 7, 28, 'They drop whatever they''re doing and do it. Are you praying that God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 256, 8, 28, 'will be done in your life like that. Lord, I want to do your will as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 256, 9, 28, 'soon as I hear it- immediately. The angels do God’s will joyfully; they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 256, 10, 28, 'don''t do it to with a long face; with a grumble or a complaint. Third,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 256, 11, 28, 'they do it completely. They don''t do a half-job and come back. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 256, 12, 28, 'said on the cross, “It is finished.” It is a principle by which He lived');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 256, 13, 28, 'all through life. If His mother told Him to go and bring a bucket of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 256, 14, 28, 'water from the village when He was a little twelve-year-old boy, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 256, 15, 28, 'wouldn''t bring a half bucket; He''d bring a full bucket. These are little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 256, 16, 28, 'steps of obedience which delights our Father in heaven. “Thy will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 256, 17, 28, 'done on earth as it is done in heaven.” Lord, I want to do your will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 256, 18, 28, 'waiting on You, and when I hear Your voice, I am going to do it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 256, 19, 28, 'immediately, joyfully and completely. That''s how I want to do Your will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 256, 20, 28, 'and I want this to be done in every aspect of my life. I want it to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 256, 21, 28, 'done in my family, I want it to be done like that in my local church,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 256, 22, 28, 'and I want it to be done like that in my city, in my country and all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 256, 23, 28, 'over the world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 256, 24, 28, '“Thy will be done on earth as it is done in heaven.” Notice here it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 256, 25, 28, 'God''s name, God''s kingdom and God''s will. The focus of my life shifts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 256, 26, 28, 'from being centered in myself to be centered in God. You know when Adam');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 256, 27, 28, 'chose to eat of the tree of knowledge of good and evil, he was actually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 256, 28, 28, 'choosing a life centered in himself and not centered in God. The tree of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 257, 1, 28, 'life was a choice to be centered in God, but Adam didn''t want that. Now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 257, 2, 28, 'Jesus has come to bring us back to the tree of life, to have a life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 257, 3, 28, 'centered in God because that is having our head up. When you''re centered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 257, 4, 28, 'in yourself, you''re walking on your head with your feet up. You are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 257, 5, 28, 'actually walking upside down. When some folks in Acts 17:6 said that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 257, 6, 28, 'Paul and the other apostles were turning the world upside down, what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 257, 7, 28, 'they should have said is they are turning the world right-side up. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 257, 8, 28, 'looked upside down because everybody else is walking upside down, but it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 257, 9, 28, 'is actually right-side up; they were telling people to be centered in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 257, 10, 28, 'God and to put God first in their life. That''s what Christ came to do.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 257, 11, 28, 'Once we do that then we come to our requests. Is it right for us to pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 257, 12, 28, 'for our requests? Absolutely right! Is it right to pray for material');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 257, 13, 28, 'things? Absolutely right because we need those things on earth. In that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 257, 14, 28, 'little prayer, “Give us this day our daily bread,” I want you to notice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 257, 15, 28, 'God doesn''t want you to think only about your own needs. If you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 257, 16, 28, 'hungry, the people around you, your fellow believers are hungry also.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 257, 17, 28, 'Don''t just say, “Lord, give me food.” What about them? If you have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 257, 18, 28, 'need in your family, your fellow believers have a need in the family as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 257, 19, 28, 'well. Pray for them as much as for yourself. Do you want your children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 257, 20, 28, 'to be married? Do you have people around you who need their children to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 257, 21, 28, 'be married; pray for them too and not just for your children. God will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 257, 22, 28, 'mightily care for you when you start caring for other people. I''ve seen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 257, 23, 28, 'that through 50 years. I have proved it and I''ve experienced it. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 257, 24, 28, 'take care of God’s family and God will take special care over your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 257, 25, 28, 'family. So, don''t say “give me” but pray “give us.” Let’s change our way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 257, 26, 28, 'of thinking. It''s not just repeating it as a formula. No, it is actually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 257, 27, 28, 'putting others needs also in our mind.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 257, 28, 28, 'I''m not saying don''t pray for yourself. The prayer doesn’t say, “Give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 258, 1, 28, 'them their daily bread.” No, we''re not ascetics or super spiritual.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 258, 2, 28, 'Jesus said, “Give us.” I need bread too. I need my children to get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 258, 3, 28, 'married too but I''m thinking of the needs of others as well. I need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 258, 4, 28, 'housing, they need housing. I need a job; they need a job. In that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 258, 5, 28, 'little request “Give us our daily bread” is included many things. Daily');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 258, 6, 28, 'bread is a symbol of all that we need for life on earth: food, clothing,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 258, 7, 28, 'shelter, our children''s education etc. It includes education because our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 258, 8, 28, 'children need it in order to get a job when they grow so that they can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 258, 9, 28, 'get their daily food, clothing and shelter. I see that, in that request');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 258, 10, 28, 'for something earthly, is a request for, food, clothing, shelter, my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 258, 11, 28, 'children''s education, everything related to earthly needs, maybe for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 258, 12, 28, 'medical treatment or physical health. Prayer for physical health is all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 258, 13, 28, 'included in that little statement “give us this our daily bread.” It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 258, 14, 28, 'basically praying, “Lord, help me to be able to live a healthy life to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 258, 15, 28, 'earn my living and to take care of myself. I''m not expecting manna to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 258, 16, 28, 'drop from heaven. No. I''m expecting to work and earn my living so I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 258, 17, 28, 'praying that I''ll have a job. I''m praying that I''ll have a house to take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 258, 18, 28, 'care of my family. It''s all included in that prayer and it''s absolutely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 258, 19, 28, 'right to ask for it. God may give you more than you asked for. He may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 258, 20, 28, 'give you ice cream and not just bread, but you don''t ask for it. There''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 258, 21, 28, 'nothing wrong in asking for it once in a while but that''s not the main');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 258, 22, 28, 'burden of our prayer. My point is we''re not asking God for luxuries. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 258, 23, 28, 'God decides to give us some luxuries, that''s fine but don''t get into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 258, 24, 28, 'debt to buy them. Never. God increases your financial circle so that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 258, 25, 28, 'have enough to buy something, some time-saving gadget in your home, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 258, 26, 28, 'some little luxury to make transport easier, go ahead and get it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 258, 27, 28, 'There''s nothing wrong in that but don''t make that the goal and focus of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 258, 28, 28, 'your prayer where that is the only thing you want in life. Leave that to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 259, 1, 28, 'God and you seek His kingdom and His righteousness, and He will add to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 259, 2, 28, 'you whatever He knows is good for you and take away the things that are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 259, 3, 28, 'not good. So, let''s not hesitate to ask for material things provided it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 259, 4, 28, 'is number four on our request. This request follows after the prayer,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 259, 5, 28, '“Thy will be done.” In other words, Lord I''m praying that you will give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 259, 6, 28, 'me health to do Your will on earth as it is done in heaven; that''s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 259, 7, 28, 'point. Why do I want all these things? Why do I want food, clothing,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 259, 8, 28, 'shelter, opportunity to educate my children? So that I can do God''s will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 259, 9, 28, 'on earth because that is the previous request, “Thy will be done on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 259, 10, 28, 'earth in my life as it is done in heaven.” And in order to do thy will,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 259, 11, 28, 'Lord give us this day our daily bread, give me my food clothing and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 259, 12, 28, 'shelter and opportunity to educate my children so that they will do Your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 259, 13, 28, 'will on earth in their generation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 259, 14, 28, 'Then we go to the next request. It''s interesting that even forgiveness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 259, 15, 28, 'of sins is mentioned after “Give us this day our daily bread,” teaching');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 259, 16, 28, 'us that it''s perfectly right to ask for material things. How can we live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 259, 17, 28, 'on earth otherwise? Then forgive us our sin just as we forgive others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 259, 18, 28, 'That is the condition. How do you want God to forgive you? Exactly like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 259, 19, 28, 'you have forgiven somebody else who harmed you. When somebody who''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 259, 20, 28, 'harmed you comes to you, do you say “Well, I''ll forgive you, but I can''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 259, 21, 28, 'ever forget what you did to me.” That’s how God is going to forgive you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 259, 22, 28, 'too. When you pray to God, He will say, “Well I''ve forgiven you, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 259, 23, 28, 'I''ll never forget the way you rebelled against me all these years.” You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 259, 24, 28, 'want God to forgive you like that or do you want God to forgive you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 259, 25, 28, 'saying, “Listen, I don''t even want to remember anything that you did in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 259, 26, 28, 'the past.” I want God to forgive me like that, but God says you better');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 259, 27, 28, 'forgive others like that too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 259, 28, 28, 'In fact, Jesus picked out forgiveness out of all the six requests in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 260, 1, 28, 'prayer and emphasized. In Matthew 6:14-15, He said that if you don’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 260, 2, 28, 'forgive others, your heavenly Father will not forgive you. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 260, 3, 28, 'forgive people, only then will your heavenly Father forgive you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 260, 4, 28, 'Forgiveness is not unconditional, it is conditional. Jesus made it so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 260, 5, 28, 'clear. It doesn''t matter how many years you''ve lived in faithfulness to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 260, 6, 28, 'God, at the end of your life, if there''s one human being you have not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 260, 7, 28, 'forgiven, your heavenly Father will not forgive you. Either this is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 260, 8, 28, 'true, or Jesus is a liar. A lot of people think they have served God for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 260, 9, 28, 'forty years and it doesn''t matter if they keep a little grudge against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 260, 10, 28, 'somebody before they die. You better be careful; you''ll get a surprise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 260, 11, 28, 'when you go beyond the grave as to where you end up because heaven and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 260, 12, 28, 'earth will pass away, but this word will not pass away. Our heavenly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 260, 13, 28, 'Father will not forgive someone who has not forgiven others. So, if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 260, 14, 28, 'haven''t done it and you don''t know when you''ll die, you better forgive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 260, 15, 28, 'them right away. That doesn''t mean you''re to go and visit them and do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 260, 16, 28, 'all types of things for them. Just forgive them. It''s an act of your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 260, 17, 28, 'will in your heart. Right where you''re sitting right now, you say “Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 260, 18, 28, 'this person, that person, the other person who has harm me, right now I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 260, 19, 28, 'forgive them. I wish them the best. I don''t wish them any evil from now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 260, 20, 28, 'on. I pray you will bless them. I want to love them. I may never see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 260, 21, 28, 'them in my life but my attitude towards them has changed. Right now, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 260, 22, 28, 'have forgiven them.” Jesus doesn''t tell you to go visit them. He doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 260, 23, 28, 'tell you to go and meet them or anything. If you meet them smile at them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 260, 24, 28, 'but in your heart forgive them. That''s all He''s saying, and we must ask');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 260, 25, 28, 'the Lord to forgive us in the same way and we can believe that the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 260, 26, 28, 'will forgive us in the same way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 260, 27, 28, 'The last request is, “Don''t lead us into temptation but deliver us from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 260, 28, 28, 'evil.” We recognize that there are some temptations that are too strong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 261, 1, 28, 'for us and so we pray to the Father, “Please Father, don''t let me ever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 261, 2, 28, 'face a temptation that''s too strong for me.” He has promised in 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 261, 3, 28, 'Corinthians 10:13 that He’ll never allow us to be tempted beyond our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 261, 4, 28, 'ability. But He wants us to pray it, also to remind ourselves that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 261, 5, 28, 'ourselves should not expose ourselves to temptation that''s too strong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 261, 6, 28, 'for us. If the devil asks you to jump from the top of the temple like He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 261, 7, 28, 'told Jesus, say “No, I won''t do it. That''s tempting God. Lead me not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 261, 8, 28, 'into temptation. Don''t walk into a pornographic bookshop and ask God to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 261, 9, 28, 'protect you from temptation. Don''t go to a pornographic site on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 261, 10, 28, 'internet and ask God to protect you from temptation. He won’t. If you go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 261, 11, 28, 'there yourself, How can you pray, “Lead us not into temptation?” We have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 261, 12, 28, 'to be very careful here. Many Christians fall into sin because they go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 261, 13, 28, 'into situations that are provocative. For example, don''t walk in lonely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 261, 14, 28, 'places at night with a woman who''s not your wife; you can be tempted.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 261, 15, 28, 'Young people should be careful; don''t allow yourself to be in situations');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 261, 16, 28, 'where you’re tempted. You can lose your whole testimony for Christ in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 261, 17, 28, 'moment and destroy your usefulness for your whole life. “Lead us not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 261, 18, 28, 'into temptation but deliver us from evil.” We pray that God Himself will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 261, 19, 28, 'set us free from Satan and from all evil. We believe that He can keep us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 261, 20, 28, 'from falling and that''s what we''re praying for. He will deliver us from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 261, 21, 28, 'evil completely; not 90% but 100%. I don''t want any evil in my life;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 261, 22, 28, 'deliver me from all evil. Not only physical evil but something worse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 261, 23, 28, 'than that which is spiritually evil. Deliver me from sin is a prayer for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 261, 24, 28, 'victory over sin. Lord, keep me from falling. Don''t let me fall in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 261, 25, 28, 'thought, word, deed, attitude, motive in any area. Lord, I believe that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 261, 26, 28, 'you will answer all this because all power is Yours. The kingdom is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 261, 27, 28, 'Yours; the power is Yours and when you answer these prayers, the glory');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 261, 28, 28, 'will be Yours; I will never take the credit for myself (Matthew 6:13).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 262, 1, 28, 'Then you finally conclude with amen. You know what the word “amen”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 262, 2, 28, 'means? Amen means I believe it will be exactly as I have prayed. It''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 262, 3, 28, 'very good way to conclude prayer; In Jesus name, I claim this, and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 262, 4, 28, 'know it will be true in my life. May God help you to change the way you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 262, 5, 28, 'pray from today- centered in God, considerate for others and believing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 262, 6, 28, 'that when you pray, your Father in heaven will answer you beyond what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 262, 7, 28, 'you ask or think.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 262, 8, 28, 'Share');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 262, 9, 28, 'Who Am I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('fundamental_biblical_truths', 262, 10, 28, 'Our Message');
