INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 1, 1, 1, 'Chapter 1 The Origin Of Evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 1, 2, 1, 'Let us consider one of the greatest mysteries in the world that people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 1, 3, 1, 'have tried hard to understand: The mystery of evil. How did evil begin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 1, 4, 1, 'in a world that was created by a perfectly good God Who is full of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 1, 5, 1, 'wisdom? Why has God permitted evil to exist and to spread so much? Why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 1, 6, 1, 'does evil have the upper hand in every part of the world? Why is there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 1, 7, 1, 'so much sickness, poverty, and sorrow? Isn''t God interested in helping');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 1, 8, 1, 'us?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 1, 9, 1, 'There is an answer to this question of why God has allowed evil to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 1, 10, 1, 'exist. Is it because God could not control it? Very often we find people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 1, 11, 1, 'suffering in so many ways in different parts of the world, and our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 1, 12, 1, 'hearts are moved - how much more the heart of God, Who is full of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 1, 13, 1, 'compassion?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 1, 14, 1, 'Before we proceed further, we need to understand that our human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 1, 15, 1, 'reasoning cannot tell us what God is really like. A dog cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 1, 16, 1, 'understand a human being because a human being is higher in the levels');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 1, 17, 1, 'of creation than a dog. In the same way, we cannot understand God. If a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 1, 18, 1, 'dog is to understand a human being, it must be taught human commands by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 1, 19, 1, 'the human being himself. Likewise, if we use our mind to understand God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 1, 20, 1, 'it would be as foolish as a dog trying to understand a human being; it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 1, 21, 1, 'impossible. We must instead allow God to reveal Himself to us. That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 1, 22, 1, 'what we read in the Bible: God has revealed Himself to us in His Word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 1, 23, 1, 'In the Bible, we read of a God who is interested in a personal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 1, 24, 1, 'relationship with every single human being on the face of the earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 1, 25, 1, 'He''s intensely, deeply interested in every single detail in our life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 1, 26, 1, 'God is full of wisdom; He''s Almighty, All-Powerful, All-knowing; He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 1, 27, 1, 'knows the future, and has total control of the whole universe - not only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 1, 28, 1, 'this earth, but the whole universe with its millions of stars. God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 2, 1, 1, 'infinitely pure; we cannot understand His purity. He''s also infinitely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 2, 2, 1, 'loving; full of love, full of goodness. God''s love is totally unselfish.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 2, 3, 1, 'Very often, the love that we see on earth is a selfish love, but not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 2, 4, 1, 'God''s love. His love is totally unselfish. Right from the beginning when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 2, 5, 1, 'He created Man, God wanted to share His joy and happiness with others,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 2, 6, 1, 'and with us. That''s why He created living beings. Before He created man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 2, 7, 1, 'and the human race, we read in the Bible that God created millions of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 2, 8, 1, 'angels. Long before He created human beings, He created the angels. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 2, 9, 1, 'His purpose in creating them was that He might share His happiness and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 2, 10, 1, 'His glory with created beings who obeyed His commands. This principle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 2, 11, 1, 'was put into place by God long ages ago.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 2, 12, 1, 'But when we consider the angels and the human race, God created them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 2, 13, 1, 'with a free will. In other words, unlike the planets, stars, plants, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 2, 14, 1, 'trees, God created the angels and the human race with a freedom to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 2, 15, 1, 'choose whether we wanted to obey God or not; whether we would obey Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 2, 16, 1, 'or not. The plants grow, and naturally obey the laws of nature which God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 2, 17, 1, 'has put into them. They don''t have freedom to choose to disobey. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 2, 18, 1, 'why a star, or planet, or tree, or plant can never become evil because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 2, 19, 1, 'they have no freedom of choice. And though trees and plants may do us a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 2, 20, 1, 'lot of good because God has created them to be useful, they cannot do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 2, 21, 1, 'good out of their own voluntary choice. A planet, star, or tree cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 2, 22, 1, 'do any good out of its own choice. A tree grows according to certain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 2, 23, 1, 'laws of nature built into it, and thus, has no choice. So, we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 2, 24, 1, 'conclude that these beings which have no choice; these parts of creation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 2, 25, 1, '- the stars, planets, and trees, etc – cannot do good or evil. They''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 2, 26, 1, 'like programmed robots. If you had a computerised robot in your home,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 2, 27, 1, 'you could program it to pick up your slippers and do many other things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 2, 28, 1, 'The robot could bring in the newspaper, perhaps even make a cup of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 3, 1, 1, 'coffee. There are several things you could program a robot to do. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 3, 2, 1, 'the robot would not have any feelings of its own. It would never disobey');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 3, 3, 1, 'you if you programmed it correctly; it would do every single thing that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 3, 4, 1, 'you ever wanted it to do. God could have made man like that robot, where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 3, 5, 1, 'we would never do anything wrong, but would automatically, blindly, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 3, 6, 1, 'dumbly as it were, obey God in everything. But God never wanted a race');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 3, 7, 1, 'of people like that. They could never be His children. Robots could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 3, 8, 1, 'never be our children even though they obey. Any father would say, “I''d');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 3, 9, 1, 'rather have a naughty, disobedient son of my own than an obedient');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 3, 10, 1, 'robot.” It is the same with God. Do you know how robots and machines');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 3, 11, 1, 'bring no joy to a childless couple? Do you know why human fathers would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 3, 12, 1, 'rather have a disobedient son than an obedient robot? Because we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 3, 13, 1, 'made in the likeness of God, we have something of God''s nature in us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 3, 14, 1, 'Married couples long to have children. They''re never happy with obedient');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 3, 15, 1, 'machines, they want children. And there we see the heart of God: God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 3, 16, 1, 'also interested in children. Our children can turn out to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 3, 17, 1, 'disobedient, and can bring a lot of sorrow to our hearts. And there we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 3, 18, 1, 'understand why God created the angels and human beings with a free will,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 3, 19, 1, 'unlike the stars and planets. This is the first thing that we need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 3, 20, 1, 'understand: Free will is the first essential for one to be a moral');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 3, 21, 1, 'being. And if we don''t have free will, we cannot become moral beings.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 3, 22, 1, 'And the second essential is a conscience; something within us that tells');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 3, 23, 1, 'us what is right and wrong.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 3, 24, 1, 'Let us consider birds and animals, they also have a free will - they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 3, 25, 1, 'better than trees and stars in their ability to choose. A dog can choose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 3, 26, 1, 'to obey or disobey. But they are not moral beings; they have no sense of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 3, 27, 1, 'morality because they don''t have a conscience. Though they have free');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 3, 28, 1, 'will, they don''t have a conscience. But we as humans have the two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 4, 1, 1, 'essentials necessary for morality: we have a free will and a conscience.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 4, 2, 1, 'The lack of these two essentials is why birds and animals can never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 4, 3, 1, 'become sinful or holy, or become children of God. A dog cannot be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 4, 4, 1, 'child of God because it doesn''t have a conscience. You can train a dog');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 4, 5, 1, 'over a period of time, and teach it certain things it should do or not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 4, 6, 1, 'do, but the resulting obedience is not because of an inbuilt conscience');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 4, 7, 1, 'but because of external training. This training is similar to teaching a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 4, 8, 1, 'computer by programming it to do certain things a certain way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 4, 9, 1, 'But when we consider the human race, we have a conscience. Before the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 4, 10, 1, 'human race was created God made all the angels. He created millions of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 4, 11, 1, 'angels, all with a free will. Among the angels, there was one who was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 4, 12, 1, 'the leader. His name was Lucifer. The Bible says, in Ezekiel 28:12-15,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 4, 13, 1, 'that he was created perfect in wisdom and beauty, and given a high');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 4, 14, 1, 'position. But gradually he began to have thoughts and ambitions in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 4, 15, 1, 'mind that were not good. How did that happen? Because he had a free');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 4, 16, 1, 'will, and that''s where evil first began in this universe.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 4, 17, 1, 'Not only were Lucifer''s thoughts evil; they were also proud and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 4, 18, 1, 'rebellious thoughts of discontent with the lot that God had appointed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 4, 19, 1, 'for him. Until then, the universe was perfectly pure, but now, evil had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 4, 20, 1, 'lifted up its head in the heart of an angel God had created. That is how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 4, 21, 1, 'evil came into the world. Initially this evil that was in the heart of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 4, 22, 1, 'Lucifer the angel did not manifest itself externally in any way. Evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 4, 23, 1, 'always begins in the heart. Even a murder is planned by a man in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 4, 24, 1, 'heart, and from the heart it goes out into action; that''s how it was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 4, 25, 1, 'with Lucifer too. But as soon as this evil came up in his heart, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 4, 26, 1, 'could see it. God can see into a person''s heart, and God cast out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 4, 27, 1, 'Lucifer from His presence. So there we learn something: God hates evil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 4, 28, 1, 'But when He created a moral being, He had to give that moral being a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 5, 1, 1, 'free will. There is the origin of evil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 5, 2, 1, 'But there is a solution that God has made through Jesus Christ, and we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 5, 3, 1, 'want to consider that in greater detail. Let us remember this about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 5, 4, 1, 'evil; that it is not outside of God''s control. Evil is something God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 5, 5, 1, 'knew was coming, yet He permitted it, He accepted it, and He has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 5, 6, 1, 'provided a solution for it. That solution is in Jesus Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 5, 7, 2, 'Chapter 2 God Makes Evil Work For Good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 5, 8, 2, 'We want to look at a very important question. If evil originated with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 5, 9, 2, 'the fall of Lucifer, the head of the angels, why didn''t God destroy it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 5, 10, 2, 'immediately? God could have done that. If Satan is the cause of all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 5, 11, 2, 'evil in the world, why doesn''t God destroy Satan? Why doesn''t He destroy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 5, 12, 2, 'all the demons, so that we would not be harassed by them? Why should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 5, 13, 2, 'people suffer in so many ways?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 5, 14, 2, 'If God does not do that, we can be certainly sure that He has a very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 5, 15, 2, 'good purpose. There are many things about God that we cannot fully');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 5, 16, 2, 'understand. God''s wisdom is like that of an ocean, and our mind is like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 5, 17, 2, 'a little cup; it can contain just a little bit of the water of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 5, 18, 2, 'ocean. So we can understand a little bit, but we can''t understand it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 5, 19, 2, 'fully. And with that little bit, with that little intelligence and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 5, 20, 2, 'understanding that God has given us, we can understand a little bit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 5, 21, 2, 'the reason why God has not destroyed Satan; why God permits life on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 5, 22, 2, 'earth to be so difficult, so insecure, so dangerous in so many ways.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 5, 23, 2, 'One reason is, if God had made life on earth extremely comfortable and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 5, 24, 2, 'easy, people would not think of eternity. Man was not created only for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 5, 25, 2, 'his short life on earth. Even if you live a hundred years on this earth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 5, 26, 2, 'that is a very short period compared to eternity. Plants and animals do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 5, 27, 2, 'not exist eternally. But when God created man, He created man to be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 5, 28, 2, 'creature of eternity; to live endlessly. His body may perish on earth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 6, 1, 2, 'after he has lived, say, 70, 80 or 100 years, but, that soul within him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 6, 2, 2, 'is eternal; it will never, never die. Once you are born, that soul never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 6, 3, 2, 'dies; it exists eternally. It is important for you to understand that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 6, 4, 2, 'One thing we can be sure is that God, in His infinite wisdom, has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 6, 5, 2, 'permitted life on earth to be difficult, so that people think about Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 6, 6, 2, 'Even the problems, the sicknesses, the trials and difficulties that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 6, 7, 2, 'Satan and evil spirits bring into your life are permitted by a loving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 6, 8, 2, 'God to make you turn to Him. In that way, even those trials and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 6, 9, 2, 'difficulties are an expression of God''s love for you. See, God is so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 6, 10, 2, 'powerful and so almighty that He can make even evil work for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 6, 11, 2, 'fulfilment of His purposes. Now, we can''t understand that. We can only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 6, 12, 2, 'think that good is good and evil is evil, and only good things can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 6, 13, 2, 'further God''s purposes. No, God is so almighty that He can make evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 6, 14, 2, 'work to further the purposes of good for us as human beings.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 6, 15, 2, 'Let me give you an example. In fact, this is the whole message of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 6, 16, 2, 'Bible - how God uses Satan and evil spirits to further His purposes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 6, 17, 2, 'That is why He does not destroy them. All the evil that is going on in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 6, 18, 2, 'the world, we will discover finally, that they fulfilled God''s purposes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 6, 19, 2, 'in some wonderful way. God did not create evil. But when the angels and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 6, 20, 2, 'man decided to be evil, God decided to use it to further His purposes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 6, 21, 2, 'And there we see something of the almighty power of God. When we see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 6, 22, 2, 'that, our own faith is strengthened, and we discover that we are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 6, 23, 2, 'afraid of evil anymore, as God can make it to work for our good.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 6, 24, 2, 'I heard a story of a businessman, who had been very close to God at one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 6, 25, 2, 'time. But, over a period of time, he drifted away from God as his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 6, 26, 2, 'business prospered. He was going to a Christian church, and the elders');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 6, 27, 2, 'in that church tried speaking to him repeatedly to turn him back to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 6, 28, 2, 'faith in God, to surrender his life to Christ again. But he was too');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 7, 1, 2, 'occupied in his business. He didn''t have time anymore to come for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 7, 2, 2, 'meetings even on Sundays. His business was prospering. Then one day, a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 7, 3, 2, 'poisonous snake bit the youngest of his three sons, and the child became');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 7, 4, 2, 'seriously sick. When the doctors gave up all hope, the father was really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 7, 5, 2, 'worried. He sent for one of the elders of the church to pray for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 7, 6, 2, 'child. The elder was a wise man. He came and prayed like this: ‘Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 7, 7, 2, 'thank you for sending this snake to bite this child, because I tried for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 7, 8, 2, 'six years to get his family to think about You, and I never succeeded.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 7, 9, 2, 'But what I couldn''t do in six years, this snake has done in a moment, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 7, 10, 2, 'has been more successful. Now that they have learnt the lesson, Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 7, 11, 2, 'heal this child and grant that this family will never need any more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 7, 12, 2, 'snakes to remind them of You again.’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 7, 13, 2, 'Now do you think a snake bite is good or evil? All of us would agree it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 7, 14, 2, 'is evil, definitely. But in this particular family''s case, did God use');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 7, 15, 2, 'it for good? He certainly did. That family was drifting away from God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 7, 16, 2, 'and they would have destroyed their lives in the pursuit of money. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 7, 17, 2, 'it was through a snake (that did something evil) biting one of their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 7, 18, 2, 'sons made them turn back to God, so their life could be spiritually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 7, 19, 2, 'blessed; they could live for eternity''s values. This is an example of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 7, 20, 2, 'how God uses evil to accomplish good. If there were no snakes in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 7, 21, 2, 'world, there would be no snake to bite that child, and they probably');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 7, 22, 2, 'would have destroyed themselves eternally. So we see how God used an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 7, 23, 2, 'evil thing like a snake. And, very often, it is the same with sickness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 7, 24, 2, 'There are people who don''t think about God at all in their life, until');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 7, 25, 2, 'one day, they are suddenly taken to hospital with cancer or some other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 7, 26, 2, 'serious sickness. All of a sudden, these people who have never thought');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 7, 27, 2, 'about God for forty years suddenly start thinking about God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 7, 28, 2, 'First of all, we need to establish one thing: is it a good thing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 8, 1, 2, 'think about God or not? Certainly it is. A man who lives without God in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 8, 2, 2, 'his life lives without meaning and purpose. He may make a lot of money,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 8, 3, 2, 'but ultimately, he will die frustrated. He will die with emptiness. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 8, 4, 2, 'has created us in such a way that He is the most important factor in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 8, 5, 2, 'lives and if we don''t think about Him, we miss the meaning and purpose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 8, 6, 2, 'of life altogether. So, if a man lives for 40 or 50 years without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 8, 7, 2, 'thinking about God, and then he gets cancer, and he begins to think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 8, 8, 2, 'about God and turns to Him, would that cancer be good or bad? Of course,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 8, 9, 2, 'if you look at cancer by itself, all of us would say cancer is evil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 8, 10, 2, 'Sure, but there are examples of how God has used cancer to make people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 8, 11, 2, 'turn to Him. How is it that even though the cancer itself was evil, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 8, 12, 2, 'was used for a good purpose, just like the snake?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 8, 13, 2, 'One day we will discover the full story of every man''s life, when Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 8, 14, 2, 'Christ comes back to this earth. When we stand before Him and we see all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 8, 15, 2, 'the people who have lived on this earth from the very beginning, from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 8, 16, 2, 'the very first man, and we hear their stories, we will see that God used');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 8, 17, 2, 'many things to turn people away from a sinful life towards heaven;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 8, 18, 2, 'incurable diseases, sicknesses, wild animals, snakes, even poverty and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 8, 19, 2, 'suffering and many other evils were used by God to get people to turn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 8, 20, 2, 'away from their sins towards heaven, and thus to find an eternal home in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 8, 21, 2, 'heaven. So we see, through all these examples, how God uses these evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 8, 22, 2, 'things that Satan does to save people from Satan''s clutches. There is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 8, 23, 2, 'man living for the devil, doomed to an eternal destiny in hell, away');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 8, 24, 2, 'from God, and Satan is working on him. Then through some of the evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 8, 25, 2, 'things like sickness, the man turns to God. So we see that God uses the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 8, 26, 2, 'very things that Satan brings into the world - evil to deliver people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 8, 27, 2, 'from Satan''s clutches and to bring them into eternal salvation. There we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 8, 28, 2, 'see the wonderful way in which God works His almighty power. We can also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 9, 1, 2, 'say that thus God makes fool of Satan again and again. This is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 9, 2, 2, 'wonderful message of the Bible. The Bible says that Jesus Christ came to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 9, 3, 2, 'undo the works of Satan in 1 John 3:8.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 9, 4, 2, 'We can say that we all started off life with a ball of string neatly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 9, 5, 2, 'rolled up. But through the years, we have ended with that string tied up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 9, 6, 2, 'into ten thousand or even ten million knots. Now, as we look at this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 9, 7, 2, 'ball of string, we are frustrated, we are discouraged, we are wondering');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 9, 8, 2, 'what we can do? Then comes to us this wonderful message of the Bible -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 9, 9, 2, 'Jesus Christ can untie every knot. I don''t know with how many knots you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 9, 10, 2, 'have got your life tied into, my friend, but I want to tell you the good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 9, 11, 2, 'news - Jesus can untie every single knot. He can give you back a whole');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 9, 12, 2, 'roll of new string with your whole life just as though you were born');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 9, 13, 2, 'now, and you can start life all over again, if you turn to Jesus Christ,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 9, 14, 2, 'call upon His name, and say, ''Lord Jesus, you came to destroy the works');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 9, 15, 2, 'of the devil, destroy those works in my life. Amen.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 9, 16, 3, 'Chapter 3 The Power Of Choice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 9, 17, 3, 'What is sin? People talk about sin, but they don''t very often understand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 9, 18, 3, 'what it is. When we realize that sin is what makes us distant from God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 9, 19, 3, 'it is important that we understand it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 9, 20, 3, 'Why do some men often behave like animals? Don''t you feel sometimes that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 9, 21, 3, 'perhaps you yourself, your behaviour - if you are honest - is just like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 9, 22, 3, 'that of an animal? The way some human beings behave towards each another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 9, 23, 3, 'is the way dogs bare their teeth at one another. What is the answer?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 9, 24, 3, 'Such people are interested only in their bodily needs and their earthly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 9, 25, 3, 'existence – and not in the things related to God and eternity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 9, 26, 3, 'What is an animal interested in? An animal has no spiritual values.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 9, 27, 3, 'There is no animal in this world who thinks about God. You never find a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 9, 28, 3, 'religious monkey or a religious dog kneeling down anywhere or doing any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 10, 1, 3, 'such thing, any act of worship. But when it comes to man, even out there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 10, 2, 3, 'in the jungles, barbarians, who know nothing about any religion, who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 10, 3, 3, 'have never been educated, they have a sense that there is a god whom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 10, 4, 3, 'they have displeased in some way. And that is why they make sacrifices.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 10, 5, 3, 'Maybe they worship the sun or a tree, or something else, some created');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 10, 6, 3, 'thing. Man has that sense that they are answerable to some supreme');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 10, 7, 3, 'being. Now no animal has that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 10, 8, 3, 'What is an animal interested in then? Food, sleep, sexual satisfaction,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 10, 9, 3, 'taking care of its little ones and that is all. You see animals with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 10, 10, 3, 'their head always bent down to the earth. They are all interested in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 10, 11, 3, 'things of earth. There is no future for them. When they die they become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 10, 12, 3, 'dust; that is all. But man is created primarily to be a child of God. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 10, 13, 3, 'have a body of course. We need food, God has created us with sexual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 10, 14, 3, 'desire, and we need to sleep. All these things are okay. There is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 10, 15, 3, 'nothing wrong with any of these provided they are fulfilled in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 10, 16, 3, 'legitimate ways. If we are hungry we shouldn''t steal in order to eat');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 10, 17, 3, 'food. There are legitimate ways of earning our living. It is proper to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 10, 18, 3, 'sleep, but not to sleep when you are on duty and doing something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 10, 19, 3, 'important. In the same way with sexual satisfaction, God has ordained');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 10, 20, 3, 'marriage for the fulfilment of that. There are lawful ways in which God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 10, 21, 3, 'has planned for man to fulfil these legitimate needs of food, sleep, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 10, 22, 3, 'sexual satisfaction.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 10, 23, 3, 'Now animals don''t think like that. They have no laws. They try to fulfil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 10, 24, 3, 'these longings in any way possible. Even if it means fighting with other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 10, 25, 3, 'animals and tearing them to pieces, it doesn''t make a difference. When a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 10, 26, 3, 'man behaves like that, we can say that he is reduced to the level of an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 10, 27, 3, 'animal. When man has no spiritual values and he is only interested in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 10, 28, 3, 'earthly things, we can say he has descended to the level of the animals.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 11, 1, 3, 'But God didn''t create us to be like that. He has created us to be like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 11, 2, 3, 'Him - moral, upright, with character and self-control - and not to be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 11, 3, 3, 'slave to animal passions. I mean the mere fact that we, as human beings,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 11, 4, 3, 'are cleverer than animals; that we are educated and we can solve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 11, 5, 3, 'mathematical problems, unlike a dog or a monkey doesn''t make us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 11, 6, 3, 'necessarily better than them. I mean there is a lot of difference');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 11, 7, 3, 'between being cleverer and being better than them. Because we find that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 11, 8, 3, 'even clever educated people are often slaves to greed, sexual lust,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 11, 9, 3, 'anger, bitterness, and selfishness. And very often their behaviour, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 11, 10, 3, 'spite of their being PhDs and intelligent and clever, is exactly like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 11, 11, 3, 'that of animals. Do you know why? Because they haven''t dealt with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 11, 12, 3, 'most important problem in their life; and that is sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 11, 13, 3, 'There is a part of us that is much deeper than our mind. Many people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 11, 14, 3, 'think that man is just body and mind or body and soul, with the soul');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 11, 15, 3, 'consisting of our mind, our emotions, and our personality. No, man is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 11, 16, 3, 'deeper than that. There is a part of man which is much deeper than the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 11, 17, 3, 'soul. That is what the Bible calls our spirit. Our spirit is what makes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 11, 18, 3, 'us aware of the fact that there is a God. No animal has it. So all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 11, 19, 3, 'chaos, confusion, diseases, and evil in this world, are the direct');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 11, 20, 3, 'result of man disobeying God; ignoring what His spirit is prompting him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 11, 21, 3, 'to hear - the voice of God; ignoring that, and listening to the devil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 11, 22, 3, 'Now in an earlier study we considered that God gave man a free will. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 11, 23, 3, 'we didn''t have freedom of choice, as I said in that study, we would be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 11, 24, 3, 'like robots. We would obey God automatically like a robot obeys, but we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 11, 25, 3, 'could never become children of God. A robot cannot be your child. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 11, 26, 3, 'took that risk, we can say, of the possibility of man disobeying Him, of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 11, 27, 3, 'bringing chaos and confusion into this world, by disobeying Him and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 11, 28, 3, 'listening to the devil, being deceived by the devil. But He was willing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 12, 1, 3, 'to take that risk because He wanted children. He wanted those who would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 12, 2, 3, 'obey Him out of voluntary choice freely, not out of compulsion. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 12, 3, 3, 'first man and woman that God created, Adam and Eve, they were created');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 12, 4, 3, 'innocent. And they had to make a choice, if they wanted to be holy. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 12, 5, 3, 'had the freedom of will and, in order to make that choice, they had to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 12, 6, 3, 'be tempted.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 12, 7, 3, 'How do you know, for example, whether your child will obey you if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 12, 8, 3, 'put him in a room with freedom to do whatever he wants to? Supposing you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 12, 9, 3, 'are going away from home and you tell your son, your little boy, ''You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 12, 10, 3, 'can do anything you like till we come back,'' you will never discover');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 12, 11, 3, 'whether your son is obedient or not. If you want to find out whether');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 12, 12, 3, 'your son is obedient or not, you should say something like this: ''well,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 12, 13, 3, 'you can do anything you like in this house except one thing. You should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 12, 14, 3, 'not open that tin of biscuits and eat any biscuit while daddy and mommy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 12, 15, 3, 'are away.'' When you make one restriction like that, you can at least');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 12, 16, 3, 'find out whether he is obedient. He can do anything; he can play, he can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 12, 17, 3, 'read books, he can do anything. But there is one thing you have told him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 12, 18, 3, 'not to do. When you come back and see that he has done that one thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 12, 19, 3, 'which you told him not to, you discover that he is obedient or not. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 12, 20, 3, 'is why temptation is necessary for man to prove his obedience; for man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 12, 21, 3, 'to make a choice and say, ''I say no to something and yes to God.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 12, 22, 3, 'When God created Adam and Eve, we read in the Bible, that He placed them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 12, 23, 3, 'in a garden and they could eat of any tree in that garden. There were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 12, 24, 3, 'beautiful trees with plenty of good fruit, and God said you can eat');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 12, 25, 3, 'anything. It is like you telling your son you can do anything you like,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 12, 26, 3, 'except one thing. And that is what God told Adam and Eve too. ''There is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 12, 27, 3, 'one thing I don''t want you to do: there is one particular tree here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 12, 28, 3, 'which I don''t want you to eat of.'' It wasn''t very difficult. There were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 13, 1, 3, 'a thousand other trees which had excellent fruit, which they could have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 13, 2, 3, 'gone to. There was another tree called the tree of life, which they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 13, 3, 3, 'could have gone to also. It was not that God planted one thousand trees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 13, 4, 3, 'and told them that they were not to eat from 999 of them and they could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 13, 5, 3, 'only eat from one. Then we could say that that would have been tough. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 13, 6, 3, 'mean, if you left your son at home and told him 999 things he could not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 13, 7, 3, 'do, he probably wouldn''t even remember them. If you just allowed him to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 13, 8, 3, 'do only one thing, it would have been difficult. But it wasn''t like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 13, 9, 3, 'that. You left your son at home saying he could do anything he liked,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 13, 10, 3, 'except one thing he should not do. In the same way, God told Adam and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 13, 11, 3, 'Eve that there was only one tree that they should not eat of.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 13, 12, 3, 'There we see the purpose of temptation. It is for man to become holy. As');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 13, 13, 3, 'he says no to that temptation he could become holy. But, on the other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 13, 14, 3, 'hand, if he says yes to that temptation then he would sin. That choice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 13, 15, 3, 'was necessary. We already saw the reason for freedom of choice. We read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 13, 16, 3, 'about this temptation that Adam and Eve had to face, and the results in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 13, 17, 3, 'the first book of the Bible, Genesis 2 and 3.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 13, 18, 3, 'Now there is a lot of difference between being innocent and being holy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 13, 19, 3, 'Innocence is what you see in a baby. You know that a baby is ignorant of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 13, 20, 3, 'good and evil, neither holy nor perfect. But if a little baby, as it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 13, 21, 3, 'grows up, has to become a man of character, it has to make choices.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 13, 22, 3, 'Adam, though he was physically like a grown man, was in a sense like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 13, 23, 3, 'baby. He was innocent and he had to make a choice of refusing evil and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 13, 24, 3, 'choosing God in order to become a mature, spiritual man, which is what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 13, 25, 3, 'God wanted him to be. There we understand the reason why God permits us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 13, 26, 3, 'to be tempted with our passions, with things that we know are wrong, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 13, 27, 3, 'why God allows Satan to come and tempt us. When we refuse to yield to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 13, 28, 3, 'temptation in our minds, you know what happens? Every time you say no to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 14, 1, 3, 'a temptation, you are developing character. The type of person you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 14, 2, 3, 'today is the net result of all the decisions that you have made in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 14, 3, 3, 'life so far. If others around you are better, it is because they made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 14, 4, 3, 'better choices, and if you are evil, it is because the choices you made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 14, 5, 3, 'were evil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 14, 6, 3, 'We can''t do anything about our past, but we can do something about the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 14, 7, 3, 'future. It is sin to choose evil, and holiness to choose God. Jesus has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 14, 8, 3, 'come to show us this, so that we can know what is good for us. He has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 14, 9, 3, 'not only come to show us what is right, He has come also to help us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 14, 10, 3, 'Will you pray a little prayer right now, and say, ''Lord, I can''t do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 14, 11, 3, 'anything about the past years of my life, but I want to do something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 14, 12, 3, 'about the future. I want to choose what will please you. Lord Jesus,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 14, 13, 3, 'help me.'' He will help you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 14, 14, 4, 'Chapter 4 Sin Comes From Unbelief');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 14, 15, 4, '''Sin,'' what is it? Every religion in the world uses the word ''sin''. But,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 14, 16, 4, 'I think, it is true to say that in the minds of many human beings, who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 14, 17, 4, 'are religious, there is no understanding of what it is. Even those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 14, 18, 4, 'read the Bible, if you ask them, ''What is sin, really,'' they don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 14, 19, 4, 'understand. Just as when we understand the sickness, we can find the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 14, 20, 4, 'cure, so do we when we understand sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 14, 21, 4, 'The Bible speaks about how the first man and woman, whom God created,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 14, 22, 4, 'sinned. Essentially, they sinned because they did not believe that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 14, 23, 4, 'was a good God, who loved them, who gave commands for their good. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 14, 24, 4, 'had placed them in a garden where He told them they could eat anything;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 14, 25, 4, 'they could do anything except one thing - they were not to eat of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 14, 26, 4, 'particular tree. There God wanted to test their obedience. And not only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 14, 27, 4, 'to test their obedience but also to give them an opportunity to choose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 14, 28, 4, 'what was right; to say no to what was wrong, and thereby develop');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 15, 1, 4, 'character. We read in Genesis 3 how that Satan came into that garden and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 15, 2, 4, 'tempted Adam and Eve to do what God told them not to. He tempted them by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 15, 3, 4, 'telling them that they could get certain advantages if they ate of that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 15, 4, 4, 'tree. They were told they would be like God - ''you will develop your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 15, 5, 4, 'personality.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 15, 6, 4, 'That is how Satan always comes. When Satan tempts people to do something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 15, 7, 4, 'wrong, he never tells them about the consequences. When Satan tempts a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 15, 8, 4, 'person to take his first alcoholic drink, he does not tell him how he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 15, 9, 4, 'will finally become enslaved to alcoholic drinks; become a drunkard,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 15, 10, 4, 'waste his money, destroy his family, bring poverty into his home, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 15, 11, 4, 'how his wife and children will suffer. He doesn''t tell him all that. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 15, 12, 4, 'just says, ''You will get a kick out of it.'' When he tempts some young');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 15, 13, 4, 'person to take drugs, he doesn''t tell that person how finally he will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 15, 14, 4, 'destroy his mind, destroy his life. He will probably have a premature');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 15, 15, 4, 'death, he will lose all his money, he will probably become a thief');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 15, 16, 4, 'finally because he would want more and more money with his insatiable');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 15, 17, 4, 'craving for drugs. The devil won''t tell him all that. He will just tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 15, 18, 4, 'him how he is going to enjoy himself if he takes a little of these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 15, 19, 4, 'forbidden drugs and that he will get a kick out of it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 15, 20, 4, 'It was exactly like that when Satan came to Adam and Eve in the Garden');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 15, 21, 4, 'of Eden. There we have an example of how he comes to all human beings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 15, 22, 4, 'today, telling them what they can gain. When he tells a man to steal, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 15, 23, 4, 'doesn''t tell him about all the potential dangers; about how he could be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 15, 24, 4, 'locked up in jail, he could have children grow up following his example');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 15, 25, 4, 'and be thieves, etc. No, he just tells of that immediate prospect of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 15, 26, 4, 'gaining some money. In the same way with adultery, Satan doesn''t tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 15, 27, 4, 'people about the consequences, but only the immediate pleasure. Remember');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 15, 28, 4, 'this thing: whenever you are tempted, temptation always offers a certain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 16, 1, 4, 'forbidden pleasure. But if you are sensible, you will think of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 16, 2, 4, 'consequences. A sensible man always thinks about the future, not just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 16, 3, 4, 'about the immediate present. He thinks what is going to be the result of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 16, 4, 4, 'my action? And if you think about the results of your action, there are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 16, 5, 4, 'many things you will not do.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 16, 6, 4, 'Animals don''t normally think about the results of their actions, though');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 16, 7, 4, 'some animals do. There are many animals which are sensible, more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 16, 8, 4, 'sensible than human beings. But very often animals don''t know the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 16, 9, 4, 'consequences of their actions, but we do. We have seen around us so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 16, 10, 4, 'examples of people who have destroyed themselves by wrong actions. Adam');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 16, 11, 4, 'and Eve took a very important decision that day that produced lifelong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 16, 12, 4, 'consequences, not only for themselves, but for their children and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 16, 13, 4, 'grandchildren and all their descendants. From that we should learn one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 16, 14, 4, 'thing, that all the decisions we take in life produce consequences; we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 16, 15, 4, 'have to reap what we sow. That is what the Bible says. Many a times, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 16, 16, 4, 'is not only we who will have to suffer, our children also will have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 16, 17, 4, 'reap what we sow. The same works the other way too. If you sow what is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 16, 18, 4, 'good, your children are going to reap the good fruit of what you sow.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 16, 19, 4, 'In Adam''s case, he and his wife were sent out of God''s presence from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 16, 20, 4, 'that garden for the rest of their lives. So don''t think that the little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 16, 21, 4, 'choices that you make in your life are unimportant, and that you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 16, 22, 4, 'never reap a harvest in your future of what you are sowing today. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 16, 23, 4, 'not true. I mean, the devil will blind you and make you think that such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 16, 24, 4, 'things will not happen. But they will. We considered in an earlier study');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 16, 25, 4, 'as to why does God want us to be tempted? - So that our character may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 16, 26, 4, 'develop. He doesn''t want robots. He doesn''t want inanimate beings that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 16, 27, 4, 'just go automatically according to certain laws of nature. He wants us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 16, 28, 4, 'to be moral beings that choose to do what is good. That is the only way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 17, 1, 4, 'we can be children of God. There is no virtue in choosing what is good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 17, 2, 4, 'unless there is an alternative choice which is also attractive.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 17, 3, 4, 'See, when Adam and Eve were put into that garden, if God had made that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 17, 4, 4, 'forbidden tree ugly, repulsive, full of thorns and thistles, and in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 17, 5, 4, 'every way hideous, would Adam and Eve ever have been tempted to go near');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 17, 6, 4, 'it? But we read in the Bible that the tree was very attractive. It made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 17, 7, 4, 'Adam and Eve''s mouths water; they longed to eat of it. Temptation has to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 17, 8, 4, 'be attractive for it to be a temptation. Otherwise, it is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 17, 9, 4, 'temptation. If you find something in the world unattractive, you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 17, 10, 4, 'never be tempted by it. Character is developed through temptation that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 17, 11, 4, 'is attractive and yet which you know is wrong and you are resisting and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 17, 12, 4, 'saying no to it. That is what it is to be a moral being.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 17, 13, 4, 'That is why God has allowed many things in the world to be attractive.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 17, 14, 4, 'Some of those things are forbidden, for example, an attractive woman who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 17, 15, 4, 'is not your wife. You are not to lust after her, you are not to admire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 17, 16, 4, 'her beauty. It will destroy you. It will destroy your marriage');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 17, 17, 4, 'relationship. Money is attractive, but if you place money above God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 17, 18, 4, 'pursue after money to the exclusion of God - like many people do - your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 17, 19, 4, 'life will be destroyed. So everything we do, every decision we take is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 17, 20, 4, 'like sowing a seed from that comes the harvest.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 17, 21, 4, 'Now let us look at the sin of Adam and Eve. God loved them. He gave them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 17, 22, 4, 'their bodies, gave them health, gave them life, gave them a garden, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 17, 23, 4, 'gave them each other. They should have thought, ''Well, God is so good.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 17, 24, 4, 'He will give everything good for us. If he forbids us from partaking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 17, 25, 4, 'something, it must be with a very good reason.'' If they had that faith,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 17, 26, 4, 'they would not have gone astray. But they lost faith in God. They did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 17, 27, 4, 'not believe that God was good when Satan told them that God did not want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 17, 28, 4, 'them to be like Him: ''There is some reason why He did not allow you to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 18, 1, 4, 'eat from this tree; He doesn''t want you to develop.'' They believed that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 18, 2, 4, 'lie, and it is when people believe the lie of Satan that they fall into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 18, 3, 4, 'sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 18, 4, 4, 'Sin begins with unbelief in the perfect love of God. That leads to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 18, 5, 4, 'disobedience. That is why, in the Bible, faith in God and obedience to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 18, 6, 4, 'his commandments are linked always close together. And unbelief and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 18, 7, 4, 'disobedience to God''s commandments also go together. Disobedience is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 18, 8, 4, 'fruit of unbelief, just like obedience is the fruit of faith. If I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 18, 9, 4, 'believe, for example, that everything that God has forbidden will harm');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 18, 10, 4, 'me, I will be very happy to avoid all of them. Why? Because I believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 18, 11, 4, 'that God is a good God. And whatever God tells me to do, if I believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 18, 12, 4, 'that it is really for my good, I would obey. So, when I don''t have faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 18, 13, 4, 'in God''s love, I sin. That is unbelief which leads to sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 18, 14, 4, 'Consider our children, for example, when we tell them to go to school.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 18, 15, 4, 'When they are small, say, 4 or 5 years old, they are not eager to go to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 18, 16, 4, 'school; we have to force them. And sometimes they go weeping to school,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 18, 17, 4, 'perhaps thinking that daddy and mommy are so hard; they are forcing me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 18, 18, 4, 'to go to school; they don''t allow me to sit at home and play. But we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 18, 19, 4, 'know what is good for them. They don''t know what is good for them. One');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 18, 20, 4, 'day, when they grow up, they will realise that what daddy and mommy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 18, 21, 4, 'forced them to do was good for them. In the same way, if we can believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 18, 22, 4, 'in God, we will realise that everything He tells us is for our good and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 18, 23, 4, 'then we will do it. So the first step to God is faith, and then comes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 18, 24, 4, 'obedience. That is what we see in the New Testament. In The New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 18, 25, 4, 'Testament, salvation comes by faith. You must believe in God, believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 18, 26, 4, 'that He is good, that He is kind, that He is interested in you. Sin is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 18, 27, 4, 'unbelief. You don''t believe that God is good, and therefore you do the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 18, 28, 4, 'things which He tells you not to do; the things He tells you to avoid');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 19, 1, 4, 'through the conscience within you. You don''t obey in the things which He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 19, 2, 4, 'tells you to obey. Why? - Because you don''t believe.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 19, 3, 4, 'We can also say that ''sin'' is choosing created things; ourselves, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 19, 4, 4, 'our ways above God, instead of God''s way; seeking to please ourselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 19, 5, 4, 'instead of pleasing God. That is what Adam and Eve did. There was this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 19, 6, 4, 'tree that would satisfy their longing and even though God had told them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 19, 7, 4, 'not to take part in it, they did it. Why do people commit adultery? It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 19, 8, 4, 'is because they want their own way, they want to please themselves. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 19, 9, 4, 'don''t believe in what God says about the harm that will do to them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 19, 10, 4, 'Once our minds are enlightened to see this truth, that God is a good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 19, 11, 4, 'God, everything He forbids us from taking part of is for our good,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 19, 12, 4, 'everything He tells us to do is for our good, we will submit to God, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 19, 13, 4, 'will submit to Jesus Christ. We will open our hearts to the teaching of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 19, 14, 4, 'Christ in the Scriptures, and say, ''Lord, I want to obey your word.'' I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 19, 15, 4, 'want to encourage you to turn to the Bible and read it. When you pray,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 19, 16, 4, 'say, ''Lord Jesus, help me to give up everything you tell me to give up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 19, 17, 4, 'and to do everything you tell me to do. I believe you are a good God.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 19, 18, 5, 'Chapter 5 The Function Of Conscience');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 19, 19, 5, 'God''s greatest gift to all men in their own beings and personalities is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 19, 20, 5, 'something that we don''t think often about. And because we ignore it, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 19, 21, 5, 'brings a lot of suffering in our lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 19, 22, 5, 'All of us have been born from that first couple, Adam and Eve. And the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 19, 23, 5, 'sinful nature that poisoned, that entered into their system when they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 19, 24, 5, 'disobeyed God, is something that Adam and Eve have passed on to all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 19, 25, 5, 'their descendants. Today, we are all born with this tendency towards');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 19, 26, 5, 'evil. We see that in children. We don''t have to teach children to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 19, 27, 5, 'evil. We don''t have to teach children to tell lies. We don''t have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 19, 28, 5, 'teach children to do anything wrong. You know as parents what we have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 20, 1, 5, 'teach children, is to do good. They are born with a tendency towards');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 20, 2, 5, 'evil. That is because of that nature which they have inherited from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 20, 3, 5, 'parents and ultimately from Adam and Eve who sinned.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 20, 4, 5, 'We see, for example, children basically wanting their own way. Sin is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 20, 5, 5, 'not just external actions. It is far deeper rooted than that. It is an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 20, 6, 5, 'attitude of rebellion against God where I want my own way in life. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 20, 7, 5, 'want to please myself, and it doesn''t matter if other people get hurt in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 20, 8, 5, 'the process. It doesn''t really matter what God thinks about it, so long');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 20, 9, 5, 'as I please myself. We see that attitude very clearly in little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 20, 10, 5, 'children. Little children will grab and fight, and take things from one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 20, 11, 5, 'another. They are not bothered about other children. They just want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 20, 12, 5, 'be happy themselves. This wanting one''s own way, this stubbornness, is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 20, 13, 5, 'something that is in a child''s nature from birth. And as he grows up, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 20, 14, 5, 'doesn''t get rid of that. In fact, as we grow to manhood, we don''t really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 20, 15, 5, 'change. We are still the same except that we seek our own in more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 20, 16, 5, 'refined and cultured ways. We just become cleverer and change our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 20, 17, 5, 'methods by which we seek to grab for ourselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 20, 18, 5, 'So the fifty year-old man and the one year-old child, are basically the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 20, 19, 5, 'same in wanting to seek their own except they seek it in different');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 20, 20, 5, 'methods. The barbarian in the jungle, and the cultured, civilized man in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 20, 21, 5, 'the city are both basically the same. The selfishness of the cultured');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 20, 22, 5, 'person, his covetousness, and his lust may be covered up with culture');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 20, 23, 5, 'and civilization, but he hasn''t changed within. And very often,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 20, 24, 5, 'religious people too are the same; selfish within, with an external');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 20, 25, 5, 'veneer of graciousness and goodness, but basically, wanting to have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 20, 26, 5, 'their own way. The Bible teaches us that this is the cause of all of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 20, 27, 5, 'problems - wanting to have our own way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 20, 28, 5, 'What is that which God has placed within us which we could say is God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 21, 1, 5, 'greatest gift to man? It is our conscience. Conscience points out to us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 21, 2, 5, 'where we come short of God''s standards. It is not a perfect guide, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 21, 3, 5, 'it is an initial guide that shows us where we come short. When we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 21, 4, 5, 'seeking to please ourselves, when we are harming another, our conscience');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 21, 5, 5, 'warns us. Particularly the conscience of little children is very tender.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 21, 6, 5, 'It is not easy for a child to tell a lie with a straight face. When a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 21, 7, 5, 'little child tells a lie, we can see it on its face that he is telling a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 21, 8, 5, 'lie. But as we grow older, we kill that voice of conscience so much,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 21, 9, 5, 'that a time can come in our life, where we can tell a lie with a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 21, 10, 5, 'straight face. And then we can say that our conscience has become almost');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 21, 11, 5, 'dead.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 21, 12, 5, 'Now that is a serious thing, because conscience is like a warning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 21, 13, 5, 'signal. It is like pain. Some of us don''t realise what a great blessing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 21, 14, 5, 'pain is in our body. It is pain that tells us that something is wrong.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 21, 15, 5, 'If you get a nail stuck in your foot, for example, you feel the pain.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 21, 16, 5, 'That is what tells you something is wrong. And you sit down and pull off');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 21, 17, 5, 'that nail; otherwise, your foot would get infected. If something is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 21, 18, 5, 'wrong with your stomach, or in your kidneys, or somewhere, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 21, 19, 5, 'indication is always pain. Pain is one of the greatest blessings in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 21, 20, 5, 'physical body. It is because of that we are saved from death many times,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 21, 21, 5, 'or from infections. We are immediately aware that something is wrong.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 21, 22, 5, 'Now the equivalent of pain in our spirit is our conscience, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 21, 23, 5, 'troubles us when we do something wrong. Think of those who have the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 21, 24, 5, 'disease of leprosy, what happens to them? Leprosy kills the nerves and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 21, 25, 5, 'destroys sensation in the skin. A person with leprosy can have a nail');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 21, 26, 5, 'pierce through his foot, and he won''t even know it, because he doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 21, 27, 5, 'have the blessing of pain. His foot would get infected, and he still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 21, 28, 5, 'wouldn''t know it, because he doesn''t feel the pain. In fact, I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 22, 1, 5, 'heard stories of lepers whose toes were bitten off by rats in the middle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 22, 2, 5, 'of the night, when they were asleep, and they didn''t feel a thing. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 22, 3, 5, 'they got up in the morning, they found that their toes were missing and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 22, 4, 5, 'there is blood all around. Is that a good state to be in, where you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 22, 5, 5, 'don''t feel pain? I hope you realise what a tremendous blessing it is to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 22, 6, 5, 'have pain. Pain is what saves us from losing our toes, or our foot, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 22, 7, 5, 'our fingers or anything. It is through pain that we know something is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 22, 8, 5, 'wrong.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 22, 9, 5, 'Conscience is like pain. It warns us when we have violated God''s laws.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 22, 10, 5, 'What happens if you ignore its warnings, like many people do? You tell a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 22, 11, 5, 'lie, and your conscience tells you it is wrong, and you just suppress');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 22, 12, 5, 'that voice? It doesn''t die immediately. But over a period of time, if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 22, 13, 5, 'you keep doing that, finally, your conscience won''t trouble you anymore');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 22, 14, 5, 'when you tell a lie. And it could go on with other sins as well. What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 22, 15, 5, 'happens then is that we get spiritual leprosy, and a day will come when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 22, 16, 5, 'you won''t feel any sensitivity to sin anymore. That is not a good state');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 22, 17, 5, 'to be in. It means you are spiritually dead. We would then become like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 22, 18, 5, 'animals, which have no conscience. A person, who has killed his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 22, 19, 5, 'conscience, descends to the level of an animal, which has no conscience.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 22, 20, 5, 'That is the reason why some human beings, sometimes, behave much worse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 22, 21, 5, 'than animals.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 22, 22, 5, 'So I hope you realise now, that one of the greatest blessings or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 22, 23, 5, 'greatest gifts that God has given to man in His spirit is the gift of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 22, 24, 5, 'conscience. It tells us that we are spiritually sick, just like pain in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 22, 25, 5, 'our body will tell that we are physically sick or something is wrong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 22, 26, 5, 'inside and we should do something about it to get rid of it. We don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 22, 27, 5, 'try to ignore the pain. We do something to heal that sickness. In the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 22, 28, 5, 'same way, when the conscience tells us something is wrong, it is God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 23, 1, 5, 'voice, within us, telling us, ''You are responsible for what you did;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 23, 2, 5, 'what you did was wrong; you need to set it right.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 23, 3, 5, 'Jesus once used an illustration. He said that we should keep our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 23, 4, 5, 'conscience like we keep our eyes. You know how carefully we keep our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 23, 5, 5, 'eyes. It is the one part of our body that is bathed many times without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 23, 6, 5, 'even our realising it. Every time our eyelids close, our eyes are being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 23, 7, 5, 'cleaned with tears, and that happens thousands of times in a day. All');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 23, 8, 5, 'the dust is being wiped out. Now we can afford to have dust on our body,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 23, 9, 5, 'all over our body, and live for many days. It won''t destroy us or our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 23, 10, 5, 'bodies. But if you get even one speck of dust in your eyes, it can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 23, 11, 5, 'damage your eyes very soon, if you don''t do anything about it. A small');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 23, 12, 5, 'speck of dust is enough to destroy the eyes. That is why God has made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 23, 13, 5, 'the human body in such a way that the eyes are washed all the time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 23, 14, 5, 'Jesus said keep your conscience like you keep your eyes. In the Gospel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 23, 15, 5, 'of Luke 11:34-36, He likened the conscience to the eye. He said if your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 23, 16, 5, 'eye is clear, your whole body will be full of light. In other words, if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 23, 17, 5, 'you keep your conscience clear - what does that mean? That means that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 23, 18, 5, 'when we have done something wrong, we acknowledge it, we set the matter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 23, 19, 5, 'right. If you have hurt somebody you go and ask his forgiveness. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 23, 20, 5, 'have sinned against God you confess your sin to God. It is the first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 23, 21, 5, 'step to spiritual heath, just like setting our body right whenever we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 23, 22, 5, 'discover pain. It is the first step to physical health. In the same way,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 23, 23, 5, 'conscience is the indication of sin in your body. It is only those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 23, 24, 5, 'recognise that they are sick who go to a doctor. Jesus once said to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 23, 25, 5, 'certain religious people of His time that He couldn''t help them; He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 23, 26, 5, 'didn''t really come for them because they were not aware that they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 23, 27, 5, 'sick. They were so convinced that because they were religious, they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 23, 28, 5, 'accepted by God. But they were sick as anything.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 24, 1, 5, 'How was it they were not aware of it? Because they had killed their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 24, 2, 5, 'conscience for so many years, they were not even aware of how distant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 24, 3, 5, 'they were from God. A lot of religious people try to appease God or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 24, 4, 5, 'please Him by going to places of worship, by giving money to the poor,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 24, 5, 5, 'and various other means. But none of these things can cleanse our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 24, 6, 5, 'conscience from sin. The most important thing for us to recognise is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 24, 7, 5, 'that it is sin that has separated us from God. And any amount of good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 24, 8, 5, 'works or money given to the poor, or any types of activity like that can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 24, 9, 5, 'never bring us back to God. If we recognise that we are sick and that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 24, 10, 5, 'need to be cleansed, and that sin is destroying our soul, we will come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 24, 11, 5, 'to God; we will come to Jesus Christ who came to earth to forgive us our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 24, 12, 5, 'sins. The Bible says that if we confess our sins - that means you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 24, 13, 5, 'acknowledge you are a sinner - and tell the Lord what you have done, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 24, 14, 5, 'will forgive you, because He came to earth to die for our sins.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 24, 15, 6, 'Chapter 6 Why Christ Has To Die');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 24, 16, 6, 'Sin separates man from God. This is the first problem that needs to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 24, 17, 6, 'dealt with, before man can come back into fellowship with God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 24, 18, 6, 'God is a holy God. He is a loving Father and He is a God full of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 24, 19, 6, 'goodness and love. But however loving He may be, He cannot overlook our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 24, 20, 6, 'rebellion and our sin, because He is holy as well. Now, it is this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 24, 21, 6, 'balance between the holiness and the love of God that many people do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 24, 22, 6, 'seem to have understood. Many people''s idea is this: that if they just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 24, 23, 6, 'go to God and say, ''Well, God I am sorry for what I have done,'' He will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 24, 24, 6, 'forgive them. But on what basis can He forgive them? If you were to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 24, 25, 6, 'commit a crime against the laws of the land and you were taken to court');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 24, 26, 6, 'by the police, and if the one sitting as a judge was your own earthly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 24, 27, 6, 'father, who loves you intensely, could he say, ''Well I love you my son,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 24, 28, 6, 'I declare you to be free?'' He may love you intensely, but as long as he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 25, 1, 6, 'is sitting there as a judge it would be unjust for him to let you go.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 25, 2, 6, 'Now if a human being can be so just and fair and righteous, can you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 25, 3, 6, 'imagine how much more just and righteous God is? But what can that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 25, 4, 6, 'father do for you? He can punish you with the full penalty of the law.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 25, 5, 6, 'Let us say it is a 100,000 rupees fine that he imposes upon you as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 25, 6, 6, 'judge. And then, he can step down from his judge''s chair, take off his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 25, 7, 6, 'robes and come to you as your father, and write out a check from his own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 25, 8, 6, 'hard-earned money for those 100,000 rupees and give it to you to pay the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 25, 9, 6, 'fine. Then there would be no injustice, because he has punished you with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 25, 10, 6, 'the full penalty of the law, and then paid that punishment himself. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 25, 11, 6, 'is the only way in which God can forgive our sin. It is not by our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 25, 12, 6, 'feeling sorry for our sins alone; it is by God having provided a way in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 25, 13, 6, 'His justice for the price of our sins being paid.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 25, 14, 6, 'This is the whole message of the Bible. That is what Jesus Christ did.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 25, 15, 6, 'God came down to earth in the person of Jesus Christ, and paid that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 25, 16, 6, 'price. He punished us with a full penalty of the law; the punishment for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 25, 17, 6, 'sin is death. You and I need to get that death whether our sins are many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 25, 18, 6, 'or few. A man who commits one murder is hanged and a man who commits a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 25, 19, 6, 'thousand murders is also hanged. The number of sins doesn''t make a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 25, 20, 6, 'difference. If we are guilty, we deserve death whether our sins are one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 25, 21, 6, 'or many. But God, in His love, made this way by which our sins can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 25, 22, 6, 'forgiven: Jesus Christ came to earth and took our punishment when He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 25, 23, 6, 'died upon the cross. God had to become a man, just like us. He had to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 25, 24, 6, 'live through the temptations and struggles that we face as human beings.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 25, 25, 6, 'He died as a sacrifice in our stead, taking the punishment of our sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 25, 26, 6, 'upon Himself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 25, 27, 6, 'Now, remember this: the punishment for sin is not physical suffering, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 25, 28, 6, 'sickness, or poverty, or coming back into the world on a lower social');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 26, 1, 6, 'scale, or any such thing. The punishment for sin is eternal death. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 26, 2, 6, 'means being separated from God forever. Also our sin is like a debt that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 26, 3, 6, 'we owe to God. Jesus Christ, when He died, paid that debt for us. Our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 26, 4, 6, 'good works, the Bible says, are like filthy rags in God''s sight. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 26, 5, 6, 'think of certain works as good works and certain works as bad works. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 26, 6, 6, 'that is because we compare ourselves with other people who are more evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 26, 7, 6, 'than us. To take an illustration from a classroom, a student who got 25%');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 26, 8, 6, 'in mathematics may consider himself a very bright student compared to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 26, 9, 6, 'the other student who got 5%. That may be true, but he has failed, just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 26, 10, 6, 'like the other student has failed as well. And they both have to sit in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 26, 11, 6, 'the same class next year, even though one got 20 marks more than the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 26, 12, 6, 'other. So when we say we are good or somebody is good, it is a relative');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 26, 13, 6, 'term; compared to somebody else he is good, he got 20%, whereas the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 26, 14, 6, 'other person got 10%. But compared to Almighty God''s standard, of 100%,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 26, 15, 6, 'everybody has come short. That is why the Bible says, even the so-called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 26, 16, 6, 'good things that you have done are not valuable in God''s eyes. They are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 26, 17, 6, 'like filthy rags in God''s eyes; they cannot make you acceptable before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 26, 18, 6, 'Him .It is because we have such a low understanding of God''s standards');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 26, 19, 6, 'that we think the few good works that we do are going to make us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 26, 20, 6, 'acceptable to Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 26, 21, 6, 'God''s standard of holiness is infinite and none of us can ever reach it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 26, 22, 6, 'We are all in a hopeless condition, every one of us. If even our good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 26, 23, 6, 'works, and the best works we can ever do, cannot measure up to God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 26, 24, 6, 'standard, then what hope is there for us? We are hopelessly lost. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 26, 25, 6, 'is why God made this way through sending His own Son, Jesus Christ, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 26, 26, 6, 'die for our sins. And through Christ''s death, every sin of every human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 26, 27, 6, 'being has been totally atoned for - that means, paid for. Your debt has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 26, 28, 6, 'been paid. But like the illustration I used in the beginning, of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 27, 1, 6, 'father who comes down from the judge''s seat and writes out a check and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 27, 2, 6, 'gives it to his son to pay the fine, that son is still not free until he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 27, 3, 6, 'takes the check from his father. It is not enough that the father has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 27, 4, 6, 'written the check. The son has to take it. And that is what God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 27, 5, 6, 'waiting for man to do.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 27, 6, 6, 'God has already paid the price for man''s sin when Christ died 2,000');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 27, 7, 6, 'years ago on a cross. But that forgiveness can never be yours until you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 27, 8, 6, 'accept it. You have to take it, you have to say, ''thank you Lord, for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 27, 9, 6, 'dying for me.'' And you see the foolishness of a man when he does not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 27, 10, 6, 'receive that which is offered freely. What would you think of that son');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 27, 11, 6, 'in the courtroom, when his father writes out this check of 100,000');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 27, 12, 6, 'rupees, and he doesn''t take it? That is the foolishness of man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 27, 13, 6, 'everywhere. If that son says, ''No, I will pay the fine myself,'' well, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 27, 14, 6, 'is going to spend years in the jail and still not be able to pay the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 27, 15, 6, 'fine. That is the condition of man. Man is unable to pay for his sins.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 27, 16, 6, 'The only way we can have our sins forgiven is coming in simplicity,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 27, 17, 6, 'acknowledging our need, and saying, ''Lord, I am unable to meet my need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 27, 18, 6, 'of forgiveness. I want to receive it from you. I am never able to pay');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 27, 19, 6, 'for my sins. Thank you, that Jesus died for me and that when He shed his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 27, 20, 6, 'blood on the cross and gave His body as a sacrifice; it took care of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 27, 21, 6, 'punishment of all my sins.'' Then the demands of God''s justice have been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 27, 22, 6, 'met.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 27, 23, 6, 'How do we know whether this sacrifice of Jesus Christ was accepted or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 27, 24, 6, 'not by the holy God? This is very important to know. The proof is that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 27, 25, 6, 'after three days, Jesus Christ was raised from the dead. See, these two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 27, 26, 6, 'things make the message of The Bible and the Christian Gospel unique. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 27, 27, 6, 'is different from any other message. We can say that every religion in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 27, 28, 6, 'the world teaches us that we must be good, we must be kind, etc. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 28, 1, 6, 'all true. But there is the foundation in the Christian Gospel which is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 28, 2, 6, 'unique, and what is that? Two things, basically: The Christian gospel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 28, 3, 6, 'does not start with, ''Be good, be kind, and don''t tell lies, etc.,'' that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 28, 4, 6, 'comes much later. It starts with, ''You cannot be good, you cannot be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 28, 5, 6, 'upright, and everything you do is unacceptable to God. First of all, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 28, 6, 6, 'need the guilt of your past life to be removed. You got to clear your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 28, 7, 6, 'old account before we start on our new account. The old debt has to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 28, 8, 6, 'cleared.'' How is that cleared? Christ died for the sins of the world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 28, 9, 6, 'That is the way that old record is cleared, the debt is taken out of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 28, 10, 6, 'way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 28, 11, 6, 'Secondly, the proof is that Christ rose again from the dead. There is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 28, 12, 6, 'only one person in the history of the human race that came out from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 28, 13, 6, 'grave and conquered man''s greatest enemy: death. There is one thing man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 28, 14, 6, 'has never been able to conquer. Man has conquered space; man has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 28, 15, 6, 'conquered many sicknesses, but he has never been able to conquer death');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 28, 16, 6, 'and he will never be able to conquer death. Jesus Christ is the only one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 28, 17, 6, 'who has conquered death. That is the proof to the entire human race that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 28, 18, 6, 'His sacrifice is accepted. Now all we have got to do is to believe, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 28, 19, 6, 'receive. The Bible says that if you believe in your heart that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 28, 20, 6, 'raised Jesus from the dead, and if you confess with your mouth that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 28, 21, 6, 'Jesus Christ is Lord, you will be saved. Your sins will be forgiven - it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 28, 22, 6, 'is like receiving that check that the father gives and saying, ''Thank');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 28, 23, 6, 'you dad for paying my fine. I can go out of this courtroom absolutely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 28, 24, 6, 'free.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 28, 25, 6, 'The Bible says that Jesus Christ is going to come back to this world to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 28, 26, 6, 'judge every human being that ever lived here. Before that time comes, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 28, 27, 6, 'have to make sure that our life is right with God, that our sins are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 28, 28, 6, 'forgiven. This is the invitation that comes to you today. What do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 29, 1, 6, 'have to do? Acknowledge that you are a sinner. Believe that Christ died');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 29, 2, 6, 'for your sins and rose again. Receive Him into your life. Ask him to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 29, 3, 6, 'forgive you. Confess Him as your Lord. That means, say it with your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 29, 4, 6, 'mouth: ''Jesus Christ is now my Lord.'' It is that simple. May God help');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 29, 5, 6, 'you to take that decision today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 29, 6, 7, 'Chapter 7 Repentance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 29, 7, 7, 'Repentance means an about-turn in our lives. That is what helps us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 29, 8, 7, 'turn towards God. God has to see that a man chooses Him before He can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 29, 9, 7, 'forgive his sin. God doesn''t force anyone to accept what he does not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 29, 10, 7, 'want. God has given you a free will. If you don''t want what He offers,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 29, 11, 7, 'He won''t thrust it down your throat. The Bible says that Jesus stands at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 29, 12, 7, 'the door of your heart and knocks. He waits for you to open the door');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 29, 13, 7, 'because He is a gentleman. He will never force you to do anything that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 29, 14, 7, 'you don''t want. He wants you to respond to His invitation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 29, 15, 7, 'To be united with Christ is something like getting married. Here is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 29, 16, 7, 'man who says ''Yes, I am willing to marry you'' to a girl, but the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 29, 17, 7, 'marriage is not complete until the girl also says, ''I am also willing.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 29, 18, 7, 'When both express their willingness, then only does the marriage take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 29, 19, 7, 'place. Now a man may have said he wants to marry the girl and he may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 29, 20, 7, 'have to wait five years before the girl says, yes. That is how it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 29, 21, 7, 'with God. He says to you, ''I want to be united with you. I want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 29, 22, 7, 'forgive your sins, I want to come and live in your heart and I want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 29, 23, 7, 'bless you. I want to change your life, and I want to deliver you from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 29, 24, 7, 'your bad habits.'' But He won''t do it until you say, yes. He is not going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 29, 25, 7, 'to force Himself into a marriage with you if you are not interested.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 29, 26, 7, 'That is why so many people in the world live without God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 29, 27, 7, 'Now you see a lot of people in this world living with religion. To live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 29, 28, 7, 'with a religion is not the same as living with God. There is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 30, 1, 7, 'tremendous difference. There are so many religions including the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 30, 2, 7, 'Christian religion. People usually have a religion because they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 30, 3, 7, 'born into it. They were born into a particular family and so they go to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 30, 4, 7, 'a particular place of worship. But there is a lot of difference between');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 30, 5, 7, 'that and being united to the person of God. Jesus Christ did not come to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 30, 6, 7, 'start a new religion. No, that is a misunderstanding. Jesus Christ did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 30, 7, 7, 'not come to teach us to go through many rituals, and to go to Church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 30, 8, 7, 'every Sunday. No. He primarily came to bring us into a relationship with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 30, 9, 7, 'God as our Father; into a personal relationship with Him; into a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 30, 10, 7, 'marriage, like I said. He has already said yes when He died on the cross');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 30, 11, 7, 'for you, and rose up from the dead. Now He is waiting for you to respond');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 30, 12, 7, 'to Him just like the girl had to say yes to the waiting boy. And the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 30, 13, 7, 'moment you say yes, your marriage is over. You are united with Him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 30, 14, 7, 'forever. But in order to do that (say yes to Him), you have to do what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 30, 15, 7, 'the Bible calls you to - repent.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 30, 16, 7, 'Repent is a very simple word which just means ''to turn about''. Now you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 30, 17, 7, 'have seen a military parade. You have seen perhaps the leader of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 30, 18, 7, 'parade saying ''about-turn''. When that command is given, all the soldiers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 30, 19, 7, 'turn 180 degrees to the opposite direction of what they were facing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 30, 20, 7, 'before. That is an about-turn and that is basically what repentance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 30, 21, 7, 'really means. We are born with our backs to God. We are not really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 30, 22, 7, 'interested in God. The Bible says that no one in the world seeks out for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 30, 23, 7, 'God. A lot of people are religious, but to seek for God is something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 30, 24, 7, 'quite different from being religious. We are born seeking our own profit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 30, 25, 7, 'and gain. Even the religious people are seeking their own profit and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 30, 26, 7, 'gain. Think of all the people who go to various places of pilgrimage.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 30, 27, 7, 'What are they going there for? They are going there to get some benefit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 30, 28, 7, 'for themselves. And there we see that it is really selfishness; they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 31, 1, 7, 'no different than the non-religious businessman who is also seeking his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 31, 2, 7, 'own interest when he seeks to make money in the marketplace.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 31, 3, 7, 'So to turn to God means to turn away from seeking just my own way in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 31, 4, 7, 'life; to say, ''Lord, I want to turn around from everything that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 31, 5, 7, 'dishonours you and displeases You. I want to turn around and face You.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 31, 6, 7, 'Till now my back was to You and my face was towards the world, towards');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 31, 7, 7, 'sinful pleasures; having my own way, pleasing myself. Now I want to turn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 31, 8, 7, 'around and put my back to all those things and face You, and seek to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 31, 9, 7, 'please You.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 31, 10, 7, 'The Bible calls repentance in 1 Thessalonians, 1:9 as ''a turning to God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 31, 11, 7, 'from idols.'' If we worship anything other than the true God - it could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 31, 12, 7, 'be money, it could be self - that becomes like an idol in our life and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 31, 13, 7, 'that turns me away from God. That thing becomes my God, that thing is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 31, 14, 7, 'uppermost in my mind. Repentance is to turn away from all those things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 31, 15, 7, 'and turn to the one true God. A pretty girl whom you love could be your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 31, 16, 7, 'idol; who could be like God in your life to occupy so much time. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 31, 17, 7, 'could be money, your job, your house, your car; it could be anything.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 31, 18, 7, 'Unless we are willing to turn from the worship of these things and say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 31, 19, 7, '''God, Creator of the Heavens and my Creator, I want You to have the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 31, 20, 7, 'first place in my life'' (that is repentance, to turn around and make God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 31, 21, 7, 'central in our life), we cannot have a relationship with God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 31, 22, 7, 'Now, very often, we find it easy for us to deceive ourselves. We can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 31, 23, 7, 'think that, because we have said these words, we have repented. But the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 31, 24, 7, 'Bible also says that we must bring forth fruits that are in keeping with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 31, 25, 7, 'our repentance. How do we prove that we have really turned from our old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 31, 26, 7, 'way of life? One way would be, if you have stolen money from someone in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 31, 27, 7, 'the past, or if you have cheated the government of taxes, then once you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 31, 28, 7, 'have repented of it, you are going to return it. You are going to go to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 32, 1, 7, 'that person and say, ''I am sorry, I stole some money from you. Perhaps');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 32, 2, 7, 'you didn''t know about it. Here is the money with interest that I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 32, 3, 7, 'returning to you.'' If you have cheated the government of taxes, it would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 32, 4, 7, 'mean returning that money to the government. If you have travelled in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 32, 5, 7, 'the railways without buying the ticket, it would mean repaying that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 32, 6, 7, 'money to the railways. Then, it would prove that you are serious about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 32, 7, 7, 'your repentance. Otherwise they would be mere words.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 32, 8, 7, 'Now a lot of people turn to God with mere words. There is a verse in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 32, 9, 7, 'Bible where God says, these people turn to me with their lips, but their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 32, 10, 7, 'hearts are far away from me and their worship is a mere tradition. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 32, 11, 7, 'is how it is with most religious people in the world; their religion is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 32, 12, 7, 'one which never causes them any inconvenience. Do you know how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 32, 13, 7, 'inconvenient it is to go back and return money which you have taken');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 32, 14, 7, 'wrongfully from somebody? It is humiliating, but that is the proof that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 32, 15, 7, 'you really want to give up that way of life. It also means that if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 32, 16, 7, 'have lost your temper at somebody, and shouted at somebody, or called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 32, 17, 7, 'somebody by a bad name, you should go to that person and say, ''I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 32, 18, 7, 'sorry for what I did. That was my mistake, please forgive me.'' See,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 32, 19, 7, 'those are just a few words. It takes only fifteen seconds for you to say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 32, 20, 7, 'it to somebody. But you will discover it is so difficult for you to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 32, 21, 7, 'it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 32, 22, 7, 'Why is it so difficult for you to say those ten or fifteen words to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 32, 23, 7, 'somebody? - Because of pride, we are so proud. That is the reason why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 32, 24, 7, 'many people cannot turn to God. Christ has died for our sins, but we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 32, 25, 7, 'have to turn towards Him in order to receive that forgiveness. We have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 32, 26, 7, 'to turn away from that old way of life that we have chosen. And we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 32, 27, 7, 'to say, ''Lord, I want to receive what you give.'' To say that, I have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 32, 28, 7, 'repent - there should be a turnabout. Otherwise, if I just say with my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 33, 1, 7, 'words to God that I am sorry and I am not willing to set right with man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 33, 2, 7, 'the things I have done wrong to man; it would only mean that I am not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 33, 3, 7, 'really serious about turning from my old way of life. It would mean that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 33, 4, 7, 'I want to get forgiveness from God cheaply. Do you know that forgiveness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 33, 5, 7, 'is not cheap? God had to send His son Jesus Christ to earth to die? And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 33, 6, 7, 'he had to go through all that suffering to purchase our forgiveness. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 33, 7, 7, 'you want it cheaply, if you don''t even want to acknowledge your sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 33, 8, 7, 'before man and confess to that person, then you cannot get that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 33, 9, 7, 'forgiveness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 33, 10, 7, 'So, repentance means that I acknowledge the guilt of worshipping things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 33, 11, 7, 'other than God. I need to come to God and say, ''Lord, You alone are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 33, 12, 7, 'worthy to be worshipped. You, whom I cannot see with my eyes - the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 33, 13, 7, 'Invisible Creator of this universe - You are the One worthy to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 33, 14, 7, 'worshipped. I am sorry that I have spent my life worshipping created');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 33, 15, 7, 'things. I want to turn to You.'' Repentance doesn''t mean that you have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 33, 16, 7, 'give up your job and become a hermit or give up your family or any such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 33, 17, 7, 'thing. It is not giving up earthly things as much as giving up an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 33, 18, 7, 'attachment to earthly things. There is a lot of difference. God may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 33, 19, 7, 'still allow you to have your home, your job, your family, but don''t be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 33, 20, 7, 'attached to them, don''t make them your god. In fact, making them your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 33, 21, 7, 'god destroys you. It is not a sin to use the comforts that modern');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 33, 22, 7, 'civilization provides us, but it is a sin to love those comforts more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 33, 23, 7, 'than we love God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 33, 24, 7, 'See, God has created our bodies in such a way that we can experience the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 33, 25, 7, 'pleasure of food, sleep, and many other things like that. There is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 33, 26, 7, 'nothing wrong in experiencing these pleasures. But if we make these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 33, 27, 7, 'things more important than God, then those things have become idols in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 33, 28, 7, 'our lives. One more thing: if we don''t forgive others, then Jesus said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 34, 1, 7, 'that our Heavenly Father will also not forgive us. So that is another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 34, 2, 7, 'thing we need to do. If we are really repentant, we will forgive every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 34, 3, 7, 'single person who has harmed us, just like God, our Heavenly Father, has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 34, 4, 7, 'forgiven us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 34, 5, 8, 'Chapter 8 Faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 34, 6, 8, 'The Bible says that all things are possible if you can believe.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 34, 7, 8, 'Repentance means a turning towards God. The second thing which is like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 34, 8, 8, 'twin with repentance for receiving God''s forgiveness and salvation is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 34, 9, 8, 'faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 34, 10, 8, 'The Bible speaks a lot about faith. Jesus Christ, when He came to earth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 34, 11, 8, 'encouraged people to have faith in God. In fact, that was one of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 34, 12, 8, 'primary themes of His entire ministry - have faith in God. We cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 34, 13, 8, 'receive God''s forgiveness if we don''t believe. We don''t have to do work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 34, 14, 8, 'in order to earn forgiveness. Forgiveness is far too expensive for us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 34, 15, 8, 'be able to earn it with works or money or any amount of pilgrimages or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 34, 16, 8, 'any such thing. God gives us forgiveness freely. Why freely? - Because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 34, 17, 8, 'it is so valuable, so expensive, that we can never pay for it with any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 34, 18, 8, 'number of good works. Faith is not such a complicated thing. It just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 34, 19, 8, 'means reaching out our hand and receiving what God is offering us. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 34, 20, 8, 'Bible says in Ephesians 2:8, ''we are saved by grace through faith.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 34, 21, 8, 'These are two important worlds that we find coming in the New Testament');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 34, 22, 8, 'and they have very simple meanings.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 34, 23, 8, 'Grace , we can say, is God''s hand reaching out to give us His help, His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 34, 24, 8, 'blessings, His forgiveness and strength for every task we can ever face');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 34, 25, 8, 'in life. What is faith? Faith is our hand reaching up to take that help');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 34, 26, 8, 'and those blessings from God''s hands. Now, if I were to give you a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 34, 27, 8, 'Bible, and if you have to receive it, you need to stretch out your hand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 34, 28, 8, 'and take it. That is faith; when God in grace offers me something, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 35, 1, 8, 'reach out my hand to take it. I told you in an earlier study that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 35, 2, 8, 'will not force anything down our throats. He will not force us to accept');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 35, 3, 8, 'something which we don''t want to receive, because He has given us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 35, 4, 8, 'freedom of choice. He doesn''t want mindless robots that just do what He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 35, 5, 8, 'has programmed them to do. He wants us to make a choice. When I choose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 35, 6, 8, 'to believe, I have made a choice. I say, ''Lord, I believe that Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 35, 7, 8, 'died for my sins and rose up from the dead and I receive Him as my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 35, 8, 8, 'Lord.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 35, 9, 8, 'The Bible says much about the power there is in the name of our Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 35, 10, 8, 'Jesus Christ. There is no other name on earth through which we can get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 35, 11, 8, 'salvation, through which we can get forgiveness. And you can receive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 35, 12, 8, 'that if you just stretch out your hand. In other words, if you say to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 35, 13, 8, 'the Lord, ''Lord Jesus, I am sinner. I want to turn away from my sins. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 35, 14, 8, 'believe you died for me, and I receive you right now in my life.'' That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 35, 15, 8, 'is a simple prayer. It will take you less than a minute to pray, and if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 35, 16, 8, 'you pray it in sincerity, you can be a child of God in a moment. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 35, 17, 8, 'not a magic formula. You see, God is not looking for particular words.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 35, 18, 8, 'Just like a father, when he listens to his child, he is not seeing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 35, 19, 8, 'whether the child repeats a particular formula or says things in correct');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 35, 20, 8, 'language. He is not even bothered about the child''s grammar. He listens');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 35, 21, 8, 'to the child''s words as an expression of the longings of that child''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 35, 22, 8, 'heart. In the same way, when you speak to God, God listens to your heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 35, 23, 8, 'more than to your words.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 35, 24, 8, 'Jesus has said these words in John 6:37, "The one who comes to me, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 35, 25, 8, 'will never reject." It doesn''t matter who you are. Christ did not die');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 35, 26, 8, 'only for Christians. He died for the sins of the whole world. The Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 35, 27, 8, 'puts all human beings in one category - sinners. Whatever our religion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 35, 28, 8, 'may be, we are all sinners. There is no difference between the one and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 36, 1, 8, 'the other. We are all born with the same nature. We are all born far');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 36, 2, 8, 'away from God. And the Bible offers forgiveness to everyone equally,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 36, 3, 8, 'saying Christ died for all of your sins. So faith is the means by which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 36, 4, 8, 'we stretch out our hands and take all that God has promised for us in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 36, 5, 8, 'Christ. There is a verse in the Bible which says, ''God has blessed us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 36, 6, 8, 'with every spiritual blessing in the heavenly places in Christ'' (Eph.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 36, 7, 8, '1:3).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 36, 8, 8, 'Now why is it that some Christians tend to grow spiritually more than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 36, 9, 8, 'others? The reason is faith. We can say that God''s blessings are like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 36, 10, 8, 'banquet feast that is being laid out on the table. But if you go for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 36, 11, 8, 'buffet lunch or dinner in a restaurant, all the food is laid out there.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 36, 12, 8, 'Nobody is going to put it on your plate. You have to go to the table and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 36, 13, 8, 'take whatever you like. So, if you take a little, that is your choice.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 36, 14, 8, 'Somebody else fills up his plate with everything from the table, with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 36, 15, 8, 'every dish. You could have done the same, but you didn''t do it. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 36, 16, 8, 'how it is with many Christians. They don''t take everything that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 36, 17, 8, 'offers them. And that is why they remain poor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 36, 18, 8, 'Faith means, to see the things that God has given us and to take them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 36, 19, 8, 'Think of this promise which we just read from Ephesians 1:3 that, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 36, 20, 8, 'Christ, God has blessed us with every spiritual blessing in the heavenly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 36, 21, 8, 'places. That means, every single thing that we need for our spirit,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 36, 22, 8, 'beginning with forgiveness. Remember forgiveness of sins is only the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 36, 23, 8, 'beginning. All that we have been saying in our past studies is only to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 36, 24, 8, 'lay a foundation for a wonderful superstructure that we are going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 36, 25, 8, 'build on in the studies to come. It is the foundation, the clearing of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 36, 26, 8, 'our past evil record, the removal of our guilt, the paying of our debt,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 36, 27, 8, 'the settling of old accounts. And it begins with repentance and faith -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 36, 28, 8, 'a turning to God; setting matters right in relation to the things that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 37, 1, 8, 'we have done wrong in the past and receiving God''s forgiveness freely;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 37, 2, 8, 'reaching out our hand and saying, ''Lord, You have blessed me with every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 37, 3, 8, 'spiritual blessing in the heavenly places in Christ. I want to receive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 37, 4, 8, 'it.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 37, 5, 8, 'See, this is the principle that we find throughout Scripture. We read in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 37, 6, 8, 'the Gospels that once two blind men came to Jesus and asked Jesus to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 37, 7, 8, 'heal their blind eyes (Matthew 9). They knew that Jesus had the power to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 37, 8, 8, 'open their blind eyes, and so they came and asked Him to do it for them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 37, 9, 8, 'Now Jesus was willing to do it for them. They were also longing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 37, 10, 8, 'receive it. But Jesus still asked them one more question: do you believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 37, 11, 8, 'that I am able to do this for you. See, this is the principle in all of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 37, 12, 8, 'God''s dealings with us, that He asks us a question. You ask Him for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 37, 13, 8, 'something; you ask Him for forgiveness, let us say - that is the first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 37, 14, 8, 'thing we ask for. And the Lord says, ''do you believe I will forgive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 37, 15, 8, 'you?'' If you respond, ''well, Lord, I am not so sure,'' you are not going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 37, 16, 8, 'to get it. It is like these blind men we read of in Matthew 9:27-29. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 37, 17, 8, 'read that they came, they asked for their eyes to be opened, and Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 37, 18, 8, 'said, ''do you believe that I am able to do this for you?''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 37, 19, 8, 'Now just supposing that one of them responded saying, ''well, I am not so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 37, 20, 8, 'sure Lord, whether you will do it,'' do you know what would have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 37, 21, 8, 'happened? He would have gone away with his eyes still blind. They would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 37, 22, 8, 'have remained unchanged. See the situation there? He wanted his eyes to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 37, 23, 8, 'be opened, Jesus wanted to open his eyes, but he still didn''t get it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 37, 24, 8, 'What was missing? Faith, that is all. So sometimes, you may come to God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 37, 25, 8, 'with a great desire for something. God may also have a great desire to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 37, 26, 8, 'give it to you. But if you say, ''well, if I have a desire and God has a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 37, 27, 8, 'desire, then I get it.'' No, you don''t, because there is one more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 37, 28, 8, 'question there to answer: do you believe God will do it for you? That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 38, 1, 8, 'the question we read in Matthew 9:28. But they did not say, ''we are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 38, 2, 8, 'sure''. They said, ''Yes Lord'' - that was a bold confession - ''yes Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 38, 3, 8, 'we believe, you are able to do this.'' Then what did Jesus do? He touched');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 38, 4, 8, 'their eyes, and He said: be it done to you according to your faith.'' Now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 38, 5, 8, 'notice that carefully? Not according to your desire, not even according');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 38, 6, 8, 'to my desire, but according to your faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 38, 7, 8, 'Now pay attention to this, my friend. If you could receive everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 38, 8, 8, 'you desired you would have gotten a lot of things by now from God. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 38, 9, 8, 'if you could receive everything God desired, again, you would have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 38, 10, 8, 'gotten many things from God by now. Why haven''t you then? God desires to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 38, 11, 8, 'give it you, you desire to receive it, and you still haven''t got it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 38, 12, 8, 'What is the reason? Because when God says, ''do you believe, I will give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 38, 13, 8, 'to you,'' you say, I am not so sure?'' Then the Lord says, ''be it done for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 38, 14, 8, 'you not according to your desire, but according to your faith.'' That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 38, 15, 8, 'what made the difference. You see the rain''s falling outside, and you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 38, 16, 8, 'take a little cup outside to fill. Another person takes a bucket and yet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 38, 17, 8, 'another person takes a big drum. Who is going to get the maximum water');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 38, 18, 8, 'when they come back inside the house- the one who went out with the big');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 38, 19, 8, 'drum? You can''t say that God gave him more, that God was partial to him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 38, 20, 8, 'No, you went out with a little cup, so that is all you got. Another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 38, 21, 8, 'person went out with a drum, he got much more. It is like that, faith is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 38, 22, 8, 'like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 38, 23, 8, 'God''s blessings are there for everyone. He has blessed us with every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 38, 24, 8, 'single spiritual blessing in the heavenly places, but all of you are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 38, 25, 8, 'going to get the same amount. That depends on your faith. You know,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 38, 26, 8, 'faith honours God. That is what you say when you say, ''I believe'';');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 38, 27, 8, '''Lord, I believe you are trustworthy.'' That is why it is so important.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 38, 28, 8, 'It means, ''Lord, I believe, what You have said is true.'' You believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 39, 1, 8, 'that what God has said in His Word is true.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 39, 2, 8, 'Now, I want you to pray right now. Will you close your eyes and say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 39, 3, 8, 'these words: ''Lord Jesus, I believe you died for me. Right now you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 39, 4, 8, 'going to forgive my sins.'' And if there is any other need in your life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 39, 5, 8, 'say that right now, and say, ''Lord, I believe you will give me even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 39, 6, 8, 'that. I believe. Amen.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 39, 7, 9, 'Chapter 9 The Gift Of The Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 39, 8, 9, 'What does the Bible says concerning God''s provision for our future? See,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 39, 9, 9, 'we, as human beings, have basically two problems. All human beings have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 39, 10, 9, 'the same problems, whatever our religion, our culture, our language, our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 39, 11, 9, 'education, our temperament, or anything. We could simplify these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 39, 12, 9, 'problems by putting them into two categories: one is a problem relating');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 39, 13, 9, 'to our past - our guilt, our failure, our sins. And the other is,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 39, 14, 9, 'problem relating to the future. How are we going to deal with what comes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 39, 15, 9, 'forth from our nature in the future? Is it going to be a repetition of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 39, 16, 9, 'the same old failures from our past? Do we have to keep on going to God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 39, 17, 9, 'again and again, asking Him to forgive us the same old sins that we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 39, 18, 9, 'asked for many times in the past? Or, has God made some provisions so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 39, 19, 9, 'that we can overcome in the areas where we failed in the past?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 39, 20, 9, 'The good news in the Bible is that God has made a provision. He has not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 39, 21, 9, 'only made a provision for our past failures through Christ''s death on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 39, 22, 9, 'the cross of Calvary (that was a complete and total taking care of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 39, 23, 9, 'past failures), but He has also provided for this problem of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 39, 24, 9, 'possibility of our failing again and again in the same areas in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 39, 25, 9, 'future by offering us the gift of His Holy Spirit. Now, Jesus said to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 39, 26, 9, 'His disciples, when He was on earth, just before He went up to heaven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 39, 27, 9, 'that, "It is good for you that I go away, because when I go, I will send');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 39, 28, 9, 'the Holy Spirit from heaven to dwell in your hearts." The Holy Spirit is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 40, 1, 9, 'the very person of God, the Spirit of God, and this is the gift freely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 40, 2, 9, 'given by God to us, just as much as forgiveness of our sins.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 40, 3, 9, 'The first day that the Christian message was preached in this world was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 40, 4, 9, '2000 years ago, and it is described in Acts 2. It was the Jewish feast');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 40, 5, 9, 'of Pentecost when many people had come together in Jerusalem. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 40, 6, 9, 'apostle Peter got up and proclaimed the Gospel message: that Christ had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 40, 7, 9, 'died, that He had risen again from the dead, and then ascended to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 40, 8, 9, 'heaven. And that He has poured out His Holy Spirit that had filled the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 40, 9, 9, 'hearts of those120 peoples, who were praying that day in Jerusalem. Then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 40, 10, 9, 'Peter said to all the thousands of people who were listening to him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 40, 11, 9, '(Acts 2:38) these words: "Repent (we have considered what that means)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 40, 12, 9, 'and let each one of you be baptized being immersed in water to symbolize');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 40, 13, 9, 'the break with the past, the burial of the old man, and the resurrection');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 40, 14, 9, 'of being a new man. That is the symbolism of going into the water and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 40, 15, 9, 'coming out in baptism - my old man is dead and is buried and now I am a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 40, 16, 9, 'new man in Christ. And then he said, ''if you do that, you will receive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 40, 17, 9, 'two gifts: one, the forgiveness of your sins (that deals with our past),');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 40, 18, 9, 'and second, you will receive the gift of the Holy Spirit.'' That is God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 40, 19, 9, 'provision for the future. So, both of our problems are dealt with; our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 40, 20, 9, 'past, as well as our future. We have taken care of the guilt of our past');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 40, 21, 9, 'and the provision of strength to overcome when we are faced with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 40, 22, 9, 'temptations and problems in the future.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 40, 23, 9, 'Now many Christians think that God has only dealt with our past');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 40, 24, 9, 'problems. As I said in the last study, you can receive from God only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 40, 25, 9, 'what you have faith for. If you don''t believe, you cannot receive. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 40, 26, 9, 'you don''t believe, for example, that God will give you strength to face');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 40, 27, 9, 'your problems in the future, you won''t receive it. You may desire it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 40, 28, 9, 'God may also desire to give you that strength, but you still won''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 41, 1, 9, 'receive, if you don''t have faith. Every gift of God is received by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 41, 2, 9, 'simple faith. It is not because we deserve it. None of us deserve even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 41, 3, 9, 'the lowest of God''s gifts. We don''t deserve anything but hellfire. All');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 41, 4, 9, 'of us deserve judgment. All of us deserve to burn in hell for eternity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 41, 5, 9, 'because we have sinned. We have sinned deliberately, we have dishonoured');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 41, 6, 9, 'God. So God places all humanity - the entire human race under sin so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 41, 7, 9, 'that He can have mercy on everyone. This is God''s way - to put us all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 41, 8, 9, 'under sin so that we all are in the same category, so that no one can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 41, 9, 9, 'boast over another, saying, ''I am better than you.'' You know how many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 41, 10, 9, 'people there are out in the world, who think they are superior to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 41, 11, 9, 'others?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 41, 12, 9, 'It is because they haven''t seen themselves in God''s eyes. It is like I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 41, 13, 9, 'said in another study where the child who gets 20% thinks he is better');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 41, 14, 9, 'than the child who gets 5%. And worse than that, the child who gets 20%');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 41, 15, 9, 'thinking he is superior to the child who gets 19.5%. How much superior');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 41, 16, 9, 'is he really? That is the height foolishness of one man who thinks he is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 41, 17, 9, 'better than another. It is all relative. In God''s eyes, we are all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 41, 18, 9, 'failures and He gives us a promotion to the next class freely, i.e.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 41, 19, 9, 'forgiveness. Then He gives us strength to face the problem of our own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 41, 20, 9, 'sinful nature, the problem that we can face living in a world that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 41, 21, 9, 'still under the curse, and that is through the gift of his Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 41, 22, 9, 'It is His own presence coming in and dwelling in our hearts, filling our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 41, 23, 9, 'hearts, giving us strength from within.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 41, 24, 9, 'You know, when Jesus was on earth, He could only encourage people and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 41, 25, 9, 'strengthen them from the outside. He walked with the disciples, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 41, 26, 9, 'talked with them, but He could only be in one place at a given time. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 41, 27, 9, 'He was in Galilee, He could not be in Jerusalem. If He was in Jerusalem,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 41, 28, 9, 'He couldn''t be in Galilee. If He was in Palestine, He couldn''t be in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 42, 1, 9, 'India. That would have been terrible, if it had continued like that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 42, 2, 9, 'forever. Because, then all of us would have to be where Jesus was. Even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 42, 3, 9, 'that wouldn''t help us because how many thousands could get near Him in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 42, 4, 9, 'any case? And so, Jesus said to His disciples that, "It is better if I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 42, 5, 9, 'go away, because if I go away, I will send My Holy Spirit who will come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 42, 6, 9, 'and dwell in your heart and that will bring my presence." All the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 42, 7, 9, 'disciples could receive this Holy Spirit in every part of the world and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 42, 8, 9, 'have the presence of Jesus with them wherever they are.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 42, 9, 9, 'And even better than that, not just wherever they are, but instead of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 42, 10, 9, 'having Jesus outside of them, they could have Jesus inside of them. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 42, 11, 9, 'know that is far better. Because with the disciples, even though Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 42, 12, 9, 'was with them for three and a half years, and even though He taught');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 42, 13, 9, 'them, encouraged them, challenged them, rebuked them, blessed them in so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 42, 14, 9, 'many ways, yet we see that, at the end of three and a half years, they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 42, 15, 9, 'were still competing with one another to see who would take over the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 42, 16, 9, 'leadership after Jesus died. They were still competing with one another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 42, 17, 9, 'for honour and position. That inward problem could not be dealt even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 42, 18, 9, 'with Jesus'' physical presence. Jesus'' physical presence only dealt with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 42, 19, 9, 'external problems around them. If there was a storm in the sea He could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 42, 20, 9, 'still it. Or, if there was not enough food to feed them all, He could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 42, 21, 9, 'provide it. Or, if there wasn''t enough wine at the wedding, He could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 42, 22, 9, 'change the water into wine. External problems could be dealt with, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 42, 23, 9, 'the internal problem - which is far more serious - of sin within could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 42, 24, 9, 'not be dealt with as long as Jesus was outside.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 42, 25, 9, 'And that is another reason why it was good that Jesus went away to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 42, 26, 9, 'heaven. Because He sent the Holy Spirit through the third person of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 42, 27, 9, 'triune God to come and dwell in our hearts, so that the presence and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 42, 28, 9, 'power of Jesus comes to us through the Holy Spirit within. Now how do we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 43, 1, 9, 'receive this gift? Exactly the same way we receive the forgiveness of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 43, 2, 9, 'sins. Peter said, "repent, confess your faith in baptism in the name of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 43, 3, 9, 'Jesus Christ, and you will receive the forgiveness of sins and you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 43, 4, 9, 'receive the gift of the Holy Spirit" (Acts 2:38). There is no extra');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 43, 5, 9, 'condition required. It is not some post-graduate degree. No, it is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 43, 6, 9, 'beginning of Christian life. Many people have thought that, to receive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 43, 7, 9, 'the Holy Spirit, to be filled with the Holy Spirit, it is something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 43, 8, 9, 'which has to come many years after we begin the Christian life. No. On');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 43, 9, 9, 'the very day that you begin your Christian life, you have to receive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 43, 10, 9, 'forgiveness to sins and the gift of the Holy Spirit. You open your heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 43, 11, 9, 'and receive it. It is like going to a shop where somebody has already');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 43, 12, 9, 'paid for a two-volume encyclopaedia for you. If you come home with one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 43, 13, 9, 'volume, and there you discover that you don''t have the whole thing, what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 43, 14, 9, 'would you do? When you discover that both volumes are paid for, you go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 43, 15, 9, 'back to the shop and you say, ''well, I am sorry, I didn''t take the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 43, 16, 9, 'second volume. That is paid for too.'' And you take it, it is free.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 43, 17, 9, 'So Peter offered forgiveness of sins and the gift of the Holy Spirit to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 43, 18, 9, 'those people who repented. That is what God offers us today. In Hebrews,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 43, 19, 9, '4:16, we read, "Let us come boldly to the throne of grace, so that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 43, 20, 9, 'may receive two things: mercy, and grace." Mercy and grace are not the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 43, 21, 9, 'same. Mercy is referring to the forgiveness of our sins, dealing with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 43, 22, 9, 'our past. We have all sinned, we need mercy. Grace is referring to God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 43, 23, 9, 'power that He can give us to help us to be overcomers in the coming days');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 43, 24, 9, '- it is referring to the future. And it says here in Hebrews, 4:16, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 43, 25, 9, 'let us come with boldness to God''s throne, so we can receive mercy to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 43, 26, 9, 'deal with the past and grace through the Holy Spirit to help us face');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 43, 27, 9, 'everything that we can face in the future: temptations, problems,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 43, 28, 9, 'trials, whatever it is. Isn''t it wonderfully good news that God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 44, 1, 9, 'provided for our past as well as our future, and all we need to do is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 44, 2, 9, 'come in faith? So I want to invite you right now to come to God boldly -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 44, 3, 9, 'don''t hesitate. He invites you - say ''Lord, I believe you have dealt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 44, 4, 9, 'with my past. But today I also want to believe that you will strengthen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 44, 5, 9, 'me to face the future. I want you to fill me with Your Holy Spirit. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 44, 6, 9, 'want you to fill my heart with your power, with grace, so that I can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 44, 7, 9, 'face the coming days.'' Believe, and it will be yours.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 44, 8, 10, 'Chapter 10 God’s Word Is Our Food');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 44, 9, 10, 'We want to think about the Word of God, which gives us power to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 44, 10, 10, 'overcomers in our battle against Satan, and which gives us strength to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 44, 11, 10, 'face every situation in the future.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 44, 12, 10, 'The Bible is the Word of God . It was written by men under the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 44, 13, 10, 'inspiration of the Holy Spirit. It is the food for the soul for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 44, 14, 10, 'Christian who has come to faith in Christ and been born again. Just like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 44, 15, 10, 'a baby cries out for milk as soon as it is born, a true Christian, if he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 44, 16, 10, 'is to grow spiritually, he needs this food of the Word of God. I want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 44, 17, 10, 'show you to a verse where it speaks of what the Word of God does,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 44, 18, 10, 'initially. We read 1 Peter 1:23, "You have been born again not of seed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 44, 19, 10, 'which is perishable but imperishable, that is, through the living and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 44, 20, 10, 'enduring word of God." Many people feel, when they have made a mess of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 44, 21, 10, 'their life, they wish they could live their lives all over again. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 44, 22, 10, 'that is exactly the opportunity God offers you when He says, ''You can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 44, 23, 10, 'born again.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 44, 24, 10, 'Think if you could start your life all over again, as a little baby, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 44, 25, 10, 'with no record of your past failures; it is all wiped out. That is what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 44, 26, 10, 'it means to be born again. Your past is wiped out and you are born a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 44, 27, 10, 'second time. That wish that you had, ''oh, I wish I could start my life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 44, 28, 10, 'all over again'' - God says, ''I can fulfil it for you.'' That is what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 45, 1, 10, 'happens when we receive Christ into our life. In the verse we just saw');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 45, 2, 10, 'it says that this new birth takes place through a seed, just like your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 45, 3, 10, 'physical birth also began with the seed of your father. In the same way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 45, 4, 10, 'here, spiritually, the Word of God is like a seed which brings you to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 45, 5, 10, 'new birth, in what way? You believed that Word, you responded to that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 45, 6, 10, 'Word of God which said that Christ died for your sins. You accepted the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 45, 7, 10, 'Word of God which said that you are a sinner. You believed that Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 45, 8, 10, 'rose again from the dead, and you were born again. You received His Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 45, 9, 10, 'Spirit by faith, because that was God''s promise given in His Word. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 45, 10, 10, 'through that Word, you have come into a new relationship with God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 45, 11, 10, 'Then it goes on to say, now that you are a new born baby, the same Word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 45, 12, 10, 'of God - which is like a seed which fell into your heart and brought you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 45, 13, 10, 'to life - now becomes like milk for the new born baby. In 1 Peter 2:2,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 45, 14, 10, 'it says, "like new born babes, long for the pure milk of the Word, so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 45, 15, 10, 'that you may grow in respect to salvation." A new born baby needs to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 45, 16, 10, 'grow. God has not forgiven us our sins in order that He might just take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 45, 17, 10, 'us to heaven. He wants us to grow, like it says in this verse, with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 45, 18, 10, 'respect to salvation, to be increasingly saved from all the corruption');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 45, 19, 10, 'that is in our nature that we have inherited from Adam, our first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 45, 20, 10, 'father; selfishness, pride, arrogance, bitterness, jealousy, wickedness,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 45, 21, 10, 'and the like. We have to be saved from all these things. They don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 45, 22, 10, 'disappear the moment we are born again. When we are born again it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 45, 23, 10, 'like a new life that is come into us, and that life has the potential to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 45, 24, 10, 'overcome all these evil habits. But that potential must be used to grow.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 45, 25, 10, 'You know, like a little baby, when it is born, it has the potential to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 45, 26, 10, 'become a muscular giant. But it is not going to grow into that if it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 45, 27, 10, 'doesn''t eat its food or drink its milk. It has to be fed and it has to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 45, 28, 10, 'eat its food in order to grow. And this is the mistake that many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 46, 1, 10, 'Christians make. They think that once their sins are forgiven, and they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 46, 2, 10, 'have received the Holy Spirit, that is it. There is nothing more. Well,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 46, 3, 10, 'there is a lot more. You are just born. Can you say once a baby is born');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 46, 4, 10, 'into the world, that is it? There is nothing more for the baby? Well,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 46, 5, 10, 'that baby will die, if you just leave it like that. In fact, one of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 46, 6, 10, 'first things that a baby does, as soon as it is born, is it cries. From');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 46, 7, 10, 'the very first day, it longs for milk. There is a tremendous cry. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 46, 8, 10, 'have heard babies screaming for milk. That is how a true Christian cries');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 46, 9, 10, 'out for the Word of God, for God to feed him through His Word. Now if a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 46, 10, 10, 'baby does not cry out like that, we could say the baby is sick, or it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 46, 11, 10, 'about to die. Healthy babies will always cry out for milk, all the time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 46, 12, 10, 'Healthy Christian is one who cries out for God''s Word to feed him, as it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 46, 13, 10, 'says like new born babes. There must be a tremendous longing in us for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 46, 14, 10, 'the milk of the Word of God. The Word of God is milk that helps us grow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 46, 15, 10, 'in salvation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 46, 16, 10, 'In the beginning of the Bible, we see a beautiful picture of this. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 46, 17, 10, 'Genesis 1we read of the earth being in a chaotic state. The Bible says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 46, 18, 10, 'the earth was formless, empty, and dark. And that is the condition of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 46, 19, 10, 'humanity away from God also; formless, empty and dark. That is what we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 46, 20, 10, 'were before being born again. How did God change this chaotic, formless,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 46, 21, 10, 'empty, dark world and make it into such a beautiful world, that at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 46, 22, 10, 'end of Genesis 1, God says, "This is very good?" How did God do it?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 46, 23, 10, 'You see, two things are very important for us to see here. First of all,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 46, 24, 10, '"The Spirit of God moved upon this earth." All of God''s work begins with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 46, 25, 10, 'the Holy Spirit moving upon a chaotic situation and trying to redeem it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 46, 26, 10, 'trying to solve the problem. But that was not all. We read a second');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 46, 27, 10, 'thing: the Word of God went forth. The Spirit of God moved, and the Word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 46, 28, 10, 'of God went forth. These two always work together - the Spirit of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 47, 1, 10, 'and the Word of God. What did the Word of God say? "Let there be light."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 47, 2, 10, 'That was the Word. And as soon as that Word went forth from God''s mouth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 47, 3, 10, 'light came. Again, we read the Word of God saying, "Let there be an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 47, 4, 10, 'expanse in the midst of the waters," and the heavens were created. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 47, 5, 10, 'then God said, "Let the waters be gathered together and let the dry land');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 47, 6, 10, 'appear" and the earth was made. And so we find that every time the Word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 47, 7, 10, 'of God went forth on the first day, on the second day, on the third day,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 47, 8, 10, 'something happened. Something of the chaos was changed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 47, 9, 10, 'The whole earth was not changed in one day. It took six days, not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 47, 10, 10, 'because God takes time. God could have changed it in a moment. He could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 47, 11, 10, 'have made the whole earth beautiful in one moment, with one Word. But He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 47, 12, 10, 'is trying to teach us something in the first page of the Bible and that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 47, 13, 10, 'is, that God works in our lives slowly, day by day by day. Each day, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 47, 14, 10, 'wants to do something in us to remove the chaos, to remove the darkness,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 47, 15, 10, 'to remove the shapelessness, the un-Christ likeness in our life. In The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 47, 16, 10, 'New Testament, in 2 Corinthians 4:16 we read, "Our inner man is being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 47, 17, 10, 'renewed day by day." On the first day, there should be a change, on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 47, 18, 10, 'second day, there should be a change, on the third day...and, throughout');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 47, 19, 10, 'our lifetime, God wants to change us little by little by little, till a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 47, 20, 10, 'day comes, at the end of our life, when God can say, ''Very good, I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 47, 21, 10, 'been able to complete My work in this man.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 47, 22, 10, 'Now the sad thing is, with many Christians, that doesn''t happen, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 47, 23, 10, 'they don''t respond to God. You see, in Genesis 1, when the Word of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 47, 24, 10, 'went forth, the earth responded, and something happened. So, if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 47, 25, 10, 'respond to the Word of God, as it comes to your heart, something will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 47, 26, 10, 'definitely happen in your life. If you accept that Word, if you believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 47, 27, 10, 'that Word, if you obey that Word, something will definitely happen. Just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 47, 28, 10, 'like you read in Genesis 1, every day something happened, and God said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 48, 1, 10, 'it was good. God''s will for you is that every day, you should receive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 48, 2, 10, 'some Word of God into your heart that is going to produce some change in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 48, 3, 10, 'your life. That is why the most important thing for you to receive every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 48, 4, 10, 'day is the Word of God, more than your food.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 48, 5, 10, 'You remember in the first temptation that Jesus faced in the wilderness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 48, 6, 10, 'He had fasted for forty days, and the devil came to Jesus and said, ''Why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 48, 7, 10, 'don''t you turn these stones to bread. You are hungry; you will die if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 48, 8, 10, 'you don''t eat.'' It is true. If you have not eaten food forty days and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 48, 9, 10, 'you continue like that, there is a possibility that you will die. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 48, 10, 10, 'Jesus replied to Satan, it is more important to receive the Word of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 48, 11, 10, 'than to eat food. I have paraphrased Matthew 4:4 here. Have you read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 48, 12, 10, 'that Word? ''Man shall not live by bread alone, but by every word that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 48, 13, 10, 'proceeds from God''s mouth.'' What He was saying is: it is more important');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 48, 14, 10, 'to receive the Word of God than it is to even eat food.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 48, 15, 10, 'Now how many Christians are there who believe that it is more important');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 48, 16, 10, 'every day to receive the Word of God for their soul, for their spirit,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 48, 17, 10, 'than it is to receive food for their body? We all know the value of food');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 48, 18, 10, 'for the body; we know that we will not grow without food. And we enjoy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 48, 19, 10, 'food, we enjoy good food. Why is it that many Christians don''t enjoy the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 48, 20, 10, 'Word of God like that? It is because they have not understood its value,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 48, 21, 10, 'just like little children, sometimes. Little children don''t understand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 48, 22, 10, 'the value of food. You tell them to eat, they don''t eat. You tell them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 48, 23, 10, 'to drink milk, they don''t drink milk. And sometimes father and mother');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 48, 24, 10, 'have to force them. It is like that with many Christians. But once you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 48, 25, 10, 'understand that the Word of God can make you grow; can make you strong;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 48, 26, 10, 'can make you overcome Satan, if you submit to it, your life will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 48, 27, 10, 'transformed from chaos to beauty. It can change your whole life if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 48, 28, 10, 'begin that habit from today. Make a decision today, to read the Word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 49, 1, 10, 'God, to believe it, and to obey it every day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 49, 2, 11, 'Chapter 11 God’s Word Helps Us Overcome Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 49, 3, 11, 'We want to consider an important weapon that God has given us, by which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 49, 4, 11, 'we can overcome our spiritual enemy - Satan, and that weapon is His ''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 49, 5, 11, 'Word''.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 49, 6, 11, 'God''s Word is like a seed that brings us to being born again (1 Pet.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 49, 7, 11, '1:23). From 1 Peter 2:2 we learn that God''s word is like milk that helps');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 49, 8, 11, 'us to grow. We also see in Ephesians 6 that God''s Word is like a sword -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 49, 9, 11, 'the sword of the spirit with which we can fight against Satan; " ... and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 49, 10, 11, 'the sword of the Spirit, which is the word of God " (Eph. 6:17). It is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 49, 11, 11, 'wonderful weapon that God has given us to resist the attacks of Satan.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 49, 12, 11, 'Many believers are discouraged - do you know why? Because they don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 49, 13, 11, 'know how to use this sword when Satan comes attacking them with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 49, 14, 11, 'discouragement. Many believers live under condemnation and feelings of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 49, 15, 11, 'guilt. Who gives it to them? Not God! Are you living with feelings of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 49, 16, 11, 'guilt and condemnation? Are you feeling uncertain whether God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 49, 17, 11, 'accepted you -whether God loves you, whether God has forgiven your sins,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 49, 18, 11, 'whether God still remembers your past against you? These are some of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 49, 19, 11, 'ways in which Satan harasses the believers. And believers are weighed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 49, 20, 11, 'down, around the world, with guilt which they should not be bearing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 49, 21, 11, 'How can they overcome Satan? How can you overcome Satan? Whatever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 49, 22, 11, 'feelings that come to draw you away from God - discouragement,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 49, 23, 11, 'condemnation, guilt feelings - every one of these can be overcome if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 49, 24, 11, 'can take the Word of God as a weapon. For example, supposing you are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 49, 25, 11, 'sure that Jesus Christ has accepted you; supposing the devil comes to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 49, 26, 11, 'you and says, ''Oh yes, you think Jesus has accepted you? Jesus is far');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 49, 27, 11, 'too holy to accept a sinner like you''. What are you going to do when he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 49, 28, 11, 'tells you that? Are you going to argue with him? Let me tell you, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 50, 1, 11, 'will be defeated.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 50, 2, 11, 'You can never argue with Satan. He is far too clever for you. You know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 50, 3, 11, 'when Satan tempted Jesus Christ, saying to him, "If you are the Son of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 50, 4, 11, 'God turn these stones into bread" (Mt. 4:3), he questioned Jesus - are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 50, 5, 11, 'you really the son of God? If he could put such a question to Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 50, 6, 11, 'Christ Himself, do you think Satan will not try those questions with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 50, 7, 11, 'you? Of course he will. He will make you doubt whether you are a child');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 50, 8, 11, 'of God. How can we overcome it? We need the Word of God. Here is a Word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 50, 9, 11, 'which you could use - Jesus said, " The one who comes to me, I will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 50, 10, 11, 'certainly not cast out" (Jn. 6:37).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 50, 11, 11, 'When I was a young boy I had asked Jesus to come into my life for many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 50, 12, 11, 'years - not days, not months, but years. I lived in doubt, whether');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 50, 13, 11, 'Christ had really accepted me. For all of those years in which I lived');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 50, 14, 11, 'in doubt I did not make any spiritual progress in my life, and it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 50, 15, 11, 'probably like that with you as well. But a day came in my life, over 38');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 50, 16, 11, 'years ago, when I believed this Word and I could say to Satan, ''Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 50, 17, 11, 'has accepted me just as I am, because He has said, "The one who comes to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 50, 18, 11, 'Me I will never cast out."" And I said to the Lord, ''Lord Jesus, I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 50, 19, 11, 'come to you. From today onwards I believe that you have not cast me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 50, 20, 11, 'out.'' It was like dropping an anchor. I have never drifted from that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 50, 21, 11, 'position for 38 years.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 50, 22, 11, 'I want you take that Word and believe from today, if you have come to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 50, 23, 11, 'Jesus. It doesn''t matter if you are the greatest sinner in the world. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 50, 24, 11, 'you have come to Him, He says, "I will certainly not cast you out."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 50, 25, 11, 'There is a certainty about it. You don''t have to believe the devil''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 50, 26, 11, 'lies anymore. Tell the devil, ''Jesus says He has certainly accepted me.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 50, 27, 11, 'Now who are you going to believe from today onwards - Jesus or the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 50, 28, 11, 'devil? That''s your choice. If you want to continue to believe the devil,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 51, 1, 11, 'then nobody can help you. But if you will believe the Word of God - take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 51, 2, 11, 'up that sword and the devil will flee from you. And you will never have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 51, 3, 11, 'a doubt again for the rest of your life that Christ has accepted you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 51, 4, 11, 'Now some of you may have another problem. You may feel that there are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 51, 5, 11, 'certain sins that you have committed in your past life which were very,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 51, 6, 11, 'very bad -even serious. May be some of you have committed adultery or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 51, 7, 11, 'murder, or it could be any horrible thing. You may feel, well some of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 51, 8, 11, 'the less serious sins God has forgiven you, but some of those horrible,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 51, 9, 11, 'wicked things, which nobody knows but you, does God always remember them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 51, 10, 11, 'when He thinks of you? Is it like that?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 51, 11, 11, 'You know how it is. Supposing somebody has killed your son, and you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 51, 12, 11, 'gracious enough to forgive him. Yet every time you see him you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 51, 13, 11, 'remember that this is the man who killed my son, even if you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 51, 14, 11, 'forgiven him. Does God look at us like that? That every time He sees us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 51, 15, 11, 'He thinks of us as the one who did all those wicked things twenty years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 51, 16, 11, 'ago, or ten years ago, or last week. What does the Bible say? The answer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 51, 17, 11, 'again is to know the Word of God . Satan will come to you with all these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 51, 18, 11, 'torturing thoughts. His aim is to keep you far away from God. You cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 51, 19, 11, 'overcome him with arguments or psychology, or any such thing. You have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 51, 20, 11, 'got to quote the Word of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 51, 21, 11, 'You know when Jesus was tempted by Satan. What did He say? He only said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 51, 22, 11, '''It is written, God''s Word says this.'' The second time Satan came to him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 51, 23, 11, 'with another temptation and Jesus said, ''God''s Word says this.'' Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 51, 24, 11, 'then came to Him quoting a Word of God, but Jesus'' answer was, ''But it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 51, 25, 11, 'also says in God''s Word, this.'' Every single time, in those three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 51, 26, 11, 'temptations in the wilderness, Jesus overcame Satan only by quoting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 51, 27, 11, 'Scripture - no discussion, no argument, nothing. Eve was the one who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 51, 28, 11, 'discussed and argued with Satan and you know what happened to her - she');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 52, 1, 11, 'fell.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 52, 2, 11, 'Jesus never did that. He just quoted the Word of God, and that is what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 52, 3, 11, 'you need to do too. Here is a promise - God says, "I will be merciful to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 52, 4, 11, 'their iniquities and I will remember their sins no more" (Heb. 8:12).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 52, 5, 11, 'Not only ''I will forgive your sins'' - that in itself is wonderful - ''but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 52, 6, 11, 'I will not remember your sins anymore against you.'' That means, when God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 52, 7, 11, 'looks at me, He does not hold against me any of the sins I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 52, 8, 11, 'committed in the past; not the ones I committed 40 years ago and not the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 52, 9, 11, 'ones I committed yesterday. If I have confessed my sins, the Bible says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 52, 10, 11, 'that " God is faithful and righteous to forgive us our sins; the blood');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 52, 11, 11, 'of Jesus cleanses us from all sins."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 52, 12, 11, 'These are powerful weapons. These Words of God are like swords. We can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 52, 13, 11, 'say the Bible is like an armoury with many swords and you need to take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 52, 14, 11, 'out the appropriate one when the devil comes to you with one or other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 52, 15, 11, 'type of attack. When he reminds you that you have sinned so much in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 52, 16, 11, 'past, you can say, ''well the blood of Jesus has cleansed me from all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 52, 17, 11, 'sins''. Satan is a great accuser. He seeks to accuse, torment, and harass');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 52, 18, 11, 'believers, preventing them from being happy. So many believers go around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 52, 19, 11, 'with long faces. That is not God''s will for you, my friend. Do you think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 52, 20, 11, 'God wants you to go around in this world with a long face? How can you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 52, 21, 11, 'ever draw anyone to Christ if you go around with a long face? How can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 52, 22, 11, 'you be happy? You can''t psychologically work up happiness, can you? You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 52, 23, 11, 'must know that your sins are forgiven; you have been accepted by Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 52, 24, 11, 'Not only that, but God will not remember your sins anymore.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 52, 25, 11, 'Now I want to lead you one step further. It is not only that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 52, 26, 11, 'forgives our sin. It is not only that He doesn''t remember our sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 52, 27, 11, 'anymore, but He does something more. There is a word called ''justified''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 52, 28, 11, 'used in Romans - that God has justified us. It says, "Having been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 53, 1, 11, 'justified by faith" (Rom. 5:1). Do you know what justified means? It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 53, 2, 11, 'means ''declared righteous''. That means God has declared you to be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 53, 3, 11, 'righteous person. Now let''s use an illustration: supposing I have been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 53, 4, 11, 'accused of a crime, and I have been taken to court. The judge says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 53, 5, 11, '''okay, you are forgiven.'' I am happy, because I come out of the court');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 53, 6, 11, 'forgiven, but I still hang my head in shame, because I am accused of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 53, 7, 11, 'terrible crime. But on the other hand, if the judge says, ''Well, after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 53, 8, 11, 'considering all the evidence I don''t believe you are guilty at all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 53, 9, 11, 'There is no need to be forgiven, you are righteous. You can go home.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 53, 10, 11, 'Righteous! Then I come out of the court, not just as a forgiven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 53, 11, 11, 'criminal, but as one with my head lifted up. This is the meaning of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 53, 12, 11, 'justification. It is more than forgiveness and many Christians haven''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 53, 13, 11, 'understood it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 53, 14, 11, 'God not only forgives, He justifies. He declares me righteous. In other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 53, 15, 11, 'words, He clothes me with the righteousness of Christ. He puts the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 53, 16, 11, 'goodness of Christ over me as my dress. Can you think of it - the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 53, 17, 11, 'goodness of Christ clothing you? How do you look when you are clothed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 53, 18, 11, 'with the goodness of Christ? I will tell you: Perfect. Do you believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 53, 19, 11, 'it? Oh that is where the problem lies, you don''t believe it! Then it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 53, 20, 11, 'will never be true for you. It says justified by faith. Do you believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 53, 21, 11, 'God puts the goodness of Christ over you? Thank Him for it and resist');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 53, 22, 11, 'Satan with this weapon of the Word of God. Say, ''I have been accepted by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 53, 23, 11, 'Christ.'' Say it right now, ''I have been accepted, I have been forgiven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 53, 24, 11, 'God does not remember my past against me anymore. I have been justified.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 53, 25, 11, 'I am a righteous person clothed with the goodness of Christ over my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 53, 26, 11, 'life. I am just as precious to God as Jesus Himself is.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 53, 27, 11, 'These are the weapons by which Satan will flee from us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 53, 28, 12, 'Chapter 12 God’s Word Renews Our Mind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 54, 1, 12, 'Wouldn''t it be wonderful if we could understand God''s mind concerning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 54, 2, 12, 'any problem or concerning the solution to a problem.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 54, 3, 12, 'Let us turn to the Word of God in Romans 12:2. Here the Holy Spirit is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 54, 4, 12, 'speaking to our hearts, and I want you to listen very carefully - God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 54, 5, 12, 'trying to speak to your heart ; "Don''t be conformed to this world but be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 54, 6, 12, 'transformed by the renewing of your mind that you may prove what the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 54, 7, 12, 'will of God is, that which is good and acceptable and perfect." We see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 54, 8, 12, 'here that God wants us to be transformed inwardly. He is speaking here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 54, 9, 12, 'about the renewing of our mind. We have considered, in one of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 54, 10, 12, 'earlier studies, referring to Genesis 1, how the Word of God and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 54, 11, 12, 'Holy Spirit moved over the chaotic earth and, how out of that chaotic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 54, 12, 12, 'situation produced order, form, beauty, light and every good thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 54, 13, 12, 'until, at the end, God Himself could say, ''this is excellent, this is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 54, 14, 12, 'very good'' (Gen. 1:26).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 54, 15, 12, 'Do you know that is just a faint picture of what God wants to do in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 54, 16, 12, 'life also; to take our chaotic, formless, and dark life and allow the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 54, 17, 12, 'Holy Spirit to work upon us; let the Word of God sink into us and change');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 54, 18, 12, 'us inwardly so much that, at the end, He can look into our lives and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 54, 19, 12, 'say, ''excellent''. In other words, we, who were such wretched, corrupt,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 54, 20, 12, 'and sinful creatures, full of bitterness, envy, and evil in so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 54, 21, 12, 'forms, are so radically transformed by the Word of God and the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 54, 22, 12, 'Spirit that we begin to manifest the nature of Christ Himself. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 54, 23, 12, 'the meaning of renewing of our minds. To put it in another way, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 54, 24, 12, 'wants our mind to begin to think the ways He thinks.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 54, 25, 12, 'When our minds are not renewed, even if we are born again and have our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 54, 26, 12, 'sins forgiven, we may still think the way worldly people think.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 54, 27, 12, 'Unfortunately this is true with a lot of believers, because they don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 54, 28, 12, 'grow. Their minds think exactly like the people in the world concerning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 55, 1, 12, 'money, pretty women, property, concerning position and honour, and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 55, 2, 12, 'way they look at their enemies and everything else. But God uses all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 55, 3, 12, 'these things in a different way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 55, 4, 12, 'What does it mean to be transformed? It means to be changed into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 55, 5, 12, 'likeness of Christ. Where does it take place? It doesn''t take place in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 55, 6, 12, 'our physical appearance. God is not in the business of physically making');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 55, 7, 12, 'us look like Jesus. That would be of no use. He is in the business of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 55, 8, 12, 'changing our inner character and life into the likeness of Christ. How');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 55, 9, 12, 'does it happen? He does it through renewing our mind - changing our way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 55, 10, 12, 'of thinking. He makes us think the way He thinks through the Word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 55, 11, 12, 'God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 55, 12, 12, 'In the Bible we have God''s way of thinking. If you want to know God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 55, 13, 12, 'way of thinking, read the Bible. If you want to know what God thinks of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 55, 14, 12, 'money, what God thinks of adultery, theft, cheating others, jealousy,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 55, 15, 12, 'selfishness or unselfishness, humility or pride, or any matter, just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 55, 16, 12, 'read the Bible. The answer is there. When Jesus came to earth, He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 55, 17, 12, 'called the Word of God. We are told the Word became flesh. This means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 55, 18, 12, 'that if you want to know what God thinks about anything, about any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 55, 19, 12, 'subject, you got to look at the life of Jesus and you will have the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 55, 20, 12, 'answer!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 55, 21, 12, 'There the Word of God is not just in a written form but manifested in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 55, 22, 12, 'human form as well. This is the difference between the Old Testament and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 55, 23, 12, 'the New Testament. In the Old Testament, they had God''s Word in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 55, 24, 12, 'written form. There were the Ten Commandments written on two pieces of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 55, 25, 12, 'rock and there was The Law written on many scrolls of parchment. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 55, 26, 12, 'when Jesus came, we had the Word of God in human form. It is much easier');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 55, 27, 12, 'to read the Word of God in human form than it is to read the Word of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 55, 28, 12, 'in a scroll of parchment or a book.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 56, 1, 12, 'God wants to make each one of us demonstrations of the Word of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 56, 2, 12, 'written in human form. How does that happen? - Through God renewing our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 56, 3, 12, 'way of thinking, so that we begin to think like He thinks. When we begin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 56, 4, 12, 'to think like He thinks, we begin to act like He would act. You see, our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 56, 5, 12, 'whole inner life controls our external behaviour, and that is why God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 56, 6, 12, 'Word says, ''Don''t be conformed to the world.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 56, 7, 12, 'Now when we are born into the world, as little babies, we have no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 56, 8, 12, 'particular way of thinking. A new born baby is not worldly because it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 56, 9, 12, 'doesn''t have a worldly way of thinking - it is just born. But, as it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 56, 10, 12, 'grows, its nature develops - that evil corrupt nature it has inherited');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 56, 11, 12, 'from Adam grows seeing the world around it; in the way people live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 56, 12, 12, 'selfishly; the way we are surrounded by people who tell lies. As that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 56, 13, 12, 'baby develops, its way of thinking becomes exactly like everybody else');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 56, 14, 12, 'in the world; selfish, seeking its own, proud, arrogant, jealous of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 56, 15, 12, 'others who are better, and so many things like that. Therefore it harms');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 56, 16, 12, 'others, hurts others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 56, 17, 12, 'But when Christ comes in, His desire for the born again believer is to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 56, 18, 12, 'change all that. A new birth is like a baby being born all over again.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 56, 19, 12, 'Now we should allow this new life to develop and take over our way of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 56, 20, 12, 'thinking so that we begin to think like God thinks. Gradually, as we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 56, 21, 12, 'allow our thinking - the patterns of thinking to change, we will find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 56, 22, 12, 'that, when we face life situations we know God''s answer to those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 56, 23, 12, 'problems.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 56, 24, 12, 'Now, when you come to a crisis situation in your life, and you say ''Oh');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 56, 25, 12, 'God what shall I do, I want to know your will.'' You have come to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 56, 26, 12, 'crossroad in life. You have to take this decision or that decision, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 56, 27, 12, 'you don''t know what to do. Well, here it says in Romans 12:2 we can know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 56, 28, 12, 'God''s will in such a situation. Now if, during the years preceding your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 57, 1, 12, 'coming to that crossroad or that crisis, you had allowed the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 57, 2, 12, 'through God''s word to change your way of thinking, at that crisis point');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 57, 3, 12, 'in your life you will be able to " prove what is the good and acceptable');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 57, 4, 12, 'and perfect will of God"(Rom. 12:2). But, if you had been a careless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 57, 5, 12, 'Christian and you had not cared to let the way of God change your way of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 57, 6, 12, 'thinking, you are going to come to that crisis in your life and not know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 57, 7, 12, 'what to do. You will have to run to some older godly brother asking for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 57, 8, 12, 'advice and maybe he can give you good advice.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 57, 9, 12, 'But do you know that is the Old Testament way? In the Old Testament the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 57, 10, 12, 'only man who knew God''s will was the prophet, if he was a true prophet.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 57, 11, 12, 'They were very rare and sometimes, for centuries on end, there would be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 57, 12, 12, 'no true prophet. But if there happened to be a true prophet around, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 57, 13, 12, 'will have to go to him and ask what to do in a particular situation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 57, 14, 12, 'Even the kings had to go to the prophets. Then the prophet will find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 57, 15, 12, 'God''s will and tell the king or you, if you had asked him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 57, 16, 12, 'In the New Testament, the Bible says, ''You don''t have to teach everyone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 57, 17, 12, 'his fellow citizens, saying, ''Know the Lord'', because all will know me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 57, 18, 12, 'personally, from the least to the greatest" (Heb. 8:11). So one of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 57, 19, 12, 'privileges we have (because the Holy Spirit, God Himself has now come to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 57, 20, 12, 'dwell in our hearts) is that from within we can know the mind of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 57, 21, 12, 'without going to a prophet. You don''t have to go to a prophet now, or a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 57, 22, 12, 'pastor, or an elder to find the will of God. We see from Romans 12:2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 57, 23, 12, 'that ''If your mind is renewed, you can prove the will of God yourself.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 57, 24, 12, 'This is wonderful. You can have a direct hotline with God - a direct');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 57, 25, 12, 'connection with God Himself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 57, 26, 12, 'It is very important that you don''t wait until a crisis comes before you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 57, 27, 12, 'begin to seek God. Some believers turn to God only when there is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 57, 28, 12, 'crisis. And when things start to go smoothly they forget all about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 58, 1, 12, 'maintaining a close walk with God until the next crisis. Again they turn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 58, 2, 12, 'to God. Well, such believers are not going to grow. Whether there is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 58, 3, 12, 'crisis or not, whether there are problems or not, we should develop this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 58, 4, 12, 'habit of opening our mind to be influenced by the teachings of God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 58, 5, 12, 'word, particularly from the New Testament. Then we begin to understand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 58, 6, 12, 'how God thinks, what God''s attitude towards different things is.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 58, 7, 12, 'The Bible says we need to meditate on His Word. We also look at the life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 58, 8, 12, 'of Jesus Christ where that Word of God was demonstrated in human form.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 58, 9, 12, 'So, if we allow the Holy Spirit to show us, from the Scriptures, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 58, 10, 12, 'beauty and glory of Jesus and the way He lived on earth, then we will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 58, 11, 12, 'have an understanding of what God is like. The Bible says that one of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 58, 12, 12, 'the purposes with which Jesus came to the earth was to explain the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 58, 13, 12, 'Father (Jn. 1:18). So, when you look at the life of Jesus Christ, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 58, 14, 12, 'know what God the Father is like. When you read the Scriptures, the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 58, 15, 12, 'Spirit shows us how Jesus lived, how Jesus reacted to different');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 58, 16, 12, 'situations, how Jesus behaved in different circumstances and, gradually,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 58, 17, 12, 'we get that explanation in our own mind of what God is like. This way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 58, 18, 12, 'the Holy Spirit changes our way of thinking, if we submit to Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 58, 19, 12, 'Gradually, the sinful person that you and I are, get changed into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 58, 20, 12, 'likeness of Christ. Then, one day, when we face a crisis, when we come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 58, 21, 12, 'into a particular problem, we know almost immediately how Jesus would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 58, 22, 12, 'react here, how Jesus would behave, what decision Jesus would take. Then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 58, 23, 12, 'we take the same decision, and it is going to be right. I want to invite');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 58, 24, 12, 'you, if you have never done it before, from today to develop a habit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 58, 25, 12, 'opening your mind to read God''s Word and meditate on it, allowing the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 58, 26, 12, 'Holy Spirit to show you the glory of Jesus in the Scripture, so that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 58, 27, 12, 'can see how He reacted to situations, how He behaved towards His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 58, 28, 12, 'enemies, how He behaved towards people, how He conducted Himself. Pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 59, 1, 12, 'saying, ''Spirit of God, change me into that likeness.'' Then you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 59, 2, 12, 'find the will of God in different situations without having to go to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 59, 3, 12, 'prophet or a pastor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 59, 4, 13, 'Chapter 13 Religiosity And Spirituality');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 59, 5, 13, 'Let us consider something about the difference between being religious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 59, 6, 13, 'and being spiritual. Perhaps, you have never thought about it, but the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 59, 7, 13, 'difference is very important for us to understand.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 59, 8, 13, 'We read in God''s Word that, "In the last days there are going to be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 59, 9, 13, 'lot of people who hold to a form of Godliness but having denied its');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 59, 10, 13, 'power" (2 Tim. 3:1, 5). Take for example someone who wants to poison');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 59, 11, 13, 'another person, he would not give him a full glass of poison but perhaps');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 59, 12, 13, 'a glass full of milk with, may be, just two or three drops of poison');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 59, 13, 13, 'that is enough to kill the man. In the same way, when Satan wants to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 59, 14, 13, 'deceive people, he is not going to give people what is an obvious error.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 59, 15, 13, 'He is not going to come preaching sin and unrighteousness. The Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 59, 16, 13, 'says that Satan comes as an angel of light (2 Cor. 11:14, 15). There are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 59, 17, 13, 'many forms in which he comes; he comes as a lion, as a dragon, as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 59, 18, 13, 'serpent. When he comes in these forms, we can easily recognize him. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 59, 19, 13, 'may frighten us but he cannot deceive us. You are not frightened when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 59, 20, 13, 'you see a lion, or a serpent, or a dragon concerning their intentions.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 59, 21, 13, 'But you can be deceived when you see Satan coming as an angel of light');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 59, 22, 13, 'and when his servants are servants of righteousness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 59, 23, 13, 'Satan, in order to fulfil his purpose of leading people astray from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 59, 24, 13, 'true God and from the truth, has invented so many religions. He has also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 59, 25, 13, 'invented versions of Christianity which are different from what we see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 59, 26, 13, 'in the Scriptures. We use the expression nominal Christians to people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 59, 27, 13, 'who are born into a Christian family, whatever denomination they may be,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 59, 28, 13, 'but who have not come to a personal faith in Jesus Christ. Yet many of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 60, 1, 13, 'these people can have a form of godliness. Even those who have accepted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 60, 2, 13, 'Christ as their Saviour, if they fail to distinguish between religiosity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 60, 3, 13, 'and spirituality, may develop in becoming more and more religious and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 60, 4, 13, 'not spiritual.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 60, 5, 13, 'Religiosity is a human thing whereas spirituality is divine - it is from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 60, 6, 13, 'heaven. The Old Testament Law, for example, could not make anybody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 60, 7, 13, 'spiritual. There were people in the Old Testament who rose above the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 60, 8, 13, 'standards of The Law. People like Moses, Elijah, and John the Baptist');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 60, 9, 13, 'became spiritually minded, knowing the heart of God. But The Law itself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 60, 10, 13, 'could not make anybody spiritual, because The Law only demanded that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 60, 11, 13, 'conform to certain standards externally. If you kept the Ten');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 60, 12, 13, 'Commandments, i.e. you didn''t have any other gods, you didn''t worship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 60, 13, 13, 'idols, you didn''t take the Lord''s name in vain, you kept the Sabbath,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 60, 14, 13, 'you honoured your father and mother, you didn''t commit adultery, theft,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 60, 15, 13, 'murder, or bear false witness, or covet something which is your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 60, 16, 13, 'neighbour''s, you are okay. Externally The Law cannot find fault with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 60, 17, 13, 'you. If you kept all the commandments concerning the ceremonial law, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 60, 18, 13, 'would be accepted as a person in very good standing; you would be an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 60, 19, 13, 'outstanding Jew in Israel. But you need not be spiritual.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 60, 20, 13, 'Now the same thing can happen today. A person can go to the meetings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 60, 21, 13, 'regularly and can conform to the external demands of a particular');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 60, 22, 13, 'Christian denomination or a church and have a good standing there. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 60, 23, 13, 'could even be a board member or an elder there in the church but not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 60, 24, 13, 'necessarily be spiritual at al l . He may be only religious. Then he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 60, 25, 13, 'would be the equivalent of the Pharisees in Jesus'' time. They conformed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 60, 26, 13, 'to all the requirements of The Law, externally, in the eyes of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 60, 27, 13, 'people, but were not devoted to Jesus Christ in their hearts. They were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 60, 28, 13, 'not spiritual. They were not devoted to God. They did not love God with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 61, 1, 13, 'all their heart, soul, strength and mind. They loved money (Lk. 16:14).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 61, 2, 13, 'That is just one example.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 61, 3, 13, 'Religious people can pray, read the Bible daily, attend all night');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 61, 4, 13, 'fasting and prayer meetings, tithe their income, give out tracts, but,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 61, 5, 13, 'along with all that, they will also seek honour from men, live for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 61, 6, 13, 'themselves, love money, be interested in gossiping, etc.. They don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 61, 7, 13, 'seem to see that there is a contradiction between these two aspects of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 61, 8, 13, 'their lives. There doesn''t seem to be a connection between these two. On');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 61, 9, 13, 'one side, there is a form of godliness, but on the other side, the inner');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 61, 10, 13, 'power that delivers a person from a self-centred life and makes him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 61, 11, 13, 'really godly is not there. These are some examples. If you are more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 61, 12, 13, 'interested in the opinion of men; in what men think about you than in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 61, 13, 13, 'what God thinks about you, the chances are, my friend, that you could be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 61, 14, 13, 'just religious.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 61, 15, 13, 'It is good to face up to it. We are not saying anything insulting to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 61, 16, 13, 'anyone but when we expose our life to the scan of the Word of God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 61, 17, 13, 'God''s Word shows us that our Christianity is only superficial, it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 61, 18, 13, 'good to face up to it. It is better to recognize it now rather than when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 61, 19, 13, 'Christ comes again and we stand before him. That will be too late. If we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 61, 20, 13, 'recognize today that we are only religious and not spiritual, we can do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 61, 21, 13, 'something about it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 61, 22, 13, 'A spiritual man is more interested in God''s opinion of his life than the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 61, 23, 13, 'opinion of all men. A spiritual man is more interested in living a godly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 61, 24, 13, 'life than even in attending the meetings. His attendance at meetings is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 61, 25, 13, 'only to help him to live a godly life, because godly life is more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 61, 26, 13, 'important than a meeting. The way he behaves with his wife and children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 61, 27, 13, 'at home is far more important for a godly man than whether he preaches');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 61, 28, 13, 'on a Sunday morning in the meetings or not. There you can evaluate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 62, 1, 13, 'yourself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 62, 2, 13, 'If you are very careful to prepare your sermon for your Sunday morning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 62, 3, 13, 'message but not careful in the way you speak to your wife at home, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 62, 4, 13, 'are probably just religious, not spiritual. It is people who have a form');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 62, 5, 13, 'of godliness who have got a reputation that they are very holy people,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 62, 6, 13, 'but they not really spiritual. If a person is satisfied that he fasts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 62, 7, 13, 'and prays and tithes, but doesn''t seem to bother whether he can control');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 62, 8, 13, 'his speech during the day or not, is not disturbed by the fact that he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 62, 9, 13, 'is a lover of money, then he is religious. A person could be interested');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 62, 10, 13, 'in evangelism - reaching out for the lost, which is a very good thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 62, 11, 13, 'and a very necessary thing, but if he, along with that, not interested');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 62, 12, 13, 'in personal sanctification, he is just religious. A spiritual man will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 62, 13, 13, 'be interested in both.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 62, 14, 13, 'A lot of these activities which the religions people are involved in are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 62, 15, 13, 'very good, but the question is of priorities. Priorities are what make a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 62, 16, 13, 'man spiritual. You see a religious person is very often interested in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 62, 17, 13, 'the written word - the letter of the law. Bible says that ".... the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 62, 18, 13, 'letter of the law kills, but the spirit brings life" (2 Cor. 3:6). That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 62, 19, 13, 'means, God''s word, if taken just according to the letter, without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 62, 20, 13, 'understanding its spirit, won''t bring life, it will kill you. Have you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 62, 21, 13, 'thought of that? We must understand this in the context of entire verse,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 62, 22, 13, 'particularly the first part; "We are servants of a new covenant, not of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 62, 23, 13, 'the letter but the Spirit, because the letter kills but the Spirit gives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 62, 24, 13, 'life."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 62, 25, 13, 'Remember once when Jesus said, ''You have got to eat my flesh and drink');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 62, 26, 13, 'my blood'', a lot of people got offended, as they thought Jesus was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 62, 27, 13, 'preaching cannibalism. We read this in John 6. They got so offended that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 62, 28, 13, 'they went away and they never walked with Him anymore. Jesus said one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 63, 1, 13, 'last word to them before they left. He said to them, "The words I speak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 63, 2, 13, 'to you are Spirit and life, the flesh profits nothing" (Jn. 6:63). And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 63, 3, 13, 'so, what Jesus spoke was spiritual.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 63, 4, 13, 'You can take the word of Scripture - the letter, and obey it down to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 63, 5, 13, 'last detail, and just be a religious person, not spiritual at all. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 63, 6, 13, 'takes more than just keeping the letter of the law. It takes a heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 63, 7, 13, 'attitude towards God - towards His words for a person to become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 63, 8, 13, 'spiritual. Our goal in life should be to be spiritual, not a religious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 63, 9, 13, 'person like the Pharisees of old. They were more interested in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 63, 10, 13, 'justifying themselves before men and proving to men that what they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 63, 11, 13, 'standing for is right and what they were doing is right. The spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 63, 12, 13, 'man is not really bothered about what people think about him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 63, 13, 13, 'Jesus never lived wondering what people were thinking or saying about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 63, 14, 13, 'him; He lived only to please the Father. A spiritual person cares for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 63, 15, 13, 'God''s opinion. Religious people can often meditate for years on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 63, 16, 13, 'words of praise that somebody has said about them. A spiritual person,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 63, 17, 13, 'on the other hand, refuses to receive testimony from men. They know that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 63, 18, 13, 'other men do not know the corruption that is in their own heart. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 63, 19, 13, 'know that the praise of men is worth less than nothing. So they live for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 63, 20, 13, 'God''s opinion, they live to please Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 63, 21, 13, 'If our goal in life is to please God, that is not easy, we have to fight');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 63, 22, 13, 'a battle and say, ''Lord, I do not want to please man, I want to please');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 63, 23, 13, 'you.'' And if that is our determined goal, then we will find that Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 63, 24, 13, 'of God shows us the way to be truly spiritual. Then we will not only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 63, 25, 13, 'have the external form of godliness, but the inner power as well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 63, 26, 14, 'Chapter 14 Maximum Or Minimum For The Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 63, 27, 14, 'In our last study we looked at the difference between being religious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 63, 28, 14, 'and spiritual. We would like to think a little bit more about that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 64, 1, 14, 'because it is such a vital area to be a true Christian.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 64, 2, 14, 'We all know the difference between a servant - a worker working in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 64, 3, 14, 'shop or a factory and a son working for his own father in the same shop');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 64, 4, 14, 'or factory. Their attitude towards their work will be fundamentally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 64, 5, 14, 'different. A servant will be working for wages. He works for certain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 64, 6, 14, 'fixed hours. If he has to work longer than that, he expects overtime');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 64, 7, 14, 'pay. He expects a bonus at the end of the year. And after may be one or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 64, 8, 14, 'two years, he may expect a raise in salary. But a son is so different.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 64, 9, 14, 'He doesn''t think in terms of the number of hours he works. There may be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 64, 10, 14, 'more work required in the office or the shop or the factory and the son');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 64, 11, 14, 'would gladly stay on long after the workers have gone away. And if the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 64, 12, 14, 'factory is going through a difficult time financially, the son will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 64, 13, 14, 'expect his father to give him any money. What is the difference?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 64, 14, 14, 'In the difference between the attitude of the worker and the attitude of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 64, 15, 14, 'son, we can see the difference between the Old Testament way of life and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 64, 16, 14, 'the New Testament way of life. You know that your Bible is divided into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 64, 17, 14, 'two parts: the Old Testament and the New Testament or it is also called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 64, 18, 14, 'the Old Covenant and the New Covenant. Now these are not words that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 64, 19, 14, 'use so much nowadays. Testament, Covenant - they sound more like legal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 64, 20, 14, 'words. In very simple language it only means an agreement.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 64, 21, 14, 'We all know what an agreement is like. When a person sells a property or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 64, 22, 14, 'hires a worker, they sign an agreement - both the person who is buying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 64, 23, 14, 'and the person who is selling or the person who is employing and person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 64, 24, 14, 'who is being employed. And that agreement is the picture of this Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 64, 25, 14, 'Testament and the New Testament. God made an agreement with man in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 64, 26, 14, 'Old Testament times with Israel. But when Jesus came (He is called the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 64, 27, 14, 'mediator of the new covenant), God made a new agreement with man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 64, 28, 14, 'In very simple terms, we could say, under the old agreement man was like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 65, 1, 14, 'a servant. You know a servant can''t call his master, ''father'' and, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 65, 2, 14, 'is why in the Old Testament the Jews could never call God, ''Father'',');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 65, 3, 14, 'because they were servants. They could call Him, ''O Lord,'' ''God,''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 65, 4, 14, '''Mighty Master,'' and all that, but they couldn''t call Him ''Father.'' But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 65, 5, 14, 'when Jesus came, He gathered His disciples around and said, ''I am going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 65, 6, 14, 'to teach you how to pray under the New Covenant. When you pray you say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 65, 7, 14, '''Our Father, who is in heaven." What does this mean? - That this was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 65, 8, 14, 'new agreement.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 65, 9, 14, 'We are now going to be like sons and daughters of God and our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 65, 10, 14, 'relationship with God is not going to be any more like that of a Master');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 65, 11, 14, 'and a servant. It was not even going to be like that of a friend - a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 65, 12, 14, 'friend is higher to the master than a servant. It is going to be more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 65, 13, 14, 'than a friendship. Abraham was called the friend of God. But you know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 65, 14, 14, 'the difference between a friend and a son. If a rich man says, ''This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 65, 15, 14, 'my friend'' and points to another one and says, ''This is my son,'' you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 65, 16, 14, 'know who has the inheritance. Who is going to receive everything from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 65, 17, 14, 'the father? - Not the friend, but the son. To be a son of God is greater');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 65, 18, 14, 'than to be a servant of God. It is greater than to be a friend of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 65, 19, 14, 'Now, very often we use the expression that, so and so is the Lord''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 65, 20, 14, 'servants and, subconsciously, we think that that man is greater than the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 65, 21, 14, 'other person who is only the son of God. But is that really true? If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 65, 22, 14, 'were to come to my house and I introduce you to two people and say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 65, 23, 14, '''This is my servant and this is my son,'' who would you think is more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 65, 24, 14, 'important in my house? Is it greater to be the servant of the Lord than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 65, 25, 14, 'to be the son of God ? These are all wrong concepts that we have got in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 65, 26, 14, 'our mind which are not from Scripture. Of course, the son of God should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 65, 27, 14, 'also be a servant, if he is a responsible son.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 65, 28, 14, 'We need to recognize that Jesus came to deliver us from merely becoming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 66, 1, 14, 'slaves and wants us to become sons. There we see the difference between');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 66, 2, 14, 'being religious and being spiritual. A religious person behaves exactly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 66, 3, 14, 'like a servant. A spiritual person will behave like a son. Let''s put it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 66, 4, 14, 'in two different words. A servant would think in terms of the minimum');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 66, 5, 14, 'that he has to do in order to fulfil his duties, whereas a son - a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 66, 6, 14, 'responsible son that is, would think in terms of maximum that he can do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 66, 7, 14, 'to please his father or to help his father. In these two terms - the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 66, 8, 14, 'minimum and the maximum, you can see the difference between the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 66, 9, 14, 'Covenant and the New Covenant, between being a slave and being a son.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 66, 10, 14, 'That is why, when Jesus was preaching, what is known as the Sermon on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 66, 11, 14, 'the Mount, He tried to teach his disciples the spirit behind the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 66, 12, 14, 'commands. He said, for example, under the Old Dispensation, you were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 66, 13, 14, 'told, ''You shall not commit murder''. That is good. What is the minimum');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 66, 14, 14, 'required? - You shall not commit murder. But, is that the maximum that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 66, 15, 14, 'God required? Certainly not. What would the maximum be in that realm -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 66, 16, 14, 'in that area to please the Father?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 66, 17, 14, 'Where does murder come from? It comes from anger. So Jesus said, "I say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 66, 18, 14, 'to you "don''t be angry."" What was He trying to say? He was trying to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 66, 19, 14, 'say, ''If you meditate on the commandment, ''thou shall not commit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 66, 20, 14, 'murder,'' you will discover that that is just the minimum.'' If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 66, 21, 14, 'meditate on it you will discover the way to please the Father. If your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 66, 22, 14, 'attitude is, ''What is the maximum I can do,'' then it will be, ''I should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 66, 23, 14, 'not even get angry with my brother or with anyone.'' Then I have pleased');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 66, 24, 14, 'the Father . I have not pleased the Father if I have only refrained from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 66, 25, 14, 'committing murder.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 66, 26, 14, 'Now a religious person is one who takes the letter of the law and says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 66, 27, 14, '''Well, I have kept it.'' Religious people become Pharisees, and Pharisees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 66, 28, 14, 'gradually drift away from the truth. In every denomination of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 67, 1, 14, 'Christianity, you will find Pharisees - people who have taken up the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 67, 2, 14, 'letter with the traditions and who are more interested in keeping those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 67, 3, 14, 'external traditions of their particular group than in life in Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 67, 4, 14, 'Christ. This is the form of godliness that we are told in 2 Tim. 3:5 to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 67, 5, 14, 'beware of.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 67, 6, 14, 'See, if you keep your fellowship with people who are proud and arrogant,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 67, 7, 14, 'gradually you will get a little of their spirit. If you constantly keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 67, 8, 14, 'companionship with murderers, you will get their spirit. And in the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 67, 9, 14, 'way, if you keep companionship with the people who are a little bit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 67, 10, 14, 'godly, you will get their spirit. So, when it says in 2 Tim. 3:5 to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 67, 11, 14, 'avoid people, who have only a form of godliness, it is to preserve us in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 67, 12, 14, 'life. The Holy Spirit warns us not to spend a lot of time with people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 67, 13, 14, 'who are just doing the letter of the law, who are righteous externally.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 67, 14, 14, 'That type of religiosity does not please God at all. Be a son, be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 67, 15, 14, 'responsible son.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 67, 16, 14, 'In the same way, when Jesus spoke about adultery, He said, under the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 67, 17, 14, 'Dispensation, the thing was to avoid adultery - the physical act. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 67, 18, 14, 'was certainly a sin, but is that the maximum that God required? No, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 67, 19, 14, 'was the minimum. What was the maximum? The son would look at that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 67, 20, 14, 'commandment of God and meditate on it and say, ''Well that is the minimum');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 67, 21, 14, 'that God requires.'' It is like the servant saying, ''well I got to work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 67, 22, 14, 'from 9 AM to 5 PM. Once my eight hour shift is over, I will be home.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 67, 23, 14, 'But a son may stay on until 9 PM or all through the night, if there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 67, 24, 14, 'work to be done. So the 9 to 5 attitude says, ''I don''t have to commit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 67, 25, 14, 'adultery, that''s all.'' But the son''s attitude is what is behind that? -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 67, 26, 14, '''I should not be impure in my attitude or thoughts towards anyone. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 67, 27, 14, 'must be purity in thoughts towards the opposite sex.'' Jesus emphasized');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 67, 28, 14, 'it to such an extent that He said, "If your eye offends you, it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 68, 1, 14, 'better to pluck it off."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 68, 2, 14, 'Now who understands that? Only a son, who is desperate to please his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 68, 3, 14, 'Father , who has longed that his Father will be totally satisfied with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 68, 4, 14, 'his life. Only such a person can be really spiritual. He seeks to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 68, 5, 14, 'understand the spirit behind the commandments in Scripture and not just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 68, 6, 14, 'the letter of the law.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 68, 7, 14, 'The Bible says that our relationship with Jesus Christ is like that of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 68, 8, 14, 'bride to bridegroom. This is true Christianity - It is a marriage, it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 68, 9, 14, 'not a religion. It is a relationship between two people. It is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 68, 10, 14, 'worshipping a book; it is being united to a person - to the person of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 68, 11, 14, 'Jesus Christ. Religious people worship a book. The Bible is the most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 68, 12, 14, 'important thing to them. Now the Bible is very important to me, but not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 68, 13, 14, 'more important than Jesus Christ. If I didn''t have the fellowship of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 68, 14, 14, 'Jesus Christ, the Bible would become a dead book to me. It is living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 68, 15, 14, 'because Jesus can speak to me through it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 68, 16, 14, 'Our relationship to Christ is to be like that of an earthly bride who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 68, 17, 14, 'deeply in love with her bridegroom. The Bible speaks of our relationship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 68, 18, 14, 'with Christ like that, and then one day, Christ will come and will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 68, 19, 14, 'married to her. It is the exact picture of a bride who is engaged,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 68, 20, 14, 'waiting for her wedding day, eager to correspond to her bridegroom, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 68, 21, 14, 'telephone and to listen to her bridegroom, and wanting to spend time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 68, 22, 14, 'with him, until the day of the marriage. During that time, how does she');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 68, 23, 14, 'live? She is only interested in her bridegroom''s opinion. She is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 68, 24, 14, 'bothered what anybody else in the world thinks about her. She wants to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 68, 25, 14, 'please her bridegroom and she doesn''t do the minimum.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 68, 26, 14, 'Think of an engaged couple that are deeply in love with each other. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 68, 27, 14, 'they get an opportunity to spend time with each other, do they think of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 68, 28, 14, 'the minimum time required? Do they look at the watch and say, ''Ok, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 69, 1, 14, 'have spent ten minutes and it is enough?'' No, they feel even five hours');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 69, 2, 14, 'is not enough! When they write letters to each other, an engaged couple');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 69, 3, 14, 'that are deeply in love with one another, how long are those letters');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 69, 4, 14, 'going to be - half a page? Do they say, ''Well that is enough, I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 69, 5, 14, 'told you I am okay and hope you are okay?'' No, they may write 25 pages');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 69, 6, 14, 'and next day they may write another 25 pages again! This is due to love.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 69, 7, 14, 'True spirituality is the result of a loving relationship with Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 69, 8, 14, 'Religiosity, on the other hand, is a merely formal relationship with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 69, 9, 14, 'Christ, like a servant to a master. Let us seek to be spiritual.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 69, 10, 15, 'Chapter 15 A Son Or A Servant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 69, 11, 15, 'We want to consider a little bit more about what we were looking at in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 69, 12, 15, 'our last couple of messages - the difference between being religious and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 69, 13, 15, 'being spiritual.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 69, 14, 15, 'A person can be religious and still be very, very selfish and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 69, 15, 15, 'self-centred and think all the time in terms of his own profit and his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 69, 16, 15, 'own gain. When a person becomes spiritual, he cannot be self-centred or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 69, 17, 15, 'selfish. He thinks not in terms of what he is going to gain, but in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 69, 18, 15, 'terms what God is going to gain; how God is going to be glorified.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 69, 19, 15, 'You remember the prayer which Jesus taught His disciples, which is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 69, 20, 15, 'commonly known as the ''Lord''s Prayer'' - "Our Father who art in heaven"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 69, 21, 15, 'followed by six requests. The three of those requests, the first three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 69, 22, 15, 'in fact, concern God - His name, His kingdom, His will, and the next');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 69, 23, 15, 'three concerns ourselves - our physical and material needs -daily bread,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 69, 24, 15, 'our need for forgiveness - our past life, i.e. "Forgive us our sins as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 69, 25, 15, 'we forgive others," and our need for deliverance from sins in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 69, 26, 15, 'future. Notice that Jesus taught His disciples that the right way to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 69, 27, 15, 'pray was putting God''s glory, name, honour, and His will, and His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 69, 28, 15, 'kingdom first and putting our own needs secondary.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 70, 1, 15, 'Now, if you were to examine your own prayer, I mean, think of the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 70, 2, 15, 'you have prayed to God, even if it is half a minute prayer, or one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 70, 3, 15, 'sentence prayer, or a long prayer. What have you basically prayed to God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 70, 4, 15, 'for, say, during the last one year? When you spend time in prayer or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 70, 5, 15, 'make short requests to God, what are you actually asking God for? If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 70, 6, 15, 'are honest, you will discover how much your prayers are centred on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 70, 7, 15, 'yourself and your family. That is an indication of the way you live also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 70, 8, 15, '- How do you spend your money, your time, and your abilities? You may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 70, 9, 15, 'find that the answer to these questions show that your life is so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 70, 10, 15, 'wrapped up only around yourself and your family. And to ease your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 70, 11, 15, 'conscience you give a little time to God, may be on a Sunday morning, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 70, 12, 15, 'may be on a Wednesday evening. Then you feel that you are spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 70, 13, 15, 'because you have given a little time to God or may be because you live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 70, 14, 15, 'what you consider as an upright life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 70, 15, 15, 'True spirituality is a lot more than going to two meetings in a week. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 70, 16, 15, 'fact, a man can be spiritual even without going for any meeting at all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 70, 17, 15, 'in a week. If he is locked up in a prison, for example, he is not able');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 70, 18, 15, 'to go for a meeting, or if he is in a hospital or sick, he can''t go for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 70, 19, 15, 'a meeting. He can still be spiritual. But you can''t be spiritual, if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 70, 20, 15, 'are seeking your own. A religious person goes through religious acts to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 70, 21, 15, 'ease his conscience but, deep down in the centre of his life, SELF still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 70, 22, 15, 'sits on the throne. That is why Jesus said, "You can''t be my disciple');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 70, 23, 15, 'unless you take up the cross" - deny that self which is sitting on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 70, 24, 15, 'throne (Lk. 9:23). "Unless you deny your self-life, dethrone it, kill');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 70, 25, 15, 'it, and follow me, you can''t be my disciple." He said, "You got to do it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 70, 26, 15, 'every day."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 70, 27, 15, 'So we see that a religious person can still have SELF sitting on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 70, 28, 15, 'throne of his heart and go through the motions of every external');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 71, 1, 15, 'activity. He may go to every meeting, he may go to six or seven meetings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 71, 2, 15, 'a week, he may engage in evangelism, he may even be a full-time worker');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 71, 3, 15, 'who has given up his job, and may be travels to some difficult place to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 71, 4, 15, 'preach God''s word, still he may be just religious. Jesus once said to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 71, 5, 15, 'the Pharisees, who were religious people of his time, ''You travel and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 71, 6, 15, 'cross lands and seas, you travel here and there to make converts. What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 71, 7, 15, 'do you accomplish? You produce people exactly like yourself. They have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 71, 8, 15, 'become double the children of hell. In fact, they would have been better');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 71, 9, 15, 'off if you had left them alone, because you made them like yourselves -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 71, 10, 15, 'self-centred, thinking that they are spiritual, when they are only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 71, 11, 15, 'religious . Lot of conversions are like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 71, 12, 15, 'Even in Christendom today, people are converted to a form of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 71, 13, 15, 'religiosity. They never become spiritual because the SELF sits on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 71, 14, 15, 'throne. They have never thought to take up the cross every day. Think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 71, 15, 15, 'about yourself; has anybody ever taught what it means to deny yourself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 71, 16, 15, 'every day, to take up your cross every day, as you read Luke 9:23? What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 71, 17, 15, 'does it say there? It says, ''Unless you do that every day, you can''t be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 71, 18, 15, 'His disciple, you can''t follow Him; it is impossible.'' He said that in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 71, 19, 15, 'Luke 14:27 too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 71, 20, 15, 'The religious man thinks like this, i.e. when he becomes Christian, this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 71, 21, 15, 'is the way his thought processes work: What can I get from the Lord? Can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 71, 22, 15, 'the Lord give me forgiveness of sins? Yeah I want that. Can He give me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 71, 23, 15, 'healing? Yeah I would like that. Can He give me heaven after I die? Yeah');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 71, 24, 15, 'I want that too. Can He bless me? Yeah I want that. Can He bless me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 71, 25, 15, 'materially? Boy, I would love that. Can He anoint me so that I can be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 71, 26, 15, 'mighty, famous preacher going around with my pictures here and there in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 71, 27, 15, 'Christian magazines? I would love that too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 71, 28, 15, 'Now, do you think such a man is spiritual? He may be talking about a lot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 72, 1, 15, 'of Christian activities, but his goal is something for himself. He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 72, 2, 15, 'seeking his own name, his own fame, his own gain, his own prosperity,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 72, 3, 15, 'his own blessing, everything for self. Self sits on the throne of his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 72, 4, 15, 'life. He is got a form of godliness though. He may be a fulltime worker.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 72, 5, 15, 'But a lot of people in fulltime Christian work today are doing it for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 72, 6, 15, 'their own profit. If those people were in secular jobs, they would not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 72, 7, 15, 'be earning even half of what they earn in Christian work. It has brought');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 72, 8, 15, 'them profit. They are doing business with God. Jesus turned such people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 72, 9, 15, 'out of the temple in His day, in His time - People who sought their own,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 72, 10, 15, 'who appeared to be selling sheep and doves to help people sacrifice in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 72, 11, 15, 'the temple, but who were actually just thinking in terms of their own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 72, 12, 15, 'profit and gain. Do you know the amount of religiosity there is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 72, 13, 15, 'Christianity today that goes undetected, disguised as Christian work?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 72, 14, 15, 'Oh, there is such a lot of that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 72, 15, 15, 'A spiritual man, on the other hand, is not thinking what he can get out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 72, 16, 15, 'of the Lord. He thinks, ''What can the Lord get out of me? What can the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 72, 17, 15, 'Lord get from this one earthly life that I have? What is the maximum');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 72, 18, 15, 'that He can get?'' Now, if you are honest, as you read this transcript ,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 72, 19, 15, 'you can ask yourself, what is your attitude towards the Lord? Are you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 72, 20, 15, 'always thinking, what is the next thing I can get from the Lord for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 72, 21, 15, 'myself, for my family? Or is your attitude is , ''What more can the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 72, 22, 15, 'get out of my earthly life before I leave this earth? What more can He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 72, 23, 15, 'get out of me?'' Personally, I want Him to have everything of me from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 72, 24, 15, 'head to foot, and I want my life to be dispensed for Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 72, 25, 15, 'There is a lot of difference between these two attitudes. Both people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 72, 26, 15, 'may sit next to each other in a Christian church, and you may not be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 72, 27, 15, 'able to distinguish between the two, because it is a question of heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 72, 28, 15, 'attitude. Both may go out for evangelism, both may go out to serve the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 73, 1, 15, 'Lord, and both may sacrifice. And yet the fundamental motive underneath');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 73, 2, 15, 'may be totally different. You know it is the motive that determines the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 73, 3, 15, 'spirituality, not the actions.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 73, 4, 15, 'Jesus went to the Synagogue and the Pharisees went to Synagogue. Do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 73, 5, 15, 'think they were both equally acceptable to God? Jesus studied the Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 73, 6, 15, 'and the Pharisees studied the Bible. Do you think they were equally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 73, 7, 15, 'acceptable to the Father ? Jesus went out to preach, the Pharisees went');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 73, 8, 15, 'out to preach. The Pharisees were full time workers and Jesus was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 73, 9, 15, 'fulltime worker for three-and-a-half years. But do you think they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 73, 10, 15, 'the same? There was a vast difference. In fact, in the gospels, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 73, 11, 15, 'constantly see the contrast between Jesus and Pharisees. It is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 73, 12, 15, 'contrast between true spirituality and religiosity. It is the contrast');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 73, 13, 15, 'between living according to the Spirit of the New Covenant, the new');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 73, 14, 15, 'agreement that God has made with man and living according to the letter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 73, 15, 15, 'of the law - the Old Covenant. There is a vast difference between the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 73, 16, 15, 'two.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 73, 17, 15, 'When Adam sinned, do you know what he did? He covered himself with fig');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 73, 18, 15, 'leaves. Fig leaves are a picture of religiosity with which a man tries');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 73, 19, 15, 'to make himself presentable before God and before man. You know what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 73, 20, 15, 'Jesus did when he saw a fig tree covered with leaves. He cursed it and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 73, 21, 15, 'the whole tree withered out. That teaches us that there is a curse on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 73, 22, 15, 'religiosity. He came looking for fruit in that fig tree; He didn''t want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 73, 23, 15, 'its leaves. Fig trees were not created just to have leaves. Likewise,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 73, 24, 15, 'God did not create man just to be religious. Yes, there are religious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 73, 25, 15, 'activities but underneath it all if there is not a spiritual life, then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 73, 26, 15, 'God is not interested. There is a curse over it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 73, 27, 15, 'What is it that God gave Adam? God stripped him of those fig leaves and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 73, 28, 15, 'gave him a covering of skin; He killed an animal and put its skin over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 74, 1, 15, 'him. It is a picture of God giving us his own nature. The dress of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 74, 2, 15, 'fig leaves was what Adam manufactured; He sewed up the fig leaves and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 74, 3, 15, 'made a dress for himself, to cover himself. When God saw it, He said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 74, 4, 15, '''Throw that away, I don''t want it.'' They may be good fig leaves, i.e.,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 74, 5, 15, 'they were not rotten but still not acceptable. God said, ''I will give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 74, 6, 15, 'you a dress.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 74, 7, 15, 'God gives us the nature of Christ. That is what that skin of the animal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 74, 8, 15, 'means. We can then ask, ''Why did God keep people under the law for 1500');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 74, 9, 15, 'years?'' - To show man the emptiness of it. He never intended that man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 74, 10, 15, 'should live under The Law all his life. God left man under The Law to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 74, 11, 15, 'show that that is not the way. ''You will never attain to my nature that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 74, 12, 15, 'way.'' He wanted man to come to an end of himself and that is what The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 74, 13, 15, 'Law was meant to accomplish. Those people who did come to an end of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 74, 14, 15, 'themselves, they began to seek God. To them God is able to give His own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 74, 15, 15, 'nature, and that is throwing away the fig leaves of religiosity and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 74, 16, 15, 'giving us the nature of Jesus Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 74, 17, 15, 'The nature of Jesus Christ means that we serve God with the same Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 74, 18, 15, 'with which Christ served the Father - Not as a servant but as a Son.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 74, 19, 15, 'Beloved friends, God has called you not to be his servant but to be his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 74, 20, 15, 'son and to serve Him with the Spirit of His Son.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 74, 21, 16, 'Chapter 16 Keeping The Tenth Commandment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 74, 22, 16, 'Once again, we will continue looking at the difference between being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 74, 23, 16, 'religious and being spiritual as we did in our last three studies; look');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 74, 24, 16, 'into a little more in depth so that we can be clear in our own minds on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 74, 25, 16, 'this very important matter.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 74, 26, 16, 'Most of us are aware of the Ten Commandments that God gave Moses. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 74, 27, 16, 'may not know all of them. It is good to know all of them. I want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 74, 28, 16, 'point something out to you in those Ten Commandments which you may have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 75, 1, 16, 'not noticed up until now. If we understand that, we will see a little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 75, 2, 16, 'bit of the reason why God gave The Law, even though He knew that The Law');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 75, 3, 16, 'could never lead anyone to becoming spiritual or to live a godly life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 75, 4, 16, 'In fact, in Hebrews 8:7, you will see very clearly that the Old Covenant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 75, 5, 16, 'was faulty. That is the word used there that the old covenant, The Law');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 75, 6, 16, 'was faulty.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 75, 7, 16, 'Did God give something faulty? Did He make a mistake? - He certainly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 75, 8, 16, 'didn''t; He knows the end from the beginning. He gave it with a purpose,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 75, 9, 16, 'for our help; for us to see our need. The Law was given to expose sins.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 75, 10, 16, 'We could also say that The Law was given by God to test man - to see how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 75, 11, 16, 'many people would be satisfied with an external righteousness that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 75, 12, 16, 'brought the honour of men, and how many would seek God for that inner');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 75, 13, 16, 'purity which alone pleases God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 75, 14, 16, 'You remember when Jesus was speaking to the Pharisees, He told them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 75, 15, 16, '"You are people, who just clean the outside of the cup, but God sees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 75, 16, 16, 'your hearts and He wants the inside of the cup cleansed. You people will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 75, 17, 16, 'do all the right things externally so that people are impressed, but God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 75, 18, 16, 'sees deep within; He is looking for inner purity of motive." We can say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 75, 19, 16, 'that the Pharisees were like Adam covered with fig leaves, and you know,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 75, 20, 16, 'from the previous study, that there is curse upon it. That is why you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 75, 21, 16, 'find that Jesus was in constant conflict with the Pharisees.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 75, 22, 16, 'The Pharisees, who kept the letter of the law down to the last detail,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 75, 23, 16, 'whose doctrines were so correct that we read that Jesus told even His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 75, 24, 16, 'disciples to follow the teachings of the Pharisees (Mt. 23:2-3). Have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 75, 25, 16, 'you noticed that? He said that because whatever they say is right. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 75, 26, 16, 'only thing, He said, is that they don''t do like they teach; don''t follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 75, 27, 16, 'their example in your life, because they teach things they don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 75, 28, 16, 'practice. So, there was nothing wrong with the doctrine of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 76, 1, 16, 'Pharisees.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 76, 2, 16, 'There was another group in Jesus'' time called the Sadducees who had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 76, 3, 16, 'wrong doctrines. Jesus never told His disciples to follow their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 76, 4, 16, 'teachings, because they didn''t believe in angels or Spirit or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 76, 5, 16, 'resurrection. In fact, they were very earthly minded. They didn''t think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 76, 6, 16, 'much about future life at all. Their doctrine was wrong. But the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 76, 7, 16, 'Pharisees were the people whose doctrines were right. A person can have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 76, 8, 16, 'all his doctrines right - his doctrines may be thoroughly evangelical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 76, 9, 16, 'and yet he may be religious; He may be only having a doctrine which is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 76, 10, 16, 'external.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 76, 11, 16, 'Now think of the Ten Commandments; God said, "You shouldn''t have any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 76, 12, 16, 'other gods, you mustn''t make idols, you must not take My name in vain,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 76, 13, 16, 'you must keep the Sabbath day holy. You must honour your father and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 76, 14, 16, 'mother, you must not murder, you must not commit adultery, you must not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 76, 15, 16, 'steal, you must not bear false witness." Now these are nine of the Ten');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 76, 16, 16, 'Commandments. It is possible for any person, without the help of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 76, 17, 16, 'Holy Spirit, to keep those nine commandments. The proof of it is that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 76, 18, 16, 'many people in the Old Testament kept those nine commandments without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 76, 19, 16, 'the help of the Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 76, 20, 16, 'They did not have the Holy Spirit in the Old Testament times and yet,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 76, 21, 16, 'Paul could say, "I have lived with a good conscience before God from my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 76, 22, 16, 'childhood up until this day" (Acts 23:1). The rich young ruler, when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 76, 23, 16, 'Jesus pointed out these commandments to him, said, "I have kept all of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 76, 24, 16, 'these from my childhood" (Mk. 10:20). It was possible for a God-fearing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 76, 25, 16, 'person to keep all these commandments without the help of the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 76, 26, 16, 'Spirit, just by his own strength. It is possible for any man of any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 76, 27, 16, 'religion to keep these nine commandments without any help from God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 76, 28, 16, 'because man has certain strength to lead an externally moral life. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 77, 1, 16, 'you don''t lead an externally moral life, nobody is going to accept your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 77, 2, 16, 'religion. People expect religious people to be, at least, moral');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 77, 3, 16, 'externally!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 77, 4, 16, 'But, when we come to the tenth commandment, the tenth commandment did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 77, 5, 16, 'not deal with the external; it dealt with something inward. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 77, 6, 16, 'commandment was, ''You shall not lust or covet or strongly desire''- all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 77, 7, 16, 'these three words mean the same. Unfortunately, lust has got an evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 77, 8, 16, 'connotation in people''s minds. But all it means is strong desire, like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 77, 9, 16, 'it says in Galatians 5:17, "The Holy Spirit lusts against the flesh."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 77, 10, 16, 'What does that mean? The Holy Spirit doesn''t do any evil. He has got a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 77, 11, 16, 'strong desire against (as opposed to) the flesh. And the flesh has got a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 77, 12, 16, 'strong desire against the Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 77, 13, 16, 'It is the same word used in Exodus 20: 17 in the tenth Commandment -"You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 77, 14, 16, 'shall not covet your neighbour''s house or your neighbour''s wife." This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 77, 15, 16, 'means the same as, ''You shall not lust for your neighbour''s house or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 77, 16, 16, 'lust for your neighbour''s wife.'' It means the same as, ''You shall not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 77, 17, 16, 'have a strong desire for your neighbour''s house or for your neighbour''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 77, 18, 16, 'wife or you shall not have a strong desire to get your neighbour''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 77, 19, 16, 'servant and wish that that servant who works in your neighbour''s house');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 77, 20, 16, 'could be your servant, because may be she is such a faithful servant.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 77, 21, 16, 'You shall not desire your neighbour''s business, or his donkey, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 77, 22, 16, 'anything that is your neighbour''s. The tenth commandment was inward. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 77, 23, 16, 'thing is there is no way by which anybody could find out whether you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 77, 24, 16, 'kept it or not. It was impossible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 77, 25, 16, 'Now Paul was a very, very honest person. He tells us that, ''According to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 77, 26, 16, 'the righteousness which is in The Law, he was blameless'' (Phil. 3:6). He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 77, 27, 16, 'had kept the law blamelessly. What does it mean? Does it mean he kept');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 77, 28, 16, 'all Ten Commandments? - He certainly didn''t; He kept only nine. But that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 78, 1, 16, 'is all that was required. Nobody could keep the tenth commandment.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 78, 2, 16, 'Nobody could say I have never lusted after anything; I have never lusted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 78, 3, 16, 'out for my neighbour''s wife or my neighbour''s daughter and remember');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 78, 4, 16, 'every woman in the world is either your neighbour''s wife or your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 78, 5, 16, 'neighbour''s daughter, everyone in the world. You can never say that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 78, 6, 16, 'have never desired what belongs to somebody else.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 78, 7, 16, 'There is not a soul in this world who can say that, not even the apostle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 78, 8, 16, 'Paul. And He tells us that very honestly, "What shall we say then, is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 78, 9, 16, 'The Law sin, may it never be." He continued, "I would not have known sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 78, 10, 16, 'except for The Law" (Rom. 7:7). Then he mentions the tenth commandments,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 78, 11, 16, 'not the first nine, because he kept the first nine. He says, when it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 78, 12, 16, 'came to the tenth Commandment, which said, ''You shall not covet, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 78, 13, 16, 'shall not lust, you shall not have a strong desire for anything that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 78, 14, 16, 'your neighbour''s,'' "I discovered every type of lust in my heart" (Rom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 78, 15, 16, '7:8). He was honest. He said, ''I thought I was pleasing God till this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 78, 16, 16, 'commandment showed me the corruption of sin in my life. I saw that I was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 78, 17, 16, 'dead spiritually in God''s eyes, because I found every kind of lust in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 78, 18, 16, 'me.'' He says, ''Every kind of coveting, every kind of strong desire''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 78, 19, 16, '(Rom. 7:8).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 78, 20, 16, 'Why did God give such a commandment if He knew that nobody could keep it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 78, 21, 16, 'without the help of the Holy Spirit? Now here is the answer: God gave it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 78, 22, 16, 'to see how many people would be honest in admitting that they come short');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 78, 23, 16, 'in this area. Do you know friends; the first step to being spiritual is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 78, 24, 16, 'honesty. God doesn''t ask you to be holy first; none of us can be holy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 78, 25, 16, 'Again, He doesn''t ask us to be loving or humble or anything, because all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 78, 26, 16, 'these things take time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 78, 27, 16, 'There is one thing you can be today, that is the first step to true');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 78, 28, 16, 'spirituality, and that is honesty. Paul was honest. He said, ''It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 79, 1, 16, 'true, I find every type of covetousness in my heart. I am a sinner.'' He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 79, 2, 16, 'admits, ''Such a sinner that I thought I was alive, but I am actually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 79, 3, 16, 'dead, I am dead in sin.'' A man who kept every single external');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 79, 4, 16, 'commandment acknowledges that he is thoroughly dead in sin, because he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 79, 5, 16, 'discovered every type of lust in his heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 79, 6, 16, 'How do you find it in your heart? You just got to be honest. If you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 79, 7, 16, 'honest, God will lead you further. But if you are dishonest and pretend');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 79, 8, 16, 'that you don''t have any such desires and that you are so clean and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 79, 9, 16, 'upright like the Pharisees pretended, then Jesus will say to you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 79, 10, 16, 'sarcastically, like He said to the Pharisees, "I did not come for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 79, 11, 16, 'righteous people, I came for the sinners. I came to call sinners to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 79, 12, 16, 'repentance," and he will pass by you altogether. And you will miss the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 79, 13, 16, 'Lord completely, like the Pharisees missed him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 79, 14, 16, 'Why did they miss the Lord? Why did the Lord leave them alone? He says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 79, 15, 16, '"You people are healthy. I came for sick people; only sick people need a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 79, 16, 16, 'doctor. Why do you healthy people need me?" You think they were healthy?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 79, 17, 16, '- Far from healthy. Pharisees were the sickest people in Israel. Why did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 79, 18, 16, 'Jesus say, "You people are healthy?" He was being sarcastic. He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 79, 19, 16, 'trying to show them their hypocrisy. He was showing them that He would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 79, 20, 16, 'not go to help those who are not honest.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 79, 21, 16, 'You see, how easy it is to come to the Lord. You just got to be honest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 79, 22, 16, 'about the sin in your heart and say, ''Lord, there is every type of lust');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 79, 23, 16, 'in me.'' Because Paul was honest, you know what happened? He discovered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 79, 24, 16, 'how the Holy Spirit''s power could help him keep even the tenth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 79, 25, 16, 'commandment; How the Holy Spirit''s power could deliver him from lusting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 79, 26, 16, 'within his heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 79, 27, 16, 'The blood of Jesus would cleanse his past failure and the Holy Spirit''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 79, 28, 16, 'power would set him free. He says, "The Law of the Spirit of life has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 80, 1, 16, 'set me free from The Law of sin and death" (Rom. 8:2). Do you want that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 80, 2, 16, 'experience? Do you want to come into a life where the Law of the Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 80, 3, 16, 'sets you free from this slavery to lust in your heart? Be honest. Tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 80, 4, 16, 'the Lord that you have come short, that you have failed, that you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 80, 5, 16, 'sinned in your heart, and ask Him to forgive you and cleanse you in His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 80, 6, 16, 'blood and say, ''Lord, I never want to be dishonest again.'' Ask Him to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 80, 7, 16, 'fill you with His Holy Spirit and give you power within and you can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 80, 8, 16, 'pure.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 80, 9, 17, 'Chapter 17 Dead Works');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 80, 10, 17, 'We shall continue our study on the difference between religiosity and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 80, 11, 17, 'spirituality; particularly we will be looking at the subject of dead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 80, 12, 17, 'works.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 80, 13, 17, 'The New Testament speaks of the works of the flesh in Galatians 5:19');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 80, 14, 17, 'onwards and we are all familiar with those works: immorality, strife,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 80, 15, 17, 'jealousy, outburst of anger, sorcery, and many things like that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 80, 16, 17, 'mentioned in those verses. We understand that a true Christian, as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 80, 17, 17, 'spiritual person, can never indulge in these sins. These are known as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 80, 18, 17, 'sins - these works are so obviously sinful that it would be difficult');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 80, 19, 17, 'for a believer to practice any of them without being deeply convicted in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 80, 20, 17, 'his conscience. So, they are not dangerous in the sense of leading us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 80, 21, 17, 'astray. Certainly, they are evil. But one good thing is that, when we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 80, 22, 17, 'fall in any of them, we are aware of it, because our conscience tells us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 80, 23, 17, 'immediately. Even a worldly unconverted person''s conscience will tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 80, 24, 17, 'him about immorality and things like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 80, 25, 17, 'But dead works are more deceitful. The New Testament speaks about dead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 80, 26, 17, 'works in Hebrews 6:1. It says that we should repent from dead works. Now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 80, 27, 17, 'in the Old Testament there is no such thing as dead works. You either');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 80, 28, 17, 'have good works or bad works; there is only good and evil. But in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 81, 1, 17, 'New Testament we have good works, evil works, and dead works. Good works');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 81, 2, 17, 'are works that please God; evil works are works which are mentioned in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 81, 3, 17, 'Galatians 5:19-21, also known as the works of the flesh. What are dead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 81, 4, 17, 'works then?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 81, 5, 17, 'Dead works are works that appear good externally but that spring from a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 81, 6, 17, 'corrupt motive or done for the wrong reason. Therefore, they are like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 81, 7, 17, 'filthy garments in God''s eyes. It is like a person who is filled with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 81, 8, 17, 'leprosy giving you a first-class apple to eat with his leprous hand.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 81, 9, 17, 'Would you take it and eat it? The apple may be good, but it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 81, 10, 17, 'contaminated with the germs of leprosy in that person''s hands. It is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 81, 11, 17, 'same way when we offer a good thing to God but contaminated with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 81, 12, 17, 'wrong motive. It could be a prayer, you could sing a solo in a Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 81, 13, 17, 'meeting, and your aim may be to get honour for yourself. Well, what is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 81, 14, 17, 'that - a good work or a bad work? - It is a dead work.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 81, 15, 17, 'It is important for us to understand this. It is well known among');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 81, 16, 17, 'believers that "The blood of Jesus cleanses us from all sins" (1 John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 81, 17, 17, '1:7), but what is not so well known is that "The blood of Christ must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 81, 18, 17, 'also cleanse us from dead works before we can serve the living God"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 81, 19, 17, '(Heb. 9:14). So, what does the blood of Christ cleanse us from? - Not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 81, 20, 17, 'only sins. It must also cleanse us from the dead works. And therefore,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 81, 21, 17, 'it is very, very important for us to have a very clear understanding as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 81, 22, 17, 'to what dead works are.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 81, 23, 17, 'Let''s look at some of the type of works which we could call as dead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 81, 24, 17, 'works. First of all, dead works are works done without any joy. In other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 81, 25, 17, 'words, these are works done out of compulsion, or necessity, or for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 81, 26, 17, 'fear of punishment, or something like that. You know how some of you get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 81, 27, 17, 'your son, for example, to obey you to do his homework when he wants to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 81, 28, 17, 'play out in the field. You force him to come in with a threat of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 82, 1, 17, 'punishing him with a cane if he doesn''t listen. Then he sits down with a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 82, 2, 17, 'grumpy face at his table and does his homework. He is not doing it with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 82, 3, 17, 'joy, but he is doing it. The homework is a good thing to do but then it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 82, 4, 17, 'is done out of compulsion.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 82, 5, 17, 'It is the same way a lot of people pay their tithe; they don''t do it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 82, 6, 17, 'joyfully. They do it because they are told by some pastor that if they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 82, 7, 17, 'don''t do it they will be punished - that they will get some sickness in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 82, 8, 17, 'their home and then they have to give the money to the doctor at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 82, 9, 17, 'hospital, if they don''t give it to God etc. So, out of fear, they pay');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 82, 10, 17, 'their tithe.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 82, 11, 17, 'Do you think God is interested in all these psychological techniques by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 82, 12, 17, 'which people are forced to give their money? - Far from it. These are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 82, 13, 17, 'the techniques of manipulators among Christians. The Bible says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 82, 14, 17, 'concerning giving, "God loves a cheerful giver" (2 Cor. 9:7). In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 82, 15, 17, 'everything God wants cheerfulness. The Bible says, in not a so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 82, 16, 17, 'well-known verse, that "God meets with those who rejoice in doing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 82, 17, 17, 'righteousness" (Is. 64:5), not just those who do righteousness. Let me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 82, 18, 17, 'show you another verse where the Lord was telling Israelites why they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 82, 19, 17, 'were being punished or why they would be punished in the future. Moses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 82, 20, 17, 'was telling them, "Because you did not serve the Lord with joy and with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 82, 21, 17, 'a glad heart for the abundance of all the things He has given you;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 82, 22, 17, 'therefore, you shall serve your enemies ..." (Deut. 28:47, 48).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 82, 23, 17, 'Why did the Lord send the Israelites to become slaves at different times');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 82, 24, 17, 'in their history? It is because they didn''t serve the Lord with joy. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 82, 25, 17, 'Kingdom of God is not just righteousness (Rom. 14:17). This verse makes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 82, 26, 17, 'it very, very clear that the Kingdom of God consists of righteousness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 82, 27, 17, 'along with peace and joy in the Holy Spirit. In other words, if you just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 82, 28, 17, 'do righteousness without the joy of the Holy Spirit, you are not really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 83, 1, 17, 'serving the Kingdom of God; you are just fulfilling weak legalistic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 83, 2, 17, 'requirement. And, therefore, you can be religious, but not spiritual. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 83, 3, 17, 'spiritual man is a man who has discerned dead works and repented of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 83, 4, 17, 'those dead works and cleansed his heart from dead works through the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 83, 5, 17, 'blood of Christ. The only ones who can bring joy and delight to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 83, 6, 17, 'heart of God are those who do whatever they do with joy, with a cheerful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 83, 7, 17, 'heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 83, 8, 17, 'Take this matter of tithing which I just mentioned earlier. This was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 83, 9, 17, 'command under the Old Covenant. In fact, in the Old Covenant, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 83, 10, 17, 'addition to your tithes you had to give other offerings and sacrifices.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 83, 11, 17, 'You ultimately end up giving about 15% or more of your income to God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 83, 12, 17, 'But it is interesting to see that Jesus never commanded it. The only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 83, 13, 17, 'time He ever mentioned it is in Mathew 23 when he spoke to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 83, 14, 17, 'Pharisees. That was the time when people were still under The Law and He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 83, 15, 17, 'said, "You ought to have done this (tithes) but not neglected the other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 83, 16, 17, 'things." Otherwise, it was not a commandment that Jesus gave to people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 83, 17, 17, 'who have come under the New Covenant. That is why, after Acts 2, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 83, 18, 17, 'never find any command to tithe. The only reference to it, after that,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 83, 19, 17, 'is in Hebrew''s 7:2 where it talks about Abraham tithing and giving his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 83, 20, 17, 'money to Melchizedek.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 83, 21, 17, 'Why is there no commandment to tithe in the New Covenant? Because, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 83, 22, 17, 'the Old Testament, the quantity you gave to God was important. In the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 83, 23, 17, 'New Testament the quality of your giving is what is more important -Not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 83, 24, 17, 'how much you give, but how you give. You understand the difference');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 83, 25, 17, 'between how much you give and how you give? In the Old Testament, it was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 83, 26, 17, 'a question of how much you gave. If you didn''t give 10% you disobeyed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 83, 27, 17, 'In fact, in the last page of the Old Testament it says, "You are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 83, 28, 17, 'robbers. You have not brought tithe into the storehouse. Bring the tithe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 84, 1, 17, 'in and see how I will bless you" (Mal. 3:10). But once you finish with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 84, 2, 17, 'Malachi that is the end of it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 84, 3, 17, 'When you come into the New Covenant, we read in 2 Corinthians 9:7 that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 84, 4, 17, 'the Lord is interested in you giving with joy. Then why is it so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 84, 5, 17, 'people are being compelled to pay their tithes reluctantly? It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 84, 6, 17, 'because of covetous Christian leaders who want them. So people pay up,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 84, 7, 17, 'but without any joy; it is not spontaneous giving. It is grudging,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 84, 8, 17, 'reluctant giving. The preachers who collect the money may be happy but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 84, 9, 17, 'God is not. God is not happy because the money is not given cheerfully.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 84, 10, 17, 'I agree that it is a good discipline to give 10%. If a man says, ''Well,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 84, 11, 17, 'if I don''t discipline myself, I will give nothing'' and gives 10%, then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 84, 12, 17, 'that is good. But don''t think that God is going to be happy if you give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 84, 13, 17, 'that money reluctantly. Christian preachers, very often, love very large');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 84, 14, 17, 'givers but God loves cheerful givers. There is a lot of difference. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 84, 15, 17, 'see, the New Covenant''s principle is not - give as much as you can give.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 84, 16, 17, 'No, the New Covenant''s principle is - give as much as you can give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 84, 17, 17, 'cheerfully and stop there. God doesn''t want anymore. God wants happy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 84, 18, 17, 'people. He wants children who are happy. Of course, the Bible says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 84, 19, 17, '''Give in proportion to what God has given you. If you give more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 84, 20, 17, 'liberally you will get more liberally.'' That is all true. But when you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 84, 21, 17, 'do business with God thinking that if you give more you will get back');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 84, 22, 17, 'more, that is a dead work. So, you see, even your giving money to God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 84, 23, 17, 'something you may need to repent of because you gave it reluctantly or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 84, 24, 17, 'grudgingly. It is so clear from 2 Corinthians 9:7 not to give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 84, 25, 17, 'grudgingly. Did you notice that? - Not grudgingly, not under any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 84, 26, 17, 'compulsion. What does that mean? Nobody should compel another person to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 84, 27, 17, 'give because God loves a cheerful giver. Christian leaders are so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 84, 28, 17, 'different from God in this area.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 85, 1, 17, 'This is one area of dead works - doing things without joy, cheerfulness,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 85, 2, 17, 'gladness. A second area of dead works are, works done without love. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 85, 3, 17, 'know how, in the home of a new couple that are just married, the wife');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 85, 4, 17, 'serves; everything she does for her husband is out of love; She cooks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 85, 5, 17, 'the food, washes the clothes, and keeps the house clean; all done out of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 85, 6, 17, 'love. Twenty years later you go to the same home, the wife is still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 85, 7, 17, 'cooking the food, still keeping the house clean, still washing the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 85, 8, 17, 'clothes, but it is not out of love anymore. Jesus said, "Love God with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 85, 9, 17, 'all your heart, soul, and strength." This is the first commandment. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 85, 10, 17, 'you don''t keep it, all your other works are useless.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 85, 11, 17, 'Think about what the Lord told the leader of the church in Ephesus: "All');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 85, 12, 17, 'your works are useless because you left your first love." Also think of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 85, 13, 17, 'what the Lord told Peter in John chapter 21, when he was commissioning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 85, 14, 17, 'Peter to be His apostle once again after Peter had denied the Lord three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 85, 15, 17, 'times. What did the Lord ask Peter three times? Only one question: ''do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 85, 16, 17, 'you love me?'' He said, ''if you love me keep my Commandments,'' not if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 85, 17, 17, 'fear me. That which is done out of fear is a dead work. That which is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 85, 18, 17, 'done in love is a living work. You can do a good work and yet, if it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 85, 19, 17, 'done out of fear of judgment or the hope that you will get a reward from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 85, 20, 17, 'God, God has no value for it. He wants us to love and, from our love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 85, 21, 17, 'must come obedience, from our love must come service.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 85, 22, 17, 'We have looked at two marks of dead works and we will continue to look');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 85, 23, 17, 'at some other marks of dead works in the next study.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 85, 24, 18, 'Chapter 18 More On Dead Works');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 85, 25, 18, 'We want to continue with our study on the difference between being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 85, 26, 18, 'religious and being spiritual, to see what the Bible says about dead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 85, 27, 18, 'works as opposed to good works and evil works. We saw in our last study');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 85, 28, 18, 'that there is a difference between the works of the flesh - evil things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 86, 1, 18, 'that are so obvious that our unconscious tells us about them and dead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 86, 2, 18, 'works, which could be good works, but works that spring from a corrupt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 86, 3, 18, 'source. We have considered two of them in our last study; works, those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 86, 4, 18, 'are done reluctantly or grudgingly without joy and works those are done');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 86, 5, 18, 'not out of love for God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 86, 6, 18, 'Now we want to continue looking at some other works which may look good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 86, 7, 18, 'on the outside but which are dead in God''s eyes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 86, 8, 18, 'Third dead work that we shall look at is works done without zeal. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 86, 9, 18, 'read in Revelation 3:15-19 about the Lord speaking to the elder of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 86, 10, 18, 'church in Laodicea and saying, ''You are lukewarm, you are neither hot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 86, 11, 18, 'nor cold, you are not on fire, and you are half-hearted.'' Further He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 86, 12, 18, 'says, ''I wish you were either cold or hot.'' Now in the world, there is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 86, 13, 18, 'saying: ''Something is better than nothing,'' but the Lord, apparently,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 86, 14, 18, 'doesn''t believe in that. He says, ''I wish you were cold - dead or on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 86, 15, 18, 'fire. But this half-hearted type of Christianity, I am not interested');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 86, 16, 18, 'in'', and, finally, in verse 19, the Lord says, ''therefore be zealous.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 86, 17, 18, 'Half-hearted works are dead works.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 86, 18, 18, 'In quoting an Old Testament commandment, Jesus said in Mark 12:30 that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 86, 19, 18, 'we are to love the Lord, our God. It doesn''t just stop there. We must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 86, 20, 18, 'love the Lord with all our heart, with all our soul, with all our mind,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 86, 21, 18, 'and all our strength. He said that that is the first commandment. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 86, 22, 18, 'other words, our whole being must be taken up with the love for God. For');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 86, 23, 18, 'example, when you worship God, there is a lot of difference between a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 86, 24, 18, 'whole-hearted worship and a half-hearted worship. When you praise the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 86, 25, 18, 'Lord, you can say hallelujah, and the other person says hallelujah,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 86, 26, 18, 'there can be a lot of difference between the two. In the other, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 86, 27, 18, 'springs from the depth of his heart; he is really thankful to God and he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 86, 28, 18, 'praises the Lord with all the heart. But you have gone through the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 87, 1, 18, 'ritual. You have said the right words. It is not a sin to say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 87, 2, 18, 'hallelujah, but it is a dead work as far as you are concerned. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 87, 3, 18, 'doesn''t come from the depth of your heart; it is lifeless. Our worship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 87, 4, 18, 'and our praise must be whole-hearted.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 87, 5, 18, 'Again, if you listen to some people praying, you can see the difference.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 87, 6, 18, 'I mean, they are not saying anything sinful in their prayer, but the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 87, 7, 18, 'whole thing is dead. You know what a dead prayer meeting is. What is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 87, 8, 18, 'dead prayer meeting - that people prayed for sinful things there? No,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 87, 9, 18, 'they prayed for good things, but they were lifeless. Works, prayer,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 87, 10, 18, 'praise - any activity done without zeal is a dead work.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 87, 11, 18, 'The Bible says (with one translation putting it like this) that we must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 87, 12, 18, 'be ''aglow with the Spirit'' - on fire in the Spirit at all times (Rom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 87, 13, 18, '12:11). Fervent in Spirit means on fire in the Spirit at all times.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 87, 14, 18, 'There was a law in the Old Testament which says that "the fire must burn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 87, 15, 18, 'on the altar perpetually" (Lev. 6:13). It must never die out. Paul told');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 87, 16, 18, 'Timothy, "Fan to a flame that gift which is in you." There was a danger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 87, 17, 18, 'of it dying out. It is not a question of just exercising them in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 87, 18, 18, 'half-hearted way. You have to fan to a flame even the gifts of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 87, 19, 18, 'Spirit that God gives us. Just because some other people abuse them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 87, 20, 18, 'doesn''t mean that we should ignore them and throw them in the wastepaper');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 87, 21, 18, 'basket. No, let''s exercise them in a proper way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 87, 22, 18, 'A lot of Christian churches, today, are not probably living in gross');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 87, 23, 18, 'sin, but they are lifeless, lacking the burning fire of the Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 87, 24, 18, 'They are not cold, but they are not hot either. And the Lord told that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 87, 25, 18, 'the whole church in Laodicea, "Because you are lukewarm, I''ll just spit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 87, 26, 18, 'you out of my mouth." You see how dead works can lead to a lifeless type');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 87, 27, 18, 'of Christianity which, finally, the Lord rejects? We need to repent of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 87, 28, 18, 'works done without zeal.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 88, 1, 18, 'And then fourthly, dead works are works done without faith. In the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 88, 2, 18, 'Testament there is no such phrase called ''The obedience of faith''. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 88, 3, 18, 'was only ''obedience'' - you obey what the Lord says you to obey. But,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 88, 4, 18, 'when you come to the New Testament, you see in the first paragraph of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 88, 5, 18, 'Romans 1 and in the last paragraph of Romans 16, this phrase repeated:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 88, 6, 18, '''The obedience of faith''. James says that faith without works is dead. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 88, 7, 18, 'would also say, works without faith are also dead, because without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 88, 8, 18, 'faith, it is impossible to please God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 88, 9, 18, 'Supposing you do a good work, and it is not in faith, it is a dead work.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 88, 10, 18, 'For example, you pray for half an hour, and you pray for a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 88, 11, 18, 'powerful things but you don''t believe that God is going to do one of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 88, 12, 18, 'those things, what is the use of that type of prayer? What is the use of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 88, 13, 18, 'a one-hour prayer meeting where you don''t believe one single thing that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 88, 14, 18, 'God is going to do for you? Isn''t that a dead work? You can have an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 88, 15, 18, 'all-night prayer meeting which is a dead work because people don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 88, 16, 18, 'believe. Praying without faith is a dead work. In fact, one minute of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 88, 17, 18, 'prayer, with faith, is far more acceptable to God than an all-night');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 88, 18, 18, 'prayer meeting which is just a ritual, without faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 88, 19, 18, 'Works done without faith are dead works. Now I am not against long');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 88, 20, 18, 'prayers - Jesus prayed all night, and there may be times when we need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 88, 21, 18, 'do that. But Jesus praying all night was not a dead work; He prayed in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 88, 22, 18, 'faith. Faith also means personal conviction. We read in Romans, "The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 88, 23, 18, 'faith which you have, have as your own conviction before God" (Rom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 88, 24, 18, '14:22). We must have a personal conviction about the truths of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 88, 25, 18, 'Scripture. The faith which you have, it says here, let it be your own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 88, 26, 18, 'conviction before God. When you do something merely to imitate what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 88, 27, 18, 'somebody else is doing, or merely because some man of God teaches it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 88, 28, 18, 'without personal conviction, it is a dead work. Maybe it is a good work,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 89, 1, 18, 'and maybe that great man of God teaches that particular doctrine and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 89, 2, 18, 'tells you to do it, in some way you imitate him, it is not going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 89, 3, 18, 'bring life in you; imitation always brings death.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 89, 4, 18, 'Let me give you an example of it. We read in Hebrews 11:29 that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 89, 5, 18, 'Israelites, by faith, crossed the Red Sea and then, it says, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 89, 6, 18, 'Egyptians imitated them. What happened then? - They drowned. What did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 89, 7, 18, 'imitation bring to the Egyptians? - Death. Now the Israelites went');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 89, 8, 18, 'through by faith. The Egyptians didn''t have faith. They just imitated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 89, 9, 18, 'what the Israelites did. It was a dead work. That is written for our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 89, 10, 18, 'warning. You may see another brother doing something in faith - a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 89, 11, 18, 'ministry, for example, he does it in faith and you imitate that. What is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 89, 12, 18, 'it going to be? - A dead work. God never called you to do that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 89, 13, 18, 'So we are not to imitate another man''s ministry, or the emphasis that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 89, 14, 18, 'another man has in his ministry. The Bible says, " Prophesy according to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 89, 15, 18, 'the proportion of your faith" (Rom. 12:6). God doesn''t want us to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 89, 16, 18, 'imitators; you know, like parrots, repeating what somebody else says. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 89, 17, 18, 'wants us to have personal convictions, and what you do without personal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 89, 18, 18, 'convictions is a dead work, even if it is a good work. God has no value');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 89, 19, 18, 'for it, because it doesn''t come out of your personal relationship with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 89, 20, 18, 'God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 89, 21, 18, 'Let me say this for your encouragement. God does not want you to be like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 89, 22, 18, 'somebody else; He wants you to be yourself. He made you to be yourself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 89, 23, 18, 'with a particular personality and a particular background and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 89, 24, 18, 'upbringing. Just be thankful and do what you can. And that will be far');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 89, 25, 18, 'more acceptable to God than if you try to imitate somebody else.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 89, 26, 18, 'A fifth way in which we can do dead works is when we do works, which may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 89, 27, 18, 'be good works, Christian works, but which are done for personal gain or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 89, 28, 18, 'honour. The Lord told the leader of the church in Sardis, "You have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 90, 1, 18, 'name that you are alive." Sometimes we can do Christian work to get a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 90, 2, 18, 'name that we are alive, and we can build up a reputation. And to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 90, 3, 18, 'continue that reputation we keep on doing certain things. They look very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 90, 4, 18, 'spiritual in the eyes of others, but God sees the underlying motive in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 90, 5, 18, 'everything: you want to get a name that you are alive. And what is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 90, 6, 18, 'result? All your works are dead works. Anything that we do to impress');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 90, 7, 18, 'another man is a dead work.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 90, 8, 18, 'A living work, on the other hand, is one that is done to impress God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 90, 9, 18, 'Living works are done in secret, before God''s face alone where your left');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 90, 10, 18, 'hand does not know what your right hand has done, where you keep it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 90, 11, 18, 'hidden. You pray, but you don''t let anybody know that you pray. You fast');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 90, 12, 18, 'and you don''t let anybody know that you have fasted. Those are living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 90, 13, 18, 'works. But dead works are works done to impress people, and you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 90, 14, 18, 'conceal it from the eyes of men. We could say that those are works which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 90, 15, 18, 'we later on meditate on and glory over.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 90, 16, 18, 'I wonder if you noticed this expression in Acts 7:41 where Stephen was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 90, 17, 18, 'speaking about the Israelites that t hey worshipped the work of their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 90, 18, 18, 'own hands.'' You know what that means? To do something, and then to look');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 90, 19, 18, 'at your work and say, ''Boy, that is something good I''ve done.'' Do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 90, 20, 18, 'remember how Nebuchadnezzar walked on the roof of the palace in Babylon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 90, 21, 18, '(Dan. 4:30) and he said, ''This is a tremendous kingdom which I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 90, 22, 18, 'built, a huge palace with its hanging gardens and all that, and what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 90, 23, 18, 'must people be thinking about it?''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 90, 24, 18, 'Do you know, my friend, that when you serve the Lord and you do some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 90, 25, 18, 'work - maybe God has used you in building a great ministry for the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 90, 26, 18, '- and then you look over it, like Nebuchadnezzar did, and say, ''It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 90, 27, 18, 'tremendous what I have done'' and you are thinking about the opinion that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 90, 28, 18, 'others have about your work. It is a dead work. You have got to take all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 91, 1, 18, 'those thoughts and throw it in the garbage bin. It is Babylon. What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 91, 2, 18, 'Nebuchadnezzar built was Babylon, and what you are doing is building');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 91, 3, 18, 'Babylon too. Our righteous acts, in human eyes, are an abomination fit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 91, 4, 18, 'to be flushed out into the sewage system in the sight of God. "All that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 91, 5, 18, 'is great in man''s eyes is an abomination to God" (Lk. 16:15).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 91, 6, 18, 'If you are not going to be radical in eliminating dead works from your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 91, 7, 18, 'life, you will never be a spiritual man. If you do God''s work, for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 91, 8, 18, 'example, for a salary, it is a dead work. God may give you money to care');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 91, 9, 18, 'for your needs, but if you serve the Lord only because you are paid,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 91, 10, 18, 'what is that? You can call it Christian work, but it is not really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 91, 11, 18, 'serving God; it is serving God and money.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 91, 12, 18, 'May God help us to have our eyes open, so that we are free from dead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 91, 13, 18, 'works.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 91, 14, 19, 'Chapter 19 Some More On Dead Works');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 91, 15, 19, 'We are continuing our study today on the subject of dead works, which,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 91, 16, 19, 'as we considered earlier, marked out a religious person from a spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 91, 17, 19, 'person, and it is important for you to know the difference.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 91, 18, 19, 'We have been trying to understand what it means to have a form of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 91, 19, 19, 'godliness without its power. Or, in other words, what it means to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 91, 20, 19, 'just religious as opposed to being spiritual. Now the danger of this is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 91, 21, 19, 'that religiosity finally makes everybody into a Pharisee. Spirituality');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 91, 22, 19, 'is what conforms us to the likeness of Christ. The contrast between');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 91, 23, 19, 'Jesus and the Pharisees is so great and so vast, we need to see that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 91, 24, 19, 'there is equally vast a difference between being spiritual and being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 91, 25, 19, 'religious.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 91, 26, 19, 'Dead works are spoken of in the New Testament as something that we need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 91, 27, 19, 'to repent of. We already saw five characteristics of dead works in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 91, 28, 19, 'previous studies. They are works done without joy, without love, without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 92, 1, 19, 'zeal, works done without faith, and works done for personal gain and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 92, 2, 19, 'honour.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 92, 3, 19, 'Now we want to look at a sixth characteristic of dead works: These are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 92, 4, 19, 'works which are done merely to ease one''s conscience. You see, all of us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 92, 5, 19, 'have a conscience, and that conscience disturbs us when we do something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 92, 6, 19, 'which we feel a bit uneasy about. In fact, the heathen people also have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 92, 7, 19, 'it. Paul says that all people in the world, even if they have no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 92, 8, 19, 'external law, have a law written in their hearts: " Their conscience,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 92, 9, 19, 'bearing witness, either accusing them or now even excusing or defending');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 92, 10, 19, 'them" (Rom. 2:15). It is the same with us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 92, 11, 19, 'Conscience develops in sensitivity as we hear the voice of the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 92, 12, 19, 'Spirit. But our conscience can sometimes urge us to do something and we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 92, 13, 19, 'do merely to escape this harassing voice of conscience; not out of love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 92, 14, 19, 'for God or because we feel this is what God wants us to do, but merely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 92, 15, 19, 'to escape the harassing voice of conscience! I will give you an example.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 92, 16, 19, 'You may feel one morning that you haven''t read the Bible, and you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 92, 17, 19, 'getting out for work. Then your conscience tells you, ''Hey, you haven''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 92, 18, 19, 'read the Bible.'' And so, you open the Bible, and sit down for two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 92, 19, 19, 'minutes, and maybe read a Psalm or read a proverb or a few proverbs, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 92, 20, 19, 'then you close the Bible. Your conscience is now eased, and you can go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 92, 21, 19, 'to work peacefully. Otherwise, you may fear, perhaps, that you might');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 92, 22, 19, 'have an accident on the road or something like that. This is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 92, 23, 19, 'spirituality; that is superstition. It is like people keeping the Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 92, 24, 19, 'under their pillows to have clean dreams - another superstition that is.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 92, 25, 19, 'People can pray, when they feel, ''Oh, I haven''t prayed.'' So I kneel down');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 92, 26, 19, 'and spend five minutes just to ease my conscience, and then my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 92, 27, 19, 'conscience is relieved and I get up. I haven''t become spiritual; I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 92, 28, 19, 'just religious. You know, for the same reason people may go to meetings,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 93, 1, 19, 'or pay their tithe, or give money to beggars, just to ease one''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 93, 2, 19, 'conscience. All such works are dead works. They are not evil works. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 93, 3, 19, 'mean, to pray or to read the Bible, how can it ever be evil?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 93, 4, 19, 'Now there is a difference between doing these things as a discipline. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 93, 5, 19, 'am not saying that we should read the Bible only when we feel like it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 93, 6, 19, 'We don''t live by feelings. We do what is right whether we feel like it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 93, 7, 19, 'or not. It is like going to work. You don''t go to work only when you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 93, 8, 19, 'feel like it. You don''t tell your children to go school only when you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 93, 9, 19, 'feel like it. Even if it is raining, you still put on your raincoat or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 93, 10, 19, 'take an umbrella and go to work. It is a discipline; you need that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 93, 11, 19, 'Similarly, we don''t read the Bible or pray only when we feel like it;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 93, 12, 19, 'Most of the time you may not feel like it. So, there is a place for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 93, 13, 19, 'discipline in the Christian life. That is not a dead work. Discipline is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 93, 14, 19, 'a very, very good thing for all Christians to have; to have a discipline');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 93, 15, 19, 'of reading the Scriptures, and of communion with God every day, of going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 93, 16, 19, 'to meetings regularly, etc. But there is a difference between that and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 93, 17, 19, 'just seeking to do something to ease our conscience.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 93, 18, 19, 'For example, it also could be in the matter of evangelism. A preacher');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 93, 19, 19, 'can stir you up and say, ''There are millions of people dying without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 93, 20, 19, 'Christ. What are you doing about it? Why are you sitting, earning your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 93, 21, 19, 'living? Why don''t you go?'' And you decide to give up your job and go to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 93, 22, 19, 'reach the perishing millions without any call from God. You leave your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 93, 23, 19, 'job, you go to some other place to do Christian work and, after some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 93, 24, 19, 'time, you are just frustrated. You acted on the emotion of a moment, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 93, 25, 19, 'perhaps to relieve a guilty conscience. Now isn''t it a good thing to go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 93, 26, 19, 'to some difficult place to preach the Gospel? - It certainly is. But do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 93, 27, 19, 'you know the number of people who have gone to all these places and were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 93, 28, 19, 'frustrated because they did not wait upon the Lord? They did not seek to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 94, 1, 19, 'see or examine themselves why am I going? Is it to ease my conscience,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 94, 2, 19, 'or is it because I love the Lord, and I see the Lord pulling me in that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 94, 3, 19, 'direction? There is a lot of difference. Otherwise, you can end up with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 94, 4, 19, 'an endless round of dead works, like in a merry-go-round you go round');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 94, 5, 19, 'and round and round and round and, in the end, you can waste your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 94, 6, 19, 'Seventhly, dead works are works that are done out of fear of divine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 94, 7, 19, 'judgment. If you look in the Old Testament you will find that that was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 94, 8, 19, 'the only way God could get most of the Israelites to obey Him. You see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 94, 9, 19, 'that particularly in Deuteronomy 28:15 onwards and right through the end');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 94, 10, 19, 'of that chapter that, ''If you don''t obey the Lord, and do all these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 94, 11, 19, 'things I am commanding you,'' says Moses, ''you will be cursed in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 94, 12, 19, 'city, cursed in the country. You are going to have confusion and rebuke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 94, 13, 19, 'and sickness and your enemies will defeat you and you will have poverty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 94, 14, 19, 'and all types of problems.'' And so, the Israelites obeyed. You know,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 94, 15, 19, 'this is the way we get children to obey us - by the fear of punishment.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 94, 16, 19, 'There is no other way to get a little child to obey.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 94, 17, 19, 'When we obey God out of fear of punishment, it is better than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 94, 18, 19, 'disobedience. Certainly, I would say that dead works are better than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 94, 19, 19, 'evil works. But God says, ''You better repent of doing things merely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 94, 20, 19, 'because you are afraid of punishment.'' Jesus said, "If you love me, keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 94, 21, 19, 'my commandments" (Jn. 14:15); and not like it says in Deuteronomy 28 -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 94, 22, 19, '''If you don''t want to be punished, keep my commandments.'' There is a lot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 94, 23, 19, 'of difference between the emphasis in Deuteronomy 28:15 to the end of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 94, 24, 19, 'the chapter and what Jesus said in John 14:15. See, many Christians have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 94, 25, 19, 'not really understood that there is a great difference between the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 94, 26, 19, 'Testament and the New Testament.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 94, 27, 19, 'That motive, the thing that impels me to do something, is what God sees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 94, 28, 19, 'and is what makes us spiritual. For example, if we avoid telling lies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 95, 1, 19, 'because we are afraid we would be caught, well, that is a good motive,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 95, 2, 19, 'but that is not the best motive. Jesus did not refrain from telling lies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 95, 3, 19, 'just because He was afraid, He would be caught, but because it was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 95, 4, 19, 'dishonouring to the Father. It is contrary to God''s nature. That is why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 95, 5, 19, 'He avoided it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 95, 6, 19, 'Now, if a doctor tells you, ''Because you have bitterness and an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 95, 7, 19, 'unforgiving attitude towards others, you are suffering from asthma or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 95, 8, 19, 'rheumatoid arthritis or migraine, you better give up your bitterness or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 95, 9, 19, 'wrong attitude towards others and be positive,'' you may do that. What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 95, 10, 19, 'for? - To be healed - Because you don''t want to be punished. But those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 95, 11, 19, 'are not works done for the glory of God. They are dead works. So, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 95, 12, 19, 'see, there are many, many examples we can take where we do something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 95, 13, 19, 'because we are afraid, believing, if we don''t do it, we will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 95, 14, 19, 'punished. You don''t want to get a sickness; you don''t want to get a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 95, 15, 19, 'judgment from God. And with that selfish fear of judgment, we can avoid');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 95, 16, 19, 'doing a lot of things and live a fairly upright life. But that is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 95, 17, 19, 'spirituality.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 95, 18, 19, 'Let me now tell you an eighth characteristic of dead works. We also find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 95, 19, 19, 'in Deuteronomy 28 opposite of what we have just considered. It is works');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 95, 20, 19, 'that are done for the sake of obtaining a reward. You know that that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 95, 21, 19, 'another way in which we deal with children. We tell the children: okay,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 95, 22, 19, 'if you finish your homework, I will give you a chocolate or take you for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 95, 23, 19, 'an outing. Or, if you come first in the class, I will get you a bicycle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 95, 24, 19, 'to go to school, and then they work hard. In the Old Testament God had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 95, 25, 19, 'to deal with the Israelites like that. In Deuteronomy 28: 1-14, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 95, 26, 19, 'says, ''If you are careful to keep all My commandments, you know what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 95, 27, 19, 'will happen? You will be blessed in the city; you will be blessed in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 95, 28, 19, 'body; God will bless your children; God will bless the animals in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 96, 1, 19, 'field and your fields will prosper; and you will get rain upon your land');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 96, 2, 19, 'and God will bless you in so many ways.'' So, they kept the commandment,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 96, 3, 19, 'because they wanted to be blessed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 96, 4, 19, 'Do you know how much of this there is even amongst Christians? The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 96, 5, 19, 'apostle Peter once asked Jesus, just after the rich young ruler had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 96, 6, 19, 'refused to give up all that he had to follow the Lord. Peter compared');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 96, 7, 19, 'himself with that rich young ruler and said in Matthew 19:27, ''Lord what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 96, 8, 19, 'about us? We have forsaken everything; I gave up my nets and my job, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 96, 9, 19, 'security of being a fisherman down in Galilee and I have followed you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 96, 10, 19, 'What am I going to get out of all this?'' And Jesus answered this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 96, 11, 19, 'question on what was he going to get out of it with a story of a man who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 96, 12, 19, 'employed labourers in his vineyard as described in Matthew 20:1-16.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 96, 13, 19, 'The essential point in that parable is, if you read it carefully, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 96, 14, 19, 'the first few groups who came to work, all came with an agreement to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 96, 15, 19, 'receive a certain amount of pay at the end of their work. The last group');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 96, 16, 19, 'was the only group who came without any agreement to receive any pay.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 96, 17, 19, 'That was the main difference between that last group and all the other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 96, 18, 19, 'people who preceded them. And what was the result? The last group worked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 96, 19, 19, 'for only one hour whereas the first group worked for 12 hours. In the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 96, 20, 19, 'end, when it came to pay the wages, we see the master rewarding the last');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 96, 21, 19, 'group first. They got twelve times the pay of what the first group got.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 96, 22, 19, 'If we compare what their hourly wages were, they got for one hour what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 96, 23, 19, 'the other people got for twelve hours. And there, the Lord was answering');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 96, 24, 19, 'Peter''s question: if you work thinking what you are going to get out of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 96, 25, 19, 'it, you are going to be the last. But if you work joyfully, cheerfully,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 96, 26, 19, 'without thinking of what you are going to get in return, you are going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 96, 27, 19, 'to be first.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 96, 28, 19, 'Dead works are works done for the sake of obtaining a reward. The only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 97, 1, 19, 'type of work that God wants is works done out of love joyfully and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 97, 2, 19, 'cheerfully. Quality means much more to God than any amount of quantity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 97, 3, 19, 'He is looking for a response of love and gratitude from us, not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 97, 4, 19, 'compulsory service out of fear or out of hope of obtaining a reward.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 97, 5, 20, 'Chapter 20 Still More On Dead Works');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 97, 6, 20, 'Once again, we are going to look a little deeper at what it means to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 97, 7, 20, 'dead works that are neither classified under good or evil, and that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 97, 8, 20, 'makes us religious instead of making us spiritual.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 97, 9, 20, 'We want to look at two more characteristics of dead works in this study.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 97, 10, 20, 'Before that let us just review what, we have already studied in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 97, 11, 20, 'previous studies. We have been trying to understand what is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 97, 12, 20, 'difference between a religious Christian and a spiritual Christian? And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 97, 13, 20, 'we have been trying to see how this makes all the difference in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 97, 14, 20, 'world, because religious Christians will finally become Pharisees, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 97, 15, 20, 'they are the people who crucified Christ. Spiritual Christians will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 97, 16, 20, 'become like Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 97, 17, 20, 'So, it is not just a small difference. The Pharisees were not people who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 97, 18, 20, 'were living constantly in adultery, or theft, or murder etc. They were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 97, 19, 20, 'not debaucherous evil worldly people. In fact, they were considered very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 97, 20, 20, 'spiritual by the undiscerning Jews of their time. It is quite likely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 97, 21, 20, 'that even the disciples of Jesus, before they began to follow the Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 97, 22, 20, 'if you had gone up to Peter or James or John, say, 2, 3 years before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 97, 23, 20, 'they met the Lord and asked them, ''Well Peter, who do you think is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 97, 24, 20, 'spiritual man that you know in your town?'' I think, Peter would have,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 97, 25, 20, 'perhaps, mentioned some long bearded, old Pharisee who was an elder in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 97, 26, 20, 'the synagogue. And, I think, James and John would have also said the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 97, 27, 20, 'same. Because those are the people whom they respected as leaders; they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 97, 28, 20, 'saw them fasting, they saw them praying, they saw them carrying these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 98, 1, 20, 'little boxes with scripture upon their foreheads. They were so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 98, 2, 20, 'frequently praying in the synagogue, fighting for the truth and standing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 98, 3, 20, 'for the true doctrine. They were reading the scriptures, studying the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 98, 4, 20, 'scriptures, fervently keeping the law. They would have thought that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 98, 5, 20, 'these are spiritual men.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 98, 6, 20, 'But when Jesus came along and they joined up with Him, and when they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 98, 7, 20, 'heard Jesus denouncing these Pharisees as vipers and deceivers who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 98, 8, 20, 'deserved to go to Hell, they must have been shocked. Only then would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 98, 9, 20, 'their eyes have been opened to see that what they thought was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 98, 10, 20, 'spirituality was actually religiosity; that the people whom they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 98, 11, 20, 'considered to be spiritual were just plain religious. I believe, unless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 98, 12, 20, 'the Holy Spirit opens our eyes, we can make the same mistake; we can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 98, 13, 20, 'quite sincere like Peter, James and John were, and yet be mistaken.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 98, 14, 20, 'We have looked at so far, (1) when a person does the Lord''s work,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 98, 15, 20, 'Christian work, Christian activity without joy, it is a dead work; (2)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 98, 16, 20, 'When he does it without love; (3) When he does it without zeal; (4) When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 98, 17, 20, 'he does it without faith; (5) When he does it for his personal gain and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 98, 18, 20, 'honour; (6) When he does those works merely to ease his conscience; (7)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 98, 19, 20, 'When he does it out of fear of divine judgment; and (8) When he does it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 98, 20, 20, 'for the sake of obtaining a reward; All of these would be classified as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 98, 21, 20, 'dead works.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 98, 22, 20, 'In this study we shall look at two more characteristics of dead works.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 98, 23, 20, '(9) Works that are done without bearing our cross daily. Let us look at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 98, 24, 20, 'a verse which many Christians are not familiar with: "we always bear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 98, 25, 20, 'about in our body the dying of Jesus, so that the life of Jesus might be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 98, 26, 20, 'made manifest in our body" (2 Cor. 4:10). The life of Jesus is the light');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 98, 27, 20, 'of the world. If I were to ask you, ''who is the light of the world?''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 98, 28, 20, 'what would your answer be? My guess is that 99% of Christians would give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 99, 1, 20, 'the wrong answer. They would say, ''Jesus is the light of the world.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 99, 2, 20, 'Unfortunately, that answer would be wrong, and I will show that to you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 99, 3, 20, 'from the Scripture. Pay attention to this. Jesus said in John 9:5,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 99, 4, 20, '"While I am in the world, I am the light of the world." So, when did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 99, 5, 20, 'Jesus say He was the light of the world? - As long as He was in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 99, 6, 20, 'world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 99, 7, 20, 'When He prayed to the Father in John 17, He said to His father, ''And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 99, 8, 20, 'now, I am no longer in the world. I am leaving this world and I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 99, 9, 20, 'coming to you.'' Now that Jesus is no longer in the world, but in heaven,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 99, 10, 20, 'who is the light of the world today? He said that as long as He is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 99, 11, 20, 'the world, He is the light of the world, but He is gone now. But He had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 99, 12, 20, 'said to His disciples in Matthew 5:14, "You are the light of the world."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 99, 13, 20, 'So, what is the correct scriptural answer to this question- who is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 99, 14, 20, 'light of the world today? The answer is, ''We, the disciples of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 99, 15, 20, 'Christ.'' Now that sounds like an awesome claim, but that is exactly what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 99, 16, 20, 'Jesus said. Sometimes we have got to change our way of thinking and make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 99, 17, 20, 'it more in line with scripture.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 99, 18, 20, 'What does it mean to say we are the light of the world? The Bible says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 99, 19, 20, '"In Jesus Christ was life and that life was the light of men" (Jn. 1:4).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 99, 20, 20, 'The world is full of darkness. It is ruled by the prince of darkness -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 99, 21, 20, 'Satan. And in the midst of this darkness God wants the light to shine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 99, 22, 20, 'for Him. Do you think the people in the world can see the life of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 99, 23, 20, 'in Jesus himself? No, He is in heaven; they cannot see him. Where can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 99, 24, 20, 'they see it then? They have to see it in you and me, as disciples of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 99, 25, 20, 'Jesus Christ. If they don''t see it in us, they will never see it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 99, 26, 20, 'anywhere. In us, in the way they see us react in different situations');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 99, 27, 20, 'and behave; in the way they see us handling money and talking to people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 99, 28, 20, 'and behaving; there, people see whether the life of Jesus is being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 100, 1, 20, 'manifested or not.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 100, 2, 20, 'And here we see Paul saying (2 Cor. 4:10) that "the life of Jesus is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 100, 3, 20, 'manifested in our mortal flesh." In other words, here is the life coming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 100, 4, 20, 'forth from us, from which come forth certain works. You know the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 100, 5, 20, 'difference between taking a glass of water and pouring out the water and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 100, 6, 20, 'a glass being filled with water from a jug and the glass overflowing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 100, 7, 20, 'with water. Water is getting poured out from the glass in both the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 100, 8, 20, 'cases. What is the difference in its application to our life? Is your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 100, 9, 20, 'service for the Lord is something you are pouring out, or is it the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 100, 10, 20, 'overflow that is coming out of your life, because you are filled with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 100, 11, 20, 'the life of Jesus? There is a lot of difference.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 100, 12, 20, 'Jesus said, "If you thirst, and believe in Me, out of your innermost');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 100, 13, 20, 'being will flow rivers of flowing water.'''' Now what is the difference');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 100, 14, 20, 'between a river flowing and a hand pump through which water is pumped');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 100, 15, 20, 'out? There is a world of difference. With many Christians, their service');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 100, 16, 20, 'to the Lord can be likened to a hand pump. Yes, some water does come out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 100, 17, 20, '- there is some type of service. You pump and pump and pump and pump,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 100, 18, 20, 'and some water comes out. But, in the case of Jesus, His service to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 100, 19, 20, 'Father was not like that. Similarly in the case of a spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 100, 20, 20, 'Christian, his service for his Father and the Lord is not like that; it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 100, 21, 20, 'is an overflow. It is not something poured out or pumped out, it is an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 100, 22, 20, 'overflow, because his life is filled with the life of Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 100, 23, 20, 'So how can we come to this life? - Only if we bear the dying of Jesus;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 100, 24, 20, 'take up the cross daily. If I don''t take up the cross daily, the life is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 100, 25, 20, 'not going to flow out from within. Let me give you a practical example.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 100, 26, 20, 'If we merely control our tongues from speaking angrily or our faces from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 100, 27, 20, 'scowling, but we are still boiling with anger and irritation against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 100, 28, 20, 'somebody inside, what are we doing? We are just practicing self-control,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 101, 1, 20, 'and any heathen could do that. You don''t need the Holy Spirit. You don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 101, 2, 20, 'need Jesus Christ to do that work within you. You just need to have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 101, 3, 20, 'lot of self-discipline. Now that is not what Jesus offers us. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 101, 4, 20, 'good, but it is not the best. That is all that The Law can produce, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 101, 5, 20, 'the Holy Spirit has come to bring a death within us so that from us will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 101, 6, 20, 'flow, from within, from our innermost being, the goodness of Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 101, 7, 20, 'There will be no boiling and irritation inside.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 101, 8, 20, '(10) One last characteristic of dead works is works that originate from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 101, 9, 20, 'our own human reasoning. Perhaps, the best example of this would be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 101, 10, 20, 'Martha''s service for the Lord in Bethany, described in Luke 10:38-42. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 101, 11, 20, 'read that Jesus came to Bethany and Martha served. Now isn''t that a very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 101, 12, 20, 'good thing to do? You know the Lord and His disciples are hungry, I need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 101, 13, 20, 'to go to the kitchen and produce some food for them. She did that work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 101, 14, 20, 'because she felt that was a good work to do. But let me direct you to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 101, 15, 20, 'scripture which is very sensible: "The most important thing about a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 101, 16, 20, 'servant is that he does just what his master tells him t o " (1 Cor. 4:2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 101, 17, 20, 'Living), and not whatever he feels like doing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 101, 18, 20, 'If you have a servant at home, or if you have a servant at office, what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 101, 19, 20, 'do you want him to do? - Just what he feels like? - Even if it is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 101, 20, 20, 'evil, and just good? Or do you want him to do exactly what you tell him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 101, 21, 20, 'to do? You see there are very few people who understand this. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 101, 22, 20, 'the difference between soulish human service and spiritual human service');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 101, 23, 20, 'in the will of God. God''s Word divides between the soulish and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 101, 24, 20, 'spiritual as we read in Hebrews 4: 10, 12. Soulish works are dead works;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 101, 25, 20, 'they are works that originate from my own human reason.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 101, 26, 20, 'There is an amazing verse written about Jesus in John 5:30; He never did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 101, 27, 20, 'anything on His own initiative. That means He waited to listen to what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 101, 28, 20, 'the Father wanted Him to do, not what He felt like doing. You know,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 102, 1, 20, 'since Abraham wanted to help God, he produced an Ismael, which caused so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 102, 2, 20, 'much confusion. If he had listened to God, he wouldn''t have done that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 102, 3, 20, 'Ishmaels are the dead works many Christians are doing today, sincerely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 102, 4, 20, 'wanting to help God, but without seeking the will of God. Now what shall');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 102, 5, 20, 'we do? Shall we sit back and do nothing? On the contrary, let us seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 102, 6, 20, 'God. If you love Him, it doesn''t matter if you make mistakes. We can go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 102, 7, 20, 'forth to doing spiritual works to the glory of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 102, 8, 21, 'Chapter 21 Law And Grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 102, 9, 21, 'We want to continue our study in trying to see the difference between');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 102, 10, 21, 'the Old Covenant and the New Covenant; between law and grace. This is so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 102, 11, 21, 'important, because if we don''t know the difference, we will live at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 102, 12, 21, 'low level that many Old Testament people lived in. God wants to lift us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 102, 13, 21, 'higher.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 102, 14, 21, 'Let us look at a verse from Romans 6, which, I think puts it in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 102, 15, 21, 'nutshell, in a very brief sentence, the essential difference between the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 102, 16, 21, 'Old Covenant and the New Covenant: "Sin shall not be master over you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 102, 17, 21, 'when you are not under law but under grace" (Rom. 6:14). The word ''Law''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 102, 18, 21, 'there symbolizes the Old Covenant, God''s agreement with Israel, and all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 102, 19, 21, 'the terms and conditions of that Covenant are all included in that one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 102, 20, 21, 'word, ''Law''. And grace, in one word, sums up God''s new agreement through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 102, 21, 21, 'the Lord Jesus Christ, and all the terms and conditions of that new');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 102, 22, 21, 'agreement.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 102, 23, 21, 'And here, it says, you can be either under law or under grace. And the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 102, 24, 21, 'proof is this: when you are not under law but under grace, sin cannot be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 102, 25, 21, 'master over you. We could put it another way that, if you are not under');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 102, 26, 21, 'grace but under law, then sin will have the mastery over you. So,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 102, 27, 21, 'ultimately, the way we discover whether we are under the law or under');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 102, 28, 21, 'grace is not by testing whether we are legalistic in relation to a lot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 103, 1, 21, 'of rules and regulations, but on the other hand, by a far deeper test:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 103, 2, 21, 'does sin have the mastery over you? Or, do you have the mastery over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 103, 3, 21, 'sin?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 103, 4, 21, 'This is a very, very important question, because a lot of people do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 103, 5, 21, 'understand the difference between what Jesus has come to give and what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 103, 6, 21, 'Moses came to give under the Old Covenant. Now if I were to ask you a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 103, 7, 21, 'simple question: who is greater - Moses or our Lord Jesus Christ? That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 103, 8, 21, 'is clear, Moses is a servant and the Lord Jesus is the Master. It is so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 103, 9, 21, 'clear that Jesus is far greater than Moses. Now let me tell you, since');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 103, 10, 21, 'you understand that clearly, that the covenant or agreement that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 103, 11, 21, 'mediated with Israel, through Moses, is as inferior to the New Covenant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 103, 12, 21, 'that God mediated through Jesus, as Moses is inferior to Jesus. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 103, 13, 21, 'implication is that, if Moses and the law could bring people in the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 103, 14, 21, 'Testament to a certain standard of life, Jesus and the New Covenant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 103, 15, 21, 'should be able to bring them to what - to a higher standard or an equal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 103, 16, 21, 'standard? Of course, you will say it has to be a higher standard.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 103, 17, 21, 'It would be something comparable to walking and flying or to a bicycle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 103, 18, 21, 'and an aeroplane. I mean, there is a lot of difference between the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 103, 19, 21, 'bicycle and the aeroplane, with the speed and the ability to move from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 103, 20, 21, 'place to place. If you can compare a bicycle with an aeroplane, there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 103, 21, 21, 'you see the difference between the Old Covenant and the New Covenant.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 103, 22, 21, 'The Old Covenant can take you from one place to another, like a bicycle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 103, 23, 21, 'can. And the New Covenant also can take you from one place to another,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 103, 24, 21, 'like an aeroplane can. There is a world of difference between the two.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 103, 25, 21, 'The Old Covenant could bring a man to a certain point of fellowship with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 103, 26, 21, 'God, but not beyond that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 103, 27, 21, 'In the Old Testament tabernacle, God illustrated this by putting a thick');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 103, 28, 21, 'curtain between the Holy place and the Most Holy place, called the veil,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 104, 1, 21, 'and told the Israelites, "Nobody can come into this Most Holy place,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 104, 2, 21, 'this veil blocks you. You can come so far, but no further." You know,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 104, 3, 21, 'beyond that veil, God Himself lived in that temple - Old Testament');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 104, 4, 21, 'temple. Nobody could go there. Even the High Priest could go only once a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 104, 5, 21, 'year, and that was only as a token. But nobody could go there whenever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 104, 6, 21, 'they liked.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 104, 7, 21, 'But when Jesus died on Calvary, that veil was rent, torn from top to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 104, 8, 21, 'bottom, showing that the way into God''s presence was open now. So, let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 104, 9, 21, 'me ask you, now that the veil is torn and the way into the most holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 104, 10, 21, 'place, into God''s presence, is open, should our standard of life be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 104, 11, 21, 'higher or lower than people in the Old Testament? The answer is clear.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 104, 12, 21, 'If without personal fellowship with God, with just the law, people could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 104, 13, 21, 'come to a certain standard of life, how much higher our standard of life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 104, 14, 21, 'should be, once we come into fellowship with God Himself, inside that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 104, 15, 21, 'torn veil? And yet, many, many Christians don''t seem to have understood');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 104, 16, 21, 'this.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 104, 17, 21, 'For example, why do we find or hear of sometimes Christians falling into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 104, 18, 21, 'some terrible sins? Can you imagine Elijah or John the Baptist running');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 104, 19, 21, 'after women or running after money? No, and yet they did not have grace;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 104, 20, 21, 'they did not have that open access into the Most Holy place like we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 104, 21, 21, 'have; and without it, they came to such a life. How much more we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 104, 22, 21, 'come to it if only we would have faith and rise up to our privileges');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 104, 23, 21, 'under the New Covenant?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 104, 24, 21, 'That is what Paul is saying here: "Sin shall not be master over you, for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 104, 25, 21, 'you are not under law but under grace." Jesus once said that John the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 104, 26, 21, 'Baptist was the greatest human being born until that day (Mt. 11:11). Of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 104, 27, 21, 'course apart from himself; He was not born of a human father, so Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 104, 28, 21, 'Himself is excluded. But among all others, John the Baptist was the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 105, 1, 21, 'greatest. Then Jesus went on to say, ''But, the one who is least in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 105, 2, 21, 'Kingdom of Heaven - in God''s kingdom - is greater even than John the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 105, 3, 21, 'Baptist.'' What He was trying to say was that the highest that the law');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 105, 4, 21, 'could take a man was still inferior or less than where grace could take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 105, 5, 21, 'the weakest of God''s children.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 105, 6, 21, 'So it is not going to be just an occasional believer who raises to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 105, 7, 21, 'higher standard of life than John the Baptist. God''s will is that every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 105, 8, 21, 'single one of His children, who come under grace, should rise to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 105, 9, 21, 'higher level than John the Baptist. But whether they will actually live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 105, 10, 21, 'that life is quite another thing. But the possibility is there, if they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 105, 11, 21, 'understand and receive grace as God offers it to us, through our Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 105, 12, 21, 'Jesus Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 105, 13, 21, 'Now, when we compare the word ''mercy'', as we read, for example, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 105, 14, 21, 'Hebrews 4:16, we are told there that, "We are to come with confidence to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 105, 15, 21, 'the throne of grace that we may receive mercy, and find grace to help in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 105, 16, 21, 'time of need." . As I mentioned in a previous study, there is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 105, 17, 21, 'difference between ''mercy'' and ''grace''. Mercy is essentially an Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 105, 18, 21, 'Testament word. It is a word which you find very frequently in the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 105, 19, 21, 'Testament - the Lord whose mercy endures forever. David often speaks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 105, 20, 21, 'about it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 105, 21, 21, 'As a result of that mercy people in the Old Testament had their sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 105, 22, 21, 'covered and forgiven. They could not be cleansed. David could only say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 105, 23, 21, '"Blessed is the man whose sins are covered." Nobody''s sins could be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 105, 24, 21, 'cleansed until Jesus died on Calvary''s cross. But they could be covered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 105, 25, 21, 'until Christ came. They were forgiven. In the well-known psalm, Psalm');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 105, 26, 21, '103, David said, " Bless the Lord, O my soul, and forget not all His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 105, 27, 21, 'benefits, who forgives all your inequity." That was mercy, and all of us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 105, 28, 21, 'need it too; we need mercy; we need our sins to be forgiven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 106, 1, 21, 'But there is something more than that we have in the New Covenant, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 106, 2, 21, 'that is grace; something more than mercy; something to help us in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 106, 3, 21, 'future; something to help us overcome the passions in our nature. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 106, 4, 21, 'says here in Hebrews 4:16 that we can come to the throne of grace and in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 106, 5, 21, 'the place where we receive mercy, we can find grace to help us in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 106, 6, 21, 'time of need.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 106, 7, 21, 'Now what is our time of need? Our time of need is when we are under');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 106, 8, 21, 'tremendous pressure from the lusts in our flesh; tremendous pressure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 106, 9, 21, 'from the devil to sin. In that moment, when we are tempted to sin and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 106, 10, 21, 'fall, God says grace can help me. Grace is help; help for my need,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 106, 11, 21, 'whatever it is. If my need right now is that I need help to overcome a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 106, 12, 21, 'particular sin, it says, grace can help me in my time of need.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 106, 13, 21, 'It is like, if I were climbing a mountain, and I am about to slip and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 106, 14, 21, 'fall, then if I ask for help, God can lift me up and make me stand so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 106, 15, 21, 'that I don''t fall. But if I don''t ask for help and I struggle on my own,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 106, 16, 21, 'I slip and fall and break my bones, and then I ask God for help, and an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 106, 17, 21, 'ambulance comes and picks me up. Well, that is help too. But that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 106, 18, 21, 'mercy; that is after I have fallen, that God picks me up, forgives me,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 106, 19, 21, 'takes me to a hospital, patches me up, and restores me. That is how it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 106, 20, 21, 'is with the experience of many Christians. They fall, and they ask God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 106, 21, 21, 'for help. But isn''t there a better way? There is - grace to help me in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 106, 22, 21, 'my time of need.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 106, 23, 21, 'Now why don''t you do this next time when you find the pressure of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 106, 24, 21, 'temptation, so strong that you are about to fall, try this out and see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 106, 25, 21, 'if it doesn''t work. You ask God at that moment and say, ''Lord, I am not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 106, 26, 21, 'able to overcome this; I want you to help me. Give me grace to overcome');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 106, 27, 21, 'this.'' And you will see in that moment, grace coming to carry you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 106, 28, 21, 'through.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 107, 1, 22, 'Chapter 22 One Reason For Failure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 107, 2, 22, 'We are going to consider the reasons why we fall into sin, and why we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 107, 3, 22, 'need not fall. I am sure this is going to be a very relevant study for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 107, 4, 22, 'you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 107, 5, 22, 'We considered in our last study that grace could keep us from being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 107, 6, 22, 'mastered by sin. Man''s greatest problem is that he is mastered by sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 107, 7, 22, 'God has made a way through Jesus Christ not only for the forgiveness of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 107, 8, 22, 'our sins, but also for delivering us from sin''s power. This is the good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 107, 9, 22, 'news of the Gospel - we can be delivered from the power of sin. You know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 107, 10, 22, 'there is a difference between being forgiven and being saved. Many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 107, 11, 22, 'people wouldn''t be able to explain the difference between the two. Let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 107, 12, 22, 'me use an illustration to explain it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 107, 13, 22, 'Let us suppose that the people from the corporation or municipality have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 107, 14, 22, 'dug up the road in front of my house and they have made a deep pit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 107, 15, 22, 'there. If I have a little child at home, I will tell him “Well , son,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 107, 16, 22, 'don''t go near that pit, you may fall and you may hurt yourself." But you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 107, 17, 22, 'know how little children are; they don''t pay attention to their parents.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 107, 18, 22, 'Let''s say he goes near the pit and he falls into it, and, from within');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 107, 19, 22, 'the pit, he cries out: Daddy! Daddy! Help me. I hear that voice and I go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 107, 20, 22, 'running and I say, '' S on, what happened?'' He replies, ''Daddy, I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 107, 21, 22, 'sorry, I disobeyed you, and I have fallen here in this pit.'' Let us say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 107, 22, 22, 'that pit is eight feet deep, and I say, ''well that''s ok S on, I forgive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 107, 23, 22, 'you, goodbye'' and if I leave him there, and go, have I forgiven him for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 107, 24, 22, 'his disobedience? I certainly have. But have I saved him? No, I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 107, 25, 22, 'not.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 107, 26, 22, 'You understand the difference now between being forgiven and being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 107, 27, 22, 'saved? David said, " Bless the Lord, o my soul, who forgives all your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 107, 28, 22, 'inequities." But David could not be saved from the power of sin. It was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 108, 1, 22, 'the same with every person in the Old Testament. But when we turn to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 108, 2, 22, 'pages of the New Testament, on the very first page, we come to this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 108, 3, 22, 'verse: " You shall call His name Jesus, because He shall save His people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 108, 4, 22, 'from their sins" (Mt. 1:21); not just forgive their sins. He will save');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 108, 5, 22, 'His people not in their sins but from their sins. If the Gospel message');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 108, 6, 22, 'is only that Jesus can forgive me but cannot save me, I would say it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 108, 7, 22, 'good news, but it is not as good a news as it should be. It would be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 108, 8, 22, 'like telling the woman caught in adultery, that we read in John 8, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 108, 9, 22, 'remember what Jesus asked her: "Has no man condemned you?" She replied,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 108, 10, 22, '''no man Lord.'' Jesus then said two things: "I don''t condemn you, from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 108, 11, 22, 'now don''t sin anymore" (Jn. 8:11). That is the twofold message of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 108, 12, 22, 'Gospel - I do not condemn you. Go and don''t sin again.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 108, 13, 22, 'Now if there was only one part to it - I don''t condemn you, then you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 108, 14, 22, 'know you may go and fall into sin again; you may again live in adultery.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 108, 15, 22, 'That wouldn''t be very much of a Gospel. The Gospel''s message has two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 108, 16, 22, 'sides to the coin and, if one side is missing, it is an incomplete');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 108, 17, 22, 'Gospel. People often talk about the full Gospel. Here it is in John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 108, 18, 22, '8:11: I don''t condemn you, and don''t sin again; mercy and grace;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 108, 19, 22, 'forgiveness and victory. They only had forgiveness under the law. Now we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 108, 20, 22, 'have both - forgiveness and victory. There will not be any mastery over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 108, 21, 22, 'our life of sin anymore.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 108, 22, 22, 'Now, if that be the case, does it mean that we will never sin again? No,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 108, 23, 22, 'it doesn''t mean that. God says that He is going to change our nature and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 108, 24, 22, 'give us the nature of God Himself; His own divine nature. When I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 108, 25, 22, 'that nature and I allow that nature to gradually control my life, I will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 108, 26, 22, 'become more and more free from sin, and I wouldn''t want to sin anymore.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 108, 27, 22, 'How do you know the difference between a pig and the cat? We can''t say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 108, 28, 22, 'that a pig will always fall into dirty water and a cat will never fall');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 109, 1, 22, 'into dirty water, because cats can fall into dirty water too. But the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 109, 2, 22, 'difference, we can say, when both these animals fall into the dirty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 109, 3, 22, 'water, one relishes the experience and the other jumps out immediately.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 109, 4, 22, 'Not only the cat jumps out immediately, but it also licks itself and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 109, 5, 22, 'makes itself clean.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 109, 6, 22, 'Now this, we could say, illustrates the difference between an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 109, 7, 22, 'unconverted person and a person who is born again. We cannot say that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 109, 8, 22, 'the born-again person will not sin. It is very evident that born again');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 109, 9, 22, 'people do, both in the Bible and in our experience - you do and I do.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 109, 10, 22, 'But there is a difference, and the difference is a difference of nature.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 109, 11, 22, 'You know whether you are born again or not by your attitude towards that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 109, 12, 22, 'fall, when you fall into sin. If it is one of remorse, and you want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 109, 13, 22, 'get up and want to be clean; you want to break away from it; well, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 109, 14, 22, 'proves that God has done His work in your heart. But if you are happy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 109, 15, 22, 'that nobody saw it, and you enjoy yourself, and you don''t want to give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 109, 16, 22, 'it up; well, that would prove that you are only religious, you haven''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 109, 17, 22, 'changed within.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 109, 18, 22, 'Then, why do Christians fall? Is it possible for us to overcome in such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 109, 19, 22, 'a way that we don''t have to keep on falling into the same old sins again');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 109, 20, 22, 'and again? The Christian life is a life of growth. It is not one where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 109, 21, 22, 'we keep on being defeated by, let''s say, anger, for 25 years; or we keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 109, 22, 22, 'on getting defeated by dirty thoughts for 25 years, or by jealousy or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 109, 23, 22, 'bitterness or anything. No, there has to be progress. The Bible speaks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 109, 24, 22, 'about growing in grace. And we could compare this with the growth of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 109, 25, 22, 'child in a school.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 109, 26, 22, 'You know, a child goes to school and, as years pass by, it goes from one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 109, 27, 22, 'standard to the next. It learns things in one standard which it did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 109, 28, 22, 'learn in the previous standard. We can say it overcomes certain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 110, 1, 22, 'problems, let''s say, mathematical problems in one year that it could not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 110, 2, 22, 'overcome in the previous years. Let''s say a child does not know how to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 110, 3, 22, 'add. But then, after a year, it knows how to add but it doesn''t know how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 110, 4, 22, 'to subtract. Then, after a year, perhaps, it learns how to subtract, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 110, 5, 22, 'it doesn''t know how to multiply. Then after another year it learns how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 110, 6, 22, 'to multiply. Then it learns how to divide and how to get square roots');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 110, 7, 22, 'and so on. So, this is growth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 110, 8, 22, 'Here is an example of how it should be in our Christian life too. Growth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 110, 9, 22, 'is where we overcome area after area in our life, where once upon a time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 110, 10, 22, 'we were defeated. Just like that child overcame area after area in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 110, 11, 22, 'whole realm of mathematics, where once upon a time it was totally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 110, 12, 22, 'ignorant. This is growth in grace. Then, what shall we say about a child');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 110, 13, 22, 'who is repeatedly failing in the first standard? Is that God''s perfect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 110, 14, 22, 'will? - Certainly not. We will never be sinlessly perfect here on this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 110, 15, 22, 'earth. But we are to press on to perfection, just like a child starting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 110, 16, 22, 'in the kindergarten class presses all the way hoping for, perhaps, a PhD');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 110, 17, 22, 'one day. But there is a pressing on to something higher each year.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 110, 18, 22, 'The Bible says that " The path of the righteous is like the light of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 110, 19, 22, 'dawn that becomes brighter and brighter as the day progresses until it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 110, 20, 22, 'reaches the perfect noonday position" (Prov. 4:18); Brighter and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 110, 21, 22, 'brighter, just like the sun, from dawn to midday position. There is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 110, 22, 22, 'never a time when the sun goes down and becomes darker. It gets brighter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 110, 23, 22, 'and brighter and brighter and brighter, and that is God''s perfect will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 110, 24, 22, 'for us. Just like for a child in school that, if it is in first standard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 110, 25, 22, 'this year, we expect it to go to second standard next year. It won''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 110, 26, 22, 'reach tenth standard for another nine years. But we expect it to reach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 110, 27, 22, 'the second standard next year, the third standard next year, and so on.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 110, 28, 22, 'God''s will, my friend, for you is that, you should go from one degree of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 111, 1, 22, 'glory to another; progress in overcoming. You are not to be defeated by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 111, 2, 22, 'the same sins year after year. You have to be an overcomer. Then why is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 111, 3, 22, 'it that some students fail and fail and fail and fail repeatedly in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 111, 4, 22, 'same class? Well, there could be many reasons. I think one of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 111, 5, 22, 'fundamental reasons is the lack of the fear of God. In the Book of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 111, 6, 22, 'Proverbs it says that " The fear of God is the beginning of wisdom"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 111, 7, 22, '(Prov. 9:10). In other words, it is the first lesson in the school of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 111, 8, 22, 'wisdom; it is like learning the alphabet. You know, when you go to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 111, 9, 22, 'school, or a child goes to school, the first thing it learns is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 111, 10, 22, 'alphabet. What is the alphabet of wisdom? It is to fear the Lord. Again,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 111, 11, 22, 'it says in Proverbs 8:13 that "To fear the Lord is to hate evil." We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 111, 12, 22, 'hate evil because God hates evil. When we hear that God has called us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 111, 13, 22, 'be holy because He is holy, and we are gripped by it, we begin to hate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 111, 14, 22, 'sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 111, 15, 22, 'Let me ask you a question: why is that you find, when some other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 111, 16, 22, 'believer is nearby, you don''t fall into some sins which you fall into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 111, 17, 22, 'when you are all by yourself? When you are alone in a room all by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 111, 18, 22, 'yourself, there is nobody around, why is it that you fall into certain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 111, 19, 22, 'sins? And if at that moment, a believer walked into the room; knocked at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 111, 20, 22, 'your door and came in; you wouldn''t think of or dream of committing that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 111, 21, 22, 'sin. I will tell you the reason - Because you fear that man''s opinion.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 111, 22, 22, 'That man''s opinion means more to you than God''s. When you are alone,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 111, 23, 22, 'only God is in the room and when that person comes in, that man is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 111, 24, 22, 'the room. If that person''s presence can prevent you from committing a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 111, 25, 22, 'particular sin, and when that person is away and only God is there, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 111, 26, 22, 'commit that sin, it would indicate that you do not fear God. You fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 111, 27, 22, 'man more than you fear God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 111, 28, 22, 'One of the first things to do, dear friend, is to pray to God and say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 112, 1, 22, '''Lord, please help me to fear You. Please help me to mourn when I fail,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 112, 2, 22, 'when I come short.'' Now let me give you this as a challenge: if you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 112, 3, 22, 'willing to mourn every single time you fail, and you say, ''Lord, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 112, 4, 22, 'slipped up. Forgive me. Help me to fear You. I want to recognize Your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 112, 5, 22, 'presence. I want to live before Your face,'' you will discover that those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 112, 6, 22, 'who mourn are strengthened, and you can be an overcomer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 112, 7, 23, 'Chapter 23 Another Reason For Failure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 112, 8, 23, 'We want continue looking at the reasons why we keep falling into sin and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 112, 9, 23, 'do not grow spiritually. Perhaps this could solve the problem you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 112, 10, 23, 'facing right now.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 112, 11, 23, 'In our previous study we were considering the fact that, under grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 112, 12, 23, 'there is no need for any of us to be mastered by sin. Grace is God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 112, 13, 23, 'power that enables us to overcome. In fact, Romans 6:14 is such a clear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 112, 14, 23, 'promise: "Sin shall not be master over you, for you are not under law');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 112, 15, 23, 'but under grace." And if we do fall, if we are not growing spiritually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 112, 16, 23, 'by overcoming sins that we have been constantly defeated by in the past,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 112, 17, 23, 'as we considered in our last study, one of the primary reasons could be,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 112, 18, 23, 'and often is, the fact that we do not fear God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 112, 19, 23, 'You know, God has given all of us a private area in our life: it is our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 112, 20, 23, 'thought life. Nobody can enter in there; not even your wife or your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 112, 21, 23, 'husband. The thoughts that go on in your mind are a private area, and it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 112, 22, 23, 'is in that totally private area of your life that God tests you to see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 112, 23, 23, 'whether you fear Him or not. And that is how God is testing the entire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 112, 24, 23, 'human race.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 112, 25, 23, 'Consider for a moment, supposing your thoughts sounded out loud like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 112, 26, 23, 'your words (I am sure God could have made man in such a way that our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 112, 27, 23, 'thoughts sounded out loud just like our words do), would you then be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 112, 28, 23, 'more careful with your thoughts? Then why are you not careful when your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 113, 1, 23, 'thoughts are silent and other people cannot here? Does it mean that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 113, 2, 23, 'are not bothered if God hears it, but you are only concerned that men');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 113, 3, 23, 'should not hear it? That is an indication that we fear men more than we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 113, 4, 23, 'fear God. I am convinced that, one of the most important things that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 113, 5, 23, 'and I need to develop in our life is the fear of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 113, 6, 23, 'David said in one of the Psalms, ''Come, my children, I will teach you to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 113, 7, 23, 'fear God.'' We have to learn, through developing our senses, to fear the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 113, 8, 23, 'presence of God, who is always with us wherever we are; who hears every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 113, 9, 23, 'thought that passes through our mind as loudly as other people can hear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 113, 10, 23, 'our words. It is not just that we need to fear God as much as we fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 113, 11, 23, 'other men - that itself would bring a terrific deliverance, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 113, 12, 23, 'certainly we have to fear Him more. In fact, one of the sins mentioned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 113, 13, 23, 'in Romans 1:25 is that, people worship the creature more than the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 113, 14, 23, 'Creator; they worship a man''s opinion more than God''s opinion. We are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 113, 15, 23, 'all basically like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 113, 16, 23, 'You know, from childhood, we grow up being afraid of people''s opinions;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 113, 17, 23, 'we want to impress people. We are not so concerned about impressing the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 113, 18, 23, 'Lord, and the result of that is that we keep falling into sin. If we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 113, 19, 23, 'going to be careless in our thought life, in our inner attitudes and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 113, 20, 23, 'motives, which nobody can see but God, there is never going to be any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 113, 21, 23, 'purity in our life. We are just going to be defeated constantly. Here is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 113, 22, 23, 'the number one reason why many people never make progress in overcoming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 113, 23, 23, 'sin, because they have never sought to develop the fear of God in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 113, 24, 23, 'life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 113, 25, 23, 'Now let me give you a second reason. The Bible says in Romans 1:17 that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 113, 26, 23, '"The righteous man will live by faith." All progress in the Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 113, 27, 23, 'life is by faith. For example, in the letter of Jude, verse 24, it says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 113, 28, 23, '"Jesus can keep you from falling;" if you don''t believe that, it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 114, 1, 23, 'never going to take place in your life. If you don''t believe that God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 114, 2, 23, 'intensely interested in your living in victory over sin, you are never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 114, 3, 23, 'going to experience it in your life. If you don''t believe that sin is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 114, 4, 23, 'serious matter, you are not going to overcome sin in your life. We need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 114, 5, 23, 'to have faith in the Word of God. Let me give you one or two examples');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 114, 6, 23, 'which should prove to you why sin is so serious.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 114, 7, 23, 'In the beginning of the history of the human race, when God created Adam');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 114, 8, 23, 'and Eve, He gave them only one commandment - not ten, just one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 114, 9, 23, 'commandment. He told them not to eat the fruit of a particular tree;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 114, 10, 23, 'that was all. They lived with one commandment. One would think that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 114, 11, 23, 'could have enjoyed life so much because of that beautiful garden with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 114, 12, 23, 'everything available, and all they had to do was keep one commandment.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 114, 13, 23, 'That was not at all difficult, was it? But they disobeyed that one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 114, 14, 23, 'commandment, probably on that very first day. And what was the result?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 114, 15, 23, 'Did God give them a second chance? No. He didn''t say, ''Ok, let''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 114, 16, 23, 'overlook your failure; you probably didn''t realize how serious it was. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 114, 17, 23, 'will give you one more chance.'' There was no second chance. Now, if our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 114, 18, 23, 'children make a mistake, we would give them a second chance. God never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 114, 19, 23, 'gave Adam and Eve a second chance. He turned them out of the garden');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 114, 20, 23, 'immediately. Is it because God is not compassionate? Do you think you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 114, 21, 23, 'are more compassionate than God as a Father when you give your child a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 114, 22, 23, 'second chance or a third chance? - Certainly not. There is no one in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 114, 23, 23, 'universe more compassionate and more merciful than God. If you have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 114, 24, 23, 'little compassion in your heart, you got that from God; it is a little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 114, 25, 23, 'drop in the ocean of God''s compassion. God loved Adam and Eve intensely.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 114, 26, 23, 'Why didn''t He give them a second chance then? - Because sin is so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 114, 27, 23, 'serious. It is not a light thing!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 114, 28, 23, 'So right in the beginning of the Bible, you see the seriousness of sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 115, 1, 23, 'in this one act of God in not giving Adam and Eve a second chance. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 115, 2, 23, 'know, many children take some of commands or orders of their parents');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 115, 3, 23, 'very lightly, saying, "Yeah, daddy and mommy won''t mind even if I do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 115, 4, 23, 'it." Very often they are right. They disobey their parents and their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 115, 5, 23, 'parents don''t take it seriously and they let them go. It is possible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 115, 6, 23, 'that Adam and Eve felt in the same way: ''well, God is a loving God after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 115, 7, 23, 'all, He won''t take it seriously if we just slip up a little bit.'' But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 115, 8, 23, 'they discovered that sin was serious. They discovered that one sin was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 115, 9, 23, 'enough to shut them out from God''s presence forever. Sometimes people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 115, 10, 23, 'say, concerning their sin, ''well, that is only one sin.'' But how many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 115, 11, 23, 'sins did Adam commit before He was shut out of God''s presence - twenty,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 115, 12, 23, 'thirty, hundred? - No, not even two. Just one!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 115, 13, 23, 'Why am I stressing this? I have found in my life that very, very few');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 115, 14, 23, 'believers who believe that even one sin is serious. It says in Romans');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 115, 15, 23, '6:1,"Shall we continue in sin that grace may abound". Again, we see in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 115, 16, 23, 'in Romans 6:15 (taking the literal translation) that, " What shall we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 115, 17, 23, 'say then? Shall we sin even once that grace may abound." Have you ever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 115, 18, 23, 'asked yourself that question, ''shall we sin even once?'' I wish we could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 115, 19, 23, 'see how serious sin is, in Adam''s time and in our time. That is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 115, 20, 23, 'first proof that God takes sin very seriously; that a compassionate,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 115, 21, 23, 'merciful God could not give Adam and Eve a second chance. One sin shut');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 115, 22, 23, 'them out of His presence permanently. Even if they never committed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 115, 23, 23, 'another sin in their whole life, they would still go to Hell; one sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 115, 24, 23, 'was enough.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 115, 25, 23, 'Now I want to show you a second example. The previous one was from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 115, 26, 23, 'Old Testament. Now I will show you an example from the New Testament,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 115, 27, 23, 'and it is not something you don''t know about. Why did Jesus die on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 115, 28, 23, 'Calvary''s cross? What was the reason? - Sin. Supposing only one man had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 116, 1, 23, 'committed only one sin in the history of the human race, tell me, do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 116, 2, 23, 'think Jesus would have come down from heaven to die for that one man,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 116, 3, 23, 'for his one sin? I believe He would have.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 116, 4, 23, 'You see, it is not just that He took the sins of the whole world -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 116, 5, 23, 'millions of sins. If only one man had committed only one sin, Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 116, 6, 23, 'would still have to come and died to save that one man, from that one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 116, 7, 23, 'sin; from the consequences of that one sin. When Jesus died, just before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 116, 8, 23, 'He died, for three hours, we read, the sun was darkened. At 12 noon it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 116, 9, 23, 'became like midnight on the earth. Why did it become like midnight? Why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 116, 10, 23, 'did it become pitch-dark at 12 noon? - Because God turned His face away');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 116, 11, 23, 'from His own son. In all eternity that had never happened. God the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 116, 12, 23, 'Father and the Son were in perfect fellowship for years. But for three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 116, 13, 23, 'hours the Father turned away His face from His son; broke fellowship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 116, 14, 23, 'with His son. What Jesus endured during those three hours was the agony');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 116, 15, 23, 'of being forsaken by God, what we would call Hell on the cross.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 116, 16, 23, 'What does that prove? That sin is extremely serious that Jesus Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 116, 17, 23, 'had to suffer so much. When we believe the Word of God we will take sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 116, 18, 23, 'seriously. I am absolutely convinced, dear friends, that many of us have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 116, 19, 23, 'not overcome sin because we haven''t seen the seriousness of sin. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 116, 20, 23, 'have got a leprous patch in your hand, what would you do? Would you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 116, 21, 23, 'ignore it, or would you rush to the doctor? If you felt a pain in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 116, 22, 23, 'stomach, which you thought might be cancer, what would you do? Would you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 116, 23, 23, 'delay in going and getting an x-ray or a scan done and get a doctor''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 116, 24, 23, 'opinion? Why do we rush; why do we take leave from our work the very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 116, 25, 23, 'next day and go to the doctor? Because we know these things are serious.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 116, 26, 23, 'Supposing your blood test shows that you have got AIDS, what would you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 116, 27, 23, 'do, just ignore it?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 116, 28, 23, 'How many of us believe that sin is more serious than all these things?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 117, 1, 23, 'Do you believe the Word of God? Here is the second reason why many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 117, 2, 23, 'people fall: they do not believe; they do not believe that sin is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 117, 3, 23, 'serious; they do not believe God''s Word that with grace you can overcome');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 117, 4, 23, 'sin. Take God''s Word seriously from today onwards, every Word of God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 117, 5, 23, 'and see if it doesn''t make a difference in your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 117, 6, 24, 'Chapter 24 More Reasons For Failure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 117, 7, 24, 'We want to continue with the subject of our last study as to how we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 117, 8, 24, 'overcome sin, our biggest problem in all of our life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 117, 9, 24, 'We saw, from our last study, two reasons why many Christians don''t grow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 117, 10, 24, 'in their Christian life and don''t grow to overcome sinful habits. One is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 117, 11, 24, 'the lack of the fear of God, and the other is the lack of faith. You see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 117, 12, 24, 'faith is a personal thing. We saw that Jesus can keep people from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 117, 13, 24, 'falling. Now that is a fact; an intellectual fact that even the devil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 117, 14, 24, 'believes in. But, to personally believe that Jesus can keep you from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 117, 15, 24, 'falling when you are tempted, that quality of your heart that can bring');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 117, 16, 24, 'you victory, can come only if you have taken the first step of believing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 117, 17, 24, 'what the Bible describes as the seriousness of sin. When you believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 117, 18, 24, 'that, then you will long to be free from this wretched disease. So faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 117, 19, 24, 'is a very important factor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 117, 20, 24, 'Now a third reason why people keep falling into sin is, because they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 117, 21, 24, 'have not understood that their own flesh, their own human personality');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 117, 22, 24, 'and the being that they are, their human strength is totally impotent to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 117, 23, 24, 'do the will of God. We, in our own strength, can never ever overcome');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 117, 24, 24, 'sin. Any amount of determination, any amount of self-discipline,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 117, 25, 24, 'anything you like, you can do, but cannot overcome sin because sin is so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 117, 26, 24, 'deeply rooted in our nature. It is like trying to train a pig to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 117, 27, 24, 'clean. What chance is there of success? Maybe by whipping or feeding and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 117, 28, 24, 'offering it rewards, you can try and get a pig to be clean for a little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 118, 1, 24, 'while. But leave it alone for some time; it reverts back to its original');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 118, 2, 24, 'nature. That is how it is with human beings too. This type of overcoming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 118, 3, 24, 'through self-effort is not victory at all. It is just personal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 118, 4, 24, 'self-discipline - a good thing for sure, but not what God offers. No, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 118, 5, 24, 'need to recognize the weakness of our own flesh, our own weakness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 118, 6, 24, 'If you realize this, there will be two things that you will do. First of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 118, 7, 24, 'all, you will run away from temptation; you will not expose yourself to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 118, 8, 24, 'danger. Who are the people who expose themselves to temptation? - Those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 118, 9, 24, 'who don''t feel their weakness. One who feels his weakness will run away.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 118, 10, 24, 'That is what the Bible says we should do: flee from youthful lusts; flee');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 118, 11, 24, 'from immorality (2 Tim. 2:22). There we read that Paul told, even a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 118, 12, 24, 'godly man like, Timothy to flee from youthful lusts; to flee from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 118, 13, 24, 'love of money, to flee from idolatry, to flee from immorality. We read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 118, 14, 24, 'all these exhortations in 1 Timothy 6, 1 Corinthians 6, 1 Corinthians 10');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 118, 15, 24, 'and 2 Timothy 2. Flee, flee, flee, flee - run away. Why do we run away?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 118, 16, 24, 'Because we realize we are weak. We can overcome many sins if we just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 118, 17, 24, 'obey that one exhortation to run away.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 118, 18, 24, 'The second thing that a person, who has recognized the weakness of his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 118, 19, 24, 'flesh, will do is that he will pray to God earnestly for help. You see,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 118, 20, 24, 'prayer is a sign of weakness. When do people usually pray, even worldly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 118, 21, 24, 'people? - When they are in real trouble, when nobody else can help them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 118, 22, 24, 'One of the things that Jesus taught us to pray is - lead us not into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 118, 23, 24, 'temptation. Why do we pray that prayer? -Because we are convinced that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 118, 24, 24, 'our flesh is weak. One would think that someone like Timothy, who had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 118, 25, 24, 'advanced in the Christian life so much, was not in danger of youthful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 118, 26, 24, 'lusts, but even he needed to run away.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 118, 27, 24, 'Now, if we realize our weakness we will not only want to run away from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 118, 28, 24, 'temptation, but we will also pray, ''Lord, please help me. Give me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 119, 1, 24, 'strength to overcome this weakness.'' Just like we need to see the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 119, 2, 24, 'seriousness of sin, we also need to see the weakness of our flesh.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 119, 3, 24, 'One truth of the wonderful truths in scripture, that we read is that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 119, 4, 24, '"Jesus Christ was tempted in all points, as we are" (Heb. 4:15). He did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 119, 5, 24, 'not live on earth without being tempted. In Matthew 4 we are given a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 119, 6, 24, 'very clear description of how He was tempted, at least in three areas.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 119, 7, 24, 'But in Hebrews 4:15, we are told He was tempted in all areas, just like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 119, 8, 24, 'us, but He never sinned.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 119, 9, 24, 'How is it He never sinned? Was it because He automatically could not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 119, 10, 24, 'sin? Well, we don''t want to probe into the nature of Jesus. There is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 119, 11, 24, 'much about His inner nature that we cannot understand. Even there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 119, 12, 24, 'much about our own inner nature we can''t understand ourselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 119, 13, 24, 'Psychologists try so much and they still don''t know everything about the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 119, 14, 24, 'human personality. It is impossible to try and gauge what went on within');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 119, 15, 24, 'Jesus, and we don''t even want to attempt it. But one thing we know:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 119, 16, 24, 'Jesus prayed. Why did He have to pray?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 119, 17, 24, 'You know, the stronger we feel within ourselves, the less we pray; the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 119, 18, 24, 'more capable we think we are, the less we pray. It is the one who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 119, 19, 24, 'realizes his helpless dependence upon the Father for everything - for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 119, 20, 24, 'wisdom, for strength, for guidance - that is the one who prays. The one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 119, 21, 24, 'who feels, ''Yeah, well, I can handle all that myself, I don''t need God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 119, 22, 24, 'help, I can sort out, I can gauge the relative importance of things and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 119, 23, 24, 'take decision,'' he doesn''t pray. But Jesus prayed. He prayed all night');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 119, 24, 24, 'before He chose His twelve apostles; He didn''t want to make a mistake.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 119, 25, 24, 'Now these things indicate that Jesus received strength from the Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 119, 26, 24, 'through prayer. We don''t receive it because we don''t pray as much, or we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 119, 27, 24, 'don''t pray as earnestly. We are told in Hebrews 5 that Jesus prayed with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 119, 28, 24, 'strong crying and tears. Imagine that. Can you picture that in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 120, 1, 24, 'mind? - Of Jesus Christ, the perfect man who walked on this earth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 120, 2, 24, 'praying with strong crying and tears? When was the last time you prayed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 120, 3, 24, 'with strong crying and tears? Why the difference? Don''t you think you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 120, 4, 24, 'and I need to pray much more than Jesus needed to? He had lived in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 120, 5, 24, 'presence of the Father from all eternity. He did not have a sinful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 120, 6, 24, 'nature like you and I have. And yet, He prayed. How much more we need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 120, 7, 24, 'pray?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 120, 8, 24, 'True humility is to recognize the weakness of our flesh. All of us are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 120, 9, 24, 'weak, but not all of us are equally conscious of our weakness. The one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 120, 10, 24, 'who is conscious of his weakness will run away from danger when he sees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 120, 11, 24, 'it, and he will cry out for help. So this is the third reason why many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 120, 12, 24, 'people fall; they don''t run away from temptation. They foolishly expose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 120, 13, 24, 'themselves to temptation and they don''t cry out for help.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 120, 14, 24, 'Let me give you a fourth reason why many people fall into sin. Peter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 120, 15, 24, 'says that we must arm ourselves with a mind to suffer in the flesh, like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 120, 16, 24, 'Jesus suffered in the flesh, because if we suffer in the flesh, we cease');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 120, 17, 24, 'from sin (1 Pet. 4:1, 2). Now, that is not an easy verse to understand.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 120, 18, 24, 'It is not talking about bodily suffering, because people who suffer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 120, 19, 24, 'bodily don''t finish with sin. We know that. Otherwise, the hospitals');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 120, 20, 24, 'would be full of people who are finished with sin. It is obviously not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 120, 21, 24, 'referring to bodily suffering. What does it mean when it says, "As');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 120, 22, 24, 'Christ suffered in the flesh, arm yourselves with the same mind, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 120, 23, 24, 'he who suffers in the flesh ceases from sin so that he can do the will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 120, 24, 24, 'of God." It is referring to an attitude of mind where we would rather');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 120, 25, 24, 'suffer in self-denial than get the least pleasure out of even a single');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 120, 26, 24, 'sinful thought.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 120, 27, 24, 'When we are tempted, all of us, we have the opportunity, either to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 120, 28, 24, 'indulge in it and get some pleasure out of it or to resist it and reject');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 121, 1, 24, 'it. The la t ter causes a certain suffering. That is the suffering that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 121, 2, 24, 'is mentioned here. Peter says, before you are tempted, you must be armed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 121, 3, 24, 'for the conflict. In other words, you must be armed with this attitude');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 121, 4, 24, 'of mind, which says, ''I would rather suffer than enjoy the pleasure of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 121, 5, 24, 'sin even for a moment.'' We read about Jesus that He was obedient even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 121, 6, 24, 'unto death (Phil. 2:8). This means, Jesus'' attitude was that He would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 121, 7, 24, 'rather die than sin. Now that is quite a radical attitude - I would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 121, 8, 24, 'rather die than disobey my Father in the smallest little thing. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 121, 9, 24, 'the meaning of ''He was obedient even unto death.'' He calls us to follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 121, 10, 24, 'in His footsteps; to be willing to suffer rather than displease God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 121, 11, 24, 'A fifth reason why many Christians do not progress spiritually, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 121, 12, 24, 'fall, is because they are not seeking to press on to perfection. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 121, 13, 24, 'are satisfied with the progress that they have made thus far. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 121, 14, 24, 'become satisfied with second standard, you will never get to the third');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 121, 15, 24, 'standard. That is for certain - Because you feel you are better than all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 121, 16, 24, 'the others who are in the first standard and kindergarten. But if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 121, 17, 24, 'are determined to press on and say, ''well, I have overcome something but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 121, 18, 24, 'I want to get something more, I want to press towards the mark,'' you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 121, 19, 24, 'will make progress. Paul said, "One thing I do, I press towards the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 121, 20, 24, 'mark, for the prize of the high calling of God in Christ Jesus " (Phil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 121, 21, 24, '3:13-14) - the goal of becoming like Jesus totally, in every part of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 121, 22, 24, 'personality. What is the result of Paul having this attitude? It not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 121, 23, 24, 'only kept him from stagnating in the Christian life, but it also kept');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 121, 24, 24, 'him from sin. Paul told Timothy to not only flee from temptation but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 121, 25, 24, 'also to pursue after righteousness, godliness, love and gentleness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 121, 26, 24, 'Any point in our Christian life, where we get satisfied with our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 121, 27, 24, 'progress, is a danger point. That is the time we are going to fall into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 121, 28, 24, 'sin. And that is where we need to ask ourselves: ''Am I progressing? Am I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 122, 1, 24, 'longing to become like Jesus in every area? Am I mourning every time I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 122, 2, 24, 'see something in my life that is un-Christ like? Do I cry out to God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 122, 3, 24, 'say, ''Lord, I have faith." Begin today, my friend, to mourn every time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 122, 4, 24, 'you see something un-Christ like in your life. Cry out to God for help,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 122, 5, 24, 'and see if your life doesn''t change from this very day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 122, 6, 25, 'Chapter 25 Faith And Praise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 122, 7, 25, 'We want to look at a key that God has given us in His Word, through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 122, 8, 25, 'which we can break through many prison doors. It is the key of praising');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 122, 9, 25, 'God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 122, 10, 25, 'In this study we will look at a very important part of Christian life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 122, 11, 25, 'which is often misunderstood and, in most cases, not understood at all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 122, 12, 25, 'I want to begin with a verse in Psalm 106. Here it says, concerning the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 122, 13, 25, 'Israelites, who saw the Egyptians drowned in the Red Sea, "Then they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 122, 14, 25, 'believed God''s words, and they sang His praise" (Ps. 106:12). Notice the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 122, 15, 25, 'connection there between faith and praising God. We could say that when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 122, 16, 25, 'a man has faith, he will praise God. But, when a man has unbelief, when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 122, 17, 25, 'he does not believe God''s Word or God''s promise, then he will grumble');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 122, 18, 25, 'and complain and murmur and criticize and find faults and be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 122, 19, 25, 'dissatisfied and discouraged and depressed. If any of these things are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 122, 20, 25, 'found in your life, it will indicate that, even if you think you believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 122, 21, 25, 'in God and in Jesus Christ, you don''t really believe - Because if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 122, 22, 25, 'believe His words, you will sing His praise. You will never have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 122, 23, 25, 'complaint in your life concerning anything, if you believe in God and in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 122, 24, 25, 'His promises.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 122, 25, 25, 'Now the Israelites, mentioned here in Psalm 106, could praise God only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 122, 26, 25, 'after God had destroyed their enemies, those Egyptians, before their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 122, 27, 25, 'eyes. Today, we live by faith. But the Old Testament people, like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 122, 28, 25, 'Israelites, lived by sight. To live by sight means that they would see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 123, 1, 25, 'something happen before them - a miracle that God did for them - and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 123, 2, 25, 'only then they could believe. In the previous verse we read that, "after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 123, 3, 25, 'all their adversaries were drowned in the Red Sea " (Ps. 106:11); When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 123, 4, 25, 'not one of them was left they believed God''s words. That is living by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 123, 5, 25, 'sight, i.e. after all your problems are solved, after the storm has been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 123, 6, 25, 'stilled, after the enemies have been drowned and the last one of them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 123, 7, 25, 'has been killed, then we praise God. That is to live by sight, and that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 123, 8, 25, 'is all they could do in the Old Testament. Anybody can do that. Even an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 123, 9, 25, 'unconverted heathen person would be thankful, when all his problems are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 123, 10, 25, 'solved.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 123, 11, 25, 'But, in the New Covenant, now that Jesus has come, we don''t walk by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 123, 12, 25, 'sight, we walk by faith. We can believe the Word of God even before we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 123, 13, 25, 'see the enemies drowned in the sea. We can praise God while our enemies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 123, 14, 25, 'are still in front of us, like David said, "You have set a table before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 123, 15, 25, 'me in the presence of my enemies." That means, my problems may not be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 123, 16, 25, 'solved, but I have faith in God, and I can praise Him. As I praise Him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 123, 17, 25, 'I find that the problems will get solved. But they will never get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 123, 18, 25, 'solved, if we are always murmuring and complaining.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 123, 19, 25, 'Do you know, dear friend, that the more you murmur and complain, you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 123, 20, 25, 'really adding to your problem. It is not going to get solved at all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 123, 21, 25, 'Maybe somebody harmed you. The more you get bitter against that person,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 123, 22, 25, 'what are you doing to yourself? - You are just destroying yourself. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 123, 23, 25, 'more you keep that bitterness in your heart, it will destroy you more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 123, 24, 25, 'and more; it will destroy your body; destroy your soul; destroy your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 123, 25, 25, 'spirit; destroy your relationship with God. You won''t be able to enjoy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 123, 26, 25, 'life at all and you get ulcers in your stomach and all types of things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 123, 27, 25, 'You see, when God gives us laws they are for our good. They are for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 123, 28, 25, 'good of our body; they are good for our soul; for the good of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 124, 1, 25, 'spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 124, 2, 25, 'There is a very close connection between faith and praising God. We see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 124, 3, 25, 'that also in the New Testament. In Hebrews 2:12, 13 we read some amazing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 124, 4, 25, 'words mentioned about what Jesus Himself does in the midst of a church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 124, 5, 25, 'Here we read, in the words of Jesus, "I will proclaim your name" - i.e.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 124, 6, 25, 'the Father''s name - "to my brethren." You can very clearly see from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 124, 7, 25, 'previous verse that it is Jesus who is speaking: I will proclaim the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 124, 8, 25, 'Father''s name to my brothers- i.e. to you and me - "and in the midst of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 124, 9, 25, 'the church, I will sing Thy praise," and again, " I will put my trust in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 124, 10, 25, 'Him." Notice here again the connection between praise in verse 12 and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 124, 11, 25, 'trust in verse 13. Because we put our trust in Him, we sing His praise;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 124, 12, 25, 'exactly what we read in Psalm 106. We are told in Hebrew 2:11 and 12');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 124, 13, 25, 'that we are the younger brothers of Jesus and He is our elder brother');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 124, 14, 25, 'who is praising the Father in the midst of the church. We are called to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 124, 15, 25, 'follow Him and His example and join with him in exalting our heavenly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 124, 16, 25, 'Father.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 124, 17, 25, 'Now God is a very great King. He is the greatest King of all, the King');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 124, 18, 25, 'of the Universe. Therefore, He does not sit on any cheap throne of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 124, 19, 25, 'silver or gold; such thrones would be too cheap for Him. We read in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 124, 20, 25, 'Psalm 22 about the throne on which God sits (and that is good for us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 124, 21, 25, 'know), - "Thou art holy O my God, Thou Who art enthroned upon the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 124, 22, 25, 'praises of Israel" (Ps. 22:3) - today the praises of the Church. So, how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 124, 23, 25, 'do we make a throne for God? - By our praises. Praise forms the throne');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 124, 24, 25, 'on which God sits as a King. That is why heaven is a place of perpetual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 124, 25, 25, 'praise, like we read in the Book of Revelation - the angels are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 124, 26, 25, 'constantly praising God. That is the throne on which God sits.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 124, 27, 25, 'When the Holy Spirit comes into our hearts, He brings heaven down into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 124, 28, 25, 'our hearts. We can now prepare a throne of praise for our God to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 125, 1, 25, 'enthroned upon in our hearts, in our homes, and in the church. So, when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 125, 2, 25, 'we praise God, we are actually saying, ''God, you are King and here is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 125, 3, 25, 'the throne we have prepared for you to come and sit upon.'' Do you want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 125, 4, 25, 'God to dwell in your heart? - Very simple, prepare a throne for Him. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 125, 5, 25, 'want God to dwell in your home? - Prepare a throne for him there. Do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 125, 6, 25, 'want God to dwell in the church? - Prepare a throne for Him there.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 125, 7, 25, 'What is the throne? - A throne of praises. In other words, let your life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 125, 8, 25, 'be filled with the spirit of praise, not necessarily of words. We can''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 125, 9, 25, 'always be praising God, 24 hours of the day! We have got work to do, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 125, 10, 25, 'have to sleep, and we have to do so many things. It is the spirit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 125, 11, 25, 'praise - let your home be filled with the spirit of praise. In other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 125, 12, 25, 'words, totally eliminate all grumbling, all complaining, all murmuring');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 125, 13, 25, 'from your life, because that destroys the throne on which God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 125, 14, 25, 'supposed to sit. On the other hand, when you grumble and complain, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 125, 15, 25, 'get angry and lose your temper and get irritated, you are actually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 125, 16, 25, 'preparing a throne for Satan!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 125, 17, 25, 'So you see, two thrones that you can make in your life, in your home:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 125, 18, 25, 'one is the throne of praise, giving thanks to God always for all things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 125, 19, 25, 'in the name of Jesus Christ, a throne on which God will sit; or, a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 125, 20, 25, 'throne of complaining, murmuring, grumbling, dissatisfaction,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 125, 21, 25, 'discontentment, which you offer for the devil to come and sit, whether');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 125, 22, 25, 'it is in your life or in your home, or in your church. And that is why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 125, 23, 25, 'the Bible says, in Philippians 2:12-14, that when the Holy Spirit is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 125, 24, 25, 'working in our heart, He seeks to eliminate all grumbling, disputing and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 125, 25, 25, 'murmuring from our lives completely, because He wants to prepare a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 125, 26, 25, 'throne in our hearts for our heavenly Father. That is what the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 125, 27, 25, 'Spirit has really come for.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 125, 28, 25, 'You know, we have lived all our lives with our own self sitting on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 126, 1, 25, 'throne in our hearts. That means, we listen to self, whatever self');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 126, 2, 25, 'wants; we do, whatever the self likes. We please ourselves, we live for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 126, 3, 25, 'ourselves, and we want to enjoy ourselves. And then one day, when we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 126, 4, 25, 'say, ''Lord Jesus, come into our hearts,'' what place do we give Him in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 126, 5, 25, 'our hearts? He is not going to come like a visitor or a guest, but many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 126, 6, 25, 'Christians treat him like that, you know.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 126, 7, 25, 'How can you prepare a throne for Christ; for God, in your heart? This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 126, 8, 25, 'how you do it: by praising Him under all circumstances. In the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 126, 9, 25, 'Testament, we can do that. You see, in the Old Testament, they couldn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 126, 10, 25, 'praise all the time, because, first of all, the Holy Spirit was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 126, 11, 25, 'dwelling in people''s hearts in those days, and secondly there was no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 126, 12, 25, 'guarantee that God would make everything work together for their good.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 126, 13, 25, 'How could you praise God for something when you are not sure whether it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 126, 14, 25, 'is working out for your good?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 126, 15, 25, 'But today, things are different. Today, the Holy Spirit has come to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 126, 16, 25, 'dwell in our hearts. He has made it His permanent home, and there, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 126, 17, 25, 'prepares a throne for the Father. He works in us to deliver us from our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 126, 18, 25, 'sinful nature and He works outside of us as well. We are told in Romans');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 126, 19, 25, '8:28 that God is working in all the circumstances in our life to make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 126, 20, 25, 'everything work for our good. Now, if everything is working for your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 126, 21, 25, 'good, outside you and inside you, is there any reason for you to have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 126, 22, 25, 'complaint about anything? - Certainly not. Then, why don''t you give up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 126, 23, 25, 'all complaining and praise God?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 126, 24, 25, 'Here''s the answer: You don''t really believe. You don''t really believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 126, 25, 25, 'what God says in Romans 8:28 that He causes everything to work together');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 126, 26, 25, 'for good. You see, it is only when we believe that Word, that God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 126, 27, 25, 'Almighty; that God is Sovereign, we can praise Him. Look at the stars');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 126, 28, 25, 'sometimes and see how great God is. Do you think it is difficult for Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 127, 1, 25, 'to handle that small, puny situation that you are facing? It may be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 127, 2, 25, 'difficult boss or a difficult landlord or some particular problem you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 127, 3, 25, 'are facing; do you think that person or that circumstance is too');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 127, 4, 25, 'difficult for God to handle? Of course, He can handle it. What is there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 127, 5, 25, 'that God can''t handle?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 127, 6, 25, 'But He can''t do that for you till you start praising Him, till you say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 127, 7, 25, '''Lord, here is the proof of my faith; I praise You. I want to thank You.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 127, 8, 25, 'I want to exalt You. I want to acknowledge that You are on the throne of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 127, 9, 25, 'heaven, and I don''t have any complaint about the way people are treating');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 127, 10, 25, 'me, about my circumstances, or about anything in my life. I believe that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 127, 11, 25, 'You are in total control.'' Is it enough to say that in words? No, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 127, 12, 25, 'praise Him from our heart, in spirit. As we praise Him, we acknowledge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 127, 13, 25, 'that God is in total control. That is how we honour Him. And when you do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 127, 14, 25, 'that, you will discover how God makes a way for you out of that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 127, 15, 25, 'situation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 127, 16, 26, 'Chapter 26 Crucifixion And Praise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 127, 17, 26, 'In this study we want to continue looking at this wonderful key of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 127, 18, 26, 'praising God, through which we prepare a throne for God in our hearts,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 127, 19, 26, 'and through which we can escape from any situation that we ever find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 127, 20, 26, 'ourselves in the world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 127, 21, 26, 'In our last study, we studied about this wonderful key that God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 127, 22, 26, 'given us. It is like a master key that can open every door. Isn''t it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 127, 23, 26, 'wonderful to have a key in your hands through which you can unlock');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 127, 24, 26, 'yourself and get out of any tight corner or any situation that you find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 127, 25, 26, 'yourself in? It can be some difficult situation, some problem, or some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 127, 26, 26, 'difficult people perhaps, and here you have a master key. What is that?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 127, 27, 26, '- To enthrone God on our praises.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 127, 28, 26, 'But it is not a technique. If you try it as technique, I guarantee you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 128, 1, 26, 'right now, it will fail. Technique is something that we adopt selfishly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 128, 2, 26, 'We want something, and we think that, if we repeat certain words like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 128, 3, 26, 'some kind of ''mantra'' or magic, it will work. It doesn''t work like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 128, 4, 26, 'I am not talking about words. You know God has no interest in words if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 128, 5, 26, 'they don''t come from our hearts. I am not talking about praise alone. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 128, 6, 26, 'am talking about praise that comes from a heart that has faith in God -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 128, 7, 26, 'in His sovereign power, in His perfect love and in His infinite wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 128, 8, 26, 'Faith indicates that you believe that God is full of love, full of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 128, 9, 26, 'wisdom, full of power and when you believe that you will sing His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 128, 10, 26, 'praise. We saw in the last study, “Praise is the throne on which God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 128, 11, 26, 'sits" (Ps. 22:3). Now Psalm 22 is a Psalm about the Cross of Calvary. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 128, 12, 26, 'begins with these words ‘‘My God, my God, why have you forsaken me.’’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 128, 13, 26, 'Jesus spoke those words when He was hanging on the cross and then He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 128, 14, 26, 'speaks about God being enthroned on the praises of His people in the 3rd');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 128, 15, 26, 'verse. Then it refers to His hands and feet being pierced in verse 16.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 128, 16, 26, 'It is very obviously a message of a cross - a Psalm of the cross.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 128, 17, 26, 'And, as you continue in the Psalm, from this crucified position, Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 128, 18, 26, 'invites His younger brothers, that is you and me, to join Him to prepare');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 128, 19, 26, 'a throne of praise for the Father (verse 22); "I will tell of Your name');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 128, 20, 26, 'to my brethren, in the midst of the assembly I will praise Thee." That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 128, 21, 26, 'is the verse which is quoted in Hebrews 2 as referring to Jesus praising');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 128, 22, 26, 'the Father. So it is very interesting to see that this verse of praise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 128, 23, 26, 'comes in the midst of a Psalm which is speaking about Jesus being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 128, 24, 26, 'crucified, His hands and feet being pierced.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 128, 25, 26, 'The crucifixion of Jesus was the worst evil that was ever committed on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 128, 26, 26, 'this earth. There was never a greater sin committed by any human being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 128, 27, 26, 'than that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 128, 28, 26, 'Then consider this: What was the best thing that ever took place on this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 129, 1, 26, 'earth, in all the 6000 years of human history? The answer is again the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 129, 2, 26, 'same: The crucifixion of Jesus Christ. There was never any better thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 129, 3, 26, 'that ever took place on this earth. Because of Christ’s crucifixion, our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 129, 4, 26, 'sins can all be forgiven and we can spend eternity with God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 129, 5, 26, 'So the crucifixion of Christ was the worst sin that man ever committed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 129, 6, 26, 'and also the best thing that ever happened on earth. What does that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 129, 7, 26, 'show? Just this that the worst thing that man could do was turned by God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 129, 8, 26, 'into the very best thing of all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 129, 9, 26, 'Now, once you understand that, you will realize that whatever other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 129, 10, 26, 'people may do to you are certainly not as bad as the crucifixion of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 129, 11, 26, 'Jesus. And if God could turn that evil thing into something good, tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 129, 12, 26, 'me what is there that other people can do to you, which God cannot turn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 129, 13, 26, 'for good. Everything is less than that. Nothing can happen to you worse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 129, 14, 26, 'than the crucifixion of Jesus and that worst thing God turned into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 129, 15, 26, 'very best. That teaches us something about God''s Almighty power. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 129, 16, 26, 'why we praise Him. That is why, right in the middle of this Psalm which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 129, 17, 26, 'is the Psalm of the cross, we find, ‘‘I will praise you.’’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 129, 18, 26, 'Do you feel like praising God when you are crucified? What do you think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 129, 19, 26, 'the thieves were doing when they were hanging on the cross? They were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 129, 20, 26, 'not praising God. They were cursing and swearing and probably biting the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 129, 21, 26, 'hands of the soldiers who were crucifying them and spitting at them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 129, 22, 26, 'They were not at all happy. Can you imagine how Jesus was crucified? He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 129, 23, 26, 'must have opened His palms and co-operated with them as they drove the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 129, 24, 26, 'nails in, put His legs, one on top of the other, so that they could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 129, 25, 26, 'drive the nails in more easily. He was happy. Why was He happy? Didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 129, 26, 26, 'He suffer? Oh, He suffered for sure. He felt the pain of crucifixion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 129, 27, 26, 'just as much as you and I would feel it. Then why was he happy? He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 129, 28, 26, 'happy that He was doing the will of His Father. You know, when we do the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 130, 1, 26, 'will of our Father, it doesn''t matter if we suffer. We can still be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 130, 2, 26, 'happy. We may feel pain. Jesus felt pain, but He was happy, and that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 130, 3, 26, 'why He could praise the Father hanging on the Cross. And this is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 130, 4, 26, 'way. This is the secret.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 130, 5, 26, 'The Bible says that it is not only Jesus Christ who was crucified on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 130, 6, 26, 'Calvary. Do you know somebody else who was crucified on the same cross');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 130, 7, 26, 'as Jesus? I don''t mean on either side of Him like the thieves. Tell me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 130, 8, 26, 'somebody else who was crucified on the same cross as Jesus was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 130, 9, 26, 'crucified. It is not so well known among Christians, by the way. Every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 130, 10, 26, 'Christian knows that Jesus died on the cross on Calvary, but if you were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 130, 11, 26, 'to ask them, who else died with Him on that same cross? They don''t know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 130, 12, 26, 'the answer. The answer is given to us, in two places at least, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 130, 13, 26, 'Scripture.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 130, 14, 26, 'In Romans 6:6, we read, "Our old man was also crucified with Christ on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 130, 15, 26, 'the cross" and Paul says, in Galatians 2:20, applying it personally to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 130, 16, 26, 'himself, "I am crucified with Christ, I have been crucified with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 130, 17, 26, 'Christ." So, it is not only Jesus who died on the cross. In some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 130, 18, 26, 'wonderful way, God, who knew that one day you and I would also give our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 130, 19, 26, 'lives to Christ (because He knew the future), took us and put us into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 130, 20, 26, 'Christ and we were crucified with Him. We have died with Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 130, 21, 26, 'It is not only that our sins were placed on Christ on the cross, but we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 130, 22, 26, 'ourselves have been placed on that Cross. Now, crucified with Christ, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 130, 23, 26, 'praise God. See, that is a different type of praise than the hollow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 130, 24, 26, 'empty words of praise that sometimes people make by noises and shouting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 130, 25, 26, 'which is meaningless. Why do I say it is meaningless? Praise is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 130, 26, 26, 'spirit. You can''t just switch it on, on Sunday morning for 2 hours, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 130, 27, 26, 'switch it off, when you go home. If you say ''Hallelujah,'' ''Praise the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 130, 28, 26, 'Lord'', on Sunday morning in the meeting, and then go home and shout at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 131, 1, 26, 'your wife on Sunday afternoon, do you have the spirit of praise? -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 131, 2, 26, 'Certainly not. That is something you switch on and switch off. It is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 131, 3, 26, 'a spirit of praise. It is a form. It is a tradition, and that is all a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 131, 4, 26, 'lot of people have. That is hollow.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 131, 5, 26, 'There is a verse in the Old Testament where God says, "These people draw');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 131, 6, 26, 'near to me with their lips but their hearts are far away from me." Their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 131, 7, 26, 'hearts seek their own. So, it is easy to draw near to God with our lips,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 131, 8, 26, 'and God doesn''t care for that. He doesn''t listen to a lot of praise that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 131, 9, 26, 'is spoken out on Sunday mornings from different parts of the world. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 131, 10, 26, 'know what He listens to? He listens to the people who have a spirit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 131, 11, 26, 'praise, and not just words. Words can be empty. Words can be a ritual.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 131, 12, 26, 'There are a lot of people who say that they love Jesus in the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 131, 13, 26, 'spirit that Judas Iscariot kissed Jesus in Gethsemane. Judas Iscariot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 131, 14, 26, 'kissing Jesus wasn''t a sign of love and affection and friendship; he was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 131, 15, 26, 'betraying him. And in the same way, many people stand up Sunday morning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 131, 16, 26, 'and praise the Lord, and say Hallelujah, but it is not in their hearts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 131, 17, 26, 'If you want praise to come into your heart, you have to be crucified');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 131, 18, 26, 'with Christ. You are to say, ''Lord I die to myself.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 131, 19, 26, 'I want to show you another Psalm which is also a Psalm of the cross and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 131, 20, 26, 'that just confirms what I have been trying to say to you. You know,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 131, 21, 26, 'God''s word is powerful and that is why we need to turn to His words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 131, 22, 26, 'again and again. Man''s words are not as powerful as God''s words. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 131, 23, 26, 'Psalm 118:11-14 you read, "They surrounded me like bees and in the name');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 131, 24, 26, 'of the Lord, I will cut them off." It is a Psalm of the cross and then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 131, 25, 26, 'it says in Verse 22, " The stone which the builders rejected became the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 131, 26, 26, 'Chief Cornerstone." That is a word that Jesus quoted in the Gospels. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 131, 27, 26, 'read that in Matthew 21:42 and Mark 12:10, 11. It is the word that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 131, 28, 26, 'quoted concerning Himself. When did the builders reject the stone? That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 132, 1, 26, 'was on Calvary; they said, "We don''t want Him to reign over us. We will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 132, 2, 26, 'not have this man to reign over us. Crucify him." And they rejected Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 132, 3, 26, 'But there, hanging on the cross, crucified, the Lord says, in Verse 28,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 132, 4, 26, '"I give thanks to Thee; I will extol Thee, give thanks to the Lord, for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 132, 5, 26, 'He is good." Then in verse 24, " This is the day which the Lord has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 132, 6, 26, 'made. Let us rejoice and be glad in it." Was the day, on which Jesus was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 132, 7, 26, 'crucified, a day which the Lord had made? It is easy to say - this is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 132, 8, 26, 'the day which the Lord has made when you get an increment or a promotion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 132, 9, 26, 'in your job or a better salary or a better job or when you get married');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 132, 10, 26, 'or get a better house or some earthly benefit. But to say that ''this is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 132, 11, 26, 'the day which the Lord has made,'' when somebody crucifies you, requires');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 132, 12, 26, 'faith. What is the day which the Lord has not made? Is there any day in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 132, 13, 26, 'any year which the Lord has not made? Every day is the day which the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 132, 14, 26, 'Lord has made. The devil doesn''t make any days, I will tell you that. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 132, 15, 26, 'this is the day which the Lord has made, we are going to rejoice and be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 132, 16, 26, 'glad in it. Whether we get a large gift or whether we get crucified, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 132, 17, 26, 'doesn''t make a difference, because we believe in the sovereignty of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 132, 18, 26, 'And so, we find in both these Psalms (Psalm 22 and Psalm 118), this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 132, 19, 26, 'great truth, that it is only as I am willing to die to my self- life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 132, 20, 26, 'which is always seeking its own, that I can enter into a spirit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 132, 21, 26, 'praise. Then my praise to God on Sunday mornings will be meaningful. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 132, 22, 26, 'will come from my heart and I will not have to live a double life, where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 132, 23, 26, 'I am a Holy person on Sunday morning and behave like a devil on Sunday');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 132, 24, 26, 'Evening. No, I can be genuine through and through. So, it is not just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 132, 25, 26, 'faith that is connected with praising God, but being crucified with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 132, 26, 26, 'Christ is also connected with praising God. We are trying to lay a good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 132, 27, 26, 'ground so that our life of praise will be on a solid foundation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 132, 28, 27, 'Chapter 27 Praise Drives Satan Out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 133, 1, 27, 'We will continue looking at this wonderful key that God has given us, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 133, 2, 27, 'open every door on earth, the key of praising God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 133, 3, 27, 'God is a good God. Every single thing that He does and allows to come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 133, 4, 27, 'into our lives is designed for our very best. Some of it may be painful,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 133, 5, 27, 'and we may not understand it, but it is designed for our very best. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 133, 6, 27, 'know just like our children who don''t understand sometimes what is good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 133, 7, 27, 'for them. When you force your child to go to school on a Monday morning,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 133, 8, 27, 'your 4 year or 5 years old child doesn''t understand. The child would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 133, 9, 27, 'rather stay at home, play or sleep or something like that, but he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 133, 10, 27, 'doesn''t understand what you are forcing him to do is good for him. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 133, 11, 27, 'the same way, many things that God allows in our life, we may not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 133, 12, 27, 'understand, because we are immature, but they are all designed for our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 133, 13, 27, 'good. It is only the devil who is out to destroy us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 133, 14, 27, 'Jesus came to earth and exposed two things. One, He exposed the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 133, 15, 27, 'tremendous goodness of our heavenly Father and second, He exposed the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 133, 16, 27, 'thoroughly evil nature of the devil who seeks to deceive us in so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 133, 17, 27, 'ways. There is a verse in Isaiah 61 which tells us the ministry that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 133, 18, 27, 'Jesus came to accomplish. In fact, Jesus quoted this passage, in Luke 4,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 133, 19, 27, 'in the very first Sermon that He preached in the Synagogue in Nazareth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 133, 20, 27, 'Here it says, "The Spirit of the Lord God is upon me because the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 133, 21, 27, 'has anointed me." And what has the Lord - the Father, anointed Jesus to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 133, 22, 27, 'do? - "To bring the good news to the oppressed. To build up the broken');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 133, 23, 27, 'hearted, to proclaim liberty to the captives and freedom to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 133, 24, 27, 'prisoners" (Is. 61:1).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 133, 25, 27, 'You know, Jesus came to set people free. The devil has come into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 133, 26, 27, 'earth to bring people into bondage, but Jesus came to set people free.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 133, 27, 27, 'He has also come " To grant those who mourn in Zion, to give them a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 133, 28, 27, 'garland instead of ashes and the oil of gladness instead of mourning and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 134, 1, 27, 'the mantle of praise instead of the spirit of fainting" (Is. 61:3).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 134, 2, 27, 'Jesus has come to give us the oil of gladness and the mantle of praise -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 134, 3, 27, 'a garment of praise instead of the spirit of heaviness and depression.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 134, 4, 27, 'Do you know that the spirit of heaviness is not from God? It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 134, 5, 27, 'something that the devil tries to put upon you like a garment. You must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 134, 6, 27, 'just shake it off. You must say, ''In Jesus'' name, I resist you Satan.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 134, 7, 27, 'You can''t put any depression on me. I resist you. I have been crucified');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 134, 8, 27, 'with Christ. The blood of Jesus has cleansed my past life completely. My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 134, 9, 27, 'guilt is gone. You can''t accuse me anymore, Satan.'' Say these words to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 134, 10, 27, 'the devil and reject that spirit of heaviness and depression that Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 134, 11, 27, 'tries to put upon you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 134, 12, 27, 'Jesus has come to cast that spirit out from your life permanently, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 134, 13, 27, 'not just cast it out and leave you naked. If He leaves you naked, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 134, 14, 27, 'clothing of depression will come back on you again. No, He clothes you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 134, 15, 27, 'instead with the garment of praise. That is what it says here: the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 134, 16, 27, 'garment of praise instead of the spirit of heaviness. Isn''t it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 134, 17, 27, 'wonderful? Now, if you can believe this, this is really true. It is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 134, 18, 27, 'the will of God that we should be depressed or discouraged or in a bad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 134, 19, 27, 'mood at any time. It may come like a temptation. We should shake it off');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 134, 20, 27, 'and God will help us to shake it off.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 134, 21, 27, 'What the Bible says in 1 John 2:6 is a very important. I don''t know how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 134, 22, 27, 'many of you know it. "The one who says he abides in Christ, must walk as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 134, 23, 27, 'Jesus walked." In other words, if you say that "you are a Christian,"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 134, 24, 27, 'the Living Bible puts it like this, "You must live as He lived." That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 134, 25, 27, 'our calling; to live as He lived; to walk as He walked. Was Jesus ever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 134, 26, 27, 'depressed? Was He ever discouraged, or in a bad mood at any time? No,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 134, 27, 27, 'never. But one thing about Jesus'' life is that, He took up the Cross.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 134, 28, 27, 'Every day He took up the Cross and He followed in His Father''s will.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 135, 1, 27, 'Now, if we choose that way, this verse will be fulfilled in our life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 135, 2, 27, 'not just occasionally, but every single day; a garment of praise instead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 135, 3, 27, 'of the spirit of heaviness, oil of gladness instead of mourning. It is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 135, 4, 27, 'wonderful life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 135, 5, 27, 'Let me turn to another Psalm. In Psalm 8:2 we read this statement which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 135, 6, 27, 'Jesus quoted once in the temple when the little children were shouting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 135, 7, 27, 'and praising God. We read in Matthew 21: 15-16 about the time when the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 135, 8, 27, 'people held palm branches and lay down their clothes on the road for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 135, 9, 27, 'Jesus to ride on a donkey into Jerusalem. At that time, when Jesus came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 135, 10, 27, 'into the temple, He saw the children that were there yelling and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 135, 11, 27, 'shouting, "Hallelujah,'' ''Hosanna to the Son of David." The Chief Priests');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 135, 12, 27, 'did not like a lot of noise and all that. They believed that the only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 135, 13, 27, 'way to worship God was quietly and seriously as though a funeral was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 135, 14, 27, 'going on. There are people who think like that even today that, the only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 135, 15, 27, 'proper way to praise God is quietly and solemnly as though you were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 135, 16, 27, 'sitting in a funeral.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 135, 17, 27, 'Now I believe with all my heart that there is a way of praising God in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 135, 18, 27, 'silence. But there is also praise that is acceptable to God that comes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 135, 19, 27, 'forth with shouts of joy. The Bible says, "Make a joyful noise unto the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 135, 20, 27, 'Lord". We worship God with shouts of praise and also in solemn silence.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 135, 21, 27, 'It is not just always one or always the other. But here it was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 135, 22, 27, 'absolutely proper for the children to be excited and to praise God. Have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 135, 23, 27, 'you ever seen how people praise those who have just won a cricket match?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 135, 24, 27, 'For example, say, a cricket match is going on between India and Pakistan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 135, 25, 27, 'and India has won. Can you picture how that stadium erupts in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 135, 26, 27, 'excitement. Then why is that Christians don''t seem to be excited about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 135, 27, 27, 'the fact that Jesus has forgiven their sins, that Jesus has defeated the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 135, 28, 27, 'devil, that Jesus overcame everything on the Cross, that Christ is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 136, 1, 27, 'returning in glory and He is going to set up His kingdom on the Earth?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 136, 2, 27, 'People sit with long faces in God''s presence. Jesus was thrilled to hear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 136, 3, 27, 'the noise of praise and so, when the Chief priest criticized those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 136, 4, 27, 'little children praising God, Jesus quoted Psalm 8:2. He said, ''Haven''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 136, 5, 27, 'you read that it says in the Bible, " From the mouth of infants and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 136, 6, 27, 'nursing babes, thou has established strength, because of Thine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 136, 7, 27, 'adversaries, to make the enemy and the revengeful cease. "'' So what do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 136, 8, 27, 'we read there? That praise is the means by which God shuts the mouth of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 136, 9, 27, 'the enemy. That is very important for us to understand. It is through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 136, 10, 27, 'praising God that the mouth of the devil is shut and very often you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 136, 11, 27, 'can''t shut the mouth of the devil in your life or your home, because you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 136, 12, 27, 'don''t praise God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 136, 13, 27, 'The devil hates praise, I will tell you that. He hates praise in a home,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 136, 14, 27, 'he hates praise in a life, and he hates praise in a Church. That is why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 136, 15, 27, 'he makes people so grumpy and long-faced, grumbling and complaining most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 136, 16, 27, 'of the time, because then he can rule in their lives and in their homes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 136, 17, 27, 'Satan cannot stand the sincere shouts of praise to God. That is why he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 136, 18, 27, 'can''t stay in heaven because, in heaven, every angel is yelling and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 136, 19, 27, 'shouting praises to God. How can the devil stand around there? And he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 136, 20, 27, 'can''t stand around in any Church where everybody is praising and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 136, 21, 27, 'shouting and thanking God; he can''t. He can''t be in a home where people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 136, 22, 27, 'are praising God. He can''t sit in a life or in a heart where people are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 136, 23, 27, 'praising God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 136, 24, 27, 'Jesus was so excited when He saw those little children praising God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 136, 25, 27, 'That reminded Him of His home, Heaven. Jesus was used to living in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 136, 26, 27, 'heaven for eternity where He heard the angels praising God with a voice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 136, 27, 27, 'like loud thunders and then when Jesus came to earth and lived in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 136, 28, 27, 'Nazareth, He saw so many people grumbling, complaining, long-faced. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 137, 1, 27, 'felt sad then, but now when He saw a situation like this, where children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 137, 2, 27, 'are shouting and praising God, it reminded Him of His heavenly home.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 137, 3, 27, 'But those religious people just couldn''t understand that. They couldn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 137, 4, 27, 'stand that type of praise. What does that actually prove? They were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 137, 5, 27, 'actually in fellowship with the devil. The devil hated that praise and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 137, 6, 27, 'those religious people hated that praise. How is it in your life? Did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 137, 7, 27, 'you give room to the devil by that spirit of complaining and grumbling?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 137, 8, 27, 'What do we read in Psalm 8, through that expression of praise that came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 137, 9, 27, 'from the mouth of infants? - That it established strength to make the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 137, 10, 27, 'enemy shut his mouth and to make the revengeful person cease.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 137, 11, 27, 'When we look around at Christians today, we can see how Satan has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 137, 12, 27, 'succeeded everywhere. In most places, he does it in 2 ways: One, he will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 137, 13, 27, 'stop the shouts of praise altogether, and that is what he has done in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 137, 14, 27, 'many homes, many churches, and many lives; there is no shout of praise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 137, 15, 27, 'If he doesn''t succeed there, then he has got a second technique, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 137, 16, 27, 'is, where people are praising God, he will make them insincere. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 137, 17, 27, 'means that they will say it with their mouths, but it is not true in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 137, 18, 27, 'their hearts and it is not true in their lives. So, both ways he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 137, 19, 27, 'succeeds.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 137, 20, 27, 'So you have some Churches where they don''t praise God at all and some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 137, 21, 27, 'other churches where it is only a ritual; it is not something which is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 137, 22, 27, 'true in their life all the time, but just praise God on Sunday morning.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 137, 23, 27, 'And then the devil succeeds in both these Churches. But what is God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 137, 24, 27, 'looking for? He is looking for churches, homes, individuals like you who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 137, 25, 27, 'are determined to drive the devil right out of your life, your home and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 137, 26, 27, 'your church by sincere praise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 137, 27, 27, 'Why does Satan hate sincere praise to God? - Because, as we saw in Psalm');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 137, 28, 27, '8, that is how he is going to lose his power over you. Empty shouts of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 138, 1, 27, 'praise, that doesn''t come from a Holy life, that doesn''t come from a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 138, 2, 27, 'sincere heart, don''t have any power. No, but if it comes from a heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 138, 3, 27, 'that is really committed to God, it has tremendous power in it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 138, 4, 27, 'You know, how that the Israelites worshipped the golden calf and they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 138, 5, 27, 'called it Jehovah and they shouted to that Jehovah or what they called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 138, 6, 27, 'Jehovah. So loud that Moses and Joshua heard it at such a long distance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 138, 7, 27, 'away, but that wasn''t real praise. It was empty, it was hollow. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 138, 8, 27, 'was immorality in the midst of that praise and that can happen even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 138, 9, 27, 'today. People can praise God with a loud voice and there can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 138, 10, 27, 'immorality in the midst of all the praise to Jesus. But where it comes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 138, 11, 27, 'from sincerity, there, you can be absolutely certain that it is powerful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 138, 12, 27, 'to drive the devil right out. Why don''t you practice it from today?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 138, 13, 28, 'Chapter 28 The New Song Of Praise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 138, 14, 28, 'We are going to continue to think about this wonderful key that God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 138, 15, 28, 'given us, to drive the devil out and to create a throne for God in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 138, 16, 28, 'hearts and in our homes. That is the key of praising God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 138, 17, 28, 'In the book of Revelation, which is the last book of the Bible, we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 138, 18, 28, 'more glimpses of heaven given to us than in any other book in the whole');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 138, 19, 28, 'Bible. Now it is very sad that many believers don''t read the book of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 138, 20, 28, 'Revelation. The devil doesn''t like you to read it because it is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 138, 21, 28, 'book, in which you read about the devil''s final destiny of being cast');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 138, 22, 28, 'into the lake of fire. The devil certainly does not want you to read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 138, 23, 28, 'about his defeat and his being cast out. But I would encourage you, if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 138, 24, 28, 'you have never done it so far, to really seriously read and meditate on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 138, 25, 28, 'the book of Revelation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 138, 26, 28, 'In that book we have many sevens. It speaks about seven lamps, seven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 138, 27, 28, 'thunders, seven trumpets and many sevens like that. One of those seven''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 138, 28, 28, 'which is not mentioned as seven, but which is hidden throughout the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 139, 1, 28, 'whole book are the seven glimpses of heaven. If you have the patience to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 139, 2, 28, 'meditate on these seven glimpses of heaven, you will see that, in every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 139, 3, 28, 'one of these places, they are praising God. I just want to show you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 139, 4, 28, 'those passages very briefly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 139, 5, 28, 'First of all, in Revelation 4:8-11, the last four verses of Revelation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 139, 6, 28, '4, you find that they are praising God and singing, ''Thou are Worthy''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 139, 7, 28, 'and they cast their crowns before Him. Secondly, again in Chapter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 139, 8, 28, '5:8-14, you find the elders and the living creatures and the angels -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 139, 9, 28, 'millions and millions of angels singing with a loud voice. Notice that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 139, 10, 28, 'they don''t say it softly. Verse 12 says, "With a loud voice they praise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 139, 11, 28, 'God and praise the Lord Jesus Christ, the Lamb of God." Thirdly, we see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 139, 12, 28, 'another example in chapter 7: 9-12. This is the great multitude of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 139, 13, 28, 'people who have been born again, cleansed in the blood of Jesus Christ,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 139, 14, 28, 'who are standing and then again, it says in verse 10, they cry out with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 139, 15, 28, 'a loud voice to Him who sits on the throne, saying, our salvation is due');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 139, 16, 28, 'to God and all the angels also join in that, and they fall down before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 139, 17, 28, 'the throne and worship God, saying, Amen, Blessing and glory and wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 139, 18, 28, 'and thanksgiving and honour and power be to God. And then the fourth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 139, 19, 28, 'sight of heaven, we find in chapter 11:15-18. There we find loud voices');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 139, 20, 28, 'in heaven again saying, the kingdom of this world has become the kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 139, 21, 28, 'of our Lord and of His Christ and we give thanks Oh Lord because You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 139, 22, 28, 'have taken Your great power and have begun to reign. Then we see a fifth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 139, 23, 28, 'picture in chapter 14: 1-4 where we see 144,000 standing with the Lamb');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 139, 24, 28, 'on mount Zion and also singing this new song. The sixth glimpse of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 139, 25, 28, 'heaven is chapter 15:1-4 where we see a sea of glass, and those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 139, 26, 28, 'overcome standing there and with the harps of God. They were singing the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 139, 27, 28, 'Song of Moses and of the Lamb, saying, great and marvellous are Your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 139, 28, 28, 'works, Oh Lord. Then the last glimpse of heaven is in chapter 19:1-6');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 140, 1, 28, 'where there is a loud voice again of a great multitude singing,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 140, 2, 28, 'Hallelujah, Salvation and Glory and Power belong to our God, and Babylon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 140, 3, 28, 'has been judged. And the second time, they said, Hallelujah, give praise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 140, 4, 28, 'to our God. In verse 6 we read, ''This voice of the great multitude was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 140, 5, 28, 'like the sound of many waters and as the sound of mighty peels of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 140, 6, 28, 'thunder.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 140, 7, 28, 'Have you got a little picture of heaven now? What does this heaven and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 140, 8, 28, 'the praise sound like - like thunder? There is not a single angel there,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 140, 9, 28, 'sitting depressed and gloomy or complaining about something, or scared,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 140, 10, 28, 'wondering, what is going to happen to the world next. No, nobody is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 140, 11, 28, 'scared; they are praising God with all of their heart, because they know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 140, 12, 28, 'that God is on the throne. They praise God for His sovereignty, His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 140, 13, 28, 'holiness, His judgment. There is not a single long-faced, gloomy angel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 140, 14, 28, 'anywhere in heaven. You will only find them in hell, not heaven. And the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 140, 15, 28, 'more you are long-faced and gloomy, the more you bring the spirit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 140, 16, 28, 'hell into your lives. And the more you are cheerful and happy,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 140, 17, 28, 'acknowledging that God is on the throne, in your heart, in your home, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 140, 18, 28, 'your Church, and in heaven, the more you bring the spirit of Heaven into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 140, 19, 28, 'your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 140, 20, 28, 'So we see here again and again, in these glimpses of heaven, that people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 140, 21, 28, 'shout Hallelujah and Amen. It is meaningful praise, because they say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 140, 22, 28, 'Hallelujah, because God has done this, or because God is sovereign. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 140, 23, 28, 'worship the God in the beauty of holiness. Now the Holy Spirit has come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 140, 24, 28, 'from heaven into our hearts, to produce within our hearts, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 140, 25, 28, 'atmosphere of heaven. He has come into our homes to produce the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 140, 26, 28, 'atmosphere of heaven in our homes. He comes to our Churches to produce');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 140, 27, 28, 'the atmosphere of Heaven in our Churches. What should it be? It should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 140, 28, 28, 'be an atmosphere of praise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 141, 1, 28, 'Now you may say, well, when I get to heaven, I will start praising the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 141, 2, 28, 'Lord. Well, why has the Holy Spirit come then? He has come to prepare us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 141, 3, 28, 'for heaven. He has come to teach us the language of heaven before we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 141, 4, 28, 'reach there. Now, for example, if you have decided that you are going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 141, 5, 28, 'migrate to, say, France and live in France for the rest of your life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 141, 6, 28, 'what would you do before you go to France? One thing you would certainly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 141, 7, 28, 'do is learn French, the language of France. You won''t wait till you go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 141, 8, 28, 'there. You will like to learn it before you go there. And you know what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 141, 9, 28, 'the language of heaven is? It is the language of praise. It is good for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 141, 10, 28, 'us to learn it now, before we go to heaven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 141, 11, 28, 'It is a language in which there is no grumbling, no complaining, no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 141, 12, 28, 'murmuring concerning anything. It is a language of continuous praise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 141, 13, 28, 'Let''s learn that language now, before we go. We are told in Revelation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 141, 14, 28, '14, one of the passages that we looked at, that there were 144,000');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 141, 15, 28, 'people who sang a new song before the throne. " And no one else could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 141, 16, 28, 'learn that song except these people, and they learnt it while they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 141, 17, 28, 'on Earth" (Rev. 14:3). Now what is this new song that these 144,000');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 141, 18, 28, 'people were singing? We already saw in Revelation 4 and 5 that the new');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 141, 19, 28, 'song is the song of praise and it is a song to God and to the Lord Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 141, 20, 28, 'Christ. What is the old song then, if this is the new song?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 141, 21, 28, 'Well, the old song is the song that everybody sings on earth. The song');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 141, 22, 28, 'of grumbling, complaining against people and circumstances; 1st verse,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 141, 23, 28, '2nd verse, 3rd verse; all verses of the old song is the same; somebody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 141, 24, 28, 'or the other has done something and something or the other has gone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 141, 25, 28, 'wrong. Every day they are singing that same song, verse after verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 141, 26, 28, 'after verse. This has only got one thing; everything is going the bad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 141, 27, 28, 'way and this person is bad and the other person is bad and this person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 141, 28, 28, 'is evil and somebody else has treated me badly and somebody else has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 142, 1, 28, 'cheated me and the circumstances are so bad and it is a time of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 142, 2, 28, 'financial difficulty; it is the same old thing in every single verse.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 142, 3, 28, 'It is the old song, but in the midst of such a world, where everybody is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 142, 4, 28, 'singing that old song, do you know that God wants from you, if you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 142, 5, 28, 'given your life for Christ? God wants you to learn this new song and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 142, 6, 28, 'that is the song of praising Him. Don''t wait till you get to heaven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 142, 7, 28, 'Learn the language now where you say, ''Lord, I know You are on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 142, 8, 28, 'throne,'' and if you are willing, as we saw in one of earlier study, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 142, 9, 28, 'die with Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 142, 10, 28, 'We complain because we don''t have our own ways. Everything doesn''t work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 142, 11, 28, 'out according to our plans, but they are working out according to God''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 142, 12, 28, 'plan. God is on the throne and you are not, that is good. If we were on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 142, 13, 28, 'the throne, we would mess up everything in our lives. Since God is on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 142, 14, 28, 'the throne, He makes everything for good. So when people praise God, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 142, 15, 28, 'Heaven, they are praising God because they believe in His sovereignty.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 142, 16, 28, 'And if we believe in the sovereignty of God, that, God Almighty is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 142, 17, 28, 'ruling this universe, we would also give thanks in everything.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 142, 18, 28, 'I am going to show you three passages in scriptures, from the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 142, 19, 28, 'Testament, about what we are to give thanks for. Now this is not found');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 142, 20, 28, 'in the Old Testament because they did not have the Holy Spirit. You see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 142, 21, 28, 'in the Old Testament, they came together may be on Saturdays in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 142, 22, 28, 'Temple to praise God, and then they go back home for six days of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 142, 23, 28, 'grumbling and complaining and then come back again on next Saturday');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 142, 24, 28, 'morning to praise God in the Temple. Now, that is how many Christians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 142, 25, 28, 'live today. They come on Sunday morning to the church meeting and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 142, 26, 28, 'praise and thank God, and go back home to six days of grumbling and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 142, 27, 28, 'complaining and then come back again the next Sunday morning to praise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 142, 28, 28, 'God. That is an Old Testament life. Well, it is better than nothing, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 143, 1, 28, 'it is hypocritical. It is saying something which is not true in the rest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 143, 2, 28, 'of our life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 143, 3, 28, 'But, in the New Testament, we are told to give thanks always, not just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 143, 4, 28, 'sometimes. First of all , let me show you, 1 Thessalonians 5:18, where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 143, 5, 28, 'it says, " In everything give thanks, for this is the will of God for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 143, 6, 28, 'you in Christ Jesus." So tell me, after reading that verse, how many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 143, 7, 28, 'things should you thank God for? - Everything. How can you give thanks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 143, 8, 28, 'for everything when some of those things don''t appear to be very good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 143, 9, 28, 'for you? Because you believe in Romans 8:28 that, even though that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 143, 10, 28, 'evil, God makes it work for your good. Romans 8:28 is like a filter.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 143, 11, 28, 'Now, some of you may have seen ''Aqua Guard Filter'' which filters the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 143, 12, 28, 'water that comes through the pipeline and, at the end of that system,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 143, 13, 28, 'you get a clean glass of water. That is a water filter with ultra violet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 143, 14, 28, 'rays and candle that removes germs and bacteria. You can put any amount');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 143, 15, 28, 'of dirty water through that and what you get through at the end, is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 143, 16, 28, 'clean water. Romans 8:28 is like that clean water - everything works for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 143, 17, 28, 'good. That is why we give thanks in everything.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 143, 18, 28, 'The second verse in Ephesians 5 where it says, verse is Ephesians 5:20');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 143, 19, 28, 'where it says, "Give thanks for everything, always, for all things"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 143, 20, 28, '(Eph. 5:20). That means all the time and for every single thing, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 143, 21, 28, 'should give thanks. And the last verse is in 1Timothy 2:1 where it says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 143, 22, 28, 'that we are to give thanks for all men. Can you understand it now? - In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 143, 23, 28, 'every situation, for everything, at all times, and for all men.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 143, 24, 28, 'Now when you learn to do that, you learn the new song and you can learn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 143, 25, 28, 'it only on earth. Why? Because in heaven you don''t have difficult');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 143, 26, 28, 'situations, you don''t have difficult people, you don''t face problems,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 143, 27, 28, 'you don''t face trials. So, it is only here on earth that we can learn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 143, 28, 28, 'this wonderful new song - to learn to praise God in every type of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 144, 1, 28, 'situation, with every type of person. Say, ''Lord you are on the throne.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 144, 2, 28, 'Things may be difficult for me, maybe hard even, but you are on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 144, 3, 28, 'throne.'' Let me encourage you, dear friend, to learn this song of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 144, 4, 28, 'praise, now.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 144, 5, 29, 'Chapter 29 Praise Brings Deliverance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 144, 6, 29, 'Once again, we want continue to look at this tremendous power that can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 144, 7, 29, 'come into our lives if we learn how to praise God in all situations.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 144, 8, 29, 'God allows Satan to harass and trouble His children in many ways. Why do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 144, 9, 29, 'you think God allows that? God is wise, and He can destroy Satan in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 144, 10, 29, 'moment, if He likes. But He doesn''t do it, because He accomplishes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 144, 11, 29, 'something good through it. That is why He has permitted Satan to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 144, 12, 29, 'continue to exist. Fire, for example, is dangerous but fire can purify');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 144, 13, 29, 'gold. In the same way, God can use the trials, the persecutions, and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 144, 14, 29, 'oppression that Satan can bring upon His children, to purify them, just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 144, 15, 29, 'like gold is purified. But we have to react in a proper way, in a good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 144, 16, 29, 'way to those trials and temptations.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 144, 17, 29, 'The right way to react, if you have faith, is with a spirit of praise:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 144, 18, 29, '''Lord I will not complain here. I am suffering, perhaps I am going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 144, 19, 29, 'through a difficult time, but I will not lose my faith. God is on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 144, 20, 29, 'throne and the devil is defeated on the cross. My sins are forgiven. My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 144, 21, 29, 'past is blotted out. I am on my way to heaven. Jesus is my Lord; my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 144, 22, 29, 'heavenly bridegroom, and God is making everything work together for my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 144, 23, 29, 'good.'' And when we remain in the spirit of thanksgiving and praise like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 144, 24, 29, 'that, in every situation, you know what happens?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 144, 25, 29, 'I want show you a wonderful verse in Psalm 50. In Psalm 50:23, we read,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 144, 26, 29, '"The one who offers a sacrifice of thanksgiving honours Me, says the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 144, 27, 29, 'Lord, and makes a way for Me to show him My deliverance." That is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 144, 28, 29, 'literal translation of that verse that, anyone who offers a sacrifice of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 145, 1, 29, 'thanksgiving honours God and, in doing that, he makes a way for God to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 145, 2, 29, 'show him God''s deliverance or Salvation. Now what does that mean? It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 145, 3, 29, 'means that if you are in a tight spot right now, and you want God to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 145, 4, 29, 'deliver you from it, you have to make a way for God to show you that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 145, 5, 29, 'deliverance; for God to bring that deliverance. God will do the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 145, 6, 29, 'deliverance, but He cannot do that until you open a way for it and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 145, 7, 29, 'way we open the way is by praising the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 145, 8, 29, 'That is what it says here: ''The one who offers a sacrifice of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 145, 9, 29, 'thanksgiving makes a way for God to bring deliverance in that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 145, 10, 29, 'situation.'' This means that there are many situations out of which we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 145, 11, 29, 'could have been delivered, if we had praised God instead of complaining');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 145, 12, 29, 'against people and against the devil - Because praise is the mark of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 145, 13, 29, 'faith. They believed his words; they sang His praise. If you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 145, 14, 29, 'praise God, God can do nothing for you, because you don''t believe Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 145, 15, 29, '''Without faith, it is impossible to please God,'' we read in Hebrews. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 145, 16, 29, 'with faith you can shut the mouth of lions, you can put enemies to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 145, 17, 29, 'flight, you can open prison doors. With faith, people even got their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 145, 18, 29, 'dead children back to life. Faith is a tremendous power and faith is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 145, 19, 29, 'manifested in praise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 145, 20, 29, 'Now praying alone cannot deliver us out of some situation. It is good to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 145, 21, 29, 'pray when you are in a tight spot but, in addition to prayer, we must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 145, 22, 29, 'learn how to praise. In other words, we must keep on praying until we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 145, 23, 29, 'reach the point where we don''t have to pray anymore. We have an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 145, 24, 29, 'assurance in our heart, the Holy Spirit gives us a witness in our heart,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 145, 25, 29, 'God has heard our prayer and then, what do you do after that? Supposing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 145, 26, 29, 'you are asking for something and, after sometime, you hear a witness in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 145, 27, 29, 'your spirit that it is been granted, what do you do? Then you praise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 145, 28, 29, 'God, you thank Him. Faith is then born and we believe that we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 146, 1, 29, 'received, like Jesus said, "When you pray believe that you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 146, 2, 29, 'received." You can''t do that at the beginning, but as you continue to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 146, 3, 29, 'pray, you come to a point where you believe that you receive. Even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 146, 4, 29, 'though the answer has not yet come, you can''t see the answer yet, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 146, 5, 29, 'you praise God and then we will receive what we pray for. When that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 146, 6, 29, 'point comes, we stop praying and start praising God. That is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 146, 7, 29, 'evidence of faith and then, through that praise, we make a way for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 146, 8, 29, 'God to show us His deliverance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 146, 9, 29, 'Now there is a wonderful example of this in the Old Testament, in 2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 146, 10, 29, 'Chronicles 20. It is unfortunate that some believers don''t read the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 146, 11, 29, 'Testament so much, particularly the Books of Chronicles. They are not so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 146, 12, 29, 'familiar with it. Here is beautiful story where we read of a great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 146, 13, 29, 'multitude of enemies that surrounded King Jehoshaphat. When King');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 146, 14, 29, 'Jehoshaphat was surrounded by such a great multitude of enemies, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 146, 15, 29, 'called the whole nation of Judah too seek God in fasting and prayer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 146, 16, 29, 'That was absolutely a proper thing to do.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 146, 17, 29, 'They prayed to God and, in their prayer, they acknowledged three things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 146, 18, 29, 'You know what they said to God? They acknowledged their helplessness,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 146, 19, 29, 'they acknowledged their foolishness, and then they acknowledged their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 146, 20, 29, 'faith (2 Chr. 20:12). Now these are the three things we need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 146, 21, 29, 'acknowledge too. It is easy to acknowledge our helplessness and our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 146, 22, 29, 'foolishness, to say, ''Well Lord, we have got no strength against this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 146, 23, 29, 'situation and we don''t know what to do.'' We can say that in all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 146, 24, 29, 'situations, but nothing happens, if you stop there. You got go on and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 146, 25, 29, 'say, ''Lord we believe that you will answer us.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 146, 26, 29, 'Now notice the prayer that Jehoshaphat prayed, in 2 Chronicles 20:6-12.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 146, 27, 29, 'You see, this is a pattern for prayer, something that we can learn from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 146, 28, 29, 'Jehoshaphat. Notice the seven things he prayed for. First of all, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 147, 1, 29, 'praised God for His Sovereignty (verse 6). He said, ''Lord you are the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 147, 2, 29, 'ruler over all the kingdoms of the nations; power and might are in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 147, 3, 29, 'hand, no one can stand against you.'' You know when we pray to God, it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 147, 4, 29, 'good to remind ourselves, first of all, of the sovereignty of God. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 147, 5, 29, 'said, ''When you pray, say, ''Our Father,'' and then what, ''who art in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 147, 6, 29, 'Heaven.'' That means the one who is the sovereign ruler from Heaven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 147, 7, 29, 'Then the second thing that Jehoshaphat reminded God and reminded himself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 147, 8, 29, 'of was what God had done in past days. ''Lord, are You not the one who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 147, 9, 29, 'drove out the Canaanites from this land and You gave it to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 147, 10, 29, 'descendants of Abraham forever'' (verse 7). See, if we remind ourselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 147, 11, 29, 'of what God has done for us in the past, then that really stirs our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 147, 12, 29, 'faith. You know, sometimes you are facing a very difficult situation and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 147, 13, 29, 'you feel there is no way out. Why don''t you look back over your life and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 147, 14, 29, 'think of the many, many, many times in your life where you felt that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 147, 15, 29, 'there was no way out, and God made a way out! That stirs up faith in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 147, 16, 29, 'your heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 147, 17, 29, 'Then the third thing we read is that Jehoshaphat reminded God of His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 147, 18, 29, 'promise in His word. He said, ''Didn''t you say Lord that, if evil comes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 147, 19, 29, 'upon us or the sword and, if we stand before You in this house and cry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 147, 20, 29, 'to You, You will deliver us'' (verse 9). And that is another good thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 147, 21, 29, 'to have when we are in a tight situation - some promise from the word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 147, 22, 29, 'God. It could be a simple promise like we have in Psalm 50 which says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 147, 23, 29, '''Call upon me in the day of trouble and I will deliver you.'' Say, ''Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 147, 24, 29, 'you promise that''. Do it now. It is good to know the promises of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 147, 25, 29, 'Scriptures. It is good to memorize the promises of God in Scriptures so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 147, 26, 29, 'that you can quote them in prayer. It strengthens faith; it is fuel for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 147, 27, 29, 'faith. You know, it is like putting fuel in the fire, then the fire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 147, 28, 29, 'burns brighter. If you don''t have any promises then the fire of faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 148, 1, 29, 'burns very low.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 148, 2, 29, 'Fourthly, we read in verse 11 that he reminded God saying, ''We are your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 148, 3, 29, 'inheritance.'' We are not just like other people in the world. We are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 148, 4, 29, 'your inheritance, You purchased us. That is the fourth thing we can tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 148, 5, 29, 'God too. '' Lord you purchased us on Calvary; the blood of Jesus has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 148, 6, 29, 'purchased me. I am God''s inheritance''. You are God''s inheritance,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 148, 7, 29, 'purchased by the blood of Jesus Christ on the cross.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 148, 8, 29, 'Fifthly, he told God, what we already saw: ''Lord we are powerless, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 148, 9, 29, 'we are weak'' (verse 12). That is another thing we need to acknowledge.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 148, 10, 29, 'Sometimes we think that we are very strong, but we are actually weak. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 148, 11, 29, 'is good for us to acknowledge it. Say, ''Lord, I am weak, I can''t handle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 148, 12, 29, 'the situation, and it is too much for me.'' Then sixthly, in the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 148, 13, 29, 'verse 12, he said, ''Lord, not only I am weak, I don''t have any wisdom as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 148, 14, 29, 'to what to do in this situation''. That is also good for us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 148, 15, 29, 'acknowledge. Instead of thinking that we are clever and capable, say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 148, 16, 29, '''Lord, I don''t have any wisdom.'' The Bible says in James 1, "Does anyone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 148, 17, 29, 'l ack wisdom among you, let him ask God. God will give him liberally"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 148, 18, 29, '(Jas. 1:5). But you got to be humble and say, ''Lord, I don''t know how to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 148, 19, 29, 'handle this situation.'' Finally, the seventh (this is where you must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 148, 20, 29, 'finish), he said, ''But our eyes are on you; we are trusting in you.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 148, 21, 29, 'Let me go through those seven things. First of all, he praised God for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 148, 22, 29, 'His sovereignty (verse6). Secondly, he reminded himself of what God had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 148, 23, 29, 'done in past days (verse 7). Third, he reminded God of His promise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 148, 24, 29, '(verse 9). Fourth, he reminded God that we are your inheritance (verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 148, 25, 29, '11) and then in verse 12, he reminded God of three things: first, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 148, 26, 29, 'have no power to handle this, we have no wisdom, but we are relying on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 148, 27, 29, 'you; we are trusting in you completely.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 148, 28, 29, 'We read in the rest of that chapter (take time to read it) that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 149, 1, 29, 'enemies were thoroughly defeated. They went out praising God. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 149, 2, 29, 'didn''t take any weapons; neither bows nor arrows. They just went our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 149, 3, 29, 'praising the Lord. Jehoshaphat believed God and he sent a choir of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 149, 4, 29, 'people praising God. We read in verse 22,"As they began singing and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 149, 5, 29, 'praising the Lord," exactly like we saw in Psalm 50:23, the Lord opened');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 149, 6, 29, 'the door for them to be delivered and the enemies were defeated. Not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 149, 7, 29, 'only the enemies were defeated, we read later on in that chapter, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 149, 8, 29, 'that Israel became rich with the wealth of their enemies. This is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 149, 9, 29, 'secret. Whatever situation you are in, learn to praise God on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 149, 10, 29, 'foundation of these seven things that I have mentioned and you will find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 149, 11, 29, 'God opens a door for you to be set free.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 149, 12, 30, 'Chapter 30 Praise Opens Closed Doors');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 149, 13, 30, 'We will have one more study on this wonderful key of praise which opens');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 149, 14, 30, 'every door and which can set us free from situations that are like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 149, 15, 30, 'prisons.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 149, 16, 30, 'In our last study we were looking at 2 Chronicles 20. It is one of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 149, 17, 30, 'finest illustrations, in the entire Bible, on how the spirit of praise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 149, 18, 30, 'can defeat the enemy and deliver you from situations when you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 149, 19, 30, 'surrounded by problems which you don''t know how to handle. Faith always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 149, 20, 30, 'brings praise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 149, 21, 30, 'Jesus said, ''If you believe, nothing will be impossible to you.'' When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 149, 22, 30, 'you trust in God, you will never be disappointed. Man may disappoint');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 149, 23, 30, 'you, but God will never disappoint you. He may take time to answer your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 149, 24, 30, 'prayer, and take time before He solves your problem, and opens the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 149, 25, 30, 'prison door, but He will definitely do it, one day. He doesn''t want His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 149, 26, 30, 'children to be bound. He wants His children to be free in their spirits.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 149, 27, 30, 'In their bodies, they may be locked up. Paul was locked up; Peter was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 149, 28, 30, 'locked up; they were even killed. But in your spirit, God always wants');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 150, 1, 30, 'you to be like the birds in the air, flying, like the eagles flying in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 150, 2, 30, 'the air, and that comes through the spirit of praise. You know an eagle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 150, 3, 30, 'flapping its wings, and rising up is a picture of a Christian praising');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 150, 4, 30, 'God with all his heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 150, 5, 30, 'I want to point out one or two things to you from 2 Chronicles 20 where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 150, 6, 30, 'Jehoshaphat was surrounded by so many enemies that they were far too');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 150, 7, 30, 'many for him to handle. God allows us to face situations, where we see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 150, 8, 30, 'that we are absolutely helpless, we are weak. Once, when Jesus spoke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 150, 9, 30, 'about prayer, He pictured the church as a poor, helpless, old widow who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 150, 10, 30, 'was being harassed by some enemy (Lk. 18). Can you picture this in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 150, 11, 30, 'mind? - A poor, helpless, old widow being harassed by some strong man or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 150, 12, 30, 'men, and she has no man in the house, no husband, no sons and she');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 150, 13, 30, 'doesn''t know what to do. These men are harassing her, maybe for rent, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 150, 14, 30, 'turning her out of the house, or not giving her own property back,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 150, 15, 30, 'something like that. She goes to a judge and asks the judge to help her.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 150, 16, 30, 'Now, what is the picture we have here of the Church? The Church is not a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 150, 17, 30, 'strong muscular ''He-man''. No, Jesus pictured the Church like a helpless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 150, 18, 30, 'widow. Are we like that? Yes, we are. God has made the Church weak on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 150, 19, 30, 'earth, so that it will depend on the Lord. You know, in the early days,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 150, 20, 30, 'the Christians were thrown to the lions. Well, they couldn''t defend');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 150, 21, 30, 'themselves physically against the might of the Roman Empire but, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 150, 22, 30, 'their spirits, they were free. God allows us to be weak, because it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 150, 23, 30, 'only when we are weak that we can exercise faith in Him. Otherwise, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 150, 24, 30, 'tend to depend on our resources. So, God allowed so many enemies to come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 150, 25, 30, 'around Jehoshaphat, and we read in 2 Chronicles 20:2, He said, ''Lord we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 150, 26, 30, 'are powerless.'' Now, if 1 or 2 enemies had come, he wouldn''t have said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 150, 27, 30, 'that, but God allowed so many to come. He told the Lord, ‘We are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 150, 28, 30, 'helpless, we just can''t handle this.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 151, 1, 30, 'When you are defeated by sin, overcome by Satan, you say, that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 151, 2, 30, 'because you are weak. No, my friend, it is not because you are weak, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 151, 3, 30, 'is because you are strong! You are so strong. That is why you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 151, 4, 30, 'defeated. If you were weak, you would turn to God and you would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 151, 5, 30, 'experience God''s help and you would be an overcomer. Only weak people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 151, 6, 30, 'can praise God. Strong people praise themselves. So, we see only a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 151, 7, 30, 'strong person has got strong opinions, he speaks strong stinging words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 151, 8, 30, 'to other people and he is quick to judge other people. Are you like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 151, 9, 30, 'that? Then you are not weak, a weak person is not like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 151, 10, 30, 'Supposing that you go to a hospital and you see a man with tubes in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 151, 11, 30, 'mouth and nose and he is helpless, hardly able to speak, that is a weak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 151, 12, 30, 'person. You don''t see him there criticizing others. No, it is only when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 151, 13, 30, 'he gets healthy and stronger again that he starts blaming others,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 151, 14, 30, 'blaming the doctors and the nurses and his enemies and relatives. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 151, 15, 30, 'starts speaking stinging words and judging others when he has recovered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 151, 16, 30, 'his strength, but when he is weak, he doesn''t'' say a thing. He is just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 151, 17, 30, 'lying there, helpless.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 151, 18, 30, 'What are you like, aren''t you strong? It is strong people that are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 151, 19, 30, 'defeated. Because, we read in 2 Corinthians 12:9, God says, "My strength');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 151, 20, 30, 'is made perfect in weak people." That is why God allows us to become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 151, 21, 30, 'weak. When you argue and dispute with people, are you weak or strong?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 151, 22, 30, 'You are strong, and strong people are easy targets for Satan. He always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 151, 23, 30, 'wins the battle with those who argue. That is how he won the battle with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 151, 24, 30, 'Eve. So, God allows us to become weak.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 151, 25, 30, 'That is what we learn in the story of Lazarus. We read that when Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 151, 26, 30, 'got a message that Lazarus was dying, He said, ''We will just wait a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 151, 27, 30, 'little longer and go on to see him later.'' Why would He do that? -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 151, 28, 30, 'Because as long as Lazarus was sick, he was still a bit strong.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 152, 1, 30, 'Gradually his strength weakened and weakened until one day he died. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 152, 2, 30, 'he had become really weak and died God raised him up. What is the lesson');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 152, 3, 30, 'from that? That God has to make us weak before he can do His work in us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 152, 4, 30, 'When Jehoshaphat came to that place and said, ''We are powerless, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 152, 5, 30, 'don''t know what to do, but our eyes are on You; we are expecting You to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 152, 6, 30, 'work on our behalf'' (2 Chronicles 20:12), God acted.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 152, 7, 30, 'Now there are three categories of believers in the world. Pay attention');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 152, 8, 30, 'to what I am saying and see which category you belong to! First - those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 152, 9, 30, 'who have a tremendous confidence in themselves. They are very strong,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 152, 10, 30, 'they know the Bible, they pray and fast, they are capable, and they have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 152, 11, 30, 'a lot of confidence in themselves; in their own abilities. Or, it maybe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 152, 12, 30, 'that they don''t pray, they don''t fast but they are strong in themselves,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 152, 13, 30, 'they have powerful personalities. Such believers can never do any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 152, 14, 30, 'eternal work for God. There is a second category of believers and they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 152, 15, 30, 'are those who have no confidence in themselves and no confidence in God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 152, 16, 30, 'either. They may say they have no strength, they are weak, they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 152, 17, 30, 'helpless, they are sinners, they are good for nothing, but at the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 152, 18, 30, 'time they also don''t believe that God will ever do anything with them or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 152, 19, 30, 'through them, because they feel God cannot do much. Such believers are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 152, 20, 30, 'also useless to God. Now, here is the third category of believers, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 152, 21, 30, 'ones those are really useful to God - those who have no confidence in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 152, 22, 30, 'themselves but total confidence in God. Those who say like Jehoshaphat,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 152, 23, 30, '''We have no strength, we have no wisdom, but we trust You , Lord. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 152, 24, 30, 'don''t know how to handle this situation but we trust You to handle it.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 152, 25, 30, 'Remember this: just to say, we are weak doesn''t solve the problem. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 152, 26, 30, 'must also trust God. Without faith, it is impossible to please Him. To');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 152, 27, 30, 'merely confess that we are rotten, good for nothing and foolish is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 152, 28, 30, 'humility; that is just unbelief. Jesus never confessed that type of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 153, 1, 30, 'thing. Jesus was the humblest person to walk down the earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 153, 2, 30, 'It is when they finally said, ''Lord, we trust you,'' we read t hat a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 153, 3, 30, 'prophet got up there and God sent His message through him saying, ''Don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 153, 4, 30, 'be afraid, the battle is not yours, but God''s. You don''t have to fight');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 153, 5, 30, 'in this battle; stand still and see the salvation of the Lord on your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 153, 6, 30, 'behalf" (2 Chr. 20:15, 17). Stand still and see what God is going to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 153, 7, 30, 'for you: to whom does God speak such words today? To those who say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 153, 8, 30, '''Lord, we are weak, but we are trusting in You.'' They will never ever be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 153, 9, 30, 'disappointed or put to shame. You know that there is a wonderful promise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 153, 10, 30, 'in Romans 9:33, ".... He who believes in the Lord will never be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 153, 11, 30, 'disappointed." What a wonderful verse! So, they went out, and we read in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 153, 12, 30, '2 Chronicles 20, that they began to praise the Lord and the enemy was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 153, 13, 30, 'thoroughly defeated.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 153, 14, 30, 'Now we see another example of this in the book of Jonah. You know the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 153, 15, 30, 'story of Jonah, don''t you? He was disobeying God and running away from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 153, 16, 30, 'God. He got onto a ship to go in the opposite direction of where God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 153, 17, 30, 'wanted him to go. God stopped him by getting those people to throw him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 153, 18, 30, 'out of that ship. As soon as he was thrown out of the ship, there was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 153, 19, 30, 'big fish that swallowed him up. We read that in Jonah 1:17, " The Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 153, 20, 30, 'appointed a great fish to swallow Jonah and he was in the stomach of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 153, 21, 30, 'fish for three days and three nights." What did he do during those three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 153, 22, 30, 'days and three nights, we are not told. Perhaps, he was struggling to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 153, 23, 30, 'get out of that fish''s stomach, because it says in Chapter 2:1, ''Then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 153, 24, 30, 'after three days and three nights, he began to pray.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 153, 25, 30, 'Now very often that is how we are too. When we get into a problem, maybe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 153, 26, 30, 'in some type of fish''s belly, we have got ourselves locked up in. In the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 153, 27, 30, 'beginning, we don''t pray. We try to get out in some way or the other,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 153, 28, 30, 'sometimes for many days or weeks. And when everything fails, we start to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 154, 1, 30, 'pray and that is what Jonah also did. For three days and three nights,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 154, 2, 30, 'he did nothing. He tried but every time he tried to get out of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 154, 3, 30, 'whale''s mouth, he just slipped back in. And then he began to pray. Like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 154, 4, 30, 'I said before, God waits till we come to the end of ourselves. The same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 154, 5, 30, 'lesson is here.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 154, 6, 30, 'Then Jonah prayed and he prayed and he prayed and he prayed and still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 154, 7, 30, 'nothing happened. That is another thing we see. Finally, we see, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 154, 8, 30, 'verse 9, that he began to thank the Lord. He said, ''''With the voice of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 154, 9, 30, 'thanksgiving, I will sacrifice to you" and then we read in verse 10 that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 154, 10, 30, 'the Lord commanded the fish to vomit Jonah out in the dry land. When did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 154, 11, 30, 'the Lord command the fish to do that? - When Jonah began to praise the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 154, 12, 30, 'Lord. This is the fulfilment of Psalm of 50:23: ''''He that offers the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 154, 13, 30, 'sacrifice of thanksgiving makes a way, by which I can show him My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 154, 14, 30, 'deliverance," the same thing is mentioned here in Jonah 2:9.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 154, 15, 30, 'Look at another final example in Acts 16. There we read of the Apostles');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 154, 16, 30, 'Paul and Silas, being locked up in the jail. What did they do in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 154, 17, 30, 'jail? Instead of sleeping and instead of complaining and grumbling, they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 154, 18, 30, 'began to praise the Lord. In Acts 16:25-26, we read, "And as they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 154, 19, 30, 'praising the Lord, the Lord opened the prison doors." Again, a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 154, 20, 30, 'fulfilment of that promise!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 154, 21, 30, 'My dear friends, the key to every fish''s mouth is in God''s hands; to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 154, 22, 30, 'every prison door, to every situation you are in. If you praise Him and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 154, 23, 30, 'stop complaining, He can open every door. There is no door that the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 154, 24, 30, 'cannot open. Miracles happen when you begin to praise God in faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 154, 25, 31, 'Chapter 31 God’s Purpose For Man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 154, 26, 31, 'In the first chapter of Genesis, the very first page of the Bible, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 154, 27, 31, 'gives us the reason why He created man. Because man has completely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 154, 28, 31, 'forgotten about that, throughout the world men and women face problems');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 155, 1, 31, 'for which they don''t know what the solutions are. They don''t seem to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 155, 2, 31, 'find meaning and purpose in life. Well, you never find it until you come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 155, 3, 31, 'back to what God says in His word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 155, 4, 31, 'You know the Bible is really like a book of instructions - an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 155, 5, 31, 'instruction manual. If you buy a tape recorder, or a washing machine, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 155, 6, 31, 'some expensive electronic gadget, along with that you will get a little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 155, 7, 31, 'booklet. This booklet is the manufacturer''s instructions on how to use');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 155, 8, 31, 'this particular gadget that you have bought. If you are wise, you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 155, 9, 31, 'just follow the instructions in that booklet exactly. You won''t change a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 155, 10, 31, 'single thing, because you realise what? You realise that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 155, 11, 31, 'manufacturer knows better than you; how that product was made, how it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 155, 12, 31, 'supposed to run. If there are certain special warnings given saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 155, 13, 31, '''Don''t do this, don''t plug this in here or don''t put a jack into this,''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 155, 14, 31, 'I am sure you would not experiment. You would just obey because you may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 155, 15, 31, 'blow up a Rs. 10,000 or Rs. 20,000 worth of equipment. You certainly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 155, 16, 31, 'don''t want to lose that much money. You would experiment with things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 155, 17, 31, 'that are cheaper, but not with something very expensive.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 155, 18, 31, 'Now what is the value of your life? A human life is far more than 20,000');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 155, 19, 31, 'Rupees, far more than many lakhs. In fact, once Jesus said, ''What shall');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 155, 20, 31, 'it profit a man if he gains the whole world and loses his own soul?'' In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 155, 21, 31, 'saying so, He took a balance and placed the whole world with all its');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 155, 22, 31, 'wealth, all its glory, and honour on one side, and one human soul on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 155, 23, 31, 'other side. And He said that one human soul was heavier. He weighed more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 155, 24, 31, 'than the entire world. So you are very valuable. Then how is it that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 155, 25, 31, 'man, who is so valuable, is so careless with following his Maker''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 155, 26, 31, 'instructions when it comes to how to run his life? That is the tragedy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 155, 27, 31, 'If you want to know why there is so much chaos in the world and why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 155, 28, 31, 'things have gotten to a real mess, here is the answer: God gave man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 156, 1, 31, 'certain instructions and he never followed them. That is the reason for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 156, 2, 31, 'confusion in the world, in individual lives, in families, and between');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 156, 3, 31, 'nations.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 156, 4, 31, 'So let us look at Genesis 1. We read here about the time when God made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 156, 5, 31, 'different things on this earth. Each day He made something new. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 156, 6, 31, 'whenever He made any of the things, He never told us the purpose with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 156, 7, 31, 'which He made them. For example, on the first day He created light. What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 156, 8, 31, 'is the purpose? Well, we don''t know. We can guess, but God never said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 156, 9, 31, 'what the reason was. The next day, He created the heavens. No purpose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 156, 10, 31, 'mentioned. The following day He created the dry lands, and the plants');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 156, 11, 31, 'and the trees, no purpose mentioned there and so on. And also with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 156, 12, 31, 'animals, the fish and the birds! But when it came to making man,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 156, 13, 31, 'finally, before He even started making man He said, "Let us make man in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 156, 14, 31, 'Our image according to Our likeness. And let them rule over the fish in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 156, 15, 31, 'the sea or the birds on the sky."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 156, 16, 31, 'So we see the first purpose with which God created man was that man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 156, 17, 31, 'should show forth the likeness of God. That means if man moved around,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 156, 18, 31, 'you could see what God was like, because God is a Spirit and invisible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 156, 19, 31, 'God wanted His character to be manifested through a created being. Now,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 156, 20, 31, 'in an earlier study, we had considered how God had made the angels');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 156, 21, 31, 'before He made man. But there is no evidence in the Bible that God made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 156, 22, 31, 'the angels in His image. No angels could manifest the likeness of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 156, 23, 31, 'That is a unique privilege that God gave to man. Man was made in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 156, 24, 31, 'likeness of God to show forth God''s own image and character.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 156, 25, 31, 'Once we understand this, we would see that the whole purpose of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 156, 26, 31, 'dying for us and redeeming us was in order that we might be brought back');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 156, 27, 31, 'to God''s original purpose for us. Supposing we were to draw this in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 156, 28, 31, 'graphical form: think of God''s purpose for man being like a straight');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 157, 1, 31, 'line going slightly upwards, because God''s purpose for man was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 157, 2, 31, 'progressive. That was God''s purpose that man should progress in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 157, 3, 31, 'straight line going upwards. But somewhere in the beginning of that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 157, 4, 31, 'straight line, Adam fell. So you never progress. You just dip straight');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 157, 5, 31, 'down. Now let that line go downwards to a pit. What did Jesus do? He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 157, 6, 31, 'came down to the pit, where man was, and lifted him back up to that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 157, 7, 31, 'straight line.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 157, 8, 31, 'Now man is being brought back to that straight line of God''s purpose for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 157, 9, 31, 'man. So the whole purpose of God for man is not fulfilled in Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 157, 10, 31, 'lifting us up from our sin and our failure. No, that is only bringing us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 157, 11, 31, 'back to the place where Adam was when he fell. It is restoring the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 157, 12, 31, 'failure of Adam; bringing man back to the place where he was before he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 157, 13, 31, 'fell. But then, now we need to understand what God''s purpose is, what is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 157, 14, 31, 'the straight line? That is to reflect His likeness. So, it is not enough');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 157, 15, 31, 'to say that your sins are forgiven. Many Christians are just happy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 157, 16, 31, 'saying, ''Well, my sins are forgiven.'' That is like saying, ''Well, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 157, 17, 31, 'lifted me up from the pit and brought me up to the straight line.'' But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 157, 18, 31, 'what about progressing along that straight line? We need to understand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 157, 19, 31, 'what that means. It means growing in likeness to Jesus Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 157, 20, 31, 'You know, when Jesus came to Earth, He didn''t come only to die for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 157, 21, 31, 'sins of the world. That is only part of His purpose in coming to Earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 157, 22, 31, 'His death from the cross was just an act that lasted for six hours on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 157, 23, 31, 'one day. That was it. And He died, He was buried, and He rose again on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 157, 24, 31, 'the third day. But the life that He lived for 33 years, what was that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 157, 25, 31, 'supposed to demonstrate? That was supposed to demonstrate how God wanted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 157, 26, 31, 'man to live on this earth. Jesus'' life was a demonstration of how God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 157, 27, 31, 'wanted man to live. So, if you want to know how you are supposed to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 157, 28, 31, 'live. It is very easy. You just got to look at the life of Jesus Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 158, 1, 31, 'as described in the Bible. There you have not just in words, but a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 158, 2, 31, 'living demonstration.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 158, 3, 31, 'See in the Old Testament, there is no example that God gave man. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 158, 4, 31, 'gave commandments. Everybody knows the Ten Commandments, which is also a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 158, 5, 31, 'picture of how God wanted man to live. But it was a very faint picture-');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 158, 6, 31, 'very, very incomplete. All the laws that God gave man about mutual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 158, 7, 31, 'relationships and everything else were all a faint picture. Jesus summed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 158, 8, 31, 'up the Old Testament Law with two sentences. He said the whole law can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 158, 9, 31, 'be summed up in "You shall love the Lord your God with all your heart,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 158, 10, 31, 'soul, strength and mind and you shall love your neighbour as yourself."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 158, 11, 31, 'In those two verses, those two sentences, the entire duty of man is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 158, 12, 31, 'summed up. But it is far better to have an example that shows us how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 158, 13, 31, 'this is to be done.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 158, 14, 31, 'Consider if I were to try and teach you swimming. There are two ways in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 158, 15, 31, 'which I could do it. One is, I could explain to you, on a blackboard, by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 158, 16, 31, 'drawing various diagrams on how you must move your hands, how you must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 158, 17, 31, 'move your legs, tec. And then say, ''Okay, now go and jump in the river,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 158, 18, 31, 'and follow the instructions that you saw on the blackboard and swim.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 158, 19, 31, 'You are not going to learn to swim that way. Even if you study very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 158, 20, 31, 'carefully all the diagrams I drew on the blackboard, you will still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 158, 21, 31, 'probably drown. That is a very poor way. But if I were to take you to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 158, 22, 31, 'the river and say, ''Well, now just watch me as I swim. Just do exactly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 158, 23, 31, 'what I do.'' That is the way you will learn. You see instruction is never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 158, 24, 31, 'as good as example. Any amount of instruction on any subject is never as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 158, 25, 31, 'good as an example.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 158, 26, 31, 'We could say the Old Testament was instruction. In the New Testament, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 158, 27, 31, 'have an example. Jesus Christ demonstrated, through His life, what it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 158, 28, 31, 'means to be a human being; how we are supposed to live. When the Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 159, 1, 31, 'says we are not under the law, what does it mean? It means we don''t need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 159, 2, 31, 'the blackboard now, because we got an example in Jesus Christ. But, if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 159, 3, 31, 'you don''t have Jesus Christ as your example, then you certainly need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 159, 4, 31, 'go back to the law. The mistake that a lot of Christians have made is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 159, 5, 31, 'that they say, ''We are free form the law. We don''t need the Ten');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 159, 6, 31, 'Commandments. We don''t need the instructions of God.'' Fine, provided');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 159, 7, 31, 'Jesus Christ becomes your example. But if Jesus does not become your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 159, 8, 31, 'example, then you need the law very much so.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 159, 9, 31, 'And so, what does it mean to come under grace; to be free from the law?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 159, 10, 31, 'It means that I have now seen Jesus as my example, who lived on earth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 159, 11, 31, 'manifesting the nature of God so perfectly. He turned around to His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 159, 12, 31, 'disciples just before He went to the cross and said, ''If you have seen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 159, 13, 31, 'Me, you have seen the Father.'' If you have seen the way I have lived,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 159, 14, 31, 'what I lived for, you have seen what God was like. You have seen that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 159, 15, 31, 'God is kind. You have seen that God is pure. He is holy, loving, humble,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 159, 16, 31, 'everything.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 159, 17, 31, 'Our calling now is to show forth that same nature of God. You know what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 159, 18, 31, 'we read in Genesis 1:26. God''s original plan for man was to reflect His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 159, 19, 31, 'likeness; to manifest His nature. Now that calling comes to you and me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 159, 20, 31, 'This is why God has given us the Holy Spirit, so that, through the power');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 159, 21, 31, 'of the Holy Spirit, we can show forth God''s nature in our daily life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 159, 22, 32, 'Chapter 32 Humility In Jesus Coming To Earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 159, 23, 32, 'The first thing that we could say that we see in the life of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 159, 24, 32, 'Christ, when He lived on this Earth, is His deep humility.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 159, 25, 32, 'Man is basically proud. We are proud of many things. We are proud of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 159, 26, 32, 'race, our upbringing, and our family tree, perhaps. We can be proud of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 159, 27, 32, 'our education, our good looks, our intelligence, our capabilities. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 159, 28, 32, 'can be proud of our talents, our gifts, and our positions, maybe our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 160, 1, 32, 'house or car, influential friends or it could be anything. But when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 160, 2, 32, 'Jesus came to Earth, He took the lowest place that any man could ever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 160, 3, 32, 'take. He came as a servant of everyone, even though He was God; He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 160, 4, 32, 'God manifest in human form. That is where we see the greatness of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 160, 5, 32, 'God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 160, 6, 32, 'You know we can see the greatness of God in creation. The stars, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 160, 7, 32, 'planets, and so many wonderful things like the snowflakes, the little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 160, 8, 32, 'atoms which eye can''t even see. All these things contain the wonder of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 160, 9, 32, 'God. But to the one who reads the Scriptures, to the true disciples of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 160, 10, 32, 'Jesus Christ, the greatness is not seen in these wonders of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 160, 11, 32, 'universe. It is seen in the humility with which God came to earth in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 160, 12, 32, 'human form, emptying Himself of the privileges and powers that He had as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 160, 13, 32, 'God and identifying with our fallen race.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 160, 14, 32, 'The Bible says, in John 1:14 that the Word became flesh and dwelt among');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 160, 15, 32, 'us and we beheld His glory. That glory, we can say, was far greater than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 160, 16, 32, 'the glory seen in the creation of the sun, moon, and stars. God came and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 160, 17, 32, 'dwelt as one of us. He didn''t come in a condescending, patronizing way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 160, 18, 32, 'as our benefactor, you know, showing that He is a great person. No,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 160, 19, 32, 'instead humbling Himself to be with us. He came with real humility');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 160, 20, 32, 'making Himself one with us in every way. He was made like His brothers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 160, 21, 32, 'in all things. Once we see this glory of His humility, we would see that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 160, 22, 32, 'there is far greater glory in that than even in the wonderful miracles');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 160, 23, 32, 'that Jesus did when He was on the earth. Here is the first area that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 160, 24, 32, 'need to see how God wants man to live.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 160, 25, 32, 'In the life of Jesus, we have an example. God has given us an example on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 160, 26, 32, 'how God wants man to live. There was not an atom of pride in our Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 160, 27, 32, 'Jesus Christ. He never imposed Himself on people. He never made people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 160, 28, 32, 'dread Him as if He was somebody far superior to them. He was far');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 161, 1, 32, 'superior to every single one. He was also their creator, the Almighty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 161, 2, 32, 'God. But He hid all that glory; it was all concealed in that flesh in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 161, 3, 32, 'which He came and He lived just like any other ordinary man. He would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 161, 4, 32, 'call Himself the Son of man meaning, I am just an ordinary man. There we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 161, 5, 32, 'see the greatness of God. He humbled himself. God wants man to live in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 161, 6, 32, 'humility.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 161, 7, 32, 'In one of our earlier studies, we have considered how evil came to this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 161, 8, 32, 'universe through Lucifer, the head of the angels, seeking to exult');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 161, 9, 32, 'himself in pride. Because he was perfect in wisdom and beauty, Lucifer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 161, 10, 32, 'began to be proud of it. He sought to go still further up, and even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 161, 11, 32, 'exult himself above God Almighty. As soon as such a thought entered into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 161, 12, 32, 'Satan''s heart, God immediately cast him down. God is always against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 161, 13, 32, 'pride, wherever He finds it. The Bible says God resists the proud. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 161, 14, 32, 'you are a proud person, it doesn''t matter what you are proud of, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 161, 15, 32, 'will find that God is resisting you all the time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 161, 16, 32, 'Now the word ''resist'' is the opposite of support. God does not support');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 161, 17, 32, 'proud people and not only that, He resists them; He fights against them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 161, 18, 32, 'That is why Satan was cast out. There could be no pride in heaven. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 161, 19, 32, 'Satan was cast down and man was created, Satan decided to infect man as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 161, 20, 32, 'well with the same pride with which he was infected. And now the human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 161, 21, 32, 'race is infected with his pride.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 161, 22, 32, 'Every child born into this world was born with this infection of pride.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 161, 23, 32, 'That is why, from that time he can do anything, he begins to fight to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 161, 24, 32, 'assert himself and seek his own. To save man from this wretched pride,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 161, 25, 32, 'to redeem man from this poison Jesus came and humbled Himself. So just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 161, 26, 32, 'like our sin originated in the pride of Lucifer, all sin originated in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 161, 27, 32, 'the pride of Lucifer. In the same way, redemption originated in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 161, 28, 32, 'self-humbling of Jesus Christ. See these are two completely different');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 162, 1, 32, 'spirits that are operating in the world. We need to understand it. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 162, 2, 32, 'is the spirit of pride, always seeking to exult itself, push other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 162, 3, 32, 'people down, show that we are greater, and then there is the spirit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 162, 4, 32, 'humility of Jesus always seeking to go down.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 162, 5, 32, 'So it is very easy for you to know how much of the mind of Christ you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 162, 6, 32, 'have in your own life. Here is the answer. You have as much of the mind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 162, 7, 32, 'of Christ in you as you have of his humility. That is the infallible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 162, 8, 32, 'gauge of spiritual growth. You are growing spiritually if you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 162, 9, 32, 'growing in humility, that is and no more than that and not when you grow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 162, 10, 32, 'in Bible knowledge. A lot of people think that spiritual growth means,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 162, 11, 32, '''I am growing in the knowledge of the Bible, I am growing in usefulness,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 162, 12, 32, 'I am growing in serving God here, there and everywhere.'' Well, that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 162, 13, 32, 'not really the infallible gauge. You can be mistaken. There are a lot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 162, 14, 32, 'people who are serving, and they are not really growing. They are more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 162, 15, 32, 'active, but they are not really growing spiritually. The person that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 162, 16, 32, 'growing spiritually will always become more and more humble.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 162, 17, 32, 'When you look at Jesus, the very fact that He came down from heaven to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 162, 18, 32, 'earth - God became man -itself would be a tremendous demonstration of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 162, 19, 32, 'humility. But He didn''t stop there. When He became a man, He refused to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 162, 20, 32, 'be a King. Now, if Jesus had come from heaven and become the greatest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 162, 21, 32, 'King on earth, it would still have been humility - Because it would have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 162, 22, 32, 'been a tremendous step down from God to become a King. But the wonderful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 162, 23, 32, 'thing you see here is He went still further. He refused to be a King. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 162, 24, 32, 'read once that when people tried to crown him He just ran away. When He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 162, 25, 32, 'became a man, He humbled Himself and became a servant of everyone. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 162, 26, 32, 'became like a slave.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 162, 27, 32, 'He often used to tell His disciples, ''I didn''t come here for you people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 162, 28, 32, 'to serve me; I came to serve you.'' You know, that is how God is. God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 163, 1, 32, 'nature is to serve, help, and bless other people. The more you have of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 163, 2, 32, 'God''s nature in you, what will you do? The more you will seek to serve,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 163, 3, 32, 'and bless, and help other people. You will not seek to promote yourself,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 163, 4, 32, 'show yourself as great. Unfortunately, even among those who call');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 163, 5, 32, 'themselves Christians and Christian leaders, one finds very often a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 163, 6, 32, 'spirit of self-exultation. That is so contrary to the spirit of Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 163, 7, 32, 'Jesus never exulted himself. He told His disciples not to use titles. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 163, 8, 32, 'said, ''you must be just like brothers, just like all the others''. We are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 163, 9, 32, 'here to serve one another. Jesus demonstrated by His life that a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 163, 10, 32, 'person''s position, wealth, accomplishments, and family status, all have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 163, 11, 32, 'no value. It is humility alone that determines your value in God''s eyes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 163, 12, 32, 'primarily.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 163, 13, 32, 'Consider one fact. You know that you and I never had a choice as to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 163, 14, 32, 'which family we should be born into in this world. You didn''t choose the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 163, 15, 32, 'family you were born into, did you? You could say it was accidental,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 163, 16, 32, 'completely beyond your choice. I was born into a family, which I never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 163, 17, 32, 'chose. You were born into a family, which you never chose. We were just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 163, 18, 32, 'born into it. We were born in a country, which we didn''t choose; into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 163, 19, 32, 'circumstances we didn''t choose. There was only one person born into this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 163, 20, 32, 'world that could choose and determine beforehand where He would be born,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 163, 21, 32, 'when He will be born, in which town, in which building in that town, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 163, 22, 32, 'which family, everything. That was Jesus Christ. From heaven He could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 163, 23, 32, 'have planned His birth perfectly, the exact date, the exact time, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 163, 24, 32, 'exact location, the exact family. And what did Jesus choose? He chooses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 163, 25, 32, 'a poor, unknown carpenter''s family, in a place called Nazareth, which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 163, 26, 32, 'had a very bad reputation in Israel. It was a very poor family; Joseph');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 163, 27, 32, 'was a carpenter. Not only that, Jesus was the only person who could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 163, 28, 32, 'determine where exactly He was going to be born. What place did he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 164, 1, 32, 'choose? - The stable, a lowly stable where donkeys and cows and other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 164, 2, 32, 'animals were moving around; a dirty place. This is the place he chose.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 164, 3, 32, 'When you read in Matthew 1, you read the family line. People are proud');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 164, 4, 32, 'of their family line. He chose a family line in which there was a woman');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 164, 5, 32, 'called Tamar who committed adultery with her father-in-law. Another one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 164, 6, 32, 'in that family tree was Rahab who was a prostitute in Jericho. Another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 164, 7, 32, 'one was Ruth who was a descendant of Moab who was born as the result of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 164, 8, 32, 'incest (you read about it in Genesis 19). And one was Bathsheba who made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 164, 9, 32, 'David commit adultery. This is the line, which Jesus chose. Why did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 164, 10, 32, 'Jesus choose this type of humiliating line and a lowly place to be born?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 164, 11, 32, '- Because He wanted to come underneath all of us to serve us. Remember');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 164, 12, 32, 'dear friend, this is the nature God wants you to have, to go underneath');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 164, 13, 32, 'others to serve them and bless them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 164, 14, 33, 'Chapter 33 Humility In Jesus Earthly Life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 164, 15, 33, 'We have been looking at the way God wants man to live, as demonstrated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 164, 16, 33, 'in the life of Jesus Christ, and that is the example we need to follow.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 164, 17, 33, 'We want to consider a little more about His humility.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 164, 18, 33, 'We have seen how Jesus identified Himself totally with man. He was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 164, 19, 33, 'ashamed to be a man. The Bible says He is not ashamed to call us His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 164, 20, 33, 'brothers. Sometimes we feel superior to other human beings; we feel we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 164, 21, 33, 'are more educated or we belong to a higher class of society. All this is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 164, 22, 33, 'because of the perverted pride that has infected us ever since Adam');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 164, 23, 33, 'sinned. Jesus came to demonstrate that essentially all human beings are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 164, 24, 33, 'equal, irrespective of race, family, education, intelligence, culture,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 164, 25, 33, 'position in life, or whatever. He came and became one with the least and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 164, 26, 33, 'the lowest in the social level in His day, in Israel. He came below');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 164, 27, 33, 'everybody because that is the only way He could be the servant of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 164, 28, 33, 'everybody. You cannot be the servant of another if you are not willing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 165, 1, 33, 'to go underneath him. If you want to lift somebody up, you must go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 165, 2, 33, 'beneath him. That is how Jesus came.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 165, 3, 33, 'Now the Holy Spirit has come to make our mind like Christ''s. In other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 165, 4, 33, 'words, to make our way of thinking exactly like Christ. This is not a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 165, 5, 33, 'theory. This is not something we just talk about over a radio program or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 165, 6, 33, 'in a Church or in an article like this. It is supposed to become a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 165, 7, 33, 'reality in our life, that in our mind, we do not any longer consider');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 165, 8, 33, 'ourselves superior to any other human being, whatever his religion, race');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 165, 9, 33, 'or anything may be. Only then we can say that the humility of Christ has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 165, 10, 33, 'begun to work in our thoughts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 165, 11, 33, 'If I were to ask you a question on what are the thoughts you think about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 165, 12, 33, 'yourself when you are all by yourself, what would be your response? You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 165, 13, 33, 'think of yourself, perhaps, as a good-looking person, or very clever, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 165, 14, 33, 'fortunate to be born in a rich family, or other such thoughts. There you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 165, 15, 33, 'can assess how much of your thoughts are like Christ and how much you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 165, 16, 33, 'think like the devil. If you are comparing yourself with others, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 165, 17, 33, 'considering yourself superior, those are exactly the kind of thoughts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 165, 18, 33, 'that went through the mind of Lucifer before he became the devil. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 165, 19, 33, 'Bible says that we must regard others as more important than ourselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 165, 20, 33, '(Phil. 2:3), and Paul goes on to speak in that passage about Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 165, 21, 33, 'Christ being our example. Paul once said, in Ephesians 3:8, that he was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 165, 22, 33, 'the very least of all the saints. Paul had been so gripped by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 165, 23, 33, 'humility of Christ that, as he thought about himself, he saw himself as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 165, 24, 33, 'the absolute lowest among all the believers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 165, 25, 33, 'There is no contradiction between this and Paul calling the Corinthians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 165, 26, 33, 'believers carnal. Paul didn''t consider himself carnal. The Bible does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 165, 27, 33, 'not tell us to consider other people better than ourselves. That would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 165, 28, 33, 'be impossible. Who was the humblest man that walked on the earth? You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 166, 1, 33, 'know the answer. It was Jesus Christ. He was the humblest person that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 166, 2, 33, 'walked on the earth. Now let us consider this question. Did Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 166, 3, 33, 'consider other people better than Himself? How could He do that? He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 166, 4, 33, 'the purest, the holiest. He knew Judas Iscariot was a devil. He didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 166, 5, 33, 'consider other people better than Himself. Humility does not mean');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 166, 6, 33, 'considering other people better than ourselves, because then we have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 166, 7, 33, 'believe a lie.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 166, 8, 33, 'When Paul wrote to the Corinthians saying, ''You are carnal, you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 166, 9, 33, 'babies,'' did he consider the Corinthians better than himself? No. Some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 166, 10, 33, 'people have this false humility where they struggle and try to consider');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 166, 11, 33, 'other people better than themselves. It is a futile effort. The Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 166, 12, 33, 'doesn''t t ask you to do that. The Bible says in Philippians 2:3 to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 166, 13, 33, 'consider others more important than you. That is different.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 166, 14, 33, 'Jesus always considered others more important. That is why we see Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 166, 15, 33, 'taking a bucket of water, and washing the disciples'' feet at the Last');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 166, 16, 33, 'Supper. It was the job done only by servants in those days. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 166, 17, 33, 'visited a wealthy home, in those days, they usually they had slaves at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 166, 18, 33, 'home. A slave is someone who is bought, one who did not get any wages.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 166, 19, 33, 'Slaves were lower than servants. When a guest came to visit a home, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 166, 20, 33, 'was the slave''s duty to take a basin of water, remove the guest''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 166, 21, 33, 'sandals, and wash the dust from their feet. Whenever there was a dinner,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 166, 22, 33, 'there would always be a basin of water near the door.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 166, 23, 33, 'When Jesus and the disciples came to this Last Supper, there was no host');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 166, 24, 33, 'there. They only had an empty room for their use. But the basin of water');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 166, 25, 33, 'was kept at the door as usual. Now the question was who was going to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 166, 26, 33, 'the job of washing the people''s feet? Each disciple must have thought,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 166, 27, 33, '''Well, I am not going to do that.'' Peter may have thought, ''Well, I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 166, 28, 33, 'going to be the leader after Jesus goes away, how I can do such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 167, 1, 33, 'thing?'' And Matthew may have thought, ''Well, I am an educated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 167, 2, 33, 'accountant; I can''t go washing the feet of these disciples.'' Each of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 167, 3, 33, 'disciples may have thought of how they were superior to the others in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 167, 4, 33, 'some way, and therefore they couldn''t possibly do a slave''s job. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 167, 5, 33, 'better it is not done.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 167, 6, 33, 'Then Jesus took up that basin of water and began to wash their feet.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 167, 7, 33, 'Why? Because He said, ''Well, you are all more important than me.'' They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 167, 8, 33, 'were certainly not more spiritual than Him, and He didn''t think so. Yet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 167, 9, 33, 'He treated them more important. He genuinely considered Himself less');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 167, 10, 33, 'important. It was not an act, merely put on to show that He was humble.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 167, 11, 33, 'There can be people who act humble, who do things just to show that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 167, 12, 33, 'are humble servants. That is hypocrisy. God hates it. Jesus was genuine.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 167, 13, 33, 'He really took that place of being nothing before His Heavenly Father.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 167, 14, 33, 'And this is what humility really is: to take the place of being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 167, 15, 33, 'absolutely nothing before God. ''Lord, I am nothing, everything that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 167, 16, 33, 'am, you have made me.'' If you are intelligent, who made you intelligent?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 167, 17, 33, 'God did. There are so many children born into this world that are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 167, 18, 33, 'retarded. You could have been born like that. You could have been born');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 167, 19, 33, 'with a defective brain, or a defective body, or some congenital disease,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 167, 20, 33, 'or polio like many other children born into this world. What would you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 167, 21, 33, 'be then? It really is proper for us to be thoroughly humble when we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 167, 22, 33, 'think of our condition: ''Lord, what do I have, which I have not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 167, 23, 33, 'received?'' Only a foolish man is proud.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 167, 24, 33, 'Jesus not only took that place of a servant. But we also read that He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 167, 25, 33, 'went still further. What is lower than a slave? We would say nothing is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 167, 26, 33, 'lower than a slave; that is the lowest place. No, a criminal, a murderer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 167, 27, 33, 'would be considered even lower than a slave. We read that Jesus was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 167, 28, 33, 'crucified just like a criminal. You know, this crucifixion - killing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 168, 1, 33, 'people on the cross was something that the Romans reserved for the worst');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 168, 2, 33, 'criminals in Palestine. Ordinary criminals were not crucified. But the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 168, 3, 33, 'worst, the absolutely incorrigible, worst criminals, they would kill');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 168, 4, 33, 'them; kill them with this terrible process of crucifixion where they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 168, 5, 33, 'suffer and die over a period of many hours. Jesus humbled Himself to die');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 168, 6, 33, 'on a cross as a criminal. The Bible says in Isaiah that He was numbered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 168, 7, 33, 'with the transgressors. He was counted among the criminals. Why? Because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 168, 8, 33, 'that was His Father''s will, He accepted it. He obeyed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 168, 9, 33, 'It is marvellous to see the humility of Jesus right from the time He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 168, 10, 33, 'a little child. You know, we read in the Bible, in Luke''s Gospel, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 168, 11, 33, 'Jesus came to Nazareth, and continued in subjection to Joseph and Mary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 168, 12, 33, '(Lk. 2:51), and that went on for 30 years. Were Joseph and Mary perfect?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 168, 13, 33, '- Far from it. They were no better than any couple today. Think of an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 168, 14, 33, 'average Christian home today where husband and wife fight with each');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 168, 15, 33, 'other at least once in a while. Joseph and Mary were like that. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 168, 16, 33, 'were not perfect people who never sinned. There is nobody like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 168, 17, 33, 'They were sinners. They were imperfect. They did not know everything.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 168, 18, 33, 'And in their home lived Jesus, who was sinless, who was perfect, and who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 168, 19, 33, 'never did anything wrong. So who should submit to whom? One would think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 168, 20, 33, 'Joseph and Mary should submit to Jesus, right? We would think that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 168, 21, 33, 'ones who are imperfect (Joseph and Mary) should submit to the one who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 168, 22, 33, 'perfect (Jesus).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 168, 23, 33, 'But it wasn''t like that. Jesus submitted to an imperfect foster father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 168, 24, 33, 'and mother. We know it is not easy for us to submit to those who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 168, 25, 33, 'inferior to us. Can you submit to somebody who is inferior to you? But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 168, 26, 33, 'if you are genuinely humble, you will have no problem. You would submit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 168, 27, 33, 'to anybody because you would realise you are nothing. Humility is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 168, 28, 33, 'secret. We will have no problem with anyone when we are humble.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 169, 1, 33, 'Jesus was quite happy to be a carpenter. When He went out to ministry,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 169, 2, 33, 'He never took any title. He never called Himself Reverend Jesus or any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 169, 3, 33, 'such thing. He never wanted any position or title or anything that would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 169, 4, 33, 'exalt Him above the common people whom He came to serve. He became like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 169, 5, 33, 'His brothers in all things. When they wanted to make Him a King, He ran');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 169, 6, 33, 'away. He never did anything to get honour from men. If He healed a sick');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 169, 7, 33, 'person, He would tell that sick person not to tell anyone. Do you see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 169, 8, 33, 'His humility? He wanted all the glory to be given to the Father. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 169, 9, 33, 'never wanted to draw anybody to Himself; His healings were not publicity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 169, 10, 33, 'stunts to draw attention to Himself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 169, 11, 33, 'What a beautiful picture we have of what man is supposed to be. Think of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 169, 12, 33, 'what will happen if the world became full of people like this? But you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 169, 13, 33, 'can make a beginning in your life now.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 169, 14, 34, 'Chapter 34 Humility In Jesus Death');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 169, 15, 34, 'We are, once again, going to look a little more at the humility of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 169, 16, 34, 'Christ, which is an example for us to follow. It is important for us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 169, 17, 34, 'follow this example because God says that He gives His grace only to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 169, 18, 34, 'humble.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 169, 19, 34, 'The night before Jesus was crucified, just after He washed their feet,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 169, 20, 34, 'He said, ''You call me Lord and Master and yet I have washed your feet.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 169, 21, 34, 'You must do the same for one another'' (Jn. 13:13, 14). What does that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 169, 22, 34, 'mean? Many people have felt that, it means that we must all take basins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 169, 23, 34, 'of water and wash one another''s feet; even if our feet are covered with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 169, 24, 34, 'socks and shoes and they are not dirty. That becomes a meaningless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 169, 25, 34, 'ritual.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 169, 26, 34, 'What exactly did Jesus do that day, when He took that basin of water? If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 169, 27, 34, 'all those disciples were wearing socks and shoes like we wear today,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 169, 28, 34, 'particularly in colder climates, then there would be absolutely no need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 170, 1, 34, 'to wash their feet at all. Why did He wash their feet? It is not a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 170, 2, 34, 'religious ritual that He went through. No, it was an act of necessity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 170, 3, 34, 'He saw a need for a dirty job to be done for His disciples, and He did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 170, 4, 34, 'it. So when He said, ''I have given you an example. I the Lord and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 170, 5, 34, 'Teacher washed your feet of you all, you also must wash one another''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 170, 6, 34, 'feet'' (Jn. 13:15).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 170, 7, 34, 'We must ask ourselves: What is it that Jesus did to the Apostles? In one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 170, 8, 34, 'sentence, we could say, He met their physical need by doing a dirty task');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 170, 9, 34, 'for them. So what has He told us to do? He has told us to be willing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 170, 10, 34, 'do dirty tasks for one another, where there is such a necessity, and not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 170, 11, 34, 'to go through a ritual. If you are in a meeting hall, for example, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 170, 12, 34, 'way you wash people''s feet would probably be by going in and cleaning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 170, 13, 34, 'the toilet, so that it is kept clean. That would be the equivalent of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 170, 14, 34, 'washing the feet today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 170, 15, 34, 'It is a question of seeing a particular need and then meeting it. What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 170, 16, 34, 'Jesus did there, in taking that basin of water and washing their feet,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 170, 17, 34, 'was typical of His whole life. All His life, I believe, He was a servant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 170, 18, 34, 'of all men. We are not told how He lived for 30 years in Nazareth, but I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 170, 19, 34, 'can imagine how He lived. He must have lived serving others; serving His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 170, 20, 34, 'younger brothers, younger sisters; serving Mary, serving others in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 170, 21, 34, 'neighbourhood - being willing to do any task for anyone; seeing a need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 170, 22, 34, 'and being quick to meet it. There we see His humility. And there we see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 170, 23, 34, 'how God wants man to live.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 170, 24, 34, 'My dear friend, that is how God wants you to live. If you can see this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 170, 25, 34, 'and be gripped by the glory of Jesus, your life can be transformed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 170, 26, 34, 'Don''t worry if other Christians around you are not living like this.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 170, 27, 34, 'Don''t judge them. Don''t find fault with them. It is not our business.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 170, 28, 34, 'God is the Judge of all men and we don''t have to judge anyone. But you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 171, 1, 34, 'can be like this, can''t you? How happy you will be? Jesus, after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 171, 2, 34, 'speaking about being willing to wash one another''s feet and actually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 171, 3, 34, 'doing it, said, "if you know these things you will be really happy, if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 171, 4, 34, 'you do it" (Jn. 13:17). Not if you just think about it. The way of life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 171, 5, 34, 'that Jesus demonstrated is the way of supreme happiness. You are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 171, 6, 34, 'happy when you sit like a big maharaja or lord on your chair and make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 171, 7, 34, 'other people serve you. If you really want to be happy, be a servant.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 171, 8, 34, 'Jesus associated very closely with the lowest level of society in His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 171, 9, 34, 'time. He moved among them as their equal. Have you seen fisherman on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 171, 10, 34, 'coasts of India? You go down to a number of places along the coast and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 171, 11, 34, 'you can see fisherman. What level of society do they live? They are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 171, 12, 34, 'despised as belonging to the lowest level of the society. I don''t mean');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 171, 13, 34, 'these rich fishermen who go out in trawlers and motorboats. No, I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 171, 14, 34, 'talking about people who put their nets into the sea and catch fish.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 171, 15, 34, 'Peter, James, and John were like that. If you want to see what they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 171, 16, 34, 'like go and look at these fishermen who cast their nets into the sea,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 171, 17, 34, 'who go out in their little boats. Jesus associated with them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 171, 18, 34, 'Not only with people in a lower level of society socially, but also with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 171, 19, 34, 'those who were at the lower level morally; prostitutes, drunkards,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 171, 20, 34, 'cheats. He was sinless and perfect, yet He mingled with them. He was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 171, 21, 34, 'afraid of people calling bad names, saying, He is a friend of sinners.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 171, 22, 34, 'He never made a single sinner feel awkward through His perfect holiness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 171, 23, 34, 'You know one mark of a humble man is that He never makes you feel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 171, 24, 34, 'awkward; he always makes you feel comfortable around His presence even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 171, 25, 34, 'though He is holy. Jesus was like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 171, 26, 34, 'The Pharisees were not like that. You know they were so stiff. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 171, 27, 34, 'wouldn''t let anybody come near them because they consider themselves so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 171, 28, 34, 'holy. But Jesus wasn''t like that. He mingled with the lowest level of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 172, 1, 34, 'people and made them feel at home. In fact, He moved around with His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 172, 2, 34, 'disciples so freely that Peter would sometimes rebuke Him and felt free');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 172, 3, 34, 'to give Him advice. Can you think of that? The disciple would feel free');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 172, 4, 34, 'to give some advice, '' Lord, we think you should do this or that.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 172, 5, 34, 'Now, how is it today with a lot of Christian leaders? Do you find them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 172, 6, 34, 'mingling like this? No. Christianity has not given to our country a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 172, 7, 34, 'demonstration of how Jesus lived on the earth. We have failed. We need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 172, 8, 34, 'to acknowledge it. Never mind others. You, who are reading this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 172, 9, 34, 'transcript, you can demonstrate the life of Christ in your own life, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 172, 10, 34, 'your locality. If, little by little, each one of us does that, our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 172, 11, 34, 'country will once again be able to see true Christianity demonstrated by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 172, 12, 34, 'people living like Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 172, 13, 34, 'See the humility of Jesus in the spiritual realm. In the Garden of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 172, 14, 34, 'Gethsemane, He was under tremendous pressure. The Bible says in Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 172, 15, 34, '26:38 that Jesus was deeply grieved to the point of death. What does He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 172, 16, 34, 'do at such a time? He doesn''t act as though He is self-sufficient; He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 172, 17, 34, 'doesn''t need anybody''s help. No, He calls Peter, James and John and asks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 172, 18, 34, 'them to pray with Him. Think of asking somebody to pray with you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 172, 19, 34, 'A proud man will never ask anybody to pray with Him. He doesn''t feel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 172, 20, 34, 'such a need. But Jesus, the Son of God, who lived such a perfect life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 172, 21, 34, 'asking these simple disciples, who had so many weaknesses, saying, ''Will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 172, 22, 34, 'you please come and pray with me because I am under tremendous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 172, 23, 34, 'pressure.'' Jesus was conscious of his weakness as a human being and He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 172, 24, 34, 'sought the fellowship of his disciples in prayer. Do you do that? Or,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 172, 25, 34, 'are you so self-sufficient? Do you see my dear friend, how far we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 172, 26, 34, 'from the humility of Jesus Christ? It is because we are not honest to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 172, 27, 34, 'acknowledge that we are nothing. That is why God''s power cannot be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 172, 28, 34, 'manifested through our lives. You know why God''s power manifested in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 173, 1, 34, 'such a fantastic way in the life of Jesus? Because He recognized He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 173, 2, 34, 'nothing. He just lived before His Father as nothing - and the Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 173, 3, 34, 'could manifest all His power through Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 173, 4, 34, 'There are only two spirits operating in the world: one going up, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 173, 5, 34, 'other going down. Up, in the sense of exulting oneself in pride and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 173, 6, 34, 'down, in the sense of humbling oneself; the spirit of Lucifer and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 173, 7, 34, 'spirit of Christ. It is operating everywhere. It is operating in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 173, 8, 34, 'Christendom too. You find it even in Christian organizations, Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 173, 9, 34, 'churches; Christians trying to push other people down, get on top of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 173, 10, 34, 'their shoulder, climb up to a higher, higher, higher positions. What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 173, 11, 34, 'spirit is that? Is that the spirit of Christ? No, it is the spirit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 173, 12, 34, 'Lucifer. It is the spirit of Satan operating in churches and Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 173, 13, 34, 'organizations. Is that not sad? Jesus Christ came with another spirit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 173, 14, 34, 'humbling Himself, going down. I want to say to you: this is the way we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 173, 15, 34, 'can identify a true disciple of Jesus. He has absolutely no desire to go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 173, 16, 34, 'up or to become great or big either in the Christian church or in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 173, 17, 34, 'world. He just wants to go down. He wants to bless others. He doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 173, 18, 34, 'want to exult himself over a single person anywhere.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 173, 19, 34, 'Finally, in the death of Jesus, we see His humility coming to a perfect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 173, 20, 34, 'end; to perfection, because in the death and trial of Jesus, He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 173, 21, 34, 'never given justice. He was humiliated, ridiculed, mocked, ill-treated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 173, 22, 34, 'and made like the scum of the earth. There you see His humility that He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 173, 23, 34, 'never called the angels to help. He could have called 12 legions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 173, 24, 34, '(72,000) of angels with one word. Why didn''t He do it?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 173, 25, 34, 'Oh! He humbled Himself. He didn''t grab. All through His life He opened');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 173, 26, 34, 'His palms to give to others. And finally, He opened His palms to receive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 173, 27, 34, 'the nails, on the cross. This is the way that Jesus went and this is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 173, 28, 34, 'way God wants you and me to live; with an open palm and not with a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 174, 1, 34, 'clenched fist to fight with others. No, but with an open palm, to give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 174, 2, 34, 'up our rights. Not judging others, leaving it to God to judge.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 174, 3, 34, 'Jesus once said in John 8:15, ''I don''t judge anybody.'' He submitted to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 174, 4, 34, 'the humiliating death that His Father planned for Him. It didn''t matter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 174, 5, 34, 'how He was killed. He accepted it. He was obedient unto death. My dear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 174, 6, 34, 'friend, this is the real Jesus of the scriptures. He was not honoured as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 174, 7, 34, 'a celebrity or a film star, like many of today''s evangelists are. On the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 174, 8, 34, 'other hand, people rejected Him, despised Him and nailed Him to a cross.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 174, 9, 34, 'This is true Christianity. It is not a popular big thing. The Bible says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 174, 10, 34, 'that that which is highly esteemed among men is an abomination before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 174, 11, 34, 'God . Let us look at Jesus and go down the way He went.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 174, 12, 35, 'Chapter 35 Jesus Overcame Sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 174, 13, 35, 'We want to continue looking at the life of Jesus as the perfect example');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 174, 14, 35, 'God has given us on earth and demonstrating how God wanted man to live .');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 174, 15, 35, 'In this study we want to look at His holiness and His purity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 174, 16, 35, 'God is holy and He tells us, "Because I am holy, be holy yourself." But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 174, 17, 35, 'for us, who are human beings, created with a free will, holiness can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 174, 18, 35, 'come only through overcoming temptation; through saying no to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 174, 19, 35, 'temptation. We are not inherently holy. When we are born, we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 174, 20, 35, 'inherently sinful. In fact, even when Adam was created, he was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 174, 21, 35, 'inherently holy, he was inherently innocent. He had to choose God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 174, 22, 35, 'say no to temptation in order to be holy. Now, in the same way, today,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 174, 23, 35, 'to be holy, we have to be tempted. In fact, this is one purpose of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 174, 24, 35, 'temptation. Temptation is not meant to lead us into sin; quite the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 174, 25, 35, 'opposite. It is meant to lead us to holiness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 174, 26, 35, 'Holiness is like being spiritually healthy and strong. Why do people go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 174, 27, 35, 'to a gymnasium and do exercise there, with bars and weights, and subject');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 174, 28, 35, 'their muscle to resistance with springs and various things like that?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 175, 1, 35, 'Why is all that equipment lying around the gymnasium for? It is not easy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 175, 2, 35, 'to lift those weights and do exercise with all those springs and various');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 175, 3, 35, 'things. In fact, it is a strain. Then why do people go through that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 175, 4, 35, 'strain? They are even willing to pay money to go through that strain!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 175, 5, 35, 'You know why? - Because they want a physically fit body. They know that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 175, 6, 35, 'a physically fit body can only come if every muscle in the body is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 175, 7, 35, 'subjected to strain and resistance. So, all that equipment in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 175, 8, 35, 'gymnasium is meant for subjecting different muscles in the body to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 175, 9, 35, 'resistance. Now a person, whose muscle is not subjected to resistance,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 175, 10, 35, 'will just be a fat, flabby man. When doctors advice a fat, flabby man to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 175, 11, 35, 'get rid of his fat, they suggest exercise, or in other words, subject');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 175, 12, 35, 'your muscles to some resistance. It is exactly the same principle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 175, 13, 35, 'spiritually.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 175, 14, 35, 'We have to be subjected to resistance. We have to have somebody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 175, 15, 35, 'resisting us. And we have to resist in return and overcome in order to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 175, 16, 35, 'be spiritually fit, muscular and strong. In other words, become holy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 175, 17, 35, 'That is why the Bible says, "Consider it all joy when you encounter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 175, 18, 35, 'various types of temptations" (J a s. 1:2). Now that is not the common');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 175, 19, 35, 'understanding of how to face temptations. Most people think, ''Oh boy,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 175, 20, 35, 'temptation, I wish I would never face it.'' It is like a fat man saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 175, 21, 35, '''Oh, I don''t want to do any exercise, it is such a labour, such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 175, 22, 35, 'problem.'' What is the result? He never becomes muscular. If a Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 175, 23, 35, 'would say, ''I don''t want to face trails, I don''t want to face any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 175, 24, 35, 'temptations,'' he will never be a spiritually muscular, healthy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 175, 25, 35, 'Christian. That is impossible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 175, 26, 35, 'Holiness can come only if you are willing to say no to temptation. So,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 175, 27, 35, 'what does James say you should do? Consider it all joy. Like the fat man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 175, 28, 35, 'going into the gymnasium and considering it all joy when he finds these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 176, 1, 35, 'various bits of equipment around him, and he begins to exercise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 176, 2, 35, 'Gradually the fat melts away from his body and he comes out later, in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 176, 3, 35, 'year or so, a healthy, strong muscular man. Wasn''t that good? Shouldn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 176, 4, 35, 'he consider it all joy when he subjects his muscles to resistance? It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 176, 5, 35, 'exactly the same thing what James says here. Because people have not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 176, 6, 35, 'understood it, they think that avoiding temptation, and avoiding trial');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 176, 7, 35, 'is the best way. It is not the best way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 176, 8, 35, 'Now the amazing thing is that, even for someone like Jesus, who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 176, 9, 35, 'sinless, had to be tempted. That is quite a mystery. Why did He have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 176, 10, 35, 'be tempted? In Matthew 4, we read that the devil came to Him and tempted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 176, 11, 35, 'Him. Three of the temptations are mentioned there. And in Hebrews 4:15');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 176, 12, 35, 'we are told that He was tempted in every respect like us but He didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 176, 13, 35, 'sin even once. It is amazing that Jesus Christ, the perfect sinless Son');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 176, 14, 35, 'of God, was also subject to temptation in every area. The Bible says in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 176, 15, 35, 'Hebrews 6:20 that Jesus is our forerunner. Forerunner means somebody who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 176, 16, 35, 'has run the race in front of us and has shown us the path in which to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 176, 17, 35, 'follow. So, as One who has gone in front of us, He says to us today,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 176, 18, 35, '"Follow Me."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 176, 19, 35, 'The Bible says in Hebrews 12:1-2, "Let us look u nto Him who ran this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 176, 20, 35, 'race in front and let us run the race behind Him." Again , we read,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 176, 21, 35, '"Consider Him who faced such contradiction of sinners against Himself,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 176, 22, 35, 'who resisted sin unto blood" (Heb. 12:3-4) Jesus endured every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 176, 23, 35, 'temptation that can ever come to any human being. He was tempted in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 176, 24, 35, 'every point as we are and He overcame in the power of the Holy Spirit,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 176, 25, 35, 'as a man. If He had faced temptation as God, there would be nothing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 176, 26, 35, 'great about it. In fact, the Bible says that God can''t be tempted (J a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 176, 27, 35, 's. 1:13).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 176, 28, 35, 'So, Jesus had to give up that privilege, when He walked on earth as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 177, 1, 35, 'man, in order to be tempted, in order to be an example for us. If He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 177, 2, 35, 'overcame temptation in the power of God, and He, as God, tells us -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 177, 3, 35, 'human beings to somehow overcome, when we are not God, it would be like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 177, 4, 35, 'a father driving a motorcar at 80 miles per hour (mph), and telling his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 177, 5, 35, 'little son to run after him on the road, ''Follow me.'' Isn''t that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 177, 6, 35, 'ridiculous? - A father driving in a car at 80mph and telling his son to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 177, 7, 35, 'run after him? Then how can Jesus say, ''Follow me,'' if He encountered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 177, 8, 35, 'temptation as God? In fact, in any case, as I said earlier, God cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 177, 9, 35, 'be tempted.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 177, 10, 35, 'The fact is that Jesus encountered temptation as a man and overcame in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 177, 11, 35, 'the power of the Holy Spirit. And that is the same power He offers us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 177, 12, 35, 'That is what gives us hope when we face temptation. The devil would like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 177, 13, 35, 'to rob you of that hope, by trying to tell you, ''No, you can''t overcome');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 177, 14, 35, 'temptation. You will always be defeated.'' But you tell him, ''How did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 177, 15, 35, 'Jesus overcome?'' He might say, ''Oh, He overcame as God.'' Is that what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 177, 16, 35, 'the Bible says? No. He overcame Satan by quoting the word of God to Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 177, 17, 35, 'You can overcome Satan in the same way. The Bible asks you to take the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 177, 18, 35, 'sword of the spirit, which is the Word of God, and you can drive the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 177, 19, 35, 'devil away too, in the power of the Holy Spirit. Jesus prayed, sought');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 177, 20, 35, 'for help, and overcame.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 177, 21, 35, 'Suppose today we have to face some temptation, which Jesus never faced,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 177, 22, 35, 'we could say to Him, ''Well, Lord you don''t understand what I am facing.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 177, 23, 35, 'But we can never say that because He does understand. The Bible says He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 177, 24, 35, 'can sympathise with our struggle, with our weakness (Heb. 4:15). The one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 177, 25, 35, 'thing that Jesus demonstrated th r ough His life on earth was that with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 177, 26, 35, 'the power of the Holy Spirit, as a man, we can obey every commandment of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 177, 27, 35, 'God. If we don''t do it, it is because we are not wholehearted as He was.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 177, 28, 35, 'That is why the Bible says, "Anyone, who says, he abides in Christ must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 178, 1, 35, 'walk as He walked" (1 Jn. 2:6). Is that possible? If it is not possible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 178, 2, 35, 'there would be no such command in scripture.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 178, 3, 35, 'The L iving Bible says, "Anyone who calls themselves a Christian should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 178, 4, 35, 'live as Christ did." Is that really true? Jesus Christ''s life was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 178, 5, 35, 'demonstration of how we are to live. Now, we may not be able to say that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 178, 6, 35, 'we are walking like Christ. In fact, I have never met anyone on earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 178, 7, 35, 'who walks like Jesus Christ, neither would you have. But if we make that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 178, 8, 35, 'our goal and, if we have faith, we should press on to that perfection');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 178, 9, 35, 'where we say, ''Lord I want to walk like You.'' Then from one degree of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 178, 10, 35, 'glory to another, the Holy Spirit will conform us to Christ''s likeness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 178, 11, 35, 'Paul said he hadn''t attained it himself, but he was pressing on. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 178, 12, 35, 'says, "I press toward the mark, for the prize of the high calling of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 178, 13, 35, 'in Christ Jesus." He wanted to live like Jesus lived. He made that his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 178, 14, 35, 'goal and, little by little, he approached it. But a person, who has no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 178, 15, 35, 'goal, is never going to get anywhere near there. It is like climbing a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 178, 16, 35, 'mountain. If you don''t have the top of the mountain as your goal, what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 178, 17, 35, 'is going to happen? You are just going to be at ground level, even after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 178, 18, 35, '25 years. But if you keep the top of the mountain as your goal, every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 178, 19, 35, 'year will find you higher and higher and higher and higher, and little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 178, 20, 35, 'more and little more and little more like Christ. This is Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 178, 21, 35, 'growth. How did Jesus overcome? When He faced temptation and He felt the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 178, 22, 35, 'pull of it, He resisted it in the power of the Holy Spirit; He died to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 178, 23, 35, 'Himself and He overcame. That is why the Bible says, "Arm yourself with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 178, 24, 35, 'the same mind" (1 Pet. 4:1-2).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 178, 25, 35, 'Now there could be a misunderstanding here because some of us don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 178, 26, 35, 'understand what is the essence of sin. The essence of all sin is doing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 178, 27, 35, 'your own will. Now, if that is the essence is sin, then what is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 178, 28, 35, 'essence of holiness? Denying your own will and doing the will of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 179, 1, 35, 'That is holiness. We read what Jesus said in John 6:38, "I came from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 179, 2, 35, 'heaven not to do My own will," i.e. not to sin, "but to do the will of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 179, 3, 35, 'God, the will of Him who sent Me." That is holiness. In the Garden of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 179, 4, 35, 'Gethsemane He said, "Not as I will Father, but as Though will." Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 179, 5, 35, 'offered up His human will as a perpetual sacrifice. He said, "I never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 179, 6, 35, 'want to do My will." That is what is meant by Jesus never sinned. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 179, 7, 35, 'never did His own will. Human nature is just the opposite. We see that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 179, 8, 35, 'in a little child; a child wants to do his own will. That stubbornness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 179, 9, 35, 'is sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 179, 10, 35, 'Jesus warned His disciple in the Garden of Gethsemane. He said, "Pray,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 179, 11, 35, 'your flesh is weak. Your spirit may be willing to live a holy life but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 179, 12, 35, 'your flesh is weak." That is why we need the power of the Holy Spirit to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 179, 13, 35, 'deny our will and to do the will for God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 179, 14, 35, 'Make that your goal dear friend. Believe today that it is possible for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 179, 15, 35, 'you to live a holy life; to climb higher and higher up this mountain of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 179, 16, 35, 'becoming more and more like Jesus Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 179, 17, 36, 'Chapter 36 Jesus Did God''s Will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 179, 18, 36, 'We want to consider a little more about how Jesus Christ is our example');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 179, 19, 36, 'in living a holy life, so that, as a Christian, your life need not be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 179, 20, 36, 'defeated by sin anymore.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 179, 21, 36, 'Jesus made two amazing statements to His disciples on the night He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 179, 22, 36, 'crucified. He meant what He said. If we take seriously what He said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 179, 23, 36, 'even if we cannot understand what He said, we will seek to understand.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 179, 24, 36, 'Because there must be a depth of meaning to it and something very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 179, 25, 36, 'important. It is in John 14:12. He started, "He who believe in Me". Now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 179, 26, 36, 'that applies to every believer. He did not specifically point out to His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 179, 27, 36, 'apostles and say, "I give this power to you." No, it is to "He who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 179, 28, 36, 'believes in Me." Who does that apply to? Well, if you are one of those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 180, 1, 36, 'who believe in Him, it applies to you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 180, 2, 36, 'And what did He say, "He who believes in Me, the works that I do shall');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 180, 3, 36, 'he do also." In other words, Jesus is saying to you (give careful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 180, 4, 36, 'attention to this) that you can do the works that Jesus did. Is it true');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 180, 5, 36, 'or not? Well, either Jesus was telling the truth or He was telling a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 180, 6, 36, 'lie. I believe He is telling the truth. He has never told a lie. He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 180, 7, 36, 'not teasing us either. He really means that the works that He did we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 180, 8, 36, 'do also. Further He said, "Greater works than these shall such a person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 180, 9, 36, 'do because I go to the Father." What does this mean?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 180, 10, 36, 'What were the works that Jesus did? We immediately think of His raising');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 180, 11, 36, 'the dead, feeding the 5000, walking on the water, etc. Well, those were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 180, 12, 36, 'certainly some of the works, but He did a lot of other works too. Like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 180, 13, 36, 'putting His arms around a leper, comforting people who were in sin,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 180, 14, 36, 'forgiving a woman caught in adultery, and forgiving those who called Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 180, 15, 36, 'Beelzebub, the prince of devils. Those don''t look so spectacular, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 180, 16, 36, 'those are also the works that He did.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 180, 17, 36, 'So, what did He mean by the works that He did? Can we use one phrase to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 180, 18, 36, 'sum up all the works that He did? Yes, we can. And that is He obeyed the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 180, 19, 36, 'will of His Father; He did the will of His Father. Those are the works');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 180, 20, 36, 'that He did. If His Father wanted Him to walk on the water, He walked on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 180, 21, 36, 'the water. If His Father wanted Him to put His arm around a leper, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 180, 22, 36, 'did that. If His Father wanted Him to forgive a woman caught in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 180, 23, 36, 'adultery, He did that. If His Father wanted Him to wash the disciple''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 180, 24, 36, 'feet, He did that. His works were works of obedience to the Father. Not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 180, 25, 36, 'just miracle works.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 180, 26, 36, 'So, when He said that we can do the same works, what He meant was, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 180, 27, 36, 'can also obey whatever the Father''s will for us is. Now, if it is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 180, 28, 36, 'the Father''s will for you to raise the dead, you can''t raise the dead.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 181, 1, 36, 'That is all. Man has gone to the moon. But when Jesus was on the earth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 181, 2, 36, 'He didn''t go to the moon because it was not the Father''s will for Him to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 181, 3, 36, 'go to the moon. He didn''t even go to Rome, leave alone the moon. So, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 181, 4, 36, 'find that it is not a question of accomplishment. If , it is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 181, 5, 36, 'Father''s will for you to feed 5000 people with 5 loaves and 2 fishes,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 181, 6, 36, 'you can do it. The point is , what is the Father''s will? Whatever was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 181, 7, 36, 'the Father''s will for Jesus, He did it. For example, for 30 years, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 181, 8, 36, 'never fed the 5000, or walked on the water, or raised any dead person,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 181, 9, 36, 'or even healed a sick person, because it was not the Father''s will. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 181, 10, 36, 'He still did His Father''s will during those 30 years.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 181, 11, 36, 'In a nutshell, we could say that the works that Jesus did were works of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 181, 12, 36, 'obedience to His Heavenly Father''s will. When He says, "The works that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 181, 13, 36, 'do you can do also," what it means is everything (note carefully), every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 181, 14, 36, 'single thing that is in God''s will for your life can be done;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 181, 15, 36, 'definitely. How did Jesus do all that? He did it through the power of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 181, 16, 36, 'the Holy Spirit. When the disciples were filled with the Holy Spirit, on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 181, 17, 36, 'the day of Pentecost, as we read in Acts 2, they received power to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 181, 18, 36, 'what? They received the power to do the same works of obedience that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 181, 19, 36, 'Jesus did. That is to do the will of the Father. If the Father wanted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 181, 20, 36, 'them to heal the sick, they could do it; to raise the dead, they could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 181, 21, 36, 'do it. When the Holy Spirit came and filled them, they received power to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 181, 22, 36, 'do the works that Jesus did.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 181, 23, 36, 'What does it mean when it says in John 14:12 that greater works than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 181, 24, 36, 'these they shall do? That is referring to leading other people into this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 181, 25, 36, 'life. Note what He said: because "I go to the Father." What would happen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 181, 26, 36, 'when Jesus went to the Father? He would send the Holy Spirit. And the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 181, 27, 36, 'Holy Spirit would now be able to come and dwell in people''s hearts,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 181, 28, 36, 'after the day of the Pentecost and, that would enable people to come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 182, 1, 36, 'into this life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 182, 2, 36, 'Let me give you an example. After three and a half years of preaching to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 182, 3, 36, 'the disciples, Jesus could not make even two of them one. He prayed in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 182, 4, 36, 'John 17 that they may be one as the Father and Son are one. But they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 182, 5, 36, 'were not one. They were all aiming for the highest seat. They were all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 182, 6, 36, 'wondering who was the greatest. Well, if 12 people are thinking who was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 182, 7, 36, 'the greatest, all 12 of them, they are certainly not one; they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 182, 8, 36, 'divided. But today we find that we are able to preach in such a way that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 182, 9, 36, 'people are becoming one. Even if two people become one today, it is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 182, 10, 36, 'greater work than Jesus did in His entire lifetime. But it is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 182, 11, 36, 'because we are greater than Jesus; far from it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 182, 12, 36, 'Because He went to the Father, He sent the Holy Spirit. When Jesus was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 182, 13, 36, 'on the earth, the Holy Spirit could not come into the hearts of those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 182, 14, 36, 'disciples. If He had come into the hearts of those disciples, they would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 182, 15, 36, 'have become one. But after the day of Pentecost, since the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 182, 16, 36, 'has come, there is the opportunity to accomplish more because the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 182, 17, 36, 'Spirit, who now comes in to dwells in people''s heart is greater. What do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 182, 18, 36, 'we see as the purpose of God filling us with the Spirit - So that we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 182, 19, 36, 'do the works that Jesus did, or in other words, the will of God. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 182, 20, 36, 'the life that God offers through the power of the Holy Spirit, in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 182, 21, 36, 'new agreement (New Covenant) that God has made with man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 182, 22, 36, 'Turn with me to Romans 8:3-4 where we have these wonderful words which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 182, 23, 36, 'tells us what God can do for us. Now this is intensely practical. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 182, 24, 36, 'believe the whole Bible has been given to us for practical Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 182, 25, 36, 'living. It is not meant for theological study primarily. What we read in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 182, 26, 36, 'Romans 8:3-4 is, "What the law could not do because of the weakness of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 182, 27, 36, 'the flesh, God did". What was it the law could not do? The law could not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 182, 28, 36, 'make me pure inside; the law could not make me overcome sin in my heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 183, 1, 36, 'It could only help me overcome sin on the outside. How did then God do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 183, 2, 36, 'this?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 183, 3, 36, '"He sent His own Son, in the likeness of sinful flesh ." That means like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 183, 4, 36, 'us, but without sin. He came only in the likeness, not in our sinful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 183, 5, 36, 'flesh, but in the likeness of sinful flesh. He gave His body on Calvary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 183, 6, 36, 'as an offering for sin, and there , God judged our sin in the flesh of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 183, 7, 36, 'Jesus. We read in Romans 8:3 as to why God did that? So that "The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 183, 8, 36, 'righteous requirement of the law can now be fulfilled inside of us" -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 183, 9, 36, 'the law which said, ''You shall not covet'' can now be fulfilled. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 183, 10, 36, 'opposite of you shall not covet is you shall love. The opposite of you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 183, 11, 36, 'shall not lust is you shall love. That righteous requirement of the law');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 183, 12, 36, 'can now be fulfilled inside us. The requirement of the law of purity, of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 183, 13, 36, 'holiness, can now be fulfilled inside us, when we walk in the power of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 183, 14, 36, 'the Holy Spirit. This is what Jesus has come to do for us. This is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 183, 15, 36, 'significance of Jesus coming to earth and dying, and giving us the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 183, 16, 36, 'Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 183, 17, 36, 'Now God has not promised to make us sinlessly perfect on this earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 183, 18, 36, 'There is nobody on earth who has walked in sinless perfection other than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 183, 19, 36, 'Jesus Christ; not Paul, nobody. But the Bible says we are to press on to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 183, 20, 36, 'perfection. Jesus came without sin and, therefore, He lived a sinlessly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 183, 21, 36, 'perfect life. But in us, there is so much of unconscious sin; corruption');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 183, 22, 36, 'in our flesh. That is because we have lived in sin so much. Throughout');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 183, 23, 36, 'our lifetime on earth, we will never be sinlessly perfect.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 183, 24, 36, 'In fact, John says, "If anyone says he has no sin in him, he is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 183, 25, 36, 'deceiving himself, he''s telling a lie." But we can press on to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 183, 26, 36, 'perfection, like it says in Hebrews 6:1, and become more and more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 183, 27, 36, 'perfect in holiness. For example, take our speech. Jesus'' speech was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 183, 28, 36, 'perfectly pure. No filthy word ever escaped His lips; no idle word; no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 184, 1, 36, 'untruthful word. He always spoke the truth. There was no deceit in His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 184, 2, 36, 'mouth. You could not engage Jesus in useless conversations. You could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 184, 3, 36, 'not engage Jesus in discussions about evil concerning other people. No,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 184, 4, 36, 'His mind was pure.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 184, 5, 36, 'He used material things but He didn''t love them. His holiness was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 184, 6, 36, 'inward. It was not an outward holiness manifested in food and of special');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 184, 7, 36, 'type of dress or in associating with holy people. Neither was His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 184, 8, 36, 'holiness that of being a hermit or sanyasi, living out in the desert of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 184, 9, 36, 'the wilderness. No, He lived in the midst of other people, working like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 184, 10, 36, 'other people, wearing the same type of dress that other people wore and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 184, 11, 36, 'eating and drinking just like others; enjoying the good things that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 184, 12, 36, 'has given man to enjoy, and yet in purity. He was not self-indulgent in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 184, 13, 36, 'the matter of food. He was not fashionable in the way He wore clothes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 184, 14, 36, 'He did not associate only with religious people; He associated with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 184, 15, 36, 'sinners.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 184, 16, 36, 'This is Jesus'' Holiness. It was a life of purity. Not just in avoiding');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 184, 17, 36, 'sin, but also avoiding anything that was unnecessary and wasteful. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 184, 18, 36, 'there He has given us an example of what true holiness is. I believe if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 184, 19, 36, 'we look at Jesus'' life more and more, we will be transformed from one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 184, 20, 36, 'degree of glory to another in His likeness by the holy Spirit as per the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 184, 21, 36, 'wonderful promise in 2 Corinthians 3:18. Take this promise to heart and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 184, 22, 36, 'say, ''Lord transform me to the likeness of Christ, fill me with the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 184, 23, 36, 'Spirit.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 184, 24, 37, 'Chapter 37 Jesus Valued All People');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 184, 25, 37, 'We want to think about a word that many people use - ''love,'' but which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 184, 26, 37, 'most people don''t understand. True love is unselfish. The love, which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 184, 27, 37, 'many people think of, is actually selfish lust. We want to consider what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 184, 28, 37, 'it means to really love as seen in the life of Jesus Christ, our Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 185, 1, 37, 'When we speak about holiness, many people think of holiness as dry,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 185, 2, 37, 'starchy religion or something repulsive, or hard, or strict. But that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 185, 3, 37, 'not the holiness Jesus manifested. God is holy, absolutely holy. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 185, 4, 37, 'Bible also says that God is love. Therefore, true holiness is perfect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 185, 5, 37, 'love. I want to say that again: True holiness is perfect love. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 185, 6, 37, 'have holiness without love, it is not the holiness of Jesus Christ. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 185, 7, 37, 'is the so-called holiness of the Pharisees. It is self-righteousness. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 185, 8, 37, 'may be a disciplined life; maybe you pay your taxes, you pray, read the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 185, 9, 37, 'Bible, tithe, and do so many things, but you are like a skeleton.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 185, 10, 37, 'You can''t draw people if you are a skeleton; people are not attracted to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 185, 11, 37, 'a skeleton. Supposing you are walking down a dark street one night, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 185, 12, 37, 'you see a skeleton walking towards you, just a skeleton - just skull and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 185, 13, 37, 'bones, walking towards you from the opposite direction, what would you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 185, 14, 37, 'do? Would you feel like embracing that one? Running forward to meet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 185, 15, 37, 'that? Or, would you feel like turning around and running away? That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 185, 16, 37, 'how the Pharisees were. People felt like running away from them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 185, 17, 37, 'Unfortunately, that is how many self-righteous Christians are. Even many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 185, 18, 37, 'Christians who say, ''We are in the separated assemblies, we are not like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 185, 19, 37, 'the dead denomination, we are separated from all that, we are holy,'' but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 185, 20, 37, 'they are like skeletons. People run away from them. They are like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 185, 21, 37, 'Pharisees. But Jesus was not like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 185, 22, 37, 'Yes, we need to be holy, we need to have truth. The Bible says in John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 185, 23, 37, '1:14 that the glory of God was seen in Jesus, full of grace and truth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 185, 24, 37, 'There is a balance. Consider our body, do we need bones or not? If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 185, 25, 37, 'didn''t have bones, you wouldn''t be able to stand up, you wouldn''t be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 185, 26, 37, 'able to sit down. You will collapse like a jellyfish that has got no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 185, 27, 37, 'bones in it. Spiritually speaking, some people are like that. You know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 185, 28, 37, 'there are certain disadvantages in having bones. For example, you cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 186, 1, 37, 'squeeze through a very narrow opening. But a jellyfish can squeeze');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 186, 2, 37, 'through anything. It just becomes thin as it has no bones and slides');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 186, 3, 37, 'through it. It is like a sponge. You can squeeze a sponge through any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 186, 4, 37, 'opening, any shape, and any size. But we can''t go through because we got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 186, 5, 37, 'bones.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 186, 6, 37, 'Some people, spiritually speaking, are like jellyfish; they compromise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 186, 7, 37, 'They have no convictions. They don''t stand for the truth. They don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 186, 8, 37, 'stand for holiness. They are like people without any bones. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 186, 9, 37, 'certainly not God''s will. On the other hand, if we are only bones, like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 186, 10, 37, 'I said, you will be like a skeleton; you will scare people away. But God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 186, 11, 37, 'has made this body so beautiful. What is it that makes our body');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 186, 12, 37, 'attractive? The bones are covered over with flesh. When you say somebody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 186, 13, 37, 'is handsome, or a girl is pretty, what do you mean? It is not their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 186, 14, 37, 'skeleton you are talking about. I mean, if you pull off the flesh, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 186, 15, 37, 'skeleton looks the same as the ugliest people in the world. It is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 186, 16, 37, 'flesh on top of that skeleton, beautifully featured that makes somebody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 186, 17, 37, 'attractive.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 186, 18, 37, 'Now apply this to the Christian life. It is not just truth. It is grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 186, 19, 37, 'on top of the truth that makes the words attractive. It is love and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 186, 20, 37, 'holiness. God is light and God is love. The two are inseparable. True');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 186, 21, 37, 'holiness is full of love, and true love is perfectly pure. So, in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 186, 22, 37, 'sense, they are not different. I mean, people say they have great love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 186, 23, 37, 'for everybody, but if they don''t live in purity and righteousness, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 186, 24, 37, 'is just not divine love. That is just wishy-washy sentimentality. Those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 186, 25, 37, 'who claim to have great holiness, but don''t have compassion and love for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 186, 26, 37, 'people, they are just Pharisees.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 186, 27, 37, 'How is it with Jesus? He was not a skeleton, and He was not a jellyfish.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 186, 28, 37, 'He had all the truth. He stood for everything that the Law of God stood');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 187, 1, 37, 'for, more than the Pharisees did. He was not just bones; the bones were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 187, 2, 37, 'covered over with flesh, as God intended human beings to be. This is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 187, 3, 37, 'balance of the divine glory that the Holy Spirit has come to communicate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 187, 4, 37, 'to you and me. Not to make you like a skeleton, a Christian who drives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 187, 5, 37, 'other people away. Neither does God want us to be a wishy-washy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 187, 6, 37, 'jellyfish, just compromising and able to fit in to any type of opening.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 187, 7, 37, 'No, God doesn''t want that either.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 187, 8, 37, 'We read that Jesus spoke the truth, but He spoke it in love. His word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 187, 9, 37, 'had authority, but they were also gracious. When it says that God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 187, 10, 37, 'love, it doesn''t mean He just acts lovingly. Now, a person can act');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 187, 11, 37, 'lovingly without any love in his heart. It could be just an external');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 187, 12, 37, 'action which is done to impress others. Jesus did not just go around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 187, 13, 37, 'doing acts of love. We can imitate somebody and do acts of love, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 187, 14, 37, 'know, like help the poor, do good. No, Jesus'' love came from deep within');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 187, 15, 37, 'His heart. Just like holiness and humility, love can be put on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 187, 16, 37, 'outside. Then it is just a garment that a person can put on or take off.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 187, 17, 37, 'Jesus said, "He who believes in Me, from his inner most being will flow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 187, 18, 37, 'rivers of living water." The spirit-filled man is a man from whose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 187, 19, 37, 'innermost being humility, holiness and love flow out. Our thoughts and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 187, 20, 37, 'our attitudes become holy and loving and not just the words and our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 187, 21, 37, 'actions. That can be just diplomacy. You know when we do something or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 187, 22, 37, 'say something, our thoughts and attitudes, towards that other person or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 187, 23, 37, 'toward those people, gives out a certain odour or smell of our life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 187, 24, 37, 'Others can easily detect it. Words and actions of love count for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 187, 25, 37, 'nothing, if our thoughts and attitudes towards others are still critical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 187, 26, 37, 'and selfish. The Bible says in Psalm 51:6 (David said that after he had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 187, 27, 37, 'sinned), " God desires truth in the innermost being. "He wants love to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 187, 28, 37, 'flow from our hearts. That is how it was with Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 188, 1, 37, 'So, as we look at the life of Jesus, we can see what the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 188, 2, 37, 'wants to make of our life. Let me say, first of all, that if you love a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 188, 3, 37, 'person, you will value him. You see, Jesus placed a very high value on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 188, 4, 37, 'all human beings. It didn''t matter whether they were cultured,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 188, 5, 37, 'intelligent, clever, smart, or rich. It is very easy to place a great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 188, 6, 37, 'value on cultured, intelligent, rich people. But a godly man would value');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 188, 7, 37, 'all people; whether he is dressed in a suit and a tie, or he is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 188, 8, 37, 'beggar. If you can''t value a beggar as one of God''s creations , as one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 188, 9, 37, 'who is made in the image of God, you will not love him. Do you know what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 188, 10, 37, 'the Bible says in James 3:9 that "All human beings are made in the image');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 188, 11, 37, 'of God?" Yes, James says that in the context of use of our tongue in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 188, 12, 37, 'verse 8. Men have been made in the likeness of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 188, 13, 37, 'What about a beggar with his ragged clothes, lack of culture, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 188, 14, 37, 'illiteracy? Is he made in the image of God? If so, you will respect him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 188, 15, 37, 'Jesus respected all people. He did not make any difference between the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 188, 16, 37, 'rich and the poor; educated and the uneducated; the cultured and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 188, 17, 37, 'uncultured; or even between the righteous and the sinners. He valued');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 188, 18, 37, 'everyone, because everyone was made by God. Everyone was loved by God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 188, 19, 37, 'He came to die for everyone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 188, 20, 37, 'We can think that, when we start loving our fellow believers in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 188, 21, 37, 'local church, that itself is something wonderful. It certainly is. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 188, 22, 37, 'Jesus loved all men. Do you think He healed only the sick who believed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 188, 23, 37, 'in Him for salvation from sin? No, He healed so many sick people who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 188, 24, 37, 'were not interested in receiving anything further from Him. That was how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 188, 25, 37, 'His goodness was. Jesus never despised anyone because they were poor, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 188, 26, 37, 'ignorant, or ugly. No, Jesus once said that the whole world was not as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 188, 27, 37, 'valuable as one human soul. That is how He valued men.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 188, 28, 37, 'You know, just think you value your treasures; your stocks and your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 189, 1, 37, 'shares, your house, land, bank account, gold bars, car, and whatever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 189, 2, 37, 'else you have, put it all together. For Jesus, one human soul is worth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 189, 3, 37, 'more than all that, and much more than that. He said it was worth more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 189, 4, 37, 'than the whole world. That is why He delighted in men; He valued them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 189, 5, 37, 'He saw those men, those people who were being bound by Satan and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 189, 6, 37, 'deceived. He longed to bring them to the light, and to set them free.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 189, 7, 37, 'And His love for man was so great that He was willing even to pay the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 189, 8, 37, 'ultimate price of death, in order to free men from sin''s grip over their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 189, 9, 37, 'lives. Because He was willing to die for men, to save them from their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 189, 10, 37, 'sins, He had the right to preach against sin so forcefully. You know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 189, 11, 37, 'Jesus turned around to the Pharisees and said, "You generation of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 189, 12, 37, 'vipers." Do you think you and I can say that to religious people, even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 189, 13, 37, 'if they are as bad as the Pharisees? Well, you can say that if you love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 189, 14, 37, 'them enough to die for them; otherwise, you can''t. It is very easy to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 189, 15, 37, 'get up and say it. Any fool can get up and say such words. But to say it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 189, 16, 37, 'in the spirit of Christ is quite another thing. Remember, He was willing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 189, 17, 37, 'to die to save them from their sin and, that is why, He had the right to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 189, 18, 37, 'use such strong words. We have no right to preach against sin if we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 189, 19, 37, 'not willing to do anything to save people from their sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 189, 20, 37, 'This is what it means to speak the truth in love. To speak the truth is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 189, 21, 37, 'easy. Anybody can do that. Some people think, "I am a great prophet; I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 189, 22, 37, 'am going to say the truth." But to be like Jesus, we got to do it in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 189, 23, 37, 'love. Let us look at the life of Jesus more carefully and see how this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 189, 24, 37, 'love came from His life, and ask the Holy Spirit to fill our heart with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 189, 25, 37, 'that same love.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 189, 26, 38, 'Chapter 38 Jesus Valued People More Than Things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 189, 27, 38, 'Do you know what God wants us to do with people as opposed to things? We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 189, 28, 38, 'are supposed to love people and use material things. But do you know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 190, 1, 38, 'what is happening to the world today? People love material things and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 190, 2, 38, 'use people. This is the opposite. This is because man is following the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 190, 3, 38, 'devil. Jesus is our example. Let us look at Him and learn something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 190, 4, 38, 'about this.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 190, 5, 38, 'One of the things that sin has done in this world is to turn everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 190, 6, 38, 'upside down. Our sense of values is upside down. The world is full of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 190, 7, 38, 'people who think that money is more important than God. With their lips');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 190, 8, 38, 'they say that God is more important than money, but in their lives, what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 190, 9, 38, 'urges them, motivates them, what they live for, proves that money is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 190, 10, 38, 'more important than God. Don''t you think that such a world is living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 190, 11, 38, 'upside down?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 190, 12, 38, 'In the midst of this upside-down world, God has sent His children to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 190, 13, 38, 'show them the right way to live. But how are God''s children living? How');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 190, 14, 38, 'many Christians have you met in your life that, by observing their life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 190, 15, 38, 'you could say that they believe that God is more important than money?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 190, 16, 38, 'There are very few; very, very few. The vast majority of Christians in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 190, 17, 38, 'our country also believe that money is more important than God. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 190, 18, 38, 'one example of an upside-down world. When money becomes more important');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 190, 19, 38, 'than God, money also becomes more important than people. We love money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 190, 20, 38, 'more than we love human beings. This is tragic.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 190, 21, 38, 'Jesus has come to show us the truth that God is more important than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 190, 22, 38, 'money, that people are more important than money. If that understanding');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 190, 23, 38, 'has not come into your mind, my friend, I want to tell you the truth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 190, 24, 38, 'that your mind is still perverted; It is upside down. Things have been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 190, 25, 38, 'given by God for us to use. Now, all material things, money, food,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 190, 26, 38, 'fruits, vegetables, and everything in the world has been given, not to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 190, 27, 38, 'be loved but to be used. But people have been given to us not to be used');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 190, 28, 38, 'but to be loved. Do you use people?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 191, 1, 38, 'Do you know that the world is full of factories and offices where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 191, 2, 38, 'businessmen use people for their own ends? To achieve their own ends,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 191, 3, 38, 'they use people. Of course, they pay them a salary as little as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 191, 4, 38, 'possible, but in order to promote themselves and promote their business.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 191, 5, 38, 'Well, we can understand that in the business world. But the same thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 191, 6, 38, 'is happening in many Christian organisations and Churches where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 191, 7, 38, 'so-called Christian leaders use people to promote themselves. We can say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 191, 8, 38, 'that such people have not understood the love of Jesus. They have not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 191, 9, 38, 'understood what it is to value people. They use people for their own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 191, 10, 38, 'ends. They have not been converted to a right way of thinking; their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 191, 11, 38, 'mind has not yet been renewed. But how is it with Jesus?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 191, 12, 38, 'Jesus never used anybody to promote Himself; He loved people. He knew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 191, 13, 38, 'that people were far more important than material things. Think of Judas');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 191, 14, 38, 'Iscariot, you will see a clear example. Judas Iscariot was the treasurer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 191, 15, 38, 'of that band of disciples. Whenever people gave money to that group that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 191, 16, 38, 'were with Jesus, Judas kept that money as a treasurer. Now, have you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 191, 17, 38, 'ever thought, to whom where the people giving that money? Were they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 191, 18, 38, 'giving it because they appreciated Judas or because they appreciated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 191, 19, 38, 'Jesus? That is clear. They gave their money in appreciation for Jesus''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 191, 20, 38, 'ministry; for His healing perhaps, for His preaching. Jesus took it and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 191, 21, 38, 'told Judas to keep it. It was not Judas'' money at all. It was money that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 191, 22, 38, 'came because of Jesus'' ministry.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 191, 23, 38, 'Well, what was Judas doing with that money? He was stealing it, using it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 191, 24, 38, 'for himself. Still Jesus loved Judas. He was willing to lose that money,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 191, 25, 38, 'if He could save Judas'' soul. He was not bothered that Judas was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 191, 26, 38, 'stealing that money. He was concerned about His soul. That is an example');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 191, 27, 38, 'of Jesus'' attitude to people. He wanted to save people from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 191, 28, 38, 'corruption of sin, which had made them value material-things more than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 192, 1, 38, 'people. Jesus shared the burdens of people. He had words of kindness for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 192, 2, 38, 'those who were defeated in life''s battle; words of encouragement for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 192, 3, 38, 'downtrodden. He never considered a single human being as worthless. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 192, 4, 38, 'may be uncultured, crude, not able to speak properly, or illiterate, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 192, 5, 38, 'they were people who needed to be redeemed, and He had come to give His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 192, 6, 38, 'life for them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 192, 7, 38, 'When the Bible says that the Holy Spirit fills our hearts with the love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 192, 8, 38, 'of God, this is what happens; it makes us like this towards people. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 192, 9, 38, 'want to ask you, as a Christian, if you are a Christian, has the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 192, 10, 38, 'Spirit filled you? You know a lot of people speak about being filled');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 192, 11, 38, 'with the Holy Spirit. What is the proof that your heart has been filled');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 192, 12, 38, 'with the Holy Spirit? The answer is in Romans 5:5"The love of God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 192, 13, 38, 'been spread abroad in our hearts through the Holy Spirit." One mark of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 192, 14, 38, 'being filled with the spirit is that your heart is filled with love for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 192, 15, 38, 'people and you will be right side up. You will not be upside down. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 192, 16, 38, 'will value people more than material things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 192, 17, 38, 'Jesus never valued material things; He used them. He worked in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 192, 18, 38, 'carpenter shop where He was using material things all the time; working');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 192, 19, 38, 'with them to earn His living as a carpenter for many years. Can you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 192, 20, 38, 'imagine some neighbour''s child walking into that carpenter shop one day,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 192, 21, 38, 'and break something expensive which Jesus had just made? What do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 192, 22, 38, 'think Jesus would have done? Do you think that Jesus would have got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 192, 23, 38, 'upset and shouted at that child and chased Him out of the carpenter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 192, 24, 38, 'shop? No, I think Jesus would have just picked up that child, kissed him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 192, 25, 38, 'and said, ''Don''t worry My son, it is okay. I can make another one.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 192, 26, 38, 'He loved people. He loved children. Material things didn''t mean anything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 192, 27, 38, 'to Him. Material things were to be used to help people. He did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 192, 28, 38, 'become a carpenter in order to be rich. No, He loved people and not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 193, 1, 38, 'things. When the Holy Spirit renews our mind, you know what happens? We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 193, 2, 38, 'are able to see in the way God sees. We see people as God''s sees people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 193, 3, 38, 'We see material things as God sees material things. And, I believe, one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 193, 4, 38, 'of the most important prayers you need to pray, if you want to be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 193, 5, 38, 'spiritual man, is to ask the Lord to help you to see people as He sees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 193, 6, 38, 'them; to see material things as He sees them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 193, 7, 38, 'The Bible says in Zephaniah 3:17 that God rejoices over His people with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 193, 8, 38, 'singing. Now think of that verse: God rejoicing over all people, and not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 193, 9, 38, 'over perfect people. There are no perfect people anywhere in the world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 193, 10, 38, 'He is rejoicing over imperfect people who have expressed a desire for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 193, 11, 38, 'Him and who want to love Him with all their imperfections. When Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 193, 12, 38, 'walked on this earth, He shared His Father''s joy over people. Think of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 193, 13, 38, 'the disciples that were with Jesus. They were not perfect. They were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 193, 14, 38, 'ordinary, stumbling sinners, just like you and me. But Jesus looked at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 193, 15, 38, 'them the way the Father looked at them. He loved them. He wasn''t always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 193, 16, 38, 'criticising them for their fault, their awkwardness and their crudeness,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 193, 17, 38, 'because He was compassionate.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 193, 18, 38, 'We read in Mark 12:37 that common people heard Him gladly. People');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 193, 19, 38, 'detected the beautiful aroma that came out of His spirit; the love of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 193, 20, 38, 'God that flowed out of His heart. Jesus was constantly moved with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 193, 21, 38, 'compassion when He saw sick people, needy people, hungry people or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 193, 22, 38, 'shepherd-less people. He put Himself in their shoes. He made their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 193, 23, 38, 'misery His own and that is how He was able to comfort them. You know,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 193, 24, 38, 'you can comfort the misery of other people, my friend, only if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 193, 25, 38, 'identify with them. It is very easy to speak nice words, but you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 193, 26, 38, 'got to put yourself in their shoes to understand what they are going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 193, 27, 38, 'through. And that is what Jesus did.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 193, 28, 38, 'You know, we have used our imagination so much in the past for evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 194, 1, 38, 'things. Is that not true? You have used your imagination to think dirty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 194, 2, 38, 'things, bitter things about other people, and all types of evil things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 194, 3, 38, 'Now that we are converted, what do we use our imagination for? Most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 194, 4, 38, 'Christians use their imagination for nothing. Let me tell you something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 194, 5, 38, 'good that can put your imagination for good use. Use your imagination to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 194, 6, 38, 'put yourself in the situations of other people who are suffering, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 194, 7, 38, 'ones you know around you. When you see it, when you hear about it, put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 194, 8, 38, 'yourself in their shoes. Use your imagination to think that you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 194, 9, 38, 'there; living in that little hut or living with that difficult husband');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 194, 10, 38, 'or difficult wife or having a problem child as if you were the parent.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 194, 11, 38, 'Put yourself in their shoes and try to understand what they are going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 194, 12, 38, 'through. That would be the proof of your love. Jesus did that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 194, 13, 38, 'He was so grieved once when He saw men hard-hearted, unwilling to let a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 194, 14, 38, 'man with a withered hand be healed in the synagogue. One day, as He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 194, 15, 38, 'walked by, He saw a widow going in a funeral procession where her only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 194, 16, 38, 'son had died. He stopped the whole funeral procession, opened the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 194, 17, 38, 'coffin, raised the boy from the dead, and gave him back to the mother.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 194, 18, 38, 'This miracle was not to show people His power. No, it was to show them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 194, 19, 38, 'the love of God. He had compassion. Every miracle of Jesus rose out of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 194, 20, 38, 'compassion. If you seek to do miracles for God, and if you don''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 194, 21, 38, 'compassion, you will never be able to follow Jesus. You are unfit to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 194, 22, 38, 'His servant.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 194, 23, 38, 'Jesus always died to His own rights. He had no tears for His own grief');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 194, 24, 38, 'and sorrows. But He shed drops of blood for our sorrows; He carried our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 194, 25, 38, 'burdens. He was never offended by anything that people said or did to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 194, 26, 38, 'him. He was never offended by the failure of others to do what they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 194, 27, 38, 'should have done for Him, because He never came here to serve. He never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 194, 28, 38, 'imposed burdens on others. He came to carry other people''s burdens, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 195, 1, 38, 'serve them, not to be served. Because He lived like this, His love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 195, 2, 38, 'flowed out like a sweet perfume and people were drawn to Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 195, 3, 38, 'Why the message of Christ is no more accepted in our country? - Is it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 195, 4, 38, 'not because Christians do not seek to have this love. If you are a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 195, 5, 38, 'Christian, claiming the name of Christ, I want to encourage you. Seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 195, 6, 38, 'with all your heart, that you will have such a love, like a sweet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 195, 7, 38, 'perfume coming forth from your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 195, 8, 39, 'Chapter 39 Jesus Was Unpopular');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 195, 9, 39, 'We want to consider a little further about the example of Jesus in His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 195, 10, 39, 'earthly life as a model for the holy life that He wants us to live.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 195, 11, 39, 'As we look at the life of Jesus, we have been seeing that, God not only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 195, 12, 39, 'sent His Son to die for the sins of the world, but the way He lived on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 195, 13, 39, 'earth is to be a demonstration to all of us as to how God wants man to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 195, 14, 39, 'live. We saw His humility and we have seen a little bit about His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 195, 15, 39, 'holiness. His was a life that overcame sin; it was a life of purity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 195, 16, 39, 'What was the source of this?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 195, 17, 39, 'Jesus'' holiness came out of a life of meditation on the word of God. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 195, 18, 39, 'read in the scriptures, in Luke 2, that when He was 12 years old, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 195, 19, 39, 'knew enough of the scriptures to even confound the great scholars of His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 195, 20, 39, 'time. And remember, in those days, there were no printed Bibles like we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 195, 21, 39, 'have today; People did not have a Bible in their home. Nobody had a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 195, 22, 39, 'Bible in their home. The Old Testament was handwritten and only the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 195, 23, 39, 'synagogue in the village or town would have a copy. Only rich people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 195, 24, 39, 'could afford to have even portions of the Old Testament with them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 195, 25, 39, 'So, it was only those who listened carefully, when they were being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 195, 26, 39, 'taught by the Rabbis in the synagogue, could know what the scripture');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 195, 27, 39, 'said. And Jesus listened as a little boy. Remember, He had emptied');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 195, 28, 39, 'Himself of all that supernatural ability He had as God. He came as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 196, 1, 39, 'little baby. The Bible says He grew in wisdom. In other words, His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 196, 2, 39, 'growth was just like ours, growing in the knowledge of the word. Only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 196, 3, 39, 'thus could He be an example for us. From that meditation on the word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 196, 4, 39, 'God, He saw and understood what the Father wanted, just like we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 196, 5, 39, 'understand it. He saw that the word of God spoke more than what was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 196, 6, 39, 'written on the surface. He dug deep. The Bible says that, if you dig as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 196, 7, 39, 'you would dig for hidden treasure, only then that you will find the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 196, 8, 39, 'knowledge of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 196, 9, 39, 'To have a superficial knowledge of the Bible is easy. You can read the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 196, 10, 39, 'Bible like you read a physics book or a chemistry book and get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 196, 11, 39, 'knowledge. But to know God through His word, that is quite a different');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 196, 12, 39, 'thing. And that came to Jesus through, not just by meditation, but also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 196, 13, 39, 'by obedience to what He saw in the Word. Many people read the Bible only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 196, 14, 39, 'to get messages to preach, particularly if you are a preacher. You are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 196, 15, 39, 'in great danger of reading the Bible only to get messages, or reading');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 196, 16, 39, 'books in order to prepare sermons, or listening to tapes to get points');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 196, 17, 39, 'for your sermons. That is a very dangerous practice because you can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 196, 18, 39, 'more interested in what you have to say to other people than what God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 196, 19, 39, 'has to say to you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 196, 20, 39, 'Now the best way to prepare a sermon is, first of all, to hear what God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 196, 21, 39, 'is saying to you and to obey that, and then from your life speak it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 196, 22, 39, 'forth as a message for others. Then it has gone through you. The word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 196, 23, 39, 'God is like a two-edged sword. One edge must cut you before you can use');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 196, 24, 39, 'the other edge, in your ministry, to expose sin in another. When Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 196, 25, 39, 'meditated on the word of God, He found that there were a lot of things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 196, 26, 39, 'there which are completely contrary to the traditions that were being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 196, 27, 39, 'practiced by people in His time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 196, 28, 39, 'It was not just meditation on the Word but also Jesus depended on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 197, 1, 39, 'Holy Spirit. The Bible says that Jesus was filled with the Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 197, 2, 39, 'Jesus lived just like us. His holiness came out of a life of meditation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 197, 3, 39, 'of God''s word and being filled with the Holy Spirit. If we follow in His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 197, 4, 39, 'footsteps, we too would get revelation on His word and our life will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 197, 5, 39, 'come to holiness, genuine holiness, getting in line with God''s thoughts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 197, 6, 39, 'The Bible speaks about our mind being renewed that comes through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 197, 7, 39, 'meditation on God''s word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 197, 8, 39, 'When He saw that God''s word proclaimed a certain standard and certain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 197, 9, 39, 'thing, He preached that even though His preaching ran counter to or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 197, 10, 39, 'against all the popular traditions of His day. Jesus did not go forth as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 197, 11, 39, 'a scholar or as one who had graduated from some Bible school. He went');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 197, 12, 39, 'forth as One who had meditated on God''s word in secret, lived in secret');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 197, 13, 39, 'and heard God speaking to Him through the spirit. He spoke forth the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 197, 14, 39, 'word as a prophet, not just as a preacher; He proclaimed it faithfully.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 197, 15, 39, 'This is what made Him expose the hypocrisies and the worldliness of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 197, 16, 39, 'Pharisees. Now, the other people couldn''t see that; other people just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 197, 17, 39, 'blindly thought that the Pharisees were spiritual people. Jesus, not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 197, 18, 39, 'only exposed the hypocrisy of the Pharisees, He exposed the doctrinal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 197, 19, 39, 'error - the wrong interpretations of the scriptures that the Sadducees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 197, 20, 39, 'held.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 197, 21, 39, 'Jesus'' holiness is seen in the fact that He never sought to be popular');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 197, 22, 39, 'in His preaching. It is a tremendous temptation to a preacher to seek to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 197, 23, 39, 'be popular, particularly if you want to receive money for your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 197, 24, 39, 'preaching. If you preach things that offend people, you won''t get gifts;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 197, 25, 39, 'you won''t get invited back again. But then, you won''t proclaim God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 197, 26, 39, 'word faithfully as well. All who proclaim God''s word must proclaim it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 197, 27, 39, 'prophetically as the mouthpiece of God. That is part of holiness. Our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 197, 28, 39, 'holiness needs to be seen not only in our life but in our words. We must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 198, 1, 39, 'be absolutely true to God. Holiness is manifested in not seeking to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 198, 2, 39, 'please men but to please God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 198, 3, 39, 'There was a time, when even His enemies told Him, as we read in Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 198, 4, 39, '22:16 in the Living Bible: "We know Teacher that you are very honest,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 198, 5, 39, 'and you teach the truth regardless of the consequences, without fear or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 198, 6, 39, 'favour." Those of you who preach, if you are a preacher, I want to ask');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 198, 7, 39, 'you a personal question. Can it be said of your preaching that you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 198, 8, 39, 'honest, and you teach the truth regardless of the consequences, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 198, 9, 39, 'without fear and without favour? That is the type of preacher India');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 198, 10, 39, 'needs to hear in every Church. That is how Jesus was. If we looked at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 198, 11, 39, 'Jesus, we would see that we have to be like Him in this area.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 198, 12, 39, 'Jesus had a tremendous zeal for the purity of God''s house. You know,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 198, 13, 39, 'when people beat Him, pulled the hairs out of His head and face - His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 198, 14, 39, 'beard, and ill-treated Him in so many ways, called Him the prince of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 198, 15, 39, 'devils, He never got angry. He never said anything. He just accepted it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 198, 16, 39, 'You could do anything to Jesus personally, and He would never say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 198, 17, 39, 'anything; He would just forgive you. But when He saw God''s house being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 198, 18, 39, 'defiled by people trying to make money in the name of religion, He was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 198, 19, 39, 'different person. It says in John 2:15 that He made a whip and He drove');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 198, 20, 39, 'them all out of the temple. He said, “Stop making My Father''s house a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 198, 21, 39, 'house of business." Then His disciples remembered what was written in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 198, 22, 39, 'the scriptures, in the Old Testament, "Zeal for Your house will consume');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 198, 23, 39, 'Me." Righteous anger burned in Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 198, 24, 39, 'Do you know the meaning of the verse in Ephesians 4:26 where it says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 198, 25, 39, '"Be angry but do no sin?" There is a command in that verse asking you to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 198, 26, 39, 'be angry. Now, we always thought that anger is a sin. Anger is a sin in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 198, 27, 39, 'certain situations. In certain other situations, as it says in Ephesians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 198, 28, 39, '4:26, we must be angry. How to know the difference? We can know the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 199, 1, 39, 'difference from the life of Jesus. When was it He was not angry? When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 199, 2, 39, 'they insulted Him, spoke evil of Him, slapped Him, beat Him, pull the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 199, 3, 39, 'hairs from His beard, spat on Him, crucified Him, He was never angry. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 199, 4, 39, 'said, "Father, forgive them." When was He angry? He was angry when God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 199, 5, 39, 'house was being defiled; when poor people were being exploited; when the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 199, 6, 39, 'Pharisees and the elders of the synagogue would not allow Him to heal a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 199, 7, 39, 'man with a withered hand on the Sabbath day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 199, 8, 39, 'So, we see the type of anger that we need to have is , when we see God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 199, 9, 39, 'house and God''s name being dishonoured; when we see poor people being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 199, 10, 39, 'exploited. And when is it we should never be angry? When people insult');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 199, 11, 39, 'us, harm us, exploit us, and do all types of evil to us, and speak all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 199, 12, 39, 'types of evil to us. So, in anything concerning ourselves, we should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 199, 13, 39, 'never be angry. But when it concerns the purity of God''s house, and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 199, 14, 39, 'way people exploit others, then we need to be angry.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 199, 15, 39, 'Unfortunately, in the world, it is the other way around. It is tragic.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 199, 16, 39, 'People in the world get angry when it concerns them. When they see God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 199, 17, 39, 'name being dishonoured in the church, they are not angry. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 199, 18, 39, 'exactly the opposite of how it was with Jesus. Jesus was angry when it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 199, 19, 39, 'concerned God''s house. There is an anger that is holy, and there is an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 199, 20, 39, 'anger that is sinful. When Jesus used the whip that day in the temple,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 199, 21, 39, 'He was not bothered whether people misunderstood Him. He was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 199, 22, 39, 'bothered what even His disciples thought about Him. He was only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 199, 23, 39, 'concerned about the purity of God''s house. He didn''t lose control of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 199, 24, 39, 'Himself. He was in perfect control of Himself. He was not diplomatic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 199, 25, 39, 'either. He didn''t go to those people, who were changing money, and say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 199, 26, 39, '''Will you gentleman please move your table?'' He never said anything like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 199, 27, 39, 'that. He turned the tables, made the coins run here and there, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 199, 28, 39, 'chased the sheep and the oxen and the birds, all out of the compound.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 200, 1, 39, 'Yeah, that wasn''t a gentlemanly thing to do. But when it came to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 200, 2, 39, 'purity of God''s house, Jesus was fiery. He came to bring a sword and He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 200, 3, 39, 'used it unsparingly. It cut, it wounded, and it hurt, and thus the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 200, 4, 39, 'Father''s glory was manifested.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 200, 5, 39, 'So, holiness in the life of Jesus brought Him a lot of misunderstanding,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 200, 6, 39, 'opposition and persecution. It is the same in the world today. You are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 200, 7, 39, 'not going to be popular if you live a holy life. I mean, if you are only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 200, 8, 39, 'thinking in terms of paying your taxes, washing people''s feet, doing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 200, 9, 39, 'what is right, and never exposing sin in Christendom, then you may be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 200, 10, 39, 'popular. Then you are being diplomatic. But if you follow Jesus all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 200, 11, 39, 'way, your holiness will lead you to expose sin. The Bible says, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 200, 12, 39, 'Ephesians 5, that we must, by our life, expose and rebuke the works of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 200, 13, 39, 'darkness. Jesus'' life was the most beautiful, the most orderly, the most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 200, 14, 39, 'peaceful, and the happiest life this world has ever seen, because He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 200, 15, 39, 'only interested in pleasing God. He was not interested in pleasing a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 200, 16, 39, 'single human being. He didn''t care about people''s opinions.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 200, 17, 39, 'Do you know that you and I can live such a life? Do you long for such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 200, 18, 39, 'life? Why don''t you bow you head right now, as you complete reading this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 200, 19, 39, 'study and pray a simple prayer. Say, "Lord Jesus, I have been trying to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 200, 20, 39, 'please men too much. Forgive me. Help me to follow You and seek to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 200, 21, 39, 'please You alone."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 200, 22, 40, 'Chapter 40 Jesus Obeyed The Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 200, 23, 40, 'We once again want to look at the life of Jesus, particularly in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 200, 24, 40, 'relation to the holiness of His life. We will look at another aspect of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 200, 25, 40, 'His holiness: His total obedience to the will of the Father, whatever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 200, 26, 40, 'the cost. The more we look at the life of Jesus, the more we will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 200, 27, 40, 'understand how we are supposed to live on this earth, and our life would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 200, 28, 40, 'be perfectly peaceful and orderly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 201, 1, 40, 'Have you ever thought about the order that there is in the physical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 201, 2, 40, 'universe - the stars and the planets. They move about in the heavens in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 201, 3, 40, 'such perfect order that we can set our time accurately to the millionth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 201, 4, 40, 'of a second by them. They were moving around for thousands of years. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 201, 5, 40, 'they never lost time, even a split ‑ second timing. You can predict');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 201, 6, 40, 'where a particular star or a planet will be in one year, two years from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 201, 7, 40, 'now, on a particular date, at a particular time, because it never slows');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 201, 8, 40, 'down, it never goes too fast, it moves in its orbit. It moves according');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 201, 9, 40, 'to the speed which God has appointed for it. And that is why, when you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 201, 10, 40, 'look at the heavens, there is such a perfect order. No planet crashes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 201, 11, 40, 'into another. Everything moves about in perfect order. What is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 201, 12, 40, 'secret?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 201, 13, 40, 'The secret is they obey the will of God exactly. In those heavenly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 201, 14, 40, 'bodies, we have a message. You know the Bible says that though they do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 201, 15, 40, 'not speak, their voice goes around over the whole earth. What is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 201, 16, 40, 'voice that comes to us from these heavenly bodies? It is basically this:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 201, 17, 40, '''We have a Creator,'' that is what the stars and planets are saying, ''and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 201, 18, 40, 'we obey that Creator perfectly and we never have a problem. Everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 201, 19, 40, 'goes smoothly for us day by day because we obey our Creator totally.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 201, 20, 40, 'Have you heard that message? Do you believe it is true?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 201, 21, 40, 'Why is there so much chaos, confusion, perhaps in your life, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 201, 22, 40, 'certainly in the world? It is because of disobedience. The one Man who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 201, 23, 40, 'walked on this earth, who lived in perfect rest at all times in peace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 201, 24, 40, 'and in joy, whose life was in perfect order at all times, who was never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 201, 25, 40, 'disturbed by what other people did, or tried to do; the evil that people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 201, 26, 40, 'did, who did not bother about whether He had a following or no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 201, 27, 40, 'following, was Jesus Christ. And the secret of His life was the same as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 201, 28, 40, 'the secret of the planets. He obeyed the will of His Father in heaven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 202, 1, 40, 'exactly, completely, totally. Wherever there is obedience to God, there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 202, 2, 40, 'is perfection and beauty. And wherever there is disobedience to God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 202, 3, 40, 'there is chaos and ugliness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 202, 4, 40, 'Do you think it is a burden for the stars and the planets to move in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 202, 5, 40, 'orbits that God has appointed for them? Some are so far away from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 202, 6, 40, 'sun that they are frozen throughout the year. Some planets are so close');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 202, 7, 40, 'to the sun that they are burning hot throughout the year. None of them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 202, 8, 40, 'complain. They believe that they are in the place which God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 202, 9, 40, 'appointed to them; absolutely the right place. Jesus'' whole life was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 202, 10, 40, 'like that. He never had any desire to go to places that His Father never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 202, 11, 40, 'wanted Him to go. His whole life was a demonstration of this truth, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 202, 12, 40, 'in this life and in eternity , godliness alone is most profitable. Of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 202, 13, 40, 'all the things there are, godliness is most profitable. No one can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 202, 14, 40, 'happier, or more peaceful, or more content, than a godly man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 202, 15, 40, 'The Bible says that the fear of the Lord is a fountain of life. When you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 202, 16, 40, 'fear God it is like having a fountain of life within you. The Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 202, 17, 40, 'exhorts us in Proverbs 23:17, "Live in the fear of the Lord the whole');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 202, 18, 40, 'day long." Jesus lived in that fear. Sometimes we think that whatever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 202, 19, 40, 'Jesus did was because He was the Son of God; some things automatically');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 202, 20, 40, 'happen for Him. But we read in Hebrews 5:8, "Although He was a Son, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 202, 21, 40, 'learned obedience from the things which He suffered." Why did He have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 202, 22, 40, 'learn? We also read in the previous verse (Heb. 5:7), that He was heard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 202, 23, 40, 'not because He was the Son of God, but because of His piety; because He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 202, 24, 40, 'feared His Father. It was the fear of His heavenly Father that made His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 202, 25, 40, 'prayers to be heard. There is an example for us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 202, 26, 40, 'You know, in every area, Jesus was thinking of an example for us. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 202, 27, 40, 'holier our life is, the more our prayers will be heard. Why does it say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 202, 28, 40, 'in the Bible, in James 5:17 onwards, that "The effectual fervent prayer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 203, 1, 40, 'of a righteous man avails much." Not anybody''s prayer; it is the prayer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 203, 2, 40, 'of a righteous man! The godlier a man is, the more his prayers are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 203, 3, 40, 'heard. Why was Jesus'' prayers heard? - Because He feared; because of His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 203, 4, 40, 'godly fear. Do you think that your prayers are heard no matter how you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 203, 5, 40, 'live? It is not true. David said in the Psalms, "If I regarded iniquity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 203, 6, 40, 'in my heart, the Lord will not hear me." A godly life is the most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 203, 7, 40, 'profitable life that any man can ever live. You may face problems, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 203, 8, 40, 'you will overcome them; every single one of them. If you have 1000');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 203, 9, 40, 'problems, you will overcome 1000. Not one will be left unsolved. You can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 203, 10, 40, 'overcome every single one of them, if you are godly, because God listens');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 203, 11, 40, 'to the prayer of those who fear Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 203, 12, 40, 'Let me tell you another result of being godly. The Bible says in Hebrews');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 203, 13, 40, '1:9 that Jesus was anointed with the oil of gladness. That means He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 203, 14, 40, 'perpetually fresh with gladness and joy. Not because He was God''s Son,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 203, 15, 40, 'but because He loved righteousness and hated sin. That is what that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 203, 16, 40, 'verse says. He was anointed with the oil of gladness above His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 203, 17, 40, 'companions. That means He had more joy and gladness in His life than all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 203, 18, 40, 'other believers, not because He was the Son of God but because He loved');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 203, 19, 40, 'righteousness, and hated sin. That we can say for ourselves too. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 203, 20, 40, 'more we love righteousness and the more we hate sin, the more the oil of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 203, 21, 40, 'gladness is going to overflow from our life. God can commit Himself only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 203, 22, 40, 'to a man who is upright morally. This is the secret of all spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 203, 23, 40, 'authority. If you want to have authority in your life over Satan, over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 203, 24, 40, 'your circumstances, over your problems, seek after godliness. Keep your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 203, 25, 40, 'conscience absolutely clear, whatever your conscience convicts you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 203, 26, 40, 'about. Never mind what other Christians do. You follow your conscience');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 203, 27, 40, 'and keep it absolutely clear. You will find spiritual authority coming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 203, 28, 40, 'in your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 204, 1, 40, 'Now religious people in Jesus'' time did not appreciate the holiness of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 204, 2, 40, 'Jesus. You know, one godly man can make a tremendous difference even in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 204, 3, 40, 'a city. There is a verse in Jeremiah 5:1, which says, ''If there was one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 204, 4, 40, 'godly man in Jerusalem at that time, the city would not have been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 204, 5, 40, 'captured by the Babylonians.'' Isn''t it a sad thing? Jerusalem could have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 204, 6, 40, 'been saved by one godly man, but there wasn''t even one. Sodom could have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 204, 7, 40, 'been saved if there were ten godly people there, but there weren''t ten.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 204, 8, 40, 'There may have been a thousand compromisers in Sodom and in Jerusalem,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 204, 9, 40, 'they couldn''t help. What is God looking for - Numbers? No. He has never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 204, 10, 40, 'looked for numbers. One thousand compromisers cannot save a city, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 204, 11, 40, 'one godly man can.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 204, 12, 40, 'One would have thought that, Jesus living in Nazareth would have been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 204, 13, 40, 'such a tremendous blessing to the synagogue there. But when He went to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 204, 14, 40, 'speak in that synagogue, His very first message, they interrupted Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 204, 15, 40, 'halfway. We read in Luke 4 that they took Him to the hill on which their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 204, 16, 40, 'city was built and wanted to throw Him down a cliff. What does this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 204, 17, 40, 'teach us? That even religious people do not appreciate genuine holiness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 204, 18, 40, 'Even religious Christians do not appreciate a man who comes with a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 204, 19, 40, 'message of holiness, godliness, victory over sin, and obedience to God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 204, 20, 40, 'commandments. Why did they hate Jesus so much? - Because He pointed out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 204, 21, 40, 'their sin, fearlessly. He pointed out their love of money. He pointed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 204, 22, 40, 'out their love of honour. He pointed out how they were seeking their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 204, 23, 40, 'own. He pointed out how they were interested just in their rituals and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 204, 24, 40, 'their traditions and keeping petty little rules, but they were not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 204, 25, 40, 'living in purity and compassion towards the needy. Therefore, Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 204, 26, 40, 'faced the hostility of people. He faced rejection, misunderstanding,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 204, 27, 40, 'opposition, hatred, criticism, rejection, ridicule, persecution,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 204, 28, 40, 'excommunication by all Jewish religious leaders. He was being warned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 205, 1, 40, 'about, being called bad names, and finally they killed Him, because He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 205, 2, 40, 'preached holiness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 205, 3, 40, 'So, you see, the result of living a holy life is not that you are going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 205, 4, 40, 'to get a medal; you are probably going to be crucified. They would not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 205, 5, 40, 'have crucified Him if He had just lived a holy life and not bothered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 205, 6, 40, 'them. But His holiness was such that, it was a like a light that exposed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 205, 7, 40, 'the darkness in them and they were determined to silence Him. Jesus said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 205, 8, 40, 'it like this in John 3:19- 20, "Their sentences are based on this fact');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 205, 9, 40, 'that the light from heaven came into this world, but they loved the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 205, 10, 40, 'darkness more than the light, for their deed s were evil. They hated the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 205, 11, 40, 'heavenly life because they wanted to sin in the darkness. They stayed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 205, 12, 40, 'away from that light for fear their sins would be exposed" (The Living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 205, 13, 40, 'Bible).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 205, 14, 40, 'My dear friends, the Christian religious world of today is just the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 205, 15, 40, 'same. If you walk in real holiness, you won''t get a medal. Instead, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 205, 16, 40, 'will be hated, rejected, misunderstood, persecuted, and probably');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 205, 17, 40, 'crucified. So, before you start following the Lord, do what Jesus says:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 205, 18, 40, 'Sit down and count the cost. It is worth it. Let us go forth to Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 205, 19, 40, 'outside the camp bearing His reproach.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 205, 20, 41, 'Chapter 41 Jesus’ speech was always loving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 205, 21, 41, 'Once again, we want to look at the perfect example of the one perfect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 205, 22, 41, 'Man that walked on this earth, Jesus Christ and to see in Him an example');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 205, 23, 41, 'for us to follow, particularly in the area of love.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 205, 24, 41, 'We have seen, in a previous study, how Jesus'' love was shown, not in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 205, 25, 41, 'sentimental words, but in the fact that He valued people; He had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 205, 26, 41, 'compassion for people. People were more important to Jesus than material');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 205, 27, 41, 'things. The love of Jesus is seen in the fact that He was willing to die');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 205, 28, 41, 'in order to save people from their sin. God so loved the world that He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 206, 1, 41, 'gave His only begotten Son. The highest proof of God''s love is in this,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 206, 2, 41, 'that He gave His Son to die for us. Jesus said, "Greater love has no man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 206, 3, 41, 'than this, that a man lays down his life for his friends." It was just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 206, 4, 41, 'not physically that Jesus died. Every day, in His relationships with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 206, 5, 41, 'people, He died to Himself. This is the cross that He told us to take up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 206, 6, 41, 'daily. The greatest proof of my love for another is that, I am willing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 206, 7, 41, 'to die to myself, to my rights, my reputation, my own interest, in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 206, 8, 41, 'relationship with that person. Anything less than this is not love.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 206, 9, 41, 'The world is full of people who seek their own; who are always seeking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 206, 10, 41, 'how this will benefit me. That is what I meant by using people for one''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 206, 11, 41, 'own ends. True love is totally interested in the other person and not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 206, 12, 41, 'interested in what I can get out of that other person for myself. If we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 206, 13, 41, 'don''t cleanse ourselves from this filthiness of the flesh and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 206, 14, 41, 'spirit, there is in all of us, we will never be able to love others with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 206, 15, 41, 'the love of God. We must ask the Holy Spirit to remove from us, to help');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 206, 16, 41, 'us crucify, these wrong attitudes, so that we can love people with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 206, 17, 41, 'love of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 206, 18, 41, 'This is one reason why Jesus was never irritated by people, even if they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 206, 19, 41, 'were crude, or stupid, or they made mistakes. They may have been slow,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 206, 20, 41, 'but they never got on His nerves. They never upset Him; their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 206, 21, 41, 'untidiness, their disorderliness, their slowness, their carelessness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 206, 22, 41, 'never made Him impatient and irritated. Why do these things that you see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 206, 23, 41, 'in other people irritate you? I will tell you the reason. It is because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 206, 24, 41, 'you are not willing to die to yourself. That is the reason. You do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 206, 25, 41, 'know love.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 206, 26, 41, 'We sing about love, we speak about love. But what is the proof of love?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 206, 27, 41, '- That I am willing to die; that when I see something slow or disorderly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 206, 28, 41, 'or untidy in that person, I am willing to die. I must love him first.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 207, 1, 41, 'You say, ''But don''t you think that we should correct him and set him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 207, 2, 41, 'right?'' Yes, by all means. Jesus also corrected. Why did people accept');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 207, 3, 41, 'Jesus'' corrections and not accept corrections from the Pharisees? Why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 207, 4, 41, 'was it different that when Jesus said something they listened and when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 207, 5, 41, 'the Pharisees said the same thing, they wouldn''t listen? It was because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 207, 6, 41, 'they saw Jesus loved them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 207, 7, 41, 'When people see that you love them, they will accept your corrections.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 207, 8, 41, 'It is when we don''t love them, and we correct them, that we become like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 207, 9, 41, 'the Pharisees. See, if I am irritated with a person, I am unfit to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 207, 10, 41, 'correct him. I need to correct myself. If I am impatient with people, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 207, 11, 41, 'am not ready to correct them. I need to correct my own impatience first.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 207, 12, 41, 'But how many people see that? Do you see that you need to correct your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 207, 13, 41, 'irritation, your impatience, and your lack of love, before you correct');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 207, 14, 41, 'the untidiness, or the disorderliness, or the carelessness, or the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 207, 15, 41, 'slowness of other people? Jesus said that before you see a speck in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 207, 16, 41, 'other person''s eye, you remove the beam from your own eye.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 207, 17, 41, 'You know a perfect person can easily bear with imperfect people. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 207, 18, 41, 'was perfect. That is why, even though He lived in a world that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 207, 19, 41, 'totally imperfect, He could bear with the imperfections of people. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 207, 20, 41, 'who are not at all perfect; we who are so imperfect, why is it we cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 207, 21, 41, 'bear with other imperfect people? We are imperfect and they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 207, 22, 41, 'imperfect. They have to bear with us, and we have to bear with them. Why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 207, 23, 41, 'is it that we find it so difficult to bear with other imperfect people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 207, 24, 41, 'around us? I will tell you the reason my friend; it is because we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 207, 25, 41, 'imperfect.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 207, 26, 41, 'The more we press on to perfection, the more we take up the cross, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 207, 27, 41, 'die to ourselves. The more we will be patient, the more we will tolerate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 207, 28, 41, 'the mistakes of others. We will be able to forgive them. We won''t get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 208, 1, 41, 'upset; we won''t get irritated. We will then say, "What does it matter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 208, 2, 41, '2000 years from now?" It won''t make any difference, this little thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 208, 3, 41, 'that you are getting upset about. You see, you will see things from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 208, 4, 41, 'eternity''s viewpoint. You see that that person has to be loved more.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 208, 5, 41, 'Never mind if he made a mistake.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 208, 6, 41, 'Look at the way some parents get irritated with their children. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 208, 7, 41, 'think they really love them? Yeah, they love them enough to feed them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 208, 8, 41, 'clothe them, educate them, and sacrifice many things for them. But, when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 208, 9, 41, 'the child does something to cause some inconvenience to the parents, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 208, 10, 41, 'parents get upset. In all our relationships, we need to die. It is when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 208, 11, 41, 'we love a person that we can correct that person. When the beam is taken');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 208, 12, 41, 'out of my eye, then I can see clearly to be able to take the speck out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 208, 13, 41, 'of the other person''s eye. Look at Jesus'' love in the way He spoke to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 208, 14, 41, 'people, in His speech. You know our speech is a great revealer of what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 208, 15, 41, 'is in our hearts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 208, 16, 41, 'Jesus said that from the abundance of the heart the mouth speaks.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 208, 17, 41, 'Whatever is in your heart will come out when you speak. You can''t hide');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 208, 18, 41, 'it for long. Why do people belittle others, pass remarks and jokes about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 208, 19, 41, 'other people that hurt them? Why do they do it? - Because they are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 208, 20, 41, 'like Christ. They don''t love. I wonder whether they were even born');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 208, 21, 41, 'again! Such people don''t seem to have any sensitivity to say rude things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 208, 22, 41, 'about other people, to say things that hurt others. That is sad. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 208, 23, 41, 'make subtle wounding statements. You see that sometimes among husbands');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 208, 24, 41, 'and wives, who say sharp things, stinging remarks to one another. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 208, 25, 41, 'never did it; not even once.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 208, 26, 41, 'He knew how to rebuke people strongly. He turned around once to Peter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 208, 27, 41, 'and said, "Get behind me Satan." But He didn''t say that in irritation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 208, 28, 41, 'He didn''t say that in anger. He said it to help Peter to see how that,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 209, 1, 41, 'in that statement that Peter had made at that time to Jesus to avoid the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 209, 2, 41, 'cross, that it was satanic. God wanted Jesus to go to the cross and here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 209, 3, 41, 'was Satan trying to stop Jesus from going to the cross through Peter. So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 209, 4, 41, 'to help Peter see the seriousness of the fact, He said that it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 209, 5, 41, 'satanic. Well, otherwise, He would never hurt people. He never made any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 209, 6, 41, 'subtle, wounding statement to anyone. He never discussed the weaknesses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 209, 7, 41, 'of the disciples behind their backs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 209, 8, 41, 'How do we know that? Isn''t it amazing that, in all the three years that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 209, 9, 41, 'His disciples were with Him, He never even discussed Judas Iscariot with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 209, 10, 41, 'all the other eleven disciples? He never exposed Judas in all those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 209, 11, 41, 'three years. I will give you the proof of that. If Jesus had been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 209, 12, 41, 'discussing the weaknesses of Judas Iscariot with all the other eleven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 209, 13, 41, 'disciples, behind Judas'' back, then at the last supper, when Jesus said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 209, 14, 41, 'one of you is going to betray me, everybody would have known. "Yeah,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 209, 15, 41, 'yeah we know that", they would have all responded, if Jesus already has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 209, 16, 41, 'spoken to them about Judas. Everybody would have said, ''We know who that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 209, 17, 41, 'is.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 209, 18, 41, 'But none of them knew. They all said, ''Lord is it I?'' How it is that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 209, 19, 41, 'none of them knew? It proves that Jesus never discussed even Judas');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 209, 20, 41, 'Iscariot. Jesus was not a backbiter. Jesus was not a gossiper. A lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 209, 21, 41, 'believers are gossipers. A lot of believers are backbiters. You know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 209, 22, 41, 'why? They haven''t seen the glory of God. They haven''t seen the goodness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 209, 23, 41, 'and the love of God in Jesus Christ. They talk about being filled with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 209, 24, 41, 'this Spirit, and having supernatural experiences and praising and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 209, 25, 41, 'shouting, but they haven''t been freed from backbiting and gossiping.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 209, 26, 41, 'We need to see the glory of Jesus, and only then we can be like Him. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 209, 27, 41, 'Holy Spirit wants to show us how Jesus lived. The Holy Spirit says, ''Now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 209, 28, 41, 'let me make you like Him.'' He doesn''t just say, ''Be like Him''. No, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 210, 1, 41, 'says, ''Let me make you like Him.'' Isn''t that good? Supposing the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 210, 2, 41, 'Spirit just showed me the glory of Jesus and said, ''Be like Him,'' I will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 210, 3, 41, 'just give up in discouragement. I will say, ''Lord, I can''t.'' But that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 210, 4, 41, 'not what the Holy Spirit says. The Holy Spirit shows us the beauty of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 210, 5, 41, 'Jesus in the way He spoke, and then says to us, ''Now, my son, my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 210, 6, 41, 'daughter, will you allow Me to make your speech also like that - pure,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 210, 7, 41, 'good, loving? Will you let Me control your tongue? Will you let Me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 210, 8, 41, 'control your speech from today onwards?'' This is the fullness of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 210, 9, 41, 'Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 210, 10, 41, 'The fruit of the Spirit is self- control. We can be filled with the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 210, 11, 41, 'Spirit, so that we never hurt anybody with our words or any such thing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 210, 12, 41, 'He leads us along the path of death to ourselves. On the other hand,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 210, 13, 41, 'Jesus used His tongue in a positive way to encourage people, to correct');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 210, 14, 41, 'people. He made His tongue an instrument of life in God''s hands. We read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 210, 15, 41, 'a wonderful verse in Isaiah 50:4, where it says concerning Jesus'' tongue');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 210, 16, 41, '(it is an amazing word), "You have given me the tongue of a disciple so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 210, 17, 41, 'that I can know how to speak a right word to a weary person."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 210, 18, 41, 'Just think of you having a ministry like that. You don''t have to be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 210, 19, 41, 'preacher. You may never stand at a pulpit, but just to have the right');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 210, 20, 41, 'word for weary people. Do you know how many weary people come across');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 210, 21, 41, 'your path every day? How many people do you think you meet in a day - in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 210, 22, 41, 'your office, in your neighbourhood? There must be at least some. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 210, 23, 41, 'some of them are weary. Do you have a word to encourage them, or do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 210, 24, 41, 'just sit back and discuss politics, the weather, and they remain with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 210, 25, 41, 'their heaviness? God wants to use your tongue. God wants to use your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 210, 26, 41, 'tongue to speak a word of encouragement, and sometimes a word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 210, 27, 41, 'correction too. Jesus used His tongue also as a sword, to cut down the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 210, 28, 41, 'proud and the haughty.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 211, 1, 41, 'Think of how the Roman centurion must have been encouraged when Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 211, 2, 41, 'said, "I have never seen such great faith" or the Syrophoenician woman,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 211, 3, 41, 'when Jesus praised her for her faith. You read that in Matthew 8 and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 211, 4, 41, 'Matthew 15. Think of that sinful woman, in the house of Simon the Leper');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 211, 5, 41, '(in Luke 7), who was encouraged when Jesus praised her for washing His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 211, 6, 41, 'feet. Mary of Bethany was praised for her sacrificial offering. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 211, 7, 41, 'would never have forgotten these words of Jesus. Think of how Peter was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 211, 8, 41, 'strengthened when Jesus said, ''I am going to pray for you.'' Just a few');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 211, 9, 41, 'words, what strength! Many people must have heard words like these from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 211, 10, 41, 'Jesus'' lips and they can come from your lips too if you ask the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 211, 11, 41, 'Spirit to give you the love of God in your heart for people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 211, 12, 42, 'Chapter 42 Jesus’ Gentleness and Goodness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 211, 13, 42, 'We want to consider today something more about the meaning of ''love'', a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 211, 14, 42, 'word which is much misunderstood. But we can understand it clearly when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 211, 15, 42, 'we look at the life of Jesus, and see how we can have the same love in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 211, 16, 42, 'our life for other people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 211, 17, 42, 'One mark of love is gentleness. Jesus was gentle with all people,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 211, 18, 42, 'particularly with people who were battered by life. Jesus loved');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 211, 19, 42, 'especially those who had fallen deeply into sin. He came to help such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 211, 20, 42, 'people because they are rejected by everybody else. The woman caught in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 211, 21, 42, 'adultery, the thief on the cross, rejected criminals; Jesus went to pick');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 211, 22, 42, 'them up and encourage them. He saw the good points in those weak, sinful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 211, 23, 42, 'people, and He hoped for the best in everyone. You know, Jesus was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 211, 24, 42, 'type of a person whom other people longed to be with, because He was so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 211, 25, 42, 'understanding, so kind and so gentle. Who are the people who avoided');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 211, 26, 42, 'Jesus? Those who were proud, those who were hypocrites, and those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 211, 27, 42, 'had secret sin which they were afraid He would expose.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 211, 28, 42, 'We read in Matthew 12:20, "Jesus would not break a bruised or a battered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 212, 1, 42, 'reed and would not put off a dimly burning wick." A reed is a very small');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 212, 2, 42, 'little thing. If it is bruised or battered, most people would throw it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 212, 3, 42, 'away and pick another reed, because reeds are cheap. But Jesus wouldn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 212, 4, 42, 'do it. And a wick that is burning very dimly, Jesus would fan it to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 212, 5, 42, 'flame. That is what it says there. He would not quench a dimly burning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 212, 6, 42, 'wick. If you are like a battered reed - weak, most of your life broken,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 212, 7, 42, 'Jesus cares for you. He can bring you back into His perfect plan for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 212, 8, 42, 'your life, even if you are like a battered reed, or a dimly burning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 212, 9, 42, 'wick, or a wick that is about to die out.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 212, 10, 42, 'Jesus saw the good points in people. He always hoped for the best. His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 212, 11, 42, 'love was not sentimental. He always sought the highest good. That is why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 212, 12, 42, 'He rebuked Peter with strong words of admonition. You can''t rebuke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 212, 13, 42, 'people strongly unless you love them. When James and John were seeking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 212, 14, 42, 'for places of honour, He rebuked them. When they wanted to call down');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 212, 15, 42, 'fire on the Samaritans, He rebuked them. He rebuked His disciples seven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 212, 16, 42, 'times for unbelief. Why? - Because He loved them. If He didn''t care for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 212, 17, 42, 'them, then He would not have corrected them at all. He wouldn''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 212, 18, 42, 'bothered if they went to hell or anywhere.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 212, 19, 42, 'So we see that Jesus was not afraid of speaking the truth, even if it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 212, 20, 42, 'hurt others, because He loved them. He was concerned for their eternal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 212, 21, 42, 'good. He was not seeking a reputation for being known as a kind person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 212, 22, 42, 'He was not concerned that His reputation for kindness would be lost if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 212, 23, 42, 'He spoke strong words. No, He loved other people more than He loved');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 212, 24, 42, 'Himself. So, He was willing to sacrifice His reputation in order to help');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 212, 25, 42, 'other people. He spoke the truth firmly because He did not want men to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 212, 26, 42, 'be ruined eternally. Essentially, in one sentence, we could say, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 212, 27, 42, 'eternal welfare of men mattered more to Jesus Christ than their opinions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 212, 28, 42, 'about Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 213, 1, 42, 'A true Christian is like that when He encounters other people; their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 213, 2, 42, 'eternal welfare means more to him than all their opinions of him. Once,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 213, 3, 42, 'when Peter was in the house of Cornelius, he was talking about the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 213, 4, 42, 'ministry of Jesus to them. He summed up the whole ministry of Jesus in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 213, 5, 42, 'one sentence: "Jesus went about doing good and delivering people who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 213, 6, 42, 'were oppressed by the devil" (Acts 10:38). You see what the ministry of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 213, 7, 42, 'Jesus was? Doing good, and not just preaching. Not just saying nice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 213, 8, 42, 'words, but actually doing good to people and delivering them from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 213, 9, 42, 'oppression of Satan. He didn''t just want to win souls. He loved the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 213, 10, 42, 'total man - both the spiritual and physical.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 213, 11, 42, 'He was concerned about man''s physical need. There was a time when there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 213, 12, 42, 'were more than 4000 people who had been with Him for three days. We read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 213, 13, 42, 'about that in Matthew 15. Three days and they didn''t eat anything. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 213, 14, 42, 'was concerned. He said, ''Let us provide them with some meal - something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 213, 15, 42, 'to eat.'' He was concerned about man''s physical need and that is why He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 213, 16, 42, 'taught us to pray, "Give us today our daily bread." Wherever He went, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 213, 17, 42, 'did good not only to the souls of men, but to their bodies. He cared for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 213, 18, 42, 'people who were sick and suffering. He cared for the worst of sinners so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 213, 19, 42, 'much that His enemies would taunt Him saying, ''Oh He is a friend of tax');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 213, 20, 42, 'collectors and sinners.'' Yes, that is what He was. He was a friend of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 213, 21, 42, 'the most despised people in society, and a true man of God will be like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 213, 22, 42, 'that also.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 213, 23, 42, 'You know you can be like that. What is hindering you from loving people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 213, 24, 42, 'who are despised by others; from loving people who are low in society?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 213, 25, 42, 'It is your own sense of dignity. You don''t want to be like Jesus. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 213, 26, 42, 'want to have a respectable type of Christianity with respectable type of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 213, 27, 42, 'people. No, it is not natural for men to go around becoming friends with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 213, 28, 42, 'the outcast of society like the lepers and people like that. But Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 214, 1, 42, 'did that. You know, we seek to make friends with those whom we can get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 214, 2, 42, 'benefit from for ourselves. Our love is selfish. Jesus'' love was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 214, 3, 42, 'selfless; it was pure. It is not by all these cultural refinement and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 214, 4, 42, 'nice words that we manifest the nature of Christ, it is by love - A love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 214, 5, 42, 'that seeks the good of others. A love that enables us to be their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 214, 6, 42, 'servants like Jesus was. Jesus washed their feet, not to impress them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 214, 7, 42, 'with His humility, but because He loved them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 214, 8, 42, 'You know, whenever Jesus did good to others, He never had the slightest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 214, 9, 42, 'thought that He would get something in return. Jesus used an example of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 214, 10, 42, 'the sun. The sun shines on the evil and the good, He said in Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 214, 11, 42, '5:45. What is the sun expecting in return from all these people? -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 214, 12, 42, 'Nothing. What about the rain? He used the illustration of the rain also.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 214, 13, 42, 'He said the rain falls on the righteous and the unrighteous. What is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 214, 14, 42, 'rain expecting in return? Not even a word of thanks. Nobody looks up at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 214, 15, 42, 'the sun and says, ''thank you for rising this morning, and shining upon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 214, 16, 42, 'us, or giving us light.'' But the sun is not bothered. Even though nobody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 214, 17, 42, 'thanks it, it still rises in the morning. Jesus said, ''Be like that. Be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 214, 18, 42, 'like your heavenly Father who gives sunlight to good and evil people,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 214, 19, 42, 'whether they thank Him or not.'' Nobody turns to God and says, ''Thank you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 214, 20, 42, 'Lord for giving me sunlight this morning.'' But He still sends it. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 214, 21, 42, 'was not interested in getting something in return.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 214, 22, 42, 'See, God''s nature is one which He wants to give, and give, and give, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 214, 23, 42, 'give. That is as natural for God as it is for the sun to shine, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 214, 24, 42, 'shine, and shine, and shine. Jesus came to earth and manifested that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 214, 25, 42, 'nature of God, seeking to do good, to serve, to help, and to bless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 214, 26, 42, 'wherever He went. Whether people appreciated it, whether they thanked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 214, 27, 42, 'Him, or didn''t thank Him, it didn''t make a difference to Him. It is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 214, 28, 42, 'easy to manifest this type of love. Human love is so selfish. If that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 215, 1, 42, 'fellow loves me in return, then I continue to love him. That is the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 215, 2, 42, 'we can distinguish between human love and divine love. There is a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 215, 3, 42, 'difference between the two. In divine love it doesn''t matter to us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 215, 4, 42, 'whether the other person responds or not. We just continue.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 215, 5, 42, 'Consider the way Jesus used His money. From John 13:29 we see that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 215, 6, 42, 'used his money primarily for two things: to buy what was needed and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 215, 7, 42, 'give to the poor. Now Jesus was not a great rich millionaire, but He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 215, 8, 42, 'still found some money to give to those who were poor. He taught people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 215, 9, 42, 'that it is more blessed to give than to receive. His love taught Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 215, 10, 42, 'that whatever possessions God gave Him were to be used to bless others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 215, 11, 42, 'How many of us understand that? How many Christian s are there in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 215, 12, 42, 'world that understand this that God gives us material things so that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 215, 13, 42, 'can bless others, use them to the benefit of others? This is love, when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 215, 14, 42, 'we learn to love people and use things to bless people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 215, 15, 42, 'Let me say something else about His preaching. We read of a time in Luke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 215, 16, 42, '19:41 that He wept over Jerusalem. Why did He weep over Jerusalem? He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 215, 17, 42, 'used such strong words when He preached and little later, we read, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 215, 18, 42, 'the same chapter (Lk. 49:45), that He used a whip. But before He used');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 215, 19, 42, 'the whip, He wept. This was the balance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 215, 20, 42, 'Let me mention another aspect of Jesus'' love, and that is, you didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 215, 21, 42, 'have to see a secretary in order to meet with Jesus. Now, in the world,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 215, 22, 42, 'if you want to meet a big man, you have to meet a secretary first. What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 215, 23, 42, 'secretary did Jesus have? Anybody could meet Him. Nicodemus could even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 215, 24, 42, 'go in the middle of the night, wake Him up, and speak to Him and Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 215, 25, 42, 'was ready to talk to him. Once Jesus was so busy helping people that (we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 215, 26, 42, 'read in Mark 3:20-21) He did not even have enough time to eat. He did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 215, 27, 42, 'not have anybody to regulate the access of people to Him saying, ''You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 215, 28, 42, 'can''t come to Him.'' You know, when you become so busy that you cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 216, 1, 42, 'meet with ordinary people, you have become busier than Jesus Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 216, 2, 42, 'When you need a secretary to prevent people from meeting you, you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 216, 3, 42, 'not a servant of God anymore. You are just a businessman. You are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 216, 4, 42, 'running an industry, not a Christian church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 216, 5, 42, 'The relatives of Jesus thought He was insane to allow people to take so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 216, 6, 42, 'much of His time, but that is because He loved them. Jesus was freely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 216, 7, 42, 'approachable. Once they brought sick people to Him at sunset. We read in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 216, 8, 42, 'Luke 4:40 that He spent the whole evening till late into the night,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 216, 9, 42, 'praying for them, laying His hands on them, healing them. He did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 216, 10, 42, 'feel His time was His own. His time was for other people. He came to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 216, 11, 42, 'live, to do God''s will, to bless them, and He was willing to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 216, 12, 42, 'inconvenienced. This is why the mighty gifts of the Spirit were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 216, 13, 42, 'manifested through Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 216, 14, 42, 'You know, miracles are a dangerous thing if they are not operated in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 216, 15, 42, 'love. This is the love of God that we need to flood our hearts with. His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 216, 16, 42, 'love was such that it was concerned, even in His last moments, to bring');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 216, 17, 42, 'a thief into God''s kingdom. When the world around us sees such love,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 216, 18, 42, 'they will be drawn to Jesus. Let us ask God to give us this love.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 216, 19, 43, 'Chapter 43 Finding Security In God As A Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 216, 20, 43, 'In this study we want to consider the reason why so many people feel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 216, 21, 43, 'insecure, the problems that arise out of insecurity and the solutions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 216, 22, 43, 'for the same.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 216, 23, 43, 'When Jesus was leaving the world, on the night before He was crucified,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 216, 24, 43, 'He told his disciples, "I will not leave you as orphans; I will come to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 216, 25, 43, 'you" (Jn. 14:18). That happened (coming back of Jesus) in the coming of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 216, 26, 43, 'the Holy Spirit, on the day of Pentecost. What is an orphan? An orphan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 216, 27, 43, 'is one who has no father and mother. There is a lot of difference');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 216, 28, 43, 'between a child, who has grown up in a home experiencing the love of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 217, 1, 43, 'father and a mother, and a child who has had no father and mother. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 217, 2, 43, 'means the father and mother died when the child was small so that child');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 217, 3, 43, 'had to be brought up by stepmother or stepfather, or uncle or auntie, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 217, 4, 43, 'grandparents or, sometimes, in an orphanage. Orphans tend to be insecure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 217, 5, 43, 'because they have not experienced love in their childhood, the love that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 217, 6, 43, 'only a father and mother can give, no uncle or auntie, or grandmother or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 217, 7, 43, 'an orphanage can ever give.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 217, 8, 43, 'And when there is this type of insecurity due to the lack of love,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 217, 9, 43, 'orphans tend to be very defensive. They tend to feel that the world is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 217, 10, 43, 'against them, that people are against them, and that they must defend');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 217, 11, 43, 'themselves. They become introverted, depressed, discouraged, and jealous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 217, 12, 43, 'of others who have more than them. They become very possessive in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 217, 13, 43, 'friendships because of insecurity. They want somebody to love only them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 217, 14, 43, 'and nobody else. We should not judge orphans who are like this. They can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 217, 15, 43, 'remain the same even when they are 40 or 50 years old, because, way back');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 217, 16, 43, 'in childhood, they never experienced the love of a father or mother.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 217, 17, 43, 'Those of us, who have parents, sometimes don''t appreciate the value of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 217, 18, 43, 'having them. That is unfortunate! Some of you, children, probably don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 217, 19, 43, 'appreciate the value of your parents sufficiently. You need to thank God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 217, 20, 43, 'for your father and mother, because there are many children in the world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 217, 21, 43, 'who do not have a father and mother.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 217, 22, 43, 'I want to apply this spiritually. What did Jesus mean when he said, ''I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 217, 23, 43, 'will not leave the orphans?'' Spiritually speaking, we can say that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 217, 24, 43, 'world is full of orphans, because they don''t have a Father; they don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 217, 25, 43, 'have God as a Father. They don''t know God as a Father or Mother. So, all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 217, 26, 43, 'the characteristics that you find in ordinary physical orphans, you find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 217, 27, 43, 'in these spiritual orphans. The world is full of people who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 217, 28, 43, 'insecure; who feel that others are against them. So they fight, they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 218, 1, 43, 'defend themselves, they are very possessive. It is like that because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 218, 2, 43, 'they are spiritually orphans. They love money because they are insecure.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 218, 3, 43, 'They have no heavenly Father. They are anxious. They are worried.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 218, 4, 43, 'Jesus sought so much, during His earthly ministry, to impress upon His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 218, 5, 43, 'disciples the fact that God was a loving Father. He taught them to pray,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 218, 6, 43, '"Our Father." No person in the Old Testament could ever pray like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 218, 7, 43, 'He said, ''When you pray, say, "Our Father,"'' and after His resurrection,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 218, 8, 43, 'He said, ''My Father is your Father.'' There is a beautiful verse in John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 218, 9, 43, '1:18 "No one has seen God at any time. But Jesus came and explained Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 218, 10, 43, 'to us." In other words, Jesus, by His life and His teaching, has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 218, 11, 43, 'explained to us what God is like.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 218, 12, 43, 'You know, the world is full of people who have never seen God. None of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 218, 13, 43, 'us have seen God. That is what it says in that verse. When we have not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 218, 14, 43, 'seen God, it is like a man who has never seen an elephant. Supposing you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 218, 15, 43, 'were to go to some country, say some western country, where there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 218, 16, 43, 'some child who has, maybe, seen pictures of lions and tigers, but has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 218, 17, 43, 'never seen an elephant or a picture of one. If you ask that child to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 218, 18, 43, 'draw a picture of an elephant, what do you think that elephant would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 218, 19, 43, 'look like? Do you think any child in the world will ever think of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 218, 20, 43, 'drawing a long nose, which we call a trunk? No, because there is no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 218, 21, 43, 'other animal that has it. They will draw something that looks like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 218, 22, 43, 'lion or a dog, or like most animals with four legs, but nobody will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 218, 23, 43, 'able to draw an elephant, if he has not seen an elephant or a picture of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 218, 24, 43, 'one. How can you imagine one?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 218, 25, 43, 'If it is so with some created animal like this, which we cannot draw a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 218, 26, 43, 'correct picture of, can you draw a correct picture of God? No, your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 218, 27, 43, 'picture will definitely be wrong. We have so many people who have given');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 218, 28, 43, 'their own opinions about God. And what is the result? Today we have so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 219, 1, 43, 'many religions, each with their own ideas of what God is like. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 219, 2, 43, 'like two hundred people who have never seen an elephant or a picture of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 219, 3, 43, 'one, trying to draw an elephant. Who is right? Every one of them is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 219, 4, 43, 'wrong. But the man who has seen an elephant, he will be able to draw a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 219, 5, 43, 'correct one. When Jesus came from heaven, He was the only person who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 219, 6, 43, 'could tell us what God is like.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 219, 7, 43, 'Most people''s idea of God is that of a very strict person, like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 219, 8, 43, 'policeman, who is out to catch you for some small mistake you do. Like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 219, 9, 43, 'traffic police who waits around a blind corner to see if you have cut');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 219, 10, 43, 'the circle or made some traffic violation or broken some traffic rule.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 219, 11, 43, 'They think God is like that; just waiting and hiding on the corner, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 219, 12, 43, 'pounce on you as soon you make some mistake. So, most people live in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 219, 13, 43, 'wrong type of fear of God. They are afraid that God will punish them or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 219, 14, 43, 'harm them. In every religion, there are preachers and teachers, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 219, 15, 43, 'priests who capitalize on this fear that people have. They say that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 219, 16, 43, 'have to please this god in some way or the other, otherwise he will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 219, 17, 43, 'punish you. In almost every religion, including the Christian religion,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 219, 18, 43, 'priests and preachers say that the way to please God is by giving Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 219, 19, 43, 'money.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 219, 20, 43, 'So, people give money. They go on long pilgrimages, here and there, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 219, 21, 43, 'give hundreds of thousands of rupees. A lot of this money goes into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 219, 22, 43, 'pockets of these priests and preachers and pastors. It is all to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 219, 23, 43, 'capitalize on the weakness of orphan-like people, knowing that they have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 219, 24, 43, 'some type of guilt feeling or fear, and making them give their money. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 219, 25, 43, 'is a great deception. Jesus came to remove this concept of God from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 219, 26, 43, 'people all together. He said God is a loving Father. God is interested');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 219, 27, 43, 'in you, and not in your money. He is interested in helping you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 219, 28, 43, 'Which father is always trying to get money out of his small children? A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 220, 1, 43, 'father is always trying to help his children; feed them, clothe them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 220, 2, 43, 'educate them, spend so much money on them, and get nothing in return.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 220, 3, 43, 'Jesus revealed God as a Father. When you feel that God is like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 220, 4, 43, 'managing director, living up there in the top floor of some factory,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 220, 5, 43, 'whom you never see, well, you have got the wrong concept of God. And you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 220, 6, 43, 'are an orphan. The result is that there is a lot of insecurity, anxiety,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 220, 7, 43, 'fear, tension in your life, which you need not have.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 220, 8, 43, 'Jesus said look at the birds of the air, who feeds them? They don''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 220, 9, 43, 'a barn, they don''t have a storehouse, and yet how many dead birds due to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 220, 10, 43, 'hunger do you see on the road? You hardly can find one dead bird on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 220, 11, 43, 'road. It is very rarely that you find a dead bird on the road. How is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 220, 12, 43, 'that? How is it they don''t all starve to death? Are there lots of people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 220, 13, 43, 'throwing seeds for the birds every day? How many times have you done it?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 220, 14, 43, 'No, they find it; somehow our Heavenly Father feeds them. They are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 220, 15, 43, 'worried. And Jesus said, ''Don''t you think you are of more value than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 220, 16, 43, 'many sparrows.'' Sparrows are among the cheapest of all birds.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 220, 17, 43, 'There is a little poem about two little birds, sitting on a tree, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 220, 18, 43, 'talking to one another. One bird was asking the other bird, ''Why do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 220, 19, 43, 'think these human beings are so anxious and worried all the time? They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 220, 20, 43, 'always seem to be so tensed in their life.'' The other bird replied, ''I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 220, 21, 43, 'think the reason is that they don''t have a heavenly Father like we have.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 220, 22, 43, 'We are okay because our Heavenly Father provides us something.'' What do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 220, 23, 43, 'you think my friends, when you hear those two birds talking? Isn''t it a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 220, 24, 43, 'shame when Christians are anxious and worried?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 220, 25, 43, 'You know, when we are anxious and worried it makes us irritable. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 220, 26, 43, 'makes us tense; it makes us hit back at people who we suspect are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 220, 27, 43, 'hitting at us. The person who is secure in God is never disturbed by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 220, 28, 43, 'whatever people say. Supposing you are walking down the road, and a dog');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 221, 1, 43, 'keeps on barking from inside a locked gate, or even barking from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 221, 2, 43, 'other side of the road, what are you going to do? Are you going to argue');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 221, 3, 43, 'with that dog? Are you going fight with that dog asking, ''Why do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 221, 4, 43, 'bark at me?'' It is as foolish when you go and start arguing with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 221, 5, 43, 'somebody who is accusing you, calling you names, or telling false');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 221, 6, 43, 'stories about you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 221, 7, 43, 'What should you do? What do you do when you see a barking dog on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 221, 8, 43, 'other side of the road? Just leave him alone. But if you are insecure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 221, 9, 43, 'and you are like an orphan you won''t be able to do that. You will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 221, 10, 43, 'tense; you will be worried and you will just go and fight with that dog.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 221, 11, 43, 'That is how many people fight and argue with people who are calling them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 221, 12, 43, 'bad names. Somebody writes a bad letter to them; they write one back to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 221, 13, 43, 'them. This is all the result of insecurity. But how was it with Jesus,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 221, 14, 43, 'when people called Him the prince of devils? He just left them alone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 221, 15, 43, 'They accused him. They said all types of stories about him, He just left');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 221, 16, 43, 'them alone, it did not bother Him one bit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 221, 17, 43, 'So, the most important thing for us is to know God as a Father. He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 221, 18, 43, 'not a policeman. He loves you. He cares for you. He knows every detail');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 221, 19, 43, 'of your life. If you have opened you heart to let Jesus Christ, come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 221, 20, 43, 'into your heart, God has become your Father. That choice is yours. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 221, 21, 43, 'you are not sure of that you can do that right now. Just open your heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 221, 22, 43, 'and say, ''Lord Jesus, I want you to come into my heart. I want to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 221, 23, 43, 'sure that I am a child of God.'' Ask him to give you that assurance and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 221, 24, 43, 'He will send His Holy Spirit into your heart to assure you that God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 221, 25, 43, 'your Father. If you are a Christian already, ask God to give you that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 221, 26, 43, 'assurance that He is your Father who cares for you. It will make all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 221, 27, 43, 'difference in your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 221, 28, 44, 'Chapter 44 God Can Give You Wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 222, 1, 44, 'In the last study we were thinking about finding our security in God as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 222, 2, 44, 'a Father. We need to think about that little more. I believe that once');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 222, 3, 44, 'we solve this problem of finding security many of the other problems in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 222, 4, 44, 'your life will be solved.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 222, 5, 44, 'It is wonderful to see that God has made provision for every single need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 222, 6, 44, 'of ours. You know when God created Adam, He gave him certain desires,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 222, 7, 44, 'not sinful desires. For example, the desire for food, as a result of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 222, 8, 44, 'which Adam was hungry and he would feel thirsty, and he needed to drink');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 222, 9, 44, 'water. Now can you imagine, if God had created these desires in Adam for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 222, 10, 44, 'food and water, and if He had not provided food and water in the world,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 222, 11, 44, 'how terrible it would have been? Adam''s life would have been a torture;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 222, 12, 44, 'hunger but no food, thirst but no water.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 222, 13, 44, 'But you see that when God put such a desire within Adam, He provided');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 222, 14, 44, 'food and water outside, in the world, and there is plenty of it, for all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 222, 15, 44, 'of us. In the same way with sleep - the desire to rest, we all need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 222, 16, 44, 'sleep. That is why God has made the sun, the earth to move; rotate on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 222, 17, 44, 'its axis, and the sun to rise and set, so that we have day and night. So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 222, 18, 44, 'that people can sleep and rest. God has made provision for that. Our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 222, 19, 44, 'bodies automatically sleep when we are tired. In a similar way the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 222, 20, 44, 'sexual desire too. If God created man with tremendous sexual desire, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 222, 21, 44, 'never gave him a wife, what would happen to Adam? He would be absolutely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 222, 22, 44, 'frustrated. When God created Adam with such a desire, He also gave him a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 222, 23, 44, 'wife. What do we learn from all these things? That if there is a desire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 222, 24, 44, 'that God has created in our heart which is not answered, there is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 222, 25, 44, 'provision for it somewhere.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 222, 26, 44, 'Spiritually also it is the same. There are longings we have in our heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 222, 27, 44, 'for God. And He wants to fulfil all of them fully. One of the greatest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 222, 28, 44, 'needs we have in our life is to find security, to be free from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 223, 1, 44, 'loneliness, from feeling lost and alone in this world. It is very easy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 223, 2, 44, 'to feel like that. You can live in a home with many children and yet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 223, 3, 44, 'feel lonely. You can be in a large church and feel lonely. In fact,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 223, 4, 44, 'there are a lot of people who meet in small house churches with just 5');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 223, 5, 44, 'or 6 people who are freer from loneliness than someone who attends a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 223, 6, 44, 'church with 3000 members. It is not just a lot of people around us that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 223, 7, 44, 'removes loneliness from our life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 223, 8, 44, 'I want to tell you, if you want to find the answer to your loneliness in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 223, 9, 44, 'just finding friends among people, you will never have a complete');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 223, 10, 44, 'answer. You will be disappointed one day. You need to first find your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 223, 11, 44, 'answer to your loneliness in God, in Jesus. The Bible says that there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 223, 12, 44, 'a friend that sticks closer than a brother, and that is Jesus Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 223, 13, 44, 'So, when we know God as a Father who cares, we are no longer orphans.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 223, 14, 44, 'An orphan is one who has no father and mother. If he has a need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 223, 15, 44, 'suddenly, whom can he go to? He can go to some uncle or some aunty but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 223, 16, 44, 'he will have to go like a beggar. He doesn''t know whether the uncle or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 223, 17, 44, 'aunty will help him. The uncle or aunty may ill treat him in a very bad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 223, 18, 44, 'way. But if he has a father, the father won''t treat the son like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 223, 19, 44, 'beggar. He can go and ask his father for anything, any amount of money,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 223, 20, 44, 'and he can ask his father to go through any amount of inconvenience. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 223, 21, 44, 'he hesitates to ask an uncle or an aunty or somebody else. When he has a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 223, 22, 44, 'father, he is secure. If he has a problem and he doesn''t know the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 223, 23, 44, 'solution to, he can discuss it with his father. If he is far away in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 223, 24, 44, 'some city, he can ring up his father. It is wonderful to have a father,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 223, 25, 44, 'an earthly one, and it is exactly the same spiritually.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 223, 26, 44, 'When you have found God as your heavenly Father, you can never feel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 223, 27, 44, 'lonely again. It is impossible, because the phone line is always open.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 223, 28, 44, 'You can always ring Him up; you can always call Him wherever you are.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 224, 1, 44, 'You can tell Him every need of yours. In fact, He knows your need even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 224, 2, 44, 'before you tell Him. He has an answer to every problem you can ever face');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 224, 3, 44, 'in your life. Let me assure you this. I hope you believe it. It doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 224, 4, 44, 'matter what your problem is. It doesn''t matter how serious it is. I want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 224, 5, 44, 'to tell you, in Jesus’ name, that God has a solution for it. If you come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 224, 6, 44, 'to Him in faith as unto a Father who desires to help you, He won''t scold');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 224, 7, 44, 'you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 224, 8, 44, 'I want to give you a lovely promise from the word of God, from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 224, 9, 44, 'letter of James, so that your faith does not rest on my words. Faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 224, 10, 44, 'comes by the word of God. I may say something to you in these studies,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 224, 11, 44, 'but how do you know I am speaking the truth? I may be just telling some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 224, 12, 44, 'psychologically nice things to make you feel nice. But that will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 224, 13, 44, 'evaporate. Once this study is over, you might feel nice for a few');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 224, 14, 44, 'minutes or may be for a few hours and then, when you face the reality of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 224, 15, 44, 'life, you are stuck. You need to read this again to soothe you. I am not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 224, 16, 44, 'speaking to you, over these series of studies, just to soothe you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 224, 17, 44, 'psychologically.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 224, 18, 44, 'These are real answers to the real problems of life. This is what God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 224, 19, 44, 'word says. "If any of you lacks wisdom, let him ask of God, who gives to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 224, 20, 44, 'all generously and without reproach, and it will be given to him" (J a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 224, 21, 44, 's. 1:5). ''If any of you lack wisdom,'' what is wisdom? There is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 224, 22, 44, 'difference between wisdom and knowledge. Knowledge means the study of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 224, 23, 44, 'some particular subject. It could be chemistry, it could be mathematics,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 224, 24, 44, 'and it could be the Bible. You can have chemistry knowledge, mathematics');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 224, 25, 44, 'knowledge, or Bible knowledge. With chemistry knowledge you may still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 224, 26, 44, 'have problems. With Bible knowledge also you may still have problems.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 224, 27, 44, 'That chemistry knowledge doesn''t help you with that particular practical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 224, 28, 44, 'problem in life. Nor does the Bible help you in practical problems in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 225, 1, 44, 'life. There are so many people with so much Bible knowledge who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 225, 2, 44, 'still anxious, worried, tensed, fighting, quarrelling, insecure,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 225, 3, 44, 'jealous, and competitive and everything. Their Bible knowledge is no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 225, 4, 44, 'better than the knowledge of mathematics or science.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 225, 5, 44, 'But what is wisdom? Wisdom is the knowledge of God, which helps us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 225, 6, 44, 'find a practical solution. Not one which doesn''t work. That will be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 225, 7, 44, 'theoretical solution. It is a practical solution to a particular problem');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 225, 8, 44, 'that we are facing. That is wisdom; the knowledge of God, not knowledge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 225, 9, 44, 'of a book. Do you know that there is a lot of difference in knowing the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 225, 10, 44, 'Bible and knowing God?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 225, 11, 44, 'Supposing you were separated from your father from childhood, and lived');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 225, 12, 44, 'far away from your father for 25 years. And you read a book about your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 225, 13, 44, 'father''s life, every detail, you would know about your father by reading');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 225, 14, 44, 'that book, but you don''t know your father. You have never spoken to him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 225, 15, 44, 'for 25 years. But another child, who has grown up with his father for 5');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 225, 16, 44, 'or 6 years, who has never read any book about his father, knows his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 225, 17, 44, 'father better than you know your father. Many people read the Bible. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 225, 18, 44, 'is like reading a biography of your father and you don''t know your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 225, 19, 44, 'father himself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 225, 20, 44, 'Wisdom is the knowledge of God as a Father and thus finding a solution');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 225, 21, 44, 'to whatever problem I am facing right now. It doesn''t matter what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 225, 22, 44, 'problem it is. It could be a family problem, a financial problem, a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 225, 23, 44, 'problem of marrying, getting your children married, problem of getting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 225, 24, 44, 'education for your children, or employment for them, or finding a house');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 225, 25, 44, 'to live in. There are so many difficulties in the world in which we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 225, 26, 44, 'live, but the answer is in God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 225, 27, 44, '''If anyone lacks wisdom,'' it means anyone. You qualify to be one of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 225, 28, 44, 'those. Do you lack wisdom? That means do you lack a solution to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 226, 1, 44, 'problem you are facing? "Let him ask God." What should you do? You run');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 226, 2, 44, 'around and ask so many people and it has not solved your problem. Why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 226, 3, 44, 'don''t you do something else now? Why don''t you ask God? God can hear you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 226, 4, 44, 'right where you are. Right now, if you call out to God, He can hear you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 226, 5, 44, 'Will He give you? Sure. He is a Father. He is not an uncle. He is not a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 226, 6, 44, 'neighbour. Even a helpful neighbour may help us but a father much more.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 226, 7, 44, 'He is the best Father of all. And He will give you the best.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 226, 8, 44, 'Jesus once said, "If you fathers know how to give good gifts to your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 226, 9, 44, 'children, how much more your Heavenly Father will give good things to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 226, 10, 44, 'those who ask Him?" If your son asks you for bread, will you give him a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 226, 11, 44, 'stone? No. If he asks for an egg will you give him a scorpion? Will you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 226, 12, 44, 'give him something to harm him? No, you will give him exactly what he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 226, 13, 44, 'needs. That is exactly how God is. He gives us exactly what we need.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 226, 14, 44, 'James says, ''God will give you and generously.'' That is what this verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 226, 15, 44, 'says in James 1:5. Not few drops. You ask for a spoon, He will give you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 226, 16, 44, 'a bucket. You need a spoonful of wisdom but He will give you a bucket of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 226, 17, 44, 'it, generously. God is like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 226, 18, 44, 'And the other thing it says here is without scolding or reproaching you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 226, 19, 44, 'You know, fathers sometimes scold their children, ''Oh you stupid fellow,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 226, 20, 44, 'don''t you know the answer to that?'' God will never scold us. Remember');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 226, 21, 44, 'this. He will never scold us. He will never say, ''Why don''t you know the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 226, 22, 44, 'answer to that?'' It will be given to you. There is only one condition.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 226, 23, 44, 'Now pay attention to this condition. You have to ask in faith. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 226, 24, 44, 'what it says in James 1:6. In fact it goes on to say, in verse 6-7 that,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 226, 25, 44, '"If you don''t ask Him in faith, you won'' get it."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 226, 26, 44, 'You may want the wisdom and God may want to give it to you. The need is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 226, 27, 44, 'there. The solution is there but you don''t get it. Because, when you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 226, 28, 44, 'ask, you don''t believe. It is that simple. Maybe this is the reason why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 227, 1, 44, 'you have not found the solution to your problems yet. Why don''t you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 227, 2, 44, 'decide today onwards, to believe the revelation of God that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 227, 3, 44, 'brought? - God as the Father who knows your every need. It may be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 227, 4, 44, 'physical need for healing. Maybe a spiritual need, whatever it is. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 227, 5, 44, 'may be a solution for a family problem that has gone on for many years.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 227, 6, 44, 'You may not be able to solve the problem, but you may be able to solve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 227, 7, 44, 'that part of it that is bothering you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 227, 8, 44, 'Ask in faith. Say, ''Lord, from today I am going to believe. I want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 227, 9, 44, 'believe that you will solve this problem of mine. Why? Because You are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 227, 10, 44, 'my Father . Because Jesus loves me, He died for me, I am cleansed in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 227, 11, 44, 'blood, I am Your son, I am your daughter. I have a right to ask You. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 227, 12, 44, 'are my Father . Why don''t you ask God right now? Mention that problem.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 227, 13, 44, 'Be specific. Don''t be general, be specific and say, ''Lord this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 227, 14, 44, 'particular problem I commit it to You, I trust You to answer me.'' And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 227, 15, 44, 'you can be absolutely certain that God will give you generously without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 227, 16, 44, 'scolding you and God will be glorified. Be sure to give Him the glory');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 227, 17, 44, 'when the answer comes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 227, 18, 45, 'Chapter 45 God And Money Are Opposites');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 227, 19, 45, 'In this study we shall discuss about something that the world considers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 227, 20, 45, 'to be the most important thing of all, and that is money. What should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 227, 21, 45, 'our attitude be towards money, if we want to live for God?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 227, 22, 45, 'Money is one area where we know it is easy for us to be deceived. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 227, 23, 45, 'world is full of people who have cheated others through various clever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 227, 24, 45, 'tricks, in the area of money. So many people have discovered very, very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 227, 25, 45, 'clever ways in which to cheat others, but there is no one who has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 227, 26, 45, 'cheated man as much, in the area of money, as Satan. He has given man a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 227, 27, 45, 'false understanding of the value of money. He has made people feel that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 227, 28, 45, 'money is more important than God Himself. That is worse than somebody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 228, 1, 45, 'cheating me of a hundred thousand rupees. I would rather be cheated of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 228, 2, 45, 'hundred thousand rupees than be cheated in this way, where I begin to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 228, 3, 45, 'think, in my life, that money is more important than God. It is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 228, 4, 45, 'true. And yet there are very, very few people who have really seen this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 228, 5, 45, 'clearly. Satan deceives them. Jesus came and brought the clear light of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 228, 6, 45, 'heaven on this issue.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 228, 7, 45, 'Let us turn to turn to Luke 16:13. Now this is a revolutionary verse. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 228, 8, 45, 'don''t think many Christians have ever read this verse properly. I myself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 228, 9, 45, 'never read it properly for many, many years after I was born again, at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 228, 10, 45, 'least for 20 years. What does it say here? Jesus said, "No servant can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 228, 11, 45, 'serve two masters." He is talking about two masters here and immediately');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 228, 12, 45, 'you begin to think that the two masters are God and Satan. But it is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 228, 13, 45, 'God and Satan because everybody in the world knows that you can''t serve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 228, 14, 45, 'God and Satan. If I were to ask you, ''do you love Satan,'' you will all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 228, 15, 45, 'say, no. Do you love God? Yes. Can you love God and Satan at the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 228, 16, 45, 'time? No, you know that clearly. Can you serve God and Satan at the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 228, 17, 45, 'time? - Certainly not. Are you holding on to God? Are you holding on to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 228, 18, 45, 'Satan? You say, ''Sure I am holding on to God.'' Do you despise Satan and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 228, 19, 45, 'have nothing to do with him? You say, yes. So that is not an issue.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 228, 20, 45, 'If the two masters were God and Satan, there is no need even to talk');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 228, 21, 45, 'about it. But here Jesus said "No servant can serve two masters;" for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 228, 22, 45, 'either he will hate the one and love the other, or else he will be loyal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 228, 23, 45, 'to the one and despise the other. You cannot serve God and mammon." The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 228, 24, 45, 'two masters here are God and mammon. Mammon means money and material');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 228, 25, 45, 'riches or material things. And what did He say in relation of these two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 228, 26, 45, 'masters? Now read very carefully. You must hate the one and love the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 228, 27, 45, 'other. These are the words of Jesus! Jesus is bringing the light of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 228, 28, 45, 'heaven upon this area of God and money and He is pointing out here that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 229, 1, 45, 'money is a master, and God is a Master. You can''t serve two masters');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 229, 2, 45, 'because both masters will call you to do something. God calls you to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 229, 3, 45, 'something and money calls you to do something. Now you have to make a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 229, 4, 45, 'choice: which of the two would you obey.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 229, 5, 45, 'First of all, you have to make a break with one of these masters. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 229, 6, 45, 'have to decide which one you are going to serve. He is not talking about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 229, 7, 45, 'the use of money. Money is a good servant but a terrible master.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 229, 8, 45, 'Remember that. Just like fire; fire is a good servant but a terrible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 229, 9, 45, 'master. You use fire and you keep the fire under control in the kitchen,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 229, 10, 45, 'on the gas stove. That is okay. But if you let that fire, go out of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 229, 11, 45, 'control, what happens? Your whole house will be burnt down. And if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 229, 12, 45, 'can treat money like that, as a servant, and keep it under control like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 229, 13, 45, 'you keep the fire on the gas stove under control, then it is a wonderful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 229, 14, 45, 'servant; very, very useful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 229, 15, 45, 'How can you live in this world without money? It is useful for food,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 229, 16, 45, 'clothing, education, housing, and everything, even for God''s work! Money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 229, 17, 45, 'is required for God''s work. Money can help the poor. But when money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 229, 18, 45, 'takes over a person''s life, you know what it is like? It is like a house');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 229, 19, 45, 'catching fire. It destroys the whole house. So we are not against money,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 229, 20, 45, 'just like we are not against fire. But we should be careful when you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 229, 21, 45, 'handle fire. Fire is very dangerous. Don''t be careless when you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 229, 22, 45, 'handling fire. So many people have died by being burnt in the kitchen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 229, 23, 45, 'because they were carless with fire. Many more people have died because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 229, 24, 45, 'they were careless with money as well. Are you as careful in handling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 229, 25, 45, 'money as you are in handling fire? Actually, you should be more careful,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 229, 26, 45, 'because money is more dangerous than fire.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 229, 27, 45, 'So, we need to understand this in its proper perspective and proper');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 229, 28, 45, 'balance. We are not preaching some kind of sanyasi type of life or being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 230, 1, 45, 'a hermit or a monk or a nun or any such thing. That is not what I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 230, 2, 45, 'preaching. I am talking about living a normal life, earning your living,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 230, 3, 45, 'whatever profession you do for earning money. And by all means earn as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 230, 4, 45, 'much as you can without destroying your soul and without neglecting you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 230, 5, 45, 'family, putting God''s kingdom first. But, once you earn it, remember');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 230, 6, 45, 'what you earn is like a fire. Keep it under control. Keep it as your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 230, 7, 45, 'servant.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 230, 8, 45, 'Let me use another illustration. Supposing you have a servant in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 230, 9, 45, 'house, and the servant becomes like a mistress or a master and starts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 230, 10, 45, 'running the house. You, who are the master of the house or the mistress');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 230, 11, 45, 'of the house, have been reduced to the place of a servant. Your servant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 230, 12, 45, 'is bossing you, telling you to sit down and get up, and go here and go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 230, 13, 45, 'there. Ultimately, the servant has taken over the house. What a tragedy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 230, 14, 45, 'that is. The servant, who came in to help in the house, has now become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 230, 15, 45, 'the mistress. This is exactly what has happened to many Christians;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 230, 16, 45, 'money has not been kept in the place of a servant.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 230, 17, 45, 'There are many unrealistic attitudes towards money among Christians.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 230, 18, 45, 'Some people have preached extreme things, which are unrealistic and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 230, 19, 45, 'impossible to live by. God has not called everybody to become a sanyasi');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 230, 20, 45, 'or a hermit. God has not called everybody to become a full-time worker');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 230, 21, 45, 'to give up their job. Only one in a thousand is called to be a full-time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 230, 22, 45, 'worker. The rest, 999 of them, must be in a secular job. But they must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 230, 23, 45, 'know how to handle money; to see the relationship that God should have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 230, 24, 45, 'and money should have.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 230, 25, 45, 'Let us take an illustration from what I said earlier. Here is your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 230, 26, 45, 'husband in your home and here is a man who works as a servant, a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 230, 27, 45, 'gardener in your home, or a cook perhaps. Now, it is useful to have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 230, 28, 45, 'somebody doing the gardening or the cooking. But if you begin to love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 231, 1, 45, 'that cook more than your husband, something has gone wrong. That is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 231, 2, 45, 'problem with many believers. Money is all right when it is kept in its');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 231, 3, 45, 'place. But she starts loving the servant and has forgotten all about her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 231, 4, 45, 'husband. It is like the wife going and marrying the servant man or the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 231, 5, 45, 'gardener and forgetting all about her husband. This is an accurate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 231, 6, 45, 'picture of what has happened to many Christians and they have destroyed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 231, 7, 45, 'their lives. They have divorced their relationship with God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 231, 8, 45, 'So, what am I saying? Get rid of the gardener, get rid of the servant?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 231, 9, 45, 'No. By all means keep the gardener, keep the servant, but keep them in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 231, 10, 45, 'their proper place and you be devoted to your husband. Be devoted to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 231, 11, 45, 'God. Be so devoted to the Lord Jesus Christ that money has no value for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 231, 12, 45, 'you and it is kept as a servant. You know, how you and your husband will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 231, 13, 45, 'go out together, and the servant he doesn''t come into the picture at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 231, 14, 45, 'all. No. He may work in the fields for you. But he doesn''t come into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 231, 15, 45, 'picture when you and your husband go out. You are living with your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 231, 16, 45, 'husband, and not with your servant man. That is what Jesus said here.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 231, 17, 45, 'We must hate the one and love the other. Can you say that your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 231, 18, 45, 'relationship with God and money is like that? - That you hate one and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 231, 19, 45, 'love the other. You love God so much that your interest for money can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 231, 20, 45, 'compared to hatred. He said you must hold on to one, and despise the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 231, 21, 45, 'other. That means you value your husband so much, that you don''t care');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 231, 22, 45, 'for that servant who works in the field. Your love for Jesus is so great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 231, 23, 45, 'that money has no value for you at all. Many people have not taken this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 231, 24, 45, 'verse seriously, and many so-called believers don''t realize that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 231, 25, 45, 'actually they hate God, that they despise Him. Because, according to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 231, 26, 45, 'this verse, if you love money and material things, you hate God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 231, 27, 45, 'despise Him. Yeah ! it is true.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 231, 28, 45, 'You know the Pharisees about whom Jesus said that they were doctrinally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 232, 1, 45, 'pure (we read that in Matthew 23:3). Their doctrines were all correct.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 232, 2, 45, 'They were extremely religious. But we read in Luke 16:14 that they loved');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 232, 3, 45, 'money, which proved that they hated God. They were religious but they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 232, 4, 45, 'hated God, because they loved money so much. You can''t have a neutral');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 232, 5, 45, 'attitude towards money. Just like you can''t have a neutral attitude');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 232, 6, 45, 'towards Satan. You must either love Satan or hate him. You must either');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 232, 7, 45, 'love money or hate it. You will either hold on to money or despise it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 232, 8, 45, 'God and mammon are like two opposites, like the North and South Pole of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 232, 9, 45, 'a magnet. If you are attracted by one pole, you are repelled by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 232, 10, 45, 'other. You know anybody who has studied physics, knows that a magnet has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 232, 11, 45, 'a north pole and a south pole. If you bring another magnet to it, if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 232, 12, 45, 'are attracted to one pole of that magnet, you will be repelled by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 232, 13, 45, 'other one automatically.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 232, 14, 45, 'So then how shall we learn to be detached from money or to hate money -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 232, 15, 45, 'in the way Jesus said? Jesus used some strong words. For example, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 232, 16, 45, 'told us to hate our father and mother, wife and children. What did He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 232, 17, 45, 'mean? Here he says you have to hate money. We need to understand what He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 232, 18, 45, 'meant. He didn''t mean that we should kick our father and mother, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 232, 19, 45, 'wife and children out of the house. That is not the meaning. Neither is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 232, 20, 45, 'He saying that you must get rid of your money and be a hermit or a monk,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 232, 21, 45, 'or a pastor or full-time worker or go and give all your money to some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 232, 22, 45, 'Christian work or faith home or any such thing. No! That is not the way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 232, 23, 45, 'Let me use an example. If you look at Jesus'' life, there is the perfect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 232, 24, 45, 'example of how to handle money. He worked as a carpenter and He earned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 232, 25, 45, 'His living. But He was not attached to it. That is the answer. Look at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 232, 26, 45, 'Jesus and say, ''Lord I want to have the same attitude that You had to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 232, 27, 45, 'material things.'' That is the answer. We have a lot more to say about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 232, 28, 45, 'this subject which we shall continue in our next study.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 233, 1, 46, 'Chapter 46 The Love Of Money Is Evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 233, 2, 46, 'In this study we want to consider a little more in depth about how God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 233, 3, 46, 'and money are two opposites and, if we are attracted to one, we will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 233, 4, 46, 'reject the other.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 233, 5, 46, 'Let us look at Luke 16:13 once again where Jesus said, "No servant can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 233, 6, 46, 'serve two masters." We have seen that the two masters are God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 233, 7, 46, 'mammon. Mammon means money and material riches. Either you will hate one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 233, 8, 46, 'and love the other, or hold on to one and despise the other. If you love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 233, 9, 46, 'God, you will hate money, if you hold onto God, you will despise money.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 233, 10, 46, 'If you love money, it proves that you hate God. If you hold onto money,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 233, 11, 46, 'it proves that you despise God. It is as clear as that. In fact,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 233, 12, 46, '1Timothy 6:10 says, "The love of money is the root of every sort of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 233, 13, 46, 'evil." Not money. Money is not the root of all evil, but the love of it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 233, 14, 46, '"And many people wander away from the faith, and destroy themselves, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 233, 15, 46, 'create a lot of problems for themselves" (1 Tim. 6:10).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 233, 16, 46, 'So, if we don''t get this matter of money right in our life, we are going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 233, 17, 46, 'to have a lot of problems. We will never be able to grow in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 233, 18, 46, 'Christian life. I am convinced that, this is one of the main reasons why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 233, 19, 46, 'many believers do not make progress in their Christian Life. They seem');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 233, 20, 46, 'to be stunted like little children that have never gown up. How can we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 233, 21, 46, 'love God more than we love money? Is it by preaching, and preaching, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 233, 22, 46, 'preaching, that we should hate money? No, that doesn''t seem to work. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 233, 23, 46, 'negative message like that would only produce Pharisees, who imagine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 233, 24, 46, 'that they hate money and love Jesus, and imagine that all other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 233, 25, 46, 'believers are not like them. They will be self-righteous. No, that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 233, 26, 46, 'not the way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 233, 27, 46, 'Here is an example. Think of a young girl who is deeply in love with a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 233, 28, 46, 'young man and who feels that she cannot live without him. She is always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 234, 1, 46, 'thinking about him, trying to meet him, telephoning him, writing letters');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 234, 2, 46, 'to him, because she is deeply in love with him. He may not be a good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 234, 3, 46, 'man; he may even be a bad man. Her parents may try to tell their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 234, 4, 46, 'daughter to end that relationship, to give it up; to stop loving him, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 234, 5, 46, 'hate him. And it doesn''t work. It is just like telling believers to hate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 234, 6, 46, 'money, it doesn''t work. The parents keep on telling the girl, ''No he is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 234, 7, 46, 'not a good boy for you, and that is not the type of boy you should be in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 234, 8, 46, 'love with or marry. Give it up. Give it up.'' Nothing happens. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 234, 9, 46, 'continue to meet secretly. No matter what the parents say, her love for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 234, 10, 46, 'that man increases.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 234, 11, 46, 'This is exactly how it is with many believers. They hear hundreds of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 234, 12, 46, 'sermons on hating money - it doesn''t make any difference. They still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 234, 13, 46, 'love money secretly and they are attached to it, just like this girl to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 234, 14, 46, 'this boy. Then, one day, a miracle takes place. This girl now meets');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 234, 15, 46, 'another young man who is far more handsome, far more considerate, far');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 234, 16, 46, 'more kind, and better behaved, has a better job, and better prospects');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 234, 17, 46, 'and, in every way, more attractive. Suddenly her heart is filled with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 234, 18, 46, 'love for this young man, and she never wants to see that first young man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 234, 19, 46, 'anymore.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 234, 20, 46, 'What the parents did not succeed in doing in so many years, in one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 234, 21, 46, 'moment, this man has accomplished by coming into her life. She will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 234, 22, 46, 'never again reply to the phone call of that first man. She is finished');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 234, 23, 46, 'corresponding with him. She says, ''I never want to see you again, I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 234, 24, 46, 'finished with you.'' What happened? Her parents are delighted because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 234, 25, 46, 'this new man is a very good man. How did she get rid of her love for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 234, 26, 46, 'that first man? There we see how we can get rid of our love for money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 234, 27, 46, 'and material things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 234, 28, 46, 'Your heart has to be filled with love for someone else. That is the only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 235, 1, 46, 'way. That new love will drive out the old one. It is like light driving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 235, 2, 46, 'out the darkness. Supposing a room is filled with darkness and you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 235, 3, 46, 'switch on the light, what happens? The darkness and the light cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 235, 4, 46, 'live in the same room. Till then that room was filled with darkness and,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 235, 5, 46, 'in one moment, it is gone. Just like this girl, for so long her heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 235, 6, 46, 'was attached to that bad man and the parents could never remove that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 235, 7, 46, 'affection from her heart. But once she found this better man, she');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 235, 8, 46, 'changed immediately. So, we don''t preach a negative message. We lift up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 235, 9, 46, 'Christ. And when your heart is drawn to love Him, when you see Jesus as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 235, 10, 46, 'He really is, when you love the Lord with all your heart, automatically,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 235, 11, 46, 'without any effort, you will find that your attachment and love for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 235, 12, 46, 'money has disappeared.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 235, 13, 46, 'Then what shall we say if this girl outwardly says that she loves this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 235, 14, 46, 'second man, but secretly still corresponds with the first man,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 235, 15, 46, 'telephones him, and secretly meets him. What would you say? You would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 235, 16, 46, 'say she is a hypocrite. She is only pretending to love the second one.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 235, 17, 46, 'She is actually still in love with the first one. Now this is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 235, 18, 46, 'condition of many, many believers. They say they love Jesus. Every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 235, 19, 46, 'Sunday they get up and sing songs to each other like wonderful love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 235, 20, 46, 'letters written to Jesus. Some of these hymns that we sing on Sunday');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 235, 21, 46, 'morning are like love letters to the Lord, fantastic love letters. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 235, 22, 46, 'throughout the week we are interested in the first man. What does it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 235, 23, 46, 'prove?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 235, 24, 46, 'We are just hypocrites. We don''t really love the Lord at all. Why don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 235, 25, 46, 'we love the Lord? You can''t force a person. You can''t take this girl and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 235, 26, 46, 'say, ''Come on, you must love this man.'' Love is spontaneous, you can''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 235, 27, 46, 'force it. If it doesn''t come automatically, it is just not there. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 235, 28, 46, 'only when you get to appreciate a person, you get drawn. It is when this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 236, 1, 46, 'girl appreciated this second boy she was drawn to him. It is only when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 236, 2, 46, 'we really see the glory of Jesus, how good God is, how loving He is, how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 236, 3, 46, 'much He gave to purchase me to be his own, how He lived, suffered, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 236, 4, 46, 'died on this earth only for me, then we will love Him. And when we love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 236, 5, 46, 'him like that, the attraction of these earthly things just vanishes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 236, 6, 46, 'So, it is very clear that, even if you call yourself a believer, if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 236, 7, 46, 'still love money and material things, you do not love Jesus with all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 236, 8, 46, 'your heart. It is impossible to love God and mammon. If you say, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 236, 9, 46, 'don''t love mammon but you pursue after it, aren''t you telling a lie? If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 236, 10, 46, 'you say, ''No I don''t have any interest in that first boy anymore,'' but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 236, 11, 46, 'every now and then you are running after him, aren''t you telling a lie?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 236, 12, 46, 'That is exactly the same. You say, ''But we need money to live on this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 236, 13, 46, 'earth.'' We certainly do. I said that right from the beginning.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 236, 14, 46, 'I am not saying that we don''t need money. Even Jesus needed money to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 236, 15, 46, 'live on this earth. But He never ran after it. That was not the goal of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 236, 16, 46, 'His life; to make more and more money. No! Let me ask you a question. Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 236, 17, 46, 'you get excited when you suddenly get a lot of money, unexpectedly? Are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 236, 18, 46, 'you longing to make more and more money? If your answer is yes to either');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 236, 19, 46, 'of these questions; you are excited when you get more money or you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 236, 20, 46, 'longing to make more and more money, then it is clear, my dear friend,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 236, 21, 46, 'that you love money. You do serve mammon.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 236, 22, 46, 'There is nothing wrong in getting more money. There is nothing wrong in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 236, 23, 46, 'getting a very high salary. No! You can get Fifty Thousand rupees a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 236, 24, 46, 'month, and still love God; it is quite possible. It is not a question on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 236, 25, 46, 'how much you earn. I am not saying you can love God only if you get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 236, 26, 46, 'three hundred rupees a month. That is not what Jesus taught. It is not a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 236, 27, 46, 'question of how much you earn, it is a question of whether you love or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 236, 28, 46, 'run after it. That is the point.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 237, 1, 46, 'Now, many believers are so foolish to think that, if they get more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 237, 2, 46, 'money, that is an indication of God''s blessing on them. Some believers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 237, 3, 46, 'even wish that God would help them, one day, to win a lottery; if they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 237, 4, 46, 'can get that bumper prize of ten lakhs rupees having bought a ticket for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 237, 5, 46, 'only one rupee. Do you know lotteries are one of Satan''s means to lure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 237, 6, 46, 'people to worshipping money? Hoping to earn hundred thousand rupees by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 237, 7, 46, 'paying one rupee or five rupees? What is the use? How are you getting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 237, 8, 46, 'that one lakh rupees? One hundred thousand people have bought tickets');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 237, 9, 46, 'and you are cashing in on the disappointment of those hundred thousand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 237, 10, 46, 'other people in order to be lucky. You are getting one rupee each given');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 237, 11, 46, 'by a hundred thousand people. Is that the way God wants us to live on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 237, 12, 46, 'this earth? That is what lottery is. That is not God''s way for us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 237, 13, 46, 'earn a living. No! Do you think Jesus would buy a lottery ticket? Many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 237, 14, 46, 'people think that that will make them happy. It is evil to live off of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 237, 15, 46, 'the money of other people. It is better to have little that we earn on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 237, 16, 46, 'our own. Don''t think that this is an indication of God''s blessing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 237, 17, 46, 'God''s blessing is not seen in material things. Jesus was poor and He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 237, 18, 46, 'the most blessed. The apostle Peter once said, ''Silver and gold I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 237, 19, 46, 'none.'' Paul was poor. He had to work with his hand, struggle to earn a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 237, 20, 46, 'living. In the Old Testament we have an example of Lot and Abraham.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 237, 21, 46, 'Abraham never wanted to get rich but God blessed him and he was rich.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 237, 22, 46, 'But Lot wanted to get rich. He went to Sodom to make money. You can read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 237, 23, 46, 'about that in Genesis 12-13 and all the way up to Genesis 19. What was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 237, 24, 46, 'the result? He destroyed himself. Balaam wanted to get rich as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 237, 25, 46, 'preacher. What was the result? He lost his calling and went to hell.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 237, 26, 46, 'Gehazi, the servant of Elisha (you can read about it in 2 Kings 5),');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 237, 27, 46, 'wanted to get rich. He not only missed the opportunity to be the next');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 237, 28, 46, 'prophet after Elisha, but also brought leprosy upon himself and his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 238, 1, 46, 'children. You see so many examples. Judas Iscariot wanted to get some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 238, 2, 46, 'money and he destroyed himself and went to hell. We have enough warning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 238, 3, 46, 'there. D e mas could have been an apostle like Paul; he could have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 238, 4, 46, 'written scripture. Instead of that, he went after money and destroyed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 238, 5, 46, 'himself and lost his calling.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 238, 6, 46, 'Dear friend, take it seriously. The Bible warns us: "Those who want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 238, 7, 46, 'get rich will fall into temptation and many foolish and harmful desires,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 238, 8, 46, 'which plunged men into ruin and destruction." There is only one way to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 238, 9, 46, 'escape it, say, ''Lord Jesus, I want to love You with all my heart, not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 238, 10, 46, '90% of my heart, with all my heart and all my life, and save me form');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 238, 11, 46, 'this terrible evil of the love of money.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 238, 12, 47, 'Chapter 47 Give Back What Belongs To Others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 238, 13, 47, 'We want to look at bit more into this subject that we have looking at in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 238, 14, 47, 'our last two studies, and that is, how the love of money and material');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 238, 15, 47, 'things can destroy us. Please read carefully because this affects your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 238, 16, 47, 'life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 238, 17, 47, 'Let us look to two verses from 1 Timothy 6:8-10. It starts with, "Those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 238, 18, 47, 'who want to get rich." This doesn''t apply to everybody in the world. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 238, 19, 47, 'applies to those who want to get rich. Do you fall into that category? A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 238, 20, 47, 'lot of people do, even a lot of believers. So, if that (those who want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 238, 21, 47, 'to get rich) refers to you, then read carefully. Because the Bible warns');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 238, 22, 47, 'you in advance of what is going to happen to such people. "Those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 238, 23, 47, 'want to get rich will fall into temptation, and a snare, and many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 238, 24, 47, 'foolish and harmful desires, which plunge men into ruin and destruction.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 238, 25, 47, 'Because the love of money is a root of all sorts of evil and some by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 238, 26, 47, 'longing for it (Again, this does not apply to everybody but to those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 238, 27, 47, 'long for more and more and more money. Are you in that category? Here is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 238, 28, 47, 'what Almighty God says will happen) have wandered away from the faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 239, 1, 47, 'and have pierced themselves with many sorrows."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 239, 2, 47, 'So, what are the results of wanting to get rich and longing for more and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 239, 3, 47, 'more money beyond what we need? Falling into temptation, falling into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 239, 4, 47, 'the trap of the devil, falling into many foolish desires, many harmful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 239, 5, 47, 'desires, plunging into ruin, plunging into destruction, wandering away');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 239, 6, 47, 'from the faith, and being pierced with many sorrows. Do you want such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 239, 7, 47, 'life? All you have to do is pursue after money beyond your needs. Now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 239, 8, 47, 'the Lord is not against our earning our living. The Lord is not against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 239, 9, 47, 'our seeking to increase our income in getting a better job with a higher');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 239, 10, 47, 'income. This is not what it is talking about. This is talking about a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 239, 11, 47, 'passion. Love is a passion, where your heart is possessed. You know what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 239, 12, 47, 'it means when you say a boy and a girl in love with each other? They are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 239, 13, 47, 'everything to each other. And when a person loves money like that and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 239, 14, 47, 'wants more, and more, this is exactly what is going to happen to him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 239, 15, 47, 'Satan doesn''t tell us, right in the beginning, what all is going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 239, 16, 47, 'happen if you go along this way. He first lures us by giving us a little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 239, 17, 47, 'taste of the enjoyment of wealth, you know, just like people who sell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 239, 18, 47, 'drugs and get people hooked on drugs. They begin by giving a little bit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 239, 19, 47, 'of a drug, maybe in a sweet, sometimes freely, to a little child in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 239, 20, 47, 'school. Once the child gets the taste of it, once that young boy or girl');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 239, 21, 47, 'gets a taste of it, they want more. Then we say they are hooked like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 239, 22, 47, 'fish caught in the bait. They want more and more and then the people who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 239, 23, 47, 'sell drugs make their money through that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 239, 24, 47, 'That is exactly how Satan does it. He increases our appetite for money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 239, 25, 47, 'and material things by giving us a little bit until you have plunged');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 239, 26, 47, 'your family and yourself into ruin and destruction. People get into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 239, 27, 47, 'debt, to buy this and buy that. And the result is Christians whose lives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 239, 28, 47, 'were meant to build the church, now have their lives being wasted in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 240, 1, 47, 'pursuit of money. Many believers have sold their heavenly birthright for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 240, 2, 47, 'a bowl of porridge, just like Esau. Just think what regret they will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 240, 3, 47, 'have in eternity. Any sensible believer, therefore, will never, never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 240, 4, 47, 'pursue after accumulating wealth beyond his needs, just like he will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 240, 5, 47, 'jump off the 10th floor of a building. Supposing you climb up a building');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 240, 6, 47, 'to the 10th floor, if you are a sensible person, you don''t jump down');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 240, 7, 47, 'from the 10th floor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 240, 8, 47, 'It is more foolish to pursue after money. Why is it then people do it?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 240, 9, 47, 'They don''t think any harm will come to them. Just like that senseless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 240, 10, 47, 'person who jumps off the 10th floor and thinks no harm will come to him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 240, 11, 47, '''Oh yeah,'' he may say, ''Other people got hurt but I am not going to get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 240, 12, 47, 'hurt.'' That is how a lot of believers run after money till they have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 240, 13, 47, 'destroyed themselves. The pursuit of money and jumping off a 10th floor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 240, 14, 47, 'of a building, both of these actions can destroy you. If you take the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 240, 15, 47, 'warnings of scripture, you will protect yourself. But, if you jump off');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 240, 16, 47, 'the 10th floor of a building and you say, that God will protect me, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 240, 17, 47, 'are foolish. God is not going to protect a person who jumps from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 240, 18, 47, 'pinnacle of the temple.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 240, 19, 47, 'Now, it is possible for a person to say sincerely, ''Lord I want to know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 240, 20, 47, 'how to be free from this.'' I believe there are many believers like that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 240, 21, 47, 'around the world really seeking to be free. And to such people, I want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 240, 22, 47, 'to tell two things which are mentioned in Matthew 22:21. You may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 240, 23, 47, 'remember how Jesus answered when somebody asked Jesus, ''Should we pay');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 240, 24, 47, 'taxes?'' Jesus asked them to show Him a coin and then He asked, "Whose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 240, 25, 47, 'picture is on that coin?" They replied, ''Caesar''s.'' That is when the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 240, 26, 47, 'Lord made these statements in Matthew 22:21. He said, "You give Caesar');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 240, 27, 47, 'the things that are Caesar''s, and give God the things that are God''s."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 240, 28, 47, 'There are two statements here that can deliver you from the pursuit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 241, 1, 47, 'money. Jesus was telling us there about our responsibility in relation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 241, 2, 47, 'to material things. First of all, "Give to Caesar what is Caesar''s."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 241, 3, 47, 'Notice, Jesus did not say, first give to God what is God''s and then give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 241, 4, 47, 'to Caesar what is Caesar''s. No. Let us get the order correct. He did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 241, 5, 47, 'put God first here. He said, "First of all, give to Caesar what is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 241, 6, 47, 'Caesar''s. Secondly, give God what is God''s." He was first telling us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 241, 7, 47, 'be righteous in money matters and then he was telling us to be faithful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 241, 8, 47, 'in money matters. These are two different things. One is higher than the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 241, 9, 47, 'other: First of all, we have got to be righteous in money matters and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 241, 10, 47, 'then we got to be faithful in money matters.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 241, 11, 47, 'What does is it mean to be righteous in money matters? This is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 241, 12, 47, 'kindergarten lesson in money. This means we must give to Caesar what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 241, 13, 47, 'belongs to him. Caesar, here, represents another human being or the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 241, 14, 47, 'government, either. For example, if you have borrowed money from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 241, 15, 47, 'somebody, call that person Caesar. Don''t give God that money. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 241, 16, 47, 'doesn''t want it. You give back your debt to Caesar. What belongs to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 241, 17, 47, 'Caesar must go back to Caesar first. That is why Jesus put God second.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 241, 18, 47, 'Do you recognize that? God doesn''t want Caesar''s money. So, you better');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 241, 19, 47, 'give back to Caesar what belongs to him and then decide what you want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 241, 20, 47, 'give to God; those of you who are in debt, who owe money to others. I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 241, 21, 47, 'sorry to say that there are many believers who have got this very bad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 241, 22, 47, 'habit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 241, 23, 47, 'I want to encourage you to start giving back to Caesar what belongs to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 241, 24, 47, 'him, unless that other person has released you from your debt saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 241, 25, 47, '''Okay, that is alright, you need not pay it back.'' You have an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 241, 26, 47, 'obligation to pay it back, even if you borrowed it from him 25 years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 241, 27, 47, 'ago. It may not have been borrowed. It may have been stolen. Supposing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 241, 28, 47, 'you had stolen something that belongs to somebody else, may be his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 242, 1, 47, 'property, maybe you got somebody''s book lying with you for many years at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 242, 2, 47, 'home, you never returned it, a book that you had borrowed. Maybe a knife');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 242, 3, 47, 'or a pickaxe or a shovel or something you borrowed, which you never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 242, 4, 47, 'returned. Return it. Give back to Caesar what is Caesar''s. If it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 242, 5, 47, 'money that you took wrongfully, maybe you worked in an office and you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 242, 6, 47, 'stole things from that office, send a cheque to that office. Return that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 242, 7, 47, 'money. Maybe you worked in a hospital and stole drugs from that hospital');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 242, 8, 47, 'for your family use, or stole equipment. Return that money. Give back to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 242, 9, 47, 'Caesar what is Caesar''s. Maybe you travelled in the railways, without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 242, 10, 47, 'buying a ticket. Go and buy a ticket for that distance and return that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 242, 11, 47, 'money. If you travelled in a bus, give that money back to that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 242, 12, 47, 'particular bus service.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 242, 13, 47, 'We have to begin by giving to Caesar what is Caesar''s. If you haven''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 242, 14, 47, 'set these things right with Caesar, then don''t give to God. God won''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 242, 15, 47, 'accept it. That is why Jesus said to put Caesar first. The same thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 242, 16, 47, 'applies to the government. Supposing, in the past, you cheated the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 242, 17, 47, 'income tax by not telling them how much you earned. Well, calculate that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 242, 18, 47, 'and give the money back. Maybe you came back from a foreign trip, from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 242, 19, 47, 'some gulf country, and brought in a lot of things and hid it from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 242, 20, 47, 'customs to avoid paying the customs duty. Or, what is worse, perhaps');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 242, 21, 47, 'that you bribed the customs officer and got the thing through. What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 242, 22, 47, 'should you do now? Well, calculate the duty and pay it back to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 242, 23, 47, 'government. You say, ''But I give such a lot of money to the customs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 242, 24, 47, 'officer.'' Forget it. Set it right with the government. To give to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 242, 25, 47, 'customs officer is a bribe. It is not the same as giving it to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 242, 26, 47, 'government; definitely not. That went into his pocket.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 242, 27, 47, 'So this is where we must begin. Return all money that was taken');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 242, 28, 47, 'wrongfully. Zacchaeus said to the Lord, "I will return four times of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 243, 1, 47, 'what I have taken wrongfully from people " (Lk. 19:9). He calculated the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 243, 2, 47, 'interest and said, ''I took it many years ago. They could have put it in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 243, 3, 47, 'a bank and could have got more interest. I better give back four times.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 243, 4, 47, 'And then he thought of all the people whose addresses he didn''t know,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 243, 5, 47, 'how to give back their money. He said, ''I will give it to the poor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 243, 6, 47, 'instead.'' So, when you have money with you that belongs to other people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 243, 7, 47, 'and you don''t know where they are living today, then you must give it to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 243, 8, 47, 'the church or to the poor; one of the two.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 243, 9, 47, 'Even if your debt is very large, don''t get discouraged. Start by paying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 243, 10, 47, 'a small amount every month, maybe 10 rupees a month, even that. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 243, 11, 47, 'start paying it back. If there is a willing heart, God will bless you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 243, 12, 47, 'from the very first day that you start paying back your debt, even if it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 243, 13, 47, 'takes you 15 years to pay your whole debt. He doesn''t wait until the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 243, 14, 47, 'whole debt is cleared. He sees a willing heart and He sees that you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 243, 15, 47, 'willing to set it right. Give to Caesar everything that belongs to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 243, 16, 47, 'Caesar.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 243, 17, 47, 'It is no use hanging a plaque in your house saying, ''God bless our home''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 243, 18, 47, 'if you got things in your home, money in your home, that has been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 243, 19, 47, 'obtained unrighteously, "Owe nothing to anyone" is what the Bible says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 243, 20, 47, 'in Romans 13:8. Let us begin today. Make a decision right now, as you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 243, 21, 47, 'are concluding this study, to give back to everyone that belongs to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 243, 22, 47, 'them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 243, 23, 48, 'Chapter 48 Giving Everything To God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 243, 24, 48, 'In this study we shall look to a verse of scripture that tells us how we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 243, 25, 48, 'can be delivered from the power of mammon, and serve God with all of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 243, 26, 48, 'heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 243, 27, 48, 'Money is a wonderful servant but a terrible master like fire is. Fire is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 243, 28, 48, 'a wonderful servant when kept in control on the gas stove, but a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 244, 1, 48, 'terrible master when it is allowed to burn down the house. Jesus said in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 244, 2, 48, 'Matthew 22:21, "Render to Caesar the things that are Caesar''s, and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 244, 3, 48, 'God the things that are God''s," teaching us, first of all, to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 244, 4, 48, 'righteous in money matters, and secondly, to be faithful in money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 244, 5, 48, 'matters. To be righteous, first of all, is to give back to other people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 244, 6, 48, 'what is rightfully theirs. If you have borrowed money, return it. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 244, 7, 48, 'have cheated, return it. If you have cheated the income tax department');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 244, 8, 48, 'or the customs department, give it back. If you don''t do it, you will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 244, 9, 48, 'dragging a chain on your feet all your life. You will never be able to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 244, 10, 48, 'run the Christian race, I will tell you that. Settle it now. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 244, 11, 48, 'better to get God''s blessing than to hang on to money, which is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 244, 12, 48, 'yours.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 244, 13, 48, 'Do you know that if you have even one rupee with you, which is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 244, 14, 48, 'unrighteously earned, that money will be a curse to you and to your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 244, 15, 48, 'children? You will not be ready for the coming of the Lord if you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 244, 16, 48, 'not settled matters down on this earth. No, we must not have one rupee');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 244, 17, 48, 'with us, which has been unrighteously earned. Concerning this matter the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 244, 18, 48, 'Bible says in Roman 13:8, "Owe nothing to anyone." We should avoid all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 244, 19, 48, 'borrowing, as far as possible. Avoid getting into debt, it is a bad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 244, 20, 48, 'habit. Be happy with what God gives you and live within that income. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 244, 21, 48, 'advertisement in the papers say, ''Buy now and pay later.'' That is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 244, 22, 48, 'surest way to get into debt. Let me give you another motto: ''Save now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 244, 23, 48, 'and buy later,'' when you have enough money with you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 244, 24, 48, 'Now, I want to make something clear here. Many people get loans from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 244, 25, 48, 'their offices or banks for buying a vehicle, a two-wheeler or a car, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 244, 26, 48, 'a building loan to build a house. There is nothing wrong in taking a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 244, 27, 48, 'loan like that because, for that money, you have something to show like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 244, 28, 48, 'a vehicle or a house. If you are unable to repay that money, they will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 245, 1, 48, 'take back the house or take back the vehicle so in that sense you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 245, 2, 48, 'not in debt at all. So that is all right. But when you take money to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 245, 3, 48, 'spend on something that disappears, for example, for a wedding, you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 245, 4, 48, 'in slavery. The slavery of believers to mammon is seen most clearly at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 245, 5, 48, 'weddings. There you can see the covetousness, the greed, and the honour');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 245, 6, 48, 'seeking displayed unashamedly. Consider the dowry system practiced not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 245, 7, 48, 'only by unbelievers, but by believers in almost every denomination. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 245, 8, 48, 'is very sad.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 245, 9, 48, 'Those who ask for a dowry, before deciding whether this is the girl God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 245, 10, 48, 'wants them to marry, are a disgrace to the name of Jesus Christ. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 245, 11, 48, 'are certainly not His disciples. How do you find out God''s will whether');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 245, 12, 48, 'this is the girl whom God wants you to marry - By finding out whether');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 245, 13, 48, 'her father can give you so much money! You are serving mammon then. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 245, 14, 48, 'doesn''t matter if your pastor or your priest says it is okay. God''s word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 245, 15, 48, 'does not encourage it. If you were to ask Jesus, what would He say? What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 245, 16, 48, 'would Jesus tell you when you pray? Will He tell you to go and ask him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 245, 17, 48, 'for some more dowry? Can you imagine the Lord Jesus saying such a thing?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 245, 18, 48, 'Then where are you getting that advice from? You are getting that advice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 245, 19, 48, 'form unconverted people. We must never expect a dowry when it comes to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 245, 20, 48, 'marriage. No!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 245, 21, 48, 'Consider also the great waste of money there is at many wedding');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 245, 22, 48, 'receptions. Now there is nothing wrong in having a good wedding');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 245, 23, 48, 'reception, if you can afford it. Jesus Himself made extra wine for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 245, 24, 48, 'people at a wedding reception! But I know many believers who have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 245, 25, 48, 'borrowed money in order to have such a grand reception and then remain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 245, 26, 48, 'in debt for years. Isn''t that a stupid way to start a marriage? That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 245, 27, 48, 'evil. It is far better, in such a case, to have a simple reception.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 245, 28, 48, 'Don''t compete with some other family who had a grand reception for their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 246, 1, 48, 'wedding. And borrow money to show that you are also able to have such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 246, 2, 48, 'grand reception. You may say, ''If I have a simple reception, what will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 246, 3, 48, 'others say?'' Why not then ask yourself, ''What will God say?'' Are you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 246, 4, 48, 'more afraid of man''s opinion than God''s? Do you think God wants you to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 246, 5, 48, 'start your married life in debt? We must never adulterate the message of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 246, 6, 48, 'Christ in the Christian church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 246, 7, 48, 'This must be our standard: We will not get into debt, as far as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 246, 8, 48, 'possible. There may be situations, such as emergency, you have to borrow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 246, 9, 48, 'money from somebody. You know emergency situations which you didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 246, 10, 48, 'anticipate. But then you must seek to return that as soon as possible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 246, 11, 48, 'The word of God is very clear in Romans 13:8 "Owe nothing to anyone." Be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 246, 12, 48, 'content with what you have. Don''t be in competition with any other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 246, 13, 48, 'believer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 246, 14, 48, 'Once you learn to be righteous in money matters, you go on to being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 246, 15, 48, 'faithful. What does it mean to be faithful? Render to God what is God''s.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 246, 16, 48, 'That is the second thing He said. What is God''s? Many people will say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 246, 17, 48, '10%. Well, in the Old Testament it was 10%. In the New Testament, Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 246, 18, 48, 'said, "If you don''t forsake all that you have, you cannot be my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 246, 19, 48, 'disciple." How much is all? All means 100%. When He says, ''Give to God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 246, 20, 48, 'what is God''s,'' He means 100%. What would you think of a wife who works,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 246, 21, 48, 'and tells her husband, ''I will give you 10% of my income, the other 90%');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 246, 22, 48, 'I am giving to somebody else?'' Is that a good partnership type of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 246, 23, 48, 'relationship? No!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 246, 24, 48, 'In the Old Testament, people were not married to God like we are to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 246, 25, 48, 'Christ. They were servants. Servants can give 10% to their master; that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 246, 26, 48, 'is okay. But we are not servants. We are a bride. We are the wife. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 246, 27, 48, 'have a joint account. Not separate accounts. Masters and servants don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 246, 28, 48, 'have joint accounts. They have separate accounts. But a husband and wife');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 247, 1, 48, 'have a joint account. Like Jesus said to the Father in John 17:10, "All');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 247, 2, 48, 'that is mine is thine, and all that is thine is mine." That is a joint');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 247, 3, 48, 'account. And that is what we say also as Christians: ''Lord all that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 247, 4, 48, 'mine is yours.'' Not 10%. Then do you know what He says? "All that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 247, 5, 48, 'Mine is yours too." Isn''t that wonderful? - That, you give your little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 247, 6, 48, '10 paise to God, and He gives you His millions. Isn''t it wonderful to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 247, 7, 48, 'have a joint account with God?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 247, 8, 48, 'But you can''t have a joint account with God if you give 10%. You have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 247, 9, 48, 'give everything. You have to say, ''Lord, first of all, everything that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 247, 10, 48, 'have belongs to you in any case.'' We read in 1 Corinthians 10:26, "The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 247, 11, 48, 'earth is the Lord''s, and everything that the earth contains is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 247, 12, 48, 'Lord''s." Have you read that? All the houses, all the lands, all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 247, 13, 48, 'gold, all the silver, everything on earth belongs to God. Once you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 247, 14, 48, 'recognize that, you don''t think you are doing God a great favour when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 247, 15, 48, 'you give everything to him. No! You are giving what belongs to Him. Have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 247, 16, 48, 'you earned much? Has God given you intelligence, ability,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 247, 17, 48, 'qualifications, and capabilities, and talents to earn a lot of money,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 247, 18, 48, 'whether in business or in a profession or whatever? Don''t forget');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 247, 19, 48, 'Deuteronomy 8:18, "It is the Lord who gives you power to make money."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 247, 20, 48, 'Don''t ever forget that. It is the Lord who gives you power to make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 247, 21, 48, 'money. You could have been paralyzed, you could have been retarded, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 247, 22, 48, 'could have been sick and you would have earned nothing. You could have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 247, 23, 48, 'been stupid and earned nothing. Don''t ever forget that all the money you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 247, 24, 48, 'have earned in your life, God helped you to do it. So your money is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 247, 25, 48, 'your own. Every way you look at it, it is not yours.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 247, 26, 48, 'Now that doesn''t mean you have to take all your income and give it for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 247, 27, 48, 'God''s work. No! That is not what I mean. We give it to Him, first of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 247, 28, 48, 'all, because it belongs to Him, and secondly because we love Him. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 248, 1, 48, 'so, we say, ''Lord this is yours, now tell me what I can spend on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 248, 2, 48, 'myself.'' Do you think God doesn''t want you to live in a decent house?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 248, 3, 48, 'You think He wants you to live in a slum? That is not true. I don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 248, 4, 48, 'believe it. Jesus didn''t live in a slum, a dirty slum. No, His house in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 248, 5, 48, 'Nazareth was not a dirty slum. Also God wants you to live with proper');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 248, 6, 48, 'food, clothing, and house and education for your children. He wants you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 248, 7, 48, 'to spend on all these things. There is nothing wrong in all these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 248, 8, 48, 'things. So to give a 100% to God doesn''t mean to give it all to God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 248, 9, 48, 'work and to live on the streets. No! But to recognize that I am a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 248, 10, 48, 'steward, I am only a manager handling somebody else''s money. Though you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 248, 11, 48, 'earned it, you recognize it is God''s. I want to use it faithfully,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 248, 12, 48, 'recognizing all this is God''s. That is the only way to be detached from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 248, 13, 48, 'mammon. That is the only way to be delivered from the power of mammon in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 248, 14, 48, 'your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 248, 15, 48, 'Jesus said in Luke 16:13, "If you have not been faithful in the use of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 248, 16, 48, 'unrighteous mammon who will entrust the true riches to you." You know,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 248, 17, 48, 'if you are not faithful, we are not talking about righteousness here. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 248, 18, 48, 'already finished with righteousness. To be faithful means, you say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 248, 19, 48, '''Lord, I don''t want to waste any money. I don''t want to spend');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 248, 20, 48, 'unnecessarily on myself. I want to be wise on what I spend. I don''t want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 248, 21, 48, 'to be luxurious. I want to live simply so that I can have money to give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 248, 22, 48, 'for your work, to serve you, to live for you.'' When we are faithful, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 248, 23, 48, 'know what God gives us in exchange - The true riches of heaven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 248, 24, 48, 'Revelation on His word, likeness to Christ, if we learn to be simple in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 248, 25, 48, 'our expenditure, being careful not to waste anything that God gives us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 248, 26, 48, 'This is the reason why many people are spiritually poor. Because they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 248, 27, 48, 'are not faithful with money or they are not being righteous with money.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 248, 28, 48, 'Will you make a decision right now? Say, ''Lord, I not only want to give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 249, 1, 48, 'back to Caesar what is Caesar''s, I also want to give you what is yours.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 249, 2, 48, 'In every area I want to put you first. I don''t want to waste money on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 249, 3, 48, 'myself anymore. I want to be faithful knowing that I have to give an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 249, 4, 48, 'account to you, one day, of every rupee that I have earned.'' Make that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 249, 5, 48, 'covenant with God and see, if from this day onwards God doesn''t bless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 249, 6, 48, 'you. I believe He will.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 249, 7, 49, 'Chapter 49 God Binds Husband And Wife Together');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 249, 8, 49, 'In this study we want to think about something very important, very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 249, 9, 49, 'crucial, and that is on God''s plan for an excellent marriage. I believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 249, 10, 49, 'this is very vital in the days in which we live.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 249, 11, 49, 'The Pharisees once came to Jesus (we read in Matthew 19) to test Him and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 249, 12, 49, 'asked Him, in verse 3,"Is it lawful for a man to divorce his wife for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 249, 13, 49, 'any reason?" Jesus'' reply was, “Haven’t you read that He who created');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 249, 14, 49, 'them from the beginning, made them male and female," and He went to say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 249, 15, 49, 'that, “The two shall become one flesh." Consequently, they are no more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 249, 16, 49, 'two but one. "And what therefore God has joined together let no man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 249, 17, 49, 'separate."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 249, 18, 49, 'The point I want you to notice here is, even though under the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 249, 19, 49, 'Testament Moses had permitted divorce, as the Pharisees pointed out in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 249, 20, 49, 'Matthew 19:7, it was only a temporary arrangement. Jesus said, ''If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 249, 21, 49, 'want to know God''s perfect will, go back to the beginning.'' That is what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 249, 22, 49, 'He said in verse 4, ''From the beginning.'' So, if we want to understand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 249, 23, 49, 'what God''s will is for a man and a woman, we must go back to Genesis');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 249, 24, 49, 'chapter 2. That is what Jesus quoted here (Mat. 19:5), "A man shall');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 249, 25, 49, 'leave his father and mother and cleave to his wife and the two shall');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 249, 26, 49, 'become one flesh." That is why, He said, there is no question of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 249, 27, 49, 'divorce.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 249, 28, 49, 'Unfortunately, among Christians also, who are supposed to be the light');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 250, 1, 49, 'of the world, a lot of marriages are not happy. They are not divorced,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 250, 2, 49, 'in the sense that they have not separated and gone to live in separate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 250, 3, 49, 'homes, but there is a separation in spirit. Though they are not divorced');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 250, 4, 49, 'physically, they are divorced in spirit. You can be living in the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 250, 5, 49, 'house for 20 years and live as two lonely individuals. Then you are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 250, 6, 49, 'fulfilling God''s purpose for your marriage. Because God''s purpose is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 250, 7, 49, 'that two shall become one. That is God''s plan, two should become one. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 250, 8, 49, 'need to see why two are not becoming one.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 250, 9, 49, 'If we go back to the beginning (Genesis 2), we read that it was not Adam');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 250, 10, 49, 'who went to God and said, ''Lord, I am feeling lonely, can you please');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 250, 11, 49, 'give me a wife?'' Isn''t that interesting? That, it was God who said (Gen.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 250, 12, 49, '2:18), when He looked at man, "It is not good for man to be alone. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 250, 13, 49, 'will make him a helper suitable for him." Now the question is, ''Why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 250, 14, 49, 'didn''t God make Adam and Eve simultaneously, at the same time?'' He could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 250, 15, 49, 'have done it very easily. It says, He took the dust of the ground and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 250, 16, 49, 'made Adam. At the same time, He could have made Eve and breathed into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 250, 17, 49, 'both of them the breath of life, so that, as soon as their eyes were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 250, 18, 49, 'open, they could see each other. Why did He make Adam first, alone, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 250, 19, 49, 'a while later, put him to sleep, pulled out his rib, and made a woman?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 250, 20, 49, 'There is a good reason. There is something spiritual that God was trying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 250, 21, 49, 'to tell both Adam and Eve, which is the secret of how two can become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 250, 22, 49, 'one. What was that secret? When God made Adam, when he got life, and he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 250, 23, 49, 'opened his eye s , who was the first person he saw? You know the answer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 250, 24, 49, 'God! He met God. He talked with God. He had no wife. It was just him and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 250, 25, 49, 'God. Much later he got a wife. So what was God trying to teach Adam');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 250, 26, 49, 'through that? He was trying to teach Adam one simple lesson that, "I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 250, 27, 49, 'must be first in your life at all times. Before you see a wife, you must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 250, 28, 49, 'see me. More than you value your wife, you must value me." That is why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 251, 1, 49, 'He made Adam alone and fellowshipped with him before a wife even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 251, 2, 49, 'existed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 251, 3, 49, 'What shall we learn from this? That, throughout your life, even if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 251, 4, 49, 'are married for 50 years or 75 years, God must always be first every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 251, 5, 49, 'day. Many people start with their wives first, if they are fallen in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 251, 6, 49, 'love with each other. In some cases, the parents are first, but let me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 251, 7, 49, 'go into that later. Let me now speak about the creation of Eve. God put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 251, 8, 49, 'Adam to sleep - a deep sleep is mentioned (Gen. 2:21), so that he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 251, 9, 49, 'couldn''t even wake up. Then He took one of his ribs, closed it up with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 251, 10, 49, 'flesh and made a woman out of that rib. Now, as soon as God made a woman');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 251, 11, 49, 'out of that rib, when God breathed into Eve, when she got life and her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 251, 12, 49, 'eyes were opened, whom did she see first? Not Adam.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 251, 13, 49, 'She did not even know of the existence of Adam. She thought she was the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 251, 14, 49, 'only human being created. She did not know anything about Adam. Her eyes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 251, 15, 49, 'opened and she saw God, exactly like when Adam was created. Adam was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 251, 16, 49, 'somewhere else in the garden fast asleep. He did not know about her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 251, 17, 49, 'existence, and she did not know about his existence. She met God. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 251, 18, 49, 'was the first person to speak to her and, only much later did God bring');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 251, 19, 49, 'her to Adam. So, what was God trying to teach Eve? The same lesson He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 251, 20, 49, 'was trying to teach Adam. "I must be first in your life. You must have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 251, 21, 49, 'fellowship with me before you fellowship with your husband."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 251, 22, 49, 'Do you understand now God''s plan for an excellent marriage? Adam had to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 251, 23, 49, 'fellowship with God, before he fellowshipped with Eve. Eve had to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 251, 24, 49, 'fellowship with God, before she fellowshipped with Adam. It is all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 251, 25, 49, 'written there. From the beginning this is how God intended marriage to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 251, 26, 49, 'be. When God Himself is between a husband and wife, where each person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 251, 27, 49, 'and the partner in the marriage seek to put the Lord first in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 251, 28, 49, 'personal life, you know what will happen? They will be glued together.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 252, 1, 49, 'God is the greatest binding force in the universe. When He holds two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 252, 2, 49, 'people together, it is impossible for anybody to separate them, not the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 252, 3, 49, 'devil, not demons, not circumstances, not poverty and not even the whole');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 252, 4, 49, 'world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 252, 5, 49, 'When God is not there to hold people together, then people are held');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 252, 6, 49, 'together by other forces. But the other forces are not as strong. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 252, 7, 49, 'don''t know whether you have seen an advertisement for this adhesive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 252, 8, 49, 'called Fevicol . One of the advertisements that I have seen, it is also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 252, 9, 49, 'pictured in some of the bottles of Fevicol , where two things are stuck');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 252, 10, 49, 'together, and on each side an elephant is trying to pull it and they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 252, 11, 49, 'can''t separate it. When a husband and wife are joined together by God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 252, 12, 49, 'it is even greater than that. No elephants can separate them. No demons');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 252, 13, 49, 'can separate them. No human beings can separate them. But they must have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 252, 14, 49, 'God in the middle. God is a greater joiner than Fevicol , or Araldite,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 252, 15, 49, 'or any other superglue. With God in between a husband and a wife, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 252, 16, 49, 'will join you both together in such a way that nothing can separate you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 252, 17, 49, 'So, you have to be very careful not to allow anything to come between');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 252, 18, 49, 'both of you, as husband and wife, or wife and husband, nothing other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 252, 19, 49, 'than God. What is the binding force in many marriages in young people?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 252, 20, 49, 'It is very often good looks. A boy likes a girl because she has got good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 252, 21, 49, 'looks. Now mere good looks are not good enough to hold a marriage for 50');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 252, 22, 49, 'years. Look at these marriages where people marry someone for good looks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 252, 23, 49, 'and within three months they are fighting with each other. It can''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 252, 24, 49, 'hold. We are not against good looks. By all means marry a good-looking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 252, 25, 49, 'girl. But that is not the main factor. It will never hold a marriage');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 252, 26, 49, 'together. What do many girls choose a boy for? - Good job, good family,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 252, 27, 49, 'a lot of money. You think that is going to hold a marriage together?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 252, 28, 49, 'Never! Some boys will marry girls because they get a big dowry. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 253, 1, 49, 'will never hold a marriage together. It is impossible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 253, 2, 49, 'The way God did it from the beginning is the way a marriage is held');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 253, 3, 49, 'together, where the Lord is first, where each person has a relationship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 253, 4, 49, 'with God that is greater than their relationship with each other. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 253, 5, 49, 'other words, if you are a husband, you must not seek to be first in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 253, 6, 49, 'wife''s affection. The Lord must be first in her affections. If you are a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 253, 7, 49, 'wife, the Lord must be first in your husband''s affection, and you must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 253, 8, 49, 'be second. Those who put the Lord first and walk in the light, as the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 253, 9, 49, 'Bible says in 1 John 1:7, "If we walk in the light as God is in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 253, 10, 49, 'light," they will have fellowship with one with another." And the two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 253, 11, 49, 'are held together.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 253, 12, 49, 'Now what are the things that can come between a husband and wife? It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 253, 13, 49, 'could be parents. It says in Genesis 2:24,"A man must leave his father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 253, 14, 49, 'and his mother and cleave to his wife." Then only they can become one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 253, 15, 49, 'flesh. Notice again what that verse saying: you have to leave something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 253, 16, 49, 'and then you can cleave. If you try to cleave without leaving, you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 253, 17, 49, 'never become one. Isn''t that amazing? That is the one commandment given');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 253, 18, 49, 'in scripture for us even before sin came into the world - Leave your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 253, 19, 49, 'father and mother. I want to ask you who are married, have you left your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 253, 20, 49, 'father and mother? I don''t mean physically. By all means care for them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 253, 21, 49, 'take care of them till their dying day. We should do that. We have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 253, 22, 49, 'honour our parents. But don''t let them come between you and your married');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 253, 23, 49, 'life. You must leave them emotionally. They brought you up for so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 253, 24, 49, 'years, and that is good. But now that you are married, you got to leave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 253, 25, 49, 'them. It is because many husbands have not left their emotional');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 253, 26, 49, 'attachment to their parents, there is confusion in their married life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 253, 27, 49, 'Many a wife has not left her emotional attachment to her parents and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 253, 28, 49, 'they are not united to their husbands. This is the tragedy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 254, 1, 49, 'The Lord is not first and there are parents in between, interfering in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 254, 2, 49, 'their life. Sometimes it is a job that is so important for you and comes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 254, 3, 49, 'between marriages. Anything other than God, it may be money, it may be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 254, 4, 49, 'being occupied with so many things, may be your children that come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 254, 5, 49, 'between you as husband and wife. That often happens in India. But it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 254, 6, 49, 'should never be. What is the answer to a happy marriage? Here is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 254, 7, 49, 'first answer. Put the Lord first in every situation, walk in the light,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 254, 8, 49, 'judge yourself and you will find a binding force between you and your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 254, 9, 49, 'marriage partner that nothing can destroy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 254, 10, 50, 'Chapter 50 Responsibilities Of Husband And Wife');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 254, 11, 50, 'We want to continue thinking a little more deeply about God''s plan for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 254, 12, 50, 'an excellent marriage. And if you give careful attention to this study,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 254, 13, 50, 'I believe, it can change your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 254, 14, 50, 'We saw in our last study, that God should be between a husband and wife;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 254, 15, 50, 'only God for them to be bound together throughout their life on earth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 254, 16, 50, 'because God is the greatest binding force in the universe. If anything,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 254, 17, 50, 'else comes in between; money, parents, job, children, there is going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 254, 18, 50, 'be confusion. Should you honour your parents? Definitely! But don''t let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 254, 19, 50, 'them come between you and your marriage partner. Should you take care of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 254, 20, 50, 'your children? Yes, you need to sacrifice for your children, do many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 254, 21, 50, 'things for your children, but don''t love your children more than you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 254, 22, 50, 'love one another. That is not God''s will. Many parents love their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 254, 23, 50, 'children more than they love each other. They disobey God. I am talking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 254, 24, 50, 'about believers here.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 254, 25, 50, 'There is no relationship, spoken of in the entire Bible, as close as the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 254, 26, 50, 'relationship of a husband and wife. You know about the example used in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 254, 27, 50, 'Ephesians Chapter 5 that the husband is the head of the wife, in what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 254, 28, 50, 'way? Not like the head of an organization. Do you know the difference');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 255, 1, 50, 'between the head of an organization and the head of a physical body? The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 255, 2, 50, 'head of an organization may not have any interest in the members in that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 255, 3, 50, 'organization. But the head in your physical body has a very living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 255, 4, 50, 'interest in every part of the physical body, every member. That is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 255, 5, 50, 'will of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 255, 6, 50, 'So the relationship between a husband and wife is pictured, in Ephesians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 255, 7, 50, 'Chapter 5, as, as close and as intimate as the relationship between your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 255, 8, 50, 'physical head and the rest of your body. Can you think of a closer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 255, 9, 50, 'relationship than that? - Your physical head and your physical body.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 255, 10, 50, 'That is the closest, most intimate of relationships one can think of.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 255, 11, 50, 'Even a father and son are not described in the Bible as head and body.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 255, 12, 50, 'Mother and daughter are not described like that. No! Parents and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 255, 13, 50, 'children are not described like that. It is only a husband and wife.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 255, 14, 50, 'That is the closeness with which God wants a husband and wife to live.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 255, 15, 50, 'In other words, you should love one another more than you love every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 255, 16, 50, 'other relationship. If you love your children more, you are destroying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 255, 17, 50, 'your marriage. If you love your parents more, you are destroying your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 255, 18, 50, 'marriage. If you love your job more, you are destroying your marriage.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 255, 19, 50, 'Even if you love your ministry more, you are destroying your marriage.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 255, 20, 50, 'When I said you must put the Lord first, don''t misunderstand that it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 255, 21, 50, 'means you must put the Lord''s work first. No, there is a difference');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 255, 22, 50, 'between the Lord and the Lord''s work. Many people don''t understand that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 255, 23, 50, 'There are people who ignore their wives, saying, ''I am doing the Lord''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 255, 24, 50, 'work.'' What''s the result? Their marriage gets destroyed, and finally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 255, 25, 50, 'their so-called Lord''s work also gets destroyed. That is not God''s will.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 255, 26, 50, 'How should our spiritual life be built?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 255, 27, 50, 'Let me use a picture of a three-storey house. Consider you are building');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 255, 28, 50, 'a three-storey house, a ground floor, first floor, and a second floor,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 256, 1, 50, 'or a 1st storey, 2nd storey, 3rd storey. The first thing you build is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 256, 2, 50, 'the foundation and the foundation is God''s perfect love for us revealed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 256, 3, 50, 'in Jesus Christ. On that foundation we must build. There is no other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 256, 4, 50, 'foundation. On that foundation we, first of all, build the first storey');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 256, 5, 50, 'or the ground floor whichever you call it. The first storey is our own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 256, 6, 50, 'personal walk with God. That means your relationship with God where you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 256, 7, 50, 'walk in the light, you keep your conscience clear, and you listen to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 256, 8, 50, 'voice of the Holy Spirit telling you where you need to cleanse yourself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 256, 9, 50, 'from all filthiness of the flesh and spirit. That is the first storey.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 256, 10, 50, 'Whether you are married or single that is the first storey, you have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 256, 11, 50, 'build that first. Once you build that, or as you are building that, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 256, 12, 50, 'go to the 2nd storey. What is the second storey? The 2nd storey, if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 256, 13, 50, 'are married, is your relationship with your wife. So, after we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 256, 14, 50, 'built a relationship with the Lord, we seek to build a relationship with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 256, 15, 50, 'our wives. That is the 2nd storey, our home relationship. Then we come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 256, 16, 50, 'to the 3rd storey, which is our ministry, the church, for example.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 256, 17, 50, 'If you are an elder in a church, you know what it says as one of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 256, 18, 50, 'qualifications of an elder in 1 Timothy 3 is? He must have a good home.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 256, 19, 50, 'He must be the husband of one wife and he should have brought up his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 256, 20, 50, 'children properly. Why? Read that verse carefully, "If a man cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 256, 21, 50, 'control his own house, how will he control the church?" (1 Tim. 3:5).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 256, 22, 50, 'So, which comes first - House or church? You know that it is very clear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 256, 23, 50, 'from this verse - your house is first. You first control your house then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 256, 24, 50, 'you will be able to control the church. If you can''t control the house,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 256, 25, 50, 'you can''t control the church either. So, the ministry comes after your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 256, 26, 50, 'family. That is God''s word. God comes first, then my home, and then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 256, 27, 50, 'God''s work. Then I have a base on which to do God''s work.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 256, 28, 50, 'This is where the devil has destroyed so many people. He has made them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 257, 1, 50, 'concentrate on the Lord''s work. What is the result? Their children are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 257, 2, 50, 'unconverted, go astray. They fight and quarrel with their wives at home,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 257, 3, 50, 'and they are doing God''s ministry. It is a disgrace. I believe such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 257, 4, 50, 'people should resign from God''s ministry and sit at home, and build a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 257, 5, 50, 'relationship with their wives and their children first. Now I am not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 257, 6, 50, 'saying that your wife has to be spiritual before you serve the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 257, 7, 50, 'There are many people who have served the Lord with unspiritual wives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 257, 8, 50, 'including great men like John Wesley who had thoroughly carnal and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 257, 9, 50, 'probably even an unconverted wife. But as regards to your attitude to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 257, 10, 50, 'your wife, you are in control of. It must be one of perfect love even if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 257, 11, 50, 'she is the most evil person in the world. If your attitude to your wife');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 257, 12, 50, 'is not one of love, you cannot do God''s ministry.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 257, 13, 50, 'Whether you have good relationships or not, of course, is a two-sided');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 257, 14, 50, 'affair, and if there is no cooperation from the other side you may not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 257, 15, 50, 'have a good relationship. That is another thing. But from your side, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 257, 16, 50, 'must always be willing to humble yourself, always be willing to wash her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 257, 17, 50, 'feet. The Bible says that, like Jesus loved the church, the husband must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 257, 18, 50, 'love his wife. What should the husband do? Be willing to wash the wife''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 257, 19, 50, 'feet. In other words, be willing to do dirty jobs for you r wife. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 257, 20, 50, 'is what Jesus did for the church. How many times does Jesus forgive the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 257, 21, 50, 'church - millions and millions of times? How many times should a husband');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 257, 22, 50, 'forgive his wife- millions and millions of times? Infinitely! This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 257, 23, 50, 'what it means to love your wife as Christ loved the church. If you want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 257, 24, 50, 'a happy marriage follow the Maker''s instructions in Ephesians 5:22-33.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 257, 25, 50, 'What about wives? In fact, the command to wives comes before the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 257, 26, 50, 'commands to husbands. If you are a wife, what does God tell you to do?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 257, 27, 50, 'Read carefully. "Be subject to your husband" (Eph. 5:22). Then verse 24');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 257, 28, 50, 'tells you how to be subject. It is very interesting, "As the church is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 258, 1, 50, 'subject to Christ, so also wives ought to be to their husbands in every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 258, 2, 50, 'single thing." How does the church obey Christ, obey the Lord? Not with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 258, 3, 50, 'argument and strife and reluctantly but joyfully in everything. So,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 258, 4, 50, 'unless your husband tells you to do something which is contrary to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 258, 5, 50, 'word of God, in which case you must obey God and not your husband. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 258, 6, 50, 'all other areas a wife should obey her husband. That is the teaching of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 258, 7, 50, 'the word of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 258, 8, 50, 'Now I want to give a warning here. The great danger, even in Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 258, 9, 50, 'families, is that the husbands take a verse like this and address it to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 258, 10, 50, 'the wives and use it as a hammer to hit their wives on the head with.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 258, 11, 50, 'They keep saying, ''See what the Bible says - You must be subject to me.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 258, 12, 50, 'Now note carefully husbands, the Bible does not say, ''husbands get your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 258, 13, 50, 'wives to submit to you.'' No. Your job is only to love your wife as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 258, 14, 50, 'Christ loved the church. That is all. And let me say a word to you wives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 258, 15, 50, 'also. There is no verse in scripture which says, ''wives get your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 258, 16, 50, 'husbands to love you as Christ loved the church.'' But that is how some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 258, 17, 50, 'husbands and wives understand it. They go to a passage like this and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 258, 18, 50, 'husband is reading what the wife should do, instead of reading what he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 258, 19, 50, 'should do. The wife is reading what the husband should do, instead of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 258, 20, 50, 'reading what she should do. Then there is absolute confusion. Just like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 258, 21, 50, 'in the Garden of Eden. Adam began to point the finger at Eve. God said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 258, 22, 50, '(let me paraphrase God''s words), "What is the cause of the problem?"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 258, 23, 50, 'Adam points his finger at his wife and says, "She is the cause of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 258, 24, 50, 'problem." You see, that started at Genesis 3, pointing the finger at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 258, 25, 50, 'wife, and saying this whole problem started with her and then indirectly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 258, 26, 50, 'blaming God; "This is the wife you gave me. What can I do?" So, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 258, 27, 50, 'doesn''t take the blame himself. And then God asked the wife, "What is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 258, 28, 50, 'the cause of the problem?" She pointed her finger at the serpent and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 259, 1, 50, 'said, "That is the cause of the problem, the devil. The devil caused it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 259, 2, 50, 'I mean it is not my fault, the devil did something."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 259, 3, 50, 'I want to tell you dear friends, as long as you are blaming each other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 259, 4, 50, 'and blaming the devil, you will just be thrown out of paradise. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 259, 5, 50, 'what happened to them. God sent them both out of paradise, because they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 259, 6, 50, 'were not willing to take the blame. They sinned. What was Adam''s sin? He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 259, 7, 50, 'didn''t take his place as the head of the home there. When Eve was eating');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 259, 8, 50, 'that fruit, he should have stopped her and said, ''That is wrong.'' But he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 259, 9, 50, 'stood there silently. The first husband was an effeminate husband. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 259, 10, 50, 'couldn''t take his place as the head of his home. When husbands don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 259, 11, 50, 'take their place as the head of the home, there is confusion in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 259, 12, 50, 'home. When a wife does not take her place as the “helper” to her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 259, 13, 50, 'husband, but instead begins to take decisions as the “leader” (as Eve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 259, 14, 50, 'did in Eden), then she opens the door for Satan to bring confusion into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 259, 15, 50, 'her home (as Satan did in Eden).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 259, 16, 50, 'So, we need to stop blaming one another. If you are a husband, say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 259, 17, 50, '''Lord, my duty is not to find out what my wife has to do. My duty is to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 259, 18, 50, 'love her as Christ loved the Church.'' And if you are a wife you need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 259, 19, 50, 'say, ''Lord, my duty is not to find out what my husband has to do but to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 259, 20, 50, 'be subject to him.'' If each of you can do what God wants you to do,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 259, 21, 50, 'instead of being a busy body and finding fault with your partner,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 259, 22, 50, 'saying, ''He is not doing what God has told him to do'', there can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 259, 23, 50, 'peace. There will be continued confusion. Why not start taking the blame');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 259, 24, 50, 'yourselves, humbling yourself from today. And experience that excellent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 259, 25, 50, 'marriage God wants to give you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 259, 26, 51, 'Chapter 51 Bringing Up Godly Children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 259, 27, 51, 'In our last two studies we were considering the Christian home, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 259, 28, 51, 'place which Satan has attacked the most from the days of Adam and Eve,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 260, 1, 51, 'and which is under tremendous attack till today. In our last two studies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 260, 2, 51, 'we considered the relationship between a husband and a wife. In this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 260, 3, 51, 'study we want to continue and consider God''s plan for bringing up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 260, 4, 51, 'children.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 260, 5, 51, 'Children were part of God''s perfect will from the time He created man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 260, 6, 51, 'and woman. When God created Adam and Eve, the very first words that He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 260, 7, 51, 'spoke to Adam and Eve, mentioned in Genesis 1:28 were, "Be fruitful and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 260, 8, 51, 'multiply, and fill the earth and subdue it." They were to have physical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 260, 9, 51, 'relationship with each other and thereby produce children. That was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 260, 10, 51, 'God''s will. Again, in the last book of the Old Testament (Malachi), in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 260, 11, 51, 'the last page of the Old Testament, we see an emphasis on that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 260, 12, 51, 'Why did God tell Adam and Eve to be fruitful? Their children were to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 260, 13, 51, 'reflect God''s image just like Adam and Eve were to reflect God''s image.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 260, 14, 51, 'God created Adam and Eve that they might reflect His image. Adam could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 260, 15, 51, 'not do it alone. Eve could not do it alone. Together they were to show');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 260, 16, 51, 'the character and the nature of God. There are things a man can show of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 260, 17, 51, 'God''s nature and there are things a woman can show God''s nature.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 260, 18, 51, 'Together there would be a balance. And their children were to carry on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 260, 19, 51, 'fulfilling that ministry in the next generation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 260, 20, 51, 'In Malachi 2:14, 15, the Lord mentions two important things. In the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 260, 21, 51, 'middle of verse 14 we read, "The Lord has been a witness between you and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 260, 22, 51, 'the wife of your youth whom you have dealt treacherously though she is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 260, 23, 51, 'your companion and your wife by covenant." The first thing He speaks to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 260, 24, 51, 'you, in the last page of the Old Testament, is your relationship with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 260, 25, 51, 'your wife - the wife of your youth! Why does He emphasize that? Maybe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 260, 26, 51, 'you are both 50-60 years old today. But when you chose her, she was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 260, 27, 51, 'young attractive person in your eyes. And to you wife, your husband was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 260, 28, 51, 'a young attractive man in your eyes. But you have dealt treacherously');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 261, 1, 51, 'with each other. You have not been faithful even though she is your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 261, 2, 51, 'companion and your wife by covenant.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 261, 3, 51, 'Do you know that marriage is a covenant? You promised to be faithful to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 261, 4, 51, 'her. She is meant to be your companion, your friend. How many of you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 261, 5, 51, 'husbands can honestly say that your wife is your best friend? She should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 261, 6, 51, 'be. That is what God says in the last page of the Old Testament. And how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 261, 7, 51, 'many of you can say, ''I have not dealt treacherously with her?'' And if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 261, 8, 51, 'you have, that you have repented and you seek to be faithful to her now.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 261, 9, 51, 'This is God''s will. Then He goes on, in the next verse (Mal. 2:15), to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 261, 10, 51, 'say, "And what was God seeking in uniting you as husband and wife?" I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 261, 11, 51, 'paraphrasing the words: He was seeking a godly offspring. He was seeking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 261, 12, 51, 'godly children that in the next generation they would transmit God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 261, 13, 51, 'image to the next generation. Not just offspring, but a godly seed to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 261, 14, 51, 'transmit God''s image to the next generation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 261, 15, 51, 'It is easy to have children, but to bring up children in a godly way,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 261, 16, 51, 'that is a task of a lifetime. It requires sacrifice. It requires');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 261, 17, 51, 'sincerity, wholeheartedness in our life to God. Just like God is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 261, 18, 51, 'binding force that holds husband and wife together, it is only with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 261, 19, 51, 'God''s power that we will be able to bring up our children in a godly way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 261, 20, 51, 'in this evil generation. The way your children have turned out is an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 261, 21, 51, 'indication of whether you have lived in a godly way or not in your own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 261, 22, 51, 'home. Do you know what the Bible says about the way children turn out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 261, 23, 51, 'later on in life? It says in Proverbs 22:6, "Train up a child in the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 261, 24, 51, 'he should go and even when he is old, he will not depart from it." Now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 261, 25, 51, 'either that is the stupid opinion of a man or it is the inspired word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 261, 26, 51, 'God. What do you think it is? If you accept this as the inspired words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 261, 27, 51, 'by God, inspired by the Holy Spirit, then listen to it. If you do the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 261, 28, 51, 'first part of that verse, the second part will be automatic. What is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 262, 1, 51, 'that?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 262, 2, 51, 'If you train up your children in the way you want them to go. It doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 262, 3, 51, 'say a spiritual way. No. It doesn''t say if you train up a child in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 262, 4, 51, 'godly way. No. Maybe you want your children to make money in the world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 262, 5, 51, 'Fine, train up a child in the way you want them to go, when he is old,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 262, 6, 51, 'he will not depart from it. Why are your children running after money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 262, 7, 51, 'today? Because you have trained them up in that way! When they are old,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 262, 8, 51, 'they will not depart from it. Why are your children seeking for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 262, 9, 51, 'greatness in the world? Because that is what you wanted for them! He may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 262, 10, 51, 'speak high-sounding spiritual language, and be an elder in a church, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 262, 11, 51, 'many, many things like that. But if your children are worldly and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 262, 12, 51, 'wayward and unconverted, dear parents, I don''t want to condemn you, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 262, 13, 51, 'I would encourage you to take the blame instead of blaming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 262, 14, 51, 'circumstances, people, etc. Humble yourself and say, ''Lord, it is my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 262, 15, 51, 'fault that my children are not converted. It is my fault that my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 262, 16, 51, 'children are not following the Lord.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 262, 17, 51, 'When you take the blame, God can help you, even if you are being a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 262, 18, 51, 'failure. Do you know that God can help you, even if your children have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 262, 19, 51, 'left your home? They have gone away and you recognize today that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 262, 20, 51, 'failed miserably in the way you brought them up, and as a result today');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 262, 21, 51, 'they are unconverted?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 262, 22, 51, 'Now, when I say that they should be living for God, I don''t mean they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 262, 23, 51, 'should become full-time workers or preachers or evangelists or pastors.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 262, 24, 51, 'No. That is a matter of calling. God doesn''t call everybody to full-time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 262, 25, 51, 'Christian work. But they should be born again; they should be disciples');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 262, 26, 51, 'of Jesus. 99.9% of people are called to work for the Lord in a secular');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 262, 27, 51, 'job, but they should all be disciples of Jesus, every single one of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 262, 28, 51, 'them. So we are not to train up our children to become full-time workers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 263, 1, 51, 'or pastors or preachers or evangelist or missionaries. No, that is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 263, 2, 51, 'primary. We train them up to do the will of God; to be disciples of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 263, 3, 51, 'Jesus in whatever God calls them to do. If God calls them to be an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 263, 4, 51, 'evangelist, that is fine. But they must be disciples irrespective of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 263, 5, 51, 'whether they are nurses or teachers or engineers or missionaries or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 263, 6, 51, 'evangelist or pastors, or whatever it is. They must be wholehearted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 263, 7, 51, 'disciples of Jesus. Whether they are teachers or clerks or peons doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 263, 8, 51, 'make a difference. They must be wholehearted disciples of Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 263, 9, 51, 'And that is what we have to train them up in, from earliest childhood,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 263, 10, 51, 'to show them that the only thing worth living for in this world is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 263, 11, 51, 'kingdom of God and His righteousness. The children must see this in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 263, 12, 51, 'their parents. They must see the way their parents live. They must see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 263, 13, 51, 'what their parents live for. If children see that you, as parents, have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 263, 14, 51, 'lived for money, even though you go to some church and speak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 263, 15, 51, 'high-sounding spiritual things over there, don''t blame your children if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 263, 16, 51, 'they grow up doing what they saw you doing at home. If they saw that,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 263, 17, 51, 'even though you preached wonderful things in the church on Sundays and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 263, 18, 51, 'lived as hypocrites at home with other standards, you can''t blame your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 263, 19, 51, 'children for going astray. Train up a child in the way he should go and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 263, 20, 51, 'when he is old, he will not depart from it. I believe that is the word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 263, 21, 51, 'of God. It can work for the good of the children or for the bad of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 263, 22, 51, 'children depending on how you bring them up.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 263, 23, 51, 'Why do you think Judas Iscariot went astray? Was it because he was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 263, 24, 51, 'dedicated to the Lord as a little baby? He was probably taken to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 263, 25, 51, 'temple exactly like Jesus was taken to the temple and dedicated to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 263, 26, 51, 'Lord. But it is quite likely that, after dedicating him to the Lord, his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 263, 27, 51, 'parents brought him up for the world. Maybe when Judas Iscariot did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 263, 28, 51, 'little wrong things as a child, such as him bringing back from school');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 264, 1, 51, 'somebody else''s pencil or rubber or something like that and his parents');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 264, 2, 51, 'just ignored it. When you ignore the little thefts and the little lies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 264, 3, 51, 'that your children say, you are training them to be thieves and liars');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 264, 4, 51, 'when they grow up. Even a small thing!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 264, 5, 51, 'Supposing you see your child come home one day from a kindergarten class');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 264, 6, 51, 'with a pencil that you never gave him. And you ask him, ''How did you get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 264, 7, 51, 'this pencil?'' Suppose he replies, ''Well somebody stole my pencil, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 264, 8, 51, 'don''t know who it was. So, I found somebody else''s pencil and I took it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 264, 9, 51, 'Then if you gave him the impression that he is a smart boy, you trained');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 264, 10, 51, 'him to be a Judas Iscariot when he grows up. It starts with a small');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 264, 11, 51, 'pencil but it may end with robbing a bank. What do you need to tell that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 264, 12, 51, 'child at that time? You need to tell that child, ''If somebody else robs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 264, 13, 51, 'your pencil, it doesn''t mean you can rob somebody else''s. Tomorrow , go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 264, 14, 51, 'and give it back to the teacher or to the person to whom it belongs to,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 264, 15, 51, 'and say I am sorry I took this.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 264, 16, 51, 'My dear friends, very many times, parents are responsible for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 264, 17, 51, 'godless way in which children grow up. Do you realize that God wants you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 264, 18, 51, 'to bring up godly offspring? The responsibility primarily comes upon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 264, 19, 51, 'fathers. We read in Ephesians 6:4, "Fathers, bring up your children in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 264, 20, 51, 'the discipline and instruction of the Lord." There are two things we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 264, 21, 51, 'need to give to our children: instruction and discipline. Instruction in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 264, 22, 51, 'the Lord does not mean just the stories of Joseph, and David, and Moses.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 264, 23, 51, 'That is good. But at the same time teach the principles of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 264, 24, 51, 'righteousness, of honouring parents, honouring and speaking respectfully');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 264, 25, 51, 'to older people. Who is going to teach children all these? Who is going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 264, 26, 51, 'to teach little girls’ modesty of dress and behaviour? Parents, if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 264, 27, 51, 'don''t teach your little girls principles of modesty and behaviour, they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 264, 28, 51, 'are going to pick up practices from the television screen and from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 265, 1, 51, 'pictures of the film stars they see.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 265, 2, 51, 'Take these responsibilities seriously from today. If you have failed and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 265, 3, 51, 'your children are grown up, repent. Take the blame and ask the Lord to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 265, 4, 51, 'change them even today. If fortunately, your children are still with you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 265, 5, 51, 'at home, then say, ''Lord, give me grace to bring them up in a godly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 265, 6, 51, 'way.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 265, 7, 52, 'Chapter 52 Responsibilities Of Parents And Children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 265, 8, 52, 'We want to continue thinking about the Christian home that we have been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 265, 9, 52, 'looking at in the last three studies. In the first 2 studies, we thought');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 265, 10, 52, 'about husband-wife relationships and in our last study, we thought about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 265, 11, 52, 'bringing up children. This is a very important area and we need to think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 265, 12, 52, 'about it a little more today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 265, 13, 52, 'Let us now look at the one commandment that God gives to children. Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 265, 14, 52, 'you know that God gave Adam and Eve only one commandment? You all know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 265, 15, 52, 'about the Ten Commandments that Moses gave to the Israelites. But God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 265, 16, 52, 'gave Adam and Eve only one commandment and they disobeyed that one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 265, 17, 52, 'commandment. As a result, they brought chaos into the world, into their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 265, 18, 52, 'home, into their mutual relationships, and the first child that was born');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 265, 19, 52, 'to them grew up to be a murderer, killing their second child. It was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 265, 20, 52, 'tragic. In the same way, we find that God has given only one commandment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 265, 21, 52, 'for children and has not made it difficult. He has not given children 10');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 265, 22, 52, 'commandments but just one. We read in Ephesians 6:1-3 what that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 265, 23, 52, 'commandment was. It was given in the Old Testament as part of the Ten');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 265, 24, 52, 'Commandments. The 5th commandment, "Honour your father and your mother."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 265, 25, 52, 'It says here in Ephesians 6:2 that, this is the first commandment that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 265, 26, 52, 'God gave with a promise. The promise was that "It may be well with you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 265, 27, 52, 'and that you may live long on the earth."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 265, 28, 52, 'I want to speak to parents first. I want to ask you parents; do you want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 266, 1, 52, 'it to go well with your children? Do you want your children to live long');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 266, 2, 52, 'on the earth? Or do you want your children''s life to be shortened? Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 266, 3, 52, 'you want it to go badly with your children? Now, it is not talking about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 266, 4, 52, 'your children being intelligent, or healthy, or capable, or rich, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 266, 5, 52, 'great, or any such thing. When it says, ''It will go well with them,'' it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 266, 6, 52, 'means that it will go well spiritually. Even if they work as peons in an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 266, 7, 52, 'office or as corporation sweepers, it doesn''t matter. If they are godly,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 266, 8, 52, 'they will be great in God''s eyes. The point is not about their earthly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 266, 9, 52, 'position. The point is that it goes well with them spiritually.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 266, 10, 52, 'What does it mean that they will live long on the earth? Live up to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 266, 11, 52, 'age of 100? No, Jesus lived only up to 33. To live long, in New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 266, 12, 52, 'Testament terms, means to complete God''s plan for their lives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 266, 13, 52, 'irrespective of whether they die at 20 or 60 or 100. The point is to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 266, 14, 52, 'complete God''s plan for their lives before they leave the earth, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 266, 15, 52, 'God has a specific plan for your children. Please remember that parents,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 266, 16, 52, 'and don''t destroy that plan by putting other values into the heads of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 266, 17, 52, 'your children. That they think other things are more important than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 266, 18, 52, 'God''s Kingdom and His righteousness. Uprightness, straightforwardness,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 266, 19, 52, 'honesty, these are far more important than anything on this earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 266, 20, 52, 'So, fathers are told in Ephesian 6:4, "Don''t provoke your children to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 266, 21, 52, 'anger." Don''t keep on irritating them by nagging them, and scolding them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 266, 22, 52, 'day and night, but bring them up in the discipline and instructions of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 266, 23, 52, 'the Lord. Instruct them, first of all, by teaching them scriptural');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 266, 24, 52, 'principles and secondly, by disciplining them. We need to punish our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 266, 25, 52, 'children because the Bible says in Proverbs 22:15, "Foolishness is bound');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 266, 26, 52, 'up in the heart of a child, but the rod of discipline will remove it far');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 266, 27, 52, 'from him." Every child is born into the world with foolishness bound up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 266, 28, 52, 'in his heart. It doesn''t matter whose child it is. Whether it is an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 267, 1, 52, 'atheist child, or a God-fearing Christian couple''s child, they both are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 267, 2, 52, 'born with the same flesh and the same ''old man'' that has a tendency to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 267, 3, 52, 'sin; foolishness is bound up in their heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 267, 4, 52, 'How can this atheist''s child and this God-fearing couple''s child have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 267, 5, 52, 'that foolishness driven out of their heart? Only one way - the rod of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 267, 6, 52, 'discipline! There is no other way. Parents who do not use the rod are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 267, 7, 52, 'not going to bring up their children in a godly way. We need to use the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 267, 8, 52, 'rod of discipline, because we want to drive out that foolishness. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 267, 9, 52, 'Bible makes it very clear that the rod of discipline will drive it far');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 267, 10, 52, 'away. The foolishness is in the heart, but the rod is applied to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 267, 11, 52, 'bottom and it drives out the foolishness from the heart. This is God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 267, 12, 52, 'way. You might as well follow it instead of the teachings of modern');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 267, 13, 52, 'psychologists.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 267, 14, 52, 'With all these techniques that modern psychologists teach, what is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 267, 15, 52, 'result? See what is happening in the western world today. Those children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 267, 16, 52, 'grow up rebelling against their parents with no respect for their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 267, 17, 52, 'parents. This is the result of modern psychology and ignoring the Word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 267, 18, 52, 'of God. Go and see the homes where people have followed the simple');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 267, 19, 52, 'old-fashion teaching of proverbs 22:15 and see the difference. The Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 267, 20, 52, 'says that you can save your child fr o m hell by using the rod; don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 267, 21, 52, 'spare him, it says, even if he cries. What should we use the rod for? -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 267, 22, 52, 'When they don''t obey that one commandment to honour their parents. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 267, 23, 52, 'know that that is the most important thing for children to learn.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 267, 24, 52, 'If your children break something expensive, maybe you have an expensive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 267, 25, 52, 'dish or vase, or something like that, made of China, and they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 267, 26, 52, 'accidentally dropped it and it broke, are you going to punish them for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 267, 27, 52, 'that? That is foolish. Now, if they do it in rebellion and anger, they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 267, 28, 52, 'certainly need to be punished, but not if they do it accidentally. Your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 268, 1, 52, 'loss may be great in terms of money, but it is no use punishing your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 268, 2, 52, 'children for what they did accidentally. Don''t you and I do things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 268, 3, 52, 'accidentally and make mistakes? What do we need to teach our children? -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 268, 4, 52, 'The one commandment that God gave children - "Honour your father and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 268, 5, 52, 'mother." That means to respect them first of all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 268, 6, 52, 'If you are a son or a daughter reading this article, let me tell you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 268, 7, 52, 'this - If you want it to go well with you, and if you want to fulfil the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 268, 8, 52, 'length of days that God has appointed for you on the earth, honour your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 268, 9, 52, 'father and mother. Even if you are 75 years old and your parents are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 268, 10, 52, 'still alive, honour them. Honour them till you die. You don''t have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 268, 11, 52, 'obey them once you leave your home to set up your own home and you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 268, 12, 52, 'earning your own living. Jesus obeyed Joseph and Mary as long as He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 268, 13, 52, 'lived in that home. The moment He left that home, after His baptism, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 268, 14, 52, 'honoured His mother but did not obey her. Once His mother came and told');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 268, 15, 52, 'Him about the lack of wine at the wedding in Cana. He said, "Woman, what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 268, 16, 52, 'have I got to do with you? Don''t interfere in My ministry." Jesus didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 268, 17, 52, 'disobey the scripture, but He honoured His mother. He cared for her when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 268, 18, 52, 'He was hanging on the cross by asking John to take care of her, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 268, 19, 52, 'provide a home for her. But He did not listen to her once He left the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 268, 20, 52, 'home.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 268, 21, 52, 'As long as you are living at home under your parents'' authority, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 268, 22, 52, 'command for you is to obey your parents. Do what they say, unless they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 268, 23, 52, 'tell you to disobey the word of God in some area. Then you have to obey');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 268, 24, 52, 'God and say, ''We have to obey God rather than man,'' just like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 268, 25, 52, 'apostle Peter said in Acts 5:29-32. But in every other area you must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 268, 26, 52, 'obey them. Honouring them must be true throughout your life, even when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 268, 27, 52, 'you leave your home; respecting them, never speaking evil about them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 268, 28, 52, 'You may see many weaknesses in your parents, hide them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 269, 1, 52, 'Do you know why Noah''s son Ham was cursed? When he saw his father''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 269, 2, 52, 'nakedness, instead of hiding it, he went and spoke to others about it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 269, 3, 52, 'Do you speak about your father''s weaknesses which you have seen at home');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 269, 4, 52, 'or your mother''s weaknesses? There will be curse on you, like there was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 269, 5, 52, 'on Ham. Get rid of that habit. Why should you expose your father ’ s or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 269, 6, 52, 'mother ’ s weakness? If you want, pray for them, but keep it hidden,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 269, 7, 52, 'unless you are seeking advice from some godly brother to whom you go and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 269, 8, 52, 'share. If there is a problem you are facing then it is all right,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 269, 9, 52, 'because that godly brother may need to know your problem in order to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 269, 10, 52, 'help you. That is the only situation in which you should reveal the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 269, 11, 52, 'your father or mother is behaving, which may not be godly. But to talk');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 269, 12, 52, 'about them as gossip will bring the judgment of God upon your life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 269, 13, 52, 'because you are not honouring them. This is so important.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 269, 14, 52, 'It is so important, for us as parents, to teach our children obedience');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 269, 15, 52, 'and to break their stubborn will when they are young, so that they learn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 269, 16, 52, 'to obey us as their parents. That is how we prepare them to obey God one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 269, 17, 52, 'day, in the future. But, if you don''t break their will when they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 269, 18, 52, 'young, they will never be able to obey God later on in life. It will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 269, 19, 52, 'have to be a miracle. It does happen in some cases, because God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 269, 20, 52, 'great. But it is our responsibility, as parents, to do it early in life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 269, 21, 52, 'When shall we start punishing them and correcting them? - As soon as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 269, 22, 52, 'they are able to understand. If they can understand what you are saying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 269, 23, 52, 'when they are 1 year old or 1 and 1/2 years old, then that is the time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 269, 24, 52, 'to start punishing them, if they disobey. The earlier you start the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 269, 25, 52, 'sooner you can finish. By the time the child is 13 years or so old,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 269, 26, 52, 'there should be no more need to use the rod on that child anymore, if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 269, 27, 52, 'you started when the child was say about one year old, and if you did it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 269, 28, 52, 'in the fear of God and wholeheartedly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 270, 1, 52, 'But, if you were careless, then you have a problem on your hand from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 270, 2, 52, 'your child when he becomes a teenager. He does not know how to speak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 270, 3, 52, 'respectfully. He does not know how to obey you. He doesn''t know how to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 270, 4, 52, 'obey God. This is the tragedy in many Christian homes. What shall we do?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 270, 5, 52, 'Repent, say, ''Lord, have mercy on us.'' Those, whose children are still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 270, 6, 52, 'in their early stages, not yet teenagers, do what the scripture says.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 270, 7, 52, 'Bring them up in the fear of God. Teach them to fear God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 270, 8, 52, 'The greatest thing you can do, as husband and wife, is to be united.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 270, 9, 52, 'Don''t be divided in the punishment of your children. Be united in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 270, 10, 52, 'following scripture. When husband and wife are divided, it brings chaos');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 270, 11, 52, 'into the home. It opens the door for the devil to come right in and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 270, 12, 52, 'destroy your children. Be united and let the devil find no gap between');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 270, 13, 52, 'you, to come through and attack your children. Be a good example. Don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 270, 14, 52, 'tell your children to do what you can''t do yourself. The unity of father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 270, 15, 52, 'and mother and being a good example is very, very important. From such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 270, 16, 52, 'life, God will be able to lead your children in godly paths.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 270, 17, 52, 'One last thing: parents pray for your children by name every day, every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 270, 18, 52, 'single one of them. All through your life pray for your children by name');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 270, 19, 52, 'every single day that they will grow up in a godly way. Then God''s heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 270, 20, 52, 'will be satisfied, as our homes become godly examples and a light in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 270, 21, 52, 'midst of a dark world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 270, 22, 53, 'Chapter 53 Not Praying As Hypocrites Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 270, 23, 53, 'Here are some of the most important things that Jesus taught concerning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 270, 24, 53, 'communicating with God. You know, we were created to talk to God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 270, 25, 53, 'hear God talk to us. You would not like to have a child that is both');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 270, 26, 53, 'deaf and dumb. Nobody would like to have such a child, who doesn''t speak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 270, 27, 53, 'and cannot hear. The Bible says that we are made in the likeness of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 270, 28, 53, 'and the same desire that we have, as fathers and mothers for our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 271, 1, 53, 'children, God also has in a much greater measure. He does not want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 271, 2, 53, 'have children that are deaf and dumb - that can''t hear what He is saying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 271, 3, 53, 'and that never speak to Him. Are you one of those deaf and dumb');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 271, 4, 53, 'Christians who never speak to your Father ? Who never hears what the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 271, 5, 53, 'Father has to say to you? Well, I want to say, if you are, you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 271, 6, 53, 'missed a great deal of a Christian life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 271, 7, 53, 'God doesn''t force us to listen to Him or to speak to Him, just like we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 271, 8, 53, 'don''t force our children to speak to us. We are delighted when they on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 271, 9, 53, 'their own are eager to speak to us. So, what the Bible calls prayer is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 271, 10, 53, 'not a ritual. It is not something that we perform by repeating certain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 271, 11, 53, 'things to God. It is certainly not something like a mantra. Far from it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 271, 12, 53, 'it is a child speaking to a father. In the gospel of Matthew 6:5, Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 271, 13, 53, 'was telling His disciples how they should pray and how they should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 271, 14, 53, 'communicate with God. He said, when you pray, the important thing is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 271, 15, 53, 'the content of your prayer as much as the state of your heart. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 271, 16, 53, 'why Jesus didn''t place an emphasis on certain words to be said, instead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 271, 17, 53, 'He said, make sure that you don''t pray like the hypocrites.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 271, 18, 53, 'Now the word hypocrite means actor. You know an actor is one who gets on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 271, 19, 53, 'the stage and pretends to be somebody which he is not in real life. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 271, 20, 53, 'real life he may be a drunkard, but on the stage, he can act like a holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 271, 21, 53, 'man. There are a lot of religious hypocrites like that. Their stage is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 271, 22, 53, 'the church meeting room or hall. When they come to the church meeting on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 271, 23, 53, 'Sunday, they are dressed up to act as holy people. The whole thing is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 271, 24, 53, 'drama. They pray, they preach, they do so many things, but when they go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 271, 25, 53, 'back from that stage, which is the church and the meeting hall, they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 271, 26, 53, 'become their own selves again. They live the same old lives they lived');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 271, 27, 53, 'before. Just like, if you went to the house of an actor and you discover');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 271, 28, 53, 'that he is not behaving in the same way in his house like he behaved on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 272, 1, 53, 'the stage, you are not surprised, because you know that he was acting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 272, 2, 53, 'there and here he is a real person. That is how it is with a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 272, 3, 53, 'Christians. In the church they are acting; they are singing songs of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 272, 4, 53, 'great devotion to God which they don''t really mean in their life. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 272, 5, 53, 'they come home, they are their real person. It is that type of thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 272, 6, 53, 'which Jesus condemned the most.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 272, 7, 53, 'You and I would think that the greatest sins are murder, adultery,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 272, 8, 53, 'theft, etc., but Jesus placed another sin on top of all of these and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 272, 9, 53, 'that was hypocrisy - acting, pretending to be holy when you are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 272, 10, 53, 'really holy. If you read the teaching of Jesus, in the gospels, you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 272, 11, 53, 'find that He condemned this type of religious acting more than He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 272, 12, 53, 'condemned adultery, or murder, or anything else. We read in the gospels');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 272, 13, 53, 'of women who were adulteress, whom Jesus didn''t condemn. They were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 272, 14, 53, 'repentant and Jesus saved them. There was a murderer hanging next to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 272, 15, 53, 'Jesus, who got saved and went to heaven, because he repented. You will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 272, 16, 53, 'never find Jesus condemning the murderers because they already know it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 272, 17, 53, 'is wrong and everybody in the world know s it is wrong. Not that those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 272, 18, 53, 'things are not sins, but they are so obvious that everybody knows it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 272, 19, 53, 'wrong.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 272, 20, 53, 'Why did Jesus condemn the hypocrites? - Because they were giving people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 272, 21, 53, 'the impression that they were very holy when they were not. That is what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 272, 22, 53, 'Jesus hated and detested and spoke against. He called such people vipers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 272, 23, 53, 'and people who are ready to go to hell. To whom did Jesus condemn to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 272, 24, 53, 'hell, first of all? Not the murderers, prostitutes and thieves, but the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 272, 25, 53, 'hypocrites and we could say today, the people who go to church and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 272, 26, 53, 'pretend so holy, but don''t live at home the way they act when they go to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 272, 27, 53, 'church. Here (Matthew 6), Jesus speaks about hypocrites - actors in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 272, 28, 53, 'relation to praying. So , He tells His disciples, ''Before I tell you how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 273, 1, 53, 'to pray, you need to learn how you should not pray, because, even if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 273, 2, 53, 'say the right words, if your heart''s attitude is like that of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 273, 3, 53, 'hypocrite''s, God will not hear you.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 273, 4, 53, 'Prayer is like a telephone call. When you dial a number, you wait until');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 273, 5, 53, 'the other person has heard you. That means he picks up the phone and you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 273, 6, 53, 'make sure he can hear and only then you speak. In the same way, when we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 273, 7, 53, 'pray to God, that is when we talk to God, it is exactly like talking on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 273, 8, 53, 'a telephone. The first thing you have to be sure of is that God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 273, 9, 53, 'listening - that He can hear you. Because, if He is not hearing you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 273, 10, 53, 'what is the use of speaking? What is the use of speaking on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 273, 11, 53, 'telephone if there is nobody at the other end of the line? Have you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 273, 12, 53, 'thought of that? Do you ever think that prayer is like speaking on a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 273, 13, 53, 'telephone? In a telephone call, you speak to a human being, in prayer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 273, 14, 53, 'you talk to God. In a telephone call, you listen to what the other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 273, 15, 53, 'person is saying to you and in prayer you should be listening to what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 273, 16, 53, 'God is saying to you as well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 273, 17, 53, 'For many people prayer is only talking. Usually it is not even talking,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 273, 18, 53, 'it is just asking God to give you this and give you that, and give your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 273, 19, 53, 'family this and give your family that. That ’ s it. Just like a long');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 273, 20, 53, 'shopping list. You go to the market with a shopping list that your wife');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 273, 21, 53, 'has given to buy, a list of things. Similarly, you go to God with a list');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 273, 22, 53, 'and say, ''Lord, give all of this to me.'' That is not really prayer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 273, 23, 53, 'What would you think of a child who only wants to talk to his father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 273, 24, 53, 'when he wants to get something from him? ''Now buy me a chocolate, or buy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 273, 25, 53, 'me this, or buy me that, or get me that.'' That is the only time the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 273, 26, 53, 'child wants to talk to his father. Would you be happy with such a child?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 273, 27, 53, 'As soon as the child comes to you, you know he is asking for something.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 273, 28, 53, 'He is not interested in any other conversation with you, neither is he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 274, 1, 53, 'interested in listening to you. He just wants to ask you for something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 274, 2, 53, 'and if you give that to him, he is happy. A lot of Christians are like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 274, 3, 53, 'that. I want to say that, just like you would not like to have a child');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 274, 4, 53, 'like that, God is not happy with His children who are like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 274, 5, 53, 'So prayer is more than just asking, it is communicating. It is talking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 274, 6, 53, 'and listening to God and enjoying your time together. For many people,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 274, 7, 53, 'prayer is a boring thing, because they have not understood what it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 274, 8, 53, 'really is. So, if we take what Jesus spoke in this passage seriously, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 274, 9, 53, 'can change our whole lives. The first thing he said is, "Don''t act".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 274, 10, 53, 'When you come to pray, don''t pray in order to be seen by men. Instead,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 274, 11, 53, 'He said, "When you pray, go into your inner room and when you shut your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 274, 12, 53, 'door, pray to you Father who is in secret and your Father who''s in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 274, 13, 53, 'secret will repay you" (Mat. 6:6).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 274, 14, 53, 'So the first thing He said, that religious actors would do is, that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 274, 15, 53, 'want to show other people how holy they are. One way they do that is by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 274, 16, 53, 'letting other people know that they are praying a lot. Do you let other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 274, 17, 53, 'people know that you are praying a lot? There are some people who are so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 274, 18, 53, 'shy that they never pray in public. That is one extreme. You will find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 274, 19, 53, 'others at the other extreme, who always want to pray long boring prayers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 274, 20, 53, 'in public. Who are they praying to? They are not praying to God. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 274, 21, 53, 'are praying to impress all the other people in the meeting.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 274, 22, 53, 'It will be a good thing, if you ask yourself next time, or any time you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 274, 23, 53, 'pray in public, whether that is exactly what you pray in private also.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 274, 24, 53, 'For example, supposing you are praying in public, ''Oh God, I want a lot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 274, 25, 53, 'of people to be converted and to have faith in You in this country and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 274, 26, 53, 'pray for the millions of people in India who need to hear the gospel''.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 274, 27, 53, 'Ask yourself, do you have that same burden of prayer when you are all by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 274, 28, 53, 'yourself in your room or do you pray those things only when you are in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 275, 1, 53, 'public, in a meeting, to impress other people that you are a very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 275, 2, 53, 'spiritual person? That is acting.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 275, 3, 53, 'Acting is praying in the presence of others as though you have a great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 275, 4, 53, 'burden but not really having that burden in your heart. It could be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 275, 5, 53, 'praying in very flowery impressive language and trying to show off to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 275, 6, 53, 'others what a wonderful prayer you make. God is not impressed at all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 275, 7, 53, 'These are the areas in which we can pray only for men to hear. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 275, 8, 53, 'have done that before (if we are honest, we all have to admit to having');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 275, 9, 53, 'done it), go home from such a meeting and say, ''Lord forgive me, I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 275, 10, 53, 'sinned. My prayer was a sinful prayer because I offered it to man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 275, 11, 53, 'Please forgive me''. If you do that, you will find that next time you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 275, 12, 53, 'pray more sincerely to God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 275, 13, 54, 'Chapter 54 Not Praying With Meaningless Repetition');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 275, 14, 54, 'One of the most important things in the life of a Christian is talking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 275, 15, 54, 'to God - prayer. Have you ever thought about that? One of the greatest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 275, 16, 54, 'privileges, we have, is that we can talk to God just like we talk to any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 275, 17, 54, 'other man, and we can hear Him talk to us as well. We want to continue');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 275, 18, 54, 'looking at what Jesus spoke and taught His disciples about speaking to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 275, 19, 54, 'God, what we call prayer, communicating with God, talking to Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 275, 20, 54, 'We saw in the last study that the most important thing about prayer is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 275, 21, 54, 'not the words, but the attitude of heart with which we approach God .');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 275, 22, 54, 'The most important thing, Jesus said in this connection, was that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 275, 23, 54, 'should not act; we should not pray in order to impress men. We seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 275, 24, 54, 'honour either from God or from men. For example, if you pray and you let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 275, 25, 54, 'other people know that you are a great man or woman of prayer, or you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 275, 26, 54, 'are always talking about the time you spend in prayer, the hours and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 275, 27, 54, 'days you spend in praying and fasting and things like that, the chances');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 275, 28, 54, 'are that you will not get any answer to your prayers. Did you know that?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 276, 1, 54, 'You can pray and fast for days and get no answer from God for any of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 276, 2, 54, 'those prayers, if you did it to show men. You talk about it afterwards');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 276, 3, 54, 'to other people saying, ''You know I was praying and fasting here for 3');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 276, 4, 54, 'days or 7 days before God.'' Do you know what Jesus said about that in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 276, 5, 54, 'Matthew 6:5? He said about such people that they already have their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 276, 6, 54, 'reward in full. What is their reward? They wanted the honour of men that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 276, 7, 54, 'they are very godly men and women, and they got that reputation from men');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 276, 8, 54, 'as their reward. Men began to think that they are very godly people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 276, 9, 54, 'Jesus said that that is what they wanted and that is what they got. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 276, 10, 54, 'are not going to get anything from God; there will be no reward from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 276, 11, 54, 'heaven. All those prayers and fasting was wasted.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 276, 12, 54, 'Now on the other hand, here is another person who doesn''t let anyone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 276, 13, 54, 'know about his prayer life, it is all in secret; he shuts the room and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 276, 14, 54, 'prays. Maybe his wife or those living at home know, but he tries his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 276, 15, 54, 'best to conceal it, hide it from as many people as possible. He never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 276, 16, 54, 'talks about his prayer life with anyone. He prays to the Father in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 276, 17, 54, 'secret. He doesn''t get any reward from people, because nobody knows');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 276, 18, 54, 'anything about his praying. But he gets a full reward from God, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 276, 19, 54, 'God sees him in secret. Now my question to you, dear friends, is which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 276, 20, 54, 'of these two types of people do you want to be? Do you want a reward');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 276, 21, 54, 'from men, where you get a reputation as a godly man or a godly woman or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 276, 22, 54, 'a man of prayer or a woman of prayer? Or, do you want God to approve of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 276, 23, 54, 'your life and answer your prayer and bless you? He will reward you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 276, 24, 54, 'openly. People will see, when there is a blessing of God upon your life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 276, 25, 54, 'that you are one who prays to God in secret and God rewards you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 276, 26, 54, 'So that is the first thing that Jesus said in relation to prayer - this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 276, 27, 54, 'is how you should not pray. If Jesus said that as the number one danger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 276, 28, 54, 'in prayer, then we can be pretty sure that that is the thing that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 277, 1, 54, 'must beware of the most. You know man is basically religious. We like to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 277, 2, 54, 'show a lot of our religion to get a reputation before people that we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 277, 3, 54, 'very religious and holy people. One way we get that reputation is by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 277, 4, 54, 'letting people know how much we pray, how much we fast, and how much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 277, 5, 54, 'money we give to the Lord''s work, or what sacrifices we have made for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 277, 6, 54, 'the Lord, etc. Jesus said, ''Be very careful that you don''t tell anybody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 277, 7, 54, 'any of these things. Let God see it and that is enough.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 277, 8, 54, 'The other thing that Jesus told us not to do is, "When you are praying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 277, 9, 54, 'don''t use meaningless repetition as the heathen people do, because those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 277, 10, 54, 'heathen people think that they will be heard for their many words" (Mat.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 277, 11, 54, '6:7). This is the second mistake that a lot of people make when they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 277, 12, 54, 'praying. They think that God will hear them if they use many words. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 277, 13, 54, 'keep on repeating the same thing over, and over, and over again, as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 277, 14, 54, 'though God was deaf and He can''t hear you if you say it once. They think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 277, 15, 54, 'that the reason why God hears some people is because they pray for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 277, 16, 54, 'long time and that God does not hear those who pray for a short time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 277, 17, 54, 'This is another heathen concept. You think that if you pray for one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 277, 18, 54, 'hour, God would definitely have heard you, but if you pray for one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 277, 19, 54, 'minute, God won''t listen to that, because it is too short. Where did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 277, 20, 54, 'that idea come from?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 277, 21, 54, 'When Peter was walking on the water and when he turned his eyes away');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 277, 22, 54, 'from Jesus, he began to sink in the sea. He turned to the Lord and said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 277, 23, 54, '''Lord save me.'' This prayer lasted may be one or two seconds. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 277, 24, 54, 'how long his prayer was and the Lord answered it. How long does your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 277, 25, 54, 'prayer have to be before God answers it? Peter''s prayer was less than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 277, 26, 54, 'two seconds. So, it is not a question of length of time, nor is it a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 277, 27, 54, 'question of repetition - particularly meaningless repetition. We read,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 277, 28, 54, 'in the Garden of Gethsemane, that Jesus prayed the same thing three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 278, 1, 54, 'times, but it was not meaningless repetition. It was from His heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 278, 2, 54, 'Sometimes when you have a burden in your heart, you take it before God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 278, 3, 54, 'and you take it again and again and again until the burden goes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 278, 4, 54, 'So that is not the type of repetition Jesus is speaking about. Jesus had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 278, 5, 54, 'Himself said in another passage on prayer about a widow who went to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 278, 6, 54, 'judge. We read that in Luke 18:1-7. She kept on asking for one thing,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 278, 7, 54, '''Give me justice against my enemy.'' She went back and said the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 278, 8, 54, 'thing again and again and again until finally, the judge heard it. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 278, 9, 54, 'said that, that is how you have to pray. "His elect cry out to Him day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 278, 10, 54, 'and night and don''t you think God will avenge them?" Jesus said, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 278, 11, 54, 'another parable, when He spoke on prayer, that a man went to his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 278, 12, 54, 'neighbour and said, ''A guest has come by my house, and I don''t have any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 278, 13, 54, 'food.'' The neighbour wouldn''t open the door because it was late. Still,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 278, 14, 54, 'he kept on knocking until the neighbour opened the door and gave him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 278, 15, 54, 'some bread. The lesson here is the same. We need persistence in asking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 278, 16, 54, 'for something again and again and again.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 278, 17, 54, 'So in talking about repetitive prayers, we are not talking about that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 278, 18, 54, 'type of persistence which Jesus Himself encourages in Luke 11 and Luke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 278, 19, 54, '18. Instead, He is talking about meaningless repetition. For example,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 278, 20, 54, 'immediately after the advice on how not to pray, Jesus told them how to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 278, 21, 54, 'pray. He said, ''When you pray, say, ''Our Father who art in heaven" and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 278, 22, 54, 'so on in Matthew 6: 9 onwards. Now you can take that prayer and repeat');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 278, 23, 54, 'it meaninglessly before God, just repeat it like a parrot. Supposing you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 278, 24, 54, 'repeat that prayer 20 times - ''Our Father who art in heaven, hallowed be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 278, 25, 54, 'Thy name, Thy kingdom come'' and so on and you say it 20 times, is God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 278, 26, 54, 'going to hear it? Another fellow prays the same prayer 50 times. Is God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 278, 27, 54, 'going to hear him more?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 278, 28, 54, 'Some people have that idea that if you keep on repeating that prayer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 279, 1, 54, '30-40 times, the more times you repeat it, the more God is going to hear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 279, 2, 54, 'you. Jesus said very clearly in Matthew 6:7 that it is a heathen idea.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 279, 3, 54, 'It is the heart that determines what God hears. If it doesn''t come from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 279, 4, 54, 'the heart, and if it is a meaningless repetition from your mouth, it has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 279, 5, 54, 'no value at all. Don''t think that God will hear you because you use many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 279, 6, 54, 'words. It is not the number of words that determines whether God hears');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 279, 7, 54, 'us or not, it is the condition of our heart. So, He gave us two warnings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 279, 8, 54, 'concerning how we should not pray. One, seeking the honour of man by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 279, 9, 54, 'acting and pretending to be holy, and second, repeating ourselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 279, 10, 54, 'meaninglessly again and again and thinking that if we pray for a long');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 279, 11, 54, 'time, God will listen to us. These are the two things that Jesus warned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 279, 12, 54, 'against severely. Only after that introduction did He go on to tell His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 279, 13, 54, 'disciples how they should pray. And in connection with heathen practice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 279, 14, 54, 'of meaningless repetitions, Jesus said one more thing: Don''t be like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 279, 15, 54, 'heathen, because "Your father knows what you need before you ask him"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 279, 16, 54, '(Mat. 6:8 ). That is a very important thing to remember.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 279, 17, 54, 'See, when you pray to God for something, you are not informing God about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 279, 18, 54, 'a need which He does not know about. If you ring up on the telephone and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 279, 19, 54, 'tell a man that such and such a thing has happened or that such and such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 279, 20, 54, 'a thing is needed, it possible that the other person never knew it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 279, 21, 54, 'before. But when you tell God something like ''Lord someone is sick,'' He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 279, 22, 54, 'already knows that. ''Lord someone needs money, perhaps, to live,'' God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 279, 23, 54, 'knows that as well. There is absolutely nothing that God doesn''t know.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 279, 24, 54, 'Please remember that when you pray. That, your prayer is not a means of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 279, 25, 54, 'informing God what He doesn''t know. Yet some people act like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 279, 26, 54, 'Sometimes people think that prayer is trying to force God to have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 279, 27, 54, 'compassion on some person whom God is a bit hard-hearted to. That is all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 279, 28, 54, 'ridiculous! God has more compassion for everybody in the world than you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 280, 1, 54, 'and I can ever have. And He knows everything that happened long before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 280, 2, 54, 'you and I hear of it. He knows our needs before we asked Him. So, all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 280, 3, 54, 'these things are not the reasons why we pray. We pray as an expression');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 280, 4, 54, 'of our dependence upon God and our faith and our testimony that He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 280, 5, 54, 'the one who provides all our needs. Once these wrong ideas are cleared');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 280, 6, 54, 'out of the way, then we can pray exactly the way God wants us to pray.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 280, 7, 55, 'Chapter 55 Praying Putting God First');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 280, 8, 55, 'There was no one, who lived on earth who prayed and communicated with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 280, 9, 55, 'God and was heard by God every time, like Jesus Christ, when He was on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 280, 10, 55, 'the earth as a man. So, if there is anyone who can teach us how to pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 280, 11, 55, 'and communicate with God, it is Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 280, 12, 55, 'We were considering how we should not pray. First, Jesus cleared the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 280, 13, 55, 'ground of all the rubbish. Just like you go to an empty plot of ground');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 280, 14, 55, 'where there is a lot of rubbish and you have to clear it all out and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 280, 15, 55, 'then dig the ground before you lay a foundation. In the same way Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 280, 16, 55, 'cleared out all the garbage by first telling people not to pray seeking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 280, 17, 55, 'man''s honour and not to pray thinking God will hear you if you keep on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 280, 18, 55, 'repeating many words. Now that we have cleared those two things, if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 280, 19, 55, 'have any doubt that God doesn''t know your need, get that sorted out of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 280, 20, 55, 'your mind as well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 280, 21, 55, 'Then He said, "When you pray begin like this, ''Our Father who art in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 280, 22, 55, 'heaven."'' That is the way Jesus told us to begin our prayer for this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 280, 23, 55, 'reason: Throughout the New Testament, one of the most important');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 280, 24, 55, 'requirements for answered prayer is faith. In fact, the Bible says in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 280, 25, 55, 'James 1:6, 7, that when you ask God for wisdom (he is talking about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 280, 26, 55, 'wisdom there but the principle applies for any prayer), "ask in faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 280, 27, 55, 'without any doubting, because the one who doubts is like a surfer of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 280, 28, 55, 'sea who is driven and tossed by the waves and that man will not receive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 281, 1, 55, 'anything from the Lord." So, we see here that faith is such an important');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 281, 2, 55, 'requirement when we pray and ask God for something. When you have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 281, 3, 55, 'need, a burden, maybe a great longing for something, and you desperately');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 281, 4, 55, 'require it, yet if you don''t have faith, the Bible says in James 1:7');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 281, 5, 55, 'that you will receive nothing, absolutely nothing from the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 281, 6, 55, 'Yet many people don''t understand the importance of this. They think,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 281, 7, 55, '''well, I have prayed, I suppose God has heard.'' The question is, did you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 281, 8, 55, 'pray with faith? Did you believe that God will hear? Or, you are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 281, 9, 55, 'sure whether He has heard or not? Then you are like the atheist who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 281, 10, 55, 'wonders whether there is a God up there listening to us at all. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 281, 11, 55, 'Bible says, "He who comes to God must believe that God exists and He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 281, 12, 55, 'a rewarder of those who diligently seek Him" (Heb. 11:6). This is faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 281, 13, 55, 'First of all, you must believe that, out there, there is a God who can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 281, 14, 55, 'hear you and, secondly, that God rewards every single person who seeks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 281, 15, 55, 'Him diligently, whoever he is.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 281, 16, 55, 'So, in order to encourage and strengthen our faith, Jesus told us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 281, 17, 55, 'begin our prayer by saying, ''Our Father who art in heaven,'' because in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 281, 18, 55, 'those two statements we have two facts concerning God that will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 281, 19, 55, 'strengthen our faith. One is that, He is our Father and not the managing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 281, 20, 55, 'director of a big company, outside whose door we are waiting hoping to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 281, 21, 55, 'get an entrance. He is not some great religious leader with whom we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 281, 22, 55, 'trying to get an audience and for which there is a big waiting list');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 281, 23, 55, '(queue). No, He is a loving Father. As a child can go and see his father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 281, 24, 55, 'and talk to his father anytime, so can you. That is what Jesus taught.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 281, 25, 55, 'Our Father is one who loves us and cares for us, is interested in us and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 281, 26, 55, 'wants to help us in every possible way. That truth must be established');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 281, 27, 55, 'in your mind when you pray, that you are talking to a father. As we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 281, 28, 55, 'considered in our last study, it is not a question of just repeating');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 282, 1, 55, 'these words, every time we pray, but being conscious and aware of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 282, 2, 55, 'reality of it, when we do pray, that we are praying to a father - Our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 282, 3, 55, 'Father.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 282, 4, 55, 'Secondly, we are praying to the One who lives in heaven. It is to God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 282, 5, 55, 'who rules in heaven, who has authority over the whole universe, that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 282, 6, 55, 'are praying. So, it is not only somebody who loves us, but also somebody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 282, 7, 55, 'who has such fantastic power, that He runs the universe. He is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 282, 8, 55, 'heaven! Now, because we know He loves us, our faith is strengthened and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 282, 9, 55, 'because we know He is Almighty and has all power, again our faith is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 282, 10, 55, 'strengthened. These are two things that we need to know - one is that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 282, 11, 55, 'God loves us perfectly and then the other is that God is Almighty. Both');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 282, 12, 55, 'these things come forth in that first sentence in this prayer: Our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 282, 13, 55, 'Father - who loves us, who art in heaven -therefore is sovereignly in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 282, 14, 55, 'control of everything that happens. So, if we don''t begin here, we will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 282, 15, 55, 'not have faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 282, 16, 55, 'When you begin to talk with God or you are going to ask Him something or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 282, 17, 55, 'say something, it is good to pause and ask yourself to whom are you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 282, 18, 55, 'talking to. Once you are sure that you are talking to the One who loves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 282, 19, 55, 'you intensely and the One who has all power to do anything in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 282, 20, 55, 'universe, i.e. once we see the greatness of God, the greatness of His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 282, 21, 55, 'power, and the greatness of His love, then we are ready to pray.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 282, 22, 55, 'Otherwise, our prayers will be useless, because it will be without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 282, 23, 55, 'faith. If you talk to God as though He is a stranger or something like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 282, 24, 55, 'that, you could pray long prayers and nothing will happen. My guess is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 282, 25, 55, 'that lots and lots of prayers prayed by Christians never get answered,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 282, 26, 55, 'probably 90% of them or more, because there is no faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 282, 27, 55, 'Now, when it comes to earthly things, you may imagine that you got some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 282, 28, 55, 'answers from God in prayer. But Jesus said in Matthew 5 that God is such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 283, 1, 55, 'a good God that He makes the sun to rise on the good person and the evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 283, 2, 55, 'person equally. He makes the rain to fall on the righteous and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 283, 3, 55, 'unrighteous equally. So those material blessings are for everybody. Even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 283, 4, 55, 'those who don''t pray get it. The atheist gets rain on his farm without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 283, 5, 55, 'praying about it. So, I am not talking about general blessings that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 283, 6, 55, 'everybody gets, but specific things that we ask God for. You can have it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 283, 7, 55, 'if you ask Him in faith; our Father who art in heaven - One who loves me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 283, 8, 55, 'perfectly and One who has all mighty power.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 283, 9, 55, 'There are six requests in this prayer: Hallowed be Thy name, Thy kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 283, 10, 55, 'come, Thy will be done on earth as it is in heaven, give us this day our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 283, 11, 55, 'daily bread, forgive us our debts as we have forgiven others and don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 283, 12, 55, 'lead us into temptation, but deliver us from evil. The first three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 283, 13, 55, 'concerns God and the next three concern our needs and the needs of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 283, 14, 55, 'fellow believers. So we see here, before we come to our needs, Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 283, 15, 55, 'taught us how to pray concerning God''s glory, His kingdom and His will.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 283, 16, 55, 'Thereby He was teaching us the importance of putting God first in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 283, 17, 55, 'lives. Even though our needs maybe desperate and very great, Jesus still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 283, 18, 55, 'taught us to put it secondary, because when you seek the kingdom of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 283, 19, 55, 'first, all the other things will be added to you. If you don''t seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 283, 20, 55, 'God''s kingdom first and seek those other things, you may get some of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 283, 21, 55, 'them, but that won''t be a help or a blessing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 283, 22, 55, 'So Jesus taught us to be centred in God in our life and also in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 283, 23, 55, 'prayers. The trouble with the entire human race, ever since Adam''s days,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 283, 24, 55, 'is that we are centred in ourselves. One result of sin coming in to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 283, 25, 55, 'Adam''s race is that we are centred in ourselves. We always think of what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 283, 26, 55, 'we can get out of it and how is this going to benefit me and my family.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 283, 27, 55, 'Every businessman in the world lives by that principle - what profits');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 283, 28, 55, 'can I get out of it? How will this benefit me? And the vast majority of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 284, 1, 55, 'Christians live by that principle too: How is it going to benefit me?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 284, 2, 55, 'Jesus has come to save us from sin. He has also come to save us from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 284, 3, 55, 'this warped, crooked, and perverted idea of Christianity, where you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 284, 4, 55, 'a religious outward impression that you give to others of being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 284, 5, 55, 'spiritual and all that, but, in your private life, you are seeking your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 284, 6, 55, 'own gain just as much as the most worldly business man in the world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 284, 7, 55, 'That is hypocrisy!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 284, 8, 55, 'We need to change our way of thinking. The Bible calls it the renewing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 284, 9, 55, 'of our mind in Romans 12:2. The renewing of our minds is something that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 284, 10, 55, 'leads us to look at everything from God''s point of view first, and not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 284, 11, 55, 'our selfish, self-centred viewpoint. So, looking at it from God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 284, 12, 55, 'viewpoint, we say, first of all, ''I want to pray Lord, concerning your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 284, 13, 55, 'name. Your name is dishonoured in the world and we don''t want it to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 284, 14, 55, 'dishonoured. We want Your kingdom to come in the world, a world that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 284, 15, 55, 'being ruled by the devil right now. We want You to come in and rule in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 284, 16, 55, 'Your Kingdom and we want Your will to be done. Lord, the world is full');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 284, 17, 55, 'of people that are doing their own will and I am doing my own will too,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 284, 18, 55, 'but Lord, have mercy on us and help us to do Your will on earth, exactly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 284, 19, 55, 'like it is done in heaven. In heaven it is done joyfully, cheerfully by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 284, 20, 55, 'the angels and I want to do it exactly like that in my life.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 284, 21, 55, 'So concern for God''s name and His kingdom and His will should be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 284, 22, 55, 'primary. Then, we have learned to pray correctly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 284, 23, 56, 'Chapter 56 Praying About God’s Interests');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 284, 24, 56, 'We have been looking about the right way to pray, to talk to God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 284, 25, 56, 'because, when we learn to pray the right way, we can get our prayers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 284, 26, 56, 'answered. A lot of prayers are not answered because they are prayed in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 284, 27, 56, 'the wrong way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 284, 28, 56, 'Please give careful attention. When Jesus was teaching His disciples how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 285, 1, 56, 'to pray, He said in Mathew 6:9 ''Our Father who art in heaven.'' That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 285, 2, 56, 'to think of God as a loving Father and to think of Him as Almighty Ruler');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 285, 3, 56, 'from heaven who can answer every prayer, meet every need, solve every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 285, 4, 56, 'problem, lift you up from any pit you have fallen into, unwind any mess');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 285, 5, 56, 'you have made of your life, and there is nothing He can''t do. He loves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 285, 6, 56, 'you enough to help you, and He is powerful enough to solve your problems');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 285, 7, 56, 'and to protect you from your enemies. ''Our Father, who art in heaven'' -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 285, 8, 56, 'we are not orphans, we are children of God. That is why we can pray ''Our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 285, 9, 56, 'Father who is in heaven.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 285, 10, 56, 'Then He said if you want to communicate with God, you have to get rid of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 285, 11, 56, 'the self-centred attitude. Jesus came to save us from sin and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 285, 12, 56, 'essence of sin is that I am centred in myself. I am thinking of myself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 285, 13, 56, 'all the time - What I can get from this? What I can get from that? What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 285, 14, 56, 'I can get from the other? If that has not changed in your life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 285, 15, 56, 'something is wrong. The reason for all our problems is that we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 285, 16, 56, 'centred in ourselves and Jesus said, get out of that, make God the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 285, 17, 56, 'centre of your life. That is the way it is meant to be. You know, for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 285, 18, 56, 'thousands of years people thought the earth was the centre of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 285, 19, 56, 'universe. All your calculations will all go wrong in astronomy if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 285, 20, 56, 'think the earth is the centre of the universe. The earth is just one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 285, 21, 56, 'little speck of dust floating around in space. Man got his science right');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 285, 22, 56, 'when he discovered that the earth is not the centre of the universe, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 285, 23, 56, 'not even the centre of the solar system, but the sun is the centre of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 285, 24, 56, 'the solar system. In the same way, spiritually, we need to recognize');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 285, 25, 56, 'that God did not create us to be centred in ourselves, thinking of what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 285, 26, 56, 'we are going to gain or what our families are going to get. As long as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 285, 27, 56, 'you think like that you are living in sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 285, 28, 56, 'Jesus came to save us from that sin; to teach us to be centred in God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 286, 1, 56, 'where we are taken up with what His needs are: with His Kingdom, His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 286, 2, 56, 'name, and all other things will fall into place in our lives. So, if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 286, 3, 56, 'are having problems in this area, just consider if the reason is that,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 286, 4, 56, 'in all your prayers, you only think of yourself and your family''s needs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 286, 5, 56, 'Change that, change it from today. I am not saying don''t pray for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 286, 6, 56, 'yourself or your family. By all means do that. In fact, it is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 286, 7, 56, 'responsibility for parents especially to pray for their children every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 286, 8, 56, 'day. That is important and you should be doing that. I am not saying you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 286, 9, 56, 'should stop that, but centre everything in God. When you pray for your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 286, 10, 56, 'children, don''t just pray that they make a lot of money, but pray that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 286, 11, 56, 'they will honour God and seek His Kingdom first. That is what I mean by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 286, 12, 56, 'centring it in God. Centre everything in God in terms of God''s name');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 286, 13, 56, 'being glorified: ''Hallowed be Your name'', that is what Jesus taught us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 286, 14, 56, 'to pray.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 286, 15, 56, 'The very first request is, Lord, let Your name be glorified. Let people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 286, 16, 56, 'respect and reverence that name. The name of Jesus Christ is the name');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 286, 17, 56, 'that God has given by which all men can be saved. It is the only name');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 286, 18, 56, 'through which you can get answers to prayer. When we come to the Father,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 286, 19, 56, 'we are to come in the name of Jesus Christ, His son. We have to pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 286, 20, 56, 'that the name of the Lord Jesus will be honoured throughout the world,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 286, 21, 56, 'throughout our country. Not honoured in the sense that they respect Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 286, 22, 56, 'as a great man. That is not the type of honour God wants. The way the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 286, 23, 56, 'name of Jesus Christ is to be honoured is when people bow in total');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 286, 24, 56, 'submission to the Lordship of Christ in their lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 286, 25, 56, 'Beginning with Christians, those who claim to be Christians, they should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 286, 26, 56, 'put Jesus Christ first in their life totally. So the first thing Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 286, 27, 56, 'said was that we must have a concern for God''s name. It is not enough');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 286, 28, 56, 'just to pray these prayers with our lips, but it must come from our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 287, 1, 56, 'heart: ''Hallowed be Thy name. Lord, the number one burden in my heart is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 287, 2, 56, 'that Your name will be glorified in my life, in my family, with my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 287, 3, 56, 'children, in our church and in our country.'' That must be the burden of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 287, 4, 56, 'our heart and, if that is not the burden of our heart, we must ask God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 287, 5, 56, 'to change us inside. ''Lord, change me such that my greatest burden at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 287, 6, 56, 'all times will be that your name will be honoured. Even if I have to go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 287, 7, 56, 'through difficult times, let your name be honoured.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 287, 8, 56, 'There was a time, when Jesus was on earth, He was facing a great time of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 287, 9, 56, 'pressure, just before He went to the cross. He was honest and said in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 287, 10, 56, 'John 12:27, "My soul has become troubled. What shall I say?" Think of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 287, 11, 56, 'this verse when you are in a very difficult situation and your soul is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 287, 12, 56, 'troubled. What are you going to say? He said, "Shall I say, Father save');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 287, 13, 56, 'me from this hour?" No, I will not say that. I will say, "Father glorify');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 287, 14, 56, 'Thy name" (Jn. 12:28).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 287, 15, 56, 'So you see, when Jesus was in that difficult situation, when His soul');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 287, 16, 56, 'was under such tremendous pressure and when He was tempted to pray,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 287, 17, 56, '''Father save me from this hour,'' He said, ''I am not going to pray that.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 287, 18, 56, 'He prayed what was proper, even though it meant pain and suffering, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 287, 19, 56, 'the ultimate death of the cross - "Father, glorify Thy name". That was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 287, 20, 56, 'just before He went to the cross. He could have said, ''Father, please');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 287, 21, 56, 'save me from this hour'' and could have gone straight in to heaven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 287, 22, 56, 'without going to the cross and we would all have been lost in our sins.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 287, 23, 56, 'Isn''t it a good thing that He did not seek to save himself there, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 287, 24, 56, 'sought the glory of the Father? That teaches us that when we seek the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 287, 25, 56, 'glory of the Father, and not our own comfort or gain, our life can be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 287, 26, 56, 'tremendous blessing to others. So even when we are under pressure, let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 287, 27, 56, 'us follow the example of Jesus who taught us to pray ''Hallowed be thy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 287, 28, 56, 'name''.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 288, 1, 56, 'From there you go onto "Thy kingdom come." See, our next request also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 288, 2, 56, 'has nothing to do with our problems or our family problems, but we say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 288, 3, 56, '''Lord, at the moment, the kingdoms of the world are ruled by the devil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 288, 4, 56, 'and his agents, but I want Your kingdom to come on earth - a kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 288, 5, 56, 'where righteousness is at home. I want Your kingdom to come quickly.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 288, 6, 56, 'The word ''kingdom'' is not understood so much nowadays, because we don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 288, 7, 56, 'have kings. A better word would be ''government''. ''Lord, let Your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 288, 8, 56, 'government come.'' That means the government which He is heading, which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 288, 9, 56, 'He is controlling with the way He runs the universe. ''Lord, we pray that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 288, 10, 56, 'You will be able to run this world, this church and my life in exactly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 288, 11, 56, 'the same way'' - Your kingdom come.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 288, 12, 56, 'Then He taught us to pray, "Your will be done on earth as it is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 288, 13, 56, 'heaven." So, there we see a desire for God''s name, God''s kingdom, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 288, 14, 56, 'God''s will to be done on earth exactly as it is done in heaven. Now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 288, 15, 56, 'Jesus once said in John 6:38 that He had come from heaven to do the will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 288, 16, 56, 'of His Father. He said, "I come from heaven not to do my own will but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 288, 17, 56, 'the will of Him who sent me." Throughout His life Jesus never did his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 288, 18, 56, 'own will, but did the will of His Father, however much pain or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 288, 19, 56, 'difficulty it meant. Jesus taught us to pray, ''Whenever you pray, pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 288, 20, 56, 'this for your life that God''s will be done in your life and not your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 288, 21, 56, 'own.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 288, 22, 56, 'All the misery, sorrow, and problems in the world have come because man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 288, 23, 56, 'has always wanted to do his own will. Whatever he thinks is good; that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 288, 24, 56, 'is what he wants to do, but Jesus taught us to pray for the Father''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 288, 25, 56, 'will to be done on earth as it is in heaven. In other words, first of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 288, 26, 56, 'all, it has to begin in our own lives. ''In my life Father, let Your will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 288, 27, 56, 'be done.'' Now how is God''s will done in heaven? Think of how the angels');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 288, 28, 56, 'obey God. The angels obey God immediately. They wait to hear what God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 289, 1, 56, 'has to say and they obey immediately. They obey joyfully and they obey');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 289, 2, 56, 'totally. If God says something to an angel, the angel does not say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 289, 3, 56, '''Hang on God, just wait a minute, I have got something more important to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 289, 4, 56, 'do.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 289, 5, 56, 'Man behaves like that. God tells him to do something - to go and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 289, 6, 56, 'apologize to someone, or to go and get baptized, or go and do this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 289, 7, 56, 'particular thing, or return that money you took wrongfully, and man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 289, 8, 56, 'waits, and, waits, and waits, sometimes for days or weeks and even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 289, 9, 56, 'months before he decides to do. But no angels in heaven waits like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 289, 10, 56, 'As soon as God says something they will do it immediately. We are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 289, 11, 56, 'praying that God''s will would be done in our life like that. It means,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 289, 12, 56, 'as soon as you see something in the word of God, you are going to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 289, 13, 56, 'that immediately. You are not going to wait and you are going to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 289, 14, 56, 'joyfully. You see, the angels don''t go around with a long face');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 289, 15, 56, 'complaining and grumbling that their lot in life is so difficult. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 289, 16, 56, 'are joyful! They are happy! They obey God totally. Jesus was teaching us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 289, 17, 56, 'there that that is how we must obey also - totally, completely and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 289, 18, 56, 'joyfully. Thy will be done on earth exactly as it is done in heaven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 289, 19, 56, 'There we have the angels as an example on how it is done in heaven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 289, 20, 56, 'So, if we get this right, i.e. first of all in our prayers we think of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 289, 21, 56, 'God''s name, God''s kingdom and God''s will and apply all that to our own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 289, 22, 56, 'life, then in our life the name of God will be honoured by the way we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 289, 23, 56, 'live. In our life, God''s government or rule will come; He is going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 289, 24, 56, 'rule our life. In our life, God''s will , will be done exactly like it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 289, 25, 56, 'done in heaven - unquestioning, joyful, complete, total and immediate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 289, 26, 56, 'obedience. Then we can say that we got our priorities right. Self is no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 289, 27, 56, 'longer the centre. Then we are beginning to learn how to pray right and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 289, 28, 56, 'then we shall find our prayers answered.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 290, 1, 57, 'Chapter 57 Praying For Our Material Needs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 290, 2, 57, 'Once again, we want to look at the secret of how we can get our prayers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 290, 3, 57, 'answered by God. If you study carefully and learn from the way Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 290, 4, 57, 'told us to pray, it can change your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 290, 5, 57, 'We were looking at, in our last, study about putting God first in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 290, 6, 57, 'life and in our prayer. You know in Matthew 6:9-11, Jesus spoke about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 290, 7, 57, 'praying, "Our Father who art in heaven." The number one burden, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 290, 8, 57, 'request and the longing of my heart is that Your name will be hallowed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 290, 9, 57, 'The number two longing and burden and the request that I have in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 290, 10, 57, 'heart is that Your kingdom will come. And the number three desire and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 290, 11, 57, 'longing and request in my heart is that Your will be done on earth as it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 290, 12, 57, 'is in heaven. Do you think many believers really mean that? I mean a lot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 290, 13, 57, 'of believers pray this prayer like a parrot from childhood, but they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 290, 14, 57, 'never stop to think what they are really saying. They are making the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 290, 15, 57, 'very same mistake that Jesus said right at the beginning - ''Don''t pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 290, 16, 57, 'like hypocrites'' and ''Don''t pray with meaningless repetition''.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 290, 17, 57, 'But once we understand aright what Jesus was trying to emphasis here, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 290, 18, 57, 'discover that, if you really begin to pray like this, you become a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 290, 19, 57, 'spiritual man. You will really be spiritual if the primary desires in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 290, 20, 57, 'your life are that God''s name should be glorified, His kingdom should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 290, 21, 57, 'come on earth and His will should be done. That is the uppermost thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 290, 22, 57, 'in your life, not whether you make money or whether your back ache is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 290, 23, 57, 'healed or any such thing. Those things are there, but they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 290, 24, 57, 'secondary. Can you imagine what it will do to your life, if you begin to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 290, 25, 57, 'pray like this all the time, putting God''s interests first all the time?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 290, 26, 57, 'It will change your life completely. You will become another man,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 290, 27, 57, 'another woman instead of being primarily occupied with all the other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 290, 28, 57, 'problem s of the earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 291, 1, 57, 'The reason why Jesus told us to put God first is, because many of those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 291, 2, 57, 'other problems will never get solved if you don''t put God first. You may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 291, 3, 57, 'get rid of one set of problems and end up with another set of problems');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 291, 4, 57, 'because God is not first in your life. Once you put God first in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 291, 5, 57, 'life, I am not saying you won''t have problems, but I say that God will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 291, 6, 57, 'intervene and make you triumphant in the midst of those problems. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 291, 7, 57, 'Bible says in Psalm 34:19 "Many are the afflictions of the righteous,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 291, 8, 57, 'but the Lord delivers him from all of them." That is the difference.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 291, 9, 57, 'Worldly people also face problems but they don''t have anyone to deliver');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 291, 10, 57, 'them. We have a Father in heaven. So, learn to put God first in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 291, 11, 57, 'life in everything. Don''t put your business first, or your studies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 291, 12, 57, 'first, or your children first, or your wife or husband or home or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 291, 13, 57, 'property first, or anything. Put God first and see the difference it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 291, 14, 57, 'will make in your life. Then you will become a real disciple.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 291, 15, 57, 'Once you have done that, Jesus taught us to pray, "Give us this day our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 291, 16, 57, 'daily bread. Forgive us our debt as we have forgiven others and lead us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 291, 17, 57, 'not into temptation and delivers from evil." Notice, one word or, let us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 291, 18, 57, 'say two words that are never found in this prayer: ''I'' and ''me''. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 291, 19, 57, 'could add another one which is similar: ''my''. These three words - ''I'',');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 291, 20, 57, '''me'', and ''my,'' are so common in our language. ''I'' is a very important');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 291, 21, 57, 'for a person and is one of the most important words in the English');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 291, 22, 57, 'language. ''I'', ''me'', ''my'' are not even mentioned once in this prayer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 291, 23, 57, 'After we have sought God''s name, God''s kingdom, and God''s will, i.e.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 291, 24, 57, 'after we put God first in our life, the next thing the Lord wants to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 291, 25, 57, 'teach us is not to think selfishly of only of ourselves, but think of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 291, 26, 57, 'our fellow believers. The Father has many children.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 291, 27, 57, 'Are you hungry? Do you need food? Yes, certainly pray that God will give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 291, 28, 57, 'you your daily bread. But don''t forget that there are other children of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 292, 1, 57, 'God also who are also hungry. You are not the only one. Pray for them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 292, 2, 57, 'too. If you have an abundance of food, don''t forget those other children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 292, 3, 57, 'of God who don''t have it. So He said, when you pray say ''give us this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 292, 4, 57, 'day our daily bread''. When you pray for forgiveness say, ''Forgive us our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 292, 5, 57, 'sins'' and when you pray for deliverance say, ''deliver us from evil.'' So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 292, 6, 57, 'we find that the Lord was trying to deliver people not only from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 292, 7, 57, 'self-centeredness in the sense that God is not the centre of their life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 292, 8, 57, 'but also from this self-centeredness where we don''t think about other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 292, 9, 57, 'people around us at all. He taught us to pray, ''Give us, forgive us and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 292, 10, 57, 'deliver us.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 292, 11, 57, 'In this prayer about praying for daily bread, Jesus wasn''t asking us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 292, 12, 57, 'pray that we should have bread for a whole year or any such thing, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 292, 13, 57, 'Lord, if you will give me just enough for today that is fine. Now, I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 292, 14, 57, 'not saying that you shouldn''t have food for tomorrow or money for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 292, 15, 57, 'tomorrow or savings or any such thing. That is not the point here at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 292, 16, 57, 'all. You can have savings for your need in the future or whatever. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 292, 17, 57, 'is nothing wrong with that, but you should be happy and satisfied if God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 292, 18, 57, 'has given you just enough for today. That is the point. That means, if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 292, 19, 57, 'God has given you food only enough for today, well, praise the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 292, 20, 57, 'Thank you, Lord, for today and You will take care of tomorrow. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 292, 21, 57, 'can plan for tomorrow, go right ahead. There is nothing wrong with that,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 292, 22, 57, 'but be thankful for what is provided and ask God for the provision of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 292, 23, 57, 'our immediate need. Lord, give us this day our daily bread.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 292, 24, 57, 'Jesus did not teach us there to pray for luxury. He is not asking for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 292, 25, 57, 'daily ice-cream or daily cake or any such thing. It is just daily bread;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 292, 26, 57, 'just that simple meal to keep my body and soul together and to keep me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 292, 27, 57, 'in good health. That is all Lord, just give me enough for today. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 292, 28, 57, 'is no covetousness here. Jesus taught us to pray for material things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 293, 1, 57, 'when we are praying for our necessity and not for luxury. We don''t find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 293, 2, 57, 'anywhere in the New Testament any encouragement to pray to God for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 293, 3, 57, 'luxury. But we do find here, in this prayer which the Lord Himself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 293, 4, 57, 'taught, He is encouraging us to pray for necessity. Yes, it is true that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 293, 5, 57, 'your heavenly Father knows what you need even before you ask Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 293, 6, 57, 'Doesn''t the Father know that we need daily bread? He certainly does.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 293, 7, 57, 'Then why doesn''t He give them without our asking? The reason is, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 293, 8, 57, 'wants to have communication with us and He wants us to have the joy and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 293, 9, 57, 'privilege of answered prayer when you get your daily bread.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 293, 10, 57, 'That is why before we eat our meal, as Christians, we always bow our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 293, 11, 57, 'heads and pray and thank God for the food. I hope all of you do that. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 293, 12, 57, 'hope in your homes you don''t rush into your meal without bowing your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 293, 13, 57, 'heads first and praying and thanking God for the food. Now it is not in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 293, 14, 57, 'order to make the food taste better or any such thing. We do it as an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 293, 15, 57, 'expression of gratitude, and thereby acknowledging that it is God who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 293, 16, 57, 'has provided it. There are atheists and godless people in the world who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 293, 17, 57, 'dig in to their meal without thanking anybody. Well, let them go their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 293, 18, 57, 'way, but we acknowledge that it is God who has given it. God has opened');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 293, 19, 57, 'our eyes to see that. Those atheists are blind; they don''t know who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 293, 20, 57, 'provided their food. So we pray to God not to inform our need, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 293, 21, 57, 'He already knows that, but to express our dependence upon Him even for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 293, 22, 57, 'our material necessity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 293, 23, 57, 'Now this also teaches us that there is nothing wrong in praying for any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 293, 24, 57, 'material thing which we need. It may be clothing; if you need clothing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 293, 25, 57, 'you can pray for it. It may be a house that you need to live in, you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 293, 26, 57, 'pray for it. For educational facilities for your children, you can pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 293, 27, 57, 'for it because you want them also to learn to earn their daily bread.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 293, 28, 57, 'Well, they can''t earn their daily bread in most countries unless they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 294, 1, 57, 'have decent education. So, there is nothing wrong in praying for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 294, 2, 57, 'education of our children as well. So, all these things come in that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 294, 3, 57, 'little prayer - ''give us this day our daily bread''. ''Lord, provide us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 294, 4, 57, 'with what is necessary for our life on this earth.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 294, 5, 57, 'Now it is very interesting to see that this prayer for daily bread comes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 294, 6, 57, 'immediately after ''Thy will be done on earth as it is in heaven.'' So,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 294, 7, 57, 'when we put these two requests side by side, i.e. next to each other, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 294, 8, 57, 'find it is something like this -''It is my longing that Your will is done');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 294, 9, 57, 'on earth as it is in heaven and, in order to do that will of Yours on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 294, 10, 57, 'earth, please give me my daily bread so that I can have strength to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 294, 11, 57, 'it.'' So, you see that the reason why we ask God for material things. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 294, 12, 57, 'is so that we can do His will and not our own. That is why it is very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 294, 13, 57, 'important first to pray, ''Thy will be done on earth as it is in heaven,''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 294, 14, 57, 'and then to come to our material needs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 294, 15, 57, 'The trouble with a lot of Christians, of course, is that, they are only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 294, 16, 57, 'praying for material needs and there is no connection between that and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 294, 17, 57, 'doing the will of God in their lives on earth. Some people think that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 294, 18, 57, 'shouldn''t pray to God for any material things and that it is wrong to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 294, 19, 57, 'pray for material things, and you should only pray for spiritual things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 294, 20, 57, 'It is not true. It sounds very holy, but it is contrary to the teaching');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 294, 21, 57, 'of Jesus who taught us even before the prayer for forgiveness of sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 294, 22, 57, 'and deliverance from evil, to pray for our bodily need. So let us never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 294, 23, 57, 'think that this body is created by Satan. It is created by God and when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 294, 24, 57, 'we put God first in our life, it is perfectly proper to ask God to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 294, 25, 57, 'provide all our material needs. Not luxury, but necessity. The word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 294, 26, 57, 'God says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 294, 27, 57, '"My God shall supply all your need according to His riches and glory by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 294, 28, 57, 'Christ Jesus."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 295, 1, 58, 'Chapter 58 Praying For Our Spiritual Needs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 295, 2, 58, 'In this study we are going to look at how God answers our spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 295, 3, 58, 'needs if we ask Him in prayer; How He can deliver you from every evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 295, 4, 58, 'influence and every type of evil in your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 295, 5, 58, 'In the prayer that Jesus taught His disciples to pray, in Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 295, 6, 58, '6:9-13, we see first of all, that Jesus taught His disciples to pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 295, 7, 58, 'putting God first - God''s name, God''s kingdom and God''s will. After');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 295, 8, 58, 'that, He taught them to pray concerning their own needs: first of all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 295, 9, 58, 'their physical and material needs. There is nothing unspiritual about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 295, 10, 58, 'praying that, because if we are not physically alive, how can we do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 295, 11, 58, 'anything else. So, to be physically alive is important before we can do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 295, 12, 58, 'God''s will. So, he taught us to pray, "Give us this day our daily bread"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 295, 13, 58, '- the necessities of life. We considered that in our last study.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 295, 14, 58, 'Now we want to go on to the second request for ourselves and that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 295, 15, 58, '"Forgive us our sins" and the third request for ourselves, “Deliver us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 295, 16, 58, 'from evil." See, we basically have two problems as human beings - one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 295, 17, 58, 'relates to our past and the other relates to the future. We could put it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 295, 18, 58, 'like this: in the past we have done so many wrong things and what we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 295, 19, 58, 'need is forgiveness. In the future, because of our corrupt nature, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 295, 20, 58, 'may still do a lot of evil things. Because of that danger we need help');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 295, 21, 58, 'from God to be able to overcome this evil in our nature, so that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 295, 22, 58, 'don''t do the evil in the future. So, we can say the first request');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 295, 23, 58, 'concerns the past and the second request concerns the future. Those are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 295, 24, 58, 'the only two sides in our life - the past and the future.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 295, 25, 58, 'So, the first request here is concerning the past. ''Lord, I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 295, 26, 58, 'committed so many sins. Please forgive me all my sins.'' You don''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 295, 27, 58, 'to make a list of all your sins, and I think it is impossible for anyone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 295, 28, 58, 'to make a list of all the millions of sins he has committed in his life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 296, 1, 58, 'We acknowledge that we are sinners and that we have done so many things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 296, 2, 58, 'to displease God and we are asking Him to forgive us as we have forgiven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 296, 3, 58, 'our debtors. See, that is the only condition. When we come to the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 296, 4, 58, 'and ask Him to forgive us, it is important that we ourselves have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 296, 5, 58, 'forgiven other people who have done wrong to us. Isn''t that righteous of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 296, 6, 58, 'God to require that from us?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 296, 7, 58, 'Jesus once told a story about a king who forgave a man, his servant a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 296, 8, 58, 'huge debt, let us say one crore worth of rupees or 100 lakhs worth of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 296, 9, 58, 'rupees. This man had such a huge debt to the king and the king forgave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 296, 10, 58, 'him. To be forgiven of one crore or 100 lakh rupees of debt is such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 296, 11, 58, 'fantastic experience. A man would just jump for delight and shout for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 296, 12, 58, 'joy that he has been forgiven so much. Then Jesus said that this man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 296, 13, 58, 'went out into the street jumping with joy and delight and he met another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 296, 14, 58, 'person, a fellow servant, who owed him ten rupees. He caught this other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 296, 15, 58, 'person by the throat and said, ''You better pay up the ten rupees you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 296, 16, 58, 'borrowed from me, otherwise I will lock you up in jail''. He then took');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 296, 17, 58, 'him to court for the ten rupees debt and got him thrust into jail.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 296, 18, 58, 'Do you know what the king did when he heard about it? He called that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 296, 19, 58, 'first servant back said, ''Hey come here. Didn''t I forgive you 100 lakh');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 296, 20, 58, 'rupees debt and you couldn''t forgive that other person ten rupees? Why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 296, 21, 58, 'was that? Well, now you have to learn a lesson too. If you don''t forgive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 296, 22, 58, 'other people, I won''t forgive you. You get into the prison along with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 296, 23, 58, 'the other fellow and you pay up your one crore or 10 million and he will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 296, 24, 58, 'pay you your ten rupees.'' On conclusion of this story Jesus said, ''My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 296, 25, 58, 'heavenly Father will do exactly like that to you, if you don''t forgive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 296, 26, 58, 'others.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 296, 27, 58, 'I want to tell you, dear friends, that one of the greatest sins found');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 296, 28, 58, 'among Christians throughout the world today is the sin of an unforgiving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 297, 1, 58, 'spirit, an unforgiving attitude. If you have that towards another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 297, 2, 58, 'person, that is the one place where, Jesus said, your own sins will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 297, 3, 58, 'be forgiven. And , even if forgiven in the first place, God will remove');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 297, 4, 58, 'that forgiveness and un-forgive you. Have you ever heard of forgiveness?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 297, 5, 58, 'Yes, you have. Here God un-forgives what He had already forgiven. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 297, 6, 58, 'is the meaning of that story in Matthew 18. The king forgives the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 297, 7, 58, 'servant and later on withdrew that forgiveness. Jesus said, "My Heavenly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 297, 8, 58, 'Father will do the same to you."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 297, 9, 58, 'See, not to forgive another person is such a serious crime in God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 297, 10, 58, 'eyes, that out of all of these six requests in the prayer (Hallowed be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 297, 11, 58, 'Thy name, Thy kingdom come, Thy will be done, give us this day our daily');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 297, 12, 58, 'bread, forgive our sin, deliver us from evil), Jesus picked out one and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 297, 13, 58, 'emphasized it at the end of that prayer. You know which was that? - This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 297, 14, 58, 'one on forgiving others. He repeated it like this in Matthew 6:14 "If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 297, 15, 58, 'you have forgiven men their transgressions, your heavenly Father will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 297, 16, 58, 'forgive you, but if you don''t forgive men, then your Father will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 297, 17, 58, 'forgive your transgressions."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 297, 18, 58, 'Think of that for a moment. If there is somebody on earth whom you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 297, 19, 58, 'not forgiven, your heavenly Father will not forgive you. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 297, 20, 58, 'impossible! You will not go to heaven if you have not forgiven everybody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 297, 21, 58, 'on this earth. Please remember that. There is no entry into God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 297, 22, 58, 'kingdom without forgiveness of sins through the death of Jesus Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 297, 23, 58, 'But that forgiveness will not be given to you if there is one human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 297, 24, 58, 'being you have not forgiven. So let us ask the Lord to forgive us and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 297, 25, 58, 'let us forgive every single person who has ever wronged us in our life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 297, 26, 58, 'and release them. Never mind, if you can''t forget the evil. God doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 297, 27, 58, 'ask you to forget what people have done. He only asks you to forgive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 297, 28, 58, 'them. A simple word to say to the Lord, - ''Lord I forgive this person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 298, 1, 58, 'and that person and the other person. I am not going to hold it anymore');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 298, 2, 58, 'against them whatever they have done.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 298, 3, 58, 'Then we can go to the next prayer, ''Lord, lead us not into temptation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 298, 4, 58, 'but deliver us from evil.'' ''Lord, help me to run away from temptation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 298, 5, 58, 'Give me strength.'' Dear friend, don''t try to act like a brave person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 298, 6, 58, 'The Bible says flee from idolatry, flee form youthful lusts. Don''t put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 298, 7, 58, 'yourself in the place where you can be tempted unnecessarily. No, run');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 298, 8, 58, 'away from it. ''Lord, please help me; don''t lead me into situations where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 298, 9, 58, 'I face things which are too much for me to handle. Lord, deliver me from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 298, 10, 58, 'every type of evil Lord, especially the evil of sin. The corruption that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 298, 11, 58, 'is in my nature, please deliver me from it Lord, and all these things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 298, 12, 58, 'that I ask are for Your glory and for the honour of Your name, for Yours');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 298, 13, 58, 'is the kingdom, the power and the glory.'' He concludes with that, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 298, 14, 58, 'said, Amen - It shall be so.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 298, 15, 58, 'Let us look at that last request for a moment - deliver us from evil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 298, 16, 58, 'Again, it is not just me. It is me plus my fellow believers. Deliver us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 298, 17, 58, 'from evil for the sake of Your kingdom, for the sake of Your glory.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 298, 18, 58, 'Lord, your name is so dishonoured when Christians who take your name do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 298, 19, 58, 'evil. So, deliver us Lord from evil; from everything that dishonours');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 298, 20, 58, 'your name, deliver us. See here is an acknowledgement that I cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 298, 21, 58, 'deliver myself, just like I cannot earn forgiveness. God has to forgive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 298, 22, 58, 'me. I cannot deliver myself by self-control or by determination or any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 298, 23, 58, 'such thing. I am asking God, who is the only one that has power, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 298, 24, 58, 'deliver me. ''Lord, deliver us from evil. We acknowledge that You are the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 298, 25, 58, 'only one who has the strength to deliver us. The devil is too strong,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 298, 26, 58, 'the lusts in our flesh are so strong, the lust of my eyes is so strong,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 298, 27, 58, 'and my tongue is so uncontrollable, this anger is too powerful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 298, 28, 58, 'Therefore, deliver us from anger, deliver us from the lusting with our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 299, 1, 58, 'eyes, and deliver us from bitterness and wrong attitudes and from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 299, 2, 58, 'telling lies in our place of work. Lord the pressure is so great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 299, 3, 58, 'sometimes, but deliver us. Your power is able to do it.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 299, 4, 58, 'Then Jesus concludes the prayer as it began - with God. The Bible says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 299, 5, 58, 'God is the first and He is the last. In this prayer Jesus taught us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 299, 6, 58, 'conclude acknowledging that the kingdom is of God, the power is of God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 299, 7, 58, 'and the glory is of God. It is the prayer of a humble man who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 299, 8, 58, 'acknowledges that God is everything and he is nothing. ''Oh God, Yours is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 299, 9, 58, 'the kingdom, Yours is all the power, and Yours is the glory that can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 299, 10, 58, 'make us live as we should be living. In other words, when You have done');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 299, 11, 58, 'these things and answered our prayers, we won''t take any credit for it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 299, 12, 58, 'to ourselves. We won''t pretend that we did it. It was Your work and we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 299, 13, 58, 'give You all the glory. It is Yours.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 299, 14, 58, 'Then that last word Amen in the prayer. That is a Hebrew word which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 299, 15, 58, 'means ''it shall be so''. It is an expression of faith. Just like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 299, 16, 58, 'prayer began with faith, by praying, ''Our Father who loves us, who art');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 299, 17, 58, 'in heaven, almighty sovereign king, ruler of the universe,'' it concludes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 299, 18, 58, 'also with an expression of faith. Amen means, ''Lord everything that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 299, 19, 58, 'have prayed, I believe it will be so. It is going to take place like I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 299, 20, 58, 'have asked for and I believe that Your name is going to be honoured and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 299, 21, 58, 'Your kingdom will come and Your will be done on earth as it is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 299, 22, 58, 'heaven, and you are going to provide us our need, you are going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 299, 23, 58, 'forgive us our debts, and you are going to deliver us from all evil and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 299, 24, 58, 'Your name will be glorified.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 299, 25, 58, 'So when we conclude any prayer with the word ''amen'', it means more than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 299, 26, 58, 'just a little signal to everybody that the prayer is over. It is a very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 299, 27, 58, 'meaningful statement. We are saying thereby, ''I believe it shall be so,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 299, 28, 58, 'exactly like this brother prayed, I am saying amen - it shall be so.'' It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 300, 1, 58, 'is an expression of faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 300, 2, 58, 'Now we don''t have to repeat this prayer every time we pray. Because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 300, 3, 58, 'Jesus said pray in this way in Matthew 6:9, which means all our prayers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 300, 4, 58, 'should begin with being centred with God, it should be an expression of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 300, 5, 58, 'faith, and conclude by giving God the glory and an expression of faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 300, 6, 58, 'that God will answer our prayer. May all our prayers be like this in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 300, 7, 58, 'future.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 300, 8, 59, 'Chapter 59 Hypocrisy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 300, 9, 59, 'What are the sins that Jesus hated the most? When we see sin like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 300, 10, 59, 'sickness, even more serious than sickness, we will learn to hate it more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 300, 11, 59, 'than we hate sickness. Jesus came to reveal the serious sins that ruin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 300, 12, 59, 'our life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 300, 13, 59, 'We want to start with the first chapter of Matthew''s gospel, the very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 300, 14, 59, 'first book of the New Testament and the very first page. Matthew 1:21');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 300, 15, 59, 'gives the reason why Jesus was called Jesus when He was born as baby.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 300, 16, 59, '"You shall call His name Jesus because He will save His people from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 300, 17, 59, 'their sins." The word ''Jesus'' means saviour; One who has come to save us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 300, 18, 59, 'from our sins. So, if you want to know what it is to be saved from sin,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 300, 19, 59, 'you need to know what sin is. In the minds of many, many people, sin is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 300, 20, 59, 'a very vague concept; it is not clear what sin is. If you were told that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 300, 21, 59, 'you are being saved from leprosy or saved from tuberculosis, or saved');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 300, 22, 59, 'from a pit in which you have fallen, or saved from failure in an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 300, 23, 59, 'examination, you understand what it means to ''save''. These things are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 300, 24, 59, 'clearly understood.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 300, 25, 59, 'But when you say saved from sin, what do you understand? That depends on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 300, 26, 59, 'your definition of sin. If you think sin is just getting drunk, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 300, 27, 59, 'gambling, or wasting your money and fooling around with other women and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 300, 28, 59, 'things like that, and if you don''t do those gross sins, you will think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 301, 1, 59, 'that you are saved. You know, if you go by the Ten Commandments where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 301, 2, 59, 'there are gross sins like murder, adultery, theft, giving false witness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 301, 3, 59, 'in court to injure another person, and things like that, I think most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 301, 4, 59, 'people in the world could say, ''Well, we are not committing those type');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 301, 5, 59, 'of things. We don''t need salvation.'' If those are the only things that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 301, 6, 59, 'are sins, a lot of people don''t need Jesus at all. But when we read the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 301, 7, 59, 'gospels, we find that Jesus spoke about certain other sins which are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 301, 8, 59, 'listed in the Ten Commandments at all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 301, 9, 59, 'So, when we see the teaching of Jesus, we find that sin is not primarily');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 301, 10, 59, 'external. I mean a mango tree is a mango tree even if it doesn''t produce');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 301, 11, 59, 'mangoes. It may be barren but it is still a mango tree. When it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 301, 12, 59, 'produces, it will produce mangoes. It won''t produce apples or coconuts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 301, 13, 59, 'In the same way sin is like a tree. Whether the fruit of it comes out of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 301, 14, 59, 'our life or not, doesn''t make a difference. Sin is still there within;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 301, 15, 59, 'it is in the heart. Jesus said it is from the heart that everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 301, 16, 59, 'comes out; evil thoughts, murders, and adultery and everything like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 301, 17, 59, 'that. That is why Jesus spoke about sin in the heart and to deal with it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 301, 18, 59, 'there, rather than after it has come forth. When we look at the overall');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 301, 19, 59, 'teaching of Jesus, we find that there are certain sins which He spoke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 301, 20, 59, 'against which men don''t consider seriously. In Isaiah 55:8-9 God said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 301, 21, 59, '"My thoughts are not your thoughts." That applies in many areas.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 301, 22, 59, 'God''s thoughts about sin are different from man''s thoughts about sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 301, 23, 59, 'Man doesn''t take sin so seriously. Man thinks sin is only in these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 301, 24, 59, 'external things. But God says there are a lot of other things, which are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 301, 25, 59, 'sins. And number one among them would be hypocrisy. Now in the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 301, 26, 59, 'Testament, you hardly ever find a condemnation of hypocrisy. It is very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 301, 27, 59, 'rare. The prophets mostly spoke against adultery, worshipping of idols,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 301, 28, 59, 'greed, covetousness, etc. These are some of the main sins they spoke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 302, 1, 59, 'about. But when Jesus came, though He spoke about these things also, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 302, 2, 59, 'spoke much more about hypocrisy. In fact, when a woman caught in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 302, 3, 59, 'adultery was brought before Him, He didn''t even want to stone her. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 302, 4, 59, 'saved her life. There was a thief, a dacoit and possibly a murderer who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 302, 5, 59, 'hung with Him on the cross, He forgave him, and took him to paradise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 302, 6, 59, 'But when He met religious leaders; the elders, the bishops of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 302, 7, 59, 'synagogues of that time - the Pharisees and the scribes, He condemned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 302, 8, 59, 'them outright, because they were hypocrites.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 302, 9, 59, 'He kept on saying, for example, in Matthew 23, "Woe unto you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 302, 10, 59, 'hypocrites." Woe means curse, like in the Old Testament we read "Curse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 302, 11, 59, 'be upon you". So, Jesus was saying, ''Curse be upon you scribes - Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 302, 12, 59, 'scholars and Pharisees, who were the religious leaders at that time, who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 302, 13, 59, 'studied in the Bible schools and had become elders in the synagogues,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 302, 14, 59, 'hypocrites.'' We see this repeatedly said by Jesus in verses 13, 14, 15,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 302, 15, 59, '23, 25, 27, and 29. So frequently He condemns them for their hypocrisy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 302, 16, 59, 'And finally, He calls them serpents, a brood of vipers, how will they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 302, 17, 59, 'escape the sentence of hell in verse 33.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 302, 18, 59, 'You never find Jesus speaking like that to a prostitute or to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 302, 19, 59, 'murderer. But you find Jesus speaking like that to most of the religious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 302, 20, 59, 'people of His time who read the Bible - Genesis to Malachi every day,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 302, 21, 59, 'and who were very devout in their external piety. So, we can see how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 302, 22, 59, 'much Jesus hated hypocrisy, more than anything else. This was what He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 302, 23, 59, 'sought to condemn. The reason was, Jesus said in Mark 7:6 that rightly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 302, 24, 59, 'did Isaiah prophecy of you hypocrites, as it is written there: "This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 302, 25, 59, 'people honour me with their lips but their heart is far away from me."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 302, 26, 59, 'What was it that Jesus detested? It was their saying so many wonderful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 302, 27, 59, 'things to Him with their lips but their heart was far away from Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 302, 28, 59, 'They appeared to be devoted to the Lord. But in their heart, they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 303, 1, 59, 'interested in themselves; their money and their other things. They were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 303, 2, 59, 'seeking their own gain everywhere, but pretending to be holy. What did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 303, 3, 59, 'the prostitutes, the thieves, and the murderers have better than the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 303, 4, 59, 'Pharisees? Not in external life, but the fact that they were honest.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 303, 5, 59, 'They were murderers and they didn''t pretend that they were not. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 303, 6, 59, 'prostitute acknowledged that she was a prostitute. She wasn''t pretending');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 303, 7, 59, 'to be holy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 303, 8, 59, 'So, we find that Jesus hated pretence; words spoken with the lips, holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 303, 9, 59, 'words, when we pray; words that make us appear holy and very humble. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 303, 10, 59, 'can be a total lie. To be a hypocrite is to be a liar. It is to give an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 303, 11, 59, 'impression to people of being spiritual when you are not really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 303, 12, 59, 'spiritual. You know, one of the first sins that children learn and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 303, 13, 59, 'commit is the sin of telling a lie. They don''t commit murder or adultery');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 303, 14, 59, 'and things like that first, it is telling a lie from birth. Right from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 303, 15, 59, 'their earliest years they begin to tell lies, they begin to deceive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 303, 16, 59, 'their parents. And as we grow up, we develop this art of deceiving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 303, 17, 59, 'others, of giving people an impression about ourselves, which is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 303, 18, 59, 'really true, fooling them. Then if you become a Christian, you develop');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 303, 19, 59, 'that still more by trying to give people the impression that you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 303, 20, 59, 'very spiritual in order to impress them. And that is the sin the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 303, 21, 59, 'hates most, more than anything else.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 303, 22, 59, 'Remember the story that Jesus said about ten virgins who went to meet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 303, 23, 59, 'the bridegroom. What was the difference? Externally they were all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 303, 24, 59, 'virgins. That means the external life of all ten was good. They wore the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 303, 25, 59, 'same white dress, they all went to meet the bridegroom, and there was no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 303, 26, 59, 'difference as far as those things are concerned. They were exactly the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 303, 27, 59, 'same. But there was a lot of difference inside. Inside, maybe the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 303, 28, 59, 'pockets of one of those cloaks, five of them had oil, extra oil to fill');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 304, 1, 59, 'up the lamps when they started dying out. Initially all ten had their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 304, 2, 59, 'lamps burning. But when their lamps started dying out, we read that five');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 304, 3, 59, 'of them only had oil. What does this parable teach us? This parable');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 304, 4, 59, 'teaches us that an external life alone does not prepare us for meeting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 304, 5, 59, 'the Lord when He comes. We must have a hidden life as well. That is what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 304, 6, 59, 'the flask of oil symbolizes - a hidden life of our walk with God. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 304, 7, 59, 'oil symbolizes the Holy Spirit and inner life where we are walking with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 304, 8, 59, 'God, where our love for the Lord is clear, pure, and whole-hearted, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 304, 9, 59, 'addition to the lamp burning. So, it is not enough to be a virgin - to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 304, 10, 59, 'have your external life right. Those five virgins were left out when the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 304, 11, 59, 'bridegroom came, just because they did not have that inner flask of oil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 304, 12, 59, 'So, what was Jesus emphasizing here? If you are a hypocrite, you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 304, 13, 59, 'going to miss out when the Lord comes. The first sin that was judged in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 304, 14, 59, 'the early church, what was it? Ananias and Sapphira were punished not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 304, 15, 59, 'for murder, or adultery or anything like that. It was hypocrisy -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 304, 16, 59, 'pretending to be spiritual when they were not really spiritual. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 304, 17, 59, 'a lesson for us. Ananias and Sapphira didn''t cheat anybody, they didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 304, 18, 59, 'harm anyone, but they came to the church pretending that they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 304, 19, 59, 'totally dedicated to the Lord, when they were actually not. Do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 304, 20, 59, 'realize how much Jesus hates this? They were killed. Let us learn from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 304, 21, 59, 'this, that hypocrisy is what Jesus hates more than anything else.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 304, 22, 60, 'Chapter 60 Pride');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 304, 23, 60, 'We want to look a little more at what sin really is. Sin is what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 304, 24, 60, 'destroys us more than any sickness. Sin is what has brought chaos and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 304, 25, 60, 'confusion into the world. The answer to all of our problems lies, first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 304, 26, 60, 'of all, in being saved from sin, even more than being healed from our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 304, 27, 60, 'diseases.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 304, 28, 60, 'Do you realize that sin is more serious than sickness? Suppose you heard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 305, 1, 60, 'a message that Jesus could heal all your diseases and that Jesus could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 305, 2, 60, 'save you from all your sins, which would you prefer, if you had a choice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 305, 3, 60, 'of one of the two? Supposing Jesus appeared to you and said, ''Either I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 305, 4, 60, 'can save you from all of your sins, or heal you from all your diseases,''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 305, 5, 60, 'which one would you choose? I think most people in the world would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 305, 6, 60, 'choose healing from all their diseases, even many believers. The reason');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 305, 7, 60, 'is they have never understood how serious sin is.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 305, 8, 60, 'The destruction sin produces in our soul is invisible and that is why we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 305, 9, 60, 'don''t realize how bad it is. It is like when a smoker smokes cigarettes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 305, 10, 60, 'and his lungs are being destroyed, he doesn''t see it. If he could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 305, 11, 60, 'actually see it, he would stop smoking. It is the same way with sin. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 305, 12, 60, 'don''t see it till it has destroyed us completely; the seriousness of it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 305, 13, 60, 'the damage it is doing. That is why the message of the New Testament');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 305, 14, 60, 'primarily is not that Jesus can heal you from all your diseases, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 305, 15, 60, 'that Jesus can save you from your sins. In fact, the meaning of the word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 305, 16, 60, '''Jesus'', in Matthew 1:21, is not healer but saviour. He has come to save');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 305, 17, 60, 'us from all our sins. Of course He heals the sick, but that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 305, 18, 60, 'secondary. He primarily came to save us from our sins.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 305, 19, 60, 'If we are to be saved from our sins, we need to understand what sin is,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 305, 20, 60, 'what are we to be saved from? Sickness we understand. We saw in our last');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 305, 21, 60, 'study that there are sins, the inward sins, which Jesus condemned, which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 305, 22, 60, 'were far more serious than anything listed in the Ten Commandments. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 305, 23, 60, 'the last study we looked at one of the inward sins - about hypocrisy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 305, 24, 60, 'In this study we want to look at another sin that Jesus spoke about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 305, 25, 60, 'which is again far more serious than many sins listed in the Ten');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 305, 26, 60, 'Commandments, and that is the sin of pride. In Luke 18, Jesus told a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 305, 27, 60, 'parable about two people who went to the temple to pray. One was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 305, 28, 60, 'Pharisee and the other a tax collector. In those days the tax collectors');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 306, 1, 60, 'in most cases were cheats, who made money from other people. Everybody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 306, 2, 60, 'knew that they are sinners. On the other hand, the Pharisees were a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 306, 3, 60, 'people who appeared to be very holy on the outside. This Pharisee stood');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 306, 4, 60, 'and prayed, in Luke 18:11, "God ! I thank you that I am not like other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 306, 5, 60, 'men. I am not a swindler, unjust, adulterer, or even like this tax');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 306, 6, 60, 'gatherer" and then he listed all the right things that he did; he fasted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 306, 7, 60, 'twice a week, he paid tithes and so on. But the tax collector, standing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 306, 8, 60, 'some distance away, said, "God be merciful to me, a sinner." And Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 306, 9, 60, 'said, that man, that sinner, went to his house justified rather than the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 306, 10, 60, 'Pharisee. What was wrong with the Pharisee? What was his sin here, which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 306, 11, 60, 'made God condemn him? Pride!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 306, 12, 60, 'Pride is what made the devil into a devil. Prior to that, he was an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 306, 13, 60, 'angel, a perfect angel. As soon as pride came into his heart, he became');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 306, 14, 60, 'a devil. It didn''t take even one second, it was immediate. As soon as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 306, 15, 60, 'the thought came into his heart, God cast him down. The Bible says in 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 306, 16, 60, 'Peter 5:5, "God resists the proud." God is always fighting against proud');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 306, 17, 60, 'people. Wherever He finds pride, wherever He finds proud people, He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 306, 18, 60, 'resisting them, fighting them, standing against them, because that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 306, 19, 60, 'contrary to God''s nature. Just like, if you are a clean hygienic person,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 306, 20, 60, 'you would hate filth and rubbish and garbage, whereas a pig doesn''t hate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 306, 21, 60, 'rubbish and dirty water. Why do you hate it? Why do you immediately have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 306, 22, 60, 'revulsion to filth and rubbish, whereas a pig doesn''t have such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 306, 23, 60, 'revulsion? It is a matter of nature.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 306, 24, 60, 'We don''t have revulsion for pride because pride is part of our nature.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 306, 25, 60, 'We don''t see it as a filthy thing. We are exactly like that pig,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 306, 26, 60, 'wallowing in the mire and thinking, ''This is okay''. But God''s nature is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 306, 27, 60, 'the opposite of that. He hates pride. The Bible says that Jesus humbled');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 306, 28, 60, 'Himself. He came down from heaven to earth, became a servant and thereby');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 307, 1, 60, 'demonstrated what God''s nature is like; one of humility and lowliness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 307, 2, 60, 'He showed thereby what man should be like. God created man to be humble.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 307, 3, 60, 'When man is proud, what he has is the nature of Satan, the thing which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 307, 4, 60, 'God hates, the thing which God resists, it is sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 307, 5, 60, 'When you are proud of anything, for example, if you are proud of your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 307, 6, 60, 'good looks, it is a sin. Jesus came to save you from that, that you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 307, 7, 60, 'never again be proud of your good looks. There is nothing wrong with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 307, 8, 60, 'good looks. But to be proud of it, there is everything wrong with that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 307, 9, 60, 'What about your intelligence? There is nothing wrong with being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 307, 10, 60, 'intelligent. You can be the most intelligent person in the world with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 307, 11, 60, 'the highest IQ. That is not a sin. But if you are proud of it, even a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 307, 12, 60, 'little bit, then it is a sin. If you are proud of the house you live in,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 307, 13, 60, 'proud of what you have accomplished in life, proud of your position in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 307, 14, 60, 'society, proud perhaps, of the family you belong to, all of these are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 307, 15, 60, 'sin. And if Jesus has not saved you from these sins, I have to say that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 307, 16, 60, 'Jesus has not become your saviour. Then what has He saved you from?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 307, 17, 60, 'A lot of people want to be saved from hell. But do you know that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 307, 18, 60, 'Bible almost never speaks about being saved from hell? It speaks a lot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 307, 19, 60, 'more about being saved from sin and from the judgment of God against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 307, 20, 60, 'sin. But where do you find a verse in the Bible about being saved from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 307, 21, 60, 'hell? Almost never! Most of the verses about salvation speak about being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 307, 22, 60, 'saved from sin. The first promise in the New Testament is you should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 307, 23, 60, 'call His name Jesus because He will save His people not from hell or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 307, 24, 60, 'from their sicknesses but from their sin. Salvation from hell is the end');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 307, 25, 60, 'result of being saved from sin. If you are saved from sin, you will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 307, 26, 60, 'saved from hell automatically. It is like saying, if you are saved from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 307, 27, 60, 'sickness, you will be saved from death. You must be saved from sickness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 307, 28, 60, 'then you will be saved from death. That is automatic. Then should not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 308, 1, 60, 'you say that if you are saved from sin, you will be saved from hell.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 308, 2, 60, 'That is automatic.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 308, 3, 60, 'That is why, as I said in the beginning, we need to understand what sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 308, 4, 60, 'actually is. Pride, seeking the honour of man, glorying in what God gave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 308, 5, 60, 'us as a free gift, is sin. The Bible says in 1 Corinthians 4:7 "What do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 308, 6, 60, 'you have that you did not receive?" Just think of that for a moment.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 308, 7, 60, 'Think of all the things you have in your life: health, good looks,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 308, 8, 60, 'intelligence, a house, a job, a position, you never chose any of these.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 308, 9, 60, 'You never got any of these by any ability that God didn''t give you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 308, 10, 60, 'Maybe you were born with certain intelligence, you were born into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 308, 11, 60, 'certain family, but you didn''t choose it. Why are you proud of it then?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 308, 12, 60, 'What have you got that you did not receive? You may say that you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 308, 13, 60, 'earned so much, you have accomplished so much. That is because God gave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 308, 14, 60, 'health to you for so many years. Think of another person who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 308, 15, 60, 'bedridden, paralytic or blind or deaf, if you were like that you would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 308, 16, 60, 'never accomplish what you did. So, what do you have that you did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 308, 17, 60, 'receive.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 308, 18, 60, 'What about spiritual gifts, your Bible knowledge perhaps. People can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 308, 19, 60, 'proud of Bible knowledge. That is a sin. Bible knowledge is not a sin,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 308, 20, 60, 'but to be proud of it is. For a preacher to stand up and be proud of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 308, 21, 60, 'fact that he is such a wonderful preacher, accepted and invited');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 308, 22, 60, 'everywhere, he is the biggest sinner of all. Not because of his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 308, 23, 60, 'preaching, but because he is proud of it. Because he goes back from his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 308, 24, 60, 'preaching and congratulates himself that so many people appreciate him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 308, 25, 60, 'It could be that you have a large church and you are very proud of that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 308, 26, 60, 'Yours is one of the biggest churches in the city and your church is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 308, 27, 60, 'growing more than other churches. There is nothing wrong with that. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 308, 28, 60, 'if you are proud of it, you are evil. Jesus came to save us from pride.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 309, 1, 60, 'Pride is not listed in the Ten Commandments just like hypocrisy is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 309, 2, 60, 'listed. But those are the sins Jesus came to save us from. Jesus spoke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 309, 3, 60, 'about those who seek the honour of men, when they give money, when they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 309, 4, 60, 'pray, when they fast, what is this? All this is pride. Jesus said to His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 309, 5, 60, 'disciples, ''Don''t be like that.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 309, 6, 60, 'Whenever we look down on others, we are proud. Think of the story of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 309, 7, 60, 'prodigal son. What is the problem with the elder son in that story? He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 309, 8, 60, 'looked down on his younger brother. He said, ''See what he is like and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 309, 9, 60, 'see what I am like.'' Whenever you compare yourself with another person,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 309, 10, 60, 'and you think what a wonderful person you are, how much better you are,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 309, 11, 60, 'maybe you are purer, or holier, that is pride. You can be proud of your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 309, 12, 60, 'holiness. Maybe you are holier than somebody else, you are proud of it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 309, 13, 60, 'and you can say, ''Lord ! I thank you that I am not like the people in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 309, 14, 60, 'that denomination.'' When you are proud of the denomination you belong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 309, 15, 60, 'to, it is a sin. There is nothing wrong in belonging to a good church,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 309, 16, 60, 'but when you are proud of it, it is a sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 309, 17, 60, 'You see there is a lot of sin in the many, many good things that we do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 309, 18, 60, 'and that we have. And that is the sin of pride, a sin found right in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 309, 19, 60, 'most religious and so-called spiritual activities, a sin which is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 309, 20, 60, 'unrecognized. Jesus hates it. Imagine you got something in your life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 309, 21, 60, 'that Jesus hates; don''t you want to be saved from it? Ask God to show');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 309, 22, 60, 'you right now the areas in your life where you have pride, because they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 309, 23, 60, 'are destroying you. Ask Jesus to save you from them right now.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 309, 24, 61, 'Chapter 61 Selfishness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 309, 25, 61, 'Once again, we want to look at sin and how serious it is. It is more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 309, 26, 61, 'serious than sickness; worse than cancer, leprosy, AIDS , and all put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 309, 27, 61, 'together. Once you understand that, you will have a great longing to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 309, 28, 61, 'free from all sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 310, 1, 61, 'In this study let us look at a passage from Luke 10. Jesus told a story');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 310, 2, 61, 'here about a man who was beaten up by thieves, as he was travelling on a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 310, 3, 61, 'road, and he was left lying there half dead. Two religious people - one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 310, 4, 61, 'a priest, and the other one, a sort of an assistant (Levite) to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 310, 5, 61, 'priest passed by that road. They just walked past that man, on the other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 310, 6, 61, 'side of the road, and left him there. They went on to the temple to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 310, 7, 61, 'carry on with their religious services! After that, another man came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 310, 8, 61, 'that way, a Samaritan. He was neither a priest nor a religious type of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 310, 9, 61, 'person. He was just an ordinary person, an ordinary sinner. But he had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 310, 10, 61, 'compassion on this poor person lying half dead there. He lifted him up,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 310, 11, 61, 'bandaged his wounds and took care of him. He even paid for the expenses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 310, 12, 61, 'for putting up that injured person in a little hotel. He told the hotel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 310, 13, 61, 'keeper, ''Take care of him and I will give you more, if you have to spend');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 310, 14, 61, 'more on him.'' Jesus then asked, ''Which of these three proved to be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 310, 15, 61, 'neighbour (Lk. 10:36). The answer is obvious.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 310, 16, 61, 'Religious people, sometimes, are very, very selfish. Jesus spoke here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 310, 17, 61, 'about a sin, which is again not listed in the Ten Commandments. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 310, 18, 61, 'the sin of selfishness. We have been looking, in our last two studies,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 310, 19, 61, 'about the sins that Jesus hated the most. What are the sins that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 310, 20, 61, 'hated the most? We saw, first of all, hypocrisy, and then we saw, pride,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 310, 21, 61, 'and here, we see another one, selfishness - thinking only about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 310, 22, 61, 'ourselves. You know, we can be very, very religious; religious enough to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 310, 23, 61, 'be a priest or a bishop or even an archbishop and still be thoroughly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 310, 24, 61, 'selfish. That priest, who was supposed to be representing God, all he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 310, 25, 61, 'was interested was in his religious ceremony and not helping the poor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 310, 26, 61, 'person in his need. When our life is like that, it does not bring us the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 310, 27, 61, 'approval of God. We can be very upright in a whole lot of external');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 310, 28, 61, 'things. We can think that God is very happy with us, because we do all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 311, 1, 61, 'those external things so correctly and that we have a good testimony');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 311, 2, 61, 'before men, and we keep very accurately the external rituals of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 311, 3, 61, 'religion. Maybe you are even an elder in your local church or a pastor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 311, 4, 61, 'or whatever it is, but if there is selfishness in your life, I want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 311, 5, 61, 'tell you, Jesus hates selfishness. He hates a life that is only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 311, 6, 61, 'interested in self.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 311, 7, 61, 'Now we are all born selfish by nature. We are not born thinking about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 311, 8, 61, 'others. Think of little children in our homes as they grow up. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 311, 9, 61, 'don''t automatically know how to share their toys with others. No, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 311, 10, 61, 'have to teach them that. Naturally speaking, they are selfish; they will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 311, 11, 61, 'fight for the best toy, the biggest toy, the biggest piece of cake in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 311, 12, 61, 'the plate and things like that. That is their nature. Only when we grow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 311, 13, 61, 'up, we don''t fight in such a crude way (for the biggest piece of cake),');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 311, 14, 61, 'but we still like it. Inwardly we haven''t changed; our selfishness is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 311, 15, 61, 'now more subtle. People don''t see it so obviously. And we seek it in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 311, 16, 61, 'cleverer ways.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 311, 17, 61, 'So, when we see selfishness as a sin just like the sins of hypocrisy and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 311, 18, 61, 'pride, we would realize that Jesus came to save us from our sin. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 311, 19, 61, 'Jesus hasn''t saved you from selfishness, what type of saviour is He? If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 311, 20, 61, 'he has saved you only from gambling and drunkenness, that is not much of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 311, 21, 61, 'a salvation, is it? Because, a lot of people out in the world have that,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 311, 22, 61, 'without Jesus Christ; they also do not gamble or drink. What does it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 311, 23, 61, 'prove? Many Christians are glorying in the fact that they don''t commit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 311, 24, 61, 'certain external sins. Then I can show you ten other people in the world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 311, 25, 61, 'who don''t commit those sins also, who don''t have Christ in their lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 311, 26, 61, 'So what type of salvation has this Christian experienced?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 311, 27, 61, 'That is why, we need to see this sin the way Jesus defined it, not just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 311, 28, 61, 'external, but inward primarily: Hypocrisy, as we saw first, then pride,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 312, 1, 61, 'and here selfishness. That means you see a person in need whom you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 312, 2, 61, 'help, but you are not bothered. You think only of yourself and your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 312, 3, 61, 'family. It could be in relation to salvation: ''Oh I am saved; my family');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 312, 4, 61, 'is saved; it doesn''t matter if anybody else is saved.'' Then I never seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 312, 5, 61, 'to be a witness of Christ to others. Think, my dear friend, you who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 312, 6, 61, 'born again, you who know there is no way of salvation outside of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 312, 7, 61, 'Christ. You know that there is no way to go into God''s kingdom except in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 312, 8, 61, 'repentance and faith in Jesus Christ. You know that being born in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 312, 9, 61, 'Christian family never takes you into God''s kingdom. You have to repent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 312, 10, 61, 'and accept Christ as your Saviour and Lord. You are saved and maybe your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 312, 11, 61, 'family members are saved too. Do you have any concern at all for all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 312, 12, 61, 'other people around you? I am not talking about people who are living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 312, 13, 61, '10000 miles away, whom you will never meet. No, I am talking about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 312, 14, 61, 'people you work with, your neighbours, your relatives, people whom you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 312, 15, 61, 'meet regularly, who are on their way into eternal hell. Are you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 312, 16, 61, 'concerned about them? Are you selfish?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 312, 17, 61, 'Selfishness is a sin - to be thinking only in terms of myself. Something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 312, 18, 61, 'is fundamentally wrong. If I say I have partaken in the God''s nature and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 312, 19, 61, 'I am still selfish, I am just deceiving myself, because God''s nature is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 312, 20, 61, 'totally unselfish. Why did Jesus come to earth? What have we seen in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 312, 21, 61, 'Jesus'' life? He was never interested in himself. He came entirely for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 312, 22, 61, 'the sake of others. The reason why many of us, Christians, are so poor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 312, 23, 61, 'spiritually, and not blessed by God, as we can be blessed, because this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 312, 24, 61, 'sin clings to us. Jesus once said these words in Acts 20:35,"It is more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 312, 25, 61, 'blessed to give than to receive." Those are words spoken by Jesus, not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 312, 26, 61, 'found in the gospels but Paul mentions it. "It is more blessed to give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 312, 27, 61, 'than to receive." The one who is always thinking of receiving is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 312, 28, 61, 'selfish man. The one who thinks of giving, he is a person who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 313, 1, 61, 'concerned about others. What does he give? He gives to someone in need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 313, 2, 61, 'what he himself has. It could be material things or it could be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 313, 3, 61, 'spiritual. Supposing I have received something spiritual from God that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 313, 4, 61, 'has radically changed my life. You know, immediately it places me in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 313, 5, 61, 'debt to everybody else. I have to give it to them that they haven''t got.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 313, 6, 61, 'Think of another story that Jesus spoke in Luke 16 about the rich man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 313, 7, 61, 'and Lazarus. There was this rich man who had plenty of everything in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 313, 8, 61, 'this world and who dressed royally and lived in grand style. At his gate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 313, 9, 61, 'was his brother Lazarus. Brother because every one of those Jews was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 313, 10, 61, 'child of Abraham. You read later on, after his death, that the rich man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 313, 11, 61, 'said, ''Father Abraham'' in Luke 16:24. He was a descendant of Abraham and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 313, 12, 61, 'so was Lazarus. In that sense, Lazarus was his brother and he did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 313, 13, 61, 'care. He went past that gate so many times and saw the dogs licking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 313, 14, 61, 'Lazarus'' sores and he never helped him one bit, just like the priest and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 313, 15, 61, 'the Levite. Finally, both of them died. Jesus said that the rich man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 313, 16, 61, 'went to hell. Why did he go to hell? Maybe he paid his tithes regularly,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 313, 17, 61, 'but he still went to hell. Maybe the great religious leaders of his time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 313, 18, 61, '- the priests and bishops came to his funeral and said that he was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 313, 19, 61, 'great man, but the man himself went to hell and Lazarus went to heaven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 313, 20, 61, 'Why did that rich man go to hell? - Because he did not have faith. How');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 313, 21, 61, 'do I know he did not have faith? James 2:14 says, if you have faith, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 313, 22, 61, 'proof of it is, it will be seen in your works. James further says, "If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 313, 23, 61, 'you say that you believe in God, and you see your brother or sister');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 313, 24, 61, 'without clothing and in need of daily food, and you just say, ''Praise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 313, 25, 61, 'the Lord and God bless you'' and you don''t give him what is necessary.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 313, 26, 61, 'What''s the use of that" (Js. 2:15, 16)? Such faith is dead (Js. 2:17).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 313, 27, 61, 'That is not living faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 313, 28, 61, 'Salvation is by faith and that rich man did not have faith. The proof of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 314, 1, 61, 'it was that there were no works. There was no concern for others. What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 314, 2, 61, 'God had given him, he thought, was his own. It was not his own. God had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 314, 3, 61, 'given him wealth so that he could help other people who are needy. Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 314, 4, 61, 'you know that everything we have is given by God? And it is given to us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 314, 5, 61, 'to see whether we would share it with others or just live selfishly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 314, 6, 61, 'ourselves. The same thing applies spiritually. Whatever God has given me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 314, 7, 61, 'spiritually, I am in debt to the rest of the world to share it with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 314, 8, 61, 'them, at least in the circle that I move. Jesus said, as I said earlier,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 314, 9, 61, 'it is more blessed to give than to receive. I have received something fr');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 314, 10, 61, 'o m God, that is good, I am blessed. But Jesus said that I would be more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 314, 11, 61, 'blessed if I give to another person that which I have received. If I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 314, 12, 61, 'give to another person, the message that saved my life, that forgave my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 314, 13, 61, 'sin, that brought me into victory or whatever it is, I will experience a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 314, 14, 61, 'greater blessing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 314, 15, 61, 'So if you want to have a greater blessing, I want to encourage you to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 314, 16, 61, 'listen to this word of Jesus - "It is more blessed to give than to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 314, 17, 61, 'receive." Because when you follow that word, you will find something you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 314, 18, 61, 'have never experienced so far in your life; the blessing that comes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 314, 19, 61, 'through giving. The Bible says the liberal man shall be made fat and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 314, 20, 61, 'one who waters others will be watered also himself. So let us learn to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 314, 21, 61, 'hate this sin of selfishness that Jesus hates and we shall find abundant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 314, 22, 61, 'life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 314, 23, 62, 'Chapter 62 Hatred');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 314, 24, 62, 'We want to continue on this subject, that is the most dangerous thing in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 314, 25, 62, 'our lives and that which is destroying us - sin, much worse than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 314, 26, 62, 'sickness. We have been looking at that in the last few studies and we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 314, 27, 62, 'want to go bit further on the issue.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 314, 28, 62, 'In this study we want to look at another sin that Jesus spoke about,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 315, 1, 62, 'which is not considered a sin by a lot of people in the world, and even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 315, 2, 62, 'by a lot of believers. In our last three studies, if you remember, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 315, 3, 62, 'looked at the sins that Jesus hated the most. We saw three of them so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 315, 4, 62, 'far: hypocrisy, pride, and selfishness. Now, in the world hypocrisy is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 315, 5, 62, 'not hated, pride is not hated, and selfishness is not hated. Everybody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 315, 6, 62, 'assumes that it is not serious. A man pretends, so what. Or a man is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 315, 7, 62, 'proud or selfish; everybody is like that, we say. So long as you keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 315, 8, 62, 'the Ten Commandments, the external good life, you are okay.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 315, 9, 62, 'Unfortunately, a lot of believers think like that too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 315, 10, 62, 'As a result, the lives of many believers are only external. There is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 315, 11, 62, 'nothing inward. They are saved only from the sins which are external,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 315, 12, 62, 'the things that people could be saved from, even under the law, before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 315, 13, 62, 'Jesus came. Under the law, people were saved from murder and adultery by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 315, 14, 62, 'the Ten Commandments. But by the law they couldn''t be saved from inward');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 315, 15, 62, 'sin, the really serious sins that are destroying us. In the first page');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 315, 16, 62, 'of the New Testament, as we have seen already, we read in Matthew 1:21,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 315, 17, 62, 'that Jesus means saviour, a person who will save you from your sins. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 315, 18, 62, 'so, as I said before, if you don''t understand what sin is, we will never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 315, 19, 62, 'understand what has Jesus come to save us from. He has come to save us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 315, 20, 62, 'from sin. But what is sin? Now we see it a little more clearly. Sin is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 315, 21, 62, 'pretending -being a hypocrite; He has come to save us from that. Sin is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 315, 22, 62, 'pride; Jesus has come to save us from every type of pride, physical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 315, 23, 62, 'pride, spiritual pride, intellectual pride. He has come to save us from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 315, 24, 62, 'selfishness - from thinking just about ourselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 315, 25, 62, 'In this study I want to speak to you about hatred. A lot of people do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 315, 26, 62, 'not think of hatred as sin. The New Testament says that "He who hates');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 315, 27, 62, 'his brother is a murderer" (1 Jn. 3:15). It is as serious as that. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 315, 28, 62, 'you hate a person, it is equivalent to murdering him. Maybe you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 316, 1, 62, 'have the opportunity to murder him. Maybe you are afraid that if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 316, 2, 62, 'murder him, you will get caught. You wouldn''t mind somebody else killing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 316, 3, 62, 'him or his having some misfortune. That is how you know whether you hate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 316, 4, 62, 'a person or not. Sometimes we may say, ''Well I don''t hate anybody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 316, 5, 62, 'really.'' But just ask yourself this: s omebody who has done some harm to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 316, 6, 62, 'you, or to your family, maybe some relative has cheated you, maybe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 316, 7, 62, 'somebody has done some real harm to you, maybe somebody spoilt your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 316, 8, 62, 'reputation, or pushed you down in your job, maybe your boss, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 316, 9, 62, 'landlord, or someone who has done some harm to you, and you say, ''Yeah I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 316, 10, 62, 'have forgiven him.'' But when you hear that some calamity happened to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 316, 11, 62, 'him, do you feel a little happy? If you feel happy, you know what that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 316, 12, 62, 'shows? That shows that you really hate him. You will never be happy when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 316, 13, 62, 'a calamity comes on your son or daughter, or someone you love. You can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 316, 14, 62, 'never be happy when a calamity or accident, or misfortune comes to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 316, 15, 62, 'somebody you love.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 316, 16, 62, 'Why are you happy when it happens to that person whom you say you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 316, 17, 62, 'forgiven? No, it really proves that you hate him. Or, it could be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 316, 18, 62, 'another way. When you hear that something good happened to that man,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 316, 19, 62, 'that he got blessed in some way, got a promotion or something wonderful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 316, 20, 62, 'happened to him, and you feel a bit unhappy, what does that show? That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 316, 21, 62, 'also shows that you really hate that person. Would you be unhappy if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 316, 22, 62, 'something good happened to your son or daughter? If your son came first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 316, 23, 62, 'in the class, would you be unhappy? You would be unhappy if somebody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 316, 24, 62, 'else''s son comes first in the class. See when we are unhappy at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 316, 25, 62, 'blessing or good fortune or some happiness that comes to another person,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 316, 26, 62, 'it shows that you really don''t love that person, you hate him. So, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 316, 27, 62, 'see hatred is pretty deeply entrenched in our hearts, and we fool');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 316, 28, 62, 'ourselves by saying we don''t have it. You say you are not bitter against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 317, 1, 62, 'a person, but the test is this: are you happy when something bad happens');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 317, 2, 62, 'to him? Are you unhappy when something good happens to him? Then you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 317, 3, 62, 'bitter. You might as well face up to it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 317, 4, 62, 'This is like a scan that the Bible gives of your heart. You know, in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 317, 5, 62, 'hospital, nowadays, they give you a scan to take a picture of what is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 317, 6, 62, 'inside your body, which you cannot see. And when the doctor looks at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 317, 7, 62, 'scan, he says, ''Listen, there is something wrong with you, there is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 317, 8, 62, 'tumour there, there is a cancer there.'' You may say, ''Well, I feel okay,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 317, 9, 62, 'I don''t feel there is anything wrong.'' Maybe you don''t feel it, but here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 317, 10, 62, 'is a scan that shows that there is a tumour and you better remove it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 317, 11, 62, 'whether you feel good or not. Otherwise, it will kill you. I want to say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 317, 12, 62, 'to you that this is a scan of your heart''s condition. When you are happy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 317, 13, 62, 'with somebody else''s misfortune, the scan says you have a tumour. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 317, 14, 62, 'better remove it. It is a tumour called bitterness, an unforgiving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 317, 15, 62, 'attitude. All these things are children of hatred. Hatred has many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 317, 16, 62, 'children: bitterness, jealousy, anger, these are all children that come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 317, 17, 62, 'out of the mother called hatred, and an unforgiving attitude. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 317, 18, 62, 'manifestation is, as I said earlier, that you are happy when something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 317, 19, 62, 'bad happens to somebody else or you are unhappy when something good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 317, 20, 62, 'happens to somebody else. We must be sensitive. Jesus has come to save');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 317, 21, 62, 'us from that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 317, 22, 62, 'You see God is love. The Bible says that again and again. If God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 317, 23, 62, 'love, tell me the answer to this question. What is Satan? Even a child');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 317, 24, 62, 'can answer that one. What is the opposite of love - Hatred? If God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 317, 25, 62, 'full of love, what is Satan full of - Hatred? When you have hatred in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 317, 26, 62, 'your heart, how do you know that you have it? Well, these children are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 317, 27, 62, 'being born through you: bitterness, jealousy, an unforgiving attitude.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 317, 28, 62, 'What does it prove? It proves that you are in fellowship with Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 318, 1, 62, 'whether you know it or not. These things are so deeply entrenched in us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 318, 2, 62, 'that it is impossible for us to be saved from it, unless Jesus saves us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 318, 3, 62, 'Do you know that salvation from hatred is impossible? You can control');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 318, 4, 62, 'your anger, you can control your bitterness and keep it inside. But that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 318, 5, 62, 'is just like being constipated. You have all that rubbish inside but it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 318, 6, 62, 'doesn''t mean you are clean. What is the use of keeping the anger inside');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 318, 7, 62, 'and not being cleansed? Or keeping the jealousy inside and saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 318, 8, 62, '''Well, I don''t manifest it outwardly.'' It is still there within. If the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 318, 9, 62, 'sickness is within, it will still kill you, even if there is no external');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 318, 10, 62, 'symptom. And who knows whether it is within you or not? - You yourself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 318, 11, 62, 'Nobody else may know whether it is within or not, but you know very well');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 318, 12, 62, 'whether it is there within you or not.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 318, 13, 62, 'That is why we have to be extremely careful, whenever we detect a wrong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 318, 14, 62, 'attitude towards somebody within. It is usually towards people who have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 318, 15, 62, 'harmed us in some way in the past. Jesus spoke about that man who caught');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 318, 16, 62, 'another person by the throat, because he owed him a little bit of money,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 318, 17, 62, 'but he himself had been forgiven so much by the king. He didn''t cleanse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 318, 18, 62, 'that wrong attitude in his heart and the result was that he finally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 318, 19, 62, 'ended up in jail having to pay back to the king that entire large amount');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 318, 20, 62, 'that he owed. Jesus was teaching there to be careful about a little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 318, 21, 62, 'wrong attitude towards another person. Do you have an attitude where you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 318, 22, 62, 'are trying to catch somebody by the throat because you feel he owes you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 318, 23, 62, 'something? Yeah, be careful there. It is not a question of cutting off');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 318, 24, 62, 'the fruit; it is a question of making the tree good. You know Jesus said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 318, 25, 62, 'make the tree good. Don''t just cut off the fruit and put some good fruit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 318, 26, 62, 'hanging on the tree and fool people that you are a good person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 318, 27, 62, 'Remember what Jesus said: "Out of the heart proceeds evil thoughts "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 318, 28, 62, '(Mat. 15:18). What are the things that proceed from the heart - "Evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 319, 1, 62, 'thoughts, murders, these are what defile the man" (Mat. 15:19). You have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 319, 2, 62, 'to cleanse your heart. In other words, the root of the disease, the root');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 319, 3, 62, 'of bitterness, the root of jealousy, the root of an unforgiving attitude');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 319, 4, 62, 'towards others, that is what needs to be cleansed, if you want to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 319, 5, 62, 'pure. That is what Jesus has come to save us from. As I said, it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 319, 6, 62, 'impossible to be free from it, but Jesus can do that for you. He has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 319, 7, 62, 'come to do what is humanly speaking impossible. He has come to save us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 319, 8, 62, 'from the sin of hatred.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 319, 9, 62, 'First of all we need to confess: ''Lord I thought I had forgiven that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 319, 10, 62, 'person, I haven''t really. I thought I had no hatred in my heart against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 319, 11, 62, 'people, but now I realize I do. I really want to be free. I want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 319, 12, 62, 'partake of God''s nature, which is full of love. I want to have my heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 319, 13, 62, 'cleansed of every bit of hatred and all the children of hatred:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 319, 14, 62, 'bitterness, jealousy, everything. I want to have God''s nature within:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 319, 15, 62, 'one of love, overflowing in goodness, desiring good, desiring the very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 319, 16, 62, 'best for other people.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 319, 17, 62, 'There is a verse in the Sermon on the Mount where Jesus said, "Blessed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 319, 18, 62, 'are those who hunger and thirst for righteousness, for they will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 319, 19, 62, 'filled." They will be satisfied. If you have a tremendous longing in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 319, 20, 62, 'your heart for the life of God within you, to have love and to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 319, 21, 62, 'completely free from all hatred, you will find that God answers your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 319, 22, 62, 'prayer. It depends on your longing. It is not enough just to make a weak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 319, 23, 62, 'prayer, ''Yeah Lord I got a bit convicted today by what you said, yeah I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 319, 24, 62, 'know my attitude towards that person is not so good.'' That is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 319, 25, 62, 'enough. You won''t be free. You will be free only if you have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 319, 26, 62, 'tremendous longing to be free: ''Oh God this is an evil thing.'' Just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 319, 27, 62, 'think, if you discovered you have AIDS or leprosy, how you would long to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 319, 28, 62, 'be free. You would go from one doctor to another, one hospital to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 320, 1, 62, 'another, desperate to be free. When you have that type of desperation to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 320, 2, 62, 'be free from the sin of hatred and all of its manifestations, Jesus will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 320, 3, 62, 'set you free.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 320, 4, 63, 'Chapter 63 Unbelief');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 320, 5, 63, 'We shall continue looking at those seriously evil things that are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 320, 6, 63, 'destroying our inner life, which, sometimes, we may not even be aware');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 320, 7, 63, 'of. The word of God is like an x-ray machine or a scanning machine that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 320, 8, 63, 'shows us what our inside is really like.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 320, 9, 63, 'Let us turn today to Mark 4:37 where we read, once when Jesus was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 320, 10, 63, 'travelling in a boat across the lake with His disciples, there was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 320, 11, 63, 'fierce gale of storm and the waves breaking into the boat. The boat was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 320, 12, 63, 'filling up and they were going to sink. The disciples were scared while');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 320, 13, 63, 'Jesus was asleep in the boat. They woke Him up and Jesus rebuked the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 320, 14, 63, 'wind and the wind became still. They were afraid that they would perish.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 320, 15, 63, 'They asked Him, " Teacher, don''t you care that we are perishing." And He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 320, 16, 63, 'said to them, "Why are you so timid? How is it that you have no faith"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 320, 17, 63, '(Mk. 4:40)? Whenever we look at Jesus rebuking His disciples, we find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 320, 18, 63, 'Him reserving His strongest rebukes for one sin and that was unbelief.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 320, 19, 63, 'We have been looking at sins which Jesus hated the most; sins which are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 320, 20, 63, 'not considered sins by most people in the world - Hypocrisy, pride,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 320, 21, 63, 'selfishness, hatred, and to the list we can add unbelief. Now unbelief');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 320, 22, 63, 'is definitely not considered a sin by anybody in the world. The sad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 320, 23, 63, 'thing is, I think, 99% of believers, born again believers, also do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 320, 24, 63, 'consider unbelief as a sin. They think it as a weakness. ''Yeah, I don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 320, 25, 63, 'have enough faith, brother.'' It is like saying, ''Well, I am not able to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 320, 26, 63, 'lift so many kilos of weight. I am weak. My right hand is weak.'' Now if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 320, 27, 63, 'it were a weakness, it is not serious. No, it is serious because it is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 320, 28, 63, 'sin. Jesus rebuked it as a sin. In fact, it is such a serious sin that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 321, 1, 63, 'in the book of Hebrews we are given a warning: "Take care brethren, lest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 321, 2, 63, 'there should be in anyone of you (in you believers), there can be an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 321, 3, 63, 'evil unbelieving heart" (Heb. 3:12). It is clear that the reference is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 321, 4, 63, 'to believers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 321, 5, 63, 'What is an unbelieving heart called? An EVIL unbelieving heart! Now for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 321, 6, 63, 'an adulteress heart, we can understand, it being called an evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 321, 7, 63, 'adulteress heart. Jesus spoke about an evil and adulteress generation in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 321, 8, 63, 'Matthew 16. A murderer''s heart, we can say, as an evil murderer''s heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 321, 9, 63, 'Maybe even a selfish heart, we could be a little more sensitive, and say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 321, 10, 63, 'that a selfish heart is also an evil heart or a proud heart is an evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 321, 11, 63, 'heart. Maybe, if we have that much light, we can say a hypocritical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 321, 12, 63, 'heart is also an evil heart. Again, if we have greater light, a heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 321, 13, 63, 'full of hatred can also be said as an evil heart. But how many people,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 321, 14, 63, 'who have light on all these sins, would also say that an unbelieving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 321, 15, 63, 'heart is an evil heart? But that is exactly what it says here in Hebrews');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 321, 16, 63, '3:12. In fact, it can make you fall away from the living God altogether.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 321, 17, 63, 'That is how serious it is. An unbelieving heart can make you fall away');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 321, 18, 63, 'from the living God. And so, we see this is another sin that we need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 321, 19, 63, 'take seriously. Seven times Jesus rebuked His disciples for unbelief,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 321, 20, 63, 'including even after His resurrection. He was rebuking them only for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 321, 21, 63, 'unbelief. It is not that they had conquered their other sins in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 321, 22, 63, 'life. I am sure they were defeated by hundreds of sins. All those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 321, 23, 63, 'disciples were still seeking who was to be the greatest among them and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 321, 24, 63, 'many, many such things. But Jesus rebuked them only for unbelief.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 321, 25, 63, 'Now unbelief is a sin, because it is an insult to God. When God has said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 321, 26, 63, 'something and you don''t believe it, it is an insult to God. Supposing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 321, 27, 63, 'you are a student in the college and your father sent you a letter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 321, 28, 63, 'saying, ''Son, I have deposited 1000 rupees in your bank account for you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 322, 1, 63, 'to pay your fees.'' But you say, ''Well, I am not so sure whether dad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 322, 2, 63, 'really has put it. He may be bluffing me.'' Don''t you think that is an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 322, 3, 63, 'insult to your father? It certainly is. How much more then when God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 322, 4, 63, 'said something and you don''t believe it? Either we must say, ''No I don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 322, 5, 63, 'believe the Bible as the word of God.'' Then you are okay. Then you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 322, 6, 63, 'not insulting God because you don''t know what God has said. Supposing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 322, 7, 63, 'you are one of those people who believe that that there is no book in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 322, 8, 63, 'the world which is the word of God. There are people like that you know.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 322, 9, 63, 'They don''t believe the Bible is the word of God, and that the Bible is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 322, 10, 63, 'written by certain people who expressed their ideas. Such people are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 322, 11, 63, 'insulting God because they don''t have any understanding of what God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 322, 12, 63, 'said. But you, who are a believer, on one hand you say the Bible is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 322, 13, 63, 'word of God and on the other, you don''t believe what God has written');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 322, 14, 63, 'there. You are the one who has an evil heart of unbelief, that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 322, 15, 63, 'insulting God by saying, ''God said, but I don''t believe it.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 322, 16, 63, 'Do you believe when God says, "I will never leave you nor forsake you"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 322, 17, 63, '(Heb. 13:5-6), that He really means it, that he will never fail you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 322, 18, 63, 'never forsake you? Do you believe when it says in Romans 8:28, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 322, 19, 63, 'every single thing that happens in your life; every single thing, big or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 322, 20, 63, 'small, God makes it all work together for your good? All the evil other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 322, 21, 63, 'people do to you; God will make it work together for your good. Do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 322, 22, 63, 'believe that? If you believed it, it would change your whole attitude');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 322, 23, 63, 'towards your life. You wouldn''t hate that man for doing something evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 322, 24, 63, 'to you because that evil works for your good. Everything depends on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 322, 25, 63, 'faith. If you have faith, you find that you can overcome many other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 322, 26, 63, 'sins.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 322, 27, 63, 'The Bible says, "This is the victory that overcomes the world, even our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 322, 28, 63, 'faith." Why it is so many believers are afraid of the devil? I will tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 323, 1, 63, 'you why. It is because they don''t believe that he was defeated by Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 323, 2, 63, 'on the cross. If you believe God''s Word that, when Jesus died on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 323, 3, 63, 'cross, He made Satan powerless (Heb. 2:14), you wouldn''t be afraid of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 323, 4, 63, 'the devil. He didn''t kill the devil. No. The Bible is very exact. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 323, 5, 63, 'says here that He made the devil powerless. That means that he has no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 323, 6, 63, 'power over a child of God. If you believe that, you would never be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 323, 7, 63, 'afraid of the devil again. You would never be afraid of witchcraft. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 323, 8, 63, 'would never be afraid of anything. It all depends on faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 323, 9, 63, 'See faith and fear are opposites. You cannot have faith and fear living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 323, 10, 63, 'in the same heart. You can have one of the two. When faith comes in,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 323, 11, 63, 'fear goes out. It is like light. When you put on the light, the darkness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 323, 12, 63, 'goes out of the room. How can you have darkness and light co-existing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 323, 13, 63, 'anywhere? It is impossible. If you switch off the light, then the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 323, 14, 63, 'darkness takes over the room. In the same way, for fear to come in,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 323, 15, 63, 'faith has to go out. Why did the disciples get scared? They thought,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 323, 16, 63, '''Hey, we are dying, the boat is drowning now.'' You may find yourself in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 323, 17, 63, 'situations where it looks as if you are really going to sink and it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 323, 18, 63, 'looks as if Jesus is asleep. And you wonder, ''Lord ! don''t you care?'' It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 323, 19, 63, 'is a question that can often come from the heart of many people. ''Lord !');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 323, 20, 63, 'don''t you care for us? Don''t you understand what we are going through?''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 323, 21, 63, 'I want to tell you, He certainly does.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 323, 22, 63, 'In the book of Job, we read, "He knows the way that I take" (Job 23:10)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 323, 23, 63, 'or He knows the way it is with me, as the margin in NASB says. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 323, 24, 63, 'Living Bible paraphrase of it reads like this; "God knows every detail');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 323, 25, 63, 'of what is happening to me." He knows every detail of what is happening');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 323, 26, 63, 'to me! Do you believe that? Do you believe that all the minute details');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 323, 27, 63, 'of the problems you are facing in your life, God knows it? He certainly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 323, 28, 63, 'does. Jesus was trying to stir up faith in His own disciples and He said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 324, 1, 63, 'in Matthew 10, "Don''t be afraid." He further said, "You are of more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 324, 2, 63, 'value than many sparrows, and not one sparrow falls to the ground,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 324, 3, 63, 'anywhere on the earth, without your Father knowing about it" (Mat.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 324, 4, 63, '10:31). He also said "The very hairs on your head are all numbered." No');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 324, 5, 63, 'human being can ever count the number of hairs in his head. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 324, 6, 63, 'impossible, even if he has very little hair. It is impossible to count');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 324, 7, 63, 'the number of hairs on your head. But the Bible says that your heavenly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 324, 8, 63, 'Father knows the exact number of the hairs on your head.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 324, 9, 63, 'When you don''t trust Him, He is insulted. That is why unbelief is such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 324, 10, 63, 'terrible sin. When you think that God will harm you instead of caring');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 324, 11, 63, 'for you and protecting you, that is an insult to God. Supposing you went');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 324, 12, 63, 'to your little 4-year-old son''s room in the middle of the night, say at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 324, 13, 63, '2 AM, to see if he was sleeping soundly. But he is sitting up in the bed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 324, 14, 63, 'scared and you ask him, ''Son what is wrong with you?'' And if he replies,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 324, 15, 63, '''Daddy, I was afraid that in the middle of the night you would come and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 324, 16, 63, 'kill me or something like that,'' how would you feel as a father? My son');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 324, 17, 63, 'thinks I will harm him when he is asleep. How does God feel, as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 324, 18, 63, 'Father, when you think that He will harm you? That He won''t protect you?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 324, 19, 63, 'That the son has such fear?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 324, 20, 63, 'Unbelief is an insult to God. Faith honours God. The Bible says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 324, 21, 63, '"Without faith it is impossible to please Him." Unbelief is a sin. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 324, 22, 63, 'came to save us from sin. Let us remember these sins. From these sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 324, 23, 63, 'come many other sins, but let us remember these five: Hypocrisy, pride,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 324, 24, 63, 'selfishness, hatred, and unbelief. Ask Jesus to save you from all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 324, 25, 63, 'five.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 324, 26, 64, 'Chapter 64 Unforgiveness And Bitterness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 324, 27, 64, 'In this study we want to look at the way, in one way at least, in which,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 324, 28, 64, 'Satan seeks to find an entry into our life. You know that the devil is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 325, 1, 64, 'out to destroy us and, if we give him any slight entry into our life, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 325, 2, 64, 'any area, he is going to take over many other areas as well. So, we need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 325, 3, 64, 'to be careful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 325, 4, 64, 'Let us turn to 2 Corinthians 2:11. I want to give you a little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 325, 5, 64, 'background to what we are going to read here, so that we understand this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 325, 6, 64, 'verse. When Paul wrote the first letter to the Christians in Corinth, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 325, 7, 64, 'had heard that there were some serious sins in that church, that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 325, 8, 64, 'were not judged, and a particular man who was living in that sin was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 325, 9, 64, 'disciplined. So, Paul wrote concerning that to the Corinthians (in 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 325, 10, 64, 'Corinthians 5) and told them that the sin that particular man has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 325, 11, 64, 'committed was so serious that he needed to be put out of the church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 325, 12, 64, 'altogether. Yes, it is true. Some sins require that a man be disciplined');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 325, 13, 64, 'so severely, that he will be put out or excommunicated from the church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 325, 14, 64, 'altogether. That may sound harsh, but the purpose is to save his soul,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 325, 15, 64, 'and in this particular case, it did save his soul. Because, we read a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 325, 16, 64, 'little later, when Paul wrote the 2nd letter to the Corinthians, maybe a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 325, 17, 64, 'year later, you find that the man had repented.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 325, 18, 64, 'When he was put out of the church, he realized the seriousness of sin a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 325, 19, 64, 'little more. He realized how terrible it is to be out in the darkness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 325, 20, 64, 'without fellowship and that brought him to repentance. As long as he was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 325, 21, 64, 'sitting in the church and breaking bread, he never realized the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 325, 22, 64, 'seriousness of sin. Some people realize the seriousness of sin only when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 325, 23, 64, 'they are put out of the church. And, so also with this man and he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 325, 24, 64, 'realized it. But now what was happening was that some of these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 325, 25, 64, 'Corinthian believers, and elders perhaps, went to the other extreme. At');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 325, 26, 64, 'first, they were at one extreme where they tolerated sin and were first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 325, 27, 64, 'class compromisers. Now they went to the other extreme where they became');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 325, 28, 64, 'self-righteous Pharisees. They wouldn''t even accept this man, even after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 326, 1, 64, 'he had repented, had set matters right, given up on his sin, and had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 326, 2, 64, 'given every evidence of repentance. They still would not accept him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 326, 3, 64, 'So, Paul had to write to them again and he said in 2 Corinthians 2:10,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 326, 4, 64, '"Whom you forgive anything, I also forgive. For indeed what I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 326, 5, 64, 'forgiven, if I have forgiven anything, I did it for your sakes in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 326, 6, 64, 'presence of Christ." So, he says that this man has already suffered the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 326, 7, 64, 'punishment: "Sufficient for such a one is this punishment which was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 326, 8, 64, 'inflicted by the majority" (2 Cor. 2:6). What was the punishment? The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 326, 9, 64, 'punishment was that the people in the church would have no more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 326, 10, 64, 'fellowship with him. He experienced that now for a whole year. Now what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 326, 11, 64, 'should you do? You should forgive him and comfort him, lest somehow, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 326, 12, 64, 'be overwhelmed by excessive sorrow. So, he says forgive him now and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 326, 13, 64, 'receive him because he has really repented. Even though he had brought a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 326, 14, 64, 'bad name to the church in the past, since now he has repented, forgive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 326, 15, 64, 'him. Then Paul says these words, in verse 11; "In order that no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 326, 16, 64, 'advantage be taken of us by Satan for we are not ignorant of Satan''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 326, 17, 64, 'schemes."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 326, 18, 64, 'So, what do we see here? We see that, when you don''t forgive somebody,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 326, 19, 64, 'Satan can take advantage of you. That is the message we need to get from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 326, 20, 64, 'this passage. And he says, ''We are not ignorant of Satan''s scheme, so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 326, 21, 64, 'let me urge you, don''t be ignorant of Satan''s plan.'' We need to be more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 326, 22, 64, 'afraid of Satan as a deceiver, than as a persecutor. Satan may try to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 326, 23, 64, 'persecute us, but that won''t harm us as much as when he tries to deceive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 326, 24, 64, 'us. Satan is very, very subtle, very, very clever. He will nurse in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 326, 25, 64, 'heart, and take care that you keep in your heart, an unforgiving bitter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 326, 26, 64, 'attitude towards someone, so that he can finally destroy you. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 326, 27, 64, 'far more deep rooted than we imagine. The Bible speaks in Hebrews 12,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 326, 28, 64, 'about a root of bitterness that can cause trouble. You don''t have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 327, 1, 64, 'wait till it becomes fruit. You know what a root is. When a tree has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 327, 2, 64, 'started taking root, it is probably not even come up above the surface');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 327, 3, 64, 'of the ground. Nothing is visible. When you plant a seed in the ground,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 327, 4, 64, 'first of all it takes root before it comes up.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 327, 5, 64, 'Bitterness is like that. You sowed something in your heart and it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 327, 6, 64, 'beginning to take root. If you don''t pull it out, it is taking root and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 327, 7, 64, 'it will cause a lot of trouble. Not only that a lot of trouble to you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 327, 8, 64, 'first of all, but many other people can be defiled. Many people can get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 327, 9, 64, 'that infection, because the person who has bitterness in his heart will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 327, 10, 64, 'go around telling other people. It is like a person who has chicken pox');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 327, 11, 64, 'who goes around spreading it to others, or like a person with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 327, 12, 64, 'tuberculosis who goes around spreading it to others, or a person with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 327, 13, 64, 'cold going around giving it to others or the like. It is very easy to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 327, 14, 64, 'transmit this sickness. It is highly infectious. You find people who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 327, 15, 64, 'bitter everywhere in the world. You will find that Christendom is full');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 327, 16, 64, 'of it. When a man comes to you with a complaint against another, a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 327, 17, 64, 'gossiper who is talking evil of others, what does he have in his heart?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 327, 18, 64, 'He has bitterness against that person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 327, 19, 64, 'I want to say to you dear friends, if you want to save yourself from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 327, 20, 64, 'infection, be careful about whom you listen to. Would you like to get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 327, 21, 64, 'AIDS from somebody? Oh, how careful you are? Well, this is more serious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 327, 22, 64, 'than that. It can destroy you more than AIDS can. Would you like to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 327, 23, 64, 'embrace a man with leprosy? Well, this is more serious. Why do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 327, 24, 64, 'welcome and embrace a gossiper in your home; a backbiter? The Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 327, 25, 64, 'speaks (in 1 Timothy 5) about women who go from house to house,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 327, 26, 64, 'gossiping. There are lots of women like that in many of our churches. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 327, 27, 64, 'have no hesitation in saying that each of those women is an agent of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 327, 28, 64, 'Satan. You not only welcome them, you give them a cup of coffee or tea');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 328, 1, 64, 'and biscuits, and sit and listen to whatever Satan wants to tell you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 328, 2, 64, 'through them and you get defiled yourself. And then she goes to the next');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 328, 3, 64, 'house with her tale and you also go to somebody else''s house with this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 328, 4, 64, 'tale that you have heard. Satan is, thus, multiplying his agents by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 328, 5, 64, 'hundreds every day. Believers are doing his work for him in the church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 328, 6, 64, 'Satan is called the accuser of the brethren (Rev. 12:10). The one you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 328, 7, 64, 'are listening to, he/she who has come to your house, is an accuser of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 328, 8, 64, 'the brethren. What about you, are you an accuser of the brethren of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 328, 9, 64, 'believers? The point is not whether what you say is right or wrong. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 328, 10, 64, 'Bible says in Revelation 12:10, that, "Satan accuses the brothers before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 328, 11, 64, 'God." Now Satan may tell us, human beings, many, many lies. He is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 328, 12, 64, 'liar. But he will not dare to go and tell a lie to God. When Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 328, 13, 64, 'accuses you before God, what do you think he accuses you of? Do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 328, 14, 64, 'think he cooks up some story about something you never did and tries to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 328, 15, 64, 'bluff God with? No, Satan is not such a fool. What he will be telling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 328, 16, 64, 'God is what wrong you have actually done. He is watching your life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 328, 17, 64, 'pretty carefully and, when you have done something wrong, he goes to God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 328, 18, 64, 'and says, ''See, that is what this fellow did.'' It is not a lie; it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 328, 19, 64, '100% true. And the same thing he says about somebody else, ''See, what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 328, 20, 64, 'that fellow did over there.'' Again, it is a 100% truth. So we see that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 328, 21, 64, 'the accusations that Satan makes before God are all 100% true, not 90%');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 328, 22, 64, 'but 100% true.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 328, 23, 64, 'From that we learn another important thing. When somebody comes in and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 328, 24, 64, 'tells you a tale, even if there is no exaggeration in it, and it is 100%');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 328, 25, 64, 'true, that person can still be an accuser of the brethren. He is 100% in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 328, 26, 64, 'fellowship with Satan, who is the great accuser of the brethren. It says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 328, 27, 64, 'in that verse that, Satan does this day and night. He is a full-time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 328, 28, 64, 'worker, full-time accusing the brethren. He needs agents on earth. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 329, 1, 64, 'has got multitude of agents among the unbelievers who are his children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 329, 2, 64, 'and his servants. But he has a lot of agents among God''s children too;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 329, 3, 64, 'people who have some bitterness against somebody, people who haven''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 329, 4, 64, 'forgiven someone, who have a complaint against someone and who go around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 329, 5, 64, 'telling tales about that person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 329, 6, 64, 'That is why the Bible says in Colossians 3:13, "If anybody has a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 329, 7, 64, 'complaint against anyone, as the Lord forgave you, you should also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 329, 8, 64, 'forgive him." Anyone! Do you have a complaint against someone? Has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 329, 9, 64, 'someone done something wrong to you? Forgive. If you don''t forgive, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 329, 10, 64, 'will become an agent of Satan, very, very easily. You may think, ''No,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 329, 11, 64, 'no, no, I have forgiven.'' But the very fact that you go to someone and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 329, 12, 64, 'tell your tale of woe and make that person feel sorry for you, is an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 329, 13, 64, 'indication that, deep down in your heart, you haven''t forgiven that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 329, 14, 64, 'person at all. And who are you destroying? You may think you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 329, 15, 64, 'destroying that person''s reputation by spreading stories about him. Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 329, 16, 64, 'you know that, if that person loves God, and is whole-hearted, God will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 329, 17, 64, 'make even the evil that you do to him work for his good and sanctify');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 329, 18, 64, 'him? The one who is being destroyed is you. So, get rid of that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 329, 19, 64, 'Jesus prays for his children, for his brothers and sisters, who failed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 329, 20, 64, 'Satan accuses them. You can have a choice. Either fellowship with Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 329, 21, 64, 'and pray for them or fellowship with Satan and accuse them. I hope we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 329, 22, 64, 'will make the right choice at least from today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 329, 23, 65, 'Chapter 65 Lying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 329, 24, 65, 'In this study we shall look at a certain characteristic of the human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 329, 25, 65, 'race, which probably is the most widespread and which causes such a lot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 329, 26, 65, 'of destruction and damage in relationships. It is something we can never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 329, 27, 65, 'overcome without the help of God. But you can overcome it. Every human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 329, 28, 65, 'being falls into this sin. Only God can deliver him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 330, 1, 65, 'In John 8:44, Jesus said to the Jews who believed in Him, "You are of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 330, 2, 65, 'your father - the devil." It is really amazing to see Jesus speak such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 330, 3, 65, 'words to people who had apparently believed in Him (Jn. 8:30, 31). There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 330, 4, 65, 'is a belief in Jesus, which is intellectual. It still leaves a man as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 330, 5, 65, 'child of the devil. Of course, nowadays people are not bold enough to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 330, 6, 65, 'tell others that they are children of the devil, but not Jesus. He said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 330, 7, 65, '"You are of your father, the devil and you want to do the desires of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 330, 8, 65, 'your father." He wasn''t insulting them or cursing them. He was just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 330, 9, 65, 'telling them a fact, and showing them, how they could be delivered from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 330, 10, 65, 'that situation and become children of God. But they will never be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 330, 11, 65, 'delivered until they first faced up to the fact of what they were. Until');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 330, 12, 65, 'we acknowledge what we are, God cannot deliver us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 330, 13, 65, 'Jesus said, further in John 8:44, "The devil was a murderer from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 330, 14, 65, 'beginning and does not stand in the truth because there is no truth in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 330, 15, 65, 'him." Here is one characteristic of Satan: there is no truth in him at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 330, 16, 65, 'all and he does not stand in the truth. Then Jesus went on to say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 330, 17, 65, '"Whenever Satan speaks a lie, he speaks from his own nature, because he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 330, 18, 65, 'is a liar and the father of lies." So just like, in an earlier study, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 330, 19, 65, 'saw that God is love and Satan is hatred, in the same way, we see that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 330, 20, 65, 'Jesus said, ''I am the truth'' and devil is a liar. The devil does not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 330, 21, 65, 'stand in the truth and there is no truth in him. Whenever he speaks a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 330, 22, 65, 'lie, he speaks from his own nature. That is, his nature is to tell a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 330, 23, 65, 'lie, for he is a liar and the father of lies. All lies originate with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 330, 24, 65, 'Satan as the father. If you tell a lie, that lie is a child born through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 330, 25, 65, 'Satan being the father and you being the mother. You have given your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 330, 26, 65, 'heart and your tongue to Satan, at that time, to produce a child called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 330, 27, 65, 'a lie. God never fathers lies. That is why it is so important to learn,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 330, 28, 65, 'once we become Christians (believers), to always speak the truth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 331, 1, 65, 'Jesus said, concerning this matter, "Let your statement be, ''Yes, Yes''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 331, 2, 65, 'or ''No, No''; anything beyond these is of evil" (Mt. 5:37) He also said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 331, 3, 65, '"You should not swear. Don''t make an oath at all" (Mt. 5:34). You don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 331, 4, 65, 'need to make an oath because, when a man is making an oath, he puts his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 331, 5, 65, 'hand on the Bible or swears by God or heaven or something like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 331, 6, 65, 'What he is really saying? ''Well ! most of the time I tell lies, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 331, 7, 65, 'right now, I am speaking the truth because I am swearing.'' But Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 331, 8, 65, 'said, "You shouldn''t be like that. You should just speak the truth the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 331, 9, 65, 'whole time, that, you don''t need to swear at all." No statement made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 331, 10, 65, 'under oath should be more truthful than a statement made without oath.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 331, 11, 65, 'It should be the same. Anything beyond this is of evil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 331, 12, 65, 'What is the first thing God requires from us when we come to Him? It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 331, 13, 65, 'not perfection, it is not purity, it is not goodness, it is not love,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 331, 14, 65, 'and it is none of these things. There is only one thing God requires');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 331, 15, 65, 'from us when we come to Him, and that is honesty. In Jeremiah 3:13, 14');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 331, 16, 65, 'we read what the Lord is saying through His prophet, "Only acknowledge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 331, 17, 65, 'your iniquity, that you have transgressed against the Lord your God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 331, 18, 65, 'return and I am a master to you and I will take you and bring you to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 331, 19, 65, 'Zion." That is, I will bring you to the church if you will only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 331, 20, 65, 'acknowledge your in i quity. In other words, be honest. What did the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 331, 21, 65, 'woman caught in adultery have? Honesty! She had no other virtue. What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 331, 22, 65, 'about the thief who hung on the cross? He said, ''I deserve this.'' He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 331, 23, 65, 'acknowledged that he was a criminal deserving death. The other thief,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 331, 24, 65, 'the unrepentant thief, was not willing to acknowledge that. He told');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 331, 25, 65, 'Jesus, ''Get us down from this cross. We don''t deserve to die.'' He went');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 331, 26, 65, 'to hell, not because he was a criminal, but because he was dishonest.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 331, 27, 65, 'The other one, on the other side, was equally a criminal or perhaps a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 331, 28, 65, 'greater criminal than the one who went to hell, but he was honest. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 332, 1, 65, 'said, ''I deserve this'' and he went to paradise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 332, 2, 65, 'Paradise is not made for perfect people. It is made for honest people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 332, 3, 65, 'It is made for people who are willing to speak the truth. The first sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 332, 4, 65, 'mentioned in the Bible is lying. We get to read, in Genesis 3, about the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 332, 5, 65, 'first sin mentioned in the Bible, and that is not the sin Eve committed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 332, 6, 65, 'when she ate of the tree that God had forbidden. There is a sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 332, 7, 65, 'mentioned in Genesis 3 even before that, not committed by man but by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 332, 8, 65, 'Satan. When Satan came to Eve and asked her, ''Has God said, ''You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 332, 9, 65, 'shouldn''t eat of any of these trees?'' And the woman said, ''Well, God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 332, 10, 65, 'said, ''If you eat from this tree, which is in the middle of the garden,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 332, 11, 65, 'you will die." The serpent said in Genesis 3:4, ''You surely shall not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 332, 12, 65, 'die.'' That was a lie. That is the first lie and the first sin mentioned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 332, 13, 65, 'in the scriptures; you shall not die, you can disobey God but you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 332, 14, 65, 'not be punished for it, you will not go to hell. Sin does not have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 332, 15, 65, 'punishment. That was the lie with which Satan deceived Eve, and ever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 332, 16, 65, 'since, he has deceived the entire human race for thousands of years,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 332, 17, 65, 'even until today. There are preachers who comfort sinners in their sins.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 332, 18, 65, 'There are preachers who comfort believers in their sin, saying, ''You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 332, 19, 65, 'have accepted the Lord. You will go to heaven, no matter how much you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 332, 20, 65, 'sin.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 332, 21, 65, 'The Bible says in Ecclesiastes 8:11, "Because the sentence against an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 332, 22, 65, 'evil work is not executed quickly, therefore the hearts of the sons of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 332, 23, 65, 'men are fully given to do evil." It is because God does not punish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 332, 24, 65, 'immediately, people keep on living in sin. Therefore, the devil says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 332, 25, 65, '''You''re not going to be punished. Look at all these other people around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 332, 26, 65, 'you. Look at these sins they commit. Look at the believers who do so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 332, 27, 65, 'many wrong things and they get away with it.'' They haven''t got away with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 332, 28, 65, 'it. God''s punishment, His judgment has not yet come. That is all. So,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 333, 1, 65, 'there is a lie with which Satan is fooling people all over: you can sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 333, 2, 65, 'and you will not suffer. The Bible says that, "If you live according to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 333, 3, 65, 'the flesh, you will surely die" (Rom. 8:13). But Satan says, ''No, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 333, 4, 65, 'will not die. God is merciful. God is gracious. You have asked Jesus to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 333, 5, 65, 'come into your life. So, even if you live according to flesh, you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 333, 6, 65, 'not die.'' That is a deception. If you live according to the flesh you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 333, 7, 65, 'will die. There is no doubt about it at all. If Satan is a liar, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 333, 8, 65, 'seeks to transmit that nature to his children. And it is very easy for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 333, 9, 65, 'believer to be infected with that too. Whenever you tell a lie, you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 333, 10, 65, 'offering yourself to Satan to father one more child.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 333, 11, 65, 'The last sin mentioned in the Bible is in Revelation 22:15. There it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 333, 12, 65, 'says about those who will be outside the city of God in the final day:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 333, 13, 65, '"Everyone who loves and practices a lie will be outside the kingdom."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 333, 14, 65, 'Have you ever noticed this before, that, the first sin and the last sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 333, 15, 65, 'mentioned in the Bible is telling a lie? Lying is a very serious thing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 333, 16, 65, 'Lying to God, lying to people and every lie is fathered by Satan. Peter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 333, 17, 65, 'said to Ananias, "Why have you lied to the Holy Spirit?" That is why he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 333, 18, 65, 'was killed. The first sin judged in the early church was lying. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 333, 19, 65, 'extremely serious. And that is why, as parents, one of the most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 333, 20, 65, 'important things we must teach our children is to stop telling lies. Our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 333, 21, 65, 'children are born with our nature. They tell lies from birth. Unless we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 333, 22, 65, 'show them how serious it is, unless they can see it in our lives they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 333, 23, 65, 'won''t learn. They need to see, as parents, we take speaking the truth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 333, 24, 65, 'very seriously, that, if we say something we will do it. If we promised');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 333, 25, 65, 'to do something for our children, we need to keep our word or explain to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 333, 26, 65, 'them if some other circumstances came up that prevented us from doing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 333, 27, 65, 'it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 333, 28, 65, 'Telling the truth is a quality, a virtue. We have to battle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 334, 1, 65, 'whole-heartedly, if we want to acquire it. The Holy Spirit is the spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 334, 2, 65, 'of truth. If you want to be truthful, you have to ask the Holy Spirit to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 334, 3, 65, 'fill you and to mortify this lying habit in all your speech. If we do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 334, 4, 65, 'that, we will find that God gives us discernment on the lies which Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 334, 5, 65, 'seeks to deceive us with.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 334, 6, 66, 'Chapter 66 Don’t Believe Satan’s Lies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 334, 7, 66, 'In this study we want to consider something about deception. In our last');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 334, 8, 66, 'study, we thought about lying , and deception is closely related to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 334, 9, 66, 'that. We can be saved from a lot of problems in our life if we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 334, 10, 66, 'identify Satan''s deception.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 334, 11, 66, 'Let us turn to 2 Thessalonians 2. Here we read about a world ruler who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 334, 12, 66, 'is going to come up to dominate the world in the last days, and he is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 334, 13, 66, 'going to be an instrument in Satan''s hands. And he is going to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 334, 14, 66, 'supported with supernatural powers from Satan. We read here that many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 334, 15, 66, 'people are going to be deceived. "The one who is coming is in accord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 334, 16, 66, 'with the activity of Satan, with all power and signs and false wonders');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 334, 17, 66, 'and with all the deception of wickedness for those who perish because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 334, 18, 66, 'they did not receive the love of the truth, so as to be saved. For this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 334, 19, 66, 'reason, God will send on them a deluding influence so that they might');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 334, 20, 66, 'believe what is false, in order that they may be judged who did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 334, 21, 66, 'believe the truth, but took pleasure in wickedness" (2 Thes. 2:9-12).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 334, 22, 66, 'So, there we see how Satan is going to deceive people in the last days.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 334, 23, 66, 'Again, we read in another verse that "The Spirit speaks explicitly that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 334, 24, 66, 'in the latter times, some will fall away from the faith paying attention');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 334, 25, 66, 'to deceitful spirits and doctrines of demons" (1 Tim. 4:1).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 334, 26, 66, 'Why does God allow spirits that deceive, to come into the midst of His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 334, 27, 66, 'people, to the point where it says here, some will fall away from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 334, 28, 66, 'faith? We need to understand the reason for that. Heaven is a place of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 335, 1, 66, 'truthfulness. Jesus is the truth. His Spirit is the Spirit of truth. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 335, 2, 66, 'is the God of truth. God has to separate among those who claim to be His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 335, 3, 66, 'children; those who speak the truth and those who tell lies. He uses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 335, 4, 66, 'many circumstances, many situations, and deceiving spirits as well, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 335, 5, 66, 'separate these two groups. There are so-called believers who would tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 335, 6, 66, 'lies when they can make some profit out of it and get some benefit from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 335, 7, 66, 'it for themselves. There are other believers who will not tell a lie');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 335, 8, 66, 'under any circumstances, whatever the price they have to pay. These two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 335, 9, 66, 'categories of people cannot be put together. They sit together in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 335, 10, 66, 'church building today but they will not sit together in heaven. God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 335, 11, 66, 'going to separate between those who love the truth and those who do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 335, 12, 66, 'love the truth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 335, 13, 66, 'Now one would think that everyone, who claims to be a Christian, loves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 335, 14, 66, 'the truth but it is not so. And only a person who is truthful; one who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 335, 15, 66, 'loves the truth and seeks to be upright in this area of truthfulness,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 335, 16, 66, 'will, in every area of his life, be protected from the deception of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 335, 17, 66, 'Satan, the liar. One of the first areas in which Satan seeks to deceive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 335, 18, 66, 'people is by preventing them from having any assurance of their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 335, 19, 66, 'salvation. I know in my own life, how it took me a number of years, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 335, 20, 66, 'be sure that I was saved. I had accepted the Lord Jesus as my saviour');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 335, 21, 66, 'and had asked Him to come into my heart, perhaps a hundred times,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 335, 22, 66, 'between the ages of 13 and 19. I don''t know when He actually came; I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 335, 23, 66, 'don''t even know the date. I was always unsure: am I saved or am I not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 335, 24, 66, 'saved? And then one day, I read a verse in John 6:37, where Jesus says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 335, 25, 66, '"Him that comes to me, I will never cast out." And I could say, ''Well,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 335, 26, 66, 'Lord, I have certainly come to you, at least a hundred times, if not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 335, 27, 66, 'more. Today I am going to believe you that you did not cast me out.'' Now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 335, 28, 66, 'that was probably true long before that day, but I believed it only that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 336, 1, 66, 'day and then I got assurance of salvation. And once I got that assurance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 336, 2, 66, 'of salvation, it has never left me. It hasn''t left me for 39 years now.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 336, 3, 66, 'God''s word is the truth and, if I believe God''s word, it will deliver me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 336, 4, 66, 'from all the lies of Satan. Satan tried to tell me for so long that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 336, 5, 66, 'was not a child of God, but God''s word, with the witness of the Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 336, 6, 66, 'within my heart, assured me that I was.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 336, 7, 66, 'The second thing Satan tries to do is, tell you a lie that God hasn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 336, 8, 66, 'forgiven all your past sins. He has forgiven most of them perhaps, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 336, 9, 66, 'some of those really serious sins you committed, they are not forgiven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 336, 10, 66, 'There are so many believers who live under condemnation because they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 336, 11, 66, 'believe this deception, the lie of the devil. Don''t believe him. He is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 336, 12, 66, 'liar! The Bible says in 1 John 1:7, "If we walk in the light (and that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 336, 13, 66, 'means we are honest before God), the blood of Jesus cleanses us from all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 336, 14, 66, 'sins." Every sin is cleansed away by the blood, when we come into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 336, 15, 66, 'light and acknowledge our failure and our sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 336, 16, 66, 'So, the third way you find that Satan seeking to deceive is, to tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 336, 17, 66, 'people that even if God forgave you, every time He looks at you, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 336, 18, 66, 'still remembers all those terrible things you did against Him. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 336, 19, 66, 'another lie. You shouldn''t believe Satan. He is a liar. In Hebrews 8:12,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 336, 20, 66, 'the Lord says, "I will be merciful to their inequities. I will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 336, 21, 66, 'remember their sins anymore." I had this problem for at least a couple');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 336, 22, 66, 'of years after I had assurance of my salvation. I thought, ''Yeah, well,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 336, 23, 66, 'I know God has forgiven me but I am not too sure whether He still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 336, 24, 66, 'remembers all those things I did and holds that against me,'' until one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 336, 25, 66, 'day, I believed this verse in Hebrews 8:12 - I will not remember their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 336, 26, 66, 'sins anymore. And I said, ''Lord I believe that. That not a single sin I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 336, 27, 66, 'have ever done in my life, you will remember.'' He doesn''t hold a single');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 336, 28, 66, 'thing that you have done against Him. When He looks at you, it is as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 337, 1, 66, 'though you have never sinned. That is, if you had been honest with God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 337, 2, 66, 'in the first place.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 337, 3, 66, 'We read about Satan tempting Jesus. It is quite amazing to see when this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 337, 4, 66, 'happened. We read in Matthew 3:17, the voice from heaven came at Jesus''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 337, 5, 66, 'baptism saying, "This is My beloved son in whom I am well pleased."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 337, 6, 66, 'Immediately after that, Jesus went into the wilderness and the devil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 337, 7, 66, 'tempted Him. The first thing the devil said was, "If you are the son of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 337, 8, 66, 'God," questioning the voice of God that came from heaven! The voice had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 337, 9, 66, 'said very clearly, "This is my beloved son," and the devil says, "Are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 337, 10, 66, 'you really? - if you are the son of God...". This type of temptation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 337, 11, 66, 'also comes to us as the children of God. The Holy Spirit has come giving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 337, 12, 66, 'us an assurance that we are God''s children and we call God our Father.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 337, 13, 66, 'But the devil comes to us and says, ''Are you really?'' What are you going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 337, 14, 66, 'to believe now; those feelings that the devil gives you or God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 337, 15, 66, 'unchangeable word? Feelings will come and feelings will go and every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 337, 16, 66, 'feeling is deceiving. But God''s word is unchanging. That is where we put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 337, 17, 66, 'our faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 337, 18, 66, 'The devil seeks to make us feel condemned by so many lies like this. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 337, 19, 66, 'tells us that we are accepted by God on the basis of our works. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 337, 20, 66, 'another lie. We are not accepted by God on the basis of our works. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 337, 21, 66, 'are accepted by God on the basis of our repentance and faith in Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 337, 22, 66, 'We are accepted by God in Christ. What do I mean by this? Supposing one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 337, 23, 66, 'morning, you didn''t get time to read the Bible and you rush off to work.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 337, 24, 66, 'Are you going to have an accident that day? The devil will tell you that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 337, 25, 66, 'you might. That is superstition; it is a lie. I am not accepted by God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 337, 26, 66, 'because I read the Bible in the morning. The only thing that can break');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 337, 27, 66, 'my fellowship with God is conscious sin, where I have deliberately');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 337, 28, 66, 'disobeyed God in some area where He made His will clear to me. If I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 338, 1, 66, 'deliberately sinned, then my fellowship with God is broken, but not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 338, 2, 66, 'otherwise. Maybe I didn''t get time to read the Bible or maybe I didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 338, 3, 66, 'pray and I went off to work. If my conscience is clear, that is, as far');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 338, 4, 66, 'as I know I am not consciously sinning, my fellowship with God is clear.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 338, 5, 66, 'I can read the scriptures later on in the day. I am not going to have an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 338, 6, 66, 'accident. We must not believe all these lies that the devil says.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 338, 7, 66, 'Think of the lies that the devil tells us in relation to the future.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 338, 8, 66, 'What is anxiety? Anxiety is the result of all the lies the devil tells');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 338, 9, 66, 'us, which are going to happen to us in the future. I think it is true to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 338, 10, 66, 'say that 99% of the things that we worry about never take place. Think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 338, 11, 66, 'of the things you worried about in past years. They haven''t taken place');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 338, 12, 66, 'in your life. But you worried about them, got anxious and wasted a lot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 338, 13, 66, 'of time, perhaps a lot of sleep as well, but none of those evil things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 338, 14, 66, 'which you thought might happen, have happened, except maybe 1%. Have you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 338, 15, 66, 'realized how much time and energy - emotional energy you wasted in past');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 338, 16, 66, 'years, worrying about things that were never going to take place? Who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 338, 17, 66, 'did that? Who caused all that anxiety and worry in your mind? That was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 338, 18, 66, 'Satan. He was the one who kept on telling you about this thing and that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 338, 19, 66, 'thing and the other thing that might happen to you, or to your children,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 338, 20, 66, 'or your wife.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 338, 21, 66, 'Let us make a decision today that we are not going to let the devil fool');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 338, 22, 66, 'us anymore. We are going to love the truth and we are going to expose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 338, 23, 66, 'the deception and lies of Satan.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 338, 24, 67, 'Chapter 67 Anger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 338, 25, 67, 'Once again, we are going to look at a certain characteristic of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 338, 26, 67, 'human race that is so widespread across the world, among people of all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 338, 27, 67, 'temperaments, nations, races and cultures, something that reaps havoc');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 338, 28, 67, 'and destruction in homes and everywhere, and how God can deliver us from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 339, 1, 67, 'it. I am talking about anger.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 339, 2, 67, 'In a previous study we saw how we give Satan an opportunity in our life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 339, 3, 67, 'if we don''t forgive someone; an opportunity to get a foothold in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 339, 4, 67, 'life to destroy us. The Bible says another thing that gives the devil an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 339, 5, 67, 'opportunity in our life is anger. Ephesians 4:26-27 says, "Be angry but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 339, 6, 67, 'don''t sin... and don''t let the sun go down on your anger and don''t give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 339, 7, 67, 'the devil an opportunity." There is an anger that is sinful, and there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 339, 8, 67, 'is an anger that is not sinful. We read in Mark 3, when Jesus went into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 339, 9, 67, 'the synagogue, there was a man with a withered hand and the Pharisees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 339, 10, 67, 'were watching Jesus to see if He would to heal him on the Sabbath day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 339, 11, 67, 'When Jesus saw the lack of compassion on the part of these Pharisees, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 339, 12, 67, 'read, "He looked around at them with anger, grieved at their hardness of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 339, 13, 67, 'heart" (Mk. 3:5). He didn''t lose control of Himself. If He had lost');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 339, 14, 67, 'control of Himself, He would not have been grieved. He had grief and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 339, 15, 67, 'anger at these people. Jesus was angry when He saw the moneychangers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 339, 16, 67, 'making money in the name of religion in the temple. He drove them out.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 339, 17, 67, 'Again, He did not lose control of Himself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 339, 18, 67, '"The spirit filled man is full of self-control" (Gal. 5:24). He does not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 339, 19, 67, 'lose control of himself, but he may be angry when he sees people, like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 339, 20, 67, 'the Pharisees, lacking compassion for poor suffering people or when he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 339, 21, 67, 'sees people making money in the name of religion. Such anger, where it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 339, 22, 67, 'concerns the glory of God and the good of other people, is not sin. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 339, 23, 67, 'anger that concerns ourselves; angry because somebody cheated me or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 339, 24, 67, 'somebody inconvenienced me or somebody disturbed my plans or made things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 339, 25, 67, 'difficult for me, or hurt me, all such anger is sin. When they slapped');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 339, 26, 67, 'Jesus on the face and pulled out the hair from His beard, He never got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 339, 27, 67, 'angry. He never said anything. He forgave them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 339, 28, 67, 'So when it says be angry but don''t sin, we need to recognize what type');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 340, 1, 67, 'of anger is sin and what type isn''t. Anger that has got nothing to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 340, 2, 67, 'with us, but only with the glory of God and the good of others, it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 340, 3, 67, 'righteous anger. But anger, because of anything connected with us, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 340, 4, 67, 'way somebody treats me or hurts me, whatever it is, it is always sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 340, 5, 67, 'Then it goes on to say (Eph. 4:26), if you do sin in this way, make sure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 340, 6, 67, 'your anger doesn''t stay with you for more than 12 hours. God recognizes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 340, 7, 67, 'that a lot of believers are not going to have victory over anger,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 340, 8, 67, 'because they are not wholehearted enough. If they were wholehearted,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 340, 9, 67, 'they would have victory over anger, the wrong type of anger. Because He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 340, 10, 67, 'knows that there are a lot of people who will not choose God''s best, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 340, 11, 67, 'offers them a second best for their salvation. He says, "Just make sure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 340, 12, 67, 'the sun doesn''t set over your anger."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 340, 13, 67, 'In those days, the day was divided into two parts, day and night in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 340, 14, 67, 'different way that it is now. Day was 6 o''clock in the morning till 6');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 340, 15, 67, 'o''clock in the evening or sunset, and night was from sunset to sunrise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 340, 16, 67, 'next morning. So, when it says here, don''t let the sun go down on your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 340, 17, 67, 'anger, what it basically means is, don''t go to sleep with your anger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 340, 18, 67, 'unresolved or unsettled. In those days, without electricity, people went');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 340, 19, 67, 'to sleep in the sunset and woke up at sunrise. So, the word for us today');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 340, 20, 67, 'is, don''t go to bed with some unresolved, unsettled anger still there in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 340, 21, 67, 'your heart. How careful people are to brush their teeth before they go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 340, 22, 67, 'to bed? Many people are careful just to ensure that leftover particles');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 340, 23, 67, 'of food don''t stay within the teeth and destroy their teeth. How much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 340, 24, 67, 'more careful we should be to make sure that some leftover bitterness or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 340, 25, 67, 'anger is not still there in our hearts, not cleansed away, when we go to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 340, 26, 67, 'sleep with that? This means that a husband and wife, even if they had a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 340, 27, 67, 'disagreement or a tension between them during the day, should settle it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 340, 28, 67, 'before they go to bed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 341, 1, 67, 'Very, very few believers, husband and wives, obey this exhortation. Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 341, 2, 67, 'you lose your temper, do you get angry? Well, seek to overcome it. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 341, 3, 67, 'until you do, make sure of one thing, that, at least, you settle the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 341, 4, 67, 'matter before you go to sleep. That is the absolute outer limit. Don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 341, 5, 67, 'go beyond that. What shall we say then about believers who carry anger,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 341, 6, 67, 'bitterness, and hatred in their heart against others for days, months,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 341, 7, 67, 'and years? We have to say they have no fear of God; no respect for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 341, 8, 67, 'word of God. When you let anger to stay in your heart, "You give the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 341, 9, 67, 'devil an opportunity" (Eph. 4:27). You are giving the devil a foothold');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 341, 10, 67, 'in your life to destroy you, to control you, and to do something in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 341, 11, 67, 'life to bring confusion. Don''t give the devil an opportunity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 341, 12, 67, 'When you turn back to the beginning of the Bible, after Adam and Eve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 341, 13, 67, 'were thrown out of the Garden of Eden, we read that they had two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 341, 14, 67, 'children. They were not the only two, there were many others, but two of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 341, 15, 67, 'them are mentioned here, Cain and Abel. They both came and offered an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 341, 16, 67, 'offering to God. Abel offered a lamb and Cain offered some vegetables.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 341, 17, 67, 'The Lord accepted Abel and his offering (Gen. 4:4) but He did not accept');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 341, 18, 67, 'Cain. There we read of the first sin mentioned after man left the Garden');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 341, 19, 67, 'of Eden. No doubt Adam and others committed many sins before that, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 341, 20, 67, 'the first sin mentioned in the Bible, after man got out of Eden, is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 341, 21, 67, 'anger. Cain became very angry and his countenance fell. You know, when a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 341, 22, 67, 'man is angry, you can see it in his face. He can''t hide it. God has made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 341, 23, 67, 'our face in such a way that if you are angry, everybody will know it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 341, 24, 67, 'And the Lord said to him, ''Why are you angry? Why is your face like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 341, 25, 67, 'this? If you also do well and intend well, don''t you think your face');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 341, 26, 67, 'would be lifted up - you will be cheerful and not angry?'' Cain did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 341, 27, 67, 'listen. Because he didn''t listen to God, when God tried to warn him, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 341, 28, 67, 'went out and became a murderer. The Lord had said to him, "Sin is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 342, 1, 67, 'crouching at your door. It desires you - sin desires to have you. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 342, 2, 67, 'you must master it" (Gen. 4:7). That is the first place in the Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 342, 3, 67, 'where you hear about victory over sin preached by God himself. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 342, 4, 67, 'preached the first message on victory over sin. Sin desires you but you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 342, 5, 67, 'must master it, you must overcome it. There we see the importance of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 342, 6, 67, 'dealing with anger as soon as it comes and God warns us, even today,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 342, 7, 67, 'through the Holy Spirit. But Cain didn''t listen. When you don''t listen,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 342, 8, 67, 'sin just grows like a cancer. If you don''t cut it out, it will be worse.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 342, 9, 67, 'And it finally became so bad he went and killed his brother.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 342, 10, 67, 'So, there we see how anger came out of jealousy. Here was Cain. He saw');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 342, 11, 67, 'God blessing Abel and he couldn''t stand it, particularly because Abel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 342, 12, 67, 'was younger. Are you jealous of someone, younger than you, being blessed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 342, 13, 67, 'mightily by the Lord? What is your attitude towards him? Do you rejoice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 342, 14, 67, 'like you should, if you are the member of the same body, or are you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 342, 15, 67, 'jealous that God is using him and not you? If so, you are evil. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 342, 16, 67, 'jealousy will lead to anger and you never know what the final result');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 342, 17, 67, 'will be. We read another example in 1 Samuel 18. It was a time when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 342, 18, 67, 'David had killed Goliath and all the women came out of the cities of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 342, 19, 67, 'Israel dancing and singing and saying, "Saul has slain his thousands and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 342, 20, 67, 'David his ten thousands ! " (1 Sam. 18:7). And just like it is said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 342, 21, 67, 'about Cain, it says about Saul, a man whom God had once chosen to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 342, 22, 67, 'king that he became very angry, and eventually an evil spirit possessed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 342, 23, 67, 'him because he allowed this anger to go beyond limits. He was angry out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 342, 24, 67, 'of jealousy. He said, "They have ascribed ten thousands to David, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 342, 25, 67, 'only thousands to me" ( 1 Sam. 18:8). And it came about in the next day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 342, 26, 67, 'an evil spirit came upon Saul. It is dangerous to let anger continue. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 342, 27, 67, 'can lead to an evil spirit oppressing you. That is what we see here. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 342, 28, 67, 'became so bad that Saul took a spear and tried to kill David. Anger can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 343, 1, 67, 'lead to murder. Of course, unlike Abel, David escaped.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 343, 2, 67, 'Jesus Christ has come to save us from sin. Seek God with all of your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 343, 3, 67, 'heart to be totally free from anger. Ask God to deliver you from it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 343, 4, 67, 'completely, totally! Cry out to God every time you slip and fall. Go to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 343, 5, 67, 'God and say, ''Lord I have sinned, deliver me from this completely.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 343, 6, 67, 'Don''t take it lightly. Jesus can deliver you totally from this bad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 343, 7, 67, 'habit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 343, 8, 68, 'Chapter 68 Proving God’s Perfect Will (1)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 343, 9, 68, 'In this and the next two studies we want to consider how we can find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 343, 10, 68, 'God''s perfect will for our lives. This is a very, very important');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 343, 11, 68, 'subject.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 343, 12, 68, 'The Bible speaks in Romans 12 about understanding the perfect will of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 343, 13, 68, 'God. It says "Don''t be conformed to this world, but be transformed by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 343, 14, 68, 'the renewing of your mind, that you may prove what the will of God is,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 343, 15, 68, 'that which is good, acceptable and perfect" (Rom. 12:2). There is a will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 343, 16, 68, 'of God for your life, which is perfect. From the time you are born');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 343, 17, 68, 'again, from the time you have given your life to Christ, till the end of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 343, 18, 68, 'your appointed days on earth, God has chalked out, mapped out, marked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 343, 19, 68, 'out, and prepared a perfect blueprint, a perfect plan for every detail');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 343, 20, 68, 'of your life; where you should live, whom you should marry, what you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 343, 21, 68, 'should do, what your earthly occupation should be, what all trials you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 343, 22, 68, 'should go through, what all temptations you should face, and what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 343, 23, 68, 'ministry you should have in His Body. These are all part of God''s plan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 343, 24, 68, 'for your life. And you will never know or fulfil that plan unless you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 343, 25, 68, 'have a longing. God doesn''t force anyone to walk in this plan. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 343, 26, 68, 'doesn''t even force people to go into heaven. He doesn''t stop people from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 343, 27, 68, 'going to hell, if they want to go to hell. God is a rewarder of those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 343, 28, 68, 'who diligently seek Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 344, 1, 68, 'The Holy Spirit is in the world, moving around, turning people towards');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 344, 2, 68, 'God, steering believers to respond to His call, to surrender, and seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 344, 3, 68, 'God''s perfect will. But if the Holy Spirit finds that you are not really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 344, 4, 68, 'serious about doing God''s perfect will in your life, He will just leave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 344, 5, 68, 'you alone. He won''t pursue after you. He may cry a few times, but if He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 344, 6, 68, 'finds that you are not eager about doing God''s will because you won''t be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 344, 7, 68, 'able to make so much money, or you won''t be able to get on in the world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 344, 8, 68, 'if you seek God''s will, well then, He will just leave you alone. And in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 344, 9, 68, 'eternity, you will have a lot of regrets. When you map out your life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 344, 10, 68, 'you map out as a blind man. You are totally blind concerning the future;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 344, 11, 68, 'you don''t even know what is going to happen tomorrow. You are totally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 344, 12, 68, 'blind concerning all the dangers and the pitfalls that are in front of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 344, 13, 68, 'you, made by men and made by Satan and his demons.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 344, 14, 68, 'As far as the future goes, we are totally blind. It is like a blind man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 344, 15, 68, 'trying to walk through an unknown path. Isn''t it good for such a man to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 344, 16, 68, 'have a guide whose eyes are wide open and who can see far ahead, so far');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 344, 17, 68, 'in distance? That is exactly what God wants to do for us. God knows the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 344, 18, 68, 'whole future. He knows exactly what is good for us. He knows every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 344, 19, 68, 'pitfall, every snare that is prepared for you by men or demons, and He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 344, 20, 68, 'can protect you from all of them. He can lead you in a path, in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 344, 21, 68, 'earthly life, that will be so perfect that one day, when you come to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 344, 22, 68, 'end of your life and you stand before the Lord and look back over your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 344, 23, 68, 'life, you will realize you could not have made a better plan yourself. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 344, 24, 68, 'see it like this: If I knew all the factors that are going to affect my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 344, 25, 68, 'life in the future, if I knew every single thing that would happen to me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 344, 26, 68, 'along this path and that path and the other path, and the alternatives I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 344, 27, 68, 'have to choose, if I knew every aspect of the future and if I knew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 344, 28, 68, 'myself as God knows me; my abilities, my personalities, if I have God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 345, 1, 68, 'wisdom, the plan I would make would exactly be the same as what God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 345, 2, 68, 'made for me. Because all of us seek our own interests, we seek what is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 345, 3, 68, 'good for us. Do you know that God also seeks what is good for you? There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 345, 4, 68, 'is a verse in Jeremiah 29:11 where God says, "I know the plans I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 345, 5, 68, 'for you, they are not plans for calamity but plans for your welfare, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 345, 6, 68, 'give you a future and a hope."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 345, 7, 68, 'God''s perfect plan for us is something that is for our welfare, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 345, 8, 68, 'which is the very best for us. Therefore, if you are a wholehearted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 345, 9, 68, 'disciple of Jesus Christ, you will seek His plan in every area of your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 345, 10, 68, 'life. You will say, ''Lord, I don''t want to live in any city or town');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 345, 11, 68, 'where you don''t want me to live. I don''t want to marry any girl or any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 345, 12, 68, 'boy whom you don''t want me to marry. Your choice is going to be the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 345, 13, 68, 'uppermost in every single area of my life. I want to spend my money the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 345, 14, 68, 'way you want me to spend it. I want to spend my time the way you want me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 345, 15, 68, 'to spend it. And I want to do only what you want me to do on this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 345, 16, 68, 'earth.'' If you are such a person, I want to share with you some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 345, 17, 68, 'principles, by which we can prove the perfect will of God. I want to put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 345, 18, 68, 'this in the form of 12 questions that we can ask ourselves, if we are to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 345, 19, 68, 'find God''s perfect will on any issue. Sometimes we can be faced with an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 345, 20, 68, 'issue concerning which we are not sure. Is this God''s will or is it not?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 345, 21, 68, 'Then if we ask ourselves these 12 questions and seek to answer them as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 345, 22, 68, 'honestly as possibly, we can to ourselves, as we come to the end of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 345, 23, 68, 'list of those questions, it will become more and more clear to us what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 345, 24, 68, 'the will of God is.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 345, 25, 68, 'Let me first list out those questions to you and then we will go through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 345, 26, 68, 'them one by one over this and next two studies.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 345, 27, 68, '1) Is this thing that I am considering contrary to any of the teachings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 345, 28, 68, 'of Jesus and the apostles, or to the spirit of the New Testament as far');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 346, 1, 68, 'as I know? In other words, is there something forbidding it in God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 346, 2, 68, 'word, in the New Testament especially?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 346, 3, 68, '2) Is it something I can do with a clear conscience?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 346, 4, 68, '3) Is it something I can do for the glory of God?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 346, 5, 68, '4) Is it something I can do in fellowship with Jesus?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 346, 6, 68, '5) Can I ask God to bless me as I do it?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 346, 7, 68, '6) Will my doing it, blunt my spiritual edge in any way?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 346, 8, 68, '7) Will it be spiritually profitable and edifying to the best of my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 346, 9, 68, 'knowledge?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 346, 10, 68, '8) Would I be happy if I were found doing it at the moment when Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 346, 11, 68, 'returns to earth?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 346, 12, 68, '9) What do wiser and more mature brothers think about it?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 346, 13, 68, '10) Will my doing it bring dishonour to God''s name or ruin my testimony,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 346, 14, 68, 'if others know about it?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 346, 15, 68, '11) Will my doing it cause others to stumble, if they know about it?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 346, 16, 68, '12) Do I feel free in my spirit to do it?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 346, 17, 68, 'As we look at these 12 questions one by one, it will become more and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 346, 18, 68, 'clearer, what God''s will is concerning any area.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 346, 19, 68, 'First of all, if something is forbidden in scripture, we don''t need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 346, 20, 68, 'think about that a second time. That is very clear in scripture. Should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 346, 21, 68, 'I tell a lie here? Well, does the scripture say anything about telling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 346, 22, 68, 'lies? It certainly does. Is there any excuse for me not to forgive this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 346, 23, 68, 'person? In those areas, scripture is absolutely clear. We must forgive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 346, 24, 68, 'and we must always speak the truth. There are many other areas like this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 346, 25, 68, 'where God''s word is crystal clear and, we don''t need to pray or seek God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 346, 26, 68, 'at all. If you are considering something which is contrary to God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 346, 27, 68, 'word, if it is contrary to the spirit of the New Testament; it may not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 346, 28, 68, 'be a particular passage in scripture that is pointing to that particular');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 347, 1, 68, 'matter which I am considering but if I have understood the principles of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 347, 2, 68, 'the New Testament, I can ask myself, ''Is this contrary to the Spirit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 347, 3, 68, 'The New Testament ?'' By that itself I should know what to do. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 347, 4, 68, 'the first question. That is why it is important for us to know what the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 347, 5, 68, 'scripture says.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 347, 6, 68, 'In 2 Timothy 3:16-17 we read, "All scripture is inspired by God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 347, 7, 68, 'profitable for teaching, for reproof, for correction, for training in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 347, 8, 68, 'righteousness so that the man of God may be adequate, equipped for every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 347, 9, 68, 'good work." So, there we see that scripture has been given to us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 347, 10, 68, 'correct us, to lead us in the path of righteousness, and equip us for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 347, 11, 68, 'every good work. If you are not familiar with the teaching of the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 347, 12, 68, 'Testament, there may be situations in your life where you don''t know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 347, 13, 68, 'what God''s will is. You won''t know because you do not pay attention to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 347, 14, 68, 'scripture and you have not studied the scriptures. This is why it is so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 347, 15, 68, 'important to give ourselves to a careful study of the New Testament, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 347, 16, 68, 'order to find God''s will in the areas where that will is revealed in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 347, 17, 68, 'scripture. Then it will be much easier for us to know God''s will in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 347, 18, 68, 'those many other areas of our life, which are not revealed in scripture');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 347, 19, 68, 'as well, because we will know the spirit behind the scriptures. For');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 347, 20, 68, 'example, if you are considering a job or considering marrying someone,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 347, 21, 68, 'you will not find explicit mention in the scripture. But if you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 347, 22, 68, 'spent your life seeking to obey God''s will in every area that you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 347, 23, 68, 'seen in the scriptures, God will make sure you don''t miss His will in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 347, 24, 68, 'such important areas as marriage! That is the benefit we get by obeying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 347, 25, 68, 'God''s word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 347, 26, 68, 'And secondly, you need to ask yourself, ''Is this something you can do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 347, 27, 68, 'with a clear conscience.'' Conscience is not a perfect guide, but it is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 347, 28, 68, 'very healthy guide to show us what God''s will is. In 1 John 3:21, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 348, 1, 68, 'says, "If our heart does not condemn us, we have confidence before God."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 348, 2, 68, 'This is the thing that gives us boldness. As you consider this course of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 348, 3, 68, 'action, you find in your conscience a freedom. Or does your conscience');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 348, 4, 68, 'disturb you that this is not good? This is not something that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 348, 5, 68, 'would want you to do. If your conscience disturbs you, don''t do it. So,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 348, 6, 68, 'think of these two things. Is it according to God''s word? Is it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 348, 7, 68, 'something I can do with a clear conscience?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 348, 8, 69, 'Chapter 69 Proving God’s Perfect Will (2)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 348, 9, 69, 'We want to continue the subject of how we can find the perfect will of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 348, 10, 69, 'God for our lives. This is so important, because, if we find God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 348, 11, 69, 'perfect will, we can live the most useful life, any human being can ever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 348, 12, 69, 'live, on the face of the earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 348, 13, 69, 'In our last study we were considering the importance of knowing God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 348, 14, 69, 'perfect will. If we know God''s perfect will, we can spend our earthly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 348, 15, 69, 'days to gain maximum profit. When people have money that they have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 348, 16, 69, 'saved, they need advice on how best to invest it, to get maximum returns');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 348, 17, 69, 'and maximum profit. People are so careful to get the maximum, safe and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 348, 18, 69, 'secure returns for their money, but they are not so careful with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 348, 19, 69, 'investing their life in the most profitable way possible. This is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 348, 20, 69, 'foolishness of man. We think money is more important than our life. Is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 348, 21, 69, 'it really so? - Far from it. If you want to invest your money to get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 348, 22, 69, 'maximum returns, how much more, if God gives you 70 or 80 years on this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 348, 23, 69, 'earth, that you should invest those 80 years to get the maximum returns');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 348, 24, 69, 'possible? And the maximum returns can never be counted in terms of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 348, 25, 69, 'money. It can only be counted in terms of usefulness for God''s kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 348, 26, 69, 'because that alone is going to be eternal.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 348, 27, 69, 'So, we need to know what the best way to live on this earth is. God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 348, 28, 69, 'made a plan for each of our lives. But you will never know it unless you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 349, 1, 69, 'seek Him for it. So, in our last study, we listed 12 questions that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 349, 2, 69, 'need to answer, if we are to know God''s perfect will. We saw two of them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 349, 3, 69, 'already. Firstly, we need to ask ourselves this question: ''This thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 349, 4, 69, 'which I am considering, this step which I am taking, is it contrary to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 349, 5, 69, 'any of the teachings of Jesus and the apostles or is it contrary to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 349, 6, 69, 'spirit of the New Testament, as far as I know?'' Secondly, ''Is it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 349, 7, 69, 'something I can do with a clear conscience?'' Let me say a word about a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 349, 8, 69, 'clear conscience. It is possible, sometimes, for us to kill our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 349, 9, 69, 'conscience. When our conscience forbids us from doing something, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 349, 10, 69, 'silence our conscience by asking it to keep quiet and go ahead and do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 349, 11, 69, 'what is forbidden by it. If you keep doing that for a few occasions,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 349, 12, 69, 'gradually your conscience will no longer trouble you because you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 349, 13, 69, 'killed it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 349, 14, 69, 'A third question that we need to ask ourselves is, ''Is this something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 349, 15, 69, 'that I can do for the glory of God?'' In 1 Corinthians 10:31, we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 349, 16, 69, 'told, "Whether, then, you eat or drink or whatever you do, do all to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 349, 17, 69, 'glory of God." God has created us for His glory and our salvation lies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 349, 18, 69, 'in seeking to do everything for His glory. God has designed this in such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 349, 19, 69, 'a way, because that is the very best for us. Otherwise, we would seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 349, 20, 69, 'our own glory and destroy ourselves. That is what is happening in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 349, 21, 69, 'world. Men seek their own glory and their own in so many ways that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 349, 22, 69, 'fight and clash with each other and destroy themselves. It happens in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 349, 23, 69, 'Christian churches as well, unfortunately.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 349, 24, 69, 'Supposing you are trying to find out a particular action, whether it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 349, 25, 69, 'something that God wants you to do or not, maybe watching a particular');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 349, 26, 69, 'TV program or going to a particular place. Here is a good question to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 349, 27, 69, 'ask yourselves, as it says the scripture that we just saw, ''Whatever you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 349, 28, 69, 'do, do all for the glory of God.'' Ask then, ''Lord can I do this for your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 350, 1, 69, 'glory? Can I watch that for your glory? Can I go there for your glory?''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 350, 2, 69, 'And if you find you cannot, drop it. Even if it looks very innocent, if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 350, 3, 69, 'you cannot honestly say that you can do that for the glory of God, don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 350, 4, 69, 'do it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 350, 5, 69, 'A fourth question you need to ask yourself, ''Is it something I can do in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 350, 6, 69, 'fellowship with Jesus? Is it something that Jesus and I can sit together');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 350, 7, 69, 'and do?'' Take for example, is it right for a believer to smoke a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 350, 8, 69, 'cigarette? Well, can you offer a cigarette to Jesus as well and ask Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 350, 9, 69, 'to smoke along with you? If so, go ahead. Is it right for a believer to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 350, 10, 69, 'be drinking alcohol, particularly in excess? Well, ask yourself, would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 350, 11, 69, 'Jesus join you in such a bout of drinking? And if He won''t join you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 350, 12, 69, 'then you better not go in for that yourself. Is there a particular movie');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 350, 13, 69, 'you feel like Jesus would go along with you to watch? Then go ahead and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 350, 14, 69, 'watch it. A particular program on TV that you feel is good, would Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 350, 15, 69, 'watch with you? Then go ahead and watch it, otherwise avoid it. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 350, 16, 69, 'Bible says in Colossians 3:17, "Whatever you do, in word or in deed, do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 350, 17, 69, 'everything in the name of the Lord Jesus, giving thanks through Him to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 350, 18, 69, 'God the Father." Everything I do, I need to do in fellowship with Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 350, 19, 69, 'Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 350, 20, 69, 'A fifth question that we could ask ourselves is, ''Can I ask God to bless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 350, 21, 69, 'me as I do this particular thing?'' Maybe you are in doubt, whether');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 350, 22, 69, 'something is good or right or wrong. You are not sure. Maybe it is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 350, 23, 69, 'borderline matter. Then you ask this fifth question to yourself. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 350, 24, 69, 'Bible says in 2 Corinthians 9:8, "God is able to make all grace abound');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 350, 25, 69, 'to you, that you always having all sufficiency in everything, may have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 350, 26, 69, 'an abundance for every good deed." God gives grace and His blessing for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 350, 27, 69, 'every good deed. So, ask yourself, and your conscience will tell you. Is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 350, 28, 69, 'this something, which you can ask God to put His blessing upon as you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 351, 1, 69, 'move ahead? If not, hold back.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 351, 2, 69, 'A sixth question, ''Will my doing this blunt my spiritual edge in any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 351, 3, 69, 'way?'' We read of Paul advising Timothy (2 Tim. 2:15), "Be diligent to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 351, 4, 69, 'present yourself approved to God as a workman who does not need to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 351, 5, 69, 'ashamed handling accurately the word of truth." He is saying be very,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 351, 6, 69, 'very careful to always present yourself to God as a workman who does not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 351, 7, 69, 'need to be ashamed. So, this particular course of action that you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 351, 8, 69, 'considering right now, is it something that will (it may be good, it may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 351, 9, 69, 'be right in so many ways), blunt your spiritual edge. That means you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 351, 10, 69, 'won''t be spiritually sharp if you keep on doing these types of things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 351, 11, 69, 'You see, there are many legitimate things in the world like music,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 351, 12, 69, 'sport, or entertainment and certain good TV programs. There is nothing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 351, 13, 69, 'wrong in engaging in these activities. But, when these things are taken');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 351, 14, 69, 'to an excess, man becomes a slave to those activities and he loses his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 351, 15, 69, 'spiritual sharpness. He is no longer sharp. And there we see how many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 351, 16, 69, 'believers have their effectiveness for God nullified by Satan.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 351, 17, 69, 'A seventh question, ''Is this spiritually profitable? Will it be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 351, 18, 69, 'spiritually profitable and edifying to the best of my knowledge?'' Paul');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 351, 19, 69, 'says, "All things are lawful for me, but not all things are profitable.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 351, 20, 69, 'All things are lawful for me but I will not be mastered by anything" (1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 351, 21, 69, 'Cor. 6:12). He repeats somewhat similar words later where he says, “All');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 351, 22, 69, 'things are lawful, but not all things are profitable. All things are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 351, 23, 69, 'lawful, but not all things edifying" (1 Cor. 10:23 ). So, the question');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 351, 24, 69, 'is not whether it is lawful or not. Many Christians are always operating');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 351, 25, 69, 'on the level of, is it lawful or is it not lawful, will God permit it or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 351, 26, 69, 'won''t He permit it. I am not talking about God''s permissive will for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 351, 27, 69, 'your life; I am talking about God''s perfect will for your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 351, 28, 69, 'God permits many things, which are not His perfect will. So, if you want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 352, 1, 69, 'to live in God''s permissive will, just ask yourself is it right or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 352, 2, 69, 'wrong. Don''t do anything unrighteous and don''t do anything unlawful and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 352, 3, 69, 'you will be in God''s permissive will. But, if you want God''s perfect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 352, 4, 69, 'will for your life, you need to ask one more question: ''Is this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 352, 5, 69, 'spiritually profitable and edifying? Is this something that will help');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 352, 6, 69, 'me? Is it a profitable thing spiritually? Is it something that will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 352, 7, 69, 'build me up, help me to be a better disciple of Jesus?'' If you ask');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 352, 8, 69, 'questions like these, you will find God''s perfect will in your spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 352, 9, 69, 'Now when I say spiritually profitable and edifying, don''t misunderstand.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 352, 10, 69, 'I am not saying that only Bible reading and prayer and going to meetings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 352, 11, 69, 'are spiritually profitable and edifying. We are creatures made with a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 352, 12, 69, 'body and this body has certain needs. There may be times that you need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 352, 13, 69, 'to relax. Sometimes just sleeping may be the most glorifying thing to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 352, 14, 69, 'for God. There may be times when sleeping is the most spiritually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 352, 15, 69, 'profitable and edifying thing to do. Or, it may be some type of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 352, 16, 69, 'relaxation or entertainment - going to a picnic with your children is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 352, 17, 69, 'the most spiritually profitable and edifying thing to do. So don''t think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 352, 18, 69, 'that it is only fasting and prayer and reading the Bible are the only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 352, 19, 69, 'spiritually profitable, edifying things. We need relaxation, we need a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 352, 20, 69, 'certain amount of rest and we need food to eat. There is nothing wrong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 352, 21, 69, 'with any of these things. We are not ascetics. Jesus slept, Jesus ate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 352, 22, 69, 'good food. So don''t go to the fanatical extreme when you ask this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 352, 23, 69, 'question.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 352, 24, 69, 'But here are good questions that you can ask yourselves and, as you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 352, 25, 69, 'answer them, you will know what God''s will is for your life. ''Is it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 352, 26, 69, 'something that I can do for the glory of God? Is it something I can do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 352, 27, 69, 'in fellowship with Jesus? Can I ask God to bless me as I do it? Will my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 352, 28, 69, 'doing it blunt my spiritual edge? Will it be spiritually profitable and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 353, 1, 69, 'edifying?'' Then you will know what God''s will is for your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 353, 2, 70, 'Chapter 70 Proving God’s Perfect Will (3)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 353, 3, 70, 'We shall continue with what we have been considering in our last two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 353, 4, 70, 'studies, as to how we can find the perfect will of God for our life, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 353, 5, 70, 'the different decisions we have to make in life. This is the way our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 353, 6, 70, 'life can be brought to maximum effectiveness for God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 353, 7, 70, 'We have been looking at a number of questions that we need to ask');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 353, 8, 70, 'ourselves, which will help us to be sure concerning God''s will for our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 353, 9, 70, 'life. In this New Covenant age, God doesn''t speak to us through prophets');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 353, 10, 70, 'or with voices from heaven, primarily but through our renewed mind. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 353, 11, 70, 'Bible says in Romans 12:2, "Be not conformed to this world but be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 353, 12, 70, 'transformed by the renewing of your mind that you may prove what that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 353, 13, 70, 'will of God is, which is good, acceptable and perfect."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 353, 14, 70, 'When we are in doubt concerning God''s will, we need to ask ourselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 353, 15, 70, 'these questions. We have already considered seven of them. Let me repeat');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 353, 16, 70, 'them for your benefit. First of all, we ask ourselves, ''Is it contrary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 353, 17, 70, 'to any of the teachings of Jesus and the apostles, or to the spirit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 353, 18, 70, 'the New Testament, as far as I know?'' The second question that we need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 353, 19, 70, 'to ask ourselves: ''Is it something I can do with a clear conscience?''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 353, 20, 70, 'Then a third question; ''Is it something I can do for the glory of God?''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 353, 21, 70, 'The fourth question: ''Is it something I can do in fellowship with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 353, 22, 70, 'Jesus?'' Fifthly, ''Can I ask God to bless me, as I do it?'' Sixth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 353, 23, 70, 'question: ''Will my doing it blunt my spiritual edge in any way?'' And the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 353, 24, 70, 'seventh question: ''Will it be spiritually profitable and edifying to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 353, 25, 70, 'best of my knowledge?''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 353, 26, 70, 'Now we go to the eighth question. We need to ask ourselves, when we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 353, 27, 70, 'considering a particular course of action, ''Would I be happy, if I were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 353, 28, 70, 'found doing this, at the moment when Jesus returns to earth?'' That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 354, 1, 70, 'means, supposing while you are doing this particular thing, whatever you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 354, 2, 70, 'are planning to do, Christ returns! Would you be ashamed of what you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 354, 3, 70, 'doing or would you be perfectly happy that the Lord found you doing that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 354, 4, 70, 'when He returned? 1 John 2:28 says, "Now, little children, abide in Him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 354, 5, 70, 'so that when He appears, we may have confidence, and not shrink away');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 354, 6, 70, 'from Him in shame, at His coming." There are people who are going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 354, 7, 70, 'shrink away from Him in shame, because they have done so many things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 354, 8, 70, 'that have dishonoured the Lord; so many things that they would not want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 354, 9, 70, 'to be found doing, if Christ returned at that moment. So, He says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 354, 10, 70, '''Little children abide in Him so that, if He appears suddenly, we will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 354, 11, 70, 'have confidence.'' So, that is a good question to ask ourselves: ''Would I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 354, 12, 70, 'be happy, if I were found doing this, at the moment when Jesus returns');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 354, 13, 70, 'to earth?'' Now don''t think that, if it is a Christian work or something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 354, 14, 70, 'like that, definitely Jesus will be happy if you are found doing that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 354, 15, 70, 'No. There are so many types of Christian work in the world today, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 354, 16, 70, 'you need to know what particularly the Lord wants you to do.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 354, 17, 70, 'A ninth question, which is a very important question, particularly for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 354, 18, 70, 'younger people. I mean young spiritually; those who are not very matured');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 354, 19, 70, 'in the Lord themselves. ''What do wiser and more mature brothers think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 354, 20, 70, 'about this?'' Let me show you three verses from the book of Proverbs. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 354, 21, 70, 'Proverbs 11:14 we read, "Where there is no guidance the people fall, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 354, 22, 70, 'in abundance of counsellors there is deliverance or victory." Where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 354, 23, 70, 'there are many counsellors, there is a safety, because people can tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 354, 24, 70, 'you different aspects of that particular matter that you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 354, 25, 70, 'considering, which you may not have thought of yourself, particularly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 354, 26, 70, 'spiritual aspects. So, it is good for us to consult with wiser and more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 354, 27, 70, 'mature brothers. The same message is found in Proverbs 15:22, "Without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 354, 28, 70, 'consultation, plans are frustrated, but with many counsellors they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 355, 1, 70, 'succeed." So, if you are fortunate enough to have godly counsellors who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 355, 2, 70, 'can advise you, it is good to get their opinions and see what they think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 355, 3, 70, 'about your course of action. We don''t have to become slaves to their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 355, 4, 70, 'opinion, but it is good to take their advice. Again, in Proverbs 24:6,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 355, 5, 70, '"By wise guidance, you will wage war and in abundance of counsellors');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 355, 6, 70, 'there is victory." So, there is a great value in considering what other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 355, 7, 70, 'people think about this particular course of action.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 355, 8, 70, 'Another question (10th) that we need to ask ourselves is, ''This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 355, 9, 70, 'particular thing that I am thinking of doing, will my doing it bring');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 355, 10, 70, 'dishonour to God''s name if others know about it, or ruin my testimony if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 355, 11, 70, 'others know about it?'' Maybe you are considering an action which other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 355, 12, 70, 'people will not be able to find out. Maybe it is a secret thing; maybe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 355, 13, 70, 'it is a thing in which there is very little likelihood of anybody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 355, 14, 70, 'discovering it. But that is not the point. The point is if other people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 355, 15, 70, 'discovered it, would it bring dishonour to God''s name? Or, if other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 355, 16, 70, 'people discovered it, will it ruin your testimony? If you say, ''Oh well,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 355, 17, 70, 'only as long as I keep it secret, it is okay'' but, if others come to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 355, 18, 70, 'know about it, God''s name will be dishonoured, my testimony will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 355, 19, 70, 'ruined. Then you know, perhaps the best course of action for you is to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 355, 20, 70, 'avoid doing that altogether. Because it is something shady, it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 355, 21, 70, 'something that you know will bring dishonour to God''s name if other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 355, 22, 70, 'people know about it and so you don''t want other people to know about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 355, 23, 70, 'it. You try your best to conceal it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 355, 24, 70, 'The eleventh question that we can ask is, ''Will my doing it cause others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 355, 25, 70, 'to stumble if they know about it?'' Fortunately, other people don''t know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 355, 26, 70, 'what you are doing or planning to do. But supposing they did know, would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 355, 27, 70, 'it cause them to stumble? Or, are you going to say like Cain, ''Well, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 355, 28, 70, 'am not my brother''s keeper.'' But the Lord said you are. We are our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 356, 1, 70, 'brother''s keeper. Paul said, ''If something I do is going to cause');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 356, 2, 70, 'another person to stumble, or fall away, I won''t do it at all in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 356, 3, 70, 'life. I will just avoid it altogether.'' So it is a very good question to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 356, 4, 70, 'ask: ''Will my doing this cause others to stumble if they know about it?''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 356, 5, 70, 'For example, in Romans 14:13 we read, "Let us not judge one another, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 356, 6, 70, 'not put an obstacle or a stumbling block in a brother''s way". Again in 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 356, 7, 70, 'Corinthians 8:9, "Take care lest this liberty of yours become a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 356, 8, 70, 'stumbling block to the weak." So, there are two things we need to ask:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 356, 9, 70, 'if other people know about this, will it dishonour God''s name and will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 356, 10, 70, 'it cause them to stumble? If it is going to dishonour God''s name, then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 356, 11, 70, 'we should avoid it. 2 Corinthians 8:21 says, "We are careful not only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 356, 12, 70, 'for what is right in the sight of the Lord and honourable, but also what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 356, 13, 70, 'is in the sight of men." It is also important. We should not cause');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 356, 14, 70, 'anyone in the world to stumble by the way we live or do something. Paul');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 356, 15, 70, 'said, ''I will not even eat meat if it causes other people to stumble.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 356, 16, 70, 'And the last question we could ask ourselves is, ''Do I feel free in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 356, 17, 70, 'spirit to do it?'' Ultimately that is the way we decide after having');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 356, 18, 70, 'asked all these questions. We finally ask, ''Do I feel free in my spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 356, 19, 70, 'to do it.'' 1 John 2:27 says, "You have an anointing that teaches you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 356, 20, 70, 'about all things and just as it taught you, you abide in Him. You don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 356, 21, 70, 'need anyone to teach you and that anointing will teach you everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 356, 22, 70, 'that you need to know." That is the Holy Spirit witnessing within our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 356, 23, 70, 'spirit that something is in line with God''s will.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 356, 24, 70, 'So as you ask yourselves these 12 questions, you will come to know very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 356, 25, 70, 'clearly in your mind whether some course of action you are considering');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 356, 26, 70, 'is God''s will or not. Let us go through that list again:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 356, 27, 70, '1. Is it in line with the teachings of Jesus and the apostles and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 356, 28, 70, 'New Testament, is it contrary to any of their teachings, as far as I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 357, 1, 70, 'know?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 357, 2, 70, '2. Is it something I can do with a clear conscience?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 357, 3, 70, '3. Is it something I can do for the glory of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 357, 4, 70, '4. Is it something I can do in fellowship with Jesus?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 357, 5, 70, '5. Can I ask God to bless me as I do it?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 357, 6, 70, '6. Will my doing it blunt my spiritual edge in any way?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 357, 7, 70, '7. Will it be spiritually profitable and edifying to the best of my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 357, 8, 70, 'knowledge?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 357, 9, 70, '8. Will I be happy if I were found doing it at the moment when Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 357, 10, 70, 'returns to earth?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 357, 11, 70, '9. What do wiser and mature brothers think about it?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 357, 12, 70, '10. Will my doing it bring dishonour to God''s name or ruin my testimony');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 357, 13, 70, 'if others know about it?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 357, 14, 70, '11. Will my doing it cause others to stumble if they know about it?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 357, 15, 70, '12. Do I feel free in my spirit to do it?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 357, 16, 70, 'After asking these questions if you can get a positive answer, the right');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 357, 17, 70, 'answer to these questions, then we can move forward, because the Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 357, 18, 70, 'says in Romans 8:6, "The mind of the spirit is life and peace." You will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 357, 19, 70, 'have peace in your spirit as you move forward and you can fulfil God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 357, 20, 70, 'perfect will.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 357, 21, 71, 'Chapter 71 Submission To Authority');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 357, 22, 71, 'We want to consider in this study, whether the matter of submitting to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 357, 23, 71, 'authority in our home or in our office or in the church is an essential');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 357, 24, 71, 'thing; when we should submit and when we shouldn''t. It is a very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 357, 25, 71, 'relevant topic to the decisions we have to take in our daily life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 357, 26, 71, 'When we look at the origin of sin (we have looked at this in our studies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 357, 27, 71, 'quite a while ago), we find that sin originated in the universe when a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 357, 28, 71, 'created angel rebelled against God''s authority. Lucifer was the head of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 358, 1, 71, 'all the angels. He decided that he is not going to submit to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 358, 2, 71, 'authority of God as creator, and he rebelled against that authority. As');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 358, 3, 71, 'soon as he rebelled, he was cast out of heaven and he became the devil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 358, 4, 71, 'So, we find that the question of submission to authority was something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 358, 5, 71, 'that arose way back in the beginning of creation. The great controversy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 358, 6, 71, 'there was: shall I submit to authority or not. And throughout the ages,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 358, 7, 71, 'this has been the greatest question that has caused problems in every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 358, 8, 71, 'area. When do we submit to those whom God places over us, and when can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 358, 9, 71, 'we say no? Are we to be slaves without any opinion or is there anything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 358, 10, 71, 'that we can do on our own? Are we to just blindly do what other people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 358, 11, 71, 'tell us to do?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 358, 12, 71, 'Well, first of all, let me quote you this verse from Acts 5:29. This was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 358, 13, 71, 'when the apostles stood before the High Priest who was questioning them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 358, 14, 71, 'They said to him, "We must obey God rather than men." Now there are no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 358, 15, 71, 'two ways about that. We must obey God rather than men. If it is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 358, 16, 71, 'question of, ''shall I obey God or shall I obey any man,'' the answer is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 358, 17, 71, 'clear, ''I have to obey God.'' So, if a man tells me to do something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 358, 18, 71, 'contrary to what the Bible says, I never have to listen to him, even if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 358, 19, 71, 'he is an authority over me at home, or in the office, or in the church,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 358, 20, 71, 'or anywhere. But it must be something that God has clearly spoken in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 358, 21, 71, 'word. For example, God has said, ''We should not bow down to idols.'' If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 358, 22, 71, 'somebody tells you to bow down to idols, you can say, ''I am sorry sir, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 358, 23, 71, 'can''t do that.'' Or, if you are a wife, and your husband tells you to go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 358, 24, 71, 'and murder somebody or to give your body in adultery, you can say, ''no,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 358, 25, 71, 'I am sorry I won''t do it. I am not going to submit to you in that area.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 358, 26, 71, 'These are examples where a wife can say no to her husband. Even a child');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 358, 27, 71, 'can say no to his parents.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 358, 28, 71, 'When I say what God has told you, I don''t mean what you feel God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 359, 1, 71, 'spoken in your heart. The reason is, in some of those things, it maybe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 359, 2, 71, 'just your own feeling. You say, ''Well, God has told me to go here.'' That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 359, 3, 71, 'is not in scripture. If you are under some authority that God has placed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 359, 4, 71, 'over you, you better submit to that authority. And if he tells you not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 359, 5, 71, 'to go there, don''t go there, even if you feel like going in your heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 359, 6, 71, 'If that person is an authority over you, you must submit to his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 359, 7, 71, 'authority. It is the other way around too. If he tells you to go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 359, 8, 71, 'somewhere and you don''t feel like going, if he is an authority over you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 359, 9, 71, 'you have to submit to him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 359, 10, 71, 'When Jesus came to earth to undo the works of the devil, God kept him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 359, 11, 71, 'under the authority of Joseph and Mary for 30 years, not for 1 or 2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 359, 12, 71, 'weeks, but for 30 long years, as a child, as a teenager, as a young man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 359, 13, 71, 'in his twenties. We read in Luke 2:51 that Jesus continued in subjection');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 359, 14, 71, 'to Joseph and Mary at Nazareth. That is the way the 30 years of His life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 359, 15, 71, 'is described. He came to undo the works of Satan. Satan is the author of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 359, 16, 71, 'rebellion. He rebelled against authority. He teaches children to rebel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 359, 17, 71, 'against parental authority.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 359, 18, 71, 'There are basically three areas where we have an authority structure.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 359, 19, 71, 'One is in the home, where parents are an authority over their children.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 359, 20, 71, 'The other is in society, where we have the government or the police or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 359, 21, 71, 'secular authorities, and in your place of work, your boss. These are all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 359, 22, 71, 'secular authorities in the society placed over you for things to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 359, 23, 71, 'conducted in an orderly way. God has planned that in society, as much as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 359, 24, 71, 'He has planned parents in a home. And it is your duty to submit to those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 359, 25, 71, 'authorities. The third area is the church, where God places elders to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 359, 26, 71, 'whose authority you need to submit. In all these areas, if you rebel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 359, 27, 71, 'against the authority that God has placed over you, you are going to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 359, 28, 71, 'in fellowship with Satan. Because he was the first person to rebel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 360, 1, 71, 'against authority and he is the one who instigates people to rebel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 360, 2, 71, 'against authority even today. He instigates children to rebel against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 360, 3, 71, 'parents, students to rebel against their teachers, workers to rebel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 360, 4, 71, 'against their bosses and employees to form trade unions to go on strike');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 360, 5, 71, 'and to fight against the management and many things like that. Now to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 360, 6, 71, 'ask for your legitimate rights, as a worker in a factory, it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 360, 7, 71, 'perfectly right, even if it is asked through a trade union. But to rebel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 360, 8, 71, 'against authority, that is wrong.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 360, 9, 71, 'So, we need to see that rebellion is of Satan. When we see that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 360, 10, 71, 'subjected Himself in Nazareth to Joseph and Mary, we could ask ourselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 360, 11, 71, 'this question: ''Who was perfect in that home in Nazareth?'' Were Joseph');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 360, 12, 71, 'and Mary perfect? Neither of them was perfect! They were just an Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 360, 13, 71, 'Testament couple who had their struggles and problems like all married');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 360, 14, 71, 'people have. Joseph and Mary must have lost their temper at each other,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 360, 15, 71, 'like all married couples do. They must have had their disagreements and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 360, 16, 71, 'their tension, and the days when they didn''t speak to each other and so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 360, 17, 71, 'many things like that. They were far from perfect. They were an Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 360, 18, 71, 'Testament couple, living in a time where victory over sin was not even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 360, 19, 71, 'promised. When you look at New Testament couples today, the way they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 360, 20, 71, 'live, you can imagine how an Old Testament couple lived. That was not a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 360, 21, 71, 'perfect home, far from perfect. Don''t think that Joseph and Mary were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 360, 22, 71, 'saints. That is a delusion that Satan has put upon a lot of people. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 360, 23, 71, 'were ordinary people who needed a saviour.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 360, 24, 71, 'Jesus was perfect. He never sinned. Joseph and Mary sinned and yet Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 360, 25, 71, 'lived in subjection to an imperfect authority over Him, for 30 years.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 360, 26, 71, 'Everything they asked Him to do were not perfect commands , but He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 360, 27, 71, 'obeyed them anyway . If it was not contrary to God''s will, He did it. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 360, 28, 71, 'they asked Him to do something at a time when He was tired, He still got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 361, 1, 71, 'up and did it, without questioning or complaining. If He felt, in some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 361, 2, 71, 'situation, that a decision His parents took was not fair. He still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 361, 3, 71, 'obeyed them. He was tempted in all points, like children are , but He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 361, 4, 71, 'never sinned. And He didn''t do that just when he was 5 or 6 years old,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 361, 5, 71, 'He did that to the age of 30, till the time He moved out of His house.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 361, 6, 71, 'I want to say to you , young people, as long as you live in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 361, 7, 71, 'parent''s house dependant on them, follow Jesus'' example. You cannot do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 361, 8, 71, 'better than that. Those are the first steps towards being a spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 361, 9, 71, 'man or a woman. Children, honour your father and mother. Obey your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 361, 10, 71, 'parents. Do what they tell you and it will go well with and you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 361, 11, 71, 'live long on the earth. Your example is Jesus Himself. It doesn''t matter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 361, 12, 71, 'if your parents make mistakes. Jesus'' earthly parents also made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 361, 13, 71, 'mistakes. But He still obeyed them. God does not ask us to submit to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 361, 14, 71, 'perfect authority. There is no perfect authority in the home, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 361, 15, 71, 'society, in the church, or anywhere in the world. Everybody is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 361, 16, 71, 'imperfect. But He tests our humility by asking us to submit to imperfect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 361, 17, 71, 'authorities.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 361, 18, 71, 'It is the same in society. The Bible says in Romans 13:1, 2 - "Every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 361, 19, 71, 'soul should be subject to the higher powers, to the governing authority,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 361, 20, 71, 'for there is no authority except from God. And those, which exist, are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 361, 21, 71, 'established by God. So, He who resists authority has opposed the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 361, 22, 71, 'ordinance of God. They will receive condemnation." And He goes on to say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 361, 23, 71, 'in verse 4 that a ruler is a servant of God. Again, in verse 6 that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 361, 24, 71, 'those who collect your taxes are servants of God. So, pay your taxes to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 361, 25, 71, 'them. People who don''t pay their taxes are rebelling against authority.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 361, 26, 71, 'It is the same thing in the church. In the church God has appointed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 361, 27, 71, 'elders and the Bible says in Hebrews 13:17, "Obey those who rule over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 361, 28, 71, 'you and submit to them, for they keep an account and watch over your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 362, 1, 71, 'souls as those who give an account to God." This does not mean that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 362, 2, 71, 'have to submit to some religious leader, who sits in our church and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 362, 3, 71, 'calls himself our priest or pastor, but he is not a spiritual man. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 362, 4, 71, 'is, if he is not the one who is accountable for your soul? With parents');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 362, 5, 71, 'you have no choice. With your government you have no choice. But, when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 362, 6, 71, 'it comes to a church, if you feel that the church you are in where the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 362, 7, 71, 'leadership is not spiritual, then God doesn''t ask you to stay there. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 362, 8, 71, 'can move out and find another church where the leadership is spiritual.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 362, 9, 71, 'But when you find one church like that, you must submit to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 362, 10, 71, 'leadership. This is very important.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 362, 11, 71, 'The principle of submission to authority has been demonstrated by Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 362, 12, 71, 'Christ. That is how salvation came. Let us learn that from Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 362, 13, 72, 'Chapter 72 God’s Plan For Those Who Have Failed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 362, 14, 72, 'In this final study we want to consider a word of encouragement for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 362, 15, 72, 'those who feel that their life has been a failure. Lots and lots of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 362, 16, 72, 'people feel that they have messed up their life so badly that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 362, 17, 72, 'wonder, ''What can I do with my life for God now?'' There is a message of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 362, 18, 72, 'hope in the word of God for such people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 362, 19, 72, 'There are many brothers and sisters, believers who feel that, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 362, 20, 72, 'they have sinned and failed God at some time in the past, they can''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 362, 21, 72, 'fulfil God''s perfect plan for their lives now. They say, ''Well, once');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 362, 22, 72, 'upon a time, when I was young and, if I had yielded completely to God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 362, 23, 72, 'and lived in His perfect will, maybe I could have, but I have made such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 362, 24, 72, 'a mess of my life. What can I do now?'' Now, according to logic and our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 362, 25, 72, 'own human reasoning, that sounds right. But let us look at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 362, 26, 72, 'scriptures, and you will find that God''s thoughts are completely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 362, 27, 72, 'different; God''s ways are completely different. There is hope, even for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 362, 28, 72, 'you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 363, 1, 72, 'Notice first of all how the Bible begins. In the beginning, God created');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 363, 2, 72, 'the heaven and the earth. That is written in Genesis 1:1. When the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 363, 3, 72, 'heavens and the earth were made, since whenever God makes anything, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 363, 4, 72, 'is perfect, they must have been perfect. He never does anything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 363, 5, 72, 'imperfect. But some of the angels, whom He had created, fell away. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 363, 6, 72, 'is described in Isaiah 14:11-15 and Ezekiel 28:13-18. When that fall');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 363, 7, 72, 'happened, we read, in Genesis 1:2, the earth became formless and void');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 363, 8, 72, 'and empty and dark. Then, what did God do? He didn''t leave the earth in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 363, 9, 72, 'that condition. It says the Holy Spirit began to move upon that earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 363, 10, 72, 'and the word of God went forth on that earth and God remade that earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 363, 11, 72, 'He worked on that shapeless, empty, dark mass, and made something so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 363, 12, 72, 'beautiful out of that mess - that in the end of it, He could say, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 363, 13, 72, 'Genesis 1:31, it is very good! Now what is the lesson in the first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 363, 14, 72, 'chapter of the Bible? That, even if the devil has made a mess of your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 363, 15, 72, 'life, if you surrender to God''s word (you see how "God said...", "God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 363, 16, 72, 'said...", "God said..." appears in the first chapter) and through the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 363, 17, 72, 'Holy Spirit, He can make something excellent out of your life, no matter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 363, 18, 72, 'how much you have failed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 363, 19, 72, 'Before this fall of Lucifer, God must have had a perfect plan for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 363, 20, 72, 'heavens and the earth. When Lucifer sinned, that plan had to be set');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 363, 21, 72, 'aside. But God remade the heavens and the earth and still made something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 363, 22, 72, 'good out of it. See what happens next. God creates man and woman, and He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 363, 23, 72, 'has a perfect plan for Adam and Eve. In God''s perfect plan for Adam and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 363, 24, 72, 'Eve, there was no provision for them to eat of this forbidden tree. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 363, 25, 72, 'was not God''s will. In fact, God clearly said you shouldn''t eat of that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 363, 26, 72, 'So, God had a plan for them and the plan was that they should not eat of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 363, 27, 72, 'it. But they did eat of it and they spoilt God''s plan. Now, if we go by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 363, 28, 72, 'logic and reason, we will have to say, ''Well, now they cannot fulfil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 364, 1, 72, 'God''s perfect plan. Now we have to go to God''s second best.'' But what do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 364, 2, 72, 'we read there? We read there that, the Lord comes to Adam and Eve, after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 364, 3, 72, 'they have sinned, and tells them, ''Well don''t worry, I am going to solve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 364, 4, 72, 'this problem. I am going to send a seed through the woman (that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 364, 5, 72, 'referring to Christ), who will come and bruise the serpent, the devil,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 364, 6, 72, 'on his head and destroy his power over you.'' So there He is speaking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 364, 7, 72, 'about Christ dying for our sins and overcoming Satan on Calvary.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 364, 8, 72, 'Now tell me this, what is your answer to this question? Was the death of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 364, 9, 72, 'Christ part of God''s perfect plan for us from all eternity, or not? The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 364, 10, 72, 'Bible says in Revelations 13:8, that the Lamb was slain from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 364, 11, 72, 'foundation of the world. So was that in God''s mind from eternity or was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 364, 12, 72, 'it God''s second best? How many of you would dare to say that the death');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 364, 13, 72, 'of Christ on Cavalry was God''s second best? Wasn''t it His perfect plan?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 364, 14, 72, 'It was. Yet, when you turn to Genesis 3, logically, you have to say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 364, 15, 72, 'Christ had to die only because Adam and Eve failed. If Adam and Eve had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 364, 16, 72, 'not sinned, there would be no need for Christ to die on the cross at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 364, 17, 72, 'all. So, was it God''s perfect plan or not? Also, we would not have known');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 364, 18, 72, 'of God''s love, if Adam had not sinned. There would not have been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 364, 19, 72, 'Calvary''s cross. What is the answer? You are confused. Our human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 364, 20, 72, 'understanding cannot grasp this, that even where man has failed, God can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 364, 21, 72, 'still fulfil His perfect plan.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 364, 22, 72, 'Now human logic fails here. It baffles us. That is why the Bible says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 364, 23, 72, '"Don''t lean on your own understanding. Trust in the Lord with all your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 364, 24, 72, 'heart." If God was working according to mathematical logic, then we will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 364, 25, 72, 'have to say that Christ coming to the earth was God''s second-best plan.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 364, 26, 72, 'But that is blasphemous. It was part of God''s perfect plan. God makes no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 364, 27, 72, 'mistakes. God who knows the end from the beginning, and who silently');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 364, 28, 72, 'plans for us in love, plans something allowing for our failures. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 365, 1, 72, 'knows that we are going to fail. He allows for our failures and has made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 365, 2, 72, 'a perfect plan for us. That is the word of encouragement that there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 365, 3, 72, 'for you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 365, 4, 72, 'God''s perfect plan for Adam was certainly not that he should eat of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 365, 5, 72, 'tree of the knowledge of good and evil, but because He knew the end from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 365, 6, 72, 'the beginning, He knew that they would fail. So, He had already made a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 365, 7, 72, 'plan that accounted for that failure. The same way in your life, a lot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 365, 8, 72, 'of things that you have done in your life, God never wanted you to do.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 365, 9, 72, 'But do you know that in His great love for you and in His perfect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 365, 10, 72, 'wisdom, He has made allowance for that failure and can still lead you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 365, 11, 72, 'into His perfect plan?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 365, 12, 72, 'His ways are not our ways. His thoughts are not our thoughts. So don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 365, 13, 72, 'let your logic and reason say, ''Oh! Now I cannot do God''s perfect will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 365, 14, 72, 'for my life.'' God''s message to us from these opening pages of the Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 365, 15, 72, 'is just this: He can take a man who has failed and make something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 365, 16, 72, 'glorious out of him and still make him fulfil God''s perfect plan for his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 365, 17, 72, 'life. That is in the first page of the Bible and we must never forget');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 365, 18, 72, 'it. If you are a failure, God can pick you up and fulfil not His second');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 365, 19, 72, 'best or third best, but His perfect plan. That is why it is important');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 365, 20, 72, 'for you to give the rest of your life totally to God. Many of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 365, 21, 72, 'failures, though it is not part of God''s perfect plan, maybe permitted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 365, 22, 72, 'by Him to teach us some lessons. For example, we never learn humility,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 365, 23, 72, 'unfortunately, except through many failures.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 365, 24, 72, 'We try to get victory over sin so many times, but we fail and fail and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 365, 25, 72, 'fail and fail and fail and we realize finally that we cannot, without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 365, 26, 72, 'God''s help. Well, that is an education we got through our failure. Take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 365, 27, 72, 'Peter for example. Part of Peter''s training for leadership was failure.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 365, 28, 72, 'The Lord could not break Peter through educating him, through teaching');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 366, 1, 72, 'him, but when he denied the Lord three times, which is not certainly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 366, 2, 72, 'God''s perfect will, He accomplished something in Peter. It broke him and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 366, 3, 72, 'that was God''s perfect will, that he should be broken. So, God can use');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 366, 4, 72, 'failure to accomplish something good. One of the biggest problems God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 366, 5, 72, 'has with us is to bless us in such a way that the blessing does not puff');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 366, 6, 72, 'us up with pride. You see, if you get victory over anger and then you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 366, 7, 72, 'become proud, that is falling into a far deeper pit than anger itself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 366, 8, 72, 'So, it is not only important to get victory over sin, it is important to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 366, 9, 72, 'be humble at the end of it. Now how does that happen - only if God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 366, 10, 72, 'allows us to fail many times? Genuine victory is always accompanied by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 366, 11, 72, 'humility.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 366, 12, 72, 'And the other thing is, if we have failed many times, we can never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 366, 13, 72, 'despise another person, because we know we failed ourselves. So, we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 366, 14, 72, 'not saying that a man should, therefore, keep on sinning. No. Paul');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 366, 15, 72, 'speaks about that saying, ''Well if my dishonesty brought glory to God''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 366, 16, 72, 'and if you follow through with that idea you come to this, ''The worse we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 366, 17, 72, 'are the better God likes it, but the damnation of those who say such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 366, 18, 72, 'things is just'' (Rom. 3:7-8). No, we are not saying that we have to sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 366, 19, 72, 'What we are saying is that, if we have failed, God is not frustrated in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 366, 20, 72, 'fulfilling His plan for our life. Every man whom God has used has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 366, 21, 72, 'failed. Peter, Paul, John, James, you, I, everyone. God has not called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 366, 22, 72, 'people who never made mistakes in their life. If God could fulfil His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 366, 23, 72, 'perfect plan only in the lives of those who never made a mistake, then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 366, 24, 72, 'we will have to say, Jesus Christ is the only person who ever fulfilled');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 366, 25, 72, 'God''s perfect plan for His life, nobody else. Very many great men of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 366, 26, 72, 'may not have told you about their failures but they have failed too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 366, 27, 72, 'Now the question is whether you can believe that or not. If you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 366, 28, 72, 'believe this and if you say, ''No, it is not possible in my case,'' then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 367, 1, 72, 'it won''t work. But if you can believe, ''Lord, there is nothing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 367, 2, 72, 'impossible for you, you can take the mess I made of my life and still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 367, 3, 72, 'accomplish something glorious and fulfil your perfect plan,'' it will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 367, 4, 72, 'happen according to your faith. Think of the story of the prodigal son');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 367, 5, 72, 'who wasted so many years and all that father''s money. And when he came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 367, 6, 72, 'back, the Bible says, he got the best robe and the best seat. What was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 367, 7, 72, 'that? It is a message that says that God can pick up a person who has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 367, 8, 72, 'made a mess of his life and make something glorious out of him. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 367, 9, 72, 'the story of the prodigal son. Think of the story of the man who went');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 367, 10, 72, 'out hiring labourers. He went at 6 in the morning and hired labourers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 367, 11, 72, 'and then he went at 5 in the evening to hire labourers, who could work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 367, 12, 72, 'only for one out of twelve hours. In other words, they had wasted 90% of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 367, 13, 72, 'their life, 11 hours out of 12. But when they went and worked, they got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 367, 14, 72, 'their reward first. What does that parable in Matthew 20 teach us? That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 367, 15, 72, 'God can do something even with those who have ruined 90% of their lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 367, 16, 72, 'Nobody is so hopeless that God cannot do something with him. We read in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 367, 17, 72, '1 John 3:8 that Jesus came to destroy the works of the devil. He can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 367, 18, 72, 'untie all the knots that the devil has tied you up with in your life, my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 367, 19, 72, 'brother, my sister. Don''t listen to the lies of the devil. When he says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 367, 20, 72, '''No that is impossible,'' if you believe him, it will be impossible. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 367, 21, 72, 'if you believe God, who can take the broken vessel, and as a potter,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 367, 22, 72, 'make it anew again, then it will be fulfilled in your life, whatever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 367, 23, 72, 'your blunders and failures were.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 367, 24, 72, 'You can make a new beginning and if you made a thousand new beginnings,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 367, 25, 72, 'you can make a thousand and first new beginning today. God can make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 367, 26, 72, 'something glorious out of your life. Give glory to God by believing this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 367, 27, 72, 'is true. And one day in eternity, God will show you as a person who was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 367, 28, 72, 'a failure, but from whom He brought tremendous glory in your earthly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 368, 1, 72, 'life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 368, 2, 72, 'Share');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 368, 3, 72, 'Who Am I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 368, 4, 72, 'Our Message');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('basic_christian_teachings', 368, 5, 72, 'Resources');
