INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 1, 1, 1, 'Chapter Introduction');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 1, 2, 2, 'Chapter 1 The Other Half of the Great Commission');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 1, 3, 2, 'The burden I have on my heart is to bring a balance in the matter of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 1, 4, 2, 'fulfilling the Great Commission. All Christians know how important it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 1, 5, 2, 'to fulfill what is known as "the Great Commission," which Jesus gave to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 1, 6, 2, 'His disciples just before He left this earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 1, 7, 2, 'The first part of that Great Commission is found in Mark 16:15, "Go into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 1, 8, 2, 'all the world and preach the gospel to all creatures. He who believes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 1, 9, 2, 'and is baptized will be saved; but he who does not believe will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 1, 10, 2, 'condemned." But there''s another part of this Great Commission -- the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 1, 11, 2, 'other half, so to speak -- which is described in Matthew 28:18-20. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 1, 12, 2, 'Jesus says, "All authority has been given to Me in heaven and on earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 1, 13, 2, 'Go therefore and make disciples of all nations, baptizing them in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 1, 14, 2, 'name of the Father and the Son and the Holy Spirit, teaching them to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 1, 15, 2, 'observe all that I commanded you; and lo, I am with you always, even to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 1, 16, 2, 'the end of the age."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 1, 17, 2, 'I have observed Christendom -- born-again Christians, Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 1, 18, 2, 'missions, and Christian churches -- in the last 52 years since I was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 1, 19, 2, 'born again, and I find that most Christians emphasize the Mark 16:15');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 1, 20, 2, 'aspect of the Great Commission. Very few emphasize the other half,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 1, 21, 2, 'Matthew 28:19. My guess would be that 99% make Mark 16:15 their primary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 1, 22, 2, 'focus, while only about 1% prioritize Matthew 28:19-20. To use an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 1, 23, 2, 'illustration, that is like a hundred-people trying to carry a log, with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 1, 24, 2, '99 people at one end of the log and only one person at the other end,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 1, 25, 2, 'struggling to hold that end up. That''s the way I see it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 1, 26, 2, 'So I found that the Commission the Lord gave me when I began to teach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 1, 27, 2, 'the Word as He gifted me was to emphasize the other aspect of the Great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 1, 28, 2, 'Commission, the one which is being fulfilled only by about 1%, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 2, 1, 2, 'the true balance should be 50-50. The first part of the Great Commission');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 2, 2, 2, 'is what we know as evangelism. It is generally called missionary work,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 2, 3, 2, 'and often requires going into unreached areas. It is very essential to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 2, 4, 2, 'bring the message of the Gospel (that man is in sin, that all have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 2, 5, 2, 'sinned and come short of the glory of God, that Christ died for the sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 2, 6, 2, 'of the world, that He is the only way to the Father, that Christ rose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 2, 7, 2, 'from the dead, that he who believes in Him and is baptized will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 2, 8, 2, 'saved, and that he who does not believe will be condemned) to these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 2, 9, 2, 'unreached areas.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 2, 10, 2, 'But did the Lord want it to stop there? Once a person has believed,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 2, 11, 2, 'accepted the fact that he''s a sinner, and received Christ as a Savior,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 2, 12, 2, 'is that all? Not at all. In Matthew 28:19, He asks us to go into all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 2, 13, 2, 'nations and make disciples.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 2, 14, 2, 'The early apostles who heard this commission for the first time had no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 2, 15, 2, 'doubt in their minds as to what was meant by "disciples," because Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 2, 16, 2, 'had explained it very clearly to them in Luke 14.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 2, 17, 2, 'When Jesus saw a great multitude of people coming along with Him, as we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 2, 18, 2, 'read in Luke 14:25, He turned and said some of the hardest words that He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 2, 19, 2, 'ever spoke to anyone. Most preachers and pastors, if they see a great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 2, 20, 2, 'crowd coming to listen to them, would never dream of speaking words like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 2, 21, 2, 'this, and this shows us how Jesus was different. He was not interested');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 2, 22, 2, 'in numbers. There are very few Christian preachers today who are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 2, 23, 2, 'interested in numbers; but what we see through the end of Luke 14 is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 2, 24, 2, 'Jesus emphasizing quality. He wanted disciples, and so He turns around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 2, 25, 2, 'and tells them, "If any of you come to Me and you don''t hate your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 2, 26, 2, 'father, mother, wife, children, brothers and sisters and even your own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 2, 27, 2, 'life, you cannot be My disciple." It''s not that you can be a second');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 2, 28, 2, 'level of disciple; you cannot be a disciple, period.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 3, 1, 2, 'Here we see the first condition of discipleship. The Bible says that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 3, 2, 2, 'we''ve got to honor our father and mother. What then did Jesus mean when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 3, 3, 2, 'He said we must "hate"? It''s a relative statement. Jesus used some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 3, 4, 2, 'strong language sometimes - for example: "If your right eye offends you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 3, 5, 2, 'pluck it out." "If your right hand offends you, cut it off." "It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 3, 6, 2, 'easier for a camel to go through the eye of a needle than for a rich man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 3, 7, 2, 'to enter God''s kingdom." "If you don''t eat My flesh and blood, you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 3, 8, 2, 'have eternal life." He spoke many strong words. But the words that He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 3, 9, 2, 'spoke were spirit and life. So, what He actually meant here was that, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 3, 10, 2, 'comparison with our love for Him, our love for our earthly relatives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 3, 11, 2, 'should be like darkness compared to light. To use an illustration, if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 3, 12, 2, 'your love for your parents, wife, children, brothers, and sisters is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 3, 13, 2, 'like the light of the stars, then your love for Christ must be like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 3, 14, 2, 'light of the sun. When the sun comes up, the stars seem to become dark.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 3, 15, 2, 'They are still there, but you can''t see them in the light of the sun.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 3, 16, 2, 'So, the word "hate" here means that your love for your father and mother');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 3, 17, 2, 'is almost invisible: you still love them, but in the light of your love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 3, 18, 2, 'for Christ, which is like the bright-shining sun, this love is like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 3, 19, 2, 'darkness by comparison. Love for our family members is like hatred when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 3, 20, 2, 'compared with our love for Christ. It also means that we should not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 3, 21, 2, 'allow any family member to hinder us from following whatever the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 3, 22, 2, 'may call us to do.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 3, 23, 2, 'So, the first condition of discipleship is a supreme love for Christ,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 3, 24, 2, 'where we love Christ more than our parents, more than our wives, more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 3, 25, 2, 'than our children, more than every brother and sister in our blood');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 3, 26, 2, 'relationship or within the church, and more than our own life. Would you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 3, 27, 2, 'say that missionary work and evangelism has brought Christians to this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 3, 28, 2, 'place? Has every person who claims to be a born-again Christian come to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 4, 1, 2, 'this place? Have you yourself, if you claim to be a born-again');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 4, 2, 2, 'Christian, come to this place? Can you honestly say that you love Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 4, 3, 2, 'supremely more than anyone on this earth? In my observation of believers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 4, 4, 2, 'in many lands in the last half-century, I don''t find that to be true.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 4, 5, 2, 'Many have accepted Christ and sing, "my sins are all forgiven and I''m on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 4, 6, 2, 'my way to heaven," but they haven''t become disciples.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 4, 7, 2, 'The second condition of discipleship is mentioned in Luke 14:27.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 4, 8, 2, '"Whoever does not carry his own cross and come after Me cannot be My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 4, 9, 2, 'disciple." Again, that is absolute: "cannot." What does it mean to carry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 4, 10, 2, 'the cross every day? He said "his own cross;" I don''t have to carry the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 4, 11, 2, 'cross of Jesus Christ, and I don''t have to carry anybody else''s cross,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 4, 12, 2, 'but I must carry my own cross. Jesus explained it like this in Luke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 4, 13, 2, '9:23: "If anyone wishes to come after Me, he must deny himself, and take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 4, 14, 2, 'up his cross daily and follow Me." In Luke 9:23 the word "daily" is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 4, 15, 2, 'added, which applies Luke 14:27 as well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 4, 16, 2, 'If we are to take up a cross every day of our life and follow Christ, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 4, 17, 2, 'must mean that Christ Himself carried a cross daily. Otherwise, how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 4, 18, 2, 'could He ask me to follow Him daily in taking up my cross? There was an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 4, 19, 2, 'inward cross in the life of the Lord Jesus all through His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 4, 20, 2, 'thirty-three-and-a-half-year life, which culminated in a physical cross');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 4, 21, 2, 'that He carried to Calvary. We need to understand what this inward cross');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 4, 22, 2, 'was, because if I don''t take up that cross in my life -- I cannot be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 4, 23, 2, 'disciple. Today we don''t use the word "cross" much because it has become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 4, 24, 2, 'the symbol of Christianity. People have golden crosses and ivory');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 4, 25, 2, 'crosses, but in the day when Jesus spoke about it, it was the most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 4, 26, 2, 'horrible means of executing people that the Romans had invented. Today a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 4, 27, 2, 'more appropriate symbol might be the hangman''s rope, the electric chair,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 4, 28, 2, 'or the guillotine. The cross was a symbol of execution, of a man being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 5, 1, 2, 'put a death because he''s a criminal. Only criminals were crucified.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 5, 2, 2, 'Jesus was speaking about something in us that had to be put to death');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 5, 3, 2, 'every day if we are to follow Him. What is that? And as we see in other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 5, 4, 2, 'places, Jesus spoke about our self-life: "If anyone loves his own life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 5, 5, 2, '(his self-life), he will lose it." This is the cross that we must take,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 5, 6, 2, 'where our self is crucified every day. Where we say, in the words of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 5, 7, 2, 'Jesus in the Garden of Gethsemane, "not My will but Thine." The strength');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 5, 8, 2, 'of my self is found in my will. I want to do my will, whatever pleases');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 5, 9, 2, 'me. This is the root of all sin, and if that is not put to death, then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 5, 10, 2, 'I''m not taking up the cross. This is something that needs to be done');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 5, 11, 2, 'every single day. It''s only then that I can be a disciple. I don''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 5, 12, 2, 'to necessarily say those words every single day, but I must have the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 5, 13, 2, 'attitude, "I''m not going to do my will this day in any area. I''m going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 5, 14, 2, 'to do the will of God." It''s one of the things that Jesus taught us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 5, 15, 2, 'pray, "Thy will be done on earth as it is done in heaven." In heaven,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 5, 16, 2, 'none of the angels do their own will. They always wait upon God to see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 5, 17, 2, 'what God wants them to do, and that''s what they do every single day in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 5, 18, 2, 'heaven. If our days are to be like the days of heaven on earth, if our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 5, 19, 2, 'life is to be a heavenly life, then here''s the secret: "Thy will be done');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 5, 20, 2, 'on earth as it is done in heaven." In other words, my attitude to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 5, 21, 2, 'Lord is, "Lord I never want to do my own will in anything. I don''t want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 5, 22, 2, 'to marry whom I like; I don''t want to take the job I like; I don''t want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 5, 23, 2, 'to live where I like; I want to know what Your will is, in every single');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 5, 24, 2, 'area. When somebody treats me badly I want to react in the way You want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 5, 25, 2, 'me to react, and not the way my flesh, my self-life, wants to react."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 5, 26, 2, 'This is the meaning of taking up the cross every single day, and He says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 5, 27, 2, 'if you don''t do that, you absolutely "cannot be My disciple."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 5, 28, 2, 'Knowing that Jesus gave the other half of the Great Commission in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 6, 1, 2, 'Matthew 28, do you find that the believers you''ve met are walking in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 6, 2, 2, 'this way of taking up the cross every single day, of dying to themselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 6, 3, 2, 'every single day? Are you doing that yourself? This is evidence of how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 6, 4, 2, 'little the Commission given in Matthew 28:19 is being taken seriously by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 6, 5, 2, 'Christians.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 6, 6, 2, 'The third condition for discipleship is in Luke 14:33. The first is love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 6, 7, 2, 'Jesus more than all our relatives, friends and anyone on earth; the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 6, 8, 2, 'second condition is to love Jesus above our own self-life and our own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 6, 9, 2, 'will; and the third is to love Jesus above all material things. In Luke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 6, 10, 2, '14:33, Jesus says, "None of you (it''s another absolute statement) can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 6, 11, 2, 'My disciple who does not give up all his own possessions." What does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 6, 12, 2, 'this mean in practical terms? We need to understand it. Does it mean we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 6, 13, 2, 'must become hermits or sanyasis and go into the jungles and live there,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 6, 14, 2, 'forsaking everything? No. "Possessions" refers to those things that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 6, 15, 2, 'possess us. My possession is what possesses me. If my house is my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 6, 16, 2, 'possession, I cling to it because it''s mine. I possess it, and so it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 6, 17, 2, 'possesses me. It could be an expensive car that you''ve got or very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 6, 18, 2, 'valuable stocks and shares; you possess them, and then they possess you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 6, 19, 2, 'because your mind is so much on those things. Your mind is not on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 6, 20, 2, 'worthless things that you have in your home, but these very precious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 6, 21, 2, 'possessions.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 6, 22, 2, 'So, what does it mean when it says that we have to "give up all our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 6, 23, 2, 'possessions" if we are to be His disciples? Do I have to sell everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 6, 24, 2, 'that I have? There was one particular young man who came to Jesus, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 6, 25, 2, 'read in Mark 10, whom Jesus did tell to sell all that he had, but Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 6, 26, 2, 'never gave that command to everyone. Zacchaeus, for example, said to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 6, 27, 2, 'Jesus in Luke 19 that He would give away half his goods to the poor and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 6, 28, 2, 'repay those whom he had cheated, and Jesus said that was fine. He said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 7, 1, 2, '"salvation has come to this house." He didn''t demand of Zacchaeus that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 7, 2, 2, 'he should give up everything like the rich young ruler. In the house of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 7, 3, 2, 'Mary, Martha, and Lazarus, Jesus didn''t even demand that they should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 7, 4, 2, 'give up anything. So, He didn''t tell everyone that they should sell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 7, 5, 2, 'everything. The love of money is like cancer: in some cases the cancer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 7, 6, 2, 'is so widespread that a doctor says the only way you can be cured is by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 7, 7, 2, 'removing the entire organ. It could be some internal organ that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 7, 8, 2, 'cancerous, and the doctor says, "There is no other way. You''ve got to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 7, 9, 2, 'remove the whole organ, otherwise you''ll die." But in other cases, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 7, 10, 2, 'cancer has not spread so much, and they need to cut out just a little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 7, 11, 2, 'bit. The love of money is like a cancer. In the case of that young rich');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 7, 12, 2, 'ruler, it had spread so much that the Lord had to tell him, "You''ve got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 7, 13, 2, 'to sell all that you have, and give it to the poor." But in the case of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 7, 14, 2, 'others, like Zacchaeus, it is less. And in case of Mary and Martha, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 7, 15, 2, 'was much less. So, He didn''t give that same command to everyone. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 7, 16, 2, 'depends on how much the love of money has gripped you, how widespread');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 7, 17, 2, 'that cancer is in your life, that determines how much the Lord will tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 7, 18, 2, 'you to actually give up and sell your possessions.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 7, 19, 2, 'The attitude of forsaking what we have is understood perhaps best by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 7, 20, 2, 'thinking of the story Abraham and Isaac. Abraham possessed Isaac as his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 7, 21, 2, 'own. He loved him, and he possessed him. Isaac was the darling of his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 7, 22, 2, 'heart, and he cared more for him than even for his wife. God saw that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 7, 23, 2, 'Isaac was a little idol in Abraham''s heart, that Isaac was actually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 7, 24, 2, 'Abraham''s god. He loved Him too much, and God wanted to detach him from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 7, 25, 2, 'that idolatry of possessing Isaac. So He told Abraham to take Isaac to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 7, 26, 2, 'Mount Moriah and kill him, and Abraham obeyed. God gave him three days');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 7, 27, 2, 'to think about it, so he walked all the way for three days to reach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 7, 28, 2, 'Mount Moriah, and then he said, "Yes Lord, I worship You. I will offer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 8, 1, 2, 'Isaac up to You." But as he took the knife to slay Isaac, God asked him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 8, 2, 2, 'to stop, and told him to take Isaac home. From that day onwards, Abraham');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 8, 3, 2, 'did not possess Isaac, but he had him. Isaac was still in his house, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 8, 4, 2, 'was still his son, but Abraham never possessed him again, and that''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 8, 5, 2, 'very beautiful picture of what it means to forsake our possessions.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 8, 6, 2, 'Think of the things that are most valuable (earthly things, material');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 8, 7, 2, 'things) to you in your life. What are the things that you value, which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 8, 8, 2, 'are very, very, very important for you? Perhaps you should make a list');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 8, 9, 2, 'of them. Those are your possessions, and you must be very honest if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 8, 10, 2, 'want to really be a disciple. You''ve got to be honest about what your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 8, 11, 2, 'possessions really are and then you must decide whether you are willing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 8, 12, 2, 'to stop having a possessive attitude to these things. You know a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 8, 13, 2, 'possession when you hold onto something tightly. For example, if I hold');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 8, 14, 2, 'a pen tightly in my hand, I''m possessing it. It could be your house, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 8, 15, 2, 'could be your bank account, it could be your stocks and shares, it could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 8, 16, 2, 'be your car, it could be anything valuable like your property or real');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 8, 17, 2, 'estate. To have it means you open your palm. It is still there -- you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 8, 18, 2, 'haven''t given it up to somebody else -- but now you say, "Lord I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 8, 19, 2, 'recognize this is not something that''s mine. It is Yours. You''ve given');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 8, 20, 2, 'it to me and I am a steward. I want to use it faithfully, but I''m not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 8, 21, 2, 'going to be possessive about it. This doesn''t possess me. I have it, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 8, 22, 2, 'I thank You for allowing me to have it."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 8, 23, 2, 'So, this is the difference between possessing and having, and Jesus says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 8, 24, 2, 'that I must forsake all my possessions. I can still have many things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 8, 25, 2, 'that the Lord gives back to me and I can use them, but I no longer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 8, 26, 2, 'possess them. So, the third condition of discipleship is that I love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 8, 27, 2, 'Jesus more than all earthly things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 8, 28, 2, 'These are the three conditions of discipleship in Luke 14. First, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 9, 1, 2, 'love Christ more than any human being on this earth. Psalm 73:25 is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 9, 2, 2, 'confession of a true disciple: "Whom have I in heaven but Thee? There is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 9, 3, 2, 'nothing and no one I desire on earth more than You." I do not desire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 9, 4, 2, 'anyone on earth more than Christ. Second, to love Christ more than my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 9, 5, 2, 'own will and my own choice. "Lord, I don''t desire my choice in any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 9, 6, 2, 'matter. I want Your will in every single area my life -- how I''m to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 9, 7, 2, 'spend my time, my money, my energy, my life, my ambitions. My future is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 9, 8, 2, 'all laid at the feet of Jesus." The third condition is that I don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 9, 9, 2, 'possess anything, that everything on earth I will hold loosely. Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 9, 10, 2, 'means more to me than all those things. If the Lord takes away some of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 9, 11, 2, 'those things or I lose some of those things, I say like Job said in Job');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 9, 12, 2, '1:21, "The Lord gave and the Lord has taken away, blessed be the name of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 9, 13, 2, 'the Lord." That is the attitude of a true disciple. If a person does not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 9, 14, 2, 'fulfill these three conditions of discipleship, according to Luke 14, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 9, 15, 2, 'is not a disciple .');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 9, 16, 2, 'When Jesus told His apostles to go into every nation and make disciples');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 9, 17, 2, 'in Matthew 28:19, He meant that we must bring people to the place where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 9, 18, 2, 'they not only know Christ as the Forgiver of their sins, but also as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 9, 19, 2, 'their Lord. That means we love Him more than anyone on earth, more than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 9, 20, 2, 'our own life, more than our own will and more than all the things we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 9, 21, 2, 'possess on earth. He means more to us than all of that. Would you say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 9, 22, 2, 'that Christian missionaries and evangelists who preach the gospel have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 9, 23, 2, 'fulfilled that second half of the Great Commission? I would say no. Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 9, 24, 2, 'you see why I used that illustration of 99% fulfilling Mark 16:15 and 1%');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 9, 25, 2, 'fulfilling Matthew 28:19-20? Ninety-nine people holding one end of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 9, 26, 2, 'log, and one person holding up the other end of the log? That''s why I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 9, 27, 2, 'found that the Lord called me to go and help the one person who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 9, 28, 2, 'holding up the other end of the log. I believe that''s a great need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 10, 1, 2, 'today, and this is also the reason why Christianity has such a bad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 10, 2, 2, 'testimony in so many nations. All of us know how born-again Christians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 10, 3, 2, 'have brought such disgrace to the name of the Lord. Why is it? Because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 10, 4, 2, 'they''ve only been converted; they have not become disciples. They''ve not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 10, 5, 2, 'been brought to giving up their own will, or being detached from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 10, 6, 2, 'things they possess, and therefore the end result is like Jesus said in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 10, 7, 2, 'Luke 14: they''re like people who have laid a foundation, but don''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 10, 8, 2, 'enough to complete the building. In the middle of this whole section on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 10, 9, 2, 'discipleship in Luke 14, Jesus speaks about a man who wants to build a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 10, 10, 2, 'tower, which is a picture of the entire Christian life. By the time he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 10, 11, 2, 'finishes the foundation, it says he doesn''t have enough to complete it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 10, 12, 2, 'The meaning, if you see it in the context of these three conditions of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 10, 13, 2, 'discipleship, is that he''s not willing to complete the tower by paying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 10, 14, 2, 'the price. Maybe he has the money, but he says, "I don''t want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 10, 15, 2, 'complete it."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 10, 16, 2, 'The foundation is that once our sins are forgiven and we have been given');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 10, 17, 2, 'the Holy Spirit, we become children of God. But is that all there is to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 10, 18, 2, 'the Christian life? It must be a tower, according to what Jesus said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 10, 19, 2, 'not just a foundation. Verse 29 says that such a person who does not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 10, 20, 2, 'complete the tower is the object of ridicule, and that the angels in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 10, 21, 2, 'heaven are amazed that Christians who only lay a foundation in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 10, 22, 2, 'Christian life imagine that that is the full purpose of Christianity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 10, 23, 2, 'So that''s why it''s very important to emphasize and understand what it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 10, 24, 2, 'says in Matthew 28:19, that we must go into every nation and make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 10, 25, 2, 'disciples . Whichever nation you are in today, if you are preaching, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 10, 26, 2, 'should be making disciples.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 10, 27, 2, 'Jesus ended this second half of the Great Commission by saying, "Lo I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 10, 28, 2, 'with you always." In essence, "If you do this, go into all nations and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 11, 1, 2, 'make disciples, I''ll be with you always." How can people lay claim to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 11, 2, 2, 'that promise without fulfilling the condition? What a wonderful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 11, 3, 2, 'assurance it is. If I have determined to go into all the world, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 11, 4, 2, 'preach the gospel and to make disciples, the Lord will be with me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 11, 5, 2, 'always.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 11, 6, 3, 'Chapter 2 Baptism');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 11, 7, 3, 'Think about the beauty in the symmetry of our human body. How ugly a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 11, 8, 3, 'body would look if one half of it was muscular and strong, and the other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 11, 9, 3, 'half of it was skin and bones. That would look hideous. What if one eye');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 11, 10, 3, 'was normal size, and the other eye was 1 percent of that size? Or one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 11, 11, 3, 'ear was one percent of the size of the other ear? That''s how bad it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 11, 12, 3, 'looks when the Great Commission, given in Mark 16 and Matthew 28, is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 11, 13, 3, 'fulfilled in an imbalanced way. Mark 16:15 is being emphasized to such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 11, 14, 3, 'an extent that Matthew 28:19-20 is almost ignored. In Matthew 28:19-20,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 11, 15, 3, 'Jesus speaks about making disciples in every nation, not just getting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 11, 16, 3, 'them to the place where their sins are forgiven. Not just getting them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 11, 17, 3, 'to the place where they were baptized, but making them disciples and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 11, 18, 3, 'then leading on to other things, which we will address later.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 11, 19, 3, 'But let''s look at Matthew 28:19. In the last chapter we saw the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 11, 20, 3, 'conditions of discipleship and what it means to make a person a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 11, 21, 3, 'disciple. Jesus''s apostles understood this very clearly. We saw those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 11, 22, 3, 'conditions in Luke 14:25-33. Then He said, "Once you make them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 11, 23, 3, 'disciples, you need to baptize them in the name of the Father, Son, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 11, 24, 3, 'Holy Spirit." In other words, before we baptize them, we must present to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 11, 25, 3, 'them the claims of discipleship, and say, "When you come to Christ,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 11, 26, 3, 'we''re not inviting you just to go to heaven when you die. We''re not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 11, 27, 3, 'inviting you just to come to have your sins forgiven. We''re inviting you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 11, 28, 3, 'to make Jesus Lord of your life. Not someone whom you occasionally visit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 12, 1, 3, 'once a week, but One who''s going to be your Husband. When a woman');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 12, 2, 3, 'marries, she even gives up her parent''s name, and she becomes completely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 12, 3, 3, 'one with her husband. That''s the way she should be, and this is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 12, 4, 3, 'relationship that Christ wants to have with each of us. This is what it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 12, 5, 3, 'means to be a disciple. A woman should not enter into marriage thinking,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 12, 6, 3, '"I''ve only got to spend one day a week with my husband," or, "I can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 12, 7, 3, 'continue to live my own life and visit him once in a while." She must be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 12, 8, 3, 'made aware of the fact that, in marriage, it''s a total commitment to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 12, 9, 3, 'this man whom she''s going to marry .');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 12, 10, 3, 'Even in the preaching of the gospel, there must be a clarity in the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 12, 11, 3, 'we explain to the people to whom we preach, that the Christian life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 12, 12, 3, 'requires total commitment. It means discipleship. It means following the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 12, 13, 3, 'Lord. Those who are ready for that, are ready to be baptized. We don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 12, 14, 3, 'wait till a person becomes perfect, but we do say that a person must be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 12, 15, 3, 'presented with the claims of discipleship. When he accepts these claims');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 12, 16, 3, 'of Christ as Savior and Lord, then we baptize him in the name of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 12, 17, 3, 'Father, Son and Holy Spirit. That''s why we like to wait in our churches');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 12, 18, 3, 'to see whether a person is willing to follow the Lord before we baptize');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 12, 19, 3, 'him. In countries where there''s persecution, or where it''s not popular');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 12, 20, 3, 'to be a Christian, we may not need to wait so long. In the early days,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 12, 21, 3, 'for a Jewish person to become a Christian was a tremendous sacrifice (as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 12, 22, 3, 'it is even today), and that''s why they could baptize a person almost');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 12, 23, 3, 'immediately (as we see in the Acts of the Apostles). For an idol');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 12, 24, 3, 'worshipper to give up their idolatry and become a Christian meant being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 12, 25, 3, 'cut off by their relatives completely. Thus it was easy to know that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 12, 26, 3, 'they were willing to be disciples, and so they could be baptized very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 12, 27, 3, 'soon. But nowadays, in countries where there''s no persecution, it''s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 12, 28, 3, 'so easy to know whether a person has understood the claims of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 13, 1, 3, 'discipleship. He may have just accepted Christ because he wants to go to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 13, 2, 3, 'heaven. The claims of discipleship may not have been presented to him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 13, 3, 3, 'or he may not have understood them, or even if he understood them, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 13, 4, 3, 'may not be willing to fulfill the conditions of discipleship. We have no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 13, 5, 3, 'right to baptize such people. A person can backslide after they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 13, 6, 3, 'baptized -- that''s another issue -- but the claims of discipleship must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 13, 7, 3, 'be made clear to people right at the outset.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 13, 8, 3, 'Jesus always proclaimed the truth like that. When a rich young ruler');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 13, 9, 3, 'came to Him and asked Him, "What must I do to inherit eternal life," He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 13, 10, 3, 'virtually told the rich young ruler to forsake all that he had. When he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 13, 11, 3, 'was not willing to do that and walked away, the Lord never went after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 13, 12, 3, 'him. The Lord never sought to reduce the conditions in order to make it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 13, 13, 3, 'convenient. He didn''t even ask him to come step-by-step. He said, "It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 13, 14, 3, 'absolute. If you want to follow Me, you''ve got to give up all."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 13, 15, 3, 'What we see in Matthew 28:19 is the way the gospel should be presented.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 13, 16, 3, 'Then we can baptize them. Baptism is significant because, as we read in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 13, 17, 3, 'Romans 6, it is symbolic of the burial of that old self: my old way of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 13, 18, 3, 'life, which is basically doing my own will, doing what pleased me,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 13, 19, 3, 'seeking to please myself or seeking to please other human beings. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 13, 20, 3, 'person, that Adamic person living inside me, has died. I have taken my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 13, 21, 3, 'place with Christ on the cross and that person has died. When I accept');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 13, 22, 3, 'that, then I can be baptized. Coming out of the waters of baptism, I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 13, 23, 3, 'testifying that I''m a new person now. So that''s the meaning of being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 13, 24, 3, 'baptized or immersed. If that is not true of a convert, then baptism');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 13, 25, 3, 'becomes meaningless. You can''t bury a man who has not died, and a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 13, 26, 3, 'people who are baptized, are not dead because they have not chosen to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 13, 27, 3, 'die to themselves. Instead, they go into the waters as a ritual. Many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 13, 28, 3, 'parents want to urge their children to be baptized for their own honor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 14, 1, 3, 'Or parents think that baptism will somehow protect their children from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 14, 2, 3, 'the world. It doesn''t. Baptism is only a symbol of a choice that a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 14, 3, 3, 'person has already made - to die to doing his own will. If he hasn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 14, 4, 3, 'made that choice, then it''s a meaningless ritual. Sadly, a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 14, 5, 3, 'Christians go through meaningless rituals like that .');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 14, 6, 3, 'The other thing we read in Matthew 28:19 is that baptism must be in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 14, 7, 3, 'name of the Triune God: Father, Son and Holy Spirit. Christ emphasizes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 14, 8, 3, 'the Trinity, just as it was at His own baptism. We read there was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 14, 9, 3, 'voice from Heaven, which was the voice of the Father. Jesus was the Son');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 14, 10, 3, 'of God going to the river Jordan. And the Holy Spirit descended upon Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 14, 11, 3, 'in the form of a dove. Christian baptism (as commanded by Jesus in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 14, 12, 3, 'Matthew 28:19) emphasizes the Triune God, the three persons of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 14, 13, 3, 'Father, Son and Holy Spirit, Who are three distinct persons, but one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 14, 14, 3, 'God. And that''s why it''s mentioned "in the name," not "the many names."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 14, 15, 3, 'One name: Father, Son, and Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 14, 16, 3, 'This is a mystery. I don''t believe that it''s possible for us as human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 14, 17, 3, 'beings to fully understand the mystery of how God is One but yet in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 14, 18, 3, 'three distinct Persons. To me that is one of the proofs that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 14, 19, 3, 'Christianity is the truth. One proof of it is that I can''t understand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 14, 20, 3, 'everything about God. It''s beyond my human understanding. To use an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 14, 21, 3, 'illustration, a dog is not able to understand a human being. Many things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 14, 22, 3, 'that a human being does, such as mathematics, are beyond a dog''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 14, 23, 3, 'understanding. You may be able to convince a very clever dog or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 14, 24, 3, 'chimpanzee by putting three objects in front of it that one plus one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 14, 25, 3, 'plus one is three. There are some clever chimpanzees who can identify');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 14, 26, 3, 'that and say the total is three. But then if you go on from addition');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 14, 27, 3, '(one plus one plus one equals three) to multiplication, and try to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 14, 28, 3, 'explain to the clever chimpanzee that when one multiplied by one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 15, 1, 3, 'multiplied by one is still one, the chimpanzee is all confused. He can''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 15, 2, 3, 'understand that. Why is that? Because he is not a human being. Whereas');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 15, 3, 3, 'when a little child going to school studies multiplication, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 15, 4, 3, 'understands very clearly that one multiplied by one multiplied by one is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 15, 5, 3, 'still one. Three ones added together will be three, and three ones');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 15, 6, 3, 'multiplied together will still be one.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 15, 7, 3, 'This is a simple illustration which shows that even a 20-year-old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 15, 8, 3, 'chimpanzee won''t be able to understand what an eight-year-old child can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 15, 9, 3, 'understand, because it''s not a human being. For a chimpanzee to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 15, 10, 3, 'understand multiplication, it has to come to the level of the human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 15, 11, 3, 'being. Now consider this: the distance between us and a chimpanzee is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 15, 12, 3, 'much less than the distance between us and God. The distance between us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 15, 13, 3, 'and God is immense. And if a dog or chimpanzee can''t understand what a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 15, 14, 3, 'human being can, then how do you think we as human beings could possibly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 15, 15, 3, 'understand Almighty God, and the fact that the three persons are one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 15, 16, 3, 'God. In fact, if I could explain God, I would have to be God myself,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 15, 17, 3, 'just like a chimpanzee would have to become a human being to understand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 15, 18, 3, 'multiplication. It''s as simple as that. So I don''t seek to understand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 15, 19, 3, 'the mystery of the Godhead. It is arrogance to think that the little cup');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 15, 20, 3, 'of my mind can contain the ocean of God''s wisdom, and His immensity, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 15, 21, 3, 'the mystery that this truth represents.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 15, 22, 3, 'So we can say that the Christian life begins with immersing a person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 15, 23, 3, 'into this mystery, as it were. He acknowledges there that there are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 15, 24, 3, 'things about God he cannot understand. We baptize him in the name of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 15, 25, 3, 'Father and the Son and the Holy Spirit, and he is being immersed into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 15, 26, 3, 'God Himself. When he becomes a disciple, he must have a personal, direct');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 15, 27, 3, 'connection with God. He is not connected to God through a prophet, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 15, 28, 3, 'through a pastor, or through anybody else. Just like a man doesn''t want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 16, 1, 3, 'to have a secretary between him and his wife, Christ doesn''t want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 16, 2, 3, 'have any mediator between Him and His bride, which is you and me, if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 16, 3, 3, 'you''re a disciple of Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 16, 4, 3, 'Emphasizing baptism as one part of the Great Commission includes this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 16, 5, 3, 'great mystery. "Make disciples and baptize them in the name of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 16, 6, 3, 'Father, Son, and Holy Spirit."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 16, 7, 3, 'Right at the beginning of the Christian life, introducing disciples to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 16, 8, 3, 'the mystery of the Trinity, which they can''t understand humanly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 16, 9, 3, 'speaking, but which they can experience, teaches disciples that they can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 16, 10, 3, 'experience the love of the Father and the Son and the power of the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 16, 11, 3, 'Spirit in their lives even though they can''t explain that mystery.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 16, 12, 3, 'There are many things like this in the Christian life, which are a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 16, 13, 3, 'mystery, which disciples may not be able to explain. The important thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 16, 14, 3, 'is not explanation, but reality of experience, in regard to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 16, 15, 3, 'mysteries of our faith. We human beings have such a tremendous faith in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 16, 16, 3, 'the ability of our own mind that we are tempted to arrogantly believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 16, 17, 3, 'that our mind can explain everything. We can limit ourselves from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 16, 18, 3, 'knowing the truth if we say, "I only accept what my mind can explain."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 16, 19, 3, 'That is like a dog saying, "I can''t understand multiplication, so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 16, 20, 3, 'multiplication must be all rubbish." That''s how it is when a man says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 16, 21, 3, '"If I can''t explain the Trinity, It must be all rubbish." But man has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 16, 22, 3, 'limitations in his mind, just like a dog''s limitation that prevents him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 16, 23, 3, 'from understanding multiplication. As we begin the Christian life, it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 16, 24, 3, 'important for us to realize that we are commanded not to lean on our own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 16, 25, 3, 'understanding if we want to follow Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 16, 26, 3, 'I remember once a very tall person was being baptized in our church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 16, 27, 3, 'When he was being immersed in the water by the brother who was baptizing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 16, 28, 3, 'him, I noticed that he did not go in completely. The top part of his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 17, 1, 3, 'head was still above water when the brother lifted him up. So I said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 17, 2, 3, '"Wait. We have to immerse him completely! And the top part of his head,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 17, 3, 3, 'where his brain is, has really got to die so that he can be resurrected');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 17, 4, 3, 'and have the mind of Christ, and be humble enough to acknowledge that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 17, 5, 3, 'his human way of thinking is not capable of understanding divine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 17, 6, 3, 'mysteries apart from the revelation of the Holy Spirit." So I gave the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 17, 7, 3, 'instruction that he be immersed fully.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 17, 8, 3, 'This is important for us to understand. It may be a very small thing,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 17, 9, 3, 'but I believe that many Christians go astray because they try to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 17, 10, 3, 'understand with their mind what can only be revealed by the Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 17, 11, 3, 'In fact, Jesus said that in Matthew 11:25, "I praise You, Father, Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 17, 12, 3, 'of heaven and earth, that You have hidden these things from the wise and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 17, 13, 3, 'intelligent and have revealed them to babes." Have you ever thought');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 17, 14, 3, 'about that verse? Right at the outset of the Christian life, when we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 17, 15, 3, 'baptized in the name of the Father, Son, and Holy Spirit, we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 17, 16, 3, 'acknowledging (whether you know it or not), "There''s a mystery here that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 17, 17, 3, 'my human mind cannot explain fully." It''s hidden from the clever and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 17, 18, 3, 'intelligent, who seek to explain everything of God with their minds.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 17, 19, 3, 'Look at the foolishness of people who believe evolution. Just because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 17, 20, 3, 'they put certain evidence together, they come to certain conclusions,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 17, 21, 3, 'and yet they still have to acknowledge that there is a missing link');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 17, 22, 3, 'there between that chimpanzee and the man, which they never have been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 17, 23, 3, 'able to figure out. When man is so confident in the power of his mind,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 17, 24, 3, 'he doesn''t understand many things in Scripture. The explanation is here,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 17, 25, 3, 'that God has hidden these things from those who are wise and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 17, 26, 3, 'intelligent, and the reason is that they''re proud of their wisdom, their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 17, 27, 3, 'cleverness, and their intelligence. It is not that God is against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 17, 28, 3, 'intelligent people, because God Himself gave us intelligence. But if I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 18, 1, 3, 'become proud of my cleverness and my intelligence, then I''ll become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 18, 2, 3, 'blind to the things of God .');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 18, 3, 3, 'Why does it say that He has revealed them to babes? There''s a word Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 18, 4, 3, 'used in this passage, "revelation," which is different from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 18, 5, 3, 'understanding. Understanding comes through study and analysis and using');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 18, 6, 3, 'my mind, and is useful for solving a chemistry equation or a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 18, 7, 3, 'mathematical. I can use my mind, my cleverness, and my intelligence to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 18, 8, 3, 'grasp and understand such things, but the things of God are not grasped');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 18, 9, 3, 'by understanding, but by revelation. Revelation is a word used in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 18, 10, 3, 'New Testament to speak about truths that cannot be understood by our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 18, 11, 3, 'natural mind without the Holy Spirit enlightening it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 18, 12, 3, 'It says that revelation is given to babes. What do babes have that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 18, 13, 3, 'clever, intelligent people don''t have? Is there any book that anyone can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 18, 14, 3, 'write anywhere in the world that clever people will not understand, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 18, 15, 3, 'that babes will understand? There is one such book, and that is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 18, 16, 3, 'Bible. What does a babe have that the clever, intelligent people don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 18, 17, 3, 'have? First of all, a babe has a pure heart. A little baby''s heart is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 18, 18, 3, 'absolutely pure. He has got no bitterness against anyone. He has got no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 18, 19, 3, 'hatred, no grudges, nothing impure. They also have a humility that no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 18, 20, 3, 'other human being has. Jesus once picked up a little baby and said, "You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 18, 21, 3, 'have to humble yourself like this little child."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 18, 22, 3, 'A very important factor in revelation is humility, and humility is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 18, 23, 3, 'closely connected with death on the cross. Romans 6 says baptism is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 18, 24, 3, 'symbolic of our dying with Jesus, of death to self, of death to the old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 18, 25, 3, 'man. In baptism, I''m burying the old man that was crucified with Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 18, 26, 3, 'on the cross. Ephesians 1:4 says that God has placed us in Christ before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 18, 27, 3, 'the foundation of the world. What that means is God, Who knows the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 18, 28, 3, 'future, knew that millions of years later we would be born and at a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 19, 1, 3, 'particular time in our lives, we would open our life and surrender');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 19, 2, 3, 'ourselves to Christ. He chose us on the basis of this foreknowledge. 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 19, 3, 3, 'Peter 1:1-2 says that on the basis of God''s knowledge of the future, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 19, 4, 3, 'chose us in Christ. Before Genesis 1:1, right at the beginning, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 19, 5, 3, 'placed us in Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 19, 6, 3, 'Imagine a piece of paper placed completely inside a Bible. The paper');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 19, 7, 3, 'represents you, and the Bible symbolizes Christ. The Father placed you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 19, 8, 3, 'completely in Christ, just like the paper is completely inside the book.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 19, 9, 3, 'So in that sense, whatever happens to the book, happens to the paper');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 19, 10, 3, 'inside the book as well. You were in Christ, and when Christ died on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 19, 11, 3, 'cross, because you were (in God''s mind) placed in Christ before the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 19, 12, 3, 'foundation of the world, you died with Him when He died. And when He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 19, 13, 3, 'buried, you were buried with Him spiritually; when He rose again, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 19, 14, 3, 'rose again with Him spiritually; and when He ascended to heaven, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 19, 15, 3, 'ascended with Him spiritually. Now when you are born again and the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 19, 16, 3, 'Spirit comes into you, these things become a reality in your life. So in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 19, 17, 3, 'baptism, you are testifying: "I accept that on the cross, not only were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 19, 18, 3, 'my sins forgiven, but I also died with Christ." This is something that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 19, 19, 3, 'we need to lead Christians to understand right at the beginning of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 19, 20, 3, 'Christian life. Your old man was crucified with Christ, and you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 19, 21, 3, 'risen again. This is not some postgraduate lesson. It''s okay if you were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 19, 22, 3, 'baptized and you didn''t understand the full meaning of baptism. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 19, 23, 3, 'since Romans 6 fully explains the meaning, it is good for us to seek to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 19, 24, 3, 'understand it. We are baptized in the name of the Father, Son, and Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 19, 25, 3, 'Spirit so that we can be raised up, and as we come out of the water, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 19, 26, 3, 'are saying, "I''m raised up with Christ, and now my mind is set on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 19, 27, 3, 'things that are above."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 19, 28, 3, 'The command to be baptized in Matthew 28:19 is not something we should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 20, 1, 3, 'take as a ritual. It''s unfortunate that many people, despite being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 20, 2, 3, 'obedient to Scripture, don''t seek to understand the meaning of Biblical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 20, 3, 3, 'practices. If you don''t understand the meaning of baptism, then you miss');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 20, 4, 3, 'out on the full blessing of it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 20, 5, 3, '"Make disciples and baptize them into the name of the Father, Son, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 20, 6, 3, 'Holy Spirit." We must acknowledge that there are many things that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 20, 7, 3, 'can''t understand, but as we accept them by faith, and as we come in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 20, 8, 3, 'humility, God reveals them to us. For example, we read in 1 Corinthians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 20, 9, 3, '2:10, "God has revealed them to us through the Holy Spirit." When the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 20, 10, 3, 'Holy Spirit comes into our heart, He reveals things that our mind cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 20, 11, 3, 'grasp. As we come in humility like little babes, He reveals these things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 20, 12, 3, 'to us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 20, 13, 3, 'There are a lot of people who deny the Trinity. So there''s something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 20, 14, 3, 'seriously wrong if you are not baptized in the name of the Father, Son,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 20, 15, 3, 'and Holy Spirit. To really become a disciple, you need to be baptized in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 20, 16, 3, 'the name of the Father, Son and Holy Spirit, and then you can move on to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 20, 17, 3, 'more of what Jesus taught.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 20, 18, 4, 'Chapter 3 Teaching People to Do All That Jesus Commanded');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 20, 19, 4, '"Teaching them to do all that I commanded you…" (Matthew 28:20)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 20, 20, 4, 'This is the next part of the Great Commission. First, we go into all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 20, 21, 4, 'world and tell people that they are sinners, that Christ died for their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 20, 22, 4, 'sins and rose up from the dead, that He ascended to heaven and is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 20, 23, 4, 'returning, and that He is the only way to the Father. Wherever we find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 20, 24, 4, 'people responding, then we invite them to make Jesus Lord of their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 20, 25, 4, 'lives, to be disciples who are going to follow Christ all their life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 20, 26, 4, 'baptize them into the name of the Father, Son, and Holy Spirit, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 20, 27, 4, 'introduce them to the mystery of the Godhead. But doesn''t finish there;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 20, 28, 4, 'all of that is like coming to the starting line of the Olympic marathon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 21, 1, 4, 'race');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 21, 2, 4, 'Running the Race After We Reach the Starting Line');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 21, 3, 4, 'It would be a great feat if you were selected to represent your country');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 21, 4, 4, 'and to get to come to the starting line of the Olympic marathon race.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 21, 5, 4, 'That itself is a feat, but it doesn''t mean anything on its own, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 21, 6, 4, 'coming to the starting line is just the beginning of the race. The fact');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 21, 7, 4, 'that you have become a disciple and have been baptized in the name of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 21, 8, 4, 'the Father, Son, and Holy Spirit is likewise great, but just like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 21, 9, 4, 'picture of the Olympics, you must begin to run the race. And to run that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 21, 10, 4, 'race is to do every single thing that Jesus commanded us. This will take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 21, 11, 4, 'a lifetime for every Christian, and this is what every church should be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 21, 12, 4, 'teaching people. If a church is prioritizing making disciples and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 21, 13, 4, 'baptism, it should not stop there. What should they be teaching every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 21, 14, 4, 'Sunday in their church services? Every single thing that Jesus taught.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 21, 15, 4, 'All that Jesus taught, not just a few selected things, and certainly not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 21, 16, 4, 'psychology or mere entertainment. It''s sad when a church is more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 21, 17, 4, 'interested in improving its music than improving the quality of its');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 21, 18, 4, 'members. That''s extremely sad. What do you think God in heaven is more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 21, 19, 4, 'interested in?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 21, 20, 4, 'Suppose a new church is gathered together. Assume they are full of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 21, 21, 4, 'people who are really born again, and they really want to make Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 21, 22, 4, 'Lord of their life. If you find that such a church is concentrating on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 21, 23, 4, 'music, do you think God is pleased? It''s good to have good music. I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 21, 24, 4, 'not against that. But it is a question of priority. What is God more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 21, 25, 4, 'interested in, the quality of the people in that church becoming more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 21, 26, 4, 'Christ-like, or the music becoming more entertaining? There we can see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 21, 27, 4, 'how Christians have drifted away, because Christian leaders haven''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 21, 28, 4, 'understood what pleases God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 22, 1, 4, 'What are we supposed to do in our churches? We are to teach people to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 22, 2, 4, 'obey every single thing that Jesus commanded. We cannot teach others how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 22, 3, 4, 'to obey God''s commands if we haven''t obeyed them ourselves. Notice the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 22, 4, 4, 'difference between these two statements: "Teach them all that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 22, 5, 4, 'commanded you," and "Teach them to do all that I commanded you." If I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 22, 6, 4, 'just had to teach others all that Jesus commanded, I can take all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 22, 7, 4, 'teachings of Jesus and teach them just like a man teaches chemistry or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 22, 8, 4, 'physics or history. I study the concepts and I teach them. But to "Teach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 22, 9, 4, 'them to do…" would require that I''ve done it myself first, so that I can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 22, 10, 4, 'teach them how they can also do it. If I haven''t done it myself, I would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 22, 11, 4, 'be like a person teaching swimming when I don''t know how to swim. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 22, 12, 4, 'understood the principles and techniques of swimming, you can explain it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 22, 13, 4, 'clearly on a blackboard to whole lot of people, and yet not be a swimmer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 22, 14, 4, 'yourself. That''s merely "teaching them." But "teaching them to do…" is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 22, 15, 4, 'showing them in the swimming pool or in a river how you can actually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 22, 16, 4, 'swim on the surface of the water, and how to move from place to place.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 22, 17, 4, 'A biblical Christian leader has the responsibility to teach people to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 22, 18, 4, 'actually do every single thing that Jesus commanded, and that is a huge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 22, 19, 4, 'amount of teaching. That''s why I wrote this book, to fulfill that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 22, 20, 4, 'command. All that I am seeking to do in this book is to fulfill the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 22, 21, 4, 'command of Jesus, to teach all that Jesus taught, and to teach you to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 22, 22, 4, 'it as I''ve sought to do it myself in the last 52 years of my life. Not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 22, 23, 4, 'just emphasizing the things that are my favorite commands, or the ones');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 22, 24, 4, 'that are easy, and neglecting the others. In the Old Testament law, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 22, 25, 4, 'gave many commandments. We all know the major Ten Commandments, but did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 22, 26, 4, 'you know there were 603 other commandments, making a total of 613');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 22, 27, 4, 'commandments? Many were "do''s" and many were "don''ts," and some of those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 22, 28, 4, 'commandments were not as important as the ten commandments. Even Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 23, 1, 4, 'emphasized that, in Matthew 5:19, when He uses the expression "the least');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 23, 2, 4, 'of these commandments."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 23, 3, 4, 'The Importance of Keeping the Small Commandments');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 23, 4, 4, 'So in other words, in Jesus'' understanding, all commandments did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 23, 5, 4, 'have equal importance. There was an order of priority. Some things were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 23, 6, 4, 'more important than others. There were certain commands, like certain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 23, 7, 4, 'types of food they were not supposed to eat, in Leviticus 11, that were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 23, 8, 4, 'not as important as not committing murder and not committing adultery.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 23, 9, 4, 'But they were still commandments, and that''s what made Daniel a man whom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 23, 10, 4, 'God accepted, because he decided to keep those least commandments in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 23, 11, 4, 'Old Testament. In Daniel 1:8, it says, "Daniel made up his mind that he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 23, 12, 4, 'would not defile himself with the king''s choice food." Perhaps there was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 23, 13, 4, 'some pork on that table, or some type of bird that God had forbidden in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 23, 14, 4, 'Leviticus 11. Daniel may not have been able to give a full explanation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 23, 15, 4, 'for the reasons why God had forbidden those things, but he decided, "If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 23, 16, 4, 'that is part of the Law of Moses, even if it''s not part of the Ten');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 23, 17, 4, 'Commandments, I''ll keep it." It''s written that, because he wouldn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 23, 18, 4, 'defile himself, God honored him, and made him a mighty witness in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 23, 19, 4, 'Babylon. God saw in Daniel a man who was willing to keep all His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 23, 20, 4, 'commandments.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 23, 21, 4, 'This is how it has always been through the ages. God has always looked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 23, 22, 4, 'for those who will keep His commandments, those who will do all that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 23, 23, 4, 'Jesus taught, and not just pick and choose the commandments they like.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 23, 24, 4, 'In Matthew 5:19, Jesus said, "Whoever annuls one of the least of these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 23, 25, 4, 'commandments, and teaches others to do the same, shall be called least');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 23, 26, 4, 'in the kingdom of heaven." Jesus doesn''t say he''ll go to hell, but he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 23, 27, 4, 'will be the least in terms of Heaven''s recognition and values. To be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 23, 28, 4, 'least on the earth is absolutely unimportant. It doesn''t matter. But to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 24, 1, 4, 'be least in the kingdom of heaven means that God Almighty doesn''t think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 24, 2, 4, 'much of you. I don''t want to be in that category! I don''t care if the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 24, 3, 4, 'world doesn''t think much of me, but I certainly want God to think much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 24, 4, 4, 'of me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 24, 5, 4, 'It is said about John the Baptist, that the angel Gabriel told his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 24, 6, 4, 'father Zechariah, "Your son John will be great in the sight of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 24, 7, 4, 'Lord." To be great in the sight of the Lord is certainly something worth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 24, 8, 4, 'coveting. I don''t want to be least in the sight of the Lord, to be one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 24, 9, 4, 'whom the Lord doesn''t think much of. Yet here it says here that there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 24, 10, 4, 'are going to be some people who are least in the kingdom of heaven, not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 24, 11, 4, 'because they don''t keep the major commandments, but because they ignore');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 24, 12, 4, 'the minor ones.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 24, 13, 4, 'I find that attitude among many Christians even today. They say they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 24, 14, 4, 'New Testament Christians, but they neglect some minor New Testament');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 24, 15, 4, 'commands and say, "That''s not important, you don''t have to obey that."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 24, 16, 4, 'I''m not questioning their faith in Christ. I''m not here to judge whether');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 24, 17, 4, 'they go to heaven or hell. That''s not my business. God is the judge of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 24, 18, 4, 'that, but I certainly believe what Jesus said, that if one cancels the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 24, 19, 4, 'least commandment of all that Jesus taught (and all that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 24, 20, 4, 'subsequently taught through His Holy Spirit through the Apostles, in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 24, 21, 4, 'Epistles), then he will be called the least in the kingdom of heaven. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 24, 22, 4, 'contrast to that, who is the one who is going to be great in the kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 24, 23, 4, 'of heaven? The one who keeps the least commandment and teaches people to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 24, 24, 4, 'keep the least commandment. Matthew 5:19 could not be clearer. It''s very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 24, 25, 4, 'clear.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 24, 26, 4, 'Your attitude to the smallest commandments in the New Testament is what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 24, 27, 4, 'shows where you stand before God in His kingdom. Jesus said, "If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 24, 28, 4, 'love Me, keep My commandments." That''s the mark of our love. Nobody can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 25, 1, 4, 'say, "I love Jesus," and ignore His commandments. To the extent that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 25, 2, 4, 'ignore the least of the commandments of Jesus, in that measure, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 25, 3, 4, 'don''t love Him. Maybe you do keep the big ones, but it''s your attitude');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 25, 4, 4, 'to the least of them that determines your position in God''s kingdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 25, 5, 4, '"All That Jesus Taught" Isn''t the Only Commandments Made in the Gospels');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 25, 6, 4, 'One more word of clarification regarding "all that Jesus taught." There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 25, 7, 4, 'are some people who say, "What Jesus said in the Gospels is more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 25, 8, 4, 'important than what is written in the Epistles. The Epistles could be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 25, 9, 4, 'merely Paul''s opinion, or Peter''s opinion, or James'' opinion. And if it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 25, 10, 4, 'is Paul''s opinion or Peter''s opinion and James'' opinion, then I can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 25, 11, 4, 'throw that in the trash can." If that logic were true, then I wouldn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 25, 12, 4, 'even keep the Epistles in my Bible. I''d cut out those pages and throw');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 25, 13, 4, 'them in the trash can. Why do I want to know what Peter or Paul thought');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 25, 14, 4, 'about something? It may have some value, but I wouldn''t call such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 25, 15, 4, 'opinions the Word of God. Certainly not. A godly man''s opinion may be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 25, 16, 4, 'important, but you can''t say it is the Word of God. How in the world can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 25, 17, 4, 'I say something is the Word of God, and worthy of being included in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 25, 18, 4, 'Bible, if it is just somebody''s opinion? Do you know what Jesus said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 25, 19, 4, 'before He went to the cross, at the Last Supper? In John 16:12, He said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 25, 20, 4, 'to His disciples, "I have many more things to say to you, but you cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 25, 21, 4, 'bear them now (or you cannot understand them now, because you can''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 25, 22, 4, 'grasp the importance of them now). But when the Holy Spirit, the Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 25, 23, 4, 'of truth, comes, He will guide you into all the truth." This is very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 25, 24, 4, 'important for us to understand.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 25, 25, 4, 'Paraphrasing His words, what Jesus is saying is, "There are a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 25, 26, 4, 'things I want to share with you, My dear disciples, but you won''t be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 25, 27, 4, 'able to understand them. I wanted to tell you about all that''s involved');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 25, 28, 4, 'in New Covenant life. I want to share with you all that''s involved in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 26, 1, 4, 'having the fruit of the spirit, and partaking in the divine nature. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 26, 2, 4, 'want to share with you what it means to have the gifts of the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 26, 3, 4, 'Spirit to serve Me. I want to explain to you what Divine Love is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 26, 4, 4, 'different from human love, which is what you have right now. I want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 26, 5, 4, 'explain to you what it means to build the church as the body of Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 26, 6, 4, 'I want to explain to you how to build local churches and how those local');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 26, 7, 4, 'churches are to be administered. I want to explain to you about My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 26, 8, 4, 'second coming and things that''ll happen before I return to this earth; I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 26, 9, 4, 'want to explain to you the real meaning of grace, and how sin will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 26, 10, 4, 'be able to rule over you when you''re under grace. There are many things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 26, 11, 4, 'like that which if I tell you now, you won''t be able to understand,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 26, 12, 4, 'because you don''t have the Holy Spirit."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 26, 13, 4, 'Jesus knew all of these things, and more. He could have shared a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 26, 14, 4, 'things, but that would be like trying to explain calculus to a student');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 26, 15, 4, 'in the third standard. What will he know about calculus? It will just go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 26, 16, 4, 'over his head. He''s got to wait six or seven years before he can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 26, 17, 4, 'understand calculus. It is somewhat similar here, the Lord is saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 26, 18, 4, '"Until the Holy Spirit comes into you, if I explain all these things,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 26, 19, 4, 'it''s a waste of time." Just like it is waste of time teaching');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 26, 20, 4, 'differential calculus to seven-year-old students, because they have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 26, 21, 4, 'grow up. In the same way, Jesus said, "When the Spirit of truth has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 26, 22, 4, 'come, He will lead you into all the truth." There are lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 26, 23, 4, 'commandments in the Epistles, and that''s the fulfillment of John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 26, 24, 4, '16:12-13. It is Jesus Himself speaking in Paul''s letter to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 26, 25, 4, 'Ephesians, the Colossians, the Philippians, the Corinthians, etc. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 26, 26, 4, 'the same for the letters of Peter, of James, the three epistles of John,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 26, 27, 4, 'and the book of Revelation. This is Jesus speaking the things that He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 26, 28, 4, 'could not speak when He was on earth, because they would have never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 27, 1, 4, 'understood it. So in one sense we can say that all that Jesus taught');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 27, 2, 4, 'includes a lot of things in the Epistles. Those are the things that He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 27, 3, 4, 'wanted to teach when He was on earth, but because of the limitations of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 27, 4, 4, 'the apostles, He could not. But once that limitation was removed (when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 27, 5, 4, 'they received the Holy Spirit), then He could teach them through Paul,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 27, 6, 4, 'Peter, James and the other apostles.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 27, 7, 4, 'The Compromising Position of Ignoring Select New Testament Commands If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 27, 8, 4, 'we apply all of these things back to Matthew 5:19, we can say that "he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 27, 9, 4, 'who cancels one of the least of these commandments in the New Testament');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 27, 10, 4, ', he shall be called the least in the kingdom of heaven." I could tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 27, 11, 4, 'you of a number of commandments in the New Testament Epistles which many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 27, 12, 4, 'Christians and Christian leaders ignore. They say, "That was for that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 27, 13, 4, 'time," "It''s not for us today," "That was a cultural command only for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 27, 14, 4, 'those people in Corinth, and not for us today." Once you take that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 27, 15, 4, 'attitude to any commandment in the New Testament, however small it may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 27, 16, 4, 'be, you have to give freedom to another person to say, "Well, take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 27, 17, 4, 'same-sex marriage: it is no longer forbidden. In that time, they had to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 27, 18, 4, 'marry opposite sexes, but now it doesn''t matter. Marriage between man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 27, 19, 4, 'and woman was only for that time." How can you prevent a person from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 27, 20, 4, 'saying that if you also have changed some commandment in the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 27, 21, 4, 'Testament, saying "that was only for that time?" People can say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 27, 22, 4, '"Homosexuality is not wrong. In those days, two thousand years ago, yes,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 27, 23, 4, 'it was wrong. But not today. It was wrong only for that culture and that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 27, 24, 4, 'time." Do you see the foolish position that many Christian leaders put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 27, 25, 4, 'themselves in when they take one commandment out of the New Testament');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 27, 26, 4, 'and say, "That was for that time"? The same difficulty applies to any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 27, 27, 4, 'such compromise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 27, 28, 4, 'Whoever cancels the least of Jesus'' commandments, he will be called the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 28, 1, 4, 'least in the kingdom of heaven. He won''t go to hell, but he will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 28, 2, 4, 'certainly be called the least in the kingdom of heaven, and is totally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 28, 3, 4, 'unfit to be a servant of God. So what did Jesus say in the Great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 28, 4, 4, 'Commission? "Teach them to observe all," and "all" includes the big');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 28, 5, 4, 'commandments, the small commandments, and every single commandment that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 28, 6, 4, 'He taught them to do. The important thing about the commandments,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 28, 7, 4, 'whether they are big or small, is Who commanded them. In the military,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 28, 8, 4, 'people are taught that to obey a simple command like "right turn" or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 28, 9, 4, '"left turn" on the parade ground, is as important as "go to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 28, 10, 4, 'battlefield" or "report for duty at such and such a place." One may be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 28, 11, 4, 'more major commandment than the other; both are equally important.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 28, 12, 4, 'Instant obedience is the mark of any military officer or soldier, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 28, 13, 4, 'that''s the type of person that the Lord wants in His church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 28, 14, 4, 'I find that people are more careful to obey commands in the military');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 28, 15, 4, 'than in the church. The church calls itself "the Lord''s army," but most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 28, 16, 4, 'of them don''t behave like soldiers. From the day they join as recruits,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 28, 17, 4, 'soldiers are taught to instantly obey everything, and not to try to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 28, 18, 4, 'figure out whether they can understand the reason or meaning of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 28, 19, 4, 'command.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 28, 20, 4, 'Have we fulfilled this part of the Great Commission? Do we "Teach people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 28, 21, 4, 'to do all that Jesus commanded" in this way? I find that very few people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 28, 22, 4, 'have taken this matter seriously.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 28, 23, 4, 'The Difference Between Really Living and Merely Existing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 28, 24, 4, 'Matthew 4:4 is the very first sentence that Jesus spoke, after being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 28, 25, 4, 'anointed by the Holy Spirit at His baptism, that is recorded in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 28, 26, 4, 'Scripture. He was anointed with the Holy Spirit at His baptism in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 28, 27, 4, 'Matthew 3:16, and then was led into the wilderness to face temptation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 28, 28, 4, 'At the end of forty days of fasting, we read these words, which are the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 29, 1, 4, 'first words that come out of Jesus'' mouth in response to the first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 29, 2, 4, 'temptation. The first temptation was from the Devil, "If you are Son of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 29, 3, 4, 'God, command these stones to become bread" (Matthew 4:3). And we can say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 29, 4, 4, 'the very first thing that Jesus taught was His response, "Man shall not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 29, 5, 4, 'live on bread alone, but on every word that proceeds out of the mouth of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 29, 6, 4, 'God." That''s a huge subject that we need to think about a lot more than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 29, 7, 4, 'just in this brief space, but I want to mention it here.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 29, 8, 4, 'How shall man live? He doesn''t that say bread is not necessary. Jesus is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 29, 9, 4, 'very realistic. He says bread is necessary -- we need food in order to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 29, 10, 4, 'live -- but not food alone. He''s also saying that food is not primary.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 29, 11, 4, 'What is primary is every word that proceeds out of the mouth of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 29, 12, 4, 'What is every word that proceeds out of mouth of God? Everything that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 29, 13, 4, 'God has said - His commandments and His promises. These are the words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 29, 14, 4, 'that we find in the Scripture, and every Scripture is a word on which I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 29, 15, 4, 'can live. Really live. If I''m only thinking of existing, then I only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 29, 16, 4, 'need food; but if I want to live spiritually, the way God wants me to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 29, 17, 4, 'live, then I need every word of God. That has been revealed to us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 29, 18, 4, 'primarily in the Scriptures, the Bible. A person who is more interested');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 29, 19, 4, 'in food than in studying the Bible has not really understood how God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 29, 20, 4, 'wants man to live. The very first words that Jesus taught us are, "Man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 29, 21, 4, 'shall not live by bread alone, but by every word that proceeds from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 29, 22, 4, 'mouth of God."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 29, 23, 4, 'That is why God has given us His Word: so that we can know how we are to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 29, 24, 4, 'live. If you''re a true disciple of Jesus Christ, you''ll have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 29, 25, 4, 'tremendous passion to know every word of God -- every promise and every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 29, 26, 4, 'commandment -- because that''s the only way you can really live. That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 29, 27, 4, 'why it''s important to understand all that Jesus taught. Otherwise we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 29, 28, 4, 'only exist.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 30, 1, 4, 'Do you know the difference between existing and living? It is this:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 30, 2, 4, 'Every single word of God . And this is not something we just read. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 30, 3, 4, 'says, "every word that proceeds out of the mouth God." God is constantly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 30, 4, 4, 'speaking. I can read the same Scripture 50 times and something fresh');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 30, 5, 4, 'will continue to proceed from the mouth of God in that verse. God''s word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 30, 6, 4, 'in the Bible truly is a most wonderful thing - because it is always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 30, 7, 4, 'living and fresh. We cannot fulfill the Great Commission really if we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 30, 8, 4, 'don''t seek to hear all that Jesus spoke and taught, the promises He gave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 30, 9, 4, 'us, and the commands that He gave us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 30, 10, 5, 'Chapter 4 Complementary Functions in the Body of Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 30, 11, 5, 'The great tragedy in Christendom is that many Christians who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 30, 12, 5, 'fulfilling the first half of the Great Commission do not realize how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 30, 13, 5, 'important it is to fulfill the second half. What is worse, there are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 30, 14, 5, 'many workers who fulfill the first half and actually despise those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 30, 15, 5, 'are seeking to fulfill the second half. If we are humble, we will see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 30, 16, 5, 'that we are fellow workers in the body of Christ, and that one function');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 30, 17, 5, 'is as important as the other. The man who goes out to reach those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 30, 18, 5, 'have never heard the gospel with the message of Christ dying for their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 30, 19, 5, 'sins is as important as the one who is seeking to complete the job by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 30, 20, 5, 'making that person into a disciple and teaching him to do all that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 30, 21, 5, 'commanded.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 30, 22, 5, 'Some Functions are More Popular, but That Doesn''t Mean They''re More');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 30, 23, 5, 'Important');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 30, 24, 5, 'It''s very exciting to fulfill the first part of the Great Commission');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 30, 25, 5, 'because this work often yields many wonderful stories to relate. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 30, 26, 5, 'true accounts of missionary and evangelistic work are always exciting.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 30, 27, 5, 'There are stories to relate of people delivered from demons and idolatry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 30, 28, 5, 'and many things like that, and especially a lot of statistics to report.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 31, 1, 5, 'Evangelists can boast about the number of people they have brought to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 31, 2, 5, 'Christ. But what about another Christian worker, who is taking that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 31, 3, 5, 'convert and making him a disciple who obeys all that Jesus taught? He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 31, 4, 5, 'doesn''t have statistics to boast about, but we may discover when Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 31, 5, 5, 'comes back that that person has done a more faithful job without getting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 31, 6, 5, 'any honor on the earth for making disciples. Generally speaking,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 31, 7, 5, 'Christians like to perform ministries that they can report about, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 31, 8, 5, 'where they can quote numbers. That''s why the Mark 16:15 aspect of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 31, 9, 5, 'Great Commission is far more popular than the other half, in Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 31, 10, 5, '28:19-20. But that is also why we are focused on the other half, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 31, 11, 5, 'teaching people to do all that Jesus commanded.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 31, 12, 5, 'Suppose you''ve spent 25 years reaching out into different parts of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 31, 13, 5, 'world, preaching the gospel and doing evangelism. If you''re an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 31, 14, 5, 'evangelist, you probably have the opportunity to report statistics of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 31, 15, 5, 'hundreds or perhaps thousands of people whom you have brought the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 31, 16, 5, 'Christ. But if you spent those 25 years teaching a group of converts who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 31, 17, 5, 'are not yet disciples to do all that Jesus commanded, you may not have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 31, 18, 5, 'much to report in terms of statistics. You have, however, produced');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 31, 19, 5, 'Christ-like people who are a far better testimony for Christ on earth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 31, 20, 5, 'and ones whom God can show forth to the devil as specimens of people who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 31, 21, 5, 'are redeemed from the nature of Adam, and who can manifest the nature of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 31, 22, 5, 'Christ. That effort brings glory in heaven, not on this earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 31, 23, 5, 'If you''re a Christian who is seeking honor from men (even from fellow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 31, 24, 5, 'Christians!), you will not care much about the second part of the Great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 31, 25, 5, 'Commission, because that won''t give you much to report. You will only be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 31, 26, 5, 'interested in the first part, if your interest is in statistics and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 31, 27, 5, 'numbers and the honor of men. The Old Testament prophets were never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 31, 28, 5, 'popular; it was the false prophets who were popular in Israel. What is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 32, 1, 5, 'the difference between the two? One of the differences was that false');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 32, 2, 5, 'prophets told people what they liked to hear, while true prophets told');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 32, 3, 5, 'the people what they needed to hear from God. And very often, it was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 32, 4, 5, 'rebuke for their sin, their worldliness, their idolatry, adultery, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 32, 5, 5, 'their going away from God, as well as a call to repentance (turning back');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 32, 6, 5, 'to God).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 32, 7, 5, 'Prophetic ministry has never been popular, neither in the Old Testament');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 32, 8, 5, 'nor in the New Testament. New Testament prophetic ministry is, in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 32, 9, 5, 'same way, calling God''s people back to Him, back to the word, back to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 32, 10, 5, 'obedience to the Scriptures, back to obeying all that Jesus taught. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 32, 11, 5, 'is very different from evangelistic ministry - and the body of Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 32, 12, 5, 'cannot be built only by prophets or only by evangelists.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 32, 13, 5, 'To use an illustration, fulfilling the first half of the Great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 32, 14, 5, 'Commission (Mark 16:15) through evangelism can be likened to taking food');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 32, 15, 5, 'from a plate and putting into our mouth. What is the purpose of all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 32, 16, 5, 'evangelism? To bring someone who is not a member of the body of Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 32, 17, 5, 'into the body of Christ. That''s evangelism essentially. Evangelism is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 32, 18, 5, 'designed to make an unbeliever, idol worshipper or person without any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 32, 19, 5, 'God, in to become a part of the body of Christ. My hand takes food,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 32, 20, 5, 'which is not a part of my body at the moment, and picks it up from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 32, 21, 5, 'plate, and puts it into my body. That''s a picture of how evangelism');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 32, 22, 5, 'brings a non-Christian into the body of Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 32, 23, 5, 'How does food fully become a part of the body? First of all, I see the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 32, 24, 5, 'food and I take it with my hand, and put it into my mouth. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 32, 25, 5, 'evangelism, taking the unbeliever and bringing him into Christ. But this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 32, 26, 5, 'food, if it remains in my mouth, is never going to be a part of my body');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 32, 27, 5, 'as long as I keep it in my mouth. It will rot, and I''ll spit it out. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 32, 28, 5, 'lot of people who raise their hands and sign decision cards and say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 33, 1, 5, 'they''ve come to Christ are like that, like food kept in the mouth. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 33, 2, 5, 'go there and visit these five hundred people who''ve signed these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 33, 3, 5, 'decision cards, and you may find only one of them became a real');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 33, 4, 5, 'disciple. The other 499 just drifted away. That happens all the time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 33, 5, 5, 'It''s not enough for the food to simply make it into the mouth. The teeth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 33, 6, 5, 'have to chew the food, and then it goes down the throat and into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 33, 7, 5, 'stomach where there are all types of acids thrown upon it to break it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 33, 8, 5, 'down. At this point, it''s no longer a potato, or a chapati, or rice. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 33, 9, 5, 'will get converted into other forms yet, and after a process of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 33, 10, 5, 'digestion and many other things that happen inside the body, finally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 33, 11, 5, 'that food fully becomes a part of the body. This is a very gentle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 33, 12, 5, 'ministry, initially taking the food and putting it into the mouth, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 33, 13, 5, 'this is evangelism. But after that, other parts of the body take over,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 33, 14, 5, 'and they do things that the hand can never do. Likewise, other workers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 33, 15, 5, 'perform functions which the evangelists can never do, such as prophetic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 33, 16, 5, 'ministry, teaching ministry, shepherding ministry, and apostolic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 33, 17, 5, 'ministry, all of which builds that person to become a living,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 33, 18, 5, 'functioning, effective, and powerful member of the body of Christ. Like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 33, 19, 5, 'that food which, after a few weeks, is no longer a potato, or a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 33, 20, 5, 'chapatti, but has become flesh and blood and bone, so it should be with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 33, 21, 5, 'every person whom the evangelist brings to Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 33, 22, 5, 'Light on the Complementary Gifts Given to the Body of Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 33, 23, 5, 'So which function is more needed? The evangelist, or the prophet, or the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 33, 24, 5, 'shepherd, or the teacher? That is like asking, "Is the hand more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 33, 25, 5, 'important, or the teeth, or the stomach?" There is no way of comparing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 33, 26, 5, 'body parts, because if the hand doesn''t take the food and put it in,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 33, 27, 5, 'then the teeth and the stomach have nothing to do; and if the hand does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 33, 28, 5, 'the job of putting the food into the mouth, but the teeth and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 34, 1, 5, 'stomach don''t do anything, then also it''s wasted. So there''s no use in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 34, 2, 5, 'thinking that the evangelist is more important than the prophet, or that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 34, 3, 5, 'the prophet is more important than the evangelist.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 34, 4, 5, 'These are some of the words that Jesus wanted to speak to His disciples');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 34, 5, 5, 'when He was with them on the earth, but that they couldn''t yet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 34, 6, 5, 'understand. He wanted to teach them about the function of apostles,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 34, 7, 5, 'prophets, evangelists, shepherds, and teachers in the life of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 34, 8, 5, 'church. We''re told in Ephesians 4:11 that these are the gifts that He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 34, 9, 5, 'gave to the church after He ascended to heaven. He wanted to tell His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 34, 10, 5, 'disciples about these things while He was on earth, as we saw in John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 34, 11, 5, '16:12, in the previous chapter. To paraphrase, He said, "I want to teach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 34, 12, 5, 'you these things, but you can''t understand them now because you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 34, 13, 5, 'have the Holy Spirit." Once they received the Holy Spirit, they could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 34, 14, 5, 'understand. Paul could understand, as he said in Ephesians 4:10, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 34, 15, 5, 'when Jesus ascended, above all the heavens, He gave some the gift to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 34, 16, 5, 'apostles. Paul knew these are not the apostles that He appointed when He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 34, 17, 5, 'was on earth, but that these are apostles that He appointed from heaven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 34, 18, 5, 'They were apostles who would go forth and plant local churches, prophets');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 34, 19, 5, 'who would diagnose the spiritual condition of people and provide them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 34, 20, 5, 'with a solution, evangelists who would bring non-Christians into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 34, 21, 5, 'body of Christ, shepherds who would take care of the young ones, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 34, 22, 5, 'teachers who would teach them God''s Word. All of these Christ gave for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 34, 23, 5, 'the purpose of equipping all the believers so that all the believers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 34, 24, 5, 'could build the body of Christ, as he says in Ephesians 4:12. These are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 34, 25, 5, 'not the folks who will build the body of Christ. Ephesian 4:11-12 says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 34, 26, 5, 'people given these five gifts will equip all the other believers who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 34, 27, 5, 'don''t have these gifts, and those believers will build the body of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 34, 28, 5, 'Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 35, 1, 5, 'So in the body of Christ, just like in the human body, every part has a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 35, 2, 5, 'function. We''re not comparing those who fulfill Mark 16:15 with those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 35, 3, 5, 'who fulfill Matthew 28:19. Anybody who compares these two is a person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 35, 4, 5, 'who is ignorant of God''s ways. God needs and uses both this one and that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 35, 5, 5, 'one. It is like asking, "Is your left hand or your right hand important?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 35, 6, 5, 'Which one would you like to cut off?" One may appear to fulfill a more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 35, 7, 5, 'important function than the other, but both are equally necessary in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 35, 8, 5, 'body. God has determined that every part of the body must be healthy and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 35, 9, 5, 'muscular to be useful to fulfill its function .');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 35, 10, 5, 'We Need the Strength of Jesus''s Authority to Fulfill the Great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 35, 11, 5, 'Commission');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 35, 12, 5, 'In order to help us do all that He commanded, Jesus began by saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 35, 13, 5, '"all authority has been given to Me in heaven and on earth" (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 35, 14, 5, '28:18). We must believe that if we''re to go out and fulfill this Great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 35, 15, 5, 'Commission. If I don''t believe that all authority has been given to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 35, 16, 5, 'Jesus, I''m going to give up after a little while, because Christian work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 35, 17, 5, 'can be very discouraging work. You don''t see results immediately.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 35, 18, 5, 'Neither the evangelists nor the prophets nor the apostles see results');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 35, 19, 5, 'immediately. Much like bringing a child up to adulthood. I can attest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 35, 20, 5, 'this through my years of planting churches and establishing believers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 35, 21, 5, 'and trying to lead them up to godliness. It is very easy to get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 35, 22, 5, 'discouraged unless we realize that the One Who is sending me forth into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 35, 23, 5, 'this ministry is One Who has been given all authority in heaven and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 35, 24, 5, 'earth. He is supporting me with that authority.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 35, 25, 5, 'So I look at this part of the Great Commission like this. The second');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 35, 26, 5, 'half of the Great Commission that we''ve been considering -- Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 35, 27, 5, '28:19-20, which says, "Go and make disciples of all nations, baptize');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 35, 28, 5, 'them in the name of the Father, the Son and the Holy Spirit, teach them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 36, 1, 5, 'to do, by doing yourself first (don''t teach what you haven''t done), all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 36, 2, 5, 'that I commanded you" -- is bracketed between two of the most fantastic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 36, 3, 5, 'statements that Jesus made. The first is verse 18, "All authority in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 36, 4, 5, 'heaven and earth is given to Me," and the second is verse 20, "Lo, I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 36, 5, 5, 'with you always, even to the end of the age." If I have a doubt about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 36, 6, 5, 'either of these two facts, I''m not going to fulfill the second half of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 36, 7, 5, 'the Great Commission. I have found in fifty years of Christian ministry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 36, 8, 5, 'that it can be pretty discouraging, if you''re not convinced that:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 36, 9, 5, '- The One who sent you forth is the One who has all authority in heaven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 36, 10, 5, '(in the heavenlies, in the second heavens where the demons dwell) and on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 36, 11, 5, 'earth (over all people on earth). Christ has this authority.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 36, 12, 5, '- When I go forth trying to fulfill this part of the Great Commission, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 36, 13, 5, 'have a specific promise from Him that He will be with me always.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 36, 14, 5, 'We Must Meet the Conditions to Receive Spiritual Promises');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 36, 15, 5, 'Christians have a very bad habit of trying to claim a promise without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 36, 16, 5, 'fulfilling the conditions. For example, if you''re told, "believe in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 36, 17, 5, 'Lord Jesus Christ and you''ll be saved," and you say, "well I''m not going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 36, 18, 5, 'to fulfill the condition, to believe in the Lord Jesus Christ, but I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 36, 19, 5, 'still going to be saved," wouldn''t you think that''s crazy? Or, "If we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 36, 20, 5, 'confess our sins, He is faithful and just to forgive our sins." If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 36, 21, 5, 'don''t fulfill the condition of confessing your sin, how can you believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 36, 22, 5, 'that He''s going to forgive your sin? The promises of God are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 36, 23, 5, 'conditional. There are material promises, like God makes the sun to rise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 36, 24, 5, 'on the good and the evil and He makes the rain to fall on the righteous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 36, 25, 5, 'and the unrighteous, which He gives to everybody without any conditions.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 36, 26, 5, 'But when it comes to the spiritual promises of God, there are conditions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 36, 27, 5, 'to receive them. This begins with the forgiveness of sins. Without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 36, 28, 5, 'repentance and faith in Christ, nobody gets forgiveness of sins.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 37, 1, 5, 'Justification is by faith, and sanctification is by faith. Also, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 37, 2, 5, 'does not give His grace to everyone without condition. He only gives his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 37, 3, 5, 'grace to the humble. There is a condition for every spiritual promise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 37, 4, 5, 'Why do so many Christians, who understand the importance of fulfilling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 37, 5, 5, 'the condition attached to the promise in all these other areas that I''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 37, 6, 5, 'just mentioned, come to this promise, "Lo I am with you always, even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 37, 7, 5, 'unto the end of the age," and try to claim it without fulfilling the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 37, 8, 5, 'condition? That amazes me. They would be surprised if I preach that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 37, 9, 5, 'can be forgiven even if you don''t repent and believe. If I say you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 37, 10, 5, 'be forgiven if you don''t confess your sins, they would say that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 37, 11, 5, 'ridiculous. The Bible says if you confess your sins, He is faithful and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 37, 12, 5, 'just to forgive you, right? Well the same Bible says the Lord will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 37, 13, 5, 'with you always to the end of the age if you go and make disciples,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 37, 14, 5, 'baptize them, and teach them to do all that I have commanded you. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 37, 15, 5, 'is what the Lord said. Then He said, "Lo, I''m with you always."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 37, 16, 5, 'So that is a promise specifically given to those who go forth to teach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 37, 17, 5, 'others to do all that Jesus has commanded. I''ve spent 35 years seeking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 37, 18, 5, 'to fulfill that, teaching people to do all that Jesus commanded, in many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 37, 19, 5, 'parts of the world, through CDs, the internet, and literature. I can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 37, 20, 5, 'testify that I have really experienced the presence and the authority of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 37, 21, 5, 'the Lord with me. So I want to encourage you to believe that God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 37, 22, 5, 'promises are true. His authority will back you if you go forth seeking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 37, 23, 5, 'to teach people to do all that Jesus commanded, by doing it yourself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 37, 24, 5, 'first, and He''ll be with you always. One of the results of His being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 37, 25, 5, 'with us always is, He delivers us from discouragement, gloom, bad moods,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 37, 26, 5, 'and all types of things like that. How in the world can I have a bad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 37, 27, 5, 'mood if Jesus is with me all the time? How in the world can I be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 37, 28, 5, 'discouraged or fearful if Jesus is with me all the time? A lot of people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 38, 1, 5, 'imagine that Christ is with them, when He''s not. They''re not seeking to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 38, 2, 5, 'do all that Jesus commanded; they''re not seeking to teach other people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 38, 3, 5, 'what Jesus commanded. So there''s a condition to fulfill before we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 38, 4, 5, 'claim that promise, and I want to encourage you to see that clearly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 38, 5, 5, 'An Illustration from a Carpenter''s Shop');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 38, 6, 5, 'The first part of the Great Commission (Mark 16:15) is generally being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 38, 7, 5, 'done more by Christians than the second part because, when we think of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 38, 8, 5, 'the phrase, "all that I have commanded you," it covers a wide range of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 38, 9, 5, 'subjects. There is a wide range of areas where we need first of all to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 38, 10, 5, 'do what Jesus has commanded us in our own lives, and then, to teach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 38, 11, 5, 'others to do as well. Otherwise, the Great Commission remains');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 38, 12, 5, 'incomplete. Jesus was a carpenter for the first part of His life up to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 38, 13, 5, 'the age of 30, so I will use an illustration from a carpenter shop:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 38, 14, 5, 'Suppose Jesus as a master carpenter gets an order from a business that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 38, 15, 5, 'wants a hundred tables to be made. Suppose Jesus employs ten carpenters,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 38, 16, 5, 'and nine of them spend all their time making just the legs of those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 38, 17, 5, 'tables. Granted, legs are very important. You can''t have a table without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 38, 18, 5, 'four legs, so at the end of a number of weeks, you will need to have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 38, 19, 5, 'multitudes of legs there. But because there''s just one man making the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 38, 20, 5, 'tabletops, Jesus is going to have a tremendous disproportion between the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 38, 21, 5, 'number of legs and the number of tabletops, and ultimately, He will have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 38, 22, 5, 'very, very few fully completed tables. He may have hundreds of legs, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 38, 23, 5, 'perhaps only three or four tables. So if you were hired now as an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 38, 24, 5, 'additional carpenter to go into that shop, what would you do? What would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 38, 25, 5, 'the Lord tell you to do? I think He''d tell you forget about legs for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 38, 26, 5, 'now, and focus on tabletops so that we can have completed tables.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 38, 27, 5, 'This is a picture of what is happening in a lot of Christendom today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 38, 28, 5, 'Many are being converted, and we should praise the Lord for that. Many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 39, 1, 5, 'evangelists are going into unreached areas with the gospel at great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 39, 2, 5, 'sacrifice. They are laying down their lives to preach the gospel. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 39, 3, 5, 'should respect them and appreciate them, and I believe their reward will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 39, 4, 5, 'be great. They have fulfilled their calling, but there are other parts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 39, 5, 5, 'of the body that need to carry on from there and complete the work. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 39, 6, 5, 'is the second half of the Great Commission: to make these converts into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 39, 7, 5, 'disciples and teach them to do every single thing that Jesus commanded.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 39, 8, 5, 'Is that something we can ignore? We can''t afford to neglect a single');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 39, 9, 5, 'command. For example Jesus said, "No man can serve two masters." He said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 39, 10, 5, 'that in the Sermon on the Mount, in Matthew 6:24. Those two masters are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 39, 11, 5, 'not God and Satan. Even though Satanis the master of many people, that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 39, 12, 5, 'not the one Jesus was referring to here, because no Christian believes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 39, 13, 5, 'that he can serve God and Satan. A Christian does not attempt to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 39, 14, 5, 'that. The two masters mentioned in Matthew 6:24 are God and mammon.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 39, 15, 5, 'Mammon means money, material wealth, material possessions, real estate,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 39, 16, 5, 'stocks and shares, houses, lands, cars, etc. Jesus said we cannot serve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 39, 17, 5, 'both of these, but there aremany Christians who feel they can serve God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 39, 18, 5, 'and material wealth. Jesus said you have to have a radical attitude');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 39, 19, 5, 'towards the one or the other if you want to serve. He said, "You have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 39, 20, 5, 'hate one and love the other or hold on to one and despise the other."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 39, 21, 5, 'How many Christians have understood what it is to "hold onto God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 39, 22, 5, 'hate money?" To say, "I want to use money as my servant, but I won''t let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 39, 23, 5, 'it be my master?" Have all those who''ve been converted through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 39, 24, 5, 'evangelism come to that place? Another example is what Jesus said about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 39, 25, 5, 'plucking out our eye if it stumbles us and causes to lust after woman.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 39, 26, 5, 'How many Christians have even been taught that? How many preachers have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 39, 27, 5, 'lived that standard of life so that they''re able to teach it? There you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 39, 28, 5, 'see how so many tables are incomplete, and thus the work of the Great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 40, 1, 5, 'Commission is incomplete.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 40, 2, 6, 'Chapter 5 Doing Must Come Before Teaching');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 40, 3, 6, 'Jesus wants us to do and then to teach, not teach what we have not done.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 40, 4, 6, 'We don''t begin by teaching; we begin by doing. You can''t go to a Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 40, 5, 6, 'school, spend three years there, get a degree, and then think that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 40, 6, 6, 'can now teach people, if you have not done what Jesus has commanded in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 40, 7, 6, 'your own life. I remember speaking with a person who graduated after a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 40, 8, 6, 'four-year Bible college course in a particular Bible College. He was the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 40, 9, 6, 'top student in his class. At the graduation ceremony where I was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 40, 10, 6, 'speaking, he came to see me and I asked him, "What is your spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 40, 11, 6, 'condition at the end of these four years of study, in your inner life?"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 40, 12, 6, 'He said, "It''s worse than when I first came. I''m more defeated by sin."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 40, 13, 6, 'He was honest. I said, "Now that you are going to go out with your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 40, 14, 6, 'degree and become a pastor somewhere, what are you going to teach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 40, 15, 6, 'people? Hebrew and Greek interpretations of various verses, or can you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 40, 16, 6, 'teach them how to overcome the lust of the eyes, and how to overcome');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 40, 17, 6, 'anger? That''s what they need to hear, because that''s what Jesus taught.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 40, 18, 6, 'And if you haven''t experienced that overcoming in your own life, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 40, 19, 6, 'will just teach theory."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 40, 20, 6, 'This is the sad state of so many preachers and pastors, and that''s why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 40, 21, 6, 'you hear every now and then of some famous preacher or pastor, who has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 40, 22, 6, 'been preaching for many years, suddenly admit that he''s been living in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 40, 23, 6, 'adultery for many years. How is it that the people in the congregation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 40, 24, 6, 'could not discern the impurity in this man''s spirit? Because they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 40, 25, 6, 'taken up by the eloquence of his preaching and the knowledge that he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 40, 26, 6, 'had. Jesus said, "Teach them to do all that I commanded."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 40, 27, 6, 'Acts 1:1 shows us Jesus'' Own example. Acts was written by Luke, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 40, 28, 6, 'co-worker of Paul, and before he wrote the Acts of the Apostles, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 41, 1, 6, 'wrote Luke''s Gospel. He wrote both of them to a person called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 41, 2, 6, 'Theophilus. In the beginning of the Acts of the Apostles, he refers to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 41, 3, 6, 'the gospel that he had written previously by saying, "The first account');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 41, 4, 6, 'I composed, Theophilus, about all that Jesus began to do and teach…" If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 41, 5, 6, 'you were to ask Luke to give a title to his gospel, he would say "All');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 41, 6, 6, 'that Jesus began to do and teach." Not, "All that Jesus taught," but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 41, 7, 6, '"All that He did and taught." It was a principle in Jesus'' life that He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 41, 8, 6, 'would not teach what He hadn''t done. The principle is this: do and then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 41, 9, 6, 'teach. Not teach and do, but do and teach. Jesus did not practice what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 41, 10, 6, 'He preached; He preached what He had already practiced and continued to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 41, 11, 6, 'practice. That''s the principle.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 41, 12, 6, 'Based on that, if you were to ask Luke to give a title to the Acts of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 41, 13, 6, 'the Apostles, what title do you think he would give? If the Gospel of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 41, 14, 6, 'Luke was "All that Jesus began to do and teach in His physical body on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 41, 15, 6, 'earth," then the Acts of the Apostles would be "All that Jesus continued');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 41, 16, 6, 'to do and teach through His spiritual body, the church." That is our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 41, 17, 6, 'ministry, to continue to do and teach what He began to do and teach when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 41, 18, 6, 'He lived on earth for thirty-three years. That''s why the church is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 41, 19, 6, 'called the Body of Jesus Christ. That''s why understanding all that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 41, 20, 6, 'taught is important, because we need to do it and then we need to teach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 41, 21, 6, 'it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 41, 22, 6, 'The Right to Proclaim the Gospel Is Reserved for Those Who Have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 41, 23, 6, 'Experienced It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 41, 24, 6, 'There is a very interesting incident in Acts 10. There we read that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 41, 25, 6, 'there was a very God-fearing military man who was a heathen, not a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 41, 26, 6, 'Christian, and not even a Jew. He was a Roman soldier called Cornelius.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 41, 27, 6, 'That he was a Centurion means he was a certain high-ranking officer in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 41, 28, 6, 'the Roman army, and he was a God-fearing man. It says that "he was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 42, 1, 6, 'devout man, a man who gave many alms to the people, he helped poor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 42, 2, 6, 'people and prayed to God continually." Does God listen to the prayers of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 42, 3, 6, 'people who are not Christians? Does God look at the money that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 42, 4, 6, 'non-Christians give to poor people? Well, have a look here. God sent an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 42, 5, 6, 'angel to Cornelius, and he said to him in Acts 10:4, "Your prayers have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 42, 6, 6, 'ascended as a memorial before God and the money you''ve given to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 42, 7, 6, 'poor, the alms, have also ascended as a memorial before God." Isn''t that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 42, 8, 6, 'interesting? And when Peter saw Cornelius later on, he says, "There''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 42, 9, 6, 'one thing I''ve discovered," Peter says, "That with God, there is no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 42, 10, 6, 'respect of persons." When the angel came to Cornelius, why didn''t he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 42, 11, 6, 'give him the gospel? Why didn''t he ask Cornelius, "Do you know that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 42, 12, 6, 'you''re a sinner, that Christ died for your sins and rose again, that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 42, 13, 6, 'need to receive Him as your Lord, repent and believe?" He couldn''t say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 42, 14, 6, 'that. All that the angel could tell him was "Your prayers and alms have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 42, 15, 6, 'ascended, and now please send somebody to go and call for Peter; he''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 42, 16, 6, 'living far away in another place, in Joppa. It may take a few days for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 42, 17, 6, 'Peter to come here, but you''ve got to wait." And the angel then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 42, 18, 6, 'departed. Don''t you think the angel could have told him exactly what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 42, 19, 6, 'Peter would tell Cornelius? The angel knew the gospel very clearly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 42, 20, 6, 'There''s a very important reason why Almighty God didn''t allow the angel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 42, 21, 6, 'to preach the gospel to Cornelius. Cornelius had to wait for so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 42, 22, 6, 'days to hear the gospel, till Peter came, because the angel had not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 42, 23, 6, 'experienced the gospel. He could not say, like Peter, "I was a sinner,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 42, 24, 6, 'but Jesus died for me, and His blood cleansed my sin, and I''m forgiven."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 42, 25, 6, 'Because the angel could not say that, he could not preach it. He could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 42, 26, 6, 'not preach a truth that he knew only in his mind. He could probably');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 42, 27, 6, 'preach better than Peter; it didn''t matter. He was not allowed to preach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 42, 28, 6, 'it because he hadn''t experienced it, which teaches us one fundamental');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 43, 1, 6, 'principle: we are not permitted by God to preach what we have not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 43, 2, 6, 'experienced. There''s a word for people who preach what they have not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 43, 3, 6, 'practiced or experienced, and the word in the New Testament is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 43, 4, 6, '"hypocrite." There are many hypocritical preachers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 43, 5, 6, 'When Jesus said in His great commission, "Teach them to do all that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 43, 6, 6, 'have commanded you," He was telling us to be free from hypocrisy. He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 43, 7, 6, 'telling us never to speak about that which we haven''t done. For example,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 43, 8, 6, 'if you have not gone to North India as a missionary, you can''t ask other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 43, 9, 6, 'people to go there as missionaries, can you? While you can teach it but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 43, 10, 6, 'you haven''t done it. It is very necessary, and very important to send');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 43, 11, 6, 'missionaries to North India. But who''s got the right to teach it? The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 43, 12, 6, 'one who''s done it. That''s just one example that applies in many other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 43, 13, 6, 'areas of life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 43, 14, 6, 'We must be willing to humble ourselves and recognize that God has placed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 43, 15, 6, 'many people in the body of Christ to preach various things, and we may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 43, 16, 6, 'not be called to preach everything ourselves. I can only preach what I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 43, 17, 6, 'have done. I cannot teach people to overcome anger if I''m still getting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 43, 18, 6, 'angry with myself, with my wife, co-workers, or anyone else. I cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 43, 19, 6, 'ask people to overcome dirty sexual thoughts, if I''m still defeated by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 43, 20, 6, 'them myself. I can say, "Hey fellas I am defeated, but let''s you and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 43, 21, 6, 'struggle together." That''s fine, but I must be honest. Only teach others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 43, 22, 6, 'to do what we have first done ourselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 43, 23, 6, 'The Very First Thing That Jesus Taught: Receive God''s Word Every Single');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 43, 24, 6, 'Day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 43, 25, 6, 'The very first thing that Jesus taught after His being anointed with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 43, 26, 6, 'Holy Spirit was that we cannot live if we don''t receive the words that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 43, 27, 6, 'God speaks. We can''t fulfill God''s purpose and satisfy His heart, if we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 43, 28, 6, 'merely serve Him. A lot of Christians find a satisfaction in saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 44, 1, 6, '"I''m doing this for the Lord," "I''m doing that for the Lord," "I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 44, 2, 6, 'running an orphanage," "I''m running a Bible School and I''m helping');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 44, 3, 6, 'people," "I''m giving money to these people who are in need," and "I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 44, 4, 6, 'going here and doing that." They''re always thinking of what they''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 44, 5, 6, 'doing for the Lord. I don''t despise that. We need to serve the Lord till');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 44, 6, 6, 'He comes, as it says in 1 Corinthians 15:58, "be steadfast, immovable,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 44, 7, 6, 'always abounding in the work of the Lord." I want to do that till the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 44, 8, 6, 'end of my life, until Christ comes, "always abounding in the work of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 44, 9, 6, 'Lord." I never want to stop serving the Lord. So I''m not despising that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 44, 10, 6, 'I believe we must serve, but I''d say more important than service, is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 44, 11, 6, 'receiving the Word of God. "Man shall not live by serving God alone, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 44, 12, 6, 'by every word that proceeds out of the mouth of God." These are the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 44, 13, 6, 'first spoken words of Jesus after His anointing, so it must be very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 44, 14, 6, 'significant. Of all that Jesus taught, here was the very first thing:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 44, 15, 6, 'learn to receive the Word of God continuously every day. The Scriptures');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 44, 16, 6, 'must come alive to you every day. In the early days, people didn''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 44, 17, 6, 'a Bible like we have today. We are so privileged to have the Bible. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 44, 18, 6, 'must read the Bible every day, if we are going to receive God''s Word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 44, 19, 6, 'every day. In the early days, when they didn''t have a Bible, they could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 44, 20, 6, 'still receive the Holy Spirit reminding them of what they heard from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 44, 21, 6, 'apostles. A Christian who doesn''t have a Bible, who is imprisoned for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 44, 22, 6, 'his faith and sitting in a prison, can still receive God''s Word every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 44, 23, 6, 'day even though he doesn''t have a Bible open in front of him, because he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 44, 24, 6, 'has read it in the days when he was not in prison. That''s why it''s so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 44, 25, 6, 'important to read and meditate on God''s Word, because in our moment of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 44, 26, 6, 'need, God through the Holy Spirit will give us that particular word that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 44, 27, 6, 'will be the solution to our problem, and that''ll be the answer to our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 44, 28, 6, 'need and the promise that we can claim.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 45, 1, 6, 'This is illustrated in a story in Luke 10:38-42. There we read about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 45, 2, 6, 'Jesus entering the house of Mary and Martha. Martha received Him into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 45, 3, 6, 'the house, and went to prepare some food for Him, while her sister Mary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 45, 4, 6, 'sat at Jesus'' feet listening to His word. Now remember, connect this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 45, 5, 6, 'with what we read earlier, that "man shall not live by food alone, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 45, 6, 6, 'by every word that proceeds from God''s mouth." Here are the two options,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 45, 7, 6, 'food and sitting at Jesus''s feet. Is food important? Yes, it is. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 45, 8, 6, 'what''s more important is receiving the word that proceeds from God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 45, 9, 6, 'mouth. This is illustrated so vividly here in these two sisters.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 45, 10, 6, 'Martha was distracted with preparing food. For whom? Not for herself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 45, 11, 6, 'She was very, very unselfish. Do you know how much labor it takes to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 45, 12, 6, 'cook food for 13 hungry men (Jesus and His twelve disciples)? She was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 45, 13, 6, 'slogging away in the kitchen, working hard not for herself, but for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 45, 14, 6, 'Lord. She was spending her money, going to the market, and getting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 45, 15, 6, 'things to prepare food for the Lord. She was spending time, money,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 45, 16, 6, 'energy, and sacrificing to do work for the Lord. Maybe you''re like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 45, 17, 6, 'Maybe you''re sacrificing time, money, and energy doing so many things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 45, 18, 6, 'for the Lord here and there. Good. You might think, like Martha might');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 45, 19, 6, 'have thought, "well, when I''ve done all this and I come before the Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 45, 20, 6, 'He''s is going to say, ''well done, good and faithful servant. You''ve done');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 45, 21, 6, 'a great job!''" But that''s not what she hears. When she came to Jesus,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 45, 22, 6, 'she was irritated with her sister Mary inwardly. Whenever a person is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 45, 23, 6, 'not at rest in his heart, it means something is wrong. She was not at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 45, 24, 6, 'rest. She was wondering, "why is Mary not coming and helping me?" and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 45, 25, 6, 'Jesus rebukes her. He says, "Martha, food is not the most important');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 45, 26, 6, 'thing. To hear My word is far more important, and that''s what Mary has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 45, 27, 6, 'chosen, and that will not be taken away from her" (Luke 10:42). Do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 45, 28, 6, 'see what Jesus means by, "Man shall not live by food alone"? What did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 46, 1, 6, 'Jesus want from Martha first? All that service? What does Jesus want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 46, 2, 6, 'from you? Service is good. We read later on that Mary served Jesus by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 46, 3, 6, 'pouring out perfume at His feet, and so we know that service is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 46, 4, 6, 'important; but the first, most important thing was to receive the Word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 46, 5, 6, 'of God. That is what Jesus taught.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 46, 6, 6, 'We must learn this lesson first of all, that one thing is needful. Not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 46, 7, 6, '25 things. Luke 10:42 tells us to sit at Jesus'' feet every day, to have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 46, 8, 6, 'that attitude all the time, and to receive what He has to say to us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 46, 9, 6, 'personally.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 46, 10, 6, 'Long for God''s Word like a Baby Longs for Milk');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 46, 11, 6, 'In 1 Peter 2:2, it says, "Like newborn babes, we must desire the pure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 46, 12, 6, 'milk of the Word of God." We should desire the pure milk of the Word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 46, 13, 6, 'God, just like any newborn baby, if it''s normal and healthy, as soon as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 46, 14, 6, 'it is born, cries out. From the very first day onwards, for a number of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 46, 15, 6, 'days and weeks and months, it keeps on crying out. What''s it crying out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 46, 16, 6, 'for? Milk. Nobody has to teach that newborn baby to cry for milk. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 46, 17, 6, 'it''s a sick child, it will not cry, and unfortunately, we have a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 46, 18, 6, '"sick babies" in Christendom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 46, 19, 6, 'If you have had a proper new birth, and you''re a spiritually healthy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 46, 20, 6, 'child of God, nobody will have to teach you to cry out for the milk of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 46, 21, 6, 'the word of God. I remember in my own life, when I was born again 52');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 46, 22, 6, 'years ago, I found within me a tremendous cry for the milk of the word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 46, 23, 6, 'of God. I was too young to eat the meat that is also found in this book,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 46, 24, 6, 'but I could receive the milk, and this is the very first thing that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 46, 25, 6, 'characterizes any genuinely born-again child of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 46, 26, 6, 'If you claim to be a born-again and you have absolutely no desire for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 46, 27, 6, 'the milk of God''s Word, I would ask you to question whether you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 46, 28, 6, 'really born again. Every healthy baby cries out for milk all over the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 47, 1, 6, 'world. In every nation, every place, through all centuries, it''s been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 47, 2, 6, 'like that. And so it is with the new birth: when it''s genuine, there''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 47, 3, 6, 'longing to receive God''s Word and to hear what God has to say. Even if I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 47, 4, 6, 'don''t have a Bible to hear what God has to say to me, I long to hear His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 47, 5, 6, 'word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 47, 6, 6, 'Don''t Live by One Scripture, but by the Whole of Scripture');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 47, 7, 6, 'The second statement that Jesus made in his ministry was in response to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 47, 8, 6, 'the second temptation. In Matthew 4:7, He said, "You shall not put the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 47, 9, 6, 'Lord your God to the test." This is a very important principle. What the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 47, 10, 6, 'devil was saying to Jesus was, "If You''re the Son of God, why don''t You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 47, 11, 6, 'just throw Yourself down from the top of the temple and claim the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 47, 12, 6, 'promise of God? He even quoted Psalm 91, ''He will give his angels charge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 47, 13, 6, 'concerning you; in their hands they will bear you up, lest you strike');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 47, 14, 6, 'your foot against a stone.''" This teaches us that Satan can even quote');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 47, 15, 6, 'God''s Word to you to get you to sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 47, 16, 6, 'This temptation is related to the first temptation. The first time,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 47, 17, 6, 'Satan told Jesus to turn the stones into bread, and Jesus said, "Hey,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 47, 18, 6, 'man does not live by bread alone; he lives by every word of God." Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 47, 19, 6, 'caught on to that and said, "Every word of God, huh? Okay, here''s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 47, 20, 6, 'Word of God: ''He will give His angels charge over you and your foot will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 47, 21, 6, 'not strike against a stone.'' So why not jump off from the temple?" When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 47, 22, 6, 'the devil sees that you have learned to respect God''s Word, the next');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 47, 23, 6, 'thing he will try to do is to twist God''s Word to make it mean something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 47, 24, 6, 'it didn''t mean at all. He will misquote God''s Word, and take God''s Word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 47, 25, 6, 'out of context. I can think of numerous Christians I have met in my life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 47, 26, 6, 'who have quoted a Scripture from here or there completely out of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 47, 27, 6, 'context, to satisfy their own desire. It''s very easy to go to Scripture');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 47, 28, 6, 'and find a verse to do what you want to do. There are so many people who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 48, 1, 6, 'go to Scripture and find a verse that justifies exactly what they want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 48, 2, 6, 'to do.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 48, 3, 6, 'When we realize the importance of receiving God''s Word, and read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 48, 4, 6, 'Scripture regularly, we need to remember from this temptation that Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 48, 5, 6, 'can come and misquote Scripture. That''s why it''s important for us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 48, 6, 6, 'study the Scriptures in its context, and why it''s important to study the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 48, 7, 6, 'whole of Scripture by "every word of God," as Jesus said, not just by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 48, 8, 6, 'one Scripture. We can''t live by one Scripture (for example, "man shall');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 48, 9, 6, 'live by every word of God"), and that''s why it''s important to know the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 48, 10, 6, 'whole of Scripture. That''s why it''s important to study it. If you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 48, 11, 6, 'young, it''s good to go and seek counsel from godly older men who know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 48, 12, 6, 'the Word whenever you''re thinking of understanding what Scripture says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 48, 13, 6, 'on a particular subject. It is very easy. I''ve come across too many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 48, 14, 6, 'people who have deceived themselves by seeking to live by only one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 48, 15, 6, 'particular Scripture, and not the whole of Scripture.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 48, 16, 6, 'Let me use a humorous illustration to highlight this point: Consider a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 48, 17, 6, 'young man who''s very much in love with a girl called Grace. He wants to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 48, 18, 6, 'find the will of God, or at least he thinks he does, but he''s already');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 48, 19, 6, 'very much in love with this girl. The truth is, he wants to marry her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 48, 20, 6, 'and he just wants God''s approval. So one day he reads 2 Corinthians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 48, 21, 6, '12:9, "My grace is sufficient for you," and he''s convinced. "Ah, God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 48, 22, 6, 'spoken to me, Grace is the girl for me," he says to himself. He''s just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 48, 23, 6, 'satisfying his own desire. Now consider another young man whose parents');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 48, 24, 6, 'have suggested some girl called Grace to him. He doesn''t like her at all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 48, 25, 6, 'and he has no interest, so he tells his parents "I will have to find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 48, 26, 6, 'God''s will." He reads the same verse, 2 Corinthians 12:9, "My grace is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 48, 27, 6, 'sufficient for you." He goes to his parents and says, "God has told me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 48, 28, 6, 'that His grace is sufficient for me. I don''t want this girl called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 49, 1, 6, 'Grace, God''s grace is enough for me." You can see how, from the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 49, 2, 6, 'verse, these two young men get two different answers to satisfy their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 49, 3, 6, 'own lusts. What they want to do, they try to put into God''s Word. That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 49, 4, 6, 'one example of how the devil can take a Scripture and quote that to you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 49, 5, 6, 'If he tried it with Jesus, don''t you think he will try it with you?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 49, 6, 6, 'What was Jesus'' reply to the devil? It is very interesting to see that,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 49, 7, 6, 'when the devil said in Matthew 4:6, "It is written," Jesus replied in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 49, 8, 6, 'verse 7, saying, " Again it is written." Or, "On the other hand, it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 49, 9, 6, 'written like this." That''s what He meant by, "again it is written." This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 49, 10, 6, 'teaches us that the whole truth is not found only in "it is written" but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 49, 11, 6, 'in "it is written, and again it is written." When you put both');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 49, 12, 6, 'Scriptures together, then you get the truth. That''s why it is important');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 49, 13, 6, 'to study the Scriptures to hear what God is saying to you. Otherwise,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 49, 14, 6, 'you can take one verse of Scripture and go completely astray. So Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 49, 15, 6, 'said to him, "It is also written, you shall not tempt the Lord your God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 49, 16, 6, 'You shall not put the Lord your God to the test." You shall not try to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 49, 17, 6, 'claim a promise just to try and test God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 49, 18, 6, 'Don''t Test God by Insisting He Does Something Spectacular');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 49, 19, 6, 'How does this apply in practical terms? Here the temptation to Jesus was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 49, 20, 6, 'to jump off the roof of the temple, claim the promise in Psalm 91, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 49, 21, 6, 'descend to the courtyard of the temple unhurt so that people will see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 49, 22, 6, 'and exclaim, "Oh, what a great man of God! Look at His faith, how He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 49, 23, 6, 'claimed that promise and was not hurt." And Jesus said, "I will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 49, 24, 6, 'tempt God like that." When there are stairs provided from the roof of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 49, 25, 6, 'the temple to go down, there is no need to jump off. The meaning of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 49, 26, 6, 'Jesus''s refusal is that we can use means that God has provided and not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 49, 27, 6, 'tempt God by asking Him to do something for us in some spectacular way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 49, 28, 6, 'For example, in Acts 8:39, we read of an instance where, after Philip');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 50, 1, 6, 'had preached to the eunuch, the Holy Spirit snatched Philip up and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 50, 2, 6, 'transported him all the way to another please called as Azotus. The Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 50, 3, 6, 'Spirit gave him an airlift like a helicopter would today. Now, if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 50, 4, 6, 'want to go from one place to another place, and you try to tempt God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 50, 5, 6, 'saying, "Do that for me Lord," that''s tempting God. If God has provided');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 50, 6, 6, 'buses, trains, scooters, and airplanes, why do we need to ask the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 50, 7, 6, 'Spirit to take us like that?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 50, 8, 6, 'Another way to tempt God is to try and claim a promise so that I can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 50, 9, 6, 'perhaps testify later of a spectacular thing God did for me. For');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 50, 10, 6, 'example, there are people who, when they are sick, say, "I am going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 50, 11, 6, 'trust God to heal me even though medicines are available on the next');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 50, 12, 6, 'street and there are doctors available to advise us. We don''t use those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 50, 13, 6, 'doctors and those medicines." And there are many foolish Christians who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 50, 14, 6, 'have died like that, or allowed their children to die and their wives to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 50, 15, 6, 'die, because they try to claim a promise that "the Lord is my Healer,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 50, 16, 6, 'and so I don''t need medicine." When God has provided stairs in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 50, 17, 6, 'temple, He expects you to use them instead of trying to jump off the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 50, 18, 6, 'roof and claiming Psalm 91. Similarly, when God has provided medicines,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 50, 19, 6, 'He expects you to use them and not foolishly claim some promise that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 50, 20, 6, 'Lord will heal you. It is as foolish as trying to ask the Lord to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 50, 21, 6, 'transport you from one place to another like He did with Philip.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 50, 22, 6, 'We also must remember that God does certain things for certain people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 50, 23, 6, 'He doesn''t perform every miracle for every believer. We need to be very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 50, 24, 6, 'careful in studying the Scriptures that we''re not trying to do something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 50, 25, 6, 'spectacular in order to get some honor for ourselves. The desire for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 50, 26, 6, 'honor from men is so deeply rooted in our flesh, but sometimes we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 50, 27, 6, 'not even aware of it. It''s one of the great things that Jesus taught His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 50, 28, 6, 'disciples to battle against. Here the basic temptation was to get honor,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 51, 1, 6, 'to claim God''s promise and descend unhurt to the courtyard of the temple');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 51, 2, 6, 'and people will acclaim you. But the temptation can come in less');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 51, 3, 6, 'spectacular ways, too. Jesus said in Matthew 6, "When you pray, don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 51, 4, 6, 'pray in such a way as to get honor from the men who are listening to you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 51, 5, 6, 'praying, and don''t fast and inform everybody how many days you''ve fasted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 51, 6, 6, 'for." If you do that, it''s to get honor. He also said, "When you give,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 51, 7, 6, 'don''t let anybody know what you gave." Yet many Christians have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 51, 8, 6, 'disobeyed these commands, seeking honor and tempting God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 51, 9, 6, 'Seek for a Christ-Like Balance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 51, 10, 6, 'The matter of putting God to the test has many, many ramifications.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 51, 11, 6, 'There are many, many areas where we can do this. We need to be balanced');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 51, 12, 6, 'in our understanding of these Scriptures, and be able to say, "it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 51, 13, 6, 'written and it is also written." The great need in the Christian life is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 51, 14, 6, 'for a balance. For example, the Bible says in John 1:14, "The glory of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 51, 15, 6, 'God was seen in Jesus Christ, full of grace and truth." That''s balance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 51, 16, 6, 'And when the devil said, "It is written," Jesus said, "It is also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 51, 17, 6, 'written." We must have grace and we must have truth. That''s the balance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 51, 18, 6, 'there must be in our life. We must have the fruit of the Spirit and we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 51, 19, 6, 'must have the gifts of the Spirit. We find Christians sometimes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 51, 20, 6, 'emphasizing that the fruit of the Spirit is the most important thing,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 51, 21, 6, 'while some other group says the gifts of the Spirit are more important.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 51, 22, 6, 'We need both, and the answer always is to look at Jesus and see what he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 51, 23, 6, 'had. What did Jesus have? Did He have the fruit of the Spirit or the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 51, 24, 6, 'gifts of the Spirit? You know the answer: He had both. Did He have grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 51, 25, 6, 'or truth? He had both. Many people say we must stand for the truth. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 51, 26, 6, 'others say no, but we must also be merciful. Which was Jesus? Was He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 51, 27, 6, 'merciful, or did He stand for the truth? Both.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 51, 28, 6, 'You see a classic example of that in the case of the woman caught in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 52, 1, 6, 'adultery. The Pharisees wanted to stone her to death. The truth is,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 52, 2, 6, 'Moses said to stone her to death. What did Jesus say? "He who is without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 52, 3, 6, 'sin, throw the first stone." But He didn''t then tell the woman, "Oh,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 52, 4, 6, 'your sins are not serious." He balanced grace and truth in His response');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 52, 5, 6, 'to her. He coupled grace ("I do not condemn you") with truth ("Go and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 52, 6, 6, 'sin no more"). So remember, we find the whole truth of Scripture in "it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 52, 7, 6, 'is written," and "it is also written."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 52, 8, 7, 'Chapter 6 Seeking God’s Glory and Honor Alone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 52, 9, 7, 'The Third Temptation and Satan''s Great Sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 52, 10, 7, 'When Satan asked Jesus to bow down to him, he said, as it were, "you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 52, 11, 7, 'have come here to get all these kingdoms of the world back to God." So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 52, 12, 7, 'he showed Him all the kingdoms of the world in their glory in a moment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 52, 13, 7, 'of time, and said, "I''ll give you all these if you fall down and worship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 52, 14, 7, 'me." In Luke''s Gospel, in the parallel passage in chapter four, Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 52, 15, 7, 'says, "All these have been given to me - they''re mine - but I''ll give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 52, 16, 7, 'them to you." How did Satan get them? Adam handed it all over to Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 52, 17, 7, 'in the Garden of Eden. God had given Adam authority to rule over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 52, 18, 7, 'everything on the earth, but the moment Adam bowed down to Satan and did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 52, 19, 7, 'what Satan told him to do, he handed over what God had given him to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 52, 20, 7, 'Satan. And ever since that day, Satan has had that and Satan told Jesus,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 52, 21, 7, '"I''ll give this to you if you will bow down and worship me." That''s what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 52, 22, 7, 'he has always wanted, and that''s what made him the devil. He was the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 52, 23, 7, 'head of the angels, created by God, beautiful, full of wisdom, with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 52, 24, 7, 'highest position in the universe, long before man was created. We read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 52, 25, 7, 'the history of this highest angel in Isaiah 14 and Ezekiel 28. We don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 52, 26, 7, 'know his name, only that he is called the morning star (Isaiah 14:12),');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 52, 27, 7, 'which is translated as "Lucifer" in Latin. So that title stuck to him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 52, 28, 7, 'but that''s not his name. We don''t know his name, but this head of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 53, 1, 7, 'angels wanted the angels not to worship God but to worship him. That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 53, 2, 7, 'what he says In Isaiah 14, "I will make myself like God." Remember that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 53, 3, 7, 'this is how sin originated: When someone wanted worship, when someone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 53, 4, 7, 'wanted to rebel against God, and when someone''s heart was lifted up with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 53, 5, 7, 'pride and wanted the angels to admire him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 53, 6, 7, 'This is the origin of sin. The first sin in the world was not murder or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 53, 7, 7, 'adultery; it was the desire to get other people to admire you. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 53, 8, 7, 'have that desire, whoever you are, even if you call yourself a Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 53, 9, 7, 'or a preacher, if you want people to admire you and not Christ, you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 53, 10, 7, 'walking in the way that Satan walked. It''s a dangerous spot because it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 53, 11, 7, 'finally leads to hell. Satan couldn''t get it then; he was cast out from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 53, 12, 7, 'heaven, but now he tries to get it again. "Fall down," Satan says, "and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 53, 13, 7, 'worship me." But Jesus said, "Be gone Satan," Matthew 4:10, "for it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 53, 14, 7, 'written you shall worship the Lord your God and serve Him." There is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 53, 15, 7, 'only one Person we must worship. We can make the mistake of worshipping');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 53, 16, 7, 'glorious beings and great servants of God. In Revelation 22:8, even the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 53, 17, 7, 'great apostle John made this mistake. He saw an angel and he fell down');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 53, 18, 7, 'to worship him after he saw the wonderful things that were revealed in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 53, 19, 7, 'the book of Revelation. Imagine, if the Apostle John, at 95 years of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 53, 20, 7, 'age, who had known the Lord for so long, could make the mistake of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 53, 21, 7, 'admiring a mighty servant of God, any of us can make that mistake. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 53, 22, 7, 'must not admire some mighty servant of God to the point that our contact');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 53, 23, 7, 'with God Himself becomes through that servant.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 53, 24, 7, 'Wherever a preacher or a pastor seeks to be a second mediator between');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 53, 25, 7, 'God and men, you''ve got to be careful. The Old Testament prophets were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 53, 26, 7, 'people who communicated God''s will to men, but in the New Covenant,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 53, 27, 7, 'there''s only one Mediator between God and man, and that is the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 53, 28, 7, 'Jesus Christ. You don''t need a pastor or a preacher or any man of God to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 54, 1, 7, 'be a second mediator between Christ and you. You don''t need Mary. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 54, 2, 7, 'don''t need anybody else. You can go directly to Jesus, and through Him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 54, 3, 7, 'to the Father. But we can make a mistake, just like John did. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 54, 4, 7, 'Revelation 22, we also see the faithfulness of this mighty angel. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 54, 5, 7, 'says, "Don''t do that; don''t worship me." Where are the preachers and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 54, 6, 7, 'pastors and Christian leaders who will not allow other Christians to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 54, 7, 7, 'attached to them, who will push them off and say, "Don''t get attached to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 54, 8, 7, 'me; seek to be connected to Christ Himself"? That is a true man of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 54, 9, 7, 'whom you can follow without any fear - the one who refuses to allow you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 54, 10, 7, 'to be attached to him and refuses to find God''s will for you but tells');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 54, 11, 7, 'you, "God is your Father. Go to Him directly, and He will show you His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 54, 12, 7, 'will." Because God''s New Covenant promise in Hebrews 8:11 is, "They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 54, 13, 7, 'shall not teach every man, his brother saying, ''Know the Lord,'' but all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 54, 14, 7, 'shall know Me from the least to the greatest." That means that even the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 54, 15, 7, 'one who''s newly born again, a baby in Christ, all the way up to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 54, 16, 7, 'greatest, the mightiest servant of God, all can know Him personally. So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 54, 17, 7, 'the angel says, "Don''t worship me. I''m one of your brothers, I am fellow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 54, 18, 7, 'servant and you need to worship God."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 54, 19, 7, 'Seek an Intimate, Direct Relationship with God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 54, 20, 7, 'That''s effectively what Jesus said in Matthew 4:10. The New Testament');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 54, 21, 7, 'begins, as it were, with this phrase "worship the Lord your God alone,"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 54, 22, 7, 'and ends (in Revelation 22:9) with the same message, "worship the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 54, 23, 7, 'your God alone." Don''t worship the devil, don''t worship angels, don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 54, 24, 7, 'worship human beings, and don''t worship any great messenger of God. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 54, 25, 7, 'word "angel" can also be translated as "messenger." You can fall down');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 54, 26, 7, 'before a messenger of God when he reveals mighty truths; you''ve got to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 54, 27, 7, 'be very careful. We must honor God''s servants, of course; we must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 54, 28, 7, 'respect and appreciate and express our appreciation to God''s servants,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 55, 1, 7, 'but we must not worship them, nor imagine that they are God, nor give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 55, 2, 7, 'them the place that God alone should have in our hearts. We shouldn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 55, 3, 7, 'give that place to our husbands, wives, fathers, mothers, material');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 55, 4, 7, 'things or God''s servants or anybody else. We must each have a direct');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 55, 5, 7, 'connection with God and that''s what Jesus was saying here: "Worship the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 55, 6, 7, 'Lord your God and serve Him only." It speaks of an intimate connection');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 55, 7, 7, 'that we have with God directly because in the New Covenant, He has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 55, 8, 7, 'become our Father. He''s not a distant God, as in the Old Testament,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 55, 9, 7, 'where He could only speak to people through the prophets: if you wanted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 55, 10, 7, 'to find God''s will, there was no way to find it unless you went to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 55, 11, 7, 'high priest and he used the Urim and Thummim, which were the things they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 55, 12, 7, 'had in those days to find God''s will; and the people went to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 55, 13, 7, 'prophet, who could hear God speak to him, because God was outside of man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 55, 14, 7, 'those days. That''s why we see in the Old Testament about God speaking in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 55, 15, 7, 'an audible voice, because He was outside of man. But now, after the day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 55, 16, 7, 'of Pentecost, the Holy Spirit has come inside. That''s why we don''t hear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 55, 17, 7, 'God''s voice audibly on the outside now - we hear it from within us. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 55, 18, 7, 'now come to know the will of God through the renewing of our mind by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 55, 19, 7, 'Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 55, 20, 7, 'Worship in Spirit, Not Just Body and Soul');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 55, 21, 7, 'Worship of God is something that brings us into a very intimate, close');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 55, 22, 7, 'relationship with our Heavenly Father, and worship is more than just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 55, 23, 7, 'speaking words or saying words to God. Let me clarify a misunderstanding');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 55, 24, 7, 'that more than 90 percent of believers have. There is a very common');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 55, 25, 7, 'expression used in many churches today for their Sunday morning meeting,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 55, 26, 7, 'which is called a "worship service." In Charismatic or other Pentecostal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 55, 27, 7, 'churches, they call it a time of "praise and worship." If you want to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 55, 28, 7, 'completely scriptural and Biblical, that is a totally wrong expression;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 56, 1, 7, 'what they''re doing there on Sunday morning is not worship. If you listen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 56, 2, 7, 'to the words of the songs they sing, it is praise and thanksgiving.It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 56, 3, 7, 'not worship at all. If you don''t believe me, you can take a concordance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 56, 4, 7, 'and look at the word worship as it is found throughout the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 56, 5, 7, 'Testament. In the Old Testament, that was the only way they could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 56, 6, 7, 'express their worship to God: clapping and singing and using instruments');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 56, 7, 7, 'to sing songs to God. But in the New Covenant, Jesus said to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 56, 8, 7, 'Samaritan woman in John chapter 4:23-24, "The hour is coming and now is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 56, 9, 7, 'when the true worshippers will worship the Father in spirit and in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 56, 10, 7, 'truth, for such people the Father seeks to be His worshipers. God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 56, 11, 7, 'Spirit and those who worship Him must worship Him in spirit and truth."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 56, 12, 7, 'Jesus spoke about an hour that was "coming." He was referring to the day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 56, 13, 7, 'of Pentecost, which hadn''t yet come. He also said in John 4:23, "now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 56, 14, 7, 'is," which means it was already fulfilled in Him, because Jesus is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 56, 15, 7, 'firstborn of many brothers in the New Covenant. He was the one who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 56, 16, 7, 'opened up the New Covenant for us, so in a sense, He was the first, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 56, 17, 7, 'our Leader. And so, that hour had come where there was one man finally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 56, 18, 7, 'walking on the earth who was worshiping the Father in spirit and in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 56, 19, 7, 'truth, and that was Jesus Himself. Nobody ever had done it before. Man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 56, 20, 7, 'is spirit, soul and body. 1 Thessalonians 5:23 tells us that, and this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 56, 21, 7, 'indicates that when Jesus uses the word spirit here, He was saying that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 56, 22, 7, 'all Old Testament worship up until that point was only in the body and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 56, 23, 7, 'the soul. That means they worship God with their hands, raising their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 56, 24, 7, 'hands, clapping their hands; they worship God with their soul, which is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 56, 25, 7, 'using their mind, their intellect, their emotions; they felt joy and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 56, 26, 7, 'feelings, emotional feelings just like you when you sing songs of praise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 56, 27, 7, 'and thanksgiving in the meeting. That was the extent of worship in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 56, 28, 7, 'soul and body. But He said, "Now you''ve come to a deeper level of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 57, 1, 7, 'worship that you can have from now on, when the Holy Spirit dwells in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 57, 2, 7, 'you like He''s dwelling in Me." Jesus was saying, "You''ll also be able to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 57, 3, 7, 'worship in spirit and in truth, not just in body and soul."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 57, 4, 7, 'What should we do today? We still clap our hands and raise our hands, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 57, 5, 7, 'still feel emotional and use our intellect when we praise God, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 57, 6, 7, 'beyond all that, we must worship in the spirit, and that means that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 57, 7, 7, 'penetrate that veil between soul and spirit, and enter into that realm');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 57, 8, 7, 'where we''re alone with God. In the Old Testament tabernacle, there are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 57, 9, 7, 'three parts - corresponding to body, soul and spirit - and the last');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 57, 10, 7, 'part, this closed part, which was covered by the veil, is the most holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 57, 11, 7, 'place, where only God dwelt. In the outer court, they had lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 57, 12, 7, 'excitement with sacrifices being offered. In the holy place, a number of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 57, 13, 7, 'priests were jostling around each other offering incense and lighting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 57, 14, 7, 'the lamps, etc. But in the most holy place, it was God alone. So when a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 57, 15, 7, 'person entered in the most holy place, he was with God alone. He was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 57, 16, 7, 'conscious of anybody else. There was nobody else there but him and God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 57, 17, 7, 'That is worship in the spirit, where it''s you and God alone, and that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 57, 18, 7, 'something you can do in your room, and it is not something that you do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 57, 19, 7, 'merely with words.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 57, 20, 7, 'One of the finest examples of what a true worshipper says in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 57, 21, 7, 'attitude towards God is seen in Psalm 73:25. If you can say this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 57, 22, 7, 'honestly to God from the depth of your heart, you are a worshipper. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 57, 23, 7, 'not, you are not worshipping in spirit. It says, "O God, Whom have I in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 57, 24, 7, 'heaven but Thee?" In other words, "When I get to heaven, I''m not looking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 57, 25, 7, 'for the golden streets or a mansion or a crown. I''m going to be happy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 57, 26, 7, 'and satisfied with God alone. I don''t need anybody or anything else but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 57, 27, 7, 'God." That is saying, "I have wonderful brothers and sisters and family');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 57, 28, 7, 'members who may be there in heaven, but You are going to be everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 58, 1, 7, 'for me. "And besides Thee, I desire nothing on earth." That is saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 58, 2, 7, '"Not only in heaven, but before I get to heaven, here on this earth, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 58, 3, 7, 'don''t desire anything but You. I don''t desire anything more of material');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 58, 4, 7, 'goods than what You''ve given me. I''m perfectly content." Godliness with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 58, 5, 7, 'contentment is great gain. A worshiper never has a complaint about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 58, 6, 7, 'anything on this earth - he''s perfectly content with all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 58, 7, 7, 'circumstances that God has arranged for him. He''s content with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 58, 8, 7, 'family God has brought him into, the job he has, everything he has. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 58, 9, 7, 'is perfectly content. He desires nothing but God. Like the old saying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 58, 10, 7, 'goes, if a time comes in your life where you have nothing but God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 58, 11, 7, 'everything else is lost, you''ll find that God is more than enough.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 58, 12, 7, 'So this is true worship, where the attitude of my heart is that I desire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 58, 13, 7, 'nothing here on this earth but God. If you don''t have that attitude of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 58, 14, 7, 'heart, no matter how emotional you feel when you praise and thank God on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 58, 15, 7, 'Sunday mornings, you''re not a worshipper. You can call it worship and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 58, 16, 7, 'praise, but you''re deluding yourself, and Satan is quite happy for you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 58, 17, 7, 'to do that to yourself because you imagine that you''re worshipping God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 58, 18, 7, 'when you''re not. But Jesus said in John 4:23 that the Father is seeking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 58, 19, 7, 'for those who worship Him in spirit. And what a longing the Father has.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 58, 20, 7, 'Do you have that longing to satisfy your Father''s heart, to be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 58, 21, 7, 'worshipper in spirit? Then go to Psalm 73:25 and don''t rest until those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 58, 22, 7, 'words are the expression of your heart, that you desire nothing on earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 58, 23, 7, 'but Jesus Christ, not even a ministry. Don''t find your satisfaction in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 58, 24, 7, 'your evangelism or in your teaching or in your church building or in any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 58, 25, 7, 'ministry or in your money or your property or anything. "Lord, I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 58, 26, 7, 'You and I desire only You." Will such a man be a lazy man? Far from it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 58, 27, 7, '"Thou shall worship the Lord thy God," Matthew 4:10, "and serve Him."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 58, 28, 7, 'True worship leads to service, and it will be highly effective service.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 59, 1, 7, 'The apostles worshipped and served, Jesus worshipped and served, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 59, 2, 7, 'when you worship, it will lead to service, which will be far more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 59, 3, 7, 'effective than just serving.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 59, 4, 7, 'Four Steps of Communion with God: Prayer, Thanksgiving, Praise, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 59, 5, 7, 'Worship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 59, 6, 7, 'In our communion with God, we can say there are four steps: First of all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 59, 7, 7, 'is prayer, which is asking God for things. Second is thanksgiving, which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 59, 8, 7, 'is thanking God for what He''s done for us, and for what He has given us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 59, 9, 7, 'Then we go one step higher with praise, which is expressing our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 59, 10, 7, 'appreciation to God and adoring Him for who He is, not for what He''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 59, 11, 7, 'done. Thanksgiving is for what He has done; praise is for who He is. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 59, 12, 7, 'highest level is worship. Worship may be expressed in words like we just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 59, 13, 7, 'read, "Whom have I in heaven but Thee Lord? There is nothing on earth I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 59, 14, 7, 'desire beside You, Lord Jesus." Worship can be expressed in song, where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 59, 15, 7, 'we express to God words such as, "all that I have is Yours, Lord", "Take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 59, 16, 7, 'my life and let it be consecrated Lord, to Thee. Take my silver and my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 59, 17, 7, 'gold, not a mite would I withhold. Take my voice, and let me sing always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 59, 18, 7, 'only for my King." This is expressing my worship to God in song. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 59, 19, 7, 'highest expression of worship is silence, where I''m so taken up with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 59, 20, 7, 'glory of God that I cannot even open my mouth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 59, 21, 7, 'Very, very few believers come to the point where they are blinded by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 59, 22, 7, 'light of God in their hearts - not in their eyes, but in their hearts -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 59, 23, 7, 'like Isaiah, which makes them cry out, "Oh Lord, I''m a sinful man," like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 59, 24, 7, 'Paul cried out, "Oh wretched man that I am, I am the chief of sinners."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 59, 25, 7, 'That is the expression of a true worshipper who has seen the glory of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 59, 26, 7, 'God, and very, very few believers come to that point. The devil doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 59, 27, 7, 'want you to arrive there. He wants you to worship him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 59, 28, 7, 'Seeking God''s Kingdom First, Not Earthly Gain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 60, 1, 7, 'Do you know that when you seek for something in the world, some gain in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 60, 2, 7, 'the world, you actually have to worship the devil in order to get it?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 60, 3, 7, 'But if you seek the glory of God- "seek first the kingdom of God," as it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 60, 4, 7, 'says in Matthew 6:33 - God will add to you whatever you need. Otherwise,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 60, 5, 7, 'we can long to get so many things that God doesn''t want us to have. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 60, 6, 7, 'we pray for them, we may think that God has blessed us, but some of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 60, 7, 7, 'those material things can be a curse to us and our children. Jesus said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 60, 8, 7, '"My kingdom is not of this world," in John 18:36, "Otherwise my servants');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 60, 9, 7, 'would fight." Jesus doesn''t fight for earthly things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 60, 10, 7, 'So we don''t pray for these things. We believe that if we seek God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 60, 11, 7, 'kingdom first and are worshippers of God our Father, He will add to us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 60, 12, 7, 'whatever we need on this earth. We don''t go to the devil to get things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 60, 13, 7, 'Very often when people are saying, "Lord give me this, give me that,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 60, 14, 7, 'give me the other material thing," they are just proving that they''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 60, 15, 7, 'not content with what they have. Whereas Paul said, in Philippians 4:11,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 60, 16, 7, '"I have learnt to be content with what I have, whether God gives me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 60, 17, 7, 'little or gives me much." Only a worshipper can say that. He seeks God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 60, 18, 7, 'kingdom and God determines how much of this earth we should have, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 60, 19, 7, 'gives us an amount which will not destroy us. It''s better God decides');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 60, 20, 7, 'that. Too much of things of earth can destroy us if we''re not careful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 60, 21, 7, 'So we need to come before God and say, "Lord, please guide us in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 60, 22, 7, 'matter so that we can never stop worshiping you and never be distracted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 60, 23, 7, 'by Mammon and the attractions of Mammon."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 60, 24, 7, 'Remember this: When we seek for something of this world and its glory,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 60, 25, 7, 'like the honor of men, very often we''ll end up worshipping the devil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 60, 26, 7, 'The devil said to Jesus, "Fall down and worship me. I''ll give you the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 60, 27, 7, 'things of this world and its glory." So don''t seek the glory and honor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 60, 28, 7, 'of this world lest you end up worshipping Satan. Seek the glory and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 61, 1, 7, 'honor of God alone - not your name but God''s name. He taught us to pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 61, 2, 7, '"Hallowed be Your name" first - that''s the way of salvation from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 61, 3, 7, 'worshiping Satan. Unconsciously, many believers are worshipping Satan;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 61, 4, 7, 'we need to worship God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 61, 5, 8, 'Chapter 7 The Kingdom of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 61, 6, 8, 'John the Baptist''s primary message, described in Matthew 3:2, was,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 61, 7, 8, '"Repent, for the kingdom of heaven is at hand." He was the last of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 61, 8, 8, 'prophets to the nation of Israel. He was also the forerunner for Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 61, 9, 8, 'Christ, who was going to open up the way to a new covenant that God was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 61, 10, 8, 'making with man, which would bring people of all nations into a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 61, 11, 8, 'relationship with God as their Father. And so, his message to the nation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 61, 12, 8, 'of Israel was, ''Repent." To repent means to turn around. The best');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 61, 13, 8, 'analogy I can think of for this could be from the military command,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 61, 14, 8, '"About-turn." When a soldier is facing forward and the Sergeant Major on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 61, 15, 8, 'the parade ground says, "About-turn," the soldier turns around instantly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 61, 16, 8, 'with his back toward the direction he was facing and looks toward the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 61, 17, 8, 'direction where his back was facing formerly. That gives us a clear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 61, 18, 8, 'picture of the word repent - to turn around. We have to turn around in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 61, 19, 8, 'our mind. In English and in most languages, the word repent is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 61, 20, 8, 'translated very clearly, but in the Tamil language it is very clear. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 61, 21, 8, 'Tamil, repent is translated as"manam thirumbudhal'', which means the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 61, 22, 8, 'turning of the mind. An about-turn of the mind is exactly what John the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 61, 23, 8, 'Baptist was preaching to the nation of Israel.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 61, 24, 8, 'The nation of Israel was promised a whole lot of earthly things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 61, 25, 8, 'Throughout the Old Covenant, there is no promise that they could partake');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 61, 26, 8, 'of the divine nature of God, or have a treasure in heaven, or about a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 61, 27, 8, 'heavenly life on earth, etc. It was all earthly. In Deuteronomy 28, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 61, 28, 8, 'see clearly that they were promised material wealth, material');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 62, 1, 8, 'prosperity, physical health, a number of children, and blessings on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 62, 2, 8, 'their businesses, crops and cattle. They were promised that they would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 62, 3, 8, 'be very prosperous, they would never be in debt, their earthly enemies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 62, 4, 8, 'will all be destroyed, they would be a great nation, and they would have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 62, 5, 8, 'a land, the land of Canaan, which was called Israel.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 62, 6, 8, 'All the blessings promised to Israel up to this point in time were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 62, 7, 8, 'earthly, and their face was completely set towards the things of earth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 62, 8, 8, 'all the time. But John the Baptist came along and said, "turn around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 62, 9, 8, 'now, about-turn from this. Stop facing the things of earth and turn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 62, 10, 8, 'around because now a new kingdom is coming. That is the kingdom of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 62, 11, 8, 'heaven, where earthly needs become secondary, even physical health');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 62, 12, 8, 'becomes secondary. Material prosperity becomes unimportant because God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 62, 13, 8, 'provides us with material necessities. Turn around, because now God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 62, 14, 8, 'going to give you spiritual wealth, that is, heavenly wealth. God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 62, 15, 8, 'going to give you spiritual children, not necessarily physical children.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 62, 16, 8, 'You will have a spiritual, heavenly land to possess, not an earthly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 62, 17, 8, 'land, primarily." He was telling them to turn around because the kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 62, 18, 8, 'of heaven had not yet come, and was near at hand. It was going to come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 62, 19, 8, 'on the day of Pentecost.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 62, 20, 8, 'We read in Matthew 4:12-13 that John was taken prisoner by Herod. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 62, 21, 8, 'Jesus heard this, He withdrew from Galilee and left Nazareth, where He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 62, 22, 8, 'had grown up and lived for thirty years, and came and stayed at a house');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 62, 23, 8, 'in Capernaum, which is beside the sea. Then, from that moment onwards,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 62, 24, 8, 'Jesus began to preach the same message exactly as John the Baptist had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 62, 25, 8, 'preached. "Repent, for the kingdom of heaven is at hand" (Matthew 4:17).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 62, 26, 8, 'John, as it were, had run the first leg of the relay race and handed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 62, 27, 8, 'over the baton to Jesus and He took up the same message - "Repent." When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 62, 28, 8, 'Jesus ascended up to heaven, we read that the apostle Peter took up the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 63, 1, 8, 'baton from Jesus'' hand and preached the same message - "Repent" (Acts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 63, 2, 8, '2:38). He preached to the people on the day of Pentecost, "Repent and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 63, 3, 8, 'you will receive the gift of the Holy Spirit, which is the kingdom of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 63, 4, 8, 'God within us." Then, it had finally come.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 63, 5, 8, 'When John the Baptist and Jesus talked about the kingdom of God, they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 63, 6, 8, 'said that it was going to come, or it was at hand. Jesus once said the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 63, 7, 8, 'kingdom of God is in your midst, referring to the fact that, in Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 63, 8, 8, 'Himself, the kingdom of God was already present. But it was not present');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 63, 9, 8, 'in the people around Him. That would take place only on the day of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 63, 10, 8, 'Pentecost, when those 120 disciples waited for baptism in the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 63, 11, 8, 'Spirit. Then the Spirit of God filled them and the kingdom of God came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 63, 12, 8, 'to dwell within them. That is the kingdom they proclaimed - the kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 63, 13, 8, 'of heaven (or the kingdom of God) - where the Holy Spirit dwells within');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 63, 14, 8, 'us. It is not an external kingdom of physical healing and material');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 63, 15, 8, 'prosperity, as it is, unfortunately, being preached by a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 63, 16, 8, 'Christian preachers today. Plainly put, that is a deception, and is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 63, 17, 8, 'the kingdom of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 63, 18, 8, 'What Matthew calls the kingdom of heaven is also called the kingdom of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 63, 19, 8, 'God in the other gospels. For example, when John the Baptist preached');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 63, 20, 8, 'that the kingdom of heaven is at hand, the same thing is quoted in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 63, 21, 8, 'other gospels as, "the kingdom of God is at hand" (Mark 1:15). If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 63, 22, 8, 'compare Mark 1:15, where John the Baptist is quoted saying, "the kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 63, 23, 8, 'of God is at hand, and so repent," with Matthew 3:2 where he says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 63, 24, 8, '"Repent, for the kingdom of Heaven is at hand," it becomes clear as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 63, 25, 8, 'crystal that the kingdom of heaven and the kingdom of God are the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 63, 26, 8, 'thing. Some Christians try to make a distinction between them because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 63, 27, 8, 'they haven''t studied the Scripture properly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 63, 28, 8, 'The Kingdom of God Is an Inward Reality');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 64, 1, 8, 'We see that the kingdom of God is one and the same thing as the kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 64, 2, 8, 'of heaven. But what is it, exactly? In Romans 14:17 it says, the kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 64, 3, 8, 'of God is not eating and drinking. It is not something earthly like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 64, 4, 8, 'prosperity or healing - it is not an earthly blessing at all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 64, 5, 8, 'According to Romans 14:17, the kingdom of God is righteousness, joy, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 64, 6, 8, 'peace in the Holy Spirit:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 64, 7, 8, '&#8226; Righteousness: The righteousness of God Himself, first imputed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 64, 8, 8, 'to us when we receive Christ as our Savior and Lord, and then imparted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 64, 9, 8, 'to us from within by the Holy Spirit, where the righteousness of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 64, 10, 8, 'becomes manifested in our life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 64, 11, 8, '&#8226; Joy: An inward joy that delivers us completely from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 64, 12, 8, 'discouragement and depression in the Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 64, 13, 8, '&#8226; Peace: An inward peace, primarily given by the Holy Spirit,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 64, 14, 8, 'freedom from anxiety, fear, tension, discouragement, gloom, bad moods et');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 64, 15, 8, 'cetera and an outward peace with all men, where we refuse to fight with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 64, 16, 8, 'people or anything.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 64, 17, 8, 'So this is the kingdom of God. It''s an inward thing. The kingdom of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 64, 18, 8, 'is within us. It is the life of Christ coming within, through the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 64, 19, 8, 'Spirit. This is the kingdom of God. This is the kingdom of heaven. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 64, 20, 8, 'the life of heaven, here on this earth, inside our hearts and that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 64, 21, 8, 'what Jesus was preaching. That is what we read in Matthew''s gospel as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 64, 22, 8, 'the very first thing he preached. "Repent, for the kingdom of heaven (or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 64, 23, 8, 'the kingdom of God) is near." This is what has already come on the day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 64, 24, 8, 'of the Pentecost. That is what we should be proclaiming now - not as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 64, 25, 8, 'something that is near, but something that has already come. In fact,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 64, 26, 8, 'Jesus made that clear in Mark''s gospel. In the gospel of Mark, when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 64, 27, 8, 'Jesus was speaking to some of the people, He said to the people standing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 64, 28, 8, 'in front of Him, "Truly I say to you there are some of those who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 65, 1, 8, 'standing here," not all but some, "who will not die until they see the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 65, 2, 8, 'kingdom of God come with power" (Mark 9:1). Some of you standing here,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 65, 3, 8, 'He said, would die before that day, but there are some standing here who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 65, 4, 8, 'will not die. There were old people and young people there and He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 65, 5, 8, 'saying that some of you will not die till you see the kingdom of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 65, 6, 8, 'come with power. Now obviously, that is not referring to the second');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 65, 7, 8, 'coming of Christ, when the glory of God will cover the earth as the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 65, 8, 8, 'waters cover the sea. No. That day is in the future and nobody who heard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 65, 9, 8, 'Jesus speak there is alive today. So He is not referring to that. He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 65, 10, 8, 'referring to something else that would happen in the lifetime of some of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 65, 11, 8, 'those people standing in front of Him, when they would see the kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 65, 12, 8, 'of God, which they hadn''t seen till then. No one on earth had seen the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 65, 13, 8, 'kingdom of God until then.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 65, 14, 8, 'The Kingdom of God Came at Pentecost');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 65, 15, 8, 'When did that kingdom of God, which Jesus referred to here, come with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 65, 16, 8, 'power? The answer is in the word ''power.'' Jesus used the word power');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 65, 17, 8, 'again before He ascended into heaven. He told His disciples in Acts 1:8,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 65, 18, 8, '"you shall receive power when the Holy Spirit has come upon you," and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 65, 19, 8, 'ten days later, we read that they did receive that power. That was the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 65, 20, 8, 'fulfillment of Mark 9:1. Some of the people who heard Jesus had died');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 65, 21, 8, 'before the day of Pentecost, but some others, who were standing there,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 65, 22, 8, 'were alive when the kingdom of God had come to earth on the day of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 65, 23, 8, 'Pentecost. So when we compare Scripture with Scripture, we find this is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 65, 24, 8, 'the kingdom of God that we have to proclaim.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 65, 25, 8, 'The Gospel of the Kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 65, 26, 8, 'When the disciples asked Jesus about the second coming, the question');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 65, 27, 8, 'they asked was, "When will these things happen, and what will be the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 65, 28, 8, 'sign of Your coming, and of the end of the age?" (Matthew 24:3). Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 66, 1, 8, 'said many things, and one of the things He said was about the gospel of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 66, 2, 8, 'the kingdom (Matthew 24:14).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 66, 3, 8, 'What is this gospel of the kingdom? Now many of us have heard of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 66, 4, 8, 'gospel of forgiveness of our past sins. Praise God for that! But what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 66, 5, 8, 'about this gospel of the kingdom of heaven, the kingdom of God on earth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 66, 6, 8, 'the kingdom of heaven coming and dwelling in people''s hearts? According');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 66, 7, 8, 'to Jesus in Matthew 24:14, this is going to be preached in the whole');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 66, 8, 8, 'world. But very few will receive it - probably only 1% or 2%. But it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 66, 9, 8, 'will be preached for a witness to all the nations and then, the end will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 66, 10, 8, 'come.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 66, 11, 8, 'I am greatly encouraged by the fact that before Christ comes there''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 66, 12, 8, 'going to be a proclamation of this gospel of the kingdom. What is that?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 66, 13, 8, 'We saw earlier in Romans 14:17, a gospel of righteousness in the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 66, 14, 8, 'Spirit, peace in the Holy Spirit and joy in the Holy Spirit. There are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 66, 15, 8, 'very few proclaiming it. Most people are only proclaiming the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 66, 16, 8, 'forgiveness of sins, which is a very good first step. To me it is like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 66, 17, 8, 'the cleaning of a cup. If my little boy comes to me and says, "Daddy,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 66, 18, 8, 'can you give me a glass of milk?", and he gives me a dirty cup (a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 66, 19, 8, 'picture of our hearts), what I do first is clean the cup. I would not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 66, 20, 8, 'pour milk into that dirty cup. I would take that cup and clean it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 66, 21, 8, 'thoroughly. But then, what''s the purpose of that? I don''t give him an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 66, 22, 8, 'empty cup! I fill it with milk and then give it to him. So when we come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 66, 23, 8, 'to Christ, the first thing He does is clean up our hearts, like cleaning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 66, 24, 8, 'the inside of the cup. But does He leave it like that? No! He fills it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 66, 25, 8, 'with the righteousness of God, the peace of God, and the joy of God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 66, 26, 8, 'through the Holy Spirit. This is the gospel. If we only offer the truth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 66, 27, 8, 'that Christ will clean up the heart and clean up the cup, we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 66, 28, 8, 'offering people an empty cup, and that is why so many Christians are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 67, 1, 8, 'thirsty. They are not satisfied because they are going around with an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 67, 2, 8, 'empty cup that may indeed be clean, but it is empty. What''s the use of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 67, 3, 8, 'giving my son an empty cup that''s clean saying, "Son, you gave me a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 67, 4, 8, 'dirty cup, here it is, clean". If that is all God gives us, it will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 67, 5, 8, 'frustrating. My son would say, "Hey dad, I wanted some milk."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 67, 6, 8, 'The Kingdom of God and the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 67, 7, 8, 'Do you hunger and thirst for righteousness? The trouble is that a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 67, 8, 8, 'Christians are not hungry and thirsty for righteousness and that is why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 67, 9, 8, 'they go around with a clean empty cup. Do you know the difference');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 67, 10, 8, 'between the old covenant and the new covenant? It can be pictured like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 67, 11, 8, 'this. The gift of the Holy Spirit, who brings the kingdom of God to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 67, 12, 8, 'earth, as given to an old covenant believer, is like a cup that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 67, 13, 8, 'placed on a table, upside down. And you pour water from a jug on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 67, 14, 8, 'cup. This is the picture of the outpouring of the Holy Spirit. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 67, 15, 8, 'how it was in the Old Testament times. The water flowed; the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 67, 16, 8, 'was upon people and flowed out around them and probably blessed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 67, 17, 8, 'thousands and millions of people. There were two million people in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 67, 18, 8, 'wilderness who Moses, the anointed servant of God, led. But the inside');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 67, 19, 8, 'of Moses'' heart was dirty. He could not overcome anger. He got so angry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 67, 20, 8, 'at one time, that he broke the tablets of stone that God had written on,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 67, 21, 8, 'with His own hands. Do you know what the new covenant equivalent of that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 67, 22, 8, 'would be today? It would be like tearing the Bible. That is what Moses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 67, 23, 8, 'did. Imagine a man getting so angry that he tore the Bible. Whatever may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 67, 24, 8, 'provoke you to anger, you shouldn''t tear the Bible. But Moses did it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 67, 25, 8, 'because the inside of his cup was dirty. Despite his anger, the blessing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 67, 26, 8, 'flowed from him to bless the multitudes. David was an anointed person,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 67, 27, 8, 'but the inside of his cup was dirty. He could kill Goliath, but when he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 67, 28, 8, 'saw Bathsheba, he fell into sin. The inside of his cup had adultery. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 68, 1, 8, 'was like that with Samson, Gideon and so many other people in the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 68, 2, 8, 'Testament. The Spirit of God was upon them. Even the great John the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 68, 3, 8, 'Baptist, who had the Spirit of God upon him from his mother''s womb, had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 68, 4, 8, 'doubts about Christ when he was imprisoned. He questioned whether Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 68, 5, 8, 'was really the Messiah, even though he had heard a voice from heaven. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 68, 6, 8, 'had unbelief because the inside of his cup was not filled with faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 68, 7, 8, 'But on the day of Pentecost, the Lord turned this cup right side up and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 68, 8, 8, 'poured the Holy Spirit inside the cup, which is the heart. Then it would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 68, 9, 8, 'not only overflow and bless people, like in the Old Testament, but much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 68, 10, 8, 'more than that, in the New Testament. It would be from the innermost');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 68, 11, 8, 'being. That is the kingdom of God flowing out from within us. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 68, 12, 8, 'the kingdom that Jesus prophesied would come on the day of Pentecost.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 68, 13, 8, 'That is why on the last day of the great feast in Jerusalem Jesus said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 68, 14, 8, '"as the Scripture said, ''From his innermost being will flow rivers of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 68, 15, 8, 'living water''" (John 7:38). That would not and could not happen before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 68, 16, 8, 'the day of Pentecost. That is why it says in John 7:39, "This He spoke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 68, 17, 8, 'referring to the Holy Spirit, whom those who believed in Him were to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 68, 18, 8, 'receive; for the Holy Spirit was not yet given," that means not given in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 68, 19, 8, 'this way, "because Jesus was not yet glorified."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 68, 20, 8, 'New Covenant Cleansing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 68, 21, 8, 'Christ had to die and rise again and present His blood before the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 68, 22, 8, 'Father. Only then, could the hearts of men be cleansed. In the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 68, 23, 8, 'Testament, people''s hearts were not cleansed. Psalm 32:1 says their sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 68, 24, 8, 'were covered. They were forgiven, but their hearts were not cleansed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 68, 25, 8, '(Psalm 103:2-3). Today my sins are not covered, but cleansed. If your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 68, 26, 8, 'sins are only covered, it is like putting a sheet over your sins. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 68, 27, 8, 'can lift the sheet up and still see your sins. The blood of bulls and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 68, 28, 8, 'goats could never cleanse people''s hearts, and that is why God could not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 69, 1, 8, 'put the Holy Spirit within people. The kingdom of God could not come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 69, 2, 8, 'within people in Old Testament times. But now that Christ has shed His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 69, 3, 8, 'blood and ascended to the Father, every sin of ours can be cleansed if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 69, 4, 8, 'we confess it to the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 69, 5, 8, 'People ask me what is a sin that cannot be forgiven. I say that the sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 69, 6, 8, 'you do not confess will not be forgiven. Whatever sin you don''t repent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 69, 7, 8, 'of and that you don''t confess, will never be forgiven. But if you repent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 69, 8, 8, 'and confess any sin, it can be cleansed in the blood of Christ - however');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 69, 9, 8, 'great it may be. So God turns the cup right side up and cleanses us in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 69, 10, 8, 'the blood of Christ and pours the Holy Spirit within us first, so that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 69, 11, 8, 'He strengthens us to do God''s will. Then, His life flows out from us in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 69, 12, 8, 'words and actions, so that we can also lead other people to do God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 69, 13, 8, 'will, like we''ve done it ourselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 69, 14, 8, 'The Meaning and Importance of Repentance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 69, 15, 8, 'The Holy Spirit flows from our innermost being. If the Spirit does not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 69, 16, 8, 'flow from our innermost being, then that is an old covenant type of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 69, 17, 8, 'ministry. In order to come to this life, the first step Jesus taught us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 69, 18, 8, 'is to repent or turn around (Matthew 4:17). Not only turning around from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 69, 19, 8, 'seeking the things of earth, but most of all from sin. We don''t have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 69, 20, 8, 'overcome sin before we receive the Holy Spirit. The Holy Spirit comes in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 69, 21, 8, 'to help us overcome sin. We don''t put the cart before the horse. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 69, 22, 8, 'horse should be in front of the cart. I can''t give up sin and then say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 69, 23, 8, '"Lord give me the Holy Spirit." Instead I say, "Lord, I need the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 69, 24, 8, 'Spirit to be able to overcome sin." But I can turn around in my mind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 69, 25, 8, 'from sin; that means my attitude is that I genuinely desire to give up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 69, 26, 8, 'all sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 69, 27, 8, 'That''s all that God is asking you. Do you have an attitude where you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 69, 28, 8, 'want to give up every single thing that is dishonoring to God in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 70, 1, 8, 'life? It may take you some years before you actually overcome them, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 70, 2, 8, 'it doesn''t matter. Make sure your attitude is always one of repentance,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 70, 3, 8, 'where you turn around from your old way of life. It is through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 70, 4, 8, 'repentance and faith in Christ that we come to the starting line of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 70, 5, 8, 'Christian race. Hebrews 12:1-2 says that the Christian life is like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 70, 6, 8, 'race, and I can come to the starting line only if I have repented. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 70, 7, 8, 'message of repentance and turning around from sin is the message that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 70, 8, 8, 'lacking in Christendom today. How many gospel messages do you hear on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 70, 9, 8, 'repentance? How many songs do you hear on repentance? Look at any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 70, 10, 8, 'hymnbook and see how many songs there are on repentance - hardly any.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 70, 11, 8, 'You will find many songs about believing. For example, there is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 70, 12, 8, 'well-known song that says, ''To God be the glory, great things He has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 70, 13, 8, 'done''. One of the lines in that song says, "The vilest offender who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 70, 14, 8, 'truly believes, that moment from Jesus a pardon receives". I disagree');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 70, 15, 8, 'with it. Suppose there is a man attending a meeting - a complete');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 70, 16, 8, 'wretched sinner - who doesn''t know anything about the gospel. And he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 70, 17, 8, 'comes there and listens to that song - "The vilest offender who truly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 70, 18, 8, 'believes, that moment from Jesus a pardon receives." He says, "Yes, I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 70, 19, 8, 'the vilest offender," and he acknowledges that and says, "that is all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 70, 20, 8, 'I''ve got to do, just believe in Jesus. I believe in Him, He is the Son');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 70, 21, 8, 'of God, He died for my sins." Is he forgiven? Not if he has not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 70, 22, 8, 'repented. The vilest offender who repents and believes is one who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 70, 23, 8, 'forgiven. Many people will say, "Well that''s the meaning of ''truly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 70, 24, 8, 'believe''". But that is a theological explanation that an unconverted,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 70, 25, 8, 'godless sinner does not know. He needs to be told that he has to repent.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 70, 26, 8, 'That is what the Apostle Peter made clear on the day of Pentecost:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 70, 27, 8, 'repentance. And that is what Paul preached everywhere. He preached two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 70, 28, 8, 'things - "Repentance toward God and faith in our Lord Jesus Christ"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 71, 1, 8, '(Acts 20:21).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 71, 2, 8, 'Repentance toward God, not toward prosperity and healing. Repentance is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 71, 3, 8, 'not turning away from sickness to healing. I am not turning away from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 71, 4, 8, 'poverty to prosperity. No! That is a false gospel that is being preached');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 71, 5, 8, 'today. It says here I repent toward God from everything that was against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 71, 6, 8, 'God in my life and have faith in our Lord Jesus Christ. Paul says the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 71, 7, 8, 'same thing when he writes to the Thessalonians. He tells them that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 71, 8, 8, 'Word of God came to them and they turned to God, having turned away from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 71, 9, 8, 'idols to serve the living God" (1 Thessalonians 1:8-9).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 71, 10, 8, 'What is an idol? An idol is anything that takes the place of God in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 71, 11, 8, 'heart. It could be your health, your wealth, your job, your house, your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 71, 12, 8, 'car, your wife or your children. It could be anything that takes the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 71, 13, 8, 'place of God in your heart. Just like Isaac took the place of God in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 71, 14, 8, 'Abraham''s heart and God told Abraham to get rid of that idolatry.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 71, 15, 8, 'Turning to God from idols and from everything that prevents God from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 71, 16, 8, 'being first and uppermost in your heart - that is repentance. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 71, 17, 8, 'the meaning of seeking the kingdom of God first and His righteousness,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 71, 18, 8, 'in such a way that all our earthly necessities will be added to us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 71, 19, 8, '(Matthew 6:33). You can be absolutely sure that you will never lack');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 71, 20, 8, 'earthly necessities -- even if you never become a millionaire, He will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 71, 21, 8, 'make sure your earthly necessities are added to you -- if you seek God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 71, 22, 8, 'kingdom first. Thank God for that. This is the way every Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 71, 23, 8, 'should live. It''s a very sad thing today when Christians think that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 71, 24, 8, 'material prosperity and physical healing are the marks of God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 71, 25, 8, 'blessing. That cannot be true because there are a lot of non-Christians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 71, 26, 8, 'who have a lot more material prosperity and a lot more physical health');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 71, 27, 8, 'than even spiritual Christians. That itself proves that that is not the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 71, 28, 8, 'gospel. Moreover, they don''t have freedom from sin that a true disciple');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 72, 1, 8, 'has.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 72, 2, 8, 'The message that Jesus proclaimed first, and that we need to keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 72, 3, 8, 'proclaiming, is repentance. Jesus said, "Teach them to do all that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 72, 4, 8, 'have taught." What did He teach? Turn around from sin, turn toward God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 72, 5, 8, 'and open your heart to the kingdom of heaven so that your mind is now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 72, 6, 8, 'set on things above, on the things of God - righteousness, peace and joy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 72, 7, 8, 'in the Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 72, 8, 9, 'Chapter 8 Progressive Sanctification');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 72, 9, 9, 'If you are a Christian leader, you must not be satisfied until your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 72, 10, 9, 'flock is actually doing all that Jesus commanded. Not just one or two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 72, 11, 9, 'things that Jesus commanded, but every single commandment. Your job is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 72, 12, 9, 'not completed as a Christian leader until everyone in your flock loves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 72, 13, 9, 'all their enemies, blesses everyone who curses them, and is free from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 72, 14, 9, 'the love of money, anger, and lusting with their eyes. It is not enough');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 72, 15, 9, 'to get them to say, "My sins are all forgiven. I am on my way to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 72, 16, 9, 'heaven." That is an incomplete fulfillment of the Great Commission.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 72, 17, 9, 'An Incomplete Fulfillment of the Great Commission');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 72, 18, 9, 'Unfortunately, there is a lot of incomplete fulfillment of the Great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 72, 19, 9, 'Commission. I believe we must be honest with Scripture. Jesus said in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 72, 20, 9, 'Matthew 28:18, "All authority has been given to Me in heaven and on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 72, 21, 9, 'earth." If I submit to that authority, then I must say, "Lord, I am not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 72, 22, 9, 'here to preach the gospel that I think is right. You have all authority');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 72, 23, 9, 'in heaven and on earth. You have all authority over me. You have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 72, 24, 9, 'commanded me to go. Therefore, I go. You commanded me to go and not just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 72, 25, 9, 'make converts but make disciples who put Christ first in every area of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 72, 26, 9, 'their life. You have called me to baptize them in the name of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 72, 27, 9, 'Trinity - Father, Son and Holy Spirit. Then after that, you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 72, 28, 9, 'commanded me to teach them to obey all Your commandments. I must first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 73, 1, 9, 'obey them in my life. Then I can teach others to do it." As I seek to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 73, 2, 9, 'this ministry, only then can I claim the promise in Matthew 28:20 that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 73, 3, 9, 'You will be with me until the end of the age.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 73, 4, 9, 'This is God''s will for us. If we go around proclaiming this message,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 73, 5, 9, 'only then are we teaching people what Jesus taught and completing the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 73, 6, 9, 'Great Commission. Otherwise, we are doing an unfinished job. If you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 73, 7, 9, 'a red letter Bible that shows the words of Jesus in red, you will easily');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 73, 8, 9, 'be able to go through the Gospels and see all the things that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 73, 9, 9, 'taught and commanded. This is what we are to teach every single person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 73, 10, 9, 'Running the Race Looking at Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 73, 11, 9, 'Earlier in Matthew 4:17, Jesus was teaching repentance. The first step');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 73, 12, 9, 'in the Christian life is to repent. Repentance is turning around or an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 73, 13, 9, 'about-turn. Up until this point, I might have spent my entire life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 73, 14, 9, 'following after money and earthly things, but now I turn around from all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 73, 15, 9, 'of that and follow Jesus Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 73, 16, 9, 'Now in Matthew 4:19, we read that Jesus saw Peter and Andrew casting a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 73, 17, 9, 'net by the sea. He said to them, "Follow me, and I will make you fishers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 73, 18, 9, 'of men." The next step in the Christian life is to follow Him or running');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 73, 19, 9, 'the race behind Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 73, 20, 9, 'We run the race looking at Jesus (Hebrews 12:1-2), who is the author and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 73, 21, 9, 'finisher of our faith. He does not ask us to run a race that He Himself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 73, 22, 9, 'did not run. Instead, He came to earth as a man and emptied Himself of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 73, 23, 9, 'equality with God. He did not regard equality with God as something to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 73, 24, 9, 'be held onto tightly, but rather He emptied Himself (Philippians 2:6-7).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 73, 25, 9, 'Jesus did not empty Himself of His person as God, as that is something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 73, 26, 9, 'God could never do. For God could never cease to be God any more than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 73, 27, 9, 'you or I could cease to be a human being. God will always remain God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 73, 28, 9, 'When Jesus Christ, the second person of the Trinity, came to this earth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 74, 1, 9, 'He was still God. That is why Jesus could accept worship. Seven times in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 74, 2, 9, 'the Gospels we read that people worshipped Him, and He accepted it. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 74, 3, 9, 'is unlike the angels in heaven who do not receive worship. This is also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 74, 4, 9, 'unlike Peter who told Cornelius to stand up when he tried to worship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 74, 5, 9, 'Peter. Jesus accepted their worship readily because He is God. He has a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 74, 6, 9, 'right to be worshipped. He also forgave sins, which only God can do. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 74, 7, 9, 'can tell people that God forgives their sins, but Jesus forgave them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 74, 8, 9, 'directly. For example, Jesus said to the paralytic in Mark 2:5, "Son,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 74, 9, 9, 'your sins are forgiven."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 74, 10, 9, 'Jesus was still God so what did He empty Himself of? He emptied himself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 74, 11, 9, 'of those powers, resources, and privileges He had as God. For example,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 74, 12, 9, 'God is never tired, but Jesus would get tired. In Mark 4:38, Jesus was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 74, 13, 9, 'asleep in a boat. In the same way, God is never hungry, but Jesus was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 74, 14, 9, 'hungry. He also had the privilege to call seventy-two thousand angels to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 74, 15, 9, 'defend Him in the garden of Gethsemane, but He would not call them. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 74, 16, 9, 'He was on earth, He said that He did not even know the date of His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 74, 17, 9, 'second coming. He had given up that knowledge, which He now has in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 74, 18, 9, 'heaven. While on earth, He also emptied Himself of God''s omniscience. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 74, 19, 9, 'had to go near a fig tree to see whether there was fruit on (Mark');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 74, 20, 9, '11:13). God can see whether there is fruit on the fig tree from a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 74, 21, 9, 'million miles away, but Jesus had to go near it. There are many similar');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 74, 22, 9, 'examples that show us that Jesus emptied Himself of the privileges of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 74, 23, 9, 'being God, but not of being God Himself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 74, 24, 9, 'We Can Follow Jesus Because He Was Tempted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 74, 25, 9, 'Jesus could be tempted because He had given up the privileges of being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 74, 26, 9, 'God. God can never be tempted according to James 1:13. Yet in Matthew 4,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 74, 27, 9, 'we read how Jesus was tempted. That must be one of the privileges He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 74, 28, 9, 'gave up and emptied Himself of. Why did He do that? Because only then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 75, 1, 9, 'could He be an example for us and be able to say, "Follow me." The very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 75, 2, 9, 'first words Jesus spoke after He spoke on repentance in Matthew 4:17');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 75, 3, 9, 'were, "Follow me" (Matthew 4:19). Suppose an angel came from heaven to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 75, 4, 9, 'teach us how to swim and flew across the swimming pool. The angel then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 75, 5, 9, 'says to us, "Follow me." How could we follow him? Can an angel teach you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 75, 6, 9, 'how to swim? Impossible. You would have to say to the angel, "First, get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 75, 7, 9, 'rid of your wings and take on a body like mine that sinks in the water.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 75, 8, 9, 'Then you can teach me how to swim." In other words, "Become like me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 75, 9, 9, 'Live in a body constantly pulled down by gravity twenty-four hours a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 75, 10, 9, 'day. Then I can follow your example when you show me how to swim."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 75, 11, 9, 'Along the same lines, if Jesus came to earth and lived with all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 75, 12, 9, 'resources He had as God, He could never be tempted. The devil would not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 75, 13, 9, 'come anywhere near Him. If Jesus were to say, "Follow Me," that would be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 75, 14, 9, 'exactly like an angel with wings flying across a swimming pool and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 75, 15, 9, 'telling me to follow him. The angel would be taunting me because he is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 75, 16, 9, 'urging me to do something that he knows I cannot do. God does not do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 75, 17, 9, 'that. Jesus became exactly like His brothers in all things in order to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 75, 18, 9, 'become our High Priest before God (Hebrews 2:17). He had to be made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 75, 19, 9, 'exactly like His brothers in all things. If we have received Jesus as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 75, 20, 9, 'Lord, we are His brothers. Jesus is a high priest who can sympathize');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 75, 21, 9, 'with our struggles in temptation. Therefore, He can say to us, "Follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 75, 22, 9, 'Me."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 75, 23, 9, 'It is a struggle to overcome temptation. We realize how weak we are in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 75, 24, 9, 'the moment of temptation. Even a little feather in the moment of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 75, 25, 9, 'temptation can knock us down into sin. One look at a pretty woman can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 75, 26, 9, 'make us sin. It is so easy for us to lie to get through some examination');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 75, 27, 9, 'or to sign something false. There is also pride. We do something good,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 75, 28, 9, 'and immediately, we can become proud. Imagine a man whom you could knock');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 76, 1, 9, 'down by touching him with a feather. How weak is he? That is how weak we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 76, 2, 9, 'are when it comes to temptation. But Jesus is a high priest who can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 76, 3, 9, 'sympathize with our weakness. Why? Because He was tempted in every way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 76, 4, 9, 'as we are, and yet, did not sin. He was made like us in all things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 76, 5, 9, '(Hebrews 2:17), and He was tempted like us in all things (Hebrews 4:15).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 76, 6, 9, 'Therefore, these two verses show us that Jesus Christ has every right to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 76, 7, 9, 'say to us, "Follow Me."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 76, 8, 9, 'Jesus Was 100% God and 100% Man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 76, 9, 9, 'We can never turn around and say to the Lord, "You do not know what I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 76, 10, 9, 'going through." He would respond, "I know very well because I became a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 76, 11, 9, 'man like you. I became one hundred percent man." The trouble with a lot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 76, 12, 9, 'of Christians is that they accepted Jesus Christ as one hundred percent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 76, 13, 9, 'God, unlike some other cult groups, but they have not accepted Him as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 76, 14, 9, 'one hundred percent man. That is as much a false teaching and heresy as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 76, 15, 9, 'it is to reject that He is one hundred percent God. The truth is in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 76, 16, 9, 'balanced acceptance of both. He was not fifty percent God and fifty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 76, 17, 9, 'percent man like some people think.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 76, 18, 9, 'The Bible never uses the expression "God-man" to describe Jesus Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 76, 19, 9, 'He was fully God and fully man. When He came to earth, He lived as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 76, 20, 9, 'man, and He ascended up into God the Father''s presence as a man. In 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 76, 21, 9, 'Timothy 2:5, the Holy Spirit, who knows the truth better than you and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 76, 22, 9, 'me, tells us that there is one God and one mediator between God and man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 76, 23, 9, 'Who is that? Not the God-man, but the man, Christ Jesus. He became a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 76, 24, 9, 'when He came to this earth, and He remains a man forever.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 76, 25, 9, 'In other words, when Christ, as God, became man on earth, He did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 76, 26, 9, 'cease to be God. When He ascended to heaven, He did not cease to be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 76, 27, 9, 'man. That is the full truth, if you are willing to accept it. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 76, 28, 9, 'why He can say to us, "Follow me. Walk in My footsteps. Deny yourself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 77, 1, 9, 'like I denied Myself. Take up the cross and die to yourself every day,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 77, 2, 9, 'just as I died to Myself every day." He can say all of this because He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 77, 3, 9, 'lived on earth with the same limitations and temptations as us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 77, 4, 9, 'Jesus Also Had to Fight Temptation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 77, 5, 9, 'Was it easy for Christ to overcome temptation? Is it easy for you to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 77, 6, 9, 'overcome temptation? You might not find it difficult to overcome some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 77, 7, 9, 'serious sins like murder, but there are surely other, more subtle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 77, 8, 9, 'temptations in your thought life that are very difficult to overcome.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 77, 9, 9, 'For example, you might find it hard to overcome sexually impure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 77, 10, 9, 'thoughts, anxiety, bitterness, jealousy, grudges, pride, an unforgiving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 77, 11, 9, 'spirit, or love of money. Many of our inward struggles are very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 77, 12, 9, 'difficult to overcome. As someone who was perfectly pure, did Jesus find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 77, 13, 9, 'it any easier? Some think that because He was so pure, it was easier for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 77, 14, 9, 'Him. Because we are not as pure, temptation is much more difficult for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 77, 15, 9, 'us. They believe that He did not really experience what we go through.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 77, 16, 9, 'Therefore, it is still difficult for us to follow Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 77, 17, 9, 'However, think of it this way. Suppose someone grew up in a slum or in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 77, 18, 9, 'poor village in India and always lived in completely filthy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 77, 19, 9, 'surroundings. There are rats, cockroaches, and mosquitoes. There is no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 77, 20, 9, 'proper drainage or sewage. They are used to living in those dirty and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 77, 21, 9, 'filthy conditions. It is not difficult for them to live in that filth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 77, 22, 9, 'because they have been used to it from childhood. But think of someone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 77, 23, 9, 'comes from a very hygienic environment and was brought up in luxury.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 77, 24, 9, 'Perhaps they are from some western country where some people might never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 77, 25, 9, 'have seen a lizard or cockroach crawling in their house. Not even once');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 77, 26, 9, 'in their life! Think of someone with such a standard of hygiene coming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 77, 27, 9, 'and living in this slum in order to help the people in that slum live a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 77, 28, 9, 'better life. Who do you think would find it a greater struggle to live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 78, 1, 9, 'in that slum? Is it the person who has come from totally sanitary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 78, 2, 9, 'conditions or the person who has always lived in the slum? You know the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 78, 3, 9, 'answer. The person who has come from the hygienic surroundings will find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 78, 4, 9, 'it much more of a struggle to live there, let alone keep himself pure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 78, 5, 9, 'from the unsanitary conditions.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 78, 6, 9, 'In the same way, it must have been much more difficult for Jesus Christ,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 78, 7, 9, 'who came from the purity of heaven, to live on this earth than for us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 78, 8, 9, 'who are so used to this filth. Not only was the battle more difficult');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 78, 9, 9, 'for Him, but He could not afford to sin even once if He were going to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 78, 10, 9, 'a sacrifice for us. We know how difficult it is to keep from sinning in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 78, 11, 9, 'our thoughts, attitudes, or motives just for one day. What a feat it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 78, 12, 9, 'would be to live free from sin in thought, word, attitude, or motive for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 78, 13, 9, 'one month, let alone a lifetime!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 78, 14, 9, 'Pray, "Lord, Forgive Me of My sins"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 78, 15, 9, 'Jesus taught us to pray every day, "Forgive us our sins as we forgive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 78, 16, 9, 'others." Do you know that we need to pray for forgiveness every day?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 78, 17, 9, 'Even if we do not repeat Jesus'' prayer each day, we must at least');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 78, 18, 9, 'recognize that we need to pray for forgiveness daily. I pray every day,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 78, 19, 9, '"Lord, forgive me of my sins." How do we know forgiveness is something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 78, 20, 9, 'we need daily? Because the previous line in the prayer is, "Give us this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 78, 21, 9, 'day our daily bread" (Matthew 6:11). Therefore, it is a daily thing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 78, 22, 9, 'Lord, I need my daily bread today, and my follow-up request is that You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 78, 23, 9, 'forgive me of my sins today as well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 78, 24, 9, 'You might ask, "How you can claim to have victory over sin, but also say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 78, 25, 9, 'that I sin every day?" There is a difference between overcoming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 78, 26, 9, 'conscious sin and unconsciously sinning in areas that we do not even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 78, 27, 9, 'know about. We are really only aware of about ten percent of our lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 78, 28, 9, 'Just like we can only see the tip of the iceberg, we can only see the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 79, 1, 9, 'top part of sin in our life. There are a whole lot of areas in our life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 79, 2, 9, 'where we are unconscious of sin and of un-Christlikeness. We need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 79, 3, 9, 'pray that God will forgive us even in those areas.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 79, 4, 9, 'That is the meaning of asking for forgiveness every day. We can live in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 79, 5, 9, 'total victory over conscious sin as the Apostle Paul did. In 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 79, 6, 9, 'Corinthians 4:4, Paul says, "I am conscious of nothing against myself."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 79, 7, 9, 'In other words, Paul is saying, "I am living in victory over all known');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 79, 8, 9, 'sin." I might not be aware of any sin in my life, but that does not mean');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 79, 9, 9, 'I am acquitted or completely free from guilt. The one who examines me is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 79, 10, 9, 'the Lord Himself, to whom I am answerable to. He sees a lot of areas in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 79, 11, 9, 'my life that I do not even see myself. That is why I cannot carelessly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 79, 12, 9, 'say that I am acquitted. I have to ask God to forgive me. When He gives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 79, 13, 9, 'me light on areas I had not previously been conscious of, then I can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 79, 14, 9, 'seek to overcome in these areas. This is sanctification.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 79, 15, 9, 'The Path of the Righteous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 79, 16, 9, 'The Lord gives us a simple command, "Follow me." The Lord then shows us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 79, 17, 9, 'the pathway to a wonderful life of progressive sanctification. Proverbs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 79, 18, 9, '4:18 says, "The path of the righteous is like the light of dawn that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 79, 19, 9, 'shines brighter and brighter until the full day." If we are born again,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 79, 20, 9, 'we are declared righteous because the righteousness of Christ has been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 79, 21, 9, 'imputed to us. The moment of conversion is like the sun rising over the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 79, 22, 9, 'horizon at dawn, chasing away the darkness. The sun becomes brighter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 79, 23, 9, 'while it slowly rises into the heavens until it comes to the perfect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 79, 24, 9, 'noonday position when it is brightest. Similarly, if we are righteous,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 79, 25, 9, 'we should progress in practical righteousness to a greater degree day by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 79, 26, 9, 'day. The sun should not remain on the horizon all the days of our lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 79, 27, 9, 'It must increase in brightness. The path of the righteous is like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 79, 28, 9, 'shining light of the dawn that gets brighter and brighter until the day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 80, 1, 9, 'Christ comes back. Then we will be like Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 80, 2, 9, 'We will be completely like Him only when He comes, but we can walk like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 80, 3, 9, 'Him today. 1 John 3:2 says, "Beloved, now we are children of God, and it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 80, 4, 9, 'has not appeared as yet what we will be. We know that when He appears,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 80, 5, 9, 'we will be like Him, because we will see Him just as He is." Notice the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 80, 6, 9, 'distinction made in 1 John 3:2. We are already children of God, but what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 80, 7, 9, 'we are going to be is not yet manifested. What are we going to be like?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 80, 8, 9, 'We are going to be like Jesus completely. Our total personality');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 80, 9, 9, 'including all our thoughts, words, deeds, attitudes, motives, every area');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 80, 10, 9, 'of our inner life, and our unconscious life will be like Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 80, 11, 9, 'And when will this happen? When He comes again, and we see Him as He is.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 80, 12, 9, 'But until that day, what should we do? 1 John 3:3 says that if you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 80, 13, 9, 'this hope that one day you will be completely like Jesus, you will keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 80, 14, 9, 'on purifying yourself every day until you reach His standard of purity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 80, 15, 9, 'This is similar to what is written a little earlier in 1 John 2:6, which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 80, 16, 9, 'says that if I say I am a Christian, I must live like Christ lived and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 80, 17, 9, 'walk as He walked. Then one day, I will be like Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 80, 18, 9, 'There is a difference between 1 John 2:6 and 1 John 3:2. The message of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 80, 19, 9, '1 John 2:6 means that we need to walk by the same principles by which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 80, 20, 9, 'Jesus lived His earthly life and follow Him. We must have the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 80, 21, 9, 'attitude that Jesus had towards material things, men, women, Pharisees,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 80, 22, 9, 'religious hypocrites, and enemies. For example, Jesus prayed for those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 80, 23, 9, 'enemies who crucified Him, "Father, forgive them for they do not know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 80, 24, 9, 'what they do."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 80, 25, 9, 'The Holy Spirit will enable us to walk like Jesus, but it will only be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 80, 26, 9, 'in our conscious lives, which is only ten percent of our full lives. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 80, 27, 9, 'remaining ninety percent is hidden. God will reveal more of that hidden');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 80, 28, 9, 'area to us so that we may overcome in those areas and increasingly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 81, 1, 9, 'purify ourselves. God cleanses us from sin (1 John 1:7), but we must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 81, 2, 9, 'also seek to purify ourselves by getting rid of sin through the power of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 81, 3, 9, 'the Holy Spirit (1 John 3:3).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 81, 4, 9, 'Jesus is Our Forerunner');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 81, 5, 9, 'To follow in Jesus'' footsteps is seeking to root out sin. In Hebrews');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 81, 6, 9, '6:20, Jesus is called our Forerunner. It is a title which many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 81, 7, 9, 'Christians do not know. We know Him as our Savior, the Light of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 81, 8, 9, 'world, the Bread of Life, the Good Shepherd, and the Resurrection. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 81, 9, 9, 'know Jesus as the Way, the Truth, and the Life. But here is a title');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 81, 10, 9, 'which is not so well known: our Forerunner. As our Forerunner, He has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 81, 11, 9, 'run this race in front of us. Hebrews is a great book that tells us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 81, 12, 9, 'about the humanity of Christ and how we can follow Him. In Hebrews');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 81, 13, 9, '12:1-2, we are instructed to run this race looking at our forerunner,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 81, 14, 9, 'Jesus Christ, who was tempted like us and lived on earth like us. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 81, 15, 9, 'is no excuse for us to say that we cannot overcome conscious sin. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 81, 16, 9, 'only excuse is that we are not hungering and thirsting after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 81, 17, 9, 'righteousness. We are not seeking to be filled with the Holy Spirit and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 81, 18, 9, 'live a Spirit-filled life every day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 81, 19, 9, 'Jesus is Our Dictionary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 81, 20, 9, 'This is all that is involved in this simple command of "Follow Me".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 81, 21, 9, 'We can come up with so many theological arguments about what a verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 81, 22, 9, 'means. Sometimes people even make the Bible their idol and worship the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 81, 23, 9, 'Bible. But what do you do when you come to an English word that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 81, 24, 9, 'cannot understand? If I find a difficult English word in a book, I put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 81, 25, 9, 'the book aside, take out a dictionary, and try to find out the meaning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 81, 26, 9, 'of that word. As a result, my English has improved.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 81, 27, 9, 'In the same way, when you come across a verse that you cannot understand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 81, 28, 9, 'in the Bible, look it up in the dictionary. However, this dictionary is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 82, 1, 9, 'not an earthly dictionary. It is the Word made flesh in Christ. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 82, 2, 9, 'Christ is our dictionary. When you come across a verse in the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 82, 3, 9, 'Testament that commands you to do something, and you do not know how to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 82, 4, 9, 'do it, look at Jesus Christ and see how He did it. The way He did it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 82, 5, 9, 'the definition we are looking for and the way for us to follow Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 82, 6, 9, 'If you want to understand humility, do not look it up in the English');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 82, 7, 9, 'dictionary. Look at Jesus Christ. If you want to understand loving God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 82, 8, 9, 'look at Christ. If you want to understand loving people, look at Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 82, 9, 9, 'If you want to know how to treat women, look at Christ. If you want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 82, 10, 9, 'know what your attitude towards money should be, look at Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 82, 11, 9, 'This is the meaning of the simple command, "Follow Me." We are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 82, 12, 9, 'following the commands from the Old Testament. Everyone in the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 82, 13, 9, 'Covenant could only follow commands. There were 613 commandments in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 82, 14, 9, 'law of Moses. It would be so difficult to remember them, let alone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 82, 15, 9, 'follow them! Now it has been simplified by the Holy Spirit, who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 82, 16, 9, 'constantly shows us how we can follow Jesus Christ''s example without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 82, 17, 9, 'having to remember all the commandments.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 82, 18, 9, 'Let us allow the Holy Spirit to show us the glory of Jesus so that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 82, 19, 9, 'can follow Him more closely.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 82, 20, 10, 'Chapter 9 Becoming Fishers of Men');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 82, 21, 10, 'All That Jesus Taught Is for Disciples');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 82, 22, 10, 'Doing all that Jesus taught isn''t a message for everybody in the world,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 82, 23, 10, 'but rather, for those who are interested in being disciples. We''ve got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 82, 24, 10, 'to preach the gospel, forgiveness of sins, to the whole world, but when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 82, 25, 10, 'it comes to "all that Jesus taught," we have to teach that to disciples.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 82, 26, 10, 'There is no use telling worldly, unconverted people everything that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 82, 27, 10, 'Jesus taught. He said to first make them disciples (Matthew 28:19) and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 82, 28, 10, 'then teach those who have become disciples to do all that He commanded.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 83, 1, 10, 'If you don''t make a person a disciple, it''s pointless trying to teach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 83, 2, 10, 'him all that Jesus commanded. It will be just head knowledge that he has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 83, 3, 10, 'no interest in following. We have multitudes of Christians today who sit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 83, 4, 10, 'in churches listening to all that Jesus commanded, yet they have no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 83, 5, 10, 'interest in following His commands and no interest in doing them, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 83, 6, 10, 'neither do their leaders. That''s not what Jesus has commanded. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 83, 7, 10, 'church can become a strong church that the gates of hell will never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 83, 8, 10, 'prevail against, if we first make disciples and then teach them to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 83, 9, 10, 'every single thing that Jesus commanded. I believe God wants little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 83, 10, 10, 'groups of people like this - New Testament churches - all across the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 83, 11, 10, 'world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 83, 12, 10, 'The mark of a New Testament church is that its members do everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 83, 13, 10, 'that Jesus commanded, and seek to love one another as Christ loved them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 83, 14, 10, 'so that all people will know that they are Christ''s disciples. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 83, 15, 10, 'God''s will, and this is why we have set out to study all the things that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 83, 16, 10, 'Jesus commanded beginning in Matthew 4. In the previous chapter, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 83, 17, 10, 'looked at Matthew 4:19, where Jesus turned to Simon Peter and Andrew and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 83, 18, 10, 'said to them, "Follow Me, and I will make you fishers of men." We looked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 83, 19, 10, 'at what the command "Follow Me" implies. In this chapter, we want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 83, 20, 10, 'look at the rest of that verse.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 83, 21, 10, 'Read the Bible Slowly, Intending to Obey');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 83, 22, 10, 'We need to read the verse slowly and carefully. Many Christians don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 83, 23, 10, 'read the Bible slowly - they don''t meditate on it or think about the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 83, 24, 10, 'words - and therefore they miss what God has for them. Much more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 83, 25, 10, 'important than going through the Bible 50 times in a year, is the Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 83, 26, 10, 'going through you once, in a way that changes you. I don''t want to get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 83, 27, 10, 'into the Guinness Book of Records for how many times I read through the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 83, 28, 10, 'Bible or how many verses in the Bible I have memorized; I am not in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 84, 1, 10, 'competition with anybody on those issues. (It is certainly good to read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 84, 2, 10, 'through the Bible many times. And it is also good to memorize portions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 84, 3, 10, 'of Scripture, if you apply them in your life, claim those promises, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 84, 4, 10, 'obey those commands. Otherwise, it''s worthless head knowledge that will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 84, 5, 10, 'only puff you up. But it is much more important to let the Bible go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 84, 6, 10, 'through you).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 84, 7, 10, 'One of the prayers that I have prayed and continue to pray is, firstly,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 84, 8, 10, '"Lord, before I leave this earth, I want to obey every single');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 84, 9, 10, 'commandment that You have given me to obey, especially in the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 84, 10, 10, 'Testament." There are many commands God gave Israel in the old covenant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 84, 11, 10, 'that are not for me, such as sacrificing lambs, keeping the Sabbath day,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 84, 12, 10, 'etc. But every one of the commands in Scripture that is meant for me, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 84, 13, 10, 'want to obey completely (100%) before I leave this earth. Secondly, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 84, 14, 10, 'pray, "Lord, before I leave this earth, I want to claim every promise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 84, 15, 10, 'that You have given me, especially in the New Testament." There are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 84, 16, 10, 'promises to Israel and to Abraham, which I am not interested in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 84, 17, 10, 'claiming. But before I leave this earth, I want to claim every single');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 84, 18, 10, 'one of the promises which are for me - a child of God - whether in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 84, 19, 10, 'Old Testament or New Testament. Isn''t this a good prayer to pray? Why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 84, 20, 10, 'should I leave this earth ignoring certain sections of Scripture,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 84, 21, 10, 'certain commandments, or certain promises? I want to claim all of them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 84, 22, 10, 'before I reach heaven so that I can stand before my Lord not having');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 84, 23, 10, 'despised a single commandment or promise of His. How do you think you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 84, 24, 10, 'would feel if, when you stood before the Lord, you discovered that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 84, 25, 10, 'neglected a lot of His commandments, even just the small ones? Or if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 84, 26, 10, 'discovered that you neglected to claim some of His promises, which made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 84, 27, 10, 'your life unnecessarily miserable on earth? I would feel terrible if I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 84, 28, 10, 'stood before the Lord like that! So I don''t want to neglect any of His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 85, 1, 10, 'commandments or promises. That is why we want to read Scripture');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 85, 2, 10, 'carefully.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 85, 3, 10, 'Follow Jesus to Become a Fisher of Men');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 85, 4, 10, 'Keeping the above in mind, let us consider the simple statement "I will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 85, 5, 10, 'make you fishers of men." Who is going to make you a fisher of men?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 85, 6, 10, 'Christ. No man can make you a fisher of men. You can go to a Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 85, 7, 10, 'college and spend years there, but it will not make you a fisher of men.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 85, 8, 10, 'You don''t become a fisher of men by studying the Bible, by hearing a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 85, 9, 10, 'missionary challenge and raising your hand, or by coming forward and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 85, 10, 10, 'kneeling down to consecrate your life for God''s work. No, if you want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 85, 11, 10, 'be a fisher of men, the Lord says, "Follow Me." Not even, "Study the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 85, 12, 10, 'Bible," but, "Follow Me."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 85, 13, 10, 'The early Christians did not have a Bible. How could they become fishers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 85, 14, 10, 'of men? By following Jesus. We must understand this correctly. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 85, 15, 10, 'certainly must study the Scriptures, as we learned at the beginning of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 85, 16, 10, 'this study: "Man shall live by every word that proceeds from the mouth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 85, 17, 10, 'of God" (Matthew 4:4). But we must not become idol worshippers of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 85, 18, 10, 'Bible. Don''t become a biblioidolator. The Bible is meant to help us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 85, 19, 10, 'follow Jesus better. The Holy Spirit uses the Word to show us the glory');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 85, 20, 10, 'of Jesus Christ. And to follow Jesus is the way to become a fisher of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 85, 21, 10, 'men. It is Jesus Christ Himself Who is going to make you a fisher of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 85, 22, 10, 'men, not some missionary Bible training institute. God may use men, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 85, 23, 10, 'ultimately it is Christ who wants to have a personal relationship with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 85, 24, 10, 'you, and He alone can make you a fisher of men.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 85, 25, 10, 'True Fishermen Bring Men Completely Out of the Water of This World');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 85, 26, 10, 'What does it mean to be fishers of men? To be fishers of men is to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 85, 27, 10, 'just like fishermen who go into the sea or river and let down their nets');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 85, 28, 10, 'to pick up fish and bring them to the shore. They bring them from one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 86, 1, 10, 'surrounding into another. The fish is not naturally comfortable on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 86, 2, 10, 'earth; it is comfortable in the sea! And a fisherman is picking that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 86, 3, 10, 'fish up from the water and bringing it to earth, to a completely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 86, 4, 10, 'different environment from what it was in. It is important to understand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 86, 5, 10, 'that it is not like capturing a lion or an elephant and putting it in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 86, 6, 10, 'cage, because the lion is already used to living on the earth, not in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 86, 7, 10, 'the sea. But when you catch a fish, it is being taken out of one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 86, 8, 10, 'environment, and put into a completely different one. Land and water are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 86, 9, 10, 'like opposites. So to be a fisher of men - a real fisher of men - is to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 86, 10, 10, 'go to people who are in the waters of this world, pick them up from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 86, 11, 10, 'there, and bring them into a completely different environment: the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 86, 12, 10, 'kingdom of heaven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 86, 13, 10, 'If you haven''t brought a person out of the kingdom of this earth and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 86, 14, 10, 'into the kingdom of heaven, you haven''t really brought that fish out.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 86, 15, 10, 'You may have kept that fish in your net perhaps, but if it is still in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 86, 16, 10, 'the water, you haven''t really brought it out. You haven''t really become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 86, 17, 10, 'a fisher of men. Which fisherman catches a fish in a net and leaves it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 86, 18, 10, 'in the net, still in the water, where the fish is very comfortable? But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 86, 19, 10, 'once you bring it out to the earth, you see how fish behaves. When it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 86, 20, 10, 'on land, it flaps around and says, "Hey, I''m not very comfortable here!"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 86, 21, 10, 'When a person is transported from the kingdom of earth to the kingdom of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 86, 22, 10, 'heaven - just like when a fish comes out of the water and onto the land');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 86, 23, 10, '- he is brought into a completely different environment altogether. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 86, 24, 10, 'Holy Spirit makes us comfortable in the kingdom of heaven. So don''t feel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 86, 25, 10, 'that you have completed your job and you are therefore a "fisher of men"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 86, 26, 10, 'just because you made a hundred people say, "Lord Jesus, come into my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 86, 27, 10, 'heart." Unfortunately, that is what has happened with many believers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 86, 28, 10, 'They have not meditated on what it means to be a fisher of men because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 87, 1, 10, 'other human beings and teachers have made them fishers of men - not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 87, 2, 10, 'Christ. If Christ were to make you a fisher of men, it would be on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 87, 3, 10, 'same principle that He preached two verses earlier, "Repent, for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 87, 4, 10, 'kingdom of heaven is at hand." We must teach these ''fish'' to turn around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 87, 5, 10, 'and seek for the kingdom of heaven, to come into a completely different');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 87, 6, 10, 'environment than they were in. That is what a fisherman is doing. He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 87, 7, 10, 'taking a fish from the sea onto the land, and we must take people out of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 87, 8, 10, 'the kingdom of earth into the kingdom of heaven - out of the kingdom of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 87, 9, 10, 'the devil and into the kingdom of God - if we are to be true fishers of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 87, 10, 10, 'men. It is only Jesus who can make us fishers of men. Nobody else can do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 87, 11, 10, 'it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 87, 12, 10, 'Furthermore, it is not just the evangelist who is a fisher of men. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 87, 13, 10, 'evangelist is only doing part of that job. The prophet, the apostle, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 87, 14, 10, 'teacher, the shepherd, the pastor also have to complete the job of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 87, 15, 10, 'making these people really comfortable in their new environment, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 87, 16, 10, 'kingdom of heaven. The complete task is to take a person out of the sea');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 87, 17, 10, 'and onto the land - out from the kingdom of earth and into the kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 87, 18, 10, 'of heaven. And the way to do that is to follow Christ. If I follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 87, 19, 10, 'Jesus, I will do that just like He did it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 87, 20, 10, 'Don''t Be Discouraged If Some Fish Want to Go Back into the Water of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 87, 21, 10, 'World');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 87, 22, 10, 'Jesus called twelve people to be His apostles but He only succeeded in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 87, 23, 10, 'transferring eleven of them to the values of the kingdom of heaven; one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 87, 24, 10, 'of them dropped out. This teaches us that despite our best efforts, some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 87, 25, 10, 'will still drop out when we seek to lead people into God''s kingdom. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 87, 26, 10, 'are not to be discouraged by that because that happened even in Jesus''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 87, 27, 10, 'church. Even if somebody steals money in your church, don''t get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 87, 28, 10, 'discouraged; even in Jesus'' church, somebody stole money - Judas');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 88, 1, 10, 'Iscariot. So we are not talking about a perfect 100% success with all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 88, 2, 10, 'those we work with. Jesus did not have perfect success with all those He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 88, 3, 10, 'worked with. He always said, "He who has ears to hear, let him hear." He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 88, 4, 10, 'does not force people to enter into His Kingdom. He did not force Judas');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 88, 5, 10, 'Iscariot, and He will not force anybody else. So don''t get discouraged');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 88, 6, 10, 'if you find some people dropping out. Paul once said that, "all who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 88, 7, 10, 'in Asia turned away from me" (2 Timothy 1:15). He once looked at his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 88, 8, 10, 'co-workers and said, "I have no one else of kindred spirit (like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 88, 9, 10, 'Timothy) who will genuinely be concerned for your welfare. For they all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 88, 10, 10, 'seek after their own interests" (Philippians 2:20-21). But he was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 88, 11, 10, 'discouraged because he knew that the way to life was narrow and few');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 88, 12, 10, 'would find it. Jesus knew that (He taught it in Matthew 7), the apostles');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 88, 13, 10, 'knew it, and I know it. We work with everybody, recognizing all the time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 88, 14, 10, 'that only few will really make it - only few will find the way to life -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 88, 15, 10, 'because most people are just not interested. They want the things of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 88, 16, 10, 'heaven as well as the things of the earth, and so they end up like Judas');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 88, 17, 10, 'Iscariot or like the people who turned away from Paul. But if we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 88, 18, 10, 'faithful with our job, there will always be a remnant that really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 88, 19, 10, 'becomes a part of the kingdom of heaven on earth and becomes a very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 88, 20, 10, 'powerful church, as a witness for Christ on this earth. They may not be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 88, 21, 10, 'large in number. In fact, they will not be large in number, because the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 88, 22, 10, 'way to life is narrow and very few find it. It is very important to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 88, 23, 10, 'understand that it is the Lord who makes us fishers of men.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 88, 24, 10, 'Becoming Fishers of Men Changes Our Entire Outlook');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 88, 25, 10, 'Think of the picture in Jeremiah 18, where the Lord told Jeremiah to go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 88, 26, 10, 'to the potter''s house. There he saw the potter taking clay and making a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 88, 27, 10, 'beautiful vessel out of it. It is amazing how experienced potters can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 88, 28, 10, 'make beautiful vessels out of ordinary mud. We are also like mud that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 89, 1, 10, 'the Lord takes and, by the power of Holy Spirit, transforms into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 89, 2, 10, 'servants of God - fishers of men. Most people in the world are fishing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 89, 3, 10, 'for money. They are looking for opportunities to make money just like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 89, 4, 10, 'fishermen who look for where they can catch plenty of fish. That is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 89, 5, 10, 'way most people live on the earth. "Where can I make more money? Over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 89, 6, 10, 'here or over there?" However, when a person begins to seek God''s kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 89, 7, 10, 'first, his mindset changes. He is thinking of where he can turn more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 89, 8, 10, 'people into members of God''s kingdom - to be more Christlike. He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 89, 9, 10, 'looking for opportunities where he can bring an unconverted person to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 89, 10, 10, 'Christ, or where he can bring a person who is converted but not yet a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 89, 11, 10, 'disciple into being a disciple, or where he can make a disciple who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 89, 12, 10, 'just sitting lazily, to obey every single thing that Jesus commanded, so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 89, 13, 10, 'that he is completely in the kingdom of heaven, following in Jesus''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 89, 14, 10, 'footsteps. Then he can reproduce himself in another generation that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 89, 15, 10, 'begins to follow Jesus. So first I begin to follow Jesus, and then as I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 89, 16, 10, 'fish for people and seek that they be transformed into people who follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 89, 17, 10, 'Jesus completely, I produce another generation of disciples.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 89, 18, 10, 'This is what we should do with our own children. Every true disciple of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 89, 19, 10, 'Jesus should desire that every single one of his sons and daughters also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 89, 20, 10, 'become followers of Jesus, so that Jesus (not I) can make them fishers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 89, 21, 10, 'of men. There are many preachers who promote their own children to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 89, 22, 10, 'follow in their footsteps. I am not talking about that type of nonsense.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 89, 23, 10, 'Only Jesus can make anybody a fisher of men. I can never make my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 89, 24, 10, 'children fishers of men. Jesus has to do that. I can encourage them to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 89, 25, 10, 'follow Jesus, but Jesus has to make them His servants. I cannot do that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 89, 26, 10, 'no matter how much I try. It is very important to recognize this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 89, 27, 10, 'difference as we seek to train our children and the younger generation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 89, 28, 10, 'whom we minister to, to follow Jesus'' footsteps and say, "Lord, please');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 90, 1, 10, 'make them fishers of men as well. Make them people who will draw others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 90, 2, 10, 'out of this world and bring them into your everlasting kingdom".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 90, 3, 10, 'Jesus'' Principles for Catching Men');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 90, 4, 10, 'In this process, we have to learn from the examples that Jesus gave in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 90, 5, 10, 'the gospels. Jesus taught those fishermen how to fish through His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 90, 6, 10, 'actions. He taught them once at the beginning of His ministry and once');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 90, 7, 10, 'at the end of His ministry. It is very interesting to see that. We read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 90, 8, 10, 'of Jesus cleansing the temple twice - once at the beginning of His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 90, 9, 10, 'ministry (in John 2) and once at the end of His ministry as well. In the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 90, 10, 10, 'same way, we find Him teaching the disciples this truth by illustration');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 90, 11, 10, 'once at the beginning of His ministry (in Luke 5) and then at the end of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 90, 12, 10, 'His ministry, too (in John 21). Consider the example in Luke 5 and see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 90, 13, 10, 'how He taught them to catch earthly fish as a principle by which we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 90, 14, 10, 'learn how He makes us fishers of men.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 90, 15, 10, 'In Luke 5, we read that Jesus was standing by the lake of Gennesaret.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 90, 16, 10, '"And He got into one of the boats, which was Simon''s, and asked him to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 90, 17, 10, 'put out a little way from the land. And He sat down and began teaching');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 90, 18, 10, 'the people from the boat. When He had finished speaking, He said to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 90, 19, 10, 'Simon, ''Put out into the deep water and let down your nets for a catch''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 90, 20, 10, '(Luke 5:1-4). Jesus had borrowed Peter''s boat, and so He want to repay');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 90, 21, 10, 'Peter for it (wasn''t that kind of Christ?). Simon answered and said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 90, 22, 10, '"Master, we worked hard all night and caught nothing, but I will do as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 90, 23, 10, 'You say and let down the nets" (Luke 5:5). This is the principle we need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 90, 24, 10, 'to understand in serving the Lord. If you work hard all your life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 90, 25, 10, 'without the power of the Holy Spirit, you will discover when you stand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 90, 26, 10, 'in heaven one day that you caught nothing, even if you yourself are in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 90, 27, 10, 'the boat and you are saved. Do you want a life like that? I certainly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 90, 28, 10, 'don''t want it. That is why I want to learn to listen to Jesus, the word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 91, 1, 10, 'of God, and the voice of God in the Holy Spirit. Jesus says to him, "Put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 91, 2, 10, 'out into the deep water and let down your nets for a catch," and Simon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 91, 3, 10, 'was willing to respond. He says, "even though we caught nothing, at Your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 91, 4, 10, 'bidding, I will let down the nets" (Luke 5:5).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 91, 5, 10, 'This is the first principle: "Lord I will not go by my human reason. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 91, 6, 10, 'am going to do what You say, even though my human reason says it''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 91, 7, 10, 'waste of time - having tried all night, in the same areas, going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 91, 8, 10, 'every single spot in this lake and not getting any fish." Imagine how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 91, 9, 10, 'many hours in the night they might have toiled (maybe 7-8 hours) and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 91, 10, 10, 'caught nothing. They were absolutely sure there were no fish down there,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 91, 11, 10, 'but at Jesus'' bidding, they let down their nets again anyway. Their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 91, 12, 10, 'attitude was, "Lord, if You told us to do it, we''ll do it." So they went');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 91, 13, 10, 'out into the waters and "when they had done this, they enclosed a great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 91, 14, 10, 'quantity of fish, and their nets began to break; so they signaled to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 91, 15, 10, 'their partners in other boats for them to come and help them. And they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 91, 16, 10, 'came and filled both the boats" (Luke 5:6-7). This is like a picture of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 91, 17, 10, 'churches cooperating together, eager to bring people completely into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 91, 18, 10, 'God''s kingdom and acknowledging that, "we cannot do all of this alone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 91, 19, 10, 'Let us cooperate and fill both boats." Imagine getting such a catch that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 91, 20, 10, 'they even began to sink. "But when Simon Peter saw that," he knew it was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 91, 21, 10, 'an absolute miracle and not something accidental, and "he fell down at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 91, 22, 10, 'Jesus'' feet, saying, ''Go away from me Lord, for I am a sinful man!'' For');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 91, 23, 10, 'amazement had seized him and all his companions because of the catch of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 91, 24, 10, 'fish which they had taken; and so also were James and John, sons of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 91, 25, 10, 'Zebedee, who were partners with Simon. And Jesus said to Simon, ''Do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 91, 26, 10, 'fear, from now on you will be catching men''" (Luke 5:8-10).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 91, 27, 10, 'This is Jesus'' first principle for catching men: Recognize that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 91, 28, 10, 'cannot do it on your own, and that all your labor will amount to zero.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 92, 1, 10, 'Bow your head before God and say, "Lord I do not want to do my will in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 92, 2, 10, 'my life. I do not want to serve You according to my plan. I do not want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 92, 3, 10, 'to go to this part of the lake or that part of the lake according to my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 92, 4, 10, 'own choice. You tell me where I must go and I will go." Is that the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 92, 5, 10, 'you seek to serve the Lord? Only then will you accomplish God''s will.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 92, 6, 10, 'This is one of the great blessings I have discovered, particularly in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 92, 7, 10, 'the last 36 years, as I have sought to listen to where God wants me to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 92, 8, 10, 'go. I do not go everywhere people invite me because that may not be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 92, 9, 10, 'where God wants me to go. People think that I am a gifted brother, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 92, 10, 10, 'if I speak somewhere, it will automatically be a blessing. Not so! I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 92, 11, 10, 'cannot be a blessing, except when God sends me. I cannot catch fish,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 92, 12, 10, 'unless God tells me to go. That is the first thing we need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 92, 13, 10, 'understand. The second thing we need to understand is that when the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 92, 14, 10, 'tells you to go, despite what all your feelings and your reason say, go,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 92, 15, 10, 'and you will find that God has a purpose in sending you there. I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 92, 16, 10, 'found this many times.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 92, 17, 10, 'The other example is in John 21, at the end of Jesus'' ministry. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 92, 18, 10, 'the last miracle that He worked after the resurrection. We read in John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 92, 19, 10, '21:3 that the disciples went fishing in a boat, and they toiled all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 92, 20, 10, 'night, and again caught nothing. This time Jesus was not in the boat.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 92, 21, 10, 'This was a repetition of the lesson they had learnt three years earlier');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 92, 22, 10, 'at the beginning of Jesus'' ministry. "So Jesus said to them, ''Children,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 92, 23, 10, 'you do not have any fish, do you?'' They answered Him, ''No.'' And He said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 92, 24, 10, 'to them, ''Cast the net on the right-hand side of the boat and you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 92, 25, 10, 'find a catch.'' So they cast, and then they were not able to haul it in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 92, 26, 10, 'because of the great number of fish" (John 21:5-6). This teaches the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 92, 27, 10, 'same lesson: we can toil all night without seeking the Lord''s will. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 92, 28, 10, 'says, "Simon Peter said to them, ''I am going fishing.'' And the others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 93, 1, 10, 'said, ''We will also come with you''" (John 21:3). They went out doing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 93, 2, 10, 'their own will and caught nothing. Then a few hours later, as the day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 93, 3, 10, 'breaks, Jesus comes to them, after they had come to an end of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 93, 4, 10, 'themselves, and asks, "Have you caught anything with all your labor,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 93, 5, 10, 'doing your own will?" Very often the Lord has to wait until we come to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 93, 6, 10, 'an end of ourselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 93, 7, 10, 'Look at the quality of your converts - they are defeated, they fight');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 93, 8, 10, 'with each other, they love money, they do not do anything that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 93, 9, 10, 'commanded. Is that the type of fish you are going to present to Jesus?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 93, 10, 10, 'The Apostle Paul said that he wanted to present to God an offering that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 93, 11, 10, 'is acceptable to Him. Are the believers that you have converted in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 93, 12, 10, 'church the type that are acceptable to God? Or do they fight and quarrel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 93, 13, 10, 'with each other? How are the married couples in your church? How are the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 93, 14, 10, 'children being brought up in your church? Are they acceptable to God?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 93, 15, 10, 'Paul says in Romans 15, "I want them to be acceptable to God." It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 93, 16, 10, 'very important that we present the best before God. Just like when we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 93, 17, 10, 'invite an important person to our house for a meal. Paul says, "I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 93, 18, 10, 'betrothed you to one husband, so that to Christ I might present you as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 93, 19, 10, 'pure virgin" (2 Corinthians 11:2). In Colossians he says, I want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 93, 20, 10, '"present every man perfect in Christ and to this end I labor"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 93, 21, 10, '(Colossians 1:28-29).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 93, 22, 10, 'What does it mean to catch fish? To present the best possible fish to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 93, 23, 10, 'our Lord, by going out, laboring and working with other members of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 93, 24, 10, 'body of Christ, not by ourselves, but by cooperating according to His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 93, 25, 10, 'leading. We do our part, and they do their part, so that finally we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 93, 26, 10, 'transport people from the kingdom of earth into the kingdom of heaven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 93, 27, 10, 'and present to God an offering that is acceptable to Him, a pure virgin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 93, 28, 10, 'to be the Bride of Christ. Let us labor for that day. The way to do it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 94, 1, 10, 'is to follow Jesus Christ and allow Him to make us, like a potter makes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 94, 2, 10, 'clay, into a beautiful vessel.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 94, 3, 11, 'Chapter 10 Follow God’s Will for You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 94, 4, 11, 'Jesus'' Ministry in Galilee');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 94, 5, 11, '"Jesus was going throughout all Galilee, teaching in their synagogues');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 94, 6, 11, 'and proclaiming the gospel of the kingdom, and healing every kind of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 94, 7, 11, 'disease and every kind of sickness among the people" (Matthew 4:23).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 94, 8, 11, 'Jesus went about in all of Galilee teaching in their synagogues and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 94, 9, 11, 'proclaiming the gospel of this kingdom - the same gospel of the kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 94, 10, 11, 'of heaven that He has commanded us to proclaim. He was healing every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 94, 11, 11, 'kind of disease and every kind of sickness among the people. It did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 94, 12, 11, 'matter what that disease was. There was not a sickness that He could not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 94, 13, 11, 'cure. There was not a disease that He could not heal. The news went');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 94, 14, 11, 'about into all of Syria outside of Israel and they brought to him all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 94, 15, 11, 'who were ill. Even non-Jewish people brought people with various');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 94, 16, 11, 'diseases and pains. They brought demoniacs, epileptics, and paralytics');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 94, 17, 11, 'and Jesus healed them. There was nobody who was not healed. We have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 94, 18, 11, 'never seen a healing ministry like that since that time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 94, 19, 11, 'Jesus was the only One Who healed in such a miraculous way that every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 94, 20, 11, 'single disease and sickness was healed. In today''s so-called healing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 94, 21, 11, 'campaigns, people are excited if one out of a thousand people walk out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 94, 22, 11, 'of a wheelchair, but so many people go away disappointed from these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 94, 23, 11, 'healing meetings with their diseases and sicknesses. Many of those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 94, 24, 11, 'were proclaimed healed die a few days later.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 94, 25, 11, 'This is not the reputation of the healing ministry of Jesus. A lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 94, 26, 11, 'this is just a mighty deception fooling people in order to collect their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 94, 27, 11, 'money. We should not be fooled by that. Don''t ever think that is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 94, 28, 11, 'reputation of Jesus'' healing ministry. If you want to see the healing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 95, 1, 11, 'ministry of Jesus, read Matthew 4:23-24. Have you seen anything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 95, 2, 11, 'comparable to even 0.01% of that? No, we have not. Nowhere does that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 95, 3, 11, 'happen.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 95, 4, 11, 'Why did Jesus heal like this? In Acts 2:22, Peter says to the multitude,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 95, 5, 11, '"Men of Israel, listen to these words: Jesus the Nazarene, a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 95, 6, 11, 'attested to you by God with miracles and wonders and signs which God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 95, 7, 11, 'performed through Him in your midst." The miracles and healings of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 95, 8, 11, 'were an attestation by the Father - "This is My Son." This was needed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 95, 9, 11, 'before He went to the cross so that people would know that this was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 95, 10, 11, 'indeed the Son of God dying for the sins of the world on the cross. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 95, 11, 11, 'was an attestation from God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 95, 12, 11, 'Healing Miracle Is Not Guaranteed for Everyone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 95, 13, 11, 'This was not something that every one of His disciples was supposed to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 95, 14, 11, 'do because there is not a single disciple who could do what Jesus did in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 95, 15, 11, 'this area of healing, not even the great, mighty Apostle Paul. Yes, Paul');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 95, 16, 11, 'raised a dead man once (Acts 20), but he could not heal a simple problem');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 95, 17, 11, 'like Timothy''s stomach aches. Where is the comparison between a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 95, 18, 11, 'stomachache and a dead man?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 95, 19, 11, 'Paul could raise a dead man in Acts 20 but he says to Timothy in 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 95, 20, 11, 'Timothy 5:23, "For your frequent stomach aches, take a little wine as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 95, 21, 11, 'medicine." Do you not think Paul laid his hands on Timothy and prayed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 95, 22, 11, 'for him? I am sure he did many times. But Timothy was not healed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 95, 23, 11, 'Timothy would have said to Paul, "Paul, I''m having frequent stomach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 95, 24, 11, 'aches. Can you pray for me?" Paul prayed for him and nothing happened.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 95, 25, 11, 'Paul said, "Okay, just take some medicine." Do you think Paul did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 95, 26, 11, 'pray for Trophimus? In 2 Timothy 4:20, Paul writes, "I prayed for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 95, 27, 11, 'Trophimus but he is still sick. I left him sick at Miletus." Trophimus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 95, 28, 11, 'could have travelled with Paul, but he was sick and was not healed yet,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 96, 1, 11, 'so he couldn''t go. We must be realistic when it comes to this matter of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 96, 2, 11, 'healing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 96, 3, 11, 'The miracles and healings of Jesus were total, but they were an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 96, 4, 11, 'attestation from God as to Who He was. Jesus was the Son of God Who has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 96, 5, 11, 'come to die for the sins of the world. We must keep this in mind so that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 96, 6, 11, 'we do not get an unrealistic idea of what Jesus has commanded us to do.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 96, 7, 11, 'Jesus has not commanded us to go into all the world and heal all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 96, 8, 11, 'sick people. There will be healings and confirmations with healings, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 96, 9, 11, 'that''s not the main emphasis of our ministry. In Mark 16:17, Jesus says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 96, 10, 11, '"Go and preach the gospel to all creation and these signs will accompany');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 96, 11, 11, 'those who have believed."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 96, 12, 11, 'We need to read Scripture slowly, carefully, and exactly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 96, 13, 11, '"In My Name, they will cast out demons.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 96, 14, 11, 'In My Name, they will speak in new languages.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 96, 15, 11, 'They will pick up serpents, and if they drink deadly things, it will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 96, 16, 11, 'hurt them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 96, 17, 11, 'They will lay hands on the sick, and they will recover."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 96, 18, 11, 'Who is going to do this? Not every single believer, as it is often');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 96, 19, 11, 'taught. It says "The group of people who believe in Me" (Mark 16:17) -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 96, 20, 11, 'the body of people who believe in Jesus. These signs will be in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 96, 21, 11, 'midst. It is enough if one person out of 1,000 do it. But what will they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 96, 22, 11, 'do? They will cast out demons. They will speak in unknown tongues. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 96, 23, 11, 'all happening even today. When they are hurt by serpents or poison, they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 96, 24, 11, 'are protected supernaturally. When these people travel to preach in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 96, 25, 11, 'unknown regions, they face so many dangers and God protects them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 96, 26, 11, 'In their midst, there will be some who recover from sickness. These');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 96, 27, 11, 'signs will accompany that group of people. This refers to the group of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 96, 28, 11, 'people who have believed. It is not something that every believer does.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 97, 1, 11, 'It does happen, even today, but differently from the ministry of Jesus,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 97, 2, 11, 'where every single person was healed. It says a number of times in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 97, 3, 11, 'gospels that Jesus "healed them all" (for example, in Matthew 4:23 and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 97, 4, 11, 'Matthew 9:35). We must have an accurate understanding of this matter of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 97, 5, 11, 'healing. Jesus did not tell us to go into all the world and heal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 97, 6, 11, 'everybody.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 97, 7, 11, 'Jesus Did Tell Us to Make Disciples and Teach Them to Do All That He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 97, 8, 11, 'Commanded Us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 97, 9, 11, 'Jesus told us to go into all the world and make disciples, baptize them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 97, 10, 11, 'and teach them to do all that He commanded. You are not to heal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 97, 11, 11, 'everybody who is sick. You are not to even heal every believer who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 97, 12, 11, 'sick. If we try to add to Scripture, we get into problems. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 97, 13, 11, 'different from the Commission that Jesus gave in Matthew 10, which was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 97, 14, 11, 'given before the new covenant was established. When Jesus called His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 97, 15, 11, 'disciples, the very first thing He said to them was "Do not go to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 97, 16, 11, 'nations" (Matthew 10:5). If you really expect to apply the commands in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 97, 17, 11, 'Matthew 10 for yourself, then you must begin with the first command: "Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 97, 18, 11, 'not go to the nations, do not go to the Samaritans. Go only to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 97, 19, 11, 'Israelites." Isn''t that very clear? He could not be clearer than that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 97, 20, 11, 'But there are people who ignore that first part and take the rest of it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 97, 21, 11, 'saying the last part is for us as well. It does not seem to work in many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 97, 22, 11, 'cases. But they deceive believers who do not read the Scriptures');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 97, 23, 11, 'carefully. Read them slowly and carefully.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 97, 24, 11, '"Do not go to the nations, to the people of other nationalities. Do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 97, 25, 11, 'even go to the Samaritans (who are half Jews and half Assyrians), but go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 97, 26, 11, 'only to Israel, the descendants of Abraham, Isaac and Jacob. And as you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 97, 27, 11, 'go, preach, saying, ''The kingdom of heaven is at hand''" (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 97, 28, 11, '10:5-7). Today, this is not our message. We do not preach today that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 98, 1, 11, 'kingdom of heaven is at hand. We say, "The kingdom of heaven is here.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 98, 2, 11, 'Get your sins forgiven. Turn to Christ." Their message was the kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 98, 3, 11, 'of heaven is near. This was a preparation for what was coming in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 98, 4, 11, 'future. Jesus said to them, "Heal the sick." But where? In Israel. Raise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 98, 5, 11, 'the dead in Israel, cleanse the lepers in Israel, and cast out demons in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 98, 6, 11, 'Israel. Freely you have received, so freely give.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 98, 7, 11, 'Jesus also said, "Do not ever acquire any gold or silver" (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 98, 8, 11, '10:9). How many preachers have you seen who follow that command? "Do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 98, 9, 11, 'acquire any gold or silver. Do not carry any money with you." Where have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 98, 10, 11, 'you seen preachers following that? People are selective. They pick and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 98, 11, 11, 'choose from different verses and say, "This is for us; this is not for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 98, 12, 11, 'us." That is playing the fool with God and playing the fool with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 98, 13, 11, 'Scripture. Either take the whole thing or dump the whole thing! These');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 98, 14, 11, 'words are not for us. This is what Jesus told His disciples to do when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 98, 15, 11, 'they went to Israel. Then He said, "Do not even take a bag for your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 98, 16, 11, 'journey. Do not take two coats." How many preachers have you seen like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 98, 17, 11, 'that? "Do not take an extra pair of sandals or a staff because wherever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 98, 18, 11, 'you go, the Lord will provide for you" (Matthew 10:10). He goes on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 98, 19, 11, 'giving them further descriptions of what they should do. When He finally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 98, 20, 11, 'commissions them at the end of His life in Luke 22, He cancels out the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 98, 21, 11, 'instructions He gave in Matthew 10. Many people have not seen Luke 22.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 98, 22, 11, '"When I sent you out three years ago, I sent you out without a purse or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 98, 23, 11, 'bag or an extra pair of sandals. Did you lack anything? Did you not find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 98, 24, 11, 'that your sandals probably never wore out? Did you not find that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 98, 25, 11, 'somebody provided your needs supernaturally? You had no purse, no bag,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 98, 26, 11, 'and no sandals. You lacked nothing, but now, we are entering a new phase');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 98, 27, 11, 'of ministry. Those rules I gave to you in Matthew 10 to heal the sick,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 98, 28, 11, 'cleanse the lepers, and raise the dead do not apply now. "Do not take a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 99, 1, 11, 'purse. Do not take sandals.'' That does not apply now. What should you do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 99, 2, 11, 'now? Take a purse with you. This is new covenant ministry. Take a purse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 99, 3, 11, 'with you. If you do not have a bag, take a bag with you. And if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 99, 4, 11, 'don''t have a sword, get one." Jesus never told them to go with a sword');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 99, 5, 11, 'in Matthew 10. Jesus now says, "If you don''t have a sword, it is better');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 99, 6, 11, 'to sell your robe and buy one because you are going to face all types of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 99, 7, 11, 'dangers. You need to defend yourself. You don''t use a sword to attack');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 99, 8, 11, 'people, but you need to have a sword to defend yourself. For I tell you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 99, 9, 11, 'this is going to be fulfilled, ''He was numbered with the transgressors.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 99, 10, 11, 'And the disciples said, ''Lord, here are two swords.'' They had two swords');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 99, 11, 11, 'with them, and He said that was enough" (Luke 22:35-38).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 99, 12, 11, 'Why Did Jesus Tell Disciples to Take Swords?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 99, 13, 11, 'What was He telling them to take swords for when they went to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 99, 14, 11, 'Gethsemane? Peter took one of the swords and chopped up somebody''s ear.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 99, 15, 11, 'Jesus healed that ear and told Peter to put his sword back. Jesus said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 99, 16, 11, '"He who takes the sword will perish with the sword" (Matthew 26:51-52).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 99, 17, 11, 'They could have said, "Lord, You''re the One Who told us to bring these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 99, 18, 11, 'swords!" Jesus would have told them, "I never told you to bring swords');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 99, 19, 11, 'to attack people. What I meant was if the Roman soldiers take out their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 99, 20, 11, 'swords to attack you, you do not have to lift up your hands and get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 99, 21, 11, 'injured. Bring a sword so that you can defend yourself with it." In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 99, 22, 11, 'other words, you can use the sword for defense, but never to attack.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 99, 23, 11, 'When we do not understand the words of Jesus clearly, we can go to an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 99, 24, 11, 'extreme position like a lot of people who say we should never take a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 99, 25, 11, 'sword at all. That is trying to be more spiritual than Jesus Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 99, 26, 11, 'Himself. If somebody attacks you, you have every right to defend');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 99, 27, 11, 'yourself, but you are not to attack someone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 99, 28, 11, 'If somebody takes you to court, you have a right to defend yourself, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 100, 1, 11, 'you do not go taking other people to court. That is the point. You do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 100, 2, 11, 'not attack people, but you can defend yourself. We have a right to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 100, 3, 11, 'that. When people slapped Jesus, He said, "If I have spoken the truth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 100, 4, 11, 'why do you slap Me?" (John 18:23). So we have a right to defend');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 100, 5, 11, 'ourselves but never to attack. If we understand this, we realize that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 100, 6, 11, 'our calling today is not what we read in Matthew 10, because Jesus did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 100, 7, 11, 'not tell us to go and do what He has done. What is the command in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 100, 8, 11, 'Matthew 28? "Go into all the world, make disciples, and teach them to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 100, 9, 11, 'all that I have commanded."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 100, 10, 11, 'If we read Scripture exactly, we find that it literally gets fulfilled.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 100, 11, 11, 'We can do everything that Jesus commanded, but we cannot do everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 100, 12, 11, 'that Jesus did. All those preachers who pretend to tell you that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 100, 13, 11, 'are doing everything that Jesus did in the realm of miracles and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 100, 14, 11, 'healings are deceiving you. We need to understand what Jesus meant. "Go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 100, 15, 11, 'and teach them to do all that I commanded, not all the ministry that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 100, 16, 11, 'did." When Jesus said, "Follow Me," He was not telling us to follow Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 100, 17, 11, 'in His ministry , but in His life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 100, 18, 11, 'Be Followers of Christ''s Life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 100, 19, 11, 'The Apostle Paul said in 1 Corinthians 11:1, "Be followers of me as I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 100, 20, 11, 'of Christ." There are two people in the New Testament who said, "Follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 100, 21, 11, 'me." No Old Testament prophet could ever say follow me. Their life was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 100, 22, 11, 'not an example to be followed. Not Isaiah or Moses; there was nobody.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 100, 23, 11, 'They could only proclaim, "Hear what God says through me. These are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 100, 24, 11, 'God''s words." But not one of them could say "Follow my example." Moses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 100, 25, 11, 'quarreled with his wife and disobeyed God in not circumcising his son.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 100, 26, 11, 'They were not all good examples in their life, but they could proclaim');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 100, 27, 11, 'God''s Word accurately and say, "Thus said the Lord." But in the new');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 100, 28, 11, 'covenant, we do not just say, "Thus said the Lord." We do not just say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 101, 1, 11, '"Come and hear what God is saying." In the new covenant, we say, " Come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 101, 2, 11, 'and see what God has done," which is different from the Old Testament');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 101, 3, 11, 'prophets saying, "Come and hear what God is saying." The New Testament');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 101, 4, 11, 'prophet says, "Come and see what God has done in my life. Come and see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 101, 5, 11, 'what God has done in my family. Come and see what God has done in me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 101, 6, 11, 'Now I want to teach you to obey what Jesus has commanded so that He can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 101, 7, 11, 'do the same thing in your life. Follow me."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 101, 8, 11, 'Jesus was the first Person in the Bible to say, "Follow Me." Then we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 101, 9, 11, 'read Paul saying, "Follow me as I follow Christ" (1 Corinthians 11:1).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 101, 10, 11, 'He goes on to say in Philippians 3:17, "Brothers, follow my example. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 101, 11, 11, 'not only my example, but observe others who are walking like me. You can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 101, 12, 11, 'follow their example too, because I''m following Christ. "Christ is like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 101, 13, 11, 'the person who has climbed to the top of a 10,000 meter high mountain.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 101, 14, 11, 'He has reached the top, and we''re following. Paul is probably ahead of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 101, 15, 11, 'us. Maybe he has gone up 3,000-4,000 meters. He says to those behind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 101, 16, 11, 'him, "Follow me." Maybe I have gone only up to 500 meters. I can say to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 101, 17, 11, 'people who are still further lower down on the mountain, "Follow me." I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 101, 18, 11, 'can follow the example of others who are ahead of me, who are following');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 101, 19, 11, 'Christ to the peak. The peak is total likeness to Christ. That is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 101, 20, 11, 'goal. The goal is not to heal all the sick people in the world, but to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 101, 21, 11, 'become totally like Jesus Christ in our life, and from that life will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 101, 22, 11, 'an overflow of ministry.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 101, 23, 11, 'We need to understand this. Jesus did not command us to go and tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 101, 24, 11, 'people to do the same ministry He did. We could not follow Paul when he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 101, 25, 11, 'said, "Follow me" if he was speaking of ministry. He was not telling us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 101, 26, 11, 'to become apostles. How can everybody be an apostle? How can everybody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 101, 27, 11, 'be a prophet or an evangelist like Paul was? He was saying, "Follow me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 101, 28, 11, 'in my life. Imitate me in the way I imitate Christ." Even the Apostle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 102, 1, 11, 'Paul could not imitate Christ''s ministry of healing all the sick,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 102, 2, 11, 'walking on water, or feeding 5,000 people with five loaves of bread.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 102, 3, 11, 'There were times when Paul said he himself was hungry (2 Corinthians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 102, 4, 11, '11:27). When he was in need, he shivered in the cold and asked Timothy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 102, 5, 11, 'to bring a blanket for him (2 Timothy 4:13). The early Christians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 102, 6, 11, 'suffered in many ways. They were not protected when they were thrown to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 102, 7, 11, 'the lions, but they followed Jesus, Who refused protection when He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 102, 8, 11, 'being crucified. It is His life that we have to follow. We cannot follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 102, 9, 11, 'Jesus in His ministry.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 102, 10, 11, 'The clearest example of this is that His ministry included dying for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 102, 11, 11, 'sins of the world. How in the world can we follow that ministry? We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 102, 12, 11, 'cannot. So, it is in His life that we follow. We need to distinguish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 102, 13, 11, 'between Jesus'' life and His ministry. In one sentence Jesus could say He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 102, 14, 11, 'did the will of His Father - both in His life and in His ministry. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 102, 15, 11, 'can do the will of God for us in our lives and in our ministry as well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 102, 16, 11, 'In our life, it is to follow the example of Jesus exactly. That is what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 102, 17, 11, 'Paul did. In our ministry, it is to fulfill that particular function in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 102, 18, 11, 'the body of Christ that is given to us. If we understand this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 102, 19, 11, 'distinction between the life of Jesus and the ministry of Jesus, we will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 102, 20, 11, 'find that we are protected from deception and save ourselves from a lot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 102, 21, 11, 'of unreality and hypocrisy. A lot of hypocrisy is in Christians who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 102, 22, 11, 'pretend that they are doing the same things that Jesus did.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 102, 23, 11, 'People sometimes ask, "What does it mean when Jesus said after the Last');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 102, 24, 11, 'Supper, ''Truly, truly I say to you, he who believes in Me, the works');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 102, 25, 11, 'that I do, he will do also; and greater works than these shall he do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 102, 26, 11, 'because I go to the Father. I am going to ask the Father to send the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 102, 27, 11, 'Holy Spirit'' (John 14:12,16)?" What He was saying is when the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 102, 28, 11, 'Spirit was going to come, you''re going to be able to do the works that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 103, 1, 11, 'He did and greater works than those. We need to understand that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 103, 2, 11, 'If you were to ask somebody what are the works that Jesus did, they will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 103, 3, 11, 'immediately talk about healing the sick, raising the dead, walking on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 103, 4, 11, 'water, feeding the 5000 with five loaves of bread. But you would only be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 103, 5, 11, 'talking about the last 10% of Jesus'' life! This is what He did in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 103, 6, 11, 'last three and a half years of His life. Is that all He did? What about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 103, 7, 11, 'the other 90% of His life? What did He do in that 90% of His life? What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 103, 8, 11, 'did He do throughout all of His life? In one sentence: He did the will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 103, 9, 11, 'of His Father. Jesus Himself said in John 6:38, "I came from heaven not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 103, 10, 11, 'to raise the dead, heal the sick, and walk on water. I came from heaven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 103, 11, 11, 'to deny My Own will and to do the will of My Father."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 103, 12, 11, 'That in a nutshell is "the works of Jesus." He came to say "No" to His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 103, 13, 11, 'Own will and to do the will of His Father. The will of His Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 103, 14, 11, 'included preaching the Sermon on the Mount, healing all who were sick,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 103, 15, 11, 'sometimes healing only one person like in the pool of Bethesda, walking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 103, 16, 11, 'on water, making Peter walk on water, and feeding the 5,000 with five');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 103, 17, 11, 'loaves. The will of the Father for Paul did not include walking on water');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 103, 18, 11, 'or feeding 5,000 with 5 loaves or raising someone who had been dead for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 103, 19, 11, 'four days like Lazarus, but it included fulfilling the will of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 103, 20, 11, 'Father.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 103, 21, 11, 'That is the point. The works that Jesus did were, in one sentence, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 103, 22, 11, 'will of God. Paul did that as well. For him, the will of God was to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 103, 23, 11, 'travel around, plant churches, and write Scripture. Jesus never wrote');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 103, 24, 11, 'any Scripture, but Paul did. We are not called to write Scripture. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 103, 25, 11, 'we are called to do the will of our Father. Those are the works of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 103, 26, 11, 'Jesus. This included His obedience to Joseph and Mary at home. If Mary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 103, 27, 11, 'asked Him to bring a bucket of water from the well, Jesus would bring a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 103, 28, 11, 'full bucket of water. Those are the works of Jesus: obedience to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 104, 1, 11, 'Father in the little things and the big things. All of us can do that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 104, 2, 11, 'That in a nutshell is the works that He did and He says we can do that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 104, 3, 11, 'The opposite of that is living in sin or doing our own will. He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 104, 4, 11, 'saying there you do not have to do your own will. You do not have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 104, 5, 11, 'live in sin anymore. You can do the works I did. You can live in purity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 104, 6, 11, 'doing God''s will.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 104, 7, 11, 'What Are the Greater Works That Jesus Mentioned?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 104, 8, 11, '"And greater works than these shall you do." What is that? There is one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 104, 9, 11, 'work that Jesus could never do when He was on earth, and that was to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 104, 10, 11, 'make people one. He had preached to His 12 disciples for three and half');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 104, 11, 11, 'years. At the Last Supper, they were still arguing as to who was the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 104, 12, 11, 'greatest and who was going to be the leader after Jesus dies (Luke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 104, 13, 11, '22:24). And He said, "You are going to do a greater work than that"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 104, 14, 11, '(John 14:12). The reason why Jesus could not make His disciples one was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 104, 15, 11, 'not because of any failure on His part, but because they did not have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 104, 16, 11, 'the Holy Spirit within them. When people do not have the Holy Spirit,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 104, 17, 11, 'even Jesus cannot make them one. So He said, "After I go and I ask the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 104, 18, 11, 'Father to send the Holy Spirit (John 14:16) then the Spirit of God will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 104, 19, 11, 'come inside your hearts. Then you will become one. Then you will do a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 104, 20, 11, 'greater work."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 104, 21, 11, 'That greater work He was referring to is to build the body of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 104, 22, 11, 'Christ. Not a congregation of people, like in the Old Testament, who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 104, 23, 11, 'were unrelated to each other, but born-again believers who are one with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 104, 24, 11, 'each other exactly like the members of a human body, functioning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 104, 25, 11, 'perfectly together. Those twelve disciples did not function like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 104, 26, 11, 'members of a body because they did not have the Holy Spirit within them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 104, 27, 11, 'But once the Holy Spirit came, Jesus said, "You are going to be able to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 104, 28, 11, 'do a greater work than even I have done." That is why building the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 105, 1, 11, 'church and building the body of Christ is the greatest work that anybody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 105, 2, 11, 'can ever do on this earth. And for that, we have to obey the command in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 105, 3, 11, 'Matthew 28:19-20 and make disciples in every nation. You cannot build a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 105, 4, 11, 'church without disciples. You cannot build the church if you don''t teach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 105, 5, 11, 'them to do every single thing that Jesus commanded.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 105, 6, 11, 'I hope that makes it clear as to what exactly it means to be a servant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 105, 7, 11, 'of God in this new covenant age. I hope it clears this fog of confusion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 105, 8, 11, 'concerning healing ministry. We believe in praying for the sick (James');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 105, 9, 11, '5), but our calling primarily is to teach people to do all that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 105, 10, 11, 'has commanded. If we come across demon-possessed people, we have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 105, 11, 11, 'deliver them in Jesus'' name. I have done that myself often. We need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 105, 12, 11, 'do that. But my primary ministry is to lead people to obey all that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 105, 13, 11, 'Jesus commanded, because that is the only way we will be able to build');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 105, 14, 11, 'the church as the body of Christ. The church is God''s ultimate goal,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 105, 15, 11, 'against which the gates of hell will never prevail.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 105, 16, 12, 'Chapter 11 Right Attitudes 1 to 3');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 105, 17, 12, 'Beatitudes/Sermon on the Mount');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 105, 18, 12, 'Matthew 5 marks the beginning of what is known as the Sermon on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 105, 19, 12, 'Mount, which comprises the next three chapters of Matthew. There''s a lot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 105, 20, 12, 'of instruction here.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 105, 21, 12, 'Beatitudes Were for Disciples');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 105, 22, 12, '“When He saw the multitudes, He went up to the mountain, His disciples');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 105, 23, 12, 'came to Him, and He began to teach them” (Matthew 5:2). The first thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 105, 24, 12, 'we should notice is that Jesus was speaking to His disciples. The Sermon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 105, 25, 12, 'on the Mount was not given to the multitudes primarily, but to His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 105, 26, 12, 'disciples - it was to those who wanted to follow Him. Only they could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 105, 27, 12, 'understand and live by the standards of the sermon. Many times,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 105, 28, 12, 'Christians neglect these three chapters, or take their instruction');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 106, 1, 12, 'lightly. They say something like, “This is not for us, this is for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 106, 2, 12, 'Jews!” There are many crazy, foolish, stupid arguments like that among');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 106, 3, 12, 'Christians who do not want to obey all that Jesus taught. They find many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 106, 4, 12, 'excuses to do away with what Jesus taught. But if we see that these are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 106, 5, 12, 'very important words that Jesus spoke specifically to His disciples,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 106, 6, 12, 'then those of us who are disciples will take them very seriously (even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 106, 7, 12, 'if the multitudes are also permitted to listen).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 106, 8, 12, 'Jesus Prepared This Message for 30 Years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 106, 9, 12, 'It says, “He sat down, His disciples came to Him, and He taught them.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 106, 10, 12, 'And at the end of the Sermon on the Mount, it says, “the multitudes were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 106, 11, 12, 'amazed at His teaching” (7:28). The picture is one of Jesus getting His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 106, 12, 12, 'few disciples close to Him and speaking to them, and the multitudes are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 106, 13, 12, 'behind them listening to what He was saying as well. They were amazed at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 106, 14, 12, 'his teaching, and one paraphrase says, “It was obvious that He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 106, 15, 12, 'living (He had lived) what He was preaching” (Matthew 7:29 MSG). He had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 106, 16, 12, 'authority (unlike the scribes who preached without authority), and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 106, 17, 12, 'reason behind Jesus’ authority was that He lived every word of what He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 106, 18, 12, 'spoke.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 106, 19, 12, 'People take a lot of time preparing sermons. How long did Jesus take to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 106, 20, 12, 'prepare the Sermon on the Mount? Thirty years. He was speaking out of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 106, 21, 12, 'His life. These are not notes that He sat down one day earlier and wrote');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 106, 22, 12, 'down to speak on, like a lot of preachers do today. He was speaking out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 106, 23, 12, 'of His life, a life that had faced all types of temptations and various');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 106, 24, 12, 'circumstances in Nazareth. And from there, He was now speaking out of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 106, 25, 12, 'His life, and that is the example for how we ought to speak as well, as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 106, 26, 12, 'we have considered already in this study.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 106, 27, 12, 'An Outline of the Sermon on the Mount');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 106, 28, 12, 'The first verses of the Sermon on the Mount describe nine “Blessed”s or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 107, 1, 12, 'nine of what I would call, “right attitudes” (beatitudes – verses 3-12).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 107, 2, 12, 'Then Jesus gives a little introduction in Matthew 5:13-20. From 5:21 up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 107, 3, 12, 'to Matthew 7:6, Jesus describes nine wrong attitudes that a believer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 107, 4, 12, 'should not have. At the end of chapter 7 is a conclusion, from 7:7');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 107, 5, 12, 'onwards. We will begin by looking at each of the right attitudes that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 107, 6, 12, 'Jesus taught.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 107, 7, 12, 'Right Attitude #1: Poor in Spirit (Matt 5:3)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 107, 8, 12, 'First of all in Matthew 5:3 Jesus says, “blessed are the poor in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 107, 9, 12, 'spirit.” This word “blessed” can mean “happy” or like the Amplified');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 107, 10, 12, 'Bible says, “someone to be envied.” If you want to envy somebody on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 107, 11, 12, 'earth, don’t envy the rich person, don''t envy the famous person, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 107, 12, 12, 'don''t envy the good-looking person. Envy the one who''s poor in spirit,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 107, 13, 12, 'because the kingdom of heaven belongs to him. People with many other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 107, 14, 12, 'qualities, such as charisma and wealth, can have things on this earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 107, 15, 12, 'and possess a kingdom on earth, but the kingdom of heaven belongs to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 107, 16, 12, 'poor in spirit. In the long run, this is the one who is really to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 107, 17, 12, 'envied, because his wealth is going to last for all eternity. When we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 107, 18, 12, 'think of our lifetime on earth, even if it''s 70 or 80 years, if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 107, 19, 12, 'really believe that man is an eternal being (eternity is never-ending,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 107, 20, 12, 'millions of years are like one second in eternity), what would 70 years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 107, 21, 12, 'be? Nothing! In 2 Peter, it says a thousand years is like one day before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 107, 22, 12, 'the Lord and one day is like a thousand years! In the light of eternity,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 107, 23, 12, 'our entire life on earth is very short.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 107, 24, 12, 'A wise person is one who really seeks to have a future in God''s kingdom,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 107, 25, 12, 'and here we are told that the one who''s going to have the maximum');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 107, 26, 12, 'possessions in God''s kingdom is the one who is poor in spirit. This is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 107, 27, 12, 'phrase that is not understood by many Christians because they don''t seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 107, 28, 12, 'to understand these seemingly confusing statements of Scripture. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 108, 1, 12, 'just read and move on. One thing that helps me is to think in terms of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 108, 2, 12, 'an illustration. I find that when I think in terms of pictures, I get a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 108, 3, 12, 'clearer understanding of the Scripture. In fact, Jesus Himself explained');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 108, 4, 12, 'many doctrines in terms of pictures, such as salt and light, and through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 108, 5, 12, 'many parables.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 108, 6, 12, 'A Picture of Spiritual Poverty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 108, 7, 12, 'We can compare “poor in spirit” with “poor in body,” because man is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 108, 8, 12, 'spirit and body, and we understand what it is to be poor in body. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 108, 9, 12, 'tramp or a beggar is poor in body, which means he does not have what it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 108, 10, 12, 'takes to care for his bodily needs. A really poor beggar who''s living on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 108, 11, 12, 'the streets might go from house to house begging for his needs, only to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 108, 12, 12, 'get just enough to survive for the day, and then he would have to come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 108, 13, 12, 'back to the same house to receive some more for the next day. So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 108, 14, 12, 'applying that picture to the phrase, “poor in spirit,” we see that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 108, 15, 12, 'means a person who is aware of his spiritual need every day. He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 108, 16, 12, 'describing a person who is just like that beggar, who is aware of his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 108, 17, 12, 'physical need every day and goes to some generous man''s house for help.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 108, 18, 12, 'And if the man asks him, “What about what I gave you yesterday?” he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 108, 19, 12, 'would say, “That was finished yesterday - the money you gave me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 108, 20, 12, 'yesterday was just enough for yesterday''s need, and again I am in need.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 108, 21, 12, 'I am penniless, I''m in need.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 108, 22, 12, 'A person who is “poor in spirit” is one who comes to God in that way,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 108, 23, 12, 'saying, “Lord I''m a needy person.” He comes to God every single day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 108, 24, 12, 'aware of his spiritual need, and asks for help to meet his spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 108, 25, 12, 'need, just like the beggar would ask for help to meet his physical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 108, 26, 12, 'needs. In the book of Proverbs, there is a verse that speaks about this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 108, 27, 12, 'condition. Proverbs 8 is a chapter on wisdom, and Christ is pictured');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 108, 28, 12, 'here as wisdom, saying, “I, wisdom…” (starting in verse 12). He goes on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 109, 1, 12, 'to say that it is through wisdom that the world was created. And it says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 109, 2, 12, 'in verse 24 that He was there before the fields were there and the earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 109, 3, 12, 'and everything else - when He established the heavens (verse 27), He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 109, 4, 12, 'there. So wisdom is what we need, and it says, “Blessed is the man who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 109, 5, 12, 'listens to me, who watches daily at my gates.” Think of that beggar now,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 109, 6, 12, 'waiting at God’s doorposts. Just like a beggar waiting for his daily');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 109, 7, 12, 'gift of money, we are to come before God as spiritual paupers every day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 109, 8, 12, 'We won''t come like that unless we are needy. Rich people don''t go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 109, 9, 12, 'begging at other people''s houses; they would be ashamed to do it. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 109, 10, 12, 'beggar is not ashamed because he''s needy. He doesn''t have money for food');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 109, 11, 12, 'or his daily necessities, and he''s aware of that. It’s only the person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 109, 12, 12, 'who''s aware of his spiritual need every day who will come before God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 109, 13, 12, 'every single day and say, “Lord I''m a needy person. Please give me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 109, 14, 12, 'wisdom for today.” And as it says in Proverbs 8:35, “He who finds me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 109, 15, 12, 'finds life.” This is what it means to be poor in spirit: to be aware of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 109, 16, 12, 'our spiritual need constantly. The one who is aware of his spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 109, 17, 12, 'need constantly, and who keeps seeking for wisdom from God, will possess');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 109, 18, 12, 'the entire kingdom of heaven. If you see the kingdom of heaven as the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 109, 19, 12, 'riches of God''s kingdom, the Bible says in Ephesians 1:3, that God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 109, 20, 12, 'blessed us with every spiritual blessing in the heavenly places in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 109, 21, 12, 'Christ. Every single blessing of the Holy Spirit is ours in Christ in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 109, 22, 12, 'the heavenly places. We can think of all the spiritual blessings in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 109, 23, 12, 'kingdom of heaven as a huge mansion with thousand rooms, and the master');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 109, 24, 12, 'key that opens every door of that mansion is a poverty of spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 109, 25, 12, 'Blessed is the one who is poor in spirit, because he can possess the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 109, 26, 12, 'entire kingdom of heaven - that is, every single room of the mansion.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 109, 27, 12, 'The treasures in every room will be his, if he holds fast to this master');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 109, 28, 12, 'key.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 110, 1, 12, 'Be Aware of Your Own Need, Not Judgmental of Others’ Needs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 110, 2, 12, 'The master key to possess God''s kingdom is to be aware of your own need.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 110, 3, 12, 'Very often the devil makes us aware of the needs of other people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 110, 4, 12, 'Towards the end of the Sermon on the Mount, Jesus speaks about the wrong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 110, 5, 12, 'attitude of judging others. He says to leave them alone. Judge yourself,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 110, 6, 12, 'and don''t worry about the speck in somebody else''s eye. See the log in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 110, 7, 12, 'your own eye, your own need. This is how Jesus begins and ends the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 110, 8, 12, 'Sermon on the Mount. Be aware of your own need. Don''t be a busybody in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 110, 9, 12, 'other people''s matters. Aware of your own spiritual need, come before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 110, 10, 12, 'God, and wait before Him day by day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 110, 11, 12, 'It is not enough to only be aware of our need in the beginning, when we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 110, 12, 12, 'come to the Lord. When we first come to Christ, we''re all aware that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 110, 13, 12, 'are sinners. We are hopelessly lost, and at that time we are very aware');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 110, 14, 12, 'of the fact that we need Christ’s help to have our sins forgiven; but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 110, 15, 12, 'many people stop there. We don''t realize that we need God''s help for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 110, 16, 12, 'deliverance from this wretched nature, the corrupt nature that we''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 110, 17, 12, 'inherited from Adam, which has everything in it contrary to the nature');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 110, 18, 12, 'of Christ. And if we''re longing for that, we will become aware of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 110, 19, 12, 'own need and we won''t be looking at other people’s needs. A tramp or a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 110, 20, 12, 'beggar comes to a house asking for charity for himself, and that''s how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 110, 21, 12, 'we have to come to God. We must say “Lord, I''m a needy person. I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 110, 22, 12, 'needy.” It is very easy to recognize and acknowledge that on the day we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 110, 23, 12, 'are born again, but we still need to live recognizing our need 50 years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 110, 24, 12, 'after we are born again. I''m personally very thankful that God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 110, 25, 12, 'opened my eyes to see the great secret of the Christian life, to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 110, 26, 12, 'aware of my need every day, even 52 years after I was born-again: to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 110, 27, 12, 'come before God empty-handed and say, “Lord I need You.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 110, 28, 12, 'The picture that Jesus used of need is that of a branch in a tree, “I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 111, 1, 12, 'the vine and you are the branches,” He said. A branch is always aware of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 111, 2, 12, 'its need. Even if a branch has been in the tree and produced mangoes for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 111, 3, 12, '50 years, it still needs to remain in the tree to produce mangoes again');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 111, 4, 12, 'this year. It can’t say, “I have 50 years of experience! Now I can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 111, 5, 12, 'cut off from the tree and produce mangoes on my own.” It is impossible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 111, 6, 12, 'A branch is constantly “poor in spirit,” and therefore it constantly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 111, 7, 12, 'produces fruit. It’s when a man begins to think that he can rely on his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 111, 8, 12, 'experience and not upon Christ that he stops producing fruit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 111, 9, 12, 'Let me also add one other thing: the branches that have been laden down');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 111, 10, 12, 'with the most fruit are the ones that bend lowest to the ground, and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 111, 11, 12, 'most upright branches are the ones that have no fruit. The more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 111, 12, 12, 'spiritual fruit we have, the humbler we will also be. And the less');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 111, 13, 12, 'spiritual fruit we have, the prouder we will be. “Blessed are the poor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 111, 14, 12, 'in spirit for theirs is the kingdom of heaven.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 111, 15, 12, 'Right Attitude #2: Mourn for My Sin and Others’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 111, 16, 12, '“Blessed are those who mourn, for they shall be comforted” (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 111, 17, 12, '5:4). The word “comfort” means “strengthened.” It has the little word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 111, 18, 12, '“f-o-r-t” right in the middle of it. “Fort” is a picture of a huge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 111, 19, 12, 'military protected area - a fort, strengthened. “Blessed are those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 111, 20, 12, 'mourn, for they shall be comforted.” People in the world mourn for all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 111, 21, 12, 'types of things. Most people mourn because of some personal loss. Either');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 111, 22, 12, 'they lost money, or they lost a loved one, or they lost their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 111, 23, 12, 'reputation, or they lost something of this earth, like their dignity,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 111, 24, 12, 'their position, their job, or something else like that. But Jesus is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 111, 25, 12, 'speaking about such mourning. It is not mourning because somebody hurt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 111, 26, 12, 'me, nor is it weeping for my own sorrows.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 111, 27, 12, 'Jesus never wept for His own sorrows, but He did weep for others. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 111, 28, 12, 'read that He wept over Jerusalem (Luke 19:41) and that He wept at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 112, 1, 12, 'tomb of Lazarus (John 11:35), but never once did He weep for the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 112, 2, 12, 'people treated Him, whether they called Him the devil or spat on Him. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 112, 3, 12, 'never wept for Himself. Not only that, as He was taking up the cross and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 112, 4, 12, 'stumbling on the road to the cross, we read in Luke 23:27 that a great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 112, 5, 12, 'multitude of people were following Him as He was carrying the cross, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 112, 6, 12, 'some women were mourning and loudly crying when they saw Him being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 112, 7, 12, 'whipped and beaten, and the blood flowing down His head and back as He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 112, 8, 12, 'carried this heavy cross, with a crown of thorns upon His head. Do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 112, 9, 12, 'know what Jesus turned around and said to them? “Daughters of Jerusalem');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 112, 10, 12, 'stop weeping for Me! I''m OK; yes, My back is torn, there''s a crown of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 112, 11, 12, 'thorns on My head, and I am carrying a heavy cross. I''m going to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 112, 12, 12, 'killed in a few moments, but I''m perfectly okay because I''m in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 112, 13, 12, 'center of the will of God” (Luke 23:28)! Can you have that attitude when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 112, 14, 12, 'you''re suffering the most? “Don''t weep for me, I''m OK, but if you want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 112, 15, 12, 'to weep, weep for yourselves and your children - look at their spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 112, 16, 12, 'condition.” They are Pharisees, cloaked in robes and looking very grand.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 112, 17, 12, 'But look at their spiritual condition. What''s going to happen in the day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 112, 18, 12, 'when Christ comes back and they say to the mountains, “Fall on us and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 112, 19, 12, 'cover us” (Luke 23:30)? That is the attitude of Jesus. He didn''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 112, 20, 12, 'any tears for His Own griefs like the song says, but sweat drops of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 112, 21, 12, 'blood for my griefs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 112, 22, 12, 'The true disciple of Jesus mourns because he''s not like Christ; he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 112, 23, 12, 'mourns when he has sinned, and when he has slipped up. He doesn''t mourn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 112, 24, 12, 'for the way people treat him. He believes that''s his appointed lot on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 112, 25, 12, 'this earth, to be dishonored for the sake of Christ. But he mourns');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 112, 26, 12, 'whenever he has dishonored the Lord by sin or by failure. When he goes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 112, 27, 12, 'to a higher level spiritually, He also mourns for the sins of others,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 112, 28, 12, 'for the failure of others, like Jesus wept over Jerusalem. This is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 113, 1, 12, 'mourning that Jesus spoke of. “Blessed are those who mourn, for they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 113, 2, 12, 'shall be strengthened.” Perhaps the reason why some of us are not being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 113, 3, 12, 'strengthened is because we’re not mourning for our sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 113, 4, 12, 'Spiritual Fathers Mourn for the Sins of Others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 113, 5, 12, 'It''s an even higher level to go beyond that to mourn for the sins of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 113, 6, 12, 'others. The apostle Paul had reached that higher level. He says to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 113, 7, 12, 'Corinthians who had failed so miserably, “I''m afraid when I come to you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 113, 8, 12, 'my God will humble me before you” (2 Corinthians 12:21). Why should God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 113, 9, 12, 'humble Paul? He had lived such an upright life, and was conscious of no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 113, 10, 12, 'sin against himself. But he says, “I will mourn over many of you who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 113, 11, 12, 'have sinned in the past and who have not repented of your impurity,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 113, 12, 12, 'immorality, and sensuality.” He lists some of the things they had in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 113, 13, 12, 'midst of their church (verse 20): jealousy, anger, tempers disputes,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 113, 14, 12, 'slanders, gossips, arrogance, disturbances, etc. When he thought of all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 113, 15, 12, 'the sins among those people who called themselves God''s people, he wept,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 113, 16, 12, 'because he was their spiritual father. It’s just like how an earthly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 113, 17, 12, 'father would weep if his son were very sick. If the father were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 113, 18, 12, 'spiritually minded, he would be very grieved that his son is going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 113, 19, 12, 'astray into drugs or evil habits. Paul was a spiritual father to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 113, 20, 12, 'Corinthians, and every true Christian shepherd or pastor should be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 113, 21, 12, 'spiritual father to his flock. One mark of a spiritual father is that he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 113, 22, 12, 'won''t just criticize the flock, but he will also weep over them like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 113, 23, 12, 'Paul wept over the Corinthians. Only such a man is fit to be a spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 113, 24, 12, 'leader. In Isaiah 49:10 (Isaiah 49 is a great chapter on spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 113, 25, 12, 'leadership) it says, “He who has compassion on the people will lead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 113, 26, 12, 'them.” Who is fit to be a spiritual leader? It’s the one who has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 113, 27, 12, 'compassion on people. And so the “mourning” in Matthew 5:4 refers to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 113, 28, 12, 'mourning for oneself, for one''s own sin, one’s unlikeness to Christ, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 114, 1, 12, 'mourning for others. We will be strengthened if we do that, and we will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 114, 2, 12, 'find strength to be able to strengthen other people as well if we go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 114, 3, 12, 'along this way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 114, 4, 12, 'Right Attitude #3: Be Humble');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 114, 5, 12, '“Blessed are the gentle (or those who are humble and meek) for they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 114, 6, 12, 'shall inherit the earth” (Matthew 5:5). I believe this refers to those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 114, 7, 12, 'who will not fight for their rights, who will not retaliate when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 114, 8, 12, 'ill-treated. Jesus showed what meekness was when His rights were taken');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 114, 9, 12, 'away, and He did not fight back. He did not curse those who cursed Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 114, 10, 12, 'He did not pray for God''s judgment on those who crucified Him. He said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 114, 11, 12, 'to us in Matthew 11:29, “Learn from Me, for I''m meek and gentle of heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 114, 12, 12, '- I''m humble and gentle of heart.” It’s not an easy word to fully');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 114, 13, 12, 'translate in English, and that''s why there are many different');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 114, 14, 12, 'translations that people use - “gentle” (in the margin of my Bible it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 114, 15, 12, 'says “humble, meek”). The general picture is one who is not fighting for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 114, 16, 12, 'his rights on earth, because it says that he shall inherit the earth one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 114, 17, 12, 'day. God gives the earth to those who do not fight for it. This is God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 114, 18, 12, 'Way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 114, 19, 12, 'It''s not those who fight for their rights to whom God gives His greatest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 114, 20, 12, 'blessings, but those who yield their rights. Jesus went down to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 114, 21, 12, 'cross; He yielded up all His rights. His humility and His meekness were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 114, 22, 12, 'seen in this, that He humbled Himself to the point of death, even death');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 114, 23, 12, 'on a shameful cross (Philippians 2:8). He was humiliated and put to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 114, 24, 12, 'shame, and because He was willing to go down like that, to that level,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 114, 25, 12, 'therefore, it says in verse 9, “God exalted Him and gave Him a name');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 114, 26, 12, 'which is above every name.” The reason why Christ is exalted to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 114, 27, 12, 'right hand of the Father today is not because He was always there for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 114, 28, 12, 'all eternity. He was always there as God. But when He came to earth as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 115, 1, 12, 'Man, He earned His right to come to the right hand of the Father. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 115, 2, 12, 'very important to understand that. He earned a right to come back to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 115, 3, 12, 'right hand of the Father because He demonstrated the nature of God so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 115, 4, 12, 'perfectly in His earthly life, as a man facing all types of temptations,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 115, 5, 12, 'and He humbled Himself to the point of death, even death on a cross. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 115, 6, 12, 'didn''t fight for His rights and therefore, one day the whole earth will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 115, 7, 12, 'be given to Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 115, 8, 12, 'Right now He''s been given a name that is above every name, that at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 115, 9, 12, 'name of Jesus every knee will bow, who are in heaven and on earth and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 115, 10, 12, 'under the earth. That''s not yet happened. A lot of people despise the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 115, 11, 12, 'name of Jesus and do not bow to His name today. The demons don''t, and a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 115, 12, 12, 'lot of people on earth don''t. But a day will definitely come when every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 115, 13, 12, 'knee will bow at the name of Jesus and every tongue will confess that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 115, 14, 12, 'Jesus Christ is Lord, and the whole earth will be given to Him. It will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 115, 15, 12, 'belong to Him because He was meek. And so, to the ones who follow Him in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 115, 16, 12, 'that road of meekness, Jesus said, “Learn from Me” (Matt 11:29). The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 115, 17, 12, 'only thing He told us to learn from Him was this gentleness and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 115, 18, 12, 'meekness. “Learn from Me, for I’m gentle and humble, meek and lowly of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 115, 19, 12, 'heart.” This is something we have to learn from Jesus Himself. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 115, 20, 12, 'doesn''t tell us to learn from a book. He says, “Look at Me and see how I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 115, 21, 12, 'did not fight for My rights, how I gave up My rights and I was meek and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 115, 22, 12, 'lowly, and you will find rest for your souls.” I believe there’s only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 115, 23, 12, 'one reason why so many Christians are at unrest, in tension, and some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 115, 24, 12, 'have nervous breakdowns: they''re not meek. They are inwardly fighting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 115, 25, 12, 'for something. They are seeking for their rights, and therefore they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 115, 26, 12, 'at unrest.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 115, 27, 12, 'We must seek to learn these three values: to be poor in spirit, to mourn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 115, 28, 12, 'for our un-Christlikeness and to be meek, never fighting for our rights,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 116, 1, 12, 'but walking in humility and leaving it to God to give us what He sees we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 116, 2, 12, 'need.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 116, 3, 13, 'Chapter 12 Right Attitudes(4 to 6):Hunger and Thirst for Righteousness,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 116, 4, 13, 'Be Merciful, Be Pure in Heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 116, 5, 13, 'The Narrow Way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 116, 6, 13, 'In the last chapter we looked at Matthew 5:3-5, where we saw the first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 116, 7, 13, 'three “right attitudes” that disciples should have. Jesus was primarily');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 116, 8, 13, 'teaching His disciples, as we read in verses 1-2. Notice that these are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 116, 9, 13, 'not characteristics that people in the world appreciate. People in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 116, 10, 13, 'world do not appreciate being constantly aware of their own need. In the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 116, 11, 13, 'world we are told to be full of self-confidence - confidence in our own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 116, 12, 13, 'ability. This is true as far as physical ability, intellectual ability,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 116, 13, 13, 'and human smartness are concerned, which are all required of salesmen,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 116, 14, 13, 'CEOs, etc.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 116, 15, 13, 'But when it comes to the spiritual realm, it is exactly the opposite. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 116, 16, 13, 'is the one who is poor in spirit who is going to possess God''s kingdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 116, 17, 13, 'It is the one who mourns for his sin who is going to be strengthened');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 116, 18, 13, 'spiritually. And it is the one who is meek and does not fight for his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 116, 19, 13, 'own rights who is going to inherit the earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 116, 20, 13, 'In other words, God''s ways are not our ways. His way of thinking is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 116, 21, 13, 'completely opposite to this world’s way of thinking. The right attitudes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 116, 22, 13, '(beatitudes) mentioned here are not things that the world appreciates.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 116, 23, 13, 'In fact they are quite the opposite. That is why, at the end of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 116, 24, 13, 'Sermon on the Mount, Jesus says, “This way that I have spoken of is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 116, 25, 13, 'very narrow way, and very few people find it” (Matthew 7:14 -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 116, 26, 13, 'Paraphrase). I don''t anticipate millions of people turning to this way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 116, 27, 13, 'Millions of people want to go to heaven and millions want the power of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 116, 28, 13, 'the Holy Spirit, but very few want to have the attitudes that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 117, 1, 13, 'taught are the characteristics of God''s people, who live in God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 117, 2, 13, 'kingdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 117, 3, 13, 'Right Attitude #4: Hunger & Thirst for Righteousness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 117, 4, 13, '“Blessed are those who hunger and thirst for righteousness, for they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 117, 5, 13, 'shall be satisfied” (Matthew 5:6). In the world, people are hungering');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 117, 6, 13, 'and thirsting for all types of things. If you look at the things that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 117, 7, 13, 'people in the world hunger and thirst for, they are things like wealth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 117, 8, 13, 'money, a comfortable life, houses and lands, advancement in society,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 117, 9, 13, 'higher position in their jobs, beautifying their appearance, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 117, 10, 13, 'anything else that will bring them honor, comfort and pleasure in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 117, 11, 13, 'world. This is also true for many Christians.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 117, 12, 13, 'Most Christians, even those who claim they''re born again, are pursuing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 117, 13, 13, 'these things. But hungering and thirsting to live a godly life -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 117, 14, 13, 'hungering and thirsting to overcome sin - is such a rare quality that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 117, 15, 13, 'believe what Jesus said: very few find this way to life. I am not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 117, 16, 13, 'surprised when I find very few interested in a message of being totally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 117, 17, 13, 'righteous. In fact I am not surprised when people turn around and say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 117, 18, 13, '“That''s impossible.” When people say the Sermon on the Mount has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 117, 19, 13, 'impossible standards and that nobody can live up to it, that is exactly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 117, 20, 13, 'the answer I expect from a worldly Christian or so-called born-again');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 117, 21, 13, 'Christians who have worldly attitudes. I would question whether such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 117, 22, 13, 'person really born again if he neglects all that Jesus taught in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 117, 23, 13, 'Sermon on the Mount. That is why Jesus said, “Make them disciples”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 117, 24, 13, 'before He said, “Teach them all that I have commanded,” in Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 117, 25, 13, '28:20.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 117, 26, 13, 'Every person who calls himself a Christian, but who only wants to go to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 117, 27, 13, 'heaven and is not interested in obeying all that Jesus commanded, is far');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 117, 28, 13, 'from it. If a person truly becomes a disciple, he will be interested to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 118, 1, 13, 'know what Jesus has commanded. The attitude of a true disciple of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 118, 2, 13, 'is, “If He wants me to be poor in spirit, I want to know what that means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 118, 3, 13, 'and obey it. If He wants me to mourn for my sin or to be gentle, I want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 118, 4, 13, 'to know what that means too. If He wants me to hunger and thirst for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 118, 5, 13, 'righteousness, I want to hunger and thirst for righteousness.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 118, 6, 13, 'What does it mean to hunger and thirst for righteousness? For example,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 118, 7, 13, 'if you say, “I''m thirsty for a little bit of water,” how much would you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 118, 8, 13, 'be willing to pay for that glass of water? What if a glass of water cost');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 118, 9, 13, '100,000 rupees? You would say, “No, I''m not that thirsty, to pay 100,000');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 118, 10, 13, 'rupees for a glass of water.” But consider if you were a person who had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 118, 11, 13, 'been wandering in the desert for seven days and your whole body is dry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 118, 12, 13, 'and your mouth is dry and you are about to die of thirst. Boy, you would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 118, 13, 13, 'be willing to pay 100,000 rupees for a glass of water! That is thirst.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 118, 14, 13, 'And you would be willing to pay any amount for food if you were dying of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 118, 15, 13, 'hunger.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 118, 16, 13, 'The type of hunger and thirst that Jesus is speaking of is a desperate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 118, 17, 13, 'hunger and thirst to be righteous at any cost, not to be righteous only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 118, 18, 13, 'if it''s convenient or if it doesn''t disturb any of my plans. Most people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 118, 19, 13, 'who sit in churches, even those who listen to messages of holiness, want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 118, 20, 13, 'to be holy if it doesn''t disturb their plans, or if it doesn''t ruin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 118, 21, 13, 'their ambitions for the future, or if it doesn''t hinder them from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 118, 22, 13, 'marrying the girl or boy they want to marry. They want righteousness, as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 118, 23, 13, 'long as there''s not too much of a price to pay for it. So when you offer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 118, 24, 13, 'them righteousness, if their first question is, “What’s the price?” then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 118, 25, 13, 'you know that they are not really hungry. A person who is desperately');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 118, 26, 13, 'thirsty or hungry will not ask for the price. He will say, “Give me that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 118, 27, 13, 'water! I will pay! I will give you everything I have because I''m dying!”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 118, 28, 13, 'That is the meaning of seeking God with all of our hearts. The reason');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 119, 1, 13, 'why many people do not find God in the way that others have found Him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 119, 2, 13, 'and why they do not have a satisfying Christian life (which is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 119, 3, 13, 'condition of most born again Christians), is because they are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 119, 4, 13, 'seeking God with all their heart. I have found very few Christians in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 119, 5, 13, 'life, as I’ve traveled to many countries and been a Christian for 52');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 119, 6, 13, 'years, who can honestly say, “I am really satisfied with the Lord, I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 119, 7, 13, 'satisfied with my Christian life, in the progress He’s given me, and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 119, 8, 13, 'am thankful for the way it has gone. I''m excited about my life every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 119, 9, 13, 'day!” Very few can honestly say that. I find most people are bored of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 119, 10, 13, 'their Christian life. Maybe they were excited on the day they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 119, 11, 13, 'converted, but now they are so bored. They have no time to read the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 119, 12, 13, 'Bible, they have no interest in spiritual things; they may be indulging');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 119, 13, 13, 'in a certain amount of activity like going to church, witnessing, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 119, 14, 13, 'caring for the poor, but they are not excited about following in Jesus’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 119, 15, 13, 'footsteps.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 119, 16, 13, 'To understand the reason behind this we need to understand a law');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 119, 17, 13, 'concerning man and God. In Jeremiah 29:13 the Lord says to His people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 119, 18, 13, 'Israel, “You will seek Me and find Me when you search for Me with all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 119, 19, 13, 'your heart.” What if you do not seek Him with all your heart because you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 119, 20, 13, 'are seeking Him half-heartedly, or three-quarters of your heart? Sure,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 119, 21, 13, 'you would have a religion. You would have a Christianity that is a mere');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 119, 22, 13, 'religion, with rituals and various things that you do, but you would not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 119, 23, 13, 'know the Lord. You would not know Jesus as a personal friend, and so you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 119, 24, 13, 'would miss out on everything in the Christian life. You may have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 119, 25, 13, 'Christian name and be a member of a Christian Church, but if you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 119, 26, 13, 'know the Lord personally, you have missed out on the main thing. And the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 119, 27, 13, 'reason may be because you aren’t seeking God with all your heart. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 119, 28, 13, 'are lot of things in the world you may be seeking with all your heart,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 120, 1, 13, 'but not the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 120, 2, 13, 'Jesus said, “Blessed are those who hunger and thirst for righteousness,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 120, 3, 13, 'for they shall be filled (or they shall be satisfied)” (Matthew 5:6). So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 120, 4, 13, 'when a man says, “Oh brothers, I have been trying so hard for victory');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 120, 5, 13, 'over sin, but I haven''t got it, I can tell him on the basis of this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 120, 6, 13, 'verse that he is not really hungering and thirsting for a holy life. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 120, 7, 13, 'is not really desperate about overcoming sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 120, 8, 13, 'Jesus’ Own Hunger & Thirst for Righteousness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 120, 9, 13, 'Consider how Jesus prayed to overcome sin. We know the fact that Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 120, 10, 13, 'was tempted on earth exactly like us and He never sinned, but it was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 120, 11, 13, 'easy for Him. Hebrews 5 tells us about how Jesus faced temptation. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 120, 12, 13, 'are told in Hebrews 4:15 that He was tempted in all points as we are,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 120, 13, 13, 'and then it goes on to say that this Christ is our High Priest after the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 120, 14, 13, 'order of Melchizedek (Hebrews 5:6). It says further in verse 7, “In the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 120, 15, 13, 'days of His flesh, He offered up both prayers and supplications with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 120, 16, 13, 'loud crying and tears to the One able to save Him from death, and He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 120, 17, 13, 'heard because of His piety” (Hebrews 5:7). This is not speaking about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 120, 18, 13, 'the last day of His flesh in Gethsemane, but of the entire period that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 120, 19, 13, 'He was in the flesh on earth - for thirty-three and a half years: He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 120, 20, 13, 'offered up prayers and supplications.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 120, 21, 13, 'Supplication means a specific request to His Father. They were not just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 120, 22, 13, 'general prayers saying, ‘Bless Me,’ but they were specific requests. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 120, 23, 13, 'He offered up these prayers with loud crying and tears. Why in the world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 120, 24, 13, 'was He crying out loud and shedding tears when He prayed? Would Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 120, 25, 13, 'pray like that? Can you think of a time in your life where you prayed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 120, 26, 13, 'with tears? Maybe if your child was sick, or if you lost something which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 120, 27, 13, 'you wanted badly, you may have cried and prayed to God, but Jesus wasn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 120, 28, 13, 'praying for any such thing. Have you ever prayed with loud crying? Maybe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 121, 1, 13, 'when somebody died or something tragic happened, but Jesus wasn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 121, 2, 13, 'praying on such occasions. It says He was praying with loud crying and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 121, 3, 13, 'tears to the One (that is the Father) Who was able to save Him from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 121, 4, 13, 'death. And He was heard because of His godly fear.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 121, 5, 13, 'Now there are a number of things that that verse teaches about what it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 121, 6, 13, 'means to hunger and thirst for righteousness. Jesus did not have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 121, 7, 13, 'righteousness offered to Him on a platter in a way different from us. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 121, 8, 13, 'had to struggle and fight for it, hunger and thirst for it, just like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 121, 9, 13, 'us, because He was a Man like us, in order to be an example for us. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 121, 10, 13, 'faced every situation, every temptation that we face, and He faced it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 121, 11, 13, 'the way we have to face it, in order to overcome that temptation. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 121, 12, 13, 'is the meaning of praying to the One able to save Him from death.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 121, 13, 13, 'What death is Scripture talking about? Jesus was not afraid of going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 121, 14, 13, 'Calvary. He loved us so much that He would be willing to go to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 121, 15, 13, 'thousand Calvarys to save us from our sins. He was not afraid of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 121, 16, 13, 'physical death. There are Christian martyrs who have gone singing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 121, 17, 13, 'their deaths. How could Jesus ever be afraid of that? It also says that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 121, 18, 13, 'His prayer “was heard,” but He was not saved from physical death. So how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 121, 19, 13, 'was His prayer heard? Both those statements indicate that it was another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 121, 20, 13, 'kind of death that He was praying to be saved from.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 121, 21, 13, 'The Bible speaks about physical death and spiritual death. James 1 says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 121, 22, 13, '“When sin is accomplished, it brings forth death.” When you are tempted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 121, 23, 13, 'and yield, it leads to sin, and that ends in death. That is the death');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 121, 24, 13, 'Jesus is asking to be saved from, in the moment of temptation: that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 121, 25, 13, 'there would not even be a smell of the spiritual death of sin brought');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 121, 26, 13, 'about by Him responding to temptation in any way - in thought, attitude,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 121, 27, 13, 'motive, word, or deed. There should be no smell of sin. And because He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 121, 28, 13, 'was so desperately eager to be totally pure, to be pleasing to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 122, 1, 13, 'Father, He had to pray with loud crying and tears.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 122, 2, 13, 'For 30 years in Nazareth, and three and half years in His ministry (in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 122, 3, 13, 'all the days of His flesh), He prayed, “Father, I never want to sin. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 122, 4, 13, 'never want to do My Own will, (that''s the root of all sin).” He prayed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 122, 5, 13, 'and struggled in Gethsemane for that same thing, sweating as great drops');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 122, 6, 13, 'of blood, because He wanted never to do His Own will and He was heard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 122, 7, 13, 'because of His godly fear.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 122, 8, 13, 'So what is the mark of godly fear, according to this verse? One mark of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 122, 9, 13, 'godly fear is that you cry out desperately that you will not displease');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 122, 10, 13, 'God in any way. And He was saved, His prayers were heard, He never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 122, 11, 13, 'sinned. Perhaps this is the reason why we sin - because we are not so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 122, 12, 13, 'desperate to be saved from it. The Bible says, “Flee from immorality.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 122, 13, 13, 'Herein lies the secret of living a godly life. The first step is,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 122, 14, 13, '“Blessed are those who hunger and thirst for righteousness.” And there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 122, 15, 13, 'is a promise: you will be filled. There is no doubt about it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 122, 16, 13, 'Right Attitude #5: Be Merciful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 122, 17, 13, '“Blessed are the merciful, for they shall receive mercy” (Matthew 5:7).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 122, 18, 13, 'Mercy is the attitude that includes both forgiving others who have hurt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 122, 19, 13, 'us and also doing good to those who are in need. The Bible speaks of two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 122, 20, 13, 'aspects of mercy. In the story of the Good Samaritan, Jesus asks the man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 122, 21, 13, 'who questioned Him, “Who was the one who showed mercy and who was the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 122, 22, 13, 'one who loved his neighbor?” The answer was that it was the man who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 122, 23, 13, 'showed mercy to his neighbor. And what was that act of mercy? It was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 122, 24, 13, 'helping a man in his need. That is one aspect of mercy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 122, 25, 13, 'The other aspect of mercy is forgiving people. The Lord is merciful to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 122, 26, 13, 'us and He forgives us our sins. He taught us to pray, “Our Father in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 122, 27, 13, 'Heaven, forgive us our sins in exactly the same way as we forgive others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 122, 28, 13, 'for their sins against us.” What does that prayer mean? It means, if I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 123, 1, 13, 'don''t forgive somebody for his sin against me, the Lord will not forgive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 123, 2, 13, 'me. What I am praying to God is, “Lord, forgive me in the same way that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 123, 3, 13, 'I have forgiven this other person.” But if I haven''t forgiven this other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 123, 4, 13, 'person, I am really asking the Lord not to forgive me. Do you recognize');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 123, 5, 13, 'that? “Forgive me in exactly the same way that I have forgiven this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 123, 6, 13, 'person; since I haven''t forgiven him, You don''t forgive me.” Or, “I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 123, 7, 13, 'forgiven him but I have a terrible grudge against him because of what he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 123, 8, 13, 'did toward me, so Lord, when You forgive me, You too keep a grudge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 123, 9, 13, 'towards me.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 123, 10, 13, 'Do you realize that when you pray the Lord’s prayer, you are asking God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 123, 11, 13, 'to forgive you in exactly the same way as you have forgiven others? If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 123, 12, 13, 'you are merciful to others, God will be merciful to you. If you are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 123, 13, 13, 'merciful to others, God will not be merciful to you. “Blessed are the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 123, 14, 13, 'merciful, for they shall receive mercy” (Matthew 5:7).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 123, 15, 13, 'Whenever people do us harm or hurt us in some way, there are two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 123, 16, 13, 'contradictory thoughts that arise in our mind. One is a thought of mercy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 123, 17, 13, 'and the other is the thought of judgment. The Holy Spirit tells us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 123, 18, 13, 'forgive and to be merciful, but our flesh tells us to be hard on that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 123, 19, 13, 'person and to judge him, and to pray that God will judge him as well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 123, 20, 13, 'But it says in James 2:13, “For judgment will be merciless to the one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 123, 21, 13, 'who has shown no mercy to others.” If I am merciless towards someone,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 123, 22, 13, 'God will be merciless to me. And in the day of judgment, we are going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 123, 23, 13, 'get a big surprise when God imposes a very heavy judgment on believers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 123, 24, 13, 'who did not forgive others - they will not enter God''s kingdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 123, 25, 13, 'Mercy Triumphs over Judgment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 123, 26, 13, 'James 2:13 goes on to say, “Mercy must triumph over judgment.” That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 123, 27, 13, 'means that when there is a conflict in my heart between judging someone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 123, 28, 13, 'and being merciful to him, let mercy triumph, and not judgment. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 124, 1, 13, 'the mark of a man of God. Mercy triumphs over judgment. “Blessed are the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 124, 2, 13, 'merciful for they shall obtain mercy.” It is God''s business to take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 124, 3, 13, 'vengeance on people, not ours.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 124, 4, 13, 'Romans 12:19 says, “Never take your own revenge” because that is God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 124, 5, 13, 'business. God says, “Taking revenge is My business. It''s not your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 124, 6, 13, 'business.” “Vengeance is Mine, I will repay,” says the Lord. So if your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 124, 7, 13, 'enemy is hungry feed him, if he is thirsty give him something to drink.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 124, 8, 13, 'We must not take revenge. We must be merciful and seek to do good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 124, 9, 13, 'wherever we can do good to others. “Blessed are the merciful for they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 124, 10, 13, 'shall obtain mercy.” We will discover on the day of the judgment that if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 124, 11, 13, 'we have not forgiven others, God will not forgive us. Jesus repeats that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 124, 12, 13, 'same instruction again in the Lord''s Prayer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 124, 13, 13, '“If you do not forgive others, then your heavenly Father will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 124, 14, 13, 'forgive your transgressions” (Matthew 6:15). “Your heavenly Father”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 124, 15, 13, 'implies that He is already your Father and you are a child of God. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 124, 16, 13, 'did not say, “God will not forgive you.” If He had used the word “God,”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 124, 17, 13, 'then we could say that this verse refers to unbelievers. But notice what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 124, 18, 13, 'it says in Matthew 6:15 - “Your Father…” Is God the Father of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 124, 19, 13, 'unbelievers? No! But if you are a born-again child of God, then God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 124, 20, 13, 'your Father. And it says “Your Father will not forgive your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 124, 21, 13, 'transgressions.” Why? Because you did not forgive somebody else.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 124, 22, 13, 'If your transgressions are not forgiven, how in the world can you enter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 124, 23, 13, 'God''s kingdom? Do you think they will be forgiven after you die? Is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 124, 24, 13, 'there a second chance after we die? If you die without forgiving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 124, 25, 13, 'someone, what is going to be your fate in eternity? I have no doubt in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 124, 26, 13, 'my mind that you will go to hell, because no one can enter heaven with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 124, 27, 13, 'their sins not forgiven on earth. There is no chance of sins being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 124, 28, 13, 'forgiven after we die. They must be forgiven now, and that is why it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 125, 1, 13, 'so important to be merciful to others. That is not a kind act that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 125, 2, 13, 'are doing to someone else. It is actually a kind act that you are doing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 125, 3, 13, 'to yourself, because you want God to be merciful to you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 125, 4, 13, 'Right Attitude #6: Be Pure in Heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 125, 5, 13, '“Blessed are the pure in heart, for they shall see God” (Matthew 5:8).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 125, 6, 13, 'There are many things about God that He reveals to those whose hearts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 125, 7, 13, 'are pure. It is lack of purity in our heart that blinds our eyes. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 125, 8, 13, 'spoke about the eye being the lamp of the body. I want to connect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 125, 9, 13, 'Matthew 5:8 with Luke 11:34, where Jesus spoke about the eye being the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 125, 10, 13, 'lamp of your body. When your eye is clear your whole body is full of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 125, 11, 13, 'light. If you want to know what it means to be blind, just shut your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 125, 12, 13, 'eyes and you know what blindness is. All the light outside is not coming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 125, 13, 13, 'in anymore and so you cannot see anything. “The lamp of the body is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 125, 14, 13, 'eye, but if your eye is bad or blind or full of cataracts, then your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 125, 15, 13, 'whole body is full of darkness. Then watch out that the light in you is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 125, 16, 13, 'not darkness. If therefore your whole body is full of light, with no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 125, 17, 13, 'dark part in it, then it will be wholly illumined”.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 125, 18, 13, 'This verse is a reference to the conscience. The conscience is the eye');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 125, 19, 13, 'of the heart. When you keep your conscience clear, your heart is filled');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 125, 20, 13, 'with light, and you can see God. But when you neglect to keep your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 125, 21, 13, 'conscience clear, which means you did something wrong and you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 125, 22, 13, 'confess it – if you don''t take the blame for it, and you try to put the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 125, 23, 13, 'blame on somebody else - the eye becomes dim little by little and you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 125, 24, 13, 'lose your vision of God. You can still have a head full of knowledge of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 125, 25, 13, 'the Bible, but you won''t see God anymore, because that has nothing to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 125, 26, 13, 'with head knowledge; that has to do with purity of heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 125, 27, 13, 'There is another possible way of looking at this verse. We can say that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 125, 28, 13, 'this also refers to seeing God in all our circumstances when our heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 126, 1, 13, 'is pure. When my heart is pure, I can look around and I see God in all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 126, 2, 13, 'my circumstances, in everything He does and in everything He says. I can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 126, 3, 13, 'say that God is in control, and even in the evil that other people do to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 126, 4, 13, 'me, I can see God using that for my good. Jesus could see God in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 126, 5, 13, 'most evil thing that happened to Him. When the Roman soldiers came to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 126, 6, 13, 'capture Him in Gethsemane, all that Peter could see was this crooked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 126, 7, 13, 'betrayer Judas betraying Jesus Christ and the evil Roman soldiers coming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 126, 8, 13, 'to capture his Master. But Jesus did not see them. He said, “The cup');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 126, 9, 13, 'which My Father has given Me, shall I not drink it?” The postman may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 126, 10, 13, 'have been Judas Iscariot, or the Pharisees and the high priest, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 126, 11, 13, 'ultimately the cup came from the Father. What does it matter if the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 126, 12, 13, 'postman looks like an evil man, if the letter came from your beloved?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 126, 13, 13, 'Jesus’ heart was pure, therefore He saw God in everything. That is why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 126, 14, 13, 'He could accept being captured, humiliated, and crucified. His heart was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 126, 15, 13, 'pure and He saw God in everything. When we love God with all of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 126, 16, 13, 'hearts and we are called according to His purpose, then everything works');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 126, 17, 13, 'together for good (Romans 8:28). If our heart is pure, then God makes it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 126, 18, 13, 'all work for good, and when we look at the evil that other people do to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 126, 19, 13, 'us in circumstances that don''t seem to fit in with our desire, we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 126, 20, 13, 'say “God is there.” This is why there is tremendous blessing in pursuing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 126, 21, 13, 'purity of heart. As we understand more Scripture, we will see Jesus more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 126, 22, 13, 'clearly in Scripture. Many people study Scripture and don''t see Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 126, 23, 13, 'They see a doctrine and they fight for a doctrine. But when our heart is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 126, 24, 13, 'pure and our eyes are clear, the same Scripture, where somebody else');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 126, 25, 13, 'sees a doctrine, will reveal Jesus. We see the glory of Jesus that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 126, 26, 13, 'Holy Spirit brings out, and it draws our heart to Him and helps us be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 126, 27, 13, 'able to follow Him more closely.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 126, 28, 13, 'Consider these three good attitudes seriously in your life. Blessed are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 127, 1, 13, 'the meek. Blessed are those who hunger and thirst for righteousness, for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 127, 2, 13, 'they have a tremendous longing to be totally pure. Blessed are those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 127, 3, 13, 'are merciful, who are ready to forgive no matter what harm another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 127, 4, 13, 'person has done to them. And blessed are those who seek with all of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 127, 5, 13, 'their heart to keep their conscience pure before God and men, like Paul');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 127, 6, 13, 'did, and who are thereby pure in heart, because they will see God all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 127, 7, 13, 'the time - in the Word, and in their circumstances.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 127, 8, 14, 'Chapter 13 Right Attitudes (7 to 9): Peacemakers, Rejoice When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 127, 9, 14, 'Persecuted for Righteousness and Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 127, 10, 14, 'Right Attitude #7: Peacemakers Will Be Called Sons of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 127, 11, 14, '“Blessed are the peacemakers, for they shall be called sons of God”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 127, 12, 14, '(Matthew 5:9). Do we have a right to call ourselves the sons of God? It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 127, 13, 14, 'says here that it''s not us calling ourselves sons of God; it says they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 127, 14, 14, 'shall be called sons of God. That means that God is going to call us His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 127, 15, 14, 'sons when we are peacemakers. We must have a reputation as peacemakers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 127, 16, 14, 'The opposite of a peacemaker is a troublemaker. What is your reputation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 127, 17, 14, 'in your church? Maybe you say, “I''m not a troublemaker and I’m not a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 127, 18, 14, 'peacemaker, but I’m neutral.” Well then you can’t be called a son of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 127, 19, 14, 'God! It says here “Blessed are the peacemakers, for they shall be called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 127, 20, 14, 'sons of God.” Peacemakers are those who are always seeking for peace.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 127, 21, 14, 'God Is Pleased with Those Who Pursue After Peace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 127, 22, 14, 'When Jesus was born, the angels from heaven came saying, “Peace on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 127, 23, 14, 'earth, glory to God in the highest and on earth peace among the men with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 127, 24, 14, 'whom He is pleased” (Luke 2:14). God is pleased with those who pursue');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 127, 25, 14, 'after peace. The world is full of all types of quarrels, fighting,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 127, 26, 14, 'grumbling, murmuring, and complaining. If we were to look at this earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 127, 27, 14, 'from heaven’s standpoint, we would see it filled with darkness because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 127, 28, 14, 'of this. But in the midst of this darkness there are a few spots of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 128, 1, 14, 'light - those are the children of God, the sons of God; and one mark of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 128, 2, 14, 'these sons of God is that they are peacemakers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 128, 3, 14, 'We find the same thing repeated in Philippians 2. Why does it say that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 128, 4, 14, 'we must do all things without grumbling, disputing, and complaining');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 128, 5, 14, '(Philippians 2:14)? We must do every single thing in our life without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 128, 6, 14, 'any grumbling, without any complaining, and without any disputing -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 128, 7, 14, 'that''s a pretty high standard. But it says in verse 15, that that''s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 128, 8, 14, 'only way we can prove ourselves to be blameless, “Innocent children of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 128, 9, 14, 'God in the midst of a crooked and perverse generation.” That''s the only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 128, 10, 14, 'way we can appear as lights in this dark world. How is that? What is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 128, 11, 14, 'darkness? It’s murmuring, grumbling, and complaining. What is the light?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 128, 12, 14, 'It’s people who make peace and do not grumble or complain.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 128, 13, 14, 'When Jesus sent out His disciples to the people of Israel He appointed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 128, 14, 14, 'seventy to go two by two, ahead of Him to every place where He Himself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 128, 15, 14, 'was going to come later (Luke 10:1). He directed them to look for a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 128, 16, 14, 'of peace to stay with whenever they enter a town. He said, “Whenever you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 128, 17, 14, 'enter a house, say ‘peace be to this house,’ and if a man of peace is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 128, 18, 14, 'there, your peace will rest upon him. But if not, it will return to you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 128, 19, 14, 'And if you find a man of peace, stay in that house - don''t move from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 128, 20, 14, 'house to house because you will hardly find another house like that in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 128, 21, 14, 'town” (Luke 10:5-6).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 128, 22, 14, 'In other words, what He was saying was: “You will probably find only one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 128, 23, 14, 'house in a town where a man is a man of peace.” Otherwise why did He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 128, 24, 14, 'tell them not to move from house to house? What if there were 10 or 20');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 128, 25, 14, 'or 30 or 100 houses like that? Jesus knew that it is very unlikely to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 128, 26, 14, 'find such homes. But such homes are exactly the type where God dwells.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 128, 27, 14, 'Is your house a house of peace? Can it be said about you as a husband');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 128, 28, 14, 'that you''re a man of peace? It always requires two people to quarrel;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 129, 1, 14, 'you can’t have a quarrel if one person refuses to fight. It’s just like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 129, 2, 14, 'how both of your two hands have to collide with each other to make a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 129, 3, 14, 'noise. You can’t have a noise with just one hand clapping. If one hand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 129, 4, 14, 'refuses to clap, the other hand cannot make a noise; quarreling is like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 129, 5, 14, 'that. If anyone (say husband or wife) refuses to fight and dies to him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 129, 6, 14, 'or herself, there will be no fight. Instead, there will be peace. So I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 129, 7, 14, 'can never blame the lack of peace on another person, whether it be in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 129, 8, 14, 'church or in my house or anywhere else.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 129, 9, 14, 'You can’t say, “My wife is the one who disturbs the peace,” or “My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 129, 10, 14, 'husband disturbs the peace.” It is because you cooperate in that quarrel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 129, 11, 14, 'and fight that there''s no peace. There can be no sound if even one hand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 129, 12, 14, 'refuses to come together with the other. So in a situation where there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 129, 13, 14, 'is conflict, if you are pursuing peace, then you will die to yourself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 129, 14, 14, 'and let the other person agitate as much as he or she likes. Then there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 129, 15, 14, 'will be peace.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 129, 16, 14, 'Fellowship Is Better Than Peace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 129, 17, 14, 'If both husband and wife are willing to die to themselves, then there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 129, 18, 14, 'will be what we call fellowship. Fellowship is even higher than peace.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 129, 19, 14, 'Peace is second best; fellowship is the best. Peace is where one person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 129, 20, 14, 'refuses to fight and dies to himself or herself; fellowship is when both');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 129, 21, 14, 'die to themselves and their rights, and they both refuse to grumble or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 129, 22, 14, 'complain or find fault. They have fellowship. But where we can’t build');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 129, 23, 14, 'fellowship, let''s at least pursue after peace.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 129, 24, 14, 'Two verses in the New Testament speak about the importance of this. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 129, 25, 14, 'already saw in Philippians 2:14 the importance of never grumbling or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 129, 26, 14, 'complaining or finding fault in others. Romans 12:18 says, “If possible,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 129, 27, 14, 'so far as it depends on you, be at peace with all men.” That’s exactly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 129, 28, 14, 'the same principle: if anybody wants to come for a fight or an argument');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 130, 1, 14, 'with you, but you refuse to fight and quarrel, and you die to yourself,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 130, 2, 14, 'then there is peace. There may not be fellowship with that person - for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 130, 3, 14, 'example there may not be fellowship between you and your husband or wife');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 130, 4, 14, '- but there can still be peace in the home. As much as it depends on you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 130, 5, 14, 'and is possible from your side, die to yourself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 130, 6, 14, 'Pursue Peace Even If It Means Losing an Argument');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 130, 7, 14, 'I refuse to argue with people even on doctrinal matters if I find that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 130, 8, 14, 'all they are interested in is controversy. When people come to my home');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 130, 9, 14, 'and inquire or ask questions after a meeting, if I find that they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 130, 10, 14, 'really eager to know the truth, I''m willing to spend hours with them;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 130, 11, 14, 'but if I find they are only interested in controversy, I want to pursue');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 130, 12, 14, 'peace. I say, “Listen, let''s change the subject, let''s talk about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 130, 13, 14, 'cricket or something like that where we’re united. Let''s talk about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 130, 14, 14, 'pursuing humility instead of arguing about this doctrine because I know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 130, 15, 14, 'this person''s interest is in controversies. He is getting upset and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 130, 16, 14, 'angry, and it’s pointless pursuing that discussion, because I don''t want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 130, 17, 14, 'to win an argument and lose a friend. I''d rather say, “Let''s keep the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 130, 18, 14, 'friendship. You can assume that you have won the argument but I''m not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 130, 19, 14, 'going to argue with you.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 130, 20, 14, 'Pursuing Peace Requires Dying to Self');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 130, 21, 14, 'If I believe that God is sovereign and will never allow me to be tested');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 130, 22, 14, 'beyond my ability, I''ll be willing to die to myself. Many people say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 130, 23, 14, 'that if you pursue this path, people will just take advantage of you;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 130, 24, 14, 'they will treat you like a doormat and walk over you. Not so. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 130, 25, 14, 'believe 1 Corinthians 10:13, which says, “God will never allow you to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 130, 26, 14, 'tested beyond your ability,” then you will recognize that He will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 130, 27, 14, 'allow people to take advantage of you, and you will confidently pursue');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 130, 28, 14, 'the way of peace. You''ll find, like it says in the book of Proverbs,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 131, 1, 14, '“The name of the Lord is a strong tower, the righteous run into it and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 131, 2, 14, 'are safe” (Proverbs 18:10). When you find controversy, take refuge in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 131, 3, 14, 'the name of Jesus and then you''ll find the fulfillment of Proverbs 16:7,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 131, 4, 14, 'that “When a man''s ways are pleasing to the Lord, you come and hide in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 131, 5, 14, 'the Lord, he makes even his enemies to be at peace with him.” It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 131, 6, 14, 'amazing what God can do! I''ve experienced that. If you try to please the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 131, 7, 14, 'Lord, you too will find that even your enemies get subdued.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 131, 8, 14, 'The peacemakers are called “sons of God.” Hebrews 12:14 says, “Pursue');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 131, 9, 14, 'peace with all men.” Not only are we to pursue peace with other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 131, 10, 14, 'believers, but with every human being - with your difficult neighbor,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 131, 11, 14, 'your difficult mother-in-law, your relatives, your brother-in-law who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 131, 12, 14, 'cheated you of the property, your family members who cheated you and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 131, 13, 14, 'took advantage of you - with everyone. Pursue peace with them and God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 131, 14, 14, 'will make sure that you get what you should get – and you don''t have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 131, 15, 14, 'fight for it. “Pursue peace with all men, and sanctification, without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 131, 16, 14, 'which no one will see the Lord” (Hebrews 12:14). Now this is an amazing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 131, 17, 14, 'verse; it says that it is not enough to pursue sanctification, but I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 131, 18, 14, 'must also pursue peace with all men. Many people are pursuing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 131, 19, 14, 'sanctification in their personal life with the Lord, but they''re not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 131, 20, 14, 'pursuing peace with all men. However, it says that I need to pursue');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 131, 21, 14, 'peace with all men and sanctification, without which I will not see the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 131, 22, 14, 'Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 131, 23, 14, '“Sons” of God Are More Mature Than “Children” of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 131, 24, 14, '“Blessed are the peacemakers for they shall be called be the sons of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 131, 25, 14, 'God.” The meaning of sons of God is different than the meaning of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 131, 26, 14, 'children of God. Children of God are babies; a son is a mature person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 131, 27, 14, 'who knows how to die to self and to walk in the footsteps of Jesus. Ask');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 131, 28, 14, 'yourself whether you deserve the title, “son of God” or “daughter of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 132, 1, 14, 'God.” It''s very easy to find out. Just ask yourself the question: Are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 132, 2, 14, 'you a peacemaker? Are you a peacemaker at home? Are you a peacemaker in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 132, 3, 14, 'the church or are you a troublemaker? Are you a peacemaker with your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 132, 4, 14, 'neighbors? Are you the type of person who kicks up a quarrel wherever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 132, 5, 14, 'you go? If yes, then you don''t deserve the title “son of God,” since you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 132, 6, 14, 'are acting more like a son of the devil. So let''s be careful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 132, 7, 14, 'Right Attitude #8: Being Persecuted for Righteousness Leads to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 132, 8, 14, 'Kingdom of Heaven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 132, 9, 14, '“Blessed are those who have been persecuted for the sake of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 132, 10, 14, 'righteousness, for theirs is the kingdom of heaven” (Matthew 5:10).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 132, 11, 14, 'Earlier on we saw, “Blessed are the poor in spirit for theirs is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 132, 12, 14, 'kingdom of heaven.” When we take a position of humility and pursuing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 132, 13, 14, 'peace and hungering and thirsting for righteousness, and we pursue');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 132, 14, 14, 'gentleness and we don''t fight for our rights, we will find that we will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 132, 15, 14, 'run into people in the world who are evil persecutors. All those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 132, 16, 14, 'seek to live in a godly way will be persecuted. So if we seek to live in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 132, 17, 14, 'righteousness, we will be persecuted.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 132, 18, 14, '2 Timothy 3:12 is an absolute statement inspired by the Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 132, 19, 14, 'Paul says, “All who desire to live godly in Christ Jesus will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 132, 20, 14, 'persecuted.” It doesn''t say “some;” it doesn''t say “many;” it doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 132, 21, 14, 'say “most.” It could be some, many, most, or all. It says “all.” All');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 132, 22, 14, 'includes every single believer in Christ Jesus (not every single person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 132, 23, 14, 'who calls himself a believer, but everyone who desires to live a godly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 132, 24, 14, 'life). You will be persecuted in your place of work. You may be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 132, 25, 14, 'persecuted for righteousness. What does it mean to be persecuted for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 132, 26, 14, 'righteousness? It means that in your place of work or in some situation,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 132, 27, 14, 'you say, “I will not do that wrong.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 132, 28, 14, 'I remember numerous situations when I was working in the Navy, where I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 133, 1, 14, 'had to stand up to my senior officers and say, “I''m sorry, sir, I cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 133, 2, 14, 'do that because my conscience does not permit me. I''m a Christian.” And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 133, 3, 14, 'that is a very risky, dangerous thing to say in the military. If you say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 133, 4, 14, 'that in a secular job, you just get sacked and turned out of your job.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 133, 5, 14, 'But when you say that in the military, you''re in danger of being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 133, 6, 14, 'court-martialed, which means being taken before a court and probably put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 133, 7, 14, 'into jail, because it is a very serious thing not to obey orders in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 133, 8, 14, 'military. I remember numerous situations where that happened and I had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 133, 9, 14, 'to trust God to take care of me. If they asked me to do something that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 133, 10, 14, 'violated my conscience, I would say, “Sorry, sir, I am a Christian, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 133, 11, 14, 'can’t do that.” It didn’t matter how senior the officer was.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 133, 12, 14, 'It’s possible that I would have suffered in some way because of that,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 133, 13, 14, 'meaning that the commanding officer wouldn''t give me a good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 133, 14, 14, 'recommendation for a promotion. Once I was transferred within half an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 133, 15, 14, 'hour to another post. I could suffer inconvenience, but that''s okay. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 133, 16, 14, 'can’t call this persecution at all; these are like little mosquito bites');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 133, 17, 14, 'compared to the lions that ate up the early Christians. But the early');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 133, 18, 14, 'Christians faced these too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 133, 19, 14, 'Standing up for Righteousness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 133, 20, 14, 'We need to consider what it means to stand up for righteousness. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 133, 21, 14, 'are many jobs in which people compromise - they tell lies, they cheat,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 133, 22, 14, 'and they give bribes in order to get something unrighteous done. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 133, 23, 14, 'Christians go that way, they of course will not face persecution; but if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 133, 24, 14, 'they refuse to go that way, if they refuse to take a bribe, or to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 133, 25, 14, 'something unrighteous, they may face threats from the people above them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 133, 26, 14, 'who want a share of that bribe or something. There are many cases like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 133, 27, 14, 'this. When you stand for uprightness, you may lose your job or find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 133, 28, 14, 'disfavor with your bosses, but the kingdom of heaven belongs to you. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 134, 1, 14, 'may lose something of earth in that process - maybe a position, maybe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 134, 2, 14, 'some promotion - but you will get something of heaven in exchange. Is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 134, 3, 14, 'that worth it?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 134, 4, 14, 'Is it right for a person to tell a lie to get admission or to get a job');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 134, 5, 14, 'in some situation? It’s not worth it! It’s never worth it for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 134, 6, 14, 'Christian. It''s far better that he doesn''t do it because he will be out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 134, 7, 14, 'of the will of God. If you get admission into some situation by telling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 134, 8, 14, 'a lie, you can be pretty sure that God didn’t lead you there. When you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 134, 9, 14, 'face a tight spot, the devil may tell you, “Tell a lie here because a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 134, 10, 14, 'lie is almighty; it can get you anything.” And the Holy Spirit says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 134, 11, 14, '“No, that''s a lie; God is almighty. Telling a lie is not the most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 134, 12, 14, 'powerful way to get what you want. Stand up for God. God is able to give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 134, 13, 14, 'you what He wants you to get.” Then you will find that God will give you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 134, 14, 14, 'what you should get.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 134, 15, 14, 'Sometimes God will test you in this. I know God has tested me at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 134, 16, 14, 'different times and I believe that if I had failed that test in those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 134, 17, 14, 'places, I would not be where I am today and I would not have the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 134, 18, 14, 'ministry God has given me. Perhaps you could have had a ministry if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 134, 19, 14, 'had been upright and had been willing to suffer earthly loss in some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 134, 20, 14, 'places for the sake of righteousness. The kingdom of heaven would have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 134, 21, 14, 'been more greatly yours to some extent, but you lost some of that. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 134, 22, 14, 'can''t do anything about the past; what you have lost is gone and you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 134, 23, 14, 'can’t get it back. But you can do something about the future. Say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 134, 24, 14, '“Lord, at least in the days to come, I want to stand up for what is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 134, 25, 14, 'righteous and upright.” A Christian is not supposed to be crooked in any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 134, 26, 14, 'area. A Christian is not supposed to tell a lie or cheat for any type of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 134, 27, 14, 'profit. God is looking for those who will stand upright so that he can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 134, 28, 14, 'commit a greater ministry to them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 135, 1, 14, 'Right Attitude #9: Rejoice When You Are Persecuted for Jesus’ Sake');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 135, 2, 14, '“Blessed are you when men cast insults on you and persecute you (not for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 135, 3, 14, 'righteousness sake now (v10) and say all kinds of evil against you on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 135, 4, 14, 'account of Me” (Matthew 5:11). The difference between verse 10 and verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 135, 5, 14, '11 is that, in verse 10, you''re standing for what is right. There are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 135, 6, 14, 'even non-Christians sometimes who stand for what is right. There are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 135, 7, 14, 'people who have lost their jobs, judges who have been killed for giving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 135, 8, 14, 'a right verdict, and businessmen, politicians, and others who have been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 135, 9, 14, 'killed by their enemies for standing up for what is right. It is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 135, 10, 14, 'just Christians who do this, and it''s a shameful thing that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 135, 11, 14, 'non-Christians are sometimes more willing to stand for uprightness than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 135, 12, 14, 'many who claim to be Christians. I believe you''re going to get a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 135, 13, 14, 'surprises in the day of judgment when such Christians who imagined that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 135, 14, 14, 'they were entering God''s kingdom are exposed as compromisers and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 135, 15, 14, 'backsliders. If you''re righteous and you''re willing to be persecuted for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 135, 16, 14, 'righteousness’ sake, the kingdom of heaven is yours; not otherwise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 135, 17, 14, 'Matthew 5:11 speaks about being persecuted for Jesus’ sake. If you keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 135, 18, 14, 'quiet about the fact that you''re a disciple of Jesus Christ, you can get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 135, 19, 14, 'some benefits in your place of work. Maybe you’re righteous and that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 135, 20, 14, 'appreciated by others, but you keep quiet about the fact that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 135, 21, 14, 'believe in Jesus Christ as the way of salvation because you''re afraid');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 135, 22, 14, 'you won''t get a promotion. Perhaps you''d rather let others believe that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 135, 23, 14, 'you are a non-Christian, just like your bosses are and you are ashamed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 135, 24, 14, 'to be a witness for Christ. I’ve seen government offices and banks where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 135, 25, 14, 'non-Christians will hang up a calendar with the picture of their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 135, 26, 14, 'favorite idol, but it''s very rare that you find a Christian who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 135, 27, 14, 'willing to hang up a calendar with the Word of God on it, which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 135, 28, 14, 'pronounces the fact that he''s a Christian. This is because he''s afraid');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 136, 1, 14, 'of what will people say about him. “Will my boss see it and prevent me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 136, 2, 14, 'from getting a promotion or harass me in some way?”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 136, 3, 14, '“Blessed are those who are persecuted on account of Me, who are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 136, 4, 14, 'ashamed of Me.” Are you ashamed of Jesus in your place of work? Don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 136, 5, 14, 'glory in the fact that you''re externally righteous because many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 136, 6, 14, 'non-Christians are externally righteous too. Go beyond that, one step');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 136, 7, 14, 'further: declare, “I''m also a Christian. I''m a disciple of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 136, 8, 14, 'Christ.” If you stand up for God and His Word (and it''s not only in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 136, 9, 14, 'place of work, even as a preacher if you stand for everything that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 136, 10, 14, 'taught in God''s Word), if you are eager to expose the deception in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 136, 11, 14, 'Christian circles today, people will insult you and persecute you and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 136, 12, 14, 'say all kinds of evils stories about you falsely, because you stand up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 136, 13, 14, 'for the truth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 136, 14, 14, 'Rejoice When You Are Persecuted for Jesus’ Sake');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 136, 15, 14, 'What should you do when that happens? Do we have to feel sorry for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 136, 16, 14, 'ourselves? Far from it! It says, “Rejoice and be glad, for your reward');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 136, 17, 14, 'in heaven is great” (Matthew 5:12). You won’t get a reward on earth -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 136, 18, 14, 'you might be persecuted and cast out - but your reward in heaven is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 136, 19, 14, 'great because that''s exactly how they persecuted all the prophets who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 136, 20, 14, 'were before you. If you look at the Old Testament prophets, you’ll see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 136, 21, 14, 'that true prophets of God were persecuted. The persecutions that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 136, 22, 14, 'faced, however, are not always mentioned. Take for example, a man like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 136, 23, 14, 'Isaiah, who spoke some strong words against the people of Israel. We’re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 136, 24, 14, 'not told in the book of Isaiah how he died, but tradition tells us that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 136, 25, 14, 'he was inside of an empty hollow log of wood and his persecutors sawed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 136, 26, 14, 'him into two pieces.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 136, 27, 14, 'He is one of the people mentioned in Hebrews 11, who were sawn asunder.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 136, 28, 14, 'All those who stand up for Christ will be persecuted. Stephen, when he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 137, 1, 14, 'was standing before the chief priests in Acts 7, asks the crowd a very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 137, 2, 14, 'significant question at the end of his long message: he says in Acts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 137, 3, 14, '7:52, “Which one of the prophets did your fathers not persecute? Your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 137, 4, 14, 'fathers killed those who had previously announced the coming of Jesus,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 137, 5, 14, 'the righteous One. Which one of the prophets in Israel did your fathers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 137, 6, 14, 'not persecute? Can you name one?” Stephen was describing Israel''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 137, 7, 14, 'history. He had studied Israel''s history and he concluded that there was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 137, 8, 14, 'not a single prophet in the entire history of Israel who was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 137, 9, 14, 'persecuted. No true profit was popular neither in the Old Testament nor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 137, 10, 14, 'in the New Testament.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 137, 11, 14, 'Pastors can be popular, evangelists can be popular, and even apostles');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 137, 12, 14, 'can be popular at times. Teachers can be very popular, but a prophet is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 137, 13, 14, 'almost never popular because he is coming to diagnose and expose the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 137, 14, 14, 'faults in a church or in people. And he comes into a church to speak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 137, 15, 14, 'what they need to hear and not what they like to hear. He will show them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 137, 16, 14, 'the areas of God''s Word that they are ignoring. He will show them the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 137, 17, 14, 'areas in their lives where they are falling short of God''s standards,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 137, 18, 14, 'and then he will be persecuted. It happens even today. This is what it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 137, 19, 14, 'means to stand up for Jesus, “On account of Me and My Word.” If you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 137, 20, 14, 'persecuted, you''re blessed and you are to be envied. In another version');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 137, 21, 14, 'it says, “Leap for joy!” You should be excited because you’re in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 137, 22, 14, 'footsteps of the prophets and in the footsteps of Jesus Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 137, 23, 15, 'Chapter 14 Jesus’ Disciples Must Be Salt and Light');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 137, 24, 15, '“You are the salt of the earth” (Matthew 5:13). Jesus didn’t say this to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 137, 25, 15, 'the multitudes. Remember that the Sermon on the Mount is primarily to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 137, 26, 15, 'His disciples and the multitudes sat around listening. The multitudes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 137, 27, 15, 'are certainly not the salt of the earth – they don’t have any salt. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 137, 28, 15, 'the disciples are to be the salt of the earth. Jesus was a master of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 138, 1, 15, 'using word pictures, and He left it to us to understand the meaning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 138, 2, 15, 'behind them as we seek for the inspiration and revelation of the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 138, 3, 15, 'Spirit. “You are the salt of the earth, but if the salt has become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 138, 4, 15, 'tasteless, how it will be made salty? It is good for nothing any more,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 138, 5, 15, 'except to be thrown out and trampled underfoot by men.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 138, 6, 15, 'Purpose of Salt in Our Food: Taste');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 138, 7, 15, 'So what is the purpose of salt, particularly in our food? He is talking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 138, 8, 15, 'about taste here. Salt is used for many other reasons, such as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 138, 9, 15, 'preservation. But He is not speaking here about the preserving power of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 138, 10, 15, 'salt. He is talking about taste.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 138, 11, 15, 'We can’t preserve the world from becoming rotten. It will become rotten,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 138, 12, 15, 'because men’s hearts are fully set on evil. But in the church, He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 138, 13, 15, 'talking about disciples who have retained the taste of heaven in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 138, 14, 15, 'life. That means that when you come in touch with this disciple, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 138, 15, 15, 'will taste something of heaven, which is so different from what you see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 138, 16, 15, 'in the average person, who tastes of this earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 138, 17, 15, 'Taste of Earth vs Heaven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 138, 18, 15, 'What do I mean by “tasting of heaven” and “tasting of the earth”? When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 138, 19, 15, 'you meet many people, all they can talk about is what’s happening on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 138, 20, 15, 'earth: what is the latest price of the stocks and shares, what calamity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 138, 21, 15, 'is happening here, what evil is happening there, etc. Or they may talk');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 138, 22, 15, 'of the latest gossip concerning other people - this is the taste of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 138, 23, 15, 'world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 138, 24, 15, 'The taste of heaven is something that brings life and joy and peace and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 138, 25, 15, 'goodness. It is very rare to find people like that, who have the life of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 138, 26, 15, 'Jesus bubbling up in them. They are like salt that gives taste to its');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 138, 27, 15, 'surroundings.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 138, 28, 15, 'Quality Salt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 139, 1, 15, 'In a bowl of food, you need very little salt. You don’t even need one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 139, 2, 15, 'full spoon of salt; that would be too much. In a bowl of food, you need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 139, 3, 15, 'very little salt to give taste to the whole bowl, if the salt is really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 139, 4, 15, 'powerful and good. But if the salt is tasteless, then even if you put 20');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 139, 5, 15, 'spoons in it, it is not going to make any difference in the taste. So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 139, 6, 15, 'the point is not quantity, but quality. When Jesus says, “If the salt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 139, 7, 15, 'has become tasteless” (Matthew 5:13), He is not talking about the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 139, 8, 15, 'quantity of salt at all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 139, 9, 15, 'He is using this picture to show us that His disciples will always be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 139, 10, 15, 'small in number. If you have a plate of rice and curry, how much salt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 139, 11, 15, 'are going to put into that whole plate of rice and curry? You would not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 139, 12, 15, 'even put half a teaspoon. You need very little salt to make that whole');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 139, 13, 15, 'plate taste right. And so the proportion of the amount of salt relative');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 139, 14, 15, 'to the food is about the same as the proportion of true disciples on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 139, 15, 15, 'earth relative to the population of the world (and sometimes even the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 139, 16, 15, 'number of people in the church!). The true disciples are very few.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 139, 17, 15, 'But it’s only those true disciples who are called the salt of the earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 139, 18, 15, 'It is because of them that the earth is preserved from judgment. Abraham');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 139, 19, 15, 'once prayed to God concerning the evil city of Sodom, which the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 139, 20, 15, 'said He would destroy. He asked to the Lord (concerning whether He would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 139, 21, 15, 'still destroy it), “Suppose Lord you find only ten righteous people in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 139, 22, 15, 'Sodom?” (Genesis 18:32), the Lord said, “I won’t destroy Sodom, if there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 139, 23, 15, 'are ten righteous people in that city.” Ten people were enough to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 139, 24, 15, 'preserve the city from being destroyed, but there were not even ten');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 139, 25, 15, 'there, so it was destroyed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 139, 26, 15, 'In Jeremiah’s time, the Lord reduced that number even further. Jeremiah');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 139, 27, 15, 'was prophesying at a time when Israel was about to be taken into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 139, 28, 15, 'captivity by the Babylonian king (that was God’s punishment), but before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 140, 1, 15, 'that, Jeremiah went to prophesy. He preached and warned them for 40');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 140, 2, 15, 'years, but they wouldn’t listen to him. The Lord told Jeremiah, “Go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 140, 3, 15, 'through the streets of Jerusalem and see if you can find one man (not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 140, 4, 15, 'ten, just one single man) who does justice, who seeks truth, and I will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 140, 5, 15, 'pardon the whole city” (Jeremiah 5:1). It’s amazing, but there wasn’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 140, 6, 15, 'even one righteous man, and so the whole city went into captivity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 140, 7, 15, 'Very often God is looking around like that. Ezekiel was also a prophet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 140, 8, 15, 'at the time of Babylon and God said through Ezekiel, “I searched for one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 140, 9, 15, 'man among all of them who should stand in the gap for me and build the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 140, 10, 15, 'wall that I shouldn’t destroy the land, and I found none” (Ezekiel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 140, 11, 15, '22:30). God spoke the same words: quality, not quantity. He wasn’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 140, 12, 15, 'looking for 10,000 people. He was looking for even one man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 140, 13, 15, 'It’s amazing what God can do through one man if he is whole-hearted and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 140, 14, 15, 'radical. Think of Moses - one man in the Old Testament through whom God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 140, 15, 15, 'could deliver 2 million Israelites. There was nobody else in Israel who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 140, 16, 15, 'was fit to be the leader. In Elijah’s time, even though there were 7000');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 140, 17, 15, 'people who did not bow their knee to Baal (a picture of 7000 believers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 140, 18, 15, 'who don’t worship idols), there was only one man (Elijah) who could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 140, 19, 15, 'bring the fire down from heaven. It is the same proportion today. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 140, 20, 15, 'might find only one believer among 7000 believers who can bring the fire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 140, 21, 15, 'down from heaven through their ministry or their prayer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 140, 22, 15, 'The 7000 may say, “I don’t do this, and I don’t do that.” Their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 140, 23, 15, 'testimony is negative! “I don’t go to movies, I don’t drink, I don’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 140, 24, 15, 'gamble and I don’t smoke cigarettes.” They don’t worship Baal, but who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 140, 25, 15, 'can bring the fire down from heaven? The one who lives before God’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 140, 26, 15, 'face, like Elijah did; Elijah had salt.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 140, 27, 15, 'It’s the same in the New Testament. Can you imagine the loss that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 140, 28, 15, 'church would have faced, and the loss we would have faced, if the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 141, 1, 15, 'Apostle Paul had never existed? How much Scripture would be missing? He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 141, 2, 15, 'was one man! Of course God’s work is not going to be hindered because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 141, 3, 15, 'one man fails (God could have used somebody else), but what we see in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 141, 4, 15, 'Scripture is that often God accomplishes more through one person who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 141, 5, 15, 'whole-hearted than He does through 10,000 compromisers. That is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 141, 6, 15, 'point Jesus emphasizes when He tells His disciples, “You are like salt.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 141, 7, 15, 'Don’t ever complain, “We are so few!”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 141, 8, 15, 'God Answers the Prayers of the Few');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 141, 9, 15, 'I remember situations in our own church in Bangalore where we found a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 141, 10, 15, 'need to pray for the government, because of some problems in the city.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 141, 11, 15, 'We were not a big church, but we had two good qualities in our midst:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 141, 12, 15, 'first, we were pursuing holiness with all of our heart. We were not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 141, 13, 15, 'there to compare ourselves with others but we could honestly say before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 141, 14, 15, 'God, “We are sincerely seeking to pursue holiness and to please You in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 141, 15, 15, 'everything. We don’t want to please men, or worship money. We have no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 141, 16, 15, 'interest in money in our church, and so we don’t worship Mammon; we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 141, 17, 15, 'worship Christ instead.” The second thing is, to the best of our ability');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 141, 18, 15, 'and knowledge, we were one with each other. We were not a church full of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 141, 19, 15, 'strife, quarrels, disputes, and cliques. So we pursued holiness and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 141, 20, 15, 'unity. Those are the things God looks for, because if we have iniquity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 141, 21, 15, 'in our heart, the Lord will not hear us (Psalm 66:18). And where two are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 141, 22, 15, 'united (Matthew 18:19,20), they can ask for anything, because the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 141, 23, 15, 'is in the midst. So I said, since we have purity, and we have unity, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 141, 24, 15, 'have a right to get an answer to our prayer. And we received that answer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 141, 25, 15, 'many times in many miracles that God has done.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 141, 26, 15, 'How does God do these things? He does them through a few people who have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 141, 27, 15, 'not lost the taste of radical righteousness, purity, fervent love,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 141, 28, 15, 'pursuing humility, etc. So keep this in mind: you are the salt of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 142, 1, 15, 'earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 142, 2, 15, 'Quality Light');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 142, 3, 15, 'Next, Jesus says, “You are the light of the world. A city set on a hill');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 142, 4, 15, 'cannot be hidden, nor do men light a lamp and put it under the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 142, 5, 15, 'peck-measure, but on the lampstand, and it gives light to all that are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 142, 6, 15, 'in the house. Let your light shine before men in such a way they may see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 142, 7, 15, 'your good works and glorify your Father who is in heaven” (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 142, 8, 15, '5:14-16).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 142, 9, 15, 'Light is another illustration or word picture that Jesus used. In those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 142, 10, 15, 'days, they used lamps. The wick of a lamp is a very, very small thing (a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 142, 11, 15, 'bulb is a very small thing today). But it lights up a whole room! The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 142, 12, 15, 'wick of a lamp in those days was so small, but as it burned, it lit up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 142, 13, 15, 'the whole room. It was not the size of the wick or the size of the bulb,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 142, 14, 15, 'but the intensity of light that would come forth from it that mattered.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 142, 15, 15, 'Again the emphasis is not on quantity but quality. There are zero watt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 142, 16, 15, 'bulbs that emit such a dim light that you can hardly see anything from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 142, 17, 15, 'them, and then there are powerful bulbs about the same size, like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 142, 18, 15, 'halogen bulbs, which light up a whole street. A bulb can be very low');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 142, 19, 15, 'wattage or very high wattage. The important thing is not its size, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 142, 20, 15, 'its power - the intensity of power with which it can light something up.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 142, 21, 15, 'And Jesus says, “You are the light of the world.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 142, 22, 15, 'The world is in darkness, and there must be nothing of that darkness in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 142, 23, 15, 'me. If I am a bulb and the darkness of the world is in me, then I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 142, 24, 15, 'like a broken bulb. A lot of churches have Christians who are like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 142, 25, 15, 'broken bulbs. Once upon a time they were burning, but now they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 142, 26, 15, 'broken: they are backslidden and their light is not shining anymore.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 142, 27, 15, 'What is that light? It says here, “Let your light shine before men in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 142, 28, 15, 'such a way that they may see your good works and glorify your Father Who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 143, 1, 15, 'is in heaven.” In those days, light came through a lamp that was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 143, 2, 15, 'constantly burning with oil that enabled the wick to burn, and the oil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 143, 3, 15, 'is the picture of the Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 143, 4, 15, 'One mark of a person anointed with the Holy Spirit is that he does good.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 143, 5, 15, 'It says in Acts 10:38 that when Jesus was anointed with the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 143, 6, 15, 'and power, He went about doing good. He didn’t go around collecting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 143, 7, 15, 'money from people for His ministry like a lot of so-called “anointed”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 143, 8, 15, 'preachers do today. He was exactly the opposite of that. He went around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 143, 9, 15, 'doing good, and He never charged for it. People voluntarily gave Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 143, 10, 15, 'gifts without His asking and He accepted them, but He would never make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 143, 11, 15, 'His needs known to anyone. He went about doing good without any charge.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 143, 12, 15, 'He says, “Let your light so shine upon men so they may see your good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 143, 13, 15, 'works and not glorify you, but God!” If you do good works to get honor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 143, 14, 15, 'for yourself, to get glory for yourself, that’s actually darkness. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 143, 15, 15, 'lot of good works that many Christians do are actually advertisements');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 143, 16, 15, 'for themselves, to get honor for themselves. Their organization or their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 143, 17, 15, 'ministry is actually darkness because there is no glory that goes to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 143, 18, 15, 'Father in heaven. Instead, glory comes to that particular organization');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 143, 19, 15, 'or that particular man. But Jesus said, “Let people see your good works');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 143, 20, 15, 'and glorify your Father in heaven.” That is the true light, where a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 143, 21, 15, 'person is doing good and as a result of that, Christ is glorified, not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 143, 22, 15, 'the individual.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 143, 23, 15, 'This is what it means to manifest light. In John 1:4, this light is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 143, 24, 15, 'described like this: “In Jesus Christ was life, and that life was the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 143, 25, 15, 'Light of men.” So the light is not a doctrine, a teaching, or a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 143, 26, 15, 'particular message - it’s a life. It’s the very life of Jesus coming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 143, 27, 15, 'forth from us through the Holy Spirit. The life of Jesus coming forth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 143, 28, 15, 'from us is like an old lamp that was lit with oil, giving off light.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 144, 1, 15, 'Jesus said very clearly in John 8:12, “I am the light of the world; he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 144, 2, 15, 'who follows me shall never walk in darkness.” Whenever a person is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 144, 3, 15, 'walking in darkness, according to John 8:12, we can say without a doubt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 144, 4, 15, 'that that person is not following Jesus. If you say, “Well, I am a bit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 144, 5, 15, 'dark right now,” the reason is that you may not be following Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 144, 6, 15, 'Please do not confuse walking in darkness with being unsure of God’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 144, 7, 15, 'will. Even Jesus was confused about the Father’s will, being perplexed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 144, 8, 15, 'in the garden of Gethsemane. That’s why He prayed for one hour, “Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 144, 9, 15, 'what is Your will, should I drink this cup or not?” That’s not darkness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 144, 10, 15, 'Perplexity is part of the life of faith, but darkness is something else,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 144, 11, 15, 'something contrary to the life of Jesus. Jesus said, “He who follows Me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 144, 12, 15, 'will never walk in darkness but have the light of life, because I am the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 144, 13, 15, 'light of the world.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 144, 14, 15, 'Then He went on to say that He was the light of the world only for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 144, 15, 15, 'certain period of time. “While I am in the world, I am the light of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 144, 16, 15, 'world” (John 9:5). How long was He in the world? He was in the world for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 144, 17, 15, '33 ½ years. That’s all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 144, 18, 15, 'People may be super-spiritual and say, “Isn’t Christ in the world right');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 144, 19, 15, 'now?” Well, if you read John 17:11, He says, “I am no longer in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 144, 20, 15, 'world.” We have to get rid of our super-spirituality. Just before Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 144, 21, 15, 'left this earth and went to heaven, on the eve of the cross, He said, “I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 144, 22, 15, 'am no more in the world. But these disciples are here in the world. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 144, 23, 15, 'are in the world, but I am no more here. I am coming to You, Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 144, 24, 15, 'Father, so I am not in the world anymore.” So when He said in John 9,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 144, 25, 15, '“As long as I am in the world,” He was talking about that 33 ½ year');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 144, 26, 15, 'period where He manifested life. After He went up to heaven, who is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 144, 27, 15, 'light of the world today?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 144, 28, 15, 'Jesus’ Disciples Are the Light of the World Now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 145, 1, 15, 'Matthew 5:14 says, “You are the light of the world.” If somebody were to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 145, 2, 15, 'ask me, “Who is the light of the world?”, the Scriptural answer would be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 145, 3, 15, 'to say, “Me. I am the light of the world, along with others who follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 145, 4, 15, 'Jesus.” Have you ever thought of it like that? Have you ever thought of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 145, 5, 15, 'answering the question, “Who is the light of the world?” by saying “Me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 145, 6, 15, 'and others who follow Jesus”? That is the right answer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 145, 7, 15, 'It is very easy to say “Oh, don’t look at me. Just look at Jesus.” But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 145, 8, 15, 'He is not in the earth! He said, “I am the light of the world only as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 145, 9, 15, 'long as I am in the world.” So many Christians haven’t read the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 145, 10, 15, 'Scriptures properly, and they get many types of wrong ideas in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 145, 11, 15, 'heads that are from their own understanding and are completely wrong.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 145, 12, 15, 'Just like God depended 100% on Jesus Christ during those 33 ½ years to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 145, 13, 15, 'manifest His life perfectly, He is depending on His church - His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 145, 14, 15, 'disciples on earth - to manifest that same light perfectly now. “Let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 145, 15, 15, 'people see your good works and glorify your Father who is in heaven.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 145, 16, 15, 'Jesus’ Life Was the Law Manifested');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 145, 17, 15, 'Matthew 5:17 says, “Don’t think that I came to abolish the law of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 145, 18, 15, 'prophets; I didn’t come to abolish, but to fulfill.” The fundamental');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 145, 19, 15, 'principle behind God’s law is His life. In the law, He was, in a limited');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 145, 20, 15, 'way, putting into writing what His nature was like. The absence of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 145, 21, 15, 'idolatry and giving God the first place, honoring father and mother,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 145, 22, 15, 'never hurting other people with murder, adultery or any such thing,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 145, 23, 15, 'etc., was a manifestation of the life of God in man, and Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 145, 24, 15, 'manifested that life. He said, “I haven’t come to abolish the law.” The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 145, 25, 15, 'fundamental principle behind the law was never abolished. Some people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 145, 26, 15, 'misunderstand that verse to mean that we should keep the Sabbath as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 145, 27, 15, 'well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 145, 28, 15, 'But it is the principle behind the law that the Lord was speaking about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 146, 1, 15, 'here. He says, “Until heaven and earth pass away, not a smallest letter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 146, 2, 15, 'or stroke shall pass away from the law until all is accomplished.” He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 146, 3, 15, 'says, “I have come to fulfill the law,” and then He goes on to say, “If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 146, 4, 15, 'you cancel one of the least of these commandments and teach other people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 146, 5, 15, 'that some commandment is unimportant, you will be called least in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 146, 6, 15, 'kingdom of heaven. But if you keep them and teach others to keep even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 146, 7, 15, 'the least commandment, you will be called great in the kingdom of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 146, 8, 15, 'heaven” (Matthew 5:18-19) .');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 146, 9, 15, 'Is He referring to the ten commandments, or the commandments of Moses,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 146, 10, 15, 'such as killing lambs and offering peace, grain, and sin offerings?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 146, 11, 15, 'Those commands were all in Old Testament, so we can’t pick out one. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 146, 12, 15, 'commandments (laws) were fulfilled in Christ. So when He is speaking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 146, 13, 15, 'about the “least commandment” in the law, He is talking about the spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 146, 14, 15, 'of the law.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 146, 15, 15, 'The Law Was the Shadow of Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 146, 16, 15, 'Colossians 2:16 says, “Don’t let anyone act as your judge in regard to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 146, 17, 15, 'food or drink or in respect to a festival or a new moon or a Sabbath');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 146, 18, 15, 'day, because all these things are a shadow.” Did you notice that He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 146, 19, 15, 'included the fourth commandment, keeping the Sabbath? He says it is only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 146, 20, 15, 'a shadow. It is fulfilled in Christ. In today’s language, you could say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 146, 21, 15, 'it is like a photograph. Until Christ came, you needed the photograph.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 146, 22, 15, 'If I am not travelling with my wife, I may carry her photograph with me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 146, 23, 15, 'and look at it, but if I am travelling with my wife, why do I need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 146, 24, 15, 'look at the photograph? There is something wrong with a man who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 146, 25, 15, 'travelling with his wife but keeps looking at her photograph!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 146, 26, 15, 'The law is over, now that Christ has come. He says that was only a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 146, 27, 15, 'shadow. It is an accurate picture of Christ - many things in the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 146, 28, 15, 'Testament accurately portrayed Christ - but it is only a photograph. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 147, 1, 15, 'reality is in Christ. We need to keep that in mind when Jesus speaks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 147, 2, 15, 'about fulfilling the law. The Sabbath was fulfilled in Christ, and now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 147, 3, 15, 'it’s the inner Sabbath that the Lord is seeking to bring into our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 147, 4, 15, 'hearts. “Come to Me and I will give you rest” (Matthew 11:28). That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 147, 5, 15, 'inner rest comes as we take His yoke upon us. Some people think of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 147, 6, 15, 'keeping the Sabbath as the one commandment that should never be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 147, 7, 15, 'cancelled. No, the fulfillment of the law is now through the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 147, 8, 15, 'inside our hearts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 147, 9, 15, 'In Romans 8:4, it is explained like this: “The righteous requirement of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 147, 10, 15, 'the law is now fulfilled inside us, who do not walk according to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 147, 11, 15, 'flesh, but according to the Spirit.” This is how the law is fulfilled.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 147, 12, 15, 'We have to compare Scripture with Scripture. The law will not pass away.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 147, 13, 15, 'Jesus did not come to abolish the law, but to fulfill it, and it must be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 147, 14, 15, 'fulfilled in us, too. How is it going to be fulfilled in us? The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 147, 15, 15, 'righteous requirement of the law is fulfilled in us when we don’t walk');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 147, 16, 15, 'according to the flesh, but according to the Holy Spirit instead, every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 147, 17, 15, 'single day (Romans 8:4). It’s not by keeping the Sabbath or other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 147, 18, 15, 'commandments.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 147, 19, 15, 'Finally, in Matthew 5:20, He says “Unless your righteousness exceeds the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 147, 20, 15, 'righteousness of the scribes and Pharisees, you cannot enter the kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 147, 21, 15, 'of heaven.” Jesus Christ came to fulfill the law, and even in our lives,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 147, 22, 15, 'the law of God has to be fulfilled in our hearts. In the Old Testament,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 147, 23, 15, 'they fulfilled it externally in various ways - they kept the “outside of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 147, 24, 15, 'the cup” clean. But it is the inside of the cup that God is interested');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 147, 25, 15, 'in now. We are to be the salt of the earth and the light of the world,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 147, 26, 15, 'and that life has to come from the Holy Spirit, from within.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 147, 27, 16, 'Chapter 15 Inward Righteousness and Anger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 147, 28, 16, 'Don’t Lower God’s Standards');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 148, 1, 16, 'We need to receive the teaching of Jesus exactly like it is written');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 148, 2, 16, 'because many have diluted it or made it mean something it doesn''t mean.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 148, 3, 16, 'Because they''re not able to live up to God’s standard, many teachers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 148, 4, 16, 'have lowered His standard down to their level. Whenever you see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 148, 5, 16, 'something in God''s Word that you haven''t attained to, or which is higher');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 148, 6, 16, 'than your level of life, you have two options. One option is to say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 148, 7, 16, '“Well, God’s Word doesn''t really mean that. It means something in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 148, 8, 16, 'general way but not exactly that.” For example, “I know that it says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 148, 9, 16, '‘Rejoice in the Lord always,’ in Philippians 4:4, but it doesn''t really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 148, 10, 16, 'mean ‘always.’ It means, ‘generally speaking,’ or ‘most of the time.’”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 148, 11, 16, 'Thus you have succeeded in lowering God''s Word down to your carnal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 148, 12, 16, 'level, and you satisfy yourself by imagining that you''re obeying it. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 148, 13, 16, 'the spiritually-minded Christian leaves God''s Word where it is and says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 148, 14, 16, '“I''m supposed to rejoice in the Lord 24/7,” and he acknowledges humbly,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 148, 15, 16, '“Lord, I''m not there yet. I''m rejoicing some of the time, grumbling some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 148, 16, 16, 'of the time (or most of the time), and angry often, but I''m not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 148, 17, 16, 'rejoicing in all circumstances. I''m not giving thanks for everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 148, 18, 16, 'like the Bible says, so I acknowledge this. Please bring me there.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 148, 19, 16, 'That’s the person who will reach God’s standard. The other person, who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 148, 20, 16, 'has lowered God’s standard to his level, will never attain it. One day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 148, 21, 16, 'he will wake up in eternity and discover that he disobeyed God all his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 148, 22, 16, 'life. So, it''s good to leave God''s Word where it is, and acknowledge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 148, 23, 16, 'that either we haven''t understood it or we haven''t reached there. Then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 148, 24, 16, 'there''s some hope we will get there.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 148, 25, 16, 'Surpassing the Righteousness of the Pharisees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 148, 26, 16, 'We must bear this in mind as we come to Matthew 5:20: “I say to you that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 148, 27, 16, 'unless your righteousness exceeds/surpasses that of the scribes and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 148, 28, 16, 'Pharisees, you shall not enter the kingdom of heaven.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 149, 1, 16, 'The righteousness of the Pharisees was a pretty high standard. They kept');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 149, 2, 16, 'the Ten Commandments. The rich young ruler came to Jesus and said, “I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 149, 3, 16, 'kept all the commandments,” Jesus didn''t question that. (Of course, they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 149, 4, 16, 'couldn''t keep the Tenth Commandment, but nobody could keep that because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 149, 5, 16, 'the tenth one was inward. I''ll come to that later. But they were keeping');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 149, 6, 16, 'the other nine commandments, and all the Old Testament laws, which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 149, 7, 16, 'included more than 600 commandments.) The Pharisees boasted that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 149, 8, 16, 'prayed regularly, probably three times a day, fasted twice a week, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 149, 9, 16, 'gave tithes of all their income. So what does it mean when this verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 149, 10, 16, 'says that your righteousness must exceed theirs?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 149, 11, 16, 'Does it mean that you have to pray more than three times a day, fast');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 149, 12, 16, 'more than twice a week, and give more than 10 percent of your income?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 149, 13, 16, 'That’s not the meaning. We always think in terms of quantity, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 149, 14, 16, 'our mind is worldly-minded. The more worldly-minded we are, the more we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 149, 15, 16, 'think in terms of numbers, statistics, and quantity. We judge a church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 149, 16, 16, 'by the number of people there are, not by the quality of life of those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 149, 17, 16, 'people. We think Jesus said, “All men will know you are My disciples');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 149, 18, 16, 'when there are 30,000 of you meeting in one church.” But that''s not what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 149, 19, 16, 'He said. He told his eleven disciples, “All men will know you are my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 149, 20, 16, 'disciples when you eleven love one another.” The number of people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 149, 21, 16, 'doesn''t matter. Love for one another is the primary mark of a true local');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 149, 22, 16, 'church of disciples.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 149, 23, 16, 'Jesus always emphasized quality. Today''s Christianity, such as mission');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 149, 24, 16, 'organizations and megachurches, emphasizes numbers. How many people are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 149, 25, 16, 'there in our church? How many places have you reached? How much is our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 149, 26, 16, 'yearly offering? These are the things they inwardly glory in. Or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 149, 27, 16, 'preachers will say: How many countries have I traveled to? How many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 149, 28, 16, 'sermons have I preached? How many books have I written? How many TV');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 150, 1, 16, 'programs am I speaking on? These are the things that carnal people glory');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 150, 2, 16, 'in.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 150, 3, 16, 'Jesus always emphasized quality: quality salt and quality light. He had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 150, 4, 16, 'only eleven disciples at the end of His life. That’s not a large number,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 150, 5, 16, 'but look at the quality of their lives. Those eleven disciples turned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 150, 6, 16, 'the world upside down. Where do you find disciples like that, who have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 150, 7, 16, 'forsaken all, who have no interest in money, and things like this? It’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 150, 8, 16, 'so rare to find even one preacher like that in the world today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 150, 9, 16, 'And it’s quality that Jesus was emphasizing when He said, “Your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 150, 10, 16, 'righteousness must exceed the righteousness of the Pharisees.” Quality,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 150, 11, 16, 'not in the number of activities that you engage in. It''s got nothing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 150, 12, 16, 'do with money. It''s got nothing to do with praying. It''s got nothing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 150, 13, 16, 'do with fasting. It''s got to do with quality of life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 150, 14, 16, 'Jesus goes on in the remaining verses (in fact, almost until the end of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 150, 15, 16, 'the Sermon on the Mount) explaining this one verse. We can say the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 150, 16, 16, 'majority of the Sermon on the Mount is explaining Matthew 5:20. Do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 150, 17, 16, 'want to enter the kingdom of heaven? He speaks a lot about this. Blessed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 150, 18, 16, 'are the poor in spirit, for theirs is the kingdom of heaven (verse 3).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 150, 19, 16, 'Blessed are those who are persecuted for righteousness sake, for theirs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 150, 20, 16, 'is the kingdom of heaven (verse 10). And now He says your righteousness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 150, 21, 16, 'must exceed the righteousness of scribes and Pharisees if you want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 150, 22, 16, 'enter the kingdom of heaven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 150, 23, 16, 'Two Strengths of the Pharisees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 150, 24, 16, 'There were two good things about the Pharisees that Jesus Himself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 150, 25, 16, 'commended. If Jesus gave a certificate of approval for something, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 150, 26, 16, 'can be sure it was pretty good. In Matthew 23:2,3, Jesus says the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 150, 27, 16, 'scribes and the Pharisees are seated in the chair of Moses. “Therefore,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 150, 28, 16, 'all that they tell you to do and observe, do, but don''t do according to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 151, 1, 16, 'their deeds.” He is saying that their doctrine was right. That''s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 151, 2, 16, 'first certificate of approval that He gives them. He wouldn''t say that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 151, 3, 16, 'about the Herodians, who were worldly. And He wouldn''t say that about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 151, 4, 16, 'the Sadducees, who did not believe in angels or in the resurrection from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 151, 5, 16, 'the dead. He wouldn''t say to the disciples, “All that the Sadducees tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 151, 6, 16, 'you to do, do,” because their doctrines were wrong. But when it came to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 151, 7, 16, 'the Pharisees, He said their doctrines were right. Here''s one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 151, 8, 16, 'certificate of approval.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 151, 9, 16, 'The other certificate that Jesus gave the Pharisees is in Matthew 23:25:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 151, 10, 16, '“You clean the outside of the cup and the dish.” That means that their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 151, 11, 16, 'external life was very upright. What this shows us is that if your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 151, 12, 16, 'external life is upright and your doctrines are correct, you could still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 151, 13, 16, 'be a terrible Pharisee, on your way to hell. It is to these people that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 151, 14, 16, 'Jesus said, “How will you escape the damnation of hell?” He says in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 151, 15, 16, 'Matthew 23:33, “You people who have all your doctrines right, you people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 151, 16, 16, 'whose outer life is very clean, how in the world will you escape hell?”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 151, 17, 16, 'Do you think Jesus would say that to some Christians today? “Your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 151, 18, 16, 'doctrine is alright and your external life is so good that people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 151, 19, 16, 'appreciate you, but how will you escape hell, my dear Christians?”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 151, 20, 16, 'What is it that Jesus is looking for? Your righteousness must exceed the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 151, 21, 16, 'righteousness of the Pharisees in quality. These are not comfortable');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 151, 22, 16, 'truths that Christians like to listen to. We''ve been coddled and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 151, 23, 16, 'comforted for so long, and assured by preacher after preacher after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 151, 24, 16, 'preacher that our sins are forgiven, that we''re all on our way to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 151, 25, 16, 'heaven, and that the blood of Jesus is all that we need. But it''s better');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 151, 26, 16, 'to trust in the Word of God than what some preacher tells you. See what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 151, 27, 16, 'Jesus Himself said: “If your righteousness doesn''t surpass the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 151, 28, 16, 'righteousness of the Pharisees in quality, you are not going to enter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 152, 1, 16, 'the kingdom of heaven, no matter which preacher assured you that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 152, 2, 16, 'are.” It is better to listen to a preacher who points you to God''s Word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 152, 3, 16, 'and tells you the truth. Don''t get a surprise on the day of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 152, 4, 16, 'judgment, my friend.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 152, 5, 16, 'Inward Righteousness Deals with the Root of Sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 152, 6, 16, 'Jesus explains the standard of righteousness that the Pharisees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 152, 7, 16, 'maintained. They kept the standard of the law externally and cleaned the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 152, 8, 16, 'outside of the cup. You have heard that it was said, “You shall not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 152, 9, 16, 'commit murder.” It’s good when you don''t commit murder, and in that area');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 152, 10, 16, 'the outside of your cup is clean. But what about the inside of the cup?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 152, 11, 16, 'That''s the question. Your doctrine may be right, but what about the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 152, 12, 16, 'inside of the cup?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 152, 13, 16, 'Matthew 5:21 says that it is not just the man who commits murder who''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 152, 14, 16, 'liable to the court, but that if a man has the seed of anger in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 152, 15, 16, 'heart, that is murder. Murder comes out of anger. That''s the seed. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 152, 16, 16, 'like a little acorn seed from which the big oak tree grows. Anger is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 152, 17, 16, 'seed from which murder comes, and Jesus was pointing out the root of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 152, 18, 16, 'problem.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 152, 19, 16, 'The Old Testament and the law were like a pair of scissors that snipped');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 152, 20, 16, 'off the bad fruit from the tree, but John the Baptist said Jesus has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 152, 21, 16, 'come to lay an axe to the root of the tree. Jesus came to hit the root');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 152, 22, 16, 'of the problem. To use a modern illustration, the law was like ointment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 152, 23, 16, 'that you spread upon a sore that comes in your body, to prevent it from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 152, 24, 16, 'coming forth. The law restrained people from murder, adultery, and so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 152, 25, 16, 'many other evils. After you rub on the ointment, the sore goes away, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 152, 26, 16, 'then it comes up somewhere else. You rub in the ointment again, but then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 152, 27, 16, 'the sore pops up on your leg, and this process keeps repeating itself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 152, 28, 16, 'Then, all of a sudden, somebody discovers an antibiotic, and the doctor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 153, 1, 16, 'says, “Now you don''t need to keep rubbing in the ointment. Instead, take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 153, 2, 16, 'this antibiotic. The antibiotic hits the root of the problem, and gets');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 153, 3, 16, 'to the root of this disease that is causing these eruptions on your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 153, 4, 16, 'skin. You can be healed.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 153, 5, 16, 'This is what grace does. Grace hits at the root of the problem. So in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 153, 6, 16, 'Matthew 5:20, Jesus says, “I want to tell you that anger will make you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 153, 7, 16, 'liable to the court. In the Old Testament, murder would make you liable');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 153, 8, 16, 'to the court, but I''m saying that even anger will make you just as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 153, 9, 16, 'guilty today.” In the Old Testament, you were only guilty if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 153, 10, 16, 'committed murder; in the New Testament, you are guilty when you get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 153, 11, 16, 'angry. Now, an anger that is just in the heart, even if it hasn''t even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 153, 12, 16, 'come out of your mouth yet (verse 22), makes you guilty.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 153, 13, 16, 'Wrong Attitude #1: Anger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 153, 14, 16, 'There are nine wrong attitudes that Jesus spoke of after speaking about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 153, 15, 16, 'the nine right attitudes. The number one wrong attitude is anger. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 153, 16, 16, 'have anger in your heart, it''s a wrong attitude, and you''re already');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 153, 17, 16, 'guilty, even though you have done nothing. You''ve said nothing, nor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 153, 18, 16, 'killed your brother physically or with your words, but you''re guilty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 153, 19, 16, 'already.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 153, 20, 16, 'And then that anger can go one step further. Out of the abundance of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 153, 21, 16, 'heart, Jesus said, the mouth speaks. The mouth is like the overflow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 153, 22, 16, 'valve of what is in the heart, and if there is anger in the heart, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 153, 23, 16, 'overflows through the mouth. Jesus says that if your anger overflows');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 153, 24, 16, 'through the mouth and you say something to hurt your brother in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 153, 25, 16, 'anger, now you''re going to be guilty before a higher court, the supreme');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 153, 26, 16, 'court (Matthew 5:22).).). Before that, you were just guilty at a lower');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 153, 27, 16, 'court. He’s using human language to show that your guilt is much greater');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 153, 28, 16, 'when you have allowed your anger to be expressed in words towards your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 154, 1, 16, 'brother. If you''ve kept it in, that’s good, but you''re still guilty; if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 154, 2, 16, 'you express it, you''re guilty at a higher level; if you go still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 154, 3, 16, 'further, and you hurt your brother with even more angry words, you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 154, 4, 16, 'be guilty enough to go beyond court, and beyond supreme court, to hell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 154, 5, 16, 'itself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 154, 6, 16, 'What has Jesus taught us about anger? That anger in the heart is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 154, 7, 16, 'first of three steps to hell. Have you ever heard any preacher tell you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 154, 8, 16, 'that, that when you get angry with anyone (it could be with your wife,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 154, 9, 16, 'with your husband, with your mother-in-law, with your neighbor, with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 154, 10, 16, 'your boss, with someone who has done some evil to you, or anyone else),');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 154, 11, 16, 'in God''s eyes the seed of murder is already there in your heart? You are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 154, 12, 16, 'guilty, and if it comes forth in hurtful words, you''re guilty enough to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 154, 13, 16, 'go to hell without ever having murdered that person. This is where our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 154, 14, 16, 'righteousness is to exceed the righteousness of the Pharisees.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 154, 15, 16, 'The Pharisees only thought of physical murder as taking a man to hell,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 154, 16, 16, 'and it is to this outward attitude toward the commandments that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 154, 17, 16, 'added His, “but I say to you.” We can say that Moses went up to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 154, 18, 16, 'mountain and brought down the two tablets with Ten Commandments, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 154, 19, 16, 'Jesus went up to the mountain and replaced those Ten Commandments with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 154, 20, 16, 'the Sermon on the Mount. Whatever is written in those commandments that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 154, 21, 16, 'Moses got on the mountain, Jesus wants to tell you the spirit behind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 154, 22, 16, 'those commands.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 154, 23, 16, 'Jesus said in John 6, “The words that I speak to you are spirit and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 154, 24, 16, 'life. The flesh profits nothing.” It''s the spirit that''s most important.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 154, 25, 16, 'He showed what was behind the law of murder: God is against your getting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 154, 26, 16, 'angry with your brother. It''s a serious thing, so if you are angry with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 154, 27, 16, 'your brother, what should you do?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 154, 28, 16, 'How To Deal with Anger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 155, 1, 16, 'It’s wonderful that the Lord gives us a solution. He doesn''t only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 155, 2, 16, 'identify the problem; He gives us a solution. A true prophet will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 155, 3, 16, 'only indicate the sin in a church or in a person, but will also provide');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 155, 4, 16, 'them a solution, just like a good doctor does not only diagnose a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 155, 5, 16, 'sickness, but also provides a cure. So He says, “If you come before God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 155, 6, 16, 'with an offering of apology because you realize that you have sinned,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 155, 7, 16, 'God will say, ‘That''s not enough. I''m not going to accept your offering');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 155, 8, 16, 'of asking for forgiveness.’ So here’s what you must do: leave your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 155, 9, 16, 'offering there. First go to your brother whom you spoke against, whom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 155, 10, 16, 'you hurt, and be reconciled to him. Then come back and present your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 155, 11, 16, 'offering to God and ask Him for forgiveness” (Matthew 5:24).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 155, 12, 16, 'How many people do that? When you have hurt your wife by some words you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 155, 13, 16, 'spoke, or you’ve hurt your husband by something you said (or a co-worker');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 155, 14, 16, 'or somebody else), as a Christian, what is the first thing you need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 155, 15, 16, 'do as soon as you are aware that you did something wrong? Go to that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 155, 16, 16, 'person and say, “I''m sorry.” The Lord says, “Don''t come to Me first.” We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 155, 17, 16, 'need to understand God''s law. You have to go to the one whom you hurt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 155, 18, 16, 'first, otherwise God won''t even listen to your prayer. It''s so clear. Go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 155, 19, 16, 'first to man and not to God. First be reconciled to your brother, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 155, 20, 16, 'then come present your offering to God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 155, 21, 16, 'But people may say, “What if I go to my brother and say, ‘I''m sorry for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 155, 22, 16, 'what I did,’ and he doesn''t forgive me?” Your responsibility is over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 155, 23, 16, 'then. It''s between him and God if he''s got a grudge against you. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 155, 24, 16, 'will deal with him, but you finished your responsibility. You don''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 155, 25, 16, 'to force him to forgive you. You have to do your best to clear your debt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 155, 26, 16, 'to him because you sinned against him, and as far as you''re concerned,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 155, 27, 16, 'your reconciliation is complete when you''ve done your part. If he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 155, 28, 16, 'doesn''t do his part to forgive you, that''s between him and God. A person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 156, 1, 16, 'who doesn''t forgive another will go to hell. That''s none of your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 156, 2, 16, 'business. You have to do your part to go and ask forgiveness, and then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 156, 3, 16, 'come to God. Otherwise, He says if you don''t do that, then you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 156, 4, 16, 'finally go to hell. That''s the meaning of Jesus’ parable which says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 156, 5, 16, 'you''ll be thrown into prison and you''ll never be able to come out of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 156, 6, 16, 'there till you paid the last cent. It’s too late after you get into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 156, 7, 16, 'eternity to go and ask people for forgiveness. That''s why we need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 156, 8, 16, 'settle all matters with God and men right now.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 156, 9, 16, 'The Righteous Keep Their Consciences Clear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 156, 10, 16, 'The Apostle Paul said in Acts 24:15 when he was speaking to Felix in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 156, 11, 16, 'trial, “I have a hope in God which these men cherish themselves, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 156, 12, 16, 'there will certainly be a resurrection of the righteous and the wicked.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 156, 13, 16, 'All who are born again Christians believe in two resurrections. The book');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 156, 14, 16, 'of Revelation speaks about the first resurrection and a second');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 156, 15, 16, 'resurrection. Jesus spoke in John 5 of the resurrection of the wicked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 156, 16, 16, 'and the resurrection of the righteous. Here also, he says there''ll be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 156, 17, 16, 'resurrection of the righteous and the wicked. People die, and one day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 156, 18, 16, 'they''re going to be raised up - the righteous and the wicked alike. Paul');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 156, 19, 16, 'says, “I want to be in the resurrection of the righteous, not in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 156, 20, 16, 'resurrection of the wicked.” In order to be in the resurrection of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 156, 21, 16, 'righteous, what should we do?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 156, 22, 16, '“In view of this” means, “because it is true that there are going to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 156, 23, 16, 'two resurrections, I want to make sure that I''m in the resurrection of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 156, 24, 16, 'the righteous and so I do my best...” He doesn''t say, “I trust in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 156, 25, 16, 'Lord to forgive my sins.” That''s fine. Your salvation is only through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 156, 26, 16, 'the death of Christ, but he says - “I do my best to maintain always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 156, 27, 16, '(always means 24/7) a blameless conscience before God and before man.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 156, 28, 16, 'Not only before God. We should all be able to say, “I seek to keep my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 157, 1, 16, 'conscience clear 24 hours a day, seven days a week, before God and men.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 157, 2, 16, 'You see an example of that in the previous chapter where he shouted at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 157, 3, 16, 'the high priest. As soon as he realized his mistake, he immediately');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 157, 4, 16, 'asked for forgiveness (Acts 23:5). I believe it is implied there in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 157, 5, 16, 'words written there.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 157, 6, 16, 'First be reconciled to your brother, and then come and give your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 157, 7, 16, 'offering.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 157, 8, 16, 'Don’t Grieve the Holy Spirit with Your Words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 157, 9, 16, 'This is why we have such a strong word in Ephesians 4:31, which says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 157, 10, 16, '“Let all anger be put away from you.” Our words are very important. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 157, 11, 16, 'one place in Scripture where it speaks about grieving the Holy Spirit -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 157, 12, 16, 'hurting the Holy Spirit, really making Him sad at the way you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 157, 13, 16, 'conducting yourself - is in our speech. Ephesians 4:30 says, “Do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 157, 14, 16, 'grieve the Holy Spirit.” What is a subject in the previous verse and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 157, 15, 16, 'next verse? The words we speak. The exact meaning of verse 29 is, “Let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 157, 16, 16, 'no rotten word come out of your mouth, but only what is good, that it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 157, 17, 16, 'may give grace to those who hear.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 157, 18, 16, '“Don''t grieve the Holy Spirit with your words,” and therefore, “Let all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 157, 19, 16, 'bitter words, wrathful words, angry words, clamorous words, slanderous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 157, 20, 16, 'words, be put away along with all hateful words” (paraphrase verse 31).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 157, 21, 16, 'The context of grieving the Holy Spirit is our words. So if we don’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 157, 22, 16, 'want to grieve the Holy Spirit, we must ensure that all angry words, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 157, 23, 16, 'all spiteful words, and all bitter words, and all slander, and all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 157, 24, 16, 'gossip, and all ways of speech where we yell and scream, must be put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 157, 25, 16, 'away.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 157, 26, 16, 'What percentage of those words should we put away? 100%! Verse 31 says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 157, 27, 16, '“all.” I want to ask you: have taken that word, “all,” seriously? Do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 157, 28, 16, 'believe what Jesus said, that our righteousness must exceed the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 158, 1, 16, 'righteousness of the Pharisees? It''s not enough to say, “I have not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 158, 2, 16, 'murdered people.” Have you gotten angry with people or expressed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 158, 3, 16, 'yourself in anger and hatred, or kept bitterness against people?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 158, 4, 16, 'A Note on Speaking to Children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 158, 5, 16, 'I want to clarify one thing. When you raise your voice at your children,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 158, 6, 16, 'that may not necessarily be anger. It may be because they aren’t taking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 158, 7, 16, 'what you say seriously. It''s like when somebody is hundred meters away');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 158, 8, 16, 'from you, you have to raise your voice to help them to hear; you are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 158, 9, 16, 'angry with him. In the same way, a child may be sitting next to you, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 158, 10, 16, 'you tell him to do something, but in his mind, he is 10 miles away. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 158, 11, 16, 'you then raise your voice to help him hear you, that does not mean that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 158, 12, 16, 'you are angry. We need to distinguish between raising a voice without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 158, 13, 16, 'anger and raising a voice in anger. But just because raising your voice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 158, 14, 16, 'is permissible, don''t justify yourself with that. Ask yourself if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 158, 15, 16, 'there''s anger in your heart. There’s no excuse for doing that with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 158, 16, 16, 'adults. With your wife or husband, you can never make that excuse,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 158, 17, 16, 'because a raised voice in speaking to an adult is almost invariably a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 158, 18, 16, 'sign of anger.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 158, 19, 16, 'Let''s ask for the Holy Spirit''s help to put away all anger. Call it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 158, 20, 16, '“murder” and put it away from your life so that you can please your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 158, 21, 16, 'Heavenly Father, and so let your light shine before men that, as they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 158, 22, 16, 'see your good words and works, they glorify God for what He''s done in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 158, 23, 16, 'your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 158, 24, 17, 'Chapter 16 Righteous Anger, Unrighteous Anger and Lustful Thinking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 158, 25, 17, 'Fulfilling the great commission of making disciples is more laborious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 158, 26, 17, 'than simply bringing people to Christ, which can be done in a moment. To');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 158, 27, 17, 'lead people to the type of life that Jesus described in His teaching is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 158, 28, 17, 'a life-long process. This is not independent of the ministry of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 159, 1, 17, 'evangelism and missionary work, but it is completing the job those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 159, 2, 17, 'ministries begin. One needs the other, just like how a hand takes food');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 159, 3, 17, 'and puts it into the mouth (a picture of evangelism). And then the rest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 159, 4, 17, 'of the human body’s processes digest that food and make it part of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 159, 5, 17, 'body - that is a picture of the other ministries that complete the work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 159, 6, 17, 'and make that new convert an effective member the body of Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 159, 7, 17, 'This is what we see in Matthew 5, things that Jesus taught and commanded');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 159, 8, 17, 'that we are to bring every single believer into this life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 159, 9, 17, 'New Covenant Standards: Anger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 159, 10, 17, 'In Matthew 5 Jesus spoke about putting away anger. The old covenant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 159, 11, 17, 'standard was “You shall not murder” (Matthew 5:21), but in the next');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 159, 12, 17, 'verse Jesus says, “My standard is, do not be angry” (Matthew 5:22).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 159, 13, 17, 'However, there is an anger that is not sinful and there is an anger that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 159, 14, 17, 'is sinful, and we need to understand the difference. In Ephesians 4, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 159, 15, 17, 'have a command that says, “Be angry, and yet do not sin” (Ephesians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 159, 16, 17, '4:26). What it means is, the type of anger you should have in your life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 159, 17, 17, 'is an anger that is not sinful. So when Jesus raised the bar from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 159, 18, 17, 'Old Testament standard of, “Do not murder,” to, “Do not be angry,” we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 159, 19, 17, 'need to understand what is the right type of anger and what is the wrong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 159, 20, 17, 'type of anger.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 159, 21, 17, 'Whenever we do not understand a verse correctly we must look at our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 159, 22, 17, 'spiritual dictionary: the Word made flesh - the life of Jesus Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 159, 23, 17, 'Jesus called Himself the light of the world and it says of Him, “In Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 159, 24, 17, 'was life, and that life was the Light of men” (John 1:4). The life of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 159, 25, 17, 'Jesus Christ our Lord is the light that explains every verse in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 159, 26, 17, 'Scripture. So when we read, “Be angry, and yet do not sin” and we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 159, 27, 17, 'trying to distinguish between an anger that is sinful and an anger that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 159, 28, 17, 'is not sinful, we’ve got to look at the Light that is in the life of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 160, 1, 17, 'Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 160, 2, 17, 'Righteous Anger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 160, 3, 17, 'When was Jesus angry and when was He not angry? We read in Mark 3:1-5');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 160, 4, 17, 'that when Jesus was in a synagogue, He looked around with anger at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 160, 5, 17, 'people who were trying to hinder a man with a withered hand from being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 160, 6, 17, 'healed. He was angry when the Pharisees, who were more concerned about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 160, 7, 17, 'keeping the ritual of the Sabbath than healing a paralyzed man. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 160, 8, 17, 'the right type of anger – anger towards religious leaders and religious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 160, 9, 17, 'people who are more interested in ritual than in people and more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 160, 10, 17, 'interested in keeping certain rituals than delivering paralyzed people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 160, 11, 17, 'Today the paralysis is found among Christians who are defeated by sin,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 160, 12, 17, 'and when we have religious people who are more interested to make sure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 160, 13, 17, 'that the people pay their tithes more than that they are free from sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 160, 14, 17, 'They are in the same category as the Pharisees who would not allow the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 160, 15, 17, 'man with a withered hand to be healed and were more interested in people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 160, 16, 17, 'paying their tithes and keeping the Sabbath. There are a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 160, 17, 17, 'preachers and pastors like that today, who are not interested in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 160, 18, 17, 'delivering their flock from the power of sin in their life, but rather');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 160, 19, 17, 'are more interested in ensuring that they pay their tithes. Jesus would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 160, 20, 17, 'look at such people with anger today because He did not come to earth to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 160, 21, 17, 'make people pay their tithes; He came to save people from their sins. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 160, 22, 17, 'did not die on the cross to get people to pay their tithes; He died on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 160, 23, 17, 'the cross to deliver us from our sins.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 160, 24, 17, 'Our Savior’s name is Jesus and He came to save us from our sins (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 160, 25, 17, '1:21). When people hinder others from being saved from their sins and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 160, 26, 17, 'say, “Don''t go and listen to this person because he is preaching victory');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 160, 27, 17, 'over sin, but keep listening to me because I tell you how to pay your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 160, 28, 17, 'tithes,” we must be sure that Jesus would be angry with such people. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 161, 1, 17, 'if you are in fellowship with Jesus Christ, as a servant of God you must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 161, 2, 17, 'also be angry with such people, who hinder others from being delivered.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 161, 3, 17, 'Another example when Jesus was angry is in John 2 when Jesus went into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 161, 4, 17, 'the temple and drove the money changers out of the temple. It says that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 161, 5, 17, 'He made a whip and turned over the tables of the money changers and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 161, 6, 17, 'said, “Take these things away!” He was really angry and the disciples');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 161, 7, 17, 'remembered the word that said, “Zeal for Your house has consumed Me”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 161, 8, 17, '(John 2:15-17). Zeal for the purity of God''s house should make us angry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 161, 9, 17, 'when we see people making money in the name of religion or in the name');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 161, 10, 17, 'of Christ and exploiting poor people just like the sellers of doves and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 161, 11, 17, 'sheep exploited the poor people saying, “We will sell you these sheep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 161, 12, 17, 'and doves for your sacrifice but of course it’s going to cost you a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 161, 13, 17, 'little more than out in the market because we have to get our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 161, 14, 17, 'commission.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 161, 15, 17, 'He was angry with such people. He said, “If you want to make money, go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 161, 16, 17, 'out into the marketplace. The temple (the house) of God is not the place');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 161, 17, 17, 'to make money.” Today we have a lot of preachers who are using');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 161, 18, 17, 'Christianity to make money for themselves. They are using television and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 161, 19, 17, 'all types of means to become wealthy, to build huge houses, to buy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 161, 20, 17, 'airplanes for themselves, and all types of things. What would Jesus do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 161, 21, 17, 'if He were here today? He would do the exact same thing. He would be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 161, 22, 17, 'angry with them because they are dishonoring God''s name by exploiting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 161, 23, 17, 'poor people. This is the right type of anger that we see in Christ. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 161, 24, 17, 'was angry when He sees poor people being exploited, when He sees people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 161, 25, 17, 'making money in the name of religion by exploiting their ignorance. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 161, 26, 17, 'when you see that happening today, if you are not angry, you are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 161, 27, 17, 'like Christ. If you are Christlike, you will be angry when you see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 161, 28, 17, 'people, whether on television or on a platform or in a church, trying to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 162, 1, 17, 'make money in the name of Christianity or exploiting poor people in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 162, 2, 17, 'name of religion.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 162, 3, 17, 'Unrighteous Anger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 162, 4, 17, 'When was Jesus not angry? One example is when He was called Beelzebub');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 162, 5, 17, '(prince of devils) (Matthew 12:22-24).). This occurred when Jesus cast');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 162, 6, 17, 'out a demon from a man who was deaf and dumb. The multitude saw that,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 162, 7, 17, 'were excited, and began to say, “This is the Son of David. Look what a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 162, 8, 17, 'wonderful miracle He has done and set this man free!” But the Pharisees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 162, 9, 17, 'were jealous and they immediately said, “This man is casting out demons');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 162, 10, 17, 'by the ruler of demons” (Matthew 12:24). They were calling Jesus, Satan.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 162, 11, 17, 'Imagine if somebody called you Satan when you are serving the Lord. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 162, 12, 17, 'Jesus responded saying, “I am just a Son of a man, I am just an ordinary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 162, 13, 17, 'Man. If you have spoken against Me, you are forgiven; but be careful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 162, 14, 17, 'that you do not speak against the Holy Spirit” (Matthew 12:32).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 162, 15, 17, 'He wasn''t angry when people called Him the devil. He said, “It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 162, 16, 17, 'alright if you speak against me, I am just the Son of a man. You are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 162, 17, 17, 'forgiven.” He was Almighty God when they called Him the devil, and He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 162, 18, 17, 'wasn''t upset. He forgave them. A true Christian will never be upset with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 162, 19, 17, 'people calling him bad names, calling him a devil, pig, dog or whatever.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 162, 20, 17, 'It doesn’t make a difference. If he is Christlike, he will forgive them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 162, 21, 17, 'and not get angry. He won''t even retain any bitterness or anger against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 162, 22, 17, 'the people who called him those names.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 162, 23, 17, 'Another example of Jesus not getting angry is when He was standing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 162, 24, 17, 'before the chief priest at His trial and they spat on His face. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 162, 25, 17, 'even slapped Him, and He still didn''t get angry. When people physically');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 162, 26, 17, 'assault us or spit on our face, if we get angry, then we are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 162, 27, 17, 'Christlike. That’s the difference between anger that is sinful and anger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 162, 28, 17, 'that''s not sinful. Anger that is sinful is when I am upset that people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 163, 1, 17, 'say something against me or do something to me. Your convenience is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 163, 2, 17, 'disturbed and your will is crossed. Be it your wife or husband or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 163, 3, 17, 'neighbor or your enemy or anybody. If we get angry then, we are not like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 163, 4, 17, 'Christ. We need to overcome that type of anger. The Holy Spirit comes to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 163, 5, 17, 'help us overcome to make us like Christ, Who was never upset when people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 163, 6, 17, 'called Him the devil or spat on His face.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 163, 7, 17, 'Very few Christians want to be like Jesus Christ, but they all want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 163, 8, 17, 'go to heaven when they die. Every Christian wants to go to heaven when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 163, 9, 17, 'he dies, but how many of them want to live like Jesus Christ on this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 163, 10, 17, 'earth before they go to heaven? Very few. That''s the problem. Many of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 163, 11, 17, 'these folks are not really Christians. They are Christian by name');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 163, 12, 17, 'because they were born in a Christian family, but they have not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 163, 13, 17, 'surrendered to the Lordship of Jesus Christ in their life and therefore');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 163, 14, 17, 'as far as God is concerned, they are not Christians. They are going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 163, 15, 17, 'get a big surprise when Christ comes again and they discover they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 163, 16, 17, 'not Christians at all, because you cannot be a Christian by being born');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 163, 17, 17, 'into a Christian family. You have to make a personal choice.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 163, 18, 17, 'In the Old Testament you were a Jew if you were born into a Jewish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 163, 19, 17, 'family because becoming a Jew was by natural birth. But becoming a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 163, 20, 17, 'Christian is not by natural birth. It is by spiritual birth, and that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 163, 21, 17, 'comes when you repent of your sins and receive Jesus Christ as your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 163, 22, 17, 'Lord. That is the reason why many people don''t take the matter of living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 163, 23, 17, 'like Jesus on this earth seriously. A true Christian will seek to live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 163, 24, 17, 'like Christ on this earth before he goes to heaven. Such a Christian,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 163, 25, 17, 'when he reads a command like, “Be angry, and yet do not sin,” is very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 163, 26, 17, 'eager to find out what type of anger is sinful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 163, 27, 17, 'When you see a television preacher trying to make money out of poor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 163, 28, 17, 'people in the name of Christ, if you are not angry at that, then you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 164, 1, 17, 'not Christlike - you are sinning. You should be angry because Christ was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 164, 2, 17, 'angry when He saw people making money in the name of religion. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 164, 3, 17, 'are angry when people spit on you and call you the devil or hurt you in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 164, 4, 17, 'some way, then again, you are sinning because that is the wrong type of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 164, 5, 17, 'anger. When you look at a lot of Christians today, much like a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 164, 6, 17, 'people in the world, they are angry at the wrong things - they are angry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 164, 7, 17, 'when people hurt them – but they are not angry when God''s name is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 164, 8, 17, 'dishonored. They are angry when their own name is dishonored. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 164, 9, 17, 'taught us to pray, “Our Father, Who art in heaven, hallowed be Thy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 164, 10, 17, 'name,” not, “Hallowed be my name.” It doesn''t matter what people say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 164, 11, 17, 'about my name or me or my family. That is unimportant! Let the name of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 164, 12, 17, 'the Lord be honored. If that is our fundamental prayer, the first prayer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 164, 13, 17, 'that Jesus taught us to pray, then we will be angry at the right time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 164, 14, 17, 'and we will give up sinful anger.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 164, 15, 17, 'This is so important for us to understand. This is the meaning of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 164, 16, 17, 'Ephesians 4:26, “Be angry, and yet do not sin.” And then five verses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 164, 17, 17, 'later in Ephesians 4:31 it says, “Put away all anger.” The two verses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 164, 18, 17, 'look contradictory, where in one place it says, “Be angry but don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 164, 19, 17, 'sin,” and in another place it says, “Put away all anger.” What anger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 164, 20, 17, 'should we put away? Anger that is selfish, self-centered, and sinful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 164, 21, 17, 'What is the anger that we should have? That which is God-centered, which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 164, 22, 17, 'concerns the glory of God''s name. We should be burdened that God''s name');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 164, 23, 17, 'is not being honored on the earth today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 164, 24, 17, 'New Covenant Standard: Lust');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 164, 25, 17, 'Jesus continues teaching in Matthew 5 about a second wrong attitude. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 164, 26, 17, 'first wrong attitude He spoke about was anger. We must get rid of anger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 164, 27, 17, 'from our life. The second wrong attitude, which is another major problem');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 164, 28, 17, 'with all Christians (even all human beings),), is sexually lustful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 165, 1, 17, 'thinking – such as when a man looks at a woman to lust for her. Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 165, 2, 17, '5:27-28 says that the Old Testament standard was “Do not commit physical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 165, 3, 17, 'adultery.” As long as you don''t touch a woman who is not your wife, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 165, 4, 17, 'you don''t commit adultery with her, you were alright. That was the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 165, 5, 17, 'Testament standard. But Jesus raised that standard, too. Just like Moses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 165, 6, 17, 'went up to the mountain and came down with Ten Commandments, Jesus went');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 165, 7, 17, 'up to the mountain and preached the Sermon on the Mount. He raised the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 165, 8, 17, 'level of those Ten Commandments to the spirit of those commandments.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 165, 9, 17, 'This showed that murder was like anger, and adultery was same as lusting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 165, 10, 17, 'with your eyes - in other words, you are committing adultery with that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 165, 11, 17, 'woman in your mind. Jesus said that in God''s eyes, that was adultery');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 165, 12, 17, 'because your inner life was impure.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 165, 13, 17, 'The mark of the Pharisees was that they kept their external life pure -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 165, 14, 17, 'the outside of the cup. A Christian who keeps his outer life clean but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 165, 15, 17, 'his inner thought life impure is a Pharisee, and he is on his way to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 165, 16, 17, 'hell, whether he knows it or not. Many of us don''t understand the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 165, 17, 17, 'seriousness of this.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 165, 18, 17, 'During the last 35 years I have preached the most against a handful of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 165, 19, 17, 'sins, but two sins particularly - anger and sexually sinful, lustful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 165, 20, 17, 'thoughts. People have asked me why I speak so much against them. I tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 165, 21, 17, 'them it’s because Jesus referred to these two sins when He first said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 165, 22, 17, 'that our righteousness must exceed the righteousness of the scribes and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 165, 23, 17, 'Pharisees. Immediately after saying that your righteousness must be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 165, 24, 17, 'higher than the righteousness of all the Pharisees around you (who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 165, 25, 17, 'very religious people), the first two sins Jesus mentioned were in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 165, 26, 17, 'area of anger, and in the area of sexually lustful thinking. That’s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 165, 27, 17, 'first reason why I preach against them the most.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 165, 28, 17, 'The second reason why I preach against these two sins is that these are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 166, 1, 17, 'the only two sins that Jesus spoke about in the Sermon on the Mount');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 166, 2, 17, 'where He said the danger of indulging in them was going to hell. Most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 166, 3, 17, 'people don''t believe that. The only two times where Jesus spoke about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 166, 4, 17, 'hell in the Sermon on the Mount were in relation to these two sins, so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 166, 5, 17, 'this tells us that these two sins must be very serious.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 166, 6, 17, 'There were other sins mentioned in Matthew 5, 6 & 7, but He didn''t refer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 166, 7, 17, 'to hell again. But when it came to anger, He said there is a danger of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 166, 8, 17, 'hell: “you can be guilty enough to go to the fiery hell” (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 166, 9, 17, '5:22b). And when He spoke about lusting after a woman, He said the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 166, 10, 17, 'thing in Matthew 5:29, “your whole body can be thrown into hell,” and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 166, 11, 17, 'again in Matthew 5:30, “your whole body can be thrown into hell.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 166, 12, 17, 'It is very significant that the only two times Jesus spoke about hell in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 166, 13, 17, 'the Sermon on the Mount were in relation to anger, and to sexually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 166, 14, 17, 'lustful thinking. So these must be very serious sins in God''s eyes and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 166, 15, 17, 'there is not sufficient preaching against them today. Can you think of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 166, 16, 17, 'the last time you heard a message on overcoming anger? I don''t think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 166, 17, 17, 'I’ve heard a message on that in my whole life. In the 50+ years I''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 166, 18, 17, 'been moving around Christendom, I''ve heard a lot of preachers on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 166, 19, 17, 'television, tapes, CDs, and in many churches. Yet I''ve hardly ever heard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 166, 20, 17, 'a message on overcoming sexually lustful patterns of thinking. Why is it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 166, 21, 17, 'that the devil has prevented preachers from preaching on these two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 166, 22, 17, 'areas?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 166, 23, 17, 'The number one reason is that the preachers themselves haven''t got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 166, 24, 17, 'victory. How can they speak about it if they’re still enslaved');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 166, 25, 17, 'themselves? Secondly, the preachers are very often more interested in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 166, 26, 17, 'making people look nice on the outside in their churches and collecting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 166, 27, 17, 'their money. So there''s a great need to emphasize these two things,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 166, 28, 17, 'which Jesus spoke about so much. These are the two sins that Jesus said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 167, 1, 17, 'would lead a person finally to hell and that is a very serious thing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 167, 2, 17, 'Jesus took the Ten Commandments and showed the people what was behind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 167, 3, 17, 'those commands.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 167, 4, 17, 'You don''t have to come to Matthew 5 to understand that lusting after a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 167, 5, 17, 'woman who is not your wife is a sin, as will be shown later. Jesus said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 167, 6, 17, 'that everyone (and it doesn''t matter if the person is a believer or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 167, 7, 17, 'unbeliever) who looks on a woman to desire her has committed adultery');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 167, 8, 17, 'with her already in his heart. Lust means a strong desire. He said it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 167, 9, 17, 'so serious that if your right eye makes you to stumble in this area then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 167, 10, 17, 'you must tear it out! You must be radical when you''re tempted to lust');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 167, 11, 17, 'with your eyes. You must act as if you''re a blind man. That is the only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 167, 12, 17, 'way to overcome it. You shouldn''t take it lightly and say, “Well, I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 167, 13, 17, 'just admiring the beauty that God has created.” There are so many ways');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 167, 14, 17, 'we can justify this sin, and a lot of people do. It''s when a person is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 167, 15, 17, 'careless in this area that over a period of time he will even fall into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 167, 16, 17, 'physical adultery, like a lot of pastors have throughout the world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 167, 17, 17, 'Overcoming Lust Through the Fear of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 167, 18, 17, 'You don''t need to have a Bible to understand that lusting after a woman');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 167, 19, 17, 'is wrong. Let me give you an example of a man who did not have a Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 167, 20, 17, 'and yet overcame in this area. That man is Job. The book of Job was the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 167, 21, 17, 'first book of the Bible that was written. We know this because there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 167, 22, 17, 'no reference to Abraham, Isaac or Jacob in that book. Every other book');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 167, 23, 17, 'in the Bible has some connection with Abraham, Isaac and Jacob, but the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 167, 24, 17, 'book of Job does not. There is also no reference to Moses. Job probably');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 167, 25, 17, 'lived in the time of Abraham, and he certainly lived before Moses, for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 167, 26, 17, 'it was Moses who wrote Genesis. The book of Job must have been written');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 167, 27, 17, 'before that because there are so many accurate details of Job’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 167, 28, 17, 'conversations in this book that could not have been written by anyone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 168, 1, 17, 'else other than Job himself. This is a man who lived long before the Law');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 168, 2, 17, 'was given, who had no understanding of the Ten Commandments, who had no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 168, 3, 17, 'Bible, and who had no fellowship. He was a lonely but godly man on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 168, 4, 17, 'earth. But one thing he did have was the fear of God - a reverence for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 168, 5, 17, 'God. He turned away from whatever was wrong and sought to live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 168, 6, 17, 'uprightly. God Himself certified him saying, “For there is no one like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 168, 7, 17, 'him on the earth, a blameless upright man who reveres Me and turns away');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 168, 8, 17, 'from evil” (Job 1:8).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 168, 9, 17, 'What was Job’s attitude towards women? He says: “I have made a covenant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 168, 10, 17, 'with my eyes, how then can I gaze at a virgin (a woman who is not my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 168, 11, 17, 'wife), because doesn''t God see my ways and number all my steps?” (Job');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 168, 12, 17, '31:1,4). “If my heart has been enticed by a woman, or if I have lurked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 168, 13, 17, 'at my neighbor’s doorway (when he is not there and his wife is there -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 168, 14, 17, 'v9), that would be a lustful crime” (Job 31:11). Who taught Job that?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 168, 15, 17, 'There was no Old Testament, and there was no New Testament in those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 168, 16, 17, 'days. There was no Bible at all! It was his reverence for God that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 168, 17, 17, 'taught him that even if he sinned only with his eyes, that it would be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 168, 18, 17, 'sin against Almighty God, and it would be a disaster in his life (Job');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 168, 19, 17, '31:3).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 168, 20, 17, 'What Jesus taught in Matthew 5 was not something new that God-fearing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 168, 21, 17, 'men did not know. I''m sure John the Baptist knew it even before Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 168, 22, 17, 'spoke it. Job knew it. Anyone who reveres God, even if he doesn''t have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 168, 23, 17, 'Bible like Job, will conclude that if I look with sexual lust at a woman');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 168, 24, 17, 'who is not my wife, it is a sin before God. There is something within us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 168, 25, 17, 'that tells us that it is wrong. It is like stealing what God hasn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 168, 26, 17, 'given to you. Even if you don''t have a Bible, your conscience will tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 168, 27, 17, 'you that when you steal something that doesn''t belong to you, it is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 168, 28, 17, 'sin. You don''t need a commandment to tell you that. Reverence for God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 169, 1, 17, 'itself will tell you that.. That is a wonderful thing to remember as we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 169, 2, 17, 'see what Jesus taught.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 169, 3, 17, 'Since Job knew this two thousand years before Jesus ever spoke it, even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 169, 4, 17, 'when there was no Bible available to anybody on the earth, what excuse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 169, 5, 17, 'is there for a Christian today who has a Bible? And those who speak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 169, 6, 17, 'English have the Bible in 20 or 30 translations today - every one of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 169, 7, 17, 'which tells the same thing. How is it that so many believers today take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 169, 8, 17, 'this matter of sexually lusting with their eyes so lightly? It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 169, 9, 17, 'because there is a fundamental lack of reverence for God, which Job had.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 169, 10, 17, 'Today’s Christians have Bible knowledge, but no reverence for God. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 169, 11, 17, 'are people who go to Bible schools and get doctorates in theology');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 169, 12, 17, 'studying the Bible, yet still lust after women. What does that teach us?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 169, 13, 17, 'It teaches us that head knowledge of Scripture and “getting a degree”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 169, 14, 17, 'from a Bible seminary does not make you holy. There is so much Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 169, 15, 17, 'knowledge today with the abundance of translations and concordances. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 169, 16, 17, 'even have the Bible on our mobile phones and on CDs, which people can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 169, 17, 17, 'listen to when they drive in their cars, etc. Yet in spite of all this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 169, 18, 17, 'abundance of knowledge, there is very little reverence for God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 169, 19, 17, 'In the Sermon on the Mount, Jesus taught many things that we could know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 169, 20, 17, 'even without reading the Sermon on the Mount, as long as we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 169, 21, 17, 'reverence for God. Some of these things are very clear to us: anger is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 169, 22, 17, 'sin, lusting after women is sin, and many other things written here.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 169, 23, 17, 'Therefore it is not because of a lack of knowledge that you continue in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 169, 24, 17, 'sin; it is because of lack of reverence for God. Reverence for God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 169, 25, 17, 'the beginning of wisdom. It is the “ABC” of the Christian life and if we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 169, 26, 17, 'don''t have that, there is no amount of Bible study or listening to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 169, 27, 17, 'messages that is going to make us holy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 169, 28, 18, 'Chapter 17 Faith to Overcome Anger and Lustful Thinking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 170, 1, 18, 'Taking Anger and Lustful Thinking Seriously');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 170, 2, 18, 'A lot of people are just happy with having their sins forgiven, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 170, 3, 18, 'that’s it. Such people do not know Jesus as their Savior; they know Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 170, 4, 18, 'as their Forgiver. For example, anger and sexually lustful thinking are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 170, 5, 18, 'not spoken about much because most preachers don''t have any victory in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 170, 6, 18, 'either of these areas. Without victory, they can’t possibly have the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 170, 7, 18, 'authority to speak against them; and even if they do speak against them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 170, 8, 18, 'victory-less preachers will not speak in a practical way, which leads');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 170, 9, 18, 'others to overcome.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 170, 10, 18, 'Let’s look a little more at these sins, so that we don''t just see their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 170, 11, 18, 'seriousness, but so that we also understand how we can overcome them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 170, 12, 18, 'Their seriousness is seen by the fact that these are the only two sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 170, 13, 18, 'in the Sermon on the Mount that Jesus connected with the possibility of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 170, 14, 18, 'a man going to hell. My observation is that 99% of Christians do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 170, 15, 18, 'feel that anger is a very serious sin. They certainly do not feel that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 170, 16, 18, 'anger can take them to hell. Thus they don''t really believe what Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 170, 17, 18, 'said in Matthew 5:22. What type of Christians are they if they, don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 170, 18, 18, 'believe what Jesus Christ said? Do you believe what He said about anger?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 170, 19, 18, 'Or do you believe the psychologists? Psychologists can’t lead you to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 170, 20, 18, 'heaven. In the same way, 99% of Christians don’t really believe that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 170, 21, 18, 'lusting after a women with your eyes is serious enough to take you to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 170, 22, 18, 'hell. Most people don’t take that seriously at all, which is proof that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 170, 23, 18, 'the devil has made sin such a light, unimportant thing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 170, 24, 18, 'Sin Is a Spiritual Disease');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 170, 25, 18, 'Think of a deadly disease, like AIDS or cancer: how many people would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 170, 26, 18, 'take contracting AIDS or getting cancer lightly? Only people who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 170, 27, 18, 'completely ignorant of what such diseases can do. If you were to tell an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 170, 28, 18, 'illiterate, poor woman in a remote village that she''s got cancer, she');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 171, 1, 18, 'wouldn’t be disturbed, because she does not know what cancer is. An');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 171, 2, 18, 'educated person, on the other hand, would be very disturbed if the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 171, 3, 18, 'doctor tells him that cancer has spread all over inside his body. Why is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 171, 4, 18, 'he disturbed? Because he sees the danger of cancer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 171, 5, 18, 'In the same way, when you''re spiritually illiterate, you don''t consider');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 171, 6, 18, 'anger to be a serious sin. When you''re spiritually illiterate, you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 171, 7, 18, 'consider lusting after women to be a serious sin. That is a mark of your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 171, 8, 18, 'spiritual illiteracy, just like that illiterate woman doesn''t know how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 171, 9, 18, 'serious cancer is. In the same way, one who is spiritually literate will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 171, 10, 18, 'take these sins very seriously. He doesn''t even need the words of God to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 171, 11, 18, 'tell him to, because he knows instinctively that these are serious sins,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 171, 12, 18, 'because one hurts other people, and the other hurts himself. So that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 171, 13, 18, 'why we should look at these sins more carefully and ask how we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 171, 14, 18, 'overcome them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 171, 15, 18, 'Teachers Must Obey and Warn Others Against These Sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 171, 16, 18, 'Jesus said that it is responsibility of those who preach God''s Word to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 171, 17, 18, 'teach every single one of the people in their flock how to overcome in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 171, 18, 18, 'these two areas. If you are a preacher or a pastor or a teacher: are you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 171, 19, 18, 'doing that? Have you overcome in these two areas? And are you teaching');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 171, 20, 18, 'others to whom you preach to overcome in these areas? Are you showing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 171, 21, 18, 'them how it is possible? If not, you''re failing in your duty, and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 171, 22, 18, 'would say that you have no right to be a minister of the gospel; you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 171, 23, 18, 'not teaching people what Jesus taught. Today, most Christian teachers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 171, 24, 18, 'are preaching what the psychologists teach, not what Jesus taught in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 171, 25, 18, 'Bible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 171, 26, 18, 'There are very few prophetic voices in Christendom today that hold');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 171, 27, 18, 'people up to the standards that Jesus proclaimed in His Word. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 171, 28, 18, 'ministry is sadly lacking. The devil has silenced prophetic voices in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 172, 1, 18, 'the church, and most people think of prophesy only as “predicting the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 172, 2, 18, 'future;” not only that, but usually predicting the future in relation to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 172, 3, 18, 'material things. That''s a deception. A prophetic voice is one which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 172, 4, 18, 'leads God''s people to repentance from the sins that are destroying them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 172, 5, 18, 'Material prosperity is not the way to heaven; it’s freedom from sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 172, 6, 18, 'that''s the way to heaven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 172, 7, 18, 'What Jesus’ Name Means for These Sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 172, 8, 18, 'When the angel came to Joseph in Matthew 1, he gave the very first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 172, 9, 18, 'promise of the New Testament. It says in Matthew 1:21, “Jesus will save');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 172, 10, 18, 'His people from their sins.” That is the meaning of the Name of Jesus. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 172, 11, 18, 'lot of people who name the Name of Jesus don''t even know what His Name');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 172, 12, 18, 'means. Matthew 1:21 tells us that the name, “Jesus,” means “the One Who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 172, 13, 18, 'will save His people from their sins.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 172, 14, 18, 'What''s the difference between being saved from our sins, and being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 172, 15, 18, 'forgiven of our sins, as it pertains to anger and sexually lustful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 172, 16, 18, 'patterns of thinking?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 172, 17, 18, 'If you get angry in a sinful way, and then repent of it and ask the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 172, 18, 18, 'to forgive you, He will forgive you. And tomorrow, if you will get angry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 172, 19, 18, 'again in a sinful way and ask the Lord to forgive you, He will forgive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 172, 20, 18, 'you. And next week, if you do the same thing, and you ask Him to forgive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 172, 21, 18, 'you, He will forgive you. In the same way, if you lust after a woman');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 172, 22, 18, 'with your eyes and you realize it''s a sin, and you ask the Lord to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 172, 23, 18, 'forgive you, He will forgive you. And if you do it again tomorrow, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 172, 24, 18, 'you ask Him to forgive you, He will forgive you. You turn to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 172, 25, 18, 'internet and watch pornography, and you ask the Lord to forgive you, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 172, 26, 18, 'He forgives you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 172, 27, 18, 'But have you been saved from these sins? No. Have you been forgiven?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 172, 28, 18, 'Yes. The pattern of your life is one of sinning, asking the Lord to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 173, 1, 18, 'forgive you, sinning again, and asking the Lord to forgive you again.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 173, 2, 18, 'It’s an endless circle. Have you been forgiven? Yes! You may have sinned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 173, 3, 18, 'a thousand times, and all your sins are forgiven, but have you been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 173, 4, 18, 'saved from your sin? No, because you keep on doing it! It’s like coming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 173, 5, 18, 'out of a pit, and falling into the pit again; you ask somebody to pull');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 173, 6, 18, 'you out, he pulls you out, and then tomorrow you fall into the pit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 173, 7, 18, 'again. Every time you ask someone to pull you out, you fall into the pit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 173, 8, 18, 'again. When is it going to end?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 173, 9, 18, 'Be Honest with the Lord: What Do You Have Faith For?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 173, 10, 18, 'What has Jesus done for you up to this point? Jesus has forgiven you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 173, 11, 18, 'Then be honest and say, “I know Jesus as my Forgiver, but I do not know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 173, 12, 18, 'Him as my Savior. I know Him as One who forgives my sins, but not as One');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 173, 13, 18, 'Who saves me from my sins.” We have to be honest. If we are dishonest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 173, 14, 18, 'with ourselves, we will never come into the fullness of what the Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 173, 15, 18, 'promises us. God loves honest people. I encourage you to be honest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 173, 16, 18, 'before God, and say to Him honestly, from your heart, “Lord Jesus, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 173, 17, 18, 'only know You as my Forgiver. I do not know You as my Savior.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 173, 18, 18, 'If you''re honest with Him, and say, “Lord, I want to know You as my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 173, 19, 18, 'Savior, not only as One Who forgives me, Who keeps on lifting me out of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 173, 20, 18, 'the pit I fall into. Your promise is that You will save me from my sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 173, 21, 18, 'Your Name doesn''t just mean Forgiver; it means Savior! “He will save his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 173, 22, 18, 'people from their sins,” not simply, “He will Forgive them their sins.’”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 173, 23, 18, 'Of course He forgives us, thank God for that. None of us could live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 173, 24, 18, 'without His forgiveness. But He does more than that! He saves us, and we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 173, 25, 18, 'need to experience that, too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 173, 26, 18, 'Consider the story of the two blind men who once came to Jesus. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 173, 27, 18, 'Matthew 9:27, we read that two blind men followed Jesus and said, “Have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 173, 28, 18, 'mercy on us,” and Jesus asked them, “What do you want Me to do for you?”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 174, 1, 18, '(In the parallel passage in another gospel that becomes clear.) They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 174, 2, 18, 'said, “We want our eyes to be opened!” and then He asks them a question');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 174, 3, 18, 'in Matthew 9:28, “Do you believe that I am able to do this for you?”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 174, 4, 18, 'That''s a very important question. It''s an important question that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 174, 5, 18, 'Lord asks concerning anything He has promised when you make your request');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 174, 6, 18, 'to God. “Lord, I want my blind eyes to be opened,” or, “I want a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 174, 7, 18, 'sickness to be healed,” or, “I want to be saved from a particular sinful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 174, 8, 18, 'habit,” or, “Lord I want to get a job,” or, “I want to find a place to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 174, 9, 18, 'live.” There are so many things we can ask God for. God cares for all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 174, 10, 18, 'our needs, spiritual and physical, but the question that the Lord will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 174, 11, 18, 'ask us after we have made our specific requests to God is this: “Do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 174, 12, 18, 'believe that I can do this for you?” That is Jesus speaking.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 174, 13, 18, 'He''s not asking you, “Do you believe that you can overcome this sin.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 174, 14, 18, 'That''s a very liberating thought! Thank God that Christ does not ask you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 174, 15, 18, 'or me, “Do you believe that you can give up this sinful habit?” I would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 174, 16, 18, 'straight away answer, “No, Lord. I can’t give up any sinful habit. I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 174, 17, 18, 'such a slave to sin, being born as a child of Adam. Every single sin I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 174, 18, 18, 'a slave to. I''m a slave to anger, a slave to this, to that, and to any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 174, 19, 18, 'other - You name it - but I believe with all my heart that You can save');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 174, 20, 18, 'me from it.” That’s the question: do you believe? The Lord says, “I can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 174, 21, 18, 'do this for you.” Thank God for that! Jesus didn''t come teaching');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 174, 22, 18, 'psychology, on how to train ourselves or our mind, and He didn''t come to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 174, 23, 18, 'teach us yoga, how to control our thoughts or how to overcome anger with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 174, 24, 18, 'self-control.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 174, 25, 18, 'No. He''s asking you, “Do you believe that I can do this for you?” He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 174, 26, 18, 'said in John 15:5, “Without Me you can do nothing.” Thank God for that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 174, 27, 18, 'verse. I say, “Lord, You Yourself said, ‘Without You, I can do nothing.’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 174, 28, 18, 'I agree 100%.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 175, 1, 18, 'Christ’s Deliverance Produces Inward Uprightness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 175, 2, 18, 'A branch cannot bear fruit if it''s not in the tree, and every branch can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 175, 3, 18, 'say to its tree after being in that tree for 50 years, “Without you, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 175, 4, 18, 'can produce no fruit; but if I am in you, it’s almost effortless to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 175, 5, 18, 'produce fruit.” Do you think a branch is struggling? Look at a mango');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 175, 6, 18, 'tree: is that branch struggling to produce mangoes? No. But if you cut');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 175, 7, 18, 'that branch off of that tree, even if it''s been producing mangoes for 50');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 175, 8, 18, 'years, it stops producing immediately, because it withers. As long as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 175, 9, 18, 'it''s in the tree, though, the sap of the tree flows in, and that’s how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 175, 10, 18, 'the mangoes are produced. That’s the principle of overcoming sin and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 175, 11, 18, 'that''s what we need to teach every single person who is a disciple in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 175, 12, 18, 'every nation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 175, 13, 18, 'Dear friends, you have to understand (and if you''re a preacher, you’ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 175, 14, 18, 'got to make other people to understand) that without Christ, you cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 175, 15, 18, 'overcome any sin. You can overcome external sins, sure. But what does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 175, 16, 18, 'that prove? There are multitudes of atheists in the world who don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 175, 17, 18, 'murder anybody, and who won’t even commit adultery physically. To keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 175, 18, 18, 'the outside of the cup clean, you don''t need Jesus Christ; you just need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 175, 19, 18, 'to be a good Pharisee. There are non-Christians, even atheists, who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 175, 20, 18, 'never cheat, who are honest, and whose external life is very upright;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 175, 21, 18, 'but when it comes to the inner life, they are corrupt within. Inner');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 175, 22, 18, 'uprightness is more than self-control. You can keep from expressing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 175, 23, 18, 'anger outwardly with the powers of yoga, but that''s not deliverance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 175, 24, 18, 'That''s just closing the bottle tight so that the poison remains inside;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 175, 25, 18, 'it still destroys you. That''s not the deliverance that Christ offers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 175, 26, 18, 'Christ offers deliverance from the anger within. I can open the bottle,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 175, 27, 18, 'and there''s no poison there. If you look inside my heart, there’s no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 175, 28, 18, 'anger there; it is not by great effort that I am trying to keep my mouth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 176, 1, 18, 'shut and don''t lose my temper - that‘s yoga, but that''s not deliverance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 176, 2, 18, 'from anger. Deliverance from anger is where Christ delivers us from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 176, 3, 18, 'anger within our hearts. It’s completely gone, and if you look inside of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 176, 4, 18, 'one such heart, there is no anger. If you look inside that heart, there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 176, 5, 18, 'is no lusting after women. Only Jesus can do that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 176, 6, 18, 'According to Your Faith Be It Unto You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 176, 7, 18, 'Think again of the blind men who came to Jesus. After they made their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 176, 8, 18, 'request, the Lord asks them, “Do you believe that I''m able to do this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 176, 9, 18, 'for you?” Imagine that they came one by one to the Lord, and the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 176, 10, 18, 'asks the first man, “Do you believe that I''m able to open your eyes?”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 176, 11, 18, 'Not, “Do you believe that you can open your eyes with some exercise?” or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 176, 12, 18, 'any such thing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 176, 13, 18, 'Imagine if the first blind man says, “Well Lord, I will be happy if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 176, 14, 18, 'could open just one eye. That’s more than enough for me. I could survive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 176, 15, 18, 'on this earth with one eye, and I believe you can do that.” The Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 176, 16, 18, 'would reply to him just as He says in verse 29, “Be it done to you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 176, 17, 18, 'according to your faith.” Not, “According to My ability,” the Lord says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 176, 18, 18, '“but according to your faith.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 176, 19, 18, 'Do you know that the Lord does for us not according to His ability, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 176, 20, 18, 'according to our faith? If you don''t have faith for something, even if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 176, 21, 18, 'the Lord has ability to do more than that for you, you won’t experience');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 176, 22, 18, 'all that the Lord wants to do for you. You will only experience');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 176, 23, 18, 'deliverance according to the level of your faith. So when one man says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 176, 24, 18, '“I have faith to have only one eye open,” the Lord will say, “According');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 176, 25, 18, 'to your faith be done to you,” and he will go out of that room with one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 176, 26, 18, 'eye open and the other eye still shut. Now that''s pretty good; for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 176, 27, 18, 'blind man to have even one eye opened is fantastic.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 176, 28, 18, 'Then imagine that the other blind man comes, and the Lord asks him the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 177, 1, 18, 'same question, “Do you believe I can do this for you?” And he says, “Yes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 177, 2, 18, 'Lord! I believe You can open both of my eyes! What’s impossible for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 177, 3, 18, 'You?” He gets both eyes opened. If he meets the other blind man (who had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 177, 4, 18, 'only one eye opened), and that man asks, “How in the world did you get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 177, 5, 18, 'both eyes open?! This must be some false teaching!” It’s not false');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 177, 6, 18, 'teaching; the second blind man just had more faith than the first,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 177, 7, 18, 'that''s all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 177, 8, 18, 'We can think of these two eyes as being forgiven of our sins, and being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 177, 9, 18, 'saved from our sins. One person gets both; another person gets only the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 177, 10, 18, 'first one. Why is that? Is it because God was partial to that person? Is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 177, 11, 18, 'it because that person was a better person? No. He just had faith for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 177, 12, 18, 'all that Christ promised to do for him. One person only had faith that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 177, 13, 18, 'Christ could only forgive his sin, and so he got that. Another person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 177, 14, 18, 'doesn''t even have faith that Christ can forgive his sin, so he doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 177, 15, 18, 'get even forgiveness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 177, 16, 18, 'There are lots of people like that in the world. One has faith that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 177, 17, 18, 'Christ will forgive his sin, and he will get forgiveness. Another has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 177, 18, 18, 'faith for “both eyes,” that Christ can not only forgive me, but also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 177, 19, 18, 'deliver me from that sinful habit. He gets both. And when a person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 177, 20, 18, 'proclaims both, that Christ can not only forgive, us but also deliver');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 177, 21, 18, 'us, then people who have experienced only forgiveness will call that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 177, 22, 18, 'greater deliverance a false teaching. Because they haven''t experienced');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 177, 23, 18, 'it themselves, they say it''s impossible. They say it''s impossible for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 177, 24, 18, 'any human being to have deliverance from sin. But the question is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 177, 25, 18, 'whether it''s impossible for men. The question is, is it impossible for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 177, 26, 18, 'God?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 177, 27, 18, 'Jesus said there is nothing impossible for God. Many things are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 177, 28, 18, 'impossible for man. It’s impossible for a man even to get forgiveness of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 178, 1, 18, 'sins without God''s power, but with God, nothing is impossible. Please');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 178, 2, 18, 'remember that if you don''t experience something that somebody else does,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 178, 3, 18, 'it''s not necessarily because he has some false teaching; it could be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 178, 4, 18, 'because you don''t believe as much as he does.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 178, 5, 18, 'To use another illustration, imagine that rain is falling equally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 178, 6, 18, 'outside everybody''s house and there''s a shortage of water in the town,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 178, 7, 18, 'so the people put containers outside to collect the rainwater. If one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 178, 8, 18, 'man puts a little cup outside his house, how much rain is he going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 178, 9, 18, 'get? Just a full cup. If another person puts a huge tub outside his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 178, 10, 18, 'house, how much water does he get? A full tub! Is there a difference');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 178, 11, 18, 'between a full tub and a full cup? Certainly! The man with the full cup');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 178, 12, 18, 'might say, “How in the world did you get a full tub of water? God was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 178, 13, 18, 'partial to you, sending more rain in front of your house!” The man with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 178, 14, 18, 'the tub would respond, “No; the same amount of rain fell outside your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 178, 15, 18, 'house, too brother, but you only had a little cup outside! That was the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 178, 16, 18, 'level of your faith, and so that''s all you got.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 178, 17, 18, 'We get from God according to the proportion of our faith. God''s blessing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 178, 18, 18, 'is unlimited. Ephesians 1:3 says He has “blessed us with every spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 178, 19, 18, 'blessing in the heavenly places,” every blessing of the Holy Spirit to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 178, 20, 18, 'deliver us from every single wretched sinful habit that we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 178, 21, 18, 'inherited from Adam, our forefather. We have all inherited the same evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 178, 22, 18, 'nature from Adam. Every evil man in the world has the same evil flesh');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 178, 23, 18, 'that you and I have. Our circumstances and upbringing might have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 178, 24, 18, 'restrained us from doing some of the terrible, evil things that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 178, 25, 18, 'terrorists do. But we''ve got the same flesh that they do, and we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 178, 26, 18, 'only be delivered from it by the power of Jesus Christ, through the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 178, 27, 18, 'Spirit. That''s important for us to remember and to explain when we teach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 178, 28, 18, 'people all that Jesus commanded. His commandments can be fulfilled only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 179, 1, 18, 'through the power of the Holy Spirit, particularly in these two areas.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 179, 2, 18, 'The New Covenant Life Is Much Higher');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 179, 3, 18, 'In the Old Testament, how did the Lord tell people to overcome anger?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 179, 4, 18, 'Ephesians 4:26, “Be angry and don''t sin,” it is actually a quotation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 179, 5, 18, 'from Psalm 4:4, which says “Tremble, and do not sin.” You may tremble');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 179, 6, 18, 'with anger but don''t let that anger become sinful. And the solution for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 179, 7, 18, 'that is to go and, “Meditate in your heart upon your bed, be still, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 179, 8, 18, 'trust in the Lord” (Psalm 4:4-5).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 179, 9, 18, 'The Old Testament solution for anger was, whenever you''re upset with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 179, 10, 18, 'somebody, withdraw from that person. Go and lock yourself up in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 179, 11, 18, 'bedroom, and lie down on your bed and meditate on God till you cool');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 179, 12, 18, 'down, and trust in the Lord to take care of that situation. That was all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 179, 13, 18, 'that''s possible. So in the Old Testament, you could control the words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 179, 14, 18, 'that come out of your mouth in a manner somewhat similar to yoga.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 179, 15, 18, 'But in the New Testament, God has given us the Holy Spirit, and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 179, 16, 18, 'fruit of the Holy Spirit is self-control from within. Jesus Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 179, 17, 18, 'delivers us inwardly from that anger.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 179, 18, 18, 'It’s exactly the same with lusting with the eyes. In Matthew 5, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 179, 19, 18, 'speaks about lusting with the eyes, and He goes on to say that nobody in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 179, 20, 18, 'the Old Testament could overcome it. The tenth commandment in Exodus 20');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 179, 21, 18, 'was the one commandment that nobody could keep. I don''t know whether you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 179, 22, 18, 'know that. The first nine were all external commands, and they’re all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 179, 23, 18, 'that anybody could keep. But the tenth Commandment was, “You shall not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 179, 24, 18, 'lust after your neighbor''s house or his wife or male servant or …');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 179, 25, 18, 'anything that belongs to your neighbor.” Every woman that walks on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 179, 26, 18, 'street is either your neighbor''s daughter or your neighbor’s wife, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 179, 27, 18, 'it says you''re not supposed to lust after them. This was actually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 179, 28, 18, 'written as the Tenth Commandment, and nobody could keep it. Nobody in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 180, 1, 18, 'the Old Testament could keep that commandment.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 180, 2, 18, 'The Apostle Paul once said, “According to the righteousness of the law,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 180, 3, 18, 'I was found blameless.” When he testified before a high priest in Acts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 180, 4, 18, '23:1, “I have lived with a perfectly good conscience before God until');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 180, 5, 18, 'this day,” what did he mean? He meant that he was keeping all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 180, 6, 18, 'commandments. What commandments was he keeping? Only the first nine,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 180, 7, 18, 'because he''s honest enough to say in Romans 7:7-8, that when he came to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 180, 8, 18, 'the tenth commandment, which said, “You shall not covet, you shall not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 180, 9, 18, 'lust,” he “found lusting of every kind.” He discovered every type of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 180, 10, 18, 'lust - a lust for money, a lust for other people''s wives and daughters,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 180, 11, 18, 'lust for honor, and every type of lust - within himself, and realized he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 180, 12, 18, 'could not keep this commandment.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 180, 13, 18, 'The Holy Spirit Strengthens Us Inwardly to Fulfill the Sermon on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 180, 14, 18, 'Mount');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 180, 15, 18, 'When the Apostle Paul was filled with the Holy Spirit in his heart (just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 180, 16, 18, 'like when the Holy Spirit came and filled people on the day of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 180, 17, 18, 'Pentecost), he says in Romans 8:2, that “the law of the Holy Spirit -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 180, 18, 18, 'which is not ten commandments but - the law of life in Christ Jesus, set');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 180, 19, 18, 'me free from the law of sin that kept causing me to fall into anger and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 180, 20, 18, 'lust and everything else,” and he goes on in verse 4 to say, “the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 180, 21, 18, 'righteous requirement of the law - which is “You shall not lust” - is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 180, 22, 18, 'now fulfilled inside of us because we don''t walk according to the flesh,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 180, 23, 18, 'but we walk according to the leading of the Holy Spirit.” This was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 180, 24, 18, 'impossible under the old covenant.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 180, 25, 18, 'When Jesus spoke about overcoming these sins in Matthew 5, He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 180, 26, 18, 'talking about something that is impossible for a man to do without the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 180, 27, 18, 'power of the Holy Spirit. If you read Matthew 5, 6 and 7, you find that,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 180, 28, 18, 'at the end of those three chapters, the most important question has not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 181, 1, 18, 'been answered. What is that? “Lord, how do I live this life?” That’s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 181, 2, 18, 'even mentioned in Matthew 5, 6 and 7! The Sermon on the Mount just shows');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 181, 3, 18, 'us the standard of life that God expects of a new covenant Christian, of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 181, 4, 18, 'a born-again Christian, but how to get there is not mentioned in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 181, 5, 18, 'whole sermon.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 181, 6, 18, 'Then how in the world will we know what to do? I believe that Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 181, 7, 18, 'only proclaimed the Sermon on the Mount to create a desire in our heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 181, 8, 18, 'for this life, and that, if a person has a longing for this life, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 181, 9, 18, 'will go to God and say, “Lord, what''s the solution?” And Lord will say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 181, 10, 18, '“You need to be filled with the Holy Spirit. You need to be strengthened');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 181, 11, 18, 'in the inner man.” There are a lot of counterfeit experiences of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 181, 12, 18, 'Holy Spirit today, which only emphasize speaking in tongues, but this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 181, 13, 18, 'inner life of freedom from sin is not emphasized. I thank God that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 181, 14, 18, 'speak in tongues - I have spoken in tongues for 35 years - but the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 181, 15, 18, 'fullness of the Holy Spirit brought something far more important into my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 181, 16, 18, 'life: it brought deliverance from inner sin! That''s the primary purpose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 181, 17, 18, 'of the fullness of the Holy Spirit, so let''s seek God for that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 181, 18, 19, 'Chapter 18 How to Overcome');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 181, 19, 19, 'Adultery and Lustful Thinking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 181, 20, 19, '“You have heard that it was said, ’You shall not commit adultery’”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 181, 21, 19, '(Matthew 5:27). That was the standard under the Old Testament. Jesus was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 181, 22, 19, 'explaining what was behind that command. It is not just a question of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 181, 23, 19, 'physically avoiding adultery; it’s about not even lusting inwardly after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 181, 24, 19, 'a woman. God has put a strong sexual desire in all men, and this desire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 181, 25, 19, 'rises up in the early teenage years. It becomes strong and lasts for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 181, 26, 19, 'many decades.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 181, 27, 19, 'Why has God allowed such a strong desire within man? A woman doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 181, 28, 19, 'have such a strong desire for sex. God could have kept the sexual desire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 182, 1, 19, 'low in a man just as in a woman, but in His great wisdom, He has made it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 182, 2, 19, 'much stronger in a man, and there is a reason for that. God wants us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 182, 3, 19, 'be overcomers, and this is an area where we should overcome before we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 182, 4, 19, 'get married. God could have made man in such a way that he didn''t get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 182, 5, 19, 'this desire till he was 25 or 26, when he gets married. But yet God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 182, 6, 19, 'allowed this desire to come up in our hearts when we are 12 to 13 years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 182, 7, 19, 'old. From that time, we have to battle it constantly, and God wants us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 182, 8, 19, 'to overcome in our thought life before we are married. This is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 182, 9, 19, 'reason why He gives us 13 to 14 years to fight and struggle - to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 182, 10, 19, 'overcome before we get married. It doesn''t have to take that long if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 182, 11, 19, 'are faithful and have a radical attitude. If we are to overcome, then we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 182, 12, 19, 'have to be honest and acknowledge that it''s impossible to overcome in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 182, 13, 19, 'our own human power.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 182, 14, 19, 'Genuine Fullness of the Holy Spirit Leads Us to Overcome');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 182, 15, 19, 'The great Apostle Paul was a very upright man according to the law, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 182, 16, 19, 'even he could not overcome this desire until he was filled with the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 182, 17, 19, 'Spirit, and then the Spirit of God set him free. This is like Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 182, 18, 19, 'opening the blind man''s eyes: the blind man couldn''t open them by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 182, 19, 19, 'himself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 182, 20, 19, 'It is only through the power of the Holy Spirit that this is possible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 182, 21, 19, 'In fact, we can live up to everything Jesus spoke about in the Sermon on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 182, 22, 19, 'the Mount only if we are filled with the Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 182, 23, 19, 'I''m not talking about the cheap counterfeits that are going around today');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 182, 24, 19, 'under the name of “fullness of the spirit”. If the fullness of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 182, 25, 19, 'spirit that you claim to have experienced made you shake, roll on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 182, 26, 19, 'ground, laugh, and speak in tongues, but you are defeated by the sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 182, 27, 19, 'like anger and sexual lust, if you still raise your voice at your wife');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 182, 28, 19, 'or husband, then you have not been filled with the Holy Spirit. Don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 183, 1, 19, 'let anybody deceive you. Many people are deceived. The Holy Spirit gives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 183, 2, 19, 'us a new tongue, not just the ability to speak in unknown tongues, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 183, 3, 19, 'even to control our mother tongue. It is of no use to speak in unknown');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 183, 4, 19, 'tongues on Sunday morning in church and yet shout at your wife in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 183, 5, 19, 'mother tongue on Sunday afternoon. That''s not the fullness of the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 183, 6, 19, 'Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 183, 7, 19, 'The fullness of the Holy Spirit gives us control over our tongues. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 183, 8, 19, 'fruit of the Spirit is self-control, and He gives us control over our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 183, 9, 19, 'tongues 24 hours a day, seven days a week. If this is not the case, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 183, 10, 19, 'should ask God to give you a genuine fullness of the Holy Spirit. Thank');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 183, 11, 19, 'God for the gifts of the Spirit, but ask God for the genuine fullness of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 183, 12, 19, 'the Spirit, which is beyond just having the gifts of the Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 183, 13, 19, 'That’s the only way to overcome. There is no other way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 183, 14, 19, 'James says that every animal has been tamed by man, but no man can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 183, 15, 19, 'control the tongue (James 3:7-8). Only the Holy Spirit can. If you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 183, 16, 19, 'filled with the Holy Spirit, He will give you control over your tongue');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 183, 17, 19, 'and over your eyes. These are the two parts of the human body that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 183, 18, 19, 'spoke of in relation to sin in Matthew 5:21 -32. Sinning with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 183, 19, 19, 'tongue, and sinning with the eyes. Both are very, very important.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 183, 20, 19, 'Don''t ever be satisfied with any cheap counterfeit of the fullness of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 183, 21, 19, 'the Holy Spirit if it does not give you control over your tongue and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 183, 22, 19, 'control over your eyes. Go before God and say, “Lord I''ve got a cheap');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 183, 23, 19, 'counterfeit. I want to be honest with You. I''m just convincing people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 183, 24, 19, 'that I’m filled with the Holy Spirit, and that is worth nothing. I don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 183, 25, 19, 'want to miss out on the genuine fullness of the Holy Spirit.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 183, 26, 19, 'When I was a young Christian, I was defeated in both of these areas. As');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 183, 27, 19, 'I sought for the fullness of the Holy Spirit, people sent me to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 183, 28, 19, 'different assemblies, but I was so disappointed with what I saw there. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 184, 1, 19, 'heard a lot of noise and I said, “Lord, this is not what I''m looking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 184, 2, 19, 'for. I’m looking for power to overcome sin. Even if it takes ten years,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 184, 3, 19, 'I want the real thing. I want what Peter, James and John got on the day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 184, 4, 19, 'of Pentecost, not the cheap counterfeit that''s going around the world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 184, 5, 19, 'today.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 184, 6, 19, 'The devil wants people to be satisfied with some counterfeit. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 184, 7, 19, 'were going to buy gold or diamonds, or even currency notes, how careful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 184, 8, 19, 'you would be to ensure that you don''t get a counterfeit. If you know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 184, 9, 19, 'there''s a lot of counterfeit currency going around, you will be careful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 184, 10, 19, 'to look at the five hundred rupee notes you pick up. How much more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 184, 11, 19, 'careful we need to be about something that concerns our eternal destiny:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 184, 12, 19, 'the genuine fullness of the Holy Spirit! Don''t be satisfied with a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 184, 13, 19, 'counterfeit. If you are not satisfied with counterfeit gold and diamonds');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 184, 14, 19, 'and currency notes, how much more you should not be satisfied with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 184, 15, 19, 'counterfeit in the area of the fullness of the Spirit. This is the test:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 184, 16, 19, 'has the Spirit of God set you free from the law of sin and death (Romans');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 184, 17, 19, '8:2)? That''s the test.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 184, 18, 19, 'Be Honest to Overcome');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 184, 19, 19, 'In Matthew 5:28, Jesus says, “Everyone who looks on a woman to lust');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 184, 20, 19, 'after her has already committed adultery with her in his heart.” We need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 184, 21, 19, 'to go to God for deliverance from this, and the first step is to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 184, 22, 19, 'honest. If you got angry, be honest. Go to the person you wronged and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 184, 23, 19, 'say, “Brother, I''m sorry. I am sorry for the way I spoke to you,” and if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 184, 24, 19, 'you sinned ten times a day in anger, go ten times to that person and say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 184, 25, 19, 'you''re sorry. If God sees you’re honest and you’re humble, He will give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 184, 26, 19, 'you the power to be free from it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 184, 27, 19, 'But if you cover up, make an excuse, and try to justify your anger, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 184, 28, 19, 'will never be free. The only time you are justified in anger is when it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 185, 1, 19, 'concerns the glory of God, not when it concerns yourself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 185, 2, 19, 'When it comes to lusting after women, you are never justified. You can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 185, 3, 19, 'look at your wife and admire her, but not any other woman. That''s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 185, 4, 19, 'God''s will. God says you have to be radical here. First of all, you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 185, 5, 19, 'to be honest and say, “Lord, I committed adultery.” Don''t ever say, “I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 185, 6, 19, 'admired a beautiful face.” Instead, say, “I committed adultery.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 185, 7, 19, 'If you are honest, God will deliver you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 185, 8, 19, 'Be Radical to Overcome');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 185, 9, 19, 'The other thing is you must do is be radical. The Bible says, “Flee from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 185, 10, 19, 'immorality” (1 Corinthians 6:18). If you are at the computer and you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 185, 11, 19, 'tempted, either run away from it or turn it off and say, “Lord I don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 185, 12, 19, 'care what I miss, but I don''t want to fall here.” When Jesus says, “If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 185, 13, 19, 'your right eye makes you stumble, tear it out,” He is not telling us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 185, 14, 19, 'physically pull out our right eye. That''s obvious because you can still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 185, 15, 19, 'lust with the left eye. The meaning is that you must take a radical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 185, 16, 19, 'attitude towards sin, a radical attitude towards your tongue and your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 185, 17, 19, 'eyes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 185, 18, 19, 'Be like a blind and dumb man at that time when you are tempted. Can a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 185, 19, 19, 'dumb man raise his voice and shout at someone? Can a blind man lust? No.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 185, 20, 19, 'Be like a blind man and say, “Lord, You didn’t give me eyes to lust');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 185, 21, 19, 'after women. You gave me eyes to see Your glory.” Jesus says that if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 185, 22, 19, 'don''t do that, you might preserve the physical parts of your body, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 185, 23, 19, 'you’ll still be thrown into Hell. It is better for you lose one part of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 185, 24, 19, 'your body (i.e., voluntarily refusing sinful pleasure that your physical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 185, 25, 19, 'body craves for) and go into God''s kingdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 185, 26, 19, 'In the same way, Jesus says, “If you sin sexually with your right hand,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 185, 27, 19, 'and that makes you stumble, cut it off” (Matthew 5:30). Imagine that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 185, 28, 19, 'have an amputated hand and that you can’t sin with your right hand or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 186, 1, 19, 'left hand. Jesus was very down to earth and practical. Jesus tells you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 186, 2, 19, 'to act as if you''re blind, as if you’re amputated, because sin is very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 186, 3, 19, 'serious. If we take such a radical attitude, I believe God will help us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 186, 4, 19, 'to be completely free, and we will have better marriages as well. Don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 186, 5, 19, 'think marriage will solve the problem of lust. There are lots of married');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 186, 6, 19, 'people who fall into adultery in their thoughts all the time. Every day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 186, 7, 19, 'there are many married people who watch internet pornography. Marriage');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 186, 8, 19, 'doesn''t solve that problem because it''s an inner desire. If you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 186, 9, 19, 'battle it in the power of the Holy Spirit, you''ll be defeated, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 186, 10, 19, 'you’ll delude yourself all your life that you''re a spiritual Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 186, 11, 19, 'when you''re not.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 186, 12, 19, 'Is this some postgraduate level of Christianity that Jesus is speaking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 186, 13, 19, 'about? No, He''s just talking about how to escape Hell. Escaping Hell is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 186, 14, 19, 'not postgraduate Christian material. It is elementary. Jesus says that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 186, 15, 19, 'it''s better for your body part to perish than for your whole body to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 186, 16, 19, 'thrown into Hell. Salvation from Hell is the bare minimum, and this is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 186, 17, 19, 'what Jesus wants us to teach every disciple in every nation. How much is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 186, 18, 19, 'this being taught? Hardly at all, and that is why I have been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 186, 19, 19, 'commissioned by the Lord personally in my own ministry to keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 186, 20, 19, 'emphasizing it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 186, 21, 19, 'Jesus’s Teaching on Divorce');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 186, 22, 19, 'In Matthew 5:31, Jesus goes on to speak about another type of adultery.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 186, 23, 19, 'The Old Testament standard was to send your wife away with a certificate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 186, 24, 19, 'of divorce. It was not that God was telling people to divorce their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 186, 25, 19, 'wives. He was not even permitting divorce like the Pharisees said. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 186, 26, 19, 'never wanted man to divorce his wife from the time he created Adam and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 186, 27, 19, 'Eve. God did not make two women for Adam to choose which one he wanted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 186, 28, 19, '(“if you get fed up with one, just choose the other!”). He made only one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 187, 1, 19, 'woman for Adam, and He has made one woman to be your wife. That is God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 187, 2, 19, 'will; Jesus said that very clearly in Matthew 19. But Satan has lead man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 187, 3, 19, 'astray, and it is a fact that people divorce. So the law was given. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 187, 4, 19, 'is mentioned here in Matthew 5:31, which is a quotation from Deuteronomy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 187, 5, 19, '24. If you read Deuteronomy 24, it doesn''t say God permitted divorce.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 187, 6, 19, 'God said if you do divorce your wife -- out of your own choice -- at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 187, 7, 19, 'least give her a certificate of divorce so that she can go away decently');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 187, 8, 19, '(Deuteronomy 24:1). That is what He meant when saying ‘Whoever sends his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 187, 9, 19, 'wife away, let him give her a certificate of divorce.’ It is different');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 187, 10, 19, 'from permitting divorce.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 187, 11, 19, 'But He says, “I say to you, I’m raising the standard. You can’t just get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 187, 12, 19, 'away with giving a certificate of divorce. I say to you that if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 187, 13, 19, 'divorce your wife except for the cause of unchastity, you are making her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 187, 14, 19, 'commit adultery. And if you marry a divorced woman, you are committing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 187, 15, 19, 'adultery.” You cannot lower that standard. It is being lowered all over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 187, 16, 19, 'in Christendom, particularly in Western Christianity today; but you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 187, 17, 19, 'cannot change God''s Word. Let God be true and every man a liar. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 187, 18, 19, 'doesn''t matter if 90% of Christendom accepts divorce. It is still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 187, 19, 19, 'against the Word of God. We have the tragic situation today of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 187, 20, 19, 'Christians, even well known Christian leaders and preachers, disobeying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 187, 21, 19, 'the Word, which says that whoever marries a divorced woman commits');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 187, 22, 19, 'adultery. There are great preachers I know who married divorced women');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 187, 23, 19, 'and justified it by saying that God led them to do it. Imagine using the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 187, 24, 19, 'name of God to justify one''s own desire and lust. And there are many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 187, 25, 19, 'pastors and preachers today who are divorced themselves, and who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 187, 26, 19, 'marrying divorced women, completely ignoring Scripture.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 187, 27, 19, 'Seek for Purity in the Church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 187, 28, 19, 'This is a day when reverence for God and His Word has disappeared');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 188, 1, 19, 'completely, and there''s a great need to come back to what Jesus said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 188, 2, 19, 'about going into every nation, making disciples, and teaching them to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 188, 3, 19, 'every single thing He commanded. Will you have a large church as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 188, 4, 19, 'result? No! Many people will get offended and leave your church, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 188, 5, 19, 'this way to life is very narrow and few there’ll be who find it. Is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 188, 6, 19, 'Lord interested in a large church? Far from it. He''s interested in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 188, 7, 19, 'pure church. And if it is pure and large, then praise the Lord. But if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 188, 8, 19, 'it''s a choice between numbers and purity, the Lord says, “Purity is what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 188, 9, 19, 'I want.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 188, 10, 19, 'What about you? Is that your position too? The vast majority of pastors');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 188, 11, 19, 'and preachers do not preach the whole truth because they''re afraid some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 188, 12, 19, 'people will leave their congregations, but your congregation will become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 188, 13, 19, 'a better congregation when those people leave. Don’t you pull the weeds');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 188, 14, 19, 'out your garden to keep your garden fresh and fruitful? That''s what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 188, 15, 19, 'needs to be done in a church too. The standard is, God hates divorce. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 188, 16, 19, 'said that in Malachi 2:16, “I hate divorce.” He hated divorce even in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 188, 17, 19, 'the Old Testament, and Jesus makes it very clear that anyone who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 188, 18, 19, 'divorces is committing adultery (verse 32).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 188, 19, 19, 'Both Adulteries: Lustful Thinking and Divorce Are Equally Serious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 188, 20, 19, 'Jesus actually taught us about two adulteries: one is to lust after a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 188, 21, 19, 'woman (Matthew 5:28), and the other is divorce. Both are equal to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 188, 22, 19, 'adultery. Many people ask me about the stand of my church on divorce,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 188, 23, 19, 'but never till today has anybody asked me about the stand of my church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 188, 24, 19, 'on lusting after women. Why is that? Why is there so much emphasis on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 188, 25, 19, 'adultery number two (divorce), and not as much emphasis on adultery');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 188, 26, 19, 'number one (lusting)? There are churches that take a very strong stand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 188, 27, 19, 'against divorce (praise the Lord, they even put people out). But what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 188, 28, 19, 'about taking an equally strong stand on adultery number one, which is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 189, 1, 19, 'lusting after women? We can be very hard on divorced people, but not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 189, 2, 19, 'hard on people who are lusting with their eyes. Is there a difference?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 189, 3, 19, 'Both are adultery in God''s eyes, and we need to take them both');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 189, 4, 19, 'seriously. Some of you may say, “Well I''m not divorcing my wife. I''m a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 189, 5, 19, 'pretty holy person,” but you lust with your eyes. That is equal to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 189, 6, 19, 'adultery too. Why is it that so many Christians who would never dream of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 189, 7, 19, 'divorcing their wives, lust with their eyes? It’s because they have not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 189, 8, 19, 'seen that both are equally adultery. They have not taken God''s Word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 189, 9, 19, 'exactly as it is.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 189, 10, 19, 'God Looks for The Humble and Contrite Person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 189, 11, 19, 'The latter half of Isaiah, beginning with chapter 40, has some fantastic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 189, 12, 19, 'promises for Christians. There are two parts in Isaiah, the first 39');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 189, 13, 19, 'chapters correspond to the first 39 books of the Old Testament, and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 189, 14, 19, 'next 27 chapters correspond to the 27 books in the New Testament. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 189, 15, 19, 'last 27 chapters of Isaiah are essentially new covenant prophecies - a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 189, 16, 19, 'lot of them referring to Christ and a lot of them referring to us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 189, 17, 19, 'follow in Jesus’ footsteps - and so there are some fantastic promises in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 189, 18, 19, 'Isaiah chapters 40 to 66 which essentially relate to us in the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 189, 19, 19, 'Covenant.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 189, 20, 19, 'Isaiah 66:1-2 is a picture of building the true Church of Jesus Christ,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 189, 21, 19, 'against which the gates of Hell will never prevail. “Heaven is My throne');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 189, 22, 19, 'and the Earth is My footstool, where''s the house that you''re going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 189, 23, 19, 'build for Me? Where''s the church that you human beings, you people who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 189, 24, 19, 'call yourselves born again Christians, are going to build for Me?”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 189, 25, 19, 'When the Lord says, “To this one I will look,” He is describing the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 189, 26, 19, 'person that He will look upon with favor to build His church, against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 189, 27, 19, 'which the gates of Hell will not prevail. A church against which Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 189, 28, 19, 'cannot infiltrate with anger, lust, adultery, lying, stealing, and all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 190, 1, 19, 'the other wretched things that are found in the race of Adam.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 190, 2, 19, '“I will look at the one who is humble and contrite of spirit” (Isaiah');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 190, 3, 19, '66:2). The number one quality He is looking for is humility and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 190, 4, 19, 'contrition, or brokenness of spirit. God looks at people who have a low');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 190, 5, 19, 'opinion of themselves, not low self-esteem. Jesus did not have low');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 190, 6, 19, 'self-esteem. He was the Son of God. He told His disciples, “I am your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 190, 7, 19, 'Lord and Master. You call me that, and so I am” (John 13:14). He had no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 190, 8, 19, 'doubt about Who He was. He knew He was the Son of God. He didn''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 190, 9, 19, 'any low self-esteem. But he had such tremendous humility that He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 190, 10, 19, 'considered others as people whom He should serve, and He would wash');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 190, 11, 19, 'their feet. Do you know that He even washed the feet of Judas Iscariot?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 190, 12, 19, 'That is humility, washing the feet of one who is going to betray you in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 190, 13, 19, 'a few hours. He had no low self-esteem, but took a low position. He had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 190, 14, 19, 'low thoughts about Himself. In our relation to others, Philippians 2:3');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 190, 15, 19, 'says, “Consider others as more important than yourself.” That is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 190, 16, 19, 'number one quality, brokenness of spirit. A brokenness in sorrow because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 190, 17, 19, 'we’re not like Christ. God looks at that type of person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 190, 18, 19, 'Tremble at God’s Word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 190, 19, 19, 'The second quality in a person that God looks for in Isaiah 66:2 is,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 190, 20, 19, '“One who trembles at My Word.” This is so important to consider in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 190, 21, 19, 'connection to what we are studying in Matthew 5. When you read words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 190, 22, 19, 'like these, do you tremble at God''s Word? At the word that says that if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 190, 23, 19, 'you get angry and speak in that anger to a person, you''re guilty enough');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 190, 24, 19, 'to go to Hell? Do you tremble at the Word that says that if you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 190, 25, 19, 'take a radical attitude to cut off bodily members that cause you to lust');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 190, 26, 19, 'with your eyes and commit sexual sin your eyes or your hands, you must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 190, 27, 19, 'take a radical attitude, otherwise you will go to Hell? Do you tremble');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 190, 28, 19, 'at that Word?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 191, 1, 19, 'I find very few Christians who tremble at that Word, even among those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 191, 2, 19, 'who have heard me preach about this for years. I''m sorry to say that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 191, 3, 19, 'even in some of the churches where I have responsibility, where people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 191, 4, 19, 'have heard me preach against these sins for 25 years, they still do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 191, 5, 19, 'tremble at this Word. That is the condition of a lot of Christians:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 191, 6, 19, 'they''ve got the knowledge, but they take it lightly. How can you take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 191, 7, 19, 'sin lightly when you see the price that Christ paid on the cross to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 191, 8, 19, 'deliver us from sin? There is a hymn that I often sing to myself, which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 191, 9, 19, 'says:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 191, 10, 19, 'Ever when tempted make me see,Beneath the olives'' moon-pierced shade,My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 191, 11, 19, 'God alone outstretched and bruisedAnd bleeding on the earth He made.And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 191, 12, 19, 'make me feel it was my sin,As though no other sins were there.That was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 191, 13, 19, 'to Him Who bears the worldA load that He could scarcely bear.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 191, 14, 19, 'I sing that many times to myself to remind myself how my Lord, Who could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 191, 15, 19, 'bear the load of this universe on His shoulder, couldn''t bear the load');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 191, 16, 19, 'of my sin. It crushed Him on Calvary -- and that''s what has helped me to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 191, 17, 19, 'have a tremendous hatred for sin, and has caused me to tremble at God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 191, 18, 19, 'Word. And this is what makes me have a burden to educate Christians, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 191, 19, 19, 'help them to know that sins like lusting with your eyes are worse than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 191, 20, 19, 'getting AIDS, or cancer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 191, 21, 19, 'Take These Sins More Seriously Than AIDS');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 191, 22, 19, 'The day you understand that, you will fight these sins radically. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 191, 23, 19, 'wouldn''t play the fool with syringes infected with AIDS. Why are you so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 191, 24, 19, 'careful about them, and are yet not careful about something far worse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 191, 25, 19, 'than AIDS? I’ll tell you why: because you don''t believe that sin is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 191, 26, 19, 'worse than AIDS and cancer, you don''t tremble at God''s Word. I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 191, 27, 19, 'learned to believe this, and that''s why I''m extremely careful with these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 191, 28, 19, 'sins such as anger, lusting after women, and divorce. To enter Kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 192, 1, 19, 'of Heaven, our righteousness must surpass that of the scribes and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 192, 2, 19, 'Pharisees.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 192, 3, 19, 'I find very few Christians who take this seriously, and very few');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 192, 4, 19, 'preachers who preach it seriously. The Sermon on the Mount is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 192, 5, 19, 'fundamental requirement that we need to have. Jesus said, “Unless your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 192, 6, 19, 'righteousness surpasses the righteousness of the scribes and Pharisees,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 192, 7, 19, 'you will not enter the kingdom of heaven” (Matthew 5:20).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 192, 8, 19, 'I believe this with all my heart. The Lord is expecting Christians to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 192, 9, 19, 'show a quality of righteousness that is way above the Ten Commandments.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 192, 10, 19, 'Idolatry is not bowing down before idols of wood and stone. It’s giving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 192, 11, 19, 'something other than God a place in my heart. The Sabbath is not just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 192, 12, 19, 'not doing work on a Sabbath day; it is an inner life of rest. Adultery');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 192, 13, 19, 'is not just physical adultery; it’s lusting with the eyes. Murder is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 192, 14, 19, 'just killing someone; it is anger. And so on with all the commandments,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 192, 15, 19, 'as we will look at later on.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 192, 16, 19, 'Be the Person God Looks for to Build His Church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 192, 17, 19, 'Let us learn to tremble at God''s Word so that God can use us to build');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 192, 18, 19, 'His church. The type of person God will look for and use to build His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 192, 19, 19, 'House is what we saw in Isaiah 66:1-2. May God help us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 192, 20, 20, 'Chapter 19 Love the Spirit of Truth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 192, 21, 20, 'New Covenant Righteousness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 192, 22, 20, 'The section beginning in Matthew 5:33 is an expansion of what Jesus said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 192, 23, 20, 'in Matthew 5:20, “Your righteousness must surpass or exceed the quality');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 192, 24, 20, 'of the righteousness of the Pharisees (which is only external).” Your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 192, 25, 20, 'righteousness must be internal as well. Jesus was expanding our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 192, 26, 20, 'understanding of the Ten Commandments. He was saying that “murder” means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 192, 27, 20, 'more than murder; it means anger in the heart. He said that “adultery”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 192, 28, 20, 'means more than adultery; it means lusting after a woman in your heart,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 193, 1, 20, 'or divorcing her.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 193, 2, 20, 'Let Your “Yes” Be “Yes,” and Your “No” Be “No”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 193, 3, 20, 'Then Jesus went on to the matter of making vows (Mathew 5:33). In the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 193, 4, 20, 'Old Testament, the law said, “You shall not make false vows but shall');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 193, 5, 20, 'fulfill your vows to the Lord,” and, “You shall not bear false witness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 193, 6, 20, 'against your neighbor.” In today’s terms, a vow is like swearing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 193, 7, 20, 'something under oath. People put their hand on a Bible and say that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 193, 8, 20, 'will speak the truth. What they really mean is, “Most of the time I tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 193, 9, 20, 'lies, but now I''m going to speak the truth.” That’s what the meaning of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 193, 10, 20, 'a vow is when someone puts their hand on a Bible and swears by it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 193, 11, 20, 'However, in James it says you should be speaking the truth all the time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 193, 12, 20, '(James 5:12), and that’s what Jesus said here.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 193, 13, 20, 'The sum and substance of Matthew 5:33-37 is that we should always be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 193, 14, 20, 'truthful. We must not be ingenious and clever and subtle with our words,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 193, 15, 20, 'and claim to speak the truth legally as if it were in a court of law. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 193, 16, 20, 'must be known as truthful people and not tell lies in anything. Our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 193, 17, 20, '“yes” must be “yes” and our “no” must be “no.” Anything other than that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 193, 18, 20, 'is evil. If I have to say “yes” in a devious way, there is something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 193, 19, 20, 'wrong and that will ultimately lead to hypocrisy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 193, 20, 20, 'If you read the Ten Commandments in Exodus 20, it did not say, “You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 193, 21, 20, 'shall not tell lies.” The ninth commandment was, “You shall not bear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 193, 22, 20, 'false witness against your neighbor.” That was basically referring to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 193, 23, 20, 'court of law, and that in a court of law you must not tell a lie. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 193, 24, 20, 'other words, if you swear to something you must speak the truth. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 193, 25, 20, 'was the standard in the Old Testament because God knew that nobody could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 193, 26, 20, 'keep a command to not tell lies. Similarly, there was no commandment in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 193, 27, 20, 'the Old Testament saying, “You shall not lose your temper,” because God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 193, 28, 20, 'knew nobody could keep such a commandment. Back then, the commandment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 194, 1, 20, 'was “You shall not murder.” Similarly, there was no commandment in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 194, 2, 20, 'Old Testament that said, “Don''t lust after a woman,” because God knew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 194, 3, 20, 'nobody could keep it. So the commandment was, “Don''t commit physical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 194, 4, 20, 'adultery.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 194, 5, 20, 'But now in the new covenant, the gift of the Holy Spirit comes within,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 194, 6, 20, 'and makes it possible to live such a life. When the Holy Spirit comes in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 194, 7, 20, 'power, He comes in like electricity that lights up a light or runs a fan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 194, 8, 20, 'or runs our gadgets. Then we can do certain things that we could not do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 194, 9, 20, 'without the power of the Holy Spirit. Now it''s possible to overcome the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 194, 10, 20, 'lust of the eyes, it''s possible to overcome anger, it''s possible to stop');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 194, 11, 20, 'shouting at your spouse, it’s possible to speak the truth all the time,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 194, 12, 20, 'and it’s possible to let your “yes” be “yes” and your “no” be “no.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 194, 13, 20, 'To use a more up-to-date illustration: if you signed a sale deed or any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 194, 14, 20, 'other agreement in a court of law with witnesses, you were very careful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 194, 15, 20, 'to read that agreement before you signed it because you know that it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 194, 16, 20, 'will be enforced by the court of law. For a Christian, his word should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 194, 17, 20, 'be as good as that signed agreement. Would you say that is true in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 194, 18, 20, 'life?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 194, 19, 20, 'God Tests Us to See to Whom He Can Give a Higher Ministry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 194, 20, 20, 'It''s worth losing a little bit of money to be upright and to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 194, 21, 20, 'Christ-like in our conduct. Many times we are tested in the area of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 194, 22, 20, 'money to see whether we''re willing to let our yes be yes and our no be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 194, 23, 20, 'no.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 194, 24, 20, 'God tests us in this area before He can lead us higher. I found in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 194, 25, 20, 'life many, many times that God tested me in places where I may have had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 194, 26, 20, 'to lose something or sacrifice something. He tests me with these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 194, 27, 20, 'commandments to see whether I will live according to them. Then I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 194, 28, 20, 'discover whether I really believe it or not. There are many situations');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 195, 1, 20, 'today where speaking the truth costs us nothing. There is no test there,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 195, 2, 20, 'but when speaking the truth could cost you your job, for example - it’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 195, 3, 20, 'then that you''re tested by God to see whether He can lead you to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 195, 4, 20, 'higher ministry. I believe many of these areas are where God tests us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 195, 5, 20, 'And many, many people young people have failed God’s test.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 195, 6, 20, 'I remember once asking the Lord, “India has 1,200 million people - such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 195, 7, 20, 'a huge population - where are the prophets in this land who speak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 195, 8, 20, 'faithfully for You? We have wonderful evangelists but where are the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 195, 9, 20, 'prophets who will hold up God’s standard in His Word in every single');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 195, 10, 20, 'area exactly the way Jesus taught and lived and spoke?”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 195, 11, 20, 'The Lord spoke an answer to me; “I have prepared many young people to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 195, 12, 20, 'my prophets in this land and many of them have fallen away and through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 195, 13, 20, 'failing the test. Either they go after money, or they join up with some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 195, 14, 20, 'American Christian organization to get a better salary, or they marry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 195, 15, 20, 'the wrong person, or they are unfaithful with their eyes or tongue and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 195, 16, 20, 'don''t take sin seriously. By the time they could have become prophets');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 195, 17, 20, 'they are unfit, and I have to set them aside”. That has happened to so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 195, 18, 20, 'many! I believe it has happened to hundreds of people. I myself have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 195, 19, 20, 'seen wonderful, zealous young people when I was a young man and I’ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 195, 20, 20, 'seen where they are today - fallen by the wayside. There has been a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 195, 21, 20, 'tremendous loss for God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 195, 22, 20, 'God doesn''t force anybody to be His faithful servant. I believe He wants');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 195, 23, 20, 'you and me to be faithful servants of His, but whether you''re going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 195, 24, 20, 'be faithful or not, whether you are going to stick to the standards of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 195, 25, 20, 'God''s Word, and whether you are going to compromise Him to please people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 195, 26, 20, 'will determine whether you ever become true servant of God or not.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 195, 27, 20, '“If I seek to please men, I cannot be the servant of Christ” (Galatians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 195, 28, 20, '1:10). This is absolutely clear. I remember I had that verse written on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 196, 1, 20, 'a little wooden plaque and I kept it in my sitting room before me for 25');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 196, 2, 20, 'years. I studied it every day until it was drilled into my mind. I don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 196, 3, 20, 'need it in front of me now, since it is in my heart. It is a very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 196, 4, 20, 'important principle. If you ever seek to please men I can tell you in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 196, 5, 20, 'Jesus’ name that you will never be a servant of God! So don''t ever seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 196, 6, 20, 'to please men. Seek to please God. Jesus spent those 30 years seeking to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 196, 7, 20, 'please His Father and He got a certificate in the end. The question is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 196, 8, 20, 'not whether men think you''re truthful. Can the God say about you that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 196, 9, 20, 'your yes is always yes and your no is always no?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 196, 10, 20, 'Think of a situation for example, if you''re working in an office and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 196, 11, 20, 'maybe there''s an expensive machine there that you accidentally misused');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 196, 12, 20, 'and spoiled, but nobody saw you doing it. Many people use that machine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 196, 13, 20, 'and a little later on somebody discovers the machine is not working, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 196, 14, 20, 'the authorities come to investigate. The boss comes by and asks who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 196, 15, 20, 'spoiled the machine. You know it was you but you keep quiet because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 196, 16, 20, 'there''s no way they can find out, since a lot of people were using it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 196, 17, 20, 'You think you didn’t lie because you didn’t open your mouth, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 196, 18, 20, 'actually you did tell a lie. You told a lie without opening your mouth!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 196, 19, 20, 'So that you would keep your job, you did not admit that you were the one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 196, 20, 20, 'who used it last and spoiled it in some way. Maybe if you had confessed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 196, 21, 20, 'it they would have sacked you from the job because it is an expensive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 196, 22, 20, 'machine.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 196, 23, 20, 'Which is more important in that moment? The devil comes to you and says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 196, 24, 20, 'a lie is almighty; that if you tell a lie you can preserve your job. At');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 196, 25, 20, 'the same time the Holy Spirit whispers to your heart that it is a lie.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 196, 26, 20, 'Is not God almighty? If you trust God in this situation and speak the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 196, 27, 20, 'truth, maybe you will lose your job, but God will give you a better one.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 196, 28, 20, 'Do you have that faith? It is in such situations that we are tested.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 197, 1, 20, 'I''m not speaking in theory. Many, many times God has tested me in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 197, 2, 20, 'different things in this area, not to see whether I''m clever or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 197, 3, 20, 'ingenious to find my way out of some situation, but to see whether I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 197, 4, 20, 'honest and willing to pay a price for speaking the truth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 197, 5, 20, 'This is how He anointed me and gave me a ministry to speak the truth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 197, 6, 20, 'from the pulpit irrespective of the cost. I believe God wants many, many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 197, 7, 20, 'prophets of God in the pulpits in Christendom today who will speak the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 197, 8, 20, 'truth, irrespective of the cost - even if they get thrown out and become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 197, 9, 20, 'despised, rejected, misunderstood, criticized, or falsely accused. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 197, 10, 20, 'way that God will prepare you for that ministry is by testing you in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 197, 11, 20, 'ordinary circumstances of life to see whether you will speak the truth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 197, 12, 20, 'even if you have to pay a price for it and lose your job, or if you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 197, 13, 20, 'to lose money for it because you stand for the truth. This is a very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 197, 14, 20, 'important area.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 197, 15, 20, 'Being Truthful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 197, 16, 20, 'The Holy Spirit is called the Spirit of Truth. Jesus said, “The Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 197, 17, 20, 'of Truth will guide you into all the truth, He will not speak on his own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 197, 18, 20, 'initiative. He will disclose to you what is to come, and He will lead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 197, 19, 20, 'you into all the truth” (John 16:13).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 197, 20, 20, 'I want my life to be totally truthful from head to foot because that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 197, 21, 20, 'what it means to follow Jesus. Jesus said, “I am the truth.” So often');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 197, 22, 20, 'even Christian preachers are diplomatic in the way they speak to others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 197, 23, 20, 'They say, “If I say it like this, well, that could cause some problems');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 197, 24, 20, 'so let me be diplomatic.” Jesus was never diplomatic. He always spoke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 197, 25, 20, 'the truth plainly and directly. I don''t mean that He was rude and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 197, 26, 20, 'don''t believe we should be rude, but Jesus was not diplomatic for any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 197, 27, 20, 'personal gain. I believe we should be gracious and considerate in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 197, 28, 20, 'speaking the truth (not rude), but I''m talking about speaking the truth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 198, 1, 20, 'where it''s going to affect you. We''re always to be gracious when we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 198, 2, 20, 'speak to other people, but we must be truthful when it comes to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 198, 3, 20, 'ourselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 198, 4, 20, 'Did you know that the Holy Spirit leads us into all the truth? The first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 198, 5, 20, 'sin that was judged in the early church was the sin of dishonesty, not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 198, 6, 20, 'the sin of covetousness. In Acts 5, Ananias and Sapphira saw many people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 198, 7, 20, 'selling their lands and bringing the money to the Apostles’ feet (many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 198, 8, 20, 'people were doing that in Acts 4:34). Ananias and Sapphira also wanted a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 198, 9, 20, 'reputation in the church of being wholehearted and surrendered to God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 198, 10, 20, 'completely, so they also sold a bit of their land, but didn''t give the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 198, 11, 20, 'full amount of money to lay at the Apostles’ feet like the others were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 198, 12, 20, 'doing. Let''s assume they sold the land for a 100,000 rupees and kept');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 198, 13, 20, 'back 50,000 rupees, thus giving 50% to the church. If somebody sold');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 198, 14, 20, 'their property today and brought 50% of their proceeds to God, you would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 198, 15, 20, 'call that person a wholehearted Christian! But Ananias was killed, not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 198, 16, 20, 'because of what he gave or didn''t give, but because he told a lie.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 198, 17, 20, 'He stood in the line with others and kept his mouth shut as the people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 198, 18, 20, 'were leaving their money at the Apostles’ feet. He also left his money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 198, 19, 20, 'and moved on. As he moved on Peter said, “Ananias, come back here.” God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 198, 20, 20, 'gave Peter discernment that this guy was a liar. Peter told him in Acts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 198, 21, 20, '5:4, “When this land was yours, it was your own. Nobody asked you to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 198, 22, 20, 'sell it. God doesn’t want your money or your land. Everybody is giving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 198, 23, 20, 'voluntarily and after you sold it, the money was still yours. Nobody has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 198, 24, 20, 'asked you to give 50% or 10% or even 1% -- why have you thought of this?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 198, 25, 20, 'You have told a lie to God.” Ananias could have said, “I never opened my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 198, 26, 20, 'mouth! I never said a word,” but do you know you can tell a lie to God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 198, 27, 20, 'without opening your mouth? Ananias just stood in line, put the money at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 198, 28, 20, 'the Apostles’ feet, and moved on. He never opened his mouth, but in that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 199, 1, 20, 'action, it was a lie. This is hypocrisy - to pretend.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 199, 2, 20, 'You can come to the fellowship in a church and pretend to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 199, 3, 20, 'wholehearted like all the others, and yet be a liar. If you sit with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 199, 4, 20, 'people pretending to be wholehearted like the others and you are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 199, 5, 20, 'wholehearted, you are a liar even if you don''t open your mouth. You can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 199, 6, 20, 'sing to Jesus “Take my silver and my gold, not a mite would I withhold,”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 199, 7, 20, 'because you''re singing along with all the others and the tune and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 199, 8, 20, 'words are nice, but you may be an absolute liar because you don''t mean');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 199, 9, 20, 'it. Many Christians tell more lies to God on Sunday than any other day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 199, 10, 20, 'of the week because of the songs they sing! If you sing “All to Jesus I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 199, 11, 20, 'surrender,” but you haven''t surrendered all, then you''re a liar. You may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 199, 12, 20, 'not hear a preacher tell you the truth, but you need to hear it because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 199, 13, 20, 'it is the truth. If you have surrendered all to Christ then say it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 199, 14, 20, 'otherwise keep your mouth shut, or say, “Lord I want to surrender all,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 199, 15, 20, 'but I haven''t done it all.” That’s more honest. It doesn''t matter if it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 199, 16, 20, 'doesn''t fit in with the tune that others are singing. You be honest with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 199, 17, 20, 'God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 199, 18, 20, 'Loving the Truth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 199, 19, 20, 'What is the consequence of this? In 2 Thessalonians 2:10 it speaks of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 199, 20, 20, 'those who don''t receive the love of the truth. Loving the truth is more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 199, 21, 20, 'than speaking the truth. I can speak the truth but a higher level than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 199, 22, 20, 'that is to love the truth. I have such a tremendous longing to speak the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 199, 23, 20, 'truth that I love it and I don''t ever want to have any lie in me. If we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 199, 24, 20, 'don''t receive the love of the truth to be saved from all lying, then 2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 199, 25, 20, 'Thessalonians 2:11 tells us the consequence: that God Himself will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 199, 26, 20, 'deceive us. That''s one of the most fearful verses in the New Testament.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 199, 27, 20, 'If you don''t love the truth dear friend, let me tell you straight:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 199, 28, 20, 'Almighty God will deceive you. Satan is a deceiver. Your lusts deceive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 200, 1, 20, 'you. Your heart is deceitful. On top of that, if Almighty God, Who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 200, 2, 20, 'your only hope of protection from deception, decides to deceive you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 200, 3, 20, 'there is no hope for you. 2 Thessalonians 2:11 says that God will make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 200, 4, 20, 'you believe what is false. He will make you believe that you''re born');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 200, 5, 20, 'again when you''re not born again. He will make you believe that you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 200, 6, 20, 'filled with the Holy Spirit when you''re not filled with the Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 200, 7, 20, 'Why? Because of one reason: you don''t receive the love of the truth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 200, 8, 20, 'Do you know the first sin mentioned in the Bible? It was a lie, when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 200, 9, 20, 'Satan told a lie to Eve saying, “You shall not die” (Genesis 3:4).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 200, 10, 20, 'That’s the first sin mentioned in the Bible - a lie.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 200, 11, 20, 'What is the last sin mentioned in the Bible? If you turn to the very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 200, 12, 20, 'last chapter of the Bible, you see that lying is also the last sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 200, 13, 20, 'mentioned. In Revelation 22:15 it says that those who practice lying are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 200, 14, 20, 'outside the holy city. So the first sin and the last sin mentioned in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 200, 15, 20, 'the Bible is lying. The first sin judged in the early church was lying.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 200, 16, 20, 'The people whom God deceives are those who don’t love the truth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 200, 17, 20, 'It''s very important for us to take this seriously. “Let your yes be yes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 200, 18, 20, 'and your no be no” (Mathew 5:37). This protects us from deception. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 200, 19, 20, 'said, “I am the Way.” We all appreciate that. We acknowledge that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 200, 20, 20, 'is the Way and the Life. But He also said, “I am the Truth - I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 200, 21, 20, 'reality” (John 14:6).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 200, 22, 20, 'They couldn''t have this in the Old Testament. David says in Psalm 51:6');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 200, 23, 20, 'where He makes his confession after sinning with Bathsheba, “Lord I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 200, 24, 20, 'realize You decide truth in the innermost being, I don''t have it. I''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 200, 25, 20, 'been a hypocrite. I could kill Goliath, I could defeat the Philistines,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 200, 26, 20, 'but I was a hypocrite in my heart. I sinned with Bathsheba and tried to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 200, 27, 20, 'cover it up by first of all getting her husband to go to her bed that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 200, 28, 20, 'day. I didn''t succeed there. Then I got rid of her husband and married');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 201, 1, 20, 'her. Lord I realize You desire truth in the innermost being. I don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 201, 2, 20, 'have it.” But truth in the innermost being is one of the wonderful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 201, 3, 20, 'things we can have today because of the Holy Spirit. The Spirit of Truth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 201, 4, 20, 'will make us truthful all the way to the innermost being of our life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 201, 5, 20, 'and heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 201, 6, 20, 'Revelation 14 speaks about certain people who are standing with the Lamb');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 201, 7, 20, 'on Mount Zion. Revelation 14:4 tells of a group of overcomers who follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 201, 8, 20, 'the Lamb wherever He goes. One characteristic about them is, “No lie was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 201, 9, 20, 'found in their mouth” (Revelation 14:5). Children of men are liars from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 201, 10, 20, 'the time they are born. We read that in Psalm 58:3. But here''s a group');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 201, 11, 20, 'of people who are completely delivered from lying so that there is no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 201, 12, 20, 'lie is found in their whole system. They have become like Jesus: full of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 201, 13, 20, 'truth! I want to encourage you: we need to cleanse ourselves from every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 201, 14, 20, 'type of lie.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 201, 15, 20, 'Even if you have to pay a price for speaking the truth, if you stand for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 201, 16, 20, 'the truth and decide that you are going to eliminate lying from your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 201, 17, 20, 'life, then 100% your life will be clean. You''ll be able to see God. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 201, 18, 20, 'will never be deceived by any of the deceptions going around in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 201, 19, 20, 'Christendom today. You will know the truth because God Himself will show');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 201, 20, 20, 'you the truth, and you will never be deceived about your spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 201, 21, 20, 'condition.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 201, 22, 21, 'Chapter 20 The Spirit of Jesus'' Commandments');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 201, 23, 21, 'Attitude of Taking Revenge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 201, 24, 21, 'We have looked at three wrong attitudes so far. The first wrong attitude');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 201, 25, 21, 'is the wrong attitude of anger (Matthew 5:21) and the second wrong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 201, 26, 21, 'attitude is that of sexually sinful ways of thinking and divorce, both');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 201, 27, 21, 'of which amount to adultery in verses 27-32. And then the third wrong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 201, 28, 21, 'attitude is that of lying. We need to eliminate lying completely from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 202, 1, 21, 'our lives so that we are totally truthful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 202, 2, 21, 'The fourth wrong attitude is the attitude of taking revenge. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 202, 3, 21, 'also very common, unfortunately, even among those who call themselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 202, 4, 21, 'believers. In the Old Testament, the law said, “An eye for an eye and a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 202, 5, 21, 'tooth for a tooth.” This was a law that God gave in Exodus 21, Leviticus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 202, 6, 21, '24, and also in Deuteronomy 19. What God was saying there was not that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 202, 7, 21, 'if somebody takes out your eye you must take out his eye. What He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 202, 8, 21, 'saying is, don''t take out both of his eyes if he took out only one of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 202, 9, 21, 'yours. The point is that you can forgive the offender and let him go,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 202, 10, 21, 'and not take any of his eyes out. That would be the best way. God was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 202, 11, 21, 'limiting punishment by saying, “An eye for an eye and a tooth for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 202, 12, 21, 'tooth.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 202, 13, 21, 'But Jesus raises the standard higher, and says, “Do not resist the one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 202, 14, 21, 'who is evil; if somebody slaps you on the right cheek, turn the other to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 202, 15, 21, 'him. If someone sues you to take your shirt, give him your coat as well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 202, 16, 21, 'Whoever forces you to go one mile, go with them two” (Matthew 5:39-41).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 202, 17, 21, 'Roman soldiers would sometimes force the Jewish people who were their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 202, 18, 21, 'slaves to carry their baggage and military equipment for a mile. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 202, 19, 21, 'Jews were slaves so they had to do it. Jesus tells us that in situations');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 202, 20, 21, 'like these we should go two miles with the person, to not fight with him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 202, 21, 21, 'about it, to give to him who asks of you, and to not turn away from him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 202, 22, 21, 'who wants to borrow from you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 202, 23, 21, 'We need to take these words in the spirit in which they are spoken. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 202, 24, 21, 'need to see exactly what Jesus meant. Was He telling us to be like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 202, 25, 21, 'doormats? Are we to let people do whatever they like? It cannot be.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 202, 26, 21, 'Whenever you don''t understand the Scripture properly, look at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 202, 27, 21, 'example of Jesus Christ Himself - because He is the Word made flesh. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 202, 28, 21, 'the Old Testament, they had scribes who examined the law to explain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 203, 1, 21, 'every jot and tittle in it. In the New Testament, we don''t need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 203, 2, 21, 'analyze verses as much as we look at Jesus, since we have His example');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 203, 3, 21, 'now.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 203, 4, 21, 'What did Jesus mean by, “If someone slaps you on your right cheek turn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 203, 5, 21, 'the other cheek”? We see that Jesus Himself, when He was standing before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 203, 6, 21, 'the chief priests in the trial just before his crucifixion, was slapped');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 203, 7, 21, 'and didn''t turn the other cheek. He said in John 18:23, “If I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 203, 8, 21, 'spoken what''s right, why do you slap Me?” They didn’t respond to that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 203, 9, 21, '(they probably slapped Him again and He didn''t fight back). When they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 203, 10, 21, 'slapped him, He didn''t offer His other cheek to be slapped as well. So,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 203, 11, 21, 'we need to be careful to understand the spirit of what Christ is saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 203, 12, 21, 'otherwise we would have to accuse Jesus Himself of not practicing what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 203, 13, 21, 'He preached.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 203, 14, 21, 'The principle here is: I don''t desire revenge; I''m not seeking to get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 203, 15, 21, 'back at someone for what was done to me. If someone calls me a devil,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 203, 16, 21, 'I''m not going to call that person a devil. If I am slapped, I will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 203, 17, 21, 'slap back. I''d rather just sit back and trust God to protect me from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 203, 18, 21, 'being taken advantage of.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 203, 19, 21, 'What does He mean when He says that if somebody sues you in court to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 203, 20, 21, 'take your shirt, give your coat also? For example, if somebody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 203, 21, 21, 'unrighteously tells a lie and sues you for your own property saying it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 203, 22, 21, 'is his property - perhaps he got some false documents in court and wants');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 203, 23, 21, 'to take away your house from you - what are you supposed to do? Are you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 203, 24, 21, 'supposed to tell him to take your house and offer your other house as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 203, 25, 21, 'well? Is that the meaning?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 203, 26, 21, 'That’s not at all what Jesus meant. Again, we need to understand the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 203, 27, 21, 'spirit. If somebody forces you to go one mile, go with him two miles. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 203, 28, 21, 'other words, if someone forces you to do something, do more. You must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 204, 1, 21, 'understand the spirit of it. Jesus also instructs us not to turn anyone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 204, 2, 21, 'who wants to borrow from us away. Is He saying that you should give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 204, 3, 21, 'money to every single person who wants to borrow from you? Here in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 204, 4, 21, 'India, if you give money to someone once and you get a reputation as one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 204, 5, 21, 'who freely keeps on giving to anyone, you’ll end up bankrupt in no time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 204, 6, 21, 'at all!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 204, 7, 21, 'If you don''t understand the spirit of these words, and blindly take them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 204, 8, 21, 'literally, you''re going to get into a lot of trouble. The same thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 204, 9, 21, 'applies to words that He spoke earlier, such as, “If your right eye');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 204, 10, 21, 'makes you to stumble, tear it out.” Imagine if you actually tore out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 204, 11, 21, 'your right eye because one day you lusted after a woman and then the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 204, 12, 21, 'next day you lusted with your left eye, and then you have to tear that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 204, 13, 21, 'out, and so now you are blind. Is that what He meant? You can still lust');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 204, 14, 21, 'in your mind after both your eyes are gone! Do you think blind men don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 204, 15, 21, 'lust? You can be totally blind and still lust in your mind without both');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 204, 16, 21, 'eyes, so you need to understand the spirit of these words. He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 204, 17, 21, 'talking about a radical attitude towards lusting when He instructed us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 204, 18, 21, 'to be as a blind man is, or as the one with an amputated hand.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 204, 19, 21, 'That''s the spirit in which we need to understand all of these things:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 204, 20, 21, 'don''t seek to take revenge, be willing to be taken advantage of, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 204, 21, 21, 'even be willing to die to myself; but it doesn''t mean I have no rights.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 204, 22, 21, 'It doesn''t mean that I have to give up my property to anybody who asks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 204, 23, 21, 'me for it. We need to balance Scripture with Scripture, so let’s look at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 204, 24, 21, 'the last statement in particular.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 204, 25, 21, 'Principles of Lending');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 204, 26, 21, '“Do not turn away from him who wants to borrow from you” (Matthew 5:42).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 204, 27, 21, 'Sometimes we understand things better by comparing Scripture with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 204, 28, 21, 'Scripture, so we must look at a parallel passage to best understand this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 205, 1, 21, 'verse. Jesus said in Luke 6:35, “Lend expecting nothing in return.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 205, 2, 21, 'I remember a brother once came to me saying that he lent three thousand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 205, 3, 21, 'rupees to this other brother who said he would return it. A great deal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 205, 4, 21, 'of time had gone by and he had not yet returned it. I told this brother');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 205, 5, 21, 'that he is the one who disobeyed Scripture, because Scripture says to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 205, 6, 21, '“lend expecting to receive nothing in return.” If you lend expecting to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 205, 7, 21, 'receive what credit is that to you, even sinners lend to sinners in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 205, 8, 21, 'order to receive back the same amount (Luke 6:34). But when you as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 205, 9, 21, 'believer lend you must be different - expect nothing in return.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 205, 10, 21, 'What Jesus meant was that you should only lend an amount of money that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 205, 11, 21, 'you can write off as a gift. So, I told this brother that he probably');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 205, 12, 21, 'should not have lent this other brother three thousand rupees when he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 205, 13, 21, 'asked to borrow it. He should have said, “Sorry, I can''t afford to give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 205, 14, 21, 'you three thousand rupees, but I can give you 500.” In other words, lend');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 205, 15, 21, 'only as much money as you are comfortable never seeing again. Treat it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 205, 16, 21, 'as a gift, and if he doesn''t return it, that’s it. But if you didn''t do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 205, 17, 21, 'that, then you have disobeyed Scripture. We need to understand the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 205, 18, 21, 'spirit in these things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 205, 19, 21, 'What did Jesus mean when He said, “Don''t turn away from him who wants to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 205, 20, 21, 'borrow from you”? When I was as a young Christian, I was earning a lot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 205, 21, 21, 'of money as a naval officer (far more than I needed) and I had plenty of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 205, 22, 21, 'money to spare. There was a poorer brother in the church who knew that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 205, 23, 21, 'and would come to me and ask to borrow money. I asked how much he wanted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 205, 24, 21, 'and he agreed to pay it back in a month. The next month came along and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 205, 25, 21, 'he came to me and said he still couldn’t return what he borrowed and he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 205, 26, 21, 'asked for more money, so I gave him more money. I had in mind this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 205, 27, 21, 'verse, “Don’t turn away from him who wants to borrow from you,” and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 205, 28, 21, 'continued to give him money for months. I just kept quiet thinking I was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 206, 1, 21, 'obeying Scripture. I was a young, newly-baptized Christian and I was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 206, 2, 21, 'doing what Scripture said as far as I knew, but after a while this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 206, 3, 21, 'person who took this money backslid and got into drinking and other bad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 206, 4, 21, 'habits. When I heard that, then I wrote to him saying that if he used');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 206, 5, 21, 'the money to buy alcohol and to finance the devil’s kingdom, then he had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 206, 6, 21, 'better return the money to me because this money was to be used for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 206, 7, 21, 'God’s kingdom. He got very angry with me and he said that even the dead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 206, 8, 21, 'denominations did not make demands like I was making.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 206, 9, 21, 'And the Lord told me to forget it. I never wrote back to him and I never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 206, 10, 21, 'got the money back. I thought, “Lord, what did I do wrong? I obeyed Your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 206, 11, 21, 'Scripture which said, ‘Don''t turn away from him who wants to borrow from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 206, 12, 21, 'you.’” And the Lord taught me something that has helped me throughout');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 206, 13, 21, 'all these nearly 50 years. That is, you must compare Scripture with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 206, 14, 21, 'Scripture. The Lord showed me that I treated that money as if it was my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 206, 15, 21, 'own. One Scripture said I must lend to him who asks, but there''s another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 206, 16, 21, 'Scripture that says that nothing that I have belongs to myself -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 206, 17, 21, 'everything on earth belongs to the Lord. “The earth is the Lord''s and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 206, 18, 21, 'everything that it contains” (1 Corinthians 10:26). So when I receive a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 206, 19, 21, 'salary that I think is mine, I have to see that it''s not mine; I should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 206, 20, 21, 'forsake it. I should give it to the Lord. Even though I collect my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 206, 21, 21, 'salary on the first of the month and it''s in my bank account, I must say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 206, 22, 21, 'that it''s not my money; that it''s God''s money.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 206, 23, 21, 'An illustration that came to me at that time: if somebody had given me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 206, 24, 21, '5000 rupees to keep and then return later, and another person comes to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 206, 25, 21, 'me at that time saying that he heard I had 5000 rupees and asks for me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 206, 26, 21, 'to lend him 3000 rupees, what will I say? I’ll say “I''m sorry, brother;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 206, 27, 21, 'that that''s not my money, it''s somebody else''s. He just asked me to hold');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 206, 28, 21, 'on to it for him. Let me ask him about it and if he allows me to give it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 207, 1, 21, 'to you, then I''ll give it to you.” Wouldn''t that be the righteous way to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 207, 2, 21, 'handle this situation since it''s not my money? If I had treated my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 207, 3, 21, 'salary as the Lord''s money, then I wouldn''t have given it out as easily');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 207, 4, 21, 'as I did. When that brother came to borrow from me, I would have said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 207, 5, 21, '“Yes, that''s fine; it’s right for me to lend to somebody who is in need,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 207, 6, 21, 'but let me go and ask the One to Whom the money belongs (in this case,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 207, 7, 21, 'the Lord). I would have brought it to the Lord and said, ‘Lord, do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 207, 8, 21, 'want me to give it to this person?’” And maybe the Lord would have said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 207, 9, 21, 'yes or no. God speaks; He is a living God. Perhaps the first time He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 207, 10, 21, 'would say yes, and the second time He would have probably said no, but I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 207, 11, 21, 'didn''t wait to listen. I went by the letter of the law and I got into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 207, 12, 21, 'bondage, but I''m very glad that I learned a lesson very early in my life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 207, 13, 21, 'on how to obey Scripture – “it is written” and “it is also written.” I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 207, 14, 21, 'need to balance Scripture with Scripture to be able to understand. I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 207, 15, 21, 'willing to lend to everyone who asks of me today just like it says here.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 207, 16, 21, 'But I also want to recognize that all that I have belongs to the Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 207, 17, 21, 'so I cannot give that out without asking the Lord and that''s what I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 207, 18, 21, 'followed subsequently when people have come to me and asked me for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 207, 19, 21, 'money. I now say, “Let me seek the Lord; if I have freedom in my spirit,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 207, 20, 21, 'I’ll give it to you.” And there are times that I have given and I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 207, 21, 21, 'never gotten it back, and there are times when I''ve not given because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 207, 22, 21, 'Lord didn''t give me freedom to give, but my heart was willing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 207, 23, 21, 'This is an example of how we need to understand the spirit in which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 207, 24, 21, 'Jesus spoke all these things. It''s not that we allow people to treat us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 207, 25, 21, 'like doormats. The principle is that we do not take revenge on anyone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 207, 26, 21, 'and that we do not wish to get back at someone who hurt us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 207, 27, 21, 'Another brother, who worked as a bus driver, once testified in a church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 207, 28, 21, 'meeting that as he drove down the street, he would sometimes at night');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 208, 1, 21, 'see someone coming toward him in a car in the opposite direction with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 208, 2, 21, 'glaring headlights that would blind his eyes. They''re supposed to dip');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 208, 3, 21, 'their lights when there''s another car coming in the other direction, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 208, 4, 21, 'these people didn''t. Because their lights were blinding his eyes, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 208, 5, 21, 'felt like making his bus headlights also glare back at them in much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 208, 6, 21, 'greater brightness, blinding the other driver back to teach him a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 208, 7, 21, 'lesson. He suddenly realized that he was a Christian and shouldn''t take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 208, 8, 21, 'revenge so and he decided not to do it. Notice the revelation that that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 208, 9, 21, 'brother got on what it means to take revenge: to hurt another person in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 208, 10, 21, 'the same way that he hurt him!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 208, 11, 21, 'If I understand the principle Jesus taught, I will discover the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 208, 12, 21, 'application of that principle even when driving down the road as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 208, 13, 21, 'somebody is allowing his headlights to glare into my eyes. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 208, 14, 21, 'situation may not be written in Scripture anywhere, but I''ll understand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 208, 15, 21, 'the principles and be willing to yield, recognizing that my time and my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 208, 16, 21, 'money and my energy primarily belong to the Lord. I''m not a slave of men');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 208, 17, 21, 'and I''m not going to allow every Tom, Dick, and Harry to reduce me to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 208, 18, 21, 'become their slave. I''m primarily a slave of the Lord and I''m not going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 208, 19, 21, 'to be a slave of men.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 208, 20, 21, 'So if I keep that in mind, I understand these principles: I never want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 208, 21, 21, 'to take revenge, I never want to treat that person the way he treats me,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 208, 22, 21, 'and I don''t want to speak back to him the way he spoke back to me. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 208, 23, 21, 'want to yield, I want to be gracious, and I want to give up my rights.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 208, 24, 21, 'Love Your Enemies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 208, 25, 21, 'Jesus goes on to something that is very closely connected. The next');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 208, 26, 21, 'wrong attitude He speaks of is hating people. “You have heard it said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 208, 27, 21, 'you shall love your neighbor and hate your enemy” (Matthew 5:43). In the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 208, 28, 21, 'Old Testament the Israelites hated the Canaanites, they hated the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 209, 1, 21, 'Philistines, they hated the Amorites, the Moabites, etc. They intended');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 209, 2, 21, 'to destroy them. But Jesus now says, “I say to you, love your enemies.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 209, 3, 21, 'Has God changed through the years? No. Man now has the higher');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 209, 4, 21, 'possibility to live like Jesus Christ. He was not capable of living like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 209, 5, 21, 'Jesus in the Old Testament. Without the Holy Spirit it is impossible to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 209, 6, 21, 'really love your enemies the way God wants you to love them. You may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 209, 7, 21, 'love your enemy to get some honor as a very gracious person, but what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 209, 8, 21, 'about to love your enemy for the glory of God? Only a person filled with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 209, 9, 21, 'the Holy Spirit can do that. “So I say to you love your enemies and pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 209, 10, 21, 'for those who persecute you.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 209, 11, 21, 'Remember that these are the commandments that we’re supposed to teach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 209, 12, 21, 'every single believer who is a disciple around the world. If I''m to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 209, 13, 21, 'build a church, I must build a church where every single person in that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 209, 14, 21, 'church loves every one of his enemies. If he has ten enemies and he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 209, 15, 21, 'loves nine of them, he has not obeyed that command. Jesus said, “Go into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 209, 16, 21, 'all nations and make them disciples, teaching them to obey and do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 209, 17, 21, 'everything I have commanded.” In other words, I have to go through the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 209, 18, 21, 'experience myself first, and that''s why every servant of God is allowed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 209, 19, 21, 'by God to face enemies in his life - so that he can learn to love them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 209, 20, 21, 'That''s how he can teach other people to love their enemies.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 209, 21, 21, 'That''s also why every true servant of God has to face persecution -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 209, 22, 21, 'because it''s only then that he can learn how to pray for those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 209, 23, 21, 'persecute him, and then he can also teach others how to pray for those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 209, 24, 21, 'who persecute them. That is why Jesus says, “So that you can be sons of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 209, 25, 21, 'your Father Who is in heaven.” He instructs us to look at our Father in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 209, 26, 21, 'Heaven, Who “makes the Sun to rise on the evil and the good and sends');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 209, 27, 21, 'the rain on the righteous and the unrighteous” (Matthew 5:45).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 209, 28, 21, 'Think of two farmers, one is an atheist and the other is a God-fearing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 210, 1, 21, 'farmer. Their farms are next to each other, and one man prays regularly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 210, 2, 21, 'while the other man thinks that there''s no God and it''s all rubbish. Yet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 210, 3, 21, 'God makes the sun rise on both of them and their farms! God makes the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 210, 4, 21, 'rain fall equally on both of their farms so that they get good crops and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 210, 5, 21, 'good fruit in their trees. Do you see how good God is! He pours equally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 210, 6, 21, 'on the atheist and the God-fearing farmer, and He tells us to be like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 210, 7, 21, 'that. Be like God - equally good to the person who is good to you and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 210, 8, 21, 'the person who is evil to you. All of this is impossible without the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 210, 9, 21, 'power of the Holy Spirit - that''s why we don''t read such commands in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 210, 10, 21, 'Old Testament.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 210, 11, 21, 'Jesus goes on to say that if we only love those who love us, there’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 210, 12, 21, 'nothing special about that, because even the tax collectors, and evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 210, 13, 21, 'sinful people like murderers, and people in false religions and groups,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 210, 14, 21, 'do that. So if you only greet your friends or your brothers, you''re no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 210, 15, 21, 'better than the heathen (Matthew 5:47).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 210, 16, 21, 'Have you ever gone out of your way to greet somebody who doesn''t want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 210, 17, 21, 'greet you? I''ve done that numerous times. As a servant of the Lord, many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 210, 18, 21, 'people are upset with me because of the truth I proclaim - the truth of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 210, 19, 21, 'God''s Word. Just as people were upset with Jesus and Paul and many other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 210, 20, 21, 'servants of God through these twenty centuries, many would not greet me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 210, 21, 21, 'if they were to pass me on the road. Sometimes I cross the road to go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 210, 22, 21, 'and greet them because the Bible says to greet those who don''t have an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 210, 23, 21, 'interest in greeting you, to show that you have nothing against them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 210, 24, 21, 'Someone once asked me how many friends I have. I said as many people as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 210, 25, 21, 'there are in the world I have as friends, and the number keeps');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 210, 26, 21, 'increasing every day! If there are seven billion people in the world, as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 210, 27, 21, 'far as I''m concerned, they''re all my friends. I don''t have any enemies;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 210, 28, 21, 'I love them all. They may consider me as their enemy, but I don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 211, 1, 21, 'consider them as my enemy. People who have done harm to me, persecuted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 211, 2, 21, 'me, I want to pray for them. People who have cursed me, I want to bless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 211, 3, 21, 'them. “Bless those who curse you” (Matthew 5:44). Do you do that?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 211, 4, 21, 'You know that no curse can ever harm you. That''s impossible because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 211, 5, 21, 'we''re under the blessing of God. Christ took every curse on the cross');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 211, 6, 21, 'and now we are under the blessing of God, so any person cursing me is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 211, 7, 21, 'not going to hurt me in any way. He doesn''t know that and I can, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 211, 8, 21, 'response, bless him by saying, “God bless you.” I can turn to every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 211, 9, 21, 'human being in the world and say, “God bless you.” That’s sincerely what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 211, 10, 21, 'I desire for every single person. Whether God blesses him or not depends');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 211, 11, 21, 'on his attitude, etc. but I certainly desire that God will bless him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 211, 12, 21, 'Be Perfect in Mercy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 211, 13, 21, 'Lastly, the Lord teaches, “You are to be perfect as our Heavenly Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 211, 14, 21, 'is perfect” (Matthew 5:48). What does that mean? In what area am I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 211, 15, 21, 'supposed to be perfect? I can’t be perfect in love and holiness and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 211, 16, 21, 'wisdom like God - that is impossible. He''s not saying here that one day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 211, 17, 21, 'you will be perfect; what He is saying is that you must be perfect.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 211, 18, 21, 'Again, we should compare Scripture with Scripture. In Luke’s gospel the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 211, 19, 21, 'same verse is mentioned: “Be merciful just as your Father is merciful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 211, 20, 21, 'Love your enemies and be merciful just as your Father is merciful” (Luke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 211, 21, 21, '6:35-36) - that''s a parallel passage.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 211, 22, 21, 'By comparing Scripture with Scripture, I realized that there is one area');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 211, 23, 21, 'where I''m supposed to be perfect and that is in the area of mercy. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 211, 24, 21, 'must be perfect in mercy. That means that I must forgive 100% of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 211, 25, 21, 'people who have harmed me. I must love 100% of my enemies. I must bless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 211, 26, 21, '100% of those who curse me. I must do good to 100% of people who hate me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 211, 27, 21, '- that should be how I live. So when Jesus says, “Be perfect as your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 211, 28, 21, 'Heavenly Father is perfect,” when we compare Scripture with Scripture,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 212, 1, 21, 'we see that it‘s something that is indeed possible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 212, 2, 21, 'Many people have not taken a serious look at this verse and so they take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 212, 3, 21, 'this as a promise that one day they will be perfect (that is 1 John 3:2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 212, 4, 21, '- one day when Christ comes back we will be like Him - that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 212, 5, 21, 'absolutely true, but we are not talking about that now). Instead, here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 212, 6, 21, 'it says you must be perfect, and Jesus is giving the example of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 212, 7, 21, 'Father in Matthew 5:45, Who makes the sun to rise on both the evil and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 212, 8, 21, 'the good. Be good to that person who is evil towards you, in just the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 212, 9, 21, 'same way that God makes the Sun and the rain to fall upon people who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 212, 10, 21, 'evil and don’t even believe in His existence.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 212, 11, 21, 'Isn’t that a wonderful way to live on the earth? This is true');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 212, 12, 21, 'Christianity and if you are not able to live like this, it is for one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 212, 13, 21, 'reason only: you don''t take the words of Jesus seriously. You don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 212, 14, 21, 'tremble at His Word, or you''re not filled with the Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 212, 15, 21, 'The fullness of the Holy Spirit is not something that will make us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 212, 16, 21, 'giggle, laugh, fall down and roll on the ground. It''s something that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 212, 17, 21, 'will make us love our enemies, greet those who don''t greet us, bless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 212, 18, 21, 'those who curse us, pray for those who persecute us, and be merciful to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 212, 19, 21, 'every single person who is evil towards us just like our Heavenly Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 212, 20, 21, 'is merciful to us. Think of how merciful God has been to you: the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 212, 21, 21, 'millions of sins He just overlooks and forgives. Can’t we forgive others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 212, 22, 21, 'in the same way? Let''s take these words seriously and be free of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 212, 23, 21, 'wrong attitudes that the Lord wants us to be free from.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 212, 24, 22, 'Chapter 21 Secret Giving and Praying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 212, 25, 22, 'In Matthew 6:1-18, Jesus speaks on one wrong attitude. We have already');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 212, 26, 22, 'seen a number of wrong attitudes in the previous verses from Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 212, 27, 22, '5:21-48. Another wrong attitude is seeking honor from human beings in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 212, 28, 22, 'relation to giving alms (money for charity, or giving to the Lord’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 213, 1, 22, 'work), in relation to prayer, and in relation to fasting.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 213, 2, 22, 'In all these areas of giving, praying, and fasting, Jesus said it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 213, 3, 22, 'very important that we do not allow men to know anything about our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 213, 4, 22, 'sacrifices. We should keep these secrets before God as far as possible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 213, 5, 22, 'This is another area where our righteousness is to surpass the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 213, 6, 22, 'righteousness of the Pharisees (Matthew 5:20). Remember, that verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 213, 7, 22, 'could be the heading for almost for the rest of the Sermon on the Mount:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 213, 8, 22, 'the ways in which our righteousness is to exceed the righteousness of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 213, 9, 22, 'the scribes and Pharisees, in order for us to enter into God’s kingdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 213, 10, 22, 'Righteous Motives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 213, 11, 22, 'In the matter of our giving, Jesus says our attitude must be completely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 213, 12, 22, 'different from the Pharisees, hypocrites who wanted people to know what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 213, 13, 22, 'they were giving. He said to beware of practicing your righteousness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 213, 14, 22, 'before men. That’s the fundamental principle. And that righteousness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 213, 15, 22, 'Jesus breaks down to giving, praying, and fasting. In all these areas,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 213, 16, 22, 'Jesus said not to do it in order to be noticed by people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 213, 17, 22, 'We can’t avoid people noticing these things sometimes, and we don’t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 213, 18, 22, 'to feel guilty if people happen to accidentally to know about them, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 213, 19, 22, 'if there is no way to avoid it, but we don’t do these things in order to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 213, 20, 22, 'be noticed by men. That’s the point. Otherwise you have no reward from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 213, 21, 22, 'your Father in Heaven. According to this verse, there are a number of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 213, 22, 22, 'people who have prayed and fasted and given for the Lord’s work who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 213, 23, 22, 'going to get NO reward in Heaven, because they wanted other people to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 213, 24, 22, 'know how much they gave, prayed, and fasted.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 213, 25, 22, 'Righteousness in Giving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 213, 26, 22, 'Jesus said, “When you give alms, do not sound a trumpet before you”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 213, 27, 22, '(Matthew 6:2). Jesus always had a way of exaggerating something to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 213, 28, 22, 'highlight a point. He didn’t speak literally about swallowing a camel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 214, 1, 22, 'and straining out a gnat, for nobody strains out gnats or swallows');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 214, 2, 22, 'camels. Jesus spoke about having a log in your eye, but it is impossible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 214, 3, 22, 'to have a log in your eye. And here He speaks about blowing a big');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 214, 4, 22, 'trumpet. Nobody blows a literal trumpet before they give money.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 214, 5, 22, 'Jesus was exaggerating in order to highlight a point. You want people to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 214, 6, 22, 'know what you are giving so that you can get honor from them. And Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 214, 7, 22, 'said that if people do this, then they have already received their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 214, 8, 22, 'reward. This means that what they wanted is honor from men (and not from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 214, 9, 22, 'God), and so they received it. There is no reward from God left for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 214, 10, 22, 'them, because they have already received their reward. But Jesus said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 214, 11, 22, 'that when you give, don’t let your left hand know what your right hand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 214, 12, 22, 'is doing, meaning that another member of the body of Christ should not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 214, 13, 22, 'know what you have given. Thus, your alms may be in secret, and your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 214, 14, 22, 'Father who sees in secret will repay you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 214, 15, 22, 'This matter of giving is very important. In the Old Testament there was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 214, 16, 22, 'no law that said that other people should not know how much you give,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 214, 17, 22, 'because everybody knew that you had to pay a tithe. A tithe was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 214, 18, 22, 'money in those days. The Jewish people were farmers, so they brought');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 214, 19, 22, 'their grain, mint, cumin, and animals as their tithe. When they offered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 214, 20, 22, 'it up to God, people would see them bringing a sheep or an ox or grain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 214, 21, 22, 'or whatever it was. They couldn’t hide it. Thus, there was no law that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 214, 22, 22, 'said that people should not see what you are giving. And there was no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 214, 23, 22, 'law in the Old Testament that said you even have to give cheerfully,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 214, 24, 22, 'which is a rule and principle in the New Covenant, which says that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 214, 25, 22, 'loves a cheerful giver, and that no one should give grudgingly or under');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 214, 26, 22, 'pressure (2 Corinthians 9:7).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 214, 27, 22, 'Giving - Not Tithing - Is the New Covenant Command');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 214, 28, 22, 'We need to understand the principles of New Testament giving. There is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 215, 1, 22, 'no law in the New Testament that says you must pay 10%. The last mention');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 215, 2, 22, 'of a tithe being commanded is in the book of Malachi, in the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 215, 3, 22, 'Testament. When Jesus referred to it in Matthew 23, He was speaking to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 215, 4, 22, 'people who were still under the Old Covenant -- the Pharisees and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 215, 5, 22, 'Jewish people. The New Covenant was established on the day of Pentecost,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 215, 6, 22, 'and after that, there is not a single command to Christians to pay the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 215, 7, 22, 'tithe. There is no reference to the tithe at all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 215, 8, 22, 'There is a vague reference to Abraham having given 10% to Melchizedek in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 215, 9, 22, 'the book of Hebrews, but that wasn’t a law that Abraham was following.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 215, 10, 22, 'He could have given whatever he liked. It happened to be 10%, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 215, 11, 22, 'Abraham was not following a law, and he wouldn’t have sinned if he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 215, 12, 22, 'hadn’t done it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 215, 13, 22, 'The emphasis that we see on tithing in Christendom today is completely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 215, 14, 22, 'Old Covenant. Most Christians live under the Old Covenant in many areas.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 215, 15, 22, 'In the Old Covenant, you could only have your sins forgiven (Psalm 103);');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 215, 16, 22, 'in the New Covenant, Romans 6:14 says that sin will not rule over you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 215, 17, 22, 'When people have only forgiveness of sins and no victory over the sin,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 215, 18, 22, 'they are living in the Old Covenant. In the Old Covenant, there was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 215, 19, 22, 'congregation that could not work together as one body. When a church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 215, 20, 22, 'today is like that - when it cannot function together as a body - that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 215, 21, 22, 'proves it is really just an Old Covenant congregation. When tithing is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 215, 22, 22, 'emphasized, that is also Old Covenant.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 215, 23, 22, 'There are many areas where Christians today are living under the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 215, 24, 22, 'Covenant; they don’t realize that the New Covenant was established on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 215, 25, 22, 'the day of Pentecost. It is almost like people in India not knowing that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 215, 26, 22, 'we became independent in 1947. Can you imagine somebody being ignorant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 215, 27, 22, 'of that? It is just as ridiculous for Christians to still live under the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 215, 28, 22, 'Old Covenant.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 216, 1, 22, 'In the New Covenant, the principles of giving are that it should be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 216, 2, 22, 'secret (Matthew 6:1-4), cheerful (2 Corinthians 9:7), and, proportionate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 216, 3, 22, 'to what you have earned (1 Corinthians 16:2). There is no law as to how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 216, 4, 22, 'much you should give. You can give as God has prospered you. If you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 216, 5, 22, 'much, and you have got plenty to spare, then you can give more; and if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 216, 6, 22, 'you don’t have much, you don’t have to give. That is OK, because God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 216, 7, 22, 'a billionaire, and He doesn’t want any of His poor children to suffer by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 216, 8, 22, 'giving to Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 216, 9, 22, 'If you don’t understand these principles, a lot of pastors and preachers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 216, 10, 22, 'will exploit you and take advantage of you financially. But keep this in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 216, 11, 22, 'mind, that when we give, we should give secretly. Any church that makes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 216, 12, 22, 'you reveal what you are giving is actually asking you to disobey the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 216, 13, 22, 'word of God in Matthew 6:1-4. As far as possible all our giving should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 216, 14, 22, 'be secret, voluntary, and cheerful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 216, 15, 22, 'This is why I personally do not believe that we should put a bag in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 216, 16, 22, 'front of people and force people to give when they may not be giving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 216, 17, 22, 'cheerfully. It is probably not possible for them to give secretly,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 216, 18, 22, 'because their neighbors are watching them give. I believe the way to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 216, 19, 22, 'it is by keeping a box somewhere in the church where people voluntarily');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 216, 20, 22, 'give secretly, cheerfully, and according to their ability. But very few');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 216, 21, 22, 'churches practice this because there is a tremendous love for money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 216, 22, 22, 'among most Christian preachers and in most Christian churches.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 216, 23, 22, 'If you give secretly, your Father, Who sees in secret, will repay you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 216, 24, 22, 'That is a wonderful reward that God has promised, that if we obey His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 216, 25, 22, 'command here, then one day, when Christ comes again, there is going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 216, 26, 22, 'be a great reward for those who have given sacrificially and secretly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 216, 27, 22, 'Righteousness in Prayer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 216, 28, 22, 'Jesus’ principle in prayer is the same: when you pray, don’t be like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 217, 1, 22, 'hypocrites. There are number of things Jesus tells us about prayer as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 217, 2, 22, 'warning.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 217, 3, 22, 'First of all, hypocrites love to be seen praying. “They stand and pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 217, 4, 22, 'in synagogues and the street corners in order to be seen. They have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 217, 5, 22, 'their reward in full.” The principle here is that if you pray in public,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 217, 6, 22, 'and your aim is that other people should appreciate your prayer, that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 217, 7, 22, 'seeking honor from men. Almost everybody who begins to pray in public');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 217, 8, 22, 'will have to admit that they are seeking honor when they pray.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 217, 9, 22, 'Ask yourself, do you pray in public in the same way that you pray in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 217, 10, 22, 'private? When you are kneeling by your bed alone, how do you pray? What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 217, 11, 22, 'do you say to God? Is that what you say when you’re praying in public?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 217, 12, 22, 'Or do you make your language more flowery and bring a little tremor into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 217, 13, 22, 'your voice and behave like an actor, like a lot people do when they pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 217, 14, 22, 'in public, to impress people that they are very earnest or they’re very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 217, 15, 22, 'emotional?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 217, 16, 22, 'It’s all hypocrisy. God hates it. I wish we would realize that type of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 217, 17, 22, 'public praying is detestable before God. God detests it and won’t even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 217, 18, 22, 'listen to it. Most public praying in churches falls under this category,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 217, 19, 22, 'where people are praying in order to demonstrate how well they can pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 217, 20, 22, 'before other people. This is completely against the teaching of Jesus,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 217, 21, 22, 'and people do it because they have not been taught all that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 217, 22, 22, 'commanded.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 217, 23, 22, 'How shall we cleanse ourselves from it? We should judge ourselves each');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 217, 24, 22, 'time we pray. I remember the first time I prayed as a Christian in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 217, 25, 22, 'public. I have to confess that I was seeking honor from people when I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 217, 26, 22, 'prayed. When I went home and judged myself, I said, “Lord, that is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 217, 27, 22, 'the way I should pray.” The next time I got up and prayed in public, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 217, 28, 22, 'was still seeking honor, and so I went home and judged myself again. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 218, 1, 22, 'took me a number of years before I could cleanse myself from this desire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 218, 2, 22, 'to seek honor from men in public prayer, but finally, after many years,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 218, 3, 22, 'I learned to pray to God Almighty alone, to my Heavenly Father. Have you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 218, 4, 22, 'come there? If not, I want to encourage you to work out your salvation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 218, 5, 22, 'from seeking the honor of men.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 218, 6, 22, 'Seek Cleansing from Dead Works');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 218, 7, 22, 'Matthew 6:1-18 is warning against seeking the honor of men. It is a sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 218, 8, 22, 'that many people don’t even recognize, and it is not spoken about much.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 218, 9, 22, 'You can do a good work, but when you do it to seek honor from men, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 218, 10, 22, 'becomes a dead work. In the Old Testament, there were only bad works');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 218, 11, 22, '(evil works) and good works. There were no dead works. But in the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 218, 12, 22, 'Testament, we read about three categories of works: evil works, good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 218, 13, 22, 'works, and then something in between, called “dead works.” We are told');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 218, 14, 22, 'in Hebrews 6:1 that we must repent of dead works, and we are told in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 218, 15, 22, 'Hebrews 9:14 that the blood of Christ must cleanse us from dead works. 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 218, 16, 22, 'John 1:7 says the blood of Jesus will cleanse us from all sin. That we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 218, 17, 22, 'can understand; but do you know what it is for the blood of Christ to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 218, 18, 22, 'cleanse you from dead works as well?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 218, 19, 22, 'Nothing can be cleansed unless it is confessed. When was the last time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 218, 20, 22, 'you confessed a dead work? What is a dead work? A dead work is a good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 218, 21, 22, 'work done in order to seek honor from men. When I pray, that is a good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 218, 22, 22, 'work. But if I pray to seek the honor of men, that good work becomes a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 218, 23, 22, 'dead work, and I need to repent of that prayer. When I give money for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 218, 24, 22, 'God’s work, that is a good work. If I give money to a poor believer,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 218, 25, 22, 'that is a good work. But if I give in order to be seen by men, that good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 218, 26, 22, 'work becomes a dead work that I need to repent of.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 218, 27, 22, 'Any work done with a wrong motive -- even doing work to get some reward');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 218, 28, 22, 'from God -- becomes a dead work. People say, “Give your tithe to our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 219, 1, 22, 'ministry, and God will reward you with a car,” or something like that --');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 219, 2, 22, 'you are doing business with God, and it is a dead work. You can’t do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 219, 3, 22, 'business with God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 219, 4, 22, 'Whatever we do, we must do out of love for God, to glorify Him. Not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 219, 5, 22, 'because we want some return from Him, as if we are doing business with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 219, 6, 22, 'Him. Don’t pray like a hypocrite, seeking to impress others. You have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 219, 7, 22, 'be radical in your attitude if you ever want to be free from this,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 219, 8, 22, 'otherwise you will never be free.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 219, 9, 22, 'Praying Alone Before God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 219, 10, 22, 'Then Jesus said, “When you pray, go into your inner room; and when you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 219, 11, 22, 'shut your door, pray to your Father in secret.” How do we do this in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 219, 12, 22, 'public? We can do it in public if we have a door in our mind that we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 219, 13, 22, 'shut. Even when I am standing in the midst of 100 people, there is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 219, 14, 22, 'door in my mind. I shut it, and then I say, “I am now standing before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 219, 15, 22, 'Almighty God, my Father, alone.” There may be people around me, but I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 219, 16, 22, 'don’t want to be conscious of them. That’s one reason we close our eyes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 219, 17, 22, 'when we pray. There is no law that says you should close your eyes when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 219, 18, 22, 'you pray. You can pray with open eyes, because even Jesus did that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 219, 19, 22, 'sometimes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 219, 20, 22, 'We close our eyes so that we don’t get distracted by our surroundings,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 219, 21, 22, 'so that we don’t seek honor from the people around us. In a sense we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 219, 22, 22, 'shutting out people when we shut our eyes. We need to shut our mind,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 219, 23, 22, 'too, and say, “Father, I have shut the doors now and I am praying to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 219, 24, 22, 'You.” That’s the way to pray, and we can do that even in public. We pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 219, 25, 22, 'to our Father in secret, and our Father, Who sees in secret, will repay');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 219, 26, 22, 'us. You can be absolutely sure that if you are praying to God your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 219, 27, 22, 'Father, and not seeking honor from men, He will definitely repay you and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 219, 28, 22, 'answer that prayer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 220, 1, 22, 'Avoid Meaningless Repetition');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 220, 2, 22, 'Jesus gives us more advice concerning how not to pray in verse 7, “Don’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 220, 3, 22, 'use meaningless repetition like the heathen do because they think they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 220, 4, 22, 'will be heard for their many words.” One of the mistakes that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 220, 5, 22, 'heathen make is to use meaningless repetition. Some religions have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 220, 6, 22, 'habit of chanting something. They repeat some religious phrase, and it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 220, 7, 22, 'becomes a meaningless thing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 220, 8, 22, 'It’s possible to take some spiritual language and repeat it. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 220, 9, 22, 'possible for us to say, “Hallelujah, Hallelujah, Hallelujah,” and it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 220, 10, 22, 'becomes quite meaningless after a while. It becomes a ritual. The same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 220, 11, 22, 'is true for phrases like, “Praise the Lord, Praise the Lord, Praise the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 220, 12, 22, 'Lord..” Jesus said, “Do not use meaningless repetition.” If you read the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 220, 13, 22, 'New Testament, you discover the word Hallelujah only comes in Revelation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 220, 14, 22, '19, and it says, “Hallelujah because of this,” and then it goes on to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 220, 15, 22, 'say another time, “Halleluiah because of this.” There must be a reason');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 220, 16, 22, 'why we praise the Lord, and so we should not just say "Halleluiah”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 220, 17, 22, 'meaninglessly. We must give thanks in everything, but if it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 220, 18, 22, 'meaningless repetition, it can be pretty foolish, and it doesn’t amount');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 220, 19, 22, 'to anything before God. It can even be taking the Lord’s name in vain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 220, 20, 22, 'because the last part of Hallelujah, ''yah,'' is a short form of Jehovah,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 220, 21, 22, 'and the Jewish people were very afraid to even mention that name, lest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 220, 22, 22, 'they take the Lord’s name in vain. I believe a lot of Christians are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 220, 23, 22, 'taking the Lord’s name in vain, when they say “Hallelujah”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 220, 24, 22, 'meaninglessly. I often say it when I praise the Lord, but I seek to say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 220, 25, 22, 'it meaningfully every single time. I am not against using that word, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 220, 26, 22, 'neither is God, but it must be meaningful, and not a meaningless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 220, 27, 22, 'repetition.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 220, 28, 22, 'Do you see how Christians have not taken a simple command like this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 221, 1, 22, 'seriously? Jesus said that it‘s the non-Christians who repeat something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 221, 2, 22, 'meaninglessly like a chant, and that must not be true in our lives. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 221, 3, 22, 'same thing applies to lot of songs we sing. When you sing a song,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 221, 4, 22, 'particularly a song you have known very well and have sung probably 500');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 221, 5, 22, 'times, check yourself. The next time you sing that song in a church, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 221, 6, 22, 'may discover at the end that you don’t even remember what you sang. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 221, 7, 22, 'you were to ask an average, born again Christian at the end of a church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 221, 8, 22, 'service, “what did you tell God today in the songs you sang?” he’ll have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 221, 9, 22, 'to scratch his head and think, “What did I say? I don’t even remember.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 221, 10, 22, 'It was a nice song, so I just sang it along without even thinking of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 221, 11, 22, 'what I was saying.” That is meaningless repetition! We need to reverence');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 221, 12, 22, 'God and say what we mean. You can’t go before a king, or the president,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 221, 13, 22, 'or the prime minister of India and just repeat something, when you don’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 221, 14, 22, 'even know what you are saying. We must have much more reverence for God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 221, 15, 22, 'Avoid meaningless repetition.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 221, 16, 22, 'Seek Faith and a Clean Heart Rather Than Long Prayers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 221, 17, 22, 'Jesus also says, “Don’t think that you will be heard for many words.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 221, 18, 22, 'That’s another mistake lot of people make in prayer. They think that if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 221, 19, 22, 'they pray for a long time, God will certainly hear them. “I prayed for 3');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 221, 20, 22, 'hours, so definitely God will hear me.” That’s a lot of nonsense, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 221, 21, 22, 'that’s what non-Christians think - if they pray for long time, then God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 221, 22, 22, 'will definitely hear them. It’s not true.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 221, 23, 22, 'On Mount Carmel, the prophets of Baal prayed for many hours -- maybe six');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 221, 24, 22, 'hours or more -- but nothing happened. Elijah got up and prayed for half');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 221, 25, 22, 'a minute and the fire fell. It’s not the length of a prayer that makes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 221, 26, 22, 'Lord hear. It is very important to understand that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 221, 27, 22, 'A lot of people think that they will be heard for praying all night.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 221, 28, 22, '“Well I prayed all night, so of course God will answer my prayer.” Who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 222, 1, 22, 'said that? It’s faith that brings an answer to prayer and a heart that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 222, 2, 22, 'is free from sin. Those are the most important things. “If I regard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 222, 3, 22, 'iniquity in my heart,” Psalm 66:18 says, “the Lord will not hear me”.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 222, 4, 22, 'It doesn’t matter if you pray all night, and it doesn’t matter how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 222, 5, 22, 'wonderful your prayer sounds. If there is sin which is not settled, if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 222, 6, 22, 'there is unconfessed sin in your heart, if there is a wrong relationship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 222, 7, 22, 'between you and your brother, if you hurt somebody and you come and pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 222, 8, 22, 'to God, God will not listen to your prayer. Go and settle that matter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 222, 9, 22, 'with your brother. If there is a sin between you and God, or between you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 222, 10, 22, 'and your brother, that is not confessed and settled, you can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 222, 11, 22, 'absolutely sure that you are wasting your time praying, whether you pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 222, 12, 22, 'for 1 minute or 10 hours.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 222, 13, 22, 'Faith is the second requirement to be heard in prayer. If you don’t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 222, 14, 22, 'faith when you pray, you will not get anything. You don’t have because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 222, 15, 22, 'you don’t believe that you will receive. Jesus said, “When you pray,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 222, 16, 22, 'believe and then you will receive” (Mark 11:24). Even if I pray for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 222, 17, 22, 'long time, if I don’t believe that God is going to grant it to me, then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 222, 18, 22, 'I will not get my request.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 222, 19, 22, 'Why do we say, “Amen,” at the end of the prayer? Amen is not just a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 222, 20, 22, 'signal that the prayer is over; it is much more than that. It means that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 222, 21, 22, 'I believe that I will get what I have prayed for. Amen is a Hebrew word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 222, 22, 22, 'which means, “It shall be done,” or “It will be so..” I am saying to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 222, 23, 22, 'God, “I prayed this, Father, in the name of Jesus Christ, and I believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 222, 24, 22, 'it will be done. I have asked in faith - I believe I have asked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 222, 25, 22, 'according to Your will - and so it will be done.” When there are areas');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 222, 26, 22, 'where we don’t know what God’s will is, we say, “Father not my will, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 222, 27, 22, 'Thine be done.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 222, 28, 22, 'As little children go to their father and ask for anything, you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 223, 1, 22, 'permitted to ask God for anything. A little child can ask for an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 223, 2, 22, 'elephant or a real airplane! A little child can ask his father for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 223, 3, 22, 'anything, and you can ask God for anything, provided that you conclude');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 223, 4, 22, 'your prayer with this one sentence, “Nevertheless Father, not as I will,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 223, 5, 22, 'but as Thou will.” This is effectively telling God, “I trust You to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 223, 6, 22, 'choose for me.” This is a wonderful attitude to have in prayer. “I trust');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 223, 7, 22, 'You, Father, to choose for me, and I trust You that I will get this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 223, 8, 22, 'which I am praying according to Your Will.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 223, 9, 22, 'There are many areas where God’s will is revealed to us in Scripture. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 223, 10, 22, 'must come in faith. Many Christians say, “I don’t know whether God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 223, 11, 22, 'heard my prayer.” We should not be like that. We are not to pray like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 223, 12, 22, 'the heathen who think that we have to inform God about our needs. No,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 223, 13, 22, 'Your Heavenly Father knows what you need before you even ask Him. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 223, 14, 22, 'asks us to pray so that we can have a sense of cooperating with God when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 223, 15, 22, 'the answer comes! We say, “Yes! I prayed, and God answered me,” and that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 223, 16, 22, 'brings a closer fellowship between us and our Heavenly Father.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 223, 17, 23, 'Chapter 22 How to Pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 223, 18, 23, 'Having taught us in Matthew 6:5-8, how not to pray -- not as the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 223, 19, 23, 'hypocrites, not with meaningless repetitions, and not with length of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 223, 20, 23, 'prayer, but believing that our Father knows what we need -- Jesus next');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 223, 21, 23, 'tells us how to pray. I notice, as I have observed Christians, that very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 223, 22, 23, 'few people actually pay attention to these simple statements of Jesus,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 223, 23, 23, 'which even a child can understand. He taught us how not to pray, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 223, 24, 23, 'many people have not taken that seriously, and He has taught us how to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 223, 25, 23, 'pray, and even this many people have not taken seriously.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 223, 26, 23, 'He was not giving us a prayer to blindly repeat though. There is no harm');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 223, 27, 23, 'in repeating it if you mean every sentence. But Jesus was teaching us a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 223, 28, 23, 'pattern that should characterize all of our prayers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 224, 1, 23, 'First, Pray to Our Father Who Is in Heaven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 224, 2, 23, 'Jesus said when you pray, pray like this -- “Our Father Who art in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 224, 3, 23, 'Heaven.” The first thing Jesus said is that when you talk to God, call');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 224, 4, 23, 'Him Father. Nobody in the Old Testament could ever dare to look up to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 224, 5, 23, 'God and say, “Father.” Old Testament prayer was always, “O God, Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 224, 6, 23, 'Almighty, etc.” because God was the CEO of the universe and His people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 224, 7, 23, 'were like little employees in a factory. You can’t talk to the CEO any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 224, 8, 23, 'way you like! But in the New Covenant, we are God’s children, and just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 224, 9, 23, 'like the child of a CEO can walk into his Dad’s office and call him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 224, 10, 23, '“Daddy,” so we need to understand the privilege of being a child of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 224, 11, 23, 'It is fundamentally different!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 224, 12, 23, 'And yet, it is true of most Christians that they don’t call God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 224, 13, 23, '“Father;” they call Him, “O God.” There is nothing wrong in that. He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 224, 14, 23, 'God, and it is right to address Him as God; but if you only address Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 224, 15, 23, 'as God, and not also as Father, then there is something wrong.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 224, 16, 23, 'In the Old Testament, God had a name, Jehovah (or Yahweh (Nobody knows');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 224, 17, 23, 'the exact pronunciation of it because the Hebrew alphabet did not have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 224, 18, 23, 'any vowels in it)). As far as I am concerned, it is an absolutely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 224, 19, 23, 'unimportant discussion, because I don’t call God Jehovah or Yahweh! I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 224, 20, 23, 'call Him Daddy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 224, 21, 23, 'He is my Father because Jesus taught us to pray, saying, “Our Father.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 224, 22, 23, 'In Romans 8, we learn that the Holy Spirit comes into our hearts and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 224, 23, 23, 'cries out, “Abba! Father!” (Romans 8:15). Yet if you look at some of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 224, 24, 23, 'songs people sing, like “Guide me, Thou Oh great Jehovah,” are they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 224, 25, 23, 'speaking to their Father? He is Jehovah, but we need to learn to address');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 224, 26, 23, 'Him as our Father. If my children came up to me and said, “Mr. Poonen,”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 224, 27, 23, 'I would think there is something wrong with them! Why are they calling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 224, 28, 23, 'me Mr. Poonen? They should call me Daddy. When I come to God, I don’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 225, 1, 23, 'call him Jehovah or Yahweh, even though that is His name. I say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 225, 2, 23, '“Father,” because He is my Father. I have become His child.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 225, 3, 23, 'That reality of having become the child of God has not hit many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 225, 4, 23, 'Christians, and this is because they don’t open themselves up to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 225, 5, 23, 'Holy Spirit. When the Holy Spirit fills a person, one of the first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 225, 6, 23, 'things He does is make him cry out “Abba Father,” which means, “Daddy.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 225, 7, 23, 'Has that happened to you? This is very, very important. It is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 225, 8, 23, 'something that somebody trains you to say. It’s an automatic, inward');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 225, 9, 23, 'cry. That inward reality comes when the Holy Spirit comes into a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 225, 10, 23, 'person’s heart, when he is born again. If he is filled with the Spirit,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 225, 11, 23, 'he really knows God as his Father. It is one of the most important');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 225, 12, 23, 'things in the Christian life, to know God as Father and to call Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 225, 13, 23, 'Father. You can call Him Lord, and you can call Him God. But the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 225, 14, 23, 'predominant way you should be praying is to your, “Abba Father.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 225, 15, 23, 'Not only “our Father,” but Jesus said to pray, “Our Father Who art in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 225, 16, 23, 'heaven.” We are not praying to some earthly father. My earthly father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 225, 17, 23, 'may love me very much, but he may be helpless to help me in a difficult');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 225, 18, 23, 'situation. My Father in heaven is not helpless; He runs the universe. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 225, 19, 23, 'is more powerful than the prime minister of India! Think if the prime');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 225, 20, 23, 'minster of India were your father. If you had a problem, all you’d have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 225, 21, 23, 'to do is call your dad and tell him about it. Well, your Father in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 225, 22, 23, 'Heaven is mightier and more powerful than anyone in this world. Why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 225, 23, 23, 'don’t you go to Him with your problems?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 225, 24, 23, 'Jesus was trying to lay a basis for faith in that very first sentence of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 225, 25, 23, 'this prayer. “Our Father, Who art in heaven,” makes it clear in my heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 225, 26, 23, 'before I start praying that the One I am talking to is my Heavenly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 225, 27, 23, 'Father, a Father Who loves me intensely. This Father is in heaven, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 225, 28, 23, 'He is almighty. These two truths, that God loves me intensely, and that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 226, 1, 23, 'God is all-powerful, are the basis for my faith. He can solve any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 226, 2, 23, 'problem - He can do anything - and He loves me intensely. This is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 226, 3, 23, 'greatest basis for faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 226, 4, 23, 'Prioritize God’s Interests');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 226, 5, 23, 'In the six requests that follow, if you look carefully, you’ll notice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 226, 6, 23, 'that the first three requests concern God. When you go to God in prayer,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 226, 7, 23, 'what is your first request? You’ll find it is almost always something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 226, 8, 23, 'for yourself or your family. “Lord meet this need,” or “Heal my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 226, 9, 23, 'backache,” or “Give me a job,” or “Take care of my children: provide a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 226, 10, 23, 'job and a marriage partner for them,” etc. There is nothing wrong with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 226, 11, 23, 'these requests. We can certainly pray for all of these things. God wants');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 226, 12, 23, 'us to go to Him for every little thing, even small things. Even if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 226, 13, 23, 'have misplaced your keys, you can ask God to help you find them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 226, 14, 23, 'You can ask God for every little thing, and every big thing, but what do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 226, 15, 23, 'you give priority to? Jesus said that when you pray, you should make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 226, 16, 23, 'your priority be God and His needs. That’s the meaning of “seek God’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 226, 17, 23, 'kingdom first.” Jesus says this in Matthew 6:33, “Seek God’s kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 226, 18, 23, 'first and His righteousness and these other earthly things will be added');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 226, 19, 23, 'to you.” You can ask for them, but put God’s kingdom first; this is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 226, 20, 23, 'God’s way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 226, 21, 23, 'Jesus says your first request must be, “God, my Father in Heaven,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 226, 22, 23, 'hallowed be Your name. Never mind what people say about my name. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 226, 23, 23, 'unimportant, because my reputation is fit for the trash-can.” Are you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 226, 24, 23, 'concerned about your name and your reputation more than God’s Name? Then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 226, 25, 23, 'you are not praying in the way Jesus taught us. Suppose somebody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 226, 26, 23, 'scandalized you or scandalized your daughter. Does that disturb you more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 226, 27, 23, 'than the name Jesus being dishonored in our country? It doesn’t bother');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 226, 28, 23, 'us enough that Christians fight with each other and do so many wrong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 227, 1, 23, 'things. If that doesn’t bother us at all, I wonder whether we really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 227, 2, 23, 'have relationship with God as our Father. If you are more concerned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 227, 3, 23, 'about your name, your family name and your children (what people are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 227, 4, 23, 'saying about them), then you need to reorient your thinking and get it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 227, 5, 23, 'more centered on God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 227, 6, 23, 'A Christian’s Life Should Revolve Around God, Not Self');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 227, 7, 23, 'The first three requests that Jesus taught us are “Hallowed be Thy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 227, 8, 23, 'Name,” “Thy kingdom come,” and “Thy will be done.” Notice everything has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 227, 9, 23, 'to do with God. Man is basically self-centered. What we have inherited');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 227, 10, 23, 'from Adam is a self-centered life that makes us think of ourselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 227, 11, 23, 'primarily, and very often ourselves only. It’s I, me, and my family,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 227, 12, 23, 'that’s all that concerns most people. If they get converted, it’s still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 227, 13, 23, 'I, me, and my family. When they receive Christ, they only think of how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 227, 14, 23, 'Christ can now bless I, me, and my family. That’s not Christianity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 227, 15, 23, 'Jesus came to deliver us from this self-centered life, which is the root');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 227, 16, 23, 'cause of all our misery and unhappiness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 227, 17, 23, 'The reason why most Christians cannot rejoice all the time is because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 227, 18, 23, 'they are centered in themselves. When something good happens to them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 227, 19, 23, 'they rejoice; and when something doesn’t happen the way wanted -- if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 227, 20, 23, 'they didn’t get the promotion that they expected -- then they lose their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 227, 21, 23, 'joy. Why? God is still on the throne, your sins are still forgiven, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 227, 22, 23, 'devil is still defeated! You can’t rejoice because something you wanted,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 227, 23, 23, 'you didn’t get. Jesus has come to deliver us from a self-centered life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 227, 24, 23, 'which is the root cause of all our problems.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 227, 25, 23, 'Can we ask for food? Of course we can, Jesus taught us to pray in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 227, 26, 23, 'Matthew 6:11, “Give us this day our daily bread.” “Daily bread” includes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 227, 27, 23, 'food, clothing, shelter, and children’s education, because they need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 227, 28, 23, 'get educated and get a job so that they can earn their daily bread.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 228, 1, 23, 'There is nothing wrong in asking for these things. “Forgive us our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 228, 2, 23, 'sins,” and “Deliver us from evil” are also good requests, but all these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 228, 3, 23, 'three requests concerning us come after seeking God’s name, God’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 228, 4, 23, 'kingdom, and God’s glory. Jesus is changing our priorities.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 228, 5, 23, 'The right way to pray is to pray with God’s Kingdom, His name, and His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 228, 6, 23, 'will primary in our thinking. In other words, I must change my whole way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 228, 7, 23, 'of life, to now think in terms of God’s name, God’s Kingdom, and God’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 228, 8, 23, 'glory. That is the truly spiritual Christian. Anyone can repeat this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 228, 9, 23, 'prayer - even a parrot can. But only spiritual people can pray this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 228, 10, 23, 'prayer from their hearts, because only spiritual people can honestly say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 228, 11, 23, 'that their primary concern in life is that God’s name will be hallowed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 228, 12, 23, 'in the country, in the church, and in themselves and their families.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 228, 13, 23, '“God’s kingdom should come soon, God’s rule should be established in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 228, 14, 23, 'church, and God’s will should be done in my life, in my family,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 228, 15, 23, 'everywhere.” That is the mark of a spiritual man. Don’t consider');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 228, 16, 23, 'yourself spiritual until these three are the uppermost desires in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 228, 17, 23, 'heart. Everything else is meaningless if the center of your life is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 228, 18, 23, 'still around yourself. Many people, when they are converted, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 228, 19, 23, 'their life has been self-centered all along, have just added Jesus into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 228, 20, 23, 'their orbit to serve them - to forgive their sins, to answer their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 228, 21, 23, 'prayers, to bless them, make them prosperous, and heal their sicknesses.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 228, 22, 23, 'This is not Christianity. This is a self-centered life with religion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 228, 23, 23, 'added on to it. When Christ really comes in, we turn from (repent of)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 228, 24, 23, 'our self-centered life, and God becomes the center.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 228, 25, 23, 'Consider Others Even in Our Material Requests');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 228, 26, 23, 'In the three requests concerning ourselves at the end of the Lord’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 228, 27, 23, 'prayer, Jesus does mention material things (give us this day our daily');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 228, 28, 23, 'bread), but He links them with “Thy will be done on Earth as it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 229, 1, 23, 'Heaven.” I am saying “My Father, I want to do Your will on earth in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 229, 2, 23, 'life exactly like the angels do it Heaven, which is instant obedience;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 229, 3, 23, 'and in order to do Your will, I need health, so give me my daily bread.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 229, 4, 23, 'Are you praying for daily bread in order to do God’s will, or in order');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 229, 5, 23, 'for you to do your own will? Is it in order to sin, or in order to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 229, 6, 23, 'please God? Our prayer should be, “Give me this day my daily bread for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 229, 7, 23, 'health and strength to live for God.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 229, 8, 23, 'The other thing to notice is that in this entire prayer, the words “me”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 229, 9, 23, 'and “my” are missing. Isn’t that interesting, that in our own prayers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 229, 10, 23, 'you’ll find “me” and “my” very frequently, but in the prayer that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 229, 11, 23, 'Lord taught us to pray, these words are completely absent. He says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 229, 12, 23, '“Give us” - “it is not just me Lord, I think of my brother too, he needs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 229, 13, 23, 'his daily bread.” “Forgive us” - “don’t just forgive me, forgive my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 229, 14, 23, 'brother too.” “Deliver us…” The truly spiritual man is a man whose life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 229, 15, 23, 'is centered in God, and when it comes to considering himself, he thinks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 229, 16, 23, 'not only of himself, but also of the people around him - others who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 229, 17, 23, 'also part of the family of God. Because God is the Father of large');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 229, 18, 23, 'family, he thinks of others as well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 229, 19, 23, 'The proper order is Christ first, and then others and me together; not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 229, 20, 23, 'just me by myself. That’s the way a spiritual person prays: not just for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 229, 21, 23, 'his own needs. He is concerned about his children naturally, but he is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 229, 22, 23, 'also concerned about somebody else’s children. He doesn’t look down on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 229, 23, 23, 'them. It is not humanly possible to be burdened as much for other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 229, 24, 23, 'people’s children as for our own. We must be realistic, but we must have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 229, 25, 23, 'some concern for them. Give us this day our daily bread.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 229, 26, 23, 'Forgiving Others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 229, 27, 23, '“Forgive us our sins as we have forgiven others.” This is an important');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 229, 28, 23, 'request. It is the one request Jesus repeats at the end. He says in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 230, 1, 23, 'verse 14, “If you forgive men their transgressions, your Heavenly Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 230, 2, 23, 'will also forgive you.” It is very important to understand this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 230, 3, 23, 'condition, because Jesus Himself laid it down: if you don’t forgive men,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 230, 4, 23, 'then your Father will not forgive your transgressions. Is this true, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 230, 5, 23, 'not?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 230, 6, 23, 'Does God withhold forgiveness when you don’t forgive somebody else for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 230, 7, 23, 'what that person did against you? Absolutely. He will not forgive you if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 230, 8, 23, 'you don’t forgive other people. Please remember this. It is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 230, 9, 23, 'fundamental principle in God’s dealings with men that He treats us like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 230, 10, 23, 'we treat other people. If we are merciful to others, then God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 230, 11, 23, 'merciful to us. If you forgive others, then God forgives you. We saw');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 230, 12, 23, 'that in Matthew 5:7, “Blessed are the merciful, for they will obtain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 230, 13, 23, 'mercy.” Here we can say, blessed are those who forgive others, for they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 230, 14, 23, 'will be forgiven; and those who do not forgive others will not be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 230, 15, 23, 'forgiven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 230, 16, 23, 'Jesus once told a story in this connection to illustrate it clearly in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 230, 17, 23, 'Matthew 18:21-35. This is a very important parable that we need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 230, 18, 23, 'understand. There was a king who had many slaves and they all owed him a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 230, 19, 23, 'lot of money. One man owed him 10,000 talents, which is something like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 230, 20, 23, 'billion rupees - a huge debt that you can never pay. The king was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 230, 21, 23, 'merciful and forgave him. This forgiven man went out and found another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 230, 22, 23, 'person who owed him a hundred rupees, caught him by the throat, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 230, 23, 23, 'said, ‘If you don’t pay me, I will take you to court and have you locked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 230, 24, 23, 'up,” and then he does just that. When other slaves saw this, they went');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 230, 25, 23, 'and reported to the king. The king called the slave and said, ‘You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 230, 26, 23, 'wicked slave, you just asked me to forgive your debt and I forgave you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 230, 27, 23, 'Shouldn’t you also have mercy on your fellow slave, even as I had mercy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 230, 28, 23, 'on you? And he was moved with anger. The King handed this slave over to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 231, 1, 23, 'the torturers until he paid back everything he owed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 231, 2, 23, 'In other words, that forgiven debt was put back upon his head. How do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 231, 3, 23, 'you account for that? Does God, who forgives us, un-forgive us? Does He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 231, 4, 23, 'put back on our heads the sins He has already forgiven? According to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 231, 5, 23, 'this verse, yes. The Bible never says that God has forgotten our sins.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 231, 6, 23, 'He says, “I will not remember your sins anymore,” meaning, “I will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 231, 7, 23, 'hold your sins against you.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 231, 8, 23, 'There is no verse that says that God completely forgets. I myself cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 231, 9, 23, 'forget the sins I committed, so how can God forget them? No, He still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 231, 10, 23, 'knows, but doesn’t hold them against us. This parable teaches us that if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 231, 11, 23, 'you forgive others, God forgives you, and if you do not forgive, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 231, 12, 23, 'will not forgive you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 231, 13, 23, 'Be Humble Towards Temptation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 231, 14, 23, 'And then the last request is, “Do not lead us into temptation.” What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 231, 15, 23, 'does that mean? God will not allow us to be tempted beyond our ability');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 231, 16, 23, '(1 Corinthians 10:13), but it is good for us to pray this, because it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 231, 17, 23, 'good for us to recognize that some temptations are way beyond our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 231, 18, 23, 'ability to cope with. We know that God will not allow us to be tested');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 231, 19, 23, 'beyond our ability, but we need to pray to not be led into temptation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 231, 20, 23, 'that is too strong for us. “But deliver me from evil.” I am expressing a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 231, 21, 23, 'humble position saying, “I do not know how to overcome this temptation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 231, 22, 23, 'I don’t have the ability to overcome this temptation. So Lord, my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 231, 23, 23, 'Father, please don’t lead me into something too strong for me.” When I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 231, 24, 23, 'pray like this, I am expressing my inability and helplessness. That’s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 231, 25, 23, 'good attitude to have towards temptation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 231, 26, 23, 'We are not to think that we are too strong to be overcome by temptation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 231, 27, 23, 'That’s the reason many people don’t have victory over sin. The reason');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 231, 28, 23, 'most Christians are defeated by sin is that they have too much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 232, 1, 23, 'self-confidence. They think they have the ability -- they think that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 232, 2, 23, 'having a few more good resolutions and gritting their teeth will help');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 232, 3, 23, 'them overcome. No, that won’t. We have to acknowledge, “Lord, don’t lead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 232, 4, 23, 'me into temptation too strong for me, and when I face any temptation,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 232, 5, 23, 'deliver me from evil, because I can’t overcome evil on my own.” If only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 232, 6, 23, 'we would recognize that evil is far too strong for us, even in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 232, 7, 23, 'matter of forgiving others, then we would pray as Jesus teaches here. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 232, 8, 23, 'you find it difficult to forgive somebody -- if somebody has done');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 232, 9, 23, 'terrible harm to you or to your family, and you find it very difficult');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 232, 10, 23, 'to forgive that person, for the evil that person has done, -- then you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 232, 11, 23, 'can ask God for grace. Say, “Lord please help me, deliver me from this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 232, 12, 23, 'evil of an unforgiving spirit. I don’t have the ability to forgive this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 232, 13, 23, 'person, but I ask You to help me to forgive him.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 232, 14, 23, 'Prayer is an expression of our weakness and our helpless dependence on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 232, 15, 23, 'God, and faith is the confidence that God will help me because He is my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 232, 16, 23, 'Father Who is in heaven, Who sent His Son to die to free me from all my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 232, 17, 23, 'sins. Romans 8:32 says, “If He gave His son to free you from all your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 232, 18, 23, 'sins, how much more will He will give you everything that you need along');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 232, 19, 23, 'with Him!”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 232, 20, 23, 'The prayer concludes in Matthew 6:13, “For Thine is the Kingdom, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 232, 21, 23, 'power and the glory forever and ever, Amen”.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 232, 22, 23, 'It is very important that we conclude our prayer like this and say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 232, 23, 23, '“Lord, at the end of it all, when you have answered my prayer and done');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 232, 24, 23, 'everything that I asked you for, I want to acknowledge that the kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 232, 25, 23, 'is Yours, and the power is Yours. I don’t have power to be able live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 232, 26, 23, 'this life; I don’t have power to overcome sin. The power is Yours. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 232, 27, 23, 'when I do overcome sin, the glory also be Yours.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 232, 28, 23, 'Then the prayer concludes with “Amen,” which means, “It will be so”.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 233, 1, 23, 'Keep Praying - Never Give Up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 233, 2, 23, 'Jesus placed a great importance on prayer. One of the things Jesus said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 233, 3, 23, 'in Luke 18:1 was that men should always pray and not give up - not get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 233, 4, 23, 'discouraged. In each of the only two parables He gave on prayer, Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 233, 5, 23, 'spoke of persistence. One example of this is the widow who went to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 233, 6, 23, 'judge in Luke 18:1-8, who kept on asking until she got justice against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 233, 7, 23, 'her enemy. Hers is a prayer for overcoming Satan and the lust in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 233, 8, 23, 'flesh. The other example is in Luke 11:5-13, where Jesus was speaking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 233, 9, 23, 'about asking God for bread - for strength and gifts to help another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 233, 10, 23, 'person who is in need who comes to us. In both parables, the emphasis is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 233, 11, 23, 'on persistence; the person keeps on knocking until he gets that bread.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 233, 12, 23, 'The total teaching of Jesus regarding prayer is never give up! God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 233, 13, 23, 'your Father: He will meet your need, He will overcome the enemy for you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 233, 14, 23, 'and He will give you all that you need to bless others. We need to go to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 233, 15, 23, 'God in prayer and in faith, believing that He will give us what we ask');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 233, 16, 23, 'for his glory, Amen.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 233, 17, 24, 'Chapter 23 Fasting in Secret and Love of Money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 233, 18, 24, 'Jesus first spoke about giving, then about praying, and then about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 233, 19, 24, 'fasting. In Matthew 6:16-18, Jesus speaks of fasting. The principle is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 233, 20, 24, 'the same for fasting as it is for prayer -- do it in secret. “Don’t be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 233, 21, 24, 'like the hypocrites who neglect their appearance in order to be seen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 233, 22, 24, 'fasting by men -- they have their reward in full. But when you fast,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 233, 23, 24, 'anoint your head, and wash your face so that you may not be seen fasting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 233, 24, 24, 'by men, but by your Father who is in secret”.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 233, 25, 24, 'Many Christians like to secretly boast about what they have done for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 233, 26, 24, 'Lord (in the areas of giving, praying, and fasting), but Jesus said to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 233, 27, 24, 'keep it secret -- let God reward you in the final day. Many would like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 233, 28, 24, 'others to know how much they pray. For example, you read in some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 234, 1, 24, 'people’s biographies that they would spend a certain number of hours in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 234, 2, 24, 'prayer every day. If that person was praying in secret, he should have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 234, 3, 24, 'never let anybody know that he was praying. Perhaps he couldn’t avoid');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 234, 4, 24, 'his family members knowing, but otherwise nobody else should know how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 234, 5, 24, 'much a person prays. He should tell his family members not to tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 234, 6, 24, 'anyone. Very often you read biographies of such people and you just get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 234, 7, 24, 'discouraged. The Bible doesn’t tell you to pray for two hours or for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 234, 8, 24, 'four hours. It just tells you to pray always (Luke 18:1) and without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 234, 9, 24, 'ceasing (1 Thessalonians 5:17).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 234, 10, 24, 'If you pray, don’t let anybody know how long you prayed for or anything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 234, 11, 24, 'concerning your prayer. When you give, don’t let anybody know how much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 234, 12, 24, 'you gave. And in the area of fasting, perhaps more than praying and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 234, 13, 24, 'giving, keep it secret. I have heard numerous people tell others that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 234, 14, 24, 'they fasted for 7 days or 21 days or 40 days -- and I don’t see any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 234, 15, 24, 'righteous purpose in that. Such stories are outright disobedience to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 234, 16, 24, 'Word of God, which says that you should never let anybody know how long');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 234, 17, 24, 'you fasted, whether it was for one meal or 40 days. Jesus said this so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 234, 18, 24, 'clearly, and yet this command is thoroughly disobeyed by almost');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 234, 19, 24, 'everybody who fasts. I presume that very few people on earth fast');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 234, 20, 24, 'without anybody knowing about it, but they are the ones who will get a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 234, 21, 24, 'reward from God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 234, 22, 24, 'Notice this expression that comes repeatedly in the areas of giving,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 234, 23, 24, 'praying and fasting. “Your Father, who sees in secret, will repay you”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 234, 24, 24, '(Matthew 6:4,6,18).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 234, 25, 24, 'People will see the result of your secret activity in these three areas');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 234, 26, 24, 'in your life. There is no need for you to advertise. When you advertise,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 234, 27, 24, 'you are seeking your own honor and glory, the very thing that Jesus said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 234, 28, 24, 'you should avoid. This is why I have no respect for people who tell me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 235, 1, 24, 'how long they pray for, how much they give, or how much they fast. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 235, 2, 24, 'don’t respect them because they are disobeying the command of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 235, 3, 24, 'openly. If somebody tells you how long he fasted, remind him that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 235, 4, 24, 'said we are not supposed to tell anyone how long we fasted.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 235, 5, 24, 'The Purpose of Fasting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 235, 6, 24, 'All of us have a tremendous love for food. Every human being loves it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 235, 7, 24, 'and it is very easy for food to become our god. In fact, in Philippians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 235, 8, 24, '3:18-19, it speaks about certain people whose god is their appetite.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 235, 9, 24, 'They are called enemies of the cross of Christ. Food can be an idol that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 235, 10, 24, 'replaces God and becomes too essential in your life. Fasting breaks that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 235, 11, 24, 'slavery to food.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 235, 12, 24, 'Fasting also helps us really understand what hungry people in the world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 235, 13, 24, 'feel like. I never knew what hungry people in the world feel like until');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 235, 14, 24, 'I fasted, and you won’t know what hungry people feel like until you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 235, 15, 24, 'fast. That is another purpose of fasting. It detaches us and helps us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 235, 16, 24, 'concentrate more on the things that we are particularly praying about.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 235, 17, 24, 'Very often prayer is coupled with fasting, and usually, when you have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 235, 18, 24, 'take some momentous decision, it is good to concentrate and maybe take a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 235, 19, 24, 'day off from work to fast and seek God in prayer. It doesn’t mean you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 235, 20, 24, 'have to be on your knees all the time. Sometimes you can also go to work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 235, 21, 24, 'while fasting.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 235, 22, 24, 'Fasting is a very good habit to do as discipline. I believe that all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 235, 23, 24, 'godly men give, pray, and fast. A person who is spiritual will always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 235, 24, 24, 'give, pray, and fast in secret. A person who does not do these three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 235, 25, 24, 'things should not consider himself to be a very spiritual person at all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 235, 26, 24, 'The important thing in all these areas is to do it in secret.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 235, 27, 24, 'Now we come to another very important area. We have seen the wrong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 235, 28, 24, 'attitudes of anger, sinful sexual desire, lying, revenge, and hatred in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 236, 1, 24, 'Matthew 5:21-48. The sixth we considered is seeking the honor of men');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 236, 2, 24, '(Matthew 6:1-18).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 236, 3, 24, 'Do Not Love Money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 236, 4, 24, 'The seventh wrong attitude is an attitude that loves money (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 236, 5, 24, '6:19-24). Many people do not believe this is a wrong attitude. To have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 236, 6, 24, 'money is not a sin, to love money is a sin. Jesus said, “don’t lay up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 236, 7, 24, 'for yourself treasure upon earth, where moth and rust will destroy and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 236, 8, 24, 'where thieves break in and steal. But lay up for yourself treasure in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 236, 9, 24, 'Heaven, where no moth nor rust destroys, and where thieves cannot break');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 236, 10, 24, 'in or steal --the reason is -- because where your treasure is, there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 236, 11, 24, 'will your heart be also (Matthew 6:19-21).”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 236, 12, 24, 'It is very easy to understand whether we have obeyed this command or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 236, 13, 24, 'not. If your mind is thinking more about earthly things than Heavenly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 236, 14, 24, 'things -- If you are thinking more about your earthly assets and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 236, 15, 24, 'properties than Heavenly things -- you can be pretty sure that your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 236, 16, 24, 'heart is on this earth, and that your treasure is also here. The way to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 236, 17, 24, 'know whether we have obeyed this command is to ask ourselves during the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 236, 18, 24, 'day where is our heart set. In the middle of our work (or anything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 236, 19, 24, 'else), if we’re terribly disturbed because of a little financial loss or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 236, 20, 24, 'excited because of a financial gain, this could indicate that our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 236, 21, 24, 'treasure is on this Earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 236, 22, 24, 'I remember many years ago, when somebody gave me a small financial gift,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 236, 23, 24, 'the Lord asked me a question - ‘Has your joy increased?” I suddenly felt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 236, 24, 24, 'convicted and confessed to the Lord that my joy did increase because I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 236, 25, 24, 'got this little money. I learned that day that I must rejoice only in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 236, 26, 24, 'the Lord and not in money. I also learned that the increase of money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 236, 27, 24, 'should never increase my joy. If it does increase my joy, it means that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 236, 28, 24, 'my joy is in money.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 237, 1, 24, 'The Bible says to rejoice in the Lord always - and the Lord is always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 237, 2, 24, 'the same - so if you gain money or lose money, your joy in the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 237, 3, 24, 'should not increase or decrease. It should be the same. If your joy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 237, 4, 24, 'decreases because you lost some money, you can be pretty sure that your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 237, 5, 24, 'heart was there. If your joy increases because you got some money, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 237, 6, 24, 'can be pretty sure your heart was there. We must trust God. He will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 237, 7, 24, 'provide all we need for our earthly life, but we must not find our joy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 237, 8, 24, 'in these earthly things. We can use these earthly things but should not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 237, 9, 24, 'find our joy in them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 237, 10, 24, 'Make Money Your Servant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 237, 11, 24, 'Money is a wonderful servant, but it is a terrible master -- just like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 237, 12, 24, 'fire. Fire is a wonderful servant but a terrible master. We cannot live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 237, 13, 24, 'without fire in our houses, to cook, for example. But if the fire in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 237, 14, 24, 'that stove becomes a master, then the house will be burnt up. It is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 237, 15, 24, 'terrible master - capable of burning down your whole house - but if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 237, 16, 24, 'keep it under control (when you turn the knob say, “I am going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 237, 17, 24, 'control when I turn you on, and when I turn you off. I am going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 237, 18, 24, 'decide that. I, not you.” Thus you are master of the house), then it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 237, 19, 24, 'a wonderful servant. Money must be like that. Just like we need fire, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 237, 20, 24, 'need money to live on this earth, but it must be a servant. You must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 237, 21, 24, 'say, “Money I am going to decide that you are not going to control me; I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 237, 22, 24, 'am going to control you. You are not going to control my mind and make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 237, 23, 24, 'me think about you all the time. I am going to think about the Lord and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 237, 24, 24, 'things of Heaven, but I am going to use you.” This is the position of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 237, 25, 24, 'spiritual man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 237, 26, 24, 'Gold is a very good thing if it is used as a servant. The Bible says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 237, 27, 24, 'there is even gold in Heaven! But there, we read about streets of gold.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 237, 28, 24, 'That means you walk on it, it is under your feet. This is the difference');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 238, 1, 24, 'between a heavenly Christian and an earthly-minded Christian. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 238, 2, 24, 'heavenly-minded Christian has put gold under his feet - it does not rule');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 238, 3, 24, 'him - but a carnal Christian wears gold on his head and it is on his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 238, 4, 24, 'mind all the time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 238, 5, 24, 'So if money is on your mind all the time, then you love it, whether you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 238, 6, 24, 'like it or not. It’s like a boy who loves a girl and is always thinking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 238, 7, 24, 'about her. One who is always thinking about money is in love with money,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 238, 8, 24, 'and the love of money is root of all sorts of evil. You don’t have to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 238, 9, 24, 'rich to love money. I have never seen a beggar in India who does not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 238, 10, 24, 'love money. Every beggar loves money. If you gave them 50 paisa they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 238, 11, 24, 'would despise it. They love money and want more. Thus, it is not wealth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 238, 12, 24, 'that makes a man love money. Poor people love money too just as much as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 238, 13, 24, 'rich people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 238, 14, 24, 'It is also the case that you can be free from money irrespective of how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 238, 15, 24, 'much wealth you have. It is a question of your attitude towards it. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 238, 16, 24, 'you have one servant in your home, and he takes over your house, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 238, 17, 24, 'would be terrible. You can have a little money (like having one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 238, 18, 24, 'servant), but he has taken over your house and rules your thinking. On');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 238, 19, 24, 'the other hand, you can have 318 servants like Abraham had, yet they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 238, 20, 24, 'were all his servants and obeyed him. Like Abraham, you can have lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 238, 21, 24, 'money, and if you rule over it, then you can use it for the glory of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 238, 22, 24, 'God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 238, 23, 24, 'The love of money is the root of all evil, (not necessarily having');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 238, 24, 24, 'plenty of money). It is very important to understand this distinction. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 238, 25, 24, 'have seen many poor people who love money tremendously, and I have seen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 238, 26, 24, 'rich people who do not love it. I have seen that it is not a question of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 238, 27, 24, 'how much you have, but what you love. This is what Jesus was speaking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 238, 28, 24, 'about. Your mind must be set on the things above. Lay up treasure in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 239, 1, 24, 'Heaven. Check what are you thinking of, where your heart is, to discover');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 239, 2, 24, 'what are you in love with.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 239, 3, 24, 'Then Jesus goes on to speak about the eye in relation to money in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 239, 4, 24, 'Matthew 6:22, “The lamp of the body is the eye, and if your eye is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 239, 5, 24, 'clear, your whole body will be full of light.” This means that it is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 239, 6, 24, 'question of how you look at money. If your eye is bad, it means that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 239, 7, 24, 'look at money as something very important, as most important for your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 239, 8, 24, 'life on earth, and your body will be full of darkness. “If the light');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 239, 9, 24, 'that is in you is darkness, how great that darkness is.” It is amazing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 239, 10, 24, 'that many people who have all of their doctrines right, and are good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 239, 11, 24, 'Christians in the eyes of others, who go to church services regularly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 239, 12, 24, 'yet they love money tremendously. They may even look down on other dead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 239, 13, 24, 'denominations without knowing that people in dead denominations are free');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 239, 14, 24, 'from the love of money than they are, who claim to be in New Testament');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 239, 15, 24, 'patterned churches.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 239, 16, 24, 'Ask yourself some fundamental questions like these: do you get excited');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 239, 17, 24, 'when you get little more money? Do you get depressed when you lose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 239, 18, 24, 'money? Then you love money. Our joy will be completely unaffected if it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 239, 19, 24, 'is in the Lord alone. If our joy is in earthly things, it will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 239, 20, 24, 'affected by changes in our income.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 239, 21, 24, 'If You Serve Mammon, You Cannot Serve God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 239, 22, 24, 'Jesus went on to make a tremendously important statement in Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 239, 23, 24, '6:24. Having just said that the love of money is as wrong as revenge or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 239, 24, 24, 'hatred, as wrong as seeking the honor of men, telling lies, lusting, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 239, 25, 24, 'getting angry, He explains even further. In Matthew 6:24, Jesus says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 239, 26, 24, '“No one can serve two masters; either he will hate the one and love the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 239, 27, 24, 'other, or he will hold on to one and despise the other. You cannot serve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 239, 28, 24, 'God and mammon.” The two masters are not God and devil - there is no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 240, 1, 24, 'Christian who feels that he can serve God and the devil. The two masters');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 240, 2, 24, 'are God and money. There are lot of Christians who think they can love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 240, 3, 24, 'God and they can also love money. They don’t think that they can love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 240, 4, 24, 'God and Satan, but they do think they can love God and money. But Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 240, 5, 24, 'just demolished this idea and said, “You cannot do that.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 240, 6, 24, 'This is so important in our day, where we find that many Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 240, 7, 24, 'leaders and preachers are always asking people to give money to their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 240, 8, 24, 'ministry. A lot of the money that is given enables this great preacher');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 240, 9, 24, 'to live a very luxurious lifestyle, often ten times better than the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 240, 10, 24, 'people who are giving him the money. This is a crime that people on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 240, 11, 24, 'earth don’t judge, but God will severely judge such people in the Final');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 240, 12, 24, 'Day. Can you imagine Jesus taking money from poor people and living at a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 240, 13, 24, 'much higher standard than them? Is that the Jesus you see in Scripture?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 240, 14, 24, 'Far from it! Jesus would not take money from poor people and live at a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 240, 15, 24, 'higher standard Himself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 240, 16, 24, 'There are many today however, who call themselves servants of God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 240, 17, 24, 'take money from poor believers to live in a luxurious lifestyle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 240, 18, 24, 'themselves. This is a crime of the first order, and if Jesus was here,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 240, 19, 24, 'He would take a whip and chase such people out of the church. He would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 240, 20, 24, 'say, “Listen, if you want to make money, go out and do business');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 240, 21, 24, 'somewhere else. Go and do some other work, earn as much as you can, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 240, 22, 24, 'do what you like; but don’t take money in God’s name, from people who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 240, 23, 24, 'give for God''s work, and use it to live luxuriously.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 240, 24, 24, 'God has ordained that those who preach the gospel should live of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 240, 25, 24, 'Gospel (1 Corinthians 9:14). But many people misuse this verse. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 240, 26, 24, 'verse says, “The Lord has directed those who proclaim the Gospel to get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 240, 27, 24, 'their living from the Gospel.” It is right for those who preach the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 240, 28, 24, 'gospel to receive gifts to take care of their earthly needs, but the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 241, 1, 24, 'Lord has not directed that those who proclaim the Gospel should live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 241, 2, 24, 'luxuriously from it. This is the result of the covetousness of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 241, 3, 24, 'preachers. We see plenty of examples in Christendom today, of people who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 241, 4, 24, 'misuse this verse and live at a far higher standard of life than the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 241, 5, 24, 'people who support them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 241, 6, 24, 'Most preachers today, particularly those on television, are not serving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 241, 7, 24, 'God. They are serving money. Why is it that so many people who claim to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 241, 8, 24, 'be able to do miracles and healings in big stadiums and on television');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 241, 9, 24, 'say God can do anything? It is quite hilarious when I look at it and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 241, 10, 24, 'hear them; “God can open blind eyes, raise the dead, open deaf ears,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 241, 11, 24, 'cleanse the leper, and heal the sick! He can do any miracle, and He can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 241, 12, 24, 'do all types of things for you. There is one miracle God cannot do - He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 241, 13, 24, 'cannot give me money for my needs, so you people have to do that for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 241, 14, 24, 'me.” You see what a joke this is? Is that the one miracle God cannot do?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 241, 15, 24, 'The Lord says the silver and the gold in all the universe is His, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 241, 16, 24, 'that the cattle on a thousand hills are His (Psalms 50).” If I were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 241, 17, 24, 'hungry, I would not tell you.” If this billionaire is the Ruler of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 241, 18, 24, 'universe whose servants we claim to be, then why do we go begging to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 241, 19, 24, 'people for money? No servant can serve two masters. If you cannot trust');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 241, 20, 24, 'your Heavenly Father to meet your needs, stop serving Him and go do some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 241, 21, 24, 'earthly business.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 241, 22, 24, 'If You Love Money, You Hate God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 241, 23, 24, 'No one can serve two masters. “Either he will hate the one and love the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 241, 24, 24, 'other.” It is quite a radical thing Jesus says here, just like Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 241, 25, 24, 'speaks about hating father, mother, wife, children, brothers, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 241, 26, 24, 'sisters in Luke 14:26. Jesus was radical. Jesus says that if you want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 241, 27, 24, 'love God, you have to hate money (Matthew 6:24). Mammon refers to money,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 241, 28, 24, 'real estate, stocks and shares. Jesus says that if you want to love God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 242, 1, 24, 'you must hate all of that. You can use it, but your love for God must be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 242, 2, 24, 'so supreme -- like the brightness of the sun -- that your interest in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 242, 3, 24, 'money disappears as stars disappear in daylight. If it is not like that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 242, 4, 24, 'for you, you cannot serve God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 242, 5, 24, 'Jesus says, “If you hold onto one, you despise the other.” Put “the Word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 242, 6, 24, 'God” and “mammon” into that sentence and this is how it reads: “No one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 242, 7, 24, 'can serve God and material things (material wealth, money). Either he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 242, 8, 24, 'will hate money and love God or hate God and love money.” The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 242, 9, 24, 'implication of what Jesus’ saying is that anyone who loves money, hates');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 242, 10, 24, 'God. You may not have not known it before, but now you do. Jesus is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 242, 11, 24, 'saying that if you love money, you hate God. You may think you love God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 242, 12, 24, 'just because you sing a lot of songs to Him, but that is not what Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 242, 13, 24, 'says. Jesus says that if you hold onto God, you will despise money, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 242, 14, 24, 'if you hold onto money, you despise God. You can have money and earn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 242, 15, 24, 'money, but the moment you begin to love it you begin to hate God. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 242, 16, 24, 'may have given a good job or an inheritance where you have lot of money,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 242, 17, 24, 'and that is fine. But if you love it, and hold onto it, you despise God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 242, 18, 24, 'and you hate God. It is so important for us to understand and to have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 242, 19, 24, 'right attitude in this if we want to serve the Lord faithfully.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 242, 20, 24, 'In Luke 16:11, Jesus said, “If you are not faithful in the use of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 242, 21, 24, 'unrighteous mammon, who will entrust the true riches to you?” The true');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 242, 22, 24, 'riches are revelation in God’s Word, likeness to Christ, the anointing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 242, 23, 24, 'of the Holy Spirit, and partaking of God’s nature. Why is it we find so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 242, 24, 24, 'few Christians manifesting the likeness of Christ, getting revelation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 242, 25, 24, 'from God’s Word, and having a rich anointing of Holy Spirit? One reason');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 242, 26, 24, 'is that they are not faithful with mammon. This is the reason for all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 242, 27, 24, 'the boring sermons that we hear in churches and all the unfaithfulness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 242, 28, 24, 'that we see in Christian workers. Money is an alternate master to God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 243, 1, 24, 'and if you want to have a right attitude to God, you must keep money in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 243, 2, 24, 'its proper place, as a servant, under your feet.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 243, 3, 25, 'Chapter 24 Do Not Be Anxious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 243, 4, 25, 'The eighth wrong attitude, anxiety, is mentioned in Matthew 6:25-34.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 243, 5, 25, 'Many people don''t think of anxiety as a sin, just like a lot of people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 243, 6, 25, 'don''t think of anger, love of money, seeking honor from men, hating your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 243, 7, 25, 'enemy, or telling white lies as a sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 243, 8, 25, 'Treat Sin as Seriously as God Does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 243, 9, 25, 'Many people think of love of money or anger is a weakness. As long as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 243, 10, 25, 'you call it a “weakness,” you will never be free from it. Jesus didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 243, 11, 25, 'come to save us from weaknesses; He came to save us from sin. If we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 243, 12, 25, 'confess something as sin, Jesus will save us from it. But if you try to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 243, 13, 25, 'give it a more polished name, you will never be free from it. Call');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 243, 14, 25, 'something by the dirtiest name you can think of -- call lust,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 243, 15, 25, '“adultery,” call anger, “murder,” call the love of money, “the hatred of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 243, 16, 25, 'God,” and you''ll be free from it because you see what an evil it is.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 243, 17, 25, 'If you think of AIDS and cancer only as serious as a cough or a cold,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 243, 18, 25, 'you are not going to take it seriously. Many people take these sins very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 243, 19, 25, 'lightly even though Jesus spoke so strongly against them. I don''t blame');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 243, 20, 25, 'them because I would say that their leaders and teachers have not taught');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 243, 21, 25, 'these things to them. There is a great lack of Christian preachers and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 243, 22, 25, 'teachers who preach the whole truth of God and who do not seek the honor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 243, 23, 25, 'of men. There are few preachers who do not want anybody''s money but want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 243, 24, 25, 'to speak the truth to lead God''s people to spiritual help. It’s like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 243, 25, 25, 'doctor who is not interested in your money but who is interested in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 243, 26, 25, 'leading you to health. There are very few preachers like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 243, 27, 25, 'People also call anxiety a weakness. It is not just a weakness. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 243, 28, 25, 'Matthew 6:25-34, Three times in Matthew 6:25-34, Jesus Christ, the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 244, 1, 25, 'of the Universe, says, “Do not be anxious.” In the space of just ten');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 244, 2, 25, 'verses, the Lord says “Do not be anxious” three times. This is the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 244, 3, 25, 'Lord Who commanded us not to commit murder, not to commit adultery, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 244, 4, 25, 'not to steal. Put them all together: “Do not kill, do not commit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 244, 5, 25, 'adultery, do not steal, and do not be anxious.” Which one is not a sin?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 244, 6, 25, 'Can you say, “Oh well, I''m anxious only once or twice a week?” That’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 244, 7, 25, 'like saying, “Well, I murder people only once or twice a week” or, “I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 244, 8, 25, 'commit adultery once or twice a week, not too often.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 244, 9, 25, 'Why is it that we take some sins seriously, and not others? Because your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 244, 10, 25, 'teachers haven''t taught you. Fear is not a weakness, it''s a sin -- like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 244, 11, 25, 'murder is a sin. How do we know what is sin? If God says you shouldn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 244, 12, 25, 'do it, then it is a sin. If God has said you must love your wife, even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 244, 13, 25, 'if your wife is an evil woman, you have to love her, because God said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 244, 14, 25, 'so. And if God has said not to do something, even if you don''t think it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 244, 15, 25, 'is evil, don’t do it -- it is evil. It''s not because I think adultery is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 244, 16, 25, 'bad. God has said, “Don''t do it.” He has said, “Don''t be anxious, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 244, 17, 25, 'don''t be afraid.” I want to see the things which God has said “don''t do”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 244, 18, 25, 'as evil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 244, 19, 25, 'Anxiety Is an Insult to God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 244, 20, 25, 'Anxiety destroys my fellowship with God. Anxiety says that God doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 244, 21, 25, 'care for me. It is an insult to God. What would you think of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 244, 22, 25, 'four-year-old child who is eating from the garbage bins? There are a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 244, 23, 25, 'number of them like that in our country. Unfortunately, they don’t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 244, 24, 25, 'parents who care for them. Is our Heavenly Father like that? Does our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 244, 25, 25, 'Heavenly Father not care for us? It is an insult to put our Heavenly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 244, 26, 25, 'Father in the same category as the fathers of those children who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 244, 27, 25, 'eating from those garbage bins. These children don''t know where their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 244, 28, 25, 'next meal is going to come from -- they have a right to be anxious,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 245, 1, 25, 'because their earthly fathers don''t care for them. But if you have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 245, 2, 25, 'Heavenly Father and you''re anxious, you''re saying that your Heavenly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 245, 3, 25, 'Father is also in the same category.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 245, 4, 25, '“For this reason I say to you, do not be anxious for your life” (verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 245, 5, 25, '25). Don''t be anxious for your life -- what you eat, what you drink, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 245, 6, 25, 'for your body. Isn’t your life more than food body and clothing? Luke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 245, 7, 25, 'takes the example of the birds of the air -- they don''t sow, they don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 245, 8, 25, 'reap, nor do they gather into barns, yet your Heavenly Father feeds');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 245, 9, 25, 'them. How many times have you seen a dead bird on the road? It is such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 245, 10, 25, 'rare sight to see a dead bird on the road. I think I can count on my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 245, 11, 25, 'fingers the number of times in my entire life that I''ve seen a dead bird');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 245, 12, 25, 'on the road. Where have you seen birds starving? It''s such a rare thing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 245, 13, 25, 'There are millions and millions of these birds on earth, and they get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 245, 14, 25, 'food even though they don''t sow, they don''t reap, and they have to go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 245, 15, 25, 'looking for food here and there. Who feeds them? Jesus said your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 245, 16, 25, 'Heavenly Father feeds them. He''s not their Heavenly Father; He''s your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 245, 17, 25, 'Heavenly Father. He''s their Creator, and He feeds them, but with you, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 245, 18, 25, 'is not just your Creator; He is your Father. Are you not worth much more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 245, 19, 25, 'than these birds?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 245, 20, 25, 'I read a little poem once which is a very interesting. It is about two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 245, 21, 25, 'little birds talking to each other. The Robin said to the Sparrow, “I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 245, 22, 25, 'would really like to know why these anxious human beings rush about and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 245, 23, 25, 'worry so?” The Sparrow said to the Robin, “Friend, I think that it must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 245, 24, 25, 'be that they have no Heavenly Father such as cares for you and me.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 245, 25, 25, 'We need to remember that this is not just a lovely story. It is an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 245, 26, 25, 'insult to God to think that He doesn’t care for our every anxiety.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 245, 27, 25, 'Concern Is Not Anxiety');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 245, 28, 25, 'To have a concern for our children, for example, is good. If your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 246, 1, 25, 'children have not come home at the usual time, to be concerned for them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 246, 2, 25, 'is not wrong. To be concerned is right, but to be anxious is wrong. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 246, 3, 25, 'is like having money. It is right to have money. It is right to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 246, 4, 25, 'concerned for our children, for their future education and their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 246, 5, 25, 'spiritual growth, etc. But to be anxious is wrong.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 246, 6, 25, 'Faith Says, “God Knows”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 246, 7, 25, 'Do not be anxious. Then Jesus says, “By anxiety can you add height to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 246, 8, 25, 'yourself?” No. Why are you anxious about clothing? He says, “Look at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 246, 9, 25, 'lilies of the field, how they grow; they don''t toil and spin clothing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 246, 10, 25, 'for themselves, yet I say to you that even Solomon the Great King in all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 246, 11, 25, 'his glory could not clothe himself like these flowers. And if God can so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 246, 12, 25, 'clothe the grass of the field, which is alive today and tomorrow thrown');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 246, 13, 25, 'into the furnace, won''t He do much more for you, oh you of little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 246, 14, 25, 'faith?” Jesus is speaking to His disciples and saying, “Why are you so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 246, 15, 25, 'worried about what type of clothing you going to wear, where you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 246, 16, 25, 'get it from, etc. God cares for the birds, He cares for the lilies, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 246, 17, 25, 'for the grass of the field (not just the flowers, but even the grass of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 246, 18, 25, 'the field He cares for!). If He has clothed the flowers with such beauty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 246, 19, 25, 'won’t he cloth you?” He certainly will, so then do not be anxious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 246, 20, 25, 'saying, “What shall we eat?” or “What shall we drink?” or “With what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 246, 21, 25, 'shall we clothe ourselves? For all these things the gentiles eagerly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 246, 22, 25, 'seek but your Heavenly Father knows that you need all these things.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 246, 23, 25, 'Faith in this area is to say that my Heavenly Father knows what I need.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 246, 24, 25, 'If that is true, then why should we pray? We pray because, in prayer, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 246, 25, 25, 'are expressing our need to God so that we come into fellowship with Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 246, 26, 25, 'God wants to have fellowship with us and that''s why He wants us to talk');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 246, 27, 25, 'to Him and commune with Him. God wants to commune with us, it is very,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 246, 28, 25, 'very important. This was not possible in the Old Testament. In the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 247, 1, 25, 'Testament, God just spoke to the prophets. The prophets spoke to God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 247, 2, 25, 'and nobody else could have a direct communication with God. But today');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 247, 3, 25, 'God is your Father. You know how much we love little children when they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 247, 4, 25, 'come into our home. Think about a couple that never had children for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 247, 5, 25, 'many years, and how delighted they are when they finally do have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 247, 6, 25, 'child.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 247, 7, 25, 'God says in Isaiah 49:15, “Can a mother forget her sucking child and not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 247, 8, 25, 'care for the child of her womb? Even she might forget, but I will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 247, 9, 25, 'forget you.” That is a beautiful picture of God. He is not only a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 247, 10, 25, 'Father. He is also like a mother. He cares for us so intensely!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 247, 11, 25, 'There are many people who are afraid and wonder who will take care of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 247, 12, 25, 'them when they get older. I have heard people complain to me that their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 247, 13, 25, 'children are not taking care of them now that they are old. But I ask,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 247, 14, 25, '‘Did you bring up your children to take care of you, or did you bring up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 247, 15, 25, 'your children for the glory of God?” Don’t bring up your children to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 247, 16, 25, 'take care of you when you’re old. Bring them up for the glory of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 247, 17, 25, 'Here is a promise for old people from Isaiah 46:3-4. The Lord says to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 247, 18, 25, 'you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 247, 19, 25, '“Listen to Me, O house of Jacob,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 247, 20, 25, 'And all the remnant of the house of Israel,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 247, 21, 25, 'You who have been borne by Me from birth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 247, 22, 25, 'And have been carried from the womb;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 247, 23, 25, 'Even to your old age I will be the same,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 247, 24, 25, 'And even to your graying years I will bear you!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 247, 25, 25, 'I have done it, and I will carry you;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 247, 26, 25, 'And I will bear you and I will deliver you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 247, 27, 25, 'What a promise! Trust in God -- you don''t have to depend on your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 247, 28, 25, 'children. God can use anybody and any means to provide what you need.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 248, 1, 25, 'You don''t have to be anxious.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 248, 2, 25, 'Deal With the Root of Anxiety');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 248, 3, 25, 'The Bible says to be anxious for nothing in Philippians 4:6. It is an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 248, 4, 25, 'absolute statement, “Be anxious for nothing.” But we do need to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 248, 5, 25, 'something about the cause of anxiety. Perhaps there''s some problem that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 248, 6, 25, 'you are facing now, and you don''t know how it will work out. What should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 248, 7, 25, 'you do? God doesn’t say to do nothing; He says to pray about it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 248, 8, 25, 'Supplication means to make a specific request to God and tell God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 248, 9, 25, 'exactly what the problem is. After supplication, don''t forget to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 248, 10, 25, 'complete the prayer with thanksgiving. Thanksgiving is saying, ‘Thank');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 248, 11, 25, 'you, Father, for hearing my prayer, and thank you for caring for me.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 248, 12, 25, 'Giving God thanks is like a receipt -- an acknowledgment that my letter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 248, 13, 25, 'has reached God''s presence and he received the letter -- that’s what I’m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 248, 14, 25, 'saying when I say, “Thank You for hearing me.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 248, 15, 25, 'When you do these two things, Philippians 4:7 says, then “The peace of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 248, 16, 25, 'God which is beyond comprehension, which we cannot even understand, will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 248, 17, 25, 'guard (guard is a military word -- like a fortress) your heart and mind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 248, 18, 25, 'in Christ Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 248, 19, 25, 'To not be anxious is a command we must obey. When I am free from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 248, 20, 25, 'anxiety, I will also be free from a lot to discouragement. This is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 248, 21, 25, 'wonderful step that we must take.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 248, 22, 25, 'The Right Kind of Anxiety');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 248, 23, 25, 'Jesus goes on to say in Matthew 6:33 (paraphrase): “Don’t be anxious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 248, 24, 25, 'about all these earthly things, but if you do want to be anxious about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 248, 25, 25, 'something, be anxious about pursuing God''s kingdom first and His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 248, 26, 25, 'righteousness’. In other words, let those energies be directed toward');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 248, 27, 25, 'seeking God''s Kingdom first and His righteousness, and you will find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 248, 28, 25, 'that all these earthly things which you are anxious about will be taken');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 249, 1, 25, 'care of.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 249, 2, 25, 'That’s a wonderful promise, and it applies to anyone in any age. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 249, 3, 25, 'word ‘kingdom’ refers to the rule of God in our life. If God is my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 249, 4, 25, 'authority, then He is the one who rules over me. It is the government of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 249, 5, 25, 'God I submit to. This is the meaning of seeking God''s kingdom. To “seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 249, 6, 25, 'His righteousness” means to seek total purity in every area of my life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 249, 7, 25, 'When I seek these things first, all my earthly needs will be added to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 249, 8, 25, 'me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 249, 9, 25, 'Financial Debts Reveal a Lack of Trust');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 249, 10, 25, 'Our lives should be a testimony to the truth of this verse. I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 249, 11, 25, 'sought to live following this verse all my life. Sincerely seeking God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 249, 12, 25, 'Kingdom and His righteousness first - to the best of my knowledge and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 249, 13, 25, 'ability - and I can testify that God has certainly added all my earthly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 249, 14, 25, 'needs. I and my wife have been through times of deep poverty, but we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 249, 15, 25, 'have never been in debt ever since I was married.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 249, 16, 25, 'I have never been in debt. When we get into debt, we are saying that our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 249, 17, 25, 'Father has forsaken us. If we trust in God, He will provide our need.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 249, 18, 25, 'When the Bible says in Romans 13:8, “Owe no man anything,” it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 249, 19, 25, 'teaching us never to get into debt.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 249, 20, 25, 'I want to explain what debt is. If you take a loan from the bank to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 249, 21, 25, 'build a house, there is no debt there. Because for the money you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 249, 22, 25, 'borrowed, there''s an asset counter-balancing that debt. If you take a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 249, 23, 25, 'loan to buy a car, and that car is insured, then there is a balance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 249, 24, 25, 'there, and there is no debt in this case. But if you have borrowed money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 249, 25, 25, 'to spend it on yourself - to go on a vacation, for example, or to spend');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 249, 26, 25, 'it on a wedding - and it has evaporated (meaning there''s no asset to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 249, 27, 25, 'counterbalance your borrowing), then it is a debt. We should not get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 249, 28, 25, 'into this type of debt; we must learn to live within our income. If we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 250, 1, 25, 'spend extravagantly, there will be plenty of reason for anxiety. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 250, 2, 25, 'says that the Gentiles live like this -- they eagerly seek to live a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 250, 3, 25, 'very luxurious, comfortable life, and if they can’t afford it, they use');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 250, 4, 25, 'a credit card to keep buying things and get into credit card debt. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 250, 5, 25, 'a shameful thing if a Christian is in credit card debt. If you use a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 250, 6, 25, 'credit card, make sure that it is paid within the month so that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 250, 7, 25, 'don''t pay any interest on it. If you have gotten into the habit of using');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 250, 8, 25, 'a credit card and getting into debt, I want to say to you in Jesus'' name');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 250, 9, 25, 'that you are living in disobedience to God. You have every reason to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 250, 10, 25, 'anxious and worried. You are testifying that your Heavenly Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 250, 11, 25, 'doesn''t care for you. You''re trying to live beyond your means, and you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 250, 12, 25, 'are not satisfied with what God has given you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 250, 13, 25, 'I''m not speaking what I have not practiced. I have been through times');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 250, 14, 25, 'when my wife and I had very little, but we decided to never get into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 250, 15, 25, 'debt. We lived with what we had, and as God increased the circle of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 250, 16, 25, 'finances, we could buy more things. This has been such a tremendous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 250, 17, 25, 'education for us. I can stand boldly before people today and say, no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 250, 18, 25, 'matter what our circumstances, I have learned to be content. Paul could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 250, 19, 25, 'say in his late sixties “I''ve learned to be content in all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 250, 20, 25, 'circumstances. I have learned to have little and I''ve learned to have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 250, 21, 25, 'much” (Philippians 4:12). However much I have been given is up to God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 250, 22, 25, 'But I''m perfectly content. Godliness with contentment is great gain (1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 250, 23, 25, 'Timothy 6:6).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 250, 24, 25, 'It’s very important for us to understand the simple principles of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 250, 25, 25, 'finances because a lot of anxiety comes from a wrong attitude in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 250, 26, 25, 'area of money. It''s a continuation from Jesus’ earlier statement, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 250, 27, 25, 'you cannot serve God and money (Matthew 6:24), that Jesus spoke about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 250, 28, 25, 'anxiety. He said, “For this reason - because you cannot serve God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 251, 1, 25, 'money - do not be anxious” (Matthew 6:25). So seek the kingdom of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 251, 2, 25, 'first and do not be anxious concerning tomorrow, for tomorrow will take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 251, 3, 25, 'care of itself (Matthew 6:34). Each day has got enough trouble of its');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 251, 4, 25, 'own. Just live for today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 251, 5, 25, 'Saving Is Wise, Not Anxious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 251, 6, 25, 'That said, do lay up for the future, by all means. The Bible says, “Go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 251, 7, 25, 'to the ant” (Proverbs 6:6-8). Because the ant knows that in winter time,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 251, 8, 25, 'there won''t be enough grains, it lays up for the future. There is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 251, 9, 25, 'nothing wrong in having a savings account Even Jesus Christ had a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 251, 10, 25, 'treasurer who kept money. That was like a savings account; there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 251, 11, 25, 'nothing wrong with having a savings account. It is not laying up a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 251, 12, 25, 'treasure for yourself. It’s being wise about the future. It is wise to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 251, 13, 25, 'provide for your children. 2 Corinthians 12:14 says that parents should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 251, 14, 25, 'lay up for their children. That’s a perfectly right thing to do. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 251, 15, 25, 'don’t lay up treasure for yourself, but you must provide for your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 251, 16, 25, 'children; that''s right. 1 Timothy 5:8 says that if you don''t care for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 251, 17, 25, 'your family you are worse than an unbeliever. And so, as we conduct');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 251, 18, 25, 'ourselves with wisdom, we can be completely free from anxiety. We don’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 251, 19, 25, 'seek for things that God doesn''t give us, we are satisfied with what God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 251, 20, 25, 'has given us, and we are going to live within our means.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 251, 21, 25, 'It’s a good thing to ask ourselves this question. This little phrase');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 251, 22, 25, 'that Jesus used in verse 32, “these things the Gentiles seek after.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 251, 23, 25, 'What are the things that the Gentiles seek after? Ask yourself whether');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 251, 24, 25, 'you''re seeking after those things. Are you seeking for the same things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 251, 25, 25, 'worldly people seek? Then you shouldn''t be calling yourself a Christian.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 251, 26, 25, 'You should be calling yourself a worldly person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 251, 27, 25, 'A Christian is one who seeks God''s kingdom first and His righteousness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 251, 28, 25, '(Matthew 6:33) and finds that all the other things are added unto him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 252, 1, 25, 'At the end of his life, whether he has lived for fifty years or ninety');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 252, 2, 25, 'years, he can that say he spent his life seeking God''s Kingdom first and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 252, 3, 25, 'His righteousness. I can testify that, in all my years of being a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 252, 4, 25, 'born-again Christian, I have spent my life seeking God''s kingdom and His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 252, 5, 25, 'righteousness, and God has added all that I need. May that be your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 252, 6, 25, 'testimony too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 252, 7, 26, 'Chapter 25 Do Not Judge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 252, 8, 26, 'The ninth wrong attitude - judging and condemning others - is like many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 252, 9, 26, 'of the other wrong attitudes, in that it is another attitude which most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 252, 10, 26, 'people don''t even think is wrong.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 252, 11, 26, '“Do not judge or condemn others lest you be judged and condemned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 252, 12, 26, 'yourself. For in the way you judge, you will be judged; and by your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 252, 13, 26, 'standard of measure, it will be measured to you. Why do you look at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 252, 14, 26, 'speck that is in your brother''s eye, but do not notice the log that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 252, 15, 26, 'in your own eye? Or how can you say to your brother, ‘Let me take the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 252, 16, 26, 'speck out of your eye,’ and behold, the log is in your own eye? You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 252, 17, 26, 'hypocrite, first take the log out of your own eye, and then you will see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 252, 18, 26, 'clearly to take the speck out of your brother''s eye” (Matthew 7:1-5).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 252, 19, 26, 'Now it is a very, very common practice, unfortunately, among Christians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 252, 20, 26, 'to judge people, to look down on them, and to despise them. It’s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 252, 21, 26, 'common practice among Christians to consider yourself better than others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 252, 22, 26, 'when most of the time, you don''t even know everything about them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 252, 23, 26, 'There’s a reason why we are told not to judge others, and if we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 252, 24, 26, 'understand the reason behind it, it is easier to obey that command.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 252, 25, 26, 'Jesus gives us the command not to judge here, but just as Jesus said in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 252, 26, 26, 'John 16:12 -- “There are many other things that I want to say to you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 252, 27, 26, 'which you cannot bear now. But when the Holy Spirit, the Spirit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 252, 28, 26, 'truth, comes, He will explain the truth to you,” -- this is a command');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 253, 1, 26, 'whose reason is given by the Spirit elsewhere.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 253, 2, 26, 'When the Holy Spirit came, He explained through the Apostle Paul in 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 253, 3, 26, 'Corinthians 4 why we should not judge others. Jesus did not explain that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 253, 4, 26, 'in Matthew 7. This comes under the category of things He could not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 253, 5, 26, 'explain to them then. In 1 Corinthians 4:5, the Holy Spirit tells us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 253, 6, 26, 'through the Apostle Paul, “Do not go on passing judgment before the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 253, 7, 26, 'time, but wait.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 253, 8, 26, 'The Holy Spirit is saying to those of us who have a tremendous lust (I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 253, 9, 26, 'call it a lust because it is a strong desire) to judge other people, “I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 253, 10, 26, 'will give you that opportunity, but just wait. Don''t judge right now.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 253, 11, 26, 'That''s all I''m saying. You can judge later, but hang on. Wait until the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 253, 12, 26, 'right time. Wait until the Lord comes. When He comes, He will bring to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 253, 13, 26, 'light the full story.” The reason why we''re not allowed to judge others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 253, 14, 26, 'is because we don''t know the full story. Think of the number of days and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 253, 15, 26, 'months sometimes a High Court judge takes to listen to both sides of an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 253, 16, 26, 'argument and evaluate the whole thing before he writes his 500-page');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 253, 17, 26, 'judgment. If an earthly judge takes so much trouble to investigate fully');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 253, 18, 26, 'before arriving at a conclusion, how can we make conclusions so quickly?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 253, 19, 26, '“Do not go on passing judgment before the time, but wait until the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 253, 20, 26, 'comes who will bring to light…” What will He bring to light? First of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 253, 21, 26, 'all, He will bring to light “the things hidden in the darkness.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 253, 22, 26, 'Secondly, He will bring to light “the motives of men''s hearts” (v5).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 253, 23, 26, 'Confess How Little You Know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 253, 24, 26, 'Those are two areas which we know nothing about. When you look at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 253, 25, 26, 'another person, you do not know what he''s doing in secret. Most of us do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 253, 26, 26, 'not know, for example, how a person behaves with his wife at home. We do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 253, 27, 26, 'not know how she behaves with her husband, or how they speak to each');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 253, 28, 26, 'other. They may speak very nicely and lovingly in public, but they may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 254, 1, 26, 'not be speaking to each other like that at home. You may think they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 254, 2, 26, 'a very loving couple, but they may not be like that at all. They may be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 254, 3, 26, 'fighting and quarrelling with each other every day at home. So your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 254, 4, 26, 'assessment could be completely wrong. And vice versa too. You may look');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 254, 5, 26, 'at a very quiet type of person and think that he is pretty useless. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 254, 6, 26, 'is not doing anything for God and yet in secret, he may be doing ten');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 254, 7, 26, 'times more for God than you are. The only thing is that he doesn''t make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 254, 8, 26, 'a big show of it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 254, 9, 26, 'The things hidden in darkness, we do not know. You do not know the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 254, 10, 26, 'things that are private, even if you live with a person. A wife can live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 254, 11, 26, 'with her husband for fifty years and still not know whether he loves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 254, 12, 26, 'money or not. Externally, it may appear as if he doesn''t love money. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 254, 13, 26, 'deep down in his heart, he may be loving money. God will expose it in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 254, 14, 26, 'the final day. A husband and a wife may not know whether either of them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 254, 15, 26, 'has bitterness in their heart against somebody, such as a relative or a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 254, 16, 26, 'neighbor. It can be very carefully hidden in nice language. Yet in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 254, 17, 26, 'darkness of their heart which we cannot see, there may be bitterness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 254, 18, 26, 'There may be jealousy. Very often, you can’t make out whether there''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 254, 19, 26, 'pride in someone''s heart. The person may appear to be very humble. Wait');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 254, 20, 26, 'until God exposes the darkness as well as what''s hidden in the darkness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 254, 21, 26, 'The second thing that God is going to reveal in that day is the motives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 254, 22, 26, 'of men''s hearts. This means the reason why a person did something. For');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 254, 23, 26, 'example, suppose that you hear a man preach a wonderful message. You may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 254, 24, 26, 'not know why he did that. He may have done that for money. He may be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 254, 25, 26, 'preaching for honor. Or he may be preaching to show that he is better');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 254, 26, 26, 'than somebody else. There''s always this tendency, in even the best of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 254, 27, 26, 'our actions, to do them with wrong motives. That is another reason why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 254, 28, 26, 'you shouldn''t judge.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 255, 1, 26, 'You can listen to a man praying and say, “Ah! He is just trying to seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 255, 2, 26, 'honor!” He may not be seeking honor at all. He may be praying to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 255, 3, 26, 'best of his ability to God. But you judge him. We have such a tendency');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 255, 4, 26, 'to judge people in areas we know nothing about. We don''t know their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 255, 5, 26, 'motives. Because of the evil of our Adamic nature, we often attribute');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 255, 6, 26, 'the worst possible motive to people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 255, 7, 26, 'We Know Much Less Than We Think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 255, 8, 26, 'Let me say this from many years of observation. Even if you know a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 255, 9, 26, 'person very intimately or even if you live with that person, you still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 255, 10, 26, 'know only 10% of his life. I want to say to every husband and wife who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 255, 11, 26, 'have known each other for fifty years - you know only 10% of your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 255, 12, 26, 'husband or wife. The other 90% lies hidden, like the bottom part of an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 255, 13, 26, 'iceberg or the lower part of an ice cube in water. There are depths');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 255, 14, 26, 'which you know nothing about. You may know more than other people, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 255, 15, 26, 'there are still hidden depths you know nothing about.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 255, 16, 26, 'If you see a person occasionally, you still only know 1% of his life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 255, 17, 26, 'Maybe you work with him in an office or you see him in church every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 255, 18, 26, 'Sunday for 25 years. You still only know 1% of his life. The same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 255, 19, 26, 'applies to the people you meet regularly at church or in your office.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 255, 20, 26, 'You only know 1% of their life. That is why, when one day, you hear that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 255, 21, 26, 'they have been in some horrible sin, you’re shocked. You say, “Hey, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 255, 22, 26, 'thought I knew him for 10 years.” No, you didn''t. You only saw 1% of his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 255, 23, 26, 'life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 255, 24, 26, 'What would you think of a teacher who evaluates a hundred-question exam');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 255, 25, 26, 'on the basis of the answer to the first question? If the first question');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 255, 26, 26, 'was wrong, the teacher gives a zero even though 99 questions may be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 255, 27, 26, 'right. Or if the first question was right, the teacher gives a 100% even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 255, 28, 26, 'though the other 99 questions were wrong. What do you think of such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 256, 1, 26, 'teacher? I think such a teacher should be sacked from the school! How');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 256, 2, 26, 'can a teacher evaluate a whole hundred-question test on the basis of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 256, 3, 26, 'answer to the first question?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 256, 4, 26, 'You can see the absurdity of that, yet that is exactly what you do when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 256, 5, 26, 'you judge others. You know one percent of his life, and you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 256, 6, 26, 'evaluated him. You say, “he''s like this,” or “he''s not like this.” The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 256, 7, 26, 'Bible says, “Wait. Don''t go on passing judgment before the time.” That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 256, 8, 26, 'is the reason why we should not judge: because we will be judging');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 256, 9, 26, 'wrongly. We tend to judge people with wrong motives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 256, 10, 26, 'God Waits to Judge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 256, 11, 26, 'The other thing to know about judgment is found in Hebrews 9:27. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 256, 12, 26, 'says, “It is appointed unto men once to die and after this comes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 256, 13, 26, 'judgment.” So when does God judge people? When does Almighty God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 256, 14, 26, 'Creator of this universe, judge people? According to this verse, “Once');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 256, 15, 26, 'to die and after this comes judgment.” So God judges people only after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 256, 16, 26, 'they die.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 256, 17, 26, 'When do you judge people? You judge people long before they die. Why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 256, 18, 26, 'does God wait till a person dies before He judges? He may be an evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 256, 19, 26, 'person, but God says, “I have hope for him. Maybe he will change,” and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 256, 20, 26, 'so God waits. Think of what would have happened if God had judged the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 256, 21, 26, 'dying thief on the cross who went to paradise before he died. Consider');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 256, 22, 26, 'if God judged him even a few minutes before or few hours before he died.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 256, 23, 26, 'That would have been terrible. He was deserving to go to Paradise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 256, 24, 26, 'finally, but he would have been judged and sentenced to hell. God waited');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 256, 25, 26, 'until he died, and then took him to paradise. This shows that God waits');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 256, 26, 26, 'until a person dies before He judges him. Man is impatient and judges');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 256, 27, 26, 'people long before they die. This is the foolishness of man. He doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 256, 28, 26, 'know all the facts. He doesn''t know 99% of the person''s private, inner');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 257, 1, 26, 'life. He doesn''t know how much that person has struggled or prayed, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 257, 2, 26, 'he judges him. No serious High Court judge would ever judge with such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 257, 3, 26, 'little evidence. If a judge knows only 1% of the case, he will say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 257, 4, 26, '“Listen, I need more evidence before I can pass a judgment. Until then,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 257, 5, 26, 'I will suspend judgment.” This is what every Christian should say too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 257, 6, 26, 'Judging Others Is a Mirror');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 257, 7, 26, 'When we judge a person, we''re really just showing the condition of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 257, 8, 26, 'own heart. As it says in Proverbs 27:19, “As in water face reflects');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 257, 9, 26, 'face, so the heart of man reflects man.” Or like in mirror, a man sees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 257, 10, 26, 'his own face. This means what you imagine finding in that person''s heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 257, 11, 26, 'as a bad motive is only an indication of the wrong attitudes you have in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 257, 12, 26, 'your own heart. You imagine that man can’t possibly be doing that with a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 257, 13, 26, 'good motive. You think, “It must be with a bad motive because I myself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 257, 14, 26, 'would only do such a thing with a bad motive.” You are revealing your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 257, 15, 26, 'own heart. It''s very foolish to judge other people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 257, 16, 26, 'Think of the story of the prodigal son. In the story of the prodigal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 257, 17, 26, 'son, we read about the elder son. He was very upset when he saw the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 257, 18, 26, 'Father rejoicing over the return of the prodigal son. When the Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 257, 19, 26, 'goes out and asks the elder son why he hasn''t come in, see what he says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 257, 20, 26, 'in Luke 15:30, “This son of yours.” He doesn''t even call him, “this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 257, 21, 26, 'brother of mine.” What a despising way to speak. “He has devoured your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 257, 22, 26, 'wealth with prostitutes.” How did he know that? How did he imagine that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 257, 23, 26, 'his younger brother was going around with prostitutes? Did somebody come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 257, 24, 26, 'and report that back to him? Not at all. He assumed this man, his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 257, 25, 26, 'younger brother, must have been spending money on prostitutes. It may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 257, 26, 26, 'not have been true at all. He may have been drinking and wasting his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 257, 27, 26, 'money in foolish ways, but perhaps not on prostitutes. But when you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 257, 28, 26, 'a wrong attitude like this older brother’s attitude towards his younger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 258, 1, 26, 'brother, you can always imagine the worst about the other person. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 258, 2, 26, 'whenever you imagine the worst about somebody else, you can recognize');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 258, 3, 26, 'that the problem is with you more than with the other person. The other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 258, 4, 26, 'person may end up sitting with his Father at the dining table and enjoy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 258, 5, 26, 'the fattened calf, and you may end up outside the house.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 258, 6, 26, 'The story of the prodigal son is a story where in the beginning of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 258, 7, 26, 'story, the younger son is outside the house and the elder son is inside.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 258, 8, 26, 'At the end of the story, the younger son is inside the house, and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 258, 9, 26, 'elder son is outside the house, because he is judging people. Make sure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 258, 10, 26, 'you don''t end up outside the Father''s house because you''re judging');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 258, 11, 26, 'people with insufficient information. The safest thing to do is not to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 258, 12, 26, 'judge.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 258, 13, 26, 'Consider Judgment to Be the More Serious Sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 258, 14, 26, 'Do not judge. Jesus says even if you''re judging, what are you doing,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 258, 15, 26, 'judging a little speck in your brother''s eye, when you have a log in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 258, 16, 26, 'your own eye? That''s what He said. What is this log that is in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 258, 17, 26, 'person''s eye? You can’t have a physical log inside your eye. But Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 258, 18, 26, 'is exaggerating to show how grievous your sin is compared to his.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 258, 19, 26, 'Granted, perhaps he did something terribly wrong. But your unloving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 258, 20, 26, 'attitude towards that person is a log compared to his sin, which is only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 258, 21, 26, 'like a speck.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 258, 22, 26, 'Maybe he went to prostitutes. Okay, that''s a sin. But then even that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 258, 23, 26, 'only a speck compared to your unloving attitude towards him. That’s like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 258, 24, 26, 'a log. The Lord says to get rid of your unloving attitudes towards');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 258, 25, 26, 'others. He says that unloving attitude towards that person makes you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 258, 26, 26, 'constantly want to find fault with that person. Whatever that person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 258, 27, 26, 'does, you put a wrong motive to it. That person cannot do anything good.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 258, 28, 26, 'The person is evil in your eyes, but you don''t see how evil you are to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 259, 1, 26, 'have such an unloving attitude towards that person. So what does He say?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 259, 2, 26, 'Imagine a man who has very poor eyesight. Would you go to that person to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 259, 3, 26, 'pull something out of your eye? Would you go to an eye doctor who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 259, 4, 26, 'almost blind due to cataracts and other problems with his eyes? How in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 259, 5, 26, 'the world can he look into your eyes and remove a little speck from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 259, 6, 26, 'them? I wouldn''t want to go anywhere near that person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 259, 7, 26, 'That is what the Lord says. How can you say to your brother, “Let me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 259, 8, 26, 'take the speck out your eye,” when there is a huge log in your eye that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 259, 9, 26, 'keeps you from seeing properly? You can damage his eyes. But the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 259, 10, 26, 'says, “You hypocrite! See your unloving attitude.” Every person who has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 259, 11, 26, 'an unloving attitude towards another person and judges that person is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 259, 12, 26, 'hypocrite according to Matthew 7:5. First, get rid of this unloving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 259, 13, 26, 'attitude, and then you will see clearly. Then that brother may come to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 259, 14, 26, 'you of his own accord and say, “Brother, could you please take the speck');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 259, 15, 26, 'out of my eye?” Isn’t that wonderful when you come to that type of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 259, 16, 26, 'situation?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 259, 17, 26, 'Only the Father’s Mind Is Fit to Judge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 259, 18, 26, 'Jesus said in John 8:15, “You judge according to the flesh; I am not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 259, 19, 26, 'judging anyone. But even if I do judge, My judgement will be absolutely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 259, 20, 26, 'true because I''m not alone in this, but I and He who sent me.” Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 259, 21, 26, 'walked in such perfect fellowship with the Father that He could say, “If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 259, 22, 26, 'I do pass a judgment, it would be absolutely right, because I''m in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 259, 23, 26, 'complete fellowship with the mind of the Father.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 259, 24, 26, 'You and I are not in such perfect fellowship with the mind of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 259, 25, 26, 'Father. We have to humbly admit that. How in the world can we pass a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 259, 26, 26, 'judgment? Even Jesus, Who was in such perfect fellowship with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 259, 27, 26, 'Father, says, “I do not judge.” Jesus says, “You people judge according');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 259, 28, 26, 'to the flesh. You see something and you have your own carnal way of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 260, 1, 26, 'assessing that. And you judge that person. But even I am not judging');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 260, 2, 26, 'anyone.” What a fantastic verse! Can you follow the example of Jesus,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 260, 3, 26, 'who was in such perfect fellowship with the Father and still said, “I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 260, 4, 26, 'not judging anyone”? The more we are out of fellowship with God, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 260, 5, 26, 'more we judge other people. He said, “I''m not judging anyone.” This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 260, 6, 26, 'occurs immediately after the story of the Pharisees judging the woman');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 260, 7, 26, 'caught in adultery, and Jesus setting her free.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 260, 8, 26, 'Seek Discernment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 260, 9, 26, 'In the previous chapter, John 7, Jesus speaks about how we are to judge.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 260, 10, 26, 'We are not to live in this world without any opinion, like zombies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 260, 11, 26, 'floating around this world. No, God doesn''t want us to be opinion-less');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 260, 12, 26, 'people. Paul had an opinion about the Corinthians. He said they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 260, 13, 26, 'carnal. He had an opinion about the Galatians. He says, “You Galatians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 260, 14, 26, 'have been bewitched! You''re foolish!” We need to understand this. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 260, 15, 26, 'need to have discernment, but we should not have a suspicion of others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 260, 16, 26, 'Sometimes what people call discernment is plain, simple suspicion.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 260, 17, 26, '“Do not judge, but judge.” Have you heard a verse like that? Do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 260, 18, 26, 'judge, but judge. We are commanded to judge. Here is the balance. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 260, 19, 26, 'John 7:24, Jesus says, “Do not judge according to appearance, but judge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 260, 20, 26, 'with righteous judgment.” That means don''t judge by what you see or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 260, 21, 26, 'hear. Instead, you need to judge righteously. In Isaiah chapter 11, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 260, 22, 26, 'are told that that''s how Jesus would judge. “When the Spirit of God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 260, 23, 26, 'upon Jesus, He will delight in the fear of the Lord.” One mark of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 260, 24, 26, 'fearing God is given in Isaiah 11:3, “He will not judge by what He sees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 260, 25, 26, 'or what He hears, but with righteousness.” We get a lot of information');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 260, 26, 26, 'from our eyes and our ears. He says not to judge on the basis of that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 260, 27, 26, 'information. Listen and see, but reserve judgment. Say, “Lord, I''ve seen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 260, 28, 26, 'something, I''ve heard something, but I don''t know whether this is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 261, 1, 26, 'truth. I want to wait on You.” That''s how Jesus did it. He would never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 261, 2, 26, 'judge by what His eyes saw or by what His ears heard because He wanted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 261, 3, 26, 'to listen to the Father. It''s a very good example for us to follow.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 261, 4, 26, 'Never judge by outward appearance, but judge with righteousness and have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 261, 5, 26, 'a righteous opinion.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 261, 6, 26, 'Recognize the Circle God Has Appointed You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 261, 7, 26, 'Whom do we have to judge? We have to judge the people who are within our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 261, 8, 26, 'circle. For example, if you''re a father and your children are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 261, 9, 26, 'quarrelling with each other, you can’t turn around to them and say, “No,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 261, 10, 26, 'I''m not going to judge because the Bible says, ‘Don''t judge.’” You have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 261, 11, 26, 'authority in the circle of your family. You have to judge and sort out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 261, 12, 26, 'the problem between them. If you''re an elder in a church, you have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 261, 13, 26, 'discern the situation and sort out the problems between husbands and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 261, 14, 26, 'wives or between brothers. We read in 1 Corinthians 5 that the Apostle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 261, 15, 26, 'Paul once gave a man over to Satan, because he had authority over that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 261, 16, 26, 'church. He passed judgement. That is right, and that was after waiting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 261, 17, 26, 'upon God to know what to do. We are to judge the circle in which we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 261, 18, 26, 'responsibility.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 261, 19, 26, 'You don''t have to judge what''s happening in another person’s church. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 261, 20, 26, 'don''t have any responsibility there. You don''t have to judge another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 261, 21, 26, 'person’s children because you''re not their parent, but you do have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 261, 22, 26, 'judge your own children. The principal of judgment is to see if that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 261, 23, 26, 'person is within your circle. For example, if you’re a boss having');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 261, 24, 26, 'people working under you in your factory, and they have a problem, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 261, 25, 26, 'have to pass a judgment because you have authority over them. But in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 261, 26, 26, 'spheres where you don''t have authority, the answer is to mind your own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 261, 27, 26, 'business. It’s a wonderful word - mind your own business. Peter says in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 261, 28, 26, '1 Peter 4:15, “Let none of you suffer as a busybody in other people''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 262, 1, 26, 'matters.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 262, 2, 26, 'For many years, I had this little sentence written in front of my table');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 262, 3, 26, '- The happiest people in the world are those who never judge others but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 262, 4, 26, 'judge themselves constantly. I got that from 1 Peter 4: 17, “In the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 262, 5, 26, 'household of God, we judge ourselves first,” and 1 Peter 4:15, “Don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 262, 6, 26, 'become a busybody in other people''s matters.” We judge ourselves first.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 262, 7, 26, 'The mark of a true household of God is that it comprises of people who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 262, 8, 26, 'are not busybodies in other people''s matters, but who judge themselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 262, 9, 26, 'first. Such are the happiest people in the whole world. I''m thankful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 262, 10, 26, 'that I kept that before my mind for a long time. I''ve urged people who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 262, 11, 26, 'want to live a godly life to take this decision, to only judge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 262, 12, 26, 'themselves and the people whom God has put under their authority, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 262, 13, 26, 'nobody else. I believe you can live a wonderful life. This is the ninth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 262, 14, 26, 'wrong attitude that Jesus warned us about in Matthew chapter 7. It is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 262, 15, 26, 'very important word for us to follow. I hope you have understood the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 262, 16, 26, 'balance of where to judge, where not to judge, whom to judge, whom not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 262, 17, 26, 'to judge, and how to judge. May God help us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 262, 18, 27, 'Chapter 26 Seek to Prophesy the Right Word by Listening to God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 262, 19, 27, 'Beginning at Matthew 7:6 we have the concluding paragraphs of the Sermon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 262, 20, 27, 'on the Mount. “Do not give that which is holy to dogs, and do not throw');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 262, 21, 27, 'your pearls before swine, lest they trample them under their feet and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 262, 22, 27, 'turn and tear you to pieces” (Matthew 7:6). Jesus is teaching us that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 262, 23, 27, 'have to be wise concerning what we speak to whom. In Proverbs 26:4, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 262, 24, 27, 'are told that we''re not to answer a fool according to his folly. We must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 262, 25, 27, 'look to Jesus’ example when we try to understand a verse of Scripture.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 262, 26, 27, 'Seek to Understand the Principles Behind Jesus’ Commands');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 262, 27, 27, 'When we look at a verse like this, it is not that we are to treat');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 262, 28, 27, 'anybody like dogs, or to treat anybody like swine. We are all sinners.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 263, 1, 27, 'Every single person is a sinner. We''re all sinners. Some of us are saved');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 263, 2, 27, 'by the grace of God with our sins forgiven, and some are still in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 263, 3, 27, 'sins, but we''re basically all sinners to start with because we''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 263, 4, 27, 'inherited that from Adam. So there''s no reason for one person to think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 263, 5, 27, 'that he''s better than the other, or to look down on another like a dog');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 263, 6, 27, 'or a swine.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 263, 7, 27, 'We need to understand the principles behind what Jesus is saying as we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 263, 8, 27, 'read through the Sermon on the Mount. For example, when Jesus said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 263, 9, 27, '“Pull out your eye” or, “Cut off your hand,” He wasn''t referring to us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 263, 10, 27, 'actually cutting off our hand by amputating it, or plucking out our eye.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 263, 11, 27, 'It’s the principle behind the statement that He wants us to obey. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 263, 12, 27, 'He spoke about eating His flesh and drinking His blood in John 6, it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 263, 13, 27, 'not His physical flesh or physical blood that He was speaking of. He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 263, 14, 27, 'talking about a participation in His death. Some people took this word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 263, 15, 27, 'literally and got offended and left, but He said to them, “The words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 263, 16, 27, 'that I speak to you are spirit and are life. The flesh profits nothing”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 263, 17, 27, '(John 6:63).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 263, 18, 27, 'There was another instance of this when Jesus went Syrophoenicia, to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 263, 19, 27, 'land of Tyre (Matthew 15:21-28). He went all the way that distance from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 263, 20, 27, 'where He was (about 80 kilometres) just to help one Canaanite woman.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 263, 21, 27, 'It''s amazing that Jesus would walk 80 kilometres one way, and 80');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 263, 22, 27, 'kilometres back (over 150 kilometres), just to help one person. He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 263, 23, 27, 'obviously led by the Spirit to do this. As a man He didn''t know what He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 263, 24, 27, 'was going to find, but when the Spirit leads, if you obey, you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 263, 25, 27, 'discover there''s something wonderful at the end of the journey. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 263, 26, 27, 'Jesus got to Tyre, a woman came asking for help for her daughter who was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 263, 27, 27, 'demon possessed. Jesus turned around and said, “It''s not good to take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 263, 28, 27, 'the children’s bread and throw it to the dogs” (Matthew 15:26). Some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 264, 1, 27, 'people have questioned that statement.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 264, 2, 27, 'Was Jesus calling her a dog? Would you walk 150 kilometres to help one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 264, 3, 27, 'single person? How long does it take to walk 150 kilometres? It would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 264, 4, 27, 'take a couple of days at least. There we see the intensity of Christ''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 264, 5, 27, 'love. Knowing how deeply He loved her, we see that the Lord was testing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 264, 6, 27, 'her to see whether she was willing to take any lowly position,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 264, 7, 27, 'recognizing that she deserves nothing from God. When she said, “That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 264, 8, 27, 'fine. I''m a dog, but can I get the crumbs that fall from the table?”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 264, 9, 27, 'Jesus said, “O woman, your faith is great!” It’s only twice that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 264, 10, 27, 'ever said that to anybody, and both were to non-Jewish people. One was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 264, 11, 27, 'to a Roman centurion, and the other was to this Syrophoenician woman.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 264, 12, 27, 'Look how He appreciated her!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 264, 13, 27, 'We need to understand that when Jesus speaks about dogs and swine in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 264, 14, 27, 'Scripture, He’s not despising people. He’s recognizing that we don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 264, 15, 27, 'deserve anything at all from God. Anyone who thinks, “I deserve that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 264, 16, 27, 'should do something for me” hasn''t understood man''s position before God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 264, 17, 27, 'The only thing that you and I deserve is hell. If we go to God and say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 264, 18, 27, '“Lord give me what we deserve,” then He should be giving us hell.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 264, 19, 27, 'Anything better than that is God''s grace. When we recognize that, then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 264, 20, 27, 'we will see that we get a lot that we do not deserve from God. But most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 264, 21, 27, 'people don''t recognize that position.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 264, 22, 27, 'The Difference Between Animals, Men, and Christians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 264, 23, 27, 'When Jesus said, “Don''t give that which is holy to dogs,” He meant,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 264, 24, 27, '“Don''t give something which people don''t appreciate to them.” All a dog');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 264, 25, 27, 'wants is a bone. He doesn''t want something holy. When a human being is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 264, 26, 27, 'more interested in material things on earth than God, there is a sense');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 264, 27, 27, 'in which he is no better than an animal. What do you live for? Do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 264, 28, 27, 'live just to bring up children, have sex, sleep, and eat good food?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 265, 1, 27, 'Well, that''s what all the animals are interested in too! Animals are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 265, 2, 27, 'always interested in earthly things. Dogs are always looking down on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 265, 3, 27, 'earth. So are swine. You never see a dog or a swine looking up to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 265, 4, 27, 'heaven. Animals are always looking down at the things of the earth, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 265, 5, 27, 'that''s the meaning of the word ‘dogs’ here - it means “people whose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 265, 6, 27, 'minds are set on earthly things.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 265, 7, 27, 'A true Christian has his head lifted up. He is looking at things above.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 265, 8, 27, 'For people who are not interested in the things above, it is pointless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 265, 9, 27, 'giving to them that which is holy. It''s like casting pearls in front of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 265, 10, 27, 'swine. What swine need is a lot of rubbish (slop). That''s what they love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 265, 11, 27, 'to eat, so it''s pointless giving them that which is holy. Jesus is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 265, 12, 27, 'speaking of the Sermon on the Mount - the teaching of the Sermon on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 265, 13, 27, 'Mount is not meant for unbelievers. That is the point of Matthew 7:6:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 265, 14, 27, 'don''t give this message to those who are not born again, because they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 265, 15, 27, 'cannot appreciate it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 265, 16, 27, 'What people who are not born again need to hear is the message of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 265, 17, 27, 'repentance. They need to know that they are sinners. They need to know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 265, 18, 27, 'that they deserve hell. They need to know that they are lost, and cut');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 265, 19, 27, 'off from God, and are heading to an eternal destiny in hell. That’s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 265, 20, 27, 'message that non-Christians and even people born in Christian homes (who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 265, 21, 27, 'are not born again, who have not come into a living connection with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 265, 22, 27, 'Christ) need to hear.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 265, 23, 27, 'Every human being, if he does not give God first place in his life, is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 265, 24, 27, 'really like an animal. An animal has no interest in God, no interest in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 265, 25, 27, 'prayer, no interest in hearing what God has to say. When you have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 265, 26, 27, 'human being living on Earth with no interest in prayer, no interest in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 265, 27, 27, 'God, and no interest in hearing what God is to say to him, he is no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 265, 28, 27, 'better than an animal. An animal is interested in sex. When man is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 266, 1, 27, 'primarily interested in sex, he is like an animal. Every animal is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 266, 2, 27, 'interested in sex and food, and when human beings are interested only in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 266, 3, 27, 'food, sex, sleep, and having children, they are just like animals. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 266, 4, 27, 'there was a difference when God made Adam. He made Adam from the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 266, 5, 27, 'dust that He used to make the pigs, the dogs, and all the animals. It’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 266, 6, 27, 'exactly the same dust. If you look at the internal organs of dogs and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 266, 7, 27, 'swine, there''s a lot of similarity there between man''s internal organs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 266, 8, 27, 'and the internal organs of these animals. So what the Lord was saying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 266, 9, 27, 'is, physically, both of you are from the same material. And that''s why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 266, 10, 27, 'God made animals and man both on the sixth day. The first part of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 266, 11, 27, 'sixth day He made the animals, and the second part of the sixth day He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 266, 12, 27, 'made man. But there was one big difference with the animals: God didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 266, 13, 27, 'breathe on them. They automatically had breath when they were created');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 266, 14, 27, 'from the dust, but as soon as man was made, God breathed into him, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 266, 15, 27, 'he became a living soul (Genesis 2:7), and that was the thing that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 266, 16, 27, 'distinguished him from the animals immediately - the breath of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 266, 17, 27, 'If God had not breathed into Adam, he may have looked like a man, but he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 266, 18, 27, 'would have been like an animal. But the moment God breathed into him, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 266, 19, 27, 'became a living soul. He became an eternal being, unlike animals, which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 266, 20, 27, 'are not eternal. When an animal dies, they just become dust. But when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 266, 21, 27, 'God breathed into a man and man became a living soul, he became an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 266, 22, 27, 'eternal being at that moment. He became an eternal being answerable to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 266, 23, 27, 'God. He didn''t have eternal life, because eternal life refers to life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 266, 24, 27, 'that had no beginning, and only God has that. But we can receive that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 266, 25, 27, 'eternal life when we repent of our sins and come to Christ and receive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 266, 26, 27, 'Him as our Lord and Savior. Then we will have eternal life. Otherwise,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 266, 27, 27, 'we are just eternal beings who go to hell and dwell there for eternity,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 266, 28, 27, 'separated from God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 267, 1, 27, 'What the Lord is saying is that there are two distinct categories of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 267, 2, 27, 'people on this earth. There are those who live just like animals (like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 267, 3, 27, 'dogs and swine), and there are others who recognize that they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 267, 4, 27, 'supposed to be children of God, and who recognize that God has made them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 267, 5, 27, 'eternal beings answerable to Him. When God breathed into man, he was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 267, 6, 27, 'made of dust, but he also had a conscience that made him aware that he''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 267, 7, 27, 'answerable to God for his actions and words. Animals don''t have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 267, 8, 27, 'conscience. They don''t have any sense of guilt when they do something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 267, 9, 27, 'wrong, whereas man (even if he''s a completely illiterate barbarian in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 267, 10, 27, 'jungle) has a sense of guilt because he has a conscience. Even the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 267, 11, 27, 'barbarians in the jungles bow down and worship - maybe a rock or a stone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 267, 12, 27, 'or the sun, for example. There''s some awareness that there is a Creator,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 267, 13, 27, 'there is an eternal Being to Whom they are answerable. You never find a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 267, 14, 27, 'religious dog anywhere, or a religious monkey or swine. Why is it that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 267, 15, 27, 'even barbarians have that sense of awareness of an eternal Being to Whom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 267, 16, 27, 'they’re answerable? That''s because they have a conscience. Every man has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 267, 17, 27, 'a conscience, and that''s what distinguishes man from swine, dogs, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 267, 18, 27, 'other animals.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 267, 19, 27, 'Discern the Maturity of Your Audience');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 267, 20, 27, 'We need to recognize what truth we can give to each person. That''s what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 267, 21, 27, 'Christ is saying in this verse. The Apostle Paul says when writing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 267, 22, 27, 'the Corinthians, “I decided when I was with you I will only speak about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 267, 23, 27, 'Jesus Christ, and Him crucified” (1 Corinthians 2:2). Some people have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 267, 24, 27, 'misunderstood this verse, as if that is the only thing that we have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 267, 25, 27, 'ever speak on. If ever you take one verse out of its context you can get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 267, 26, 27, 'a wrong doctrine, and that’s how many cults are built. Whenever you read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 267, 27, 27, 'a verse in Scripture, remember it is part of a letter, and if you take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 267, 28, 27, 'one sentence out of page two of a letter you can get a wrong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 268, 1, 27, 'understanding. Read the whole paragraph. Read the whole letter. When you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 268, 2, 27, 'read the whole paragraph here, you read that Paul is telling the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 268, 3, 27, 'Corinthians, “With you people I could only speak about Christ dying for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 268, 4, 27, 'our sins.” Then in Chapter 3 he explains why; “You''re like babes, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 268, 5, 27, 'babes can only drink milk.” You don''t put solid food in the mouth of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 268, 6, 27, 'one-month-old baby, it will choke to death. What do you give a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 268, 7, 27, 'one-month-old baby? Milk. You cannot put solid food into that child''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 268, 8, 27, 'mouth, because it can’t chew it. That''s what Paul is saying about the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 268, 9, 27, 'Corinthians.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 268, 10, 27, 'But he says in 1 Corinthians 2:6 (paraphrase), “We do speak wisdom among');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 268, 11, 27, 'those who are mature, and you guys are not mature, so I can’t speak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 268, 12, 27, 'God''s wisdom to you people. I can only tell you that Christ died for our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 268, 13, 27, 'sins, because you''re constantly falling into sin and asking God to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 268, 14, 27, 'forgive you, and again falling into sin after that. What do you need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 268, 15, 27, 'know? You need to drink milk, that Christ died for your sins, repent of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 268, 16, 27, 'your sins, confess them, and ask God to forgive you.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 268, 17, 27, 'Paul is saying to them, “How long are you going to be babes? You need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 268, 18, 27, 'grow up.” That''s what the Hebrews were also told. The writer to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 268, 19, 27, 'Hebrews says, “You people can only drink milk. You''re not ready to eat');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 268, 20, 27, 'solid food (the food of righteousness).” This is being told to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 268, 21, 27, 'Christians who should have become more mature. The writer says, “By this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 268, 22, 27, 'time you should have become teachers, but you still need somebody to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 268, 23, 27, 'teach you the elementary principles of the oracles of God, and you need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 268, 24, 27, 'milk and not solid food” (Hebrews 5:12). So just like we don''t give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 268, 25, 27, 'pearls before swine, and we don''t give that which is holy to the dogs,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 268, 26, 27, 'we should not give solid food to babies.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 268, 27, 27, 'The point here is, we need to give appropriate truth to people according');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 268, 28, 27, 'to their spiritual level. If they''re not even converted, it’s no use');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 269, 1, 27, 'taking a Bible study on the Sermon on the Mount to them, because that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 269, 2, 27, 'not meant for them; that''s meant for disciples. If a person is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 269, 3, 27, 'unconverted, what he needs to hear about is his sin. He needs to hear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 269, 4, 27, 'how terribly guilty he is because of his sin before God, how he is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 269, 5, 27, 'headed to an eternal hell, how he is a rebel against God, and how God’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 269, 6, 27, 'wrath and judgment are resting upon his head. He needs to hear that so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 269, 7, 27, 'he can turn and be broken and humble before God and ask God for His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 269, 8, 27, 'mercy. That''s the message for the sinners, not the Sermon on the Mount.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 269, 9, 27, 'Then, when the person is converted, we can teach him. First, we begin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 269, 10, 27, 'teaching them as a babe with milk, and then we can go on to more mature');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 269, 11, 27, 'teaching of God''s wisdom. Then, we can (once he is a disciple) teach him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 269, 12, 27, 'the Sermon on the Mount.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 269, 13, 27, 'It is a very simple principle because there are many people in the world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 269, 14, 27, 'who think Christianity is only following the Sermon on the Mount. That’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 269, 15, 27, 'not true. The first step of Christianity is laying a foundation, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 269, 16, 27, 'that foundation is - you''re a sinner and you''re on your way to hell,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 269, 17, 27, 'you''re a rebel against God, and you need to repent of that and come back');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 269, 18, 27, 'in brokenness and humility and repentance, feel sorry for your sins and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 269, 19, 27, 'want to turn away from your sins, believe that Christ died and took the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 269, 20, 27, 'punishment for all your sins upon the cross, and believe also that He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 269, 21, 27, 'proved this was the only way of salvation by rising from the dead. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 269, 22, 27, 'thing that distinguishes Christianity from all other faiths is two great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 269, 23, 27, 'truths; 1) Jesus Christ died for your sins (nobody else has even claimed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 269, 24, 27, 'to do that) 2) Jesus Christ rose from the dead, proving what He said was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 269, 25, 27, 'true (nobody else has ever raised from the dead). If you remove these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 269, 26, 27, 'two truths from Christianity, Christianity is like any other religion.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 269, 27, 27, 'Do good, help the poor, be kind, don’t hurt anybody, etc. That is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 269, 28, 27, 'superstructure of Christianity, but the foundation is that Christ died');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 270, 1, 27, 'for our sins and rose again. That foundation is what is lacking in all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 270, 2, 27, 'religions.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 270, 3, 27, 'The superstructure of Christianity may look the same as that of other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 270, 4, 27, 'religions, but it''s like comparing the man who built a house on the sand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 270, 5, 27, 'with the man who built on the rock. Both houses look the same, but one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 270, 6, 27, 'doesn’t have a foundation. A lot of things in Christianity may look');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 270, 7, 27, 'similar to what is taught in other religions, but if you look at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 270, 8, 27, 'foundation, you’ll see that there is no foundation elsewhere. Only in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 270, 9, 27, 'Christianity is a foundation that Someone died for my sins and took my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 270, 10, 27, 'punishment, which is the greatest need that human beings have. Nobody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 270, 11, 27, 'did that except Christ, and how do we know that''s true? He rose from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 270, 12, 27, 'dead. It’s on that foundation that we lead people to follow in Jesus’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 270, 13, 27, 'footsteps and become disciples who give all to Christ. When a person has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 270, 14, 27, 'come there, the foundation has been laid. Then we can teach him the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 270, 15, 27, 'Sermon on the Mount.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 270, 16, 27, 'Seeking the Lord for Wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 270, 17, 27, 'That is the point of Matthew 7:6 - we''re not to give truth to those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 270, 18, 27, 'do not appreciate it. That''s why we need to have wisdom whenever we talk');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 270, 19, 27, 'to people. We''re not to have a standard message for everybody. We need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 270, 20, 27, 'to seek God to hear what God wants me to say to each person. Even Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 270, 21, 27, 'lived like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 270, 22, 27, 'There’s a prophecy concerning the Lord Jesus Christ in Isaiah 50:4 which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 270, 23, 27, 'is very appropriate for those who preach the Word, wondering, “What am I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 270, 24, 27, 'supposed to give to a person as God''s message?” I first need to discern');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 270, 25, 27, 'what his spiritual condition is. This is why I need prophetic insight');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 270, 26, 27, 'from God when I speak God''s Word to anybody. Giving God''s Word is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 270, 27, 27, 'supernatural thing. If you only think of it as giving a lecture, like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 270, 28, 27, 'teaching chemistry, then you can teach the Bible anytime to anyone. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 271, 1, 27, 'if you want to minister God’s Word according to the person’s spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 271, 2, 27, 'level, you need to have supernatural insight which only God can give.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 271, 3, 27, 'Isaiah 50:4 says (this is referring to Christ), “The Lord God, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 271, 4, 27, 'Father has given me the tongue of a disciple, that I may know how to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 271, 5, 27, 'sustain the weary one with a word.” In other words, “In order to get the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 271, 6, 27, 'right word for a weary one who comes across my path, God my Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 271, 7, 27, 'awakens me morning by morning every day, and he awakens my ear in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 271, 8, 27, 'morning to listen as a disciple.” Jesus is saying here that He would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 271, 9, 27, 'listen every day, and He would listen constantly so that He could give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 271, 10, 27, 'the appropriate word to the people who came to Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 271, 11, 27, 'One example of this is in John 8. We read of the Pharisees bringing a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 271, 12, 27, 'woman who was caught in adultery to Jesus and quoting the Old Testament');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 271, 13, 27, 'Scriptures, which clearly said that she was to be stoned to death. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 271, 14, 27, 'did not disagree with that because He knew the Old Testament Scriptures.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 271, 15, 27, 'He had given them Himself to Moses hundreds of years earlier! So what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 271, 16, 27, 'does He do? It says that Jesus did not reply. They kept on accusing this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 271, 17, 27, 'woman, and Jesus just stooped down with His finger and started doodling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 271, 18, 27, 'on the ground (John 8:6). He was waiting for a clear word from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 271, 19, 27, 'Father. “What shall I give these people? What is the appropriate word to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 271, 20, 27, 'give these people who want to stone this poor woman to death?” He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 271, 21, 27, 'not going to contradict Scripture, since the Scripture which He Himself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 271, 22, 27, 'gave to Moses said to stone her. When He had a word from His Father, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 271, 23, 27, 'just straightened up and spoke to them (John 8:7 paraphrase), “He who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 271, 24, 27, 'without sin among you, let him be the first to throw a stone. Go ahead -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 271, 25, 27, 'you can stone this woman according to the law, but only the one who''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 271, 26, 27, 'without a sin can throw the first stone.” And it says that they all went');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 271, 27, 27, 'away beginning with the oldest, because the oldest had sinned the most.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 271, 28, 27, 'One word was enough to handle the situation! It did not take a whole');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 272, 1, 27, 'sermon. There were other times when Jesus would say nothing. For');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 272, 2, 27, 'example, once when somebody asked Him a question He said in reply, “Let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 272, 3, 27, 'Me ask you a question first: the baptism of John, was it from heaven, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 272, 4, 27, 'is it from men?” And they began to dispute among themselves, “If we say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 272, 5, 27, 'it was ‘from men’ the people will be upset because they considered John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 272, 6, 27, 'a prophet, and if we say ‘it was from heaven,’ Jesus will ask us ‘why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 272, 7, 27, 'didn’t you believe him then?’” So they didn''t know how to reply and so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 272, 8, 27, 'they said, “We don''t know. We''re not going to say.” So Jesus said, “Well');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 272, 9, 27, 'I''m not going to reply your question either” (Matthew 21:27).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 272, 10, 27, 'Jesus didn''t have a standard way of dealing with everybody. Sometimes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 272, 11, 27, 'people came to Him and asked Him a silly question, like, “A man died and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 272, 12, 27, 'his wife was married by his brother, and that happened with his seven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 272, 13, 27, 'other brothers. Who''s going to be her husband in the resurrection?”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 272, 14, 27, 'Jesus gave a reply to them; He didn’t just walk away. He took the time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 272, 15, 27, 'to explain to them that in the resurrection there is no marriage. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 272, 16, 27, 'look at the replies that Jesus gave, it wasn’t like getting a fixed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 272, 17, 27, 'answer, like you would get if you looked up a computer program saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 272, 18, 27, '“What’s the reply to this?” He was always listening to the Holy Spirit,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 272, 19, 27, 'and that''s a very important principle that we need to learn from Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 272, 20, 27, '7:6.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 272, 21, 27, 'Earnestly Desire to Prophesy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 272, 22, 27, 'Many times, we need to know what the appropriate word for a particular');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 272, 23, 27, 'person is. It is so important in all ministry to know exactly the right');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 272, 24, 27, 'word to give to people. Why does the New Testament say that we must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 272, 25, 27, 'covet to prophesy in 1 Corinthians 14:1? Every believer is told that he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 272, 26, 27, 'must earnestly desire to prophesy. The reason is that in the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 272, 27, 27, 'Testament church meeting, if all prophesy, and all have the gift of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 272, 28, 27, 'prophecy (all are not prophets, but all can prophesy), then it says that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 273, 1, 27, 'when someone comes in who is an ungifted man, who probably doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 273, 2, 27, 'believe in these gifts, he''s convicted by what he hears and the secrets');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 273, 3, 27, 'of his heart are disclosed because he heard a word exactly according to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 273, 4, 27, 'his needs (1 Corinthians 14:24-25). He will then fall on his face and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 273, 5, 27, 'worship God saying, “Boy! God is certainly here, because I got a word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 273, 6, 27, 'according to my need!”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 273, 7, 27, 'Every single church meeting should be like that. Every church should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 273, 8, 27, 'have people who prophesy prophetic words. You need to wait upon God, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 273, 9, 27, 'you need to surrender everything to Him to do that. And if you''re not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 273, 10, 27, 'doing that, then you''re not fit to be a preacher of God''s Word. You need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 273, 11, 27, 'to know exactly what is appropriate to give to a person. That is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 273, 12, 27, 'point of what Jesus said in Matthew 7:6. When you see someone who''s like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 273, 13, 27, 'a swine, give him what''s appropriate for a swine; when you see someone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 273, 14, 27, 'who is like a dog, give him a bone. You can’t give animals the Sermon on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 273, 15, 27, 'the Mount. As we seek for the gift of prophecy, God gives us the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 273, 16, 27, 'ability, at the moment we get up to speak, to discern exactly what the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 273, 17, 27, 'need of the people who are in front of us is, and God will give us the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 273, 18, 27, 'word for their need. This is a very important principle that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 273, 19, 27, 'concludes the Sermon on the Mount with and it’s very, very important for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 273, 20, 27, 'us to understand - especially for those of us who are called to preach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 273, 21, 27, 'God''s Word, whether it’s to unbelievers or believers. We don''t despise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 273, 22, 27, 'anyone. If you despise someone, you''re not fit to be a servant of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 273, 23, 27, 'Jesus didn''t despise the worst of sinners. But we need to have an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 273, 24, 27, 'appropriate word according to the need of the people. That is the point');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 273, 25, 27, 'of Matthew 7:6.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 273, 26, 28, 'Chapter 27 Asking Receiving Spiritual Blessings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 273, 27, 28, 'Matthew 7:7 repeats the core message of the Sermon on the Mount. The bar');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 273, 28, 28, 'to live up to is so high that it is impossible, humanly-speaking, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 274, 1, 28, 'live up to it. That is why most people look at it and simply give up,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 274, 2, 28, 'believing that no one can live in such a way—nobody can be completely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 274, 3, 28, 'free from anger, nobody can be completely free from lusting with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 274, 4, 28, 'eyes, nobody can be completely free from the love money, everything that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 274, 5, 28, 'Jesus speaks about.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 274, 6, 28, 'Christians look at what Jesus says in the Sermon on the Mount and say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 274, 7, 28, 'that the standard is too high. Is it possible to speak the truth all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 274, 8, 28, 'time? Can you pray without caring at all for the opinion of men as you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 274, 9, 28, 'pray? Can anybody live without judging others? If you asked Christians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 274, 10, 28, 'about the standard Jesus gives us in His sermon, many of them would say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 274, 11, 28, 'that you can’t live at that level, especially not in all areas. In a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 274, 12, 28, 'sense, they’re right, because with human strength, it is impossible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 274, 13, 28, 'However, Jesus also said later in Matthew’s gospel that “with men this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 274, 14, 28, 'is impossible, but not with God—with God all things are possible”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 274, 15, 28, '(Matthew 19:26). It’s a lovely verse that Jesus spoke when a rich young');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 274, 16, 28, 'ruler came to Him and Jesus told him to sell all that he had. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 274, 17, 28, 'couldn''t do it, and Jesus said to His disciples, “With men this is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 274, 18, 28, 'impossible, but with God all things are possible.” At this point in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 274, 19, 28, 'Sermon on the Mount, we can apply this truth to everything that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 274, 20, 28, 'has already said. All of the exhortations that Jesus has given up until');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 274, 21, 28, 'Matthew 7:5 are impossible—but that''s not the end of the sentence—yet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 274, 22, 28, 'with God, they are possible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 274, 23, 28, 'Praying for Spiritual Needs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 274, 24, 28, 'It comes together in Matthew 7:7, where Jesus says you need to ask,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 274, 25, 28, 'otherwise you won’t receive. What you ask for will be given to you, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 274, 26, 28, 'you need to ask for power to be able to live according to this standard.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 274, 27, 28, 'That is the meaning of the verse in this context. Very often, we ask God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 274, 28, 28, 'only for material things. “Lord, I need a house; I need a car; I need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 275, 1, 28, 'healing from my sickness; I need this, that, and the other,” almost all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 275, 2, 28, 'entirely worldly things. It is the same with our requests for others: “I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 275, 3, 28, 'need this for my family and my children;” again, all worldly things. To');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 275, 4, 28, 'tell you honestly, there''s not much difference between the prayers that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 275, 5, 28, 'believers pray and the prayers that unbelievers pray. The prayer that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 275, 6, 28, 'non-Christians pray in their mosques and temples is quite similar to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 275, 7, 28, 'prayer many Christians pray in their private lives. It’s almost 99%');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 275, 8, 28, 'about material things, and the one spiritual thing they may pray is,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 275, 9, 28, '“Lord forgive my sins,” but nothing more than that. For example, when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 275, 10, 28, 'was the last time you prayed that you would learn to forgive every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 275, 11, 28, 'single person? When was the last time you prayed that you would love all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 275, 12, 28, 'your enemies? When was the last time you prayed that you would be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 275, 13, 28, 'completely free from sexually sinful ways of thinking? When was the last');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 275, 14, 28, 'time you prayed that you would be 100% free from anger, and persisted in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 275, 15, 28, 'that prayer? When was the last time you prayed that you would speak the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 275, 16, 28, 'truth 100% of the time? Or that you would be completely free from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 275, 17, 28, 'honor of men? Or that you would never judge others? We hardly ever pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 275, 18, 28, 'for these things. Instead, we''re praying for material things, just like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 275, 19, 28, 'the non-Christian. There''s almost no difference between the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 275, 20, 28, 'non-Christian and the Christian, because the standard of Christianity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 275, 21, 28, 'taught today is so pathetically low. The teachers of these Christians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 275, 22, 28, 'have never taught them to do all that Jesus commanded, and these people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 275, 23, 28, 'have not experienced a genuine fullness of the Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 275, 24, 28, 'The fullness of the Holy Spirit that many Christians experience is just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 275, 25, 28, 'a counterfeit. It is counterfeit in the same way that there are also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 275, 26, 28, 'fake diamonds, fake gold, and counterfeit currency notes. When people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 275, 27, 28, 'are genuinely filled with the Holy Spirit, they''ll become holy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 275, 28, 28, 'Everybody knows that unclean spirits make people unclean, and evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 276, 1, 28, 'spirits make people evil. What is the Holy Spirit? Some people say the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 276, 2, 28, 'Holy Spirit makes you make a lot of noise. That''s not true! The Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 276, 3, 28, 'Spirit makes you holy! I remember one man who came to our church in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 276, 4, 28, 'Bangalore once. He was from some particular denomination that believed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 276, 5, 28, 'in making a lot of noise during Sunday morning meetings. He came to me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 276, 6, 28, 'after the service and said, “You don''t have the Holy Spirit here.” I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 276, 7, 28, 'said, “How do you know? Have you lived in our homes and seen how we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 276, 8, 28, 'live, whether we live holy lives or not?” “No,” he said, “you don''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 276, 9, 28, 'enough noise in your meetings.” “Oh,” I said, “your Trinity is Father,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 276, 10, 28, 'Son, and noisy spirit. My Trinity is Father, Son, and Holy Spirit. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 276, 11, 28, 'third person of your trinity makes you make noise, and the third Person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 276, 12, 28, 'of my Trinity makes me holy.” Which is the third Person of the Trinity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 276, 13, 28, 'in the Bible, the noisy spirit or the Holy Spirit? It’s as simple as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 276, 14, 28, 'that. Even a little child can understand.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 276, 15, 28, 'Requirements to Receive: Desire, Asking, and Faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 276, 16, 28, 'But if we don''t desire the Holy Spirit who makes us holy, we will never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 276, 17, 28, 'have the ability to live up to Jesus’ standard. That''s why Jesus said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 276, 18, 28, '“Ask, and it will be given to you.” In the last part of James 4:2, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 276, 19, 28, 'read, “You do not have because you do not ask.” Remember this little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 276, 20, 28, 'sentence at the end of James 4:2, you do not have something that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 276, 21, 28, 'wants you to have because you do not ask. There are many things that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 276, 22, 28, 'wants to give Christians, but they have not received them because they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 276, 23, 28, 'do not ask. Take the verse in Luke 11:13, “How much more shall your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 276, 24, 28, 'Heavenly Father give the Holy Spirit to those who ask Him.” There are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 276, 25, 28, 'millions of things that Christians have missed just because they don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 276, 26, 28, 'ask God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 276, 27, 28, 'Why does God wait for us to ask Him? Because He wants us to appreciate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 276, 28, 28, 'what He gives us. What He gives without us asking, we don''t usually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 277, 1, 28, 'value. Forgiveness of sins, that’s the most important thing of all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 277, 2, 28, 'Didn’t you get it by asking for it? Would you have gotten it if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 277, 3, 28, 'didn''t ask for it? Would you have received salvation if you didn''t ask');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 277, 4, 28, 'for it? There are millions of people on earth who have not been saved');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 277, 5, 28, 'because they don''t ask for it. They don''t humble themselves to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 277, 6, 28, 'acknowledge that they need it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 277, 7, 28, 'What are the other requirements for receiving God''s highest spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 277, 8, 28, 'blessings? First of all, we must have a desire, a thirst, for them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 277, 9, 28, 'Then, we must ask in faith. Asking speaks of that desire, and Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 277, 10, 28, 'speaks about faith a few verses down, in Matthew 7:11. He says, “If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 277, 11, 28, 'know how to give good gifts to your children, how much more will your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 277, 12, 28, 'Heavenly Father give good things to those who ask him.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 277, 13, 28, 'If you don''t ask, you won''t receive. If you seek, you will find. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 277, 14, 28, 'want to know the truth, you’ve got to seek for it. There are treasures');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 277, 15, 28, 'in God''s Word. There are some things on the surface, which everybody can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 277, 16, 28, 'receive, but its deepest treasures are inside, and you have to seek for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 277, 17, 28, 'them. Think about the earth. There are a lot of valuable things on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 277, 18, 28, 'surface, like mangoes, coconuts, and so much other good fruit, but if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 277, 19, 28, 'you want the really expensive treasures, like gold and diamonds, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 277, 20, 28, 'have to dig thousands of feet into the ground. In the same way, there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 277, 21, 28, 'are certain things you get from the surface of the Bible, such as how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 277, 22, 28, 'our sins can be forgiven (because Christ died for them). But if you want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 277, 23, 28, 'to discover the deepest truths of Scripture—how to live a Spirit-filled');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 277, 24, 28, 'life, how to partake in God''s nature, how to overcome all sin, how to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 277, 25, 28, 'overcome anger, bitterness, unforgiveness, jealousy, sexual lusting—then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 277, 26, 28, 'you have to dig deep. If a person doesn''t dig deep, God sees he is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 277, 27, 28, 'really interested. “Ask, and it will be given to you. Seek with all your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 277, 28, 28, 'heart, and you will find.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 278, 1, 28, 'It’s a promise we find in Jeremiah 29:13, “When you seek Me with all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 278, 2, 28, 'your heart, you will find Me.” If a person has not found God and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 278, 3, 28, 'wealth that is in Him, I can say without the slightest hesitation, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 278, 4, 28, 'this man has not sought God with all his heart. He has sought');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 278, 5, 28, 'half-heartedly, and there is no promise for the half-hearted in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 278, 6, 28, 'Scripture. There''s no promise for the three-quarter-hearted either, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 278, 7, 28, 'tremendous promises for the whole-hearted. You can be so close, you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 278, 8, 28, 'give 90% of yourself to God and get no more than the person who gave 10%');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 278, 9, 28, 'to Him. But, when you give a 100% to God, you get everything. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 278, 10, 28, 'give 90%, you''re in just the same category as the person who gave 10%.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 278, 11, 28, 'That''s what Christians don''t realize. Seek God with 10% of your heart,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 278, 12, 28, 'and you won’t find Him. Seek Him with 90% of your heart, and you won’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 278, 13, 28, 'find Him. Seek God with all your heart, and you’ll find Him. Seek, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 278, 14, 28, 'you will find. Knock, and it will be opened to you. These are promises.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 278, 15, 28, 'God never breaks His promises. Every single person who asks receives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 278, 16, 28, 'Why haven’t you received? You’re obviously not asking the way God wants');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 278, 17, 28, 'you to ask. Everyone who seeks, finds. Maybe you haven''t sought the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 278, 18, 28, 'God wants you to. It will be opened to everyone who knocks. Perhaps you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 278, 19, 28, 'have not knocked sufficiently. Jesus emphasizes faith, thirst, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 278, 20, 28, 'persistence in prayer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 278, 21, 28, 'Persist In Prayer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 278, 22, 28, 'In connection to this, there are two parables that Jesus gave, both');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 278, 23, 28, 'emphasizing persistence. One is in Luke 18, where He spoke about prayer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 278, 24, 28, 'and said men ought always to pray and never to lose heart (v1). Then He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 278, 25, 28, 'speaks about a judge, who didn''t fear God or man, and a widow who was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 278, 26, 28, 'being oppressed by her neighbor (and perhaps an enemy). She didn''t want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 278, 27, 28, 'to trouble the enemy in any way. She asked the judge, just protect me,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 278, 28, 28, 'give me legal protection so the enemy does not take advantage of me. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 279, 1, 28, 'might have been encroaching into her property or troubling her in ways');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 279, 2, 28, 'he had no right to. She was asking for her legal rights, and the judge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 279, 3, 28, 'wouldn''t help her. The judge was not willing, but she kept on at him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 279, 4, 28, 'She went to his door at two o''clock in the morning and woke him up, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 279, 5, 28, 'he said, get away from here. She came again the next morning at two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 279, 6, 28, 'o''clock in the morning, knocking, knocking, day and night at his door,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 279, 7, 28, 'until he got so fed up that he said, “This widow bothers me so much that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 279, 8, 28, 'I''ll give her legal protection, otherwise she will wear me out” (v5).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 279, 9, 28, 'The Lord said, “Look at what an unjust judge does and says; do you not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 279, 10, 28, 'think that a just God is better than that? Don''t you think He will bring');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 279, 11, 28, 'justice for His elect? Who are the elect? Those who cry to Him day and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 279, 12, 28, 'night. Do you think He''ll delay in answering them? No, He will answer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 279, 13, 28, 'them speedily” (Luke 18:7). What a lovely promise. God will answer me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 279, 14, 28, 'speedily if He sees that I''m earnest in asking Him to help me overcome');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 279, 15, 28, 'Satan, my enemy, 100%. Will you say, “Lord, Satan has taken over certain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 279, 16, 28, 'areas of my life, certain areas of my home”? Maybe he''s come and taken');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 279, 17, 28, 'over your wife, or husband, or children, or someone else. Pray, “I want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 279, 18, 28, 'to drive him out. Give me protection from my enemy.” If you persist, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 279, 19, 28, 'can be absolutely sure that God will answer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 279, 20, 28, 'The other place Jesus spoke about prayer is in Luke 11, when the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 279, 21, 28, 'disciples asked Him, “Lord, teach us to pray" (v1). He taught them to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 279, 22, 28, 'pray, and He gave them a parable. He told them, “Suppose one of you has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 279, 23, 28, 'a friend who visits your home at midnight, and out of courtesy and love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 279, 24, 28, 'for him, you ask him if he has eaten. If he says he hasn’t, and you look');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 279, 25, 28, 'into your refrigerator and see that there is no food there or in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 279, 26, 28, 'rest of the house, what do you do? You go to your neighbor.” Now, this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 279, 27, 28, 'is very rare. Hardly anyone would go to their neighbor at midnight and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 279, 28, 28, 'wake him up to ask food for their friend, but this person does. He goes,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 280, 1, 28, 'knocks at his neighbor’s house, and says, “Please lend me three loaves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 280, 2, 28, 'I’ll return it tomorrow, but lend them to me now. A visitor has come to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 280, 3, 28, 'my house, a very good friend of mine, and I''ve got no food for him.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 280, 4, 28, 'Now, the man inside the house tells him to not disturb him or his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 280, 5, 28, 'children because they are all in bed, “You''re disturbing us at midnight,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 280, 6, 28, 'waking us all up, and you keep on banging at the door.” But this person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 280, 7, 28, 'will keep knocking and won’t let his neighbor sleep till he gets what he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 280, 8, 28, 'needs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 280, 9, 28, 'The Lord says, “Even if this neighbor doesn''t give you anything because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 280, 10, 28, 'you are his friend, because of your persistence and because of your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 280, 11, 28, 'shameless knocking, he will get up and give you as much as you need.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 280, 12, 28, 'What a lovely expression this is, “As much as you need.” Jesus then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 280, 13, 28, 'finishes— “I say to you, ask like this.” Matthew 7:7 echoes this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 280, 14, 28, 'message, but from the parallel passage in Luke 11, we see the full');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 280, 15, 28, 'story. We have to ask with constant asking, seeking, and knocking.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 280, 16, 28, 'Everyone who asks like this will receive.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 280, 17, 28, 'Why We Pray to God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 280, 18, 28, 'In Luke 18, the widow went and knocked for her own need, and in Luke 11,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 280, 19, 28, 'someone went and knocked for somebody else''s need. We have two reasons');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 280, 20, 28, 'why we go to God. First of all, we go to Him for our own need. “Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 280, 21, 28, 'the enemy is oppressing me. I’m defeated in certain areas by the enemy,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 280, 22, 28, 'by sin. He has taken over certain areas in my life, he''s come and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 280, 23, 28, 'occupied areas of my home. He''s gotten hold of some of my children, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 280, 24, 28, 'I want them to be free.” This is personal need. The other reason we go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 280, 25, 28, 'to God is for the need of others, for ministry. “Lord, I want you to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 280, 26, 28, 'give me that which will help me meet the need of these people whom I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 280, 27, 28, 'have to serve.” When you have a burden for the people in your church, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 280, 28, 28, 'lead them to a Godly life, to lead them to do all that Jesus commanded,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 281, 1, 28, 'to lead them to live according to the standards of the Sermon on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 281, 2, 28, 'Mount, you will ask for the power of the Holy Spirit, you''ll ask for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 281, 3, 28, 'prophetic word from heaven that will meet the need of those people and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 281, 4, 28, 'deliver them from the clutches of the devil and bring them to a Godly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 281, 5, 28, 'life. And if you love them enough, you''ll be persistent. Don''t you think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 281, 6, 28, 'that this person, who went to his neighbor’s house at midnight, loved');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 281, 7, 28, 'his visitor? He must have loved him so much that he was determined to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 281, 8, 28, 'get him food that night. Most of us, if we didn''t have food the night');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 281, 9, 28, 'the visitor came, would tell him, "I’m sorry, but we have no food, so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 281, 10, 28, 'let''s go to bed now, I''ll get you something in the morning.” But this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 281, 11, 28, 'man loved his hungry visitor so much that he said, “I’m going to get you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 281, 12, 28, 'something tonight, even if I have to be shameless before my neighbor.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 281, 13, 28, 'It’s a wonderful picture of going to God with persistence and saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 281, 14, 28, 'Lord give me the gifts of the Holy Spirit to serve these people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 281, 15, 28, 'I remember when I sought for baptism in the Holy Spirit - for the power');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 281, 16, 28, 'of the Holy Spirit to be an effective teacher of God''s Word - to have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 281, 17, 28, 'utterance. I was a very shy person when I became a Christian and began');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 281, 18, 28, 'to share God''s Word. I knew I needed the power of the Holy Spirit, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 281, 19, 28, 'if I got the power of the Holy Spirit, I''d be transformed into another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 281, 20, 28, 'person. And that''s exactly what happened. If you seek God like that for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 281, 21, 28, 'the mighty supernatural anointing of the Holy Spirit not for yourself,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 281, 22, 28, 'but for others, and you keep on knocking, saying, “Lord, give me bread');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 281, 23, 28, 'to feed these people (we saw this expression in Luke 11:8),” then God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 281, 24, 28, 'will give you as much as you need (Luke 11:13). I''m referring to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 281, 25, 28, 'Holy Spirit here. Jesus made it clear what we''re supposed to ask God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 281, 26, 28, 'for. “Give me the power of the Holy Spirit to serve others. My needs are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 281, 27, 28, 'met, we''ve gone past Luke 18, now I''m thinking about the needs of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 281, 28, 28, 'others.” That''s a true Christian.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 282, 1, 28, 'Very often, people seek for the power of the Holy Spirit to get some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 282, 2, 28, 'tickle down their spine, some electric shock or feeling, some speaking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 282, 3, 28, 'in tongues, or something for their own benefit. We need to seek for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 282, 4, 28, 'gifts of the Holy Spirit to be able to bless other people. I remember');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 282, 5, 28, 'when I sought God for the gifts of the Holy Spirit. It was to serve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 282, 6, 28, 'other people, and even if God gave me the gift of tongues, it was to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 282, 7, 28, 'keep myself fresh, because the Bible says that he who speaks in a tongue');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 282, 8, 28, 'edifies himself. I wanted to edify myself so that I’d always be fresh');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 282, 9, 28, 'when I''m serving other people. Therefore, even the gift of tongues was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 282, 10, 28, 'to benefit others, to keep myself fresh and to build myself up. No gift');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 282, 11, 28, 'of the spirit was for my own personal edification, but rather for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 282, 12, 28, 'personal edification that led to the blessing of other people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 282, 13, 28, 'We need to remember that all the gifts of the Holy Spirit are meant for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 282, 14, 28, 'others. The fruit of the Spirit benefit me. If I have joy or peace, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 282, 15, 28, 'benefits me, not you. But, if I have the gifts of the Holy Spirit,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 282, 16, 28, 'whether it be prophecy or healing or any other gift, those gifts benefit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 282, 17, 28, 'others. We need both of these. You need to ask God, and you need faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 282, 18, 28, 'God Only Gives What Is for Our Good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 282, 19, 28, '“If you, being evil, know how to give good gifts to your children, how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 282, 20, 28, 'much more shall your Heavenly Father give what is good (especially the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 282, 21, 28, 'Holy Spirit and all His good gifts) to those who ask Him?” We need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 282, 22, 28, 'have faith that we''re coming to our Father. We''re not coming to the CEO');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 282, 23, 28, 'of some company, who is so distant that we have to approach him through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 282, 24, 28, 'a secretary. We’re coming to our Heavenly Dad, and what will He deny us?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 282, 25, 28, 'There’s absolutely nothing good that He can ever deny us. If God doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 282, 26, 28, 'see fit to give us something, we can be absolutely sure that it’s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 282, 27, 28, 'good for us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 282, 28, 28, 'The Apostle Paul once had a sickness in his body which he called a thorn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 283, 1, 28, 'in the flesh. He prayed three times for it to be removed (2 Corinthians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 283, 2, 28, '12). God didn''t remove it, and he realized that it was for his good,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 283, 3, 28, 'because it kept him humble and broken. God always gives us what is good,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 283, 4, 28, 'and when God is good to us like that, tremendously good to us, what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 283, 5, 28, 'should we do? We need to be good to other people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 283, 6, 28, 'The Golden Rule');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 283, 7, 28, 'Jesus then goes on to what is often called the Golden Rule (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 283, 8, 28, '7:12). Therefore, since God has been so good to you, to give you all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 283, 9, 28, 'that you need, you must treat people in a good way as well. Freely you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 283, 10, 28, 'received, freely you give. God has forgiven you, so you forgive other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 283, 11, 28, 'people. God forgave you all your sins, forgive other people all their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 283, 12, 28, 'sins. God is good to you; be good to them. Treat people in the way you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 283, 13, 28, 'want them to treat you. How do you want people to treat you? Treat them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 283, 14, 28, 'in the same way. Don''t treat people the way they treat you. A lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 283, 15, 28, 'human beings live like that. They say, “I treat people the way they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 283, 16, 28, 'treat me. If they''re good to me, I''m good to them. If they are bad to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 283, 17, 28, 'me, I’m bad to them.” That''s the law of Adam. The law of God is to treat');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 283, 18, 28, 'people not in the way they treat you, but to treat them the way you want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 283, 19, 28, 'them to treat you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 283, 20, 28, 'Do you want people to gossip about you behind your back? Do you want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 283, 21, 28, 'people to speak evil about you in their homes? No? Then don''t speak evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 283, 22, 28, 'about them in your home. Do you want people to spread bad stories about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 283, 23, 28, 'you, even if those stories are true? Suppose you slipped up and made a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 283, 24, 28, 'blunder? Do you want everybody to broadcast that all over town? No? Then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 283, 25, 28, 'don''t broadcast the evil you know about others either. Treat other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 283, 26, 28, 'people the way you want them to treat you. If you want them to be kind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 283, 27, 28, 'to you, be kind to them. If you want people to speak graciously to you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 283, 28, 28, 'speak graciously to them. What about husband and wife? Let me ask you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 284, 1, 28, 'husbands, how do you want your wives to speak to you? Graciously?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 284, 2, 28, 'Respectfully? Then speak to them graciously and respectfully, and vice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 284, 3, 28, 'versa.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 284, 4, 28, 'It is certainly true that it is a Golden Rule because Jesus said the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 284, 5, 28, 'whole message of the Law and the Prophets—that’s an expression for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 284, 6, 28, 'entire Old Testament, the Law being the first five books, and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 284, 7, 28, 'Prophets and history making up the remaining 34 books— is this: God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 284, 8, 28, 'been good to you (Matthew 7:11), therefore you have a debt and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 284, 9, 28, 'obligation to be good to other people around you. You have to pass on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 284, 10, 28, 'the love that God has given you, to treat others exactly like God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 284, 11, 28, 'treated you. Treat them the way you want them to treat you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 284, 12, 28, 'For example, Ephesians 4:32 says, “Be kind to one another,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 284, 13, 28, 'tender-hearted, forgiving each other…” And how exactly should we extend');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 284, 14, 28, 'forgiveness to others? “Exactly like God in Christ forgave you.” Be kind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 284, 15, 28, 'to one another like God has been kind to you in Christ. Be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 284, 16, 28, 'tender-hearted to others - especially your children when they slip up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 284, 17, 28, 'and make a mistake, and towards your wife, and towards your husband -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 284, 18, 28, 'because God has been tender-hearted towards you. Forgive like God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 284, 19, 28, 'forgave you. It goes on to say in the next verse, “Be imitators of God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 284, 20, 28, 'as beloved children.” That''s a lovely expression. Do you know that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 284, 21, 28, 'you''re called to imitate God in the way He''s tender-hearted, kind, good,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 284, 22, 28, 'and forgiving towards you? Do you know that we''re supposed to reflect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 284, 23, 28, 'that to others like the moon reflects the light of the Sun? We are to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 284, 24, 28, 'like that, reflecting the light of God and the goodness of God to other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 284, 25, 28, 'people, and this is why we need to ask - and keep on asking - for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 284, 26, 28, 'power of the Holy Spirit. This is the message of the whole Bible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 284, 27, 29, 'Chapter 28 Narrow Way and How to Discern False Prophets');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 284, 28, 29, 'Matthew 7:13 marks the conclusion to what Jesus had already taught. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 285, 1, 29, 'need to read the following verses in the context of all that precedes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 285, 2, 29, 'them in Matthew 5-7. “Enter by the narrow gate.” What does Jesus mean?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 285, 3, 29, 'Jesus meant that what He has preached so far is, in a sense, a very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 285, 4, 29, 'narrow gate. “For the gate is wide and the way is broad that leads to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 285, 5, 29, 'destruction. Many are those who enter by the wide gate and the broad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 285, 6, 29, 'way” (Matthew 7:13-14).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 285, 7, 29, 'The Broad Way Disregards the Sermon on the Mount');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 285, 8, 29, 'Destruction is eternal hell. Did Jesus speak about Hell in the Sermon on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 285, 9, 29, 'the Mount? He certainly did. He spoke about it three times. Let''s look');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 285, 10, 29, 'at the way to destruction. In Matthew 5:22, Jesus said, “If you''re angry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 285, 11, 29, 'with your brother, you’re guilty before the court. If that anger gives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 285, 12, 29, 'expression to words of anger, then you are guilty before the Supreme');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 285, 13, 29, 'Court. If it goes further to serious words of anger, then you’ll be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 285, 14, 29, 'guilty enough to go to hell to destruction.” Again, Jesus says in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 285, 15, 29, 'Matthew 5:28, “If a man looks at a woman with lust for her in his heart,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 285, 16, 29, 'it is better for him to pull out his right eye. Otherwise, you can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 285, 17, 29, 'thrown into hell. It is better to cut off your right hand if it leads');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 285, 18, 29, 'you to sexual sin.” Otherwise, Jesus says in Matthew 5:30, you can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 285, 19, 29, 'thrown into hell. That is the way to destruction. The way of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 285, 20, 29, 'uncontrolled anger and uncontrolled sexual desire is the wide way, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 285, 21, 29, 'there are multitudes of people walking along that way. The world is full');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 285, 22, 29, 'of people who are angry and saturated with sexual lust, uncontrolled');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 285, 23, 29, 'sinful sexual desire, exploiting poor women, etc. That is the broad way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 285, 24, 29, 'to destruction.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 285, 25, 29, 'What if a man says he''s a born-again Christian, but watches internet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 285, 26, 29, 'pornography, taking advantage of poor women being exploited? What if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 285, 27, 29, 'this Christian expresses his anger outwardly? That is the way to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 285, 28, 29, 'destruction. Whether he calls himself a Christian or a non-Christian, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 286, 1, 29, 'makes no difference. He is on the way to destruction. It is the wide');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 286, 2, 29, 'way. The way is sometimes made wide by preachers who say we don''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 286, 3, 29, 'to be so narrow-minded and say that only those who overcome these things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 286, 4, 29, 'are going in to eternal life. No, they make the gate wider than Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 286, 5, 29, 'taught. Jesus said that the way to life was like a needle’s eye. Can a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 286, 6, 29, 'camel go through a needle’s eye? No. Jesus said that it is easier for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 286, 7, 29, 'camel to go through a needle’s eye than for the man who is rich in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 286, 8, 29, 'himself to possess the kingdom of God. Our richness is not only in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 286, 9, 29, 'wealth. It could be in our intellect. It could be our intellectual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 286, 10, 29, 'arguments when we come to Scripture. We take away the seriousness of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 286, 11, 29, 'God’s words with intellectual arguments. You are not going to enter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 286, 12, 29, 'God''s kingdom through the wide road that leads to destruction. But the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 286, 13, 29, 'gate is small, and the way is narrow, that leads to life. That is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 286, 14, 29, 'way Jesus preached in the Sermon on the Mount. What Jesus is saying is,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 286, 15, 29, '“All that I''ve spoken here so far is a very narrow gate and a very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 286, 16, 29, 'narrow way, but it is the way that leads to life. There are very, very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 286, 17, 29, 'few people who find it.” Do you expect multitudes of people to choose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 286, 18, 29, 'the way described in the Sermon on the Mount? Not at all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 286, 19, 29, 'Few Will Find the Narrow Way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 286, 20, 29, 'The Sermon on the Mount is not meant for non-Christians. It is not meant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 286, 21, 29, 'for non-disciples. It is meant for those who have already laid a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 286, 22, 29, 'foundation in their life of repentance and faith in Christ, who are born');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 286, 23, 29, 'again, and who have become God''s children. If a person has not taken');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 286, 24, 29, 'that first step when he tries to follow the Sermon on the Mount, he is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 286, 25, 29, 'like a person who is building a house without a foundation. But here, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 286, 26, 29, 'is speaking about disciples who are seeking to follow the Lord. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 286, 27, 29, 'will find that this is a very narrow gate, and that there are very few');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 286, 28, 29, 'who find it. I don''t expect multitudes of people to come rushing to obey');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 287, 1, 29, 'the things written in Matthew 5-7.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 287, 2, 29, 'When you see mega churches with thousands of people sitting there, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 287, 3, 29, 'might wonder if these are the “few” people who have found the way to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 287, 4, 29, 'life. Or are these people are being led astray by false preachers, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 287, 5, 29, 'going on the broad way that leads to destruction? We do not want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 287, 6, 29, 'judge any of them. I would be delighted if thirty thousand people in one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 287, 7, 29, 'little area want to obey the Sermon on the Mount and follow Jesus. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 287, 8, 29, 'would be happy if there is a church of three hundred thousand people who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 287, 9, 29, 'want to follow Christ. I would not be happy with 300,000 people who just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 287, 10, 29, 'want to go to heaven without following Christ on earth. From what I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 287, 11, 29, 'observed, the people sitting in most churches want to go to heaven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 287, 12, 29, 'without following Christ on earth. That is not the true church of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 287, 13, 29, 'Christ. That is a church against which the gates of hell will certainly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 287, 14, 29, 'prevail, and where the preachers have made the gate wide so that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 287, 15, 29, 'multitudes of people can get in without paying the price. The gate is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 287, 16, 29, 'wide enough so that you can love money and imagine that you love God as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 287, 17, 29, 'well. They made the gate wide, and are deceiving themselves that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 287, 18, 29, 'are making disciples of Jesus in that church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 287, 19, 29, 'We need to see very clearly that it is at the end of the Sermon on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 287, 20, 29, 'Mount that Jesus explained this gate is very small, and this way is very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 287, 21, 29, 'narrow that leads to life. There are very, very few that actually find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 287, 22, 29, 'it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 287, 23, 29, 'False Prophets Dilute the Scriptures');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 287, 24, 29, 'The very next thing He says is, “Beware of the false prophets” (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 287, 25, 29, '7:15). We need to see who these false prophets are in the context of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 287, 26, 29, 'this passage. Are these false prophets the ones who come to church but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 287, 27, 29, 'talk about some other religion, and start teaching from the holy book of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 287, 28, 29, 'some other religion? No. False prophets are those “who come in sheep''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 288, 1, 29, 'clothing.” Sheep''s clothing means the appearance of being a servant of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 288, 2, 29, 'Jesus Christ and being a sheep of Christ. They come in sheep''s clothing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 288, 3, 29, 'They look like sheep. They come with the Bible in their hand, but they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 288, 4, 29, 'made the way broad. They explain away the commands of Scripture, saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 288, 5, 29, '“This command is not necessary,” or “It does not mean exactly this…”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 288, 6, 29, 'These people have tried to explain away so many things in Scripture. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 288, 7, 29, 'they come to verse like Philippians 4:4, “Rejoice in the Lord always,”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 288, 8, 29, 'they say, “It doesn''t mean 24/7. It means generally speaking, or most of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 288, 9, 29, 'the time.” When it says in Philippians 4:6, "Be anxious for nothing,”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 288, 10, 29, 'they say, “It doesn''t mean ‘nothing.’ It means generally speaking, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 288, 11, 29, 'should avoid anxiety.” When it says in 1 Thessalonians 5:18 that we must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 288, 12, 29, '“give thanks in everything, for this is the will of God in Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 288, 13, 29, 'Jesus,” they say, “That it doesn''t really mean every single thing.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 288, 14, 29, 'God''s Word is being diluted and robbed of its sharpness and power by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 288, 15, 29, 'many preachers. Take for example a small thing like a woman covering her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 288, 16, 29, 'head to show her submission to male authority. Such preachers say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 288, 17, 29, '“Well, it doesn''t mean that we have to do that. That was for that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 288, 18, 29, 'culture, in Corinth,” and thus everything is explained away. There is an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 288, 19, 29, 'explanation for everything. God''s Word has been diluted. The Bible says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 288, 20, 29, 'that if you do not take sexual sin radically, you can go to hell. Such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 288, 21, 29, 'preachers say, “No, it is not that serious.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 288, 22, 29, 'Beware of Hypocrisy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 288, 23, 29, 'You will discover in the final day when you stand before Jesus Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 288, 24, 29, 'that God meant exactly what He said. Christ meant exactly what He said.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 288, 25, 29, 'If you do not believe these words in the Bible, you must be honest and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 288, 26, 29, 'scratch them out or tear up those pages in the Bible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 288, 27, 29, 'You are being dishonest and hypocritical if you say the Bible is God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 288, 28, 29, 'Word, but then you do not follow it. God is going to judge this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 289, 1, 29, 'hypocrisy. God loves an honest person. I believe God loves many atheists');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 289, 2, 29, 'more than hypocritical Christians because they are honest. They do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 289, 3, 29, 'believe there is a God. They act like there is no God. The businessman');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 289, 4, 29, 'out in the world says there is no God but money. He worships money, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 289, 5, 29, 'he is honest. But Christians, who say that Jesus Christ is the true God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 289, 6, 29, 'and the Bible is God’s Word, if they live like those worldly people,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 289, 7, 29, 'they are the hypocrites. Remember that when Christ was on earth, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 289, 8, 29, 'condemned the hypocrites more than anybody else. The adulteress was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 289, 9, 29, 'saved. The thief on the cross was saved. The murderer was saved. But the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 289, 10, 29, 'hypocrites went to hell.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 289, 11, 29, 'The same thing is going to happen today. Beware of the false prophets');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 289, 12, 29, 'who come to you with sheep’s clothing and with the Bible in their hand.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 289, 13, 29, 'They speak the right doctrine, but inwardly, they are ravenous wolves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 289, 14, 29, 'They put on sheep''s clothing in order to come in the midst of the flock.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 289, 15, 29, 'They pretend to be sheep, but all they want is to bite the sheep and get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 289, 16, 29, 'what they can out of them. It is a picture of a preacher who comes with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 289, 17, 29, 'his Bible college degree, quotes Scripture, and is an eloquent speaker.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 289, 18, 29, 'But all he wants is to get your money. Whenever you find a preacher like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 289, 19, 29, 'that, think of this verse. He is a “ravenous wolf” who has come in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 289, 20, 29, '“sheep’s clothing.” That person is not a shepherd. He is a wolf. A good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 289, 21, 29, 'shepherd cares for his sheep. He is interested in leading the sheep to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 289, 22, 29, 'the green pastures and by still waters, not to bite off the sheep like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 289, 23, 29, 'lot of preachers do.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 289, 24, 29, 'How to Know False Prophets: Fruits, Attitude Towards Money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 289, 25, 29, 'Jesus said you will know these false prophets by their fruits, not by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 289, 26, 29, 'their gifts. Many people seek to identify a man of God by His gifts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 289, 27, 29, 'That is the biggest mistake of Christians. They go directly against what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 289, 28, 29, 'Jesus has said. In Matthew 7:16, Jesus said that you will not be able to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 290, 1, 29, 'distinguish between a true prophet and a false prophet if you look at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 290, 2, 29, 'the gifts. Both may appear to have gifts. A true prophet has gifts, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 290, 3, 29, 'a false prophet has gifts. But the true prophet also has fruit. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 290, 4, 29, 'want to know whether one of these is a true prophet of God, do not look');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 290, 5, 29, 'to see if he has a healing gift. Do not look to see if he is eloquent.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 290, 6, 29, 'Do not look to see if his doctrines are right. Both of their doctrines');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 290, 7, 29, 'will be right, but one of them has sheep''s clothing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 290, 8, 29, 'The way to distinguish which one is the real sheep and which is the wolf');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 290, 9, 29, 'is by their fruits. What is the fruit of the Spirit? This is primarily');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 290, 10, 29, 'humility. Does he have humility? Does he have a genuine compassion for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 290, 11, 29, 'people? Is he free from the love of money? If he is always compelling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 290, 12, 29, 'you to pay your tithe, that is a wolf, without a shadow of a doubt. Most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 290, 13, 29, 'preachers are wolves like that today. A lot of them only preach on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 290, 14, 29, 'giving your tithe to their ministry. They give you all types of false');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 290, 15, 29, 'promises that God will give you a hundred times if you give to their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 290, 16, 29, 'ministry. Do not be deceived by these preachers that dominate Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 290, 17, 29, 'television. They are ravenous wolves who are after your money.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 290, 18, 29, '“You will know them by their fruits.” Always look for fruit. For');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 290, 19, 29, 'example, the fruits of goodness, kindness, and humility. Look for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 290, 20, 29, 'someone who treats you with respect and is not out to get your money.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 290, 21, 29, 'Look for the fruit of Jesus Christ in their life. Where do you find in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 290, 22, 29, 'the Bible that Jesus Christ went after anybody for their money? Never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 290, 23, 29, 'once did He take a collection and offering, at any time in His ministry.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 290, 24, 29, 'When He healed the sick, He did not take an offering. He did not ask His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 290, 25, 29, 'disciples to go with an offering bag and collect money from the people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 290, 26, 29, 'He healed, unlike what we see in today''s healers and preachers. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 290, 27, 29, 'believe they are counterfeits and deceivers compared to Jesus Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 290, 28, 29, 'You never find any of the apostles going around with an offering bag');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 291, 1, 29, 'after they preached to people or healed people. How will we have money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 291, 2, 29, 'for God''s work? Yes, we can keep a box and let people voluntarily give.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 291, 3, 29, 'We should not put a bag in front of them and compel them to give. Also,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 291, 4, 29, 'the Bible teaches that Jesus and the Apostles would never take a cent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 291, 5, 29, 'from unbelievers. It is a great tragedy today that unbelievers are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 291, 6, 29, 'invited to a meeting, hear the gospel, and are asked to give money. Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 291, 7, 29, 'you have to pay money to get your sins forgiven? Do you have to pay');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 291, 8, 29, 'money to get healed? Beware of false prophets. They are worse than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 291, 9, 29, 'unbelievers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 291, 10, 29, 'Someone invited me once to sit on the platform for a healing meeting in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 291, 11, 29, 'Bangalore. I said, “I''m all for getting unsaved people to Christ, but I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 291, 12, 29, 'want to know whether the organizers are going to be upright and honest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 291, 13, 29, 'in presenting the gospel.” I wanted to ensure that the gospel is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 291, 14, 29, 'absolutely free. Even praying for the sick is free. Let me use an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 291, 15, 29, 'illustration. If I were to go and buy a CD player from a non-Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 291, 16, 29, 'store and next day, I find it doesn''t work. I will take it back to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 291, 17, 29, 'store and tell the store owner that it doesn’t work. He will refund the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 291, 18, 29, 'money to me. If I paid two thousand rupees, he will refund two thousand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 291, 19, 29, 'rupees to me. Now apply that illustration to this situation. I said to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 291, 20, 29, 'the organizers that you conduct a healing meeting and invite a famous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 291, 21, 29, 'person somewhere to pray. Before he prays for the sick, you take a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 291, 22, 29, 'collection in the background. There is a non-Christian there who brings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 291, 23, 29, 'his paralyzed wife to the healing meeting to be healed. You pass a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 291, 24, 29, 'collection bag and that non-Christian man thinks, “If I give money, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 291, 25, 29, 'will heal my sick wife.” He puts two thousand rupees into the bag. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 291, 26, 29, 'pray for that sick wife, and she is not healed. This man comes back to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 291, 27, 29, 'you the next day and says, “Your prayer didn’t work. (It’s like saying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 291, 28, 29, 'your product didn’t work). My wife is not healed. Will you please return');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 292, 1, 29, 'the two thousand rupees I gave you?” If you say no, I say you are a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 292, 2, 29, 'bigger crook than that an evil store keeper who doesn’t return my money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 292, 3, 29, 'when his CD player he sold me didn''t work. Your prayer didn’t work to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 292, 4, 29, 'heal that person. You should return that money to them, but you don''t do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 292, 5, 29, 'that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 292, 6, 29, 'I asked the organizers, “How in the world can I sit with all of you on a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 292, 7, 29, 'platform and conduct this type of counterfeit healing meeting in Jesus’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 292, 8, 29, 'name?” Show me a healing meeting where you do not take any money at all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 292, 9, 29, 'and where people are genuinely healed. That is the type of healing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 292, 10, 29, 'meeting that Jesus and the apostles had. A lot of what goes on today is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 292, 11, 29, 'just a gimmick and used to swindle people from their money. Beware of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 292, 12, 29, 'false prophets. They come to you in sheep''s clothing. You will know them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 292, 13, 29, 'by their fruits.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 292, 14, 29, 'Jesus said in Matthew 7:16, "You do not go to thorn bushes to gather');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 292, 15, 29, 'grapes; you do not go to thistles to get figs, do you?” It is so simple.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 292, 16, 29, 'If you want to go to get grapes, you go to a vine. You do not go to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 292, 17, 29, 'thorn bush to get grapes. The fruit manifests what the tree is like.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 292, 18, 29, 'When you see thorns coming out of it, you know that is not fruit. Always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 292, 19, 29, 'look for fruit, not for gifts. Gifts can be deceptive. For example,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 292, 20, 29, 'Satan has tremendous gifts, but he does not have fruit, nor character.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 292, 21, 29, 'Satan can give those abilities to his servants. The Bible says that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 292, 22, 29, 'Satan’s servants can appear as ministers of righteousness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 292, 23, 29, 'Further, Jesus said that even so, every good tree bears good fruit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 292, 24, 29, 'There is no doubt about it. A good tree will always bear good fruit. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 292, 25, 29, 'can buy good fruit, tie it up on a bad tree, cut off all the bad fruit,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 292, 26, 29, 'and fool people that your tree is a good tree. But it isn’t. This is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 292, 27, 29, 'way a lot of Christian behave. I look at a lot of Christians and see how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 292, 28, 29, 'they appear to be good in public, but are really bad in the way they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 293, 1, 29, 'live in their homes and in their offices. They live in unrighteousness,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 293, 2, 29, 'cheating, etc. I am reminded of a man who has a bad tree in his garden:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 293, 3, 29, 'it produces rotten, stinking, dried-up mangoes, but he doesn''t want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 293, 4, 29, 'anybody to know, so he cuts them off, buys very luscious mangoes from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 293, 5, 29, 'the market, and ties it up very cleverly on this tree. People look at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 293, 6, 29, 'this tree and say, “Boy, what a lovely mango tree you have!” It looks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 293, 7, 29, 'very nice, but it is not coming from within the tree. It is something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 293, 8, 29, 'which is meant to deceive people. This is hypocrisy. A good tree will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 293, 9, 29, 'produce good fruit. “A good tree cannot produce bad fruit, and a bad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 293, 10, 29, 'tree cannot produce good fruit” (Matthew 7:18).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 293, 11, 29, 'How to Deal with Bad Fruit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 293, 12, 29, 'What should you do with the tree that does not bear good fruit? In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 293, 13, 29, 'Matthew 7:19, Jesus said that it must be cut down and thrown into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 293, 14, 29, 'fire. The nature of ours that we have inherited from Adam needs to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 293, 15, 29, 'crucified. That is the great need. That is the meaning of “cut down.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 293, 16, 29, 'John the Baptist said that Jesus is coming with an axe that is laid at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 293, 17, 29, 'the root of the tree to cut it down. He is going to cut it down in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 293, 18, 29, 'root, throw it in the furnace, and replace it with another tree. Many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 293, 19, 29, 'people have not experienced this. They try to get rid of superficial');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 293, 20, 29, 'sins in their life and respond to Christ. But the root is still there.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 293, 21, 29, 'It is like seeing a doctor. If you have symptoms, he will not just give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 293, 22, 29, 'you some ointment to get rid of those symptoms. He will give you an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 293, 23, 29, 'antibiotic that treats the root of the disease. When the root of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 293, 24, 29, 'disease is treated, then its symptoms will disappear. That is how a good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 293, 25, 29, 'doctor treats patient who are sick. That is also how Jesus does it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 293, 26, 29, 'Jesus says that the root to all these problems in your life is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 293, 27, 29, 'self-centered life. From that self-centered life, only fruit that seeks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 293, 28, 29, 'your own will come. You can tie nice fruit there and preach nice things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 294, 1, 29, 'like many preachers, but if you''re a self-centered person, you will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 294, 2, 29, 'seeking your own all the time. Until you hit the root of that, you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 294, 3, 29, 'not going to be really experiencing the salvation that Christ came to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 294, 4, 29, 'give.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 294, 5, 29, 'Numerous people who have come to our church in Bangalore have told me,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 294, 6, 29, '“Brother Zac, I never knew what it was to be really converted until I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 294, 7, 29, 'came here. This is because I never knew what repentance was until I came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 294, 8, 29, 'to your church. I thought I was born again. I took baptism somewhere.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 294, 9, 29, 'But I never knew how serious sin was. I never knew what repentance was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 294, 10, 29, 'because I didn''t know what sin I had to turn from. When I came here, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 294, 11, 29, 'saw and I heard what sin really was. It was a self-centered way of life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 294, 12, 29, 'I saw that I had to turn from that. It is only now that I''m really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 294, 13, 29, 'saved.” I believe a lot of people who imagine they are born again, are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 294, 14, 29, 'really not, because they have not turned from their self-centeredness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 294, 15, 29, 'The root of that bad nature is not being hit by the axe. That bad tree');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 294, 16, 29, 'has not been cut down. They are trying to produce good fruit on a bad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 294, 17, 29, 'tree.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 294, 18, 29, 'What is the mark of those who belong to Christ? Galatians 5:24 says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 294, 19, 29, '“Those who belong to Christ have crucified the flesh.” “The flesh”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 294, 20, 29, 'speaks of that self-centered life that wants to do its own will. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 294, 21, 29, 'attitude of those that belong to Christ is to crucify that self-centered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 294, 22, 29, 'life. The Romans reserved crucifixion for the worst criminals in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 294, 23, 29, 'society. The ordinary criminals will be just jailed; the worst criminals');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 294, 24, 29, 'were crucified. When you see that this self-centered nature that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 294, 25, 29, 'inherited from Adam is the worst possible criminal and deserves to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 294, 26, 29, 'crucified, then you have understood what repentance all is about. Then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 294, 27, 29, 'you can belong to Christ, because all those who belong to Christ have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 294, 28, 29, 'taken this attitude.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 295, 1, 29, 'We Must Crucify Our Self-Life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 295, 2, 29, 'What is the right attitude to have towards my self-centered life?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 295, 3, 29, 'Crucify it with all its passions and desires. Some people will say that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 295, 4, 29, 'they belong to Christ even if they don’t crucify their self-centered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 295, 5, 29, 'life. Suppose those who belong to Christ may not have crucified the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 295, 6, 29, 'flesh with its passions and desires. Then God''s Word is meaningless. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 295, 7, 29, 'God''s Word is true. A tree that produces bad fruit must be cut down and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 295, 8, 29, 'thrown into the fire. Then we can have this other nature that the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 295, 9, 29, 'Spirit gives us, that produces good fruit. Many people who have fruit,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 295, 10, 29, 'may not have the gifts of the Spirit. That does not matter. God gives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 295, 11, 29, 'different gifts to different people. If you can remember what Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 295, 12, 29, 'repeated twice in Matthew 7, then you will be saved from a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 295, 13, 29, 'deception. In Matthew 7:16, Jesus said that you will be able to identify');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 295, 14, 29, 'a true and a false prophet, not by their gifts, but by their fruits.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 295, 15, 29, 'Again, Jesus says in Matthew 7:20, “You will know them by their fruits.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 295, 16, 29, 'If only all Christians had just taken this one simple sentence to heart,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 295, 17, 29, 'we would be saved from a tremendous amount of deception in Christianity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 295, 18, 29, 'today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 295, 19, 29, 'Christianity today can be divided into two categories: Babylon and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 295, 20, 29, 'Jerusalem. That which is Babylonian, or harlot Christianity, is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 295, 21, 29, 'described in Revelation 17, and it will be burnt up and destroyed by God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 295, 22, 29, 'one day. The pure holy bride of Jesus Christ is called Jerusalem in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 295, 23, 29, 'Revelation 21. That will shine with its glory through all eternal ages.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 295, 24, 29, 'There is a way to distinguish between the two. Both may have gifts, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 295, 25, 29, 'remember that only one will have the fruit of the Spirit, of humility,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 295, 26, 29, 'love, goodness, freedom from the love of money, etc. Whenever you look');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 295, 27, 29, 'at a preacher, this is what you need to look for. Is he a true prophet,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 295, 28, 29, 'or he is just false prophet? Is he a real sheep, or a wolf in sheep''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 296, 1, 29, 'clothing? This is such an important work for our day. Does he preach the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 296, 2, 29, 'Sermon on the Mount? Does he preach the narrow way that leads to life?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 296, 3, 29, 'Or is he just showing off his oratory and his abilities? This is the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 296, 4, 29, 'to distinguish between a true and false prophet.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 296, 5, 30, 'Chapter 29 A Bridal Relationship with Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 296, 6, 30, 'In Matthew 7:14, Jesus says that the way that He has described in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 296, 7, 30, 'Sermon on the Mount is a very narrow way. Salvation is only through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 296, 8, 30, 'faith in Christ; it''s not by works. It''s not by keeping the Sermon on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 296, 9, 30, 'the Mount that we get life. We get life, first of all, by coming to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 296, 10, 30, 'Christ and acknowledging we are sinners, and that we can do nothing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 296, 11, 30, 'get our sins forgiven. Next, we must believe that He paid the entire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 296, 12, 30, 'price for all our sins on the cross, and that because He died and He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 296, 13, 30, 'rose again from the dead, we receive forgiveness of sins as a free gift');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 296, 14, 30, 'from God. However, salvation comes only when we have turned from our sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 296, 15, 30, '– this is called repentance. If I have not turned from my sin in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 296, 16, 30, 'repentance, it''s no use believing that Christ died for our sins because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 296, 17, 30, 'salvation is offered to those who repent and believe, not just to those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 296, 18, 30, 'who believe. There are many who believe - the world is full of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 296, 19, 30, 'Christians who believe that Christ died for their sins - but 95% of them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 296, 20, 30, 'haven’t repented. In that case, they have not received anything. They’re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 296, 21, 30, 'asking God to forgive them, but they are still facing their sins; they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 296, 22, 30, 'need to turn around. But how do we know that our faith is genuine? James');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 296, 23, 30, 'says in his letter that “Faith without works is dead.” That''s where the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 296, 24, 30, 'Sermon on the Mount comes in: if our faith is genuine, it’ll produce a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 296, 25, 30, 'desire to live the type of life described in the Sermon on the Mount.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 296, 26, 30, 'Desire to Obey Is the Proof of Faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 296, 27, 30, 'Just like a human being has different desires from an animal, a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 296, 28, 30, 'Christian has heavenly desires. When God created Adam, He breathed into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 297, 1, 30, 'him the breath of life, but Adam also had flesh, so there were two pulls');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 297, 2, 30, 'in him. One was the downward pull to earth because he had flesh, just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 297, 3, 30, 'like the animals. The other was the upward pull from God because of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 297, 4, 30, 'divine life, divine breath in him. He responded to the downward pull in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 297, 5, 30, 'the garden of Eden, which is how he sinned.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 297, 6, 30, 'And when a man keeps responding to the downward pull, he becomes like an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 297, 7, 30, 'animal. You find around the world that most men behave like animals');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 297, 8, 30, 'towards each other, and animals don''t have any interest in God. A lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 297, 9, 30, 'people don''t have any interest in God, and they are just like animals.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 297, 10, 30, 'But when we respond to the voice of conscience that’s reminding us of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 297, 11, 30, 'God, that helps us to turn towards Him, and that''s the first step of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 297, 12, 30, 'Salvation. When we respond to that and are really born again, it will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 297, 13, 30, 'produce a desire to live the type of life described in the Sermon on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 297, 14, 30, 'Mount.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 297, 15, 30, 'James describes it like this: just like the body without breath is dead,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 297, 16, 30, 'so faith without works is dead (James 2:26). He compares faith in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 297, 17, 30, 'doctrines of Scripture to all the parts of our body. You may believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 297, 18, 30, 'every single truth in Scripture - that''s like saying this person has ten');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 297, 19, 30, 'fingers, ten toes, two ears, two eyes one mouth. If all the internal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 297, 20, 30, 'parts of the body - liver, kidney, heart - are all there, but he is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 297, 21, 30, 'dead, what’s the use of that? In that case, it doesn''t matter if he is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 297, 22, 30, 'in even worse shape - has no hands and no eyes and no legs and no heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 297, 23, 30, 'and no kidney - if he''s dead, everything is useless. In the same way,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 297, 24, 30, 'what’s the use of believing all the doctrines, if the breath is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 297, 25, 30, 'there, and if the Holy Spirit has not brought in us the desire to live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 297, 26, 30, 'according to what is described in the Sermon on the Mount? “Faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 297, 27, 30, 'without works is dead” (James 2:26). That kind of faith is exactly like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 297, 28, 30, 'a dead body. It may have all its parts, but not breath! Only when the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 298, 1, 30, 'body has breath, do you know it''s living. And it’s better to have a body');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 298, 2, 30, 'with one hand (incomplete doctrine) that''s living than have two hands');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 298, 3, 30, '(perfect doctrine) and be dead. We shouldn''t glory in our doctrines; we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 298, 4, 30, 'shouldn''t even glory in our gifts. That''s the point: that the way to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 298, 5, 30, 'life is narrow. When a false prophet wants many people in his church, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 298, 6, 30, 'is going to widen that gate. And that''s exactly what many preachers have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 298, 7, 30, 'done, widen the gate so that many people would come in.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 298, 8, 30, 'Don’t Lower God’s Standards in the Last Days');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 298, 9, 30, 'Noah in the Old Testament is a great example of a man who did not widen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 298, 10, 30, 'the gate. He was living in a time of tremendous sexual sin, immorality,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 298, 11, 30, 'violence, and evil, and Jesus said that the last days will be like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 298, 12, 30, 'days of Noah, much like they are today. Noah, however, kept the gate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 298, 13, 30, 'narrow so that nobody could get in unless they were willing to fulfill');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 298, 14, 30, 'the conditions. Ultimately, it was only his own family members that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 298, 15, 30, 'fulfilled those conditions and stayed in that church. Noah’s church was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 298, 16, 30, 'comprised of eight members - he, his wife, his three sons, and their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 298, 17, 30, 'wives - his whole family, but nobody else. It''s not because he didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 298, 18, 30, 'want anybody else - he preached to the whole world of his time to enter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 298, 19, 30, 'into the ark - but only these 8 wanted to enter in. Now if he had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 298, 20, 30, 'lowered the standard (Noah is called a preacher of righteousness), he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 298, 21, 30, 'could have gotten many more people. He could have gotten 80 or 800, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 298, 22, 30, 'none of them would have qualified to get into the ark, and the entire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 298, 23, 30, 'world would have been destroyed. You and I wouldn''t be living today. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 298, 24, 30, 'should thank God for Noah’s faithfulness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 298, 25, 30, 'If the last days are like the days of Noah, then there must be a few');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 298, 26, 30, 'people like Noah in the last days, too, who don''t lower God’s standards.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 298, 27, 30, 'There must be preachers of righteousness who keep the gate as narrow as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 298, 28, 30, 'Jesus made it - not legalists who try to make it narrower than what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 299, 1, 30, 'Jesus made it. I''m sorry to say there are some people like that, too,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 299, 2, 30, 'who add to Scripture, who say things which Jesus never said and try to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 299, 3, 30, 'make the gate narrower than what Jesus made it. We have to make it the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 299, 4, 30, 'right size, and that''s why we need to know Scripture. False prophets are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 299, 5, 30, 'those who widen the gate, and we could also say that there are false');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 299, 6, 30, 'prophets who make it narrower than the way of Jesus (like a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 299, 7, 30, 'legalists). You will know them by their fruits.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 299, 8, 30, 'The Fruit of the Spirit Is More Important Than Gifts and Doctrine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 299, 9, 30, 'The test is always the fruit of the Holy Spirit, and that''s why the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 299, 10, 30, 'fruit of the Holy Spirit is much more important than the gifts of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 299, 11, 30, 'Holy Spirit. Both are necessary, but fruit is more important. Jesus’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 299, 12, 30, 'life produced the fruit of the Spirit for thirty-three and half years,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 299, 13, 30, 'but He manifested the gifts of the Spirit for only 10% of that time,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 299, 14, 30, 'just three and a half years. So which is more important? This shows that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 299, 15, 30, 'the fruit of the Spirit was ten times more important than the gifts of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 299, 16, 30, 'the Spirit in Jesus’ Own life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 299, 17, 30, 'We do need both, but both are not equally important. That''s what comes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 299, 18, 30, 'up in the next section of the Sermon on the Mount, starting in Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 299, 19, 30, '7:21. In the earlier section, verses 15-20, Jesus spoke about the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 299, 20, 30, 'importance of fruit. Good trees produce good fruit, and “You will know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 299, 21, 30, 'them by their fruits.” He begins and ends that section with the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 299, 22, 30, 'sentence, “You shall know them by their fruits.” The same sentence is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 299, 23, 30, 'repeated in verses 16 and 20, emphasizing fruit and then He compares it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 299, 24, 30, 'with gifts. He says, in relation to gifts, that, “Not everyone who says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 299, 25, 30, 'to Me, ‘Lord, Lord,’ will enter the kingdom of heaven,” and He then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 299, 26, 30, 'describes fruit as “Doing the will of My Father in heaven.” That is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 299, 27, 30, 'beautiful expression of what fruit is - doing the will of my Father,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 299, 28, 30, 'whatever it is. And that means denying your own will. You cannot do the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 300, 1, 30, 'will of God if you don''t deny your own will. Jesus could not do the will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 300, 2, 30, 'of the Father in Gethsemane if He did not say, “Not My will.” That “not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 300, 3, 30, 'my will,” is described in verse 19 as cutting down that which doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 300, 4, 30, 'bear good fruit. My will is always contrary to God''s will. Man''s human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 300, 5, 30, 'self-will is contrary to God''s will, otherwise Jesus would not have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 300, 6, 30, 'said, “Not My will.” In heaven, before He became a man, He could say, “I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 300, 7, 30, 'do My Own will” because it was the same as His Father''s will. However,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 300, 8, 30, 'the moment He came as a man, He said, in John 6:38, “I came from heaven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 300, 9, 30, 'not to do My Own will.” Why not, Lord?” Because it''s not the same as My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 300, 10, 30, 'Father''s will. I came to do not My Own will, but the will of My Father.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 300, 11, 30, 'We can describe it like this: in a cross, my will crosses God''s will,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 300, 12, 30, 'and that''s where I have to die. If I die there, then I will do God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 300, 13, 30, 'will.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 300, 14, 30, 'Not everyone who simply says to Jesus, “Lord, Lord” is going to enter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 300, 15, 30, 'God''s kingdom. There are lot of people who say to the Lord, “Lord, Lord”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 300, 16, 30, 'that are not going to enter God’s kingdom. The fact that he says, “Lord”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 300, 17, 30, 'proves that his doctrine is right. The fact that he says, “Lord, Lord”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 300, 18, 30, 'indicates that he''s emotionally excited about the fact that Jesus is his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 300, 19, 30, 'Lord, but he doesn''t realize that this Jesus is not really his Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 300, 20, 30, 'because in his daily life, he doesn''t do the will of the Father. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 300, 21, 30, 'the one who does the will of God, which means the one who dies to his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 300, 22, 30, 'own will and does the will of God and is crucified with Christ, that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 300, 23, 30, 'the one who is going to enter God''s kingdom. Do you qualify according to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 300, 24, 30, 'this verse? Jesus says that many - not just one or two, “many” means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 300, 25, 30, 'thousands - are going to stand before God in the day of judgment and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 300, 26, 30, 'say, “Lord, Lord.” They are going to use the right words. “Didn''t we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 300, 27, 30, 'prophesy in Your Name?” they’ll say. Prophecy is one of the greatest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 300, 28, 30, 'gifts of the Holy Spirit that we are encouraged to seek for. In 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 301, 1, 30, 'Corinthians 14:1, this gift is to proclaim God''s Word as His mouthpiece;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 301, 2, 30, 'it''s not just like a teacher who is teaching God''s Word - those are the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 301, 3, 30, 'scribes, which are different from the prophets. Prophets are people who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 301, 4, 30, 'understand God''s Word to proclaim it prophetically according to the need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 301, 5, 30, 'of people - it is a supernatural gift.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 301, 6, 30, 'Attitude Towards Sin Is More Important Than Performing Miracles');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 301, 7, 30, 'The Lord says that “many people” will come to Him and say, “Lord, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 301, 8, 30, 'prophesied in Your Name. We blessed people with the spirit of prophecy,”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 301, 9, 30, 'and many others will say, “In Your Name we cast out demons!” And a third');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 301, 10, 30, 'group of people will say, “We performed not one or two miracles, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 301, 11, 30, 'many miracles in Your Name!” These are genuine miracles, not like fake');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 301, 12, 30, 'counterfeit miracles that a lot of people claim to be doing on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 301, 13, 30, 'television and on public platforms today. They perform genuine miracles,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 301, 14, 30, 'and all of these say, “We did it in Your Name.” Three times you find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 301, 15, 30, 'that expression, “coming in Jesus’ Name” (verse 22). And yet Jesus “will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 301, 16, 30, 'declare to them, ‘I never knew you, you who did miracles in My Name.’” I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 301, 17, 30, 'don''t question that they really worked miracles - they wouldn’t dare');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 301, 18, 30, 'tell lies to Christ if it didn''t actually happen. Today somebody can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 301, 19, 30, 'fool you, saying he is doing a miracle. It may be a magician''s trick or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 301, 20, 30, 'very often people boast about miracles that happen in other places (lot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 301, 21, 30, 'of preachers talk about miracles that happen in other places). Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 301, 22, 30, 'never spoke about miracles He did in other places; He did a miracle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 301, 23, 30, 'right in front of people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 301, 24, 30, 'There are lot of deceivers today, and Jesus will say to them, “I never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 301, 25, 30, 'knew you. Depart from Me you who practice lawlessness (or you who live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 301, 26, 30, 'in sin).” The important issue is their attitude to sin - not how many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 301, 27, 30, 'demons they cast out, not how many miracles they did, and not how much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 301, 28, 30, 'they prophesied. Again, it’s their attitude to sin that is important. Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 302, 1, 30, 'you believe that these are words of Jesus? Do you believe that it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 302, 2, 30, 'going to be exactly like this in the day of judgment? Do you believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 302, 3, 30, 'that many of these great healers whom you''ve seen on television, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 302, 4, 30, 'whom you have seen on platforms preach so eloquently, and whom you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 302, 5, 30, 'admire so much because you think they are doing great miracles and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 302, 6, 30, 'casting out demons – do you believe that many of them will be cast into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 302, 7, 30, 'hell in the final day? I don''t think many Christians do. I''m not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 302, 8, 30, 'surprised by these deceivers who get up and swindle people of their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 302, 9, 30, 'money with all their fake gifts and miracles. I''m more surprised that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 302, 10, 30, 'millions of people are so gullible and dumb and blind, spiritually, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 302, 11, 30, 'they swallow all their gimmicks and imagine that these are men of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 302, 12, 30, 'Christians don''t seem to look for the fruits of these deceivers. Is this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 302, 13, 30, 'man free from the love of money? Is he using my money to live in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 302, 14, 30, 'luxurious lifestyle himself? Is he a humble man? Is he leading me to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 302, 15, 30, 'godliness? Is he living in sin? Is he divorced? Is he fooling around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 302, 16, 30, 'sexually? Hardly anybody seems to worry about these things. Jesus says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 302, 17, 30, 'to such people, “I never knew you. Depart from Me. I don''t have anything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 302, 18, 30, 'to do with you.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 302, 19, 30, 'I believe these are the exact words of Jesus, and that it’s going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 302, 20, 30, 'happen exactly like this when Christ comes again. Whether you believe it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 302, 21, 30, 'or not, it’s going to happen like this because the Word of God says that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 302, 22, 30, 'there will be many, which means thousands of people, who will come to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 302, 23, 30, 'Him - some of these great so-called “men of God” whom you think are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 302, 24, 30, 'great men of God, and you’ll discover on that day that they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 302, 25, 30, 'swindlers and crooks and not men of God at all. What are they going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 302, 26, 30, 'say to the Lord? “Lord, we preached on television for so many years.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 302, 27, 30, 'Millions listened to us, millions sent us their money for these programs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 302, 28, 30, 'and have enabled us to live in great style. We cast out demons in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 303, 1, 30, 'name. We preached powerful messages in Your Name that held people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 303, 2, 30, 'spellbound for hours. We performed many (not one or two, but many)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 303, 3, 30, 'miracles in Your name!” - and He will turn around and say, “Get away');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 303, 4, 30, 'from Me, all of you. I never knew you personally. I didn''t have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 303, 5, 30, 'personal relationship with you. You had certain doctrines that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 303, 6, 30, 'proclaimed to know, like a chemistry teacher who gets up in a class and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 303, 7, 30, 'teaches chemistry because he studied chemistry.” These people can teach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 303, 8, 30, 'the Bible because they studied the Bible, but they didn''t have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 303, 9, 30, 'personal relationship with Jesus Christ. If they did have a personal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 303, 10, 30, 'relationship with Jesus Christ, they would have imbibed the nature of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 303, 11, 30, 'Christ, which is one of humility, freedom from the love of money, never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 303, 12, 30, 'exploiting the poor, always seeking the good of people, and no showing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 303, 13, 30, 'off or drawing people to themselves. They would be drawing people to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 303, 14, 30, 'Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 303, 15, 30, 'It''s a good question to ask ourselves, what is important in the final');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 303, 16, 30, 'day? Why is He sending them away? He says, “All of these things that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 303, 17, 30, 'did count for nothing.” Listen to this! All of these miracles, casting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 303, 18, 30, 'out of demons, ministry, and prophecy - God says, “As far as I’m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 303, 19, 30, 'concerned, it counts for zero if you''re not free from sin in your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 303, 20, 30, 'The important thing is to be free from sin.” You who practice sin, sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 303, 21, 30, 'is lawlessness, we read that in 1 John 3:5. So the important question in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 303, 22, 30, 'the final day is going to be: what is your attitude to sin? Not how many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 303, 23, 30, 'miracles you did, or how much you preached, or how many tracts you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 303, 24, 30, 'distributed, or how much evangelism you did, or whatever else - not your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 303, 25, 30, 'ministry, but your attitude to sin. Many people satisfy themselves today');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 303, 26, 30, 'by doing some ministry for the Lord. That''s not what''s going to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 303, 27, 30, 'primary in the final day. Your attitude to sin in your heart and in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 303, 28, 30, 'personal life, that is the essence of the Sermon on the Mount. He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 304, 1, 30, 'concluding the Sermon on the Mount, and there is nothing about ministry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 304, 2, 30, 'in the Sermon on the Mount. It is all about your personal life. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 304, 3, 30, 'says that that''s the important thing, and that''s the way to distinguish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 304, 4, 30, 'a true prophet from a false prophet. A true prophet will emphasize');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 304, 5, 30, 'freedom from sin; he will emphasize holiness, not gifts. You will know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 304, 6, 30, 'true prophets by their fruits, and not by their gifts. What He said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 304, 7, 30, 'earlier, in verse 16-20 (about knowing people by their fruit), is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 304, 8, 30, 'contrast to what He says here. Don''t judge by their doctrine. They may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 304, 9, 30, 'say, “Lord, Lord” correctly, but look for their fruit, and don''t be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 304, 10, 30, 'deceived by their gifts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 304, 11, 30, 'How Do False Prophets Have Gifts?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 304, 12, 30, 'Many may say, “How do they exercise these gifts?” Well, we should ask');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 304, 13, 30, 'ourselves, “How does Satan have supernatural gifts today?” Satan has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 304, 14, 30, 'such tremendous supernatural abilities; he even gives abilities to witch');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 304, 15, 30, 'doctors, as we read in the Bible. The first person who brought fire down');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 304, 16, 30, 'from heaven was not Elijah - it was the devil, in the book of Job. Job');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 304, 17, 30, 'lived before Moses, who wrote Genesis, and Job is the first book of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 304, 18, 30, 'Bible ever written. There we read, in chapter 1, of fire coming down');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 304, 19, 30, 'from heaven. Who sent it? The devil did, and it descended on Job’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 304, 20, 30, 'property. He has supernatural power to stir people to attack God’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 304, 21, 30, 'servants, as we read in Job 1. He has power to give sickness to people,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 304, 22, 30, 'as we read in Job 2. Satan has tremendous supernatural power - you see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 304, 23, 30, 'that in the witch doctors of today, and in people who are in contact');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 304, 24, 30, 'with black magic and such things - where did he get it from? He couldn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 304, 25, 30, 'have created it, and a being cannot have supernatural power. He got it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 304, 26, 30, 'from God. Why did God give Satan all these supernatural abilities, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 304, 27, 30, 'when did He give them? It''s obvious that God would never give the devil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 304, 28, 30, 'any gifts after he became the devil. These were gifts that God had given');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 305, 1, 30, 'him before he became Satan, and you read about that in Ezekiel 28. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 305, 2, 30, 'had so many abilities then - he was full of wisdom and beauty - and he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 305, 3, 30, 'still has all the supernatural gifts that God gave him when he was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 305, 4, 30, 'Holy Angel. He was called in Ezekiel 28:14, “The anointed cherub that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 305, 5, 30, 'covers,” and anointing always refers to supernatural gifts. But he''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 305, 6, 30, 'using those gifts for himself and for purposes to promote himself now,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 305, 7, 30, 'and not to promote God. The same is true for some of these people who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 305, 8, 30, 'are doing certain supernatural things today as Christians, preaching in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 305, 9, 30, 'Jesus’ Name.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 305, 10, 30, 'Once upon a time, maybe they were sincere Christians who sought God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 305, 11, 30, 'who received gifts, but then they began to use the gifts for themselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 305, 12, 30, 'It’s like the prodigal son, who came to his father, received the gifts,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 305, 13, 30, 'and then went away and used them for himself. That''s a perfect picture');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 305, 14, 30, 'of many preachers today. They come to God to receive gifts from Him, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 305, 15, 30, 'then go out and use the gifts to promote themselves. This is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 305, 16, 30, 'opposite of Jesus; Jesus wouldn''t even use the gifts of God to make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 305, 17, 30, 'bread for Himself. He did make bread for the 5,000, but He wouldn''t do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 305, 18, 30, 'it for Himself. That''s the mark of a true servant of God. But these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 305, 19, 30, 'preachers have used God''s gifts to promote themselves, and gradually,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 305, 20, 30, 'what happens to such people is that they drift away in sin. Jesus’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 305, 21, 30, 'attitude to them is, “I never knew you. I forgave you once upon a time,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 305, 22, 30, 'but you drifted away from Me, and you have lost that forgiveness. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 305, 23, 30, 'have lost your salvation, and you never came into a personal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 305, 24, 30, 'relationship with Me.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 305, 25, 30, 'Jesus Is Most Interested in a Bride-Bridegroom Relationship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 305, 26, 30, 'Does God give gifts to people who don''t know Him? “Knowing” is a word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 305, 27, 30, 'used in the Old Testament for husband and wife - Adam “knew” his wife.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 305, 28, 30, '“I never knew you” means, “I never had a relationship with you as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 306, 1, 30, 'bridegroom and a bride.” Did you know that God does not have that kind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 306, 2, 30, 'of relationship with any angel? It''s only with man, redeemed by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 306, 3, 30, 'blood of Christ. Christ is not the Bridegroom of any angel. He is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 306, 4, 30, 'Bridegroom of the church, those who are redeemed by His blood. Satan,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 306, 5, 30, 'even when he was a holy angel, was not the bride, and he had no personal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 306, 6, 30, 'knowledge like that spoken of here, knowing like a husband knows his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 306, 7, 30, 'wife. He did, however, have gifts, and there are a lot of people like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 306, 8, 30, 'him today who have gifts, but who do not have an intimate relationship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 306, 9, 30, 'with Christ. Again, “I never knew you” means, “I never had a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 306, 10, 30, 'bridegroom-bride relationship with you.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 306, 11, 30, 'That is the important thing that will matter in the final day. Christ is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 306, 12, 30, 'coming for a bride, not for people who exercise gifts and who serve him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 306, 13, 30, 'in this ministry in that ministry. Ask yourself what is important to you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 306, 14, 30, 'in your life - are you like Martha, doing a lot of things for the Lord?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 306, 15, 30, 'Or are you like Mary, having that bridal attitude, sitting at Jesus’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 306, 16, 30, 'feet and loving Him like a bride? A bride and a bridegroom love to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 306, 17, 30, 'with each other. It''s not what they do for each other that is important,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 306, 18, 30, 'but their attitude towards each other. They know each other, and that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 306, 19, 30, 'going to be the most important thing in the final day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 306, 20, 30, 'Do you know the Lord? Do you know him intimately, as a bride knows a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 306, 21, 30, 'bridegroom, as wife knows her husband? That''s what the Lord is telling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 306, 22, 30, 'these people. You can exercise so many gifts, you can do so much of work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 306, 23, 30, 'for Me, you can distribute thousands of tracts, raise so much money,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 306, 24, 30, 'travel here and there, preach, and do so many wonderful things, but if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 306, 25, 30, 'you don''t have a bridal relationship with Me, I will say to you, “I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 306, 26, 30, 'never knew you.” He told Martha that one thing is needful: that bridal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 306, 27, 30, 'attitude that Mary had, who sat at His feet; not all the work you do for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 306, 28, 30, 'Him. He said that''s a distraction. In Luke 10:42, He said, “Martha,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 307, 1, 30, 'you''re distracted by your work for Me.” He did not even appreciate the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 307, 2, 30, 'fact that Martha was doing so many things unselfishly - just like false');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 307, 3, 30, 'teachers have also blessed many people with their healing ministries,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 307, 4, 30, 'their demon casting-out ministries, and their preaching ministries - but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 307, 5, 30, 'Jesus didn''t bother to mention it. Christ was not impressed with that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 307, 6, 30, 'He said, “More than your work, I want you.” I wish we would recognize');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 307, 7, 30, 'this, and realize what it is that the Lord wants from us, and what it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 307, 8, 30, 'that going to matter in the final day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 307, 9, 30, 'That''s why the Sermon on the Mount is so important. That''s why it''s very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 307, 10, 30, 'important to go through Matthew 5, 6, and 7 - to see whether you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 307, 11, 30, 'obeying these things. That will prove whether the Lord knows you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 307, 12, 30, 'whether you know the Lord, whether you have a bridal relationship with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 307, 13, 30, 'Him, and if so, then He will receive you. He will not say to you, “Oh,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 307, 14, 30, 'but you never cast out demons,” or, “Oh you never prophesied.” He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 307, 15, 30, 'never going to say that. That''s not important. If God gives you the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 307, 16, 30, 'gift, then you can do that. The important thing is the bridal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 307, 17, 30, 'relationship with Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 307, 18, 31, 'Chapter 30 Building on the Rock');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 307, 19, 31, 'In the last paragraph of the Sermon on the Mount, Jesus says, “Everyone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 307, 20, 31, 'who hears these words of Mine and does them can be compared to a wise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 307, 21, 31, 'man who built his house upon a rock” (Matthew 7:24). This is referring');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 307, 22, 31, 'to a Christian who goes to church and reads the Bible. He hears the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 307, 23, 31, 'words of Jesus, specifically the Sermon on the Mount, which begins in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 307, 24, 31, 'Matthew 5:3, and does them. He is like the man who built his house on a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 307, 25, 31, 'rock. “The rain descended, the floods came, the winds blew against that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 307, 26, 31, 'house, but it did not fall.” But the one “who hears these words of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 307, 27, 31, 'Mine,” - which means, he reads the Sermon on the Mount, he believes it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 307, 28, 31, 'as the words of Jesus, he goes to church and listens to the preaching,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 308, 1, 31, 'and reads the Bible, but he does not do it; he just understands it and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 308, 2, 31, 'is excited about it - “but he doesn''t do it, is a man who built his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 308, 3, 31, 'house upon sand. The rain descended the floods came the winds blew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 308, 4, 31, 'against that house and it fell - and great was its fall” (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 308, 5, 31, '7:25-27).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 308, 6, 31, 'Obedience - Not Just Understanding and Excitement - Is Building upon the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 308, 7, 31, 'Rock');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 308, 8, 31, 'So what is the difference between these two? There is a children’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 308, 9, 31, 'chorus called, “Build Your House on the Rock.” It goes, “The wise man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 308, 10, 31, 'built his house upon the rock, the foolish man built his house upon the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 308, 11, 31, 'sand,” and then it goes on to say, “so build a house in the Lord Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 308, 12, 31, 'Christ.” Many people think, “If I have accepted Christ as my Saviour, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 308, 13, 31, 'have already built my house on the rock”. There''s a sense in which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 308, 14, 31, 'Christ is our foundation. He is the only foundation. But here, if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 308, 15, 31, 'read carefully, what Jesus says is that the proof that a man has built');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 308, 16, 31, 'his house on the rock is that he obeys - not that he just said, “Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 308, 17, 31, 'I''m a sinner please come into my heart and forgive my sins.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 308, 18, 31, 'There are multitudes of Christians who have said those words, and who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 308, 19, 31, 'imagine themselves to be born again, but who don''t care one bit for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 308, 20, 31, 'commands of Jesus mentioned in Matthew 5, 6 and 7. They don''t seek to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 308, 21, 31, 'overcome anger, they don''t seek to overcome sexual lust, they are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 308, 22, 31, 'careful about speaking the truth, they don''t love their enemies, etc.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 308, 23, 31, 'But they''ve said, “Lord Jesus come into my heart.” They are living in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 308, 24, 31, 'world of deception. They are like a man who hears these words and does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 308, 25, 31, 'not do them. They may understand them and may even be excited about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 308, 26, 31, 'them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 308, 27, 31, 'In our previous study, we looked at a man who said, “Lord, Lord”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 308, 28, 31, '(Matthew 7:21-22). When he says, “Lord,” it means his intellect is right');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 309, 1, 31, 'and he has understood the truth. When he says, “Lord, Lord,” it means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 309, 2, 31, 'his emotions are right and he is excited about it. But his will is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 309, 3, 31, 'strong. Our human personality (our soul) consists of three parts: mind,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 309, 4, 31, 'emotions, and will. We may have understood the truth in our mind, and be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 309, 5, 31, 'excited in our emotions about it, but if we don''t yield our will to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 309, 6, 31, 'the will of God, we are deceiving ourselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 309, 7, 31, 'The wise man is the man who penetrated all the way through the sand and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 309, 8, 31, 'hit rock. This becomes clear when you read the parallel passage in Luke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 309, 9, 31, '6. There it says, “The wise man is the one who dug deep and hit rock and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 309, 10, 31, 'there lays foundation on the rock” (Luke 6:48). In other words, they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 309, 11, 31, 'were both building in the same area, where the surface was sand. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 309, 12, 31, 'foolish man built on the sand, while the wise man dug through the sand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 309, 13, 31, 'till he hit rock, blasted the rock, and laid his foundation there.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 309, 14, 31, 'What is the sand? The sand is our intellectual understanding of God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 309, 15, 31, 'Word. The sand is our emotional excitement about God''s Word. You can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 309, 16, 31, 'intellectually understand everything. You can hear these words of Jesus,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 309, 17, 31, 'understand them, be excited about them, and call Him, “Lord, Lord,” but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 309, 18, 31, 'you are still on sand. It is when your will is blasted, when you yield');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 309, 19, 31, 'your will and say, “Lord, I will not do my will but Your will” -- when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 309, 20, 31, 'your self-will is shattered, you die on that cross, say no to your will,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 309, 21, 31, 'and do God''s will -- that is the moment you hit rock.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 309, 22, 31, 'That is what Jesus is saying here. “One who hears these words and does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 309, 23, 31, 'them,” not just hears and is excited. In other words, it’s the yielding');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 309, 24, 31, 'of the will that finally plants our house on the rock. It’s the yielding');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 309, 25, 31, 'of the will that goes beyond saying, “Lord, Lord.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 309, 26, 31, 'The Veil of Self-Will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 309, 27, 31, 'In the Old Testament tabernacle, the soul was represented by the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 309, 28, 31, 'Place, the body was represented by the Outer Court, and the spirit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 310, 1, 31, 'man is represented by the Most Holy Place. In between the Most Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 310, 2, 31, 'Place and the Holy Place there was a thick veil which was closed in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 310, 3, 31, 'Old Testament times, but it was torn when Jesus died on the cross. What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 310, 4, 31, 'did that tearing of that veil symbolize when Jesus died on the cross?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 310, 5, 31, 'Hebrews 10:20 explains it to us: “Jesus inaugurated a new and living way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 310, 6, 31, 'into the Most Holy Place through the veil, and that symbolizes His flesh');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 310, 7, 31, '(and flesh means self-will).”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 310, 8, 31, 'Jesus did not have sin in Him when He came to earth. He was born, as the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 310, 9, 31, 'angel Gabriel said, a Holy Thing, but He did have a self-will. Otherwise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 310, 10, 31, 'He couldn''t be a man like us, which the Bible calls flesh. When it says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 310, 11, 31, 'Jesus came in the flesh, it means He came with a will of His own. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 310, 12, 31, 'said that very clearly in John 6:38, “For I have come down from heaven,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 310, 13, 31, 'not to do My own will, but the will of Him who sent Me.” He had a will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 310, 14, 31, 'of His own that had to be denied because it was contrary to His Father''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 310, 15, 31, 'will. That''s what we see in Gethsemane, “Not My will, but Thine be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 310, 16, 31, 'done.” He didn''t want to drink the cup, so He struggled for one hour and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 310, 17, 31, 'said, “Father, if You want Me to drink the cup, I''ll do it.” He denied');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 310, 18, 31, 'His Own will and did the Father''s will. But that was not only true in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 310, 19, 31, 'Gethsemane; it was true all through His life. The essence of temptation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 310, 20, 31, 'is to do your own will and not to do the will of God. In Genesis 3,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 310, 21, 31, 'God''s will was, “don’t eat from that tree of knowledge of good and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 310, 22, 31, 'evil.” Eve wanted to eat the fruit. It made her mouth water. The devil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 310, 23, 31, 'told her that it would make her wise, and she did her own will. That was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 310, 24, 31, 'the origin of sin - doing her will and denying God''s will. Salvation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 310, 25, 31, 'came when Jesus did the opposite - He denied His will and did God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 310, 26, 31, 'will. It''s as simple as that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 310, 27, 31, 'True Worship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 310, 28, 31, 'It’s the will that''s important, not how much you understand God''s word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 311, 1, 31, 'or how excited you are about it. You can feel so spiritual when you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 311, 2, 31, 'emotionally thrilled, singing songs on Sunday morning in your church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 311, 3, 31, 'service, which you call praise and worship. That is not worship at all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 311, 4, 31, 'That''s only emotional praise or thanksgiving; it''s not worship. Worship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 311, 5, 31, 'comes when we deny our own will.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 311, 6, 31, 'The first time the word “worship” occurs in the Bible, it cost Abraham');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 311, 7, 31, 'something - Isaac on the altar. When Abraham offered Isaac on the altar,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 311, 8, 31, 'giving up his own will, he said, “I am worshiping God,” (read Genesis');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 311, 9, 31, '22). This is the meaning of worship. It is the denial of one’s will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 311, 10, 31, 'which opens the way into the Most Holy Place. So when the veil was rent,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 311, 11, 31, 'when Jesus died on the cross, He said, “It is finished.” What He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 311, 12, 31, 'saying was, He faced the entire range of temptations that any human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 311, 13, 31, 'being can ever face (Hebrews 4:15) – not necessarily all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 311, 14, 31, 'circumstances, but all the temptations - and He said no to His Own will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 311, 15, 31, 'in every one of those thousands or millions of instances in thirty-three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 311, 16, 31, 'and a half years. He never did His Own will, or in other words, He never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 311, 17, 31, 'sinned. He said no to His will, which is like the veil, and so the veil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 311, 18, 31, 'was rent. The veil being rent was symbolic of the fact that Jesus never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 311, 19, 31, 'did His own will in His entire life, and when He died on the cross, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 311, 20, 31, 'opened what Hebrews calls “the new and living way.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 311, 21, 31, 'The New and Living “Way”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 311, 22, 31, 'What is this new and living way? The veil is a “way,” not a door. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 311, 23, 31, 'word, “way” means something that we have to walk on consistently. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 311, 24, 31, 'the way of denying our own will and doing the Father’s will so that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 311, 25, 31, 'can live in the Father''s presence forever - in Whose presence there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 311, 26, 31, 'fullness of joy, and at Whose right hand there are pleasures forevermore');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 311, 27, 31, '(Psalm 16:11). Why do people seek the pleasures of the earth? It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 311, 28, 31, 'because they haven''t seen the eternal pleasures in the Father''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 312, 1, 31, 'presence. Why are people discouraged and gloomy and in bad moods? It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 312, 2, 31, 'because they haven''t enjoyed the fullness of joy there is in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 312, 3, 31, 'Father''s presence, because they do not deny their own wills. The devil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 312, 4, 31, 'has fooled even Christians by saying, “You will be happy when you do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 312, 5, 31, 'your own will.” It is a lie. You’re miserable when you do your own will.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 312, 6, 31, 'Jesus was constantly happy, always rejoicing, because He did His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 312, 7, 31, 'Father''s will.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 312, 8, 31, 'This is the point: “Everyone who hears these words of Mine and does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 312, 9, 31, 'them…” If he doesn''t do them, he is still on sand, regardless of how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 312, 10, 31, 'much he may have understood them, or how much he may be able to take a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 312, 11, 31, 'Bible study on the Sermon on the Mount, or how much he may be excited');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 312, 12, 31, 'about it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 312, 13, 31, 'Review of Sermon on the Mount');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 312, 14, 31, 'Here is a quick look through what we have covered in our study of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 312, 15, 31, 'Sermon on the Mount:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 312, 16, 31, 'Nine Right Attitudes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 312, 17, 31, 'Seeking for poverty of spirit - a constant sense of our own need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 312, 18, 31, 'Mourning for our sins, that we are not more Christ-like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 312, 19, 31, 'Being meek, so that we don''t fight for our rights');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 312, 20, 31, 'Hungering and thirsting for righteousness, not for money or healing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 312, 21, 31, 'Being merciful to others, no matter what wrong they''ve done to us, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 312, 22, 31, 'forgiving them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 312, 23, 31, 'Being pure in heart, wanting only God and not anything else (a good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 312, 24, 31, 'conscience means I''m free from sin; pure in heart means more than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 312, 25, 31, 'freedom from sin: it means I desire nothing but God)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 312, 26, 31, 'Becoming peacemakers, always pursuing after peace with all people -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 312, 27, 31, 'believers and unbelievers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 312, 28, 31, 'Being willing to stand up for righteousness, even if it means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 313, 1, 31, 'persecution suffering loss');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 313, 2, 31, 'Being unashamed to confess Christ, even if it brings loss and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 313, 3, 31, 'persecution');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 313, 4, 31, 'These are the nine right attitudes, by which we can be the salt of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 313, 5, 31, 'earth and the light of the world (Matthew 5:13-14) Then he goes on to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 313, 6, 31, 'speak about the nine wrong attitudes that we can have.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 313, 7, 31, 'Nine Wrong Attitudes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 313, 8, 31, 'Anger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 313, 9, 31, 'Sexually sinful ways of thinking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 313, 10, 31, '(Lord I want to have a radical attitude towards sexual thoughts, towards');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 313, 11, 31, 'pornography, etc. I want to cut it off completely. I want to be as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 313, 12, 31, 'radical as pulling out my eye and cutting off my hand I want to take sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 313, 13, 31, 'as more serious than losing my hand. How many of you believe that sexual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 313, 14, 31, 'sin even in the thoughts is more serious than losing your right hand or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 313, 15, 31, 'losing your right eye? The wise man does that. If you don''t have that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 313, 16, 31, 'attitude to sin, you''re not a wise person. You are not building a house');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 313, 17, 31, 'on the rock. Many people take this so casually).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 313, 18, 31, 'Lying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 313, 19, 31, 'Taking Revenge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 313, 20, 31, 'Hatred');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 313, 21, 31, 'Seeking the honor of men (Matthew 6:1-18).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 313, 22, 31, 'The wise man seeks to be completely free from seeking the honor of men,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 313, 23, 31, 'just like he seeks to love all his enemies. He wants to be completely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 313, 24, 31, 'free from the honor of men.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 313, 25, 31, 'Love of money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 313, 26, 31, 'The wise man doesn''t just hear about it, he wants to be completely free');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 313, 27, 31, 'from the love of money. It''s not a question of whether you''re wealthy or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 313, 28, 31, 'poor. Poor people love money and wealthy people love money. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 314, 1, 31, 'possible to be poor and free from the love of money and it’s possible to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 314, 2, 31, 'be wealthy and free from the love of money. 1 Timothy 6 says, “Charge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 314, 3, 31, 'those who are rich not to give up all their riches but to share what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 314, 4, 31, 'they have with others and to provide for the need of other poor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 314, 5, 31, 'believers.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 314, 6, 31, 'Anxiety');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 314, 7, 31, 'It''s an evidence of a lack of faith in our loving Father when we''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 314, 8, 31, 'anxious. To say, “What''s going to happen to us in the future?” shows');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 314, 9, 31, 'that we can’t trust that God will provide all our need, even though He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 314, 10, 31, 'feeds the birds and cares for the flowers. Jesus said even the hairs on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 314, 11, 31, 'your head are numbered. You''re of more value than many sparrows.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 314, 12, 31, 'It''s a great insult when a person believes that his Heavenly Father will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 314, 13, 31, 'not provide for him. When you go and ask people for money, like a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 314, 14, 31, 'preachers do, you''re saying, “I''m not content with what God has given me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 314, 15, 31, 'or God has let me down.” Can you imagine Jesus going to somebody in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 314, 16, 31, 'days when He was preaching and saying, “Can you give Me some money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 314, 17, 31, 'because I''m a bit hard up? My Heavenly Father has let me down”? It''s so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 314, 18, 31, 'ridiculous to even think of that. But that''s how it is when many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 314, 19, 31, 'preachers and many people go begging for money. A lot of Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 314, 20, 31, 'preachers are just dignified beggars. What about your Heavenly Father?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 314, 21, 31, 'Isn''t He the One Who rules the universe? Doesn’t He care for you? If the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 314, 22, 31, 'richest man in the world’s son came to you asking for money, what would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 314, 23, 31, 'you say to him? “Hey, aren’t you the son of the richest man in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 314, 24, 31, 'world? Why are you asking me? Has your Father disinherited you? Is that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 314, 25, 31, 'why you''re hard up?” When a Christian goes begging for money from other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 314, 26, 31, 'people, what he is saying is, “My Heavenly Father has disinherited me. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 314, 27, 31, 'am no longer His child. He has given up on me and that is why I''m hard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 314, 28, 31, 'up. I''m like the prodigal son, far away from the Father''s house, and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 315, 1, 31, 'have to eat what the pigs are eating. I have to go around begging for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 315, 2, 31, 'money.” Every Christian who has to go around begging for money is like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 315, 3, 31, 'the prodigal son far from his Father''s house. Can you imagine a son who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 315, 4, 31, 'is in his father''s house having to beg for money? Completely out of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 315, 5, 31, 'question! If you have to get into debt and beg and borrow, it is one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 315, 6, 31, 'indication that you are far away from the Father’s house.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 315, 7, 31, 'And if you''re anxious and worried about where your provision will come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 315, 8, 31, 'from, you''re not in the Father''s house. Anyone who''s in the Father''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 315, 9, 31, 'house is not anxious. The prodigal son was anxious not when he was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 315, 10, 31, 'sitting at the Father’s table. He was anxious when he was far away. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 315, 11, 31, 'so anxiety is a wrong attitude.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 315, 12, 31, 'Judging others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 315, 13, 31, 'The Bible says “There is only one judge. Do not speak against one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 315, 14, 31, 'another, brethren. He who speaks against a brother or judges his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 315, 15, 31, 'brother, speaks against the law” (James 4:11-12). The law says that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 315, 16, 31, 'must love your brother as yourself, but he who speaks against his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 315, 17, 31, 'brother judges him. You''re judging the law itself - the law of God. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 315, 18, 31, 'if you judge the law, you are not a doer of the law but a judge of it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 315, 19, 31, '“There is only one Lawgiver and Judge” (James 4:12). This is an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 315, 20, 31, 'important word because lawgiver and judge are put together here. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 315, 21, 31, 'the Bible says, “Do not judge” (Matthew 7:1), it’s saying there is only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 315, 22, 31, 'One Lawgiver and Judge. Remember that. A judge has a right to lay down');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 315, 23, 31, 'the law. You and I don''t have any right to lay down a law.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 315, 24, 31, 'When Christians make rules for other Christians - like Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 315, 25, 31, 'preachers who make rules for Christians which are not found in Scripture');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 315, 26, 31, '- they have become law givers. This is the mark of the legalist. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 315, 27, 31, 'legalist lays down rules for other people which are not found in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 315, 28, 31, 'Scripture. To teach the principles that Jesus lived by and to explain to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 316, 1, 31, 'people how that principle applies in a particular situation is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 316, 2, 31, 'different thing, but to lay down a law for other people in an area where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 316, 3, 31, 'the Bible doesn''t lay down a law (but gives us a guideline) makes you a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 316, 4, 31, 'lawgiver. There are many areas where lawgivers also judge other people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 316, 5, 31, 'when the other people don''t keep the laws which they have made. Are you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 316, 6, 31, 'a lawgiver? Then you are taking the throne of God. You are sitting like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 316, 7, 31, 'God on His throne. We have no right to make laws for other people except');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 316, 8, 31, 'what is written in Scripture. And if somebody does not obey that law, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 316, 9, 31, 'have no right to judge him. God is his Judge. The only exception is if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 316, 10, 31, 'God has appointed us as a sub-judge, as it were, in a sphere where God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 316, 11, 31, 'has given us responsibility, like a father over his children, or like an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 316, 12, 31, 'elder over his local church, or like an employer over his employee.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 316, 13, 31, 'Outside of that, we are not called to judge. This is so important.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 316, 14, 31, 'The Hidden Life Is What Really Matters');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 316, 15, 31, 'A man who hears all these things and does not do them is like one who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 316, 16, 31, 'building his house on sand. One day the flood will come and everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 316, 17, 31, 'will collapse. His house may look like the wise man’s house on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 316, 18, 31, 'surface. The superstructure may look alike. But the wise man is a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 316, 19, 31, 'who paid a price which is invisible. The most important part of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 316, 20, 31, 'house is its foundation, which teaches us that the most important part');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 316, 21, 31, 'of your life is that part which other people cannot see. Every house has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 316, 22, 31, 'two parts, one which can be seen above the surface to the ground, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 316, 23, 31, 'one which cannot be seen. The most important part is what is beneath the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 316, 24, 31, 'ground.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 316, 25, 31, 'In all these areas - what we have considered in the Sermon on the Mount');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 316, 26, 31, '- if you hear these words and you do not do them, you are like a person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 316, 27, 31, 'who has no foundation underneath his house. You are not obeying the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 316, 28, 31, 'things that are written here, in your inner life, but your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 317, 1, 31, 'superstructure looks good because you are serving God, going to church,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 317, 2, 31, 'singing in the church meetings, and doing many things that Christians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 317, 3, 31, 'do. You look like a Christian in all your activities, but one day God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 317, 4, 31, 'going to test, not the superstructure, but the foundation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 317, 5, 31, 'What did the flood test? The flood did not come and test what material');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 317, 6, 31, 'the superstructure was made of, or how attractive the superstructure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 317, 7, 31, 'was. The point of this is, the flood came and tested the foundation. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 317, 8, 31, 'will find in the final day, when Christ comes again, that what is going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 317, 9, 31, 'to be tested is not what other people thought about our lives - the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 317, 10, 31, 'outward part of our Christian life - but that which nobody could see (1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 317, 11, 31, 'Corinthians 4:5). The hidden part - which is under the ground, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 317, 12, 31, 'foundation - which nobody sees. Even your wife or your husband do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 317, 13, 31, 'know what your inner life is like.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 317, 14, 31, 'Pay the Price of Obedience to Build on the Foundation of Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 317, 15, 31, 'The Sermon on the Mount ends by emphasizing that “the foundation is more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 317, 16, 31, 'important than the superstructure.” You must be willing to pay a price');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 317, 17, 31, 'to go through the sand and blast the rock. The man who is not willing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 317, 18, 31, 'pay a price for his inner hidden life is a foolish man. Many people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 317, 19, 31, 'don''t want to pay a price to walk that inner walk with God. They are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 317, 20, 31, 'foolish. When Jesus finished these statements, the multitudes were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 317, 21, 31, 'amazed at His teaching because He was teaching them as One having');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 317, 22, 31, 'authority. The great need today in the pulpits in Christendom is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 317, 23, 31, 'spiritual authority. Jesus had lived what He had preached. One');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 317, 24, 31, 'paraphrase says, “it was obvious that He was living every word that He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 317, 25, 31, 'was preaching.” That is how we get spiritual authority. When preachers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 317, 26, 31, 'have lived every word that they are preaching, then they will have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 317, 27, 31, 'spiritual authority. That is the type of authority we need in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 317, 28, 31, 'pulpits, and that is sadly lacking because people want to have a cheap');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 318, 1, 31, 'and easy way to minister God''s word. They go and study in some Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 318, 2, 31, 'School, get a degree, and preach. It costs far more than that to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 318, 3, 31, 'minister with authority. We have to pay a price - of yielding our will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 318, 4, 31, 'in our hidden life - to every one of these points that Jesus brings out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 318, 5, 31, 'in the Sermon on the Mount, and obey them. If we do that, great will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 318, 6, 31, 'our reward and great will be the long-term permanent eternal results of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 318, 7, 31, 'our ministry.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 318, 8, 32, 'Chapter 31 Humility, Compassion and Faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 318, 9, 32, 'We Are to Follow Jesus’ Life, as Well as His Word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 318, 10, 32, 'Starting in Matthew 8, Jesus came down from the mountain, and great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 318, 11, 32, 'multitudes followed Him. A leper came to Him and bowed down to Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 318, 12, 32, 'saying, “Lord, if You''re willing, You can make me clean” (Matthew 8:2).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 318, 13, 32, 'And Jesus stretched out His hand and touched him, saying, “I am willing,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 318, 14, 32, 'be cleansed.” Immediately the man’s leprosy was cleansed. Jesus then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 318, 15, 32, 'said to him, “See that you tell no one, but go show yourself to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 318, 16, 32, 'priest and present the offering that Moses commanded for a testimony to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 318, 17, 32, 'them” (Matthew 8:2-4).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 318, 18, 32, 'When we think about all that Jesus taught, we need to see that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 318, 19, 32, 'taught not only by His words, but also by His actions - the way He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 318, 20, 32, 'related to people, and what He told them to do. It was by His life that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 318, 21, 32, 'He taught, in addition to His words. So when we consider studying “all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 318, 22, 32, 'that Jesus taught,” we need to look at His life and the way He conducted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 318, 23, 32, 'His ministry as well, if we are to follow Him in the same spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 318, 24, 32, 'For example, we see that Jesus healed the leper in Matthew 8. It is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 318, 25, 32, 'fantastic thing when every sign of leprosy disappears from a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 318, 26, 32, 'immediately! You may have seen lepers, how they are, with fingers eaten');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 318, 27, 32, 'away, nose eaten away, and disfigurement on their face. For all of that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 318, 28, 32, 'to disappear in a moment is really a supernatural miracle! If that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 319, 1, 32, 'happened today, people would be so excited that they''d ask him to go and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 319, 2, 32, 'testify to everyone, and to make sure that he tells everyone who it was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 319, 3, 32, 'who prayed for him! This is how so many Christian preachers seek honor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 319, 4, 32, 'for themselves. You see that particularly in the so-called “Great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 319, 5, 32, 'healing campaigns.” As soon as someone has some type of minor healing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 319, 6, 32, '(almost insignificant), the preacher gets up and stands in front of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 319, 7, 32, 'microphone, and he proclaims that this person is healed so that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 319, 8, 32, 'preacher himself gets honor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 319, 9, 32, 'Things were so different with Christ. All that Jesus taught was by His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 319, 10, 32, 'life. He was not excited at the power that went out from Him; He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 319, 11, 32, 'excited that a poor suffering leper was healed. This is the Spirit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 319, 12, 32, 'Christ - where we are concerned that somebody else is blessed, and not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 319, 13, 32, 'so much that he was blessed through me, or that people should know that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 319, 14, 32, 'I was the channel whom God used. There is, unfortunately, so much of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 319, 15, 32, 'that in Christian circles, in Christian preachers, in Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 319, 16, 32, 'organizations, churches, and missions everywhere. When God blesses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 319, 17, 32, 'someone, and we’re not excited that God has blessed them, but instead,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 319, 18, 32, 'we want everybody to know that we were the ones whom God used, that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 319, 19, 32, 'not the spirit of Christ. Where we see something like that, we need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 319, 20, 32, 'recognize that is a trace of the old Adam still in us, and if we don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 319, 21, 32, 'cleanse ourselves from it, we will never be more Christ-like.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 319, 22, 32, 'Jesus even told him, “Don’t tell anyone.” Have you ever heard that type');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 319, 23, 32, 'of instruction from any person who has been instrumental in praying for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 319, 24, 32, 'somebody who was sick? This is the Spirit of Christ. The other thing we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 319, 25, 32, 'see in this exchange is that, since the old covenant was still in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 319, 26, 32, 'operation in Israel, and the new covenant had not been established,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 319, 27, 32, 'Jesus lived under the law, the Bible says, and so He told the one who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 319, 28, 32, 'was cleansed to do exactly what Moses had commanded in the law, (to go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 320, 1, 32, 'to the priest and show himself) because the priest had to declare him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 320, 2, 32, 'cleansed, exactly as Moses commanded.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 320, 3, 32, 'There are many things in the Gospels that Jesus said to people because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 320, 4, 32, 'they were still under the law, which we mustn’t forget. For example, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 320, 5, 32, 'told the Pharisees to pay their tithes (Matthew 23:23). He said that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 320, 6, 32, 'it''s not enough to pay tithes of dill and cumin, etc. but also you also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 320, 7, 32, 'need to fulfil the weightier matters of law; you need to do both. Some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 320, 8, 32, 'people use that as an excuse to say, “Jesus commanded people to tithe.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 320, 9, 32, 'Yes, He did, because they were under the law. But that''s been abolished');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 320, 10, 32, 'in the new covenant. The old covenant has disappeared, so the command to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 320, 11, 32, 'tithe is no longer here today. In the same way, there''s no need to go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 320, 12, 32, 'and show yourself to a priest if you''re healed today. It’s exactly the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 320, 13, 32, 'same thing, because the law is over. This is the main thing that we want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 320, 14, 32, 'to see from this passage.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 320, 15, 32, 'The second thing we want to see is that the Lord always desires');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 320, 16, 32, 'something good for us. When the leper said to Him, “If You are willing,”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 320, 17, 32, 'there was no lack of willingness on Jesus’ part. The Lord immediately');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 320, 18, 32, 'said, “Of course I''m willing” (Matthew 8:3 paraphrase). How does that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 320, 19, 32, 'apply to us? It means that whenever we have a need in our life and we go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 320, 20, 32, 'to the Lord and say, “Lord, are You willing to meet this need?” the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 320, 21, 32, 'says, “Yes, I''m willing.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 320, 22, 32, 'God Always Seeks the Greatest Good for Us in the New Covenant, Even If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 320, 23, 32, 'There Is Suffering');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 320, 24, 32, 'Under the new covenant, we see that there are times when the Lord allows');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 320, 25, 32, 'us to suffer for some greater good. For example, not every sickness is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 320, 26, 32, 'necessarily healed. Even the Apostle Paul''s thorn in the flesh was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 320, 27, 32, 'healed (2 Corinthians 12:7-10), and Timothy''s stomach infirmities were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 320, 28, 32, 'not healed (1 Timothy 5:23), because some greater good, which was more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 321, 1, 32, 'important than the healing, was what the Lord wanted to accomplish in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 321, 2, 32, 'their lives. That happens even today. It’s just like martyrdom under the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 321, 3, 32, 'old covenant. We read that when Daniel was thrown into a den of lions,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 321, 4, 32, 'the lions couldn''t touch him throughout the night. But in the early days');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 321, 5, 32, 'of Christianity (in the Roman amphitheaters) when Christians were thrown');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 321, 6, 32, 'to the lions, the lions ate them up immediately. Daniel and three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 321, 7, 32, 'friends went through the fire untouched. But when Christians were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 321, 8, 32, 'persecuted in the early centuries and burned at the stake, the fire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 321, 9, 32, 'burnt them up. This is because in the new covenant, there is a greater');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 321, 10, 32, 'glory that will come to God through Christians going faithfully through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 321, 11, 32, 'suffering and sickness. There are cases where even in the new covenant,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 321, 12, 32, 'the Apostle Peter, for example, was delivered from prison');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 321, 13, 32, 'supernaturally. Paul was delivered from the Philippian prison');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 321, 14, 32, 'supernaturally, but the same Paul later on, when he was in prison in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 321, 15, 32, 'Rome, was not delivered supernaturally - he had to spend several years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 321, 16, 32, 'in prison.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 321, 17, 32, 'God''s ways are not always the same. He''s always seeking to accomplish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 321, 18, 32, 'His purpose for the greater good of us, and of those whom He wants to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 321, 19, 32, 'reach through us. For example, in the Philippian jail, the reason why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 321, 20, 32, 'Paul was delivered supernaturally was because the jailer had to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 321, 21, 32, 'converted. In the Roman jail, he was not delivered supernaturally,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 321, 22, 32, 'because he had to be the witness to the Roman guards so that they would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 321, 23, 32, 'be converted. God''s ways are always for His greater glory, and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 321, 24, 32, 'greater good of humanity, and it''s not always for our own comfort. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 321, 25, 32, 'need to keep that in mind and not say, “Well, Jesus healed everybody who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 321, 26, 32, 'came to Him, therefore everybody will be healed today.” That''s actually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 321, 27, 32, 'not true. Anyone who gives people that impression is not speaking the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 321, 28, 32, 'truth. That''s often taken as an example, but we need to understand all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 322, 1, 32, 'that Jesus taught.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 322, 2, 32, 'The Centurion’s Humility and Faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 322, 3, 32, 'Another case of healing is when Jesus entered Capernaum and a Centurion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 322, 4, 32, 'came to Him and said, “Lord, my servant is lying paralyzed at home,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 322, 5, 32, 'suffering great pain” (Matthew 8:5-6). Jesus told him that He would come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 322, 6, 32, 'and heal him. Something wonderful that we see about the Centurion is his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 322, 7, 32, 'humility. Remember, he was a Roman military man who was in charge of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 322, 8, 32, 'around one hundred (a Centurion has perhaps a hundred) soldiers under');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 322, 9, 32, 'him. This was a man who was used to exercising authority, and yet we see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 322, 10, 32, 'his humility in being willing to travel all the way from wherever he was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 322, 11, 32, 'going to meet Jesus, just to tell him about his servant who was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 322, 12, 32, 'paralyzed and lying at home.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 322, 13, 32, 'For a military captain to be interested in a slave working in his home');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 322, 14, 32, '(this was probably a Jewish slave) is an amazing thing! You see his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 322, 15, 32, 'humility. That''s the first thing we need to see, and we see his humility');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 322, 16, 32, 'further in verse 8, when he replies to Jesus saying, “I''m not worthy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 322, 17, 32, 'Lord that You should come under my roof. But just say the word and my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 322, 18, 32, 'servant would be healed.” Before you see his faith, I want you to see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 322, 19, 32, 'his humility.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 322, 20, 32, 'If Jesus were to say to you or me, “I want to come to your house,” we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 322, 21, 32, 'would say, “Sure Lord, come!” But look what this Centurion says. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 322, 22, 32, 'certainly would have loved for Christ to come to his house, but instead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 322, 23, 32, 'he says, “I''m not worthy. You''re so holy, and I don''t feel that I can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 322, 24, 32, 'really receive You, such a holy Person, into my house” (Matthew 8:8');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 322, 25, 32, 'paraphrase). The reason I mention that is because this demonstrates the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 322, 26, 32, 'great connection between humility and faith. Then you see his faith when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 322, 27, 32, 'he says, “Lord, you just stand here and speak the word and he''ll be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 322, 28, 32, 'healed, because I''m also a man under authority, and when I tell a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 323, 1, 32, 'soldier under me to go, he goes immediately without any delay. Being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 323, 2, 32, 'under authority if somebody tells me to go, I go as well. That''s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 323, 3, 32, 'point. If I tell another soldier to come, he comes while I tell a slave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 323, 4, 32, 'to do this, he does it” (Matthew 8:8-9 paraphrase). There, he was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 323, 5, 32, 'recognizing two things, though he didn''t understand it fully.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 323, 6, 32, 'Military men usually can recognize other military men. There’s something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 323, 7, 32, 'about their bearing (the way a person walks and conducts himself) that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 323, 8, 32, 'indicates a military man. This Roman centurion couldn''t understand it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 323, 9, 32, 'but there was something about Jesus’ bearing that indicated that He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 323, 10, 32, 'a Man subject to some authority. He didn''t know what it was, and that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 323, 11, 32, 'why he says, “I too.” What does that mean? He is saying, “Lord, like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 323, 12, 32, 'You, I''m also a man under authority” (Matthew 8:9). The authority Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 323, 13, 32, 'was under, the Roman centurion couldn’t recognize. He didn''t know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 323, 14, 32, 'anything about the Trinity, or the Father, or any such thing. But he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 323, 15, 32, 'recognized this is a Man Who didn’t seem to be doing whatever He felt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 323, 16, 32, 'like doing. He seemed to be a Man Who was guided by somebody else. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 323, 17, 32, 'amazing that he recognized that! That''s why he said, “I also am a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 323, 18, 32, 'under authority.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 323, 19, 32, 'The other thing he recognized was that when a man is under authority, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 323, 20, 32, 'has authority over other things or people. He had obviously heard about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 323, 21, 32, 'Jesus healing the sick, and he recognized that it was because Christ was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 323, 22, 32, 'under authority that He had authority over sickness. He knew that with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 323, 23, 32, 'that type of supernatural authority from heaven, you don''t have to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 323, 24, 32, 'actually physically present near the sick person. The sick person could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 323, 25, 32, 'be many kilometers away, and you could just speak the word and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 323, 26, 32, 'person will be healed. It is remarkable faith!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 323, 27, 32, 'In many cases, people brought the sick child or man right up to Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 323, 28, 32, 'for Him to touch, but this is an amazing case where this man didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 324, 1, 32, 'bring his sick servant. He probably could have brought him in a chariot,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 324, 2, 32, 'but he didn''t. He said, “You don’t have to come to my house, (maybe five');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 324, 3, 32, 'kilometers away) but if You speak the word here, I know my servant will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 324, 4, 32, 'be healed.” He said, “Therefore, I ask you to do it.” When Jesus heard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 324, 5, 32, 'this, it says He marveled.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 324, 6, 32, 'The Importance of Faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 324, 7, 32, 'There are only two places in Scripture where it says Jesus marveled. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 324, 8, 32, 'is very interesting to see that. It says He marveled when he saw faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 324, 9, 32, 'like this! Imagine doing something to make Jesus Christ Himself marvel!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 324, 10, 32, 'The other example is in Mark, where we see that He marveled at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 324, 11, 32, 'unbelief of those in His hometown (Mark 6:6). These are the only two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 324, 12, 32, 'places in Scripture where we read about Jesus being surprised, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 324, 13, 32, 'wondering. One is a case where He saw amazing faith, and the other where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 324, 14, 32, 'He saw amazing unbelief. Faith meant so much to the Lord. He was always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 324, 15, 32, 'excited whenever He saw people who had faith, and terribly disappointed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 324, 16, 32, 'when He saw people with unbelief.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 324, 17, 32, 'He marveled and said, “Truly, I say to you, I''ve not found such great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 324, 18, 32, 'faith with anyone in Israel” (Matthew 8:10). He''s comparing a Roman');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 324, 19, 32, 'military man, who never read the Bible, who doesn''t know anything about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 324, 20, 32, 'Moses or the prophets or any such thing, with all of Israel. This was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 324, 21, 32, 'including the great scholars who had studied the Scriptures and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 324, 22, 32, 'regarding this man, He said, “I found more faith in this man, who hardly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 324, 23, 32, 'knows anything about Scripture, than all the rest of you who have read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 324, 24, 32, 'the Bible for so many years!”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 324, 25, 32, 'The Danger of Being Cast Out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 324, 26, 32, 'I wonder if that can be true even today. Does Jesus have to rebuke us,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 324, 27, 32, 'Christians who read the Bible so much, and study the Bible so much, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 324, 28, 32, 'we don''t have the faith that sometimes even a non-Christian may have in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 325, 1, 32, 'what God can do? In so many situations, even today, there are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 325, 2, 32, 'non-Christians who believe God will help them, and many Christians who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 325, 3, 32, 'get into a panic, and are anxious and fearful. I say to you, there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 325, 4, 32, 'more faith in those people than you who know the Scriptures. And the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 325, 5, 32, 'Lord goes on to say, “I say to you, that many from the east and west');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 325, 6, 32, 'will sit at table with Abraham, and Isaac, and Jacob in the kingdom of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 325, 7, 32, 'heaven, and those sons of the kingdom will be cast out into outer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 325, 8, 32, 'darkness, the place where there will be weeping and gnashing of teeth”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 325, 9, 32, '(Matthew 8:11-12).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 325, 10, 32, 'We must take seriously what Jesus said, that the sons of the kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 325, 11, 32, 'will be cast out (Matthew 8:12). There are some people who feel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 325, 12, 32, 'Christians (sons of the kingdom) can never be cast out. They will always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 325, 13, 32, 'be in the kingdom. But consider what Jesus said - that the sons of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 325, 14, 32, 'kingdom will be cast out into outer darkness. Why are they cast out? In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 325, 15, 32, 'this context, it’s because they don''t have faith, whereas the one who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 325, 16, 32, 'has faith (who is not one of the sons of the kingdom, who comes from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 325, 17, 32, 'east and west) is going to sit with Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob (who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 325, 18, 32, 'the sons of the kingdom) in the kingdom of heaven, while the others will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 325, 19, 32, 'be out where they will be weeping and gnashing their teeth. He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 325, 20, 32, 'speaking about hell. It is very important to understand this. Very often');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 325, 21, 32, 'we think that just because we know so much of the Bible and we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 325, 22, 32, 'understand so much truth intellectually, that Lord must be very happy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 325, 23, 32, 'with us, and accepts us without any reservation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 325, 24, 32, 'But that''s not what He looks for. We see in the Roman centurion three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 325, 25, 32, 'very important characteristics that Jesus looks for and appreciates:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 325, 26, 32, 'first is humility, the second is faith, and the third is a concern for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 325, 27, 32, 'the poor. This military man had a concern for a poor slave, he was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 325, 28, 32, 'humble person who did not feel that Christ was worthy to come under his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 326, 1, 32, 'roof, and he had faith to believe that Christ could do anything, even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 326, 2, 32, 'from a distance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 326, 3, 32, 'When we apply that to ourselves today, we can have the same qualities if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 326, 4, 32, 'we want. This is what Jesus appreciated. He appreciates it even today,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 326, 5, 32, 'whenever He sees people who have a concern for those who are the outcast');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 326, 6, 32, 'of society, those who are on the fringes of the society, those who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 326, 7, 32, 'poor and weak, like this military man had. Those who have the humility');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 326, 8, 32, 'to recognize that they are nothing in His presence, those whose faces');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 326, 9, 32, 'are in the dust before the Lord, and those who have the faith that it’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 326, 10, 32, 'not only from five kilometers away, but from millions of kilometers up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 326, 11, 32, 'in heaven that Christ can speak the word today!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 326, 12, 32, 'Jesus said to the Centurion, “Go your way, let it be done to you as you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 326, 13, 32, 'have believed” (Matthew 8:13), and the servant was healed that very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 326, 14, 32, 'hour. We see something else in this story, which we hardly ever find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 326, 15, 32, '(almost never) in the Old Testament; we see it right from the beginning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 326, 16, 32, 'of the New Testament: how much Jesus appreciated faith. You see that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 326, 17, 32, 'right through His entire ministry. Wherever He saw faith, He appreciated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 326, 18, 32, 'it tremendously. Salvation is by faith. Everything we receive from God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 326, 19, 32, 'is on the basis of faith. The words that Jesus spoke to the Centurion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 326, 20, 32, '“Let it be done as you have believed,” He spoke to more than just one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 326, 21, 32, 'person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 326, 22, 32, 'What did Jesus teach regarding this? Very often we have a wrong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 326, 23, 32, 'understanding. It’s not “as you have earnestly desired” that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 326, 24, 32, 'receive, and it’s not “as God has earnestly desired for you.” Sometimes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 326, 25, 32, 'we think, “I earnestly desire this.” It could be anything. Well, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 326, 26, 32, 'don''t receive according to your desire. God earnestly desires many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 326, 27, 32, 'things for us, but we don''t get them, because the law is “not according');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 326, 28, 32, 'to your earnest desire,” or “according to God''s earnest desire.” The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 327, 1, 32, 'principle is according to how much you have believed for. Let it be done');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 327, 2, 32, 'for you as you have believed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 327, 3, 32, 'We receive according to the measure of our faith, and that is why we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 327, 4, 32, 'find that some people receive much, and some people receive very little.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 327, 5, 32, 'It''s like if the rain is falling heavily outside, and one person puts a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 327, 6, 32, 'cup outside, another person puts a bucket, and a third person puts a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 327, 7, 32, 'huge tub. They''re going to get different quantities of water. It’s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 327, 8, 32, 'because God is partial to one; not at all. The same rain is falling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 327, 9, 32, 'everywhere, but the size of the vessel is different, and that determines');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 327, 10, 32, 'how much each person gets. It''s exactly the same in the Christian life:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 327, 11, 32, 'if you find a difference between one Christian and another, then it’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 327, 12, 32, 'because there''s a difference in their faith. According to their faith,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 327, 13, 32, 'they have received.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 327, 14, 32, 'That being said, our faith (I want to mention this also) must be based');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 327, 15, 32, 'on the word of Jesus. Jesus had spoken this word to Him, and the Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 327, 16, 32, 'says that faith comes by hearing, and hearing by the word of Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 327, 17, 32, '(Romans 10:17). It''s not that I just try and work up faith in my heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 327, 18, 32, 'for anything I want. This is the foolishness that is found in so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 327, 19, 32, 'Christians. They desire and covet so many earthly things, and they try');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 327, 20, 32, 'to imagine that their working up faith to believe God to get that thing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 327, 21, 32, 'That''s not correct. Romans 10:17 is clear: faith can only be based on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 327, 22, 32, 'hearing the Word of Christ. We must have a very definite promise to have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 327, 23, 32, 'confidence that we will receive what we have faith for.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 327, 24, 32, 'Abraham did not have a son at the age of 100 simply because he worked up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 327, 25, 32, 'faith for it. God had specifically told him that he would have a son,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 327, 26, 32, 'and it was only then that he could have faith. Faith is always based on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 327, 27, 32, 'the word of God. Here also, it''s the same principle. It’s according to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 327, 28, 32, 'what you believe, and that faith must be based on the Word of Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 328, 1, 32, 'This faith is coupled with humility. If we don''t have humility, then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 328, 2, 32, 'it''s very difficult to have faith. There is a close connection between');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 328, 3, 32, 'the two. It’s not only here, but in a number of places we see this. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 328, 4, 32, 'see this in the case of another woman, who was a Canaanite woman. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 328, 5, 32, 'tries to test her by saying, “We can’t give the children''s bread to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 328, 6, 32, 'dogs” (Matthew 15:26) and she willingly took that position. ”Ok Lord, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 328, 7, 32, 'may be like a dog, but can’t I get the crumbs that fall from the table?”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 328, 8, 32, 'and she received according to her faith. It was humility again, to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 328, 9, 32, 'willing to take the place of a dog at the foot of the table and say, “I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 328, 10, 32, 'don''t deserve the bread, give me the crumbs.” Her faith was great. These');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 328, 11, 32, 'examples of great faith and humility were two non-Jewish people. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 328, 12, 32, 'appreciated their faith. We can learn from the example of this Roman');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 328, 13, 32, 'centurion practical principles that can help us in our daily Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 328, 14, 32, 'walk.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 328, 15, 33, 'Chapter 32 How God Answers Prayers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 328, 16, 33, 'In Matthew 8:14, Jesus goes to Peter’s home and finds his mother-in-law');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 328, 17, 33, 'lying sick in bed with a fever. He touches her hand, the fever leaves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 328, 18, 33, 'her, and she rises to wait on Him. It is a beautiful picture of what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 328, 19, 33, 'should happen when the Lord touches us. Apply this to your own life. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 328, 20, 33, 'are sick with sin, and Jesus comes by, touches us, and raises us up,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 328, 21, 33, 'delivering us from it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 328, 22, 33, 'And as soon as Peter’s mother-in-law got up, she didn’t wait; she');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 328, 23, 33, 'immediately started serving Jesus. It’s a beautiful picture of how it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 328, 24, 33, 'should be whenever the Lord touches us and raises us up from our sin or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 328, 25, 33, 'our problems.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 328, 26, 33, 'By the time evening came, news had gotten around that Jesus had come and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 328, 27, 33, 'had healed Peter’s mother-in-law as soon as He had arrived. Many were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 328, 28, 33, 'then brought to him who were demon possessed, and He cast out the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 329, 1, 33, 'spirits with a word. He healed all who were ill, in order that what was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 329, 2, 33, 'spoken through Isaiah the prophet might be fulfilled, “He Himself took');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 329, 3, 33, 'our infirmities and carried away our diseases” (Matthew 8:16-17).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 329, 4, 33, 'How Jesus Healed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 329, 5, 33, 'We can learn much here about what Jesus taught, not only by His words,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 329, 6, 33, 'but by His life. It says that they brought many to Him. If you look at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 329, 7, 33, 'the parallel passage of this incident in Luke''s Gospel and compare');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 329, 8, 33, 'Scripture with Scripture, you learn something that is not mentioned in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 329, 9, 33, 'Matthew. We read in Luke 4:40 that He laid His hands on every single one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 329, 10, 33, 'of them. There were many people brought who were demon-possessed or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 329, 11, 33, 'sick, but we read that Jesus did not say a mass prayer to heal all of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 329, 12, 33, 'them at once. Instead, He laid hands on each one individually. He wanted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 329, 13, 33, 'each person to feel that God was interested in them personally, and so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 329, 14, 33, 'He gave each a personal touch.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 329, 15, 33, 'We also notice that Jesus did not heal only 1% of those who came to Him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 329, 16, 33, 'as we see so often today with those who claim to imitate His healing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 329, 17, 33, 'ministry. Instead, every single one was healed. He healed all of them;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 329, 18, 33, 'every single person who was sick was healed. This was the ministry that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 329, 19, 33, 'Jesus accomplished.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 329, 20, 33, 'Be Honest About Your Measure of Faith and Gifts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 329, 21, 33, 'Why is it that we don''t see the same type of ministry today? It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 329, 22, 33, 'because Jesus had total faith, and we do not. We must be humble enough');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 329, 23, 33, 'to acknowledge the difference.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 329, 24, 33, 'Once, there was a family who called me to come and pray for their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 329, 25, 33, 'daughter who was sick. I don''t have a healing gift, but in James 5, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 329, 26, 33, 'read that when someone is sick, they should call an elder to pray for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 329, 27, 33, 'them and anoint them with oil. The prayer of faith will save the sick.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 329, 28, 33, 'Therefore, I went, not as one who had a gift of healing, but as an elder');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 330, 1, 33, 'obeying the command in James. When I went there, I saw this 16-year-old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 330, 2, 33, 'girl curled up in the bed, and they told me she had suffered a head');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 330, 3, 33, 'injury at birth and had never walked, or talked, or done anything. For');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 330, 4, 33, 'sixteen years, she had been curled up like that and had to be fed,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 330, 5, 33, 'clothed, and more because she could not do anything herself. Then I had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 330, 6, 33, 'to tell them—“I don''t have the faith to make this girl get up and walk,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 330, 7, 33, 'I might as well be honest with you.” I told them that I could pray for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 330, 8, 33, 'God to give them grace to look after this child, but that I didn’t want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 330, 9, 33, 'to deceive them into thinking that as soon as I prayed for her, she');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 330, 10, 33, 'would get up and walk for the first time in her sixteen years.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 330, 11, 33, 'We must be honest and humble about the measure of our gift and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 330, 12, 33, 'measure of our faith. I told them that if Jesus Himself had been there,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 330, 13, 33, 'He would have made her walk immediately. What is the difference? Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 330, 14, 33, 'had complete faith that there was no sin in His life. So much of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 330, 15, 33, 'problem is that our mind and heart are polluted by sin. There are so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 330, 16, 33, 'many things in us that make us unclean. It could be selfishness, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 330, 17, 33, 'could be pride, it could be an attachment to this material world, which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 330, 18, 33, 'Jesus was so completely detached from. He walked on earth as One Who was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 330, 19, 33, 'totally heavenly, and as a result, His word had authority.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 330, 20, 33, 'Distinguishing Between Jesus’ Life and His Ministry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 330, 21, 33, 'We need to humble ourselves and acknowledge that we cannot do all that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 330, 22, 33, 'Jesus did. Yet, we can certainly live the way He taught us to live,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 330, 23, 33, 'because He gives us the provision for it. In other words, we can follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 330, 24, 33, 'Him in His life, but not necessarily in His ministry. We need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 330, 25, 33, 'distinguish between the two. When Jesus said that we should follow Him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 330, 26, 33, 'He meant that we should follow the example He set in His personal life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 330, 27, 33, 'In the same way, Paul wrote, “Be imitators of me, just as I also am of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 330, 28, 33, 'Christ” (1 Corinthians 11:1), and “Brethren, join in following my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 331, 1, 33, 'example, and observe those who walk according to the pattern you have in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 331, 2, 33, 'us” (Philippians 3:17). He did not mean that we should seek to have his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 331, 3, 33, 'ministry, but to live like he did.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 331, 4, 33, 'In this life, we are to walk as Jesus walked, but we cannot serve with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 331, 5, 33, 'all of the gifts that He had. He had all of the gifts, but today the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 331, 6, 33, 'Body of Christ is much larger than any one person. In Him, there was the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 331, 7, 33, 'complete body of Christ housed in one Person. Now, the gifts are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 331, 8, 33, 'distributed, and so, no one should feel condemned if he prays for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 331, 9, 33, 'someone and they are not healed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 331, 10, 33, 'Our aim is still to walk as Jesus walked, so we need to distinguish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 331, 11, 33, 'between His life and His ministry. It is clear that we cannot follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 331, 12, 33, 'Jesus in His ministry. He died for the sins of the world—can we follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 331, 13, 33, 'Him in that ministry? Obviously not! And we can’t follow Him in any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 331, 14, 33, 'other ministry either—not even in healing all the sick. We might as well');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 331, 15, 33, 'acknowledge this limitation, because a lot of Christians are being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 331, 16, 33, 'deceived when they are told that we can do everything that Jesus did in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 331, 17, 33, 'His life. Yes, we can overcome sin as He did, but we can’t perform His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 331, 18, 33, 'ministry. That''s the honest truth, and anyone who says otherwise is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 331, 19, 33, 'actually trying to deceive you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 331, 20, 33, 'Clarifying Isaiah’s Prophecy Concerning Christ’s Ministry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 331, 21, 33, 'After Jesus healed Peter’s mother-in-law and the crowds who were sick,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 331, 22, 33, 'we read in Matthew 8:17 that a prophecy of Isaiah was fulfilled, “HE');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 331, 23, 33, 'HIMSELF TOOK OUR INFIRMITIES AND CARRIED AWAY OUR DISEASES.” It comes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 331, 24, 33, 'from Isaiah 53, and it is often misquoted and misused by preachers. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 331, 25, 33, 'say that Jesus took away our infirmities and carried away our diseases');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 331, 26, 33, 'on the cross. But He did no such thing. We read in Matthew that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 331, 27, 33, 'prophecy from Isaiah was fulfilled when Jesus healed the sick in His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 331, 28, 33, 'earthly ministry, years before He went to Calvary.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 332, 1, 33, 'There are a number of verses in Isaiah 53 that do relate to the cross,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 332, 2, 33, 'but there are also others that do not. Let us examine these verses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 332, 3, 33, 'carefully so that we can understand the truth and not fall into bondage');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 332, 4, 33, 'by believing a false teaching—the truth will set us free.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 332, 5, 33, 'In Isaiah 53:2, we read that Jesus grew up before Him like a tender');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 332, 6, 33, 'shoot. That was not on the cross; that was in Nazareth. And in verse 3,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 332, 7, 33, 'He was despised and forsaken by men. That was throughout His life; it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 332, 8, 33, 'was not on the cross. He was a man of sorrows, acquainted with grief,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 332, 9, 33, 'and throughout His life men hid their faces. He was despised, and we did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 332, 10, 33, 'not esteem Him. Isaiah also prophesied that He was to be oppressed and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 332, 11, 33, 'afflicted, yet He would not open His mouth (v4). This did not occur on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 332, 12, 33, 'the cross, but when He was being tried in court. Therefore, all of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 332, 13, 33, 'Isaiah 53 does not relate to the cross. Some of it is relates to other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 332, 14, 33, 'periods of His life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 332, 15, 33, 'There is no verse that says that Christ took our sicknesses with Him on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 332, 16, 33, 'the cross, even though it’s a popular belief, particularly in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 332, 17, 33, 'Pentecostal and charismatic circles. Yet, if we look through Scripture,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 332, 18, 33, 'we can’t find it anywhere in the New Testament. It''s amazing how many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 332, 19, 33, 'Christians believe things not written in Scripture, just because they''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 332, 20, 33, 'been brainwashed by some preacher. Let us be careful to read Scripture');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 332, 21, 33, 'exactly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 332, 22, 33, 'Can we still pray for healing? Of course! We can pray for anything that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 332, 23, 33, 'will help us to serve God better. I myself pray for healing every time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 332, 24, 33, 'I''m sick, and I’ve found that many times God has healed me. We won’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 332, 25, 33, 'always have perfect health. And when we’re seventy years-old, we can’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 332, 26, 33, 'expect to have the health of a twenty-five-year-old, and we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 332, 27, 33, 'certainly still ask God for healing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 332, 28, 33, 'Deliverance from Sin - Not Sickness - Is Jesus’ Promise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 333, 1, 33, 'The point is this: I cannot ask God to take away every single sickness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 333, 2, 33, 'in the same way that I can ask Him to take away every single sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 333, 3, 33, 'Scripture clearly teaches that Christ died for our sins, but there is no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 333, 4, 33, 'verse that says Christ died for all our sicknesses. If there were such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 333, 5, 33, 'verse, we would have every right to ask the Lord to take away every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 333, 6, 33, 'single sickness. That includes poor vision—so I wouldn’t be wearing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 333, 7, 33, 'glasses—and hair loss!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 333, 8, 33, 'A lot of Christians don''t love the truth, which is why God allows them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 333, 9, 33, 'to be deceived (2 Thessalonians 2:10-12). I want you to know the truth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 333, 10, 33, 'in this area so that you won’t be fooled. It’s important because suppose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 333, 11, 33, 'you were to tell a non-Christian that Christ can take away all your sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 333, 12, 33, 'and heal all your sicknesses. You have scriptural support for the first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 333, 13, 33, 'statement, but no scriptural support for the second, even though you''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 333, 14, 33, 'heard it preached. Let’s say that this non-Christian, who knows nothing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 333, 15, 33, 'about the Bible, believes you. He asks you what he should do, and you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 333, 16, 33, 'tell him that he should turn from his sin, ask Christ to forgive him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 333, 17, 33, 'and receive Him as Savior. After he does all that, you tell him that on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 333, 18, 33, 'the basis of the God''s Word, his sins are blotted out. And it’s true. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 333, 19, 33, 'read in 1 John 1:9 “If we confess our sins, He is faithful and righteous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 333, 20, 33, 'to forgive us our sins and to cleanse us from all unrighteousness.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 333, 21, 33, 'Everything you have told him so far about the forgiveness of sins is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 333, 22, 33, 'grounded in Scripture.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 333, 23, 33, 'But what if you go on to say, Christ has also died for your sicknesses?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 333, 24, 33, 'Perhaps he has some serious sickness, tuberculosis or cancer, and you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 333, 25, 33, 'tell him to pray for healing in the same way he prayed about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 333, 26, 33, 'forgiveness. Then, he prays and tells God that he has the same faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 333, 27, 33, 'that God will take away his sickness as he has that Christ took away his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 333, 28, 33, 'sins. You had already told him that sin is a greater problem than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 334, 1, 33, 'sickness, and he thinks to himself that if Jesus could take care of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 334, 2, 33, 'bigger problem, surely, He can take care of the smaller one.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 334, 3, 33, 'He leaves believing you when you said his sins were forgiven and also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 334, 4, 33, 'believing you when you said that his sicknesses were healed. Yet, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 334, 5, 33, 'might go to the doctor a week later and hear that his cancer is worse.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 334, 6, 33, 'What is he going to think about your gospel then? He''s going to say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 334, 7, 33, '“This Christian fooled me! He said that Christ has taken away my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 334, 8, 33, 'sickness, but He hasn''t!” Then the new believer might think that perhaps');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 334, 9, 33, 'Jesus hasn''t even taken away his sin, because He could not take away the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 334, 10, 33, 'smaller problem of sickness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 334, 11, 33, 'You can now see how this type of preaching, which mis-quotes Scripture,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 334, 12, 33, 'confuses people. It is this type of deception that I want to deliver you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 334, 13, 33, 'from, and you should spread this message to others. Don''t try to have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 334, 14, 33, 'faith for something that Scripture has not promised. Look for God’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 334, 15, 33, 'promises in Scripture, and when you find them, see if they apply to you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 334, 16, 33, 'Is this something Jesus accomplished on the cross? In this case, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 334, 17, 33, 'prophecy in Isaiah that He Himself took away all our infirmities and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 334, 18, 33, 'carried away our diseases, was fulfilled before the cross, when Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 334, 19, 33, 'was physically on earth healing some people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 334, 20, 33, 'Why God Doesn’t Grant Some Requests');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 334, 21, 33, 'In Philippians 4:19, Paul writes, “And my God will supply all your needs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 334, 22, 33, 'according to His riches in glory in Christ Jesus.” That’s a specific');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 334, 23, 33, 'promise. He doesn’t say that God will give me all that I want; he says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 334, 24, 33, 'that his God will supply all that I need. There are many things that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 334, 25, 33, 'think we need, but God knows otherwise. It’s just like how little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 334, 26, 33, 'children come to their father, telling him about their “needs,” when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 334, 27, 33, 'they’re really only asking for things they want.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 334, 28, 33, 'A good father doesn’t give his children everything they ask. Only a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 335, 1, 33, 'foolish father would do that. Sometimes, we give our children painful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 335, 2, 33, 'experiences like an injection or surgery. It is extremely painful, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 335, 3, 33, 'necessary for them. They don''t want it, but they need it. That''s how a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 335, 4, 33, 'good father is. The child might not understand why they need to go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 335, 5, 33, 'through the surgery or take the painful injection, but still the parent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 335, 6, 33, 'says that they need it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 335, 7, 33, 'God is like that. He''s a loving Father, and we are His children. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 335, 8, 33, 'don''t always know what''s good for us. Even so, God has promised to give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 335, 9, 33, 'us everything we need. If He sees that I need healing because it will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 335, 10, 33, 'further His purposes and is for my greater good, He will always heal me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 335, 11, 33, 'However, where He sees it is not necessary, He may not.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 335, 12, 33, 'I have discovered that God allows me to go through certain difficulties');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 335, 13, 33, 'here on earth so that I can understand the difficulties that other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 335, 14, 33, 'people are going through. If by prayer we could escape every problem,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 335, 15, 33, 'every difficulty, every sickness, and every trial, it would be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 335, 16, 33, 'incredibly difficult for us to have compassion on those who must go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 335, 17, 33, 'through such things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 335, 18, 33, 'Some years ago, when I was just in my late twenties, I was in the middle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 335, 19, 33, 'of a conference, speaking to young people, and I had to go change my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 335, 20, 33, 'train ticket. It required that I go to the railway station, and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 335, 21, 33, 'prayed, asking God to make sure the queue there was short so that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 335, 22, 33, 'wouldn’t have to waste much time there. And when I arrived, the queue');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 335, 23, 33, 'was so long it went outside the station. I ended up having to stand in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 335, 24, 33, 'the sun for quite a while before reaching the counter to change my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 335, 25, 33, 'ticket. When I came back, I asked the Lord why He hadn’t answered my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 335, 26, 33, 'prayer. And I got a word from Him that I''ve never forgotten. He told me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 335, 27, 33, 'that if He were to deliver me from all the problems that my fellow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 335, 28, 33, 'countrymen face, then I would never be able to empathize with them, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 336, 1, 33, 'would never be able to understand what they go through. He said that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 336, 2, 33, 'there would be many prayers of mine that He would answer, but there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 336, 3, 33, 'would be some that He would not, because He wanted me to experience what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 336, 4, 33, 'others went through, so that in the midst of those sufferings or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 336, 5, 33, 'difficulties, I still know how to trust Him and thank Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 336, 6, 33, 'It’s a lesson I’ve never forgotten. When I travel in crowded trains and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 336, 7, 33, 'face other difficulties common here in India I say, “Lord, thank You. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 336, 8, 33, 'understand what other people are going through, and therefore I can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 336, 9, 33, 'sympathize with them.” Remember that if God hasn’t healed your sickness,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 336, 10, 33, 'or if He hasn’t solved some other physical problem, it''s because He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 336, 11, 33, 'wants you to understand what other people in your country are going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 336, 12, 33, 'through, so that you can be more sympathetic in how you minister to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 336, 13, 33, 'them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 336, 14, 33, 'When it comes to sin, the word of God is clear, absolutely clear: every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 336, 15, 33, 'sin that you confess will be immediately forgiven; there''s no delay.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 336, 16, 33, 'When you pray for a sickness, the Lord might take some time to heal you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 336, 17, 33, 'However, when it comes to sin, forgiveness for past sins is immediate.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 336, 18, 33, 'And when it comes to overcoming sin, Romans 6:14 plainly tells us that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 336, 19, 33, 'sin will not rule over us, and we can claim that promise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 336, 20, 33, 'God Answers Every Prayer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 336, 21, 33, 'When we pray, there are some requests that God will grant immediately,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 336, 22, 33, 'some that He might perform slowly, and some that He might not do at all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 336, 23, 33, 'It can be confusing, and we might wonder whether God actually answers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 336, 24, 33, 'prayer. God answers every prayer, but not in the way we might expect. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 336, 25, 33, 'find His answers to be similar to the traffic lights we see at a traffic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 336, 26, 33, 'intersection. Sometimes the light is red, and that’s God saying no. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 336, 27, 33, 'is an answer, but the answer is “No.” Other times, the light is orange');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 336, 28, 33, 'or yellow, and then God is saying, “Wait. Not yet. I''ll give it to you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 337, 1, 33, 'when the time is right.” Then there are times when the light is green');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 337, 2, 33, 'and God gives to us right away. God answers every prayer, and His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 337, 3, 33, 'traffic lights are always working. Don''t think that He didn’t answer you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 337, 4, 33, 'when the answer is no. He did answer; it was just a “no.” If my little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 337, 5, 33, 'son came to me asking me for something, and I told him that I couldn’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 337, 6, 33, 'give it to him, he wouldn’t be able to say that I didn’t give him an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 337, 7, 33, 'answer, because I did. The answer was “No.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 337, 8, 33, 'Remember this: God answers every prayer. Sometimes the answer is, “Yes.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 337, 9, 33, 'Sometimes the answer is, “Wait.” And sometimes the answer is, “No.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 337, 10, 33, 'When it comes to sin, God’s answer is always, “Yes.” It’s always the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 337, 11, 33, 'same because Christ came to the world to save us from sin. I must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 337, 12, 33, 'emphasize the distinction between what Christ came for and what Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 337, 13, 33, 'does. He blesses us in many ways. Some of these blessings are promised');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 337, 14, 33, 'to us, and some are a matter of His goodness, for God is a good God. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 337, 15, 33, 'makes the sun rise on the evil and on the good, and He makes the rain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 337, 16, 33, 'fall on the just and the unjust (Matthew 5:45). God does many things for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 337, 17, 33, 'unbelievers and even might answer their prayers. For example, Cornelius');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 337, 18, 33, 'was a totally unconverted military man, yet we read that God heard his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 337, 19, 33, 'prayers (Acts 10:31). God may grant many requests, but from Scripture we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 337, 20, 33, 'know without a doubt that when it comes to the forgiveness of sins or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 337, 21, 33, 'becoming a child of God, His answer is an immediate, “Yes!”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 337, 22, 33, 'I want to make sure there is no confusion about any of this. If we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 337, 23, 33, 'equate sickness with sin, as many Christians do, we’ll be confused about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 337, 24, 33, 'why our prayers for healing are not always answered. It’s not to say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 337, 25, 33, 'that we shouldn’t pray for healing or material things. Many people pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 337, 26, 33, 'for houses, land, cars—all types of things. And we can certainly ask for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 337, 27, 33, 'them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 337, 28, 33, 'I always say that you can ask God for anything, absolutely anything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 338, 1, 33, 'under the sun, provided that you conclude your prayer saying, “But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 338, 2, 33, 'Father, not as I will, but as Thou will.” If you can conclude your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 338, 3, 33, 'prayer with that sentence, then you can ask for anything. Some things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 338, 4, 33, 'are not God''s will. What we think is good for us might not be. Freedom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 338, 5, 33, 'from sin and forgiveness of sin are always good for us. God will grant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 338, 6, 33, 'those requests 100% of the time. But oftentimes, what we think is good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 338, 7, 33, 'for us may not be what is best for us, and God will deny those requests');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 338, 8, 33, 'in order to fulfill His best in our lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 338, 9, 34, 'Chapter 33 Having the Right Word for Every Situation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 338, 10, 34, 'When Jesus saw the crowd around Him in Matthew 8:18, He gave orders to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 338, 11, 34, 'depart to the other side, and a certain scribe (‘scribe’ refers to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 338, 12, 34, 'someone who is a scholar of Scripture, who spent years studying the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 338, 13, 34, 'Bible. There were many people like that in those days, like there are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 338, 14, 34, 'Bible college graduates today) came and said to him, “Teacher I will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 338, 15, 34, 'follow You wherever You go.” Jesus said to him, “The foxes have holes,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 338, 16, 34, 'and the birds of the air have nests, but the Son of Man has nowhere to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 338, 17, 34, 'lay His head.” He immediately told him the price he would have to pay if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 338, 18, 34, 'he was to follow Christ. Jesus never hid from people the price of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 338, 19, 34, 'physical inconvenience or physical loss that they would suffer if they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 338, 20, 34, 'were going to follow Him. A lot of people today try to hide that, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 338, 21, 34, 'not Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 338, 22, 34, 'Different Sicknesses Call for Different Treatment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 338, 23, 34, 'Right at the outset, for example, He told a rich young ruler, “If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 338, 24, 34, 'want to follow Me, you have to give up all your money.” He didn''t say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 338, 25, 34, 'that to everybody, but in that rich young ruler’s case, his love of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 338, 26, 34, 'money was so deep-rooted, like a cancer where the whole organ has to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 338, 27, 34, 'removed, that he needed such radical surgery. In the case of a man like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 338, 28, 34, 'Zacchaeus, the Lord accepted him when he said that he would give half of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 339, 1, 34, 'his goods to the poor. In the case Lazarus, Mary, and Martha, the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 339, 2, 34, 'did not ask for anything. Spiritual cancer has progressed to different');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 339, 3, 34, 'degrees in different people. So we find the Lord was willing to tell a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 339, 4, 34, 'person to give everything he had when He sensed some cancer in that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 339, 5, 34, 'person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 339, 6, 34, 'The Lord had such tremendous discernment, that He spoke to people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 339, 7, 34, 'exactly according to their needs. That''s one thing that happens when we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 339, 8, 34, 'walk with God for many years. This is part of prophetic speaking.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 339, 9, 34, 'Prophetic ministry is not only in the pulpit. Prophetic ministry is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 339, 10, 34, 'ordinary conversation as well, where you discern (by God-given');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 339, 11, 34, 'discernment) a person''s need, and God gives you exactly the right word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 339, 12, 34, 'which that person needs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 339, 13, 34, 'When the Lord said this, it was not a standard reply that He gave to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 339, 14, 34, 'everyone. He didn''t tell this man to “Go and sell all that you have, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 339, 15, 34, 'give to the poor.” That He said to another person. To this person, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 339, 16, 34, 'says, “Foxes have holes and the birds of the air have nests.” Scribes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 339, 17, 34, 'tend to just quote standard Scriptures. They''ve been taught in seminary,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 339, 18, 34, '“for this problem, quote this Scripture,” “for that problem, quote that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 339, 19, 34, 'Scripture,” and so their ministry to people is based on academic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 339, 20, 34, 'understanding of the Bible, just like some people are employed by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 339, 21, 34, 'computer companies to answer customers over the phone: the customer asks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 339, 22, 34, 'about a problem, and the employee looks up that particular problem on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 339, 23, 34, 'the computer. They enter that into the computer, get a reply on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 339, 24, 34, 'computer, and then read that answer to the customer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 339, 25, 34, 'We Need Anointing to Have the Right Word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 339, 26, 34, 'This is not how we''re supposed to do ministry. Ministry is to be done by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 339, 27, 34, 'supernatural discernment. That''s why we need the anointing of the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 339, 28, 34, 'Spirit to have exactly the right word, like the Old Testament prophets.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 340, 1, 34, 'When they were anointed by the Holy Spirit, they had exactly the right');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 340, 2, 34, 'word for each person who came to them. Ministry is a very costly affair.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 340, 3, 34, 'It''s not something you can do just by studying the Bible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 340, 4, 34, 'You have to walk with God. When you walk with God, that fellowship with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 340, 5, 34, 'God will give you the right word for each occasion, and that''s why you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 340, 6, 34, 'find Jesus always said different things to different people. For');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 340, 7, 34, 'example, when there were Pharisees who wanted to stone a woman caught in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 340, 8, 34, 'adultery, Jesus didn''t give them a big lecture on legalism. He didn’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 340, 9, 34, 'give them a big lecture on compassion. He sought the Father, He waited');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 340, 10, 34, 'for a few moments (that''s why He was scribbling on the sand, to be clear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 340, 11, 34, 'in His mind), and as soon as He heard from the Father, He just said one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 340, 12, 34, 'sentence: “He who is without sin among you, let him cast the first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 340, 13, 34, 'stone.” That’s all. And they went away one by one. It wasn''t a sermon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 340, 14, 34, 'that solved the problem. It was one sentence.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 340, 15, 34, 'This is an example of the way we can walk in our ministry as well, if we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 340, 16, 34, 'walk with God. But there''s a price to be paid to have that kind of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 340, 17, 34, 'wisdom and authority. We have to keep a clear conscience, we have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 340, 18, 34, 'walk in humility, we have to be free from the love of money, and we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 340, 19, 34, 'to be totally committed - no area of our life must be free from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 340, 20, 34, 'surrender to the Lord. That’s how Jesus walked.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 340, 21, 34, 'When the scribe came, Jesus discerned something in him, and so He said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 340, 22, 34, '“The foxes have holes, and the birds of the air have nests, but the Son');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 340, 23, 34, 'of Man has nowhere to lay His head.” He discerned that this man was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 340, 24, 34, 'Bible-seminarian-scholar-scribe, and that he thought he could live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 340, 25, 34, 'comfortably while serving the Lord. Jesus said, “No, you may not even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 340, 26, 34, 'have a place to sleep.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 340, 27, 34, 'Beware Deceptive Teaching About Riches');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 340, 28, 34, 'This is an answer to many people who are teaching nowadays that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 341, 1, 34, 'was a very rich person. That type of teaching - which was introduced in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 341, 2, 34, 'the last 25 years or so - was never heard of before in Christendom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 341, 3, 34, 'That''s because we''re now living in a day when a lot of preachers have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 341, 4, 34, 'become fantastically rich through receiving tithes and offerings from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 341, 5, 34, 'their followers. And how do they justify their millions and still say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 341, 6, 34, 'that they are following Jesus? The only way to do it is somehow find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 341, 7, 34, 'Scriptures from here and there to prove that Jesus was a rich Person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 341, 8, 34, 'For example, they say things like, “the Roman soldiers did not tear up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 341, 9, 34, 'His inner garment because it was a branded type of garment that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 341, 10, 34, 'was wearing.” It is ridiculous. Here is a clear proof of how He lived -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 341, 11, 34, '“The Son of Man has nowhere to lay His head.” He didn''t always find a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 341, 12, 34, 'place to sleep. He was not a wealthy man. He was not a person who could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 341, 13, 34, 'go and stay in some five-star inn in those days by spending the money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 341, 14, 34, 'that he collected from the people. He was a very simple Preacher.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 341, 15, 34, 'Jesus Had No Complaints About His Material Circumstances');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 341, 16, 34, 'In John''s Gospel, we read of the great sermon He preached in the temple.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 341, 17, 34, 'On the last day of the feast, He said, “If anyone is thirsty, come to Me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 341, 18, 34, 'and drink. He who believes in Me, from his innermost being will flow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 341, 19, 34, 'rivers of living water” (John 7:37). There were many other words He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 341, 20, 34, 'preached. It was so impressive that the multitudes said in John 7:40,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 341, 21, 34, '“This is certainly the Prophet.” When the Pharisees and others had sent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 341, 22, 34, 'some people to catch him, the officers came back empty-handed in verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 341, 23, 34, '45, and they asked them, “Why didn’t you bring Him?” Even those military');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 341, 24, 34, 'officers who had gone to capture Jesus came back saying, “Never did a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 341, 25, 34, 'man speak the way this man spoke” (John 7:46). They were impressed by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 341, 26, 34, 'the tremendous sermons He preached at that particular occasion in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 341, 27, 34, 'temple. We read at the end of that chapter, ‘After everything was over,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 341, 28, 34, 'everyone went to his own home” (John 7:53). Remember, Jesus is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 342, 1, 34, 'Jerusalem, and His home is more than a hundred kilometers away, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 342, 2, 34, 'Capernaum. “Everyone went to his own home, but Jesus went to the Mount');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 342, 3, 34, 'of Olives” (John 7:53 - 8:1).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 342, 4, 34, 'These two sentences are actually one sentence even though it''s been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 342, 5, 34, 'split by the chapter division there. Have we ever thought of that? A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 342, 6, 34, 'Preacher comes from another town and preaches these powerful messages');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 342, 7, 34, 'that bless everybody, and at the end of the day, nobody asked Him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 342, 8, 34, '“Where are You staying tonight?” They just ignore Him and go home. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 342, 9, 34, 'didn''t have a home in Jerusalem. So what does He do, when everybody''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 342, 10, 34, 'gone and nobody has invited Him to their home? He says, “Well, it''s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 342, 11, 34, 'raining. I can go to sleep under the trees on the Mount of Olives.” He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 342, 12, 34, 'goes to the Mount of Olives and sleeps there under the trees. The Son of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 342, 13, 34, 'Man had nowhere to lay His head. The foxes have holes, and the birds of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 342, 14, 34, 'the air have nests, but Son of Man had nowhere to lay His head.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 342, 15, 34, 'Why didn''t He spend some of that money which Judas Iscariot had in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 342, 16, 34, 'bag at this time, and go and stay in an inn? He wouldn''t do that because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 342, 17, 34, 'a lot of that money that came to Judas Iscariot came from poor widows');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 342, 18, 34, 'who had put in their mites, and He would never think of using those poor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 342, 19, 34, 'widows’ mites to stay in some posh hotel. He would rather stick it out.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 342, 20, 34, 'It''s that type of faithfulness that you see in Jesus. I''m not saying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 342, 21, 34, 'it’s wrong to stay in a hotel. There is a time and a place for that,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 342, 22, 34, 'where it’s needed, but in this particular case, He was led by the Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 342, 23, 34, 'to think, “I shouldn''t use that money. Let Me go and sleep under the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 342, 24, 34, 'trees.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 342, 25, 34, 'The next morning, in John 8:2, He came back again to the temple, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 342, 26, 34, 'people came to Him, and He began to teach them again. The interesting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 342, 27, 34, 'thing I see here is, nobody asked Him, “Lord, where did You sleep last');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 342, 28, 34, 'night, by the way?" No. It’s amazing, the callousness of people. We see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 343, 1, 34, 'that He just continued to teach. He did not have a complaint about it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 343, 2, 34, 'Isn’t it wonderful to follow His example? That people could ignore you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 343, 3, 34, 'even though you are a great invited preacher, and you don’t have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 343, 4, 34, 'complaint against anybody about anything? It''s a wonderful way to live,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 343, 5, 34, 'and I encourage all of you who are preachers of God''s Word - if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 343, 6, 34, 'expect people to do so many things for you and expect so many things,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 343, 7, 34, 'and you''re disappointed when they don''t do it, or if you have a little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 343, 8, 34, 'complaint or a little grumble in your heart - follow Jesus. Be satisfied');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 343, 9, 34, 'with what you have, and don''t expect anything, and then you''ll always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 343, 10, 34, 'rejoice in the Lord. You’ll never have a single murmur of grumbling or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 343, 11, 34, 'complaining in your heart EVER.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 343, 12, 34, 'When Jesus said in Matthew 8:20, “the Son of Man has no place to lay His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 343, 13, 34, 'head,” it was literally true as we just saw in the Gospels (and probably');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 343, 14, 34, 'many other times; we don''t have a full record of His three and a half');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 343, 15, 34, 'years of ministry). What He was telling this man is, “You want to follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 343, 16, 34, 'Me wherever I go? Do you know what it is going to cost you? You won''t be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 343, 17, 34, 'able to exploit poor people and take advantage of their money and live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 343, 18, 34, 'in great style yourself. No, if you want to follow Me, be willing to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 343, 19, 34, 'inconvenienced, be willing to give up some of your comforts, be willing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 343, 20, 34, 'to deny yourself a good bed, deny yourself good food, and many other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 343, 21, 34, 'things like that” (Matthew 8:19).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 343, 22, 34, 'Be Willing to Be Inconvenienced');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 343, 23, 34, 'Next, we read in Matthew 8:21, “Another of the disciples said to Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 343, 24, 34, '(this was a disciple, not a scribe; the first was a scribe) “Lord permit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 343, 25, 34, 'me first to go and bury my father.” I don''t know exactly what was meant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 343, 26, 34, 'by that. It is very difficult to say, because I cannot imagine that, if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 343, 27, 34, 'his father had died and if it was just a matter of going for the funeral');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 343, 28, 34, 'service, Jesus would be so hard-hearted to say, “You can''t even go for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 344, 1, 34, 'the funeral service of your father if you want to follow Me.” I don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 344, 2, 34, 'think it''s exactly that. It is difficult to say. Perhaps (I''m only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 344, 3, 34, 'saying perhaps) it meant, “Let me wait until my dad dies and I bury him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 344, 4, 34, 'then I’ll come and follow You. You know I’ve got certain obligations at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 344, 5, 34, 'home. My dad''s old, and when he dies and I have buried him, I''ll follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 344, 6, 34, 'You.” And the Lord said, “Follow Me now. Allow the dead to bury their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 344, 7, 34, 'own dead.” Whatever the reason for that be, one thing is clear: there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 344, 8, 34, 'are times when the Lord speaks to us and says, “Following Me in My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 344, 9, 34, 'ministry is more important than a social obligation, like burying your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 344, 10, 34, 'father.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 344, 11, 34, 'Sometimes it happens like that. I remember I was in the middle of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 344, 12, 34, 'conference when I heard that my mother was dying. She was in her last');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 344, 13, 34, 'moments. She had been sick for a while, and then I heard she died. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 344, 14, 34, 'sought the Lord about it that morning I said, “Lord, what shall I do?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 344, 15, 34, 'I''m sure that everybody in this conference will understand if I walk');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 344, 16, 34, 'away from it, because I have to go for mother''s funeral, and nobody will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 344, 17, 34, 'object to that.” But the Lord gave this word to me. So I wrote to my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 344, 18, 34, 'brothers, sister and my sons who were there, “I can’t come. You please');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 344, 19, 34, 'take care of it,” and I continued with the conference. I''m not saying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 344, 20, 34, 'that''s a rule. But there are times when God Himself tells you something,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 344, 21, 34, 'and if you''re a disciple, you must be willing for anything. So I didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 344, 22, 34, 'go, and I don''t have any regret. I''m going to see my mother in heaven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 344, 23, 34, 'She was saved and she went to be with the Lord. For me, it’s just like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 344, 24, 34, 'traveling to another country. If I couldn''t be there to send her off,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 344, 25, 34, 'that is fine.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 344, 26, 34, 'Dear brothers and sisters, if you''re going to be a radical disciple of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 344, 27, 34, 'Jesus Christ, if you want to walk as Jesus walked, if you want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 344, 28, 34, 'accomplish what God has planned for you in your one earthly life, I want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 345, 1, 34, 'to tell you that you can’t live by certain social rules. Don''t quote me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 345, 2, 34, 'and make this a law in your life now. I''ve not made it a law for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 345, 3, 34, 'anybody, but you must be willing to be inconvenienced, to sacrifice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 345, 4, 34, 'anything, if you want to follow the Lord. Jesus said, “If you love your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 345, 5, 34, 'father or mother more than Me, you''re not worthy of Me.” This is radical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 345, 6, 34, 'teaching, but that is the type of discipleship that is so lacking in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 345, 7, 34, 'Christendom today. That''s one of the reasons why there is such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 345, 8, 34, 'shallowness in the life of most Christians, and that''s why there are so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 345, 9, 34, 'few Christians in the world today who can say to others, “Follow me as I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 345, 10, 34, 'follow Christ.” The world needs more Christians like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 345, 11, 34, 'Seek the Anointing of the Holy Spirit, Not Rules');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 345, 12, 34, 'Jesus said to him, “Let the dead bury their dead.” Then He got into His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 345, 13, 34, 'boat and the disciples followed Him. Very often Jesus would just say one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 345, 14, 34, 'word to someone. There is nothing more to be said, though Jesus may not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 345, 15, 34, 'have given that same answer to someone else who also wanted to go and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 345, 16, 34, 'attend his father''s funeral. Jesus had an appropriate word for each');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 345, 17, 34, 'person. We don''t live under the law in the New Testament. In the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 345, 18, 34, 'Testament there were laws - in such a situation you do this, and in some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 345, 19, 34, 'other situation you do this - it was clear-cut; but in the New Covenant,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 345, 20, 34, 'we’re led by the Holy Spirit, and in one particular set of circumstances');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 345, 21, 34, 'the Lord may tell us to do something, and in a similar set of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 345, 22, 34, 'circumstances, on another occasion, the Lord may tell us to do the exact');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 345, 23, 34, 'opposite. This is the beauty of being led by the Holy Spirit. At one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 345, 24, 34, 'time, He may tell you to attend a funeral, another time He may tell you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 345, 25, 34, 'not to attend it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 345, 26, 34, 'Many Christians unfortunately still seek to live by rules. That''s why,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 345, 27, 34, 'whenever they hear a preacher or a hear a sermon, they''re looking for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 345, 28, 34, 'rules. I want to emphasize that I''m not teaching rules in this study.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 346, 1, 34, 'Jesus didn''t. We can learn from this. What shall we learn from all that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 346, 2, 34, 'Jesus taught by His life? Basically, listen to the Holy Spirit. He will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 346, 3, 34, 'lead you moment-by-moment. The Bible says in Romans 8:14, (and it''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 346, 4, 34, 'beautiful verse. You need to understand it properly). “Those who are led');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 346, 5, 34, 'by the Spirit of God, these are the sons of God.” What about all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 346, 6, 34, 'others? They are children of God, and there’s a difference between');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 346, 7, 34, 'children and sons in the New Testament. “As many as received Him, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 346, 8, 34, 'them He gave the authority to be children of God.” As soon as you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 346, 9, 34, 'receive Christ, you become a child of God. You''re born again, but if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 346, 10, 34, 'allow the Holy Spirit to lead you thereafter day by day, then you''re a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 346, 11, 34, 'mature son. Many Christians are still babies. That''s why we need to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 346, 12, 34, 'filled with the Holy Spirit. We need to live under the anointing of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 346, 13, 34, 'Holy Spirit every day. If there''s one thing that we can learn from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 346, 14, 34, 'way Jesus lived (all that He taught by His actions), it is to be led by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 346, 15, 34, 'the Holy Spirit moment-by-moment. Even in the one-sentence answers that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 346, 16, 34, 'He gives to people, which were exactly appropriate according to their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 346, 17, 34, 'needs. Do you believe that God can give you that type of anointing,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 346, 18, 34, 'where you have a word according to the need of everybody?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 346, 19, 34, 'God Will Give You Utterance, If You Meet His Conditions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 346, 20, 34, 'A verse that has been a great help to me in my own life is Luke 21:15.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 346, 21, 34, 'It''s a promise I have claimed many times in my life. Not for public');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 346, 22, 34, 'ministry alone, but even for private conversation with people who come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 346, 23, 34, 'to me asking questions. The Lord says, “I will give you utterance and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 346, 24, 34, 'wisdom which none of your enemies will be able to resist or refute”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 346, 25, 34, '(Luke 21:15). For me it''s been a great promise in my life. If you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 346, 26, 34, 'believe that the Lord can do that for you, then you won’t experience it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 346, 27, 34, 'Like taking a check to the bank, claim this promise saying, “I want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 346, 28, 34, 'cash this, because it’s been signed by Jesus Christ!” Take it to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 347, 1, 34, 'bank of heaven and say, “In Christ''s Name, I claim this. This promise is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 347, 2, 34, 'for me, that I can have an utterance and wisdom for every situation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 347, 3, 34, 'which nobody will be able to resist or refute. They may hate me and they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 347, 4, 34, 'make call me all types of names (Beelzebul perhaps, like they called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 347, 5, 34, 'Jesus), but it doesn’t matter. I know that what I will say will be the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 347, 6, 34, 'wisdom of God.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 347, 7, 34, 'Dear brothers and sisters, long for this. The Bible says sisters can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 347, 8, 34, 'prophesy in the New Covenant, and that doesn''t mean getting up in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 347, 9, 34, 'pulpit and teaching; it means having a word according to people’s needs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 347, 10, 34, 'That’s the prophetic word. So that''s a great thing that we see in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 347, 11, 34, 'way Jesus answered these two people with two different needs. The Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 347, 12, 34, 'of God gave Him discernment.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 347, 13, 34, 'Two things I want to say in conclusion. The Lord has spoken to me when I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 347, 14, 34, 'was seeking to know, “How can I have a word for every single occasion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 347, 15, 34, 'that I am to speak, whether it''s individually to people, or in a TV');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 347, 16, 34, 'program, or in a pulpit in a conference?”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 347, 17, 34, 'And the Lord said, “First of all, your heart must be filled with My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 347, 18, 34, 'Word.” God''s Word must fill your heart. Secondly, “Your heart must be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 347, 19, 34, 'filled with love for My people”. That''s it. We must be anointed with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 347, 20, 34, 'Holy Spirit (that''s of course primary and you don''t just rely on that),');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 347, 21, 34, 'but we must also study God''s word - fill our mind with God''s Word - and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 347, 22, 34, 'let the Spirit of God fill our hearts with love for God''s people. I can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 347, 23, 34, 'assure you that God will always give you a word according to the need of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 347, 24, 34, 'the people you speak to. I have experienced that for years, and God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 347, 25, 34, 'no favorites. What He does for me, He will do for you. I believed many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 347, 26, 34, 'years ago that what God did for Jesus, He would also do for me. I want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 347, 27, 34, 'to encourage you to believe that, so that you can also walk on earth and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 347, 28, 34, 'serve the Father like Jesus did.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 348, 1, 35, 'Chapter 34 Deliverance from Fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 348, 2, 35, 'In Matthew 8:24, there was a great storm, and the boat that Jesus and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 348, 3, 35, 'His disciples were in was covered with waves. But Jesus Himself was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 348, 4, 35, 'asleep (There is something wonderful to see here. Jesus was very human;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 348, 5, 35, 'He got tired. When He was tired, He would sleep. That is the right thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 348, 6, 35, 'for us to do as well.) His disciples came to Him and woke Him up,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 348, 7, 35, 'saying, “Save us, Lord! We are perishing!” Jesus said to them, “Why are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 348, 8, 35, 'you timid, you men of little faith?” Then He rose and rebuked the winds');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 348, 9, 35, 'and the sea. Then it became perfectly calm.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 348, 10, 35, 'Is there anything wrong in being concerned, worried, and anxious when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 348, 11, 35, 'your boat is about to sink? The fishing boat was covered with the waves,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 348, 12, 35, 'and it would sink soon. These were experienced fisherman, and even they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 348, 13, 35, 'were scared! They said words like, “We are perishing!” They thought they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 348, 14, 35, 'were going to drown in the sea. If experienced fishermen say they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 348, 15, 35, 'going to drown in the sea, it must be pretty serious.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 348, 16, 35, 'Jesus Came To Deliver Us From Fear Of Death');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 348, 17, 35, 'The Lord does not say, “Oh well, I understand your concern. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 348, 18, 35, 'natural to be anxious, but do not worry.” No, Jesus immediately says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 348, 19, 35, '“You timid people! You men of little faith! Why are you so timid? Why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 348, 20, 35, 'are you so afraid of perishing?” Jesus came to deliver us from the fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 348, 21, 35, 'of death. These disciples are afraid of death, and it is natural for all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 348, 22, 35, 'human beings to be afraid of death, except for true disciples of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 348, 23, 35, 'Christ. Hebrews 2:14-15 says, “Therefore, since the children share in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 348, 24, 35, 'flesh and blood, He Himself likewise also partook of the same, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 348, 25, 35, 'through death He might render powerless him who had the power of death,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 348, 26, 35, 'that is, the devil, and might free those who through fear of death were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 348, 27, 35, 'subject to slavery all their lives.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 348, 28, 35, 'These are very important verses. I want to connect them with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 349, 1, 35, 'apostles saying, “Lord, we are perishing.” We all know that Jesus took');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 349, 2, 35, 'part in flesh and blood in order to die for our sins. There was no other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 349, 3, 35, 'way that our sins could be forgiven and removed except for Jesus dying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 349, 4, 35, 'for our sins. But there is another great truth in the New Testament');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 349, 5, 35, 'which is not sufficiently preached. According to Hebrews 2:14-15, one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 349, 6, 35, 'reason why Jesus took part in our flesh and blood was to make Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 349, 7, 35, 'powerless. We can be absolutely sure that our sins are forgiven when we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 349, 8, 35, 'have turned to the Lord in repentance and asked Him to forgive us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 349, 9, 35, 'Similarly, we can be equally sure that all the power Satan had over our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 349, 10, 35, 'lives for so many years is gone. This happens the moment we surrender');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 349, 11, 35, 'every area of our life to Christ. Satan will only have power in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 349, 12, 35, 'areas of your life that you do not surrender to Christ. Remember that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 349, 13, 35, 'Hebrews 2:14-15 does not say the devil was destroyed. We know Satan is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 349, 14, 35, 'not destroyed. He is very much alive, and he still has a lot of power.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 349, 15, 35, 'He moves around the world. He rules the entertainment industries of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 349, 16, 35, 'world. He works through witches and all types of evil people who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 349, 17, 35, 'persecute Christians. But his power is gone. One reason why Satan’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 349, 18, 35, 'power was taken away from him was so that Jesus might deliver those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 349, 19, 35, 'through fear of death were subject to slavery all their lives (Hebrews');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 349, 20, 35, '2:15). The fear of death brings us into slavery. If you are afraid of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 349, 21, 35, 'death, you are a slave. You are not necessarily a slave of the devil,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 349, 22, 35, 'but a slave to fear. Being a slave to fear is just as bad as being a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 349, 23, 35, 'slave to the devil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 349, 24, 35, 'The Lord does not want you to be a slave of fear. Hebrews 2:15 says the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 349, 25, 35, 'fear of death is slavery. Jesus died to deliver us not only from sin,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 349, 26, 35, 'but also from the slavery of the fear of death. It says that the race of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 349, 27, 35, 'Adam has been enslaved to the fear of death but now, we have been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 349, 28, 35, 'delivered if we accept death, because it has lost its sting. Even though');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 350, 1, 35, 'Christ accomplished this for us on the cross, it never becomes ours');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 350, 2, 35, 'until we receive it by faith. Christ died for the sins of the world (1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 350, 3, 35, 'John 2:2), but the whole world’s sins are not forgiven, even though He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 350, 4, 35, 'is a propitiation for the sins of the whole world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 350, 5, 35, 'We Must Receive the Deliverance Christ Purchased');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 350, 6, 35, 'The reason why the world’s sins are not forgiven is because the majority');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 350, 7, 35, 'of people in the world have not accepted it for themselves. In the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 350, 8, 35, 'way, Christ made Satan powerless so that all Christians can be freed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 350, 9, 35, 'from the fear of death. But are all Christians free from the fear of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 350, 10, 35, 'death? No. The majority of Christians are not free. They live in slavery');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 350, 11, 35, 'to the fear of death. The fear of death is the highest of all fears. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 350, 12, 35, 'is number one; every other fear is lower than that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 350, 13, 35, 'Any fear, anxiety, or tension due to any other cause is inferior to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 350, 14, 35, 'fear of death. When the Lord delivers us from the fear of death, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 350, 15, 35, 'delivers us from everything else as well. If the greatest fear is gone,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 350, 16, 35, 'then the other fears are gone too. When Goliath was killed, all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 350, 17, 35, 'other Philistines ran away because their champion was killed (1 Samuel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 350, 18, 35, '17). When the fear of death is overcome, all other fears disappear. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 350, 19, 35, 'is very important for every one of us to overcome this number one fear.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 350, 20, 35, 'Hebrews 2:14-15 says that Christ died to deliver us from that. I cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 350, 21, 35, 'free myself. It is not a matter of mentally convincing myself. You do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 350, 22, 35, 'not get freed from sin by mentally convincing yourself of anything. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 350, 23, 35, 'do not teach psychology, but the Word of God. It is Christ who delivers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 350, 24, 35, 'us from sin. It is the same Christ who can deliver us completely from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 350, 25, 35, 'the fear of death so that we are not slaves to the fear of death');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 350, 26, 35, 'anymore.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 350, 27, 35, 'The disciples said, “Oh, save us, Lord! We are perishing!” We are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 350, 28, 35, 'supposed to have that type of fear. Today, it may not be waves crashing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 351, 1, 35, 'into the boat. It may be cancer or something else that comes crashing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 351, 2, 35, 'into our lives. It looks as if our life is sinking, and we are finished.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 351, 3, 35, 'We do not have to get into a panic even if we say, “Oh, Lord. Please');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 351, 4, 35, 'save us! We are perishing!” We can ask God to save us from sickness and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 351, 5, 35, 'even from death. But we should not ask in a panic. Instead, we should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 351, 6, 35, 'ask in faith. It is quite a different thing to ask in faith than it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 351, 7, 35, 'to cry out in panic. The Lord said to them, “Why are you so timid, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 351, 8, 35, 'men of little faith?” They had a little bit of faith. Jesus did not say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 351, 9, 35, 'that they had no faith. “Little faith” means they had enough faith to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 351, 10, 35, 'follow Him, but when it came to certain crises in life, they discovered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 351, 11, 35, 'that that is about as good as having no faith at all. A little faith was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 351, 12, 35, 'almost equal to no faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 351, 13, 35, 'The Purpose of Storms');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 351, 14, 35, 'Jesus rose and rebuked the winds in the sea, and it became perfectly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 351, 15, 35, 'calm (Matthew 8:26). This is a beautiful picture of how the Lord wants');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 351, 16, 35, 'to rebuke every storm that ever comes into your life. The Lord could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 351, 17, 35, 'have taken His disciples through seas that were calm, but they would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 351, 18, 35, 'never have learnt anything. It is because they went through stormy seas');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 351, 19, 35, 'that they discovered that Christ had the power to still the storm.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 351, 20, 35, 'This teaches us that one reason why God allows us to face stormy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 351, 21, 35, 'situations in our life is because He wants to show us that He has the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 351, 22, 35, 'power to still storms even today. So do not ever pray, “Lord, give me a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 351, 23, 35, 'safe calm passage through life.” You will never get to know the Lord. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 351, 24, 35, 'fact, the more the Lord loves you, the more He wants to make you more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 351, 25, 35, 'like Him. He will take you through many stormy situations, difficulties,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 351, 26, 35, 'trials, and things that other human beings may never face. The purpose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 351, 27, 35, 'is to always to show you that He still has power to rebuke the storm.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 351, 28, 35, 'Whatever you are facing today, next week or next year, remember this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 352, 1, 35, 'passage: Jesus rose and rebuked the winds, and it became perfectly calm.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 352, 2, 35, 'God’s Will: Reigning in Peace over Every Storm');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 352, 3, 35, 'God''s will is that there is a perfect calmness at all times in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 352, 4, 35, 'heart. This is not because we never face storms, but rather, peace in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 352, 5, 35, 'spite of the storms. In the middle of a storm, a person at rest in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 352, 6, 35, 'heart is a greater testimony to God than a person who is at rest in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 352, 7, 35, 'heart who is not facing any trials or storms. That is the thing we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 352, 8, 35, 'learn here. The other thing we can learn here is that this is the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 352, 9, 35, 'God wanted man to live. When God created Adam, He told him that He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 352, 10, 35, 'wanted Adam to have authority over all things on the earth and to subdue');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 352, 11, 35, 'everything. Notice the exact words there in Genesis 1:26, “Let them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 352, 12, 35, 'rule.” Sometimes, we forget when God created man, God said, “Let us make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 352, 13, 35, 'man in Our image, and let them rule.” Adam and Eve were created to rule.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 352, 14, 35, 'The opposite of ruling is to be a slave. God’s original purpose for man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 352, 15, 35, 'was that he might be a king, queen, or ruler - not a slave to anything.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 352, 16, 35, '“Let them rule over the birds of the air, the cattle and creeping');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 352, 17, 35, 'things” (Genesis 1:26). They were to rule over everything. God created');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 352, 18, 35, 'man in His own image and gave him authority over everything. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 352, 19, 35, 'what we see in Genesis. When Jesus lived on earth, He was demonstrating');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 352, 20, 35, 'on earth, "This is the way My Father and I wanted Adam to live when We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 352, 21, 35, 'created him. Now I am here on earth, showing you how he was supposed to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 352, 22, 35, 'live. He failed only because of sin. Now I have come to deliver you from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 352, 23, 35, 'sin so that you can live with supernatural authority on this earth. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 352, 24, 35, 'can live in such a way that fears, anxieties, and storms of life do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 352, 25, 35, 'disturb the calmness in your soul.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 352, 26, 35, 'Do you believe God’s will for you is to be perfectly calm and still in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 352, 27, 35, 'every storm? What a beautiful expression. I wish you would take this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 352, 28, 35, 'expression in Matthew 8:26 to heart. Say, “Lord, I want this in my life!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 353, 1, 35, 'I want You to always deliver me from storms! I do not want to escape');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 353, 2, 35, 'every storm. I want to go through storms, but I want to be like You so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 353, 3, 35, 'that I can sleep through it without fear because You can still every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 353, 4, 35, 'storm.” People have never seen anything like this. Those disciples');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 353, 5, 35, 'marveled saying, “What kind of a Man is this, that even the wind and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 353, 6, 35, 'sea obey Him?” Jesus answered that this is how God wanted all men to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 353, 7, 35, 'live: with God’s authority reigning in them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 353, 8, 35, 'Our Times Are in His Hand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 353, 9, 35, 'Why are you timid? Why are you afraid that you will perish before God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 353, 10, 35, 'time? When we live in the will of God, with all of our life totally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 353, 11, 35, 'surrendered to Him, we can be totally at rest, and sleep like Jesus did,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 353, 12, 35, 'even in the middle of a storm. Jesus could do that because He knew that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 353, 13, 35, 'He could never die until God’s time had come. Nobody could kill Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 353, 14, 35, 'until God’s time had come. No storm in the sea could drown Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 353, 15, 35, 'We read of another occasion in Luke 4 where people stopped Jesus in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 353, 16, 35, 'middle of a sermon. They pulled Him out from the pulpit, took Him to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 353, 17, 35, 'cliff, and wanted to throw Him down. Jesus just quietly walked out from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 353, 18, 35, 'there. Imagine two hundred people grabbing one man. Jesus quietly walks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 353, 19, 35, 'out. That is the authority that we can have. Jesus had no fear. He knew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 353, 20, 35, 'they could try their best. 200 people can grab Him and try to throw Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 353, 21, 35, 'down from the cliff. It will not happen because God''s time for Jesus had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 353, 22, 35, 'not come. Have you noticed the number of times in John 7 it says, “His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 353, 23, 35, 'hour had not come”? One time, it says they could not capture Him because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 353, 24, 35, 'His hour had not come, not because they were not strong enough. They had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 353, 25, 35, 'swords, spears and armor. There were hundreds of people, but when they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 353, 26, 35, 'came to capture Jesus, they could not capture Him because His hour had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 353, 27, 35, 'not yet come. That is why, if you have surrendered to Christ like Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 353, 28, 35, 'was surrendered to His Father, you cannot die before your time comes,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 354, 1, 35, 'either. This promise does not apply to people whose aim in life is to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 354, 2, 35, 'make money, promote their own honor, or live comfortably. If your only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 354, 3, 35, 'aim in life is to glorify God and to do His will, then I can assure you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 354, 4, 35, 'in Jesus’ name that you cannot die before your time comes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 354, 5, 35, 'Like the saying goes, “I am immortal until my life''s work is done.” No');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 354, 6, 35, 'one can touch us. We can walk as Jesus walked on this earth with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 354, 7, 35, 'complete freedom from fear, anxiety, and death. May the Lord never have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 354, 8, 35, 'to say to us, “Why are you so afraid, men of little faith?” You will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 354, 9, 35, 'find that there are some situations in your life when the Lord speaks a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 354, 10, 35, 'word of rebuke like that to you. Listen to that word of rebuke and take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 354, 11, 35, 'it to heart. “Why are you afraid, you men of little faith? Can’t you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 354, 12, 35, 'trust Me?” God in heaven controls all our circumstances. He controls the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 354, 13, 35, 'people who try to harm us. He controls the devil, and He will not allow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 354, 14, 35, 'us to be tested or tried beyond our ability (1 Corinthians 10:13). You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 354, 15, 35, 'do not need to hear that every now and then, like a pep talk to stir you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 354, 16, 35, 'up. It is something that we must believe constantly. 1 Corinthians 10:13');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 354, 17, 35, 'is true all the time. God will never allow us to be tested beyond our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 354, 18, 35, 'ability. Romans 8:28 says “He will make everything work together for our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 354, 19, 35, 'good if we love Him.” We want to fulfill His purpose in our life; that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 354, 20, 35, 'is why we are not afraid of perishing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 354, 21, 35, 'God Has Determined the Exact Days of Our Lives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 354, 22, 35, 'In Psalm 139, it says that the Lord knew us as an unformed body in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 354, 23, 35, 'mother''s womb. Psalm 139:16 says, “Your eyes have seen my unformed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 354, 24, 35, 'substance; And in Your book were all written the days that were ordained');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 354, 25, 35, 'for me, when as yet there was not one of them.” Before I was born, David');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 354, 26, 35, 'says, the number of days I was supposed to live on earth in Your perfect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 354, 27, 35, 'will was already recorded. Before my first day on earth, it was already');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 354, 28, 35, 'determined when I should die. Death is not an accidental thing for one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 355, 1, 35, 'who is totally surrendered to do God''s will. There was an exact date on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 355, 2, 35, 'which Jesus was supposed to be born in God''s perfect will. There was an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 355, 3, 35, 'exact date when He was supposed to die. It was already written in God’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 355, 4, 35, 'book.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 355, 5, 35, 'God loves us as He loved Jesus. I believe there is a book where my days');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 355, 6, 35, 'are recorded. I know God determined the date when I should be born and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 355, 7, 35, 'where I should be born. He has also determined the exact date when I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 355, 8, 35, 'supposed to leave this earth to go be with Him forever. That is why I do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 355, 9, 35, 'not live in fear that a road accident, cancer, or persecution may kill');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 355, 10, 35, 'me before that time. That is impossible. I am not looking forward to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 355, 11, 35, 'death. I am looking forward to the coming of the Lord. Like Paul says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 355, 12, 35, 'we will be alive until we are called to meet Him in the air when He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 355, 13, 35, 'returns. But if that is not the Lord’s will, and it is God’s will that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 355, 14, 35, 'should die, then it will not happen before God''s time. That is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 355, 15, 35, 'assurance I have. I have no doubt about it at all. Jesus could not die');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 355, 16, 35, 'before God’s time. It can be like that for you too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 355, 17, 35, 'There is no need to panic. There is no need to fear. There is no need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 355, 18, 35, 'live with unbelief. It is an insult to God when a child of God thinks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 355, 19, 35, 'the devil is more powerful than Almighty God. That is what you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 355, 20, 35, 'actually saying when you live in fear of circumstances, death, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 355, 21, 35, 'sickness. You wonder whether Satan is more powerful than God. Satan is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 355, 22, 35, 'not more powerful than God. God is the only One Who is Almighty.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 355, 23, 35, 'Jesus Delivers Us from the Storms Inside Us, Too');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 355, 24, 35, 'The Lord says to these disciples, “Why are you timid, oh ye of little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 355, 25, 35, 'faith?” Then they go to the other side in the country of the Gadarenes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 355, 26, 35, 'They see two men who have a storm inside of them. Earlier, it was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 355, 27, 35, 'storm out in the sea. Now, we find people with the storm inside them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 355, 28, 35, 'The demons inside were kicking up a storm. Previously, the demons kicked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 356, 1, 35, 'up a storm outside on the lake, but here, the demons that kicked up a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 356, 2, 35, 'storm inside these people. They were hurting themselves. Scripture says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 356, 3, 35, 'they cut themselves with knives and stones, and they were exceedingly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 356, 4, 35, 'violent (Matthew 8:28). No one could pass by that road. What could they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 356, 5, 35, 'do? They cried out. It says in another place they were tied with chains,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 356, 6, 35, 'but they would break the chains and get free. Nobody could tie them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 356, 7, 35, 'down. They cried out saying, “What have we to do with You, Son of God?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 356, 8, 35, 'Have You come here to torment us before the time?”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 356, 9, 35, 'Demons recognize that there is a time coming when they are going to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 356, 10, 35, 'tormented forever. They believe in eternal torment. A lot of human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 356, 11, 35, 'beings do not believe in eternal hell. A lot of Christians do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 356, 12, 35, 'believe in eternal hell, but the demons know it is true. There is a time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 356, 13, 35, 'when God has allowed them to roam around until that time comes. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 356, 14, 35, 'demons know that time is coming. That is why they asked Jesus, “Have You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 356, 15, 35, 'come here to torment us before our time?” We read about them saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 356, 16, 35, '“Please do not cast us out. Do not send us to that torment now. Can You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 356, 17, 35, 'please send us into these swine? If You are going to cast us out, send');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 356, 18, 35, 'us into the swine.” Jesus said, “Be gone.” The demon-possessed man was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 356, 19, 35, 'Legion. There were maybe hundreds or thousands of demons inside of him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 356, 20, 35, 'It is amazing that with one word, all the demons inside this man left');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 356, 21, 35, 'immediately.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 356, 22, 35, 'Matthew 8:16 says, “Jesus cast out the spirits with a word.” We do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 356, 23, 35, 'have to shout, scream, yell, and cry out for many hours for casting out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 356, 24, 35, 'a demon. That would be an indication of powerlessness. That would be an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 356, 25, 35, 'indication that we still have to fight the battle. No, the demons were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 356, 26, 35, 'defeated on the cross. Every single one of them was defeated on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 356, 27, 35, 'cross. With one word, one who has faith, authority, and the anointing of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 356, 28, 35, 'the Spirit can cast it out. I have seen it happen numerous times in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 357, 1, 35, 'life. With one word, in the name of Jesus, the demons go. You can have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 357, 2, 35, 'that authority if your life is clean. Surrender to the Lord and believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 357, 3, 35, 'that the Lord Jesus Christ has defeated Satan on the cross.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 357, 4, 36, 'Chapter 35 Casting Out Demons and Faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 357, 5, 36, 'In the last chapter, we considered the two demon-possessed people in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 357, 6, 36, 'Gadarenes how even though no one could control them, yet Jesus cast out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 357, 7, 36, 'the demons with a word (Matthew 8:28). This is so important. Today we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 357, 8, 36, 'have many people doing many things to cast demons out: screaming,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 357, 9, 36, 'yelling, even pulling people’s hair in such a dishonorable way, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 357, 10, 36, 'sometimes praying and fasting for days on end.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 357, 11, 36, 'In Matthew 17 the disciples came to Jesus with a boy whom they could not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 357, 12, 36, 'cast a demon out of. Jesus just spoke one word and the demon came out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 357, 13, 36, '(Mathew 17:18), so the disciples asked Him why they couldn’t cast it out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 357, 14, 36, '(verse 19). Some people say it was because they didn’t fast and pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 357, 15, 36, 'enough. But if you read carefully, you’ll see that Jesus said it was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 357, 16, 36, 'because their faith was little (Matthew 17:20). When your faith is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 357, 17, 36, 'little, you may cry, scream, pull people''s hair, fast and pray, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 357, 18, 36, 'nothing will happen. The disciples did not pray and fast (verse 21),');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 357, 19, 36, 'indicating that there was something in their life they hadn’t sacrificed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 357, 20, 36, 'or they hadn’t given up.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 357, 21, 36, 'Prayer is an expression of our helpless dependence upon God. Fasting is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 357, 22, 36, 'an expression of our willingness to deny ourselves of certain earthly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 357, 23, 36, 'comforts, legitimate comforts, for the sake of the gospel. Is this true');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 357, 24, 36, 'in your life? Are you showing your helpless dependence upon God through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 357, 25, 36, 'prayer? Are you willing to give up legitimate comforts of earth for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 357, 26, 36, 'sake of God''s Kingdom? If you are willing to fast and pray, then you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 357, 27, 36, 'will have faith. With that faith, you will not have to speak to a demon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 357, 28, 36, 'twice. There isn’t single case in Scripture where Jesus had to speak to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 358, 1, 36, 'a demon twice before the demon left.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 358, 2, 36, 'We read one case where Jesus prayed for a blind man in Mark 8:22-25. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 358, 3, 36, 'man was healed only partially, so Jesus prayed again, and the man was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 358, 4, 36, 'healed fully. This was to teach us that when we are healed partially, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 358, 5, 36, 'don''t have to falsely confess that we are fully healed. After praying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 358, 6, 36, 'for him Jesus asked in Mark 8:23, “Can you see anything?” The man said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 358, 7, 36, '“I see men like trees” - he wasn''t healed completely yet. Jesus had spat');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 358, 8, 36, 'on his eyes, laid hands on him, and prayed for him, but he was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 358, 9, 36, 'healed fully! That is amazing, there was never another case where Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 358, 10, 36, 'touched somebody and he was not healed fully.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 358, 11, 36, 'That incident was specifically planned for our times, in this 20th and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 358, 12, 36, '21st century where people are told to confess that they''re healed when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 358, 13, 36, 'they are not. Thank God for this incident, where one person was prayed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 358, 14, 36, 'for and was not healed! The man didn’t lie; he was honest, and said he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 358, 15, 36, 'wasn’t healed properly - he still confused men and trees. Did the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 358, 16, 36, 'say, “No, no, no, I already prayed for you. Now just keep confessing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 358, 17, 36, 'that you are fully healed until it happens”? He never said that. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 358, 18, 36, 'would be telling a lie.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 358, 19, 36, 'A lot of preachers are now going around telling people to say they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 358, 20, 36, 'healed when they really weren’t. Instead of the preacher confessing his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 358, 21, 36, 'own unbelief, he tells the sick person to keep confessing he is healed!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 358, 22, 36, 'This is tragic. Jesus prayed for the man again. He said, “That’s fine,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 358, 23, 36, 'I’ll pray for you again.” That’s what we should do when a person is sick');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 358, 24, 36, 'that we prayed for and they are not healed - we don’t tell him to say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 358, 25, 36, 'that he’s healed. Jesus never asks us to confess a lie. A person should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 358, 26, 36, 'be honest, and if they still have pain, say that they still have pain;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 358, 27, 36, 'if they’re still sick, they should be honest that they are still sick.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 358, 28, 36, 'Then Jesus prayed again, and the man was fully healed and could see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 359, 1, 36, 'everything clearly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 359, 2, 36, 'Resisting the Devil and Casting out Demons');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 359, 3, 36, 'Jesus always spoke a word whenever He cast out a demon, and that word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 359, 4, 36, 'was enough. Today Satan has been conquered, and every demon has been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 359, 5, 36, 'defeated on the cross. Is it possible that there is a single demon who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 359, 6, 36, 'does not tremble at the name of Jesus? Even Satan does! The Bible says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 359, 7, 36, '“Submit therefore to God. Resist the devil and he will flee from you”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 359, 8, 36, '(James 4:7).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 359, 9, 36, 'First submit to God – it says, “submit to God and resist the devil.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 359, 10, 36, 'Many quote only the second half of James 4:7. Make sure your whole life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 359, 11, 36, 'is submitted to God, and then resist the devil. The promise is that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 359, 12, 36, 'devil will not just walk away, or run away, but he will flee! “Flee” is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 359, 13, 36, 'a word which means to run at full speed. The devil will not be anywhere');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 359, 14, 36, 'near you, he will disappear. This promise is true, and if it isn’t true');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 359, 15, 36, 'for you, then it must either be because you didn''t submit to God, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 359, 16, 36, 'didn''t resist the devil, or you resisted the devil without first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 359, 17, 36, 'submitting to God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 359, 18, 36, 'If you submitted to God, and then resisted the devil, it is impossible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 359, 19, 36, 'for the promise in James 4:7 not to be fulfilled. I''m speaking from more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 359, 20, 36, 'than fifty years of experience. Whenever I submit to God and resist the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 359, 21, 36, 'devil, the devil flees.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 359, 22, 36, 'One word is enough to defeat a demon who has been conquered on Calvary''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 359, 23, 36, 'cross. There is no need to scream or yell. I remember once whispering');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 359, 24, 36, 'under my breath because I didn''t want to disturb the whole congregation,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 359, 25, 36, 'and a demon that possessed a person 30-40 feet away from me obeyed the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 359, 26, 36, 'command. I remember another time when a demon possessed person tried to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 359, 27, 36, 'scare me with a fierce face and I was taken back for a moment. I asked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 359, 28, 36, 'myself this question just to reaffirm my faith: “did is this demon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 360, 1, 36, 'escape at Calvary, or was he conquered on the cross?” I reminded myself,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 360, 2, 36, '“He was conquered. Every single demon was conquered on Calvary” - so I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 360, 3, 36, 'spoke to the demon to get out, and he left. In every single case I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 360, 4, 36, 'believe the word of Jesus, that you don''t need to speak to any demon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 360, 5, 36, 'possessed person more than once to cast out the demon - not because of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 360, 6, 36, 'what you are, but because of the authority there is in the name of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 360, 7, 36, 'Christ, and because you believe that every demon in hell, and Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 360, 8, 36, 'himself, were all defeated on the cross. You have authority over them if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 360, 9, 36, 'your life is clean and if you are anointed with the Holy Spirit. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 360, 10, 36, 'devil has to listen to your word when you cast out a demon.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 360, 11, 36, 'If that demon does not leave, then like the disciples, you need to pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 360, 12, 36, 'and fast and seek God. The Lord will show you something in your life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 360, 13, 36, 'that needs to be set right. There is no need to continue praying for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 360, 14, 36, 'hours for the demon to be cast out and wasting people’s time. There is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 360, 15, 36, 'no need to spend hours struggling to cast the demon out. This is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 360, 16, 36, 'type of crazy thing that is happening a lot in Christendom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 360, 17, 36, 'Let’s follow the example of Jesus. In one word He said “Begone” (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 360, 18, 36, '8:32). Again in Matthew 8:16, it says that He cast out the spirits with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 360, 19, 36, 'one word; that’s it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 360, 20, 36, 'Another question we can ask ourselves here is why God allowed these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 360, 21, 36, 'demons to go into 2000 pigs, which then all ran down the cliff and went');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 360, 22, 36, 'into the sea. What delight did the Lord get out of seeing those pigs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 360, 23, 36, 'perishing in the waters? There was a reason: it was to convince these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 360, 24, 36, 'two men that the demons had actually gone out of them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 360, 25, 36, 'When you cast a demon out of someone, other people can say that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 360, 26, 36, 'didn’t see the change in behavior in this person. But how are these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 360, 27, 36, 'people themselves to know the demon was really cast out? Is it by a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 360, 28, 36, 'certain calmness that came into their mind right then? They may have had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 361, 1, 36, 'occasional periods of calmness even before. I have seen demon possessed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 361, 2, 36, 'people who look perfectly normal sometimes, who only get worked up when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 361, 3, 36, 'a man with spiritual authority comes to them; otherwise they are calm.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 361, 4, 36, 'Think about all the demon possessed people who sat in the synagogues in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 361, 5, 36, 'Jesus’ time. They weren’t creating a ruckus and confusion there when the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 361, 6, 36, 'Pharisees were speaking. The Pharisees had been speaking there for years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 361, 7, 36, 'and these demon-possessed people sat comfortably in those synagogues.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 361, 8, 36, 'But the moment Jesus came there, the demons got worked up because Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 361, 9, 36, 'had come. So calmness in a person does not always indicate that he is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 361, 10, 36, 'not demon possessed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 361, 11, 36, 'How then would these people know that the demons had gone out of them?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 361, 12, 36, 'They heard the demons from within them asking Jesus for permission,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 361, 13, 36, '“Please allow us to go into the swine.” The Lord gave them that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 361, 14, 36, 'permission as if almost He answered the prayer of these demons for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 361, 15, 36, 'sake of these two human beings, and the demons then went into the swine.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 361, 16, 36, 'When the two human beings who were demon possessed saw all the pigs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 361, 17, 36, 'falling into the water, they said to themselves, “Wow! They have gone! I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 361, 18, 36, 'know they have gone because I saw them getting into those swine and saw');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 361, 19, 36, 'the swine falling into the water!” It’s very interesting how we then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 361, 20, 36, 'read that the herdsmen ran away, and went into the city and reported');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 361, 21, 36, 'what had happened (verse 33).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 361, 22, 36, 'Now read carefully what the herdsmen reported. First they reported');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 361, 23, 36, 'everything, and then, as if it were in brackets, it says they included');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 361, 24, 36, 'the incident of the demoniacs. In other words, the main thing they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 361, 25, 36, 'reported, which they felt was the most important thing that happened');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 361, 26, 36, 'that day, was that they lost the pigs! The less important postscript was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 361, 27, 36, 'that two demon possessed people were healed and are now sitting at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 361, 28, 36, 'feet of Jesus listening to him. Clearly, the loss of the pigs was most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 362, 1, 36, 'important thing in the mind of those herdsmen, and the other deliverance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 362, 2, 36, 'of the demoniacs was sort of a postscript added at the end of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 362, 3, 36, 'message.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 362, 4, 36, 'Is that how it is with us? Does loss of property mean more to us than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 362, 5, 36, 'people delivered from the power of Satan? If you examine your life, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 362, 6, 36, 'will find that loss of your property disturbs you more than people who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 362, 7, 36, 'are in the grip of the devil himself. That is what the Lord wants us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 362, 8, 36, 'have a priority for the deliverance of people. Jesus did not come to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 362, 9, 36, 'protect us from the loss of material things. He came to deliver people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 362, 10, 36, 'from the power of Satan. And it says that when the people in the city');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 362, 11, 36, 'heard it, their mindset was exactly the same as the herdsmen: the pigs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 362, 12, 36, 'were more important than two people delivered from demons. Jesus showed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 362, 13, 36, 'that 2000 pigs were not as important as two human beings.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 362, 14, 36, 'Jesus Left, He Does Not Force Himself on Anyone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 362, 15, 36, 'Mathew 8:34 says, “The whole city came to meet Jesus and when they came,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 362, 16, 36, 'they entreated Him to depart from their region.” One would have thought');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 362, 17, 36, 'they''d be excited and would have praised God! No, in their minds they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 362, 18, 36, 'thought, “2000 pigs have been lost, and this Man was the cause of it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 362, 19, 36, 'Let’s drive Him out of here before we lose more material things.” They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 362, 20, 36, 'were not bothered about the demon possessed people. There could have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 362, 21, 36, 'been other demon possessed people in this town (that could have been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 362, 22, 36, 'brought to Jesus), but the townspeople were not bothered about them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 362, 23, 36, 'What a commentary on the state of affairs with many who were Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 362, 24, 36, 'believing people there! Whenever people told Jesus they didn’t want Him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 362, 25, 36, 'He always left. He didn’t force Himself on anyone. Matthew 9:1 tells us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 362, 26, 36, 'that Jesus got into a boat and crossed over and came to His own city,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 362, 27, 36, 'Capernaum.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 362, 28, 36, 'It''s a very sad thing that many people choose material blessing over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 363, 1, 36, 'spiritual blessing. Christians refuse spiritual blessing if something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 363, 2, 36, 'material needs to be sacrificed in order to get it. This is the message');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 363, 3, 36, 'of this story. The people of the Gadarenes were more interested in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 363, 4, 36, 'business than in the deliverance of human beings from the devil’s power.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 363, 5, 36, 'There are many Christians like this, for whom deliverance of people from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 363, 6, 36, 'Satan''s power ranks very low in their order of priorities. Making money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 363, 7, 36, '- having plenty of pigs - is more important to them. Are these people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 363, 8, 36, 'believers? Are they following Jesus, or they are following these blind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 363, 9, 36, 'people of the Gadarenes?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 363, 10, 36, 'Jesus won’t force Himself. Revelation 3:20 says, “I stand at the door');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 363, 11, 36, 'and knock; if anyone hears My voice and opens the door, I will come in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 363, 12, 36, 'to him and dine with him, and he with Me”. If someone doesn''t open the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 363, 13, 36, 'door, then Jesus won’t come in. This doesn’t only refer to receiving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 363, 14, 36, 'Christ into our hearts. It can also mean allowing Him to come into areas');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 363, 15, 36, 'of our life where there is an influence of Satan in our life. Do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 363, 16, 36, 'watch pornography? That’s not demon possession, but it is a tremendous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 363, 17, 36, 'demonic influence which is affecting your mind. This influence allows');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 363, 18, 36, 'you to make choices when you go to the computer to look at scenes that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 363, 19, 36, 'you could never sit watching if Christ was sitting beside you. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 363, 20, 36, 'wrong to do; anything that you can’t do if Jesus were sitting next to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 363, 21, 36, 'you is wrong. However much you may justify yourself, there is something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 363, 22, 36, 'sinful about that. The things you do in your financial transactions, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 363, 23, 36, 'books you read, the music you listen to, movies and DVD''s you watch -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 363, 24, 36, 'can you have Jesus there with you while doing them? If not, then they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 363, 25, 36, 'are areas of your life that Satan has some control over. Even though you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 363, 26, 36, 'may not be demon possessed, he has some influence into your life through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 363, 27, 36, 'your flesh, through the dirty desires in your heart, he has influence in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 363, 28, 36, 'those areas.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 364, 1, 36, 'Those areas of your life are the areas where you’ll have confusion,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 364, 2, 36, 'because the Lord will not enter into an area of your life in which you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 364, 3, 36, 'do not permit Him. When you say, “Lord I don''t want You to interfere in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 364, 4, 36, 'what I''m watching on the computer. I don''t want You to stop me from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 364, 5, 36, 'watching certain movies. I don''t want you to stop me from reading');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 364, 6, 36, 'certain books,” then the Lord will say, “Fine. I''m not going to stop');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 364, 7, 36, 'you. Go and do what you like.” He will get into a boat and depart,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 364, 8, 36, 'because you don''t want Him in that area of your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 364, 9, 36, 'We Are Protected in the Areas Where We Are Submitted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 364, 10, 36, 'This is the reason why Satan can create so much confusion in the lives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 364, 11, 36, 'of many believers. Take the example of an umbrella. If it is raining and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 364, 12, 36, 'you stand under a big umbrella, then no part of your body will get wet.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 364, 13, 36, 'But if you put only part of your body is under that umbrella, the part');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 364, 14, 36, 'that is still outside will get wet. It’s like that when you give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 364, 15, 36, 'yourself to Christ. Jesus offers total protection for our whole being,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 364, 16, 36, 'but if I offer only part of myself to Him, then only that part will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 364, 17, 36, 'protected. The other part gets affected by the devil, and he can bring');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 364, 18, 36, 'sickness, confusion, and all types of problems into that area of my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 364, 19, 36, 'life. How safe it is to be completely under Christ!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 364, 20, 36, 'Our Sin Is Our Biggest Problem');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 364, 21, 36, 'Matthew 9 tells of people who brought to Jesus a paralytic lying on a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 364, 22, 36, 'bed. Seeing their faith, Jesus said to the paralytic, “Take courage My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 364, 23, 36, 'son, your sins are forgiven” (Matthew 9:2). What can we learn from this?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 364, 24, 36, 'What Jesus taught us through this is that if you can''t have faith,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 364, 25, 36, 'somebody else''s faith can help you. It doesn''t say that the paralytic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 364, 26, 36, 'had faith. It was the faith of the people who brought him. The very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 364, 27, 36, 'action of bringing that paralytic to Jesus was an act of faith. Before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 364, 28, 36, 'Jesus healed him, Jesus forgave his sins and said, “Take courage My son,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 365, 1, 36, 'your sins are forgiven.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 365, 2, 36, 'There''s a bigger problem with you than paralysis: your sin. You need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 365, 3, 36, 'understand that even if you are physically paralyzed, the bigger problem');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 365, 4, 36, 'is your sin. Jesus didn’t heal the paralytic first, He forgave him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 365, 5, 36, 'And some of those around were thinking, “This fellow blasphemes” because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 365, 6, 36, 'they thought, “How can a man forgive sins?” Jesus knew their thoughts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 365, 7, 36, '(He had discernment). The Lord can also give you discernment to know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 365, 8, 36, 'what people are thinking. What God did for Jesus, He will do for you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 365, 9, 36, 'Jesus knew their thoughts and said, “Why are you thinking evil in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 365, 10, 36, 'hearts? Which is easier to say, ‘Your sins are forgiven,’ or to say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 365, 11, 36, '‘Rise up and walk’?” When it comes to words, it may be easier to say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 365, 12, 36, '“Your sins are forgiven.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 365, 13, 36, 'Forgiveness of Our Sins is Far More Valuable Than Healing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 365, 14, 36, 'But it cost far more for Christ to forgive our sins than to heal our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 365, 15, 36, 'sickness. He didn’t die on the cross to heal our sickness. God could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 365, 16, 36, 'speak a word from Heaven and heal everybody’s sickness. It is more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 365, 17, 36, 'difficult to have our sins forgiven, but the people didn''t understand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 365, 18, 36, 'that. Jesus said it in order to prove that He had the authority on earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 365, 19, 36, 'to forgive sin. Then He said to the paralytic, “Rise up, take up your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 365, 20, 36, 'bed and walk,” and the man rose up and went home.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 365, 21, 36, 'Thus Jesus’ forgiveness of the man’s sin was attested to by God. Many of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 365, 22, 36, 'the miracles Jesus did where an attestation by God of His ministry and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 365, 23, 36, 'spoken Word. In the very first sermon that Peter preached he said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 365, 24, 36, '“Jesus the Nazarene, a Man attested to you by God with miracles and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 365, 25, 36, 'wonders and signs which God performed through Him in your midst” (Acts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 365, 26, 36, '2:22). The miracles were attestation of Jesus’ ministry. That''s why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 365, 27, 36, 'Jesus said, “So that you may know that this Son of Man has authority on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 365, 28, 36, 'earth to forgive sins.” Jesus made the person get up and walk, and he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 366, 1, 36, 'went away. The multitude saw this and were filled with awe. Mathew 9:8');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 366, 2, 36, 'says, “They glorified God Who had given such authority to men.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 366, 3, 36, 'Praise the Lord, there is something we can learn from every single');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 366, 4, 36, 'action and word that Jesus spoke, which He taught by His life and by His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 366, 5, 36, 'words.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 366, 6, 37, 'Chapter 36 Those Whom Jesus Called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 366, 7, 37, '“As Jesus went on from there, He saw a man called Matthew, sitting in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 366, 8, 37, 'the tax collector’s booth; and He said to him, ‘Follow Me!’ And he got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 366, 9, 37, 'up and followed Him” (Matthew 9:9). Jesus did not call everybody. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 366, 10, 37, 'lived by the promptings of the Holy Spirit. He would always be listening');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 366, 11, 37, 'to the Holy Spirit. His whole life, the antenna was up to receive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 366, 12, 37, 'messages from heaven. This is how we are supposed to walk, to be led by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 366, 13, 37, 'the Holy Spirit. As Jesus moved around, the Spirit of God would point');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 366, 14, 37, 'out a certain person to be an apostle.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 366, 15, 37, 'It’s amazing how the Lord can do that even today in His sovereignty. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 366, 16, 37, 'leads us to individuals who are to be our coworkers in the ministry God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 366, 17, 37, 'has entrusted to us, so that we can pass on to them what God has taught');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 366, 18, 37, 'us so that they can continue the work. It is God''s will that we pass on,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 366, 19, 37, 'particularly to the next generation, all that God has entrusted to us,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 366, 20, 37, 'especially those of us administering the word. That has been my own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 366, 21, 37, 'burden for a long time, and I want to pass on to others all that God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 366, 22, 37, 'taught me so that they can benefit from it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 366, 23, 37, 'Jesus selected His disciples in the same way. He saw Matthew and there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 366, 24, 37, 'was a prompting is His heart to call him. There were many people sitting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 366, 25, 37, 'there, collecting taxes; Matthew was not the only one. But Jesus went to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 366, 26, 37, 'Matthew and called him, just like He went to the shores of Galilee,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 366, 27, 37, 'where there were many fishermen, and He only called Peter, Andrew,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 366, 28, 37, 'James, and John. He called the four of them and let the others continue');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 367, 1, 37, 'with their fishing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 367, 2, 37, 'Jesus saw Matthew sitting in the tax office and He said, “Follow me!” It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 367, 3, 37, 'is amazing that Matthew rose and followed Him. Can you picture this in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 367, 4, 37, 'your mind? Here is a man who was probably a chartered accountant (or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 367, 5, 37, 'whatever he was in those days), writing out his accounts in the tax');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 367, 6, 37, 'office where they are always busy keeping their accounts up to date, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 367, 7, 37, 'Jesus walks in and says, “Follow Me!” And he drops his pen, gets up,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 367, 8, 37, 'tells his boss, “Sir, I am resigning. I am following Jesus,” and walks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 367, 9, 37, 'out. He rose and followed Him. It’s quite amazing. I''ve often thought');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 367, 10, 37, 'about this. When you read Scripture, meditate and put yourself in that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 367, 11, 37, 'situation and see what you can learn from there.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 367, 12, 37, 'Wouldn''t it have been better if Jesus went to Matthew’s house later in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 367, 13, 37, 'the evening when he had finished work and returned home? If Jesus went');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 367, 14, 37, 'to Matthew’s home while he was just relaxing there and Jesus said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 367, 15, 37, '“Follow Me,” that would have sounded more reasonable. But a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 367, 16, 37, 'things that sound reasonable to human reason are not God''s ways. God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 367, 17, 37, 'ways are as different from man''s ways as the heaven is above the earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 367, 18, 37, 'God’s way are what we need to learn from the way that Jesus called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 367, 19, 37, 'Matthew.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 367, 20, 37, 'Jesus Always Called Working People');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 367, 21, 37, 'Every single person whom Jesus called, He called from his place of work,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 367, 22, 37, 'whether it was James or John, or Peter or Matthew, or anyone. If it was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 367, 23, 37, 'written that He had called them at home, we would not know if they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 367, 24, 37, 'unemployed people sitting idle at home. But every person He called to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 367, 25, 37, 'a disciple was called from his place of work.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 367, 26, 37, 'There is not even a single exception to that in the Gospels, teaching us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 367, 27, 37, 'one thing - that the Lord calls His disciples from their workplace. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 367, 28, 37, 'calls working people to be His servants. He is not calling the lazy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 368, 1, 37, 'unemployed people who have nothing else to do to be His servants. People');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 368, 2, 37, 'like Samuel in the Old Testament and Timothy in the New Testament are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 368, 3, 37, 'probably an exception. We don''t know whether Timothy was working or not.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 368, 4, 37, 'But the general rule in the New Testament is crystal clear - it’s those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 368, 5, 37, 'who are working whom the Lord calls out to serve Him full time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 368, 6, 37, 'I''m not saying there are no exceptions because this is not a law written');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 368, 7, 37, 'in Scripture. But I see this principle from the example of how Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 368, 8, 37, 'called people. In a country like India, for example, there are many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 368, 9, 37, 'people who are in Christian work today, who never did one honest day’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 368, 10, 37, 'work at a secular job. They were unemployed, so they went to some Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 368, 11, 37, 'School, and then they started serving the Lord. You see the shallow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 368, 12, 37, 'quality of their work.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 368, 13, 37, 'When a person has been employed and he leaves his job in order to serve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 368, 14, 37, 'the Lord full-time, there''s a sacrifice involved. He has to give up a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 368, 15, 37, 'comfortable and consistent source of earning. That would be a pretty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 368, 16, 37, 'good indication that perhaps God has called him. But if an unemployed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 368, 17, 37, 'person is willing to get a job in a Christian organization to be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 368, 18, 37, 'preacher or to serve the Lord, how do you know whether God called him at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 368, 19, 37, 'all? He may be looking for a job. In a country like India, there are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 368, 20, 37, 'thousands of people like that who are ready to join any Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 368, 21, 37, 'organization under the sun to preach whatever doctrine you want them to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 368, 22, 37, 'preach, provided that you pay them a monthly income. There are thousands');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 368, 23, 37, 'of young men and women in India who would be willing to join any Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 368, 24, 37, 'School, not because God has called them, but because they can perhaps');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 368, 25, 37, 'have free boarding and get a degree as well. What more do they want? And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 368, 26, 37, 'then they’ll probably get a job as well in some Christian organization.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 368, 27, 37, 'That is one of the main reasons for the shallowness of a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 368, 28, 37, 'Christian work in India today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 369, 1, 37, 'Why the Disciples Were Called at Work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 369, 2, 37, 'The first reason Matthew was called from his place of work, just like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 369, 3, 37, 'every other disciple, is because that would test whether God has really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 369, 4, 37, 'called them. A person would not give up a well-paying job or sacrifice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 369, 5, 37, 'it just for nothing, just for an empty dream. But a person may be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 369, 6, 37, 'willing to take a risk to do that if he is unemployed since he has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 369, 7, 37, 'nothing to lose. “I am already earning nothing, I don''t have a degree so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 369, 8, 37, 'I might as well try out this so-called Christian work.” And that is how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 369, 9, 37, 'it is with a lot of Christian workers in India today. That, as I said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 369, 10, 37, 'is the reason for the shallowness of Christianity in India today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 369, 11, 37, 'Secondly, it is only a person who has been working in a secular job who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 369, 12, 37, 'can know the pressures of work. It is not easy to work in a secular');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 369, 13, 37, 'situation with difficult bosses, trials, temptations, the pressure of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 369, 14, 37, 'having to get up and go to work and return late in the evening. A person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 369, 15, 37, 'who goes straight into full-time Christian work doesn''t have that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 369, 16, 37, 'pressure of waking up at 6:30 in the morning like some working people,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 369, 17, 37, 'of getting ready quickly to catch a bus, and making sure he is never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 369, 18, 37, 'late on any day. He doesn''t face the pressure of difficult bosses who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 369, 19, 37, 'yell and scream at him and ask him to do all types of difficult, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 369, 20, 37, 'sometimes unrighteous, things. A pastor doesn''t face that week after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 369, 21, 37, 'week. A lot of people in India work six days a week, but a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 369, 22, 37, 'pastors only work one evening and one morning a week. That is a much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 369, 23, 37, 'easier job. Wake up when you like, prepare a few sermons and preach them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 369, 24, 37, 'twice a week. A lot of people would like to quit their secular jobs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 369, 25, 37, 'because a pastor’s job is much easier.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 369, 26, 37, 'Jesus called people who were hardworking and faithful in their jobs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 369, 27, 37, 'because they would have the experience of struggling of earning a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 369, 28, 37, 'living. Even Jesus was a carpenter Who had to struggle to support His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 370, 1, 37, 'four younger brothers, two sisters and His mother (an eight-member');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 370, 2, 37, 'family). He had to work to support them. God the Father allowed Him to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 370, 3, 37, 'be tested for a number of years in that way before He sent Him out to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 370, 4, 37, 'the ministry. That is one important reason why Jesus called people at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 370, 5, 37, 'their place of work.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 370, 6, 37, 'Jesus Came to Call the Sick');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 370, 7, 37, 'As you know, Matthew wrote this gospel. He is talking about himself in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 370, 8, 37, 'the third person when he says, “A man called Matthew.” Matthew himself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 370, 9, 37, 'was writing this account. It says, “Then it happened that as Jesus was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 370, 10, 37, 'reclining at the table in the house” (Matthew 9:10). Matthew doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 370, 11, 37, 'tell us whose house it was, but we know from one of the other gospels');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 370, 12, 37, 'that it was Matthew’s own house. His other name was Levi, and that was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 370, 13, 37, 'his own house. But he was humble enough to not mention that. As Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 370, 14, 37, 'was sitting at the table (they used to recline at the table in those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 370, 15, 37, 'days), there were a lot of tax gatherers and sinners who were dining');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 370, 16, 37, 'with Jesus and His disciples. Matthew was a tax collector himself, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 370, 17, 37, 'he had a great feast in his house for all of his friends, multitudes of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 370, 18, 37, 'tax collectors. He invited a lot of others who were all well-known');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 370, 19, 37, 'sinners in the town. They were all dining with Jesus and His disciples.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 370, 20, 37, 'Matthew must have been a pretty rich man to invite so many guests for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 370, 21, 37, 'meal.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 370, 22, 37, '“When the Pharisee saw this, they said to His disciples, “Why is your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 370, 23, 37, 'Teacher eating with the tax collectors and sinners?” (Matthew 9:11).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 370, 24, 37, 'Everybody knows that the tax collectors are crooks. They look for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 370, 25, 37, 'bribes, they try to harass people. It happens even today. But Jesus was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 370, 26, 37, 'friendly with such people. Jesus is friendly with sinners. “But when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 370, 27, 37, 'Jesus heard this, He said, “It is not those who are healthy who need a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 370, 28, 37, 'physician, but those who are sick. But go and learn what this means: ‘I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 371, 1, 37, 'desire compassion and not sacrifice,’ for I did not come to call the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 371, 2, 37, 'righteous, but sinners” (Matthew 9:12-13). A healthy person doesn''t need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 371, 3, 37, 'a doctor; it’s the sick who need a doctor. Jesus is saying, “These');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 371, 4, 37, 'people whom you call sinners -- whom you call ‘cheating tax collectors,’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 371, 5, 37, '-- are sick and they need my help.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 371, 6, 37, 'Now what about the Pharisees and scribes? Weren’t they sick? They were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 371, 7, 37, 'sicker than anybody else. They had hypocrisy and pride, the worst sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 371, 8, 37, 'of them all. But they were not aware of their need. So Jesus was being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 371, 9, 37, 'sarcastic. There is a place for sarcasm in preaching. Jesus has taught');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 371, 10, 37, 'us to be sarcastic in order to emphasize a point. He calls these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 371, 11, 37, 'terribly sick Pharisees healthy people. He was saying to them, “Since');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 371, 12, 37, 'you think you are healthy, then you don''t need Me, right?” That is what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 371, 13, 37, 'He was saying when He said, “It is not those who are healthy who need a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 371, 14, 37, 'physician, but those who are sick” (Matthew 9:12). He is implying, “You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 371, 15, 37, 'think you''re healthy so I won’t waste My time coming to you. But you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 371, 16, 37, 'not healthy. You are sicker than these other people, but you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 371, 17, 37, 'realize it. But fortunately for these sinners, they realize they''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 371, 18, 37, 'sick. It''s more blessed to realize you’re sick than to be sick and not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 371, 19, 37, 'know it. These other people know that they''re sick, and so they want a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 371, 20, 37, 'doctor. I''m glad to go and help them.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 371, 21, 37, 'The Lord then spoke to the Pharisees and scribes directly because they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 371, 22, 37, 'were passing judgment on the others. “Before you do all your prayers and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 371, 23, 37, 'sacrifices, go and learn what this verse from the Old Testament means:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 371, 24, 37, '‘I desire compassion, and not sacrifice,’ for I did not come to call the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 371, 25, 37, 'righteous, but sinners to repentance” (Matthew 9:13). This is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 371, 26, 37, 'quotation from Hosea 6:6. God desires compassion more than sacrifice. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 371, 27, 37, 'says, “I want you to learn that it is not sacrifice alone that I want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 371, 28, 37, 'from you. I want you to have compassion on people and not just judge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 372, 1, 37, 'them saying, ‘Oh, they are tax collectors and sinners. We''re not sinners');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 372, 2, 37, 'like them.’”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 372, 3, 37, 'For I delight in loyalty rather than sacrifice,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 372, 4, 37, 'And in the knowledge of God rather than burnt offerings.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 372, 5, 37, '(Hosea 6:6)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 372, 6, 37, 'Jesus Was a Friend of Sinners');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 372, 7, 37, 'Jesus is always taking the side of sinners against the Pharisees.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 372, 8, 37, 'Remember the story of the woman caught in adultery? The Pharisees on one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 372, 9, 37, 'side and the woman caught in adultery on the other. Whose side does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 372, 10, 37, 'Jesus take? Whom does He defend? He drives those Pharisees away and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 372, 11, 37, 'tells the woman, “I do not condemn you.” That does not mean He condones');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 372, 12, 37, 'sin. Never! He told the woman, “Don''t ever sin again.” He never condoned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 372, 13, 37, 'any sin, but He never condemned sinners, either.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 372, 14, 37, 'And once again we see the scribes and Pharisees on one side and tax');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 372, 15, 37, 'collectors and sinners on the other, and Jesus takes the side of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 372, 16, 37, 'sinners, and defends them against the accusations of the Pharisees. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 372, 17, 37, 'is a great example for us because we find very few preachers who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 372, 18, 37, 'identify like that and who are the friend of sinners. A lot of preachers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 372, 19, 37, 'are friends with rich people. Jesus was not the friend of rich people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 372, 20, 37, 'Pastors are friendly with the rich people and put them on the boards of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 372, 21, 37, 'their churches because they know they will get money from them. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 372, 22, 37, 'was not interested in anybody''s money, so He did not do that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 372, 23, 37, 'Why Disciples Fast');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 372, 24, 37, '“Then the disciples of John came to Him, asking, “Why do we and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 372, 25, 37, 'Pharisees fast, but Your disciples do not fast?” (Matthew 9:14). They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 372, 26, 37, 'were always coming up with a new question. I personally thank God they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 372, 27, 37, 'asked these questions, because the wonderful answers of Jesus are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 372, 28, 37, 'written in the Scriptures, and they instruct me today. “And Jesus said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 373, 1, 37, 'to them, ‘The attendants of the bridegroom cannot mourn as long as the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 373, 2, 37, 'bridegroom is with them, can they?’” (Matthew 9:15). Jesus is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 373, 3, 37, 'Bridegroom and the Jewish people were the attendants of the Bridegroom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 373, 4, 37, 'As the church today, we are the bride. We are not the attendants of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 373, 5, 37, 'Bridegroom; we are the Bride of Christ. In those days, the church was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 373, 6, 37, 'not yet formed, so they were only the attendants of the Bridegroom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 373, 7, 37, 'Jesus says you can''t fast when the bridegroom is with you. One day the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 373, 8, 37, 'bridegroom will go away, and then they will fast. We see that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 373, 9, 37, 'never commanded people to fast, like some preachers do, and neither');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 373, 10, 37, 'should we. He just stated a fact that when the bridegroom is gone they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 373, 11, 37, 'will fast. In Matthew 6, He said, “When you fast, make sure other people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 373, 12, 37, 'don''t know about it.” He did not command people. Neither did He say ‘if’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 373, 13, 37, 'you fast, as if it was an optional thing. Even here it says, “They will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 373, 14, 37, 'fast.” It doesn''t say, when the bridegroom is taken away, they may fast.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 373, 15, 37, 'That teaches us that one of the reasons for fasting is because our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 373, 16, 37, 'Bridegroom is absent. It is an expression of our longing for Someone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 373, 17, 37, 'Whom we love so much. So in that sense, fasting is an expression of love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 373, 18, 37, 'for an absent Bridegroom. That is what I learn from Matthew 9:15, “But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 373, 19, 37, 'the days will come when the bridegroom is taken away from them, and they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 373, 20, 37, 'will fast.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 373, 21, 37, 'A New Patch on an Old Garment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 373, 22, 37, 'But He goes on to say in the same context, “No one puts a patch of an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 373, 23, 37, 'unshrunk cloth on an old garment.” We all know that when cotton clothes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 373, 24, 37, 'are soaked in water, they tend to shrink. So if there''s a tear in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 373, 25, 37, 'cotton cloth, and you get a new piece of cotton which has not been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 373, 26, 37, 'soaked in water, and stitch it onto the cloth, that new patch will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 373, 27, 37, 'shrink and tear away the garment as soon as it is put in water.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 373, 28, 37, 'So the point is that you can’t get in the New Covenant (which is the new');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 374, 1, 37, 'garment) by taking a patch and putting it into the old garment (which is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 374, 2, 37, 'the Old Covenant). That is what some people are doing. It is a very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 374, 3, 37, 'interesting parable. A lot of Christians live under the law and are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 374, 4, 37, 'frightened when their preachers say that if they don''t tithe, God will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 374, 5, 37, 'punish them, and all types of rubbish like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 374, 6, 37, 'They live under laws, but then they hear a New Covenant message they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 374, 7, 37, 'say, “Hey, that''s a good message. Let me take a patch from that and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 374, 8, 37, 'stitch it onto this life of legalism that I already have.” They hear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 374, 9, 37, 'some new truth like, ‘God is our Father’ or ‘we can overcome sin,’ and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 374, 10, 37, 'patch it on to the Old Covenant. They don''t want to give up the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 374, 11, 37, 'Covenant, even though God has said the Old Covenant is abolished. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 374, 12, 37, 'have not abolished it in their own minds. They have some place in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 374, 13, 37, 'heart devoted to it, but they like “this new thing that Brother Zac is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 374, 14, 37, 'preaching,” so they take that and patch it on. Jesus says that won''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 374, 15, 37, 'work. It will tear the garment and the results won''t be good. Ultimately');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 374, 16, 37, 'it will be worse. It''s far better to just stick with that old garment.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 374, 17, 37, 'What you need to do is throw away the whole garment completely.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 374, 18, 37, 'In the Old Covenant there was a law for the Israelites to fast on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 374, 19, 37, 'certain days. There were no two ways about it. In the New Covenant there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 374, 20, 37, 'is no law that says you must fast. It just doesn''t exist. It says, “When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 374, 21, 37, 'you fast,” or, “They will fast.” We need to know that distinction,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 374, 22, 37, 'because a lot of preachers today are forcing people to fast. Now fasting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 374, 23, 37, 'is a very good thing as a discipline. For example, it is a good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 374, 24, 37, 'discipline to miss all your meals one day in a week. If you can’t do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 374, 25, 37, 'that, at least start with one meal, then two meals, and then three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 374, 26, 37, 'meals. I think it’s a very good discipline. It frees us from the love of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 374, 27, 37, 'food, gives us time to concentrate on something, and gives us the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 374, 28, 37, 'opportunity to show God that we are really interested in what He has to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 375, 1, 37, 'give us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 375, 2, 37, 'The New Covenant Life Is Meant for the New Covenant Church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 375, 3, 37, 'This passage is very relevant, but the point is it must not be done in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 375, 4, 37, 'the Old Covenant way - as a law. There is a difference between a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 375, 5, 37, 'discipline and a law. The other illustration He uses to answer the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 375, 6, 37, 'question about fasting is, “Nor do people put new wine into old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 375, 7, 37, 'wineskins; otherwise the wineskins will burst, and the wine pours out,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 375, 8, 37, 'and the wineskins are ruined; but they put new wine into fresh');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 375, 9, 37, 'wineskins, and both are preserved” (Matthew 9:17). This is a well-known');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 375, 10, 37, 'example. When wine is put into anything, it expands, and if it is put in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 375, 11, 37, 'an old wineskin, it stretches the wineskin. Because the old wineskin is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 375, 12, 37, 'already stretched, it can’t stretch anymore, and so it bursts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 375, 13, 37, 'This is another picture of the Old Covenant versus New Covenant - trying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 375, 14, 37, 'to live this New Covenant life, the new wine, in the Old Covenant system');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 375, 15, 37, '(an approach of tithing and fasting and praying); the whole thing will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 375, 16, 37, 'explode. That is not the way we are supposed to live. Everything in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 375, 17, 37, 'New Covenant life must be put into the New Covenant pattern. The New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 375, 18, 37, 'Covenant life must be in the New Covenant church. We can’t live the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 375, 19, 37, 'Covenant life in an Old Covenant church. That is the mistake a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 375, 20, 37, 'people are making. They like this life, and they try to add it onto');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 375, 21, 37, 'their dead denominational church, which is an Old Covenant system. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 375, 22, 37, 'is what Jesus is speaking of here, not only in relation to fasting, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 375, 23, 37, 'in relation to praying and many other things. So let us take heed to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 375, 24, 37, 'these things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 375, 25, 38, 'Chapter 37 Being Led by the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 375, 26, 38, '“While Jesus was saying these things (He was speaking about fasting, as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 375, 27, 38, 'we previously considered in verses 14-17), there came a synagogue');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 375, 28, 38, 'official who bowed down before Him saying, ‘My daughter has just died,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 376, 1, 38, 'but come and lay Your hand on her and she will live.’ Jesus rose and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 376, 2, 38, 'began to follow him, and so did his disciples. And behold, a woman who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 376, 3, 38, 'had been suffering from a hemorrhage for twelve years came up behind Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 376, 4, 38, 'and touched the fringe of His cloak; for she was saying to herself, ‘If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 376, 5, 38, 'I only touch his garment, I should get well.’ Jesus turned, and seeing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 376, 6, 38, 'her, said, ‘Daughter, take courage, your faith has made you well.’ At');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 376, 7, 38, 'once, the woman was made well” (Matthew 9:18-22).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 376, 8, 38, 'Jesus Made Room for Interruptions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 376, 9, 38, 'One thing we see here by Jesus’ actions, and something we learn of what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 376, 10, 38, 'we are to do in our life as well, is that He was willing to have His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 376, 11, 38, 'program interrupted by people in need. We can often have such a rigid');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 376, 12, 38, 'program that we have made out for ourselves (of course, it is good to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 376, 13, 38, 'have a program and to be disciplined so that we don''t waste time in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 376, 14, 38, 'life), but we must at times allow those programs of ours to be modified');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 376, 15, 38, 'or changed depending on circumstances, situations, and people who come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 376, 16, 38, 'to us, who are in need. If I''m so rigid in my program that I''m unwilling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 376, 17, 38, 'to interrupt it with anything - if I won''t even allow a person in need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 376, 18, 38, 'to interrupt me - then I''m more rigid than Jesus Himself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 376, 19, 38, 'Jesus didn''t have a fixed program laid out in the beginning saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 376, 20, 38, '“Nobody''s going to disturb Me. I''m going to do this and if somebody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 376, 21, 38, 'needs something, they’ll have to wait.” Instead, He was talking to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 376, 22, 38, 'people and He was engaged in something, and someone interrupted Him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 376, 23, 38, 'asking that He please lay His hand on a sick child. And it says in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 376, 24, 38, 'Matthew 9:19 that immediately, Jesus rose up and went. Then, on the way,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 376, 25, 38, 'a woman who was sick touched Him and, again, He stopped and turned to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 376, 26, 38, 'speak to her, comfort her, and encourage her.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 376, 27, 38, 'This was His whole way of life. Nicodemus came and disturbed Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 376, 28, 38, 'probably around midnight, we read in John 3, and Jesus opened the door');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 377, 1, 38, 'to His house and said, “Come right in! Let''s sit down and talk.” He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 377, 2, 38, 'not bothered about how long Nicodemus would sit and speak, or how long');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 377, 3, 38, 'He would be disturbed, or any such thing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 377, 4, 38, 'This is a very important principle in the Lord''s work: anyone who is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 377, 5, 38, 'willing to be inconvenienced like this and to change his program will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 377, 6, 38, 'not be able to serve the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 377, 7, 38, 'We Need Wisdom to Discern God’s Will Amidst Interruptions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 377, 8, 38, 'At the same time, we need the wisdom to know whether we should allow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 377, 9, 38, 'ourselves to be disturbed in some cases. That''s where, once again,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 377, 10, 38, 'there''s no law. Even what I''ve said just now is not a rule, but a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 377, 11, 38, 'principle that we see in Jesus’ life. We must be sensitive to the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 377, 12, 38, 'Spirit because there are multitudes of Christians and others who would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 377, 13, 38, 'like to disturb us day and night, particularly if our ministry expands,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 377, 14, 38, 'and we need to be sensitive to see which of those we should respond to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 377, 15, 38, 'and which we should not. Those of you who are more well-known among');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 377, 16, 38, 'others in the ministry might get a lot of invitations from here and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 377, 17, 38, 'there, and if you decide to respond to every single invitation, you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 377, 18, 38, 'miss God’s will for your life. You need to know which of those you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 377, 19, 38, 'should accept and which you should not. Even Jesus rejected many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 377, 20, 38, 'invitations.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 377, 21, 38, 'For example, we read in Luke 4:42 that early in the morning, Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 377, 22, 38, 'departed and went to a lonely place and He was praying there, obviously');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 377, 23, 38, 'seeking the Father’s will for the day. There had been a great revival');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 377, 24, 38, 'the previous evening, and He was seeking Father, asking, “Do you want Me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 377, 25, 38, 'to stay here? It looks as though there''s a great moving of the Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 377, 26, 38, 'here…” And the multitudes searched for Him and they tried to keep Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 377, 27, 38, 'from going away from them. What they told Him was, “Lord, we need You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 377, 28, 38, 'here. People experienced an unexpected revival here yesterday. Don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 378, 1, 38, 'walk away from it! You’ve got to stay and build upon the foundation You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 378, 2, 38, 'laid yesterday!” But He said to them, “No. I''m not going to stay.” He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 378, 3, 38, 'refused their invitation saying, “I must preach the kingdom of God to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 378, 4, 38, 'other cities where I was sent for this purpose.” So He went on.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 378, 5, 38, 'No Laws in the New Covenant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 378, 6, 38, 'I mention this to show that Jesus didn''t accept every single invitation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 378, 7, 38, 'He knew which ones to accept and which ones to reject. So again, we come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 378, 8, 38, 'to that principle that I''ve been emphasizing, that there are no laws in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 378, 9, 38, 'the New Covenant. We live by the Holy Spirit, and the Holy Spirit leads');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 378, 10, 38, 'us in each particular case. Those who want to live by a rule or a law');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 378, 11, 38, 'will make even these principles that I''m teaching into laws and rules,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 378, 12, 38, 'and seek to live by them, and thereby go completely out of the will of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 378, 13, 38, 'God. There is one principle in the New Covenant: we must be led by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 378, 14, 38, 'Holy Spirit. “Those who are being led by the Spirit are the sons of God”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 378, 15, 38, '(Romans 8:14). That''s more difficult.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 378, 16, 38, 'Man would rather live by a law than by the Spirit. When Adam was in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 378, 17, 38, 'Garden of Eden, he chose the tree of knowledge of good and evil, which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 378, 18, 38, 'is a picture of the law. The law teaches us what is good and what is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 378, 19, 38, 'evil, and there’s nothing wrong with it, but Scripture says that those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 378, 20, 38, 'who try to live under the law will die spiritually. The other tree in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 378, 21, 38, 'the Garden of Eden was the tree of life, which symbolizes living by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 378, 22, 38, 'power of the Holy Spirit. Adam faced a choice between the two trees, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 378, 23, 38, 'he moved towards law. The Israelites then spent fifteen hundred years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 378, 24, 38, 'under the law, and even though the law was abolished about two thousand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 378, 25, 38, 'years ago - the Lord showed us in the Sermon on the Mount a higher');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 378, 26, 38, 'principle to live by and an inner witness - Christians still seem to go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 378, 27, 38, 'back to the law.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 378, 28, 38, 'I''m not saying that the commandments are not important all. What I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 379, 1, 38, 'saying is that you can obey those commandments in the Spirit of the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 379, 2, 38, 'Covenant, that is, the Spirit of the law according to the letter, which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 379, 3, 38, 'kills. 2 Corinthians 3:6 says, “The letter kills but the Spirit gives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 379, 4, 38, 'life,” and even the letter of the New Testament can kill if you try to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 379, 5, 38, 'follow it according to the letter. Look at the number of denominations');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 379, 6, 38, 'and cults that have come up by people concentrating on one verse in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 379, 7, 38, 'New Testament or something like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 379, 8, 38, 'There''s only one principle we are called to live by, which we see in 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 379, 9, 38, 'John 2:6: “He who says he is a Christian must walk as Jesus walked” - he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 379, 10, 38, 'must live as Jesus lived. And Jesus lived not according to law, but He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 379, 11, 38, 'lived by the witness of the Spirit within Him. That is the most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 379, 12, 38, 'effective way to live.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 379, 13, 38, 'Seek the Inner Witness of the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 379, 14, 38, 'I don’t want you to misunderstand and think that whenever a person calls');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 379, 15, 38, 'us, we have to interrupt what we are doing and cancel our program just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 379, 16, 38, 'because somebody has called us to visit his home. Not at all. We should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 379, 17, 38, 'understand the principle, that we must be willing to be disturbed at any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 379, 18, 38, 'time, truly any time. I remember once in my own life when I was very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 379, 19, 38, 'busy writing a Christian article that I needed to finish because there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 379, 20, 38, 'was a fast-approaching deadline, I heard the doorbell ring. I opened the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 379, 21, 38, 'door and I found someone whom I had never met in my life, a total');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 379, 22, 38, 'stranger. He said, “Brother Zac, I read a book of yours as a young man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 379, 23, 38, 'and I want to have just a chat with you.” I could have turned him away');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 379, 24, 38, 'from the door saying, “Hey listen, I''m busy writing a Christian article,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 379, 25, 38, 'so can you come back later?” But he had come from out of town, so I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 379, 26, 38, 'said, “Okay, come in.” I thought he would sit for two or three minutes,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 379, 27, 38, 'but he sat for a long time, and as I listened to him, I saw that he was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 379, 28, 38, 'a person with need and that I could help him. He left my home an hour or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 380, 1, 38, 'two later. Here was a person who was in need, and when he eventually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 380, 2, 38, 'went away, really satisfied and blessed, the Lord spoke to me and said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 380, 3, 38, '“I have asked you to go into all the world and make disciples, and here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 380, 4, 38, 'I sent someone right to your door so that you don''t have to go outside.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 380, 5, 38, 'He comes to you, and then you spend the whole time waiting for him to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 380, 6, 38, 'leave (because I had been getting impatient until I saw that he was in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 380, 7, 38, 'need).” I said, “Okay, I will sit with him as long as he wants.” I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 380, 8, 38, 'learnt something that day, and I said, “Lord, let that never happen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 380, 9, 38, 'again. Whenever I see a witness in my spirit, then I must spend time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 380, 10, 38, 'with this person. I must be willing to cancel my programs or postpone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 380, 11, 38, 'them.” So I went back to my writing, just sitting up a little later that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 380, 12, 38, 'night to complete my article.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 380, 13, 38, 'The Lord will test us in things like this to see whether we have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 380, 14, 38, 'spirit that''s willing to serve others while following the witness of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 380, 15, 38, 'Spirit. If you don''t follow the witness of the Spirit, and you say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 380, 16, 38, '“I''ve got a law that I’m going to serve everybody who comes to me,”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 380, 17, 38, 'you''ll have a nervous breakdown without any doubt. You’ll wear yourself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 380, 18, 38, 'out. The inner witness of the Spirit is the ultimate thing that we learn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 380, 19, 38, 'from all these examples that we''re looking at in the life of Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 380, 20, 38, 'Discouraging Words Are Not from God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 380, 21, 38, 'As we continue in Matthew 19, we read that Jesus told the woman who had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 380, 22, 38, 'touched Him, “‘Daughter, take courage, your faith has made you well,’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 380, 23, 38, 'and at once, the woman was made well.” Consider that word: take courage.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 380, 24, 38, 'Jesus was always encouraging people; never did He discourage people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 380, 25, 38, '“Take courage” means, “be encouraged.” “Be encouraged,” He would say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 380, 26, 38, '“Don''t be afraid. Fear not, be encouraged.” Words that people speak to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 380, 27, 38, 'us that discourage us and put fear into our hearts are not from God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 380, 28, 38, 'God does not give us a spirit of fear or a spirit of condemnation. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 381, 1, 38, 'have to be very careful when you listen to a message or a word that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 381, 2, 38, 'somebody gives you. If you find it brings fear and condemnation, reject');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 381, 3, 38, 'it immediately. God is a God of encouragement, not a God who discourages');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 381, 4, 38, 'us or puts fear into your heart. “Be encouraged, daughter, your faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 381, 5, 38, 'has made you well.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 381, 6, 38, 'Notice in all of these examples that it is faith that Jesus looked for,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 381, 7, 38, 'it is faith that He was delighted to see, and which He emphasized in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 381, 8, 38, 'each of these cases (your faith or your lack of faith). There’s one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 381, 9, 38, 'thing we learn from all this: the Lord wants us to live by faith - in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 381, 10, 38, 'total trust in Him. Leaning upon Him, depending upon Him - this is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 381, 11, 38, 'true Christian life. All of the Bible knowledge we have, and all of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 381, 12, 38, 'wonderful doctrines we know, and all the wonderful things we can teach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 381, 13, 38, 'and preach, are worthless if we don''t know how to live in total');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 381, 14, 38, 'dependence upon God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 381, 15, 38, 'Jesus Did Not Raise and Heal Everyone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 381, 16, 38, 'In Matthew 9:23, when Jesus came into the house of Jairus, the official,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 381, 17, 38, 'and saw the flute players and the crowd in noisy disorder because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 381, 18, 38, 'Jairus’ daughter had died, Jesus began to say, “Depart, for the girl has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 381, 19, 38, 'not died but is asleep,” and they began laughing at Him. There were many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 381, 20, 38, 'people who died in Israel during those three and a half years of Jesus’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 381, 21, 38, 'ministry, and as far as we know, He raised only three of them from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 381, 22, 38, 'dead. One was Lazarus, one was Jairus'' daughter, and the other was the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 381, 23, 38, 'widow of Nain’s son. Surely those are not the only three people whom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 381, 24, 38, 'Jesus heard of who had died in those three and a half years of ministry;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 381, 25, 38, 'there must be many people who died, and people must have heard about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 381, 26, 38, 'Jesus raising somebody from the dead, and they may have gone to Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 381, 27, 38, 'saying, “Please come! Somebody has died here!” Jesus did not spend three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 381, 28, 38, 'and a half years raising everybody who died from the dead in Israel -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 382, 1, 38, 'this is very important to understand.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 382, 2, 38, 'What was the principle at work here? It was not that these three were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 382, 3, 38, 'special to God. It was not that these three people had some special');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 382, 4, 38, 'faith. We don''t find Jairus (or anybody else at his house) having any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 382, 5, 38, 'great faith, and we don''t find the widow of Nain, Mary, or Martha having');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 382, 6, 38, 'much faith either. But again, Jesus was led by the Holy Spirit. He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 382, 7, 38, 'prompted by the Holy Spirit to go and raise a particular person from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 382, 8, 38, 'dead.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 382, 9, 38, 'There is another instance when Jesus heard that around a hundred people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 382, 10, 38, 'died, but He had no witness from the Spirit to go there. Again, we see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 382, 11, 38, 'the same principle consistently: it''s not a uniform law like “Thou shall');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 382, 12, 38, 'raise everyone from the dead.” No. Neither was it the opposite, like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 382, 13, 38, '“Thou shall raise no one from the dead.” It was always the leading of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 382, 14, 38, 'the Holy Spirit: sometimes, “Do it,” sometimes, “Don''t do it.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 382, 15, 38, 'Consider the time when Jesus went to the pool of Bethesda in Jerusalem.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 382, 16, 38, 'We read in John 5:3 that when He went there, a great multitude');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 382, 17, 38, '(multitude means a lot people, maybe 300 - 500, I don''t know for sure)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 382, 18, 38, 'who were sick, blind, lame, and withered (means paralyzed) were waiting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 382, 19, 38, 'for the moving of the water. And a certain man was there who had been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 382, 20, 38, 'there for 38 years, and Jesus went up to him and asked, “Do you wish to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 382, 21, 38, 'get well?” That man also didn''t seem to have such great faith, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 382, 22, 38, 'he made excuses saying, “I wish I could jump into the pool before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 382, 23, 38, 'anybody else. Only one man is healed when the waters move, and I never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 382, 24, 38, 'seem to get to there in time to be the first person. Somebody else comes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 382, 25, 38, 'and steps in before me, and I miss it. I have missed it for 38 years.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 382, 26, 38, 'Jesus could have rebuked him for making excuses. Instead, He just said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 382, 27, 38, 'to him, “Arise, take up your bed and walk” and then He went away.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 382, 28, 38, 'What about the other 500 people who were sick? Why didn’t Jesus go to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 383, 1, 38, 'them and ask them if they wanted to get well? Again we see that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 383, 2, 38, 'didn''t heal everybody. He left potentially hundreds of people there sick');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 383, 3, 38, 'and healed only one person. Why? The principle is that He was led by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 383, 4, 38, 'Holy Spirit. One day when God makes everything plain, we''ll understand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 383, 5, 38, 'the broader reason for this. Today we see darkly, but for us, it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 383, 6, 38, 'enough to know that if we live by the Spirit, we’ll never miss the will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 383, 7, 38, 'of God. There are things God wants us to do, and if we listen to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 383, 8, 38, 'Spirit, we will do them. If we don''t listen to the Spirit, we will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 383, 9, 38, 'do them. There are also things God does not want us to do, and if we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 383, 10, 38, 'listen to the Spirit, we will avoid them. If we don''t listen to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 383, 11, 38, 'Spirit, we will go and do them, and probably mess up God''s work. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 383, 12, 38, 'are things which, if we do them, will hinder God’s work.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 383, 13, 38, 'When Doing Good Hinders God’s Work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 383, 14, 38, 'I will give you one example of that from the Acts of the Apostles. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 383, 15, 38, 'Chapter 3, we read that Peter went to the beautiful gate of the temple');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 383, 16, 38, 'and there he saw a man who had been lame from his mother''s womb, who was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 383, 17, 38, 'being carried along (Acts 3:2). They used to sit him down at the gate of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 383, 18, 38, 'the temple, which is called Beautiful, and in Acts chapter 4, it tells');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 383, 19, 38, 'us that this man was over forty years old. I don''t know how many years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 383, 20, 38, 'they had been bringing him to the temple - maybe they had been bringing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 383, 21, 38, 'him every day to the gate of the temple for 10 or 20 years. He stretched');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 383, 22, 38, 'out his hand to Peter, asking for alms, and Peter said, “Look at me. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 383, 23, 38, 'don''t have any money, but I''ll give you what I have. In the name of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 383, 24, 38, 'Jesus, rise up and walk.” And he walked (Acts 3:4-6).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 383, 25, 38, 'Surely this man must have been there during the last 3-4 years, when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 383, 26, 38, 'Jesus regularly came into that temple. If so, Jesus would walk past that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 383, 27, 38, 'gate called Beautiful and every day, He would see this lame man sitting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 383, 28, 38, 'there asking for alms. Did Jesus say what Peter said? No. Jesus would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 384, 1, 38, 'give him some money, or He would tell Judas to give him some money, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 384, 2, 38, 'He would move on. And He would see him the next day. For the three and a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 384, 3, 38, 'half years He was there, Jesus never healed that man. And why? Because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 384, 4, 38, 'the Spirit said, “Don’t heal him.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 384, 5, 38, 'Consider now if Jesus had actually healed him, then what would have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 384, 6, 38, 'happened? The revival that took place because of this healing (in Acts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 384, 7, 38, '4) would never have taken place. We read in Acts 4:4 that, because of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 384, 8, 38, 'this man''s healing, many of those who had heard the message believed,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 384, 9, 38, 'and the number of them came to be 5,000. It was all because of this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 384, 10, 38, 'man''s healing. As you read in the whole section there, 5,000 people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 384, 11, 38, 'believed it. I don''t know how many actually converted that day, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 384, 12, 38, 'maybe hundreds or perhaps thousands, and it was a result of this lame');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 384, 13, 38, 'man not being healed by Jesus one or two years earlier, but instead, his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 384, 14, 38, 'being healed now by Peter. If Jesus had healed him, he wouldn’t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 384, 15, 38, 'been at the Beautiful gate of the temple, and the people wouldn''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 384, 16, 38, 'seen the miracle in Acts 4.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 384, 17, 38, 'If Jesus had not listened to the Spirit, and just said, “Oh, I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 384, 18, 38, 'compassion on this sick man, let Me just heal him whether the Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 384, 19, 38, 'prompts Me or not. I have the gift of healing,” then He would have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 384, 20, 38, 'hindered the work of the Father. That''s just one example of how many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 384, 21, 38, 'Christians hinder the work God by doing something, which their reason');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 384, 22, 38, 'says is a good thing. What''s wrong in helping someone needy? There''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 384, 23, 38, 'nothing wrong inherently. The question is whether or not the Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 384, 24, 38, 'leads you to do it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 384, 25, 38, 'Another example is if a prodigal son is living next door to you and he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 384, 26, 38, 'is eating what the pigs are eating, you can, of course, help him; but if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 384, 27, 38, 'you keep on helping him with food, he’ll never go back to his father''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 384, 28, 38, 'house. There can be a soulish compassion, which prevents the prodigal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 385, 1, 38, 'son from ever going back to his father’s house. God was disciplining');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 385, 2, 38, 'that young boy, and he needed to be disciplined so that he would go back');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 385, 3, 38, 'to his father''s house, but if some soulish Christian goes and helps him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 385, 4, 38, 'financially, with food, then the son misses out on going back to his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 385, 5, 38, 'father''s house.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 385, 6, 38, 'The Holy Spirit Will Lead Us as He Led Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 385, 7, 38, 'These are examples we see in Scripture of how doing things according to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 385, 8, 38, 'our own reason, and not by the leading of the Spirit, can cause a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 385, 9, 38, 'problems. Jesus was always listening to the prompting of the Spirit, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 385, 10, 38, 'this is the case with Jairus’ daughter as well. The crowd had been put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 385, 11, 38, 'out (Matthew 9:25), and Jesus entered and took her by the hands. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 385, 12, 38, 'were only three people He took with him into the room - Peter, James and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 385, 13, 38, 'John. He drove out people who were just causing a problem there and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 385, 14, 38, 'said, “You don''t believe anything, don''t stand here.” He then gathered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 385, 15, 38, 'just a few, as He didn''t want to show something fantastic. He didn’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 385, 16, 38, 'think, “You know, I''m going to raise the dead and it''s good that all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 385, 17, 38, 'these people see it,” for that would have been human reason-foolishness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 385, 18, 38, 'He didn’t want anybody to see it. He went inside, He raised her from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 385, 19, 38, 'dead, and He just moved on. He didn’t even stay there. Then this news');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 385, 20, 38, 'went out into all that land.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 385, 21, 38, 'This is what Jesus is teaching us by His life: we must be sensitive to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 385, 22, 38, 'the Holy Spirit in our ministry. We must respond where the Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 385, 23, 38, 'prompts us. In my early years, I didn''t understand this principle. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 385, 24, 38, 'thought I had to meet the need everywhere - that because I have a gift');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 385, 25, 38, 'and am able to teach, I must go here and there and preach. I’ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 385, 26, 38, 'discovered that''s not the way of God. The way of God is to live by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 385, 27, 38, 'tree of life, which is by the promptings the Holy Spirit. Think of this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 385, 28, 38, 'lovely verse, Isaiah 30:21, which finds its fulfillment in the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 386, 1, 38, 'Covenant: “Your ears will hear a word behind you saying, ‘This is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 386, 2, 38, 'way, walk in it’ when you turn to the right or turn to the left.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 386, 3, 38, 'That’s how we''re supposed to live every day, listening to and turning to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 386, 4, 38, 'the Spirit of God as He says, “Now go here, now go there,” or, “Don''t go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 386, 5, 38, 'there.” The Lord is looking for people who will respond to His call and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 386, 6, 38, 'go where He tells them to go, and who do not go where He does not permit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 386, 7, 38, 'them to go.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 386, 8, 38, 'That is the way we are to serve the Lord. The Spirit of God is faithful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 386, 9, 38, 'This promise in Isaiah 30:21 says, “Your eyes will see your Teacher,”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 386, 10, 38, 'that is, Jesus. You see His example -- you will see Him in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 386, 11, 38, 'particular situation -- and then you can walk as He walked. Your ears');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 386, 12, 38, 'will hear a Voice saying, “Turn to the right, turn to the left, don''t go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 386, 13, 38, 'there.” This is not only in relation to avoiding temptation; it’s also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 386, 14, 38, 'in relation to fulfilling God’s will. The Spirit of God is very faithful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 386, 15, 38, 'to steer us away from places where we will be unnecessarily tempted, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 386, 16, 38, 'to steer us away from places where we’ll waste our time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 386, 17, 38, 'May God help us to walk this way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 386, 18, 39, 'Chapter 38 Praying Specifically with Faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 386, 19, 39, 'Be Specific in Your Prayer Requests');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 386, 20, 39, '“As Jesus went on from there, two blind men followed Him, crying out,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 386, 21, 39, '‘Have mercy on us, Son of David!’ When He entered the house, the blind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 386, 22, 39, 'men came up to Him, and Jesus said to them, ‘Do you believe that I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 386, 23, 39, 'able to do this?’ They said to Him, ‘Yes, Lord.’” - Matthew 9:27-28');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 386, 24, 39, 'We see a similar incident in Luke 18:41 (and Mark 10:51), where he had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 386, 25, 39, 'asked Jesus to have mercy on him. But Jesus asked the blind man there,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 386, 26, 39, '“What do you want me to do for you? The Lord wanted him to be specific:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 386, 27, 39, '“What exactly do you want me to do for you?” That is very important. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 386, 28, 39, 'Bible speaks about prayer and supplication. Here we see a general');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 387, 1, 39, 'prayer, “Have mercy on me.” And then a specific prayer, “I want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 387, 2, 39, 'regain my sight.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 387, 3, 39, '“Have mercy on us” is a general prayer, but the Lord wants us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 387, 4, 39, 'acknowledge our condition and be specific. We can say, “Lord, I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 387, 5, 39, 'blind. Lord, I am a slave to internet pornography. Lord, I am a slave to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 387, 6, 39, 'hatred. Lord, I am a slave to jealousy and bitterness.” We like to be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 387, 7, 39, 'little holy and say, “Lord, I would like to be free from all sin.” But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 387, 8, 39, 'the Lord asks us, “But which one? What do you want me to do for you?”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 387, 9, 39, 'We can tell the Lord where we are constantly being defeated and be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 387, 10, 39, 'specific with the Lord. The Lord loves those who point out exactly what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 387, 11, 39, 'they are and where they are failing. That is the first principle.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 387, 12, 39, 'General prayers really take us nowhere.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 387, 13, 39, 'Do You Believe Jesus Can Do It?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 387, 14, 39, 'Once we have made our specific request known to God, we still do not get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 387, 15, 39, 'our request answered. There is one more step, and that is faith. Do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 387, 16, 39, 'believe that He is able to do this? The question it is not, “Do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 387, 17, 39, 'believe that you can do this?” The question is, “Do you believe that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 387, 18, 39, 'can do this for you?” The blind men said to Him, “Yes, Lord.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 387, 19, 39, 'What do we learn from this about Jesus? We learn the same principle of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 387, 20, 39, 'faith that we have been considering in all these passages. Jesus is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 387, 21, 39, 'always looking for faith. Jesus is amazed when He sees faith. He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 387, 22, 39, 'disturbed and saddened when He sees unbelief. He is always encouraged');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 387, 23, 39, 'whenever He sees faith. He encourages people by saying, “Your faith will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 387, 24, 39, 'save you. You were healed because of your faith.” Again, Jesus asks the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 387, 25, 39, 'blind men, “Do you trust in Me? Do you believe I can do this for you?”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 387, 26, 39, 'There are many promises in Scripture you can look at and say are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 387, 27, 39, 'impossible. What about opening the eyes of a blind man? Impossible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 387, 28, 39, 'These blind men have never heard of anyone opening the eyes of blind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 388, 1, 39, 'people in their entire life. They were trying to believe in something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 388, 2, 39, 'that everybody in Israel considered impossible, but they said, “Yes,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 388, 3, 39, 'Lord. We believe you have the power. We would not trust these Pharisees,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 388, 4, 39, 'but we trust You.” And they got what they wanted. Jesus said, “Be it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 388, 5, 39, 'done for you according to your faith.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 388, 6, 39, 'We Receive According to How Much We Believe, Not How Much We Want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 388, 7, 39, 'It is not according to your desire, but according to your faith. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 388, 8, 39, 'will receive from God not according to how much you want or how much God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 388, 9, 39, 'wants to give you, but according to how much you believe that God can do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 388, 10, 39, 'for you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 388, 11, 39, 'This is a principle of Christianity. No religion in the world except for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 388, 12, 39, 'Christianity teaches us that we receive from God not according to our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 388, 13, 39, 'desire or God’s desire, but according to our faith. Our desire may be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 388, 14, 39, 'huge. God''s desire to bless us may be immense, but we do not get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 388, 15, 39, 'anything. For example, God wants to bless you with rivers of living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 388, 16, 39, 'water flowing through you. It is certainly His desire because we read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 388, 17, 39, 'that in John 7:38. If you only get a cup of water, that is because of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 388, 18, 39, 'the measure of your faith. You do not believe that the rivers will ever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 388, 19, 39, 'flow through you because you say, “I am so weak. I am so insignificant.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 388, 20, 39, 'You keep looking inside. It is like blind men saying, “Lord, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 388, 21, 39, 'struggled for so many years to see, but we have not succeeded.” Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 388, 22, 39, 'said, “Do you believe I can do this for you?” He was not looking at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 388, 23, 39, 'their ability. He was asking them whether they trusted His ability. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 388, 24, 39, 'is faith. Do you believe that the Lord can do this for you? He has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 388, 25, 39, 'promised it in Scripture.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 388, 26, 39, 'One Eye Versus Two Eyes Opened');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 388, 27, 39, 'There are many areas where this principle – it shall be done to you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 388, 28, 39, 'according to your faith - can be applied. For example, what if one of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 389, 1, 39, 'those blind men had said, “Lord, I believe You can open one eye. But I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 389, 2, 39, 'am not so sure whether You have the power to open both. But I believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 389, 3, 39, 'with all my heart that You can open one eye.” That blind man would have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 389, 4, 39, 'left with one eye open. If the other blind man had said, “Lord, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 389, 5, 39, 'believe you can open both eyes,” then he would have left with two eyes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 389, 6, 39, 'open. This is what is happening in Christianity today. Some believe only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 389, 7, 39, 'one part. Some believe both parts. They separate into groups and become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 389, 8, 39, 'different denominations. The only difference is that one group believed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 389, 9, 39, 'that God could do exactly what He promised.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 389, 10, 39, 'Rejoice in the Lord Always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 389, 11, 39, 'For example, there is a command in Philippians 4:4 which says, “Rejoice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 389, 12, 39, 'in the Lord always.” This means twenty four hours a day, seven days a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 389, 13, 39, 'week. In a sense, those who do not rejoice at all are like blind people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 389, 14, 39, 'and those who rejoice always are the ones with both eyes open. The Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 389, 15, 39, 'says to these blind people, “Do you believe I can do this in your life?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 389, 16, 39, 'Do you believe that I can bring you into a certain quality of life where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 389, 17, 39, 'you will rejoice always, 24 hours a day, 7 days a week?” If you say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 389, 18, 39, '“Lord, I am not so sure. My temperament is so moody. I am melancholy. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 389, 19, 39, 'do not think I can rejoice always.” Then the Lord’s answer will be,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 389, 20, 39, '“According to your faith, be it done to you. You will rejoice most of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 389, 21, 39, 'the time.” Another person says, “Lord, I am more moody and more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 389, 22, 39, 'melancholy than that other guy, but I believe you can do this for me.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 389, 23, 39, 'This man will rejoice always. He will come into a glorious life where he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 389, 24, 39, 'is never in a bad mood. He will never be discouraged, but always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 389, 25, 39, 'rejoicing. What is the difference between the two? The second man''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 389, 26, 39, 'temperament is worse, but he came into a higher life because he believed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 389, 27, 39, 'that God could do it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 389, 28, 39, 'There could be many similar things in your life which God has promised');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 390, 1, 39, 'in His Word. But you have not experienced it because you do not believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 390, 2, 39, 'God can do it for you. You are always looking at your own ability to see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 390, 3, 39, 'if you can achieve it. For example, God’s promise is that sin shall not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 390, 4, 39, 'have dominion over you. You can look at yourself and ask, “Can I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 390, 5, 39, 'overcome this?” But the question is not whether you can overcome this.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 390, 6, 39, 'The question is whether you believe God can do it for you. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 390, 7, 39, 'fundamental principle is that it is not how much you can accomplish, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 390, 8, 39, 'how much God can accomplish on the basis of faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 390, 9, 39, 'From “You Shall” (Old Covenant) to “I Will” (New Covenant)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 390, 10, 39, 'This is one of the big differences between law and grace. In Exodus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 390, 11, 39, '20:2-17, the law said, “I am the Lord your God. Thou shalt have no other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 390, 12, 39, 'gods, but Me. Thou shalt not worship idols. Thou shalt not take the name');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 390, 13, 39, 'of the Lord thy God in vain. Thou shalt keep the Sabbath day holy. Thou');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 390, 14, 39, 'shalt honor thy father and mother. Thou shall not murder. Thou shall not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 390, 15, 39, 'commit adultery. Thou shall not steal. Thou shall not covet your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 390, 16, 39, 'neighbor’s wife.” The Ten Commandments are full of “thou shall not’s.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 390, 17, 39, 'Israel tried to obey it for 1,500 years, but they did not succeed. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 390, 18, 39, 'could not keep all of it. They could keep some of them, but James 2:10');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 390, 19, 39, 'says that if you keep most of them and miss out on one of them, you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 390, 20, 39, 'as guilty as those who disobeyed everything. It is like whether you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 390, 21, 39, 'one hole in a vessel or ten holes in a vessel. The vessel is still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 390, 22, 39, 'useless. Whether you disobeyed one commandment or ten commandments, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 390, 23, 39, 'are considered guilty.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 390, 24, 39, 'In the New Covenant, it is entirely different. If you compare Exodus 20');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 390, 25, 39, 'with Hebrews 8, it says in Hebrews 8 that the Old Covenant has been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 390, 26, 39, 'abolished. The New Covenant has been established because the first was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 390, 27, 39, 'faulty, and the Old Covenant is obsolete (Hebrews 8:7). The Old Covenant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 390, 28, 39, 'is ready to disappear (Hebrews 8:13), and the Lord will make a New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 391, 1, 39, 'Covenant (Hebrews 8:8). Look at the terms of this New Covenant. There is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 391, 2, 39, 'no “thou shall not.” The Ten Commandments was full of “thou shall');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 391, 3, 39, 'not’s”. But the New Covenant is, “I will. I will. I will.” God says “I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 391, 4, 39, 'will” five times in Hebrews 8:8-12.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 391, 5, 39, 'When this New Covenant is prophesied in the Old Testament in Ezekiel,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 391, 6, 39, 'notice how it is mentioned there. This is a prophecy about the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 391, 7, 39, 'Covenant. Ezekiel 36:25 says, “I will sprinkle clean water on you. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 391, 8, 39, 'will be clean.” This is speaking about cleansing from sin symbolically');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 391, 9, 39, 'using water. Ezekiel 36:26-27 says, “I will give you a new heart. I will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 391, 10, 39, 'put a new Spirit within you. I will remove the heart of stone from your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 391, 11, 39, 'flesh, and I will give you a heart of flesh. I will put my Spirit within');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 391, 12, 39, 'you. I will cause you to walk in my statutes and then you will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 391, 13, 39, 'careful to keep my ordinances.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 391, 14, 39, 'The promises in Ezekiel 36:25-27 are fulfilled the New Covenant. God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 391, 15, 39, 'saying, “I will.” That is the important point from I wanted you to see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 391, 16, 39, 'in the healing of the blind men (Matthew 9). It is not how much you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 391, 17, 39, 'keep the commandments. It is not “you shall” and “you shall not”. People');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 391, 18, 39, 'go to church meetings today and hear many commandments. , “This is how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 391, 19, 39, 'you must live. You must not do this and you must not do that.” This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 391, 20, 39, 'all good.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 391, 21, 39, 'Commandments Are like Gadgets');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 391, 22, 39, 'The New Testament has commandments as well, but the question is, “How');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 391, 23, 39, 'are you supposed to keep them?” The commandments are all good. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 391, 24, 39, 'like having a whole lot of gadgets in your house. Suppose you have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 391, 25, 39, 'refrigerator or a washing machine or some other electronic gadget. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 391, 26, 39, 'are extremely useful. You might think you are better than another man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 391, 27, 39, 'who has none of these gadgets in his house. But are you? If you do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 391, 28, 39, 'have electricity your home, it is just as bad as the other man who does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 392, 1, 39, 'not have these gadgets. Here is one person who has got so many wonderful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 392, 2, 39, 'laws like these gadgets, but he does not have the power of the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 392, 3, 39, 'Spirit. Here is another person who is a non-Christian and does not have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 392, 4, 39, 'any laws or commandments. He is in the same condition as this man who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 392, 5, 39, 'has these commandments.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 392, 6, 39, 'What is required is the power of the Holy Spirit. This is what was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 392, 7, 39, 'missing in the Old Covenant under the law. This is the main gift in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 392, 8, 39, 'New Covenant. It is not just a new technique. It is the Holy Spirit. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 392, 9, 39, 'we have not understood that, we have not understood the New Covenant at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 392, 10, 39, 'all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 392, 11, 39, 'Ministry of Holy Spirit Has Many Counterfeits Because It is Valuable');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 392, 12, 39, 'Therefore, it is not surprising that the devil has made the subject of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 392, 13, 39, 'the Holy Spirit the most controversial in Christendom. It is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 392, 14, 39, 'surprising that there is maximum amount of counterfeit in the area of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 392, 15, 39, 'the ministry of the life and the gifts of the Holy Spirit. More than any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 392, 16, 39, 'area of Christianity, the area of the ministry of the Holy Spirit has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 392, 17, 39, 'the most counterfeit. Why has the devil made this the area of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 392, 18, 39, 'controversy? Why has he made the maximum number of counterfeits in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 392, 19, 39, 'area? Because it is only the things that are valuable that are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 392, 20, 39, 'counterfeited. Nobody counterfeits brown paper or newspapers. People');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 392, 21, 39, 'counterfeit diamonds and gold. If you find a lot of counterfeits of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 392, 22, 39, 'ministry of the Holy Spirit and the gifts of the Holy Spirit, you can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 392, 23, 39, 'pretty sure that the original must be pretty valuable. But I am sorry to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 392, 24, 39, 'say that more than ninety percent of what you see today is counterfeit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 392, 25, 39, 'You need to be very careful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 392, 26, 39, 'Fourfold Test to Discern Counterfeits');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 392, 27, 39, 'How do you distinguish the counterfeit from the real? In India, if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 392, 28, 39, 'have a currency note and you do not know whether it is counterfeit or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 393, 1, 39, 'real, you take it to the Reserve Bank of India. The authority that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 393, 2, 39, 'issues the notes will tell you immediately whether it is real or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 393, 3, 39, 'counterfeit. Go to the source. In the same way, if you want to know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 393, 4, 39, 'whether some manifestation you see is of the Holy Spirit or not, go to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 393, 5, 39, 'the Scriptures. See whether Jesus did it, whether Jesus taught it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 393, 6, 39, 'whether the apostles did it, or whether the apostle taught it. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 393, 7, 39, 'what I call the fourfold test. Did Jesus do it? Did He teach it? Did the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 393, 8, 39, 'apostles do it? Did the apostles teach it? If the answer is “no” on all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 393, 9, 39, 'four counts, forget it. It is questionable. What is of the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 393, 10, 39, 'would have been done by Jesus or the apostles. What is of the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 393, 11, 39, 'Spirit would have been taught by Jesus or the apostles. If you do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 393, 12, 39, 'follow that rule, I can give you a written guarantee you will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 393, 13, 39, 'deceived. The Word of God is our guideline. Please keep that in mind.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 393, 14, 39, 'Jesus Did Not Want to Publicize His Healing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 393, 15, 39, 'This is the principle - “Do you believe that I am able to do this for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 393, 16, 39, 'you?” (Matthew 9:28). The blind men said, “Yes.” Again, you find the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 393, 17, 39, 'simple principle of Jesus not wanting them to tell others about it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 393, 18, 39, 'Jesus says in Matthew 9:30, “See that no one knows about this.” Earlier');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 393, 19, 39, 'in this verse, it says that Jesus sternly warned them. Where in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 393, 20, 39, 'world do you find a so-called healer today sternly warning people to not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 393, 21, 39, 'let other know that I prayed for you and you were healed? There is so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 393, 22, 39, 'little of the Spirit of Christ in the so-called healing ministries');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 393, 23, 39, 'today. Almost all of it is counterfeit. The real healing ministries are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 393, 24, 39, 'being conducted today by people who are mostly unknown and unheard of. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 393, 25, 39, 'believe Jesus heals the sick even today. But it is not through these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 393, 26, 39, 'well-known, so-called healers. The real healing is done by people who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 393, 27, 39, 'are unknown, who do not want their name to be known, just like Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 393, 28, 39, 'Jesus Was Not Bothered by Men’s Opinion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 394, 1, 39, '“As they were going out, a mute, demon-possessed man was brought to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 394, 2, 39, 'Him.” Matthew 9:32');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 394, 3, 39, 'Here is another case of somebody who was in need. He was dumb, but after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 394, 4, 39, 'the demon was cast out again, he could speak. I believe Jesus cast out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 394, 5, 39, 'the demon with one command, “Be gone! Get out of him.” Today, we say “in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 394, 6, 39, 'the name of Jesus” because it is only His authority with which we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 394, 7, 39, 'cast out a demon. The dumb man spoke and the multitudes marveled. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 394, 8, 39, 'was nothing like this ever seen in Israel.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 394, 9, 39, 'But the Pharisees were saying that Jesus casted out demons by the ruler');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 394, 10, 39, 'of the demons. Jesus just ignored that and went on. We read in another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 394, 11, 39, 'passage that Jesus forgave the Pharisees. Jesus said in Matthew 12:32,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 394, 12, 39, '“Whoever speaks a word against the Son of Man, it shall be forgiven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 394, 13, 39, 'him.” Have you spoken a word against Son of Man? You are forgiven. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 394, 14, 39, 'was not disturbed by people calling Him the ruler of demons or being in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 394, 15, 39, 'league with Satan. It did not disturb Him one bit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 394, 16, 39, 'I find so many Christians are disturbed if somebody accuses them of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 394, 17, 39, 'being in league with Satan. It disturbs them. But Jesus was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 394, 18, 39, 'disturbed. Jesus lived before His Father. It did not bother Him what men');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 394, 19, 39, 'thought about Him. Like I have often said, the opinions of men are fit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 394, 20, 39, 'for the trash can. Whether people speak highly of you or speak lowly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 394, 21, 39, 'about you, throw it into the trash can. It is not worth anything. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 394, 22, 39, 'opinion of man is worth nothing, regardless of whether it is good or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 394, 23, 39, 'bad. That is another thing we can learn from the example of Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 394, 24, 39, 'Our Kingdom Is Not of This World');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 394, 25, 39, '“Jesus was going about all the cities and the villages teaching in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 394, 26, 39, 'synagogues, proclaiming the gospel of the kingdom, and healing every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 394, 27, 39, 'kind of disease and every kind of sickness.” Matthew 9:35');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 394, 28, 39, 'Jesus had an amazing healing ministry. John the Baptist came proclaiming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 395, 1, 39, 'that Jesus Christ would come to proclaim a heavenly kingdom, not an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 395, 2, 39, 'earthly kingdom. For fifteen hundred years, the earthly kingdom was what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 395, 3, 39, 'Moses has promised God would bless you with. The earthly kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 395, 4, 39, 'promised that God would bless you with prosperity, healing, being lifted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 395, 5, 39, 'up above the nations, etc.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 395, 6, 39, 'Jesus did not come to proclaim an earthly kingdom, but a heavenly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 395, 7, 39, 'kingdom. The kingdom of heaven is where heavenly things become more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 395, 8, 39, 'important in your life. This is the kingdom that Jesus proclaimed. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 395, 9, 39, 'gospel of the kingdom of heaven is very rarely preached today. In fact,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 395, 10, 39, 'the opposite is being preached. In Deuteronomy 28, it says that if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 395, 11, 39, 'pay your tithes and follow God’s law, He will bless you materially and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 395, 12, 39, 'heal your sicknesses. If you do not do it, you will sick and be poor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 395, 13, 39, 'That is the old gospel which Jesus gave to Israel. This is the gospel of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 395, 14, 39, 'an earthly kingdom that speaks about property, and Israelites received');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 395, 15, 39, 'property in Canaan. Today, false prophets tell you that God will bless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 395, 16, 39, 'you and give you property. They say God will give you money or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 395, 17, 39, 'promotion. That is not the gospel of the kingdom of heaven. The gospel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 395, 18, 39, 'of the kingdom of heaven is that you can have a heavenly life while you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 395, 19, 39, 'are here on earth. You can have a life of peace and joy. If you believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 395, 20, 39, 'Him, He will do it for you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 395, 21, 39, 'Jesus Came to Save Us from Our Sins, Not to Make Us Rich');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 395, 22, 39, 'This is the gospel that Jesus preached. Jesus felt compassion for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 395, 23, 39, 'people because they were distressed and downcast like sheep without a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 395, 24, 39, 'shepherd. It is exactly the same today. There are many people and even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 395, 25, 39, 'so-called Christians, who have heard about the forgiveness of sins. Some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 395, 26, 39, 'people even speak in tongues and remove their ornaments. They think they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 395, 27, 39, 'are very holy even though they have not overcome sin. Jesus did not come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 395, 28, 39, 'just to get us to remove our ornaments or make us wear white clothes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 396, 1, 39, 'Jesus did not come here just to forgive our sins. The angel said in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 396, 2, 39, 'Matthew 1:21, “He will save His people from their sins.” That is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 396, 3, 39, 'gospel of the kingdom. The gospel of the kingdom is not Jesus will make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 396, 4, 39, 'you prosperous and healthy. He will provide you all your earthly needs,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 396, 5, 39, 'but He will help you seek God''s kingdom first and His righteousness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 396, 6, 39, 'Real Gospel of the Kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 396, 7, 39, 'That gospel is hardly heard today. Therefore, there are multitudes who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 396, 8, 39, 'are downcast and distressed. A lot of these people who have taken off');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 396, 9, 39, 'ornaments, speak in tongues and make a lot of noise in their meetings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 396, 10, 39, 'are sometimes so discouraged. Husband and wife yell at each other at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 396, 11, 39, 'home. This is not true Christianity. This is not the gospel of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 396, 12, 39, 'kingdom. They do not have the kingdom of heaven. In the kingdom of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 396, 13, 39, 'heaven, people are not shouting and yelling at each other. What sort of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 396, 14, 39, 'home is it where the father and mother speak in tongues in the meeting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 396, 15, 39, 'on Sunday morning and shout at each other in their mother tongue on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 396, 16, 39, 'Sunday afternoon? That is a counterfeit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 396, 17, 39, 'Ninety percent of people who say they are filled with the Spirit and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 396, 18, 39, 'speaking in tongues are living like this. The gospel of the kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 396, 19, 39, 'includes tongues, prophecy, and healing. But it enables us to control');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 396, 20, 39, 'our mother tongue and make us free from anger, depression, gloom,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 396, 21, 39, 'jealousy, and bitterness. Heaven is free from these things. It makes us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 396, 22, 39, 'pure and frees us from internet pornography. This is the gospel of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 396, 23, 39, 'kingdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 396, 24, 39, 'Pray that God Sends True Shepherds');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 396, 25, 39, 'Jesus looked at His disciples and said the harvest is plentiful. Look');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 396, 26, 39, 'around the world today. Look at even the Christian world and see the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 396, 27, 39, 'number of people who are distressed, downcast, and like sheep without a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 396, 28, 39, 'shepherd. Most shepherds only want to fleece the sheep of their wool.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 397, 1, 39, 'They do not want to feed them in green pastures. They want to take their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 397, 2, 39, 'money because they are not shepherds. They are hirelings who are out to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 397, 3, 39, 'get whatever they can from the sheep. Hirelings are only interested in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 397, 4, 39, 'taking the sheep to the slaughter and making money out of them. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 397, 5, 39, 'shepherd is interested in feeding the sheep.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 397, 6, 39, 'The harvest is plentiful, but the true workers, who are like shepherds');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 397, 7, 39, 'of these poor flock, are few in number. Pray to the Lord of the harvest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 397, 8, 39, 'that He will send out workers to the harvest. Only He can send them out.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 397, 9, 39, 'We cannot send ourselves out. God has to send you. He has to equip you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 397, 10, 39, 'bring you into the New Covenant yourself, and then send you out.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 397, 11, 40, 'Chapter 39 Principles of Witnessing for the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 397, 12, 40, '“These twelve Jesus sent out after instructing them: “Do not go in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 397, 13, 40, 'way of the Gentiles, and do not enter any city of the Samaritans; but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 397, 14, 40, 'rather go to the lost sheep of the house of Israel. And as you go,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 397, 15, 40, 'preach, saying, ‘The kingdom of heaven is at hand.’ Heal the sick, raise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 397, 16, 40, 'the dead, cleanse the lepers, cast out demons. Freely you received,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 397, 17, 40, 'freely give. Do not acquire gold, or silver, or copper for your money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 397, 18, 40, 'belts, or a bag for your journey, or even two coats, or sandals, or a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 397, 19, 40, 'staff; for the worker is worthy of his support. And whatever city or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 397, 20, 40, 'village you enter, inquire who is worthy in it, and stay at his house');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 397, 21, 40, 'until you leave that city. As you enter the house, give it your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 397, 22, 40, 'greeting. If the house is worthy, give it your blessing of peace. But if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 397, 23, 40, 'it is not worthy, take back your blessing of peace. Whoever does not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 397, 24, 40, 'receive you, nor heed your words, as you go out of that house or that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 397, 25, 40, 'city, shake the dust off your feet. Truly I say to you, it will be more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 397, 26, 40, 'tolerable for the land of Sodom and Gomorrah in the day of judgment than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 397, 27, 40, 'for that city” (Matthew 10:5-15).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 397, 28, 40, 'Is this particular commission that the Lord gave to His disciples, only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 398, 1, 40, 'temporarily for the period before the New Covenant was established? Or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 398, 2, 40, 'is this a commission that is valid for us today?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 398, 3, 40, 'This is a very, very important question to answer because a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 398, 4, 40, 'people have read this passage and have sought to apply it to Gospel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 398, 5, 40, 'preaching today. But such people are selective. They pick up some verses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 398, 6, 40, 'and leave out other verses. For example, they will say that Jesus said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 398, 7, 40, 'we can heal the sick, raise the dead, cleanse the lepers, and cast out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 398, 8, 40, 'demons (Matthew 10:8). Therefore, they say that we should do those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 398, 9, 40, 'things. But Jesus also said do not acquire any gold (Matthew 10:9). They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 398, 10, 40, 'leave this instruction out, and go on collecting gold. Jesus said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 398, 11, 40, '“Freely you received, freely you give”. But they do not give freely;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 398, 12, 40, 'they collect tithes. Jesus also said, “Do not take a bag for your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 398, 13, 40, 'journey or two tunics,” and yet these preachers have multitudes of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 398, 14, 40, 'tunics, coats, and suits bought at the expense of poor believers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 398, 15, 40, 'Why do they pick out only certain parts of this commission? Jesus also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 398, 16, 40, 'said in Matthew 10:5, “Do not go to the Gentiles, only go to the Jews.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 398, 17, 40, 'Do not even go to the Samaritans. Go only to the lost sheep of the house');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 398, 18, 40, 'of Israel.” They ignore this part as well. Whenever you find Christians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 398, 19, 40, 'making this commission for today, there is something wrong. They should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 398, 20, 40, 'either take the whole thing, or dump the whole thing. Jesus also said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 398, 21, 40, 'that you should not take any sandals, staff or money (Matthew 10:9-10).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 398, 22, 40, 'But when you compare Scripture with Scripture, Jesus changed this at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 398, 23, 40, 'Last Supper. It is very important to understand that. In Luke 22:35,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 398, 24, 40, 'Jesus said to His disciples at the Last Supper, “When I sent you out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 398, 25, 40, 'without purse, without a bag, without sandals (referring to Matthew 10),');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 398, 26, 40, 'did you lack anything?” The disciples said, “No, nothing. The Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 398, 27, 40, 'provided for our needs all along.” But there is an important phrase in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 398, 28, 40, 'Luke 22:36. Now things are different. We are coming to the end of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 399, 1, 40, 'Old Covenant. Jesus was about to die the next morning. In a few days,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 399, 2, 40, 'the New Covenant would be established when the Holy Spirit would be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 399, 3, 40, 'poured out. Jesus said, “But now, if you have a purse, take it along. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 399, 4, 40, 'you have a bag, take it.” Not only that, but Jesus said some amazing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 399, 5, 40, 'words, “If you have no sword, sell your robe and buy a sword.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 399, 6, 40, 'Disciples Can Defend Themselves When Attacked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 399, 7, 40, 'What does that mean? That means be prepared to defend yourself when you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 399, 8, 40, 'are attacked. When Peter took that sword, they said, “Lord, there are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 399, 9, 40, 'two swords here” (Luke 22:38). Jesus said, “Two swords is enough.” Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 399, 10, 40, 'was saying that when you go in to the Garden of Gethsemane, the Roman');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 399, 11, 40, 'soldiers might take out their swords to fight against you. If you lift');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 399, 12, 40, 'up your hand in defense, your hand will get cut. If you lift up a sword');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 399, 13, 40, 'and defend yourself, you can protect your face and your hands.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 399, 14, 40, 'Otherwise, they will slash your face. Jesus said that as a principle for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 399, 15, 40, 'ministry in this New Covenant age. We can defend ourselves if we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 399, 16, 40, 'attacked. When Peter took out that sword and began to attack the Roman');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 399, 17, 40, 'soldiers and cut off somebody''s ear, Jesus said, “Put it back. He who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 399, 18, 40, 'takes the sword will perish with the sword.” But Peter could have turned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 399, 19, 40, 'to the Lord and said, “Lord, You are the one who told us to take a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 399, 20, 40, 'sword.” The Lord would have told him, “Yes, but I did not ask you to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 399, 21, 40, 'bring a sword to attack people. I asked you to bring a sword so that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 399, 22, 40, 'could defend yourself when others attack you.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 399, 23, 40, 'We are not called as Christians to attack others. We are permitted to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 399, 24, 40, 'defend ourselves if we are attacked. This is something that many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 399, 25, 40, 'Christians do not understand. They point out verses like Matthew 5:39-40');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 399, 26, 40, 'which says, “But I say to you, do not resist an evil person; but whoever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 399, 27, 40, 'slaps you on your right cheek, turn the other to him also. If anyone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 399, 28, 40, 'wants to sue you and take your shirt, let him have your coat also.” But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 400, 1, 40, 'they do not compare that Scripture with this Scripture in Luke 22:36,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 400, 2, 40, 'which says, “If you do not have a sword, sell your robe and buy a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 400, 3, 40, 'sword.” We need to put both Scriptures together to understand what Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 400, 4, 40, 'is saying. Our attitude is one where we do not sue people, and we do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 400, 5, 40, 'attack people. But if people do attack us, we defend ourselves. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 400, 6, 40, 'people take us to court, then we seek to defend ourselves in court. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 400, 7, 40, 'we do not desire any evil for others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 400, 8, 40, 'The Commission in Matthew 10 Was Temporary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 400, 9, 40, 'Jesus modified the instructions He gave in Matthew 10 because that was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 400, 10, 40, 'only for the period when they were going to the nation of Israel. After');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 400, 11, 40, 'the New Covenant was established, He was going to send them into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 400, 12, 40, 'entire world, into lot of non-Christian nations. Previously, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 400, 13, 40, 'disciples needed to proclaim, “the kingdom of heaven is at hand”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 400, 14, 40, '(Matthew 10:7). That is not the message we are preaching today. Today,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 400, 15, 40, 'we preach that the Kingdom of Heaven has already come on the day of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 400, 16, 40, 'Pentecost. We can have a heavenly life now on this earth. Christ is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 400, 17, 40, 'risen, and He can lift us in our spirit into the heavenlies. That is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 400, 18, 40, 'big difference. Do not go to Matthew 10 to get your commission for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 400, 19, 40, 'preaching the Gospel today. That is not for today. It was for that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 400, 20, 40, 'particular period. It is like some of the other things that Jesus spoke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 400, 21, 40, 'when He was on earth. For example, Jesus told the lepers to go and show');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 400, 22, 40, 'themselves to the priests. He also told the Pharisees to pay their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 400, 23, 40, 'tithes. That all changed after the day of Pentecost.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 400, 24, 40, 'Satan quoted a verse of Scripture to Jesus and said, “It is written”.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 400, 25, 40, 'But Jesus responded by saying, “It is also written.” We need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 400, 26, 40, 'understand this principle. The whole truth of God is not found in, “It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 400, 27, 40, 'is written,” but in, “It is written,” and “it is also written.” Two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 400, 28, 40, 'passages of Scripture related to one another need to be considered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 401, 1, 40, 'simultaneously to understand the truth. You must bear that in mind when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 401, 2, 40, 'studying the Bible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 401, 3, 40, 'Principles New Covenant Believers Can Draw from Matthew 10');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 401, 4, 40, 'Despite this passage being a specific instruction for a particular');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 401, 5, 40, 'period, yet there are certain principles here that the Lord wants us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 401, 6, 40, 'live by. For example, Jesus said the laborer is worthy of his support');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 401, 7, 40, '(Luke 10:7). That is something that is quoted later in the New Testament');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 401, 8, 40, 'by the Apostle Paul. In 1 Corinthians 9:14, Paul says, “the Lord Himself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 401, 9, 40, 'has directed that those who preach Gospel are to be supported by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 401, 10, 40, 'Gospel”. In 1 Timothy 5:18, Paul speaks about the laborer being worthy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 401, 11, 40, 'of his support. Paul said that those who serve the Lord are entitled to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 401, 12, 40, 'be supported. This is not to get the highest salary possible, but they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 401, 13, 40, 'can receive gifts from people who want to support them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 401, 14, 40, 'We must compare Scripture with Scripture to understand the whole truth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 401, 15, 40, 'For example, Jesus spoke about this principle of going to a house where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 401, 16, 40, 'there is peace. “If the house is worthy, give it your blessing of peace”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 401, 17, 40, '(Matthew 10:13). How do you find out if a house is worthy? We can find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 401, 18, 40, 'out by comparing Scripture with Scripture. In Luke 10:6, Jesus gave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 401, 19, 40, 'similar instructions about going to a house. He said that if a man of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 401, 20, 40, 'peace is there, stay in that house. If it is a quarrelsome house, do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 401, 21, 40, 'stay there. Jesus said further in Luke 10:7 to not keep moving from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 401, 22, 40, 'house to house, because you will hardly find any houses with peace like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 401, 23, 40, 'that. You would be lucky if you find one in the village.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 401, 24, 40, 'That principle remains even today. Jesus Christ seeks for houses where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 401, 25, 40, 'there is peace. The responsibility for that peace is primarily upon the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 401, 26, 40, 'man of the house. In other words, the responsibility is primarily upon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 401, 27, 40, 'the husband or the father. This is almost the most important thing that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 401, 28, 40, 'a man should seek to have in his house. There should be peace. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 402, 1, 40, 'should not be quarreling, fighting, murmuring, or grumbling. It is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 402, 2, 40, 'responsibility of every head of the house to ensure that his house is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 402, 3, 40, 'house of peace. That is where the servants of the Lord should stay. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 402, 4, 40, 'is where the Lord Himself stays.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 402, 5, 40, 'For people who reject those who bring God''s Word, “it will be more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 402, 6, 40, 'tolerable for the land of Sodom and Gomorrah in the day of judgment than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 402, 7, 40, 'for that city” (Matthew 10:15). This is because those who preached to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 402, 8, 40, 'Sodom and Gomorrah were not as important as the Lord''s servants who go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 402, 9, 40, 'out today. Who went to Sodom and Gomorrah and asked them to repent? Lot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 402, 10, 40, 'was a backslidden person who was living there. Two angels went there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 402, 11, 40, 'just to rescue him. God punished them, but today God sends His servants');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 402, 12, 40, 'with the Gospel. If people reject the message from God’s servants, it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 402, 13, 40, 'a very, very serious crime.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 402, 14, 40, 'God Sends Us out as Sheep Who Are Shrewd as Serpents');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 402, 15, 40, 'In Matthew 10:16, Jesus continues to speak to His disciples about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 402, 16, 40, 'certain principles regarding how we are to go out. These principles');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 402, 17, 40, 'remain today even though Jesus changed the exact details of not taking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 402, 18, 40, 'money and sandals. Jesus did not change what He meant when He said, “I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 402, 19, 40, 'send you out as sheep in the midst of wolves.” That applies even today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 402, 20, 40, 'Christians go out like sheep into a world that is full of wolves. Sheep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 402, 21, 40, 'are helpless. A sheep is a picture of an innocent, helpless person going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 402, 22, 40, 'into the midst of wolves. What is the reason for that? Why does God send');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 402, 23, 40, 'His servants out like that? This is so that they will depend upon Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 402, 24, 40, 'Why did Israel have so many enemies surrounding them in the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 402, 25, 40, 'Testament period? This is so that they would not depend on themselves,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 402, 26, 40, 'but would depend on God. This is a fundamental principle that we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 402, 27, 40, 'learn from the commission in Matthew 10.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 402, 28, 40, 'God sends us out, but not as wolves going to the sheep. A Christian acts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 403, 1, 40, 'like a wolf when he tries to get money from others and lords it over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 403, 2, 40, 'others. Some preachers are like lions when they seek to collect money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 403, 3, 40, 'from others. They are not, however, lions, in the pulpit. The sheep does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 403, 4, 40, 'not seek to lord himself over anyone. Jesus says, “I send you out as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 403, 5, 40, 'sheep in the midst of wolves.” Babylonian Christianity is full of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 403, 6, 40, 'wolves. A true Christian is like a sheep in his innocence and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 403, 7, 40, 'helplessness, but he is not like a sheep in foolishness. Instead, he is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 403, 8, 40, 'shrewd as a serpent. In Matthew 10:16, Jesus says a person is like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 403, 9, 40, 'sheep in his character when he is not seeking to fight with people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 403, 10, 40, 'Sheep do not fight. A true Christian is shrewd as a serpent. He is not a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 403, 11, 40, 'foolish, dumb character. At the same time, he is as innocent as a dove.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 403, 12, 40, 'Notice the pictures the Lord uses from the animal kingdom. Jesus says we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 403, 13, 40, 'are to be as sheep in the midst of wolves, shrewd as serpents, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 403, 14, 40, 'innocent as doves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 403, 15, 40, 'Jesus said to be careful of men. This is all that Jesus taught. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 403, 16, 40, 'how we must be. We must have the shrewdness of a serpent. There is no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 403, 17, 40, 'virtue in being gullible. There are a lot of deceivers in Christendom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 403, 18, 40, 'There are a lot of deceptive reports about Christian work. These reports');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 403, 19, 40, 'are distributed to wealthy countries so that Babylonian Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 403, 20, 40, 'workers can collect money from them. We must be shrewd as a serpent.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 403, 21, 40, 'Some of those reports may be true. But many of them may be false. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 403, 22, 40, 'must be shrewd as a serpent in accepting what is true and rejecting what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 403, 23, 40, 'is false. We must be innocent as doves. However, we must beware of men');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 403, 24, 40, 'because they will deliver you up into their courts and scourge you in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 403, 25, 40, 'their synagogues. The Lord did not promise that they will be protected');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 403, 26, 40, 'from persecution. He warned them right at the beginning that they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 403, 27, 40, 'going to be persecuted. Jesus said that “you shall even be brought');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 403, 28, 40, 'before governors and kings for My sake as a testimony to them and to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 404, 1, 40, 'Gentiles.” Notice now He speaks about the Gentiles. Jesus has moved on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 404, 2, 40, 'from what He said earlier. In Matthew 10:5, Jesus said do not go to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 404, 3, 40, 'Gentiles. In Matthew 10:16 and onwards, Jesus is talking about what is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 404, 4, 40, 'going to happen in the New Covenant age. Jesus said that you will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 404, 5, 40, 'brought before governors and kings for my sake as a testimony to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 404, 6, 40, 'Gentiles.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 404, 7, 40, 'We Should Expect Persecution');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 404, 8, 40, 'When we go out in to the midst of the Gentiles, to the non-Jewish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 404, 9, 40, 'nations, we go out as sheep in the midst of wolves. We can expect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 404, 10, 40, 'persecution. Some of God’s servants in the Old Covenant were protected');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 404, 11, 40, 'supernaturally. For example, when armies came to catch Elijah and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 404, 12, 40, 'Elisha, God protected them supernaturally. God protected Daniel and his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 404, 13, 40, 'three friends. God protected many others, but there were also many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 404, 14, 40, 'others whom He did not protect. For example, according to tradition,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 404, 15, 40, 'Isaiah was sawn in half. Jesus also spoke about how Zechariah was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 404, 16, 40, 'killed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 404, 17, 40, 'There is much more of that in the New Covenant. Through New Covenant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 404, 18, 40, 'history, true servants of God who stood up for the truth and never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 404, 19, 40, 'compromised were persecuted. They were brought before kings and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 404, 20, 40, 'governors. They were taken to court and were falsely accused. In all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 404, 21, 40, 'those situations, Jesus said in Matthew 10:19, “Do not be anxious about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 404, 22, 40, 'what you are going to speak or how you are going to speak because in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 404, 23, 40, 'that hour God, will give you words to speak.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 404, 24, 40, 'This is not referring to standing up in the pulpit. A lot of people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 404, 25, 40, 'misquote Scripture and do not think about what they will speak when they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 404, 26, 40, 'stand in the pulpit. There are a lot of people who do not prepare when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 404, 27, 40, 'they come to share God''s Word in a pulpit. They get up and waste');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 404, 28, 40, 'everybody''s time. Unfortunately, a lot of preachers are like that today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 405, 1, 40, 'You should not get up into a pulpit to preach God''s Word if you are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 405, 2, 40, 'well-prepared and live before God. The preparation is primarily living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 405, 3, 40, 'before God’s face, but also becoming familiar with His Word. When you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 405, 4, 40, 'are young, you probably need to do a lot of preparation before you get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 405, 5, 40, 'up to speak. Do not claim this verse out of its context. Do not think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 405, 6, 40, 'that in moment you stand in the pulpit, it will be given you what to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 405, 7, 40, 'speak. You will find nothing is given to you. But as you grow in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 405, 8, 40, 'Lord and become more and more mature, you are able to discern the Lord''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 405, 9, 40, 'voice more clearly. Then you will find God speaking to you even as you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 405, 10, 40, 'get up to speak. But that is forty years after you have been a believer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 405, 11, 40, 'It will probably not be before that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 405, 12, 40, 'Jesus is speaking about even a new believer who is persecuted and made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 405, 13, 40, 'to stand in a court for the sake of his faith. He does not have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 405, 14, 40, 'prepare beforehand what he is going to say. When they ask him to give a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 405, 15, 40, 'testimony, at that moment the Holy Spirit will give him the right words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 405, 16, 40, 'to speak. That is what it is referring to here. Jesus says in Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 405, 17, 40, '10:20 that it is not you who is going to be speaking, but the Spirit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 405, 18, 40, 'the Father will speak in you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 405, 19, 40, 'The Difference Between Demon Possession and Spirit-Filling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 405, 20, 40, 'Evil spirits can possess people. They control people and give them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 405, 21, 40, 'strength. They can even speak through them. The Holy Spirit can also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 405, 22, 40, 'dwell in us. There is one big difference, however, between the way the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 405, 23, 40, 'Holy Spirit speaks through us and the way evil spirits speak through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 405, 24, 40, 'demon-possessed people. When an evil spirit possesses a person, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 405, 25, 40, 'person has no control over his tongue. He may want to say something, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 405, 26, 40, 'the evil spirit overrules that and makes that person speak words that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 405, 27, 40, 'even that person may not know what they are saying. They cannot change');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 405, 28, 40, 'it because the evil spirit is speaking. That is why it is called demon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 406, 1, 40, 'possession. It is a complete possession. But when the Holy Spirit comes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 406, 2, 40, 'into a person and controls him, the Holy Spirit does not possess him. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 406, 3, 40, 'fills him. There is a lot of difference between demon possession and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 406, 4, 40, 'Spirit-filling. Demons do not fill people. They possess people. The Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 406, 5, 40, 'Spirit does not possess people. He fills them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 406, 6, 40, 'That means the Holy Spirit gives them freedom. He is not going to speak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 406, 7, 40, 'through your tongue in the same way that a demon speaks through the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 406, 8, 40, 'tongue of a demon possessed person. He will instruct you in your mind,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 406, 9, 40, 'but you use and control your tongue. This applies even for speaking in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 406, 10, 40, 'tongues. Nowhere in the Bible does it say the Holy Spirit spoke in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 406, 11, 40, 'tongues. In Acts 2:4, it says, “They - the disciples - spoke in tongues');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 406, 12, 40, 'as the Spirit give them utterance.” That is the genuine speaking in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 406, 13, 40, 'tongues. The believers who spoke in tongues usually spoke to God. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 406, 14, 40, 'the believer himself moved his tongue and spoke to God. The Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 406, 15, 40, 'gives the utterance. It is fundamentally different from a demon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 406, 16, 40, 'possessing a person, where the demon himself speaks. The demons can also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 406, 17, 40, 'make a person speak in tongues because they have supernatural power.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 406, 18, 40, 'There will be a world of difference. The difference is this: when a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 406, 19, 40, 'demon speaks through a person, whether in known language or unknown');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 406, 20, 40, 'tongues, the person does not have any control over himself. But when the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 406, 21, 40, 'Holy Spirit gives utterance to a person to speak in an unknown tongue,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 406, 22, 40, 'he has complete control over himself because the fruit of the Spirit is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 406, 23, 40, 'self-control. When a person says, “Oh, I couldn''t control myself. I just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 406, 24, 40, 'went on and on. I could not stop, that must have been a demon, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 406, 25, 40, 'only demons control people''s tongues like that. The Holy Spirit gives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 406, 26, 40, 'utterance. I have experienced speaking in tongues for 38 years. I found');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 406, 27, 40, 'it is me who speaks to God - I am the one who moves my tongue, but the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 406, 28, 40, 'Spirit gives the utterance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 407, 1, 40, 'We need to understand this fundamental principle when the Lord says that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 407, 2, 40, '“it is not you who speaks, but the Spirit who speaks in you. There is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 407, 3, 40, 'difference between the way the Holy Spirit speaks and the way demons');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 407, 4, 40, 'speak. Demons possess, but the Holy Spirit gives utterance and then we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 407, 5, 40, 'speak. That is a fundamental principle. Demons do not allow a person to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 407, 6, 40, 'have freedom. They completely possess people. For example, demons can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 407, 7, 40, 'control people through activities like automatic writing. There are so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 407, 8, 40, 'many things that the demons do. They completely possess the person. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 407, 9, 40, 'is why demon possessed people can sometimes be so strong. Even if it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 407, 10, 40, 'a woman, you need three or four men to hold them down. They have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 407, 11, 40, 'tremendous strength because demons have come and taken over. But when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 407, 12, 40, 'the Holy Spirit comes and dwells in a person, He gives the power to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 407, 13, 40, 'person, but He expects the person to use that power himself. He gives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 407, 14, 40, 'instruction us in our mind, but gives us freedom to obey Him or not obey');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 407, 15, 40, 'Him. It is same when we speak in a pulpit. The Holy Spirit can mightily');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 407, 16, 40, 'anoint a person. But it is the person himself who speaks. He is using');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 407, 17, 40, 'his mind, but his mind is being renewed by the Holy Spirit. This is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 407, 18, 40, 'principle by which the Holy Spirit works. It is so important to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 407, 19, 40, 'understand this in this day when there is so much deception. People do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 407, 20, 40, 'not understand the difference between being filled with the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 407, 21, 40, 'and being possessed by demons.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 407, 22, 40, 'No Virtue in Seeking Unnecessary Persecution');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 407, 23, 40, 'Jesus also says in relation to persecution, “brother will deliver a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 407, 24, 40, 'brother to death, and the father his child” (Matthew 10:21). There will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 407, 25, 40, 'be enmity within the same family. “You will be hated by all people on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 407, 26, 40, 'account of My Name. But it is the one who endures to the end who will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 407, 27, 40, 'saved” (Matthew 10:22). Say to the Lord, “Lord, I want to be faithful to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 407, 28, 40, 'You till the very end.” He also said there is no virtue in facing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 408, 1, 40, 'persecution and trying to be brave. Jesus said in Matthew 10:23, “If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 408, 2, 40, 'they persecute you in one city, flee to the next one. For truly I say to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 408, 3, 40, 'you, you will not finish going through the cities of Israel until the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 408, 4, 40, 'Son of Man comes.” Jesus says that there is no virtue in standing up and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 408, 5, 40, 'facing persecution unnecessarily. If it is unavoidable, praise the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 408, 6, 40, 'God will give you grace. But if you can avoid persecution, avoid it. Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 408, 7, 40, 'not force yourself to be a martyr to get some honor or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 408, 8, 40, 'self-satisfaction. Whenever they persecute you in one city, flee to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 408, 9, 40, 'another.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 408, 10, 40, 'Please remember these simple principles concerning our speaking or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 408, 11, 40, 'witnessing for the Lord and how we face up to persecution. We need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 408, 12, 40, 'face the reality that people will hate us when we stand up for the true');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 408, 13, 40, 'faith. The true Christian is not going to be a popular person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 408, 14, 41, 'Chapter 40 Do Not Fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 408, 15, 41, '“A disciple is not above his teacher, and a slave is not above his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 408, 16, 41, 'master.” This is a simple principle. How can we be above the One Who''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 408, 17, 41, 'our Teacher and our Master? “Isn''t it enough that the disciple becomes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 408, 18, 41, 'like his teacher, and the slave like his master?” (Matthew 10:24-25.).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 408, 19, 41, 'This principle applies throughout the Christian age: a disciple is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 408, 20, 41, 'above his Teacher and the slave is not above his Master.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 408, 21, 41, 'What is He leading onto? Verse 25 continues, “If they have called the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 408, 22, 41, 'Head of the house Beelzebul (prince of devils) how much more they will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 408, 23, 41, 'call the members of His household by worse names?” “How much more” means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 408, 24, 41, 'worse names than prince of devils. Think of that. Are you looking for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 408, 25, 41, 'honor and fame as a Christian? You will get it in false Christianity, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 408, 26, 41, 'Babylon, but if you''re a true Christian who proclaims the whole counsel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 408, 27, 41, 'of God, according to the teaching of Christ, you will be unpopular. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 408, 28, 41, 'will be called a heretic and a false teacher, just like Jesus was called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 409, 1, 41, 'a false teacher by the Pharisees. They said He was preaching heresy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 409, 2, 41, 'Many people called Paul a false teacher in his time, and it’s exactly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 409, 3, 41, 'the same today. People who don’t know the Lord or fear Him will call the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 409, 4, 41, 'true prophets of God false teachers and heretics.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 409, 5, 41, 'Satan Has Turned the World Upside Down');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 409, 6, 41, 'This is the standard method by which the devil has turned people away');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 409, 7, 41, 'from the truth. It''s amazing that Christians are more afraid of what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 409, 8, 41, 'they consider to be false teaching than of sin. The end result is that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 409, 9, 41, 'when somebody preaches that you can overcome sin, this is called a false');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 409, 10, 41, 'teaching! And when somebody else teaches the opposite - “of course');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 409, 11, 41, 'you’ll always keep on sinning till the end of your life” - that''s called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 409, 12, 41, 'true teaching. Can you believe how the devil has turned truth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 409, 13, 41, 'upside-down?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 409, 14, 41, 'Let me repeat this. Those who preach that you can overcome sin - that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 409, 15, 41, 'sin will not have dominion over you, that you don''t have to sin, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 409, 16, 41, 'that Jesus can deliver you - are considered heretics. And those who say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 409, 17, 41, '‘Well, we’ll keep on sinning. You’ll always be defeated, our nature is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 409, 18, 41, 'bad,’ they''re called the true truth speakers. This is the way that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 409, 19, 41, 'devil has turned truth upside-down. The Master Himself was called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 409, 20, 41, 'Beelzebul (prince of devils) when He did something good (like delivering');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 409, 21, 41, 'people from demons), so when He says, ‘how much more’ (Matthew 10:25),');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 409, 22, 41, 'that means that the way that I know that I''m a member of Christ’s family');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 409, 23, 41, 'is by being called worse names than Beelzebul, prince of devils.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 409, 24, 41, 'You may think that you are very faithful disciples of Jesus Christ, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 409, 25, 41, 'that you are a member of His household. Can you tell me some of the bad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 409, 26, 41, 'names that people have called you, not for the stupid things you did,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 409, 27, 41, 'but because you stood up for Christ and for the truth of God''s Word?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 409, 28, 41, 'That is the way to find out whether you''re a member of His family, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 410, 1, 41, 'whether you''re a compromiser who wants the benefits of the kingdom but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 410, 2, 41, 'does not want to stand up for Christ in places where it''s unpopular. So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 410, 3, 41, 'many Christians seek popularity and don''t know what it means to stand up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 410, 4, 41, 'for the truth. I believe we need to hear this Word today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 410, 5, 41, 'You Have Nothing to Fear If You Fear God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 410, 6, 41, 'Then He goes on to speak about fear. “Do not fear” is one of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 410, 7, 41, 'favorite words of Jesus. ”Fear not! Do not fear what people can do to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 410, 8, 41, 'you.” There may be a lot of things people accuse you of, but it says in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 410, 9, 41, 'Matthew 10:26 that there''s nothing covered that will not be revealed,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 410, 10, 41, 'there is nothing hidden that will not be known, and so you don''t have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 410, 11, 41, 'be afraid of anything.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 410, 12, 41, 'God is going to bring everything into the light. Even the hidden motives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 410, 13, 41, 'of people when they attack you, God will bring into light. Don''t worry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 410, 14, 41, 'about crooked people who try to accuse you falsely. God will bring them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 410, 15, 41, 'to light. Leave it to God; there''s nothing covered that will not be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 410, 16, 41, 'revealed, and hidden that will not be known. The same thing applies to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 410, 17, 41, 'our own life. If you are a preacher and there''s something crooked in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 410, 18, 41, 'your life, be sure that one day it will be revealed. That is why we must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 410, 19, 41, 'walk in the light all the time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 410, 20, 41, '“If I have told you something in the darkness, speak it in the light;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 410, 21, 41, 'and what you hear whispered in your ear, proclaim upon the housetops’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 410, 22, 41, '(Matthew 10:27). That is a very interesting word -- “what I tell you in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 410, 23, 41, 'the darkness” means in the middle of the night, when it''s dark, if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 410, 24, 41, 'wake up like Samuel and say, “Speak Lord, Your servant is listening,”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 410, 25, 41, 'and God says something to you, you are to proclaim it. Have the habit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 410, 26, 41, 'listening when you''re in bed at night and you''re awake. Say, ‘Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 410, 27, 41, 'speak.’ It''s one of the best times to hear because the whole world is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 410, 28, 41, 'still - everybody''s asleep - and you can hear God speaking to you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 411, 1, 41, 'Proclaim in the light what you hear whispered in the ear, the gentle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 411, 2, 41, 'whisper of the Holy Spirit. Proclaim it on the housetops.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 411, 3, 41, 'This verse teaches us that God speaks to us not with big trumpet sounds,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 411, 4, 41, 'but in a gentle voice -- softly, like a whisper, and in the darkness --');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 411, 5, 41, 'but we proclaim it publicly and don''t fear. Again it is repeated, “Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 411, 6, 41, 'not fear,” verse 26, 28). It is like when Jesus said three times not to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 411, 7, 41, 'be anxious at the end of Matthew 6. Here he says, “Don’t be afraid,”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 411, 8, 41, 'three times as well (verse 26, 28, 31).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 411, 9, 41, '“Don''t be afraid of those who can kill your body.” Every Christian who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 411, 10, 41, 'wants to be a true disciple of Jesus must listen to this. “Don’t be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 411, 11, 41, 'afraid of people who call you Beelzebul (Matthew 10: 25, 26).” Don''t be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 411, 12, 41, 'afraid of those who can kill your body because they can’t kill your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 411, 13, 41, 'soul. It is better to fear Him who can destroy both body and soul in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 411, 14, 41, 'Hell” (Matthew 10:28). Isaiah 8:12-13 in the Living Bible says, “If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 411, 15, 41, 'fear God, you need fear nothing else.” It''s a great verse. I have had it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 411, 16, 41, 'in my sitting room for forty years, and it has encouraged me constantly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 411, 17, 41, 'I want to encourage you to believe this verse -- you need fear nothing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 411, 18, 41, 'Terrible things are going to happen on this earth in the days to come,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 411, 19, 41, 'but you need to fear nothing if you fear God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 411, 20, 41, 'God’s Care Is a Shield from All Fears');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 411, 21, 41, 'Jesus goes on to speak about our personal needs. “Aren’t two sparrows');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 411, 22, 41, 'sold for a cent? Not one of them will fall to the ground apart from your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 411, 23, 41, 'Father, but the very hairs of your head are numbered.” The Lord then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 411, 24, 41, 'says, “You''re of more value than many sparrows” (Matthew 10:29,31),');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 411, 25, 41, 'therefore do not fear because even the sparrow that falls to the ground,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 411, 26, 41, 'the Father is watching. It is so difficult for our mind to comprehend');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 411, 27, 41, 'that of all the millions of insects and birds that are on earth, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 411, 28, 41, 'sees even a sparrow fall to the ground! Here the Lord is teaching us of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 412, 1, 41, 'the tremendous ability the Father has. Even the hairs of your head are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 412, 2, 41, 'numbered (verse 30). Can you imagine the intense care God has over you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 412, 3, 41, 'throughout the night? A lot of people get dreadful dreams at night. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 412, 4, 41, 'you are afraid at night, think of this verse. Even the hair that falls');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 412, 5, 41, 'from your head to the pillow at night, God knew about it! This is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 412, 6, 41, 'intensity of His care for us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 412, 7, 41, 'Being One Whom Jesus Is Pleased to Confess');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 412, 8, 41, '“Therefore everyone who confesses Me before men, I will also confess him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 412, 9, 41, 'before My Father in Heaven. But whoever denies Me before men, I will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 412, 10, 41, 'also deny him before My Father Who is in Heaven” (Matthew 10: 32-33). We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 412, 11, 41, 'need to see that there is a principle here - the Lord will deal with us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 412, 12, 41, 'in exactly the same way that we deal with Him. He’ll confess us before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 412, 13, 41, 'the Father in the measure in which we have unashamedly confessed Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 412, 14, 41, 'before men. This whole section is talking about being a witness for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 412, 15, 41, 'Christ and the fear that people can have about being a witness because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 412, 16, 41, 'they think, “If I''m a witness, I will suffer some loss.” Some people are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 412, 17, 41, 'even afraid to witness for Christ in their offices, lest they lose a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 412, 18, 41, 'promotion. I''ve seen a lot of non-Christians in banks in other places');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 412, 19, 41, 'hang a calendar near their table with picture of some Hindu idol, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 412, 20, 41, 'have almost never seen a Christian hang out a calendar with a Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 412, 21, 41, 'verse on it. They’re ashamed to be known as Christians because, in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 412, 22, 41, 'non-Christian world, they say, “I might lose opportunities for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 412, 23, 41, 'promotion; my manager won''t be so happy with me if he sees that.” We’re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 412, 24, 41, 'ashamed to confess Christ, but when we have a need, of course we go to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 412, 25, 41, 'Him. That’s how it was in Israel, and the Lord said, “Why do you come to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 412, 26, 41, 'Me only when you have a problem? Why don''t you go to the gods of Egypt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 412, 27, 41, 'that you''ve been worshipping?”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 412, 28, 41, 'How do we deny Him? It is not by saying like Peter, “I don''t know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 413, 1, 41, 'Christ.” I don’t think any of us would say that, but we deny Him very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 413, 2, 41, 'often by silence, by keeping quiet when we should be speaking, by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 413, 3, 41, 'hesitating, or by being unwilling to let people know that we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 413, 4, 41, 'Christian. We deny Him when we are unwilling to let people know that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 413, 5, 41, 'are Christians. If we deny Him, He will deny us. But if we confess Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 413, 6, 41, 'before men, He will confess us before His Father in Heaven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 413, 7, 41, 'We need to think about this: there''s a day coming when Christ will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 413, 8, 41, 'return in glory, and we will stand before Him. Who are the ones of whom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 413, 9, 41, 'He is going to be proud? Do you want the Lord to be proud of you when He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 413, 10, 41, 'comes back? Here''s what Jesus taught: He will not confess before the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 413, 11, 41, 'Father those who are ashamed of Him on this earth. Remember this: that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 413, 12, 41, 'if you have not been bold enough to acknowledge that you are a disciple');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 413, 13, 41, 'of Jesus and have kept quiet about your faith, then you can be sure that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 413, 14, 41, 'you have denied the Lord. You can be sure that when Christ comes back,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 413, 15, 41, 'He will deny you before the Father. You probably never heard preaching');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 413, 16, 41, 'like this, but it is the truth. Whoever calls himself a Christian, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 413, 17, 41, 'says that they are Spirit-filled, or can speak in tongues, or whatever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 413, 18, 41, 'else, if you deny Christ before men, He will deny you before the Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 413, 19, 41, 'in Heaven (Matthew 10:33).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 413, 20, 41, 'It’s like Jesus telling you on the final day, “I don''t know you, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 413, 21, 41, 'when you were on earth, you acted as though you didn''t know Me”. It is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 413, 22, 41, 'very serious thing. The Lord wants us to be His bold disciples. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 413, 23, 41, 'doesn''t want us to be secret disciples who hide our light under a bushel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 413, 24, 41, 'or put it under a bed where nobody can see it. He says to put the light');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 413, 25, 41, 'upon the lamp stand, and if people reject you let them reject you. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 413, 26, 41, 'they call you Beelzebul, let them call you Beelzebul. If they kill you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 413, 27, 41, 'then be willing to be killed. Don’t be afraid of a man who can kill your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 413, 28, 41, 'body; be afraid of Him who can destroy your body and soul. If you fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 414, 1, 41, 'God, you can be sure that nobody can touch you without His permission.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 414, 2, 41, 'And if you confess Him, if you boldly say, “Lord I am Your witness and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 414, 3, 41, 'I''m not ashamed to confess to others that I belong to Jesus Christ,”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 414, 4, 41, 'then think of the joy that’ll be yours one day when Christ returns and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 414, 5, 41, 'your turn comes up - your name is called - and Jesus says, ‘I want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 414, 6, 41, 'confess this person boldly before You, Father, because he has been a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 414, 7, 41, 'bold witness for Me on the earth.” I hope we will hear the words, “Well');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 414, 8, 41, 'done, good and faithful servant.” I want to hear them, and I don''t care');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 414, 9, 41, 'what loss I might have on the earth because I confess Christ. Of course');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 414, 10, 41, 'we will lose many things -- maybe you lose a promotion, or maybe you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 414, 11, 41, 'lose financially, or socially in the sense that your relatives will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 414, 12, 41, 'think you''re crazy and off your head. Whatever it is, be bold to confess');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 414, 13, 41, 'Christ, and in the long run, you will be thankful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 414, 14, 41, 'Confessing Christ Will Bring Division on Earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 414, 15, 41, 'When we confess Christ like this, there is going to come a division,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 414, 16, 41, 'even in a family. Jesus says, “Don’t think I came to bring peace.” One');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 414, 17, 41, 'way He came to bring peace was “peace on earth and goodwill towards men”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 414, 18, 41, '-- that is what the angels sang. But this was peace in people’s hearts,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 414, 19, 41, 'and between the true disciples of Jesus. But everybody doesn''t want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 414, 20, 41, 'peace. Most people want war, so “don''t think I came to bring peace; I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 414, 21, 41, 'did not come to bring peace, but a sword that will bring a division');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 414, 22, 41, 'between those who confess Christ and those who don''t confess Him, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 414, 23, 41, 'the result will be a man will be against his father, a daughter against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 414, 24, 41, 'her mother, daughter-in-law against her mother-in-law” (Matthew 10:35).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 414, 25, 41, 'This is not talking about the regular daughter-in-law mother-in-law');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 414, 26, 41, 'fights which are universal among non-Christians everywhere; this is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 414, 27, 41, 'talking about one of them standing up for Christ, and therefore a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 414, 28, 41, 'division coming between that person and the other person who doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 415, 1, 41, 'want to follow Christ all the way. We see this happening all the time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 415, 2, 41, 'Take for example, a son who is gripped by the truth of the Gospel, who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 415, 3, 41, 'wants to take baptism. He wants to really live for God, give up sinful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 415, 4, 41, 'ways, and wholeheartedly follow the Lord, but his father doesn''t want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 415, 5, 41, 'that. What is the result? A division comes between the father and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 415, 6, 41, 'son. That''s where the sword comes in. You have to love Jesus more than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 415, 7, 41, 'you love your father or mother, and “a man''s enemies will be the members');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 415, 8, 41, 'of his own household” (Matthew 10:36). Throughout these two thousand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 415, 9, 41, 'years of Christianity, it has been true that the true disciples of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 415, 10, 41, 'love peace - they want peace - but their relatives (so-called believers)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 415, 11, 41, 'will turn against them. It’s religion that will make people turn against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 415, 12, 41, 'the true disciples of Jesus. History is full of examples of unconverted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 415, 13, 41, 'religious Christians who persecuted the true disciples of Jesus Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 415, 14, 41, '-- very often much more than the heathen and the non-Christians. If a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 415, 15, 41, 'man loves his father or mother more than he loves Christ, the Lord says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 415, 16, 41, '“You''re not worthy of Me”.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 415, 17, 41, 'I don''t want to ever hear Jesus say to me in the final day, “You''re not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 415, 18, 41, 'worthy of Me; you loved your father or mother more than Me, and you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 415, 19, 41, 'wanted to please your father and mother more than you wanted to please');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 415, 20, 41, 'Me..” Will the Lord have to say that to you? “Whoever loves son or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 415, 21, 41, 'daughter more than Me is not worthy of Me.” Do you compromise your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 415, 22, 41, 'Christian convictions in order to please your son or your daughter? Then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 415, 23, 41, 'you''re not worthy of Jesus Christ. I don''t want the Lord to say to me in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 415, 24, 41, 'the final day, “You''re not worthy of Me.” I want to love Jesus more than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 415, 25, 41, 'I love my parents and more than I love my son or daughter. If they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 415, 26, 41, 'wrong, I have to stand against them and say they''re wrong. So many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 415, 27, 41, 'Christian parents are partial towards their children and don''t stand up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 415, 28, 41, 'for the Lord against their children. The end result is that those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 416, 1, 41, 'children go away from the Lord and the parents go away from the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 416, 2, 41, 'But if the parents stood up for the Lord and loved the Lord more than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 416, 3, 41, 'they loved their children, their children would have become disciples of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 416, 4, 41, 'Jesus. Have you been soft towards your children, compromised, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 416, 5, 41, 'lowered Christian standards? If you don’t stand up for the Lord when you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 416, 6, 41, 'see your daughter dressing in an immodest way and following the fashions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 416, 7, 41, 'of the world, then you love her more than you love the Lord and His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 416, 8, 41, 'testimony. That will determine whether the Lord will deny you in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 416, 9, 41, 'final day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 416, 10, 41, 'Die to Your Self-Life to Find Your Life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 416, 11, 41, 'In Matthew 10:38, Jesus says, “If you don''t take up the cross and follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 416, 12, 41, 'after Me, you’re not worthy of Me.” That''s the message that we need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 416, 13, 41, 'hear today. The main missing message in Christendom today is the message');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 416, 14, 41, 'of the cross. “Take up your cross daily and follow Me,” Jesus said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 416, 15, 41, '“otherwise you cannot be My disciple.” That means you must die to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 416, 16, 41, 'yourself (your self-will) and do the will of God. Otherwise it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 416, 17, 41, 'impossible to follow Him. If you imagine that you are following Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 416, 18, 41, 'without denying your own will every day, and doing the will of God in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 416, 19, 41, 'the power of the Holy Spirit, then you are fooling yourself. You are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 416, 20, 41, 'following the Lord. When Jesus speaks about finding our life in Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 416, 21, 41, '10:39, He is speaking about this earthly soulish life, which includes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 416, 22, 41, 'our reputation, our honour, our dignity, etc. If we try to preserve our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 416, 23, 41, 'reputation, honor, and our dignity (this is what Jesus calls finding our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 416, 24, 41, 'life), we’ll lose it. But we should be willing to lose our reputation,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 416, 25, 41, 'dignity, and honor for the sake of standing up for Christ. That is what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 416, 26, 41, 'it means to lose our life. Then we will find it. So “losing your life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 416, 27, 41, 'for Jesus’ sake” means that you stand up for the Lord, and you “lose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 416, 28, 41, 'your life” because you are treated like garbage by the people of this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 417, 1, 41, 'world, and you are spoken evil of, and you are persecuted. Such people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 417, 2, 41, 'will find life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 417, 3, 41, 'Rewards of Receiving Godly People');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 417, 4, 41, 'Then Jesus says, “He who receives you receives Me” (Matthew 10:40). What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 417, 5, 41, 'an honor. Do you know that if you are a true devoted servant of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 417, 6, 41, 'Christ, and faithful to Him, anyone who receives you is receiving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 417, 7, 41, 'Christ, and anyone who rejects you is rejecting Christ? It''s an amazing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 417, 8, 41, 'thing. Similarly, “He who receives a prophet in the name of a prophet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 417, 9, 41, 'will receive a prophet’s reward” (Matthew 10:41). If you honor a prophet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 417, 10, 41, 'of God because you recognize that this is a man who is speaking as the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 417, 11, 41, 'mouthpiece of God, and you honor him as that, you can get a reward just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 417, 12, 41, 'for that! If you receive a righteous man here - if you find a man who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 417, 13, 41, 'standing up for holiness and purity, and standing against sin, and you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 417, 14, 41, 'receive him as a righteous man whom you respect because he is standing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 417, 15, 41, 'up for the Lord - you will receive his reward. These are amazing words.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 417, 16, 41, 'And in verse 42, He includes an ordinary disciple and even a little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 417, 17, 41, 'child! Notice the order here: apostle, prophet, righteous man, and a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 417, 18, 41, 'little child. The easiest thing to do is to give a little child a cup of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 417, 19, 41, 'cold water, and even just this act will receive a reward. What the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 417, 20, 41, 'is saying is, if you honor God’s servants, God will honor you. If you do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 417, 21, 41, 'something for His servants - help them in some way, even such a small');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 417, 22, 41, 'thing like giving a cup of water - God will make sure that He repays you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 417, 23, 41, 'because God is not a debtor to any man. That''s a wonderful truth that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 417, 24, 41, 'you can always be sure of, if you''ve done anything for the Lord or for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 417, 25, 41, 'His people or His servants, you can be absolutely sure that the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 417, 26, 41, 'will repay you (I’m talking about the true servants of God, not the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 417, 27, 41, 'multitudes of fake preachers and crooks that go out in the name of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 417, 28, 41, 'Christ today, which constitute 90% of today''s preachers. Steer clear of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 418, 1, 41, 'them. Don''t believe every spirit but discern and honor the true servants');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 418, 2, 41, 'of the Lord).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 418, 3, 42, 'Chapter 41 John the Baptist');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 418, 4, 42, 'Introduction');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 418, 5, 42, '“When Jesus had finished instructing His twelve disciples, He went on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 418, 6, 42, 'from there to teach and preach in their cities” (Matthew 11:1). Here you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 418, 7, 42, 'see something of the tireless nature with which Jesus served during the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 418, 8, 42, 'three and a half years of His ministry. He never took a vacation. He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 418, 9, 42, 'constantly on the go with a burden to complete the ministry the Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 418, 10, 42, 'had given Him to complete on this earth, and every true servant of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 418, 11, 42, 'will have that same passion. Jesus taught us by His life to be tireless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 418, 12, 42, 'in our service for God. It says that He went about teaching and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 418, 13, 42, 'preaching in all the cities.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 418, 14, 42, 'John the Baptist’s Doubts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 418, 15, 42, 'When John the Baptist was in prison and he heard about the works of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 418, 16, 42, 'Christ, he sent word through his disciples to Christ in Matthew 11:3,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 418, 17, 42, '“Are you the expected one or shall we look for someone else?” This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 418, 18, 42, 'interesting because Jesus later says that John the Baptist is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 418, 19, 42, 'greatest man born of women and the greatest prophet ever up until that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 418, 20, 42, 'time. Yet this man who was the greatest prophet had doubts about Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 418, 21, 42, 'He wondered whether Jesus was the Messiah even though he had seen those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 418, 22, 42, 'supernatural signs at Jesus’ baptism. He saw the dove coming down, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 418, 23, 42, 'heard the voice from Heaven, and he had the sense in his own spirit that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 418, 24, 42, 'this was the Lamb of God who takes away the sins of the world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 418, 25, 42, 'If that’s the case, then why did this doubt come into John''s mind? First');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 418, 26, 42, 'of all, remember that he was under the old covenant. We cannot compare');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 418, 27, 42, 'ourselves with him because, in the new covenant, we have the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 418, 28, 42, 'Spirit, and we have many privileges that people under the old covenant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 419, 1, 42, 'just didn''t have. So we''re not here to compare ourselves with him. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 419, 2, 42, 'the reason John doubted is because when he was in prison, he expected');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 419, 3, 42, 'Jesus to deliver him. He expected God to deliver him from prison because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 419, 4, 42, 'he had faithfully fulfilled his ministry. Why was God allowing him to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 419, 5, 42, 'in prison now?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 419, 6, 42, 'The Ability We Have in the New Covenant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 419, 7, 42, 'Paul never had that type of question when he was in prison. Peter didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 419, 8, 42, 'have that type of question when he was in prison. This wasn’t because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 419, 9, 42, 'they were better than John the Baptist, but because they had the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 419, 10, 42, 'Spirit. That''s why we must never compare ourselves with Old Testament');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 419, 11, 42, 'saints and prophets when we see the mistakes they made. Even when David');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 419, 12, 42, 'committed adultery, he was under the old covenant. Many Christians don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 419, 13, 42, 'understand the distinct difference between old covenant and new');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 419, 14, 42, 'covenant. The privilege we have today, of being filled with the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 419, 15, 42, 'Spirit from within, they never had in the Old Covenant. When it says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 419, 16, 42, 'that John the Baptist was filled with the Spirit from his mother''s womb,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 419, 17, 42, 'it means that the Spirit God was upon John; but He was not within him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 419, 18, 42, 'Today, we have the Spirit within.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 419, 19, 42, 'In the old covenant, there was a veil between the soul and the spirit,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 419, 20, 42, 'so the Holy Spirit could not penetrate through into man’s spirit and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 419, 21, 42, 'dwell within him. The Spirit could only be upon people, flow over them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 419, 22, 42, 'and be a blessing - perhaps to thousands. In the new covenant, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 419, 23, 42, 'Spirit comes within because the veil has been rent between the soul and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 419, 24, 42, 'spirit. Man can now have God dwelling right within his spirit, and from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 419, 25, 42, 'his innermost being rivers of living water flow. That''s the difference.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 419, 26, 42, 'Because the Spirit was not within him, John the Baptist had this doubt,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 419, 27, 42, 'and he wondered, “Why am I still in prison? I’m supposed be the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 419, 28, 42, 'forerunner for Christ and now I want to complete my ministry.” He didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 420, 1, 42, 'realize that he had already completed his ministry.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 420, 2, 42, 'When he asked if Jesus was really the Messiah, Jesus doesn''t say to him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 420, 3, 42, '“Don''t you remember what you saw at the baptism?” No. He understands the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 420, 4, 42, 'struggle people under the old covenant had, and He says, “Go and report');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 420, 5, 42, 'to John what you hear and see: the blind receive sight and the lame');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 420, 6, 42, 'walk, the lepers are cleansed, the deaf hear, the dead are raised up,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 420, 7, 42, 'and the poor have the gospel preached to them.” That’s the greatest of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 420, 8, 42, 'all, in ascending order - the blind receiving sight, the lame walking,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 420, 9, 42, 'the lepers cleansed, the deaf hearing, the dead being raised up, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 420, 10, 42, 'then the greatest of all: the poor have the gospel preached to them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 420, 11, 42, 'The Lord was saying, “Here are other signs that prove that I am the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 420, 12, 42, 'Messiah.” All of the signs mentioned in verse 5 were not necessarily to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 420, 13, 42, 'be repeated throughout the Christian era for 2000 years. It’s not that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 420, 14, 42, 'Christians would go around giving all blind people sight, making all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 420, 15, 42, 'deaf people hear, cleansing all lepers, and raising all dead people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 420, 16, 42, 'That''s not the meaning. These were specific signs that were meant to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 420, 17, 42, 'endorse the fact that Jesus was the Messiah Himself, which is very clear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 420, 18, 42, 'because He was answering the question, “How do we know you''re the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 420, 19, 42, 'Messiah?”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 420, 20, 42, 'It’s important for us to understand what Jesus was teaching, so that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 420, 21, 42, 'don''t live under the false illusion that a lot of Christians live under');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 420, 22, 42, 'today, that every single Christian who is sick must be healed. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 420, 23, 42, 'doesn''t work, and preachers who preach that are leading others into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 420, 24, 42, 'deception. These were emphasized as the signs that endorsed the fact');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 420, 25, 42, 'that Jesus was the Messiah.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 420, 26, 42, 'Jesus goes on to say in verse 6, “Blessed is he who keeps from stumbling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 420, 27, 42, 'over Me.” In other words, blessed is the one who doesn''t get offended');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 420, 28, 42, 'with something Jesus does or doesn’t do. It is very easy for Christians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 421, 1, 42, 'to be offended when they expect God to do something and He does not do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 421, 2, 42, 'it. For example, in John the Baptist’s case, he was expecting Christ to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 421, 3, 42, 'deliver him from prison. It didn''t happen as he anticipated, so he was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 421, 4, 42, 'disappointed and offended perhaps. It''s in this connection that the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 421, 5, 42, 'is saying, “Blessed is he who never gets offended with Me.” This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 421, 6, 42, 'something that Jesus taught that we need to practice in our own life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 421, 7, 42, 'Whether God does not do what we expect Him to do or He does something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 421, 8, 42, 'that we don''t expect Him to do, we shouldn’t get offended. We must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 421, 9, 42, 'believe that He is sovereign, and that He knows what is best for us. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 421, 10, 42, 'may not know it ourselves, but He knows what is best, and He will do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 421, 11, 42, 'what is best for His children.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 421, 12, 42, 'Beware of People-Pleasing Preachers and Churches');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 421, 13, 42, 'As Jesus and His disciples were going away, Jesus began to speak to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 421, 14, 42, 'multitudes in verse 7 about John. He said to them, “What did you go out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 421, 15, 42, 'into the wilderness to look at? Were you looking for a reed shaken by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 421, 16, 42, 'the wind?” Many preachers are unsteady people, bending whichever way the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 421, 17, 42, 'wind is blowing. The Lord was asking, “Is this the type of person you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 421, 18, 42, 'went out to see?” There are many preachers, He implies, who are moved by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 421, 19, 42, 'the wind of public opinion. If people are craving for something, this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 421, 20, 42, 'kind of preacher gives them what they want to hear.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 421, 21, 42, 'Today we hear of seeker-friendly churches that say that they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 421, 22, 42, 'fulfilling Christ’s ministry of being the friend of sinners. But you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 421, 23, 42, 'don''t become the friend of sinners by compromising your convictions.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 421, 24, 42, 'Then you''re not a friend of sinners at all, because you don''t deliver');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 421, 25, 42, 'them from their sin or their worldliness! Seeker-friendly churches and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 421, 26, 42, 'seeker-friendly attitudes result in the compromise of our convictions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 421, 27, 42, 'and we become like reeds that are swaying with the wind. If the wind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 421, 28, 42, 'blows to the left, we move to the left. If the wind blows to the right,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 422, 1, 42, 'we move to the right. We see so much of that today. For example, there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 422, 2, 42, 'has been a craze suddenly of people falling down on the ground and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 422, 3, 42, 'laughing uncontrollably. Other preachers have seen it and said, “Hey, if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 422, 4, 42, 'this is the way things are going, we better manipulate and produce that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 422, 5, 42, 'in our congregation as well.” Then, after a while, you see Western');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 422, 6, 42, 'cultures laying hands on people and pushing them down. Then you find in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 422, 7, 42, 'many third world countries people begin to imitate that as a way to gain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 422, 8, 42, 'popularity. In other cases, someone hears someone elsewhere talking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 422, 9, 42, 'about the prosperity gospel or healing and they begin to preach that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 422, 10, 42, 'here. These are not prophets of God; these are people who preach to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 422, 11, 42, 'those who want their ears tickled.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 422, 12, 42, 'Seeker-friendly messages are meant to please man. The Apostle Paul said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 422, 13, 42, 'in Galatians 1:10, “If I seek to please men, I cannot be the servant of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 422, 14, 42, 'Christ.” It is very, very important to remember that if I ever seek to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 422, 15, 42, 'please human beings, I can never be a servant of Jesus Christ. This is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 422, 16, 42, 'fundamental principle. It''s not that I can be an inferior servant; it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 422, 17, 42, 'means that I cannot be a servant at all! A man has to choose when he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 422, 18, 42, 'preaches God''s Word whether he''s going to be a servant of God or servant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 422, 19, 42, 'of the people. He should not be like a reed swayed by the wind or shaken');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 422, 20, 42, 'by the wind. God wants people who are upright like firm trees rooted in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 422, 21, 42, 'the ground that even a storm will not shake.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 422, 22, 42, 'So Jesus says, “Did you go out to see one of these regular preachers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 422, 23, 42, 'that you''ve seen in your synagogues when you went out to the wilderness?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 422, 24, 42, 'No, that’s not John. Then what have you gone out to see? Did you go out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 422, 25, 42, 'to see a man dressed in soft clothing? All those who wear soft clothing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 422, 26, 42, 'are in king''s palaces.” In other words, He said, “Did you expect to go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 422, 27, 42, 'and see a preacher who is dressed in the latest style with branded suits');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 422, 28, 42, 'and very expensive clothes made by the most expensive tailors? He says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 423, 1, 42, 'that these people are not true servants of God. They just collect tithes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 423, 2, 42, 'from the poor people and buy expensive clothes and cars and houses for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 423, 3, 42, 'themselves.” He says those are not true prophets. There are plenty of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 423, 4, 42, 'them today, and we need these warnings about what Jesus considered to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 423, 5, 42, 'the marks of a true prophet. “But what did you go out to see? A prophet?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 423, 6, 42, 'Well I''ll tell you something, John is one who is more than a prophet.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 423, 7, 42, 'It’s amazing that Jesus referred to John the Baptist as someone who was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 423, 8, 42, 'more than a prophet. In the Old Testament, the prophet was the greatest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 423, 9, 42, 'servant of God, who expressed God''s mind.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 423, 10, 42, 'What does it mean to be greater than a prophet? Jesus says, “This is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 423, 11, 42, 'one about whom it is written, ‘I send My messenger before My face who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 423, 12, 42, 'will prepare your way before you.’” All the prophets prophesied about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 423, 13, 42, 'the coming of Christ, but John the Baptist was unique. He came to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 423, 14, 42, 'actually prepare the way just before the Messiah came. He was the last');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 423, 15, 42, 'of the prophets of the old covenant and had the unique privilege of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 423, 16, 42, 'preparing the way for the arrival of the Messiah. He''s the one who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 423, 17, 42, 'preached, “Repent, for the Kingdom of Heaven is at hand.” None of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 423, 18, 42, 'Old Testament prophets preached about the kingdom of heaven, they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 423, 19, 42, 'preached a kingdom of earth. They preached that if you honor God, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 423, 20, 42, 'will give you the land of Canaan, He will deliver you from your earthly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 423, 21, 42, 'enemies, He will kill the giants in Canaan, He will give you rain from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 423, 22, 42, 'heaven, He will bless and prosper you, and He will heal you of your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 423, 23, 42, 'sicknesses.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 423, 24, 42, 'These are the things the Old Testament prophets prophesied, but John the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 423, 25, 42, 'Baptist preached about the kingdom of heaven. He said, “You have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 423, 26, 42, 'repent. You have to turn around from living for these earthly things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 423, 27, 42, 'Something new is coming. The Messiah is now coming and He''s not going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 423, 28, 42, 'deliver you from the Romans; He’s going to deliver you from sin. He''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 424, 1, 42, 'not going to help you to have beautiful land, better than the land of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 424, 2, 42, 'Canaan. He''s going to lead you to a heavenly life on this earth.” You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 424, 3, 42, 'are not going to get much of this earth with this new message, but you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 424, 4, 42, 'are going to get all of heaven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 424, 5, 42, 'For this reason, John the Baptist was the greatest prophet of all, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 424, 6, 42, 'that''s why Jesus said he was more than a prophet. He was one who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 424, 7, 42, 'prepared the way before Jesus. Jesus goes on to say in verse 11, “Truly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 424, 8, 42, 'I say to you, among those who are born of women there is no one greater');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 424, 9, 42, 'than John the Baptist. But the one who is least in the kingdom of heaven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 424, 10, 42, 'is greater than he.” That’s an amazing statement. We who belong to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 424, 11, 42, 'kingdom of heaven are greater than John the Baptist. We have the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 424, 12, 42, 'potential to be greater than John the Baptist. It''s an amazing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 424, 13, 42, 'statement.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 424, 14, 42, 'Greater Than John the Baptist');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 424, 15, 42, 'John the Baptist was the greatest of the Old Testament prophets, and we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 424, 16, 42, 'can be greater even than him! In what way? John the Baptist could only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 424, 17, 42, 'say, “Get ready, for the kingdom of heaven is near,” whereas we can say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 424, 18, 42, '“The Kingdom of Heaven has come. It is right here.” Now we can enter in.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 424, 19, 42, 'We can live this heavenly life right now, whereas John the Baptist could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 424, 20, 42, 'not lead people into heavenly life. He could only prepare the way. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 424, 21, 42, 'is the way in which we have a greater ministry than even John the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 424, 22, 42, 'Baptist, because while he could only say, “Christ is coming now,” we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 424, 23, 42, 'say, “Christ has come, risen, and ascended, and you can receive Him into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 424, 24, 42, 'your life. You can receive the Holy Spirit into your life and come into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 424, 25, 42, 'a glorious new life.” This is what we preach.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 424, 26, 42, 'John the Baptist had the Spirit upon him, whereas we can have the Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 424, 27, 42, 'within us. This is a very fundamental difference between the old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 424, 28, 42, 'covenant and the new covenant. If you''re only interested in ministry,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 425, 1, 42, 'then you need the Spirit upon you. In the Old Testament, people had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 425, 2, 42, 'tremendous ministries with the Spirit upon them, but that didn''t change');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 425, 3, 42, 'their inner lives. Samson blessed Israel in many ways, but his inner');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 425, 4, 42, 'life was full of lust. Even David delivered Israel from many of its');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 425, 5, 42, 'enemies, but he was defeated within by sexual lust.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 425, 6, 42, 'This is not to be true of any servant of God in the new covenant. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 425, 7, 42, 'you hear of a preacher today falling into adultery or some other sin,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 425, 8, 42, 'he''s living like an old testament person even if he has been a blessing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 425, 9, 42, 'to millions. There were a lot of people in the Old Testament who were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 425, 10, 42, 'blessings to many, many people, but the Spirit was not within them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 425, 11, 42, 'That is the sense in which we are greater than John the Baptist; but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 425, 12, 42, 'that doesn''t mean that every Christian is more wholehearted than him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 425, 13, 42, 'What it means is that there is greater potential. For example, we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 425, 14, 42, 'access to computers today, so we can do calculations far better and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 425, 15, 42, 'quicker than great mathematicians who had lived a hundred years ago. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 425, 16, 42, 'this doesn''t mean that we are greater mathematicians than them. It means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 425, 17, 42, 'we have greater resources, and because we have greater resources, we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 425, 18, 42, 'do some things that those great minds that lived a hundred years ago');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 425, 19, 42, 'could not. If you compare yourself with Albert Einstein, who was one of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 425, 20, 42, 'the greatest geniuses of the 20th century, we can do calculations faster');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 425, 21, 42, 'than him, not because we''re cleverer than him, but because we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 425, 22, 42, 'access to certain gadgets like computers which he didn''t have access to.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 425, 23, 42, 'It''s in this way that Jesus is saying that the least in the kingdom of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 425, 24, 42, 'heaven is greater than John the Baptist. A little boy using a computer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 425, 25, 42, 'today can calculate things faster than the great scientist, Albert');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 425, 26, 42, 'Einstein. In the same way, with the potential we have in the new');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 425, 27, 42, 'covenant, we can rise higher than John the Baptist in our inner life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 425, 28, 42, 'For example, in this particular matter of doubt, we can come to a life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 426, 1, 42, 'where we never doubt whether Jesus is our Savior or not (as John did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 426, 2, 42, 'while he was in prison), even if we are in prison for years. We know of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 426, 3, 42, 'great signs of God in many lands where Christians were persecuted for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 426, 4, 42, 'the faith, and they were imprisoned for many years, even ten, fifteen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 426, 5, 42, 'years, but they never lost their faith. They never asked the type of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 426, 6, 42, 'question that John the Baptist asked. It''s not because they were greater');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 426, 7, 42, 'or more wholehearted than John the Baptist; it’s because they had the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 426, 8, 42, 'Holy Spirit within them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 426, 9, 42, 'This is the meaning of Matthew 11:11. We must not misuse this verse.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 426, 10, 42, 'Also, we must not come short of what God''s expectation is in the new');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 426, 11, 42, 'covenant. He wants every one of us to rise higher than John the Baptist');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 426, 12, 42, 'in our inner life. What a challenge that is! You cannot imagine John the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 426, 13, 42, 'Baptist running after women or running after money, so a Christian who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 426, 14, 42, 'claims to be under the new covenant should be way above that; when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 426, 15, 42, 'they''re not, they are sinking below even old covenant saints. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 426, 16, 42, 'foolish to say that we''re in the new covenant when we live at a lower');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 426, 17, 42, 'standard than the people in the old covenant.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 426, 18, 42, 'Jesus explains that when He says, “From the days of John the Baptist the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 426, 19, 42, 'kingdom of heaven suffers violence and violent men take it by force,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 426, 20, 42, 'because all the prophets in the law prophesied until John” (verse 12).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 426, 21, 42, 'He was saying that John was the dividing line between old covenant and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 426, 22, 42, 'new covenant. The law and the prophets is the Old Testament (the old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 426, 23, 42, 'covenant), and was in effect right up to John - John marked that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 426, 24, 42, 'dividing line. From that time onwards it’s the kingdom of heaven that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 426, 25, 42, 'preached, not the kingdom of earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 426, 26, 42, 'If your mind is set on earthly things, and what you''re preaching is an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 426, 27, 42, 'earthly message of prosperity and healing, I want to say that you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 426, 28, 42, 'more than two thousand years outdated. That is an old covenant message');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 427, 1, 42, 'from Deuteronomy 28. It is not the message of Ephesians 1:3, which says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 427, 2, 42, 'that we are blessed with all spiritual blessings in the heavenly places.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 427, 3, 42, 'It is not the message of Ephesians 2:6, which says that we are seated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 427, 4, 42, 'with Christ in the heavenly places. This is the message we''re supposed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 427, 5, 42, 'to preach; the kingdom of heaven that is already come.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 427, 6, 42, 'Violence in the Inner Life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 427, 7, 42, 'One last thing we see here is that Jesus said the kingdom of heaven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 427, 8, 42, 'suffers violence, and that violent men take it by force. In general,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 427, 9, 42, 'Christians are people of peace. We don''t fight with human beings. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 427, 10, 42, 'concentrate on fighting with the devil. The Old Testament saints fought');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 427, 11, 42, 'with human beings, but not us. We fight with Satan. But in Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 427, 12, 42, '11:12, we read that the kingdom of heaven suffers violence. What does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 427, 13, 42, 'that mean? It’s inward violence against Satan and against the flesh (the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 427, 14, 42, 'lust in our flesh). We fight with them violently. This is the mark of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 427, 15, 42, 'those who are seeking the kingdom of heaven, and these are the ones who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 427, 16, 42, 'get the kingdom of heaven. Many people do not possess the riches of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 427, 17, 42, 'God''s kingdom because inwardly they are not violent against the lust in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 427, 18, 42, 'their flesh and against satanic attempts to tempt them and make them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 427, 19, 42, 'fall.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 427, 20, 42, 'This is speaking about whole-hearted people. The kingdom of heaven is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 427, 21, 42, 'possessed by men of violence and this may be the reason why you have not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 427, 22, 42, 'come into this heavenly life so far - you''re not a person of violence in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 427, 23, 42, 'your inner life, against your own lust. You''re not a person who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 427, 24, 42, 'radical and has a violent attitude towards satanic temptations that come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 427, 25, 42, 'your way. Unfortunately, many Christians are more violent in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 427, 26, 42, 'speech and behavior towards other people, very often to other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 427, 27, 42, 'Christians. These people are old covenant people, or probably not even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 427, 28, 42, 'converted. A new covenant person never is violent against human beings.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 428, 1, 42, 'A person who fights with his wife or husband is not a new covenant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 428, 2, 42, 'person at all. A new covenant person is one who does violence in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 428, 3, 42, 'inner man, to the lusts in his flesh, and towards satanic temptation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 428, 4, 42, 'Such people possess the kingdom. This is what the Lord is emphasizing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 428, 5, 42, 'here.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 428, 6, 43, 'Chapter 42 The Spirit of Elijah');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 428, 7, 43, 'In Matthew 11:11, Jesus describes John the Baptist as the greatest of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 428, 8, 43, 'all the Old Testament prophets and then He goes on to say in verse 14,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 428, 9, 43, '“if you are willing to accept it, John himself is Elijah who was to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 428, 10, 43, 'come.” There is a prophecy in Malachi 4:5 -- almost the last words of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 428, 11, 43, 'the Old Testament -- where the Lord says, “Behold, I''m going to send you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 428, 12, 43, 'Elijah the prophet before the coming of the great and terrible day of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 428, 13, 43, 'the Lord.” This is not referring to the first coming of Christ, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 428, 14, 43, 'the first coming of Christ is not “the great and terrible day of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 428, 15, 43, 'Lord”; it is the second coming of Christ, when He will come in judgment.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 428, 16, 43, '“Before the great and terrible day of the Lord” means that just before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 428, 17, 43, 'the second coming of Christ, the Lord is going to send Elijah the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 428, 18, 43, 'prophet, and one of his main ministries will be within families to turn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 428, 19, 43, 'the hearts of the fathers to the children and the children to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 428, 20, 43, 'fathers. It also refers to the church, where the generational gap');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 428, 21, 43, 'between spiritual fathers and spiritual children will be removed in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 428, 22, 43, 'sense that they will both have fellowship with each other.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 428, 23, 43, 'Elijah’s Ministry Restores Fellowship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 428, 24, 43, 'Unfortunately in many churches, the older brothers don''t have much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 428, 25, 43, 'fellowship with the younger brothers. Their hearts are distant from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 428, 26, 43, 'younger brothers, and the younger brothers despise the older brothers as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 428, 27, 43, 'old-fashioned. However, it says that Elijah will come and remove that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 428, 28, 43, 'distance, and restore the hearts of the fathers to the children and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 429, 1, 43, 'hearts of the children to the fathers, lest “I come and smite the land');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 429, 2, 43, 'with the curse,” the Lord says. In other words, it''s a serious thing in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 429, 3, 43, 'God''s eyes when, in a family, the parents are distant from the children.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 429, 4, 43, 'That is not a good testimony for any Christian family.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 429, 5, 43, 'Parents and children must be very intimate with each other, and very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 429, 6, 43, 'often, distance comes because parents do not continue to keep the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 429, 7, 43, 'fellowship with their children from childhood. When a child is born, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 429, 8, 43, 'parents hug and kiss them and talk to them frequently even before the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 429, 9, 43, 'child knows how to speak, but as the children grow up more, there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 429, 10, 43, 'less and less communication between parents and children. By the time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 429, 11, 43, 'the children become teenagers, there is a distance, and when the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 429, 12, 43, 'children are in their twenties, they hardly ever talk to their parents.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 429, 13, 43, 'This is really sad. The Lord says that He is so sad as a result of this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 429, 14, 43, 'that the earth should be smitten with a curse for this type of thing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 429, 15, 43, 'Yet many parents don''t seem to see the seriousness of it, and they don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 429, 16, 43, 'see how important it is to restore that relationship with their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 429, 17, 43, 'children. It must begin with the fathers - it’s not the children''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 429, 18, 43, 'responsibility - whose hearts have to be turned to his children, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 429, 19, 43, 'then that will result in the children’s hearts turning to their fathers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 429, 20, 43, 'God Ministers Through the Body in the New Covenant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 429, 21, 43, 'This is a very important ministry of the last days, and this is what the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 429, 22, 43, 'Lord is going to send Elijah to do. When it refers to Elijah, Jesus said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 429, 23, 43, 'about John the Baptist, “If you accept him (meaning if the Jewish nation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 429, 24, 43, 'Israel accepts John the Baptist), then it would be the fulfillment of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 429, 25, 43, 'that prophecy.” However, we know that they did not accept him. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 429, 26, 43, 'rejected him, and finally Herod beheaded him. So there''s going to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 429, 27, 43, 'another Elijah who is going to come before the second coming of Christ,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 429, 28, 43, 'and that will not be one person. In the Old Testament, the Prophets were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 430, 1, 43, 'individuals - Jeremiah, Isaiah, Elijah, Elisha, John the Baptist; but as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 430, 2, 43, 'soon as Jesus came, He never sent out His disciples one by one, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 430, 3, 43, 'always two by two. That is what is carried on in the Acts of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 430, 4, 43, 'Apostles. The Lord sent out His first missionary teams always two by two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 430, 5, 43, '- Paul and Barnabas, Peter and John, going to the temple. You read in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 430, 6, 43, 'Acts 3, after the day of Pentecost, it was always two by two, and that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 430, 7, 43, 'is because in the New Covenant, the Lord ministers through a body, not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 430, 8, 43, 'through an individual. This is never true in the Old Testament, as the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 430, 9, 43, 'Prophets all worked individually. The only exception could be just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 430, 10, 43, 'before the New Covenant began -- Haggai and Zechariah -- otherwise, all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 430, 11, 43, 'the Old Testament Prophets worked individually. In the New Covenant,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 430, 12, 43, 'however, it’s never individual; it''s a body.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 430, 13, 43, 'So the anointed body of Christ on earth, the new man, is going to be the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 430, 14, 43, 'Elijah. It''s a church of living, powerful, anointed, Spirit-filled');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 430, 15, 43, 'people that is going to be the Elijah in the last days, proclaiming,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 430, 16, 43, 'bringing together spiritual fathers with spiritual children and earthly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 430, 17, 43, 'fathers with earthly children and preparing the way again for the second');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 430, 18, 43, 'coming of Christ. This is the important thing: that just like John the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 430, 19, 43, 'Baptist prepared Israel for the first coming of Christ, the church is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 430, 20, 43, 'going to prepare people for the second coming of Christ saying, “Prepare');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 430, 21, 43, 'the way of the Lord.” And just like John the Baptist’s message was one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 430, 22, 43, 'of repentance, the main message that the church has to proclaim in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 430, 23, 43, 'day and age just before the coming of the Lord is, “Repent.” There is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 430, 24, 43, 'tremendous need for the Spirit of Elijah to be manifested in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 430, 25, 43, 'proclamation of the gospel to Christians today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 430, 26, 43, 'The last messages of Jesus to the church in Revelation 2 and 3, to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 430, 27, 43, 'five churches that were backslidden, was, “Repent.” Repentance is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 430, 28, 43, 'last message that Christ gave to the church. When He was on earth, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 431, 1, 43, 'was preaching repentance to sinners; in the Acts of the Apostles, they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 431, 2, 43, 'preached repentance to sinners; and in the book of Revelation, the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 431, 3, 43, 'message is given to the church: the church needs to repent. This is also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 431, 4, 43, 'the message of John the Baptist, and the church, in the Spirit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 431, 5, 43, 'Elijah, needs to proclaim it as well, just like Elijah just stood on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 431, 6, 43, 'Mount Carmel and said to the Israelites, “Choose whom you want to serve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 431, 7, 43, '- Jehovah or Baal. You cannot serve both” (1 Kings 18:21).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 431, 8, 43, 'No One Can Serve Two Gods');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 431, 9, 43, 'We think we understand this very clearly. As we read that, we say, “it’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 431, 10, 43, 'obvious that people could not serve Jehovah or Baal. Today we don''t pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 431, 11, 43, 'to Jehovah; we pray to our Heavenly Father. We don''t call God “Jehovah;”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 431, 12, 43, 'we call Him “Father.” What is Baal representing today? Baal represents');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 431, 13, 43, 'money and material wealth, or what Jesus called “mammon,” which is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 431, 14, 43, 'everything connected with earthly wealth. Jesus said in Luke 16:13, “No');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 431, 15, 43, 'man can serve two masters - or have two Gods,” just like Elijah said on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 431, 16, 43, 'Mount Carmel, “You cannot serve Jehovah and Baal.” Jesus saying, “You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 431, 17, 43, 'cannot serve God and mammon” is the exact equivalent of what Elijah');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 431, 18, 43, 'preached on Mount Carmel. So when the church comes in the Spirit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 431, 19, 43, 'Elijah in the last days, the prophetic message of the church, which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 431, 20, 43, 'hardly anybody is preaching today, is this: “He who has ears to hear,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 431, 21, 43, 'let him hear: you cannot serve God and mammon. If your heart is set on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 431, 22, 43, 'material wealth, forget about serving God, and if your heart is serving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 431, 23, 43, 'material wealth, just go ahead and serve that god like businessmen”. For');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 431, 24, 43, 'example, in the world, they serve the god mammon so devotedly, that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 431, 25, 43, 'dream about it, live for it, and work day and night for it. Where do we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 431, 26, 43, 'have Christians who work day and night to serve the true God and who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 431, 27, 43, 'not at all interested in mammon? Most businessmen in the world are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 431, 28, 43, 'interested in God; they''re only interested in mammon and money. Why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 432, 1, 43, 'don''t we have equally devoted servants of God who are not at all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 432, 2, 43, 'interested in mammon or money? Where do you find such preachers? This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 432, 3, 43, 'the sad lack in Christendom. The Apostles were like that - they served');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 432, 4, 43, 'God. You never find any collection being raised for the Apostles in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 432, 5, 43, 'entire New Testament. All the money raised in the Acts of the Apostles');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 432, 6, 43, 'and what you read about in the New Testament in 2 Corinthians 8 and 9');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 432, 7, 43, 'was always for the poor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 432, 8, 43, 'Look to God to Meet Your Needs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 432, 9, 43, 'The Apostles were servants of God, and they had to trust God for their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 432, 10, 43, 'needs, that God would move people to meet their needs. The Philippians,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 432, 11, 43, 'for example, sent gifts to Paul. He and the Apostles trusted God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 432, 12, 43, 'didn''t live by salaries nor served God and mammon. This is a tragedy in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 432, 13, 43, 'Christendom today, which has ruined God''s work. We have multitudes of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 432, 14, 43, 'preachers today who are not trusting God for their needs. They trust');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 432, 15, 43, 'some organization, or they are looking to U.S. for help. “Where shall my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 432, 16, 43, 'help come from? Shall I look up to the hills?” the Psalmist says, “No,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 432, 17, 43, 'my help comes from the Lord.” But today''s preachers say, “Where shall my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 432, 18, 43, 'help come from? Yes, it comes from this organization; it comes from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 432, 19, 43, 'America; it comes from some western country.” It’s not from God. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 432, 20, 43, 'tragedy is that they don''t look to God, and that''s because the church is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 432, 21, 43, 'not coming forth in the Spirit of Elijah saying, “You cannot serve God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 432, 22, 43, 'and money.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 432, 23, 43, 'This is such an important message, and the reason why I believe this is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 432, 24, 43, 'needed is because Jesus said to the Israelites, “If you accept him, this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 432, 25, 43, 'is the Elijah who is to come,” but they did not accept him. Therefore,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 432, 26, 43, 'this message needs to come forth in these last days, the message of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 432, 27, 43, 'repentance and the message of choosing today whom you will serve, God or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 432, 28, 43, 'money. Jesus says at the end of Matthew 11:15, “He who has ears, to hear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 433, 1, 43, 'let him hear.” What does he mean by that? What I''ve just explained above');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 433, 2, 43, 'is not something that every Christian wants to hear. Perhaps as you hear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 433, 3, 43, 'it, you may think it is too radical a message, and not so important. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 433, 4, 43, 'so, then you don''t have an ear to hear it. The Lord says, “Forget about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 433, 5, 43, 'you, but there may be someone who is listening to this who does have an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 433, 6, 43, 'ear to hear.” It is only those whom the Lord is trying to reach; He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 433, 7, 43, 'ignores all the others. Even when He was on earth, so many people heard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 433, 8, 43, 'His message and they had physical ears to hear, but inwardly -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 433, 9, 43, 'spiritually - they had no ears to hear. What the Lord was saying to His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 433, 10, 43, 'people then is exactly the same today, and that''s why He says, “He who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 433, 11, 43, 'has ears to hear let him hear.” He is speaking about inward ears.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 433, 12, 43, 'Resist a Critical Attitude Towards God’s Servants');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 433, 13, 43, 'Then He goes on to say in Matthew 11:16, “To what shall I compare this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 433, 14, 43, 'generation?” Remember we are trying to understand all that Jesus taught');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 433, 15, 43, 'and trying to study, in depth, what Jesus taught, verse by verse, so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 433, 16, 43, 'that we can practice it ourselves and then proclaim it to others. “What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 433, 17, 43, 'shall I compare this generation to? It’s like children sitting in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 433, 18, 43, 'marketplace who call out to other children saying, ‘We played the flute');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 433, 19, 43, 'and you did not dance, and we sang a dirge and you did not mourn.’”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 433, 20, 43, 'Imagine children saying, “Hey, listen, we''re playing a game here. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 433, 21, 43, 'we play the flute, you must dance, and then when we sing a dirge, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 433, 22, 43, 'must mourn.” And then the other children don’t cooperate. Then the first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 433, 23, 43, 'children start playing and singing and saying, “Hey we we''re over here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 433, 24, 43, 'playing a flute, you should be dancing, but you are not dancing! And we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 433, 25, 43, 'are playing a dirge and you''re not mourning!” In the same way, the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 433, 26, 43, 'says that John came neither eating nor drinking. He is comparing them to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 433, 27, 43, 'these children who, whatever you do, think that is wrong. John did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 433, 28, 43, 'eat or drink - he was fasting and eating locusts and honey in the forest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 434, 1, 43, '- and they still said he has a demon. Imagine a man resting in camels’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 434, 2, 43, 'skin and eating all that type of stuff in the wilderness, he might seem');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 434, 3, 43, 'like he''s got a demon. Jesus comes exactly the opposite of that and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 434, 4, 43, 'verse 17, we see the comparison of two opposites: one is the dance and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 434, 5, 43, 'the other is a funeral song. He is comparing the two, John the Baptist');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 434, 6, 43, 'who came fasting and living very simply, not even wearing regular');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 434, 7, 43, 'clothes but camel skin etc. and the Son of Man who came wearing the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 434, 8, 43, 'type of clothes as everybody else wears, eating and drinking and not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 434, 9, 43, 'emphasizing fasting or a simple lifestyle and all that. And the people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 434, 10, 43, 'said, “He is a gluttonous man and a drunkard.” And on top of that, John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 434, 11, 43, 'the Baptist was not a friend of sinners - he had nothing with to do with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 434, 12, 43, 'sinners - but Jesus was.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 434, 13, 43, 'Christ is Our Example of a Perfect Preacher');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 434, 14, 43, 'Jesus is saying that whatever God''s servants do, people can always find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 434, 15, 43, 'something to criticize. This is the attitude of many Christians. Their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 434, 16, 43, 'whole mind is a critical attitude, and whichever servant of God it is,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 434, 17, 43, 'they''ll find something to fault him. You may find yourself like that my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 434, 18, 43, 'friend, that every preacher has something wrong with him, and you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 434, 19, 43, 'the great expert for giving marks to the different preachers saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 434, 20, 43, '“So-and-so gets 30% or 80% or 75%.” You''re giving marks, criticizing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 434, 21, 43, 'everyone because it depends on what you want to hear. If you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 434, 22, 43, 'comparing preachers with Jesus and the Scriptures, that''s a very good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 434, 23, 43, 'thing to do. In fact, we should do that. I do it all the time. I seek to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 434, 24, 43, 'compare preachers with Christ. I see Christ as the example of a perfect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 434, 25, 43, 'preacher, Who really showed us how we should serve God, so I seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 434, 26, 43, 'compare every preacher with Christ. I see whether that person is free');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 434, 27, 43, 'from the love of money, like Christ, whether he is humble and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 434, 28, 43, 'approachable, and things like that. We can also compare a person''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 435, 1, 43, 'teaching with the Word of God and see whether it is according to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 435, 2, 43, 'Scripture.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 435, 3, 43, 'But the attitude that Jesus is criticizing is different; the attitude of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 435, 4, 43, 'always trying to find fault. It says about the Pharisees that they would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 435, 5, 43, 'look carefully to see if there was some way in which they could catch');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 435, 6, 43, 'Jesus in some word that He said or something that He did. They were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 435, 7, 43, 'watching carefully, and there are some Christians like that who’ve got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 435, 8, 43, 'shrewd eyes. They don''t have ears to hear the truth; they''re only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 435, 9, 43, 'watching and listening for something to criticize. Most of these are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 435, 10, 43, 'even converted people; they only think they are Christians. They may say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 435, 11, 43, 'they are born again, but if they were really born again, they would be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 435, 12, 43, 'delivered from this destructive critical attitude. There is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 435, 13, 43, 'constructive criticism which always seeks to go directly to the person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 435, 14, 43, 'and speaks in an encouraging constructive way, but there''s a destructive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 435, 15, 43, 'criticism which usually speaks behind a person''s back and it is only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 435, 16, 43, 'interested in tearing people down and tearing down the work of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 435, 17, 43, 'There is a big difference.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 435, 18, 43, 'Jesus Came to Draw People to Repentance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 435, 19, 43, 'The Lord says, “John the Baptist came like this and you found fault with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 435, 20, 43, 'him. I have come in a different manner, and you find fault with Me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 435, 21, 43, 'Well, who is going to satisfy you? Nobody will satisfy you,” and those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 435, 22, 43, 'are the people who don''t have ears to hear anybody. If Almighty God came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 435, 23, 43, 'down, they wouldn''t listen to even Him, and so He says, “Wisdom is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 435, 24, 43, 'vindicated by her deeds.” It is a difficult verse to fully interpret.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 435, 25, 43, 'There could be a depth of meaning in that simple sentence, which is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 435, 26, 43, 'capable of more than one interpretation, that is, the wisdom of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 435, 27, 43, 'person''s life, we could say, will be manifested by the results of his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 435, 28, 43, 'life. Whether a man has wisdom is seen in his deeds, his actions, and in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 436, 1, 43, 'how he lives. The very fact that people who claim to have wisdom are so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 436, 2, 43, 'critical proves that they don''t have any wisdom. Those who really have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 436, 3, 43, 'wisdom will behave like Christ and see things to appreciate. They will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 436, 4, 43, 'see what is godly in a person and accept it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 436, 5, 43, 'It goes on to say in verse 20 that “He began to reproach the cities in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 436, 6, 43, 'which most of His miracles were done because they did not repent.” It’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 436, 7, 43, 'very important to understand that the purpose of the miracles, according');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 436, 8, 43, 'to Matthew 11:20, was to lead people to repentance. It was not to show');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 436, 9, 43, 'people what a great person He was, unlike a lot of so-called healers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 436, 10, 43, 'with fake miracles. They''re more like magicians who stand upon a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 436, 11, 43, 'platform and do a magic show to impress people - “You see how cleverly I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 436, 12, 43, 'can fool all of you” - a lot of today''s healing ministries are like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 436, 13, 43, 'that, fooling people. A lot of today''s so-called supernatural ministries');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 436, 14, 43, 'of pushing people down are like a magic show on a platform. We must not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 436, 15, 43, 'be deceived by that. Jesus did miracles in order to lead the people to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 436, 16, 43, 'repentance, and He didn''t care what they thought about Him. If they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 436, 17, 43, 'repented, that was it and He wasn’t gathering crowds to demonstrate His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 436, 18, 43, 'healing powers. He was gathering people constantly to repent, and He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 436, 19, 43, 'reproached them because they had seen His miracles but had still not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 436, 20, 43, 'repented.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 436, 21, 43, 'Jesus mentions the names Chorazin and Bethsaida saying, “Woe unto you!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 436, 22, 43, 'Woe unto you because if the miracles had occurred in Tyre and Sidon that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 436, 23, 43, 'had occurred near you, they would have repented.” Tyre and Sidon were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 436, 24, 43, 'non-Israeli cities outside the boundaries of Israel, and sometimes in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 436, 25, 43, 'the Old Testament the prophets denounced them for their sins. The Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 436, 26, 43, 'is saying that if these miracles had been done in Tyre and Sidon, those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 436, 27, 43, 'heathen nations, the cities would have repented. “You guys have seen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 436, 28, 43, 'these miracles, and you have heard these wonderful messages, so your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 437, 1, 43, 'responsibility is greater.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 437, 2, 43, 'To Whom Much Is Given, Much Is Expected');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 437, 3, 43, 'The simple principle in Scripture is that to whom more is given, more is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 437, 4, 43, 'required. The more God has done for us and taught us, and the more we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 437, 5, 43, 'have received God''s Word, the more we are answerable to Him for what we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 437, 6, 43, 'have heard. God is not going to judge all people equally. He is very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 437, 7, 43, 'clear in Luke 12 that “To whom more is given, more is required, and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 437, 8, 43, 'whom less is given, less is required.” It''s as simple as in a school, a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 437, 9, 43, '3rd standard student is expected to know less mathematics than a 10th');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 437, 10, 43, 'standard student. Because the 10th standard student has been taught');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 437, 11, 43, 'more, more is expected of him. Less is expected of the 3rd standard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 437, 12, 43, 'student because he''s been taught less. This is a very elementary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 437, 13, 43, 'principle, which you understand in schools.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 437, 14, 43, 'It’s the same thing in the Christian life. There are many Christians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 437, 15, 43, 'today who claim to belong to separate assemblies who know the Word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 437, 16, 43, 'God better than other groups. They look down on other denominations of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 437, 17, 43, 'churches saying, “We know more than you.” That''s probably true, but if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 437, 18, 43, 'you do know more than them, then your standard of life must be much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 437, 19, 43, 'higher than theirs. But is that true? Very often it''s not true. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 437, 20, 43, 'are people who look down on others saying, “I''m filled with the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 437, 21, 43, 'Spirit and I speak in tongues.” If he does, fine for him, but I hope his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 437, 22, 43, 'standard of life is at least a hundred times better than another person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 437, 23, 43, 'whom he accuses of not being filled with the Holy Spirit. If the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 437, 24, 43, 'fullness of the Holy Spirit does not make your life at least 100 times');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 437, 25, 43, 'better than the lives of other people who are not filled with the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 437, 26, 43, 'Spirit, then I question what type of spirit you have received.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 437, 27, 43, 'The Holy Spirit Makes Us Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 437, 28, 43, 'That guy quarrels with this his wife, and you quarrel with your wife.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 438, 1, 43, 'That guy loves money, and you love money. So what has the so-called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 438, 2, 43, '“fullness of the Spirit” done for you? What has the so-called “speaking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 438, 3, 43, 'in tongues” done for you? If it hasn’t delivered you from anger and from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 438, 4, 43, 'lusting after women, what has it done? It is one of the great deceptions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 438, 5, 43, 'of today, people thinking, ‘Oh, I got a little shaking, a little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 438, 6, 43, 'experience, and I blabbered something, so I''m filled with the Spirit.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 438, 7, 43, 'Don''t be deceived. The Holy Spirit makes us holy. Many people understand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 438, 8, 43, 'that an evil spirit makes people evil, an unclean spirit makes people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 438, 9, 43, 'unclean, and a deceiving spirit deceives. So what does the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 438, 10, 43, 'do? He makes people holy, not just make a lot of noise. Unfortunately,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 438, 11, 43, 'that''s what a lot of people think, that when the Holy Spirit comes, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 438, 12, 43, 'make a lot of noise. You go to a church’s Sunday meeting where everybody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 438, 13, 43, 'is making a lot of noise, and you think, ‘Oh, they’ve got the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 438, 14, 43, 'Spirit.’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 438, 15, 43, 'I remember a man once came to our church in Bangalore and said to me,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 438, 16, 43, '“You don''t have the Holy Spirit here.” I said, “How do you know? Have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 438, 17, 43, 'you seen how I speak to my wife at home? Do you see how I handle money?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 438, 18, 43, 'Those are the ways we find out whether a man is filled with the Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 438, 19, 43, 'or not. You don’t know any of those things, so how can you say that?” He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 438, 20, 43, 'said, “Well, you don''t have enough noise in the meetings.” “Ha!” I said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 438, 21, 43, '“Your trinity is Father, Son and Noisy Spirit. My Trinity is Father,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 438, 22, 43, 'Son, and Holy Spirit. That''s the big difference. You can follow your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 438, 23, 43, 'trinity if you like, but it’s a false trinity. The Holy Spirit does not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 438, 24, 43, 'make people noisy; He makes them holy.” We may or may not make noise -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 438, 25, 43, 'that depends a lot on our temperament, what we''re used to in our life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 438, 26, 43, 'and factors like that - but holiness is something which the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 438, 27, 43, 'communicates to every single one whose life He fills. This is so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 438, 28, 43, 'important to understand.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 439, 1, 43, 'The purpose of the miracles and this message is that we might come to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 439, 2, 43, 'repentance. Otherwise, the Lord says, “These heathen nations are better');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 439, 3, 43, 'than you. And you, Capernaum, who have been exalted to heaven, you shall');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 439, 4, 43, 'descend to Hades.” Capernaum is full of people who think they''re holy,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 439, 5, 43, 'but they’ll go to hell. He says, “If the miracles done in you were done');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 439, 6, 43, 'in Sodom and Gomorrah, they would have remained until today, but in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 439, 7, 43, 'day of judgment, it''ll be more tolerable for the land of Sodom than for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 439, 8, 43, 'you.” I believe that''s the word many Christians need to recognize, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 439, 9, 43, 'it is going to be more tolerable for non-Christians in the day of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 439, 10, 43, 'judgment than for many Christians. How many Christians believe that in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 439, 11, 43, 'the day of judgment it''s going to be more tolerable for non-Christians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 439, 12, 43, 'because they never knew the truth, and because they never understood');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 439, 13, 43, 'these things? But we understand.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 439, 14, 43, 'May God help us to take this seriously and really repent.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 439, 15, 44, 'Chapter 43 Revelation from God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 439, 16, 44, '“At that time, Jesus said, ‘I praise You, Father, Lord of heaven and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 439, 17, 44, 'earth, that You have hidden these things from the wise and intelligent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 439, 18, 44, 'and have revealed them to infants. Yes, Father, for thus it was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 439, 19, 44, 'well-pleasing in Your sight’” (Matthew 11:25-26).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 439, 20, 44, 'This is a fundamental principle for understanding Scripture - God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 439, 21, 44, 'hidden His greatest truths from clever and intelligent people. In the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 439, 22, 44, 'world, you need to be clever and intelligent in order to understand many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 439, 23, 44, 'things and to work in any earthly occupation. But in spiritual matters,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 439, 24, 44, 'that is no advantage. It can be a handicap. I do not think most people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 439, 25, 44, 'realize this. Many people think that because they have a clever and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 439, 26, 44, 'intelligent mind, they can understand the Bible better. But it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 439, 27, 44, 'exactly the opposite. The cleverest people in Israel were the Pharisees,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 439, 28, 44, 'and they could not understand Christ. They studied the Old Testament');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 440, 1, 44, 'carefully and read the Scriptures every Sabbath (Acts 13:27), but when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 440, 2, 44, 'Jesus Christ (Whom the entire Old Testament spoke about) came into their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 440, 3, 44, 'midst, they thought He was the prince of devils. How much more wrong can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 440, 4, 44, 'anyone be than those people who considered the Son of God to be the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 440, 5, 44, 'prince of devils? Those are complete opposites!! On the other hand, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 440, 6, 44, 'Roman centurion at the cross, who had never read the Bible in his life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 440, 7, 44, 'said, “You are the Son of God” (Mark 15:39). So we see that clever and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 440, 8, 44, 'intelligent people in Jesus'' lifetime missed the truth, while simple');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 440, 9, 44, 'people received it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 440, 10, 44, 'When Jesus asked His disciples, “Who do you say that I am?” (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 440, 11, 44, '16:15), Simon Peter replied, “You are the Christ, the Son of the living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 440, 12, 44, 'God. You are the Messiah.” How did he know that? Was he cleverer than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 440, 13, 44, 'the Pharisees who studied the Scriptures? The Pharisees studied the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 440, 14, 44, 'Scriptures much more than Peter. Peter was a fisherman. He was not a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 440, 15, 44, 'scribe or a scholar, but God revealed Jesus to him. Jesus said in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 440, 16, 44, 'Matthew 16:17, “Blessed are you, Simon son of Jonah because flesh and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 440, 17, 44, 'blood did not reveal this to you, but my Father Who is in heaven.” In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 440, 18, 44, 'other words, “Your human cleverness and intelligence did not reveal this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 440, 19, 44, 'to you, but my Father in heaven revealed it to you.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 440, 20, 44, 'There is a great word in the New Testament called revelation. You do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 440, 21, 44, 'find it so much in the Old Testament. In the Old Testament, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 440, 22, 44, 'important thing was understanding. The Old Testament tabernacle had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 440, 23, 44, 'three parts: the outer court, the Holy Place, and the Most Holy Place.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 440, 24, 44, 'This corresponds exactly to man, who was created to be the tabernacle of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 440, 25, 44, 'God. The outer court was visible to everyone, symbolizing the body,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 440, 26, 44, 'which is visible to everyone. The Holy Place and the Most Holy Place');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 440, 27, 44, 'were covered by a tent. This tent had two parts, not one. These two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 440, 28, 44, 'parts symbolize soul and spirit. 1 Thessalonians 5:23 makes this very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 441, 1, 44, 'clear: man is composed of spirit, soul and body. In that Old Testament');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 441, 2, 44, 'tabernacle, there was a thick veil between the Holy Place and the Most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 441, 3, 44, 'Holy Place, which also symbolized a thick veil between the soul and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 441, 4, 44, 'spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 441, 5, 44, 'This meant that man could not go into God''s presence - into the Most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 441, 6, 44, 'Holy Place - and that God could not come and dwell in man’s spirit. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 441, 7, 44, 'is because there was a big veil between the soul and spirit. This thick');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 441, 8, 44, 'veil is what we call “self-will” or the “flesh” in the new covenant. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 441, 9, 44, 'the New Testament, the word “flesh” symbolizes self-will. When the Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 441, 10, 44, 'says that Jesus came in the flesh, He did not have any sin in Him. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 441, 11, 44, 'is no sin in Him at all, but He came with a will of His Own, which He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 441, 12, 44, 'had to deny. Jesus said in John 6:38, “I came from heaven not to do My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 441, 13, 44, 'Own will.” He never did His Own will. As far as He was concerned, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 441, 14, 44, 'door to His Spirit was constantly open to the Father. Jesus was in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 441, 15, 44, 'perfect communication with the Father. The more self-will you have, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 441, 16, 44, 'less communication you have with God. Also, pride is one of the big');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 441, 17, 44, 'things that block the spirit from being open to God. Jesus had zero');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 441, 18, 44, 'pride in Him. We can say that the veil was completely open and rent. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 441, 19, 44, 'more pride we have, the less communication with God we will have in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 441, 20, 44, 'own lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 441, 21, 44, 'Why is God against clever and intelligent people? It is not because of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 441, 22, 44, 'their cleverness and intelligence. We have an example of the opposite of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 441, 23, 44, 'Peter, which is the Apostle Paul. Paul had a brilliant mind. He was one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 441, 24, 44, 'of the cleverest and most intelligent people in his generation. If he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 441, 25, 44, 'were living today, he would have been a top computer scientist or rocket');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 441, 26, 44, 'scientist or some type of top businessman. He had such a brilliant mind,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 441, 27, 44, 'but he received revelation just like Peter. Paul writes in Galatians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 441, 28, 44, '1:16 that it pleased God to “reveal His Son inside me.” Paul got a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 442, 1, 44, 'revelation inside as to Whom Jesus was.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 442, 2, 44, 'God is not against cleverness and intelligence, because that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 442, 3, 44, 'something we are born with. You did not create your cleverness or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 442, 4, 44, 'intelligence. Neither did you acquire it by study. It is something you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 442, 5, 44, 'were born with, exactly like the color of your skin or your height.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 442, 6, 44, 'These are natural characteristics that are in us. Some are born with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 442, 7, 44, 'higher intelligence and some are born with less. So how in the world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 442, 8, 44, 'could God be against someone whom He Himself created with greater');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 442, 9, 44, 'intelligence? He is not against intelligent people. Why then does Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 442, 10, 44, 'say to God, “You have hidden these things from the clever and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 442, 11, 44, 'intelligent”? Please pay careful attention to this - it is because the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 442, 12, 44, 'more one has which others do not have, the greater the tendency there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 442, 13, 44, 'for pride in him. If you are a student in a class and everybody is more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 442, 14, 44, 'intelligent than you, you will not be proud. You would be pretty humble.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 442, 15, 44, 'But if you go to another school where everybody in your class is less');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 442, 16, 44, 'intelligent than you, you will be proud. Pride comes by comparison. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 442, 17, 44, 'humility comes by comparison too. When a person is very clever and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 442, 18, 44, 'intelligent, and he compares himself with other people around him, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 442, 19, 44, 'tends to be proud. It is pride that hinders him from getting revelation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 442, 20, 44, 'In another place, Jesus said that it is difficult for a rich person to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 442, 21, 44, 'enter God''s kingdom (Matthew 19:23). Some people have inherited a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 442, 22, 44, 'money. They did not chase after money. Maybe their father was a rich');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 442, 23, 44, 'man. They inherited a lot of money and are rich. Many millionaires are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 442, 24, 44, 'born into rich families. What can they do? Is God against them because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 442, 25, 44, 'they were born into a million-rupee inheritance? No, but the more wealth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 442, 26, 44, 'a person has, the more he tends to look down on people who are poor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 442, 27, 44, 'When Jesus speaks about riches, it could be riches of intelligence. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 442, 28, 44, 'could be riches of money. It could be riches of beauty, personality,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 443, 1, 44, 'attractiveness, gifts or whatever it is that makes us rich compared to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 443, 2, 44, 'others. If it makes us proud, it is impossible to enter God''s kingdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 443, 3, 44, 'This makes both riches and intelligence dangerous.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 443, 4, 44, 'That is why God hides things from certain people. You see the truth of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 443, 5, 44, 'that in the rest of the statement – “You have revealed them to infants.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 443, 6, 44, 'Notice that word, “revelation.” Revelation is a word used in the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 443, 7, 44, 'Testament to mean God showing something to us that cannot be understood');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 443, 8, 44, 'by mere academic study. You can read the Bible and become a scholar. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 443, 9, 44, 'can get a PhD in biblical studies just like a person can get a PhD in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 443, 10, 44, 'chemistry or physics. It is just academic study. I remember in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 443, 11, 44, 'younger days, I used to see a lot of Christian workers reading their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 443, 12, 44, 'Bible on their knees and spending hours studying the Bible. I thought');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 443, 13, 44, 'they would be very holy people. But I would watch them during the day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 443, 14, 44, 'They got angry and upset. They loved money. There was every evidence of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 443, 15, 44, 'carnality in everything in their life - competition, jealousy, etc.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 443, 16, 44, 'I was in my twenties and I was confused. I said, “Lord, what is this?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 443, 17, 44, 'How is it that people who spend so much time with Your Word behave like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 443, 18, 44, 'this?” The same day, the Lord spoke something to my heart that really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 443, 19, 44, 'opened my eyes. The Lord said that even though they are on their knees,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 443, 20, 44, 'they are reading a book. It could be a chemistry book or a newspaper or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 443, 21, 44, 'the Bible. But they are not getting in touch with God reading the Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 443, 22, 44, 'like that, anymore than they get in touch with God when they read the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 443, 23, 44, 'newspaper. I discovered that just because you read the Bible on your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 443, 24, 44, 'knees or read it for one hour, it does not mean that you contact God. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 443, 25, 44, 'you contacted God, your life would be changed! I have experienced times');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 443, 26, 44, 'when I have spent 15 minutes listening to a really godly man. The effect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 443, 27, 44, 'of it sometimes lasted for years. 15 minutes with a godly man changed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 443, 28, 44, 'the direction of my life sometimes. Can you imagine what will happen if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 444, 1, 44, 'you spend 15 minutes with God Himself? Here are people spending half an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 444, 2, 44, 'hour reading the Bible, but their lives have not changed. They are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 444, 3, 44, 'spending time with God. They are using their cleverness and intelligence');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 444, 4, 44, 'to read the Bible. Perhaps you are reading the Bible like that. You have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 444, 5, 44, 'a lot of information, but you still fight and quarrel at home. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 444, 6, 44, 'criticize, backbite, are jealous, and are in competition with others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 444, 7, 44, 'You have not received revelation. You have a lot of understanding, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 444, 8, 44, 'the Bible says in Proverbs 3:5, “Do not lean upon your own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 444, 9, 44, 'understanding.” Your own understanding will lead you astray. Trust in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 444, 10, 44, 'the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 444, 11, 44, 'Characteristics of Those Who Receive Revelation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 444, 12, 44, 'What we need is revelation. In Matthew 11:25, the Lord describes those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 444, 13, 44, 'to whom He gives revelation. Jesus taught that with your cleverness and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 444, 14, 44, 'intelligence, you cannot get revelation. What you need is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 444, 15, 44, 'characteristic that babes have. The Father reveals His truth to babes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 444, 16, 44, 'What do babes have which clever and intelligent people do not have? Is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 444, 17, 44, 'there any book that only babes can understand, but clever and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 444, 18, 44, 'intelligent people cannot understand? Can you think of any book on any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 444, 19, 44, 'subject that only babes or little children can understand, but clever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 444, 20, 44, 'and intelligent people do not understand? There is only one book like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 444, 21, 44, 'that in the whole world: the Bible. For every other book in the world,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 444, 22, 44, 'if a babe can understand it, any clever person can understand it too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 444, 23, 44, 'But the Bible can only be understood by those who have this one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 444, 24, 44, 'characteristic of babes. Jesus emphasized that in Matthew 18:3. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 444, 25, 44, 'picked up a child and said to humble yourself like this little child if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 444, 26, 44, 'you want to enter the kingdom of heaven. The primary characteristic of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 444, 27, 44, 'babe is humility. There are other characteristics too. For example, a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 444, 28, 44, 'babe has simple trust. A child simply trusts his mother or father.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 445, 1, 44, 'Whatever the mother or father teaches the child, the child believes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 445, 2, 44, 'because he or she trusts. Even if the child is given the wrong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 445, 3, 44, 'information, the child will still believe it. It is simple trust. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 445, 4, 44, 'cannot trust human beings like that, but we can certainly trust God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 445, 5, 44, 'because God will never give us wrong information. A child has that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 445, 6, 44, 'simple, trustful attitude.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 445, 7, 44, 'Another characteristic of a child is that he or she is constantly open');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 445, 8, 44, 'to understanding truth that it does not know. A child does not think it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 445, 9, 44, 'knows it all. As people grow up, they think they know it all. There are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 445, 10, 44, 'many Christians I met who think they know it all. They will not get any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 445, 11, 44, 'more revelation. They can read the Bible and not get revelation. I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 445, 12, 44, 'been reading the Bible for 53 years. I find I still get revelation on it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 445, 13, 44, 'when I read it now because I see a lot of truth here that I still do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 445, 14, 44, 'know. Come to Scripture like a babe, with the recognition that there are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 445, 15, 44, 'a lot of things you do not know. That is how a little child learns. Come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 445, 16, 44, 'to the Scriptures with humility, a simple trust in God, and in openness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 445, 17, 44, 'God’s Humility');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 445, 18, 44, 'Jesus said in Matthew 11:26, “Yes, Father, for this was well pleasing in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 445, 19, 44, 'Your sight to do this.” The reason that God gives grace to the humble is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 445, 20, 44, 'because God is a humble Person. How do I know? It says in John 1:18 that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 445, 21, 44, 'Jesus explained the Father. Jesus also said in John 14:9, “He who has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 445, 22, 44, 'seen Me has seen the Father.” Jesus is saying that if you want to know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 445, 23, 44, 'what the Father is like, just look at His life. You do not need to see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 445, 24, 44, 'the Father. When I look at Jesus’ life, the characteristic that that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 445, 25, 44, 'strikes me the most is humility. Jesus, the Son of God, had tremendous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 445, 26, 44, 'humility to wash the dirty feet of those poor fishermen. Jesus said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 445, 27, 44, 'that, “If you have seen Me, you have seen the Father.” Jesus said those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 445, 28, 44, 'words immediately after washing their feet (He washed their feet in John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 446, 1, 44, '13 and said those words in John 14). “Have you seen Me washing their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 446, 2, 44, 'feet just now? That is what the Father is like.” When you see God the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 446, 3, 44, 'Father in heaven one day, you will see that He is a very humble Person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 446, 4, 44, 'He is not arrogant or dictatorial like so many Christian leaders are.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 446, 5, 44, 'No, these leaders give a false picture of Jesus Christ and God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 446, 6, 44, 'God Himself has that nature of humility. He fellowships with people who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 446, 7, 44, 'have that nature. God can give us His nature and we can partake of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 446, 8, 44, 'divine nature (2 Peter 1:4). How do you know that you have partaken of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 446, 9, 44, 'the divine nature? It will make you tremendously humble. If your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 446, 10, 44, 'Christianity has not made you humble, you have not partaken of God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 446, 11, 44, 'nature. You still have the old Adamic nature of arrogance, pride, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 446, 12, 44, 'looking down on others. That is a characteristic of Adam. Most so-called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 446, 13, 44, 'born-again Christians that I have met do not know the slightest little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 446, 14, 44, 'thing about partaking of God’s nature. I have seen a lot of others who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 446, 15, 44, 'do not have so much understanding of Christianity or do not claim to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 446, 16, 44, 'filled with the Spirit and speak in tongues, but they have humility.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 446, 17, 44, 'They partake in God''s nature. That is more important than all the gifts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 446, 18, 44, 'of the Holy Spirit. This is the way to get revelation. Revelation is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 446, 19, 44, 'most important thing in the New Testament.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 446, 20, 44, 'It is through revelation that we get true salvation. It is through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 446, 21, 44, 'revelation that we partake of God''s nature. It is through revelation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 446, 22, 44, 'that we build the church - the body of Christ. Very often, we find that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 446, 23, 44, 'churches are congregations and not functioning bodies. The reason is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 446, 24, 44, 'because they do not have revelation. Jesus said to Peter in Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 446, 25, 44, '16:17, “Blessed are you because flesh and blood has not revealed this to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 446, 26, 44, 'you, but My Father in heaven.” Jesus said in Matthew 16:18, after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 446, 27, 44, 'speaking of this revelation, “On this rock - the Christ revealed by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 446, 28, 44, 'Father - I will build my church as the body of Christ”.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 447, 1, 44, 'Why is it that we have churches where people fight and quarrel with each');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 447, 2, 44, 'other? Your two hands have never fought with each other all your life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 447, 3, 44, 'because they are members in one body. When we recognize ourselves as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 447, 4, 44, 'members of one body, we do not fight with each other. As long as we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 447, 5, 44, 'on this earth, we may not always agree with each other, but we love one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 447, 6, 44, 'another. We may not be able to work together with all believers for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 447, 7, 44, 'various reasons, but we love one another. Every part of this body loves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 447, 8, 44, 'the other part of the body. If you cannot love fellow Christians who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 447, 9, 44, 'disagree with you, I wonder whether you have partaken of God''s nature at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 447, 10, 44, 'all. I would even question whether you are born again. The Apostle John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 447, 11, 44, 'tells us in 1 John 3:10 that we know that we are the children of God in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 447, 12, 44, 'that we love our fellow believers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 447, 13, 44, 'That this view of life and our relationship with our brothers and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 447, 14, 44, 'sisters in Christ is the result of revelation. Revelation produces');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 447, 15, 44, 'everything in the new covenant. There was no need for revelation in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 447, 16, 44, 'Old Testament. In the Old Testament, only the prophets had revelation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 447, 17, 44, 'If you wanted to know God''s will, you went to a prophet. Today, the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 447, 18, 44, 'Spirit dwells in all believers. You do not have to go to any prophet.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 447, 19, 44, 'Through the Holy Spirit, you can even know God’s will for yourself if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 447, 20, 44, 'you have humility.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 447, 21, 44, 'The Humility of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 447, 22, 44, 'In Matthew 11:26 Jesus said, “All things have been have handed over to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 447, 23, 44, 'Me by My Father.” The Father has given everything into the hands of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 447, 24, 44, 'Christ. The Father has given the entire universe and all authority to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 447, 25, 44, 'Christ. Jesus said that before He went up to heaven as well. Jesus said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 447, 26, 44, 'in Matthew 28:18, “All authority in heaven and earth has been given to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 447, 27, 44, 'Me.” Jesus did not say, “I have it.” He said it was given to Him. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 447, 28, 44, 'is humility in Christ in saying that it was given to Him. It is so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 448, 1, 44, 'different from the attitude of many Christians and Christian preachers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 448, 2, 44, 'who act as though they have acquired this through a lot of study,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 448, 3, 44, 'fasting and prayer, and other stupid, foolish things that they boast');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 448, 4, 44, 'about. Jesus never said that. He never said that He received it through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 448, 5, 44, 'many times of fasting and praying when He was Nazareth. There was no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 448, 6, 44, 'empty boasting in Christ. Everything He did was in secret before the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 448, 7, 44, 'Father. Jesus gave the glory to God by saying, “All authority in heaven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 448, 8, 44, 'has been given to Me, and all things have been handed over to Me by My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 448, 9, 44, 'Father.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 448, 10, 44, 'It is so wonderful to see this. Dear brothers and sisters, if you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 448, 11, 44, 'see it and be gripped by it, it will change your life. It will make you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 448, 12, 44, 'a deeply humble person who is constantly grateful to God for everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 448, 13, 44, 'that you have, even for physical health. We need more Christians like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 448, 14, 44, 'that in India who are thankful, humble, and grateful - who have this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 448, 15, 44, 'attitude, “All things have been handed over to me by my Father.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 448, 16, 44, 'Revelation of the Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 448, 17, 44, 'In Matthew 11:27, it says, “No one knows the Son except the Father.” Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 448, 18, 44, 'you think you know Jesus Christ? If you really know the real Christ,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 448, 19, 44, 'that must have come through the revelation of the Father. I do not mean');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 448, 20, 44, 'the external Christ. Hindus and Muslims also talk about the external');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 448, 21, 44, 'Christ. Even in the Koran, they talk about Jesus being born of Mary and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 448, 22, 44, 'the miracles He did, etc. Many Hindus respect Jesus Christ. I do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 448, 23, 44, 'mean knowing Christ in that way. A lot of Christians know Christ only in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 448, 24, 44, 'that way, as the external Christ. They have not received revelation like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 448, 25, 44, 'Peter, who received revelation that Christ is God Almighty Who became a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 448, 26, 44, 'Man so that I can become a son of God - One Whose nature I can partake');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 448, 27, 44, 'of. They have not received that. They do not know Jesus that way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 448, 28, 44, 'No one knows the Son except the Father, but the Father revealed the Son');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 449, 1, 44, 'to Peter. We see that in Matthew 16. What He did for Peter, He can do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 449, 2, 44, 'for you and me. He can reveal the Christ to us as well, and that is what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 449, 3, 44, 'we need. Further, Jesus says that no one knows the Father except the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 449, 4, 44, 'Son, and to anyone to whom the Son wills to reveal Him. It is the other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 449, 5, 44, 'way too. A lot of Christians do not know the Father. They say, “God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 449, 6, 44, 'our Father.” But how can you know whether you really know God as your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 449, 7, 44, 'Father? Do you get anxious about something? Do you get into a panic in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 449, 8, 44, 'different situations? Then I want to tell you that you do not know the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 449, 9, 44, 'Father. When you have a problem, do you turn to God first or you turn to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 449, 10, 44, 'man? If you turn to a man, you do not know the Father.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 449, 11, 44, 'These are the practical ways we can discover whether we know the Father.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 449, 12, 44, 'If your own father was the prime minister of India and you had a serious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 449, 13, 44, 'problem with the government, would you go to the local inspector of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 449, 14, 44, 'police, or would you ring up your dad, the prime minister of India? You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 449, 15, 44, 'know that you would not go to some junior person. You would not even go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 449, 16, 44, 'to the director general of police, who is a junior person compared to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 449, 17, 44, 'the prime minister of India. You would say, “Why do I need to go to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 449, 18, 44, 'director general of police? My dad is the prime minister!”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 449, 19, 44, 'Do you believe that Almighty God is greater than all the rulers of earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 449, 20, 44, 'and all the greatest dignitaries and powerful men in society? Is He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 449, 21, 44, 'really your dad? Do you know Him as “Dad”? The Bible says in Romans 8:16');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 449, 22, 44, 'that the Spirit within us cries out saying, “Abba!” “Abba” is a Hebrew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 449, 23, 44, 'word which means “Daddy” in English. The Holy Spirit comes within us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 449, 24, 44, 'crying out, looking up to God saying, “Daddy! You have become my Father!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 449, 25, 44, 'You have become my Dad!” It is not the formal title of father, but that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 449, 26, 44, 'intimate title of “Daddy!” The person whose heart cries “Daddy” is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 449, 27, 44, 'person who knows the Father. The test is in the different circumstances');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 449, 28, 44, 'of life. We can pray every day to “Our Father who art in heaven.” I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 450, 1, 44, 'prayed that for years before I knew God as my Father. I accepted Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 450, 2, 44, 'when I was 19 and a half, but I would say for sixteen or seventeen years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 450, 3, 44, 'after that, I really did not know God in a personal way. I did not know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 450, 4, 44, 'God as my Dad, to Whom I could go to anytime with any need. If I was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 450, 5, 44, 'sick, I could go to Him and ask Him to heal me. If I had a financial');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 450, 6, 44, 'need, I could go to Him. If people were troubling me, I did not have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 450, 7, 44, 'hate them. I would not have to go here and there. I go to my Dad because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 450, 8, 44, 'He is the most powerful Person in the universe. When you see Christians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 450, 9, 44, 'and Christian preachers begging others for money, is that not an insult');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 450, 10, 44, 'to their heavenly Dad? Suppose your father was the richest person in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 450, 11, 44, 'universe, would you go to some man for money? Never. These are some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 450, 12, 44, 'tests by which we know whether the Father has been revealed to us. Let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 450, 13, 44, 'us go to the Lord and say, “Lord, reveal the Father to me.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 450, 14, 45, 'Chapter 44 The Rest That Christ Gives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 450, 15, 45, 'The Test of If We Know God as a Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 450, 16, 45, '“No one knows the Father except the Son and anyone to whom the Son wills');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 450, 17, 45, 'to reveal Him” (Matthew 11:27).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 450, 18, 45, 'You may think you know the Father, but the tests of whether you really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 450, 19, 45, 'do are two-fold. First, it’s whether He’s the first one you go to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 450, 20, 45, 'whenever you are in need, and secondly, it’s whether you are free from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 450, 21, 45, 'anxiety and fear. When you are sick, do you go to a doctor first or do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 450, 22, 45, 'you go to your Dear Father? There is nothing wrong in going to a doctor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 450, 23, 45, 'There is nothing wrong in taking medicines. There is nothing wrong in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 450, 24, 45, 'seeking human help. But we must develop the habit of going to our Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 450, 25, 45, 'first. It is like a little child turning to his parents first when he is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 450, 26, 45, 'in need instead of first going to strangers or neighbors. That is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 450, 27, 45, 'test of whether we really know the Father. Since no one knows the Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 450, 28, 45, 'except for Jesus, we need to ask Jesus to reveal the Father to us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 451, 1, 45, 'This is the most important need among Christians. A lot of competition,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 451, 2, 45, 'jealousy, and strife exist because of insecurity in many Christians. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 451, 3, 45, 'have observed that for more than fifty years. I was myself insecure for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 451, 4, 45, 'many years after I was born again. In those years when I was insecure, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 451, 5, 45, 'wanted to impress people. I was jealous, competitive, afraid, anxious,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 451, 6, 45, 'and defeated in everything. But when I came to know that God is my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 451, 7, 45, 'Father intimately, that became the foundation of my life. Jesus has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 451, 8, 45, 'revealed the Father to me. When God filled me with the Holy Spirit and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 451, 9, 45, 'the Holy Spirit opened my eyes to see my Abba - my Daddy in heaven - it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 451, 10, 45, 'changed my whole life. It became the foundation of my life. This is so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 451, 11, 45, 'important. Just like how the Father reveals the Son, the Son reveals the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 451, 12, 45, 'Father. That is connected to what Jesus says in the next verse.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 451, 13, 45, 'Sometimes many people take Matthew 11:28 all by itself. It is one of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 451, 14, 45, 'bad habits that Christians have. They know individual verses. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 451, 15, 45, 'memorize verses, which is a very good thing, but very often those memory');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 451, 16, 45, 'verses become isolated verses completely out of context. If you meditate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 451, 17, 45, 'only on that verse without seeing the context, you may get some truth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 451, 18, 45, 'but miss out on the whole truth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 451, 19, 45, 'Coming to Jesus for Rest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 451, 20, 45, 'The Lord Jesus says there, “Here, come to Me. I want to reveal the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 451, 21, 45, 'Father to you, so come to Me. Come to Me, you who are weary, heavy laden');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 451, 22, 45, 'with sin, defeated, and insecure with strife and problems in your life.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 451, 23, 45, 'That is not a verse primarily for unbelievers. What does this verse say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 451, 24, 45, 'that Jesus will do? He will reveal the Father to you. The result of that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 451, 25, 45, 'is that you will get rest. Jesus will give you rest and that rest comes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 451, 26, 45, 'through knowing the Father. There is a connection between Matthew 11:27');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 451, 27, 45, 'and Matthew 11:28 that you will not understand if you just memorize');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 451, 28, 45, 'Matthew 11:28 by itself. I myself did that for many years. Jesus wants');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 452, 1, 45, 'to bring us to a life of rest.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 452, 2, 45, 'The Bible says in Isaiah 57:20, “But the wicked are like the tossing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 452, 3, 45, 'sea, for it cannot be quiet, and its waters toss up refuse and mud.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 452, 4, 45, '‘There is no peace,’ says my God, ‘for the wicked.’”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 452, 5, 45, 'Unrest and turmoil in the heart is the identifying mark of an evil man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 452, 6, 45, 'When we talk about evil people, we often think of only terrorists and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 452, 7, 45, 'murderers. But anyone who has insecurity, jealousy, and strife in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 452, 8, 45, 'heart is to some degree evil. He may not be as evil as a terrorist, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 452, 9, 45, 'the Bible says if a person’s heart is like the tossing sea, that person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 452, 10, 45, 'is wicked.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 452, 11, 45, 'Do you find at any time that your heart is disturbed with somebody else?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 452, 12, 45, 'Are you disturbed with what somebody has said about you or did to you?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 452, 13, 45, 'Are you disturbed when you expected somebody to do something, and he did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 452, 14, 45, 'not do it for you? You become disturbed and your heart is like a sea in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 452, 15, 45, 'turmoil. You have seen pictures of roaring waves in a troubled sea. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 452, 16, 45, 'your heart is like that, then according to Isaiah 57:20, there is some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 452, 17, 45, 'wickedness in it. I do not want to call you a wicked person, but it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 452, 18, 45, 'wickedness that caused that kind of restlessness inside. God’s will for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 452, 19, 45, 'you is that you might be at rest. Compare that type of troubled sea with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 452, 20, 45, 'another sea described in Revelation 15 where the righteous, godly people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 452, 21, 45, 'are standing. Revelation 15 is a beautiful contrast. Here it describes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 452, 22, 45, 'those who overcame and came out victorious. Revelation 15:2-3 says, “I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 452, 23, 45, 'saw… those who had been victorious over the beast and his image and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 452, 24, 45, 'number of his name, standing on a sea of glass, holding the harps of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 452, 25, 45, 'and singing.” This sea of glass is the exact opposite of Isaiah 57:20.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 452, 26, 45, 'I remember the years when I was in the Navy. I was on ships where I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 452, 27, 45, 'seen seas in great turmoil. The waves were ten feet high with the ship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 452, 28, 45, 'going up and down, making one seasick. I have also seen seas that are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 453, 1, 45, 'exactly like glass, without a ripple right up to the horizon. There is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 453, 2, 45, 'great contrast between a troubled sea and a sea like glass. God''s will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 453, 3, 45, 'is that we come out victorious from everything that is the opposite of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 453, 4, 45, 'Christ, which is symbolized by the beast. Our inner life will be like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 453, 5, 45, 'standing on a sea of glass, without a ripple, an anxiety, or a fear. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 453, 6, 45, 'may say that such a life is impossible on this earth. In that case,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 453, 7, 45, 'according to your faith be it done to you. It will be impossible for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 453, 8, 45, 'you, but it will be possible for someone else who has ten times more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 453, 9, 45, 'problems than you and yet says, “No, if God says it is possible, then it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 453, 10, 45, 'is possible.” According to your faith be it done to you. You will have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 453, 11, 45, 'life like a sea of glass. It does not depend on how serious your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 453, 12, 45, 'problems are. It depends on how much you believe.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 453, 13, 45, 'Complete Rest is Possible Only for Those with Faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 453, 14, 45, 'Jesus says, “I will give you rest.” When the Lord says, “Come to Me, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 453, 15, 45, 'I will give you rest like a sea of glass,” the next question He asks you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 453, 16, 45, 'is, “Do you believe I can do this for you?” In the story of the blind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 453, 17, 45, 'men in Matthew 9:27-30, Jesus asked them this question, “Do you believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 453, 18, 45, 'that I can do this for you?” They said, “Yes.” Then Jesus said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 453, 19, 45, '“According to your faith be it done to you.” That is the law with God -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 453, 20, 45, 'according to your faith be it done to you. It has nothing to do with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 453, 21, 45, 'number of problems you have or the difficulties or sicknesses you have.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 453, 22, 45, 'I am not saying you will get perfect healing from all your sickness, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 453, 23, 45, 'I believe you can have perfect rest. Whatever your problems may be,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 453, 24, 45, 'Jesus has promised that He will give you rest.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 453, 25, 45, 'There is no promise in the New Testament that Jesus will heal all our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 453, 26, 45, 'sicknesses. That does not work on earth (we need to face reality), but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 453, 27, 45, 'He has promised to give us rest - that is a clear promise. We can claim');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 453, 28, 45, 'it just like a check signed by Jesus Christ. We can take it to the bank');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 454, 1, 45, 'of heaven and say, “Lord Jesus, You said if I come to You, You will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 454, 2, 45, 'only give me forgiveness of sins, but You will also give me rest. I want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 454, 3, 45, 'it. You said that You will reveal the Father to me. I want to know the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 454, 4, 45, 'Father.” How did you get forgiveness of sins? You came to Christ, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 454, 5, 45, 'you believed that He would give it. Why is it so many other people in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 454, 6, 45, 'the world for whom Christ died have not received forgiveness of sins? It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 454, 7, 45, 'is because they do not believe; but you believed. It is according to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 454, 8, 45, 'your faith, not according to what we asked for. A lot of people ask and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 454, 9, 45, 'never get anything. If you ask and you do not believe, you will get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 454, 10, 45, 'nothing. We have to ask in faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 454, 11, 45, '“Come to Me, and I will give you rest.” There is no partiality with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 454, 12, 45, 'Christ. If you come to Him with all your heart and say, “Lord, I am so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 454, 13, 45, 'insecure in my life. I am backsliding. I am failing. I am insecure. I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 454, 14, 45, 'jealous. I have not been saved,” and if you are honest and tell the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 454, 15, 45, 'the whole thing and say, “Lord, I want to know the Father,” then He will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 454, 16, 45, 'reveal the Father to you. Your life will move to a much higher plane');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 454, 17, 45, 'than you have ever known so far. Jesus says, “Come to Me.” Do not go to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 454, 18, 45, 'men. Do not go to preachers. Do not ask some preacher to lay his empty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 454, 19, 45, 'hands on your head. You will get nothing from him. Go to Jesus and ask');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 454, 20, 45, 'Him to lay His nail pierced hands on your head. That is how I received');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 454, 21, 45, 'the anointing. I did not ask any man to put his hands on my head. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 454, 22, 45, 'asked Christ to lay His hands on my head.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 454, 23, 45, 'There is Only One Way to the Father - Through One Mediator, Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 454, 24, 45, 'I am not saying that God does not use the laying on of hands. But if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 454, 25, 45, 'do get laying on of hands, make sure it is a really godly man who lays');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 454, 26, 45, 'his hands on your head. They are very rare on earth nowadays. A lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 454, 27, 45, 'people who lay hands on peoples’ heads only bring confusion into their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 454, 28, 45, 'lives. Come to Christ. Go directly to Christ. You do not need a second');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 455, 1, 45, 'mediator. A lot of Christians do not go directly to Christ. Jesus says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 455, 2, 45, '“Come to Me.” Who do Christians go to? They go to their pastor. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 455, 3, 45, 'Jesus says, “Come to Me,” they go to their pastor. No wonder you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 455, 4, 45, 'problems! I am not saying we should not seek counsel from godly men. Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 455, 5, 45, 'it by all means, but if you want rest, you have to come to Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 455, 6, 45, 'Unconsciously, sometimes people have made their pastor a second mediator');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 455, 7, 45, 'between them and God. The Bible says in 1 Timothy 2:4-5, “There is only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 455, 8, 45, 'one mediator between God and man. That is the Man, Jesus Christ.” He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 455, 9, 45, 'the only mediator between God and man. I can go to God directly through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 455, 10, 45, 'Jesus Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 455, 11, 45, 'Our Roman Catholic friends say we have to go through Mary in order to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 455, 12, 45, 'come to Christ. This is a second mediator. You go to Mary, then go to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 455, 13, 45, 'Christ, and then go to God. A lot of Protestants despise that Roman');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 455, 14, 45, 'Catholic teaching, but they are doing the same thing themselves. They go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 455, 15, 45, 'to a pastor who then goes to Christ. They go to some so-called prophet,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 455, 16, 45, 'which is usually a false prophet. They ask him, “Can you find out what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 455, 17, 45, 'God wants me to do?” They do not go directly to Jesus. They go through a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 455, 18, 45, 'prophet, and that person is very often only interested in your money and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 455, 19, 45, 'trying to fool you. If you have to go through a second mediator, I would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 455, 20, 45, 'suggest you go to Mary rather than that pastor, because Mary at least');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 455, 21, 45, 'was a godly woman! (I am saying that sarcastically..) You do not need a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 455, 22, 45, 'second mediator. Go directly to Jesus Christ. Jesus said in Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 455, 23, 45, '11:28-29, “Come to Me. I will give you rest. Take My yoke up on you and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 455, 24, 45, 'learn from Me. And you shall find rest for your soul.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 455, 25, 45, 'This rest is not something that comes automatically without us doing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 455, 26, 45, 'anything. The two mistakes that Christians make (particularly in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 455, 27, 45, 'realm) are first, to believe that God will do everything, and I have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 455, 28, 45, 'do nothing. Or second, they think that I have to do everything – “It all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 456, 1, 45, 'depends on me and not upon God. God has finished everything on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 456, 2, 45, 'cross, but now I have to do everything from now on.” Both are completely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 456, 3, 45, 'wrong. The Christian life is a partnership. What Jesus did on the cross');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 456, 4, 45, 'was a finished work. I do not get the benefit of that finished work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 456, 5, 45, 'until I take His yoke upon me. What does it mean to take His yoke upon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 456, 6, 45, 'me (Matthew 11:29)? Unfortunately, we who live in cities hardly ever see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 456, 7, 45, 'two oxen plowing a field. Farmers use tractors these days, but in Jesus’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 456, 8, 45, 'day, and even today in the villages of India, oxen are used to plow the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 456, 9, 45, 'fields. A yoke is on the neck of the two oxen, and they plow the field');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 456, 10, 45, 'together. If an ox dies and a junior ox takes the place of the dead ox,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 456, 11, 45, 'the senior ox has to teach the junior ox how to plow a straight furrow.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 456, 12, 45, 'The senior ox tells the junior ox, “Learn from me. You do not know how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 456, 13, 45, 'to plow a straight furrow, but if you take my yoke upon you, you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 456, 14, 45, 'learn from me. I have enough experience here. I have done this for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 456, 15, 45, 'years. You are just coming in to learn. Learn from me. Take my yoke upon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 456, 16, 45, 'you, and make sure you do not rush ahead of me or lag behind. When I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 456, 17, 45, 'move forward, walk in the same pace with me step by step. Make sure you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 456, 18, 45, 'do not veer off into some other direction. Stick with the direction I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 456, 19, 45, 'going. You will find perfect rest. You will be able to do a great job.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 456, 20, 45, 'You will not make a zigzag furrow through the field. It will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 456, 21, 45, 'absolutely straight.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 456, 22, 45, 'His Yoke Is a Partnership, Where We Follow His Lead in Every Situation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 456, 23, 45, 'That is the picture Jesus is using. He says, “Take My yoke upon you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 456, 24, 45, 'Learn from Me how to walk straight and upright without any crookedness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 456, 25, 45, 'Trust Me. I am a Partner with you.” Isn’t that wonderful? A lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 456, 26, 45, 'business people would be delighted if the top businessman in the country');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 456, 27, 45, 'asked them to be partners with him. They would think, “Wow! The top');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 456, 28, 45, 'businessman in the country wants me to be a partner with him?” That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 457, 1, 45, 'unheard of. The top businessman would not come to some businessman who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 457, 2, 45, 'is just starting to do business and say, “Be a partner with me.” On top');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 457, 3, 45, 'of that, the top businessman says, “In this partnership, I will do all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 457, 4, 45, 'the investing with my money. You have to put in nothing, but we will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 457, 5, 45, 'share the profits.” That is unheard of. How in the world can any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 457, 6, 45, 'businessman be willing to do that? But that is what Jesus said. He said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 457, 7, 45, '“Come to Me. Take My yoke upon you. Let us form a partnership. You do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 457, 8, 45, 'not have to invest anything, but simply be a partner with Me, 100%. Let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 457, 9, 45, 'us proceed doing God''s work together.” This is the way to serve the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 457, 10, 45, 'Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 457, 11, 45, '“Take My yoke upon you and learn from Me for I am gentle and humble in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 457, 12, 45, 'heart,” Matthew 11:29.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 457, 13, 45, 'How do we come to this life of rest? It is not by study. It is by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 457, 14, 45, 'character of our heart changing through our fellowship with Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 457, 15, 45, 'Christ. Taking Christ’s yoke upon us is a picture of fellowship. We have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 457, 16, 45, 'to be very careful not to rush ahead or lag behind. Fellowship means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 457, 17, 45, 'walking with Him and not going off in some other direction. For example,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 457, 18, 45, 'one day you want to watch some television program or a movie. But you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 457, 19, 45, 'are absolutely sure in your heart that Christ would not be willing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 457, 20, 45, 'sit and watch with you. If He were in the room, He would walk out. What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 457, 21, 45, 'are you doing then? You are letting Him go. You are going off in some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 457, 22, 45, 'other direction. You will not have rest in your soul. You may enjoy the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 457, 23, 45, 'movie. Your carnal self may enjoy the movie, but you lose your rest.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 457, 24, 45, 'That is just one example.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 457, 25, 45, 'Or suppose that you come into a situation in the office where you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 457, 26, 45, 'asked to do something unrighteous. Your conscience says no. But you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 457, 27, 45, 'do it and think to yourself, “Well, I will get some benefit out of it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 457, 28, 45, 'My boss has asked me to do it. I will get some profit out of the whole');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 458, 1, 45, 'thing.” You know that Jesus would not do it. If Jesus were sitting there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 458, 2, 45, 'with you, you would not sign that paper. But you go ahead and sign it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 458, 3, 45, 'because of the benefit you can get. You have veered off into another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 458, 4, 45, 'direction. No wonder you get unrest!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 458, 5, 45, 'There are many other instances like that. For example, you could be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 458, 6, 45, 'tempted to speak a rude word to somebody in your home or in your office');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 458, 7, 45, 'or on the road when somebody violates the rules of the road. These are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 458, 8, 45, 'the occasions in life where we tend to veer off. “I want to go in my own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 458, 9, 45, 'direction. I want to say what I want to say. I want to let that person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 458, 10, 45, 'have a piece of my mind.” That is how we miss God''s will. That is how we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 458, 11, 45, 'come into unrest.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 458, 12, 45, 'Learning Two Things: Gentleness and Humility');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 458, 13, 45, 'This is a great verse: “Learn gentleness and humility from Me.” Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 458, 14, 45, 'never told us to learn how to preach from Him. A lot of people spend');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 458, 15, 45, 'hours trying to learn how to preach. They spend even more hours learning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 458, 16, 45, 'how to sing and how to play instruments. That is fine, but the one thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 458, 17, 45, 'Jesus did tell us was to learn was gentleness and humility from Him. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 458, 18, 45, 'is more important in your life to learn gentleness and humility than to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 458, 19, 45, 'learn to play a musical instrument or to learn to sing perfectly. All');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 458, 20, 45, 'that is good, but the good can be the enemy of the best. The best is to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 458, 21, 45, 'learn gentleness and humility, because that will help you in your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 458, 22, 45, 'Singing and playing musical instruments will only help you to have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 458, 23, 45, 'ministry and get some honor from men. Are you willing to come to Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 458, 24, 45, 'and say, “Lord, I want to learn two things fundamentally from you”? “I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 458, 25, 45, 'do not primarily want to learn all the details about prophecy and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 458, 26, 45, 'doctrines, but I want to learn about gentleness and humility”? Many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 458, 27, 45, 'other things will fall into place when you learn these two. These are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 458, 28, 45, 'the two primary things that Jesus said we must learn from Him. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 459, 1, 45, 'because what we have inherited from Adam is the exact opposite of these.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 459, 2, 45, 'The nature of Adam has made us hard and proud. We are very hard on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 459, 3, 45, 'people. We are not hard on people whom we are afraid of, but we are hard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 459, 4, 45, 'on people who are gentle and quiet. We take advantage of them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 459, 5, 45, 'That shows just how evil we are. We are hard on people. We are very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 459, 6, 45, 'proud of any little thing that we accomplish which makes us better than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 459, 7, 45, 'somebody else. This brings pride into our heart. God is the enemy of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 459, 8, 45, 'proud. If God is your enemy, you will never have rest. Jesus said to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 459, 9, 45, 'learn from Him the two opposites of the nature of Adam: humility and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 459, 10, 45, 'gentleness. This is the fundamental difference. If you want to come into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 459, 11, 45, 'a life of rest, you better take this seriously. How do we learn from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 459, 12, 45, 'Jesus? Jesus is not here physically. It is not by sitting and waiting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 459, 13, 45, 'for some revelation from God to know what Jesus is like. We learn from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 459, 14, 45, 'Jesus by reading the Scriptures (especially the gospels), and by seeing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 459, 15, 45, 'how Jesus conducted Himself. See how Jesus spoke to others. See how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 459, 16, 45, 'Jesus related to people. See His attitude towards all types of people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 459, 17, 45, 'from Pharisees to prostitutes to evil people to money changers to lepers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 459, 18, 45, 'to sinful people. There I can see His gentleness and His humility. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 459, 19, 45, 'if I am willing to learn from Him, I will come to a life of rest. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 459, 20, 45, 'is God''s will. It is God''s will that we should come to a life of rest.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 459, 21, 45, 'Hebrews 4:9 says, “There remains therefore a Sabbath rest for the people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 459, 22, 45, 'of God.” This is not the rest that Joshua gave to the Israelites in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 459, 23, 45, 'Canaan (Hebrews 4:8). That is only a picture. If Joshua had given them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 459, 24, 45, 'that rest, then he would not be speaking again of a rest after that. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 459, 25, 45, 'Psalms 95:7-8, it says “Today, if you hear his voice, do not harden your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 459, 26, 45, 'hearts.” The rest that Joshua gave to the Israelites in Canaan was only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 459, 27, 45, 'a picture. There is another rest symbolized by the Sabbath. That is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 459, 28, 45, 'rest that we can experience in our lives. This is the rest Jesus spoke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 460, 1, 45, 'of. The Old Testament Sabbath is a very important law, but like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 460, 2, 45, 'everything in the Old Testament, it is a picture of something we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 460, 3, 45, 'experience today. We can experience this life of rest today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 460, 4, 45, 'This is what Jesus taught. He said to go into every nation and teach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 460, 5, 45, 'people what He has taught. This is one of His commands. “Come to Me and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 460, 6, 45, 'learn from Me,” are commands. Jesus said to go into all the world, make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 460, 7, 45, 'disciples, baptize them and teach them to do everything He has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 460, 8, 45, 'commanded. This means to teach them to come to Him. This means to teach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 460, 9, 45, 'them to learn humility and gentleness from Him. That is what we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 460, 10, 45, 'going to do right now. And finally, Jesus said, “When I tell you to take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 460, 11, 45, 'my yoke upon you, it is not going to be like the yoke of the law. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 460, 12, 45, 'will not be full of ’Thou shall, thou shall not, you shall, you shall');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 460, 13, 45, 'not.’ It will not be with a heavy burden. My yoke is easy, and My load');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 460, 14, 45, 'is light.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 460, 15, 45, 'The commandments of Jesus are not like the commandments of the Law in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 460, 16, 45, 'this sense. It is like the verse of a poem I read: The Law commands us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 460, 17, 45, 'to run, but Jesus commands us to fly much higher. The Law says do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 460, 18, 45, 'commit adultery, but Jesus says do not even lust with your eyes. The Law');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 460, 19, 45, 'commands us to run, but Jesus commands us to fly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 460, 20, 45, 'There''s one big difference, however. The Law commands us to run, but it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 460, 21, 45, 'does not give us feet or hands. How can you run if you do not have feet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 460, 22, 45, 'or hands? Jesus commands us to fly, but He gives us wings. Which is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 460, 23, 45, 'easier? Is it easier to run without legs or to fly if you have wings?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 460, 24, 45, 'Definitely it is easier to fly with wings. The new covenant command is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 460, 25, 45, 'to fly. The Old Testament commandment is run. The New Testament command');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 460, 26, 45, 'is to fly, but the difference is that the Law could not give us legs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 460, 27, 45, 'Jesus gives us wings.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 460, 28, 46, 'Chapter 45 True Sabbath Rest and Dealing with Legalists');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 461, 1, 46, 'Jesus tells us that we will find rest when we take His yoke upon us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 461, 2, 46, '(Matthew 11:29-30). It’s a great word for us, and it is so applicable to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 461, 3, 46, 'the time in which we live. We are living in a time of tremendous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 461, 4, 46, 'turmoil, and there are many events around the world that can bring a lot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 461, 5, 46, 'of fear into our hearts. Jesus warned us that there would be much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 461, 6, 46, 'perplexity on earth and that men would faint from fear and expectation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 461, 7, 46, 'of what is to come upon the world (Luke 21:25-26). What a prophetic word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 461, 8, 46, 'for the times in which we live. There is fear of depression, financial');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 461, 9, 46, 'recession, and other calamities. People are in perplexity, and they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 461, 10, 46, 'afraid in such a time as this. This is just the word we need. The Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 461, 11, 46, 'says, “Take My yoke upon you and learn from Me, for I am gentle and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 461, 12, 46, 'humble in heart, and you will find rest for your souls. For My yoke is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 461, 13, 46, 'easy and My burden is light” (Matthew 11:29-30).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 461, 14, 46, 'The Apostle John lived to be ninety-five or older, and it was around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 461, 15, 46, 'that age that he wrote the first letter of John. In that letter, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 461, 16, 46, 'writes that God’s commandments are not burdensome (1 John 5:3). He had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 461, 17, 46, 'probably been filled with the Spirit on the day of Pentecost, and now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 461, 18, 46, 'after sixty-five years of living with the Spirit and obeying God, He can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 461, 19, 46, 'still say that God’s commandments are not burdensome. John was able to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 461, 20, 46, 'say from first-hand experience, that Jesus’ yoke was easy, and His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 461, 21, 46, 'burden was light, because that was how it has been for him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 461, 22, 46, 'Do you find any commandment of God to be a burden? Have you read the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 461, 23, 46, 'Sermon on the Mount (Matthew 5-7) and felt that some of them are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 461, 24, 46, 'incredibly difficult to obey? Is it difficult to live by God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 461, 25, 46, 'standards? Many Christians say that it is. There are people who have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 461, 26, 46, 'come to my church in Bangalore and told me, “Brother Zac, your standards');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 461, 27, 46, 'are too high!” I respond that we’re just preaching God''s Word. We never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 461, 28, 46, 'go beyond His Word. If we go beyond God’s word, we will be legalistic.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 462, 1, 46, 'Instead, we preach exactly to the level of His Word. We''re not going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 462, 2, 46, 'lower the standard to please anyone, because if we were to lower it, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 462, 3, 46, 'would no longer be the church that Jesus wants to build.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 462, 4, 46, 'Where Do You Insist Upon High Standards?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 462, 5, 46, 'We teach total freedom from sin. When people say that this church has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 462, 6, 46, 'too high a standard, I compare such complaints with refusing to go to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 462, 7, 46, 'hospital because its standard for hygiene is too high. If the treatment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 462, 8, 46, 'were free, would you ever say that you would like to go to a hospital');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 462, 9, 46, 'that is a little dirtier? Would you complain against a hospital because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 462, 10, 46, 'the standard is too high? Or, would you complain against a school,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 462, 11, 46, 'because its standard of education is too high? You wouldn’t go to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 462, 12, 46, 'principal and say that you can’t admit your child there because the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 462, 13, 46, 'standard of education or the standard of discipline is too high, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 462, 14, 46, 'you want your child to get a good education and to be well-disciplined.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 462, 15, 46, 'Why is it that we always want the best standards for our schools and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 462, 16, 46, 'hospitals, but when it comes to the Christian faith, we''re willing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 462, 17, 46, 'take lower levels of spiritual hygiene, lower levels of spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 462, 18, 46, 'education? It’s because we value health and education, but we don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 462, 19, 46, 'value our spiritual lives. That’s the plain truth, and it’s why we might');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 462, 20, 46, 'say such ridiculous things as, “I’d like to attend the same church my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 462, 21, 46, 'grandfather and great-grandfather always belonged to.” Really? Would you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 462, 22, 46, 'like to go to the same school that your great-grandfather attended?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 462, 23, 46, 'Would you put your child in the same hospital that your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 462, 24, 46, 'great-grandmother was admitted to when she was sick? No—you want to go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 462, 25, 46, 'to a better school and a better hospital today. It’s because you value');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 462, 26, 46, 'health and you value education, but you don''t look for a better church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 462, 27, 46, 'because you don''t care for spirituality and you don''t care for God. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 462, 28, 46, 'might not have heard the plain truth before, but you can hear it today,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 463, 1, 46, 'because we seek to proclaim the whole truth that is in God''s Word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 463, 2, 46, 'Two Powerful Prayers to Pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 463, 3, 46, 'I have told God that before I leave this earth I want to obey every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 463, 4, 46, 'single commandment He has given for Christians to obey. Not the ones He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 463, 5, 46, 'gave to Israel, such as killing lambs and paying tithes, but everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 463, 6, 46, 'that He gave Christians to obey—to give cheerfully, to make inner');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 463, 7, 46, 'sacrifices hidden from men, to never lust with my eyes, to never to tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 463, 8, 46, 'lies, and to never be angry—I want to obey all these commands before I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 463, 9, 46, 'leave this earth. I don’t want to leave this earth with any of these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 463, 10, 46, 'commands unfulfilled in my life. I want to encourage you to pray that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 463, 11, 46, 'little prayer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 463, 12, 46, 'I''ve also prayed, “Lord, I want to claim every promise You have given');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 463, 13, 46, 'for Christians on earth.” If you get ten checks in the mail, you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 463, 14, 46, 'go and cash just five of them. You go and deposit all ten of them. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 463, 15, 46, 'are many promises in Scripture, and just like the checks, I want to cash');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 463, 16, 46, 'all of them before I leave this earth, because each of them is meant for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 463, 17, 46, 'me. You also would do well to ask God to help you obey every commandment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 463, 18, 46, 'in the Bible before you leave this earth, and also to help you claim');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 463, 19, 46, 'every promise for Christians before you leave this earth. His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 463, 20, 46, 'commandments are not burdensome. His yoke is easy, and His burden is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 463, 21, 46, 'light. Come to Him, and He will give you rest (Matthew 11:28-30).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 463, 22, 46, 'True Sabbath Rest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 463, 23, 46, 'In Matthew 12, Jesus contrasts this kind of rest with the false rest of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 463, 24, 46, 'the Pharisees, who were trying to keep their understanding of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 463, 25, 46, 'Sabbath. In Him is the fulfillment of the Old Testament Sabbath. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 463, 26, 46, 'come to Him, you will stand on a sea of glass where there is no fear,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 463, 27, 46, 'anxiety, tension, bitterness, jealousy, nor turmoil inside your heart,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 463, 28, 46, 'but in their place, there is rest. The Pharisees didn''t understand the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 464, 1, 46, 'real meaning of the Sabbath, and Jesus exposed them through two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 464, 2, 46, 'incidents that took place on the Sabbath day (Matthew 12:1-13) that came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 464, 3, 46, 'right after He invited the weary and heavy-laden to come to Him and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 464, 4, 46, 'take His yoke upon them so that they would find rest for their souls.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 464, 5, 46, 'In Matthew 12:1, Jesus walked through the grain fields on the Sabbath,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 464, 6, 46, 'and His disciples, becoming hungry, began to pick heads of grain and eat');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 464, 7, 46, 'them. In the Old Testament, there was a law permitting you to pick food');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 464, 8, 46, 'from another person''s field to eat. You couldn''t take a basket and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 464, 9, 46, 'collect food from their field to sell or take home, but you could pick');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 464, 10, 46, 'something to eat then and there. It was a law God gave to teach people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 464, 11, 46, 'to be generous. Therefore, what the disciples were doing was perfectly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 464, 12, 46, 'lawful. The problem was they were doing it on the Sabbath day, and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 464, 13, 46, 'Pharisees accused them of doing something unlawful, saying that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 464, 14, 46, 'can’t pick the heads of the grain on a Sabbath day, even if you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 464, 15, 46, 'hungry. Jesus defended His disciples, just as He always defended those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 464, 16, 46, 'being attacked by legalists (even sinners). When legalists wanted to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 464, 17, 46, 'stone a woman caught in adultery, Jesus quickly came to the side of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 464, 18, 46, 'woman, saying, “He who is without sin can throw the first stone” (John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 464, 19, 46, '8:7). They all went away, beginning with the eldest, because they knew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 464, 20, 46, 'that if they picked up a stone, Jesus would have revealed all their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 464, 21, 46, 'sins.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 464, 22, 46, 'Jesus always defends His people from legalists. His disciples were not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 464, 23, 46, 'perfect, but Jesus defended them. He is always against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 464, 24, 46, 'legalists—remember that. He would rather take the side of the sinner and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 464, 25, 46, 'try to save them, than be with the legalists, who try to condemn the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 464, 26, 46, 'sinner. On the Sabbath day in the grain fields, when the Pharisees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 464, 27, 46, 'accused His disciples, Jesus reminded them what the Bible had recorded');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 464, 28, 46, 'about David. When he was being chased by Saul, he and his companions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 465, 1, 46, 'entered the house of God and ate the consecrated bread (1 Samuel 21:6)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 465, 2, 46, 'because they were hungry. In those days, there was no temple, but David');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 465, 3, 46, 'came to the tabernacle and asked the priest there for any food they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 465, 4, 46, 'might have. All that was available was the consecrated bread, and it was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 465, 5, 46, 'not lawful for any non-Levite priest to eat it. God Himself had given');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 465, 6, 46, 'the law that permitted only Levites to eat the consecrated bread placed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 465, 7, 46, 'on the table in the Holy Place. Yet, David took and ate it, and God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 465, 8, 46, 'didn''t kill him. Then, Jesus gave the Pharisees another example: He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 465, 9, 46, 'reminded them of how, on the Sabbath, the priests go into the temple and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 465, 10, 46, 'perform their service there without breaking the law. He finishes by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 465, 11, 46, 'telling them that something greater than the temple had come—the Son of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 465, 12, 46, 'God— so if the priests could do what they did for David in the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 465, 13, 46, 'Testament temple without violating the Sabbath, then surely His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 465, 14, 46, 'disciples could eat from the grain fields as they walked through them on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 465, 15, 46, 'the Sabbath.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 465, 16, 46, 'God didn’t make man after He made the Sabbath. The Sabbath wasn’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 465, 17, 46, 'created on the sixth day, and man on the seventh. God didn’t think to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 465, 18, 46, 'Himself, “We made a law, now we’ve got to make man so that there can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 465, 19, 46, 'someone to obey that law.” It wasn''t like that. Man was made on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 465, 20, 46, 'sixth day, and the Sabbath was made subsequently, to bless man. It was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 465, 21, 46, 'created to be a day of rest for him, to have fellowship with God. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 465, 22, 46, 'the Pharisees had made it into a rigid commandment, bringing bondage.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 465, 23, 46, 'Do Not Judge by Appearance or Man-Made Rules');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 465, 24, 46, 'Jesus sees what they are doing and says to them, “If you had known what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 465, 25, 46, 'this means, ‘I DESIRE COMPASSION, AND NOT A SACRIFICE,’ you would not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 465, 26, 46, 'have condemned the innocent” (Matthew 12:7). He is quoting Hosea 6:6');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 465, 27, 46, 'here. The same desire to condemn innocent people can be found among many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 465, 28, 46, 'Christians today. They look at someone, judge him, and condemn him. One');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 466, 1, 46, 'of the commandments that Christians disobey most today is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 466, 2, 46, 'commandment in John 7:24, "Do not judge according to appearance, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 466, 3, 46, 'judge with righteous judgment.” Jesus didn''t say that you can’t judge.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 466, 4, 46, 'He only said to judge righteously, and not just by what we see on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 466, 5, 46, 'outside.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 466, 6, 46, 'Often Christians will just look at someone and will have already passed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 466, 7, 46, 'judgment. They will consider external things, such as what a man is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 466, 8, 46, 'wearing. He might have on jewelry, which the one passing judgment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 466, 9, 46, 'chooses not to wear. Or, he might wear a t-shirt when he goes to church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 466, 10, 46, 'on Sunday morning, and the other man thinks that he must a wear a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 466, 11, 46, 'long-sleeved shirt to church, or some other stupid rule like that, not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 466, 12, 46, 'found anywhere in Scripture. You’ll only find one rule in Scripture');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 466, 13, 46, 'about how to dress, and it’s not on how to dress on Sunday mornings, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 466, 14, 46, 'about how women should always dress modestly, every hour of every day,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 466, 15, 46, 'and especially when they’re in public. Other than that, there''s no law');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 466, 16, 46, 'on how to dress.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 466, 17, 46, 'Even so, Christians make all types of rules. They are religious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 466, 18, 46, 'legalists, and they pass judgment on others who might be ten times more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 466, 19, 46, 'spiritual than them in their private lives, just as we see in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 466, 20, 46, 'incident with the Pharisees. To such Christians, I would say what Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 466, 21, 46, 'said—Go and learn the meaning of “I desire compassion and not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 466, 22, 46, 'sacrifice.” Stop condemning innocent people for breaking religious laws');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 466, 23, 46, 'that God has not made. You have taken God’s laws and made them into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 466, 24, 46, 'something much bigger than He intended.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 466, 25, 46, 'That''s what the Pharisees did. The Sabbath was one of God’s laws. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 466, 26, 46, 'instructed man not to work on the Sabbath, because God wanted him to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 466, 27, 46, 'have at least one day of the week to spend in fellowship with Him. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 466, 28, 46, 'was the purpose of the Sabbath, but the Pharisees didn’t bother about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 467, 1, 46, 'fellowship with God. If they had had fellowship with Him, they wouldn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 467, 2, 46, 'have condemned the disciples. Instead, they made all sorts of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 467, 3, 46, 'nonsensical rules about what you could and couldn’t do on the Sabbath.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 467, 4, 46, 'For example, one of God’s laws concerning the Sabbath prohibited you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 467, 5, 46, 'from lifting a burden on the Sabbath day, meaning that on that day you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 467, 6, 46, 'should not be carrying around heavy items, such as suitcases. They began');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 467, 7, 46, 'to nitpick the law and even set standards for how much your shoes could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 467, 8, 46, 'weigh, because if they weighed more, you’d be lifting a burden whenever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 467, 9, 46, 'you walked. Can you imagine a more stupid rule than that? And these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 467, 10, 46, 'Pharisees would sit down and try to decide whether you could eat the egg');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 467, 11, 46, 'that a hen laid on the Sabbath, given that neither you nor a Gentile');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 467, 12, 46, 'employed by you could work on the Sabbath. You see how stupid these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 467, 13, 46, 'people were, and you will find so many Christian legalists today, who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 467, 14, 46, 'examine others with all types of silly standards, while they themselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 467, 15, 46, 'are committing much bigger crimes. They lack compassion, and they think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 467, 16, 46, 'that God cares primarily about our sacrifices. Yet, Jesus taught');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 467, 17, 46, 'compassion (“I desire compassion and not sacrifice”), and we must pay');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 467, 18, 46, 'attention to all that Jesus taught.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 467, 19, 46, 'Jesus ends by saying, “The Son of Man is Lord of the Sabbath” (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 467, 20, 46, '12:8). Jesus reminds them that He is the Lord of the Sabbath, and as the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 467, 21, 46, 'One who gives of all the commandments, He is far greater than the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 467, 22, 46, 'commandments themselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 467, 23, 46, 'Jesus Wants to Heal Lives Withered by Sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 467, 24, 46, 'Departing from the place, He enters their synagogue and finds a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 467, 25, 46, 'there with a withered hand. To me, this man is a picture of many of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 467, 26, 46, 'Christians sitting in churches today, whose lives are withered by sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 467, 27, 46, 'Their sins are forgiven. They are born-again Christians. But, they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 467, 28, 46, 'perpetually defeated by sin, perpetually lusting with their eyes. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 468, 1, 46, 'are slaves to internet pornography, slaves to anger, slaves to an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 468, 2, 46, 'unforgiving spirit. And they are withered exactly like this person here.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 468, 3, 46, 'This man’s hand was withered, but the whole soul and spirit of each of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 468, 4, 46, 'these Christians is withered, which is much worse. It is much better to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 468, 5, 46, 'have a withered hand than a withered soul and spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 468, 6, 46, 'Jesus wants to come and heal these born-again Christians, yet the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 468, 7, 46, 'religious leaders don''t want that. They will not permit someone who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 468, 8, 46, 'preaches total deliverance from sin to come and preach to their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 468, 9, 46, 'churches, because it would expose how the religious leaders themselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 468, 10, 46, 'are defeated. The preacher would get up in front of the church and ask');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 468, 11, 46, 'the pastor— “What can you teach these people if you still shout at your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 468, 12, 46, 'wife?” The pastor sitting there would feel condemned because he shouts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 468, 13, 46, 'at his wife and doesn''t preach victory over sins. That’s why he won’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 468, 14, 46, 'let such a preacher come to his church. He will allow everybody in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 468, 15, 46, 'church to remain in their withered lives, so long as they pay their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 468, 16, 46, 'tithes, and he continues to get receive his salary, in order to live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 468, 17, 46, 'comfortably. Instead, he’ll continue preaching the forgiveness of sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 468, 18, 46, 'and reassure them that the rest that Jesus taught is not important.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 468, 19, 46, 'Legalists Are Fault-Finders Who Broaden God’s Commands');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 468, 20, 46, 'That’s the condition of many churches today, and we see that it was the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 468, 21, 46, 'same with the legalists that Jesus interacted with The Pharisees knew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 468, 22, 46, 'that Jesus would heal the man with the withered hand, so they questioned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 468, 23, 46, 'Him, “Is it lawful to heal on the Sabbath?” They wanted Him to say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 468, 24, 46, 'something so that they could accuse Him. We still have sharp-minded');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 468, 25, 46, 'Pharisees in Christian churches today who want to find some fault with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 468, 26, 46, 'God’s servants. They look for some fault so that they can accuse. Their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 468, 27, 46, 'whole purpose is to accuse because they are in fellowship with Satan;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 468, 28, 46, 'because he accuses Christians day and night, they also accuse their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 469, 1, 46, 'brethren with him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 469, 2, 46, 'Jesus asked them a question. “If one of your sheep were to fall into a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 469, 3, 46, 'pit on the Sabbath, would you leave the sheep there for twenty-four');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 469, 4, 46, 'hours? Would you say, ‘Today is the Sabbath day, I am not supposed to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 469, 5, 46, 'any work, so I won’t pull him out today. I’ll wait till the Sabbath is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 469, 6, 46, 'over before I pull him out’? Wouldn’t you instead pull out the sheep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 469, 7, 46, 'immediately, without bothering about whether it was breaking the Sabbath');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 469, 8, 46, 'or not? Don''t you think a man who has fallen into a pit, as this man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 469, 9, 46, 'has, is of more value than a sheep? Is it wrong to pull this man up and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 469, 10, 46, 'make him healthy? Rather, it is lawful to do good on the Sabbath day”.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 469, 11, 46, 'We may not have the same problem with the Sabbath, because most of us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 469, 12, 46, 'have nothing to do with it, but we can nitpick over other laws. We make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 469, 13, 46, 'these laws stricter than God has made them, and we condemn others when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 469, 14, 46, 'they don''t obey them. It''s very easy to slip into this sort of legalism.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 469, 15, 46, 'I am not encouraging you to disobey small laws, because Jesus said that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 469, 16, 46, 'if you keep the least of God’s commandments, you will be called great in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 469, 17, 46, 'the kingdom of heaven (Matthew 5:19). Yet, if you cancel even the least');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 469, 18, 46, 'of His commandments, you will be called least in the kingdom of heaven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 469, 19, 46, 'You won’t go to hell, but you will be called least in the kingdom. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 469, 20, 46, 'are commandments that are small, and there are commandments that are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 469, 21, 46, 'great. Jesus Himself makes it clear. And if you ignore even the least of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 469, 22, 46, 'these commandments, you will lose your position in heaven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 469, 23, 46, 'I''m not encouraging you to disobey the small commandments, and I am also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 469, 24, 46, 'warning you not to make any commandment broader and stricter than God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 469, 25, 46, 'has made it. Leave it just as it is.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 469, 26, 46, 'An Example of Broadening God’s Commands');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 469, 27, 46, 'There is a commandment given in 1 Corinthians 11 that a woman should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 469, 28, 46, 'veil her head when she prays or prophesies. It’s a very clear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 470, 1, 46, 'commandment, and Paul explains the meaning of it right there in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 470, 2, 46, 'letter. A woman’s head covering is a symbol of her submission to her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 470, 3, 46, 'husband or to a man''s authority in the Church. However, people can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 470, 4, 46, 'expand that commandment and say that women should have their hair');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 470, 5, 46, 'covered all the time, even when they are not praying or prophesying.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 470, 6, 46, 'That’s ridiculous! Those are the Pharisees of today. I’ve met some of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 470, 7, 46, 'these people, and they ask me whether my wife veils her head all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 470, 8, 46, 'twenty-four hours of the day. I respond, saying that she covers her head');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 470, 9, 46, 'when she prays or prophesies, and she covers it when she sings praises');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 470, 10, 46, 'to God during a church service. Then they’ll say that the Bible tells us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 470, 11, 46, 'to be praying always. See how they misuse this other verse? I have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 470, 12, 46, 'ask them, does your wife veil her head when she’s in bed or asleep? Once');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 470, 13, 46, 'someone said, “Yes, my wife covers her head even then.” I said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 470, 14, 46, '“Amazing! Let me ask another question. Does she veil her head when she''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 470, 15, 46, 'taking a shower or bathing? Shouldn''t she be praying even then?” I got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 470, 16, 46, 'no reply to that question.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 470, 17, 46, 'This is how Jesus silenced legalists, and that’s how I''ve been able to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 470, 18, 46, 'silence them as well. We have to be very careful to not stretch God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 470, 19, 46, 'commandments beyond what He says. That''s what we can learn from Jesus’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 470, 20, 46, 'response to the Pharisees in the grain field and in the synagogue. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 470, 21, 46, 'instructed them to teach even the least of the commandments in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 470, 22, 46, 'entirety, but not to make them bigger and stricter than God made them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 470, 23, 46, 'Legalists Seek to Destroy God’s True Servants');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 470, 24, 46, 'Jesus told the man with the withered hand to stretch out his hand, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 470, 25, 46, 'when he did, it was restored. Imagine how excited you’d be if you saw');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 470, 26, 46, 'someone with a withered hand healed. You’d be shouting, “Hallelujah!”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 470, 27, 46, 'And everybody else should be excited too. But the Pharisees went out,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 470, 28, 46, 'and they counseled together against Jesus, the One Who healed him, as to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 471, 1, 46, 'how they might destroy Him. What a strong word, “destroy.” Must they not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 471, 2, 46, 'have been inspired by the devil himself? Great Bible scholars can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 471, 3, 46, 'inspired by the devil when they want to hurt others. Here, these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 471, 4, 46, 'scholars wanted to kill Jesus physically, and today many great Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 471, 5, 46, 'scholars may try to kill other servants of God with their words. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 471, 6, 46, 'tongue is the weapon they use, rather than a dagger nor a spear. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 471, 7, 46, 'their messages, books, and essays, they hit out against people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 471, 8, 46, 'proclaiming total freedom from sin, the healing of a withered life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 471, 9, 46, 'Don’t Take Unnecessary Risks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 471, 10, 46, 'Jesus was aware of their intentions, and so He went away from there. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 471, 11, 46, 'didn''t stay to prove that He was a brave person. Jesus said that when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 471, 12, 46, 'you are persecuted in one city, go to another. If someone in a place');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 471, 13, 46, 'wants to kill you, don''t try to show your bravery by remaining there.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 471, 14, 46, 'And Jesus, knowing the Pharisees sought to kill Him, withdrew from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 471, 15, 46, 'place and went somewhere else. In John 7:1, we read that Jesus was aware');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 471, 16, 46, 'that the people in Judea wanted to kill Him, and so He stayed away from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 471, 17, 46, 'there. Why should He go there if they were going to try to kill Him? But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 471, 18, 46, 'later on in that same chapter, Jesus did go to Judea, when His Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 471, 19, 46, 'told Him to. We learn from His example that we are not to take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 471, 20, 46, 'unnecessary risks. We must be willing to go anywhere the Lord tells us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 471, 21, 46, 'to go, knowing that He will protect us. However, we should not take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 471, 22, 46, 'unnecessary risks to show how brave we are or to show off our faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 471, 23, 47, 'Chapter 46 Healing and Compassion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 471, 24, 47, 'Jesus Healed All - as an Attestation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 471, 25, 47, '“Many followed Him, and He healed them all” (Matthew 12:14-15). This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 471, 26, 47, 'one of those places in Scripture, similar to the passage in Matthew 8,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 471, 27, 47, 'where not a single person remained without being healed. Today, all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 471, 28, 47, 'those who claim to be healing people like Jesus are just deceiving you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 472, 1, 47, 'because in all their healing ministries, not even 1% of the sick people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 472, 2, 47, 'are healed. Even in the churches that proclaim Jesus as Healer, not even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 472, 3, 47, '1% of the sick people there are healed. That''s not the healing ministry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 472, 4, 47, 'of Jesus. Don''t be fooled. Jesus heals people and we can ask the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 472, 5, 47, 'for healing. I have experienced healing myself and I''ve seen people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 472, 6, 47, 'healed. But this happens in 1%of the cases or less, I must be honest.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 472, 7, 47, 'Sometimes God Chooses Not to Heal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 472, 8, 47, 'There could be many reasons for this. Sometimes it could be the sin in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 472, 9, 47, 'someone’s life, or sometimes God may, as in Paul''s case and Timothy’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 472, 10, 47, 'stomach infirmities, allow it for a particular purpose. There could be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 472, 11, 47, 'many reasons that we don''t know. But when Jesus healed in these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 472, 12, 47, 'incidents, He healed them all as an attestation of the fact that He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 472, 13, 47, 'the Son of God. This is not something that He told us to imitate. In the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 472, 14, 47, 'history of Christianity, nobody has ever imitated it. Even the Apostle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 472, 15, 47, 'Paul could not heal the stomach aches of his co-worker, Timothy. A man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 472, 16, 47, 'like Paul, who raised Eutychus from the dead, could not heal a small');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 472, 17, 47, 'thing like a stomach ache. Scripture also says in 2 Timothy 4:20 that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 472, 18, 47, 'Paul left his co-worker Trophimus sick in Miletus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 472, 19, 47, 'So we must not be confused by the attestation of Jesus’ ministry by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 472, 20, 47, 'total healing and imagine that we ought to do the same thing. Otherwise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 472, 21, 47, 'you will live in a world of delusion and fool other people into trying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 472, 22, 47, 'to live a type of Christianity that is not being lived by anybody. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 472, 23, 47, 'you believe in such a lie, you can be led astray in many other areas as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 472, 24, 47, 'well. I mention that as a word of caution. Don''t go to one extreme where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 472, 25, 47, 'you say every sick person will be healed and don''t go to the other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 472, 26, 47, 'extreme where you say no sick person will be healed. Both are wrong -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 472, 27, 47, 'the narrow way lies between the two. God still heals, but He doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 472, 28, 47, 'heal everyone, for reasons best known to Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 473, 1, 47, 'Jesus Warned People Not to Speak of Healing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 473, 2, 47, 'Then, “He warned them not to tell who He was” (Matthew 12:16). Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 473, 3, 47, 'warned them whenever He healed people. What a strong word! He didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 473, 4, 47, 'just tell them, He “warned” them. It''s like warning people against a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 473, 5, 47, 'danger. He warned them not to make this known. He never said that when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 473, 6, 47, 'people were telling others that He was the One Who forgives sins or that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 473, 7, 47, 'He was the Messiah. Philip went and found Nathanael and said, “We have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 473, 8, 47, 'found the Messiah.” Jesus didn’t say that was wrong. He never prevented');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 473, 9, 47, 'anyone from saying that He can forgive sins. But He did warn them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 473, 10, 47, 'whenever He healed people. He said, “Don''t tell anyone that I healed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 473, 11, 47, 'you.” Why was that? Because if He didn’t, then a lot of people would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 473, 12, 47, 'come to Him, not for something spiritual, but for something physical.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 473, 13, 47, 'That''s the great tragedy. A lot of people today are being drawn with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 473, 14, 47, 'message of, “God will bless you physically and materially.” It is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 473, 15, 47, 'very thing Jesus said not to teach. He said, “I will heal you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 473, 16, 47, 'spiritually, I will give you rest, I will make you gentle and humble');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 473, 17, 47, 'like Me, I will make you spiritual and holy; but don''t advertise the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 473, 18, 47, 'other things too much.” Of course there were some people who disobeyed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 473, 19, 47, 'in Jesus’ time, and a lot of people disobey it today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 473, 20, 47, 'Look Carefully at Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 473, 21, 47, 'It says, "This was to fulfill what was spoken through Isaiah the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 473, 22, 47, 'prophet: ''Behold, My Servant Whom I have chosen; My Beloved in Whom My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 473, 23, 47, 'soul is well-pleased''” (Matthew 12:17-18). This is a quotation from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 473, 24, 47, 'Isaiah 42:1 – “Behold My Servant,” which means “Look carefully at My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 473, 25, 47, 'Servant.” It is a wonderful exhortation to look carefully at Jesus. All');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 473, 26, 47, 'of us need to obey that exhortation. Look carefully at Jesus, “Whom I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 473, 27, 47, 'have chosen. I will put My Spirit upon Him, and He shall proclaim');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 473, 28, 47, 'justice to the Gentiles. He will not quarrel, nor cry out; Nor will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 474, 1, 47, 'anyone hear His voice in the streets” (Matthew 12:18-19). God says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 474, 2, 47, '“Look carefully at My Servant, Who never quarrels with anyone.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 474, 3, 47, 'My brothers and sisters, why do you quarrel with your husband, wife,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 474, 4, 47, 'other sisters or brothers, neighbors or coworkers in the office? It’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 474, 5, 47, 'because you do not look carefully at Jesus. He says look carefully at My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 474, 6, 47, 'servant Who will never quarrel with people. He stood for the truth -- He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 474, 7, 47, 'drove out the money changers from the temple -- but He never quarreled');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 474, 8, 47, 'with people when they spat on His face and called Him a devil. He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 474, 9, 47, 'not going to fight with any of them. He did not fight with flesh and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 474, 10, 47, 'blood because He was leading us into the New Covenant. He is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 474, 11, 47, 'mediator of a better covenant. The Old Covenant involved fighting with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 474, 12, 47, 'the Goliaths and Canaanites and Midianites etc., but in the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 474, 13, 47, 'Covenant, we fight with Satan. He did not quarrel at all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 474, 14, 47, 'I want to encourage you that there is a great need for such Christians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 474, 15, 47, 'in our land, who look carefully at Jesus, to stop quarrelling, to finish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 474, 16, 47, 'with it in their lives permanently. It is possible, and I have found it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 474, 17, 47, 'true in my own life. It was not true for many years because I did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 474, 18, 47, 'look carefully at Jesus. I looked at other Christians, and I found most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 474, 19, 47, 'of them quarrelling. I followed them in my blindness and stupidity,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 474, 20, 47, 'until I learned to look carefully at Jesus. He did not quarrel, He did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 474, 21, 47, 'not cry out, nor would anyone hear His voice in the streets. You don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 474, 22, 47, 'have to shout and yell to impress people with the power of the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 474, 23, 47, 'Spirit. It says here Jesus did not raise His voice and shout. If He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 474, 24, 47, 'preaching inside a house, they wouldn''t hear Him on the streets. Isn’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 474, 25, 47, 'it wonderful that His preaching was not with the yelling and shouting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 474, 26, 47, 'and frequent “Hallelujahs”?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 474, 27, 47, 'Many people think that if a person yells and shouts and bangs the table');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 474, 28, 47, 'and says ’Hallelujah’ every two minutes, then he is a mighty servant of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 475, 1, 47, 'God. This is absolute rubbish. Jesus was not like that. In all of His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 475, 2, 47, 'sermons, He never said a single Hallelujah, nor did He raise His voice.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 475, 3, 47, 'There may be a place where you raise your voice for emphasis, but to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 475, 4, 47, 'think that this is the time when you are really filled with the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 475, 5, 47, 'Spirit is wrong. There are a lot of churches where they think if the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 475, 6, 47, 'noise level during a time of singing raises up to a very high level and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 475, 7, 47, 'the emotional pitch becomes very high, that the Holy Spirit is come.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 475, 8, 47, 'This is a deception. The Holy Spirit''s presence is not recognized by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 475, 9, 47, 'decibel level of the sound or the emotional high that people are having.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 475, 10, 47, 'It is by purity and by a Spirit of praise, genuine praise, which makes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 475, 11, 47, 'people fall on their faces and worship God, and recognize the holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 475, 12, 47, 'presence of the Son of God in the midst of the meeting. That is the mark');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 475, 13, 47, 'of the Holy Spirit. It is very important to understand what Jesus would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 475, 14, 47, 'and would not do. These are some of the things He did not do; but what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 475, 15, 47, 'did He do?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 475, 16, 47, 'Jesus Has Not Given Up on You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 475, 17, 47, '“A battered reed He will not break off, and a smoldering wick He will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 475, 18, 47, 'not put out, until He leads justice to victory” (Matthew 12:20). That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 475, 19, 47, 'means, He would take a battered reed and make it holy, and He would blow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 475, 20, 47, 'a smoldering wick to a flame. What are a battered reed and a smoldering');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 475, 21, 47, 'wick? People who are discouraged and failures, who have made a mess of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 475, 22, 47, 'their lives like many Christians, constantly defeated and without hope.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 475, 23, 47, 'I''ve had numerous letters from people on the verge of suicide; they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 475, 24, 47, 'the battered reeds. They have been battered by preachers who condemn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 475, 25, 47, 'them. Once upon a time they were smoldering wicks where the flame was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 475, 26, 47, 'burning, but it died out due to circumstances, difficulties, problems in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 475, 27, 47, 'marriage etc. But the Lord says, “Don''t give up! Don''t get discouraged!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 475, 28, 47, 'I can help you.” He can take the most battered or broken reed and fix');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 476, 1, 47, 'it. Most people would just throw it away and pick another reed, but the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 476, 2, 47, 'Lord says, “No! I will fix that broken reed and blow a smoldering wick');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 476, 3, 47, 'to a flame.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 476, 4, 47, 'I want to say to you who are discouraged and defeated, and feel that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 476, 5, 47, 'your life is a total failure, that you may have done so many wrong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 476, 6, 47, 'things in your life (you may have tried to get victory for a long time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 476, 7, 47, 'and you never obtained it, you may have heard messages of victory and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 476, 8, 47, 'their effects seem to only last for a very short time), but Jesus has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 476, 9, 47, 'not given up on you. I don''t care how battered you are as a reed. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 476, 10, 47, 'don''t care if the flame is gone out from your life and you''re just a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 476, 11, 47, 'smoking wick now (which is worse than a wick that is not smoking - a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 476, 12, 47, 'wick that was never lit - because smoke is very uncomfortable).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 476, 13, 47, 'The Lord says, “Even if you''re like that, I will blow you to a flame. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 476, 14, 47, 'can put the fire of God back into your life.” I hope you will hear this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 476, 15, 47, 'word from the Lord to you, that He will repair that broken reed. He will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 476, 16, 47, 'blow that wick back to a flame. The Lord can do it! I would ask you the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 476, 17, 47, 'same question that He asked the blind people, “Do you believe that I can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 476, 18, 47, 'do this for you?” Do you believe that even though your life is so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 476, 19, 47, 'utterly defeated and a failure in the eyes of men, and probably a bigger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 476, 20, 47, 'failure in your own eyes - because you know all the secret sins in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 476, 21, 47, 'life – even still, do you believe that the Lord says, “I can lead you to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 476, 22, 47, 'a glorious, holy life”? That was my experience forty years ago. Even as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 476, 23, 47, 'a Christian, I was thoroughly defeated. I had no fellowship and I was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 476, 24, 47, 'not part of a living Church. I did not have a spiritual father or a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 476, 25, 47, 'godly example that I could follow, and I never had anyone explain the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 476, 26, 47, 'New Covenant to me and tell me that I could have a life of victory. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 476, 27, 47, 'was defeated and utterly backslidden as a born-again Christian. But at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 476, 28, 47, 'the depth of my defeat, when I was at rock bottom, this is what the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 477, 1, 47, 'did:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 477, 2, 47, 'The only righteous thing that God could have done to me when I was at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 477, 3, 47, 'rock-bottom as a hypocrite, preaching things that were not true in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 477, 4, 47, 'life, was to have sent me to hell. But He didn''t do that. If He had only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 477, 5, 47, 'forgiven me completely, that itself would have been more than enough.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 477, 6, 47, 'But He did more than just that. He not only forgave me completely, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 477, 7, 47, 'also filled me with the Holy Spirit, teaching me that God does not give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 477, 8, 47, 'the fullness of the Holy Spirit to those who deserve it or those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 477, 9, 47, 'earn it through years of fasting and prayer. He gives it to those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 477, 10, 47, 'desperately need it. I certainly did not deserve it and I certainly did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 477, 11, 47, 'not spend years in fasting and prayer, but I desperately needed the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 477, 12, 47, 'power of the Holy Spirit. Oh yes, I certainly needed the power of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 477, 13, 47, 'Holy Spirit. I learnt through this that God meets people at the place of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 477, 14, 47, 'their need - when they are not looking at others and judging them, when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 477, 15, 47, 'they are not trying to earn the fullness of the Spirit, but saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 477, 16, 47, '“Lord I need it, because if there is anyone on earth who needs it, it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 477, 17, 47, 'me. I need to be filled with the Holy Spirit.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 477, 18, 47, 'Here is an illustration: Suppose you are working at a company and you’ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 477, 19, 47, 'done a lot of wrong things - you’ve broken some of their machines and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 477, 20, 47, 'ruined them. They had to spend a lot of money, maybe hundreds of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 477, 21, 47, 'thousands of rupees, fixing all those machines because you ruined some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 477, 22, 47, 'of them. But they still have not fired you from your job. So you should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 477, 23, 47, 'be thankful for that. Then one day you carelessly do something, and ruin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 477, 24, 47, 'one of their most expensive machines that cost millions of rupees. Now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 477, 25, 47, 'you''re sure they will sack you because you messed up so badly. Then you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 477, 26, 47, 'get a call from the managing director and he says, “I want you to come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 477, 27, 47, 'and see me.” You know what he is going to say. Not only are you going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 477, 28, 47, 'be sacked, but you are going to pay huge fines etc. or you’re probably');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 478, 1, 47, 'going to jail if you can’t pay the fines. But you go there and you get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 478, 2, 47, 'the surprise of your life when he says, “That’s okay, I have forgiven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 478, 3, 47, 'you for what you did, and not only that, I want to make you the deputy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 478, 4, 47, 'managing director of this company.” You would think he''s joking. But he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 478, 5, 47, 'says, “No, I''m not joking. I''m giving you a big raise in your salary.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 478, 6, 47, 'There is no company in the world that will do that. But this is exactly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 478, 7, 47, 'what God did to me, and this is exactly what God has done to many people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 478, 8, 47, 'around the world. He can do the same for you too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 478, 9, 47, 'Encouragement for Battered Reeds');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 478, 10, 47, 'I write this as an encouragement to you who are battered reeds and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 478, 11, 47, 'smoking wicks. I was more battered than all of you and the fire had gone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 478, 12, 47, 'out from my life long before. I was a thoroughly backslidden, defeated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 478, 13, 47, 'Christian. More than forty years ago, God met with me, filled me with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 478, 14, 47, 'the Holy Spirit, and turned my life around. He can do that for you as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 478, 15, 47, 'well. It has never been the same. Once God touches you and fills you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 478, 16, 47, 'with the Spirit and you realize that you received what you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 478, 17, 47, 'deserve, you will never look down on another battered reed again. I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 478, 18, 47, 'seen a lot of battered reeds in the last thirty-seven years, as I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 478, 19, 47, 'planted churches in different places, but God is my witness: I''ve never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 478, 20, 47, 'despised or looked down on any of them, as though they are inferior to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 478, 21, 47, 'me. I''ve seen smoking wicks in whom the fire has gone out years ago. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 478, 22, 47, 'don''t despise them because I know what a smoking wick and battered reed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 478, 23, 47, 'I was, and yet God never despised me. I have hope for every backslidden');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 478, 24, 47, 'Christian in the world. I have hope for the worst sinner in the world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 478, 25, 47, 'because I know what God did for me. I can understand a little bit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 478, 26, 47, 'what Paul said when he said, “Christ Jesus came into the world to save');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 478, 27, 47, 'sinners; of whom I am the chief” (1 Timothy 1:15). That is the message');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 478, 28, 47, 'of the gospel. It says, He will not give up or be discouraged “until He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 479, 1, 47, 'leads us to victory, and in His name the gentiles will hope” (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 479, 2, 47, '12:20-21). I hope you trust in this Savior Who can lead you to this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 479, 3, 47, 'wonderful life. This is what Jesus taught, and this is what we need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 479, 4, 47, 'experience and proclaim wherever we go.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 479, 5, 47, 'Pharisees Were Jealous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 479, 6, 47, 'In the next verse, “a demon-possessed man who was blind and mute was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 479, 7, 47, 'brought to Jesus” (Matthew 12:22). It''s amazing that there are cases');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 479, 8, 47, 'where a demon possesses a person and the person becomes blind and also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 479, 9, 47, 'mute. It is very rare to meet a person who is both blind and mute. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 479, 10, 47, 'have never seen someone who was both blind and mute. I''ve seen people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 479, 11, 47, 'that are blind and people that are mute, but a person who is blind and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 479, 12, 47, 'mute is such a rarity. But here was a man who was blind and mute because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 479, 13, 47, 'he was demon-possessed, and Jesus healed the man. He cast out the demon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 479, 14, 47, 'with a word, the man''s eyes were opened, and he could see. “All the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 479, 15, 47, 'crowds were amazed, and were saying, ''This Man cannot be the Son of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 479, 16, 47, 'David, can He?''” (Matthew 12:23). But the Pharisees were jealous.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 479, 17, 47, 'There are a lot of preachers who want all the admiration of people for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 479, 18, 47, 'themselves but they cannot bear to see somebody else drawing people to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 479, 19, 47, 'better gospel and turning away from the inferior gospel that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 479, 20, 47, 'presented. So they become jealous and their jealousy makes them judge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 479, 21, 47, 'others. Don''t be disturbed if you are the object of jealousy by others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 479, 22, 47, 'or if they call you bad names. Has anybody called you “the prince of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 479, 23, 47, 'devils?” They called Jesus by that name. It says here that when Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 479, 24, 47, 'did this good thing that so many people appreciated, the religious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 479, 25, 47, 'leaders said, “This man casts out demons only by Beelzebul the ruler of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 479, 26, 47, 'the demons” (Matthew 12:24). They were saying that Jesus performed the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 479, 27, 47, 'healing by the power of the devil, that He is just in league with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 479, 28, 47, 'ruler of demons. They said, essentially, “He is hand in hand with Satan,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 480, 1, 47, 'and that is how He does this.” But Jesus didn''t get upset with that. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 480, 2, 47, 'knew they were blind. How can you get angry with a blind man if you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 480, 3, 47, 'sight and another person is blind? You say this wall is white and that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 480, 4, 47, 'man says it’s black, because he is blind. How can you argue with him?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 480, 5, 47, 'How can you convince a blind man that the wall is white? You would be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 480, 6, 47, 'stupid if you get angry with him and call him crazy. He is not crazy; he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 480, 7, 47, 'is blind. That is why Jesus wasn''t upset with them when they called Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 480, 8, 47, 'the prince of devils -- because they were blind. He was the Son of God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 480, 9, 47, 'pure and clean, but they called Him dirty.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 480, 10, 47, 'Jesus wasn''t upset with them, teaching us that it is foolish to be upset');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 480, 11, 47, 'with somebody who insults you. Jesus replied in a very rational and calm');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 480, 12, 47, 'way, and said, “Any kingdom divided against itself is laid waste; and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 480, 13, 47, 'any city or house divided against itself will not stand. If Satan casts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 480, 14, 47, 'out Satan, he is divided against himself; how then will his kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 480, 15, 47, 'stand?" (Matthew 12:25-26). Jesus was saying that Satan is not so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 480, 16, 47, 'foolish.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 480, 17, 47, 'One Thing We Can Learn from Demons');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 480, 18, 47, 'Christians fight with each other, but the demons don’t. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 480, 19, 47, 'something you can learn from the demons. Don''t fight with one another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 480, 20, 47, 'when you are fighting for the same cause. The demons are fighting for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 480, 21, 47, 'one cause - for the glory of Satan - and they are united. Christians are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 480, 22, 47, 'supposed to be fighting for the glory of God, but they fight with each');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 480, 23, 47, 'other. A kingdom divided against itself cannot stand; a house divided');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 480, 24, 47, 'against itself will fall. Husbands and wives who quarrel with each other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 480, 25, 47, 'need to hear this word, “A house divided against itself will not stand.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 480, 26, 47, 'That means your children will suffer. Don''t be foolish; learn from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 480, 27, 47, 'demons to not fight with each other nor to cast each other out.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 480, 28, 47, 'God Writes His Law on Our Hearts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 481, 1, 47, 'He went on to say, “If I by Beelzebul cast out demons, by whom do your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 481, 2, 47, 'sons cast them out? For this reason they will be your judges” (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 481, 3, 47, '12:27). I don''t know the exact details of what was happening there so I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 481, 4, 47, 'can’t talk about the things that are not written in Scripture. I don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 481, 5, 47, 'have an explanation. But He said, “But if I cast out demons by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 481, 6, 47, 'Spirit of God, then the kingdom of God has come upon you” (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 481, 7, 47, '12:28). In the gospel of Luke, in the similar passage, He said, “But if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 481, 8, 47, 'I cast out demons by the finger of God, then the kingdom of God has come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 481, 9, 47, 'upon you” (Luke 11:20). When you put these two verses together, you find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 481, 10, 47, 'that the “finger of God” is the Spirit of God. Just as God wrote the Ten');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 481, 11, 47, 'Commandments with His finger on tablets of stone and gave it to Moses,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 481, 12, 47, 'today, in the New Covenant, He writes His laws with His finger (the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 481, 13, 47, 'Spirit of God) on our hearts. It is wonderful to compare Scripture with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 481, 14, 47, 'Scripture and see that the finger of God is the Spirit of God. The Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 481, 15, 47, 'Spirit is the Person through Whom God writes His laws in our hearts, so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 481, 16, 47, 'that we can obey them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 481, 17, 47, 'Then Jesus said, “Or how can anyone enter the strong man’s house and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 481, 18, 47, 'carry off his property, unless he first binds the strong man? And then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 481, 19, 47, 'he will plunder his house” (Matthew 12:29). If Satan has not been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 481, 20, 47, 'defeated, how can you take possession of what he has taken or robbed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 481, 21, 47, 'from your life? Suppose the devil robbed you of many things in your life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 481, 22, 47, '(and he has robbed all Christians). How can you go and take it all back,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 481, 23, 47, 'if Satan himself is not bound? That is why people could not overcome');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 481, 24, 47, 'Satan in the Old Covenant. In the New Covenant, we know that Satan was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 481, 25, 47, 'defeated on the cross, and therefore we can take back everything that he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 481, 26, 47, 'has taken away from us. Satan has no authority over us anymore; he has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 481, 27, 47, 'been defeated on the cross.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 481, 28, 47, 'He then spoke about their sin, “He who is not with Me is against Me; and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 482, 1, 47, 'he who does not gather with Me scatters. Therefore I say to you, any sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 482, 2, 47, 'and blasphemy shall be forgiven people, but blasphemy against the Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 482, 3, 47, 'shall not be forgiven. Whoever speaks a word against the Son of Man, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 482, 4, 47, 'shall be forgiven him; but whoever speaks against the Holy Spirit, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 482, 5, 47, 'shall not be forgiven him, either in this age or in the age to come”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 482, 6, 47, '(Matthew 12:30-32). What I want you to see is that when they cursed Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 482, 7, 47, '-- called Him the prince of devils -- He forgave them. That''s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 482, 8, 47, 'difference between Jesus and the Old Testament prophets. When Miriam');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 482, 9, 47, 'cursed Moses, Miriam got leprosy; when somebody cursed Elisha, he was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 482, 10, 47, 'eaten by bears; but Jesus gave forgiveness. That''s how a New Covenant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 482, 11, 47, 'servant lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 482, 12, 48, 'Chapter 47 Wholehearted Disciples');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 482, 13, 48, 'Who Is for Jesus and Against Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 482, 14, 48, 'In the verses leading up to Matthew 12:30, the Pharisees have accused');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 482, 15, 48, 'Jesus of casting out demons through the power of the prince of demons,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 482, 16, 48, 'Satan. When Jesus said that a house divided itself cannot stand (verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 482, 17, 48, '25), He taught an important principle, of who is with Jesus and who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 482, 18, 48, 'not with Him. In Matthew 12:30, He says, “He who is not with Me is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 482, 19, 48, 'against Me.” On the surface, this appears to contradict what Jesus said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 482, 20, 48, 'in Luke 9:50, when his disciples were concerned about someone who was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 482, 21, 48, 'not following them, and Jesus said something which appears to be very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 482, 22, 48, 'different. When He heard of certain people who were casting out demons');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 482, 23, 48, 'but not following Him, Jesus said, “Don''t forbid him.” Paraphrasing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 482, 24, 48, 'Jesus’ words, He said, “Don''t follow him, don''t forbid him, because it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 482, 25, 48, 'doesn''t matter if he doesn''t preach discipleship, he is casting out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 482, 26, 48, 'demons. That''s fine because he who is not against us, is for us.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 482, 27, 48, 'That appears to contradict what it says here, “He who is not with Me, is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 482, 28, 48, 'against Me.” but when we see two apparently contradictory verses in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 483, 1, 48, 'Scripture, we must remember that both are true in the context in which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 483, 2, 48, 'Jesus says each. In Luke 9:50, He was replying to the disciples, who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 483, 3, 48, 'said in the previous verse, “Master, we saw someone casting out demons');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 483, 4, 48, 'and we tried to hinder him. We wanted to stop him because he doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 483, 5, 48, 'follow along with us.” In other words, if I were to paraphrase it, this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 483, 6, 48, 'man’s ministry seemed to be casting out demons, and he didn’t seem to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 483, 7, 48, 'emphasizing discipleship. So what do we do when we find someone like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 483, 8, 48, 'that today? They just go around casting out demons, and they''re not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 483, 9, 48, 'teaching people to follow Jesus and to be disciples. The word of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 483, 10, 48, 'Lord to such is, “Don''t hinder him, because he who is not against you is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 483, 11, 48, 'for you.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 483, 12, 48, 'In other words, He was telling the disciples that this man is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 483, 13, 48, 'against you - he''s not speaking against you. He''s doing a certain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 483, 14, 48, 'ministry (casting out demons), so leave him alone. The principle is -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 483, 15, 48, 'don''t hinder him, and don''t join him. That''s important to remember. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 483, 16, 48, 'didn’t say, “Okay you fellows, go and join him and do the same thing.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 483, 17, 48, 'No, leave him alone. Let him do his work, but you do what you are called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 483, 18, 48, 'to do, which is make disciples. It doesn''t mean that we have to work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 483, 19, 48, 'together with people who have a different vision, because if we did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 483, 20, 48, 'that, then the work would get diluted. If God has called you to make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 483, 21, 48, 'disciples, you must stick to that. But we don''t hinder or speak against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 483, 22, 48, 'others who are casting out demons. We believe that ultimately the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 483, 23, 48, 'wants to make disciples. That was the commission that He finally gave to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 483, 24, 48, 'His disciples in Matthew 28:18-20, but remember this instance took place');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 483, 25, 48, 'long before the final commission, long before the day of Pentecost.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 483, 26, 48, 'There was no commission at that time to go and make disciples. So if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 483, 27, 48, 'people were casting out demons, that was fine. If they didn''t join up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 483, 28, 48, 'with Jesus and become His disciples then, that was okay. But today, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 484, 1, 48, 'situation is different. We still follow the principle that we don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 484, 2, 48, 'hinder someone who is doing another ministry, but we can’t say that that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 484, 3, 48, 'person is fulfilling God’s full purpose.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 484, 4, 48, 'The full purpose of God is: cast out a man’s demons, bring him to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 484, 5, 48, 'Christ, make him a disciple, baptize him, and make him a disciple. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 484, 6, 48, 'that''s not done by someone else in their ministry, we don''t hinder him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 484, 7, 48, 'but we will make it clear that that''s not the calling of the church. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 484, 8, 48, 'we have to make this distinction clear to people who may be deceived by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 484, 9, 48, 'such a ministry also.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 484, 10, 48, 'We must remember when we’re reading the Gospels that certain things are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 484, 11, 48, 'permitted at that time. Jesus permitted for example, the payment of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 484, 12, 48, 'tithes, and for lepers to go and show themselves to the priests. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 484, 13, 48, 'was even an instance in Mark 10 when one rich young ruler came to him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 484, 14, 48, 'and said, “What must I do to inherit eternal life?” And Jesus told Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 484, 15, 48, 'to keep the commandments. What would you answer someone who asked you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 484, 16, 48, 'today, “How can I have eternal life?” Would you tell him to keep the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 484, 17, 48, 'commandments? No, but that''s what Jesus said to him. That''s one of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 484, 18, 48, 'many examples that show that the new covenant age had not yet started.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 484, 19, 48, 'It started only on the day of Pentecost. So until then, Jesus’ attitude');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 484, 20, 48, 'was; if somebody spends his time casting out demons and is not interest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 484, 21, 48, 'in discipleship, don’t hinder him - let him do that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 484, 22, 48, 'The Great Commission - Discipleship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 484, 23, 48, 'Now we have to urge everyone to make disciples, because that''s the Great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 484, 24, 48, 'Commission. So it is in that connection that Jesus says in Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 484, 25, 48, '12:30, “He who is not with Me is against Me, and he who does not gather');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 484, 26, 48, 'with Me, scatters.” It is in regards to following Jesus in building His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 484, 27, 48, 'church that if you''re not wholeheartedly with Him, you’re in a limited');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 484, 28, 48, 'way against Him. The non-Christian is obviously against the Lord. He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 485, 1, 48, 'not even claiming to have anything to do with the Lord. But when a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 485, 2, 48, 'Christian claims to belong to the Lord and claims to be doing the Lord''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 485, 3, 48, 'work, and yet he''s not gathering together, he can actually be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 485, 4, 48, 'hindrance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 485, 5, 48, 'Consider the example of a building site. Suppose you’ve got twenty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 485, 6, 48, 'workers there, and 10 of them are working hard, and 10 of them are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 485, 7, 48, 'sitting around and doing nothing but talking, wasting people''s time, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 485, 8, 48, 'getting in the way of other people doing their work. Would you say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 485, 9, 48, '“They’re doing no harm”? They’re doing a tremendous amount of harm! They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 485, 10, 48, 'are against the building of that building because they are hindering the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 485, 11, 48, 'ones who are working. They''re wasting their time talking about lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 485, 12, 48, 'things. If they had gone away from that site, the remaining ten people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 485, 13, 48, 'could have done a better job. That is an example of “He who is not with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 485, 14, 48, 'Me, is against Me, and he who does not gather with Me, scatters.” If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 485, 15, 48, 'you''re gathering from the fields (the harvest), and there are lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 485, 16, 48, 'people hanging around in the fields not doing anything, just standing in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 485, 17, 48, 'your way, they are hindering the work. They are going to stumble others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 485, 18, 48, 'and hinder them, and whatever they gather will slip out of their hand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 485, 19, 48, 'and scatter.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 485, 20, 48, 'Examples like this indicate that if you are not a wholehearted disciple');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 485, 21, 48, 'of Jesus, just forget about being a Christian. We must have no interest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 485, 22, 48, 'in going around gathering people whose only aim is to go to heaven. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 485, 23, 48, 'personally said that openly to the Lord: “I’ve no interest at all in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 485, 24, 48, 'gathering together people who just want to go to heaven when they die”.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 485, 25, 48, 'Is there any human being in the world, out of seven billion people, who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 485, 26, 48, 'doesn’t want to go to heaven when they die? Every single person wants to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 485, 27, 48, 'go to heaven! Nobody wants to go to hell. If that is the only reason for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 485, 28, 48, 'which people are coming, then I''m not interested because Jesus said, “Go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 486, 1, 48, 'and make disciples.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 486, 2, 48, 'Therefore, we''re not really interested in people who just come along');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 486, 3, 48, 'because they want to go to heaven when they die. That''s not the gospel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 486, 4, 48, 'we preach, but unfortunately that is the gospel being preached by lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 486, 5, 48, 'people today. The Great Commission is, “Go and make disciples, and teach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 486, 6, 48, 'them to do every single thing that I have commanded.” Very few people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 486, 7, 48, 'are doing that today, but those are the people who are really doing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 486, 8, 48, 'God''s work. You may not realize it because the work is small. Obviously,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 486, 9, 48, 'it’s small because they''re concentrating on quality and not on quantity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 486, 10, 48, 'The world emphasizes quantity. Every company examines its progress by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 486, 11, 48, 'what the balance sheets show, and how much their profit is. When a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 486, 12, 48, 'Christian church goes that way – keeping balance sheets of converts - it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 486, 13, 48, 'has gone the way of the world. Jesus made disciples. It''s not quantity,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 486, 14, 48, 'but quality that He looked for. Whenever He saw huge numbers, He turned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 486, 15, 48, 'around and said to them some of the hardest words that He ever said.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 486, 16, 48, 'Luke 14:25-26 is an example of this: great multitudes followed Him and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 486, 17, 48, 'He turned around and said, “You can’t follow me if you don’t hate your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 486, 18, 48, 'father, mother, brother, sister, wife and children” (paraphrased). Is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 486, 19, 48, 'that the type of sermon any preacher would preach to great multitude');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 486, 20, 48, 'following him? No! Jesus was not interested in quantity; He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 486, 21, 48, 'interested in quality.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 486, 22, 48, 'I heard a little story of a mother rabbit talking to a lioness, saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 486, 23, 48, '“I had 20 little rabbits last year, you know rabbits multiply very fast.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 486, 24, 48, 'How many did you have?” The lioness said, “I had only one last year, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 486, 25, 48, 'that one was a lion.” Do you see that''s the difference? Are we gathering');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 486, 26, 48, 'a lot of rabbits, or do we have some lions? Are we making disciples, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 486, 27, 48, 'a great crowd of people sitting in our Churches whose only aim is to go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 486, 28, 48, 'to heaven when they die? They want preachers who will tell them how to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 487, 1, 48, 'go to heaven when they die, and I want to say this also, that most of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 487, 2, 48, 'them are not going to go to heaven when they die, because their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 487, 3, 48, 'preachers have deceived them. Is it enough to believe in Jesus? Even the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 487, 4, 48, 'demons believe (James 2:19). That type of belief is not going to take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 487, 5, 48, 'anyone into God''s kingdom. The safest thing is to be a disciple and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 487, 6, 48, 'make disciples. Then, you are sure of where you''re going. So, “He who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 487, 7, 48, 'does not gather with Me, scatters.” A person is hindering God''s work if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 487, 8, 48, 'he''s not gathering wholehearted disciples.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 487, 9, 48, 'Blasphemy Against the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 487, 10, 48, '“Any sin can be forgiven, but blasphemy against the Holy Spirit will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 487, 11, 48, 'be forgiven” (Matthew 12:31). There is only one sin that Jesus said will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 487, 12, 48, 'never be forgiven, and what is it? From the context, what we see here is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 487, 13, 48, 'an attitude towards the Holy Spirit. The Holy Spirit is working, and you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 487, 14, 48, 'stand against it. The Holy Spirit is trying to say something to you and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 487, 15, 48, 'you resist it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 487, 16, 48, 'There are two types of sin: sins of action, and sins of attitudes. For');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 487, 17, 48, 'example, telling a lie is a sin of action. Or slapping somebody, that’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 487, 18, 48, 'a sin of action. Adultery is a sin of action. But there are other sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 487, 19, 48, 'that are sins of attitudes, such as hatred, bitterness, jealousy, an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 487, 20, 48, 'unforgiving spirit, pride, and selfishness. These are sins of attitude.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 487, 21, 48, 'Is the blasphemy against the Holy Spirit a sin of action, or a sin of an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 487, 22, 48, 'attitude? I believe it''s a sin of an attitude because that''s what these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 487, 23, 48, 'Pharisees were demonstrating - an attitude against the Holy Spirit. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 487, 24, 48, 'need not be just in the way they spoke to Jesus. Today it could be in an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 487, 25, 48, 'attitude where you resist the pleadings of the Holy Spirit until you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 487, 26, 48, 'cross a line and the Holy Spirit stops pleading with you. That can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 487, 27, 48, 'happen. Now the important thing is not to define what the sin against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 487, 28, 48, 'the Holy Spirit is. What is more important is to know whether you''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 488, 1, 48, 'committed it or not. It doesn''t matter the definition, definition is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 488, 2, 48, 'important. For example, the definition of humility is not the main');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 488, 3, 48, 'thing, the important thing is to be humble. So in the same way, in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 488, 4, 48, 'area, the important thing is not a definition (which is all that a lot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 488, 5, 48, 'of people seek). What is the sin against the Holy Spirit? That''s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 488, 6, 48, 'important to know, because it''s not very clear what exactly it is, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 488, 7, 48, 'we don''t want to be wrong here.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 488, 8, 48, 'But one thing we can be sure of, we can know definitely whether we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 488, 9, 48, 'committed it, and that''s enough. How do we know whether we''ve committed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 488, 10, 48, 'the sin against the Holy Spirit or not? It is the Holy Spirit who brings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 488, 11, 48, 'us to repentance. Look at this verse for example in Acts 11:18, (the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 488, 12, 48, 'last part). “God has granted to the Gentiles repentance that leads to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 488, 13, 48, 'life” (that is - through the Holy Spirit’s working). All the working of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 488, 14, 48, 'the God today in the world in people''s lives is through the Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 488, 15, 48, 'So the Holy Spirit led people to repentance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 488, 16, 48, 'So if you find in your heart a desire to turn from sin, to repent, then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 488, 17, 48, 'you can be absolutely sure that you''ve not committed the sin against the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 488, 18, 48, 'Holy Spirit. No matter what you have spoken against the Holy Spirit, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 488, 19, 48, 'what you have done in your life (however great of a crime you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 488, 20, 48, 'committed), you have not sinned against the Holy Spirit if there is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 488, 21, 48, 'slightest desire in you to turn around and come back to the Lord. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 488, 22, 48, 'is the test. Because in a person who has committed that sin of blasphemy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 488, 23, 48, 'against the Holy Spirit, the Holy Spirit will stop pleading with that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 488, 24, 48, 'person and he will never have a desire to repent. He will be hard, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 488, 25, 48, 'he can sin and he’ll have no desire to repent, and he will make a joke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 488, 26, 48, 'of sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 488, 27, 48, 'I think in my whole life I can think of only one person whom I''ve ever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 488, 28, 48, 'met like that who could sin and make a joke of the whole thing. I was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 489, 1, 48, 'amazed he could go and commit adultery and make a joke of the whole');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 489, 2, 48, 'thing, and he was supposed to be a Christian. In that case, I would say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 489, 3, 48, 'it''s possible that he had committed a sin against the Holy Spirit, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 489, 4, 48, 'he resisted the Holy Spirit so long that his conscience is hardened and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 489, 5, 48, 'he had no desire to turn.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 489, 6, 48, 'But we''re not here to judge who has committed that sin or not. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 489, 7, 48, 'important thing is that we can definitely know about ourselves. You may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 489, 8, 48, 'not be able to know about another person, but you can definitely know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 489, 9, 48, 'about yourself, whether you have committed that sin. I say this so that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 489, 10, 48, 'you don''t let the devil bring you under unnecessary condemnation, making');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 489, 11, 48, 'you feel, “Oh I committed that sin, now there''s no hope for me!” I''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 489, 12, 48, 'had a number of people in my life ask me, “Do you think I have sinned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 489, 13, 48, 'against the Holy Spirit?” I ask them one simple question: “Do you have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 489, 14, 48, 'desire to turn from sin and trust in Jesus now?” If they say “yes,” then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 489, 15, 48, 'I say, “Well, I can assure you that you''ve not sinned against the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 489, 16, 48, 'Spirit.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 489, 17, 48, 'In Matthew 12:32, Jesus says, “Whoever shall speak a word against the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 489, 18, 48, 'Son of Man, it shall be forgiven him, but whoever speaks against the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 489, 19, 48, 'Holy Spirit shall not be forgiven, in this age, or age to come.” Again,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 489, 20, 48, 'I think that speaking against the Holy Spirit is a deliberate knowing,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 489, 21, 48, 'standing against the work of the Holy Spirit. Sometimes there are these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 489, 22, 48, 'fake preachers who do all types of crazy things like pushing people down');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 489, 23, 48, 'with their hand and saying, “This is the work of the Holy Spirit!” They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 489, 24, 48, 'say, “Don''t you dare speak against the Holy Spirit (referring to their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 489, 25, 48, 'false works), because you''ll never be forgiven!” It''s a verse which many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 489, 26, 48, 'preachers use to scare people, and so people get scared and say, “Okay,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 489, 27, 48, 'I will not speak against it.” I''ve spoken against that type of garbage');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 489, 28, 48, 'all my life, and when people try to scare me with these words, I say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 490, 1, 48, '“You know, there''s another verse in 1 John 4:1.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 490, 2, 48, 'The devil also quoted verses to Jesus saying, “It is written,” and Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 490, 3, 48, 'replied saying, “It is also written.” So when people speak to me and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 490, 4, 48, 'say, “Don''t speak against these things, because it is written that if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 490, 5, 48, 'you speak against the Holy Spirit, you won''t be forgiven!” I say to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 490, 6, 48, 'them, “It''s also written in 1 John 4:1, ‘Beloved, don''t believe every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 490, 7, 48, 'spirit, but test the spirits to see whether they are from God,’ and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 490, 8, 48, 'that''s what I''m doing - I want to test every action. Is that from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 490, 9, 48, 'Holy Spirit”? For me, this is a four-fold test to see whether it’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 490, 10, 48, 'something from the Holy Spirit: Did Jesus do it? Did Jesus teach it? Did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 490, 11, 48, 'the apostles do it? Did the apostles teach it? And if it''s “no” on all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 490, 12, 48, 'four counts, then I say “I reject it. That''s not from the Holy Spirit,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 490, 13, 48, 'because if it is from the Spirit, I''ll see it in one of these four');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 490, 14, 48, 'areas”. We should not be afraid to test the spirits. If you don''t,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 490, 15, 48, 'you''re disobeying 1 John 4:1, and you deserve to be deceived because you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 490, 16, 48, 'are not obeying God''s Word. That’s how so many people are deceived,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 490, 17, 48, 'because they''re scared by this verse. Don''t allow anybody to scare you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 490, 18, 48, 'by quoting Scripture to you. Remember that there''s another Scripture');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 490, 19, 48, 'that tells you to test every single spirit, and every single');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 490, 20, 48, 'manifestation, because there''s a lot of deception going on in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 490, 21, 48, 'Christendom right now, just like the Bible says. Deceiving spirits will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 490, 22, 48, 'flood Christendom in the last days.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 490, 23, 48, 'Jesus’ Attitude of Forgiveness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 490, 24, 48, 'Jesus also said, “Whoever speaks against the Son of Man will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 490, 25, 48, 'forgiven.” That is an amazing verse! He''s not just telling the Pharisees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 490, 26, 48, 'that they are forgiven for speaking against him at that time, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 490, 27, 48, 'calling him the ruler of demons, or working with the ruler of demons. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 490, 28, 48, 'is saying that whoever (for the next 2,000, or 10,000 years) speaks a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 491, 1, 48, 'word against the Son of Man is forgiven! Jesus is offering forgiveness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 491, 2, 48, 'to every single person who speaks against Him. What an attitude to have!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 491, 3, 48, 'Every Christian says they want to be like Jesus. What does that mean,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 491, 4, 48, 'practically? Here''s one area where we can be like Him that we should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 491, 5, 48, 'decide right at the outset. We must have this attitude: whoever ever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 491, 6, 48, 'speaks against or harms me in any way, right now I say, “He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 491, 7, 48, 'forgiven.” I have nothing against him. I''m not going to hold anything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 491, 8, 48, 'against him. I will not keep a grudge against him for a single moment,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 491, 9, 48, 'leave alone for a single day!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 491, 10, 48, 'This is the attitude we must have - this person who harmed us is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 491, 11, 48, 'forgiven. He is forgiven because he doesn''t know what he''s doing, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 491, 12, 48, 'does not know what a serious crime it is to speak against the child of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 491, 13, 48, 'God. He doesn’t know it. If he knew it, he wouldn''t dare to do it, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 491, 14, 48, 'he is so blind. He is so lacking in spiritual intelligence, that he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 491, 15, 48, 'speaks against God''s children. Forgive him! He''s a spiritual idiot! What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 491, 16, 48, 'do you do with an idiot who comes and says some foolish things to you on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 491, 17, 48, 'the road? You don''t pick a fight with him. In the same way, that’s how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 491, 18, 48, 'to deal with spiritual idiots who keep on criticizing God''s people and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 491, 19, 48, 'criticizing God’s servants and finding fault with them: leave them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 491, 20, 48, 'alone. Just treat them like the dumb idiots you meet on the road');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 491, 21, 48, 'perhaps, and ignore them. Forgive them, and don''t take seriously what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 491, 22, 48, 'they say, because there is spiritual idiocy, just like there is normal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 491, 23, 48, 'idiocy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 491, 24, 48, 'Cleansing the Inner Life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 491, 25, 48, 'In the next verse (Matthew 12:33), He continues to speak on the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 491, 26, 48, 'subject. He says it’s not just a question of slightly changing your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 491, 27, 48, 'external life - your words and your behavior. For example, a person when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 491, 28, 48, 'recognizing their sin may simply say, “Okay, in the future I won''t do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 492, 1, 48, 'this particular thing.” That doesn''t solve the problem though, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 492, 2, 48, 'that is only external refinement. Management seminars are often');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 492, 3, 48, 'conducted by companies for management. Executives teach people there to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 492, 4, 48, 'refine their external behavior so that sales can improve, and working');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 492, 5, 48, 'together in a company can improve their sales. They''re all seeking their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 492, 6, 48, 'own gain, benefit, and profit. But here Jesus says that this is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 492, 7, 48, 'going to solve the problem as far as Christianity is concerned. “You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 492, 8, 48, 'have to make the total tree good, and then its fruit will be good. Or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 492, 9, 48, 'make the tree bad, and the fruit will be bad. The tree is known by its');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 492, 10, 48, 'fruit” (Matthew 12:33).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 492, 11, 48, 'For example, if you have a tree in your garden that''s producing bad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 492, 12, 48, 'mangoes. As soon as fruit comes out, it''s rotten. You can see that it’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 492, 13, 48, 'rotten. It’s very, very bad, and you can do nothing about it. You can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 492, 14, 48, 'keep cutting off the fruit, and go and buy some really good mangoes in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 492, 15, 48, 'the market and tie your tree up here and there in the branches, and fool');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 492, 16, 48, 'everybody who passes by your house that you have a fantastically rich');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 492, 17, 48, 'mango tree. You can make them think it produces so much fruit, and such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 492, 18, 48, 'luscious fruit, but it is a deception. The real tree is producing a lot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 492, 19, 48, 'of corrupt mangoes, but you''re not letting anybody see it because as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 492, 20, 48, 'soon as fruit comes up, you cut it off. You are buying some good mangoes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 492, 21, 48, 'from the market, and tying your tree up here and there carefully in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 492, 22, 48, 'branches, and people are thinking that''s the fruit of the tree.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 492, 23, 48, 'This is a perfect picture of many, many Christians. They cover up all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 492, 24, 48, 'the wrong things that they do in secret and darkness, and in their homes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 492, 25, 48, 'and many other places, but they put on all these good fruits in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 492, 26, 48, 'presence of the others to fool passers-by. They want to fool others who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 492, 27, 48, 'know them, and make them think that they are godly people. And Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 492, 28, 48, 'said that that''s not the answer. You need to make the whole tree good.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 493, 1, 48, 'That''s why John the Baptist said, “The axe is laid to the root of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 493, 2, 48, 'tree” (Matthew 3:10). We can say that in the old covenant under the law,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 493, 3, 48, 'God gave Israel a pair of scissors to cut off bad fruits as soon as they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 493, 4, 48, 'came. So, when the Israelites obeyed God, you found hardly any murder,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 493, 5, 48, 'adultery, theft, etc. because of the commandments that they obeyed. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 493, 6, 48, 'is like scissors that cut off the bad fruit immediately. Meanwhile, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 493, 7, 48, 'other nations around Israel, who didn’t have these commandments, kept');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 493, 8, 48, 'living with these terrible sins. So Israel was just as bad as the other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 493, 9, 48, 'nations on the inside, but they had a pair of scissors to cut off the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 493, 10, 48, 'bad fruit so that it didn''t continue to grow and develop. So while that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 493, 11, 48, 'gave the nation of Israel a good testimony externally, it did not make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 493, 12, 48, 'the tree good.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 493, 13, 48, 'In the new covenant, God has taken away the pair of scissors. Jesus came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 493, 14, 48, 'with an axe (as you read in Matthew 3) and laid it to the root of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 493, 15, 48, 'tree, to cut it from its root. Once the bad tree is cut from the root,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 493, 16, 48, 'it can’t produce any bad fruit. And now, Jesus has planted a good tree -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 493, 17, 48, 'a tree that produces good fruit. Now you don''t have to go to the market');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 493, 18, 48, 'to buy good mangoes to fool people, and you''re not interested in fooling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 493, 19, 48, 'people now anyways. You’re interested in having a really good tree.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 493, 20, 48, 'That''s the point here. Make the tree good, and then its fruit will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 493, 21, 48, 'good. But if the tree is bad, you know the fruit will be bad. The tree');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 493, 22, 48, 'is known by its fruit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 493, 23, 48, 'We cannot examine another person''s inner life, or his heart. God alone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 493, 24, 48, 'knows the heart. Man looks on the outward appearance, but God looks at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 493, 25, 48, 'the heart. We can’t see people. That heart means the root of a tree. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 493, 26, 48, 'don''t know anything about the roots of the tree. Whenever you see a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 493, 27, 48, 'tree, you don''t see its roots, but we look at the fruit. By the fruit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 493, 28, 48, 'you can gauge what the tree is like. So in a sense, you don''t have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 494, 1, 48, 'look inside a person''s heart. The fruit that comes out of that tree is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 494, 2, 48, 'an indication. Jesus says, “By their fruit you shall know them.” You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 494, 3, 48, 'shall know the tree by its fruits. He warned us against false prophets');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 494, 4, 48, 'in Matthew 7 by telling us to look at the fruit in their life. So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 494, 5, 48, 'remember this: the main thing we should look for in one another is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 494, 6, 48, 'gift, but fruit. By fruit, we know whether a person is godly or not.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 494, 7, 49, 'Chapter 48 The Importance of Our Speech');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 494, 8, 49, 'In Matthew 12:33, Jesus says, “Either make the tree good and its fruit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 494, 9, 49, 'good, or make the tree bad and its fruit bad, for the tree is known by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 494, 10, 49, 'its fruit.” Then He says, “You brood of vipers!” (He''s talking to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 494, 11, 49, 'Pharisees, who had said that He was casting out demons by the prince of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 494, 12, 49, 'demons, and He calls them brood of vipers.) There are many people who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 494, 13, 49, 'feel that Christlikeness means that you never speak strong words. If a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 494, 14, 49, 'preacher ever got up and said, “This group of people is a brood of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 494, 15, 49, 'vipers!” there are lots of Christians who would jump on him and say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 494, 16, 49, '“Brother, be more Christ-like!” But what does it mean to be Christlike?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 494, 17, 49, 'This is Jesus Christ Himself saying, “You brood of vipers!” That is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 494, 18, 49, 'Christlike statement when it is made to those who deserve it. You don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 494, 19, 49, 'call those who don''t deserve it by that name, but Jesus called those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 494, 20, 49, 'did deserve it by a very strong name. Or if someone were to turn the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 494, 21, 49, 'tables of money changers today, people would say, “You need to be more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 494, 22, 49, 'Christlike.” The people who say these words don''t realize that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 494, 23, 49, 'Himself has turned the tables of money changers in the temple. People’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 494, 24, 49, 'understanding of Christlikeness is from their own head. They think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 494, 25, 49, 'Christlikeness means, “Just be gracious and let the devil run the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 494, 26, 49, 'church. Don''t say anything, keep quiet!” Is that really Christlikeness?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 494, 27, 49, 'That''s a lot of garbage! That''s the garbage that a lot of Christians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 494, 28, 49, 'believe is Christlikeness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 495, 1, 49, 'Christlikeness includes gentleness, but it also includes firmness. It’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 495, 2, 49, 'tough love that is like Christ, not a wishy-washy, sentimental type of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 495, 3, 49, 'love that ignores the glory of God. So Jesus turns around to these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 495, 4, 49, 'people and says, “You brood of vipers! How can you, being evil, speak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 495, 5, 49, 'what is good? The tree will only give forth the type of fruit depending');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 495, 6, 49, 'on what type of tree it is, and the mouth speaks out that which fills');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 495, 7, 49, 'the heart” (Matthew 12:34). Everything that comes out of our mouths');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 495, 8, 49, 'comes from within our hearts, because the mouth is the overflow valve of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 495, 9, 49, 'the heart. If your heart is filled with evil, evil will come out of your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 495, 10, 49, 'mouth. If your heart is filled with anger, anger comes out with your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 495, 11, 49, 'mouth. If your heart is filled with goodness, goodness comes out of your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 495, 12, 49, 'mouth. Of course, we can act, and say things that are not in our heart -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 495, 13, 49, 'by a certain measure of self-control, I can suppress what is in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 495, 14, 49, 'heart, and speak words that are not really a true reflection of my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 495, 15, 49, 'heart. Sometimes, diplomatically, we say things we don''t really feel for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 495, 16, 49, 'some personal gain. But whenever you see a person suddenly out of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 495, 17, 49, 'control, bursting out with something, you can be sure that has come from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 495, 18, 49, 'his heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 495, 19, 49, 'Shaking Reveals What’s Inside');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 495, 20, 49, '“Out of the abundance of the heart the mouth speaks” (Matthew 12:34).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 495, 21, 49, 'Someone has used this illustration: if I''m carrying a jug of sweet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 495, 22, 49, 'water, no matter how heavily somebody shakes it or shakes me, only sweet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 495, 23, 49, 'water will spill out. How can the sweet water in my jug suddenly become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 495, 24, 49, 'bitter just because somebody shook me? When somebody irritates us, what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 495, 25, 49, 'comes out is what is truly in our heart – likely something that we never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 495, 26, 49, 'conquered, like Irritability or anger. That is revealed to be what’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 495, 27, 49, 'really in our heart. It was carefully hidden and submerged, but someone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 495, 28, 49, 'approaches us, and said or did something, and out it came out like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 496, 1, 49, 'flood. We should never say, “somebody irritated me and therefore I said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 496, 2, 49, 'this.” The truth is, somebody shook you, and what was already inside');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 496, 3, 49, 'your jar came out. Thank God that this person shook you so that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 496, 4, 49, 'could discover what was inside your jar! You should be thankful to that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 496, 5, 49, 'person. Otherwise, you would have remained constantly ignorant of what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 496, 6, 49, 'was in your heart. All the nice people around you who never shook you --');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 496, 7, 49, 'never shook your jug -- never gave you the opportunity to discover what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 496, 8, 49, 'was in your heart; then this evil man came along and shook you really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 496, 9, 49, 'hard, and out came all those bitter words for you to discover the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 496, 10, 49, 'bitterness that was in your heart. So should you be thankful or not? If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 496, 11, 49, 'somebody came into your room and a toppled the cupboard, and a snake');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 496, 12, 49, 'came out from underneath there that was living there all along, would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 496, 13, 49, 'you be thankful to that man who toppled that cupboard? Sure! You would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 496, 14, 49, 'say, “Hey, thank you very much! I never knew there was a snake living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 496, 15, 49, 'underneath there all these years.” So if we take that attitude, we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 496, 16, 49, 'cleanse ourselves. But if you get upset with the person who revealed the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 496, 17, 49, 'snake, then you have it all wrong. ”The mouth speaks out of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 496, 18, 49, 'abundance that fills the heart,” is a principle we must remember.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 496, 19, 49, '“The good man out of his good treasure brings forth what is good.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 496, 20, 49, 'Naturally, if the tree is good, it will bring forth good fruit. The evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 496, 21, 49, 'man out of his evil treasure brings forth what is evil. Just imagine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 496, 22, 49, 'this, that a man can have evil treasure in his heart. One wouldn''t think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 496, 23, 49, 'that evil is a treasure. Good is a treasure that we can understand. Good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 496, 24, 49, 'thoughts about people and good attitudes to people are certainly a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 496, 25, 49, 'treasure; but imagine this: people can be so bad that they have evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 496, 26, 49, 'attitudes and evil thoughts about others, and they call it a treasure!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 496, 27, 49, 'This is satanic. From that evil treasure, when some pressure comes (like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 496, 28, 49, 'you squeeze a toothpaste tube), out comes what is inside. That''s it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 497, 1, 49, 'The Way We Speak Is Very Important');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 497, 2, 49, 'If you think that the way we speak is unimportant so long as we’ve done');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 497, 3, 49, 'a lot of good things, then you must be believing that the same thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 497, 4, 49, 'that many religions believe - that in the final day of judgment, God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 497, 5, 49, 'going to take a weighing balance, put all your good deeds on one side');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 497, 6, 49, 'and all the evil words you spoke on the other side, and then weigh the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 497, 7, 49, 'two. If the good deeds outweigh the evil deeds, you go to heaven. If the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 497, 8, 49, 'evil deeds outweigh the good deeds, then you go to hell.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 497, 9, 49, 'That''s what many religions really believe deep down, and that could be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 497, 10, 49, 'your belief too, even though you''re a Christian. Even though you say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 497, 11, 49, 'salvation is through the death of Jesus Christ, you may feel, “Oh these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 497, 12, 49, 'bad words I''ve spoken are taken care of by all the good that I have done');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 497, 13, 49, 'which God will see.” Well your faith is then the same. But look at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 497, 14, 49, 'words of Jesus. “I say to you” - Jesus sometimes uses that expression to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 497, 15, 49, 'emphasize that which most people wouldn''t believe – “that every careless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 497, 16, 49, 'word that men shall speak, they shall render account for it in the day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 497, 17, 49, 'of judgment” (Matthew 12:36). I have sometimes wanted to write a little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 497, 18, 49, 'article on all the verses that born-again Christians do not believe and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 497, 19, 49, 'do not take seriously, and this would be one of them. I don''t know if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 497, 20, 49, 'you who are really born again. Believe this, that in the day of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 497, 21, 49, 'judgment, you’ll have to give an account for every single careless,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 497, 22, 49, 'useless word that you spoke in your life. Jesus forgave them for calling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 497, 23, 49, 'Him Beelzebul, but they would still have to give an account for it in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 497, 24, 49, 'the day of judgment. That they cannot escape, because forgiveness has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 497, 25, 49, 'two directions: whenever you sin against a human being, you first sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 497, 26, 49, 'against God and then against the human being. So forgiveness has both a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 497, 27, 49, 'vertical and a horizontal component, like the arms of the cross.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 497, 28, 49, 'Every sin is against God, but some sins are only against God. For');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 498, 1, 49, 'example, if you have dirty thoughts or you do something that harms your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 498, 2, 49, 'body, that''s a sin against God. But if you hate another person in some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 498, 3, 49, 'way with words or actions, then you’ve sinned not only against God, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 498, 4, 49, 'you’ve also sinned against that person. That person can forgive you only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 498, 5, 49, 'the horizontal element of that sin, that is, the man-to-man part. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 498, 6, 49, 'cannot forgive you your sin against God. How can he forgive you what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 498, 7, 49, 'you''ve sinned against God? That''s impossible. So when the Pharisees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 498, 8, 49, 'spoke against Jesus, or when you speak against somebody, that person may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 498, 9, 49, 'forgive you, but that''s forgiveness for only the horizontal aspect of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 498, 10, 49, 'that sin. The vertical aspect you''re still responsible for. When Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 498, 11, 49, 'said on the cross, “Father, forgive them, for they don''t know what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 498, 12, 49, 'they''re doing,” He was forgiving that horizontal element. He is saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 498, 13, 49, '“As far as I''m concerned, I’ve forgiven them.” But there was a vertical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 498, 14, 49, 'element to it, in the sense that they had crucified the Son of God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 498, 15, 49, 'which was a terrible sin against God, and one day they will all answer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 498, 16, 49, 'for it. The Jewish nation answered for it also forty years later. After');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 498, 17, 49, 'the forty years God gave them to repent, He scattered them all over the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 498, 18, 49, 'world. God is very righteous in these matters.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 498, 19, 49, 'Defining Careless Speech');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 498, 20, 49, 'We will have to give an account for every careless word that we speak,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 498, 21, 49, 'and in the context, it appears to be words of accusation that are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 498, 22, 49, 'carelessly spoken. Have you carelessly spoken against God''s people,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 498, 23, 49, 'against God''s servants, without thinking about how serious of a sin that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 498, 24, 49, 'is? You haven’t known all the facts, yet you’ve judged and criticized');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 498, 25, 49, 'people based on hearsay. That''s what I mean by careless speaking.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 498, 26, 49, '“Careless” means you don''t take care to find out if that thing is true.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 498, 27, 49, 'You don''t take care to think, “Is this something which I can stand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 498, 28, 49, 'before God and say, ‘it’s the truth,’ or is it something I just heard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 499, 1, 49, 'and I am spreading scandal, or is it something that I feel about this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 499, 2, 49, 'person? I feel this is the prince of devils operating here.” Your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 499, 3, 49, 'feeling is unimportant. Do you have some evidence for it? That’s a test.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 499, 4, 49, 'So He says that every careless word that men shall speak they shall');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 499, 5, 49, 'render account on the day of the judgment. In other words, think of all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 499, 6, 49, 'the words you''ve spoken every day. We have to be very careful that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 499, 7, 49, 'don''t speak words that hurt people unnecessarily. Though sometimes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 499, 8, 49, 'there''s a need to speak strong words like Jesus spoke to even Peter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 499, 9, 49, 'saying, “Get behind me Satan!” (Matthew 16:23).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 499, 10, 49, 'God is the judge of the motive with which we have spoken different');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 499, 11, 49, 'words, but you can be pretty sure that the words we have spoken are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 499, 12, 49, 'being recorded, somewhere in our memory perhaps, and they will be played');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 499, 13, 49, 'back on the day of judgment. Every human being is going to be judged on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 499, 14, 49, 'the basis of those words. We''re not referring to humor here. For');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 499, 15, 49, 'example, God is the one who created humor, and I believe there''s a place');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 499, 16, 49, 'for humor in the Christian life. So if you crack a clean joke which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 499, 17, 49, 'doesn''t hurt anybody, that''s a good thing. It sometimes builds');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 499, 18, 49, 'relationships. That''s not a “careless word.” We''re talking about words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 499, 19, 49, 'that are spoken instigated by Satan, or designed to hurt people, etc.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 499, 20, 49, 'Next, Jesus speaks some very important words. We have all heard of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 499, 21, 49, 'justification by faith (Romans 4), and we''ve all heard of justification');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 499, 22, 49, 'by faith that produces works (James 2), and that we are justified by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 499, 23, 49, 'works that come out of faith, but have you ever heard of this? “By your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 499, 24, 49, 'words you will be justified, and by your words you will be condemned”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 499, 25, 49, '(Matthew 12:37). Jesus is saying what is also in James 2 - the works');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 499, 26, 49, 'that we do include the words that we speak. This shows how important our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 499, 27, 49, 'words are, that they are going to determine in the final day, whether we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 499, 28, 49, 'are going to be justified or condemned. In other words, our words are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 500, 1, 49, 'the fruit that determine what type of tree we are. If you listen to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 500, 2, 49, 'person''s words, then you can pretty much tell what type of tree he is.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 500, 3, 49, 'If I can listen to a man for 15 minutes and gauge pretty much where he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 500, 4, 49, 'stands, then imagine God’s understanding! He can see much more!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 500, 5, 49, 'Our words are a very important revelation of our nature, and our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 500, 6, 49, 'character, especially the words that we speak when we are under');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 500, 7, 49, 'pressure. So be very careful with your words.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 500, 8, 49, 'Speak Words Rich in Grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 500, 9, 49, 'Colossians 4:6 is an amazing verse which says how we are to speak. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 500, 10, 49, 'a verse that most Christians don''t take too seriously: “Let your speech');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 500, 11, 49, 'always be with grace.” “Always” means 24/7. Every sentence we speak must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 500, 12, 49, 'be with grace; seasoned, as it were, as with salt, so that you may know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 500, 13, 49, 'how you should respond to each person. When grace is lacking in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 500, 14, 49, 'speech, it is like salt missing in the food. It is tasteless. So it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 500, 15, 49, 'not just speaking about evil words; we can also speak tasteless words.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 500, 16, 49, 'God wants us to speak words rich in grace. They can be strong words,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 500, 17, 49, 'like, “Brood of vipers!” spoken to wake people up to see reality, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 500, 18, 49, 'they are spoken in love. Or they could be gracious words, like, “Neither');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 500, 19, 49, 'do I condemn you.” So by our words we can encourage people, by our words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 500, 20, 49, 'we can condemn people. Let''s make sure our words are always words of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 500, 21, 49, 'encouragement, of challenge, of comfort.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 500, 22, 49, 'Craving for a Sign');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 500, 23, 49, 'In Matthew 12:38, some of the scribes and Pharisees (who were always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 500, 24, 49, 'trying to catch Jesus in some thing or the other) came to Him and said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 500, 25, 49, '“We want to see a sign.” Remember we''re trying to understand all that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 500, 26, 49, 'Jesus taught, and Jesus taught a lot here about our speech, which is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 500, 27, 49, 'very important. “Teach others to do what I have commanded you, teach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 500, 28, 49, 'others to speak like I''ve taught you” (Matthew 16:20 paraphrase). So how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 501, 1, 49, 'did Jesus speak to a group of people who wanted to see a sign? They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 501, 2, 49, 'wanted to see some type of miracle. They thought Jesus was some type of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 501, 3, 49, 'magician who had come to show a magic show on earth, and He answered and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 501, 4, 49, 'said to them, “An evil and adulterous generation craves for a sign, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 501, 5, 49, 'yet no sign shall be given to it but the sign of Jonah the prophet.” Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 501, 6, 49, 'you know that it is an evil and an adulterous generation that is always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 501, 7, 49, 'looking for signs? To ask God, “Please do a miracle! Please do a sign');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 501, 8, 49, 'for me!” is to be a part of an evil and adulterous generation. When God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 501, 9, 49, 'has given us His Word and spoken to us through Christ, there''s no need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 501, 10, 49, 'to ask God for a sign. He has shown us His will in the Scriptures,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 501, 11, 49, 'through the life of Jesus and through the words of the Holy Spirit. An');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 501, 12, 49, 'evil and adulterous generation ask for a sign, and He says, “the only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 501, 13, 49, 'sign you will get is the sign of Jonah the prophet,” and that is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 501, 14, 49, 'sign of resurrection. “As Jonah was in the belly of the sea monster for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 501, 15, 49, 'three days and three nights, so shall the Son of Man will be three days');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 501, 16, 49, 'and three nights in the heart of the earth, and then He will come out.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 501, 17, 49, 'That''s a sign. Jonah came out of that sea monster’s mouth, and the Son');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 501, 18, 49, 'of Man will come out after three days and three nights in the heart of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 501, 19, 49, 'the earth. That resurrection is the only sign that God is going to give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 501, 20, 49, 'to an evil and an adulterous generation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 501, 21, 49, 'Clarifying Two Misunderstandings About the Resurrection');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 501, 22, 49, 'The resurrection of Jesus Christ is a very, very important aspect of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 501, 23, 49, 'witness for Him. He says to hear about Jonah being in the belly of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 501, 24, 49, 'fish for three days and three nights. A lot of things that Christians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 501, 25, 49, 'believe and practice are tradition - and not according to Scripture -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 501, 26, 49, 'and this is a perfect example. Many people think Jesus was crucified on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 501, 27, 49, 'what they call ‘Good Friday,’ and that He rose from the dead on a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 501, 28, 49, 'Sunday. Now if you calculate using simple arithmetic, you will see that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 502, 1, 49, 'Friday to Sunday morning is not three days and three nights. It''s only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 502, 2, 49, 'two nights - Friday and Saturday. But Jesus said so clearly that it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 502, 3, 49, 'would be three days and three nights that He would be in the heart of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 502, 4, 49, 'the earth. So it is obvious. We know definitely that He rose on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 502, 5, 49, 'first day of the week. That''s clearly written in John''s gospel and in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 502, 6, 49, 'the other gospels, but if that is the case (which we know is true), then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 502, 7, 49, 'Jesus Christ was crucified on Thursday afternoon, and at three o''clock');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 502, 8, 49, 'in the afternoon, He died. So that would be part of Thursday (first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 502, 9, 49, 'day), Thursday night (first night), Friday (second day), Friday night');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 502, 10, 49, '(second night), Saturday (third day), and Saturday night (third night).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 502, 11, 49, 'That''s three days three nights. Then, early Sunday morning before dawn,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 502, 12, 49, 'He rose up from the dead. That is the only way it could be three days');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 502, 13, 49, 'and three nights.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 502, 14, 49, 'I don''t have the slightest doubt in my mind that Christ was crucified on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 502, 15, 49, 'a Thursday. It says in John 19:31 that, Jesus was crucified on the day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 502, 16, 49, 'of the preparation for the Sabbath the next day, and that the Sabbath');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 502, 17, 49, 'was not a regular Sabbath, but a high day. So the next day Sabbath was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 502, 18, 49, 'not the regular Saturday Sabbath day, but the first day of the Feast of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 502, 19, 49, 'Unleavened Bread, according to the Law. And the day after the Passover');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 502, 20, 49, 'was to be the regular Saturday Sabbath. So there were two Sabbaths here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 502, 21, 49, 'on this “high day,” which also explains why the women couldn''t come to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 502, 22, 49, 'anoint the body of Jesus until Sunday morning. So Jesus Christ died on a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 502, 23, 49, 'Thursday. He was three days and three nights in the grave, and rose on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 502, 24, 49, 'Sunday morning.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 502, 25, 49, 'The other question people have is this: “If Jonah was alive in the belly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 502, 26, 49, 'of a fish, does it mean that Jesus was alive in the grave?” But it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 502, 27, 49, 'doesn''t say He was “in the grave for three days and three nights.” They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 502, 28, 49, 'have read carelessly. It says that He was in the heart of the earth. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 503, 1, 49, 'heart of the earth is the center of the earth, where at that time all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 503, 2, 49, 'departed spirits went. It had two sections - one was hell, and the other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 503, 3, 49, 'was what was called Paradise, or Abraham''s bosom. Those who qualified to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 503, 4, 49, 'be in Paradise went there (like the thief on the cross), and the others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 503, 5, 49, 'went to hell. Jesus made it very clear to the thief on the cross that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 503, 6, 49, 'that very day, they would be together in Paradise, and here it says, “in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 503, 7, 49, 'the heart of the earth.” So from that we know that paradise at that time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 503, 8, 49, 'was in the heart of the earth, and that is where Jesus was alive (He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 503, 9, 49, 'alive in His spirit; His body of course was in the tomb of Joseph of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 503, 10, 49, 'Arimathea, but He Himself was not in his body). The Son of man was alive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 503, 11, 49, 'in the heart of the earth, where Paradise is. Three days later, He came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 503, 12, 49, 'into His body in the grave, and rose up from the dead. That''s how, if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 503, 13, 49, 'you don''t read Scripture carefully, you can be mistaken there.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 503, 14, 49, 'By the way, Paradise was then taken up to the third heaven when Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 503, 15, 49, 'ascended. Ephesians 4 says He took all those captives captive, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 503, 16, 49, 'ascended with them. When the Apostle Paul was caught up to the third');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 503, 17, 49, 'heaven, he found Paradise was there. So Paradise is no longer in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 503, 18, 49, 'heart of the earth after the ascension of Christ; it is in the third');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 503, 19, 49, 'heaven. We go up to be with the Lord now when we leave this earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 503, 20, 49, 'In Matthew 12:41, Jesus says, “The men of Nineveh shall stand up with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 503, 21, 49, 'this generation at the judgment, and shall condemn it because they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 503, 22, 49, 'repented at the preaching of Jonah; and behold, something greater than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 503, 23, 49, 'Jonah is here.” To whom more is given, more is required. If the men of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 503, 24, 49, 'Nineveh repented at the preaching of an ordinary preacher like Jonah,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 503, 25, 49, 'and here people are listening to Jesus Christ, the Son of God, and they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 503, 26, 49, 'don''t repent, then their crime is greater. He goes on in verse 42,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 503, 27, 49, 'saying, “The Queen of the South -- Queen of Sheba -- will rise up in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 503, 28, 49, 'judgment and condemn this generation because she came all the way all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 504, 1, 49, 'those many kilometers to hear the wisdom of Solomon, and someone greater');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 504, 2, 49, 'than Solomon is here.” So amazing, how even today we find so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 504, 3, 49, 'Christians who ignore the privileges they have right in their own town.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 504, 4, 49, 'Sometimes the gospel is being preached even on their own street, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 504, 5, 49, 'they don''t realize it. There may be a man of God living next door and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 504, 6, 49, 'they don''t realize it. Their judgment will be greater.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 504, 7, 49, 'Don’t Leave a Cleansed Spirit Empty!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 504, 8, 49, 'Lastly, Jesus says that unclean spirits, when they leave a man, are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 504, 9, 49, 'always looking for somebody else to possess. Evil spirits have a longing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 504, 10, 49, 'to possess human beings. They pass through waterless places seeking for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 504, 11, 49, 'someplace to settle down, and they don''t find it. They go back to visit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 504, 12, 49, 'the man from whom the unclean spirit was cast out, and they find that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 504, 13, 49, 'the man has not surrendered his life to Christ and that he has not been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 504, 14, 49, 'filled with the Holy Spirit, so they take along seven other spirits more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 504, 15, 49, 'wicked than themselves and go and live there. This is the way with this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 504, 16, 49, 'evil generation. This is how it happens with many individuals as well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 504, 17, 49, 'When we cast out an evil spirit, if we don''t replace that with something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 504, 18, 49, 'good, we''ll find that we’ll get into worse evil. I come across cases');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 504, 19, 49, 'like that of demons that are cast out of somebody who did not seek to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 504, 20, 49, 'surrender their life to Christ afterwards, and to be filled with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 504, 21, 49, 'Holy Spirit. The demons possess them all over again, sometimes, in worse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 504, 22, 49, 'ways. This is not only a warning about demon possession. For example, if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 504, 23, 49, 'we get rid of the habit of grumbling, we must replace it with a habit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 504, 24, 49, 'thanksgiving, and then that grumbling attitude won''t come back. But if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 504, 25, 49, 'you just try to get rid of grumbling and don''t replace it, but instead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 504, 26, 49, 'remain empty, you’ll find grumbling comes right back. This is something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 504, 27, 49, 'that happens in the realm in the world of the spirits, which Jesus knew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 504, 28, 49, 'better than any of us. I don''t try to understand it or argue with One');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 505, 1, 49, 'Who knows everything about this realm of spirits, but it is a warning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 505, 2, 49, 'that comes to us, that when we cast out something evil, we must replace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 505, 3, 49, 'it with something good.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 505, 4, 49, 'Those Who Have Known the Way of Righteousness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 505, 5, 49, 'In 2 Peter 2, Peter speaks about those who have known the way of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 505, 6, 49, 'righteousness. 2 Peter 2:20 says, “If a man, after escaping the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 505, 7, 49, 'defilements of the world by the knowledge of the Lord and Savior Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 505, 8, 49, 'Christ” (something evil has been cast out from his heart), “is again');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 505, 9, 49, 'entangled in them and overcome” (he remains empty, and other worse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 505, 10, 49, 'spirits come and take over, and he is overcome), the last state of that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 505, 11, 49, 'person has become worse than the first.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 505, 12, 49, 'In such a case, Peter says that it would be better if such a man had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 505, 13, 49, 'never known the way of righteousness at all than to have known it and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 505, 14, 49, 'turn from the holy commandment delivered to him. Is that possible for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 505, 15, 49, 'believer? It certainly is, because he''s speaking about someone who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 505, 16, 49, 'escaped the defilements of the world by the knowledge of the Lord and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 505, 17, 49, 'Savior Jesus Christ. He was born again, and then was entangled in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 505, 18, 49, 'same sin and was overcome. His last state is much worse than his first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 505, 19, 49, 'because he knew the truth. It would have been far better if such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 505, 20, 49, 'person had never known the way of righteousness at all, than having');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 505, 21, 49, 'known it, to turn from the holy commandment delivered to him. This shows');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 505, 22, 49, 'us what an awesome responsibility it is to know the truth. It''s a very,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 505, 23, 49, 'very serious thing to know the truth and to turn from it. If you didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 505, 24, 49, 'know the truth at least you could be forgiven. But in this case, “It has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 505, 25, 49, 'happened to them according to the true proverb, ‘a dog returns to its');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 505, 26, 49, 'own vomit’” (1 Peter 2:22). If you found something wrong in your life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 505, 27, 49, 'and you threw it out, and then you go back to it again, that is like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 505, 28, 49, 'dog returning to what it has vomited, or a pig that goes back to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 506, 1, 49, 'wallowing in the mire after it has washed. These are strong words that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 506, 2, 49, 'Peter uses to warn believers who play the fool with sin after they have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 506, 3, 49, 'come to know the Lord. He says in that case it would have been better if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 506, 4, 49, 'you don''t know the Lord at all. He connects it by quoting the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 506, 5, 49, 'expression from Matthew 12:45, “the last state of that man is worse than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 506, 6, 49, 'the first.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 506, 7, 50, 'Chapter 49 Holding Faithfully to the Truth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 506, 8, 50, 'Jesus’ True Family');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 506, 9, 50, '“While Jesus was still speaking,” we read in Matthew 12:46, “Jesus’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 506, 10, 50, 'mother Mary and brothers were standing outside seeking to speak to Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 506, 11, 50, 'Someone said to Him, ‘Behold, Your mother and Your brothers are standing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 506, 12, 50, 'outside seeking to speak to You.’ But Jesus answered, ‘Who is My mother');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 506, 13, 50, 'and who are My brothers?’” It''s amazing that Jesus could speak like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 506, 14, 50, 'this! If a Christian spoke like this today, someone would tell him to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 506, 15, 50, 'more Christlike. This is how Christ Himself spoke, “‘Who is My mother,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 506, 16, 50, 'and who are My brothers?’ And stretching out His hand towards His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 506, 17, 50, 'disciples, He said, ‘Here are My mother and My brothers! Because he who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 506, 18, 50, 'does the will of My Father in Heaven, he is My brother and sister and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 506, 19, 50, 'mother.’”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 506, 20, 50, 'Jesus was saying that the spiritual relationship He had with those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 506, 21, 50, 'are seeking to do the will of God was closer than a physical earthly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 506, 22, 50, 'relationship. This is one of the marks that a person has really become a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 506, 23, 50, 'child of God. It is good thing for you to check yourself on. Can you say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 506, 24, 50, 'that your spiritual relationship with God''s children after you are born');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 506, 25, 50, 'again is stronger than the relationship you have with your blood');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 506, 26, 50, 'brothers and sisters? If not, you may be born again, but your birth is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 506, 27, 50, 'very poor birth. It may be a premature birth, and there is something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 506, 28, 50, 'lacking in it. If you think that wholehearted disciples are not as close');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 507, 1, 50, 'as to you as your own blood brothers and sisters, you need to seriously');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 507, 2, 50, 'question your salvation, because Jesus said that those who hear the Word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 507, 3, 50, 'of God and who do the will of His Father are His brothers and sisters.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 507, 4, 50, 'These are strong words, and Jesus said that if you want to be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 507, 5, 50, 'disciple, you have to love Him more than your father and mother and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 507, 6, 50, 'brothers and sisters, more than all your earthly relationships. Many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 507, 7, 50, 'Christians do not grow as much and as quickly as they should because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 507, 8, 50, 'their earthly relationships continue to mean much more to them than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 507, 9, 50, 'their spiritual relationship with brothers and sisters. One may find it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 507, 10, 50, 'difficult to say this because there are so many hypocrites among');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 507, 11, 50, 'professing believers; I''m not talking about your relationship with such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 507, 12, 50, 'people. But don''t you know at least a few wholehearted radical disciples');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 507, 13, 50, 'of Jesus? What is your relationship with them?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 507, 14, 50, 'If you say there''s nobody like that in your church, then you shouldn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 507, 15, 50, 'be in that church. Find a church where there are at least a few');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 507, 16, 50, 'wholehearted, radical disciples. You will never find a church where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 507, 17, 50, 'everybody''s a wholehearted, radical disciple. Even Jesus’s Church of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 507, 18, 50, 'twelve had a crook in it. That is an 8% rate of hypocrites in a good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 507, 19, 50, 'church. You will never find a perfect church, but if you find a church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 507, 20, 50, 'where there are number of radical wholehearted disciples, that is where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 507, 21, 50, 'you should seek fellowship, because those relationships should be more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 507, 22, 50, 'important to you than any earthly relationship.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 507, 23, 50, 'A Word About Coming to Jesus Through Mary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 507, 24, 50, 'Regarding the claim that the way to approach Jesus is through His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 507, 25, 50, 'mother, Mary, you see that even while He was on earth, there are two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 507, 26, 50, 'occasions where His mother explicitly tried to approach Him: one was at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 507, 27, 50, 'the marriage of Cana, and Jesus turned around and said to her “woman');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 507, 28, 50, 'what have I to do with you? My hour has not yet come” (John 2:4), and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 508, 1, 50, 'the second is here, in Matthew 12, where His mother just wanted to talk');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 508, 2, 50, 'to Him and He rejected her request, saying that His mother and brothers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 508, 3, 50, 'are those who hear the Word of God and do it. So it''s not a good plan to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 508, 4, 50, 'try and approach Jesus through Mary. It is clear in Scripture for those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 508, 5, 50, 'who have eyes to see.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 508, 6, 50, 'Parable of the Sower/Soils');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 508, 7, 50, 'In Matthew 13, we have a number of parables that Jesus spoke to explain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 508, 8, 50, 'different aspects of God''s kingdom. Jesus explained one or two of those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 508, 9, 50, 'parables, and the others He left unexplained, leaving it to us to seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 508, 10, 50, 'the wisdom of the Holy Spirit to understand them and apply them to our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 508, 11, 50, 'lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 508, 12, 50, 'The first is the parable of the sower and the seed. “A sower went out to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 508, 13, 50, 'sow. As He sowed seeds, some seeds fell on the road and the birds came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 508, 14, 50, 'and ate it up, that is one type of bad ground. Others fell on the rocky');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 508, 15, 50, 'places where there was not much depth of earth, and they sprang up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 508, 16, 50, 'quickly because there was not much depth and withered away when the sun');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 508, 17, 50, 'rose. The third seed was sown among thorns where there was depth of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 508, 18, 50, 'earth, but as it came up the thorns came and choked it” (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 508, 19, 50, '13:3-7). There were three bad grounds, and then He describes three good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 508, 20, 50, 'grounds.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 508, 21, 50, 'Some people think there was only one good ground, but there were three.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 508, 22, 50, 'One that produced a hundredfold crop (where one seed produced a hundred');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 508, 23, 50, 'seeds), another ground where one seed produced 60 seeds, and another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 508, 24, 50, 'ground one seed produced 30 seeds. They are not all the same quality.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 508, 25, 50, 'They were all good, but there were different degrees of goodness, just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 508, 26, 50, 'like the bad soil, where there were different degrees of badness. Then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 508, 27, 50, 'Jesus said, “He who has ears to hear, let him hear.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 508, 28, 50, 'Explaining the Parable of the Sower');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 509, 1, 50, 'Mind the Birds!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 509, 2, 50, 'Then Jesus began to explain the parable of the Sower. He says the first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 509, 3, 50, 'type of ground is one who listens to God''s Word very casually. He is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 509, 4, 50, 'serious. People come and sit in a meeting, and their mind is not on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 509, 5, 50, 'what''s being proclaimed there; their mind is wandering. Demons are there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 509, 6, 50, 'in every meeting to take away what we hear, that''s what Jesus says here,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 509, 7, 50, '‘the evil one comes and snatches away what is been sown in the heart’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 509, 8, 50, '(verse 19). When there is a preacher preaching something, and the Word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 509, 9, 50, 'of God is going in to your heart, the devil comes to snatch it away.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 509, 10, 50, 'This is pictured as the birds of the air coming and eating up the seed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 509, 11, 50, 'that is sown on the roadside. Some hearts are like that: they go into a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 509, 12, 50, 'meeting and hardly get anything out of it. Even if they do, before any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 509, 13, 50, 'of that seed can produce any fruit in their life, the devil has taken it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 509, 14, 50, 'away. This is the first type of heart. We need to be very careful that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 509, 15, 50, 'our heart is not like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 509, 16, 50, 'Remember, the same seed is sown in all the six types of ground, and yet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 509, 17, 50, 'the results are entirely different. It depends on the response from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 509, 18, 50, 'hearer. If the hearer is sluggish in his response to God''s Word, then of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 509, 19, 50, 'course there is not going to be any fruit; neither will there be if he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 509, 20, 50, 'allows the devil to take the Word away. If you look back at all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 509, 21, 50, 'messages you’ve heard in the past, you have to acknowledge that there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 509, 22, 50, 'are some wonderful messages which you have heard, where you took');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 509, 23, 50, 'decisions, and said, “Lord, I want to wholeheartedly respond to that and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 509, 24, 50, 'live for You,” but then, a few weeks or months later, the effect of that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 509, 25, 50, 'message is gone from your life. The birds of the air have come and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 509, 26, 50, 'succeeded in taking away the seed. Remember that the birds of the air');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 509, 27, 50, 'are there in every single meeting. Every single meeting we ever go to,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 509, 28, 50, 'the demons are there to try and take away that Word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 510, 1, 50, 'Beware of Superficial Exuberance with No Depth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 510, 2, 50, 'The second type of ground is pictured in the seed that fell on rocky');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 510, 3, 50, 'places – “It immediately springs up.” There is a great excitement. Such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 510, 4, 50, 'people say, “Hallelujah! Praise the Lord! This is a great message,” etc.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 510, 5, 50, 'Some people’s temperament is like that. They quickly express their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 510, 6, 50, 'appreciation, and are very excited about what they have heard. But a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 510, 7, 50, 'little while later, when some persecution arises, they don''t have roots.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 510, 8, 50, 'Beneath the surface, they are very shallow. There is a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 510, 9, 50, 'superficial exuberance and apparent interest in God''s Word, but the Word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 510, 10, 50, 'of God does not go deep into their heart. Because they don''t have a firm');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 510, 11, 50, 'root, when the sun rises (persecution), they wither and fall away. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 510, 12, 50, 'teaches us that if we allow God''s Word to take deep root in our hearts,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 510, 13, 50, 'then when persecution comes, we will not fall away. We don''t have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 510, 14, 50, 'worry about it. That''s why the time to prepare for persecution of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 510, 15, 50, 'Christians is now, when there is no persecution. In times of peace we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 510, 16, 50, 'must prepare for war.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 510, 17, 50, 'Beware of Riches Choking out the Word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 510, 18, 50, 'The third type of ground is the one on whom seed was sown, and it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 510, 19, 50, 'responds. He’s got depth of earth. He is serious, not like shooting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 510, 20, 50, 'stars that suddenly appear in the sky for a while, and are very bright,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 510, 21, 50, 'but then disappear. I have seen many believers like that, who come to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 510, 22, 50, 'our meetings and are apparently so gripped in the beginning, but in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 510, 23, 50, 'little while, they are no longer there. They are like a shooting star');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 510, 24, 50, 'that crossed the sky and then is gone, and destroyed. We do not have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 510, 25, 50, 'be like that. This third soil was not like that. He heard the word,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 510, 26, 50, 'appreciated it, listened to it, and allowed the word to sink deep and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 510, 27, 50, 'come up well. Maybe he was converted when he was very young, when he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 510, 28, 50, 'didn’t earn money. He was gripped by the truth and allowed it to sink');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 511, 1, 50, 'in, and he would meditate on God''s Word. Everything was going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 511, 2, 50, 'wonderfully - this plant was coming up and growing well. But then he got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 511, 3, 50, 'a job with a really good salary, and that becomes like a thorn that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 511, 4, 50, 'chokes the fruit that was coming up, because now he feels that he has to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 511, 5, 50, 'spend so many extra hours at work. He spends that extra time there so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 511, 6, 50, 'that he can advance in his profession. He decided he has to give more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 511, 7, 50, 'time to his profession, and gradually the deceitfulness of riches, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 511, 8, 50, 'lust for other things, and the worries of the world came into him and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 511, 9, 50, 'choked this wonderful fruit. I have also seen wonderful young believers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 511, 10, 50, 'who are wholehearted and radical, but then the love of money grips them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 511, 11, 50, 'or all types of worries from the world, and desire for many other things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 511, 12, 50, 'chokes the Word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 511, 13, 50, 'Faithfulness Determines Good Soil’s Fruitfulness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 511, 14, 50, 'The last soil Jesus refers to is the good soil. There are three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 511, 15, 50, 'different types of good soil. These hear the Word, understand it, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 511, 16, 50, 'bear fruit. They are careful of the thorns that try to choke them, too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 511, 17, 50, 'Every Christian faces the danger of being choked by the thorns of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 511, 18, 50, 'riches, worries and cares of this world, and the desire for many things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 511, 19, 50, 'contrary to God''s Word. These things are constantly trying to choke the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 511, 20, 50, 'Word. How is it the devil didn''t succeed with these people? Because they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 511, 21, 50, 'watched over the Word and prevented him from crushing the seed. Why did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 511, 22, 50, 'some produce a hundredfold, some sixtyfold and some thirtyfold? Some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 511, 23, 50, 'were faithful, but then occasionally careless; some were faithful, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 511, 24, 50, 'not so careless; and some were utterly faithful. Thus even among');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 511, 25, 50, 'believers, there are different degrees of faithfulness. God is looking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 511, 26, 50, 'for those who will be steadfast in continuing to be faithful in keeping');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 511, 27, 50, 'His Word, watering it, preserving it, meditating on it, and allowing it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 511, 28, 50, 'to grow up to be a strong tree for the glory of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 512, 1, 50, 'The Purpose of Parables');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 512, 2, 50, 'The disciples also asked Jesus why He spoke to the people in parables.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 512, 3, 50, 'Some Christians think Jesus spoke in parables so that people would able');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 512, 4, 50, 'to understand spiritual truth, but that''s not true. Jesus said, “To you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 512, 5, 50, 'it is being granted to know the mysteries of the kingdom of heaven, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 512, 6, 50, 'to them it is not been granted” (Matthew 13:11). There are many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 512, 7, 50, 'mysteries in God''s kingdom. A mystery is something only God can reveal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 512, 8, 50, 'to you by the Holy Spirit. If it is not revealed to you, you can never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 512, 9, 50, 'understand it. You can go completely wrong if you try to understand it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 512, 10, 50, 'without God''s help, without the help of the Holy Spirit. Much of the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 512, 11, 50, 'Testament is like that. You cannot understand it without the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 512, 12, 50, 'explaining it to you. When people go to the New Testament, or even other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 512, 13, 50, 'parts of Scripture, with their human reason, and find inconsistencies,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 512, 14, 50, 'they begin to doubt God''s Word. God allows them to be deceived, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 512, 15, 50, 'fundamentally, they don''t love the truth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 512, 16, 50, 'But the mysteries of the kingdom were revealed to the disciples. Was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 512, 17, 50, 'that because they were the cleverest people of all? Not at all! They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 512, 18, 50, 'were following Jesus Christ. They loved Christ more than their parents,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 512, 19, 50, 'brothers, sisters and even their own jobs and themselves. Therefore the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 512, 20, 50, 'Lord gave revelation to them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 512, 21, 50, 'Jesus Explains Why He Speaks in Parables');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 512, 22, 50, 'Jesus goes on to say, “Because seeing they do not see, and hearing they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 512, 23, 50, 'do not hear, and they do not understand” (Matthew 13:13). It’s as if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 512, 24, 50, 'Jesus speaks in parables so that the people don''t understand what He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 512, 25, 50, 'says. This is the very opposite of what we think. This is not like in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 512, 26, 50, 'illustration in a message to clarify something. Jesus said that a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 512, 27, 50, 'parable is to actually confuse people! “And in their case the prophecy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 512, 28, 50, 'of Isaiah is being fulfilled which says, ‘You will keep on hearing but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 513, 1, 50, 'you will not understand; you will keep on seeing but you will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 513, 2, 50, 'perceive; for the heart of these people has become dull, with their ears');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 513, 3, 50, 'they scarcely hear, and they have closed their eyes, otherwise they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 513, 4, 50, 'would see with their eyes, hear with their ears, and understand with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 513, 5, 50, 'their heart and return (that is, turn from their sin), and I would heal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 513, 6, 50, 'them” (Matthew 13:14-15, Isaiah 6:9-10). It is because of their wrong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 513, 7, 50, 'attitudes to sin that they''re not able to understand God''s Word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 513, 8, 50, 'Remember that the more radical your attitude toward sin is, the more you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 513, 9, 50, 'will understand the mysteries of the kingdom of heaven. This is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 513, 10, 50, 'secret. But if your heart has become dull, if you don''t listen to your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 513, 11, 50, 'conscience anymore, if you are not really interested in hearing what God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 513, 12, 50, 'is saying, and don''t take time to read the Scriptures, then you will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 513, 13, 50, 'deceived and led astray.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 513, 14, 50, 'Jesus Was Not a Communist');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 513, 15, 50, 'In Matthew 13:12, Jesus says, “Whoever has, to him shall more be given,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 513, 16, 50, 'and he shall have in abundance; but whoever does not have, even what he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 513, 17, 50, 'has shall to be taken away from him.” This is so contrary to spirit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 513, 18, 50, 'communism in the world -- Communists say whoever has, from him we must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 513, 19, 50, 'take away so that we can give to the one who doesn''t have -- and that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 513, 20, 50, 'why I have stated that Jesus was not a communist or a socialist. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 513, 21, 50, 'kingdom of heaven had certain values. It rewards hard work. It doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 513, 22, 50, 'take what a man earned through his hard work and give it to a poor lazy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 513, 23, 50, 'man who didn''t have anything because he was too lazy to work. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 513, 24, 50, 'not what Jesus taught.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 513, 25, 50, 'What did Jesus mean when He said, “To whomever has, to him will more be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 513, 26, 50, 'given”? The meaning is that if you''re faithful with what you have, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 513, 27, 50, 'will give you more. Some people have very little, like the man with one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 513, 28, 50, 'talent who buried it. He was not faithful with the little he had, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 514, 1, 50, 'then one day even that one talent was taken away. When God gives you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 514, 2, 50, 'something, whether it''s time, money, energy, or something that you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 514, 3, 50, 'use for Him, and you don''t use it (or you just use it on yourself or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 514, 4, 50, 'live selfishly), then even that little opportunity you had to serve God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 514, 5, 50, 'will be taken away from you. You will just drift along waste your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 514, 6, 50, 'But one who is faithful, even if just to help one or two people, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 514, 7, 50, 'will begin to expand his boundary, and he will be able to help more and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 514, 8, 50, 'more and people, and will become a very useful servant of God one day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 514, 9, 50, 'Gratitude for Hearing the Truth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 514, 10, 50, 'The Lord said to His disciples, “Blessed are your eyes, because they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 514, 11, 50, 'see; and your ears, because they hear” (Matthew 13:16). Then Jesus says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 514, 12, 50, 'that in ancient times, “many righteous men and prophets desired to see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 514, 13, 50, 'what you''re seeing, and they did not see it, and to hear what you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 514, 14, 50, 'now hearing and did not hear it” (verse 17).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 514, 15, 50, 'I have to say this many times to many people in our churches who hear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 514, 16, 50, 'the most amazing truths. Some of you who are reading this are reading');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 514, 17, 50, 'some of the most amazing truths that can be known, and yet you can take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 514, 18, 50, 'it lightly, as if it is someone’s opinion. Or you can take Scripture');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 514, 19, 50, 'exactly like you''ve been hearing it and say, “Lord I have been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 514, 20, 50, 'tremendously privileged to hear these things.” Even a hundred years ago,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 514, 21, 50, 'our ancestors couldn''t hear these things. For hundreds of years during');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 514, 22, 50, 'the time of Christianity, how many of your ancestors do you think heard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 514, 23, 50, 'the type of things you''re learning through this teaching? We need to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 514, 24, 50, 'deeply thankful that we are able to see these things, and respond in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 514, 25, 50, 'gratitude by saying, “Lord, I want to live for You because of the truth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 514, 26, 50, 'that You have taught me.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 514, 27, 51, 'Chapter 50 Parables Continued');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 514, 28, 51, 'The Parable of the Tares');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 515, 1, 51, 'In Matthew 13:24 Jesus presented a second parable to His disciples. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 515, 2, 51, 'said, “The Kingdom of Heaven can be compared to a man who sowed good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 515, 3, 51, 'seed in his field. But while his men were sleeping, his enemy came and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 515, 4, 51, 'sowed tares also among the wheat, and went away. When the wheat sprang');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 515, 5, 51, 'up and bore grain, the tares became evident also. The slaves of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 515, 6, 51, 'landowner came and said to him, ‘Sir, did you not sow good seed in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 515, 7, 51, 'field? How then does it have tares?’ He said to them, ‘An enemy has done');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 515, 8, 51, 'this!’ The slaves said to him, ‘Do you want us, then, to go and gather');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 515, 9, 51, 'them up?’ But he said, ‘No, lest while you are gathering up the tares,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 515, 10, 51, 'you may root up the wheat with them. Allow both to grow together until');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 515, 11, 51, 'the harvest, and in the time of the harvest I will say to the reapers,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 515, 12, 51, '‘First gather up the tares and bind them in bundles to burn them up, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 515, 13, 51, 'gather the wheat into my barn.’”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 515, 14, 51, 'We need to understand what this is a picture of. The tares are those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 515, 15, 51, 'that look like the wheat. There was a danger that if the workers went');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 515, 16, 51, 'and pulled out the tares, they could accidently pull out some genuine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 515, 17, 51, 'wheat crop as well. In verse 36, Jesus left the multitudes and went into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 515, 18, 51, 'the house, and His disciples came to Him and asked Him to explain the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 515, 19, 51, 'parable of the tares of the field. Jesus answered and said, “The One who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 515, 20, 51, 'sows the good seed is the Son of Man.” Just like in the previous parable');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 515, 21, 51, '(the parable of the sower), Jesus is the One who sows the seed. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 515, 22, 51, 'also says that the field is not the church - this is the most important');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 515, 23, 51, 'thing to understand in this parable.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 515, 24, 51, 'There are many who interpret this saying that the field is the church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 515, 25, 51, 'They haven’t read the explanation Jesus gave. They say in the church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 515, 26, 51, 'there are both tares and wheat, but this is not what Jesus said. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 515, 27, 51, 'read Scripture carelessly, or try to imagine you have a better');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 515, 28, 51, 'interpretation than Christ Himself, you can be sure you are wrong.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 516, 1, 51, 'The field is not the church, it is the world, and the good seed are the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 516, 2, 51, 'sons of the kingdom living in this world. They are very few in number.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 516, 3, 51, 'They are the good wheat, the people who belong to the kingdom of heaven,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 516, 4, 51, 'whose mind is heavenly, whose heart is set on heavenly things because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 516, 5, 51, 'their treasure is in heaven and not on this earth. For a lot of people,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 516, 6, 51, 'their treasure is on this earth, and so their heart is on this earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 516, 7, 51, 'The sons of the kingdom of heaven are those who have their heart set on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 516, 8, 51, 'things above. The tares are the sons of the evil one, the devil. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 516, 9, 51, 'sons of the evil one are the children of the devil. There are children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 516, 10, 51, 'of God, and children of the devil, as John says in 1 John 3:10, “The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 516, 11, 51, 'children of God and the children of the devil are manifest.” And Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 516, 12, 51, 'explains: “The enemy who sowed the tares is the devil, and the harvest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 516, 13, 51, 'is the end of the age and the reapers are angels. Just as the tares are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 516, 14, 51, 'gathered up and burned with fire, so shall it be at the end of the age');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 516, 15, 51, 'that the Son of man will send forth his angels and they will gather out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 516, 16, 51, 'of his kingdom all the stumbling blocks and all those who commit sin and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 516, 17, 51, 'will cast them into the furnace of fire in that place where there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 516, 18, 51, 'weeping and gnashing of teeth. Then the righteous will shine forth as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 516, 19, 51, 'the sun in the kingdom of the Father. He who has ears, let him hear”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 516, 20, 51, '(Matthew 13:39-43).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 516, 21, 51, 'Through this parable, Jesus taught that He allows evil people to grow up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 516, 22, 51, 'side by side with His children in this world (again, this is not talking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 516, 23, 51, 'about the church). When there is an evil person in the church, we know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 516, 24, 51, 'very clearly what the Holy Spirit has said. There was a case like that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 516, 25, 51, 'in the church in Corinth, where a man was living in sexual sin without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 516, 26, 51, 'repentance. When Paul heard about it he said, “I have already judged him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 516, 27, 51, 'in the name of our Lord Jesus and with the power of our Lord Jesus. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 516, 28, 51, 'have decided to deliver such a one to Satan for the destruction of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 517, 1, 51, 'flesh. Put that evil man out of the church” (1 Corinthians 5:4-5). Paul');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 517, 2, 51, 'said that such a person must not be kept inside the church; he must be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 517, 3, 51, 'put out completely.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 517, 4, 51, 'Was Paul contradicting what Jesus said about removing the tares lest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 517, 5, 51, 'they make a mistake of the wheat? No, because the field is not the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 517, 6, 51, 'church! The field is the world, and the meaning is that God doesn''t send');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 517, 7, 51, 'His servants to pull all of the wicked people out of the world, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 517, 8, 51, 'destroy them straight away, leaving only God''s children here on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 517, 9, 51, 'earth. He is giving them time because there are some who are not really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 517, 10, 51, 'wholehearted yet - they are wheat but can look like tares. It is sad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 517, 11, 51, 'that they are like that, but God says He gives them time and opportunity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 517, 12, 51, 'to develop to become wholehearted.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 517, 13, 51, 'God does not bring about His judgment on people now. He waits until the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 517, 14, 51, 'end of the age before He separates the wheat from the tares. But this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 517, 15, 51, 'must not be so in the church. The church must be kept pure at all times.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 517, 16, 51, 'There is a place for putting out people who live in sin and pollute the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 517, 17, 51, 'church. When people don’t do this, the church gets destroyed. A person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 517, 18, 51, 'who claims to be a believer but is living in sin inside the church must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 517, 19, 51, 'be disciplined or be put out of the church completely. Otherwise, a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 517, 20, 51, 'little leaven will leaven the whole lump (1 Corinthians 5:6), or like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 517, 21, 51, 'the English proverb says, one bad apple can spoil all the other apples');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 517, 22, 51, 'in the basket. You must remove it and throw it out. Otherwise it will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 517, 23, 51, 'corrupt everything else.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 517, 24, 51, 'The Parable of the Mustard Seed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 517, 25, 51, 'The next parable is in Matthew 13:31. This is another parable that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 517, 26, 51, 'misunderstood. If we compare it with other passages of Scripture, we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 517, 27, 51, 'find the answer. For example, it says in Matthew 13:31 that the kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 517, 28, 51, 'of heaven is like a mustard seed which is a very small seed - smaller');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 518, 1, 51, 'than all the other seeds. A man takes it and sows it in his field, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 518, 2, 51, 'when it is full grown, it is larger than the garden plants and becomes a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 518, 3, 51, 'tree so that the birds of the air come and nest in its branches. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 518, 4, 51, 'regular mustard tree is not a very big tree. How is this that it has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 518, 5, 51, 'become much larger than all the other trees and the birds of the air can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 518, 6, 51, 'come and make nests in it?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 518, 7, 51, 'I believe that this refers to a mustard seed which has artificially been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 518, 8, 51, 'made to grow. The end result is that you have a huge tree in which the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 518, 9, 51, 'birds of the air come and make its nests. This is not a picture of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 518, 10, 51, 'development of the true church because Jesus never referred to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 518, 11, 51, 'church as something that grows up to be a huge tree. Jesus always said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 518, 12, 51, 'the way to life is narrow and there are few who will find it. Thus the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 518, 13, 51, 'Church would be more like a small plant or a very short tree, not a huge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 518, 14, 51, 'one. The huge tree is referring to the false Church, what the book of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 518, 15, 51, 'Revelation calls Babylon, which is huge in size. How can a so-called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 518, 16, 51, 'Christian Church, which is supposed to be preaching the narrow way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 518, 17, 51, '(which Jesus said very few would find), suddenly have thousands of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 518, 18, 51, 'people in it?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 518, 19, 51, 'The Narrow Way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 518, 20, 51, 'This is happening because the gate has been made broader. When you make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 518, 21, 51, 'the gate broader, many people come in and the tree becomes huge. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 518, 22, 51, 'this Babylonian Church becomes so big in size, the birds of the air come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 518, 23, 51, 'and nest in its branches. What is meant by ‘birds of the air’? We don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 518, 24, 51, 'have to try and reason what they are because Jesus Himself told us about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 518, 25, 51, 'the birds of the air in verse 4. They were the birds that came and ate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 518, 26, 51, 'up the seed. Jesus explained that the birds of the air are the agents of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 518, 27, 51, 'evil. The evil one his demons come and take away the seeds (God’s Word).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 518, 28, 51, 'The same birds of the air are in this parable, they are demons settling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 519, 1, 51, 'inside churches. They have occupied certain areas, and on certain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 519, 2, 51, 'branches they''ve settled down.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 519, 3, 51, 'This has happened in many churches. Demons are very happy there because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 519, 4, 51, 'the narrow way to life is not being preached, in order to please people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 519, 5, 51, 'Seeker-friendly churches preach that which will draw the crowds. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 519, 6, 51, 'compromise in music standards because they want to draw the young');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 519, 7, 51, 'people. The result is that many young people come to the church not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 519, 8, 51, 'because they are interested in holiness, but because they are interested');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 519, 9, 51, 'in good music. A church should not be known for good music. It should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 519, 10, 51, 'not even just be known for good preaching! It must be known for leading');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 519, 11, 51, 'people to holiness. If a church is interested in leading people to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 519, 12, 51, 'holiness, then it is not going to be a very large church, because Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 519, 13, 51, 'Himself said, “The way to life is narrow and few there be that find it”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 519, 14, 51, '(Matthew 13:14).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 519, 15, 51, 'How small is this narrow gate? Jesus spoke of a camel trying to go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 519, 16, 51, 'through a needle’s eye in Mark 10:25. The gate is so narrow that it’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 519, 17, 51, 'like a needle''s eye - that is the size of the gate that leads to eternal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 519, 18, 51, 'life. A camel cannot go through! When the preacher widens the gate so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 519, 19, 51, 'that the camel can go through, then you have thousands of camels in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 519, 20, 51, 'there who are really not God’s children. The camel cannot go through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 519, 21, 51, 'because it is so big! Anyone who is very big in his own eyes - very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 519, 22, 51, 'important in his own eyes - will not be able to get through in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 519, 23, 51, 'narrow gate. There are many Christians who are self-important and think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 519, 24, 51, 'the world of themselves. They are deceiving themselves when they think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 519, 25, 51, 'that they are born again Christians. A true disciple of Jesus can never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 519, 26, 51, 'be big in his own eyes. He will be small in his own eyes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 519, 27, 51, 'Many creatures cannot crawl through this needle-sized gate, either. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 519, 28, 51, 'an amoeba (which you can only see through a microscope) can get through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 520, 1, 51, 'easily! When an amoeba comes near, the needle’s eye looks like a huge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 520, 2, 51, 'door! It’s like a man walking through a fifty-foot door. The camel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 520, 3, 51, 'thinks it too small, but the amoeba can run through it! Hundreds of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 520, 4, 51, 'amoebas can get through it because they are all very small.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 520, 5, 51, 'Thus, when we are small in our own eyes it becomes very easy to go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 520, 6, 51, 'through into God''s kingdom. God gives grace to the humble, but He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 520, 7, 51, 'resists the proud. That''s the thing we learn in Matthew 13:31-32 - the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 520, 8, 51, 'tree has become so huge that the demons can settle in. There are many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 520, 9, 51, 'churches like this, where there is conflict and strife. This is all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 520, 10, 51, 'because discipleship is not preached and because they don’t teach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 520, 11, 51, 'everything that Jesus taught. If you want to build a church that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 520, 12, 51, 'going to please the Lord, where the Lord can say to it, “I am with you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 520, 13, 51, 'always till the end of the age,” then it must be a church that preaches');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 520, 14, 51, 'discipleship and everything that Jesus taught.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 520, 15, 51, 'The Parable of the Leaven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 520, 16, 51, 'In Matthew 13:33, Jesus spoke another parable saying that the kingdom of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 520, 17, 51, 'heaven is like leaven. Jesus is talking about the kingdom of heaven in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 520, 18, 51, 'its outward expression here on the earth, not in its total purity in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 520, 19, 51, 'heaven. In that purity there will not be any tares, like He said in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 520, 20, 51, 'previous parable. There will not be any birds of the air - demons making');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 520, 21, 51, 'a nest there. The kingdom of heaven being referred to is in its outward');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 520, 22, 51, 'expression on the earth, where there is bad ground and there are tares -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 520, 23, 51, 'demons making nests there. It is the outward expression of what we call');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 520, 24, 51, 'the church, and a lot of it is Babylonian.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 520, 25, 51, 'Jesus said, “The kingdom of heaven is like leaven.” Throughout the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 520, 26, 51, 'Testament leaven is a symbol of something that is bad. In the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 520, 27, 51, 'Testament the Israelites were told that on Passover day they must make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 520, 28, 51, 'sure there''s no leaven anywhere in the house. I have seen pictures of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 521, 1, 51, 'Jewish people lighting a lamp and looking underneath the bed here and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 521, 2, 51, 'there just in case some leavened bread was thrown around by the children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 521, 3, 51, 'somewhere. That''s how careful they were to remove leaven from their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 521, 4, 51, 'houses on the Passover day - on the Feast of the Unleavened Bread.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 521, 5, 51, 'Christians need to be just as careful to remove leaven from their lives,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 521, 6, 51, 'their homes, and their church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 521, 7, 51, 'Jesus further describes it as leaven that a woman took and hid. Whenever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 521, 8, 51, 'you have to hide something, you know there is something wrong. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 521, 9, 51, 'woman hid it in in three pecks of meal until the whole thing was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 521, 10, 51, 'leavened. This could refer to Jesus prophetically looking towards the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 521, 11, 51, 'future to different aspects of Christianity. We don’t know exactly what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 521, 12, 51, 'is meant by the 3 measures of meal, but broadly speaking in the world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 521, 13, 51, 'there are three major streams of Christianity - Roman Catholic,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 521, 14, 51, 'Protestant, and the Pentecostal - and leaven has spread into all three.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 521, 15, 51, 'Each group thinks the leaven is in the other denomination, but it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 521, 16, 51, 'actually in all three. Jesus said it would be, therefore we have to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 521, 17, 51, 'very careful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 521, 18, 51, '1 Corinthians 5 explains this clearly: “Your boasting is not good. Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 521, 19, 51, 'you not know that a little leaven leavens the whole lump of dough? Clean');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 521, 20, 51, 'out the old leaven so that you may be a new lump, just as you are in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 521, 21, 51, 'fact unleavened. For Christ our Passover also has been sacrificed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 521, 22, 51, 'Therefore let us celebrate the feast, not with old leaven, nor with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 521, 23, 51, 'leaven of malice and wickedness, but with the unleavened bread of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 521, 24, 51, 'sincerity and truth” (1 Corinthians 5:6-8). This is speaking of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 521, 25, 51, 'leaven of wickedness and malice, hatred, strife, bitterness in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 521, 26, 51, 'church. The devil introduces these things: wickedness, malice, hatred,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 521, 27, 51, 'strife, bitterness and competition, and the end result is that all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 521, 28, 51, 'things are leavened. But unleavened bread is total sincerity and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 522, 1, 51, 'truthfulness. The solution to this is to make sure that sin is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 522, 2, 51, 'constantly judged. This is the way to preserve a church in purity and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 522, 3, 51, 'prevent the whole measure from being leavened.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 522, 4, 51, '“All these things Jesus spoke to the multitudes in parables and He did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 522, 5, 51, 'not speak to them without a parable. This was to fulfill what was spoken');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 522, 6, 51, 'through the prophet ‘I will open My mouth in parables; I will utter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 522, 7, 51, 'things hidden since the foundation of the world’” (Matthew 13:34-35).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 522, 8, 51, 'The Parable of the Hidden Treasure and the Pearl of Great Price');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 522, 9, 51, 'The next parable is of hidden treasure in Matthew 13:44.”The kingdom of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 522, 10, 51, 'heaven is like a treasure, hidden in the field, which a man found and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 522, 11, 51, 'hid; and from joy over it he goes and sells all that he has, and buys');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 522, 12, 51, 'that field.” One of the things this teaches is that you have to pay a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 522, 13, 51, 'price. There are many things in the Christian life that are free - like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 522, 14, 51, 'forgiveness of sins and the gift of the Holy Spirit. In this parable,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 522, 15, 51, 'Jesus speaks of something you have to buy - something for which you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 522, 16, 51, 'to sell everything in order to buy. To be a wholehearted disciple of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 522, 17, 51, 'Jesus, there are certain things we have to give up. This is the price we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 522, 18, 51, 'pay. Sometimes we have to give up even legitimate things. Paul once said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 522, 19, 51, 'that if I have given up sin in my life, there are many things I can do,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 522, 20, 51, 'but I don''t do all of them. From all the lawful things I can do, I pick');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 522, 21, 51, 'out the things that are profitable and I do only what is profitable. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 522, 22, 51, 'wholehearted Christian is like that (1 Corinthians 6:12). Paul speaks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 522, 23, 51, 'there about picking out only the profitable things from what is lawful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 522, 24, 51, 'so that he can find fulfillment in his Christian life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 522, 25, 51, 'Jesus says, “The kingdom of heaven is like a treasure hidden in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 522, 26, 51, 'field.” Note that the treasure is hidden; it is not obvious. What you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 522, 27, 51, 'see on the surface is superficial. There is treasure hidden in Scripture');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 522, 28, 51, 'by God. Once you discover what a treasure there is in Christ and in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 523, 1, 51, 'God''s kingdom you would be willing to give up everything you have to get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 523, 2, 51, 'it. Why is it you find so many half-hearted Christians who are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 523, 3, 51, 'willing to give up some sin or habit that may be legitimate but is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 523, 4, 51, 'helpful for spiritual growth? Why do they always ask questions about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 523, 5, 51, 'what they can and cannot do? Asking in such a way is like asking how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 523, 6, 51, 'close they can get to the edge of the cliff before falling over! It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 523, 7, 51, 'all because people haven''t seen this treasure that is hidden. If only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 523, 8, 51, 'they saw it, they would be glad to sell everything to get it. Suppose a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 523, 9, 51, 'property developer discovers that in one piece of land there is a hoard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 523, 10, 51, 'of gold hidden underground, which nobody knows about. He would be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 523, 11, 51, 'willing to pay any price to get that land because when he gets the land');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 523, 12, 51, 'he gets all that gold hidden under the ground!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 523, 13, 51, 'The man who has discovered something that no one else has discovered is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 523, 14, 51, 'willing to pay any price to get it. He is willing to sell all his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 523, 15, 51, 'property to get it. Jesus spoke about buying something from Him in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 523, 16, 51, 'Revelation 3. There was a backslidden church that was dead and wretched');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 523, 17, 51, 'and miserable in Laodicea. The Lord told that church, “I advise you to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 523, 18, 51, 'buy from me gold and white garments, eye salve, etc” (Revelation 3:18).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 523, 19, 51, 'Thus there are certain things that have to be bought if we are to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 523, 20, 51, 'possess God''s kingdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 523, 21, 51, 'The same principle is repeated a second time in Matthew 13:45-46. “The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 523, 22, 51, 'kingdom of heavens is like a merchant seeking very fine pearls - and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 523, 23, 51, 'then he found a pearl of great price.” The pearl is a picture of Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 523, 24, 51, 'Himself. The merchant has found Jesus Christ, and has seen Him to be so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 523, 25, 51, 'valuable that he is willing to sell all that he has in order to gain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 523, 26, 51, 'Him. In other words, nothing is more important to him than Christ. It’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 523, 27, 51, 'like the Psalmist says in Psalm in 73:25, “Whom have I in Heaven but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 523, 28, 51, 'Thee? And there is nothing on earth I desire besides Thee.” Many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 524, 1, 51, 'Christians haven''t seen the value of Christ like that. That''s why they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 524, 2, 51, 'are always saying, “Lord, how much do I have to give up? Do I have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 524, 3, 51, 'give up this, do I have to give up that?” Many young people don’t think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 524, 4, 51, 'the pearl is worth so much. They put a low value on Christ, and so they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 524, 5, 51, 'are not willing to give up many things. They miss the greatest treasure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 524, 6, 51, 'of all. One day when we stand before the Lord we will discover what a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 524, 7, 51, 'tremendous loss was ours because we did not see the value of Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 524, 8, 51, 'This is why it is so important for us to see the value of Christ right');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 524, 9, 51, 'now.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 524, 10, 51, 'The Parable of the Dragnet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 524, 11, 51, 'The last parable Jesus spoke about was the dragnet - the final day when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 524, 12, 51, 'the Lord will bring everything in and separate the good fish from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 524, 13, 51, 'bad fish, and those who are bad will be cast into the lake of fire. Then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 524, 14, 51, 'Jesus asks them if they have understood all these things, and they said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 524, 15, 51, 'yes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 524, 16, 51, 'Lastly, He said in conclusion that once you have understood these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 524, 17, 51, 'things, you must become a disciple. The scribe must become a disciple.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 524, 18, 51, 'He must become a disciple, not just understanding Scripture but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 524, 19, 51, 'practicing it. Thus these parables are meant for practice, and once we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 524, 20, 51, 'have practiced, from our understanding we can bring out treasures, both');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 524, 21, 51, 'new and old (verse 52).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 524, 22, 52, 'Chapter 51 A New Covenant Servant of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 524, 23, 52, 'At the end of the parables, Jesus asks His disciples, “Have you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 524, 24, 52, 'understood all of these things?” (Matthew 13:51). It is quite amazing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 524, 25, 52, 'that they said that they had understood all of His parables. Then Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 524, 26, 52, 'said that the scribe must become a disciple (Matthew 13:52). What Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 524, 27, 52, 'meant was that a scribe is one who understands everything: he has used');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 524, 28, 52, 'his mind to grasp the intellectual part of the Scriptures. But the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 525, 1, 52, 'scribe must become a disciple; that means he has to obey what he has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 525, 2, 52, 'understood. Though the disciples said they understood, Jesus said that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 525, 3, 52, 'they must practice what they understood. You have to apply the truth of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 525, 4, 52, 'these parables to your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 525, 5, 52, 'Scribes May Understand the Parables, but Disciples Apply Them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 525, 6, 52, 'For example, if you say you have understood the parable of the treasure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 525, 7, 52, 'in the field, how do you apply it? You must be willing to give up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 525, 8, 52, 'everything because you recognize that Jesus Christ Himself is that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 525, 9, 52, 'hidden treasure. The same goes for the parable of the pearl. If we see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 525, 10, 52, 'Christ as a pearl of great price, we will be willing to give up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 525, 11, 52, 'everything on earth in order to have Him. We will say like the Psalmist,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 525, 12, 52, '“Whom I have in heaven but Thee, and on earth, there is nothing that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 525, 13, 52, 'desire beside Thee” (Psalm 73:25). The mark of a true disciple is that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 525, 14, 52, 'he can sincerely say this to the Lord from his heart. We can understand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 525, 15, 52, 'the parable of the soils in our minds, but we have to make sure that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 525, 16, 52, 'thorns like the deceitfulness of riches and the anxieties of worldly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 525, 17, 52, 'things don''t grow up to choke our Christian life. Then we become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 525, 18, 52, 'disciples. Otherwise we can preach wonderful messages on these parables,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 525, 19, 52, 'but we''re just scribes. That is why after ending this section on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 525, 20, 52, 'parables, Jesus said, “the scribe must become a disciple.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 525, 21, 52, 'Jesus taught that it is not enough to be a scribe. You have to be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 525, 22, 52, 'disciple. Once you are a disciple, then you have treasure, which is what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 525, 23, 52, 'we experience from putting these teachings to practice in daily life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 525, 24, 52, 'through trial and temptation, and overcoming. Then we have a treasure,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 525, 25, 52, 'and from that treasure we can bring forth and make other people rich');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 525, 26, 52, 'with what we have practiced and understood. “New and old” (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 525, 27, 52, '13:52) means we have experiences from past years, but we must also be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 525, 28, 52, 'continually having new experiences with the Lord. If you only have old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 526, 1, 52, 'experiences with the Lord, you''re probably a backslider. A person who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 526, 2, 52, 'walking with God does not only have experiences with the Lord to talk');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 526, 3, 52, 'about from last year or year before that; he must be having current');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 526, 4, 52, 'experiences (not necessarily every day but something recent) of what the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 526, 5, 52, 'Lord has spoken to him and done to him and for him; these are his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 526, 6, 52, '“treasures new and old.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 526, 7, 52, 'Needed: New Covenant Disciples Who Minister God’s Strength');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 526, 8, 52, 'Remember that in the New Covenant, ministry does not come by study, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 526, 9, 52, 'even by waiting on the Lord and hearing His voice - that is Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 526, 10, 52, 'Covenant. In the Old Covenant, ministry was by hearing God speak through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 526, 11, 52, 'the prophets. Moses would go up to the mountain, and then come down and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 526, 12, 52, 'tell people what the Lord had said. In the New Covenant, ministry comes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 526, 13, 52, 'through the trials God takes us through. Paul says in 2 Corinthians 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 526, 14, 52, 'that God allows us to go through all types of afflictions so that He can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 526, 15, 52, 'strengthen us. In 2 Corinthians 1:4, the word “comfort” means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 526, 16, 52, '“strengthens” and “encourages”. The word “fort” is within the word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 526, 17, 52, 'comfort, meaning a fort of strength. “God strengthens us in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 526, 18, 52, 'affliction so that we may be able to strengthen those who are in an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 526, 19, 52, 'affliction themselves with the same strength that we received when God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 526, 20, 52, 'strengthened us.” The word “comfort” or “strength” comes in that verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 526, 21, 52, 'four times. The strength we receive in the trials we go through is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 526, 22, 52, 'basis of our ministry to other people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 526, 23, 52, 'People don''t need an intellectual knowledge of God. They need to know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 526, 24, 52, 'how to overcome in their trials, and that can only come through what we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 526, 25, 52, 'have experienced. That is why Jesus Christ Himself had to go through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 526, 26, 52, 'every temptation that any man can ever go through. He was tempted in all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 526, 27, 52, 'points as we are (Hebrews 4:15). That is how He can run to the aid of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 526, 28, 52, 'those who are tempted today (Hebrews 2:18). If we are to run to the aid');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 527, 1, 52, 'of the people who are in trial and temptation today, we must be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 527, 2, 52, 'mini-forerunners for others. We must be able to say to others, “Follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 527, 3, 52, 'me as I follow Christ.” Paul could say that, and from his trials, Paul');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 527, 4, 52, 'the scribe became Paul the disciple.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 527, 5, 52, 'The great danger of many preachers today is that they are scribes and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 527, 6, 52, 'not disciples. They have lot of head knowledge and can beautifully');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 527, 7, 52, 'arrange a sermon, but they have very little to speak about from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 527, 8, 52, 'practical experience of the Lord, how He took them through triumphantly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 527, 9, 52, 'in different situations, helped them to overcome sins, or help them to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 527, 10, 52, 'come to a glorious family life, etc. If we don''t have such a message, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 527, 11, 52, 'are still scribes, and that is why the church suffers so much today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 527, 12, 52, 'There are too many scribes, or like Paul says in 1 Corinthians 4:15,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 527, 13, 52, '“You have 10,000 teachers but only one father.” What the church needs is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 527, 14, 52, 'fathers and disciples who can bring forth out from their treasure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 527, 15, 52, 'experiences from the past, as well as current experiences of what the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 527, 16, 52, 'Lord is teaching them right now.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 527, 17, 52, 'Jesus’ Ministry Overflowed from His Life with God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 527, 18, 52, 'Matthew 13:53 says, “When He finished these parables, He departed from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 527, 19, 52, 'there. He came to His hometown and He began teaching them in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 527, 20, 52, 'synagogues.” Jesus was constantly teaching. He was never tired of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 527, 21, 52, 'teaching because He knew that people needed to hear. He had gone through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 527, 22, 52, 'thirty years of walking with the Father in Nazareth, and was rich in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 527, 23, 52, 'practical experience of walking with God as a man. He had to come as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 527, 24, 52, 'man, and go through many trying experiences, and only then could He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 527, 25, 52, 'teach. He didn''t rush out and teach as soon as He knew the Bible. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 527, 26, 52, 'knew the Bible when He was 12 years old, but then He would have only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 527, 27, 52, 'been a scribe. To be a disciple of the Father, Jesus had to go through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 527, 28, 52, 'another eighteen years in Nazareth, practicing everything that He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 528, 1, 52, 'studied. Then God sent Him out. Today, we have many people who think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 528, 2, 52, 'that they are ready to teach others after three years in a Bible School.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 528, 3, 52, 'Like Jesus, we have to go through experiences in life in order to lead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 528, 4, 52, 'other people to a Godly life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 528, 5, 52, 'Those Who Will Despise Prophets');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 528, 6, 52, 'Matthew 13:54 says, “And when He came there, the people in His hometown');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 528, 7, 52, 'were astonished and said, ‘Where did this man get this wisdom and these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 528, 8, 52, 'miraculous powers?’ The people only knew Jesus as a poor carpenter''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 528, 9, 52, 'son. Carpenters were not considered high up in the society. Jesus’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 528, 10, 52, 'family were not scholars or rich people, so Jesus was just a poor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 528, 11, 52, 'carpenter''s Son from a town called Nazareth, which is a despised town.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 528, 12, 52, 'We read that Jesus had at least four brothers and was therefore a member');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 528, 13, 52, 'of a family with at least seven children. When they asked, “Where did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 528, 14, 52, 'this man get all these things?” and took offense at Him, Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 528, 15, 52, 'responded, “A prophet is not without honor except in his hometown and in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 528, 16, 52, 'his own family” (Matthew 13:57). This has been true through two thousand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 528, 17, 52, 'years. People who have seen a prophet (in his hometown or in his family)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 528, 18, 52, 'grow up from a little child always think of him as the little child they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 528, 19, 52, 'knew; but God may have raised him to be a prophet. Family members');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 528, 20, 52, 'usually despise a true prophet of God. In the town in which the prophet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 528, 21, 52, 'grew up, they have seen him from childhood as a little school boy, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 528, 22, 52, 'they despise him. Other towns that have seen him as a grown man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 528, 23, 52, 'recognize that he is a prophet straightaway, and tend to respect him;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 528, 24, 52, 'and this was true in Jesus’ time as well. Everybody in Nazareth had seen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 528, 25, 52, 'Jesus as a little boy. His family members and relatives had also seen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 528, 26, 52, 'Him as a little boy, and so they did not respect Him as a great prophet.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 528, 27, 52, 'It is the same today. Many people despise a true prophet of God within');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 528, 28, 52, 'his family and in his hometown. If you are a true servant of God and God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 529, 1, 52, 'has given you a prophetic ministry, you shouldn’t be surprised if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 529, 2, 52, 'are not valued in your home town. As the English proverb says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 529, 3, 52, '“familiarity breeds contempt.” We don''t necessarily get respect in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 529, 4, 52, 'hometown and from our own family members. That is just following in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 529, 5, 52, 'footsteps of Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 529, 6, 52, 'Unbelief Prevents God’s Work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 529, 7, 52, 'In Matthew 13:58, it says, “He did not do many miracles there because of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 529, 8, 52, 'their unbelief.” What do we learn from Jesus’ life? Though He wanted to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 529, 9, 52, 'do miracles for some people, yet He could not do so. He was prevented');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 529, 10, 52, 'from performing miracles, not because He didn''t want to, or because they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 529, 11, 52, 'didn''t have need - He greatly wanted to do a miracle for them, and they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 529, 12, 52, 'had great need - but because they wouldn''t believe. It is quite amazing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 529, 13, 52, 'that in Jesus’ Own hometown, where they should have had the maximum');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 529, 14, 52, 'blessing, they got the least. Imagine that, that in all the towns and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 529, 15, 52, 'villages where Jesus ministered, the village that got the least amount');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 529, 16, 52, 'of blessing was Nazareth, where Jesus had lived for thirty years. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 529, 17, 52, 'wouldn''t accept or believe in Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 529, 18, 52, 'Wherever you despise a true servant of God, you will be the loser. If a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 529, 19, 52, 'man is a genuine, true man of God anointed by the Holy Spirit, and you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 529, 20, 52, 'look down on him for some reason, you will be the loser. There is no man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 529, 21, 52, 'without weaknesses. Every servant of God in the history of humanity,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 529, 22, 52, 'including the Apostle Paul, had weaknesses. Jesus wanted to do many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 529, 23, 52, 'miracles there, but He could not do them. This also teaches us that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 529, 24, 52, 'need to ask ourselves, “Is there something God wanted to do for me, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 529, 25, 52, 'which He couldn''t do, because I wouldn''t trust Him?” Perhaps there is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 529, 26, 52, 'difficult problem you are facing, and you really want to be delivered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 529, 27, 52, 'from it. God also wants to deliver you from it, but you are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 529, 28, 52, 'delivered from it because of your unbelief.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 530, 1, 52, 'I have often thought about this verse in relation to the final day of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 530, 2, 52, 'judgment when I stand before the Lord. When the Lord reviews my life on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 530, 3, 52, 'the day of judgment, will He say, “I could have done something for you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 530, 4, 52, 'there if you had trusted Me,” or, in this other place, “If only you had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 530, 5, 52, 'trusted Me, things would have turned out very differently from the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 530, 6, 52, 'they did, but I couldn''t do anything for you. My hands were tied because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 530, 7, 52, 'you wouldn''t trust Me. You depended on man to help you. You looked up to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 530, 8, 52, 'the hills for your help. You went to Egypt instead of coming to Me.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 530, 9, 52, 'Will that be true? I can''t do anything about the years gone by. Many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 530, 10, 52, 'years of my life were wasted in unbelief. But at least in the years to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 530, 11, 52, 'come, I want to trust God first in every situation, whatever my need is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 530, 12, 52, '- physical sickness, problems with other people, difficulties with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 530, 13, 52, 'children, or any type of problem I may ever face, “Lord, I want to trust');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 530, 14, 52, 'You first. I know that You are Almighty God. You taught me to pray to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 530, 15, 52, '‘our Father who art in Heaven,’ Who can do everything.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 530, 16, 52, 'Dear brothers and sisters, please consider whether there are things in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 530, 17, 52, 'your life that the Lord could have done differently if you had only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 530, 18, 52, 'trusted Him. It is a very challenging verse to me, and one of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 530, 19, 52, 'saddest verses in all the four Gospels. “He could not and did not do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 530, 20, 52, 'many miracles there because of their unbelief” (Matthew 13:58). Mark 6:5');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 530, 21, 52, 'says, “He could do no miracle there, except that He healed few sick');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 530, 22, 52, 'people. And He wondered at their unbelief.” He was amazed at their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 530, 23, 52, 'unbelief. Do you recognize that you tie the hands of Christ when you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 530, 24, 52, 'don''t trust Him?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 530, 25, 52, 'Jesus Found Strength for His Sorrow in His Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 530, 26, 52, 'Matthew 14:1 says, “At that time Herod the tetrarch heard the news about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 530, 27, 52, 'Jesus, and said to his servants, ‘This is John the Baptist; he has risen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 530, 28, 52, 'from the dead, and that is why miraculous powers are at work in him.’ It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 531, 1, 52, 'is quite amazing that Jesus was mistaken for another human being. What a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 531, 2, 52, 'man John the Baptist must have been for somebody to think that Jesus was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 531, 3, 52, 'John the Baptist! John never did a miracle. But Jesus did miraculous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 531, 4, 52, 'things all the time. That''s a real challenge - a wholehearted servant of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 531, 5, 52, 'God being considered equal to Jesus by a heathen man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 531, 6, 52, 'Matthew 14:13 says that when Jesus heard about the beheading of John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 531, 7, 52, '(the story of his beheading is found in Matthew 14:1-12), He withdrew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 531, 8, 52, 'from there in a boat to a secluded place by Himself.” Jesus was human,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 531, 9, 52, 'and that is why He was so grieved that when He heard about Herod killing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 531, 10, 52, 'His forerunner, John the Baptist. He had to withdraw Himself. That is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 531, 11, 52, 'good thing to do. We can learn from the life of Jesus that whenever we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 531, 12, 52, 'feel some pressure of sorrow because of some circumstance or death,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 531, 13, 52, 'etc., we need to withdraw and get alone with God and overcome it. Cast');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 531, 14, 52, 'that sorrow into the Lord''s hands. The Bible says, “Cast your burden');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 531, 15, 52, 'upon the Lord and He will sustain you,” because otherwise, we can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 531, 16, 52, 'overwhelmed with sorrow. There are many Christians who face some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 531, 17, 52, 'difficult or sorrowful situation. They become so overwhelmed that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 531, 18, 52, 'are incapacitated and useless for weeks. To avoid this, we need to get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 531, 19, 52, 'alone in the presence of God. Even Jesus needed to do this when He heard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 531, 20, 52, 'that John the Baptist had been killed. He withdrew Himself and went');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 531, 21, 52, 'alone to be with the Father in prayer. This shows me His tremendous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 531, 22, 52, 'identification with the human race, that when He experienced our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 531, 23, 52, 'weaknesses and our sorrows, He knew how to weep and felt the feelings we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 531, 24, 52, 'feel in such situations. He knew the answer was to get alone with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 531, 25, 52, 'Father.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 531, 26, 52, 'When He had finished His time of grieving and seeking comfort and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 531, 27, 52, 'strength from His Father, Jesus saw the multitudes that had followed Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 531, 28, 52, 'and He “felt compassion for them and healed their sick” (Matthew 14:14).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 532, 1, 52, 'Within a short time, Jesus was back into the ministry. He didn''t let the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 532, 2, 52, 'sorrow of John’s death overwhelm Him. That is what we learn from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 532, 3, 52, 'life of Jesus. He teaches us even by the little actions of His life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 532, 4, 52, 'just as much as He does from His words.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 532, 5, 52, 'To Serve God, Be Willing to Be Inconvenienced');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 532, 6, 52, '“When it was evening, the disciples came to Him, saying, ‘This place is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 532, 7, 52, 'desolate, and the time is already past; so send the multitudes away, so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 532, 8, 52, 'they may go into the villages and buy food for themselves.’ But Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 532, 9, 52, 'said, ‘They need not go away; you give them something to eat’” (v15-16).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 532, 10, 52, 'Jesus’ response should be the attitude of every servant of God. Many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 532, 11, 52, 'would say, “Send them away,” but Jesus says to give them something to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 532, 12, 52, 'eat before sending them away. A servant of God must be one who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 532, 13, 52, 'hospitable; one whose home is open to serve others who come, to feed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 532, 14, 52, 'them and take care of them. If you are unwilling to do that, you cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 532, 15, 52, 'be a servant of God. If you are always thinking that it will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 532, 16, 52, 'inconvenient, or will involve sacrifice, forget about serving God. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 532, 17, 52, 'you want to be a servant of God, you must be willing to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 532, 18, 52, 'inconvenienced. You must be willing to sacrifice time, energy, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 532, 19, 52, 'money, etc.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 532, 20, 52, 'Jesus said to bring the five loaves and two fishes they had to Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 532, 21, 52, '“Ordering the multitudes to sit down on the grass, He took the five');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 532, 22, 52, 'loaves and two fish, and looking up to heaven, He blessed the food, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 532, 23, 52, 'breaking the loaves He gave them to the disciples, and the disciples');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 532, 24, 52, 'gave them to the multitudes, and they all ate and were satisfied. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 532, 25, 52, 'picked up what was left over of the broken pieces, twelve baskets full.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 532, 26, 52, 'And there were about five thousand men who ate, beside women and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 532, 27, 52, 'children” (Matthew 14:18-21). What we learn from this is that if we seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 532, 28, 52, 'to be hospitable, God can even supernaturally help us to bless other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 533, 1, 52, 'people. That is what we learn from Jesus. Honor God and say, “Lord, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 533, 2, 52, 'want to serve others and bless them,” and you will find that God does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 533, 3, 52, 'amazing, supernatural things to help you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 533, 4, 53, 'Chapter 52 Secret Prayer, Purpose of Storms, and Overcoming the Law of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 533, 5, 53, 'Gravity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 533, 6, 53, 'Immediately after feeding the multitude, Jesus, “made His disciples get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 533, 7, 53, 'into the boat and go ahead of Him to the other side while He sent the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 533, 8, 53, 'multitudes away. And after He had sent the multitudes away, He went up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 533, 9, 53, 'to the mountain by Himself to pray” (Matthew 14:22). This is something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 533, 10, 53, 'that Jesus often did. After He had done some tremendous miracle, like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 533, 11, 53, 'healing many sick people or feeding 5,000 with five loaves and two fish,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 533, 12, 53, 'He would go be alone with the Father.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 533, 13, 53, 'Why Jesus Slipped Away to Pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 533, 14, 53, 'Do you think Jesus was tempted to be proud? If you read Hebrews 4:15,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 533, 15, 53, 'you’ll know the answer. He was tempted in all things exactly as we are.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 533, 16, 53, 'Suppose you had fed 5,000 people with five loaves and two fish. Would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 533, 17, 53, 'you be tempted to be proud? If you had healed hundreds of sick people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 533, 18, 53, 'miraculously, would you be tempted to be proud? You know the answer; we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 533, 19, 53, 'would be! Jesus too was tempted, but He never became proud for even a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 533, 20, 53, 'single moment. But let’s not imagine that this was automatic for Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 533, 21, 53, 'Holiness was not handed to Him on a platter.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 533, 22, 53, 'What do we learn from Jesus’ life? What does He teach us from His life?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 533, 23, 53, 'We learn that after God has used us, we must get alone with God and give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 533, 24, 53, 'Him the glory, and acknowledge that it was done through His power.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 533, 25, 53, 'Remember that Christ lived on earth as a Man. That is why He could say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 533, 26, 53, 'to us, “Follow Me.” If He lived on Earth as God, He would never need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 533, 27, 53, 'pray. He would never be tempted because God is never tempted. He could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 533, 28, 53, 'never say to us, “Follow Me.” An angel flying with wings across the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 534, 1, 53, 'river could never ask us to follow him. And if Christ had come to earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 534, 2, 53, 'as God, He could never say the words “Follow Me.” We could boldly say to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 534, 3, 53, 'Him, “Lord, we cannot follow You. Don''t tease us. You had powers that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 534, 4, 53, 'don''t have.” But Jesus could say to all His disciples, and to us today,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 534, 5, 53, '“Follow Me.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 534, 6, 53, 'In What Way Do We Follow Jesus?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 534, 7, 53, 'We don''t have the same ministry Jesus had. Even I don''t have the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 534, 8, 53, 'ministry. As human beings, we all don''t have the same ministry. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 534, 9, 53, 'can’t do what I do. I can’t do what you do. We have different functions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 534, 10, 53, 'in the body. The hand cannot do what the liver does. The legs cannot do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 534, 11, 53, 'what the kidneys do. We have different functions in the body. In the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 534, 12, 53, 'body of Christ, we also all have different functions. When it comes to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 534, 13, 53, 'ministry, we can’t do what Christ did. Also, you can’t do what I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 534, 14, 53, 'doing, and I can’t do what you''re doing. So ministry is different for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 534, 15, 53, 'different people, but I can follow your example if you''re following');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 534, 16, 53, 'Christ. You can follow my example if I''m following Christ. I can follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 534, 17, 53, 'Christ in the way He lived and by the principles by which He lived.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 534, 18, 53, 'We read in Luke 5:15, “The news about Jesus was spreading further, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 534, 19, 53, 'great multitudes were gathering to hear Him and to be healed of their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 534, 20, 53, 'sicknesses.” Thousands were being healed. It was not this fake type of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 534, 21, 53, 'healing seen in healing campaigns today where someone’s invisible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 534, 22, 53, 'backache is healed or a little hearing problem is improved 10%. It was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 534, 23, 53, 'not a fake healing or psychosomatic healing where a changed mental');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 534, 24, 53, 'attitude brings healing. These were absolutely supernatural healings.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 534, 25, 53, 'People born blind or lame were being raised up and healed completely.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 534, 26, 53, 'Hundreds and thousands were healed immediately. It was not a gradual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 534, 27, 53, 'healing that took place over a period of months. This was immediate,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 534, 28, 53, 'instantaneous, and miraculous healing of hundreds and thousands. Was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 535, 1, 53, 'Jesus tempted to be proud? Sure, but He never became proud. He did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 535, 2, 53, 'have an atom of pride in Him, not for even a fraction of a second. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 535, 3, 53, 'is because, as Luke 5:16 says, “He would often slip away into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 535, 4, 53, 'wilderness to pray.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 535, 5, 53, 'The Right Way to Slip Away');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 535, 6, 53, 'This is what I have learned from Jesus’ life. He teaches me that when I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 535, 7, 53, 'am used by God in some wonderful way, I need to slip away into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 535, 8, 53, 'wilderness and pray. I like the words, “slip away.” This is what “slip');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 535, 9, 53, 'away” means: for example, a number of people are talking together and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 535, 10, 53, 'Jesus is involved in the conversation. All of a sudden, they look around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 535, 11, 53, 'and say, “Where’s Jesus? He left us. When did He leave us? We don’t even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 535, 12, 53, 'know when He left us.” That''s the meaning of “slip away.” It is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 535, 13, 53, 'getting up and saying, “Hey fellas, I''m going for a time of prayer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 535, 14, 53, 'Please excuse Me.” It wasn''t like that. No, there was not an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 535, 15, 53, 'announcement. He just left quietly, while the conversation was going on.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 535, 16, 53, 'He would slip away quietly in such a way that they wouldn''t even know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 535, 17, 53, 'that He left.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 535, 18, 53, 'That is the way to get alone with God and pray. Do not make big');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 535, 19, 53, 'announcements and speak about it later on, “During my time of prayer,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 535, 20, 53, 'God spoke to me…” and all this pompous stuff. Or, “While I was fasting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 535, 21, 53, 'for three weeks, the Lord said this to me…” All this type of garbage is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 535, 22, 53, 'complete disobedience to what Jesus says in Matthew 6 - “When you fast,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 535, 23, 53, 'don''t tell anybody about it. When you pray, don''t let anyone know that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 535, 24, 53, 'you''re praying.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 535, 25, 53, 'I have seen that Christians who fast and pray are the ones who disobey');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 535, 26, 53, 'that command the most. They have a tremendous lust to inform others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 535, 27, 53, 'about how long they fasted and how long they prayed. How do you know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 535, 28, 53, 'these men of God prayed for two hours every day? They must have told');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 536, 1, 53, 'someone. Their family members may know it. If others speak it, it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 536, 2, 53, 'okay. But if they themselves inform others, they are violating and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 536, 3, 53, 'disobeying Matthew 6. Jesus said, “When you pray, don''t let anybody know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 536, 4, 53, 'about it. When you fast, don’t let anyone know about it. When you give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 536, 5, 53, 'money, don''t let anyone know about it.” These commands are often');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 536, 6, 53, 'disobeyed by Christians.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 536, 7, 53, 'Secret Prayer Is a Protection from Pride & Temptation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 536, 8, 53, 'Jesus would slip away and pray. After feeding the 5,000, it says in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 536, 9, 53, 'Matthew 14:23, “He went up to the mountain to pray, and when it was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 536, 10, 53, 'evening He was there alone.” That''s why Jesus never sinned in His entire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 536, 11, 53, 'life. There was no pride in Jesus, not even for a fraction of a second.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 536, 12, 53, 'He was tempted. I am sure thoughts of pride would be flashed into His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 536, 13, 53, 'mind by the devil, but He overcame them because He would get alone with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 536, 14, 53, 'His Father. If He was not like us and He had come here as God, then He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 536, 15, 53, 'would not need to get alone like that in prayer. Prayer is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 536, 16, 53, 'expression of weakness and helplessness. It’s only a weak person who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 536, 17, 53, 'prays. It is because we think we are so strong that we don''t pray very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 536, 18, 53, 'much. It is because we think we are so capable that we do not depend');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 536, 19, 53, 'upon God for our service. That is why our results are so shallow. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 536, 20, 53, 'is why we so frequently fall into pride and many other sins.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 536, 21, 53, 'But Jesus recognized His limitation as a human being. He told His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 536, 22, 53, 'disciples in Gethsemane, “Watch and pray. Otherwise you will fall in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 536, 23, 53, 'time of temptation. You will definitely fall.” But Peter, James and John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 536, 24, 53, 'were self-confident, like a lot of Christians today. In the Garden of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 536, 25, 53, 'Gethsemane, they said, “We are okay. We are praying. We are not going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 536, 26, 53, 'fall.” And then they went to sleep. But Jesus prayed because He said, “I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 536, 27, 53, 'am a man. I am weak. I need to pray.” The disciples did not recognize');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 536, 28, 53, 'their weakness, and they slept. What happened in the moment of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 537, 1, 53, 'temptation? Peter took out his sword and chopped off somebody’s ear. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 537, 2, 53, 'fell in the moment of temptation. But Jesus did not because He had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 537, 3, 53, 'prayed. He healed the man''s ear.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 537, 4, 53, 'This is the difference. I want to tell you in Jesus’ name that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 537, 5, 53, 'reason why you keep falling into temptation is because you have not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 537, 6, 53, 'listened to the words of Jesus saying, “Watch, be alert, and pray.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 537, 7, 53, 'Otherwise, you will fall into temptation.” Recognize your weakness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 537, 8, 53, 'Recognize your helplessness and lean upon God, and especially after God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 537, 9, 53, 'has used you in some wonderful way. This is what Jesus has taught us by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 537, 10, 53, 'his life, and we need to practice it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 537, 11, 53, 'Jesus Secretly Insisted Upon Secret Prayer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 537, 12, 53, 'It was Jesus who urged His disciples to get into the boat. There is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 537, 13, 53, 'very interesting word in Matthew 14:22. In the margin, it says the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 537, 14, 53, 'literal Greek word means compelled. “He ‘compelled’ His disciples to get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 537, 15, 53, 'into the boat and go to the other side.” Just think about it. That means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 537, 16, 53, 'they did not want to go. They said, “No, no. We’ll stay here.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 537, 17, 53, '“No,” He says, “You must go. You must get into the boat and go.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 537, 18, 53, 'They said, “No, no, no, Lord. We’ll stay here.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 537, 19, 53, '“No, you have to go.” He compelled them. Finally, they reluctantly got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 537, 20, 53, 'into the boat and went off.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 537, 21, 53, 'There were two reasons for this. First of all, Jesus wanted to be alone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 537, 22, 53, 'There are times when we need to send everybody away. Even when they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 537, 23, 53, 'don''t want to go, you have to compel them to leave and say, “Listen, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 537, 24, 53, 'need to be alone right now.” He didn''t tell them why He was sending them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 537, 25, 53, 'away. So the first reason is that Jesus wanted to get alone for prayer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 537, 26, 53, 'The Lord Sends Us into Storms');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 537, 27, 53, 'The second reason was that He wanted to teach them something in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 537, 28, 53, 'lake. “When the boat was already hundreds of feet from the land, it was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 538, 1, 53, 'battered by the waves, for the wind was contrary” (Matthew 14:24).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 538, 2, 53, 'What do we learn from this about Jesus’ dealings with us? If they had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 538, 3, 53, 'disobeyed God and not gotten into the boat and gone into the lake, they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 538, 4, 53, 'wouldn''t have faced the storm. They would not have been battered by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 538, 5, 53, 'waves. It is when they obeyed the Lord that they faced the problems. Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 538, 6, 53, 'you see that? He compelled them to go. Finally, they went and they faced');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 538, 7, 53, 'the waves battering their boat. It says, “The wind was contrary.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 538, 8, 53, 'When do we face storms, contrary winds and trials in life? It is when we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 538, 9, 53, 'obey the Lord. If you disobey the Lord, you probably won''t face many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 538, 10, 53, 'problems. That is what we learn from this passage. When we obey, we face');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 538, 11, 53, 'storms and the winds battering our life and our home. Disobedient people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 538, 12, 53, 'usually have a comfortable life, at least temporarily. In the long run,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 538, 13, 53, 'they reap what they sow and find judgment, sorrows, and problems.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 538, 14, 53, 'Wholehearted disciples face more earthly problems than half-hearted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 538, 15, 53, 'ones. Half-hearted ones tell lies, compromise, do wrong things, and have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 538, 16, 53, 'a pretty easy way through life. It is the wholehearted, radical ones who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 538, 17, 53, 'face storms, battering waves, and many, many, trials in their life. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 538, 18, 53, 'they are the fortunate ones because they are the ones who experience the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 538, 19, 53, 'Lord stilling the storm and quieting the waves. They are the ones that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 538, 20, 53, 'experience the Lord calming everything and solving the problem.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 538, 21, 53, 'Storms Give Jesus an Opportunity to Demonstrate Power');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 538, 22, 53, 'Would you rather go through life without problems, as a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 538, 23, 53, 'Christians would like? Or would you like to face problems and see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 538, 24, 53, 'Almighty God delivering you from them, one after the other? You can have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 538, 25, 53, 'a remarkable testimony to give to others. So don’t ever pray, “Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 538, 26, 53, 'don''t give us any problems.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 538, 27, 53, 'Think of Sunday school children who would be taught stories about Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 538, 28, 53, 'like this: “Jesus went to a marriage in Cana. Fortunately, they had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 539, 1, 53, 'ordered enough food and wine for everybody. They never ran short.” The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 539, 2, 53, 'children say, “That''s a boring story. I don''t want to hear that.” But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 539, 3, 53, 'when the children hear, “Hey! The wine ran out and Jesus turned the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 539, 4, 53, 'water into wine! Wow, look at that!” Imagine a story like this: “There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 539, 5, 53, 'were five thousand men, and many women and children, who were sitting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 539, 6, 53, 'and listening to Jesus. Then they were all hungry. Fortunately,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 539, 7, 53, 'everybody had brought their lunch packets so they opened them and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 539, 8, 53, 'started eating.” That''s boring. But “Jesus took five loaves and two fish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 539, 9, 53, 'from one little boy and fed the five thousand!” That is the interesting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 539, 10, 53, 'story.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 539, 11, 53, 'When we face shortage, trials, difficulties, and limitations, we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 539, 12, 53, 'experience the mighty power of God. This is what Jesus teaches us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 539, 13, 53, 'through these experiences that are written down in the Gospels for our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 539, 14, 53, 'instruction. It was when the the wind was contrary in the fourth watch');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 539, 15, 53, 'of the night that “Jesus came walking on the sea” (Matthew 14:25).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 539, 16, 53, 'Jesus Can Overcome Every Law We Face');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 539, 17, 53, 'Every miracle is also a parable. (We saw a list of parables in Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 539, 18, 53, '13.) This miracle is also a parable because no human being can walk on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 539, 19, 53, 'the sea. That is impossible. The law of gravity pulls everybody down.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 539, 20, 53, 'They''ll drown in the sea. Look at the millions of people that have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 539, 21, 53, 'drowned in the sea. It is because gravity pulls them down. It is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 539, 22, 53, 'land. Nobody drowns on land, but millions of people have died in the sea');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 539, 23, 53, 'through the years, pulled down by gravity. When Jesus walked on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 539, 24, 53, 'water, He was saying, “I can overcome the law of gravity.” The law of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 539, 25, 53, 'gravity is still operating. It’s not cancelled out, but Jesus could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 539, 26, 53, 'overcome it by the power of God. The parable is this: the law of gravity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 539, 27, 53, 'is like the law of sin, which also pulls us down all the time. Paul');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 539, 28, 53, 'speaks about the law of sin and spiritual death in Romans 7. The law of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 540, 1, 53, 'sin and spiritual death is operating in every part of the world and is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 540, 2, 53, 'always pulling us down like the law of gravity, every single moment - 24');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 540, 3, 53, 'hours a day, seven days a week. Just as the law of gravity operates upon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 540, 4, 53, 'us, the law of sin and death operates upon every human being, Christians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 540, 5, 53, 'included, all the time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 540, 6, 53, 'The law of sin and death tugged at Jesus over and over again (He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 540, 7, 53, 'tempted in all points as we are – Hebrews 4:15), and sought to bring Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 540, 8, 53, 'down, but He never sinned. He walked over it. It says in Hebrews 5:7');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 540, 9, 53, 'that, “Jesus prayed with loud crying and tears to be saved from that law');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 540, 10, 53, 'of sin and death, and He was heard.” The law of death couldn''t pull Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 540, 11, 53, 'down. He was heard because of His godly fear. He overcame the law of sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 540, 12, 53, 'and death constantly, all the time, every single moment. Right after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 540, 13, 53, 'Hebrews 4:15 tells us that Jesus never sinned, we are urged in verse 16');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 540, 14, 53, 'to “therefore go to the throne of grace and ask God for the same grace.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 540, 15, 53, 'That is the point. We don’t look at Jesus as Someone Whom we admire, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 540, 16, 53, 'Someone to follow. Jesus never said, “Admire Me.” Never! He always said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 540, 17, 53, '“Follow Me.” We are not to set up our lives for others to admire either,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 540, 18, 53, 'but rather, for them to follow.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 540, 19, 53, 'Don’t Just Admire Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 540, 20, 53, 'Jesus never said, “Admire Me.” If you are only admiring Jesus, you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 540, 21, 53, 'not a disciple. When you break bread at the Lord''s table, you are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 540, 22, 53, 'admiring Jesus. Rather, you are saying, “Lord, I want to go the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 540, 23, 53, 'way: I want to be broken the way You were broken.” When you drink the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 540, 24, 53, 'cup, you are saying, “Like You shed Your blood, I want my life to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 540, 25, 53, 'poured out for You.” If you are only admiring Jesus, then you must look');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 540, 26, 53, 'at the bread when it comes to you, admire it, and pass it on to the next');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 540, 27, 53, 'person without touching it. This is because you don''t want to follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 540, 28, 53, 'Jesus; you just want to admire Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 541, 1, 53, 'Be honest. If you''re taking part in the breaking of bread, then you’re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 541, 2, 53, 'saying, “I want to follow Jesus.” To follow means that you believe, “I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 541, 3, 53, 'can also overcome like Jesus did.” That is the most important part of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 541, 4, 53, 'this miracle. When the disciples saw Him walking on the sea, they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 541, 5, 53, 'frightened. They said, “It is a ghost,” and they cried out in fear (they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 541, 6, 53, 'had a fear of ghosts way back in the first century too). Immediately,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 541, 7, 53, 'Jesus spoke to them saying, “Take courage. It is I. Do not be afraid.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 541, 8, 53, 'What a word! Never be discouraged because the Lord says, “It is Me. I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 541, 9, 53, 'yours. Do not be afraid. As long as I am here, you don''t have to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 541, 10, 53, 'afraid.” Peter was bold and said, “Lord, if this is You, command me to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 541, 11, 53, 'come to You on the water.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 541, 12, 53, 'Be Bold to Expect to Be an Overcomer, Too');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 541, 13, 53, 'I want to apply this spiritually. Bold Christians look up to Jesus and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 541, 14, 53, 'say, “Lord, if You lived on earth as a man, and You only had the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 541, 15, 53, 'resource that Christians have today - the power of the Holy Spirit -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 541, 16, 53, 'then bid me also to step out and overcome the law of sin and death like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 541, 17, 53, 'You did. If You can do it, I can do it.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 541, 18, 53, 'That is the boldness of faith, and Peter was the one who said it. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 541, 19, 53, 'others said, “Oh, we''re not so sure. We’d better stay in the comfort of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 541, 20, 53, 'this boat because the law of sin and death will take over and we’ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 541, 21, 53, 'drown. The law of gravity will take over.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 541, 22, 53, 'But Peter said, “If You can do it, Lord, then I can do it. Tell me to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 541, 23, 53, 'come.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 541, 24, 53, 'And the Lord said, “Come.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 541, 25, 53, 'Some of you are defeated by sin. The law of sin and death is pulling you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 541, 26, 53, 'down every single day. You''re falling and getting discouraged and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 541, 27, 53, 'downcast. The Lord is saying to you, “Come and overcome the law of sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 541, 28, 53, 'and death. Look at Me. Look at My example, and I will give you the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 542, 1, 53, 'power to overcome.” Peter stepped out. I don''t know how many others in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 542, 2, 53, 'the boat called him a heretic for believing that he could overcome the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 542, 3, 53, 'law of sin and death. Certainly, it happens today. Romans 6:14 says that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 542, 4, 53, 'grace is more powerful than the law of sin and death. If anyone preaches');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 542, 5, 53, 'that sin shall not have dominion over you because you are under grace,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 542, 6, 53, 'others will call him a heretic for believing Scripture.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 542, 7, 53, 'This is the tragic state of Christendom today. If somebody preaches that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 542, 8, 53, 'we can never overcome sin or we will keep on sinning till our dying day,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 542, 9, 53, 'others call that person a true servant of God. The Devil has succeeded');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 542, 10, 53, 'in turning the truth of God upside down. The true servants of God are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 542, 11, 53, 'called heretics, and the heretics are called true servants of God. Can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 542, 12, 53, 'you imagine what a work the devil has done? I''m surprised at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 542, 13, 53, 'thousands of blind and dumb Christians who sit like idiots and believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 542, 14, 53, 'all this rubbish that is contrary to God''s Word. They are like those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 542, 15, 53, 'disciples who like the comfort of the boat. Thank God for every man like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 542, 16, 53, 'Peter, who steps out and says, “Lord, if You can overcome the law of sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 542, 17, 53, 'and death, so can I. You were a Man like me, and the power of the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 542, 18, 53, 'Spirit worked in You. You have given the same Holy Spirit to me today.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 542, 19, 53, 'This is unlike the Old Covenant, where they did not have the power of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 542, 20, 53, 'the Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 542, 21, 53, 'Peter steps out. That is a greater miracle than Jesus walking on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 542, 22, 53, 'water! For Jesus to walk on the water is not such a great thing, but for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 542, 23, 53, 'Peter to walk on the water is an amazing thing. For Jesus to overcome');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 542, 24, 53, 'sin is not such a great thing, but for us to overcome sin is really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 542, 25, 53, 'amazing. That is what the Lord says He’ll do for us. It is not without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 542, 26, 53, 'His power, but it is guaranteed with His power.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 542, 27, 53, 'Keep Your Eyes on Jesus, and Cry Out as Soon as You Sink');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 542, 28, 53, 'Peter walked on the water and came to Jesus. Then, he made a mistake. As');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 543, 1, 53, 'long as we run the race looking unto Jesus, as it says in Hebrews');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 543, 2, 53, '12:1-2, we will endure till the end without falling or sinking. But we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 543, 3, 53, 'can turn our eyes away from the Lord like Peter did and begin to look at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 543, 4, 53, 'the wind and the waves. When we turn our eyes away from Christ and His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 543, 5, 53, 'example, we can begin to compare ourselves with other people who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 543, 6, 53, 'drowning in the sea and become proud. You can think, “‘I''m not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 543, 7, 53, 'drowning.” At that very moment, you begin to drown through pride. Or you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 543, 8, 53, 'look around at others and start criticizing them for something. Again,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 543, 9, 53, 'you’ll drown. Or you look around at others and listen to their opinions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 543, 10, 53, 'about you and you get discouraged. Again, you’ll drown.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 543, 11, 53, 'What is the solution? Don''t look at them. Don''t listen to them. Look at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 543, 12, 53, 'Jesus. Let us run the race, as one translation says, “Looking away from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 543, 13, 53, 'everything else, unto Jesus”. Look away from everyone else unto Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 543, 14, 53, 'Fix and focus our vision on Christ alone Who has overcome everything. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 543, 15, 53, 'has overcome sin, the world, and the devil. Our flesh, the world, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 543, 16, 53, 'the devil have all been overcome. And He says to us, “Follow Me.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 543, 17, 53, 'It says that Peter began to sink. What shall we do if we fail? There is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 543, 18, 53, 'a message here for the entire Christian life. What shall we do if we did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 543, 19, 53, 'turn our eyes away from the Lord in stupidity and we begin to sink? If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 543, 20, 53, 'we begin to feel is all hope gone? Do we have to drown? No! You just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 543, 21, 53, 'have to cry out, “Lord, save me.” I love that word, “immediately” in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 543, 22, 53, 'Matthew 14:31. “Immediately, Jesus stretched out His hand and said, ‘Oh,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 543, 23, 53, 'you of little faith. Why do you doubt Me?’” He took hold of him first.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 543, 24, 53, 'He did not give him a warning or exhortation first. He held him and made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 543, 25, 53, 'him stand. Then gave him the rebuke. He didn’t rebuke him first, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 543, 26, 53, 'if He had done that, Peter would have sunk to the bottom by then. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 543, 27, 53, 'Lord holds us first and then rebukes us. Isn’t that wonderful? He makes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 543, 28, 53, 'us stand first before correcting us. But you have to cry out saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 544, 1, 53, '“Lord, save me,” immediately. Peter said that when he was beginning to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 544, 2, 53, 'sink, not when he hit the bottom of the sea. Don''t wait till you hit the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 544, 3, 53, 'bottom of the sea before you call out. Ask Him now, while you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 544, 4, 53, 'beginning to sink. Call out to Him and say, “Lord, save me.” And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 544, 5, 53, 'immediately, you will find He stretches out His hand to help you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 544, 6, 54, 'Chapter 53 God''s Word Over Man’s Tradition');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 544, 7, 54, 'Cry Out to the Lord Immediately When Beginning to Sink');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 544, 8, 54, 'When Peter began to sink, he just cried out, “Lord, save me” (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 544, 9, 54, '14:30). That is all you have to do when you have failed or when you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 544, 10, 54, 'slipping. The important thing is to call on the Lord when you’re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 544, 11, 54, 'beginning to sink, not after you hit rock bottom or the bottom of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 544, 12, 54, 'sea. Many people ask God to help them and to be merciful to them after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 544, 13, 54, 'they have completely fallen and messed up their life. The best time to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 544, 14, 54, 'ask God to help you is immediately when you are beginning to sink.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 544, 15, 54, 'For example, in practical terms, this means to cry out, “Lord, give me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 544, 16, 54, 'grace. Lord save me!” when you''re facing a particular pressure. It could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 544, 17, 54, 'be pressure to become angry, or to watch internet pornography on a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 544, 18, 54, 'computer, or some type of pressure like that. You are trying to resist');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 544, 19, 54, 'it, but you find you are slipping and falling. The pull is becoming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 544, 20, 54, 'greater and greater, and you fear that you may fall, that is the time to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 544, 21, 54, 'cry out, “Lord, give me grace. Lord, save me!”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 544, 22, 54, 'The words are not important. The Lord hears the cry of your heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 544, 23, 54, 'Whoever calls upon the name of the Lord will be delivered. That is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 544, 24, 54, 'promise in Scripture. Whoever calls upon the name of the Lord will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 544, 25, 54, 'delivered (Romans 10:13). As soon as Peter called on the name of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 544, 26, 54, 'Lord saying, “Lord, save me,” the Lord took hold of him, and then He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 544, 27, 54, 'proceeded to give him a rebuke. That is always God''s Way. He’ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 544, 28, 54, 'definitely correct you - He’ll rebuke you for your unbelief - but He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 545, 1, 54, 'will first hold you; and then after that, He will correct you. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 545, 2, 54, 'held Peter and then spoke to him. He didn''t speak to him and then hold');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 545, 3, 54, 'him because by the time the Lord said those words, Peter would have gone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 545, 4, 54, 'right into the sea!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 545, 5, 54, 'Faith for What He Promised');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 545, 6, 54, 'Jesus held Peter and then said, “Oh, you of little faith. Why did you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 545, 7, 54, 'doubt?” We have seen this again and again in the Gospel of Matthew. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 545, 8, 54, 'Lord rebukes people for unbelief. The Lord admires faith. What is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 545, 9, 54, 'overall message that comes to us through this? What is Jesus trying to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 545, 10, 54, 'teach us through all these incidents put together? It is that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 545, 11, 54, 'greatly appreciates faith - specifically, faith which is based on His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 545, 12, 54, 'Word. If the Lord had not told Peter to come, but he stepped out on his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 545, 13, 54, 'own initiative, then that would be a different thing altogether.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 545, 14, 54, 'Unfortunately, a lot of people today are doing things that the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 545, 15, 54, 'never told them to do. They are trying to have faith for things God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 545, 16, 54, 'never promised. No wonder they are sinking! They make a mess of their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 545, 17, 54, 'lives because they are trying to do things that God never told them to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 545, 18, 54, 'do. They are jumping off of the roof of the temple and trying to claim a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 545, 19, 54, 'promise. Then they crash and break their bones and wonder why the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 545, 20, 54, 'did not protect them. Well, the Lord has not promised to support our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 545, 21, 54, 'stupidity. If there are steps provided from the roof of the temple, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 545, 22, 54, 'should use the steps. You should not jump off and ask the Lord to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 545, 23, 54, 'protect you, trying to claim some promise of His. It is when we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 545, 24, 54, 'faith based on a promise of God or a command that says, “Come and do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 545, 25, 54, 'this,” that we can be 100% sure that God will give us the resources to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 545, 26, 54, 'do it. Whatever He has commanded, He gives us the resources to do.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 545, 27, 54, 'In Acts 20:32, Paul uses a lovely expression to refer to God’s Word. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 545, 28, 54, 'says, “I commend you to God and to the Word of His Grace.” That is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 546, 1, 54, 'lovely expression for the Word of God. It is the ‘Word of His Grace.’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 546, 2, 54, 'This means that every command in His Word will have the promise of grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 546, 3, 54, 'attached to it. If you find a command, you can expect grace is available');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 546, 4, 54, 'to keep that command. There is no command in the New Testament for which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 546, 5, 54, 'grace is not available.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 546, 6, 54, 'For example, there is a command to, “Rejoice in the Lord always”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 546, 7, 54, '(Philippians 4:4). That means there is grace available to rejoice in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 546, 8, 54, 'Lord 24/7. You may not have availed of it. That is another thing. Or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 546, 9, 54, 'take Philippians 4:6, “Be anxious for nothing.” There is grace available');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 546, 10, 54, 'to live a life completely free from anxiety. That may not be your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 546, 11, 54, 'experience because you do not avail of that grace. You do not cry,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 546, 12, 54, '“Lord, save me.” You do not believe that the Lord can do it. You look at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 546, 13, 54, 'the circumstances like Peter did. You look around at people and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 546, 14, 54, 'circumstances, and you drown in anxiety or fear or grumbling and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 546, 15, 54, 'complaining when there is absolutely no need to. There is no need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 546, 16, 54, 'live on this Earth having a bad mood even one single time in your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 546, 17, 54, 'Can you have a bad mood and rejoice in the Lord always? That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 546, 18, 54, 'impossible. Can you be gloomy and depressed and rejoice in the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 546, 19, 54, 'always? Can you be anxious and fearful yet obey the command that says be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 546, 20, 54, 'anxious for nothing? No. What is the secret? The secret is to look at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 546, 21, 54, 'Jesus, and see how He lived. Obey His command and trust Him to give us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 546, 22, 54, 'the grace to live by that standard. This is what Christendom needs to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 546, 23, 54, 'challenged to do. This is the message that is missing in Christendom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 546, 24, 54, 'today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 546, 25, 54, 'Matthew 14:33-34 says, “When they got into the boat, the wind stopped.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 546, 26, 54, 'And those who were in the boat worshipped Him, saying, ‘You are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 546, 27, 54, 'certainly God’s Son!’ When they had crossed over, they came to land at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 546, 28, 54, 'Gennesaret. There the men at that place recognized Him, and they brought');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 547, 1, 54, 'to Him all who were sick. They began to entreat Him that they might just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 547, 2, 54, 'touch the fringe of His cloak.” They did not even touch His body; they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 547, 3, 54, 'just touched the dress He was wearing. There was so much power that was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 547, 4, 54, 'transmitted through His body and through His dress. “As many as touched');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 547, 5, 54, 'it were cured.” In other words, every single person was cured. They were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 547, 6, 54, 'all healed. All types of terrible diseases were healed by touching the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 547, 7, 54, 'hem of His garment. Blind people’s eyes were opened. Deaf people began');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 547, 8, 54, 'to hear. Dumb people began to speak. Lame people began to walk. Those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 547, 9, 54, 'with internal diseases and aches were healed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 547, 10, 54, 'God Promised That We Can Follow Jesus’ Life, Not His Ministry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 547, 11, 54, 'This was an attestation by God of the fact that Jesus was the Messiah.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 547, 12, 54, 'It is not something that we can repeat. It is not something that has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 547, 13, 54, 'happened again throughout 2000 years of Christianity. It happened only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 547, 14, 54, 'in the time of Jesus. God has occasionally given such supernatural');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 547, 15, 54, 'powers to some people according to His sovereign choice, but nobody had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 547, 16, 54, 'even 1% of the extent to which it was seen in Christ. There has never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 547, 17, 54, 'been an apostle or servant of God, who has been able to manifest the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 547, 18, 54, 'power of healing and miracles that flowed out from Christ’s life and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 547, 19, 54, 'body even 1% of which He did, to even one thousandth of that! We need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 547, 20, 54, 'humble ourselves and acknowledge that we cannot do that. Jesus never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 547, 21, 54, 'asked us to do it. He never asked us to follow Him in His ministry.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 547, 22, 54, 'Jesus asked us to follow Him in His life and the way He lived. Let’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 547, 23, 54, 'keep that in mind.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 547, 24, 54, 'Finding Fault in Others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 547, 25, 54, 'In Matthew 15, some Pharisees and scribes came to Jesus from Jerusalem.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 547, 26, 54, 'They were always trying to find fault with Him and His disciples. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 547, 27, 54, 'are some Christians like that too. They’re great Bible scholars like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 547, 28, 54, 'Pharisees. You can ask yourself whether you are one like that. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 548, 1, 54, 'Pharisees disagreed with Jesus. They did not quite agree with what He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 548, 2, 54, 'was doing and preaching. When you find someone whom you disagree with,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 548, 3, 54, 'ask yourself whether you are acting like the Pharisees acted towards');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 548, 4, 54, 'Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 548, 5, 54, 'Are you trying to find some fault or some little thing that you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 548, 6, 54, 'nit-pick? Are you trying to find an error in some little sentence');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 548, 7, 54, 'someone said? If so, very often you will find it is caused by jealousy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 548, 8, 54, 'The Pharisees were tremendously jealous of Jesus because He was so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 548, 9, 54, 'popular. You could be jealous of someone whose ministry is more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 548, 10, 54, 'effective or more anointed than yours. More people are listening to him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 548, 11, 54, 'than to you and you want to do something to tear him down. There are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 548, 12, 54, 'lots of Pharisees like that in the world today. The Lord would say to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 548, 13, 54, 'you, “You generation of vipers! How will you escape the damnation of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 548, 14, 54, 'Hell?” You need to take that seriously. These things are written for our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 548, 15, 54, 'instruction. What we learn from here is not only from Jesus’ life. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 548, 16, 54, 'can learn from the reaction of other people to Jesus’ ministry. These');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 548, 17, 54, 'lessons are for our own salvation, if you''re interested.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 548, 18, 54, 'Tradition vs the Word of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 548, 19, 54, 'The Pharisees came to Jesus and said in Matthew 15:2, “Why do Your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 548, 20, 54, 'disciples transgress the tradition of the elders?” The tradition of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 548, 21, 54, 'elders was most important for the Pharisees. It was not the Word of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 548, 22, 54, 'or the Heart of God or the Spirit of God, but it was the tradition of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 548, 23, 54, 'the elders. I find many Christians with this problem. The tradition of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 548, 24, 54, 'the elders is what people have believed in our church from ancient ages.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 548, 25, 54, 'In some churches, people say “Our church started a hundred years ago.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 548, 26, 54, 'This is what our senior elders have taught and this is what we believe.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 548, 27, 54, 'This is the tradition of the elders.” But is it found in the Word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 548, 28, 54, 'God? That is the question.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 549, 1, 54, 'Jesus broke with tradition. He said the Word of God is more important');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 549, 2, 54, 'than tradition. That''s why they killed Him. They didn’t kill Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 549, 3, 54, 'because He was washing the disciples’ feet. They didn''t kill Him because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 549, 4, 54, 'He said love your enemies. They didn’t kill Him because He said don’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 549, 5, 54, 'lust after women. They killed Him because He said the tradition of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 549, 6, 54, 'elders is a lot of rubbish and it violates and contradicts the Word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 549, 7, 54, 'God. Jesus said you need to throw it away. You need to understand the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 549, 8, 54, 'spirit of God''s Word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 549, 9, 54, 'This phrase, “the tradition of the elders,” is a very important thing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 549, 10, 54, 'the Pharisees and to today''s Pharisees also. You will find it in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 549, 11, 54, 'own heart too, if you respect human tradition and have no Scriptural');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 549, 12, 54, 'foundation. These traditions can hinder you from following the Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 549, 13, 54, 'particularly if we hold onto traditions that contradict Scripture. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 549, 14, 54, 'are a lot of traditions that have nothing to do with Scripture. By all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 549, 15, 54, 'means you can follow them, but traditions that contradict Scripture must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 549, 16, 54, 'be thrown into the garbage bin. There are a lot of things in Christendom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 549, 17, 54, 'today that need to be thrown in the trash can if we want to follow the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 549, 18, 54, 'Lord. If you do not do that, you will not be able to follow Jesus. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 549, 19, 54, 'will be following the tradition of the elders. One day you will stand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 549, 20, 54, 'before the Lord and discover that you did not obey God''s Word. You just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 549, 21, 54, 'obeyed the traditions of your church. So be careful that does not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 549, 22, 54, 'happen.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 549, 23, 54, 'One tradition the Pharisees emphasized was that they did not sit down to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 549, 24, 54, 'eat without first going through a ritual washing of their hands. But the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 549, 25, 54, 'disciples were pretty careless about all that. Jesus answered and said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 549, 26, 54, 'to the Pharisees, “Why do you yourselves transgress the commandment of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 549, 27, 54, 'God for the sake of your tradition?” He says to them, “I''ll tell you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 549, 28, 54, 'other areas where you are breaking God''s Word with your traditions.” For');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 550, 1, 54, 'the disciples to not wash their hands ritualistically was a small thing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 550, 2, 54, 'The Pharisees were not bothered about hygiene. They were talking about a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 550, 3, 54, 'ritualistic washing of the hands in a certain way for a period of time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 550, 4, 54, 'before they eat. It is one thing if one washes hands for the sake of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 550, 5, 54, 'hygiene. But this was a religious ritual, and the Pharisees were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 550, 6, 54, 'wondering why the disciples didn’t follow it. Jesus said, “That''s not a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 550, 7, 54, 'serious thing. I''ll tell you the Word of God that you cancelled with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 550, 8, 54, 'your tradition.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 550, 9, 54, 'Jesus then taught them in Matthew 15:4, “God has said, Honor your father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 550, 10, 54, 'and mother. He who speaks evil of his father and mother should be put to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 550, 11, 54, 'death.” God takes very seriously this matter of speaking disrespectfully');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 550, 12, 54, 'to your parents or about your parents. Speaking evil of your father and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 550, 13, 54, 'mother does not mean saying that they worship idols. Maybe they do and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 550, 14, 54, 'that is the truth. That''s not speaking evil of them. That is a fact. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 550, 15, 54, 'when you denounce them by criticizing them him in a bad way, that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 550, 16, 54, 'speaking evil. That is a very serious sin in God''s eyes. Jesus was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 550, 17, 54, 'pointing out there to the Pharisees that they teach children, who need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 550, 18, 54, 'to support their parents financially, to say, “I’m sorry. Anything of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 550, 19, 54, 'mine that I could have sent you to help you, I have given it to God.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 550, 20, 54, 'Wow! What a spiritual answer to give! Your parents are in need. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 550, 21, 54, 'hardly have enough to eat. You are earning a good salary, and you do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 550, 22, 54, 'help them because you say you have given that money to God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 550, 23, 54, 'That is religious garbage! The Lord said a person who does this is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 550, 24, 54, 'honoring their father and mother. He said, “You Pharisees teach him to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 550, 25, 54, 'not honor his father mother. There you invalidate or cancel the Word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 550, 26, 54, 'God for the sake of your tradition. You are so greedy to get that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 550, 27, 54, 'person’s money that you don''t even allow him to support his parents!”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 550, 28, 54, 'Traditions and Giving to God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 551, 1, 54, 'This is happening today. There are so many churches that are so greedy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 551, 2, 54, 'for people''s money that they do not allow them to use it for legitimate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 551, 3, 54, 'needs in their family. That is not the way we do it in our church. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 551, 4, 54, 'tell people that if you have legitimate needs in your family, God is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 551, 5, 54, 'a greedy Person asking you not to meet those needs, but to give it to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 551, 6, 54, 'God’s work instead. No - take care of your needs, clear your debts, help');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 551, 7, 54, 'your children get a good education, and then give to God cheerfully as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 551, 8, 54, 'much as you can give. That is the New Testament teaching. Forcing people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 551, 9, 54, 'to give ten percent is a tradition of men carried over from the old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 551, 10, 54, 'covenant.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 551, 11, 54, 'It is amazing. Why do people take just one commandment from the old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 551, 12, 54, 'covenant about paying your tithes? What about other commandments like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 551, 13, 54, 'keeping the Sabbath by not doing any work, or not lighting a fire on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 551, 14, 54, 'Saturdays? What about other commandments like killing a lamb or goat');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 551, 15, 54, 'every time you sin? That has been all fulfilled in Christ. The lamb and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 551, 16, 54, 'the goats being slain is fulfilled in Christ. The same applies to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 551, 17, 54, 'Sabbath and to tithing. It is all fulfilled in Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 551, 18, 54, 'The Law is over, and the old covenant has been abolished (Hebrews 8). We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 551, 19, 54, 'are not supposed to tithe today. “Are we not supposed to give to God?”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 551, 20, 54, 'you ask. Yes, you can give cheerfully. Whatever you give, give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 551, 21, 54, 'cheerfully (2 Corinthians 9:7). In the Old Testament, the important');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 551, 22, 54, 'thing was how much you gave. Strictly giving 10% is like paying income');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 551, 23, 54, 'tax. It is a fixed rate. The Israelites were paying income tax to God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 551, 24, 54, 'In the new covenant, our relationship with God is not like a servant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 551, 25, 54, 'paying income tax to his master. It is like the relationship a wife has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 551, 26, 54, 'to her husband. A wife does not pay income tax to her husband! She loves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 551, 27, 54, 'her husband and says, “Anything I have you can have.” It is a bride to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 551, 28, 54, 'bridegroom relationship.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 552, 1, 54, 'Do you want to go back to the old servant-master relationship with God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 552, 2, 54, 'and pay income tax to Him? If not, forget about tithing and say, “Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 552, 3, 54, 'I have a relationship with you where all that I have is yours! Tell me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 552, 4, 54, 'how much I can use for myself.” Can you imagine a husband allowing his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 552, 5, 54, 'bride or his wife to starve because he wants her money? That would be an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 552, 6, 54, 'evil husband. God is not like that. Christ is not like that. Here we see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 552, 7, 54, 'an example of human traditions that have cancelled out God’s clear Word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 552, 8, 54, 'in 2 Corinthians 9:7, which says that God loves a cheerful giver. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 552, 9, 54, 'must not give grudgingly. You must not give out of compulsion because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 552, 10, 54, 'somebody forced you to give. God’s Word has been cancelled out by greedy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 552, 11, 54, 'preachers and pastors. But who is willing to proclaim that? If anybody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 552, 12, 54, 'proclaims it, those pastors and preachers will jump on him and call him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 552, 13, 54, 'a heretic. If you''re afraid of that, you''ll never be a servant of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 552, 14, 54, 'That is the modern-day application of this teaching.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 552, 15, 54, 'When you say you have given it to God and yet you don''t help your own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 552, 16, 54, 'family, Jesus said you have actually cancelled out the Word of God. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 552, 17, 54, 'says in 1 Timothy 5:8 (paraphrase), “He who does not provide for his own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 552, 18, 54, 'family is worse than an infidel, an unbeliever, or an atheist.” We need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 552, 19, 54, 'to know these verses of Scripture, which a lot of pastors won''t tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 552, 20, 54, 'you. Jesus says in Matthew 15:8-9 (paraphrase), “You hypocrites! Rightly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 552, 21, 54, 'did Isaiah prophesy of you, saying, ‘These people honor Me with their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 552, 22, 54, 'lips. They say a lot of nice things about Me, but they do not know the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 552, 23, 54, 'Scriptures. They do not know what My Word says and their hearts are far');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 552, 24, 54, 'away from Me. In vain do they worship Me.’” They say they are coming on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 552, 25, 54, 'Sunday morning for praise and worship, but what do they do after that?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 552, 26, 54, 'They teach as doctrines the commandments of men. They practice what some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 552, 27, 54, 'preacher teaches them from the pulpit and it is not even found in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 552, 28, 54, 'New Testament.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 553, 1, 54, 'The Teaching of Human Tradition vs the Teaching of God’s Word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 553, 2, 54, 'That is so true even today. We need to apply these Scriptures to our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 553, 3, 54, 'lives today and see all that Jesus taught. He taught us to give up human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 553, 4, 54, 'traditions that cancel the Word of God. There are a lot of traditions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 553, 5, 54, 'that have no conflict with God''s Word, so they are fine. But whenever a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 553, 6, 54, 'tradition conflicts with the Word of God, we must be willing to stand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 553, 7, 54, 'against relatives, church leaders, or anybody else and say, “I''m not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 553, 8, 54, 'going to do that.” This is because there is a higher authority than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 553, 9, 54, 'father, mother, pastor, preacher, bishop, etc. The authority is in God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 553, 10, 54, 'Word, and that is the highest authority there is in this universe. I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 553, 11, 54, 'going to obey that and not obey a tradition passed down through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 553, 12, 54, 'centuries in some church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 553, 13, 54, 'This is what Jesus taught. We are to do it and to teach other people all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 553, 14, 54, 'that He commanded. The traditions of men can cancel out or invalidate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 553, 15, 54, 'the Word of God (Matthew 15:6). These are the things that made the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 553, 16, 54, 'Pharisees furious. That is why they called Him the prince of devils.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 553, 17, 54, 'These are the things that make a lot of Christian leaders, Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 553, 18, 54, 'scholars, and fundamentalist preachers (who came through Bible school,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 553, 19, 54, 'etc.) furious too, because they expose their error and their greediness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 553, 20, 54, 'They will call you similar names like Beelzebul, the prince of devils,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 553, 21, 54, 'etc. for exposing them, but if you follow Jesus, that won’t disturb you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 553, 22, 54, 'one bit. It will be like water off a duck''s back. You carry on and stand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 553, 23, 54, 'true to what God has told you to do. You continue to proclaim the truth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 553, 24, 54, 'This is how it must be.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 553, 25, 54, 'The Spirit Behind the Word of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 553, 26, 54, 'In Matthew 15:10-11, Jesus called the multitudes and said, “Hear and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 553, 27, 54, 'understand. It is not what enters into the mouth that defiles a man, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 553, 28, 54, 'what proceeds out of the mouth, this defiles a man.” There were a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 554, 1, 54, 'laws in the Old Testament, particularly in Leviticus 11, which had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 554, 2, 54, 'specific instructions about not eating certain types of meat and food.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 554, 3, 54, 'It was all meant to teach people the principle of being sanctified or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 554, 4, 54, 'set apart from sin. That was the purpose of giving such laws as, don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 554, 5, 54, 'wear clothing made of half-linen and half-wool. There is nothing sinful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 554, 6, 54, 'about wearing half-linen and half-wool. Today, we wear mixed material');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 554, 7, 54, 'clothing all the time, and it’s ok. But the Lord was trying to teach the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 554, 8, 54, 'principle of separation and of staying away from uncleanness. In order');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 554, 9, 54, 'to drill that into the minds of people, He told them not to eat certain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 554, 10, 54, 'types of birds, fishes, and other animals. We can make a law out of that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 554, 11, 54, 'today, and there are people who do. They say do not drink coffee, do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 554, 12, 54, 'eat pork, etc. But the Lord says, “It is not what goes into a mouth that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 554, 13, 54, 'defiles a man” (Matthew 15:11).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 554, 14, 54, 'We make so many laws about these little, little things. That is not the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 554, 15, 54, 'issue. It’s what proceeds out of the mouth that defiles the man. You can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 554, 16, 54, 'take that Word and misuse it. You can misquote even Jesus Christ. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 554, 17, 54, 'are people who can take harmful drugs and say that Jesus said what goes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 554, 18, 54, 'into the mouth does not defile the man. That is right. Taking a harmful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 554, 19, 54, 'drug will not defile you spiritually, but it''ll ruin your body. It’ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 554, 20, 54, 'kill you. It is like taking poison. So don''t misuse the Word of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 554, 21, 54, 'Jesus did not say what goes into a mouth won''t harm your body. He said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 554, 22, 54, 'it won''t defile you spiritually.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 554, 23, 54, 'What is it that defiles us spiritually? It is what comes out of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 554, 24, 54, 'heart. “Out of the abundance of the heart, the mouth speaks” (Luke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 554, 25, 54, '6:45). It is not what we eat that defiles us. That may cause an upset');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 554, 26, 54, 'stomach if the food is not good. But what defiles us spiritually is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 554, 27, 54, 'ritualistically avoiding of certain types of food. Even eating food');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 554, 28, 54, 'offered to idols does not defile us spiritually because an idol is just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 555, 1, 54, 'a block of wood or stone. But what can defile us is what comes out of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 555, 2, 54, 'our heart. Out of the heart comes forth evil thoughts, murders,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 555, 3, 54, 'adulteries, fornications, etc.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 555, 4, 54, 'Then the disciples came and said in verse 12, “Do you know that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 555, 5, 54, 'Pharisees were offended when they heard this statement?” This means the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 555, 6, 54, 'Pharisees were offended that Jesus spoke so much against tradition. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 555, 7, 54, 'really hated him for that. That is what finally made them kill Him. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 555, 8, 54, 'disciples were disturbed when they saw the Pharisees were terribly upset');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 555, 9, 54, 'at Jesus’ preaching against tradition, so they came to Him and said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 555, 10, 54, '“Lord, be careful. These guys are terribly upset, and they''ll do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 555, 11, 54, 'something to you.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 555, 12, 54, 'Be Careful to Follow Good Teaching of God’s Word, not Traditions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 555, 13, 54, 'Jesus said, “Every plant that my Heavenly Father did not plant shall be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 555, 14, 54, 'rooted out.” We must never forget that. If you''re following a tradition');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 555, 15, 54, 'that God did not plant in His Word, one day it will be pulled out. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 555, 16, 54, 'would have wasted your life following something that God never said nor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 555, 17, 54, 'planted. If you are trying to have faith for something that God never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 555, 18, 54, 'promised, you are going to be frustrated. “Every plant that my Heavenly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 555, 19, 54, 'Father did not plant will be rooted out.” If you are doing a work that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 555, 20, 54, 'God never told you to do, one day it will be rooted out. All your work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 555, 21, 54, 'will be rooted out. Seek God to see whether what you are doing is what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 555, 22, 54, 'God has told you to do or not.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 555, 23, 54, 'Jesus also said, “Don''t worry about them; just leave them alone. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 555, 24, 54, 'are blind guides of the blind. And if a blind man guides a blind man,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 555, 25, 54, 'both will fall into a pit.” It is very, very important that you do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 555, 26, 54, 'follow blind leaders. And in the context, who are the blind leaders? The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 555, 27, 54, 'blind leaders are those who follow traditions and not God''s Word. Who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 555, 28, 54, 'are the leaders who can see? They are those who see the Word of God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 556, 1, 54, 'follow that. Be careful which type of leaders you follow because you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 556, 2, 54, 'going to end up where they end up. If they are in a pit, you''ll be in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 556, 3, 54, 'pit too. We need to be careful about what type of leaders we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 556, 4, 54, 'following. We need to see whether they are showing us what is written in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 556, 5, 54, 'God''s Word, or whether they are showing us the traditions of men.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 556, 6, 55, 'Chapter 54 Sickness or Sin?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 556, 7, 55, 'In Matthew 15:11, Jesus said that it is not what enters into the mouth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 556, 8, 55, 'that defiles the man, but what proceeds out of the mouth. Peter could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 556, 9, 55, 'not understand that. He said, “What does this parable mean? What does it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 556, 10, 55, 'mean that only what comes out of the mouth defiles the person?”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 556, 11, 55, 'Jesus explained the statement in Matthew 15:16 saying, “Are you still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 556, 12, 55, 'lacking in understanding also?” Jesus was always speaking strong words.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 556, 13, 55, '“Why can''t you understand that? It is so simple. Don''t you understand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 556, 14, 55, 'that everything that goes into the mouth passes into the stomach and is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 556, 15, 55, 'eliminated? If there''s something defiled, it gets pushed out.” But the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 556, 16, 55, 'things that proceed out of the mouth come from the heart, and these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 556, 17, 55, 'defile the man. For out of the heart come evil thoughts, murders,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 556, 18, 55, 'adulteries, fornications, thefts, false witnesses, and slanders. These');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 556, 19, 55, 'are the things that defile the man. But to eat with unwashed hands does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 556, 20, 55, 'not defile the man.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 556, 21, 55, 'It is good to wash your hands so that you do not get sick, but that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 556, 22, 55, 'not as serious as our heart being defiled by impurity. There’s a little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 556, 23, 55, 'principle here that we need to ask ourselves to see whether we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 556, 24, 55, 'understood. We are all very careful to ensure that germs don''t get into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 556, 25, 55, 'our body. That is why we wash our hands and the plates that we eat on.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 556, 26, 55, 'You do not put today’s food on yesterday''s unwashed plates. You wash the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 556, 27, 55, 'cups, plates, and vessels. You don''t allow food to remain there for days');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 556, 28, 55, 'and keep that vessel unwashed. You will get sick. We are so careful to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 557, 1, 55, 'cleanse and wash our plates, spoons, vessels, and utensils every single');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 557, 2, 55, 'day. Why? Because we know that little, teeny weeny germs can get inside');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 557, 3, 55, 'us and make us sick.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 557, 4, 55, 'If I were to paraphrase Jesus’ words, what the Lord is saying is, “You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 557, 5, 55, 'are so careful about washing plates and utensils to make sure that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 557, 6, 55, 'defiling things do not go in your body, which would never ruin you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 557, 7, 55, 'spiritually. Why aren''t you careful about the things that get into your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 557, 8, 55, 'heart, which do defile you spiritually? Are you more afraid of sickness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 557, 9, 55, 'that comes through bad food than of sin that comes through reading and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 557, 10, 55, 'seeing things that are not good? For example, movies and pictures on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 557, 11, 55, 'internet that defile you? Are you more disturbed by that? You are very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 557, 12, 55, 'careful about food, but you are careless about something far more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 557, 13, 55, 'serious.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 557, 14, 55, 'Attitude Towards Sin Shows True Spirituality');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 557, 15, 55, 'Here is where our Christianity is tested. If you are really a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 557, 16, 55, 'spiritually-minded person, this is one good test to find out whether you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 557, 17, 55, 'are deceiving yourself or whether you are really spiritual. If you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 557, 18, 55, 'really spiritual, you will be more afraid of sin than of sickness. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 557, 19, 55, 'will be more afraid of sin that defiles your heart than sickness that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 557, 20, 55, 'comes through something you ate. Maybe you got typhoid, jaundice, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 557, 21, 55, 'hepatitis because of something you drank or ate. Are you careful about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 557, 22, 55, 'that and immediately seek to cleanse yourself and to avoid it? Look at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 557, 23, 55, 'the number of injections people take in order to avoid these sicknesses.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 557, 24, 55, 'But you are not anywhere as careful about the things that enter through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 557, 25, 55, 'your eyes into your heart and the things that you read, which defile');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 557, 26, 55, 'you. There are movies with five or ten seconds of a sex scene to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 557, 27, 55, 'stimulate people. And people say that most of the two hours of the movie');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 557, 28, 55, 'is fine; it is just five or ten seconds. It is like saying that a glass');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 558, 1, 55, 'of milk with just a couple drops of poison in it is perfectly fine. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 558, 2, 55, 'people want to poison somebody, they do not give them a whole glass of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 558, 3, 55, 'poison. They put one drop of poison in a glass of milk. That is enough');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 558, 4, 55, 'to kill somebody if it is a strong enough poison. Sexual scenes are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 558, 5, 55, 'pretty strong poison. The five seconds of a sex scene in a two-hour');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 558, 6, 55, 'movie is all that you will remember for the next fifty years. When you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 558, 7, 55, 'have forgotten the story of the movie, it is the five seconds that will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 558, 8, 55, 'remain in your memory because that is something that appeals to your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 558, 9, 55, 'lusts. That is why we need to be more careful about what goes into our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 558, 10, 55, 'hearts than we are about what goes into our mouths. Because once it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 558, 11, 55, 'comes into the heart, from that heart will come out that which defiles');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 558, 12, 55, 'our whole system.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 558, 13, 55, 'This is what Jesus taught. Be more careful of your heart than your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 558, 14, 55, 'stomach. Be more afraid of sin than of sickness. If you are more afraid');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 558, 15, 55, 'of sickness than of sin, you are not really spiritual. You are just a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 558, 16, 55, 'carnal Christian. You probably never heard anybody say that, but that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 558, 17, 55, 'the truth. One mark of a spiritual man is that he hates sin more than he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 558, 18, 55, 'is afraid of sickness. It is good to be careful about sickness. We want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 558, 19, 55, 'to remain healthy. But I will tell you honestly that I am far more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 558, 20, 55, 'interested in being holy than in being healthy. If there is a flu around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 558, 21, 55, 'town, it is possible that we can pick it up if we are careless. If we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 558, 22, 55, 'are weak and our immune system is not so strong, we can pick it up. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 558, 23, 55, 'does not mean you are unspiritual. But there is defilement worse than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 558, 24, 55, 'the flu, particularly in the entertainment world and what comes over the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 558, 25, 55, 'television. If you are more worried about a flu or a chicken pox going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 558, 26, 55, 'around town than about the defilement that is constantly coming in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 558, 27, 55, 'air through TVs, movies, music CDs, etc. I wonder whether you are even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 558, 28, 55, 'born again.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 559, 1, 55, 'The Holy Spirit Makes Us Sensitive to Spiritual Rottenness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 559, 2, 55, 'A born-again person is very sensitive to these things. A dead person is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 559, 3, 55, 'not disturbed by corruption around him. If you are healthy, you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 559, 4, 55, 'immediately react. If some spoilt, rotten food were put into your mouth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 559, 5, 55, 'you immediately feel the taste. You say, “Hey, this is bad food.” What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 559, 6, 55, 'do you do? You do not swallow it. You do not taste it for a few more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 559, 7, 55, 'seconds. You spit it out immediately. It is an immediate reaction as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 559, 8, 55, 'soon as bad food touches your tongue. God has given us a sensitive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 559, 9, 55, 'tongue that can immediately detect bad food. This is why He has given us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 559, 10, 55, 'a sense of taste. We immediately spit it out. That is a form of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 559, 11, 55, 'protection. Our sense of taste is a protection for us. In the same way,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 559, 12, 55, 'as soon as anything sinful comes to defile our heart, we should spit it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 559, 13, 55, 'out immediately. Do you do that? If so, you are a spiritual man. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 559, 14, 55, 'you read or see something in a magazine that tempts you and you turn the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 559, 15, 55, 'page immediately, then you are a spiritual man. It is like spitting out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 559, 16, 55, 'something from your mouth. If you do not do that, and you are just happy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 559, 17, 55, 'that you go to church, sing songs to praise the Lord, and everybody is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 559, 18, 55, 'happy with you, you are just a Pharisee. You are just fooling yourself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 559, 19, 55, 'that you are a Christian. You are a Pharisee, and the end of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 559, 20, 55, 'Pharisees will be your end too. This is what Jesus taught, and we need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 559, 21, 55, 'to take that very carefully.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 559, 22, 55, 'The Syrophoenician Woman');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 559, 23, 55, 'In Matthew 15:21, there is something wonderful that we can learn from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 559, 24, 55, 'the actions of Jesus. We can learn from Jesus’ words and actions too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 559, 25, 55, '“And Jesus went away from there and withdrew into the district of Tyre');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 559, 26, 55, 'and Sidon” (Matthew 15:21). Tyre and Sidon were outside the borders of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 559, 27, 55, 'Israel. Jesus hardly ever went outside the borders of Israel. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 559, 28, 55, 'one of the only times He went. And it is interesting why He went. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 560, 1, 55, 'says in Matthew 15:24, “I was sent only to the lost sheep of the house');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 560, 2, 55, 'of Israel.” That’s it. Then why did He go to Tyre and Sidon when He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 560, 3, 55, 'sent only to the lost sheep of the house of Israel? That is a very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 560, 4, 55, 'interesting thing, particularly when you see where He was. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 560, 5, 55, 'compare this with other gospels, He was by the Lake of Galilee or the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 560, 6, 55, 'Sea of Galilee. If you look at a map, Tyre and Sidon is probably about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 560, 7, 55, '80 kilometers away by road. Jesus did not travel by chariots. There was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 560, 8, 55, 'no other mode of transport available to Christ other than His Own two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 560, 9, 55, 'feet. Imagine how long it took for Him to walk 80 kilometers. Even if it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 560, 10, 55, 'was 60 kilometers, it would have taken him a whole day. If He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 560, 11, 55, 'continuously walking, it would have taken 16 or 17 hours. Why did He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 560, 12, 55, 'walk such a big distance? It is a very interesting question.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 560, 13, 55, 'There He beheld a Canaanite woman. The Canaanites were the people whom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 560, 14, 55, 'the Israelites were supposed to destroy completely. In the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 560, 15, 55, 'Testament, all the Canaanites were supposed to be killed. But the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 560, 16, 55, 'Israelites did not kill them all. Because they did not kill all of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 560, 17, 55, 'Canaanites, some of the Canaanites survived. Here is a Canaanite woman');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 560, 18, 55, 'whose ancestors survived from Joshua’s time (1500 years earlier!) down');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 560, 19, 55, 'to this generation. She came out from that region. She had heard about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 560, 20, 55, 'Jesus, and she came to Him and said, “Have mercy, Oh Lord, Son of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 560, 21, 55, 'David.” She was not an Israelite, but she recognized Jesus, and she');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 560, 22, 55, 'said, “Oh, Son of David, my daughter is cruelly demon-possessed.” She');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 560, 23, 55, 'did not bring her daughter with her. Her daughter was in the house maybe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 560, 24, 55, 'a few kilometers away. She came alone to where Jesus was staying. “He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 560, 25, 55, 'did not answer a word. His disciples came to Him and kept asking Him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 560, 26, 55, '‘Send her away. Send her away. She is just following after us and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 560, 27, 55, 'shouting at us as we are going down the road.’”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 560, 28, 55, 'Jesus Tests Our Persistence, Humility, and Faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 561, 1, 55, 'He answered and said to her, “I was not sent to you, folks. I was sent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 561, 2, 55, 'only to the sheep of the house of Israel.” One would think that Jesus is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 561, 3, 55, 'being a little hard here, but very often when Jesus spoke to people, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 561, 4, 55, 'was testing them. Remember this, when Jesus speaks to you, He is testing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 561, 5, 55, 'you as well. He was testing her. She did not know that Jesus had walked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 561, 6, 55, 'a whole day, almost 17 hours, only to help her. We know this because we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 561, 7, 55, 'read that immediately after that, they departed and went back to the Sea');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 561, 8, 55, 'of Galilee (Matthew 15:29). He walked 80 kilometers up, and 80');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 561, 9, 55, 'kilometers back, a total of 160 kilometers. Jesus walked at least 120');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 561, 10, 55, 'kilometers just to help one person. How can we say that a person who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 561, 11, 55, 'walks 120 kilometers to help one person was despising that person? He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 561, 12, 55, 'was testing her, and that is why He said, “I was not sent for you.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 561, 13, 55, 'She began to bow before Him and said, “Lord, please help me.” She would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 561, 14, 55, 'not give up. This is something that God always appreciates. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 561, 15, 55, 'appreciates when you come to Him in prayer and you persist even if it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 561, 16, 55, 'looks as if He has not answered your prayer. Do you do that when you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 561, 17, 55, 'pray for something? Or do you give up because you prayed once and you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 561, 18, 55, 'did not get it? You did not get it because you gave up. It looked as if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 561, 19, 55, 'the Lord rejected your request. The Lord loves those who seek Him with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 561, 20, 55, 'all their hearts because when you continue to seek God, you are thereby');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 561, 21, 55, 'expressing your faith in the fact that God is a good God. If you pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 561, 22, 55, 'once, don''t get what you asked for, and then give up, you are thereby');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 561, 23, 55, 'saying, “Well, I don''t know whether God is a good God. He does not seem');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 561, 24, 55, 'to care for me.” But when you persist, you are saying, “I am convinced');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 561, 25, 55, 'that God is a good God.” That is why Jesus said, “Men ought always to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 561, 26, 55, 'pray and never to faint” (Luke 18:1).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 561, 27, 55, 'Keep on asking like that widow who went to the judge again and again and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 561, 28, 55, 'said, “Give me justice against my enemy.” The judge finally answered,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 562, 1, 55, 'and Jesus said, “How much more your Heavenly Father will do for you?”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 562, 2, 55, '(Luke 18:1-6) In another parable, we read of a man who went to his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 562, 3, 55, 'neighbor''s house at midnight and kept on banging at the door saying, “I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 562, 4, 55, 'want some bread.” (Luke 11:8)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 562, 5, 55, 'In both of these parables on prayer, Jesus emphasized persistence. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 562, 6, 55, 'believe you will discover in the day of judgment, when you stand in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 562, 7, 55, 'Heaven, that there were so many things that God would have done for you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 562, 8, 55, 'if you had persisted a little more in prayer instead of being lazy about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 562, 9, 55, 'it, asking once, and giving up. If the woman had only asked once and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 562, 10, 55, 'then given up, the Lord would have replied that He was only sent to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 562, 11, 55, 'lost sheep of the house of Israel. She would have gone back to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 562, 12, 55, 'demon-possessed daughter and said, “Sorry, my girl. I went to Jesus, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 562, 13, 55, 'He said He could not help us.” But this mother would not let go. Thank');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 562, 14, 55, 'God she did not let go. Are your children suffering today because you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 562, 15, 55, 'gave up on praying for them? You prayed to Jesus once or twice for a son');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 562, 16, 55, 'or daughter who had gone astray. You did not get the answer immediately,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 562, 17, 55, 'and you gave up. You never experienced a miracle in your home. Your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 562, 18, 55, 'daughter and son would have been changed if you had persisted in prayer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 562, 19, 55, 'These are the lessons we learn from this example of a woman who persists');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 562, 20, 55, 'in prayer for her daughter. What a lot a mother can do for her children.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 562, 21, 55, 'Then Jesus said in Matthew 15:26, “It is not good to take the children''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 562, 22, 55, 'bread and throw it to the dogs.” One more insult. It was a test. “Let me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 562, 23, 55, 'see what she says. First of all, let me see whether she is persistent.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 562, 24, 55, 'She passed that test. Now let me see whether she is humble.” Two tests.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 562, 25, 55, 'Are you persistent? Are you humble? And she passed that test too. How');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 562, 26, 55, 'wonderful. Both were tough tests, but she passed. The Lord said, “You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 562, 27, 55, 'are a dog, I cannot give it to you.” And she said, “Yes, Lord. I take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 562, 28, 55, 'that place of a dog. I am nothing. I am a nobody. I deserve nothing from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 563, 1, 55, 'You, but cannot the dogs get at least the crumbs that fall from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 563, 2, 55, 'table?” And see how excited Jesus was when He heard that reply. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 563, 3, 55, 'what He was waiting for. When He first tested her, He wanted her to pass');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 563, 4, 55, 'the test of persistence. When He tested her the second time, He wanted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 563, 5, 55, 'her to pass the test of humility and faith. Humility and faith are very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 563, 6, 55, 'closely linked together, as we have seen again and again. She passed the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 563, 7, 55, 'test, and she said, “Lord, just give me a crumb. I''m not asking for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 563, 8, 55, 'children''s bread. One little crumb is enough to cast the demon out of my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 563, 9, 55, 'daughter.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 563, 10, 55, 'Seek for More Than Crumbs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 563, 11, 55, 'Physical and material blessings are the crumbs that fall from the table.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 563, 12, 55, 'We are not dogs. We are sons and daughters of the living God. We have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 563, 13, 55, 'right to eat the children''s bread. We do not have to sit at the foot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 563, 14, 55, 'the table like dogs and eat crumbs. The crumbs are material blessings.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 563, 15, 55, '“Lord, bless me materially. Give me a better house. Give me a better');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 563, 16, 55, 'car. Give me physical healing of my sickness.” I want to tell you, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 563, 17, 55, 'Jesus’ name, these are the crumbs. A lot of preachers are preaching the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 563, 18, 55, 'crumbs and treating people like dogs. They are saying, “Hey, you dogs,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 563, 19, 55, 'here are the crumbs the Master is throwing down from the table for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 563, 20, 55, 'dogs.” Is that what you want? Or do you want the children''s bread? What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 563, 21, 55, 'is the children''s bread? The children''s bread is to partake of God''s own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 563, 22, 55, 'nature. 2 Peter 1:4 says there are magnificent, precious promises that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 563, 23, 55, 'enable us to partake of God''s Own nature, and help us to manifest the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 563, 24, 55, 'life of Christ in our earthly bodies. That is the children''s bread. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 563, 25, 55, 'all the other blessings God gives us are the crumbs that fall from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 563, 26, 55, 'table.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 563, 27, 55, 'When she said that, Jesus said, “Oh, woman, your faith is great.” It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 563, 28, 55, 'very interesting to see that the only two instances where Jesus ever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 564, 1, 55, 'told anybody, “Your faith is great,” were both to non-Israelis or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 564, 2, 55, 'non-Jewish people. One was a Roman centurion (Matthew 8) and the other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 564, 3, 55, 'was a Canaanite woman (Matthew 15). Is it possible today that Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 564, 4, 55, 'would say to a non-Christian person, “Your faith in Me is great! Some of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 564, 5, 55, 'these Christians who claim to be born again believers do not have 10% of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 564, 6, 55, 'the faith that you have.” I have seen non-Christian people who have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 564, 7, 55, 'trusted the Lord for something and found remarkable answers to prayer. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 564, 8, 55, 'have seen born again Christian people who trust in themselves and are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 564, 9, 55, 'proud that they are born again, but who do not get 1% of what another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 564, 10, 55, 'person got who came from a non-Christian faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 564, 11, 55, 'What I want to say is this. If we come with persistence, faith, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 564, 12, 55, 'humility, there is a lot that we can get from God that we will not get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 564, 13, 55, 'if we don''t come with that persistence, humility, or faith. It says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 564, 14, 55, '“Her daughter was healed at once. Be it done for you as you wish,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 564, 15, 55, 'according to your faith. You get it.” How terrible it would have been if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 564, 16, 55, 'she had gone away and missed that opportunity, because Jesus never came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 564, 17, 55, 'back to Tyre and Sidon again. Sometimes there is one last opportunity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 564, 18, 55, 'You have to trust God and expect Him to do a miracle for you. And you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 564, 19, 55, 'can miss it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 564, 20, 55, 'Jesus’ Ministry Gave Glory to God, Not Himself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 564, 21, 55, 'In Matthew 15:29-30, it reads, “Departing from there, Jesus went along');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 564, 22, 55, 'the Sea of Galilee, and having gone up to the mountain, He was sitting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 564, 23, 55, 'there. And great multitudes came to Him and bringing with them the lame,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 564, 24, 55, 'the crippled, the blind, the dumb, and many others. And they laid them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 564, 25, 55, 'down at His feet; and He healed them all, every single one.” The number');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 564, 26, 55, 'of times we read this happening in the Gospel of Matthew is an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 564, 27, 55, 'attestation by God of the Messianic ministry of Jesus Christ. Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 564, 28, 55, '15:31 says, “The multitude marveled as they saw the dumb speaking, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 565, 1, 55, 'cripple restored, and the lame walking, and the blind seeing; and they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 565, 2, 55, 'glorified the God of Israel.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 565, 3, 55, 'That is wonderful how Jesus deflected the glory away from Himself and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 565, 4, 55, 'made them glorify God for healing. This is so different from today''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 565, 5, 55, 'preachers, who seek to turn all the glory upon themselves when they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 565, 6, 55, 'fulfill a ministry. They get people to get up and testify, “Hey, how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 565, 7, 55, 'were you when you came to this meeting? Do you have some sickness? And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 565, 8, 55, 'how are you now? You’re healed!” And though they say, “Let''s praise the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 565, 9, 55, 'Lord,” the person is actually trying to get glory for himself. Here it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 565, 10, 55, 'says they “glorified the God of Israel.” They glorified the God of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 565, 11, 55, 'Israel when they saw these amazing, genuine healings of hundreds of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 565, 12, 55, 'people. There are many things we can learn from what Jesus taught us by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 565, 13, 55, 'how He lived.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 565, 14, 55, 'Jesus Was Concerned for the Multitude');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 565, 15, 55, 'In Matthew 15:32, it reads, “And Jesus called His disciples, and said to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 565, 16, 55, 'them, ’I feel compassion for this multitude, because they have remained');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 565, 17, 55, 'with Me now for three days and have nothing to eat, and I do not wish to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 565, 18, 55, 'send them away hungry, lest they faint on the way.’” Look at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 565, 19, 55, 'consideration that Jesus had. “These guys have been with Me for three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 565, 20, 55, 'days. They have not eaten a thing. Now if they walk back, some of them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 565, 21, 55, 'will faint on the way. The strong ones may get home, but some may faint');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 565, 22, 55, 'along the way,” and Jesus did not want that to happen. So He says, “We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 565, 23, 55, 'have to give them something to eat.” And He said, “I don’t want to send');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 565, 24, 55, 'them away hungry.” And the disciples said to Him, “Where can we get so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 565, 25, 55, 'many loaves in a desolate place to satisfy such a great multitude?” And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 565, 26, 55, 'Jesus said to them, “How many loaves do you have?” They said, “Seven,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 565, 27, 55, 'and a few small fish.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 565, 28, 55, 'He took the seven loaves and the fish and gave thanks. This is Jesus’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 566, 1, 55, 'habit. He always gave thanks before eating. “Father, I deserve nothing,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 566, 2, 55, 'but You have given me food. Thank you so much.” Thanksgiving is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 566, 3, 55, 'expression of a humble man acknowledging that whatever he has is a gift');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 566, 4, 55, 'of God. This is a wonderful habit to develop. “He gave thanks, broke the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 566, 5, 55, 'bread, and started giving it to the disciples. The disciples gave it to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 566, 6, 55, 'the multitudes, and they all ate and were satisfied. They picked up what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 566, 7, 55, 'was left over of the broken pieces, seven large baskets full. Those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 566, 8, 55, 'ate were four thousand besides women and children. And again He sent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 566, 9, 55, 'away the multitudes and then He got into the boat” (Matthew 15:36-39).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 566, 10, 55, 'This is the second instance where Jesus fed the multitude. He was always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 566, 11, 55, 'concerned.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 566, 12, 55, 'There’s another thing to notice here: Have you ever seen anyone spending');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 566, 13, 55, 'three days at a conference without eating? They were not thirsty. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 566, 14, 55, 'probably drank something, but they were hungry and yet they never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 566, 15, 55, 'complained. And it is not a small number. There were four thousand men');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 566, 16, 55, 'plus women and children (Matthew 15:38). It probably means seven to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 566, 17, 55, 'eight thousand people were there. They were with Jesus for three days');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 566, 18, 55, 'listening to Him morning, noon, and evening. They were sleeping on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 566, 19, 55, 'hillside in the evening. The children did this too. Waking up the next');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 566, 20, 55, 'morning, they had another day of the same. They slept there, woke up the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 566, 21, 55, 'next day, and did the same thing again. It was a three-day conference,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 566, 22, 55, 'morning till night, and with no food. We will have a revival if we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 566, 23, 55, 'conferences like that, where food is not the main thing, but where we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 566, 24, 55, 'are all so eager to hear the Word of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 566, 25, 56, 'Chapter 55 What to Seek to Build the Church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 566, 26, 56, '“The Pharisees and Sadducees came up, and testing Jesus, they asked Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 566, 27, 56, 'to show them a sign from heaven” (Matthew 16:1).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 566, 28, 56, 'It is interesting that the Pharisees and Sadducees were never eager to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 567, 1, 56, 'sit at Jesus’ feet like Mary to learn from Him. Imagine that! They had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 567, 2, 56, 'the greatest Preacher in the world, the greatest Man of God, the Son of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 567, 3, 56, 'God Himself, walking in their midst, and yet all the Pharisees and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 567, 4, 56, 'Sadducees did was spend their time arguing with Him and testing Him. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 567, 5, 56, 'see the same thing happening today. There are some wonderful godly men');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 567, 6, 56, '-- but not many -- here and there across the world. They stand for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 567, 7, 56, 'truth and are real prophets who speak the truth of God without any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 567, 8, 56, 'compromise. There are many believers who pick holes in some doctrine of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 567, 9, 56, 'theirs or find some little fault in them to criticize. Instead, they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 567, 10, 56, 'could have gotten so much more if they were just willing to sit at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 567, 11, 56, 'feet of these men and learn what God had to teach them. Examine yourself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 567, 12, 56, 'and see whether you are guilty of that crime.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 567, 13, 56, 'The Danger of Seeking for Signs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 567, 14, 56, 'The Pharisees and Sadducees came to test Him, and they asked Him, “Show');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 567, 15, 56, 'us a sign or do a miracle for us.” Jesus did not always give the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 567, 16, 56, 'answer every time. He began by saying, “When it is evening, you say it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 567, 17, 56, 'will be fair weather because the sky is red. In the morning, you say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 567, 18, 56, 'there will be a storm today because the sky is threatening and red. Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 567, 19, 56, 'you know how to discern the appearance of the sky, but cannot discern');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 567, 20, 56, 'the signs of the times?” In other words, Jesus is saying, “You guys are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 567, 21, 56, 'so sharp in the things you can see with your physical eyes, but you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 567, 22, 56, 'totally blind in your heart. You cannot understand the signs of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 567, 23, 56, 'times in which you live.” Notice that expression - “signs of the times.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 567, 24, 56, 'We also need to recognize the signs of the times in which we live. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 567, 25, 56, 'said there will be a great falling away from the faith. Deceiving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 567, 26, 56, 'spirits will come in. Paul spoke about deceiving spirits coming into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 567, 27, 56, 'Christendom and great apostasy before the coming of the Lord. Do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 567, 28, 56, 'recognize the signs of the times? Do you recognize the drift we see in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 568, 1, 56, 'Christendom today, away from godliness and holiness, towards');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 568, 2, 56, 'entertainment, superficial Christianity, academic study of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 568, 3, 56, 'Scriptures, and knowledge rather than experience? It is one of the signs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 568, 4, 56, 'of the great falling away that people are more interested in prosperity,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 568, 5, 56, 'money, and healing than they are in holiness. People try to cover their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 568, 6, 56, 'lives by supporting things like orphanages, Bible schools, and mission');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 568, 7, 56, 'work, but they are hard set on their own covetousness. This is all an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 568, 8, 56, 'indication that Christianity has fallen away from the truth. Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 568, 9, 56, 'leaders are more interested in pushing people down and demonstrating');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 568, 10, 56, 'their so-called psychic powers in a meeting rather than leading people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 568, 11, 56, 'to a godly life. Do you recognize the signs of the times?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 568, 12, 56, 'Jesus said in Matthew 16:4, “An evil and adulterous generation seeks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 568, 13, 56, 'after a sign.” We are not supposed to seek God for a miracle. If you do,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 568, 14, 56, 'you are a part of this evil and adulterous generation. God will do a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 568, 15, 56, 'miracle when He feels like it, when it is His will. He will do a miracle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 568, 16, 56, 'when it will accomplish some purpose of His. But He is not going to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 568, 17, 56, 'miracles according to our whims and fancies. God will not do a miracle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 568, 18, 56, 'every time we ask for one. “An evil and adulterous generation seeks for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 568, 19, 56, 'miracles, and no miracle or sign will be given to them except the sign');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 568, 20, 56, 'of Jonah.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 568, 21, 56, 'In the margin of my Bible, the word “sign” is an “attesting miracle.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 568, 22, 56, 'Many people look for that. If you look for that, you are part of this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 568, 23, 56, 'evil and adulterous generation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 568, 24, 56, 'Jesus said there is only one sign that will be given, and that is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 568, 25, 56, 'sign of Jonah. In an earlier study, we discussed that Jonah coming out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 568, 26, 56, 'of the fish’s mouth is a picture of the resurrection of Jesus Christ. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 568, 27, 56, 'is a picture of Jesus coming out from three days and three nights in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 568, 28, 56, 'heart of the earth. Resurrection is the main sign to which Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 569, 1, 56, 'referred. That is why the apostles always spoke about themselves as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 569, 2, 56, 'witnesses of Christ’s resurrection. We must also be witnesses of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 569, 3, 56, 'Christ’s resurrection.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 569, 4, 56, 'Beware of Hypocrisy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 569, 5, 56, 'The disciples came together and had forgotten to take bread. Jesus said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 569, 6, 56, 'to them after this discussion to watch out and beware of the leaven of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 569, 7, 56, 'the Pharisees and Sadducees. The disciples began to discuss among');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 569, 8, 56, 'themselves. They said, “Hey, He must be saying that we were foolish not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 569, 9, 56, 'to take some bread with us to eat along the way.” I am surprised that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 569, 10, 56, 'those disciples thought that the leaven of the Pharisees and Sadducees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 569, 11, 56, 'was referring to bread. I know leaven is used in bread, but the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 569, 12, 56, 'Pharisees and Sadducees were not bakers or sold bread in some store. No,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 569, 13, 56, 'a young person would have said, “Hey, that does not refer to bread.” But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 569, 14, 56, 'somehow, they began to think of bread, and Jesus was aware of this.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 569, 15, 56, 'Jesus said, “You men of little faith! Why do you discuss among');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 569, 16, 56, 'yourselves that you have no bread? Do you not yet understand that bread');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 569, 17, 56, 'is no problem for me? How many baskets did you pick up after I fed the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 569, 18, 56, 'five thousand with five loaves? Do you not remember the seven loaves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 569, 19, 56, 'that I used to feed four thousand? How many large baskets did you pick');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 569, 20, 56, 'up then? How is it that you still think that food is the thing that I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 569, 21, 56, 'talking about?” (Matthew 16:5-11)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 569, 22, 56, 'Jesus was not speaking about food. He said, “Do you not understand that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 569, 23, 56, 'I did not speak to you concerning bread? I was speaking about the leaven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 569, 24, 56, 'of the Pharisees and Sadducees.” What is the leaven of the Pharisees and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 569, 25, 56, 'Sadducees? Luke 12:1, “Beware of the leaven of the Pharisees, which is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 569, 26, 56, 'hypocrisy.” The leaven of the Pharisees is hypocrisy. What does leaven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 569, 27, 56, 'do in a bit of dough? It spreads and puffs up the whole thing. When you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 569, 28, 56, 'do not use leaven, the bread is flat, and it is normal size. When you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 570, 1, 56, 'put leaven in the bread, it puffs up with a lot of empty holes in it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 570, 2, 56, 'just like regular bread.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 570, 3, 56, 'That is what hypocrisy does. You don''t need much leaven to blow up a bit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 570, 4, 56, 'of dough. A little of bit of leaven in our heart is going to make us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 570, 5, 56, 'appear very big in the eyes of others, but we will be like bread with a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 570, 6, 56, 'lot of holes inside us. There will be a lot of empty spaces. This is how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 570, 7, 56, 'most Christians are. They like to make a big impression on people. Their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 570, 8, 56, 'doctrines are right. The Pharisees certainly had right doctrines, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 570, 9, 56, 'this leaven puffed them up. Jesus said, “I was trying to warn you about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 570, 10, 56, 'getting proud, and not asking whether we had enough bread.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 570, 11, 56, 'Hypocrisy Is Worse Than Starvation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 570, 12, 56, 'It is very important for us to see this. Which is more important? Food,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 570, 13, 56, 'or freedom from hypocrisy? That is basically the question here. What did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 570, 14, 56, 'Jesus teach here? Even if you do not have food to eat or if you forgot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 570, 15, 56, 'to bring bread, never mind. Make sure you do not have hypocrisy in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 570, 16, 56, 'life. If I am free from hypocrisy, it does not matter even if I starve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 570, 17, 56, 'to death.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 570, 18, 56, 'I do not know if you believe that. I do not know whether you believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 570, 19, 56, 'that it is better to die without food than to have hypocrisy. Many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 570, 20, 56, 'people do not seem to hate hypocrisy like that. Food is necessary for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 570, 21, 56, 'life, but Jesus told us to beware of hypocrisy. Do not worry that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 570, 22, 56, 'did not bring bread to eat. Beware of hypocrisy. That is more dangerous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 570, 23, 56, 'than even not having enough food to eat. That is basically what He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 570, 24, 56, 'trying to say here. If you have understood that, then you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 570, 25, 56, 'understood the message from this passage. “Then the disciples understood');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 570, 26, 56, 'that” (Matthew 16:12).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 570, 27, 56, 'Revelation Comes from God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 570, 28, 56, 'Matthew 16:13 says, “Now when Jesus came to the district of Caesarea');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 571, 1, 56, 'Philippi, He began asking His disciples, ‘Who do people say that the Son');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 571, 2, 56, 'of Man is?’” Jesus didn''t ask this because He cared about what people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 571, 3, 56, 'thought of Him. He never cared for people''s opinions, not even once. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 571, 4, 56, 'could not care less for what people said or thought about Him. But He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 571, 5, 56, 'was trying to ask His disciples how much people in Israel understood');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 571, 6, 56, 'about who He was, and hardly anybody seemed to know who He was. Some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 571, 7, 56, 'said Jesus was John the Baptist. Others said He was Elijah or Jeremiah');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 571, 8, 56, 'or one of the prophets who had come back to life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 571, 9, 56, 'Then Jesus asked the question He really wanted to ask. Jesus said, “Who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 571, 10, 56, 'do you say that I am?” In other words, “Forget what the others are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 571, 11, 56, 'saying, but who do you say that I am?” Simon Peter got up and said, “You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 571, 12, 56, 'are the Christ, the Son of the living God.” And immediately, Jesus said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 571, 13, 56, '“You are blessed, Simon Barjona, because you did not understand this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 571, 14, 56, 'with your human cleverness. It is not flesh and blood that revealed this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 571, 15, 56, 'to you, but my Father in Heaven. Give the glory to the Father who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 571, 16, 56, 'allowed you to know who I am” (Matthew 16:15-17).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 571, 17, 56, 'It is very, very important to always recognize that whatever we know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 571, 18, 56, 'about Jesus has come by divine revelation. It is not because we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 571, 19, 56, 'cleverer or smarter than anybody else. It is because God was pleased to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 571, 20, 56, 'give us revelation as to who Christ is. There were so many cleverer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 571, 21, 56, 'people than Peter who did not recognize Jesus as the Way of forgiveness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 571, 22, 56, 'There are lots of people cleverer than you and me around us here on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 571, 23, 56, 'earth who do not know Christ. Jesus said, “You are blessed, Simon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 571, 24, 56, 'Barjona, because flesh and blood did not reveal this to you.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 571, 25, 56, 'The word “revelation” is fundamental here. It is by revelation that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 571, 26, 56, 'know Christ. It is not by intellectual study or argument. This is why,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 571, 27, 56, 'when people come to argue with me about something in the Bible, I say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 571, 28, 56, '“I am not interested in argument, because if I convince you by some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 572, 1, 56, 'argument from Scripture, it will only prove that I am cleverer than you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 572, 2, 56, 'or that I know the Bible better than you. It does not mean that truth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 572, 3, 56, 'has triumphed. What I say may be the truth, but argument only proves who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 572, 4, 56, 'is cleverer.” It is revelation that leads people to know, “Oh, this is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 572, 5, 56, 'Jesus.” Revelation comes to those who have a need in their life, not to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 572, 6, 56, 'those who just study. So please bear this important thing in mind:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 572, 7, 56, 'whenever you read the Scripture, read it to get revelation, or its inner');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 572, 8, 56, 'meaning. Revelation on Jesus, which only God can give you, comes through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 572, 9, 56, 'the Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 572, 10, 56, 'The Church Is Built on the Rock of Revelation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 572, 11, 56, 'Jesus then speaks about the church in Matthew 16:18, “I also say to you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 572, 12, 56, 'that you are Peter, and upon this rock I will build My church.” Jesus is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 572, 13, 56, 'saying, “Peter, you have seen Me as Christ, the Son of the living God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 572, 14, 56, 'Now I say to you, you are only Peter or Petros. You are a small little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 572, 15, 56, 'stone, but on this rock, (“Petra,” not “Petros,” which is Peter’s name),');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 572, 16, 56, 'I will build My church.” In other words, Jesus would build His church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 572, 17, 56, 'based on this revelation that Christ is the Son of the living God. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 572, 18, 56, 'was contrasting the two. Jesus is not saying, “You are Peter, and I will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 572, 19, 56, 'build My church on you.” This is the way some people have interpreted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 572, 20, 56, 'it, which is totally wrong. Peter is such a shaky person. I would not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 572, 21, 56, 'want to be a part of a church that is built on him. The church is built');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 572, 22, 56, 'on the revealed Jesus Christ. What Jesus was saying to Peter is that he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 572, 23, 56, 'received a revelation from heaven about who Jesus was. “On this rock --');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 572, 24, 56, 'of revelation of Who Christ is -- I will build My church.” You cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 572, 25, 56, 'build a church without revelation from heaven as to Who Christ is.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 572, 26, 56, 'Jesus Christ: Fully God and Fully Man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 572, 27, 56, 'In those days, the important question was whether Christ was God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 572, 28, 56, 'because He looked like an ordinary man. The people said, “This cannot be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 573, 1, 56, 'God.” In spite of the attesting miracles, they did not accept Him as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 573, 2, 56, 'God, and they killed Him. Today, however, the question is, “Is Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 573, 3, 56, 'really a Man?” In those days, there was no doubt that He was a man; the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 573, 4, 56, 'question was whether He was God. Today, Christians say that Jesus is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 573, 5, 56, 'God, but most Christians have not understood that He was also a Man. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 573, 6, 56, 'need to see Christ revealed from heaven as a Man today just as much as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 573, 7, 56, 'He was revealed to them as God then. Let us understand this very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 573, 8, 56, 'clearly. Christ was fully God and fully Man. We need to get equal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 573, 9, 56, 'revelation on both. Because He is Almighty God, we worship Him. We pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 573, 10, 56, 'to Him. We believe He can do anything. We believe He has authority over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 573, 11, 56, 'everything on Heaven and Earth. We believe every name must bow at that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 573, 12, 56, 'name and acknowledge that Jesus Christ is Lord because He is God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 573, 13, 56, 'Because Jesus is Man, I can follow Him. I can overcome sin like He did.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 573, 14, 56, 'I can serve the Father like Jesus served the Father. I can be loved by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 573, 15, 56, 'my Father as Jesus was loved on Earth. I can be filled with the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 573, 16, 56, 'Spirit like Jesus was filled with the Holy Spirit on earth. I can have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 573, 17, 56, 'gifts to serve my Heavenly Father like Jesus had. Most Christians have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 573, 18, 56, 'seen Jesus as God, but they have not seen Him as a Man. That is why they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 573, 19, 56, 'live defeated lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 573, 20, 56, 'We need to see Christ as totally God and totally Man. Blessed are you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 573, 21, 56, 'who have received revelation from God the Father that Christ came to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 573, 22, 56, 'earth as a Man and lived on earth as a Man. He was tempted like us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 573, 23, 56, 'sin, but did not sin, and overcame temptation as a Man. When you get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 573, 24, 56, 'that revelation from God, you will come into a life of overcoming sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 573, 25, 56, 'The main reason why a lot of sincere Christians live lives defeated by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 573, 26, 56, 'sin is because they accept defeat. The tragedy is not that they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 573, 27, 56, 'defeated by sin. The tragedy is that they accept it. They say, “We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 573, 28, 56, 'cannot live better lives than this.” The great tragedy is that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 574, 1, 56, 'accept it. They believe that Christ overcame sin because He was God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 574, 2, 56, 'that He could not possibly be tempted to sin like we are, even though');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 574, 3, 56, 'the Bible says that plainly. All such people live defeated lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 574, 4, 56, 'They could be better than others. There could be a measure of holiness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 574, 5, 56, 'in them, but there is no spiritual development in holiness. That is what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 574, 6, 56, 'I have seen through many years of observation of Christians. We need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 574, 7, 56, 'revelation that Christ is God. And we need revelation that Christ was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 574, 8, 56, 'Man who came in flesh like us. Christ did not come in sinful flesh.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 574, 9, 56, 'There was no sin in Him. He was born holy, but He had a flesh, which is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 574, 10, 56, 'one’s own will. Jesus had to deny His will every single day of His life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 574, 11, 56, 'in order to please His Father.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 574, 12, 56, 'It is on this rock of revelation that the church is built. You cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 574, 13, 56, 'build a church if you do not see Christ as totally God and totally Man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 574, 14, 56, 'On this revelation from heaven, Jesus will build His church. All the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 574, 15, 56, 'gates of hell, or the powers of spiritual darkness, will never be able');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 574, 16, 56, 'to prevail against that church. It is a very comforting thought that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 574, 17, 56, 'church Christ is building will last forever. Powers of darkness will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 574, 18, 56, 'be able to prevail over it in eternity, or even now. Is this the type of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 574, 19, 56, 'church you belong to?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 574, 20, 56, 'Seek a Church That Jesus Is Building');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 574, 21, 56, 'If you belong to a church that is full of strife, quarrelling, hate,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 574, 22, 56, 'backbiting, gossip, and fighting going on all the time, that is not the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 574, 23, 56, 'church that Jesus is building, because it says here, “The church that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 574, 24, 56, 'build, the powers of darkness will not be able to overpower it” (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 574, 25, 56, '16:18).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 574, 26, 56, 'That means these sins will not be able to come into that church. Why is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 574, 27, 56, 'it like that in so many churches? It is because it is not the church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 574, 28, 56, 'Jesus is building. We need to be a part of a church that Jesus is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 575, 1, 56, 'building, where spiritual death does not have power, because we live in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 575, 2, 56, 'resurrection power. Resurrection power can overcome the forces of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 575, 3, 56, 'spiritual death. They did not have such overcoming power in the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 575, 4, 56, 'Testament because Jesus had not risen from the dead. But when Jesus rose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 575, 5, 56, 'from the dead, He communicated that resurrection power to all His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 575, 6, 56, 'disciples. If you are a wholehearted disciple of Jesus, you can have an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 575, 7, 56, 'experience of that resurrection power in your spirit fully here on earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 575, 8, 56, 'and a taste of it even in your body. This is God''s will.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 575, 9, 56, 'Authority to Build the Church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 575, 10, 56, 'The Lord said to Peter, “I will give you the keys to the kingdom of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 575, 11, 56, 'heaven; and whatever you bind on earth will be bound in heaven, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 575, 12, 56, 'whatever you loose on earth will be loosed in heaven” (Matthew 16:19).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 575, 13, 56, 'Keys are a symbol of authority in the Bible. Wherever there is a mention');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 575, 14, 56, 'of keys in the Old Testament, it speaks of authority. Jesus says in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 575, 15, 56, 'Revelation 1:18, “I have the keys of hell and death.” He is the one who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 575, 16, 56, 'determines when a wholehearted child of His dies. Those keys are in His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 575, 17, 56, 'hands, and until He opens the door, a wholehearted disciple of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 575, 18, 56, 'cannot die. There are people whose aim in life is different; they call');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 575, 19, 56, 'themselves Christians, but their real aim in life is to make money or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 575, 20, 56, 'something like that. They will perhaps die before their time. The gates');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 575, 21, 56, 'of death may be open for them before that. But for a wholehearted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 575, 22, 56, 'disciple of Jesus, it is pretty clear: you cannot die before your time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 575, 23, 56, 'Keys speak of authority. The Lord said to Peter, “I am going to give you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 575, 24, 56, 'authority, and whatever you bind on earth will be bound in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 575, 25, 56, 'heavenlies.” It is not in the third heaven where God is, but in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 575, 26, 56, 'heavenlies, where the devil dwells. The devil is not in Hell; he is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 575, 27, 56, 'the heavenlies. It is probably the second heaven between what we know as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 575, 28, 56, 'the sky and God''s presence.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 576, 1, 56, 'Jesus said, “I will give you power and authority to bind those satanic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 576, 2, 56, 'forces that seek to bring confusion on earth. I will give you power to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 576, 3, 56, 'loose certain people who have been gripped by Satan here on this earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 576, 4, 56, 'and set them free.” What this teaches is that, in order to build the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 576, 5, 56, 'church, we need spiritual authority. Without spiritual authority, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 576, 6, 56, 'cannot build the church. No matter how gifted you are or how much of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 576, 7, 56, 'Bible you know, you cannot build a church without spiritual authority.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 576, 8, 56, 'The Lord commissioned Peter to build His church. He gave him authority.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 576, 9, 56, 'If the Lord commissions you today to build His church, He will give you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 576, 10, 56, 'authority. Without that authority, you will not be able to build His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 576, 11, 56, 'church. In order to have that authority, we must seek God for it. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 576, 12, 56, 'need the anointing of the Holy Spirit, and we need to be filled with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 576, 13, 56, 'Holy Spirit. We need to live a clean life because if our life is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 576, 14, 56, 'clean, the Spirit of God will not support us or endorse us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 576, 15, 56, 'The Way of the Cross');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 576, 16, 56, 'Jesus then warned His disciples not to tell others who He was. The other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 576, 17, 56, 'thing that is required to build the church is an understanding of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 576, 18, 56, 'way of the cross. Spiritual authority alone is not enough. A true');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 576, 19, 56, 'disciple of Jesus who wants to build the church of Christ must have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 576, 20, 56, 'spiritual authority. However, he must also know the way of the cross.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 576, 21, 56, 'That is why it says in Matthew 16:21, “From that time…”. This means that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 576, 22, 56, 'from the time that Jesus spoke about building the church, He taught His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 576, 23, 56, 'disciples about the fact that He is going to go to the cross, suffer,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 576, 24, 56, 'die, and be raised up on the third day. Peter took Him aside and began');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 576, 25, 56, 'to rebuke Him. He could not understand that. He said, “What do you mean');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 576, 26, 56, 'about this cross? I thought You just gave me authority to bind all these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 576, 27, 56, 'forces of darkness. How can anybody come and take You, then? No, I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 576, 28, 56, 'going to defend You. God forbid it! Lord, that is never going to happen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 577, 1, 56, 'to you. I am not going to let anybody take You and spit on You or kill');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 577, 2, 56, 'You” (Matthew 16:22). Peter spoke in love. He really loved his Master so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 577, 3, 56, 'much.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 577, 4, 56, 'But Jesus turned around and said to him, “Get behind Me, Satan! You are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 577, 5, 56, 'a stumbling block to Me” (Matthew 16:23). Everyone who avoids the way of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 577, 6, 56, 'the cross is a stumbling block to Christ. Their mind is set on their own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 577, 7, 56, 'interests, and not God''s interests. There we understand what is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 577, 8, 56, 'meaning of the cross. When the cross comes into our life, our mind is no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 577, 9, 56, 'longer set on our interests, but on God''s interests. If your mind is set');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 577, 10, 56, 'on your own interests in life, no matter what you may say, you have not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 577, 11, 56, 'understood the way of the cross.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 577, 12, 56, 'This is why Jesus rebuked Peter and called him Satan. Just a few couple');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 577, 13, 56, 'of minutes earlier, He said, “You are blessed, Simon Peter, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 577, 14, 56, 'flesh and blood has not revealed this to you, but My Father in heaven.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 577, 15, 56, 'A few moments later, Jesus called him Satan. It is interesting how the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 577, 16, 56, 'Lord called His closest co-worker Satan because he was trying to prevent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 577, 17, 56, 'Him from going the way of the cross. Jesus went on to say in Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 577, 18, 56, '16:24, “This cross is not only for Me. If you want to follow Me, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 577, 19, 56, 'need to take up the cross too.” What does that mean? Matthew 16:23');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 577, 20, 56, 'explains it. When you take up the cross, you stop seeking your own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 577, 21, 56, 'interests, and you begin to seek God''s interests. That is the mark of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 577, 22, 56, 'man who has taken up the cross. Now you understand the cross. If you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 577, 23, 56, 'seeking your own interests in life, you have not understood the cross.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 577, 24, 56, 'In fact, you are a stumbling block, according to Matthew 16:23. Any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 577, 25, 56, 'Christian who is seeking his own interest is a stumbling block to God’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 577, 26, 56, 'work on earth and a stumbling block to building the church. Let us take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 577, 27, 56, 'that seriously. May God help us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 577, 28, 57, 'Chapter 56 Wholeheartedly Seeking God’s Interests');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 578, 1, 57, 'In Matthew 16:24, Jesus tells the disciples for the first time about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 578, 2, 57, 'building the church. This is the first time in His life, and the first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 578, 3, 57, 'time in the Bible, that the word “church” occurs. They probably did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 578, 4, 57, 'even know what it meant. Jesus did not come to make holy individuals');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 578, 5, 57, 'alone. He came to build holy individuals into a fellowship called the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 578, 6, 57, 'church, which is the family of God. In other places, this is called the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 578, 7, 57, 'body of Christ. The relationships between the members of the church were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 578, 8, 57, 'to be exactly like the members in our body. Many people have not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 578, 9, 57, 'understood what Jesus meant when He spoke about the church in Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 578, 10, 57, '16:18. We need to look at Matthew 16:18 before we look at Matthew 16:24');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 578, 11, 57, 'because it is all in the same context. We looked a little bit in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 578, 12, 57, 'previous chapter, and saw that first of all, we need revelation from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 578, 13, 57, 'heaven as to Who Christ really is in order to build His church. Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 578, 14, 57, 'is fully God and fully Man. He is the One Who we have to worship and Who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 578, 15, 57, 'we can follow in our daily life and in our family life. We also need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 578, 16, 57, 'spiritual authority to build this church. You cannot build this church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 578, 17, 57, 'with human wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 578, 18, 57, 'Qualifications to Build the Church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 578, 19, 57, 'First of all, we need revelation from heaven. You cannot build the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 578, 20, 57, 'church simply because you studied the Bible. The Pharisees studied the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 578, 21, 57, 'Bible, but they could not build the church. Peter received revelation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 578, 22, 57, 'from heaven. That is the first thing. On that rock, the church is built.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 578, 23, 57, 'Unfortunately, Christians have moved away from revelation, towards mere');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 578, 24, 57, 'study and understanding. That is the reason for the drift in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 578, 25, 57, 'Christianity towards the compromise of Babylon.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 578, 26, 57, 'Second, we need authority. Jesus said in Matthew 16:19, “I give you the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 578, 27, 57, 'keys of the kingdom of heaven.”) We cannot build the church without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 578, 28, 57, 'spiritual authority that God has given us to do His work. You cannot do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 579, 1, 57, 'it with human authority. You cannot serve God just because somebody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 579, 2, 57, 'appoints you as a director, pastor, or bishop. That is a human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 579, 3, 57, 'appointment. You cannot build the church with that. You need spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 579, 4, 57, 'authority that Christ Himself gives you from His nail-pierced hands. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 579, 5, 57, 'you do not receive that, then you are not going to build the church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 579, 6, 57, 'Defining the Church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 579, 7, 57, 'Let me reemphasize what I mean by “the church is the body of Christ.” I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 579, 8, 57, 'am not referring to individual holy people sitting together in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 579, 9, 57, 'building. That is a congregation. Today, we think that a church is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 579, 10, 57, 'building. Or we may think the church is a denomination, like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 579, 11, 57, 'Methodist Church or the Baptist Church. The church that Jesus spoke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 579, 12, 57, 'about is a body. It is not an organization. It is an organism, like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 579, 13, 57, 'human body. Different members of the body are all functioning together');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 579, 14, 57, 'perfectly because of one reason: they are all connected to the head. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 579, 15, 57, 'only reason my two hands work together is not because they are always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 579, 16, 57, 'hanging around with each other. It is not because they are good friends.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 579, 17, 57, 'What many Christians have is nothing more than friendship. It is like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 579, 18, 57, 'two hands hanging around with each other. But fellowship is where these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 579, 19, 57, 'two hands can work together perfectly, like hands playing a piano,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 579, 20, 57, 'because they are both perfectly connected to the head. If one hand is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 579, 21, 57, 'paralyzed, its connection with the head is gone. It cannot work with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 579, 22, 57, 'other. It is always because of a break of connection with our Head,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 579, 23, 57, 'Jesus Christ, that we cannot work together with someone else.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 579, 24, 57, 'Building the church, which is the real body of Christ, is not the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 579, 25, 57, 'as building an organization called a church. The real body of Christ is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 579, 26, 57, 'where the people in a local congregation are fitted together like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 579, 27, 57, 'members of a body working together. That can only happen if each member');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 579, 28, 57, 'is directly connected to the Head. It is paralysis that prevents one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 580, 1, 57, 'member from working with another. Whether it is 10 people (or 11 in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 580, 2, 57, 'Jesus’ case) or a hundred people, a church is where people can work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 580, 3, 57, 'together. To work together is like building a house. There is a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 580, 4, 57, 'difference between 20,000 bricks lying on the roadside, and those 20,000');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 580, 5, 57, 'bricks built together in a house. This is because the bricks used to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 580, 6, 57, 'build a house are interconnected in the walls and in the concrete in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 580, 7, 57, 'roof. A house is made of little stones put together along with steel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 580, 8, 57, 'rods. Otherwise, the bricks are just stones on the road. Anybody can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 580, 9, 57, 'walk off with them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 580, 10, 57, 'That is what happens in many churches. People say, “You have stolen one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 580, 11, 57, 'of my sheep! Why did you take this person from my church?” Have you ever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 580, 12, 57, 'tried stealing a brick from a solidly built house? How in the world can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 580, 13, 57, 'you steal a brick from a solidly built house? It is impossible. You need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 580, 14, 57, 'to use a hammer and break that house to take a brick out of it because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 580, 15, 57, 'it is stuck with cement and a lot of other bricks. But anyone can walk');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 580, 16, 57, 'off with bricks that are lying loose on the roadside. If anybody says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 580, 17, 57, '“Somebody has taken one of my members from my church!” it is because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 580, 18, 57, 'they were not built into a body. They were a loose pile of bricks lying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 580, 19, 57, 'there. In the same way, our human body is another picture of the church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 580, 20, 57, 'The church is a house, and the church is a body. Can somebody detach my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 580, 21, 57, 'hand and take it off? Yes, he can if it is an artificial hand. They make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 580, 22, 57, 'artificial hands now-a-days which look so similar to human hands. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 580, 23, 57, 'have exactly the same color and shape. But nuts-and-bolts are used to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 580, 24, 57, 'fit it into my body. If it is fitted with nuts and bolts, then somebody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 580, 25, 57, 'can unscrew it and take it off of the hand. But a real hand, which is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 580, 26, 57, 'part of the body, connected to the head, can never be taken. You have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 580, 27, 57, 'cut it off or amputate it, but it cannot walk off on its own, and you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 580, 28, 57, 'cannot simply take it out.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 581, 1, 57, 'When people talk about somebody being “taken away” from a church, I say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 581, 2, 57, '“That is not the body of Christ.” That is the tragedy today. When Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 581, 3, 57, 'said, “I am going to build My church,” He was talking about building His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 581, 4, 57, 'own body, His spiritual body. He had a physical body when He was on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 581, 5, 57, 'earth, and He fulfilled God''s will on earth. Then He went up to heaven,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 581, 6, 57, 'and He sent the Holy Spirit to build a spiritual body, which is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 581, 7, 57, 'church, the body of Christ. The purpose of this body is to continue');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 581, 8, 57, 'doing the same thing that He did when He was on earth. What did Jesus do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 581, 9, 57, 'when He was on earth? He denied His Own will. He did not seek His own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 581, 10, 57, 'interests, but the interests of God. He completed the work God gave Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 581, 11, 57, 'to do. That is why He told Peter in Matthew 16:23, “If your mind is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 581, 12, 57, 'set on God’s interests, you will be a stumbling block to Me. You will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 581, 13, 57, 'not be a help to Me. You will be a stumbling block. You will be an agent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 581, 14, 57, 'of Satan.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 581, 15, 57, 'Seek God’s Interests');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 581, 16, 57, 'The important things needed for a person to build the church are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 581, 17, 57, 'revelation (Matthew 16:17) and authority (Matthew 16:19). We also need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 581, 18, 57, 'people who are not seeking their own interests. In other words, people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 581, 19, 57, 'who take up the cross. This is the meaning of the cross. Do you want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 581, 20, 57, 'understand the cross? Just read Matthew 16:23 and Matthew 16:24');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 581, 21, 57, 'together. A person who had revelation (Matthew 16:17) and was given');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 581, 22, 57, 'authority (Matthew 16:19) became the voice of Satan one minute later.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 581, 23, 57, 'How quickly a person who has received revelation and been given');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 581, 24, 57, 'authority by the Lord can become the voice of Satan! How so soon?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 581, 25, 57, 'Because he was seeking his own interests, and not the interests of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 581, 26, 57, 'This is the tragedy in so much of Christendom today. That is why Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 581, 27, 57, 'said in Matthew 16:24-25, “If you want to follow Me (and certainly if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 581, 28, 57, 'you want to build My church and be a co-worker with Me), then you must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 582, 1, 57, 'deny yourself, take up your cross, and follow Me. You cannot follow Me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 582, 2, 57, 'without denying yourself. Denying yourself is saying ‘no’ to your own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 582, 3, 57, 'interests.” Every human being on earth seeks his own interests right');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 582, 4, 57, 'from childhood. Children are always grabbing for things. They will grab');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 582, 5, 57, 'toys. They will fight and push other people away. They will even take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 582, 6, 57, 'other people''s toys. That is how children are. We have this habit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 582, 7, 57, 'grabbing and seeking our own interests. “What is good for me?” Then,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 582, 8, 57, 'when we are married and have a family with children, we are always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 582, 9, 57, 'thinking, “What is good for me and my family?”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 582, 10, 57, 'The whole race of Adam is only seeking their own interests. They will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 582, 11, 57, 'fit in other things where it is convenient. Basically, their whole life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 582, 12, 57, 'is surrounded in seeking their own interests. Of course, they will have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 582, 13, 57, 'a little interest in doing a few other things. Perhaps a little social');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 582, 14, 57, 'work, giving a little money to missions, giving a little money for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 582, 15, 57, 'poor and the orphanages, and maybe going to the church service on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 582, 16, 57, 'Sunday. But basically, the center of their life is seeking their own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 582, 17, 57, 'interests. Such people can never build the church. What they will build');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 582, 18, 57, 'is an organization. This is a dead system, and no such person can be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 582, 19, 57, 'true servant of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 582, 20, 57, 'A true servant of God is one who is not seeking his own interest in any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 582, 21, 57, 'area. He has given up his own interests, and he is seeking God’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 582, 22, 57, 'interests because he has taken up the cross. He has denied himself. Here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 582, 23, 57, 'is where the failure comes in so much of church building nowadays: we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 582, 24, 57, 'are seeking to save our life. That is what Jesus said in the next verse,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 582, 25, 57, 'Matthew 16:25, “Whoever wishes to save his life will lose it.” My “life”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 582, 26, 57, 'means not just my physical life. It could be physical, but it is also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 582, 27, 57, 'this soul life of mine. This means that I want to save my reputation and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 582, 28, 57, 'my dignity. I do not want anyone to dishonor me. “Saving my life” is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 583, 1, 57, 'saying, “I have all these interests and ambitions, and I want to save');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 583, 2, 57, 'all of them!” The Lord says that if you are interested in all that, then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 583, 3, 57, 'forget about building the church. You are going to lose it one day. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 583, 4, 57, 'the one who is willing to lose his self-life and not seek his own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 583, 5, 57, 'interests will find it. He will find it in a better way as he builds the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 583, 6, 57, 'church, which will last forever.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 583, 7, 57, 'The Church Is like the Ark');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 583, 8, 57, 'I have often thought about the days of Noah. I have said, “Lord, if I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 583, 9, 57, 'were living in Noah’s day, what would I do?” Well, I would earn my own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 583, 10, 57, 'living. I would plow the fields, and plant vineyards or something to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 583, 11, 57, 'take care my family. But my main aim in life would be to build the ark.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 583, 12, 57, 'I would go to Noah and say, “Hi Noah, I would like to cooperate with you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 583, 13, 57, 'in building the ark because I know that is the only thing that is going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 583, 14, 57, 'to remain when the flood comes and destroys everything else.” So while I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 583, 15, 57, 'would take care of my family, my main goal in life would be to build the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 583, 16, 57, 'ark, and to spend as little time as possible for my own interest to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 583, 17, 57, 'provide for my family’s needs. But I would dream about building the ark');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 583, 18, 57, 'and sleep at night thinking about new ways to help build the ark.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 583, 19, 57, 'That is how a true Christian should live today. He does the minimum');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 583, 20, 57, 'necessary to take care of his family, but his mind will be set on, “How');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 583, 21, 57, 'can I build the church? How can I build fellowship? Not a church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 583, 22, 57, 'building, but to build God''s people into a fellowship related to one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 583, 23, 57, 'another like the members of the body. How can I build them like stones');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 583, 24, 57, 'and bricks that are taken from a pile on the roadside and built into a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 583, 25, 57, 'building? How can I do it better?” This is the person who is seeking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 583, 26, 57, 'God’s interests.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 583, 27, 57, 'God or Mammon?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 583, 28, 57, 'We can compare this desire to a person who is seeking business');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 584, 1, 57, 'interests. The reason why I make this comparison is because Jesus said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 584, 2, 57, 'there are only two masters in the world – God and money (Luke 16:13).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 584, 3, 57, 'There are only two masters, and the second master is not the devil. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 584, 4, 57, 'is money. Christians are not at all in danger of serving the devil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 584, 5, 57, 'Christians are in great danger of serving money, earthly things, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 584, 6, 57, 'material things. And most of them do. How do you know which of these two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 584, 7, 57, 'is your master? Is God your master, or is money your master? Suppose God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 584, 8, 57, 'calls you here, and money calls you there, at the same time. Which one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 584, 9, 57, 'do you listen to? That is your master. If two people are calling a slave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 584, 10, 57, 'in two different directions, it is very easy to find out who is his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 584, 11, 57, 'master. The one he listens to is his master. Let us suppose money calls');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 584, 12, 57, 'you in one direction, and God calls you in another direction. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 584, 13, 57, 'listen to money, you are a slave of money, whether you know it or not.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 584, 14, 57, 'You need to be honest with yourself and ask yourself whose call you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 584, 15, 57, 'responding to day by day. Whose call are you responding to as you think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 584, 16, 57, 'about your ambitions on this earth?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 584, 17, 57, 'Timothy: A Faithful Servant of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 584, 18, 57, 'This is why there are so few really faithful servants of God on this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 584, 19, 57, 'earth. Most of them are servants of mammon, material things, and money.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 584, 20, 57, 'See what Paul said in his day about Timothy, in Philippians 2:19. We are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 584, 21, 57, 'considering the way of the cross, not seeking our own interests, denying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 584, 22, 57, 'ourselves, not trying to save our life, but willing to lose it for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 584, 23, 57, 'sake of the Gospel. In that connection, Paul is thinking of sending');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 584, 24, 57, 'somebody as his representative to Philippi to encourage them, and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 584, 25, 57, 'learn about their condition, so that he himself can be encouraged by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 584, 26, 57, 'hearing about the condition of the Philippians. Paul writes in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 584, 27, 57, 'Philippians 2:19, “I hope in the Lord Jesus to send Timothy to you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 584, 28, 57, 'shortly so that I may be encouraged when I learn of your condition.” He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 585, 1, 57, 'says, “I want to send somebody to you, not just to find out how things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 585, 2, 57, 'are going on there. Anybody could go and find out. But I want to send');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 585, 3, 57, 'someone who is spiritual enough to come, build them up, and discern what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 585, 4, 57, 'their condition is.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 585, 5, 57, 'It really requires a spiritual man to discern the condition of a church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 585, 6, 57, 'The ordinary man cannot understand it. Paul wants to send somebody to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 585, 7, 57, 'learn of the condition of the Philippian church. What is their real');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 585, 8, 57, 'spiritual state? He says, “I have to send somebody who is really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 585, 9, 57, 'spiritual.” Only a spiritual man can have discernment. The other people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 585, 10, 57, 'will say, “Well, there were 135 people meeting. There was so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 585, 11, 57, 'children. This is the program they have for the children. These are the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 585, 12, 57, 'days of the meeting,” and many other external things which do not reveal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 585, 13, 57, 'their spiritual condition. A person with spiritual discernment will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 585, 14, 57, 'be counting attendees or what programs they had or what times they met');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 585, 15, 57, 'on Sundays. These are not the things that he would be concerned about.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 585, 16, 57, 'He would be concerned about, “What is the spiritual state all these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 585, 17, 57, 'people in this church? What is the spiritual condition of the elders?”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 585, 18, 57, 'Only a spiritual man can discern that. He says, “I want to send somebody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 585, 19, 57, 'to find out about your condition. I cannot find a single person among');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 585, 20, 57, 'all my co-workers.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 585, 21, 57, 'Paul was not looking among unbelievers for a representative. He is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 585, 22, 57, 'even looking at the believers. He is looking at his co-workers and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 585, 23, 57, 'saying, “Which of them can I send to find out the condition of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 585, 24, 57, 'Philippian church? Only Timothy. I have no one else of kindred spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 585, 25, 57, '(this means one who has the same spirit as me, one who has the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 585, 26, 57, 'spiritual vision, longing, and ambition that I have). There is nobody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 585, 27, 57, 'else. Here is somebody who will genuinely be concerned for your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 585, 28, 57, 'welfare.” Now if Paul had said, “I am just concerned for your welfare,”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 586, 1, 57, 'that would have been enough. But some people pretend to be concerned.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 586, 2, 57, 'Paul was one who is genuinely concerned, and he was looking for someone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 586, 3, 57, 'like-minded to send, but he had to conclude, “They all seek after their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 586, 4, 57, 'own interests.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 586, 5, 57, 'Remember what the Lord told Peter, “You set your mind on your own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 586, 6, 57, 'interests, not God''s.” We see the same thing in Philippians 2, where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 586, 7, 57, 'Paul’s co-workers are seeking their own interests, not God’s interests,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 586, 8, 57, 'and not those of Christ Jesus. In Philippians 2:21, we see the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 586, 9, 57, 'contrast between the two interests that we saw in Matthew 16:23. What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 586, 10, 57, 'type of person can build the church? One who is not seeking his own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 586, 11, 57, 'interests. The entire race of Adam seeks their own interests. As I said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 586, 12, 57, 'they are always thinking, “What is best for me and my family? I will go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 586, 13, 57, 'wherever is best for me and my family. I will do whatever is best for me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 586, 14, 57, 'and my family.” That is fine for them, but if you want to be a true');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 586, 15, 57, 'servant of the Lord, you need to ask yourself, “Since God will take care');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 586, 16, 57, 'of the interests of me and my family, what is the best for God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 586, 17, 57, 'interest on this earth?”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 586, 18, 57, 'Seek to Be One of God’s Few Wholehearted Servants');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 586, 19, 57, 'There are very few like that. There were very few like that in the 1st');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 586, 20, 57, 'century, and there are very few like that in this century, whose whole');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 586, 21, 57, 'minds are set on what is best for God''s interests. “How can I be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 586, 22, 57, 'available for God''s interest in my life?” I want to ask you, dear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 586, 23, 57, 'friend, do you want to be a wholehearted, radical servant of God, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 586, 24, 57, 'spend your earthly days in the best possible way? Then be dedicated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 586, 25, 57, 'completely to God’s interests. Put to death every interest of your own,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 586, 26, 57, '100%. That is the way. Be genuinely interested in the things of God, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 586, 27, 57, 'His interests. And then you need not ask, “Who is going to take care of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 586, 28, 57, 'my interests?” God will take care of your interests.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 587, 1, 57, 'Do you think God can do a better job of taking care of your family than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 587, 2, 57, 'you, yourself? I can testify to this. I quit my job in the Navy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 587, 3, 57, 'forty-six years ago. I was married forty-four years ago, and I have four');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 587, 4, 57, 'children. We were very poor when we started, but my wife and I decided');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 587, 5, 57, 'to honor God at every single step. We have sought to put God’s interests');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 587, 6, 57, 'first in our life for all these many years, and especially in the last');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 587, 7, 57, '37 years since, God filled me with the Holy Spirit and showed me what it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 587, 8, 57, 'was to build His church (or local churches in different places). I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 587, 9, 57, 'discovered one thing: the more I set my mind on God''s interests (which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 587, 10, 57, 'required me to sacrifice a lot of time, money, and energy that I could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 587, 11, 57, 'have had for my family), I found God took care of my family, and He did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 587, 12, 57, 'a far better job than I could have ever done. It is like saying, “God, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 587, 13, 57, 'will take care of Your interests, and You take care of mine.” Isn’t that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 587, 14, 57, 'a good exchange? You take care of God’s interests, and He takes care of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 587, 15, 57, 'yours? The other option is you take care of your own interests and God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 587, 16, 57, 'says, “Ok, you do that.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 587, 17, 57, 'Timothy was interested in the things of God. Timothy was always thinking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 587, 18, 57, 'of God’s interests. If there is a clash between God’s interest and my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 587, 19, 57, 'interests, I will put God’s interests first. That is the meaning of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 587, 20, 57, 'seeking God''s kingdom first. I may have to deny myself of certain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 587, 21, 57, 'things. I cannot do this or that for my family. Do not worry. God will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 587, 22, 57, 'do something better. That is what it means to live by faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 587, 23, 57, 'That is such an essential characteristic to build the church. There were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 587, 24, 57, 'very few in Paul''s day. Imagine, even among Paul’s own co-workers, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 587, 25, 57, 'he could not find anyone with that type of passion. There was just one -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 587, 26, 57, 'Timothy. And even today, there are very few whom God can find like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 587, 27, 57, 'I urge you to be one like that because then you will not have any regret');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 587, 28, 57, 'in eternity. You will live a wonderful life on earth and come through to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 588, 1, 57, 'a glorious life at the end of it all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 588, 2, 57, '“If you seek to save your life - or seek your own interests - you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 588, 3, 57, 'lose it. But, if you are willing to lose it for the Gospel’s sake or for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 588, 4, 57, 'Christ’s sake, you will find it” (Matthew 16:25). It is a life of faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 588, 5, 57, 'That means you trust that as you give up something for God, He will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 588, 6, 57, 'never be in debt you. Remember, Jesus said that even a cup of water that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 588, 7, 57, 'somebody gives will get a reward. Imagine if you have given up all of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 588, 8, 57, 'your interests to seek God’s interests. What your reward will be here on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 588, 9, 57, 'this earth! He will take care of all your needs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 588, 10, 57, 'The Foolishness of Gaining the World');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 588, 11, 57, '“What will a man be profited?” (Matthew 16:26) Supposing the Lord said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 588, 12, 57, '“you set all your mind on your own interests and pursue it. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 588, 13, 57, 'ultimately end up gaining not only wealth here and there, but the whole');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 588, 14, 57, 'world! Yet you have lost your soul.” We often quote that verse to an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 588, 15, 57, 'unbeliever. I want to quote it to believers. What does it mean to gain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 588, 16, 57, 'the whole world? You spend all your life pursuing earthly things. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 588, 17, 57, 'get all that and ultimately, you wasted your one earthly life. God gave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 588, 18, 57, 'you one life to live for Him on this earth. When you waste it, you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 588, 19, 57, 'lost your soul. You have wasted the one thing that you should live for.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 588, 20, 57, 'What can you give in exchange for this one earthly life that could be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 588, 21, 57, 'lived for God? What can you give in exchange for your soul?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 588, 22, 57, 'Then Jesus said in Matthew 16:27, “Think of the final day.” That is what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 588, 23, 57, 'we must always think of. One day, the Son of Man is going to come in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 588, 24, 57, 'glory of His Father with His angels. He will reward every man according');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 588, 25, 57, 'to his deeds. What did he live for? Did he seek his own interests (in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 588, 26, 57, 'the whole context of this passage)? What did he live for? What did he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 588, 27, 57, 'seek? His own interests? Did He give a little money in the offering box?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 588, 28, 57, 'Did he go to church every Sunday? That is not the point. The Pharisees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 589, 1, 57, 'went to the synagogue every Saturday. They gave money, tithed, prayed,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 589, 2, 57, 'fasted, but they went to hell. That is not the issue. The issue is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 589, 3, 57, 'whether your mind set on the things above, on God’s interests. Did you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 589, 4, 57, 'trust God? Did you live by faith? Did you believe that He would take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 589, 5, 57, 'care of your interests?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 589, 6, 57, 'Jesus then says in Matthew 16:28, “I want to say to you, there are some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 589, 7, 57, 'of you standing here who will not taste of death until they see the Son');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 589, 8, 57, 'of Man coming in His kingdom.” How is that? That is referring to the day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 589, 9, 57, 'of Pentecost. The kingdom of heaven came to earth when the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 589, 10, 57, 'was given. Jesus is saying, “Some of you standing here will be able to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 589, 11, 57, 'experience that. Jesus called the day of Pentecost the coming of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 589, 12, 57, 'kingdom of heaven. The Son of Man, Christ, coming in a body through 120');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 589, 13, 57, 'people on earth. He says, “Some of you standing here (not all of you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 589, 14, 57, 'but some of you, as some may die) will see that.” We are living in that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 589, 15, 57, 'age, where we can see the power of the Holy Spirit operating. Be open,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 589, 16, 57, 'be filled with the Holy Spirit, and seek with all your heart not to seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 589, 17, 57, 'your own interests anymore, but to say, “Lord, I want to seek with all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 589, 18, 57, 'my heart the things of the kingdom of heaven, and to build Your church,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 589, 19, 57, 'the body of Christ, with the one earthly life I have.” You will never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 589, 20, 57, 'regret it in eternity, when the Son of Man comes in the glory of His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 589, 21, 57, 'Father and His angels, sets up His kingdom, and rewards you publicly for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 589, 22, 57, 'what you did. Live for Him on this earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 589, 23, 58, 'Chapter 57 The Transfiguration and Spiritual Authority');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 589, 24, 58, '“Six days later Jesus took with Him Peter and James and John his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 589, 25, 58, 'brother, and led them up on a high mountain by themselves. And He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 589, 26, 58, 'transfigured before them; and His face shone like the sun, and His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 589, 27, 58, 'garments became as white as light. And behold, Moses and Elijah appeared');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 589, 28, 58, 'to them, talking with Him. Peter said to Jesus, ‘Lord, it is good for us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 590, 1, 58, 'to be here; if You wish, I will make three tabernacles here, one for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 590, 2, 58, 'You, and one for Moses, and one for Elijah.’ While he was still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 590, 3, 58, 'speaking, a bright cloud overshadowed them, and behold, a voice out of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 590, 4, 58, 'the cloud said, ‘This is My beloved Son, with whom I am well-pleased;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 590, 5, 58, 'listen to Him!’ When the disciples heard this, they fell face down to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 590, 6, 58, 'the ground and were terrified. And Jesus came to them and touched them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 590, 7, 58, 'and said, ‘Get up, and do not be afraid.’ And lifting up their eyes,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 590, 8, 58, 'they saw no one except Jesus Himself alone” (Matthew 17:1-8). Here is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 590, 9, 58, 'the important principle that we need to recognize. We can say that Moses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 590, 10, 58, 'here represented the Law and Elijah represented the prophets. There is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 590, 11, 58, 'frequent expression that in the Bible, the Law and the Prophets, which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 590, 12, 58, 'refers to the Old Testament. The first five books are called the books');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 590, 13, 58, 'of the Law and then there are history books and then the Prophets. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 590, 14, 58, 'is a general description for the Old Testament. Moses is known');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 590, 15, 58, 'throughout Israel as the lawgiver, and Elijah is the most well known');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 590, 16, 58, 'prophet, who is even quoted in the last verse of the Old Testament.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 590, 17, 58, 'Jesus Is Higher Than Any Book or Man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 590, 18, 58, 'We see this symbolically on the Mount of Transfiguration. Peter was so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 590, 19, 58, 'excited that he was putting Jesus on the same level as the Law and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 590, 20, 58, 'Prophets. He wanted to make three tabernacles for Jesus, Moses, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 590, 21, 58, 'Elijah, with all three on the same level. As soon as he said that, a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 590, 22, 58, 'cloud overshadowed them and a voice came from the cloud, as if saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 590, 23, 58, '“Don''t ever do that! This is My beloved Son. He is not in the same class');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 590, 24, 58, 'as a book or a man. This is My beloved Son, listen to Him” (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 590, 25, 58, '17:4-6). What Christians can learn from this is that it is possible for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 590, 26, 58, 'us to be so taken up with a man of God, who has been a tremendous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 590, 27, 58, 'blessing to us, or maybe a great prophet, that we unconsciously put him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 590, 28, 58, 'on the same level as Jesus in our lives. We may criticize the Roman');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 591, 1, 58, 'Catholics for making Mary a second mediator, but a lot of Protestants');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 591, 2, 58, 'make a pastor a second mediator between them and Christ. When a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 591, 3, 58, 'becomes equal to Christ, a cloud comes immediately and the Lord says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 591, 4, 58, '“You can’t do that. This is My Son. He is in a class by Himself. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 591, 5, 58, 'cannot equate Him with any man.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 591, 6, 58, 'The second thing, which is more subtle, is Bibliolatry - where we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 591, 7, 58, 'worship the Bible. That may not seem as serious because the Bible is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 591, 8, 58, 'word of God, but the Bible itself says, “The letter kills” (2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 591, 9, 58, 'Corinthians 3:6). That means that if you take the letter of Scripture');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 591, 10, 58, 'and live by it, it can kill you. It doesn''t mean that we shouldn''t obey');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 591, 11, 58, 'God''s Word, but obedience must be in the spirit. There are so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 591, 12, 58, 'legalists who take little verses here and there and build a legalistic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 591, 13, 58, 'system in Christianity, or build a cult. This is one of the lessons that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 591, 14, 58, 'comes through this story - you cannot put the Bible or even the greatest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 591, 15, 58, 'man of God on earth on the same level as Jesus. These are all meant to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 591, 16, 58, 'direct us to Christ. The greatest, most effective man of God and prophet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 591, 17, 58, 'in the Old Testament was John the Baptist. He pointed to Christ Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 591, 18, 58, 'saying, “Behold, the Lamb of God,” “I am not worthy to untie His laces,”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 591, 19, 58, 'or “Here is the One who baptizes in the Holy Spirit.” He was a pointer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 591, 20, 58, 'No prophet was meant to be a destination in himself. They are like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 591, 21, 58, 'signposts that point to a city. As you drive down the road, there are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 591, 22, 58, 'these signposts saying where the city is. So a prophet is like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 591, 23, 58, 'signpost saying, “Christ is there, go in that direction.” The one who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 591, 24, 58, 'draws people to himself is a hindrance to God''s work. We also shouldn’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 591, 25, 58, 'get so taken up with the letter of Scripture that we don''t understand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 591, 26, 58, 'the spirit of what is written. This was the problem with the Pharisees.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 591, 27, 58, 'They were taking the letter of Scripture and were criticizing Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 591, 28, 58, 'Himself saying, “You are not obeying God''s Word - You are not keeping');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 592, 1, 58, 'the Sabbath, You are not doing this or that,” whereas Jesus was the One');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 592, 2, 58, 'Who obeyed the Law completely. He said, “I''ve come to fulfill the Law.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 592, 3, 58, 'But He obeyed the spirit of the Law. There''s something we can learn from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 592, 4, 58, 'that. It says that when the cloud appeared, they heard a voice saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 592, 5, 58, '“This is My beloved Son in whom I am well pleased. Listen to Him.” God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 592, 6, 58, 'may use a prophet, He may use the Bible, but ultimately you must listen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 592, 7, 58, 'to Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 592, 8, 58, 'Hearing By the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 592, 9, 58, 'The Bible says, “Faith comes by hearing, and hearing by the word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 592, 10, 58, 'Christ” (Romans 10:17). Faith doesn''t come by simply reading the Bible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 592, 11, 58, 'It does not say, “Faith comes by the word of Christ.” There''s an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 592, 12, 58, 'in-between step. “Faith comes by hearing, and hearing by the Word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 592, 13, 58, 'Christ.” The word of Christ refers to the New Testament, and as you read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 592, 14, 58, 'it you must hear the Holy Spirit speaking to you. That is how faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 592, 15, 58, 'comes. But mere academic study of the word will not produce faith in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 592, 16, 58, 'anybody. There are a lot of people who study the word academically and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 592, 17, 58, 'yet are not spiritual. They are just Bible scholars. There are those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 592, 18, 58, 'study chemistry books and get a PhD in Chemistry. Similarly, you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 592, 19, 58, 'study the Bible and get a PhD in Theology, but that won’t make you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 592, 20, 58, 'spiritual. It is very important to remember that study of the Bible by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 592, 21, 58, 'itself will not produce faith; it will only produce knowledge that puffs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 592, 22, 58, 'us up. It is the Holy Spirit that must speak to us through Scripture.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 592, 23, 58, 'Further, “When they looked up, they saw no one except Jesus” (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 592, 24, 58, '17:8). The others had disappeared, and that''s how it must be. It doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 592, 25, 58, 'say “let us run the race looking at any man of God;” it doesn''t say “let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 592, 26, 58, 'us run the race looking at the Bible.” In fact, for 1400 years there was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 592, 27, 58, 'no printed Bible. Most Christians never had access to a Bible in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 592, 28, 58, 'homes like we have today. We have access to so many translations today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 593, 1, 58, 'We must never forget that for 1400 years most Christian did not have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 593, 2, 58, 'Bible at home. How were they supposed to follow the Lord for those 1400');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 593, 3, 58, 'years? If the Bible was so essential for following the Lord, God would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 593, 4, 58, 'have allowed printing to be discovered at least a hundred years before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 593, 5, 58, 'Christ came.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 593, 6, 58, 'I have seen the result of dependence on the Bible firsthand. I grew up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 593, 7, 58, 'in an assembly where they studied the Bible thoroughly - and I’m very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 593, 8, 58, 'thankful for it - but it took away the dependence on the Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 593, 9, 58, 'That is the balance we need. I believe in the study of the Scriptures.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 593, 10, 58, 'I''ve studied the Bible from cover to cover, and I still study it. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 593, 11, 58, 'believe I’ll never exhaust the depth of the Bible, but I am looking for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 593, 12, 58, 'the Spirit to speak to me through it at all times. Otherwise I will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 593, 13, 58, 'putting Moses on the same level as Jesus. In the same way, I’ve been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 593, 14, 58, 'tremendously blessed by some wonderful, godly men who I respect very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 593, 15, 58, 'highly. There are very few really godly men, men of God who know God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 593, 16, 58, 'intimately and whose writings and lives have blessed me. But I''ve always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 593, 17, 58, 'gone beyond them to Christ. Like Paul said, “Follow me as I follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 593, 18, 58, 'Christ.” We can follow a man as long as he is leading us closer and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 593, 19, 58, 'closer to Christ. If he drifts away, we stop looking at him and continue');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 593, 20, 58, 'to follow Christ. Thus we will never go astray. A truly godly man will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 593, 21, 58, 'never seek to draw you to himself. He will always point you beyond');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 593, 22, 58, 'himself to Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 593, 23, 58, 'Submit to Your Leaders');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 593, 24, 58, 'However, I want to also warn you because there are many people who can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 593, 25, 58, 'take advantage of this. There are many independent spirits in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 593, 26, 58, 'Christendom who love to hear something like this and say, “I don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 593, 27, 58, 'follow any man.” That sounds exactly like what I’ve written here. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 593, 28, 58, 'what they mean is, “I don''t submit to anybody. I am alone by myself.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 594, 1, 58, 'These are the worst of the lot. They are the biggest hindrance to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 594, 2, 58, 'body of Christ. There is a balance in the teaching of the Scripture.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 594, 3, 58, 'When Satan quoted Scripture to Jesus he said, “It is written,” and Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 594, 4, 58, 'said, “It is also written.” The truth is found in both - “it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 594, 5, 58, 'written,” and “it is also written.” It is true that it is written, “We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 594, 6, 58, 'run the race looking only unto Jesus,” (Hebrews 12:2), but it is also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 594, 7, 58, 'written, “Obey your leaders and submit to them, for they keep watch over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 594, 8, 58, 'your soul as those who will give an account. Let them do this with joy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 594, 9, 58, 'and not with grief.” (Hebrews 13:17).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 594, 10, 58, 'There must be a balance. God has given us human leaders, apostles, etc.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 594, 11, 58, 'Paul, for example, had such authority over the church in Corinth that he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 594, 12, 58, 'could hand over a man in that church to Satan from many hundreds of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 594, 13, 58, 'kilometers away. That''s the authority that God gives an apostle. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 594, 14, 58, 'could tell them, “For if you were to have countless tutors in Christ,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 594, 15, 58, 'yet you would not have many fathers. For in Christ Jesus I became your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 594, 16, 58, 'father through the gospel” (1 Corinthians 4:15). That was inspired by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 594, 17, 58, 'the Holy Spirit. We also see the balance here. Paul was not attaching');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 594, 18, 58, 'people to himself; he was leading people to Christ. But there was an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 594, 19, 58, 'authority that God gave Paul that a spiritual person would recognize and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 594, 20, 58, 'submit to.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 594, 21, 58, 'Learn from Jesus’ Life, and Not Just His Teaching');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 594, 22, 58, 'When we try to understand all that Jesus taught in the gospels, there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 594, 23, 58, 'were situations and circumstances that the Lord led His people into. For');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 594, 24, 58, 'example, during the storm in the lake, Jesus was teaching the disciples');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 594, 25, 58, 'that He could still the storm, through His life, through His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 594, 26, 58, 'circumstances and through His words. So all that Jesus taught combines');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 594, 27, 58, 'all these things together. It''s not only His spoken words. There are a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 594, 28, 58, 'lot of things we learn from the circumstances like this incident on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 595, 1, 58, 'mount of transfiguration.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 595, 2, 58, '“As they were coming down from the mountain, Jesus commanded them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 595, 3, 58, 'saying, ‘Tell the vision to no one until the Son of Man has risen from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 595, 4, 58, 'the dead’” (So Peter kept it to himself and only spoke about it in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 595, 5, 58, 'Epistle). And His disciples asked him, “Why then do the scribes says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 595, 6, 58, 'that Elijah must come first?’” (referring to the prophecy in Malachi).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 595, 7, 58, 'And He answered and said, ‘Elijah is coming and will restore all things;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 595, 8, 58, '[in the future] but I say to you Elijah already came (that is referring');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 595, 9, 58, 'to John the Baptist) but they did not recognize him, but did to him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 595, 10, 58, 'whatever they wished. So also the Son of Man is also going to suffer at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 595, 11, 58, 'their hands.’ Then the disciples understood that He had spoken to them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 595, 12, 58, 'about John the Baptist” (Matthew 17:9-13). This teaches us that John the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 595, 13, 58, 'Baptist came in the spirit of Elijah, preparing the way for the first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 595, 14, 58, 'coming of Christ, “Behold, I am going to send you Elijah the prophet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 595, 15, 58, 'before the coming of the great and terrible day of the Lord” (Malachi');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 595, 16, 58, '4:5). This means a ministry like Elijah''s, which is not going to be one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 595, 17, 58, 'man, but a whole church - the body of Christ - that understands God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 595, 18, 58, 'purpose together, will be the new man. That is the Elijah of the last');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 595, 19, 58, 'days. It won’t be one person, it will be a prophetic ministry coming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 595, 20, 58, 'forth from the church, preparing the way and preparing people for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 595, 21, 58, 'second coming of Christ. That is the ministry of the church today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 595, 22, 58, 'Mountain Tops Prepare Us for Valleys');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 595, 23, 58, '“When they came to the crowd, a man came up to Jesus, falling on his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 595, 24, 58, 'knees before Him and saying, ‘Lord, have mercy on my son, for he is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 595, 25, 58, 'lunatic and is very ill; for he often falls into the fire and often into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 595, 26, 58, 'the water. I brought him to Your disciples, and they could not cure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 595, 27, 58, 'him’” (Matthew 17:14-16). This is why Jesus told his disciples that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 595, 28, 58, 'could not stay up on the mountain forever. Peter said it was good for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 596, 1, 58, 'them to be up there, “Let''s just settle down here, this is a wonderful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 596, 2, 58, 'place, it''s the spirit of heaven out here on the mountain top.” But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 596, 3, 58, 'Jesus said, “No, we need to go down.” This is how we feel sometimes when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 596, 4, 58, 'we have mountain top experiences with the Lord. It''s so wonderful to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 596, 5, 58, 'in His presence, in the presence of His people, especially when we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 596, 6, 58, 'godly men near us like Moses and Elijah. It''s wonderful to be with such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 596, 7, 58, 'people. But the Lord says, “You can’t be there forever, because this is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 596, 8, 58, 'only a preparation for a ministry down in the valley.” Every mountain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 596, 9, 58, 'top experience that we have, even with godly men or with Christ Himself,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 596, 10, 58, 'is only a preparation for a ministry to needy people in the valley. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 596, 11, 58, 'has not called us to only bless ourselves. The blessing of Abraham was,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 596, 12, 58, '“I will bless you and you will be blessing to all the families on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 596, 13, 58, 'earth” (Genesis 12:3). And that is the blessing that comes to us through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 596, 14, 58, 'the Holy Spirit. The Holy Spirit puts within us a spring of water that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 596, 15, 58, 'springs up to everlasting life. But then that same spring flows out from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 596, 16, 58, 'us and becomes rivers of living water that bless other people. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 596, 17, 58, 'how it must be in our life. If it only remains as a spring satisfying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 596, 18, 58, 'ourselves, we have frustrated the ultimate purpose of God. It must flow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 596, 19, 58, 'out from us to bless others because there are needy people down in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 596, 20, 58, 'valley.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 596, 21, 58, 'Consider the man whose son was lunatic: how would he be helped if Peter,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 596, 22, 58, 'James, John, and Jesus stayed up on the mountain forever? This is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 596, 23, 58, 'lesson for those who are taken up by the mountain top experiences. Every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 596, 24, 58, 'experience like that must lead us down to serve people oppressed by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 596, 25, 58, 'devil in the valleys.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 596, 26, 58, 'Christians Have a Responsibility to Deliver Others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 596, 27, 58, 'When they go down, they find this man who could not be helped by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 596, 28, 58, 'other disciples. Remember we saw in Matthew 10, that Jesus had given the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 597, 1, 58, 'disciples specific authority to cast out demons, just like He has given');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 597, 2, 58, 'us as believers today. Every believer must believe that Satan (and every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 597, 3, 58, 'demon) has been defeated on the cross, and that his power has been taken');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 597, 4, 58, 'away. Can I cast out demons in Jesus’ name? The demons are not afraid of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 597, 5, 58, 'man, but they are afraid of the mighty name of Jesus and the authority');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 597, 6, 58, 'behind it. Yet the disciples couldn''t cast it out even though God had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 597, 7, 58, 'given them specific authority that they could exercise. This man had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 597, 8, 58, 'brought his son to the disciples, and His disciples could do nothing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 597, 9, 58, 'This is true even today. There are many demon-possessed people in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 597, 10, 58, 'world and sometimes they bring them to Christians, only to find that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 597, 11, 58, 'many Christians are powerless. They don''t know what to do. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 597, 12, 58, 'because these Christians have never been baptized in the Holy Spirit and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 597, 13, 58, 'fire and have never known the anointing of God and the authority that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 597, 14, 58, 'Christ has given us over satanic powers. Non-Christians say, “I brought');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 597, 15, 58, 'somebody to Your disciples and they couldn''t even help him.” And the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 597, 16, 58, 'Lord says “O unbelieving and perverted generation, how long shall I be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 597, 17, 58, 'with you? How long shall I put up with you? Bring him here to Me.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 597, 18, 58, 'Very often the Lord says similar words today. He is the same yesterday,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 597, 19, 58, 'today and forever. When He sees needy humanity bringing people to His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 597, 20, 58, 'children for deliverance and help from Satanic oppression, a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 597, 21, 58, 'people can’t help them. He says the same words, “O unbelieving and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 597, 22, 58, 'perverted generation - you Christians who call yourself by My name - how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 597, 23, 58, 'long shall I put up with you?” It''s very sad. I believe that it is our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 597, 24, 58, 'responsibility to take this seriously and say, “Lord, I want to be able');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 597, 25, 58, 'to meet the needs of those whom You send to me, according to Your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 597, 26, 58, 'purpose for my life. I want to seek You so earnestly, that You will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 597, 27, 58, 'anoint me for my calling.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 597, 28, 58, 'I am not supposed to do everything in the body of Christ but only my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 598, 1, 58, 'particular function. That is something all of us who are believers must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 598, 2, 58, 'recognize, that every single believer has some function. Preaching');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 598, 3, 58, 'wonderful messages is not the only thing. There are many, many functions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 598, 4, 58, 'in the body of Christ, and if you can recognize your particular');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 598, 5, 58, 'function, say, “Lord, I want to be able to exercise that function to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 598, 6, 58, 'deliver people who come across my path from the oppression of the devil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 598, 7, 58, 'I want to be available for You, and I want to be anointed by the Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 598, 8, 58, 'for that.” Then you will not frustrate God''s purposes. But a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 598, 9, 58, 'Christians are frustrating God’s purposes because they are not thinking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 598, 10, 58, 'in terms of their responsibility to deliver others from the oppression');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 598, 11, 58, 'of Satan. They are only thinking of being with Moses and Elijah on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 598, 12, 58, 'mountain top. Every now and then, we have wonderful experiences. When we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 598, 13, 58, 'go to church on Sunday, we have lot of clapping and wonderful music, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 598, 14, 58, 'what about being useful to the people oppressed by the devil in society');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 598, 15, 58, 'around you? That''s an important part of our calling too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 598, 16, 58, 'Demons Flee at One Word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 598, 17, 58, 'And then the man was brought to Jesus, “And Jesus rebuked the demon and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 598, 18, 58, 'cast it out at once” (Matthew 17:18). You see this principle throughout');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 598, 19, 58, 'Scripture, that Jesus cast out the demons with a word. I believe that it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 598, 20, 58, 'is a great testimony to the heathen when those who cast out demons cast');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 598, 21, 58, 'them out with one single sentence and not by screaming, yelling, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 598, 22, 58, 'hours of prayer and fasting. You never see Jesus spending hours of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 598, 23, 58, 'prayer and fasting to cast out one demon. We must manifest the authority');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 598, 24, 58, 'of Jesus, where with one word or sentence, the demon goes away. I can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 598, 25, 58, 'tell you that it is true in my life. I never had to say more than one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 598, 26, 58, 'sentence to the number of demons that I have cast out. This is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 598, 27, 58, 'because I''m special; it is because of the name of Jesus. They fear and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 598, 28, 58, 'tremble at the name of Jesus. We must have faith in that; if we don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 599, 1, 58, 'have such faith, then it won''t work. Then, even hours of prayer and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 599, 2, 58, 'fasting are not going to solve the problem. You need to go away from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 599, 3, 58, 'there and say, “Lord, I did not have faith,” and you need to pray and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 599, 4, 58, 'fast in secret, so that you will be equipped, and then, the next time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 599, 5, 58, 'you encounter a similar problem, you can deal with it. There is a place');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 599, 6, 58, 'for prayer and fasting in secret: prior to handling these situations.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 599, 7, 58, 'Jesus cast out the demons with a word. It was always like that - one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 599, 8, 58, 'word. The Bible says, “As Jesus is, so are we in this world” (1 John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 599, 9, 58, '4:17). If we are anointed with the Holy Spirit, our conscience is clear,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 599, 10, 58, 'and we are walking in humility with the Lord, we have the same authority');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 599, 11, 58, 'that Christ had. That is what it means to use His name. It should not be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 599, 12, 58, 'said about us that, “Somebody brought this to one of Your disciples and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 599, 13, 58, 'he couldn''t cast out the demons.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 599, 14, 58, 'There may be numerous reasons why God does not allow some sickness to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 599, 15, 58, 'healed. In Paul''s case, his sickness was not healed. In Timothy’s case,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 599, 16, 58, 'his sickness was not healed. But there was never a single case where God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 599, 17, 58, 'allows a demon to possess a person. That is 100% against God''s will.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 599, 18, 58, 'Just as God does not want us to be a slave to a single sin in our life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 599, 19, 58, 'I have no doubt in my mind that God does not want any human being to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 599, 20, 58, 'have one single demon in him. But it is the responsibility of Christians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 599, 21, 58, 'to cast out the demon in the name of Jesus, whenever they encounter one.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 599, 22, 58, 'We do not go around looking for demons all over town, but when they come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 599, 23, 58, 'across our path or people bring them to us, we should have the authority');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 599, 24, 58, 'to cast them out. That is why we need to walk with the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 599, 25, 58, 'continuously, because we do not know when that occasion will arise and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 599, 26, 58, 'when we will be called upon to cast out a demon.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 599, 27, 58, 'Authority Comes By Faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 599, 28, 58, '“Then the disciples came to Jesus privately and said, ‘Why could we not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 600, 1, 58, 'drive it out?’” (Matthew 17:19) We are trying to understand all that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 600, 2, 58, 'Jesus taught, and here, He is teaching us about casting out demons. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 600, 3, 58, 'is a very important aspect of the ministry, particularly if you minister');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 600, 4, 58, 'in the villages in India. It is very important to know how to do it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 600, 5, 58, '“And He said to them, ‘Because of the littleness of your faith’”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 600, 6, 58, '(Matthew 17:20). He did not say, “Because you did not pray and fast.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 600, 7, 58, 'That is how some people misunderstand it. “Your problem is you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 600, 8, 58, 'believe I gave you such authority (mentioned in Matthew 10). Then, of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 600, 9, 58, 'course nothing will happen.” It is possible for the Lord to give you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 600, 10, 58, 'authority, and yet you don''t believe it. That was the situation here.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 600, 11, 58, 'Did the Lord give them authority? Sure (Matthew 10:1)! Then why couldn’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 600, 12, 58, 'they cast it out? Because they didn''t believe that the Lord had given it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 600, 13, 58, 'to them. If you don''t believe, then nothing happens.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 600, 14, 58, 'This is a principle in the Christian life. You can access anything in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 600, 15, 58, 'the Scripture by faith alone. Christ died for your sins, but if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 600, 16, 58, 'don''t believe it, your sins are not forgiven. Christ can fill you with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 600, 17, 58, 'the Holy Spirit, but if you don''t believe it, you won’t be filled with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 600, 18, 58, 'the Spirit. Christ has given you authority over demons, but if you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 600, 19, 58, 'believe it, you will never have authority over demons. ”If you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 600, 20, 58, 'faith the size of a mustard seed, you will say to this mountain, ‘Move');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 600, 21, 58, 'from here to there,’ and it will move; and nothing will be impossible to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 600, 22, 58, 'you” (Matthew 17:20). The mountain is something that is a hindrance to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 600, 23, 58, 'my fulfilling the will of God in my life. There are some obstacles that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 600, 24, 58, 'God Himself places in our way. If He closes the door, there is no use');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 600, 25, 58, 'trying to bang at that door, since God Himself has closed it. But there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 600, 26, 58, 'are some mountains that the devil puts in our way, that hinder us from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 600, 27, 58, 'moving on in God''s purpose for our lives, and those mountains have to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 600, 28, 58, 'removed in Jesus’ name. We have to pray against them and make sure they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 601, 1, 58, 'get out of the way, because they are hindering us from fulfilling God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 601, 2, 58, 'will.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 601, 3, 58, 'How do you know whether this obstacle is from God or from the devil?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 601, 4, 58, 'There is absolutely no way to know it except by walking in the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 601, 5, 58, 'Spirit. That is why I say there is no rule book here. You have to learn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 601, 6, 58, 'to live by the Holy Spirit, keep a clear conscience, and walk in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 601, 7, 58, 'humility, and the Holy Spirit will tell you. “Those who are led by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 601, 8, 58, 'Holy Spirit, they are the sons of God” (Romans 8:14), and to come to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 601, 9, 58, 'that faith, you need to pray and fast (Matthew 17:21). There is a place');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 601, 10, 58, 'for prayer and fasting in secret, but not in public, while trying to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 601, 11, 58, 'cast out the demon. You must be prepared in private, before the time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 601, 12, 58, 'comes. Jesus prayed and fasted in private, and so, when the time came,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 601, 13, 58, 'He had the authority to cast out demons. We must recognize that it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 601, 14, 58, 'God''s will for us to have authority over all of Satan’s power. I believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 601, 15, 58, 'that God will help, if we trust him. Believe that for yourself!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 601, 16, 59, 'Chapter 58 Become Like a Child');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 601, 17, 59, 'Matthew 17:22 says, “While they were gathering together in Galilee,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 601, 18, 59, 'Jesus said to them, ‘The Son of man is going to be delivered into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 601, 19, 59, 'hands of men. They will kill Him and He will be raised on the third');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 601, 20, 59, 'day.’ And they were deeply grieved. When they had come to Capernaum,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 601, 21, 59, 'those who collected the two-drachma tax came to Peter and said, ‘Does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 601, 22, 59, 'your teacher not pay the two drachma-tax?’ He promptly said, ‘Yes.’ And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 601, 23, 59, 'when he came into the house, Jesus spoke to him first saying, ‘What do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 601, 24, 59, 'you think, Simon? From whom do the Kings of the earth collect customs or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 601, 25, 59, 'poll tax? From their sons or from strangers?’ Peter replied, ‘From');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 601, 26, 59, 'strangers,’ and Jesus said to him, ‘Consequently, the sons are exempt,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 601, 27, 59, 'but lest we give them offense, go to the sea and throw in a hook, take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 601, 28, 59, 'the first fish that comes up and when you open its mouth, you''ll find a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 602, 1, 59, 'shekel. Take that and give it to them for you and Me.’”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 602, 2, 59, 'Don’t Offend People Unnecessarily');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 602, 3, 59, 'We see something here of Jesus’ attitude towards things that He didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 602, 4, 59, 'have to do. He says, “I don''t have to pay the tax when I''m a son, but to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 602, 5, 59, 'avoid giving them offense, let’s pay it.” Sometimes in the Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 602, 6, 59, 'life we may have to do certain things, which we are not required to do,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 602, 7, 59, 'but we want to avoid giving offense. It is a great example Jesus has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 602, 8, 59, 'given us here by His life: that we don''t stand on our rights. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 602, 9, 59, 'question He asked was, “Do Kings ever collect tax from their own sons?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 602, 10, 59, 'No. Then the sons are exempt. So I really don''t have to pay tax, but I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 602, 11, 59, 'don''t want to give them offense, so let’s pay it.” Many people sometimes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 602, 12, 59, 'stand on their rights and they think that is standing for the truth and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 602, 13, 59, 'standing for the faith. Sometimes it can be pretty stupid. A true');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 602, 14, 59, 'Christian should be gracious. They would say, “Ok and I don’t want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 602, 15, 59, 'cause offense. It is a small thing. It is just a money matter. Take it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 602, 16, 59, 'I’ll pay it off, no problem,” instead of standing on some imaginary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 602, 17, 59, 'right that they think they have. There was one person who did not need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 602, 18, 59, 'to pay tax - it was Christ the Son of God. But He had this principle:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 602, 19, 59, '“Lest we give them offense.” Was Christ trying to please men? No. But He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 602, 20, 59, 'didn''t want anyone to cause anyone to stumble over a small thing like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 602, 21, 59, 'this. His aim was to win people to God. Our aim is to win people to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 602, 22, 59, 'Christ, and we want to make sure that nothing we do or stand for, causes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 602, 23, 59, 'offense to people unnecessarily. There is an offense called “the offense');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 602, 24, 59, 'of the cross” that we are willing to accept, but we don''t want to create');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 602, 25, 59, 'offense for unnecessary things that don''t relate to the offense of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 602, 26, 59, 'cross. And that''s where we need to be wise because some Christians are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 602, 27, 59, 'foolish and stand on certain rights they think they have, and they''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 602, 28, 59, 'very poor witnesses for Christ as a result. You can apply that to your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 603, 1, 59, 'own life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 603, 2, 59, 'For You and For Me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 603, 3, 59, 'The other beautiful thing I see here is that Jesus was so considerate.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 603, 4, 59, 'He said, “When you take that money, that will cover tax for you and for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 603, 5, 59, 'Me.” Notice how He said, “For you and Me” - what a beautiful expression.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 603, 6, 59, 'Jesus entered into partnership with Peter and paid His debt as well. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 603, 7, 59, 'like that because this is how the Lord treats you and me, too. You can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 603, 8, 59, 'take that for yourself. The Lord says, “That’s for you and me. I''m in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 603, 9, 59, 'partnership with you in this ministry.” Peter had forsaken everything to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 603, 10, 59, 'serve the Lord. Previously, Peter was a man who was spending his life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 603, 11, 59, 'making money as a fisherman. There would have been no requirement then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 603, 12, 59, 'for the Lord to say that to Peter. But since Peter had now forsaken');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 603, 13, 59, 'everything for the Lord''s sake, the Lord says to him, “Don''t worry, I''ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 603, 14, 59, 'take care of your tax as well.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 603, 15, 59, 'What about you? Do you sometimes try to cheat on your taxes? The Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 603, 16, 59, 'says, “You don''t have to. There''s no shortage of money with me. I can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 603, 17, 59, 'get money out of a fish''s mouth to pay your tax. I have a shortage of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 603, 18, 59, 'honest people, so don''t add to that shortage by cheating on your taxes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 603, 19, 59, 'yourself. I''ll give you the money to pay the tax. I can even get it out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 603, 20, 59, 'of fish’s mouth. I can provide it to you supernaturally, but I don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 603, 21, 59, 'want you to cheat and be crooked and don''t cause offense to people.” So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 603, 22, 59, 'there are some wonderful lessons here.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 603, 23, 59, 'We''re trying to learn all that Jesus taught so that in our lives, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 603, 24, 59, 'walk as Jesus walked. That''s our goal. 1 John 2:6 says, “Everyone who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 603, 25, 59, 'says he is a Christian must live like Christ lived,” as the Living Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 603, 26, 59, 'paraphrases, “Must walk as He walked.” We want to live by the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 603, 27, 59, 'principles by which Jesus lived. This is the purpose of our study.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 603, 28, 59, 'Do Not Seek Honor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 604, 1, 59, 'Matthew 18:1 says, “At that time the disciples came to Jesus saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 604, 2, 59, '‘Who is the greatest in the kingdom of heaven?’” This seems to have been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 604, 3, 59, 'an issue with the disciples many times. It’s an issue with many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 604, 4, 59, 'Christian leaders. Who is greater? You or me? There are a lot of people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 604, 5, 59, 'who say they''ve come to serve the meek and lowly as Jesus who washed the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 604, 6, 59, 'disciple’s feet when they come into Christian ministry. They’re always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 604, 7, 59, 'thinking, “Who is senior, you or me?” and there''s a great lust for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 604, 8, 59, 'seniority. Similarly, during the last supper, they were discussing who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 604, 9, 59, 'is the greatest. James and John wanted to sit on the right hand and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 604, 10, 59, 'left hand of the Jesus as greatest in heaven. That sounds like a good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 604, 11, 59, 'thing! They were saying “I don’t want to be great on earth, I want to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 604, 12, 59, 'great in heaven,” but even that is wrong because they were seeking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 604, 13, 59, 'honor. Wherever you seek honor, whether you seek it on the earth or in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 604, 14, 59, 'heaven, it''s wrong (this includes when James and John''s mother came to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 604, 15, 59, 'Jesus and said, “Put my sons on either side of you in the coming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 604, 16, 59, 'kingdom”).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 604, 17, 59, 'I''m sorry to say that I''ve seen this kind of honor seeking in every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 604, 18, 59, 'single denomination, and in every single church - in the purest, and in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 604, 19, 59, 'the most corrupt. This desire for position and power by the leaders and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 604, 20, 59, 'to be recognized as a leader among others is the exact opposite of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 604, 21, 59, 'spirit of Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 604, 22, 59, 'Seek to Be a Child');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 604, 23, 59, 'Jesus takes the most unlikely person on earth to be the greatest. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 604, 24, 59, 'called a little child unto Himself (we don''t know how old that child was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 604, 25, 59, '- this child must be a very, very little child), and He set the child');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 604, 26, 59, 'before them and said, “Listen fellows, forget about being the greatest.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 604, 27, 59, 'If you want to even enter the kingdom of heaven, you have to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 604, 28, 59, 'converted from your way of thinking and become like children. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 605, 1, 59, 'little child is not talking about being great.” Jesus started with what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 605, 2, 59, 'it means to enter the kingdom. To enter the kingdom, you must change');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 605, 3, 59, 'your entire way of thinking - that''s the meaning of being converted.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 605, 4, 59, 'Your whole mind and thought process must change. Your value system must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 605, 5, 59, 'change completely until you become like little children. Little children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 605, 6, 59, 'may fight for toys and all, but they''re not seeking for honor in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 605, 7, 59, 'world; they''re not seeking to be great people in the church. Isn''t it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 605, 8, 59, 'wonderful? Have you ever seen a little child wanting to be an elder in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 605, 9, 59, 'church or wanting to be a leader in a church? No. A little 1-year-old or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 605, 10, 59, '2-year-old child, or a little child lying in a cradle, doesn''t want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 605, 11, 59, 'be a leader anywhere. That''s the spirit that’s going to take you into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 605, 12, 59, 'God''s kingdom. That’s stage one. And then after entering the kingdom, if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 605, 13, 59, 'you want to be the greatest in the kingdom, then you have to keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 605, 14, 59, 'humbling yourself like this child (verse 3). You must be converted and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 605, 15, 59, 'become like this child first (exhibit the same helpless dependence a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 605, 16, 59, 'child has on its parents) to come to a life of helpless dependence upon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 605, 17, 59, 'God. That’s how you enter the kingdom. That''s what faith means. Then you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 605, 18, 59, 'keep humbling yourself and humbling yourself and gradually you become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 605, 19, 59, 'the greatest in God''s kingdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 605, 20, 59, 'Humility, Humility, Humility');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 605, 21, 59, 'It is by humility that you become the greatest. I''ve often said, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 605, 22, 59, 'three secrets of the Christian life are first: humility, second:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 605, 23, 59, 'humility, and third: humility. That''s it. That is the way, and I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 605, 24, 59, 'preached this for years, but I find even those who’ve heard me preach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 605, 25, 59, 'this for twenty to thirty years are still seeking to be great in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 605, 26, 59, 'church. Jesus once told a parable (at the end of Matthew 19) where the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 605, 27, 59, 'rich young ruler went away saying, “I can’t give up all that I have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 605, 28, 59, 'follow you.” Peter went up to Jesus and said, “Hey Lord, this guy was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 606, 1, 59, 'not willing to give up everything He had to follow You, but we gave up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 606, 2, 59, 'everything to follow You. What are we going to get?” And the Lord said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 606, 3, 59, '“Okay, I''ll tell you what you’re going to get. If you’ve given up house');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 606, 4, 59, 'and land, the Lord will give you back house and lands and persecutions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 606, 5, 59, 'here on this earth, and also eternal life” (Matthew 19:29). And then He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 606, 6, 59, 'said, “I''ll tell you a parable about this business of wanting to get the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 606, 7, 59, 'highest reward and be greatest in the kingdom.” He tells the story of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 606, 8, 59, 'the laborers and the people who came last, which we’ll come to in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 606, 9, 59, 'later chapter.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 606, 10, 59, 'Humility is what Jesus was constantly emphasizing. It''s not the people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 606, 11, 59, 'you think are right in front who are going to be greatest in God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 606, 12, 59, 'kingdom. It is the one who is humble, the one who was really willing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 606, 13, 59, 'take the low place. He doesn''t want fame and is not trying to get his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 606, 14, 59, 'name in the newspaper. A little baby is not bothered whether people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 606, 15, 59, 'photograph him or not. He is not trying to get into every picture. He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 606, 16, 59, 'not trying to be somebody great. He is just a little child. I often');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 606, 17, 59, 'meditate on a little one-month old child in a cradle. I say, “What type');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 606, 18, 59, 'of thoughts are going through this child''s mind?” He is not thinking,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 606, 19, 59, '“What a great smart guy I am,” or “How handsome I am,” or “Look how much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 606, 20, 59, 'people admire me,” or “How many people are photographing me?” There''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 606, 21, 59, 'not a single thought like that in the mind of that one-month old child.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 606, 22, 59, 'If you pinch that child today and go away, then come back tomorrow,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 606, 23, 59, 'you’ll see that when you come, he will smile at you! He doesn’t even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 606, 24, 59, 'remember that you pinched him yesterday. What a wonderful thing it is to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 606, 25, 59, 'be like a little child in total humility - no grudges, no complaints, no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 606, 26, 59, 'memory of some evil that you did to it yesterday. That is true humility,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 606, 27, 59, 'and such a person is the greatest in God''s kingdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 606, 28, 59, 'Receive a Child in Jesus’ Name');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 607, 1, 59, 'Jesus goes on to say, “If you receive one such child in My name, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 607, 2, 59, 'will receive Me” (Matthew 18:5). You’ve got to compare this with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 607, 3, 59, 'other verse when Jesus said to His apostles, in Matthew 10:40, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 607, 4, 59, '“Whoever receives you, receives Me.” That means when you receive an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 607, 5, 59, 'apostle of Jesus Christ, you’re actually receiving Christ. But there are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 607, 6, 59, 'not many apostles in the world - I can count on my fingers on one hand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 607, 7, 59, 'the number of apostles I’ve met in my life of 53 years as a believer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 607, 8, 59, 'There are not at all many apostles in the world. So how in the world can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 607, 9, 59, 'you receive Christ? Well, you can receive a little child. It is the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 607, 10, 59, 'word, “Whoever receives an apostle receives Me” and “Whoever receives a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 607, 11, 59, 'child also receives Me.” Plus, children are more abundant than apostles.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 607, 12, 59, 'They''re everywhere!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 607, 13, 59, 'If you want to receive Jesus, receive a child in Jesus’ name. When you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 607, 14, 59, 'have a baby born into your home, what is Jesus teaching? Receive that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 607, 15, 59, 'child in Jesus’ name. You know how it is in India, if it''s a girl they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 607, 16, 59, 'say, “Oh no, another girl.” That''s not receiving a child in Jesus’ name.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 607, 17, 59, 'Certainly not. But that child is God''s gift to you. God is the One Who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 607, 18, 59, 'determined the sex of that child. God is the One Who determined that it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 607, 19, 59, 'had to be a girl. Whatever heathen tradition and philosophy and religion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 607, 20, 59, 'may teach, God creates men and women. God created male and female in His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 607, 21, 59, 'image and lot of Christians also sometimes think that God created only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 607, 22, 59, 'males in His image and not females. So when a little girl is born,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 607, 23, 59, 'they’re disappointed. They may not express it, but in their heart,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 607, 24, 59, 'they''re disappointed. That is evil. It is not just a weakness, it is one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 607, 25, 59, '100% evil! It is the mark of an unbeliever, it is the mark of an atheist');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 607, 26, 59, 'who doesn''t believe in God. If you get a daughter and you say, “Oh no,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 607, 27, 59, 'why another daughter?” God decided that you needed a daughter and God’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 607, 28, 59, 'going to fulfill a great plan through that little girl. It''s very sad. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 608, 1, 59, 'can understand heathen people - godless atheists - having that attitude,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 608, 2, 59, 'but when Christians have that attitude, I''d say they are no better than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 608, 3, 59, 'those godless atheists. They’re Christians only in name. In actual fact,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 608, 4, 59, 'they are godless atheists who have a Christianized religion. But they''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 608, 5, 59, 'not spiritual.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 608, 6, 59, 'Receive a child in Jesus name and don''t say, “Oh, how dark that child');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 608, 7, 59, 'is!” Does God create dark children? Does He create only white children?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 608, 8, 59, 'What wrong ideas! These are born-again Christians have who behave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 608, 9, 59, 'exactly like the heathen when it comes to this area. Receive that child');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 608, 10, 59, 'in Jesus’ name and don''t judge your child just because he is not as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 608, 11, 59, 'intelligent in school as somebody else''s is. Everybody’s child cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 608, 12, 59, 'come first in the class. Accept your child with whatever measure of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 608, 13, 59, 'intelligence God has given him. Receive the child in Jesus’ name. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 608, 14, 59, 'is a fundamental aspect of true Christianity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 608, 15, 59, 'Jesus goes on to say a number of things about little children. First He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 608, 16, 59, 'says, “To enter the kingdom of heaven, you must be converted and become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 608, 17, 59, 'like little children.” Then He says that If you want to be great in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 608, 18, 59, 'kingdom of heaven, you’ve got to keep on humbling yourself in every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 608, 19, 59, 'situation like little children who are perfect examples of humility');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 608, 20, 59, '(Matthew 18:4). That humility means helpless dependence. A little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 608, 21, 59, 'one-month old child is so helpless in a cradle, he is not ashamed to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 608, 22, 59, 'admit “I need my mummy for everything,” and in that way, I need to say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 608, 23, 59, 'that I need God for everything. If I want to know what to do next, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 608, 24, 59, 'has to tell me. This is humility. Humility is not bowing your head down');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 608, 25, 59, 'and talking softly. That''s all counterfeit. Humility is that helpless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 608, 26, 59, 'dependence on God, saying, “I need God''s help for every little thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 608, 27, 59, 'just like a little child.” If you keep walking like that, you''ll be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 608, 28, 59, 'great in God''s kingdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 609, 1, 59, 'Causing Others to Stumble');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 609, 2, 59, 'Jesus goes on to speak about receiving children in His name and He gives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 609, 3, 59, 'a warning: “If you cause one of these little ones who believe in me to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 609, 4, 59, 'stumble…” Deep down in a child''s heart, I believe it has some awareness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 609, 5, 59, 'of God in heaven. I don''t know, but I believe that God has put that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 609, 6, 59, 'awareness in a child and I believe what Jesus said, “If you cause one of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 609, 7, 59, 'these little ones to stumble, it is better for you to tie a heavy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 609, 8, 59, 'millstone around your neck and be drowned in the depth of the sea.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 609, 9, 59, 'These are very strong words. Do you stumble little children by anything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 609, 10, 59, 'you do or say? When a father and mother fight in the house, what are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 609, 11, 59, 'they doing? They are stumbling their poor little children in the house');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 609, 12, 59, 'showing them that Christianity does not deliver you from anger, it does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 609, 13, 59, 'not deliver you from foul filthy mouth; it just teaches you to sing a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 609, 14, 59, 'song on Sunday. You''re stumbling those little children! When you dress');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 609, 15, 59, 'in an immodest way, you''re stumbling little children in your church. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 609, 16, 59, 'six-year-old girls and 10-year-old girls go to their dads and say, “Why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 609, 17, 59, 'can’t I dress like that sister?” You''re a stumbling block when you dress');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 609, 18, 59, 'immodestly, when you expose parts of your body that you shouldn''t be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 609, 19, 59, 'exposing. Girls, when you wear tight-fitting clothes around the upper or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 609, 20, 59, 'lower part of your body to provoke men to lust, you''re stumbling other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 609, 21, 59, 'girls who are younger than you. You''re making it difficult for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 609, 22, 59, 'fathers of those girls to protect them from such things because you (an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 609, 23, 59, 'older sister in the church) are setting such a bad example. And some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 609, 24, 59, 'older sisters dressed like this may even be teaching Sunday school! That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 609, 25, 59, 'compounds the error - the crime - when you dress like that and dare to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 609, 26, 59, 'teach Sunday School. Sunday School teaching is not just sharing academic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 609, 27, 59, 'knowledge of the Bible; it’s your whole appearance and bearing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 609, 28, 59, 'If you are like that, let me tell you what you should do: you should go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 610, 1, 59, 'to a hardware shop and buy a millstone and make sure it''s really heavy,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 610, 2, 59, 'something like twenty kilograms. Get a really heavy stone and get a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 610, 3, 59, 'rope, tie it around your neck, and go jump in the sea! Those are the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 610, 4, 59, 'words of Jesus. He is not telling you to actually do that, but He’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 610, 5, 59, 'saying, “It''s better you do that than be a stumbling block to these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 610, 6, 59, 'children.” See the strong words He uses. Sometimes people tell me,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 610, 7, 59, '“Brother Zac, you speak so hard and strong.” I say, “You haven''t heard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 610, 8, 59, 'Jesus!” Have you ever heard me say anything like this: “Tie a millstone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 610, 9, 59, 'around your neck go jump in the sea?” That’s very strong and I would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 610, 10, 59, 'never say that to anyone, but Jesus said it. He was trying to emphasize');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 610, 11, 59, 'how terrible it is to do something that would stumble little children. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 610, 12, 59, 'don''t know whether you realize the seriousness of that crime.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 610, 13, 59, 'Then He goes on to say in Matthew 18:7, “There''ll always be stumbling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 610, 14, 59, 'blocks. As long as this world exists, there will be stumbling blocks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 610, 15, 59, 'that you can’t avoid.” In your church, there will be stumbling blocks.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 610, 16, 59, 'No matter how much we preach and no matter what they hear, there will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 610, 17, 59, 'still some stubborn girls and young women who will defy authority and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 610, 18, 59, 'misbehave and dress the way they like and stumble younger people. What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 610, 19, 59, 'shall we do? Woe unto the world because of its stumbling blocks - it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 610, 20, 59, 'inevitable. “These stumbling blocks will come, but woe to that person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 610, 21, 59, 'through whom this stumbling block comes” (Matthew 18:7). There''s a real');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 610, 22, 59, 'woe and curse on any brother or sister who stumbles little children by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 610, 23, 59, 'their conduct, by their anger, by their misbehavior or by their immodest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 610, 24, 59, 'dress.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 610, 25, 59, 'So what should you do? Here is the solution (Jesus’ solutions are always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 610, 26, 59, 'radical): Jesus says, “If it''s your hand or your foot is causing you to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 610, 27, 59, 'stumble, just cut it off.” Dear brother or sister, have you ever heard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 610, 28, 59, 'preaching like this? “If your hand offends you cut it off; if your foot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 611, 1, 59, 'offends you cut it off.” I think people would say to such a preacher,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 611, 2, 59, '“Be Christlike, man, when you''re preaching.” They don''t realize that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 611, 3, 59, 'this is Christlike; This is exactly what Jesus said. If your hand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 611, 4, 59, 'offends you, cut it off; if your foot offends you cut it off. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 611, 5, 59, 'better for you to enter into life crippled or lame than to have two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 611, 6, 59, 'hands and two feet but go straight into the eternal fire of hell.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 611, 7, 59, 'He''s talking about offending others by our conduct. Do you know that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 611, 8, 59, 'can go to eternal fire by offending others by your conduct? Therefore,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 611, 9, 59, 'this is something that we need to take very, very seriously. He says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 611, 10, 59, 'further, “If it’s your eye (whether it''s your hand or your feet or your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 611, 11, 59, 'eye) that causes you to stumble, pluck it out and throw it from you.” It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 611, 12, 59, 'is better for you to enter life without eyes without hands without legs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 611, 13, 59, 'than to have all these members of your body and go to hell.” What’s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 611, 14, 59, 'subject He is talking about? He''s talking about offending little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 611, 15, 59, 'children, so He comes back to it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 611, 16, 59, 'Jesus says, first of all, “See that you don''t stumble one of these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 611, 17, 59, 'little ones” (Matthew 18:6). Then He goes on to say, “Don''t despise one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 611, 18, 59, 'of these little ones - don''t look down on little children.” Woe unto');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 611, 19, 59, 'that church which despises or looks down upon their little children! I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 611, 20, 59, 'often say in our church the children are all flowers. We may not be rich');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 611, 21, 59, 'enough to put real flowers in our church, but we can have these little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 611, 22, 59, 'children. These are all our flowers and as Jesus said, “See that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 611, 23, 59, 'don''t despise one of these little ones, for I say to you that their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 611, 24, 59, 'angels in heaven continually behold the face of My Father who is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 611, 25, 59, 'heaven” (Matthew 18:10). So it appears to me that every child has an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 611, 26, 59, 'angel, at least one, maybe more. That angel is always in the presence of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 611, 27, 59, 'the Father and, at the same time, available to this child on earth to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 611, 28, 59, 'protect it from harm and danger and every type of evil. So He said, “Be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 612, 1, 59, 'careful that you don''t despise one of these little ones because the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 612, 2, 59, 'angel will report you to the Father, for the Son of Man has come to seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 612, 3, 59, 'and to save that which is lost.” This is a beautiful section here on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 612, 4, 59, 'children, emphasizing that Jesus came even to save little children. So I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 612, 5, 59, 'would encourage you to meditate on this passage to understand what Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 612, 6, 59, 'taught about our attitude toward little children.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 612, 7, 60, 'Chapter 59 Authority in the Local Church Body');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 612, 8, 60, 'Bringing Children to Faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 612, 9, 60, 'In Matthew 18:11, Jesus said, “The Son of Man has come to seek and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 612, 10, 60, 'save that which was lost.” Remember that in the previous ten verses, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 612, 11, 60, 'was talking about little children. Jesus even came to seek and to save');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 612, 12, 60, 'them. When you read that verse in the context of the previous verses,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 612, 13, 60, 'you find He is talking about seeking and saving little children and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 612, 14, 60, 'bringing them to faith. There are lot of people who don''t believe in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 612, 15, 60, 'bringing little children to faith, but Jesus did. He was interested in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 612, 16, 60, 'seeking and saving them! It is better to see what Jesus says rather than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 612, 17, 60, 'to see what clever preachers today have to say on the subject.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 612, 18, 60, 'Consider verses 12-13, remembering that the subject is little children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 612, 19, 60, 'whom the Son of Man has come to seek and to save. “What do you think? If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 612, 20, 60, 'a man has a hundred sheep, and one of them has gone astray (let''s assume');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 612, 21, 60, 'that one lost sheep is actually a little lamb, not even a sheep),');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 612, 22, 60, 'doesn’t he leave the ninety-nine on the mountains and go and search for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 612, 23, 60, 'the one that is straying? And if it turns out that he finds it, truly, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 612, 24, 60, 'say to you, he rejoices over it more than over the ninety-nine which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 612, 25, 60, 'have not gone astray.” We should rejoice over one little lamb, one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 612, 26, 60, 'little child, that has found Christ and surrendered his or her life to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 612, 27, 60, 'Christ. Verse 14 says, “Thus, it is not the will of your Father in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 612, 28, 60, 'heaven that one of these little ones perish.” Again, the emphasis is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 613, 1, 60, 'almost as though the Lord knew that in the 21st century, a new teaching');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 613, 2, 60, 'would arise among some evangelical Christians that we should not tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 613, 3, 60, 'little children to receive Jesus as their Savior, because it doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 613, 4, 60, 'mean anything. Yet Jesus clearly says that it is not the will of your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 613, 5, 60, 'Father that even one of these little ones perish. It’s almost as though');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 613, 6, 60, 'these folks have never read these verses. We praise God for Sunday');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 613, 7, 60, 'schools and for all those who work among little children, so that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 613, 8, 60, 'can put faith into their hearts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 613, 9, 60, 'I remember that when I was a little boy in Sunday school, many times I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 613, 10, 60, 'asked Jesus to come into my heart. I did not know what the right time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 613, 11, 60, 'was, and the assurance of my salvation came into my heart much later,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 613, 12, 60, 'but I know it was that Sunday school teaching which protected me from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 613, 13, 60, 'gross sins when I joined the military. In the military academy and in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 613, 14, 60, 'the navy, many of my colleagues went into gross sins. What protected me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 613, 15, 60, 'was the teaching that I received in Sunday school. In those days, I was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 613, 16, 60, 'not even really converted perhaps, but the little fear of God that was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 613, 17, 60, 'put into my heart protected me even though I was unconverted. I thank');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 613, 18, 60, 'God for those teachers in Sunday school who put a little fear of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 613, 19, 60, 'into my heart, and I want to say to all of you who work with little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 613, 20, 60, 'children. Be encouraged by Matthew 18:14, “It is not the will of your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 613, 21, 60, 'Father that even one of these little ones perish.” God wants every one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 613, 22, 60, 'of those children to be saved. Pharaoh told Moses, “Your men can go and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 613, 23, 60, 'serve the Lord if you want, but leave the little ones here.” Do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 613, 24, 60, 'think Moses would do that? A lot of people today leave their little ones');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 613, 25, 60, 'in Egypt and don''t seem to be bothered by it, but not Moses. Moses said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 613, 26, 60, '“We''re not going to be leaving our little ones behind. We''re going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 613, 27, 60, 'take them out of Egypt.” That''s the passion you must have, dear brothers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 613, 28, 60, 'and sisters. If you''re an elder in a church, dear brother, or if you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 614, 1, 60, 'a father or a mother, brother or sister, then you need to have that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 614, 2, 60, 'passion. We''re not going to leave our little children behind in Egypt.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 614, 3, 60, 'It is not God''s will that even one of these little ones perish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 614, 4, 60, 'eternally. The Good Shepherd wants to go out to those little lambs, put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 614, 5, 60, 'them on His shoulder, and carry them home. He does that through His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 614, 6, 60, 'servants nowadays, and so, I want to encourage you to understand what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 614, 7, 60, 'Jesus taught about leading little children to faith and repentance,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 614, 8, 60, 'because they have things to repent of as well. They may have things to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 614, 9, 60, 'go and apologize to their parents and teachers about, and then they can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 614, 10, 60, 'turn to God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 614, 11, 60, 'Discipline in the Local Church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 614, 12, 60, 'Jesus then goes on to speak in verses 15-20 about local church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 614, 13, 60, 'situations where discipline is needed. There are only two times, by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 614, 14, 60, 'way, when Jesus spoke about the church. He used the word “church” in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 614, 15, 60, 'Gospels only twice, once in Matthew 16 and once Matthew 18. In Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 614, 16, 60, '16:18, He speaks about the worldwide Church, the entire body of Christ,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 614, 17, 60, 'many of whom are already in heaven and many of whom are in different');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 614, 18, 60, 'countries. But here, in Matthew 18, He speaks about the local church. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 614, 19, 60, 'speaks about both the universal Church and the local church. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 614, 20, 60, 'universal Church is the total body of Christ mentioned in Matthew 16:18.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 614, 21, 60, 'The local church is the local expression of that body of Christ which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 614, 22, 60, 'Christ mentions in Matthew 18:17.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 614, 23, 60, 'This is a church of people to whom you can speak. You can’t speak to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 614, 24, 60, 'worldwide Church, because it is spread out all over the world. Nobody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 614, 25, 60, 'can ever speak to the worldwide church - many of them are in heaven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 614, 26, 60, 'anyway - but you can speak to the local church. This passage is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 614, 27, 60, 'referring to people in a local church, in a situation where a brother');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 614, 28, 60, 'has to be disciplined. This situation arises when a brother in a church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 615, 1, 60, 'sins. “Go and reprove him in private” (Matthew 18:15) is the principle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 615, 2, 60, 'that we must follow in all disciplinary matters in the church. The Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 615, 3, 60, 'recognizes that even a brother may sin. We don''t believe that believers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 615, 4, 60, 'will never sin. Believers can do wrong things, and it goes on further');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 615, 5, 60, 'here to say that some of those believers may be so stubborn that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 615, 6, 60, 'won''t even listen when the elders go and speak to them. So, He says that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 615, 7, 60, 'if a brother sins, go and reprove him in private. “If he listens to you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 615, 8, 60, 'you’ve won your brother. If he does not listen to you,” what should you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 615, 9, 60, 'do? There is a possibility that a brother may not listen to you and is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 615, 10, 60, 'stubborn in his disobedience and rebellion. In this case, “take one or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 615, 11, 60, 'two more with you, so that, in the mouth of two or three witnesses,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 615, 12, 60, 'every fact may be confirmed. If he refuses to listen to this group, tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 615, 13, 60, 'it to the church. If he refuses to listen even to the church, then let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 615, 14, 60, 'him be to you as a gentile and a tax collector, as an outcast” (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 615, 15, 60, '18:16-17).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 615, 16, 60, 'So, there are three stages. First, you speak to him personally. If he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 615, 17, 60, 'doesn''t listen you, speak to him with two or three others. If he still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 615, 18, 60, 'doesn''t listen, then the next stage is to speak to the church, and tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 615, 19, 60, 'the church that this brother, who is not listening, who''s not responding');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 615, 20, 60, 'to correction, is no longer a part of this church. He is like a tax');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 615, 21, 60, 'collector. He is an outsider. He is not part of the body of Christ here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 615, 22, 60, 'anymore. What God does with him is God''s business, but as far as this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 615, 23, 60, 'local church is concerned, we’ve relieved ourselves of all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 615, 24, 60, 'responsibility. As far as he''s concerned, he is out.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 615, 25, 60, 'The Authority of the Church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 615, 26, 60, 'In that connection, Jesus says that the church has authority. These are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 615, 27, 60, 'similar words to what He spoke in Matthew 16:19, when He spoke to Peter.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 615, 28, 60, 'In this passage, He’s speaking to the elders of the church (obviously');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 616, 1, 60, 'the two or three who go and speak to this man are all the elders of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 616, 2, 60, 'church). If the person doesn’t even listen to the elders, then all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 616, 3, 60, 'elders can do is tell the church. Then He says the elders of the church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 616, 4, 60, 'can exercise the authority to bind and to loose. Whatever they bind on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 616, 5, 60, 'earth will be bound in the heavenlies and whatever they loose on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 616, 6, 60, 'earth will be loosed in the heavenlies. We can put a person out of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 616, 7, 60, 'church and we have spiritual authority to bind satanic powers in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 616, 8, 60, 'heavenlies that try to cause confusion in the church through disobedient');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 616, 9, 60, 'people. That''s why in one case we read, in 1 Corinthians 5, Paul handed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 616, 10, 60, 'over a person to Satan. He had that authority. He was exercising the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 616, 11, 60, 'authority that the Lord has given to apostles and elders.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 616, 12, 60, '“Again I say to you, if two of you agree on earth about anything that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 616, 13, 60, 'they may ask, it will be done for them by my Father in heaven,” (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 616, 14, 60, '18:19). Consider this binding, and the authority that these people have.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 616, 15, 60, 'Binding in such a situation, the Lord says, is best exercised by at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 616, 16, 60, 'least two people. That means there are two godly men who are in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 616, 17, 60, 'agreement, and they ask that in a situation when Satan attempts to bring');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 616, 18, 60, 'confusion into the church, that he be bound, and that people who are in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 616, 19, 60, 'bondage be released. It may be that many people in a church are in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 616, 20, 60, 'bondage because of one person. God gives us the authority to release');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 616, 21, 60, 'those people, because where two or three are gathered together in Jesus’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 616, 22, 60, 'name, He is in the midst (v20). Now you see the whole context of this.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 616, 23, 60, 'Jesus is talking about the church, and verse 20 is almost like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 616, 24, 60, 'definition of the church: it’s two or three gathered together. If the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 616, 25, 60, 'Lord had said, “Where 200 or 300 are gathered in My Name, there I am in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 616, 26, 60, 'their midst,” then I would never be a part of a small church. I would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 616, 27, 60, 'look for a minimum of 200 people if that was the standard Jesus set, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 616, 28, 60, 'thank God that He said, “two or three.” In many of the early churches');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 617, 1, 60, 'and some of the churches we''ve seen in different countries, they started');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 617, 2, 60, 'with two or three gathering together in the name of Jesus. Christ was in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 617, 3, 60, 'the center, the Lord was present, and they exercised authority in His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 617, 4, 60, 'name.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 617, 5, 60, 'Conditions of Spiritual Authority in the Church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 617, 6, 60, 'We need to understand what it means to gather together in Jesus’ name.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 617, 7, 60, 'First of all, what does the name “Jesus” mean? The meaning of Jesus’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 617, 8, 60, 'name is found in the very first chapter of Matthew. In Matthew 1:21, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 617, 9, 60, 'angel said, “You shall call His name Jesus, because He''s going to save');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 617, 10, 60, 'His people from their sins.” So, a group of people who are gathering');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 617, 11, 60, 'together in the name of Jesus, the One Who''s come to save His people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 617, 12, 60, 'from their sins, is a group of two or three people who want to be saved');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 617, 13, 60, 'from their sins. It is not just two or three people who are carnal and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 617, 14, 60, 'worldly and living for themselves who can say, “We come in the name of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 617, 15, 60, 'Jesus.” That type of religious group could be Babylon. They don''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 617, 16, 60, 'any authority at all. It is two or three people who have understood the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 617, 17, 60, 'meaning of the name of Jesus, and who have come together in His name.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 617, 18, 60, 'Never forget this. This verse is used glibly by many Christian groups');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 617, 19, 60, 'that only imagine Jesus is in their midst. Don''t you think the church in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 617, 20, 60, 'Laodicea invoked this verse in their meetings whenever they met');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 617, 21, 60, 'together? The church in Laodicea, described in Revelation 3:14-22, would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 617, 22, 60, 'gather together and say, “We thank You, Lord. You''re in our midst. Your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 617, 23, 60, 'Word says that ‘where two or three are gathered together in Jesus’ name,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 617, 24, 60, 'He is in the midst.’” But He wasn''t in their midst. Jesus tells them, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 617, 25, 60, 'Revelation 3:20, “I stand at the door and knock. If anyone hears My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 617, 26, 60, 'voice and opens the door, I will come in to him and eat with him, and he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 617, 27, 60, 'with Me.” So where was He? Was He inside or outside the church? He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 617, 28, 60, 'outside, seeking for entrance into individual lives, because the church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 618, 1, 60, 'itself had rejected Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 618, 2, 60, 'A lot of churches today who claim to have Christ in their midst don’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 618, 3, 60, 'actually have Him in their midst at all. He is outside the door, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 618, 4, 60, 'perhaps nowhere near the door. He had left it and gone away long, long');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 618, 5, 60, 'ago. He has given up trying to enter that church because of the hopeless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 618, 6, 60, 'situation. So, it is not just a question of religiously using the Name');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 618, 7, 60, 'of Jesus. Have you come together with the understanding of the meaning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 618, 8, 60, 'of that Name, which means to be saved from our sins? That''s very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 618, 9, 60, 'important.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 618, 10, 60, 'The Measure of Forgiveness that Jesus Commands');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 618, 11, 60, 'Then Peter came and said to Jesus in Matthew 18:21, “Lord, how often');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 618, 12, 60, 'shall my brother sin against me, and I forgive him?” Remember the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 618, 13, 60, 'has been speaking about a brother who sins in verse 18. A brother who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 618, 14, 60, 'sins in the church may have hurt somebody. So, Peter is asking the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 618, 15, 60, 'question, “Suppose a brother keeps on doing something, more than once.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 618, 16, 60, 'How often shall my brother sin against me, and I forgive him?” Maybe he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 618, 17, 60, 'repents and comes back, and says, “I''m sorry.” The Lord said that we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 618, 18, 60, 'forgive a brother if he repents and comes back. I want you to compare');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 618, 19, 60, 'this verse with Luke 17:3, “Be on your guard!” Jesus says. “If your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 618, 20, 60, 'brother sins, rebuke him…” This is similar to what we read in Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 618, 21, 60, '18:15, “and if he repents, forgive him.” What if he doesn''t actually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 618, 22, 60, 'repent?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 618, 23, 60, 'This is the question. How often shall my brother sin, and I forgive him?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 618, 24, 60, 'Okay, he repents, and I forgive him. But how often should we do this?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 618, 25, 60, 'Suppose he comes to me many times a day. Jesus said, “Peter, you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 618, 26, 60, 'tried to be very gracious and say, ‘Shall I do that seven times in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 618, 27, 60, 'day?’ No. I tell you seventy times seven times.” If you look at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 618, 28, 60, 'parallel passage in Luke 17, it says there that if your brother sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 619, 1, 60, 'against you seven times in a single day, you must forgive him. If a day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 619, 2, 60, 'is 12 to 14 hours, this means that every two hours, he does something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 619, 3, 60, 'wrong against you. Every two hours, he does something wrong and comes to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 619, 4, 60, 'you and says, “I''m sorry.” Two hours later, he again does something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 619, 5, 60, 'similar and says, “I''m sorry. I repent.” Again, after two hours, he does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 619, 6, 60, 'the same thing. I would imagine that by the third or fourth time he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 619, 7, 60, 'comes, you couldn’t even trust him. But, the Lord says in Luke 17:4, if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 619, 8, 60, 'he comes back to you seven times, forgive him. Then, the apostles said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 619, 9, 60, 'in verse 5, “Oh Lord, increase our faith. Please, help us to believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 619, 10, 60, 'that this guy is genuine. When He comes back seven times in a day, give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 619, 11, 60, 'us faith to believe that. It is very difficult to believe when he comes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 619, 12, 60, 'back seven times, that he is genuine.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 619, 13, 60, 'We read similar words here in Matthew 18. How often shall I forgive him?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 619, 14, 60, 'Up to seven times in a day, perhaps? And Jesus said to him, “I don''t say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 619, 15, 60, 'to you seven times, but up to 70 times 7 times (490 times in a day), if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 619, 16, 60, 'he comes and asks for forgiveness.” This would mean that every few');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 619, 17, 60, 'minutes, the person repeats the same thing. He says, “Oh, I''m sorry.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 619, 18, 60, 'Forgive me.” Then a few minutes later, he does the same thing. 490');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 619, 19, 60, 'times. What is the meaning of this? I mean, nobody does the same thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 619, 20, 60, '490 times a day. Not even the worst husband and wife clash 490 times a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 619, 21, 60, 'day. So, what the Lord meant is an infinite number of times, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 619, 22, 60, 'that''s how God forgives us. You can go to God a million times in a day,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 619, 23, 60, 'and He will forgive you. He is always there to forgive.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 619, 24, 60, 'Why We Must Forgive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 619, 25, 60, 'Then Jesus told a story about the basis of forgiving others. It’s very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 619, 26, 60, 'important to understand what is the basis on which we forgive others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 619, 27, 60, 'Why should we forgive others constantly? Jesus told the story about this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 619, 28, 60, 'man who was a king, who wanted to settle accounts with the slaves. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 620, 1, 60, 'he began to settle them, there was a man who owed him ten thousand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 620, 2, 60, 'talents. That''s a lot of money, equal to a billion rupees. So, here''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 620, 3, 60, 'man who owes 1 billion rupees, and he didn''t have any means to repay');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 620, 4, 60, 'even one rupee. So, the king commanded him to be sold along with his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 620, 5, 60, 'wife and children, until he had made repayment for everything. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 620, 6, 60, 'slave, therefore, fell down and said, “Please have patience with me. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 620, 7, 60, 'will repay you everything.” First of all, this is a ridiculous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 620, 8, 60, 'statement. How in the world is he going to repay 1 billion rupees when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 620, 9, 60, 'he doesn’t have anything to pay right now? And he is a slave. The lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 620, 10, 60, 'of that slave felt compassion, released him, and forgave him his debt.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 620, 11, 60, 'He said, “Okay, you''re free. You don''t have to be sold as a slave and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 620, 12, 60, 'you don’t have to go to jail. You are forgiven. Go home and be free with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 620, 13, 60, 'your family.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 620, 14, 60, 'That slave went out and found another fellow slave who owed him a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 620, 15, 60, 'hundred denarii. One denarii is one day''s wage for a laborer. Not a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 620, 16, 60, 'skilled laborer; just an ordinary laborer. Let''s say this man’s wages');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 620, 17, 60, 'for one day was a hundred rupees and he owed his Lord 10,000 rupees.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 620, 18, 60, 'Now, 10,000 rupees is not a small amount of money. It is quite a bit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 620, 19, 60, 'money. 10,000 rupees for a laborer is three months’ salary. And the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 620, 20, 60, 'slave caught his fellow slave by the throat and said, “Pay back my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 620, 21, 60, '10,000 bucks!” The fellow slave said exactly the same thing as the first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 620, 22, 60, 'slave. He fell down before him and said, “Please have patience with me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 620, 23, 60, 'I''ll repay you.” Exactly the same words the first slave had spoken to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 620, 24, 60, 'the king. But the slave was unmerciful, and he said, “No. I will not let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 620, 25, 60, 'you go. You have to pay up right now. You don''t have any choice.” And he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 620, 26, 60, 'took him to court, got him convicted, and put him into jail until he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 620, 27, 60, 'could pay back everything that he owed (v30).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 620, 28, 60, 'Some of the other slaves heard about this and saw what happened. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 621, 1, 60, 'were very grieved, and came to the king and said, “You know what this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 621, 2, 60, 'guy did, whom you forgave so much?” The king called that slave back and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 621, 3, 60, 'said in verse 32, “You wicked slave. I forgave you all the debt, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 621, 4, 60, 'you entreated me. Don''t you think you should have had mercy on your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 621, 5, 60, 'fellow slave even as I had mercy on you?” Be merciful to others just as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 621, 6, 60, 'God had been merciful to you. And the king was so angry with this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 621, 7, 60, 'unmerciful slave that he didn''t just put him in jail, he said, “Get the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 621, 8, 60, 'torturers.” In those days, there were people who not only put people in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 621, 9, 60, 'jail, but who tortured these people in jail. So, it was a double');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 621, 10, 60, 'punishment until he repaid those 1 billion rupees, which he''d never be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 621, 11, 60, 'able to repay in his lifetime in jail.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 621, 12, 60, 'The Consequences of Unforgiveness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 621, 13, 60, 'What is the point of this story? Jesus said, “So will My Heavenly Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 621, 14, 60, 'do to each of you, who does not forgive his brother from his heart.” So,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 621, 15, 60, 'this is talking about a believer not forgiving another believer who has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 621, 16, 60, 'done some wrong to them. It’s talking about forgiving, not just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 621, 17, 60, 'externally, but from your heart. It doesn''t matter what the crime is. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 621, 18, 60, 'is still less than 1/1000th of what you have done to God. Maybe you feel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 621, 19, 60, 'that that person has done a terrible crime against you. But it is like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 621, 20, 60, 'the 10,000-rupee debt. It may be a big thing; 10,000 rupees is a big');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 621, 21, 60, 'amount of money. But, when you compare it to 1 billion? It’s 1/100,000th');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 621, 22, 60, 'of it. That means what we owe to God is 100,000 times what anybody could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 621, 23, 60, 'ever owe us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 621, 24, 60, 'Why can''t you forgive, if God has forgiven you so much? That''s the point');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 621, 25, 60, 'of the parable. Who are these torturers in the spiritual terms? They are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 621, 26, 60, 'the demons. This means that God can actually allow demons to torture');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 621, 27, 60, 'believers because of an unforgiving spirit they have towards others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 621, 28, 60, 'That, I really believe, is the reason why many believers are sick. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 622, 1, 60, 'is not to say that all sickness is caused by sin or an unforgiving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 622, 2, 60, 'spirit, but I’m absolutely convinced that a lot of sickness among');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 622, 3, 60, 'believers is caused by an unforgiving spirit. This is the cause of maybe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 622, 4, 60, '20% of illnesses among believers. Then maybe 80% of illnesses are caused');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 622, 5, 60, 'by the fact that we live in a world that is under the curse, and there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 622, 6, 60, 'are germs and illnesses all around that anybody can get. That''s true,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 622, 7, 60, 'but at least 20% of illnesses, I think, are caused by sin; sinful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 622, 8, 60, 'attitudes, bitterness, anxiety, worry, fear, and an unforgiving spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 622, 9, 60, 'of bitterness against other people. I also believe this is the reason');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 622, 10, 60, 'why a lot of prayers are not answered. The Bible says that you can move');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 622, 11, 60, 'a mountain with prayer, but before you can move that mountain, you must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 622, 12, 60, 'forgive others. That''s what Jesus said.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 622, 13, 60, 'Do you find your life being tortured? Is your mind being tortured? Is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 622, 14, 60, 'your body suffering with lots of illnesses? Consider this possibility:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 622, 15, 60, 'there may be people whom you have not forgiven in the same way that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 622, 16, 60, 'forgave you. Maybe you superficially said that you forgave them, but you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 622, 17, 60, 'have kept a secret grudge against them, and you still want to fight with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 622, 18, 60, 'them. Well, the torturers will keep troubling you until you release');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 622, 19, 60, 'those people. You may say that they''ve done such terrible harm to you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 622, 20, 60, 'They have not done more harm to you than the harm that you''ve done to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 622, 21, 60, 'God! If we compare what others have done to us with what we did to Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 622, 22, 60, '(at Calvary when our sins were put on Him), then it becomes easy to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 622, 23, 60, 'forgive other people. I hope we learn a lesson from this, and that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 622, 24, 60, 'will make sure that, because God has forgiven us so much, we openly,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 622, 25, 60, 'gladly forgive others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 622, 26, 61, 'Chapter 60 Forgiveness, Divorce, Children, and Possessions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 622, 27, 61, 'Forgiving Others Is Absolutely Essential');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 622, 28, 61, 'It is important to recognize that if you do not forgive others, God will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 623, 1, 61, 'not forgive you. After teaching about the master’s anger towards the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 623, 2, 61, 'unmerciful slave, who would not forgive a fellow slave after he had been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 623, 3, 61, 'forgiven so much, Jesus said, “So shall My heavenly Father do to you if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 623, 4, 61, 'you do not forgive a brother from the heart” (Matthew 18:35). At the end');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 623, 5, 61, 'of what is commonly known as the Lord’s prayer, Jesus said, “If you do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 623, 6, 61, 'not forgive men their sins (not only brothers, but to all men), your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 623, 7, 61, 'Father will not forgive your transgressions” (Matthew 6:15). “Your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 623, 8, 61, 'Father” means He has already become your Father. You can be born again,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 623, 9, 61, 'but God will not forgive your sins -- even though He is your Father --');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 623, 10, 61, 'because you did not forgive somebody else.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 623, 11, 61, 'What happens if you die in that state (you had become a child of God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 623, 12, 61, 'at the time of your death, you have not forgiven somebody, but instead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 623, 13, 61, 'kept an unforgiving attitude and bitterness)? Personally, if you ask me,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 623, 14, 61, 'I have absolutely no doubt where you go. You go to hell. Because there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 623, 15, 61, 'is no chance after death for God to forgive you. The only place where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 623, 16, 61, 'God can forgive somebody is here on this earth. But you say, “What if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 623, 17, 61, 'that person lived 40 years in faithfulness to the Lord and then he did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 623, 18, 61, 'not forgive somebody?” Then you probably believe the teaching of all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 623, 19, 61, 'religions in the world that God weighs all the good deeds versus the bad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 623, 20, 61, 'deeds. You believe that God will say, “Oh well, he has done so many good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 623, 21, 61, 'things for 40 years, but he did not forgive somebody. So we''ll ignore');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 623, 22, 61, 'that.” Is that the religion you believe?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 623, 23, 61, 'That is not Christianity. No, we are not saved on the basis of good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 623, 24, 61, 'deeds versus bad deeds. It does not matter if you have lived a hundred');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 623, 25, 61, 'years in faithfulness. The Word of God is still true. Jesus said, “If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 623, 26, 61, 'you do not forgive men, your Father will not forgive your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 623, 27, 61, 'transgressions.” I would even say that, in the final day, if God does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 623, 28, 61, 'forgive those who did not forgive others, then He turned out to be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 624, 1, 61, 'liar. That means Jesus was a liar when He said that your Father would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 624, 2, 61, 'not forgive them, if He finally ends up forgiving them. Don’t take a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 624, 3, 61, 'chance with unforgiveness. Believe God''s Word. Jesus said, “Heaven and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 624, 4, 61, 'earth will pass away, but My word will not pass away” (Matthew 16:35).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 624, 5, 61, 'You have a Heavenly Father and can pray to Him saying, “Our Father, who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 624, 6, 61, 'art in heaven.” But if you do not forgive men, your Father will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 624, 7, 61, 'forgive your transgressions. There are lots of believers who are living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 624, 8, 61, 'under the delusion that just because they asked Christ to come into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 624, 9, 61, 'their life, they are guaranteed to go to heaven. These people believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 624, 10, 61, 'that it does not matter how they live. They believe it does not matter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 624, 11, 61, 'how many people they do not forgive.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 624, 12, 61, 'I want to tell you in Jesus’ name that is the greatest delusion that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 624, 13, 61, 'being preached in Christendom today. There are more people who go to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 624, 14, 61, 'hell because of this “once saved always saved” doctrine than perhaps any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 624, 15, 61, 'other doctrine under the sun. They live in sin. They do not forgive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 624, 16, 61, 'others, and they think they are going to heaven. Where do you get that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 624, 17, 61, 'in Scripture? “If you do not forgive men, your Heavenly Father will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 624, 18, 61, 'forgive you.” Please keep that in mind. Let the word come in the day of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 624, 19, 61, 'the judgment to remind you that somebody warned you about it before you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 624, 20, 61, 'got there. Now is the time to set matters right. Forgiveness is such an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 624, 21, 61, 'easy thing. You do not need to go meet that person. You may never meet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 624, 22, 61, 'that person in all your life. From your heart, forgive him. That is it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 624, 23, 61, 'It is an act of a moment. You can do it on a death bed, but do not wait');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 624, 24, 61, 'until your death bed. Do it now.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 624, 25, 61, 'Pharisees Try to Trap God’s Servants');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 624, 26, 61, '“When Jesus had finished these words, He departed from Galilee and came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 624, 27, 61, 'into the region of Judea beyond the Jordan; and large crowds followed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 624, 28, 61, 'Him, and He healed them there” (Matthew 19:1-2).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 625, 1, 61, 'This is another example of Jesus healing, as far as we know, everyone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 625, 2, 61, 'Some Pharisees came to test Him. Just notice the number of times these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 625, 3, 61, 'Pharisees are out to catch Him. In my life, I have seen so many people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 625, 4, 61, 'who try to come after me in the same way. They are testing, provoking,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 625, 5, 61, 'trying to find out, and asking questions exactly like how the Pharisees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 625, 6, 61, 'tried to catch Jesus in some word. They then quote that and try to tear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 625, 7, 61, 'apart that person’s reputation. The Pharisees are around today. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 625, 8, 61, 'generation of vipers are still alive. You may find them attacking you as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 625, 9, 61, 'well, if you are a true servant of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 625, 10, 61, 'Some of the Pharisees came to test Him saying, “Is it lawful for a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 625, 11, 61, 'to divorce his wife for any cause at all?” God never commanded divorce.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 625, 12, 61, 'He hates divorce (Malachi 2:16). There was a law in the Old Covenant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 625, 13, 61, 'which said that if a man divorces his wife, he should give her a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 625, 14, 61, 'certificate of divorce (Deuteronomy 24:1-4). I want to show you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 625, 15, 61, 'something in this connection about how people quote Scripture, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 625, 16, 61, 'this happens even today. In Deuteronomy 24:1-4, it says that if a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 625, 17, 61, 'takes a wife, and it happens that she doesn’t find favour in his eyes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 625, 18, 61, '(because he has found some indecency in her. It is not specified what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 625, 19, 61, 'this is. It could be sexual immorality prior to marriage), then he must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 625, 20, 61, 'write her a certificate of divorce, put it in her hand, and send her out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 625, 21, 61, 'of the house. She leaves his house and becomes another man''s wife. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 625, 22, 61, 'the latter husband turns against her, writes her a certificate of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 625, 23, 61, 'divorce, puts it in her hand, and sends her out of the house -- perhaps');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 625, 24, 61, 'if the latter husband dies -- then her former husband who originally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 625, 25, 61, 'sent her away is not allowed to take her back again to be his wife,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 625, 26, 61, 'because she has been defiled, and that is an abomination before the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 625, 27, 61, 'Lord. Deuteronomy 24:4 says, “You shall not bring sin on the land which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 625, 28, 61, 'the Lord your God gives you as an inheritance.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 626, 1, 61, 'Was He commanding divorce there? Not at all. He is saying that if a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 626, 2, 61, 'sends a woman away, make sure he at least gives a certificate of divorce');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 626, 3, 61, 'before he does. Do not send her away without it. But see how these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 626, 4, 61, 'Pharisees have taken that, twisted it, and made it sound as if Moses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 626, 5, 61, 'commanded divorce (Matthew 19:7)? Why does Moses command him to give her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 626, 6, 61, 'a certificate of divorce before sending her away? Yes, Moses did command');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 626, 7, 61, 'to give her a certificate of divorce and send her away, but they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 626, 8, 61, 'implying that Moses permitted that divorce. He did not.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 626, 9, 61, 'God’s Plan Gives the Answer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 626, 10, 61, 'Is it lawful for a man to divorce his wife for any cause at all? Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 626, 11, 61, 'answered very clearly in Matthew 19:4, “Have you not read that the one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 626, 12, 61, 'who created them from the beginning made them male and female?” The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 626, 13, 61, 'answer to all these things can be found in God''s original plan right in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 626, 14, 61, 'the beginning. When you have any doubt about some things, go back to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 626, 15, 61, 'God’s original plan. What was God''s original plan for Adam? In many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 626, 16, 61, 'areas, that gives us the answer. We do not have time to look into all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 626, 17, 61, 'those areas. What was God’s original plan for man regarding marriage?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 626, 18, 61, 'Did God make a number of women so that if Adam got fed up with Eve, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 626, 19, 61, 'could get rid of her and marry another, and if he becomes unhappy with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 626, 20, 61, 'one of them, he can marry another? No, that is not what God planned for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 626, 21, 61, 'man in the beginning. God made one man and one woman. That is what the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 626, 22, 61, 'Lord is saying. From the beginning, God made it this way. There is no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 626, 23, 61, 'question of being unhappy with the one God gave you. God gave one woman');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 626, 24, 61, 'to Adam and said, “This is your wife.” That is it. She may have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 626, 25, 61, 'weaknesses. So do you. That is what the Lord would say to anybody today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 626, 26, 61, 'Agents of Satan, Or Servants of God?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 626, 27, 61, 'Therefore, since God did that, He also says in Genesis 2:24, “For this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 626, 28, 61, 'reason a man shall leave his father and his mother, and be joined to his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 627, 1, 61, 'wife; and they shall become one flesh.” Jesus quotes that in Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 627, 2, 61, '19:5. There is no question of them separating since they are no longer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 627, 3, 61, 'two, but one. Before they got married, they were two individuals. Once');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 627, 4, 61, 'they became one flesh in marriage, they have become one. They are no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 627, 5, 61, 'longer two. Therefore, God has joined them together. Let not man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 627, 6, 61, 'separate them. Nobody should separate those whom God has joined');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 627, 7, 61, 'together. Any man who comes between a husband and wife is an agent of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 627, 8, 61, 'Satan. I have no hesitation in saying that. If a father-in-law or a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 627, 9, 61, 'mother-in-law comes between a husband and wife, they are agents of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 627, 10, 61, 'Satan. If a father or mother comes between husband and wife, they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 627, 11, 61, 'agents of Satan. If a brother, neighbor, pastor, or anybody else comes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 627, 12, 61, 'between a husband and wife, he or she is an agent of Satan.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 627, 13, 61, 'The job of every true servant of God is to bring husband and wife closer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 627, 14, 61, 'to each other, not come between them. You may be permitted to come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 627, 15, 61, 'between a man and his son if the man is rebellious to God and the son');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 627, 16, 61, 'wants to be faithful. But you must never come between a man and his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 627, 17, 61, 'wife. They must remain together. Suppose the husband is an idolater and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 627, 18, 61, 'the wife is a true believer. What shall you say? Separate from him?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 627, 19, 61, 'Certainly not. She should not bow down to idols like he does because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 627, 20, 61, 'there is an Authority above him in all matters, which is God. But she');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 627, 21, 61, 'should co-operate with her husband in other matters.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 627, 22, 61, 'Jesus said that what God has joined together, let no man separate. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 627, 23, 61, 'does not matter where they were married. They may have been married in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 627, 24, 61, 'temple, mosque or a court. Whenever they were married legally, they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 627, 25, 61, 'joined by God. It is not only Christian marriages that are accepted by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 627, 26, 61, 'God. Every marriage is accepted by God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 627, 27, 61, 'The Whole Truth Concerning Divorce');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 627, 28, 61, 'Then the Pharisees said to Him, “Why did Moses then commanded us to give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 628, 1, 61, 'a certificate to divorce and send her away?” They have taken half of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 628, 2, 61, 'truth in the Deuteronomy 24, as the man himself was the one who decided');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 628, 3, 61, 'to send her away. Moses did not command the man to send her away. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 628, 4, 61, 'man decided, “I do not want this wife so I will send her way.” Moses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 628, 5, 61, 'said, “In case you do that, give her a certificate of divorce.” Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 628, 6, 61, 'said, “It is because of your hardness of heart that Moses permitted you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 628, 7, 61, 'to divorce your wives, but from the beginning it was not this way”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 628, 8, 61, '(Matthew 19:8).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 628, 9, 61, 'In Old Testament times, people’s hearts were hard. They were not soft.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 628, 10, 61, 'They could become soft only when the Holy Spirit came. God wrote His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 628, 11, 61, 'laws upon rocks. It was as if He was telling human beings, “I cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 628, 12, 61, 'even write My laws in your hearts. Your hearts are harder than these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 628, 13, 61, 'rocks. I can write My laws on these rocks, but not in your hearts. Your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 628, 14, 61, 'hearts are hard.” But there is a promise in Ezekiel 36:26 where God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 628, 15, 61, 'says, “I will take away that hard heart, and I will give you a soft');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 628, 16, 61, 'heart. I will put My Spirit there.” This has taken place now that we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 628, 17, 61, 'living in the age of the Holy Spirit. “Anyone who divorces his wife,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 628, 18, 61, 'except for immorality, and marries another woman, commits adultery”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 628, 19, 61, '(Matthew 19:9). There is no doubt about it. If you divorce your wife and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 628, 20, 61, 'marry another woman, you commit adultery. That is crystal clear and is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 628, 21, 61, 'very, very important.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 628, 22, 61, 'The disciples said, “If the relationship of a man and his wife is like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 628, 23, 61, 'this and he can never leave her, then it is better not to marry.” They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 628, 24, 61, 'said this because they must have seen so many unhappy marriages. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 628, 25, 61, 'said, “It must be very difficult to remain married then, if you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 628, 26, 61, 'never get rid of your wife.” However, to stay single, Jesus said that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 628, 27, 61, 'not something that all men can accept, but only those to whom it has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 628, 28, 61, 'been given. There is one thing that is very clear as far as divorce is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 629, 1, 61, 'concerned, and that is that God hates it. It is not God''s will. If a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 629, 2, 61, 'wife has given her body to another man, then her covenant of being “one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 629, 3, 61, 'flesh” with her husband is broken. In such a case, Jesus permits');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 629, 4, 61, 'divorce. That is the only situation in which He permitted divorce. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 629, 5, 61, 'did not permit a husband to divorce his wife for any other reason.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 629, 6, 61, 'We find so many Christians divorcing left, right, and center nowadays.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 629, 7, 61, 'We can see how far Christianity has drifted away from God. We see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 629, 8, 61, 'Christian leaders standing in pulpits who are divorced men. We can see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 629, 9, 61, 'how far Christianity has drifted from God. I am not saying that a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 629, 10, 61, 'divorced person cannot be restored to fellowship with God. But he cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 629, 11, 61, 'be given responsibility as an elder because his whole testimony is bad.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 629, 12, 61, 'He divorced his wife. That is very important to bear in mind in our day,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 629, 13, 61, 'when standards are being lowered everywhere.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 629, 14, 61, 'The Grace to Remain Single');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 629, 15, 61, 'Jesus said to them that not all men can accept this statement,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 629, 16, 61, 'concerning the benefits of remaining single, but some to whom it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 629, 17, 61, 'given. Then He goes on to say that there are eunuchs who were born that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 629, 18, 61, 'way. “There are eunuchs who were made eunuchs by men, and there are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 629, 19, 61, 'eunuchs who have chosen to remain single, as it were, for the kingdom of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 629, 20, 61, 'heaven. Only one who is able to accept it should accept it” (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 629, 21, 61, '19:12). The apostle Paul was one of those people who felt he had the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 629, 22, 61, 'grace to remain single without burning. How do you know whether you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 629, 23, 61, 'grace to remain single? You will not burn.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 629, 24, 61, 'Paul writes in 1 Corinthians 7:9, “It is better to marry than to burn.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 629, 25, 61, 'If a man is burning with sexual desire that he cannot control, then that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 629, 26, 61, 'is an indication that he is not called to a single life. If he is called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 629, 27, 61, 'to a single life, then he will not be burning with sexual passion. Such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 629, 28, 61, 'a person can choose a single life. But if there is burning of sexual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 630, 1, 61, 'desire within, which is perfectly normal, then that is an indication');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 630, 2, 61, 'that one should look for marriage. Jesus is very practical.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 630, 3, 61, 'Christ’s Attitude to Children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 630, 4, 61, 'Jesus then speaks about children. He sees children, and then some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 630, 5, 61, 'children were brought to Him so that He might lay hands on them and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 630, 6, 61, 'pray. But the disciples rebuked them. The disciples had seen the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 630, 7, 61, 'Pharisees always driving children away and say, “We do not have time for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 630, 8, 61, 'little children. We are serious. We can talk to adults, but we will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 630, 9, 61, 'drive away these little children.” The Pharisees did not even have time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 630, 10, 61, 'for young people perhaps. All these old men would huddle together and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 630, 11, 61, 'talk. The disciples had seen that the great rabbis did not talk to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 630, 12, 61, 'children. And so, when the children were brought to Jesus, the disciples');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 630, 13, 61, 'drove them away. They said, “Get away from here. Do you know that He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 630, 14, 61, 'a rabbi?” Jesus said, “Do not do that. Let the little children come. Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 630, 15, 61, 'not hinder them. Let them come to Me, for the kingdom of heaven belongs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 630, 16, 61, 'to such as these” (Matthew 19:14).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 630, 17, 61, 'This is Christ’s attitudes to children. Your attitude to children is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 630, 18, 61, 'pretty good indication whether you are a real man of God or a hoax. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 630, 19, 61, 'children are not drawn to you, if you do not treat children nicely and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 630, 20, 61, 'kindly, if you do not welcome them, or if you are not warm towards them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 630, 21, 61, 'I would say you do not know Christ at all. Children must not be afraid');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 630, 22, 61, 'of you. They must be warm towards you when you see them, and they see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 630, 23, 61, 'you. That is one mark of a Christlike person. A Christlike person is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 630, 24, 61, 'always very happy to be with children, not just with older people. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 630, 25, 61, 'is one way by which you can make out a fake man of God from a real one.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 630, 26, 61, 'This is not the only way, but one of the ways. Then after laying hands');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 630, 27, 61, 'on all these children, He departed from there.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 630, 28, 61, 'Rich Young Ruler');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 631, 1, 61, 'This is a very interesting story because the rich young ruler is a very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 631, 2, 61, 'unusual person. First of all, he was rich. Second, he was young. Third,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 631, 3, 61, 'he was a ruler. He was a rich young person of position in society. He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 631, 4, 61, 'a person whom any pastor would love to have as a church member – rich,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 631, 5, 61, 'young and a person with an eminent position in society as a ruler. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 631, 6, 61, 'came to Jesus and said, “Teacher, what good things shall I do so that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 631, 7, 61, 'may obtain eternal life?” In other words, what is the one thing I can do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 631, 8, 61, 'to get eternal life? And Jesus said to Him, “Why are you asking Me about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 631, 9, 61, 'what is good?” There is only One Who is good, and that is God. But if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 631, 10, 61, 'you wish to enter into life, keep the commandments.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 631, 11, 61, 'Jesus was not saying, “I am not God.” There could be a number of other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 631, 12, 61, 'interpretations. Why do you call Me good? Do you believe that I am God?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 631, 13, 61, 'There is only One Who is good, really, and that is God. Do you believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 631, 14, 61, 'that? It could be the reason why He mentioned it like that, but if it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 631, 15, 61, 'not mentioned here, we do not want to speculate. But He did tell him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 631, 16, 61, 'that if you want eternal life, keep the commandments. They were under');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 631, 17, 61, 'the Law. There is no other message that could be preached in those days.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 631, 18, 61, 'It is not the message we preach today. And then the young ruler said to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 631, 19, 61, 'Him, “Which ones?” And Jesus said, “You shall not commit murder. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 631, 20, 61, 'shall not commit adultery. You shall not steal. You shall not bear false');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 631, 21, 61, 'witness. Honor your father and mother.” In other words, love your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 631, 22, 61, 'neighbor as yourself (Matthew 19:18-19). Jesus mentioned five');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 631, 23, 61, 'commandments. You remember that there are Ten Commandments altogether.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 631, 24, 61, 'The first four commandments were probably written on one tablet of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 631, 25, 61, 'stone. They were related to man''s relationship with God. The other six');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 631, 26, 61, 'related to man''s relationship with his fellow man. The two big');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 631, 27, 61, 'commandments are to love God with all your heart and love your neighbor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 631, 28, 61, 'as yourself. The first four are related to that first great commandment.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 632, 1, 61, 'The remaining six are related to loving your neighbor as yourself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 632, 2, 61, 'Hardly anybody in Israel was ever guilty of disobeying the first four');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 632, 3, 61, 'commandments. They accepted Jehovah as the only true God. They did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 632, 4, 61, 'take the Lord’s name in vain. They do not worship idols and obeyed the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 632, 5, 61, 'Sabbath. Generally speaking, most people obeyed these.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 632, 6, 61, 'The Lord does not even ask him about those four commandments. They have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 632, 7, 61, 'no other gods, do not worship idols, do not take the Lord''s name in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 632, 8, 61, 'vain, and keep the Sabbath. Everyone in Israel kept these four');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 632, 9, 61, 'commandments. There was no need to even ask anyone in Israel to keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 632, 10, 61, 'them. That was understood, and people kept it. There was no problem.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 632, 11, 61, 'That is why Jesus deals only with the second tablet, which contained the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 632, 12, 61, 'six commandments given to man: “You shall not commit murder,” “You shall');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 632, 13, 61, 'not commit adultery,” “You shall not steal,” “You shall not bear false');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 632, 14, 61, 'witness,” and “You shall honor mother and father.” There is one more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 632, 15, 61, 'commandment. You notice the one that is left out? “You shall not desire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 632, 16, 61, 'your neighbor’s wife.” You shall not desire anything that belongs to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 632, 17, 61, 'your neighbor. Jesus knew that there is not a single human being who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 632, 18, 61, 'could ever keep that commandment, because this is speaking about inner');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 632, 19, 61, 'lust. Lust is just a word that means “strong desire.” The first nine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 632, 20, 61, 'commandments were all external, but the tenth commandment was one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 632, 21, 61, 'commandment which referred to an inner life. The Lord kept it there to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 632, 22, 61, 'test people to see how many people would honestly acknowledge that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 632, 23, 61, 'could not keep the tenth commandment. Nobody in the world could keep the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 632, 24, 61, 'tenth commandment. They could only keep the first nine.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 632, 25, 61, 'Because of this, Jesus mentions only the five external commandments');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 632, 26, 61, 'related to man, and leaves out the sixth one about desiring your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 632, 27, 61, 'neighbor’s wife. The young man says, “All these I have kept.” This was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 632, 28, 61, 'an amazing young man who had kept all the commandments faithfully. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 633, 1, 61, 'said, “There is one more thing. You have a tremendous love for money. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 633, 2, 61, 'your case, it is so serious that the only way to get rid of it is by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 633, 3, 61, 'giving it all away.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 633, 4, 61, 'That is not the case with everybody. There is a little bit love of money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 633, 5, 61, 'in everybody, but in some cases, the situation may not be so bad. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 633, 6, 61, 'cancer may not have spread so much that you have to eliminate an entire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 633, 7, 61, 'organ or something like that. If it is in its early stages, then you do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 633, 8, 61, 'not have to do such radical surgery. In the rich young ruler’s case,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 633, 9, 61, 'though, it was a terrible disease. The whole thing had to be given up.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 633, 10, 61, '“Jesus said, ‘Go and sell all your possessions. Give to the poor, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 633, 11, 61, 'you will have treasure in heaven. Then come and follow Me.’ But when the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 633, 12, 61, 'young man heard this, he went away grieved for he was a man who owned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 633, 13, 61, 'much property” (Matthew 19:21-22). He said, “Well, if that is the price');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 633, 14, 61, 'for eternal life, then forget it. I am not interested. I am interested');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 633, 15, 61, 'in this life. I want to have a good time here on this earth.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 633, 16, 61, 'Having, Not Possessing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 633, 17, 61, 'That was the test. Do you want this life? Do you want a good time on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 633, 18, 61, 'this life, or do you want eternal life? The young man said, “I want a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 633, 19, 61, 'good life here on this earth. I do not want to give up everything I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 633, 20, 61, 'have. I do not want to sell all that I have.” Now what does it mean to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 633, 21, 61, 'have eternal life? I do not have to sell everything I have. There is no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 633, 22, 61, 'command in the New Testament Epistles to sell all that we have. But I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 633, 23, 61, 'must not possess something as if it is mine. I must keep everything I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 633, 24, 61, 'have in an open palm and say, “Lord, I have it, but it is not mine. I do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 633, 25, 61, 'not possess it. I keep it in an open palm. It is Yours. I am a steward,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 633, 26, 61, 'and I hold it.” There must not be a single thing of which I say, “That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 633, 27, 61, 'is mine. I will not let go. Almighty God cannot take that away from me.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 633, 28, 61, 'If I do, then I cannot be a disciple of Jesus. I have to forsake all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 634, 1, 61, 'that I possess. I do not need to forsake all that I have, but all that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 634, 2, 61, 'possess in order to be a disciple. I can have things, but not possess');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 634, 3, 61, 'them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 634, 4, 61, 'Don’t Negotiate with Half-Hearted Disciples');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 634, 5, 61, 'When the man went away, Jesus did not go after him. Jesus did not say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 634, 6, 61, '“Hey, why don’t you come back? Let’s talk about it. Maybe you can give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 634, 7, 61, '10% now, and another 10% next year. Then, in a few years, you can give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 634, 8, 61, 'up everything.” No, it was radical discipleship. “In your case, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 634, 9, 61, 'sickness is so bad that you have to be freed from it right now.” Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 634, 10, 61, 'says, “Give it all up.” He never went after him. This is one of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 634, 11, 61, 'things we see about Jesus and all that Jesus taught by His actions. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 634, 12, 61, 'do not go after people who are not willing to pay the price for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 634, 13, 61, 'discipleship. We do not go begging and pleading with them. We do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 634, 14, 61, 'say, “Okay, we will lower the standards slightly for your sake.” Nothing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 634, 15, 61, 'of the sort. If they do not want to be a radical disciple, forget it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 634, 16, 61, 'Jesus made the conditions of discipleship plain right at the outset. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 634, 17, 61, 'did not wait until the end to slowly indicate what the cost of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 634, 18, 61, 'discipleship was.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 634, 19, 62, 'Chapter 61 The First Will Be Last, and the Last Will Be First');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 634, 20, 62, 'The Rich Young Ruler');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 634, 21, 62, 'Referencing the rich young ruler, who had turned away because he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 634, 22, 62, 'couldn''t give up all his possessions, Jesus said, “Truly I say to you it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 634, 23, 62, 'is hard for a rich man to enter into the kingdom of heaven” (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 634, 24, 62, '19:23). Wealth could refer to material wealth, intellectual wealth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 634, 25, 62, 'beauty, or position. Many things can make us rich in ourselves, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 634, 26, 62, 'these riches tend to make us proud. Pride makes us big, like a camel.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 634, 27, 62, 'That is why Jesus said in the next verse that it is easier for a camel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 634, 28, 62, 'to go through the eye of a needle than for a rich man to enter the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 635, 1, 62, 'kingdom of God. It is difficult for a camel to go through the eye of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 635, 2, 62, 'needle because it is so big! But a small amoeba would run in and out of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 635, 3, 62, 'the eye of a needle, it would feel that needle eye was a big 20-foot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 635, 4, 62, 'wide door because it''s so small! There is a lot of difference between a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 635, 5, 62, 'camel and an amoeba. Smallness is what enables us to enter into God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 635, 6, 62, 'kingdom. When we have high thoughts about ourselves (which is very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 635, 7, 62, 'common among all the children of Adam) it is impossible to enter into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 635, 8, 62, 'God''s kingdom. This is because God resists the proud and gives grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 635, 9, 62, 'only to the humble (1 Peter 5:5). We can say that God gets behind the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 635, 10, 62, 'humble and pushes them forward, but He gets in front of the proud and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 635, 11, 62, 'pushes them backward. That is the reason they can’t get into God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 635, 12, 62, 'kingdom. Any type of wealth tends to make us to be proud because we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 635, 13, 62, 'compare ourselves with others who are not as wealthy. Self-exaltation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 635, 14, 62, 'and comparing ourselves with others hinder us from entering God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 635, 15, 62, 'kingdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 635, 16, 62, 'If I do not know what it is to say, “Lord, I do not have an interest in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 635, 17, 62, 'any of these things. I want You more than everything else,” then it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 635, 18, 62, 'very difficult to enter God''s kingdom. The disciples said, “In that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 635, 19, 62, 'case, who can be saved?” Jesus said, “It is true that with men, this is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 635, 20, 62, 'impossible, but it is only possible with God” (Matthew 19:25-26). God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 635, 21, 62, 'can save anyone. God can deliver a man from attachment to material');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 635, 22, 62, 'things. Do you know that attachment to material things can hinder you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 635, 23, 62, 'from God''s kingdom? It is not preached so much today, but it is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 635, 24, 62, 'truth. May God help us be free. With God, all things are possible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 635, 25, 62, 'Even when the disciples heard this, they wondered how anybody could be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 635, 26, 62, 'saved, because many of them were rich in something. Jesus looked at them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 635, 27, 62, 'and said, “That’s right - with men this is impossible, but with God all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 635, 28, 62, 'things are possible.” God can take that huge camel and reduce it to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 636, 1, 62, 'size of an amoeba so that he runs through the eye of a needle. So even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 636, 2, 62, 'though we are so big in our own eyes because of various abilities we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 636, 3, 62, 'have, God can do a miracle and reduce us to such smallness that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 636, 4, 62, 'narrow gate looks very wide to us and easy to go through. It all depends');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 636, 5, 62, 'on how much we are willing to let God break us, humble us, and make us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 636, 6, 62, 'small in our own eyes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 636, 7, 62, 'This is the answer, this is the way to find salvation; to enter through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 636, 8, 62, 'the narrow gate and also to walk along the narrow way. The way is so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 636, 9, 62, 'narrow that a camel would find it difficult, whereas an amoeba can run');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 636, 10, 62, 'along at full speed. So it depends on how small we are. There are people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 636, 11, 62, 'who sometimes initially come through the narrow gate because they''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 636, 12, 62, 'willing to humble themselves and to be small and acknowledge they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 636, 13, 62, 'sinners, but after a few years when God has blessed them and things have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 636, 14, 62, 'gone well with them in their family, for example, then they suddenly get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 636, 15, 62, 'puffed up and their heads become big. We have to remain small if we want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 636, 16, 62, 'to continue along the narrow way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 636, 17, 62, 'In Matthew 19:27 Peter asked Jesus what he would get as a reward, as one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 636, 18, 62, 'who did leave everything to follow Him. Jesus gave two answers to this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 636, 19, 62, 'question, and we need to understand both answers. First He said, “Truly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 636, 20, 62, 'I say to you, you who have followed Me, in the regeneration (the new');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 636, 21, 62, 'kingdom, the final heaven and earth), the Son of Man will sit on His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 636, 22, 62, 'glorious throne in the millennial kingdom, and you shall sit on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 636, 23, 62, 'twelve thrones judging the twelve tribes of Israel. And everyone (that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 636, 24, 62, 'applies even to us today) who has left houses, brothers, sisters,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 636, 25, 62, 'father, mother or children or farms for My namesake will receive many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 636, 26, 62, 'times as much and will inherit eternal life.” If you have given up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 636, 27, 62, 'brothers, sisters, children and farm for Jesus’ namesake, God Himself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 636, 28, 62, 'will give you many hundreds of other brothers and sisters in many other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 637, 1, 62, 'parts of the world, brothers and sisters in Christ. So we''re not going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 637, 2, 62, 'to lose out that way and we will inherit eternal life which is worth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 637, 3, 62, 'more than anything we have ever given up.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 637, 4, 62, 'This is Jesus’ initial answer to Peter’s question as to what we will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 637, 5, 62, 'receive. But He continues to say one more thing before concluding His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 637, 6, 62, 'response to Peter: “Many who are first will be last in that day and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 637, 7, 62, 'last will be first.” How is it that there''s going to be this difference?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 637, 8, 62, 'The chapter division here is very unfortunate because Matthew 20 is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 637, 9, 62, 'really a continuation of Jesus’ answer to Peter. To explain the second');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 637, 10, 62, 'part of His answer, He uses a parable.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 637, 11, 62, 'The Parable of the Workers in the Vineyard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 637, 12, 62, 'He says the kingdom of heaven is like a landowner who went out early in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 637, 13, 62, 'the morning to hire laborers for his vineyard. He made an agreement with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 637, 14, 62, 'the laborers saying he would give them one denarius (a laborer''s wage');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 637, 15, 62, 'for one day) and sent them into the vineyard. At about nine o''clock in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 637, 16, 62, 'the morning, he saw others standing idle in the marketplace and said to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 637, 17, 62, 'them, “You too go into the vineyard and whatever is right I’ll give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 637, 18, 62, 'you.” Here too he promised them some payment. A third group went at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 637, 19, 62, 'three o''clock in the afternoon, and another group went even later.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 637, 20, 62, 'Altogether four groups went, and it says that he said the same thing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 637, 21, 62, 'each of them. All four agreed to work for a wage, that''s the important');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 637, 22, 62, 'thing to notice. All four agreed to work if they were paid for their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 637, 23, 62, 'work; otherwise they may not have gone to work in the vineyard. At the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 637, 24, 62, 'eleventh hour (5 o''clock in the evening), with just one hour more of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 637, 25, 62, 'work remaining, he went out and found some others standing around and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 637, 26, 62, 'said, “Why have you been standing here all day doing nothing?” They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 637, 27, 62, 'said, “Well nobody hired us,” and so the landowner told them to go into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 637, 28, 62, 'his vineyard to work as well - with no promise of reward. That''s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 638, 1, 62, 'important thing to distinguish between the last group and the first four');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 638, 2, 62, 'groups of people. The first four all went to work for pay and for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 638, 3, 62, 'reward; this group went with the promise of nothing. They just went to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 638, 4, 62, 'work. It’s very important to notice that, because this is what makes the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 638, 5, 62, 'difference finally. This is how the last becomes first and the first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 638, 6, 62, 'becomes last.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 638, 7, 62, 'When the evening had come (at six o''clock), work was over and the owner');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 638, 8, 62, 'called the laborers and paid them their wages starting with the last');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 638, 9, 62, 'group to the first. When those who were hired at the eleventh hour came,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 638, 10, 62, 'they were surprised that they got a full day''s wages. They received');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 638, 11, 62, 'twelve times what they deserved! One denarius was wage for twelve hours');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 638, 12, 62, 'of work; they worked only for one hour but got a full day''s wages! Those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 638, 13, 62, 'who were hired first thought they would be paid generously also (perhaps');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 638, 14, 62, 'twelve denarii) since this man gave one denarius to people who worked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 638, 15, 62, 'for only one hour. But when they came, they also received one denarius');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 638, 16, 62, 'each. So they grumbled and went to the landowner and said, “These last');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 638, 17, 62, 'men worked only one hour!” You see comparison here. All problems come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 638, 18, 62, 'when we compare ourselves with others and wonder why God has done');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 638, 19, 62, 'something for them that He''s not done for us. Here''s where the problem');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 638, 20, 62, 'arose. They went and checked for themselves and said, “How much did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 638, 21, 62, 'these guys get? They all got one denarius too, you’ve made them equal to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 638, 22, 62, 'us!” Here''s the other problem: being upset that God makes somebody equal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 638, 23, 62, 'to us. We see a lot of that in Christian churches today. People who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 638, 24, 62, 'think they are senior workers deserve greater honor and respect and more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 638, 25, 62, 'reward than those who came later.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 638, 26, 62, 'The Motivation for Service');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 638, 27, 62, 'The landowner answered and said to one of them, “Friend I am doing you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 638, 28, 62, 'no wrong. When I called you at 6 o''clock in the morning didn''t you agree');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 639, 1, 62, 'to come for one denarius? Well I''ve given you one denarius. I didn’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 639, 2, 62, 'cheat you. Take what is yours and go your way. If I decide to give the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 639, 3, 62, 'last man as much as you, what''s that to you? Don''t I have the right to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 639, 4, 62, 'give my money to anyone I like? Are you envious because I''m generous?”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 639, 5, 62, 'This is how Jesus explained, “The last will be first and the first will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 639, 6, 62, 'be the last.” So what is the point of this parable - who is going to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 639, 7, 62, 'first in the final day? It’s those who served without hope of reward -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 639, 8, 62, 'those who did not serve for pay or for what benefit they could get from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 639, 9, 62, 'serving the Lord. There are two categories of people serving the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 639, 10, 62, 'today around the world: those who work because they get paid for it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 639, 11, 62, '(with some honor, position, or perhaps a reward in heaven), and then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 639, 12, 62, 'there are others who say they will serve the Lord even if they get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 639, 13, 62, 'nothing out of it, who are not doing it to get a gift. They will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 639, 14, 62, 'struggle with poverty if necessary, and will serve the Lord even if they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 639, 15, 62, 'starve.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 639, 16, 62, 'These are two completely different categories of people. One serves for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 639, 17, 62, 'what they can get out of God. For example, there are people who are told');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 639, 18, 62, 'by preachers that if they give a tithe to God, He will bless them and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 639, 19, 62, 'prosper them in their work or reward them with 100 times as much money,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 639, 20, 62, 'or something like that. Such people are doing business. You can’t do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 639, 21, 62, 'business with God - giving tithes and expecting a return. Such people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 639, 22, 62, 'will be last. But those who don’t expect anything or want anything in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 639, 23, 62, 'return, they are saying, “Lord I don''t want anything in return. You’ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 639, 24, 62, 'already done enough for me on Calvary. Why should I expect anything more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 639, 25, 62, 'than that? I want to just serve You and spend my whole life serving You,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 639, 26, 62, 'showing my gratitude to You.” Such people are like the people who came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 639, 27, 62, 'at the eleventh hour, serving without any hope of any gain. And that was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 639, 28, 62, 'Jesus’ second answer to Peter after he asked the Lord what his reward');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 640, 1, 62, 'would be.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 640, 2, 62, 'This is a very important principle for all born again Christians. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 640, 3, 62, 'need to ask yourself, do you expect the Lord to do something for you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 640, 4, 62, 'because of what you''ve done for Him? Sometimes we expect the Lord to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 640, 5, 62, 'bless us in some way and answer our prayers because we have served Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 640, 6, 62, 'faithfully. The best way to serve the Lord is to expect nothing in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 640, 7, 62, 'return, and if we do, then we will never have a problem or complaint');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 640, 8, 62, 'against Him, like many Christians have. When you come to the Lord, do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 640, 9, 62, 'you inwardly think, “I''ve served the Lord faithfully for so many years,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 640, 10, 62, 'surely the Lord will do this for me”? If that’s the case then you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 640, 11, 62, 'coming to the Lord not in Jesus’ name, but in your own name. You are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 640, 12, 62, 'coming to Him on the merit of Jesus Christ but on your own merit because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 640, 13, 62, 'you''ve served the Lord for many years and therefore God should do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 640, 14, 62, 'something for you. This is why your Christian life remains so shallow.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 640, 15, 62, 'If you want a rich Christian experience, then come to the Lord expecting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 640, 16, 62, 'nothing in return and say, “Lord what I deserve is Hell, but You gave me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 640, 17, 62, 'everything better than Hell. I don’t deserve what You have given me, so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 640, 18, 62, 'I don''t ask for anything more.” Christians who come to the Lord like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 640, 19, 62, 'that are the happiest Christians on the face of the earth! It is because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 640, 20, 62, 'people don''t come with this attitude that many Christians are miserable.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 640, 21, 62, 'That is an important lesson we can learn from this parable.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 640, 22, 62, '“As Jesus was about to go up to Jerusalem, He took the twelve disciples');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 640, 23, 62, 'aside by themselves and said to them, ‘Behold, we''re going up to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 640, 24, 62, 'Jerusalem; and the Son of Man will be delivered to the chief priests and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 640, 25, 62, 'scribes’” (Matthew 20:17). From chapter 16, where He spoke about the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 640, 26, 62, 'church for the first time, immediately He started speaking about the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 640, 27, 62, 'cross for the first time. It is very significant that when He spoke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 640, 28, 62, 'about the church and His going to the cross, was also the first time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 641, 1, 62, 'that He spoke of His disciples having to take up the cross. It was also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 641, 2, 62, 'in connection with building the church. After this time we find Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 641, 3, 62, 'repeatedly mentioning this.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 641, 4, 62, 'Seeking for Honor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 641, 5, 62, 'Again Jesus says, “Chief priests and scribes will condemn Him to death,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 641, 6, 62, 'deliver Him to the gentiles to mock and scourge and crucify Him, and on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 641, 7, 62, 'the third day He''ll be raised up” (Matthew 16:21). Imagine when hearing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 641, 8, 62, 'such a word about the suffering, the mocking, the scourging, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 641, 9, 62, 'crucifixion of Jesus Christ - one would expect that His disciples would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 641, 10, 62, 'be in such sorrow and grief! But instead we see the mother of James and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 641, 11, 62, 'John seeking her own, coming up to Him and asking if He could put her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 641, 12, 62, 'sons on His right and left hand in the final day. It is a complete');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 641, 13, 62, 'rejection and lack of understanding of the parable which Jesus just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 641, 14, 62, 'spoke. Jesus just taught that we should not serve for reward, not even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 641, 15, 62, 'in heaven - not even seeking for the reward of sitting on His right side');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 641, 16, 62, 'or left hand. But she just didn''t understand it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 641, 17, 62, 'In Mark it says that James and John went and asked Jesus for it (Mark');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 641, 18, 62, '10:35-41) - it was not just their mother. James, John, and their mother');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 641, 19, 62, 'all went to Christ and said, “We want to sit on Your right hand and left');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 641, 20, 62, 'hand.” They didn’t understand what Jesus just spoke about regarding not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 641, 21, 62, 'serving for a reward. James and John were some of the finest of Jesus’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 641, 22, 62, 'disciples. They were part of the inner three with whom Jesus was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 641, 23, 62, 'constantly working in fellowship with, and even they had this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 641, 24, 62, 'self-seeking attitude. Do you know why? It was because they had not yet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 641, 25, 62, 'been filled with the Holy Spirit. They loved the Lord. They had given up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 641, 26, 62, 'their jobs to serve Him. They were willing to trust Him for their needs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 641, 27, 62, 'I’m sure they lived much more simply than when they were fishermen and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 641, 28, 62, 'they were willing to sacrifice all of that, but yet in them there was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 642, 1, 62, 'still this desire for honor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 642, 2, 62, 'I have seen this in many Christian workers who have given up their jobs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 642, 3, 62, 'and are willing to sacrifice and go through many hardships for the Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 642, 4, 62, 'that deep down there is yet a desire for honor and position in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 642, 5, 62, 'Christendom. That is what destroys them. These things are warnings for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 642, 6, 62, 'us. Jesus is trying to teach us through this example in Scripture,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 642, 7, 62, '“Beware of this attitude of seeking a reward for your service.” The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 642, 8, 62, 'reward could be honor on earth, in heaven, financial reward, or some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 642, 9, 62, 'other type of reward for our service. Reward should never be the motive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 642, 10, 62, 'for our service. We must serve the Lord because we are grateful for all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 642, 11, 62, 'that He''s done for us. It is like if a man gave you billions of rupees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 642, 12, 62, 'and asks you to do a little service for him - would you ask for payment?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 642, 13, 62, 'Imagine some man who was so generous that he cleared a billion rupees of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 642, 14, 62, 'your debt one day, and one day he asks you to do some small thing for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 642, 15, 62, 'him. You would be ashamed to ask for payment! He has already spent a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 642, 16, 62, 'billion rupees clearing your debt, why do you need payment for that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 642, 17, 62, 'small work that you did for him?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 642, 18, 62, 'This is how we must look at our service for the Lord. He has cleared so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 642, 19, 62, 'much of our debt. Are you expecting a reward now? Do you want honor or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 642, 20, 62, 'position, to be a leader, or honor in the church here or in heaven?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 642, 21, 62, 'Shame on anyone who feels like that! Jesus told this woman she didn’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 642, 22, 62, 'know what she was asking. Jesus had just spoken to her about the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 642, 23, 62, 'suffering He was to go through, about the way of the cross. Then He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 642, 24, 62, 'asked James and John, “Are you able to drink the cup that I''m able to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 642, 25, 62, 'drink? Are you willing to go through this way of the cross?” And they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 642, 26, 62, 'boldly said they were able. They were quite arrogant to say that and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 642, 27, 62, 'didn''t realize that without the power of the Holy Spirit it would be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 642, 28, 62, 'impossible. But they said they were able because they wanted those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 643, 1, 62, 'positions of honor. Look at Jesus’ humility here. He replied by saying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 643, 2, 62, 'that maybe they could drink His cup, but “To sit on My right hand and My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 643, 3, 62, 'left is not Mine to give.” I see the gentleness there of Jesus in not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 643, 4, 62, 'rebuking them for their covetousness. He is so gracious! “It is not mine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 643, 5, 62, 'to give but it is for those for whom the Father has prepared it.” The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 643, 6, 62, 'Bible says, “Jesus humbled Himself and became obedient unto death - even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 643, 7, 62, 'the death on a cross. For this reason, God has given Jesus a name which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 643, 8, 62, 'is above every name, that at the name of Jesus every knee should bow”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 643, 9, 62, '(Philippians 2:8-10). How did He get to that throne? By humbling Himself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 643, 10, 62, 'to the point of death, even death on a cross.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 643, 11, 62, 'Who will be sitting on His right hand and left hand in glory? It will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 643, 12, 62, 'those who have humbled themselves the most in these years of human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 643, 13, 62, 'history. It could be some poor widow from Africa, for all we know. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 643, 14, 62, 'will be those who have humbled themselves the most in their earthly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 643, 15, 62, 'life. God, Who is not partial, will exalt them. It is a principle that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 643, 16, 62, 'God exalts those who are humble. Such people will be closest to Jesus in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 643, 17, 62, 'eternity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 643, 18, 62, 'The reward we should long for should be closeness to Christ, not to sit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 643, 19, 62, 'with authority over people. When the other ten disciples heard this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 643, 20, 62, 'request of James, John, and their mother, it says that they were very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 643, 21, 62, 'indignant and angry with these two brothers (verse 24). Why was that?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 643, 22, 62, 'It’s not because they were any more spiritual, but because they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 643, 23, 62, 'disturbed that these two got ahead of them, asking for those seats');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 643, 24, 62, 'before they did. They wanted those seats for themselves. Even at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 643, 25, 62, 'Last Supper the disciples were discussing who was going to be the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 643, 26, 62, 'greatest. Everything changed after Jesus died, when they were filled');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 643, 27, 62, 'with the Holy Spirit. Though these apostles were very dedicated and very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 643, 28, 62, 'sacrificial, yet they were not spiritual. It can be like that with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 644, 1, 62, 'people today who are willing to sacrifice many things for Christ. Many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 644, 2, 62, 'people think of their sacrifices and hardships for the Lord, but it does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 644, 3, 62, 'not mean they are spiritual. If deep down in your heart you are seeking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 644, 4, 62, 'a reward, you will be among the last in the final day. This instruction');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 644, 5, 62, 'is continuing on from the previous parable, and reinforces the principle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 644, 6, 62, 'that Jesus mentioned - those who will be first and those who will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 644, 7, 62, 'last. The ones who are seeking for some position and honor now or in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 644, 8, 62, 'eternity will be last.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 644, 9, 62, 'Then Jesus called the disciples to Himself and said, “You know the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 644, 10, 62, 'rulers of the gentiles, how they Lord it over others, and they think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 644, 11, 62, 'that great men are those who exercise authority over others and sit on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 644, 12, 62, 'thrones. But it must never be like that among you. But whoever wishes to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 644, 13, 62, 'become great, let him be a servant” (Matthew 20:25 paraphrase). This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 644, 14, 62, 'greatness in the kingdom of God - to be a servant, to have the attitude');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 644, 15, 62, 'of a servant. Whoever wants to be first - learn to be a slave to others,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 644, 16, 62, 'just as the Son of Man did not come to be served but to serve and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 644, 17, 62, 'give His life as a ransom for many. Jesus told His disciples to look at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 644, 18, 62, 'His example. He didn''t come here to earth to get position. He already');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 644, 19, 62, 'had position in heaven and gave it all up! This is the spirit we must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 644, 20, 62, 'all have. It''s a shame for a person to call himself a representative of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 644, 21, 62, 'Jesus Christ on this earth, and yet seek for position. Anyone like this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 644, 22, 62, 'cannot claim to be following a Master Who gave up the greatest position');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 644, 23, 62, 'in the universe - being equal to the Father in eternity - and then came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 644, 24, 62, 'down and became a Man like us; and not only that, but our Servant as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 644, 25, 62, 'well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 644, 26, 62, 'May God help us to learn this lesson so that we can follow in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 644, 27, 62, 'Savior''s footsteps.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 644, 28, 63, 'Chapter 62 Cry Out to God Who Supplies Your Needs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 645, 1, 63, '“As they were going out from Jericho a great multitude followed Him. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 645, 2, 63, 'behold two blind men sitting by the road, hearing that Jesus was passing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 645, 3, 63, 'by, cried out saying, “Lord have mercy on us, Son of David!” and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 645, 4, 63, 'multitude sternly told them to be quiet. But they cried out all the more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 645, 5, 63, 'saying, “Lord have mercy on us, Son of David!” and Jesus stopped and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 645, 6, 63, 'called them and said, “What do you want Me to do for you?” They said to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 645, 7, 63, 'Him, “Lord, we want our eyes to be opened.” And moved with compassion,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 645, 8, 63, 'Jesus touched their eyes and immediately they regained their sight and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 645, 9, 63, 'followed Him” (Matthew 20:29-34).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 645, 10, 63, 'Cry out to the Lord Who Supplies All Your Needs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 645, 11, 63, 'There are 3 or 4 things we need to learn from this story. First, when we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 645, 12, 63, 'are in need, we must cry out to the Lord for help even if we have found');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 645, 13, 63, 'no solution to our problem in all of our life thus far. That''s what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 645, 14, 63, 'these blind men did. And when they cried out to the Lord and others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 645, 15, 63, 'tried to stop them, they cried out all the more. That''s the second thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 645, 16, 63, 'we need to learn when we are asking God to meet a genuine need. We have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 645, 17, 63, 'a promise in Philippians 4:19: “My God shall supply all your needs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 645, 18, 63, 'according to His riches of His glory in Christ Jesus.” He hasn’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 645, 19, 63, 'promised to supply all that we want but certainly all that we need, just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 645, 20, 63, 'like a good father will not give his children all that they want but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 645, 21, 63, 'he’ll give them all that they need. There’s a difference between our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 645, 22, 63, 'needs and our wants. Many times, we pray for what we want; but the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 645, 23, 63, 'promise in Philippians 4:19 is that God will give us what we need. So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 645, 24, 63, 'here is a genuine need - blind people need sight - and they cried out to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 645, 25, 63, 'God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 645, 26, 63, 'However, the people said, “Stop, don''t do that. Don''t disturb Him.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 645, 27, 63, 'There could be many reasons why other people tell us not to cry out to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 645, 28, 63, 'God, but we must ignore them and carry on crying out to God for our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 646, 1, 63, 'need. That''s the very important lesson that we need to learn first. Just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 646, 2, 63, 'imagine if they hadn''t done that, if they just listened to the advice of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 646, 3, 63, 'others instead - they would have missed out all their life on what God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 646, 4, 63, 'wanted to do for them. It''s possible that you have missed out on what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 646, 5, 63, 'God wanted to do for you thus far because you listened to other people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 646, 6, 63, 'Why don''t you go to Scripture and see what Jesus says instead of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 646, 7, 63, 'listening to wrong advice from your parents, relatives, priest, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 646, 8, 63, 'pastors. Go to God''s Word and you''ll find what God has in store for you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 646, 9, 63, 'Don''t miss out on that because people around you give you some contrary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 646, 10, 63, 'advice. That''s a very, very important lesson to learn. Otherwise you''ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 646, 11, 63, 'miss out on something that could be yours, which could be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 646, 12, 63, 'life-transforming experience for you. I’m sure these folks never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 646, 13, 63, 'regretted the fact that they ignored what people said and instead did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 646, 14, 63, 'what their hearts said. It says they “cried out all the more.” So when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 646, 15, 63, 'people tell you not to seek God for something, just ignore them and cry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 646, 16, 63, 'out to God all the more.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 646, 17, 63, 'Notice also what we’ve considered before, that when we come to the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 646, 18, 63, 'and pray a general prayer like, “Lord have mercy on us,” or “Lord, bless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 646, 19, 63, 'us,” (these are most of the general prayers that people pray, “Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 646, 20, 63, 'bless me. Lord bless me.”) the Lord says, “What exactly? Specify what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 646, 21, 63, 'blessing you want. What do you want Me to do for you?” (verse 32). We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 646, 22, 63, 'have to be specific: “Lord, I want to be filled with the Holy Spirit.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 646, 23, 63, '“Lord, I want to be anointed to serve You.” “Lord, I want the gift of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 646, 24, 63, 'prophecy, which You have told me in 1 Corinthians 14:1 to seek for.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 646, 25, 63, '“Lord, I want a heart that can forgive other people completely, which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 646, 26, 63, 'You have told me to seek for, so that I can be forgiven myself.” “Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 646, 27, 63, 'I want my heart filled with love for You and love for God''s people.” Ask');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 646, 28, 63, 'for it. Be specific, and don''t just say, “Lord, bless me,” or “Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 647, 1, 63, 'have mercy on me.” Very often we don''t get what we ask for because we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 647, 2, 63, 'are not specific.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 647, 3, 63, 'Acknowledge Your Need, Believe, and Follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 647, 4, 63, '“What do you want me to do for you?” They said to Him, specifically,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 647, 5, 63, '“Lord, we want our eyes to be open.” That''s a point I want to stress,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 647, 6, 63, 'that we must be willing to acknowledge our need. “Lord, I am blind” -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 647, 7, 63, 'that''s what they were saying. “I want my eyes to be opened.” Acknowledge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 647, 8, 63, 'your need. “Lord, I''m a very lustful man, people in the church think I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 647, 9, 63, 'a very holy man, but You know I''m a man full of sexual lust and I''m not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 647, 10, 63, 'able to overcome it in secret. Lord I confess I''m watching internet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 647, 11, 63, 'pornography, I confess I lust with my eyes.” Be honest, whatever your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 647, 12, 63, 'sin is. Confess it and then the Lord will deliver you. But if you sort');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 647, 13, 63, 'of beat around the bush and say, “Yeah, I''m a sinner” sort of thing, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 647, 14, 63, 'remain in your sin. Be specific and say, “Lord, this is my problem: my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 647, 15, 63, 'anger. I just cannot control my tongue. I speak in tongues in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 647, 16, 63, 'church, but here, I can’t control my tongue at home. My problem is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 647, 17, 63, 'with other tongues, my problem is with my mother tongue.” Be specific');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 647, 18, 63, 'and ask the Lord to deliver you, whatever your problem is, be specific.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 647, 19, 63, '“Lord, my eyes are blind I want them to be opened.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 647, 20, 63, '“And the Lord, moved with compassion, touched their eyes.” I''m sure He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 647, 21, 63, 'asked them, (though not recorded here, we know that He asked from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 647, 22, 63, 'Matthew 9:29), “Do you believe that I can do this for you?” He always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 647, 23, 63, 'asks that. Once we are specific about our need, He will ask us, “Do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 647, 24, 63, 'believe that I can do this for you?” And when we say, “Yes, I believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 647, 25, 63, 'You can do it,” we get what we ask for. God is a good God. Most of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 647, 26, 63, 'areas we know what His will is. He wants the very best for us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 647, 27, 63, 'And the last thing I want to say in this section is: when you get what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 647, 28, 63, 'you want, do what the blind men did. What was that? It says, “When they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 648, 1, 63, 'regained their sight, they followed Him.” They said, “Hey, now that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 648, 2, 63, 'can see, we can follow Jesus. Until now, we couldn''t see. Why has God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 648, 3, 63, 'given us sight? So that we can see Jesus and follow Him.” They had such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 648, 4, 63, 'wisdom. They saw the reason why God gave them sight, which was so that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 648, 5, 63, 'they could see Jesus and follow Him. The reason why God blesses us in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 648, 6, 63, 'any way is so that we can follow Jesus a little closer than we ever did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 648, 7, 63, 'before. There are many things we can learn from all that Jesus taught');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 648, 8, 63, 'through circumstances. Here''s a classic example of what Jesus taught His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 648, 9, 63, 'disciples through circumstances, which they didn''t understand then, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 648, 10, 63, 'when the Holy Spirit was given on the day of Pentecost, their eyes were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 648, 11, 63, 'opened to see the meaning behind all these little, little incidents that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 648, 12, 63, 'took place in their walk with Jesus for three and a half years.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 648, 13, 63, 'Jesus is a Humble King');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 648, 14, 63, '“They approached Jerusalem and had come to Bethphage, to the Mount of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 648, 15, 63, 'Olives and then Jesus sent two disciples saying to them, ‘Go into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 648, 16, 63, 'village opposite you, immediately you''ll find a donkey tied there and a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 648, 17, 63, 'colt with her. Untie them and bring them to Me and if anyone says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 648, 18, 63, 'something to you, you shall say, “The Lord has need of them,” and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 648, 19, 63, 'immediately he will send them’” (Matthew 21:1-3). The spiritual lesson');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 648, 20, 63, 'here is that when Jesus decided to make a triumphal entry as the King of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 648, 21, 63, 'Zion into Jerusalem before His crucifixion, He did not travel into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 648, 22, 63, 'Jerusalem like all kings do - on horses, the grand animal that kings and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 648, 23, 63, 'generals ride on. Every king and general in the history of the world has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 648, 24, 63, 'ridden on horses; it’s a magnificent animal. But Jesus chooses a donkey,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 648, 25, 63, 'which has the reputation for being the most stupid and clumsy animal.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 648, 26, 63, 'Why did He do that? It says in verse 4 and 5, “What was spoken through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 648, 27, 63, 'the prophet might be fulfilled” as it was prophesied in Zechariah 9:9,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 648, 28, 63, '“Say to the daughter of Zion, behold your King is coming to you, gentle,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 649, 1, 63, 'and mounted on a donkey, even on a colt, the foal of a beast of burden.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 649, 2, 63, 'The King of the Jews, the King of Israel, the King of Zion, the church,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 649, 3, 63, 'comes riding on a donkey.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 649, 4, 63, 'God Can Use a Donkey');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 649, 5, 63, 'Can you imagine how humiliating it is to ride on this stupidest animal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 649, 6, 63, 'of all? The devil chose a serpent to come into because it says, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 649, 7, 63, 'Genesis 3, that that was the cleverest of all the animals. And Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 649, 8, 63, 'chooses the stupidest and the dumbest of all animals to ride on. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 649, 9, 63, 'humility. In this, we see the pride of Satan and the humility of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 649, 10, 63, 'Christ. And if you are proud of your cleverness and your wisdom, like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 649, 11, 63, 'the serpent, you’re a candidate for Satan to get into fellowship with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 649, 12, 63, 'you. I''m not saying we have to become like donkeys, but we must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 649, 13, 63, 'recognize that when it comes to spiritual matters, we are like donkeys,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 649, 14, 63, 'however clever we may be in earthly things. If you take that position,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 649, 15, 63, 'God can use you. He said that when the donkey was to be set free from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 649, 16, 63, 'being tied up, “If anyone asks you, just say the Lord has need of them”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 649, 17, 63, '(Matthew 21:3). What’s the word? The Lord has need of that donkey. Look');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 649, 18, 63, 'at yourself like that. Lord, You have need of me? Some of you may have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 649, 19, 63, 'very low self-esteem. You may say about yourself, “Lord, I''m not like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 649, 20, 63, 'these gifted preachers. I''m just a useless ordinary person, a poor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 649, 21, 63, 'helpless widow or just very simple uneducated illiterate woman here in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 649, 22, 63, 'this church; what can I do for you? I''m like a donkey.” Aha! The Lord is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 649, 23, 63, 'in need of you, and that''s the word in verse 3. If you feel like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 649, 24, 63, 'donkey, the Lord is need of you. Remember that, take that word from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 649, 25, 63, 'Lord: The Lord has need of you. Human beings may not have much need of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 649, 26, 63, 'you except to treat you like a beast of burden, but the Lord has need of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 649, 27, 63, 'you, not to treat you like a beast a burden, but to ride on you in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 649, 28, 63, 'city. And we know that Jesus rode on that donkey. Interestingly, even in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 650, 1, 63, 'the Old Testament, we read of God using a donkey to speak to Balaam the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 650, 2, 63, 'prophet. Imagine a donkey speaking to a prophet! That’s an amazing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 650, 3, 63, 'story. It''s the first instance we know of in Scripture of an animal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 650, 4, 63, 'speaking in an unknown tongue, a language that it never learnt. It began');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 650, 5, 63, 'to speak to the prophet. Donkeys don''t speak in any language, they began');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 650, 6, 63, 'to speak in human language supernaturally, and this donkey rebuked and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 650, 7, 63, 'corrected the prophet. God can use a donkey, that''s the message from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 650, 8, 63, 'Old Testament. It''s the message from the New Testament, too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 650, 9, 63, 'Looking Carefully at Your King');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 650, 10, 63, 'In both cases, we see the Lord using a stupid animal to speak His word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 650, 11, 63, 'and to be used for the Lord of glory to ride on. This teaches us that a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 650, 12, 63, 'servant of God must always seek to have a low profile before men. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 650, 13, 63, 'must not seek the high positions and seek to be like others riding on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 650, 14, 63, 'horses. There are a lot of Christian preachers who want the latest cars,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 650, 15, 63, 'and want to use the money they get from other people to live in grand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 650, 16, 63, 'style themselves, completely contrary to the Spirit of Christ. If you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 650, 17, 63, 'doing your own business and you’ve worked hard and you’ve earned money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 650, 18, 63, 'through your own business, live as you like - that''s up to you. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 650, 19, 63, 'decide your standard of living and I certainly won''t dictate that to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 650, 20, 63, 'you. But if you are living on the offerings of poor people, then you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 650, 21, 63, 'better be careful how you live, because that''s not your money. It is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 650, 22, 63, 'money that poor people have given to God, and you cannot use that to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 650, 23, 63, 'live in grand style yourself. You have to humble yourself and say, “I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 650, 24, 63, 'can’t use other people''s money to live like this.” It’s good for all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 650, 25, 63, 'servants of the Lord to take a low profile and to learn from Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 650, 26, 63, '“Behold” it says (Matthew 21:5), which means, “look carefully.” Look');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 650, 27, 63, 'carefully at your King. This is the One Whom you call your King, so look');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 650, 28, 63, 'how He is coming: gentle, mounted on a donkey. We need to have this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 651, 1, 63, 'painting before our eyes always, Jesus riding on a donkey all the time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 651, 2, 63, 'A Donkey’s Honor Is Only Because of the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 651, 3, 63, 'And the disciples went and did just as Jesus had directed them and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 651, 4, 63, 'brought the donkey and the colt and laid on them their garments. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 651, 5, 63, 'sat upon them and then the multitude spread their garments on the road');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 651, 6, 63, 'so the donkey didn''t have to walk on the dirt road but could walk on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 651, 7, 63, 'coats and shirts and scarves of the people. The donkey was being treated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 651, 8, 63, 'like a royal animal. People wouldn''t throw their garments in front of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 651, 9, 63, 'the horse even when the kings rode on horses. But when Jesus came on a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 651, 10, 63, 'donkey, they threw the garments in front of it and respected Him, a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 651, 11, 63, 'waving their branches and spreading them on the road as they were crying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 651, 12, 63, 'out saying “Hosanna to the Son of David; BLESSED IS HE WHO COMES IN THE');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 651, 13, 63, 'NAME OF THE LORD; Hosanna in the highest!”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 651, 14, 63, 'I have often thought that that donkey could have suddenly had high');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 651, 15, 63, 'thoughts about itself, saying, “Wow, what an important person I am!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 651, 16, 63, 'People are throwing their garments in front of me and shouting,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 651, 17, 63, '“Hosanna!” and waving palm leaves. I must be really a important person!”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 651, 18, 63, 'That''s unfortunately how many Christians and Christian preachers behave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 651, 19, 63, 'when other people give them honor for their service. Maybe God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 651, 20, 63, 'pleased to ride you like He rode that donkey, and give you gifts to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 651, 21, 63, 'serve Him. Has that gone to your head, and have you begun to think that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 651, 22, 63, 'you''re a very important person? Especially when a lot of people honor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 651, 23, 63, 'you and exalt you, it’s natural to begin to think that you''re an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 651, 24, 63, 'important person. What happened to the donkey as soon as Jesus got off');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 651, 25, 63, 'of it? Everybody forgot about it and nobody cared for him. He just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 651, 26, 63, 'wandered and he didn''t know what to do after that. All of a sudden, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 651, 27, 63, 'found that nobody was throwing any garments in front of him and nobody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 651, 28, 63, 'was waving palm leaves and singing, “Hosanna,” because the Lord was no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 652, 1, 63, 'longer sitting on him. In the same way, it''s good for us donkeys to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 652, 2, 63, 'recognize that it is because the Lord is upon us and in us that people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 652, 3, 63, 'give us honor. We should never imagine that it is because of what we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 652, 4, 63, 'or who we are that people honor us. Let''s be humble enough to give the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 652, 5, 63, 'glory to God and remain broken and humble saying, “Lord, by ourselves,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 652, 6, 63, 'we are nothing, we are unprofitable servants.” That''s the other thing we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 652, 7, 63, 'can learn from this circumstance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 652, 8, 63, 'What were the people shouting? “Hosanna to the Son of David, Hosanna in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 652, 9, 63, 'the highest.” “Hosanna” is a Hebrew word, which means “save us now.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 652, 10, 63, 'They said, “Oh Son of David, save us now, oh, Son of David,” because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 652, 11, 63, 'their understanding of salvation was to be saved from the Roman rulers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 652, 12, 63, 'who were ruling Israel. They were not asking to be saved from sin. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 652, 13, 63, 'didn''t come to save them from the Roman rulers; He came to save His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 652, 14, 63, 'people from their sins - that’s the meaning of the name of Jesus. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 652, 15, 63, 'they were saying, “Save us now, Son of David, save us now, You Who’ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 652, 16, 63, 'come from the highest, save us now and blessed is He who comes in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 652, 17, 63, 'name of the Lord.” That''s the meaning of Hosanna.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 652, 18, 63, 'Mean the Words You Say to God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 652, 19, 63, 'A lot of people sing that word in Christian songs today without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 652, 20, 63, 'understanding what it means. Don''t ever sing something to God, which you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 652, 21, 63, 'don''t mean. Do you ever go up to your dad or mom and say something that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 652, 22, 63, 'you don''t mean? Do you ever use a meaningless word to your dad or mom?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 652, 23, 63, 'Do you go to them or to a brother and use a word you don''t even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 652, 24, 63, 'understand just because other people are using it? That''s foolish. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 652, 25, 63, 'we speak to someone, we are to always know what we''re talking about and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 652, 26, 63, 'to speak in language that we understand. We should never use words that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 652, 27, 63, 'we don''t understand. Even if you say, “Hallelujah,” you must know what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 652, 28, 63, 'Hallelujah means. That''s not an English word. It''s a Hebrew word - a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 653, 1, 63, 'combination of three words, actually - which means “Praise the Lord.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 653, 2, 63, '“Amen” is also not an English word. We know what it means. Amen means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 653, 3, 63, '“it shall be so” - it''s an expression of faith. “I believe what I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 653, 4, 63, 'prayed, therefore “it will be so.’”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 653, 5, 63, 'It''s important for us to understand everything we say. There''s nothing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 653, 6, 63, 'wrong in using these words - you can pray to God and use words in any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 653, 7, 63, 'language. You can speak in an African language if you like or Russian or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 653, 8, 63, 'what you like, but know what you''re saying. That''s the important thing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 653, 9, 63, 'By all means say, “Hallelujah,” if you want to say, "Praise the Lord.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 653, 10, 63, 'And by all means say, “Amen,” if you mean, “I believe it shall be so.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 653, 11, 63, 'And by all means say, “Hosanna,” if what you mean is, “Lord, save me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 653, 12, 63, 'now” from something you want to be saved from. There’s nothing wrong in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 653, 13, 63, 'saying any of those things if you mean them. But don''t ever sing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 653, 14, 63, 'meaningless words to God like multitudes of Christians are doing today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 653, 15, 63, 'That''s what I''m saying. People get taken up with a word and they keep on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 653, 16, 63, 'singing. Particularly in singing, I find multitudes of Christians saying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 653, 17, 63, 'meaningless words to the Lord because for them, it’s just the tune and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 653, 18, 63, 'the words and the swinging of the hips and the playing of guitar that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 653, 19, 63, 'more important to them. They don''t even think about the word they’re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 653, 20, 63, 'saying. That''s carelessness, and I want to encourage you to be more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 653, 21, 63, 'careful. The Bible says we must be careful with our mouth when we go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 653, 22, 63, 'into God''s presence. “Guard your steps when you go into the house of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 653, 23, 63, 'God. Do not be hasty in word or impulsive in thought to bring up a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 653, 24, 63, 'matter in the presence of God. Because God is in heaven and you are on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 653, 25, 63, 'the earth; therefore let your words be few” (Ecclesiastes 5:2). When you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 653, 26, 63, 'promise something to God (Ecclesiastes 5:4), “Do not be late in paying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 653, 27, 63, 'it, for He takes no delight in fools. Pay what you vow.” It is better');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 653, 28, 63, 'that you don''t make a promise to God than you make a promise and you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 654, 1, 63, 'don’t keep it. So be very careful because (verse 7) “in many words,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 654, 2, 63, 'there is emptiness, so fear God.” There can be a lot of emptiness in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 654, 3, 63, 'many words. Particularly in prayer, people pray all these flowery words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 654, 4, 63, 'trying to impress God, but God is not impressed. He is more impressed by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 654, 5, 63, 'a sincere cry that comes out from somebody''s heart; God is not impressed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 654, 6, 63, 'or in love with flowery language. He''s a Father, and just like we don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 654, 7, 63, 'go to our earthly fathers with flowery language, we go to God as our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 654, 8, 63, 'Heavenly Father, and we must mean every word that we say. I mention this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 654, 9, 63, 'because I see so many people using words like this, which they have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 654, 10, 63, 'never bothered to find out what they mean.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 654, 11, 63, '“When He entered Jerusalem, all the city was stirred, saying, ‘Who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 654, 12, 63, 'this? Who is this coming on a donkey?’ People waving their palms and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 654, 13, 63, 'throwing their garments on the ground and the multitudes were saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 654, 14, 63, '‘This is the Prophet Jesus, who has come from Nazareth in Galilee.’ And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 654, 15, 63, 'Jesus entered the temple and He cast out all those who were buying and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 654, 16, 63, 'selling in the temple, and overturned the tables of the money changers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 654, 17, 63, 'and the seats of those who were selling doves. And He said to them, ‘It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 654, 18, 63, 'is written, “My house shall be called a house of prayer; but you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 654, 19, 63, 'making it a robber’s den.”’ And the blind and the lame came to Him in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 654, 20, 63, 'the temple and He healed them” (Matthew 21:10-14).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 654, 21, 63, 'This is the second time that Jesus cleansed the temple. He cleansed it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 654, 22, 63, 'once before in the beginning of His ministry. In John 2, after the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 654, 23, 63, 'marriage in Cana, He made a whip and chased people out. That''s the first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 654, 24, 63, 'time He cleansed the temple right at the beginning of His ministry. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 654, 25, 63, 'found in the temple those who were selling oxen and sheep and doves, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 654, 26, 63, 'the moneychangers seated. And He made a scourge of cords, and drove them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 654, 27, 63, 'all out and He poured out the coins of the moneychangers, and said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 654, 28, 63, '“Take these things away! Stop making my Father''s house a house of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 655, 1, 63, 'merchandise” (John 2:14). But now it''s not a house of merchandise. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 655, 2, 63, 'says in Matthew 21:13, “You made My Father’s house a robber’s den.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 655, 3, 63, 'Things have changed terribly since that time, near the end of His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 655, 4, 63, 'ministry. So Jesus had to cleanse the temple a second time. He turned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 655, 5, 63, 'out everybody right at the beginning and then, when some time had gone,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 655, 6, 63, 'they came back into the temple and started doing all those things all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 655, 7, 63, 'over again, and then He had to drive them out a second time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 655, 8, 63, 'There''s a constant need for cleansing in the Lord''s temple. It''s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 655, 9, 63, 'enough just to have done it once; there''s a need again and again and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 655, 10, 63, 'again for the house of God to be cleaned. For our heart and life and in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 655, 11, 63, 'the church, there needs to be a prophetic word cleansing the temple of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 655, 12, 63, 'God again and again and again. That''s what we learn from the two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 655, 13, 63, 'cleansings of the temple. We should pursue that way ourselves, so that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 655, 14, 63, 'we can keep our temple as the Father''s house and never let it become a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 655, 15, 63, 'robber’s den.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 655, 16, 64, 'Chapter 63 The Balance and Compassion of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 655, 17, 64, 'The Balance of Grace and Truth in Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 655, 18, 64, 'As we read about Jesus driving out the money changers in the temple, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 655, 19, 64, 'need to understand Jesus completely and in a balanced way. He was full');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 655, 20, 64, 'of grace and truth; not just grace, and not just truth, but grace and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 655, 21, 64, 'truth. He knew how to speak compassionately to lepers and adulterous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 655, 22, 64, 'women or divorced women like the woman in Samaria. He also knew how to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 655, 23, 64, 'call the Pharisees a generation of vipers and to overturn the tables of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 655, 24, 64, 'people who were making money in the temple in the name of religion. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 655, 25, 64, 'is the balanced understanding of Christlikeness that every Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 655, 26, 64, 'must have. Very often, when we use the word “Christlike,” we only think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 655, 27, 64, 'of the tenderness with which He speaks to simple people, or we think of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 655, 28, 64, 'Him putting His arms around lepers. That''s the only understanding of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 656, 1, 64, 'Christlikeness that most (I would say 99. 99%) Christians have. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 656, 2, 64, 'would never think that someone is Christlike if he called people a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 656, 3, 64, 'generation of vipers. You wouldn''t think that somebody who turns over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 656, 4, 64, 'tables and tells people to get out of the temple is Christlike. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 656, 5, 64, 'where the devil has hidden true Christlikeness from the minds of most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 656, 6, 64, 'Christians. The end result of that is that most churches are in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 656, 7, 64, 'pathetic state when it comes to purity. The church needs cleansing, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 656, 8, 64, 'there''s nobody to cleanse it because everybody is trying to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 656, 9, 64, 'Christlike in a false way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 656, 10, 64, 'There is a lot of preaching that says we must be gracious and gentle.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 656, 11, 64, 'That is true, but the other aspect of the Christlikeness – of being hard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 656, 12, 64, 'against Pharisees and money changers - is a calling that at least some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 656, 13, 64, 'people in the body must fulfill. I''m not saying that everybody in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 656, 14, 64, 'body of Christ has to or is called to fulfill this ministry, but there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 656, 15, 64, 'must be some. There is a pathetic lack of preachers in the church today');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 656, 16, 64, 'who will drive out money loving preachers who are out to squeeze money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 656, 17, 64, 'from poor people in order to live in grand style themselves, especially');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 656, 18, 64, 'a lot of Christian television preachers, who keep asking people for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 656, 19, 64, 'money and take money from poor people to live in a grand style');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 656, 20, 64, 'themselves. These are the equivalent of the money changers of today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 656, 21, 64, 'Jesus drove them out twice, at the beginning and at the end of His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 656, 22, 64, 'ministry. He drove out of the temple those who were making money in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 656, 23, 64, 'name of God. That is exactly what He would do today and He does it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 656, 24, 64, 'through His body. If God calls you to such a ministry, fulfill it and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 656, 25, 64, 'don''t care what men think about you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 656, 26, 64, '“And He said to them, ‘It is written, “My house shall be called a house');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 656, 27, 64, 'of prayer;” but you are making it a robbers’ den’” (Matthew 21:13). The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 656, 28, 64, 'church has truly become a den of robbers. Many preachers are robbers who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 657, 1, 64, 'are taking money from poor people. They send reports from India to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 657, 2, 64, 'Western countries, for example, and report all sorts of things in order');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 657, 3, 64, 'to get a lot of money to line their own pockets. They talk about their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 657, 4, 64, 'orphanages and their Bible schools, some of which only exist on paper,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 657, 5, 64, 'fooling simple gullible people in the West. This kind of preaching –');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 657, 6, 64, 'where we expose such money changers - is offensive to some people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 657, 7, 64, 'because they haven''t seen what Christlikeness is. We need to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 657, 8, 64, 'Christlike in cleansing the Church of God. At the same time, you see the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 657, 9, 64, 'balance immediately after that, “The blind and the lame came to Him in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 657, 10, 64, 'the temple, and He was so tender, and He healed them” (Matthew 21:14 -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 657, 11, 64, 'paraphrase). Jesus could immediately switch from one to the other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 657, 12, 64, 'depending on who was in front of Him. This is how it must be with us too');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 657, 13, 64, '- that when the spiritually blind and the spiritually lame come into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 657, 14, 64, 'church, we must be tender and kind, and with encouraging words lift them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 657, 15, 64, 'up, just like we use strong words to drive out the crooks.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 657, 16, 64, 'There were two sides to what Jesus did - one was driving out these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 657, 17, 64, 'crooks, and the other was healing the blind and the lame. “But when the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 657, 18, 64, 'chief priests and the scribes saw the wonderful things that He had done,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 657, 19, 64, 'and the children who were shouting in the temple, ‘Hosanna to the Son of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 657, 20, 64, 'David,’ (Hosanna means ‘save us’), they became indignant” (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 657, 21, 64, '21:15). Imagine that - they became angry because they saw children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 657, 22, 64, 'praising the Lord. They thought children must keep quiet. “They said to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 657, 23, 64, 'Him, ‘Do you hear what these children are saying?’ And Jesus said to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 657, 24, 64, 'them, ‘Yes; have you never read, ‘Out of the mouth of infants and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 657, 25, 64, 'nursing babes You have prepared praise for Yourself?’” (Matthew 21:16).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 657, 26, 64, 'Compare Scripture with Scripture');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 657, 27, 64, 'This is a quote from Psalm 8:2. If you look carefully at Psalm 8, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 657, 28, 64, 'learn something very interesting. Whenever you read a quotation from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 658, 1, 64, 'Old Testament in the New Testament, go back to the Old Testament and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 658, 2, 64, 'look at that verse and you will find something very profitable. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 658, 3, 64, 'a great example: Jesus says in Matthew 21:16, “Out of the mouth of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 658, 4, 64, 'infants and nursing babes You have prepared praise for Yourself;”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 658, 5, 64, 'however, in Psalm 8:2 where this is quoted from, it says, “From the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 658, 6, 64, 'mouth of infants and nursing babes You have established strength (or a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 658, 7, 64, 'bulwark, which is a strong wall of defense) because of your adversaries,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 658, 8, 64, 'to make the enemy and the revengeful cease (or to keep quiet, or to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 658, 9, 64, 'cease their activity).” This verse speaks about “Strength to silence and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 658, 10, 64, 'defeat our enemies.” Remember that! From the mouth of infants and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 658, 11, 64, 'nursing babes comes strength to defeat our enemies. And Jesus said from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 658, 12, 64, 'the mouth of infants and nursing babes comes praise for God. Putting the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 658, 13, 64, 'two together we learn that the way we silence Satan and overcome him is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 658, 14, 64, 'by praising God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 658, 15, 64, 'We learn something there by comparing Scripture with Scripture, both');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 658, 16, 64, 'verses inspired by the Holy Spirit. Jesus preferred to use praise, which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 658, 17, 64, 'is how we silence Satan. Whenever you find that your prayers don''t seem');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 658, 18, 64, 'to be going through or you find yourself heavy or sleepy in the time of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 658, 19, 64, 'prayer, or you don''t seem to make contact with heaven, don''t kneel down.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 658, 20, 64, 'Get up, walk up and down, raise your hands and start praising God! You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 658, 21, 64, 'will find it is very easy to contact heaven when you praise God. It may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 658, 22, 64, 'be difficult when you pray, but once you have established contact with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 658, 23, 64, 'praise, the enemies are cleared and the way into heaven is cleared. Then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 658, 24, 64, 'you can pray. This is the way we should do it. We learn something here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 658, 25, 64, 'just by comparing the quotation in the New Testament with the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 658, 26, 64, 'Testament. There are numerous examples of this throughout the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 658, 27, 64, 'Testament that I’ve found in my own study.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 658, 28, 64, '“Then Jesus left them and went out of the city to Bethany, and spent the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 659, 1, 64, 'night there. Now in the morning when He was returning to the city, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 659, 2, 64, 'became hungry. Seeing a lone fig tree by the road, He came to it and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 659, 3, 64, 'found nothing on it except leaves” (Matthew 21:17-19). Here we see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 659, 4, 64, 'something of Jesus’ humanity. Because Jesus was completely a man, He did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 659, 5, 64, 'not use the resources and power that He had as God while He was on this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 659, 6, 64, 'earth. He could have used it, but He chose not to. He refused to use');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 659, 7, 64, 'that power because He had relinquished it voluntarily when He came to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 659, 8, 64, 'the earth. It is like when a billionaire from some western land comes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 659, 9, 64, 'here, to teach people in the slums how to live a clean and simple life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 659, 10, 64, 'with very little income (say a thousand rupees a month). He comes here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 659, 11, 64, 'and works like them and earns a thousand rupees a month and teaches');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 659, 12, 64, 'people how to live on a thousand rupees a month and live cleanly in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 659, 13, 64, 'little hut in the slums. He is still a billionaire who has a credit card');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 659, 14, 64, 'but He does not use it. This is how Jesus lived. He never used His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 659, 15, 64, 'heavenly “credit card” as God. He was like a billionaire who had a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 659, 16, 64, 'credit card but would never use that credit card when He lived in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 659, 17, 64, 'slum called earth, in order to teach people how to live without using');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 659, 18, 64, 'any of His own resources as God. He lived, first of all, with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 659, 19, 64, 'limitations we have, tempted as we are, being tired like we are tired,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 659, 20, 64, 'hungry like we are hungry and with all the desires and passions that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 659, 21, 64, 'normal human beings have, apart from sin. Yet He did not sin even though');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 659, 22, 64, 'He lived on earth as a Man. He came in the flesh and His spirit was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 659, 23, 64, 'pure. This is the secret of godliness (1 Timothy 3:16).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 659, 24, 64, 'Cursing the Fig Tree - Lessons on Faith and Religiosity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 659, 25, 64, 'Jesus came near a fig tree in order to see whether there was fruit on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 659, 26, 64, 'it. If He had used His resources as God, He would have known whether');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 659, 27, 64, 'there was fruit on the fig tree from a million miles away. But He had to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 659, 28, 64, 'get near it and then He found nothing on it except leaves. In little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 660, 1, 64, 'things like these we see the fact that He was 100% human, just like us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 660, 2, 64, '“And He said to the fig tree, ‘No longer shall there ever be any fruit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 660, 3, 64, 'from you.’ And at once the fig tree withered” (Matthew 21:19). This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 660, 4, 64, 'isn’t Jesus acting as God; this is Him acting as an Anointed Prophet of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 660, 5, 64, 'God. God can do this through a prophet even today. So even in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 660, 6, 64, 'supernatural things that Jesus did, He did not act as God. The only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 660, 7, 64, 'place He acted as God was when He forgave sins and He received worship.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 660, 8, 64, 'In everything else He did, it was as an Anointed Prophet of God - the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 660, 9, 64, 'supernatural things which God can do through any man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 660, 10, 64, '“Seeing this, the disciples were amazed and asked, ‘How did the fig tree');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 660, 11, 64, 'wither all at once?’” (Matthew 21:20). The root had withered as soon as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 660, 12, 64, 'Jesus spoke, but the tree itself took about a day to appear withered. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 660, 13, 64, 'know this because in another passage it says that the disciples asked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 660, 14, 64, 'this question on the next day (Mark 11:20). So how did the fig tree');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 660, 15, 64, 'wither up? “Jesus answered and said to them, ‘Truly I say to you, if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 660, 16, 64, 'have faith and you do not doubt, you will not only do what was done to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 660, 17, 64, 'the fig tree, but even if you say to this mountain, ‘Be taken up and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 660, 18, 64, 'cast into the sea,’ it will happen. And all things you ask in prayer,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 660, 19, 64, 'believing, you will receive’” (Matthew 21:21-22).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 660, 20, 64, 'Some people think that Jesus was angry because He could not get fruit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 660, 21, 64, 'from the fig tree. This is not true. Jesus was not a slave to food. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 660, 22, 64, 'wanted to teach His disciples a lesson on faith and it was worth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 660, 23, 64, 'withering up a fig tree to teach His disciples and all Christians this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 660, 24, 64, 'lesson. That is why He cursed the fig tree and caused it to be withered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 660, 25, 64, 'up. It was to teach His disciples that if you have faith, you can have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 660, 26, 64, 'authority over situations like this. You can even tell a mountain to get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 660, 27, 64, 'out of the way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 660, 28, 64, 'The other reason He cursed the fig tree is this: in the Old Testament');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 661, 1, 64, 'the fig tree is a picture of Israel, just like the wine is a picture of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 661, 2, 64, 'the church in the new covenant. Symbolically speaking, Jesus came to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 661, 3, 64, 'Israel looking for fruit. That means He was looking with a spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 661, 4, 64, 'desire and a spiritual hunger for the glory of God. But what did He see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 661, 5, 64, 'in this fig tree, Israel? He saw the leaves of religion and religiosity,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 661, 6, 64, 'empty religious rituals, and traditions. Therefore He cursed the tree,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 661, 7, 64, 'that religious system which was driving people away from God. Even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 661, 8, 64, 'today, He curses every single religious system in the church that turns');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 661, 9, 64, 'people away from God, where there are only leaves and no fruit. A lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 661, 10, 64, 'churches today and a lot of Christians only have leaves. Leaves refer to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 661, 11, 64, 'empty rituals such as going to church, praying, singing songs, reading');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 661, 12, 64, 'the Bible, and lot of other activity, but which are not for the glory of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 661, 13, 64, 'God. They do not bear the fruit of purity, victory over sin, a godly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 661, 14, 64, 'peaceful life, and godly children being brought up in a home, for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 661, 15, 64, 'example. They only bring forth a lot of leaves of activity, such as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 661, 16, 64, 'singing and praising with emptiness in the heart. Jesus curses that even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 661, 17, 64, 'today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 661, 18, 64, 'In Matthew 24 Jesus said, “Now learn the parable from the fig tree; when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 661, 19, 64, 'its branch has already become tender and put forth its leaves, you know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 661, 20, 64, 'that summer is near; so, you too, when you see all these things,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 661, 21, 64, 'recognize that He is near, right at the door. Truly I say to you, this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 661, 22, 64, 'generation will not pass away until all these things take place”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 661, 23, 64, '(Matthew 24:32-34). Jesus is talking about His second coming and certain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 661, 24, 64, 'signs that would take place in the world before He returns. One of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 661, 25, 64, 'specific signs He mentioned was that Israel, which was withered up,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 661, 26, 64, 'would come back and become a nation. From the history of Israel we know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 661, 27, 64, 'that they were already being ruled by the Romans when Jesus was alive.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 661, 28, 64, 'They were not really a free nation, but forty years after they rejected');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 662, 1, 64, 'Christ and crucified Him, they were scattered by God all across the face');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 662, 2, 64, 'of the earth. The fig tree had truly withered. The root had withered as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 662, 3, 64, 'soon as they crucified Christ, but it only became evident forty years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 662, 4, 64, 'later. Like it says, the fig tree they saw on the next day was withered,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 662, 5, 64, 'so it happened to Israel – they were scattered all over the earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 662, 6, 64, 'Jesus told His disciples to keep a watch on the fig tree because one day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 662, 7, 64, 'you will see it putting out leaves again, without any fruit, but the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 662, 8, 64, 'nation of Israel will come back to the land to be a religious nation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 662, 9, 64, 'again, just as they were in Jesus’ time - an independent nation. Now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 662, 10, 64, 'this took place in 1948, and the Jews returned to the city of Jerusalem');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 662, 11, 64, 'in 1967. These are signs that Jesus spoke about. It is a sign that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 662, 12, 64, 'second coming of the Lord is very near, and the generation that observes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 662, 13, 64, 'these signs will not pass away until all these things are fulfilled.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 662, 14, 64, 'Jesus said this two thousand years ago, and that is why we who have seen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 662, 15, 64, 'these things take place have the hope that we will see Christ return in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 662, 16, 64, 'our lifetime. If our understanding of this prophecy is right, then we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 662, 17, 64, 'see the fig tree is putting forth its leaves. Thus Jesus was teaching');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 662, 18, 64, 'them faith, and as they would understand it later, it was also a parable');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 662, 19, 64, 'of the nation of Israel.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 662, 20, 64, 'Jesus Answers Questions by Listening to the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 662, 21, 64, '“When He entered the temple, the chief priests and the elders of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 662, 22, 64, 'people came to Him while He was teaching, and asked Him, ‘By what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 662, 23, 64, 'authority are You doing these things, and who gave You this authority?’”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 662, 24, 64, '(Matthew 21:23). I ask this question: why did the chief priests and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 662, 25, 64, 'scribes allow these people to make the courtyard of the temple a place');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 662, 26, 64, 'of merchandise and business? In my opinion, it is because those traders');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 662, 27, 64, 'were giving the chief priests and scribes a huge commission for allowing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 662, 28, 64, 'them to do that. I can’t imagine the chief priests and scribes allowing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 663, 1, 64, 'them to run their business without a commission. This is exactly what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 663, 2, 64, 'happens in a lot of Christian churches today. Pastors receive a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 663, 3, 64, 'commission for allowing activities in the church that Christ would never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 663, 4, 64, 'allow. They receive their salary and their mouths are shut against the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 663, 5, 64, 'rich people in the church who cannot be rebuked anymore, for they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 663, 6, 64, 'the ones who pay the pastor''s salary. There is hardly anybody like Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 663, 7, 64, 'today, who will come up and denounce everything and call it Babylon.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 663, 8, 64, 'Jesus refused to answer their question because they would not understand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 663, 9, 64, 'Him. He said to them, “Before I answer you, I want to ask you something.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 663, 10, 64, 'Tell Me, was the baptism of John from heaven or from men?” (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 663, 11, 64, '21:24-25). The answer was clear because everybody knew it was from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 663, 12, 64, 'heaven. “But they began reasoning among themselves, saying, ‘If we say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 663, 13, 64, '‘From heaven,’ He will say to us, ‘Then why did you not believe in him?’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 663, 14, 64, '(Because they had rejected John the Baptist). But if we say, ‘From men,’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 663, 15, 64, 'we fear the people; for they all regard John as a prophet’” (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 663, 16, 64, '21:25-26). They were caught in a dilemma. They could not say yes or no,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 663, 17, 64, 'so they told a lie. They knew it was from heaven but they said, “We do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 663, 18, 64, 'not know.” They were being diplomatic just like a lot of today''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 663, 19, 64, 'preachers. “He also said to them, ‘Neither will I tell you by what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 663, 20, 64, 'authority I do these things” (Matthew 21:27).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 663, 21, 64, 'Jesus’ life shows us that when people came to Him with these difficult');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 663, 22, 64, 'questions, He could discern whether this was a genuine question or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 663, 23, 64, 'whether they were trying to trap Him. Every true servant of God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 663, 24, 64, 'preacher or prophet who wants to live for God needs to have that same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 663, 25, 64, 'discernment when people come to him with difficult questions. Are they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 663, 26, 64, 'trying to trap you? We need to seek God at such times and say, “Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 663, 27, 64, 'give me a word to reply them.” This is how Jesus lived. He lived in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 663, 28, 64, 'constant touch with His Father, so He knew exactly what to say to each');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 664, 1, 64, 'person. He did not live by a law that gave Him a set of rules as to how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 664, 2, 64, 'to speak to people. Neither must we live by rules. We must live by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 664, 3, 64, 'leading of the Holy Spirit and then we shall have the same wisdom and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 664, 4, 64, 'discernment that Jesus had, because the same Holy Spirit that dwelt in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 664, 5, 64, 'His earthly body is the One Who is now dwelling in us. This is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 664, 6, 64, 'wonderful truth that from the day of Pentecost, the same Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 664, 7, 64, 'that lived in Jesus’ body for 33.5 years has now come to dwell in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 664, 8, 64, 'bodies of Christians. That is why we need to seek to be filled with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 664, 9, 64, 'Holy Spirit, to keep our conscience sensitive to sin, and to keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 664, 10, 64, 'ourselves pure - so that the Holy Spirit can have free rein in us and so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 664, 11, 64, 'that our minds will be sharp. That is the only way we can effectively');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 664, 12, 64, 'serve God in this sin-cursed earth with so many deceptive spirits');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 664, 13, 64, 'roaming around in Christendom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 664, 14, 64, '“Then Jesus said, ‘But what do you think? A man had two sons, and he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 664, 15, 64, 'came to the first and said, “Son, go work today in the vineyard.” And he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 664, 16, 64, 'answered, “I will not;” but afterward he regretted it and went. The man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 664, 17, 64, 'came to the second and said the same thing; and he answered, “I will,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 664, 18, 64, 'sir;” but he didn''t go. Which of the two did the will of his father?’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 664, 19, 64, 'They said the first. Jesus said to them, ‘Truly I say to you that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 664, 20, 64, 'tax collectors and prostitutes will get into the kingdom of God before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 664, 21, 64, 'you. For John came to you in the way of righteousness and you did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 664, 22, 64, 'believe him; but the tax-collectors and prostitutes did believe him; and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 664, 23, 64, 'you, seeing this, did not even feel remorse afterward so as to believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 664, 24, 64, 'him’” (Matthew 21:28-32).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 664, 25, 64, 'Very often, those to whom God comes first reject Him. He came to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 664, 26, 64, 'Jewish people first and they rejected Christ. Then He moved on to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 664, 27, 64, 'Gentiles and they accepted Him. This is what Jesus is trying to say to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 664, 28, 64, 'the religious people who thought God would only accept them. This is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 665, 1, 64, 'mistake that a lot a Christian groups can also make. Just because God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 665, 2, 64, 'has used us to restore some truth that was unknown to others or made us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 665, 3, 64, 'a blessing to others, we can begin to think that we are God’s special');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 665, 4, 64, 'favorites and that God can only use us. This makes us casual in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 665, 5, 64, 'attitude towards sin. This is a picture of people who say, “Once saved,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 665, 6, 64, 'always saved.” Jesus says, “Son, go work today in the vineyard,” and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 665, 7, 64, 'they say, “Yes, sure,” but they don''t do it. This means they ask Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 665, 8, 64, 'to come into their heart but they never obey Him, and they think they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 665, 9, 64, 'are okay. Then there are others, who may not have responded initially,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 665, 10, 64, 'but who later repent. The important thing here is that they repent, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 665, 11, 64, 'their repentance leads to life and they obey the Lord. Which of these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 665, 12, 64, 'did the will of God, the first people, or the second? The answer is, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 665, 13, 64, 'second people. Thus Jesus said to these religious people, who knew so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 665, 14, 64, 'much of the Bible, that the tax-collectors and prostitutes will get into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 665, 15, 64, 'the kingdom of God before them. The crooked cheats and the prostitutes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 665, 16, 64, 'will get into the kingdom of God before the religious people who always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 665, 17, 64, 'preach the Bible. This is a very important word that needs to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 665, 18, 64, 'preached in churches today. We need to understand - this is the God we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 665, 19, 64, 'worship and this is the One we must proclaim.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 665, 20, 64, 'In Matthew 21:31, Jesus was saying to the religious people of His day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 665, 21, 64, 'that the tax collectors and prostitutes would go into God''s kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 665, 22, 64, 'before them. It is a word that the Lord has to speak to many Christians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 665, 23, 64, 'today who imagine that they are going to God''s kingdom because they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 665, 24, 64, 'religious, know the Bible, and go to church regularly, but there is no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 665, 25, 64, 'repentance in their lives. This is the contrast like in the case of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 665, 26, 64, 'wise man who built on the rock and the foolish man who built on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 665, 27, 64, 'sand. The contrast is between words of understanding and obedience. Here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 665, 28, 64, 'also, there were words. In Matthew 21:29-30, one son said, “I will do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 666, 1, 64, 'it,” but he never did anything. The other one initially said, “I will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 666, 2, 64, 'not do it,” but later on, repented and did it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 666, 3, 64, 'The emphasis is on obedience. It is the one who obeys who finally is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 666, 4, 64, 'accepted, not the one who says nice words. Today, we have a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 666, 5, 64, 'Christians who speak nice words in prayer, singing, fasting, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 666, 6, 64, 'preaching, but there is very little obedience in their private lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 666, 7, 64, 'That is the important thing. That is why Jesus said that the repentant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 666, 8, 64, 'cheats and prostitutes will get into God''s kingdom before the whole lot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 666, 9, 64, 'of religious people. Religious people think that they will enter God’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 666, 10, 64, 'kingdom because of their religiosity and religious activities. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 666, 11, 64, 'the great deception that needs to be exposed in our day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 666, 12, 64, 'Jesus then reminds them of John the Baptist, and He says in Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 666, 13, 64, '21:32, “You did not feel remorse.” Again, the emphasis is on remorse and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 666, 14, 64, 'repentance, just like in Matthew 21:29.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 666, 15, 65, 'Chapter 64 The True Church, Brokenness, and Justification');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 666, 16, 65, 'God’s New People Are the Church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 666, 17, 65, 'There was a landowner who planted a vineyard and put a wall around it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 666, 18, 65, 'He dug a wine press in it, built a tower, and rented it out to wine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 666, 19, 65, 'growers and went on a journey. When the harvest time approached, he sent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 666, 20, 65, 'his slaves to receive his produce. The vine-growers took the slaves and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 666, 21, 65, 'beat one and killed another and stoned the third. (This is referring to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 666, 22, 65, 'the Jewish people who killed the prophets that God had sent to them.)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 666, 23, 65, 'Then he sent another group of slaves larger than the first and they did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 666, 24, 65, 'the same thing to them. (They rejected the Prophets that came to them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 666, 25, 65, 'one by one from God.) And then finally, the landowner said, “I will send');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 666, 26, 65, 'my son. They will respect my son.” But when the wine growers saw the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 666, 27, 65, 'son, they said, “Hey, this is the heir! Let''s kill him and seize his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 666, 28, 65, 'inheritance. We will not be slaves anymore. We will be partners owning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 667, 1, 65, 'this property.” They took him, and threw him out of the vineyard and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 667, 2, 65, 'killed him. Therefore, when the owner of the vineyard comes, what will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 667, 3, 65, 'he do to those vine-growers? Jesus said, “That is right. The stone which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 667, 4, 65, 'the builders rejected had become the chief corner stone’” (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 667, 5, 65, '21:33-42).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 667, 6, 65, 'Jesus is telling them the time has come when the God is going to put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 667, 7, 65, 'them all out. God will do this because they did not give to Him the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 667, 8, 65, 'produce of the field which God gave them to cultivate for Him. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 667, 9, 65, 'treated His prophets badly. “I am the Son of God, and since you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 667, 10, 65, 'going to treat Me badly, God will take this vineyard away from you and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 667, 11, 65, 'give it to others.” He has given it to the church. He replaced Israel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 667, 12, 65, 'with the church. We need to understand that clearly. This parable makes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 667, 13, 65, 'it clearer than anything else because some people do not believe it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 667, 14, 65, 'They do not believe what Jesus said. There is no Jew or Gentile today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 667, 15, 65, 'There is no special favorite of God. No nation is His favorite. He has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 667, 16, 65, 'promised an earthly blessing to Israel, and He has given it to them (He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 667, 17, 65, 'gave them the land), but spiritually, in the body of Christ, there is no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 667, 18, 65, 'Jew or Gentile. God is not looking for any particular group of people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 667, 19, 65, 'today. Nobody is a favorite. It is very important to understand that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 667, 20, 65, 'Israel has been replaced by the church. It is so clear.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 667, 21, 65, 'The other thing I want you to see is that the Master Himself never came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 667, 22, 65, 'to collect the produce. In Matthew 21:34, it says He sent His servants');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 667, 23, 65, 'to receive the produce. God sent His servants, who are His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 667, 24, 65, 'representatives. He does not come Himself. As far as God is concerned,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 667, 25, 65, 'the way you treat His servants is the way you treat Him. We must bear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 667, 26, 65, 'this in mind. I am not talking about every pastor, preacher, or anyone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 667, 27, 65, 'who calls himself a servant of God. Ninety-nine percent of them are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 667, 28, 65, 'crooks, but there are some true genuine prophets and servants of God in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 668, 1, 65, 'the world today. There are apostles and prophets even today. God takes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 668, 2, 65, 'the way you treat them very seriously. We must bear that in mind. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 668, 3, 65, 'will bring them to a wretched end. The Lord said, “That is right.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 668, 4, 65, 'Matthew 21:42 is a quotation from Psalm 118:22-23, “The stone which the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 668, 5, 65, 'builders rejected has become the chief corner stone. This is the Lord’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 668, 6, 65, 'doing; It is marvelous in our eyes.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 668, 7, 65, 'Jesus explained that saying in the Scripture. In the Old Testament');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 668, 8, 65, 'times, the most important stone in the construction of buildings was the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 668, 9, 65, 'cornerstone. They did not have concrete pillars. Those days, they never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 668, 10, 65, 'used concrete in buildings. They built with the foundation and with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 668, 11, 65, 'stone pillars. The most important stone was the cornerstone, which they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 668, 12, 65, 'put in first in the corner of buildings. That stone had to be perfectly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 668, 13, 65, 'shaped in three dimensions with perfect right angles in all directions.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 668, 14, 65, 'If it was slightly crooked by one angle, then all the stones in that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 668, 15, 65, 'line would become crooked. The cornerstone was the most important stone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 668, 16, 65, 'There were perhaps different stones that were shaped and cut until you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 668, 17, 65, 'could get one which is perfect to be the cornerstone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 668, 18, 65, 'Jesus is talking about a situation where the builders wanted to build a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 668, 19, 65, 'big temple. The builders looked at one particular cornerstone after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 668, 20, 65, 'another. They rejected that and finally took this one. But then they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 668, 21, 65, 'find this one is leading the temple of the building to be built at an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 668, 22, 65, 'angle. So they threw it away, look back, and then they have to pick up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 668, 23, 65, 'the stone that they first rejected. That was the one that was perfect.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 668, 24, 65, 'That is what Jesus is referring to. The stone which the builders');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 668, 25, 65, 'rejected became the chief cornerstone. That is what the Lord did. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 668, 26, 65, 'Christ whom the Jews rejected has become the cornerstone of God''s house.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 668, 27, 65, 'Matthew 21:43, “Therefore I say to you, the kingdom of God will be taken');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 668, 28, 65, 'away from you and given to a nation producing the fruit of it.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 669, 1, 65, 'God has given His kingdom to those who will produce fruit for Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 669, 2, 65, 'Please remember this. He is always expecting fruit. Jesus once said, “I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 669, 3, 65, 'have chosen you and ordained you that you must go and bring forth fruit,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 669, 4, 65, 'and that your fruit might remain” (John 15:16). God does not want us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 669, 5, 65, 'live fruitless lives. It is God''s will that every single one of us bring');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 669, 6, 65, 'forth fruit in our lives for the glory of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 669, 7, 65, 'Brokenness Is Key to Producing Fruit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 669, 8, 65, 'Jesus then says, “The one who falls on this stone will be broken to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 669, 9, 65, 'pieces; but on whomever it falls, it will scatter him like dust.” He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 669, 10, 65, 'now using another picture. First, it was a picture of a cornerstone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 669, 11, 65, 'which is the most important stone in that building. Now He is using a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 669, 12, 65, 'picture of a stone over which you can fall and be broken. If you do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 669, 13, 65, 'fall and become broken on that stone, that stone will fall on you and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 669, 14, 65, 'crush you like dust. When we come to the Lord, the Lord has to break us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 669, 15, 65, 'before He can use us. It is the fundamental principle in all of God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 669, 16, 65, 'dealings with man. We have to be broken before we can be used. The Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 669, 17, 65, 'took the bread and blessed it. That is the first step. Then He broke it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 669, 18, 65, 'and fed the multitude. It is not enough to be blessed. We need to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 669, 19, 65, 'broken. I see so many people who have been blessed by God and anointed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 669, 20, 65, 'with the Holy Spirit, which is a mark of God''s blessing. But because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 669, 21, 65, 'they are not broken, the multitude cannot be fed. Let it be blessed and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 669, 22, 65, 'broken. Only then can the multitudes can be fed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 669, 23, 65, 'Brokenness is a very, very important part of the Christian life. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 669, 24, 65, 'Himself arranges circumstances for us to be broken. Even Jesus needed to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 669, 25, 65, 'go this way. For 30 years, He had to live in submission to imperfect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 669, 26, 65, 'parents. Remember, Joseph and Mary were imperfect, Old Covenant parents.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 669, 27, 65, 'But He had to submit to imperfect parents so that He could be broken. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 669, 28, 65, 'is interesting to understand that even Jesus needed to be broken. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 670, 1, 65, 'says in Isaiah 53:10 that it pleased the Lord to bruise Him. It pleases');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 670, 2, 65, 'the Lord to bruise us too. You can fall up on this stone, on Christ, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 670, 3, 65, 'say, “Lord, I want to be broken. I want to be totally broken like You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 670, 4, 65, 'were.” The Lord will use circumstances and people to break you. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 670, 5, 65, 'are young, the Lord might use your parents. If you are a little older,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 670, 6, 65, 'the Lord might use elders who misunderstand you. God can use all types');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 670, 7, 65, 'of circumstances and situations in order to break you into pieces. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 670, 8, 65, 'you do not respond to that, then the stone falls on you and crushes you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 670, 9, 65, 'into nothing. It is much better to be broken. There are only two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 670, 10, 65, 'options. If you fall on this stone, you will be broken. If you are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 670, 11, 65, 'broken, then the stone will fall on you, and you will be crushed. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 670, 12, 65, 'far better to be broken, so seek for brokenness. This is what all of us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 670, 13, 65, 'need more than anything else. God seeks to reduce us to zero before He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 670, 14, 65, 'can use us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 670, 15, 65, 'When the chief priests and the Pharisees heard His parables, they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 670, 16, 65, 'understood that He was speaking about them. They were offended that He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 670, 17, 65, 'was trying to say things about them. When they sought to seize Him, they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 670, 18, 65, 'feared the multitudes because they all said that He was a prophet. Even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 670, 19, 65, 'today, when some people hear a strong, convicting word from God, they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 670, 20, 65, 'feel disturbed saying, “This preacher is trying to speak to me.” I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 670, 21, 65, 'remember once when some men came to me at the end of a message after I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 670, 22, 65, 'had preached somewhere. He said, “Brother Zac, were you preaching to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 670, 23, 65, 'me?” I said, “That is absolutely right. I was preaching to you and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 670, 24, 65, 'all the other people sitting here. I was not preaching to the pillars');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 670, 25, 65, 'and the chairs over here. I was preaching to all of you who were sitting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 670, 26, 65, 'here and listening to me.” When somebody says, “Are you preaching to me?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 670, 27, 65, 'I hope your answer is, “yes.” We are preaching to the people who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 670, 28, 65, 'sitting in front of us. We are not preaching to the walls. We are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 671, 1, 65, 'afraid of people who try to manipulate our words. God will keep us from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 671, 2, 65, 'any harm that comes through that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 671, 3, 65, 'When the chief priests understood that He was speaking about them, their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 671, 4, 65, 'anger made them want to grab Him and kill Him, but they were afraid of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 671, 5, 65, 'the people. The chief priests’ actions were often determined by what the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 671, 6, 65, 'people said. When a Christian preacher’s actions and words are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 671, 7, 65, 'determined by what people say or think, then you know he is not a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 671, 8, 65, 'servant of God. He is a servant of men.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 671, 9, 65, 'Justification by Faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 671, 10, 65, '“Jesus spoke to them again in parables, saying, ‘The kingdom of heaven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 671, 11, 65, 'may be compared to a king who gave a wedding feast for his son’”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 671, 12, 65, '(Matthew 22:1-2).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 671, 13, 65, 'This is another very interesting and important parable because Jesus is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 671, 14, 65, 'speaking about the great truth of justification by faith. This speaks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 671, 15, 65, 'about how we can be clothed with the righteousness of Christ so that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 671, 16, 65, 'can stand before God. I want to explain the meaning of this parable in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 671, 17, 65, 'nutshell before we go into it. We have two things that hinder us from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 671, 18, 65, 'being able to stand before God, not just one. It is not just the sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 671, 19, 65, 'you committed in the past. The filthy nature that we have inherited from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 671, 20, 65, 'Adam also prevents us from standing before God. In my flesh, there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 671, 21, 65, 'nothing good. How can I stand before God with that filthy flesh, even if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 671, 22, 65, 'my past sins are forgiven? My number one requirement is that all my past');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 671, 23, 65, 'sins must be forgiven. Then something needs to be done about this nature');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 671, 24, 65, 'of mine. Even if my sins are forgiven, I cannot stand before God with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 671, 25, 65, 'this filthy nature. That is why God justifies us. He clothes us with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 671, 26, 65, 'righteousness of Christ. Christ becomes our righteousness. We are placed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 671, 27, 65, 'in Christ. Christ dwells in us, and Christ Himself becomes our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 671, 28, 65, 'righteousness. In other words, we are clothed with Christ’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 672, 1, 65, 'righteousness. Then we can stand before God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 672, 2, 65, 'God does two things for us: He forgives us and justifies us. Both are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 672, 3, 65, 'necessary. Otherwise, we cannot stand before Him. First, He cleanses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 672, 4, 65, 'away of all our past sins right up to today because we confess them with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 672, 5, 65, 'the knowledge that we are sinners. Second, He clothes us with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 672, 6, 65, 'righteousness of Christ. Keep that in mind as we come to this parable.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 672, 7, 65, 'In this parable, the king sent out his slaves, which represent his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 672, 8, 65, 'prophets, to call those who were invited to the wedding feast. They were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 672, 9, 65, 'unwilling to come. This represents the nation of Israel who were the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 672, 10, 65, 'first people God invited. They did not come because of various reasons.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 672, 11, 65, 'He sent slaves again and told them to tell everybody, “I have prepared');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 672, 12, 65, 'my dinner. The oxen and fattened livestock are butchered and everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 672, 13, 65, 'is ready. We have taken so much pains to prepare this feast for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 672, 14, 65, 'wedding of my son.” In Matthew 22:5, it says that they paid no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 672, 15, 65, 'attention. They completely ignored the message of the prophets. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 672, 16, 65, 'went their own way. One went to take care of his farm. Another went to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 672, 17, 65, 'his business. The rest of them caught the slaves and mistreated them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 672, 18, 65, 'They even killed some of them. When the king heard this, he was angry.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 672, 19, 65, 'He sent his armies, destroyed those murderers, and set the city on fire.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 672, 20, 65, 'In all these parables, Jesus was trying to show how the initial people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 672, 21, 65, 'whom God called have failed, and that God is now rejecting them. From');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 672, 22, 65, 'the parable of the two sons to the parable of landowner to the parable');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 672, 23, 65, 'of the marriage feast, the initial people whom God called, the nation of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 672, 24, 65, 'Israel, were rejected. They did not respond to the invitation. So the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 672, 25, 65, 'king goes to invite others. Then he said to slaves, “The wedding is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 672, 26, 65, 'ready, but those who were invited were not worthy.” The Jewish nation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 672, 27, 65, 'was not worthy. They went after their business. The king continued, “So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 672, 28, 65, 'go into the main highways and bring in as many as you can find there to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 673, 1, 65, 'the wedding feast. There are people on the streets. There are beggars');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 673, 2, 65, 'and tramps. Go to the parks and go to the streets. Pull out everybody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 673, 3, 65, 'and ask them to come for a wedding feast.” Of course, the tramps were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 673, 4, 65, 'delighted. They thought, “The king is inviting me for a wedding feast!”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 673, 5, 65, 'Every beggar was delighted to come. In Matthew 22:10, is says, “Those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 673, 6, 65, 'slaves went out into the street and gathered together all whom they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 673, 7, 65, 'found, both evil and good.” This means they picked up good people along');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 673, 8, 65, 'with murderers and thieves, and the wedding hall was filled with dinner');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 673, 9, 65, 'guests. These people were tramps and beggars. You cannot come into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 673, 10, 65, 'feast of a king in those filthy clothes. Although it is not written');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 673, 11, 65, 'here, we can deduce that the king at the gate of the palace offered a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 673, 12, 65, 'free beautiful white robe to every single invitee because most of them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 673, 13, 65, 'were poor. He says, “I would like you to put on this robe when you go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 673, 14, 65, 'in. Then your nakedness and your filthy dress will not be seen.” The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 673, 15, 65, 'beggars whose clothes were all in rags were absolutely thrilled. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 673, 16, 65, 'said, “Hey! This is a great! I thought I would be embarrassed throughout');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 673, 17, 65, 'the feast because of my clothes. But the king has been so good! He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 673, 18, 65, 'clothed me with this garment.” And so they wore that robe and went into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 673, 19, 65, 'the feast. This robe is a picture of the garment of the righteousness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 673, 20, 65, 'One man came along who was not a tramp or a beggar, but was invited as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 673, 21, 65, 'one of the other guests. He came dressed properly, maybe in a suit and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 673, 22, 65, 'tie. He said, “I do not need your garment. I am quite ok as I am.” The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 673, 23, 65, 'king’s servants said, “No, the king has asked everybody to put on these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 673, 24, 65, 'garments.” This man said, “No, I think my dress is good enough.” He goes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 673, 25, 65, 'and sits there in that dress. When the king came to look at all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 673, 26, 65, 'dinner guest, he sees everybody in white except this one guy sitting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 673, 27, 65, 'over there who is without the wedding clothes. He asked him, “How did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 673, 28, 65, 'you get in here? How did you come in here without the wedding clothes?”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 674, 1, 65, 'He was speechless. He could not say nobody offered it to me because it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 674, 2, 65, 'was offered at the gate freely to everyone. He could not say I did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 674, 3, 65, 'have enough money to buy it because it was offered freely. What excuse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 674, 4, 65, 'could he give? Nothing. The real reason was he thought his dress was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 674, 5, 65, 'good enough. The king said, “Bind him hand and foot and cast him into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 674, 6, 65, 'the outer darkness. In that place there will be weeping and gnashing of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 674, 7, 65, 'teeth.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 674, 8, 65, 'This is a word to self-righteous people who feel that, “I am not as bad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 674, 9, 65, 'as these other sinners.” The dirty, ragged clothes on some people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 674, 10, 65, 'symbolize people who have lived in gross sin. This well-dressed man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 674, 11, 65, 'symbolizes a righteous person who probably grew up in a God-fearing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 674, 12, 65, 'family from childhood and therefore, has not committed all those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 674, 13, 65, 'terrible sins that other people have committed. In a sense, his clothes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 674, 14, 65, 'are not ragged. Like the Pharisees, we could say we fast, tithe, pray,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 674, 15, 65, 'and keep all the requirements of the law. We are pretty good as we are.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 674, 16, 65, 'We can come to God just as we are. Jesus demolishes that idea that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 674, 17, 65, 'can come to God just as they are because it says in Isaiah 64:6 that our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 674, 18, 65, 'righteousness is like filthy rags in God''s eyes. This is speaking about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 674, 19, 65, 'our righteous deeds, not our bad deeds. If bad deeds are like filthy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 674, 20, 65, 'rags, that is understandable. But Isaiah 64:6 says that all our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 674, 21, 65, 'righteousness is like filthy rags. When we bring all the good things we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 674, 22, 65, 'have done before God, it is equivalent to filthy rags. It could have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 674, 23, 65, 'been done with the wrong motive and for our own glory.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 674, 24, 65, 'What if there is a person whose hand is infected with a disease and pus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 674, 25, 65, 'is oozing out of that hand. If that person offers you a beautiful apple');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 674, 26, 65, 'in that hand, you will say, “No, thank you. I do not want it.” But he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 674, 27, 65, 'says, “It is a beautiful apple.” That is right, but the hand is infected');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 674, 28, 65, 'with pus. Therefore, the apple is good, but it becomes bad because it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 675, 1, 65, 'coming from your hand. That is how our good deeds are corrupt in God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 675, 2, 65, 'eyes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 675, 3, 65, 'It is very important to see that. We may look pretty clean like this man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 675, 4, 65, 'who felt like he was dressed very neatly and not like these other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 675, 5, 65, 'fellows living in sin. That is right, but there is filth in our nature.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 675, 6, 65, 'That corrupts even the good deeds that we do. That is why it is very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 675, 7, 65, 'difficult for those who are externally righteous to see the need of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 675, 8, 65, 'Savior. They think, “I am alright as I am. Why do I need a Savior?”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 675, 9, 65, 'Everyone needs a Savior. Romans 1 & 2 deal with two types of sinners.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 675, 10, 65, 'Romans 1 is dealing with the godless sinner. Romans 2 is dealing with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 675, 11, 65, 'the righteous sinner or the religious sinner. In Romans 3, it says that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 675, 12, 65, 'both are guilty and need to be justified and clothed with righteousness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 675, 13, 65, 'That is the practical application of this parable.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 675, 14, 65, 'The interesting thing is that this person who came with his own clothes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 675, 15, 65, 'was not just thrown out and asked to leave the palace. He was bound hand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 675, 16, 65, 'and foot and cast into outer darkness where there is weeping and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 675, 17, 65, 'gnashing of teeth (Matthew 22:13). If he had never gone to that feast,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 675, 18, 65, 'that would be one thing, but because he went there, he got thrown into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 675, 19, 65, 'outer darkness. The Lord is saying that the self-righteous people in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 675, 20, 65, 'church are the ones who are going to be thrown out. People can come into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 675, 21, 65, 'the church and sit there for many years. One day, they will be thrown');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 675, 22, 65, 'out because of self-righteousness. They look down on others who they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 675, 23, 65, 'think are not as holy as they are, and they are proud of their own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 675, 24, 65, 'righteousness. That is the message in this parable.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 675, 25, 65, 'Then Jesus concludes by saying in Matthew 22:14, “Many are called but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 675, 26, 65, 'few are chosen.” It is not that God arbitrarily chooses some out of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 675, 27, 65, 'many who are called. Not at all. There is no partiality with God. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 675, 28, 65, 'fact remains that among the many who are called, only a few are chosen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 676, 1, 65, 'because only a few respond and say, “Lord, there is nothing good in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 676, 2, 65, 'righteousness. I want all of You.” There is a very strong message that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 676, 3, 65, 'comes through in this parable. The basis on which God accepts us is that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 676, 4, 65, 'we acknowledge not only that we have sinned, but also that we have no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 676, 5, 65, 'righteousness in ourselves, and that Christ Himself is our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 676, 6, 65, 'righteousness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 676, 7, 66, 'Chapter 65 His Word, His Power, and His Wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 676, 8, 66, 'Our Righteousness Is Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 676, 9, 66, 'In Matthew 22:1-14, Jesus teaches a parable in which a man without a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 676, 10, 66, 'wedding robe is cast out. It is very, very important to understand that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 676, 11, 66, 'the only way we can stand before God is if we are clothed in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 676, 12, 66, 'righteousness of Christ. It is not enough to just have our sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 676, 13, 66, 'forgiven. That is why we need to be forgiven and justified. Many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 676, 14, 66, 'Christians do not see the difference between these two. Forgiveness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 676, 15, 66, 'deals with our past sins, which are blotted out through the blood of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 676, 16, 66, 'Christ through His death on the cross. But to stand before God, I still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 676, 17, 66, 'need to have my sinful nature covered by the righteousness of Christ. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 676, 18, 66, 'other words, Christ’s righteousness needs to be put to my account, or I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 676, 19, 66, 'need to be clothed with Christ’s righteousness, in order for me to stand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 676, 20, 66, 'before God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 676, 21, 66, 'This is what it means to be “in Christ” or “Christ in me” or “Christ, my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 676, 22, 66, 'righteousness.” This humbles the upright. We must remember throughout');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 676, 23, 66, 'our lives that Christ alone is our righteousness. I can never, in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 676, 24, 66, 'earthly life or even in heaven, stand before God on the basis of my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 676, 25, 66, 'righteousness. God imparts His righteousness to us little by little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 676, 26, 66, 'throughout our earthly life - that is a progressive sanctification - but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 676, 27, 66, 'throughout our lives, we need to stand before God only in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 676, 28, 66, 'righteousness of Christ. Our own righteousness is like filthy rags. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 677, 1, 66, 'once we are clothed in the righteousness of Christ, we need to surrender');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 677, 2, 66, 'to the Holy Spirit, seek to walk in God''s will, and deny our own will.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 677, 3, 66, 'Then as we become more and more sanctified, our righteousness, which was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 677, 4, 66, 'once like filthy rags, will become our sparkling wedding garment on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 677, 5, 66, 'final day (Revelation 19:8).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 677, 6, 66, 'This is what the Bible teaches about human righteousness and about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 677, 7, 66, 'Christ''s righteousness. This is how we can have our own life transformed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 677, 8, 66, 'by the power of the Holy Spirit so that we partake in God''s nature and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 677, 9, 66, 'bring forth a righteousness that is acceptable before God. This is an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 677, 10, 66, 'amazing truth. I would encourage you to read this section and understand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 677, 11, 66, 'it thoroughly so that we never boast before God as if we are standing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 677, 12, 66, 'before God on the basis of something we have done or accomplished.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 677, 13, 66, 'The Humble Are Chosen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 677, 14, 66, 'Matthew 22:14 says, “Many are called but few are chosen.” This means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 677, 15, 66, 'that God invites everybody, but very few seem to be willing to accept');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 677, 16, 66, 'the righteousness that Christ gives and to stand only on the basis of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 677, 17, 66, 'that. What would be the mark of someone who stands on the basis of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 677, 18, 66, 'Christ''s righteousness alone? What is the mark of someone that had a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 677, 19, 66, 'secret trust in their own righteousness? I think it is very easy to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 677, 20, 66, 'know. Do you look down other believers? Do you feel that you are more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 677, 21, 66, 'accepted by God than other believers because of your holiness or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 677, 22, 66, 'righteousness? Do you feel more accepted by God because you did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 677, 23, 66, 'commit such gross sins as the other people? Then you are definitely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 677, 24, 66, 'standing on your own righteousness. Think of these beggars who came to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 677, 25, 66, 'the wedding with different degrees of dirt, filth, and torn clothes. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 677, 26, 66, 'once they put the wedding garment on at the feast, then they are all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 677, 27, 66, 'same.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 677, 28, 66, 'In the story in Matthew 22:14, a free wedding garment was given to them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 678, 1, 66, 'at the gate to cover their filthy robes and rags. When they put that on,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 678, 2, 66, 'what''s underneath is not visible, and so when they look at each other,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 678, 3, 66, 'they''re all exactly the same. The one who''s been a believer for 50 years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 678, 4, 66, 'and the one who came to the Lord today are accepted on the same basis.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 678, 5, 66, 'The one who has been sitting at the wedding feast for 50 years is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 678, 6, 66, 'accepted on the basis of the white garment that he''s accepted and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 678, 7, 66, 'other one who just came in this morning, he is accepted on the basis of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 678, 8, 66, 'the white garment. They are equal. This is the problem today, like in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 678, 9, 66, 'the story of the laborers, that the people who came in first say, as the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 678, 10, 66, 'laborers who came in the first hour said in Matthew 20:12, “You have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 678, 11, 66, 'made these last fellows equal to us.” Many Christians don''t like other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 678, 12, 66, 'people being made equal to them who they feel are junior.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 678, 13, 66, 'This is one of the great sins in Christendom. We find in many churches');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 678, 14, 66, 'people thinking, ‘I''m a senior worker, so I must have more respect,’ but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 678, 15, 66, 'the seniority is in government service and not in the church. In the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 678, 16, 66, 'church it''s a question of who is more spiritual, not who''s more senior.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 678, 17, 66, 'Not who''s been in the church longer, but who has grown in grace and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 678, 18, 66, 'become more spiritual and has been gripped by the truth of God. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 678, 19, 66, 'the test. It''s very important for us to understand this right at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 678, 20, 66, 'beginning, and that''s why it says, “Many are called but few are chosen.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 678, 21, 66, 'The ones who are chosen are the ones who remain humble. Humility is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 678, 22, 66, 'great secret here.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 678, 23, 66, 'Do Not Be Trapped by Men');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 678, 24, 66, '“Then the Pharisees went and counselled together how they might trap Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 678, 25, 66, 'in what He said” (Matthew 22:15). This happens again and again in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 678, 26, 66, 'Gospel of Matthew - the religious people are always trying to trip up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 678, 27, 66, 'Christ in some way, trying to catch Him in some word or some sentence He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 678, 28, 66, 'said. It is exactly like a lot of religious people today who don''t like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 679, 1, 66, 'preachers who preach holiness, victory over sin, building the body of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 679, 2, 66, 'Christ, and freedom from the love of money. They’re always trying to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 679, 3, 66, 'trap them in some way, but God doesn’t allow them to trap His servants.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 679, 4, 66, 'They sent their disciples to Him along with the Herodians, and they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 679, 5, 66, 'wanted to trap Him into saying something which would bring the wrath of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 679, 6, 66, 'the government upon Christ. That''s also a trick that a lot of religious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 679, 7, 66, 'Christians try today on fellow Christians. ’If we can get the government');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 679, 8, 66, 'itself to turn against this group which we don''t like, that would be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 679, 9, 66, 'great. Then we don''t have to deal with them, the government will deal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 679, 10, 66, 'with them.’ And so they came very subtly asking Him a question about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 679, 11, 66, 'taxes and, of course, they start with their usual, hypocritical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 679, 12, 66, 'flattery. They didn’t believe in one word of it, but they said “Teacher,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 679, 13, 66, 'we know You are truthful and teach the way of God in truth, and You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 679, 14, 66, 'defer to no one; You are not partial to anyone” (Matthew 22:16). Be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 679, 15, 66, 'careful whenever anybody comes and praises you like that. People who use');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 679, 16, 66, 'language like, “You''re the greatest man of God, etc.” can be some of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 679, 17, 66, 'your biggest enemies. So be careful. They say, “Teacher, we know You''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 679, 18, 66, 'truthful and that You teach the way of God in truth and defer to no one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 679, 19, 66, 'and You are not partial to anyone” and they think that by that, they can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 679, 20, 66, 'soften up the ground and get Jesus to reply to them, but Jesus can see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 679, 21, 66, 'through all that. If you''re a servant of God, you need to see through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 679, 22, 66, 'the flattery of other people as well, otherwise you will get trapped.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 679, 23, 66, '“So tell us, therefore, what do you think, is it lawful to give a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 679, 24, 66, 'poll-tax to Caesar?” That''s what they wanted to ask. What is the need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 679, 25, 66, 'for all that introductory flattery? That was to try and get Jesus to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 679, 26, 66, 'become weak so that He''d give up a foolish answer, but the Lord was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 679, 27, 66, 'interested in the praise of men. They didn''t realize that Christ was so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 679, 28, 66, 'far above all this flattery and empty praise, He wouldn''t care less;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 680, 1, 66, 'even if it is genuine praise would have never affected Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 680, 2, 66, 'That''s how we must be: free from the opinions of men. Yes, people want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 680, 3, 66, 'to appreciate us and are thankful to us for what we’ve done for them -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 680, 4, 66, 'that''s great! We don''t stop them, and we don’t tell them to keep quiet.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 680, 5, 66, 'It''s the right thing for people to express appreciation and thankfulness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 680, 6, 66, 'to a servant of God, for the benefit they''ve received from him. But we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 680, 7, 66, 'must be careful that that doesn’t go to our heads. We just pass it on to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 680, 8, 66, 'the God and say, “All the glory belongs to God” and move on, otherwise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 680, 9, 66, 'we''ll get trapped.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 680, 10, 66, 'God Can Give You Wisdom in All Situations');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 680, 11, 66, '“Tell us, therefore, what do you think? Is it lawful to give poll-tax to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 680, 12, 66, 'Caesar or not?” And you know that whatever He says He''s going to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 680, 13, 66, 'caught. If He says, “No,” the government can catch Him and say to Him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 680, 14, 66, '“Hey, You''re telling people not to pay their taxes.” If He says, “Yes,”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 680, 15, 66, 'they can get the Jews to say, “Hey, this guy is telling us to serve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 680, 16, 66, 'these Roman rulers who are ruling over our country” and get one group or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 680, 17, 66, 'the other against this preacher. These people are playing politics. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 680, 18, 66, 'an interesting word: “He perceived their wickedness.” There was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 680, 19, 66, 'wickedness there.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 680, 20, 66, 'Can you imagine there is wickedness in people who say, “Oh, we know that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 680, 21, 66, 'you''re truthful and teach the way of God in truth, defer to no one,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 680, 22, 66, 'you’re partial to no one.” Can you see wickedness in those statements?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 680, 23, 66, 'That shows Jesus had discernment, and that''s what we need. He perceived');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 680, 24, 66, 'their wickedness and their malice, and so He said, “Why are you testing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 680, 25, 66, 'me, you hypocrites?” He was straight with them and there was no question');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 680, 26, 66, 'of beating around the bush in Jesus’ words.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 680, 27, 66, '“Show me the coin used for the poll tax” and they brought Him a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 680, 28, 66, 'denarius. “Here it is, this is what we pay as poll tax.” He sees them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 681, 1, 66, 'and says, “Whose likeness and inscription is on this?” They said to Him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 681, 2, 66, '“That’s Caesar’s.” “Well, then give to Caesar what is Caesar’s; and give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 681, 3, 66, 'to God the things that are God’s.” They marveled at that answer. What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 681, 4, 66, 'could they say to that? The government could not catch Him for saying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 681, 5, 66, 'that because He said, “Give to Caesar what is Caesar''s” and the Jews');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 681, 6, 66, 'could not catch him for that because He said, “We must give to God what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 681, 7, 66, 'is God''s. You decide what is Caesar’s and what is God’s.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 681, 8, 66, 'If we trust in God and say, “Father, I want to walk on earth like Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 681, 9, 66, 'walked. I want to have a word ready for everybody who comes and asks me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 681, 10, 66, 'a question,” I want to tell you, in Jesus’ name, that the Father will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 681, 11, 66, 'give you the same ability that Jesus had to be able to answer questions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 681, 12, 66, 'like this when people come to you with difficult questions. He will give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 681, 13, 66, 'us the same ability that He gave to Jesus Christ. Let me show you a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 681, 14, 66, 'promise in Luke 21:15: The Lord says, “I will give you utterance and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 681, 15, 66, 'wisdom which none of your opponents will be able to resist or refute.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 681, 16, 66, 'I have claimed that promise numerous times when I''ve had to reply to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 681, 17, 66, 'people who seek to attack me in one way or the other. I said, “Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 681, 18, 66, 'give me a mouth and the wisdom which will shut their mouths,” and again');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 681, 19, 66, 'and again and again, God has done that. You can’t get it if you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 681, 20, 66, 'ask for it. You don''t have because you don''t ask. You don’t ask for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 681, 21, 66, 'wisdom, so you don''t get it, or you ask and you don''t believe God will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 681, 22, 66, 'give it to you. But if you ask and you believe God will give it to you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 681, 23, 66, 'James 1 says, “He will give you as much wisdom as you want,” but if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 681, 24, 66, 'ask and you don''t believe, “let that man not think that he will receive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 681, 25, 66, 'anything from the Lord.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 681, 26, 66, 'We can have the same wisdom as Jesus had to answer people accordingly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 681, 27, 66, 'when they try to trap us somewhere or humble us somewhere by their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 681, 28, 66, 'religiosity. I remember once, I was in a meeting somewhere with a group');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 682, 1, 66, 'in the United States where everybody wore beards, all in that particular');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 682, 2, 66, 'group (there is one particular verse that says every man must have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 682, 3, 66, 'beard). I said, “I''ve got no objection to that. Everybody''s can have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 682, 4, 66, 'their own convictions on these matters.” But, I was speaking in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 682, 5, 66, 'church in a whole-day conference and during the lunch session, we were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 682, 6, 66, 'sitting at the table and I was the only man without a beard. All the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 682, 7, 66, 'others were there with beards, and some of them had not liked what I had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 682, 8, 66, 'taught in the morning session there because it was contrary to a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 682, 9, 66, 'doctrines they believed in. And one man sitting there in front of me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 682, 10, 66, 'wanted to humiliate me in the presence of all the others and so, within');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 682, 11, 66, 'the hearing of the others while we were having our meal, he asked me a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 682, 12, 66, 'question: “Brother Zac, did God make a mistake in giving you hair on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 682, 13, 66, 'your face or did you make a mistake in cutting it off or shaving it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 682, 14, 66, 'off?” And I quickly, inwardly, said, “Lord, I’ve got to get an answer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 682, 15, 66, 'for this. You’ve got to give me a mouth and wisdom now.” And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 682, 16, 66, 'immediately, God gave me a word and I said to him, “Brother, did God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 682, 17, 66, 'make a mistake in giving you nails in your fingers, or did you make a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 682, 18, 66, 'mistake in trimming them and cutting them off?” Silence, just like here.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 682, 19, 66, 'What could he say? It was a ridiculous question he asked me, so I gave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 682, 20, 66, 'him a ridiculous answer. This is not the only occasion when I have found');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 682, 21, 66, 'God has given me a right answer to people, because I had asked for it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 682, 22, 66, 'and I believed God would give it to me. I mention that in order to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 682, 23, 66, 'encourage you. Of course, when I discovered that he was embarrassed and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 682, 24, 66, 'the tables were turned on him, I immediately changed the subject so that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 682, 25, 66, 'I would not embarrass him any further. I began to talk about something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 682, 26, 66, 'else so that he didn''t feel awkward because of me, because I didn''t want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 682, 27, 66, 'to lose him as a friend, and there was a lot of blessing in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 682, 28, 66, 'afternoon session after that. So I want to encourage you that by that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 683, 1, 66, 'testimony. God can give you wisdom in all types of situations when you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 683, 2, 66, 'find people are trying to trap you in something.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 683, 3, 66, 'His Word and His Power');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 683, 4, 66, '“And hearing this they marveled and left Him and went their way. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 683, 5, 66, 'then another group came.” The Pharisees and the Sadducees were always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 683, 6, 66, 'after Jesus (the Sadducees are the people who say there''s no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 683, 7, 66, 'resurrection). The Pharisees are a picture of the fundamentalists and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 683, 8, 66, 'evangelicals who believe all the right doctrines, and the Sadducees are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 683, 9, 66, 'picture of the liberals who called themselves Christians, like they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 683, 10, 66, 'called them “Jews.” They didn’t believe in the resurrection just like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 683, 11, 66, 'liberal Christians today don''t believe in miracles, etc.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 683, 12, 66, 'On that day, some Sadducees who say there''s no resurrection came to Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 683, 13, 66, 'and questioned Him. They said, “Teacher, Moses said that if a man dies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 683, 14, 66, 'and he has no children, his brother as next-of-kin shall marry his wife');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 683, 15, 66, 'and raise up an offspring to his brother” and then they tell this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 683, 16, 66, 'unimaginable, fictitious story: “There were seven brothers they say with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 683, 17, 66, 'us and the first married and died and had no offspring. He left his wife');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 683, 18, 66, 'to his brother and like that, the second and the third down to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 683, 19, 66, 'seventh all died.” Now, this obviously is fiction, but they spoke as if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 683, 20, 66, 'it actually happened. “Then the woman also died. Now, in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 683, 21, 66, 'resurrection, therefore, whose wife of the seven will she be, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 683, 22, 66, 'they all had her?” And Jesus answered them, “You are mistaken because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 683, 23, 66, 'you don''t understand the Scriptures and you don''t know the power of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 683, 24, 66, 'God.” There are two things we need: understanding of the Scriptures and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 683, 25, 66, 'the power of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 683, 26, 66, 'This is a beautiful verse (Matthew 22:29), and before we look at Jesus’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 683, 27, 66, 'answer to this question, look at Jesus’ rebuke to them. He says, “Your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 683, 28, 66, 'problem is that you don''t know God''s Word and you don''t have His power.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 684, 1, 66, 'Do you know the two things we need in our life to serve God and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 684, 2, 66, 'understand His ways? We need to know the Word of God and we need the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 684, 3, 66, 'mighty power of the Holy Spirit. One alone will not do. It’s like if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 684, 4, 66, 'want a railway engine to move from one station to another, there are two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 684, 5, 66, 'things that it requires: one is the rails and the other is power from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 684, 6, 66, 'steam or diesel or whichever engine. If you have only one of these, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 684, 7, 66, 'can’t move from one place to another. Which is more important? The rails');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 684, 8, 66, 'or the power? Well, you need both, and we find in Christendom, there are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 684, 9, 66, 'different emphases. Some groups concentrate on the rails - their only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 684, 10, 66, 'interest is the Word of God, and every Sunday, they come and keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 684, 11, 66, 'polishing the rails, but the engine is not moving because they don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 684, 12, 66, 'have any steam. But they look down on others who ignore the rails. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 684, 13, 66, 'say, “The rails are very important.” Then at the other extreme, you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 684, 14, 66, 'certain other people who say, “Well, the steam is very important. What’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 684, 15, 66, 'is the use of having an engine without any steam?” And so they fill it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 684, 16, 66, 'up with steam, but they say, “Rails are not important” and the result is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 684, 17, 66, 'that they drive off in any direction, derail over time, and get stuck in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 684, 18, 66, 'the mud. They''re also stuck just like the other group. The other group');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 684, 19, 66, 'is stuck because they didn''t have steam; this group is stuck in the mud');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 684, 20, 66, 'because it ignored the rails and went off the rails. But the second');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 684, 21, 66, 'group, because it has steam, can blow the whistle and make a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 684, 22, 66, 'noise in their meetings. They make a lot of noise, but they are in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 684, 23, 66, 'ditch as well. Both don''t move forward. You see them ten years later,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 684, 24, 66, 'the people in these churches, and there''s no spiritual growth. You see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 684, 25, 66, 'they''ve not become holier, they’ve not got a greater understanding of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 684, 26, 66, 'God, they’re just pulling the whistle and blowing the steam, and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 684, 27, 66, 'other group is polishing the rails every Sunday. Is this Christianity?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 684, 28, 66, 'It''s important to emphasize both, and not either or. We need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 685, 1, 66, 'understand the Scriptures and we need to experience the power of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 685, 2, 66, 'It''s a beautiful verse. We need to know God''s Word and we need to have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 685, 3, 66, 'the power of the Holy Spirit. The devil tries to make us concentrate on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 685, 4, 66, 'one or the other and miss out on what God wants us to have.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 685, 5, 66, 'After rebuking them, then He answers their question. “In the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 685, 6, 66, 'resurrection, they’re not given in marriage, but they are like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 685, 7, 66, 'angels in heaven. There''s no sex there to produce children and to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 685, 8, 66, 'married. No, in the resurrection of the dead haven''t you heard what was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 685, 9, 66, 'spoken to you by God saying, ‘I am the God of Abraham, the God of Isaac,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 685, 10, 66, 'and the God of Jacob.’ He is not the God of the dead but of the living.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 685, 11, 66, 'When He says “I''m the God of Abraham Isaac and Jacob,” He is not talking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 685, 12, 66, 'about dead people; He''s talking about people who are still living in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 685, 13, 66, 'heaven, and that''s what Jesus said. Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob are living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 685, 14, 66, 'in Heaven - not in their bodies, as their bodies were on earth - but in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 685, 15, 66, 'the spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 685, 16, 66, '“And when the multitudes heard this, they were astonished at His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 685, 17, 66, 'teaching.” In everything Jesus says, there is a lesson to learn. For');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 685, 18, 66, 'example, in the earlier point that we considered where Jesus said in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 685, 19, 66, 'verse 21, “Render to Caesar the things that are Caesar''s and God that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 685, 20, 66, 'the things that are God’s,” it was an answer directly from God. But it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 685, 21, 66, 'does more than just answer and silence those people. There is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 685, 22, 66, 'principle we can learn as well, which is that before we give to God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 685, 23, 66, 'anything, we must give to Caesar what is his. What does that mean? That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 685, 24, 66, 'means that if you have borrowed money from somebody (take Caesar as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 685, 25, 66, 'representing a human being), you owe them money and you haven''t paid him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 685, 26, 66, 'back. God says, “Don''t give me that; don’t put money in My offering box');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 685, 27, 66, 'because you''re putting his money into My box that should righteously go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 685, 28, 66, 'to him. You''re putting in My offering box, so I don''t want that guy''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 686, 1, 66, 'money. You go and give him that his money, and then give me what''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 686, 2, 66, 'yours. If you want to put something in offering box, put your money, not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 686, 3, 66, 'his.” Do you understand that when you''re in debt, what you''re giving to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 686, 4, 66, 'God is somebody else''s money? I''m not talking about where you''re paying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 686, 5, 66, 'a monthly mortgage on your house or your car or something like that,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 686, 6, 66, 'which is a fixed amount that you give and the rest of the money is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 686, 7, 66, 'yours. In that case, you can give to God, and that''s okay. Rather, I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 686, 8, 66, 'talking about where you borrowed from some human being and you haven''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 686, 9, 66, 'given back. Or you cheated the government of some taxes and you haven’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 686, 10, 66, 'repaid it. Then, what you''re giving to God is somebody else''s money - it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 686, 11, 66, 'is Caesar’s. The Lord says whom you should you put first: Caesar, then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 686, 12, 66, 'put God after. That means don''t give God somebody else''s money. It''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 686, 13, 66, 'very simple principle and we must remember that that God doesn''t want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 686, 14, 66, 'what belongs to somebody else. That''s why it''s so important to be free');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 686, 15, 66, 'from debt. The same way, here, you see in this statement, what an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 686, 16, 66, 'important principle it is. You must know the Scriptures and you must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 686, 17, 66, 'know the power of God. There is such a depth of meaning in these replies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 686, 18, 66, 'that the Lord gave, if you meditate on them. There''s more than one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 686, 19, 66, 'meaning in a single verse of Scripture.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 686, 20, 66, 'The Great Commandment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 686, 21, 66, 'When the Pharisees heard that He had put the Sadducees to silence, they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 686, 22, 66, 'gathered themselves together and said, “Hey, we’ve got to trap Him in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 686, 23, 66, 'some other way.” They were always out to trap Jesus. When the Sadducees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 686, 24, 66, 'were silent, they said, “Okay, let''s get somebody else now. Then a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 686, 25, 66, 'lawyer came up (in those days this was somebody who really studied the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 686, 26, 66, 'law) and he asked Him a question saying, “Teacher, by the way, which is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 686, 27, 66, 'the great commandment in the law?” For the Jews, the Great Commandment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 686, 28, 66, 'was keeping the Sabbath. That means you don''t get anybody to heal on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 687, 1, 66, 'Sabbath day and you don''t allow a man to carry his bed on the Sabbath');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 687, 2, 66, 'day. He also said, “Of course, you pull out your sheep from the ditch on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 687, 3, 66, 'the Sabbath day if it falls there,” but they wanted to see what He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 687, 4, 66, 'going to say thinking, ‘Are You going to say Sabbath or something else?’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 687, 5, 66, 'And Jesus said, “The great commandment in the law is you should love the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 687, 6, 66, 'Lord your God with all your heart, soul, and mind.” That''s the great and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 687, 7, 66, 'foremost commandment. The second is to love your neighbor as yourself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 687, 8, 66, 'These are like two arms of the cross: love God with all your heart, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 687, 9, 66, 'vertical arm; love your neighbor as yourself, the horizontal arm. That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 687, 10, 66, 'the cross and you can’t separate it. It’s not just loving God, it’s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 687, 11, 66, 'just loving your neighbor and it’s not loving your neighbor first. Those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 687, 12, 66, 'who think social work is the most important thing to do are setting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 687, 13, 66, 'loving their neighbor up as the first commandment. And those who just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 687, 14, 66, 'sit in a monastery and just say, “I''m just going to talk to God all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 687, 15, 66, 'time,” are also wrong. You’ve got to love God and love your neighbor,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 687, 16, 66, 'and loving God comes first.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 687, 17, 66, '“On these two commandments depend the whole law and the prophets”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 687, 18, 66, '(Matthew 22:40). Everything in the Bible is summed up in two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 687, 19, 66, 'commandments. It’s wonderful to know that. Every commandment in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 687, 20, 66, 'Bible can be put in a nutshell in these two commandments: “Love God with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 687, 21, 66, 'all your heart, soul, and strength, and love others as yourself.” What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 687, 22, 66, 'does it mean to love the Lord your God with all your heart, soul, mind?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 687, 23, 66, 'I’ve got to love God with my mind. My mind is important. I got to love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 687, 24, 66, 'God with my heart. My love and affection for God is important. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 687, 25, 66, 'said, “if you love Me, keep My commandments.” That means with all my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 687, 26, 66, 'strength, I''ve got to do God''s will. This is what it means to love God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 687, 27, 66, 'and if I love God, I will love my fellow believers. “If somebody says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 687, 28, 66, 'that he loves God, but he can’t love his fellow believer, he''s a liar,”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 688, 1, 66, 'John says. So let''s keep this in mind.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 688, 2, 67, 'Chapter 66 Marks of a Pharisee – Part I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 688, 3, 67, 'God Has Answers for Every Question');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 688, 4, 67, 'It’s very interesting to go through Matthew''s Gospel keeping in mind and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 688, 5, 67, 'understanding what Jesus taught, so that we can learn what to do in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 688, 6, 67, 'life. We learn from His words, His life, His actions, and from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 688, 7, 67, 'circumstances through which He took His disciples. We also learn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 688, 8, 67, 'something from the way He dealt with difficult circumstances and the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 688, 9, 67, 'He answered questions. His dependence upon God, the Father, for a right');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 688, 10, 67, 'answer without going into complicated reasoning. So often, when people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 688, 11, 67, 'ask us questions, we go into so many complicated reasoning’s to give an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 688, 12, 67, 'answer. Jesus, very often, answered with a brief story or a brief');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 688, 13, 67, 'answer, and that is the best way to answer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 688, 14, 67, 'In Matthew 22:41, the Pharisees were gathered together, and after they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 688, 15, 67, 'had asked Jesus so many questions, He asked them a question. “What do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 688, 16, 67, 'you think about the Christ? Whose Son is He?” Christ is another word for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 688, 17, 67, 'the Messiah, whom the Jews were expecting to come. Knowing the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 688, 18, 67, 'Scriptures, they said, “He is the Son of David.” Then He said to them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 688, 19, 67, '“Why then does David, in the Spirit, call Him Lord, when he says, ‘The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 688, 20, 67, 'Lord said to my Lord, “Sit at My right hand, until I put thine enemies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 688, 21, 67, 'beneath thy feet”’ (Psalm 110:1)? If David calls Him Lord, how is He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 688, 22, 67, 'then his Son?” They didn''t know. They couldn''t answer that. They were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 688, 23, 67, 'confused, and from that day onwards, no one dared to ask Him another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 688, 24, 67, 'question. He silenced them forever.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 688, 25, 67, 'God has an answer to every question, and the more we are in touch with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 688, 26, 67, 'God, the more we will know the answers. I remember in my early Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 688, 27, 67, 'life and soon after, I was born-again but I did not know the answers to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 688, 28, 67, 'many things in the Scriptures. But today I know a lot more. Not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 689, 1, 67, 'everything, but a lot more as I have studied the Bible. And I’ve not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 689, 2, 67, 'only studied it, I’ve also sought to live before God and to know God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 689, 3, 67, 'better. The Word of God has become clearer, and I know the answer to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 689, 4, 67, 'many, many things that puzzled me in my younger days. There''s absolutely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 689, 5, 67, 'no contradiction in God’s Word. I can tell you that after 53 years of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 689, 6, 67, 'studying it. There is no contradiction. If you think you see a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 689, 7, 67, 'contradiction, it’s because you haven''t understood God’s word properly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 689, 8, 67, 'There is an answer for everything that appears to be a contradiction in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 689, 9, 67, 'Scripture, and there''s an answer in Scripture for every one of life''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 689, 10, 67, 'problems. I can’t say I’ve found all the answers, but I’ve found many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 689, 11, 67, 'which I didn''t have 50 years ago. So, don''t reject something just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 689, 12, 67, 'because you don''t know the answer. Be humble enough to say, “I’m not yet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 689, 13, 67, 'mature enough to know the answer for that.” You know, it''s like a child');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 689, 14, 67, 'studying mathematics in school in the second standard. It doesn''t know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 689, 15, 67, 'algebra or geometry yet, and it may think that algebra and geometry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 689, 16, 67, 'don’t make any sense. The child knows that 2+2=4 and 2*3=6, but algebra');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 689, 17, 67, 'and geometry are rubbish as far as he’s concerned. That''s what he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 689, 18, 67, 'sincerely thinks, because he’s only in the second standard. When he gets');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 689, 19, 67, 'up to the eighth standard, he has studied algebra and geometry quite a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 689, 20, 67, 'bit and they make sense to him. But, then he says at that stage, “What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 689, 21, 67, 'is all this calculus, differential calculus, and integral calculus? It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 689, 22, 67, 'all rubbish.” Once he gets to the eleventh or twelfth standard, he’ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 689, 23, 67, 'understand those.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 689, 24, 67, 'If you think anything in the Bible is absolute rubbish, give it four or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 689, 25, 67, 'five years, and if you walk with the Lord, you’ll discover the truth of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 689, 26, 67, 'it. It''s good, when we are young, to be humble enough to say, “I don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 689, 27, 67, 'know. My spiritual understanding has not yet grown to the level where I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 689, 28, 67, 'can understand that, but there must be some truth in it.” I’m talking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 690, 1, 67, 'about when you go to Scripture, and you find something you can’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 690, 2, 67, 'understand, or you find something that looks like a contradiction. Don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 690, 3, 67, 'be so arrogant as to think that it is a contradiction just because you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 690, 4, 67, 'can’t explain it. It seems like a contradiction because you''re immature.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 690, 5, 67, 'You are in the kindergarten class, perhaps. No wonder you can’t explain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 690, 6, 67, 'it. Someone else who is more mature and has walked with God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 690, 7, 67, 'progressed in the Christian life understands it very clearly, but proud');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 690, 8, 67, 'people can never accept that person’s answer. They think, “If I’m smart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 690, 9, 67, 'and I have the intelligence to understand math, science, physics, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 690, 10, 67, 'things like that, I’m sure that I can understand the Bible.” No. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 690, 11, 67, 'hides these things from the clever and intelligent and reveals them to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 690, 12, 67, 'humble people. Please remember that. Once you understand that, Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 690, 13, 67, 'will silence you just like He silenced all the Pharisees.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 690, 14, 67, 'Matthew 23:1 says, “Then Jesus spoke to the multitudes and to His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 690, 15, 67, 'disciples, and He said, ‘The scribes and the Pharisees have seated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 690, 16, 67, 'themselves in the chair of Moses; therefore all that they tell you, do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 690, 17, 67, 'and observe, but do not do according to their deeds; for they say things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 690, 18, 67, 'and do not do them.” This is the definition of a hypocrite. He preaches');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 690, 19, 67, 'things that he does not practice and says things but doesn’t do them. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 690, 20, 67, 'teaches but he doesn''t do. This is the opposite of Acts 1:1, where we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 690, 21, 67, 'read about Jesus, “He did and taught”. Compare Matthew 23:3, which says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 690, 22, 67, '“they teach but do not do,” with Acts 1:1 which says, “Jesus did and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 690, 23, 67, 'then taught.” A lot of us are in one of these two categories. If you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 690, 24, 67, 'a Christian, you either preach a lot of things you don''t practice, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 690, 25, 67, 'you first practice something and then preach it. In one case, you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 690, 26, 67, 'just a Pharisee and in the other case, you''re following Christ. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 690, 27, 67, 'descendants of the Pharisees spiritually are common in the church today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 690, 28, 67, 'There are lots of them, even millions of them who preach a lot of things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 691, 1, 67, 'on the pulpit, but they don’t practice what they preach in their lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 691, 2, 67, 'There are very few people who are following Christ, who first do and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 691, 3, 67, 'then teach, who have decided that they''ll never teach what they haven''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 691, 4, 67, 'done or what they''re not aspiring to do and accomplish.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 691, 5, 67, 'Two Good Things in Pharisees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 691, 6, 67, 'The other thing I wanted you to notice here is that the Pharisees had a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 691, 7, 67, 'couple of good qualities. Not everything was wrong with the Pharisees.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 691, 8, 67, 'There were some good qualities in them. The first thing Jesus said is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 691, 9, 67, 'everything that they tell you to do, do. Jesus wouldn''t say that about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 691, 10, 67, 'the Jehovah’s witnesses or Seventh day Adventists or the Roman');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 691, 11, 67, 'Catholics. He wouldn’t say everything they teach is correct, so you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 691, 12, 67, 'do it. It''s not correct to teach that keeping the Sabbath is a way of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 691, 13, 67, 'salvation. To teach that Jesus Christ is not God as Jehovah’s witnesses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 691, 14, 67, 'say is not correct. To teach that Mary is a mediator between God and man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 691, 15, 67, 'is also not correct. So Jesus will never say about these groups that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 691, 16, 67, 'should do whatever they say. He would not say that about the liberal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 691, 17, 67, 'Christians either, but He would say that about evangelical Christians.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 691, 18, 67, 'They''ve got the right doctrine, but they could be Pharisees, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 691, 19, 67, 'Pharisees had right doctrine as well. That’s the first good quality');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 691, 20, 67, 'Jesus saw in them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 691, 21, 67, 'The second good quality He mentions is in verse 25. He says, “You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 691, 22, 67, 'Scribes and Pharisees clean the outside of the cup, but the inside is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 691, 23, 67, 'full of robbery and self-indulgence.” So this was hypocrisy. The inside');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 691, 24, 67, 'is dirty, but the outside is clean. You have to give credit to them for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 691, 25, 67, 'cleaning their outside. Here was the certificate that Jesus gave: Your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 691, 26, 67, 'external life is good, you keep the law, and you do everything the law');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 691, 27, 67, 'commands on the outside.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 691, 28, 67, 'These are the two good qualities about the Pharisees that Jesus Himself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 692, 1, 67, 'gave a certificate about. First, their doctrines were all correct');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 692, 2, 67, '(Matthew 23:3) and second, their external life was clean and upright');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 692, 3, 67, '(Matthew 23:25). Most Christians that I have met, even evangelical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 692, 4, 67, 'Christians, glory in these two things. Their doctrines are all correct');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 692, 5, 67, 'and their external life is clean. That qualifies you to be a Pharisee,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 692, 6, 67, 'the group to whom Jesus said, “You snakes, you generation of vipers, how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 692, 7, 67, 'will you escape the damnation of hell?” (Matthew 23:33). Would you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 692, 8, 67, 'believe it if Jesus came into an evangelical church and said that to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 692, 9, 67, 'evangelical Christians, who have got all their doctrines right and whose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 692, 10, 67, 'external life is clean? Have you understood Scripture? What did Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 692, 11, 67, 'look for? The inner life. Is your inner life clean? The inside of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 692, 12, 67, 'cup, is that clean? That''s what the Lord was looking for then, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 692, 13, 67, 'that''s what the Lord is looking for today. So let''s stop gloating about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 692, 14, 67, 'the fact that our doctrines are right and our external lives are clean.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 692, 15, 67, 'Those are essential. We may not be like the Sadducees who are like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 692, 16, 67, 'liberal Christians, but we are like the Pharisees. We’re not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 692, 17, 67, 'Christ-like, we''re not true Christians, if we don''t take care of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 692, 18, 67, 'inner lives. That''s the difference between a Pharisee and a Christian. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 692, 19, 67, 'Christian has his doctrines right and his external life is clean, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 692, 20, 67, 'the inside of his cup is also clean. That''s the big difference. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 692, 21, 67, 'how you distinguish between a Pharisees and a true disciple of Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 692, 22, 67, 'And you can ask yourself which you are.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 692, 23, 67, 'A Key Mark of a Legalist');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 692, 24, 67, 'In Matthew 23:3, we see a mark of legalistic people. There are millions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 692, 25, 67, 'of legalistic preachers in the world. Matthew 23:4 says, “They tie up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 692, 26, 67, 'heavy loads and lay them on men’s shoulders, but they themselves are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 692, 27, 67, 'unwilling to move them with so much as a finger.” That means they preach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 692, 28, 67, 'very high standards and tell people, “You must do this.” Do you know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 693, 1, 67, 'that there are a lot of people who preach tithing but never tithe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 693, 2, 67, 'themselves? Do you know that? They don''t pay a tithe themselves. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 693, 3, 67, 'they teach other people to pay their tithes. They’re absolute');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 693, 4, 67, 'hypocrites. I don''t believe tithing is part of New Testament teaching at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 693, 5, 67, 'all. It was abolished with everything else under the law. Today, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 693, 6, 67, 'don''t give 10%. We give whatever we are happy to give, according to 2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 693, 7, 67, 'Corinthians 9:7. That''s new covenant teaching. But there are a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 693, 8, 67, 'pastors and preachers who tell others to tithe when they don''t do it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 693, 9, 67, 'themselves. Ask yourself, if you are a person who is very eager to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 693, 10, 67, 'promote tithing, do you give 10% of all your income to God? 10% of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 693, 11, 67, 'everything you earn? It’s a very searching question. Even if you do,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 693, 12, 67, 'you’re just keeping the law. I’m not under the law, and you’ll never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 693, 13, 67, 'bring me into bondage to that. You may be able to get a bunch of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 693, 14, 67, 'ignorant Christians who don''t know the new covenant nor the Bible to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 693, 15, 67, 'obey your laws, but you can’t get me to, because I know the new');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 693, 16, 67, 'covenant.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 693, 17, 67, 'It says they bind heavy burdens on people, and they don''t lift them with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 693, 18, 67, 'the finger. That means they put unrealistic demands on others that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 693, 19, 67, 'never practice themselves. I remember once when I was at a young');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 693, 20, 67, 'people''s camp, I was there with another speaker who was a bit of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 693, 21, 67, 'legalist and a hypocrite. We were the only two speakers, and He preached');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 693, 22, 67, 'that we must not only tithe our money, we must also tithe our time. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 693, 23, 67, 'have 24 hours, so 2.4 hours every day must be given to spending time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 693, 24, 67, 'alone with God. I knew that he was not tithing his income, because he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 693, 25, 67, 'was a very rich doctor, and he was definitely not tithing his time. So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 693, 26, 67, 'what happened? I didn''t say anything when he said that. I disagreed with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 693, 27, 67, 'it, but I kept quiet, because he was the other preacher with me. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 693, 28, 67, 'didn''t want to humble him or humiliate him publicly, so I kept quiet.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 694, 1, 67, 'But these students were sharp. During one of the Q&A’s, one of them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 694, 2, 67, 'said, “I want brother Zac to answer this question. Is it right, what the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 694, 3, 67, 'other speaker said, that we have to tithe our time?” I was put on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 694, 4, 67, 'spot then, so I said, “I don''t agree with it. There''s no verse which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 694, 5, 67, 'says that in Scripture.” Then I turned around to the other speaker and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 694, 6, 67, 'said, “Brother, do you spend 2.4 hours every day with God?” Sheepishly,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 694, 7, 67, 'he said, “No, brother, I don''t.” I had to expose him for the sake of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 694, 8, 67, 'these poor people, on whom he was putting a heavy burden that he hadn’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 694, 9, 67, 'lifted with a little finger.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 694, 10, 67, 'That''s what I mean. There are plenty of preachers like this. Don''t allow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 694, 11, 67, 'anybody to put a burden on you. The yoke of Jesus is easy and His burden');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 694, 12, 67, 'is light. You are weary and heavy laden, dear friend, because you''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 694, 13, 67, 'allowed all these hypocrites to put burdens on you that they themselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 694, 14, 67, 'don''t lift with a finger. All their deeds, they do to be noticed by men');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 694, 15, 67, '(Matthew 23:5). All their deeds, they do to be seen by men. Whenever we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 694, 16, 67, 'do things for men to see us, we are like the Pharisees. We are to live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 694, 17, 67, 'our life before God. I’m not saying men won''t see us. If they see us, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 694, 18, 67, 'can’t help it, but we don''t do it in order for men to see us. That''s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 694, 19, 67, 'point. It is not that men don’t see your good deeds. We can''t help it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 694, 20, 67, 'sometimes, but we don''t do it in order to get their approval. There''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 694, 21, 67, 'little book that I’ve written called 50 marks of Pharisees, and it''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 694, 22, 67, 'very interesting study to see the characteristics of Pharisees. It’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 694, 23, 67, 'very enlightening. I find it very profitable to study what the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 694, 24, 67, 'Testament speaks about Pharisees, and that''s how I compiled that book. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 694, 25, 67, 'number of those characteristics are in Matthew 23, such as binding heavy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 694, 26, 67, 'burdens on people which they don''t lift with their own finger, doing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 694, 27, 67, 'deeds to been seen by men (Matthew 23:6), loving the place of honor at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 694, 28, 67, 'banquets, and the chief seats in the synagogues, wanting respect in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 695, 1, 67, 'synagogues, to be recognized as elders and pastors who always want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 695, 2, 67, 'sit on the platform during events. Do you like that? Jesus said to go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 695, 3, 67, 'and take the last seat. Where are the Christian leaders who obey that?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 695, 4, 67, 'Almost all Christian leaders want titles and want to sit on the platform');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 695, 5, 67, 'to be respected by others. They love the chief seats in the synagogues');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 695, 6, 67, 'and you can apply that to the churches. These are Pharisees. They love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 695, 7, 67, 'respectful greetings in the market places and being called Rabbi. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 695, 8, 67, 'love greetings, they love to be greeted by others, and they want honor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 695, 9, 67, 'Everything they do is for honor. The chief seats in the synagogues are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 695, 10, 67, 'for honor, being greeted by others is for honor, and having fancy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 695, 11, 67, 'religious titles is for honor. Everything is for honor. That’s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 695, 12, 67, 'motive behind all their actions, which God sees. God doesn''t care what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 695, 13, 67, 'seat you sit on, but He sees what your motive is in everything. What''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 695, 14, 67, 'your motive? If you are trying to convey a message to people, and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 695, 15, 67, 'most convenient place is to stand in the front of a church, then that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 695, 16, 67, 'okay. If that''s your motive, and you stand on a little elevated platform');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 695, 17, 67, 'so that everybody can see you, that''s okay; but if you''re standing up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 695, 18, 67, 'there because you want honor, that''s a completely different reason. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 695, 19, 67, 'looks at the motive, the heart. Man looks at the outward appearance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 695, 20, 67, 'Only Two Titles in the Church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 695, 21, 67, 'Jesus said, Don''t ever be called Rabbi, because One is your teacher, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 695, 22, 67, 'you''re all brothers” (Matthew 23:8). We''re all supposed to be brothers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 695, 23, 67, 'That’s the one title he has given us. We are brothers and it is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 695, 24, 67, 'wonderful thing in the new covenant to be called a brother. See, when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 695, 25, 67, 'somebody calls me a brother, and I call somebody a brother, we''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 695, 26, 67, 'referring to each other as younger brothers of Jesus Christ, Who was our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 695, 27, 67, 'eldest Brother. According to Romans 8:29, He is the firstborn among many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 695, 28, 67, 'brothers. So that''s why a brother is the highest title you can give to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 696, 1, 67, 'any human being. Brother means, “younger brother of Jesus Christ.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 696, 2, 67, 'That''s why He said, “You''re all brothers and don''t call anyone on earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 696, 3, 67, 'your father, for One is your Father. He is in heaven.” It''s question of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 696, 4, 67, 'addressing a person as father. Jesus said don''t do that, but people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 696, 5, 67, 'could be spiritual fathers even though you don''t address them as father.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 696, 6, 67, 'Paul said to the Corinthian Christians, “Although you have 10,000');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 696, 7, 67, 'teachers, you don''t have many fathers. But I have become your father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 696, 8, 67, 'through the gospel” (1 Corinthians 4:15). He also writes to Timothy in 2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 696, 9, 67, 'Timothy 1:2 inspired by the Holy Spirit, “to my beloved son.” So we see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 696, 10, 67, 'that Paul would not allow anyone to address him as father Paul. He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 696, 11, 67, 'an apostle, but he was a brother. He was a brother in Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 696, 12, 67, 'He said, Don''t call anyone on earth your father. Don''t be called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 696, 13, 67, 'leaders, for One is your leader, that is Christ. The greatest among you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 696, 14, 67, 'must be a servant” (Matthew 23:9-11). Do we take all these words of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 696, 15, 67, 'Jesus seriously or do we just ignore them? Most Christians just ignore');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 696, 16, 67, 'them. They say, yeah, that''s not important. What is not important? What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 696, 17, 67, 'is the word you can say is not important? Jesus said, “If you love Me,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 696, 18, 67, 'keep My commandments. Do not be called leader, father, or teacher.” You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 696, 19, 67, 'may have those functions. You may be a teacher of God''s Word, you may be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 696, 20, 67, 'a spiritual father, and you may be a leader. That''s fine, but your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 696, 21, 67, 'attitude must always be that of a brother and a servant. “The greatest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 696, 22, 67, 'among you shall be a servant.” That''s how it is to be in the Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 696, 23, 67, 'life. If you''re a real leader, you''re going to be a servant of everybody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 696, 24, 67, 'else. There are two titles that God has given us: brother (verse 8) and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 696, 25, 67, 'servant (verse 11); and all of us must be both in our relationship to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 696, 26, 67, 'other people. We must be brothers and we must be servants. We must not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 696, 27, 67, 'take up a title that elevates us above other brothers and sisters. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 696, 28, 67, 'may have a function that may be the most important function of all, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 697, 1, 67, 'you may be an apostle, or a prophet, or a teacher, but you''re still a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 697, 2, 67, 'brother.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 697, 3, 67, 'Take the Apostle John, the great apostle. See how he speaks about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 697, 4, 67, 'himself. He says in Revelation 1:9, “I, John, your brother.” A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 697, 5, 67, '95-year-old man served God faithfully for over 65 years and what is he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 697, 6, 67, 'at the end of all that? A brother and a servant. This is how the great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 697, 7, 67, 'apostles were. You see, while these titles don''t matter, Jesus called it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 697, 8, 67, 'exalting yourself. Matthew 23:12 says, “Whoever exalts himself shall be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 697, 9, 67, 'humbled and whoever humbles himself shall be exalted.” These are not the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 697, 10, 67, 'most important Commandments in Scripture - it’s more important to love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 697, 11, 67, 'God with all your heart and love your neighbor as yourself - but we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 697, 12, 67, 'should even obey the small commandments. Jesus said if you ignore the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 697, 13, 67, 'least commandments, you will be called least in the kingdom of Heaven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 697, 14, 67, '(Matthew 5:19).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 697, 15, 67, 'We''re trying to understand all that Jesus taught, not 90% of what He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 697, 16, 67, 'taught. Go into all the world, make disciples, baptize them in the name');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 697, 17, 67, 'of the Father, Son, and Holy Spirit, and teach them to do every single');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 697, 18, 67, 'thing that I have commanded you. Every single thing. It''s very, very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 697, 19, 67, 'important. Look at Christendom today, where numerous preachers and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 697, 20, 67, 'leaders take upon them all types of titles. Do you think that''s God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 697, 21, 67, 'will? I’m not here to judge them. But compare it with God''s Word in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 697, 22, 67, 'Scripture. “Whoever exalts himself will be humbled and whoever humbles');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 697, 23, 67, 'himself will be exalted.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 697, 24, 67, 'As you go through this chapter, you find He begins with denouncing the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 697, 25, 67, 'Pharisees. Then He goes on to say, “Woe unto you, Scribes and Pharisees,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 697, 26, 67, 'hypocrites! For you shut off the kingdom of heaven from men. You don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 697, 27, 67, 'enter in yourself nor do you allow those who are entering to go in”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 697, 28, 67, '(Matthew 23:13). Jesus spoke like a prophet, and I’ll tell you that when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 698, 1, 67, 'a prophet speaks, a lot of people are going to get offended. But Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 698, 2, 67, 'was showing the way into God''s kingdom. He was saying, you Pharisees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 698, 3, 67, 'don''t enter the kingdom yourselves, and you close it up to others who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 698, 4, 67, 'want to go in. How do they close it up? With all the legalistic rules');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 698, 5, 67, 'and regulations that they made, binding heavy burdens on people instead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 698, 6, 67, 'of showing them the way into God''s kingdom. We need to understand this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 698, 7, 67, 'even today. A legalist, though he appears to be very righteous, is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 698, 8, 67, 'many ways actually closing the door into God''s kingdom. These are people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 698, 9, 67, 'who analyze small, little things and make them bigger than God has made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 698, 10, 67, 'them. Like I said about the Sabbath, the Pharisees made the Sabbath much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 698, 11, 67, 'bigger than God had made it, and they were actually closing up the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 698, 12, 67, 'kingdom to the people who wanted to enter in. That''s what Jesus says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 698, 13, 67, 'here: You don''t enter in yourself, and you don''t let others enter in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 698, 14, 67, 'either.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 698, 15, 67, '“Woe to you, scribes and Pharisees, hypocrites! For you devour widows’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 698, 16, 67, 'houses and for a pretense you make long prayers; therefore you’ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 698, 17, 67, 'receive greater condemnation” (Matthew 23:14). This is another thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 698, 18, 67, 'they did: they would squeeze money and rent out of poor widows and then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 698, 19, 67, 'to cover up their troubled conscience, they would come to the synagogue');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 698, 20, 67, 'and pray long prayers. They prayed to cover up their unrighteousness in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 698, 21, 67, 'money matters, the way they were troubling and squeezing money out of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 698, 22, 67, 'poor widows and young people and other people who are poor. God sees all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 698, 23, 67, 'this, and these kinds of things are still happening today. Jesus taught');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 698, 24, 67, 'all these things and many others as you go through Matthew 23. There are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 698, 25, 67, 'many, many things that He wants to deliver us from. If we really love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 698, 26, 67, 'Him, we will keep all His commandments.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 698, 27, 68, 'Chapter 67 Marks of a Pharisee – Part II');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 698, 28, 68, 'In Matthew 23, Jesus is dealing with the Pharisees. He did not speak to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 699, 1, 68, 'the Pharisees. He spoke to the multitudes and to His disciples about the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 699, 2, 68, 'characteristics to the Pharisees. It is a very instructive passage');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 699, 3, 68, 'because the Pharisees were people who had right doctrine. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 699, 4, 68, 'commended them for what they taught. Jesus said that everything they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 699, 5, 68, 'taught was right (Matthew 23:3). The only thing is that they did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 699, 6, 68, 'live according to what they taught. Their external life was good and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 699, 7, 68, 'outside of their cup was clean, but the inside was dirty (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 699, 8, 68, '23:25). You can have the correct doctrine and a good external life, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 699, 9, 68, 'you can still be a brood of vipers ready to go to hell (Matthew 23:33).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 699, 10, 68, 'That is what many evangelical Christians do not understand. You can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 699, 11, 68, 'evangelical in doctrine and good in external life, but be a thorough');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 699, 12, 68, 'Pharisee on your way to hell.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 699, 13, 68, 'It is quite a revealing chapter if you are honest enough to face it. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 699, 14, 68, 'devil will not let you face up to the truth. He would like to fool you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 699, 15, 68, 'so that you can spend eternity with him. So you have to be careful that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 699, 16, 68, 'you do not allow the devil to deceive you. It is the inner life that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 699, 17, 68, 'matters. The one thing that would have delivered the Pharisees from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 699, 18, 68, 'Phariseeism is if they had not only preached the right doctrine, but if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 699, 19, 68, 'they had practiced it as well. Also, they would have been delivered from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 699, 20, 68, 'Phariseeism if they were not only concerned about their external life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 699, 21, 68, 'but their inner life as well. These two points, which were their strong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 699, 22, 68, 'points, were also their weaknesses. If they had faced up to that, they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 699, 23, 68, 'would have been delivered. If the evangelical Christians whose doctrine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 699, 24, 68, 'is right would practice what they believed and if their inner life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 699, 25, 68, 'corresponded to their external life, then they would be freed from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 699, 26, 68, 'Phariseeism.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 699, 27, 68, 'Corrupted Evangelism');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 699, 28, 68, 'In Matthew 23:15, Jesus says, “Woe to you, scribes and Pharisees because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 700, 1, 68, 'you travel about on sea and land to make one proselyte; and when he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 700, 2, 68, 'becomes one, you make him twice as much a son of hell as yourselves.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 700, 3, 68, 'The scribes and Pharisees were missionaries. In the eyes of men, this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 700, 4, 68, 'was another good quality. Whenever you hear someone going out into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 700, 5, 68, 'mission field, you have a respect for him. There is an automatic respect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 700, 6, 68, 'for someone who leaves his country and crosses land and sea. It must be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 700, 7, 68, 'a sacrifice. They had to give up their job and inconvenience their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 700, 8, 68, 'family. So many sacrifices are involved to go to another country. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 700, 9, 68, 'go in the name of religion and not to do business like a lot of people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 700, 10, 68, 'do. Most people would have appreciated that. Here is a man with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 700, 11, 68, 'right doctrine, who has a clean external life, and is going abroad for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 700, 12, 68, 'religious cause at great sacrifice and suffering for his family. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 700, 13, 68, 'average Christian would admire that type of missionary, but not Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 700, 14, 68, 'He asked, “What type of convert do you make when you get there?” That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 700, 15, 68, 'the important thing. That is what I would say to all mission work in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 700, 16, 68, 'India, “What type of convert do you make when you get to the mission');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 700, 17, 68, 'field? Is the convert a two-fold child of hell?”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 700, 18, 68, 'Is it possible for a missionary who has the right doctrine to go and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 700, 19, 68, 'make a convert who is a two-fold child of hell? According to Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 700, 20, 68, '23:15, yes. We cannot play with people''s lives. It is a very serious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 700, 21, 68, 'thing to play with people''s lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 700, 22, 68, 'If you go out in the name of Christ, it is very important that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 700, 23, 68, 'present a true gospel and obey what He said, which is to go into every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 700, 24, 68, 'nation and make disciples. Disciples are those who love Jesus more than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 700, 25, 68, 'everyone else. Luke 14:6-33 lays down the conditions of discipleship,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 700, 26, 68, 'which include loving Jesus more than father, mother, brother, sister,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 700, 27, 68, 'wife, and children. This is the first thing you must do when you go out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 700, 28, 68, 'as a missionary and preach the gospel anywhere. Whether it is in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 701, 1, 68, 'home town or around the world, we need to make disciples. We need to get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 701, 2, 68, 'a convert to the place where he loves Christ more than father, mother,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 701, 3, 68, 'and all his relatives. Jesus said, “If a man loves father or mother more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 701, 4, 68, 'than Me, he is not worthy of Me.” We do not want a whole bunch of people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 701, 5, 68, 'in church who are not worthy of Jesus Christ and who, according to His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 701, 6, 68, 'Own words, are not disciples. This means to love Jesus more than his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 701, 7, 68, 'wife, children, brothers, and sisters. That takes a while.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 701, 8, 68, 'Secondly, a disciple is one who takes up his cross every single day and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 701, 9, 68, 'follows Jesus (Luke 14:27, Luke 9:23). If a person is not willing to die');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 701, 10, 68, 'to himself daily, you have not even taught him what discipleship is.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 701, 11, 68, 'The third condition is that a disciple must not hold onto possessions.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 701, 12, 68, 'He has to give up his possessions. If he holds on to those possessions,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 701, 13, 68, 'he is not fit to be a disciple. This is what is lacking in so much of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 701, 14, 68, 'Christian preaching and missionary work. They are making converts by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 701, 15, 68, 'saying, “Ask Jesus to come in to your heart and ask Him to forgive your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 701, 16, 68, 'sins.” That is fine. If that was all that the Lord wanted, why in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 701, 17, 68, 'world did He tell us to go and make disciples? A disciple is a learner');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 701, 18, 68, 'and a follower. Why in the world did He tell us to go into all the world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 701, 19, 68, 'and teach them to do every single thing that I have commanded you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 701, 20, 68, '(Matthew 28:18-20)? This is the neglected part in the Great Commission.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 701, 21, 68, 'If I neglect this part, it is possible for me to cross land and sea as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 701, 22, 68, 'an evangelical Christian and make someone two-fold a child of hell. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 701, 23, 68, 'have often thought about that. How does a person become a double a child');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 701, 24, 68, 'of hell? A child of hell itself is bad. How does he become double a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 701, 25, 68, 'child of hell? Have you ever thought of that? Twice as much a son of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 701, 26, 68, 'hell? Everyone born into the world living in sin is on his way to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 701, 27, 68, 'destruction. According to the expression that Jesus uses, he would be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 701, 28, 68, 'son of hell. But if you go there as an evangelical Christian, you might');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 702, 1, 68, 'brainwash that person into believing that just because he has mumbled');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 702, 2, 68, 'some words, he is now a child of God, even though he has not become a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 702, 3, 68, 'disciple at all. He does not even understand what taking up the cross');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 702, 4, 68, 'means. He does not know what it is to die to himself. He does not know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 702, 5, 68, 'what it is to love Jesus more than everybody on earth. But you convinced');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 702, 6, 68, 'him that he is ok. You have immunized him that moment to hearing the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 702, 7, 68, 'gospel any more because he says, “I am a child of God now. I am okay.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 702, 8, 68, 'He thinks he is a child of God when he is not a child of God. He is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 702, 9, 68, 'a disciple, but you have convinced him with doctrinal brainwashing that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 702, 10, 68, 'he is a child of God. This is what it means to make a person two-fold');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 702, 11, 68, 'child of hell. The other person who is not doctrinally brainwashed still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 702, 12, 68, 'says, “I am a heathen. I am not a Christian.” He is a single child of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 702, 13, 68, 'hell. The double child of hell will never be converted. There is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 702, 14, 68, 'possibility of the single child of hell getting converted because he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 702, 15, 68, 'does not even believe he is converted. When you make a person believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 702, 16, 68, 'that he is converted and a disciple when he is not a disciple, you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 702, 17, 68, 'really made him a two-fold child of hell.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 702, 18, 68, 'A lot of that is happening around the world. It is not a question of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 702, 19, 68, 'percentage of Christians that needs to increase in any land. It is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 702, 20, 68, 'quality of the individual Christian that is important. Jesus was always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 702, 21, 68, 'more interested in quality. He never sought for numbers. He always spoke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 702, 22, 68, 'the hardest words when the great multitudes came to follow Him because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 702, 23, 68, 'He said there is a price to be paid to follow Him. For the pearl of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 702, 24, 68, 'great price, you need to sell everything that you have. If we do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 702, 25, 68, 'proclaim the whole counsel of God, then we are going to have converts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 702, 26, 68, 'who are twice the sons of hell. We have to be careful that we do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 702, 27, 68, 'come under the same condemnation that Jesus gave to the Pharisees.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 702, 28, 68, 'Loose Speech');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 703, 1, 68, '“Woe to you, blind guides, who say, ‘Whoever swears by the temple, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 703, 2, 68, 'is nothing; but whoever swears by the gold of the temple is obligated.’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 703, 3, 68, 'You fools and blind men! Which is more important, the gold or the temple');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 703, 4, 68, 'that sanctified the gold? And, ‘Whoever swears by the altar, that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 703, 5, 68, 'nothing, but whoever swears by the offering on it, he is obligated.’ You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 703, 6, 68, 'blind men, which is more important, the offering, or the altar that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 703, 7, 68, 'sanctifies the offering? Therefore, whoever swears by the altar, swears');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 703, 8, 68, 'both by the altar and by everything on it. And whoever swears by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 703, 9, 68, 'temple, swears both by the temple and by Him who dwells within it. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 703, 10, 68, 'whoever swears by heaven, swears both by the throne of God and by Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 703, 11, 68, 'who sits upon it” (Matthew 23:16-22).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 703, 12, 68, 'Jesus is talking about little subtle changes of words and things that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 703, 13, 68, 'are not even mentioned in the law. The Pharisees made little rules');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 703, 14, 68, 'saying, “This is okay, but that is not ok.” This is also very common');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 703, 15, 68, 'among many Christians. You can nit-pick about words, about whether you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 703, 16, 68, 'have said something the right way or not. In those days, they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 703, 17, 68, 'swearing, but Jesus taught in Matthew 5 that we are not to swear at all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 703, 18, 68, 'When you say “yes” it must be yes. When you say “no” it must be no. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 703, 19, 68, 'in those days, swearing was accepted under the law because most of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 703, 20, 68, 'time, they told lies. When a man was swearing, what he really saying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 703, 21, 68, 'was, “Most of the time I tell lies, but right now I am going to speak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 703, 22, 68, 'the truth.” That is the purpose of swearing. That means he is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 703, 23, 68, 'acknowledging that when he does not swear, he will be telling lies. Now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 703, 24, 68, 'we do not need that type of thing today at all. We do not swear by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 703, 25, 68, 'anything. We speak the truth whether we swear or not. My spoken word is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 703, 26, 68, 'as much of a commitment to what I believe in as if I had given a signed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 703, 27, 68, 'statement in court on a proper stamp paper with lot of witnesses. My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 703, 28, 68, 'spoken statement is as good as that. That is how a Christian should be.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 704, 1, 68, 'I gave my word, and I will keep it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 704, 2, 68, 'There is a verse in the Psalms that is a very interesting verse in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 704, 3, 68, 'connection to our spoken word. It says in Psalm 15:1, “Who will dwell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 704, 4, 68, '(or abide permanently) in God''s tent? Who will dwell in God''s holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 704, 5, 68, 'hill?” One of the conditions is in Psalm 15:2-3, “He who walks with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 704, 6, 68, 'integrity, and works righteousness, and speaks truth in his heart. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 704, 7, 68, 'does not slander with his tongue, he does not take up any evil or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 704, 8, 68, 'reproach against neighbor etc.” And then it says in Psalm 15:4, “The one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 704, 9, 68, 'who honors those who fear the Lord… He makes a promise, and when he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 704, 10, 68, 'discovers that keeping that promise is going to hurt him, he does not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 704, 11, 68, 'change. He still goes by his word.” Amazingly, only such person can live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 704, 12, 68, 'in God''s holy hill.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 704, 13, 68, 'I remember once some years ago, I was selling some item. It is a fairly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 704, 14, 68, 'expensive item in my house that I did not need anymore. It was some type');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 704, 15, 68, 'of musical instrument with its stand and box. I offered it to somebody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 704, 16, 68, 'for certain price. Afterwards, I discovered that it actually cost much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 704, 17, 68, 'more than that. A few days later when he came to me, I realized that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 704, 18, 68, 'offered a much lower price. He was late, and he had not made an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 704, 19, 68, 'agreement with me or anything like that. When I discovered that this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 704, 20, 68, 'price was much higher than what I had offered, I realized I made a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 704, 21, 68, 'ridiculously low offer, and he came to get it. This is what the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 704, 22, 68, 'said to me, “You gave your word. Keep it. If it is loss, let it be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 704, 23, 68, 'loss. It is more important for your integrity as a Christian that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 704, 24, 68, 'are known as a man who keeps his word.” I sold it to the man. I said, “I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 704, 25, 68, 'do not care if I lose a few thousand rupees. I want to be known as one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 704, 26, 68, 'who speaks the truth. I want to abide in the holy hill of the Lord. I do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 704, 27, 68, 'not have to swear to do that.” I could have told him, “Listen, I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 704, 28, 68, 'changed my mind on that. I am not selling.” Or I could have provided');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 705, 1, 68, 'some other excuse so that I could change the price. But I had given my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 705, 2, 68, 'word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 705, 3, 68, 'I find that the Lord tests us in these little things. I believe the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 705, 4, 68, 'tested me. What He gave me in terms of anointing, holiness, and power');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 705, 5, 68, 'was a million times more valuable than that little bit of money. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 705, 6, 68, 'wonder whether you realize how much you lose when you are not a person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 705, 7, 68, 'of integrity, when your “yes” is not yes and your “no” is not no. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 705, 8, 68, 'change your mind just because you feel, “I am going to make a little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 705, 9, 68, 'loss, but I can make a little profit by changing my word telling a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 705, 10, 68, 'little lie. I can be more accepted.” There is so much of that in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 705, 11, 68, 'Christendom. There is subtle lying even among co-workers. This makes the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 705, 12, 68, 'Lord take away His anointing from people. Very often, it is not obvious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 705, 13, 68, 'until a long time afterwards that this brother has lost the anointing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 705, 14, 68, 'What is the reason? It is because of these little, little things. He did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 705, 15, 68, 'not keep his word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 705, 16, 68, 'For us in the New Covenant, your “yes” must be yes, and your “no” must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 705, 17, 68, 'be no. When you make a promise, you do not break it. Suppose you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 705, 18, 68, 'made a promise, for example, to some cult or satanic organization. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 705, 19, 68, 'you become a Christian and you discover that was wrong, you can break it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 705, 20, 68, 'because you are trying to be faithful to God. I am talking about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 705, 21, 68, 'examples where you are seeking your own.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 705, 22, 68, 'Suppose you break a promise because you are seeking to honor God’s Word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 705, 23, 68, 'For example, suppose you were engaged to be married to an unbeliever.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 705, 24, 68, 'You had given your word to someone saying, “I will marry you.” You have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 705, 25, 68, 'not gotten married yet. Then you become born again and you discover that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 705, 26, 68, 'you are not supposed to marry an unbeliever. You can break your word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 705, 27, 68, 'because now you have to obey God, who is a higher authority. God said in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 705, 28, 68, '2 Corinthians 6:14, “Do not be unequally yoked together with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 706, 1, 68, 'unbelievers.” Now you are born again. The situation is different.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 706, 2, 68, 'Therefore, you cannot marry because you want to obey God, and you need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 706, 3, 68, 'to break your word. This is different. You can say plainly, “I would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 706, 4, 68, 'very much love to marry you, but I am sorry, I cannot because my loyalty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 706, 5, 68, 'is to God first. He has told me that I must not marry an unbeliever.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 706, 6, 68, 'There are situations where we obey higher authority. In these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 706, 7, 68, 'situations, breaking your word because you want to obey God is perfectly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 706, 8, 68, 'ok. But other than that, situations where you want to break your word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 706, 9, 68, 'because you are going to get more profit or seek your own gain or gain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 706, 10, 68, 'some position is completely wrong. It is better to suffer loss.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 706, 11, 68, 'Putting the Right Weight on Things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 706, 12, 68, 'Matthew 23:23-24, “Woe to you, scribes and Pharisees, hypocrites! For');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 706, 13, 68, 'you tithe mint and dill and cumin, and have neglected the weightier');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 706, 14, 68, 'provisions of the law: justice and mercy and faithfulness; but these are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 706, 15, 68, 'the things you should have done without neglecting the others. You blind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 706, 16, 68, 'guides, who strain out a gnat and swallow a camel!”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 706, 17, 68, 'Is there anything wrong in tithing mint, dill, and cumin? No. Remember,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 706, 18, 68, 'in those days, tithing was not money. They were not office workers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 706, 19, 68, 'earning a salary. They were not factory workers. They were farmers, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 706, 20, 68, 'their income came from their crops. Their profit came from selling their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 706, 21, 68, 'crops and farming the land. The crops were also their food. Ten percent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 706, 22, 68, 'of that was what they called the tithe. They would carry the grain up to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 706, 23, 68, 'Jerusalem and give it to Levites who did not have any farms. It was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 706, 24, 68, 'perfectly right to be very exact to include even the small little garden');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 706, 25, 68, 'plants they were growing in their kitchen garden. They would find out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 706, 26, 68, 'how much they had and give 10 percent of their crops to Levites. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 706, 27, 68, 'were very particular about weighing of ten percent of these little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 706, 28, 68, 'things like dill and cumin, which were small little seeds. But they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 707, 1, 68, 'not concerned about being merciful to others. They were very hard on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 707, 2, 68, 'people. They were not concerned about faithfulness in little things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 707, 3, 68, 'They were not concerned about being righteous and just in their dealings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 707, 4, 68, 'with others. They were not concerned about all that. But they were very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 707, 5, 68, 'concerned about these little, little things. They would say, “That is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 707, 6, 68, 'little one gram less. That is a little more. Let us make it exactly one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 707, 7, 68, 'tenth.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 707, 8, 68, 'The Lord said there are some weightier matters in the law. In Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 707, 9, 68, '5:19, Jesus spoke about the least of the commandments. Not all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 707, 10, 68, 'commandments have the same importance or value. Similarly, Jesus also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 707, 11, 68, 'said here in Matthew 23:23 that there are weightier matters of the law.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 707, 12, 68, 'There are some commandments that are the least and some which are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 707, 13, 68, 'greater. There are other weightier provisions in the law and not so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 707, 14, 68, 'important provisions of the law. All need to be kept, but some are more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 707, 15, 68, 'important than others. That is very clear. Similarly, in the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 707, 16, 68, 'Testament, some of God’s commandments are more important than others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 707, 17, 68, 'If we keep the small things and neglect the big things, we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 707, 18, 68, 'Pharisees. That does not mean we should keep the big things and ignore');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 707, 19, 68, 'the small things. Some people feel this way. When we talk about some of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 707, 20, 68, 'the small commandments, they are not the weightiest commandments, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 707, 21, 68, 'should we neglect them and just keep the big ones? There are many small');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 707, 22, 68, 'commandments like a woman must veil her head, or call no man on earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 707, 23, 68, '“Father.” They are small commands. It is not the biggest thing in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 707, 24, 68, 'world. The biggest thing is love God with all your heart and to love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 707, 25, 68, 'your neighbor as yourself. Jesus says you must keep the big ones, but do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 707, 26, 68, 'not neglect the smaller ones, because if we neglect the smaller ones, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 707, 27, 68, 'will be called least in the kingdom of heaven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 707, 28, 68, 'Many people say, “Jesus said you must pay your tithe of the small');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 708, 1, 68, 'things.” That is right. Jesus also told the cleansed lepers to go and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 708, 2, 68, 'show themselves to the priest. Jesus also told the rich young ruler who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 708, 3, 68, 'was seeking the way to eternal life to keep the commandments. These are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 708, 4, 68, 'all different from what we would say today. We do not tell any person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 708, 5, 68, 'who is healed to go and show himself to the priest. We do not tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 708, 6, 68, 'people who want eternal life to keep the commandments.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 708, 7, 68, 'Start with the Inside');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 708, 8, 68, '“Woe to you, scribes and Pharisees, hypocrites! For you clean the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 708, 9, 68, 'outside of the cup and of the dish, but inside they are full of robbery');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 708, 10, 68, 'and self-indulgence” (Matthew 23:25).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 708, 11, 68, 'In the Old Covenant, you could only clean the outside of your life. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 708, 12, 68, 'could not clean the inside. In Exodus 20, there were ten commandments,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 708, 13, 68, 'and nine of them related to the external life. The last commandment was,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 708, 14, 68, '“You shall not desire your neighbor’s wife or anything that is your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 708, 15, 68, 'neighbor’s.” That was referring to the inner life, and it was put there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 708, 16, 68, 'just to teach people in Israel that the commandments do not finish with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 708, 17, 68, 'number nine. God’s standard is much higher and deals with the inner');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 708, 18, 68, 'life, but nobody could keep it, not even the great apostle Paul. Paul');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 708, 19, 68, 'could say, “I have lived with good conscience till today” (Acts 23:1).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 708, 20, 68, 'He also said in Philippians 3:5-8, “According to the righteousness of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 708, 21, 68, 'the law, I am blameless.” Yet Paul says in Romans 7:7-8 that when it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 708, 22, 68, 'comes to coveting, Paul says, “I found every type of coveting in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 708, 23, 68, 'heart. I found I was disobeying the Ten Commandments left, right, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 708, 24, 68, 'center even though I was very good on the outside.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 708, 25, 68, 'The great Apostle Paul could not keep the tenth commandment, but he was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 708, 26, 68, 'honest about it. He cries out in Romans 7:24, “Oh, wretched man that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 708, 27, 68, 'am! Who shall deliver me from this body of death? I want to be free, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 708, 28, 68, 'want to live a pure life.” Therefore, God delivered him. He says in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 709, 1, 68, 'Romans 8:4, “The law of the Spirit has set me free from the law of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 709, 2, 68, 'sin and death. Now, as I walk in the spirit, the righteous requirement');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 709, 3, 68, 'in the law, ‘Thou shall not covet,’ can be fulfilled inside me.” But the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 709, 4, 68, 'Pharisees were not concerned about that. They were not even seeking.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 709, 5, 68, 'They just gave people a pretense that they were really holy on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 709, 6, 68, 'outside, but the inside was dirty. Jesus said you must start with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 709, 7, 68, 'inside. Always start with the inside and then the outside will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 709, 8, 68, 'automatically clean. If our mind is clean and our thoughts are clean,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 709, 9, 68, 'then the outside will be clean. That is the right order.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 709, 10, 69, 'Chapter 68 Marks of a Pharisee – Part III & Signs of the End Times -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 709, 11, 69, 'Part I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 709, 12, 69, 'Clean the Inside of the Cup');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 709, 13, 69, 'In Matthew 23:26, Jesus said, “You blind Pharisee, first clean the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 709, 14, 69, 'inside of the cup and of the dish, so that the outside of it may also be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 709, 15, 69, 'clean.” Jesus called them hypocrites in Matthew 23:25. The mark of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 709, 16, 69, 'hypocrite is his inner life does not correspond to his outer life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 709, 17, 69, 'Unfortunately, this is true of the vast majority of people who call');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 709, 18, 69, 'themselves believers. The really sad thing is they do not even seem to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 709, 19, 69, 'be concerned about it. If they were concerned about it, the Lord would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 709, 20, 69, 'have led them into victory, but because they are not concerned about it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 709, 21, 69, 'the Lord does not lead them further. This is the tragedy. To clean the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 709, 22, 69, 'inside of the cup means to concentrate on the inside first and not the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 709, 23, 69, 'outside.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 709, 24, 69, 'Which part of your life do you concentrate on? Which is more important?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 709, 25, 69, 'A skyscraper may have 70 or 80 floors that are visible. Underneath all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 709, 26, 69, 'those floors is a foundation. Which do you think is more important, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 709, 27, 69, 'upper floors or the foundation? Any contractor or engineer will tell you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 709, 28, 69, 'that the strength of the upper floors depends 100% on the strength of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 710, 1, 69, 'the foundation. If the foundation is weak, even a building with one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 710, 2, 69, 'floor will collapse. That is why engineers concentrate on laying a good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 710, 3, 69, 'foundation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 710, 4, 69, 'Jesus also talked about laying a good foundation, but on that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 710, 5, 69, 'foundation, we must build a superstructure. Jesus once spoke about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 710, 6, 69, 'someone who did not want to be a disciple. How did He describe him? In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 710, 7, 69, 'Luke 14:29, Jesus says this person just lays a foundation, but does not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 710, 8, 69, 'build anything. There is no superstructure. In Matthew 7:26, Jesus also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 710, 9, 69, 'described a foolish person who built a house but had no foundation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 710, 10, 69, 'These are two opposites. Both are foolish. We need a foundation, and on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 710, 11, 69, 'that we need to build a superstructure.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 710, 12, 69, 'In this passage, the Lord tells the Pharisees to first lay the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 710, 13, 69, 'foundation, but do not stop there. Build a superstructure. We can apply');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 710, 14, 69, 'it to our life like this: if you take care of the inside, the outside');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 710, 15, 69, 'will automatically take care of itself. There is no doubt about it. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 710, 16, 69, 'you put a seed in the ground and water it, it will automatically come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 710, 17, 69, 'up. For example, if I allow my mind to be renewed so that I am not angry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 710, 18, 69, 'with people, I will not commit murder. If my inner attitude were right,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 710, 19, 69, 'then my outer life would be okay. If I do not lust after women in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 710, 20, 69, 'inner life, then I am not in danger of committing adultery. If I decide');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 710, 21, 69, 'to love my enemies, I will have no problem externally loving my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 710, 22, 69, 'neighbors.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 710, 23, 69, 'You do not have to try to clean up your external life if you clean the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 710, 24, 69, 'inside. For example, the law was like a tube of ointment that I could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 710, 25, 69, 'use on my body whenever I have a sore. It is a very effective ointment.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 710, 26, 69, 'If I rub the ointment on the sore, it goes away. Tomorrow, if I get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 710, 27, 69, 'another sore on my other hand, I can rub the ointment and it goes away.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 710, 28, 69, 'So I need this tube of ointment all the time to keep my external body');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 711, 1, 69, 'looking clean, but the inner disease that causes these sores on my hands');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 711, 2, 69, 'is never healed. I go around rubbing this ointment every day. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 711, 3, 69, 'how the law was. All the “thou shalt” and “thou shalt not’s” were meant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 711, 4, 69, 'to prevent sin from coming forth and destroying the nation. That is why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 711, 5, 69, 'we have all the laws in different countries. If you violate them, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 711, 6, 69, 'are punished. You can preserve countries with certain laws and orders.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 711, 7, 69, 'All those laws are basically based on the ten commandments.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 711, 8, 69, 'But Jesus came with an axe, saying, “I want to deal with the problem at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 711, 9, 69, 'its root.” It is like a doctor saying, “There is a new antibiotic that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 711, 10, 69, 'has been discovered. If you take it, it will deal with the problem that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 711, 11, 69, 'is causing the sores inside your body. Then you will not need this tube');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 711, 12, 69, 'of ointment. You can throw it out because the problem is solved inside');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 711, 13, 69, 'with the antibiotic. Then you will not get the sores.” This is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 711, 14, 69, 'difference between the law and grace. So which is better? The antibiotic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 711, 15, 69, 'or tube of ointment? Which is better? Grace or law? It is so clear.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 711, 16, 69, 'But when people they talk about grace, a lot of them throw away the tube');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 711, 17, 69, 'of ointment, but they have not taken the antibiotic. They keep getting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 711, 18, 69, 'sores. And that is why the life of the average Christian is a hundred');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 711, 19, 69, 'times worse than the life of a God-fearing Jew, who lived under the law.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 711, 20, 69, 'At least that God-fearing Jew had the tube of ointment. Here is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 711, 21, 69, 'Christian who talks about grace but does not take the antibiotic and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 711, 22, 69, 'does not even use the tube of ointment. We should throw away the tube of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 711, 23, 69, 'ointment only when we have taken the antibiotic. We can throw away the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 711, 24, 69, 'law when we have the inner grace that has purified our inner life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 711, 25, 69, 'Otherwise, you better keep the law.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 711, 26, 69, 'That is what Jesus is saying in Matthew 23:26, “You clean the inside of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 711, 27, 69, 'the cup and the dish so that the outside will automatically be clean.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 711, 28, 69, 'Notice the words “so that.” If you deal with the inside, the outside');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 712, 1, 69, 'will be clean. He does not say to first clean the inside and then go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 712, 2, 69, 'clean the outside. There will be no need to clean the outside. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 712, 3, 69, 'inside will be automatically clean the outside.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 712, 4, 69, 'In Matthew 23:27, Jesus says, “Woe to you, scribes and Pharisees, for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 712, 5, 69, 'you are like whitewashed tombs which on the outside appear so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 712, 6, 69, 'beautiful.” Some tombs are so grand on the outside, but the inside is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 712, 7, 69, 'full of dead men’s bones. Look at the illustrations the Lord uses. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 712, 8, 69, 'is death inside, but such beautiful decorations on the outside. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 712, 9, 69, 'a perfect description of many Christians who want to look so nice on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 712, 10, 69, 'outside with their singing and preaching. They give a good external');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 712, 11, 69, 'impression of Christianity with their grand cathedrals and buildings,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 712, 12, 69, 'but their inner lives are corrupt. Even so, many of you outwardly appear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 712, 13, 69, 'righteous to men, but inwardly, you are full of hypocrisy and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 712, 14, 69, 'lawlessness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 712, 15, 69, 'The Life of a True Prophet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 712, 16, 69, 'Jesus goes on to say in Matthew 23:29-30, “Woe to you, scribes and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 712, 17, 69, 'Pharisees, hypocrites! For you build the tombs of the prophets and adorn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 712, 18, 69, 'the monuments of the righteous, and say, ‘If we had been living in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 712, 19, 69, 'days of our fathers, we would not have been partners with them in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 712, 20, 69, 'shedding the blood of the prophets.’ Consequently, you bear witness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 712, 21, 69, 'against yourselves, that you are sons of those who murdered the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 712, 22, 69, 'prophets.” This is a very common thing. It is very easy to admire the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 712, 23, 69, 'saints who lived hundreds of years ago who are dead. In their lifetime,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 712, 24, 69, 'those saints were called by all types of bad names such as heretics,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 712, 25, 69, 'false prophets, Beelzebul etc. But now that they are dead, people sing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 712, 26, 69, 'their praises. This is true of all the great men that evangelical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 712, 27, 69, 'Christians admire whether it is Martin Luther or John Wesley or William');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 712, 28, 69, 'Booth or D. L. Moody or Charles Bernier. It is very easy to admire all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 713, 1, 69, 'these ancient prophets, who were God’s men whom God raised up to stand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 713, 2, 69, 'for Him and to bring forth a certain truth in their lifetime. All those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 713, 3, 69, 'men were called heretics, false prophets, and all types of bad names');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 713, 4, 69, 'while they were living. Now we sing their praises.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 713, 5, 69, 'The living prophets today are maligned in exactly the same way. If there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 713, 6, 69, 'is a living prophet anywhere in the world, he is invariably called a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 713, 7, 69, 'heretic, false teacher, cult leader, etc. just as past prophets were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 713, 8, 69, 'called hundreds of years ago. But once this prophet dies, fifty years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 713, 9, 69, 'later, people will acknowledge him as a prophet. This is how Christians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 713, 10, 69, 'have dealt with the dead and with the living through 2,000 years of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 713, 11, 69, 'church history. This is what Jesus is saying.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 713, 12, 69, 'The Pharisees said, “We would not have murdered those prophets who lived');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 713, 13, 69, 'in ancient times like Isaiah and Zechariah. They were killed by our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 713, 14, 69, 'fathers, but we would not have done that. We would have made monuments');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 713, 15, 69, 'and tombs on these people.” But consider how they were treating Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 713, 16, 69, 'Christ, the greatest of all Prophets, Who was walking among them! That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 713, 17, 69, 'showed their hypocrisy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 713, 18, 69, 'Jesus says in Matthew 23:32-33, “Fill up then the measure of the guilt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 713, 19, 69, 'of your fathers. You serpents, you brood of vipers, how shall you escape');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 713, 20, 69, 'the sentence of hell?” We are trying to understand all that Jesus taught');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 713, 21, 69, 'by His life, by the way He spoke, and by the words He spoke. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 713, 22, 69, 'Christlike person is one who behaves like Christ and talks like Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 713, 23, 69, 'What would you say about a preacher who looked at people and said, “You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 713, 24, 69, 'serpents, you brood of vipers, how will you escape the sentence of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 713, 25, 69, 'hell,” to religious people sitting there with their Bibles in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 713, 26, 69, 'congregation? Would you ever think that person could be Christlike? He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 713, 27, 69, 'may be the greatest prophet in your generation as Jesus was in His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 713, 28, 69, 'generation, but because of faulty understanding of Christlikeness, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 714, 1, 69, 'would conclude that he lacks grace and is not Christlike. The word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 714, 2, 69, '“Christlike” is used by people who do not know what Christ is like. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 714, 3, 69, 'is how they deceive themselves and deceive others who do not know the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 714, 4, 69, 'Bible and have not read the Gospels. We need to have a balanced');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 714, 5, 69, 'understanding of what it means to be Christlike.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 714, 6, 69, 'Jesus says in Matthew 23:34, “Behold, I am sending you prophets, wise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 714, 7, 69, 'men, and scribes. Some of them you will kill and crucify, and some of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 714, 8, 69, 'them you will scourge in your synagogues, and persecute from city to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 714, 9, 69, 'city.” This is the lot given to any true prophet whom God sends. Notice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 714, 10, 69, 'how Jesus says, “I am sending,” meaning, “When I send you a prophet who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 714, 11, 69, 'preaches and lives according to Scripture, you will kill some of them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 714, 12, 69, 'You will crucify some of them. You will scourge them in your synagogues.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 714, 13, 69, 'You will persecute them from one city to another city and call them all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 714, 14, 69, 'types of names. You chase them around here.” Jesus said in Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 714, 15, 69, '23:35-36, “So that upon you may fall the guilt of all the righteous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 714, 16, 69, 'blood shed on earth, from the blood of righteous Abel to the blood of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 714, 17, 69, 'Zechariah son of Berechiah, whom you murdered between the temple and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 714, 18, 69, 'altar. Truly I say to you, all these things shall come upon this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 714, 19, 69, 'generation.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 714, 20, 69, 'The Lord was saying that this would be the fate of a true prophet of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 714, 21, 69, 'God. A true prophet is never popular in Christendom. Those who really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 714, 22, 69, 'fear God will love Him and respect Him, just as the people who really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 714, 23, 69, 'feared God in Jesus’ time, loved and respected Him. These were people,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 714, 24, 69, 'like the eleven disciples, who were willing to lay down their lives for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 714, 25, 69, 'Him. But the multitudes of people who studied the Scriptures and were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 714, 26, 69, 'evangelical in their doctrine, like the Pharisees in their time, thought');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 714, 27, 69, 'He was a prince of devils and called Him all types of names. It was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 714, 28, 69, 'exactly the same in Paul''s time. The religious Jews thought Paul was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 715, 1, 69, 'false teacher and heretic, but those who really loved Jesus and were the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 715, 2, 69, 'true disciples of Jesus felt Paul was an apostle of God. The way you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 715, 3, 69, 'look at a true servant of God is a pretty good indication of your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 715, 4, 69, 'spiritual condition. If you despise him, you reveal your spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 715, 5, 69, 'condition. If you value him, you know your spiritual condition.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 715, 6, 69, 'When God’s Patience Ends');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 715, 7, 69, 'Jesus does not say all this without any heart. There is a beautiful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 715, 8, 69, 'balance between truth and grace in the same chapter. He speaks so hard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 715, 9, 69, 'against the Pharisees right up to Matthew 23:36. And then you see these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 715, 10, 69, 'tender words, “Jesus wept over Jerusalem” (Luke 19:41), and “He lamented');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 715, 11, 69, 'over Jerusalem,” saying in Matthew 23:37-39, “O Jerusalem, Jerusalem,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 715, 12, 69, 'who kills the prophets and stones those who are sent to her! How often I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 715, 13, 69, 'wanted to gather your children together, the way a hen gathers her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 715, 14, 69, 'chicks under her wings, and you were unwilling! Behold, your house is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 715, 15, 69, 'being left to you desolate! For I say to you, from now on you shall not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 715, 16, 69, 'see Me until you say, ‘BLESSED IS HE WHO COMES IN THE NAME OF THE LORD!”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 715, 17, 69, 'A time comes when the patience of God comes to an end. The Lord waited');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 715, 18, 69, 'three and a half years for the people of Jerusalem and the religious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 715, 19, 69, 'people to turn and accept Him. But they rejected Him. They wanted to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 715, 20, 69, 'have nothing to do with Him. He was patient with them for a long time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 715, 21, 69, 'He wanted to gather them like a hen gathers her chicks under wings to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 715, 22, 69, 'protect them from danger and to lead them to God, but they did not want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 715, 23, 69, 'it. He says, “How frequently I wanted to do this! How much I went here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 715, 24, 69, 'and there, travelled here day and night, not serving you for money or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 715, 25, 69, 'any gain, but wanting to bless you. But you are not interested. Now your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 715, 26, 69, 'house is left to you desolate. It is not My Father''s house anymore. Once');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 715, 27, 69, 'upon a time He called it ‘My Father''s house’. Now it is your house.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 715, 28, 69, 'It is a sad thing when the Lord turns around to a church and says, “This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 716, 1, 69, 'was My church. Now it is yours. Go and do what you like.” Do you know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 716, 2, 69, 'that the Lord has said that to many churches? If you do not listen to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 716, 3, 69, 'the Word of God, your church can become like that. God sends you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 716, 4, 69, 'prophets to speak the word. The word of a prophet will not be something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 716, 5, 69, 'that tickles your ears. It will be a hard word to remove the cancers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 716, 6, 69, 'from your life. If you keep rejecting it, one day, God''s patience will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 716, 7, 69, 'come to an end. He says, “Your house is left to you desolate. From now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 716, 8, 69, 'on, you will not see Me anymore. I am going.” Soon after that, Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 716, 9, 69, 'ascended to heaven. Jesus said, “You will not see Me again until one day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 716, 10, 69, 'you see Me coming in glory (in the second coming) and you will say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 716, 11, 69, '‘Blessed is He who comes in the name the Lord.’” By that time, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 716, 12, 69, 'generation and many other generations would have died and gone to hell.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 716, 13, 69, 'It is a tremendous tragedy when a generation of leaders rejects the Word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 716, 14, 69, 'of God. It affects so many other people. Every pastor, elder, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 716, 15, 69, 'servant of God must take seriously his responsibility to lead people to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 716, 16, 69, 'the truth of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 716, 17, 69, 'In Matthew 24, Jesus came out from the temple where He was speaking. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 716, 18, 69, 'was going away when His disciples came up to point out the temple');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 716, 19, 69, 'buildings to Him saying, “What a beautiful building this is!” Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 716, 20, 69, 'answered and said to them, “Do you not see all these things? Truly I say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 716, 21, 69, 'to you, not one stone here shall be left upon another, which will not be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 716, 22, 69, 'torn down.” He was prophesying this temple will be torn down completely.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 716, 23, 69, 'There would not be one stone left on top of the other. It was something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 716, 24, 69, 'that was going to take place in the future. We know from history that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 716, 25, 69, 'this took place forty years later when the Roman generals came and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 716, 26, 69, 'destroyed the temple. Jesus was prophesying as the Spirit inspired Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 716, 27, 69, 'about what was going to happen.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 716, 28, 69, 'When Jesus was sitting on the Mount of Olives, the disciples came to Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 717, 1, 69, 'privately, and said, “Tell us, when is that going to be? When is this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 717, 2, 69, 'temple going to be destroyed?” They thought the temple would be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 717, 3, 69, 'destroyed at the second coming of Christ. The disciples also asked,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 717, 4, 69, '“What will be the sign of Your coming, and of the end of the age?” They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 717, 5, 69, 'asked three questions there. They thought it was all together, but it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 717, 6, 69, 'was not. The temple was destroyed forty years after Christ’s death. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 717, 7, 69, 'second coming of Christ has still not taken place after two thousand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 717, 8, 69, 'years. The end of the whole age of human history will not happen for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 717, 9, 69, 'another thousand years beyond that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 717, 10, 69, 'These were three separate questions that they thought were all one. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 717, 11, 69, 'temple was such a big thing to them. When it is destroyed, they thought');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 717, 12, 69, 'that is the end of the world. But it wasn’t like that. Jesus answered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 717, 13, 69, 'and said, “See to it that no one misleads you.” And in the rest of that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 717, 14, 69, 'chapter, He was answering all three questions together. If we combine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 717, 15, 69, 'the last two questions, we can say Jesus was answering two questions.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 717, 16, 69, 'When will the destruction of the temple happen? When will You return?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 717, 17, 69, 'The Primary Sign of the End Times');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 717, 18, 69, 'Jesus said, “First of all, I want to say to you do not be deceived. Many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 717, 19, 69, 'will come in my name saying, ‘I''m Christ’ and will mislead many”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 717, 20, 69, '(Matthew 24:4-5). We need to understand this verse properly. How many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 717, 21, 69, 'people have you seen stand up and say, “I am Jesus Christ”? I think in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 717, 22, 69, 'the history of the world, there may be a handful of lunatics who have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 717, 23, 69, 'said that. How many people would be misled if some person got up in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 717, 24, 69, 'pulpit and said, “I am Jesus Christ”? I do not think any Christian I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 717, 25, 69, 'know would ever be deceived by that, and certainly no born-again');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 717, 26, 69, 'Christian would. So what did Jesus mean? I think we misunderstand that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 717, 27, 69, 'verse. What Jesus is saying is, “Many will come in My Name and say that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 717, 28, 69, 'I am the real Christ and that ‘Jesus is the Messiah.’” Let me read it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 718, 1, 69, 'like this, “Many will come in My name, Jesus’ name, and say, ‘That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 718, 2, 69, 'right. Jesus is the Christ, the Messiah’ and then they will go around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 718, 3, 69, 'misleading people.” If they say Jesus is not the Messiah, then of course');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 718, 4, 69, 'they are not even Christians. They are not the ones Jesus is warning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 718, 5, 69, 'about. He is warning about people who accept Jesus as the Messiah and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 718, 6, 69, 'the Christ, and then mislead others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 718, 7, 69, '“Many will come in My Name and say, ‘Yes, it is true that I am the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 718, 8, 69, 'Christ.’” When Jesus is saying “I”, He is referring to Himself, that He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 718, 9, 69, 'is the Christ. Then they will mislead many. That is how you should read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 718, 10, 69, 'that verse, and then you can understand it. There have been many people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 718, 11, 69, 'like that throughout history who have said, “Yes, Jesus is the Christ.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 718, 12, 69, 'And then they go around with all types of wrong doctrines that have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 718, 13, 69, 'misled millions in these last two thousand years.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 718, 14, 69, 'What will be the sign of His coming? Widespread deception. Again, Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 718, 15, 69, 'says in Matthew 24:11, “Many false prophets will come and mislead many.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 718, 16, 69, 'Notice that word “many” is used in both Matthew 24:5 and 24:11. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 718, 17, 69, 'the first warning He gave.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 718, 18, 69, 'In Matthew 24:24-25, Jesus says, “False Christs and false prophets will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 718, 19, 69, 'arise and will show great signs and mislead, if possible, even the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 718, 20, 69, 'elect. I have told you in advance.” It is interesting that although He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 718, 21, 69, 'spoke about many signs like famines, earthquakes, persecution, and wars');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 718, 22, 69, '(Matthew 24:7), the one thing that He keeps repeating at least three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 718, 23, 69, 'times is deception. So what are the primary characteristics of the last');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 718, 24, 69, 'days? Will be there be a tremendous amount of deception in Christianity?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 718, 25, 69, 'There will be all types of false teachings. How shall we escape this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 718, 26, 69, 'deception? I think that is the thing that we need to really understand.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 718, 27, 69, 'How shall we escape this deception?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 718, 28, 69, 'Before we go into what are all types of deception, it says in Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 719, 1, 69, '24:24 that there will even be people showing great signs and wonders.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 719, 2, 69, 'Paul said in 2 Thessalonians 2:9 that the coming of the anti-Christ will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 719, 3, 69, 'be with a whole lot of false signs and wonders. 2 Thessalonians 2:9');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 719, 4, 69, 'says, “The one whose coming is in accord with the activity of Satan,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 719, 5, 69, 'with all power and signs and false wonders.” There are going to be a lot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 719, 6, 69, 'of false miracles and counterfeit healings. All types of people will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 719, 7, 69, 'come in the name of Jesus saying, “Jesus is the Messiah,” and deceive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 719, 8, 69, 'many people. How shall we escape such deception?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 719, 9, 69, 'Escaping Deception');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 719, 10, 69, 'This is answered subtly in 2 Thessalonians 2:10, which describes those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 719, 11, 69, 'who will perish and why. Here is a very important phrase. “Because they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 719, 12, 69, 'did not receive the love of the truth so as to be saved.” Saved from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 719, 13, 69, 'what? Not from hell, but from sin. Jesus came to save His people from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 719, 14, 69, 'their sins. “For this reason, they did not receive the love of the truth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 719, 15, 69, 'to be saved from sin. Therefore, God Himself will send on them a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 719, 16, 69, 'deluding influence so that they might believe what is false.” Ephesians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 719, 17, 69, '4:22 says that our lusts are deceitful. Revelation 12:9 says that Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 719, 18, 69, 'is a deceiver. Jeremiah 17:9 says that the heart is deceitful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 719, 19, 69, 'Our lusts, the heart, and the devil are all trying to deceive us. Our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 719, 20, 69, 'only hope is that God will protect us, but it says that there comes a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 719, 21, 69, 'point when God Himself will turn around and deceive us. Then there is no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 719, 22, 69, 'hope. We have got these three forces deceiving us: our heart, our lusts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 719, 23, 69, 'and the devil. On top of that, if Almighty God also decides to deceive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 719, 24, 69, 'us, then there is absolutely no hope. God is the source of light. If He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 719, 25, 69, 'turns off His light, it becomes darkness. Then we will definitely be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 719, 26, 69, 'deceived. On whom does God send His deluding influence? Those who “do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 719, 27, 69, 'not receive the love of the truth so as to be saved.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 719, 28, 69, 'This is the secret of how to escape deception. First of all, love the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 720, 1, 69, 'truth and seek to be saved from sin. That is it. If you love the truth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 720, 2, 69, 'and seek to be saved from sin, I can guarantee that you will never be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 720, 3, 69, 'deceived. I am absolutely certain because of that verse. God will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 720, 4, 69, 'deceive you. All these other forces may try to deceive you, but God will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 720, 5, 69, 'keep on giving you light to show you those deceptions. What does it mean');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 720, 6, 69, 'to “love the truth?” When God shows you something in yourself, say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 720, 7, 69, '“Lord, that is true.” Perhaps God shows you something in a meeting or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 720, 8, 69, 'when you are reading the Bible. Or perhaps He shows you in some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 720, 9, 69, 'circumstance that you are selfish or proud or seeking your own. Just be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 720, 10, 69, 'honest and say, “Lord, that is true.” Second, if you see something in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 720, 11, 69, 'Scripture that is contrary to what you have believed all your life, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 720, 12, 69, 'after you have studied the Scripture carefully, say, “That is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 720, 13, 69, 'truth.” Love the truth and stand up for it, even if you have to publicly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 720, 14, 69, 'acknowledge, “I was wrong.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 720, 15, 69, 'Love the truth. Do not seek your own honor. You will never be deceived.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 720, 16, 69, 'Seek to be saved from sin more than to be saved from sickness and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 720, 17, 69, 'poverty. O Lord, save me from sin. If you follow these two rules - to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 720, 18, 69, 'love the truth about yourself and what you see in God''s Word and if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 720, 19, 69, 'seek to be saved from sin - you can be absolutely sure that in the last');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 720, 20, 69, 'days, you will not be deceived. That is our only protection from Satanic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 720, 21, 69, 'deception in the last days.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 720, 22, 70, 'Chapter 69 Signs of the End Times – Part II');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 720, 23, 70, 'In Matthew 24, Jesus answers the disciples’ question about when the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 720, 24, 70, 'temple would be destroyed and when He would be returning. The first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 720, 25, 70, 'thing He mentioned repeatedly was deception. This is one thing that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 720, 26, 70, 'should be extremely careful about. A person who goes to buy diamonds or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 720, 27, 70, 'gold is concerned about not getting cheated. Maybe he takes an expert');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 720, 28, 70, 'with him who knows all about diamonds and gold. In the same way, if we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 721, 1, 70, 'want to avoid deception, we need to know the Word of God, love the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 721, 2, 70, 'truth, and seek to be saved from sin. We do not escape deception by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 721, 3, 70, 'intellectual sharpness. Many clever people are deceived. The devil came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 721, 4, 70, 'through the serpent. The devil is sharper and cleverer than the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 721, 5, 70, 'cleverest human being. We cannot overcome the devil by cleverness. He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 721, 6, 70, 'much cleverer than us. He can deceive the cleverest of Christians, and a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 721, 7, 70, 'lot of clever Christians are deceived. We must love the truth, seek to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 721, 8, 70, 'be saved from sin, and seek to obey God. Then we will know the doctrine.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 721, 9, 70, 'This is the word that Jesus spoke in John 7:17, which is relevant in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 721, 10, 70, 'this connection. He says, “If anyone is willing to do His will, he will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 721, 11, 70, 'know of the teaching, whether it is of God or whether I speak from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 721, 12, 70, 'Myself.” If I am really desiring deep down in my heart to do the will of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 721, 13, 70, 'God, then I will know the truth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 721, 14, 70, 'Wars and Persecution');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 721, 15, 70, 'Jesus says in Matthew 24:6, “You will be hearing of wars and rumors of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 721, 16, 70, 'wars. See that you are not frightened.” One of the things that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 721, 17, 70, 'constantly spoke of in relation to the last days with disciples was, “Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 721, 18, 70, 'not be afraid.” “Fear not” is word that comes many times in His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 721, 19, 70, 'messages, and when He speaks to people. This occurs even in the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 721, 20, 70, 'Testament. Do not be afraid. God will be with you. Jesus continues in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 721, 21, 70, 'Matthew 24:6-7, “These things must take place, but that is not yet the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 721, 22, 70, 'end. For nation will rise against nation, and kingdom against kingdom,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 721, 23, 70, 'and there will be famines and earthquakes. All these things are the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 721, 24, 70, 'beginning of birth pangs.” Wars and rumors of wars is not the end. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 721, 25, 70, 'second coming of Christ is compared to the birth of a baby. When a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 721, 26, 70, 'mother is looking forward to the birth of a baby, she realizes that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 721, 27, 70, 'before the birth of the baby, she is going to have a period of intense');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 721, 28, 70, 'pain. Then only the baby is born. When Jesus speaks about the birth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 722, 1, 70, 'pangs, He is equating wars, rumors of wars, and all these things with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 722, 2, 70, 'only the birth pangs that precede the birth of the baby, His return.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 722, 3, 70, 'He then speaks about persecution in Matthew 24:9, “They will deliver you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 722, 4, 70, 'to tribulation and they will kill you and you''ll be hated by all nations');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 722, 5, 70, 'on account of My name.” Do we look forward to tribulation? No. Does the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 722, 6, 70, 'mother look forward to the birth pains? No. What is she looking forward');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 722, 7, 70, 'to? The birth of the baby. But she knows that the birth pains will come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 722, 8, 70, 'before. She definitely knows that. We do not look forward to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 722, 9, 70, 'tribulation, but we know the tribulation will come before the coming of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 722, 10, 70, 'Christ without a doubt. It is one of the signs of the last days.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 722, 11, 70, 'This is one of the clearest things that Jesus spoke. speaks of wars,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 722, 12, 70, 'rumors of wars, earthquakes, and famines, but nobody speaks of the fact');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 722, 13, 70, 'that there will be tribulation (a great tribulation) before Christ comes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 722, 14, 70, 'again, and yet Jesus spoke about it so clearly. The reason is because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 722, 15, 70, 'the devil has deceived the vast majority of Christendom saying, “You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 722, 16, 70, 'will not go through the great tribulation. Christ will come and secretly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 722, 17, 70, 'rapture all of you. You will escape the tribulation.” There is not one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 722, 18, 70, 'verse in Scripture that teaches that! It is a lie of the devil! He has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 722, 19, 70, 'fooled many evangelical Christians with it. Jesus said that they will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 722, 20, 70, 'deliver you up to tribulation. In John 16:33, Jesus said, “In the world,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 722, 21, 70, 'you will have tribulation.” Tribulation is not the judgment of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 722, 22, 70, 'Christians will never face the judgment of God. Tribulation is always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 722, 23, 70, 'from men. If there is a tribulation from God, that Christians will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 722, 24, 70, 'escape. Wars and famines are not tribulation from God. There are many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 722, 25, 70, 'wars and famines that have taken place in history where even Christians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 722, 26, 70, 'have suffered. It is not a judgment from God. Far from it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 722, 27, 70, 'Jesus says that at that time, many will fall away and we will deliver up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 722, 28, 70, 'one another and hate one another. One reason people fall away at that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 723, 1, 70, 'time is because their leaders never prepared them for tribulation. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 723, 2, 70, 'were told that Christ would come in secretly and rapture them. They were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 723, 3, 70, 'waiting for that and when tribulation came, they were not prepared and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 723, 4, 70, 'they fell away. This actually happened in China, where for many years,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 723, 5, 70, 'the missionaries taught them that Christ would come and rapture them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 723, 6, 70, 'Then when tribulation came, many of them fell away from the faith. Whose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 723, 7, 70, 'failure was that? It was the failure of the missionaries who did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 723, 8, 70, 'teach them that there would be tribulation before the rapture and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 723, 9, 70, 'Christ’s second coming.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 723, 10, 70, 'Enduring to the End');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 723, 11, 70, 'Jesus said in Matthew 24:10-12, “At that time, many will fall away, not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 723, 12, 70, 'just a few. They will hate one another and deliver up one another. Many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 723, 13, 70, 'false prophets will arise and will mislead many. Because lawlessness has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 723, 14, 70, 'increased, most people''s love will grow cold.” There is going to be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 723, 15, 70, 'lot of sin in the world, particularly through the entertainment industry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 723, 16, 70, 'in movies, music, internet pornography, and other types of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 723, 17, 70, 'entertainment. Sin is going to increase and abound with adultery and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 723, 18, 70, 'homosexuality. The love of many will become cold. Instead of loving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 723, 19, 70, 'Jesus fervently, they will cool off. They may not give up Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 723, 20, 70, 'completely. It does not say they will forsake Christ. They will just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 723, 21, 70, 'cool off in their love for God, and they will cool off their love for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 723, 22, 70, 'one another. They will hate one another, but the one who endures in love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 723, 23, 70, 'to Christ and to one another will be saved. In the context, Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 723, 24, 70, '24:13 is referring to love. Most people''s love will grow cold, but in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 723, 25, 70, 'the context, “the one who endures to the end will be saved,” means that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 723, 26, 70, 'the one who endures in fervent love for Christ and for others, no matter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 723, 27, 70, 'how people treat him, will be saved.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 723, 28, 70, 'Salvation comes to the one who is willing to endure in love until the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 724, 1, 70, 'end. That is why love is the greatest. It is not understanding of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 724, 2, 70, 'doctrine that is greatest. It is fervent love for Jesus and fervent love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 724, 3, 70, 'for one another. This is the message we have to proclaim in the last');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 724, 4, 70, 'days to preserve people from cooling off. The gospel of the kingdom will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 724, 5, 70, 'be preached in the whole world, not the gospel of escaping from hell.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 724, 6, 70, 'There is a lot of difference between the gospel of escaping from hell,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 724, 7, 70, 'the gospel of financial prosperity, and the gospel of healing, and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 724, 8, 70, 'gospel of the kingdom of God. What is the gospel of the kingdom of God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 724, 9, 70, 'which Jesus said had to be preached in the whole world for a witness? Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 724, 10, 70, 'not say everybody will be converted, for the way to life is narrow and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 724, 11, 70, 'very few find it. But it will be proclaimed as a witness. This is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 724, 12, 70, 'gospel of the kingdom as described in Romans 14:17, “The kingdom of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 724, 13, 70, 'is righteousness, peace, and joy in the Holy Spirit.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 724, 14, 70, 'What is going to be proclaimed in the last days? It is the gospel of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 724, 15, 70, 'kingdom of God. This is the gospel of righteousness. This is a gospel of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 724, 16, 70, 'peace, peace with God and peace with men. This is a gospel of peace in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 724, 17, 70, 'your heart with no strife, panic, turmoil, and peace in the home. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 724, 18, 70, 'is a gospel of joy, of perpetual joy under all circumstances. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 724, 19, 70, 'the gospel that is going to be preached in the last days. You should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 724, 20, 70, 'belong to a church that is preaching righteousness, peace, and joy in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 724, 21, 70, 'the Holy Spirit. That is the church you should belong to.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 724, 22, 70, 'In Matthew 24:14, Jesus said that this gospel of the kingdom will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 724, 23, 70, 'proclaimed as a witness to all nations. God does not want the gospel to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 724, 24, 70, 'go everywhere. The ultimate result of it is that there will be a pure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 724, 25, 70, 'testimony for the Lord in every nation. There must be a testimony for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 724, 26, 70, 'the Lord in every nation for a witness to all the nations. It does not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 724, 27, 70, 'mean everybody will be converted. I do not think everybody will even get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 724, 28, 70, 'an opportunity to hear. But there will be a witness to the Lord in all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 725, 1, 70, 'nations. Unfortunately, many people''s emphasis is more on the quantity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 725, 2, 70, 'People say, “We must get the gospel to everybody!” This is a good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 725, 3, 70, 'desire. Jesus Himself said to take the gospel to all creatures. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 725, 4, 70, 'fine, but in a country like India, where we have one child born almost');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 725, 5, 70, 'every second or 3,600 babies born in an hour, you need to reach 3,600');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 725, 6, 70, 'people in an hour to be able to reach India alone, let alone all other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 725, 7, 70, 'countries! We do not want to deceive ourselves. It is almost impossible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 725, 8, 70, 'to reach every single individual with the gospel, especially with all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 725, 9, 70, 'the different languages out there. But we can have a witness in every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 725, 10, 70, 'nation, a pure, uncompromising, quality witness for Christ. That is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 725, 11, 70, 'great need of the hour. If we do not concentrate on that, we will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 725, 12, 70, 'trying to spread a wishy-washy, third-rate, useless Christianity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 725, 13, 70, 'everywhere. We have a social gospel that includes doing good, which the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 725, 14, 70, 'world will appreciate. They will give you awards for it. But that is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 725, 15, 70, 'the gospel that Jesus preached. That is a by-product of the gospel. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 725, 16, 70, 'are not against it, but the gospel must produce a pure witness for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 725, 17, 70, 'Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 725, 18, 70, 'Jesus next speaks about the destruction of the temple, which is another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 725, 19, 70, 'question the disciples had asked. He says in Matthew 24:15, “When you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 725, 20, 70, 'see the abomination of desolation spoken of by Daniel the prophet,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 725, 21, 70, 'standing in the holy place (let the reader understand).” The holy place');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 725, 22, 70, 'is in the temple. It is only referring to the Jewish time, because now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 725, 23, 70, 'there is no temple for a church. The church does not have a holy place,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 725, 24, 70, 'but Jesus is answering that first question about when the temple will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 725, 25, 70, 'destroyed. He is answering that the temple be destroyed when you see the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 725, 26, 70, 'abomination of desolation in the holy place, which refers to the most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 725, 27, 70, 'holy place that is. I have heard it said that there was a pig sacrificed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 725, 28, 70, 'on the altar in the most holy place to desecrate that place in the eyes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 726, 1, 70, 'of the Jews. That is probably the abomination of desolation that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 726, 2, 70, 'happened in the time when the temple was destroyed. He says that when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 726, 3, 70, 'you see that, “let the reader understand.” You will understand it when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 726, 4, 70, 'it happens. Jesus was speaking about something that would take place');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 726, 5, 70, 'forty years later. Jesus then says, “Then let those who are in Judea');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 726, 6, 70, 'flee to the mountains.” He is speaking specifically to the Jewish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 726, 7, 70, 'people. This is not for the last days. This is not the answer to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 726, 8, 70, 'second question of His second coming. It is the answer to the first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 726, 9, 70, 'question of when will the temple be destroyed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 726, 10, 70, 'Jesus said in Matthew 24:16, “Then those who are in Judea must flee to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 726, 11, 70, 'the mountains, and if you are on the housetop, do not wait to go down');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 726, 12, 70, 'and get anything.” In other words, just run. If you are out in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 726, 13, 70, 'field, do not turn back to your house. Just run because it is going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 726, 14, 70, 'be a time of persecution. Woe unto those who have a child in those days');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 726, 15, 70, 'or are nursing babies. It is going to be tough for them because now they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 726, 16, 70, 'are going to run with their babies. Jesus said, “But pray that your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 726, 17, 70, 'flight will not be in the winter because it is going to be difficult to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 726, 18, 70, 'run in winter. Pray that your flight will not be on a Sabbath day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 726, 19, 70, 'because you will easily be detected” (Matthew 24:15-20 paraphrase). This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 726, 20, 70, 'is referring to the Jews. The Jews did not move on a Sabbath day. If the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 726, 21, 70, 'Romans see people running, then the Romans will detect them. So pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 726, 22, 70, 'that it will not be like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 726, 23, 70, 'Prayers can change things, and those who took that seriously would have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 726, 24, 70, 'prayed, because Jesus said that then there will be great tribulation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 726, 25, 70, 'such as not occurred since the beginning of the world until now, nor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 726, 26, 70, 'ever will be. Now He is answering the second question. Jesus in Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 726, 27, 70, '24:21-22, “For then there will be a great tribulation, such as has not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 726, 28, 70, 'occurred since the beginning of the world until now, nor ever will.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 727, 1, 70, 'Unless those days had been cut short, no life would have been saved; but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 727, 2, 70, 'for the sake of the elect those days will be cut short.” Jesus is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 727, 3, 70, 'referring to a time two thousand years later from the time the temple');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 727, 4, 70, 'was destroyed. There is a fixed period that God has determined for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 727, 5, 70, 'elect to go through tribulation. When the Lord was speaking to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 727, 6, 70, 'churches in Revelation, He says to the church in Smyrna in Revelation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 727, 7, 70, '2:10, “You are going to have tribulation for ten days.” It is for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 727, 8, 70, 'fixed period. God allows it, and then it will be over. This is the great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 727, 9, 70, 'comfort we have in any tribulation we go through. God will not allow us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 727, 10, 70, 'to be tested beyond our ability. It is a fixed period determined by God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 727, 11, 70, 'before it starts. Now we do not know when it ends, but God knows already');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 727, 12, 70, 'when the end is. In one way or the other, God will put it to an end. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 727, 13, 70, 'have seen that happen in different countries that God puts it to an end');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 727, 14, 70, 'after some time. You see that happen in Rome. There was terrible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 727, 15, 70, 'persecution in the second and third centuries. In the beginning of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 727, 16, 70, 'fourth century, God put it to an end. Similarly, this time will be cut');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 727, 17, 70, 'short.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 727, 18, 70, 'In those days, if anyone says, “O, He has come! He is there!” or, “The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 727, 19, 70, 'rapture has taken place!” do not believe it. Paul writes in 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 727, 20, 70, 'Thessalonians 4:17 about the coming of Christ and our rapture and being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 727, 21, 70, 'taken up to be with Him. Now Paul writes starting in 2 Thessalonians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 727, 22, 70, '2:1, “Now we request you brethren, with regard to the coming of our Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 727, 23, 70, 'Jesus and our gathering together to Him. Do not be shaken from your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 727, 24, 70, 'composure or be disturbed, either by some person claiming to speak in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 727, 25, 70, 'spirit, or a message saying that the rapture has taken place and the day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 727, 26, 70, 'of the Lord has come, and you fellas are left behind. Do not believe it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 727, 27, 70, 'Let no one deceive you, because that day will not come until first there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 727, 28, 70, 'is a great falling away in the church (we see this happening now), and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 728, 1, 70, 'until the man of lawlessness, the son of perdition and of destruction');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 728, 2, 70, 'who opposes and exalts himself, is revealed. That day will not come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 728, 3, 70, 'until the antichrist is revealed. Do you not remember that while I was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 728, 4, 70, 'with you, I was telling you these things? You know that now that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 728, 5, 70, 'power of God is restraining him until that particular time when that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 728, 6, 70, 'power will move out of way so that he can be revealed.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 728, 7, 70, 'God restrains many things in this world. He restrains demons from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 728, 8, 70, 'possessing every human being. There is a restraining force on earth, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 728, 9, 70, 'there is a restraint upon the coming forth of the antichrist. He has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 728, 10, 70, 'waited for two thousand years. One day that restraining force will move');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 728, 11, 70, 'out of the way, and the antichrist will be revealed. Some people say the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 728, 12, 70, 'Holy Spirit will be removed, but no, the Holy Spirit will be here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 728, 13, 70, 'because nobody is going to be converted without the Holy Spirit. People');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 728, 14, 70, 'will be converted in the days of the antichrist because the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 728, 15, 70, 'leads people to repentance. The Holy Spirit will be here very much so.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 728, 16, 70, 'We hardly hear anybody telling us of the tremendous time of persecution');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 728, 17, 70, 'that we will face, a time so difficult that Jesus says, "And unless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 728, 18, 70, 'those days had been cut off, no life would have been saved" (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 728, 19, 70, '24:22).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 728, 20, 70, 'The Rapture');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 728, 21, 70, 'Jesus says in Matthew 24:24-27, “False Christs and false prophets will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 728, 22, 70, 'arise and will show great signs and wonders, and mislead, if possible,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 728, 23, 70, 'even the elect. I have told you in advance. I warned you in advance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 728, 24, 70, 'There is going to be deception, fake miracles, and do not believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 728, 25, 70, 'anybody who says ‘He is coming here,’ or ‘He is coming there,’ or that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 728, 26, 70, 'the rapture is taking place in secret. Do not believe it if anyone says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 728, 27, 70, '‘He is in the wilderness,’ or ‘He is here! He is in the inner rooms!'' Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 728, 28, 70, 'not believe it when somebody says, ‘Christ came to my room and sat');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 729, 1, 70, 'beside me.’ Do not believe it because when He comes, it will not be in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 729, 2, 70, 'secret. Just as the lightning comes from the east and flashes to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 729, 3, 70, 'west, so will the coming of Son of Man be.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 729, 4, 70, 'It is such a crystal-clear statement of the Lord. I cannot understand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 729, 5, 70, 'how anybody in the world can believe that the coming of the Lord is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 729, 6, 70, 'secret. The coming of the Son of Man will be like lightning. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 729, 7, 70, 'teaching of a secret rapture is only about a hundred and fifty years old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 729, 8, 70, 'in Christendom. The early apostles never believed it, and the early');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 729, 9, 70, 'Christians never believed it. Nowhere is that written in the Scriptures!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 729, 10, 70, 'People in persecuted countries never believed it. It arose in countries');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 729, 11, 70, 'that never had persecution for years, such as England and America. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 729, 12, 70, 'is where the teaching of a secret rapture originated. But because they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 729, 13, 70, 'had a great influence on Christianity around the world, they spread that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 729, 14, 70, 'doctrine around the world. People spread it through the Scofield Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 729, 15, 70, 'and gradually, everybody began to believe it. But it is not the truth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 729, 16, 70, 'and a lot of people have been deceived. They will not be ready for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 729, 17, 70, 'tribulation because the devil has fooled them to believe that they will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 729, 18, 70, 'never face it. It is better to believe what the Bible says.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 729, 19, 70, 'Jesus said in Matthew 24:28, “Wherever the corpse is, there the vultures');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 729, 20, 70, 'will gather.” Jesus is using an illustration. The vultures gather where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 729, 21, 70, 'there is a corpse. Perhaps it means that it will be a time of great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 729, 22, 70, 'judgment, and many will die when Christ comes. Or perhaps it means that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 729, 23, 70, 'we will be drawn to Christ just like vultures are drawn to the corpse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 729, 24, 70, 'automatically. We do not know exactly, and we would not like to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 729, 25, 70, 'dogmatic on that interpretation. As to when the rapture will take place,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 729, 26, 70, 'the answer is here in Matthew 24:29, “Immediately after tribulation (the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 729, 27, 70, 'great tribulation He mentioned in Matthew 24:21), the sun will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 729, 28, 70, 'darkened, and the moon will not give its light, and the stars will fall');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 730, 1, 70, 'from the sky, and the powers of the heavens will be shaken. And then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 730, 2, 70, '(only then!) after that, the sign of the Son of Man will appear in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 730, 3, 70, 'sky. All the tribes of the earth will mourn, and they will see Son of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 730, 4, 70, 'Man coming on the clouds of the sky with power and great glory. He will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 730, 5, 70, 'send forth His angels with a great trumpet and they will gather together');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 730, 6, 70, 'His elect from the four winds, from one end of the sky to the other.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 730, 7, 70, 'That is the time when His elect are going to be gathered up in rapture.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 730, 8, 70, 'This fits in with what is written in 1 Thessalonians 4, where we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 730, 9, 70, 'told about the details of the rapture, but not about the time. In 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 730, 10, 70, 'Thessalonians 4:16, it says that the Lord Himself will descend. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 730, 11, 70, 'speaks with a shout, the voice of the Archangel, and the trumpet of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 730, 12, 70, 'Notice these expressions, “Lord will descend,” “the Archangel,” “trumpet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 730, 13, 70, 'of God,” and “we who are alive will be caught up together in the clouds');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 730, 14, 70, 'to meet the Lord in the air.” Notice the same things are mentioned in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 730, 15, 70, 'Matthew 24: the sign of the Son of Man will appear in the sky (Mathew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 730, 16, 70, '24:30), the trumpet (Matthew 24:31), and the angels and the elect being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 730, 17, 70, 'raptured up (Matthew 24:31). When will it take place? It is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 730, 18, 70, 'mentioned in 1 Thessalonians 4, but mentioned in Matthew 24:29. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 730, 19, 70, 'rapture will happen immediately after the great tribulation, after the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 730, 20, 70, 'antichrist is revealed. This is similar to what is written in 2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 730, 21, 70, 'Thessalonians 2.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 730, 22, 70, 'It is so crystal clear! I do not know how in the world Satan has managed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 730, 23, 70, 'to fool millions of Christians. I will tell you how. They do not study');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 730, 24, 70, 'the Bible. They just believe what some preacher says. If you have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 730, 25, 70, 'Bible in your own language and you do not read it, then you deserve to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 730, 26, 70, 'be deceived. That is clear. I want to encourage you to read the Bible so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 730, 27, 70, 'that you will never be deceived.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 730, 28, 70, 'Next, He speaks about one single sign, the sign of the fig tree. “When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 731, 1, 70, 'its branch has already become tender and puts forth its leaves, you know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 731, 2, 70, 'that summer is near” (Matthew 24:32). That is referring to the nation of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 731, 3, 70, 'Israel. We considered the fig tree being cursed earlier in this study.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 731, 4, 70, 'But it will “put forth its leaves” again. This is not referring to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 731, 5, 70, 'something spiritual in the nation of Israel. There is no fruit there.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 731, 6, 70, 'But Israel will come forth as a nation again. That dead fig tree is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 731, 7, 70, 'going to be revived. “Then you know that summer is here. Even so, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 731, 8, 70, 'know when these things happen, recognize that Jesus is near. His coming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 731, 9, 70, 'is near. That generation will not pass away until all these things take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 731, 10, 70, 'place” (Matthew 24:33-34). That is why we feel that we are in the last');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 731, 11, 70, 'generation. How long until that is going to take place? Whether this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 731, 12, 70, 'generation is for seventy years or forty years, I do not know, but it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 731, 13, 70, 'going to be the last generation. We see all these signs. Jesus said in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 731, 14, 70, 'Matthew 24:26, “Heaven and earth will pass away, but My words will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 731, 15, 70, 'pass away. But that day and hour no one knows.” No one knows the exact');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 731, 16, 70, 'date. That is clear. All these people who claim to predict an exact date');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 731, 17, 70, 'are just fooling you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 731, 18, 70, 'But He said “you will know when He is near.” There are two truths here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 731, 19, 70, 'in Matthew 24:33. You will know when He is near, but the exact day and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 731, 20, 70, 'hour no one will know. We are not to look for an exact date like some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 731, 21, 70, 'people saying that on such-and-such date, Christ will come. Through the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 731, 22, 70, 'years, so many people have predicted Christ’s return and all that turned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 731, 23, 70, 'out to be false. But at the same time, we are not to remain in ignorance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 731, 24, 70, 'of it saying, “Well, it is just the same as it has always been.” Peter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 731, 25, 70, 'says that critics will say that a lot of people have been talking about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 731, 26, 70, 'the coming of Christ for ages, but everything is going on just like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 731, 27, 70, 'before. In 2 Peter 3:4, Peter writes, “Where is the promise of His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 731, 28, 70, 'coming? Since the fathers fell asleep everything is going on just like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 732, 1, 70, 'in the beginning of creation…”. But it escapes their notice that God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 732, 2, 70, 'waiting patiently.” We will know that the coming of Christ is near, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 732, 3, 70, 'we do not know the exact date. Let us be ready for His coming.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 732, 4, 71, 'Chapter 70 The Second Coming of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 732, 5, 71, 'Jesus Gave up His Omniscience');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 732, 6, 71, '“But of that day and hour no one knows, not even the angels of heaven,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 732, 7, 71, 'nor the Son, but the Father alone” (Matthew 24:36). This is another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 732, 8, 71, 'proof that Jesus Christ had become completely man and temporarily gave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 732, 9, 71, 'up the privileges of deity. One of the privileges of God is omniscience');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 732, 10, 71, '- the ability to know everything. God knows everything, and Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 732, 11, 71, 'Christ, being equal with the Father from all eternity as Son of God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 732, 12, 71, 'knew everything when He was in Heaven. When He came to Earth, He took');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 732, 13, 71, 'upon Himself the limitations of man. One of the limitations of man is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 732, 14, 71, 'that we don''t know everything. Our mind is limited in knowledge and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 732, 15, 71, 'understanding, especially of the future. So Jesus could say as a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 732, 16, 71, 'that He didn’t know the date of His second coming (Matthew 24:36); but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 732, 17, 71, 'that''s not true today, because Jesus has gone back to Heaven. He has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 732, 18, 71, 'gone back to the position of being equal with the Father,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 732, 19, 71, 'End Times like the Days of Noah');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 732, 20, 71, 'In Matthew 24:37-39, Jesus says, “But the coming of the Son of Man is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 732, 21, 71, 'like the days of Noah. For as in those days which were before the flood');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 732, 22, 71, 'they were eating and drinking, marrying, giving in marriage, until that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 732, 23, 71, 'day Noah entered the ark, and they did not understand until the flood');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 732, 24, 71, 'came and took them all away, so shall the coming of the Son of Man be.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 732, 25, 71, 'This means that judgment will come suddenly. The people who were in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 732, 26, 71, 'Noah’s time saw the animals getting inside the ark. At least that should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 732, 27, 71, 'have woken some of them up to come to Noah and repent in the last');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 732, 28, 71, 'minute. But their hearts were so hardened that even when they saw that,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 733, 1, 71, 'they did not repent of their sin. Rain had never fallen on Earth since');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 733, 2, 71, 'the days of Adam (Genesis 2). There was no rain those days, but still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 733, 3, 71, 'Noah was preaching that there was going to be rain, and all of a sudden,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 733, 4, 71, 'the rain came and flooded the earth, and everybody was killed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 733, 5, 71, 'It is going to be like that when Jesus comes again. The warning signs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 733, 6, 71, 'will be there, but people will ignore them. “In that day two men will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 733, 7, 71, 'in the field; one will be taken and the other will be left. Two women');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 733, 8, 71, 'will be grinding in the mill; one will be taken and the other will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 733, 9, 71, 'left” (Matthew 24:40,41). Suddenly, judgment will come, and some will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 733, 10, 71, 'taken up to be with the Lord, while others will be left behind. Some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 733, 11, 71, 'will be judged, and some will escape judgment. So what shall we do? We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 733, 12, 71, 'should not concentrate on trying to find out when these things are going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 733, 13, 71, 'to take place, because nobody knows the exact day or hour. We just see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 733, 14, 71, 'the general signs - the nation of Israel is becoming one - and we know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 733, 15, 71, 'that He is near.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 733, 16, 71, 'Wait Faithfully for the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 733, 17, 71, 'The whole purpose of the Lord talking about His second coming was to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 733, 18, 71, 'enable us to be on the alert. We don''t know which day He is coming, so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 733, 19, 71, 'we must always be on the alert. That means we must be ready at all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 733, 20, 71, 'times. It''s something like a bridegroom who is engaged to a girl. He has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 733, 21, 71, 'gone on a long journey to a far country and tells her to wait for Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 733, 22, 71, 'The faithful virgin will wait faithfully until he returns. She will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 733, 23, 71, 'refuse other offers for marriage because she is waiting for her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 733, 24, 71, 'bridegroom. That''s the way a true Christian should be waiting, not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 733, 25, 71, 'allowing the world and other things to drive him away from devotion to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 733, 26, 71, 'Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 733, 27, 71, 'The Lord is testing His bride to see whether she will be faithful. What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 733, 28, 71, 'would you think of a girl who is engaged to a man but is also fooling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 734, 1, 71, 'around with other men? One would call her a harlot, and that''s what you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 734, 2, 71, 'read of in the last chapters of Revelation - “Babylon the harlot” and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 734, 3, 71, '“Jerusalem the bride.” In the period before Christ comes, there are two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 734, 4, 71, 'attitudes that people who call themselves believers can have. One is of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 734, 5, 71, 'devotion to Christ and faithfulness to their absent Bridegroom. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 734, 6, 71, 'other is of playing the fool with the world and living for oneself,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 734, 7, 71, 'thinking that because the Bridegroom''s coming is delayed, it doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 734, 8, 71, 'matter how they live. Such people will get a tremendous shock when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 734, 9, 71, 'Christ comes back. Therefore Jesus says to “be on the alert, for you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 734, 10, 71, 'don''t know when the Lord is coming” (Matthew 24:42).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 734, 11, 71, 'He Will Come like a Thief to Unbelievers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 734, 12, 71, '“But be sure of this, that if the head of the house had known at what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 734, 13, 71, 'time of the night the thief was coming, he would have been on the alert');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 734, 14, 71, 'and would not have allowed his house to be broken into. For this reason');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 734, 15, 71, 'you be ready too; for the Son of Man is coming at an hour when you do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 734, 16, 71, 'not think He will” (Matthew 24:43). If a thief had given advance warning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 734, 17, 71, 'to a house saying, “I''m coming there at 2:45 tomorrow morning, so be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 734, 18, 71, 'ready,” the house owner would have been ready. But no thief gives any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 734, 19, 71, 'warning like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 734, 20, 71, 'The coming of Christ is likened to the coming of a thief in the night');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 734, 21, 71, 'for the unbeliever. Many Christians misunderstand that, and think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 734, 22, 71, 'Christ’s coming will be like a thief in the night even for believers,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 734, 23, 71, 'but that is not so. 1 Thessalonians 5: 2-4, “You yourselves know full');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 734, 24, 71, 'well that the day of the Lord will come just like a thief in the night.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 734, 25, 71, 'While they are saying, “Peace and safety!” then destruction will come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 734, 26, 71, 'upon them suddenly. But you, brethren, are not in darkness, that the day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 734, 27, 71, 'should overtake you like a thief.” For the unbelievers the day will come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 734, 28, 71, 'like a thief, but we should be expecting it. We are sons of light, sons');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 735, 1, 71, 'of the day. We don''t belong to the night or the darkness. So then let us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 735, 2, 71, 'not sleep spiritually as others do, but always be on the alert and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 735, 3, 71, 'sober. “For those who sleep, sleep at night and those who get drunk, get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 735, 4, 71, 'drunk at night. But since we are of the day, let us be sober, having as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 735, 5, 71, 'a helmet the hope of salvation” (1 Thessalonians 5:5-8).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 735, 6, 71, 'It is very clear that for believers, the coming of Christ will not be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 735, 7, 71, 'like a thief in the night. A person who is a child of light is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 735, 8, 71, 'living in darkness; his life is in the light all the time. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 735, 9, 71, 'compares His coming to the suddenness and unexpectedness of a thief in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 735, 10, 71, 'the night for the unbeliever. It is very important for us to understand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 735, 11, 71, 'this as we read Matthew 24:43.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 735, 12, 71, 'The Faithful and Unfaithful Slaves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 735, 13, 71, 'Then, in Matthew 24:45, Jesus says, “Who then is the faithful and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 735, 14, 71, 'sensible slave whom his master will put in charge of his household to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 735, 15, 71, 'give them their food at the proper time?” This is a very important verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 735, 16, 71, 'for all true servants of the Lord. A servant of the Lord must be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 735, 17, 71, 'faithful and a wise steward. Faithfulness in small things and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 735, 18, 71, 'ability to handle everything (his time, life, money, etc.) in a wise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 735, 19, 71, 'manner is very important. The Master puts such people in charge of His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 735, 20, 71, 'family. The Master doesn''t handle everything in the family Himself. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 735, 21, 71, 'has appointed apostles, prophets, and elders to be in charge of His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 735, 22, 71, 'family, and their job is to give the household the right food at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 735, 23, 71, 'right time. This is the calling of every true servant of God. God needs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 735, 24, 71, 'someone who is faithful and wise, and who will stick to doing the job');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 735, 25, 71, 'that God has given him to do. “Blessed is that slave whom his master');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 735, 26, 71, 'finds so doing when he comes” (Matthew 24:46). This means that, when the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 735, 27, 71, 'Lord comes, he is faithful to do that particular thing which his Master');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 735, 28, 71, 'called him to do. What will the Master do when He sees His servant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 736, 1, 71, 'faithfully serving Him when He comes? He will put Him in charge of all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 736, 2, 71, 'His possessions.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 736, 3, 71, '“But if that slave says, ‘Well my master is not going to come for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 736, 4, 71, 'long, long time,’ and instead of being faithful to his job, he plays the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 736, 5, 71, 'fool and begins to enjoy himself, and beats his fellow slaves and eats');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 736, 6, 71, 'and drinks with the drunkards…” (Matthew 24:48-49). What does it mean to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 736, 7, 71, 'beat fellow slaves? A lot of preachers beat people in their messages.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 736, 8, 71, 'We''re not supposed to beat people. There is a contrast given here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 736, 9, 71, 'between feeding them the food at the proper time (verse 45), and beating');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 736, 10, 71, 'them (verse 49). If you preach God''s Word, do you feed, or do you beat?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 736, 11, 71, 'If you beat, you’re neither a faithful slave nor a faithful servant of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 736, 12, 71, 'God. You have to feed the people, not beat them. This shows the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 736, 13, 71, 'difference between a true faithful servant of God and one who is not.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 736, 14, 71, 'Those of you who don''t preach but are listening to other preachers --');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 736, 15, 71, 'keep your ears open. Do you sense that the preacher is trying to beat');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 736, 16, 71, 'you? Then he is not a servant of God, and you should just ignore him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 736, 17, 71, 'If, however, you find that he is feeding you, then he is a true servant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 736, 18, 71, 'of God. Sometimes when a preacher tries to challenge you, it may feel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 736, 19, 71, 'like you’re being beaten up, but you can sense in your spirit that he''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 736, 20, 71, 'trying to encourage you to a higher life. We need to distinguish between');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 736, 21, 71, 'that feeling and the beating that some people give from a pulpit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 736, 22, 71, 'accusing people that, “you''re like this,” and, “you''re good for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 736, 23, 71, 'nothing,” etc. You have to be careful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 736, 24, 71, '“The master of that slave will come on a day when he does not expect him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 736, 25, 71, 'and at an hour which he does not know” - this is the word to all those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 736, 26, 71, 'preachers who beat others from the pulpit - “he will cut him in pieces');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 736, 27, 71, 'and assign him a place with the hypocrites, where there will be weeping');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 736, 28, 71, 'and the gnashing of teeth” (Matthew 24:50-51). It’s a pretty serious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 737, 1, 71, 'thing to beat God''s children from the pulpit, and God takes it very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 737, 2, 71, 'seriously. Brother, be sure when you speak God''s Word that you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 737, 3, 71, 'beat people but feed them. Be a faithful servant. God needs such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 737, 4, 71, 'faithful servants in the last day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 737, 5, 71, 'Jesus replies to the question about the second coming over the course of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 737, 6, 71, 'many verses, and He focuses much more on how to be ready than on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 737, 7, 71, 'details of His coming. A lot of people are very excited to study the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 737, 8, 71, 'signs of the second coming of Christ - there are people who write books');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 737, 9, 71, 'on it and become millionaires, but that''s not the point. We are called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 737, 10, 71, 'to be ready for a second coming, not just to know all the signs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 737, 11, 71, 'Parable of the Virgins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 737, 12, 71, 'Jesus speaks about being ready for His second coming as a servant of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 737, 13, 71, 'in Matthew 24:42-51. Then in Matthew 25, He teaches three parables that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 737, 14, 71, 'speak about being ready for His coming in different aspects. The first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 737, 15, 71, 'is concerning our inner life. In Matthew 25:1-13, Jesus says, “The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 737, 16, 71, 'kingdom of heaven can be compared to ten virgins, who took their lamps');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 737, 17, 71, 'and went out to meet the bridegroom.” This is a picture of Christians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 737, 18, 71, 'waiting for the coming of Christ, “five of them were foolish, and five');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 737, 19, 71, 'were wise or prudent.” And their foolishness and wisdom were seen in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 737, 20, 71, 'that, “The foolish took their lamps as they were burning, but they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 737, 21, 71, 'didn’t take any extra oil (more than what was in the lamp) with them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 737, 22, 71, 'The wise took oil in a small flask along with their lamps (perhaps they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 737, 23, 71, 'had a little pocket in their gown or robe in which they put this flask');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 737, 24, 71, 'of oil). And while the bridegroom was delaying, they all got drowsy and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 737, 25, 71, 'began to sleep (the bridegroom delayed, he didn''t come when they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 737, 26, 71, 'expected him to come). And at midnight there was a shout saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 737, 27, 71, '‘Behold, the bridegroom! Come out to meet him.’ Then all the virgins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 737, 28, 71, 'rose and trimmed their lamps (all ten began to trim their lamps because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 738, 1, 71, 'their lamps had been burning), but the foolish said to the wise, ‘Our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 738, 2, 71, 'lamps are dying out, please give us some of your oil’ (this shows that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 738, 3, 71, 'their lamp had been burning all that time, but now they were dying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 738, 4, 71, 'out)….”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 738, 5, 71, 'This is not talking about believers and unbelievers. Virgins whose lamps');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 738, 6, 71, 'are burning, who go out to meet the bridegroom, are obviously born-again');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 738, 7, 71, 'Christians. But something is missing in five of them: a flask full of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 738, 8, 71, 'oil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 738, 9, 71, '“…The wise answered them saying, ‘How can we give you the oil? There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 738, 10, 71, 'won''t be enough for us. This is not something we can give you. Go to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 738, 11, 71, 'dealers and buy some for yourself.’” The man who found the hidden');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 738, 12, 71, 'treasure in the field sold all that he had and bought it. The man who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 738, 13, 71, 'found the pearl of a good price bought it. Paul says, “I count');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 738, 14, 71, 'everything as loss, as rubbish, for the sake of Christ whom I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 738, 15, 71, 'found” (Philippians 3:8). There is a price to be paid here. Revelation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 738, 16, 71, '3:18 says, “I counsel thee to buy from Me gold tried in fire and buy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 738, 17, 71, 'from Me eye salve to anoint your eyes, so you can see…” There are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 738, 18, 71, 'certain things in the Christian life that have to be bought, that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 738, 19, 71, 'have to pay a price for. Forgiveness of sins is free, receiving the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 738, 20, 71, 'Spirit and baptism in the Holy Spirit are free, but there are many other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 738, 21, 71, 'things in the Christian life for which you have to pay a price. To');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 738, 22, 71, 'develop your character to be more like Christ, you have to pay a price.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 738, 23, 71, 'And so the wise people say, “Hey, there were dealers all along who can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 738, 24, 71, 'give you oil.” And I believe that the dealers of the oil are the trials');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 738, 25, 71, 'and the circumstances that we face in life. If we ignore them, we won’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 738, 26, 71, 'get oil. We must make use of all these dealers that come our way. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 738, 27, 71, 'are many trials and circumstances that we face in our life, and we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 738, 28, 71, 'get oil from each one of them so that we can be ready to meet Jesus when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 739, 1, 71, 'He comes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 739, 2, 71, '“…While the unwise virgins were going away to make the purchase, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 739, 3, 71, 'bridegroom came, and those who were ready went in with him to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 739, 4, 71, 'wedding feast; and the door was shut (there is a time going to come when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 739, 5, 71, 'the door will be shut). Later the other foolish virgins also came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 739, 6, 71, 'saying, ‘Lord, lord open for us,’ but he answered, ‘Truly I say to you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 739, 7, 71, 'I do not know you.’ So be on the alert, for you do not know the day nor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 739, 8, 71, 'the hour” (Matthew 25:1-13).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 739, 9, 71, 'Jesus taught that there will be people who would not be ready for His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 739, 10, 71, 'coming, even though they were virgins, and even though they had their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 739, 11, 71, 'lamps burning in the beginning. Suppose the bridegroom had come one hour');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 739, 12, 71, 'earlier, at 11pm. The five foolish virgins would have looked like wise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 739, 13, 71, 'virgins because their lamps were burning. When they started out, all 10');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 739, 14, 71, 'had their lamps burning, but it was the delay of the bridegroom that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 739, 15, 71, 'revealed the folly of the foolish virgins.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 739, 16, 71, 'Time Reveals True Heart Condition');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 739, 17, 71, 'Time has a way of revealing many things. Many believers may seem to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 739, 18, 71, 'very wholehearted and zealous. I always say, wait and see. Time will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 739, 19, 71, 'show whether a person is faithful and steadfast; fruit will come from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 739, 20, 71, 'his life. Do not form a quick judgment and assume that he is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 739, 21, 71, 'wholehearted, because many who appeared to have their lamps burning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 739, 22, 71, 'don''t have any oil in secret; they don''t have any hidden life. The wise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 739, 23, 71, 'virgins had a lamp burning on the outside and a flask of oil in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 739, 24, 71, 'pockets. It''s a picture of a believer who''s got a lamp - the light of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 739, 25, 71, 'his life burning clearly as a testimony to others - but he also has an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 739, 26, 71, 'extra supply, areas in his life which are yielded to the Holy Spirit,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 739, 27, 71, 'filled with the Holy Spirit -- that''s the flask full of oil. Oil is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 739, 28, 71, 'picture the Holy Spirit. This person has a flask full of oil and inner');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 740, 1, 71, 'devotion to Jesus Christ, the love of God shed abroad in his heart by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 740, 2, 71, 'the Holy Spirit, and love for God and for others. The foolish virgins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 740, 3, 71, 'just live for the moment. They are not worried about the future, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 740, 4, 71, 'just make sure there''s enough oil to burn right now. Their life is very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 740, 5, 71, 'superficial, and time is what exposes them. Time is a great revealer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 740, 6, 71, 'Some Christians are like shooting stars - they suddenly appear in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 740, 7, 71, 'sky and they seem so zealous and on fire, but a year later, you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 740, 8, 71, 'know where they are. Their lamp has died out. Time is a great revealer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 740, 9, 71, 'of everything, and when Christ comes, then it will be too late to go and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 740, 10, 71, '“look for oil,” to seek for the fullness of the Spirit and be ready in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 740, 11, 71, 'our inner life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 740, 12, 71, 'To Be Ready, Be Filled with the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 740, 13, 71, 'Now is the time to make sure your flask is full of oil, that your heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 740, 14, 71, 'is full of love. Now is the time to make sure that there is no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 740, 15, 71, 'bitterness, no unforgiving spirit, and no jealousy. Make sure that every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 740, 16, 71, 'nook and corner of your heart has been filled by the Holy Spirit and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 740, 17, 71, 'love of God, for that is the flask of oil that will prepare you for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 740, 18, 71, 'last days. The five wise had a flask full of oil symbolizing the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 740, 19, 71, 'fullness of the Holy Spirit; a heart full of love that enabled them to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 740, 20, 71, 'endure until the end. That links with Matthew 24:12-13 because sin is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 740, 21, 71, 'going to increase in the last days and most people’s love will grow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 740, 22, 71, 'cold. The flame is going to die out. If you don''t have a fullness of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 740, 23, 71, 'Holy Spirit within flooding your heart with God''s love, as it says in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 740, 24, 71, 'Romans 5:5, you will not be able to endure until the end. The one who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 740, 25, 71, 'endures until the end will be saved. The five wise virgins endured till');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 740, 26, 71, 'the end because they had a flask of oil, symbolizing the fullness of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 740, 27, 71, 'Holy Spirit that floods our heart with love for God and love for one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 740, 28, 71, 'another. That''s what we need to seek earnestly in these days, and that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 741, 1, 71, 'is the way to be prepared and alert for the coming of the Lord. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 741, 2, 71, 'not just keeping our good conscience, but also really seeking to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 741, 3, 71, 'filled with the Holy Spirit within, and to have the love of God within');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 741, 4, 71, 'our hearts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 741, 5, 71, 'There is so much deception in the world today; make sure your heart is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 741, 6, 71, 'filled with the genuine Holy Spirit. Many are going around leading');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 741, 7, 71, 'people to counterfeit experiences of “the fullness of the Holy Spirit.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 741, 8, 71, 'If it is really the fullness of the Holy Spirit, it will make the lamp');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 741, 9, 71, 'burn bright. The light is the life of Jesus. “In Him was life and that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 741, 10, 71, 'life was the light of men” (John 1:4). That life is the thing that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 741, 11, 71, 'need, and for that we need to be filled with the Holy Spirit. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 741, 12, 71, 'God''s will. So I want to encourage you to seek to be filled with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 741, 13, 71, 'Holy Spirit, seek that your flask is full of oil so that your light can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 741, 14, 71, 'burn bright, and that the life of Jesus can come forth from you. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 741, 15, 71, 'the only way to be ready for the second coming of Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 741, 16, 72, 'Chapter 71 Parable of Talents');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 741, 17, 72, 'Proper Stewardship of God’s Gifts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 741, 18, 72, 'The first parable that Jesus spoke in relation to being prepared for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 741, 19, 72, 'second coming of Christ was in Matthew 24:43 onwards, about a servant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 741, 20, 72, 'who is always ready serve people. He knows the Lord will come suddenly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 741, 21, 72, 'and gives the people food at the proper time. Next, in Matthew 25:1-13');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 741, 22, 72, 'Jesus speaks of our personal life and our walk with God. In verse 14');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 741, 23, 72, 'onward, He talks about our ministry and the gifts God has given us. Each');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 741, 24, 72, 'of these parables has a different aspect of the Christian life, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 741, 25, 72, 'first for those who are given responsibility in God''s house to serve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 741, 26, 72, 'God''s people, the second one about the virgins, about our personal life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 741, 27, 72, 'and the third one about being faithful with the gifts God has given us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 741, 28, 72, 'Matthew 25:14 says, “The kingdom of heaven is like a man who is going on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 742, 1, 72, 'a long journey,” that''s the picture of Christ who is going to heaven and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 742, 2, 72, 'will return after two thousand years, “who called on his own slaves and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 742, 3, 72, 'entrusted his possessions to them.” The gifts of the Spirit are God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 742, 4, 72, 'possessions. They are not ours. He has entrusted them to us to be used');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 742, 5, 72, 'as stewards for His glory. We are not supposed to use any gift that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 742, 6, 72, 'gives us for our own glory, yet so many people do that. They use God’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 742, 7, 72, 'gifts, whether preaching or healing, to get honor and glory and a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 742, 8, 72, 'money for themselves. That''s a sin. It''s a crime. When it comes to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 742, 9, 72, 'gifts, God gives different numbers of gifts to different people. Some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 742, 10, 72, 'have more and some have less. Not all are equal.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 742, 11, 72, 'There is another parable in Luke 19 where everybody gets the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 742, 12, 72, 'amount. In Luke 19:11 onwards, Jesus speaks about a man who called his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 742, 13, 72, 'slaves and gave them each of them one mina. There, everybody was equal.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 742, 14, 72, 'That refers to areas in our life where we are all equal as believers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 742, 15, 72, 'For example all of us have 24 hours a day. What we do with our time is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 742, 16, 72, 'up to us. It could also refer to temptation. The range of temptations is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 742, 17, 72, 'exactly the same for all human beings. We are all tempted to anger,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 742, 18, 72, 'lust, be selfish, proud, bitter, jealous, etc. Different people overcome');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 742, 19, 72, 'to different extents.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 742, 20, 72, 'God''s Sovereign Choice of Gifts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 742, 21, 72, 'In this parable, Jesus is talking about different levels of gifts that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 742, 22, 72, 'He has given to different people. To one He has given five, to another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 742, 23, 72, 'two, and to another one. We may ask why God has given more to some and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 742, 24, 72, 'less to others. That is His sovereign choice. 1 Corinthians 12 says that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 742, 25, 72, 'the Holy Spirit sovereignly chooses whom to give what gifts to and we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 742, 26, 72, 'cannot question it. He chooses one to be an apostle and another to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 742, 27, 72, 'just a help, which is also a gift (1 Corinthians 12:28). God sovereignly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 742, 28, 72, 'chooses that; we cannot decide what we want. The Bible does say that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 743, 1, 72, 'can all seek to prophesy. We can’t be prophets, but we can all seek to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 743, 2, 72, 'prophesy. Other than that, it is God Who sovereignly chooses to give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 743, 3, 72, 'gifts to each person. Think of a man like the Apostle Paul. He was an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 743, 4, 72, 'apostle, prophet, evangelist, teacher, and shepherd all rolled into one.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 743, 5, 72, 'He had all five. Some have received two, and some have one.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 743, 6, 72, 'What matters is what we do with these gifts. The one who received the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 743, 7, 72, 'five talents went and traded with them and gained five more talents. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 743, 8, 72, 'was something immediate; he didn''t waste time. It is a wonderful thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 743, 9, 72, 'when God gives us the Holy Spirit''s power and certain gifts that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 743, 10, 72, 'immediately begin to use them to serve and earn something for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 743, 11, 72, 'Master. This man was not earning for himself. The five talents that he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 743, 12, 72, 'got were to be given to the master; that is the important thing. We must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 743, 13, 72, 'remember that when God gives us a gift and we get something from it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 743, 14, 72, 'it''s His! Whatever profit you get from the exercise of your gift does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 743, 15, 72, 'not belong to you. It belongs to the Lord. The one who is faithful will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 743, 16, 72, 'recognize that. He won''t take the credit or glory to himself. He will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 743, 17, 72, 'give it all to the Lord. We are earning for the Lord; we are seeking the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 743, 18, 72, 'preeminence of Christ in everything. In the same manner, the one who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 743, 19, 72, 'received two talents went and gained two more. He also did it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 743, 20, 72, 'immediately. But the one who received one talent went away, dug it in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 743, 21, 72, 'the ground, and hid his master''s money.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 743, 22, 72, 'This is the person who perhaps used his one talent to get some honor for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 743, 23, 72, 'himself. “Dug it in the ground” means he connected it to this earth, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 743, 24, 72, 'used it in a very earthly way. How do people use earthly gifts? For');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 743, 25, 72, 'themselves! They don''t use them for the glory of God or for others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 743, 26, 72, 'Worldly-minded people don''t seek the glory of God. This is a picture of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 743, 27, 72, 'a man who had a gift and he buried it in the ground. He behaved just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 743, 28, 72, 'like worldly people with that gift. He used it for his own glory, honor,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 744, 1, 72, 'or to make money for himself, and there are millions of people like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 744, 2, 72, 'this, or who just don''t do anything with it. God gives them a gift and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 744, 3, 72, 'they just bury it and forget it because they''re busy making money or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 744, 4, 72, 'doing something else in the world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 744, 5, 72, 'So he dug it in the ground and hid his master’s money. After a long time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 744, 6, 72, 'the master of the slaves came and settled accounts with them (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 744, 7, 72, '25:19). “The one who had received the five talents came up and brought');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 744, 8, 72, 'five more talents saying, ‘You entrusted me five talents, see I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 744, 9, 72, 'gained five more talents.’ His master said, ‘Well done, good and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 744, 10, 72, 'faithful slave. You were faithful with the few things, I’ll put you in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 744, 11, 72, 'charge of many things. Enter into the joy of your master''. The one who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 744, 12, 72, 'received two talents came up and said, ''Master you entrusted me two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 744, 13, 72, 'talents, see I have gained two more.’ His master said, ''Well done, good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 744, 14, 72, 'and faithful slave. You were faithful with a few things, I will put you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 744, 15, 72, 'in charge of many things; enter into the joy of your lord.''”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 744, 16, 72, 'Notice that the reward or commendation that he gave to the person who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 744, 17, 72, 'earned five was exactly the same as what he gave to the person who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 744, 18, 72, 'earned two. When you see a man has two talents and someone else has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 744, 19, 72, 'five, you think the second man has more; yet in God''s eyes, they are the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 744, 20, 72, 'same. That is why the one who has five should not look down upon the one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 744, 21, 72, 'who has two or think he is better, because God has given him more! That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 744, 22, 72, 'is why he has more. God has given this man less because He is expecting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 744, 23, 72, 'less from Him. Ultimately, it''s a question of percentages. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 744, 24, 72, 'produced a return of two more from an initial two, you obtained a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 744, 25, 72, 'hundred percent increase. If the man with five talents produced only two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 744, 26, 72, 'more, he only got forty percent. His reward will be much lower than the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 744, 27, 72, 'man who earned two.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 744, 28, 72, 'This teaches us that we cannot compare the results of our service with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 745, 1, 72, 'one another. Unfortunately there is a lot of comparison amongst');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 745, 2, 72, 'Christians. One church compares itself with another church. Secretly one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 745, 3, 72, 'preacher compares his ministry with somebody else''s; he thinks he has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 745, 4, 72, 'accomplished so much for the Lord. It is very difficult to assess. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 745, 5, 72, 'almost impossible because God alone knows how much He has given us, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 745, 6, 72, 'it is percentage return that matters, not how many talents you have. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 745, 7, 72, 'God gave five and we get five, then it is a hundred percent. If God gave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 745, 8, 72, 'that man only two and he got two that would be 100 percent, and the man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 745, 9, 72, 'who got one only needs to get one more. He would get exactly the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 745, 10, 72, 'reward and commendation as the other two. It is very important to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 745, 11, 72, 'recognize this; any type of comparison of our own ministry and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 745, 12, 72, 'especially success in our ministry with somebody else''s is absolutely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 745, 13, 72, 'foolish.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 745, 14, 72, 'Why Talents Get Buried');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 745, 15, 72, 'It says further, “When the master came to the person who had one talent,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 745, 16, 72, 'the man said, ‘Master, I knew you to be a hard man, reaping where you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 745, 17, 72, 'did not sow, gathering where you scattered no seed. I was afraid, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 745, 18, 72, 'went away and hid your talent in the ground. See, what you have is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 745, 19, 72, 'yours.’ His master answered and said to him, ‘You wicked, lazy slave,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 745, 20, 72, 'you knew that I reap where I did not sow and gather where I scattered no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 745, 21, 72, 'seed. Then you ought to have put my money in the bank, and on my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 745, 22, 72, 'arrival, I would have received my money back with some interest. So take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 745, 23, 72, 'away the talent from him, and give it to the one who has ten talents’”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 745, 24, 72, '(Matthew 25:24-25).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 745, 25, 72, 'What do we learn from this? The man said, “I knew you to be a hard man.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 745, 26, 72, 'He had a wrong concept of God! That is why he buried the talent. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 745, 27, 72, 'thought God was a hard and demanding taskmaster who reaped where He had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 745, 28, 72, 'sowed nothing. God isn''t like that. God is so tender, compassionate,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 746, 1, 72, 'totally understanding, and forgiving. He''s not a hard Person at all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 746, 2, 72, 'When we have a wrong concept of God, the result is that we waste our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 746, 3, 72, 'life and we waste the talents God has given us. So it is very, very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 746, 4, 72, 'important to have a proper understanding of God as a very loving Father.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 746, 5, 72, 'Do you know God as a very, very loving Father? That is so important if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 746, 6, 72, 'we are to be effective in our service and if we are to be ready for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 746, 7, 72, 'coming of the Lord. Everything hinges on knowing the true nature of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 746, 8, 72, 'There are many Christians who think of God as a very hard, legalistic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 746, 9, 72, 'Person Who is sticky about rules, and that is because many preachers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 746, 10, 72, 'have portrayed Him that way. The way many preachers are sticky about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 746, 11, 72, 'little rules gives people the impression that God is like that. But He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 746, 12, 72, 'is not. God is totally unlike any preacher you have ever seen. He is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 746, 13, 72, 'kindest and most compassionate Person in the universe, a Person Who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 746, 14, 72, 'very easy to talk to, One Who understands everything about us – “like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 746, 15, 72, 'father has compassion on his children, so the Lord has compassion on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 746, 16, 72, 'those who fear Him,” the Bible says. Like a mother cares for a sucking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 746, 17, 72, 'child, God cares for us, but this person did not know that. It was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 746, 18, 72, 'wrong understanding of God that prevented him from making use of what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 746, 19, 72, 'God had given him. And that’s possibly true in your life as well. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 746, 20, 72, 'has given you things and you have not been able to use them to their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 746, 21, 72, 'full potential, not because you''re not faithful, but because you have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 746, 22, 72, 'wrong understanding of God. It is very important to recognize that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 746, 23, 72, 'What does the master call this person? He calls him a “wicked, lazy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 746, 24, 72, 'salve.” To be lazy is to be wicked. Why was he lazy? Because he couldn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 746, 25, 72, 'bother about trading that money. Serving God is a lot of hard work.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 746, 26, 72, 'There is no doubt about it. There is a certain amount of risk involved');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 746, 27, 72, 'in serving God as well. When you try to trade money, there is a certain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 746, 28, 72, 'amount of risk involved, but if we really trust God, He helps us. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 747, 1, 72, 'man was wicked and lazy, and that is what the Lord is going to say to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 747, 2, 72, 'anyone who has not used the talent God has given him. You need to ask');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 747, 3, 72, 'yourself whether you are using whatever God has given you. It may not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 747, 4, 72, 'only be in spiritual gifts. Maybe He has given you money to use for His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 747, 5, 72, 'service. To some He gives in abundance, to some a little less, some much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 747, 6, 72, 'less. But everyone has something that they can use. You have free time,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 747, 7, 72, 'energy, and spiritual gifts. Are you using them all for the glory of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 747, 8, 72, 'God? That''s a very, very important question.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 747, 9, 72, 'If you don''t, God says to take it away and give it to the one who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 747, 10, 72, 'already has ten, "For to everyone who has, shall more be given, and he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 747, 11, 72, 'shall have an abundance; but from the one who does not have, even what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 747, 12, 72, 'he does have shall be taken away. Cast out the worthless slave into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 747, 13, 72, 'outer darkness; in that place there will be weeping and gnashing of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 747, 14, 72, 'teeth" (Matthew 25:28-30). That''s a pretty terrifying thing; that if God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 747, 15, 72, 'has given us something and we just don''t care for it, if we waste it and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 747, 16, 72, 'spend it on ourselves, we can end up in outer darkness for all eternity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 747, 17, 72, 'We are answerable to God; that is what many Christians don''t realize.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 747, 18, 72, 'The very fact that we have life, that God has allowed us to be born on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 747, 19, 72, 'earth and we have the resources of earth God has given us brings upon us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 747, 20, 72, 'a tremendous responsibility. We are answerable to God for how we use the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 747, 21, 72, 'one life God has given us. If we neglect and bury it and don’t care for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 747, 22, 72, 'God, outer darkness is our eternal destiny.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 747, 23, 72, 'The meaning of verse 29 is that to everyone who has something and is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 747, 24, 72, 'faithful with what he has, God will give him more. “To everyone who has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 747, 25, 72, 'shall more be given.” Someone who has something, and is very faithful in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 747, 26, 72, 'using that thing for the glory of God, will have more given to him. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 747, 27, 72, 'if someone has something, and he doesn''t use it at all, then gradually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 747, 28, 72, 'he can lose even what he has. We need to heed the parable of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 748, 1, 72, 'talents.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 748, 2, 72, 'Day of Judgment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 748, 3, 72, 'Then we have another picture of the final Day of Judgment, the basis on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 748, 4, 72, 'which God judges us. This is the message of the four parables beginning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 748, 5, 72, 'in Matthew 24:45. The faithful slave who serves the master’s food to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 748, 6, 72, 'those at the table, the wise virgins, using the talents God gives us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 748, 7, 72, 'faithfully, and next, Jesus speaks about the way we treat others who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 748, 8, 72, 'in need around us. “When the Son of Man comes in His glory and all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 748, 9, 72, 'angels He will sit on His glorious throne and all the nations will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 748, 10, 72, 'gathered before Him and He will separate them from one another as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 748, 11, 72, 'shepherd separates the sheep from the goats" (Matthew 25:31-32). This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 748, 12, 72, 'one place in Scripture where Jesus talks about sheep and goats. Sheep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 748, 13, 72, 'are generally a picture of those who are His children, and goats a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 748, 14, 72, 'picture of those who are not.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 748, 15, 72, 'When all the nations gathered before Him, He is going to separate them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 748, 16, 72, 'one from another like sheep from the goats. He will put the sheep on His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 748, 17, 72, 'right side and the goats on the left. The King will say to those on His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 748, 18, 72, 'right, the sheep, “Come you who are blessed of my Father, inherit the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 748, 19, 72, 'kingdom prepared for you from the foundation of the world.” There is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 748, 20, 72, 'kingdom prepared for some people from before the worlds were created.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 748, 21, 72, 'Before Genesis 1:1, God reserved something for certain people whom He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 748, 22, 72, 'was going to create. Not just for anyone, but for those who used their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 748, 23, 72, 'life in a particular way. It says here, “I was hungry and you gave Me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 748, 24, 72, 'something to eat, I was thirsty and you gave Me something to drink, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 748, 25, 72, 'was a stranger and you invited Me in, I was naked and you clothed Me, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 748, 26, 72, 'was sick and you visited Me, I was in prison and you came to Me.” These');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 748, 27, 72, 'are called the righteous in verse 37.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 748, 28, 72, 'So what does the righteous do? They see Jesus in their fellow believers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 749, 1, 72, '- that''s the first thing you need to see. “The righteous say, ‘Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 749, 2, 72, 'when did we see You hungry and feed You, or thirsty and gave You a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 749, 3, 72, 'drink, or when did we see You a stranger or naked, see you sick or in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 749, 4, 72, 'prison?’ The King will answer and say, ‘Truly I say to you, to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 749, 5, 72, 'extent that you did it to one of these brothers of Mine, you did it to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 749, 6, 72, 'Me.’” When we do something for a brother, even giving a cup of cold');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 749, 7, 72, 'water, Jesus said we''re doing it unto Him. If you give me something in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 749, 8, 72, 'my hand, you are giving it to my body, and that includes my head. So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 749, 9, 72, 'when you help a brother in Christ, the head takes note of what you''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 749, 10, 72, 'done for one of His children! “When that hungry brother was there, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 749, 11, 72, 'was Me. You saw Me and you fed Me, when that thirsty person was there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 749, 12, 72, 'that believer you saw Me!”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 749, 13, 72, 'This is not referring to general social work; very often this passage is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 749, 14, 72, 'misunderstood. People think from misunderstanding this passage that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 749, 15, 72, 'those who do social work are going to God''s kingdom and those who don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 749, 16, 72, 'do social work will be lost. But read carefully. Foolishness comes when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 749, 17, 72, 'people don''t read Scripture carefully. What does it say here exactly?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 749, 18, 72, 'Jesus said, "In as much as you''ve done it to the least of these brothers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 749, 19, 72, 'of Mine" (Matthew 25:40). Not to every Tom, Dick, and Harry, or beggar,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 749, 20, 72, '“in as much as you helped all these people in the world,” or, “In as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 749, 21, 72, 'much as you helped all these creatures of Mine…” No, His comments are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 749, 22, 72, 'limited to a certain category of people. “To the extent that you did it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 749, 23, 72, 'to one of these brothers of Mine…” Who are the brothers of Jesus? Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 749, 24, 72, 'already defined that. Earlier we saw that Jesus said that those who do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 749, 25, 72, 'the will of God are His brothers (Matthew 12:50). The brothers of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 749, 26, 72, 'are His disciples. So this passage is referring only to those who helped');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 749, 27, 72, 'His disciples, not to those in social work for everybody in the world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 749, 28, 72, 'You may say “God doesn’t care for the people in the world?” He certainly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 750, 1, 72, 'does, but this parable is not referring to that. Galatians 6:10 says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 750, 2, 72, '“Do good to all men, but especially to the household of faith.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 750, 3, 72, 'Then the goats come and the Lord says, “’Depart from Me, accursed ones,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 750, 4, 72, 'into the eternal fire which has been prepared for the devil and his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 750, 5, 72, 'angels; because when I was hungry, you didn’t give Me anything to eat; I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 750, 6, 72, 'was thirsty, and you didn’t give Me anything to drink; I was sick and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 750, 7, 72, 'you didn’t visit; I was in prison, and you did not come and see Me.’ And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 750, 8, 72, 'they say, ''Lord when did we see you hungry or thirsty?’ And He says, ‘In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 750, 9, 72, 'as much as you didn''t do to the least of these, you did not do it to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 750, 10, 72, 'Me.’ They will go away into eternal punishment, but the righteous into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 750, 11, 72, 'eternal life.” There is eternal punishment and there is eternal life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 750, 12, 72, 'Just like eternal life exists forever, eternal punishment is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 750, 13, 72, 'punishment that goes on forever; that''s pretty clear.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 750, 14, 72, 'This is a contrast with another group that we considered earlier, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 750, 15, 72, 'Matthew 7. When the Lord reminds the righteous of what they did for Him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 750, 16, 72, 'they don''t remember it. Righteous people don''t keep a record of the good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 750, 17, 72, 'they''ve done, whereas in Matthew 7, the group of people who are standing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 750, 18, 72, 'at the judgment seat of Christ remember very well what they did - that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 750, 19, 72, 'they prophesied, cast out demons and did many miracles (Matthew 7:22).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 750, 20, 72, 'And yet the Lord says, “Depart from Me, for I don''t even know you.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 750, 21, 72, 'Do you keep a record of all the things that you have done, which you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 750, 22, 72, 'think you''ve done for the Lord, all the sacrifices that you have made?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 750, 23, 72, 'Or are you in the category of this the group mentioned in Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 750, 24, 72, '25:35-40 who say, ''Lord we don''t remember what we did for You''? May the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 750, 25, 72, 'Lord help us to do good, and then to forget about it. Then we''ll be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 750, 26, 72, 'ready for the coming of Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 750, 27, 73, 'Chapter 72 God’s Sovereignty, Poured out for Jesus, Danger of Getting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 750, 28, 73, 'Offended');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 751, 1, 73, 'Key Messages in Jesus’s Last Words to His Disciples');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 751, 2, 73, '“When Jesus had finished all these words, He said to His disciples, ‘You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 751, 3, 73, 'know that after two days the Passover is coming, and the Son of Man is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 751, 4, 73, 'to be handed over for crucifixion’” (Matthew 26:1-2).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 751, 5, 73, '“When Jesus had finished all these words” refers to the last words that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 751, 6, 73, 'He spoke before He went to Gethsemane and before He went to Jerusalem');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 751, 7, 73, 'for the final days before the crucifixion. There was a time when someone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 751, 8, 73, 'anointed His feet with oil. Then we read of the last supper and then He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 751, 9, 73, 'went to the cross. This was just a short while before He went to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 751, 10, 73, 'cross. These were the last messages He spoke to His disciples. In the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 751, 11, 73, 'Last Supper, He spoke to them about the coming of the Holy Spirit, etc.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 751, 12, 73, 'in John 14:15-16. We also read His prayer in John 17.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 751, 13, 73, 'Prior to all that, it is very interesting to see that the last words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 751, 14, 73, 'that Jesus spoke were related to faithfulness and being ready for His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 751, 15, 73, 'coming in our personal life, as described in the story about the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 751, 16, 73, 'virgins. He spoke about the use of the gifts God has given us in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 751, 17, 73, 'story of the talents. He spoke about our relationship with others who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 751, 18, 73, 'are needy in the church and how we treat and serve the sick. It is very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 751, 19, 73, 'interesting to see the contrast between those who enter God''s kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 751, 20, 73, 'and those who do not. The ones who entered God’s kingdom simply visited');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 751, 21, 73, 'the sick. In Matthew 25:36, Jesus said, “I was sick, and you visited');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 751, 22, 73, 'Me.” All they did was to visit the sick, and they get into God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 751, 23, 73, 'kingdom. Whereas in Matthew 7:22, those who heal the sick go to hell.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 751, 24, 73, 'Isn’t that interesting? Those who healed the sick went to hell (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 751, 25, 73, '7:22), and those who visited the sick went to heaven (Matthew 24:36).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 751, 26, 73, 'What is the reason? First of all, motive. Second, the quality of their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 751, 27, 73, 'inner lives. If there is sin in the inner life, all the exercise of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 751, 28, 73, 'gifts becomes worthless. If the motive is honor for oneself and not the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 752, 1, 73, 'glory of God, then the use of gifts does not count for anything.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 752, 2, 73, 'In Matthew 7:22, those who are cast out boast, “Lord, we healed the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 752, 3, 73, 'sick, and we did miracles.” Yet in Matthew 24:39, the ones admitted into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 752, 4, 73, 'God’s kingdom say, “I do not even remember when I visited the sick. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 752, 5, 73, 'was that?” It is very important to see that God does not see the way man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 752, 6, 73, 'sees. God does not evaluate our service and our life the way man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 752, 7, 73, 'evaluates. It is completely different. That is why it is important to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 752, 8, 73, 'study Scripture so that we get God''s perspective on things. Most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 752, 9, 73, 'Christians do not have God''s perspective on things. They evaluate their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 752, 10, 73, 'service and their life very often exactly like the way worldly people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 752, 11, 73, 'evaluate their life and service. But we need to reorient our thinking so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 752, 12, 73, 'that we begin to think more like the way God thinks so that we do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 752, 13, 73, 'waste our earthly life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 752, 14, 73, 'Having said and finished these things, Jesus then said to the disciples,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 752, 15, 73, '“After two days, the Passover is coming.” These words were spoken just a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 752, 16, 73, 'couple of days before He went to the cross and was delivered up to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 752, 17, 73, 'crucified. The chief priests and the elders gathered together in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 752, 18, 73, 'court of the high priest and plotted to seize Jesus by stealth to kill');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 752, 19, 73, 'Him. But they were saying, “Not during the festival, lest a riot occur');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 752, 20, 73, 'among the people.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 752, 21, 73, 'It is very interesting to see how religious people, who were supposed to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 752, 22, 73, 'be servants and representatives of God among the people, could scheme to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 752, 23, 73, 'hurt a prophet of God. It happened in Jesus’ time. It happens even now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 752, 24, 73, 'where religious people get together to scheme to hurt God''s true');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 752, 25, 73, 'servants. But they do not succeed. They may hurt him physically, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 752, 26, 73, 'they will only fulfill God''s perfect plan for that person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 752, 27, 73, 'Resting in God’s Sovereignty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 752, 28, 73, 'Any true servant of God who really seeks to follow Jesus will find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 753, 1, 73, 'similar experiences to what Jesus experienced as well. Religious people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 753, 2, 73, 'may hate you. They may scheme and do all types of things in order to get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 753, 3, 73, 'at you or to trouble you in some way. They may take you to court. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 753, 4, 73, 'may scheme and manipulate things in order to take you to court. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 753, 5, 73, 'will be bribery, corruption, etc., but God Who is watching the whole');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 753, 6, 73, 'thing will turn their plans into foolishness. That is a wonderful thing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 753, 7, 73, 'We can actually pray for that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 753, 8, 73, 'An example of this is when one of David’s friends, Ahithophel, left');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 753, 9, 73, 'David and joined up with his rebellious son Absalom in 2 Samuel 15 and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 753, 10, 73, '17. David prayed that the Lord would turn the counsel of Ahithophel into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 753, 11, 73, 'foolishness (2 Sam 15:31). God did that, and the scheme to kill David');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 753, 12, 73, 'did not succeed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 753, 13, 73, '“The king’s heart is in the hand of the Lord” (Proverbs 21:1).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 753, 14, 73, 'Everybody’s heart is in the hand of the Lord. He can make people act in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 753, 15, 73, 'a certain way when they try to harm you. He will not allow the godly to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 753, 16, 73, 'be touched without His permission. Of course, when the time finally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 753, 17, 73, 'came, God allowed them to kill Jesus, Paul, the apostles, etc. But this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 753, 18, 73, 'did not happen before God''s time. It is very, very important to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 753, 19, 73, 'understand that. Very often you read in the Gospels, Jesus said, “My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 753, 20, 73, 'hour has not yet come.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 753, 21, 73, 'All these people were scheming, but they could not do it until God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 753, 22, 73, 'time. I want you to see, in this connection, an incident in the Acts of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 753, 23, 73, 'the Apostles. In Acts 2:22, Peter, filled with the Holy Spirit, says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 753, 24, 73, 'these words concerning Jesus the Nazarene, “A man attested to you by God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 753, 25, 73, 'with miracles and wonders and signs which God performed through Him in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 753, 26, 73, 'your midst.” There are a number of things Peter reveals here about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 753, 27, 73, 'Jesus’ ministry.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 753, 28, 73, 'The first thing Peter says, inspired by the Holy Spirit, is that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 754, 1, 73, 'miracles that Jesus did were not primarily examples for all of us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 754, 2, 73, 'follow, because in the history of the Christian faith, nobody has ever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 754, 3, 73, 'been able to have the type of healing and miraculous ministry that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 754, 4, 73, 'had. We can preach as He did, but we cannot heal as He did or do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 754, 5, 73, 'miracles as He did. Peter says that those miracles were signs to attest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 754, 6, 73, 'to the fact that Jesus was the Messiah, and were not something for us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 754, 7, 73, 'copy. When Jesus said, “Follow Me,” He was not telling us to follow Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 754, 8, 73, 'in doing miracles. He was telling us to follow in the way of the cross.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 754, 9, 73, 'Jesus walked the way of the cross all His life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 754, 10, 73, 'Inspired by the Holy Spirit, Peter says in Acts 2:23, “This Man was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 754, 11, 73, 'delivered up by the predetermined plan and foreknowledge of God.” The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 754, 12, 73, 'other thing we see is that Jesus’ capture was not an accident. “It was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 754, 13, 73, 'part of God''s predetermined plan, and you nailed Him to a cross.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 754, 14, 73, 'The Bible speaks about the Lamb being slain from the foundation of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 754, 15, 73, 'world in Revelation 13:8. This means long before time began. “Slain from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 754, 16, 73, 'the foundation of the world” means that long before Genesis 1:1, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 754, 17, 73, 'knew that Adam was going to sin, and God made provision for Adam and His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 754, 18, 73, 'race to be redeemed from their sin. There would be those who wanted to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 754, 19, 73, 'respond. God had already determined that Christ is going to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 754, 20, 73, 'crucified. In Galatians 4:4, it says, “But when the fullness of the time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 754, 21, 73, 'came, God sent forth His Son.” There was a particular time in human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 754, 22, 73, 'history when God planned that Jesus Christ should be born on this earth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 754, 23, 73, 'down to the exact date on which He would be crucified. It is also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 754, 24, 73, 'mentioned in Daniel 9:26 that the Messiah will be cut off. It is all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 754, 25, 73, 'planned according to the predetermined plan and foreknowledge the God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 754, 26, 73, 'Who can see the future. It was part of His plan.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 754, 27, 73, 'In Matthew 26:3-4, Caiaphas and the chief priests and elders plotted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 754, 28, 73, 'together to seize Jesus by stealth and kill Him. They thought that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 755, 1, 73, 'were planning something that God did not know about, but God knew about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 755, 2, 73, 'it before He created Adam. They only fulfilled God’s predetermined plan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 755, 3, 73, 'according to His foreknowledge. If we understand that, we will not be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 755, 4, 73, 'worried if we are serving God. We are His children. If you hear that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 755, 5, 73, 'somebody is scheming and plotting something against you, what in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 755, 6, 73, 'world are they going to do or accomplish? Only that which God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 755, 7, 73, 'predetermined plan and foreknowledge has planned for your life. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 755, 8, 73, 'will not be able to do anything outside of that. That is a great comfort');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 755, 9, 73, 'for us to know.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 755, 10, 73, 'There are little glimpses here of the total sovereignty of God. “Our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 755, 11, 73, 'Father, Who art in heaven.” That is how He taught us to pray. When we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 755, 12, 73, 'pray, we must not only look to God who is our Dad, but also to One Who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 755, 13, 73, 'is sovereign and has control over all circumstances, Who determines even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 755, 14, 73, 'if somebody''s plotting to kill you. If you believe that, you will never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 755, 15, 73, 'be anxious. Whatever people are scheming or planning, you will say that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 755, 16, 73, 'is just the predetermined plan of God according to His foreknowledge. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 755, 17, 73, 'live in the center of God''s will. Therefore, nothing can happen to me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 755, 18, 73, 'and nobody can ever do anything to me without God''s permission. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 755, 19, 73, 'so important for us to know, especially in times of persecution. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 755, 20, 73, 'are established in this faith, then you will not be in a panic or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 755, 21, 73, 'anxiety even in times of persecution. When we face the little trials');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 755, 22, 73, 'that come our way now when we are not being persecuted, we will say that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 755, 23, 73, 'God has planned this well ahead of time. Romans 8:28 says that God makes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 755, 24, 73, 'everything work together for good to those who love Him and are called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 755, 25, 73, 'according to His purpose.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 755, 26, 73, 'The chief priests and elders were planning to kill Him on the Passover');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 755, 27, 73, 'day. Initially, they did not want to kill him during the festival, lest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 755, 28, 73, 'a riot occur among the people. But Jesus had to be killed on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 756, 1, 73, 'Passover day. The exact date on which Jesus was to be killed was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 756, 2, 73, 'determined before the world was created. In fact, the Israelites came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 756, 3, 73, 'out of Egypt on the 14th day of the first month. The Passover day was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 756, 4, 73, 'determined on the basis of when Christ would die 1500 years later. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 756, 5, 73, 'is how the date Christ would die was determined 1500 years earlier. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 756, 6, 73, 'sees in His foreknowledge and says, “That is going to be the date when I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 756, 7, 73, 'am going to deliver the Israelites out of Egypt. That is when the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 756, 8, 73, 'Israelites should kill the lamb and put the blood outside the door.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 756, 9, 73, 'This was the predetermined plan and foreknowledge of God. Here it looked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 756, 10, 73, 'as if it may not be like that. The chief priests and elders said, “We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 756, 11, 73, 'should not do it during the festival.” But finally, they did it on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 756, 12, 73, 'Passover day even though they had some discussion about that by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 756, 13, 73, 'initially saying they would not do it then. However, God had planned it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 756, 14, 73, 'Jesus was crucified right on the day of the Passover. God’s timing is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 756, 15, 73, 'perfect in everything, even despite the scheming and planning of others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 756, 16, 73, 'Poured out for Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 756, 17, 73, 'The next incident happened just before Jesus went to the cross. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 756, 18, 73, 'Jesus was in Bethany, at the home of Simon the leper, a woman came to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 756, 19, 73, 'Him with an alabaster vial of very costly perfume. She poured it upon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 756, 20, 73, 'His head as He reclined at the table. But the disciples were indignant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 756, 21, 73, 'when they saw this, and said, “Why this waste?” This is possibly the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 756, 22, 73, 'same event that is mentioned in John 12. In John 12, it was Judas');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 756, 23, 73, 'Iscariot who said, “Why should this be wasted because this perfume could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 756, 24, 73, 'have been sold for high price?” We know from John 12 that it was 300');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 756, 25, 73, 'denarii or a laboring man''s wage for 10 months (if you exclude the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 756, 26, 73, 'holidays, one-year’s wages). It could have been sold for one full year’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 756, 27, 73, 'wages, and the money be given to the poor. John 12:6 says that Judas');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 756, 28, 73, 'Iscariot said that not because he cared for the poor, but because he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 757, 1, 73, 'could swipe that money and use it for himself, just like he was doing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 757, 2, 73, 'with the rest of the money in the bag.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 757, 3, 73, 'Jesus was aware that these people were speaking like this. They felt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 757, 4, 73, 'this money was wasted by being poured out on Jesus’ head and flowing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 757, 5, 73, 'down His whole body. What a waste of such an expensive perfume. In a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 757, 6, 73, 'moment, it is all gone. One year’s wages are gone in a moment. Is it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 757, 7, 73, 'worth wasting our lives on Jesus like that? Jesus said to them, “Why do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 757, 8, 73, 'you bother this woman? She has done a good deed. The poor you always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 757, 9, 73, 'have with you. You do not always have Me.” We should not think that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 757, 10, 73, 'lavish spending on Christ and for His Glory is a waste. We can think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 757, 11, 73, 'that helping the poor is the only good thing that a Christian can do.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 757, 12, 73, 'That is where we need to hear this word. This woman did not give it to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 757, 13, 73, 'the poor. She poured it out on Jesus’s body. That is a picture of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 757, 14, 73, 'body of Christ today. We are the church, the body of Christ. To pour out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 757, 15, 73, 'an ointment and to bless and anoint the body of Christ is worth it. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 757, 16, 73, 'may think that money should be given to the poor, but that is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 757, 17, 73, 'necessarily always God''s will. Of course, Jesus was the first person to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 757, 18, 73, 'help the poor. All the disciples were eager to help the poor, but there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 757, 19, 73, 'is a place for anointing the body of Christ with something valuable,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 757, 20, 73, 'sacrificial and expensive.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 757, 21, 73, 'Don’t Wait!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 757, 22, 73, 'Notice something else: when she poured the perfume upon Jesus, Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 757, 23, 73, 'said in Matthew 26:12, “For when she poured this perfume on My body, she');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 757, 24, 73, 'did it to prepare Me for burial.” Jesus was crucified on Thursday and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 757, 25, 73, 'there were two Sabbaths after that, a special Sabbath on Friday and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 757, 26, 73, 'regular Sabbath on Saturday. It is interesting to note that when Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 757, 27, 73, 'rose from the dead, the women could not go to the tomb to anoint the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 757, 28, 73, 'body of Jesus, because they had to bury Him in a hurry on Thursday. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 758, 1, 73, 'they really finally went to the tomb on Sunday, they found it was too');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 758, 2, 73, 'late. He had already risen. There was no way to anoint the body of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 758, 3, 73, 'Jesus, but there was one woman who did it. She was able to do it because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 758, 4, 73, 'she did it before He was crucified.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 758, 5, 73, 'Jesus said, “She has anointed My body with perfume, preparing it for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 758, 6, 73, 'burial,” but He was not even dead. Why this question of burial? Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 758, 7, 73, 'knew none of the other women would get a chance. She did this before the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 758, 8, 73, 'crucifixion and thereby, His body was anointed. The lesson we learn from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 758, 9, 73, 'this is to take the time and opportunity to serve God. Waste your life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 758, 10, 73, 'on Him when you have the opportunity. If you wait for some later time,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 758, 11, 73, 'you may not get the opportunity at all. Those who waited for a later');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 758, 12, 73, 'time to anoint the body of Jesus after His crucifixion discovered on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 758, 13, 73, 'resurrection morning that they missed the opportunity. It was gone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 758, 14, 73, 'Sometimes, you wait for a future time to do something, and you will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 758, 15, 73, 'get the opportunity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 758, 16, 73, 'Now is the time. This is always the case. If you have the opportunity to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 758, 17, 73, 'do good to the members of the body of Christ, do it now. If you postpone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 758, 18, 73, 'it, you will not get the opportunity. That is the message in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 758, 19, 73, 'incident. She did not know it. She had the money with her and she');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 758, 20, 73, 'thought, “Let me do something for Jesus.” She bought the perfume and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 758, 21, 73, 'poured it out upon Him. Little did she know that she would be the only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 758, 22, 73, 'one who could anoint the body of Jesus for burial. Jesus said that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 758, 23, 73, 'Jesus said in Matthew 26:13, “Truly I say to you, wherever this gospel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 758, 24, 73, 'is preached in the whole world, what this woman has done will be spoken');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 758, 25, 73, 'of in memory of her.” That has been fulfilled over the last two thousand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 758, 26, 73, 'years. The Bible has gone across the whole world in hundreds of tongues');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 758, 27, 73, 'and languages. What this woman has done is being proclaimed all over the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 758, 28, 73, 'world. What was that? When she had an opportunity, she anointed the body');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 759, 1, 73, 'of Jesus with a very expensive perfume. What we do one day will resound');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 759, 2, 73, 'at the judgment seat of Christ one day. Take this to heart. When you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 759, 3, 73, 'have an opportunity, that is the time that you need to do good to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 759, 4, 73, 'body of Christ. Do not postpone it, because what you postpone, you may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 759, 5, 73, 'never get the opportunity to do.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 759, 6, 73, 'This anointing is an act of worship. We can learn something about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 759, 7, 73, 'worship there. Worship is always something costly and sacrificial. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 759, 8, 73, 'something that requires giving that which is very valuable to us to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 759, 9, 73, 'Lord. David said once in 2 Samuel in 24:24, “I will not offer to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 759, 10, 73, 'Lord that which cost me nothing.” This woman could have taken a very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 759, 11, 73, 'cheap perfume and anointed the body of Jesus. But she did not. She had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 759, 12, 73, 'saved up one year''s wages. I do not know how many years she took to save');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 759, 13, 73, 'one year’s wages. Think about yourself. How long does it take? What is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 759, 14, 73, 'your salary in one year? Ask yourself how long will it take for you to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 759, 15, 73, 'save that much money? A number of years. Maybe it was her life savings.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 759, 16, 73, 'It probably was. She went and spent it all in the market to buy a very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 759, 17, 73, 'expensive perfume. She poured it on the head of Jesus. This teaches us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 759, 18, 73, 'that worship is something that involves sacrifice.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 759, 19, 73, 'The Great Danger of Getting Offended');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 759, 20, 73, '“Then one of twelve, named Judas Iscariot, went to the chief priests…”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 759, 21, 73, '(Matthew 26:14). The word “then” is very important. If you compare this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 759, 22, 73, 'passage with John 12, you see that it was Judas Iscariot who primarily');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 759, 23, 73, 'said, “This could have been given to the poor.” The disciples probably');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 759, 24, 73, 'agreed with him, but he was really saying that so that money could come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 759, 25, 73, 'into his bag. When Jesus said in Matthew 26:10-13, “Why do you trouble');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 759, 26, 73, 'this woman? She has done a good deed. Why do you bother her? She has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 759, 27, 73, 'come to anoint my body for the burial and you are stopping her. Whatever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 759, 28, 73, 'she has done is going to be proclaimed throughout the whole world,”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 760, 1, 73, 'Judas was offended because he was corrected publicly. Do you get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 760, 2, 73, 'offended if somebody corrects you publicly? Judas was like that. As soon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 760, 3, 73, 'as he got offended, it says, “then” he went to the chief priests and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 760, 4, 73, 'said, “What are you willing to give me if I deliver Him up to you?”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 760, 5, 73, 'Judas was offended because he was humiliated publicly by being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 760, 6, 73, 'corrected. It was a very small thing. Compare his reaction to correction');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 760, 7, 73, 'with Peter’s reaction to correction. In an earlier study, we saw how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 760, 8, 73, 'Jesus once turned around to Peter and said, “Get behind me, Satan!” That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 760, 9, 73, 'is a very strong correction and a very strong public rebuke much worse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 760, 10, 73, 'than this. This was hardly a correction at all. But Peter’s reaction to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 760, 11, 73, 'that was, “Lord, to whom shall we go? These are the words of eternal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 760, 12, 73, 'life. I am not going to be offended. What You said is right. I was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 760, 13, 73, 'thinking in a satanic way and seeking my own interests.” Here was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 760, 14, 73, 'something much smaller, but when Judas was corrected, he got offended');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 760, 15, 73, 'and he immediately went to betray Jesus. He began looking for an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 760, 16, 73, 'opportunity and the chief priests said, “Sure, we would like you to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 760, 17, 73, 'betray him to us.” They gave him thirty pieces of silver (Matthew 26:15)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 760, 18, 73, 'and from then on, he began looking for a good opportunity to betray him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 760, 19, 73, 'We see the Peter’s reaction to correction in Matthew 16, and then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 760, 20, 73, 'Judas’s reaction to correction later. When you combine Jesus’ correction');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 760, 21, 73, 'in Matthew 16, “Get behind me Satan,” with Peter’s response in John 6,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 760, 22, 73, 'we see that Peter’s heart was, “Lord, to whom shall I go, if I get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 760, 23, 73, 'offended with your corrections? You give me the words of eternal life.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 760, 24, 73, 'But with Judas, Jesus gave a mild correction - “Leave this woman alone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 760, 25, 73, 'She has done a good thing. Do not think only of giving money to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 760, 26, 73, 'poor.” - yet Judas took offense at that and betrayed Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 760, 27, 73, 'It is a pretty serious thing to be offended by a little correction. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 760, 28, 73, 'can ask yourself what your attitude towards correction is when an older');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 761, 1, 73, 'brother who loves you, perhaps the elder in your church, corrects you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 761, 2, 73, 'about something. If you get offended, you can follow in Judas’ footsteps');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 761, 3, 73, 'and destroy your life. On the other hand, you can say, “Those are the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 761, 4, 73, 'words of eternal life,” just like it says in Psalms 141:5, “Let the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 761, 5, 73, 'righteous smite me. It will be like oil upon my head. I am going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 761, 6, 73, 'receive the correction from a righteous godly man because that is like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 761, 7, 73, 'somebody pouring and anointing me with oil.” What a wonderful way to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 761, 8, 73, 'react to correction. Let us learn that lesson here and react like Peter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 761, 9, 73, 'did. Let us realize that every word of correction is a word of eternal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 761, 10, 73, 'life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 761, 11, 74, 'Chapter 73 The Lord''s Supper');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 761, 12, 74, 'Obeying God in the Small Things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 761, 13, 74, '“On the first day of unleavened bread, the disciples came to Jesus and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 761, 14, 74, 'said, ‘Where do You want us to prepare for You to eat the Passover?’”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 761, 15, 74, '(Matthew 26:17) The Passover was a feast that God had ordained for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 761, 16, 74, 'Israelites from the day they left Egypt. It was to be a constant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 761, 17, 74, 'memorial or remembrance of how God had delivered them. It was a simple');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 761, 18, 74, 'feast, but it was to remind them of their deliverance from Egypt. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 761, 19, 74, 'had instructed them that when their children asked, “What does this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 761, 20, 74, 'mean?” they were to explain how God, with His mighty hand, brought them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 761, 21, 74, 'out of Egypt and that was repeated year after year after year for 1500');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 761, 22, 74, 'years, right up to the time of Jesus. Jesus was leading people out of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 761, 23, 74, 'the Old Covenant into the New Covenant, but as long as the New Covenant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 761, 24, 74, 'was not established, He continued to obey the laws of the Old Covenant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 761, 25, 74, 'that were given for the Jews. Whenever people came to Him for anything,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 761, 26, 74, 'He would teach them to obey the Law. For example, to the lepers who were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 761, 27, 74, 'cleansed, He said, “Go show yourself to the priests.” He told Pharisees,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 761, 28, 74, '“You must pay your tithes,” and in everything, He obeyed the law; even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 762, 1, 74, 'here we see He is keeping the Passover.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 762, 2, 74, 'So we see how even though the Passover was just a little ritualistic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 762, 3, 74, 'feast, Jesus kept it and there is something we can learn from what Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 762, 4, 74, 'taught by His example: even something small, which doesn''t really have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 762, 5, 74, 'any moral value, if it is commanded by God, we do it - that''s what we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 762, 6, 74, 'learn from Jesus. For example, the breaking of bread or baptism, these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 762, 7, 74, 'are two things that Jesus instituted. There''s no moral value in them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 762, 8, 74, 'but because Jesus commanded it, we do it. That''s what we learn from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 762, 9, 74, 'example of Jesus keeping the Passover.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 762, 10, 74, 'In Matthew 26:18, He said, “Go into the city to a certain man, and say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 762, 11, 74, 'to him, ‘The Teacher says, “My time is at hand; I am to keep the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 762, 12, 74, 'Passover at your house with My disciples.”’ It is wonderful that in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 762, 13, 74, 'land where almost everybody rejected Christ, there were still a few who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 762, 14, 74, 'were willing to open their homes for Christ, where Jesus could even say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 762, 15, 74, '“I want a room in your house.” Imagine the freedom that this man had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 762, 16, 74, 'given to Jesus, that “anytime You want a room in my house, You can come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 762, 17, 74, 'and take it.” It''s wonderful. There are people like that today, as well,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 762, 18, 74, 'who say to the Lord, “Anything Lord, in my home, in my life, is always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 762, 19, 74, 'available for You.” Otherwise, Jesus wouldn''t have taken the liberty to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 762, 20, 74, 'tell His disciples to go to that person and say, “I want to keep the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 762, 21, 74, 'Passover at your house” (because this is Jerusalem, and Jesus was living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 762, 22, 74, 'in Capernaum, so His house was not in Jerusalem; but still, He could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 762, 23, 74, 'tell someone, “I want a room in your house”). And it is wonderful if we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 762, 24, 74, 'can be available to the Lord like that, when the Lord can tell us, “I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 762, 25, 74, 'want this from you,” and immediately we''ll do it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 762, 26, 74, 'Judge Ourselves First');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 762, 27, 74, 'And the disciples, verse 19, did as Jesus had directed them and they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 762, 28, 74, 'prepared the Passover. When evening had come, He was reclining at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 763, 1, 74, 'table with the twelve disciples. And as they were eating, He said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 763, 2, 74, '“Truly I say to you that one of you will betray Me.” This is the first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 763, 3, 74, 'time that He made it clear to His disciples that somebody from among the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 763, 4, 74, 'twelve was going to betray Him, and it''s very interesting to see their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 763, 5, 74, 'reaction. They didn’t look at each other and say, “I wonder who that is,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 763, 6, 74, 'who is going to betray Him. Of course it won’t be me” - that was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 763, 7, 74, 'their reaction. With all the faults that these disciples had, there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 763, 8, 74, 'one good thing we can see about them: they did not judge each other, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 763, 9, 74, 'judged themselves. Each one began to say, “Surely, not I Lord. Is it I,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 763, 10, 74, 'Lord?” And not only that, they were deeply grieved and shocked to hear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 763, 11, 74, 'this. For the first time, they were hearing that one of them is going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 763, 12, 74, 'betray Him, and so, they were grieved and said, “Lord, it can’t be me,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 763, 13, 74, 'can it?” That’s a wonderful attitude to have. This is where the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 763, 14, 74, 'instituted the Lord''s Table, and when we come to the Lord''s Table, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 763, 15, 74, 'Bible says, “Let each man examine himself and so let him eat the bread.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 763, 16, 74, 'And we see an example of that in the disciples when, at the first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 763, 17, 74, 'breaking of bread, each one of them examined himself and said, “Lord, is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 763, 18, 74, 'it I?” This is the spirit with which the church is built. Peter says in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 763, 19, 74, '1 Peter 4:17, “The household of God is one where we judge ourselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 763, 20, 74, 'first.” We see a wonderful example with this spirit of self-judgment in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 763, 21, 74, 'the disciples.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 763, 22, 74, 'Betraying Jesus for Money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 763, 23, 74, 'Jesus goes on to say “He who dipped his hand with Me in the bowl is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 763, 24, 74, 'one who will betray Me” (Matthew 26:23). What is betrayal? Why is it so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 763, 25, 74, 'serious in this particular case? In John''s gospel, chapter 13, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 763, 26, 74, 'connection with the Lord''s Table, the Old Testament verse from Psalm 41');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 763, 27, 74, 'is quoted that “The one who eats bread with Me will betray Me.” To');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 763, 28, 74, 'betray Jesus Christ in any way is a serious thing, but to eat bread with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 764, 1, 74, 'Him and then betray Him is very much more serious. Some of us may not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 764, 2, 74, 'realize the seriousness of this as much as the people in the culture of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 764, 3, 74, 'the Middle East at that time. There is a story that comes from about a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 764, 4, 74, 'hundred years ago from Arabia of a man who was wanted and on whose head');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 764, 5, 74, 'there was a very high price. So he was very careful not to be caught and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 764, 6, 74, 'he would cover his face and travel through the desert, but he knew one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 764, 7, 74, 'thing that the Bedouin Arabs who lived there: they had a principle that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 764, 8, 74, 'if someone ate bread with them, they would never betray him. So this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 764, 9, 74, 'man, when he was hungry, covered his face so that people wouldn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 764, 10, 74, 'recognize him easily. The Bedouin Arabs who lived in the tents were very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 764, 11, 74, 'hospitable to even strangers, so he walked into a tent, sat down, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 764, 12, 74, 'they didn''t know who he was, so he ate with them. Once he had eaten with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 764, 13, 74, 'them, he could take of the shawl from his face and let them see whom he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 764, 14, 74, 'was. He was absolutely convinced that those people would never betray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 764, 15, 74, 'him because he had broken bread with them. No matter what the price was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 764, 16, 74, 'on his head, no matter how much money they could get if they betrayed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 764, 17, 74, 'him, they would not do it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 764, 18, 74, 'And that is the meaning of that verse in Matthew 26: He who has eaten');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 764, 19, 74, 'bread with Me has betrayed Me. It is a very serious crime. So, in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 764, 20, 74, 'breaking of bread, we are speaking of a commitment to Jesus, and not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 764, 21, 74, 'only to Jesus, but to the others around us. And Judas betrayed Jesus for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 764, 22, 74, 'money. Jesus said, “There are only two masters in the world, God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 764, 23, 74, 'money,” and we see the beginning of that right here, that there were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 764, 24, 74, 'those who wanted to follow Jesus and here was one person who was willing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 764, 25, 74, 'to betray Him for money. What does it mean to betray Jesus for money?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 764, 26, 74, 'That means to deny Christ by my life, by my action in today''s terms in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 764, 27, 74, 'order to gain some money. In Judas’s case, it was thirty pieces of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 764, 28, 74, 'silver, but it could be even less than that in our case. For example, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 765, 1, 74, 'your office or business, if you can make a little profit or some gain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 765, 2, 74, 'for yourself by cheating or by signing a false statement, if you do so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 765, 3, 74, 'and call yourself a Christian, you’ve betrayed Jesus. And that''s what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 765, 4, 74, 'Jesus is teaching here.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 765, 5, 74, 'For the sake of money, Judas betrays Jesus. In the history of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 765, 6, 74, 'Christianity, in the past 2000 years, there are so many believers who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 765, 7, 74, 'don''t realize it, but they have betrayed Jesus for just a little bit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 765, 8, 74, 'earthly gain. It is really true: there are only two masters, God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 765, 9, 74, 'money and it is impossible to serve both. Judas strived to serve both,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 765, 10, 74, 'but he discovered, finally, that he was actually serving money, and all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 765, 11, 74, 'those who try to serve God and money today will discover in the final');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 765, 12, 74, 'day that they''re also actually only serving money. And so, Jesus says in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 765, 13, 74, 'verse 24, “The Son of Man is to go, just as written of Him, but woe to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 765, 14, 74, 'that man by whom the Son of Man is betrayed! It would have been good for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 765, 15, 74, 'that man if he had not been born.” What a word to say that it was better');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 765, 16, 74, 'that this person was never born.” Do you see how serious it is to betray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 765, 17, 74, 'Jesus Christ? To deny Him by your action for some earthly gain or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 765, 18, 74, 'profit, whatever it is, to deny your faith in Christ and to stop');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 765, 19, 74, 'following Him just for little gain? Nobody may know it, but you have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 765, 20, 74, 'take these words seriously: if you betray Jesus Christ, it doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 765, 21, 74, 'matter whether it was Judas then or anyone else today, the principle is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 765, 22, 74, 'the same: it is better for that person if he was not even born. That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 765, 23, 74, 'what Jesus taught. It''s a very serious word that Jesus taught so we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 765, 24, 74, 'to be very watchful that we do not betray Jesus Christ by any word or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 765, 25, 74, 'action. I don''t want to be categorized by the Lord as one about whom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 765, 26, 74, 'it''s better that I was not even born.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 765, 27, 74, 'We see the hypocrisy of Judas in Matthew 26:25: “He was betraying Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 765, 28, 74, 'and assured, ‘It is not I, Rabbi?’ And Jesus said, ‘You have said it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 766, 1, 74, 'yourself.’” It’s possible that people can be so clever that they can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 766, 2, 74, 'betraying Jesus in secret, having already collected the thirty pieces of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 766, 3, 74, 'silver, and yet they can sit in the midst of God''s people, breaking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 766, 4, 74, 'bread, acting in every way like a believer, and be such good hypocrites');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 766, 5, 74, 'that they can ask in just the same language as the others, “Lord, It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 766, 6, 74, 'not I, is it?” Hypocrisy is there. The sins that have plagued the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 766, 7, 74, 'Christian Church for 2000 years begin here: betraying Jesus for the love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 766, 8, 74, 'of money and hypocrisy. It began with Judas Iscariot and it''s better');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 766, 9, 74, 'that such people were never born.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 766, 10, 74, 'The Breaking of Our Will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 766, 11, 74, '“And while they were eating, Jesus took some bread, and after blessing,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 766, 12, 74, 'He broke it and said, ‘Take, eat; this is My body’” (Matthew 26:26). The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 766, 13, 74, 'broken bread symbolized the broken body - “This is My body broken for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 766, 14, 74, 'you.” The physical body of Jesus was not broken at that time and even on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 766, 15, 74, 'the cross, His body was not broken; it was just pierced at five points');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 766, 16, 74, 'but not broken. What did He mean by saying, “This is My body broken for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 766, 17, 74, 'you?” There was something inside Jesus’ body that was broken for 33 ½');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 766, 18, 74, 'years: His Own will. We do many things with our bodies, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 766, 19, 74, 'fundamentally, we either do our own will or God''s will. In everything we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 766, 20, 74, 'do, we''re either doing our will or God''s will. The Bible says, “Present');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 766, 21, 74, 'your bodies as a living sacrifice to God and be renewed in your mind so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 766, 22, 74, 'that you may prove the perfect will of God” (Romans 12:1-2). So there''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 766, 23, 74, 'a connection between the body and doing the perfect will of God. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 766, 24, 74, 'begins with using our body, and ends with doing the perfect will of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 766, 25, 74, 'So Jesus yielded His body, we read in Hebrews 10:5, “A body that was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 766, 26, 74, 'prepared for Me, ‘Lo, I come to do your will, O God.’” In other words,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 766, 27, 74, 'right from birth He was saying, “With this body, I''m going to do only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 766, 28, 74, 'Your will.” In order for us to do God''s will in our bodies, there''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 767, 1, 74, 'something inside that has to be broken constantly as well: our will.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 767, 2, 74, 'That''s the meaning of taking up the cross every day. When Jesus said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 767, 3, 74, '“This is My body broken for you,” they didn''t understand it fully then.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 767, 4, 74, 'Jesus told them at the last table, in John 16, “There are many things I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 767, 5, 74, 'want to say to you, but you cannot bear them now, but you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 767, 6, 74, 'understand later on.” And we understand it now, after the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 767, 7, 74, 'has come, that brokenness is within. “This is My body broken for you.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 767, 8, 74, 'When we partake in the broken bread, we’re saying, “Lord, in my body');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 767, 9, 74, 'also, I want my will to be broken. I want to do Your will.” That''s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 767, 10, 74, 'meaning of taking communion.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 767, 11, 74, '“And when He had taken the cup and gave thanks, He gave it to them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 767, 12, 74, 'saying, ‘Drink from it, all of you’” (Matthew 26:27). He took the bread,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 767, 13, 74, 'gave thanks, and broke it. He took the cup and gave thanks. There was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 767, 14, 74, 'spirit of thankfulness in going to the cross. We who have seen the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 767, 15, 74, 'that Jesus walked will have a spirit of thankfulness in going to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 767, 16, 74, 'cross because we know, certainly, that if we die with Him, we will live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 767, 17, 74, 'with Him. Believers do not experience the resurrection life of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 767, 18, 74, 'because they''re not willing to go this way - the way of the cross. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 767, 19, 74, 'think this is a way of death and doom and that it’s disgusting. No! It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 767, 20, 74, 'a way of life if we can see it. And that''s what we testify to in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 767, 21, 74, 'breaking of the bread.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 767, 22, 74, 'The Cleansing Blood of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 767, 23, 74, 'When He took the cup, He said, “This is blood of the covenant, which is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 767, 24, 74, 'poured out for many for forgiveness of sins” (Matthew 26:28). This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 767, 25, 74, 'teaches us the meaning of that blood, that cup symbolizing the blood of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 767, 26, 74, 'Jesus, which is going to be poured out on the cross - He relates it to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 767, 27, 74, 'covenant. In the Old Covenant, the blood of animals was sprinkled on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 767, 28, 74, 'tabernacle and on the altar and here again Jesus was saying, “I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 768, 1, 74, 'establishing a New Covenant and that is through laying down my life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 768, 2, 74, 'through sharing My blood, the blood of the New Covenant, which is shed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 768, 3, 74, 'for the forgiveness of sins.” In the Old Testament, sin was only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 768, 4, 74, 'covered. Psalm 32 says, “Blessed is the man whose sin is covered.” But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 768, 5, 74, 'in the New Testament, sin is not covered; it is cleansed. There are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 768, 6, 74, 'people who sing songs like, “I''m under the blood.” That is an Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 768, 7, 74, 'Testament expression where they put the blood on the door so that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 768, 8, 74, 'angel of death would not come into their home. But today, I''m not under');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 768, 9, 74, 'the blood. The blood is not over me, the blood doesn''t even cover me; it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 768, 10, 74, 'cleanses me! So never speak about being under the blood or being covered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 768, 11, 74, 'by the blood but being cleansed by the blood. That is the New Covenant,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 768, 12, 74, 'cleansed by the blood.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 768, 13, 74, 'So this is the New Covenant and Jesus poured out His blood on the cross,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 768, 14, 74, 'every drop of blood was poured out, for the forgiveness of sins, for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 768, 15, 74, 'total cleansing of all of our sins. This means a new attitude toward');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 768, 16, 74, 'sin. That is what the New Covenant means, that I think of the price paid');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 768, 17, 74, 'to deliver me from sin. It was not just the blood of bulls and goats, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 768, 18, 74, 'was the blood of Jesus Christ and therefore, I take sin very seriously.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 768, 19, 74, 'The breaking of bread is very meaningful, it is not something we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 768, 20, 74, 'take very lightly. Many Christians come to the Lord''s Table without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 768, 21, 74, 'taking the whole issue very seriously. Once we come into the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 768, 22, 74, 'Covenant, we discover that this bread not only symbolizes the body of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 768, 23, 74, 'Jesus that was broken, but also the body of Christ today - the different');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 768, 24, 74, 'members of the body of Christ (1 Corinthians 10:16-17). We are all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 768, 25, 74, 'breaking that one bread, which means there is a commitment to the body');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 768, 26, 74, 'with whom I''m breaking bread. This shows that there is a double meaning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 768, 27, 74, 'in the breaking of bread. The disciples could not understand it then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 768, 28, 74, 'because they did not have the Holy Spirit. But we understand this now.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 769, 1, 74, '“The body of Christ,” firstly, relates to the body of Christ in which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 769, 2, 74, 'His will was broken for 33 ½ years, and secondly to the body with which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 769, 3, 74, 'we meet today, when we break the same bread. This is the opposite of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 769, 4, 74, 'betrayal. Every believer must choose to walk the way Jesus walked and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 769, 5, 74, 'commit to the body of Christ. If not, the only other alternative is by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 769, 6, 74, 'Judas’ betrayal. A person who does not break bread, a non-Christian who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 769, 7, 74, 'is out there in the world, cannot betray because he does not claim to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 769, 8, 74, 'following Christ. But if a person pretends to be a Christian and does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 769, 9, 74, 'not walk this way, he is a betrayer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 769, 10, 74, 'Then Jesus said, ”I will not drink of this fruit of the vine from now on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 769, 11, 74, 'until that day when I drink it new with you in My Father’s kingdom”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 769, 12, 74, '(Matthew 26:29). This is a reference to the cross as well as to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 769, 13, 74, 'second coming of Christ. In 1 Corinthians 11 we’re told that, “you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 769, 14, 74, 'proclaim the Lord’s death until He comes” (1 Corinthians 11:26). We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 769, 15, 74, 'proclaim the Lord''s death, which is the past, until it He comes, which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 769, 16, 74, 'is the future. So the breaking of bread points backward to the death of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 769, 17, 74, 'Christ as well as forward to the coming of Christ. Many people never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 769, 18, 74, 'think of that, because once Christ comes this will be over. It''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 769, 19, 74, 'testimony that I believe in the death of Christ for my sin and I also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 769, 20, 74, 'believe that Christ is coming back one day when this will be over. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 769, 21, 74, 'time will come when His kingdom, His Father''s kingdom, will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 769, 22, 74, 'established and He will drink of the vine with you. We will be feasting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 769, 23, 74, 'and drinking when Christ comes again.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 769, 24, 74, '“After singing a hymn, they went out to the Mount of Olives” (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 769, 25, 74, '26:30). It is very interesting to see this little expression just before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 769, 26, 74, 'Jesus went to the cross. He wasn’t gloomy; He was singing a hymn.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 769, 27, 74, 'Imagine praising the Lord when you know you are going to be betrayed,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 769, 28, 74, 'captured and killed the next morning. That is the spirit in which we go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 770, 1, 74, 'to the cross. We go to the cross singing a hymn, singing praise to God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 770, 2, 74, 'because we know that nothing can happen to us without God''s perfect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 770, 3, 74, 'plan. As it says in Acts 2, “Jesus was delivered over and crucified by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 770, 4, 74, 'the predetermined plan and foreknowledge of God” (Acts 2:23). There is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 770, 5, 74, 'nothing that can happen to us that is not in God''s predetermined plan,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 770, 6, 74, 'and we know that there will be a resurrection. There are many wonderful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 770, 7, 74, 'things that Jesus taught us here; they could not be fully understood by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 770, 8, 74, 'the disciples then, but we can understand them now.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 770, 9, 74, '“Then Jesus said to them, ‘You will all fall away because of Me this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 770, 10, 74, 'night, for it is written, “I will strike down the shepherd, and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 770, 11, 74, 'sheep of the flock shall be scattered.” But after I have been raised, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 770, 12, 74, 'will go before you to Galilee’” (Matthew 26:31-32). This is a quotation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 770, 13, 74, 'from Zechariah. “Strike the Shepherd that the sheep may be scattered”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 770, 14, 74, '(Zechariah 13:7). The devil always seeks to hit the shepherds in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 770, 15, 74, 'church. So shepherds: be careful, be watchful, and don''t betray, but be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 770, 16, 74, 'loyal and true, and walk the way of the cross. Otherwise your bad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 770, 17, 74, 'example can cause the sheep to be scattered.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 770, 18, 75, 'Chapter 74 Prayer at Gethsemane');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 770, 19, 75, 'After Jesus and His disciples had broken bread together and Jesus had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 770, 20, 75, 'passed the bread and the cup around, they sang a hymn and went out to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 770, 21, 75, 'the Mount of Olives. Then Jesus said to them, “You will all fall away');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 770, 22, 75, 'because of Me this night, for it is written, ‘I will strike down the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 770, 23, 75, 'shepherd, and the sheep of the flock shall be scattered.’ But after I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 770, 24, 75, 'have been raised, I will go ahead of you to Galilee” (Matthew 26:31-32).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 770, 25, 75, 'This was a prophecy relating to Christ, that the Shepard would be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 770, 26, 75, 'stricken and the sheep would be scattered. When Peter heard this, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 770, 27, 75, 'said, “Even though all may fall away because of You, I will never fall');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 770, 28, 75, 'away” (Matthew 26:33). Peter was a very self-sufficient, self-confident');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 771, 1, 75, 'type of a person. He was unprepared at that time to be the leader. Any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 771, 2, 75, 'self-confident, self-assured person is totally unfit for Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 771, 3, 75, 'leadership. He may be fit for leadership in the business world but not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 771, 4, 75, 'in the Christian world. In the Christian world, the most important');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 771, 5, 75, 'requirement is a total lack of confidence in oneself, coupled with a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 771, 6, 75, 'total confidence in God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 771, 7, 75, 'True Circumcision');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 771, 8, 75, 'There are three types of people: one is like Peter, fully');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 771, 9, 75, 'self-confident, but useless to God. The other is totally lacking in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 771, 10, 75, 'self-confidence, but he is also useless to God. It is the third category');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 771, 11, 75, 'of people who are useful to God. They are totally lacking in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 771, 12, 75, 'self-confidence, but have complete confidence in God. This is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 771, 13, 75, 'meaning of circumcision. In Philippians, we see the New Covenant meaning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 771, 14, 75, 'of circumcision. Paul says, “We are the true circumcision, who worship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 771, 15, 75, 'in the Spirit of God and glory in Christ Jesus and put no confidence in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 771, 16, 75, 'the flesh” (Philippians 3:3). We put no confidence in flesh, just like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 771, 17, 75, 'circumcision in the Old Testament was a cutting off of the flesh and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 771, 18, 75, 'casting it off. The spiritual meaning of this is that we have no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 771, 19, 75, 'confidence in the flesh; we have no confidence in ourselves but in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 771, 20, 75, 'things of God. We recognize that without Christ we can do nothing. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 771, 21, 75, 'don''t lean upon our own understanding, but we trust in the Lord with all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 771, 22, 75, 'our heart (Proverbs 3:5).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 771, 23, 75, 'This is how it is for a true disciple of Jesus Christ. Peter needed to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 771, 24, 75, 'be broken of his self-confidence; that is why God allowed him to fail');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 771, 25, 75, 'three times, denying the Lord. It broke him completely and shattered all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 771, 26, 75, 'his self-confidence. He was the one who boasted saying, “’I’I will never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 771, 27, 75, 'fall away,’ and Jesus said, ‘This very night you will deny Me three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 771, 28, 75, 'times.’ Peter said to Him, ‘Even if I have to die with You, I will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 772, 1, 75, 'deny You’” (Matthew 26:34-35). He was so self-confident that even though');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 772, 2, 75, 'Jesus, the Messiah, the Son of God, said he would deny Him three times,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 772, 3, 75, 'he said, no. But he did deny the Lord, and that shattered him so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 772, 4, 75, 'completely that he lost all his self-confidence in one moment. He went');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 772, 5, 75, 'out and wept bitterly - he was broken, he was brought down to zero -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 772, 6, 75, 'then he was ready for Pentecost, to be a leader.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 772, 7, 75, 'This has been God''s way with all His leaders, whether it was Jacob who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 772, 8, 75, 'had to become Israel when his hip was broken or Moses who had to spend');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 772, 9, 75, '40 years in the desert to get rid of all his self-confidence. This has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 772, 10, 75, 'been God''s way with all great leaders. If you have any type of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 772, 11, 75, 'responsibility among God''s people and you are confident in yourself and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 772, 12, 75, 'in your abilities, you are not fit. You are not fit until you have come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 772, 13, 75, 'to the place where you are shattered and your self-confidence is all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 772, 14, 75, 'thrown away. Then you are truly circumcised spiritually and it is only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 772, 15, 75, 'then that you can serve God. The Old Covenant law was very clear that if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 772, 16, 75, 'you were not circumcised you could not be a part of God''s people. In the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 772, 17, 75, 'New Covenant, the spiritual meaning is that only those who have no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 772, 18, 75, 'confidence in the flesh can really serve God. It wasn’t only Peter who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 772, 19, 75, 'said this; all the disciples said the same thing too. They didn''t say it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 772, 20, 75, 'as strongly as Peter, but they all said, “We will not deny you, we will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 772, 21, 75, 'not a fall away,” but yet they all ran away from Gethsemane when the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 772, 22, 75, 'soldiers captured Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 772, 23, 75, 'Jesus at Gethsemane');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 772, 24, 75, '“Then Jesus came with them to a place called Gethsemane, and said to His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 772, 25, 75, 'disciples, ‘Sit here while I go over there and pray.’ And He took with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 772, 26, 75, 'Him Peter, James and John, the two sons of Zebedee, and began to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 772, 27, 75, 'grieved and distressed. Then He said to them, ‘My soul is deeply');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 772, 28, 75, 'grieved, to the point of death; remain here and keep watch with Me’”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 773, 1, 75, '(Matthew 26:36-38). He was human and it is human to be grieved and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 773, 2, 75, 'distressed. This is an amazing example, not only of His humanity but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 773, 3, 75, 'also of His humility. His humanity is shown in that He was deeply');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 773, 4, 75, 'grieved. It is possible for a godly man to be deeply grieved and to not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 773, 5, 75, 'sin. Jesus never sinned to have deep grief. To be distressed is not sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 773, 6, 75, 'because He was preparing to bear the sins of the world. He was bearing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 773, 7, 75, 'the burden of others, and anyone who selflessly seeks to serve others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 773, 8, 75, 'will at times go through grief and distress, like Jesus did. It is only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 773, 9, 75, 'a person without feeling who will remain without grief and distress. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 773, 10, 75, 'has created us with feelings, and if we love others deeply, like God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 773, 11, 75, 'loves us, we will go through times of grief and distress. But the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 773, 12, 75, 'humility of Christ is seen here in that He was willing to ask His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 773, 13, 75, 'disciples like Peter, James and John to pray with Him. Why in the world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 773, 14, 75, 'would He want these immature people to pray with Him? Unbroken people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 773, 15, 75, 'like Peter, who just manifested how confident he was in himself! Yet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 773, 16, 75, 'Jesus selected these weak stumbling disciples for some spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 773, 17, 75, 'fellowship. Value the weaker members of the body of Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 773, 18, 75, 'This teaches us that we must value the weaker members of the body of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 773, 19, 75, 'Christ. Think of the difference between Jesus and Peter, James and John.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 773, 20, 75, 'It is such a huge difference spiritually. The difference between you and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 773, 21, 75, 'someone else in your fellowship whom you look down on is much smaller');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 773, 22, 75, 'than that. There may be a difference - you may be better, you may be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 773, 23, 75, 'more spiritual - but the difference is so tiny compared to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 773, 24, 75, 'difference between Jesus and Peter, James and John. Yet Jesus was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 773, 25, 75, 'willing to seek fellowship with Peter, James and John and even ask them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 773, 26, 75, 'to stand with Him while He was praying. That teaches us of His humility.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 773, 27, 75, 'There we see our own pride, when we think we are so spiritual that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 773, 28, 75, 'can’t pray with some of these other people. I find some believers like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 774, 1, 75, 'that who think no end of themselves, that there are only certain elite');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 774, 2, 75, 'upper-class believers who can pray with them. They have not understood');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 774, 3, 75, 'what Jesus did at Gethsemane. Jesus told them to keep watch with Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 774, 4, 75, 'That means to wait on God and be alert. Keeping watch is an expression');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 774, 5, 75, 'for being alert. It''s always easier to be alert in prayer, when you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 774, 6, 75, 'with others than when you are alone. When we are alone we tend to go off');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 774, 7, 75, 'to sleep easily but when we are with others it''s easier to be alert in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 774, 8, 75, 'prayer. “And He went a little beyond them, and fell on His face and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 774, 9, 75, 'prayed, saying, ‘My Father, if it is possible, let this cup pass from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 774, 10, 75, 'Me; yet not as I will, but as You will’” (Matthew 26:39). He repeated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 774, 11, 75, 'this prayer more than once in verses 42 and 44. This was obviously a big');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 774, 12, 75, 'struggle that He was going through. ”Then He came to the disciples and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 774, 13, 75, 'found them sleeping, and said to Peter, “So, you men could not keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 774, 14, 75, 'watch with Me for one hour?” (Matthew 26:40).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 774, 15, 75, 'We need to realize that Jesus’ prayer was not just a one sentence prayer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 774, 16, 75, 'that finished in half a minute, it went on for one hour and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 774, 17, 75, 'substance of His prayer was, “O, please take this cup away from Me, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 774, 18, 75, 'don''t want to drink it, but if it''s Your will, then I will drink it.” He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 774, 19, 75, 'told His disciples to keep watching and praying that they may not enter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 774, 20, 75, 'into temptation. The spirit is willing but the flesh is weak, keep being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 774, 21, 75, 'alert in prayer, don''t doze off to sleep, be alert spiritually and pray.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 774, 22, 75, 'Prayer is to ask God for help, to recognize your need for God''s help,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 774, 23, 75, 'because however willing your spirit may be to live for God, to be useful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 774, 24, 75, 'to God and to be pure and overcome temptation, you must recognize that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 774, 25, 75, 'your flesh is weak. The flesh is weak - that is why we lose our temper');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 774, 26, 75, 'so easily and that is why we don''t trust in God. Our self-confidence is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 774, 27, 75, 'a mark of the weakness of the flesh. But the disciples didn''t believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 774, 28, 75, 'that. They said, “we are fine.” And He found them sleeping. “He went');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 775, 1, 75, 'away a second time and prayed, saying, ‘My Father, if this cannot pass');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 775, 2, 75, 'away unless I drink it, Your will be done.’ And He came and found them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 775, 3, 75, 'sleeping for their eyes were heavy. And He left them again, and went');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 775, 4, 75, 'away and prayed the third time saying the same thing once more” (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 775, 5, 75, '26:42-44).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 775, 6, 75, 'Be Persistent in Prayer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 775, 7, 75, 'There are number of things we can learn here. One is that, there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 775, 8, 75, 'nothing wrong in praying for the same thing again and again, even for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 775, 9, 75, 'one hour, and going back and praying again, and going back and praying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 775, 10, 75, 'again. Jesus taught us the necessity of persistence in prayer. We see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 775, 11, 75, 'two instances of that. One is in the story of the widow who wanted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 775, 12, 75, 'justice in Luke 18. An enemy had probably encroached into her property');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 775, 13, 75, 'knowing she was a helpless widow with no man in the house, no husband or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 775, 14, 75, 'son. If she had a son, her son would be the one in the parable going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 775, 15, 75, 'the judge. She has to go by herself because she has no male member in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 775, 16, 75, 'the house and an enemy took advantage of that and probably encroached');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 775, 17, 75, 'upon her property. She goes to the judge and asks for legal protection');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 775, 18, 75, 'against her opponent. She persisted and persisted until she wore out the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 775, 19, 75, 'judge by going to his house at odd hours of the night and the morning.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 775, 20, 75, 'Finally he gets fed up and says, “Even though I do not fear God nor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 775, 21, 75, 'respect man, yet because this widow continues to bother me, I will give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 775, 22, 75, 'her legal protection” (Luke 18:4-5)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 775, 23, 75, 'That was a parable on prayer, where Jesus was trying to teach them “men');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 775, 24, 75, 'ought always to pray and never to give up or lose heart” (Luke 18:1).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 775, 25, 75, 'The other parable on prayer is in Luke 11, and there again the message');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 775, 26, 75, 'is the same. A man is going to a neighbor''s house to get some bread for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 775, 27, 75, 'a visitor who has come at midnight. He keeps on knocking till the man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 775, 28, 75, 'opens the door. He knocks unashamedly till the man opens the door and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 776, 1, 75, 'gives him the bread (Luke 11:5-8).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 776, 2, 75, 'In both of the parables where Jesus spoke on prayer, the emphasis is on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 776, 3, 75, 'persistence - pray for the same thing again and again. Jesus Himself is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 776, 4, 75, 'doing exactly the same thing for maybe two to or three hours. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 776, 5, 75, 'substance of His prayer throughout that time was, “Take away this cup,”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 776, 6, 75, 'and “I don''t want to drink it, but not as I will but as You will.” I''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 776, 7, 75, 'often said, you can ask God for anything under the sun - anything,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 776, 8, 75, 'anywhere - provided you conclude your prayer with, “Not as I will but as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 776, 9, 75, 'You will.” If you can pray that as your last sentence, you can ask God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 776, 10, 75, 'for anything because then you''ve submitted to His will and said, “Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 776, 11, 75, 'I really don''t want my own will but I’m happy to accept what You give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 776, 12, 75, 'me.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 776, 13, 75, 'Value of the Fellowship with the Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 776, 14, 75, 'The important question is, what was this cup that Jesus was so reluctant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 776, 15, 75, 'to drink? It is so important to understand that. Was He afraid to go to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 776, 16, 75, 'Calvary? Was He afraid of the pain of death? Impossible! We have heard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 776, 17, 75, 'of martyrs who have joyfully gone to the stake to be burnt and joyfully');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 776, 18, 75, 'sung songs when they were thrown to the lions in the Roman');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 776, 19, 75, 'amphitheaters, in the second and third century. Jesus surely wasn''t a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 776, 20, 75, 'coward. He would have been ready to face a thousand deaths on Calvary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 776, 21, 75, 'for us because He loved us so much. It''s obviously not physical death');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 776, 22, 75, 'that He was shrinking away from. A lot of people have tried to meditate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 776, 23, 75, 'and study to understand what this cup is. Another theory is that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 776, 24, 75, 'was so drained of blood at this time, as He was sweating like great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 776, 25, 75, 'drops of blood, that He was so exhausted and weak and afraid that He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 776, 26, 75, 'would die right there and so He prayed that God would not let Him die');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 776, 27, 75, 'but help Him to drink and avoid that cup.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 776, 28, 75, 'None of these answers really satisfy. There was something that He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 777, 1, 75, 'struggling with and it was not premature death on the cross. He was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 777, 2, 75, 'afraid to die for the sins of the world. He came for that purpose. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 777, 3, 75, 'there was something else that bothered Him. When we pray with tremendous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 777, 4, 75, 'burden for something, it is usually something that touches what we value');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 777, 5, 75, 'most in life. What is it that Jesus valued more than anything else in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 777, 6, 75, 'His life? It wasn''t comfort, it wasn''t His own life, and it definitely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 777, 7, 75, 'was not money or property. There was only one thing that Jesus valued');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 777, 8, 75, 'more than anything else in His life: His fellowship with the Father.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 777, 9, 75, 'From all eternity, He had been in fellowship with the Father, forever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 777, 10, 75, 'and ever, but that fellowship was going to be broken on the cross. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 777, 11, 75, 'knew it would be broken for a while because He''s going to take the sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 777, 12, 75, 'of the world. The punishment for sin is not physical death because if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 777, 13, 75, 'the punishment for sin were physical death, then when we die we would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 777, 14, 75, 'have already paid the punishment for our sins. This means every man who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 777, 15, 75, 'dies has paid for the punishment for his sin and every man who dies has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 777, 16, 75, 'to go to heaven because he died.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 777, 17, 75, 'Physical death was not the price Jesus paid for our sin. We know that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 777, 18, 75, 'the punishment for sin is eternal separation from God, being forsaken by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 777, 19, 75, 'God for all eternity. So if Jesus did not suffer eternal separation from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 777, 20, 75, 'God on the cross, He did not pay the price for our sin. The price for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 777, 21, 75, 'our sin is not physical death. It is not even three hours in hell. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 777, 22, 75, 'the eternal cutting off from God because of our sin. That is what hell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 777, 23, 75, 'is. Jesus used pictures like fire and worms to teach us how horrible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 777, 24, 75, 'hell is - being forsaken by God. There is no place on the earth that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 777, 25, 75, 'a God-forsaken place. Hell is the only truly God-forsaken place. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 777, 26, 75, 'awesome to think of what it will be like in hell. In this world, even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 777, 27, 75, 'among unbelievers and atheists, there is a certain grace and mercy of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 777, 28, 75, 'God, there is a certain restraining force of God that prevents evil from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 778, 1, 75, 'coming upon people, even on unbelievers. Otherwise the devil would make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 778, 2, 75, 'every unbeliever possessed with a demon. There is a restraining force');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 778, 3, 75, 'through the mercy of God on the earth, but in hell it is all completely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 778, 4, 75, 'removed. Eternal hell is the punishment for sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 778, 5, 75, 'How then did Jesus suffer eternal hell? He suffered when He hung on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 778, 6, 75, 'cross for three hours. There He said, “My God, My God why have You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 778, 7, 75, 'forsaken Me?” He was suffering being forsaken by God. That was hell for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 778, 8, 75, 'three hours, and three hours became eternity for Him because He is an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 778, 9, 75, 'Infinite Being. For a man, three hours is only three hours, but for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 778, 10, 75, 'Almighty God, who is an Infinite Being, three hours was eternity. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 778, 11, 75, 'experienced in three hours the eternal pangs of being separated from God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 778, 12, 75, 'forever - the sorrows and pains of billions of people being separated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 778, 13, 75, 'from God forever and ever. Jesus took that on Himself. He took it as God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 778, 14, 75, 'because only God could take the punishment for our sin. Nobody else');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 778, 15, 75, 'could suffer eternity in three hours. It would be unrighteous for God to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 778, 16, 75, 'punish somebody else for my sin; it would be completely against the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 778, 17, 75, 'principle of every law. But God Himself could take it. That is what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 778, 18, 75, 'proves that Christ was no created being or no angel. He had to be God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 778, 19, 75, 'Himself. If it was not God Himself Who died as a Man on the cross, then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 778, 20, 75, 'your sins are not forgiven. This is where we disagree with the Jehovah’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 778, 21, 75, 'Witnesses and others who talk of Jesus as a created being. If it were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 778, 22, 75, 'so, their sins are not forgiven, because it is totally unjust of God to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 778, 23, 75, 'punish another created being for my sin, just like it would be unjust');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 778, 24, 75, 'for a judge to punish one man for my sins. However, because Jesus was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 778, 25, 75, 'God, He could take that punishment on Himself. Thus in those three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 778, 26, 75, 'hours, what had never taken place in all eternity took place for three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 778, 27, 75, 'hours. That is why the earth shook and there was an earthquake and there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 778, 28, 75, 'was darkness, because the Father had forsaken the Son. There was a break');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 779, 1, 75, 'in fellowship. It is absolutely unimaginable to understand what Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 779, 2, 75, 'went through. The Bible says, “God is the head of Christ” (1 Corinthians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 779, 3, 75, '11:3). So it was like the head being wrenched off the body, spiritually.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 779, 4, 75, 'That was the very thing Jesus dreaded. He dreaded being cut off from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 779, 5, 75, 'fellowship with the Father more than anything else. He was willing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 779, 6, 75, 'suffer any pain, any ridicule, anything but being cut off from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 779, 7, 75, 'Father. That was the cup He referred to when He said, “Please take it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 779, 8, 75, 'away.” He struggled to find if there was any other way. He was willing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 779, 9, 75, 'to go through anything other than this break of fellowship from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 779, 10, 75, 'Father. When I picture this for myself, I make it personal just like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 779, 11, 75, 'cross of Calvary. When I think of Jesus going through Gethsemane, I make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 779, 12, 75, 'it personal for myself and I say, “What He went through there was for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 779, 13, 75, 'me.” I try to imagine a conversation going on between Jesus and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 779, 14, 75, 'Father, in Gethsemane. He is saying, “Oh Father, I never want to lose My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 779, 15, 75, 'fellowship with You. I’ve had this with you from all eternity. It is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 779, 16, 75, 'thing I value more than anything else and I don''t want to drink this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 779, 17, 75, 'cup. I just don''t want it.” I can then imagine the Father saying, “Well');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 779, 18, 75, 'that''s fine then, You can come right up to heaven from Gethsemane. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 779, 19, 75, 'don''t have to go to the cross at all because You have lived a perfect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 779, 20, 75, 'life and you have not sinned. You can come right up from Gethsemane to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 779, 21, 75, 'heaven, but Zac will go to hell.” Then Jesus says, “Oh, he''ll go to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 779, 22, 75, 'hell? In that case I''ll drink the cup, I''ll go to the cross. I am even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 779, 23, 75, 'willing to go through that which I hate - being cut off from You. Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 779, 24, 75, 'I’m willing to do that for Zac’s sake.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 779, 25, 75, 'Make it personal my friend. Make Gethsemane’s agony and Jesus’ death on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 779, 26, 75, 'the cross personal, and then you will understand true Christianity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 779, 27, 75, 'Otherwise you won’t understand it. Most Christians talk so glibly about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 779, 28, 75, 'Christ dying for their sins. They don''t understand what that death');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 780, 1, 75, 'meant, to be separated from God the Father, because that''s the price for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 780, 2, 75, 'our sin. I see the love of Christ for me in Gethsemane, which led to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 780, 3, 75, 'Calvary, where He said, “I will do Thy will.” Finally, a third time He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 780, 4, 75, 'was convinced, that for my sake He had to go to the cross. “Then He came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 780, 5, 75, 'back to the disciples and said to them, ‘Are you still sleeping and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 780, 6, 75, 'resting? Behold, the hour is at hand and the Son of Man is being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 780, 7, 75, 'betrayed into the hands of sinners. Get up, let us be going; Behold, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 780, 8, 75, 'one who betrays Me is at hand!’” (Matthew 26:45-46). He gets up and goes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 780, 9, 75, 'for me and for you. He goes through, determined, setting his face');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 780, 10, 75, 'steadfastly to go to the cross, to be willing to be forsaken.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 780, 11, 75, 'We must remember this. It is only when we see Jesus face to face one day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 780, 12, 75, 'that we will see love personified. That day, when our mind becomes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 780, 13, 75, 'clear, we will see how much He loved us, to be willing to suffer the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 780, 14, 75, 'greatest agony that any human being could ever face - eternal hell for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 780, 15, 75, 'three hours on the cross - just because He loved you and me. May the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 780, 16, 75, 'Lord help us to respond to Him in love.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 780, 17, 76, 'Chapter 75 No Confidence in the Flesh');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 780, 18, 76, 'In Matthew 26, Jesus went through Gethsemane dreading the break in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 780, 19, 76, 'fellowship with the Father that He would experience on the cross. What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 780, 20, 76, 'do we learn from that? That fellowship with the Father is the most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 780, 21, 76, 'important thing that we can ever desire on earth. It is what we must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 780, 22, 76, 'value more than anything else on the face of this earth. Everything else');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 780, 23, 76, 'is unimportant. We don''t understand the value of this fellowship and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 780, 24, 76, 'that''s why we sin so lightly. Every time we sin, our fellowship with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 780, 25, 76, 'Father is broken. We must learn to intensely value fellowship with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 780, 26, 76, 'Father. It’s what will help us hate sin, and it is what Jesus Himself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 780, 27, 76, 'dreaded so much, drinking the cup of broken fellowship.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 780, 28, 76, 'We must also come to the place where we dread any break in fellowship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 781, 1, 76, 'with the Father. It comes when we do something wrong, when we violate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 781, 2, 76, 'our conscience and do not listen to the Holy Spirit. When we sin, our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 781, 3, 76, 'fellowship with the Father is broken, and Jesus died so that our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 781, 4, 76, 'fellowship with the Father might never be broken. Look at sin from this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 781, 5, 76, 'perspective. If He died so that I might be freed from sin, it means that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 781, 6, 76, 'He died so that my fellowship with the Father might never be broken. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 781, 7, 76, 'valued this fellowship so much, yet He was willing to break fellowship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 781, 8, 76, 'with the Father so that my fellowship with the Father might never be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 781, 9, 76, 'broken. Therefore, we must also value fellowship with the Father.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 781, 10, 76, 'The Arrest of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 781, 11, 76, 'After Jesus had finished praying in the garden and had woken His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 781, 12, 76, 'disciples, Judas came to betray Him (Matthew 26:47). It''s amazing that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 781, 13, 76, 'Judas could betray Someone who was so kind to him. I think he was a bit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 781, 14, 76, 'disturbed that Jesus was not actually going to take power and destroy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 781, 15, 76, 'the Romans. Perhaps he thought he could be the prime minister under');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 781, 16, 76, 'Jesus until he found out that Jesus was not at all interested in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 781, 17, 76, 'political power. Then he was disappointed. Jesus was only interested in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 781, 18, 76, 'changing people''s souls, and Judas Iscariot was not interested in that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 781, 19, 76, 'So when Jesus was in the garden, Judas went up to Him and said, “Hail,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 781, 20, 76, 'Rabbi!” to betray Him. Judas never called Him, “Lord.” Instead, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 781, 21, 76, 'called Him, “Rabbi,” and kissed Him. Yet, Jesus called him, “friend.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 781, 22, 76, 'Jesus called Peter, “Satan,” to rebuke him, but when He spoke to Judas,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 781, 23, 76, 'He told him, “Friend, do what you have come for” (Matthew 26:50). He had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 781, 24, 76, 'nothing in His heart against Judas even though He knew what Judas was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 781, 25, 76, 'about to do, and He wanted Judas to know that. But even that did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 781, 26, 76, 'melt the hard heart of Judas in that moment.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 781, 27, 76, '“Then they came and laid hands on Jesus and seized Him. And behold, one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 781, 28, 76, 'of those who were with Jesus reached and drew out his sword, and struck');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 782, 1, 76, 'the slave of the high priest and cut off his ear. Then Jesus said to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 782, 2, 76, 'him, ‘Put your sword back into its place; for all those who take up the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 782, 3, 76, 'sword shall perish by the sword’” (Matthew 26:50-52). Jesus says to put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 782, 4, 76, 'the sword away, but it was Jesus Himself Who told them to take swords');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 782, 5, 76, 'before going to Gethsemane (Luke 22). Peter could have said, “Lord, what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 782, 6, 76, 'do You mean, don''t use a sword? You''re the One Who told us to take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 782, 7, 76, 'swords and that''s why we brought them - to defend You.” And Jesus would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 782, 8, 76, 'have said, “That’s not why I asked you to bring the sword. You must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 782, 9, 76, 'never use a sword to attack. I asked you to bring the sword so that if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 782, 10, 76, 'the Roman soldiers tried to slash your face, you could lift up your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 782, 11, 76, 'sword to protect your face. The swords are not for attack but for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 782, 12, 76, 'defense.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 782, 13, 76, 'Therefore, when we read the command in Luke 22 to bring a sword with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 782, 14, 76, 'you, we must also combine it with Jesus’ command in Matthew 26 to put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 782, 15, 76, 'your sword back, for those who take up the sword will perish by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 782, 16, 76, 'sword. To take a sword with you is defense. To take up the sword is to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 782, 17, 76, 'attack someone, and Jesus says that it’s completely wrong to attack.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 782, 18, 76, 'Here’s the message for us when we put these verses together: it is wrong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 782, 19, 76, 'for us to attack people, but it''s perfectly fine to defend ourselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 782, 20, 76, 'when we are attacked. Furthermore, Jesus said that if you take up the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 782, 21, 76, 'sword, you’ll perish with the sword, so we see that it''s dangerous to go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 782, 22, 76, 'about attacking.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 782, 23, 76, 'Why was Jesus not concerned for Himself? He answers in Matthew 26:53-54,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 782, 24, 76, '“Do you think that I cannot appeal to My Father, and He will at once put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 782, 25, 76, 'at My disposal more than twelve legions of angels? How then will the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 782, 26, 76, 'Scriptures be fulfilled, which say that it must happen this way?” He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 782, 27, 76, 'knew that His Father could help Him, just as He had helped Hezekiah in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 782, 28, 76, 'the Old Testament. At that time, a single angel killed about 180,000');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 783, 1, 76, 'enemies of the Lord. Can you imagine what 72,000 angels could have done?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 783, 2, 76, 'Even so, the Lord decided not to ask for that sort of help, because how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 783, 3, 76, 'else would the Scriptures be fulfilled? In the same way, if I ask God to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 783, 4, 76, 'protect me from every single problem I might encounter in my life, how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 783, 5, 76, 'will the Scripture be fulfilled? How will I fulfill my ministry?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 783, 6, 76, 'The Purpose of Prayer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 783, 7, 76, 'Prayer is not meant to be our way of asking God to save us from all of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 783, 8, 76, 'our problems and to protect us from every calamity. No! God allows some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 783, 9, 76, 'difficulties in our lives so that we can have a ministry. If Jesus had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 783, 10, 76, 'called the angels down to protect Him in Gethsemane, He wouldn’t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 783, 11, 76, 'fulfilled His ministry. And if God were to protect us from all of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 783, 12, 76, 'problems found in this world, we would not have a ministry to others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 783, 13, 76, 'Sometimes, we must experience what other people experience in order for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 783, 14, 76, 'us to empathize with their problems. That''s why God does not protect His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 783, 15, 76, 'children from certain types of suffering. In India, we ride on crowded');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 783, 16, 76, 'trains, stand in long queues, and wait hours on end at government');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 783, 17, 76, 'offices for permits and such. That''s what everybody else in our country');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 783, 18, 76, 'has to go through, and very often, God doesn''t shorten the process to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 783, 19, 76, 'make it easier for us by removing all roadblocks. We face the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 783, 20, 76, 'roadblocks that everybody in our country faces, and that''s how we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 783, 21, 76, 'empathize with them. We understand the struggles they''re going through,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 783, 22, 76, 'and we can say that we’ve faced the same things, but that we''ve learned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 783, 23, 76, 'to rejoice always. We’ve learned to trust God to help us, and we’ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 783, 24, 76, 'learned to be anxious for nothing. If we were protected from all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 783, 25, 76, 'calamities and problems and trials by prayer, then we’d have no ministry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 783, 26, 76, 'to others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 783, 27, 76, 'And this is why Jesus says that He won’t call the 72,000 angels to come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 783, 28, 76, 'protect Him. Rather, He wanted the Scriptures to be fulfilled! Then,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 784, 1, 76, 'Jesus said to the crowds of people who had come to capture Him, “Have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 784, 2, 76, 'you come out with swords and clubs to arrest Me as you would against a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 784, 3, 76, 'robber? Every day I used to sit in the temple teaching and you did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 784, 4, 76, 'seize Me” (Matthew 26:55). What need was there for them to come with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 784, 5, 76, 'weapons, as if He had been trying to run away from them? Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 784, 6, 76, 'continues, “‘But all this has taken place to fulfill the Scriptures of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 784, 7, 76, 'the prophets” (Matthew 26:56). After He finished, all His disciples left');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 784, 8, 76, 'Him and fled, the very disciples who had said that they would never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 784, 9, 76, 'leave Him. His disciples left Him when their lives were at risk, and we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 784, 10, 76, 'also will forsake Christ when we face trouble, unless we are filled with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 784, 11, 76, 'the Holy Spirit, Who builds up love for Jesus Christ in our hearts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 784, 12, 76, 'Those who are self-confident, saying, “Even if all men leave you, I will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 784, 13, 76, 'not leave you,” are usually the first ones to leave. The Bible says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 784, 14, 76, '“Let him who thinks he stands take heed that he does not fall” (1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 784, 15, 76, 'Corinthians 10:12). It is good for us to have low thoughts about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 784, 16, 76, 'ourselves, recognizing that we could deny the Lord as well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 784, 17, 76, 'The Purpose of Temptation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 784, 18, 76, '“Those who had seized Jesus led Him away to Caiaphas, the high priest,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 784, 19, 76, 'where the scribes and the elders were gathered together. But Peter was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 784, 20, 76, 'following Him at a distance as far as the courtyard of the high priest,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 784, 21, 76, 'and entered in, and sat down with the officers to see the outcome”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 784, 22, 76, '(Matthew 26:57-58). Another one of the gospels tells us that John spoke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 784, 23, 76, 'to the gatekeeper to allow Peter to come. Otherwise, Peter would not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 784, 24, 76, 'have been able to enter. However, John was related to the high priest,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 784, 25, 76, 'and so he could speak to the gatekeeper to let Peter in. Consider the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 784, 26, 76, 'result of Peter coming in. Because he came in, he was questioned by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 784, 27, 76, 'various people about his connection to Jesus, and three times he denied');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 784, 28, 76, 'the Lord. He denied knowing the Lord, and he let Him down. It all began');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 785, 1, 76, 'with John speaking to the gatekeeper, asking him to let Peter to come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 785, 2, 76, 'in. Later, Peter must have thought, “If John hadn’t spoken to the gate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 785, 3, 76, 'keeper, then I wouldn''t have got in, and I wouldn''t have been tempted.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 785, 4, 76, 'However, God allows us to be tempted. He might want to show us our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 785, 5, 76, 'weakness, if we’re too proud, or He may want to help us be strong if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 785, 6, 76, 'we’re humble. There are two ways God seeks to use temptation. If we''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 785, 7, 76, 'proud, God will allow us to fall in temptation to break us and to show');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 785, 8, 76, 'us that we’re so weak that it''s impossible for us to overcome. If we’re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 785, 9, 76, 'humble, God will give us grace in that temptation, to be an overcomer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 785, 10, 76, 'and to make us stronger. Temptation is meant to break or strengthen us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 785, 11, 76, 'God gives grace to the humble, but He opposes the proud (James 4:6).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 785, 12, 76, 'Small Additions Makes a False Witness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 785, 13, 76, 'While Peter was waiting for the outcome, “The chief priests and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 785, 14, 76, 'whole Council kept trying to obtain false testimony against Jesus, so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 785, 15, 76, 'that they might put Him to death” (Matthew 26:59). They wanted to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 785, 16, 76, 'maintain some semblance of justice, so they tried to get witnesses to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 785, 17, 76, 'tell lies about Jesus. Even then, they could not find any false');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 785, 18, 76, 'testimony about Him, despite many false witnesses coming forward with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 785, 19, 76, 'all types of lies. Finally, two people came forward saying, “This man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 785, 20, 76, 'stated, ‘I am able to destroy the temple of God and to rebuild it in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 785, 21, 76, 'three days’” (Matthew 26:61). We know very well that Jesus never said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 785, 22, 76, 'anything of that sort. What He actually said is recorded in John 2:19.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 785, 23, 76, 'He told the people, “Destroy this temple, and in three days I will raise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 785, 24, 76, 'it up” (Matthew 26:19). But according to the false witnesses, Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 785, 25, 76, 'said, “I''m able to destroy the temple of God.” However, that''s not what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 785, 26, 76, 'He said. Jesus He never said, “I''m going to destroy the temple of God.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 785, 27, 76, 'It''s just a little addition, and if you couldn’t remember exactly what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 785, 28, 76, 'He had said 3½ years before—this statement was made at the beginning of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 786, 1, 76, 'His ministry—you might say, “Yes, I remember Him saying something like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 786, 2, 76, 'that.” The problem is, that’s not what He said. There''s a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 786, 3, 76, 'difference between saying, “If you destroy the temple, I will raise it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 786, 4, 76, 'up in three days,” and saying, “I will destroy this temple, and then I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 786, 5, 76, 'will raise it up, I’ll rebuild it in three days.” Very often you find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 786, 6, 76, 'this subtle addition or removal of a word. It could be done deliberately');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 786, 7, 76, 'or unknowingly. Even today there are many bearing false witness about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 786, 8, 76, 'others in Christendom, making accusations based on false quotations.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 786, 9, 76, 'It’s all, “He said; He said; He said; He said.” It goes back and forth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 786, 10, 76, 'We might not even be telling lies consciously, we might just have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 786, 11, 76, 'forgotten what was actually said.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 786, 12, 76, 'Keeping Silent Against Your Accusers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 786, 13, 76, 'In Matthew, we read that such people are called false witnesses. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 786, 14, 76, 'might add one word to what was said, and you’re a false witness. These');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 786, 15, 76, 'two false witnesses came forward, and they said what sounded like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 786, 16, 76, 'truth, but it was not the truth. Then the high priest stood up and said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 786, 17, 76, 'to Jesus, "Do You not answer? What is it that these men are testifying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 786, 18, 76, 'against You?” (Matthew 26:62). Jesus could have said, “Listen, I did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 786, 19, 76, 'say I am able to destroy the temple of God, only that ‘If you destroy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 786, 20, 76, 'it, I will rebuild it.’” But, He kept silent (Matthew 26:63).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 786, 21, 76, 'What an example He is for us. We see it again when He stood before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 786, 22, 76, 'Pilate. He would not answer a word (Matthew 27:14). He kept silent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 786, 23, 76, 'because He knew that whatever He said, they would tear it to pieces,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 786, 24, 76, 'calling Him a liar. Then, the high priest said to Him, “I adjure You by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 786, 25, 76, 'the living God, that You tell us whether You are the Christ, the Son of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 786, 26, 76, 'God.” Jesus said to him, “You have said it yourself” (Matthew 26:63). In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 786, 27, 76, 'other words, Jesus says, “Yes, I am.” He continues, “You have said it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 786, 28, 76, 'yourself; nevertheless I tell you, hereafter you will see the Son of Man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 787, 1, 76, 'sitting at the right hand of power, and coming on the clouds of heaven”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 787, 2, 76, '(Matthew 26:64). He was talking about His Own Second Coming, and He told');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 787, 3, 76, 'the high priest that he would see it. In response, the high priest tore');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 787, 4, 76, 'his robes, which is a way of showing disgust with a witness or a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 787, 5, 76, 'criminal. He tore his clothes and said, “He has blasphemed! What further');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 787, 6, 76, 'need do we have of witnesses? Behold, you have now heard the blasphemy;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 787, 7, 76, 'what do you think?” (Matthew 26:65-66). When Jesus did answer a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 787, 8, 76, 'question, we see that the high priest had been taunting Jesus, looking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 787, 9, 76, 'for an excuse to get the crowd to turn against Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 787, 10, 76, 'And the crowd answered the high priest, “He deserves death!” (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 787, 11, 76, '26:66). The high priests and the other Pharisees had already been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 787, 12, 76, 'working them up to ask for His death, and they were just the stooges of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 787, 13, 76, 'these leaders when they said, “Yes, we want His death!” I''m amazed at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 787, 14, 76, 'what the crowd did, because I can''t believe among all those people that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 787, 15, 76, 'there was not at least one person whom Jesus had healed, and not at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 787, 16, 76, 'least one with a relative whom Jesus had healed. There must have been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 787, 17, 76, 'some there like that, and they completely forgot about what He had done.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 787, 18, 76, 'Man''s ingratitude is amazing, how quickly he forgets what God has done');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 787, 19, 76, 'for him and what other people have done for him. These people forgot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 787, 20, 76, 'what Jesus had done, “They spat in His face and beat Him with their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 787, 21, 76, 'fists; and others slapped Him, and said, ‘Prophesy to us, You Christ;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 787, 22, 76, 'who is the one who hit You?’” (Matthew 26:67-68).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 787, 23, 76, 'Though they taunted, troubled, and spat on Him, He never said a word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 787, 24, 76, 'Just as it says in Isaiah 53:7, “Like a lamb that is led to slaughter,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 787, 25, 76, 'And like a sheep that is silent before its shearers, So He did not open');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 787, 26, 76, 'His mouth.” He was oppressed and afflicted, but He didn''t open His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 787, 27, 76, 'mouth. Like a lamb that is led to the slaughter, like a sheep that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 787, 28, 76, 'silent before its shearers, He did not open His mouth. Three times in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 788, 1, 76, 'that verse it says that He did not open His mouth, that He was silent.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 788, 2, 76, 'You know, a sheep looks very beautiful when there is wool on it, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 788, 3, 76, 'when it is sheared, and all the wool is taken away, it looks so skinny');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 788, 4, 76, 'and ugly. When the people took away the beauty of Jesus and spat on Him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 788, 5, 76, 'He was silent. When they hit His face and disfigured it, He was silent.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 788, 6, 76, 'When they despised and taunted Him, He was silent.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 788, 7, 76, 'It requires tremendous grace to be silent under such provocations, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 788, 8, 76, 'that''s when we need to be silent. In the house of God, when we sing His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 788, 9, 76, 'praise, we need to shout with our lungs from the bottom of our hearts,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 788, 10, 76, 'raising our voices as much as we can. And when we are falsely accused,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 788, 11, 76, 'abused, and insulted, we need to keep quiet. We need to know when to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 788, 12, 76, 'raise our voices, and when to keep quiet. But alas, what do we see among');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 788, 13, 76, 'many believers? We see that in the time of praise, they are usually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 788, 14, 76, 'silent or whispering, but when somebody insults them or hurts them, they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 788, 15, 76, 'raise their voice in defense. They have it upside down. When you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 788, 16, 76, 'insulted, you should be silent, but in the house of God, you should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 788, 17, 76, 'raise your voice to praise Him. That''s where Jesus raises His voice. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 788, 18, 76, 'when He was sheared like a sheep, He stayed silent.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 788, 19, 76, 'Peter Denies Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 788, 20, 76, '“Peter was sitting outside in the courtyard, and a servant-girl came to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 788, 21, 76, 'him and said, ‘You too were with Jesus the Galilean.’ But he denied it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 788, 22, 76, 'before them all, saying ‘I do not know what you are talking about’”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 788, 23, 76, '(Matthew 26:69). Imagine saying that. We''re all scared for our lives,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 788, 24, 76, 'and Peter was scared for his. He completely forgot about the matter of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 788, 25, 76, 'being faithful to Christ. He said— “No, no, I don''t know what you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 788, 26, 76, 'talking about.” Do not judge and compare yourself with him. Remember, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 788, 27, 76, 'are living after the coming of the Holy Spirit, and the Spirit of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 788, 28, 76, 'has come into us. We have a certain strength that Peter did not have. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 789, 1, 76, 'was still under the Old Covenant, and under the Old Covenant, you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 789, 2, 76, 'have the strength and power that you can have with the Spirit of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 789, 3, 76, 'dwelling in you. Every true, born-again believer has the Spirit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 789, 4, 76, 'Christ within him, giving him strength. If we are filled with the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 789, 5, 76, 'Spirit, we are strong, and we can stand true to the Lord in the time of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 789, 6, 76, 'temptation. Otherwise, we will deny Him, “Let him who thinks he stands');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 789, 7, 76, 'take heed that he does not fall” (1 Corinthians 10:12).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 789, 8, 76, 'Peter denied Jesus a second time. “When he had gone out to the gateway,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 789, 9, 76, 'another servant-girl saw him and said to those who were there, ‘This man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 789, 10, 76, 'was with Jesus of Nazareth.’” She said that she was sure she saw him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 789, 11, 76, 'with Jesus of Nazareth, and again he denied it. “’I do not know the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 789, 12, 76, 'man.’ A little later the bystanders came up and said to Peter, ‘Surely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 789, 13, 76, 'you too are one of them; for even the way you talk gives you away.’ Then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 789, 14, 76, 'he began to curse and swear, ‘I do not know the man!’ And immediately a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 789, 15, 76, 'rooster crowed. And Peter remembered the word which Jesus had said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 789, 16, 76, '‘Before a cock crows, you will deny Me three times.’ And he went out and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 789, 17, 76, 'wept bitterly” (Matthew 26:71-75).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 789, 18, 76, 'Peter’s strength in himself shattered. His self-confidence shattered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 789, 19, 76, 'too. He was being circumcised inwardly. God was bringing him to a place');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 789, 20, 76, 'where he had no self-confidence at all, a wonderful place where there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 789, 21, 76, 'total dependence upon God alone. Notice also how the Lord reminded Peter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 789, 22, 76, 'through the crowing of a rooster (Matthew 26:74). Afterward, he went out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 789, 23, 76, 'and wept bitterly. God can use simple things to make us remember');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 789, 24, 76, 'promises we have made that we have broken. Has He ever used some little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 789, 25, 76, 'thing in nature or some other little unexpected thing to remind you of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 789, 26, 76, 'promise that you have broken to the Lord or somebody else? God does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 789, 27, 76, 'that. He speaks through animals too: the cock crowing and the donkey');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 789, 28, 76, 'speaking to Balaam.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 790, 1, 76, 'I also wanted to point out verse 73. One of the bystanders came up to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 790, 2, 76, 'Peter and told him that the way he talked gave him away. Apply that to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 790, 3, 76, 'yourself. I thought of it this way, “Lord, I want to be such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 790, 4, 76, 'wholehearted Christian that the way I talk gives me away.” People should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 790, 5, 76, 'say, “Here’s a Christian. This guy is a disciple of Jesus. By the way he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 790, 6, 76, 'talks, he is obviously a believer.” It''s a wonderful thing to have that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 790, 7, 76, 'testimony, that the way we live and the way we talk give us away. People');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 790, 8, 76, 'should say that this person is different. I believe this can only come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 790, 9, 76, 'about if we are first totally circumcised of all confidence in the self.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 790, 10, 76, 'We must be shattered, and we must have given up.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 790, 11, 76, 'Heed God’s Warnings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 790, 12, 76, 'Peter had three chances. But after the first time, he never asked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 790, 13, 76, 'himself, “What’s happened to me? I denied the Lord, and the Lord warned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 790, 14, 76, 'me that I would deny Him three times.” Peter didn’t take it seriously,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 790, 15, 76, 'so he denied him a second time. Again, he didn’t ask himself, “What’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 790, 16, 76, 'happening?”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 790, 17, 76, 'The Lord gives us warnings along the way. If we don''t heed them, we will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 790, 18, 76, 'eventually fall over the cliff. That''s exactly what happened to Peter.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 790, 19, 76, 'Every time we fall and slip, we should judge ourselves and go to God. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 790, 20, 76, 'believe that judging ourselves should be a way of life for us. All the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 790, 21, 76, 'time, we must go to God, and say, “Lord, what are You trying to tell me?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 790, 22, 76, 'I want to hear what You''re trying to say to me.” If I fail once but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 790, 23, 76, 'listen to God, I may not fall a second time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 790, 24, 76, 'Peter was self-confident even after the first, and then the second,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 790, 25, 76, 'denial. He remained self-confident instead of recognizing that he was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 790, 26, 76, 'close to falling away. But, to his credit, after Peter had denied the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 790, 27, 76, 'Lord three times, he remembered the word that Jesus had said to him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 790, 28, 76, 'When we fall into sin, it is good to remember what Jesus has said. Peter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 791, 1, 76, 'went out afterward and wept bitterly. He was thoroughly broken. That was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 791, 2, 76, 'the beginning of his turning around. When we learn to weep bitterly over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 791, 3, 76, 'our failure and sin, then we too have begun the way back to the ministry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 791, 4, 76, 'that God has for us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 791, 5, 76, 'Peter denied the Lord three times. What do we learn from that about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 791, 6, 76, 'Jesus’ ways? He warns us in advance of dangers that we are going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 791, 7, 76, 'face. He allows us to fall so that we can be broken. This is what we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 791, 8, 76, 'learn about Jesus’ ways from the way He allowed Peter to fall. He never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 791, 9, 76, 'prayed that Peter would not fall. He prayed that after Peter fell and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 791, 10, 76, 'hit rock bottom, Peter would not lose His faith. Jesus prayed that Peter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 791, 11, 76, 'would still believe that the Father loved Him, and Peter would come back');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 791, 12, 76, 'to Him. This is what we see in the way Jesus dealt with Peter, and that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 791, 13, 76, 'is how He deals with us as well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 791, 14, 77, 'Chapter 76 Jesus Our Forerunner in the Courts of Injustice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 791, 15, 77, '“When morning had come, all the chief priests and the elders took');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 791, 16, 77, 'counsel against Jesus to put Him to death; and they bound Him, and they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 791, 17, 77, 'led Him away, and delivered Him up to Pilate the governor (Pilate was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 791, 18, 77, 'the only one who could sanction the death penalty). Then when Judas, who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 791, 19, 77, 'had betrayed Him, saw that He had been condemned, he felt remorse and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 791, 20, 77, 'returned the thirty pieces of silver to the chief priests and elders,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 791, 21, 77, 'and confessed to them saying, “I have sinned by betraying innocent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 791, 22, 77, 'blood.” But they said, “What is that to us? See to that yourself!”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 791, 23, 77, '(Matthew 27:1-4)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 791, 24, 77, 'Go to Jesus for forgiveness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 791, 25, 77, 'I have a feeling that Judas Iscariot probably thought that Jesus escaped');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 791, 26, 77, 'out of situations like this many times. Judas thought Jesus could escape');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 791, 27, 77, 'somehow or the other this time too. And Judas would get 30 pieces of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 791, 28, 77, 'silver because he did his job. He was so greedy and covetous. When he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 792, 1, 77, 'discovered that Jesus did not let Himself escape this time and allowed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 792, 2, 77, 'Himself to be captured, then Judas felt remorse because he thought of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 792, 3, 77, 'all the goodness that Jesus had shown him through many, many years. Then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 792, 4, 77, 'Judas went to the priests. This is the first case that we read of a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 792, 5, 77, 'who has sinned and went to a priest to confess. Instead of going to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 792, 6, 77, 'priest to confess his sin and saying, “I have sinned,” (Matthew 27:4)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 792, 7, 77, 'Judas should have gone to Jesus, just like the thief on the cross who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 792, 8, 77, 'went to Jesus. Judas could have gone to Jesus and said, “O Lord, I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 792, 9, 77, 'sorry I betrayed You!” Judas’ end would have been so different. If he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 792, 10, 77, 'had only turned then! But he would not. The Lord knew in advance that he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 792, 11, 77, 'would not. That is why He said, “He is the son of perdition,” and “It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 792, 12, 77, 'would be better if he was not even born.” What was Judas’ problem? It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 792, 13, 77, 'was not that he fell. It was not even that he betrayed Jesus. Judas’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 792, 14, 77, 'problem was that he would not repent. That is why he went to hell.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 792, 15, 77, 'People do not go to hell because they sin. They go to hell because they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 792, 16, 77, 'do not repent of their sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 792, 17, 77, 'Our sins have been paid for on the cross. There is no need for a single');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 792, 18, 77, 'human being to go to hell because all sins have been paid for. What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 792, 19, 77, 'about that terrible sin of betraying Jesus Christ? It can be forgiven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 792, 20, 77, 'Jesus said that whoever speaks a word against the Son of Man, it will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 792, 21, 77, 'forgiven. Whoever does something to Son of Man, it will be forgiven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 792, 22, 77, 'Judas had heard all that. He could have gone to Him and said, “O Lord, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 792, 23, 77, 'am sorry that I betrayed You! I thought You would escape again!” But he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 792, 24, 77, 'did not do that. Instead, he went to the priests and he confessed, “I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 792, 25, 77, 'betrayed innocent blood. I have sinned.” Does a person who says, “I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 792, 26, 77, 'sinned,” still go to hell? Well, here is an example of one. Can we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 792, 27, 77, 'categorize him as a person that was better off if he was not even born?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 792, 28, 77, 'Well, that is how Jesus categorized him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 793, 1, 77, 'Judas threw the money, and said he would not take it. The chief priests');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 793, 2, 77, 'would not take the money back. He felt guilty. He threw the pieces of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 793, 3, 77, 'silver into the sanctuary and departed. Judas then went away and hung');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 793, 4, 77, 'himself. That was tragic that he went away and destroyed his own self,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 793, 5, 77, 'instead of going to Jesus and repenting. The wonderful message of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 793, 6, 77, 'gospel is that all of us can repent. If you have a slight desire to turn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 793, 7, 77, 'to God, use it and turn to God and say, “Lord forgive me for I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 793, 8, 77, 'failed.” Even if you have done the most terrible sin, like Judas');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 793, 9, 77, 'betraying Jesus Christ, you can come back to Him in repentance. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 793, 10, 77, 'Judas did not do that. Do not go to man. Do not go to priests. The only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 793, 11, 77, 'sin that we confess to men is that which we commit against them. Sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 793, 12, 77, 'must only be confessed to God. There is no such thing as confessing to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 793, 13, 77, 'priest, and there is no such thing as public confession of sin. All this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 793, 14, 77, 'is a deception. We have to confess our sins only to God, except where we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 793, 15, 77, 'have sinned against another person. Jesus said in Matthew 5:23-24 to go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 793, 16, 77, 'to that person and be reconciled. Otherwise, we do not have to go to man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 793, 17, 77, 'to confess our sin because man cannot forgive our sin. What is the point');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 793, 18, 77, 'of going to him? But if we have hurt that person, then we must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 793, 19, 77, 'definitely go and ask him for forgiveness. So this is the mistake Judas');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 793, 20, 77, 'made. He went to the priests instead of going to Christ. It is just like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 793, 21, 77, 'what a lot of people do today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 793, 22, 77, 'When Judas threw the money away, the chief priests said, “We cannot put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 793, 23, 77, 'this money into the temple treasury because it is the price of blood.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 793, 24, 77, 'These religious leaders were such crooks, just like a lot of crooked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 793, 25, 77, 'religious leaders today. They counseled together, and with the money,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 793, 26, 77, 'they bought the potter''s field as a burial place for strangers. For this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 793, 27, 77, 'reason, that field has been called the “Field of Blood” to this day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 793, 28, 77, 'Matthew 27:9 says, “Then that which was spoken through Jeremiah the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 794, 1, 77, 'prophet was fulfilled, saying, ‘and they took the thirty pieces of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 794, 2, 77, 'silver, the price of the one whose price had been set by the sons of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 794, 3, 77, 'Israel.’” There is an Old Testament prophecy on this in Zechariah 11:12.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 794, 4, 77, 'Matthew 27:10 says, “And they gave them for the potter’s field, as the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 794, 5, 77, 'Lord directed me.” That is prophesized in Zechariah 11:13. These things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 794, 6, 77, 'were all written in the Old Testament prophets.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 794, 7, 77, 'Responding to Questions, but Silent to Accusation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 794, 8, 77, '“Jesus stood before the governor, and the governor questioned Him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 794, 9, 77, 'saying, ‘Are You the King of the Jews?’ And Jesus said to him, ‘It is as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 794, 10, 77, 'you say’” (Matthew 27:11). When He was asked who He was, He said, “This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 794, 11, 77, 'is what I am,” but then when He was being accused, He kept quiet. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 794, 12, 77, 'see the difference. When He was accused with all those false');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 794, 13, 77, 'accusations, He made no reply. But when He was asked about Who He was,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 794, 14, 77, 'He replied. It is the same thing we do today. Somebody asks us, “Are you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 794, 15, 77, 'a Christian?” We should respond, “Yes, I am a Christian.” I am not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 794, 16, 77, 'ashamed to be known as a Christian. But if they accuse us falsely, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 794, 17, 77, 'follow Jesus and we do not reply, particularly when religious people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 794, 18, 77, 'accuse us. I am not talking about a false accusation in your place of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 794, 19, 77, 'work where you probably need to state that you are not guilty of that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 794, 20, 77, 'Say “No!” to that crime or whatever they are charging you with so that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 794, 21, 77, 'people do not get a bad opinion and you lose your testimony as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 794, 22, 77, 'Christian. We must not misunderstand this. If people accuse you falsely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 794, 23, 77, 'in your office, do not keep quiet because then the testimony of the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 794, 24, 77, 'is dishonored. Then you need to defend yourself and say, “No, I did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 794, 25, 77, 'do that, sir.” But otherwise, when Christians accuse you saying you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 794, 26, 77, 'a false prophet, etc. follow Jesus’ example and be silent. Let them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 794, 27, 77, 'shear all the wool off you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 794, 28, 77, 'Matthew 27:13 says, “Then Pilate said to Him, ‘Do You not hear how many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 795, 1, 77, 'things they testify against You?’” It was not just one thing. There were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 795, 2, 77, 'many, many things that they were charging Him with. Jesus did not answer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 795, 3, 77, 'Pilate with regard to even a single charge. The governor was amazed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 795, 4, 77, 'Pilate had seen many trials in his life, but he had never seen a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 795, 5, 77, 'prisoner like this, who would not reply to a single charge, not even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 795, 6, 77, 'one! Matthew 27:14 is a great verse to bear in mind when people accuse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 795, 7, 77, 'us of something. It is the sort of reply we need to give to people, who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 795, 8, 77, 'know the Scriptures When they accuse us falsely about many things, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 795, 9, 77, 'can say, “Matthew 27:14 is what I live by.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 795, 10, 77, '“Jesus did not answer Pilate with regard to even a single charge”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 795, 11, 77, '(Matthew 27:14) because He lived before God''s face. Similarly, we should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 795, 12, 77, 'commit our cause to Him who judges righteously and not give a reply. 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 795, 13, 77, 'Peter 2:21 says that we have to follow in Jesus’ footsteps. When we see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 795, 14, 77, 'what Jesus did and how He acted, His life is not just something to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 795, 15, 77, 'admire. We say, “Lord, we want to do that ourselves.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 795, 16, 77, '1 Peter 2:21 says, “Christ suffered for us, leaving us an example to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 795, 17, 77, 'follow in His steps.” How do we do this? The following verses say, first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 795, 18, 77, 'of all, “in His steps, Who committed no sin.” We must really seek to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 795, 19, 77, 'follow in His steps, Who committed no sin. We must also follow in His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 795, 20, 77, 'steps, “in whose mouth was found no deceit or deception.” We must follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 795, 21, 77, 'His steps, Who “when He was reviled, did not revile in return.” We must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 795, 22, 77, 'follow His steps, Who “while suffering uttered no threats.” We must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 795, 23, 77, 'follow in His steps, Who “kept entrusting Himself to Him who judges');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 795, 24, 77, 'righteously.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 795, 25, 77, 'Leave It to God to Repay Evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 795, 26, 77, 'This is where we have to follow in His steps by saying, “Father, this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 795, 27, 77, 'charge these guys have brought against me, I leave that with You. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 795, 28, 77, 'will take care of it.” There are a number of times when people have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 796, 1, 77, 'sought to harm me, or done some evil, or spoken or written some evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 796, 2, 77, 'against me, and the Lord has asked me, “Do you want Me to deal with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 796, 3, 77, 'them? Or do you want to deal with that yourself?” I said, “Lord, You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 796, 4, 77, 'deal with that. I am not going to deal with it. I want to follow Jesus,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 796, 5, 77, 'Who kept silent.” Let us follow that example in faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 796, 6, 77, '“Now at the feast, the governor was accustomed to release for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 796, 7, 77, 'multitude any one prisoner whom they wanted. And they were holding at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 796, 8, 77, 'that time a notorious prisoner, called Barabbas. When therefore they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 796, 9, 77, 'were gathered together, Pilate said to all the people, ‘Whom do you want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 796, 10, 77, 'me to release to you?’ There is a custom in the feast to release one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 796, 11, 77, 'prisoner. Shall I release Barabbas, who is a well-known notorious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 796, 12, 77, 'criminal? Or shall I release Jesus and let Him go? One of these I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 796, 13, 77, 'going to let go” (Matthew 27:15-17). Pilate recognized that Jesus was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 796, 14, 77, 'not the criminal. He was brought up because of the jealousy of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 796, 15, 77, 'Pharisees, who could not have the type of ministry He had. Even a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 796, 16, 77, 'like Pilate recognized that this was sheer jealousy. While he was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 796, 17, 77, 'sitting there, and before the crowds could answer that question, his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 796, 18, 77, 'wife sent a message to him. Look at the number of warnings that came to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 796, 19, 77, 'Pilate. She said to him, “Have nothing to do with that righteous Man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 796, 20, 77, 'because last night I suffered greatly in a dream because of Him”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 796, 21, 77, '(Matthew 27:19). I do not know what exactly she dreamt, but she');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 796, 22, 77, 'suffered. She felt that there was some person her husband was judging');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 796, 23, 77, 'who was absolutely righteous. It was a great crime that was being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 796, 24, 77, 'committed. She sent that message to him, but he ignored it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 796, 25, 77, 'Jesus as the Forerunner');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 796, 26, 77, 'The chief priests and the elders persuaded the multitudes to ask for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 796, 27, 77, 'Barabbas and to put Jesus to death. There must have been many people who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 796, 28, 77, 'had been healed by Jesus or were part of the 5,000 who were fed. Many of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 797, 1, 77, 'those people had experienced those blessings! But they had forgotten all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 797, 2, 77, 'of it. Now they were just going along with the crowd to be popular. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 797, 3, 77, 'said that if everybody is demanding His death, we will demand His death');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 797, 4, 77, 'too. The chief priests urged them not to ask for Jesus, but to ask for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 797, 5, 77, 'Barabbas. Let Barabbas be released. So they asked for Barabbas. Pilate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 797, 6, 77, 'was longing so much to release Jesus, especially after hearing from his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 797, 7, 77, 'wife. If you and I come into a situation like this, where we are falsely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 797, 8, 77, 'accused, and they prefer a criminal in place of us, we can be sure there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 797, 9, 77, 'is Someone, a Forerunner, Who is going ahead of us. I remember when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 797, 10, 77, 'religious people took me to court. The Lord said to me that religious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 797, 11, 77, 'people have taken Him to court as well. He said to Me, “If you look for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 797, 12, 77, 'My footsteps, you will see My footsteps in that court.” And I did. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 797, 13, 77, 'looked for the footsteps of Jesus in the court, and I saw them: forgive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 797, 14, 77, 'and love, forgive and love, forgive and love.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 797, 15, 77, 'Jesus is an example for us. He has gone ahead of us. He is a forerunner');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 797, 16, 77, 'who has gone through every temptation we have gone through and showed us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 797, 17, 77, 'an example how we are to be. Now we have to follow in His footsteps and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 797, 18, 77, 'be an example to others who come behind us. He never said a word when He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 797, 19, 77, 'was falsely accused. A criminal was preferred in place of Him. Can you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 797, 20, 77, 'imagine that? A criminal being preferred in place of the Son of God? He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 797, 21, 77, 'just said, “That is fine. God is sovereign.” Remember this: we can never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 797, 22, 77, 'follow Jesus if we do not believe in the total sovereignty of God, Who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 797, 23, 77, 'controls all circumstances and events relating to our lives. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 797, 24, 77, 'believe that, then you will be able to accept that God has allowed this,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 797, 25, 77, 'and in His sovereignty, He will bring out something wonderful out of it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 797, 26, 77, 'Pilate asked the crowd, “Okay, if you want Barabbas, I will release him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 797, 27, 77, 'What shall I do with Jesus who is called the Christ?” The crowd had been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 797, 28, 77, 'instigated by the religious leaders, and they all said, “Let Him be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 798, 1, 77, 'crucified!” Pilate was longing to let Him go. He said, “Why shall I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 798, 2, 77, 'crucify Him? What evil has He done?” But they kept shouting all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 798, 3, 77, 'more, “Let Him be crucified! Let Him be crucified!” When Pilate saw that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 798, 4, 77, 'he was accomplishing nothing and a riot was going to start now, he took');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 798, 5, 77, 'water and washed his hands in front of the multitude, saying, “I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 798, 6, 77, 'innocent of this Man’s blood; see to that yourselves” as if he could get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 798, 7, 77, 'away with that. He had the right to release them. He could have released');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 798, 8, 77, 'Jesus and Barabbas. But he wanted to be popular with the people. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 798, 9, 77, 'what we see here. He wanted to be popular with the people, and he was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 798, 10, 77, 'willing to condemn Jesus. Pilate washes his hands in public and says, “I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 798, 11, 77, 'have nothing to do with this.” And all the people said, “That is fine.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 798, 12, 77, 'His blood be upon us and on our children!” That is exactly what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 798, 13, 77, 'happened. These were Jewish people who had crucified Christ, and they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 798, 14, 77, 'said, “We are the ones who support His crucifixion. If there is any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 798, 15, 77, 'guilt, let it be on us and on our children.” And it happened exactly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 798, 16, 77, 'like that. The guilt was on them and on their children. Pilate washed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 798, 17, 77, 'his hand and said, “I''m innocent of all this myself.” He released');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 798, 18, 77, 'Barabbas for them, and after having Jesus scourged, he delivered Him up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 798, 19, 77, 'to be crucified.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 798, 20, 77, '“Then the soldiers of the governor took Jesus into the Praetorium and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 798, 21, 77, 'gathered the whole Roman cohort around Him. They gathered all the Roman');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 798, 22, 77, 'soldiers. They stripped Him and put a scarlet robe on Him. They wove a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 798, 23, 77, 'crown of thorns and put it on His head. They also put a reed in His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 798, 24, 77, 'right hand, kneeled down before Him, and mocked Him, saying, ‘Hail, King');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 798, 25, 77, 'of the Jews!’ (This can happen also to people who are persecuted for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 798, 26, 77, 'Christ’s sake. They are taunted and ridiculed). After that, they spat on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 798, 27, 77, 'Him, took the reed, and began to beat Him on the head” (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 798, 28, 77, '27:27-30).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 799, 1, 77, 'Why Jesus Had to Suffer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 799, 2, 77, 'We can ask us ourselves why did this have to happen? We know that Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 799, 3, 77, 'had to die for our sins, but why does God have to allow Him to go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 799, 4, 77, 'through this painful way before He dies on the cross? “Couldn’t God have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 799, 5, 77, 'protected Him from at least all this ridicule, etc. before the cross?”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 799, 6, 77, 'This was not necessary. But God''s way is that Jesus was to be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 799, 7, 77, 'Forerunner for all the martyrs in Christian history. Therefore, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 799, 8, 77, 'He had to be an Example for every one of them, He had to suffer through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 799, 9, 77, 'this ridicule, etc.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 799, 10, 77, 'If you are a Christian leader, you are also called to be a sort of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 799, 11, 77, 'mini-forerunner. You have to be one who is looking at Jesus, the Chief');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 799, 12, 77, 'Runner, as a mini-forerunner so that you can look around at other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 799, 13, 77, 'people, especially younger people behind you, and say, “Follow me as I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 799, 14, 77, 'follow Christ. I also do not defend myself. I keep quiet when I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 799, 15, 77, 'falsely accused.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 799, 16, 77, '“He was led away to be crucified. As they were coming out, they found a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 799, 17, 77, 'man of Cyrene named Simon, whom they pressed into service to bear His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 799, 18, 77, 'cross” (Matthew 27:31b-32). Remember that the cross that Jesus asks us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 799, 19, 77, 'to bear is not something forced on us. The Roman soldiers forced Simon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 799, 20, 77, 'of Cyrene to bear the cross, and they forced Jesus to bear the cross;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 799, 21, 77, 'but the cross that Jesus asks us to take is not something that is forced');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 799, 22, 77, 'on us at all. You do not have to take it if you do not want to. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 799, 23, 77, 'said, “If any man wishes to come after Me, let Him take up his cross and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 799, 24, 77, 'follow Me.” That leads to the crucifixion. There is a voluntary choice.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 799, 25, 77, 'You do not have to go to the cross if you do not want to, but if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 799, 26, 77, 'want to follow Jesus, there is no other way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 799, 27, 77, '“When they had come to a place called ‘Golgotha’, which means ‘Place of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 799, 28, 77, 'a Skull’, they gave Him wine to drink mingled with gall; and after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 800, 1, 77, 'tasting it, He was unwilling to drink” (Matthew 27:33-34). Why was He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 800, 2, 77, 'unwilling to drink that wine? He did not want to be dulled on the cross');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 800, 3, 77, '- He wanted to be alert on the cross. There were a lot of things He had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 800, 4, 77, 'to accomplish. This was a little act of mercy that they gave Him. It was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 800, 5, 77, 'some type of anesthetic, given so that He would not feel the pain so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 800, 6, 77, 'much. But He just tasted it, and He knew that this was an anesthetic. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 800, 7, 77, 'did not want this. I believe the Spirit of God prompted Him at that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 800, 8, 77, 'time, “Do not take it.” There was a need for that. He had to speak from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 800, 9, 77, 'the cross, forgive them, and say, “Father, forgive them, for they know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 800, 10, 77, 'not what they do.” He would not have been able to say that if He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 800, 11, 77, 'anaesthetized on the cross. He had to take care of His mother and say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 800, 12, 77, '“Woman, I want to ask John to look after you.” And most important of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 800, 13, 77, 'all, He had to forgive a repentant thief on the cross. How could He do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 800, 14, 77, 'that if He was anesthetized?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 800, 15, 77, 'Jesus Was Sensitive to the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 800, 16, 77, '“They gave Him wine to drink mixed with gall; but after tasting it, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 800, 17, 77, 'said, ‘No, I do not want it’” (Matthew 27:34). But later on, after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 800, 18, 77, 'everything was over, after He had forgiven the thief on the cross, after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 800, 19, 77, 'He made provision for His mother, etc. then we read in John 19:29,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 800, 20, 77, '“There was a jar full of sour wine standing there; so they put a sponge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 800, 21, 77, 'full of the sour wine upon a branch of hyssop, and brought it up to His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 800, 22, 77, 'mouth and He received it.” Then it was okay, but at the beginning it was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 800, 23, 77, 'not. This teaches us that even when Jesus was hanging on the cross, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 800, 24, 77, 'was very sensitive to the voice of the Holy Spirit, like He had been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 800, 25, 77, 'from the beginning. Jesus asked, “Father, should I take this or not?”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 800, 26, 77, 'And the Father said, “No, do not take it now.” We see the reason why the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 800, 27, 77, 'Father told Him not to take it till the end of six hours on the cross.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 800, 28, 77, 'This was because He had to forgive a thief, take care of His mother, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 801, 1, 77, 'forgive the people who crucified Him. Jesus needed to be alert to pray,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 801, 2, 77, '“Father, forgive them,” and to encourage the thief on the right side to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 801, 3, 77, 'assure him that he would be with Him in paradise. Jesus wanted to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 801, 4, 77, 'provide for His mother and to tell John to take care of His mother.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 801, 5, 77, 'Jesus wanted also to cry out those words, “My God, My God why hast Thou');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 801, 6, 77, 'forsaken Me?” So then, after He had finished all of this, they gave Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 801, 7, 77, 'something to drink (Matthew 27:48), and He was willing to take it. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 801, 8, 77, 'demonstrates His sensitivity to the voice of the Holy Spirit even when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 801, 9, 77, 'He was hanging on the cross. If a man is offered some type of anesthetic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 801, 10, 77, 'to relieve the pain, it is normal for a man to take it. But as soon as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 801, 11, 77, 'He was offered the anesthetic, Jesus heard the voice the Spirit saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 801, 12, 77, '“Do not take it.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 801, 13, 77, 'It is wonderful to live like this. We have seen this again and again in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 801, 14, 77, 'the life of Jesus. This is the Christian life. What we learn from Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 801, 15, 77, 'is not to live by certain laws, but to live by the prompting of the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 801, 16, 77, 'Spirit in every little thing. From the time we are born again right up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 801, 17, 77, 'until the moment we die and even on our death bed, we need to listen to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 801, 18, 77, 'the voice of the Holy Spirit. So much is missed if we do not listen to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 801, 19, 77, 'the Holy Spirit. God has called us on earth to be a blessing to other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 801, 20, 77, 'people. If we listen to the voice of the Spirit, we can complete our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 801, 21, 77, 'earthly tasks fully. The great thing in the Christian life is to learn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 801, 22, 77, 'to be led by the Holy Spirit. This is the whole secret of the Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 801, 23, 77, 'life. If we have learned the secret, then we have learned the most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 801, 24, 77, 'important thing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 801, 25, 78, 'Chapter 77 Scripture Fulfilled in Jesus’ Suffering on the Cross');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 801, 26, 78, 'Scripture Was Constantly Fulfilled in Jesus’s Life – Even His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 801, 27, 78, 'Crucifixion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 801, 28, 78, '“And when they had crucified Him, they divided up His garments among');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 802, 1, 78, 'themselves, casting lots” (Matthew 27:35). In the book of Matthew, many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 802, 2, 78, 'times we find this phrase, “so that the Scripture might be fulfilled.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 802, 3, 78, 'For example, we saw that Matthew 1:22-23 says the virgin shall be with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 802, 4, 78, 'child so that the Scriptures might be fulfilled. In Isaiah 7:14, it says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 802, 5, 78, 'that, “Therefore the Lord Himself will give you a sign: Behold, a virgin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 802, 6, 78, 'will be with child and bear a son, and she will call His name Immanuel.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 802, 7, 78, 'Also, Jesus’ birth was in Bethlehem was so that the Scriptures might be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 802, 8, 78, 'fulfilled. Matthew 2:5-6 says, “They said to him, ‘In Bethlehem of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 802, 9, 78, 'Judea; for this is what has been written by the prophet: ‘And you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 802, 10, 78, 'Bethlehem, land of Judah, Are by no means least among the leaders of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 802, 11, 78, 'Judah; For out of you shall come forth a Ruler Who will shepherd My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 802, 12, 78, 'people Israel.’” This fulfills what is written in Micah 5:2 which says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 802, 13, 78, 'that Jesus should be born in Bethlehem.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 802, 14, 78, 'Jesus went to Egypt and came out of Egypt as it was written in Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 802, 15, 78, '2:15 so that the Scripture, the word of the prophet, might be fulfilled.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 802, 16, 78, 'The prophet Hosea had written in Hosea 11:1, “Out of Egypt, I call My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 802, 17, 78, 'Son.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 802, 18, 78, 'In Matthew 2:23, Jesus resided in Nazareth so that what was spoken by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 802, 19, 78, 'the prophets might be fulfilled: “He shall be called a Nazarene.” And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 802, 20, 78, 'even when He moved to Capernaum from Nazareth in Matthew 4:13-14, it was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 802, 21, 78, 'so that what was spoken through Isaiah the prophet might be fulfilled.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 802, 22, 78, 'Again, Matthew 12:17 mentions that what was spoken through Isaiah the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 802, 23, 78, 'prophet might be fulfilled. We see this through the whole Gospel of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 802, 24, 78, 'Matthew right through until the end.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 802, 25, 78, 'Now we come to His time when He was hanging on the cross. Matthew 27:35');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 802, 26, 78, 'says, “They divided up His garments among themselves by casting lots.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 802, 27, 78, 'This is not what Jesus was doing. It is what those Roman soldiers were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 802, 28, 78, 'doing. Even that was done in order to fulfill Scripture.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 803, 1, 78, 'In the Old Testament, Psalm 22 is the Psalm of the cross. It begins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 803, 2, 78, 'with, “My God, My God, why hast Thou forsaken Me?” It is a prophetic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 803, 3, 78, 'reference to how Jesus would be forsaken on the cross by the Father for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 803, 4, 78, 'our sins. Psalm 22 is a mixture of prophecy plus David''s own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 803, 5, 78, 'experiences. So not all of it is prophetic. Here and there you find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 803, 6, 78, 'something that is prophetic, but not all. In Psalm 22:16, it says here,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 803, 7, 78, '“For dogs have surrounded me; A band of evildoers has encompassed me;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 803, 8, 78, 'They pierced my hands and my feet.” This is a clear reference to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 803, 9, 78, 'cross. It was not David’s experience; nobody pierced his hands and feet.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 803, 10, 78, 'Psalm 22:17-18 says, “I can count all my bones. They look, they stare at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 803, 11, 78, 'me; they divide my garments among them, And for my clothing they cast');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 803, 12, 78, 'lots.” This is referring to the time when Jesus was hanging on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 803, 13, 78, 'cross. This is exactly what happened in Matthew 27:35. Even the Roman');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 803, 14, 78, 'soldiers were unconsciously fulfilling a prophecy that was written by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 803, 15, 78, 'David one thousand years earlier. We see this repeated reference, “So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 803, 16, 78, 'that the Scripture might be fulfilled.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 803, 17, 78, 'If you compare Matthew 27:48 with John 19:28-29, this was also so that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 803, 18, 78, 'Scripture might be fulfilled. John 19:28-29 says, “After this, Jesus,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 803, 19, 78, 'knowing that all things had already been accomplished, to fulfill the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 803, 20, 78, 'Scripture, said, ‘I am thirsty.’ A jar full of sour wine was standing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 803, 21, 78, 'there; so they put a sponge full of the sour wine upon a branch of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 803, 22, 78, 'hyssop and brought it up to His mouth.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 803, 23, 78, 'There was a specific plan that God made for Jesus life right from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 803, 24, 78, 'time of His birth in Bethlehem all the way to the time when He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 803, 25, 78, 'hanging on the cross, and even to His resurrection. God planned for even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 803, 26, 78, 'what others would do to fulfill Scripture related to Christ. For example');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 803, 27, 78, 'His being taken as a baby to Egypt, His being brought back to His living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 803, 28, 78, 'in Nazareth, and His move to Capernaum was all done to fulfill');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 804, 1, 78, 'Scripture. We also see this in Matthew 12:18-21 where His actions and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 804, 2, 78, 'preaching were written down.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 804, 3, 78, 'What can we learn from this? Jesus recognized that God the Father had a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 804, 4, 78, 'plan for His life. In fact, that is something that applies to all of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 804, 5, 78, 'God''s children.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 804, 6, 78, 'Psalm 139:13 also says, “For You formed my inward parts; You wove me in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 804, 7, 78, 'my mother’s womb.” This is referring to the time when David was in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 804, 8, 78, 'mother’s womb. Then Psalm 139:16 says, “Your eyes have seen my unformed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 804, 9, 78, 'substance; And in Your book were all written the days that were ordained');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 804, 10, 78, 'for me, when as yet there was not one of them.” This is the book in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 804, 11, 78, 'which God’s plan for David was written. For example, David should be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 804, 12, 78, 'anointed maybe around 19 or 20 years of age. David should be king at 30.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 804, 13, 78, 'David should be king over all Israel at 37. David should die perhaps');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 804, 14, 78, 'around 70. All written that was written, and that applies to every child');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 804, 15, 78, 'of God. The earlier in your life you believe this, the better, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 804, 16, 78, 'you can seek to fulfill God''s plan for your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 804, 17, 78, 'Trusting God’s Leading');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 804, 18, 78, 'We have often considered this great truth, which I believe is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 804, 19, 78, 'greatest truth in the whole Bible: John 17:23 says that God loves us as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 804, 20, 78, 'He loved Jesus Christ. There are many verses that tell us that God loves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 804, 21, 78, 'us. But John 17:23 is the only verse that tells us how much God loves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 804, 22, 78, 'us. God loves us as much as He loved Jesus Christ. Because that is true,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 804, 23, 78, 'we know that if God had a specific plan made out for Jesus’ life from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 804, 24, 78, 'birth to death, then we can be absolutely sure that God has made a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 804, 25, 78, 'specific plan for us. But that will not be fulfilled unless you believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 804, 26, 78, 'it and you seek it. Jesus was always seeking to find that will. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 804, 27, 78, 'why He prayed often. That is why He sought, cried out and kept Himself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 804, 28, 78, 'from sin so that His mind would be clear, so that He would be sensitive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 805, 1, 78, 'to the voice of the Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 805, 2, 78, 'In little things, He would walk down a road and the Spirit of God would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 805, 3, 78, 'say, “Stop, look up into the tree.” Jesus would do that. The Spirit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 805, 4, 78, 'God would say, “There is a man up there. Ask him to come down. Go and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 805, 5, 78, 'stay in his house.” This is how the Holy Spirit led Him. He would be by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 805, 6, 78, 'the Sea of Galilee and the Spirit of God would say, “Go to Tyre and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 805, 7, 78, 'Sidon.” This was a 70 kilometer journey, and He would walk there and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 805, 8, 78, 'come back. This is how He lived His life. He has given us an example of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 805, 9, 78, 'how God wants us to live our life by constantly listening to God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 805, 10, 78, 'We have a destination to become completely like Christ. The Bible says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 805, 11, 78, 'in Romans 8:29 that God has predestined us to become like Jesus Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 805, 12, 78, 'Like the GPS that we have in cars nowadays that guides the driver where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 805, 13, 78, 'to turn, the Holy Spirit is there to guide us through our life, right up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 805, 14, 78, 'to the last day, if we will listen. But the driver in that car may not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 805, 15, 78, 'listen to the GPS. Usually they do, but if they do not listen, the GPS');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 805, 16, 78, 'does not get upset. It says, “I will recalculate. I will bring you back');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 805, 17, 78, 'to the right path.” That is how the Holy Spirit is. If we have gone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 805, 18, 78, 'astray somewhere and we do not listen, He does not get upset with us,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 805, 19, 78, 'but He guides us back to the right path. He always desires to bring us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 805, 20, 78, 'back into God''s perfect plan for our life. That is what we learn from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 805, 21, 78, 'the oft-repeated references to, “As it is written in the Scripture,”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 805, 22, 78, 'and, “So that the Scripture might be fulfilled.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 805, 23, 78, 'We must also come to the end of our lives with numerous instances the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 805, 24, 78, 'Holy Spirit having clearly led us. As the Holy Spirit told Jesus to go,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 805, 25, 78, 'so He walked. “As it was written in the book of God''s plan for His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 805, 26, 78, 'life,” Jesus went here and there, and Jesus did this and that. We need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 805, 27, 78, 'to walk like that at least from the time we are born again. We cannot do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 805, 28, 78, 'anything about the years before we were born again. Acts 17:30 says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 806, 1, 78, '“God overlooks the times of ignorance, but from the time we have light,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 806, 2, 78, 'He wants us to repent.” He wants us to turn around from that independent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 806, 3, 78, 'way of life, seek Him all the time, and not decide on our own. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 806, 4, 78, 'how Jesus lived so differently.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 806, 5, 78, 'What can we learn from Jesus? What did Jesus teach us? Jesus taught us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 806, 6, 78, 'to not live like Adam. Adam had the choice of two ways of life. The two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 806, 7, 78, 'trees in the Garden of Eden symbolized two ways of life. One is the tree');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 806, 8, 78, 'of the knowledge of good and evil, where you take the knowledge of good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 806, 9, 78, 'and evil within you. You do not have to consult God anymore. You just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 806, 10, 78, 'use your reason, go where you like, and use your mind to find out what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 806, 11, 78, 'is best and do it. This is how every human being lives, and many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 806, 12, 78, 'Christians live like that too. The other is the tree of life, where we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 806, 13, 78, 'seek for the power of the Holy Spirit, seek to be filled with the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 806, 14, 78, 'Spirit, and allow the Spirit of God to lead us every single day. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 806, 15, 78, 'wants to lead us every single day. This is pictured in the Old Testament');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 806, 16, 78, 'with a pillar of cloud and the pillar of fire that led Israel day by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 806, 17, 78, 'day. God did not give a map to the Israelites to go from Egypt to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 806, 18, 78, 'Canaan. No, then they would not have depended on God. That would have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 806, 19, 78, 'been like the tree of knowledge of good and evil. We can think, “I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 806, 20, 78, 'everything I need before me. I do not need to consult God.” But God gave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 806, 21, 78, 'them a pillar of cloud that led them moment-by-moment. They would not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 806, 22, 78, 'even know where they were going to be in the evening. The pillar of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 806, 23, 78, 'cloud may move up and move on. There is a beautiful verse in the Book of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 806, 24, 78, 'Numbers that tells us about this; it is a beautiful verse that should be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 806, 25, 78, 'fulfilled in our lives:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 806, 26, 78, '“Whenever the cloud was lifted from over the tent, afterward the sons of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 806, 27, 78, 'Israel would then set out; and in the place where the cloud settled');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 806, 28, 78, 'down, there the sons of Israel would camp. At the command of the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 807, 1, 78, 'the sons of Israel would set out, and at the command of the Lord they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 807, 2, 78, 'would camp; as long as the cloud settled over the tabernacle, they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 807, 3, 78, 'remained camped” (Numbers 9:17-18).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 807, 4, 78, 'Think of this as a picture of the leading of the Holy Spirit in Numbers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 807, 5, 78, '9:18-23. It says, “At the command of the Lord, they would set out and at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 807, 6, 78, 'the command of the Lord, they would camp. As long as the cloud settled');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 807, 7, 78, 'over the tabernacle, they remained camped. When the cloud lingered over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 807, 8, 78, 'the tabernacle for many days, they would stay there many days.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 807, 9, 78, 'Sometimes, the cloud remained just a few days and according to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 807, 10, 78, 'command of the Lord, they remained camped. Then according to the command');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 807, 11, 78, 'of the Lord, they set out. If sometimes the cloud remained from evening');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 807, 12, 78, 'until morning, then when the cloud was lifted in the morning, they would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 807, 13, 78, 'move out. Or if it remained in the daytime and at night, whenever the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 807, 14, 78, 'cloud was lifted, they would set out. Whether it was two days or a month');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 807, 15, 78, 'or a year that the cloud lingered over the tabernacle, they stayed over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 807, 16, 78, 'there. The sons of Israel remained camped and did not set out. But when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 807, 17, 78, 'it was lifted, they did set out. At the command of the LORD, they camped');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 807, 18, 78, 'and at the command of the Lord, they set out.” This is how they reached');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 807, 19, 78, 'Canaan. It is an amazing passage.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 807, 20, 78, 'Sometimes the cloud would remain from evening till morning. That means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 807, 21, 78, 'the cloud stopped in the evening. Remember what they had to do: they had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 807, 22, 78, 'to pitch their tents. It took quite a while for all these two million');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 807, 23, 78, 'people to pitch their tents and settle down. Lo and behold, just as the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 807, 24, 78, 'night is over, they wake up in the morning and the cloud is moving. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 807, 25, 78, 'have to pack up the tents again and roll it up even though it was just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 807, 26, 78, 'pitched last night. Sometimes, they will stay at a place for will be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 807, 27, 78, 'whole year (Numbers 9:22). They go to some place, pitch their tents,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 807, 28, 78, 'look up in the morning, and wonder, “Are we going today?” No. What about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 808, 1, 78, 'the next day? No. They would be there for 365 days. God did not show');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 808, 2, 78, 'them where they were going to go next. This is a beautiful picture of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 808, 3, 78, 'how the Holy Spirit leads us. He does not give us a plan for our future,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 808, 4, 78, 'but He leads us step-by-step. This is what we learn from Jesus. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 808, 5, 78, 'what Jesus taught us. We are not to live like Adam by the knowledge of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 808, 6, 78, 'good and evil, but to live dependent on the Holy Spirit. As many as are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 808, 7, 78, 'led by the Holy Spirit, they are the sons of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 808, 8, 78, 'Using the Ridicule of People for Eternal Gain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 808, 9, 78, '“They put above Him the charge against Him which read, ‘THIS IS JESUS');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 808, 10, 78, 'THE KING OF THE JEWS.’ And at that time, two robbers were crucified with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 808, 11, 78, 'Him, one on the right and one on the left. Those passing by were hurling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 808, 12, 78, 'abuse at Him and wagging their heads” (Matthew 27:37). This also is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 808, 13, 78, 'fulfilling Scripture. Psalm 22:7-8 says, “All who see me sneer at me;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 808, 14, 78, 'they separate with the lip, they wag the head, saying, ‘Commit yourself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 808, 15, 78, 'to the LORD; let Him deliver him; Let Him rescue him.’” That is exactly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 808, 16, 78, 'what they said. Matthew 27:43 says, “He trusts in God; let God rescue');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 808, 17, 78, 'Him now, if He delights in Him; for He said, ‘I am the Son of God.’” It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 808, 18, 78, 'is amazing how when we walk in the will of God, even other people around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 808, 19, 78, 'us are just fulfilling God''s plan for our life. God knows exactly what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 808, 20, 78, 'they are going to say, and exactly what they are going to do. They are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 808, 21, 78, 'going to cast lots for garments. They are going to say, “He trusts in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 808, 22, 78, 'God. Let Him deliver Him.” So many words in Psalm 22 are literally being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 808, 23, 78, 'fulfilled here.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 808, 24, 78, 'They made fun of Him saying, “You who are going to destroy the temple,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 808, 25, 78, 'rebuild it. Let us see if You are the Son of God. Come down from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 808, 26, 78, 'cross.” In Matthew 27:41, the chief priests, scribes and others were all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 808, 27, 78, 'mocking Him, saying, “He saved others. He cannot save Himself. He is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 808, 28, 78, 'king of Israel. Let Him come down.” And the robbers also who had been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 809, 1, 78, 'crucified with Him were casting the same insults at Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 809, 2, 78, 'Initially, both robbers were making fun of Him along with the crowd.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 809, 3, 78, 'What is it that made one robber finally change and said, “Lord, remember');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 809, 4, 78, 'me when You come in Your kingdom”? I believe it was this: despite all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 809, 5, 78, 'the sneering, mocking, ridiculing, and saying, “If You are the king of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 809, 6, 78, 'Israel, come down,” Jesus remained absolutely silent, just like He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 809, 7, 78, 'silent before Pilate. He was silent in front of the chief priests in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 809, 8, 78, 'those courts when the charges were made before Him. He was silent on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 809, 9, 78, 'cross, and one thief got convicted. He probably never knew much about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 809, 10, 78, 'Jesus, but he saw this Man hanging on the cross completely silent, not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 809, 11, 78, 'replying to any of the charges, mocking, sneering, etc. He hears Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 809, 12, 78, 'saying, “Father, forgive them, for they do not know what they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 809, 13, 78, 'doing.” He sees Him caring for His mother saying, “John, will take care');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 809, 14, 78, 'of you. John, please take care of My mother.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 809, 15, 78, 'The thief sees all this and is convicted. He says, “This is no ordinary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 809, 16, 78, 'Man.” That is why he said on the cross to the other thief in Luke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 809, 17, 78, '23:40-41, “Do you not fear God? We are receiving our sentence justly,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 809, 18, 78, 'but this Man has done nothing wrong.” In Luke 23:42, it says, “And he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 809, 19, 78, 'was saying, ‘Jesus, remember me when You come in Your kingdom.’” The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 809, 20, 78, 'thief said, “This Man has done nothing wrong.” How in the world did he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 809, 21, 78, 'know that? Jesus was quiet, and did not reply to numerous charges made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 809, 22, 78, 'against Him. And instead says, “Father, forgive them for they do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 809, 23, 78, 'know what they are doing.” The Holy Spirit gave revelation to that thief');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 809, 24, 78, 'that Jesus was the Son of God. That is how any true child of God behaves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 809, 25, 78, 'when other people accuse him and ridicule him. He only says, “Father,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 809, 26, 78, 'forgive them.” He does not respond and retaliate. Is that how you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 809, 27, 78, 'behave?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 809, 28, 78, 'This is what we learn from Jesus and all that Jesus taught. When He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 810, 1, 78, 'hanging on the cross, He taught us how to behave towards those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 810, 2, 78, 'ridicule us and make fun of us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 810, 3, 78, 'The Father Forsook Jesus and Then It Was Finished');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 810, 4, 78, 'Then from the sixth hour, darkness fell upon all the land until the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 810, 5, 78, 'ninth hour. And about the ninth hour, Jesus cried out, “MY GOD, MY GOD,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 810, 6, 78, 'WHY HAST THOU FORSAKEN ME?” That period of darkness was when Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 810, 7, 78, 'suffered the pangs of hell. In three hours, He experienced the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 810, 8, 78, 'concentrated punishment of eternal hell that human beings would suffer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 810, 9, 78, 'in eternity because He was an infinite being. He could experience in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 810, 10, 78, 'three hours what finite beings experience in eternity. It was awesome.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 810, 11, 78, 'It was truly terrible. We will never know the depth of that suffering');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 810, 12, 78, 'until we see Jesus face to face one day. If you see it, you will realize');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 810, 13, 78, 'how much He loves you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 810, 14, 78, 'Jesus cried out, “My God, My God why hast Thou forsaken me?” In His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 810, 15, 78, 'entire life, He had never called God, “God.” He always called Him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 810, 16, 78, '“Father.” This is the only time that He called Him God. Why was that?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 810, 17, 78, 'Because He was standing before God as a convicted criminal for the sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 810, 18, 78, 'of others, before the Judge of the universe. He had voluntarily decided');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 810, 19, 78, 'to take the sin of humanity upon Himself, so He was like a criminal, as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 810, 20, 78, 'it were. He was standing before the Judge of the universe, so He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 810, 21, 78, 'addresses Him as God. But there was no rebellion there. He did not say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 810, 22, 78, '“O God, O God, why have You forsaken me?” That would have sounded');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 810, 23, 78, 'rebellious. He says, “My God, My God,” which means, I cannot understand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 810, 24, 78, 'why You have forsaken Me. At that moment when God forsakes a person, his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 810, 25, 78, 'thinking is not clear at all. He was literally forsaken, but there in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 810, 26, 78, 'the midst of it, he says, “You are still My God. I do not know why You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 810, 27, 78, 'have forsaken Me, but You are still My God.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 810, 28, 78, 'This teaches us the submission of the Son of God. Even when He cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 811, 1, 78, 'understand something, He says, “My God, My God, You are still My God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 811, 2, 78, 'even though I do not understand why You have forsaken Me.” But we know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 811, 3, 78, 'now why He was forsaken. It was because of our sin. He was experiencing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 811, 4, 78, 'hell, and there we learn something from Jesus. What can we learn from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 811, 5, 78, 'this example of Jesus? There are times in our life when we cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 811, 6, 78, 'understand why God is dealing with us in a certain way. That is the time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 811, 7, 78, 'we say, “You are still my God. You are still my Father.” We know that at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 811, 8, 78, 'the end of that time on the cross, His relationship with the Father was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 811, 9, 78, 'restored.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 811, 10, 78, 'Matthew 27:47 says that some were thinking He was calling for Elijah. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 811, 11, 78, 'was not. He was saying “Eli.” Somebody ran with the sponge and gave it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 811, 12, 78, 'to Him. He drank and the rest of them said, “Let us see whether Elijah');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 811, 13, 78, 'will come to Him and save Him.” Jesus cried out again with a loud voice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 811, 14, 78, 'and yielded up His Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 811, 15, 78, 'What did He say at that moment with a loud voice? We know the answer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 811, 16, 78, 'from one of the other gospels. John 19:30 says that Jesus said, “It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 811, 17, 78, 'finished.” The work of salvation and redemption was over. In Luke 23:46,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 811, 18, 78, 'Jesus cried out saying, “Father, into Thy hands I commit My Spirit.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 811, 19, 78, 'Jesus was saying “Father,” not “God.” The relationship had been restored');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 811, 20, 78, 'by the end of the three hours.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 811, 21, 78, 'It is very beautiful to see what happened on the cross, comparing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 811, 22, 78, 'Scripture with Scripture in the different gospels. The relationship with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 811, 23, 78, 'the Father was restored and as He cried out, “It is finished,” the veil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 811, 24, 78, 'of the temple was torn in two from top to bottom (Matthew 27:51). The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 811, 25, 78, 'veil was the thing that blocked off the presence of God from people in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 811, 26, 78, 'Old Testament times. God dwelt in the Most Holy Place the tabernacle.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 811, 27, 78, 'When it was rent, it showed that the way into the Most Holy Place was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 811, 28, 78, 'now open. You can go right into God''s presence. Man could come into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 812, 1, 78, 'God''s presence now and call Him Father, something that they could not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 812, 2, 78, 'experience before. That was the price that had to be paid. Hebrews 10:20');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 812, 3, 78, 'says that this veil symbolizes the flesh of Jesus. That is a big subject');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 812, 4, 78, 'in itself. But the flesh of Jesus was symbolized by that veil which was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 812, 5, 78, 'torn, and the way was opened into the Most Holy Place.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 812, 6, 78, 'Matthew 27:51 says that the veil was torn from the top to the bottom,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 812, 7, 78, 'signifying that it was God who did it, not man. God did it, and then the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 812, 8, 78, 'tombs were opened. At that very moment, the tombs were opened and many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 812, 9, 78, 'bodies of the saints who had fallen asleep were raised after the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 812, 10, 78, 'resurrection of Christ. They came out of the tombs. The tombs were open,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 812, 11, 78, 'but those saints could not come out until Christ was raised from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 812, 12, 78, 'dead because He had to be the First. First Christ and then the others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 812, 13, 78, 'Even though the tombs were opened at that time, the bodies came out only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 812, 14, 78, 'after His resurrection. Saints who had died in the past came out in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 812, 15, 78, 'resurrection of the bodies. There are people in heaven now whose bodies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 812, 16, 78, 'were resurrected, and they appeared to many other people in the city.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 812, 17, 78, 'The Centurion who saw all this, the earthquake, etc. said, “Truly, this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 812, 18, 78, 'is the Son of God.” Imagine a Roman soldier who did not know anything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 812, 19, 78, 'about the Bible saying, “This is the Son of God.” It is wonderful to see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 812, 20, 78, 'what events took place at the cross.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 812, 21, 78, 'If we are faithful until the end, God will make our witness shine as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 812, 22, 78, 'well, so that even heathen military people will recognize that we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 812, 23, 78, 'children of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 812, 24, 79, 'Chapter 78 The New and Living Way Through the Veil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 812, 25, 79, 'God’s New Temple');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 812, 26, 79, 'In Matthew 27:51, we read that the veil of the temple was torn in two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 812, 27, 79, 'from top to bottom which is described in the other gospels as well. What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 812, 28, 79, 'was the significance of this? One thing, as we saw in the last chapter,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 813, 1, 79, 'is that the way into the Most Holy was opened. This is what it says in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 813, 2, 79, 'the book of Hebrews. The veil indicated that, in the Old Testament, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 813, 3, 79, 'way into the Holiest was not open. In Hebrews 9:8 it says, “The Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 813, 4, 79, 'Spirit is signifying this, that the way into the Holy Place has not yet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 813, 5, 79, 'been opened, while that outer tabernacle was standing.” That was the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 813, 6, 79, 'significance of the veil; and when that veil was rent, the way into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 813, 7, 79, 'God''s presence was opened. In the Old Testament, the fire of God dwelt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 813, 8, 79, 'upon the Most Holy Place.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 813, 9, 79, 'The Old Testament Tabernacle had three parts: the outer court, which was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 813, 10, 79, 'open for everybody to see, and then a covered tent, which had two parts:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 813, 11, 79, 'the Holy Place and Most Holy Place. Between the two was this thick veil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 813, 12, 79, 'The high priest was allowed to go in to the Most Holy Place only once a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 813, 13, 79, 'year, on the Day of Atonement. Other than that, it was completely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 813, 14, 79, 'blocked. The mercy seat was in the Most Holy Place, and God dwelt there.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 813, 15, 79, 'He would say, “I speak from between the cherubs in the mercy seat,”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 813, 16, 79, 'which was indicating that there was something blocking man from coming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 813, 17, 79, 'into God''s presence. No one in the Old Testament could understand it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 813, 18, 79, 'What was it? What did this veil symbolize?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 813, 19, 79, 'Everything in the Old Testament symbolized something. The Sabbath spoke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 813, 20, 79, 'of inner rest, circumcision spoke of the cutting off confidence in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 813, 21, 79, 'flesh, the blood of the lamb spoke of the blood of Jesus Christ, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 813, 22, 79, 'pillar of cloud symbolized the Holy Spirit, Pharaoh is a picture of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 813, 23, 79, 'Satan, and Egypt is a picture of the world, going through the Red Sea is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 813, 24, 79, 'a picture of baptism, the land of Canaan is a picture of the life of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 813, 25, 79, 'victory, the giants are pictures of the lusts in our flesh which can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 813, 26, 79, 'defeated, going through the Jordan is a picture of going through the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 813, 27, 79, 'of the cross, being crucified, and taking up that position permanently,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 813, 28, 79, 'the fire resting upon the tabernacle is a picture of the glory of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 814, 1, 79, 'and the power of the Holy Spirit, et cetera. Everything has a meaning.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 814, 2, 79, 'So what did the veil symbolize? It''s very important to understand this,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 814, 3, 79, 'because when the veil was rent, something happened. The tabernacle was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 814, 4, 79, 'also of picture a man. Man is called the tabernacle of God in John 1:14.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 814, 5, 79, 'The literal translation is, “The Word became flesh and tabernacled in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 814, 6, 79, 'our midst.” That means “dwelt like a tabernacle in our midst.” 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 814, 7, 79, 'Thessalonians 5:23 says the man has three parts, just like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 814, 8, 79, 'tabernacle: body, soul, and spirit. The body is visible, like the outer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 814, 9, 79, 'court, and the soul and spirit are covered, like the Holy Place and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 814, 10, 79, 'Most Holy Place in the tabernacle. Between the soul and spirit, there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 814, 11, 79, 'a thick veil that prevents the Holy Spirit from coming and dwelling in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 814, 12, 79, 'man’s spirit. In the Old Testament, the Holy Spirit could not dwell in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 814, 13, 79, 'any person’s heart or spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 814, 14, 79, 'There are many implications of this thick veil. One is that man could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 814, 15, 79, 'not go into God''s presence because of something blocking him, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 814, 16, 79, 'another is that God could not come into man’s spirit because something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 814, 17, 79, 'was blocking Him. But that was removed when Christ died and said, “It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 814, 18, 79, 'finished.” It''s very important for us to understand this, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 814, 19, 79, 'there''s something in the veil being rent that Jesus wants to teach us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 814, 20, 79, 'that his disciples couldn''t understand then. Jesus said in John 16:12,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 814, 21, 79, '“There are many more things I want to say to you, but you cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 814, 22, 79, 'understand them now.” They couldn''t understand because they didn''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 814, 23, 79, 'the Holy Spirit. When the Holy Spirit came, suddenly their eyes were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 814, 24, 79, 'opened and they could read. It says in 2 Corinthians 3 that there''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 814, 25, 79, 'veil over the Scriptures as long as you''re under the law. You can’t see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 814, 26, 79, 'or understand many things in the Scriptures until you turn to the Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 814, 27, 79, 'the Spirit. Then the veil is taken away. If you turn to the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 814, 28, 79, 'to explain the meaning of something, He explains it to you. Now we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 815, 1, 79, 'turn to the Holy Spirit to understand the meaning of this veil. What we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 815, 2, 79, 'have to do is compare Scripture with Scripture. In Hebrews 10:19, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 815, 3, 79, 'says, “Therefore, brethren, we have confidence to enter [the Most Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 815, 4, 79, 'Place] by the blood of Jesus.” The Old Testament priests used to take a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 815, 5, 79, 'little blood from a lamb that was slain into the Holy Place on the day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 815, 6, 79, 'of the atonement. However, we have boldness to enter immediately into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 815, 7, 79, 'the presence of God by the blood of Jesus, “by a new and living way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 815, 8, 79, 'which He has inaugurated for us through the veil, that is, His flesh”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 815, 9, 79, '(v20).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 815, 10, 79, 'The New and Living Way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 815, 11, 79, 'So there is a way into the Most Holy Place that has been inaugurated.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 815, 12, 79, 'When a road is inaugurated, it’s not just for us to admire. It’s for us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 815, 13, 79, 'to use. A way was inaugurated for us when the veil was rent, and that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 815, 14, 79, 'veil, it says, was His flesh. The word flesh is used in a number of ways');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 815, 15, 79, 'in the New Testament. It is referring to meat at times, just plain meat,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 815, 16, 79, 'and at other times it''s referring to the corrupt sinful flesh we have.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 815, 17, 79, 'In our sinful flesh dwells nothing good (Romans 7:18). The Bible says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 815, 18, 79, 'that Jesus came in the likeness of sinful flesh, but not in sinful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 815, 19, 79, 'flesh, because there was no sin in Him at all. The angel said that holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 815, 20, 79, 'thing which is going to be born is called the Son of God. So there was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 815, 21, 79, 'no sin or sinful flesh in Jesus, but He did have a flesh. In fact, John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 815, 22, 79, 'says that any spirit that doesn''t confess that Jesus came in the flesh');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 815, 23, 79, 'is the spirit of the antichrist (1 John 4:2,3). It''s not talking about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 815, 24, 79, 'Jesus coming in a body, but Jesus coming in the flesh.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 815, 25, 79, 'That''s the word that’s always used in 1 John, 2 John, and 3 John. John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 815, 26, 79, 'always says that, “Jesus came in the flesh.” The secret of Godliness is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 815, 27, 79, 'that Christ came in the flesh (1 Timothy 3:16). So we need to understand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 815, 28, 79, 'what the meaning of flesh is. Galatians 5 gives a little understanding.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 816, 1, 79, 'The flesh fights against the Spirit, and the Spirit fights against the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 816, 2, 79, 'flesh. There is a conflict between them. They are in opposition to one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 816, 3, 79, 'another so that you don''t do the things that you please. The flesh is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 816, 4, 79, 'what makes us do what we want to do (Galatians 5:17), and the Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 816, 5, 79, 'opposes that. The Spirit tells us not to do what we want to do, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 816, 6, 79, 'rather what God wants us to do.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 816, 7, 79, 'Did Jesus have this conflict all His life? He certainly did in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 816, 8, 79, 'Gethsemane. We know He said, “Father not My will; not what I want to do,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 816, 9, 79, 'but what You want Me to do; not what pleases Me, but what pleases You.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 816, 10, 79, 'That was the flesh in Jesus, this thing that we call our will. In John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 816, 11, 79, '6:38, you will find what I call the one-line autobiography of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 816, 12, 79, 'Christ; the one-line description of His entire 33 ½ years on earth. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 816, 13, 79, 'says, “I have come from heaven not to do My Own will.” In other words,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 816, 14, 79, 'He denied His flesh - His flesh was His Own will. He said no to His Own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 816, 15, 79, 'will and spent His entire life doing the will of the Father. The Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 816, 16, 79, 'put the flesh to death in Jesus. In other words, He put this thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 816, 17, 79, 'called ‘My will’ to death. In Jesus there was no sin, but there was this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 816, 18, 79, 'thing called ‘My will’ that Jesus had throughout His life, and He had to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 816, 19, 79, 'deny it. “Not to do My Own will” means that He denied His Own will, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 816, 20, 79, 'He denied His flesh.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 816, 21, 79, 'That is the other meaning of flesh in Jesus, and that is symbolized by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 816, 22, 79, 'the veil. So what was torn in the 33 ½ years of Jesus’ life? His will.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 816, 23, 79, 'His Self-will was torn. He never did His Own will, and at the end of His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 816, 24, 79, 'life, He said, “It is finished.” That means He encountered every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 816, 25, 79, 'possible temptation that a man can face to do his own will and He never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 816, 26, 79, 'gave in. The whole range of temptation, top to bottom, was faced by Him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 816, 27, 79, 'and, by the help of the Holy Spirit, He never gave in. Therefore, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 816, 28, 79, 'veil – the symbol of that Self-will in the tabernacle - could be torn.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 817, 1, 79, 'The new and living way through the veil, that is, His flesh (or His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 817, 2, 79, 'Self-will), was inaugurated for us, so that we can go that way too. What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 817, 3, 79, 'is that way? The way of denying our own flesh today, denying self. ”If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 817, 4, 79, 'any man will come after Me, let him deny himself” (Matthew 16:24). That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 817, 5, 79, 'means Jesus denied Himself too. Otherwise, how can He say, “Follow Me?”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 817, 6, 79, 'I''ve got to do it, because He did it. Then I can follow Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 817, 7, 79, 'All the Scriptures fit together. That is what we call the way of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 817, 8, 79, 'cross, the new and living way, and it''s a way. Even though we think of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 817, 9, 79, 'the veil like an object or a door, it is not a door. It''s a way. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 817, 10, 79, 'called a “new and living way.” It’s living because you go the way you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 817, 11, 79, 'always live in life. It’s new in the sense that it is always fresh.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 817, 12, 79, 'Every day there''s something fresh, something new, and it’s living,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 817, 13, 79, 'because if I die with Him, I live with Him. It is a living way, and He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 817, 14, 79, 'leads me right into God''s presence. And so we see the thing that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 817, 15, 79, 'hindered man from being able to come into God''s presence was his own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 817, 16, 79, 'self-will. When Adam and Eve chose to do their own will, they went away');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 817, 17, 79, 'from God. Jesus came and went the opposite way. He never did His Own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 817, 18, 79, 'will. It says in Romans 15:3 that Christ never pleased Himself. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 817, 19, 79, 'how the veil was rent.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 817, 20, 79, 'Now we have a choice. God doesn''t force anybody to go this way, but we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 817, 21, 79, 'have a choice. If you want to dwell in the immediate presence of God in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 817, 22, 79, 'the Most Holy Place, you can live there 24 hours a day, seven days a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 817, 23, 79, 'week, as long as you go through this new and living way. That is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 817, 24, 79, 'meaning of the rent veil in Matthew 27:51, and this way is open for us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 817, 25, 79, 'all. This is how God can dwell in our spirit too, because the innermost');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 817, 26, 79, 'part of the tabernacle, the Most Holy Place, is our spirit, where God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 817, 27, 79, 'dwells. God doesn’t dwell in our body or our mind, but in our spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 817, 28, 79, 'When you say God dwelt in the tabernacle, it was in the Most Holy Place.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 818, 1, 79, 'When we say this body is a temple of the Holy Spirit, we’re saying the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 818, 2, 79, 'Holy Spirit dwells in the Most Holy Place, the spirit of man. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 818, 3, 79, 'between soul and spirit is this thing called my will, and if I allow God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 818, 4, 79, 'to break down my will, He can make me a spiritual person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 818, 5, 79, 'True Spirituality');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 818, 6, 79, 'Merely understanding truth in my mind does not make me spiritual.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 818, 7, 79, 'Getting excited in my emotions does not make me spiritual. It''s when I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 818, 8, 79, 'yield my will to the Word that I can become spiritual. Like Jesus said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 818, 9, 79, 'a man can understand what I say, but if he doesn''t do it, his house is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 818, 10, 79, 'built on sand. But when he does it - which means he denies his will and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 818, 11, 79, 'does what God says - then his house is built on rock, and that rock is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 818, 12, 79, 'obedience to Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 818, 13, 79, 'This is the way that God wants every one of His children to walk – the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 818, 14, 79, 'new and living way. In the parable that Jesus spoke about the wise man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 818, 15, 79, 'and the foolish man in Matthew 7, at the end of the Sermon on the Mount,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 818, 16, 79, 'He said, “Everyone who hears these words of Mine and does them will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 818, 17, 79, 'like a wise man who built his house on the rock…” In our personality,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 818, 18, 79, 'our soul consists of our mind, emotions, and will. The will is the door');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 818, 19, 79, 'to the spirit, or the veil into the Most Holy Place. My mind, emotion,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 818, 20, 79, 'and will make up my soul. Even if I understand God''s Word in my mind or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 818, 21, 79, 'if I''m stirred by God''s Word in my emotions, God''s Word has still not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 818, 22, 79, 'penetrated my spirit until I have yielded my will. So when He says, “one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 818, 23, 79, 'who hears these words and does them,” Jesus means he understands it and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 818, 24, 79, 'maybe he is even excited about it, but there’s more: he does them. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 818, 25, 79, 'then that he''s built on the rock. But if he only understands it (verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 818, 26, 79, '26) and is excited about it, but does not obey it, he is still on sand.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 818, 27, 79, 'Sand is mind and emotions. But God''s Word must go through the sand till');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 818, 28, 79, 'it hits rock. Then we are unshakable.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 819, 1, 79, 'Jesus said the same thing earlier in Matthew 7:21, “Not everyone who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 819, 2, 79, 'says to Me, Lord, Lord will enter the kingdom of heaven, but he who does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 819, 3, 79, 'the will of My Father.” What does that mean? When a man says, ‘Lord,’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 819, 4, 79, 'that means his mind is right, and he believes that Jesus Christ is Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 819, 5, 79, 'When he says, ‘Lord, Lord,’ that means he is excited, and his emotions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 819, 6, 79, 'are right. But he still doesn''t enter the kingdom. It''s when he yields');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 819, 7, 79, 'his will. ‘Lord’ is not enough. ‘Lord, Lord’ is not enough. Only after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 819, 8, 79, 'obedience, when the will is broken and the veil is torn, can God dwell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 819, 9, 79, 'in his spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 819, 10, 79, 'It is the same thing everywhere. You find Scripture teaches consistently');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 819, 11, 79, 'that it is the lack of yielded-ness of our will that prevents us from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 819, 12, 79, 'being spiritual. In Christendom, two groups of people both say they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 819, 13, 79, 'separated from all the dead denominational churches. One group');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 819, 14, 79, 'concentrates on studying the Scriptures. If you go to their assemblies,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 819, 15, 79, 'they are always studying Scripture, teaching Scripture, and they have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 819, 16, 79, 'tremendous knowledge of Scripture. But it is in the mind. The other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 819, 17, 79, 'group reacts against that, saying, “That is dead academic study. We want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 819, 18, 79, 'some excitement.” They have very emotional songs and drums and beats and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 819, 19, 79, 'clapping and yelling and all types of jumping like the prophets of Baal.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 819, 20, 79, 'They think that is spirituality, but it''s not. One emphasizes the mind,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 819, 21, 79, 'and the other, emotion. Where is the church that says, “Beyond emotion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 819, 22, 79, 'and mind, you have to deny yourself and take up the cross and die. Then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 819, 23, 79, 'you’ve built on the rock.” That''s the church you should be a part of.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 819, 24, 79, 'We''re not against intellectual understanding. I believe in studying the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 819, 25, 79, 'Scriptures. That''s why we''re having this bible study. I believe in being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 819, 26, 79, 'excited about the Scriptures and stirring people emotionally. I hope');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 819, 27, 79, 'you’ve been stirred emotionally as you’ve gone through these chapters.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 819, 28, 79, 'But ultimately our aim is to get you to deny your will and do the will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 820, 1, 79, 'of God. Otherwise, you''ll never become spiritual. That is the whole');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 820, 2, 79, 'meaning of the rent veil. That is where God wants to bring us, where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 820, 3, 79, 'Christ is Lord. And when you say Christ is Lord, it is proven not just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 820, 4, 79, 'in word, and not just in emotion, but in obedience to His Word. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 820, 5, 79, 'speaks about the wise man at the end of the Sermon on the Mount as,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 820, 6, 79, '“Whoever hears these words of Mine and does them.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 820, 7, 79, 'If you are serious about following all that you''ve learned in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 820, 8, 79, 'study, do what Jesus said - build on the rock. “If you hear these words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 820, 9, 79, 'of Mine and do them, you’ll build on the rock” (Matthew 7:24). That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 820, 10, 79, 'the narrow way. At the end of Sermon on the Mount, He says, “Enter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 820, 11, 79, 'through the narrow gate…” That is the new and living way, through the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 820, 12, 79, 'veil. That is the narrow way and the narrow gate, and it relates to this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 820, 13, 79, 'chapter. So if you are serious about it, I would encourage you to read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 820, 14, 79, 'Matthew 5, 6, and 7. Go through it, verse by verse, and see if you’ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 820, 15, 79, 'obeyed it. We went through it earlier in this study, verse by verse. See');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 820, 16, 79, 'if you are obeying all that Jesus taught. If you do, your life will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 820, 17, 79, 'unshakable, your family will be unshakable, and your church will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 820, 18, 79, 'unshakable. It is such a life of obedience to God''s Word that is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 820, 19, 79, 'being taught sufficiently in Christendom today. It is the mark of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 820, 20, 79, 'love for Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 820, 21, 79, 'How do you prove your love for Christ? Is it by going out as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 820, 22, 79, 'missionary? Is it by sacrifice and offering? No. It says in Hebrews');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 820, 23, 79, '10:5, sacrifice and offering He does not desire, but He wants your body.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 820, 24, 79, 'He wants you to obey Him with your eyes and tongue and hands. That''s how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 820, 25, 79, 'you prove your love. Jesus said, “If you love Me, keep My commandments.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 820, 26, 79, 'Many people understand love as just emotional excitement, like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 820, 27, 79, 'cinematic type of love between a boy and a girl. They think love for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 820, 28, 79, 'Jesus is like that. That''s not love for Jesus. Jesus said, love for Me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 821, 1, 79, 'is proved by your obedience. John 14:15 says, “If you love Me, keep My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 821, 2, 79, 'commandments.” There''s no other way to prove our love for Him. Another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 821, 3, 79, 'sign is that you’ll love your brother. If you can’t love a brother whom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 821, 4, 79, 'you see, you can’t love God Who is invisible (1 John 4:20). These are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 821, 5, 79, 'the two ways by which I prove my love for God. One is by keeping His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 821, 6, 79, 'commandments, and the other is by loving your brother whom you can see.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 821, 7, 79, 'A lot of brothers whom we see may not be very lovable, but if you can’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 821, 8, 79, 'love them, you can’t love God. The Christian life is very practical.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 821, 9, 79, 'God Can Even Use Secret Disciples to Help Care for the Body of Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 821, 10, 79, '“And when it was evening, there came a rich man from Arimathea, named');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 821, 11, 79, 'Joseph, who himself had also become a disciple of Jesus” (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 821, 12, 79, '27:57). This was in secret, because he was in the council, and they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 821, 13, 79, 'not followers of Jesus. A man in the council was a secret disciple, like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 821, 14, 79, 'Nicodemus, and this man went to Pilate and asked for the body of Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 821, 15, 79, 'So Pilate ordered it to be given over to him. This shows how God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 821, 16, 79, 'some witnesses in high places to help us. If Peter had gone to Pilate’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 821, 17, 79, 'house, the fisherman Peter, the security guards would have thrown him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 821, 18, 79, 'out of the gate. He couldn’t have gone anywhere near, but there was this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 821, 19, 79, 'influential man called Joseph. God had him there to help the body of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 821, 20, 79, 'Jesus to be taken down. It''s the same today. God has some very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 821, 21, 79, 'influential people in high places who are willing to help the body of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 821, 22, 79, 'Christ today. Thank God for them. They may be secret disciples. They''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 821, 23, 79, 'not called to go out and plant churches and be apostles like Peter, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 821, 24, 79, 'they''re useful at certain times to help the body of Christ. It says that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 821, 25, 79, 'Joseph took the body. He himself came, took the body, wrapped it up in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 821, 26, 79, 'clean linen cloth, and laid it out in his own new tomb, which he had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 821, 27, 79, 'hewn in the rock. Then he rolled a large stone against the entrance of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 821, 28, 79, 'the tomb and went away. Just as it was prophesied in Isaiah 53, His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 822, 1, 79, 'death and His burial were with criminals on the cross and with a very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 822, 2, 79, 'wealthy man in His burial. God cares for the poor and the rich, for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 822, 3, 79, 'extreme murderers and rich people. He doesn''t exclude anybody.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 822, 4, 79, '“Mary Magdalene was there and the other Mary sitting opposite the grave.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 822, 5, 79, 'The next day, which is the one after the preparation, the chief priests');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 822, 6, 79, 'and the Pharisees gathered together with Pilate and said, ‘Sir, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 822, 7, 79, 'remember that when He was still alive that deceiver said, “After three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 822, 8, 79, 'days I am to rise again”’” (Matthew 27:61-63). They were concerned just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 822, 9, 79, 'in case this was actually going to happen. Imagine that! They didn’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 822, 10, 79, 'believe in the resurrection, but they thought something might happen.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 822, 11, 79, 'They didn’t know what, but maybe the disciples would come and steal the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 822, 12, 79, 'body or something and say that He had risen. So they went to Pilate.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 822, 13, 79, 'They were so particular to make sure the grave was protected from this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 822, 14, 79, 'type of theft and all that, which is all very good. It is good because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 822, 15, 79, 'it proved in history that the resurrection had nothing to do with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 822, 16, 79, 'anybody rolling away the stone or any disciples coming and stealing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 822, 17, 79, 'Jesus’ body. So God ordained this, that Pilate should get a security of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 822, 18, 79, 'military people to guard that tomb. They said, “Please give orders for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 822, 19, 79, 'the grave to be made secure until the third day, lest the disciples come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 822, 20, 79, 'and steal Him away and say to the people, ‘He is risen from the dead,’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 822, 21, 79, 'and the last deception would be worse than the first. So Pilate said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 822, 22, 79, '‘Go ahead, you have a guard; go and make it as secure as you know how.’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 822, 23, 79, 'And they went and made the grave secure, and along with the guard, they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 822, 24, 79, 'set a seal on the stone” (Matthew 27:64-66). Not only did they put a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 822, 25, 79, 'guard, the Roman soldiers kept doing shifts, so that 24 hours a day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 822, 26, 79, 'there would always be someone awake, watching over that tomb to make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 822, 27, 79, 'sure no disciple came anywhere near it. In any case, one soldier alone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 822, 28, 79, 'would have been enough to drive away any disciples, but there were a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 823, 1, 79, 'number of soldiers continuously there around the tomb of Jesus for all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 823, 2, 79, 'those three days. They put a seal as well on the tomb, which if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 823, 3, 79, 'didn’t know, if somebody had moved it or broke it to remove the stone,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 823, 4, 79, 'the seal would be broken. This was God''s way of sovereignly proving that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 823, 5, 79, 'the resurrection was not a fake. Even this thing that Pilate ordered was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 823, 6, 79, 'something that God allowed so that history would record that it was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 823, 7, 79, 'the disciples who took the body away. This was a case where the Roman');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 823, 8, 79, 'authority, the government, was trying to keep anyone from coming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 823, 9, 79, 'anywhere near the grave. This was not just some cemetery somewhere where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 823, 10, 79, 'anybody could come and walk in and walk off with the body. If it was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 823, 11, 79, 'like that, people could have spread all types of stories. God allowed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 823, 12, 79, 'this to happen so that there would be clear proof that the resurrection');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 823, 13, 79, 'was a supernatural event that came from God. Do you see the sovereignty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 823, 14, 79, 'of God? That''s what we learn: if our lives are surrendered to God, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 823, 15, 79, 'makes everything work for our good and His glory. His sovereignty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 823, 16, 79, 'determines and controls that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 823, 17, 80, 'Chapter 78 The New and Living Way Through the Veil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 823, 18, 80, 'God’s New Temple');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 823, 19, 80, 'In Matthew 27:51, we read that the veil of the temple was torn in two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 823, 20, 80, 'from top to bottom which is described in the other gospels as well. What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 823, 21, 80, 'was the significance of this? One thing, as we saw in the last chapter,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 823, 22, 80, 'is that the way into the Most Holy was opened. This is what it says in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 823, 23, 80, 'the book of Hebrews. The veil indicated that, in the Old Testament, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 823, 24, 80, 'way into the Holiest was not open. In Hebrews 9:8 it says, “The Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 823, 25, 80, 'Spirit is signifying this, that the way into the Holy Place has not yet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 823, 26, 80, 'been opened, while that outer tabernacle was standing.” That was the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 823, 27, 80, 'significance of the veil; and when that veil was rent, the way into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 823, 28, 80, 'God''s presence was opened. In the Old Testament, the fire of God dwelt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 824, 1, 80, 'upon the Most Holy Place.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 824, 2, 80, 'The Old Testament Tabernacle had three parts: the outer court, which was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 824, 3, 80, 'open for everybody to see, and then a covered tent, which had two parts:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 824, 4, 80, 'the Holy Place and Most Holy Place. Between the two was this thick veil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 824, 5, 80, 'The high priest was allowed to go in to the Most Holy Place only once a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 824, 6, 80, 'year, on the Day of Atonement. Other than that, it was completely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 824, 7, 80, 'blocked. The mercy seat was in the Most Holy Place, and God dwelt there.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 824, 8, 80, 'He would say, “I speak from between the cherubs in the mercy seat,”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 824, 9, 80, 'which was indicating that there was something blocking man from coming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 824, 10, 80, 'into God''s presence. No one in the Old Testament could understand it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 824, 11, 80, 'What was it? What did this veil symbolize?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 824, 12, 80, 'Everything in the Old Testament symbolized something. The Sabbath spoke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 824, 13, 80, 'of inner rest, circumcision spoke of the cutting off confidence in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 824, 14, 80, 'flesh, the blood of the lamb spoke of the blood of Jesus Christ, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 824, 15, 80, 'pillar of cloud symbolized the Holy Spirit, Pharaoh is a picture of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 824, 16, 80, 'Satan, and Egypt is a picture of the world, going through the Red Sea is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 824, 17, 80, 'a picture of baptism, the land of Canaan is a picture of the life of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 824, 18, 80, 'victory, the giants are pictures of the lusts in our flesh which can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 824, 19, 80, 'defeated, going through the Jordan is a picture of going through the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 824, 20, 80, 'of the cross, being crucified, and taking up that position permanently,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 824, 21, 80, 'the fire resting upon the tabernacle is a picture of the glory of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 824, 22, 80, 'and the power of the Holy Spirit, et cetera. Everything has a meaning.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 824, 23, 80, 'So what did the veil symbolize? It''s very important to understand this,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 824, 24, 80, 'because when the veil was rent, something happened. The tabernacle was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 824, 25, 80, 'also of picture a man. Man is called the tabernacle of God in John 1:14.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 824, 26, 80, 'The literal translation is, “The Word became flesh and tabernacled in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 824, 27, 80, 'our midst.” That means “dwelt like a tabernacle in our midst.” 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 824, 28, 80, 'Thessalonians 5:23 says the man has three parts, just like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 825, 1, 80, 'tabernacle: body, soul, and spirit. The body is visible, like the outer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 825, 2, 80, 'court, and the soul and spirit are covered, like the Holy Place and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 825, 3, 80, 'Most Holy Place in the tabernacle. Between the soul and spirit, there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 825, 4, 80, 'a thick veil that prevents the Holy Spirit from coming and dwelling in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 825, 5, 80, 'man’s spirit. In the Old Testament, the Holy Spirit could not dwell in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 825, 6, 80, 'any person’s heart or spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 825, 7, 80, 'There are many implications of this thick veil. One is that man could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 825, 8, 80, 'not go into God''s presence because of something blocking him, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 825, 9, 80, 'another is that God could not come into man’s spirit because something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 825, 10, 80, 'was blocking Him. But that was removed when Christ died and said, “It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 825, 11, 80, 'finished.” It''s very important for us to understand this, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 825, 12, 80, 'there''s something in the veil being rent that Jesus wants to teach us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 825, 13, 80, 'that his disciples couldn''t understand then. Jesus said in John 16:12,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 825, 14, 80, '“There are many more things I want to say to you, but you cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 825, 15, 80, 'understand them now.” They couldn''t understand because they didn''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 825, 16, 80, 'the Holy Spirit. When the Holy Spirit came, suddenly their eyes were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 825, 17, 80, 'opened and they could read. It says in 2 Corinthians 3 that there''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 825, 18, 80, 'veil over the Scriptures as long as you''re under the law. You can’t see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 825, 19, 80, 'or understand many things in the Scriptures until you turn to the Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 825, 20, 80, 'the Spirit. Then the veil is taken away. If you turn to the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 825, 21, 80, 'to explain the meaning of something, He explains it to you. Now we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 825, 22, 80, 'turn to the Holy Spirit to understand the meaning of this veil. What we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 825, 23, 80, 'have to do is compare Scripture with Scripture. In Hebrews 10:19, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 825, 24, 80, 'says, “Therefore, brethren, we have confidence to enter [the Most Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 825, 25, 80, 'Place] by the blood of Jesus.” The Old Testament priests used to take a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 825, 26, 80, 'little blood from a lamb that was slain into the Holy Place on the day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 825, 27, 80, 'of the atonement. However, we have boldness to enter immediately into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 825, 28, 80, 'the presence of God by the blood of Jesus, “by a new and living way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 826, 1, 80, 'which He has inaugurated for us through the veil, that is, His flesh”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 826, 2, 80, '(v20).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 826, 3, 80, 'The New and Living Way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 826, 4, 80, 'So there is a way into the Most Holy Place that has been inaugurated.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 826, 5, 80, 'When a road is inaugurated, it’s not just for us to admire. It’s for us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 826, 6, 80, 'to use. A way was inaugurated for us when the veil was rent, and that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 826, 7, 80, 'veil, it says, was His flesh. The word flesh is used in a number of ways');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 826, 8, 80, 'in the New Testament. It is referring to meat at times, just plain meat,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 826, 9, 80, 'and at other times it''s referring to the corrupt sinful flesh we have.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 826, 10, 80, 'In our sinful flesh dwells nothing good (Romans 7:18). The Bible says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 826, 11, 80, 'that Jesus came in the likeness of sinful flesh, but not in sinful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 826, 12, 80, 'flesh, because there was no sin in Him at all. The angel said that holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 826, 13, 80, 'thing which is going to be born is called the Son of God. So there was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 826, 14, 80, 'no sin or sinful flesh in Jesus, but He did have a flesh. In fact, John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 826, 15, 80, 'says that any spirit that doesn''t confess that Jesus came in the flesh');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 826, 16, 80, 'is the spirit of the antichrist (1 John 4:2,3). It''s not talking about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 826, 17, 80, 'Jesus coming in a body, but Jesus coming in the flesh.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 826, 18, 80, 'That''s the word that’s always used in 1 John, 2 John, and 3 John. John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 826, 19, 80, 'always says that, “Jesus came in the flesh.” The secret of Godliness is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 826, 20, 80, 'that Christ came in the flesh (1 Timothy 3:16). So we need to understand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 826, 21, 80, 'what the meaning of flesh is. Galatians 5 gives a little understanding.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 826, 22, 80, 'The flesh fights against the Spirit, and the Spirit fights against the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 826, 23, 80, 'flesh. There is a conflict between them. They are in opposition to one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 826, 24, 80, 'another so that you don''t do the things that you please. The flesh is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 826, 25, 80, 'what makes us do what we want to do (Galatians 5:17), and the Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 826, 26, 80, 'opposes that. The Spirit tells us not to do what we want to do, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 826, 27, 80, 'rather what God wants us to do.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 826, 28, 80, 'Did Jesus have this conflict all His life? He certainly did in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 827, 1, 80, 'Gethsemane. We know He said, “Father not My will; not what I want to do,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 827, 2, 80, 'but what You want Me to do; not what pleases Me, but what pleases You.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 827, 3, 80, 'That was the flesh in Jesus, this thing that we call our will. In John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 827, 4, 80, '6:38, you will find what I call the one-line autobiography of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 827, 5, 80, 'Christ; the one-line description of His entire 33 ½ years on earth. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 827, 6, 80, 'says, “I have come from heaven not to do My Own will.” In other words,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 827, 7, 80, 'He denied His flesh - His flesh was His Own will. He said no to His Own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 827, 8, 80, 'will and spent His entire life doing the will of the Father. The Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 827, 9, 80, 'put the flesh to death in Jesus. In other words, He put this thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 827, 10, 80, 'called ‘My will’ to death. In Jesus there was no sin, but there was this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 827, 11, 80, 'thing called ‘My will’ that Jesus had throughout His life, and He had to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 827, 12, 80, 'deny it. “Not to do My Own will” means that He denied His Own will, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 827, 13, 80, 'He denied His flesh.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 827, 14, 80, 'That is the other meaning of flesh in Jesus, and that is symbolized by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 827, 15, 80, 'the veil. So what was torn in the 33 ½ years of Jesus’ life? His will.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 827, 16, 80, 'His Self-will was torn. He never did His Own will, and at the end of His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 827, 17, 80, 'life, He said, “It is finished.” That means He encountered every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 827, 18, 80, 'possible temptation that a man can face to do his own will and He never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 827, 19, 80, 'gave in. The whole range of temptation, top to bottom, was faced by Him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 827, 20, 80, 'and, by the help of the Holy Spirit, He never gave in. Therefore, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 827, 21, 80, 'veil – the symbol of that Self-will in the tabernacle - could be torn.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 827, 22, 80, 'The new and living way through the veil, that is, His flesh (or His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 827, 23, 80, 'Self-will), was inaugurated for us, so that we can go that way too. What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 827, 24, 80, 'is that way? The way of denying our own flesh today, denying self. ”If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 827, 25, 80, 'any man will come after Me, let him deny himself” (Matthew 16:24). That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 827, 26, 80, 'means Jesus denied Himself too. Otherwise, how can He say, “Follow Me?”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 827, 27, 80, 'I''ve got to do it, because He did it. Then I can follow Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 827, 28, 80, 'All the Scriptures fit together. That is what we call the way of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 828, 1, 80, 'cross, the new and living way, and it''s a way. Even though we think of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 828, 2, 80, 'the veil like an object or a door, it is not a door. It''s a way. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 828, 3, 80, 'called a “new and living way.” It’s living because you go the way you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 828, 4, 80, 'always live in life. It’s new in the sense that it is always fresh.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 828, 5, 80, 'Every day there''s something fresh, something new, and it’s living,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 828, 6, 80, 'because if I die with Him, I live with Him. It is a living way, and He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 828, 7, 80, 'leads me right into God''s presence. And so we see the thing that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 828, 8, 80, 'hindered man from being able to come into God''s presence was his own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 828, 9, 80, 'self-will. When Adam and Eve chose to do their own will, they went away');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 828, 10, 80, 'from God. Jesus came and went the opposite way. He never did His Own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 828, 11, 80, 'will. It says in Romans 15:3 that Christ never pleased Himself. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 828, 12, 80, 'how the veil was rent.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 828, 13, 80, 'Now we have a choice. God doesn''t force anybody to go this way, but we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 828, 14, 80, 'have a choice. If you want to dwell in the immediate presence of God in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 828, 15, 80, 'the Most Holy Place, you can live there 24 hours a day, seven days a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 828, 16, 80, 'week, as long as you go through this new and living way. That is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 828, 17, 80, 'meaning of the rent veil in Matthew 27:51, and this way is open for us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 828, 18, 80, 'all. This is how God can dwell in our spirit too, because the innermost');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 828, 19, 80, 'part of the tabernacle, the Most Holy Place, is our spirit, where God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 828, 20, 80, 'dwells. God doesn’t dwell in our body or our mind, but in our spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 828, 21, 80, 'When you say God dwelt in the tabernacle, it was in the Most Holy Place.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 828, 22, 80, 'When we say this body is a temple of the Holy Spirit, we’re saying the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 828, 23, 80, 'Holy Spirit dwells in the Most Holy Place, the spirit of man. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 828, 24, 80, 'between soul and spirit is this thing called my will, and if I allow God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 828, 25, 80, 'to break down my will, He can make me a spiritual person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 828, 26, 80, 'True Spirituality');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 828, 27, 80, 'Merely understanding truth in my mind does not make me spiritual.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 828, 28, 80, 'Getting excited in my emotions does not make me spiritual. It''s when I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 829, 1, 80, 'yield my will to the Word that I can become spiritual. Like Jesus said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 829, 2, 80, 'a man can understand what I say, but if he doesn''t do it, his house is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 829, 3, 80, 'built on sand. But when he does it - which means he denies his will and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 829, 4, 80, 'does what God says - then his house is built on rock, and that rock is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 829, 5, 80, 'obedience to Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 829, 6, 80, 'This is the way that God wants every one of His children to walk – the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 829, 7, 80, 'new and living way. In the parable that Jesus spoke about the wise man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 829, 8, 80, 'and the foolish man in Matthew 7, at the end of the Sermon on the Mount,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 829, 9, 80, 'He said, “Everyone who hears these words of Mine and does them will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 829, 10, 80, 'like a wise man who built his house on the rock…” In our personality,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 829, 11, 80, 'our soul consists of our mind, emotions, and will. The will is the door');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 829, 12, 80, 'to the spirit, or the veil into the Most Holy Place. My mind, emotion,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 829, 13, 80, 'and will make up my soul. Even if I understand God''s Word in my mind or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 829, 14, 80, 'if I''m stirred by God''s Word in my emotions, God''s Word has still not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 829, 15, 80, 'penetrated my spirit until I have yielded my will. So when He says, “one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 829, 16, 80, 'who hears these words and does them,” Jesus means he understands it and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 829, 17, 80, 'maybe he is even excited about it, but there’s more: he does them. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 829, 18, 80, 'then that he''s built on the rock. But if he only understands it (verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 829, 19, 80, '26) and is excited about it, but does not obey it, he is still on sand.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 829, 20, 80, 'Sand is mind and emotions. But God''s Word must go through the sand till');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 829, 21, 80, 'it hits rock. Then we are unshakable.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 829, 22, 80, 'Jesus said the same thing earlier in Matthew 7:21, “Not everyone who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 829, 23, 80, 'says to Me, Lord, Lord will enter the kingdom of heaven, but he who does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 829, 24, 80, 'the will of My Father.” What does that mean? When a man says, ‘Lord,’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 829, 25, 80, 'that means his mind is right, and he believes that Jesus Christ is Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 829, 26, 80, 'When he says, ‘Lord, Lord,’ that means he is excited, and his emotions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 829, 27, 80, 'are right. But he still doesn''t enter the kingdom. It''s when he yields');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 829, 28, 80, 'his will. ‘Lord’ is not enough. ‘Lord, Lord’ is not enough. Only after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 830, 1, 80, 'obedience, when the will is broken and the veil is torn, can God dwell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 830, 2, 80, 'in his spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 830, 3, 80, 'It is the same thing everywhere. You find Scripture teaches consistently');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 830, 4, 80, 'that it is the lack of yielded-ness of our will that prevents us from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 830, 5, 80, 'being spiritual. In Christendom, two groups of people both say they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 830, 6, 80, 'separated from all the dead denominational churches. One group');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 830, 7, 80, 'concentrates on studying the Scriptures. If you go to their assemblies,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 830, 8, 80, 'they are always studying Scripture, teaching Scripture, and they have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 830, 9, 80, 'tremendous knowledge of Scripture. But it is in the mind. The other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 830, 10, 80, 'group reacts against that, saying, “That is dead academic study. We want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 830, 11, 80, 'some excitement.” They have very emotional songs and drums and beats and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 830, 12, 80, 'clapping and yelling and all types of jumping like the prophets of Baal.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 830, 13, 80, 'They think that is spirituality, but it''s not. One emphasizes the mind,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 830, 14, 80, 'and the other, emotion. Where is the church that says, “Beyond emotion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 830, 15, 80, 'and mind, you have to deny yourself and take up the cross and die. Then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 830, 16, 80, 'you’ve built on the rock.” That''s the church you should be a part of.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 830, 17, 80, 'We''re not against intellectual understanding. I believe in studying the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 830, 18, 80, 'Scriptures. That''s why we''re having this bible study. I believe in being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 830, 19, 80, 'excited about the Scriptures and stirring people emotionally. I hope');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 830, 20, 80, 'you’ve been stirred emotionally as you’ve gone through these chapters.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 830, 21, 80, 'But ultimately our aim is to get you to deny your will and do the will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 830, 22, 80, 'of God. Otherwise, you''ll never become spiritual. That is the whole');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 830, 23, 80, 'meaning of the rent veil. That is where God wants to bring us, where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 830, 24, 80, 'Christ is Lord. And when you say Christ is Lord, it is proven not just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 830, 25, 80, 'in word, and not just in emotion, but in obedience to His Word. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 830, 26, 80, 'speaks about the wise man at the end of the Sermon on the Mount as,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 830, 27, 80, '“Whoever hears these words of Mine and does them.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 830, 28, 80, 'If you are serious about following all that you''ve learned in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 831, 1, 80, 'study, do what Jesus said - build on the rock. “If you hear these words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 831, 2, 80, 'of Mine and do them, you’ll build on the rock” (Matthew 7:24). That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 831, 3, 80, 'the narrow way. At the end of Sermon on the Mount, He says, “Enter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 831, 4, 80, 'through the narrow gate…” That is the new and living way, through the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 831, 5, 80, 'veil. That is the narrow way and the narrow gate, and it relates to this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 831, 6, 80, 'chapter. So if you are serious about it, I would encourage you to read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 831, 7, 80, 'Matthew 5, 6, and 7. Go through it, verse by verse, and see if you’ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 831, 8, 80, 'obeyed it. We went through it earlier in this study, verse by verse. See');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 831, 9, 80, 'if you are obeying all that Jesus taught. If you do, your life will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 831, 10, 80, 'unshakable, your family will be unshakable, and your church will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 831, 11, 80, 'unshakable. It is such a life of obedience to God''s Word that is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 831, 12, 80, 'being taught sufficiently in Christendom today. It is the mark of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 831, 13, 80, 'love for Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 831, 14, 80, 'How do you prove your love for Christ? Is it by going out as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 831, 15, 80, 'missionary? Is it by sacrifice and offering? No. It says in Hebrews');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 831, 16, 80, '10:5, sacrifice and offering He does not desire, but He wants your body.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 831, 17, 80, 'He wants you to obey Him with your eyes and tongue and hands. That''s how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 831, 18, 80, 'you prove your love. Jesus said, “If you love Me, keep My commandments.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 831, 19, 80, 'Many people understand love as just emotional excitement, like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 831, 20, 80, 'cinematic type of love between a boy and a girl. They think love for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 831, 21, 80, 'Jesus is like that. That''s not love for Jesus. Jesus said, love for Me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 831, 22, 80, 'is proved by your obedience. John 14:15 says, “If you love Me, keep My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 831, 23, 80, 'commandments.” There''s no other way to prove our love for Him. Another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 831, 24, 80, 'sign is that you’ll love your brother. If you can’t love a brother whom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 831, 25, 80, 'you see, you can’t love God Who is invisible (1 John 4:20). These are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 831, 26, 80, 'the two ways by which I prove my love for God. One is by keeping His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 831, 27, 80, 'commandments, and the other is by loving your brother whom you can see.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 831, 28, 80, 'A lot of brothers whom we see may not be very lovable, but if you can’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 832, 1, 80, 'love them, you can’t love God. The Christian life is very practical.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 832, 2, 80, 'God Can Even Use Secret Disciples to Help Care for the Body of Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 832, 3, 80, '“And when it was evening, there came a rich man from Arimathea, named');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 832, 4, 80, 'Joseph, who himself had also become a disciple of Jesus” (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 832, 5, 80, '27:57). This was in secret, because he was in the council, and they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 832, 6, 80, 'not followers of Jesus. A man in the council was a secret disciple, like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 832, 7, 80, 'Nicodemus, and this man went to Pilate and asked for the body of Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 832, 8, 80, 'So Pilate ordered it to be given over to him. This shows how God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 832, 9, 80, 'some witnesses in high places to help us. If Peter had gone to Pilate’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 832, 10, 80, 'house, the fisherman Peter, the security guards would have thrown him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 832, 11, 80, 'out of the gate. He couldn’t have gone anywhere near, but there was this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 832, 12, 80, 'influential man called Joseph. God had him there to help the body of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 832, 13, 80, 'Jesus to be taken down. It''s the same today. God has some very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 832, 14, 80, 'influential people in high places who are willing to help the body of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 832, 15, 80, 'Christ today. Thank God for them. They may be secret disciples. They''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 832, 16, 80, 'not called to go out and plant churches and be apostles like Peter, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 832, 17, 80, 'they''re useful at certain times to help the body of Christ. It says that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 832, 18, 80, 'Joseph took the body. He himself came, took the body, wrapped it up in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 832, 19, 80, 'clean linen cloth, and laid it out in his own new tomb, which he had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 832, 20, 80, 'hewn in the rock. Then he rolled a large stone against the entrance of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 832, 21, 80, 'the tomb and went away. Just as it was prophesied in Isaiah 53, His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 832, 22, 80, 'death and His burial were with criminals on the cross and with a very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 832, 23, 80, 'wealthy man in His burial. God cares for the poor and the rich, for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 832, 24, 80, 'extreme murderers and rich people. He doesn''t exclude anybody.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 832, 25, 80, '“Mary Magdalene was there and the other Mary sitting opposite the grave.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 832, 26, 80, 'The next day, which is the one after the preparation, the chief priests');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 832, 27, 80, 'and the Pharisees gathered together with Pilate and said, ‘Sir, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 832, 28, 80, 'remember that when He was still alive that deceiver said, “After three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 833, 1, 80, 'days I am to rise again”’” (Matthew 27:61-63). They were concerned just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 833, 2, 80, 'in case this was actually going to happen. Imagine that! They didn’t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 833, 3, 80, 'believe in the resurrection, but they thought something might happen.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 833, 4, 80, 'They didn’t know what, but maybe the disciples would come and steal the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 833, 5, 80, 'body or something and say that He had risen. So they went to Pilate.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 833, 6, 80, 'They were so particular to make sure the grave was protected from this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 833, 7, 80, 'type of theft and all that, which is all very good. It is good because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 833, 8, 80, 'it proved in history that the resurrection had nothing to do with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 833, 9, 80, 'anybody rolling away the stone or any disciples coming and stealing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 833, 10, 80, 'Jesus’ body. So God ordained this, that Pilate should get a security of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 833, 11, 80, 'military people to guard that tomb. They said, “Please give orders for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 833, 12, 80, 'the grave to be made secure until the third day, lest the disciples come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 833, 13, 80, 'and steal Him away and say to the people, ‘He is risen from the dead,’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 833, 14, 80, 'and the last deception would be worse than the first. So Pilate said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 833, 15, 80, '‘Go ahead, you have a guard; go and make it as secure as you know how.’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 833, 16, 80, 'And they went and made the grave secure, and along with the guard, they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 833, 17, 80, 'set a seal on the stone” (Matthew 27:64-66). Not only did they put a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 833, 18, 80, 'guard, the Roman soldiers kept doing shifts, so that 24 hours a day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 833, 19, 80, 'there would always be someone awake, watching over that tomb to make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 833, 20, 80, 'sure no disciple came anywhere near it. In any case, one soldier alone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 833, 21, 80, 'would have been enough to drive away any disciples, but there were a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 833, 22, 80, 'number of soldiers continuously there around the tomb of Jesus for all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 833, 23, 80, 'those three days. They put a seal as well on the tomb, which if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 833, 24, 80, 'didn’t know, if somebody had moved it or broke it to remove the stone,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 833, 25, 80, 'the seal would be broken. This was God''s way of sovereignly proving that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 833, 26, 80, 'the resurrection was not a fake. Even this thing that Pilate ordered was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 833, 27, 80, 'something that God allowed so that history would record that it was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 833, 28, 80, 'the disciples who took the body away. This was a case where the Roman');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 834, 1, 80, 'authority, the government, was trying to keep anyone from coming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 834, 2, 80, 'anywhere near the grave. This was not just some cemetery somewhere where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 834, 3, 80, 'anybody could come and walk in and walk off with the body. If it was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 834, 4, 80, 'like that, people could have spread all types of stories. God allowed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 834, 5, 80, 'this to happen so that there would be clear proof that the resurrection');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 834, 6, 80, 'was a supernatural event that came from God. Do you see the sovereignty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 834, 7, 80, 'of God? That''s what we learn: if our lives are surrendered to God, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 834, 8, 80, 'makes everything work for our good and His glory. His sovereignty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 834, 9, 80, 'determines and controls that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 834, 10, 81, 'Chapter 79 Jesus''s Resurrection');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 834, 11, 81, 'After the regular Sabbath on Saturday (before that there was a special');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 834, 12, 81, 'Sabbath on Friday which was also a Sabbath because of the feast of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 834, 13, 81, 'unleavened bread following the Passover; Christ died on Thursday) –');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 834, 14, 81, 'which is to say, “after three days” - Mary Magdalene and the other Mary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 834, 15, 81, 'came to look at the grave. They brought spices because there was no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 834, 16, 81, 'opportunity during the Sabbath to go and anoint the body of Jesus. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 834, 17, 81, 'was all done in a rush. Joseph of Arimathea just wrapped it in a clean');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 834, 18, 81, 'linen cloth and put it in the tomb because it was getting close to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 834, 19, 81, 'sunset when the Sabbath would begin (Matthew 27:59). “A severe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 834, 20, 81, 'earthquake had occurred, for an angel of the Lord descended from heaven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 834, 21, 81, 'and came and rolled away the stone and sat on it. And His appearance was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 834, 22, 81, 'like lightning and His garment as white as snow; and the guards shook');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 834, 23, 81, 'for fear of Him and became like dead men.” These women came looking and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 834, 24, 81, 'they saw the angel, and the angel answered and said, “Do not be afraid;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 834, 25, 81, 'for I know that you are looking for Jesus Who has been crucified. He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 834, 26, 81, 'not here, for He has risen, just as He said. Come, see the place where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 834, 27, 81, 'He was lying” (Matthew 28:1-6).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 834, 28, 81, 'The Most Important Event in the History of Mankind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 835, 1, 81, 'This is the most important event in the history of man. Christians have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 835, 2, 81, 'not sufficiently emphasized the resurrection of Jesus Christ. “He has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 835, 3, 81, 'risen, come and see. Go and quickly tell His disciples that He has risen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 835, 4, 81, 'from the dead, and He is going before you to Galilee, there you will see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 835, 5, 81, 'Him; behold, I have told you” (Matthew 28:7). Why do I say this is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 835, 6, 81, 'most important event in human history? Jesus Christ is not the only One');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 835, 7, 81, 'who was crucified. Many thieves were crucified. Even on that day, two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 835, 8, 81, 'thieves were crucified. That was the standard method of death that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 835, 9, 81, 'Romans employed. Many people were crucified and many religious leaders');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 835, 10, 81, 'had been martyred and killed. How do we say Jesus is different? He could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 835, 11, 81, 'be like one of the old prophets. Resurrection is different from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 835, 12, 81, 'raising of the dead. Elijah and Elisha raised some young boys from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 835, 13, 81, 'dead. Elisha’s dead bones raised up a dead man who was thrown into that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 835, 14, 81, 'grave. This is different from those three resurrections. In Jesus’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 835, 15, 81, 'lifetime, Lazarus and Jairus’ daughter were both raised from the dead,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 835, 16, 81, 'and the widow of Nain''s son was too. But this is different from those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 835, 17, 81, 'three as well. Peter raised Tabitha from the dead and Paul raised');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 835, 18, 81, 'Eutychus from the dead, but this is also different from those two. All');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 835, 19, 81, 'of these eight people - raised from the dead at one time by godly men -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 835, 20, 81, 'died again. They hadn''t conquered death. They were raised from the dead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 835, 21, 81, 'temporarily to die again. They came out of the grave and then went back');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 835, 22, 81, 'to the grave.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 835, 23, 81, 'In Jesus’ case it was a resurrection. When Jesus came out of the grave,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 835, 24, 81, 'He didn’t come out in His old body. It was the same shape and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 835, 25, 81, 'appearance, but it was a resurrection body that could move from place to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 835, 26, 81, 'place and virtually disappear. It could move at the speed of lightning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 835, 27, 81, 'so that you could hardly see when it came and when it went, and there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 835, 28, 81, 'was no blood in it. It had only flesh and bones, as we considered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 836, 1, 81, 'earlier in Luke chapter 24:39. When He appeared before the disciples');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 836, 2, 81, 'said to them, "See My hands and My feet, that it is I Myself; touch Me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 836, 3, 81, 'and see, for a spirit does not have flesh and bones as you see that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 836, 4, 81, 'have". You read there that He could eat a piece of fish - they gave Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 836, 5, 81, 'a piece of fish and He ate it to show them that He was a living person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 836, 6, 81, 'He chose to eat fish was because when you eat fish you leave the bones');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 836, 7, 81, 'behind. Afterwards when Jesus disappeared and the disciples wondered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 836, 8, 81, 'whether it was a dream or something, they would see the bones of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 836, 9, 81, 'fish and remember that He was really there because of the bones.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 836, 10, 81, 'In the resurrection of Jesus He had a body that was not limited by time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 836, 11, 81, 'and space, without blood, a body that could never be sick and could move');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 836, 12, 81, 'around without any limitation. The Bible says that when Christ comes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 836, 13, 81, 'back we''re going to have a body like that. It says in Philippians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 836, 14, 81, '3:20-21 that “we''re waiting for the Savior Lord Jesus Christ from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 836, 15, 81, 'heaven, Who will transform the body of our humble state into conformity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 836, 16, 81, 'with the body of His glory.” Our body is going to be like His in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 836, 17, 81, 'resurrection when Christ comes back. This is the most important event in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 836, 18, 81, 'human history because there''s only one human being that ever rose from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 836, 19, 81, 'the dead and conquered death.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 836, 20, 81, 'Christians make a lot about the birth of Jesus and the death of Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 836, 21, 81, 'What are the most common paintings of Christ that you have seen? The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 836, 22, 81, 'nativity scene (the birth of Christ) and the cross (the death of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 836, 23, 81, 'Christ). How many paintings have you seen of Christ coming out of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 836, 24, 81, 'grave alive? That is most important, and yet the devil has hidden that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 836, 25, 81, 'He always wants people to think of a weak helpless Christ; a little baby');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 836, 26, 81, 'in a manger or a person hanging on the cross. But that is not Christ -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 836, 27, 81, 'the cross is empty today. He is not there. The meaning of an empty cross');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 836, 28, 81, 'is that Jesus is risen. That''s the message that needs to be proclaimed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 837, 1, 81, 'Proof of Resurrection in Romans');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 837, 2, 81, 'The resurrection is the most important truth for us to experience in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 837, 3, 81, 'whole Bible. God loves us as He loved Jesus, and He manifested that love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 837, 4, 81, 'by giving His son to die on the cross and raising Him from the dead,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 837, 5, 81, 'proving thereby that He was the Son of God. The Bible says that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 837, 6, 81, 'resurrection was the proof that He was the Son of God. He was “declared');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 837, 7, 81, 'the Son of God with power by the resurrection from the dead” (Romans');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 837, 8, 81, '1:4). The resurrection from the dead proved that what He said was true,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 837, 9, 81, 'and what all other religious leaders said was not true because they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 837, 10, 81, 'not raised from the dead. He rose from the dead. He conquered death.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 837, 11, 81, 'Man''s greatest enemy is death. Every man dies. Man has conquered space');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 837, 12, 81, 'but he has not conquered death. You can extend life in many ways with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 837, 13, 81, 'treatment and medicine, but finally man dies and you cannot conquer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 837, 14, 81, 'death. But Jesus conquered death.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 837, 15, 81, 'Further, it says in Romans 4:25 that He was delivered for our offenses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 837, 16, 81, 'and raised again for our justification. So the resurrection of Christ is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 837, 17, 81, 'significant for us because it is how I know that I''m accepted before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 837, 18, 81, 'God, that Christ is now my righteousness, and that I''m declared');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 837, 19, 81, 'righteous before God. How do I know I''m declared righteous? How do I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 837, 20, 81, 'know my sins are forgiven? Because Christ died on the cross. I can stand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 837, 21, 81, 'before God today because Christ rose from the dead and ascended up into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 837, 22, 81, 'the presence of God in a body. When Christ died, His spirit went into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 837, 23, 81, 'paradise like the spirits of dead believers, but His body was on earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 837, 24, 81, 'At the resurrection, His spirit came back into the body and the body');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 837, 25, 81, 'rose up and was transformed into a new body. He was on earth for forty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 837, 26, 81, 'days and then ascended to heaven. That is why wherever the apostles');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 837, 27, 81, 'went, they said that they were “witnesses of Jesus'' resurrection.” When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 837, 28, 81, 'the apostles wanted to select someone to replace Judas, see what they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 838, 1, 81, 'said. In Acts 1, before the day of the Pentecost, Peter says that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 838, 2, 81, 'person to replace Judas Iscariot who should "be along with us a witness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 838, 3, 81, 'of His resurrection". Not a witness of His crucifixion, but a witness of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 838, 4, 81, 'His resurrection.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 838, 5, 81, 'Speak of Crucifixion and Resurrection');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 838, 6, 81, 'We must speak more of the resurrection of Christ than the crucifixion.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 838, 7, 81, 'The two must be spoken of together. The gospel is that Christ died for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 838, 8, 81, 'our sins and rose again, not just that Christ died for our sins. See 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 838, 9, 81, 'Corinthians 15:3, "I declare to you what I received, that Christ died');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 838, 10, 81, 'for our sins according to the Scriptures, that He was buried, and on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 838, 11, 81, 'third day rose again according to the Scriptures.” He appeared to more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 838, 12, 81, 'than five hundred brethren at one time (verse 6). So the gospel is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 838, 13, 81, 'incomplete if you don''t talk about the resurrection. This is so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 838, 14, 81, 'important. I believe all preaching of the gospel must include the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 838, 15, 81, 'resurrection of Christ. It’s fundamentally important.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 838, 16, 81, '“They departed quickly and reported it with great joy and ran and told');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 838, 17, 81, 'the disciples. Then Jesus met them and greeted them. They came up and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 838, 18, 81, 'took hold of His feet and worshipped Him and then Jesus said to them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 838, 19, 81, '‘Don''t be afraid’” (Matthew 28:8). Those were always His words: peace be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 838, 20, 81, 'to you, don''t be afraid. Those are the most common words He used even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 838, 21, 81, 'after His resurrection. Peace and have no fear. I hope we will take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 838, 22, 81, 'those words to heart because of the resurrection of Jesus Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 838, 23, 81, 'Because He lives, like we sing in that song, we can face tomorrow.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 838, 24, 81, 'Because the One who holds tomorrow lives, there''s no fear or anxiety;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 838, 25, 81, 'there is peace.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 838, 26, 81, 'Jesus Is Our Brother Now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 838, 27, 81, '“Go and take My word to My brethren” (Matthew 28:10b). This is a new');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 838, 28, 81, 'thing that happened in the resurrection. Until then He called His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 839, 1, 81, 'disciples “servants” and “friends,” but after the resurrection, He calls');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 839, 2, 81, 'them His brothers. “Go and take word to My brethren to leave for Galilee');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 839, 3, 81, 'and there they shall see Me.” In John 20 we read of His meeting with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 839, 4, 81, 'Mary Magdalene. He tells her in the middle of John 20:17, “go to My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 839, 5, 81, 'brethren, and say to them, ‘I ascend to My Father and your Father, My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 839, 6, 81, 'God and your God.’” Jesus had never used that expression before. All');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 839, 7, 81, 'through the gospels and throughout His earthly life, He would talk about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 839, 8, 81, 'His Father, or sometimes He would talk to the disciples about "your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 839, 9, 81, 'Father." It was always “My Father,” or, “your Father,” but after the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 839, 10, 81, 'resurrection He combines the two for the first time: "My Father and your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 839, 11, 81, 'Father." He says we''re one now and you are My brothers. In John 15 He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 839, 12, 81, 'had told them that He no longer called them servants but friends and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 839, 13, 81, 'brothers (John 15:14-15).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 839, 14, 81, 'What does it mean when one Christian calls a person a “brother”? That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 839, 15, 81, 'the greatest title you can ever give to a child of God: “brother of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 839, 16, 81, 'Jesus Christ.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 839, 17, 81, 'I wish we''d be gripped by the significance of this title, “My brothers.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 839, 18, 81, 'We have one Father. Romans 8:29 says, “those whom God foreknew, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 839, 19, 81, 'predestined (He determined a destination for them) that they should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 839, 20, 81, 'become like Jesus, conformed to the image of His Son, so that He might');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 839, 21, 81, 'be the firstborn among many brothers.” When God sent His Son to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 839, 22, 81, 'earth, as we see in John 3:16, He was the “only begotten Son.” After the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 839, 23, 81, 'resurrection He became the “firstborn among many brothers.” So the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 839, 24, 81, 'resurrection is very significant. Jesus was no longer the only begotten');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 839, 25, 81, 'Son. Up until the resurrection He was the only begotten Son of God, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 839, 26, 81, 'the moment He rose from the dead, He became the firstborn. We need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 839, 27, 81, 'see the significance of His resurrection. Jesus is teaching us that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 839, 28, 81, 'are His brothers; that His Father is our Father, and that He is our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 840, 1, 81, 'elder Brother. It is an amazing relationship; we can have the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 840, 2, 81, 'rights as He has if we keep the same laws. God will do for us everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 840, 3, 81, 'that He did for Jesus because there''s no partiality with God; what He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 840, 4, 81, 'did for His elder Son He will do for us. When I had only one son, he was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 840, 5, 81, 'my only son; but once I had other sons, he became my firstborn. An only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 840, 6, 81, 'son becomes a firstborn when there are other sons. That is what happened');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 840, 7, 81, 'at the resurrection. The only begotten Son became the firstborn. We need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 840, 8, 81, 'to see this so that we can recognize our position and our privilege as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 840, 9, 81, 'children of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 840, 10, 81, '“While they were on their way, behold, some of the guard came into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 840, 11, 81, 'city and reported to the chief priests all that had happened” (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 840, 12, 81, '28:11). They said hey, there was an earthquake and an angel came and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 840, 13, 81, 'rolled away the stone and we were just frightened and the body just rose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 840, 14, 81, 'up, they didn''t see the body but they couldn''t see it. “When they had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 840, 15, 81, 'assembled with the elders and counseled together, they gave a large sum');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 840, 16, 81, 'of money to the soldiers, and said, ‘You must tell people that His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 840, 17, 81, 'disciples came by night and stole Him away while we were asleep’”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 840, 18, 81, '(Matthew 28:12-13). It is a crime for a Roman soldier to be asleep when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 840, 19, 81, 'he is on duty. No Roman soldier would dare to do that, but what could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 840, 20, 81, 'they say? They couldn''t say that the disciples or fishermen came and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 840, 21, 81, 'overpowered the Roman soldiers and took the body, for nobody would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 840, 22, 81, 'believe that. The guards said, “Hey, what if Pilate hears that we were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 840, 23, 81, 'asleep?” They said, “Don''t worry. We''ll talk to the governor and keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 840, 24, 81, 'you out of trouble for saying that you were asleep.” Those soldiers were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 840, 25, 81, 'happy to take the money and did exactly as they were instructed (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 840, 26, 81, '28:14-15).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 840, 27, 81, 'Right from the beginning there has been lying on the part of religious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 840, 28, 81, 'people. Religious people tell lies in order to defend their cause.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 841, 1, 81, 'People of all religions - including nominal Christians - tell lies.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 841, 2, 81, 'Whenever you tell a lie, remember that the father of a lie is Satan.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 841, 3, 81, 'Jesus said the devil is the father of all lies. Jesus said He is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 841, 4, 81, 'truth. And you see lying right at the beginning, after the resurrection.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 841, 5, 81, 'Jesus Shows Himself to Believers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 841, 6, 81, 'The resurrection is the most important thing that ever happened. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 841, 7, 81, 'what gives us hope. 1 Corinthians 15 is a great chapter on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 841, 8, 81, 'resurrection. In verse six it says that after the resurrection, Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 841, 9, 81, 'appeared to five hundred brethren. Do you know that Jesus never appeared');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 841, 10, 81, 'to an unbeliever after His resurrection? He didn''t have any cheap desire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 841, 11, 81, 'to go and stand before Pilate and say, “You killed Me, but here I am…”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 841, 12, 81, 'He didn''t have the desire to go and stand before Annas and Caiaphas or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 841, 13, 81, 'Herod either.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 841, 14, 81, 'He did appear to people, but all the people He appeared to were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 841, 15, 81, 'believers. That is very significant. He appeared to 500 brothers, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 841, 16, 81, 'not one of those was an unbeliever because He didn''t want to score any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 841, 17, 81, 'cheap points over others. If they repented of their sins they could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 841, 18, 81, 'trust Him. He told Thomas, “Blessed are those who have not seen and have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 841, 19, 81, 'believed.” "You believe,” He told Thomas, "because you''ve seen Me, put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 841, 20, 81, 'your hands into My fingers." Is that the more blessed thing? What did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 841, 21, 81, 'Jesus say about believing in Him? He said in John 22:29 “Blessed are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 841, 22, 81, 'those who have not seen Me and believed.” We are in that category. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 841, 23, 81, 'haven''t seen the risen Jesus but we believe. Do you know that you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 841, 24, 81, 'more blessed than those who actually saw the physical, resurrected');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 841, 25, 81, 'Jesus? I believe it because He said it. I believe with all my heart that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 841, 26, 81, 'I am more blessed than those people who saw the physical, resurrected');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 841, 27, 81, 'Jesus. Some of us think they would like to have been there at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 841, 28, 81, 'resurrection to see Him coming after His resurrection. No, you are more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 842, 1, 81, 'blessed if you didn''t see, and yet believe. Those are the words of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 842, 2, 81, 'Jesus, so it must be true in some way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 842, 3, 81, 'We Have Hope Because of Christ''s Resurrection');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 842, 4, 81, 'In 1 Corinthians 15 it says that if in this life only we have hope – if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 842, 5, 81, 'Christ wasn’t raised, then we are of all men most miserable. We have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 842, 6, 81, 'hope for the future because of the resurrection of Christ. We will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 842, 7, 81, 'resurrected with Christ when He comes, and then comes the end. Death has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 842, 8, 81, 'already been destroyed by the resurrection of Christ, Satan’s power has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 842, 9, 81, 'been destroyed. The Resurrection proved that all that Jesus said was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 842, 10, 81, 'true, and proves that we have hope for the future. If it were not for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 842, 11, 81, 'the resurrection, we would be of all men most miserable.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 842, 12, 81, 'Paul says he is willing to face all types of dangers because he knows');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 842, 13, 81, 'there is a resurrection from the dead. In Acts 24:15 Paul confesses his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 842, 14, 81, 'hope that there is going to be a resurrection one day of the righteous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 842, 15, 81, 'and the wicked. “In view of this, I also do my best to maintain always a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 842, 16, 81, 'blameless conscience both before God and before men" (verse 16). This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 842, 17, 81, 'teaches that if you really believe there''s going to be a resurrection,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 842, 18, 81, 'then the evidence is that you will keep your conscience absolutely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 842, 19, 81, 'clear. Otherwise it is a nominal confession. If you really believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 842, 20, 81, 'there''s going to be a resurrection of the righteous and the wicked, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 842, 21, 81, 'will do your very best to maintain a blameless conscience before God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 842, 22, 81, 'men. It is one thing to theoretically say, “I believe in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 842, 23, 81, 'resurrection of Jesus Christ.” It is quite another thing to actually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 842, 24, 81, 'believe it deep down in our heart. If you ask the devil whether he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 842, 25, 81, 'believes Jesus rose from the dead, he would say yes! Every demon in hell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 842, 26, 81, 'knows it and trembles at that truth. If you also believe in your heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 842, 27, 81, 'that there will be a resurrection of the righteous and another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 842, 28, 81, 'resurrection of the wicked, and that not everybody is going to be in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 843, 1, 81, 'resurrection of the righteous, how can you make sure that you''ll be in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 843, 2, 81, 'the resurrection of the righteous and not in the resurrection of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 843, 3, 81, 'wicked? There''s nobody who could tell us better than Paul himself. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 843, 4, 81, 'says in view of the hope that there''ll be a resurrection the righteous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 843, 5, 81, 'and the wicked, he does his best always to maintain a blameless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 843, 6, 81, 'conscience before God and before man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 843, 7, 81, 'What does that mean? It means that whenever Paul’s conscience pricked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 843, 8, 81, 'him about anything that he felt had violated God''s law or the life of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 843, 9, 81, 'Christ, he would immediately confess it and ask God to forgive it and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 843, 10, 81, 'cleanse it in the blood of Christ. If he felt he had hurt somebody, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 843, 11, 81, 'would go immediately to that person and ask forgiveness and set it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 843, 12, 81, 'right. If somebody had done some harm to him and he had a little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 843, 13, 81, 'unforgiving spirit in his heart, he would immediately get rid of it and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 843, 14, 81, 'forgive that person. He made sure his conscience was always clean. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 843, 15, 81, 'like when a thorn gets into your foot. You don''t wait to pull it out;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 843, 16, 81, 'you pull it out immediately. That is how we must keep our conscience,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 843, 17, 81, 'and that is the way anyone who believes in the resurrection will keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 843, 18, 81, 'his conscience. As far as I''m concerned, the only way I can say I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 843, 19, 81, 'believe in the resurrection is that I keep my conscience clear. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 843, 20, 81, 'don''t keep your conscience clear, your faith in the resurrection is only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 843, 21, 81, 'theoretical. May God help us to live according to the things that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 843, 22, 81, 'taught.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 843, 23, 82, 'Chapter 80 Summary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 843, 24, 82, 'We''ve been looking at the subject of all that Jesus taught, trying to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 843, 25, 82, 'obey the command in Matthew 28:20 where Jesus said that after you make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 843, 26, 82, 'disciples and baptize them, you must teach them to observe all that He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 843, 27, 82, 'commanded. We have studied the entire Gospel of Matthew, and we’ve seen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 843, 28, 82, 'all the things that Jesus taught by His words, by His life, by His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 844, 1, 82, 'actions, and by the circumstances through which He took His disciples');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 844, 2, 82, 'and trained them. What was He trying to teach them which we have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 844, 3, 82, 'learn? What was He trying to teach from the actions of others like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 844, 4, 82, 'blind man who came and asked for healing, and Jesus said, according to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 844, 5, 82, 'your faith be done to you? What was He trying to teach in His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 844, 6, 82, 'relationships with people? There are numerous lessons that we''ve learned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 844, 7, 82, 'by considering all that Jesus taught.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 844, 8, 82, 'It''s possible for us to understand it all in our mind when we study it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 844, 9, 82, 'like the veil that is the flesh of Jesus and the tabernacle. A few');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 844, 10, 82, 'chapters earlier, we saw that there is a veil between the soul and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 844, 11, 82, 'spirit, and to be spiritual, we must allow that veil to be rent in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 844, 12, 82, 'lives just like the veil in the temple was rent. That means that our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 844, 13, 82, 'will needs to be yielded and surrendered. We have to say, “Not my will.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 844, 14, 82, 'In other words, we’ve got to obey what God shows us. Then we enter into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 844, 15, 82, 'the Most Holy Place and live in God''s presence continuously. God can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 844, 16, 82, 'dwell in our spirit continuously, and the glory of God fills our life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 844, 17, 82, 'This is the truly Spirit-filled life. The Spirit-filled life is a life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 844, 18, 82, 'where we constantly say no to our own will. The perfect Spirit-filled');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 844, 19, 82, 'man was Jesus Christ, and in Him we see what it means to be filled with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 844, 20, 82, 'the Spirit. In Jesus, all the fullness of grace and fullness of truth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 844, 21, 82, 'and all the kindness and the strictness of God, was manifested in one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 844, 22, 82, 'Person. This is how all of us are to be: kind and strict, upright for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 844, 23, 82, 'God''s principles, and compassionate from the depth of our hearts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 844, 24, 82, 'We''ve finally come to the last five verses of Matthew, where the eleven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 844, 25, 82, 'disciples proceeded to Galilee. In the last chapter, we considered the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 844, 26, 82, 'resurrection, and how Jesus did not appear to anybody except disciples');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 844, 27, 82, 'after His resurrection. He did not want any cheap publicity. He didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 844, 28, 82, 'want it then, and He doesn''t want it now. “The eleven disciples');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 845, 1, 82, 'proceeded to Galilee, to the mountain which Jesus had designated. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 845, 2, 82, 'when they saw Him, they worshiped Him; but some were doubtful” (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 845, 3, 82, '28:16,17). This is always the case even among Christians. Some worship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 845, 4, 82, '(which means to fall down at His feet and say, “You are our Lord”), and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 845, 5, 82, 'there are others who doubt. There are always these two categories. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 845, 6, 82, 'came up and spoke to them saying, “All authority has been given to Me in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 845, 7, 82, 'heaven and on earth. Therefore, go and make disciples.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 845, 8, 82, 'The Basis of Our Commission');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 845, 9, 82, 'Generally speaking, when people are told to go into all nations to make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 845, 10, 82, 'disciples, they’re told, “There''s a need out there. Therefore, go.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 845, 11, 82, 'Jesus never said that. Jesus never said, “There''s a great need all over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 845, 12, 82, 'the world. Therefore, go.” He said, “All authority in heaven and earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 845, 13, 82, 'is given to Me. Therefore, go.” And when you go on the basis of all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 845, 14, 82, 'authority being given to Jesus Christ, the results are much different');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 845, 15, 82, 'than when you go trying to meet a need. If you go trying to meet a need,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 845, 16, 82, 'you can end up as a nervous wreck. I''ve seen so many missionaries who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 845, 17, 82, 'are nervous wrecks at the end of many years of labor in India. They are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 845, 18, 82, 'grumpy, sour, critical, complaining, grumbling - a pathetic testimony to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 845, 19, 82, 'Christ - and I wonder why in the world these people crossed an ocean and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 845, 20, 82, 'came to India to demonstrate this type of Christianity. It would have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 845, 21, 82, 'been far better had they stayed where they were and never came and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 845, 22, 82, 'polluted this land with the corrupt version of Christianity that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 845, 23, 82, 'manifest. Occasionally, there have been a few really godly missionaries');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 845, 24, 82, 'in India, who were sent by God and who came under the authority of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 845, 25, 82, 'Christ, but they are few and far between. The folks who come nowadays on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 845, 26, 82, 'so-called “mission trips” for two weeks are not missionaries. They’re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 845, 27, 82, 'tourists. The real servants of God are those who have gone on the basis');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 845, 28, 82, 'of Christ’s authority. In other words, they submitted to Christ’s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 846, 1, 82, 'authority, and Christ sent them. Then they didn''t have to send reports');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 846, 2, 82, 'and beg for money and compare whether they''re getting more converts or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 846, 3, 82, 'the other missionary is getting more converts - this is the type of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 846, 4, 82, 'trash I have seen among some missionaries. No. Real servants go under');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 846, 5, 82, 'Christ’s authority. Anyone who''s serving the Lord today and seeking to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 846, 6, 82, 'make disciples needs to ask himself, “Did I go because there was a need,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 846, 7, 82, 'or did I go because of Christ’s authority?” But people say, “But didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 846, 8, 82, 'Jesus say to ‘lift up your eyes and look at the harvest? The harvest is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 846, 9, 82, 'plentiful. The fields are white unto harvest’?” That''s right. Let''s look');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 846, 10, 82, 'at John 4:35; “Do you not say, ‘There are yet four months, and then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 846, 11, 82, 'comes the harvest’? I say, lift up your eyes, and look on the fields;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 846, 12, 82, 'they are white for harvest.” So what should you do? Follow Jesus, who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 846, 13, 82, 'said in verse 34, the previous verse: My meat is not to meet the need;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 846, 14, 82, 'My meat is to do the will of Him who sent Me and to finish His work. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 846, 15, 82, 'didn''t say, “I''m seeing the need and I am going to rush out and do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 846, 16, 82, 'something.” No. The fields are white unto harvest, but how do you know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 846, 17, 82, 'where you''re supposed to go? “My food is to do the will of Him who sent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 846, 18, 82, 'Me and to finish His work.” We have to take both of those verses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 846, 19, 82, 'together.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 846, 20, 82, 'The other passage a lot of people quote is in Matthew 9:37, which says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 846, 21, 82, '“The harvest is plentiful, but the workers are few.” What comes next?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 846, 22, 82, '“Therefore go”? No. He said, “Therefore pray.” There is so much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 846, 23, 82, 'misquoting of Scripture by people, and people volunteer to go out for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 846, 24, 82, 'missionary work, because they are ignorant of Scriptures. If you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 846, 25, 82, 'read the Bible, you deserve to be deceived. So many people have gone and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 846, 26, 82, 'made a mess of their lives, because they went out without God sending');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 846, 27, 82, 'them. Why should you go? All authority in heaven and earth, Jesus says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 846, 28, 82, 'is given to Him; therefore go. Those who have gone on that basis');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 847, 1, 82, 'accomplish more than a thousand people who go out to meet a need, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 847, 2, 82, 'they don''t end their lives as nervous wrecks or with frustration or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 847, 3, 82, 'grumbling or complaining. They complete their course with joy. The fruit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 847, 4, 82, 'of their life is sanctification, becoming more like Christ at the end of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 847, 5, 82, 'their ministry. They''re excited. That is how it should be and that''s how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 847, 6, 82, 'it has been. I have been in full-time Christian work for 46 years, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 847, 7, 82, 'I’ll tell you my life is more exciting today than it was 46 years ago. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 847, 8, 82, 'have understood more about victory over sin and walking with God today');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 847, 9, 82, 'than before. It''s exciting, it''s wonderful, and I''m healthier today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 847, 10, 82, 'It''s wonderful to serve God, but only if God has sent you. That''s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 847, 11, 82, 'important thing. “All authority in heaven and earth is given to Me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 847, 12, 82, 'Therefore go and make disciples.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 847, 13, 82, 'Emphasize Both Sides of Our Commission');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 847, 14, 82, 'There are two sides to this Great Commission. I want to show you the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 847, 15, 82, 'other side first, because that''s the first step. In Mark 16:15 Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 847, 16, 82, 'says, “Go into all the world and preach the gospel to all creation. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 847, 17, 82, 'who has believed and has been baptized shall be saved, but he who has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 847, 18, 82, 'disbelieved shall be condemned.” What Jesus said to do initially is, “Go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 847, 19, 82, 'into the whole world, preach the gospel to all creation, and those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 847, 20, 82, 'believe and are baptized will be saved. Those who don''t believe (baptism');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 847, 21, 82, 'is not mentioned there) will be condemned.” It doesn''t say, “Those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 847, 22, 82, 'are not baptized will be condemned.” It’s those who don’t believe who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 847, 23, 82, 'will be condemned. Connected with this type of evangelism are signs and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 847, 24, 82, 'wonders. Wherever people go and do frontier evangelism like in the Acts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 847, 25, 82, 'of the Apostles or even today, they see these signs and wonders');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 847, 26, 82, 'happening even today. All these twenty centuries it has happened,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 847, 27, 82, 'because that''s the way the Lord confirms the gospel, with casting out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 847, 28, 82, 'demons, speaking with new tongues, the sick being healed, et cetera. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 848, 1, 82, 'all happened then and it''s happening today. It says the Lord worked with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 848, 2, 82, 'them, confirming the word by the signs that followed (v20).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 848, 3, 82, 'This is connected with evangelism. I would never dream of going out to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 848, 4, 82, 'preach the gospel in a completely virgin area if I did not believe that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 848, 5, 82, 'Jesus could heal the sick and cast out demons. I wouldn''t dream of doing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 848, 6, 82, 'it. How could I tell those people, who have never heard of Jesus or read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 848, 7, 82, 'a Bible, that this baby born in Israel 2000 years ago was killed and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 848, 8, 82, 'raised up and is alive today? How can I prove it to them? They''ll think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 848, 9, 82, 'it''s a fairy tale. The only way I can prove it is by saying, “Bring your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 848, 10, 82, 'sick and your demon possessed, and I will prove to you that Jesus is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 848, 11, 82, 'alive.” Yes, it''s true. It happens even today, and everyone who goes out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 848, 12, 82, 'to preach the gospel in new areas must believe this.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 848, 13, 82, 'But the Great Commission doesn''t stop there. Once these people have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 848, 14, 82, 'believed because they''ve seen Christ healing the sick and casting out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 848, 15, 82, 'demons, they receive Christ as their Savior and their sins are forgiven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 848, 16, 82, 'Then what do you do? Many, many preachers just leave it at that and say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 848, 17, 82, '“Let''s get another person to that place,” and then they have a bunch of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 848, 18, 82, 'babies, spiritual babies. They’re all born again but nobody''s growing up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 848, 19, 82, 'to maturity. Ultimately this pastor has hundreds of babies lying there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 848, 20, 82, 'with feeding bottles in their mouths. They live like that for 20-30');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 848, 21, 82, 'years. Babies, not growing up, just like the church in Corinth. Paul');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 848, 22, 82, 'told the church in Corinth, “I can’t preach anything to you except that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 848, 23, 82, 'Jesus Christ has been crucified. That means your sins can be forgiven,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 848, 24, 82, 'because you are babies.” And what is the reason? Because they were not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 848, 25, 82, 'made into disciples. Paul couldn''t stay in Corinth all the time. If he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 848, 26, 82, 'did, like he stayed in Ephesus for three years, he would have made them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 848, 27, 82, 'into disciples. In Ephesus, he made disciples.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 848, 28, 82, 'So the other part of the Great Commission, once you’ve led people into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 849, 1, 82, 'this type of faith in Christ - to receive the Spirit and receive Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 849, 2, 82, 'by His Spirit into their heart - is to make them into disciples. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 849, 3, 82, 'the second part the Great Commission. “Go and make disciples in all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 849, 4, 82, 'nations, baptizing them in the name of the Father, Son and the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 849, 5, 82, 'Spirit” (Matthew 28:19). In other words, before you baptize them, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 849, 6, 82, 'have to tell them, “Listen. You are not just going into heaven when you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 849, 7, 82, 'die. That''s not what you’re converted for. You’ve got to be a disciple.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 849, 8, 82, 'That means you’ve got to learn from Jesus and follow Him. He''s your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 849, 9, 82, 'Leader. He is there up in front. He''s already gone ahead of you. He came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 849, 10, 82, 'to earth as a Man, lived on earth as a Man, overcame sin, served the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 849, 11, 82, 'Father, and overcame the devil. He says, “In Me, you will have peace. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 849, 12, 82, 'the world you’ll have tribulation,” and “Come, follow Me. Deny yourself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 849, 13, 82, 'and follow Me.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 849, 14, 82, 'Begin With Obedience');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 849, 15, 82, 'We have to make the claims of discipleship clear to them right at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 849, 16, 82, 'beginning, just like Jesus did with the rich young ruler. There are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 849, 17, 82, 'three primary conditions of discipleship that are stated in Luke 14 in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 849, 18, 82, 'simple words. Verse 26 says to love Jesus more than father, mother,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 849, 19, 82, 'wife, children, brothers, sisters, and your own life. Once a person has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 849, 20, 82, 'received Christ as his Savior, he must be taught to love Jesus Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 849, 21, 82, 'more than he loves his father, more than he loves his mother, more than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 849, 22, 82, 'he loves his brothers and sisters and family members, and even other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 849, 23, 82, 'brothers and sisters in the church. Then secondly, he must be told to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 849, 24, 82, 'deny himself and take up the cross (verse 27). That relates to hating');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 849, 25, 82, 'his own life. That means he is denying his self-life. That means he''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 849, 26, 82, 'not going to seek his reputation and his honor and his will. Otherwise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 849, 27, 82, 'he can''t be a disciple. Jesus said it so clearly in verse 27. And then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 849, 28, 82, 'the third condition is in Luke 14:33: he must be taught to love Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 850, 1, 82, 'more than all his earthly possessions.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 850, 2, 82, 'Basically, discipleship is loving Jesus more than one''s relatives and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 850, 3, 82, 'fellow believers, loving Jesus more than one’s own will, reputation, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 850, 4, 82, 'life, and loving Jesus more than one’s possessions. Discipleship is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 850, 5, 82, 'loving Jesus supremely. It’s loving God with all your heart, soul,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 850, 6, 82, 'strength, and mind. That is where we have to lead people, and show them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 850, 7, 82, 'as they get light, they must seek to love Him more than everything else.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 850, 8, 82, 'It''s a willingness that God seeks first, and if there''s a willingness,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 850, 9, 82, 'gradually it will become real in area by area of their life. As they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 850, 10, 82, 'open every area, they''ll be filled with the Holy Spirit. We must present');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 850, 11, 82, 'this to them and then tell them that they have to be baptized. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 850, 12, 82, 'command is very clear to be baptized in the name of the Father and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 850, 13, 82, 'Son and the Holy Spirit. We have to tell them that God is a Trinity, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 850, 14, 82, 'they must be baptized in the name of the Father, Son, and the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 850, 15, 82, 'Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 850, 16, 82, 'Some people have a question: “Why does it say in Acts 2:38 to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 850, 17, 82, 'baptized in the name of Jesus Christ?” Again and again in the Acts of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 850, 18, 82, 'the Apostles, it says they were baptized in the name of Jesus Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 850, 19, 82, 'When you see two Scriptures that apparently contradict each other, both');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 850, 20, 82, 'are true. They don''t contradict each other. I''ll tell you how I baptize');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 850, 21, 82, 'people. I baptize in a way that both this command and that history is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 850, 22, 82, 'fulfilled. If there is a conflict between command and history, we follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 850, 23, 82, 'the command, because the history in the Acts of the Apostles also tells');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 850, 24, 82, 'us lot of wrong things that the apostles did, such as Paul shaving his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 850, 25, 82, 'head, circumcising Timothy, et cetera. The command is always clear. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 850, 26, 82, 'there''s a command of Jesus that seems to contradict a practice of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 850, 27, 82, 'apostles, I have absolutely no doubt in my mind which I should obey -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 850, 28, 82, 'the command of Jesus. I won’t shave my head or circumcise somebody today');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 851, 1, 82, 'just like Paul did or shout at the high priests like Paul did. Those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 851, 2, 82, 'examples are all written in the Acts of the Apostles. But there''s no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 851, 3, 82, 'contradiction here. The heathen have a trinity too. Hinduism has its');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 851, 4, 82, 'trinity and the Egyptians have their trinity. So if you just baptize in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 851, 5, 82, 'the name of the Father, Son and Holy Spirit, that person in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 851, 6, 82, 'non-Christian religion will say, “That''s fine. That''s my Hindu trinity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 851, 7, 82, 'in whose name I was baptized - Father, Son and Holy Spirit.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 851, 8, 82, 'We have to identify the Son as Jesus Christ. When I baptize people, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 851, 9, 82, 'baptize them like this: “I baptize you in the name of the Father and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 851, 10, 82, 'Son, the Lord Jesus Christ, and the Holy Spirit. I identify that this is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 851, 11, 82, 'a Christian Trinity and not one of those heathen trinities. I baptize');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 851, 12, 82, 'them in the name of Jesus Christ. That is the meaning of Acts 2:38. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 851, 13, 82, 'does not disobey the command of Matthew 28:19. If people would only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 851, 14, 82, 'humble themselves and recognize that the Bible is God''s Word and there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 851, 15, 82, 'is no contradiction in it, these things are all settled very easily. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 851, 16, 82, 'people who use their clever brains go astray, and they deserve to go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 851, 17, 82, 'astray. People who humble themselves and come to the Holy Spirit, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 851, 18, 82, 'Spirit of God shows them the truth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 851, 19, 82, 'Treasure Opportunities to Obey God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 851, 20, 82, 'Once we baptize people, what is our responsibility for the rest of their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 851, 21, 82, 'lives? Do we have nothing to do? No. Jesus said, “You must then teach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 851, 22, 82, 'them to observe - to obey or to do - every single thing that I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 851, 23, 82, 'commanded you” (Matthew 28:20). And that''s what we have studied in these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 851, 24, 82, '80 chapters - everything that Jesus commanded. There are many other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 851, 25, 82, 'things also in some of the other gospels that we didn''t cover in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 851, 26, 82, 'Matthew''s Gospel, but our goal should be to see what Jesus commanded.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 851, 27, 82, 'That''s why it''s so important to read and study the Scriptures. You can''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 851, 28, 82, 'know what Jesus commanded if you don''t read and study the Scriptures.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 852, 1, 82, 'This is the only book that God has ever given to man, and so we should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 852, 2, 82, 'try to understand it and read it and find out the things God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 852, 3, 82, 'commanded. If you really love Jesus, the Bible says you’ll keep all His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 852, 4, 82, 'commandments. When I say, “Lord I love you with all my heart,” then the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 852, 5, 82, 'Lord says, “Keep all My commandments.” Then I pray a little prayer. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 852, 6, 82, 'say, “Lord, before I leave this earth I want to obey every single');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 852, 7, 82, 'commandment that you have given for Christians. Not the ones you gave to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 852, 8, 82, 'Israel like keeping the Sabbath and killing lambs and circumcision and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 852, 9, 82, 'paying tithes and all that. Those are for Israel. But the things you''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 852, 10, 82, 'given for Christians, every command in the Bible that is given for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 852, 11, 82, 'Christians, I want to obey every single one of them before I leave this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 852, 12, 82, 'earth. That''s how I prove that I love you with all My heart, soul, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 852, 13, 82, 'strength.” Which other way can we prove it?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 852, 14, 82, 'I would encourage you to pray that prayer. Do you want to leave this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 852, 15, 82, 'earth with some commands of Jesus unfinished? For example, Jesus says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 852, 16, 82, '“Love your enemies.” That''s why God gives you enemies - so that you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 852, 17, 82, 'love them and keep the commandment. He said, “Bless those who curse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 852, 18, 82, 'you.” That''s why God allows some people to curse you - so that you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 852, 19, 82, 'bless them. Otherwise how will you keep that commandment? I thank God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 852, 20, 82, 'for every person who thinks I''m his enemy or hates me, because I can do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 852, 21, 82, 'good to them. Those who curse me, I can bless them. They all give me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 852, 22, 82, 'opportunities to obey Jesus’ commandments. “Greet those who don''t greet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 852, 23, 82, 'you.” What an opportunity to obey a commandment, when you meet somebody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 852, 24, 82, 'who does not want to greet you, who doesn’t like your face. There are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 852, 25, 82, 'wonderful opportunities we get throughout our life to obey Jesus’');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 852, 26, 82, 'commandments, to prove that we love Him. Many people say they love Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 852, 27, 82, 'on Sunday morning when they sing the songs. They don''t really love Him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 852, 28, 82, 'because they''re not interested in keeping His commandments. They''re not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 853, 1, 82, 'even interested in finding out all that Jesus has commanded, and it says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 853, 2, 82, 'here, not only we must do them, we must “teach others to do them.” Not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 853, 3, 82, 'teach people them, but teach them to do it. Do you know the difference');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 853, 4, 82, 'between teaching people swimming and teaching people actually to swim?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 853, 5, 82, 'You can explain swimming on a blackboard - explain how to move your legs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 853, 6, 82, 'and how to breathe. You can get a class of young people and explain on a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 853, 7, 82, 'blackboard, move your legs like this and breathe like this, and then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 853, 8, 82, 'say, “Go and jump in the river!” They will all drown, because you can''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 853, 9, 82, 'teach swimming on a blackboard. You have to get into the river and say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 853, 10, 82, '“See what I''m doing folks! See how I move my hands. See how I lift my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 853, 11, 82, 'head. See how I breathe. Follow me!”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 853, 12, 82, 'That''s the way to teach people to follow Jesus Christ. Not by preaching,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 853, 13, 82, 'but by living and demonstrating. That''s why Paul said, “Follow me, as I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 853, 14, 82, 'follow Christ.” The great lack today is preachers who can say that. Dear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 853, 15, 82, 'friends, that''s the greatest need. We need to belong to a church that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 853, 16, 82, 'teaches people to do every single thing that Jesus commanded. That''s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 853, 17, 82, 'type of church I want to be in. Not just a church that has good music');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 853, 18, 82, 'and good preaching, but one that will help me obey the commandments.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 853, 19, 82, 'Treasure God’s Promises');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 853, 20, 82, 'We also need to keep and claim the promises of the Bible. The second');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 853, 21, 82, 'prayer we must pray is, “Lord, there so many promises for Christians in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 853, 22, 82, 'the Bible. I want to claim every one of them.” The promises in the Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 853, 23, 82, 'are like checks. If somebody sends me ten checks, I don''t want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 853, 24, 82, 'deposit only five of them in the bank. I want to deposit all ten,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 853, 25, 82, 'because they''re meant to make me rich. If there are 1000 promises in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 853, 26, 82, 'Bible for Christians, I want to claim all 1000 of them, not 500 of them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 853, 27, 82, 'Not even 900 of them. I want to claim all 1000 promises that I can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 853, 28, 82, 'claim. They’re like checks for me that''ll make me spiritually rich.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 854, 1, 82, 'This is what it means to obey the commandments, claim the promises, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 854, 2, 82, 'seek to be filled with the Holy Spirit. If we live like this, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 854, 3, 82, 'promise for us is, “Lo, I am with you always, even to the end of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 854, 4, 82, 'age” (v20). The promise of the Lord''s presence with us is what we must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 854, 5, 82, 'long for. “Lord, I want your presence with me every single moment of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 854, 6, 82, 'every single day.” I seek to have His presence with me when I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 854, 7, 82, 'preaching, wherever I go, or when I’m facing a trial. What do you need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 854, 8, 82, 'the presence of Jesus for? When you face a difficulty or when you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 854, 9, 82, 'tempted, you need the presence of Jesus. That''s what will strengthen you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 854, 10, 82, 'and drive temptation away. What a promise! “Lo, I''m with you always.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 854, 11, 82, 'Keep a good conscience, therefore, my friend. Seek to obey the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 854, 12, 82, 'commandments, and as you seek to obey, you’ll find it not so easy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 854, 13, 82, 'That''s where John 14:15-17 come to help us. “If you love Me, keep My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 854, 14, 82, 'commandments.” The Lord is saying, “Because I know it is difficult to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 854, 15, 82, 'keep the commandments, therefore I will ask the Father to give you a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 854, 16, 82, 'Helper to keep the commandments. Another helper, just like Me, Who will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 854, 17, 82, 'help you to keep the commandments. He''ll be with you forever and that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 854, 18, 82, 'the Spirit of truth, the Holy Spirit.”');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 854, 19, 82, 'The most important thing you need is to be filled with the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 854, 20, 82, 'of God. When you were born again, if you received Christ as your Savior');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 854, 21, 82, 'and repented of your sin, Christ came into your heart through His Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 854, 22, 82, 'Spirit. His Holy Spirit came in and you were born again, but that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 854, 23, 82, 'doesn''t mean you''re filled with the Holy Spirit. Your heart could be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 854, 24, 82, 'like a house with ten rooms. There is light in one room where all your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 854, 25, 82, 'sins are cleansed away. The room of guilt is clean and full of light,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 854, 26, 82, 'but there are other rooms - your television room, your finances room,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 854, 27, 82, 'your library, and other areas in your heart where you may not have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 854, 28, 82, 'allowed Jesus to come and flood with light and drive away the things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 855, 1, 82, 'that displease Him. If you watch movies that Christ is not happy with,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 855, 2, 82, 'you can’t say that that area of your life is yielded to Christ. Not at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 855, 3, 82, 'all. I''m not here to tell you which movies you should watch, but make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 855, 4, 82, 'sure that Jesus is with you while you''re watching them, and that you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 855, 5, 82, 'not watching stuff which Christ Himself would not want to watch. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 855, 6, 82, 'do, then at that moment, Christ is not with you. What’s the use of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 855, 7, 82, 'saying, “Christ is with me,” and quoting, “Lo, I am always with you,” if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 855, 8, 82, 'you don’t open every room? He is not always with you. If you open your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 855, 9, 82, 'heart to receive Him and make Him Lord of your life and say, “Lord, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 855, 10, 82, 'want every area of my life to be filled with light,” then why do we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 855, 11, 82, 'to live in darkness?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 855, 12, 82, 'I hope, dear friends, that these 80 studies have helped you understand a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 855, 13, 82, 'little more of what it means to be a true disciple of Jesus, and what it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 855, 14, 82, 'means to understand and to teach others to obey all that Jesus commanded');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 855, 15, 82, 'us. Remember again, in conclusion, that it''s not a question of how much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 855, 16, 82, 'we understand. To whom more is given, more is required. Now that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 855, 17, 82, 'know so much, your responsibility has increased. It is not enough to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 855, 18, 82, 'excited about it and say, “Wow. That is a wonderful message. I got so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 855, 19, 82, 'challenged by it.” Very often, people who say that, it is like a pep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 855, 20, 82, 'talk for them. They get temporarily stirred. If you want to endure, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 855, 21, 82, 'need power. Just like electric power can keep up a fan running forever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 855, 22, 82, 'and ever, the power of the Holy Spirit within is what you need to seek.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 855, 23, 82, 'The greatest gift God has given us in this day, after the forgiveness of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 855, 24, 82, 'sins, is the fullness of Holy Spirit of God Almighty. The third person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 855, 25, 82, 'of the Trinity coming and living within us and filling us. Next, seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 855, 26, 82, 'for fellowship with other like-minded people in a church that preaches');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 855, 27, 82, 'these truths. Then you can grow in grace, becoming more and more like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 855, 28, 82, 'Christ as time goes on.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 856, 1, 82, 'God bless you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 856, 2, 82, 'Share');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 856, 3, 82, 'Who Am I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 856, 4, 82, 'Our Message');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 856, 5, 82, 'Resources');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 856, 6, 82, 'Study Series');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 856, 7, 82, 'About us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('all_that_jesus_taught', 856, 8, 82, 'CHRISTIAN FELLOWSHIP CHURCH');
