INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 1, 1, 1, 'Chapter Introduction');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 1, 2, 1, 'First of all, we want to see the theme of this book, which we can say is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 1, 3, 1, 'found in Proverbs 9:10 - "The fear of the Lord is the beginning of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 1, 4, 1, 'wisdom, and the knowledge of the Holy One is understanding." There are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 1, 5, 1, 'three words found here: wisdom, knowledge, and understanding. These');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 1, 6, 1, 'three words are found very frequently in the book of Proverbs and are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 1, 7, 1, 'basically all interconnected. These three words are found together in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 1, 8, 1, 'the New Testament as well in Colossians 1:9 which says, "...we have not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 1, 9, 1, 'ceased to pray for you, asking that you may be filled with the knowledge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 1, 10, 1, 'of his will in all spiritual wisdom and understanding." We can say that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 1, 11, 1, 'wisdom means to act and to speak in a divine way - in the way God would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 1, 12, 1, 'act and speak and the way God wants us to act and speak. Knowledge is to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 1, 13, 1, 'know God, which is eternal life. John 17:3 says, "This is life eternal,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 1, 14, 1, 'that they may know Thee, the only true God, and Jesus Christ, whom Thou');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 1, 15, 1, 'hast sent." In a sense, we can say that the book of Proverbs is a New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 1, 16, 1, 'Covenant book in the Old Testament, because there''s a lot in this book');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 1, 17, 1, 'that relates to us in the New Covenant as we will see as we go on. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 1, 18, 1, 'book of Proverbs has a number of things to say about fools. Jesus spoke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 1, 19, 1, 'about the foolish man in a number of places. And the book of Proverbs,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 1, 20, 1, 'more than any other book in the Old Testament, speaks about fools. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 1, 21, 1, 'fact, throughout this book, it says sixty-six things about fools. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 1, 22, 1, 'also says twenty-eight things about lazy people or sluggards. Sluggards');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 1, 23, 1, 'are those who are not wholehearted and spiritually lazy. If we keep just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 1, 24, 1, 'these two things in mind, we find that Proverbs speaks about those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 1, 25, 1, 'are not wholehearted and those who are not wise. And when we look at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 1, 26, 1, 'Psalms and Proverbs, which are side by side in the Old Testament, we see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 1, 27, 1, 'that the Psalms are mainly about man communing with God through prayer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 1, 28, 1, 'or praise or Old Testament worship, but the Proverbs are dealing more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 2, 1, 1, 'with how we are to behave in relation to our fellow man. Two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 2, 2, 1, 'commandments that Jesus gave are that we are to love God with all our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 2, 3, 1, 'hearts and love our neighbor as ourselves. These two commandments are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 2, 4, 1, 'brought together in the book of Psalms and Proverbs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 2, 5, 1, 'Unless otherwise noted, verses are from the New American Standard Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 2, 6, 1, '(NASB). I frequently refer to verses in the Good News Translation (GNT)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 2, 7, 1, 'and The Living Bible (TLB) translations. Particularly for the book of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 2, 8, 1, 'Proverbs, I recommend using these two translations. They really bring');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 2, 9, 1, 'out the meaning of some verses.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 2, 10, 2, 'Chapter 1 Chapter 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 2, 11, 2, 'The proverbs of Solomon the son of David, king of Israel:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 2, 12, 2, 'To know wisdom and instruction,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 2, 13, 2, 'To discern the sayings of understanding,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 2, 14, 2, 'To receive instruction in wise behavior,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 2, 15, 2, 'Righteousness, justice, and integrity;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 2, 16, 2, 'Prov 1:1-3');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 2, 17, 2, 'To the best of our knowledge, Solomon wrote twenty-nine chapters in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 2, 18, 2, 'book of Proverbs with the last two chapters being written by someone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 2, 19, 2, 'else. This is the purpose of Proverbs: to receive instruction in wise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 2, 20, 2, 'behavior. To have wisdom is to behave in a godly, divine way; to speak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 2, 21, 2, 'to people in a godly, divine way; to write to people in a godly, divine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 2, 22, 2, 'way. We don''t have these things in us, because nothing good dwells in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 2, 23, 2, 'our flesh. But God''s will and purpose is that increasingly we learn to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 2, 24, 2, 'speak, behave and conduct ourselves in a godly way - in the same way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 2, 25, 2, 'that God would act and speak - and to deal with other people in a divine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 2, 26, 2, 'way. The sad thing is when many years go by in our life, and we still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 2, 27, 2, 'speak in a human way. Very often you still find that husbands and wives,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 2, 28, 2, 'even after ten or fifteen years of hearing these truths, still speak in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 3, 1, 2, 'such an Adamic way to each other. Then we know that they don''t really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 3, 2, 2, 'have any wisdom at all. When people speak to one another in such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 3, 3, 2, 'human, Adamic way, then you know that they really need to go into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 3, 4, 2, 'book of Proverbs and cry out for wisdom, because they don''t have it. So,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 3, 5, 2, 'the purpose of Proverbs is to receive instruction in wise behavior.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 3, 6, 2, 'They can teach you how to live intelligently and how to be honest, just,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 3, 7, 2, 'and fair.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 3, 8, 2, 'Prov 1:3, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 3, 9, 2, 'Righteousness, justice, and equity speak of being honest, just, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 3, 10, 2, 'fair. That is divine, wise behavior.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 3, 11, 2, 'To give prudence to the naive,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 3, 12, 2, 'To the youth knowledge and discretion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 3, 13, 2, 'Prov 1:4');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 3, 14, 2, 'The simple person is the one who is inexperienced and particularly the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 3, 15, 2, 'one who is open to every influence. Somebody says one thing, and he''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 3, 16, 2, 'influenced by that. Tomorrow, somebody says something else, and he''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 3, 17, 2, 'influenced by that. That''s how most young people are. They are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 3, 18, 2, 'influenced so much by what they read in the newspapers, what their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 3, 19, 2, 'friends say, or what their relatives say. That is a simple person. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 3, 20, 2, 'read about that type of person in Ephesians 4:14, where it speaks of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 3, 21, 2, 'children tossed about with every wind of doctrine. They are never sure,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 3, 22, 2, 'never stable. It says here that this book has been written to give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 3, 23, 2, 'prudence and wisdom to that simple-minded, unstable, unsteady person, so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 3, 24, 2, 'that he can be stable, steady, and mature. Therefore, the book of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 3, 25, 2, 'Proverbs has been particularly written for young people. It says in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 3, 26, 2, 'latter part of verse 4, "to the youth..." Here is a book written');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 3, 27, 2, 'particularly for young people, to give them knowledge and discretion,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 3, 28, 2, 'and wisdom in dealing with situations and people - particularly, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 4, 1, 2, 'opposite sex. We find tremendous stupidity among young people in many of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 4, 2, 2, 'these areas, which they themselves don''t realize. If they take the book');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 4, 3, 2, 'of Proverbs seriously, they can become wise, even while they are young.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 4, 4, 2, 'They don''t have to wait until they are fifty to become wise. There are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 4, 5, 2, 'many people who are seventy who are still quite foolish and simple;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 4, 6, 2, 'simple in a bad sense - in the sense that they have no steadiness in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 4, 7, 2, 'their life. They haven''t acquired wisdom even though they are seventy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 4, 8, 2, 'years old. And yet, a person who is twenty to twenty-five can be wise if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 4, 9, 2, 'he takes the instructions of this book seriously.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 4, 10, 2, 'A wise man will hear and increase in learning,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 4, 11, 2, 'And a man of understanding will acquire wise counsel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 4, 12, 2, 'Prov 1:5');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 4, 13, 2, 'This verse tells us that this book is not only for simple people. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 4, 14, 2, 'also for wise people - people who already have a certain amount of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 4, 15, 2, 'wisdom. They will hear and they will increase in learning. One mark of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 4, 16, 2, 'wise man is that he is teachable; he has an ear that is willing to hear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 4, 17, 2, 'and willing to be taught. Therefore, he can acquire even more wisdom. "A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 4, 18, 2, 'man of understanding will acquire wise counsel." In one translation, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 4, 19, 2, 'second part of this verse says that a man of understanding will get a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 4, 20, 2, 'steersman to steer his life. Wisdom will become like a man who steers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 4, 21, 2, 'the ship. A man of understanding has wisdom to steer his ship.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 4, 22, 2, 'To understand a proverb and a figure,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 4, 23, 2, 'The words of the wise and their riddles.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 4, 24, 2, 'Prov 1:6');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 4, 25, 2, 'Proverbs can give us understanding into the spiritual truths of God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 4, 26, 2, 'word. The first six verses outline the purpose that Solomon wrote this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 4, 27, 2, 'book. You remember that God asked Solomon, "What do you want?" (1 Kings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 4, 28, 2, '3:5). Solomon didn''t ask for wealth, he didn''t ask for honor, but he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 5, 1, 2, 'asked God for wisdom. And it says God was pleased with this request and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 5, 2, 2, 'gave it to him. Of course, the sad thing is that later Solomon drifted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 5, 3, 2, 'away, which teaches us that you can even write a book like Proverbs and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 5, 4, 2, 'still drift away if you''re not wholehearted. The life of Solomon is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 5, 5, 2, 'tremendous warning when we read the book of Proverbs, that even the man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 5, 6, 2, 'who wrote this fantastic book finally drifted away. We can preach to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 5, 7, 2, 'others and be disqualified ourselves if we don''t remain in humility and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 5, 8, 2, 'the fear of the Lord, which Solomon speaks so much about. It''s not just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 5, 9, 2, 'a question of understanding this book, but of living out this book all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 5, 10, 2, 'our days and enduring until the end. Here Solomon is a frightening');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 5, 11, 2, 'warning to all who think that they''re something, or think that they have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 5, 12, 2, 'come somewhere, or think that they have achieved something. We can even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 5, 13, 2, 'be used to write Scripture and bless thousands and still drift away if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 5, 14, 2, 'we don''t hold fast to the end!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 5, 15, 2, 'The fear of the Lord is the beginning of knowledge;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 5, 16, 2, 'Fools despise wisdom and instruction.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 5, 17, 2, 'Prov 1:7');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 5, 18, 2, 'This is the first Proverb. It is very significant that this is the first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 5, 19, 2, 'Proverb. When it says the beginning of knowledge, we can say this is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 5, 20, 2, 'referring to the foundation. Later on in Proverbs 9:10, it says, "The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 5, 21, 2, 'fear of the Lord is the beginning of wisdom." Knowledge and wisdom are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 5, 22, 2, 'really interconnected, because knowledge does not mean bible knowledge.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 5, 23, 2, 'It means the knowledge of God. When we read of knowledge, it doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 5, 24, 2, 'mean academic knowledge of the bible. Because the devil has that, and he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 5, 25, 2, 'doesn''t have the fear of the Lord. So it''s obvious that verse 7 is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 5, 26, 2, 'referring to bible knowledge. The knowledge spoken of here is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 5, 27, 2, 'knowledge of God! That''s quite different from bible knowledge. A lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 5, 28, 2, 'people who have bible knowledge have no knowledge of God. The fear of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 6, 1, 2, 'the Lord is the beginning of knowledge. "This is life eternal, that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 6, 2, 2, 'might know Thee, the only true God, and Jesus Christ whom Thou hast');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 6, 3, 2, 'sent" (John 17:3). To know more and more of what God is like. Paul said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 6, 4, 2, 'that was the great longing of his life: "...that I may know him..."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 6, 5, 2, '(Philippians 3:10). That is, he wanted to know God more and more and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 6, 6, 2, 'more and more. To know more and more of what God is like, how God looks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 6, 7, 2, 'at people, how God looks at circumstances, how God looks at things -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 6, 8, 2, 'then Paul could change his own mind to that way of thinking. That is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 6, 9, 2, 'knowledge spoken of here. And it says here that the first step to know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 6, 10, 2, 'God is to fear him; to have a reverence for him. To hate sin and to love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 6, 11, 2, 'righteousness. That is to fear God. And then we can know him better and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 6, 12, 2, 'better. That''s why it''s not a question of how much intelligence we have,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 6, 13, 2, 'but rather how much fear of God we have which determines how much we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 6, 14, 2, 'increase in spiritual knowledge and spiritual wisdom. So that''s right at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 6, 15, 2, 'the beginning - the foundation, the cornerstone, whatever you want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 6, 16, 2, 'call it - the fear of the Lord. It''s the starting line of the race. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 6, 17, 2, 'you don''t get there, you don''t get anywhere. We can also say that it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 6, 18, 2, 'the essence of all knowledge. The main part of all knowledge is the fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 6, 19, 2, 'of God, and the day I lose the fear of God, I can''t get any more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 6, 20, 2, 'understanding of God or wisdom. The way to increase in wisdom is to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 6, 21, 2, 'increase in the fear of God. The way to increase in the knowledge of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 6, 22, 2, 'is to increase in the fear of the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 6, 23, 2, 'We also understand from this verse who a fool is. When the bible speaks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 6, 24, 2, 'about a fool, it''s not speaking about someone who got fifteen percent in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 6, 25, 2, 'mathematics and ten percent in science. A person who got those scores');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 6, 26, 2, 'may still be wise according to the scriptures if they have the fear of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 6, 27, 2, 'God. When the bible speaks about a fool, it''s not speaking about someone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 6, 28, 2, 'who is bad in his studies. It''s speaking about someone who does not have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 7, 1, 2, 'the fear of the Lord - a person who can lust after women and not mourn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 7, 2, 2, 'over it, not weep over it. He''s a fool even if he gets ninety percent in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 7, 3, 2, 'math and science! He''s an absolute fool, and he''s the person about whom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 7, 4, 2, 'Solomon has written sixty-six things in the book of Proverbs. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 7, 5, 2, 'the type of person who doesn''t have any fear of God when it comes to sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 7, 6, 2, '- when it comes to telling lies or signing false statements or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 7, 7, 2, 'committing all types of other sins. The one who is not disturbed in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 7, 8, 2, 'heart about such things. Solomon has written sixty-six things about such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 7, 9, 2, 'fools. Fools are those who despise wisdom and instruction. They do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 7, 10, 2, 'have the understanding to look at things from God''s viewpoint. We can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 7, 11, 2, 'say that wisdom is to look at people and things and the whole world the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 7, 12, 2, 'way God looks at them. The more wisdom I have, the more I should look at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 7, 13, 2, 'people the way God looks at them - with tenderness, compassion, love and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 7, 14, 2, 'purity. If I can''t look at people with tenderness, compassion, love and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 7, 15, 2, 'purity, I''m not getting wisdom, however much I may be increasing in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 7, 16, 2, 'bible knowledge (which the devil has more of than me in any case).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 7, 17, 2, 'That''s where we need to see that the fool that the bible speaks of is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 7, 18, 2, 'the fool that does not fear God, who does not have a reverence for God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 7, 19, 2, 'in his life, who does not hate sin, and who does not love righteousness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 7, 20, 2, 'So that''s the first thing: to fear God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 7, 21, 2, 'Hear, my son, your father''s instruction');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 7, 22, 2, 'And do not forsake your mother''s teaching;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 7, 23, 2, 'Indeed, they are a graceful wreath to your head');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 7, 24, 2, 'And ornaments about your neck.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 7, 25, 2, 'Prov 1:8-9');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 7, 26, 2, 'Once we have the foundation of the fear of God laid, Solomon begins his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 7, 27, 2, 'instruction in the home of a child with its father and mother. Notice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 7, 28, 2, 'how Proverbs links that together. Verse 7 is about the fear of the Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 8, 1, 2, 'and verse 8 is about honoring your father and mother. I''ll tell you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 8, 2, 2, 'something I''ve seen through the short years of my life: those who never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 8, 3, 2, 'learned to sincerely, wholeheartedly honor their earthly father and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 8, 4, 2, 'mother never, never, never acquire wisdom. Even though they may increase');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 8, 5, 2, 'fantastically in bible knowledge, they never become wise. I''ve seen that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 8, 6, 2, 'again and again and again and again. The first commandment with a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 8, 7, 2, 'promise was to honor your father and mother (Ephesians 6:2). That''s why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 8, 8, 2, 'if we want children to grow up into the wisdom of the book of Proverbs,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 8, 9, 2, 'we have to first teach them to obey their parents. It''s no use sending');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 8, 10, 2, 'your children to school if they haven''t learned to obey daddy and mommy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 8, 11, 2, 'at home. It''s an absolute waste of time. You haven''t given them the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 8, 12, 2, 'education they need first of all. That''s what we need to tell our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 8, 13, 2, 'children: "Hear, my little son, listen to what your father tells you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 8, 14, 2, 'Listen to what your mother is telling you." That''s where we have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 8, 15, 2, 'begin. And that''s where all wisdom begins with that little child at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 8, 16, 2, 'home. If it begins like that, as they grow up, this can promote them to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 8, 17, 2, 'honor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 8, 18, 2, 'Notice in verse 9 this word "grace" comes. A wreath of grace to your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 8, 19, 2, 'head. It''s very interesting to see. I mentioned that the book of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 8, 20, 2, 'Proverbs is like a New Covenant book in the Old Testament. The word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 8, 21, 2, '"grace" comes a number of times in the book of Proverbs. It also comes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 8, 22, 2, 'in Zechariah 12:10, where it says, "I will pour out upon them a spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 8, 23, 2, 'of grace..." And in that New Testament sense, we can say it is found');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 8, 24, 2, 'mostly only in Proverbs and Zechariah. Consider, for example, Proverbs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 8, 25, 2, '3:34, which Peter and James quote - "God resists the proud but gives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 8, 26, 2, 'grace to the humble." That was written by Solomon in the Old Testament');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 8, 27, 2, 'long before Peter and James wrote it in the New Testament. In fact,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 8, 28, 2, 'Peter and James quoted from Solomon in the Old Testament. "He scoffs at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 9, 1, 2, 'the scoffers but gives grace to the afflicted." That means he resists');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 9, 2, 2, 'the proud and gives grace to the humble. And so, we find this word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 9, 3, 2, '"grace" coming in the book of Proverbs. And that''s why this is a book we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 9, 4, 2, 'need to study carefully, those of us who have come into the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 9, 5, 2, 'Covenant.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 9, 6, 2, 'We need to pay attention when Solomon says "my son" in Proverbs 1:10,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 9, 7, 2, '1:15, 2:1, 3:1, etc. He''s speaking to someone who is willing to submit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 9, 8, 2, 'to him as a father. He''s not speaking to people who have not understood');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 9, 9, 2, 'the principle of submission. If we have not understood the principle of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 9, 10, 2, 'submission as a child to our earthly parents and in the church to those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 9, 11, 2, 'who are spiritually like fathers to us, we''ll never get wisdom. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 9, 12, 2, 'written to those who are able to hear an exhortation which says, "my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 9, 13, 2, 'son". Can you listen to that? Not when God says it, but when a man whom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 9, 14, 2, 'God has appointed over you says it; at home - an earthly father or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 9, 15, 2, 'mother; in the church - those who are above us in the Lord. That''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 9, 16, 2, 'very important principle. I''ve come to see as of late how so much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 9, 17, 2, 'revolves around this principle of submission to authority, and how God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 9, 18, 2, 'would do ALMOST ANYTHING for a man or woman who has understood that one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 9, 19, 2, 'principle. God will do ALMOST ANYTHING for a child who has learned to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 9, 20, 2, 'submit to his parents or a wife who has learned to submit to her husband');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 9, 21, 2, 'or a person who has learned to submit to spiritual leadership in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 9, 22, 2, 'church. ALMOST ANYTHING. That''s a fundamental principle. That''s why the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 9, 23, 2, 'devil always tries to move us out from that place of submission, so that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 9, 24, 2, 'God can do ALMOST NOTHING for us. And we also deprive ourselves of God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 9, 25, 2, 'blessing, because God gives grace to the humble. And the humble are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 9, 26, 2, 'those who have learned submission to authority.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 9, 27, 2, 'My son, if sinners entice you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 9, 28, 2, 'Do not consent.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 10, 1, 2, 'If they say, "Come with us,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 10, 2, 2, 'Let us lie in wait for blood,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 10, 3, 2, 'Let us ambush the innocent without cause;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 10, 4, 2, 'Let us swallow them alive like Sheol,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 10, 5, 2, 'Even whole, as those who go down to the pit;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 10, 6, 2, 'We will find all kinds of precious wealth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 10, 7, 2, 'We will fill our houses with spoil; Throw in your lot with us,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 10, 8, 2, 'We shall all have one purse,"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 10, 9, 2, 'Prov 1:10-14');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 10, 10, 2, 'If the first place we have to learn wisdom is the home (verses 8-9),');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 10, 11, 2, 'then the second place where we have to be careful is with our friends');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 10, 12, 2, '(verses 10-19). Verses 8-9 are referring to the child at home, and verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 10, 13, 2, '10 is referring to the young man who has now gone to school and is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 10, 14, 2, 'growing up around other companions of his who are enticing him and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 10, 15, 2, 'inviting him to sin. Just like it says that the lusts of the flesh');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 10, 16, 2, 'entice us, here are friends enticing this young man to sin. Sinners.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 10, 17, 2, 'Sinners are those who don''t have the fear of God, who entice the young');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 10, 18, 2, 'man through flattery, saying something nice to him so that they can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 10, 19, 2, 'entice him away from the way of truth. They say, "Be a man! Smoke a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 10, 20, 2, 'cigarette if you''re a man! Have a drink with me if you''re a man! Prove');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 10, 21, 2, 'that you''re a man!" This young person who wants to be a man is tempted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 10, 22, 2, 'so much. He says to himself, "Oh! I''m willing to show this person that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 10, 23, 2, 'am also a man." And thus, he is enticed into sin. The word of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 10, 24, 2, 'addresses those who are out of the home and out with their friends now.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 10, 25, 2, 'If those friends are trying to entice you, do not consent! Don''t be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 10, 26, 2, 'deceived by their flattery! Don''t be deceived by their challenges to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 10, 27, 2, 'a man or a woman. No. You show that you''re a man by saying, "No, I''m not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 10, 28, 2, 'going to do what you say. I fear God." That''s the proof that we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 11, 1, 2, 'courage and that we are men and women of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 11, 2, 2, 'Verses 11-12 are speaking about some extreme circumstances of a gang of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 11, 3, 2, 'murderers inviting some young man. They say, "Come. Let''s be like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 11, 4, 2, 'highway robbers and murder and kill people. Let''s lie in wait for them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 11, 5, 2, 'and ambush them and kill them to get their money." There we see that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 11, 6, 2, 'they are enticing him to come and commit murder. Now, I don''t think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 11, 7, 2, 'anyone here is in danger of being enticed to join some gang of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 11, 8, 2, 'murderers. How shall we apply this to ourselves? We can apply it in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 11, 9, 2, 'way: this is a backbiter inviting you to come and backbite against a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 11, 10, 2, 'brother. That is the New Covenant equivalent of murder: to shed a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 11, 11, 2, 'brother or sister''s blood when he or she is not there. "Come. Let''s talk');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 11, 12, 2, 'about so and so - something bad about so and so." Listen to the word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 11, 13, 2, 'God which says, "My son, when sinners entice you to backbite, do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 11, 14, 2, 'consent." Take a stand. Don''t participate with them. That''s the warning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 11, 15, 2, 'for us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 11, 16, 2, 'In Verse 13, why are these murderers and robbers after these innocent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 11, 17, 2, 'people? With one aim: to make themselves rich. But it need not be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 11, 18, 2, 'murder. People do all types of things to get wealth and fill their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 11, 19, 2, 'houses. There are people who take bribes in order to fill their houses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 11, 20, 2, 'with television sets and video recorders and refrigerators and cars');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 11, 21, 2, 'which they got unrighteously. There are people who cheat the government');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 11, 22, 2, 'of taxes in order to fill their houses with mixers and pressure cookers,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 11, 23, 2, 'which they''ve been able to buy because they cheated the government of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 11, 24, 2, 'taxes. There are so many ways. It doesn''t have to be murder, but to fill');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 11, 25, 2, 'my house with a lot of things using unrighteous money is warned against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 11, 26, 2, 'here. It''s a warning against covetousness. It''s a warning against the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 11, 27, 2, 'lust to fill our houses with things when Jesus has said that a man''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 11, 28, 2, 'life does not consist in the abundance of things he has in his home. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 12, 1, 2, 'God gives you the ability to get things that are useful, get them. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 12, 2, 2, 'if he has chosen not to give you that ability, we have to learn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 12, 3, 2, 'godliness with contentment and have no desire to acquire anything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 12, 4, 2, 'unrighteously or be covetous in order to fill our houses.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 12, 5, 2, 'Do you know that this phrase in verse 14 - "we shall all have one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 12, 6, 2, 'purse"- is not Christianity? It''s communism. And it''s put here in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 12, 7, 2, 'mouth of sinners: "We shall all have one purse." There are some groups');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 12, 8, 2, 'of people that think it is spirituality for everyone to live together');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 12, 9, 2, 'and just have one purse. But you never find that anywhere in the word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 12, 10, 2, 'God. In fact, it''s a misunderstanding of Acts 2 and Acts 4. If you read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 12, 11, 2, 'carefully in Acts 2 and Acts 4, it never says they all had one purse. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 12, 12, 2, 'said they had all things in common - in the sense that if a man had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 12, 13, 2, 'something, his brother was quite entitled to use it. That''s right. "All');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 12, 14, 2, 'things in common" means if you have a bike or a scooter, it must be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 12, 15, 2, 'perfectly available for another brother to use if he needs it. That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 12, 16, 2, 'the meaning of having all things in common; not that we all have one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 12, 17, 2, 'purse. Because if we pull all our resources and have one purse, none of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 12, 18, 2, 'us would be able to learn faithfulness with money. It would just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 12, 19, 2, 'encourage all the lazy people to join us. No. "We shall all have one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 12, 20, 2, 'purse" is not Christianity. It''s communism. And we are never to get into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 12, 21, 2, 'that deception. Some people have and found it doesn''t work, because God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 12, 22, 2, 'never intended that type of communism to be found among Christians. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 12, 23, 2, 'to not possess anything as exclusively our own and to give according to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 12, 24, 2, 'peoples'' needs, that is Christianity. I just mention that in passing. To');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 12, 25, 2, 'share with the needy is Christianity, but to have a common purse is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 12, 26, 2, 'communism.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 12, 27, 2, 'This also gives us a warning about ungodly business partnerships. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 12, 28, 2, 'wrong for a believer to join hands with a man who doesn''t have the fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 13, 1, 2, 'of God in any business partnership. That''s also the meaning here of ''We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 13, 2, 2, 'shall all have one purse.'' "Let''s get into this business enterprise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 13, 3, 2, 'together, and we will be partners and share together in what we get. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 13, 4, 2, 'shall share the profit together." That''s the meaning. And when you join');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 13, 5, 2, 'hands with those who don''t have the fear of God, it''s going to lead you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 13, 6, 2, 'into calamity. There we need to hear the word of God which says, "My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 13, 7, 2, 'son, when a sinner invites you into a joint business enterprise, do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 13, 8, 2, 'consent."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 13, 9, 2, 'My son, do not walk in the way with them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 13, 10, 2, 'Keep your feet from their path,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 13, 11, 2, 'For their feet run to evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 13, 12, 2, 'And they hasten to shed blood.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 13, 13, 2, 'Prov 1:15-16');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 13, 14, 2, 'In other words, break off those relationships which are leading you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 13, 15, 2, 'astray. "Their feet run to evil" means they don''t have any principles in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 13, 16, 2, 'the way they do business. You''ll be entangled in their ways if you go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 13, 17, 2, 'with them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 13, 18, 2, 'Then it goes on to say something very interesting. It uses a picture');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 13, 19, 2, 'about what it means to be greedy: "They hasten to shed blood." This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 13, 20, 2, 'speaks of a young man growing up and trying to make money quickly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 13, 21, 2, 'Therefore, he is enticed by those who say, "Come, we''ll show you how to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 13, 22, 2, 'make money quickly." Young people can take a warning from this,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 13, 23, 2, 'particularly when they are newly married. They suddenly desire to have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 13, 24, 2, 'all the things in their home which many others have who have been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 13, 25, 2, 'married for fifteen or twenty years. They can be tempted in so many ways');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 13, 26, 2, 'to do things that are unrighteous.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 13, 27, 2, 'It does no good to spread a net when the bird you want to catch is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 13, 28, 2, 'watching, but people like that are setting a trap for themselves, a trap');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 14, 1, 2, 'in which they will die.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 14, 2, 2, 'Prov 1:17-18, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 14, 3, 2, 'There''s no use spreading a net when the bird is watching, because the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 14, 4, 2, 'bird is not going to come into that net. It''s watching you spread the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 14, 5, 2, 'trap. BUT greedy men are more stupid than that bird in the sense that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 14, 6, 2, 'they are setting a trap for themselves - a trap in which they will die');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 14, 7, 2, 'because of their own greed. Verses 17-18 mean that a man who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 14, 8, 2, 'covetous, who has not conquered in his own flesh the lust to possess');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 14, 9, 2, 'more and more, and to have what this person has or that person has,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 14, 10, 2, 'doesn''t realize that he''s more stupid than a bird! A bird sees that trap');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 14, 11, 2, 'and avoids it; but the greedy, covetous man is making a trap, through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 14, 12, 2, 'his greed, by which he''s going to destroy and ruin his own life. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 14, 13, 2, 'word of God speaks in 1 Timothy 6:10 about those who have the love of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 14, 14, 2, 'money piercing themselves. It''s very interesting to see how the book of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 14, 15, 2, 'Proverbs begins. It begins with practical instruction concerning the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 14, 16, 2, 'pursuit of mammon and the desire to acquire it quickly. That''s how young');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 14, 17, 2, 'people can be tempted.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 14, 18, 2, 'So are the ways of everyone who gains by violence;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 14, 19, 2, 'It takes away the life of its possessors.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 14, 20, 2, 'Prov 1:19');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 14, 21, 2, 'Such is the fate of all who seek to make more money in unrighteous ways.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 14, 22, 2, 'They lose their life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 14, 23, 2, 'Wisdom shouts in the street,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 14, 24, 2, 'She lifts her voice in the square;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 14, 25, 2, 'At the head of the noisy streets she cries out;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 14, 26, 2, 'At the entrance of the gates in the city she utters her sayings:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 14, 27, 2, '"How long, O naive ones, will you love being simple-minded?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 14, 28, 2, 'And scoffers delight themselves in scoffing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 15, 1, 2, 'And fools hate knowledge?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 15, 2, 2, 'Prov 1:20-22');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 15, 3, 2, 'Here is a contrast to everything prior involving the sinner inviting the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 15, 4, 2, 'young person. Here is another person inviting the young man. Wisdom. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 15, 5, 2, 'verse 10, sinners are inviting the young man. In verse 20, wisdom is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 15, 6, 2, 'inviting the young man and saying, "Young man/woman, why don''t you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 15, 7, 2, 'listen to me?" Wisdom is SHOUTING in the street, trying to draw those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 15, 8, 2, 'young people away from foolish ways. And that''s what we must do in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 15, 9, 2, 'church. Wisdom must SHOUT and lift her voice. Wisdom is pictured here as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 15, 10, 2, 'a woman - as a godly woman - and in that sense, the bride of Christ is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 15, 11, 2, 'inviting people - shouting and inviting people away from folly. Wherever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 15, 12, 2, 'she finds young people going astray, she''s shouting and warning them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 15, 13, 2, 'Notice in this verse that there are three stages of going down into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 15, 14, 2, 'pit. First, you are simple. That means you''re easily influenced. We can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 15, 15, 2, 'say the simple person in the book of Proverbs is the person who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 15, 16, 2, 'easily influenced. We know that many young people are like that - easily');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 15, 17, 2, 'influenced by people in their schools and colleges. That''s where it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 15, 18, 2, 'starts. After some time, if they continue like that and don''t listen to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 15, 19, 2, 'wisdom, they will enter the second stage: becoming scoffers. They will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 15, 20, 2, 'think, "You know, that''s a bit old-fashioned what they preach in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 15, 21, 2, 'church. It''s too rigid and narrow-minded." Now he''s gone a step further');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 15, 22, 2, 'and become a scoffer. That''s the second stage. The third stage is where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 15, 23, 2, 'he becomes a fool in God''s eyes. We saw in verse 7 that a fool is one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 15, 24, 2, 'who has no fear of God. Notice these three stages. First, you are easily');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 15, 25, 2, 'influenced. Second, you become a scoffer and begin to look down and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 15, 26, 2, 'laugh at those things that are spoken by godly brothers in the church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 15, 27, 2, 'And then the third is completely losing the fear of God. I want to warn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 15, 28, 2, 'all young people of these three steps. Be careful. Don''t be easily');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 16, 1, 2, 'influenced. And be much more careful if you''ve gone beyond that stage to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 16, 2, 2, 'the place where you think this is all old-fashioned, religious stuff and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 16, 3, 2, 'that those in the church are so narrow-minded. If you''ve gone that far,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 16, 4, 2, 'you''re very close to the third stage: losing the fear of God altogether.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 16, 5, 2, 'Turn around! Turn around!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 16, 6, 2, 'Turn to my reproof,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 16, 7, 2, 'Behold, I will pour out my spirit on you;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 16, 8, 2, 'I will make my words known to you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 16, 9, 2, 'Prov 1:23');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 16, 10, 2, 'This verse tells us to turn around from going down the path in verse 22.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 16, 11, 2, 'Turn around, whichever stage you are in. If you''re in the third stage,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 16, 12, 2, 'turn quickly. If you''re in that second stage, turn! You might fall into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 16, 13, 2, 'the third stage easily. But the best is to turn when you are in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 16, 14, 2, 'first stage itself. Wisdom says, "Turn to my reproof. Repent!" And what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 16, 15, 2, 'will we get? Not bible knowledge. Wisdom says, "I will pour out my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 16, 16, 2, 'spirit on you." Here is a New Covenant experience. Wisdom will pour out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 16, 17, 2, 'on you the Holy Spirit, who in Ephesians 1:17 is called "the Spirit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 16, 18, 2, 'wisdom and revelation in the full knowledge of God." That''s the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 16, 19, 2, 'Spirit. The Spirit of wisdom and revelation who gives us the full');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 16, 20, 2, 'knowledge of God. Wisdom says, "I will pour out my spirit upon you." In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 16, 21, 2, 'other words, I will change your way of thinking on the inside. I''m not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 16, 22, 2, 'just going to teach you how to behave and act on the outside, like an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 16, 23, 2, 'actor who''s pretending to be wise. No! I''ll pour out my spirit within');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 16, 24, 2, 'you so that your inside will change.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 16, 25, 2, 'Wisdom then says, "I will make my words known to you." In other words,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 16, 26, 2, 'she will teach you the word of God. There are two things we need in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 16, 27, 2, 'lives: the Holy Spirit and the word of God. That''s what we see in verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 16, 28, 2, '23. To get wisdom, we need the Holy Spirit and the word of God. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 17, 1, 2, 'needs to pour out his Spirit upon us and then he can make known his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 17, 2, 2, 'words to us. You find right from the beginning when God recreated the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 17, 3, 2, 'heavens and the earth, it says the Spirit of God brooded upon the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 17, 4, 2, 'waters, and the word of God went forth and said, "Let there be light"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 17, 5, 2, '(Genesis 1). The joint operation of the Holy Spirit and God''s word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 17, 6, 2, 'changed the face of the earth. And it says here that the joint operation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 17, 7, 2, 'of the Holy Spirit and the word of God can change our lives from foolish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 17, 8, 2, 'to wise if we turn when wisdom reproves us. Our lives can be changed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 17, 9, 2, 'when we get a word of reproof or rebuke in the church from an older');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 17, 10, 2, 'brother who has a little more wisdom than you! If you don''t get offended');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 17, 11, 2, 'at that word but turn, that can be your salvation. That can be our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 17, 12, 2, 'salvation when we turn at a word of rebuke or reproof that comes either');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 17, 13, 2, 'directly through the Holy Spirit or through a brother who may have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 17, 14, 2, 'little more wisdom than us. But the sad thing is that most people don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 17, 15, 2, 'take that seriously, particularly when they are young. Therefore, wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 17, 16, 2, 'has to say these sad words we''ll see in verse 24.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 17, 17, 2, 'Because I called and you refused,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 17, 18, 2, 'I stretched out my hand and no one paid attention;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 17, 19, 2, 'And you neglected all my counsel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 17, 20, 2, 'And did not want my reproof;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 17, 21, 2, 'I will also laugh at your calamity;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 17, 22, 2, 'I will mock when your dread comes,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 17, 23, 2, 'When your dread comes like a storm');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 17, 24, 2, 'And your calamity comes like a whirlwind,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 17, 25, 2, 'When distress and anguish come upon you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 17, 26, 2, 'Prov 1:24-17');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 17, 27, 2, 'How did wisdom call? Wisdom SHOUTED. She shouted and shouted and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 17, 28, 2, 'shouted. But he wouldn''t listen. He says, "I know how to take care of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 18, 1, 2, 'myself." That''s the spirit of self confidence in young people who have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 18, 2, 2, 'not been shattered and broken, and they refuse to take heed. They refuse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 18, 3, 2, 'the warnings of godly older people. Wisdom stretches out her hand and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 18, 4, 2, 'says, "Come, let me lead you." But they won''t pay attention. And all her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 18, 5, 2, 'counsel they neglect. Wisdom advised them, warned them, and told them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 18, 6, 2, 'but they just wouldn''t listen. Think of young brothers and sisters who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 18, 7, 2, 'are growing up like that: listening to exhortations and warnings in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 18, 8, 2, 'church but not taking it seriously. Wisdom says, " You did not want my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 18, 9, 2, 'rebuke. You got offended when somebody rebuked you. You hung around the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 18, 10, 2, 'brothers who were always saying nice things to you, and you avoided the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 18, 11, 2, 'people who rebuked and corrected you. Alright. One day calamity will hit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 18, 12, 2, 'you like a sudden flood or cyclone." We hear about that in the papers -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 18, 13, 2, 'suddenly people living on an island are all washed away. Suddenly a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 18, 14, 2, 'tidal wave came and hit them. Wisdom says, "When your calamity comes and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 18, 15, 2, 'hits you, I''ll just stand back and laugh. I''ll mock when dread comes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 18, 16, 2, 'upon you. And your dread will come like a storm, like a sudden cyclone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 18, 17, 2, 'Your calamity will come like a whirlwind, and distress and anguish will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 18, 18, 2, 'come upon you." Wisdom says that. Those who go astray from God''s paths,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 18, 19, 2, 'one day or the other, distress and anguish will certainly come upon.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 18, 20, 2, 'Then they will call on me, but I will not answer;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 18, 21, 2, 'They will seek me diligently but they will not find me,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 18, 22, 2, 'Because they hated knowledge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 18, 23, 2, 'And did not choose the fear of the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 18, 24, 2, '"They would not accept my counsel,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 18, 25, 2, 'They spurned all my reproof.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 18, 26, 2, '"So they shall eat of the fruit of their own way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 18, 27, 2, 'And be satiated with their own devices.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 18, 28, 2, 'Prov 1:28-31');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 19, 1, 2, 'Do you know that a day can come when it is too late to get wisdom? Thank');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 19, 2, 2, 'God that day hasn''t yet come. Brothers and sisters, now we can turn.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 19, 3, 2, 'Those are serious words. "They will seek me diligently at that time!"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 19, 4, 2, 'They had no time to seek her diligently at the right time. But later on,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 19, 5, 2, 'after they''ve made a mess of their life and it''s too late, they will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 19, 6, 2, 'seek diligently, but they won''t find her. We can find her now. But a day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 19, 7, 2, 'will come when we will not be able to find her, because we hated the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 19, 8, 2, 'knowledge of God. We may have been interested in bible knowledge, but we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 19, 9, 2, 'hated the knowledge of God which is pure and good and loving. We did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 19, 10, 2, 'choose the fear of the Lord. "They would not accept my counsel. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 19, 11, 2, 'spurned all my reproof." They got offended when they were reproved and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 19, 12, 2, 'rebuked. Notice how often the word ''reproof'' comes. So, what''s going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 19, 13, 2, 'happen to them? They are going to reap what they sow. That''s all. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 19, 14, 2, 'not that wisdom is going to go and punish them. No. They are just going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 19, 15, 2, 'to reap what they themselves have sown. Wisdom is only standing back and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 19, 16, 2, 'watching the whole thing. They shall eat of the fruit of their own way,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 19, 17, 2, 'and they will be satiated with their own devices. Their own cleverness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 19, 18, 2, 'is finally going to lead them astray, and they''re going to reap the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 19, 19, 2, 'corruption that comes as a result of sowing to the flesh.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 19, 20, 2, 'For the waywardness of the naive will kill them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 19, 21, 2, 'And the complacency of fools will destroy them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 19, 22, 2, 'Prov 1:32');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 19, 23, 2, 'Here we see two dangers: waywardness and complacency. Waywardness means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 19, 24, 2, 'that you don''t go along the right path. You sort of drift a little bit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 19, 25, 2, 'this way and that. And complacency means that you sit back and say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 19, 26, 2, '"Everything''s alright with me. Nothing''s going to happen to me. I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 19, 27, 2, 'alright." In other words, there''s no fear and trembling in your life in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 19, 28, 2, 'relation to working out your own salvation. You''re quite complacent and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 20, 1, 2, 'happy with your own condition. Two dangers: the waywardness of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 20, 2, 2, 'simple, and then that simple person who has become wayward gradually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 20, 3, 2, 'becomes a fool who is quite satisfied in his waywardness. That is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 20, 4, 2, 'second stage. That''s the final stage which he reaches, and which finally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 20, 5, 2, 'destroys him. The thief has come to steal and kill and destroy, and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 20, 6, 2, 'way he steals and kills and destroys is by allowing a person to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 20, 7, 2, 'influenced by his surroundings and finally allowing him to be satisfied');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 20, 8, 2, 'with his condition.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 20, 9, 2, 'But he who listens to me shall live securely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 20, 10, 2, 'And will be at ease from the dread of evil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 20, 11, 2, 'Prov 1:33');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 20, 12, 2, 'Thank God that day in verse 32 has not yet come. You can still listen to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 20, 13, 2, 'wisdom, it says in verse 33. This is a great word for the insecure days');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 20, 14, 2, 'we are living in in the world and in our country. Security comes through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 20, 15, 2, 'listening to God speaking through his spirit. Wisdom says, "If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 20, 16, 2, 'listen to me, you will not only live securely, but you will have no fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 20, 17, 2, 'in your life. You will be at ease from the dread of evil." There is no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 20, 18, 2, 'fear in love - the kind of fear that something evil will happen to me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 20, 19, 2, 'Do any of us have that fear: something evil may hit me or my family at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 20, 20, 2, 'some point? It says here you need not have that fear if you make it a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 20, 21, 2, 'habit in your life to say, "Lord, I want to listen to you. I want to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 20, 22, 2, 'what Mary did: sit at your feet and listen." That is the one thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 20, 23, 2, 'needed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 20, 24, 3, 'Chapter 2 Chapter 2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 20, 25, 3, 'My son, if you will receive my words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 20, 26, 3, 'And treasure my commandments within you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 20, 27, 3, 'Make your ear attentive to wisdom,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 20, 28, 3, 'Incline your heart to understanding;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 21, 1, 3, 'For if you cry for discernment,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 21, 2, 3, 'Lift your voice for understanding;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 21, 3, 3, 'If you seek her as silver');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 21, 4, 3, 'And search for her as for hidden treasures;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 21, 5, 3, 'Prov 2:1-4');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 21, 6, 3, 'Again, he''s speaking to those who have learned submission; those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 21, 7, 3, 'have understood submission to authority. This is for those who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 21, 8, 3, 'willing to turn at the reproof of wisdom. Wisdom has shouted. She has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 21, 9, 3, 'warned those people who don''t listen to what''s going to happen to them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 21, 10, 3, 'and now she''s speaking to those who are willing to listen. She says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 21, 11, 3, '"Okay, here is the first thing you need to do. You need to receive my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 21, 12, 3, 'word and treasure my commandments." In other words, when you come to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 21, 13, 3, 'word of God, you need to look for the commandments, not just for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 21, 14, 3, 'promises. You need to take those commandments and treasure them, not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 21, 15, 3, 'count them as a burden but take them as a treasure. "Oh! Here is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 21, 16, 3, 'commandment. I have become rich! And one more commandment, and one more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 21, 17, 3, 'commandment! I''m increasing in treasure." Treasure my commandments:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 21, 18, 3, 'That''s the first step - a right attitude towards God''s word. Learn to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 21, 19, 3, 'look for the commandments in God''s word. Do you want wisdom? Here it is.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 21, 20, 3, '"If"...There''s a big "if" there.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 21, 21, 3, 'Make your ear attentive or attuned to wisdom. In other words, just like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 21, 22, 3, 'you tune your radio set to a particular frequency, here it says tune');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 21, 23, 3, 'your ear to the frequency called "God''s wisdom". Always be listening for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 21, 24, 3, 'that and incline your heart to understanding - not your mind, but your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 21, 25, 3, 'heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 21, 26, 3, 'There are three ifs here. I want you to notice these three ifs. They are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 21, 27, 3, 'three steps to wisdom. Anyone who fulfills these three conditions will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 21, 28, 3, 'get wisdom. That''s clear. And we can meditate on these three conditions.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 22, 1, 3, 'If people don''t have wisdom, it''s because they haven''t fulfilled these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 22, 2, 3, 'three conditions. It''s very clear: if...if...if...');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 22, 3, 3, 'Then you will discern the fear of the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 22, 4, 3, 'And discover the knowledge of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 22, 5, 3, 'For the Lord gives wisdom;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 22, 6, 3, 'From His mouth come knowledge and understanding.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 22, 7, 3, 'He stores up sound wisdom for the upright;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 22, 8, 3, 'He is a shield to those who walk in integrity,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 22, 9, 3, 'Guarding the paths of justice,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 22, 10, 3, 'And He preserves the way of His godly ones.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 22, 11, 3, 'Then you will discern righteousness and justice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 22, 12, 3, 'And equity and every good course.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 22, 13, 3, 'For wisdom will enter your heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 22, 14, 3, 'And knowledge will be pleasant to your soul;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 22, 15, 3, 'Discretion will guard you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 22, 16, 3, 'Understanding will watch over you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 22, 17, 3, 'Prov 2:5-11');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 22, 18, 3, 'These verses are the promises to those who fulfill the conditions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 22, 19, 3, 'mentioned in verses 1-4. This is what we get if we fulfill the three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 22, 20, 3, 'previous ifs . The fear of the Lord is not something that we just have.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 22, 21, 3, 'God has to give it to us. We have to discern it. And we discern it when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 22, 22, 3, 'we fulfill those conditions in verses 1-4. We will also discover the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 22, 23, 3, 'knowledge of God if we fulfill the conditions in those first four verses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 22, 24, 3, 'of chapter two. Here''s what all will happen if you fulfill those three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 22, 25, 3, 'conditions: You will discern the fear of the Lord. You will become a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 22, 26, 3, 'God-fearing brother/sister. You will discover the knowledge of God. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 22, 27, 3, 'will know more and more what God is like and your life will become more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 22, 28, 3, 'and more secure, because it is the Lord who gives wisdom. No human being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 23, 1, 3, 'can give us wisdom. This clearly teaches that coming to Bible studies on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 23, 2, 3, 'the book of Proverbs will not give us wisdom. That can only show us the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 23, 3, 3, 'way to get wisdom, but it is the Lord who gives wisdom. James 1:5 says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 23, 4, 3, '"If any man lacks wisdom, let him go to the meetings." No. It says, "If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 23, 5, 3, 'any man lacks wisdom, let him ask God." Let him ask God because every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 23, 6, 3, 'good and perfect gift comes from the Father. So, we can''t get it from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 23, 7, 3, 'man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 23, 8, 3, 'Verse 6b says, "From His mouth come knowledge and understanding." Man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 23, 9, 3, 'shall not live by bread alone, but by every word which proceeds from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 23, 10, 3, 'God''s mouth, and from His mouth comes knowledge and understanding.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 23, 11, 3, 'Verse 7: Now here are some wonderful promises. God has stored up (which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 23, 12, 3, 'means he has reserved) sound wisdom for the upright. The upright are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 23, 13, 3, 'those who are not crooked, those who don''t bend in the moment of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 23, 14, 3, 'temptation and compromise, but who stand straight. Upright. Straight.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 23, 15, 3, 'The devil tries to bend them, but they won''t bend. God has reserved some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 23, 16, 3, 'wisdom for them. He has some treasure to give them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 23, 17, 3, 'Verse 8a: Here''s another promise. It says that God is a shield to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 23, 18, 3, 'protect those who walk in integrity. That is those who walk straight');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 23, 19, 3, 'forward, who are honest. God protects them and helps them. He helps');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 23, 20, 3, 'those who guard the paths of justice. You have to read verses 7 and 8');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 23, 21, 3, 'together. He''s a shield to those who walk in integrity and who guard the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 23, 22, 3, 'paths of justice.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 23, 23, 3, 'Verse 8a in the Good News Translation says, "He protects those who treat');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 23, 24, 3, 'others fairly." Justice means that we treat others with fairness. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 23, 25, 3, 'protects a person who treats other people with fairness. That''s wisdom:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 23, 26, 3, 'to do to others as you want others to do to you; not to cheat them, not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 23, 27, 3, 'to do anything that will harm them in any way. Those who treat other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 23, 28, 3, 'people with fairness and kindness find God''s protection over their life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 24, 1, 3, 'Verse 8b says, "He preserves the way of his godly ones." That means he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 24, 2, 3, 'keeps them from falling. The Good News Translation says, "He guards');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 24, 3, 3, 'those who are devoted to him."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 24, 4, 3, 'Verse 9 (The Living Bible): When you fulfill the conditions in verses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 24, 5, 3, '1-4, here''s yet another promise: "God will help you to distinguish right');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 24, 6, 3, 'from wrong." That''s what we read in Hebrews 5:14 - "to discern between');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 24, 7, 3, 'good and evil." That is wisdom. Wisdom is to discern between good and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 24, 8, 3, 'evil; to discern what a human way of reacting is but say, "I don''t want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 24, 9, 3, 'to be human. I want to be divine", or to discern what a human way of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 24, 10, 3, 'speaking is but say, "I want to be divine." God will show you how to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 24, 11, 3, 'distinguish right from wrong and he will show you how to find the right');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 24, 12, 3, 'decision every time! Think of that - how to find the right decision');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 24, 13, 3, 'every time. In the mind of a soulish, carnal believer, he immediately');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 24, 14, 3, 'thinks about this verse in relation to which job to take and which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 24, 15, 3, 'person to marry, but Solomon is not talking about such decisions. He''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 24, 16, 3, 'talking about decisions regarding how to live a godly life, and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 24, 17, 3, 'spiritual person is thinking about that too - how to live a godly life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 24, 18, 3, 'God will show us how to find the right decision every time. In some of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 24, 19, 3, 'the complicated decisions in life you will say, "What shall we do now?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 24, 20, 3, 'What is the divine way to react?" God will show you if you fulfill the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 24, 21, 3, 'conditions in verses 1-4 - if you treasure his commandments, if you cry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 24, 22, 3, 'out for knowledge, and if you desire wisdom more than anything else on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 24, 23, 3, 'the face of the earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 24, 24, 3, 'Verse 10: Here are more promises offered to the person who fulfills');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 24, 25, 3, 'those conditions. "Wisdom will enter your heart." Or as another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 24, 26, 3, 'translation says, "Wisdom will make herself at home in your heart." That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 24, 27, 3, 'means that Wisdom will not be a visitor, coming and going, but Wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 24, 28, 3, 'will come and settle down permanently and make a home in your heart and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 25, 1, 3, 'dwell there. That''s a wonderful thing when we don''t have a reputation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 25, 2, 3, 'for occasionally acting wisely but most of the time acting foolishly,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 25, 3, 3, 'but that Wisdom has made a permanent home in our heart. Think of that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 25, 4, 3, 'And it says, "Knowledge will be pleasant to your soul." To know God will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 25, 5, 3, 'be the thing that gives you pleasure more than any earthly pleasure.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 25, 6, 3, 'Verse 11 says, "Discretion will guard you, understanding will watch over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 25, 7, 3, 'you." That''s a tremendous thing for young people when you think of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 25, 8, 3, 'number of foolish things young people can do. Think of a promise like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 25, 9, 3, 'this, that discretion will guard you and understanding will watch over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 25, 10, 3, 'you. You will be safe from folly if you submit to the teaching of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 25, 11, 3, 'Wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 25, 12, 3, 'To deliver you from the way of evil,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 25, 13, 3, 'From the man who speaks perverse things;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 25, 14, 3, 'From those who leave the paths of uprightness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 25, 15, 3, 'To walk in the ways of darkness;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 25, 16, 3, 'Who delight in doing evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 25, 17, 3, 'And rejoice in the perversity of evil;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 25, 18, 3, 'Whose paths are crooked,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 25, 19, 3, 'And who are devious in their ways;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 25, 20, 3, 'To deliver you from the strange woman,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 25, 21, 3, 'From the adulteress who flatters with her words;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 25, 22, 3, 'That leaves the companion of her youth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 25, 23, 3, 'And forgets the covenant of her God;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 25, 24, 3, 'For her house sinks down to death');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 25, 25, 3, 'And her tracks lead to the dead;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 25, 26, 3, 'None who go to her return again,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 25, 27, 3, 'Nor do they reach the paths of life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 25, 28, 3, 'So you will walk in the way of good men');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 26, 1, 3, 'And keep to the paths of the righteous.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 26, 2, 3, 'For the upright will live in the land');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 26, 3, 3, 'And the blameless will remain in it;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 26, 4, 3, 'But the wicked will be cut off from the land');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 26, 5, 3, 'And the treacherous will be uprooted from it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 26, 6, 3, 'Prov 2:12-22');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 26, 7, 3, 'Now we come to the third area spoken of in chapters one and two. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 26, 8, 3, 'first area we saw was the home in Proverbs 1:8, where the child must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 26, 9, 3, 'obey his parents. The second area we saw was in Proverbs 1:10, where the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 26, 10, 3, 'child grows up to be a young person going to school or college, and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 26, 11, 3, 'other young people (his companions) are enticing him. The third area is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 26, 12, 3, 'the whole world, where there are evil men and evil, seductive women.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 26, 13, 3, 'Verses 12-15 speak of the evil men and verses 16-19 speak of the evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 26, 14, 3, 'women.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 26, 15, 3, 'In verses 12-15, it says that God can deliver you from the way of evil -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 26, 16, 3, '"from the man who speaks perverse things." That is the man who is proud,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 26, 17, 3, 'the man who "leaves the paths of uprightness to walk in the ways of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 26, 18, 3, 'darkness", the crooked man, the man who is not straightforward. God can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 26, 19, 3, 'deliver you from that. There''s a beautiful translation of this in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 26, 20, 3, 'GNT. It says God can save you from those people who "stir up trouble by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 26, 21, 3, 'what they say." Have you met people like that, who have a tremendous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 26, 22, 3, 'ability to stir up trouble by the words they speak? They have a great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 26, 23, 3, 'ability to go into a home and say something and stir up trouble. Don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 26, 24, 3, 'be such a foolish, stupid man or a foolish, stupid husband who has a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 26, 25, 3, 'great ability to stir up trouble by the way he speaks, or a wife who has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 26, 26, 3, 'a great ability to stir up trouble by the way she speaks and the words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 26, 27, 3, 'she speaks. Brothers and sisters, let''s be delivered from that folly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 26, 28, 3, 'God will keep you from such people who stir up trouble by what they say;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 27, 1, 3, 'those who delight in doing evil and rejoice in the perversity of doing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 27, 2, 3, 'evil, whose paths are crooked, who are not straightforward, who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 27, 3, 3, 'devious in their ways. Dear young people, steer clear of these ungodly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 27, 4, 3, 'friends who will lead you astray. Seek your fellowship with God-fearing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 27, 5, 3, 'young people. That''s the warning of the book of Proverbs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 27, 6, 3, 'Verses 16-19 speak about being delivered from the strange woman. That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 27, 7, 3, 'for young people. Be careful about those attractive young girls who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 27, 8, 3, 'trying to draw you. How will they draw you? With flattery (verse 16).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 27, 9, 3, 'They will say nice things about you - "Oh, you look so nice." That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 27, 10, 3, 'enough for that young man. He''s finished. Or she says, "He sings so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 27, 11, 3, 'nicely." Finished! And he runs like a sheep for the slaughter behind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 27, 12, 3, 'that girl who has flattered him. God can deliver you! Wisdom can deliver');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 27, 13, 3, 'you from the adulteress. She''s an adulteress! She''s leading you away');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 27, 14, 3, 'from God into spiritual adultery and physical adultery. She''s part of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 27, 15, 3, 'Babylon which flatters. Beware of flattery young people. Beware of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 27, 16, 3, 'flattery. It says, "She leaves the companion of her youth." She leaves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 27, 17, 3, 'her husband and forgets the marriage covenant which she made before God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 27, 18, 3, '"Her house bows down to death" or "inclines to death" means that when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 27, 19, 3, 'you go after such girls, you''re on a downward slope. It''s only a matter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 27, 20, 3, 'of time before you hit the bottom. Be careful that you don''t get onto');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 27, 21, 3, 'that downward slope and go right down. "Her tracks lead to the dead", to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 27, 22, 3, 'Sheol, to Hell. It''s a downward slope. "None who go to her return again,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 27, 23, 3, 'nor do they reach the paths of life." What does that mean? That means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 27, 24, 3, 'once you have started fooling around with girls, it will have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 27, 25, 3, 'permanent effect on your life. You can recover from it, but you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 27, 26, 3, 'never recover completely. There is some damage done that can never be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 27, 27, 3, 'rectified in all your life. Thank God if you''re saved, but there''s some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 27, 28, 3, 'damage done by all fooling around with the opposite sex. If it''s only a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 28, 1, 3, 'little bit, a little damage is done. If more, more damage is done. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 28, 2, 3, 'there''s a permanent effect on our life. Remember that. All sexual sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 28, 3, 3, 'has a permanent effect on our life. We can be forgiven but it has a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 28, 4, 3, 'permanent effect on our life. "None who go to her return again, nor do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 28, 5, 3, 'they reach the paths of life." Be careful in fooling around with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 28, 6, 3, 'opposite sex and walk in the ways of godly people (verse 20).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 28, 7, 3, 'Verses 20-22 in The Living Bible say, "Follow the steps of the godly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 28, 8, 3, 'instead, and stay on the right path, for only good men enjoy life to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 28, 9, 3, 'full; evil men lose the good things they might have had, and they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 28, 10, 3, 'themselves shall be destroyed." The world is full of people who want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 28, 11, 3, 'enjoy themselves, but they don''t realize that true enjoyment comes only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 28, 12, 3, 'through righteousness. This is the great deception of Satan where he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 28, 13, 3, 'fools people into thinking that by cheating, telling lies, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 28, 14, 3, 'committing sin, they can really enjoy life. Here is a word that goes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 28, 15, 3, 'against all that. Only righteous men enjoy life completely. This is one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 28, 16, 3, 'of the great truths that come in the book of Proverbs, that it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 28, 17, 3, 'through righteousness, the fear of God, and humility that we can enjoy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 28, 18, 3, 'all the good things that God has prepared for those who love him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 28, 19, 4, 'Chapter 3 Chapter 3');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 28, 20, 4, 'My son, do not forget my teaching,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 28, 21, 4, 'But let your heart keep my commandments;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 28, 22, 4, 'Prov 3:1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 28, 23, 4, 'Here Solomon continues with his instruction to those who will submit to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 28, 24, 4, 'his teaching as a son to a father. He''s addressing all those who will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 28, 25, 4, 'accept the principle of submission. He says, "My son, do not forget my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 28, 26, 4, 'teaching, but let your heart keep my commandments." I mentioned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 28, 27, 4, 'previously that the book of Proverbs is like a New Covenant book found');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 28, 28, 4, 'in the middle of the Old Testament. We find a lot of New Covenant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 29, 1, 4, 'teaching, a foretaste of it anyway, in this Old Testament book. We find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 29, 2, 4, 'words like wisdom, grace, and faithin the book of Proverbs which are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 29, 3, 4, 'found in almost no other book in the entire Old Testament. That is why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 29, 4, 4, 'it has a special message for us in the times in which we live. It says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 29, 5, 4, 'here, "Let your heart keep my commandments." In other words, the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 29, 6, 4, 'Spirit was trying to point out that keeping the commandments is not just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 29, 7, 4, 'an external thing. Obedience must be inside the heart. Here was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 29, 8, 4, 'foretaste of what was going to be fulfilled in the New Covenant age of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 29, 9, 4, 'righteousness - that the law would be fulfilled inside. That''s what the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 29, 10, 4, 'Spirit of God is saying here through Solomon: "Do not forget my law, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 29, 11, 4, 'let your heart keep my commandments." He''s saying that since the heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 29, 12, 4, 'is the seat of love, your obedience to the commandments must come out of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 29, 13, 4, 'love. It must not be a legalistic obedience, but an obedience that comes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 29, 14, 4, 'from the heart. He speaks later on in verse 5 about faith that must come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 29, 15, 4, 'from the heart. We can say that he''s speaking really about two things:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 29, 16, 4, 'faith and obedience, or the obedience of faith that comes from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 29, 17, 4, 'heart. You can see so clearly that this is a New Testament concept. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 29, 18, 4, 'is not found so clearly in the Old Testament, but here it comes through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 29, 19, 4, 'so clearly. Obey me from your heart and trust in the Lord with all your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 29, 20, 4, 'heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 29, 21, 4, 'For length of days and years of life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 29, 22, 4, 'And peace they will add to you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 29, 23, 4, 'Prov 3:2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 29, 24, 4, 'If you obey the commandments, you will receive length of days, years of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 29, 25, 4, 'life, and peace. Peace - inner peace - is another thing which is almost');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 29, 26, 4, 'never mentioned in the other Old Testament books. And in that sense,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 29, 27, 4, 'Proverbs is unique. It speaks about this word which is distinctively a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 29, 28, 4, 'New Testament word: peace. If you keep the commandments, you will have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 30, 1, 4, 'peace. Jesus said, "Take my yoke upon you, and you will find rest for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 30, 2, 4, 'your souls."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 30, 3, 4, 'Do not let kindness and truth leave you;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 30, 4, 4, 'Bind them around your neck,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 30, 5, 4, 'Write them on the tablet of your heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 30, 6, 4, 'So you will find favor and a good reputation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 30, 7, 4, 'In the sight of God and man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 30, 8, 4, 'Prov 3:3-4');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 30, 9, 4, 'Notice again that grace and truth, which came by Jesus Christ, are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 30, 10, 4, 'foretold here. He says to bind them around your neck and write them on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 30, 11, 4, 'the tablet of your heart. He doesn''t say to write them on tablets of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 30, 12, 4, 'stone like we read of in the Old Testament, but to write them on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 30, 13, 4, 'tablet of your heart. Solomon was the wisest man that lived. God told');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 30, 14, 4, 'him there wouldn''t be a man wiser than him. And he knew that God desires');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 30, 15, 4, 'truth in the inward parts; kindness and truth in the heart. He says two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 30, 16, 4, 'things must characterize us: "Never forget to be truthful and kind. Hold');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 30, 17, 4, 'these virtues tightly" (The Living Bible). We should always be kind and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 30, 18, 4, 'always be truthful. It''s a wonderful thing if we can hold these two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 30, 19, 4, 'simple virtues in one area in particular: our speech. In the things that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 30, 20, 4, 'we say to one another in the home, office, neighborhood, and anywhere');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 30, 21, 4, 'else, we can ask ourselves two questions: 1) Is what I''m saying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 30, 22, 4, 'truthful? 2) Is what I''m saying kind? This will cleanse our speech');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 30, 23, 4, 'tremendously! Solomon says, "You want wisdom? Begin with cleansing your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 30, 24, 4, 'speech of things which are not truthful and things which are not kind."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 30, 25, 4, 'We must take these seriously. We must write them on the tablet of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 30, 26, 4, 'heart. We must be gripped with them. It says to hold on to these virtues');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 30, 27, 4, 'tightly. That''s the meaning of binding them around your neck. Write them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 30, 28, 4, 'deep within your hearts. In other words, it''s not just a question of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 31, 1, 4, 'appearing to be kind and truthful on the outside, but being really kind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 31, 2, 4, 'and truthful from within. For example, we can hear in a meeting that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 31, 3, 4, 'Jesus was kind to little children, and then we can try to imitate him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 31, 4, 4, 'and act kind to little children. But that kindness is merely on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 31, 5, 4, 'outside. There may not be any kindness in our hearts toward them. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 31, 6, 4, 'is just hypocrisy. And so, Solomon says, "Write them on the tablet of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 31, 7, 4, 'your heart." Let''s begin there and judge ourselves and cleanse ourselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 31, 8, 4, 'of unkind and untruthful attitudes toward others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 31, 9, 4, 'If we let kindness and truth cling to us closely, we will find favor and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 31, 10, 4, 'good repute in the sight of God and man. It says about Jesus in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 31, 11, 4, 'early days that He grew in favor with God and with man. And here it says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 31, 12, 4, 'we can grow in favor in the sight of God and man if we take care to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 31, 13, 4, 'kind and true deep down from within our hearts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 31, 14, 4, 'Trust in the Lord with all your heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 31, 15, 4, 'And do not lean on your own understanding.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 31, 16, 4, 'In all your ways acknowledge Him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 31, 17, 4, 'And He will make your paths straight.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 31, 18, 4, 'Prov 3:5-6');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 31, 19, 4, 'Here again, the emphasis is on the heart. You''ll find that this emphasis');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 31, 20, 4, 'comes in the book of Proverbs often. Here we see that faith is not a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 31, 21, 4, 'matter of the mind. It''s interesting that Solomon himself understood');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 31, 22, 4, 'that in the Old Testament, but sometimes we can make that mistake. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 31, 23, 4, 'can understand certain truths (i.e., God is a loving father or God loves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 31, 24, 4, 'the disciples of Jesus as much as he loves Jesus - not everybody by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 31, 25, 4, 'way, and not even all believers, but disciples of Jesus who have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 31, 26, 4, 'forsaken everything), but they are things I may only understand in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 31, 27, 4, 'head. In the moment of trial, I still get anxious, because I don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 31, 28, 4, 'believe them from my heart. There''s a lot of difference between');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 32, 1, 4, 'believing something in my head, which is the type of faith the devil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 32, 2, 4, 'has, and trusting in the Lord with all my heart. For that, I need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 32, 3, 4, 'revelation of the Holy Spirit. To believe something in your head, all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 32, 4, 4, 'you need is a good bible teacher who will expound the subject well, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 32, 5, 4, 'then you have understood it. We think that is faith, but in the moment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 32, 6, 4, 'of trial, we discover it''s not faith at all. We think we have money, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 32, 7, 4, 'when we go to the shop, we find that it''s counterfeit currency. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 32, 8, 4, 'only a photograph of real money. It''s not the real thing. The moment of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 32, 9, 4, 'trial reveals when our faith has not come from our heart, but merely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 32, 10, 4, 'from our head. That''s why we have to pray much that God will give us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 32, 11, 4, 'revelation. That way our faith will not just sit in our mind but move');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 32, 12, 4, 'deep down into our hearts. Then in the moment of trial, that faith holds');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 32, 13, 4, 'us, and we don''t shake. Trust in the Lord with all your heart!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 32, 14, 4, 'Then he says, "Do not lean on your own understanding." Our own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 32, 15, 4, 'understanding is our reason which is in our mind. He says not to trust');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 32, 16, 4, 'your mind! Instead, trust the Lord with all your heart. He''s drawing a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 32, 17, 4, 'contrast here between the mind and the heart. He says, "Your mind is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 32, 18, 4, 'unreliable. Your mind tells you that you really believe that God is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 32, 19, 4, 'loving father, but in the moment of trial, you get anxious. That proves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 32, 20, 4, 'you don''t believe God is a loving father from your heart." This is what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 32, 21, 4, 'we have spoken of often in our church: that the number one enemy of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 32, 22, 4, 'faith is our own clever reasoning. That''s why it''s very difficult for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 32, 23, 4, 'clever people to come to faith. It''s not impossible, but it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 32, 24, 4, 'difficult, because they tend to lean on their own cleverness. And you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 32, 25, 4, 'find that clever people get anxious even though they understand so much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 32, 26, 4, 'of the scriptures. They can''t come to victory over sin, because they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 32, 27, 4, 'don''t have faith. They''re clever and they lean on their own reasoning.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 32, 28, 4, 'This is the big mistake that all bible schools and bible colleges make.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 33, 1, 4, 'They teach people to do the very thing the word of God says not to do:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 33, 2, 4, 'lean on their own understanding in trying to understand and expound');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 33, 3, 4, 'scripture. No emphasis is placed on the revelation of the Holy Spirit,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 33, 4, 4, 'and the result is that those who come out of bible schools and bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 33, 5, 4, 'colleges become the biggest hindrances to God''s work everywhere. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 33, 6, 4, 'because they violate this principle. You can''t get faith by studying in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 33, 7, 4, 'a bible school. Faith comes by revelation from the Holy Spirit. And the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 33, 8, 4, 'same things apply in the church as well. We''re not just to grasp');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 33, 9, 4, 'doctrines intellectually and try to dish them out to other people. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 33, 10, 4, 'have to be gripped by them in our hearts. Trust in the Lord with all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 33, 11, 4, 'your heart , and do not lean to your own understanding.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 33, 12, 4, 'Verse 6 says, "In all your ways acknowledge him." In other words, give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 33, 13, 4, 'every area of your life over to God. Let him control your money matters,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 33, 14, 4, 'let him control what you read, let him control how you spend your time,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 33, 15, 4, 'let him control every area of your family life, let him control the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 33, 16, 4, 'ambitions you have for your children, let him control your profession,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 33, 17, 4, 'let him control you in every area. In all your ways! Then he will make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 33, 18, 4, 'your paths straight, direct your paths, and give you guidance. There are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 33, 19, 4, 'many people who would like guidance in a particular area of their life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 33, 20, 4, 'and they say, "Lord, in this area, I''m willing to do anything you want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 33, 21, 4, 'me to do. Guide me." And the Lord says, "I can''t guide you, because you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 33, 22, 4, 'don''t acknowledge me in all your ways! Don''t just acknowledge me in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 33, 23, 4, 'area, but in every area. If you''re willing to let me have control of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 33, 24, 4, 'your entire life, then I will guide you." If you want guidance only in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 33, 25, 4, 'one area, and you only yield that one area to God, there''s no promise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 33, 26, 4, 'that you''ll get guidance. But if in all your ways - in every single area');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 33, 27, 4, 'of your life - you want to acknowledge him and let him direct our paths,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 33, 28, 4, 'then he will guide you. And not only guide you, but it also says he will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 34, 1, 4, '"clear the road up for you." That road that''s blocked with so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 34, 2, 4, 'obstructions, he will clear it up for you. If you find in your life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 34, 3, 4, 'brother or sister, that there are obstacles and all types of things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 34, 4, 4, 'hindering you in your onward path, just think of this word: if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 34, 5, 4, 'acknowledge God in all your ways, and trust in him with all your heart,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 34, 6, 4, 'and don''t lean to your own understanding, he will clear the road for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 34, 7, 4, 'you. You can''t clear it yourself; you''ve tried so long. He will clear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 34, 8, 4, 'the road for you! Think of what a life we can live, where he clears the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 34, 9, 4, 'road up for us as we keep moving forward. That''s the life of a man who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 34, 10, 4, 'trusts God with all his heart, doesn''t lean on his own cleverness, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 34, 11, 4, 'acknowledges God in every single area of his life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 34, 12, 4, 'Do not be wise in your own eyes;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 34, 13, 4, 'Fear the Lord and turn away from evil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 34, 14, 4, 'It will be healing to your body');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 34, 15, 4, 'And refreshment to your bones.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 34, 16, 4, 'Prov 3:7-8');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 34, 17, 4, 'This is a word which is also quoted in Romans 12:16. It is a New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 34, 18, 4, 'Testament exhortation: Don''t be wise in your own eyes. This means that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 34, 19, 4, 'we should not think that we have wisdom. Another translation says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 34, 20, 4, '"Don''t think of yourself as wise." You see, this is the trouble with so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 34, 21, 4, 'many people. God''s word says, "If any man lacks wisdom, let him ask');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 34, 22, 4, 'God," and we should be the first to jump up and say, "That''s me! That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 34, 23, 4, 'me, Lord. I lack wisdom." If we always have that attitude, then we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 34, 24, 4, 'get wisdom. But we can sometimes think of ourselves as wise. I''ll tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 34, 25, 4, 'you where we''re in danger of that: when we see another brother or sister');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 34, 26, 4, 'doing something foolish. Then, when we begin to judge them, we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 34, 27, 4, 'become wise in our own eyes. We say, "I would not do that. He may do it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 34, 28, 4, 'but I would not." What is that saying? I have become wise in my own eyes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 35, 1, 4, 'compared to that brother. I''ve become a spiritual idiot according to 2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 35, 2, 4, 'Corinthians 10:12. Those who compare themselves with others are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 35, 3, 4, 'spiritual idiots. Brothers and sisters, don''t become a spiritual idiot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 35, 4, 4, 'by comparing yourself with other people. Always humble yourself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 35, 5, 4, 'There was a man called Socrates who lived years before Christ, and he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 35, 6, 4, 'had a reputation as one of the wisest men in Greece. Somebody asked him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 35, 7, 4, 'what the difference was between him and other people and he said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 35, 8, 4, 'something like, "The difference is this: all of us know nothing. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 35, 9, 4, 'know nothing and I know nothing. The only difference is that I know that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 35, 10, 4, 'I know nothing." We can take a little lesson from Socrates for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 35, 11, 4, 'church: a wise man is the man who recognizes that he really knows');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 35, 12, 4, 'nothing compared to the ocean of God''s wisdom. He has a few little drops');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 35, 13, 4, 'inside his cup compared to God''s ocean of wisdom. Solomon says, "Don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 35, 14, 4, 'be wise in your own eyes." That''s such a terrific danger. It''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 35, 15, 4, 'hindrance. Don''t think of yourself as wise, but concentrate on the fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 35, 16, 4, 'of the Lord and on turning away from evil. Let that be your aim - not to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 35, 17, 4, 'find out how wise you are compared to other brothers. Rather, am I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 35, 18, 4, 'fearing the Lord more and more? Am I turning away from evil? Then you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 35, 19, 4, 'alright.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 35, 20, 4, 'If you do verse 7, then it says you''ll get healing in your body. It will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 35, 21, 4, 'be healing to your body and refreshment to your bones. Not only will you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 35, 22, 4, 'get wisdom in your life, but the fear of the Lord brings health in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 35, 23, 4, 'body. This is a good verse for physical healing. Fear the Lord, don''t be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 35, 24, 4, 'wise in your own eyes, and humble yourself. Humility and the fear of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 35, 25, 4, 'Lord can bring healing in your body and refreshment to your bones that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 35, 26, 4, 'are diseased. Wonderful!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 35, 27, 4, 'Honor the Lord from your wealth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 35, 28, 4, 'And from the first of all your produce;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 36, 1, 4, 'Then your barns will be filled with plenty,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 36, 2, 4, 'And your vats will overflow with new wine.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 36, 3, 4, 'My son, do not reject the discipline of the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 36, 4, 4, 'Or loathe His rebuke,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 36, 5, 4, 'For whom the Lord loves He disciplines,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 36, 6, 4, 'Just as a father disciplines the son in whom he delights.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 36, 7, 4, 'Prov 3:9-12');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 36, 8, 4, 'Now it speaks about our attitude toward mammon. That''s a big area where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 36, 9, 4, 'we need to acquire wisdom: in our attitude toward material wealth. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 36, 10, 4, 'first thing that Solomon says in the book of Proverbs concerning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 36, 11, 4, 'material wealth is: "honor the Lord from your wealth." In other words,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 36, 12, 4, 'glorify God with your money. Can you take this exhortation to glorify');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 36, 13, 4, 'God with your money? With any expenditure, can you say, "I''m spending');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 36, 14, 4, 'this for the glory of God"? That will give us a quick answer as to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 36, 15, 4, 'whether we should spend our money in certain ways. Glorify God with your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 36, 16, 4, 'money and use all of your money to glorify God. Honor him from the first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 36, 17, 4, 'of all your produce. That means: give him the first part of all your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 36, 18, 4, 'income. I noticed one thing in Genesis 4 when I was reading it. In the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 36, 19, 4, 'offerings that Cain and Abel brought, we know that God accepted Abel''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 36, 20, 4, 'offering, but he didn''t accept Cain''s offering. There''s one significant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 36, 21, 4, 'thing mentioned about the two offerings which indicated the heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 36, 22, 4, 'attitude that Abel and Cain had. It says about Cain - the only thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 36, 23, 4, 'that the Holy Spirit records about Cain''s offering - that Cain brought');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 36, 24, 4, 'an offering of the fruit of the ground. It wasn''t the best, it wasn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 36, 25, 4, 'the first, but it was an offering. But when Abel brought an offering, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 36, 26, 4, 'brought the first of the flock and of their fat portions. That means he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 36, 27, 4, 'brought the very best. And the Lord had regard for Abel because he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 36, 28, 4, 'brought the best. The Lord sees the heart attitude when we bring an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 37, 1, 4, 'offering to him. Even today in the church, people can bring an offering');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 37, 2, 4, 'like Cain. They can put money in the box; they can bring an offering to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 37, 3, 4, 'God, but it''s not their best. It''s not that which has cost them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 37, 4, 4, 'something (2 Samuel 24:24). There are people who serve God today, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 37, 5, 4, 'not out of their best. We must never bring to the Lord an offering like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 37, 6, 4, 'Cain - just a casual offering. Everything we offer to God must be the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 37, 7, 4, 'very best. That''s the meaning here. That''s the example we learn from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 37, 8, 4, 'Abel. He gave the best, and God accepted it because the attitude of his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 37, 9, 4, 'heart indicated, "God deserves the very best in my life." Cain''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 37, 10, 4, 'attitude was, "I have to give something to God, so I''ll give something."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 37, 11, 4, 'You find these two attitudes even among believers - those who say, "God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 37, 12, 4, 'deserves the very best of my life. He deserves the best of my children.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 37, 13, 4, 'He deserves the best of my time and all my energy. He deserves the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 37, 14, 4, 'best!" And there are others who give something as a token to God. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 37, 15, 4, 'you can think of Cain and Abel. It says, "Honor the Lord with your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 37, 16, 4, 'wealth" - with what God has given you. Honor Him! It also says, "...from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 37, 17, 4, 'the first of all your produce."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 37, 18, 4, 'In Luke 12:21, Jesus told about the rich man who wanted to build up his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 37, 19, 4, 'barns because he had so much, and God said, "You fool! You''re going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 37, 20, 4, 'die tonight." Jesus said, "So will it be with everyone who is not rich');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 37, 21, 4, 'towards God ." That''s the phrase he used: to be rich towards God. That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 37, 22, 4, 'a wonderful phrase Jesus used. And we can ask ourselves a question: Am I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 37, 23, 4, 'rich towards God? Then I''m really a rich man. If I''m not rich towards');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 37, 24, 4, 'God, then even if I''m a millionaire, I''m a poverty-stricken beggar in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 37, 25, 4, 'God''s eyes. Be rich towards God. That''s the exhortation of Solomon here.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 37, 26, 4, 'We get wisdom through being faithful in the use of money; through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 37, 27, 4, 'honoring God with the material things which he has blessed us with.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 37, 28, 4, 'That''s how we grow in wisdom, and that''s why mammon becomes a means by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 38, 1, 4, 'which God tests us, to see whether he can give us the true riches - that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 38, 2, 4, 'is, wisdom! Wisdom is the true riches. But He has to first see what my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 38, 3, 4, 'attitude is toward the false riches, called money, to see if I love it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 38, 4, 4, 'so much and I''m occupied with it. I may give a token offering to God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 38, 5, 4, 'but my whole life is occupied with money. Then God will see that he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 38, 6, 4, 'cannot give me the true riches. We will come to that later in chapter 3.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 38, 7, 4, 'Then God says if you obey verse 9, He will not be in debt to you. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 38, 8, 4, 'will prosper you. It says, "Your barns will be filled with plenty and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 38, 9, 4, 'your vats will overflow with new wine." Seek first the kingdom of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 38, 10, 4, 'and all the other things you need in life will be added to you. Verse 10');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 38, 11, 4, 'is a picture of prosperity. Then after God tests you with prosperity, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 38, 12, 4, 'will test you with adversity.. He says, "My son, do not reject the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 38, 13, 4, 'discipline/chastening of the Lord or loathe his reproof." It is through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 38, 14, 4, 'the trial and the chastening and the adversity that follows the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 38, 15, 4, 'prosperity that he''s going to teach you wisdom. After he''s taught you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 38, 16, 4, 'how to abound, then he makes you suffer need.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 38, 17, 4, 'Then it says, "For whom the Lord loves he reproves, even as a father the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 38, 18, 4, 'son in whom he delights." In Hebrews 12, you see that this scripture is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 38, 19, 4, 'quoted, and it''s very interesting to see the context. Hebrews 12:5 says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 38, 20, 4, '"You have forgotten the exhortation which is addressed to you as sons:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 38, 21, 4, '''My son...''" That exhortation is God speaking to us not as children, not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 38, 22, 4, 'as babies, but as mature sons! My son! Hebrews 12:7 says, "God deals');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 38, 23, 4, 'with you as sons." That comes in the context of Hebrews 12:1-4 which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 38, 24, 4, 'speaks about following Jesus who resisted sin to the point of death and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 38, 25, 4, 'endured the cross. Giving the example of Jesus, he quotes this verse in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 38, 26, 4, 'Proverbs and says, "When the Lord takes you through trial and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 38, 27, 4, 'chastening, don''t get discouraged. Don''t get offended when God rebukes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 38, 28, 4, 'you and corrects you. Don''t loathe his reproof." When God rebukes you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 39, 1, 4, 'maybe not directly, but through an elder brother, don''t loathe it. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 39, 2, 4, 'doesn''t always come to us directly. Do you remember the story of the man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 39, 3, 4, 'who wanted to collect the rent from the vineyard? He didn''t come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 39, 4, 4, 'himself. He sent his servants to collect the rent. If he had come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 39, 5, 4, 'himself, they may have respected him. But he sent his servants and they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 39, 6, 4, 'despised them. But the man said, "If they despise my servants, they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 39, 7, 4, 'despise me." How do we know whether we get offended with God''s reproof?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 39, 8, 4, 'We know when God reproves us through some servant of his and we get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 39, 9, 4, 'offended. That proves that we loathe God''s correction. We love his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 39, 10, 4, 'prosperity in Proverbs 3:10. Oh yes! We like our barns to be filled with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 39, 11, 4, 'plenty and our vats to overflow (we don''t have vats today, but we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 39, 12, 4, 'bank accounts). We love our bank accounts overflowing, but what about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 39, 13, 4, 'his reproof? We can be pancakes cooked on one side, not turned over. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 39, 14, 4, 'cooks us on one side with prosperity and then turns us over and cooks us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 39, 15, 4, 'on the other side with adversity and reproof and correction. Then we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 39, 16, 4, 'fully developed. Otherwise, only half our character is developing. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 39, 17, 4, 'other half is not growing properly. So, we see the balance here in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 39, 18, 4, 'Proverbs. Whom the Lord loves he reproves, because his aim is to give us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 39, 19, 4, 'wisdom. It says here in the Good News Translation, "Pay close attention');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 39, 20, 4, 'when he reproves you." That means when God rebukes you or corrects you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 39, 21, 4, 'maybe through some servant, listen carefully. If you listen carefully');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 39, 22, 4, 'and pay attention, you can become wise. If you get offended, you remain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 39, 23, 4, 'without wisdom, because wisdom comes through chastening.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 39, 24, 4, 'Blessed is a person who finds wisdom,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 39, 25, 4, 'And one who obtains understanding.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 39, 26, 4, 'Prov 3:13');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 39, 27, 4, 'This is the man who has submitted to the reproof of God and humbled');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 39, 28, 4, 'himself under the discipline of the Lord. How blessed is that man who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 40, 1, 4, 'finds wisdom and the man who gains understanding. The word here means to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 40, 2, 4, 'draw out understanding. It is like lowering a bucket into a deep well');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 40, 3, 4, 'and drawing out water. It doesn''t come just by opening a tap. It comes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 40, 4, 4, 'from drawing out understanding from the well that is in the scriptures -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 40, 5, 4, 'to go into it, to dig into it, to meditate on it, and to draw out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 40, 6, 4, 'spiritual understanding. How blessed is that man! Brothers and sisters,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 40, 7, 4, 'let me say one thing: let no bible study sessions deprive us of going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 40, 8, 4, 'the well ourselves. We would like to be like big kings, sitting with our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 40, 9, 4, 'legs crossed outside the well, having somebody else draw out the water');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 40, 10, 4, 'in the bucket and give it to us. But we miss something if it''s always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 40, 11, 4, 'like that. We miss something if we don''t know how to draw something from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 40, 12, 4, 'the well ourselves. That''s a very healthy spiritual exercise - to go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 40, 13, 4, 'into the word of God and draw out understanding. How blessed is that man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 40, 14, 4, 'who finds wisdom and who has drawn out this understanding!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 40, 15, 4, 'For her profit is better than the profit of silver');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 40, 16, 4, 'And her gain better than fine gold.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 40, 17, 4, 'She is more precious than jewels;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 40, 18, 4, 'And nothing you desire compares with her.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 40, 19, 4, 'Prov 3:14-15');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 40, 20, 4, 'Here are the true riches I was telling you about. We spoke earlier about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 40, 21, 4, 'the false riches - that is the wealth of this world. Here it says what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 40, 22, 4, 'the true riches are: "The profit of wisdom is better than the profit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 40, 23, 4, 'silver, and its gain than fine gold." People keep gold and silver in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 40, 24, 4, 'their homes. Do you know why they keep gold and silver in their homes?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 40, 25, 4, 'Because they feel the value of gold will keep going up. If they store up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 40, 26, 4, 'gold and silver in their house, then ten years from now, the one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 40, 27, 4, 'thousand rupees that they spent will become five thousand rupees. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 40, 28, 4, 'value of the same bit of gold has gone up, and they feel very happy when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 41, 1, 4, 'the price of gold and silver goes up in the market. Here it says that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 41, 2, 4, 'all nothing compared to the profit and gain of wisdom. This is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 41, 3, 4, 'contrast to what we were seeing earlier about earthly wealth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 41, 4, 4, 'Then it says, "She is more precious than jewels and nothing you desire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 41, 5, 4, 'compares with her." There is absolutely nothing in the whole world - no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 41, 6, 4, 'company shares, no gold, no silver, NOTHING - that can be compared to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 41, 7, 4, 'divine wisdom. And it comes to the man who submits himself to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 41, 8, 4, 'discipline of the Lord (verse 11); who humbles himself under the Lord''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 41, 9, 4, 'reproof and rebukes, and obeys God''s commandments from his heart (verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 41, 10, 4, '1); who trusts in the Lord with all his heart (verse 5), and does not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 41, 11, 4, 'lean on his own cleverness; who acknowledges God in all his ways. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 41, 12, 4, 'man is a blessed man. He really is a blessed man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 41, 13, 4, 'Long life is in her right hand;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 41, 14, 4, 'In her left hand are riches and honor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 41, 15, 4, 'Her ways are pleasant ways');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 41, 16, 4, 'And all her paths are peace.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 41, 17, 4, 'Prov 3:16-17');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 41, 18, 4, 'This means that when you''re walking in the way of wisdom, you can never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 41, 19, 4, 'be at unrest in your heart at any time, because ALL her paths are peace.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 41, 20, 4, 'When I get into unrest, that means I have left the path of wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 41, 21, 4, 'Somewhere I veered off the path. If I spoke to a brother in a particular');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 41, 22, 4, 'way, and I am very much at unrest about it, I must have left the path of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 41, 23, 4, 'wisdom. Or if somebody said something to me and I am very much in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 41, 24, 4, 'unrest, that means I have not reacted in the right way. That''s why I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 41, 25, 4, 'in unrest. That''s not the way of wisdom, and it''s God speaking to me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 41, 26, 4, 'through that unrest in my heart, saying, "You have left the way of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 41, 27, 4, 'wisdom, because ALL of wisdom''s paths are always peace." That''s why if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 41, 28, 4, 'you build a church with wisdom, there will always be peace in that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 42, 1, 4, 'church. There will never be fighting in that church. When we speak about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 42, 2, 4, 'a church where there hasn''t been fighting for many years, people don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 42, 3, 4, 'believe it. But it''s possible if all wisdom''s paths are peace and we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 42, 4, 4, 'proclaim wisdom in the church. There''s bound to be peace, because all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 42, 5, 4, 'her paths are peace. It''s when wisdom is not known and not proclaimed -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 42, 6, 4, 'just a lot of dry, old bible-knowledge is dished out - that you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 42, 7, 4, 'find peace there.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 42, 8, 4, 'She is a tree of life to those who take hold of her,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 42, 9, 4, 'And happy are all who hold her fast.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 42, 10, 4, 'Prov 3:18');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 42, 11, 4, 'Here we are told what that tree of life in the Garden of Eden really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 42, 12, 4, 'was. What was the tree of life? Wisdom! What was the other tree? The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 42, 13, 4, 'tree of the knowledge of good and evil. Knowledge of good and evil is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 42, 14, 4, 'not the same as wisdom. By the knowledge of good and evil, one can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 42, 15, 4, 'clever and say what''s right and what''s wrong, but wisdom is another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 42, 16, 4, 'thing altogether. People can have knowledge of good and evil and still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 42, 17, 4, 'fight with each other, but you can''t have wisdom and fight with each');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 42, 18, 4, 'other. That''s impossible. The tree of life is wisdom. It''s the divine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 42, 19, 4, 'nature. It''s the wisdom described in James 3 which is first pure and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 42, 20, 4, 'then peaceable. This is the tree of life which Adam was not interested');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 42, 21, 4, 'in, and which most believers today, unfortunately, are not interested in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 42, 22, 4, 'either. The difference between Adam and Christ is this: Christ was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 42, 23, 4, 'concerned with wisdom (the very first thing we read about Jesus when he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 42, 24, 4, 'was a child is that he grew in wisdom), but Adam was concerned with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 42, 25, 4, 'knowledge (he forgot about the tree of life and went after the tree of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 42, 26, 4, 'the knowledge of good and evil). Even today, most believers are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 42, 27, 4, 'interested in knowledge and not wisdom. But our pursuit must be wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 42, 28, 4, 'The second part says, "Happy are all who hold her fast." To hold her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 43, 1, 4, 'fast speaks of the man who keeps on eating from this tree; the man who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 43, 2, 4, 'comes to this tree and realizes, "I haven''t understood everything yet. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 43, 3, 4, 'need to know more."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 43, 4, 4, 'The Lord by wisdom founded the earth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 43, 5, 4, 'By understanding He established the heavens.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 43, 6, 4, 'By His knowledge the deeps were broken up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 43, 7, 4, 'And the skies drip with dew.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 43, 8, 4, 'My son, let them not vanish from your sight;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 43, 9, 4, 'Keep sound wisdom and discretion,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 43, 10, 4, 'So they will be life to your soul');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 43, 11, 4, 'And adornment to your neck.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 43, 12, 4, 'Then you will walk in your way securely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 43, 13, 4, 'And your foot will not stumble.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 43, 14, 4, 'When you lie down, you will not be afraid;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 43, 15, 4, 'When you lie down, your sleep will be sweet.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 43, 16, 4, 'Do not be afraid of sudden fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 43, 17, 4, 'Nor of the onslaught of the wicked when it comes;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 43, 18, 4, 'For the Lord will be your confidence');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 43, 19, 4, 'And will keep your foot from being caught.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 43, 20, 4, 'Prov 3:19-26');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 43, 21, 4, 'There are three words used here which all, more or less, mean the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 43, 22, 4, 'thing. Divine knowledge (not the knowledge of good and evil which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 43, 23, 4, 'brought death, but divine knowledge - the knowledge of God),');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 43, 24, 4, 'understanding, and wisdom. It says God founded the earth and established');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 43, 25, 4, 'the heavens, and the fountains of the earth were broken open and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 43, 26, 4, 'skies poured out rain - all through God''s wisdom, understanding, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 43, 27, 4, 'knowledge. Now when you read Genesis 1, you know that it was through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 43, 28, 4, 'God''s spoken word that these things happened. It was through God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 44, 1, 4, 'spoken word that the heavens and earth were remade. So we see that God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 44, 2, 4, 'wisdom is revealed to us through his word, and that is why it is only as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 44, 3, 4, 'we take God''s word seriously that we can have an understanding of God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 44, 4, 4, 'ways. Psalm 103:7 says, "God made known his ways to Moses, but his deeds');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 44, 5, 4, '(or his actions) to the sons of Israel." This difference can be seen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 44, 6, 4, 'even today among believers. There are those who see God''s actions and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 44, 7, 4, 'are impressed with them - healing the sick or doing a miracle (a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 44, 8, 4, 'physical miracle, particularly). They follow in the footsteps of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 44, 9, 4, 'sons of Israel who saw God''s actions. But to Moses, God was able to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 44, 10, 4, 'reveal something more than that - his ways. God was able to teach Moses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 44, 11, 4, 'something of himself, of his nature, and of his wisdom. Do you remember');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 44, 12, 4, 'when he told Moses, "I will show you my glory. I will show you all my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 44, 13, 4, 'goodness"? It''s the goodness of God which is his glory. It''s one thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 44, 14, 4, 'to see the physical healing of the sick. It''s quite another thing to see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 44, 15, 4, 'God''s goodness and be gripped by that in our lives. You find most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 44, 16, 4, 'believers are occupied with these physical miracles and very few, like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 44, 17, 4, 'Moses, want to know God''s ways. Here the book of Proverbs is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 44, 18, 4, 'teaching us how to do miracles. It''s teaching us about God''s ways. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 44, 19, 4, 'only person who will be interested - really interested - in knowing the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 44, 20, 4, 'depths there are in the book of Proverbs is one who wants to know God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 44, 21, 4, 'and his ways more. There''s no verse here that tells us how to raise the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 44, 22, 4, 'dead or how to move a mountain out of the way, but it tells us what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 44, 23, 4, 'God''s ways are.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 44, 24, 4, 'Verses 21-22 say, "My son, don''t let these (God''s wisdom, understanding,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 44, 25, 4, 'and knowledge) depart from your sight. Keep sound wisdom and discretion,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 44, 26, 4, 'because they will be life to your soul and adornment to your neck." In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 44, 27, 4, 'other words, this is the greatest honor that you can ever get. No');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 44, 28, 4, 'president of any country putting a medal around your neck can be as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 45, 1, 4, 'great an honor as getting wisdom. Solomon is using so many illustrations');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 45, 2, 4, 'to try and show that wisdom is better than riches. Wisdom is better than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 45, 3, 4, 'getting the Param Vir Chakra (Presidential Medal of Freedom) or some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 45, 4, 4, 'medal tied around your neck. Here is the thing you need to have tied');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 45, 5, 4, 'around your neck: wisdom! We must make it the main pursuit of our life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 45, 6, 4, 'Next he says, "Then you will walk securely and your foot will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 45, 7, 4, 'stumble." This means that God will not allow your feet to fall into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 45, 8, 4, 'Satan''s traps. He will keep you from falling into the traps which Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 45, 9, 4, 'has lined up for you. When Paul said, "We are not ignorant of Satan''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 45, 10, 4, 'schemes," that''s because Paul had wisdom. "When you walk, your way will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 45, 11, 4, 'be secure and your foot will not stumble, and when you lie down, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 45, 12, 4, 'will not be afraid; when you lie down, your sleep will be sweet." I want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 45, 13, 4, 'to tell you, brothers and sisters, that it is God''s will for every one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 45, 14, 4, 'of us that our sleep should be sweet. Do you believe that? If you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 45, 15, 4, 'believe it, then according to your faith be it unto you. But if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 45, 16, 4, 'believe it, according to your faith be it unto you. I believe it with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 45, 17, 4, 'all my heart. It says here that it''s God''s will for me that my sleep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 45, 18, 4, 'should be sweet; that I should not have any tension on my mind. Have you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 45, 19, 4, 'seen little children sleeping? Do you know why they sleep so well? They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 45, 20, 4, 'are not worried about anything concerning tomorrow. Think of that. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 45, 21, 4, 'can bring us to a place where we have cast our burdens on the Lord so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 45, 22, 4, 'completely, trusted in the Lord with ALL our heart, acknowledged him in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 45, 23, 4, 'ALL our ways, and sought after wisdom more than anything else - more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 45, 24, 4, 'than riches and honor and all the rubbish which people seek after. Try');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 45, 25, 4, 'it. When you lie down, your sleep will be sweet. That is the will of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 45, 26, 4, 'God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 45, 27, 4, 'Verse 25 in The Living Bible translation says, "You need not be afraid');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 45, 28, 4, 'of disaster and you won''t be afraid of the plots of evil men." You won''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 46, 1, 4, 'be afraid of robbers coming to your house in the middle of the night or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 46, 2, 4, 'evil men plotting against you in your office when you go there tomorrow.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 46, 3, 4, 'You won''t be afraid of a single thing. Your sleep will be sweet. We have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 46, 4, 4, 'to take this promise and say, "Lord, I want that." We won''t be afraid of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 46, 5, 4, 'anything - freedom from ALL fear. That is the will of God for us. So we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 46, 6, 4, 'find that our sleep is also a pretty good test of the condition of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 46, 7, 4, 'heart. We can think we''re alright, but the fact that we are so restless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 46, 8, 4, 'at night proves that everything is not alright. Something is wrong,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 46, 9, 4, 'because your sleep is not sweet. We have to ask ourselves why. It''s good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 46, 10, 4, 'to humble ourselves and go and ask God, "Lord, is there something which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 46, 11, 4, 'is causing me tension that I need to cast on you? I don''t trust in you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 46, 12, 4, 'with all my heart, perhaps. I believe so many things in my head, but I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 46, 13, 4, 'don''t trust in you with all my heart." I''m not saying this to condemn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 46, 14, 4, 'anybody. I''m just saying it to encourage everyone that this is your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 46, 15, 4, 'birthright. Don''t let the devil take this away from us. Say, "Lord, my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 46, 16, 4, 'birthright is sweet sleep at night." Verses 25b-26 say not be afraid of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 46, 17, 4, 'sudden fear, because the Lord will be your confidence, and he will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 46, 18, 4, 'protect you from falling into Satan''s traps. He will keep your foot from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 46, 19, 4, 'being caught by Satan and keep you from falling into a trap.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 46, 20, 4, 'Do not withhold good from those to whom it is due,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 46, 21, 4, 'When it is in your power to do it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 46, 22, 4, 'Do not say to your neighbor, "Go, and come back,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 46, 23, 4, 'And tomorrow I will give it,"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 46, 24, 4, 'When you have it with you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 46, 25, 4, 'Prov 3:27-28');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 46, 26, 4, 'Here he gives us an exhortation about falling into debt. The Living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 46, 27, 4, 'Bible says, "Don''t withhold any payment of your debts. Don''t say, ''Some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 46, 28, 4, 'other time'', when you can pay now." Do you want wisdom? How many of us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 47, 1, 4, 'are serious about getting wisdom? Pay back your debts! This business of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 47, 2, 4, 'getting wisdom is very practical. Pay back your debts! Don''t say, "Next');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 47, 3, 4, 'year" or "Next month" or "Some other time" if you can pay now. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 47, 4, 4, 'can pay the shopkeeper for that bar of soap now, don''t tell him to put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 47, 5, 4, 'it in a credit book and that you''ll pay him on the first of the month.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 47, 6, 4, 'You''ll never become wise that way - I''ll tell you that. This whole');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 47, 7, 4, 'credit system is for fools, not for those who want divine wisdom. Those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 47, 8, 4, 'who want divine wisdom do not get into a credit system like that. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 47, 9, 4, 'pay immediately when they have the money in their pockets. They don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 47, 10, 4, 'get their name into the shopkeeper''s book and get onto a credit list.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 47, 11, 4, 'That''s the way people end up in a lot of folly later on. Don''t say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 47, 12, 4, '"Some other time" or "On the first of next month when I get my pay" if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 47, 13, 4, 'you can pay now. That''s something for us to remember.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 47, 14, 4, 'We are not to be in debt to anyone, and this doesn''t just apply to those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 47, 15, 4, 'from whom we have borrowed money. The book of Proverbs speaks later on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 47, 16, 4, 'of the debt we owe to our parents. Do you know that every one of us owes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 47, 17, 4, 'a debt to our parents? If we were to calculate all the money and time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 47, 18, 4, 'that our parents spent on us, we find we owe them a fantastic debt. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 47, 19, 4, 'yet, so many believers can take such a casual, light attitude toward');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 47, 20, 4, 'repaying the ones to whom they owe more than any other person on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 47, 21, 4, 'face of the earth, perhaps. They owe so much! But they take it for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 47, 22, 4, 'granted. They don''t realize that we must do what we can to repay our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 47, 23, 4, 'debt to our parents in their old age. A man who is wise will repay that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 47, 24, 4, 'debt.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 47, 25, 4, 'This can also apply to debts owed to our neighbors or to the government');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 47, 26, 4, 'in taxes. Taxes are a debt that we owe to the government until we pay');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 47, 27, 4, 'them, and the wise man will have no difficulty in paying his taxes. He''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 47, 28, 4, 'glad to pay his taxes. He doesn''t want to cheat the government with any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 48, 1, 4, 'type of tax. No. He pays his debt to the government, to his parents, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 48, 2, 4, 'neighbors, and to fellow believers. He owes no man anything. He makes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 48, 3, 4, 'sure he behaves like God who''s never in debt to anyone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 48, 4, 4, 'I just want to say one more aspect of debt which is mentioned in the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 48, 5, 4, 'Testament. It says in Romans 13:8, "Owe no man anything except to love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 48, 6, 4, 'one another." This means that since God has given us so much love, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 48, 7, 4, 'have a perpetual debt of love to others. We are to take every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 48, 8, 4, 'opportunity to clear that debt of love to other people in the church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 48, 9, 4, 'That''s the meaning of Romans 13:8. I have to look at a brother and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 48, 10, 4, 'have to see that I owe him a debt of love, because God has given me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 48, 11, 4, 'something of his love, which I have to pass on. This concept is included');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 48, 12, 4, 'in this verse too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 48, 13, 4, 'Do not devise harm against your neighbor,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 48, 14, 4, 'While he lives securely beside you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 48, 15, 4, 'Do not contend with a man without cause,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 48, 16, 4, 'If he has done you no harm.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 48, 17, 4, 'Prov 3:29-30');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 48, 18, 4, 'We see here that there are certain verses that make Proverbs an Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 48, 19, 4, 'Testament book. Here''s one verse like that. It says not to contend with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 48, 20, 4, 'a man without cause, if he has done you no harm. What if someone has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 48, 21, 4, 'done you harm? Then according to the Old Testament, you can do something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 48, 22, 4, 'about it. But according to the New Testament, you still can''t do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 48, 23, 4, 'anything about it, because Jesus said, "If someone slaps you on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 48, 24, 4, 'cheek, turn to him the other." I was interested to see this phrase:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 48, 25, 4, 'without a cause. That means back in the Old Testament, if there was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 48, 26, 4, 'cause, you could get into a contention with a man. But when you turn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 48, 27, 4, 'over to the New Testament in Matthew 5, there''s something very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 48, 28, 4, 'interesting. It says in Matthew 5:22, "But I say to you, everyone who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 49, 1, 4, 'gets angry with his brother shall be guilty with the court." Now, I''ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 49, 2, 4, 'tell you something about the people who copied the scriptures in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 49, 3, 4, 'early days. They felt that what Jesus said can''t be right. How can a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 49, 4, 4, 'live without anger? So they inserted something from Proverbs 3:30 into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 49, 5, 4, 'that verse. Therefore in the King James Version, it reads like this: "I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 49, 6, 4, 'say to you that everyone who is angry with his brother without cause');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 49, 7, 4, 'shall be guilty..." Well, that''s a very nice escape hole from which we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 49, 8, 4, 'can always escape when we get angry, because there''s no one in the world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 49, 9, 4, 'who gets angry without a cause, unless he''s a madman or somebody in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 49, 10, 4, 'lunatic asylum. Everybody is angry with a cause. Have you ever heard of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 49, 11, 4, 'someone getting angry without a cause? Do you mean to say that all this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 49, 12, 4, 'fantastic teaching of Jesus was ultimately just to be watered down');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 49, 13, 4, 'completely with one little phrase? It says in the margin of the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 49, 14, 4, 'American Standard Bible, "Some manuscripts have inserted "without a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 49, 15, 4, 'cause". That''s because they felt the standard of Jesus was too high,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 49, 16, 4, 'which teaches us one thing: if you don''t have faith for it, you won''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 49, 17, 4, 'get it! If you have faith that you''ll only get victory over anger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 49, 18, 4, 'without a cause, then that''s all you''ll get. But if we have faith that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 49, 19, 4, 'we''ll get victory over anger, with or without a cause, then we''ll get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 49, 20, 4, 'it. And that''s what Jesus spoke about. But in the Old Testament, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 49, 21, 4, 'wasn''t the standard. In the Old Testament, the standard was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 49, 22, 4, 'contending with a man without a cause. But in the New Testament, Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 49, 23, 4, 'says, "I say to you, don''t be angry with your brother. Otherwise you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 49, 24, 4, 'guilty." So that''s just an interesting thing we see here.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 49, 25, 4, 'Do not envy a man of violence');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 49, 26, 4, 'And do not choose any of his ways.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 49, 27, 4, 'For the devious are an abomination to the Lord;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 49, 28, 4, 'But He is intimate with the upright.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 50, 1, 4, 'The curse of the Lord is on the house of the wicked,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 50, 2, 4, 'But He blesses the dwelling of the righteous.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 50, 3, 4, 'Prov 3:31-33');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 50, 4, 4, 'This is speaking of a lawless man - a man who doesn''t keep the laws, who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 50, 5, 4, 'makes profit by cheating and telling lies. Don''t envy him. Don''t envy a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 50, 6, 4, 'lawless man. Do you find other people in your office doing things which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 50, 7, 4, 'are not righteous and making money from it? Maybe they are cheating the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 50, 8, 4, 'office or the government or whatever it is by schemes and methods which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 50, 9, 4, 'you, as an upright Christian, won''t adopt. They''re making money, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 50, 10, 4, 'you''re finding it difficult. Don''t envy them. It''s so easy to begin to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 50, 11, 4, 'think, "What a lot I''m losing by not doing what these other people are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 50, 12, 4, 'doing. Nobody''s catching them." We can easily envy them. It says, "Don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 50, 13, 4, 'choose any of his ways." Don''t choose any of the ways of a man who''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 50, 14, 4, 'doing wrong. Students, when you see other people copying, when you know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 50, 15, 4, 'the question paper has leaked and there''s a scramble to get the question');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 50, 16, 4, 'paper, there you find the true Christian student says, "Never mind if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 50, 17, 4, 'it''s leaked. I don''t want to see it." What an attitude. You know that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 50, 18, 4, 'everybody else is going into the examination having seen the question');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 50, 19, 4, 'paper, but you are following Jesus. Do you think Jesus would go looking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 50, 20, 4, 'for that leaked question paper? No. Well, neither are we going to do it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 50, 21, 4, 'Don''t choose his ways, because "the crooked man is an abomination to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 50, 22, 4, 'Lord" (verse 32). Do you want to be an abomination to the Lord just to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 50, 23, 4, 'get high marks in the examination? Just to get a little more money in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 50, 24, 4, 'the office? The crooked man is an abomination to the Lord, "but he''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 50, 25, 4, 'intimate with the upright." He''s a close friend of the upright. Do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 50, 26, 4, 'want to be a close friend of God? Then be upright.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 50, 27, 4, 'Verse 33 says, "The curse of the Lord is on the house of the wicked, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 50, 28, 4, 'he blesses the dwelling of the righteous." You see, it''s very easy to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 51, 1, 4, 'put up a plaque on the wall, saying, "Bless this house, O Lord, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 51, 2, 4, 'pray." But he''s not going to bless every house, even if you hang a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 51, 3, 4, 'plaque, because it says he only blesses the house of the righteous. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 51, 4, 4, 'the people who live in the house who determine whether God can bless the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 51, 5, 4, 'house. He''s not interested in the windows and the walls and the doors.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 51, 6, 4, 'He''s interested in the people who live there. If they are righteous,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 51, 7, 4, 'whether they have a plaque or not, God blesses the house. But if the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 51, 8, 4, 'people are not righteous, whatever number of plaques they hang on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 51, 9, 4, 'wall, God''s not going to bless them. That''s just superstition. If you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 51, 10, 4, 'righteous, the blessing comes automatically.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 51, 11, 4, 'There''s a difference in the word used here in the original Hebrew.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 51, 12, 4, 'There''s a contrast. The "house of the wicked" means the great mansion of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 51, 13, 4, 'the wicked, and the "dwelling of the righteous" in the original Hebrew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 51, 14, 4, 'is a small, little cottage. The righteous person could not make so much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 51, 15, 4, 'money, but he has God''s blessing. Think of that, brothers and sisters.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 51, 16, 4, 'Think of living in a house and having the blessing of the Lord upon us,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 51, 17, 4, 'because we seek to be righteous.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 51, 18, 4, 'Though He scoffs at the scoffers,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 51, 19, 4, 'Yet He gives grace to the afflicted.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 51, 20, 4, 'Prov 3:34');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 51, 21, 4, 'Here we see that New Testament word, grace. This is quoted by Peter in 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 51, 22, 4, 'Peter 5:5 and by James in James 4:6 - "He resists the proud, but he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 51, 23, 4, 'gives grace to the humble." Grace is given by God. We don''t need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 51, 24, 4, 'speak much about that as we''ve spoken much about it in the church. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 51, 25, 4, 'resists the proud, so don''t seek the fellowship of the proud. He gives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 51, 26, 4, 'grace to the humble, so seek fellowship with the humble. As a godly man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 51, 27, 4, 'named Sirach once wrote in his book : When you touch tar, it dirties');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 51, 28, 4, 'your hand in a way that makes it very difficult to remove. In just the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 52, 1, 4, 'same way, if you have fellowship with a proud man, it will defile you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 52, 2, 4, 'His pride will enter into your spirit unconsciously - and you will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 52, 3, 4, 'even be aware of it. So, it will be very difficult to get rid of it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 52, 4, 4, 'Therefore if you''re wise, you''ll seek fellowship with humble and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 52, 5, 4, 'lowly-minded people, and you''ll avoid contact with the proud and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 52, 6, 4, 'haughty. This is a word of warning we need in our day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 52, 7, 4, 'Wise people will gain an honorable reputation, but stupid people will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 52, 8, 4, 'only add to their own disgrace.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 52, 9, 4, 'Prov 3:35, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 52, 10, 5, 'Chapter 4 Chapter 4');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 52, 11, 5, 'Hear, O sons, the instruction of a father,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 52, 12, 5, 'And give attention that you may gain understanding,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 52, 13, 5, 'For I give you sound teaching;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 52, 14, 5, 'Do not abandon my instruction.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 52, 15, 5, 'Prov 4:1-2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 52, 16, 5, 'He says "Hear, O sons." Now he''s speaking to a number of people, who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 52, 17, 5, 'willing to take their position in submission. We notice this phrase:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 52, 18, 5, '"Hear, O son" or "Listen, O son" coming again and again in these first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 52, 19, 5, 'few chapters. This indicates, as I mentioned in our last study, a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 52, 20, 5, 'principle of submission to spiritual authority, that God tests our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 52, 21, 5, 'submission in the home and in the church. When we are willing to humble');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 52, 22, 5, 'ourselves and listen to those who have more wisdom than us, and don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 52, 23, 5, 'become proud and wise in our own eyes, and we are willing to hear, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 52, 24, 5, 'we are willing to take the place of a son under a father, and we don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 52, 25, 5, 'think "That''s disgraceful, how can I take that position?", then there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 52, 26, 5, 'a possibility of our getting wisdom. There, our humility is tested. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 52, 27, 5, 'it''s not our heavenly Father, it''s Solomon speaking: "And give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 52, 28, 5, 'attention, that you may gain understanding, for I give you sound');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 53, 1, 5, 'teaching; Do not abandon my instruction."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 53, 2, 5, 'When I was a son to my father,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 53, 3, 5, 'Tender and the only son in the sight of my mother,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 53, 4, 5, 'Then he taught me and said to me,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 53, 5, 5, '"Let your heart hold fast my words;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 53, 6, 5, 'Keep my commandments and live;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 53, 7, 5, 'Prov 4:3-4');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 53, 8, 5, 'Now he tells us something very interesting. Solomon says, "You know,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 53, 9, 5, 'there was also a time when I was young and I had to learn something from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 53, 10, 5, 'someone who was spiritually superior to me, and that was my father,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 53, 11, 5, 'David." And we know that David was a man after God''s own heart. As far');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 53, 12, 5, 'as we know (we don''t know definitively, but as far as we know), Solomon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 53, 13, 5, 'was David''s last son. And you know who his mother was...his mother was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 53, 14, 5, 'Bathsheba. Think of that, that the son of Bathsheba was the one whom God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 53, 15, 5, 'chose to be the next king. That was the tremendous grace of God, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 53, 16, 5, 'Solomon never forgot that. Solomon knew how his mother got married to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 53, 17, 5, 'David. The whole history of that wasn''t something to be proud of. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 53, 18, 5, 'he saw something of the grace of God. Here it says that David was the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 53, 19, 5, 'one who first told Solomon to keep the commandments. Think of what a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 53, 20, 5, 'father he was. And you know, it''s very interesting because when you turn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 53, 21, 5, 'to 1 Kings 1:6, we read that David had a number of other children, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 53, 22, 5, 'one of those sons was named Adonijah. And it says about Adonijah in 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 53, 23, 5, 'Kings 1:6 that his father, David, never displeased him; he never pained');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 53, 24, 5, 'him by asking him even once, "Why have you done that?" And David had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 53, 25, 5, 'another rebellious son like that named Absalom, and another wicked son,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 53, 26, 5, 'named Amnon, who raped his sister. Amnon, Absalom, and Adonijah. David');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 53, 27, 5, 'had a whole lot of sons, and perhaps he treated all of them like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 53, 28, 5, 'Wouldn''t pain them, wouldn''t rebuke them, and he saw the damage they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 54, 1, 5, 'brought in his home, and he decided to do it differently with his last');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 54, 2, 5, 'son, Solomon. And no wonder God picked up Solomon, because his father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 54, 3, 5, 'brought up one of his sons rightly. So, there we can understand the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 54, 4, 5, 'background of what David tells Solomon.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 54, 5, 5, 'Acquire wisdom! Acquire understanding!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 54, 6, 5, 'Do not forget nor turn away from the words of my mouth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 54, 7, 5, '"Do not forsake her, and she will guard you;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 54, 8, 5, 'Love her, and she will watch over you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 54, 9, 5, '"The beginning of wisdom is: Acquire wisdom;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 54, 10, 5, 'And with all your acquiring, get understanding.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 54, 11, 5, '"Prize her, and she will exalt you;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 54, 12, 5, 'She will honor you if you embrace her.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 54, 13, 5, '"She will place on your head a garland of grace;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 54, 14, 5, 'She will present you with a crown of beauty."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 54, 15, 5, 'Prov 4:5-9');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 54, 16, 5, 'And when Solomon finally became the king and God asked him one night,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 54, 17, 5, '"What do you want?", he said, "Lord, give me wisdom." Who taught him to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 54, 18, 5, 'pray that prayer? It was David. There we see, it wasn''t Solomon''s own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 54, 19, 5, 'idea; it was David who told him: "Acquire wisdom, acquire understanding!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 54, 20, 5, 'Don''t forget, nor turn away from the words of my mouth. Don''t forsake');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 54, 21, 5, 'wisdom! Wisdom will guard you! Love wisdom, and wisdom will watch over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 54, 22, 5, 'you! The beginning of wisdom is: acquire wisdom." This means the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 54, 23, 5, 'determination to be wise is the first step towards becoming wise (The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 54, 24, 5, 'Living Bible). Determination to be wise is the first step. I''m going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 54, 25, 5, 'get wisdom at any cost. "And with all your acquiring, get understanding.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 54, 26, 5, 'Prize wisdom and she''ll exalt you. She will honor you if you embrace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 54, 27, 5, 'her. She will place on your head a garland of grace and then you''ll be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 54, 28, 5, 'real king. She''ll present you with a crown of beauty." There we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 55, 1, 5, 'understand how Solomon became wise, because his father instructed him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 55, 2, 5, 'Think that we can be fathers like that to our children. David learned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 55, 3, 5, 'through all his folly with his other sons to train up one son right.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 55, 4, 5, 'We saw in our last study how it was David who encouraged Solomon to seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 55, 5, 5, 'for wisdom, and that comes out only in Proverbs 4, so that we understand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 55, 6, 5, 'why Solomon asked God for wisdom when God appeared to him one night and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 55, 7, 5, 'asked him what he wanted (1 Kings 3). Now we know that Solomon was the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 55, 8, 5, 'wisest man that lived, but David was the man after God''s own heart. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 55, 9, 5, 'even though Solomon built the temple of God, we see something in 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 55, 10, 5, 'Chronicles 28:11 which I don''t know if you''ve noticed. It says that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 55, 11, 5, 'David gave to his son Solomon the plan of the porch of the temple, its');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 55, 12, 5, 'buildings, its storehouses, upper rooms, inner rooms, the room for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 55, 13, 5, 'mercy seat, and the plan of all that he had in mind for the courts of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 55, 14, 5, 'the house of the Lord, for the surrounding rooms, and everything. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 55, 15, 5, 'goes on right down the list through 28:18. And then David says in 28:19,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 55, 16, 5, '"All this the Lord made me understand in writing by his hand upon me all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 55, 17, 5, 'the details of this pattern." Now humanly speaking, we would think that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 55, 18, 5, 'if there are two people, you would choose the wiser man to make a plan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 55, 19, 5, 'for the temple, and Solomon was the wiser man. But it''s very interesting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 55, 20, 5, 'that God did not give the plan of the temple to Solomon, the wisest man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 55, 21, 5, 'that lived, but to David, whose brain was not as good as Solomon''s, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 55, 22, 5, 'whose heart was better. And that''s a very important thing for us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 55, 23, 5, 'understand, that when God gives revelation of his will, he does not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 55, 24, 5, 'necessarily give it to the man who is clever, but to the man who is one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 55, 25, 5, 'after his own heart. So we can say that David was the architect and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 55, 26, 5, 'Solomon was only a sort of contractor, doing what the architect told');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 55, 27, 5, 'him. We must never forget that. And even the wisdom that Solomon asked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 55, 28, 5, 'God for, we read in Proverbs 4 that it was David who exhorted him to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 56, 1, 5, 'seek for that wisdom, saying that this wisdom would really give him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 56, 2, 5, 'grace and glory. We read that in Proverbs 4:9. Consider that David was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 56, 3, 5, 'the one who told Solomon about these wonderful New Covenant words called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 56, 4, 5, '"grace" and "glory." He says, "If you seek for wisdom, you''ll get grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 56, 5, 5, 'and glory." So that''s a tremendous thing. And it teaches us, as I said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 56, 6, 5, 'that God looks at the heart. And it''s the man whose heart is right to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 56, 7, 5, 'whom God can give revelation. That''s what we learn from David and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 56, 8, 5, 'Solomon.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 56, 9, 5, 'Hear, my son, and accept my sayings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 56, 10, 5, 'And the years of your life will be many.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 56, 11, 5, 'I have directed you in the way of wisdom;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 56, 12, 5, 'I have led you in upright paths.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 56, 13, 5, 'When you walk, your steps will not be impeded;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 56, 14, 5, 'And if you run, you will not stumble.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 56, 15, 5, 'Take hold of instruction; do not let go.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 56, 16, 5, 'Guard her, for she is your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 56, 17, 5, 'Prov 4:10-13');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 56, 18, 5, 'We find that Solomon, having received the influence of his godly father,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 56, 19, 5, 'now seeks to pass on the same instruction to the next generation. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 56, 20, 5, 'read of Solomon exhorting the next generation, calling them, "My son…."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 56, 21, 5, 'The Living Bible says, "I would have you to learn this great fact...."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 56, 22, 5, 'What is this great fact that Solomon wants us to learn? "...a life of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 56, 23, 5, 'doing what is right is the wisest life there is." The wisest life that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 56, 24, 5, 'any human being can ever live is a life of doing right. And if you live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 56, 25, 5, 'this life of doing right in all situations, turning away from what is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 56, 26, 5, 'wrong and doing what is right, which is the wisest life that one can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 56, 27, 5, 'ever live, then it says, "When you walk, your steps will not be impeded,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 56, 28, 5, 'and if you run, you will not stumble." Or, as the literal translation of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 57, 1, 5, 'the Hebrew of that verse says, "As you go, step by step, I will open up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 57, 2, 5, 'the way before you." That''s the meaning of verse 12 - that if you choose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 57, 3, 5, 'the wisest life which any human being can ever live, which is a life of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 57, 4, 5, 'doing right (in other words, you keep a clear conscience in every step');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 57, 5, 5, 'you take in life), then God''s promise to all those who live by a clear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 57, 6, 5, 'conscience is: that as you move forward, it may look as though the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 57, 7, 5, 'is closed up, but as you move forward, the doors will open by themselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 57, 8, 5, '(like the automatic doors which open by themselves when you come near).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 57, 9, 5, 'And you think the door in front of you is closed? It is. But as you go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 57, 10, 5, 'near it, that opens up too. It is never God''s will that we get stuck');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 57, 11, 5, 'somewhere. We get stuck when we haven''t chosen a life of doing right,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 57, 12, 5, 'when we''ve gone against our conscience somewhere. So there''s a wonderful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 57, 13, 5, 'promise for all those who keep a clear conscience: there will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 57, 14, 5, 'enlargement in your life. "Your way will open up before you" means there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 57, 15, 5, 'will be enlargement and there will be no stumbling. He is able to keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 57, 16, 5, 'us from stumbling. Therefore, Solomon exhorts the next generation in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 57, 17, 5, 'verse 13, "Take hold of instruction and do not let go. Guard her for she');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 57, 18, 5, 'is your life."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 57, 19, 5, 'Do not enter the path of the wicked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 57, 20, 5, 'And do not proceed in the way of evil men.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 57, 21, 5, 'Avoid it, do not pass by it;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 57, 22, 5, 'Turn away from it and pass on.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 57, 23, 5, 'For they cannot sleep unless they do evil;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 57, 24, 5, 'And they are robbed of sleep unless they make someone stumble.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 57, 25, 5, 'For they eat the bread of wickedness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 57, 26, 5, 'And drink the wine of violence.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 57, 27, 5, 'Prov 4:14-17');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 57, 28, 5, '"Do not enter the path of the wicked and do not proceed in the way of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 58, 1, 5, 'evil men." You know that David had already said that in Psalm 1:1,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 58, 2, 5, '"Blessed is the man who does not walk in the council of the ungodly, nor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 58, 3, 5, 'stand in the path of sinners, nor sit in the seat of scoffers." He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 58, 4, 5, 'taught that to Solomon, and now Solomon says the same thing: "Don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 58, 5, 5, 'enter the path of the wicked. Do not proceed in the way of evil men.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 58, 6, 5, 'Avoid it! Do not pass by it. Don''t say, ''I''ll go that way and I''ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 58, 7, 5, 'overcome.''" No, that''s not the way. Avoid it altogether. Run away from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 58, 8, 5, 'temptation and do not proceed in the way of evil men. Turn away from it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 58, 9, 5, 'and pass on. Go some other way. If you find there''s temptation down one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 58, 10, 5, 'street, take another street! That''s what scripture says. Flee youthful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 58, 11, 5, 'lusts. For these evil men, they cannot sleep unless they do evil. So we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 58, 12, 5, 'must stay far away from the way they walk. Don''t even go one step on it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 58, 13, 5, 'Don''t even say, "Well, I want to know what they do." The knowledge of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 58, 14, 5, 'iniquity is not wisdom. The knowledge of sin is not wisdom. We don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 58, 15, 5, 'have to know what all sinful people do. Avoid it. Don''t take one step on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 58, 16, 5, 'it for they are evil; they cannot sleep unless they do something evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 58, 17, 5, 'and they are robbed of sleep unless they make someone stumble. Think of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 58, 18, 5, 'the opposite of that. Think if it can be said about us that they cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 58, 19, 5, 'sleep unless they have done some good to someone during the day. That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 58, 20, 5, 'the opposite of verse 16, that a person cannot sleep unless he has done');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 58, 21, 5, 'some good to someone. If the evil man is the one who cannot sleep unless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 58, 22, 5, 'they do evil, the righteous man is the one who cannot sleep unless he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 58, 23, 5, 'has done some good to someone. They''re robbed of sleep unless they make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 58, 24, 5, 'someone stumble. Think of the opposite of that. They are robbed of sleep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 58, 25, 5, 'unless they really help someone to stand, or they encourage someone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 58, 26, 5, '"For they eat the bread of wickedness and drink the wine of violence."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 58, 27, 5, 'But the path of the righteous is like the light of dawn,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 58, 28, 5, 'That shines brighter and brighter until the full day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 59, 1, 5, 'Prov 4:18');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 59, 2, 5, 'Here''s another fantastic Old Testament verse. There are two beautiful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 59, 3, 5, 'verses in this chapter; one is verse 12, and the other is verse 18. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 59, 4, 5, 'is really a New Covenant promise. The path of the righteous..." We know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 59, 5, 5, 'that a person is righteous only when he comes to faith in Christ, when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 59, 6, 5, 'his sins are forgiven and he''s declared righteous by God, justified with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 59, 7, 5, 'the righteousness of Christ clothing him. But then, it''s not God''s will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 59, 8, 5, 'that his life should be only like the sunrise. It says, "The path of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 59, 9, 5, 'righteous is like the sunrise..." But you know when the sun rises,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 59, 10, 5, 'there''s light, but the sun is still not at its brightest. Think of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 59, 11, 5, 'sun rising in the sky; this light shines brighter and brighter and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 59, 12, 5, 'brighter until the noonday position, when there is perfect brightness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 59, 13, 5, 'We can say the shadows decrease as the sun rises; the shadow of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 59, 14, 5, 'self-life keeps on decreasing, decreasing, decreasing, decreasing, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 59, 15, 5, 'finally the sun is overhead where the shadow disappears altogether. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 59, 16, 5, 'that is God''s will for us. From the time we are born again, it is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 59, 17, 5, 'God''s will that any child of his should have an up and down experience.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 59, 18, 5, 'Now, most Christians have an up and down experience, and when we hear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 59, 19, 5, 'that other people have up and down experiences, and some preacher has an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 59, 20, 5, 'up and down experience, then we are comforted in our defeat. We get our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 59, 21, 5, 'standard from some carnal believer or some carnal preacher instead of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 59, 22, 5, 'from the word of God, which says that the path of the righteous is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 59, 23, 5, 'up and down. It''s not bright and then dark, and then bright again and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 59, 24, 5, 'then dark again. On top of the mountain, then down in the dumps.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 59, 25, 5, 'Praising the Lord and rejoicing, then gloomy and miserable the next day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 59, 26, 5, 'If that''s our experience, I just want to say that''s not God''s will. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 59, 27, 5, 'is not the path of the righteous. If a person is walking that way, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 59, 28, 5, 'can clearly say he is not walking the path of the righteous.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 60, 1, 5, 'The path of the righteous is called, in the New Testament, "The New and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 60, 2, 5, 'Living Way." It''s not a doctrine to understand; it''s the path of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 60, 3, 5, 'righteous. Now, we hear of people who believe in the New and Living Way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 60, 4, 5, 'I got a letter this week about someone who spoke about "New and Living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 60, 5, 5, 'Way brothers and sisters." What is a New and Living Way brother or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 60, 6, 5, 'sister? Not somebody who sits in Christian Fellowship Church. Not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 60, 7, 5, 'someone who understands the doctrine, but someone who is not going up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 60, 8, 5, 'and down. A person who is going up and down is not in the New and Living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 60, 9, 5, 'Way; that''s the old dead way. The New and Living Way is brighter,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 60, 10, 5, 'brighter, brighter, brighter. That is the ONLY New and Living Way the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 60, 11, 5, 'New Testament speaks about: The path of the righteous. This "down in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 60, 12, 5, 'dumps" business only proves that we have understood the doctrine, but we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 60, 13, 5, 'haven''t gotten onto the actual way at all. The path of the righteous is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 60, 14, 5, 'like the sunrise that shines brighter and brighter; and the sun doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 60, 15, 5, 'go back and forth. It doesn''t change its mind suddenly. It just keeps');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 60, 16, 5, 'going steadily, and that is God''s will for our lives, brothers and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 60, 17, 5, 'sisters. That is the will of God that it becomes better and better and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 60, 18, 5, 'better and better. That means I get more and more light on what dwells');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 60, 19, 5, 'in my flesh. I get light on what dwells in my flesh now which I did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 60, 20, 5, 'know 6 months ago. If we are not in that condition, we are not on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 60, 21, 5, 'path of the righteous. Let''s learn that very clearly so that we don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 60, 22, 5, 'deceive ourselves by just understanding some doctrine. No; it is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 60, 23, 5, 'path where the light gets brighter and brighter and brighter and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 60, 24, 5, 'brighter, where I get more and more light on my flesh. Or like 1 John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 60, 25, 5, '1:7 says, "If we walk in the light as God is in the light..." God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 60, 26, 5, 'light, and if I walk in that light, the closer I get to God; the light');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 60, 27, 5, 'is getting brighter and brighter. That means I''m getting more and more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 60, 28, 5, 'light on what dwells in my flesh. I''m able to put more and more to death');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 61, 1, 5, 'in my life and I''m becoming wiser. That is how Jesus grew in wisdom: he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 61, 2, 5, 'walked the New and Living Way. It says in Luke 2:52 that he grew in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 61, 3, 5, 'wisdom. And that''s what Solomon is saying here, inspired by the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 61, 4, 5, 'Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 61, 5, 5, 'It says in 2 Corinthians 3:18 that the Holy Spirit shows us the glory of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 61, 6, 5, 'Jesus. That glory is a light, and it becomes brighter and brighter in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 61, 7, 5, 'our life as the Holy Spirit changes us into that same likeness from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 61, 8, 5, 'glory to glory. Proverbs 4:18 is the Old Testament verse which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 61, 9, 5, 'corresponds to 2 Corinthians 3:18. If you want to understand this verse,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 61, 10, 5, 'you have to turn to the corresponding verse in the New Testament, 2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 61, 11, 5, 'Corinthians 3:18, and see there, "...from glory to glory to glory to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 61, 12, 5, 'glory." Brothers and sisters, if we accept this substandard, half');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 61, 13, 5, 'depressed, half gloomy life as God''s will for our lives, we''ll always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 61, 14, 5, 'live there, defeated and thinking that''s the New and Living Way. That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 61, 15, 5, 'garbage! Throw it into the garbage bin. Say, "I know the doctrine but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 61, 16, 5, 'I''m not walking the way." If we walk the way, this is it. There is no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 61, 17, 5, 'question of someone finding you in a bad mood one day. There''s no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 61, 18, 5, 'question of bad moods on the path of the righteous. No. There are many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 61, 19, 5, 'things we may not have light on. For those things, we''ll get light as we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 61, 20, 5, 'walk along, but there''s no question of going back, or of backsliding, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 61, 21, 5, 'of going back to some sin which we had once conquered. That''s not the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 61, 22, 5, 'path of the righteous. No; far from it. So that''s something we have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 61, 23, 5, 'keep very clearly before us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 61, 24, 5, 'The way of the wicked is like darkness;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 61, 25, 5, 'They do not know over what they stumble.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 61, 26, 5, 'Prov 4:19');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 61, 27, 5, 'In contrast to verse 18, verse 19 is another path: the Old and Dead Way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 61, 28, 5, '"The way of the wicked," it''s called; it''s like darkness. You know how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 62, 1, 5, 'it is when you''re walking in the darkness. It''s all pitch dark, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 62, 2, 5, 'can''t see a thing, and you''re walking steadily - and suddenly you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 62, 3, 5, 'stumble. And then you get up and you''re walking steadily for some time -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 62, 4, 5, 'and suddenly you stumble again. You''re not stumbling all the time. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 62, 5, 5, 'this up and down and up and down and up and down experience, stumbling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 62, 6, 5, 'and getting up, stumbling and getting up. That is called here "the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 62, 7, 5, 'of the wicked." That''s not the New and Living Way. That''s the way of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 62, 8, 5, 'person who''s not wholehearted, who hasn''t learned to hate his own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 62, 9, 5, 'self-life, who hasn''t learned to hate the flesh. That''s why he''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 62, 10, 5, 'stumbling. There''s darkness there. Now, darkness doesn''t mean not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 62, 11, 5, 'knowing God''s will; even Jesus did not know God''s will in the Garden of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 62, 12, 5, 'Gethsemane. He said, "Father, if it is your will..." which means he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 62, 13, 5, 'didn''t know God''s will. "Should I drink this cup or not drink it?" So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 62, 14, 5, 'darkness does not mean perplexity concerning God''s will. Darkness means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 62, 15, 5, 'that I don''t keep a clear conscience. That''s what brings darkness into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 62, 16, 5, 'my life. I don''t hate myself. I hate the other person instead of hating');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 62, 17, 5, 'myself. That''s darkness! Whoever hates his brother walks in darkness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 62, 18, 5, 'Whoever hates himself and puts his own flesh to death walks in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 62, 19, 5, 'light. All those who are critical and judgmental of others, they''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 62, 20, 5, 'walking in darkness. They haven''t understood to judge themselves. Then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 62, 21, 5, 'of course they stumble and get up, stumble and get up. They''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 62, 22, 5, 'depressed. They''re happy one day and down in the dumps the next day. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 62, 23, 5, 'have to see very clearly what God''s word says in verse 18 and 19. Here''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 62, 24, 5, 'the New and Living Way and there''s the Old and Dead Way, and we have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 62, 25, 5, 'choose which way we want to go. But the way of the righteous is like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 62, 26, 5, 'light, and that''s the way God wants us to walk, to be wholehearted and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 62, 27, 5, 'to hate only my own self-life, nothing else, no one else. Only my own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 62, 28, 5, 'flesh. And then it gets brighter and brighter and brighter and brighter.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 63, 1, 5, 'More and more victory, more and more light on areas in which I don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 63, 2, 5, 'know anything yet. It''s wonderful, this Old Testament book which teaches');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 63, 3, 5, 'us about the New and Living Way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 63, 4, 5, 'My son, give attention to my words;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 63, 5, 5, 'Incline your ear to my sayings.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 63, 6, 5, 'Do not let them depart from your sight;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 63, 7, 5, 'Keep them in the midst of your heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 63, 8, 5, 'For they are life to those who find them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 63, 9, 5, 'And health to all their body.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 63, 10, 5, 'Prov 4:20-22');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 63, 11, 5, '"My son," (notice that word of submission to spiritual authority) - "My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 63, 12, 5, 'son, give attention to my words…" Those who have not learned to submit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 63, 13, 5, 'to spiritual authority can never come and understand wisdom. The book of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 63, 14, 5, 'Proverbs, more than any other book in the entire Old Testament, speaks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 63, 15, 5, 'about "My son...", "My son...", "My son..." It''s the submission of a son');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 63, 16, 5, 'to a spiritual father, submitting to spiritual authority. Solomon says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 63, 17, 5, '"My son, give attention to my words. Incline your ear to my sayings. Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 63, 18, 5, 'not let them depart from your sight. Keep them in the midst of your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 63, 19, 5, 'heart." Notice the emphasis again; it''s not in your mind. It''s not a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 63, 20, 5, 'question of understanding it. He got instructions from a man who was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 63, 21, 5, 'man after God''s own heart, his father David. And he told him to keep it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 63, 22, 5, 'in the midst, in the central place in your heart. Don''t just think that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 63, 23, 5, 'you can just understand and explain the doctrine. That doesn''t prove');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 63, 24, 5, 'that we are any better than the devil. But to instead keep it in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 63, 25, 5, 'midst of your heart, the central place.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 63, 26, 5, 'And when we do that, it not only makes our path brighter and brighter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 63, 27, 5, 'and brighter, that our spiritual life goes from glory to glory to glory');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 63, 28, 5, 'to glory; it also says in verse 22, not only is it life (that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 64, 1, 5, 'spiritual life, eternal life, the divine nature) to all those who find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 64, 2, 5, 'them, but secondly, it is also help to their whole body. The word of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 64, 3, 5, 'brings physical healing too. Obedience to God''s word brings spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 64, 4, 5, 'life and physical health. That''s what God''s word says. According to your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 64, 5, 5, 'faith be it unto you. Spiritual health and physical health. That''s why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 64, 6, 5, 'when we get sick or when we have a physical problem, the first thing we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 64, 7, 5, 'need to do is to ask ourselves, "Have I disobeyed God''s word somewhere,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 64, 8, 5, 'that health is not coming to my body?" That''s a question we need to ask');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 64, 9, 5, 'ourselves according to this verse.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 64, 10, 5, 'Watch over your heart with all diligence,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 64, 11, 5, 'For from it flow the springs of life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 64, 12, 5, 'Put away from you a deceitful mouth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 64, 13, 5, 'And put devious speech far from you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 64, 14, 5, 'Let your eyes look directly ahead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 64, 15, 5, 'And let your gaze be fixed straight in front of you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 64, 16, 5, 'Watch the path of your feet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 64, 17, 5, 'And all your ways will be established.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 64, 18, 5, 'Do not turn to the right nor to the left;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 64, 19, 5, 'Turn your foot from evil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 64, 20, 5, 'Prov 4:23-27');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 64, 21, 5, '"Watch over your heart with all diligence." Notice again, the emphasis');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 64, 22, 5, 'on the heart. "From the heart flow all the springs of life." It''s just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 64, 23, 5, 'like Jesus said, "Out of the abundance of the heart, the mouth speaks."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 64, 24, 5, 'That''s why after speaking about the heart in verse 23, he speaks about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 64, 25, 5, 'the mouth in verse 24: "Put away from you a deceitful mouth, put devious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 64, 26, 5, 'lips far from you," but he begins with the heart. And you really see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 64, 27, 5, 'that Solomon had some supernatural revelation that he could speak about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 64, 28, 5, 'these New Covenant concepts. "Watch your heart," he says. It''s not just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 65, 1, 5, 'a question of doing right on the outside. It''s not just a question of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 65, 2, 5, 'saying, "I''ve kept the commandments, but why am I still sick in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 65, 3, 5, 'body?" Solomon says to just look into your heart and see if there''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 65, 4, 5, 'something wrong there, some wrong attitude towards someone, some wrong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 65, 5, 5, 'motive in something that you''re doing. Watch your heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 65, 6, 5, 'Then he says to be careful with your mouth. Like James says, if a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 65, 7, 5, 'has religion, the proof of it is that he can control his tongue. If a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 65, 8, 5, 'person cannot control his tongue, James 1:26 says that the person''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 65, 9, 5, 'religion is worth zero. Any person who cannot control his tongue,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 65, 10, 5, 'whatever doctrine under the sun he preaches, God''s word says in James');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 65, 11, 5, '1:26 that his religion is worth zero. A person who cannot control his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 65, 12, 5, 'temper, who cannot control his tongue, his religion is worth nothing. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 65, 13, 5, 'has absolutely only doctrine. "Put away from you a crooked mouth." No');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 65, 14, 5, 'crooked or crafty speech or guile (saying things to give a wrong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 65, 15, 5, 'impression), deceitful mouth, devious lips.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 65, 16, 5, 'Then he says to watch your eyes. This is just like the Sermon on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 65, 17, 5, 'Mount. Watch your eyes. Look directly ahead and let your gaze be fixed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 65, 18, 5, 'straight in front of you. Don''t look to that side where you are tempted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 65, 19, 5, 'to look, because there''s something attractive there which you know God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 65, 20, 5, 'has forbidden on that side. Don''t look to that side. Look straight in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 65, 21, 5, 'front.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 65, 22, 5, 'Notice here it gets to the heart of spirituality. Watch your heart, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 65, 23, 5, 'says. Watch your tongue. Watch your eyes. And then watch the path of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 65, 24, 5, 'your feet: where you go, the homes you visit, the type of people you go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 65, 25, 5, 'and spend time with. If you can watch these: your heart (verse 23), your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 65, 26, 5, 'tongue (verse 24), your eyes (verse 25), your feet (verse 26, that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 65, 27, 5, 'turn your feet away from evil, and don''t turn right or left from the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 65, 28, 5, 'and Living Way), you''ll be a spiritual man, growing in wisdom. You see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 66, 1, 5, 'how much of this is really New Testament stuff? And so you see there in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 66, 2, 5, 'verses 26-27, watch each step, and think before you move forward, "Is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 66, 3, 5, 'this a right path for me to go?" Walk on that New and Living Way. Don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 66, 4, 5, 'turn to the right or left. That''s the time when you hear the voice of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 66, 5, 5, 'the Holy Spirit behind you saying, "No, you have missed the road there.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 66, 6, 5, 'Turn. Turn back." And when you hear that voice saying, "Humble yourself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 66, 7, 5, 'Go and set that right. Turn back to the New and Living Way," come back');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 66, 8, 5, 'to the New and Living Way. Don''t turn right or left. Don''t get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 66, 9, 5, 'sidetracked. Keep your goal. So many people start off well, but then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 66, 10, 5, 'they get sidetracked somewhere instead of keeping as their goal: "I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 66, 11, 5, 'to become more and more like Jesus as each year goes by in my life."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 66, 12, 5, 'That is my goal in life. I press towards the mark like Paul says: " One');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 66, 13, 5, 'thing I do." I don''t have twenty-five things to do, only one thing: "I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 66, 14, 5, 'press toward the mark for the prize of the high calling of God in Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 66, 15, 5, 'Jesus." That''s the meaning here. Don''t turn to the right or left. "Turn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 66, 16, 5, 'your foot from evil" means to pull back your foot from danger and sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 66, 17, 6, 'Chapter 5 Chapter 5');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 66, 18, 6, 'My son, give attention to my wisdom,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 66, 19, 6, 'Incline your ear to my understanding;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 66, 20, 6, 'Prov 5:1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 66, 21, 6, '"Incline your ear to my understanding," means "bow down your ear." That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 66, 22, 6, 'teaches us that to get spiritual wisdom, we have to humble ourselves. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 66, 23, 6, 'have to bow down our ear like James 1:21 says, "Receive with meekness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 66, 24, 6, 'the engrafted word." The word can be grafted into me if I receive it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 66, 25, 6, 'with meekness, like a branch grafted into another tree and the two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 66, 26, 6, 'become one. The word can be engrafted into me if I receive it with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 66, 27, 6, 'meekness. If I don''t receive it with meekness, it''s like the seed that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 66, 28, 6, 'falls on the path and the birds can take it away the next day. It''s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 67, 1, 6, 'engrafted. I must receive it with meekness and incline my ear and say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 67, 2, 6, '"Lord, I humble myself before your word. I want to tremble at your word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 67, 3, 6, 'Teach me." Humble yourself. Humble your understanding particularly -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 67, 4, 6, 'your human cleverness. Incline your ear. Bow down.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 67, 5, 6, 'Now he gives us a lot of instruction in the next two or three chapters');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 67, 6, 6, 'about our relationship with the opposite sex. It''s very interesting that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 67, 7, 6, 'Solomon has such a lot to say about relationships with the opposite sex.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 67, 8, 6, 'This is a very important area where we need wisdom, particularly young');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 67, 9, 6, 'people. The book of Proverbs is mainly written for young people, and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 67, 10, 6, 'encourage them to read the book of Proverbs. When you get into your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 67, 11, 6, 'teenage years, read the book of Proverbs again and again and again and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 67, 12, 6, 'again; both young men and young women.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 67, 13, 6, 'That you may observe discretion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 67, 14, 6, 'And your lips may reserve knowledge.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 67, 15, 6, 'Prov 5:2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 67, 16, 6, 'In relation to the opposite sex, the first thing he says is, "That you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 67, 17, 6, 'may observe discretion." Discretion means to be discrete. That means to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 67, 18, 6, 'be a little reserved. You can be free with people of your own sex (the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 67, 19, 6, 'sisters with the sisters, and the brothers with the brothers), but when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 67, 20, 6, 'it comes to the opposite sex, be a little reserved. That''s the meaning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 67, 21, 6, 'of discretion. That''s the first thing he says. He says, "My son, do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 67, 22, 6, 'really want some wisdom? Do you want to humble yourself? Do you want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 67, 23, 6, 'bow down your ears? Then learn something. Be a little reserved in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 67, 24, 6, 'relationship with the opposite sex."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 67, 25, 6, 'Then he says, "that your lips may reserve knowledge." That means don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 67, 26, 6, 'use your tongue so freely to crack jokes and be so familiar with people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 67, 27, 6, 'of the opposite sex. It''s just practical wisdom. Don''t become so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 67, 28, 6, 'familiar. Be careful. He doesn''t say to be a monk and never see people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 68, 1, 6, 'of the opposite sex, he just says to be a little careful. Keep a little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 68, 2, 6, 'aloof. And if you find someone is being too free with you, just be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 68, 3, 6, 'little cold so that they learn to keep their distance, and you won''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 68, 4, 6, 'regret it in later years. And if you are a brother desiring to be a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 68, 5, 6, 'of God, have this testimony: that you are a brother who is reserved with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 68, 6, 6, 'the opposite sex; that those of the opposite sex feel that you''re a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 68, 7, 6, 'little cold and aloof towards them. I''ve heard that accusation many,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 68, 8, 6, 'many times against me. I hope to live in that accusation all my life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 68, 9, 6, 'that I am a little aloof and a little cold. Be a man of God. Keep that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 68, 10, 6, 'distance. Don''t be too familiar. Take the book of Proverbs seriously. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 68, 11, 6, 'you are wholehearted, take it seriously. Be a little reserved and keep a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 68, 12, 6, 'little distance. If you want to crack jokes, crack them with people of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 68, 13, 6, 'your own sex, not with people of the opposite sex. Be careful. Now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 68, 14, 6, 'that''s not what the world says. The world says, "Oh, you''re too narrow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 68, 15, 6, 'minded." Alright, you can choose the way of the world if you like, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 68, 16, 6, 'just see what will happen after a few years. You''ll come back in sorrow,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 68, 17, 6, 'wishing you had listened to the words of wisdom in the book of Proverbs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 68, 18, 6, 'That''s what he says later on.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 68, 19, 6, 'For the lips of an adulteress drip honey');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 68, 20, 6, 'And smoother than oil is her speech;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 68, 21, 6, 'Prov 5:3');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 68, 22, 6, 'Next, he speaks about the lips of a strange woman (margin). They drop');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 68, 23, 6, 'honey. This is the flirting type who says so many nice things to you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 68, 24, 6, 'and it''s difficult to keep that reserve. "Smoother than oil is her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 68, 25, 6, 'speech." When you see oil on the ground, what do you do? You walk');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 68, 26, 6, 'carefully. When you find that someone''s speech is smoother than oil,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 68, 27, 6, 'young men, be careful. Many have slipped here and fallen. Flattery.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 68, 28, 6, 'Honey flowing out from her lips - "Oh, you look so nice" or "You look so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 69, 1, 6, 'handsome." Finished. That''s enough to knock out some young men, stupid');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 69, 2, 6, 'young men who haven''t taken the word of God seriously. Listen and be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 69, 3, 6, 'careful. We speak very frankly in the church about these things because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 69, 4, 6, 'we want to protect you. I also want to say that whenever you read about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 69, 5, 6, 'this strange woman in Proverbs, remember that it also refers to Babylon,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 69, 6, 6, 'the harlot; the mother of harlots. It refers to that flirtatious young');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 69, 7, 6, 'girl who''s trying to tempt you and it also refers to Babylon which is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 69, 8, 6, 'trying to tempt you and to lead you away from the true church, the bride');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 69, 9, 6, 'of Christ. In Babylon they also speak nice things. Rebuke and correction');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 69, 10, 6, 'are not found in that mother of harlots. It''s found only in the true');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 69, 11, 6, 'bride.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 69, 12, 6, 'But in the end she is bitter as wormwood,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 69, 13, 6, 'Sharp as a two-edged sword.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 69, 14, 6, 'Her feet go down to death,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 69, 15, 6, 'Her steps take hold of Sheol.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 69, 16, 6, 'She does not ponder the path of life;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 69, 17, 6, 'Her ways are unstable, she does not know it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 69, 18, 6, 'Prov 5:4-6');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 69, 19, 6, 'This is what happens finally. Did you know the devil has a two-edged');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 69, 20, 6, 'sword? We know what God''s two-edged sword is. God''s two-edged sword is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 69, 21, 6, 'the word of God which brings life; which cuts out the cancer and removes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 69, 22, 6, 'the evil. "The lips of a strange woman drip honey and smoother than oil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 69, 23, 6, 'is her speech." It all sounds so nice, but in the end she''s bitter as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 69, 24, 6, 'wormwood, sharp as a two-edged sword. The devil''s two-edged sword is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 69, 25, 6, 'strange woman who leads you away from God. Young men, be careful. "Her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 69, 26, 6, 'feet go down to death, her steps take hold of Sheol." Through flattery,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 69, 27, 6, 'she leads people to Hell. Through rebuke and correction, God''s word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 69, 28, 6, 'leads people to heaven, but through flattery, Babylon leads people into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 70, 1, 6, 'eternal darkness. She does not understand the path of life and people in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 70, 2, 6, 'Babylon do not understand the path of life. Their ways are unstable and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 70, 3, 6, 'they do not know it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 70, 4, 6, 'Now then, my sons, listen to me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 70, 5, 6, 'And do not depart from the words of my mouth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 70, 6, 6, 'Keep your way far from her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 70, 7, 6, 'And do not go near the door of her house,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 70, 8, 6, 'Or you will give your vigor to others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 70, 9, 6, 'And your years to the cruel one;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 70, 10, 6, 'And strangers will be filled with your strength');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 70, 11, 6, 'And your hard-earned goods will go to the house of an alien;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 70, 12, 6, 'And you groan at your final end,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 70, 13, 6, 'When your flesh and your body are consumed;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 70, 14, 6, 'Prov 5:7-11');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 70, 15, 6, 'Whenever you see a flirtatious type of girl, keep well clear of her.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 70, 16, 6, 'There''s oil there on the floor. There''s honey dripping from her mouth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 70, 17, 6, 'Be careful! Keep your way far from her! You may not be able to avoid her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 70, 18, 6, 'if you''re in college or school or work with her, but steer clear. Be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 70, 19, 6, 'little cold. Be a little aloof. Be a little reserved. Be a man of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 70, 20, 6, 'And don''t go near the door of her house. Look at this exhortation. Don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 70, 21, 6, 'go near her house. Avoid it, lest finally, you give your vigor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 70, 22, 6, '(strength) to others, and your years to the cruel one (that''s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 70, 23, 6, 'devil). And strangers will be filled with your physical strength and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 70, 24, 6, 'your hard-earned goods will go to the house of an alien. In other words,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 70, 25, 6, 'if I were to paraphrase those words, this woman finally gets married to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 70, 26, 6, 'you and ruins your money. And you groan at your latter end when your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 70, 27, 6, 'flesh and your body are consumed. Sexual sin finally destroys the body');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 70, 28, 6, 'and there are different degrees of it. Young men can play the fool in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 71, 1, 6, 'small ways in this area of sex. Their conscience disturbs them and they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 71, 2, 6, 'know it''s wrong. They know there''s something wrong there. It''s sexual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 71, 3, 6, 'sin. But they say, "It''s not so serious." It''s destroying the body. Your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 71, 4, 6, 'flesh and your body will be consumed, because you''re violating God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 71, 5, 6, 'laws for the sake of that dirty habit. There are different degrees. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 71, 6, 6, 'can go a little further, a little further, a little further and finally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 71, 7, 6, 'there are filthy forms of perversion. Avoid it right at the outset!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 71, 8, 6, 'Avoid it, lest your flesh and your body are consumed and you groan at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 71, 9, 6, 'your latter end and you waste your money. It''s speaking of avoiding');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 71, 10, 6, 'prostitutes and avoiding all types of women who seek to lead you astray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 71, 11, 6, 'from God. Keep a reserve. Speak to them, but keep a little reserve. Keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 71, 12, 6, 'a little aloof. You have to keep your heart for God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 71, 13, 6, 'And you say, "How I have hated instruction!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 71, 14, 6, 'And my heart spurned reproof!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 71, 15, 6, '"I have not listened to the voice of my teachers,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 71, 16, 6, 'Nor inclined my ear to my instructors!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 71, 17, 6, '"I was almost in utter ruin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 71, 18, 6, 'In the midst of the assembly and congregation."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 71, 19, 6, 'Prov 5:12-14');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 71, 20, 6, 'Then finally, when you suffer, you say, "How I have hated instruction."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 71, 21, 6, 'This is many years later. This teenager didn''t care for what those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 71, 22, 6, 'were older to him advised him. Finally, he suffers and his body is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 71, 23, 6, 'consumed. He gets some sickness, and he says, "I wish I had listened.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 71, 24, 6, 'How my heart spurned reproof." Brother, I want you to think of verse 12.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 71, 25, 6, 'Does your heart spurn correction? Our reaction to correction is a pretty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 71, 26, 6, 'good test of our spiritual condition when someone who is above us in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 71, 27, 6, 'Lord corrects us. It''s not a question of how pure you are on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 71, 28, 6, 'outside. Outwardly, you don''t spurn it. You act humble and you say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 72, 1, 6, '"Thank you brother." But in your heart, you don''t take it seriously. Be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 72, 2, 6, 'careful. One day, calamity can strike. Reproofs are the way of life. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 72, 3, 6, 'way of reproof and correction is the way of life. We come to that in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 72, 4, 6, 'Proverbs many times. Proverbs speaks about wisdom and I''ll tell you this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 72, 5, 6, '- one of the great contrasts in the book of Proverbs between Babylon,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 72, 6, 6, 'the strange woman, and Jerusalem, the bride, is flattery and reproof.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 72, 7, 6, 'Flattery is found with the strange woman, and reproof is found with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 72, 8, 6, 'church. Flattery has never led anybody to wisdom. Reproof and correction');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 72, 9, 6, 'have led many people to wisdom. And so, what''s your reaction to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 72, 10, 6, 'correction? Those who hate correction are in danger.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 72, 11, 6, 'Verse 13 says, "I have not listened to the voice of my teachers, and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 72, 12, 6, 'have not inclined my heart (humbled myself) to my spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 72, 13, 6, 'instructors." Who is your spiritual instructor? First of all, your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 72, 14, 6, 'father and your mother. Your first spiritual instructors are your father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 72, 15, 6, 'and your mother! Listen to them! Proverbs says that many times. You,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 72, 16, 6, 'young man, you who think you know everything and think you''re very smart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 72, 17, 6, 'and that your father and mother are old and don''t know anything, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 72, 18, 6, 'don''t know the first thing about wisdom. Wisdom is first of all humbling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 72, 19, 6, 'yourself and listening to those whom God has placed over you in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 72, 20, 6, 'home - your father and mother. Then when you belong in the church,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 72, 21, 6, 'listen to those who are elder to you spiritually - not anyone who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 72, 22, 6, 'older to you in age, but one you can inwardly acknowledge as someone who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 72, 23, 6, 'is spiritually ahead of you. Whether you''re young or old in age makes no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 72, 24, 6, 'difference. If you accept a brother as an elder brother, then listen to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 72, 25, 6, 'him. If you don''t accept it, then that''s another thing, but God gives us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 72, 26, 6, 'older brothers for our protection; and he gives husbands as protection');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 72, 27, 6, 'for wives. There are three relationships like this: parents to children,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 72, 28, 6, 'older brothers to younger brothers, and husbands to wives. How do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 73, 1, 6, 'take a word of correction as a younger brother from an older brother, as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 73, 2, 6, 'a child from a parent, or as a wife from a husband? Can you take a word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 73, 3, 6, 'of correction from your husband and not despise it? Can you take a word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 73, 4, 6, 'of correction from your parents and accept it? Can you take correction');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 73, 5, 6, 'from an older brother and accept it? Then you''re on the way of life. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 73, 6, 6, 'doesn''t just apply to sexual sin, but so many areas. The way of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 73, 7, 6, 'correction is the way of life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 73, 8, 6, 'Verse 14 says that because I have not listened to the voice of my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 73, 9, 6, 'teachers, "I was almost in utter ruin in the midst of the assembly and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 73, 10, 6, 'congregation." This means that God allowed me to be disgraced and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 73, 11, 6, 'humiliated even publicly. And the ministry that I could have had in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 73, 12, 6, 'assembly and the congregation, I lost because I did not take correction');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 73, 13, 6, 'seriously. I wanted to listen to those who flatter me and say, "You''re a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 73, 14, 6, 'wonderful brother," and "We''re all ready for the rapture. Jesus is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 73, 15, 6, 'coming, and we''re all going to be with him." We sit and listen to that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 73, 16, 6, 'and we don''t realize which way we are going. We need the word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 73, 17, 6, 'correction! Otherwise, we''ll end up in ruin and we''ll lose the ministry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 73, 18, 6, 'God has for us in the church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 73, 19, 6, 'Drink water from your own cistern');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 73, 20, 6, 'And fresh water from your own well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 73, 21, 6, 'Should your springs be dispersed abroad,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 73, 22, 6, 'Streams of water in the streets?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 73, 23, 6, 'Let them be yours alone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 73, 24, 6, 'And not for strangers with you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 73, 25, 6, 'Let your fountain be blessed,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 73, 26, 6, 'And rejoice in the wife of your youth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 73, 27, 6, 'As a loving hind and a graceful doe,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 73, 28, 6, 'Let her breasts satisfy you at all times;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 74, 1, 6, 'Be exhilarated always with her love.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 74, 2, 6, 'For why should you, my son, be exhilarated with an adulteress');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 74, 3, 6, 'And embrace the bosom of a foreigner?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 74, 4, 6, 'For the ways of a man are before the eyes of the Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 74, 5, 6, 'And He watches all his paths.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 74, 6, 6, 'His own iniquities will capture the wicked,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 74, 7, 6, 'And he will be held with the cords of his sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 74, 8, 6, 'He will die for lack of instruction,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 74, 9, 6, 'And in the greatness of his folly he will go astray.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 74, 10, 6, 'Prov 5:15-23');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 74, 11, 6, 'These verses speak particularly to married people. First, a few words of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 74, 12, 6, 'exhortation to young teenagers and young people in their twenties, now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 74, 13, 6, 'to married people. There are words of exhortation here for married');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 74, 14, 6, 'people. "Drink water from your own cistern" means that you have a well');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 74, 15, 6, 'in your own house. Don''t go to somebody else''s well. Be satisfied with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 74, 16, 6, 'drinking water from the well you have in your own house. In other words,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 74, 17, 6, 'God has given you a wife. Be happy with her! Don''t go around looking at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 74, 18, 6, 'other peoples'' wives. Don''t go around admiring other peoples'' wives. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 74, 19, 6, 'say, "Well, I never do that." Just a minute. Have you ever told your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 74, 20, 6, 'wife something like this: "Do you know what she does for her husband?"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 74, 21, 6, 'What is that? That''s adultery in the mind. It''s covetousness. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 74, 22, 6, 'coveting someone else''s wife. You think, "She is better than my wife."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 74, 23, 6, 'What is that? It''s sin. So what if she does that for her husband? You be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 74, 24, 6, 'satisfied with the one God has given you, with all her limitations and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 74, 25, 6, 'all her weaknesses and all her good points. That''s the one God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 74, 26, 6, 'chosen for you. And those who are newly married, I want to exhort you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 74, 27, 6, 'You husbands, think to be able to live all through your life without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 74, 28, 6, 'ever, ever, ever telling your wife the good qualities of some other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 75, 1, 6, 'sister. Be satisfied with the one God has given you. "Drink from your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 75, 2, 6, 'own cistern and fresh water from your own well." In other words, your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 75, 3, 6, 'relationship with your wife should be that you are in love and you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 75, 4, 6, 'fool around with other women. That''s the meaning of verse 16 - "Should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 75, 5, 6, 'your springs be dispersed abroad and your streams of water in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 75, 6, 6, 'streets?" Don''t be interested in other women down other streets. Be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 75, 7, 6, 'satisfied with the well God has put in your own house! It''s a tremendous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 75, 8, 6, 'word of warning and exhortation to married people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 75, 9, 6, 'He goes on in verses 18 and 19 to say, "Let your fountain be blessed and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 75, 10, 6, 'rejoice in the wife of your youth. As a loving hind and a graceful doe,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 75, 11, 6, 'let her breasts satisfy you at all times. Be exhilarated always with her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 75, 12, 6, 'love." What that basically means is be thrilled with loving your wife -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 75, 13, 6, 'the wife who you married when she was young and you were young, the wife');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 75, 14, 6, 'of your youth. Now you''re not young and she''s not young; she''s not as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 75, 15, 6, 'attractive as she looked twenty years ago when you married her, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 75, 16, 6, 'that''s why some people want to turn their eyes and look at some other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 75, 17, 6, 'attractive young women. That proves right from the beginning that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 75, 18, 6, 'were not spiritual. They did not understand that beauty is a temporary,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 75, 19, 6, 'empty thing that passes away. They never understood that. They got taken');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 75, 20, 6, 'up with beauty and when their wife lost her beauty, they became');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 75, 21, 6, 'interested in other women. It''s a terrific warning! Rejoice in the wife');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 75, 22, 6, 'of your youth. And it says here in the margin, "Be intoxicated with her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 75, 23, 6, 'love." What a word. Literally the word here is "intoxicated." You know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 75, 24, 6, 'the man who gets drunk? He gets so drunk he just wants to drink more and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 75, 25, 6, 'more, and every time he passes by the saloon, he wants to go and have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 75, 26, 6, 'another drink and another drink and he''s never tired! He had one in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 75, 27, 6, 'morning and at noon and it''s night now and he wants another drink at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 75, 28, 6, 'saloon. Think to love your wife like that. Just think of that drunken');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 76, 1, 6, 'man as an example of the way to love your wife. It says you just get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 76, 2, 6, 'taken up with her morning, noon, and night. You have no time for other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 76, 3, 6, 'things. This drunken man doesn''t even have time to go to work, he''s so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 76, 4, 6, 'taken up with his intoxication. Think to be so taken up that we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 76, 5, 6, 'absolutely no time or space in our heart to be taken up with any other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 76, 6, 6, 'woman. It''s very down to earth and practical. "Be taken up with her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 76, 7, 6, 'embrace and her love." That means be occupied with loving her and seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 76, 8, 6, 'to do that more and more as Christ loved the church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 76, 9, 6, 'Then he goes on and says here in verse 20, "For why should you, my son,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 76, 10, 6, 'be exhilarated with a strange woman and embrace the bosom of a foreigner');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 76, 11, 6, '(the one whom God has not given you)?" And then he gives a warning: "For');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 76, 12, 6, 'the ways of a man (one translation says "the ways of all husbands") are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 76, 13, 6, 'before the eyes of the Lord." The Lord is watching all husbands even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 76, 14, 6, 'when their wives are not watching them. That''s the meaning here. Your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 76, 15, 6, 'wife is not watching you at that moment, but the Lord is watching you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 76, 16, 6, 'brother. And "He''s watching all his ways" means that long before it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 76, 17, 6, 'speaks about the outward action in the second part of verse 21 (watching');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 76, 18, 6, 'the man''s paths), he watches the ways of his heart. Before the man ever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 76, 19, 6, 'takes a path, there are ways in his heart. He sits and plans, "I think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 76, 20, 6, 'I''ll just go that way" or "I''ll maybe drop in and visit that person",');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 76, 21, 6, 'and the Lord is already watching. This thing that''s going on in the mind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 76, 22, 6, 'of this husband, the Lord is watching and the Lord doesn''t stop him. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 76, 23, 6, 'doesn''t bring an earthquake or some lightning to stop him. He says, "You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 76, 24, 6, 'can go. If you don''t fear me, go anywhere you''d like, and you can go to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 76, 25, 6, 'Hell if you want." It''s an amazing thing that God allows millions of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 76, 26, 6, 'people to go to Hell everyday. Have you thought of that? Every day. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 76, 27, 6, 'sees millions of people going to Hell and he doesn''t stop them, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 76, 28, 6, 'he''s given them the word. He sees believers living in Babylon, living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 77, 1, 6, 'after the lusts of their flesh, thinking they have accepted Christ but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 77, 2, 6, 'going to Hell, and he doesn''t stop them. He says, "If you want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 77, 3, 6, 'deceive yourself, deceive yourself and go. I''ve given you my word and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 77, 4, 6, 'you haven''t taken it seriously."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 77, 5, 6, 'Verse 22 says, "His own iniquities will capture the wicked." It''s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 77, 6, 6, 'that God sends him to Hell, his own iniquities take him there. Then it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 77, 7, 6, 'says, "And he will be held with the cords of his sin." That''s another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 77, 8, 6, 'thing young people must remember - once you get into a sin, once you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 77, 9, 6, 'commit a sin once, it binds you. Then it draws you to do it again and it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 77, 10, 6, 'binds you once more. Again it draws you and binds you. Each time it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 77, 11, 6, 'forms one more knot, and one more knot, and one more knot, and one more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 77, 12, 6, 'knot. Think of that every time you sin in this area - a lustful thought');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 77, 13, 6, 'or a dirty sexual deed. One more knot is formed, and one more, and one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 77, 14, 6, 'more. What an idiot a man has to be to give himself to the devil little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 77, 15, 6, 'by little by little by little. And the world is full of these people,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 77, 16, 6, 'even so called "Christians". I''m sorry to say that there is not the fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 77, 17, 6, 'of God that there should be among believers. They don''t see that God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 77, 18, 6, 'watching them. They only know that their wife is not watching them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 77, 19, 6, 'That''s all. Alright, well the word of God says he will die (verse 23)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 77, 20, 6, 'because he didn''t take correction. In the greatness of his own folly he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 77, 21, 6, 'will go astray into an eternal Hell, because anyone who lives after the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 77, 22, 6, 'flesh shall die. That''s clear. It''s a very strong warning that Solomon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 77, 23, 6, 'gives here to young people. Amazing. A very strong warning.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 77, 24, 6, 'Before moving on, let me just say this in passing. The sad thing is that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 77, 25, 6, 'the man who wrote this book...you know what happened to him. He did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 77, 26, 6, 'live according to what he taught others. He said, "Don''t go near those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 77, 27, 6, 'women. Control yourself. Don''t go one step that way. Steer clear." You''d');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 77, 28, 6, 'think this was a really wholehearted brother. Sometimes we can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 78, 1, 6, 'deceived when we hear someone get up and share the word and we think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 78, 2, 6, 'they are a really wholehearted brother. If we had heard Solomon get up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 78, 3, 6, 'and preach something like this, we would have thought he was really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 78, 4, 6, 'wholehearted. Perhaps he was in the beginning, but he began to take it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 78, 5, 6, 'easy and slipped up and finally went in deep - more deep than any of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 78, 6, 6, 'other kings; deep into the very sin that he warned other people against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 78, 7, 6, 'with women. What does this teach us? We can preach the greatest,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 78, 8, 6, 'highest-sounding doctrines in the whole world but if we don''t keep our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 78, 9, 6, 'body under control, we can preach to others and be cast away ourselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 78, 10, 6, 'That''s what Paul said, "...lest I preach to others and I be a castaway');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 78, 11, 6, 'myself." So don''t think that just because we understand this and we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 78, 12, 6, 'sharing it with so many that we are spiritual. Far from it. The question');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 78, 13, 6, 'is in my daily life, am I subduing my body? Am I controlling my eyes? Am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 78, 14, 6, 'I controlling my thoughts? Am I controlling my own tongue? Am I hating');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 78, 15, 6, 'my self-life? Do I mourn? Do I hunger and thirst for righteousness? If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 78, 16, 6, 'I''m not doing all this, I can talk about more wonderful things than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 78, 17, 6, 'Solomon and end up worse than Solomon. And Solomon will rise up in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 78, 18, 6, 'judgment against me one day and say, "Hey, I didn''t know about the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 78, 19, 6, 'and Living Way. You fellas talked about something higher than even I and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 78, 20, 6, 'what was your final end? What type of life did you live in private? What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 78, 21, 6, 'type of thought-life did you have?" And Solomon will rise up in judgment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 78, 22, 6, 'against us. He who has ears to hear, let him hear. Self-control is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 78, 23, 6, 'very important aspect of wisdom. Verse 23 says, "He will die for lack of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 78, 24, 6, 'instruction," and some translations say, "He dies because he has no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 78, 25, 6, 'self-control in his life." No self-control. Brothers and sisters, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 78, 26, 6, 'fruit of the Spirit is self-control. One of the most important verses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 78, 27, 6, 'for Charismatic, Pentecostal, Spirit-filled people is that the fruit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 78, 28, 6, 'the Spirit is self-control; self-control over your tongue, self-control');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 79, 1, 6, 'over your eyes, self-control over your thoughts, self-control in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 79, 2, 6, 'eating, self-control in many, many things. The fruit of the Spirit is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 79, 3, 6, 'self-control. And he will die because he has no self-control in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 79, 4, 6, 'life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 79, 5, 7, 'Chapter 6 Chapter 6');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 79, 6, 7, 'Now he moves on to another subject, and that is the subject of being a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 79, 7, 7, 'surety for a stranger. That means agreeing to pay someone else''s debt.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 79, 8, 7, 'When someone wants an agreement signed for something, he often will need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 79, 9, 7, 'somebody who will stand as a guarantee. A person who is a guarantee is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 79, 10, 7, 'saying, "In case this fellow doesn''t pay up, I will pay up." Doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 79, 11, 7, 'that sound like a very loving thing to do? We have so much human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 79, 12, 7, 'understanding of love which is quite different from the divine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 79, 13, 7, 'understanding of love. He says, "My son, if you have become a guarantee');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 79, 14, 7, 'for your neighbor or have given up a handshake (or pledge) for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 79, 15, 7, 'stranger..." He''s referring to a person you don''t know very well. He''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 79, 16, 7, 'friend, but yet at the same time he''s a stranger. This is the type of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 79, 17, 7, 'person we have a relationship with most of the time - a person who lives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 79, 18, 7, 'next door. You can''t say you don''t know him at all and yet you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 79, 19, 7, 'know him that well either. He''s a neighbor, but he''s a stranger. That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 79, 20, 7, 'what it says here. You have decided to stand guarantee for a neighbor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 79, 21, 7, 'even though he''s a stranger. He says that''s a stupid thing to do. Don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 79, 22, 7, 'do it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 79, 23, 7, 'Have you been "ensnared by the words of your mouth" or "caught by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 79, 24, 7, 'words of your mouth"? You sat there and your neighbor said so many nice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 79, 25, 7, 'things to you and the honey dripped from his mouth, so you just agreed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 79, 26, 7, 'to it. Then after you came back home, you realized you''d been caught.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 79, 27, 7, 'You''d been caught with the words of your own mouth. You gave your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 79, 28, 7, 'promise to that man and what shall you do now? The word of God says to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 80, 1, 7, 'go and retract that promise. Go back and tell him, "I''m sorry. Please');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 80, 2, 7, 'forgive me. I can''t do that. I gave it a little more thought." Don''t be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 80, 3, 7, 'so foolish to think, "Oh, I gave my word. Now I have to stick to it."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 80, 4, 7, 'Well, you gave your word foolishly! After thinking about it, now you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 80, 5, 7, 'have a little more wisdom and you''ve realized it''s a foolish thing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 80, 6, 7, 'do. Go back! Do this, my son, and deliver yourself. It was not a mark of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 80, 7, 7, 'love but rather a foolish promise made. Go and retract it. Deliver');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 80, 8, 7, 'yourself, because you have now come under the power of your neighbor!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 80, 9, 7, 'You have committed yourself and you are bound to that person now, and he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 80, 10, 7, 'has power over you. God does not ever want us to be under the power of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 80, 11, 7, 'another man. You have been bought with a price. Don''t become the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 80, 12, 7, 'servants and slaves of men. It says, "Go, humble yourself, and be urgent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 80, 13, 7, 'with your neighbor to free yourself." This is the only book, I think, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 80, 14, 7, 'the Old Testament where you see this New Testament exhortation: Humble');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 80, 15, 7, 'yourself. It''s really a New Covenant book. Go humble yourself! Don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 80, 16, 7, 'stand on your dignity saying, "What will he think of me, that I''m a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 80, 17, 7, 'person who goes back on my word?" Never mind what he thinks of you! Go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 80, 18, 7, 'humble yourself and plead and beg with your neighbor, "I''m sorry for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 80, 19, 7, 'giving my word but please let me take it back."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 80, 20, 7, 'When are you going to do it? Let''s say you came back at 10:30pm after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 80, 21, 7, 'talking to this person and you say you''ll go tomorrow morning. Solomon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 80, 22, 7, 'says, "No! Don''t give sleep to your eyes. Go immediately" (verse 4).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 80, 23, 7, 'Don''t give slumber to your eyelids. Go right now! Deliver yourself. Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 80, 24, 7, 'you see how earnestly he pleads? Paying someone else''s debts is not a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 80, 25, 7, 'mark of love. There''s a lot of foolish, so-called love, especially in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 80, 26, 7, 'the area of money. We find a tremendous amount of folly in helping other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 80, 27, 7, 'people financially. This happens even among believers, particularly when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 80, 28, 7, 'they are young. They are so stupid and that''s why you find in the Acts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 81, 1, 7, 'of the Apostles, chapter 4, that those early believers never gave their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 81, 2, 7, 'money directly to the poor. They gave it to the apostles, and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 81, 3, 7, 'apostles gave it to the poor because they had a little more wisdom. Of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 81, 4, 7, 'course, in today''s times we think we are smart and don''t need anyone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 81, 5, 7, 'else, so we do a lot of foolish things. Think about all of the times');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 81, 6, 7, 'others have come into our own assembly and swindled people. When will we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 81, 7, 7, 'learn? Here''s an area where we have to learn wisdom. All this foolish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 81, 8, 7, 'love. Humble yourself brother - you''re quite stupid. you have a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 81, 9, 7, 'money, but you have no wisdom. If you want to help the poor, give it to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 81, 10, 7, 'someone who has a little more wisdom than you so that you can help in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 81, 11, 7, 'wise way. Don''t think that it is love to say, "I will support you and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 81, 12, 7, 'will take care of your debts." No! "Give no sleep to your eyes, Nor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 81, 13, 7, 'slumber to your eyelids; Save yourself like a gazelle from the hunter''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 81, 14, 7, 'hand, And like a bird from the hand of the fowler." This is urgent.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 81, 15, 7, 'You''re in a trap. Don''t get stuck there. Get out of it immediately. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 81, 16, 7, 'an exhortation if you have given a guarantee to support someone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 81, 17, 7, 'financially or to pay someone else''s debts. Get out of it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 81, 18, 7, 'Another area Solomon speaks about is laziness. The book of Proverbs has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 81, 19, 7, 'a lot to say about fools and lazy people. They both go together. Lazy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 81, 20, 7, 'people means spiritually lazy people. They are not wholehearted. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 81, 21, 7, 'says, "Go to the ant, O sluggard" or like one translation says, "Go to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 81, 22, 7, 'school with the ant." Go to school with the ant and learn something from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 81, 23, 7, 'that ant. When God created Adam, He said, "You''re going to have dominion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 81, 24, 7, 'over all the animals and birds and fish and everything," but it''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 81, 25, 7, 'pretty pathetic state man has come to that he has to now go to the ant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 81, 26, 7, 'and say, "Please teach me sir. I have something to learn from you." Man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 81, 27, 7, 'has become such a fool spiritually. And this is particularly to those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 81, 28, 7, 'who are lazy and not wholehearted. "Observe her ways and be wise." Watch');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 82, 1, 7, 'the ant and see how hard working it is. Do you want to learn wisdom?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 82, 2, 7, 'Learn it from the ant who has no elder brother or overseer (verse 7);');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 82, 3, 7, 'nobody to give it any exhortations. And even without all of that, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 82, 4, 7, 'ant does the job of preparing her food in the summer and gathering her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 82, 5, 7, 'provision in the harvest. That means this ant prepares for the future.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 82, 6, 7, 'The ant is such a small little thing and has such a small brain but it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 82, 7, 7, 'has a little bit of intelligence to say, "A time may come when there may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 82, 8, 7, 'not be much food around, so I better store up some." Without an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 82, 9, 7, 'exhortation or any older brother, it thinks about the future. Its future');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 82, 10, 7, 'is just the winter because the ant''s future is only here on this earth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 82, 11, 7, 'but we are not ants. We have a future in eternity. Have you laid up some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 82, 12, 7, 'treasure for eternity or are you going to be a beggar for all eternity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 82, 13, 7, 'because you decided to just enjoy yourself now? That''s the primary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 82, 14, 7, 'exhortation, to think about the future in terms of eternity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 82, 15, 7, 'But this also has a relation to our life on earth, because we''re not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 82, 16, 7, 'going to die tonight. We may live for a few years and we want to think,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 82, 17, 7, '"I don''t want to live in such a way that I carelessly spend everything I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 82, 18, 7, 'get, so that six months from now, when I have an extra sudden need (like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 82, 19, 7, 'a hospitalization or an expenditure that can''t be avoided), I have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 82, 20, 7, 'beg and borrow and go to the money lenders, because I did not learn from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 82, 21, 7, 'the ant!" You thought you were so spiritual. You thought you were like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 82, 22, 7, 'George Muller and you discovered in the moment of need that you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 82, 23, 7, 'worse than the ant when you have to beg and borrow because you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 82, 24, 7, 'know how to discipline yourself by laying up a little bit for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 82, 25, 7, 'future. We find there''s a tremendous need for this exhortation: "How');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 82, 26, 7, 'long will you lie down, O sluggard? When will you arise from your sleep?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 82, 27, 7, 'A little sleep, a little slumber, a little folding of the hands to rest"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 82, 28, 7, '- finally you become poor and poverty grabs you. It''s amazing what we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 83, 1, 7, 'can learn from the ant. In the heat of the summer it works hard.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 83, 2, 7, 'I''ve seen two ants helping each other to carry a little piece of sugar,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 83, 3, 7, 'one bearing the load of the other. Without any overseer and without any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 83, 4, 7, 'exhortation, they know how to bear one another''s burdens. They carry the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 83, 5, 7, 'food so they can eat it a little later. Observe her ways and be wise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 83, 6, 7, 'They are hard working, always looking for where they can get something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 83, 7, 7, 'to eat and lay up something for the future. You should think to be like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 83, 8, 7, 'that in terms of eternity. Your prayer should be "Lord, I want to live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 83, 9, 7, 'for the future. I want to live for that which is eternal, not for that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 83, 10, 7, 'which is just going to pass away. I don''t want to just enjoy my life and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 83, 11, 7, 'have a comfortable life here." Ask yourself, "Has my life counted for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 83, 12, 7, 'God? Have I laid up treasure in heaven?"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 83, 13, 7, 'Then the question is (verse 9): "When will you arise from your sleep?"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 83, 14, 7, 'We can paraphrase it like this: When will you become wholehearted,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 83, 15, 7, 'brother? When will you become wholehearted about eternal things? When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 83, 16, 7, 'will we finish with being occupied with temporal things? When will we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 83, 17, 7, 'become wholehearted? There''s a spiritual laziness that these words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 83, 18, 7, 'rebuke us out of. Think of eternity. Think of the future and lay up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 83, 19, 7, 'treasure like Jesus said, where moth and rust cannot corrupt and where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 83, 20, 7, 'we can have something when we go up into eternity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 83, 21, 7, 'It says in Proverbs 6:10 that a little carelessness, a little sleep, a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 83, 22, 7, 'little lack of zeal, a little slumber, a little folding of the hands to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 83, 23, 7, 'take life easy, and your spiritual poverty will come like one who walks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 83, 24, 7, '- that is, one who comes slowly. It doesn''t hit us all of a sudden.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 83, 25, 7, '"Like one who walks" means spiritual poverty comes slowly. We don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 83, 26, 7, 'realize it right away, but when it comes, it will come like an "armed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 83, 27, 7, 'man." That is, powerfully. Spiritual poverty comes slowly but powerfully');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 83, 28, 7, 'to knock us down if we are not wholehearted.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 84, 1, 7, 'Verses 12-15 describe the characteristics of a worthless, wicked person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 84, 2, 7, 'Notice what the Holy Spirit describes as the characteristics of a wicked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 84, 3, 7, 'person. It''s not so much that he goes around committing adultery and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 84, 4, 7, 'murder, rather it says a worthless, wicked man is one who "walks with a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 84, 5, 7, 'false mouth." In other words, he''s a hypocrite. He has deceit in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 84, 6, 7, 'lips. We see that in Jesus'' earthly ministry, how he could forgive the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 84, 7, 7, 'adulteress and forgive the murderer on the cross, but he really spoke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 84, 8, 7, 'out against the hypocrites. We see here that the mark of a worthless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 84, 9, 7, 'person is primarily hypocrisy - one who walks with deceit in his mouth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 84, 10, 7, 'And all of the actions that are described in these verses speak about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 84, 11, 7, 'deception and guile in words and actions. One who "winks with his eyes,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 84, 12, 7, 'signals with his feet, and points/instructs with his fingers" has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 84, 13, 7, 'deception and perversity in his heart. There is guile in his words and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 84, 14, 7, 'his actions and evil in his heart. He "continually devises evil and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 84, 15, 7, 'spreads strife" which means that he separates brothers from one another.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 84, 16, 7, 'So notice the characteristics of a wicked person: there''s deception in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 84, 17, 7, 'his words and actions, there is crookedness and evil in his heart, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 84, 18, 7, 'he goes around separating people by backbiting and gossiping against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 84, 19, 7, 'them. Jesus is in the business of uniting but a worthless person is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 84, 20, 7, 'the business of dividing and separating people. We find that there are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 84, 21, 7, 'lots of so-called believers who fall into this category of wicked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 84, 22, 7, 'person, in whose life there is deception, whose hearts are not cleansed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 84, 23, 7, 'from evil, and who go around speaking words that instead of uniting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 84, 24, 7, 'people, separate people. Let''s never forget these marks of a worthless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 84, 25, 7, 'person and a wicked person according to the Holy Spirit. Therefore, one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 84, 26, 7, 'who continues to do that, judgment will come on him suddenly, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 84, 27, 7, 'instantly he will be broken and there will be no healing. That means God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 84, 28, 7, 'will suddenly bring judgment one day on hypocrites and on those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 85, 1, 7, 'cause strife and division in the brotherhood.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 85, 2, 7, 'Here, a further expansion of the characteristics of a wicked person are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 85, 3, 7, 'described as seven deadly sins. These are seven deadly sins that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 85, 4, 7, 'Lord hates, and not only that he hates, but that are also an abomination');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 85, 5, 7, 'to him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 85, 6, 7, 'In contrast, Solomon says, "My son (the one who is willing to submit to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 85, 7, 7, 'my spiritual authority), observe the commandment of your father and do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 85, 8, 7, 'not forsake the teaching of your mother." Young children, respect the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 85, 9, 7, 'advice that your parents give you. Don''t despise them as old fashioned.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 85, 10, 7, 'Their advice can protect you. "Bind them continually on your heart."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 85, 11, 7, 'Notice the emphasis throughout Proverbs on the heart. "Tie them around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 85, 12, 7, 'your neck. When you walk about, they will guide you; When you sleep,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 85, 13, 7, 'they will watch over you; and when you awake, they will talk to you."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 85, 14, 7, 'This is God''s word that is delivered through God fearing parents.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 85, 15, 7, 'There''s a word for parents here as well. Can you honestly say to your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 85, 16, 7, 'children, "Observe the commandments of God that I have given you"? Or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 85, 17, 7, 'have we been so lazy that we''ve had no time to teach God''s commandments');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 85, 18, 7, 'to our children? That''s a challenge to parents. It''s not just our own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 85, 19, 7, 'bright ideas that we are to teach our children, but God''s commandments.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 85, 20, 7, 'When he says, "My son, observe the commandment of your father", it''s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 85, 21, 7, 'some bright idea the father has in his own head. It''s the commandment of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 85, 22, 7, 'God which a father gives to his son, according to what Moses told the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 85, 23, 7, 'Israelites: "You must teach your son these laws all the time, when you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 85, 24, 7, 'walk down the road, when you get up, when you sit down" (Deuteronomy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 85, 25, 7, '11:18-21). And that''s what it says here, when you walk about, those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 85, 26, 7, 'words will guide you; when you sleep, those words will watch over you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 85, 27, 7, '(they will even give you clean dreams at night); and when you wake up in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 85, 28, 7, 'the morning, God''s word is there again to speak to you. There is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 86, 1, 7, 'tremendous importance given to God''s word in the book of Proverbs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 86, 2, 7, 'Proverbs is the book of wisdom and when we see the tremendous importance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 86, 3, 7, 'given to God''s word, that teaches us that it''s impossible to have wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 86, 4, 7, 'unless we take the word of God seriously.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 86, 5, 7, 'A lamp is like a torchlight. An individual command of God''s word is like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 86, 6, 7, 'a torchlight, and the whole of God''s word is like a streetlight on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 86, 7, 7, 'road. That''s the imagery used here - that each commandment shows you one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 86, 8, 7, 'step that you can take and all of it together brightens up life''s path.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 86, 9, 7, '"Reproofs for discipline are the way of life", means that it is through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 86, 10, 7, 'correction and rebuke that we come to spiritual life. Throughout the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 86, 11, 7, 'book of Proverbs, we notice the contrast again and again between');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 86, 12, 7, 'flattery and rebuke. Flattery is the mark of the spiritual harlot.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 86, 13, 7, 'Rebuke and correction are the way of life. If you listen to that rebuke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 86, 14, 7, 'and correction, it will protect you and keep you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 86, 15, 7, 'It speaks here again about being kept from the evil woman. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 86, 16, 7, 'another thing we find again and again and again in the book of Proverbs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 86, 17, 7, 'It''s almost as though Solomon is never tired of warning young people to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 86, 18, 7, 'be particularly careful in their relationship with the opposite sex. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 86, 19, 7, 'you tremble at God''s word and take it seriously, it will keep you from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 86, 20, 7, 'that woman who can be Satan''s agent to ruin and destroy your life! And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 86, 21, 7, 'if he doesn''t succeed at ruining and destroying your life, he will at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 86, 22, 7, 'least try to destroy your spiritual usefulness to God as a man of God!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 86, 23, 7, 'There are people who are saved and yet fool around with women, and they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 86, 24, 7, 'have lost an entire ministry that God could have given to them! That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 86, 25, 7, 'something we have to take seriously. It''s not enough to say, "My sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 86, 26, 7, 'are forgiven." Imagine standing in eternity and finding out that God had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 86, 27, 7, 'a ministry for you, and you lost it just because you weren''t very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 86, 28, 7, 'careful in your relationships with the opposite sex. Think of standing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 87, 1, 7, 'in eternity and discovering that just for some silly little pleasure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 87, 2, 7, 'with some silly old girl, you lost a ministry that could have made all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 87, 3, 7, 'eternity glorious for yourself, but you lost it because you were such an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 87, 4, 7, 'idiot on earth. Think of the regret there will be in the hearts of many,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 87, 5, 7, 'many people on that day. Particularly when you''re young, be careful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 87, 6, 7, 'Take the book of Proverbs seriously. It will keep you from the evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 87, 7, 7, 'woman, from that smooth tongue of the adulteress. Here''s the contrast');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 87, 8, 7, 'between the rebuke of verse 23 and the flattery of the smooth tongue. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 87, 9, 7, 'is through flattery, as I''ve said, that most people fail and fall.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 87, 10, 7, 'In verse 25 God gives us a warning through Solomon through the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 87, 11, 7, 'Spirit: "Do not desire her beauty in your heart." This almost looks like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 87, 12, 7, 'the New Covenant. It''s the nearest verse in the entire bible to Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 87, 13, 7, '5:28 where it says, do not lust after a woman in your heart. There''s no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 87, 14, 7, 'other verse in the entire bible which is as close to Matthew 5:28 as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 87, 15, 7, 'Proverbs 6:25. There is wisdom. Adultery begins in the heart. It begins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 87, 16, 7, 'with just an admiration of beauty in the opposite sex. I want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 87, 17, 7, 'emphasize this because there are Christians (believers) who teach that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 87, 18, 7, 'there''s nothing wrong in admiring beauty. That is because they have no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 87, 19, 7, 'fear of God in their heart. The word of God says, "Do not desire her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 87, 20, 7, 'beauty in your heart."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 87, 21, 7, 'Do you have a wrong understanding of physical beauty? Proverbs 31:30');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 87, 22, 7, 'says that physical beauty is an empty, hollow thing. Young men, I want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 87, 23, 7, 'to tell you this, if you don''t keep before your mind that physical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 87, 24, 7, 'beauty is an empty, hollow, useless thing, you''ll be deceived by it one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 87, 25, 7, 'day. You''ll get married to the wrong person and suffer for it the rest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 87, 26, 7, 'of your life. Don''t turn your eyes and look at beauty, saying, "Well,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 87, 27, 7, 'I''m not lusting. I''m only admiring the beauty." That is a terrific');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 87, 28, 7, 'deception and God sees it! God may have called all such men to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 88, 1, 7, 'ministry, but he puts them on the shelf and says, "You can''t have it. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 88, 2, 7, 'could have given a ministry to you, but you just fooled around with your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 88, 3, 7, 'eyes and called yourself a believer and talked about the New and Living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 88, 4, 7, 'Way, but you''re not wholehearted in this area!" Do not desire her beauty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 88, 5, 7, 'even in your heart! This is not talking about adultery. This is just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 88, 6, 7, 'speaking about admiring physical beauty in a girl! Don''t even admire it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 88, 7, 7, 'it says. Well, that''s wisdom if you want to take it. Be careful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 88, 8, 7, 'Then it says, "Don''t let her capture you with her eyelids." The word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 88, 9, 7, 'God is very practical. It says here that there''s something about a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 88, 10, 7, 'woman''s eyes which can catch a young man. And that''s why we find that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 88, 11, 7, 'the devil has taught girls nowadays to paint their eyelids to make them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 88, 12, 7, 'more attractive - all those fancy colors, and in case you''re one of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 88, 13, 7, 'those who want the mark of the beast on the hand so that you can have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 88, 14, 7, 'good testimony in the assembly, I assume there are some colorless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 88, 15, 7, 'varieties also that you can put on your eyes and lips and all over the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 88, 16, 7, 'place so that you can make yourself attractive. It says here, "Don''t let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 88, 17, 7, 'her catch you with her eyelids." I want to show you a verse in 2 Kings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 88, 18, 7, '9:30 that speaks of a girl with a painted face. That''s Jezebel. You also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 88, 19, 7, 'read about her in Revelation 2. There''s a Jezebel sitting in the church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 88, 20, 7, 'in Thyatira. It says in 2 Kings 9 when Jehu came to Jezreel, Jezebel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 88, 21, 7, 'heard of it, and she painted her eyes. Do you know there was mascara');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 88, 22, 7, 'used hundreds of years before Christ? It''s not a 20th century invention.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 88, 23, 7, 'Jezebel was the one who started that product. She painted her eyes and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 88, 24, 7, 'adorned her hair. I''m sure she painted the rest of her face too and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 88, 25, 7, 'looked out the window, and Jehu said in verse 33, "Throw her down!", and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 88, 26, 7, 'they threw her down and killed her. He wasn''t impressed by a painted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 88, 27, 7, 'face, and neither should you be. Jehu was not even a God-fearing man,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 88, 28, 7, 'and yet he could withstand all that. Be careful in this area of painted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 89, 1, 7, 'faces, and the eyelids particularly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 89, 2, 7, '"Don''t let her catch you with her eyelids," he says, because "on account');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 89, 3, 7, 'of a harlot the man is reduced to a loaf of bread", or as it says in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 89, 4, 7, 'another translation, "All that a harlot is interested in is a loaf of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 89, 5, 7, 'bread. There are two types of evil women spoken of in verse 26: One is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 89, 6, 7, 'the harlot - the regular prostitute who runs a business to make money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 89, 7, 7, 'and earn her living. The second is the adulteress. This is a woman who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 89, 8, 7, 'doesn''t do it for a living but just does it for fun. This type is more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 89, 9, 7, 'dangerous because you are not on guard. The prostitute is only out to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 89, 10, 7, 'earn a loaf of bread, but this other woman is the flirtatious type.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 89, 11, 7, 'She''s in or from a good home; maybe she''s married, maybe she''s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 89, 12, 7, 'married, but she''s the flirtatious type; there''s flirting in her eyes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 89, 13, 7, 'You have to be more careful of that one than of the prostitute. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 89, 14, 7, 'prostitute you know is dangerous, so you don''t go there, but this one,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 89, 15, 7, 'the one with the flirtatious eyes, the one who is probably a married');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 89, 16, 7, 'woman and who does not know how to submit to her husband and how to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 89, 17, 7, 'happy with her husband, you must be careful of.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 89, 18, 7, 'Verses 27-29 speak about another man''s wife. Touching her is like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 89, 19, 7, 'touching dynamite. "Can a man take fire in his bosom and his clothes not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 89, 20, 7, 'be burned or can a man walk on hot coals and his feet not be scorched?"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 89, 21, 7, 'That''s impossible. Can you put fire onto dynamite and it not blow up? So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 89, 22, 7, 'is the one who goes into his neighbor''s wife and who fools around with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 89, 23, 7, 'the wife of another. Don''t even touch another woman immodestly, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 89, 24, 7, 'you will not go unpunished. Don''t become too friendly and familiar with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 89, 25, 7, 'somebody else''s wife.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 89, 26, 7, 'Verses 30 & 31 say that even a thief who''s stolen must repay and perhaps');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 89, 27, 7, 'even give the entire substance of his house, but the one who commits');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 89, 28, 7, 'adultery with a woman is lacking sense. He will destroy himself. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 90, 1, 7, 'other words, looseness in this area is equal to spiritual suicide.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 90, 2, 7, 'Playing the fool in this area is like committing suicide. Notice the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 90, 3, 7, 'strong warnings that Solomon gives to young people in this area of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 90, 4, 7, 'fooling around with other women.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 90, 5, 7, 'Verses 33-35 say that there will be a permanent reproach upon the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 90, 6, 7, 'adulterer''s life which can never be blotted out. God may forgive him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 90, 7, 7, 'but he looks at him as the man who did this thing and lost his ministry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 90, 8, 7, 'for his whole life, because he just wasn''t careful in this area.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 90, 9, 7, 'Furthermore, jealousy will enrage the man whose wife you fooled around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 90, 10, 7, 'with, and in the day he discovers it, the day of vengeance, he will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 90, 11, 7, 'spare you. He will not accept any excuse, any ransom, nor will he be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 90, 12, 7, 'content though you give him many gifts. Then, on top of that, there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 90, 13, 7, 'God''s judgment too. The bible says in Hebrews 13:4 that God will judge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 90, 14, 7, 'all fornicators and all adulterers. God will judge severely all those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 90, 15, 7, 'who sinned sexually with unmarried and married women; much more if they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 90, 16, 7, 'call themselves believers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 90, 17, 7, 'Ironically, the greatest warning of all from Chapter 6 is that the man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 90, 18, 7, 'who gave all these exhortations finally fell himself; not once, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 90, 19, 7, 'again and again and again. This teaches us that we can be so much of an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 90, 20, 7, 'expert in this area that we can listen to this word of God and say, "I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 90, 21, 7, 'don''t need that. I''m quite careful in that area." Well, that''s exactly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 90, 22, 7, 'what Solomon felt when he wrote this chapter. "He who thinks he stands');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 90, 23, 7, 'take heed lest he fall." Solomon''s fall is a tremendous warning for us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 90, 24, 7, 'Do you know that in the entire Old Testament, there was nobody who fell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 90, 25, 7, 'in this area as much as Solomon? Now, I''ll tell you something else. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 90, 26, 7, 'the entire Old Testament, there was no person who wrote as many warnings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 90, 27, 7, 'to people in this area as Solomon. He was the one who ended up with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 90, 28, 7, 'seven-hundred wives and three-hundred concubines. Imagine the way he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 91, 1, 7, 'fell. That''s there as a living warning, that you can know the theory of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 91, 2, 7, 'it, speak about it, and even warn and exhort others about it, but if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 91, 3, 7, 'don''t live in fear and trembling (regardless of your age, even if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 91, 4, 7, 'are seventy years-old), you can fall. So be careful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 91, 5, 8, 'Chapter 6 Chapter 6');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 91, 6, 8, 'My son, if you have become a guarantor for your neighbor,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 91, 7, 8, 'Or have given a handshake for a stranger,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 91, 8, 8, 'If you have been ensnared by the words of your mouth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 91, 9, 8, 'Or caught by the words of your mouth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 91, 10, 8, 'Then do this, my son, and save yourself:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 91, 11, 8, 'Since you have come into the hand of your neighbor,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 91, 12, 8, 'Go, humble yourself, and be urgent with your neighbor to free yourself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 91, 13, 8, 'Give no sleep to your eyes,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 91, 14, 8, 'Nor slumber to your eyelids;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 91, 15, 8, 'Save yourself like a gazelle from the hunter''s hand,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 91, 16, 8, 'And like a bird from the hand of the fowler.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 91, 17, 8, 'Prov 6:1-5');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 91, 18, 8, 'Now he moves on to another subject, and that is the subject of being a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 91, 19, 8, 'surety for a stranger. That means agreeing to pay someone else''s debt.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 91, 20, 8, 'When someone wants an agreement signed for something, he often will need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 91, 21, 8, 'somebody who will stand as a guarantee. A person who is a guarantee is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 91, 22, 8, 'saying, "In case this fellow doesn''t pay up, I will pay up." Doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 91, 23, 8, 'that sound like a very loving thing to do? We have so much human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 91, 24, 8, 'understanding of love which is quite different from the divine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 91, 25, 8, 'understanding of love. He says, "My son, if you have become a guarantee');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 91, 26, 8, 'for your neighbor or have given up a handshake (or pledge) for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 91, 27, 8, 'stranger..." He''s referring to a person you don''t know very well. He''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 91, 28, 8, 'friend, but yet at the same time he''s a stranger. This is the type of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 92, 1, 8, 'person we have a relationship with most of the time - a person who lives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 92, 2, 8, 'next door. You can''t say you don''t know him at all and yet you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 92, 3, 8, 'know him that well either. He''s a neighbor, but he''s a stranger. That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 92, 4, 8, 'what it says here. You have decided to stand guarantee for a neighbor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 92, 5, 8, 'even though he''s a stranger. He says that''s a stupid thing to do. Don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 92, 6, 8, 'do it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 92, 7, 8, 'Have you been "ensnared by the words of your mouth" or "caught by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 92, 8, 8, 'words of your mouth"? You sat there and your neighbor said so many nice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 92, 9, 8, 'things to you and the honey dripped from his mouth, so you just agreed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 92, 10, 8, 'to it. Then after you came back home, you realized you''d been caught.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 92, 11, 8, 'You''d been caught with the words of your own mouth. You gave your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 92, 12, 8, 'promise to that man and what shall you do now? The word of God says to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 92, 13, 8, 'go and retract that promise. Go back and tell him, "I''m sorry. Please');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 92, 14, 8, 'forgive me. I can''t do that. I gave it a little more thought." Don''t be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 92, 15, 8, 'so foolish to think, "Oh, I gave my word. Now I have to stick to it."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 92, 16, 8, 'Well, you gave your word foolishly! After thinking about it, now you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 92, 17, 8, 'have a little more wisdom and you''ve realized it''s a foolish thing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 92, 18, 8, 'do. Go back! Do this, my son, and deliver yourself. It was not a mark of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 92, 19, 8, 'love but rather a foolish promise made. Go and retract it. Deliver');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 92, 20, 8, 'yourself, because you have now come under the power of your neighbor!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 92, 21, 8, 'You have committed yourself and you are bound to that person now, and he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 92, 22, 8, 'has power over you. God does not ever want us to be under the power of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 92, 23, 8, 'another man. You have been bought with a price. Don''t become the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 92, 24, 8, 'servants and slaves of men. It says, "Go, humble yourself, and be urgent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 92, 25, 8, 'with your neighbor to free yourself." This is the only book, I think, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 92, 26, 8, 'the Old Testament where you see this New Testament exhortation: Humble');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 92, 27, 8, 'yourself. It''s really a New Covenant book. Go humble yourself! Don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 92, 28, 8, 'stand on your dignity saying, "What will he think of me, that I''m a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 93, 1, 8, 'person who goes back on my word?" Never mind what he thinks of you! Go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 93, 2, 8, 'humble yourself and plead and beg with your neighbor, "I''m sorry for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 93, 3, 8, 'giving my word but please let me take it back."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 93, 4, 8, 'When are you going to do it? Let''s say you came back at 10:30pm after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 93, 5, 8, 'talking to this person and you say you''ll go tomorrow morning. Solomon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 93, 6, 8, 'says, "No! Don''t give sleep to your eyes. Go immediately" (verse 4).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 93, 7, 8, 'Don''t give slumber to your eyelids. Go right now! Deliver yourself. Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 93, 8, 8, 'you see how earnestly he pleads? Paying someone else''s debts is not a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 93, 9, 8, 'mark of love. There''s a lot of foolish, so-called love, especially in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 93, 10, 8, 'the area of money. We find a tremendous amount of folly in helping other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 93, 11, 8, 'people financially. This happens even among believers, particularly when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 93, 12, 8, 'they are young. They are so stupid and that''s why you find in the Acts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 93, 13, 8, 'of the Apostles, chapter 4, that those early believers never gave their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 93, 14, 8, 'money directly to the poor. They gave it to the apostles, and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 93, 15, 8, 'apostles gave it to the poor because they had a little more wisdom. Of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 93, 16, 8, 'course, in today''s times we think we are smart and don''t need anyone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 93, 17, 8, 'else, so we do a lot of foolish things. Think about all of the times');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 93, 18, 8, 'others have come into our own assembly and swindled people. When will we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 93, 19, 8, 'learn? Here''s an area where we have to learn wisdom. All this foolish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 93, 20, 8, 'love. Humble yourself brother - you''re quite stupid. you have a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 93, 21, 8, 'money, but you have no wisdom. If you want to help the poor, give it to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 93, 22, 8, 'someone who has a little more wisdom than you so that you can help in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 93, 23, 8, 'wise way. Don''t think that it is love to say, "I will support you and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 93, 24, 8, 'will take care of your debts." No! "Give no sleep to your eyes, Nor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 93, 25, 8, 'slumber to your eyelids; Save yourself like a gazelle from the hunter''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 93, 26, 8, 'hand, And like a bird from the hand of the fowler." This is urgent.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 93, 27, 8, 'You''re in a trap. Don''t get stuck there. Get out of it immediately. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 93, 28, 8, 'an exhortation if you have given a guarantee to support someone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 94, 1, 8, 'financially or to pay someone else''s debts. Get out of it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 94, 2, 8, 'Go to the ant, O sluggard,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 94, 3, 8, 'Observe her ways and be wise,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 94, 4, 8, 'Which, having no chief,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 94, 5, 8, 'Officer or ruler,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 94, 6, 8, 'Prepares her food in the summer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 94, 7, 8, 'And gathers her provision in the harvest.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 94, 8, 8, 'How long will you lie down, O sluggard?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 94, 9, 8, 'When will you arise from your sleep?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 94, 10, 8, '"A little sleep, a little slumber,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 94, 11, 8, 'A little folding of the hands to rest"-');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 94, 12, 8, 'Your poverty will come in like a vagabond');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 94, 13, 8, 'And your need like an armed man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 94, 14, 8, 'Prov 6:6-11');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 94, 15, 8, 'Another area Solomon speaks about is laziness. The book of Proverbs has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 94, 16, 8, 'a lot to say about fools and lazy people. They both go together. Lazy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 94, 17, 8, 'people means spiritually lazy people. They are not wholehearted. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 94, 18, 8, 'says, "Go to the ant, O sluggard" or like one translation says, "Go to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 94, 19, 8, 'school with the ant." Go to school with the ant and learn something from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 94, 20, 8, 'that ant. When God created Adam, He said, "You''re going to have dominion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 94, 21, 8, 'over all the animals and birds and fish and everything," but it''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 94, 22, 8, 'pretty pathetic state man has come to that he has to now go to the ant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 94, 23, 8, 'and say, "Please teach me sir. I have something to learn from you." Man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 94, 24, 8, 'has become such a fool spiritually. And this is particularly to those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 94, 25, 8, 'who are lazy and not wholehearted. "Observe her ways and be wise." Watch');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 94, 26, 8, 'the ant and see how hard working it is. Do you want to learn wisdom?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 94, 27, 8, 'Learn it from the ant who has no elder brother or overseer (verse 7);');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 94, 28, 8, 'nobody to give it any exhortations. And even without all of that, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 95, 1, 8, 'ant does the job of preparing her food in the summer and gathering her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 95, 2, 8, 'provision in the harvest. That means this ant prepares for the future.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 95, 3, 8, 'The ant is such a small little thing and has such a small brain but it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 95, 4, 8, 'has a little bit of intelligence to say, "A time may come when there may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 95, 5, 8, 'not be much food around, so I better store up some." Without an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 95, 6, 8, 'exhortation or any older brother, it thinks about the future. Its future');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 95, 7, 8, 'is just the winter because the ant''s future is only here on this earth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 95, 8, 8, 'but we are not ants. We have a future in eternity. Have you laid up some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 95, 9, 8, 'treasure for eternity or are you going to be a beggar for all eternity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 95, 10, 8, 'because you decided to just enjoy yourself now? That''s the primary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 95, 11, 8, 'exhortation, to think about the future in terms of eternity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 95, 12, 8, 'But this also has a relation to our life on earth, because we''re not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 95, 13, 8, 'going to die tonight. We may live for a few years and we want to think,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 95, 14, 8, '"I don''t want to live in such a way that I carelessly spend everything I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 95, 15, 8, 'get, so that six months from now, when I have an extra sudden need (like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 95, 16, 8, 'a hospitalization or an expenditure that can''t be avoided), I have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 95, 17, 8, 'beg and borrow and go to the money lenders, because I did not learn from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 95, 18, 8, 'the ant!" You thought you were so spiritual. You thought you were like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 95, 19, 8, 'George Muller and you discovered in the moment of need that you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 95, 20, 8, 'worse than the ant when you have to beg and borrow because you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 95, 21, 8, 'know how to discipline yourself by laying up a little bit for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 95, 22, 8, 'future. We find there''s a tremendous need for this exhortation: "How');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 95, 23, 8, 'long will you lie down, O sluggard? When will you arise from your sleep?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 95, 24, 8, 'A little sleep, a little slumber, a little folding of the hands to rest"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 95, 25, 8, '- finally you become poor and poverty grabs you. It''s amazing what we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 95, 26, 8, 'can learn from the ant. In the heat of the summer it works hard.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 95, 27, 8, 'I''ve seen two ants helping each other to carry a little piece of sugar,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 95, 28, 8, 'one bearing the load of the other. Without any overseer and without any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 96, 1, 8, 'exhortation, they know how to bear one another''s burdens. They carry the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 96, 2, 8, 'food so they can eat it a little later. Observe her ways and be wise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 96, 3, 8, 'They are hard working, always looking for where they can get something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 96, 4, 8, 'to eat and lay up something for the future. You should think to be like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 96, 5, 8, 'that in terms of eternity. Your prayer should be "Lord, I want to live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 96, 6, 8, 'for the future. I want to live for that which is eternal, not for that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 96, 7, 8, 'which is just going to pass away. I don''t want to just enjoy my life and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 96, 8, 8, 'have a comfortable life here." Ask yourself, "Has my life counted for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 96, 9, 8, 'God? Have I laid up treasure in heaven?"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 96, 10, 8, 'Then the question is (verse 9): "When will you arise from your sleep?"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 96, 11, 8, 'We can paraphrase it like this: When will you become wholehearted,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 96, 12, 8, 'brother? When will you become wholehearted about eternal things? When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 96, 13, 8, 'will we finish with being occupied with temporal things? When will we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 96, 14, 8, 'become wholehearted? There''s a spiritual laziness that these words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 96, 15, 8, 'rebuke us out of. Think of eternity. Think of the future and lay up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 96, 16, 8, 'treasure like Jesus said, where moth and rust cannot corrupt and where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 96, 17, 8, 'we can have something when we go up into eternity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 96, 18, 8, 'It says in Proverbs 6:10 that a little carelessness, a little sleep, a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 96, 19, 8, 'little lack of zeal, a little slumber, a little folding of the hands to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 96, 20, 8, 'take life easy, and your spiritual poverty will come like one who walks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 96, 21, 8, '- that is, one who comes slowly. It doesn''t hit us all of a sudden.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 96, 22, 8, '"Like one who walks" means spiritual poverty comes slowly. We don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 96, 23, 8, 'realize it right away, but when it comes, it will come like an "armed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 96, 24, 8, 'man." That is, powerfully. Spiritual poverty comes slowly but powerfully');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 96, 25, 8, 'to knock us down if we are not wholehearted.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 96, 26, 8, 'A worthless person, a wicked man,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 96, 27, 8, 'Is the one who walks with a perverse mouth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 96, 28, 8, 'Who winks with his eyes, who signals with his feet,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 97, 1, 8, 'Who points with his fingers;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 97, 2, 8, 'Who with perversity in his heart continually devises evil,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 97, 3, 8, 'Who spreads strife.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 97, 4, 8, 'Therefore his calamity will come suddenly;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 97, 5, 8, 'Instantly he will be broken and there will be no healing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 97, 6, 8, 'Prov 6:12-15');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 97, 7, 8, 'Verses 12-15 describe the characteristics of a worthless, wicked person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 97, 8, 8, 'Notice what the Holy Spirit describes as the characteristics of a wicked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 97, 9, 8, 'person. It''s not so much that he goes around committing adultery and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 97, 10, 8, 'murder, rather it says a worthless, wicked man is one who "walks with a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 97, 11, 8, 'false mouth." In other words, he''s a hypocrite. He has deceit in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 97, 12, 8, 'lips. We see that in Jesus'' earthly ministry, how he could forgive the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 97, 13, 8, 'adulteress and forgive the murderer on the cross, but he really spoke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 97, 14, 8, 'out against the hypocrites. We see here that the mark of a worthless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 97, 15, 8, 'person is primarily hypocrisy - one who walks with deceit in his mouth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 97, 16, 8, 'And all of the actions that are described in these verses speak about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 97, 17, 8, 'deception and guile in words and actions. One who "winks with his eyes,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 97, 18, 8, 'signals with his feet, and points/instructs with his fingers" has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 97, 19, 8, 'deception and perversity in his heart. There is guile in his words and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 97, 20, 8, 'his actions and evil in his heart. He "continually devises evil and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 97, 21, 8, 'spreads strife" which means that he separates brothers from one another.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 97, 22, 8, 'So notice the characteristics of a wicked person: there''s deception in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 97, 23, 8, 'his words and actions, there is crookedness and evil in his heart, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 97, 24, 8, 'he goes around separating people by backbiting and gossiping against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 97, 25, 8, 'them. Jesus is in the business of uniting but a worthless person is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 97, 26, 8, 'the business of dividing and separating people. We find that there are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 97, 27, 8, 'lots of so-called believers who fall into this category of wicked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 97, 28, 8, 'person, in whose life there is deception, whose hearts are not cleansed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 98, 1, 8, 'from evil, and who go around speaking words that instead of uniting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 98, 2, 8, 'people, separate people. Let''s never forget these marks of a worthless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 98, 3, 8, 'person and a wicked person according to the Holy Spirit. Therefore, one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 98, 4, 8, 'who continues to do that, judgment will come on him suddenly, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 98, 5, 8, 'instantly he will be broken and there will be no healing. That means God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 98, 6, 8, 'will suddenly bring judgment one day on hypocrites and on those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 98, 7, 8, 'cause strife and division in the brotherhood.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 98, 8, 8, 'There are six things which the Lord hates,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 98, 9, 8, 'Yes, seven which are an abomination to Him:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 98, 10, 8, 'Haughty eyes, a lying tongue,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 98, 11, 8, 'And hands that shed innocent blood,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 98, 12, 8, 'A heart that devises wicked plans,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 98, 13, 8, 'Feet that run rapidly to evil,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 98, 14, 8, 'A false witness who utters lies,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 98, 15, 8, 'And one who spreads strife among brothers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 98, 16, 8, 'Prov 6:16-19');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 98, 17, 8, 'Here, a further expansion of the characteristics of a wicked person are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 98, 18, 8, 'described as seven deadly sins. These are seven deadly sins that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 98, 19, 8, 'Lord hates, and not only that he hates, but that are also an abomination');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 98, 20, 8, 'to him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 98, 21, 8, '1. Pride: At the top of the list is pride. A pride that begins in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 98, 22, 8, 'heart and that gradually manifests itself in the outward appearance. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 98, 23, 8, 'can''t hide for long what we are in our heart. It gradually begins to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 98, 24, 8, 'manifest, particularly in our eyes. In the way we look at other people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 98, 25, 8, 'Haughty eyes. A proud look. That is #1 on the list of things that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 98, 26, 8, 'hates. Remember that the sin of pride, of lifting oneself up, was the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 98, 27, 8, 'first sin that came into the universe through Lucifer. It''s #1 on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 98, 28, 8, 'list of things God hates.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 99, 1, 8, '2. Telling lies: A lying tongue. The tongue is very high on God''s list');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 99, 2, 8, 'because of its possibility of doing evil as well as doing good. As far');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 99, 3, 8, 'as we know, lying was the second sin of Lucifer, when he told a lie to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 99, 4, 8, 'Eve saying, "You shall not die even if you eat of the tree of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 99, 5, 8, 'knowledge of good and evil." So notice that the sins described here are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 99, 6, 8, 'characteristics of Satan, at least the first three. As you go through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 99, 7, 8, 'the book of Proverbs, you''ll see how much he speaks about the misuse of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 99, 8, 8, 'the tongue, and I believe there are many people who go to an eternal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 99, 9, 8, 'Hell just because of one small member in their body - that is their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 99, 10, 8, 'tongue, which they never learned to control. I''ll tell you something:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 99, 11, 8, 'you''ll never make any spiritual progress until you begin to take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 99, 12, 8, 'seriously the words you speak with your tongue. If we don''t take that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 99, 13, 8, 'seriously, God will just leave us as people who are not seriously');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 99, 14, 8, 'interested in spiritual progress. We can become an abomination to him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 99, 15, 8, 'and one whom God hates. We have seen examples of people who have heard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 99, 16, 8, 'the word of God many, many times in this area and still have not taken');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 99, 17, 8, 'this matter seriously. The word of God speaks much about it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 99, 18, 8, '3. Hands that shed innocent blood: That is, murder. Jesus said in John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 99, 19, 8, '8:44 that from the beginning, the devil has been a liar and a murderer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 99, 20, 8, 'He told a lie to Eve and then he caused Cain to murder Abel in the very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 99, 21, 8, 'next chapter. Today, we don''t take a big rock like Cain did but rather');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 99, 22, 8, 'do things in a more civilized way. We use our tongue. There are many who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 99, 23, 8, 'have slain others with their tongue just as Cain slew Abel. Notice that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 99, 24, 8, 'these three are at the top of the list of things God hates - a proud');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 99, 25, 8, 'look which has filtered through from the heart to the face, a lying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 99, 26, 8, 'tongue (deception on the lips), and hands (or a tongue) that sheds');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 99, 27, 8, 'innocent blood.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 99, 28, 8, '4. A heart that devises wicked plans: Evil plans in the heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 100, 1, 8, '5. Feet that run rapidly to evil: This means feet that run quickly to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 100, 2, 8, 'something wrong and that don''t run quickly to do something right.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 100, 3, 8, '6. A false witness who utters lies: This probably refers to a court');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 100, 4, 8, 'situation where the person does not speak the truth when called upon to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 100, 5, 8, 'witness concerning what has happened.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 100, 6, 8, '7. One who spreads strife among the brothers: Notice there are a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 100, 7, 8, 'similarities between these verses and the immediately preceding verses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 100, 8, 8, '(12-15). There we see the repetition in verse 14 and verse 19 about the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 100, 9, 8, 'fact that one who divides others is an abomination to God. God hates');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 100, 10, 8, 'those who separate two brothers. Suppose you say something to someone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 100, 11, 8, 'that''s going to cause a distance between him and another brother or a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 100, 12, 8, 'sister that''s going to separate one sister from another sister,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 100, 13, 8, 'according to God''s word, God hates you. You are an abomination to God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 100, 14, 8, 'according to this verse. We have to be very careful when we say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 100, 15, 8, 'something to someone, that it does not make that sister or that brother');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 100, 16, 8, 'go further away from that other person, but rather closer to that other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 100, 17, 8, 'person. In The Living Bible it states: "The one that sows discord." This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 100, 18, 8, 'refers to words that are sown that don''t lead to unity but disunity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 100, 19, 8, 'There we have to remember the words of Jesus in Luke 11:23, "The one who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 100, 20, 8, 'does not gather with me is actually scattering." In other words, there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 100, 21, 8, 'is the possibility of gathering together with Jesus (Jesus is in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 100, 22, 8, 'business of getting people to be united), but if I don''t do that, I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 100, 23, 8, 'scattering. If my whole heart is not set on uniting the body of Christ,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 100, 24, 8, 'I''m scattering. I''m doing the work of the devil. That''s why we have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 100, 25, 8, 'be so careful in our speech. We can see how guilty we''ve all been when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 100, 26, 8, 'we say something bad about an absent person to someone. What have you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 100, 27, 8, 'succeeded in doing? You''ve succeeded in making the person whom you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 100, 28, 8, 'talking to a little more distant from that absent person. You become a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 101, 1, 8, 'person who brings division among believers and then you''re an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 101, 2, 8, 'abomination to God! God hates you! No wonder you don''t make spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 101, 3, 8, 'progress in your life. And that''s why, brothers and sisters, it''s very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 101, 4, 8, 'important that we take this one sin of bringing discord among people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 101, 5, 8, 'very seriously, because it will bring upon us God''s hatred and make us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 101, 6, 8, 'an abomination, a stinking abomination, to God, and all our prayers will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 101, 7, 8, 'be an absolute waste of time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 101, 8, 8, 'My son, observe the commandment of your father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 101, 9, 8, 'And do not forsake the teaching of your mother;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 101, 10, 8, 'Bind them continually on your heart;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 101, 11, 8, 'Tie them around your neck.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 101, 12, 8, 'When you walk about, they will guide you;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 101, 13, 8, 'When you sleep, they will watch over you;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 101, 14, 8, 'And when you awake, they will talk to you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 101, 15, 8, 'Prov 6:20-22');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 101, 16, 8, 'In contrast, Solomon says, "My son (the one who is willing to submit to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 101, 17, 8, 'my spiritual authority), observe the commandment of your father and do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 101, 18, 8, 'not forsake the teaching of your mother." Young children, respect the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 101, 19, 8, 'advice that your parents give you. Don''t despise them as old fashioned.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 101, 20, 8, 'Their advice can protect you. "Bind them continually on your heart."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 101, 21, 8, 'Notice the emphasis throughout Proverbs on the heart. "Tie them around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 101, 22, 8, 'your neck. When you walk about, they will guide you; When you sleep,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 101, 23, 8, 'they will watch over you; and when you awake, they will talk to you."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 101, 24, 8, 'This is God''s word that is delivered through God fearing parents.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 101, 25, 8, 'There''s a word for parents here as well. Can you honestly say to your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 101, 26, 8, 'children, "Observe the commandments of God that I have given you"? Or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 101, 27, 8, 'have we been so lazy that we''ve had no time to teach God''s commandments');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 101, 28, 8, 'to our children? That''s a challenge to parents. It''s not just our own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 102, 1, 8, 'bright ideas that we are to teach our children, but God''s commandments.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 102, 2, 8, 'When he says, "My son, observe the commandment of your father", it''s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 102, 3, 8, 'some bright idea the father has in his own head. It''s the commandment of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 102, 4, 8, 'God which a father gives to his son, according to what Moses told the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 102, 5, 8, 'Israelites: "You must teach your son these laws all the time, when you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 102, 6, 8, 'walk down the road, when you get up, when you sit down" (Deuteronomy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 102, 7, 8, '11:18-21). And that''s what it says here, when you walk about, those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 102, 8, 8, 'words will guide you; when you sleep, those words will watch over you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 102, 9, 8, '(they will even give you clean dreams at night); and when you wake up in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 102, 10, 8, 'the morning, God''s word is there again to speak to you. There is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 102, 11, 8, 'tremendous importance given to God''s word in the book of Proverbs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 102, 12, 8, 'Proverbs is the book of wisdom and when we see the tremendous importance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 102, 13, 8, 'given to God''s word, that teaches us that it''s impossible to have wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 102, 14, 8, 'unless we take the word of God seriously.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 102, 15, 8, 'For the commandment is a lamp and the teaching is light;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 102, 16, 8, 'And reproofs for discipline are the way of life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 102, 17, 8, 'Prov 6:23');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 102, 18, 8, 'A lamp is like a torchlight. An individual command of God''s word is like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 102, 19, 8, 'a torchlight, and the whole of God''s word is like a streetlight on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 102, 20, 8, 'road. That''s the imagery used here - that each commandment shows you one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 102, 21, 8, 'step that you can take and all of it together brightens up life''s path.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 102, 22, 8, '"Reproofs for discipline are the way of life", means that it is through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 102, 23, 8, 'correction and rebuke that we come to spiritual life. Throughout the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 102, 24, 8, 'book of Proverbs, we notice the contrast again and again between');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 102, 25, 8, 'flattery and rebuke. Flattery is the mark of the spiritual harlot.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 102, 26, 8, 'Rebuke and correction are the way of life. If you listen to that rebuke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 102, 27, 8, 'and correction, it will protect you and keep you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 102, 28, 8, 'To keep you from the evil woman,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 103, 1, 8, 'From the smooth tongue of the adulteress.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 103, 2, 8, 'Prov 6:24');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 103, 3, 8, 'It speaks here again about being kept from the evil woman. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 103, 4, 8, 'another thing we find again and again and again in the book of Proverbs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 103, 5, 8, 'It''s almost as though Solomon is never tired of warning young people to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 103, 6, 8, 'be particularly careful in their relationship with the opposite sex. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 103, 7, 8, 'you tremble at God''s word and take it seriously, it will keep you from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 103, 8, 8, 'that woman who can be Satan''s agent to ruin and destroy your life! And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 103, 9, 8, 'if he doesn''t succeed at ruining and destroying your life, he will at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 103, 10, 8, 'least try to destroy your spiritual usefulness to God as a man of God!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 103, 11, 8, 'There are people who are saved and yet fool around with women, and they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 103, 12, 8, 'have lost an entire ministry that God could have given to them! That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 103, 13, 8, 'something we have to take seriously. It''s not enough to say, "My sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 103, 14, 8, 'are forgiven." Imagine standing in eternity and finding out that God had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 103, 15, 8, 'a ministry for you, and you lost it just because you weren''t very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 103, 16, 8, 'careful in your relationships with the opposite sex. Think of standing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 103, 17, 8, 'in eternity and discovering that just for some silly little pleasure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 103, 18, 8, 'with some silly old girl, you lost a ministry that could have made all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 103, 19, 8, 'eternity glorious for yourself, but you lost it because you were such an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 103, 20, 8, 'idiot on earth. Think of the regret there will be in the hearts of many,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 103, 21, 8, 'many people on that day. Particularly when you''re young, be careful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 103, 22, 8, 'Take the book of Proverbs seriously. It will keep you from the evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 103, 23, 8, 'woman, from that smooth tongue of the adulterous. Here''s the contrast');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 103, 24, 8, 'between the rebuke of verse 23 and the flattery of the smooth tongue. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 103, 25, 8, 'is through flattery, as I''ve said, that most people fail and fall.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 103, 26, 8, 'Do not desire her beauty in your heart,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 103, 27, 8, 'Nor let her capture you with her eyelids.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 103, 28, 8, 'For on account of a harlot one is reduced to a loaf of bread,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 104, 1, 8, 'And an adulteress hunts for the precious life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 104, 2, 8, 'Prov 6:25-26');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 104, 3, 8, 'In verse 25 God gives us a warning through Solomon through the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 104, 4, 8, 'Spirit: "Do not desire her beauty in your heart." This almost looks like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 104, 5, 8, 'the New Covenant. It''s the nearest verse in the entire bible to Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 104, 6, 8, '5:28 where it says, do not lust after a woman in your heart. There''s no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 104, 7, 8, 'other verse in the entire bible which is as close to Matthew 5:28 as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 104, 8, 8, 'Proverbs 6:25. There is wisdom. Adultery begins in the heart. It begins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 104, 9, 8, 'with just an admiration of beauty in the opposite sex. I want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 104, 10, 8, 'emphasize this because there are Christians (believers) who teach that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 104, 11, 8, 'there''s nothing wrong in admiring beauty. That is because they have no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 104, 12, 8, 'fear of God in their heart. The word of God says, "Do not desire her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 104, 13, 8, 'beauty in your heart."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 104, 14, 8, 'Do you have a wrong understanding of physical beauty? Proverbs 31:30');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 104, 15, 8, 'says that physical beauty is an empty, hollow thing. Young men, I want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 104, 16, 8, 'to tell you this, if you don''t keep before your mind that physical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 104, 17, 8, 'beauty is an empty, hollow, useless thing, you''ll be deceived by it one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 104, 18, 8, 'day. You''ll get married to the wrong person and suffer for it the rest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 104, 19, 8, 'of your life. Don''t turn your eyes and look at beauty, saying, "Well,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 104, 20, 8, 'I''m not lusting. I''m only admiring the beauty." That is a terrific');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 104, 21, 8, 'deception and God sees it! God may have called all such men to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 104, 22, 8, 'ministry, but he puts them on the shelf and says, "You can''t have it. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 104, 23, 8, 'could have given a ministry to you, but you just fooled around with your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 104, 24, 8, 'eyes and called yourself a believer and talked about the New and Living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 104, 25, 8, 'Way, but you''re not wholehearted in this area!" Do not desire her beauty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 104, 26, 8, 'even in your heart! This is not talking about adultery. This is just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 104, 27, 8, 'speaking about admiring physical beauty in a girl! Don''t even admire it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 104, 28, 8, 'it says. Well, that''s wisdom if you want to take it. Be careful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 105, 1, 8, 'Then it says, "Don''t let her capture you with her eyelids." The word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 105, 2, 8, 'God is very practical. It says here that there''s something about a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 105, 3, 8, 'woman''s eyes which can catch a young man. And that''s why we find that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 105, 4, 8, 'the devil has taught girls nowadays to paint their eyelids to make them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 105, 5, 8, 'more attractive - all those fancy colors, and in case you''re one of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 105, 6, 8, 'those who want the mark of the beast on the hand so that you can have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 105, 7, 8, 'good testimony in the assembly, I assume there are some colorless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 105, 8, 8, 'varieties also that you can put on your eyes and lips and all over the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 105, 9, 8, 'place so that you can make yourself attractive. It says here, "Don''t let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 105, 10, 8, 'her catch you with her eyelids." I want to show you a verse in 2 Kings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 105, 11, 8, '9:30 that speaks of a girl with a painted face. That''s Jezebel. You also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 105, 12, 8, 'read about her in Revelation 2. There''s a Jezebel sitting in the church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 105, 13, 8, 'in Thyatira. It says in 2 Kings 9 when Jehu came to Jezreel, Jezebel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 105, 14, 8, 'heard of it, and she painted her eyes. Do you know there was mascara');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 105, 15, 8, 'used hundreds of years before Christ? It''s not a 20th century invention.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 105, 16, 8, 'Jezebel was the one who started that product. She painted her eyes and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 105, 17, 8, 'adorned her hair. I''m sure she painted the rest of her face too and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 105, 18, 8, 'looked out the window, and Jehu said in verse 33, "Throw her down!", and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 105, 19, 8, 'they threw her down and killed her. He wasn''t impressed by a painted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 105, 20, 8, 'face, and neither should you be. Jehu was not even a God-fearing man,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 105, 21, 8, 'and yet he could withstand all that. Be careful in this area of painted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 105, 22, 8, 'faces, and the eyelids particularly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 105, 23, 8, '"Don''t let her catch you with her eyelids," he says, because "on account');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 105, 24, 8, 'of a harlot the man is reduced to a loaf of bread", or as it says in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 105, 25, 8, 'another translation, "All that a harlot is interested in is a loaf of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 105, 26, 8, 'bread. There are two types of evil women spoken of in verse 26: One is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 105, 27, 8, 'the harlot - the regular prostitute who runs a business to make money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 105, 28, 8, 'and earn her living. The second is the adulteress. This is a woman who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 106, 1, 8, 'doesn''t do it for a living but just does it for fun. This type is more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 106, 2, 8, 'dangerous because you are not on guard. The prostitute is only out to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 106, 3, 8, 'earn a loaf of bread, but this other woman is the flirtatious type.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 106, 4, 8, 'She''s in or from a good home; maybe she''s married, maybe she''s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 106, 5, 8, 'married, but she''s the flirtatious type; there''s flirting in her eyes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 106, 6, 8, 'You have to be more careful of that one than of the prostitute. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 106, 7, 8, 'prostitute you know is dangerous, so you don''t go there, but this one,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 106, 8, 8, 'the one with the flirtatious eyes, the one who is probably a married');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 106, 9, 8, 'woman and who does not know how to submit to her husband and how to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 106, 10, 8, 'happy with her husband, you must be careful of.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 106, 11, 8, 'Can a man take fire in his bosom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 106, 12, 8, 'And his clothes not be burned?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 106, 13, 8, 'Or can a man walk on hot coals');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 106, 14, 8, 'And his feet not be scorched?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 106, 15, 8, 'So is the one who goes in to his neighbor''s wife;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 106, 16, 8, 'Whoever touches her will not go unpunished.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 106, 17, 8, 'Prov 6:27-29');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 106, 18, 8, 'Verses 27-29 speak about another man''s wife. Touching her is like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 106, 19, 8, 'touching dynamite. "Can a man take fire in his bosom and his clothes not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 106, 20, 8, 'be burned or can a man walk on hot coals and his feet not be scorched?"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 106, 21, 8, 'That''s impossible. Can you put fire onto dynamite and it not blow up? So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 106, 22, 8, 'is the one who goes into his neighbor''s wife and who fools around with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 106, 23, 8, 'the wife of another. Don''t even touch another woman immodestly, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 106, 24, 8, 'you will not go unpunished. Don''t become too friendly and familiar with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 106, 25, 8, 'somebody else''s wife.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 106, 26, 8, 'Men do not despise a thief if he steals');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 106, 27, 8, 'To satisfy himself when he is hungry;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 106, 28, 8, 'But when he is found, he must repay sevenfold;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 107, 1, 8, 'He must give all the substance of his house.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 107, 2, 8, 'The one who commits adultery with a woman is lacking sense;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 107, 3, 8, 'He who would destroy himself does it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 107, 4, 8, 'Prov 6:30-32');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 107, 5, 8, 'Verses 30 & 31 say that even a thief who''s stolen must repay and perhaps');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 107, 6, 8, 'even give the entire substance of his house, but the one who commits');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 107, 7, 8, 'adultery with a woman is lacking sense. He will destroy himself. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 107, 8, 8, 'other words, looseness in this area is equal to spiritual suicide.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 107, 9, 8, 'Playing the fool in this area is like committing suicide. Notice the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 107, 10, 8, 'strong warnings that Solomon gives to young people in this area of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 107, 11, 8, 'fooling around with other women.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 107, 12, 8, 'Wounds and disgrace he will find,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 107, 13, 8, 'And his reproach will not be blotted out.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 107, 14, 8, 'For jealousy enrages a man,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 107, 15, 8, 'And he will not spare in the day of vengeance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 107, 16, 8, 'He will not accept any ransom,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 107, 17, 8, 'Nor will he be satisfied though you give many gifts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 107, 18, 8, 'Prov 6:33-35');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 107, 19, 8, 'Verses 33-35 say that there will be a permanent reproach upon the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 107, 20, 8, 'adulterer''s life which can never be blotted out. God may forgive him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 107, 21, 8, 'but he looks at him as the man who did this thing and lost his ministry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 107, 22, 8, 'for his whole life, because he just wasn''t careful in this area.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 107, 23, 8, 'Furthermore, jealousy will enrage the man whose wife you fooled around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 107, 24, 8, 'with, and in the day he discovers it, the day of vengeance, he will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 107, 25, 8, 'spare you. He will not accept any excuse, any ransom, nor will he be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 107, 26, 8, 'content though you give him many gifts. Then, on top of that, there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 107, 27, 8, 'God''s judgment too. The bible says in Hebrews 13:4 that God will judge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 107, 28, 8, 'all fornicators and all adulterers. God will judge severely all those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 108, 1, 8, 'who sinned sexually with unmarried and married women; much more if they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 108, 2, 8, 'call themselves believers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 108, 3, 8, 'Ironically, the greatest warning of all from Chapter 6 is that the man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 108, 4, 8, 'who gave all these exhortations finally fell himself; not once, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 108, 5, 8, 'again and again and again. This teaches us that we can be so much of an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 108, 6, 8, 'expert in this area that we can listen to this word of God and say, "I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 108, 7, 8, 'don''t need that. I''m quite careful in that area." Well, that''s exactly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 108, 8, 8, 'what Solomon felt when he wrote this chapter. "He who thinks he stands');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 108, 9, 8, 'take heed lest he fall." Solomon''s fall is a tremendous warning for us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 108, 10, 8, 'Do you know that in the entire Old Testament, there was nobody who fell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 108, 11, 8, 'in this area as much as Solomon? Now, I''ll tell you something else. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 108, 12, 8, 'the entire Old Testament, there was no person who wrote as many warnings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 108, 13, 8, 'to people in this area as Solomon. He was the one who ended up with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 108, 14, 8, 'seven-hundred wives and three-hundred concubines. Imagine the way he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 108, 15, 8, 'fell. That''s there as a living warning, that you can know the theory of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 108, 16, 8, 'it, speak about it, and even warn and exhort others about it, but if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 108, 17, 8, 'don''t live in fear and trembling (regardless of your age, even if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 108, 18, 8, 'are seventy years-old), you can fall. So be careful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 108, 19, 9, 'Chapter 7 Chapter 7');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 108, 20, 9, 'My son, keep my words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 108, 21, 9, 'And treasure my commandments within you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 108, 22, 9, 'Keep my commandments and live,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 108, 23, 9, 'And my teaching as the apple of your eye.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 108, 24, 9, 'Bind them on your fingers;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 108, 25, 9, 'Write them on the tablet of your heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 108, 26, 9, 'Say to wisdom, "You are my sister,"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 108, 27, 9, 'And call understanding your intimate friend;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 108, 28, 9, 'That they may keep you from an adulteress,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 109, 1, 9, 'From the foreigner who flatters with her words.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 109, 2, 9, 'Prov 7:1-5');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 109, 3, 9, 'Chapter 7:1-5 continues on in the same theme. It''s amazing how much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 109, 4, 9, 'Solomon wrote about it and warned others and then finally fell himself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 109, 5, 9, '"My son, keep my words. Treasure my commandments within you." In other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 109, 6, 9, 'words, treat God''s word as a treasure. Value it. There are some who say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 109, 7, 9, 'they have a bad memory, but we don''t have a bad memory for the loans we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 109, 8, 9, 'give other people, do we? Do you remember all the loans you gave to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 109, 9, 9, 'other people? Do you remember all the evil things other people have done');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 109, 10, 9, 'to you? Sure you do. You can wake me up in the middle of the night and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 109, 11, 9, 'can tell you who borrowed from me, when he borrowed from me, and how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 109, 12, 9, 'much he owes me today including the interest. The reason I can remember');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 109, 13, 9, 'is because the rupees I lent are a treasure to me. That''s why I remember');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 109, 14, 9, 'it. But God''s word which I heard last week, I can say "Ah brother, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 109, 15, 9, 'have a poor memory. I can''t remember it." Why is it that we have a bad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 109, 16, 9, 'memory for scripture? I''ll tell you why. It''s not a treasure. That''s why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 109, 17, 9, 'I can''t remember it! It''s not something I take seriously. Therefore, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 109, 18, 9, 'says, "My son, keep my words and treasure my commandments within you."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 109, 19, 9, 'Keep God''s word like a treasure if you want to have wisdom! Otherwise we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 109, 20, 9, 'can live and die on this earth with money as our only treasure! Treat');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 109, 21, 9, 'God''s word as a treasure. Take each commandment and know it. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 109, 22, 9, 'God''s will. Those who take God''s word as a treasure, they will come to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 109, 23, 9, 'wisdom. Nobody else. "Keep my commandments and live! And my teaching as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 109, 24, 9, 'the apple of your eye." It says in the Good News Translation, "Be as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 109, 25, 9, 'careful to follow my teaching as you are to protect your eyes." If one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 109, 26, 9, 'speck of dust goes into our eye, it will keep on bothering us until we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 109, 27, 9, 'stop all our work and go and wash it out. We go to a brother and say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 109, 28, 9, '"Please blow my eye," when there''s one speck of dust. God says, "Let me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 110, 1, 9, 'find someone who''s interested in following my teaching in that way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 110, 2, 9, 'He''ll be wise very quickly." It''s a matter of taking God''s word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 110, 3, 9, 'seriously. It says here to take care of God''s word like you take care of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 110, 4, 9, 'your eyes and then you''ll become wise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 110, 5, 9, '"Bind them on your fingers and write them on the tablet of your heart."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 110, 6, 9, 'That is referring to the outward life and the inner life. In The Living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 110, 7, 9, 'Bible version, verse 4 says, "Love wisdom like a sweetheart. Make her a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 110, 8, 9, 'beloved member of your family." A sweetheart is someone you love very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 110, 9, 9, 'much; a darling. Love wisdom like a sweetheart. Think of a young man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 110, 10, 9, 'who''s so gripped with the desire to have God''s wisdom, that wisdom has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 110, 11, 9, 'become his sweetheart. He longs for wisdom. That''s what God''s word says.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 110, 12, 9, '"Call understanding your intimate friend." Your closest friend. Young');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 110, 13, 9, 'people in the church should long to be with wisdom, wisdom in all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 110, 14, 9, 'situations, like a young man in the world wants to be with a sweetheart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 110, 15, 9, 'In verse 5, it states that it will keep you from the adulteress (again');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 110, 16, 9, 'it speaks about the adulteress) or the strange woman, and her weapon is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 110, 17, 9, '(again) flattery. Notice the number of times already in the first 7');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 110, 18, 9, 'chapters we''ve come across flattery as Satan''s master weapon. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 110, 19, 9, 'young men and young women are careful about the flattering words that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 110, 20, 9, 'other people speak to you, then you can protect yourself. This includes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 110, 21, 9, 'young women too. Some young man can come and say flattering words to you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 110, 22, 9, 'and your defenses are gone and you yield. Be careful of flattery. Be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 110, 23, 9, 'careful of those who will say nice things to you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 110, 24, 9, 'This applies to the false church as well, because the strange woman here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 110, 25, 9, 'is also the false church - Babylon, the harlot whose weapon is also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 110, 26, 9, 'flattery. In Jerusalem, we don''t hear flattery. What do we hear? Rebuke.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 110, 27, 9, 'Correction. People may get sick and tired of it, but it sanctifies them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 110, 28, 9, 'The alternative is to go and sit and listen to flattering words and end');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 111, 1, 9, 'up in Hell. And so it says here, beware of flattery. Beware of people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 111, 2, 9, 'who say things just to flatter you. We have no understanding of wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 111, 3, 9, 'if our closest friends are those who flatter us. Ask yourself if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 111, 4, 9, 'feel more happy with those who say nice things to you and flatter you or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 111, 5, 9, 'someone who rebukes you and corrects you and tells you the truth to your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 111, 6, 9, 'face. That''s a pretty good test of whether you love wisdom or whether');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 111, 7, 9, 'you love yourself. If I love myself, I''ll seek the fellowship of those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 111, 8, 9, 'who only say nice things to me, smooth words and flattering words, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 111, 9, 9, 'I''ll say, "These are wonderful brothers and sisters." That shows how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 111, 10, 9, 'much I love myself. But if I love wisdom, and I see how little of it I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 111, 11, 9, 'have, I''ll seek the fellowship of those who won''t flatter me, but who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 111, 12, 9, 'will correct and rebuke me and tell me the truth that I need to hear!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 111, 13, 9, 'That''s how we must have it in the church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 111, 14, 9, 'For at the window of my house');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 111, 15, 9, 'I looked out through my lattice,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 111, 16, 9, 'And I saw among the naive,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 111, 17, 9, 'And discerned among the youths');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 111, 18, 9, 'A young man lacking sense,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 111, 19, 9, 'Passing through the street near her corner;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 111, 20, 9, 'And he takes the way to her house,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 111, 21, 9, 'In the twilight, in the evening,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 111, 22, 9, 'In the middle of the night and in the darkness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 111, 23, 9, 'And behold, a woman comes to meet him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 111, 24, 9, 'Dressed as a harlot and cunning of heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 111, 25, 9, 'She is boisterous and rebellious,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 111, 26, 9, 'Her feet do not remain at home;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 111, 27, 9, 'She is now in the streets, now in the squares,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 111, 28, 9, 'And lurks by every corner.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 112, 1, 9, 'So she seizes him and kisses him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 112, 2, 9, 'And with a brazen face she says to him:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 112, 3, 9, '"I was due to offer peace offerings;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 112, 4, 9, 'Today I have paid my vows.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 112, 5, 9, '"Therefore I have come out to meet you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 112, 6, 9, 'To seek your presence earnestly, and I have found you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 112, 7, 9, '"I have spread my couch with coverings,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 112, 8, 9, 'With colored linens of Egypt.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 112, 9, 9, '"I have sprinkled my bed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 112, 10, 9, 'With myrrh, aloes and cinnamon.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 112, 11, 9, '"Come, let us drink our fill of love until morning;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 112, 12, 9, 'Let us delight ourselves with caresses.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 112, 13, 9, '"For my husband is not at home,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 112, 14, 9, 'He has gone on a long journey;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 112, 15, 9, 'He has taken a bag of money with him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 112, 16, 9, 'At the full moon he will come home."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 112, 17, 9, 'With her many persuasions she entices him;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 112, 18, 9, 'With her flattering lips she seduces him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 112, 19, 9, 'Suddenly he follows her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 112, 20, 9, 'As an ox goes to the slaughter,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 112, 21, 9, 'Or as one in fetters to the discipline of a fool,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 112, 22, 9, 'Until an arrow pierces through his liver;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 112, 23, 9, 'As a bird hastens to the snare,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 112, 24, 9, 'So he does not know that it will cost him his life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 112, 25, 9, 'Now therefore, my sons, listen to me,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 112, 26, 9, 'And pay attention to the words of my mouth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 112, 27, 9, 'Do not let your heart turn aside to her ways,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 112, 28, 9, 'Do not stray into her paths.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 113, 1, 9, 'For many are the victims she has cast down,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 113, 2, 9, 'And numerous are all her slain.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 113, 3, 9, 'Her house is the way to Sheol,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 113, 4, 9, 'Descending to the chambers of death.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 113, 5, 9, 'Prov 7:6-27');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 113, 6, 9, 'Solomon then relays an instance of a young man. In verse 6, it states,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 113, 7, 9, '"At the window of my house, I looked out through my lattice and I saw');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 113, 8, 9, 'amongst all the simple people going down the roads, I saw one young man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 113, 9, 9, 'lacking sense." It''s difficult for young people to realize that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 113, 10, 9, 'lack wisdom. In Proverbs 4:7, it says, "The beginning of wisdom is to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 113, 11, 9, 'acquire wisdom." We can put it like this: The first step to acquire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 113, 12, 9, 'wisdom is to acknowledge that you don''t have it. Don''t just say that in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 113, 13, 9, 'false humility, "Oh, I lack wisdom," but really be gripped by that and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 113, 14, 9, 'say, "Lord, I just don''t have it." That is very difficult for young');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 113, 15, 9, 'people to acknowledge, because they say, "Yeah, yeah, I know how to take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 113, 16, 9, 'care of myself." They tell their parents, "You don''t have to tell me,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 113, 17, 9, 'Daddy and Mommy. I know how to take care of myself." They don''t and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 113, 18, 9, 'sad thing is, they don''t even realize their need. That''s the condition');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 113, 19, 9, 'of most young people in the world today. But if you''re humble and you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 113, 20, 9, 'want to be a God-fearing person, acknowledge your need.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 113, 21, 9, 'He says, "Among all the bunch of the young people going down the roads,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 113, 22, 9, 'I saw one young man really lacking sense." He was the worst of the lot.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 113, 23, 9, 'And it says, "He passed through the street, through her corner," because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 113, 24, 9, 'he knew there was a good looking girl over there. He thought, "You know,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 113, 25, 9, 'I think I''ll just go for a walk," and he found his feet were taking him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 113, 26, 9, 'in a particular direction, and he took the bypass which goes near her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 113, 27, 9, 'house. Think of the folly in all of this. It was evening, twilight, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 113, 28, 9, 'then the middle of the night. Young people, you should be very thankful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 114, 1, 9, 'if you have parents who tell you to be back home by 9:30 at night, so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 114, 2, 9, 'that you''re protected from these loafer type of young people, who can go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 114, 3, 9, 'out in the evening and walk here and there. They are exposing themselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 114, 4, 9, 'to temptation. The bible says, "Flee from youthful lusts." Don''t put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 114, 5, 9, 'yourself in places where you can be tempted in the twilight, in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 114, 6, 9, 'evening, in the middle of the night walking around, idle. It''s a sad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 114, 7, 9, 'thing when young people are idle. Here was a young man with nothing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 114, 8, 9, 'do. His father didn''t have enough sense to give him some work to do at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 114, 9, 9, 'home. He didn''t have enough to study, perhaps. Idle. It''s good to give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 114, 10, 9, 'our children something to do so that they don''t have time to loaf down');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 114, 11, 9, 'the streets like this.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 114, 12, 9, '"And behold, a woman comes to meet him, dressed as a harlot…" It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 114, 13, 9, 'possible not to be a harlot but to still dress like a harlot. Then you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 114, 14, 9, 'come under this category. Proverbs 7:10 says, "dressed as a harlot,"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 114, 15, 9, 'which speaks of those who don''t know how to dress modestly. Dressed as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 114, 16, 9, 'harlot! Dear young sisters, don''t let Proverbs 7:10 be a description of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 114, 17, 9, 'your dress at any time of your life. Unfortunately, there are believers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 114, 18, 9, 'who dress like harlots, who reveal their bodies.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 114, 19, 9, 'Then it says she is cunning of heart. Young men, remember, a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 114, 20, 9, 'young women out in the world are cunning of heart. They want to grab');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 114, 21, 9, 'you. Don''t be so stupid to fall prey to their trap. There are 3 things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 114, 22, 9, 'mentioned in verse 11 about this type of woman:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 114, 23, 9, '1. She''s boisterous - That means she''s noisy. It''s not good for a woman');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 114, 24, 9, 'to be noisy. A woman needs to speak a little softly and gently. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 114, 25, 9, 'alright if a man is a little noisy, but there is something odd about a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 114, 26, 9, 'woman being noisy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 114, 27, 9, '2. Rebellious - A woman who does not know how to submit to her husband.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 114, 28, 9, 'That''s a very sad thing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 115, 1, 9, '3. Her feet do not remain at home -That''s also very sad. This is a woman');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 115, 2, 9, 'who wanders here and there, wasting time instead of taking care of her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 115, 3, 9, 'family.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 115, 4, 9, 'Dressed as a harlot, boisterous, rebellious, and a wanderer. Let none of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 115, 5, 9, 'those things describe any of the sisters in the church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 115, 6, 9, 'In verses 12-15, we read that she is now in the streets and in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 115, 7, 9, 'squares, visiting this house and that house, gossiping here and there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 115, 8, 9, 'and all over the place. She is a married woman, but she finds this young');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 115, 9, 9, 'man and seizes him and kisses him with a bold face. She says to him, "I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 115, 10, 9, 'was due to offer peace offerings." Peace offerings were the offerings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 115, 11, 9, 'that Israelites had to offer to God in the Old Testament. We read about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 115, 12, 9, 'Moses laying down laws concerning these offerings in Leviticus 7. We see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 115, 13, 9, 'that this woman is the religious type who goes to the meetings and gives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 115, 14, 9, 'peace offerings. In the Good News Translation, they''re called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 115, 15, 9, '"fellowship offerings". She says, "I have offered my peace offerings. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 115, 16, 9, 'am in fellowship with God. Everything''s alright between me and God, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 115, 17, 9, 'I''ve paid my vows to Him. I''ve done my religious duty. Now I can have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 115, 18, 9, 'some fun." There are lots of believers that think that just a little bit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 115, 19, 9, 'of religion can excuse all of their worldliness and sinful fun. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 115, 20, 9, 'the religious type! This is the one who goes to the meetings and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 115, 21, 9, 'probably sings in the choir. We have to be particularly careful about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 115, 22, 9, 'these religious types of women who are flirts. Don''t think these flirts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 115, 23, 9, 'are only out there in the world. They can be sitting right in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 115, 24, 9, 'assembly! They are not wholehearted and they do not have modesty. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 115, 25, 9, 'can see it in their eyes, you can see it in the way they dress, you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 115, 26, 9, 'see it in their noisiness, and you can see it in their wandering around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 115, 27, 9, 'to every house instead of learning to sit at home. Be careful of such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 115, 28, 9, 'girls because those are not the type of girls any wholehearted man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 116, 1, 9, 'should ever marry. She then says, "I''ve come to meet you, to seek your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 116, 2, 9, 'presence earnestly, and I have found you" There''s the flattery. "I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 116, 3, 9, 'sought you. Ah, you were the brother I was seeking for fellowship."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 116, 4, 9, 'Beware of flattery. You may not go to the extent this woman went, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 116, 5, 9, 'the seed of it can be there. We have to get rid of the serpent''s egg as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 116, 6, 9, 'well. Love rebuke, young brothers and sisters! Love rebuke! Love it when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 116, 7, 9, 'your parents rebuke you and correct you! Then you will be protected.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 116, 8, 9, 'She then says in verses 16-17, "I have spread my couch (that''s my bed)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 116, 9, 9, 'with coverings, with colored linens from Egypt. I''ve sprinkled my bed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 116, 10, 9, 'with myrrh and aloes and cinnamon." All of that is luxury. Her foolish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 116, 11, 9, 'husband wasted his money getting these colored linens of Egypt when some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 116, 12, 9, 'ordinary bed sheet would have done, and wasted money on myrrh and aloes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 116, 13, 9, 'and cinnamon. There''s evil in all this unnecessary luxury. His wife');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 116, 14, 9, 'doesn''t have to work hard with her hands to make ends meet in the home.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 116, 15, 9, 'She lies down on the colored linens of Egypt and has money to waste on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 116, 16, 9, 'myrrh and aloes and cinnamon. Be thankful, dear wives, that you have so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 116, 17, 9, 'much work in the home that you don''t have time to waste like this. Be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 116, 18, 9, 'thankful if your husband cannot afford all the colored linens of Egypt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 116, 19, 9, 'and all these fancy perfumes. You''re protected from many evils through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 116, 20, 9, 'hard work and through struggling to make ends meet. There are many evils');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 116, 21, 9, 'in luxury and in high society. You might think that people in high');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 116, 22, 9, 'society have such an easy time, but think of all the evil there is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 116, 23, 9, 'that type of lifestyle. Even today you find such women in high society');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 116, 24, 9, 'fooling around with other men.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 116, 25, 9, 'She then says to this young man whom she has met, "Come, let us drink');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 116, 26, 9, 'our fill of love!" It''s not love, it''s lust. When the cinemas speak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 116, 27, 9, 'about love, it''s actually lust. Love is what was manifested on Calvary''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 116, 28, 9, 'cross. Jesus, in all his purity and obedience to the Father, loved us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 117, 1, 9, 'and gave his life for us. There''s nothing else that''s worth being called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 117, 2, 9, 'love. All the rest must be spelled "L" "U" "S" "T", even if it''s called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 117, 3, 9, 'love in the world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 117, 4, 9, 'Then she says in verses 18-19: "Until morning, let us delight ourselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 117, 5, 9, 'with caresses for my husband is not at home. He has gone on a long');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 117, 6, 9, 'journey." I want to emphasize to all men: never visit a home and sit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 117, 7, 9, 'there when the husband is not there. Don''t sit there and say, "Oh, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 117, 8, 9, 'we are brothers and sisters." That''s how it all begins. At the judgment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 117, 9, 9, 'seat of Christ, you''ll see how many people fell into sin that way. Stay');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 117, 10, 9, 'clear - even if it''s a sister in the fellowship, even if it''s a modest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 117, 11, 9, 'one, stay clear for the sake of your own testimony. I''m not saying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 117, 12, 9, 'they''re evil. Even if you go to the home of the most wholehearted sister');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 117, 13, 9, 'in the fellowship, in order to be a good example to others, stay out of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 117, 14, 9, 'her house if the husband is not there. He who has ears to hear, let him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 117, 15, 9, 'hear. It speaks in 2 Timothy 3:6 about men like Jannes and Jambres, who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 117, 16, 9, 'enter into households, who have a form of godliness (verse 5), who speak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 117, 17, 9, 'about the New and Living Way, but who don''t have any fear of God. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 117, 18, 9, 'enter into houses when the men are not there and captivate these weak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 117, 19, 9, 'women. These are the people who, like Jannes and Jambres, opposed Moses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 117, 20, 9, '(verse 8). Don''t fall into that category. Be wise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 117, 21, 9, 'In verse 20, we read that this woman managed to capture this young man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 117, 22, 9, 'and said, "My husband is not at home, He has gone on a long journey; He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 117, 23, 9, 'has taken a bag of money with him, At the full moon he will come home. "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 117, 24, 9, 'And then it says in verse 21, "With her many persuasions, she entices');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 117, 25, 9, 'him." And this idiot fell, but only has himself to blame for hanging');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 117, 26, 9, 'around there all of the time and exposing himself to temptation. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 117, 27, 9, 'young chap didn''t yield in the beginning, but she kept on with her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 117, 28, 9, 'flattery and prolonged the conversation until finally he fell. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 118, 1, 9, 'Genesis 39 you read of Joseph and how Potiphar''s wife tempted him and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 118, 2, 9, 'tempted him but he ran. That''s the thing we have to do: run when you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 118, 3, 9, 'find temptation in your heart. "With her flattering lips she seduces');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 118, 4, 9, 'him." I really believe, brothers, dear young brothers, if after all that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 118, 5, 9, 'you read in this book, in the day of judgment you find that you''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 118, 6, 9, 'fallen in this area, you''ll have no excuse. You heard it clearly in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 118, 7, 9, 'church again and again and again. Beware of flattery.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 118, 8, 9, 'Then in verse 22, "Suddenly!" Gradually she weakens him and weakens him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 118, 9, 9, 'and weakens him, and then suddenly he falls as an ox goes to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 118, 10, 9, 'slaughter. The poor ox doesn''t know it''s going to the slaughter house');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 118, 11, 9, 'and this poor fellow doesn''t know he''s being led to the slaughter house');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 118, 12, 9, 'by the devil. His whole life is ruined in a moment. It''s like a bird');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 118, 13, 9, 'seeing a trap and running into the trap. He does not know it will cost');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 118, 14, 9, 'him his life. That''s a pretty strong warning for those who have ears to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 118, 15, 9, 'hear.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 118, 16, 9, 'Lastly it says in verse 24, "Now therefore, my sons (all those who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 118, 17, 9, 'willing to listen), listen to me, pay attention to the words of my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 118, 18, 9, 'mouth. Do not let your heart turn aside to her ways." Long before your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 118, 19, 9, 'feet get there, your heart sits at home and thinks, "Maybe I''ll go and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 118, 20, 9, 'visit her or I''ll take a walk down her street." It starts in the heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 118, 21, 9, 'He says you must stop it there! Don''t let your heart begin to long for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 118, 22, 9, 'someone''s beauty. Then he says, if your heart has already acted, then at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 118, 23, 9, 'least stop your feet. "Because many (millions) are the victims she has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 118, 24, 9, 'cast down, and numerous (too numerous to number) are the ones she has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 118, 25, 9, 'slain. Her house is the way to Hell, descending to the chambers of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 118, 26, 9, 'death." Do you know what the way to Hell is? Flirting girls. It''s pretty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 118, 27, 9, 'strong language the word of God uses. If only all the so-called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 118, 28, 9, 'Christian men in the world had taken these words seriously, they would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 119, 1, 9, 'have been protected from so much ruin and evil in their lives. "If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 119, 2, 9, 'go to her house," the Good News Translation says, "you''re on your way to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 119, 3, 9, 'Hell." If you choose to go to such a girl''s house, you''ve already taken');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 119, 4, 9, 'the first step to Hell.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 119, 5, 10, 'Chapter 8 Chapter 8');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 119, 6, 10, 'Does not wisdom call,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 119, 7, 10, 'And understanding lift up her voice?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 119, 8, 10, 'On top of the heights beside the way,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 119, 9, 10, 'Where the paths meet, she takes her stand;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 119, 10, 10, 'Beside the gates, at the opening to the city,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 119, 11, 10, 'At the entrance of the doors, she cries out:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 119, 12, 10, '"To you, O men, I call,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 119, 13, 10, 'And my voice is to the sons of men.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 119, 14, 10, '"O naive ones, understand prudence;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 119, 15, 10, 'And, O fools, understand wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 119, 16, 10, '"Listen, for I will speak noble things;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 119, 17, 10, 'And the opening of my lips will reveal right things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 119, 18, 10, '"For my mouth will utter truth;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 119, 19, 10, 'And wickedness is an abomination to my lips.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 119, 20, 10, '"All the utterances of my mouth are in righteousness;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 119, 21, 10, 'There is nothing crooked or perverted in them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 119, 22, 10, '"They are all straightforward to him who understands,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 119, 23, 10, 'And right to those who find knowledge.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 119, 24, 10, 'Prov 8:1-9');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 119, 25, 10, 'Now in contrast to all this, it says in Proverbs 8:1-9, "Does not wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 119, 26, 10, 'call?" Wisdom here is pictured as a pure young woman, calling people,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 119, 27, 10, 'calling young men. Love wisdom. Understanding lifts up her voice. Wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 119, 28, 10, 'stands all over the place: "on the top of the heights, beside the way,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 120, 1, 10, 'where the paths meet (that''s where you''ve come to a crossroads and you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 120, 2, 10, 'want to take the road to that strange woman''s house - wisdom is there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 120, 3, 10, 'saying, ''Don''t go!''), beside the gates (saying, ''Don''t go in through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 120, 4, 10, 'that gate because it''s not good for you''), at the opening of the city,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 120, 5, 10, 'at the entrance of the doors." In other words, she''s all over the place!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 120, 6, 10, '"To you, O men, I call, and my voice is to the sons of men. O simple');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 120, 7, 10, 'ones, discern prudence." She''s calling everyone. Wisdom calls everyone,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 120, 8, 10, 'everywhere. This is what wisdom is shouting out to all people: "Are you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 120, 9, 10, 'immature? Learn to be mature. Are you foolish? Learn to have some sense.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 120, 10, 10, 'Learn to be wise" (Good News Translation). That''s the call of wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 120, 11, 10, 'She says, "Listen, for I will speak noble things; and the opening of my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 120, 12, 10, 'lips will reveal right things. For my mouth will utter truth and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 120, 13, 10, 'wickedness is an abomination to my lips." Wisdom says, "I''ll teach you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 120, 14, 10, 'to stop gossiping. I''ll teach you to stop telling lies. I''ll get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 120, 15, 10, 'crookedness out of your conversation, because wickedness is an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 120, 16, 10, 'abomination to my lips. All the utterances of my mouth are in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 120, 17, 10, 'righteousness." There is no guile or hypocrisy, nothing crooked or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 120, 18, 10, 'perverted in wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 120, 19, 10, '"They''re all straightforward to him who understands, And right to those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 120, 20, 10, 'who find knowledge." Verse 9 is very beautifully paraphrased in The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 120, 21, 10, 'Living Bible, "My words are plain and clear to anyone with half a mind,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 120, 22, 10, 'if only it is open." Even if you only have half a mind (which means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 120, 23, 10, 'you''re a bit of an idiot), if that half a mind is open, you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 120, 24, 10, 'understand God''s wisdom. You don''t have to be clever. That''s the point.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 120, 25, 10, 'Even if you are stupid and you didn''t pass in your school final, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 120, 26, 10, 'doesn''t make any difference. You can be wise if your mind is open. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 120, 27, 10, 'can see the reason why so many clever, intelligent people are so foolish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 120, 28, 10, 'when it comes to these things. They don''t have any wisdom concerning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 121, 1, 10, 'eternal things because their mind is not open. Like Jesus said, "I thank');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 121, 2, 10, 'you Father that you have hidden all these things from the wise and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 121, 3, 10, 'clever and the intelligent people and you have revealed them to little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 121, 4, 10, 'babes who come in humility." It''s very difficult sometimes for young');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 121, 5, 10, 'people to be a little babe. There was a godly brother in Norway who got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 121, 6, 10, 'all the young people under 35 to stand up in a conference and repeat');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 121, 7, 10, 'after him. He said, "I am young and I am stupid and I know almost');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 121, 8, 10, 'nothing. Therefore, I will submit to my elders." He said, "Say that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 121, 9, 10, 'again - ''I am young and I am stupid and I know almost nothing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 121, 10, 10, 'Therefore, I will submit to my elders.''" He said, "If you remember that,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 121, 11, 10, 'you''ll be wise." It''s very difficult for people under 35 to say that,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 121, 12, 10, 'because they think they know quite a lot, particularly if they are a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 121, 13, 10, 'little clever and are able to grasp the scriptures quickly. They know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 121, 14, 10, 'almost nothing. It''s difficult to acknowledge unless they become like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 121, 15, 10, 'babes. If the mind is open, it can receive wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 121, 16, 10, 'Take my instruction and not silver,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 121, 17, 10, 'And knowledge rather than choicest gold.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 121, 18, 10, 'For wisdom is better than jewels;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 121, 19, 10, 'And all desirable things cannot compare with her.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 121, 20, 10, 'Prov 8:10-11');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 121, 21, 10, 'Here we read that we can get wisdom only if we value wisdom more than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 121, 22, 10, 'anything in this whole, wide world. Only if you value divine wisdom more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 121, 23, 10, 'than a promotion in your job, more than money, more than all the jewels');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 121, 24, 10, 'and gold and silver and property, and more than everything you consider');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 121, 25, 10, 'valuable. The people who get wisdom are those who say, "Lord, I want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 121, 26, 10, 'more than anything on this earth to have your wisdom in my life, to have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 121, 27, 10, 'your nature in my life, to have that purity and peaceableness and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 121, 28, 10, 'goodness (that are the characteristics of divine wisdom described in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 122, 1, 10, 'James 3:17) in my life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 122, 2, 10, 'I, wisdom, dwell with prudence,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 122, 3, 10, 'And I find knowledge and discretion.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 122, 4, 10, 'The fear of the Lord is to hate evil;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 122, 5, 10, 'Pride and arrogance and the evil way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 122, 6, 10, 'And the perverted mouth, I hate.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 122, 7, 10, 'Prov 8:12-13');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 122, 8, 10, 'There are two things we''ll find again and again in the book of Proverbs:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 122, 9, 10, 'the fear of the Lord and humility. It is through the fear of God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 122, 10, 10, 'humility that we get wisdom and if a church is to be built with wisdom,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 122, 11, 10, 'then we must be in a church that teaches us at least these two things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 122, 12, 10, 'It doesn''t matter if a church doesn''t teach us all about the tribulation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 122, 13, 10, 'and the millennium and which side of the forehead the mark of the beast');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 122, 14, 10, 'is going to be - the left side or right side. These are not important.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 122, 15, 10, 'But if a church can teach us the fear of God and humility, that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 122, 16, 10, 'enough. Those are the main things. That''s wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 122, 17, 10, 'Counsel is mine and sound wisdom;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 122, 18, 10, 'I am understanding, power is mine.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 122, 19, 10, 'By me kings reign,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 122, 20, 10, 'And rulers decree justice.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 122, 21, 10, 'By me princes rule, and nobles,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 122, 22, 10, 'All who judge rightly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 122, 23, 10, 'Prov 8:14-16');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 122, 24, 10, 'All who are sensible rulers will seek God''s wisdom. This also applies to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 122, 25, 10, 'fathers. Fathers are rulers in their home and if they are sensible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 122, 26, 10, 'fathers, they will get on their knees before God and say, "Oh God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 122, 27, 10, 'please help me as a stupid, idiot of a father to have some wisdom to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 122, 28, 10, 'bring up my children rightly." Have you ever said that to God, fathers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 123, 1, 10, 'and mothers? "God, please help me. I am a bit of an idiot as a mother,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 123, 2, 10, 'but please help me to have wisdom." All those who judge rightly will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 123, 3, 10, 'seek wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 123, 4, 10, 'I love those who love me;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 123, 5, 10, 'And those who diligently seek me will find me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 123, 6, 10, 'Prov 8:17');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 123, 7, 10, 'In verse 17, we see why many people don''t find - because they do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 123, 8, 10, 'seek diligently. The best time to seek for wisdom is when you''re young');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 123, 9, 10, 'so you will become a wise, mature young brother or sister; one who knows');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 123, 10, 10, 'how to conduct himself in a godly way in all his relationships. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 123, 11, 10, 'see some older person behaving like a fool, don''t imitate that person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 123, 12, 10, 'If some older brother or sister is gossiping, don''t get involved in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 123, 13, 10, 'that. Steer clear.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 123, 14, 10, 'It says in the King James Version, "those who seek me early find me,"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 123, 15, 10, 'which means it''s good to seek for wisdom when we are young. It''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 123, 16, 10, 'wonderful thing to begin the pursuit of wisdom from the age of 10-12,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 123, 17, 10, 'because it says about Jesus in Luke 2 that he grew in wisdom from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 123, 18, 10, 'age of 12. We do not have to wait until we are 25 or 30 to seek for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 123, 19, 10, 'wisdom, but right from our childhood days we can seek for it. You can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 123, 20, 10, 'seek for it before you enter your teenage years which will protect you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 123, 21, 10, 'from a lot of folly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 123, 22, 10, 'Riches and honor are with me,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 123, 23, 10, 'Enduring wealth and righteousness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 123, 24, 10, 'My fruit is better than gold, even pure gold,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 123, 25, 10, 'And my yield better than choicest silver.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 123, 26, 10, 'I walk in the way of righteousness,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 123, 27, 10, 'In the midst of the paths of justice,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 123, 28, 10, 'To endow those who love me with wealth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 124, 1, 10, 'That I may fill their treasuries.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 124, 2, 10, 'Prov 8:18-21');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 124, 3, 10, 'What do young people seek? Riches and honor. Wisdom says, "I''ll give it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 124, 4, 10, 'to you." Not this empty, worldly stuff. The real stuff. It would be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 124, 5, 10, 'wonderful thing if every young brother and sister in this church would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 124, 6, 10, 'seek for wisdom wholeheartedly right from their youth. The calling of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 124, 7, 10, 'this chapter is to seek those spiritual riches and honor that wisdom can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 124, 8, 10, 'give.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 124, 9, 10, 'Verse 18 means that everything this world considers wealth and honor and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 124, 10, 10, 'riches is empty if we don''t have wisdom. Wisdom is the real treasure of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 124, 11, 10, 'heaven. Jesus said to lay up treasures in heaven and not on the earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 124, 12, 10, 'We know what treasures on the earth are but the treasure of heaven is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 124, 13, 10, 'the wisdom of God. That is what we are to lay up while we are on earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 124, 14, 10, 'We won''t get it all of a sudden up there in heaven. If we don''t lay it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 124, 15, 10, 'up before we go there, we''re not going to have it. Therefore, God allows');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 124, 16, 10, 'us to go through various situations on earth so that we can lay up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 124, 17, 10, 'treasure, the real treasure of heaven, which is wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 124, 18, 10, 'Verses 19-21 are ways in which the Holy Spirit is trying to emphasize to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 124, 19, 10, 'young people particularly, the tremendous necessity and importance of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 124, 20, 10, 'seeking for wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 124, 21, 10, 'The Lord possessed me at the beginning of His way,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 124, 22, 10, 'Before His works of old.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 124, 23, 10, 'From everlasting I was established,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 124, 24, 10, 'From the beginning, from the earliest times of the earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 124, 25, 10, 'When there were no depths I was brought forth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 124, 26, 10, 'When there were no springs abounding with water.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 124, 27, 10, 'Before the mountains were settled,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 124, 28, 10, 'Before the hills I was brought forth;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 125, 1, 10, 'While He had not yet made the earth and the fields,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 125, 2, 10, 'Nor the first dust of the world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 125, 3, 10, 'When He established the heavens, I was there,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 125, 4, 10, 'When He inscribed a circle on the face of the deep,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 125, 5, 10, 'When He made firm the skies above,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 125, 6, 10, 'When the springs of the deep became fixed,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 125, 7, 10, 'When He set for the sea its boundary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 125, 8, 10, 'So that the water would not transgress His command,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 125, 9, 10, 'When He marked out the foundations of the earth;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 125, 10, 10, 'Then I was beside Him, as a master workman;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 125, 11, 10, 'And I was daily His delight,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 125, 12, 10, 'Rejoicing always before Him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 125, 13, 10, 'Prov 8:22-30');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 125, 14, 10, 'Verses 22-29 show that God''s wisdom was there even before creation. "The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 125, 15, 10, 'Lord possessed me at the beginning of his way before his works of old.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 125, 16, 10, 'From everlasting I was established." In other words, long before there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 125, 17, 10, 'was anything of this universe or any material things created, wisdom was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 125, 18, 10, 'there. God had wisdom before material things. Of course, we know that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 125, 19, 10, 'wisdom is manifested to us through Jesus Christ. We read in 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 125, 20, 10, 'Corinthians 1:30, "Jesus Christ has been made the wisdom of God to us."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 125, 21, 10, 'Verse 23 states, "From everlasting I was established," (which means from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 125, 22, 10, 'the beginning; from the earliest times of the earth; from all eternity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 125, 23, 10, 'past).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 125, 24, 10, 'It goes on to say that God inscribed a circle on the face of the deep.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 125, 25, 10, 'This is one of the verses in the Old Testament which tell us that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 125, 26, 10, 'earth is not flat, but spherical. It''s amazing that man only discovered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 125, 27, 10, 'it four-hundred years ago, but it was there in the Bible three-thousand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 125, 28, 10, 'years ago during Solomon''s time. "When he inscribed the circle (or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 126, 1, 10, 'sphere) on the face of the deep, when he made firm the skies above, when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 126, 2, 10, 'the springs of the deep became fixed, when he set for the sea its');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 126, 3, 10, 'boundary (speaking of the sand on the beaches which became the boundary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 126, 4, 10, 'for the sea so that the sea would not cross it) so that the water should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 126, 5, 10, 'not transgress his command (his command was, "Thus far shalt thou come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 126, 6, 10, 'and not further," which has been evident throughout the centuries - the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 126, 7, 10, 'tides rise and stop at a particular level so that the earth does not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 126, 8, 10, 'overflow with the sea), when he marked out the foundations of the earth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 126, 9, 10, 'then I was beside him as a master workman, and I was daily God''s delight');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 126, 10, 10, '(God''s delight was wisdom) rejoicing always before him."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 126, 11, 10, 'The point of all this is that God possessed wisdom and wisdom existed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 126, 12, 10, 'before all material things. Therefore, one who seeks for material things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 126, 13, 10, 'more than for wisdom is foolish. He is stupid. One who values material');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 126, 14, 10, 'things more than wisdom is really foolish, because wisdom existed long');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 126, 15, 10, 'before these material things and it is through wisdom that these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 126, 16, 10, 'material things were created. "The first dust of the world," it says in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 126, 17, 10, 'verse 26 - whether that''s the ordinary dust of the roads or the gold');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 126, 18, 10, 'dust you find in gold mines, wisdom existed before that, and God valued');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 126, 19, 10, 'wisdom more than all these material things he created. Therefore, if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 126, 20, 10, 'are wise, you won''t be like all the foolish idiots in the world running');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 126, 21, 10, 'after money, running after material things, and thinking that if we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 126, 22, 10, 'more material things we''ll be happy. In Luke 12:15, Jesus Christ, who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 126, 23, 10, 'the wisdom of God, speaks to us and says, "Do not think that a man''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 126, 24, 10, 'life is going to be happy when he has many material things." It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 126, 25, 10, 'through wisdom that happiness and joy come. That''s why our eyes need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 126, 26, 10, 'be opened to see this, that wisdom is above, superior to, more important');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 126, 27, 10, 'than, and prior to all things of this earth. That''s why all the riches');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 126, 28, 10, 'and honor of the earth are nothing compared to God''s wisdom in our life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 127, 1, 10, 'Rejoicing in the world, His earth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 127, 2, 10, 'And having my delight in the sons of men.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 127, 3, 10, 'Prov 8:31');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 127, 4, 10, 'Verse 31 says that he rejoiced in the world, his earth, and that which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 127, 5, 10, 'was created. God made all this earth and he rejoiced in that, but wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 127, 6, 10, 'finally was delighted and thrilled only when Adam and Eve were created.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 127, 7, 10, 'Why? Because wisdom could not communicate itself to the planets or to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 127, 8, 10, 'the sun or to the stars or to the mountains or to the trees or to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 127, 9, 10, 'lions or to the elephants or to the horses. Though wisdom was happy to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 127, 10, 10, 'see all this, she could communicate to none of these things. Finally,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 127, 11, 10, 'when God made someone in his own image (Adam and Eve), it says wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 127, 12, 10, 'was really thrilled and excited. At last there was someone created by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 127, 13, 10, 'God to whom wisdom could communicate herself. Here we see the sorrow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 127, 14, 10, 'that God has when man, whom he has created to acquire this wisdom, is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 127, 15, 10, 'foolish enough to be occupied with all these created things, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 127, 16, 10, 'worships created things more than the creator. This brings grief in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 127, 17, 10, 'God''s heart. "His delight was in the sons of men." In Ephesians 3:10,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 127, 18, 10, 'there''s a wonderful verse which says God teaches his wisdom even to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 127, 19, 10, 'angels through the church. It''s an amazing verse that says even the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 127, 20, 10, 'angels have to learn God''s wisdom through the church. We''ll come to how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 127, 21, 10, 'that happens in a moment.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 127, 22, 10, 'Now therefore, O sons, listen to me,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 127, 23, 10, 'For blessed are they who keep my ways.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 127, 24, 10, 'Heed instruction and be wise,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 127, 25, 10, 'And do not neglect it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 127, 26, 10, 'Blessed is the man who listens to me,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 127, 27, 10, 'Watching daily at my gates,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 127, 28, 10, 'Waiting at my doorposts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 128, 1, 10, 'Prov 8:32-34');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 128, 2, 10, 'Verses 32-34 explain the point of it all. "Therefore, O sons, listen to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 128, 3, 10, 'me, for blessed are those who keep my ways." The word ''blessed'' in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 128, 4, 10, 'word of God always means ''happy''. Wisdom has certain laws and if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 128, 5, 10, 'follow those laws, you will really be happy. "Heed instruction and be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 128, 6, 10, 'wise, and do not neglect it. Blessed (Happy) is the man who listens to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 128, 7, 10, 'me (who listens carefully to what I have to say), watching daily at my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 128, 8, 10, 'gates..." Daily. Why does it say daily? Because I cannot get all of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 128, 9, 10, 'God''s wisdom in one lump sum. We can only acquire it daily. Jesus said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 128, 10, 10, 'in Matthew 6:34, sufficient unto one day is the evil that there is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 128, 11, 10, 'one day. Every day we are going to encounter a certain quota of evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 128, 12, 10, 'from people, from our circumstances, from the devil, and from the lusts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 128, 13, 10, 'in our flesh. And if I want to acquire wisdom, I have to take up the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 128, 14, 10, 'cross everyday. Jesus said, "Let him deny himself and take up his cross');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 128, 15, 10, 'daily," so that my daily quota of evil (instead of corrupting me and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 128, 16, 10, 'polluting me like it does the rest of humanity) turns into wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 128, 17, 10, 'Do you know that diamonds are made from charcoal? It''s the exact same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 128, 18, 10, 'substance as charcoal. It''s carbon which has been put under the pressure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 128, 19, 10, 'of the earth for many centuries. The same substance which makes up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 128, 20, 10, 'charcoal also makes up a diamond. It''s a question of converting that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 128, 21, 10, 'black, ugly charcoal into something that''s precious and valuable. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 128, 22, 10, 'parable there is that my daily quota of evil can be converted into God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 128, 23, 10, 'wisdom and glory if I take up the cross daily. Happy is the man who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 128, 24, 10, 'listens and watches daily at Wisdom''s gates, because wisdom can''t be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 128, 25, 10, 'given to you all in one lump sum. Ephesians 5:15-16 speaks about wisdom:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 128, 26, 10, '"Therefore, be careful how you walk, not as foolish men but as wise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 128, 27, 10, 'people, making the most of your time because every single day is evil."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 128, 28, 10, 'That''s what it says here - every single day is evil. Therefore, make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 129, 1, 10, 'full use of this quota that comes to you each day. Don''t miss one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 129, 2, 10, 'opportunity to die. If you miss one, you miss something of the glory of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 129, 3, 10, 'God. Take the quota that comes your way because God has determined it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 129, 4, 10, 'He didn''t determine it all of a sudden. The quota of evil that hit you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 129, 5, 10, 'today, although it may have been a surprise to you, it wasn''t a surprise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 129, 6, 10, 'to God. That''s the quota that was appointed to us before we were born so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 129, 7, 10, 'that we could acquire wisdom. There are very few who understand how to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 129, 8, 10, 'get wisdom because they don''t understand the way of the cross. "Happy is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 129, 9, 10, 'the man who listens to me, who is watching daily at my gates, waiting at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 129, 10, 10, 'my doorposts." Just like an intern sitting outside the door of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 129, 11, 10, 'managing director, waiting to hear. Be like that, waiting for wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 129, 12, 10, 'each day. That should be our attitude right through the day: "Lord, give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 129, 13, 10, 'me wisdom today. That''s all. I don''t ask you to relieve me from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 129, 14, 10, 'suffering. I don''t ask you to give me an easy way through life. Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 129, 15, 10, 'give me wisdom. Help me to fulfill the plan you have purposed for me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 129, 16, 10, 'today."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 129, 17, 10, 'For he who finds me finds life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 129, 18, 10, 'And obtains favor from the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 129, 19, 10, 'Prov 8:35');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 129, 20, 10, 'How do you know God has blessed you? According to this verse, it''s when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 129, 21, 10, 'you have acquired God''s wisdom. It''s not when you got a promotion or a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 129, 22, 10, 'better job or anything of this earth which is listed in verses 22-29');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 129, 23, 10, 'which was created after wisdom. No. It''s when you get wisdom. Then you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 129, 24, 10, 'have obtained favor from the Lord. When you have acquired God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 129, 25, 10, 'patience, purity, peaceableness, and his willingness to yield, which are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 129, 26, 10, 'the qualities of wisdom (James 3:17).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 129, 27, 10, 'In verse 36 in the margin it says, "He who misses me injures himself."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 129, 28, 10, 'That means if you go through life and miss getting wisdom, then whatever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 130, 1, 10, 'we may have - even bible knowledge - we really wasted our life. We may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 130, 2, 10, 'have gotten a big job or were respectable members of some assembly, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 130, 3, 10, 'we missed the main thing of life if we missed partaking of God''s wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 130, 4, 10, 'in our earthly course. If I''ve missed one day''s portion of wisdom which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 130, 5, 10, 'God has appointed for me to acquire, I''ve lost it for eternity. I can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 130, 6, 10, 'never get it again. The wisdom that God wanted me to partake of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 130, 7, 10, 'yesterday, I cannot get it again. It''s gone. God has appointed that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 130, 8, 10, 'get a certain amount of wisdom each day, and if I don''t get it, I''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 130, 9, 10, 'missed it. I''ve missed it for all eternity. I can get today''s and I can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 130, 10, 10, 'get tomorrow''s, but I can''t get yesterday''s. God himself can''t give it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 130, 11, 10, 'back to me. That''s why it says we have to make the most of the time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 130, 12, 10, 'because the days are evil. Let me learn to convert that evil into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 130, 13, 10, 'wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 130, 14, 10, 'But he who sins against me injures himself;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 130, 15, 10, 'All those who hate me love death.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 130, 16, 10, 'Prov 8:36');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 130, 17, 10, 'That means those who don''t care for wisdom, those who are occupied with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 130, 18, 10, 'other things, actually love spiritual death even though they don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 130, 19, 10, 'realize it. As we look through the book of Proverbs, we see that wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 130, 20, 10, 'is the most important thing. And if only young people would start');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 130, 21, 10, 'seeking for it when they are ten or twelve years-old, they wouldn''t do a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 130, 22, 10, 'lot of the stupid things young people do when they are twenty or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 130, 23, 10, 'twenty-five. Why do young people do stupid things when they are twenty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 130, 24, 10, 'years old? Because they never sought earnestly for wisdom when they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 130, 25, 10, 'twelve or thirteen. They were occupied with so many other things. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 130, 26, 10, 'takes time to acquire wisdom. Think of people who do foolish things when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 130, 27, 10, 'they are forty. They are ruining themselves. They are injuring');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 130, 28, 10, 'themselves. It''s like committing suicide!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 131, 1, 11, 'Chapter 9 Chapter 9');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 131, 2, 11, 'Wisdom has built her house,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 131, 3, 11, 'She has hewn out her seven pillars;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 131, 4, 11, 'Prov 9:1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 131, 5, 11, 'There''s only one house that wisdom is building. It''s not a temple or a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 131, 6, 11, 'physical building. It is the church of the living God which is the bride');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 131, 7, 11, 'of Christ. Wisdom has built it, not bible knowledge. Wisdom has built');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 131, 8, 11, 'the house, and the house is built on seven pillars which support it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 131, 9, 11, 'Those seven pillars are listed for us in James 3:17 by the Holy Spirit:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 131, 10, 11, '1) Purity - the church, the true church, the body of Christ which is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 131, 11, 11, 'going to be the bride of Christ, is built firstly on purity. If there''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 131, 12, 11, 'no purity, that''s not the church. We can apply the same thing to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 131, 13, 11, 'home. Wisdom has built her house. Your home and my home must be built');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 131, 14, 11, 'with wisdom and the first mark of wisdom is purity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 131, 15, 11, '2) Peaceableness - We must have a nature that is seeking for peace as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 131, 16, 11, 'far as possible. Why do I say as far as possible? The word of God says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 131, 17, 11, 'in Romans 12:18, "As far as it lies in you, live peaceably with all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 131, 18, 11, 'men." As far as possible, there must be a desire for peace in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 131, 19, 11, 'hearts. A longing for it as much as it depends on us. That''s the second');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 131, 20, 11, 'pillar of wisdom, and you can''t have a church if you don''t gather');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 131, 21, 11, 'together people who have a desire to be at peace. In other words, not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 131, 22, 11, 'the quarrelsome type.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 131, 23, 11, '3) Gentle - We''ve thought much about this. There''s no gentleness that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 131, 24, 11, 'dwells in our flesh. We''re basically harsh, rude and unkind. So we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 131, 25, 11, 'to take up the cross, sit outside wisdom''s door, and say, "Oh God, teach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 131, 26, 11, 'me to be gentle. Help me to listen - to listen like the intern outside');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 131, 27, 11, 'the director''s office." We have to gather together a bunch of people who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 131, 28, 11, 'are fighting with their own flesh to become gentle in their life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 132, 1, 11, 'Gentleness is the third pillar.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 132, 2, 11, '4) Willing to yield - The fourth pillar of wisdom is willingness to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 132, 3, 11, 'yield or like it says in the margin - reasonableness. Instead of being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 132, 4, 11, 'stubborn like a mule, say, "Okay, have it your way." Yield. That''s how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 132, 5, 11, 'the church is built. We have to gather together people who learn how to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 132, 6, 11, 'yield. All these things are quite opposite of the world. In the world,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 132, 7, 11, 'people have impurity. That''s the pillar on which the house of folly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 132, 8, 11, '(Babylon) is built. The second pillar of Babylon is quarreling. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 132, 9, 11, 'third pillar of Babylon is harshness and rudeness. And the fourth pillar');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 132, 10, 11, 'of Babylon is unwillingness to yield on any point.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 132, 11, 11, '5) Full of mercy - Not just theoretical mercy. It says, "and good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 132, 12, 11, 'fruits." That means a willingness to forgive and forgive and forgive and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 132, 13, 11, 'forgive and forgive. It doesn''t say, "full of" in relation to the other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 132, 14, 11, 'things, but when it comes to mercy, it specifically mentions that it has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 132, 15, 11, 'to be "full of mercy". It can''t just be ninety percent - it has to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 132, 16, 11, 'full because there''s a tremendous need for mercy with one another to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 132, 17, 11, 'build the church. Wisdom is full of mercy and full of mercy''s good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 132, 18, 11, 'fruits - kindness towards those who are evil towards us and forgiving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 132, 19, 11, 'those who have harmed us immediately, totally, and completely. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 132, 20, 11, 'fullness. It''s not that we forgive somebody and then our level of mercy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 132, 21, 11, 'drops. No. Even after we''ve forgiven, our level of mercy must still be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 132, 22, 11, 'full because it''s always overflowing. God anoints our head with oil and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 132, 23, 11, 'our cup keeps on overflowing. He''s so merciful to us so we keep on being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 132, 24, 11, 'merciful to others. Full of mercy and its good fruits.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 132, 25, 11, '6) Unwavering - Not shaking, steady, steadfast, uncompromising,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 132, 26, 11, 'straight. God has shown you something and you stand for it. The devil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 132, 27, 11, 'can''t get you to bend on a small point or little advantage. You are full');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 132, 28, 11, 'of mercy but you don''t compromise. Straight. That''s a pillar of wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 133, 1, 11, 'Unwavering is also translated as "without partiality" in one of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 133, 2, 11, 'translations, which is also one aspect of being unwavering. You don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 133, 3, 11, 'lean towards somebody because he is your special friend and move away');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 133, 4, 11, 'from someone else because you don''t like him very much. You can''t build');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 133, 5, 11, 'a church with such types of people. Without wavering means no partiality');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 133, 6, 11, 'and all are just the same to you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 133, 7, 11, '7) Without hypocrisy - Finally, the seventh pillar is without hypocrisy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 133, 8, 11, 'That means to be true. You may not be perfect, but you are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 133, 9, 11, 'pretending to be something you are not. You are striving for something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 133, 10, 11, 'and you are sincerely striving for it. You are not pretending to strive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 133, 11, 11, 'for it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 133, 12, 11, 'Here are the seven pillars of wisdom. We could spend a lot of time on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 133, 13, 11, 'these but we can meditate on them on our own. But let''s never forget');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 133, 14, 11, 'that every true church and every true home that''s godly can only be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 133, 15, 11, 'built on these pillars. We have to concentrate on these seven and see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 133, 16, 11, 'how many of these seven we have in our church. The mark of a true church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 133, 17, 11, 'is that it is built on these seven pillars.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 133, 18, 11, 'She has prepared her food, she has mixed her wine;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 133, 19, 11, 'She has also set her table;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 133, 20, 11, 'She has sent out her maidens, she calls');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 133, 21, 11, 'From the tops of the heights of the city:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 133, 22, 11, '"Whoever is naive, let him turn in here!"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 133, 23, 11, 'To him who lacks understanding she says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 133, 24, 11, '"Come, eat of my food');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 133, 25, 11, 'And drink of the wine I have mixed."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 133, 26, 11, 'Prov 9:2-5');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 133, 27, 11, 'There is food in the church prepared by wisdom. It is the food of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 133, 28, 11, 'wisdom, not just bible knowledge. "She has mixed her wine, she has set');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 134, 1, 11, 'her table." All things are ready. Come and eat. She has sent out her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 134, 2, 11, 'maiden. Wisdom has her servants who "call from the tops of the height of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 134, 3, 11, 'the city." Everywhere they are calling out, ''Whoever is simple (whoever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 134, 4, 11, 'is willing to acknowledge that he doesn''t have wisdom), let him turn in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 134, 5, 11, 'here.'' Isn''t it wonderful that you need only one qualification to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 134, 6, 11, 'invited? Acknowledge that you''re a foolish person. That''s why so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 134, 7, 11, 'people can''t come in - because it''s quite humbling to acknowledge that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 134, 8, 11, 'we don''t have wisdom. However, the name on the invitation card is only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 134, 9, 11, 'for such people. Whoever is simple, let him come. Whoever lacks wisdom,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 134, 10, 11, 'come. Jesus didn''t call the righteous. He came to call sinners. Wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 134, 11, 11, 'hasn''t come to call all those who think they are wise and clever, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 134, 12, 11, 'she''s come to call the babes. That''s why all these things are hidden');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 134, 13, 11, 'from the clever and intelligent, because they don''t feel their need. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 134, 14, 11, 'those who are like babes and don''t know anything are invited. "And to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 134, 15, 11, 'him who lacks understanding..." If you lack understanding, brother or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 134, 16, 11, 'sister, your name is on the invitation card. You''re welcome to come.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 134, 17, 11, 'She says, "Come. Eat of my food and drink of the wine which I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 134, 18, 11, 'mixed. Come and eat." We know that bread and wine speak of what we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 134, 19, 11, 'partake of in the Lord''s table. They speak of the cross. That''s what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 134, 20, 11, 'wisdom has at her table, and she says, "Come. Let''s partake of this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 134, 21, 11, 'bread and wine. Let''s partake in a fellowship of the cross." And that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 134, 22, 11, 'the food that''s served in the church. That is the rich food, the word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 134, 23, 11, 'the cross that is proclaimed in the true Jerusalem.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 134, 24, 11, 'Forsake your folly and live,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 134, 25, 11, 'And proceed in the way of understanding.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 134, 26, 11, 'Prov 9:6');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 134, 27, 11, 'You may be stupid, you may be foolish, but come in with a willingness to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 134, 28, 11, 'give up all that folly. What is folly? It is the opposite of the seven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 135, 1, 11, 'things that we saw in James 3:17. Go through James 3:17 and write down');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 135, 2, 11, 'all the opposites. That''s folly. "Forsake it and live and proceed in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 135, 3, 11, 'way of understanding." That is God''s will - to proceed in the way of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 135, 4, 11, 'understanding.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 135, 5, 11, 'He who corrects a scoffer gets dishonor for himself,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 135, 6, 11, 'And he who reproves a wicked man gets insults for himself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 135, 7, 11, 'Do not reprove a scoffer, or he will hate you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 135, 8, 11, 'Reprove a wise man and he will love you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 135, 9, 11, 'Give instruction to a wise man and he will be still wiser,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 135, 10, 11, 'Teach a righteous man and he will increase his learning.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 135, 11, 11, 'Prov 9:7-9');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 135, 12, 11, 'There are people who are not interested in wisdom. They are scoffers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 135, 13, 11, 'They despise all these things. Jesus said, "Don''t cast your pearls');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 135, 14, 11, 'before swine. Don''t give that which is holy to the dogs." And while');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 135, 15, 11, 'wisdom is speaking the message of the cross and pointing out the seven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 135, 16, 11, 'pillars on which the house is built, there are those who are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 135, 17, 11, 'interested in this message. There are those who scoff and say, "Yeah,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 135, 18, 11, 'yeah, these are not the main things." There are people who despise it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 135, 19, 11, 'and it says here not to offer it to such people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 135, 20, 11, 'We learn something further in verses 7-9 about correction. Correction is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 135, 21, 11, 'one of the purposes with which God''s word has been given. We read that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 135, 22, 11, 'in 2 Timothy 3:16: "All scripture is given by God and is profitable');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 135, 23, 11, 'for...correction and for instruction in righteousness." We also see in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 135, 24, 11, 'the book of Proverbs that a very important way that wisdom is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 135, 25, 11, 'communicated to us is through correction. But not all can be corrected.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 135, 26, 11, 'Many people never acquire wisdom because when they are corrected, they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 135, 27, 11, 'get offended. Most believers get offended when you correct them. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 135, 28, 11, 'flatter them and say they are wonderful, spiritual, and wholehearted,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 136, 1, 11, 'they become all puffed up and are very friendly with you. If you tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 136, 2, 11, 'them there''s something wrong in what they are doing and point it out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 136, 3, 11, 'specifically, they get offended, they get hurt, they are cold towards');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 136, 4, 11, 'you, they are disturbed about it, and they lose their sleep. They are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 136, 5, 11, 'not bothered about the thing that needs to be corrected in their life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 136, 6, 11, 'but instead they are disturbed that somebody has pointed them out as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 136, 7, 11, 'carnal. Such people can live year after year after year and never become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 136, 8, 11, 'wise. I would say that one of the main reasons why many believers never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 136, 9, 11, 'become wise is because they get offended when they are corrected. Many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 136, 10, 11, 'young people only hang around those who flatter them and praise them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 136, 11, 11, 'Even though they may sit in so-called New Testament churches, they have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 136, 12, 11, 'the spirit of Babylon in them, because they''re only interested in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 136, 13, 11, 'flattery and not correction. If I''m only interested in flattery and not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 136, 14, 11, 'in correction, I can sit in the most spiritual assembly in the whole');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 136, 15, 11, 'world and be a Babylonian through and through. Correcting a person who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 136, 16, 11, 'doesn''t want wisdom is a waste of time and "he who reproves a wicked man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 136, 17, 11, 'gets insults for himself. Do not reprove a scoffer lest he hate you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 136, 18, 11, 'Reprove a wise man."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 136, 19, 11, 'Here''s the mark of a wise man: correct him or rebuke him, and he will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 136, 20, 11, 'love you. Every one of us can sit and ask ourselves whether we are wise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 136, 21, 11, 'or not. Here is some homework. Think of somebody who has corrected you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 136, 22, 11, 'It could be a father, a mother, a husband, or maybe an elder brother. Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 136, 23, 11, 'you really love him with all your heart? If so, then you are wise. All');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 136, 24, 11, 'wise people love correction. That''s how they became wise. The main');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 136, 25, 11, 'reason why it''s so difficult for young people to get out of their folly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 136, 26, 11, 'is because they don''t love correction. Beware of the brothers and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 136, 27, 11, 'sisters who just say nice things. They''re not going to help you to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 136, 28, 11, 'wise. You don''t see that wisdom flatters anyone in the book of Proverbs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 137, 1, 11, 'or in the whole Scripture. The word of God is not given for flattery,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 137, 2, 11, 'it''s given for correction.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 137, 3, 11, 'Verse 9 says, "Give instruction to the wise man and he will be still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 137, 4, 11, 'wiser." Why does the wise man love correction? Because he wants to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 137, 5, 11, 'even wiser. He knows that he hasn''t attained to the wisdom of God yet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 137, 6, 11, 'and so he wants to be still wiser. Therefore he receives correction and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 137, 7, 11, 'reproof. If you give an already righteous man an exhortation like, "Flee');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 137, 8, 11, 'from the love of money, brother", he doesn''t get offended that you think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 137, 9, 11, 'he loves money. He takes it. Think of what Paul wrote to Timothy:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 137, 10, 11, '"Brother, flee from youthful lusts." Timothy didn''t get offended. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 137, 11, 11, 'didn''t think, "Does Paul think I''m running after youthful lusts?" No, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 137, 12, 11, 'took it - "Thank you brother for that exhortation. It''s good for me. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 137, 13, 11, 'need it." And he becomes still more free from youthful lusts and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 137, 14, 11, 'love of money.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 137, 15, 11, 'The poor in spirit alone can become wise. The poor in spirit are those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 137, 16, 11, 'who are willing to be corrected and who see their need of being more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 137, 17, 11, 'like Jesus and having more of God''s purity, peaceableness, and goodness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 137, 18, 11, 'in their life. A test of whether we are growing in wisdom or not is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 137, 19, 11, 'whether there''s a love for those who correct us. If we are open to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 137, 20, 11, 'rebuke and correction and we long for it and we want it, then we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 137, 21, 11, 'wise. And if we are not wanting it, we can say we are sort of stagnant.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 137, 22, 11, 'We are not really growing in wisdom at all. But the more wise we are,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 137, 23, 11, 'the more we long for correction and more wisdom. We see here that our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 137, 24, 11, 'attitude to correction is not only a test of our wisdom, it''s a test of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 137, 25, 11, 'our humility, and it''s humility which receives the grace of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 137, 26, 11, 'The fear of the Lord is the beginning of wisdom,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 137, 27, 11, 'And the knowledge of the Holy One is understanding.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 137, 28, 11, 'Prov 9:10');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 138, 1, 11, 'The previous verses were a warning to not go to those who despise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 138, 2, 11, 'correction. There are people who don''t want it and who are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 138, 3, 11, 'interested and say, "This is all bondage." Leave them alone. Go to those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 138, 4, 11, 'who are interested in correction and tell them Proverbs 9:10, "The fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 138, 5, 11, 'of the Lord is the beginning of wisdom, and the knowledge of the holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 138, 6, 11, 'one is understanding." What is the beginning of wisdom? The fear of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 138, 7, 11, 'Lord. A sensitivity to sin. A hatred of sin. A hating of evil. The fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 138, 8, 11, 'of the Lord is the beginning (ABCs) of wisdom, and the knowledge of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 138, 9, 11, 'holy one is to know God in his nature; to know God is full of mercy; to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 138, 10, 11, 'know him more like that personally and to experience it; to know that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 138, 11, 11, 'God is love and that he''s never evil toward anyone; to know that he''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 138, 12, 11, 'good, always good; to know that he''s kind to unthankful people; to know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 138, 13, 11, 'God more and more. That is understanding. This is the central verse of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 138, 14, 11, 'Proverbs, and we can say that all of wisdom is summed up here: to fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 138, 15, 11, 'the Lord and to know him more and more and more.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 138, 16, 11, 'For by me your days will be multiplied,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 138, 17, 11, 'And years of life will be added to you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 138, 18, 11, 'Prov 9:11');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 138, 19, 11, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 138, 20, 11, 'I, Wisdom, will make the hours of your day more profitable and the years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 138, 21, 11, 'of your life more fruitful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 138, 22, 11, 'Prov 9:11, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 138, 23, 11, 'That means no year or even day in your life will be wasted if you make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 138, 24, 11, 'wisdom your main aim in life day by day. The hours of your day will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 138, 25, 11, 'profitable (won''t be wasted) and the years of your life will be fruitful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 138, 26, 11, 'if you make wisdom the main pursuit of your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 138, 27, 11, 'If you are wise, you are wise for yourself,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 138, 28, 11, 'And if you scoff, you alone will bear it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 139, 1, 11, 'Prov 9:12');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 139, 2, 11, 'Wisdom is saying, "Do you know why I''m exhorting you to be wise? It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 139, 3, 11, 'not that I get anything out of it. It''s for your own good." Just like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 139, 4, 11, 'loving father will tell his children, "Look, I''m telling you this for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 139, 5, 11, 'your own good. It''s not that I get anything out of it. For your own good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 139, 6, 11, 'I''m telling you this!" That''s what wisdom says in this verse: "If you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 139, 7, 11, 'wise, that''s for yourself! Who''s going to get the benefit out of that?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 139, 8, 11, 'Not me. You! And if you scoff and you remain foolish, who''s going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 139, 9, 11, 'suffer? I''m not going to suffer. You''ll suffer." And so Solomon exhorts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 139, 10, 11, 'us to be sensitive. Wisdom is for our own good. Amazing. Right through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 139, 11, 11, 'these first nine chapters, the Holy Spirit is trying to emphasize the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 139, 12, 11, 'tremendous importance of having wisdom in our lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 139, 13, 11, 'The woman of folly is boisterous,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 139, 14, 11, 'She is naive and knows nothing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 139, 15, 11, 'She sits at the doorway of her house,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 139, 16, 11, 'On a seat by the high places of the city,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 139, 17, 11, 'Calling to those who pass by,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 139, 18, 11, 'Who are making their paths straight:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 139, 19, 11, '"Whoever is naive, let him turn in here,"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 139, 20, 11, 'And to him who lacks understanding she says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 139, 21, 11, '"Stolen water is sweet;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 139, 22, 11, 'And bread eaten in secret is pleasant."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 139, 23, 11, 'But he does not know that the dead are there,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 139, 24, 11, 'That her guests are in the depths of Sheol.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 139, 25, 11, 'Prov 9:13-18');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 139, 26, 11, 'This is a picture of the foolish woman. But it''s also a picture of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 139, 27, 11, 'harlot church which is the opposite of wisdom and represents the entire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 139, 28, 11, 'Babylonian system. And it says here the woman of folly is boisterous.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 140, 1, 11, 'Noisiness. Making a lot of noise is the mark of a foolish woman. She''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 140, 2, 11, 'not going to build a godly house. Impossible. She doesn''t have the #1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 140, 3, 11, 'qualification: wisdom. She''s just noisy and makes too much noise. She');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 140, 4, 11, 'doesn''t know how to have a gentle and quiet spirit. How in the world can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 140, 5, 11, 'she build her house as a godly home? One of the first things she needs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 140, 6, 11, 'to know before building a godly home is how to turn down the volume knob');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 140, 7, 11, 'on her mouth so that her voice level comes down a bit. That''s one of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 140, 8, 11, 'first marks of wisdom. Think if all of you sisters begin to do that - if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 140, 9, 11, 'your speech becomes a little softer and a little more gentle. Then you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 140, 10, 11, 'won''t end up in the category of this woman who''s boisterous and noisy. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 140, 11, 11, 'lot of women are like that. It says, "She is simple and knows nothing."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 140, 12, 11, 'All she knows how to do is blow her top and make a lot of noise - but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 140, 13, 11, 'she really knows nothing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 140, 14, 11, 'Proverbs 9 is a picture of what we read of in Revelation: a picture of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 140, 15, 11, 'Jerusalem and Babylon. These two churches are pictured here in Proverbs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 140, 16, 11, 'It says, "She sits in the doorway of her house on a seat..." We can say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 140, 17, 11, 'she''s sitting on a throne. She''s set up a throne of high thoughts about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 140, 18, 11, 'herself and sits by the high places of the city. She''s calling all those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 140, 19, 11, 'who pass by, who are making their paths straight. These are simple');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 140, 20, 11, 'people who are walking on the straight way. Do you know what she says to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 140, 21, 11, 'them? She says exactly the same thing that wisdom said in verse 4. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 140, 22, 11, 'same words. In verse 4, Wisdom said, "Whoever is simple let him turn in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 140, 23, 11, 'here. Him who lacks understanding." Here we see the same thing. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 140, 24, 11, 'words are so similar. She takes the same bible and uses the same words,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 140, 25, 11, 'but it''s another spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 140, 26, 11, 'Those who are seeking for wisdom can sit in a Babylonian system and say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 140, 27, 11, '"I don''t seem to get much wisdom here. It''s the same bible. The same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 140, 28, 11, 'words - but I don''t get the revelation of the Holy Spirit here." Why?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 141, 1, 11, 'Because it is stolen water. That means it''s borrowed messages. They read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 141, 2, 11, 'hidden treasures and preach the messages. They don''t get any direct');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 141, 3, 11, 'revelation from God. It''s stolen from somewhere else. Cooked up.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 141, 4, 11, 'Borrowed from a lot of books and magazines. There''s a very interesting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 141, 5, 11, 'verse in Jeremiah 23:29 about this which says: "My word is like a hammer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 141, 6, 11, 'which breaks the rock in pieces - which shatters the rock. And my word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 141, 7, 11, 'is like a fire that burns everything up." Do you know what the next');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 141, 8, 11, 'verse is? It''s very important to know the next verse which is after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 141, 9, 11, 'that. In the next verse, the Lord says, "I am against those preachers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 141, 10, 11, 'who steal my messages from other preachers." Did you know that? God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 141, 11, 11, 'says, "I am against all those preachers who borrow their messages from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 141, 12, 11, 'some other preacher. Then that''s not my word. No rock is going to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 141, 13, 11, 'shattered and nothing is going to burn." Most of Christendom is like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 141, 14, 11, 'that today - all borrowed messages, stolen water, and stolen bread. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 141, 15, 11, 'the sad thing is, it''s all being eaten. That''s Babylon. We have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 141, 16, 11, 'emphasize the revelation of the Holy Spirit! And we must be true men and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 141, 17, 11, 'women of God who get the true revelation of the Holy Spirit on God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 141, 18, 11, 'word. Where there is no revelation, the people perish (Proverbs 29:18).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 141, 19, 11, 'Everything that comes from the foolish woman is deception. In contrast');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 141, 20, 11, 'to all this, you see Wisdom. In verse 2, it says that Wisdom has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 141, 21, 11, 'revelation. She prepares her own food. She hasn''t gone and borrowed it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 141, 22, 11, 'from someone else and stolen it from somewhere else - from some other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 141, 23, 11, 'book or magazine. She''s mixed her own wine and prepared her own food!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 141, 24, 11, 'She has been on her knees and sought for revelation and the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 141, 25, 11, 'has given it. That''s wisdom, and that''s how Jerusalem is built. All');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 141, 26, 11, 'borrowed messages and getting up to preach something from reading it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 141, 27, 11, 'elsewhere is honor seeking. It''s to show other people, "Look what I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 141, 28, 11, 'have," although you didn''t get it yourself. You stole it, but you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 142, 1, 11, 'wouldn''t tell them that, because you want the honor. Beware of that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 142, 2, 11, 'That''s Babylon. That spirit must never be found in the church. We don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 142, 3, 11, 'have any stolen water in our church and we prepare our own food. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 142, 4, 11, 'gives it to us through his word - the bread that God gives. Everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 142, 5, 11, 'is out in the open and nothing is secret.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 142, 6, 11, 'It says, "Bread eaten in secret is pleasant." Paul speaks about that in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 142, 7, 11, '2 Corinthians 2:17 and says, "We''ve given up all those things of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 142, 8, 11, 'dishonesty. We speak things of sincerity." 2 Corinthians 4:2 says, "We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 142, 9, 11, 'have renounced the hidden things, and we walk in the light." It is very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 142, 10, 11, 'important that there''s nothing secretive about anything in our ministry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 142, 11, 11, 'that we would have to deceive someone or cheat someone. It''s all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 142, 12, 11, 'straight-forward and open.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 142, 13, 11, 'Verse 18 concludes that all this is the way to Hell. We saw a verse like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 142, 14, 11, 'this previously about what the way to Hell is: a flattering woman. Here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 142, 15, 11, 'again, the way to Hell is being incorporated into the Babylonian system.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 142, 16, 11, 'Be assured, if you are a part of the Babylonian system, it''ll finally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 142, 17, 11, 'lead you to Hell since it''s not genuine and it''s not true. It''s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 142, 18, 11, 'following God''s word in total obedience.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 142, 19, 11, 'These nine chapters are like an introduction to the whole book of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 142, 20, 11, 'Proverbs. We can say that the whole book of Proverbs is like a big');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 142, 21, 11, 'building, and the first nine chapters are just the porch. We are just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 142, 22, 11, 'getting ready to go into the house and examine all the rooms. Now from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 142, 23, 11, 'Proverbs 10:1 onwards, we begin to enter the house itself and explore');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 142, 24, 11, 'the various rooms of wisdom. The first nine chapters are just trying to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 142, 25, 11, 'emphasize to us the tremendous importance of wisdom. It says in Proverbs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 142, 26, 11, '10:1, "The Proverbs of Solomon..." Think how much time he has taken in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 142, 27, 11, 'all these chapters just to show us the importance of acquiring wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 142, 28, 11, 'He doesn''t want to start off with chapter 10 verse 1 in the beginning.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 143, 1, 11, 'He could have started the proverbs right in the first chapter and said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 143, 2, 11, '"Okay, here are the proverbs," but that would have been casting pearls');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 143, 3, 11, 'before swine. That would be giving that which is holy to the dogs. No.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 143, 4, 11, 'He wants to find out first of all, "Are you really interested in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 143, 5, 11, 'becoming wise? If so, then I''ll teach you something." And only to those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 143, 6, 11, 'who are really eagerly seeking for wisdom, he says, "Now, I''ll tell you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 143, 7, 11, 'something." Take these next chapters seriously.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 143, 8, 12, 'Chapter 10 Chapter 10');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 143, 9, 12, 'The proverbs of Solomon are from chapter 10 through chapter 29. Chapters');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 143, 10, 12, '30 and 31 are written by others. If we take these words seriously, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 143, 11, 12, 'can change our church life, our home life, and our personal life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 143, 12, 12, 'Chapter 10 is basically a contrast between the righteous and the wicked.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 143, 13, 12, 'A wise son makes a father glad,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 143, 14, 12, 'But a foolish son is a grief to his mother.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 143, 15, 12, 'Prov 10:1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 143, 16, 12, 'Solomon is speaking to those who will take the position of sons (in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 143, 17, 12, 'submission to him). He says, "The only way you can make me happy is if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 143, 18, 12, 'you become wise - not by earning money or by getting a big job." Any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 143, 19, 12, 'parent should be happy with their children only if their children have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 143, 20, 12, 'become wise. We have a whole lot of stupid parents all over the world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 143, 21, 12, 'who are happy that their children have big jobs, have married somebody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 143, 22, 12, 'nice, and have a big house. They haven''t read Proverbs 8 which says that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 143, 23, 12, 'wisdom was created before all these houses and gold and silver and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 143, 24, 12, 'everything else. A real parent will be happy when his children are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 143, 25, 12, 'acquiring divine wisdom, beginning with obedience to daddy and mommy at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 143, 26, 12, 'home. That''s the first thing. If obedience is not there, whatever marks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 143, 27, 12, 'they get in school are of no use, even if they come first in the class,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 143, 28, 12, 'are very good in athletics, etc. It''s all useless if they don''t know the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 144, 1, 12, 'number one thing of wisdom for children: obey daddy and mommy at home.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 144, 2, 12, 'Let''s remember that. Let no father or mother be proud of children who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 144, 3, 12, 'are doing well out in the world if they don''t have the first mark of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 144, 4, 12, 'wisdom in their life. Children, remember that. All your accomplishments');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 144, 5, 12, 'in school are useless if you don''t know how to obey your daddy and mommy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 144, 6, 12, 'at home. Absolutely worthless. "A wise son makes a father glad but a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 144, 7, 12, 'foolish son is a grief to his mother." We have to rejoice only when our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 144, 8, 12, 'children have that wisdom. I never find joy in anything else.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 144, 9, 12, 'Ill-gotten gains do not profit,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 144, 10, 12, 'But righteousness delivers from death.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 144, 11, 12, 'The Lord will not allow the righteous to hunger,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 144, 12, 12, 'But He will reject the craving of the wicked.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 144, 13, 12, 'Prov 10:2-3');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 144, 14, 12, 'Next, he speaks in verses 2-3 about money. See, money is a very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 144, 15, 12, 'important thing. Proverbs has a lot to say about money and the use of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 144, 16, 12, 'money. He says, "Ill-gotten gain does not profit." That means profit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 144, 17, 12, 'which I don''t get righteously can never bring any lasting happiness in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 144, 18, 12, 'my life. Maybe I''ve cheated someone to get a little money or cheated the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 144, 19, 12, 'government of some taxes to get a little extra money. It will never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 144, 20, 12, 'bring any benefit in my life. Impossible. Let''s remember that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 144, 21, 12, 'Then it says that righteousness delivers from death. Money acquired');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 144, 22, 12, 'righteously, even if it''s a little, delivers from death. If I earn my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 144, 23, 12, 'money righteously, God himself will take care of me. It goes on in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 144, 24, 12, 'next verse to say that the Lord will not allow me to hunger. David says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 144, 25, 12, 'in Psalm 37:25, "I''ve been young, and now I am an old man, but in all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 144, 26, 12, 'these years, I''ve never seen a righteous man begging for bread or his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 144, 27, 12, 'children begging for bread." The Lord will not allow the righteous man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 144, 28, 12, 'to hunger. He''ll take care of him. If he seeks the kingdom of God first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 145, 1, 12, 'and His righteousness, all the other things he needs will be added to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 145, 2, 12, 'him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 145, 3, 12, 'Then it says, "But he will thrust aside the craving of the wicked." God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 145, 4, 12, 'will allow that craving - the lust that the wicked man has for more and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 145, 5, 12, 'more and more and more - to finally ruin his life. Like the rich man who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 145, 6, 12, 'said, "I will build bigger barns" and finally, God said, "You fool! I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 145, 7, 12, 'will take away your soul this very night. What''s the use of all that?"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 145, 8, 12, 'Poor is he who works with a negligent hand,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 145, 9, 12, 'But the hand of the diligent makes rich.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 145, 10, 12, 'He who gathers in summer is a son who acts wisely,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 145, 11, 12, 'But he who sleeps in harvest is a son who acts shamefully.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 145, 12, 12, 'Prov 10:4-5');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 145, 13, 12, 'The next thing he speaks about in verses 4-5 is hard work. He speaks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 145, 14, 12, 'about money and then he speaks about hard work. One of the first things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 145, 15, 12, 'God told Adam in the garden of Eden was, "By the sweat of your brow, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 145, 16, 12, 'will earn your bread." That means hard work. Hard work is something God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 145, 17, 12, 'has appointed for us. "Poor is he who works with a negligent hand, for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 145, 18, 12, 'the hand of the diligent makes rich." Have you noticed in the gospels');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 145, 19, 12, 'that in every recorded case of Jesus calling one of the apostles, they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 145, 20, 12, 'were working somewhere when he called them? He never called some fellow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 145, 21, 12, 'who was just relaxing at home; he never called unemployed graduates,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 145, 22, 12, 'sitting at home, waiting for something. You never find such a thing in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 145, 23, 12, 'the gospels. Those people are all in the bible schools today, but Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 145, 24, 12, 'never found such people to be his apostles - not even once. Where were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 145, 25, 12, 'Peter and Andrew? They were fishing. Why didn''t Jesus wait until the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 145, 26, 12, 'evening after they went home? Then we wouldn''t know if they were just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 145, 27, 12, 'unemployed graduates sitting at home or whether they were working men.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 145, 28, 12, 'That''s why Jesus called them at their places of work: so that it would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 146, 1, 12, 'be recorded in the gospels that they were working people, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 146, 2, 12, 'hard-working people at that. What about James and John? At their place');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 146, 3, 12, 'of work. What about Matthew? One would think that Jesus would at least');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 146, 4, 12, 'have waited for Matthew to finish counting his money before calling him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 146, 5, 12, 'No. He called him right in the middle of work to show that Jesus is only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 146, 6, 12, 'going to call those who are diligent and faithful in their secular');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 146, 7, 12, 'occupations. These things are written for our instruction. He who has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 146, 8, 12, 'ears to hear, let him hear. This is why I say we are one-hundred percent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 146, 9, 12, 'against this wretched Babylonian system that calls a whole lot of people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 146, 10, 12, 'who just finished high school (and usually failed) to go and serve the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 146, 11, 12, 'Lord. That''s a lot of garbage. You never find that anywhere from Genesis');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 146, 12, 12, 'to Revelation, except perhaps in the false prophets. Nowhere else. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 146, 13, 12, 'doesn''t call such people. God never calls those who are lazy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 146, 14, 12, 'Paul says in 2 Thessalonians 3:7-8, "You yourselves know how you ought');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 146, 15, 12, 'to follow our example, because we did not act in an undisciplined manner');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 146, 16, 12, 'among you, nor did we eat anyone''s bread without paying for it, but with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 146, 17, 12, 'labor and hardship, we work night and day so that we might not be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 146, 18, 12, 'burden to any of you." Hard work is the way people become rich out in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 146, 19, 12, 'the business world and spiritually too! It takes diligence. "He who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 146, 20, 12, 'gathers in summer is a son who acts wisely, and he who sleeps in harvest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 146, 21, 12, 'is a son who acts shamefully." Now is the time of summer and harvest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 146, 22, 12, 'when we are to gather. The time will come when we cannot gather any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 146, 23, 12, 'more. Now is the time to gather glory so that when the opportunity to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 146, 24, 12, 'gather the harvest is over, we have acquired something during our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 146, 25, 12, 'earthly life. So make full use of the opportunity. Be diligent day by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 146, 26, 12, 'day by day - be diligent to acquire what God wants you to acquire in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 146, 27, 12, 'your daily life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 146, 28, 12, 'Blessings are on the head of the righteous,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 147, 1, 12, 'But the mouth of the wicked conceals violence.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 147, 2, 12, 'Prov 10:6');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 147, 3, 12, 'That means that one mark of a wicked man is vicious words. Hurting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 147, 4, 12, 'words, evil words come out of his lips. Do you ever speak words that are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 147, 5, 12, 'meant to hurt somebody - maybe to hurt your wife or your husband or a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 147, 6, 12, 'brother or a sister or anyone? Then according to this verse, you''re a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 147, 7, 12, 'wicked person. You can call yourself a New and Living Way believer or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 147, 8, 12, 'whatever you''d like, but the word of God says you''re a wicked person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 147, 9, 12, 'That''s because vicious words come out of your mouth; words that are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 147, 10, 12, 'meant to hurt; words that are designed to hurt. This is not talking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 147, 11, 12, 'about the accidental slip of the tongue in a moment of pressure. No.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 147, 12, 12, 'Calculated words. You thought, "If I put it like this, it will really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 147, 13, 12, 'hurt that person. I''m going to say it like that." You''re a wicked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 147, 14, 12, 'person! Call yourself a believer or spiritual or New and Living Way or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 147, 15, 12, 'whatever you''d like, but the word of God says you''re a wicked person if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 147, 16, 12, 'you are like that! Calculating words to hurt - that''s the mark of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 147, 17, 12, 'wicked person. There are lots of so-called believers that actually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 147, 18, 12, 'should be called wicked brothers and sisters. Wicked. Their mouth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 147, 19, 12, 'conceals this violence. It sounds so nice, but there''s a violence');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 147, 20, 12, 'concealed in it to hurt!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 147, 21, 12, 'The memory of the righteous is blessed,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 147, 22, 12, 'But the name of the wicked will rot.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 147, 23, 12, 'Prov 10:7');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 147, 24, 12, 'This teaches us that even after a righteous person is dead and gone,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 147, 25, 12, 'like Abel, though he''s dead, yet he speaks. We have to live such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 147, 26, 12, 'righteous life that the memory of our life even after we are gone should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 147, 27, 12, 'bless others. Or if we have lived in a particular town, after we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 147, 28, 12, 'left that town, people think of us as one who has been a blessing there.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 148, 1, 12, 'Brother, sister, be one like that. That is our calling. The name of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 148, 2, 12, 'wicked will just stink.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 148, 3, 12, 'The wise of heart will receive commands,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 148, 4, 12, 'But a babbling fool will be ruined.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 148, 5, 12, 'Prov 10:8');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 148, 6, 12, 'Another mark of a wise person is that he''s willing to receive commands.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 148, 7, 12, 'Or to put it another way, as another translation has it: "willing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 148, 8, 12, 'submit to authority." To give commands is easy. All foolish people are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 148, 9, 12, 'ready to do that. But it''s the wise of heart that are willing to receive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 148, 10, 12, 'commands, beginning with the children. When the father gives a command,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 148, 11, 12, 'wise children are willing to receive it. And as we grow up, God places');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 148, 12, 12, 'authority over us in different situations. If we are wise in heart,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 148, 13, 12, 'we''ll be willing to receive the commands of those who are in authority');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 148, 14, 12, 'over us. The emphasis in Proverbs is always on the heart. If we are wise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 148, 15, 12, 'in our heart, we''ll be willing to submit to authority, or as another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 148, 16, 12, 'translation puts it: "willing to receive correction." Willingness to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 148, 17, 12, 'receive correction from someone in authority is the mark we see again');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 148, 18, 12, 'and again of those who are wise. They are willing to accept correction');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 148, 19, 12, 'and submit to authority. But a babbling fool is one who just keeps on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 148, 20, 12, 'talking, talking, talking as if he knows such a lot. There are people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 148, 21, 12, 'who just don''t know how to close the tap, and once their mouth is open,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 148, 22, 12, 'they keep on talking, talking, talking. They''ll just be cast out.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 148, 23, 12, 'He who walks in integrity walks securely,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 148, 24, 12, 'But he who perverts his ways will be found out.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 148, 25, 12, 'Prov 10:9');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 148, 26, 12, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 148, 27, 12, 'A good man has firm footing, but a crook will slip and fall.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 148, 28, 12, 'Prov 10:9, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 149, 1, 12, 'The man of integrity is the man who''s sincere. He may have many mistakes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 149, 2, 12, 'in him, but to the best of his knowledge, he''s seeking to walk in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 149, 3, 12, 'light. He''s sincere. He has a firm footing even though there are so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 149, 4, 12, 'mistakes in his life. He has a firm footing at every point because he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 149, 5, 12, 'walks in integrity. He walks securely. But he who perverts his way will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 149, 6, 12, 'be found out. The word of God says, "Be sure your sin will find you out"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 149, 7, 12, '(Numbers 32:23), and a man who''s a crook, who''s trying to deceive, who''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 149, 8, 12, 'trying to come into the congregation of the saints with some ulterior');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 149, 9, 12, 'motives - he may sit there for some time, but one day he will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 149, 10, 12, 'exposed. But the man of integrity has a firm footing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 149, 11, 12, 'He who winks the eye causes trouble,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 149, 12, 12, 'And a babbling fool will be ruined.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 149, 13, 12, 'Prov 10:10');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 149, 14, 12, 'This speaks again about the man who is deceptive - the man who winks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 149, 15, 12, 'with his eye. He''s not straightforward. There''s something wrong. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 149, 16, 12, 'know when you have some deception in your mind, you can''t look people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 149, 17, 12, 'straight in the face. There''s something this man is trying to hide. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 149, 18, 12, 'causes trouble. But a babbling fool - one who keeps on talking - is even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 149, 19, 12, 'worse than the man who winks. He will be thrown down completely.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 149, 20, 12, 'The mouth of the righteous is a fountain of life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 149, 21, 12, 'But the mouth of the wicked conceals violence.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 149, 22, 12, 'Prov 10:11');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 149, 23, 12, 'This is about our speech. We''ve considered money, hard work, deception');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 149, 24, 12, 'and integrity, submission to authority, and receiving correction. Now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 149, 25, 12, 'here''s another area where the righteous and the wicked can be discerned:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 149, 26, 12, 'their speech. There is a lot mentioned about speech in the rest of this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 149, 27, 12, 'chapter. It says, "The mouth of the righteous is a fountain of life, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 149, 28, 12, 'the mouth of the wicked conceals violence." This is what we considered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 150, 1, 12, 'earlier about suspicious language. But the mouth of the righteous is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 150, 2, 12, 'fountain of life which means that the words that come out of our mouth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 150, 3, 12, 'are kind, good, bless others, speak good about others, and are not evil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 150, 4, 12, 'They come out like a fountain. That''s a fountain of life. That''s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 150, 5, 12, 'mark of a righteous man. By his mouth you can know him. By the fruit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 150, 6, 12, 'his mouth, you can know whether he''s righteous or wicked. Just listen to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 150, 7, 12, 'the words of his mouth when he''s off guard. You''ll know exactly what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 150, 8, 12, 'type of person he is.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 150, 9, 12, 'Hatred stirs up strife,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 150, 10, 12, 'But love covers all transgressions.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 150, 11, 12, 'Prov 10:12');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 150, 12, 12, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 150, 13, 12, 'Hatred stirs old quarrels, but love overlooks insults.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 150, 14, 12, 'Prov 10:12, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 150, 15, 12, 'This is a verse we''ve considered much. It''s quoted in 1 Peter 4:8, "Love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 150, 16, 12, 'covers a multitude of sins." Long before Peter said it, Solomon said it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 150, 17, 12, 'And one translation has it like this, "Love draws a veil over all sins."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 150, 18, 12, 'It puts a sheet across all sins. When we read the Living Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 150, 19, 12, 'paraphrase we can easily know whether we are children of God or children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 150, 20, 12, 'of the devil. God is love and the devil is a murderer; and the children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 150, 21, 12, 'of God are identified by the love of God in their hearts toward one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 150, 22, 12, 'another, and the children of the devil are identified by hatred. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 150, 23, 12, 'very easy to find out which quality we have in our heart by the words we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 150, 24, 12, 'speak with our tongue. Of course, everybody speaks about love. Out in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 150, 25, 12, 'the world they speak about love too - but there is a test. If you are a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 150, 26, 12, 'person who stirs up old quarrels - that means you bring up the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 150, 27, 12, 'remembrance of something that happened in the past when you have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 150, 28, 12, 'disagreement with a person - then however much you may speak about love,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 151, 1, 12, 'you have hatred in your heart according to the word of God. Love never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 151, 2, 12, 'brings up old quarrels. That is hatred. That doesn''t mean you''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 151, 3, 12, 'forgotten about all your old quarrels, but love covers them. Love draws');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 151, 4, 12, 'a veil over all sins. So this is a very good verse by which we can find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 151, 5, 12, 'out if we have love or hatred in our hearts, so that we don''t deceive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 151, 6, 12, 'ourselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 151, 7, 12, 'The mark of a person who has hatred is that he''s always ready to pick up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 151, 8, 12, 'a quarrel; pick up a quarrel with a brother, pick up a quarrel with a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 151, 9, 12, 'sister, pick up a quarrel with his marriage partner. That is the clear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 151, 10, 12, 'mark of a person with hatred in his heart, whatever he may say about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 151, 11, 12, 'himself, whatever religious language he speaks. It''s good that he faces');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 151, 12, 12, 'up to it and realizes what the condition of his heart is lest he wake up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 151, 13, 12, 'in eternity and discover that he was deceiving himself concerning his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 151, 14, 12, 'Christianity all through his life. This verse says "stirs up" which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 151, 15, 12, 'means he sort of brings it up from the bottom. Here''s something which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 151, 16, 12, 'was sinking to the bottom, but hatred stirs it all up and brings it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 151, 17, 12, 'right up to the top. It says, "You did this and you did that. That time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 151, 18, 12, 'you said this and the other thing." That''s the mark of a man who''s full');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 151, 19, 12, 'of hatred.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 151, 20, 12, 'We can find out whether we have love in our heart by what we do when we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 151, 21, 12, 'see some sin in another person. Love will draw a veil over it. "Love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 151, 22, 12, 'covers a multitude of sins" can also be looked at in another way: when a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 151, 23, 12, 'person commits a sin, love seeks to cover it in the sense that love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 151, 24, 12, 'seeks to attach a good motive to it. Love says, "Maybe he said or did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 151, 25, 12, 'that with a good intention or a good motive." Maybe it turned out badly,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 151, 26, 12, 'but love seeks to cover the possibility of sin there. If sin is there,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 151, 27, 12, 'let God expose it. But our attitude should be to put a good construction');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 151, 28, 12, 'to the action and put a good intention behind it. That is the mark of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 152, 1, 12, 'the fact that we''ve been delivered from the kingdom of darkness. In our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 152, 2, 12, 'olden days, when we were children of Adam, we were specialists in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 152, 3, 12, 'putting the worst possible motive on everything that other people said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 152, 4, 12, 'and did. We were experts at that, and if we have not been cured of that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 152, 5, 12, 'habit, that shows that we have not been working out our salvation with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 152, 6, 12, 'fear and trembling in this area. I believe this is one of the greatest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 152, 7, 12, 'areas where we need to work out our salvation. It''s from the heart that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 152, 8, 12, 'this evil comes up. Therefore, if we don''t work out our salvation, we''ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 152, 9, 12, 'never be free from it. The book of Proverbs speaks about wisdom, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 152, 10, 12, 'wisdom begins in cleansing our heart of all hatred by working out our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 152, 11, 12, 'own salvation. You see, Wisdom is happy when everything is done in love.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 152, 12, 12, 'It may not be done perfectly, but if it is done in love, there can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 152, 13, 12, 'progress toward perfection. Even what we do in love can be done');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 152, 14, 12, 'foolishly, but at least it is done with love so that there is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 152, 15, 12, 'possibility of growth towards perfection. But if we haven''t even gotten');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 152, 16, 12, 'that far, such that we''re still doing things with hatred, then there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 152, 17, 12, 'absolutely no possibility of growth in wisdom. This is why so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 152, 18, 12, 'Christians never seem to make progress throughout their entire life:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 152, 19, 12, 'because they''ve never cleansed out this hatred and the wrong attitudes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 152, 20, 12, 'toward others in their heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 152, 21, 12, 'On the lips of the discerning, wisdom is found,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 152, 22, 12, 'But a rod is for the back of him who lacks understanding.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 152, 23, 12, 'Prov 10:13');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 152, 24, 12, 'A rod to the back is the way God seeks to give us wisdom. If I lack');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 152, 25, 12, 'wisdom, I need to say, "Lord, I am one of those people who lack wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 152, 26, 12, 'I qualify for the rod. I need a rod on my back to teach me." Just like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 152, 27, 12, 'it says about children that foolishness is bound up in their hearts, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 152, 28, 12, 'the rod of correction will drive out that foolishness (Proverbs 22:15).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 153, 1, 12, 'I need to see that spiritually I am like a little child. I do all types');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 153, 2, 12, 'of things out of selfishness and I stir up old quarrels and many other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 153, 3, 12, 'things which in God''s eyes are much worse than a child spilling milk or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 153, 4, 12, 'breaking something in the house. A million times worse. What do I need?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 153, 5, 12, 'I need a rod. This teaches us that it is through chastening that we get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 153, 6, 12, 'wisdom. It is impossible to get God''s wisdom without God disciplining');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 153, 7, 12, 'us. That is why it says that every son whom the Lord receives and whom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 153, 8, 12, 'he loves, he disciplines (Proverbs 3:11-12, Hebrews 12:6). He allows');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 153, 9, 12, 'circumstances, sicknesses, financial difficulties, trials, people to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 153, 10, 12, 'oppress us, and difficult neighbors. There are so many ways in which God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 153, 11, 12, 'disciplines us. And the purpose is that we might get wisdom, because we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 153, 12, 12, 'lack understanding.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 153, 13, 12, 'Wise men store up knowledge,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 153, 14, 12, 'But with the mouth of the foolish, ruin is at hand.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 153, 15, 12, 'Prov 10:14');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 153, 16, 12, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 153, 17, 12, 'A wise man holds his tongue. Only a fool blurts out everything he knows;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 153, 18, 12, 'that only leads to sorrow and trouble.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 153, 19, 12, 'Prov 10:14, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 153, 20, 12, 'In the midst of a bunch of people who are always babbling, it''s easy to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 153, 21, 12, 'find out who is wise: the one who knows how to control his tongue and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 153, 22, 12, 'keep quiet. This verse teaches us that if we are wise, we will not blurt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 153, 23, 12, 'out everything we know. There are some people who have this foolish idea');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 153, 24, 12, 'that the only way to have fellowship is to be absolutely honest with one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 153, 25, 12, 'another - to tell each other everything that we know. You never find a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 153, 26, 12, 'verse like that in scripture. That''s what the psychiatrists say. It''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 153, 27, 12, 'mark of folly in scripture. It says the wise man knows how to hold his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 153, 28, 12, 'tongue. It''s only the fool who blurts out everything he knows. He thinks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 154, 1, 12, 'he''s being honest, but it does not lead to fellowship. It leads to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 154, 2, 12, 'sorrow and trouble. The wise man knows how to be quiet.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 154, 3, 12, 'The rich man''s wealth is his fortress,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 154, 4, 12, 'The ruin of the poor is their poverty.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 154, 5, 12, 'Prov 10:15');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 154, 6, 12, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 154, 7, 12, 'The rich man''s wealth is his only strength. The poor man''s poverty is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 154, 8, 12, 'his only curse.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 154, 9, 12, 'Prov 10:15, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 154, 10, 12, 'Notice that in the Proverbs, there''s no connection in one sense between');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 154, 11, 12, 'one verse and the next. However, one connection that runs right through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 154, 12, 12, 'the entire book is: the book of Proverbs teaches us how to be wise and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 154, 13, 12, 'it teaches us what the marks of a fool are.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 154, 14, 12, 'Verse 15 is trying to tell us how wealth and poverty on this earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 154, 15, 12, 'really don''t have much value. There''s a verse in Proverbs 18:11 which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 154, 16, 12, 'amplifies this a little more so that we understand it better. It says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 154, 17, 12, '"A rich man''s wealth is his strong city and like a high wall in his own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 154, 18, 12, 'imagination." It''s in the rich man''s own imagination that he thinks, "My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 154, 19, 12, 'riches are a fortress to protect me." The world is full of such people,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 154, 20, 12, 'and the sad thing is there are a lot of believers like that too, who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 154, 21, 12, 'think their fortress and their security from problems and from want and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 154, 22, 12, 'from difficulty is their money. That''s the mark of a fool. He may be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 154, 23, 12, 'rich, but his wealth is his fortress only in his imagination. If a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 154, 24, 12, 'is poor, he may have difficulties on the earth - that''s true. But he can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 154, 25, 12, 'still be wise even though he is poor. We know that Jesus himself did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 154, 26, 12, 'have a place to lay his head for the last three years of his life, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 154, 27, 12, 'he was the wisest man who walked on the earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 154, 28, 12, 'The wages of the righteous is life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 155, 1, 12, 'The income of the wicked, punishment.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 155, 2, 12, 'Prov 10:16');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 155, 3, 12, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 155, 4, 12, 'The good man''s earnings advance the cause of righteousness. The evil man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 155, 5, 12, 'squanders his on sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 155, 6, 12, 'Prov 10:16, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 155, 7, 12, 'We could replace sin with selfishness as well: The evil man squanders');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 155, 8, 12, 'his on selfish desires. You see, the way we use our money is also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 155, 9, 12, 'another indication of whether we are wise or foolish. The good man''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 155, 10, 12, 'earnings advance the cause of righteousness. This is a contrast to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 155, 11, 12, 'previous verse. The previous verse was about a rich man who doesn''t use');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 155, 12, 12, 'his money to advance the cause of righteousness, but tries to build a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 155, 13, 12, 'fortress for himself with all his money. He thinks that he''s safe, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 155, 14, 12, 'really he''s foolish. But the righteous man doesn''t try to build a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 155, 15, 12, 'fortress for himself with his money. He uses it for advancing the cause');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 155, 16, 12, 'of righteousness. That''s wisdom. He uses his wages to advance the cause');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 155, 17, 12, 'of righteousness and that leads to life. Whereas the evil man squanders');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 155, 18, 12, 'his on sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 155, 19, 12, 'He is on the path of life who heeds instruction,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 155, 20, 12, 'But he who ignores reproof goes astray.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 155, 21, 12, 'Prov 10:17');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 155, 22, 12, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 155, 23, 12, 'Anyone willing to be corrected is on the pathway to life. Anyone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 155, 24, 12, 'refusing has lost his chance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 155, 25, 12, 'Prov 10:17, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 155, 26, 12, 'This is what we considered earlier about chastening. If we are willing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 155, 27, 12, 'to be corrected, that is a mark that we are on the path to life. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 155, 28, 12, 'amazing how much the book of Proverbs says about correction, and it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 156, 1, 12, 'not only about parents correcting their children. There''s no book in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 156, 2, 12, 'bible which speaks as much about parents correcting their children as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 156, 3, 12, 'the book of Proverbs. But it also speaks much about foolish people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 156, 4, 12, 'becoming wise through one simple habit: being willing to be corrected. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 156, 5, 12, 'tell you brothers and sisters, that is a test of whether we have even a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 156, 6, 12, 'little bit of desire to become wise. How do you feel when somebody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 156, 7, 12, 'corrects you? Flattery is the mark of Babylon, and all those who love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 156, 8, 12, 'flattery, even if they talk about the New and Living Way, are actually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 156, 9, 12, 'Babylonian in spirit. If I love other people coming and telling me,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 156, 10, 12, '"You''re a wholehearted brother. We really appreciate you, brother.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 156, 11, 12, 'You''re wonderful. You''re zealous," then whatever theology or doctrine I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 156, 12, 12, 'may believe, my spirit is Babylonian. But if my spirit is one that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 156, 13, 12, 'recognizes, "Lord, I lack wisdom tremendously," and I long to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 156, 14, 12, 'corrected and instructed, then I will not be interested in the flattery');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 156, 15, 12, 'of other people who come and say that I''m a wholehearted brother. Their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 156, 16, 12, 'opinion is fit for the garbage bin. I want correction. I want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 156, 17, 12, 'instruction. If we don''t learn anything else from the book of Proverbs,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 156, 18, 12, 'I''d encourage you to learn this - particularly young people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 156, 19, 12, 'Even though this is primarily for young people, it''s also for older');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 156, 20, 12, 'people. It''s a sad thing if we become old and we don''t know how to take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 156, 21, 12, 'correction. We can think we are willing to take correction until');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 156, 22, 12, 'somebody actually comes and corrects us and rebukes us. Then we get so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 156, 23, 12, 'offended. We think about it all night, we can''t sleep, we get hurt, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 156, 24, 12, 'we have a bad opinion about that brother or sister. That shows what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 156, 25, 12, 'absolute idiots and fools we are even though we speak so much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 156, 26, 12, 'high-sounding, spiritual language. Brothers and sisters, the mark of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 156, 27, 12, 'man who''s really longing to be wise is not just that he accepts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 156, 28, 12, 'correction but that he longs for it. He longs for it - "I want it. I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 157, 1, 12, 'longing to be corrected because I''m so stupid. I do so many foolish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 157, 2, 12, 'things." And so we see, the one who is willing to be corrected is on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 157, 3, 12, 'pathway to life and anyone who refuses correction goes astray. That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 157, 4, 12, 'how so many believers have gone astray. Many have gone astray without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 157, 5, 12, 'even knowing it just because of one simple thing: when they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 157, 6, 12, 'corrected, they got offended. And God doesn''t always correct us himself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 157, 7, 12, 'Sometimes he does that, but sometimes he corrects us through another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 157, 8, 12, 'brother. Then it''s more difficult to accept. People get offended when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 157, 9, 12, 'they get corrected by someone and they go astray and ruin their life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 157, 10, 12, 'It''s impossible to walk the New and Living Way if we are unwilling to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 157, 11, 12, 'receive correction without getting offended.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 157, 12, 12, 'He who conceals hatred has lying lips,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 157, 13, 12, 'And he who spreads slander is a fool.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 157, 14, 12, 'Prov 10:18');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 157, 15, 12, 'There are two things mentioned here. First is to hide hatred and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 157, 16, 12, 'pretend to love. Such a person is a liar. That''s why in the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 157, 17, 12, 'Testament in Romans 12:9 it says, "Let love be without hypocrisy." Why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 157, 18, 12, 'does it say that? Because it''s so easy for love to be with hypocrisy -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 157, 19, 12, 'just this nice smile and words and pretending, while inside we think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 157, 20, 12, 'evil thoughts about the other person and we have something bitter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 157, 21, 12, 'against him. But on the outside, a smile. There''s nothing wrong with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 157, 22, 12, 'other person. The whole problem is with me, and the word of God says I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 157, 23, 12, 'am a liar. I''m just pretending to show love while inside I have some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 157, 24, 12, 'hatred, some bitterness. I have something against that person. What am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 157, 25, 12, 'I? A liar! Any mistake he may have made is nothing compared to my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 157, 26, 12, 'mistake of being an absolute, downright liar. God''s word is strong.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 157, 27, 12, 'The second thing is to spread slander. That speaks of one who doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 157, 28, 12, 'just keep hatred in his heart - he goes one step further and spreads');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 158, 1, 12, 'slander. This is one mark of a fool. There are many marks of fools in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 158, 2, 12, 'the book of Proverbs, and one who speaks evil about others - goes to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 158, 3, 12, 'another home and speaks evil about another person - is a fool! Whatever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 158, 4, 12, 'his knowledge may be, whatever his doctrine may be, he''s a fool. In 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 158, 5, 12, 'Timothy 3:11 and 2 Timothy 3:3, the word "slanderer" in the Greek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 158, 6, 12, 'language is a word called "diabolos" from which we get the English word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 158, 7, 12, '"diabolical" or "satanic". "Diabolos" is translated in the New Testament');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 158, 8, 12, 'in two ways: one is "Satan" and the other is "slanderer". Never forget');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 158, 9, 12, 'that the word "diabolos" means Satan, and it means one who goes around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 158, 10, 12, 'speaking evil about others. In other words, all those who speak evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 158, 11, 12, 'about others are actually little satans. Satan is the accuser of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 158, 12, 12, 'brethren, and those who speak evil of others behind their backs are hand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 158, 13, 12, 'in hand with Satan doing his job. So the next time I sit with somebody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 158, 14, 12, 'and I speak evil about someone else, let me remember this: here I am, a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 158, 15, 12, 'little diabolos, holding hands with my master, Satan. I may speak about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 158, 16, 12, 'the New and Living Way in the meetings, but I''m holding hands with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 158, 17, 12, 'devil and I''m a slanderer and a gossip who will one day be exposed for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 158, 18, 12, 'the evil hypocrite that I am - if not in this life, then at the judgment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 158, 19, 12, 'seat of Christ. Let me never forget this. The word of God is very strong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 158, 20, 12, 'against slandering and speaking evil. I''m sorry to say that most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 158, 21, 12, 'Christians have never seen the satanic, diabolical, evil nature of this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 158, 22, 12, 'filthy sin. It''s not adultery which is called diabolical in the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 158, 23, 12, 'Testament - it is slander and speaking evil of others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 158, 24, 12, 'When there are many words, transgression is unavoidable,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 158, 25, 12, 'But he who restrains his lips is wise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 158, 26, 12, 'Prov 10:19');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 158, 27, 12, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 158, 28, 12, 'The more you talk, the more likely you are to sin. If you are wise, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 159, 1, 12, 'will keep quiet.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 159, 2, 12, 'Prov 10:19, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 159, 3, 12, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 159, 4, 12, 'Don''t talk so much. You keep putting your foot in your mouth. Be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 159, 5, 12, 'sensible and turn off the flow!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 159, 6, 12, 'Prov 10:19, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 159, 7, 12, 'That''s a very good thing to do: to be sensible and turn off the flow.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 159, 8, 12, 'Your mouth is flowing quite a lot. Just turn the tap and close it a bit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 159, 9, 12, 'That''s exactly what a lot of people need to do. Now this is exactly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 159, 10, 12, 'opposite of what''s out in the world. Out in the world, if you keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 159, 11, 12, 'quiet, do you know what they call you? They don''t call you wise, they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 159, 12, 12, 'call you unsociable. "Oh, he''s a quiet type." Unsociable. You know what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 159, 13, 12, 'the word of God calls such a person? Wise. That''s not surprising. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 159, 14, 12, 'world''s ideas are exactly the opposite of God''s ideas. The sad thing is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 159, 15, 12, 'when believers get more influenced by the ideas of the world than the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 159, 16, 12, 'ideas of God. It says here, "The more you talk, the more likely you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 159, 17, 12, 'to sin." If you''re wise, you''ll keep quiet. That doesn''t mean that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 159, 18, 12, 'just never say anything. We can go to an extreme on this. It doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 159, 19, 12, 'mean the wise person never says anything. It means he has control. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 159, 20, 12, 'doesn''t just keep on jabbering, jabbering, chattering, chattering,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 159, 21, 12, 'chattering all the time. Talking, talking, talking, talking, talking.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 159, 22, 12, 'I feel particularly that women have a greater temptation here than men,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 159, 23, 12, 'especially when they visit one another. The word of God says very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 159, 24, 12, 'clearly in 1 Timothy 5:13 that this is a danger particularly for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 159, 25, 12, 'sisters. And I believe this a verse that sisters need to take more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 159, 26, 12, 'seriously than anything else. In the multitude of words, sin is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 159, 27, 12, 'unavoidable. It''s easy to see that. That''s why John Wesley, when he gave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 159, 28, 12, 'instructions to those who were converted through his ministry, said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 160, 1, 12, '"When you visit one another, it''s not wise to spend more than one hour');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 160, 2, 12, 'in anybody''s home. Beyond that, you will sin." This verse is the basis');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 160, 3, 12, 'of his instruction. It''s not impossible. You can sit for two or three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 160, 4, 12, 'hours in somebody''s home without sinning, but you have to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 160, 5, 12, 'tremendously godly. The word of God doesn''t say one hour is the limit,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 160, 6, 12, 'but you have to be tremendously godly to speak for two or three hours');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 160, 7, 12, 'with a person and not sin. The average believer, after forty-five');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 160, 8, 12, 'minutes, starts talking about some evil or some gossip about another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 160, 9, 12, 'person and begins to sin. That''s true. And one who is really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 160, 10, 12, 'wholehearted about this will say, "I don''t want to ruin my life by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 160, 11, 12, 'speaking evil." If you are godly, by all means, spend any amount of time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 160, 12, 12, 'with another person. But when you find you have moved away from talking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 160, 13, 12, 'about neutral things or good things or spiritual things, and you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 160, 14, 12, 'begun to talk about evil things and about other people, you know it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 160, 15, 12, 'time to say goodbye and go home. Some people begin sinning after fifteen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 160, 16, 12, 'minutes, some people a little later. But wherever our limit is, we need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 160, 17, 12, 'to stop and say, "Now, beyond this, I feel that sin is unavoidable. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 160, 18, 12, 'need to get up and go home." Remember that, particularly sisters. Those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 160, 19, 12, 'who have ears to hear, let him hear. The rest will go astray.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 160, 20, 12, 'The tongue of the righteous is as choice silver,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 160, 21, 12, 'The heart of the wicked is worth little.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 160, 22, 12, 'Prov 10:20');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 160, 23, 12, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 160, 24, 12, 'A good person''s words are like pure silver; a wicked person''s ideas are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 160, 25, 12, 'worthless.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 160, 26, 12, 'Prov 10:20, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 160, 27, 12, 'There''s no book in the bible which speaks as much about the tongue and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 160, 28, 12, 'about our speech as the book of Proverbs. It''s amazing to see how many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 161, 1, 12, 'things are emphasized in the book of Proverbs repeatedly: correction,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 161, 2, 12, 'the use of the tongue, the use of money, etc. These are some of the ways');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 161, 3, 12, 'in which God seeks to lead us to wisdom. "The tongue of the righteous is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 161, 4, 12, 'like silver and the heart of the wicked is worthless." That is, it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 161, 5, 12, 'rubbish. In fact, one translation says that the heart of the wicked is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 161, 6, 12, 'worth so little that it''s just like rubbish. His ideas are all like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 161, 7, 12, 'rubbish, because he''s a wicked man. He may be intelligent, but his ideas');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 161, 8, 12, 'as far as godliness goes are absolute rubbish, because he has not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 161, 9, 12, 'understood how to live in purity. But a righteous man, his words are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 161, 10, 12, 'like choice silver. You see, when it comes to hearing somebody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 161, 11, 12, 'expounding the word of God, I would rather listen to an unintelligent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 161, 12, 12, 'righteous man than to a highly intelligent man who''s living a defeated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 161, 13, 12, 'life. A great bible scholar who doesn''t have victory over sin, this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 161, 14, 12, 'verse says all his sermons are worth nothing. You might as well throw');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 161, 15, 12, 'them in the garbage bin, and you have to be an idiot to sit one hour');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 161, 16, 12, 'listening to that type of trash. But the few words a person speaks who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 161, 17, 12, 'has victory over sin in his life is like silver. So brothers and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 161, 18, 12, 'sisters, what is it that''s going to give value to the words that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 161, 19, 12, 'speak? It''s not how much knowledge we have or how much we can say. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 161, 20, 12, 'a question of how much righteousness we have in our life. The more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 161, 21, 12, 'righteousness there is, the more value to the words that we speak.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 161, 22, 12, 'The lips of the righteous feed many,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 161, 23, 12, 'But fools die for lack of understanding.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 161, 24, 12, 'Prov 10:21');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 161, 25, 12, 'The lips of the righteous, which are like pure silver like we say in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 161, 26, 12, 'verse 20, feed many. The word "feed" here is like a shepherd feeding his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 161, 27, 12, 'flock. The lips of the righteous, like a shepherd feeding his flock,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 161, 28, 12, 'feed many. But fools die for lack of understanding. In other words, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 162, 1, 12, 'can kill yourself with stupidity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 162, 2, 12, 'It is the blessing of the Lord that makes rich,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 162, 3, 12, 'And He adds no sorrow to it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 162, 4, 12, 'Prov 10:22');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 162, 5, 12, 'It''s the Lord''s blessing that makes us wealthy. And in that blessing,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 162, 6, 12, '"he adds no sorrow to it." Now this is a verse that we need to contrast');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 162, 7, 12, 'with a New Testament verse, because the words "riches" and "sorrow" come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 162, 8, 12, 'together, as far as I can recollect, in only two verses in scripture.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 162, 9, 12, 'One is Proverbs 10:22 where it says, "The blessing of the Lord makes you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 162, 10, 12, 'rich and there is no sorrowin it." The other is 1 Timothy 6:10 where it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 162, 11, 12, 'says, "The love of money is the root of all evil and some, by longing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 162, 12, 12, 'for it, have wandered away from the faith and pierced themselves with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 162, 13, 12, 'many a sorrow." So we see that you can get riches with sorrow or riches');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 162, 14, 12, 'without sorrow. Riches bring sorrow if we love those riches, longing for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 162, 15, 12, 'them, scheming, planning, aiming to get rich, and finally getting them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 162, 16, 12, 'That''s the way all business men and a lot of other people in the world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 162, 17, 12, 'get riches, and along with those riches comes sorrow. There''s another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 162, 18, 12, 'way to get riches which is described in Proverbs 10:22. It says the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 162, 19, 12, 'blessing of the Lord can also make you rich. It may not make you a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 162, 20, 12, 'millionaire. In fact, it''s also a blessing that you don''t become a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 162, 21, 12, 'millionaire, because you''re protected from a lot of things that will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 162, 22, 12, 'harm you. The blessing of the Lord will make you rich - rich enough to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 162, 23, 12, 'meet all your needs. It says in Philippians 4:19, "My God shall supply');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 162, 24, 12, 'all your needs according to his riches in glory in Christ Jesus." That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 162, 25, 12, 'a tremendous promise. He has not promised all that I want, but he has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 162, 26, 12, 'promised all that I need. The blessing of the Lord can make us rich, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 162, 27, 12, 'there is no sorrow in it. That''s the wonderful thing about the blessing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 162, 28, 12, 'of the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 163, 1, 12, 'Another translation puts it like this: "Hard word work cannot make you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 163, 2, 12, 'any richer." It''s not by hard word work alone that we get rich. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 163, 3, 12, 'are some people that think by slogging, slogging, slogging they''ll make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 163, 4, 12, 'money. No. Hard work is emphasized in the book of Proverbs, but it''s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 163, 5, 12, 'blessing of the Lord ultimately that meets our needs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 163, 6, 12, 'Doing wickedness is like sport to a fool,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 163, 7, 12, 'And so is wisdom to a man of understanding.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 163, 8, 12, 'Prov 10:23');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 163, 9, 12, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 163, 10, 12, 'A fool''s fun is being bad; a wise man''s fun is being wise!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 163, 11, 12, 'Prov 10:23, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 163, 12, 12, 'In other words, foolish people enjoy hurting others. Read it like that:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 163, 13, 12, '"A fool enjoys hurting other people." Now, we all lack wisdom and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 163, 14, 12, 'sometimes we may say something that hurts someone and only afterward');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 163, 15, 12, 'realize it. "Oh, I feel so bad. I didn''t mean to hurt him, but in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 163, 16, 12, 'folly, I said something and he got hurt." He''s not talking about such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 163, 17, 12, 'people. He''s talking about those who enjoy saying something that will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 163, 18, 12, 'hurt somebody. You find that in schools and colleges, how children and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 163, 19, 12, 'teenage boys and girls like to tease others and make fun of them in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 163, 20, 12, 'way that will hurt them. Children grow up and develop that habit. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 163, 21, 12, 'perverted sense of humor gets sharpened to say something funny that will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 163, 22, 12, 'hurt other people. That''s the mark of a fool. That''s the mark of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 163, 23, 12, 'spiritual idiot. He loves to hurt others. It may not be with humor. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 163, 24, 12, 'may be with other words that he schemes and plans. "I''ll say this,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 163, 25, 12, 'because if I say this, it will really hurt him." That''s the mark of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 163, 26, 12, 'spiritual idiot. It''s like a sport. It''s a joke to him to hurt another.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 163, 27, 12, 'But a man of understanding takes pleasure in wisdom, and wisdom is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 163, 28, 12, 'manifested in saying something good. We want to find our humor and our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 164, 1, 12, 'fun in being wise and being good in what we say to others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 164, 2, 12, 'What the wicked fears will come upon him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 164, 3, 12, 'But the desire of the righteous will be granted.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 164, 4, 12, 'Prov 10:24');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 164, 5, 12, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 164, 6, 12, 'The wicked man''s fears will all come true and so will the good man''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 164, 7, 12, 'hopes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 164, 8, 12, 'Prov 10:24, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 164, 9, 12, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 164, 10, 12, 'The righteous get what they want, but the wicked will get what they fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 164, 11, 12, 'most.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 164, 12, 12, 'Prov 10:24, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 164, 13, 12, 'What the wicked person fears will come upon him. In contrast, the good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 164, 14, 12, 'man has hopes, not fears. His hopes will also come true. We find that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 164, 15, 12, 'can apply this practically to our life. We all have fears and hopes in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 164, 16, 12, 'terms of the future, and this verse teaches us that it''s our character');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 164, 17, 12, 'that determines what will come true for us. What we will get depends on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 164, 18, 12, 'whether we are wicked or righteous.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 164, 19, 12, 'When the whirlwind passes, the wicked is no more,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 164, 20, 12, 'But the righteous has an everlasting foundation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 164, 21, 12, 'Prov 10:25');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 164, 22, 12, 'This reminds us of the foolish and the wise builders whom Jesus spoke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 164, 23, 12, 'about: the man who built his house on the rock and the man who built his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 164, 24, 12, 'house on the sand. Jesus read through the book of Proverbs, and there''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 164, 25, 12, 'no doubt he based what he said on this. Jesus explained in Matthew 7:24');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 164, 26, 12, 'that the righteous people who have an everlasting foundation are "those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 164, 27, 12, 'who hear these words of mine and do them." When we hear the words of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 164, 28, 12, 'Jesus and obey them, we become wise. You know, God''s wisdom is like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 165, 1, 12, 'great, massive ocean. Think of an ocean. God''s wisdom is like an ocean,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 165, 2, 12, 'and I cannot receive all of it at once, but I can receive it drop by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 165, 3, 12, 'drop by drop by drop. If you think about it, the whole ocean is just a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 165, 4, 12, 'bunch of drops put together. And we can say those drops are God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 165, 5, 12, 'commandments. I take one commandment and I obey it. Then I take another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 165, 6, 12, 'one and I obey it. I take another one and I obey it. And little by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 165, 7, 12, 'little, drop by drop, I am accumulating in my vessel the ocean of God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 165, 8, 12, 'wisdom. It''s a wise man who builds his house on the rock little by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 165, 9, 12, 'little through obedience. That''s why it takes time to become wise. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 165, 10, 12, 'fool is one who does not understand obedience. And when the whirlwind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 165, 11, 12, 'has passed, the righteous still stands because no type of disaster will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 165, 12, 12, 'ever shake the righteous.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 165, 13, 12, 'Like vinegar to the teeth and smoke to the eyes,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 165, 14, 12, 'So is the lazy one to those who send him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 165, 15, 12, 'Prov 10:26');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 165, 16, 12, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 165, 17, 12, 'Never get a lazy person to do something for you; he will be as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 165, 18, 12, 'irritating as vinegar on your teeth or smoke in your eyes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 165, 19, 12, 'Prov 10:26, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 165, 20, 12, 'God never picks up lazy people for his ministry. You find in the gospels');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 165, 21, 12, 'that whenever Jesus called the apostles, they were always people who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 165, 22, 12, 'were working hard in their place of work - whether it was Peter, Andrew,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 165, 23, 12, 'James, or John out in the fishing boat or Matthew sitting in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 165, 24, 12, 'tax-collecting office, he always called people who were working hard in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 165, 25, 12, 'their secular jobs. Take Elisha for example. Elijah called him when he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 165, 26, 12, 'was working hard in the field. You never find in the scriptures God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 165, 27, 12, 'calling even one lazy person. Never. You never find an example of a lazy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 165, 28, 12, 'person being called to ministry from Genesis to Revelation, and you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 166, 1, 12, 'won''t find it happening even today. Such people would be like vinegar on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 166, 2, 12, 'God''s teeth and smoke in his eyes, and God doesn''t want that. We find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 166, 3, 12, 'that the word of God, particularly the book of Proverbs, has a lot to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 166, 4, 12, 'say about diligence.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 166, 5, 12, 'In Proverbs 25:13 you see the opposite of this verse: "Like the cold of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 166, 6, 12, 'snow in the time of harvest (which is a good thing) is a faithful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 166, 7, 12, 'messenger to those who send him, for he refreshes the soul of his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 166, 8, 12, 'masters." This is the opposite of this lazy person in Proverbs 10:26.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 166, 9, 12, 'Faithfulness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 166, 10, 12, 'Obey the Lord, and you will live longer. The wicked die before their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 166, 11, 12, 'time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 166, 12, 12, 'Prov 10:27, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 166, 13, 12, 'It is possible to die before one''s time. There are people who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 166, 14, 12, 'drunkards who die long before God intends them to. That''s a very obvious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 166, 15, 12, 'case. But a person can also kill himself with bitterness and hatred and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 166, 16, 12, 'envy. Those things also shorten life. But through obedience to God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 166, 17, 12, 'commandments, we can live longer. The wicked die before their time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 166, 18, 12, 'because of their wickedness. God has made us in such a way that even our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 166, 19, 12, 'physical life is affected by wrong attitudes and sin in our heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 166, 20, 12, 'The hope of the righteous is gladness,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 166, 21, 12, 'But the expectation of the wicked perishes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 166, 22, 12, 'Prov 10:28');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 166, 23, 12, 'In other words, the hopes of good men lead to joy, but the wicked person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 166, 24, 12, 'can really look forward to nothing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 166, 25, 12, 'The way of the Lord is a stronghold to the upright,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 166, 26, 12, 'But ruin to the workers of iniquity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 166, 27, 12, 'Prov 10:29');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 166, 28, 12, 'The same way is a strength to one and destruction to another. The way of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 167, 1, 12, 'the Lord for the upright is their stronghold. You see the contrast with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 167, 2, 12, 'verse 15, where it said the rich man thinks his wealth is his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 167, 3, 12, 'stronghold. But what is the fortress of the upright person? That to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 167, 4, 12, 'best of his knowledge, according to the light he has in his conscience,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 167, 5, 12, 'he is seeking to walk in the way of the Lord. But that exact same way is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 167, 6, 12, 'a ruin to the workers of iniquity - those who seek to be hypocrites in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 167, 7, 12, 'seeking to talk about this way and not walk in it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 167, 8, 12, 'The righteous will never be shaken,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 167, 9, 12, 'But the wicked will not dwell in the land.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 167, 10, 12, 'Prov 10:30');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 167, 11, 12, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 167, 12, 12, 'Righteous people will always have security, but the wicked will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 167, 13, 12, 'survive in the land.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 167, 14, 12, 'Prov 10:30, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 167, 15, 12, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 167, 16, 12, 'The good shall never lose God''s blessings, but the wicked shall lose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 167, 17, 12, 'everything.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 167, 18, 12, 'Prov 10:30, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 167, 19, 12, 'These are wonderful translations to consider.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 167, 20, 12, 'The mouth of the righteous flows with wisdom,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 167, 21, 12, 'But the perverted tongue will be cut out.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 167, 22, 12, 'Prov 10:31');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 167, 23, 12, 'It''s a beautiful word here: flows. Think of a tap that''s flowing. Think,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 167, 24, 12, 'brothers and sisters, that we can so live in the fear of the Lord the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 167, 25, 12, 'whole day long, that whenever we open our mouths, wisdom flows out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 167, 26, 12, '(because the fear of the Lord is the beginning of wisdom). Good, clean');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 167, 27, 12, 'water. We don''t always open our tap like the fools who constantly dish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 167, 28, 12, 'out rubbish from their hearts. We only open it once in a while, but when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 168, 1, 12, 'it is open, it is clean water that is flowing out because it is coming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 168, 2, 12, 'from a heart that is living the whole day in the fear of the Lord. "The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 168, 3, 12, 'mouth of the righteous flows with wisdom." This is something we need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 168, 4, 12, 'really covet. Think if we have a church where every brother and sister');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 168, 5, 12, 'has come to this life: that they only open their mouths to flow with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 168, 6, 12, 'wisdom. What a church that will be. I tell you, the gates of Hell will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 168, 7, 12, 'never prevail against that church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 168, 8, 12, 'The lips of the righteous bring forth what is acceptable,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 168, 9, 12, 'But the mouth of the wicked what is perverted.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 168, 10, 12, 'Prov 10:32');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 168, 11, 12, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 168, 12, 12, 'Righteous people know the kind thing to say, but the wicked are always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 168, 13, 12, 'saying things that hurt.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 168, 14, 12, 'Prov 10:32, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 168, 15, 12, 'This is how we know whether we are righteous or wicked. Righteous people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 168, 16, 12, 'know the kind thing to say. That means they think before they speak.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 168, 17, 12, 'They say, "If I say it like that, that will hurt him." So they don''t say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 168, 18, 12, 'it, because they know the kind thing to say and they live in the fear of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 168, 19, 12, 'God. But the wicked couldn''t care less for the fear of God and do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 168, 20, 12, 'believe that they''ll give an account on the day of judgment for every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 168, 21, 12, 'idle word they speak. They couldn''t care less for the judgment seat of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 168, 22, 12, 'Christ or any such thing. They are ALWAYS (not just once in a while)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 168, 23, 12, 'saying things that hurt others. That''s quite a standard that the word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 168, 24, 12, 'God lays down in the book of Proverbs, and it shows us whether we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 168, 25, 12, 'righteous or wicked.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 168, 26, 12, 'I''m reminded of the Apostle John when I read these verses in the book of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 168, 27, 12, 'Proverbs - the cut and dry things he said. He said things like, "The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 168, 28, 12, 'children of God are like this and the children of the devil are like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 169, 1, 12, 'this." "If you do righteousness, you''re a child of God. If you don''t do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 169, 2, 12, 'righteousness, whatever you talk about, you''re a child of the devil."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 169, 3, 12, '"If you don''t love your brothers, you''re a child of the devil. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 169, 4, 12, 'love your brothers wholeheartedly, you''re a child of God." It''s cut and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 169, 5, 12, 'dry. And here it says, "If you''re a righteous person, you know the kind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 169, 6, 12, 'thing to say. If you are saying things that hurt, you''re a wicked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 169, 7, 12, 'person." That''s all. The Holy Spirit that wrote the book of Proverbs and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 169, 8, 12, 'the book of 1 John is the same Spirit. We need to see that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 169, 9, 12, 'We notice in the last verse of chapter 10 that the tongue is the test of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 169, 10, 12, 'our character. That idea comes in James 3 as well. The tongue is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 169, 11, 12, 'test of our character. Never forget that, because out of the abundance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 169, 12, 12, 'of the heart the mouth speaks. You know what''s in a man''s heart by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 169, 13, 12, 'listening to what comes forth from his tongue.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 169, 14, 13, 'Chapter 11 Chapter 11');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 169, 15, 13, 'A false balance is an abomination to the Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 169, 16, 13, 'But a just weight is His delight.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 169, 17, 13, 'Prov 11:1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 169, 18, 13, 'As part of the law that was given through Moses, Deuteronomy 25:13-15');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 169, 19, 13, 'records a law which says, "You shall not have in your bag differing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 169, 20, 13, 'weights, a large and a small." Having different types of weights means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 169, 21, 13, 'when you want to go and buy something, you take out the large weight,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 169, 22, 13, 'and when you want to sell something to someone, you take out the small');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 169, 23, 13, 'one - always working in terms of your profit. This is wrong. The law');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 169, 24, 13, 'continues, saying "You shall have a correct and honest weight, you shall');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 169, 25, 13, 'have a correct and honest measure, so that your days may be prolonged in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 169, 26, 13, 'the land which the Lord your God gives you." In your house, you must not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 169, 27, 13, 'have different measures. Instead, there must be righteousness in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 169, 28, 13, 'business matters - absolute righteousness. In buying and selling,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 170, 1, 13, 'there''s a tremendous amount of sin. There was a wise man called Joshua');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 170, 2, 13, 'the son of Sirach who compiled the sayings of Sirach, and it says in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 170, 3, 13, 'that book, "As a nail sticks fast between two stones, so sin sticks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 170, 4, 13, 'between buying and selling." The saying is true - there''s such a great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 170, 5, 13, 'deal of sin and unrighteousness in buying and selling. There''s an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 170, 6, 13, 'illustration of a righteous man who sells fish that goes like this: a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 170, 7, 13, 'righteous man who sells fish in the market has three boxes. One for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 170, 8, 13, '"Today''s fish", one for "Yesterday''s fish", and a third for "Still older');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 170, 9, 13, 'fish." It''s almost impossible to find anyone who will be so righteous.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 170, 10, 13, 'But that''s the mark of a righteous man. He doesn''t try to fool people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 170, 11, 13, 'It''s not necessarily a question of weights. It may be a question of fish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 170, 12, 13, 'or something else. But the principle is that when we sell something, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 170, 13, 13, 'must be absolutely honest, without any cheating. If somebody gives you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 170, 14, 13, 'back a little more change, maybe in a shop, then be diligent to give it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 170, 15, 13, 'back as soon as possible. Do not postpone it to tomorrow or the next');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 170, 16, 13, 'day, but return it quickly. Seek to be righteous in this area. The Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 170, 17, 13, 'HATES cheating. So you can imagine how he hates when he sees so much of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 170, 18, 13, 'it in people''s dealings with one another who call themselves his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 170, 19, 13, 'children. But God DELIGHTS in honesty. He delights in people who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 170, 20, 13, 'absolutely honest even though it means loss for them. What do we gain by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 170, 21, 13, 'making a little extra money and at the end the Lord hates us? That''s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 170, 22, 13, 'gain. That''s a fantastic loss. Let''s learn to get the Lord''s delight on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 170, 23, 13, 'us by practicing honesty in all business matters.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 170, 24, 13, 'When pride comes, then comes dishonor,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 170, 25, 13, 'But with the humble is wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 170, 26, 13, 'Prov 11:2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 170, 27, 13, 'This teaches us that wisdom is given to humble people. Here we also find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 170, 28, 13, 'that this is almost like a New Covenant book, with the idea that wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 171, 1, 13, 'is found among humble people. If you want wisdom, mix with humble');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 171, 2, 13, 'people. You''ll never get wisdom by mixing with proud people. A proud');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 171, 3, 13, 'person can never be wise, even if he''s a bible scholar. If you meet a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 171, 4, 13, 'man who''s a bible scholar and there''s a haughtiness about him, you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 171, 5, 13, 'be sure he doesn''t have much wisdom. Don''t waste your time hanging');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 171, 6, 13, 'around such people. Don''t waste your time mingling with believers who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 171, 7, 13, 'diffuse an air of pride and haughtiness. That applies for any type of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 171, 8, 13, 'pride. The most stinking of the lot is spiritual pride. That''s the worst');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 171, 9, 13, 'type of pride there is. But wisdom is with the humble. You can be sure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 171, 10, 13, 'that the more wisdom a man gets, the more humble he is. The humblest man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 171, 11, 13, 'is the wisest man. Jesus was the humblest and he was the wisest. He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 171, 12, 13, 'poor, he wasn''t accepted by the world, but he was wise. Wisdom is with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 171, 13, 13, 'the humble and the humbler we are, the more we have wisdom. As far as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 171, 14, 13, 'God is concerned, it''s only shame and dishonor that he will bring to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 171, 15, 13, 'proud.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 171, 16, 13, 'The integrity of the upright will guide them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 171, 17, 13, 'But the crookedness of the treacherous will destroy them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 171, 18, 13, 'Prov 11:3');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 171, 19, 13, 'This proverb teaches us that those who have integrity (sincerity and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 171, 20, 13, 'honesty) are in a good place even if they are not very wise. You see, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 171, 21, 13, 'can''t all start with wisdom. Nobody can start with wisdom, because we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 171, 22, 13, 'don''t have it initially. But where we can and must start is with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 171, 23, 13, 'sincerity and honesty. The proverb continues, saying that sincerity will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 171, 24, 13, 'guide you! The sincerity and integrity of the upright will guide them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 171, 25, 13, 'into God''s perfect will. The reason why so many people find it difficult');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 171, 26, 13, 'to find God''s will in different areas is due to a lack of basic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 171, 27, 13, 'sincerity in their life. There''s some hypocrisy in our lives and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 171, 28, 13, 'more hypocritical we are, the more difficult it is to know God''s will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 172, 1, 13, 'and the greater amount of time we live as fools without wisdom. So we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 172, 2, 13, 'need to begin with sincerity and honesty. That is what will guide us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 172, 3, 13, 'Then it speaks of crookedness. Crookedness basically means hypocrisy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 172, 4, 13, 'The hypocrisy of the treacherous will finally destroy them. It''s very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 172, 5, 13, 'easy, brothers and sisters, to sit in an assembly where people speak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 172, 6, 13, 'about very high-sounding, spiritual stuff and be an absolute hypocrite.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 172, 7, 13, 'I tell you, it''s much easier to be a hypocrite sitting in CFC than it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 172, 8, 13, 'out there in some Roman Catholic church. I might as well tell you that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 172, 9, 13, 'quite honestly. There is a thousand times greater danger of hypocrisy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 172, 10, 13, 'for people sitting in CFC than someone in a Roman Catholic church. If we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 172, 11, 13, 'are wise, we''ll be alert to that danger and say, "Lord, maybe I''m in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 172, 12, 13, 'danger of hypocrisy - speaking things which are so high but not really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 172, 13, 13, 'true. I''m not sincere. I''m not honest." If that''s the case, it says I''ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 172, 14, 13, 'go astray and my hypocrisy will finally destroy me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 172, 15, 13, 'Your riches won''t help you on Judgment Day; only righteousness counts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 172, 16, 13, 'then.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 172, 17, 13, 'Prov 11:4, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 172, 18, 13, 'The first part is very easy to understand. Your riches will not help you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 172, 19, 13, 'on judgment day. I think all of us believe that. We know we can''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 172, 20, 13, 'impress God with our money or how much we earn. But we must also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 172, 21, 13, 'understand the second part: it is only righteousness that will have any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 172, 22, 13, 'value on that day. It is not bible knowledge, nor the number of meetings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 172, 23, 13, 'we attended, nor how many songs we sang, nor how zealous we were in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 172, 24, 13, 'meetings, nor any such thing that will have value, but righteousness! On');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 172, 25, 13, 'the day of judgment the only thing that will have value is a man walking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 172, 26, 13, 'in righteousness in his life. That delivers from death.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 172, 27, 13, 'Honesty makes a good person''s life easier, but the wicked will cause');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 172, 28, 13, 'their own downfall. Righteousness rescues those who are honest, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 173, 1, 13, 'those who can''t be trusted are trapped by their own greed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 173, 2, 13, 'Prov 11:5-6, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 173, 3, 13, 'He''s speaking here about righteous people whose honesty rescues them and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 173, 4, 13, 'makes their life easier. An honest man''s life is easy. He doesn''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 173, 5, 13, 'to think up thoughts like, "What lie shall I say to protect myself from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 173, 6, 13, 'this?" or "What lie shall I say to gain something here?" He only has to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 173, 7, 13, 'be honest and speak the truth. The promise in this proverb is that his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 173, 8, 13, 'honesty will rescue him. His righteousness rescues him. But a wicked man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 173, 9, 13, 'who can''t be trusted will cause his own downfall. His greed will one day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 173, 10, 13, 'trap him. Many people tell lies because of their greed. There are people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 173, 11, 13, 'who sign false statements in government offices to make a little more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 173, 12, 13, 'money and cheat various people by signing statements that are not true.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 173, 13, 13, 'One day their greed traps them. This is something we need to keep in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 173, 14, 13, 'mind.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 173, 15, 13, 'When an evil man dies, his hopes all perish, for they are based upon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 173, 16, 13, 'this earthly life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 173, 17, 13, 'Prov 11:7, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 173, 18, 13, 'His hopes perish because all his hopes were based on what he was on this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 173, 19, 13, 'earth. That''s self-explanatory.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 173, 20, 13, 'The righteous is delivered from trouble,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 173, 21, 13, 'But the wicked takes his place.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 173, 22, 13, 'Prov 11:8');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 173, 23, 13, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 173, 24, 13, 'God rescues good men from danger while letting the wicked fall into it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 173, 25, 13, 'Prov 11:8, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 173, 26, 13, 'When the red sea was opened up, the Israelites went through it, but the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 173, 27, 13, 'Egyptians drowned in that very same Red Sea. That''s a good visual of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 173, 28, 13, 'this verse. We find another fulfillment of this verse in the story of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 174, 1, 13, 'Haman and Mordecai in the book of Esther. Haman prepared a gallows to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 174, 2, 13, 'hang Mordecai on, but finally hung on it himself. The righteous is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 174, 3, 13, 'delivered and the wicked takes the place of the righteous. It''s a great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 174, 4, 13, 'encouragement to us to read the book of Proverbs and see that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 174, 5, 13, 'rescues good men from danger and turns the tables on Satan when Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 174, 6, 13, 'seeks to do something to us. If I humble myself and live in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 174, 7, 13, 'righteousness before God, God is able to rescue me from any danger. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 174, 8, 13, 'includes the things that evil people may plot or scheme against me. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 174, 9, 13, 'rescues good men from danger.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 174, 10, 13, 'I heard a very beautiful story of John Wesley who preached righteousness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 174, 11, 13, 'and was hated by many people in England. He led so many people away from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 174, 12, 13, 'drinking that the sale of alcohol went down. He was hated for exposing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 174, 13, 13, 'religious harlotry. There is a story of some people who tried to kill');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 174, 14, 13, 'him, although they wanted to do it without being caught. John Wesley');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 174, 15, 13, 'used to ride all over England on a horse, and these people knew he''d be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 174, 16, 13, 'riding through a particular place one night. They tied a strong but thin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 174, 17, 13, 'rope across two trees on the path through which John Wesley was going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 174, 18, 13, 'ride, hoping that he wouldn''t be able to see this rope in the night. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 174, 19, 13, 'plan was for the rope to throw him off the horse and kill him. Sure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 174, 20, 13, 'enough, John Wesley came riding down the path and just a few seconds');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 174, 21, 13, 'before he reached the rope, an ant bit him on his foot. He bent down to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 174, 22, 13, 'scratch his foot and safely passed under the rope and came out the other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 174, 23, 13, 'side. You see, God is the God of the ants. We may wonder why God created');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 174, 24, 13, 'ants, but we''ll discover in eternity that they saved the life of a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 174, 25, 13, 'of God. And likewise with mosquitoes and all the other things which we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 174, 26, 13, 'sometimes wonder why they exist. We''ll discover at the judgment seat of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 174, 27, 13, 'Christ how all these served a function to help somebody or the other.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 174, 28, 13, 'God rescues good men from danger. John Wesley used to say, "I''m a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 175, 1, 13, 'sent from God. Nobody can kill me till my time is finished." We must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 175, 2, 13, 'have that faith if we walk in righteousness and humility before God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 175, 3, 13, 'face. Nothing that other people do or scheme can ever touch us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 175, 4, 13, 'Impossible. It''s God almighty who is in charge.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 175, 5, 13, 'With his mouth the godless man destroys his neighbor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 175, 6, 13, 'But through knowledge the righteous will be delivered.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 175, 7, 13, 'Prov 11:9');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 175, 8, 13, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 175, 9, 13, 'Evil words destroy; godly skill rebuilds.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 175, 10, 13, 'Prov 11:9, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 175, 11, 13, 'There''s a connection between this verse and the previous verse. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 175, 12, 13, 'meaning here is that the godless man may try to kill a man of God in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 175, 13, 13, 'way as I just discussed regarding John Wesley, but he may also try to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 175, 14, 13, 'destroy a person with words. The godless man tries to destroy you with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 175, 15, 13, 'his words by slandering and saying all types of evil against you. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 175, 16, 13, 'the righteous will not fall into that trap. It says, "Through knowledge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 175, 17, 13, 'the righteous will be delivered." Through the knowledge of what? The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 175, 18, 13, 'righteous person has a knowledge of God''s promises. For example, Isaiah');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 175, 19, 13, '54:17 says, "No weapon that is formed against you will prosper and every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 175, 20, 13, 'tongue that will rise up in judgment against you, you shall condemn." He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 175, 21, 13, 'knows that all the words that people speak against him can never harm');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 175, 22, 13, 'him. Therefore he''s delivered. He also knows Romans 8:28, which says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 175, 23, 13, 'that all things will work together for good to those who love God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 175, 24, 13, 'are called according to his purpose. If we have knowledge of that,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 175, 25, 13, 'through that knowledge we are delivered from all these evil words that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 175, 26, 13, 'people may speak against us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 175, 27, 13, 'In the margin of The Living Bible, it says, "When a godless man slanders');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 175, 28, 13, 'his neighbor, the charges won''t stick because everyone knows his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 176, 1, 13, 'reputation." If you have lived in righteousness for many years and have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 176, 2, 13, 'built up a reputation, whatever evil the devil may try to attribute to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 176, 3, 13, 'you through godless people won''t stick, because people know who you are.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 176, 4, 13, 'So why should you waste your time defending yourself? Leave that to God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 176, 5, 13, 'When it goes well with the righteous, the city rejoices,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 176, 6, 13, 'And when the wicked perish, there is joyful shouting.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 176, 7, 13, 'By the blessing of the upright a city is exalted.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 176, 8, 13, 'But by the mouth of the wicked it is torn down.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 176, 9, 13, 'Prov 11:10-11');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 176, 10, 13, 'When a person is good, the whole city celebrates his success. When a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 176, 11, 13, 'is good to others, his success is appreciated. But even more than that,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 176, 12, 13, 'verse 11 says that the influence of godly people causes a city to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 176, 13, 13, 'prosper. By the blessing of the upright a city is exalted. We believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 176, 14, 13, 'that the best thing a city can have is a living church of Jesus Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 176, 15, 13, 'in its midst. That is the only thing in a city that can bind all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 176, 16, 13, 'evil spirits and bless that city. It''s the blessing of the upright by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 176, 17, 13, 'which a city is exalted and also protected from demons. Think of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 176, 18, 13, 'case of Sodom. If there were ten righteous people in the entire city,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 176, 19, 13, 'God told Abraham he would spare the city. But there were not ten');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 176, 20, 13, 'righteous people and so the city could not be spared. That teaches us,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 176, 21, 13, 'brothers and sisters, what a tremendous thing it is to be a righteous,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 176, 22, 13, 'upright man. You may not be famous or a chief minister or have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 176, 23, 13, 'influential contacts or any such thing, but I believe this verse is true');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 176, 24, 13, 'for any city. Take Bangalore for example, where CFC was started. On the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 176, 25, 13, 'day when we stand before the Lord and we look back over the history of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 176, 26, 13, 'the whole world as God sees it, we''ll see that Bangalore was blessed the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 176, 27, 13, 'most by the righteous people who lived there. God knows who they are.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 176, 28, 13, 'Whoever they are, it will have been through their righteousness,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 177, 1, 13, 'uprightness, and godliness that a blessing was brought upon the city');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 177, 2, 13, 'which chief ministers, police officials, and the jing-bang-lot could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 177, 3, 13, 'never bring. We''ll see that in eternity. It is the blessing of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 177, 4, 13, 'upright which exalts a city. That''s why God calls us to be upright and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 177, 5, 13, 'righteous and not a bunch of compromisers talking high-sounding');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 177, 6, 13, 'religious language.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 177, 7, 13, 'He who despises his neighbor lacks sense,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 177, 8, 13, 'But a man of understanding keeps silent.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 177, 9, 13, 'Prov 11:12');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 177, 10, 13, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 177, 11, 13, 'It is foolish to speak scornfully of others. If you are smart, you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 177, 12, 13, 'keep quiet.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 177, 13, 13, 'Prov 11:12, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 177, 14, 13, 'The mark of a fool is that he belittles other people. It is foolish to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 177, 15, 13, 'speak scornfully of others. If you are sensible, you will keep quiet.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 177, 16, 13, 'When you speak scornfully about another person, what does it prove? It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 177, 17, 13, 'proves one thing: that you''re a fool. It may or may not prove anything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 177, 18, 13, 'about the other person, but one thing it proves very clearly is that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 177, 19, 13, 'you''re a spiritual idiot who despises his neighbor. Whenever we despise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 177, 20, 13, 'someone because of their lack of education, or they cannot pronounce');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 177, 21, 13, 'certain words right, or their appearance looks a bit funny, or they walk');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 177, 22, 13, 'in a funny way, or anything, it shows we are spiritual idiots. It may be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 177, 23, 13, 'true that he walks in a funny way, or he''s a bit ugly, but you''re a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 177, 24, 13, 'spiritual idiot. That''s much worse. And that''s what you don''t realize');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 177, 25, 13, 'when you despise another person for something like that. Never forget');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 177, 26, 13, 'this: it''s foolish to speak scornfully about other people and to despise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 177, 27, 13, 'them. We don''t have any wisdom at all when we despise another person. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 177, 28, 13, 'doesn''t have to be another believer. It could even be an unbeliever.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 178, 1, 13, 'Leave them alone, brothers and sisters. If there''s folly or evil in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 178, 2, 13, 'others, leave them alone. Don''t despise them. This is a wonderful verse.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 178, 3, 13, 'Proverbs repeatedly speaks about the man of understanding holding his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 178, 4, 13, 'tongue. It''s amazing how right through the book of Proverbs, you see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 178, 5, 13, 'that one mark of wisdom is remaining quiet even when all the others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 178, 6, 13, 'around you are despising or speaking evil of someone. You''ll be the man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 178, 7, 13, 'of wisdom when you refuse to despise others like the people around you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 178, 8, 13, 'do. This is a good word particularly for those who are in schools and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 178, 9, 13, 'colleges, and other places where you find people doing so many evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 178, 10, 13, 'things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 178, 11, 13, 'I believe the only time, perhaps, we need to give a bad report about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 178, 12, 13, 'someone is when someone has asked our opinion of that person for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 178, 13, 13, 'purpose of entering into a business relationship or marriage or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 178, 14, 13, 'something of that nature. Then we need to give an honest opinion. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 178, 15, 13, 'most of the time when people air their opinion about someone else, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 178, 16, 13, 'has no purpose behind it at all. That only reveals that they are fools');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 178, 17, 13, 'themselves. If we are wise, we will keep quiet.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 178, 18, 13, 'He who goes about as a talebearer reveals secrets,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 178, 19, 13, 'But he who is trustworthy conceals a matter.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 178, 20, 13, 'Prov 11:13');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 178, 21, 13, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 178, 22, 13, 'No one who gossips can be trusted with a secret, but you can put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 178, 23, 13, 'confidence in someone who is trustworthy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 178, 24, 13, 'Prov 11:13, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 178, 25, 13, 'The vast majority of people in the world can''t be trusted with a secret');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 178, 26, 13, 'because they gossip so much. But you can put confidence in someone who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 178, 27, 13, 'is trustworthy. One mark of maturity is that when someone shares');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 178, 28, 13, 'something with us, we know how to keep it to ourselves. Another mark of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 179, 1, 13, 'a fool is that he hears something and he can''t keep it to himself. Have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 179, 2, 13, 'you ever felt like that? You feel an itch, "I must tell someone about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 179, 3, 13, 'this exciting thing I just heard." Yet someone may have told it to us in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 179, 4, 13, 'confidence. Brothers and sisters, we are to grow up to maturity and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 179, 5, 13, 'learn to keep things secret that other people tell us or that we know. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 179, 6, 13, 'man that is faithful conceals a matter. That''s one mark of a faithful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 179, 7, 13, 'man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 179, 8, 13, 'Where there is no guidance the people fall,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 179, 9, 13, 'But in abundance of counselors there is victory.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 179, 10, 13, 'Prov 11:14');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 179, 11, 13, 'This just means that when we are considering a course of action, it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 179, 12, 13, 'good for us to have small thoughts about ourselves. One mark of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 179, 13, 13, 'having small thoughts about ourselves is that we seek advice from others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 179, 14, 13, 'who have more wisdom and maturity - not necessarily just from one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 179, 15, 13, 'person, but from many. Of course, we can only get counsel from those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 179, 16, 13, 'have some wisdom and maturity themselves. It doesn''t say, "In an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 179, 17, 13, 'abundance of fools there is victory." That would bring confusion. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 179, 18, 13, 'means in the abundance of wise counselors there is safety. We can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 179, 19, 13, 'protected from a wrong path. That is why it is a privilege to be able to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 179, 20, 13, 'have fellowship with others whom we can consult. That keeps us safe, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 179, 21, 13, 'where there is no guidance, it''s easy to fall. It''s very easy, brothers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 179, 22, 13, 'and sisters, to take the fellowship and the word of God that we have in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 179, 23, 13, 'the church for granted. There are many who do not have the opportunities');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 179, 24, 13, 'for fellowship and guidance that we have. That''s something that we need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 179, 25, 13, 'to always be thankful for. Where there is no guidance people fall into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 179, 26, 13, 'various types of folly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 179, 27, 13, 'If you promise to pay a stranger''s debit, you will regret it. You are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 179, 28, 13, 'better off if you don''t get involved.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 180, 1, 13, 'Prov 11:15, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 180, 2, 13, 'We must never think that love means going to the extent of being a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 180, 3, 13, 'surety for someone in whom we have no confidence. I believe that we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 180, 4, 13, 'come into a relationship in the brotherhood where a brother becomes a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 180, 5, 13, 'part of you, like a member of your own body. But that takes time. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 180, 6, 13, 'doesn''t mean you merely sit in the same congregation. There are a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 180, 7, 13, 'people who sit in the same congregation who are not integrated with one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 180, 8, 13, 'another as members of a body. I, for one, would not become a surety for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 180, 9, 13, 'such a person even if he sits in the same church. It''s a question of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 180, 10, 13, 'being integrated with someone in the body of Christ. That was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 180, 11, 13, 'possible in the Old Testament. Only where such a relationship has formed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 180, 12, 13, 'between two brothers is it alright to commit to large sums of money.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 180, 13, 13, 'Otherwise, in most cases, it is wisest not to get into financial');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 180, 14, 13, 'relationships with strangers, promising to pay their debt or stand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 180, 15, 13, 'surety for them. This is something the book of Proverbs speaks so often');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 180, 16, 13, 'about. If you refuse someone, he may go around saying, "This brother');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 180, 17, 13, 'doesn''t have any love." Well, we could care less what he thinks about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 180, 18, 13, 'us. We are going to obey the word of God. We''re not going to be bothered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 180, 19, 13, 'about his opinion of us. If we are wise, we will be careful in this area');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 180, 20, 13, 'so that we don''t suffer later on. If we hate being surety, then we will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 180, 21, 13, 'be safe.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 180, 22, 13, 'Honor goes to kind and gracious women, mere money to cruel men.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 180, 23, 13, 'Prov 11:16, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 180, 24, 13, 'Cruel, violent men like thieves and robbers make money. But God gives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 180, 25, 13, 'honor to those who are kind and gracious. The contrast is drawn here is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 180, 26, 13, 'between a man and a woman, but the same thing applies to kind and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 180, 27, 13, 'gracious men. In God''s eyes, a woman, a sister, whether young or old, is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 180, 28, 13, 'honorable if she has become kind and gracious. In 1 Peter 3:4 it speaks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 181, 1, 13, 'about women having a meek and a quiet spirit. Take that seriously and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 181, 2, 13, 'say, "Lord, help me to be a sister like this - kind and gracious in all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 181, 3, 13, 'my words and actions." Then the honor of God will certainly come down');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 181, 4, 13, 'upon you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 181, 5, 13, 'You do yourself a favor when you are kind. If you are cruel, you only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 181, 6, 13, 'hurt yourself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 181, 7, 13, 'Prov 11:17, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 181, 8, 13, 'This is continuing on from the previous verse. All of God''s laws are for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 181, 9, 13, 'our good. When we are kind, we are not really doing the other person a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 181, 10, 13, 'favor as much as we''re doing ourselves a favor. Kind people are at rest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 181, 11, 13, 'and have more peace in their heart. Their digestive system works better,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 181, 12, 13, 'their health is better, and everything is better for a person who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 181, 13, 13, 'free from bitterness, cruelty, and anger. When you are cruel and evil,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 181, 14, 13, 'you need to see that you are hurting yourself much more than the other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 181, 15, 13, 'person. And when you love someone, you''re not really blessing him as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 181, 16, 13, 'much as you''re blessing yourself. This a wonderful verse. This is where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 181, 17, 13, 'we see the folly of all the people in the world. They don''t realize that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 181, 18, 13, 'they are harming themselves when they are cruel to other people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 181, 19, 13, 'The wicked earns deceptive wages,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 181, 20, 13, 'But he who sows righteousness gets a true reward.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 181, 21, 13, 'Prov 11:18');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 181, 22, 13, 'This is exactly what we read in Galatians 6:8 - we reap what we sow. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 181, 23, 13, 'we sow righteousness, we reap eternal life. The wicked, it says, earns');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 181, 24, 13, 'deceptive wages. What are deceptive wages? Money. Money is called a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 181, 25, 13, 'deceptive wage. That means you think it is very valuable, but there''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 181, 26, 13, 'deception in it. Jesus spoke in Mark 4:19 about the deceitfulness of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 181, 27, 13, 'riches. Now, we all know that we need money to live on this earth, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 181, 28, 13, 'for most of us, it is a struggle to make ends meet each month. There is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 182, 1, 13, 'a discipline inherent in that which is good. But whether we make a lot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 182, 2, 13, 'or a little, we must always remember that there is a deceitfulness in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 182, 3, 13, 'riches. When I get paid, I must say, "Lord, I need to use this money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 182, 4, 13, 'because I live in the world, but let me never forget there''s something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 182, 5, 13, 'deceptive about this. It can make me happy when I get a lot but it''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 182, 6, 13, 'hollow happiness. And it can make me so sad when I lose it, but there''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 182, 7, 13, 'a deception in that too." It''s a wonderful thing if our eyes are opened');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 182, 8, 13, 'to see this. We will see it clearly in eternity, but then it''ll be too');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 182, 9, 13, 'late. It''s good for us to realize this now.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 182, 10, 13, 'He who is steadfast in righteousness will attain to life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 182, 11, 13, 'And he who pursues evil will bring about his own death.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 182, 12, 13, 'Prov 11:19');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 182, 13, 13, 'This means that you can''t just start the race well. Being steadfast in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 182, 14, 13, 'righteousness means you''re righteous today, tomorrow, next week, next');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 182, 15, 13, 'month, the rest of the year, next year, and beyond. The one who endures');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 182, 16, 13, 'until the end will attain to life. There are people who can be stirred');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 182, 17, 13, 'up to righteousness by hearing a sermon, but it doesn''t last. Here it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 182, 18, 13, 'speaks about those who are steadfast in righteousness. Then it says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 182, 19, 13, '"...he who pursues evil will bring about his own death." As Romans 8:13');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 182, 20, 13, 'says, "If we live according to the flesh, we shall die." That''s exactly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 182, 21, 13, 'what this is saying.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 182, 22, 13, 'The perverse in heart are an abomination to the Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 182, 23, 13, 'But the blameless in their walk are His delight.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 182, 24, 13, 'Prov 11:20');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 182, 25, 13, 'Notice those who are an abomination to the Lord: not those who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 182, 26, 13, 'necessarily perverse on the outside. There are people who can be clean');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 182, 27, 13, 'on the outside but perverse in heart. That means their motives and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 182, 28, 13, 'intentions in life are different than what they appear to be on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 183, 1, 13, 'outside. These are an abomination to the Lord. It is the attitude in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 183, 2, 13, 'heart that matters. It is the goal and aim for which I live which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 183, 3, 13, 'determines God''s opinion about me. I''ll tell you something that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 183, 4, 13, 'encouraged my heart much and it''ll encourage you too: little mistakes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 183, 5, 13, 'that we make in our external life don''t disturb God so much. Think of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 183, 6, 13, 'your own child trying to help you in some way, and in trying to help, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 183, 7, 13, 'makes a few mistakes. If you''re a good father or mother, you won''t get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 183, 8, 13, 'upset at that child at all even if they mess up something, because the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 183, 9, 13, 'child''s intention was to help you. We have to realize that God is much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 183, 10, 13, 'more understanding than any earthly father or mother. Therefore, when we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 183, 11, 13, 'are seeking to live for him and serve him, and we slip up here and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 183, 12, 13, 'there, it doesn''t disturb him. It is the one who is perverse in heart,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 183, 13, 13, 'who has ulterior motives who is an abomination to the Lord. The person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 183, 14, 13, 'who appears religious on the outside and does so many spiritual things,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 183, 15, 13, 'but deep down his ambitions and goals are not for the glory of God, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 183, 16, 13, 'to get something for himself. If I''m seeking my own, I''m perverse in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 183, 17, 13, 'heart. If I appear to be religious on the outside but deep down I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 183, 18, 13, 'seeking my own, I''m an abomination to the Lord. If I''m not seeking my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 183, 19, 13, 'own and I say, "Lord, I want to live for your glory. I want to seek your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 183, 20, 13, 'kingdom and your will," and then I stumble and make a few mistakes, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 183, 21, 13, 'just ignores them. They don''t disturb him. Think of that. That''s why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 183, 22, 13, 'it''s so important that we''re not perverse or crooked in our heart, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 183, 23, 13, 'that we''re honest and sincere. We must say, "Lord, my only ambition and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 183, 24, 13, 'goal in life is to glorify you, to seek your kingdom, and to be pure and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 183, 25, 13, 'holy before you."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 183, 26, 13, 'Then it speaks about those who are blameless in their walk. That means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 183, 27, 13, 'they are wholehearted. The opposite of being perverse in heart is being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 183, 28, 13, 'wholehearted according to the light that we have. It''s not that we don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 184, 1, 13, 'make any mistakes. Say a five year-old child writes a letter to you on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 184, 2, 13, 'your birthday. There will be so many spelling mistakes in it, but it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 184, 3, 13, 'doesn''t disturb you because the letter is a blameless letter. It''s not a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 184, 4, 13, 'perfect letter, because there are a lot of spelling mistakes and grammar');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 184, 5, 13, 'mistakes which can be corrected. But it''s a blameless letter, because it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 184, 6, 13, 'came with such a good heart. We have to see that it''s the same with God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 184, 7, 13, 'There is a difference between being blameless and being perfect. We may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 184, 8, 13, 'not be perfect, but we can be blameless in the sense that our intentions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 184, 9, 13, 'are good.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 184, 10, 13, 'For example, sometimes we try to help one another and we''re not wise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 184, 11, 13, 'Maybe we do something foolishly. That doesn''t disturb God if our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 184, 12, 13, 'intention was really to seek the good of another person, even if the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 184, 13, 13, 'other person did not understand our intention. I''m not saying we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 184, 14, 13, 'shouldn''t learn from our mistakes. We also have to humble ourselves and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 184, 15, 13, 'say, "Lord, give me more wisdom next time." But always make sure that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 184, 16, 13, 'the intentions of your heart are for the glory of God and the good of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 184, 17, 13, 'others. Then many of our external mistakes don''t really matter that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 184, 18, 13, 'much. We are blameless, and it says here that blameless people are God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 184, 19, 13, 'delight. Zephaniah 3:17 says, "The Lord your God will rejoice over you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 184, 20, 13, 'with shouts of joy." Whom does he rejoice over? He doesn''t rejoice over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 184, 21, 13, 'religious hypocrites who come and sit in the church to get a reputation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 184, 22, 13, 'for holiness, but are actually seeking their own. He doesn''t rejoice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 184, 23, 13, 'over those who are seeking money, honor, gain for themselves in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 184, 24, 13, 'world, and want to have a religious white-wash all the time to cover it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 184, 25, 13, 'up. God''s certainly not rejoicing over such people. They are an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 184, 26, 13, 'abomination to him, and the sad thing is that most of them don''t even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 184, 27, 13, 'realize it. Most people who are seeking their own think themselves to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 184, 28, 13, 'quite spiritual, because they have a religious white-wash on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 185, 1, 13, 'outside. But we need to see that it''s those whose hearts are seeking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 185, 2, 13, 'God''s glory, who are sincere in heart and blameless in their way, who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 185, 3, 13, 'are God''s delight, even if they have a few spelling and grammar');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 185, 4, 13, 'mistakes, figuratively speaking.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 185, 5, 13, 'Assuredly, the evil man will not go unpunished,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 185, 6, 13, 'But the descendants of the righteous will be delivered.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 185, 7, 13, 'Prov 11:21');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 185, 8, 13, 'This reminds me of Numbers 32:23 which is a wonderful verse: "Be sure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 185, 9, 13, 'that your sin will find you out." That''s a verse we need to remember. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 185, 10, 13, 'other words, you may think that nobody saw the sin you committed, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 185, 11, 13, 'you can be sure that one day that sin will catch up with you. It will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 185, 12, 13, 'expose you and bring you reproach. That''s what it says here in verse 21:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 185, 13, 13, '"Assuredly!" Or like the modern slang says: "You can bet on it." You can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 185, 14, 13, 'be absolutely sure that the one who is evil will one day be found out.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 185, 15, 13, 'In contrast, it says not only will the righteous be delivered, but the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 185, 16, 13, 'descendants of the righteous will be delivered. It''s amazing how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 185, 17, 13, 'righteousness not only blesses one generation, but blesses even the next');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 185, 18, 13, 'generation. The bible says that the seed of the righteous will never beg');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 185, 19, 13, 'for bread (Psalm 37:25). If a father is a righteous man, something of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 185, 20, 13, 'that blessing overflows to the children. At least as far as earthly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 185, 21, 13, 'things go, God provides for the needs of the seed of the righteous.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 185, 22, 13, 'Righteousness and godliness have promise not only in the life to come,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 185, 23, 13, 'but also in this life (1 Timothy 4:8). In the days when inflation drives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 185, 24, 13, 'up the value of things, the best things to seek for are righteousness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 185, 25, 13, 'and the kingdom of God. There are pension benefits, family benefits,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 185, 26, 13, 'children benefits, and everything needed for those who seek the kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 185, 27, 13, 'of God and his righteousness. All things will be added unto you. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 185, 28, 13, 'descendants of the righteous will be delivered and will be blessed. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 186, 1, 13, 'other words, God will rescue the children of the godly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 186, 2, 13, 'As a ring of gold in a swine''s snout');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 186, 3, 13, 'So is a beautiful woman who lacks discretion.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 186, 4, 13, 'Prov 11:22');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 186, 5, 13, 'This is a good verse for all young people when they consider marriage');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 186, 6, 13, 'and also for young women to have a proper opinion of themselves. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 186, 7, 13, 'basic meaning of discretion is modesty. Women should have a modesty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 186, 8, 13, 'which men need not have. But it''s necessary for women. A woman who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 186, 9, 13, 'doesn''t have modesty but is very good looking in the face is really a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 186, 10, 13, 'pig. It''s modesty which changes a woman from being a pig into someone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 186, 11, 13, 'attractive to God. Her beautiful face is just like a golden ring hanging');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 186, 12, 13, 'on the nose of a pig. It''s very good for young men, when they look at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 186, 13, 13, 'the opposite sex and consider marriage, not just to see this golden ring');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 186, 14, 13, '(beautiful face) and get taken up with that. Otherwise, they''ll end up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 186, 15, 13, 'marrying a pig. Do you see the folly of this? The point of this proverb');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 186, 16, 13, 'is: you have to be a real fool to go and marry a pig just because you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 186, 17, 13, 'want to get the golden ring hanging on its nose. You''re going to live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 186, 18, 13, 'with that pig for the rest of your life. Think of the strong language');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 186, 19, 13, 'the word of God uses for a woman who''s pretty but lacks modesty. Think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 186, 20, 13, 'of the opinion that the book of Proverbs has about physical beauty! What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 186, 21, 13, 'is physical beauty without spiritual character? It is only a golden');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 186, 22, 13, 'ring. It has some value on earth, but the person is a pig - spiritually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 186, 23, 13, 'dirty.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 186, 24, 13, 'It''s good for young sisters also to remember that even if you look into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 186, 25, 13, 'the mirror and you find that the mirror on the wall tells you that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 186, 26, 13, 'you''re the fairest girl in your city, you have to say, "That''s just a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 186, 27, 13, 'golden ring." Don''t think too much of yourself because there''s a golden');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 186, 28, 13, 'ring in the mirror. It''s your character which determines whether you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 187, 1, 13, 'a pig or a child of God in God''s eyes. God values a meek and quiet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 187, 2, 13, 'spirit, a certain modesty and reserve, a discretion. In the margin, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 187, 3, 13, 'uses the word "taste." In the world they speak about having good taste');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 187, 4, 13, 'for things. People have good taste in the sarees they choose, good taste');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 187, 5, 13, 'in the way they decorate their houses, and good taste in their colors');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 187, 6, 13, 'and all that. Here it speaks about a spiritual taste that people need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 187, 7, 13, 'have, particularly women. How should a spiritual, God-fearing sister be?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 187, 8, 13, 'Have a good taste for that. If a woman doesn''t have that, she''s like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 187, 9, 13, 'golden ring in a pig''s nose. This is a very important verse for young');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 187, 10, 13, 'brothers and sisters, particularly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 187, 11, 13, 'The desire of the righteous is only good,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 187, 12, 13, 'But the expectation of the wicked is wrath.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 187, 13, 13, 'Prov 11:23');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 187, 14, 13, 'I read it like this: one mark of a righteous man is that if you open up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 187, 15, 13, 'his heart, you''ll find that his desire for every other person is only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 187, 16, 13, 'good. He desires good for everybody he knows. He may not be able to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 187, 17, 13, 'so much for them. That''s another thing. But his desire is only that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 187, 18, 13, 'something good might come to them. He''s not happy when something bad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 187, 19, 13, 'comes to someone else. That''s not a righteous man. The man who''s happy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 187, 20, 13, 'when something bad happens to someone else may not be a wicked person,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 187, 21, 13, 'but there''s some wickedness in him that needs to be cleansed out. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 187, 22, 13, 'discover based on our reaction in various situations when we hear some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 187, 23, 13, 'news about other brothers or sisters, whether it''s good or bad, whether');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 187, 24, 13, 'we really desire the very best for others. The mark of a righteous man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 187, 25, 13, 'is that he desires the very best for others. The desire of the righteous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 187, 26, 13, 'is ONLY GOOD.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 187, 27, 13, 'Then it says, "But the expectation of the wicked is wrath", which means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 187, 28, 13, 'that the wicked can only look forward to judgment. We can also look at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 188, 1, 13, 'that verse another way: the good man can look forward to blessing and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 188, 2, 13, 'happiness himself, but the wicked man can only look forward to judgment.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 188, 3, 13, 'There is one who scatters, and yet increases all the more,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 188, 4, 13, 'And there is one who withholds what is justly due, and yet it results');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 188, 5, 13, 'only in want.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 188, 6, 13, 'The generous man will be prosperous,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 188, 7, 13, 'And he who waters will himself be watered.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 188, 8, 13, 'Prov 11:24-25');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 188, 9, 13, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 188, 10, 13, 'It is possible to give away and become richer! It is also possible to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 188, 11, 13, 'hold on too tightly and lose everything. Yes, the liberal man shall be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 188, 12, 13, 'rich! By watering others, he waters himself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 188, 13, 13, 'Prov 11:24-25, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 188, 14, 13, 'Verses 24 and 25 are wonderful. They really teach the same thing. These');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 188, 15, 13, 'are some of those important verses in Proverbs that we all need to know.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 188, 16, 13, 'One who is concerned about the needs of others and is not stingy, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 188, 17, 13, 'generous toward God and toward his children, will never lack in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 188, 18, 13, 'life. When it speaks about scattering, the picture is of a sower who has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 188, 19, 13, 'a whole bag of seed. The seed represents all our material resources such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 188, 20, 13, 'as money and other things that we have that God has given us. I can just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 188, 21, 13, 'store up all that for myself, but at harvest time, what do I have? Just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 188, 22, 13, 'some seed. Some of it has become rotten, some of it has been eaten by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 188, 23, 13, 'insects - it''s much less than what I started out with one year ago. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 188, 24, 13, 'bag has become quite small. But another person who had the same size bag');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 188, 25, 13, 'didn''t just store it up in his house. He scattered it! Then at harvest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 188, 26, 13, 'time he collects, and he has a hundred bags. That''s the picture here.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 188, 27, 13, 'It''s also the picture used in 2 Corinthians 9 where it says if we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 188, 28, 13, 'liberal and open-handed with what God gives us, God will be open-handed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 189, 1, 13, 'with us. Even though you think you''re giving, you''re actually going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 189, 2, 13, 'end up having more. But if you are stingy, you end up only in want.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 189, 3, 13, 'When it says, "One who withholds what is justly due," it''s speaking of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 189, 4, 13, 'one who does not pay his debts or taxes. I heard something about a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 189, 5, 13, 'brother in our church. He was speaking about rejoicing in doing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 189, 6, 13, 'righteousness and he said, "I rejoice to fill out an income tax form.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 189, 7, 13, 'It''s a great delight for me to fill it out exactly and correctly and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 189, 8, 13, 'pay my taxes. It''s not something I complain and grumble about. It''s joy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 189, 9, 13, 'for me to do it." That is what it means to rejoice in doing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 189, 10, 13, 'righteousness - to pay what is justly, righteously due to someone else.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 189, 11, 13, 'Or if I borrowed something from someone and it righteously belongs to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 189, 12, 13, 'him, I don''t just sit on it lazily. Or it could be that God demands that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 189, 13, 13, 'I should share something that I have with someone. That is also due to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 189, 14, 13, 'that person and I should give it. If I don''t do these things, I can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 189, 15, 13, 'in want myself. This is one reason why some believers are in want.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 189, 16, 13, 'The last part means if we take care to bless others, God will take care');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 189, 17, 13, 'to bless us. And it''s not necessarily only money that it''s talking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 189, 18, 13, 'about. Sometimes our mind can just think in terms of money. Think of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 189, 19, 13, 'being a blessing in terms of words and goodness, and God will water us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 189, 20, 13, 'in return. What a tremendous thing. Brothers and sisters, just go around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 189, 21, 13, 'encouraging others and see how much God encourages you. If you feel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 189, 22, 13, 'condemned so much, just ask yourself whether you''re going around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 189, 23, 13, 'condemning others yourself. Stop all that condemning of others and start');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 189, 24, 13, 'encouraging them and see how much God encourages you. If you water');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 189, 25, 13, 'others, the same water will fall back on your head from God one day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 189, 26, 13, 'That''s a spiritual law. So it''s good to water others. To water others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 189, 27, 13, 'means that you find a tree that''s dry and pour some water on it. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 189, 28, 13, 'encouragement. If you see a brother or sister who''s depressed and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 190, 1, 13, 'gloomy, just give a word of encouragement, and God will water you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 190, 2, 13, 'He who withholds grain, the people will curse him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 190, 3, 13, 'But blessing will be on the head of him who sells it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 190, 4, 13, 'Prov 11:26');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 190, 5, 13, 'This is speaking of when there is a shortage of something and you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 190, 6, 13, 'plenty of it and you hold on to it. In those days they were in business');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 190, 7, 13, 'and they would hold on to grain till the prices went up. "Oh, there''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 190, 8, 13, 'shortage of grain. Wonderful!" says the man who has grain in his house.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 190, 9, 13, '"I''ll wait till it gets a little more scarce and the prices go up, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 190, 10, 13, 'then I''ll make my money." Such a man can never be a believer. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 190, 11, 13, 'impossible for a man with such an attitude to be a child of God. People');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 190, 12, 13, 'are in such terrific need, and he''s hanging on to something which is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 190, 13, 13, 'necessary for their living just because he wants to make more money. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 190, 14, 13, 'may not be selling grain, but we need to take this verse and apply it to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 190, 15, 13, 'our own professions and our own situations to see whether we have such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 190, 16, 13, 'selfishness in our attitudes. We have something which we are not using');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 190, 17, 13, 'and someone else needs it, and we just sit on it. The person''s probably');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 190, 18, 13, 'desperately in need of it and I just hang on to it. We can be so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 190, 19, 13, 'selfish. And when people know someone is doing this, they''ll curse such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 190, 20, 13, 'a man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 190, 21, 13, 'Then it says that blessing will be on the head of him who sells it. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 190, 22, 13, 'need to look at this carefully. He doesn''t have to give it away for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 190, 23, 13, 'free. The man may not be rich enough to say, "Alright. Here you are.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 190, 24, 13, 'Take it all." He sells it, but he sells it at a reasonable price. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 190, 25, 13, 'doesn''t sell it in order to make a lot of money for himself. No. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 190, 26, 13, 'will be a blessing on him if he sells it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 190, 27, 13, 'He who diligently seeks good seeks favor,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 190, 28, 13, 'But he who seeks evil, evil will come to him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 191, 1, 13, 'Prov 11:27');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 191, 2, 13, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 191, 3, 13, 'If you search for good, you will find God''s favor; if you search for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 191, 4, 13, 'evil, you will find his curse.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 191, 5, 13, 'Prov 11:27, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 191, 6, 13, 'This means if you''re always seeking how you can do good in your own life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 191, 7, 13, 'and toward other people, God''s blessing will be on your life. But if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 191, 8, 13, 'search for evil, you will find his curse. That''s clear.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 191, 9, 13, 'Those who depend on their wealth will fall like the leaves of autumn,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 191, 10, 13, 'but the righteous will prosper like the leaves of summer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 191, 11, 13, 'Prov 11:28, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 191, 12, 13, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 191, 13, 13, 'Trust in your money and down you go! Trust in God and flourish as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 191, 14, 13, 'tree!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 191, 15, 13, 'Prov 11:28, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 191, 16, 13, 'Jesus spoke of two masters: money and God. If you trust in money, you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 191, 17, 13, 'bound to go down. Money was never given to be trusted in or loved or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 191, 18, 13, 'hoarded. Money was given to be used, never to be loved or depended upon.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 191, 19, 13, 'That''s the mistake of a lot of people in the world. The opposite of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 191, 20, 13, 'trusting in money is to trust in God. In Proverbs 3 we read, "Don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 191, 21, 13, 'trust in your own understanding, but trust in the Lord." Here it says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 191, 22, 13, '"Don''t trust in money, but trust in the Lord." The two things we should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 191, 23, 13, 'not trust in are our own cleverness and money. We trust in God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 191, 24, 13, 'The fool who provokes his family to anger and resentment will finally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 191, 25, 13, 'have nothing worthwhile left. He shall be the servant of a wiser man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 191, 26, 13, 'Prov 11:29, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 191, 27, 13, 'This refers to a man who acts like a big dictator in his house, always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 191, 28, 13, 'provoking his wife and children to anger and resentment, making demands');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 192, 1, 13, 'on them and shouting at them. Finally he won''t have a home left. He''ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 192, 2, 13, 'have nothing worthwhile left. He''ll be the servant of a wiser man. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 192, 3, 13, 'wise man is one who knows how to bless his house.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 192, 4, 13, 'The fruit of the righteous is a tree of life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 192, 5, 13, 'And he who is wise wins souls.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 192, 6, 13, 'Prov 11:30');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 192, 7, 13, 'It''s amazing that we read of the tree of life a number of times in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 192, 8, 13, 'Proverbs - the same tree of life that we read of in Genesis. It says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 192, 9, 13, 'here that the fruit that comes forth from the life of one righteous man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 192, 10, 13, 'can be like a tree of life for other people. Think of that challenge: we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 192, 11, 13, 'can be like a tree of life to other people. And it says a wise person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 192, 12, 13, 'wins souls or people. He is a blessing to other people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 192, 13, 13, 'If the righteous will be rewarded in the earth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 192, 14, 13, 'How much more the wicked and the sinner!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 192, 15, 13, 'Prov 11:31');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 192, 16, 13, 'I believe this is the verse that Peter quotes in 1 Peter 4:18, where it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 192, 17, 13, 'says, "If it is with difficulty that the righteous is saved, what will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 192, 18, 13, 'become of the godless and the sinner?" The meaning is this: that even a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 192, 19, 13, 'righteous person, when he does something wrong, is disciplined by God. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 192, 20, 13, 'righteous man! Then, it says, you can imagine what''s going to be the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 192, 21, 13, 'fate of the wicked and the sinner, finally. Think of Moses. He was such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 192, 22, 13, 'a righteous man and yet once he smote the rock instead of speaking to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 192, 23, 13, 'the rock, and God punished him so severely, saying, "You''re not to enter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 192, 24, 13, 'the land of Canaan." We get examples in the scripture of how strictly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 192, 25, 13, 'God dealt with righteous people. And here he says you can get a picture');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 192, 26, 13, 'of how severe the judgment will be on the ungodly and the sinner in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 192, 27, 13, 'final day. It doesn''t appear on the earth now. They appear to be having');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 192, 28, 13, 'a cushy time. But if even the righteous get a reward on this earth, how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 193, 1, 13, 'much more the wicked and the sinner.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 193, 2, 13, 'I can show you another verse before we move on: 1 Timothy 5:24-25 says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 193, 3, 13, '"The sins of some men are quite evident, going before them to judgment.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 193, 4, 13, 'For others, their sins follow after. Likewise also, deeds that are good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 193, 5, 13, 'are quite evident, and those which are otherwise cannot be concealed."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 193, 6, 13, 'What this means is there are some people who are such obvious sinners');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 193, 7, 13, 'that you know that they are going to judgment. But there are other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 193, 8, 13, 'people who appear to be so religious. Their sins are all concealed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 193, 9, 13, 'inside, but one day they''ll be exposed. Then it says that in the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 193, 10, 13, 'way, there are some people who are so obviously good that you know that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 193, 11, 13, 'God has such a fantastic reward lined up for them. Equally, there are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 193, 12, 13, 'some people whose goodness you cannot see, because most of the things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 193, 13, 13, 'they do are in secret. We''re going to get a surprise when we see how God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 193, 14, 13, 'rewards them too. So it says here there are people whose goodness and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 193, 15, 13, 'evil can be hidden, and God will reward each person according to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 193, 16, 13, 'deeds done in his body.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 193, 17, 14, 'Chapter 12 Chapter 12');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 193, 18, 14, 'Whoever loves discipline loves knowledge,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 193, 19, 14, 'But he who hates reproof is stupid.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 193, 20, 14, 'Prov 12:1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 193, 21, 14, 'This is one of the things that we''ve looked at before: that in order to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 193, 22, 14, 'become wise God has to discipline us. There is no way to get wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 193, 23, 14, 'apart from discipline. When God disciplines you, and you love it (not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 193, 24, 14, 'just submit to it but love it) and say, "Thank you, Lord. I accept');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 193, 25, 14, 'that," then you''re really loving wisdom. And I just want to say this,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 193, 26, 14, 'brothers and sisters: a number of times in the book of Proverbs, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 193, 27, 14, 'speaks about loving correction. And if you hate correction, it says in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 193, 28, 14, 'the King James Version that you are brutish. Brutish means you are like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 194, 1, 14, 'an animal. That''s something. You find that children so often get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 194, 2, 14, 'offended when they are corrected. That animal nature is there. That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 194, 3, 14, 'something we need to grow out of quickly. Those of us who are parents');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 194, 4, 14, 'know that when we correct our children, it is for their good, but they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 194, 5, 14, 'often don''t understand it. Very often it''s exactly the same with us who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 194, 6, 14, 'are grown up. When we hear a word of correction - it may be from God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 194, 7, 14, 'directly through his Spirit, it may be from some brother in the meeting,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 194, 8, 14, 'or it may be directly from someone older than us - then I can think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 194, 9, 14, 'about it, and if I don''t like it very much, I get a little offended and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 194, 10, 14, 'a little hurt inside. What does that show? That shows that I''m not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 194, 11, 14, 'really interested in wisdom. If I were interested in wisdom, I would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 194, 12, 14, 'say, "Thank you for that. Lord, thank you for what you spoke to me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 194, 13, 14, 'through that brother or sister. That''s something I really need to take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 194, 14, 14, 'heed to."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 194, 15, 14, 'I heard about one brother in Norway who spoke in a conference. He said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 194, 16, 14, '"My wife told me one day: ''You seek your own right up to your ears.''"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 194, 17, 14, 'That means he was sunk in seeking his own. That is quite a strong thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 194, 18, 14, 'to hear from your wife. Of course, she knows you better than anybody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 194, 19, 14, 'else. So he thought to himself, "She must be right that I''ve been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 194, 20, 14, 'seeking my own in a lot of things," and he took it to heart. And he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 194, 21, 14, 'began judging himself and cleansing himself from it. That''s really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 194, 22, 14, 'something. Sometimes our wives tell us the truth. Don''t think, "Oh,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 194, 23, 14, 'she''s just angry with me." Usually it''s when she''s angry that she tells');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 194, 24, 14, 'you the truth. When she''s not angry, she may just say nice things to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 194, 25, 14, 'you. So hear it, hear it. There''s a word that perhaps you need that will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 194, 26, 14, 'lead you to wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 194, 27, 14, 'A good man will obtain favor from the Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 194, 28, 14, 'But He will condemn a man who devises evil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 195, 1, 14, 'Prov 12:2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 195, 2, 14, 'This is something that we considered earlier that it is the intention of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 195, 3, 14, 'the heart that God sees. If that basic intention of the heart is good,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 195, 4, 14, 'that man will obtain favor from the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 195, 5, 14, 'A man will not be established by wickedness,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 195, 6, 14, 'But the root of the righteous will not be moved.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 195, 7, 14, 'Prov 12:3');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 195, 8, 14, 'Here again it speaks about the root - this thing that we see much of in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 195, 9, 14, 'the New Testament. The heart. The root. When you get into the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 195, 10, 14, 'Testament, it''s only in the book of Proverbs where you find that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 195, 11, 14, 'emphasis coming out. That''s why I said the book of Proverbs has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 195, 12, 14, 'something of a New Covenant taste and spirit in it. "The root of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 195, 13, 14, 'righteous..." Check your roots, because your security and your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 195, 14, 14, 'steadfastness are dependent on righteousness in the roots. The root of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 195, 15, 14, 'the righteous will be unshaken.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 195, 16, 14, 'An excellent wife is the crown of her husband,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 195, 17, 14, 'But she who shames him is like rottenness in his bones.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 195, 18, 14, 'Prov 12:4');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 195, 19, 14, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 195, 20, 14, 'A good wife is her husband''s pride and joy; but a wife who brings shame');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 195, 21, 14, 'on her husband is like a cancer in his bones.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 195, 22, 14, 'Prov 12:4, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 195, 23, 14, 'This excellent wife (or virtuous woman) is described later on in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 195, 24, 14, 'Proverbs 31. We can define a virtuous woman as one who has the virtues');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 195, 25, 14, 'of Christ, or is increasingly having them. Nobody has them in full, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 195, 26, 14, 'the virtuous woman is seeking them more and more, realizing her own lack');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 195, 27, 14, 'in poverty of spirit. Do you know what such a virtuous woman really is?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 195, 28, 14, 'She becomes the crown for her husband. That means it''s a woman who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 196, 1, 14, 'ultimately makes a man a king in his home. That''s a tremendous challenge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 196, 2, 14, 'to all wives. You can make your husband a king if you''re a virtuous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 196, 3, 14, 'woman. And if your husband is like a slave and not a king, it''s because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 196, 4, 14, 'you''re not a virtuous woman. You can be a crown to your husband. And the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 196, 5, 14, 'word used for ''husband'' here in the original Hebrew is the word for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 196, 6, 14, '''master''. The virtuous woman is the crown for her master husband. She is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 196, 7, 14, 'one who recognizes that her husband is her master. I wonder if you wives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 196, 8, 14, 'realize that God''s word calls you to recognize your husband as your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 196, 9, 14, 'master, and there''s no disgrace there. Jesus was a servant, and that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 196, 10, 14, 'the example that all wives have to follow. Your husband is your master.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 196, 11, 14, 'In the GNT it speaks about a wife who brings shame on her husband by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 196, 12, 14, 'something she does. Maybe your husband is a god-fearing, upright,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 196, 13, 14, 'righteous man, and the way you behave and conduct yourself brings shame');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 196, 14, 14, 'on your husband. It says that a wife who brings shame on her husband is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 196, 15, 14, 'like a cancer in his bones. Cancer inside the bones of your husband.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 196, 16, 14, 'Think of that. The opposite of that is to be marrow inside the bones of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 196, 17, 14, 'your husband. And I want to tell you something about marrow: if we don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 196, 18, 14, 'have marrow inside our bones, do you know that we can''t live? Do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 196, 19, 14, 'know that the blood cells are produced in the marrow within the bones?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 196, 20, 14, 'That''s where the blood cells are produced that keep us living. When a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 196, 21, 14, 'person gets cancer inside his bones, you can write him off. He can''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 196, 22, 14, 'defend himself against germs. And a woman can be like that to her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 196, 23, 14, 'husband, it says - like cancer inside his bones. It can be by the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 196, 24, 14, 'she treats him, or by the way she speaks of him in the presence of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 196, 25, 14, 'children or in some other situation. Like a cancer. And the poor man''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 196, 26, 14, 'resistance to spiritual disease weakens. Instead of that, think that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 196, 27, 14, 'can be a wife who''s like marrow, strengthening your husband and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 196, 28, 14, 'ultimately strengthening the whole home, including yourself. There are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 197, 1, 14, 'many exhortations to wives in the book of Proverbs. It''s good to take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 197, 2, 14, 'these seriously.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 197, 3, 14, 'A good man''s mind is filled with honest thoughts. An evil man''s mind is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 197, 4, 14, 'crammed with lies.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 197, 5, 14, 'Prov 12:5, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 197, 6, 14, 'The words of the wicked lie in wait for blood,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 197, 7, 14, 'But the mouth of the upright will deliver them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 197, 8, 14, 'The wicked are overthrown and are no more,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 197, 9, 14, 'But the house of the righteous will stand.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 197, 10, 14, 'Prov 12:6-7');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 197, 11, 14, 'In verses 5, 6, and 7 we see something very interesting. Verse 5 speaks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 197, 12, 14, 'about thoughts, verse 6 speaks about words, and verse 7 speaks of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 197, 13, 14, 'result of those thoughts and words.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 197, 14, 14, 'Here again in verse 5 you find an emphasis on the inner life - the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 197, 15, 14, 'thoughts we think. Our thoughts determine whether we are good or bad:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 197, 16, 14, '"An evil man''s mind is crammed with lies." And you find out particularly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 197, 17, 14, 'when you''re in a difficult situation and you wonder what the senior');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 197, 18, 14, 'officer in the office or factory is going to ask. You''re thinking, "What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 197, 19, 14, 'shall I say? Shall I say it like this or say it like that?" And there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 197, 20, 14, 'you see the possibility of lies coming in. Whereas a good man says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 197, 21, 14, '"Well, I''ve just got to speak the truth. That''s all." There''s no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 197, 22, 14, 'question of, "Shall I say this or shall I say that?" And yet we know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 197, 23, 14, 'that the natural tendency in our flesh is to think and scheme and say a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 197, 24, 14, 'lot of white lies in order to escape some difficult situation. "An evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 197, 25, 14, 'man''s mind is crammed with lies."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 197, 26, 14, 'Now verse 6 speaks about words. Our thoughts lead to words. What does it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 197, 27, 14, 'mean to lie in wait for blood? In Luke 20:20-21, it speaks about how the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 197, 28, 14, 'scribes and chief priests watched Jesus and sent spies who pretended to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 198, 1, 14, 'be righteous in order that they might catch him in some statement.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 198, 2, 14, 'That''s it. The words of the wicked are lying in wait for blood. It says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 198, 3, 14, 'it was "in order to catch him in some statement, so as to deliver him up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 198, 4, 14, 'to the rule and the authority of the governor. And they questioned him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 198, 5, 14, 'saying, ''Teacher, we know that you speak and teach correctly and that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 198, 6, 14, 'you are not partial to any, but teach the way of God in truth.''" That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 198, 7, 14, 'happened to me some years ago when the local leader of Operation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 198, 8, 14, 'Mobilisation brought one of the OM people to my house, pretending to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 198, 9, 14, 'want to know about the New and Living Way and all that. All the time he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 198, 10, 14, 'was taking notes. Later on, it became evident that his only intention');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 198, 11, 14, 'was to warn everybody in OM against this doctrine. Well, he could have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 198, 12, 14, 'been honest about it. I don''t believe the blessing of God can ever be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 198, 13, 14, 'upon someone who is deceptive. I mean even if you disagree with someone,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 198, 14, 14, 'be honest. That deception itself shows that you''re an agent of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 198, 15, 14, 'devil, not an agent of God. An agent of God will never be deceptive. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 198, 16, 14, 'may not agree with some doctrine. That''s fine. But there will be no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 198, 17, 14, 'deception, pretending to be righteous and wanting to know the truth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 198, 18, 14, 'while actually spying with some other motive. That''s a serious thing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 198, 19, 14, 'Then it says that the mouth of the upright will deliver him. That means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 198, 20, 14, 'that the words of the upright will justify him. Jesus said, "By your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 198, 21, 14, 'words you''ll be justified, and by your words you''ll be condemned in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 198, 22, 14, 'final day."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 198, 23, 14, 'The final result of our thoughts and words is in verse 7: "The wicked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 198, 24, 14, 'are overthrown..." That''s like the foolish man who built his house on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 198, 25, 14, 'the sand. His thoughts were foolish, his words were foolish, and his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 198, 26, 14, 'house was finally overthrown. "But the house of the righteous will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 198, 27, 14, 'stand." That''s the house that the wise man built on the rock - the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 198, 28, 14, 'hidden life. The foundation. The thoughts and the words. That house will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 199, 1, 14, 'stand. So we are never to become the scheming type of people, speaking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 199, 2, 14, 'words to get some information out of people or to put them in some trap.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 199, 3, 14, 'No. We have to be upright. No crookedness in our words. No scheming and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 199, 4, 14, 'deception.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 199, 5, 14, 'A man will be praised according to his insight,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 199, 6, 14, 'But one of perverse mind will be despised.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 199, 7, 14, 'Prov 12:8');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 199, 8, 14, 'That''s a good exhortation, brothers and sisters. Let me put it like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 199, 9, 14, 'this: gain the confidence of other people. Live in such a way, speak in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 199, 10, 14, 'such a way, conduct yourself in such a way that people will begin to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 199, 11, 14, 'have confidence in you because of your wisdom and your insight. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 199, 12, 14, 'find that brothers and sisters don''t have confidence in you - well,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 199, 13, 14, 'that''s not a good thing. It''s usually an indication of something in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 199, 14, 14, 'own character. Because I believe if you''re godly, you may be despised');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 199, 15, 14, 'out there by carnal Christianity, but the brothers and sisters in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 199, 16, 14, 'church will be able to recognize one who is wise. They are able to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 199, 17, 14, 'discern one who is humble, one who has insight. So it''s good,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 199, 18, 14, 'particularly for young people, to really conduct ourselves in such a way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 199, 19, 14, 'that over a period of years, people begin to have confidence in us. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 199, 20, 14, 'is a great goal that you should have in mind, so that you can help');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 199, 21, 14, 'others. It''s not so that we can have honor, but so that we can help');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 199, 22, 14, 'others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 199, 23, 14, 'It is better to get your hands dirty-and eat, than to be too proud to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 199, 24, 14, 'work-and starve.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 199, 25, 14, 'Prov 12:9, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 199, 26, 14, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 199, 27, 14, 'It is better to be an ordinary person working for a living than to play');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 199, 28, 14, 'the part of someone great but go hungry.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 200, 1, 14, 'Prov 12:9, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 200, 2, 14, 'In other words, don''t stand on all your dignity and then not have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 200, 3, 14, 'anything to eat. You might as well do some dirty job and earn a living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 200, 4, 14, 'and support yourself than stand on all this false dignity and prestige.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 200, 5, 14, 'You find a lot of that in the world: people who try to pretend to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 200, 6, 14, 'very great, but really there''s a lack in their lives. It''s better to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 200, 7, 14, 'an ordinary man willing to do dirty jobs in order to earn a living than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 200, 8, 14, 'to stand on prestige.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 200, 9, 14, 'A righteous man has regard for the life of his animal,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 200, 10, 14, 'But even the compassion of the wicked is cruel.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 200, 11, 14, 'Prov 12:10');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 200, 12, 14, 'What does it mean to have regard for an animal? You see, we don''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 200, 13, 14, 'animals in our houses nowadays, but in those days every home had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 200, 14, 14, 'animals. They had sheep, cows, donkeys to carry the load, and various');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 200, 15, 14, 'other animals. Every house needed them. And how would the donkey know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 200, 16, 14, 'whether his master was righteous or unrighteous? By just one thing: Does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 200, 17, 14, 'he have any concern for me? You know, you can keep on loading all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 200, 18, 14, 'luggage on top of that poor donkey, but it says a righteous man has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 200, 19, 14, 'concern even for his animals. That''s something. We may think that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 200, 20, 14, 'animals have no souls, so we can throw stones at them and kick them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 200, 21, 14, 'particularly if they''re weaker than us. That''s not good. It''s alright to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 200, 22, 14, 'defend yourself from some dog that is coming to bite you, but otherwise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 200, 23, 14, 'it''s not good to be cruel. You can see cruelty even in the way a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 200, 24, 14, 'treats animals. That''s the point of this verse. He has regard for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 200, 25, 14, 'safety and the needs of his animals.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 200, 26, 14, 'Now, we can say, "We don''t have animals today." Well, what do we have?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 200, 27, 14, 'We have servants who work in our homes. And the righteous man has a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 200, 28, 14, 'concern for the needs and the safety of the one who serves him. But the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 201, 1, 14, 'wicked person, when he shows a little compassion, there''s cruelty even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 201, 2, 14, 'in that compassion. That''s what it says here. So, we can apply this to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 201, 3, 14, 'our own situations.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 201, 4, 14, 'A hard-working farmer has plenty to eat, but it is stupid to waste time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 201, 5, 14, 'on useless projects.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 201, 6, 14, 'Prov 12:11');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 201, 7, 14, 'There''s a lot that the word of God speaks regarding hard work and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 201, 8, 14, 'diligence. We can apply that to the Christian life, that the one who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 201, 9, 14, 'a hard-working farmer as Paul tells Timothy, gets a good harvest and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 201, 10, 14, 'gets it quickly. And it''s righteous of God to do that for him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 201, 11, 14, 'Crooks are jealous of each other''s loot, while good men long to help');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 201, 12, 14, 'each other.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 201, 13, 14, 'Prov 12:12, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 201, 14, 14, 'You know how crooks are. If you have two bunches of thieves, one bunch');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 201, 15, 14, 'is jealous that the other bunch got more loot. But righteous people are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 201, 16, 14, 'not like that. We can put it like this: that a wicked man - a robber -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 201, 17, 14, 'what does he desire? He desires other peoples'' things. We may not be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 201, 18, 14, 'robbers, but we may desire other peoples'' things too. We can go into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 201, 19, 14, 'somebody''s house and desire his things. We''re not so bad that we''ll rob');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 201, 20, 14, 'it. We''re just one step short of that. But we''re basically facing in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 201, 21, 14, 'same direction as that robber. The only thing is that we don''t take the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 201, 22, 14, 'next step of actually robbing it. But it''s really the same desire in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 201, 23, 14, 'heart. A wicked man desires other peoples'' things, but a righteous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 201, 24, 14, 'person - a good man - longs to help others. That''s the opposite. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 201, 25, 14, 'doesn''t think in terms of what he can get from another person, but in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 201, 26, 14, 'terms of what he can give to help him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 201, 27, 14, 'Lies will get any man into trouble, but honesty is its own defense.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 201, 28, 14, 'Telling the truth gives a man great satisfaction, and hard work returns');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 202, 1, 14, 'many blessings to him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 202, 2, 14, 'Prov 12:13-14, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 202, 3, 14, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 202, 4, 14, 'The wicked are trapped by their own words, but honest people get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 202, 5, 14, 'themselves out of trouble. Your reward depends on what you say and what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 202, 6, 14, 'you do; you will get what you deserve.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 202, 7, 14, 'Prov 12:13-14, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 202, 8, 14, 'This is also a good verse for us to bear in mind. Once you tell a lie,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 202, 9, 14, 'you get yourself into so many difficulties that you have to tell another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 202, 10, 14, 'lie to cover the first one, and it goes on and on. This is all practical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 202, 11, 14, 'advice for daily life. Whereas if you''re honest, even if you get into a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 202, 12, 14, 'little difficulty, that is its own defense. Finally, the truth will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 202, 13, 14, 'protect you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 202, 14, 14, 'Verse 14 relates to the same thing. Notice the emphasis again on our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 202, 15, 14, 'words and on our actions. What you say and what you do will determine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 202, 16, 14, 'your reward. You will get what you deserve.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 202, 17, 14, 'Stupid people always think they are right. Wise people listen to advice.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 202, 18, 14, 'Prov 12:15, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 202, 19, 14, 'It''s a mark of stupidity to think that we are always right. And one mark');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 202, 20, 14, 'of a wise man is (we can put it like this) that he knows he has certain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 202, 21, 14, 'blind spots. One mark of wisdom will be that I realize that there are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 202, 22, 14, 'certain areas of my life where I''m not right, but I''m unaware of them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 202, 23, 14, 'That''s a mark of wisdom! Whereas a stupid person says, "No, I am right');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 202, 24, 14, 'in every area." A wise man is humble. He realizes that even when his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 202, 25, 14, 'intentions are right, and to the best of his knowledge he''s doing right,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 202, 26, 14, 'there are still a whole lot of areas in his life where he may not be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 202, 27, 14, 'right. And that''s why he''s glad to receive correction from somebody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 202, 28, 14, 'else.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 203, 1, 14, 'The vexation of a fool is known at once,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 203, 2, 14, 'but the prudent ignores an insult.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 203, 3, 14, 'Prov 12:16, ESV');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 203, 4, 14, 'He who speaks truth tells what is right,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 203, 5, 14, 'But a false witness, deceit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 203, 6, 14, 'Prov 12:17');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 203, 7, 14, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 203, 8, 14, 'A good man is known by his truthfulness; a false man by deceit and lies.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 203, 9, 14, 'Prov 12:17, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 203, 10, 14, 'In the margin of the New American Standard Bible it says, "He who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 203, 11, 14, 'breathes truth." In other words, truth has become so much a part of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 203, 12, 14, 'person''s life that he''s breathing it. It''s wonderful. Once upon a time,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 203, 13, 14, 'we breathed lies. Our whole life was full of lies. Think that we can so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 203, 14, 14, 'cleanse ourselves that not only our words are truth, but we breathe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 203, 15, 14, 'truth. Then we''ll be in the category of the 144,000 in Revelation 14,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 203, 16, 14, 'who follow the lamb wherever he goes, and no guile is found in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 203, 17, 14, 'mouths because they cleansed themselves. There''s a tremendous lot that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 203, 18, 14, 'the word of God speaks about being truthful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 203, 19, 14, 'Some people like to make cutting remarks, but the words of the wise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 203, 20, 14, 'soothe and heal.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 203, 21, 14, 'Prov 12:18, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 203, 22, 14, 'Here''s another mark of a foolish man: he likes to say something cutting,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 203, 23, 14, 'something that will wound. He knows that it''s going to wound, and he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 203, 24, 14, 'says it in order to wound. He says it in a sharp way. There may be truth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 203, 25, 14, 'in it, but he says it in a sharp way. It''s said with the intention of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 203, 26, 14, 'hurting. That shows he''s a fool. But the words of the wise, they soothe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 203, 27, 14, 'and heal. They don''t keep quiet. They speak. But they speak in a way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 203, 28, 14, 'that is soothing and healing. Here''s another contrast between the wise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 204, 1, 14, 'and the wicked. It''s very interesting to see in the book of Proverbs a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 204, 2, 14, 'tremendous contrast in the words of the wise and the wicked. Words.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 204, 3, 14, 'Words determine whether we are wise or whether we are foolish.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 204, 4, 14, 'Truth stands the test of time; lies are soon exposed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 204, 5, 14, 'Prov 12:19, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 204, 6, 14, 'It''s always best to speak the truth, because finally the truth will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 204, 7, 14, 'proven - if not here, finally. It stands the test of time. But lies are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 204, 8, 14, 'soon exposed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 204, 9, 14, 'Deceit fills hearts that are plotting for evil; joy fills hearts that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 204, 10, 14, 'are planning for good!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 204, 11, 14, 'Prov 12:20, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 204, 12, 14, 'This is like how God told Cain, "If your intention is evil, then it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 204, 13, 14, 'going to be bad with you. But if you intend good, then your face won''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 204, 14, 14, 'be cast down." That''s a good verse: that if our hearts are planning for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 204, 15, 14, 'good, then there will be joy in our faces and our faces will be lifted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 204, 16, 14, 'up. But if our hearts are planning something that is not good, then we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 204, 17, 14, 'are deceptive.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 204, 18, 14, 'No real harm befalls the good, but there is constant trouble for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 204, 19, 14, 'wicked.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 204, 20, 14, 'Prov 12:21, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 204, 21, 14, 'Here''s a wonderful verse. It''s good for us to remember this: No real');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 204, 22, 14, 'harm can ever come to a righteous person. Never. Even that which appears');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 204, 23, 14, 'to be harmful is not really harmful. God makes it work for good to those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 204, 24, 14, 'who love him, who are called according to his purpose (Romans 8:28).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 204, 25, 14, 'Lying lips are an abomination to the Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 204, 26, 14, 'But those who deal faithfully are his delight.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 204, 27, 14, 'Prov 12:22');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 204, 28, 14, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 205, 1, 14, 'God delights in those who keep their promises and abhors those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 205, 2, 14, 'don''t.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 205, 3, 14, 'Prov 12:22, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 205, 4, 14, 'The book of Proverbs has a great deal to speak about those who tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 205, 5, 14, 'lies. In Revelation 21:8, it says that the liars will find their place');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 205, 6, 14, 'in the lake of fire. God places a great importance on truthfulness in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 205, 7, 14, 'our speech. Just think of that latter part of this verse, how you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 205, 8, 14, 'bring delight to the heart of God if you speak faithfully. It''s also a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 205, 9, 14, 'very serious thing to give a promise to someone, as it says in The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 205, 10, 14, 'Living Bible. God delights in those who keep their promises, those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 205, 11, 14, 'keep their word. Unless of course we find out the words that we''ve given');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 205, 12, 14, 'to a person are contrary to what we see in God''s word. Then we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 205, 13, 14, 'every right to break them. But if they do not break some teaching of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 205, 14, 14, 'God''s word, it is the will of God that we keep our word which we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 205, 15, 14, 'given to others. He delights in such people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 205, 16, 14, 'Smart people keep quiet about what they know, but stupid people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 205, 17, 14, 'advertise their ignorance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 205, 18, 14, 'Prov 12:23, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 205, 19, 14, 'This just means that a wise person does not display his knowledge. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 205, 20, 14, 'we have knowledge, we want to display it. Say in a group bible study, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 205, 21, 14, 'want to display our knowledge. That''s usually the indication of a fool.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 205, 22, 14, 'The wise person knows how to share it without showing off his knowledge.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 205, 23, 14, 'A person who wants to show off even bible knowledge is actually a fool.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 205, 24, 14, 'You see that particularly in new believers. They get a little bite of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 205, 25, 14, 'bible knowledge and they''re always trying to show it off somewhere or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 205, 26, 14, 'the other. It just goes to show they''re still fools. Now, that''s alright');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 205, 27, 14, 'when we begin, but we should grow out of that stage of always wanting to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 205, 28, 14, 'display our knowledge. Wise people keep quiet. They share when there''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 206, 1, 14, 'necessity for it, but never to show other people how much they know of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 206, 2, 14, 'the scriptures or how clever they are.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 206, 3, 14, 'Work hard and become a leader; be lazy and never succeed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 206, 4, 14, 'Prov 12:24, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 206, 5, 14, 'Now, there are many people who''d like to be leaders in the Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 206, 6, 14, 'church, but it involves being faithful in working out our own salvation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 206, 7, 14, 'in fear and trembling. It''s a principle in all areas out in the world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 206, 8, 14, 'People prosper by working hard and being diligent. That applies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 206, 9, 14, 'spiritually too. God never gives responsibility to those who are lazy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 206, 10, 14, 'He only gives it to those who are hard-working in the situations in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 206, 11, 14, 'which he finds them. And I believe that''s one reason why he chose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 206, 12, 14, 'fishermen to be his apostles. If you''ve seen fishermen, you know that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 206, 13, 14, 'it''s one of the hardest professions on the face of the earth. Almost');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 206, 14, 14, 'every other profession - all the professions any of us have - are ten');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 206, 15, 14, 'times easier than the profession of a fisherman. He has to work so hard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 206, 16, 14, 'day and night in order to catch fish and earn a living, and he has to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 206, 17, 14, 'take risks. Jesus chose such people to be his apostles, teaching us that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 206, 18, 14, 'diligence and hard work are something that he looks for in those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 206, 19, 14, 'will be his disciples. And he gives responsibility only to such people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 206, 20, 14, 'Anxious hearts are very heavy, but a word of encouragement does wonders!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 206, 21, 14, 'Prov 12:25, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 206, 22, 14, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 206, 23, 14, 'Worry can rob you of happiness, but kind words will cheer you up.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 206, 24, 14, 'Prov 12:25, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 206, 25, 14, 'This is a word that all of us need to take to heart - certainly the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 206, 26, 14, 'first part. Unnecessary worry (every type of worry is unnecessary for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 206, 27, 14, 'Christian, because the word of God says, "Be anxious for nothing") robs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 206, 28, 14, 'us of our joy, but the word of encouragement does wonders. I''ve thought');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 207, 1, 14, 'of a word of encouragement as that one talent which the man in Jesus''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 207, 2, 14, 'parable in Matthew 25 wrapped up in a napkin and buried somewhere and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 207, 3, 14, 'never used. Most of us don''t have five talents. Most of us don''t even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 207, 4, 14, 'have two. But is there a single believer who can say, "I don''t even have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 207, 5, 14, 'the ability to speak a word of encouragement to somebody else"? There is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 207, 6, 14, 'not such a believer under the sun. But what do most believers do with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 207, 7, 14, 'this ability to speak a word of encouragement? Have you ever thought of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 207, 8, 14, 'speaking a word of encouragement to your husband or your wife or your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 207, 9, 14, 'children? Of course, we scold our children for a thousand and one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 207, 10, 14, 'things. But a word of encouragement - that is usually the talent we wrap');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 207, 11, 14, 'up in a napkin and keep buried until the time the Lord comes. I really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 207, 12, 14, 'believe that. There would be a tremendous difference if people unwrapped');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 207, 13, 14, 'this napkin and started using this talent with their marriage partners');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 207, 14, 14, 'and their children. One word. Sometimes a postcard. A word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 207, 15, 14, 'encouragement does wonders and changes situations tremendously. Those of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 207, 16, 14, 'us who don''t have other spectacular gifts, I want to encourage you to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 207, 17, 14, 'think of exercising this gift toward other people. The world is full of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 207, 18, 14, 'people, and there are people even in our own home, who just need a word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 207, 19, 14, 'of encouragement in the midst of all the exhortations and scolding and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 207, 20, 14, 'rebuke that they get.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 207, 21, 14, 'The righteous is a guide to his neighbor,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 207, 22, 14, 'But the way of the wicked leads them astray.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 207, 23, 14, 'Prov 12:26');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 207, 24, 14, 'That is the calling of every righteous person, even if he cannot preach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 207, 25, 14, 'or teach or explain the bible or explain doctrine. At least he can be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 207, 26, 14, 'guide in the sense that he can say to his neighbor, "Follow me." He may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 207, 27, 14, 'not say it in many words, but his life should be an example which his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 207, 28, 14, 'neighbor can follow. The righteous should be a guide to his neighbor - a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 208, 1, 14, 'forerunner - if his neighbor wants to follow, of course. That is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 208, 2, 14, 'calling of the righteous, but the way of the wicked leads them astray.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 208, 3, 14, 'A lazy man does not roast his prey,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 208, 4, 14, 'But the precious possession of a man is diligence.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 208, 5, 14, 'Prov 12:27');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 208, 6, 14, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 208, 7, 14, 'A lazy man won''t even dress the game he gets while hunting, but the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 208, 8, 14, 'diligent man makes good use of everything he finds.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 208, 9, 14, 'Prov 12:27, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 208, 10, 14, 'I''ve thought of this as a very beautiful picture of evangelism without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 208, 11, 14, 'disciple-making. A man goes hunting and he shoots a deer and then just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 208, 12, 14, 'leaves that deer to rot. Have you ever heard of a hunter like that - who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 208, 13, 14, 'shoots a deer and then just leaves it for the flesh to waste away? I''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 208, 14, 14, 'never heard of a hunter like this. A hunter usually takes the deer back,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 208, 15, 14, 'and his whole aim is finally to cook it and make it into a meal. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 208, 16, 14, 'when people engage in evangelism without disciple-making, we can say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 208, 17, 14, 'they''ve caught souls - they''ve shot the deer - but they leave those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 208, 18, 14, 'souls to rot. That''s exactly what it says here. It''s easy to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 208, 19, 14, 'evangelism. You just go and shoot the deer. But it takes time to dress');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 208, 20, 14, 'it, cut it and cook it, just like it takes time to make disciples. To');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 208, 21, 14, 'shoot is the easy part. And here I see a beautiful picture of what the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 208, 22, 14, 'word of God thinks about evangelism without disciple-making. In the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 208, 23, 14, 'church, we believe in leading those who have been brought into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 208, 24, 14, 'kingdom into discipleship. "The precious possession of a man is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 208, 25, 14, 'diligence." You''ll notice as we go through the book of Proverbs that it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 208, 26, 14, 'has a lot to say about certain subjects such as diligence and the use of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 208, 27, 14, 'the tongue. And it''s a lazy man who engages in evangelism without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 208, 28, 14, 'disciple-making.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 209, 1, 14, 'The path of the godly leads to life. So why fear death?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 209, 2, 14, 'Prov 12:28, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 209, 3, 14, 'This means there is no need for a truly godly person to ever be afraid');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 209, 4, 14, 'of death. The fear of death is the possession of an ungodly person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 209, 5, 14, 'There is never a need for any godly person to be afraid as to when he''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 209, 6, 14, 'going to die, how he''s going to die or where he''s going to die. "When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 209, 7, 14, 'will I die? How will I die? Where will I die?" These are not the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 209, 8, 14, 'thoughts that should go through a godly person''s mind. Rather, "How can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 209, 9, 14, 'I increasingly use all the circumstances that God allows to come across');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 209, 10, 14, 'my life to partake more of his nature, his goodness, his kindness and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 209, 11, 14, 'his humility?" Leave all matters of death to God. The path of the godly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 209, 12, 14, 'leads to life. So why should he fear death?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 209, 13, 15, 'Chapter 13 Chapter 13');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 209, 14, 15, 'A wise youth accepts his father''s rebuke. A young mocker does not even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 209, 15, 15, 'listen to rebuke.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 209, 16, 15, 'Prov 13:1, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 209, 17, 15, 'I believe that our pride is tested when we are corrected. Young people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 209, 18, 15, 'find it so difficult to receive correction from a father only because of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 209, 19, 15, 'one reason: there is so much pride in them. So much pride which makes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 209, 20, 15, 'them think, "I know which way to go." Pride is what prevents us from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 209, 21, 15, 'receiving correction from an older brother. We need correction. And our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 209, 22, 15, 'response to correction is usually an indication of whether there''s pride');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 209, 23, 15, 'in our hearts. We can find out about ourselves by our response to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 209, 24, 15, 'correction. Some are quick to respond wholeheartedly to correction and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 209, 25, 15, 'to correct immediately and exactly as told. Others take correction, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 209, 26, 15, 'they are quite clever, and they like to still do things in their own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 209, 27, 15, 'way. Lurking in them is a pride which makes them unwilling to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 209, 28, 15, 'wholeheartedly accept correction. Correction often exposes the pride');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 210, 1, 15, 'that lurks in the hearts of people who think they are humble.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 210, 2, 15, '"A wise son accepts his father''s discipline," it says in NASB. Not just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 210, 3, 15, 'verbal correction but discipline. Humility is to accept the chastening');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 210, 4, 15, 'God sends our way because that is the only way to become wise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 210, 5, 15, 'When someone older than you corrects you, you have an opportunity to see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 210, 6, 15, '- however much you may think you''re humble - to see the real condition');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 210, 7, 15, 'of your heart. I believe there''s almost nothing that tests our pride');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 210, 8, 15, 'like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 210, 9, 15, 'From the fruit of a man''s mouth he enjoys good,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 210, 10, 15, 'But the desire of the treacherous is violence.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 210, 11, 15, 'Prov 13:2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 210, 12, 15, 'In other words, we reap what we sow. We sow words with our tongues. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 210, 13, 15, 'have to look at our words like seeds. Like a sower sowing seeds. Right');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 210, 14, 15, 'through the day, I am sowing seeds - in my home, in my office, in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 210, 15, 15, 'church. Each word I speak is a seed, and once it has gone out, I can''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 210, 16, 15, 'take it back. I can repent of it, but I can''t take it back. A man who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 210, 17, 15, 'has been very careful with the words he has sown naturally reaps good,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 210, 18, 15, 'finally. That''s not because God favors him, it''s just the law. Those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 210, 19, 15, 'sow words wisely reap good and peace, whereas it says a wicked person -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 210, 20, 15, 'an evil person - desires only to fight. His tongue is ready to sow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 210, 21, 15, 'something that''ll cause a fight. That''s the mark of an evil person. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 210, 22, 15, 'have to be very careful, brothers and sisters, that we don''t come under');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 210, 23, 15, 'the category of people who are ready to have a fight. The world is full');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 210, 24, 15, 'of people who are ready to have a fight. You see that particularly on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 210, 25, 15, 'the roads. When two people disobey the traffic laws and hit one another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 210, 26, 15, 'or something, you see very clearly what human nature is like. And there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 210, 27, 15, 'we can also recognize a god-fearing person. We are not interested in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 210, 28, 15, 'fighting. It always takes two people to have a quarrel and if only one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 211, 1, 15, 'person is interested in a quarrel, there cannot be a quarrel. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 211, 2, 15, 'impossible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 211, 3, 15, 'The one who guards his mouth preserves his life;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 211, 4, 15, 'The one who opens wide his lips comes to ruin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 211, 5, 15, 'Prov 13:3');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 211, 6, 15, 'Again this is talking about speech. We can preserve our life by guarding');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 211, 7, 15, 'our mouths. Be careful with what you say, and you can protect your own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 211, 8, 15, 'life. In TLB it says, "Self control means controlling the tongue." The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 211, 9, 15, 'word of God says one of the fruits of the Spirit (Galatians 5:23) is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 211, 10, 15, 'self-control. Love, joy, peace, long-suffering, gentleness, goodness,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 211, 11, 15, 'faith, patience, self-control. How do I know whether I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 211, 12, 15, 'self-control? Primarily through the use of the tongue. That''s how I know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 211, 13, 15, 'whether I''m filled with the fruit of the Spirit of self-control. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 211, 14, 15, 'contrast, a quick retort which comes to the ungodly person can ruin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 211, 15, 15, 'everything. The one who opens wide his lips means the one who''s quick to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 211, 16, 15, 'open up his lips to say something. He ends up in ruin. Let''s ask God for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 211, 17, 15, 'grace in this area.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 211, 18, 15, 'The soul of the sluggard craves and gets nothing,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 211, 19, 15, 'but the soul of the diligent is made fat.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 211, 20, 15, 'Prov 13:4');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 211, 21, 15, 'Here again it speaks about the lazy person and the hard-working person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 211, 22, 15, 'The expression "the soul of the diligent is made fat" can mean "the soul');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 211, 23, 15, 'of the diligent prospers." Now in the Old Testament, that prosperity was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 211, 24, 15, 'material. A lazy person remained poor and a hard-working person became');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 211, 25, 15, 'rich. But for us in the New Covenant, that prosperity, and that poverty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 211, 26, 15, 'is primarily spiritual. And we can say a lazy person is one who craves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 211, 27, 15, 'but never does anything about it. "Oh God, I''d like to have victory over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 211, 28, 15, 'sin. I''d like to have it. This bad habit, I''d like to get rid of it." He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 212, 1, 15, 'craves it. He desires it. He spends 10 years desiring it. But he never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 212, 2, 15, 'gets victory, because he doesn''t work towards it! He''s not wholehearted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 212, 3, 15, 'about cleansing himself and putting something to death in his life. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 212, 4, 15, 'just says, "Oh Lord, I desire this. I desire it. I desire it." And I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 212, 5, 15, 'tell you this verse tells us that I can desire all my life for something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 212, 6, 15, 'and never get it because I''m spiritually lazy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 212, 7, 15, 'The soul of the lazy man craves. Craves is a strong word. That means he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 212, 8, 15, 'strongly desires and he still gets nothing. Think of a man who''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 212, 9, 15, 'strongly desiring and still getting nothing because he''s fundamentally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 212, 10, 15, 'lazy spiritually. Think of his attitude to the word of God for example.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 212, 11, 15, 'He may have spare time, but he doesn''t have time to study the word. He''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 212, 12, 15, 'lazy in his attitude to the word, and he remains ignorant to the word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 212, 13, 15, 'Therefore he''s not strong. He doesn''t know the things God has said to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 212, 14, 15, 'help him in the moment of temptation. Think if Jesus had been like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 212, 15, 15, 'When the devil came to tempt him, he wouldn''t have had a word of reply');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 212, 16, 15, 'to drive away the devil. He wouldn''t have had the sword of the Spirit in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 212, 17, 15, 'his hands. Christ would have been like that if he''d been lazy. He could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 212, 18, 15, 'have craved for victory, but he would not have received it if he had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 212, 19, 15, 'been lazy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 212, 20, 15, 'But Jesus was not like that. The soul of the diligent - of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 212, 21, 15, 'wholehearted - really works hard toward achieving what he wants. He will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 212, 22, 15, 'prosper, desiring victory and then working towards it. Laziness may be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 212, 23, 15, 'the reason why some people never come to victory.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 212, 24, 15, 'A good man hates lies; wicked men lie constantly and come to shame');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 212, 25, 15, 'Prov 13:5, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 212, 26, 15, 'You hear that? It is the mark of a righteous person: "A good man hates');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 212, 27, 15, 'lies." Hates telling lies. Hates saying what is wrong. Hates signing a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 212, 28, 15, 'false statement even if somebody else asks him to do it. He hates it!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 213, 1, 15, 'That''s the mark of a righteous man. And a man who doesn''t hate lies, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 213, 2, 15, 'can''t put him in the category of a righteous man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 213, 3, 15, 'Wicked men, on the other hand, tell lies constantly. People who tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 213, 4, 15, 'lies don''t just lie once or twice. It''s a constant process, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 213, 5, 15, 'eventually they come to shame - those who will write false accounts and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 213, 6, 15, 'make false statements. Lying is not just a once in a while thing. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 213, 7, 15, 'becomes a habit, and after a while, the conscience doesn''t even bother');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 213, 8, 15, 'liars. Finally the word of God promises them that they will come to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 213, 9, 15, 'shame, if not on earth, certainly in eternity. The world is full of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 213, 10, 15, 'people who tell lies. The world is full of people who write false');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 213, 11, 15, 'accounts and sign false statements. And in the midst of this ungodly,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 213, 12, 15, 'dark generation, God has placed a few who are upright - even if it means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 213, 13, 15, 'they become poor - who stand up for the truth, who will not tell lies.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 213, 14, 15, 'A man''s goodness helps him all through life, while evil men are being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 213, 15, 15, 'destroyed by their wickedness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 213, 16, 15, 'Prov 13:6, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 213, 17, 15, 'This is true. Again, it''s a question of reaping what we''ve sown. If the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 213, 18, 15, 'whole desire of our hearts is to be good towards others, the word of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 213, 19, 15, 'says that good attitude that desires to help others and be good to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 213, 20, 15, 'others will help me all through my life. That''s why it''s very, very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 213, 21, 15, 'important to bless those who curse us, to do good to those who hate us,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 213, 22, 15, 'to pray for those who persecute us. Never to desire anything evil for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 213, 23, 15, 'another person, but always to desire the best even for our enemies. To');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 213, 24, 15, 'desire that something good will happen to them. That''s really difficult,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 213, 25, 15, 'you know. When somebody has done something evil towards you and some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 213, 26, 15, 'calamity strikes him, the natural reaction is to think, "God has judged');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 213, 27, 15, 'him for treating me, God''s child, so badly." Well, that may be true, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 213, 28, 15, 'that''s God''s business. That''s not my business. My business is to desire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 214, 1, 15, 'good for him, not to desire evil. That is the spirit of the Christian,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 214, 2, 15, 'and if I keep that attitude of goodness, it''ll help me all through my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 214, 3, 15, 'life. But if I have wrong attitudes toward other people, I will myself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 214, 4, 15, 'become evil, and will destroy myself by my wicked attitude.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 214, 5, 15, 'Some people pretend to be rich but have nothing, others pretend to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 214, 6, 15, 'poor and they own a fortune.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 214, 7, 15, 'Prov 13:7, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 214, 8, 15, 'Here is a very true statement which indicates the amount of hypocrisy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 214, 9, 15, 'there is in the world. You see both these categories of people in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 214, 10, 15, 'world. There are poor people who are a bit ashamed of their poverty and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 214, 11, 15, 'are always trying to act as though they are big people and great people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 214, 12, 15, 'and rich people. You find such people in the world. And then there are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 214, 13, 15, 'very rich people who are always acting as though they are trying to make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 214, 14, 15, 'both ends meet and they are very poor and they don''t have enough and yet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 214, 15, 15, 'they have millions stacked away somewhere. Both these types of people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 214, 16, 15, 'are basically hypocrites. While one group is rich and the other poor,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 214, 17, 15, 'they hold hypocrisy in common. When the poor person tries to pretend');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 214, 18, 15, 'he''s great and rich, and the rich person is always trying to act poor,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 214, 19, 15, 'we have in one case pride and the other case false humility.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 214, 20, 15, 'Being kidnapped and held for ransom never worries the poor man!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 214, 21, 15, 'Prov 13:8, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 214, 22, 15, 'The poor man may have many disadvantages, but one advantage he has is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 214, 23, 15, 'that nobody''s going to kidnap him and hold him for ransom. The book of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 214, 24, 15, 'Proverbs is telling us: "Don''t think it''s all advantages to being rich."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 214, 25, 15, 'They have many things to be afraid of. They have to be afraid of the tax');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 214, 26, 15, 'people; they have to be afraid of the market crashing and losing all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 214, 27, 15, 'value in their houses or people holding their children under ransom - so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 214, 28, 15, 'many things which a poor man doesn''t have to worry about at all. Earthly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 215, 1, 15, 'riches don''t only bring blessing; there is a bit of a curse in wealth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 215, 2, 15, 'when we have more than what we need.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 215, 3, 15, 'The righteous are like a light shining brightly, the wicked are like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 215, 4, 15, 'lamp flickering out.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 215, 5, 15, 'Prov 13:9, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 215, 6, 15, 'This reminds us of the five wise virgins and the five foolish virgins.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 215, 7, 15, 'Some whose lights were shining brightly and some whose lamps were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 215, 8, 15, 'flickering out. This verse tells us why some who appear to be virgins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 215, 9, 15, 'are actually wicked. Their lamps were flickering out. They didn''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 215, 10, 15, 'oil. They had no hidden life within - which is what the oil symbolizes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 215, 11, 15, 'But the mark of a righteous person is that he has an inner life - the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 215, 12, 15, 'oil which makes his lamp burn more and more and more. The light is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 215, 13, 15, 'life of Jesus. "In Him was life and that life was the light of men." We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 215, 14, 15, 'see that the wicked only appear to have the life of Jesus, and it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 215, 15, 15, 'flickers out in the moment of trial and temptation. But the righteous,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 215, 16, 15, 'in the moment of trial, you see their lights burning brightly. The life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 215, 17, 15, 'of Jesus comes forth because they''ve worked out their own salvation in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 215, 18, 15, 'their hidden life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 215, 19, 15, 'Pride leads to arguments; be humble, take advice, and be wise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 215, 20, 15, 'Prov 13:10, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 215, 21, 15, 'Here we see the cause of all the strife and arguments in the whole');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 215, 22, 15, 'world: pride. We are exhorted to "be humble, take advice, and become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 215, 23, 15, 'wise." When somebody gives us advice, there again we have an opportunity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 215, 24, 15, 'to test the attitude in our hearts in relation to pride or humility.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 215, 25, 15, 'It''s not easy to take advice if we are proud, because we think we know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 215, 26, 15, 'so much already. But it says here, be humble: take advice from someone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 215, 27, 15, 'who knows a little more than you and you''ll become wise. Even if you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 215, 28, 15, 'so wise already, you''ll become wiser still. What''s wrong in taking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 216, 1, 15, 'advice?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 216, 2, 15, 'When someone gives us advice, if we argue and say, "It''s like this," and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 216, 3, 15, '"It is because of this," that''s usually an indication of pride. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 216, 4, 15, 'verse also shows us that all the arguments and strife that comes in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 216, 5, 15, 'homes between husband and wife are basically due to pride. Pride. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 216, 6, 15, 'the servants of Abraham and Lot had strife which was due to pride, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 216, 7, 15, 'see Abraham''s humility in solving that strife. He said to Lot, "You want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 216, 8, 15, 'something? Take it. You have your right first." Think what benefit we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 216, 9, 15, 'might gain if we can be wise like Abraham. "Brother, take what you want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 216, 10, 15, 'first. I''ll take what''s left over." Children don''t have this humility.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 216, 11, 15, 'Children grab. Humility is being willing to yield and give way to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 216, 12, 15, 'other.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 216, 13, 15, 'Wealth obtained by fraud dwindles,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 216, 14, 15, 'But the one who gathers by labor increases it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 216, 15, 15, 'Prov 13:11');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 216, 16, 15, 'In other words, if we have cheated the government or somebody else and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 216, 17, 15, 'increased our bank account, God''s blessing will not be on that wealth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 216, 18, 15, 'But if we have worked hard in honesty, God''s blessing is on it. And I''ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 216, 19, 15, 'tell you something. It''s better to have 100 rupees a month with God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 216, 20, 15, 'blessing than 1,000 rupees by cheating someone without God''s blessing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 216, 21, 15, 'People don''t realize that. God''s blessing can make a tremendous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 216, 22, 15, 'difference in the little that we earn. It can save us unnecessary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 216, 23, 15, 'hospital expenses, for example. A little can go a long way if it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 216, 24, 15, 'earned honestly and God''s blessing is upon it and we earn it with labor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 216, 25, 15, 'In fact, God''s word says that he who does not work should not eat (2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 216, 26, 15, 'Thessalonians 3:10-12). God has determined that those who are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 216, 27, 15, 'willing to work should not be paid, and that is something that we must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 216, 28, 15, 'also remember when we think in terms of giving gifts to the poor. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 217, 1, 15, 'have to see whether they are people who are making faithful use of what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 217, 2, 15, 'we give, whether they are willing to work hard. If they''re lazy and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 217, 3, 15, 'careless and extravagant with the gifts we give them, then it''s foolish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 217, 4, 15, 'to continue giving. Maybe they are poor because they are so extravagant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 217, 5, 15, 'or because they''re not willing to work hard.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 217, 6, 15, 'Hope deferred makes the heart sick,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 217, 7, 15, 'But a desire fulfilled is a tree of life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 217, 8, 15, 'Prov 13:12');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 217, 9, 15, 'Of course, what that basically means is that when a wish comes true, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 217, 10, 15, 'fills your heart with joy. For us, the greatest longing in our hearts is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 217, 11, 15, 'to partake of God''s nature and to have victory over sin, and that is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 217, 12, 15, 'a hope that God puts before us which cannot be fulfilled. It is a hope');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 217, 13, 15, 'that can be fulfilled, and when it is fulfilled, it becomes like a tree');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 217, 14, 15, 'of life to us that we can partake increasingly of God''s nature.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 217, 15, 15, 'The one who despises the word will be in debt to it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 217, 16, 15, 'But the one who fears the commandment will be rewarded.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 217, 17, 15, 'Prov 13:13');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 217, 18, 15, 'And this is why all sinners are pictured as debtors to God. Every sin,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 217, 19, 15, 'every disobedience to God''s word is a debt that I owe to God. It''s like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 217, 20, 15, 'going and buying something from a shop without paying for it. Every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 217, 21, 15, 'disobedience to a commandment is like buying something from a shop');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 217, 22, 15, 'without paying for it. I am in debt. As it says in the Bible, it is this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 217, 23, 15, 'debt which Jesus paid for us on the cross: we have despised so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 217, 24, 15, 'words in the Bible and we have become debtors, and Jesus has cleared our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 217, 25, 15, 'debt with the intention that in the future, we do not despise the word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 217, 26, 15, 'anymore. There is forgiveness with God so that He may be feared. "The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 217, 27, 15, 'one who fears the commandments will be rewarded."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 217, 28, 15, 'The teaching of the wise is a fountain of life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 218, 1, 15, 'To turn aside from the snares of death.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 218, 2, 15, 'Prov 13:14');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 218, 3, 15, 'It is a very beautiful verse that our speech and the words we speak to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 218, 4, 15, 'others can become like a spring of fresh water. And that is the place');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 218, 5, 15, 'towards which we should work, controlling our tongues, judging');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 218, 6, 15, 'ourselves, and increasing in wisdom in our private lives, so that when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 218, 7, 15, 'we share with people and we speak to people, what we say will be like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 218, 8, 15, 'spring of fresh water. As I said, the book of Proverbs has a lot to say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 218, 9, 15, 'about speech, and in the midst of a world which is full of people who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 218, 10, 15, 'speak sinful things and useless things, it is God''s will that there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 218, 11, 15, 'should be a few who are like springs of living water who speak forth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 218, 12, 15, 'that which is refreshing. Think to be a brother or sister who people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 218, 13, 15, 'feel that anything you say whether in a meeting or in private');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 218, 14, 15, 'conversation or anywhere is always so refreshing compared to the words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 218, 15, 15, 'of people out in the world which are so heavy and bitter. I want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 218, 16, 15, 'exhort everyone here to be a brother or sister like that, to have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 218, 17, 15, 'testimony like that. That people long to hear what you have to say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 218, 18, 15, 'because your words are like a spring that refreshes. That can be our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 218, 19, 15, 'portion: the teaching of the wise. If we are willing to be wise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 218, 20, 15, 'according to the book of Proverbs, our words can be like that and we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 218, 21, 15, 'turn others aside from the snares of death.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 218, 22, 15, 'Good understanding produces favor,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 218, 23, 15, 'But the way of the treacherous is hard.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 218, 24, 15, 'Prov 13:15');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 218, 25, 15, 'This verse is somewhat similar to what we said earlier: that a man with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 218, 26, 15, 'wisdom is appreciated by others naturally because his wisdom wins the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 218, 27, 15, 'respect of others. "But the way of the treacherous is hard." The way of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 218, 28, 15, 'a sinner is hard. It may look smooth and easy, but it turns out,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 219, 1, 15, 'finally, to be hard. And that is not the way that we desire to walk.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 219, 2, 15, 'A wise man thinks ahead; a fool doesn''t and even brags about it!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 219, 3, 15, 'Prov 13:16, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 219, 4, 15, 'To think ahead and to plan ahead is the mark of a wise person. A lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 219, 5, 15, 'people who just say, "I''m trusting in the Lord," are actually fools.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 219, 6, 15, 'There is a trusting in the Lord which is genuine, but most people whom I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 219, 7, 15, 'have seen who speak high-sounding language about trusting in the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 219, 8, 15, 'are actually just downright fools who don''t think ahead and boast about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 219, 9, 15, 'it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 219, 10, 15, 'But a wise man, he realizes that God has given him a mind. God hasn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 219, 11, 15, 'made him like a stone or a brick. He''s given him wisdom; he''s given him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 219, 12, 15, 'intelligence; and he''s given him the Holy Spirit; and he wants him to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 219, 13, 15, 'think ahead. There''s nothing wrong in that. A wise man thinks ahead. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 219, 14, 15, 'says in John 7 that when the people wanted to kill Jesus in Judea, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 219, 15, 15, 'didn''t go there. That was wisdom. It would have been folly to say, "Oh');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 219, 16, 15, 'yeah, I trust in the Lord and I''m going there." That would have been the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 219, 17, 15, 'mark of a fool, but Jesus was wise and sensible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 219, 18, 15, 'A wise man thinks ahead, and God wants all of us to think and plan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 219, 19, 15, 'ahead: "How is it going to go if I do this? How will it be in 4 or 5');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 219, 20, 15, 'years if I go this way?" Particularly in spiritual things. If you keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 219, 21, 15, 'on nagging your husband, how will it be after 5 years? What will your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 219, 22, 15, 'home be like? If you keep on criticizing your wife, how will it be 5');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 219, 23, 15, 'years from now? What will your home be like? It''ll be a ruin. It''ll be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 219, 24, 15, 'wilderness. Think ahead. Think ahead in all the things that we do and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 219, 25, 15, 'say. Be wise. The wise man thinks ahead and says, "I have to deny myself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 219, 26, 15, 'a little here so that there will be some good fruit later on." But a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 219, 27, 15, 'fool just displays his folly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 219, 28, 15, 'Unreliable messengers cause trouble but those who can be trusted bring');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 220, 1, 15, 'peace.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 220, 2, 15, 'Prov 13:17, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 220, 3, 15, 'God does not commit himself to unreliable messengers. It''s very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 220, 4, 15, 'important that all of us come quickly to the place where God can find us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 220, 5, 15, 'to be trustworthy messengers who bring peace, not unreliable messengers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 220, 6, 15, 'who cause trouble.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 220, 7, 15, 'Poverty and shame will come to him who neglects discipline,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 220, 8, 15, 'But he who regards reproof will be honored.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 220, 9, 15, 'Prov 13:18');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 220, 10, 15, 'Here it speaks about poverty and shame coming to the one who neglects');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 220, 11, 15, 'discipline, or, as TLB says, "If you refuse criticism, you will end in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 220, 12, 15, 'poverty and disgrace." Now the thing is, we may think that we already');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 220, 13, 15, 'have quite a bit of wisdom compared to a lot of other people around us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 220, 14, 15, 'That may be true. And that may be the reason why we are too proud to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 220, 15, 15, 'receive any more correction. We may discover in eternity that we could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 220, 16, 15, 'have been a lot wiser if we had humbled ourselves and accepted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 220, 17, 15, 'correction. But we never became any wiser because we were proud that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 220, 18, 15, 'are already so much better than so many other believers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 220, 19, 15, 'I want to say, brothers and sisters, be particularly careful when people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 220, 20, 15, 'come to you for advice. When somebody comes to you for advice and you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 220, 21, 15, 'give them advice, and then someone else comes, and someone else comes,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 220, 22, 15, 'then gradually you begin to think of yourself as a little storehouse of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 220, 23, 15, 'wisdom. And that pride is what can prevent you, brother or sister, from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 220, 24, 15, 'getting any more wisdom. You think that you''re one of those who already');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 220, 25, 15, 'has won the confidence of others. People come to you, and you don''t need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 220, 26, 15, 'much correction now. That''s a dangerous thing. True, you are wise. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 220, 27, 15, 'you could''ve been wiser if you had humbled yourself and been willing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 220, 28, 15, 'receive correction and discipline.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 221, 1, 15, '"If you refuse criticism, you will end in poverty and disgrace; if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 221, 2, 15, 'accept criticism, you are on the road to (spiritual) fame" (TLB). Think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 221, 3, 15, 'to be all your life a receiver of correction. Say, "Lord, there are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 221, 4, 15, 'blind spots in me that I don''t see, and I need my brothers." There''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 221, 5, 15, 'song in which one line goes, "Lord, your Spirit and my brothers are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 221, 6, 15, 'showing me where I have to change." That''s a good attitude to have till');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 221, 7, 15, 'the end of our lives - if we have it, we can grow in wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 221, 8, 15, 'It is pleasant to see plans develop. That is why fools refuse to give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 221, 9, 15, 'them up even when they are wrong.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 221, 10, 15, 'Prov 13:19, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 221, 11, 15, 'It is one mark of a fool that even when someone points out to him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 221, 12, 15, '"These plans that you have made, they''re not very wise," his pride');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 221, 13, 15, 'refuses to make him change his plans even when they are wrong, and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 221, 14, 15, 'matter develops to his ruin. As the NASB puts it, "it is an abomination');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 221, 15, 15, 'to fools to turn away from evil." Basically speaking, when a fool is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 221, 16, 15, 'shown that this way is not the best way, and that some other way is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 221, 17, 15, 'better, he refuses to receive correction from someone with a little more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 221, 18, 15, 'wisdom than himself simply because the first way is the way he has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 221, 19, 15, 'chosen. It''s amazing how long it takes for us to get that humility which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 221, 20, 15, 'is willing to be corrected.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 221, 21, 15, 'He who walks with wise men will be wise,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 221, 22, 15, 'But the companion of fools will suffer harm.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 221, 23, 15, 'Prov 13:20');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 221, 24, 15, 'This verse speaks of the type of the company we keep. If you keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 221, 25, 15, 'company with stupid people, you''ll be ruined. In other words, the type');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 221, 26, 15, 'of company we keep is a pretty good indication of what''s going to happen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 221, 27, 15, 'to us, finally. In 1 Corinthians 15:33 it says, "Don''t be deceived. ''Bad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 221, 28, 15, 'company will corrupt good morals.''" I believe there''s a word here -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 222, 1, 15, 'particularly for us as believers - about the type of people we spend our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 222, 2, 15, 'time with, either through our visiting their homes or their visiting our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 222, 3, 15, 'homes. Tell me the type of people you visit and the type of people who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 222, 4, 15, 'visit you and with whom you spend most of your time, and I''ll tell you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 222, 5, 15, 'fairly well what type of person you are. We can think, "No, I''m not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 222, 6, 15, 'going to be affected," but it says in 1 Corinthians 15:33 not to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 222, 7, 15, 'deceived. Bad company will corrupt your good morals. That''s the word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 222, 8, 15, 'God. To think otherwise is how you can be deceived.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 222, 9, 15, 'Particularly young people face risks in the company they keep. You may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 222, 10, 15, 'think, "I''m a wholehearted, zealous brother." If you are, as far as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 222, 11, 15, 'possible, keep company with zealous brothers. I''m not saying we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 222, 12, 15, 'shouldn''t talk to anyone else. You have to go to school, college, your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 222, 13, 15, 'place of work, meet with others, but let your longing be to be with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 222, 14, 15, 'wholehearted, not with the half-hearted and the worldly. You may think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 222, 15, 15, 'that they don''t affect you, but their company will affect you! Don''t be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 222, 16, 15, 'deceived. Particularly young brothers and sisters, listen to that very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 222, 17, 15, 'carefully. Learn that lesson in youth so that you don''t make a fool of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 222, 18, 15, 'yourself and do stupid things when you''re grown up. Seek the company of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 222, 19, 15, 'the wholehearted. Let that be your greatest longing and desire, not the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 222, 20, 15, 'company of fools and the half-hearted. The companion of fools will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 222, 21, 15, 'suffer harm.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 222, 22, 15, 'Adversity pursues sinners,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 222, 23, 15, 'But the righteous will be rewarded with prosperity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 222, 24, 15, 'Prov 13:21');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 222, 25, 15, 'Again, we apply this verse spiritually. It is basically the same thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 222, 26, 15, 'as the Bible says in Galatians 6:9, and it''s a theme that recurs again');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 222, 27, 15, 'and again in Proverbs: what we sow we will reap. Usually whatever we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 222, 28, 15, 'sow, we have to reap ten, thirty, sixty, or one-hundred times as much.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 223, 1, 15, 'Whatever it is, it''s going to be much more than what we have sown. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 223, 2, 15, 'here''s a simple principle that we must keep in mind: that we cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 223, 3, 15, 'avoid sowing. Let me use a very simple illustration. Suppose I''m a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 223, 4, 15, 'farmer and I sow potatoes at the time of sowing, and then near harvest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 223, 5, 15, 'time I say, "I don''t want potatoes. I want tomatoes." And I kneel down');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 223, 6, 15, 'and I have prayer meetings, fasting and prayer, and I say, "Oh God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 223, 7, 15, 'please give me tomatoes. Do a miracle and give me tomatoes at harvest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 223, 8, 15, 'time." You''re not going to get tomatoes, despite all the fasting and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 223, 9, 15, 'prayer. You can say, "Lord, please forgive me for sowing those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 223, 10, 15, 'potatoes." God will forgive you, but what will come forth is still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 223, 11, 15, 'potatoes. We mustn''t forget that even when God forgives us there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 223, 12, 15, 'still a reaping of what we have sown in the past.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 223, 13, 15, 'Let me give you an example of how "adversity pursues sinners.". Here is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 223, 14, 15, 'a young man who has indulged in reading dirty, sexual novels and read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 223, 15, 15, 'pornographic books and seen pornographic pictures - and indulged in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 223, 16, 15, 'them, and indulged in them, and indulged in them, and indulged in them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 223, 17, 15, 'and indulged in them - say up to the age of twenty-five. And here''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 223, 18, 15, 'another young man who avoided all that and was a morally good person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 223, 19, 15, 'Both were not converted. Then both got converted at the same time at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 223, 20, 15, 'age of twenty-five. And you find this person who had not indulged in all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 223, 21, 15, 'this pornographic literature has an easier time later on as a Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 223, 22, 15, 'with his dreams and his thoughts than that other person who indulged in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 223, 23, 15, 'it so much. Both are forgiven, but one person is constantly harassed in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 223, 24, 15, 'his thoughts and his dreams by the potatoes that he has sown for so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 223, 25, 15, 'years. This is why you have to be very careful what you read and what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 223, 26, 15, 'you look at. Each book you read and picture you put in your mind is like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 223, 27, 15, 'a seed sown there. It''s going to come back 10x later on in life; later');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 223, 28, 15, 'in life when you wish that you could be free from some of these things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 224, 1, 15, 'God forgives you, but the reaping is still going to be there. It''s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 224, 2, 15, 'going to be tomatoes, it''s going to be potatoes even though you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 224, 3, 15, 'forgiven. And that''s the thing that should put a fear into our hearts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 224, 4, 15, 'about what we sow, because it says, "Adversity pursues sinners." This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 224, 5, 15, 'harvest of adversity sort of runs after the seed of sin that was sown.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 224, 6, 15, 'But it can be the other way around too, if we sow good. When we fill our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 224, 7, 15, 'minds with the word of God and more of the word of God; when we fill our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 224, 8, 15, 'minds with something good; and we''re thinking good thoughts about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 224, 9, 15, 'others; and we avoid all that''s evil - good choices also produce a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 224, 10, 15, 'harvest - a harvest of good. "The righteous will be rewarded with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 224, 11, 15, 'prosperity."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 224, 12, 15, 'So forgiveness is not everything. We can be forgiven and still be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 224, 13, 15, 'tremendously harassed by the memory of our past life, and there we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 224, 14, 15, 'think what a wonderful inheritance it is for young people to grow up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 224, 15, 15, 'without all this sexually polluting literature and dirty thoughts. I''ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 224, 16, 15, 'tell you this, ten years from now, some of you who are in your teens');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 224, 17, 15, 'today will be thankful if you listen to what you read today. If the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 224, 18, 15, 'tarries, you''ll be very thankful - when you become a wholehearted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 224, 19, 15, 'brother or sister - that you kept your early youth pure from all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 224, 20, 15, 'filthy things that others in your school and college are indulging in.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 224, 21, 15, 'Be careful in this area.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 224, 22, 15, 'A good man leaves an inheritance to his children''s children,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 224, 23, 15, 'And the wealth of the sinner is stored up for the righteous.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 224, 24, 15, 'Prov 13:22');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 224, 25, 15, 'Well, this was certainly true in the Old Testament. What Abraham gave to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 224, 26, 15, 'Isaac - what Abraham had when he died - even descended to Jacob. And we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 224, 27, 15, 'can apply this also in the New Testament spiritually: that if you live a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 224, 28, 15, 'God-fearing, upright, righteous life, you can give an inheritance that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 225, 1, 15, 'not only affects your children, but also your grandchildren. And the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 225, 2, 15, 'influence of a godly life is really the greatest inheritance that a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 225, 3, 15, 'can leave not only his children but his grandchildren. The influence of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 225, 4, 15, 'a godly life: the memory that a son or daughter has of a father who was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 225, 5, 15, 'God-fearing, a father who wouldn''t tell lies, a father who did not yell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 225, 6, 15, 'at his wife, a mother who knew how to submit to her husband as a church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 225, 7, 15, 'to Christ. Think what an inheritance such an example can be to children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 225, 8, 15, '- certainly one worth much more than money! A father who was upright,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 225, 9, 15, 'who wouldn''t do anything wrong to make money. A father who was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 225, 10, 15, 'righteous; a father who longed to obey the word of God. A mother who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 225, 11, 15, 'longed to obey the word of God. Such parents can leave an inheritance to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 225, 12, 15, 'their children, and it''ll affect those children in such a way that it''ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 225, 13, 15, 'be manifest in their grandchildren. A wonderful inheritance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 225, 14, 15, '"But the wealth of the sinner is stored up for the righteous." Not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 225, 15, 15, 'perhaps in this life, but it''s certainly going to be true in the next');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 225, 16, 15, 'life. All that this earth has that sinners consider as their wealth is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 225, 17, 15, 'finally going to be taken by God and handed over to the righteous. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 225, 18, 15, 'meek will inherit the earth and everything in it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 225, 19, 15, 'Abundant food is in the fallow ground of the poor,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 225, 20, 15, 'But it is swept away by injustice.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 225, 21, 15, 'Prov 13:23');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 225, 22, 15, 'Now, I understand this verse to mean that a poor man may have a small,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 225, 23, 15, 'little farm and he may think that nothing much can come out of it, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 225, 24, 15, 'it says here a tremendous lot can come out of the little that a poor man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 225, 25, 15, 'has. Like I said earlier about the one talent: the poor man is a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 225, 26, 15, 'with one talent, and he says, "Oh, what can come out of this one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 225, 27, 15, 'talent?" A tremendous lot can come out of that one talent! Suppose the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 225, 28, 15, 'poor man''s one talent is a word of encouragement. What a lot can come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 226, 1, 15, 'out of that one talent! You can produce 100 talents with that one talent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 226, 2, 15, 'if you use it and don''t wrap it up in a napkin and bury it so that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 226, 3, 15, 'spend year after year after year never giving a word of encouragement to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 226, 4, 15, 'anybody either in your home or outside your home. In many other areas');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 226, 5, 15, 'too, all of us can tend to think we have so little. We have so little of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 226, 6, 15, 'gifts, we have so little abilities, we have so little of this, that, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 226, 7, 15, 'the other, but a tremendous lot can come out of the little we have. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 226, 8, 15, 'thought of this in relation to a drama we once did in our church. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 226, 9, 15, 'used inexpensive items like old curtains and so many other things. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 226, 10, 15, 'wasn''t a big, expensive production like the shows put on out there in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 226, 11, 15, 'the world. But we need not get discouraged. So much can be produced out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 226, 12, 15, 'of so little according to this verse.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 226, 13, 15, 'This is true provided we do not ruin our whole lives by being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 226, 14, 15, 'unrighteous. If a man is unrighteous, it says, then whether he has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 226, 15, 15, 'little or much it''s just going to be ruined. It''s all going to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 226, 16, 15, 'ruined. But a tremendous lot can come out of the little resources you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 226, 17, 15, 'have, the little abilities you have, the little wisdom you have, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 226, 18, 15, 'little spirituality you have, the little you have of gifts and talents -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 226, 19, 15, 'a tremendous lot can come out of it. There''s abundant food possible out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 226, 20, 15, 'of what we have, if we humble ourselves and use it faithfully for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 226, 21, 15, 'glory of God. Much can come from the little that you possess. For');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 226, 22, 15, 'example, even materially you may have little compared to some other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 226, 23, 15, 'brothers, but you can use that little so carefully that not only much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 226, 24, 15, 'comes out of that little that you have but much character develops in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 226, 25, 15, 'your life by being careful in the use of material things, while a rich');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 226, 26, 15, 'person never develops that character. He can tend to be more free and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 226, 27, 15, 'loose with things, buying a whole lot of things that are unnecessary.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 226, 28, 15, 'Abundant food is in the fallow ground of the poor, provided that it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 227, 1, 15, 'not wasted through unrighteousness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 227, 2, 15, 'He who withholds his rod hates his son,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 227, 3, 15, 'But he who loves him disciplines him diligently.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 227, 4, 15, 'Prov 13:24');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 227, 5, 15, 'This is a verse repeated many times in the book of Proverbs concerning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 227, 6, 15, 'discipline for children. The Living Bible says, "If you refuse to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 227, 7, 15, 'discipline your son, that is the clearest proof you don''t love him." Did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 227, 8, 15, 'you know that? How do you know that a father does not love his son? He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 227, 9, 15, 'doesn''t discipline him. He doesn''t punish him. He never uses the rod on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 227, 10, 15, 'him. That is the clearest proof that a father does not love his son. How');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 227, 11, 15, 'do you know a father loves his son? He beats him with a rod. If you love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 227, 12, 15, 'him, it says here, you will be diligent, that means you will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 227, 13, 15, 'wholehearted with that rod in disciplining him. You will not say, "No,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 227, 14, 15, 'he''s just so darling." No, but you''ll be wholehearted in disciplining');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 227, 15, 15, 'your son. That''s what it says. Diligently. Just like we''re to seek God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 227, 16, 15, 'diligently. Think to be a wholehearted, loving father like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 227, 17, 15, 'Many worldly ideas can creep into us so easily, but in our parenting we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 227, 18, 15, 'need to follow the teaching of the word of God. The discipline of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 227, 19, 15, 'children is the proof of love. That''s because you don''t want your child');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 227, 20, 15, 'to grow up to be a nuisance to society, a nuisance to the church, a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 227, 21, 15, 'nuisance in the home, a nuisance to the neighbors, and finally land in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 227, 22, 15, 'the lap of the devil for all eternity. You don''t want that. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 227, 23, 15, 'therefore, because you love your son, you want your son to be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 227, 24, 15, 'testimony, to be an example - therefore you discipline him. You teach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 227, 25, 15, 'him obedience, you teach him to obey when you have spoken one word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 227, 26, 15, 'That''s how we must teach our children discipline. They may not all grow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 227, 27, 15, 'up to be wholehearted brothers and sisters. They have to take their own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 227, 28, 15, 'decision when they grow up in life. But as long as they are in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 228, 1, 15, 'homes, they must know that father''s and mother''s words have to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 228, 2, 15, 'obeyed. There is no two ways about that. They must know who is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 228, 3, 15, 'authority in the home. It''s the proof of love. They don''t understand it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 228, 4, 15, 'just like believers sometimes don''t understand it when God disciplines');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 228, 5, 15, 'them and chastens them, but discipline is the mark of love.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 228, 6, 15, 'The righteous has enough to satisfy his appetite,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 228, 7, 15, 'But the stomach of the wicked is in need.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 228, 8, 15, 'Prov 13:25');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 228, 9, 15, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 228, 10, 15, 'The righteous man eats to live and the evil man lives to eat.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 228, 11, 15, 'Prov 13:25, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 228, 12, 15, 'This is very beautifully paraphrased in The Living Bible. There''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 228, 13, 15, 'world of difference between eating in order to live which is the mark of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 228, 14, 15, 'a righteous man and the unrighteous man who just lives to eat: "Ahh,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 228, 15, 15, 'another chance to eat." But the righteous man says, "I have to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 228, 16, 15, 'careful about what I eat." And particularly in the days in which we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 228, 17, 15, 'live, I don''t know how many of us have a lot of opportunities for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 228, 18, 15, 'exercise. Almost none of us. Is there anybody carrying bricks here?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 228, 19, 15, 'Perhaps such a person would have opportunity, but most of us, we really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 228, 20, 15, 'are not going to have much opportunity to exercise, and therefore we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 228, 21, 15, 'have to really be more careful in this area that we don''t live to eat,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 228, 22, 15, 'but eat in order to live.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 228, 23, 15, 'In the margin of The Living Bible it says, "the wicked never get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 228, 24, 15, 'enough." The wicked are never satisfied no matter how much is on their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 228, 25, 15, 'plate. Particularly if it''s good, tasty food, they''re never, never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 228, 26, 15, 'satisfied no matter how much there is. And that teaches us that one mark');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 228, 27, 15, 'of a righteous man is that he knows how to discipline himself in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 228, 28, 15, 'area of eating. You see, we can discipline ourselves in public in eating');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 229, 1, 15, 'just to have a good testimony. After all, it''ll look horrible if I just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 229, 2, 15, 'go and grab everything I want. But public discipline in eating is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 229, 3, 15, 'necessarily a proof of righteousness. I may just want to keep my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 229, 4, 15, 'testimony, and that''s quite different from desiring righteousness in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 229, 5, 15, 'heart. And that is the thing which I need to see. It''s not a question of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 229, 6, 15, 'what I''m doing in order to get a good reputation before the brothers of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 229, 7, 15, 'being self-denying and not eating much, but rather, what do I desire in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 229, 8, 15, 'my heart? Supposing nobody was looking? Would I gobble up, or would I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 229, 9, 15, 'say, "Well, I want to eat to live." I believe it''s a very important area');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 229, 10, 15, 'because the New Testament speaks about those whose belly is their God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 229, 11, 15, 'They are so particular about tasty food. "How can we possibly live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 229, 12, 15, 'without having this food or that in our home?" they ask. "How can we do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 229, 13, 15, 'that?" The thing is, so many people do do that. They do live without so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 229, 14, 15, 'many things. But we can become so crazy after certain types of food that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 229, 15, 15, 'we think we can''t live without it. "How can my children live without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 229, 16, 15, 'these things?" And then our belly can become our God, and it says in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 229, 17, 15, 'Philippians 3:18-19 that such people are enemies of the cross. We are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 229, 18, 15, 'not to be enemies of the cross while speaking about the New and Living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 229, 19, 15, 'Way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 229, 20, 16, 'Chapter 14 Chapter 14');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 229, 21, 16, 'The wise woman builds her house,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 229, 22, 16, 'But the foolish woman tears it down with her own hands.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 229, 23, 16, 'Prov 14:1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 229, 24, 16, 'This teaches us that it''s not the man primarily that builds the house.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 229, 25, 16, 'Do you see that? It''s the woman. And why does it speak about the wife');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 229, 26, 16, 'instead of the husband when it comes to building the house? I''ll tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 229, 27, 16, 'you a simple reason: the wife spends more than double the time at home');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 229, 28, 16, 'than her husband does in most cases. The whole atmosphere of a home to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 230, 1, 16, 'large extent is influenced by the wife, by what she desires. The mother');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 230, 2, 16, 'spends much more time with the children than the father in most cases.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 230, 3, 16, 'And that''s why there''s tremendous need for a woman who''s married to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 230, 4, 16, 'wise, because she''s either building her home or she''s not wise and she''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 230, 5, 16, 'tearing it down with her own hands. Now, no woman would be so foolish as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 230, 6, 16, 'to take a hammer and chisel and break down the walls of her own house,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 230, 7, 16, 'but I tell you, those brick walls are nothing compared to the spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 230, 8, 16, 'home that you wives are building, that you mothers are building inside');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 230, 9, 16, 'that brick home. And that spiritual home is the thing we can easily tear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 230, 10, 16, 'down by foolishness, by doing all types of foolish things and saying all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 230, 11, 16, 'types of foolish things. It''s just like taking a hammer and chisel and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 230, 12, 16, 'breaking the house to pieces. Be wise. You know what the beginning of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 230, 13, 16, 'wisdom is? The fear of the Lord is the beginning of wisdom. I''ll tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 230, 14, 16, 'you, if there''s one person in every house that needs to have the fear of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 230, 15, 16, 'God it''s the wife/mother, because she''s the one that has to build the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 230, 16, 16, 'house. A wise woman builds her house by her god-fearing attitude. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 230, 17, 16, 'can''t remember the number of stories I''ve read, true stories, of people,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 230, 18, 16, 'men of God, who spoke about a god-fearing, praying mother who influenced');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 230, 19, 16, 'them tremendously in their life. Think of this, dear sisters, that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 230, 20, 16, 'can leave your children an inheritance, that they know you as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 230, 21, 16, 'god-fearing, praying mother. Build your home. Build your home. So much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 230, 22, 16, 'depends on you according to the word of God. So much.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 230, 23, 16, 'And our homes, of course, finally affect the church as well. You can say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 230, 24, 16, 'the sisters don''t have much of a ministry in the church. I tell you they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 230, 25, 16, 'have a fantastic ministry in the church: because the strength of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 230, 26, 16, 'church is the strength of its homes. It''s not all about the number of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 230, 27, 16, 'seats that are filled up. I couldn''t care less for that or the size of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 230, 28, 16, 'the building. The strength of each home represented in the church is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 231, 1, 16, 'strength of the church and that is sort of an invisible thing. And who''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 231, 2, 16, 'building those homes? The women. Who says sisters don''t have a ministry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 231, 3, 16, 'in our church? I believe they have one of the most important ministries');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 231, 4, 16, 'towards their husbands and their children. Tremendous. That''s why you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 231, 5, 16, 'need to pray for the fear of God upon your life so that you can be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 231, 6, 16, 'wise woman.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 231, 7, 16, 'Be honest and you show that you have reverence for the LORD; Be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 231, 8, 16, 'dishonest and you show that you do not.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 231, 9, 16, 'Prov 14:2, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 231, 10, 16, 'Again, it''s a question of lies and truthfulness, honesty and dishonesty.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 231, 11, 16, 'By honesty we show that we fear God. By dishonesty, whatever we may say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 231, 12, 16, 'we show that we don''t fear God at all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 231, 13, 16, 'Proud fools talk too much; the words of the wise protect them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 231, 14, 16, 'Prov 14:3, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 231, 15, 16, 'We''ve considered before that one mark of a fool is that he speaks a lot.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 231, 16, 16, 'In Ecclesiastes 5:3, there''s a beautiful verse to the effect that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 231, 17, 16, 'can recognize the voice of a fool by the many words that he speaks.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 231, 18, 16, 'You''ll find that in a group of people, the person that speaks the most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 231, 19, 16, '(I don''t mean God-fearing things from scripture, but general');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 231, 20, 16, 'conversation in which the person has the maximum to speak about useless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 231, 21, 16, 'things), that person is the greatest fool in that crowd. "The voice of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 231, 22, 16, 'fool [comes] through many words" (Ecclesiastes 5:3). A wise man''s words,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 231, 23, 16, 'on the other hand, protect him. Our words are not only seeds, but a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 231, 24, 16, 'means by which we build a citadel which protects us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 231, 25, 16, 'Where no oxen are, the manger is clean, But much revenue comes by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 231, 26, 16, 'strength of the ox.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 231, 27, 16, 'Prov 14:4');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 231, 28, 16, 'That basically means that if you''re too lazy to clean all the dung that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 232, 1, 16, 'will be there when you have oxen and cows, you can say, "My stable is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 232, 2, 16, 'very clean," but you don''t get much profit out of it either. In the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 232, 3, 16, 'Testament, this applies in a material way, but in the New, it applies to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 232, 4, 16, 'us in a spiritual way. If you want oxen, you have to suffer a certain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 232, 5, 16, 'amount of inconvenience to keep the stable clean as well. And if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 232, 6, 16, 'want to become spiritually rich, it involves a certain amount of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 232, 7, 16, 'inconvenience. If I''m always thinking of a convenient life with no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 232, 8, 16, 'disturbance to what I want to do in my life, then of course I am like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 232, 9, 16, 'that man who doesn''t want any oxen because it''s too much nuisance to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 232, 10, 16, 'clean all that dung and to clean all that mess they make in the stable.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 232, 11, 16, 'But, in the end, such a man won''t be rich. He''ll be a poor man. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 232, 12, 16, 'reason why many people are spiritually poor is because when it comes to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 232, 13, 16, 'a little bit of inconvenience in their life, they avoid going that way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 232, 14, 16, 'They like to have spirituality if it does not disturb their ambitions in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 232, 15, 16, 'life and their basic convenience. And I believe more and more that this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 232, 16, 16, 'is the fundamental reason why the vast majority of believers remain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 232, 17, 16, 'spiritually poor: they''re always thinking, "How will this disturb my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 232, 18, 16, 'convenience and my comfort if I go wholeheartedly for God in this? If I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 232, 19, 16, 'do this and I do that, it''s going to make life a little difficult." And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 232, 20, 16, 'so they avoid that difficult path and they remain spiritually poor. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 232, 21, 16, 'sad thing is, they''ll wake up in eternity and discover what a fantastic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 232, 22, 16, 'loss was theirs just because they sought a little comfort and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 232, 23, 16, 'convenience in their earthly life. That''ll be a sad day. That''s why the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 232, 24, 16, 'word of God warns us now, it''s better to have a little inconvenience in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 232, 25, 16, 'the stable and be rich.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 232, 26, 16, 'A faithful witness will not lie:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 232, 27, 16, 'but a false witness will utter lies.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 232, 28, 16, 'Prov 14:5, KJV');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 233, 1, 16, 'We speak much about faithfulness in the church. One tremendous area of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 233, 2, 16, 'faithfulness is absolute honesty. The book of Proverbs has a tremendous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 233, 3, 16, 'lot to speak about absolute truthfulness. If we speak about being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 233, 4, 16, 'faithful, that means being absolutely faithful in the matter of speaking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 233, 5, 16, 'the truth. A faithful witness will not tell lies, but if a person speaks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 233, 6, 16, 'lies, he''s a false witness. So this is the test of our faithfulness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 233, 7, 16, 'Let''s not think in terms of faithfulness in other things if we are being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 233, 8, 16, 'unfaithful in this matter of speaking the absolute truth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 233, 9, 16, 'A scoffer seeks wisdom and finds none,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 233, 10, 16, 'But knowledge is easy to one who has understanding.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 233, 11, 16, 'Prov 14:6');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 233, 12, 16, 'A scoffer is one who is arrogant and proud. Jesus said that the things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 233, 13, 16, 'of God are hidden from the wise and intelligent, not because they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 233, 14, 16, 'wise and intelligent but because they are proud of their wisdom and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 233, 15, 16, 'intelligence. You find people like that even among Christians who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 233, 16, 16, 'inwardly proud of the fact that they are a little clever and a little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 233, 17, 16, 'smart and a little sharp. Invariably, I have found in my life that such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 233, 18, 16, 'people never have spiritual revelation. Simple people have revelation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 233, 19, 16, 'which these clever, smart, sharp people never get. They remain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 233, 20, 16, 'spiritually blind year after year after year. Because of their arrogance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 233, 21, 16, 'God refuses to give them wisdom. They seek wisdom but they don''t get it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 233, 22, 16, 'Of course, they think that they are very spiritually wise, but anyone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 233, 23, 16, 'who''s mature can make out that they''re just deceiving themselves. But to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 233, 24, 16, 'one who comes like a little babe, knowledge is easy. It''s easy to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 233, 25, 16, 'understand the scriptures if we come to it like a little babe without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 233, 26, 16, 'any cleverness of our own to lean upon. It''s impossible to get the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 233, 27, 16, 'wisdom which the book of Proverbs speaks about if we don''t approach it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 233, 28, 16, 'with humility.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 234, 1, 16, 'If you are looking for advice, stay away from fools.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 234, 2, 16, 'Prov 14:7, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 234, 3, 16, 'This means that if you really want godly wisdom, don''t go to a man who''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 234, 4, 16, 'clever in earthly things. He''s a fool when it comes to spiritual things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 234, 5, 16, 'We can''t get wisdom from an earthly wise man. No. Leave the presence of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 234, 6, 16, 'a fool, because from him you cannot get advice that will lead you in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 234, 7, 16, 'way of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 234, 8, 16, 'The wisdom of the sensible is to understand his way,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 234, 9, 16, 'But the foolishness of fools is deceit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 234, 10, 16, 'Prov 14:8');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 234, 11, 16, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 234, 12, 16, 'The wise man looks ahead. The fool attempts to fool himself and won''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 234, 13, 16, 'face facts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 234, 14, 16, 'Prov 14:8, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 234, 15, 16, 'This means the wise man is one who considers, as it says here, his own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 234, 16, 16, 'way. The wisdom of the wise man is to understand his own way, not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 234, 17, 16, 'somebody else''s. He seeks to see the way ahead for himself. In other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 234, 18, 16, 'words, he judges himself so that he can find the right way for himself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 234, 19, 16, 'He''s not a busybody in other people''s matters. That doesn''t mean he''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 234, 20, 16, 'not concerned about others. No. But he knows he cannot help others if he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 234, 21, 16, 'hasn''t found the way for himself. As he finds the way for himself, then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 234, 22, 16, 'he can help the others by being a forerunner for them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 234, 23, 16, 'So the wisdom of the wise man is to understand the way God wants you to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 234, 24, 16, 'go. Never mind about all the other people. If you are wise, gradually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 234, 25, 16, 'others will have confidence in you, and they will want to follow your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 234, 26, 16, 'example. But the fool, he does not face facts. He wants to fool himself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 234, 27, 16, 'that he''s alright and deceives himself. The New Testament speaks a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 234, 28, 16, 'tremendous amount about how easy it is for believers to deceive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 235, 1, 16, 'themselves about their spiritual condition. My own personal conviction');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 235, 2, 16, 'is that 90% of believers or more are thoroughly deceived about their own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 235, 3, 16, 'spiritual condition. They think they are much more spiritual than they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 235, 4, 16, 'really are, and they''ll wake up in eternity to get a terrific shock when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 235, 5, 16, 'they discover what God''s evaluation of them was. And you find that in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 235, 6, 16, 'us, with all of us who have heard about the New and Living Way, how easy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 235, 7, 16, 'it is for us to have higher thoughts about our own spirituality than are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 235, 8, 16, 'really true. I would say that most of us have a higher opinion of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 235, 9, 16, 'own spirituality than is really true. There''s a tremendous need for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 235, 10, 16, 'deliverance from that type of deception - so that we can live before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 235, 11, 16, 'God''s face. A high opinion of our own spiritual condition clings to us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 235, 12, 16, 'so tightly, even though we clothe it with words of humility and all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 235, 13, 16, 'that. To hold to such an opinion is the folly of a fool - not to face');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 235, 14, 16, 'facts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 235, 15, 16, 'The common bond of rebels is their guilt. The common bond of godly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 235, 16, 16, 'people is goodwill.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 235, 17, 16, 'Prov 14:9, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 235, 18, 16, 'The thing that makes all people the same - unbelievers and all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 235, 19, 16, 'rebels in the world - the thing that makes them exactly the same in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 235, 20, 16, 'God''s eyes is their guilt. They''re all guilty to a greater or lesser');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 235, 21, 16, 'degree.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 235, 22, 16, 'The common bond of godly people, on the other hand, is their goodwill.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 235, 23, 16, 'In other words, the mark of a godly person is that he desires good for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 235, 24, 16, 'other people. If you are one who desires good for others, then you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 235, 25, 16, 'a bond with other godly people. But if you are jealous of somebody else');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 235, 26, 16, 'who has something better than you, then you don''t have any bond that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 235, 27, 16, 'binds you with godly people. The common bond of godly people is that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 235, 28, 16, 'each of them has goodwill toward the other. A godly man desires good for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 236, 1, 16, 'the other person. He''s happy when it goes well with somebody else');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 236, 2, 16, 'materially or spiritually or any other way. And that is what brings a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 236, 3, 16, 'bond among the truly godly people and makes them one. When this attitude');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 236, 4, 16, 'is lacking in a person''s life, he doesn''t have any bond with other godly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 236, 5, 16, 'people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 236, 6, 16, 'Only the person involved can know his own bitterness or joy - no one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 236, 7, 16, 'else can really share it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 236, 8, 16, 'Prov 14:10, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 236, 9, 16, 'A stranger cannot share your joy, and that is really true. The joy of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 236, 10, 16, 'the Lord is something we can only experience personally. It''s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 236, 11, 16, 'something I can experience merely because I sit in an assembly where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 236, 12, 16, 'there are some people who have come into this experience. It''s something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 236, 13, 16, 'I can experience personally if I have really and truly forsaken all. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 236, 14, 16, 'am convinced that when there''s no joy in a person''s life, it''s an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 236, 15, 16, 'indication that there''s something in his life which he has not forsaken,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 236, 16, 16, 'usually some earthly thing. Some ambition. Something which is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 236, 17, 16, 'forsaken which robs him of his joy. Those who have forsaken all have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 236, 18, 16, 'experienced that joy in its fullness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 236, 19, 16, 'The house of the wicked will be destroyed,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 236, 20, 16, 'But the tent of the upright will flourish.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 236, 21, 16, 'Prov 14:11');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 236, 22, 16, 'Jesus expanded on this in the sermon on the mount when he said that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 236, 23, 16, 'wise man who obeys what Jesus taught builds his house on the rock. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 236, 24, 16, 'house will remain forever. But the one who builds on sand is the one who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 236, 25, 16, 'hears and does not obey. The house built on sand is the house of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 236, 26, 16, 'wicked which will finally be destroyed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 236, 27, 16, 'There is a way which seems right to a man,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 236, 28, 16, 'But its end is the way of death.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 237, 1, 16, 'Prov 14:12');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 237, 2, 16, 'Jesus also spoke about the broad way and the narrow way. The broad way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 237, 3, 16, 'is what most people think is right, but its end is death. The narrow way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 237, 4, 16, 'is what leads to life. We can look at it in many ways; I just want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 237, 5, 16, 'mention one of the possible ways. You know what Jesus said to Peter:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 237, 6, 16, '"Your mind is set on man''s interests and not God''s interests." We can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 237, 7, 16, 'say man''s interests are the broad way and God''s interests are the narrow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 237, 8, 16, 'way. And what are man''s interests? My comfort and my convenience. God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 237, 9, 16, 'interest is my character. When I seek my comfort and my convenience, I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 237, 10, 16, 'on the broad way even if I appear to be spiritual. When I seek for my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 237, 11, 16, 'character to be what God wants it to be, then I go through the narrow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 237, 12, 16, 'way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 237, 13, 16, 'There is a way which seems right to a man. It looks alright - I''m not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 237, 14, 16, 'committing any sin, I''m not doing any harm to anyone - but why does it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 237, 15, 16, 'seem right to a man? You see, you can''t commit adultery and it seem');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 237, 16, 16, 'right to you. You can''t tell lies and it seem right to you. You can''t do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 237, 17, 16, 'evil to somebody else and it seem right to you. What is this way that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 237, 18, 16, 'seems right where I''m not harming anybody, where I''m not doing anything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 237, 19, 16, 'consciously evil and it seems right? It''s the way of seeking my own.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 237, 20, 16, 'Underneath it all I''m seeking my own. My own honor, my own convenience.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 237, 21, 16, 'That leads to death. That''s the thing we have to be careful about.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 237, 22, 16, 'Laughter cannot mask a heavy heart. When the laughter ends, the grief');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 237, 23, 16, 'remains.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 237, 24, 16, 'Prov 14:13, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 237, 25, 16, 'Laughter is something which is never spoken of in the New Testament. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 237, 26, 16, 'the world, they speak about laughter. In the New Testament, it speaks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 237, 27, 16, 'about joy, and joy is different from laughter. You never read once in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 237, 28, 16, 'the gospels that Jesus laughed, but you do read much about the joy that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 238, 1, 16, 'he had. There''s a world of difference between joy and laughter. People');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 238, 2, 16, 'go get some entertainment, and they laugh. But it says here that when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 238, 3, 16, 'the laughter is finished, the grief is still there. They have to go find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 238, 4, 16, 'another form of entertainment the next day to forget about their sorrow.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 238, 5, 16, 'That''s not the godly way. You can try and cover up a heavy heart with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 238, 6, 16, 'laughter but when the laughter is over, and you come back from that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 238, 7, 16, 'entertainment, the heaviness is still there. You become like a man who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 238, 8, 16, 'goes to the drinking saloon. There are a lot of charismatic meetings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 238, 9, 16, 'like that where people go and feel very happy and laugh for two or three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 238, 10, 16, 'hours and then come back home and they''re still heavy. They haven''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 238, 11, 16, 'understood how to rejoice in the Lord always. To rejoice in the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 238, 12, 16, 'always is not a question of clapping the hands and raising the hands and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 238, 13, 16, 'speaking in tongues and singing in tongues. It''s a question of taking up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 238, 14, 16, 'the cross and dying. The cross is the secret of joy and the only way to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 238, 15, 16, 'it. In the world they speak about laughter; in the church we speak about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 238, 16, 16, 'joy - the joy which comes through the cross.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 238, 17, 16, 'The backslider in heart will have his fill of his own ways,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 238, 18, 16, 'But a good man will be satisfied with his.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 238, 19, 16, 'Prov 14:14');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 238, 20, 16, 'It''s very interesting, this is a word we use very often: the backslider.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 238, 21, 16, 'Now I''ll tell you something. This is the only place in the entire bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 238, 22, 16, 'where you find the word backslider. It''s just something interesting we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 238, 23, 16, 'can keep in mind. The Living Bible paraphrase is very beautiful. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 238, 24, 16, 'says, "The backslider gets bored with himself, but the godly man''s life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 238, 25, 16, 'is exciting."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 238, 26, 16, 'How is the godly man''s life exciting? Because every day, in each');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 238, 27, 16, 'situation he says, "It''s wonderful to see how God is going to sanctify');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 238, 28, 16, 'me through this situation. This complicated situation here, it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 239, 1, 16, 'wonderful to see how the Lord has brought it across my path. I didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 239, 2, 16, 'expect this today, but it''s come across my path." That which would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 239, 3, 16, 'depress the person in the world, the godly man takes as a challenge.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 239, 4, 16, '"There''s some new opportunity for me to take up the cross, and for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 239, 5, 16, 'Holy Spirit to work mightily to deliver me. This is my quota of evil."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 239, 6, 16, 'Jesus said every day has its appointed quota of evil in Matthew 6:34. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 239, 7, 16, 'have to recognize our quota of evil for the day and convert it to glory');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 239, 8, 16, 'in some way. So life is exciting because each day, the godly man looks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 239, 9, 16, 'forward to how he can take up the cross and overcome! But the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 239, 10, 16, 'backslider, the person who has gone back - it speaks in Hebrews 10 about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 239, 11, 16, '"if anyone draws back, my soul will have no pleasure in him." You know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 239, 12, 16, 'that''s, in a sense, the backslider. The person who draws back in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 239, 13, 16, 'moment of temptation. In the meeting he''s very zealous, "Oh, praise you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 239, 14, 16, 'Lord in this meeting! Though all men deny thee, I will not deny thee,"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 239, 15, 16, 'and all that. But then before the cock has crowed twice, he''s already');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 239, 16, 16, 'denied the Lord three times after he''s gone out from the meeting. In the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 239, 17, 16, 'moment of temptation, he draws back. That''s the backslider: the man who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 239, 18, 16, 'pulls back from suffering and denying himself in the moment of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 239, 19, 16, 'temptation, though he praises God loudly in the meeting. His life is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 239, 20, 16, 'really boring. Out there in the world they say, "We want to have fun."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 239, 21, 16, 'Well I''ll tell you, you can never have as much fun - real fun - as you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 239, 22, 16, 'can have by being a godly man. His life is exciting. The type of fun');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 239, 23, 16, 'they have out in the world brings disease, it brings problems, it brings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 239, 24, 16, 'difficulties, it brings depression, occasionally they have spurts of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 239, 25, 16, 'laughter, but the godly man''s life is the really exciting life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 239, 26, 16, 'I mentioned that this word "backslider" appears only once in the bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 239, 27, 16, '(in the Old Testament in the books of Jeremiah and Hosea "backsliding"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 239, 28, 16, 'appears 16 times or so, but the word "backslider" is only found here).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 240, 1, 16, 'There is no mention of backsliders in the New Testament. The New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 240, 2, 16, 'Testament speaks much more about carnal people and lukewarm people. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 240, 3, 16, 'shouldn''t think there''s such a thing as backsliding and going forward,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 240, 4, 16, 'backsliding and going forward, in the Christian life. You know, we need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 240, 5, 16, 'to understand that the New Testament doesn''t speak of that type of life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 240, 6, 16, 'The New Testament says if you are living that type of life you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 240, 7, 16, 'carnal! You''re not just backsliding and coming back to the Lord in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 240, 8, 16, 'meeting, you''re fundamentally carnal. You''re fundamentally lukewarm.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 240, 9, 16, 'There''s something in your life you haven''t forsaken. There''s not a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 240, 10, 16, 'wholehearted acceptance of the cross in your life. We call it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 240, 11, 16, 'backsliding, but it''s not backsliding. The fundamental reason is: I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 240, 12, 16, 'carnal. I am lukewarm. There''s a fire missing in my life, and I try to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 240, 13, 16, 'cover it up by saying, "I just backslid a little bit there, but I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 240, 14, 16, 'coming back to the Lord again on Sunday." No. That''s why the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 240, 15, 16, 'Testament doesn''t speak about backsliding, but it speaks about people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 240, 16, 16, 'who are carnal and lukewarm.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 240, 17, 16, 'The naive believes everything,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 240, 18, 16, 'But the sensible man considers his steps.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 240, 19, 16, 'Prov 14:15');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 240, 20, 16, 'Don''t think there''s any virtue in believing everything you hear. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 240, 21, 16, 'the mark of a fool. When the book of Proverbs speaks of the naive or the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 240, 22, 16, 'simple, it is speaking about a fool. A simple man or a naive man or a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 240, 23, 16, 'fool is the same thing. One who is spiritually stupid. He believes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 240, 24, 16, 'everything. Jesus didn''t do that. It says he didn''t go by what his ears');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 240, 25, 16, 'heard or what his eyes saw. He listened to the father. We hear something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 240, 26, 16, 'about another brother and we believe it. That shows we are fools.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 240, 27, 16, 'Particularly if it''s something bad, we''re quick to believe it which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 240, 28, 16, 'shows what great fools we really are. The simple believe everything, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 241, 1, 16, 'the prudent man, he considers. He checks to see where he''s going. "Am I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 241, 2, 16, 'going in the right direction here?" He''s careful. A wise man is very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 241, 3, 16, 'careful about taking a step in life. He doesn''t believe everything.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 241, 4, 16, 'A wise man is cautious and turns away from evil, But a fool is arrogant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 241, 5, 16, 'and careless.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 241, 6, 16, 'Prov 14:16');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 241, 7, 16, 'A wise man is careful because he says, "I may step forward here and do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 241, 8, 16, 'something wrong." For example, I heard a brother say, "Whenever I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 241, 9, 16, 'to write a letter or take a decision, I always say to myself, ''I have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 241, 10, 16, 'flesh in which there dwells nothing good. Let me be careful now how I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 241, 11, 16, 'speak and how I act, because this flesh in which dwells nothing good can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 241, 12, 16, 'make me say things the wrong way, write things in wrong way, do things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 241, 13, 16, 'in a wrong way.''" And then he''s careful. A prudent man considers because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 241, 14, 16, 'he has a flesh in which dwells no good thing. He''s careful about each');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 241, 15, 16, 'step he takes, but a fool, he''s arrogant and he''s careless. He''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 241, 16, 16, 'careless in his speech and careless in his actions.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 241, 17, 16, 'A quick tempered man acts foolishly,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 241, 18, 16, 'And a man of evil devices is hated.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 241, 19, 16, 'Prov 14:17');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 241, 20, 16, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 241, 21, 16, 'People with a hot temper do foolish things; wiser people remain calm.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 241, 22, 16, 'Prov 14:17, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 241, 23, 16, 'We''ve considered the verse in Ecclesiastes 7:9 which says, "Anger dwells');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 241, 24, 16, '(or resides. Resides means it has a permanent house) in the bosom of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 241, 25, 16, 'fools." One way you can make out a fool is by the fact that he loses his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 241, 26, 16, 'temper. A person who loses his temper has something that has made a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 241, 27, 16, 'permanent house inside his heart, and that thing is anger. And by that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 241, 28, 16, 'anger coming forth, the person proves to everyone that he is a fool.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 242, 1, 16, 'When you hear someone shouting and losing his temper, listen carefully');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 242, 2, 16, 'and you''ll hear what he''s saying, "I am a fool! Did you hear it? Hear it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 242, 3, 16, 'again. I am a fool!" That''s what a person is saying when he loses his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 242, 4, 16, 'temper. That which is residing inside has popped its head out of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 242, 5, 16, 'house. The fool may put it back in for a little while, but it''s still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 242, 6, 16, 'living there. Anger resides permanently in the heart of a fool. We have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 242, 7, 16, 'to drive it out! Otherwise we''ll never be wise. Never. That''s why we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 242, 8, 16, 'have to humble ourselves and ask for grace. Don''t let that wretched evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 242, 9, 16, 'thing build a permanent home inside you, brother or sister. It''s made a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 242, 10, 16, 'permanent home in all the millions of the children of Adam, but once we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 242, 11, 16, 'become children of God, it is God''s intention that we drive that thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 242, 12, 16, 'out by the Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 242, 13, 16, 'The simpleton is crowned with folly; the wise man is crowned with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 242, 14, 16, 'knowledge.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 242, 15, 16, 'Prov 14:18, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 242, 16, 16, 'You see, we can crown ourselves by our foolishness and the stupidity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 242, 17, 16, 'with which we say things and do things, or we can crown ourselves with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 242, 18, 16, 'wisdom, with the peaceableness and gentleness with which we do things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 242, 19, 16, 'That''s a crown. It''s the fool''s crown and the wise man''s crown.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 242, 20, 16, 'The evil will bow down before the good, And the wicked at the gates of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 242, 21, 16, 'the righteous.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 242, 22, 16, 'Prov 14:19');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 242, 23, 16, 'Of course that''s going to take place in eternity. "...And the wicked at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 242, 24, 16, 'the gates of the righteous." That is a word which will be fulfilled when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 242, 25, 16, 'Jesus sets up his kingdom on this earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 242, 26, 16, 'The poor is hated even by his neighbor,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 242, 27, 16, 'But those who love the rich are many.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 242, 28, 16, 'Prov 14:20');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 243, 1, 16, 'Why do people love the rich? Because they love money. That''s all. Those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 243, 2, 16, 'who love rich people must know very clearly that they love money. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 243, 3, 16, 'those who don''t love poor people must also know that they love money.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 243, 4, 16, 'That''s the reason. That''s why the world is full of people who love the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 243, 5, 16, 'rich and don''t care for the poor, because they love money. And a church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 243, 6, 16, 'in which the rich person is given a special place like we read in James');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 243, 7, 16, '2, and the poor person is despised because of his poverty, we can say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 243, 8, 16, 'that is a church whose God is money. It is. Even though they speak about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 243, 9, 16, 'Jesus Christ. Actually Jesus Christ is outside the door of such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 243, 10, 16, 'church. Their God is money because they give place to the person who has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 243, 11, 16, 'money. That''s a description of the world. That shouldn''t be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 243, 12, 16, 'description of the church. Unfortunately it is a description of a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 243, 13, 16, 'Christendom today, but we praise God that that spirit will have no place');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 243, 14, 16, 'in our midst.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 243, 15, 16, 'He who despises his neighbor sins, But happy is he who is gracious to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 243, 16, 16, 'the poor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 243, 17, 16, 'Prov 14:21');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 243, 18, 16, 'God has allowed poor people to exist so that he can test us. If he had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 243, 19, 16, 'made everybody equal like Communism tries to do, there would be a test');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 243, 20, 16, 'which God would not be able to apply to many people. In the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 243, 21, 16, 'Testament in Deuteronomy 15, there''s an amazing apparent contradiction.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 243, 22, 16, 'Deuteronomy 15:4 says, "There will be no poor among you." You hear that?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 243, 23, 16, 'That is the will of God. In the Old Testament, it was not God''s will for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 243, 24, 16, 'any person to be poor. If a man honored the Lord with his substance, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 243, 25, 16, 'Lord would bless his barns. If he dishonored the Lord, that was the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 243, 26, 16, 'reason for his poverty. "There will be no poor among you, since the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 243, 27, 16, 'will surely bless you in the land... if only you listen obediently to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 243, 28, 16, 'the voice of the Lord your God" (verses 4-5). Of course, if they didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 244, 1, 16, 'listen, then the condition would not be fulfilled. Since God knew that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 244, 2, 16, 'most of them wouldn''t listen, therefore he said in verse 11, "The poor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 244, 3, 16, 'will never cease to be in the land." You see that? It looks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 244, 4, 16, 'contradictory, but it isn''t. What God was saying was, "There will be no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 244, 5, 16, 'poor people in your midst, if you obey the word of God. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 244, 6, 16, 'unfortunately since I already know that most of you are not interested');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 244, 7, 16, 'in obeying, there will be some poor people always in your midst. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 244, 8, 16, 'when you see that man, be merciful to him and open your hand and bless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 244, 9, 16, 'him." Of course, do this with wisdom. Don''t be foolish in your giving.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 244, 10, 16, 'But generosity is the test for us when we consider those who are in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 244, 11, 16, 'need. "Happy is he who is gracious to the poor." "It is more blessed to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 244, 12, 16, 'give than to receive."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 244, 13, 16, 'Will they not go astray who devise evil?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 244, 14, 16, 'But kindness and truth will be to those who devise good.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 244, 15, 16, 'Prov 14:22');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 244, 16, 16, 'This verse is referring to what we scheme and plan. The word of God says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 244, 17, 16, 'in Hebrews 10:24 that we are to consider in our minds how to provoke one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 244, 18, 16, 'another to love and good works. It speaks there in the previous verses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 244, 19, 16, 'about the New and Living Way (Hebrews 10:20), entering the most holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 244, 20, 16, 'place by the blood of Jesus - who is our high priest - and then it tells');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 244, 21, 16, 'us in verse 24 what we are to do once we get inside the most holy place.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 244, 22, 16, 'What are we to do there? We have to consider how to do some good to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 244, 23, 16, 'someone else. How can I stir up some love by doing some good to someone?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 244, 24, 16, 'That''s what''s spoken of in this proverb: kindness and truth. Or grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 244, 25, 16, 'and truth. Grace and truth is the divine nature which will be given to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 244, 26, 16, 'those who desire good and who devise good - who are scheming and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 244, 27, 16, 'planning something good like God silently plans in love for us. To plan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 244, 28, 16, 'and to think of something good that we can do for one another. On the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 245, 1, 16, 'opposite side are those who plan and scheme for evil. They have the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 245, 2, 16, 'spirit of the world, and that is why they go astray. You see, if our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 245, 3, 16, 'mind is dwelling upon good, then God is able to lead us down the right');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 245, 4, 16, 'path.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 245, 5, 16, 'In all labor there is profit, But mere talk leads only to poverty.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 245, 6, 16, 'Prov 14:23');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 245, 7, 16, 'Here is a verse that tells us that there is only one type of labor in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 245, 8, 16, 'the whole world which does not bring any profit or any results. All');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 245, 9, 16, 'types of labor in the world bring profit, but there''s one type of labor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 245, 10, 16, 'which brings poverty: when we labor to use our tongue. And the more we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 245, 11, 16, 'have the habit of speaking and speaking and speaking and speaking and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 245, 12, 16, 'never stopping - when we have no control over our tongue - that, Solomon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 245, 13, 16, 'says, is the surest way to become poor. It''s the only labor in the whole');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 245, 14, 16, 'world which brings no profit at all. In all labor there is profit,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 245, 15, 16, 'except in constant talking.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 245, 16, 16, 'The crown of the wise is their riches,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 245, 17, 16, 'But the folly of fools is foolishness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 245, 18, 16, 'Prov 14:24');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 245, 19, 16, 'The crown of the wise is their spiritual riches. Similar to what we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 245, 20, 16, 'considered earlier, that wisdom is like a crown. In other words, when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 245, 21, 16, 'the New Testament speaks about our being kings and priests, it is wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 245, 22, 16, 'that makes us a king. We can be kings, but if we act foolishly, we don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 245, 23, 16, 'have a crown. The crown of the wise is their spiritual wealth. And so we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 245, 24, 16, 'see wisdom is what makes us kings.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 245, 25, 16, 'A truthful witness saves lives,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 245, 26, 16, 'But he who utters lies is treacherous.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 245, 27, 16, 'Prov 14:25');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 245, 28, 16, 'Notice again the emphasis in the book of Proverbs on speaking the truth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 246, 1, 16, 'Speaking the truth is one of the things that''s emphasized again and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 246, 2, 16, 'again in the book of Proverbs. When we come across something in the book');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 246, 3, 16, 'of Proverbs which is repeated a number of times, we know that that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 246, 4, 16, 'something which the Holy Spirit is really trying to emphasize. Telling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 246, 5, 16, 'the truth does not come naturally to us. We speak the truth when it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 246, 6, 16, 'convenient, but in a tight spot we face the test of whether we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 246, 7, 16, 'really truthful. The test of whether we are truthful or not is when we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 246, 8, 16, 'are in a difficult situation and we can easily tell a lie and get out.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 246, 9, 16, 'That''s the time we are tested whether we are truthful or not.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 246, 10, 16, 'In the fear of the Lord, there is strong confidence,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 246, 11, 16, 'And his children will have refuge.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 246, 12, 16, 'Prov 14:26');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 246, 13, 16, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 246, 14, 16, 'Reverence for the Lord gives confidence and security to a man and his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 246, 15, 16, 'family.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 246, 16, 16, 'Prov 14:26, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 246, 17, 16, 'This is the type of thing which the life insurance corporation tries to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 246, 18, 16, 'tell you they can give you. But Proverbs tells us here, it''s the fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 246, 19, 16, 'and reverence for the Lord which alone can give a man confidence and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 246, 20, 16, 'security - not only for himself but for his family. This is one thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 246, 21, 16, 'that comes very often in the scriptures: that when a man fears God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 246, 22, 16, 'lives in reverence for God in his life, the blessing which comes upon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 246, 23, 16, 'his life not only affects him, it affects his whole family. It''s a very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 246, 24, 16, 'blessed family indeed that has at the head of that home a man who has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 246, 25, 16, 'reverence for God, who''s careful to fear God in his speech and to fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 246, 26, 16, 'God in obedience to his commandments in the home. Such a home will truly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 246, 27, 16, 'be blessed. Reverence for the Lord brings confidence and security.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 246, 28, 16, 'There''s no insecurity in the lives of those who fear God. There need not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 247, 1, 16, 'be in their families either. Their children have a refuge, it says.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 247, 2, 16, 'Think about the blessing which we can bring upon our children if we fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 247, 3, 16, 'God, even if we don''t have much money to give them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 247, 4, 16, 'The fear of the Lord is a fountain of life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 247, 5, 16, 'That one may avoid the snares of death.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 247, 6, 16, 'Prov 14:27');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 247, 7, 16, 'He''s speaking about the same thing again: that the fear of the Lord is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 247, 8, 16, 'like a bubbling spring that keeps on springing up that protects us from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 247, 9, 16, 'all the snares of death. The devil''s got many traps laid out ahead of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 247, 10, 16, 'us. We don''t know all those traps, but the fear of the Lord protects us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 247, 11, 16, 'from all of them. I remember when I was in the Navy and our ships used');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 247, 12, 16, 'to come into unknown harbors, harbors that we had never come to before -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 247, 13, 16, 'new harbors in some foreign country - and on the chart there would be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 247, 14, 16, 'marked out a channel. And when you looked out into the harbor, there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 247, 15, 16, 'were buoys marking the left and the right side, and in between those two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 247, 16, 16, 'buoys was the safe channel. That way we didn''t need to know where all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 247, 17, 16, 'the rocks were. There may have been a rock there, there may not have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 247, 18, 16, 'been a rock there. It didn''t disturb me because if we stuck in the safe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 247, 19, 16, 'channel, we didn''t need to know where the rocks were or where the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 247, 20, 16, 'shallow ground was. We didn''t hit any of them because the safe channel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 247, 21, 16, 'was marked out by those buoys, and by staying between them you would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 247, 22, 16, 'reach the harbor safely. I''ve often thought of that. There may be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 247, 23, 16, 'million traps that the devil has for believers. When am I going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 247, 24, 16, 'discover all of them? It may take me a lifetime to discover all of them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 247, 25, 16, 'but I don''t need to know where all those million traps are. If I know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 247, 26, 16, 'the safe channel, I will avoid all those rocks and shallow ground on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 247, 27, 16, 'which I can make shipwreck of my life. And that safe channel, it says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 247, 28, 16, 'here, is the fear of the Lord. You can avoid all these traps which the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 248, 1, 16, 'devil has for us by fearing of the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 248, 2, 16, 'In a multitude of people is a king''s glory,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 248, 3, 16, 'But in the dearth of people is a prince''s ruin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 248, 4, 16, 'Prov 14:28');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 248, 5, 16, 'That is absolutely true of people in the world. They glory in numbers,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 248, 6, 16, 'in quantity. A company glories in its output in terms of quantity,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 248, 7, 16, 'income, profit, numbers. Churches glory in their numbers and their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 248, 8, 16, 'offerings. That''s a mark that those churches have become like worldly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 248, 9, 16, 'companies. But that''s not true for those of us who have come into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 248, 10, 16, 'New Covenant. No. In the New Covenant, what is it that we glory in?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 248, 11, 16, 'In the Good News Translation, the verse says: "A king''s greatness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 248, 12, 16, 'depends on how many people he rules." In the world, if a king rules over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 248, 13, 16, '10 million people, that''s a big thing. But how does that apply to us in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 248, 14, 16, 'the New Covenant? We are also kings, spiritual kings. We can read it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 248, 15, 16, 'like this. The spiritual kings of the New Covenant, their greatness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 248, 16, 16, 'depends on how many lusts in their own flesh they rule, how many lusts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 248, 17, 16, 'in their own flesh they have conquered. This is the mark of a New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 248, 18, 16, 'Covenant king. That this lust and that lust and the other lust - I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 248, 19, 16, 'ruling over them now. And how poor a king he is who can count only two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 248, 20, 16, 'or three things he''s conquered in his life. Think of those who have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 248, 21, 16, 'conquered almost nothing after being believers for so many years. "In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 248, 22, 16, 'the dearth of people is a prince''s ruin." Without them he''s nothing!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 248, 23, 16, 'Haven''t conquered anything? Don''t rule over anything? You''re nothing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 248, 24, 16, 'That is what we must remember as kings.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 248, 25, 16, 'If you stay calm, you are wise, but if you have a hot temper, you only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 248, 26, 16, 'show how stupid you are.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 248, 27, 16, 'Prov 14:29, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 248, 28, 16, 'We already considered this before. This is another thing that the book');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 249, 1, 16, 'of Proverbs repeats. Think that the Holy Spirit has seen fit to repeat');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 249, 2, 16, 'it in the same chapter again: when you lose your temper, you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 249, 3, 16, 'proclaiming loudly, "I am a fool! You hear that? I am a fool!" And I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 249, 4, 16, 'lose my temper again, and I''m yelling to everybody, "I am a fool! You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 249, 5, 16, 'didn''t hear me last time? I''m telling you again. I am a fool!" The mark');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 249, 6, 16, 'of a person who''s a fool.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 249, 7, 16, 'In The Living Bible it says, "A wise man controls his temper. He knows');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 249, 8, 16, 'that anger causes mistakes." It can make him make mistakes, and that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 249, 9, 16, 'why he controls it. He really learns to die here. See, he knows that he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 249, 10, 16, 'can do so many foolish things that can ruin relationships, ruin his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 249, 11, 16, 'life, ruin the glory that can be his in eternity. Therefore, he''s wise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 249, 12, 16, 'A tranquil heart is life to the body,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 249, 13, 16, 'But passion is rottenness to the bones.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 249, 14, 16, 'Prov 14:30');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 249, 15, 16, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 249, 16, 16, 'A relaxed attitude lengthens a man''s life; jealousy rots it away.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 249, 17, 16, 'Prov 14:30, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 249, 18, 16, 'Passion kills you. We speak in the church about entering into God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 249, 19, 16, 'rest. When we enter into rest, it affects not only our spirit, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 249, 20, 16, 'affects our body too. I mean even the doctors have discovered that when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 249, 21, 16, 'you''re tense and worked up, it can work up allergies in your system,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 249, 22, 16, 'aggravate allergies and cause asthma and rheumatoid arthritis and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 249, 23, 16, 'migraines and so many other things. I''m not saying passion is the only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 249, 24, 16, 'cause, but some of these things like arthritis and migraines and asthma');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 249, 25, 16, 'get aggravated by passion and uncontrolled lusts. It''s good for us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 249, 26, 16, 'judge ourselves and see if we are at rest, so that even if we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 249, 27, 16, 'certain physical infirmities in our body, they are not due to spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 249, 28, 16, 'causes. I''m not saying that every sickness is due to a spiritual cause,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 250, 1, 16, 'but I do say that a lot of sicknesses get aggravated by spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 250, 2, 16, 'causes. There may be a physical cause, but the spiritual cause puts some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 250, 3, 16, 'more fuel into the fire and it becomes worse. It''s really true - even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 250, 4, 16, 'doctors have discovered that. So it''s good to enter into rest. A relaxed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 250, 5, 16, 'attitude lengthens a man''s life. Jealousy and passion and tension and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 250, 6, 16, 'anger against someone - they are like a cancer. That''s what the GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 250, 7, 16, 'says: jealousy is like a cancer. If you''re jealous of someone, you covet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 250, 8, 16, 'what he has, you''re not happy with what he has - you don''t realize');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 250, 9, 16, 'that''s a cancer, eating away your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 250, 10, 16, 'He who oppresses the poor taunts his Maker,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 250, 11, 16, 'But he who is gracious to the needy honors Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 250, 12, 16, 'Prov 14:31');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 250, 13, 16, 'Here''s one way we can honor God: by considering the poor and the needy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 250, 14, 16, 'The wicked is thrust down (that is into Hell) by his wrongdoing,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 250, 15, 16, 'But the righteous has a refuge (in paradise, the presence of God) when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 250, 16, 16, 'he dies.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 250, 17, 16, 'Prov 14:32');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 250, 18, 16, 'In other words, it''s not God who sends a man to Hell. It says in verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 250, 19, 16, '32 the wicked is thrust down by what? By his own sins! He himself! His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 250, 20, 16, 'own sins push him down into an eternal separation from God. But the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 250, 21, 16, 'righteous has a refuge when he dies.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 250, 22, 16, 'Wisdom rests in the heart of one who has understanding,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 250, 23, 16, 'But in the hearts of fools it is made known.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 250, 24, 16, 'Prov 14:33');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 250, 25, 16, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 250, 26, 16, 'Wisdom is in every thought of intelligent people; fools know nothing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 250, 27, 16, 'about wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 250, 28, 16, 'Prov 14:33, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 251, 1, 16, 'The Good News Translation provides a very beautiful paraphrase. Think,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 251, 2, 16, 'brothers and sisters, to be able to come to that place where in every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 251, 3, 16, 'thought I''m seeking to find out, "Is that the wisest way to do it? Is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 251, 4, 16, 'that the wisest way to speak? Is that the wisest way to speak to my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 251, 5, 16, 'neighbor who''s causing that problem? Is that the wisest way to speak to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 251, 6, 16, 'my husband or my wife? Is that the wisest way to speak to my children?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 251, 7, 16, 'Here is a way. It''s a good way. But is it the wisest way?" That is what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 251, 8, 16, 'a wise man is always seeking, to press on to perfection until wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 251, 9, 16, 'comes into his every thought. That''s really wonderful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 251, 10, 16, 'Another translation says, "Wisdom feels comfortable in a wise man''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 251, 11, 16, 'heart, but very uncomfortable in the heart of a fool." Wisdom doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 251, 12, 16, 'seem to find a place in this foolish man who claims to be a believer and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 251, 13, 16, 'who speaks all types of stupid things. Wisdom the whole time is getting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 251, 14, 16, 'very uncomfortable because this person is losing his temper and getting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 251, 15, 16, 'jealous about somebody else and backbiting against someone else. Here is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 251, 16, 16, 'wisdom trying to dwell in the heart of this believer but is always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 251, 17, 16, 'uncomfortable. We need to ask ourselves, "Does wisdom feel at home in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 251, 18, 16, 'heart? Does wisdom feel comfortable and at home in the way I speak, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 251, 19, 16, 'way I behave, the way I conduct myself?" If not, wisdom may not leave me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 251, 20, 16, '- because she still loves me - but she''s feeling very uncomfortable. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 251, 21, 16, 'know how it is: you go and live in somebody''s house, and you see the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 251, 22, 16, 'husband yelling at the wife and the wife yelling at the husband, and you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 251, 23, 16, 'feel a bit uncomfortable sitting there listening to all of it. Think how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 251, 24, 16, 'wisdom must be feeling in the hearts of some people. It''s not a question');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 251, 25, 16, 'of whether some other believer from the church is sitting there and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 251, 26, 16, 'hearing all that is going on, but wisdom is there and feels uneasy,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 251, 27, 16, 'uncomfortable. Think, brothers and sisters, that we can have a heart and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 251, 28, 16, 'a home where wisdom feels comfortable. "I''m happy to live with this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 252, 1, 16, 'person, because this person is seeking to have me in every thought."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 252, 2, 16, 'That''s a tremendous thing. Wonderful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 252, 3, 16, 'Righteousness exalts a nation,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 252, 4, 16, 'But sin is a disgrace to any people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 252, 5, 16, 'Prov 14:34');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 252, 6, 16, 'In the Old Covenant, it speaks about a nation. In the New Covenant, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 252, 7, 16, 'say church. Righteousness exalts a church in God''s eyes, but sin in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 252, 8, 16, 'church is a disgrace. It''s an absolute disgrace. If sin is judged and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 252, 9, 16, 'spoken against and rooted out so that when sinners come into the midst');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 252, 10, 16, 'of that church, they feel uncomfortable and hypocrites feel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 252, 11, 16, 'uncomfortable, that is the church that God loves. Righteousness exalts a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 252, 12, 16, 'church! When we speak about a church, we know it''s not a building, it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 252, 13, 16, 'people. And when each person in a church is righteous, that exalts a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 252, 14, 16, 'church in God''s eyes. As far as nations go, you look at all the more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 252, 15, 16, 'than 200 nations in the world today, and it is impossible to find even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 252, 16, 16, 'one where there is righteousness. All the nations are going down.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 252, 17, 16, 'The king''s favor is toward a servant who acts wisely,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 252, 18, 16, 'But his anger is toward him who acts shamefully.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 252, 19, 16, 'Prov 14:35');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 252, 20, 16, 'We can think of a King''s favor as that of King Jesus - his favor. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 252, 21, 16, 'Lord is pleased with and seeks to bless those who act wisely. That''s why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 252, 22, 16, 'God could say about Jesus, "This is my son in whom I am well pleased."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 252, 23, 16, 'God watched him for 30 years, and God saw that in everything, Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 252, 24, 16, 'sought to act in the wisest way. He had a flesh with lusts and desires');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 252, 25, 16, 'just like you and me, but he mortified those lusts when they tempted him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 252, 26, 16, 'to say something or do something in a wrong way and he sought the Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 252, 27, 16, 'for wisdom and did things in the wisest way and the Father was pleased.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 252, 28, 16, '"The King''s favor is toward a servant who acts wisely, but his anger is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 253, 1, 16, 'toward him who acts shamefully." It''s not an easy thing to be a servant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 253, 2, 16, 'of God. There are a lot of people who claim to be servants of God. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 253, 3, 16, 'most important thing about a servant is that he has some wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 253, 4, 16, 'Otherwise, he''ll be an absolute disgrace to this God who he claims to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 253, 5, 16, 'represent. Wisdom in his words and his actions, and that can''t come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 253, 6, 16, 'unless there''s wisdom in his heart and in his thoughts first.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 253, 7, 17, 'Chapter 15 Chapter 15');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 253, 8, 17, 'A gentle answer turns away wrath,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 253, 9, 17, 'But a harsh word stirs up anger.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 253, 10, 17, 'Prov 15:1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 253, 11, 17, 'I think all of us have enough experience in this area to have written');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 253, 12, 17, 'that ourselves. When someone is angry, the easiest thing to do (and what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 253, 13, 17, 'a fool does) is to be angry and speak a harsh word in return. Sometimes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 253, 14, 17, 'we can be good Buddhists and control ourselves and control ourselves and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 253, 15, 17, 'control ourselves for the last twenty-five things that a person said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 253, 16, 17, 'against us. But eventually one sentence comes out! That''s enough to ruin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 253, 17, 17, 'all the twenty-five times I controlled myself prior. That one sentence');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 253, 18, 17, 'is concentrated poison at the end of a dart. Sometimes it can be just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 253, 19, 17, 'one harsh word! And there we see our great need to die - to partake of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 253, 20, 17, 'the dying of Jesus - so that when people are angry and upset with us, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 253, 21, 17, 'are not boiling up on the inside. We are cool inside. That person is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 253, 22, 17, 'able to switch on my stove. It''s impossible for him to make me boil. Why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 253, 23, 17, 'in the world do you let him turn on your stove? If he wants to turn on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 253, 24, 17, 'his stove, that''s his business. But I''m not going to let mine boil. I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 253, 25, 17, 'going to die there.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 253, 26, 17, 'This verse is also not just saying to keep quiet. Keeping quiet can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 253, 27, 17, 'another type of Buddhism. Christianity is to speak. When somebody''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 253, 28, 17, 'angry with you, it''s much easier to keep quiet than to speak. To speak a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 254, 1, 17, 'gentle, good word in return is one-hundred times harder than keeping');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 254, 2, 17, 'quiet. When you keep quiet, you treat him like a dog. You''re basically');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 254, 3, 17, 'saying, "I am the great, godly man here. You''re just a dog." Humble');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 254, 4, 17, 'yourself. That person also has a flesh just like you. Humble yourself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 254, 5, 17, 'and speak a good word, gently and softly. When a shopkeeper loses his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 254, 6, 17, 'temper, or your boss in the office loses his temper, it''s arrogant to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 254, 7, 17, 'just keep quiet and go away. That''s not the thing to do. Speak a good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 254, 8, 17, 'word there - a good and humble word. That shows that we are eager to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 254, 9, 17, 'walk in the way that Jesus walked. The opposite of a harsh word is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 254, 10, 17, 'silence. The opposite of a harsh word is a good, gentle word. And that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 254, 11, 17, 'what turns away wrath.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 254, 12, 17, 'When wise people speak, they make knowledge attractive, but stupid');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 254, 13, 17, 'people spout nonsense.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 254, 14, 17, 'Prov 15:2, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 254, 15, 17, 'We must not imagine that everyone who claims to be a believer is wise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 254, 16, 17, 'It says here that when a wise person speaks, he makes knowledge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 254, 17, 17, 'attractive. He doesn''t make the word of God boring. Since we all have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 254, 18, 17, 'the opportunity to share the word of God in the church, we must take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 254, 19, 17, 'this word to heart that whether we speak for one minute or one hour, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 254, 20, 17, 'must not make ourselves boring to people. That only proves that we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 254, 21, 17, 'stupid fools. I think in every church in the whole world, there are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 254, 22, 17, 'people who don''t have light on this. I remember when I was in the church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 254, 23, 17, 'in Switzerland, somebody asked me, "Brother, do you have any brothers in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 254, 24, 17, 'your church who get up and just bore everyone with what they say?" I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 254, 25, 17, 'realize that this is a universal problem. And to make matters worse, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 254, 26, 17, 'people who do it don''t have any light on the fact that they are boring');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 254, 27, 17, 'everyone. They go up and speak a whole lot of nonsense, even though they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 254, 28, 17, 'are quoting the scriptures here and there. We must not develop a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 255, 1, 17, 'reputation for being boring. You may not know what your reputation is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 255, 2, 17, 'the church because other brothers and sisters are kind enough to bear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 255, 3, 17, 'with you, and they don''t tell you the truth. If that''s the case, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 255, 4, 17, 'need to go and ask your wife, because she will be a little more honest.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 255, 5, 17, 'She''ll probably tell you, "You were a bit boring today and you spoke too');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 255, 6, 17, 'long." Or you can go and listen to a recording and see if what you said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 255, 7, 17, 'was attractive.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 255, 8, 17, 'When is it that we become boring? I''ll tell you when: when we go outside');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 255, 9, 17, 'of our calling. For example, if God has not called us to teach, and we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 255, 10, 17, 'begin to teach, then we go outside of our calling. We will also become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 255, 11, 17, 'boring if we go beyond the level of our experience or our faith. Romans');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 255, 12, 17, '12:6 (King James Version) says, "Let us prophesy according to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 255, 13, 17, 'proportion of faith." But often, we don''t do that. We want to try and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 255, 14, 17, 'show that we are mighty, wholehearted, great men of God next to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 255, 15, 17, 'level of Peter and John and all the other apostles, and then people are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 255, 16, 17, 'bored. They''re not fooled. They don''t think we are equal to Peter or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 255, 17, 17, 'John or any such person. They just sit and bear with us till we get some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 255, 18, 17, 'light on ourselves. Brothers and sisters, we must reduce the number of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 255, 19, 17, 'such people in our midst. We must have light to understand that wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 255, 20, 17, 'makes knowledge attractive. If I only have the grace to speak for two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 255, 21, 17, 'minutes in an attractive way, that''s enough. I should speak for two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 255, 22, 17, 'minutes and sit down. As we grow, God will be able to give us more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 255, 23, 17, 'grace. If we really, earnestly desire the gifts of the Spirit,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 255, 24, 17, 'especially prophecy, then God will give us grace. If we are too lazy to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 255, 25, 17, 'seek God for spiritual gifts, and we are not wholehearted about bearing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 255, 26, 17, 'the cross in our daily lives, then of course we''ll have nothing to say.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 255, 27, 17, 'If we are not bearing the cross in our daily situations, we won''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 255, 28, 17, 'wisdom. It is only those who bear the cross in their daily lives who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 256, 1, 17, 'receive wisdom from God so that they can speak and present what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 256, 2, 17, 'knowledge they have in an attractive way. Let''s remember this verse.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 256, 3, 17, 'When wise people speak, they make knowledge attractive.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 256, 4, 17, 'There are two passages of scripture which often come to my mind when it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 256, 5, 17, 'comes to speaking the word of God. I want to share them with all those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 256, 6, 17, 'whom God calls to speak the word in the meetings. Take them seriously,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 256, 7, 17, 'dear brothers. I don''t want to condemn anyone, but I want to encourage');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 256, 8, 17, 'everyone to press on to perfection in this area. One passage is Luke 24');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 256, 9, 17, '- the story of Jesus and two of His disciples walking on the road to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 256, 10, 17, 'Emmaus after his resurrection. He walked with those two disciples to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 256, 11, 17, 'Emmaus, and spoke with them for hours. We don''t know exactly how long he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 256, 12, 17, 'spoke to them, but they weren''t bored! It says in verse 32 that after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 256, 13, 17, 'Jesus left, they said to one another, "Were our hearts not burning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 256, 14, 17, 'within us when he was speaking to us on the road?" What a wonderful word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 256, 15, 17, 'that must have been! When Jesus speaks, people''s hearts burn. And when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 256, 16, 17, 'Jesus speaks in the church today, peoples'' hearts burn. But when it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 256, 17, 17, 'just some man who thinks too much of himself who gets up and airs his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 256, 18, 17, 'ideas, then people are bored. You can''t be bored when your heart is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 256, 19, 17, 'burning. Dear brothers, particularly the brothers who have the ministry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 256, 20, 17, 'and the responsibility of speaking in the church, we must really pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 256, 21, 17, 'that God will give us the grace to humble ourselves and recognize our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 256, 22, 17, 'limitations. We must pray that God will give us such grace that it will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 256, 23, 17, 'be Jesus speaking through us, so that peoples'' hearts will burn when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 256, 24, 17, 'they hear us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 256, 25, 17, 'The other word is 1 Samuel 3:19: "Now Samuel grew, and the Lord was with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 256, 26, 17, 'him, and he let none of his words fail." These two passages have been in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 256, 27, 17, 'my mind for many years. I''ve thought much about these verses and cried');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 256, 28, 17, 'out to God and prayed, "Lord, grant that it will be like that with my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 257, 1, 17, 'words. I want to humble myself, the stupid idiot that I am. Please let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 257, 2, 17, 'these words be true in my life so that when I speak, peoples'' hearts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 257, 3, 17, 'will burn. Like it was with Samuel, I want my words never to fall to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 257, 4, 17, 'ground (as it says in the margin)." It''s a tremendous thing if I can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 257, 5, 17, 'speak ten words and have not even one fall to the ground. That''s quite a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 257, 6, 17, 'high standard to reach: that every word hits home! To attain that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 257, 7, 17, 'standard, we must humble ourselves, seek God, and be faithful in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 257, 8, 17, 'hidden lives. When wise people speak, they make knowledge attractive,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 257, 9, 17, 'but stupid people just spout nonsense (just a lot of ideas that don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 257, 10, 17, 'help anyone).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 257, 11, 17, 'Ecclesiastes 12:10 says (The Living Bible), "For the Preacher was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 257, 12, 17, 'only a wise man but a good teacher; he not only taught what he knew to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 257, 13, 17, 'the people, but taught them in an interesting manner." The mark of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 257, 14, 17, 'good teacher, even in secular teaching, is the ability to teach in an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 257, 15, 17, 'interesting way. Wherever God gives us the opportunity to minister the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 257, 16, 17, 'word, it should be our desire to not just teach, but teach in an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 257, 17, 17, 'interesting way so that people are gripped. That''s very important. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 257, 18, 17, 'wise man makes knowledge attractive. Let''s covet this more and more,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 257, 19, 17, 'brothers and sisters. God will give us grace when we work on this, when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 257, 20, 17, 'we are wholehearted in working out our own salvation, and when we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 257, 21, 17, 'diligent in meditating on the word of God. No man can do this on his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 257, 22, 17, 'own, but God gives us grace.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 257, 23, 17, 'The Lord sees what happens everywhere; he is watching us, whether we do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 257, 24, 17, 'good or evil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 257, 25, 17, 'Prov 15:3, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 257, 26, 17, 'This is a wonderful truth for saints. It brings us comfort that, "He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 257, 27, 17, 'knows every detail of what is happening to me," like it says in Job');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 257, 28, 17, '23:10 (The Living Bible). He hasn''t forgotten about me or my trial or my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 258, 1, 17, 'sorrow or my difficulty. He knows. The Lord''s eyes are watching. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 258, 2, 17, 'knowledge also helps us live before God''s face.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 258, 3, 17, 'It''s this same truth that brings terror into the hearts of the sinner');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 258, 4, 17, 'and the hypocrite when they realize that God is watching them. However');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 258, 5, 17, 'much they may fool other believers into thinking that that they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 258, 6, 17, 'wholehearted people, God sees the hypocrisy in their lives. God sees the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 258, 7, 17, 'unrighteous things they do in their private lives. God sees. The Lord is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 258, 8, 17, 'watching in every place - watching the evil and the good.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 258, 9, 17, 'A soothing tongue is a tree of life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 258, 10, 17, 'But perversion in it crushes the spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 258, 11, 17, 'Prov 15:4');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 258, 12, 17, 'Think of that: a tree of life in the Garden of Eden, and a tree of life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 258, 13, 17, 'right inside our mouths. How wonderful! But our tongues will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 258, 14, 17, 'automatically be trees of life. They can also be, as James says, on fire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 258, 15, 17, 'with the fire of Hell. These two possibilities lie within the tongue: it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 258, 16, 17, 'can be the fire of Hell or it can be a tree of life. Consider that God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 258, 17, 17, 'own nature can come forth through the words that we speak. And the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 258, 18, 17, 'Scripture says that all you need is a healing, gentle tongue. You don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 258, 19, 17, 'have to have great, clever revelations from Scripture to have your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 258, 20, 17, 'tongue be a tree of life. You just have to develop the habit of speaking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 258, 21, 17, 'a little more gently. Say the truth, but with gentleness and a desire to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 258, 22, 17, 'bring healing. Seek to have a healing tongue, not a tongue that worsens');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 258, 23, 17, 'the wound. A healing tongue is a tree of life. It''s amazing how much the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 258, 24, 17, 'book of Proverbs has to say about the tongue. It''s good for us to read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 258, 25, 17, 'it again and again to see the importance given to the tongue.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 258, 26, 17, 'Then it says that perversion in the tongue crushes the spirit. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 258, 27, 17, 'perverted tongue can crush the spirit of other people and finally ruin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 258, 28, 17, 'my own spirit as well. This is a good verse for us to consider.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 259, 1, 17, 'A fool rejects his father''s discipline,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 259, 2, 17, 'But he who regards reproof is prudent.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 259, 3, 17, 'Prov 15:5');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 259, 4, 17, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 259, 5, 17, 'Only a fool despises his father''s advice; a wise son considers each');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 259, 6, 17, 'suggestion.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 259, 7, 17, 'Prov 15:5, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 259, 8, 17, 'The mark of wisdom is to be willing to receive correction and advice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 259, 9, 17, 'from earthly fathers and spiritual fathers, and to consider each');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 259, 10, 17, 'suggestion seriously. That requires humility, but that is the way to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 259, 11, 17, 'wisdom. But a fool doesn''t care for his father''s discipline. He thinks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 259, 12, 17, 'that he knows everything. But the one who considers and regards reproof');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 259, 13, 17, 'values it. He who values correction will become wise. Value correction,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 259, 14, 17, 'brothers and sisters. That''s the way to wisdom. Many have missed the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 259, 15, 17, 'path to wisdom because they have despised words of correction, rebuke,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 259, 16, 17, 'and reproof.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 259, 17, 17, 'We''ve noticed from the first chapter of Proverbs the emphasis on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 259, 18, 17, 'submission of a son to a father. This applies not only in a home, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 259, 19, 17, 'also in the church. If we recognize that someone has more wisdom than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 259, 20, 17, 'us, it''s good to submit to the authority of such a person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 259, 21, 17, 'Great wealth is in the house of the righteous,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 259, 22, 17, 'But trouble is in the income of the wicked.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 259, 23, 17, 'Prov 15:6');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 259, 24, 17, 'When it says that there is great wealth in the house of the righteous,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 259, 25, 17, 'how much is ''great''? A very saintly man once said, "All the wealth in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 259, 26, 17, 'the world is not enough to satisfy the greed of one man." A greedy man,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 259, 27, 17, 'even when he has everything there is to have in the world, is still not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 259, 28, 17, 'satisfied. So how does a righteous man have great wealth in his house?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 260, 1, 17, 'For the righteous man, great wealth means enough to meet all his earthly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 260, 2, 17, 'needs. That''s it. My God will supply all your needs, not all your wants.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 260, 3, 17, 'When we have enough to meet all our earthly needs, then we can say we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 260, 4, 17, 'have great wealth. And all of it is earned righteously. But the income');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 260, 5, 17, 'of the wicked is earned by cheating, stealing, borrowing without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 260, 6, 17, 'returning, and all types of wrong methods. There is trouble that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 260, 7, 17, 'accompanies that income. And when the trouble comes, there''s no use in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 260, 8, 17, 'the wicked person asking God to help him, because he has to reap what he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 260, 9, 17, 'has sown. It''s good to be satisfied with God''s provision for our needs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 260, 10, 17, 'We should be thankful with whatever wealth we have, as long as it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 260, 11, 17, 'righteously earned and doesn''t belong to anybody else.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 260, 12, 17, 'Only the good can give good advice. Rebels can''t.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 260, 13, 17, 'Prov 15:7, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 260, 14, 17, 'Romans 15:14 says, "I myself also am convinced that you yourselves are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 260, 15, 17, 'full of goodness, filled with all knowledge and able also to admonish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 260, 16, 17, 'one another." That''s what it says here too. We would all like to give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 260, 17, 17, 'good advice to others, and that''s a very good treasure to have - to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 260, 18, 17, 'able to help other people spiritually - but there is a requirement that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 260, 19, 17, 'must be met first. The basic requirement is that our hearts are rooted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 260, 20, 17, 'in goodness. So we see that the wise man is a man whom you cannot move');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 260, 21, 17, 'out of goodness no matter what you do or say. If we can be moved away');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 260, 22, 17, 'from goodness towards other people, it proves we are not wise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 260, 23, 17, 'Basically, wisdom consists of goodness. Only the good can give good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 260, 24, 17, 'advice but rebels, they can''t do that. So we see that goodness precedes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 260, 25, 17, 'wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 260, 26, 17, 'The Lord hates the gifts of the wicked but delights in the prayers of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 260, 27, 17, 'his people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 260, 28, 17, 'Prov, 15:8, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 261, 1, 17, 'This is a principle we need to understand very clearly and stand for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 261, 2, 17, 'steadfastly in the church. God cannot receive a gift from a person who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 261, 3, 17, 'has not first given him his life and his heart. That means if we know a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 261, 4, 17, 'person is unconverted and he comes and gives gifts for God''s work, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 261, 5, 17, 'should not receive them. We should not receive such gifts because we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 261, 6, 17, 'stand as representatives of God. God doesn''t receive gifts from those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 261, 7, 17, 'who are unconverted, therefore neither should his representatives. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 261, 8, 17, 'this we see the folly of all these Christian organizations that send out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 261, 9, 17, 'magazines to everybody saying, "Please send us your donations and gifts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 261, 10, 17, 'for this particular project we have." Then all types of people send them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 261, 11, 17, 'money, and they''re not bothered about who sends it in. They just receive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 261, 12, 17, 'it. They''re just happy when they get some money, but they don''t care to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 261, 13, 17, 'find out if the person who is giving is someone who is even entitled to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 261, 14, 17, 'give to God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 261, 15, 17, 'In the New Testament, 3 John verse 7 says of the early Christians, of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 261, 16, 17, 'those who were full-time Christian workers in the first century, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 261, 17, 17, '"they went out for the sake of the Name, accepting nothing from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 261, 18, 17, 'Gentiles" (which is a name for unbelievers). They received nothing from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 261, 19, 17, 'unbelievers. That is a principle of the church: accepting nothing from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 261, 20, 17, 'the Gentiles. We don''t want anything from unbelievers, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 261, 21, 17, 'unbelievers are not permitted to contribute to God''s work or put money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 261, 22, 17, 'into the offering box. We can''t help it if they do it without our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 261, 23, 17, 'knowledge, but we''d like to make this principle clear so that people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 261, 24, 17, 'realize we don''t want their money. God wants their hearts. He cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 261, 25, 17, 'take money from a person who has not first given him his heart and life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 261, 26, 17, 'This was a principle the early apostles were very careful to follow:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 261, 27, 17, 'accept nothing from unbelievers. We must be very careful to follow the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 261, 28, 17, 'same principle.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 262, 1, 17, 'The same principle applies to getting some heathen man to come play a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 262, 2, 17, 'musical instrument or sing a solo in the church simply because he has a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 262, 3, 17, 'good voice. Much music under the label of "Christian music" is being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 262, 4, 17, 'produced now, particularly in South India, by different cinema stars and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 262, 5, 17, 'popular musicians. Do you think God can accept that? No. That is a gift');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 262, 6, 17, 'of the wicked. This music is an abomination to the Lord. He cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 262, 7, 17, 'accept it. We need to see that very clearly. God hates this, but he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 262, 8, 17, 'delights in the prayers of his people. The prayers of the upright, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 262, 9, 17, 'says in verse 8, are his delight - not everybody''s prayers. We know from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 262, 10, 17, 'James 5:16 (King James Version) that "The effectual fervent prayer of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 262, 11, 17, 'righteous man availeth much." A righteous man''s prayer has more power');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 262, 12, 17, 'before God than that of some believer who is not so righteous. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 262, 13, 17, 'prayer of a believer who is not so righteous does not have the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 262, 14, 17, 'effectiveness. Here it says that the prayer of the upright is God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 262, 15, 17, 'delight. Not all believers'' prayers are equal in God''s eyes. Everybody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 262, 16, 17, 'can pray, but if a believer is more upright and more righteous, their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 262, 17, 17, 'prayer is more effective. That''s a principle in Scripture and we can''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 262, 18, 17, 'get around it. It''s a fact.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 262, 19, 17, '1. Are you a born-again child of God?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 262, 20, 17, '2. Do you have enough for your family''s needs?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 262, 21, 17, '3. Are you free from debt (other than a house loan)?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 262, 22, 17, '4. Are you reconciled with all people?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 262, 23, 17, '5. Are you giving cheerfully?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 262, 24, 17, 'More information on these points and the verses from which they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 262, 25, 17, 'derived can be found at www.cfcindia.com/our-financial-policy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 262, 26, 17, 'The way of the wicked is an abomination to the Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 262, 27, 17, 'But He loves the one who pursues righteousness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 262, 28, 17, 'Proverbs 15:9');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 263, 1, 17, 'This is along the same theme as verse 8, that though the way of a wicked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 263, 2, 17, 'person is an abomination to the Lord, God loves in a special way those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 263, 3, 17, 'who pursue righteousness. Or as one translation has it, the one who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 263, 4, 17, '"bent on honesty." Think of a believer who is bent on being absolutely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 263, 5, 17, 'honest. God loves him in a special way in which he does not love another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 263, 6, 17, 'believer who is a bit of a crook, having schemes up his sleeves and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 263, 7, 17, 'clever plans in his mind to seek some gain for himself. He can claim the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 263, 8, 17, 'title of "believer", but God doesn''t love him in the same way. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 263, 9, 17, 'teaches us that God does not love all people in the same way. God does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 263, 10, 17, 'not even love all believers equally. It is a fantastic deception to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 263, 11, 17, 'believe that God loves all of us equally, because not all believers are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 263, 12, 17, 'bent on honesty or are pursuing after righteousness to the same degree.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 263, 13, 17, 'Jesus said in John 14:21, "He who has my commandments and keeps them is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 263, 14, 17, 'the one who loves me; And he who loves me (in this way) will be loved by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 263, 15, 17, 'my father, and I will love him." We see here that God specially loves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 263, 16, 17, 'those who keep the commandments of Jesus, and that it is righteous of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 263, 17, 17, 'God to love some believers more than others. We have to face the fact');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 263, 18, 17, 'that God does not love all of us equally. He loves some of us more than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 263, 19, 17, 'he loves others. This is not because he likes the appearance of some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 263, 20, 17, 'believers more or any such partiality, but because he sees the hidden');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 263, 21, 17, 'life of those believers that we cannot see. God sees some people who, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 263, 22, 17, 'their hidden lives, are bent on uprightness and who are pursuing after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 263, 23, 17, 'righteousness, and he loves them more. You cannot blame God for that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 263, 24, 17, 'That is righteous. That is a law. It''s a fact that he loves some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 263, 25, 17, 'brothers more than he loves others, and he loves some sisters more than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 263, 26, 17, 'he loves others. He is a loving father, but he loves some more than the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 263, 27, 17, 'others because the Scripture says, "He loves him who pursues');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 263, 28, 17, 'righteousness."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 264, 1, 17, 'Therefore, God does certain things for those whom he loves in that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 264, 2, 17, 'special way which he does not do for other believers. God did a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 264, 3, 17, 'things for Jesus, because Jesus loved the father supremely. But we can''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 264, 4, 17, 'assume that he''ll do everything for us that he did for Jesus if we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 264, 5, 17, 'not walking in the same way that Jesus walked. It''s very easy to say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 264, 6, 17, 'that God will do for us what He did for Jesus. It''s true - we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 264, 7, 17, 'potentially say that, but for God to do that for us, we have to love the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 264, 8, 17, 'Father in the same way that Jesus did. Then he will certainly do the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 264, 9, 17, 'same for us that He did for Jesus. All this means is that there is no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 264, 10, 17, 'partiality with God. What he did for Jesus, he can and will do for me if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 264, 11, 17, 'I fulfill the same conditions. And what he has done for another brother');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 264, 12, 17, 'in the church, he will do for me if I love God in the same way as that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 264, 13, 17, 'brother. If I forsake everything in the way that other brother has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 264, 14, 17, 'forsaken everything, God will love me and bless me in the same way - not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 264, 15, 17, 'otherwise. He loves the one who pursues righteousness, the one who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 264, 16, 17, 'bent on honesty, and the one who is bent on cleansing the guile from his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 264, 17, 17, 'life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 264, 18, 17, 'Stern discipline is for him who forsakes the way;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 264, 19, 17, 'He who hates reproof will die.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 264, 20, 17, 'Prov 15:10');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 264, 21, 17, 'The word of God, especially the book of Proverbs, says much about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 264, 22, 17, 'reproof and correction. If we hate correction and we get offended');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 264, 23, 17, 'whenever we are corrected, we are like a patient whom the doctor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 264, 24, 17, 'examines and says, "Well, I can''t give much hope that he will recover. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 264, 25, 17, 'think he''ll die." There''s not much hope for a person who hates');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 264, 26, 17, 'correction. And it''s not a matter of getting offended at the correction.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 264, 27, 17, 'I may keep quiet and receive it, but I may not like it. That''s what it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 264, 28, 17, 'speaking about here. I might be able to keep from saying anything back');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 265, 1, 17, 'to someone who corrects me, but still be offended on the inside. Then I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 265, 2, 17, 'come under the category of those who hate correction, even though I kept');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 265, 3, 17, 'quiet. The question is: do I love correction and view it as something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 265, 4, 17, 'that keeps me on the way of life? If we judge ourselves, we will not be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 265, 5, 17, 'judged. We read in 1 Corinthians 11:31-32 that when God judges us, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 265, 6, 17, 'disciplines us so that we may not be judged with the world. And so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 265, 7, 17, 'strong, stern discipline is for the one who strays off the way of life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 265, 8, 17, 'but whom God delights in. God does not discipline those who are not his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 265, 9, 17, 'sons, but those who are his sons he disciplines very strongly. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 265, 10, 17, 'because he does not want them to miss the way and be judged with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 265, 11, 17, 'rest of the world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 265, 12, 17, 'Sheol [Hell] and Abaddon [destruction] lie open before the Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 265, 13, 17, 'How much more the hearts of mankind!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 265, 14, 17, 'Prov 15:11');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 265, 15, 17, 'This means that even Hell and the bottomless pit lie bare before the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 265, 16, 17, 'Lord. He sees it just like it''s open. We don''t see it, or even know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 265, 17, 17, 'where it is, but before God it is all visible. And it says if even Hell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 265, 18, 17, 'is open before God, "how much more the hearts of mankind!" Think of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 265, 19, 17, 'that. We may say in response, "Well, this is not some very great truth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 265, 20, 17, 'This is something I already know: that God knows everything in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 265, 21, 17, 'hearts." What I have come to see is that if I really believe this - that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 265, 22, 17, 'God knows everything in our hearts - then I will have a hidden life of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 265, 23, 17, 'purity. That is the test of whether I really believe that my heart is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 265, 24, 17, 'completely stripped open before God all the time or not. Morning, noon,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 265, 25, 17, 'and night, the ambitions and desires of my heart, and the motives with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 265, 26, 17, 'which I speak, write, and do - everything is just open before the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 265, 27, 17, 'Regardless of what words I may say to a brother, God sees the attitudes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 265, 28, 17, 'and the motives that are underneath. All of our hidden lives are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 266, 1, 17, 'stripped open before God, and he sees everything. He sees the motives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 266, 2, 17, 'with which I visit people and the motives with which I invite people to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 266, 3, 17, 'my home. He sees every single thing. If I really, really, really believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 266, 4, 17, 'this, it will make a fantastic difference to my hidden life. Even though');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 266, 5, 17, 'people say they know this verse, the vast majority of believers don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 266, 6, 17, 'believe it at all. They don''t really believe that their hearts are open');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 266, 7, 17, 'before the Lord, and that He sees every single thing. There''s not a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 266, 8, 17, 'single thing hidden in any corner which is not open before the Lord. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 266, 9, 17, 'can conceal things from every single brother and sister in the church,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 266, 10, 17, 'maybe even from our own wife or husband for fifty years, but God is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 266, 11, 17, 'deceived even for a second. He sees through everything. If I can live in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 266, 12, 17, 'this realization, what a fantastic desire there will be in me for purity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 266, 13, 17, 'in the hidden life!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 266, 14, 17, 'A scoffer does not love one who rebukes him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 266, 15, 17, 'He will not go to the wise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 266, 16, 17, 'Prov 15:12');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 266, 17, 17, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 266, 18, 17, 'A mocker stays away from wise men because he hates to be scolded.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 266, 19, 17, 'Prov 15:12, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 266, 20, 17, 'I prefer the use of the word "rebuke" in the New American Standard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 266, 21, 17, 'Bible. The word "scolding" has a bad connotation. James 1:5 says that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 266, 22, 17, 'God never scolds. There''s a difference between scolding and rebuking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 266, 23, 17, 'which even our children can understand. Scolding a child and rebuking a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 266, 24, 17, 'child are not the same thing. God rebukes but he doesn''t scold. And so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 266, 25, 17, 'rebuking is a better word here.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 266, 26, 17, 'A mocker (one who is not really interested in wisdom) stays away from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 266, 27, 17, 'wise men, because he hates to be rebuked. One reason why some people get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 266, 28, 17, 'offended and leave the church is because they do not like to be rebuked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 267, 1, 17, 'even in the general meeting, let alone personally. It requires');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 267, 2, 17, 'tremendous grace to receive correction personally, but there are people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 267, 3, 17, 'who can''t even accept it in a meeting through the messages. They get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 267, 4, 17, 'upset and disturbed over a word of correction, and then they steer clear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 267, 5, 17, 'of wise people and mingle with fools who will just flatter them and say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 267, 6, 17, 'nice things to them - all because they don''t like to be rebuked.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 267, 7, 17, 'Therefore they miss the way of wisdom. It''s interesting that the book of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 267, 8, 17, 'Proverbs places such tremendous emphasis on this matter of receiving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 267, 9, 17, 'correction. This is good for us to bear in mind.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 267, 10, 17, 'If you consider a person to be wiser than you, and he rebukes you in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 267, 11, 17, 'some situation, my advice to you would be: humble yourself and accept');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 267, 12, 17, 'the rebuke. If not, you must admit that you don''t believe that person is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 267, 13, 17, 'wiser than you. Of course, we don''t have to receive correction from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 267, 14, 17, 'someone who may be carnal. If you think that someone is carnal, then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 267, 15, 17, 'there''s no need to receive correction from him because he may not know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 267, 16, 17, 'what is right. But if you think that someone is wiser and more spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 267, 17, 17, 'than you are, then the wisest thing to do is to accept correction from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 267, 18, 17, 'them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 267, 19, 17, 'A joyful heart makes a cheerful face,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 267, 20, 17, 'But when the heart is sad, the spirit is broken.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 267, 21, 17, 'Prov 15:13');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 267, 22, 17, 'There''s a lot of connection between the heart and the face. Very often,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 267, 23, 17, 'you can see the feelings of a person''s heart by the expression on his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 267, 24, 17, 'face. This has been true right from the days of Cain when God asked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 267, 25, 17, 'Cain, "Why has your face fallen? Something is wrong in your life." It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 267, 26, 17, 'always true that when there''s discouragement and depression, and your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 267, 27, 17, 'face has fallen, that something is wrong somewhere. A joyful heart is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 267, 28, 17, 'one that has found its joy not in money, honor, or earthly pleasure, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 268, 1, 17, 'in the Lord, and therefore has an unchanging joy. A heart of joy makes a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 268, 2, 17, 'cheerful face. This doesn''t mean that you''ll always be laughing, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 268, 3, 17, 'there will be a gladness in your face. You won''t be in a bad mood. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 268, 4, 17, 'when the heart is sad, the spirit is broken. Discouragement breaks the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 268, 5, 17, 'spirit in a wrong way, in a bad way, so that we cannot be effective for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 268, 6, 17, 'the Lord. This is something that we can ponder on.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 268, 7, 17, 'I believe you could even think of this in terms of the gift of humor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 268, 8, 17, 'The Bible does speak about foolish jesting as something to be avoided,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 268, 9, 17, 'as well as dirty jokes and jokes which are cracked at the expense of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 268, 10, 17, 'others. These are unchristian. But there is also a humor which is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 268, 11, 17, 'Christian, which is a gift of God. Humor is not something that Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 268, 12, 17, 'invented. It''s something that God gave to man. But just like all of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 268, 13, 17, 'God''s other gifts, it has been abused so that humor now is mostly dirty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 268, 14, 17, 'jokes and jokes cracked at the expense of others. But there is a clean');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 268, 15, 17, 'humor which is a very good thing for us to have. It''s the sort of thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 268, 16, 17, 'which is very often the mark of a good relationship between people. I''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 268, 17, 17, 'personally felt that you know that a husband and wife have a good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 268, 18, 17, 'relationship with each other when they can joke with one another, not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 268, 19, 17, 'necessarily when they can pray with one another. It''s possible that a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 268, 20, 17, 'husband and wife can pray with one another and still not have a good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 268, 21, 17, 'relationship. But if they can have a good laugh with one another, then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 268, 22, 17, 'you know they have a clear and good relationship. Humor is very often');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 268, 23, 17, 'the test of a relationship. Seriousness all the time indicates that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 268, 24, 17, 'there''s something wrong. A joyful heart makes a cheerful face, and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 268, 25, 17, 'believe clean humor, which is not at the expense of others, is something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 268, 26, 17, 'which we need to have. I just mention this in passing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 268, 27, 17, 'A wise man is hungry for truth, while the mocker feeds on trash.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 268, 28, 17, 'Prov 15:14, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 269, 1, 17, 'Trash means garbage or rubbish. For example, there are a lot of useless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 269, 2, 17, 'novels that are available these days which come under the category of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 269, 3, 17, 'trash. One mark of a fool is that he spends his time reading all these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 269, 4, 17, 'useless novels. Any person who is seriously interested in being wise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 269, 5, 17, 'would never waste his time reading the useless novels that are being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 269, 6, 17, 'written these days. It''s alright for young children to read these, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 269, 7, 17, 'once we have grown out of the stage of being children, we are not to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 269, 8, 17, 'spend our time reading them. A wise man is hungry for truth while the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 269, 9, 17, 'mocker feeds on trash, particularly the types of books that are being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 269, 10, 17, 'written these days.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 269, 11, 17, 'When a man is gloomy, everything seems to go wrong; when he is cheerful,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 269, 12, 17, 'everything seems right!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 269, 13, 17, 'Prov 15:15, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 269, 14, 17, 'For a miserable man, every day is unhappy. Something or the other is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 269, 15, 17, 'wrong every day because his basic attitude is miserable. There are some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 269, 16, 17, 'people who are generally miserable most of the time for no reason. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 269, 17, 17, 'is because they haven''t understood the secret of rejoicing in the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 269, 18, 17, 'They don''t believe with all their hearts the truth of Romans 8:28 - that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 269, 19, 17, 'God makes all things work together for good to those who love him, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 269, 20, 17, 'those who are called according to his purpose. There is never any need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 269, 21, 17, 'for a true child of God to be gloomy and sad. It''s because of his wrong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 269, 22, 17, 'attitude toward life that he finds that everything seems to go wrong.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 269, 23, 17, 'But when he''s cheerful because he''s found his joy in the Lord, and he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 269, 24, 17, 'believes that everything that happens to him is working for good, then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 269, 25, 17, 'everything turns out right.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 269, 26, 17, 'Better is a little with the fear of the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 269, 27, 17, 'Than great treasure, and turmoil with it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 269, 28, 17, 'Prov 15:16');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 270, 1, 17, 'This means that if, as a result of being honest, you become poor, it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 270, 2, 17, 'better to be poor than to have that little extra money which you might');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 270, 3, 17, 'have gained by dishonesty. It is better to be poor than to be wealthy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 270, 4, 17, 'and have turmoil; turmoil in your conscience and turmoil outside that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 270, 5, 17, 'can come into your life and into your home. Better is a little earned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 270, 6, 17, 'honestly, in a God-fearing way with the fear of the Lord, than great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 270, 7, 17, 'treasure. When we accumulate much more than we need by cheating and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 270, 8, 17, 'doing all types of sinful things, turmoil will accompany those riches.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 270, 9, 17, 'Any sensible person will know that honesty is the right way to go. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 270, 10, 17, 'interesting that this subject comes again and again in the book of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 270, 11, 17, 'Proverbs, that it''s better to be honest and poor than dishonest and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 270, 12, 17, 'rich.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 270, 13, 17, 'Better is a dish of vegetables where love is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 270, 14, 17, 'Than a fattened ox served with hatred.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 270, 15, 17, 'Prov 15:17');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 270, 16, 17, 'This verse mentions vegetables, but in the margin it says something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 270, 17, 17, 'worse than that. It says herbs. You know what herbs are? It''s the stuff');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 270, 18, 17, 'that medicines are made of. It''s not very tasty! Better is a dish of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 270, 19, 17, 'herbs where love is. You see, vegetables can be made very tasty. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 270, 20, 17, 'can even taste better than some non-vegetarian dishes, but herbs...think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 270, 21, 17, 'of that. Better is a dish of herbs where love is than roasted beef and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 270, 22, 17, 'hatred with it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 270, 23, 17, 'Imagine a non-vegetarian husband nagging his wife to cook a fattened ox');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 270, 24, 17, 'all the time. He''s quite content to stir up problems in the house as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 270, 25, 17, 'long as he gets his beef! It doesn''t matter if love disappears from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 270, 26, 17, 'home, because that''s not important to him. He''s an idiot! Better have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 270, 27, 17, 'dish of herbs and have love than non-vegetarian, fancy meals and unrest.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 270, 28, 17, 'I''m not saying that if you have non-vegetarian, fancy meals you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 271, 1, 17, 'have unrest, but what the word of God is saying is that love is more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 271, 2, 17, 'important than the type of food that your wife can cook or that you get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 271, 3, 17, 'in a home. It''s speaking about a home, you see. In a home, something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 271, 4, 17, 'might be cooked that''s not up to the mark. Never mind! If you love one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 271, 5, 17, 'another, even if it''s just herbs on the table, praise the Lord! You say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 271, 6, 17, '"Well, all my wife knows how to cook is herbs. It''s okay. We''ll enjoy it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 271, 7, 17, 'and love one another!" That''s what the word of God says. This is better');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 271, 8, 17, 'than having a fattened ox and creating unrest in the house. It is far');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 271, 9, 17, 'better to have fellowship with your wife than to convert her into a good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 271, 10, 17, 'cook. Fellowship is much more important, never mind if she can''t cook so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 271, 11, 17, 'well!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 271, 12, 17, 'Hot tempers cause arguments, but patience brings peace.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 271, 13, 17, 'Prov 15:18, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 271, 14, 17, 'All arguments are caused by somebody who has a hot temper. The only way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 271, 15, 17, 'to bring peace is through patience, and the only people who can bring');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 271, 16, 17, 'peace are the people who have acquired patience through circumstances in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 271, 17, 17, 'their lives. Patience is one of the most important things that we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 271, 18, 17, 'to acquire if we want to be men of peace. We pray, "Lord, make us men');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 271, 19, 17, 'and women of peace." Well, it says patience brings peace. God has to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 271, 20, 17, 'teach me patience through the difficult situations of life. That''s how I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 271, 21, 17, 'get patience. "Tribulation worketh patience," it says in Romans 5.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 271, 22, 17, 'The way of the sluggard is as a hedge of thorns,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 271, 23, 17, 'But the path of the upright is a highway.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 271, 24, 17, 'Prov 15:19');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 271, 25, 17, 'This is pretty clear. Laziness, it says here, is like thorns. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 271, 26, 17, 'laziness of a man puts thorns along his pathway, and he can''t walk');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 271, 27, 17, 'because of the thorns of his laziness. Notice here in verse 19 that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 271, 28, 17, 'opposite of the lazy man is not a hard-working man; rather it contrasts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 272, 1, 17, '"the way of the sluggard" with "the path of the upright." We can find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 272, 2, 17, 'contrasts like this in many passages of Scripture. You see here that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 272, 3, 17, 'opposite of a lazy man is an upright man. This means that if I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 272, 4, 17, 'upright, I can''t be lazy. If I''m lazy, I''m not upright.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 272, 5, 17, 'A wise son makes a father glad,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 272, 6, 17, 'But a foolish man despises his mother.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 272, 7, 17, 'Prov 15:20');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 272, 8, 17, 'The book of Proverbs has a tremendous amount to say about despising');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 272, 9, 17, 'one''s parents. Particularly when young people are able to stand on their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 272, 10, 17, 'own two feet and their parents have become old is when they begin to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 272, 11, 17, 'despise their parents. Some people despise their parents because the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 272, 12, 17, 'parents are not cultured. For instance, think of an old mother who has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 272, 13, 17, 'been brought up in a village and is now living with her children. She');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 272, 14, 17, 'may not know how to behave in a cultured way with her children''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 272, 15, 17, 'friends, and so they despise her. If you do this, it shows that you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 272, 16, 17, 'a fool. You can despise your parents because they are not educated, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 272, 17, 17, 'because they are not as spiritual and wholehearted as you are. There are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 272, 18, 17, 'various reasons for which we can despise parents. It can be for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 272, 19, 17, 'physical, intellectual, cultural, or spiritual reasons, but ANYONE who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 272, 20, 17, 'despises his mother is a big fool, no matter what wisdom he thinks he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 272, 21, 17, 'has. A person who speaks rudely to his father or mother has no wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 272, 22, 17, 'whatsoever. A wise son makes a father glad, and even if he has to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 272, 23, 17, 'disagree with his father, he will do it graciously and gently. We may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 272, 24, 17, 'have to disagree sometimes with our parents. But do it with graciousness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 272, 25, 17, 'and gentleness, never in a harsh, hard way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 272, 26, 17, 'Folly is joy to him who lacks sense,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 272, 27, 17, 'But a man of understanding walks straight.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 272, 28, 17, 'Prov 15:21');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 273, 1, 17, 'This is stated clearly. A man of wisdom goes in a straight path, like it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 273, 2, 17, 'says in Isaiah 30:21, "Your ears will hear a voice behind you, saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 273, 3, 17, '''This is the way.''" When you''re thinking of a particular course of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 273, 4, 17, 'action and you think you''ll go one way because you sense you can get a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 273, 5, 17, 'little advantage there, you may feel something in your conscience or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 273, 6, 17, 'your spirit saying, "No. Not that way." That''s the voice of the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 273, 7, 17, 'Spirit saying, "Don''t go that way. Go the straight way." The man of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 273, 8, 17, 'wisdom will listen to that voice and walk the straight way. But if he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 273, 9, 17, 'ignores that voice because he thinks, "If I go this way, I''ll get a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 273, 10, 17, 'little gain for myself", he''s really a fool. He has turned to the right');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 273, 11, 17, 'or the left and missed the path.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 273, 12, 17, 'I was reading the other day in a magazine of a preacher who said that he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 273, 13, 17, 'was speaking in a meeting as a young man. He had on a watch which was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 273, 14, 17, 'given to him by his father, and it was a very fancy type of watch for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 273, 15, 17, 'those days and for the simple people who he was preaching to. The whole');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 273, 16, 17, 'time he was preaching, the people were just looking at his watch. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 273, 17, 17, 'felt a witness in his spirit saying, "Take that off." And he thought,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 273, 18, 17, '"Can''t I wear what my dad has given me?" But he realized that if it was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 273, 19, 17, 'a hindrance to other people, he should take it off, even a small thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 273, 20, 17, 'like that. He said that there the Spirit of God began to teach him to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 273, 21, 17, 'sensitive to small things that may cause others to stumble. Therefore,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 273, 22, 17, 'God could lead him on and bless him later in life. So that''s it - a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 273, 23, 17, 'of understanding hears that voice saying, "No, don''t do that" or "Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 273, 24, 17, 'this", and he walks straight, in obedience.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 273, 25, 17, 'Without consultation, plans are frustrated,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 273, 26, 17, 'But with many counselors they succeed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 273, 27, 17, 'Prov 15:22');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 273, 28, 17, 'This is another thing we''ve read a number of times in Proverbs: be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 274, 1, 17, 'humble enough to receive advice from others. We should not think that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 274, 2, 17, 'are so clever and spiritual that we can just go ahead with our plans');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 274, 3, 17, 'without taking advice from anyone. Without consultation, our plans can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 274, 4, 17, 'be frustrated. It''s good to consult others who are wiser so that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 274, 5, 17, 'can give us wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 274, 6, 17, 'Everyone enjoys giving good advice, and how wonderful it is to be able');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 274, 7, 17, 'to say the right thing at the right time!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 274, 8, 17, 'Prov 15:23, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 274, 9, 17, 'The first part is true: everyone enjoys giving good advice. We all like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 274, 10, 17, 'to be those who give advice to people. When somebody comes to us and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 274, 11, 17, 'says, "Brother, I''d like to ask your advice on something," we feel a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 274, 12, 17, 'little nice. We secretly feel, "I''m glad this brother came to me for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 274, 13, 17, 'advice now. I''m really somebody." Not too fast. The second part of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 274, 14, 17, 'verse speaks about saying the right thing at the right time. To say the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 274, 15, 17, 'right thing at the right time, that is the mark of maturity and wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 274, 16, 17, 'You see, there''s not only the matter of saying the right thing. There is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 274, 17, 17, 'also saying it at the right time. Sometimes it may be necessary to speak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 274, 18, 17, 'to a brother about something. Wisdom is to know the right time to say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 274, 19, 17, 'it. To say the right thing at the right time - that''s a wonderful thing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 274, 20, 17, 'A timely word requires a great sensitivity to the Holy Spirit. When the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 274, 21, 17, 'Holy Spirit says, ''No,'' you hold back. If you want to write something to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 274, 22, 17, 'someone, and the Holy Spirit says, ''No,'' you tear it up. You wrote it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 274, 23, 17, 'but you''re not going to send it, because you don''t sense that it''s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 274, 24, 17, 'right time. It may be the right thing, but it''s not the right time. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 274, 25, 17, 'really need to seek God for this sensitivity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 274, 26, 17, 'Isaiah 50:4 says about Jesus that his ears were open in the morning to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 274, 27, 17, 'hear what the Father had to say so that he had a word in season for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 274, 28, 17, 'weary person. He was in touch with the Father every day. Therefore he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 275, 1, 17, 'had the right word at the right time for anybody who happened to come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 275, 2, 17, 'across his way. See, brothers and sisters, we can sometimes think that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 275, 3, 17, 'the only ministry in the church is standing up on the platform and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 275, 4, 17, 'speaking. That''s not true. In any case, we have only about three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 275, 5, 17, 'meetings per week, so the maximum number of times you could stand up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 275, 6, 17, 'here and speak is three times a week. But if we are in the habit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 275, 7, 17, 'listening to what the Father has to say, we can have a right word for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 275, 8, 17, 'anyone whom the Lord brings across our paths, seven days a week. Every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 275, 9, 17, 'day! And that is really the greatest ministry, to be able to hear from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 275, 10, 17, 'the Lord and be a blessing to those who come across our path, even if we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 275, 11, 17, 'never have the gift to stand up on the stage and preach. So don''t have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 275, 12, 17, 'lust to stand up in front of everyone and preach. Let''s have a great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 275, 13, 17, 'longing to have this ability to hear from God and to have a word in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 275, 14, 17, 'season for the weary ones who come across our path each day. That is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 275, 15, 17, 'far more important thing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 275, 16, 17, 'The path of life leads upward for the wise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 275, 17, 17, 'That he may keep away from Sheol below.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 275, 18, 17, 'Prov 15:24');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 275, 19, 17, 'This means there are two ways: one going up and one going down. We know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 275, 20, 17, 'that God created Adam from the dust of the ground. That dust, belonging');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 275, 21, 17, 'to the ground, pulls us downward. The dust from which we are made is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 275, 22, 17, 'attracted to the dust of the earth. For example, the dust we are made of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 275, 23, 17, 'is attracted to gold which is another type of dust. Because we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 275, 24, 17, 'creatures of dust, we are attracted to other creatures of dust, and our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 275, 25, 17, 'attractions are earthly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 275, 26, 17, 'But God also put inside Adam a spirit which is attracted upward. So now,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 275, 27, 17, 'we find in ourselves one pull upward and one pull downward. In the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 275, 28, 17, 'situations of daily life, we decide which pull in our soul to follow.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 276, 1, 17, 'Our soul, we can say, stands in between the body and the spirit,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 276, 2, 17, 'deciding, "Which way shall I respond? Shall I respond only to earthly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 276, 3, 17, 'things, or shall I respond to the upward pull of the spirit?" This verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 276, 4, 17, 'says, "The path of life leads upward for the wise." The path of life is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 276, 5, 17, 'to respond to the pull of the spirit. Madame Guyon once said that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 276, 6, 17, 'life of God which he puts into our spirit has such fantastic power to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 276, 7, 17, 'shoot upward to God. She didn''t use the word ''rocket,'' but that is what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 276, 8, 17, 'kind of power it has. God has put that life in us, and if our lives are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 276, 9, 17, 'not shooting upward, it''s because we are allowing all types of weights');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 276, 10, 17, 'to keep us down. It''s not so much that we have to try really hard to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 276, 11, 17, 'shoot up to God. It''s just a question of throwing out the weights that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 276, 12, 17, 'keep us down. Then, the life of God will automatically shoot us upward');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 276, 13, 17, 'toward God. That is the secret. It''s because of weights that progress is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 276, 14, 17, 'so slow with some believers. It''s not a matter of telling them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 276, 15, 17, '"Brothers, be more zealous!" No, it''s a matter of throwing out some of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 276, 16, 17, 'the weights. Otherwise, even if he becomes more zealous, his journey');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 276, 17, 17, 'upward will still be slow because there are weights keeping him down.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 276, 18, 17, 'The way of life is upward for the wise that he may keep away from Hell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 276, 19, 17, 'below.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 276, 20, 17, 'The Lord will tear down the house of the proud,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 276, 21, 17, 'But He will establish the boundary of the widow.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 276, 22, 17, 'Prov 15:25');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 276, 23, 17, 'God is not our adversary, as we read in the margin of Isaiah 63:10. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 276, 24, 17, 'was not an adversary to them, but here it tells us that he is an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 276, 25, 17, 'adversary to some people - to the proud. If you are proud and haughty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 276, 26, 17, 'and think too much of yourself, we have to say that God is your enemy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 276, 27, 17, 'I''m sorry to say that, but God is your enemy if you''re proud of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 276, 28, 17, 'anything, because it says that God will tear down the house of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 277, 1, 17, 'proud. Imagine that: it doesn''t just say he will ignore the proud and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 277, 2, 17, 'leave them to themselves. That would be bad enough. No! He tears down');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 277, 3, 17, 'their house! In other words, Satan is against them, and God is also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 277, 4, 17, 'against them. Poor people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 277, 5, 17, 'But it says that he will establish the boundary of the widow. The Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 277, 6, 17, 'speaks much about God''s care for widows, orphans, and strangers, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 277, 7, 17, 'they are the helpless people in society. If those helpless people in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 277, 8, 17, 'society will trust in the living God, the Scripture says he will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 277, 9, 17, 'establish them. A principle we see right through both the Old Testament');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 277, 10, 17, 'and the New Testament is that God helps those who cannot help');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 277, 11, 17, 'themselves. In the world they say, "God helps those who help');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 277, 12, 17, 'themselves." That''s a lie. The truth is, God helps those who cannot help');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 277, 13, 17, 'themselves. To those who are helping themselves, God says, "Alright. Go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 277, 14, 17, 'ahead. You take care of yourself." But God is on the side of those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 277, 15, 17, 'come to such a place of need that they can say, "Lord, we have nobody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 277, 16, 17, 'who will help us. We are absolutely helpless." He establishes the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 277, 17, 17, 'boundary of the widow. Imagine there is a widow who has a little plot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 277, 18, 17, 'land, but there are strong, powerful men who are trying to encroach onto');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 277, 19, 17, 'her land. God establishes that boundary and protects her home.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 277, 20, 17, 'The Lord hates evil thoughts, but He is pleased with friendly words.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 277, 21, 17, 'Prov 15:26, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 277, 22, 17, 'This means that God is interested in our thoughts and in our words. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 277, 23, 17, 'way we speak to people is important, because friendly words bring God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 277, 24, 17, 'pleasure upon our life. We must develop the habit of speaking friendly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 277, 25, 17, 'words to one another.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 277, 26, 17, 'Dishonest money brings grief to all the family, but hating bribes brings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 277, 27, 17, 'happiness (you will live).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 277, 28, 17, 'Prov 15:27, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 278, 1, 17, 'As we saw earlier, dishonest money brings turmoil to the conscience. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 278, 2, 17, 'not only that, it also ruins the whole home! There''s no blessing in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 278, 3, 17, 'dishonest money. It''s far better to have honest money.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 278, 4, 17, 'It also says here that if you want to live, you must not take bribes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 278, 5, 17, 'You must hate bribes. Hate bribes and you will live! What a word. What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 278, 6, 17, 'does bribing do? It makes a man partial. When a man gets a bribe from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 278, 7, 17, 'someone, he does a favor for this person and ignores what is right or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 278, 8, 17, 'just in the situation. Since taking bribes makes a man partial,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 278, 9, 17, 'fundamentally, this verse is warning us about being partial. Don''t be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 278, 10, 17, 'partial, whether you get a bribe or not. Don''t be partial towards your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 278, 11, 17, 'children, loving one and despising the other, or showing partiality in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 278, 12, 17, 'any other way. Impartiality is the nature of God, and that is the nature');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 278, 13, 17, 'we are to partake of. We should strive to be absolutely impartial,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 278, 14, 17, 'treating all people equally.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 278, 15, 17, 'In the King James Version, the last part reads, "He that hateth gifts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 278, 16, 17, 'shall live." That is really something, to come to the place where we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 278, 17, 17, 'hate gifts. As children of Adam, we love gifts. It is in our flesh. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 278, 18, 17, 'love to receive. We hate to give, but we love to receive. And even when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 278, 19, 17, 'we say we don''t want gifts, we are secretly disappointed when nobody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 278, 20, 17, 'gives them to us. That is how it is in our flesh. But in the Scriptures,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 278, 21, 17, 'we can see how Jesus was. We can''t say Jesus never received any gifts. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 278, 22, 17, 'woman poured an alabaster box of ointment on his feet, and he didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 278, 23, 17, 'say, "No, no, no. I hate all that." He was normal and natural, able to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 278, 24, 17, 'receive from others. But he never loved it. It''s not a question of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 278, 25, 17, 'receiving or not receiving. It''s a question of loving or hating gifts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 278, 26, 17, 'God may put us in a situation where we need to receive, but if we are in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 278, 27, 17, 'that position, we have to ask ourselves this question: "Do I love this?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 278, 28, 17, 'Is there delight in my heart in getting this?" Then I need to work out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 279, 1, 17, 'my salvation. It''s good for all of us to develop this habit. Even if I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 279, 2, 17, 'keep the gift, I need to work out my salvation so that as time goes on,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 279, 3, 17, 'I don''t find that same delight in me when somebody gives a gift. That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 279, 4, 17, 'the way of life. "He who hates gifts will live," because it''s a law of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 279, 5, 17, 'God that it is more blessed to give than to receive. I cannot change');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 279, 6, 17, 'that law. Nobody can change that law. There is a blessing in giving and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 279, 7, 17, 'there is no blessing in receiving. So, when I receive something, I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 279, 8, 17, 'to say, "Alright, since somebody''s given me this, I''ll take it. But let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 279, 9, 17, 'me remember there''s no blessing in this." There''s no word of God which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 279, 10, 17, 'says there is any blessing in receiving. I can take a gift, but I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 279, 11, 17, 'shouldn''t love it. There is, however, a blessing in giving. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 279, 12, 17, 'himself said, "It is more blessed to give than to receive" (Acts 20:35).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 279, 13, 17, 'There is a blessing there. Remember that God can change us so thoroughly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 279, 14, 17, 'from the race of Adam that we can become the exact opposite of the race');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 279, 15, 17, 'of Adam, loving to give rather than to receive. That is a fantastic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 279, 16, 17, 'position to come to, and we should not think that we have reached there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 279, 17, 17, 'easily. No. It takes quite a bit of working out our salvation to be able');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 279, 18, 17, 'to come to the place where I do not think in terms of getting, getting,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 279, 19, 17, 'getting all the time, but I can reverse my way of thinking and love to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 279, 20, 17, 'give.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 279, 21, 17, 'A good man thinks before he speaks; the evil man pours out his evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 279, 22, 17, 'words without a thought.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 279, 23, 17, 'Prov 15:28, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 279, 24, 17, 'This is really good advice for a lot of people who need to be taught to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 279, 25, 17, 'think before they speak. A modern paraphrase of it would go something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 279, 26, 17, 'like this: Put your mind in gear before opening your mouth. Don''t just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 279, 27, 17, 'open your mouth before your mind is in gear. That means you need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 279, 28, 17, 'think. What do I need to think of before I speak? Think: is this thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 280, 1, 17, 'that I''m going to say kind? Is it a kind thing to say to this person? Is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 280, 2, 17, 'it really true, or is there a little bit of exaggeration in it? Is it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 280, 3, 17, 'just something I heard? Let me think. I find that when my mind is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 280, 4, 17, 'gear, I may have to keep my mouth shut. It says words just keep on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 280, 5, 17, 'coming out of an evil man - words, words, words, words! This is the mark');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 280, 6, 17, 'of a fool. The Proverbs speak much about this. An evil man can just keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 280, 7, 17, 'on speaking, and he has an opinion about every single thing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 280, 8, 17, 'Particularly when people are young, they have a tendency to have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 280, 9, 17, 'strong opinion about everything under the sun. And they are quick to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 280, 10, 17, 'express their opinions too. But that is the mark of a fool. A good man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 280, 11, 17, 'thinks and asks himself before he speaks whether his words are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 280, 12, 17, 'necessary. He thinks before he speaks.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 280, 13, 17, 'The Lord is far from the wicked,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 280, 14, 17, 'But he hears the prayer of the righteous.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 280, 15, 17, 'Prov 15:29');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 280, 16, 17, 'This proves that the Lord is not near everyone. If a man is living in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 280, 17, 17, 'sin, the Lord is not near him, even if he calls himself a believer. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 280, 18, 17, 'Lord is FAR from a wicked man, but he hears the prayer of a righteous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 280, 19, 17, 'man. We see again here the same truth that everybody''s prayers don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 280, 20, 17, 'have the same value. When we come to a prayer meeting, everybody can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 280, 21, 17, 'pray, but there is a difference in the way God hears each person''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 280, 22, 17, 'prayer. It''s good for us to remember that. We can come here on Sunday');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 280, 23, 17, 'morning and lift up our hands and praise God, but God is not listening');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 280, 24, 17, 'to all of us in exactly the same way. The Scripture says he listens to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 280, 25, 17, 'the prayers of the righteous. He sees the life behind that man who''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 280, 26, 17, 'raising his hands and raising his voice in the meeting, and based on his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 280, 27, 17, 'life, the Lord decides how much he can listen to him. He''s not the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 280, 28, 17, 'to everyone. He listens to the prayers of the righteous.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 281, 1, 17, 'Bright eyes gladden the heart;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 281, 2, 17, 'Good news puts fat on the bones.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 281, 3, 17, 'Prov 15:30');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 281, 4, 17, 'That basically means that our physical health is dependent on good,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 281, 5, 17, 'righteous attitudes, and on having clean eyes (eyes that don''t lust and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 281, 6, 17, 'that are bright and clear). Having a righteous life even affects our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 281, 7, 17, 'physical health. Stop criticizing and speaking evil of others. Have good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 281, 8, 17, 'attitudes toward all people no matter what their attitudes are toward');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 281, 9, 17, 'you. This will positively affect our physical health and deliver us from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 281, 10, 17, 'a lot of things which doctors can never heal us from.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 281, 11, 17, 'He whose ear listens to the life-giving reproof');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 281, 12, 17, 'Will dwell among the wise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 281, 13, 17, 'He who neglects discipline despises himself,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 281, 14, 17, 'But he who listens to reproof acquires understanding.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 281, 15, 17, 'Prov 15:31-32');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 281, 16, 17, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 281, 17, 17, 'If you profit from constructive criticism, you will be elected to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 281, 18, 17, 'wise man''s hall of fame. But to reject criticism is to harm yourself and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 281, 19, 17, 'your own best interests.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 281, 20, 17, 'Prov 15:31-32, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 281, 21, 17, 'Here we are back again to the subject which Solomon, the wisest man of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 281, 22, 17, 'the Old Testament, never got tired of speaking on: reproof. The ear that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 281, 23, 17, 'listens to life-giving reproof or correction will dwell among the wise,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 281, 24, 17, 'but he who neglects discipline, or he who rejects criticism, harms');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 281, 25, 17, 'himself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 281, 26, 17, 'In The Living Bible, this verse reads, "To reject criticism is to harm');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 281, 27, 17, 'yourself." Then the New American Standard Bible says, "but he who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 281, 28, 17, 'listens to reproof acquires understanding." The New Living Translation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 282, 1, 17, 'says, "If you listen to constructive criticism, you will be at home');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 282, 2, 17, 'among the wise." It''s wonderful to feel at home with wise people, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 282, 3, 17, 'that can only happen if we''re willing to receive correction.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 282, 4, 17, 'The fear of the Lord is the instruction for wisdom,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 282, 5, 17, 'And before honor comes humility.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 282, 6, 17, 'Prov 15:33');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 282, 7, 17, 'This verse tells us what I believe are the two most important qualities');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 282, 8, 17, 'for true spirituality and wisdom: the fear of the Lord and humility.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 282, 9, 17, 'Humility and the fear of God will make you wise and give you honor in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 282, 10, 17, 'God''s eyes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 282, 11, 18, 'Chapter 16 Chapter 16');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 282, 12, 18, 'We may make our plans, but God has the last word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 282, 13, 18, 'Prov 16:1, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 282, 14, 18, 'This means that God is able to alter our plans through circumstances and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 282, 15, 18, 'through situations by which he prevents us from doing what we would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 282, 16, 18, 'normally want to do. He has the last word. And it is good for us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 282, 17, 18, 'humble ourselves and submit to his ways. We wanted to plan, we wanted to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 282, 18, 18, 'do this, but God suddenly altered our plan and according to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 282, 19, 18, 'circumstances, we ended up doing something else. We must humble');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 282, 20, 18, 'ourselves and accept it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 282, 21, 18, 'You may think everything you do is right, but the Lord judges your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 282, 22, 18, 'motives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 282, 23, 18, 'Prov 16:2, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 282, 24, 18, 'You see, here it''s so clear what the Lord judges. Externally, I can say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 282, 25, 18, 'that everything I do is right. You may think, "That''s clear to me. I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 282, 26, 18, 'doing it right." But a humble man, a God-fearing man, a wise man will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 282, 27, 18, 'say, "Even though I don''t see anything wrong with what I''m doing, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 282, 28, 18, 'recognize that I have blind spots." I don''t know whether you''ve seen one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 283, 1, 18, 'of those optical illusions where there''s a little mark on a piece of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 283, 2, 18, 'paper. You can try it yourself. As the little mark passes in front of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 283, 3, 18, 'your eye, at one particular point, you can''t see it. You can see it, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 283, 4, 18, 'then at one particular point, you can''t see it. There is a blind spot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 283, 5, 18, 'even in our physical eye. When you put the paper at that particular');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 283, 6, 18, 'point, even though there''s a mark on it, you just can''t see it, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 283, 7, 18, 'there''s nothing wrong with your vision. Any eye doctor will tell you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 283, 8, 18, 'that it''s a blind spot. And how much more in our heart and in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 283, 9, 18, 'spirit? A humble man is one who recognizes, "To the best of my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 283, 10, 18, 'knowledge, I''m doing it right, but there may be something wrong. Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 283, 11, 18, 'give me light."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 283, 12, 18, 'A humble man prays the prayer of the Psalmist in Psalm 36:9: "Lord, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 283, 13, 18, 'your light, I will see light. Otherwise, I won''t see light at all." It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 283, 14, 18, 'not a question of being a good Buddhist and cleansing my own soul');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 283, 15, 18, 'through the power of my own soul. That''s not the New and Living Way. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 283, 16, 18, 'New and Living Way says, "If we walk in the light as He is in the light"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 283, 17, 18, '(1 John 1:7), not the light of my own soul. It''s God''s word that divides');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 283, 18, 18, 'between soul and spirit! It''s God''s word that is the light, and that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 283, 19, 18, 'gives me light on what I don''t have myself! I cannot judge myself if I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 283, 20, 18, 'am not going into the word of God! A lot of people try to judge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 283, 21, 18, 'themselves who don''t read the word of God. They''re Buddhists. They may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 283, 22, 18, 'be able to cleanse themselves like the Buddhists are doing, but that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 283, 23, 18, 'not Christianity. Christianity comes through reading God''s word, walking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 283, 24, 18, 'in the light of that word, and getting light by which I can judge and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 283, 25, 18, 'cleanse myself! So he who neglects the word of God will not be a true');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 283, 26, 18, 'Christian. That''s clear.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 283, 27, 18, 'In the King James Version it says, "The Lord weighs our spirits", and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 283, 28, 18, 'that''s a good word. That means that the Lord has a fine balance like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 284, 1, 18, 'what you would weigh gold in. Those gold balances are very delicate, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 284, 2, 18, 'I may think, "My motive is good", but I come into God''s light and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 284, 3, 18, 'discover that even though most of my motive was good, it was mixed with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 284, 4, 18, 'a little bit of selfishness or a little bit of a desire to just hit that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 284, 5, 18, 'person. And the Lord weighs my motives in this delicate balance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 284, 6, 18, 'Brothers and sisters, if we are humble and honest, we will recognize');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 284, 7, 18, 'that there''s a tremendous amount of mixture in our motives; in what we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 284, 8, 18, 'say and how we do things, even in our dealings with one another as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 284, 9, 18, 'brothers and sisters. Why does it say in Colossians 3:9, "Don''t tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 284, 10, 18, 'lies to one another"? Do you think we are getting up and telling lies to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 284, 11, 18, 'each other blatantly? No - but it is in the motives with which we say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 284, 12, 18, 'and do things to one another that there''s a lying element. There''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 284, 13, 18, 'guile there, and the Lord weighs it. If I''m only bothered by that human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 284, 14, 18, 'being''s testimony then I''m alright, but if I look at the Lord''s balance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 284, 15, 18, 'and I see that it''s not exactly in the center (it''s in God''s light that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 284, 16, 18, 'I see light - Psalm 36:9), and I say, "Lord, there was a little bit of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 284, 17, 18, 'mixed motive there," and if I cleanse myself, a day will come when that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 284, 18, 18, 'balance will be straight. And it will be written of me as it is written');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 284, 19, 18, 'of the 144,000 in Revelation 14:5 (King James Version), that in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 284, 20, 18, 'mouth there was found no guile. How is that? They watched this balance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 284, 21, 18, 'and cleansed themselves. Praise God for that possibility.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 284, 22, 18, 'Commit your works to the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 284, 23, 18, 'And your plans will be established.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 284, 24, 18, 'Prov 16:3');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 284, 25, 18, 'This means that you submit to the will of God in every aspect of your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 284, 26, 18, 'future: marriage, job, and everything else in the future. Commit your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 284, 27, 18, 'whole life to the Lord, and he will establish the plans for your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 284, 28, 18, 'The Lord has made everything for His own purpose,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 285, 1, 18, 'Even the wicked for the day of evil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 285, 2, 18, 'Prov 16:4');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 285, 3, 18, 'We read that God could use even Pharaoh to fulfill a particular purpose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 285, 4, 18, 'to show the greatness of God in the land of Egypt. Even evil people, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 285, 5, 18, 'uses to fulfill his purpose! That is a wonderful thing that we see right');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 285, 6, 18, 'through the scriptures, that God always turns the tables on Satan, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 285, 7, 18, 'that the evil that people seek to do against God''s children, God turns');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 285, 8, 18, 'it back upon them and he uses everything for the fulfillment of his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 285, 9, 18, 'purpose. And in the final day, these wicked people will be judged');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 285, 10, 18, 'permanently.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 285, 11, 18, '"The Lord has made everything for His own purpose." That means that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 285, 12, 18, 'is sovereign, that all of creation is in his sovereign hands, fulfilling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 285, 13, 18, 'the purpose that he has appointed for each one. This is why we believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 285, 14, 18, 'that all things work together for good to those who love God and are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 285, 15, 18, 'called according to his purpose, because the sovereignty of God controls');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 285, 16, 18, 'all people and all things, and even the wicked are in his hands, finally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 285, 17, 18, 'to be judged in the day of evil. We can also apply this to when we as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 285, 18, 18, 'believers may find ourselves at the hands of wicked people on this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 285, 19, 18, 'earth; even that evil which is done to us by them, we must see that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 285, 20, 18, 'Lord has even made that wicked person to accomplish some purpose in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 285, 21, 18, 'allowing us to be tempted so that we can be overcomers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 285, 22, 18, 'Everyone who is proud in heart is an abomination to the Lord;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 285, 23, 18, 'Assuredly, he will not be unpunished.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 285, 24, 18, 'Prov 16:5');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 285, 25, 18, 'Many people in the world do not consider pride as a sin. That is because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 285, 26, 18, 'of spiritual blindness. Murder, adultery, telling lies, and stealing are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 285, 27, 18, 'all considered sins. But the word of God speaks much more about God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 285, 28, 18, 'being the enemy of the proud. There''s no verse in the whole bible which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 286, 1, 18, 'speaks about God being the enemy of the adulteress or the enemy of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 286, 2, 18, 'murderer or the enemy of the thief or the enemy of the liar, but there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 286, 3, 18, 'is more than one verse that tells us that God is the enemy of the proud');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 286, 4, 18, 'person. And that is why you find that Jesus could forgive the adulteress');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 286, 5, 18, 'and the thief on the cross, but he told the Pharisees that they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 286, 6, 18, 'bound for Hell because of their arrogant pride. Spiritual pride is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 286, 7, 18, 'different from any other type of pride. Anyone who has spiritual pride');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 286, 8, 18, 'because of what God has accomplished in his life can go to this verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 286, 9, 18, 'and find out that he''s an abomination to the Lord. He''s an abomination.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 286, 10, 18, 'God is his enemy! Satan is already his enemy, but God also becomes his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 286, 11, 18, 'enemy when he becomes puffed up. And that is why we have to fear pride');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 286, 12, 18, 'almost more than we fear anything else. It says, "Assuredly he will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 286, 13, 18, 'be unpunished." And the reason why many believers do not get the grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 286, 14, 18, 'of God in their life is fundamentally due to this fact - that they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 286, 15, 18, 'proud of something or the other in their life. They are proud and that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 286, 16, 18, 'is why the grace of God is withheld from them in their time of need.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 286, 17, 18, 'By lovingkindness (or mercy) and truth iniquity is atoned for,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 286, 18, 18, 'And by the fear of the Lord one keeps away from evil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 286, 19, 18, 'Prov 16:6');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 286, 20, 18, 'We can say that that verse has two parts: first is God''s part, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 286, 21, 18, 'God alone can atone for our iniquity. We can never atone for our own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 286, 22, 18, 'iniquity; it is by God''s lovingkindness and truth (like it says Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 286, 23, 18, 'came with grace and truth). We read in Psalms 85:10 KJV, "Mercy and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 286, 24, 18, 'truth are met together; righteousness and peace has kissed each other."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 286, 25, 18, 'That''s already done on the cross, where God''s lovingkindness and truth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 286, 26, 18, 'completely atoned for all our sins when he offered Jesus as a sacrifice.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 286, 27, 18, 'Lovingkindness because it was love that sent him to the cross, and truth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 286, 28, 18, 'in the sense that God could not shut his eyes to our sins. He had to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 287, 1, 18, 'face up to the truth that we were sinners, so he had to find a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 287, 2, 18, 'sacrifice. So we find that lovingkindness and truth were both there on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 287, 3, 18, 'Calvary.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 287, 4, 18, 'But then comes our part: "By the fear of the Lord, one keeps away from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 287, 5, 18, 'evil." That is man''s part. God has done his part, now our part is this:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 287, 6, 18, 'to keep away from the evil which Jesus died for on the cross. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 287, 7, 18, 'why when a person comes to Calvary''s cross, if he does not really repent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 287, 8, 18, 'and turn from his sin, he hasn''t understood that Jesus has died for his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 287, 9, 18, 'sins. He hasn''t seen that it was his own sins which nailed Jesus to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 287, 10, 18, 'cross. You cannot come to Calvary''s cross without true repentance. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 287, 11, 18, 'mean, any belief in Jesus without repentance is just a hoax. It''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 287, 12, 18, 'deception of the devil. Such a person has not seen that his sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 287, 13, 18, 'crucified Jesus on the cross, because once we see that, we cannot love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 287, 14, 18, 'sin anymore. We''ll turn away from it automatically.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 287, 15, 18, 'When a man''s ways are pleasing to the Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 287, 16, 18, 'He makes even his enemies to be at peace with him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 287, 17, 18, 'Prov 16:7');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 287, 18, 18, 'There are many people who try to harm us in many ways. But it says here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 287, 19, 18, 'that when our ways are pleasing to the Lord, God who is in sovereign');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 287, 20, 18, 'control of everything (as we saw in verse 4), is able even to control');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 287, 21, 18, 'our enemies and their reactions and actions, so that he can make even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 287, 22, 18, 'his enemies be at peace with him. This teaches us that God has a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 287, 23, 18, 'sovereign control even over our enemies, over those who are seeking to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 287, 24, 18, 'harm us. He has power over them. We must have faith to believe that if I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 287, 25, 18, 'please the Lord, all my enemies are in God''s hands. He''ll take care of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 287, 26, 18, 'them without exception.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 287, 27, 18, 'A little gained honestly is better than great wealth gotten by dishonest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 287, 28, 18, 'means.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 288, 1, 18, 'Prov 16:8, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 288, 2, 18, 'There are very few people in the world who really believe this, that a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 288, 3, 18, 'little bit of money with honesty is far better than accumulating a great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 288, 4, 18, 'treasure by dishonest methods. But anyone who has the fear of the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 288, 5, 18, 'understands that clearly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 288, 6, 18, 'The mind of man plans his way,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 288, 7, 18, 'But the Lord directs his steps.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 288, 8, 18, 'Prov 16:9');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 288, 9, 18, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 288, 10, 18, 'We should make plans - counting on God to direct us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 288, 11, 18, 'Prov 16:9, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 288, 12, 18, 'In other words, God wants us not to just sit down in an easy chair and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 288, 13, 18, 'say, "Lord, show me what I should do." It''s good to pray that, but God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 288, 14, 18, 'does not always speak from heaven like he did in Old Testament times');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 288, 15, 18, 'through a prophet or through a voice. He now treats us not like babies,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 288, 16, 18, 'but like sons. Do you know the difference between small children - four');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 288, 17, 18, 'or five years old - and grown up sons? When a four or five year old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 288, 18, 18, 'crosses the road, you have to tell him, "Look to the left, look to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 288, 19, 18, 'right," after every step. "Brush your teeth. Time to go to bed." But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 288, 20, 18, 'when a son is 20 years old, you don''t tell him all that. You treat him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 288, 21, 18, 'like a mature adult. That''s why we find that sometimes God gives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 288, 22, 18, 'specific direction to babies. But the more we grow up, he seems to speak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 288, 23, 18, 'to us a little less in these specific matters and leaves it to us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 288, 24, 18, 'decide. That''s because he wants to treat us like mature adults. So don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 288, 25, 18, 'envy the person who is always hearing some leading saying, "Go here, go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 288, 26, 18, 'there." That''s not the highest way of guidance. The highest way of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 288, 27, 18, 'guidance is where God trusts us to make right decisions - which means we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 288, 28, 18, 'must make plans!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 289, 1, 18, 'Of course, we make plans to do this or do that, to go here or go there,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 289, 2, 18, 'seeking the kingdom of God first and weighing spiritual factors in all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 289, 3, 18, 'things. BUT in all those plans, we have to say like James says, "If the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 289, 4, 18, 'Lord wills, we shall go to this city tomorrow and do this." Everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 289, 5, 18, 'is: "if the Lord wills." That''s what it says here, "counting on God to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 289, 6, 18, 'direct us." He may direct us by making us miss the train, perhaps, or in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 289, 7, 18, 'some way hindering something, or making some door close when we try to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 289, 8, 18, 'go in, or we get turned down in an interview for a job. We make plans,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 289, 9, 18, 'we try to go for that job, but God closes the door. A marriage proposal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 289, 10, 18, 'doesn''t go through. We make plans, but we are to trust God to direct us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 289, 11, 18, 'by circumstances. That is the way the Christian is guided. He seeks the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 289, 12, 18, 'kingdom of God first and his righteousness and he makes plans, but in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 289, 13, 18, 'all of his plans he says, "Lord, I want your will. Block me where I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 289, 14, 18, 'not going in the right direction and open the door for me where I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 289, 15, 18, 'going in the right direction."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 289, 16, 18, 'A divine decision is in the lips of the king;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 289, 17, 18, 'His mouth should not err (make a mistake) in judgment.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 289, 18, 18, 'Prov 16:10');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 289, 19, 18, 'This is a very important verse for when a person has become a king. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 289, 20, 18, 'means he has a tremendous amount of responsibility and he has to make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 289, 21, 18, 'decisions concerning others - like King Solomon did concerning which of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 289, 22, 18, 'the two women was the real mother of the baby. "His mouth should not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 289, 23, 18, 'make a mistake in judgment." That teaches us that the more authority we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 289, 24, 18, 'have, the more careful we have to be with our words. It''s alright for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 289, 25, 18, 'young people who don''t have any responsibility or authority to speak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 289, 26, 18, 'carelessly and say all types of things since they don''t have wisdom. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 289, 27, 18, 'the more authority we have - the king is the highest level of authority,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 289, 28, 18, 'but below the king there are so many levels - the more we have to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 290, 1, 18, 'very careful with what we say. We need wisdom in our decisions.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 290, 2, 18, 'For example, think of a father in a house. A father can''t talk in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 290, 3, 18, 'stupid way that his children talk. No. A father has authority. He can''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 290, 4, 18, 'even descend to the level of his wife. He has more authority. The more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 290, 5, 18, 'authority he has, the more he needs wisdom in making decisions. Think of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 290, 6, 18, 'an instance where God gives responsibility for leadership in a little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 290, 7, 18, 'local church. One has to be extremely careful. That''s why I believe God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 290, 8, 18, 'trains young people to see whether they''re growing in wisdom; to see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 290, 9, 18, 'whether they''re being careful with their lips before he can commit any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 290, 10, 18, 'responsibility to them. This is the reason why God can''t commit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 290, 11, 18, 'responsibility to a lot of people whether they are young or old: because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 290, 12, 18, 'they don''t seem to be growing in wisdom. They take all types of foolish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 290, 13, 18, 'decisions without waiting on God and seeking for his guidance in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 290, 14, 18, 'humility. So we have to be very careful. The king''s mouth should not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 290, 15, 18, 'make a mistake in judgment. The more responsibility we have, the more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 290, 16, 18, 'careful we have to be in decisions that we make.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 290, 17, 18, 'A just balance and scales belong to the Lord;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 290, 18, 18, 'All the weights of the bag are His concern.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 290, 19, 18, 'Prov 16:11');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 290, 20, 18, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 290, 21, 18, 'The Lord demands fairness in every business deal. He established this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 290, 22, 18, 'principle.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 290, 23, 18, 'Prov 16:11, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 290, 24, 18, 'There is a fantastic amount of sin in buying and selling. We have to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 290, 25, 18, 'very careful, particularly when we are selling something. If somebody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 290, 26, 18, 'else cheats us, we don''t have to worry. That''s not so serious. If we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 290, 27, 18, 'cheat another person, that''s serious. If you''ve cheated one person of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 290, 28, 18, 'one rupee, do you know that that is much more serious than another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 291, 1, 18, 'person having cheated you of 1,000 rupees? But out in the world, people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 291, 2, 18, 'don''t look at it like that. They get more concerned when somebody else');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 291, 3, 18, 'cheats them of 1,000 rupees, and they are not at all disturbed when they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 291, 4, 18, 'cheat someone else of one rupee. But for a true God-fearing Christian,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 291, 5, 18, 'it''s exactly the opposite. He''s more disturbed that he has cheated a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 291, 6, 18, 'person of fifty paise than if somebody else cheated him of 1,000 rupees.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 291, 7, 18, 'Fairness. The Lord demands fairness. Let the people out in the world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 291, 8, 18, 'live as they like, but God''s people have to go by this principle. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 291, 9, 18, 'says he has established this principle. All balances and scales are the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 291, 10, 18, 'Lord''s and the weights in the bag are his. He wants to see that they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 291, 11, 18, 'accurate. He''s talking about Christians who are doing business. Don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 291, 12, 18, 'copy the other businessmen and do what they do.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 291, 13, 18, 'I remember a story of a Christian cobbler who always used the best');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 291, 14, 18, 'leather to repair his shoes, unlike all the other cobblers who were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 291, 15, 18, 'using cheap leather. One day his assistant asked him, "Why do you do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 291, 16, 18, 'that? You''re losing such a lot of money." And he said, "I believe in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 291, 17, 18, 'day of judgment when I stand before Christ, there will be a big pile of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 291, 18, 18, 'shoes there - all the shoes that I repaired. And Jesus will pick them up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 291, 19, 18, 'one by one and say, ''John, that wasn''t a good job you did on this shoe.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 291, 20, 18, 'What will I answer to Him - that all the other cobblers did that? No.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 291, 21, 18, 'I''m not living just to make a few rupees more like the other cobblers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 291, 22, 18, 'I''m thinking of what Jesus will say when he picks up that shoe in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 291, 23, 18, 'day of judgment and examines it and asks me about my work." That was his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 291, 24, 18, 'work. He wasn''t a preacher. He was a cobbler. And as much as each');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 291, 25, 18, 'preacher has to give an account for every sermon he preaches, each');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 291, 26, 18, 'cobbler has to give an account for every shoe that he makes. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 291, 27, 18, 'whatever your job is, you have to give an account to God of the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 291, 28, 18, 'you''ve done your job.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 292, 1, 18, 'The Lord demands fairness in every business deal. He''s established this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 292, 2, 18, 'as a principle. That means that in every area where we are involved in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 292, 3, 18, 'money, buying or selling, we have to see to it that we are fair. We even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 292, 4, 18, 'have to be fair to the person from whom we are buying something. After');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 292, 5, 18, 'all, he also has to make some profit in order to live. Put yourself in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 292, 6, 18, 'his shoes. He''s not going around, selling things as a social service.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 292, 7, 18, 'He''s selling things because he has to earn a living and support his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 292, 8, 18, 'family. And I must think of that and be fair to him. I also must be fair');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 292, 9, 18, 'when I sell anything to another person. As we''ve often said: if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 292, 10, 18, 'something is not working properly, tell the person frankly. "This is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 292, 11, 18, 'working. So you can fix a price for that." Absolute honesty. It''s far');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 292, 12, 18, 'better to get a little honestly than to get a little more dishonestly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 292, 13, 18, 'These are the marks of a God-fearing man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 292, 14, 18, 'It is a horrible thing for a king to do evil. His right to rule depends');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 292, 15, 18, 'upon his fairness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 292, 16, 18, 'Prov 16:12, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 292, 17, 18, 'This is connected with verse 11. The Lord demands fairness. Do you call');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 292, 18, 18, 'yourself a king since Jesus has made us kings and priests unto God the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 292, 19, 18, 'Father (Revelation 1:6)? Well, if you''re a king, it''s a horrible thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 292, 20, 18, 'for you to be unfair in a business deal. Consider that. It''s terrible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 292, 21, 18, 'It''s an abomination for a king to go around cheating someone. His right');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 292, 22, 18, 'to rule in the millennium depends upon his fairness now. The New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 292, 23, 18, 'American Standard Bible says, "His throne is established on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 292, 24, 18, 'righteousness." In other words, God doesn''t give me the right to rule in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 292, 25, 18, 'the millennium if he finds that during my time on earth, I was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 292, 26, 18, 'absolutely honest. That''s how a lot of people are going to lose their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 292, 27, 18, 'throne. There are many instances in the Old Testament of kings of Israel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 292, 28, 18, 'and Judah who lost their thrones. God removed them from their thrones,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 293, 1, 18, 'beginning with Saul. All this is written for our instruction. If we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 293, 2, 18, 'unfaithful, God will take away the throne from us. We can''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 293, 3, 18, 'automatically assume that we''ll be sitting on the throne when Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 293, 4, 18, 'comes. That throne is established on righteousness, it says. That''s why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 293, 5, 18, 'he is testing us on the earth today: "In an unrighteous world, let me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 293, 6, 18, 'see who will be righteous." Those are the people that are fit to rule in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 293, 7, 18, 'that new kingdom where "righteousness is at home" as we read in 2 Peter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 293, 8, 18, '3:13.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 293, 9, 18, 'Righteous lips are the delight of kings,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 293, 10, 18, 'And he who speaks right is loved.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 293, 11, 18, 'Prov 16:13');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 293, 12, 18, 'We can look at God as a king here. God, the king of the universe,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 293, 13, 18, 'delights in righteous lips. And he who speaks what is right is loved by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 293, 14, 18, 'the king of the universe. So that is something we can long for - that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 293, 15, 18, 'the king of the universe would love us. And he loves those who speak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 293, 16, 18, 'what is right. Notice in the book of Proverbs what a fantastic emphasis');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 293, 17, 18, 'is placed on the tongue. There is no Old Testament book that speaks so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 293, 18, 18, 'much about the tongue as the book of Proverbs. And that''s why I said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 293, 19, 18, 'that this is like a New Covenant book in the middle of the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 293, 20, 18, 'Testament. There''s a spirit of the New Covenant in the book of Proverbs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 293, 21, 18, 'That''s why it tells us to seek wisdom. It''s a book of wisdom. And wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 293, 22, 18, 'has such a tremendous amount to do with our speech. That''s why we''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 293, 23, 18, 'been exhorted again and again in the church: be careful with the words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 293, 24, 18, 'you say.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 293, 25, 18, 'I want to write especially to sisters, because the New Testament says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 293, 26, 18, 'that women have a particular weakness in this area. They have a tendency');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 293, 27, 18, 'of becoming gossips and scandalmongers, going around carrying tales and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 293, 28, 18, 'stories. It''s a particular weakness of women. It''s not me saying that -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 294, 1, 18, 'the Holy Spirit has said it. The creator who created man and women has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 294, 2, 18, 'said that the woman has a tendency of becoming a gossip. And when women');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 294, 3, 18, 'see that, they will be more careful. Just like men are tempted more in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 294, 4, 18, 'the area of sex than women are - in the same way, women are tempted much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 294, 5, 18, 'more in the area of the tongue. That is their weak spot. They have to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 294, 6, 18, 'careful just like men have to be careful with their eyes. Women have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 294, 7, 18, 'be careful with their tongues. There are specific weaknesses like this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 294, 8, 18, 'in men and women. So that''s a word that sisters should particularly take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 294, 9, 18, 'care of - that God loves those who have so disciplined their tongues as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 294, 10, 18, 'to speak what is right and good at all times.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 294, 11, 18, 'The fury of the king is like messengers of death,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 294, 12, 18, 'But a wise man will appease it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 294, 13, 18, 'Prov 16:14');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 294, 14, 18, 'We can look at it like this: let''s say that the king is your boss in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 294, 15, 18, 'your office. A wise man will know how to handle a situation when the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 294, 16, 18, 'boss is angry. Let''s say you find your unconverted boss in the office');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 294, 17, 18, 'full of wrath one morning - wrath as strong as messengers of death. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 294, 18, 18, 'you''re a wise man, that''s where your wisdom is tested. You go to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 294, 19, 18, 'office and see him like this, and God gives you wisdom to cool him down.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 294, 20, 18, 'Think of that. Think of that ministry that we can have in the heathen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 294, 21, 18, 'offices in the city. That''s a tremendous thing. We need to take that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 294, 22, 18, 'seriously. A wise man will know how to quieten that wrath. That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 294, 23, 18, 'wisdom. Here we see our need and our lack of wisdom, and we can cry out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 294, 24, 18, 'to God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 294, 25, 18, 'In the light of a king''s face is life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 294, 26, 18, 'And his favor is like a cloud with the spring rain.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 294, 27, 18, 'Prov 16:15');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 294, 28, 18, 'We can think again of God as the king of the universe, and in the light');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 295, 1, 18, 'of his face (that means his favor and his presence and the fact that he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 295, 2, 18, 'looks upon us with favor) there is light. God''s favor is like a cloud');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 295, 3, 18, 'with the spring rain that waters the parched ground. Many believers are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 295, 4, 18, 'like the parched, dry fields. They haven''t received any rain. They''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 295, 5, 18, 'not green and fresh. But it says here that when God''s favor is upon us,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 295, 6, 18, 'as we stand in his presence, it''s like a cloud with the spring rain.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 295, 7, 18, 'This speaks of the latter rain - the freshness that comes through the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 295, 8, 18, 'Holy Spirit that makes us green like the green fields.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 295, 9, 18, 'How much better it is to get wisdom than gold!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 295, 10, 18, 'And to get understanding is to be chosen above silver.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 295, 11, 18, 'Prov 16:16');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 295, 12, 18, 'This teaches us what we''ve considered many times in the book of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 295, 13, 18, 'Proverbs: that true wealth is wisdom. In other words, do you want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 295, 14, 18, 'know how rich you are? We''re not to be so foolish as to calculate our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 295, 15, 18, 'bank account or our earthly assets to find out how rich we are. We are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 295, 16, 18, 'as rich as we have divine wisdom in our life. That is: purity,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 295, 17, 18, 'peaceableness, gentleness, mercy, willingness to yield, impartiality,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 295, 18, 18, 'freedom from hypocrisy - everything listed in James 3:17, the marks of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 295, 19, 18, 'divine wisdom. As much as I have those qualities in my life, I''m rich.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 295, 20, 18, 'That''s why the Lord has to say to many believers, "You do not know that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 295, 21, 18, 'you are poor and blind and naked. You have so much bible knowledge and a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 295, 22, 18, 'large ministry and gifts to do so many things. You have so many talents');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 295, 23, 18, '- musical talents and other talents. And you think that you are rich,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 295, 24, 18, 'but you do not know that in terms of heaven''s riches, you''re a poor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 295, 25, 18, 'man." It''s a sad thing when we live in ignorance of our poverty. Wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 295, 26, 18, 'is the true wealth, it tells us here. Very few people understand that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 295, 27, 18, 'it''s better to get wisdom than gold and better to choose wisdom than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 295, 28, 18, 'silver.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 296, 1, 18, 'Think of marriages in India where people think in terms of money. How');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 296, 2, 18, 'much money is the man earning? How much money will the woman bring in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 296, 3, 18, 'marriage? Even among believers. What does it show? They haven''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 296, 4, 18, 'understood this verse. They don''t think, "How much divine wisdom does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 296, 5, 18, 'this man have? How much divine wisdom does this girl have?" That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 296, 6, 18, 'secondary. That''s the blindness in Christendom today, and that is where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 296, 7, 18, 'the church stands as an island in the middle of this ocean of folly. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 296, 8, 18, 'must see that riches are not the main thing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 296, 9, 18, 'The highway of the upright is to depart from evil;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 296, 10, 18, 'He who watches his way preserves his life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 296, 11, 18, 'Prov 16:17');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 296, 12, 18, 'The way of the upright is called a highway. And it becomes a highway by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 296, 13, 18, 'departing from evil. That''s all there is to it. Here it says we have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 296, 14, 18, 'watch that we walk on this way. In other words, we have to be on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 296, 15, 18, 'alert. Jesus often used the words, "watch and pray." What does it mean');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 296, 16, 18, 'to watch? It just means be on the alert. Don''t go to sleep spiritually.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 296, 17, 18, 'Be on the alert! Be sensitive where your conscience is pricking you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 296, 18, 18, 'about that thing. Be alert! You may fall off the way altogether if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 296, 19, 18, 'ignore that prick of conscience in that decision you''re taking. Be on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 296, 20, 18, 'the alert about your way, and thus you can preserve your life. Be alert');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 296, 21, 18, 'about your walk.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 296, 22, 18, 'Pride goes before destruction,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 296, 23, 18, 'And a haughty spirit before stumbling.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 296, 24, 18, 'Prov 16:18');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 296, 25, 18, 'Before a man falls into sin, you can be sure there''s some pride in him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 296, 26, 18, 'Because if he didn''t have pride and he was humble, God would have given');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 296, 27, 18, 'him grace in the time of temptation. God gives his grace to the humble.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 296, 28, 18, 'Why didn''t that man get grace? Grace would have made him overcome sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 297, 1, 18, 'Sin cannot have dominion over those who are under grace (Romans 6:14).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 297, 2, 18, 'Why didn''t the man get grace in the moment of temptation? Because God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 297, 3, 18, 'saw, even if the man didn''t realize it himself, some pride in him. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 297, 4, 18, 'so we can say pride is the cause of falling into sin. That''s all it says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 297, 5, 18, 'here. Pride goes before that final destruction in Hell and a haughty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 297, 6, 18, 'spirit before stumbling.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 297, 7, 18, 'In Luke 16, we read about Lazarus and the rich man who was in Hell. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 297, 8, 18, 'rich man saw Lazarus sitting in Abraham''s bosom, and Abraham told the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 297, 9, 18, 'rich man, "There''s a big gulf between you and us. You can''t cross here,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 297, 10, 18, 'and we can''t cross there." What was that gulf? That gulf is pride!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 297, 11, 18, 'That''s the thing that sends people to Hell. You can''t cross over into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 297, 12, 18, 'heaven if you have pride. It''s not that people in Hell necessarily');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 297, 13, 18, 'murdered and committed adultery. We''ll be surprised to see the number of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 297, 14, 18, 'murderers and adulteresses and thieves in heaven. And you''ll also be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 297, 15, 18, 'surprised (but I won''t be) when we see bishops in Hell. I hope you won''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 297, 16, 18, 'be either. They''re going to be there. Lots of them. Arch bishops and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 297, 17, 18, 'popes by the hundreds, because of their pride in their religion. Pride');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 297, 18, 18, 'goes before destruction; and a haughty spirit before stumbling. You see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 297, 19, 18, 'that haughty spirit even in so-called Christian leaders. That''s why they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 297, 20, 18, 'lose their temper and can''t get victory over lust and are defeated by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 297, 21, 18, 'sin. It''s all because of their pride and their high thoughts about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 297, 22, 18, 'themselves. If there''s one thing that God detests in the universe, it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 297, 23, 18, 'pride. And it''s worse when it''s religious pride.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 297, 24, 18, 'It is better to be humble in spirit with the lowly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 297, 25, 18, 'Than to divide the spoil with the proud.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 297, 26, 18, 'Prov 16:19');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 297, 27, 18, 'This is in contrast to the previous verse. It is telling us, brothers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 297, 28, 18, 'and sisters, to mingle with humble brothers and sisters. Don''t spend');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 298, 1, 18, 'your time with all the proud, haughty people of the world. Mingle with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 298, 2, 18, 'the humble brothers and sisters. Now, there''s a false understanding of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 298, 3, 18, 'humility in the world. Some people think being humble means being poor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 298, 4, 18, 'No. There are a lot of poor people who are very proud. There''s no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 298, 5, 18, 'connection between humility and material poverty. Mingle with humble');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 298, 6, 18, 'people and with lowly people. It is better to be of a humble spirit with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 298, 7, 18, 'the lowly - those who have small thoughts about themselves - because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 298, 8, 18, 'that spirit can rub off on us when we mingle with them. When we mingle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 298, 9, 18, 'with people who are proud, their spirit can rub off on us too. There''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 298, 10, 18, 'wise man who once said, "When you mingle with proud people, it''s just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 298, 11, 18, 'like touching tar." Tar is the stuff you put on the road. If you touch');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 298, 12, 18, 'tar, it''s so difficult to get it off your hand. Just try it sometime.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 298, 13, 18, 'Get tar on your hand and try to take it off. It''s quite a task to get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 298, 14, 18, 'rid of it. If you mingle with proud people, it will rub off on you and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 298, 15, 18, 'after some time, you will get that spirit. So steer clear of these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 298, 16, 18, 'haughty, proud people in the world and this high-society that people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 298, 17, 18, 'want to mingle in. Avoid that! It affects your spirit. Mingle with lowly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 298, 18, 18, 'people and with the humble people of the world. God is with them. That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 298, 19, 18, 'a good exhortation. It says it''s better to do that "…than to divide the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 298, 20, 18, 'spoil with the proud." That means to sit there for the fantastic meals');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 298, 21, 18, 'that the rich, proud people can offer. We don''t want to spend all our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 298, 22, 18, 'time with high-society people and catch that spirit. It''s an infection.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 298, 23, 18, 'We have to avoid it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 298, 24, 18, 'He who gives attention to the word will find good,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 298, 25, 18, 'And blessed is he who trusts in the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 298, 26, 18, 'Prov 16:20');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 298, 27, 18, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 298, 28, 18, 'God blesses those who obey him; happy is the man who puts his trust in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 299, 1, 18, 'the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 299, 2, 18, 'Prov 16:20, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 299, 3, 18, 'This is telling us the two main things of the New Testament: trust and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 299, 4, 18, 'obey. God has given us his word basically for two purposes: that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 299, 5, 18, 'might obey it and that we might trust him (because of the promises he''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 299, 6, 18, 'given us in his word). If we have learned through his word to trust him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 299, 7, 18, 'and to obey him, we can say we are coming to know the scriptures. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 299, 8, 18, 'can''t say we''re coming to know the scriptures when we can quote a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 299, 9, 18, 'reference or when we''ve understood a doctrine. We can understand all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 299, 10, 18, 'doctrines of the bible and quote all the references in the bible and be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 299, 11, 18, 'the devil himself in our characters. The devil can quote all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 299, 12, 18, 'references and he knows all the doctrines. God has not given us his word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 299, 13, 18, 'for that, but that we might obey and trust him. So the more we obey him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 299, 14, 18, 'and the more we trust him through his word, we can say the more we''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 299, 15, 18, 'coming to know the word of God. That''s the test.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 299, 16, 18, 'A wise, mature person is known for his understanding. The more pleasant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 299, 17, 18, 'his words, the more persuasive he is.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 299, 18, 18, 'Prov 16:21, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 299, 19, 18, 'In other words, it''s easier to convince people through pleasant words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 299, 20, 18, 'than through harsh words. And wisdom and maturity are manifested in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 299, 21, 18, 'fact that we know how to speak pleasantly to people, instead of getting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 299, 22, 18, 'upset and getting in a bad mood. Those are the marks of an immature,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 299, 23, 18, 'foolish, stupid person. But if we know how to be pleasant with our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 299, 24, 18, 'words, we can persuade people much more than by getting upset. That''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 299, 25, 18, 'mark of wisdom and maturity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 299, 26, 18, 'Understanding is a fountain of life to one who has it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 299, 27, 18, 'But the discipline of fools is folly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 299, 28, 18, 'Prov 16:22');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 300, 1, 18, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 300, 2, 18, 'Wisdom is a fountain of life to the wise, but trying to educate stupid');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 300, 3, 18, 'people is a waste of time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 300, 4, 18, 'Prov 16:22, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 300, 5, 18, 'Jesus said, "Don''t cast your pearls before swine and don''t give that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 300, 6, 18, 'which is holy to the dogs." Whenever we speak to people, we need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 300, 7, 18, 'first discern: does this person have a heart for the things of the Lord?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 300, 8, 18, 'If he does not have a heart for the things of the Lord, there''s no use');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 300, 9, 18, 'sharing spiritual things with him. It''s an absolute waste of time trying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 300, 10, 18, 'to speak to him all types of spiritual things. It''s like throwing pearls');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 300, 11, 18, 'before swine or giving that which is holy to a dog.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 300, 12, 18, 'The heart of the wise instructs his mouth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 300, 13, 18, 'And adds persuasiveness to his lips.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 300, 14, 18, 'Prov 16:23');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 300, 15, 18, 'Notice the connection here to what we read in Romans 10:9: that what man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 300, 16, 18, 'believes in the heart, he confesses with his mouth. And also what Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 300, 17, 18, 'said, "Out of the abundance of the heart, the mouth speaks." And like we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 300, 18, 18, 'read in Acts 2:4 that on the day of Pentecost, when they were filled');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 300, 19, 18, 'with the Holy Spirit in their hearts, the overflow came through their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 300, 20, 18, 'mouths - speaking in other tongues. There''s a very close connection');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 300, 21, 18, 'between the heart and the mouth. You can''t believe in the heart without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 300, 22, 18, 'confessing with your mouth. You can''t be filled in the heart without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 300, 23, 18, 'overflowing through the mouth. So what this basically means is: I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 300, 24, 18, 'to see to it that my heart is right if I want my tongue to be right.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 300, 25, 18, 'It''s not just a question of controlling the tongue like a good Buddhist.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 300, 26, 18, 'It''s a question of having a good heart. The heart teaches the mouth what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 300, 27, 18, 'to say. I think about what I say. I don''t just pour out words without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 300, 28, 18, 'thinking. That''s how it must be.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 301, 1, 18, 'Pleasant (or kind) words are a honeycomb,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 301, 2, 18, 'Sweet to the soul and healing to the bones.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 301, 3, 18, 'Prov 16:24');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 301, 4, 18, 'This tells us about the type of words that come from a good heart: that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 301, 5, 18, 'is kind words. Kind words don''t come naturally to us. We have to be kind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 301, 6, 18, 'in our hearts before we can speak kind words to people. Basically, all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 301, 7, 18, 'of us have a flesh in which kindness does not dwell. Have we discovered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 301, 8, 18, 'that? Have we discovered that there''s not one atom of kindness that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 301, 9, 18, 'dwells in our flesh? I''ll tell you why: because kindness is a good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 301, 10, 18, 'thing, and the bible says that no good thing dwells in my flesh. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 301, 11, 18, 'means there''s not even one atom of kindness that dwells in my flesh.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 301, 12, 18, 'What dwells in our flesh then? Harshness, evil, and unkindness. That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 301, 13, 18, 'what dwells in our flesh. All these qualities are trying to get inside');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 301, 14, 18, 'our hearts each moment. And once they have gotten inside our hearts,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 301, 15, 18, 'they will begin to overflow through our mouths. The mouth is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 301, 16, 18, 'overflow valve of the heart. I know what''s gotten into my heart by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 301, 17, 18, 'seeing what''s coming out from my tongue. If I find unkindness and evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 301, 18, 18, 'and harshness coming out from my tongue, then I know these things got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 301, 19, 18, 'into my heart first. I can''t be talking about spiritual victory and all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 301, 20, 18, 'that if this is the case. I really have to take up the battle here and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 301, 21, 18, 'see that God wants me to be kind. Speak words of encouragement to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 301, 22, 18, 'people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 301, 23, 18, 'There is a way which seems right to a man,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 301, 24, 18, 'But its end is the way of death.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 301, 25, 18, 'Prov 16:25');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 301, 26, 18, 'We considered this earlier in Proverbs 14:12. This is the broad way -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 301, 27, 18, 'the way whereby you don''t have to go through the narrow gate. You don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 301, 28, 18, 'have to take up the cross everyday. Jesus said, "If you want to follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 302, 1, 18, 'me, you have to take up the cross everyday." But in the world, there are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 302, 2, 18, 'even many Christians who think they can follow Jesus without taking up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 302, 3, 18, 'the cross everyday. That is one of the greatest deceptions that Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 302, 4, 18, 'has perpetrated on the Christian world today - telling people that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 302, 5, 18, 'can follow Jesus without taking up the cross everyday. You can''t find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 302, 6, 18, 'that in the New Testament. They think it''s alright: "I''m doing good. I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 302, 7, 18, 'witnessing, evangelizing, sacrificing, giving money to the Lord. I''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 302, 8, 18, 'even become a full-time worker." It looks alright on the surface, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 302, 9, 18, 'Jesus said it''s impossible to follow him unless we take up the cross');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 302, 10, 18, 'everyday. That''s clear. Luke 9:23 is so clear. And yet there is a way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 302, 11, 18, 'that seems right to a man. But in the end you will discover this way is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 302, 12, 18, 'death because it is not the way of the cross. The way of the cross is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 302, 13, 18, 'the way that leads to life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 302, 14, 18, 'Hunger is good - if it makes you work to satisfy it!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 302, 15, 18, 'Prov 16:26, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 302, 16, 18, 'This means we shouldn''t be lazy. If a man does not work, neither should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 302, 17, 18, 'he eat. We have to be careful that we do not encourage people to eat who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 302, 18, 18, 'do not want to work, because God''s word forbids it. If a man''s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 302, 19, 18, 'willing to work, he should not eat.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 302, 20, 18, 'I feel there''s an application here in a country like India where we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 302, 21, 18, 'this fantastic problem of beggars. I see that there are two types of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 302, 22, 18, 'beggars: There are those who are maimed, lame, have leprosy, or unable');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 302, 23, 18, 'to work because of age. Such beggars deserve our kindness and our help.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 302, 24, 18, 'But then there are others - small boys who are hale and hearty, who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 302, 25, 18, 'just being sent off by their parents to beg. In that case, it''s not at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 302, 26, 18, 'all a good thing to give them money. It''s far better to encourage a boy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 302, 27, 18, 'who wants to do some work, even if it''s polishing your shoes or looking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 302, 28, 18, 'after your scooter. Something! He must be willing to do some work! We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 303, 1, 18, 'can give him something to do - it''s a principle. It''s not the complete');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 303, 2, 18, 'solution to this problem, but this simple principle is good for us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 303, 3, 18, 'keep in mind. Hunger is good if it makes you work to satisfy it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 303, 4, 18, 'Idle hands are the devil''s workshop; idle lips are his mouthpiece.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 303, 5, 18, 'Prov 16:27, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 303, 6, 18, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 303, 7, 18, 'Evil people look for ways to harm others; even their words burn with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 303, 8, 18, 'evil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 303, 9, 18, 'Prov 16:27, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 303, 10, 18, 'This is in contrast to verse 26. Idle hands are the devil''s workshop and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 303, 11, 18, 'idle lips are his mouthpiece. But there''s something more in this verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 303, 12, 18, 'which I want to share. The Good News Translation says that evil people''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 303, 13, 18, 'words burn with evil. Whose words? Evil people''s. Now, what I need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 303, 14, 18, 'ask myself is not, "Am I an evil man? Am I an evil woman?" Every one of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 303, 15, 18, 'us would say no. "I''m not an evil man. I''m not an evil woman." That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 303, 16, 18, 'not where we should start when meditating on this verse. Start at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 303, 17, 18, 'other end of the verse and say, "Do I ever speak words that burn other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 303, 18, 18, 'people?" If so, whether I know it or not, I am an evil person. Start at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 303, 19, 18, 'the other end of the verse and work backwards, and you''ll discover you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 303, 20, 18, 'are an evil person. Because you''re speaking words that are meant to BURN');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 303, 21, 18, 'that other person! We discover that we don''t know our spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 303, 22, 18, 'condition. That''s the mark of an evil person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 303, 23, 18, 'The New American Standard Bible says, "A worthless person digs up evil."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 303, 24, 18, 'Think of that. And in the margin it says, "A man of Belial digs up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 303, 25, 18, 'evil." That means a demonic man. Belial is a name for the devil. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 303, 26, 18, 'demonic man is one who digs up evil! That means the evil was already');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 303, 27, 18, 'buried. For example, someone did something against you three months ago');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 303, 28, 18, 'or six months ago, and you were moved in some revival meeting in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 304, 1, 18, 'church two weeks ago to bury it. You decided to be finished with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 304, 2, 18, 'dwelling on it. You knelt down and said, "Lord, I forgive that man. I''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 304, 3, 18, 'finished dwelling on it. I forgive him." But now the revival is gone,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 304, 4, 18, 'and you''re back to normal now. You''re digging up that thing which you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 304, 5, 18, 'said you buried two weeks ago. It''s back again! A demonic man does that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 304, 6, 18, 'God has forgiven it. And you said before God that day that you had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 304, 7, 18, 'forgiven it too. But still you look at that person and dig up that time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 304, 8, 18, 'he said this thing and the other time he did that thing. Think of that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 304, 9, 18, 'Even husbands and wives sometimes dig up things which they said they had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 304, 10, 18, 'forgiven one another for. They haven''t forgiven one another! They''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 304, 11, 18, 'still digging it up. They have a big fight and then they dig up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 304, 12, 18, 'everything. This is a man of Belial and a woman of Belial calling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 304, 13, 18, 'themselves believers - demonic men and women! The world is full of them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 304, 14, 18, 'They are demonic because they are accusers, and Satan is the accuser of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 304, 15, 18, 'the brethren. Brothers and sisters, I pray that there won''t be one man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 304, 16, 18, 'or woman of Belial in the church who''s so demonic as to be an accuser;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 304, 17, 18, 'who digs up what God has forgiven and what you yourself said you had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 304, 18, 18, 'forgiven. It''s gone. You buried it. Forget it now. Look at that person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 304, 19, 18, 'with the new mercies with which God looks upon you. That''s good. That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 304, 20, 18, 'to be divine.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 304, 21, 18, 'When a worthless man digs up evil, it says his words become like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 304, 22, 18, 'scorching fire. Like James says: "His tongue is set on fire with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 304, 23, 18, 'fire of Hell." It''s amazing how one moment the tongue can be set on fire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 304, 24, 18, 'with Hell and then with the same mouth, we bless God. The speaking in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 304, 25, 18, 'tongues and the tongue of fire which was on the apostles on the day of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 304, 26, 18, 'Pentecost was the heavenly fire. How can we then come out with the fire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 304, 27, 18, 'of Hell and curse our fellow men? One time this fire, and the other time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 304, 28, 18, 'that fire. This is confusion. It shouldn''t be like that. It should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 305, 1, 18, 'always be that heavenly fire that purifies my speech. The words of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 305, 2, 18, 'Lord are refined in the furnace seven times, it says in Psalms 12:6.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 305, 3, 18, 'I''ve thought of it like this: that before you speak a word, think about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 305, 4, 18, 'it. Put it in the furnace. Take it out. Put it in the furnace. Take it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 305, 5, 18, 'out. Seven times. "Lord, should I say that?" You may find that after the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 305, 6, 18, 'fourth or fifth time, God says, "There''s no need to say that." Then you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 305, 7, 18, 'don''t say it, because the Lord said not to. The words of the Lord are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 305, 8, 18, 'pure words, purified seven times. That''s how God wants us to speak or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 305, 9, 18, 'write letters. The words we speak must not be this scorching fire, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 305, 10, 18, 'the purity of the fire of heaven. It''s very simple if we can just be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 305, 11, 18, 'little patient before we speak. Humble yourself and say, "Let me put it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 305, 12, 18, 'in the Lord''s furnace and see whether it''s pure enough to speak to my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 305, 13, 18, 'brother or sister or my husband or wife or anyone." Then we''ll find that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 305, 14, 18, 'we''ll be saved from a fantastic amount of stupidity and folly and broken');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 305, 15, 18, 'relationships and 1,001 other things. Our life would be so glorious if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 305, 16, 18, 'we only followed this simple rule.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 305, 17, 18, 'A perverse man spreads strife,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 305, 18, 18, 'And a slanderer separates intimate friends.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 305, 19, 18, 'Prov 16:28');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 305, 20, 18, 'Here''s another mark of an evil man or an evil woman. He goes to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 305, 21, 18, 'somebody''s house and says something about brother X or sister Y. At the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 305, 22, 18, 'end of that half hour conversation about that brother X or sister Y, ask');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 305, 23, 18, 'yourself, "After this person''s visit, did he succeed in bringing my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 305, 24, 18, 'family closer to brother X and closer to sister Y or a little further');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 305, 25, 18, 'away from them? Has he succeeded in making us love one another more or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 305, 26, 18, 'has he succeeded in making us despise that person a little more?" There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 305, 27, 18, 'we can see so much of the conversations that go on are just to paint a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 305, 28, 18, 'bad picture of another person. Such a person is a perverse man/woman -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 306, 1, 18, 'another man/woman of Belial. They separate intimate friends by saying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 306, 2, 18, 'something that''s not good. Terrible. It''s terrible when it is found in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 306, 3, 18, 'the congregation of the righteous. The word of God is very clear on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 306, 4, 18, 'these matters, and we have to be very careful we don''t fall into this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 306, 5, 18, 'category.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 306, 6, 18, 'A man of violence entices his neighbor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 306, 7, 18, 'And leads him in a way that is not good.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 306, 8, 18, 'Prov 16:29');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 306, 9, 18, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 306, 10, 18, 'Violent people deceive their friends and lead them to disaster.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 306, 11, 18, 'Prov 16:29, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 306, 12, 18, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 306, 13, 18, 'Wickedness loves company - and leads others into sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 306, 14, 18, 'Prov 16:29, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 306, 15, 18, 'I believe this is something which particularly young people need to bear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 306, 16, 18, 'in mind. Be careful about the type of company you keep and that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 306, 17, 18, 'don''t lead you into sin. They begin with just dirty jokes. Then it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 306, 18, 18, 'gradually moves on to a little drink, and then to other things. Bad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 306, 19, 18, 'company can lead to so many problems. Steer clear of them. Blessed are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 306, 20, 18, 'those young people who, from their school days, have known to stay away');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 306, 21, 18, 'from those who are not seeking a godly life. I''m not saying not to talk');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 306, 22, 18, 'to them, but keep a little distance. Don''t get too friendly with those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 306, 23, 18, 'who are worldly minded, that they can lead you astray from God. Beware');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 306, 24, 18, 'of your company. And if you fellowship with an angry man, you can get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 306, 25, 18, 'into trouble yourself one day. Beware of fellowship with violent, angry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 306, 26, 18, 'people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 306, 27, 18, 'He who winks his eyes does so to devise perverse things;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 306, 28, 18, 'He who compresses his lips brings evil to pass.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 307, 1, 18, 'Prov 16:30');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 307, 2, 18, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 307, 3, 18, 'Watch out for people who grin and wink at you; they have thought of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 307, 4, 18, 'something evil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 307, 5, 18, 'Prov 16:30, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 307, 6, 18, 'These are your friends who are grinning at you and winking at you, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 307, 7, 18, 'they have something evil in mind. Be careful about these people who try');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 307, 8, 18, 'to act so friendly, but are really seeking to get some company for their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 307, 9, 18, 'sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 307, 10, 18, 'A grey head is a crown of glory;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 307, 11, 18, 'If it is found in the way of righteousness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 307, 12, 18, 'Prov 16:31');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 307, 13, 18, 'This means that it''s wonderful, as a brother or a sister, to grow old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 307, 14, 18, 'and for your hair to become grey. It says it''s a crown of glory. Think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 307, 15, 18, 'of that. Who in the world doesn''t want to have a crown of glory? But it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 307, 16, 18, 'says here, "A grey head is a crown of glory." All these men and women');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 307, 17, 18, 'who dye their hair, they don''t believe this or know this. They don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 307, 18, 18, 'believe grey hair is a crown of glory at all. They believe it''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 307, 19, 18, 'disgrace. That''s the trouble with a whole lot of people in the world:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 307, 20, 18, 'they all like to look young. But here it says that a grey head is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 307, 21, 18, 'crown of glory. But not automatically. No. There are a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 307, 22, 18, 'grey-headed, 70 year-old men still lusting after women, I''m sorry to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 307, 23, 18, 'say. There are a lot of grey-headed, 70 year-old women who are grumpy,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 307, 24, 18, 'miserable, and make life miserable for everybody around them. There''s no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 307, 25, 18, 'glory there. There''s just the grey hair, but no glory at all. But if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 307, 26, 18, 'grey hair is found in the way of righteousness, then it is a crown of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 307, 27, 18, 'glory! Think of that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 307, 28, 18, 'Think of a man who was wholeheartedly gripped with the New and Living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 308, 1, 18, 'Way when he was young. He faithfully, faithfully, faithfully walked that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 308, 2, 18, 'way so that when he grows old, he''s so considerate; he''s so desirous not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 308, 3, 18, 'to make himself a bother to others - because he spent his whole life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 308, 4, 18, 'trying to deny himself and live for the glory of God. Think of a saint');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 308, 5, 18, 'like that. What a glory there is there. Even young people want to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 308, 6, 18, 'with such a man to know more of God. That''s a wonderful thing. And I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 308, 7, 18, 'just want to say, dear sisters, when you see a grumpy, miserable, old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 308, 8, 18, 'woman somewhere, think of yourself. One day you''ll be like that if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 308, 9, 18, 'don''t deny yourself now when you''re young. Brothers, when you see a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 308, 10, 18, 'self-centered, miserable, critical old man, be careful. You can end up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 308, 11, 18, 'like that if you don''t start denying yourself when you''re young. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 308, 12, 18, 'think you can start denying yourself when you''re 60, it''s too late.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 308, 13, 18, 'Start now so that you can grow old gracefully and graciously. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 308, 14, 18, 'people get old, they have so many aches and pains and weaknesses and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 308, 15, 18, 'physical infirmities, insecurities, and so many things. And with all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 308, 16, 18, 'that, if you see an older person cheerful, good-natured, kind, good, not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 308, 17, 18, 'complaining, you can see that God has done a work in such a person. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 308, 18, 18, 'wonderful to grow old like that. A grey head is a crown of glory if it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 308, 19, 18, 'is found in the way of righteousness. So that''s a wonderful thing. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 308, 20, 18, 'you want to be wise later on, it''s good to start on that way when you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 308, 21, 18, 'young.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 308, 22, 18, 'He who is slow to anger is better than the mighty,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 308, 23, 18, 'And he who rules his spirit, than he who captures a city.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 308, 24, 18, 'Prov 16:32');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 308, 25, 18, 'There are two conquerors mentioned: this great conqueror who could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 308, 26, 18, 'conquer so many cities, and the other man who could conquer the lusts in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 308, 27, 18, 'his own flesh. It says the man who conquered the lusts in his flesh is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 308, 28, 18, 'greater conqueror in God''s eyes. It''s easy to conquer a city. It''s more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 309, 1, 18, 'difficult to conquer your anger. Be a conqueror! You can be a greater');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 309, 2, 18, 'conqueror than Alexander the Great if you can conquer the lusts in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 309, 3, 18, 'flesh and overcome that vile temper of yours. To be patient. To be slow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 309, 4, 18, 'to anger means to be patient. A patient man is greater than a world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 309, 5, 18, 'conqueror. And he who rules his spirit - that means in all circumstances');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 309, 6, 18, 'he has control over his spirit. He''s calm. Better than any conqueror of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 309, 7, 18, 'anything.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 309, 8, 18, 'The lot is cast into the lap,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 309, 9, 18, 'But its every decision is from the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 309, 10, 18, 'Prov 16:33');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 309, 11, 18, 'This verse tells us about the way they used to have guidance in Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 309, 12, 18, 'Testament times. They did not have the Holy Spirit in those days to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 309, 13, 18, 'guide them. The only way they could find guidance was like how people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 309, 14, 18, 'toss a coin today (heads or tails). They cast the lot into the lap to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 309, 15, 18, 'find out what to do. Even before the day of Pentecost, when they wanted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 309, 16, 18, 'to find out who was to be the twelfth apostle, they cast the lot and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 309, 17, 18, 'picked. That is not God''s way after the coming of the Holy Spirit. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 309, 18, 18, 'last time they cast lots was in Acts 1. Now God has given us the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 309, 19, 18, 'Spirit. He leads us into all the truth through the word of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 309, 20, 19, 'Chapter 17 Chapter 17');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 309, 21, 19, 'Better is a dry morsel and quietness with it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 309, 22, 19, 'Than a house full of feasting with strife.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 309, 23, 19, 'Prov 17:1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 309, 24, 19, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 309, 25, 19, 'Better to eat a dry crust of bread with peace of mind than have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 309, 26, 19, 'banquet in a house full of trouble.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 309, 27, 19, 'Prov 17:1, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 309, 28, 19, 'This verse comes back to what we considered earlier about the type of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 310, 1, 19, 'food we eat in the house. In Proverbs 15:17, it was talking about herbs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 310, 2, 19, '- now we have dry crusts of bread. You know the crust itself is pretty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 310, 3, 19, 'hard and on top of that it''s dry. But Solomon says it''s better to sit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 310, 4, 19, 'and eat a dry crust of bread in a house where there is quietness. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 310, 5, 19, 'aren''t many houses where there''s quietness, where there''s no YELLING!!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 310, 6, 19, 'And SCREAMING!! It''s alright for children to do that because they don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 310, 7, 19, 'have wisdom. But it''s a terrible thing when the adults in the house are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 310, 8, 19, 'yelling and screaming. Where there''s quietness and the adults also know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 310, 9, 19, 'how to stop the little children from yelling and screaming, that''s good.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 310, 10, 19, 'Compare a house where there''s quietness with a house full of feasting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 310, 11, 19, 'with fantastic food but there is strife, bitterness and quarrels between');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 310, 12, 19, 'the husband and wife. What''s the use of a grand meal if there''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 310, 13, 19, 'quarreling between the husband and the wife? It''s better to have a dry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 310, 14, 19, 'crust of bread. That shows us the great importance of peace.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 310, 15, 19, 'In another translation the house is called "a house full of sacrifices"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 310, 16, 19, '(it says in the margin: sacrifices of strife). That means religious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 310, 17, 19, 'sacrifices. This is a religious house but there''s strife there. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 310, 18, 19, 'are arguments in the middle of all their religion, prayers and bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 310, 19, 19, 'reading. That''s a sad thing. It is far better to eat a dry crust with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 310, 20, 19, 'peace. The bible places great importance on having quietness and peace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 310, 21, 19, 'at home.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 310, 22, 19, 'A servant who acts wisely will rule over a son who acts shamefully,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 310, 23, 19, 'And will share in the inheritance among brothers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 310, 24, 19, 'Prov 17:2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 310, 25, 19, 'In the Old Testament they were called servants (Galatians 4:1-7). In the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 310, 26, 19, 'New Covenant we are called sons. And you know there''s a difference in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 310, 27, 19, 'your home between a servant and a son. That''s the difference between the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 310, 28, 19, 'Old Covenant and the New Covenant. You may care for your servant.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 311, 1, 19, 'However, there''s a lot of difference between your care for your son and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 311, 2, 19, 'your care for a servant. But let''s not sit and think that we are greater');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 311, 3, 19, 'than Abraham, Jacob and David and all these Old Covenant people, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 311, 4, 19, 'it says a servant who acts wisely will rule over a son who claims to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 311, 5, 19, 'in the New Covenant and then acts more shamefully than that servant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 311, 6, 19, 'under the Old Covenant. There are lots of so-called sons today who act');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 311, 7, 19, 'disgracefully - in a way which would make Elijah and Elisha cover their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 311, 8, 19, 'faces in shame. God is righteous to give that rulership to a servant who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 311, 9, 19, 'acts wisely instead. The first will be last and the last will be first.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 311, 10, 19, 'That teaches us also that in the church, as we''ve often considered,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 311, 11, 19, 'somebody could have been in the church for a number of years - a senior');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 311, 12, 19, 'brother - and some younger brother can overtake him spiritually because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 311, 13, 19, 'that senior brother is not denying himself in his private life. He''s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 311, 14, 19, 'humbling himself, he''s not judging himself, he''s not walking in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 311, 15, 19, 'light. It''s a sad thing. That happens all over the world: where those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 311, 16, 19, 'who have come in later spiritually progress ahead of those who have been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 311, 17, 19, 'in the church from the beginning. The servant overtakes that son. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 311, 18, 19, 'first has become last and the last has become first, and the elders have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 311, 19, 19, 'now become "youngers" even though their age is higher. They haven''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 311, 20, 19, 'become wiser or more mature or humbler or more patient. That''s sad. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 311, 21, 19, 'is righteous. There''s no partiality with him. He gives to all equally.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 311, 22, 19, 'He doesn''t look at a man for his seniority in service. There is no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 311, 23, 19, 'seniority in service in the kingdom of God, especially in the areas of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 311, 24, 19, 'maturity and the fear of God and wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 311, 25, 19, 'The refining pot is for silver and the furnace for gold,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 311, 26, 19, 'But the Lord tests hearts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 311, 27, 19, 'Prov 17:3');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 311, 28, 19, 'God is called the God who tests the righteous (Jeremiah 20:12). He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 312, 1, 19, 'doesn''t tempt us, but he tests us like he tested Abraham and Peter and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 312, 2, 19, 'David. He tests us before he commits a responsibility to us. And that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 312, 3, 19, 'why he puts us in the fire - so that he can improve us. It says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 312, 4, 19, '"refining pot." The refining pot is not for destroying the silver but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 312, 5, 19, 'for purifying it. That teaches us that when the Lord tests us and puts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 312, 6, 19, 'us in the fire, it''s not for destroying us - it''s for purifying us. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 312, 7, 19, 'way he can commit a ministry to us. Just like silver and gold are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 312, 8, 19, 'refined, the Lord refines the righteous and tests their hearts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 312, 9, 19, 'An evildoer listens to wicked lips;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 312, 10, 19, 'A liar pays attention to a destructive tongue.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 312, 11, 19, 'Prov 17:4');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 312, 12, 19, 'This teaches us that gossipers listen to other gossipers. Birds of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 312, 13, 19, 'feather flock together. The reason why gossipers come to your home and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 312, 14, 19, 'gossip, whether you realize it or not, is because you''re a gossiper');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 312, 15, 19, 'yourself. There is a law in economics that says that supply always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 312, 16, 19, 'matches demand. That means if there''s a demand for something, it''ll be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 312, 17, 19, 'supplied. So the reason why gossip is supplied in your house is because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 312, 18, 19, 'people sense that you like it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 312, 19, 19, 'It says, "An evil doer listens to wicked lips..." It''s not just speaking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 312, 20, 19, 'evil things that makes a person guilty. It doesn''t say here that an evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 312, 21, 19, 'doer has wicked lips. It says here that an evil doer listens to wicked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 312, 22, 19, 'lips. That means the person who is listening to gossip is as guilty as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 312, 23, 19, 'the person who is gossiping. Listening to gossip is an evil action. As');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 312, 24, 19, 'we considered before, supply meets demand, which means: because people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 312, 25, 19, 'find that in a certain home the people are glad to listen to juicy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 312, 26, 19, 'gossip about others, they come to such homes. But they know in certain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 312, 27, 19, 'other homes, the people are not interested in such gossip and so they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 312, 28, 19, 'don''t go to such homes. So if you find a lot of gossipers coming to your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 313, 1, 19, 'home, you can be pretty sure that there''s something in your spirit that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 313, 2, 19, 'attracts them. Birds of a feather flock together, and the gossiper is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 313, 3, 19, 'supplying a demand that he senses in your spirit. That''s why someone who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 313, 4, 19, 'listens to wicked lips is called an ''evildoer''. And it is a liar who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 313, 5, 19, 'pays attention to a destructive tongue. A person who''s tearing another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 313, 6, 19, 'person to pieces with his tongue is paid attention to only by a person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 313, 7, 19, 'who is a liar and a deceiver himself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 313, 8, 19, 'He who mocks the poor taunts his Maker;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 313, 9, 19, 'He who rejoices at calamity will not go unpunished.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 313, 10, 19, 'Prov 17:5');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 313, 11, 19, 'This can apply to mocking a person for any infirmity that he has. Maybe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 313, 12, 19, 'the way a person walks or the way a person talks or the way a person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 313, 13, 19, 'conducts himself in some way that is peculiar. Maybe he has an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 313, 14, 19, 'infirmity, maybe he has a weakness, maybe he stammers, maybe he limps,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 313, 15, 19, 'and somebody else sits and laughs at it. Small children, who have no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 313, 16, 19, 'wisdom, laughing is one thing, but when parents who call themselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 313, 17, 19, 'believers also laugh with children at the infirmity of another person or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 313, 18, 19, 'at the poverty of another person, they are actually reproaching his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 313, 19, 19, 'Maker. Poverty can be of money or of speech or of grammar or of so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 313, 20, 19, 'other things. When we laugh at the poverty of another person in any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 313, 21, 19, 'area, we are reproaching his Maker. Never forget that. When we mock a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 313, 22, 19, 'person, we are mocking the person''s Maker. And that''s why a really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 313, 23, 19, 'God-fearing Christian will never mock another person. We have to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 313, 24, 19, 'careful about our children making fun of teachers and encouraging that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 313, 25, 19, 'type of behavior. No - that''s not healthy. There''s a little bit of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 313, 26, 19, 'spirit of rebellion in that which we have to make sure we don''t tolerate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 313, 27, 19, 'in our homes. And usually we mock others in some area where we ourselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 313, 28, 19, 'are good.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 314, 1, 19, 'Then it says, "He who rejoices at calamity will not go unpunished." Now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 314, 2, 19, 'I''ll tell you that in all of our flesh, there dwells this evil thing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 314, 3, 19, 'Not that we are happy when a misfortune falls upon somebody else, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 314, 4, 19, 'we''re not entirely sad. That''s a sad thing. We''re not entirely sad when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 314, 5, 19, 'some misfortune happens to somebody else. That''s how it is in the flesh.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 314, 6, 19, 'We''re very sad if it happens to us, but we''re not entirely sad when it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 314, 7, 19, 'happens to someone else. That attitude dwells in our flesh, and we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 314, 8, 19, 'to be ruthless with it. It says, "He who rejoices at calamity will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 314, 9, 19, 'go unpunished."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 314, 10, 19, 'Let me show you a verse in the book of Obadiah - one of the lesser known');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 314, 11, 19, 'books in the Old Testament. Obadiah comes after Hosea, Joel, and then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 314, 12, 19, 'Amos. In Obadiah 1:11-12, God spoke to Edom who was a descendant of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 314, 13, 19, 'Esau, the brother of Jacob. Edom should have been concerned when he saw');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 314, 14, 19, 'Israel suffering, but it says, "On the day that you stood aloof, on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 314, 15, 19, 'day that strangers carried off his wealth…Do not gloat over your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 314, 16, 19, 'brother''s day, the day of his misfortune. And do not rejoice over the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 314, 17, 19, 'sons of Judah on the day of their destruction; Yes, do not boast on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 314, 18, 19, 'day of their distress." Some calamity happened to the Israelites, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 314, 19, 19, 'the Edomites just watched it and rejoiced. Then it goes on to say how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 314, 20, 19, 'the Lord was going to punish them for that. We can be just a wee bit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 314, 21, 19, 'happy when things don''t go well with somebody else, particularly if that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 314, 22, 19, 'other person is someone with whom you don''t have a very good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 314, 23, 19, 'relationship. If we have a very good relationship with someone, we''ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 314, 24, 19, 'never be happy when things don''t go well for them. But if there''s just a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 314, 25, 19, 'little bit of coldness, then we find that we can detect it when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 314, 26, 19, 'something goes wrong. We may not be rejoicing over it, but we''re not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 314, 27, 19, 'entirely unhappy. The word of God says not to rejoice when something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 314, 28, 19, 'unfortunate happens to someone else - some calamity - because the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 315, 1, 19, 'punishment can come upon you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 315, 2, 19, 'Grandparents are proud of their grandchildren, just as children are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 315, 3, 19, 'proud of their parents.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 315, 4, 19, 'Prov 17:6, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 315, 5, 19, 'That''s very clear. I think all grandfathers in the world are proud of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 315, 6, 19, 'their grandchildren. Now, let me put the verse another way so that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 315, 7, 19, 'can try to understand the second part: "Let your son be proud of you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 315, 8, 19, 'just as grandfathers are proud of their children." In other words, if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 315, 9, 19, 'you''re a father, live in such a way that your son or daughter can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 315, 10, 19, 'proud that you''re his or her father - in the same way that grandparents');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 315, 11, 19, 'are proud of their grandchildren. Think of that. Think of being such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 315, 12, 19, 'father or such a mother. Think of your children never having any cause');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 315, 13, 19, 'for reproach or reason to be ashamed of their parents in any way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 315, 14, 19, 'Excellent speech is not fitting for a fool,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 315, 15, 19, 'Much less are lying lips to a prince.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 315, 16, 19, 'Prov 17:7');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 315, 17, 19, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 315, 18, 19, 'Truth from a rebel or lies from a king are both unexpected.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 315, 19, 19, 'Prov 17:7, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 315, 20, 19, 'We know that a person who''s foolish really does not have the ability to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 315, 21, 19, 'bring forth excellent speech. Equally, there is another thing that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 315, 22, 19, 'quite unfitting: a person who claims that Jesus Christ has made him a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 315, 23, 19, 'king and a priest, but tells a lie in some situation. For a person who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 315, 24, 19, 'calls himself a king and a prince in the kingdom of God to tell a lie or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 315, 25, 19, 'give a false impression or say something which is not truthful or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 315, 26, 19, 'exaggerate something (which is just another form of lying) is quite');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 315, 27, 19, 'unfitting. Quite unfitting.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 315, 28, 19, 'Some people think a bribe works like magic; they believe it can do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 316, 1, 19, 'anything.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 316, 2, 19, 'Prov 17:8, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 316, 3, 19, 'There are many verses in the book of Proverbs and other portions of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 316, 4, 19, 'scripture about those who receive bribes - that one should not receive a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 316, 5, 19, 'bribe. But this is one of the few, if not the only verse, which refers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 316, 6, 19, 'to those who give bribes. It says people who give bribes think that a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 316, 7, 19, 'bribe works like magic - like a precious stone or a charm - and they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 316, 8, 19, 'believe it can do anything. That''s what they say in the world: "Money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 316, 9, 19, 'can do anything." What they mean by "money" is a bribe. "A bribe can do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 316, 10, 19, 'anything." That''s exactly what the book of Proverbs says that people in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 316, 11, 19, 'the world are like. They have a bribe in their hand and it''s like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 316, 12, 19, 'magic stone. It can accomplish anything they want. That is the mark of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 316, 13, 19, 'the people in the world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 316, 14, 19, 'But in the New Testament, Jesus taught us that God can do anything -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 316, 15, 19, 'that he who has faith in God can do anything. And that is the great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 316, 16, 19, 'conflict. Satan says money can do anything, and then God has his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 316, 17, 19, 'representatives who say that God can do anything. God''s true');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 316, 18, 19, 'representatives are very few, because many who claim to be his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 316, 19, 19, 'representatives also believe that money can do anything. But there are a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 316, 20, 19, 'few among his representatives that believe God can do anything. It is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 316, 21, 19, 'fantastic thing to be a person about whom God can say, "There''s a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 316, 22, 19, 'who proves that I can do anything. He does not depend on mammon like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 316, 23, 19, 'people out there in the world." So this is a verse that speaks about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 316, 24, 19, 'those who give bribes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 316, 25, 19, 'He who conceals a transgression seeks love,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 316, 26, 19, 'But he who repeats a matter separates intimate friends.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 316, 27, 19, 'Prov 17:9');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 316, 28, 19, 'We have considered this many times - that one of the clearest marks of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 317, 1, 19, 'love is that when you see a transgression, you want to cover it. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 317, 2, 19, 'don''t want to talk about it. When you see something in a brother that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 317, 3, 19, 'wrong, if at all you do speak, you go to that brother himself. It says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 317, 4, 19, 'that very clearly in Matthew 18:15. This is one of those commands of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 317, 5, 19, 'Jesus which almost no believers obey at all. Very few believers obey the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 317, 6, 19, 'command which says: if your brother sins against you, go and speak to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 317, 7, 19, 'him alone. Most believers go and talk about it to someone else, some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 317, 8, 19, 'other believer, some other brother or sister in the church. They say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 317, 9, 19, '"This brother came to my house and did this," or, "That person did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 317, 10, 19, 'that." Why don''t you go to that person himself like Jesus said you must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 317, 11, 19, 'do? One who is God-fearing will not repeat a matter. One who repeats a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 317, 12, 19, 'matter is either seeking self-pity or trying to justify himself. Both');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 317, 13, 19, 'are equally Satanic and evil. On top of that, he is separating these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 317, 14, 19, 'brothers/sisters who may have been good friends.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 317, 15, 19, 'We need wisdom - we don''t need to say everything that we know. Even if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 317, 16, 19, 'we know something, we don''t have to repeat it. Let it die with us. Or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 317, 17, 19, 'let us do what it says in 1 John 5:16: if anyone sees his brother sin,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 317, 18, 19, 'what must he do? Let him ask God and God will give him life! That also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 317, 19, 19, 'hardly anybody does. Those are the two things the word of God says: Go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 317, 20, 19, 'and speak to him privately (Matthew 18:15) or pray for him if you can''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 317, 21, 19, 'speak to him (1 John 5:16). Pray for him that God will forgive him and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 317, 22, 19, 'give him life. One of these two. But to repeat it to somebody else is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 317, 23, 19, 'forbidden UNLESS it is a sin which you want to help him from but you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 317, 24, 19, 'feel you aren''t able to. Then you should go and speak to one of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 317, 25, 19, 'elder brothers who has responsibility over that person and the elder');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 317, 26, 19, 'brothers can help him. That is the only case in which it is acceptable');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 317, 27, 19, 'to tell someone else. In that case, you have spoken with a good spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 317, 28, 19, 'to help that person. Otherwise, all repeating of matters to others is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 318, 1, 19, 'evil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 318, 2, 19, 'A rebuke goes deeper into one who has understanding');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 318, 3, 19, 'Than a hundred blows into a fool.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 318, 4, 19, 'Prov 17:10');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 318, 5, 19, 'The book of Proverbs speaks so much about our attitude to rebuke and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 318, 6, 19, 'correction as one of the marks of wisdom. It''s amazing how many times it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 318, 7, 19, 'comes in the book of Proverbs. A rebuke from God or a rebuke from a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 318, 8, 19, 'brother or a rebuke from a father. And think - this verse says that if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 318, 9, 19, 'I''m really a wise man, then just those few words will have a far deeper');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 318, 10, 19, 'effect on me than a person getting 100 lashes on his back. In Islamic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 318, 11, 19, 'countries even nowadays they do public lashings to frighten people from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 318, 12, 19, 'stealing. And think that 100 lashes cannot teach a fool more than one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 318, 13, 19, 'word of rebuke can teach a wise man. That''s the mark of a wise man -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 318, 14, 19, 'that he''s quick to respond to rebuke and correction.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 318, 15, 19, 'How is it, children, when your fathers correct you? Is one word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 318, 16, 19, 'correction enough? Or 100 beatings don''t accomplish it? That''s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 318, 17, 19, 'difference between a wise child and a foolish child. What about a wife?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 318, 18, 19, 'Think about if your husband points out something in you. Do you get so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 318, 19, 19, 'offended that you won''t speak to him for the next one week? Then you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 318, 20, 19, 'a fool indeed. 100 lashes would be better for you. That''s a sad thing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 318, 21, 19, 'God wants wise children, wise wives, wise brothers and sisters. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 318, 22, 19, 'desires wisdom in our homes - where a word of correction can really be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 318, 23, 19, 'taken seriously so that we grow wiser. Why do we get so offended?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 318, 24, 19, 'Because we think, "Oh, that person thinks so little of me." Well, why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 318, 25, 19, 'should that bother us? Why not humble ourselves and see if there''s any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 318, 26, 19, 'truth in that word of correction or rebuke? Maybe there is! If our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 318, 27, 19, 'interest is cleansing ourselves, we''ll be glad to receive correction.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 318, 28, 19, 'But if our interest is honor-seeking, then we will get very offended.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 319, 1, 19, 'That''s when we find that a word of correction exposes what we''re really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 319, 2, 19, 'seeking in life. So, correction is a very wonderful exposer of our real');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 319, 3, 19, 'motives and desires in life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 319, 4, 19, 'Death will come like a cruel messenger to wicked people who are always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 319, 5, 19, 'stirring up trouble.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 319, 6, 19, 'Prov 17:11, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 319, 7, 19, 'The cruel messenger is death, and the person who continues to create');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 319, 8, 19, 'trouble and rebel against God and do things which are contrary to his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 319, 9, 19, 'word - God will speak to him through his word first, then God will speak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 319, 10, 19, 'to him through sickness, then through more sickness, and if he still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 319, 11, 19, 'doesn''t listen, then death will be sent as a cruel messenger to those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 319, 12, 19, 'who are always stirring up trouble. God loves those who seek for peace.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 319, 13, 19, 'Let a man meet a bear robbed of her cubs,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 319, 14, 19, 'Rather than a fool in his folly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 319, 15, 19, 'Prov 17:12');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 319, 16, 19, 'Think of the way the Holy Spirit describes a man who is not wise - a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 319, 17, 19, 'fool in his folly. What is it particularly referring to here? If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 319, 18, 19, 'were to meet a bear in a jungle who has been robbed - a mother bear who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 319, 19, 19, 'has just been robbed of her newly born cubs - what sort of attitude do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 319, 20, 19, 'you expect to meet in that mother bear? FURY! ANGER THAT WILL TEAR YOU');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 319, 21, 19, 'TO PIECES! And it says a fool who loses his temper is like that. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 319, 22, 19, 'it''s better to meet that bear than to face someone who calls himself a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 319, 23, 19, 'human being or calls herself a human being and behaves like that bear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 319, 24, 19, 'who''s been robbed of her cubs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 319, 25, 19, 'What are we usually robbed of which causes us to lose our temper? Our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 319, 26, 19, 'rights. "I have a right to be respected and to be honored." This person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 319, 27, 19, 'robbed me of my rights and my honor and now I''m like this bear - robbed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 319, 28, 19, 'of that which is most precious to me. The kingdom of God is not the most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 320, 1, 19, 'precious for me, but rather my rights, my honor, my reputation. I''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 320, 2, 19, 'been robbed. There''s a saying in English which says, "Anger is temporary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 320, 3, 19, 'madness." It''s true. For a few moments, a person goes insane. He doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 320, 4, 19, 'know what he''s saying or what he''s doing. He behaves like an animal. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 320, 5, 19, 'word of God speaks much about anger. That''s why Jesus spoke about our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 320, 6, 19, 'having victory over it in Matthew 5.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 320, 7, 19, 'He who returns evil for good,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 320, 8, 19, 'Evil will not depart from his house.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 320, 9, 19, 'Prov 17:13');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 320, 10, 19, 'Now that''s a terrible thing. Jesus taught us to return good for evil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 320, 11, 19, 'Overcome evil with good. You see, evil has tremendous power in the world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 320, 12, 19, 'and the only power greater than evil is not more evil, but good. Good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 320, 13, 19, 'has greater power than evil, and if you want to overcome the evil in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 320, 14, 19, 'person, the only way to overcome it is with good. We can try any number');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 320, 15, 19, 'of ways to overcome evil. For 6,000 years, from the days of Cain, people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 320, 16, 19, 'have tried other ways of overcoming evil and have never succeeded. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 320, 17, 19, 'good overcomes evil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 320, 18, 19, 'Think of this: a person can be so bad that when someone has treated him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 320, 19, 19, 'kindly, he returns evil to him. We can sit there and say, "Oh, I''ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 320, 20, 19, 'never do such a horrible thing." Just wait a minute before you judge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 320, 21, 19, 'someone else. Think, brothers and sisters. Have you had kindness shown');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 320, 22, 19, 'to you by someone? Maybe you took it for granted that that person should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 320, 23, 19, 'show you kindness. And then, perhaps at some time you''ve spoken words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 320, 24, 19, 'which are not kind concerning that person who has shown you kindness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 320, 25, 19, 'That is returning evil for good and it can happen in the brotherhood.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 320, 26, 19, 'That person''s only been good to you, but you''ve said things not at all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 320, 27, 19, 'good and kind concerning that person. That''s returning evil for good. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 320, 28, 19, 'says here that that''s a terrible thing. Evil will not depart from your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 321, 1, 19, 'house. Think that such a calamity can come upon us. God forbid that it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 321, 2, 19, 'should ever happen. We reap what we sow. We throw it out and like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 321, 3, 19, 'boomerang it comes back. It''s good to walk in humility and peace and be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 321, 4, 19, 'rooted in goodness. Let''s examine our lives and see whether we have ever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 321, 5, 19, 'been evil or said that which is evil to people who have done some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 321, 6, 19, 'kindness or good to us. Usually it''s because we''ve sat back and said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 321, 7, 19, '"They have to do that. After all, that''s what the brothers and sisters');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 321, 8, 19, 'are here for. They have to do that for me." That''s terrible. May God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 321, 9, 19, 'save us from such a calamity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 321, 10, 19, 'The start of an argument is like the first break in a dam; stop it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 321, 11, 19, 'before it goes any further.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 321, 12, 19, 'Prov 17:14, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 321, 13, 19, 'Sometimes you read in the papers of a dam that burst and the waters');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 321, 14, 19, 'flooded a village and drowned many people. But the dam didn''t break all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 321, 15, 19, 'of a sudden. It started with a little crack. And the engineers and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 321, 16, 19, 'people who were responsible for that dam never took it seriously. Just a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 321, 17, 19, 'little crack. And it says here that the start of an argument is like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 321, 18, 19, 'that little crack in a dam. The argument could be between a husband and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 321, 19, 19, 'a wife. You know how the argument starts? With one sentence. With one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 321, 20, 19, 'sentence you''ve started an argument, and blessed is the man or woman who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 321, 21, 19, 'knows how to patch up that crack immediately. We are to avoid arguments');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 321, 22, 19, 'like we avoid hellfire or like we would avoid leprosy. We have to HATE');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 321, 23, 19, 'arguments. Nobody was ever built up spiritually through arguments - not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 321, 24, 19, 'even through religious arguments on doctrinal matters. We speak the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 321, 25, 19, 'truth but we do not argue with anyone, because it''s the Holy Spirit who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 321, 26, 19, 'has to open a man''s blind eyes. It''s not by arguing. We must consider');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 321, 27, 19, 'this particularly in our homes, dear brothers and sisters. The start of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 321, 28, 19, 'an argument is like the crack in a dam! Remember that next time when an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 322, 1, 19, 'argument begins in your home - there''s a crack in the dam now. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 322, 2, 19, 'add to it, you''re taking a chisel and hammer and making that hole bigger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 322, 3, 19, 'and then only death can come. Like all dams when they burst, they bring');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 322, 4, 19, 'death. The only result can be death, so let''s take the word of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 322, 5, 19, 'seriously.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 322, 6, 19, 'He who justifies the wicked and he who condemns the righteous,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 322, 7, 19, 'Both of them alike are an abomination to the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 322, 8, 19, 'Prov 17:15');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 322, 9, 19, 'If we have not cleansed ourselves from partiality, we can justify a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 322, 10, 19, 'wicked person and condemn a righteous just because this person happens');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 322, 11, 19, 'to be our special friend. Sometimes parents can be foolish like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 322, 12, 19, 'They can be partial towards some of their children and take sides with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 322, 13, 19, 'one child against another. The scar caused by a parent''s partiality can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 322, 14, 19, 'affect that child for years as it grows up - all because of a foolish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 322, 15, 19, 'father or mother who had a favorite son. Maybe that son was good-looking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 322, 16, 19, 'or clever or smart - usually some worldly characteristic. Or maybe one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 322, 17, 19, 'child was spiritual, and the father or mother isn''t wise enough to love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 322, 18, 19, 'a son who is not spiritual - like the father who could love the prodigal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 322, 19, 19, 'son. Think of what a father he was. Think to have no partiality against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 322, 20, 19, 'our children. That''s a wonderful thing. That requires a godly nature.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 322, 21, 19, 'Even if one child is converted and one is utterly worldly - no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 322, 22, 19, 'partiality. "They''re my sons. That''s my son and that''s my son. There''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 322, 23, 19, 'no difference as far as I''m concerned. I love them equally." That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 322, 24, 19, 'godliness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 322, 25, 19, 'We can also take sides when we think of this brother and that brother,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 322, 26, 19, 'and we see there''s a little conflict. That can happen in assemblies. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 322, 27, 19, 'can take sides and that''s the way an assembly is destroyed: because I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 322, 28, 19, 'have not cleansed myself from partiality. Why do I take sides with this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 323, 1, 19, 'person and I can''t see the error in him? I only see the error in that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 323, 2, 19, 'other person. Then this verse applies. I''m justifying the wicked and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 323, 3, 19, 'condemning the righteous, because this person happens to be a little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 323, 4, 19, 'closer to me than that person. There I haven''t been godly enough to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 323, 5, 19, 'righteous.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 323, 6, 19, 'Let me turn you to an Old Testament law in the book of Exodus. God was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 323, 7, 19, 'very careful in the instructions he gave to Israel to be righteous in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 323, 8, 19, 'their judgments. Exodus 23:2 is an amazing verse: "You shall not follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 323, 9, 19, 'a multitude in doing evil." That means when most of the brothers are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 323, 10, 19, 'taking the side of this man, I also take his side. Don''t do that! Most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 323, 11, 19, 'of the brothers are carnal! You must be a spiritual man. In every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 323, 12, 19, 'assembly, most people are carnal. Very few are wise, godly, spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 323, 13, 19, 'and free from partiality. All the sisters are taking that person''s side');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 323, 14, 19, 'or are against that person, so I''ll stand with all the sisters. Don''t be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 323, 15, 19, 'such a stupid idiot. "Do not follow a multitude in doing evil. Nor shall');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 323, 16, 19, 'you testify in a dispute so as to turn aside after a multitude in order');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 323, 17, 19, 'to pervert justice." Stand alone for the truth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 323, 18, 19, 'Exodus 23:3 is another great danger: "Nor shall you be partial to a poor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 323, 19, 19, 'man in his dispute." What does that mean? That means: here is a rich man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 323, 20, 19, 'and here is a poor man, and you feel sorry for the poor man and you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 323, 21, 19, 'become partial. You think that is godliness. You think, "God must be on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 323, 22, 19, 'the side of the poor, so I''ll take the side of the poor." It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 323, 23, 19, 'ungodliness! God says not to take the side of that poor man. Seek for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 323, 24, 19, 'justice. In the world they do that. You see that out in the streets. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 323, 25, 19, 'a scooterist knocks down a pedestrian, who''s wrong? Always the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 323, 26, 19, 'scooterist. Always. Even if it was 100% the pedestrian''s fault. Out in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 323, 27, 19, 'the world, it''s like that. But we''re not to be so stupid. What is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 323, 28, 19, 'reason for that "justice" in the example of the scooterist? Because they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 324, 1, 19, 'say the scooterist is richer. This man''s walking so he must be poorer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 324, 2, 19, 'and therefore he must be right. That''s the very thing God condemned in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 324, 3, 19, 'the Old Testament law. He says to be careful that you don''t take sides');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 324, 4, 19, 'with a poor man just because he''s poor. That means you''re ungodly. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 324, 5, 19, 'doesn''t do that; he''s righteous. At the same time, the other side is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 324, 6, 19, 'Exodus 23:6: "You shall not pervert the justice due to the poor man in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 324, 7, 19, 'the dispute." There are two sides. Don''t take the side of the rich man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 324, 8, 19, 'just because he''s rich, and don''t take the side of the poor man just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 324, 9, 19, 'because he''s poor. No. Be just.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 324, 10, 19, 'Why is there a price in the hand of a fool to buy wisdom,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 324, 11, 19, 'When he has no sense?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 324, 12, 19, 'Prov 17:16');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 324, 13, 19, 'People get Bachelor''s and Master''s Degrees in Theology and all the other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 324, 14, 19, 'degrees, doctrines of devils and everything else. They study all that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 324, 15, 19, 'just to deceive all the poor Christians in this country. What''s the use');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 324, 16, 19, 'of money? You can''t get wisdom with money or with education. Simon came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 324, 17, 19, 'to Peter and said, "If I give you money, give me the power that I can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 324, 18, 19, 'lead people to the baptism of the Holy Spirit" (Acts 8:18-19). And Peter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 324, 19, 19, 'said, "Your money perishes with you. You''re in the bondage of iniquity"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 324, 20, 19, '(v20-23). No. What''s the use of money in the hands of a fool? He doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 324, 21, 19, 'have a heart for wisdom. There''s no way of getting wisdom unless we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 324, 22, 19, 'a heart for it. We can''t get it with money. A person who charges money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 324, 23, 19, 'for his services is a fool. And he''s gathering other fools.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 324, 24, 19, 'A friend loves at all times,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 324, 25, 19, 'And a brother is born for adversity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 324, 26, 19, 'Prov 17:17');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 324, 27, 19, 'The word of God really searches the thoughts and intents of the heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 324, 28, 19, 'like it says in Hebrews 4:12. How do you react when you read a verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 325, 1, 19, 'like this? "A friend loves at all times..." Do you say, "That''s how I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 325, 2, 19, 'know who my true friends are. They love me at all times"? That shows');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 325, 3, 19, 'you''re a fool because you apply this verse to somebody else. You apply');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 325, 4, 19, 'this verse to see how other people love you. And you say, "The one who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 325, 5, 19, 'loves me at all times - that''s a real friend." And, "That friend doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 325, 6, 19, 'love me all the time - that''s not a real friend." That''s the MARK OF A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 325, 7, 19, 'FOOL!! The fool doesn''t read the word of God to see, "How does this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 325, 8, 19, 'apply to me?" He tries to find out how it applies to other people and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 325, 9, 19, 'judges all the other people in the assembly to see who are his real');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 325, 10, 19, 'friends and who are the real brothers who stand by him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 325, 11, 19, 'Then it speaks about a brother who is born for adversity. And you say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 325, 12, 19, '"I was in a difficult situation and that brother came and helped me."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 325, 13, 19, 'What a FOOL and a SPIRITUAL IDIOT I am that after all these years I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 325, 14, 19, 'still don''t know how to apply these verses to myself! The verse is for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 325, 15, 19, 'me. The volume of the book is not written about any other man under the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 325, 16, 19, 'sun - it''s written about me. If I consider myself a friend, do I love?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 325, 17, 19, 'Am I a brother born to help a person in adversity? This is really a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 325, 18, 19, 'verse which searches us out. All of the sudden, you come across a verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 325, 19, 19, 'that really searches out the thoughts and intentions of your heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 325, 20, 19, 'We''re not to use it to expect other people to treat us like this. No.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 325, 21, 19, 'We''re to look at it and see how we are to behave towards others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 325, 22, 19, 'Another translation of this verse reads like this: "The friend becomes a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 325, 23, 19, 'brother in the time of adversity." The friend gets converted into a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 325, 24, 19, 'brother during the time of adversity, meaning that through trial, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 325, 25, 19, 'brings believers closer to each other and their bonds of fellowship as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 325, 26, 19, 'brothers become closer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 325, 27, 19, 'A man lacking in sense pledges');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 325, 28, 19, 'And becomes guarantor in the presence of his neighbor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 326, 1, 19, 'Prov 17:18');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 326, 2, 19, 'This is another thing which the book of Proverbs speaks about: that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 326, 3, 19, 'to stand guarantee for another person. Somebody comes to you and says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 326, 4, 19, '"Brother, will you stand guarantee for me? That if I don''t pay up this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 326, 5, 19, 'debt which I''m buying a scooter or a house with, you''ll take care of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 326, 6, 19, 'it?" And you say, "Well, as a Christian I have to be loving," and you go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 326, 7, 19, 'and stand guarantee for that person. It says here that that is love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 326, 8, 19, 'without wisdom. A man without sense. Think of that! Why do you want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 326, 9, 19, 'go and get into debt like that so foolishly? The Bible says, "Owe no man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 326, 10, 19, 'anything." If that brother wants to be so stupid as to go and borrow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 326, 11, 19, 'money and get into debt, don''t you go and hold hands with him and be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 326, 12, 19, 'guarantor in signing that debt certificate along with him to show love.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 326, 13, 19, 'There''s a fantastic amount of foolishness in many believers when it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 326, 14, 19, 'comes to this matter of money. They think it is love to go around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 326, 15, 19, 'helping people like this and keep giving and giving. They don''t have any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 326, 16, 19, 'wisdom and they actually hinder God''s word instead of helping. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 326, 17, 19, 'tremendous amount of wisdom is needed. Wisdom is the mother of love.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 326, 18, 19, 'Remember that. That means that if love is like a child, wisdom must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 326, 19, 19, 'guide the love as to which way it goes so that it can do the right');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 326, 20, 19, 'thing. And there''s a lot of love without wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 326, 21, 19, 'He who loves transgression loves strife;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 326, 22, 19, 'He who raises his door seeks destruction.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 326, 23, 19, 'Prov 17:19');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 326, 24, 19, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 326, 25, 19, 'To like sin is to like making trouble. If you brag all the time, you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 326, 26, 19, 'asking for trouble.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 326, 27, 19, 'Prov 17:19, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 326, 28, 19, 'The Bible speaks about Jesus hating iniquity (Hebrews 1:9). How do we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 327, 1, 19, 'know whether instead of hating iniquity, we love iniquity? One mark is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 327, 2, 19, 'that we go around making trouble. Don''t be a brother that goes around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 327, 3, 19, 'creating confusion. Don''t be a sister who goes around visiting other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 327, 4, 19, 'homes and creating confusion. Get out of that! Get a reputation for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 327, 5, 19, 'wisdom, brothers and sisters. Particularly sisters, because there can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 327, 6, 19, 'a tremendous amount of folly in this area - going around creating');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 327, 7, 19, 'confusion instead of seeking peace. Seek God for wisdom. Those who make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 327, 8, 19, 'trouble are those who love to sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 327, 9, 19, 'Then the other part of that verse says, "He who raises his door seeks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 327, 10, 19, 'destruction." That is somebody who is trying to build a fancy house. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 327, 11, 19, 'other words, one who exalts himself in some way, boasting in some way -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 327, 12, 19, 'if you brag, making a show of your wealth, you''re asking for trouble.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 327, 13, 19, 'And there''s so much of that in the world today, trying to make a show of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 327, 14, 19, 'vanity. So many things are purchased without any function to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 327, 15, 19, 'fulfilled, only for show, for vanity. They''re asking for trouble.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 327, 16, 19, 'He who has a crooked mind finds no good,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 327, 17, 19, 'And he who is perverted in his language falls into evil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 327, 18, 19, 'Prov 17:20');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 327, 19, 19, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 327, 20, 19, 'An evil man is suspicious of everyone and tumbles into constant trouble.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 327, 21, 19, 'Prov 17:20, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 327, 22, 19, 'A crooked mind does not find anything good in anyone. And if you find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 327, 23, 19, 'that your attitude is such that you''re always a bit suspicious of every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 327, 24, 19, 'brother/sister - something wrong with this person, something wrong with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 327, 25, 19, 'that person; this thing is wrong here, that thing is wrong in the other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 327, 26, 19, 'brother/sister - there''s one thing that kind of an attitude shows very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 327, 27, 19, 'clearly: That you yourself are a very evil brother/sister, if you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 327, 28, 19, 'even be called a brother/sister. It says in Titus 1:15 that "for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 328, 1, 19, 'pure, all things are pure, but to the perverted, everything is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 328, 2, 19, 'perverted." Do you know what that means? You see someone doing something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 328, 3, 19, 'and you''re suspicious. You say, "I know what his motive is in doing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 328, 4, 19, 'that." You don''t say it but you think it, because you''re an evil person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 328, 5, 19, 'in your thoughts. You say, "I know why he''s doing that." And then the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 328, 6, 19, 'other person does something else and you say, "I know why he''s doing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 328, 7, 19, 'that." And that sister does something and you say, "Yes, yes, I know why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 328, 8, 19, 'that sister''s doing that." You''re just there judging and always assuming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 328, 9, 19, 'a bad motive. It''s always suspicious. There''s nobody sincere except');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 328, 10, 19, 'yourself in your eyes. And it''s that conceit which robs people of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 328, 11, 19, 'grace of God so that they don''t get grace in their time of need. They''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 328, 12, 19, 'defeated in sin and that''s God shouting at them, "You''re not getting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 328, 13, 19, 'grace because you''re too proud and haughty!" You think you''re the only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 328, 14, 19, 'sincere person and that everybody else is insincere. Suspicious of this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 328, 15, 19, 'person, suspicious of that person - that''s the mark of an evil person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 328, 16, 19, 'Brothers and sisters, this evil dwells in our flesh. We can never think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 328, 17, 19, 'that someone does something with a good motive. Therefore we suffer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 328, 18, 19, 'When will we learn?! When will we learn to humble ourselves and get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 328, 19, 19, 'God''s grace? "An evil man is suspicious of everyone and tumbles into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 328, 20, 19, 'constant trouble." He goes into trouble all the time. So let''s learn to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 328, 21, 19, 'get rid of that habit. Why in the world would we want to judge another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 328, 22, 19, 'person? Like we''ve considered, Almighty God himself has decided to judge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 328, 23, 19, 'a man only at the end of his life. If God can be patient and wait for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 328, 24, 19, 'man to finish his life before judging him, hoping that at least when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 328, 25, 19, 'he''s 70 years old he may repent, why can''t we? God is willing to blot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 328, 26, 19, 'out all the 70 years of that man''s sinful life. But we are such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 328, 27, 19, 'impatient creatures. We can''t wait for a man to finish his life. We have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 328, 28, 19, 'to judge him right now. That shows how ungodly we are if we are like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 329, 1, 19, 'that. Praise God that we can cleanse ourselves from this ungodliness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 329, 2, 19, 'that dwells in our flesh so that we can be godly. God in any case is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 329, 3, 19, 'one who judges. Why in the world do I have to suspect others of so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 329, 4, 19, 'things and be so evil myself?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 329, 5, 19, 'The second part of the verse speaks about our language and our speech.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 329, 6, 19, 'Be careful of the perversion that comes into our language because of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 329, 7, 19, 'suspicions that dwell in our hearts. Sometimes it can be so subtle in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 329, 8, 19, 'the way we express it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 329, 9, 19, 'He who sires a fool does so to his sorrow,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 329, 10, 19, 'And the father of a fool has no joy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 329, 11, 19, 'Prov 17:21');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 329, 12, 19, 'We can apply it like this: that when a person calls himself a child of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 329, 13, 19, 'God and behaves like an absolute fool spiritually, that brings no joy to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 329, 14, 19, 'our heavenly father. It brings sorrow. Think of the sorrow in God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 329, 15, 19, 'heart when he sees so many people around the world calling themselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 329, 16, 19, 'his children and behaving in such ungodly ways. That''s a challenge for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 329, 17, 19, 'us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 329, 18, 19, 'A joyful heart is good medicine,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 329, 19, 19, 'But a broken spirit dries up the bones.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 329, 20, 19, 'Prov 17:22');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 329, 21, 19, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 329, 22, 19, 'A cheerful heart does good like medicine, but a broken spirit makes one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 329, 23, 19, 'sick.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 329, 24, 19, 'Prov 17:22, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 329, 25, 19, 'There are a lot of illnesses that can never be cured with pills and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 329, 26, 19, 'injections. They can only be cured by the joy of the Lord and with a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 329, 27, 19, 'cheerful heart that rejoices in the Lord - a heart that is not always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 329, 28, 19, 'suspicious (like we considered in verse 20), not always judging other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 330, 1, 19, 'people, not always grumbling and complaining about not having this,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 330, 2, 19, 'that, or the other thing. It''ll make your life miserable, and you get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 330, 3, 19, 'sick in the body too! A cheerful heart. Desire to be like that! So what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 330, 4, 19, 'if something is broken, something''s lost, and something''s gone? Why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 330, 5, 19, 'should you lose your joy and get sick because of all these things? If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 330, 6, 19, 'it''s gone, it''s gone. Let it go! If it''s broken, it''s broken. Let it be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 330, 7, 19, 'broken! Everything on this earth is corruptible. If somebody cheated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 330, 8, 19, 'you, alright. He cheated me of my money but he''s not going to cheat me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 330, 9, 19, 'of my joy! A cheerful heart! Otherwise I can have all types of ailments');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 330, 10, 19, 'which pills and injections can never cure me of.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 330, 11, 19, 'The Good News Translation puts it like this: "Being cheerful keeps you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 330, 12, 19, 'healthy." That''s really true. I think even a doctor will tell you that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 330, 13, 19, '"...and to be gloomy is actually slow death." Did you know that? To be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 330, 14, 19, 'gloomy and grumpy - that is actually a slow form of committing suicide.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 330, 15, 19, 'It''s not this quick thing by putting your head under the train. It''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 330, 16, 19, 'slow form of committing suicide over a long period of time. This gloomy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 330, 17, 19, 'attitude of, "Everything is going bad, brother." Always miserable. No!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 330, 18, 19, 'Our attitude affects our body. Let''s learn to leave other peoples''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 330, 19, 19, 'business to themselves. That''s very often what makes us gloomy. We get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 330, 20, 19, 'so occupied with what other peoples'' business is instead of worrying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 330, 21, 19, 'about our own salvation. Another thing that can make people gloomy is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 330, 22, 19, 'such a terrific love for material things. Something''s broken,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 330, 23, 19, 'something''s lost, something''s cheated and all my joy is gone. Brothers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 330, 24, 19, 'and sisters, let''s take the word of God seriously.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 330, 25, 19, 'A wicked man receives a bribe from the bosom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 330, 26, 19, 'To pervert the ways of justice.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 330, 27, 19, 'Prov 17:23');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 330, 28, 19, 'Here it speaks about those who receive a bribe in contrast to what we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 331, 1, 19, 'saw in verse 8 about those who give a bribe. The one who receives a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 331, 2, 19, 'bribe is wicked because he perverts the way of justice. We say, "Well,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 331, 3, 19, 'I''ve never taken any bribes." Maybe that''s right, but supposing somebody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 331, 4, 19, 'has done you a favor - not a bribe - somebody helped you very much.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 331, 5, 19, 'Maybe a brother in the church helped you very much at a time when you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 331, 6, 19, 'were in great need in your family practically or monetarily or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 331, 7, 19, 'something. Then later on, you find in some situation, there''s a bit of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 331, 8, 19, 'fight between that brother and another brother. You tend to take sides');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 331, 9, 19, 'with the brother who helped you. Why? Because you got a bribe from him!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 331, 10, 19, 'He helped you when you were in difficulty six months ago, so you''re on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 331, 11, 19, 'his side now. You''ve been bribed to be ungodly! It can be so subtle,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 331, 12, 19, 'this business of bribing. I didn''t look for it. But the fact that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 331, 13, 19, 'somebody helped me and I took his side means that I received a bribe,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 331, 14, 19, 'whether I knew it or not. If we look into our flesh, there''s much we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 331, 15, 19, 'cleanse ourselves from in these areas.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 331, 16, 19, 'Wisdom is in the presence of the one who has understanding,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 331, 17, 19, 'But the eyes of a fool are on the ends of the earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 331, 18, 19, 'Prov 17:24');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 331, 19, 19, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 331, 20, 19, 'Wisdom is the main pursuit of sensible men, but a fool''s goals are at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 331, 21, 19, 'the ends of the earth!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 331, 22, 19, 'Prov 17:24, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 331, 23, 19, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 331, 24, 19, 'An intelligent person aims at wise action, but a fool starts off in many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 331, 25, 19, 'directions.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 331, 26, 19, 'Prov 17:24, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 331, 27, 19, 'We can look at this verse in a number of ways. It''s a very interesting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 331, 28, 19, 'verse. Firstly, it can mean that wisdom is right in front of you if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 332, 1, 19, 'are one who has understanding! That means that in your daily situations');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 332, 2, 19, 'in life as a wife, as a mother, as a person in the place of work, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 332, 3, 19, 'have the opportunity to grow in wisdom. But the foolish person''s eyes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 332, 4, 19, 'are on the ends of the earth. He says, "If I go to Norway I can become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 332, 5, 19, 'wise; or if I go to some other country, there I can get wisdom; or there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 332, 6, 19, 'in the midst of those godly brothers I can get wisdom." Some people in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 332, 7, 19, 'other parts of India think that only if you come to Bangalore you''ll get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 332, 8, 19, 'wisdom. Well, they just have to come and see all the fools that live in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 332, 9, 19, 'Bangalore to know that you can live in Bangalore and still not get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 332, 10, 19, 'wisdom! It''s not a question of hearing and hearing and hearing. So many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 332, 11, 19, 'people can hear and hear and hear and never become wise. But a person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 332, 12, 19, 'who has understanding knows, "Wherever I am, if God has arranged my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 332, 13, 19, 'circumstances like this, then right in front of me today I have the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 332, 14, 19, 'opportunity to become wise. My eyes don''t have to be to the ends of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 332, 15, 19, 'earth." We thank God for the opportunity to gather at conferences and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 332, 16, 19, 'meet others, but I don''t need that to become wise. That is to be a fool:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 332, 17, 19, 'to have my eyes to the ends of the earth and to think that''s the way to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 332, 18, 19, 'become wise. No!! Right in my presence is wisdom. When evil comes my way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 332, 19, 19, 'and I overcome it with good, I get wisdom. When temptations come my way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 332, 20, 19, 'and I seek God for grace to overcome them, I get wisdom. It''s right in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 332, 21, 19, 'my presence. But a fool looks for it at the ends of the earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 332, 22, 19, 'The same verse in The Living Bible gives a slightly different meaning,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 332, 23, 19, 'but it''s also implied in the NASB: "Wisdom is the main pursuit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 332, 24, 19, 'sensible men, but a fool''s goals are at the ends of the earth." That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 332, 25, 19, 'means that a sensible man''s main goal in life is to acquire wisdom. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 332, 26, 19, 'a fool, his goal is not wisdom. He has things like comfort and money.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 332, 27, 19, '"Where can I get a little more comfort? Where can I make a little more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 332, 28, 19, 'money?" That''s the mark of a fool. But a really sensible child of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 333, 1, 19, 'who does not bring sorrow to his heavenly father, his main goal in life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 333, 2, 19, 'is to acquire wisdom. "Lord, how can I get wisdom?" And God says, "Right');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 333, 3, 19, 'in front of you, where you are, where you live, right in your home. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 333, 4, 19, 'don''t have to go anywhere. You don''t have to go to the ends of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 333, 5, 19, 'earth. Right where you are, in front of you, in your daily situations');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 333, 6, 19, 'you can acquire wisdom. You can be wise! Seek me for grace!" God is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 333, 7, 19, 'one who gives wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 333, 8, 19, 'It''s good to look at the Good News Translation too, so that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 333, 9, 19, 'understand another shade of meaning in this verse: "An intelligent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 333, 10, 19, 'person aims at wise action…" Wise action means to have wisdom in all our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 333, 11, 19, 'actions. "...but a fool starts off in many directions." That''s the mark');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 333, 12, 19, 'of a fool. He doesn''t have a single goal. He''s into this and into that,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 333, 13, 19, 'and he''s sitting on that committee and the other committee like so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 333, 14, 19, 'evangelicals are. They''re doing this and that and the other thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 333, 15, 19, 'instead of pursuing wisdom as the main thing. I can accomplish much more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 333, 16, 19, 'if I have wisdom, even in doing a little bit, than doing a whole lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 333, 17, 19, 'things without wisdom. Paul said, "One thing I do..." (Philippians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 333, 18, 19, '3:13). Paul didn''t do 25 things. Otherwise, he would have wasted his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 333, 19, 19, 'life. He said, "One thing I do..." And Jesus said, "Seek one thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 333, 20, 19, 'first: God''s kingdom and his righteousness." That''s the mark of a wise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 333, 21, 19, 'person: He seeks God''s kingdom and righteousness with all his heart. So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 333, 22, 19, 'let''s take all these shades of meaning and exhortations in this verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 333, 23, 19, 'seriously. It''s a very profitable verse for us to meditate on.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 333, 24, 19, 'A foolish son is a grief to his father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 333, 25, 19, 'And bitterness to her who bore him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 333, 26, 19, 'Prov 17:25');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 333, 27, 19, 'We can ask ourselves, "How many parents are there who grieve over their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 333, 28, 19, 'unconverted children?" They should. They should have sorrow even if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 334, 1, 19, 'their children are big in the world and have big jobs. There are many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 334, 2, 19, 'parents who will grieve when their children don''t have a job. Mothers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 334, 3, 19, 'who say, "I hope my son will get a job!" What about your son getting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 334, 4, 19, 'converted and becoming spiritual?! "Yeah, yeah, that also if possible."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 334, 5, 19, 'That is a foolish mother and a foolish father. What''s the use, even if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 334, 6, 19, 'he gets a big job and makes a lot of money, if he''s not converted? Or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 334, 7, 19, 'even if he''s converted, if he''s carnal, worldly, interested in worldly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 334, 8, 19, 'things, and not wholehearted? Oh, that''s a challenge to us as parents.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 334, 9, 19, 'Many of our children are not grown up. If our children are small, we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 334, 10, 19, 'keep that in mind as our children are growing up, that our burden will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 334, 11, 19, 'be not only that they will be converted, but that they''ll grow up in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 334, 12, 19, 'wisdom. Wisdom. That should be a burden in our hearts. It will be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 334, 13, 19, 'grief to the father and a bitterness to the mother that they carry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 334, 14, 19, 'unitedly before God. They don''t blame each other, saying, "You''re the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 334, 15, 19, 'cause of that," like Adam and Eve did. Rather they are united in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 334, 16, 19, 'grief and sorrow, seeking God for the conversion of their children and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 334, 17, 19, 'that their children will be wholehearted. That''s a good thing for us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 334, 18, 19, 'seek God for.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 334, 19, 19, 'It is also not good to fine the righteous,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 334, 20, 19, 'Nor to strike the noble for their uprightness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 334, 21, 19, 'Prov 17:26');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 334, 22, 19, 'We know that it''s foolish to give a fine to a righteous person or to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 334, 23, 19, 'strike the noble person for being upright, but that is the injustice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 334, 24, 19, 'that is found in this foolish world and that Jesus suffered. They struck');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 334, 25, 19, 'him - the noble person - on the face and they condemned the righteous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 334, 26, 19, 'person to death. As long as we are in the world, we must be willing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 334, 27, 19, 'face the same injustice from a foolish world. Don''t be surprised when we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 334, 28, 19, 'face injustice. We can seek for justice, but sometimes it won''t be given');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 335, 1, 19, 'to us. When that happens, we just have to humble ourselves and follow in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 335, 2, 19, 'the footsteps of Jesus and commit our cause to Him who judges');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 335, 3, 19, 'righteously. He will sort it all out in the final day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 335, 4, 19, 'Those who are sure of themselves do not talk all the time. People who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 335, 5, 19, 'stay calm have real insight.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 335, 6, 19, 'Prov 17:27, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 335, 7, 19, 'A talkative person is never a wise person. There''s no exception to that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 335, 8, 19, 'rule. Not even one exception. There is no wisdom in always opening your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 335, 9, 19, 'mouth and passing an opinion. That''s alright for someone who is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 335, 10, 19, 'spiritual baby. Sometimes spiritual babies are like that, but we should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 335, 11, 19, 'grow out of that talkativeness very soon. You see that sometimes with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 335, 12, 19, 'young brothers and sometimes young sisters too - always so talkative.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 335, 13, 19, 'Ask yourself: when you sit with other brothers or sisters, who is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 335, 14, 19, 'one who talks the most? If you find that you''re the one who always talks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 335, 15, 19, 'the most, then put your name down on the head of the list of fools in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 335, 16, 19, 'that fellowship. #1 at the top of the list is you. Always talking the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 335, 17, 19, 'most. There''s never a time when you can keep your mouth shut. A wise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 335, 18, 19, 'person knows how to control himself. He doesn''t have to speak all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 335, 19, 19, 'time. He has knowledge. He doesn''t have to boast about his knowledge and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 335, 20, 19, 'show that he knows so many things in the bible. Even in a meeting, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 335, 21, 19, 'don''t have to share everything that we know. Wisdom means to know what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 335, 22, 19, 'to speak - not to show off our bible knowledge. That is foolishness. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 335, 23, 19, 'to know what to share and when to keep quiet is tremendous wisdom. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 335, 24, 19, 'yet, there can be such a lust in a person when he wants to speak again');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 335, 25, 19, 'and again and again. It''s all because he thinks he''s such an important');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 335, 26, 19, 'person! Usually when believers are very young and immature, they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 335, 27, 19, 'like that. But we must get out of that folly quickly and be wise,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 335, 28, 19, 'particularly in private conversations. Don''t be the one who dominates');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 336, 1, 19, 'the conversation so that you don''t give a chance to other people to open');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 336, 2, 19, 'their mouths.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 336, 3, 19, 'Even a fool, when he keeps silent, is considered wise;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 336, 4, 19, 'When he closes his lips, he is considered prudent.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 336, 5, 19, 'Prov 17:28');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 336, 6, 19, 'This verse speaks again about a familiar topic. Even if you''re a fool,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 336, 7, 19, 'if you keep silent, people may think you''re a wise brother. Think of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 336, 8, 19, 'that. That''s the first step to wisdom. When he closes his lips, he''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 336, 9, 19, 'considered wise. Now, many of us are very eager to say, "I am foolish."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 336, 10, 19, 'But then it says if you are foolish, why don''t you keep your mouth shut');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 336, 11, 19, 'a little bit? Why do you talk so much? You keep on talking, talking,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 336, 12, 19, 'talking. I don''t mean in the meeting. It''s the other way around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 336, 13, 19, 'sometimes in the meetings - that people don''t share enough. People are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 336, 14, 19, 'usually too shy and quiet in meetings, but in private conversations,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 336, 15, 19, 'they are the opposite. Some of these sisters who you think are so quiet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 336, 16, 19, '- oh if only you could meet them when they''re in their own company! Boy,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 336, 17, 19, 'you''d get quite a different opinion! Think of that: to be so foolish as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 336, 18, 19, 'to talk and talk and talk excessively. Say something edifying. Have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 336, 19, 19, 'little more control over your tongue. The word of God speaks much about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 336, 20, 19, 'that. If we acknowledge that we are fools and we continue to speak such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 336, 21, 19, 'a lot, then we have to say we are absolute hypocrites. We don''t really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 336, 22, 19, 'believe that we are fools, because if we believed it, we''d try to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 336, 23, 19, 'control our tongues a little more.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 336, 24, 20, 'Chapter 18 Chapter 18');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 336, 25, 20, 'He who separates himself seeks his own desire,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 336, 26, 20, 'He quarrels against all sound wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 336, 27, 20, 'Prov 18:1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 336, 28, 20, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 337, 1, 20, 'People who do not get along with others are interested only in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 337, 2, 20, 'themselves; they will disagree with what everyone else knows is right.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 337, 3, 20, 'Prov 18:1, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 337, 4, 20, 'There are two types of separation. One type is the separation we read of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 337, 5, 20, 'in Genesis 1, where God separated the light from the darkness. The other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 337, 6, 20, 'is the separation that you read of in Genesis 3-4, where Satan separated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 337, 7, 20, 'Adam and Eve and Cain and Abel. One is a godly separation; the other is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 337, 8, 20, 'satanic. There is a separation which is godly. Like it says in 2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 337, 9, 20, 'Corinthians 6:17, "Come out from among them. Be separate and touch not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 337, 10, 20, 'the unclean thing." There is also a separation that is spoken of in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 337, 11, 20, 'book of Jude in verse 19, which says, "These are they who separate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 337, 12, 20, 'themselves, sensual, having not the Spirit" (King James Version). Indian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 337, 13, 20, 'Christianity is FULL of such people who have come out of some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 337, 14, 20, 'denomination, separating themselves because they couldn''t get along with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 337, 15, 20, 'somebody. They wanted to be the elders. Don''t ever be deceived into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 337, 16, 20, 'thinking that just because somebody came out of some dead denomination,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 337, 17, 20, 'he is interested in the truth. No. He may be in the category of one who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 337, 18, 20, 'has separated himself according to Jude 19 and not according to 2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 337, 19, 20, 'Corinthians 6:17. Those who separate themselves without the leading of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 337, 20, 20, 'the Holy Spirit are seeking their own. They wanted some honor, some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 337, 21, 20, 'position, some title - something which they didn''t get. They got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 337, 22, 20, 'offended and they separated themselves. Of course, they won''t say that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 337, 23, 20, 'this is the reason. Instead they''ll say, "This is a doctrinal matter,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 337, 24, 20, 'brother! We have to stand for the truth in these days of compromise." We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 337, 25, 20, 'must not be such fools that we believe all these people who have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 337, 26, 20, 'separated themselves. We have to see and sense, "What is the spirit in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 337, 27, 20, 'this man?" I''ve come across a lot of people myself who want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 337, 28, 20, 'fellowship with us, but I can sense the spirit in some of them is wrong.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 338, 1, 20, 'They''ve separated themselves with some other motive. Be careful because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 338, 2, 20, 'the book of Jude speaks about those who separate themselves and seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 338, 3, 20, 'their own. It says in this verse, "he quarrels against all sound');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 338, 4, 20, 'wisdom." They have a pretext for everything. There''s a reason why they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 338, 5, 20, 'won''t listen.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 338, 6, 20, 'The Good News Translation says that if you''re a person who cannot get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 338, 7, 20, 'along with others, that clearly proves that you''re only interested in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 338, 8, 20, 'yourself. That''s a strong word. And they will disagree with that which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 338, 9, 20, 'everybody else knows is right. So we''re not to think that everybody who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 338, 10, 20, 'separates themselves is necessarily spiritual.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 338, 11, 20, 'A fool does not care whether he understands a thing or not; all he wants');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 338, 12, 20, 'to do is to show how clever he is.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 338, 13, 20, 'Prov 18:2, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 338, 14, 20, 'This is another mark of a fool. He does not bother about whether this is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 338, 15, 20, 'according to the truth or according to wisdom. He just wants to show how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 338, 16, 20, 'clever he is, how much he knows of the scriptures, how spiritual he is.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 338, 17, 20, 'That''s always the mark of a fool. He opens his mouth to show how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 338, 18, 20, 'spiritual he is, and thereby he shows he''s a fool.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 338, 19, 20, 'Sin and shame go together. Lose your honor, and you will get scorn in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 338, 20, 20, 'its place.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 338, 21, 20, 'Prov 18:3, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 338, 22, 20, 'When we sin, and shame, contempt, dishonor, and reproach come as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 338, 23, 20, 'result, we''ve just got to admit, "I''m reaping what I''ve sown. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 338, 24, 20, 'the result of my sin." One of the results of sin is that we lose our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 338, 25, 20, 'testimony before others. Once we have lost our testimony, it''s very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 338, 26, 20, 'difficult to regain it. And that''s why we have to be watchful that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 338, 27, 20, 'don''t bring reproach upon the Lord''s name.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 338, 28, 20, 'The words of a man''s mouth are deep waters;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 339, 1, 20, 'The fountain of wisdom is a bubbling brook.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 339, 2, 20, 'Prov 18:4');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 339, 3, 20, 'There are two things spoken of here: one is depth and the other is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 339, 4, 20, 'freshness (like a spring). It says that the words of our mouth should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 339, 5, 20, 'have a depth in them, and there should be a freshness in them. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 339, 6, 20, 'one of the results of wisdom: that the more we acquire the wisdom that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 339, 7, 20, 'spoken of in the book of Proverbs, the more value there is in the words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 339, 8, 20, 'that we speak, and there will be a freshness in what God gives to us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 339, 9, 20, 'share with others. Our goal whenever we speak or share God''s word to one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 339, 10, 20, 'another - not just in the church, but the many times we meet and talk');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 339, 11, 20, 'together - should be to have a depth in our words. The world is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 339, 12, 20, 'characterized by a tremendous shallowness in their speech. They are only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 339, 13, 20, 'interested in shallow, earthly things. And even with believers, that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 339, 14, 20, 'the case most of the time. And not only depth, but freshness. When we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 339, 15, 20, 'are in touch with God, there won''t be anything stale or stinking in what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 339, 16, 20, 'we have to say. There will be a freshness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 339, 17, 20, 'To show partiality to the wicked is not good,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 339, 18, 20, 'Nor to thrust aside the righteous in judgment.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 339, 19, 20, 'Prov 18:5');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 339, 20, 20, 'Now this is very plain and self-evident. This is a description of how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 339, 21, 20, 'folly has taken over in the courts of law in this world. This was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 339, 22, 20, 'clearly manifested in the case of the judgment of Jesus himself, where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 339, 23, 20, 'the righteous was thrust aside in judgment.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 339, 24, 20, 'A fool gets into constant fights. His mouth is his undoing! His words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 339, 25, 20, 'endanger him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 339, 26, 20, 'Prov 18:6-7, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 339, 27, 20, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 339, 28, 20, 'When some fool starts an argument, he is asking for a beating. When a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 340, 1, 20, 'fool speaks, he is ruining himself; he gets caught in the trap of his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 340, 2, 20, 'own words.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 340, 3, 20, 'Prov 18:6-7, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 340, 4, 20, 'As we''ve seen, the book of Proverbs has much to say about the use of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 340, 5, 20, 'tongue. Here it says a fool gets into fights because of the way he uses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 340, 6, 20, 'his tongue. None of us would like to consider ourselves as fools');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 340, 7, 20, 'according to the teaching of Proverbs. But if we create a fight by our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 340, 8, 20, 'words, then we have to remember that the word of God calls us fools. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 340, 9, 20, 'you kick up a row with a shopkeeper with the words you speak, you''re a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 340, 10, 20, 'fool. Or if you kick up a row with your husband or wife by the words you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 340, 11, 20, 'speak, then according to God''s word, you''re a fool. A fool gets into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 340, 12, 20, 'constant fights, and people who get into fights, the word of God says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 340, 13, 20, 'are fools. It''s amazing how we can deceive ourselves tremendously in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 340, 14, 20, 'this area. The Holy Spirit had to emphasize through James, "Let no one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 340, 15, 20, 'deceive yourself. If a man cannot control his tongue, his religion is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 340, 16, 20, 'worth zero whatever doctrine he may believe" (James 1:26 - paraphrase).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 340, 17, 20, 'And here is where the devil deceives people: because of an increase in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 340, 18, 20, 'knowledge of scripture, you are becoming spiritual. It is not an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 340, 19, 20, 'increase in the knowledge of scripture that makes us spiritual - it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 340, 20, 20, 'the control of our tongue. So we have to take these words seriously. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 340, 21, 20, 'fool is one who gets into constant fights. His mouth is his undoing. His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 340, 22, 20, 'words endanger him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 340, 23, 20, 'The Good News Translation says, "When a fool speaks, he''s ruining');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 340, 24, 20, 'himself." That''s something we don''t realize: that our words pollute us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 340, 25, 20, 'Jesus said, "By our words we will be justified and by our words we will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 340, 26, 20, 'be condemned." The fool ruins himself and he gets caught in the trap of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 340, 27, 20, 'his own words. So words are something that the book of Proverbs speaks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 340, 28, 20, 'much about, and we need to take this seriously if we are interested in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 341, 1, 20, 'wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 341, 2, 20, 'What dainty morsels rumors are. They are eaten with great relish!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 341, 3, 20, 'Prov 18:8, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 341, 4, 20, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 341, 5, 20, 'Gossip is so tasty - how we love to swallow it!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 341, 6, 20, 'Prov 18:8, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 341, 7, 20, 'Like we''ve considered before, if we find gossip tasty, then that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 341, 8, 20, 'perhaps why people supply it constantly to our house. It''s just like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 341, 9, 20, 'various vegetable vendors, fishmongers, and people who sell meat or any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 341, 10, 20, 'other thing stop by our house because they have found from past');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 341, 11, 20, 'experience that we regularly buy from them. In the same way,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 341, 12, 20, 'gossip-mongers also stop by those houses where they find people who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 341, 13, 20, 'regularly giving a ready ear to their gossip. Supply meets demand. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 341, 14, 20, 'cannot blame only the person who spreads the gossip. We have to see that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 341, 15, 20, 'this particular person has come to my house because he has found from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 341, 16, 20, 'past experience that I give my ear to his gossip. He knows that gossip');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 341, 17, 20, 'is tasty to me, and I love to swallow it. So when a gossip-monger comes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 341, 18, 20, 'repeatedly to my place, then I have to see that as an indication of my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 341, 19, 20, 'condition. You see, a fishmonger will never keep coming to your house if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 341, 20, 20, 'every time he comes, you turn him away at the gate and say, "We don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 341, 21, 20, 'want any fish." After a few days, he won''t come. The supply is because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 341, 22, 20, 'there is a demand from within that house. That''s something we must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 341, 23, 20, 'remember. That''s how we drive all these gossip-mongers far from us: we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 341, 24, 20, 'show that we are not interested in what they have. We do not consider');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 341, 25, 20, 'gossip tasty. And yet the word of God says it is like that to many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 341, 26, 20, 'people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 341, 27, 20, 'A lazy person is as bad as someone who is destructive.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 341, 28, 20, 'Prov 18:9, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 342, 1, 20, 'We wouldn''t think of putting a person who is destroying property in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 342, 2, 20, 'same category as a lazy person, but the Bible does. It says a person who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 342, 3, 20, 'is lazy is exactly the same as a person who is destructive, and hard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 342, 4, 20, 'work is one of the themes which the book of Proverbs brings forth again');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 342, 5, 20, 'and again. It''s very good that we can read words like this again and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 342, 6, 20, 'again. When something is repeated again and again, it''s like a father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 342, 7, 20, 'writing a letter to a son who''s far away and repeating something many,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 342, 8, 20, 'many times in the letter. Then you know that''s something important.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 342, 9, 20, 'Something very important. Here we see hard work and diligence are things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 342, 10, 20, 'that Proverbs emphasizes tremendously.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 342, 11, 20, 'The name of the Lord is a strong tower;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 342, 12, 20, 'The righteous runs into it and is safe.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 342, 13, 20, 'A rich man''s wealth is his strong city,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 342, 14, 20, 'And like a high wall in his own imagination.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 342, 15, 20, 'Prov 18:10-11');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 342, 16, 20, 'Proverbs 18:10 is a beautiful verse. Our security is in the name of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 342, 17, 20, 'Lord. In the Old Testament, the Lord''s name represented the nature of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 342, 18, 20, 'God. The nature of God is love and that''s also his name. God is love.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 342, 19, 20, 'His name is Father. His name is Jesus. Those are his names. And we know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 342, 20, 20, 'that all those names symbolize things that bring security to us. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 342, 21, 20, 'are like a tower. We run into that tower and say, "Jesus, I see who you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 342, 22, 20, 'are in the scriptures. Father, I see who you are in the scriptures. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 342, 23, 20, 'know you are love, perfect love, and I find my security in you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 342, 24, 20, 'Therefore I don''t have any fear."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 342, 25, 20, 'I recently read something encouraging which talked about how Christians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 342, 26, 20, 'can very often be tortured by preachers who tell them, "God''s not doing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 342, 27, 20, 'anything for you because of your unbelief," even though they are crying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 342, 28, 20, 'out to God for help. This type of preaching can bring many people into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 343, 1, 20, 'bondage. The author used this illustration: if my son was lying in a pit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 343, 2, 20, 'and crying out to me for help, I wouldn''t dream of asking, "Do you trust');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 343, 3, 20, 'me? Let me see if you have faith." I wouldn''t even think of asking all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 343, 4, 20, 'that. I would immediately go and help him. The very fact that he calls');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 343, 5, 20, 'out to me proves that he believes I can help him. We don''t have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 343, 6, 20, 'torture ourselves by thinking, "Do I have faith?" If I call out to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 343, 7, 20, 'Lord, that proves I trust him. That''s why I call out to him. His name is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 343, 8, 20, 'love. Sometimes we can get the idea that God is sort of a tyrant. Here I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 343, 9, 20, 'am lying in the pit saying, "Daddy, help me!" and he says, "Let me see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 343, 10, 20, 'if you have faith. Oh, I see a little bit of unbelief. Sorry, you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 343, 11, 20, 'to stay in the pit." It''s an insult to think that God is like that when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 343, 12, 20, 'even an earthly father won''t treat his own son like that. It''s easy to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 343, 13, 20, 'get into that type of bondage - "Oh, there''s a wee bit of unbelief in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 343, 14, 20, 'heart, so God is going to leave me in the pit." That''s ridiculous. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 343, 15, 20, 'name and nature of the Lord is love. Let me never forget that and let me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 343, 16, 20, 'find my security in that. The strong tower. I run into it and I''m safe,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 343, 17, 20, 'and the doors are wide open. Praise God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 343, 18, 20, 'Then in verse 11 we see a contrast to verse 10. Do you know who Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 343, 19, 20, 'said the two masters are that we can serve? God and mammon. So, the rich');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 343, 20, 20, 'man''s strong tower is his money. But it''s only in his imagination. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 343, 21, 20, 'other words, he thinks that he''s getting security in money. For the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 343, 22, 20, 'righteous, his security is in the name and the nature of the Lord. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 343, 23, 20, 'knows God is love. But for the person of the world, his security is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 343, 24, 20, 'money and in earthly things. So we find that this is an area where we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 343, 25, 20, 'can profitably examine ourselves to see where we find our security. Is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 343, 26, 20, 'our security in the nature of a God who is perfect love or in something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 343, 27, 20, 'earthly? In my imagination I can say, "This earthly thing is what will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 343, 28, 20, 'protect me. I have a job in an office or a factory from which I cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 344, 1, 20, 'be terminated because of the wonderful trade unions that are in place.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 344, 2, 20, 'What security I have!" It''s amazing how believers can have more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 344, 3, 20, 'confidence in trade unions than in the living God. Often, they don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 344, 4, 20, 'even join the trade unions. But they''re thankful that they''re there,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 344, 5, 20, 'because they provide security for their job in the office or factory.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 344, 6, 20, 'The bottom line is that their trust is not in God. It isn''t. In their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 344, 7, 20, 'imagination they say, "It is this earthly thing that protects me, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 344, 8, 20, 'gives me leave travel concession. It gives me provision for medical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 344, 9, 20, 'expenses and so many other things. My security is found in this." It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 344, 10, 20, 'amazing how easily the flesh has such a tremendous tendency to lean upon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 344, 11, 20, 'the arm of flesh. There''s a curse, the bible says, upon those who lean');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 344, 12, 20, 'upon the arm of flesh (Jeremiah 17:5, 2 Chronicles 32:8). But blessed is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 344, 13, 20, 'the man who trusts in the Lord. Blessed are you if your confidence is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 344, 14, 20, 'not in anything earthly, but in the Lord and the Lord alone. Say, "My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 344, 15, 20, 'security is in him. If I seek his kingdom first and his righteousness, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 344, 16, 20, 'don''t need any trade unions or leave travel concessions or medical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 344, 17, 20, 'benefits, etc. The name of the Lord is more than sufficient." I have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 344, 18, 20, 'be very careful that my wall of security around me and my family is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 344, 19, 20, 'the terms and conditions laid down in my appointment order. Then I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 344, 20, 20, 'serving the wrong master, and I can never make progress in my Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 344, 21, 20, 'life. The blessing is upon those who lean upon the Lord and trust in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 344, 22, 20, 'him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 344, 23, 20, 'Pride ends in destruction; humility ends in honor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 344, 24, 20, 'Prov 18:12, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 344, 25, 20, 'We see this clearly in the case of Jesus: humility ended in honor. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 344, 26, 20, 'the case of Satan, pride ended in destruction. Those are two ways');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 344, 27, 20, 'described in this verse - two ways in which all the people of the world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 344, 28, 20, 'are going - either in pride which leads to destruction or in humility');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 345, 1, 20, 'which leads to honor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 345, 2, 20, 'Listen before you answer. If you don''t, you''re being stupid and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 345, 3, 20, 'insulting.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 345, 4, 20, 'Prov 18:13, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 345, 5, 20, 'I wonder whether you have noticed people who, while you''re speaking to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 345, 6, 20, 'them and saying something, don''t even wait for you to finish. They are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 345, 7, 20, 'quick to say something. It is an unconscious sin. But it''s an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 345, 8, 20, 'unconscious sin that we should get light on quickly. To interrupt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 345, 9, 20, 'another person when he is saying something means that I am not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 345, 10, 20, 'interested in listening but I want to answer; I want to say something.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 345, 11, 20, 'That''s usually an indication of how important I consider myself to be.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 345, 12, 20, 'It''s extremely sad when this is found in a person who is supposed to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 345, 13, 20, 'wise and mature. It''s alright when it''s seen in a person who is a new');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 345, 14, 20, 'convert and doesn''t have light on his flesh, but this is an area where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 345, 15, 20, 'we really need to ask God for grace if we have a weakness here. Listen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 345, 16, 20, 'before you answer, and when someone is speaking to you, don''t interrupt.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 345, 17, 20, 'That''s not good manners. Wait until he or she finishes speaking and then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 345, 18, 20, 'speak - unless of course the other person is a chatterbox and you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 345, 19, 20, 'to interject to make the person keep quiet. That''s a different thing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 345, 20, 20, 'But if a person is trying to say something to you, a principle to follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 345, 21, 20, 'is: listen before you answer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 345, 22, 20, 'Your will to live can sustain you when you are sick, but if you lose it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 345, 23, 20, 'your last hope is gone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 345, 24, 20, 'Prov 18:14, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 345, 25, 20, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 345, 26, 20, 'A man''s courage can sustain his broken body, but when courage dies, what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 345, 27, 20, 'hope is left?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 345, 28, 20, 'Prov 18:14, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 346, 1, 20, 'We know that those who commit suicide are actually taking away a life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 346, 2, 20, 'which they have no right to take away. Therefore they are in the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 346, 3, 20, 'category as murderers. It''s just that they murdered themselves. And we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 346, 4, 20, 'know that the word of God says no murderer has eternal life. So we know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 346, 5, 20, 'that no person who commits suicide can be saved. He has no eternal life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 346, 6, 20, 'And when a person longs to die and says, "Oh, I''m sick and tired of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 346, 7, 20, 'life, and I''d like to die," it is actually the same spirit. That''s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 346, 8, 20, 'spirit of suicide that''s influencing a person to say that. We must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 346, 9, 20, 'remember that. There''s actually no difference between the spirit that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 346, 10, 20, 'led that man to put his head under the train and kill himself and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 346, 11, 20, 'spirit that makes you say, "I''m sick and tired of life. I''d rather die."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 346, 12, 20, 'Elijah prayed that he might die in 1 Kings 19:4. That was the spirit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 346, 13, 20, 'suicide that he was listening to at the time. It''s wrong to listen to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 346, 14, 20, 'that spirit. The word of God says in 1 Corinthians 15:26 that death is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 346, 15, 20, 'an enemy, and that''s something we need to understand very clearly. 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 346, 16, 20, 'Corinthians 15:25 speaks about how Jesus must reign until he has put all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 346, 17, 20, 'his enemies under his feet. Let''s think of a battle ground. On one side');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 346, 18, 20, 'is Jesus and on the other side are his enemies who he is going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 346, 19, 20, 'defeat. And it says there''s one enemy who''s going to hold out for quite');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 346, 20, 20, 'a long time against Jesus and that is mentioned in verse 26. The last');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 346, 21, 20, 'enemy fighting against Jesus that will be abolished is death. So death');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 346, 22, 20, 'is an enemy of Jesus according to 1 Corinthians 15:26. How then can you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 346, 23, 20, 'welcome it? Can you welcome an enemy of Jesus into your home? Into your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 346, 24, 20, 'life? No! It is not the will of God that we welcome death. We must be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 346, 25, 20, 'ready to die at all times - that''s another thing. My conscience must be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 346, 26, 20, 'clear so that I don''t need any preparation time either for death or for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 346, 27, 20, 'the Lord''s coming. But to welcome death is one hundred percent wrong.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 346, 28, 20, 'That is to welcome an enemy of Jesus into my life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 347, 1, 20, 'This is why we need to see that sickness and death are to be resisted in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 347, 2, 20, 'the name of Jesus Christ so that I say, "Lord, I want to live on earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 347, 3, 20, 'as long as you want me to live. I don''t want to die too soon. I want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 347, 4, 20, 'die when your time for me is up." "The number of your days I will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 347, 5, 20, 'fulfill," the Lord has said in Exodus 23:26. I have to take that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 347, 6, 20, 'seriously. God has a certain number of days for me and I want to fulfill');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 347, 7, 20, 'all of them. Out in the world people talk so lightly about death, and we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 347, 8, 20, 'can be infected by that spirit. We are to be different. We don''t look');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 347, 9, 20, 'for death. We look for the coming of Jesus Christ always. Even if you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 347, 10, 20, 'one hundred years old, you''re to look for the coming of Jesus Christ -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 347, 11, 20, 'not for death by any means. And so the will to live can sustain you when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 347, 12, 20, 'you''re sick. We must have a will to live - not for ourselves, certainly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 347, 13, 20, 'not, but for the glory of God! Say, "Lord, I want to make use of my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 347, 14, 20, 'earthly life for your glory." That can sustain you if you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 347, 15, 20, 'capitulate and give in to the enemy of death. Don''t say, "Oh well. I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 347, 16, 20, 'going to die now." No. If you lose the will to live and you don''t see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 347, 17, 20, 'that death is an enemy, your last hope is gone. This teaches us what our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 347, 18, 20, 'attitude should be towards death.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 347, 19, 20, 'The Living Bible paraphrase teaches us that when we get discouraged, our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 347, 20, 20, 'case becomes hopeless. The opposite of being discouraged is to have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 347, 21, 20, 'courage - to say, "Yes, God is going to help me even now." Those are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 347, 22, 20, 'words of courage. As long as such a spirit is there, even a broken body');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 347, 23, 20, 'can be sustained. But when that courage dies and discouragement sets in,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 347, 24, 20, 'there''s no hope left. There are people who die very soon physically when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 347, 25, 20, 'they are discouraged and don''t receive encouragement from others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 347, 26, 20, 'Intelligent people are always eager and ready to learn.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 347, 27, 20, 'Prov 18:15, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 347, 28, 20, 'Another thing that the book of Proverbs says is that a person who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 348, 1, 20, 'wise is a person who has a willingness to learn. He recognizes that he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 348, 2, 20, 'knows so little. Like Socrates said, "I know that I know nothing." If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 348, 3, 20, 'I''m wiser than others, it''s only because I know that I know nothing. All');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 348, 4, 20, 'the others also know nothing, but they don''t know it. That''s the only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 348, 5, 20, 'difference. If we know that we know nothing, then we are willing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 348, 6, 20, 'learn.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 348, 7, 20, 'A man''s gift makes room for him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 348, 8, 20, 'And brings him before great men.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 348, 9, 20, 'Prov 18:16');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 348, 10, 20, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 348, 11, 20, 'A bribe does wonders; it will bring you before men of importance!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 348, 12, 20, 'Prov 18:16, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 348, 13, 20, 'We can look at this verse in two ways: The first is in relation to The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 348, 14, 20, 'Living Bible paraphrase. When the book of Proverbs speaks about gifts,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 348, 15, 20, 'it can also be referring to bribes. We know that in the world they say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 348, 16, 20, 'if you give a bribe, it can bring you before great men so that you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 348, 17, 20, 'get something accomplished. And if we keep a sensitive conscience, we''ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 348, 18, 20, 'find sometimes that there''s a very thin line between giving a gift and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 348, 19, 20, 'giving a bribe. That''s something we need to give a little thought to,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 348, 20, 20, 'because if you find yourself in such a situation, it''s easy to justify');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 348, 21, 20, 'yourself by saying, "That''s only a gift." But it may be a bribe that I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 348, 22, 20, 'giving or receiving. The thing I need to ask myself is: Am I influenced');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 348, 23, 20, 'in any way by this thing that I have received so that I become partial');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 348, 24, 20, 'towards the giver in some situation? Then it is a bribe, even if it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 348, 25, 20, 'called a gift. Or if you''re giving, ask yourself, "Am I giving this with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 348, 26, 20, 'the intention that he will be influenced in some way towards me? Then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 348, 27, 20, 'it''s a bribe. You see how we can give gifts in the church to one another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 348, 28, 20, 'which are given with the intention of wanting that brother to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 349, 1, 20, 'attached to me. What is that? That''s a bribe. It''s a bribe to try and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 349, 2, 20, 'get that brother attached to me. It''s a bribe to get that brother to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 349, 3, 20, 'a special friend of mine. A tremendous amount of bribing can go on even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 349, 4, 20, 'under the guise of giving. So we have to remember that there''s a very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 349, 5, 20, 'thin line between a gift and a bribe. We need to keep our conscience');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 349, 6, 20, 'sensitive here that gifts given are not bribes and gifts received are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 349, 7, 20, 'not bribes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 349, 8, 20, 'The other way we can look at this verse is spiritually - that a man''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 349, 9, 20, 'gift makes room for him and brings him before great men. That means,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 349, 10, 20, 'there is no need for any person to sit and think, "Well, I''ve not been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 349, 11, 20, 'given an opportunity to do something for the Lord." There are people who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 349, 12, 20, 'say that. They say, "In my church, my pastor never gives me an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 349, 13, 20, 'opportunity to serve the Lord. He''s always suppressing me." If a man has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 349, 14, 20, 'a gift from God, no human being can ever suppress it. That''s impossible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 349, 15, 20, 'Unless the God he believes in is some powerless, helpless God. But if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 349, 16, 20, 'it''s the almighty God the Bible speaks of, and he has given a man a gift');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 349, 17, 20, 'of the Holy Spirit, no amount of men can stop that man''s gift from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 349, 18, 20, 'making room for him. His gift can expand his sphere of ministry. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 349, 19, 20, 'won''t matter if anybody tries to suppress us. It won''t matter if others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 349, 20, 20, 'seem to have more opportunity than we have. The fact of the matter is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 349, 21, 20, 'that God gives each man a different gift, and it''s pointless coveting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 349, 22, 20, 'another man''s gift. A man''s gift makes room for him, and that''s why we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 349, 23, 20, 'can be at rest. If God has given you a gift, that will make room for you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 349, 24, 20, 'spiritually. But if we covet, we only end up in frustration and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 349, 25, 20, 'criticism and jealousy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 349, 26, 20, 'The first to plead his case seems right,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 349, 27, 20, 'Until another comes and examines him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 349, 28, 20, 'Prov 18:17');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 350, 1, 20, 'That''s true. Those of us who are fathers and mothers have plenty of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 350, 2, 20, 'experience with this, especially if you have more than one child.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 350, 3, 20, 'Suppose one child comes and says one thing and the other child comes and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 350, 4, 20, 'says something completely different. That''s why God has given us two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 350, 5, 20, 'ears so that we can hear one side, and then we can hear the other side.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 350, 6, 20, 'Then we can arrive at a judgment. We must not live as people who only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 350, 7, 20, 'have one ear - that''s partiality. No. I must listen to both sides and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 350, 8, 20, 'then I can make the right decision.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 350, 9, 20, 'When it says, "The first to plead his case seems right," why is that?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 350, 10, 20, 'Because he presents his case in such a way that he hides all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 350, 11, 20, 'mistakes he did and only presents the mistakes the other person did.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 350, 12, 20, 'That''s how children are: "He did this, he did this!" And the other child');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 350, 13, 20, 'will come and say, "He did this, he did this!" Both of what they said is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 350, 14, 20, 'absolutely true. The only thing is, it''s not the whole truth. They''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 350, 15, 20, 'concealed what they themselves did. Now that''s alright with children.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 350, 16, 20, 'They haven''t come under grace. But how sad it is when grown-up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 350, 17, 20, 'believers, who understand the New and Living Way, also have this spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 350, 18, 20, 'of self-justification. It is sad when we do not understand how to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 350, 19, 20, 'absolutely righteous in presenting a case: "This is what that person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 350, 20, 20, 'did, but this is what I did as well. I also did some foolish things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 350, 21, 20, 'there." It''s almost impossible to find a believer who will present a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 350, 22, 20, 'case like that. But there are a few who judge and cleanse themselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 350, 23, 20, 'from this self-justifying spirit which runs in our flesh, so that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 350, 24, 20, 'are no longer interested in justifying themselves but rather in honesty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 350, 25, 20, 'and truthfulness. That''s something we must develop, brothers and sisters');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 350, 26, 20, '- that when we present a particular case or describe a situation, we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 350, 27, 20, 'so truthful that we will speak absolutely honestly about our own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 350, 28, 20, 'blunders, failures, and wretched things that we did so that this verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 351, 1, 20, 'will not apply to us anymore. That way, when the first puts forward his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 351, 2, 20, 'case, he has spoken the whole truth. Think of that. Think to be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 351, 3, 20, 'believer like that - that after I''ve put across the truth, there''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 351, 4, 20, 'nothing more for my opponent to say, because I''ve said his side also.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 351, 5, 20, 'I''ve said everything that I did. It''s wonderful if we can be so upright');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 351, 6, 20, 'and love righteousness so much. But in the world it is quite different.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 351, 7, 20, 'Everybody speaks in such a way that his case seems right until the other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 351, 8, 20, 'person comes and pleads his case.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 351, 9, 20, 'The cast lot puts an end to strife');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 351, 10, 20, 'And decides between the mighty ones.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 351, 11, 20, 'Prov 18:18');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 351, 12, 20, 'In the Old Testament, this was the way they settled disputes. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 351, 13, 20, 'related to verse 17. Two people are quarreling and haven''t been able to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 351, 14, 20, 'come to an agreement, so they cast lots. Casting lots is like flipping a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 351, 15, 20, 'coin. Heads or tails. But praise God in the New Testament, we don''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 351, 16, 20, 'to flip a coin. Jesus has taught us something far better, and that is:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 351, 17, 20, 'when there is a contention, you yield. Having the grace to yield is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 351, 18, 20, 'mark of a really spiritual person. Like in the case of the two women who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 351, 19, 20, 'came to Solomon with one baby, and Solomon said, "Let''s cut it into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 351, 20, 20, 'two." Who yielded? The real mother. She said, "No, let her have it."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 351, 21, 20, 'That''s always the proof of the real mother. That''s always the proof of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 351, 22, 20, 'more mature, spiritual person: "Brother, have it your way." Think of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 351, 23, 20, 'that story of the real mother. It''s a tremendous lesson in yielding.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 351, 24, 20, 'Let''s say husband and wife are locked in some battle just like those two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 351, 25, 20, 'mothers before Solomon. They''re even willing to cut something into two.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 351, 26, 20, 'Nobody is willing to yield. Even believers find themselves in such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 351, 27, 20, 'situations. Learn to yield. It''s not by a coin toss that we end our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 351, 28, 20, 'arguments in the New Covenant. It''s by the way of the cross.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 352, 1, 20, 'It is harder to win back the friendship of an offended brother than to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 352, 2, 20, 'capture a fortified city. His anger shuts you out like iron bars.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 352, 3, 20, 'Prov 18:19, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 352, 4, 20, 'We can ask ourselves: if someone has said something to me or done');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 352, 5, 20, 'something and I am offended, is it now very difficult for me to have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 352, 6, 20, 'fellowship with that person? What is this like? It''s like the bars of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 352, 7, 20, 'castle and the strong city surrounded by walls. Do you know what this is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 352, 8, 20, 'referring to? It''s a cold attitude towards a brother. That''s what it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 352, 9, 20, 'referring to. I see another brother and there''s just a little coldness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 352, 10, 20, 'in me towards him because I haven''t forgotten what he said to me five');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 352, 11, 20, 'years ago. I have these bars, this wall around me. Of course, he''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 352, 12, 20, 'good brother and I stand up and say, "I have nothing against anybody. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 352, 13, 20, 'praise you, Lord. My heart is clear. I have nothing against anyone." But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 352, 14, 20, 'there is a slight coldness towards somebody. A slight coldness towards a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 352, 15, 20, 'particular sister. Bars, bars, bars. When will we get over it? Who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 352, 16, 20, 'we ruining? We''re not ruining the other person. We''re only ruining');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 352, 17, 20, 'ourselves. I really believe with all my heart the reason why many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 352, 18, 20, 'believers do not grow spiritually is because of some little resentment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 352, 19, 20, 'that is not completely cleansed out.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 352, 20, 20, 'It''s like people who get a sickness like Typhoid. They get over it and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 352, 21, 20, 'then they relapse. Then they get over it and they relapse again. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 352, 22, 20, 'are believers like that who have a resentment. They get over it, then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 352, 23, 20, 'there is a relapse - always towards the same person. Why is that? Just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 352, 24, 20, 'like in the case of Typhoid or Cholera or Jaundice or any other type of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 352, 25, 20, 'sickness, it indicates there''s a root which has never been completely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 352, 26, 20, 'cured. It was just a superficial recovery from the disease, but they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 352, 27, 20, 'very soon relapsed. And we really need to be radical if we find that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 352, 28, 20, 'have wonderful fellowship (so we think) with somebody and then every now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 353, 1, 20, 'and again we relapse back to a little resentment against them. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 353, 2, 20, 'means there is something underneath that we need to cleanse out. We''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 353, 3, 20, 'not to spend the rest of the time till Jesus comes in this relapse and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 353, 4, 20, 'recovery, relapse and recovery, relapse and recovery. No! There are some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 353, 5, 20, 'bars! We always thought this verse referred to somebody else who got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 353, 6, 20, 'offended, but we''ve discovered it applies to ourselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 353, 7, 20, 'Maybe my pride was hurt in the way another person spoke or did something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 353, 8, 20, 'to me and I cannot completely eradicate it. I may have forgiven him and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 353, 9, 20, 'ninety-nine percent of my resentment is gone, but that little one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 353, 10, 20, 'percent keeps on causing a relapse every time some new provocation comes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 353, 11, 20, 'up in relation to that brother or sister. We have to be very careful,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 353, 12, 20, 'dear brothers and sisters. Here''s how we can check whether we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 353, 13, 20, 'offended or not: if I''m cold towards one human being, I know I have been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 353, 14, 20, 'offended. Somewhere along the line I have been offended. My pride has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 353, 15, 20, 'been hurt, and it''s a tremendous amount of garbage when I say I am not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 353, 16, 20, 'offended. That''s a lot of rot. It''s an absolute lie. I''m just deceiving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 353, 17, 20, 'myself. I am offended. That''s why I''m a bit cold toward that person. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 353, 18, 20, 'because in the church we say we shouldn''t get offended, I get up and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 353, 19, 20, 'testify that I''m not offended, but I''m just fooling myself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 353, 20, 20, 'With the fruit of a man''s mouth his stomach will be satisfied;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 353, 21, 20, 'He will be satisfied with the product of his lips.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 353, 22, 20, 'Death and life are in the power of the tongue,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 353, 23, 20, 'And those who love it will eat its fruit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 353, 24, 20, 'Prov 18:20-21');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 353, 25, 20, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 353, 26, 20, 'You will have to live with the consequences of everything you say. What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 353, 27, 20, 'you say can preserve life or destroy it; so you must accept the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 353, 28, 20, 'consequences of your words.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 354, 1, 20, 'Prov 18:20-21, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 354, 2, 20, 'We can say that the words that we speak are like seeds sown. Of course,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 354, 3, 20, 'we can repent of the words we speak, but let me tell you something:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 354, 4, 20, 'repentance does not remove the consequences of those words. I can feel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 354, 5, 20, 'sorry for what I said, but I cannot remove the consequences of those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 354, 6, 20, 'words. The consequences are there forever. Suppose, for example,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 354, 7, 20, 'somebody told me something and said, "Brother, this is confidential.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 354, 8, 20, 'Please keep it to yourself. Don''t tell anyone about it." Then I went and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 354, 9, 20, 'told someone about it. Of course, I''ll tell the person who I''m telling,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 354, 10, 20, '"Brother, this is confidential. Please don''t tell anyone about it. I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 354, 11, 20, 'only telling it to you." Then afterwards, having told it to that person,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 354, 12, 20, 'it went around and did some terrific damage to the brother who told me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 354, 13, 20, 'Then he comes to me about it and I say, "I''m sorry. I told one person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 354, 14, 20, 'I''m really sorry, brother, for what I did." I''ve repented, but the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 354, 15, 20, 'consequences for my words are still there. There''s a certain confidence');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 354, 16, 20, 'in me that he''s lost which he won''t be able to regain for twenty-five');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 354, 17, 20, 'years, perhaps. He can''t trust me in the same way he trusted me before,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 354, 18, 20, 'even though he''s forgiven me and I''ve repented. And the consequences');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 354, 19, 20, 'that affect him are still there even though he''s forgiven me and we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 354, 20, 20, 'in good fellowship. We must remember that though we can repent and God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 354, 21, 20, 'forgives us and men forgive us, there are consequences of the way we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 354, 22, 20, 'speak that we will have to live with. That''s why I say to young people:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 354, 23, 20, 'be very careful about the way you speak as you grow up, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 354, 24, 20, 'gradually you will get a testimony in the church that so-and-so is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 354, 25, 20, 'such-and-such a type of person. People will have heard reports of your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 354, 26, 20, 'speech. Of course, you can repent and you can feel sorry, but you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 354, 27, 20, 'to live with the consequences of that testimony that you earned during');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 354, 28, 20, 'the many years you were that type of person. You can''t do anything about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 355, 1, 20, 'it afterwards. That''s why we have to be very careful that we don''t say a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 355, 2, 20, 'lot of foolish things. Our words are like seeds sown. I can repent of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 355, 3, 20, 'them, but the seeds will still bring forth fruit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 355, 4, 20, 'This is something God has permitted so that we become extremely careful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 355, 5, 20, 'about the way we speak. Jesus said some amazing words which I''m sure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 355, 6, 20, 'most believers in the world just do not believe. In Matthew 12:37 he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 355, 7, 20, 'said, "By your words you will be justified and by your words you will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 355, 8, 20, 'condemned." Did you know that? In other words, when I stand before the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 355, 9, 20, 'Lord, the words I''ve spoken will be played back. Then I can decide');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 355, 10, 20, 'whether I deserve to be justified or condemned. We have to take the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 355, 11, 20, 'words we speak very seriously. Jesus said this right after the verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 355, 12, 20, 'which says we will give an account for every idle word we speak in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 355, 13, 20, 'day of judgment. We have to be very, very careful about our speech.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 355, 14, 20, 'It says in the New American Standard Bible, "With the fruit of a man''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 355, 15, 20, 'mouth his stomach will be satisfied." In the Old Testament, "stomach"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 355, 16, 20, 'refers to the conscience. Proverbs 20:27 says, "The spirit of a man is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 355, 17, 20, 'the lamp of the Lord, searching all the innermost chambers of the body."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 355, 18, 20, 'This is an expression that symbolizes the conscience. Therefore one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 355, 19, 20, 'meaning of this verse could be that my conscience should be satisfied by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 355, 20, 20, 'the words I''ve spoken - that they are truthful, kind, and necessary.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 355, 21, 20, 'Verse 21 refers to the power that my tongue has. It has the capacity to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 355, 22, 20, 'be filled with the fire of heaven as we read in Acts 2:4 - how tongues');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 355, 23, 20, 'of fire came upon them. In the whole book of Acts, the main instrument');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 355, 24, 20, 'of the apostles that God used thereafter was their tongues. Through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 355, 25, 20, 'their tongues they brought life to people all over the world. At the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 355, 26, 20, 'same time, in James 3 it says your tongue can be set on fire with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 355, 27, 20, 'another fire: the fire of Hell. In Acts 2 we have the fire of heaven in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 355, 28, 20, 'the tongue, and in James 3 we have the fire of Hell in the tongue. I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 356, 1, 20, 'the one who makes the choice as to which fire is in my tongue. I can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 356, 2, 20, 'have my tongue set on fire with the fire of heaven or I can have my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 356, 3, 20, 'tongue set on fire with the fire of Hell. I have to be very careful that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 356, 4, 20, 'it''s always the fire of heaven that burns on my tongue, so that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 356, 5, 20, 'words I speak are words which are fiery in love, not fiery with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 356, 6, 20, 'nature of Satan (evil, bitterness, etc.).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 356, 7, 20, 'He who finds a wife finds a good thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 356, 8, 20, 'And obtains favor from the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 356, 9, 20, 'Prov 18:22');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 356, 10, 20, 'This is speaking of a wife whom the Lord has appointed for you. When God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 356, 11, 20, 'gave Eve to Adam, he didn''t just give any woman. He gave him a wife to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 356, 12, 20, 'be a helpmate for him. A lot of people just look around and find a woman');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 356, 13, 20, '- maybe a woman with a graduate degree, maybe a good-looking woman,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 356, 14, 20, 'etc., but a woman nonetheless. But here it says, "He who finds a wife (a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 356, 15, 20, 'God-given wife) finds a good thing and obtains favor from the Lord."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 356, 16, 20, 'That''s a tremendous favor from the Lord that he gives not just some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 356, 17, 20, 'woman from out of the two billion women there are in the world, but a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 356, 18, 20, 'wife - a helpmate like he gave to Adam. If you get a wife like that, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 356, 19, 20, 'can say the Lord has blessed you. It''s a favor from the Lord. And think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 356, 20, 20, 'also, sisters, of your calling if you''re married: to so live and so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 356, 21, 20, 'bless your husband that God can describe you as a favor (or a blessing)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 356, 22, 20, 'that he has granted to your husband. Think that you can be called by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 356, 23, 20, 'Lord "a blessing" to your husband. Fantastic! Think of a title like that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 356, 24, 20, '- to be a wife like that to your husband. There is a calling that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 356, 25, 20, 'can really seek for and a goal that you can press on towards.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 356, 26, 20, 'The poor man utters supplications,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 356, 27, 20, 'But the rich man answers roughly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 356, 28, 20, 'Prov 18:23');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 357, 1, 20, 'In other words, the rich man is rude. But when the poor man speaks he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 357, 2, 20, 'has to beg politely. What does this teach us? It teaches us a tremendous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 357, 3, 20, 'truth about what money does to the character of a person. Money tends to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 357, 4, 20, 'make a man haughty. Remember that, dear brothers and sisters. We''re not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 357, 5, 20, 'talking about people out in the world. We''re talking about believers. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 357, 6, 20, 'can talk about people right in the middle of our church. The more money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 357, 7, 20, 'we have, the more we are in danger of being independent of others and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 357, 8, 20, 'being haughty (an "I don''t need you" type of attitude). A little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 357, 9, 20, 'arrogance can come into our speech if we don''t work out our salvation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 357, 10, 20, 'with fear and trembling.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 357, 11, 20, 'On the other hand, think of a brother who''s really poor. He doesn''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 357, 12, 20, 'enough money and maybe many other brothers in the assembly always have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 357, 13, 20, 'to help him financially. Just think how he will speak. There would be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 357, 14, 20, 'humility in his speech because he''s so helpless. But we can be one of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 357, 15, 20, 'those who think, "Nobody in the assembly needs to help me. I''m quite');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 357, 16, 20, 'alright. In fact, I have so much to give to all the others." There can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 357, 17, 20, 'be arrogance in my spirit because of my wealth which can corrupt me and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 357, 18, 20, 'which can withdraw the grace of God from me, because God gives his grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 357, 19, 20, 'to the humble. For those of us who have more than enough for our needs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 357, 20, 20, '(and many of us are in this category), I just want to say that this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 357, 21, 20, 'verse teaches us that we are in terrific danger - much more than those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 357, 22, 20, 'poor brothers who never have enough to meet their needs and are always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 357, 23, 20, 'dependent on others. You can see it! There''s a helpless, polite asking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 357, 24, 20, 'with a poor brother, whereas with a rich brother, there can be an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 357, 25, 20, 'arrogance since he has everything he needs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 357, 26, 20, 'I''m not saying it has to be like that. I''m saying if we are not aware of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 357, 27, 20, 'this danger, it can affect our spirit. It can be like an unconscious sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 357, 28, 20, 'which only other people notice. But we need to be aware of this danger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 358, 1, 20, 'so that we cleanse ourselves and say, "Lord, I fall into this category');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 358, 2, 20, 'of a person who is not really poor. I have more than enough for my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 358, 3, 20, 'needs. In fact, I have enough to help others. Therefore I am in danger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 358, 4, 20, 'of having a little roughness in my spirit, a little arrogance in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 358, 5, 20, 'attitude and speech, a little bit of the spirit of independence which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 358, 6, 20, 'hinders me from receiving God''s grace. That''s why I''m defeated in so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 358, 7, 20, 'many areas of my life: because your grace is withdrawn." Let me just see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 358, 8, 20, 'if this is not the reason: that I''m earning quite a bit. He who has ears');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 358, 9, 20, 'can hear. Those who are in financial need can thank God for some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 358, 10, 20, 'blessing that comes out of that: a sense of helplessness which makes it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 358, 11, 20, 'easier to receive God''s grace.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 358, 12, 20, 'A man of many friends comes to ruin,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 358, 13, 20, 'But there is a friend that sticks closer than a brother.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 358, 14, 20, 'Prov 18:24');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 358, 15, 20, 'This means it''s dangerous to have too many friends. It''s good to have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 358, 16, 20, 'brothers and sisters, but if we have too many friends, it''s going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 358, 17, 20, 'ruin us. Then it speaks about the friend that sticks closer than a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 358, 18, 20, 'brother. In contrast to all these friends, here is a brother (Jesus), a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 358, 19, 20, 'friend who sticks closer than a brother.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 358, 20, 20, 'In the AMP translation, it reads like this: "A man of many friends will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 358, 21, 20, 'prove himself to be a bad friend to you." That''s just a little warning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 358, 22, 20, 'to be careful not to be a person who has too many unnecessary friends');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 358, 23, 20, 'out there in the world. It''s brothers that we need - brothers and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 358, 24, 20, 'sisters in the church. There''s a friend that sticks closer than a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 358, 25, 20, 'brother, and there are many - those who have the likeness to Jesus more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 358, 26, 20, 'and more - who are also brothers and sisters. These are the ones with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 358, 27, 20, 'whom we have to cultivate our fellowship.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 358, 28, 21, 'Chapter 19 Chapter 19');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 359, 1, 21, 'Better is a poor man who walks in his integrity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 359, 2, 21, 'Than he who is perverse in speech and is a fool.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 359, 3, 21, 'Prov 19:1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 359, 4, 21, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 359, 5, 21, 'Better to be poor and honest than rich and dishonest.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 359, 6, 21, 'Prov 19:1, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 359, 7, 21, 'A person who is perverse in his speech is one who tells lies in order to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 359, 8, 21, 'gain some money and make some profit, and by doing so he becomes rich. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 359, 9, 21, 'would say that the vast majority, if not all, the rich businessmen in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 359, 10, 21, 'India have become rich by lying. And here''s a word which says it''s far');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 359, 11, 21, 'better to speak the truth, even if it makes you a little poor, than tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 359, 12, 21, 'a lie and make a little profit. The book of Proverbs has much to say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 359, 13, 21, 'about this subject.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 359, 14, 21, 'Also it is not good for a person to be without knowledge,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 359, 15, 21, 'And he who hurries his footsteps errs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 359, 16, 21, 'Prov 19:2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 359, 17, 21, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 359, 18, 21, 'Enthusiasm without knowledge is not good; impatience will get you into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 359, 19, 21, 'trouble.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 359, 20, 21, 'Prov 19:2, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 359, 21, 21, 'Here it teaches us the importance of knowing God, knowing the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 359, 22, 21, 'scriptures, having wisdom, and not making haste. When we are young, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 359, 23, 21, 'usually have a lot of enthusiasm (or zeal) but not so much wisdom. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 359, 24, 21, 'that zeal is good, but we need to grow in wisdom for it to go in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 359, 25, 21, 'right direction. That''s why when we have a lot of zeal, we find that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 359, 26, 21, 'are critical of many things and judgmental of everyone. It''s good not to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 359, 27, 21, 'rush with our feet into a judgment, but rather to just wait and think.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 359, 28, 21, 'Ask God for wisdom. Wisdom is manifested in patience, not in haste. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 360, 1, 21, 'lot of hasty action that believers take is invariably the result of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 360, 2, 21, 'their tremendous lack of wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 360, 3, 21, 'Some people ruin themselves by their own stupid actions and then blame');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 360, 4, 21, 'the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 360, 5, 21, 'Prov 19:3, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 360, 6, 21, 'I''m sure we''ve come across cases like this where we do something stupid');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 360, 7, 21, 'and we suffer for it and then say, "Lord, why have you allowed this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 360, 8, 21, 'thing to happen to me?" as if it was the Lord''s fault. No. It''s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 360, 9, 21, 'result of our own stupidity. For example, someone may say, "Why, Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 360, 10, 21, 'have you allowed me not to have a good testimony in the church?" Did the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 360, 11, 21, 'Lord do that? It''s your own stupidity that''s caused you to have a bad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 360, 12, 21, 'testimony in the church. Don''t blame the Lord for that. You humble');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 360, 13, 21, 'yourself and say, "Lord, that was my own stupidity." There is so much of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 360, 14, 21, 'blaming the Lord for things we ourselves have done. We need to humble');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 360, 15, 21, 'ourselves, and then God can help us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 360, 16, 21, 'Wealth adds many friends,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 360, 17, 21, 'But a poor man is separated from his friend.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 360, 18, 21, 'Prov 19:4');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 360, 19, 21, 'This is true in the world: that a wealthy man has many friends. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 360, 20, 21, 'possible also for that spirit to creep into the church where we can try');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 360, 21, 21, 'to make friends for ourselves with our money. That''s a misunderstanding');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 360, 22, 21, 'of what Jesus said in Luke 16:9, when he said, "Make friends for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 360, 23, 21, 'yourselves with the mammon of unrighteousness." He didn''t mean that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 360, 24, 21, 'should draw people to ourselves. He meant that we should seek friends');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 360, 25, 21, 'for eternity; we should seek their eternal profit. But it''s very easy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 360, 26, 21, 'for us to draw people to ourselves and make friends with material');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 360, 27, 21, 'things. That type of friendship is not the fellowship of the body of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 360, 28, 21, 'Christ. We''re not to make friends for ourselves with money. That''s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 361, 1, 21, 'spirit of the world. If God has given us wealth, we''re not to use it to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 361, 2, 21, 'make friends. We''re to use it to build the church, not add people to my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 361, 3, 21, 'own crowd of admirers. It''s very easy to build a crowd of admirers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 361, 4, 21, 'around me who admire me because of my generosity towards them. There I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 361, 5, 21, 'can hinder the building of the body of Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 361, 6, 21, 'A false witness will not go unpunished,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 361, 7, 21, 'And he who tells lies will not escape.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 361, 8, 21, 'Prov 19:5');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 361, 9, 21, 'The Bible says in Numbers 32:23, "Be sure your sin will find you out."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 361, 10, 21, 'So if a person has given a false witness or has told lies, one day or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 361, 11, 21, 'the other, his sin will catch up with him - if not in this world,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 361, 12, 21, 'certainly at the judgment seat of Christ. This is a law of God: what we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 361, 13, 21, 'sow, we have to reap. If a person''s sin does not catch up with him in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 361, 14, 21, 'this life, it will certainly catch up with him in the day of judgment.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 361, 15, 21, 'It is impossible for a person to sin and get away with it. And it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 361, 16, 21, 'because people do not believe this that the whole of mankind sins so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 361, 17, 21, 'much in secret and in private. They feel that they have gotten away with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 361, 18, 21, 'it. They tell lies and they think they will escape, but the word of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 361, 19, 21, 'says that he who tells lies will not escape. A false witness will not go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 361, 20, 21, 'unpunished even though he may escape punishment on this earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 361, 21, 21, 'Many will seek the favor of a generous man,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 361, 22, 21, 'And every man is a friend to him who gives gifts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 361, 23, 21, 'Prov 19:6');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 361, 24, 21, 'It is very easy to be a friend to some brother who gives us gifts. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 361, 25, 21, 'if we give gifts to people, it is easy to win their friendship, but such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 361, 26, 21, 'friendships do not last. In the body of Christ, we are not to build');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 361, 27, 21, 'friendships with gifts and money. We are to build fellowship, which is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 361, 28, 21, 'through the Holy Spirit. The requirement for that is laid down in 1 John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 362, 1, 21, '1:7 - that I must walk in the light and you must walk in the light. Both');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 362, 2, 21, 'of us must walk in the light in our private lives, and then we''ll have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 362, 3, 21, 'wonderful fellowship whether we give gifts or not. But a unity between');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 362, 4, 21, 'brothers which is merely on the basis of gifts not only doesn''t glorify');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 362, 5, 21, 'God, it is also a hindrance to the building of the body of Christ. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 362, 6, 21, 'have to be careful we do not build friendships and destroy the body of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 362, 7, 21, 'Christ through gifts. This is why we see many times in the early church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 362, 8, 21, 'that they never gave gifts directly to each other, but went through the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 362, 9, 21, 'leadership of the church. That way, there would not be any unnatural');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 362, 10, 21, 'bond between believers. That was wisdom on the part of those early');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 362, 11, 21, 'Christians, and no doubt they were instructed by the apostles. "Every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 362, 12, 21, 'man is a friend to him who gives gifts." We''re not to be deceived by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 362, 13, 21, 'such friendships that we accumulate for ourselves through giving gifts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 362, 14, 21, 'to others. In the church we desire to build fellowship which requires');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 362, 15, 21, 'the cross in between us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 362, 16, 21, 'All the brothers of the poor man hate him;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 362, 17, 21, 'How much more do his friends abandon him!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 362, 18, 21, 'He pursues them with words, but they are gone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 362, 19, 21, 'Prov 19:7');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 362, 20, 21, 'God has chosen the poor of the world to be rich in faith (James 2:5).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 362, 21, 21, 'Yet, as we look around, we find so many poor people who are not rich in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 362, 22, 21, 'faith at all. Many of them don''t have any faith at all. That shows that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 362, 23, 21, 'they have not used their poverty to increase their faith. The vast');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 362, 24, 21, 'majority of poor people in India have no faith at all. They only depend');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 362, 25, 21, 'on men for their support. The tragedy is the vast majority of poor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 362, 26, 21, 'believers also have no faith. They also look to men for help. Looking to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 362, 27, 21, 'men for help is to have no faith. James 2:5 says that God has chosen the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 362, 28, 21, 'poor of the world to be rich in faith. Therefore one would expect that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 363, 1, 21, 'the people who are the richest in faith would be the people who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 363, 2, 21, 'really poor financially. Why is it not like that? Because they have not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 363, 3, 21, 'used their poverty to turn to God. Instead, the devil has deceived them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 363, 4, 21, 'and made their poverty a means to lean on other men. Other foolish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 363, 5, 21, 'believers have also encouraged them to lean on men. Therefore they have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 363, 6, 21, 'never developed faith. Even though the world may disregard the poor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 363, 7, 21, 'person, he can use his circumstances to trust in the living God, thereby');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 363, 8, 21, 'becoming spiritually rich. That is what we read about in the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 363, 9, 21, 'Testament. In the Old Testament, it was a curse to be poor, but not in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 363, 10, 21, 'the New Testament. Jesus was poor, Paul was poor, and many of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 363, 11, 21, 'apostles were poor, but they were rich in faith! These great men of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 363, 12, 21, 'in the New Testament are tremendous examples to follow for those whose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 363, 13, 21, 'financial circumstances are difficult.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 363, 14, 21, 'He who gets wisdom loves his own soul;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 363, 15, 21, 'He who keeps understanding will find good.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 363, 16, 21, 'Prov 19:8');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 363, 17, 21, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 363, 18, 21, 'Do yourself a favor and learn all you can; then remember what you learn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 363, 19, 21, 'and you will prosper.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 363, 20, 21, 'Prov 19:8, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 363, 21, 21, 'This verse relates to the word of God. Through God''s word, we get wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 363, 22, 21, 'for our daily life, and when we get wisdom, we are actually doing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 363, 23, 21, 'ourselves a favor. When we have the wisdom of God through his word, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 363, 24, 21, 'helps our whole life to be more peaceful and brings more of God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 363, 25, 21, 'blessing and happiness into our life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 363, 26, 21, 'A false witness will not go unpunished,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 363, 27, 21, 'And he who tells lies will perish.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 363, 28, 21, 'Prov 19:9');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 364, 1, 21, 'Jesus said, "I am the truth." Truth is the very nature of God. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 364, 2, 21, 'also said that the devil is the father of lies. God and Satan are on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 364, 3, 21, 'opposite sides just like truth and falsehood are on opposite sides.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 364, 4, 21, 'Therefore he who tells lies will perish. We know that the vast majority');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 364, 5, 21, 'of people in the world don''t believe that. But this is true. It''s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 364, 6, 21, 'only (as it says in verse 5) that he will not escape, but beyond that,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 364, 7, 21, 'it says here that he will perish. It''s amazing how much the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 364, 8, 21, 'Testament also has to say on being truthful, not telling lies, and not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 364, 9, 21, 'deceiving people with falsehood.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 364, 10, 21, 'Luxury is not fitting for a fool;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 364, 11, 21, 'Much less for a slave to rule over princes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 364, 12, 21, 'Prov 19:10');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 364, 13, 21, 'Luxury and wealth can ruin a person who doesn''t know how to handle it. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 364, 14, 21, 'fool, a spiritual fool, is someone who does not know how to handle the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 364, 15, 21, 'money that God has given him. He ruins himself through wastage and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 364, 16, 21, 'unnecessary luxuries in life that serve no purpose, and therefore he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 364, 17, 21, 'spoils himself. We need to bear this in mind, particularly in relation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 364, 18, 21, 'to children. It''s very easy to spoil children by giving them things that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 364, 19, 21, 'are not necessary for them to have. Maybe we can afford to give our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 364, 20, 21, 'children things other people can''t afford to give to their children, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 364, 21, 21, 'we can ruin them if we are not wise. It requires wisdom to handle money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 364, 22, 21, 'wisely, especially when we have a lot of it. Luxury is not fitting for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 364, 23, 21, 'fool.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 364, 24, 21, 'Then it says it''s even less fitting for a slave to rule over princes. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 364, 25, 21, 'can apply this to the New Testament: that if one is a slave to sin in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 364, 26, 21, 'his own life, he cannot have authority over others. No one can be an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 364, 27, 21, 'elder brother if he has not been freed from the slavery of sin. And this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 364, 28, 21, 'is something that we need to remember as fathers and mothers too, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 365, 1, 21, 'relation to our children. We all like to rule over our children, but I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 365, 2, 21, 'have to ask myself, "Have I learned to rule over sin in my own flesh?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 365, 3, 21, 'Have I been freed from that slavery?" That qualifies me to be a good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 365, 4, 21, 'father and mother - to rule over my children. It''s not fitting otherwise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 365, 5, 21, 'for a slave of sin to rule over others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 365, 6, 21, 'A man''s discretion makes him slow to anger,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 365, 7, 21, 'And it is his glory to overlook a transgression.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 365, 8, 21, 'Prov 19:11');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 365, 9, 21, 'This is something we''ve spoken of much in the church: that God gives us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 365, 10, 21, 'grace to overcome anger. That which comes so quickly to normal human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 365, 11, 21, 'beings, by the power of the Holy Spirit and the grace of God, we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 365, 12, 21, 'overcome. Being slowto anger means there is a time when we are to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 365, 13, 21, 'angry righteously, but we should not lose control of ourselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 365, 14, 21, 'Ephesians 4:26 says, "Be angry and do not sin." I heard someone say (I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 365, 15, 21, 'think it was a father to a child), "I want to beat you, but I can''t do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 365, 16, 21, 'that yet because I''m still angry. I have to wait till I overcome my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 365, 17, 21, 'anger, and then I''ll punish you." That''s wisdom. To punish a child in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 365, 18, 21, 'anger proves that the father himself is a fool. No. We are to wait. Say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 365, 19, 21, 'like that father, "I can''t beat you yet because I''m still angry. Let me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 365, 20, 21, 'overcome my anger first. Then, of course, you deserve a punishment, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 365, 21, 21, 'I''ll give it to you." That''s wisdom. That''s to be slow to anger and yet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 365, 22, 21, 'to do what is right.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 365, 23, 21, 'The verse also says, "it is his glory to overlook a transgression." This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 365, 24, 21, 'is a tremendous verse. The glory of a human being is to overlook the sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 365, 25, 21, 'that another person commits against him. If someone insults you, your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 365, 26, 21, 'glory is to overlook the insult and love him. If I can''t do that, I''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 365, 27, 21, 'lost something of the glory of God in my life. It''s my glory to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 365, 28, 21, 'overlook, not just to say, "Alright, I forgive you," but then sort of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 366, 1, 21, 'keep it in my mind and constantly remember it. No, but to overlook it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 366, 2, 21, 'and say, "That''s fine." That shows that I''ve really acquired wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 366, 3, 21, 'It''s the glory of a man of wisdom to overlook a transgression. Love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 366, 4, 21, 'covers a multitude of faults and sins in other people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 366, 5, 21, 'The King''s wrath is like the roaring of a lion,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 366, 6, 21, 'But his favor is like the dew on grass.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 366, 7, 21, 'Prov 19:12');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 366, 8, 21, 'We can apply this to God. God''s anger, when it is turned against those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 366, 9, 21, 'who live in sin and rebellion against him, is like the roaring of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 366, 10, 21, 'lion. People don''t understand that. The roaring of a lion is an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 366, 11, 21, 'absolutely terrifying thing. I''ve heard it sometimes in a zoo, and you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 366, 12, 21, 'still get terrified even though the lion is behind the bars. You can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 366, 13, 21, 'imagine how much more scary it would be if there were no bars. That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 366, 14, 21, 'the picture that the word of God uses to show God''s anger against sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 366, 15, 21, 'and against rebellion against him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 366, 16, 21, 'On the contrary, God''s favor is like the dew that falls on the grass');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 366, 17, 21, 'early in the morning that keeps it fresh and green. Our attitude should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 366, 18, 21, 'be to say, "Lord, I want your favor like dew upon the grass on my life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 366, 19, 21, 'every morning. I don''t want to face your wrath at any time."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 366, 20, 21, 'A foolish son is destruction to his father,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 366, 21, 21, 'And the contentions of a wife are a constant dripping.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 366, 22, 21, 'Prov 19:13');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 366, 23, 21, 'Now that means that a wife who is constantly nagging her husband is like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 366, 24, 21, 'a leak in the roof in the middle of the rainy season that''s dripping,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 366, 25, 21, 'dripping, dripping, dripping, dripping. It''s not a downpour and then it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 366, 26, 21, 'stops. It''s this constant nagging, nagging, nagging, nagging, nagging.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 366, 27, 21, 'Drip, drip, drip. And what is the result of a home where you have a wife');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 366, 28, 21, 'who''s like that morning till night? The result is a foolish, rebellious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 367, 1, 21, 'son. The wife brings the spirit of rebellion into the home through her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 367, 2, 21, 'attitude to her husband, and it''s like a contagious disease. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 367, 3, 21, 'children catch that spirit quickly, and then there''s rebellion in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 367, 4, 21, 'children. So these two things are connected - the foolish son and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 367, 5, 21, 'nagging wife. One comes as a result of the other. That''s why the word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 367, 6, 21, 'God says, as we''ve considered earlier in another chapter in Proverbs,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 367, 7, 21, 'that it is a wise woman who builds her house. That means the most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 367, 8, 21, 'important person in the building of a home is the wife, because it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 367, 9, 21, 'through submission to her husband and overcoming the spirit of rebellion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 367, 10, 21, 'that she''s able to pass on that same spirit to her children. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 367, 11, 21, 'children also learn to live in submission to their parents, and God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 367, 12, 21, 'blessing can be upon them, and they do not grow up to be foolish.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 367, 13, 21, 'A father can give his sons homes and riches, but only the Lord can give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 367, 14, 21, 'them understanding wives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 367, 15, 21, 'Prov 19:14, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 367, 16, 21, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 367, 17, 21, 'A man can inherit a house and money from his parents, but only the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 367, 18, 21, 'can give him a sensible wife.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 367, 19, 21, 'Prov 19:14, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 367, 20, 21, 'A father cannot give his sons understanding wives; only God can give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 367, 21, 21, 'that. The most that a father can give to his sons are houses, lands, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 367, 22, 21, 'riches, but to get a wife who is understanding, wise, and prudent, a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 367, 23, 21, 'has to seek the Lord. This is a tremendous thing for young sisters to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 367, 24, 21, 'take as a challenge: to be one of those wives and understanding sisters');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 367, 25, 21, 'whom God can pick out from all the millions of women in this country to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 367, 26, 21, 'give to God-fearing brothers. And for young brothers who are seeking the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 367, 27, 21, 'Lord for marriage, remember that no one, no elder brother, no man can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 367, 28, 21, 'give you a good wife. Only God can do that. This doesn''t just apply to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 368, 1, 21, 'fathers. Even elder brothers in the church cannot give you an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 368, 2, 21, 'understanding wife. Only the Lord, it says, can give you a wise wife.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 368, 3, 21, 'That''s why you have to seek God and say, "Lord, you are my Father. Give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 368, 4, 21, 'me the one who will be a helpmate for me."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 368, 5, 21, 'The Living Bible translates it as an "understanding" wife and the Good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 368, 6, 21, 'News Translation says "sensible". An understanding or sensible wife is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 368, 7, 21, 'tremendous gift in the sense that she''s one who understands her husband.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 368, 8, 21, 'She understands her husband''s weaknesses and strong points and seeks to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 368, 9, 21, 'be a helpmate. We have seen that a husband and wife are to be like two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 368, 10, 21, 'halves of an egg shell. When you break an egg shell, there are uneven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 368, 11, 21, 'projections on each side. But when you put them together, there are no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 368, 12, 21, 'gaps. That''s how it must be with husbands and wives. Where there''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 368, 13, 21, 'depression in one, there''s a projection in the other. And an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 368, 14, 21, 'understanding wife means one who recognizes where there is a depression');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 368, 15, 21, 'in her husband and seeks to fill up that lack. Of course, this applies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 368, 16, 21, 'vice versa too. But that''s a tremendous type of wife to be towards your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 368, 17, 21, 'husband.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 368, 18, 21, 'Laziness casts into a deep sleep,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 368, 19, 21, 'And an idle man will suffer hunger.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 368, 20, 21, 'Prov 19:15');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 368, 21, 21, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 368, 22, 21, 'Go ahead and be lazy; sleep on, but you will go hungry.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 368, 23, 21, 'Prov 19:15, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 368, 24, 21, 'This is just one of the many exhortations about diligence that are found');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 368, 25, 21, 'in the book of Proverbs, and this emphasis that comes again and again');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 368, 26, 21, 'proves that God places great value on hard work. There is no place for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 368, 27, 21, 'laziness in God''s kingdom in any area. God never commits a ministry to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 368, 28, 21, 'the lazy, but to those who have a sense of responsibility to use their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 369, 1, 21, 'time profitably in diligence. We can apply the Good News Translation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 369, 2, 21, 'also in our attitude to the study of God''s word. If we are lazy and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 369, 3, 21, 'lethargic in our attitude to study the word of God, we''ll find that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 369, 4, 21, 'remain hungry and poverty stricken, spiritually speaking.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 369, 5, 21, 'Keep God''s laws and you will live longer; if you ignore them, you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 369, 6, 21, 'die.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 369, 7, 21, 'Prov 19:16, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 369, 8, 21, 'This proves that God''s laws are for our good. The more people disobey');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 369, 9, 21, 'God''s laws, the more they actually shorten their own life. Deuteronomy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 369, 10, 21, '5:16 says, "Honor your father and mother, that it may go well with you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 369, 11, 21, 'and that you may live long on the earth." That teaches us that God is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 369, 12, 21, 'control even over the length of our life. When we keep God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 369, 13, 21, 'commandments, we are actually doing ourselves good.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 369, 14, 21, 'When you help the poor you are lending to the Lord - and he pays');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 369, 15, 21, 'wonderful interest on your loan!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 369, 16, 21, 'Prov 19:17, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 369, 17, 21, 'That''s a word which reminds me of the story of George Muller, the great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 369, 18, 21, 'man of God who lived a hundred years ago, who looked after the poor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 369, 19, 21, 'orphans in England in the name of Jesus Christ. He cared for them and he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 369, 20, 21, 'spent all his savings, his personal money, and everything that he had on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 369, 21, 21, 'those orphans. And when he was about to die, he had only (as far as I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 369, 22, 21, 'remember) one child, a daughter, and he hadn''t left any savings for her.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 369, 23, 21, 'If I remember the story right, he told his daughter on his deathbed, "I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 369, 24, 21, 'don''t have any money to leave you, because I gave everything that I had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 369, 25, 21, 'to help these poor orphans." But on the basis of this verse, Proverbs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 369, 26, 21, '19:17, he said, "If you''re ever in need at any time in your life, just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 369, 27, 21, 'go to God and say, ''Lord, my father gave you some money on loan when he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 369, 28, 21, 'was alive. Would you give me some of the interest on that?''" I''m sure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 370, 1, 21, 'she never lacked in her life. That is the word of God. Of course, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 370, 2, 21, 'need a lot of wisdom in this area of helping the poor, as we have often');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 370, 3, 21, 'spoken about. Otherwise, we can do it in a foolish way. But if we seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 370, 4, 21, 'God for wisdom and do it in a wise way, there is the blessing of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 370, 5, 21, 'Lord on it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 370, 6, 21, 'Discipline your son while there is hope,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 370, 7, 21, 'And do not desire his death.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 370, 8, 21, 'Prov 19:18');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 370, 9, 21, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 370, 10, 21, 'Discipline your children while they are young enough to learn. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 370, 11, 21, 'don''t, you are helping them destroy themselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 370, 12, 21, 'Prov 19:18, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 370, 13, 21, 'We see in the Good News Translation that when it says, "...while there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 370, 14, 21, 'is hope", that means "...while they are young enough to learn." There''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 370, 15, 21, 'no use waking up when your son is twenty years-old and saying, "Oh, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 370, 16, 21, 'need to discipline my children." No. You need to start disciplining your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 370, 17, 21, 'children when they are two. Begin when they are two while there''s still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 370, 18, 21, 'hope, so that they don''t grow up to be a nuisance to society, but rather');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 370, 19, 21, 'a credit to society. Discipline your children while they are young');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 370, 20, 21, 'enough to learn. If you don''t do that, you are helping your children to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 370, 21, 21, 'destroy themselves. There are a lot of parents who think that their love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 370, 22, 21, 'for their children is shown in sparing them and not being too hard on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 370, 23, 21, 'them. But actually, the word of God says that you''re actually helping');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 370, 24, 21, 'your children to destroy themselves when you don''t discipline them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 370, 25, 21, 'There is a marginal rendering of this verse in the Good News Translation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 370, 26, 21, 'which gives an alternate meaning: "Discipline your children, but don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 370, 27, 21, 'beat them so hard that you kill them." You see, there are two extremes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 370, 28, 21, 'to this. We know there are some unconverted parents, who, in a fit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 371, 1, 21, 'anger, can beat their children so hard. There''s a lot of that around the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 371, 2, 21, 'world. In western countries it gets a lot of publicity. There''s a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 371, 3, 21, 'abuse of children - some terrible stories of the way parents have beat');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 371, 4, 21, 'their children so badly. One extreme is to just let them do anything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 371, 5, 21, 'they like and to never correct them or punish them. The other extreme is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 371, 6, 21, 'to be so violent so as to really injure them. The word of God says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 371, 7, 21, 'there''s a middle way between these two extremes that the godly, wise man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 371, 8, 21, 'walks.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 371, 9, 21, 'A man of great anger must bear the penalty,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 371, 10, 21, 'For if you rescue him, you will only have to do it again.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 371, 11, 21, 'Prov 19:19');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 371, 12, 21, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 371, 13, 21, 'If someone has a hot temper, let him take the consequences. If you get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 371, 14, 21, 'him out of trouble once, you''ll have to do it again.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 371, 15, 21, 'Prov 19:19, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 371, 16, 21, 'This is connected to verse 18, because you''ll notice that the words "A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 371, 17, 21, 'man of…" are written in italics, which means they are not in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 371, 18, 21, 'original Hebrew. Instead, we could put "A child of…" If you read it like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 371, 19, 21, 'that, you''ll see that it''s connected to the previous verse. In other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 371, 20, 21, 'words, if your child has tantrums of anger, don''t spare him. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 371, 21, 21, 'spare him now, he''ll do it again and he''ll rule over you. It''s very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 371, 22, 21, 'important that fathers and mothers do not allow their children to have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 371, 23, 21, 'tantrums of anger, and that children recognize that they''ll be severely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 371, 24, 21, 'punished if they throw up a tantrum. If you spare them, they''ll give you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 371, 25, 21, 'trouble again. You''ll have to punish them another time. You might as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 371, 26, 21, 'well do it the first time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 371, 27, 21, 'Of course, this verse applies to adults too. It''s foolish to help an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 371, 28, 21, 'angry man. It''s good that he faces the consequences once so that he''ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 372, 1, 21, 'realize the result of losing his temper.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 372, 2, 21, 'Listen to counsel and accept discipline,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 372, 3, 21, 'That you may be wise the rest of your days.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 372, 4, 21, 'Prov 19:20');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 372, 5, 21, 'We can be wise all of our life if we do these two things: 1) if we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 372, 6, 21, 'willing to receive the instruction of God''s word day by day, and 2) if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 372, 7, 21, 'we are willing to accept God''s discipline in the circumstances of life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 372, 8, 21, 'where he humbles us and brings us down in various situations.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 372, 9, 21, 'Many are the plans in a man''s heart,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 372, 10, 21, 'But the counsel of the Lord will stand.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 372, 11, 21, 'Prov 19:21');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 372, 12, 21, 'This means that we can make many plans, but God can so arrange');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 372, 13, 21, 'circumstances and situations unexpectedly that our plans don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 372, 14, 21, 'materialize. Our plans don''t work out as we expect them to. What should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 372, 15, 21, 'we do in such times? That is the time to humble ourselves under God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 372, 16, 21, 'mighty hand and say, "Lord, I do not rebel. I bow in submission to your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 372, 17, 21, 'alteration of the plans that I had for my life. The counsel of the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 372, 18, 21, 'will stand." This is the mark of a wise man. When his plans don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 372, 19, 21, 'materialize, he''s quite happy as long as the counsel of the Lord is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 372, 20, 21, 'fulfilled in his life, even though it may have gone completely against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 372, 21, 21, 'what he had planned for himself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 372, 22, 21, 'Kindness makes a man attractive. And it is better to be poor than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 372, 23, 21, 'dishonest.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 372, 24, 21, 'Prov 19:22, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 372, 25, 21, 'What is it that makes a man attractive? The film world has deceived');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 372, 26, 21, 'humanity into thinking that attractiveness is a matter of good looks.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 372, 27, 21, 'And so we have men and women all over the world thinking that it''s good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 372, 28, 21, 'features and a good color of skin that makes them attractive. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 373, 1, 21, 'one of the greatest deceptions of the devil. We know there are many good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 373, 2, 21, 'looking people who are very evil in their heart. This verse says that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 373, 3, 21, 'it''s kindness that makes a man attractive. Therefore, every one of us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 373, 4, 21, 'has the opportunity to be really good looking and attractive. There''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 373, 5, 21, 'beautiful word in the last part of Ecclesiastes 8:1 (The Living Bible):');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 373, 6, 21, '"Wisdom lights up man''s face, softening his hardness." Basically, all of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 373, 7, 21, 'us have a hardness in our flesh. That''s why it''s easier for us to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 373, 8, 21, 'strict and harsh than it is for us to be kind. We need the power of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 373, 9, 21, 'Holy Spirit and grace from God to overcome this harshness and hardness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 373, 10, 21, 'And that verse says when we become wise, it softens the hardness in us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 373, 11, 21, 'When our hardness is softened, we become more kind which makes us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 373, 12, 21, 'attractive.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 373, 13, 21, 'The second part of the verse says, "It''s better to be poor than to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 373, 14, 21, 'dishonest." That is, "It''s better to be a poor man than a liar." That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 373, 15, 21, 'means it''s possible to make money by telling lies, but it''s not worth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 373, 16, 21, 'it. The result of being truthful is that one may not make as much money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 373, 17, 21, 'as one could have made by telling lies, but the word of God says it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 373, 18, 21, 'better to be poor and honest than rich and dishonest. Character comes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 373, 19, 21, 'through truthfulness. This, you notice, is repeated a number of times in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 373, 20, 21, 'the book of Proverbs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 373, 21, 21, 'Reverence for God gives life, happiness, and protection from harm.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 373, 22, 21, 'Prov 19:23, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 373, 23, 21, 'We read in Isaiah 8:13 (The Living Bible), "If you fear God, you need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 373, 24, 21, 'fear nothing else." When we fear something on this earth or we fear some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 373, 25, 21, 'person, that shows that we don''t fear God. When we fear human beings,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 373, 26, 21, 'it''s because we don''t fear God. When we fear sickness or the devil or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 373, 27, 21, 'danger or death or anything, it''s a proof of the fact that we don''t fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 373, 28, 21, 'God enough. If we feared God sufficiently, it would eliminate ALL other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 374, 1, 21, 'fears from our life. If we fear God, it''ll give us life, happiness, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 374, 2, 21, 'protection from harm. Those are the things the world''s really seeking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 374, 3, 21, 'after, but they''re seeking them in the wrong places. They seek for them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 374, 4, 21, 'through money and pleasure. The word of God says you get it through the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 374, 5, 21, 'fear of God, through the reverence for God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 374, 6, 21, 'The sluggard buries his hand in the dish,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 374, 7, 21, 'But will not even bring it back to his mouth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 374, 8, 21, 'Prov 19:24');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 374, 9, 21, 'Of course, it''s not literally like that. You would never find a man like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 374, 10, 21, 'that. Solomon is using sarcasm and exaggeration to show how people can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 374, 11, 21, 'have such a lazy attitude. Even though it may not literally apply to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 374, 12, 21, 'plate of rice, you do find this happen when it comes to the study of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 374, 13, 21, 'God''s word, which is another type of food for our souls. A person can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 374, 14, 21, 'take the word of God, put his hand into it (which means he reads it),');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 374, 15, 21, 'but he doesn''t have the patience to meditate on it and receive something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 374, 16, 21, 'for his spirit. He''s too lazy for that. He wants to go off and do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 374, 17, 21, 'something else. His whole attitude to God''s word is exactly as is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 374, 18, 21, 'described here. He puts his hand into it and is too lazy to try and get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 374, 19, 21, 'something out of it to feed himself. He wants to go to the meeting and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 374, 20, 21, 'always be fed by somebody else. Meetings are good. We need the meetings.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 374, 21, 21, 'We need help from one another. But we also need to learn how to put our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 374, 22, 21, 'hand into the dish and bring something out of it to feed ourselves in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 374, 23, 21, 'addition to all the meetings we go to.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 374, 24, 21, 'Punish a mocker and others will learn from his example. Reprove a wise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 374, 25, 21, 'man, and he will be the wiser.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 374, 26, 21, 'Prov 19:25, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 374, 27, 21, '1 Timothy 5:20 says for those who keep on sinning, rebuke them publicly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 374, 28, 21, 'so that others may also fear. There is a place for rebuking one who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 375, 1, 21, 'continues in sin publicly in the church, so that others will fear. Paul');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 375, 2, 21, 'was telling Timothy in 1 Timothy 3:15, "I''ve written these things to you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 375, 3, 21, 'so that you know how to conduct yourself in the church of God." One of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 375, 4, 21, 'the things that Paul told Timothy in relation to how he should conduct');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 375, 5, 21, 'himself in the church of God is 1 Timothy 5:20: those who continue in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 375, 6, 21, 'sin, rebuke in the presence of all. There is a place for rebuking a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 375, 7, 21, 'person privately. That''s the first step. But if a person doesn''t take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 375, 8, 21, 'that seriously, then he must be rebuked publicly so that others also may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 375, 9, 21, 'be afraid of sinning. The church is a place where God''s holiness must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 375, 10, 21, 'always be maintained. So there are certain things that we have to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 375, 11, 21, 'publicly in the church which are not only for the benefit of the person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 375, 12, 21, 'whom we are correcting, but also for the benefit of those who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 375, 13, 21, 'watching. Then everyone will realize they can''t play the fool with God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 375, 14, 21, 'and the church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 375, 15, 21, 'On the other hand, we read in Proverbs 19:25 that if you rebuke a wise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 375, 16, 21, 'man, he will be still wiser. When somebody rebukes you or corrects you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 375, 17, 21, 'the way you receive it determines whether you''re going to grow wiser or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 375, 18, 21, 'you''re going to remain a fool. A wise person receives a word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 375, 19, 21, 'correction or a word of rebuke, and the result is he becomes still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 375, 20, 21, 'wiser. That''s a tremendous piece of wisdom you can get when you''re a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 375, 21, 21, 'child. For the children who read this: when your father or mother');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 375, 22, 21, 'correct you and you receive it, you can grow wiser. Or maybe a wife is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 375, 23, 21, 'being corrected by her husband. If that wife can receive it, she will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 375, 24, 21, 'grow wiser. If you get offended, you can remain in your folly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 375, 25, 21, 'Only a shameful, disgraceful person would mistreat his father or turn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 375, 26, 21, 'his mother away from his home.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 375, 27, 21, 'Prov 19:26, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 375, 28, 21, 'It is a shameful thing to ill-treat our parents or to turn them away');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 376, 1, 21, 'from our home. It says only a shameful, disgraceful person will ever do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 376, 2, 21, 'that. May it never be said of any of us that we fall under that category');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 376, 3, 21, 'of being shameful and disgraceful by ill-treating our parents. One way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 376, 4, 21, 'of ill-treating our parents is by exposing their nakedness to others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 376, 5, 21, 'That''s what Ham did when he exposed the nakedness of his father, Noah.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 376, 6, 21, 'He went and told others about some weakness he saw in his father. Maybe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 376, 7, 21, 'you see a weakness in your father or mother. Keep it to yourself; pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 376, 8, 21, 'for them; but never go around speaking about it to others. That''s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 376, 9, 21, 'reason why some people don''t get God''s blessing upon their life: because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 376, 10, 21, 'they speak so badly about their parents. Maybe they have light and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 376, 11, 21, 'wisdom and understanding, but then they see their aged parents who don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 376, 12, 21, 'have the same wisdom they have, and they speak about them in a bad way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 376, 13, 21, 'I believe that there''s something of God''s blessing that you lose when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 376, 14, 21, 'you ill-treat your father or mother in that way or do something that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 376, 15, 21, 'turns they away from your home.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 376, 16, 21, 'Cease listening, my son, to discipline,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 376, 17, 21, 'And you will stray from the words of knowledge.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 376, 18, 21, 'Prov 19:27');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 376, 19, 21, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 376, 20, 21, 'Stop listening to teaching that you know contradicts what is right.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 376, 21, 21, 'Prov 19:27, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 376, 22, 21, 'In other words, when God disciplines us and punishes us through the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 376, 23, 21, 'circumstances of life, the purpose is that we might understand the words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 376, 24, 21, 'of knowledge. If you don''t accept the disciplines of life, you cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 376, 25, 21, 'understand the word of God. We can''t understand God''s word merely by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 376, 26, 21, 'studying it with our brain. We also have to allow God, through the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 376, 27, 21, 'Spirit, to discipline us in the daily circumstances of life so that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 376, 28, 21, 'God''s word becomes living to us. If we don''t accept God''s discipline, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 377, 1, 21, 'says we will stray from the words of knowledge.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 377, 2, 21, 'The Living Bible paraphrase gives another possible meaning of this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 377, 3, 21, 'verse. For example, when seeking for the baptism in the Holy Spirit,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 377, 4, 21, 'there are people who may say, "Well, I''d like to read both sides of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 377, 5, 21, 'subject." The result is when they read one side of the subject which is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 377, 6, 21, 'according to God''s word, they get faith. Then, in order to be what they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 377, 7, 21, 'think is balanced, they read the other side of the subject, and they get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 377, 8, 21, 'filled with unbelief. The result is they never get baptized in the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 377, 9, 21, 'Spirit! This should not be. We are to stop listening to teaching which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 377, 10, 21, 'we know contradicts what we know is right, particularly when we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 377, 11, 21, 'young believers. Most of us can''t handle both sides of a subject till we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 377, 12, 21, 'are past a certain degree of maturity. In the earlier part of our life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 377, 13, 21, 'it''s good to listen to that which stirs up faith. Instead, people go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 377, 14, 21, 'here and there listening to all types of preachers, many of whom sow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 377, 15, 21, 'unbelief into their hearts. Take victory over sin, for example. Someone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 377, 16, 21, 'can hear about victory over sin one day and then the next day they hear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 377, 17, 21, 'or read something else that tells them such a life is not possible. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 377, 18, 21, 'result is they don''t have faith for such a life, and it takes a long,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 377, 19, 21, 'long time for them to ever come to victory over sin. All this was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 377, 20, 21, 'because they listened to teaching or read books which sowed unbelief in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 377, 21, 21, 'their heart. We must always throw away those books which sow unbelief in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 377, 22, 21, 'our heart. We must not listen to preachers who put unbelief in our heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 377, 23, 21, 'toward God''s word. We must stop listening to teaching that contradicts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 377, 24, 21, 'what we know is right.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 377, 25, 21, 'A rascally witness makes a mockery of justice,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 377, 26, 21, 'And the mouth of the wicked spreads iniquity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 377, 27, 21, 'Prov 19:28');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 377, 28, 21, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 378, 1, 21, 'There is no justice where a witness is determined to hurt someone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 378, 2, 21, 'Wicked people love the taste of evil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 378, 3, 21, 'Prov 19:28, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 378, 4, 21, 'The sad thing in the world is that there is no justice in the courts of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 378, 5, 21, 'law. Jesus said that the world is not going to treat us (his disciples)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 378, 6, 21, 'any better than they treated him, and we know that he was treated so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 378, 7, 21, 'unjustly right through the end of his life. That is the treatment we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 378, 8, 21, 'expect as well. There will be a lot of injustice on earth. The latter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 378, 9, 21, 'part of this verse in the Good News Translation says, "Wicked people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 378, 10, 21, 'love the taste of evil." That teaches us that if we are really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 378, 11, 21, 'righteous, it''s not just that we avoid what is evil - we don''t even want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 378, 12, 21, 'to taste it. A little bit of evil on our tongue will immediately be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 378, 13, 21, 'rejected. We know how sensitive our tongue is to taste. We can put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 378, 14, 21, 'something on our tongue - just a wee, tiny bit - and we say, "That''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 378, 15, 21, 'terrible taste." That must be our attitude toward evil: exactly the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 378, 16, 21, 'opposite of the wicked. I don''t even want to have a little bit of it -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 378, 17, 21, 'not even a taste of it in my life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 378, 18, 21, 'Judgments are prepared for scoffers,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 378, 19, 21, 'And blows for the back of fools.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 378, 20, 21, 'Prov 19:29');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 378, 21, 21, 'The word of God says in Hebrews 9:27 that it''s appointed unto men once');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 378, 22, 21, 'to die and after that, the judgment. Here it speaks about the certainty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 378, 23, 21, 'of judgment; judgment has been prepared. When the book of Proverbs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 378, 24, 21, 'speaks about a scoffer, it''s speaking about a man who is rebelling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 378, 25, 21, 'against the truth of God''s word. For him judgment is certain. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 378, 26, 21, 'appointed unto men once to die, and after death comes the judgment where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 378, 27, 21, 'we will have to give an account to God of every single thing that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 378, 28, 21, 'have done in our body - every single word we have spoken, our attitudes,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 379, 1, 21, 'our thoughts, and everything.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 379, 2, 22, 'Chapter 20 Chapter 20');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 379, 3, 22, 'Wine is a mocker, strong drink a brawler,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 379, 4, 22, 'And whoever is intoxicated by it is not wise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 379, 5, 22, 'Prov 20:1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 379, 6, 22, 'Here it speaks about alcoholic drinks: "Wine is a mocker." In other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 379, 7, 22, 'words, wine deceives you. It deceives people who get drunk with it. And,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 379, 8, 22, '"strong drink is a brawler," means that strong drink leads people into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 379, 9, 22, 'fights. Whoever is intoxicated by alcohol is not wise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 379, 10, 22, 'We know that people drink alcoholic drinks and wine mainly because they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 379, 11, 22, 'want to satisfy their bodily longings. They ignore the fact that it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 379, 12, 22, 'makes them disobey God''s word. Sin came into the world through Eve''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 379, 13, 22, 'desire for food. She saw that it was something that appealed to her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 379, 14, 22, 'body. Jesus was also tempted through food. Now, most of us may not have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 379, 15, 22, 'any problem with alcoholic drinks or intoxicating liquor. We know that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 379, 16, 22, 'they are harmful. Then what shall we gain from this verse? I believe in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 379, 17, 22, 'the necessity of self-control when it comes to bodily lusts, even in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 379, 18, 22, 'area of food and drink. God calls us to discipline and self-control over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 379, 19, 22, 'our bodily lusts, even in the matter of eating and drinking.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 379, 20, 22, 'The terror of a king is like the roaring of a lion;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 379, 21, 22, 'He who provokes him to anger forfeits his own life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 379, 22, 22, 'Prov 20:2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 379, 23, 22, 'Again this is a verse that tells us about God''s wrath being like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 379, 24, 22, 'roaring of a lion. God is the king of the universe. It says if we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 379, 25, 22, 'provoke God to anger, we forfeit his own life. We''ve considered before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 379, 26, 22, 'the terribleness of God''s wrath against sin. I believe that the vast');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 379, 27, 22, 'majority of people, even many Christians, don''t have an understanding of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 379, 28, 22, 'the terribleness of God''s wrath against sin. In a sense, God''s wrath');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 380, 1, 22, 'against sin is like the roaring of a lion.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 380, 2, 22, 'Any fool can start arguments; the honorable thing is to stay out of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 380, 3, 22, 'them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 380, 4, 22, 'Prov 20:3, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 380, 5, 22, 'This teaches us that a person who starts an argument is a fool, and a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 380, 6, 22, 'person who continues an argument, with the person who has started it, is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 380, 7, 22, 'equally a fool. The honorable thing is to avoid arguments altogether.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 380, 8, 22, 'That''s a word that we really need to take seriously. Even when we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 380, 9, 22, 'proclaiming the gospel to others, we are not to get caught up into an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 380, 10, 22, 'argument about the truth of the gospel. We have to proclaim the truth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 380, 11, 22, 'but never argue, because nobody gets convinced of the truth through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 380, 12, 22, 'argument. It''s not by human cleverness that we can lead people to God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 380, 13, 22, 'truth. People can understand God''s truth only by the revelation of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 380, 14, 22, 'Holy Spirit. If they have a sense of need in their life, if they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 380, 15, 22, 'sincere, if they are humble, then the Spirit of God can reveal to them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 380, 16, 22, 'that Christ died for their sins. He can reveal the New and Living Way to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 380, 17, 22, 'them and many other things, but it''s not by human argument or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 380, 18, 22, 'cleverness. Therefore, even when it comes to preaching the gospel, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 380, 19, 22, 'are to only proclaim truth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 380, 20, 22, 'This verse also applies to all other areas of life. For example,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 380, 21, 22, 'consider a husband and wife. The one who starts the argument is a fool,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 380, 22, 22, 'whether it is the husband or the wife. And if the other person continues');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 380, 23, 22, 'it, we can say both are fools. Blessed is the home where at least one of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 380, 24, 22, 'the two is wise. Even more blessed is the home where both are wise,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 380, 25, 22, 'where there are no arguments at all. Any fool can start an argument. Any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 380, 26, 22, 'idiot in the whole world can start an argument. That''s the easiest thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 380, 27, 22, 'in the world! The wise thing is to stay out of them and to keep away');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 380, 28, 22, 'from all strife. It''s an honor for a man to do that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 381, 1, 22, 'The lazy one does not plow after the autumn,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 381, 2, 22, 'So he begs during the harvest and has nothing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 381, 3, 22, 'Prov 20:4');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 381, 4, 22, 'Again, here is another word about diligence and hard work. At the time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 381, 5, 22, 'when this man should have sown the seed, he said, "Oh, it''s too cold');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 381, 6, 22, 'today. I can''t go and sow the seed today." He''ll find some excuse not to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 381, 7, 22, 'sow seed, and the result is that when harvest comes and other people who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 381, 8, 22, 'worked hard during the sowing time reap a harvest, his own fields will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 381, 9, 22, 'have produced no crops. He was too lazy to sow during sowing time, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 381, 10, 22, 'he becomes a beggar. This teaches us about the importance of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 381, 11, 22, 'faithfulness in the time when we should be sowing seed (e.g., our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 381, 12, 22, 'present earthly life). Our whole earthly life is actually a sowing time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 381, 13, 22, 'We don''t really have a spiritual harvest here on the earth. The harvest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 381, 14, 22, 'time is after we leave the world and go into eternity. Our entire life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 381, 15, 22, 'on earth is just a sowing time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 381, 16, 22, 'Because we sow and sow and we don''t get an immediate harvest, we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 381, 17, 22, 'tend to get discouraged and give up. That''s why the word of God tells us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 381, 18, 22, 'in Galatians 6:8 to sow to the Spirit. Then it says in verse 9, "Let us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 381, 19, 22, 'not grow weary of doing good, for in due season we will reap, if we do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 381, 20, 22, 'not give up." When people are evil to us, that''s the time to sow a good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 381, 21, 22, 'seed in return. When people curse us, that''s the time to sow a good seed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 381, 22, 22, 'by blessing them. When people hate us, that''s the time to sow a good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 381, 23, 22, 'seed by doing good to them. You may say, "When shall we get a harvest?"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 381, 24, 22, 'Maybe never in our earthly lifetime, but we''ll get a harvest in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 381, 25, 22, 'eternity. That is definite! It is impossible for a person to sow and not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 381, 26, 22, 'get a harvest. It says in Galatians 6:8, "If you sow to the Spirit, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 381, 27, 22, 'will reap eternal life!" So let''s not become weary in this earthly life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 381, 28, 22, 'of sowing! Sow a kind word, sow a good action, sow good in return for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 382, 1, 22, 'the evil someone does to you. We''re not to just sit back and say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 382, 2, 22, '"Alright, I forgive him." When somebody has done evil to us, it''s good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 382, 3, 22, 'if I have forgiven him, but I haven''t sown a seed yet. To sow a seed, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 382, 4, 22, 'have to do good to that person who has done evil to me. That''s why Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 382, 5, 22, 'said, "Do good to those who hate you." He didn''t say, "Forgive those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 382, 6, 22, 'curse you." He said, "Bless those who curse you." Sow a seed and then at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 382, 7, 22, 'the time of harvest, we will not be poor. At the judgment seat of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 382, 8, 22, 'Christ, when Jesus comes back, we shall be rich, because we have used');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 382, 9, 22, 'our life for sowing seeds of goodness to the glory of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 382, 10, 22, 'A plan in the heart of a man is like deep water,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 382, 11, 22, 'But a man of understanding draws it out.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 382, 12, 22, 'Prov 20:5');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 382, 13, 22, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 382, 14, 22, 'Though good advice lies deep within a counselor''s heart, the wise man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 382, 15, 22, 'will draw it out.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 382, 16, 22, 'Prov 20:5, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 382, 17, 22, 'I believe the meaning of this verse is that a really wise man may have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 382, 18, 22, 'lot of good advice deep down in his heart, but it''s like a deep well. Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 382, 19, 22, 'you know the difference between a well and a spring? From a well, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 382, 20, 22, 'have to draw the water out, whereas from a spring, the water just flows');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 382, 21, 22, 'out all the time. Here it says good advice is deep down in a wise man''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 382, 22, 22, 'heart, like a well. In other words, a wise man does not go around giving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 382, 23, 22, 'advice to everyone he meets. That''s a foolish man. A foolish man is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 382, 24, 22, 'always gushing out his advice like a spring! He has a piece of advice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 382, 25, 22, 'for every person he meets. He has an opinion on everything! That''s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 382, 26, 22, 'mark of a fool! A wise man on the other hand, realizes people are doing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 382, 27, 22, 'a lot of foolish things, but still doesn''t come forth with advice till');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 382, 28, 22, 'he sees that they have a sense of need for it. If you want advice, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 383, 1, 22, 'have to get it out of that wise person. He doesn''t just give it out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 383, 2, 22, 'easily, even when you go to him for advice. He''s hesitant to give it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 383, 3, 22, 'because he may see that you have no interest in obeying it in any case.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 383, 4, 22, 'For example, in Jeremiah 42, the people went to Jeremiah to find out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 383, 5, 22, 'God''s will and asked, "Should we go to Egypt? Find out if it''s God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 383, 6, 22, 'will that we should go to Egypt or not." And Jeremiah said, "Alright,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 383, 7, 22, 'I''ll find out, but I''m sure you fellas won''t obey me in any case." They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 383, 8, 22, 'responded, "Oh yes, we''ll obey you." Then Jeremiah went and found God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 383, 9, 22, 'will and said, "Thus says the Lord, ''You shall not go to Egypt.''" And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 383, 10, 22, 'the people said, "No, you haven''t heard God correctly!" That''s how it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 383, 11, 22, 'with a lot of people. They don''t really want to do what God says, and a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 383, 12, 22, 'wise man realizes that. He senses who is really willing to receive God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 383, 13, 22, 'word and who isn''t.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 383, 14, 22, 'Another reason a wise man is hesitant to give advice is that he does not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 383, 15, 22, 'really want to thrust his opinion on other people. It''s a foolish man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 383, 16, 22, 'who always wants to control other people with his advice. A wise person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 383, 17, 22, 'has advice deep down within his heart, and if another person really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 383, 18, 22, 'values it, he''ll come and pull it out. That''s the meaning of this verse.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 383, 19, 22, 'Many a man proclaims his own loyalty,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 383, 20, 22, 'But who can find a trustworthy man?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 383, 21, 22, 'Prov 20:6');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 383, 22, 22, 'In other words, everyone talks about how faithful he himself is, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 383, 23, 22, 'just try finding someone who is really faithful. Now, I don''t think any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 383, 24, 22, 'of us go around saying to others, "I''m quite faithful, you know." But it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 383, 25, 22, 'says here many men do proclaim their own faithfulness. It doesn''t come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 383, 26, 22, 'out in those words, but it comes in very subtle ways. It can come out,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 383, 27, 22, 'for example, in the giving of a testimony in a meeting. I can give a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 383, 28, 22, 'testimony in a meeting about a particular situation that I faced in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 384, 1, 22, 'home or in the office or in the factory, and the whole burden of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 384, 2, 22, 'testimony is to show other people how faithful I was. Many people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 384, 3, 22, 'proclaim their own faithfulness, but not in crude words, saying, "I am a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 384, 4, 22, 'faithful brother in the church." Nobody is stupid enough to lose his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 384, 5, 22, 'reputation for humility in that way. We''re all wise to preserve our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 384, 6, 22, 'reputation for humility, so we have clever ways of proclaiming our own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 384, 7, 22, 'faithfulness. Sometimes it''s just with one sentence where I''m trying to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 384, 8, 22, 'add to some exposition of the word of God. Everybody''s thinking that I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 384, 9, 22, 'explaining the word of God, but actually I''ve put in a little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 384, 10, 22, 'illustration or a little sentence just to show how faithful I am. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 384, 11, 22, 'world is full of such people who want to show how faithful they are.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 384, 12, 22, 'And quite apart from that, I think most of us proclaim our faithfulness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 384, 13, 22, 'to ourselves even if we don''t proclaim it to other people. Generally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 384, 14, 22, 'speaking, it is true that most believers have a higher opinion about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 384, 15, 22, 'their own faithfulness than is actually the case. I believe one of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 384, 16, 22, 'biggest hindrances to spiritual growth is when we don''t have a sober');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 384, 17, 22, 'estimate about our own spiritual condition. We think, "I''m a pretty good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 384, 18, 22, 'believer. I''m a pretty faithful brother." The proof of such a thought');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 384, 19, 22, 'pattern is when I hear that somebody has said something about me which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 384, 20, 22, 'is not very good, I get worked up about it. It is then that I should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 384, 21, 22, 'realize what a high opinion I have about myself. We quote Romans 7:24,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 384, 22, 22, 'which says, "Oh, wretched man that I am," but we don''t really believe it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 384, 23, 22, 'deep down in our heart. The proof is that when somebody else says I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 384, 24, 22, 'wretched, I get a little upset for a couple of days or a couple of hours');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 384, 25, 22, 'perhaps. Most men think that they are faithful, but who can find a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 384, 26, 22, 'trustworthy man who is really honest before God, faithful in secret,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 384, 27, 22, 'seeks to judge himself, and seeks to see himself clearly in God''s light.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 384, 28, 22, 'It says, "Who can find one?" It is rare. The very fact that the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 385, 1, 22, 'Spirit, through the word of God, says, "Who can find a trustworthy man?"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 385, 2, 22, 'shows that it''s not easy to find someone who really has a sober and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 385, 3, 22, 'sensible estimate of his own spiritual condition.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 385, 4, 22, 'I believe a trustworthy man is one who is longing to see himself as God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 385, 5, 22, 'sees him at all times. I want to ask you, dear brothers and sisters: do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 385, 6, 22, 'you have a great longing to know your true spiritual condition as God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 385, 7, 22, 'sees you? Not what brother x, y, or z thinks about you. You can throw');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 385, 8, 22, 'that in the garbage. Even what the elder brothers think about you, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 385, 9, 22, 'can just throw that into the bottom of the garbage. That''s worth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 385, 10, 22, 'nothing! I believe we must have a fantastic longing for this. I know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 385, 11, 22, 'I''ve cried out to God with all my heart many times, saying, "Lord, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 385, 12, 22, 'don''t want to deceive myself. I want to know what you think about me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 385, 13, 22, 'Really! Tell me the truth! I really want to know what you think about my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 385, 14, 22, 'spirituality. If you think I''m just a rotten deceiver, tell me so! I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 385, 15, 22, 'really want to know! I don''t want to deceive myself." Ask God to show');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 385, 16, 22, 'you and he will arrange circumstances to reveal your true spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 385, 17, 22, 'condition to you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 385, 18, 22, 'Brothers and sisters, our desire should be to be among those few who God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 385, 19, 22, 'can say are really trustworthy, and who have a sober, sensible opinion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 385, 20, 22, 'about their own spiritual condition - the same opinion as God has. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 385, 21, 22, 'should be our longing: to see ourselves as God sees us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 385, 22, 22, 'Children are fortunate if they have a father who is honest and does what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 385, 23, 22, 'is right.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 385, 24, 22, 'Prov 20:7, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 385, 25, 22, 'The book of Proverbs and much of the New Testament place a great value');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 385, 26, 22, 'on being honest. Honesty about our true condition is really the first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 385, 27, 22, 'step towards spirituality. And, of course, that means being honest in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 385, 28, 22, 'all areas of life. The word of God says that your children are really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 386, 1, 22, 'blessed if you are an honest father - not if you''re a clever one, or a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 386, 2, 22, 'rich one, or one who has a big job, or one who can give them many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 386, 3, 22, 'things, but if you''re honest and you do what is right. Righteousness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 386, 4, 22, 'blesses our children. If your children can see as they grow up that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 386, 5, 22, 'always do what is right according to your conscience, how blessed are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 386, 6, 22, 'your children.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 386, 7, 22, 'A king sitting as judge weighs all the evidence carefully,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 386, 8, 22, 'distinguishing the true from false.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 386, 9, 22, 'Prov 20:8, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 386, 10, 22, 'It speaks here of the necessity of having discernment wherever we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 386, 11, 22, 'any responsibility. We can begin as parents in the home. A father is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 386, 12, 22, 'king in his home and often has to sit as a judge in various situations.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 386, 13, 22, 'This applies to wherever God gives us responsibility such as in our work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 386, 14, 22, 'situations or in a church. The great need is to be able to discern as to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 386, 15, 22, 'what is true and what is false. A king sitting as judge weighs all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 386, 16, 22, 'evidence carefully and distinguishes the true from the false.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 386, 17, 22, 'Who can say, "I have cleansed my heart,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 386, 18, 22, 'I am pure from my sin"?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 386, 19, 22, 'Prov 20:9');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 386, 20, 22, 'In the Old Testament, where the book of Proverbs is found, no one could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 386, 21, 22, 'say, "I have cleansed my heart." In the Old Testament, you don''t see the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 386, 22, 22, 'distinction between the heart and the flesh. The Holy Spirit had not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 386, 23, 22, 'come, and they did not have light in this area at all. But it''s quite');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 386, 24, 22, 'foolish for someone who is living in the New Covenant age to go back to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 386, 25, 22, 'Proverbs 20:9 and to say, "Who can say, ''I''ve cleansed my heart''?" This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 386, 26, 22, 'is because it is the will of God today that we have a clean heart:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 386, 27, 22, 'blessed are the pure in heart for they shall see God (Matthew 5:8). We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 386, 28, 22, 'have a heart which is sprinkled clean from an evil conscience as it says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 387, 1, 22, 'in Hebrews 10:22. We are cleansed by the blood of Christ so that there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 387, 2, 22, 'is nothing that defiles our heart. It is important that we see this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 387, 3, 22, 'distinction. Even though nothing good dwells in our flesh, we can keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 387, 4, 22, 'our heart clean and our heart pure from all sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 387, 5, 22, 'Differing weights and differing measures,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 387, 6, 22, 'Both of them are abominable to the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 387, 7, 22, 'Prov 20:10');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 387, 8, 22, 'This refers to any type of cheating related to buying and selling. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 387, 9, 22, 'interesting to see how many times in the book of Proverbs it speaks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 387, 10, 22, 'about being unrighteous in buying and selling. There''s a lot of that in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 387, 11, 22, 'the world, and we have to be very careful as believers. We are never to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 387, 12, 22, 'be involved in any type of unrighteousness related to buying and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 387, 13, 22, 'selling. What differing weights and measures means is that if you are a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 387, 14, 22, 'businessman selling something in a shop, and someone buys one kilogram');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 387, 15, 22, 'of something, you must give him one kilogram. Now, most of us are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 387, 16, 22, 'selling things in a shop, but the bible speaks about giving what is due');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 387, 17, 22, 'to those who have worked for us. It says in James 5:4 "Behold, the pay');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 387, 18, 22, 'of the laborers who mowed your fields, and which has been withheld by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 387, 19, 22, 'you, cries out against you; and the outcry of those who did the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 387, 20, 22, 'harvesting has reached the ears of the Lord of Sabaoth." This teaches us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 387, 21, 22, 'that it''s possible even for believers not to be righteous in paying what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 387, 22, 22, 'is due to those who have worked for them. Of course, it''s a very common');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 387, 23, 22, 'thing in the world, where people try to get work out of people and pay');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 387, 24, 22, 'them the minimum possible. But God is a righteous judge who sees whether');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 387, 25, 22, 'we take advantage of the poor who work for us. If we do that, it says in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 387, 26, 22, 'James 5:4 that their cry of our unrighteousness against them reaches the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 387, 27, 22, 'ears of the Lord, with whom there is no partiality. So we have to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 387, 28, 22, 'very careful. Just like the businessman has to give 1 kilogram to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 388, 1, 22, 'person who is buying 1 kilogram, we have to be careful that we give what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 388, 2, 22, 'is due to those who work for us. It''s better to err on the side of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 388, 3, 22, 'giving a little more rather than less, especially when we think of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 388, 4, 22, 'seriousness of our accountability in this matter on the day of judgment.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 388, 5, 22, 'The character of even a child can be known by the way he acts-whether');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 388, 6, 22, 'what he does is pure and right.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 388, 7, 22, 'Prov 20:11, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 388, 8, 22, 'This is basically what Jesus said in Matthew 7:16, that by their fruits');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 388, 9, 22, 'you shall know them. Even for a child, his character is known by the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 388, 10, 22, 'he behaves. By their fruits you shall know them right from childhood');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 388, 11, 22, 'onwards.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 388, 12, 22, 'The hearing ear and the seeing eye,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 388, 13, 22, 'The Lord has made both of them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 388, 14, 22, 'Prov 20:12');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 388, 15, 22, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 388, 16, 22, 'If you have good eyesight and good hearing, thank God who gave them to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 388, 17, 22, 'you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 388, 18, 22, 'Prov 20:12, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 388, 19, 22, 'There are many people in the world who do not have good eyesight or good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 388, 20, 22, 'hearing. Those which we can take for granted, it says to thank God who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 388, 21, 22, 'gave them to you. And of course, the implication is to use the eyesight');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 388, 22, 22, 'and hearing ability which God gave you for his glory. When we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 388, 23, 22, 'tempted with our eyes particularly, it''s good to ask ourselves: "How');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 388, 24, 22, 'would it be if God had struck me blind? Thankfully, he hasn''t done that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 388, 25, 22, 'He has given me eyesight, but it''s not for me to lust with. It''s for me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 388, 26, 22, 'to use for his glory." If God has given you good eyesight, remember it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 388, 27, 22, 'God''s gift. If he''s given you good hearing, thank him and don''t take it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 388, 28, 22, 'for granted. Remember that he gave it to you that you might use them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 389, 1, 22, 'both, for his glory alone and for no other purpose.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 389, 2, 22, 'If you love sleep, you will end in poverty. Stay awake, work hard, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 389, 3, 22, 'there will be plenty to eat!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 389, 4, 22, 'Prov 20:13, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 389, 5, 22, 'This is one of the many exhortations in the book of Proverbs relating to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 389, 6, 22, 'diligence and hard work. Both are emphasized so many times in the book');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 389, 7, 22, 'of Proverbs. This teaches that God has no place for lazy people in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 389, 8, 22, 'kingdom. Either in earthly matters or in spiritual things, there is no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 389, 9, 22, 'place for laziness. Spirituality does not come if a man is not willing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 389, 10, 22, 'to work at it. Just like in the earthly realm, a man cannot have a crop');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 389, 11, 22, 'if he does not work hard, even so spiritually. Remember what Paul told');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 389, 12, 22, 'Timothy in 2 Timothy 2:6, "The hardworking farmer has to be the first to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 389, 13, 22, 'receive his share of the crops. Consider what I say, for the Lord will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 389, 14, 22, 'give you understanding in everything." It is only righteous that a hard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 389, 15, 22, 'working farmer gets the first share of the crops. Paul is not telling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 389, 16, 22, 'Timothy how to farm a field. He''s teaching a spiritual lesson to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 389, 17, 22, 'diligent and serious about plowing up the fallow ground and sowing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 389, 18, 22, 'righteousness. This is one of the many exhortations in Proverbs about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 389, 19, 22, 'diligence which shows the great importance of it in our spiritual life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 389, 20, 22, '"Bad, bad," says the buyer,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 389, 21, 22, 'But when he goes his way, then he boasts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 389, 22, 22, 'Prov 20:14');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 389, 23, 22, 'This verse speaks about the deceit that can be in our speech. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 389, 24, 22, 'referring to a very common technique employed by people when they want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 389, 25, 22, 'to bargain. The buyer says, "It''s bad, it''s bad. It''s useless. It''s good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 389, 26, 22, 'for nothing." Thereby he beats the seller down to a lower price and when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 389, 27, 22, 'he gets it, he goes back home and boasts, "See what a bargain I got this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 389, 28, 22, 'wonderful thing for." There was a deception there. It''s alright for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 390, 1, 22, 'worldly people to engage in this type of deception, but not Christians.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 390, 2, 22, 'This verse is not teaching us that we shouldn''t bargain or that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 390, 3, 22, 'should sell something for any price that people ask. By all means, get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 390, 4, 22, 'the price down. All this verse is saying is: don''t tell a lie in order');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 390, 5, 22, 'to do it. Don''t lie by saying it''s useless when you know very well it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 390, 6, 22, 'not useless, just because you want him to bring the price down. You say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 390, 7, 22, 'it''s bad or that you can get a better one somewhere else when you know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 390, 8, 22, 'very well that you can''t. It''s not worth it to be deceptive. Here we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 390, 9, 22, 'find how believers can be so careless in their speech in little things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 390, 10, 22, 'Their motive may be good in trying to get a person to come to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 390, 11, 22, 'reasonable price for something, but the method they adopt is sinful in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 390, 12, 22, 'saying something which is not really true. When the bible says that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 390, 13, 22, 'have to love the truth, it means that we have to love the truth in all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 390, 14, 22, 'areas, particularly in our speech. We have to cleanse ourselves from all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 390, 15, 22, 'lying, even in this area of buying and selling.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 390, 16, 22, 'There is gold, and an abundance of jewels;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 390, 17, 22, 'But lips of knowledge are a more precious thing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 390, 18, 22, 'Prov 20:15');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 390, 19, 22, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 390, 20, 22, 'If you know what you are talking about, you have something more valuable');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 390, 21, 22, 'than gold or jewels.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 390, 22, 22, 'Prov 20:15, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 390, 23, 22, 'This verse is very similar to what we read in 1 Peter 3:3-4: women are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 390, 24, 22, 'not to adorn themselves with gold or ornaments or fancy clothes, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 390, 25, 22, 'with a meek and quiet spirit, which is of great value in God''s eyes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 390, 26, 22, 'Such a meek and quiet spirit is far more valuable than gold. And here it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 390, 27, 22, 'says when we speak, if we are speaking from what we have lived and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 390, 28, 22, 'experienced, then it is far more precious than gold or jewels. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 391, 1, 22, 'really referring to wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 391, 2, 22, 'Anyone stupid enough to promise to be responsible for a stranger''s debts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 391, 3, 22, 'ought to have their own property held to guarantee payment.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 391, 4, 22, 'Prov 20:16, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 391, 5, 22, 'This is one of the many exhortations found in the book of Proverbs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 391, 6, 22, 'against standing as guarantee for someone who is unknown. It speaks here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 391, 7, 22, 'about a "stranger" - someone with whom you haven''t come into a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 391, 8, 22, 'relationship. I believe it is right to stand guarantee for those with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 391, 9, 22, 'whom we have come to a committed relationship in the body of Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 391, 10, 22, 'When I say that, I don''t mean everyone who sits in the same assembly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 391, 11, 22, 'Many can sit in an assembly whom you may not have come into a committed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 391, 12, 22, 'relationship with. It''s one thing to have confidence in a person and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 391, 13, 22, 'it''s another thing to have fellowship with a person. We have fellowship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 391, 14, 22, 'with all brothers, but we don''t necessarily have confidence in all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 391, 15, 22, 'brothers. That''s because some of them are not very stable yet. We have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 391, 16, 22, 'nothing against them, but they are not very steady. We''re to be careful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 391, 17, 22, 'that we don''t stand guarantee for someone whom we do not have confidence');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 391, 18, 22, 'in in the guise of a false love. It''s a stupid thing to promise to pay');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 391, 19, 22, 'somebody else''s debts when the word of God tells us that we ourselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 391, 20, 22, 'are not to be in debt: "Owe no man anything" (Romans 13:8). Here it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 391, 21, 22, 'speaking about somebody who wants to borrow something and come to you to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 391, 22, 22, 'stand guarantee for him. If you consent out of a false understanding of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 391, 23, 22, 'love, the word of God says you''re so stupid that you deserve to have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 391, 24, 22, 'your property taken away from you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 391, 25, 22, 'What you get by dishonesty you may enjoy like the finest food, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 391, 26, 22, 'sooner or later it will be like a mouthful of sand.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 391, 27, 22, 'Prov 20:17, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 391, 28, 22, 'You know how it is to have a mouthful of sand. It''s not at all a good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 392, 1, 22, 'feeling to have, and yet it says here that is the result of acquiring');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 392, 2, 22, 'things by dishonesty. In the beginning, what you gain by cheating or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 392, 3, 22, 'dishonesty or any such method, you can enjoy like the finest food. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 392, 4, 22, 'afterward it becomes like gravel in your mouth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 392, 5, 22, 'Prepare plans by consultation,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 392, 6, 22, 'And make war by wise guidance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 392, 7, 22, 'Prov 20:18');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 392, 8, 22, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 392, 9, 22, 'Get good advice and you will succeed; don''t go charging into battle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 392, 10, 22, 'without a plan.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 392, 11, 22, 'Prov 20:18, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 392, 12, 22, 'This basically means that we should seek for advice in our life from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 392, 13, 22, 'those who have more experience, maturity, and wisdom. That will protect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 392, 14, 22, 'us from many follies. If only those who were younger in experience and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 392, 15, 22, 'age would take some of these exhortations seriously, it would save them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 392, 16, 22, 'from a tremendous amount of folly. There are many young people who make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 392, 17, 22, 'absolute fools of themselves in many things that they do, because they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 392, 18, 22, 'do not seek for correction or advice from those who have a little more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 392, 19, 22, 'maturity and wisdom than themselves. And then of course, the sad thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 392, 20, 22, 'is they can do so many foolish things that people gradually begin to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 392, 21, 22, 'lose confidence in them altogether. They need not have become like that,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 392, 22, 22, 'if only they had been a little humble and sought for advice. Prepare');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 392, 23, 22, 'plans by consultation. It''s good to consult and take advice before we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 392, 24, 22, 'take a step forward, particularly in marriage matters. There is such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 392, 25, 22, 'lot of folly in boy/girl relationships. Perhaps this is the area I''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 392, 26, 22, 'seen the most amount of folly among young people, simply because they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 392, 27, 22, 'won''t take advice and they think they know everything. Then they make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 392, 28, 22, 'fools of themselves and everybody loses confidence in them. We could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 393, 1, 22, 'speak of many other areas as well, even in the church. It''s good to seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 393, 2, 22, 'for advice. It''s good to humble ourselves and acknowledge that we lack');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 393, 3, 22, 'wisdom in so many different areas.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 393, 4, 22, 'A gossip can never keep a secret. Stay away from people who talk too');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 393, 5, 22, 'much.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 393, 6, 22, 'Prov 20:19, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 393, 7, 22, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 393, 8, 22, 'Don''t tell your secrets to a gossip unless you want them broadcast to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 393, 9, 22, 'the world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 393, 10, 22, 'Prov 20:19, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 393, 11, 22, 'This is a very good exhortation. If you find a person who is always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 393, 12, 22, 'talking too much, it''s good not to keep company with him, because he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 393, 13, 22, 'will only defile you. He can never be a help to you. It says, "Stay away');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 393, 14, 22, 'from people who talk too much." When people talk so much, they sin. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 393, 15, 22, 'the multitude of words, it''s impossible to avoid sin (Proverbs 10:19).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 393, 16, 22, 'Seek fellowship with those who don''t talk so much. Those are the people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 393, 17, 22, 'who have more wisdom. A fool''s voice is known by much speaking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 393, 18, 22, '(Ecclesiastes 5:3).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 393, 19, 22, 'I have found throughout the years, in spite of all the exhortations we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 393, 20, 22, 'give relating to gossiping and backbiting, there are very few who take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 393, 21, 22, 'them so seriously so as to eliminate them completely from their lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 393, 22, 22, 'Most people don''t take them seriously enough. They have to give an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 393, 23, 22, 'account to God for every idle word they speak in the final day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 393, 24, 22, 'Therefore we have to be particularly careful not to share secrets with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 393, 25, 22, 'someone who is not taking this matter very seriously. Many, many people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 393, 26, 22, 'do not know how to keep a secret or how to keep something confidential.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 393, 27, 22, 'There are very few people, even in the church, who know how to keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 393, 28, 22, 'something entirely to themselves. Very, very few. So we are not to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 394, 1, 22, 'foolish in sharing our problems, difficulties, or anything confidential');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 394, 2, 22, 'with people who do not know how to keep things to themselves. Don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 394, 3, 22, 'share something that''s in your heart to anybody and everybody, not even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 394, 4, 22, 'in the church. Most of them don''t have understanding in this area.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 394, 5, 22, 'He who curses his father or his mother,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 394, 6, 22, 'His lamp will go out in time of darkness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 394, 7, 22, 'Prov 20:20');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 394, 8, 22, 'The "time of darkness" means a person''s time of need. During the time of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 394, 9, 22, 'darkness, there will not be a lamp to light the way if you curse your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 394, 10, 22, 'father or your mother. This can even be cursing your parents behind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 394, 11, 22, 'their backs like Ham, the son of Noah, did. We read in Genesis 9 that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 394, 12, 22, 'Ham spoke bad about his father to his brothers. God took that very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 394, 13, 22, 'seriously, and a curse came not only upon Ham, but upon his children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 394, 14, 22, 'also. He had the spirit of rebellion in doing that. This teaches us that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 394, 15, 22, 'it''s a very dangerous thing to speak bad behind your parents'' backs,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 394, 16, 22, 'even if you see some weakness in them. We always need to cover our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 394, 17, 22, 'parents'' nakedness with a sheet like Shem and Japheth did. If you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 394, 18, 22, 'seen some weakness in your parents, cover it. We can also say this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 394, 19, 22, 'applies to your father-in-law or your mother-in-law, because they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 394, 20, 22, 'your spouse''s parents. People can be less careful with their in-laws');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 394, 21, 22, 'even though they are very careful when it comes to their own parents.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 394, 22, 22, 'We see from this that God tests each person''s faithfulness. It''s in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 394, 23, 22, 'little things that God sees if a man is faithful. Like we read in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 394, 24, 22, 'Proverbs 20:6, everybody is ready to think that he is very faithful, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 394, 25, 22, 'when God examines a person according to all the little things written in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 394, 26, 22, 'the book of Proverbs, he finds there are very few who are really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 394, 27, 22, 'trustworthy and faithful before his face in secret. But the world is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 394, 28, 22, 'full of believers who think that they are very faithful and wholehearted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 395, 1, 22, 'and zealous and all that. They are deceiving themselves. We have to take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 395, 2, 22, 'all these little things seriously and live before God''s face, because we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 395, 3, 22, 'have to give an account to him finally. Like it says here, if we curse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 395, 4, 22, 'our father or mother, then in our time of need, we''ll find there is no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 395, 5, 22, 'light along our path. Our lamps will go out in time of darkness just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 395, 6, 22, 'like the foolish virgins whose lamps went out when the darkness came.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 395, 7, 22, 'The more easily you get your wealth, the less good it will do you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 395, 8, 22, 'Prov 20:21, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 395, 9, 22, 'Don''t envy a man who has earned a fantastic inheritance. That''s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 395, 10, 22, 'necessarily the best way to get money. The word of God places much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 395, 11, 22, 'emphasis on working and earning your money. Also, don''t make a fortune');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 395, 12, 22, 'through dishonesty or cheating. It''s not worth it. You''ll find there''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 395, 13, 22, 'curse that comes along with your wealth. And that curse can be passed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 395, 14, 22, 'down to your family who inherits that cheated, dishonest money.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 395, 15, 22, 'Do not say, "I will repay evil";');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 395, 16, 22, 'Wait for the Lord, and He will save you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 395, 17, 22, 'Prov 20:22');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 395, 18, 22, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 395, 19, 22, 'Don''t repay evil for evil. Wait for the Lord to handle the matter.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 395, 20, 22, 'Prov 20:22, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 395, 21, 22, 'In other words, we are not to take vengeance on anyone. We are to let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 395, 22, 22, 'the Lord handle the matter. One of the best examples of this in the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 395, 23, 22, 'Testament was David. King Saul was after his life, and yet he never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 395, 24, 22, 'tried to take Saul''s life in return, even when Saul was at his mercy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 395, 25, 22, 'David let God handle the matter. God took care of Saul and dealt with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 395, 26, 22, 'him in his own time, and he put David on the throne. We need to see,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 395, 27, 22, 'dear brothers and sisters, that there is a great lust in our flesh to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 395, 28, 22, 'take revenge. If you say that lust is not in you, that only shows you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 396, 1, 22, 'have not yet seen what dwells in your flesh. There is a fantastic lust');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 396, 2, 22, 'in us to take revenge. You may think it is only to take revenge on those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 396, 3, 22, 'you hate. No. Very often we can take revenge on loved ones. A husband');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 396, 4, 22, 'can take revenge on his wife, not by killing her or some other crude');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 396, 5, 22, 'way, but in very subtle ways in the home. A father or mother can take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 396, 6, 22, 'revenge on their children for inconveniencing them in some way. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 396, 7, 22, 'are many ways that we try to repay evil with evil, and we need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 396, 8, 22, 'cleanse out that vengeful nature which dwells in our flesh which is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 396, 9, 22, 'constantly seeking to come into our heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 396, 10, 22, 'A little delight when something bad happens to someone who has not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 396, 11, 22, 'treated you well. What is that? That is a manifestation of this same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 396, 12, 22, 'vengeful spirit. When David heard that Saul had died, he didn''t even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 396, 13, 22, 'inwardly rejoice at the news. In 2 Samuel 1, you can see that there was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 396, 14, 22, 'such a clean spirit in him, and he was an Old Covenant man who didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 396, 15, 22, 'know anything about judging himself or about the New and Living Way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 396, 16, 22, 'What a fantastically clean spirit he had in relation to Saul, that he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 396, 17, 22, 'never coveted the throne nor was he happy when something bad happened to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 396, 18, 22, 'the person who had treated him so badly all through his life. I''m not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 396, 19, 22, 'surprised that God called David, "a man after my own heart." It''s easy,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 396, 20, 22, 'brothers and sisters, to think we are in the New Covenant and greater');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 396, 21, 22, 'than David. We need to see how much more God is going to require from us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 396, 22, 22, 'in this area of revenge. We need to cleanse ourselves thoroughly. Don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 396, 23, 22, 'ever take it upon yourself to repay wrong. Trust in the Lord and he will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 396, 24, 22, 'make it alright.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 396, 25, 22, 'Differing weights are an abomination to the Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 396, 26, 22, 'And a false scale is not good.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 396, 27, 22, 'Prov 20:23');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 396, 28, 22, 'We considered this before in Proverbs 20:10. This is one of those things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 397, 1, 22, 'repeated again and again in the book of Proverbs. I want to apply this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 397, 2, 22, 'in a spiritual way. Jesus said, "In the way you judge, you will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 397, 3, 22, 'judged; and by your standard of measure, it will be measured to you."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 397, 4, 22, 'All of us by nature have a tendency to judge others more severely than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 397, 5, 22, 'we judge ourselves. When we do something wrong, we tend to take it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 397, 6, 22, 'lightly. But when someone else makes that same mistake for which we gave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 397, 7, 22, 'ourselves leniency, we can be so severe in our judgment of them. What is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 397, 8, 22, 'that? We have differing measures like it says in this verse. I use one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 397, 9, 22, 'measure to judge that person and a different measure to judge myself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 397, 10, 22, 'That''s an abomination to the Lord. If we ever have differing weights, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 397, 11, 22, 'should be that we judge ourselves more severely and others more lightly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 397, 12, 22, 'That will help us in the day of judgment, because it says God will judge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 397, 13, 22, 'us by the same measure that we have judged others in the final day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 397, 14, 22, 'Man''s steps are ordained by the Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 397, 15, 22, 'How then can man understand his way?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 397, 16, 22, 'Prov 20:24');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 397, 17, 22, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 397, 18, 22, 'Since the Lord is directing our steps, why try to understand everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 397, 19, 22, 'that happens along the way?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 397, 20, 22, 'Prov 20:24, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 397, 21, 22, 'We can''t understand everything that happens along the way. It says in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 397, 22, 22, 'Romans 8:26 that we do not know what to pray for or how to pray as we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 397, 23, 22, 'should. But we do know that God works everything for good for those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 397, 24, 22, 'love him (Romans 8:28). There are many of God''s dealings with us which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 397, 25, 22, 'we cannot understand. We don''t have to understand. All we have to do is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 397, 26, 22, 'humble ourselves under God''s mighty hand. Since the Lord is directing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 397, 27, 22, 'our steps, why try to understand everything that happens along the way?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 397, 28, 22, 'It''s enough to know that God is working for our good.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 398, 1, 22, 'It is foolish and rash to make a promise to the Lord before counting the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 398, 2, 22, 'cost.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 398, 3, 22, 'Prov 20:25, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 398, 4, 22, 'This is another tendency man has. In some moment of trial or pressure or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 398, 5, 22, 'crisis he says, "Oh God, I''ll do this for you," or "I''ll give this to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 398, 6, 22, 'you!" Then when that crisis is over, he takes lightly what he has said.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 398, 7, 22, 'That''s not right. It says it''s foolish and rash to make a promise like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 398, 8, 22, 'that before counting the cost. Jesus said, "Sit down and count the cost"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 398, 9, 22, '(Luke 14:28). That''s a good word. Don''t make a decision while you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 398, 10, 22, 'standing. Sit down, relax, think about it, count the cost, and then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 398, 11, 22, 'decide whether you want to move forward, or commit yourself, or give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 398, 12, 22, 'whatever you''re thinking about to the Lord. You find that those who take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 398, 13, 22, 'their decisions in this way have much more steadiness and stability in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 398, 14, 22, 'their spiritual life, growth, and progress, because they have really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 398, 15, 22, 'thought through what it means to be a disciple. When I make a decision,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 398, 16, 22, 'I think of all these things. I say, "Lord, I have sat down. I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 398, 17, 22, 'counted the cost, and I want to be a disciple." But there are many who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 398, 18, 22, 'don''t sit down and count the cost. They just get excited in a meeting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 398, 19, 22, 'and say, "Yes, I''m excited to follow the Lord." You find these people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 398, 20, 22, 'are always taking decisions, and yet, year after year after year you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 398, 21, 22, 'never see much progress in their spiritual lives. That''s because they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 398, 22, 22, 'haven''t really sat down before God and counted the cost of being a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 398, 23, 22, 'disciple. I want to encourage every one of us to take that command of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 398, 24, 22, 'Jesus seriously: sit down. Before the Lord, think of all that being a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 398, 25, 22, 'disciple means. Then decide whether you want to be one or not. Lightly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 398, 26, 22, 'saying, "Yes, I want to do this," can be mere empty words. They don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 398, 27, 22, 'impress the Lord and they are actually harmful to us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 398, 28, 22, 'A wise king stamps out crime by severe punishment.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 399, 1, 22, 'Prov 20:26, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 399, 2, 22, 'This refers to God who is the wise king. He is going to stamp out all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 399, 3, 22, 'sin in this world with the lake of fire that he has prepared for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 399, 4, 22, 'wicked. That is perfectly righteous of God to do. It''s part of his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 399, 5, 22, 'wisdom, it says here. A wise king eradicates crime by severe punishment.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 399, 6, 22, 'There is a movement gradually spreading all over the world to eradicate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 399, 7, 22, 'capital punishment. That basically means that we shouldn''t hang');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 399, 8, 22, 'murderers anymore. Many countries don''t hang people anymore. A person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 399, 9, 22, 'can murder someone, and he is not hung anymore. The result of this lack');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 399, 10, 22, 'of severe punishment, which is due to a human idea of love and goodness,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 399, 11, 22, 'is that crime increases. But in the countries where punishment is very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 399, 12, 22, 'severe and strict, you find less crime. We shouldn''t have any false');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 399, 13, 22, 'ideas of love, even with our own children. Strict punishment is the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 399, 14, 22, 'we can eliminate a lot of evil in their lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 399, 15, 22, 'A man''s conscience is the Lord''s searchlight exposing his hidden');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 399, 16, 22, 'motives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 399, 17, 22, 'Prov 20:27, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 399, 18, 22, 'God has given each of us a conscience, and that conscience is like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 399, 19, 22, 'searchlight. When you shine a searchlight into a corner under the bed,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 399, 20, 22, 'you see things which you didn''t see when you looked without a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 399, 21, 22, 'searchlight. So it is with a man''s conscience. A man''s conscience is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 399, 22, 22, 'God''s searchlight that exposes our hidden motives. It''s good to keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 399, 23, 22, 'that searchlight burning. Keep the battery charged. Keep that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 399, 24, 22, 'searchlight always alive and alert so that it can help you to cleanse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 399, 25, 22, 'yourself. Since we have a conscience, it is very easy for us to judge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 399, 26, 22, 'ourselves if we want. Our conscience alerts us about our entire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 399, 27, 22, 'conscious area. We don''t have to worry about our unconscious areas. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 399, 28, 22, 'doesn''t ask us to do that. But in our conscious area, our conscience');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 400, 1, 22, 'will tell us clearly, "This is wrong. Never mind if you see some other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 400, 2, 22, 'brother doing it. This is wrong for you." Or, "You are doing this with a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 400, 3, 22, 'wrong motive." If I can listen to that voice of conscience every time,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 400, 4, 22, 'then I can cleanse myself and keep the Lord''s searchlight in me burning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 400, 5, 22, 'brightly. I believe this is one of the great secrets of spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 400, 6, 22, 'progress in our lives: to keep that searchlight always brightly burning.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 400, 7, 22, 'Don''t let it dim. For example, when you find that you''re no longer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 400, 8, 22, 'convicted today about things that you were disturbed about four or five');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 400, 9, 22, 'years ago, that means the power of your searchlight has become dimmer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 400, 10, 22, 'Once upon a time something bothered you, but it doesn''t bother you now.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 400, 11, 22, 'That''s an indication that something is wrong. It''s the beginning of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 400, 12, 22, 'backsliding when we lose sensitivity in our conscience.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 400, 13, 22, 'Loyalty and truth preserve the king,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 400, 14, 22, 'And he upholds his throne by righteousness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 400, 15, 22, 'Prov 20:28');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 400, 16, 22, 'We can think again of our position as kings in our homes and in other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 400, 17, 22, 'places where God gives us responsibility. It says that we uphold our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 400, 18, 22, 'throne by righteousness and by truth. There could be many applications');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 400, 19, 22, 'of this verse, but one is that we keep our promises to our children.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 400, 20, 22, 'That''s a very important thing, and I find that we have to be careful to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 400, 21, 22, 'cleanse ourselves in this area. If we have promised something to our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 400, 22, 22, 'children, we should keep our word. We uphold our thrones in our homes as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 400, 23, 22, 'fathers, as kings of the home, by righteousness. If you have promised to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 400, 24, 22, 'do something for your child, then do it - if, of course, the conditions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 400, 25, 22, 'are fulfilled. If you have promised to punish your child if it does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 400, 26, 22, 'something, then you have to keep your promise and punish the child when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 400, 27, 22, 'it does that thing. Don''t just ignore it. Keep your word to uphold your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 400, 28, 22, 'throne by righteousness as fathers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 401, 1, 22, 'The glory of young men is their strength,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 401, 2, 22, 'And the honor of old men is their gray hair.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 401, 3, 22, 'Prov 20:29');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 401, 4, 22, 'Grey hair refers to wisdom. The expectation is that as we grow older, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 401, 5, 22, 'should become wiser. It''s easy to get grey hair on your head. You just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 401, 6, 22, 'grow older, and the grey hair comes automatically, whether you''re wise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 401, 7, 22, 'or not. But the expectation is that as the grey hairs come, wisdom is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 401, 8, 22, 'increasingly found in our life. That, we know, cannot come overnight.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 401, 9, 22, 'That is why it is important to work on our salvation right from our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 401, 10, 22, 'youth, so that we don''t end up as fools even when we have grey hair.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 401, 11, 22, 'What are the examples of folly given in the book of Proverbs? There are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 401, 12, 22, 'many. For example, a man who is old and still doesn''t know how to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 401, 13, 22, 'control his tongue, who still speaks much like when he was young.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 401, 14, 22, 'Ecclesiastes 5:3 says, "A fool''s voice is known in the multitude of his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 401, 15, 22, 'words." Or a person who grows old and still loses his temper.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 401, 16, 22, 'Ecclesiastes 7:9 says, "Anger dwells in the bosom of fools." The man has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 401, 17, 22, 'grey hair on his head, but he still gets upset and irritated and loses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 401, 18, 22, 'his temper. That is a man who has not become wise yet. These are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 401, 19, 22, 'examples of things that we are to grow out of, so that by the time grey');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 401, 20, 22, 'hair begins to be found on our head, the marks of wisdom are also there.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 401, 21, 22, 'That''s why it''s important that we really pursue after wisdom right from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 401, 22, 22, 'the time that we are young. It takes a lifetime to acquire it. That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 401, 23, 22, 'why we really have to take this seriously. Otherwise, we''ll never make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 401, 24, 22, 'progress.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 401, 25, 22, 'Young men''s strength is their zeal. Sometimes young men can think that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 401, 26, 22, 'strength is the great thing, and so they despise those who are not so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 401, 27, 22, 'strong even though they have wisdom. But the word of God says that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 401, 28, 22, 'wisdom is better than strength. Both are needed. Both young men and old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 402, 1, 22, 'people are needed in the church. In 1 John 2:13-14, John writes to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 402, 2, 22, 'children, to the young men that are strong, and to the fathers who know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 402, 3, 22, 'God and his ways. So there is a need for all in the church - for young');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 402, 4, 22, 'men with their zeal (even if they don''t have much wisdom) and for older');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 402, 5, 22, 'people who are wise. By older people, I don''t mean old in age. A man can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 402, 6, 22, 'have a head full of grey hair and have no wisdom at all, yet there may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 402, 7, 22, 'be another young brother who doesn''t have one grey hair but he has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 402, 8, 22, 'wisdom. Spirituality does not depend on physical age. A person can be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 402, 9, 22, 'spiritual father when he''s thirty or thirty-five - a spiritual father!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 402, 10, 22, 'Much more than someone else who is seventy if he hasn''t progressed in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 402, 11, 22, 'the way of patience and wisdom. But it is God''s will that there are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 402, 12, 22, 'those who have wisdom in the church and young men with their strength.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 402, 13, 22, 'It''s very important to be zealous when we are young. It''s a sad thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 402, 14, 22, 'when young men are lukewarm spiritually. There''s not much hope for them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 402, 15, 22, 'Punishment that hurts chases evil from the heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 402, 16, 22, 'Prov 20:30, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 402, 17, 22, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 402, 18, 22, 'Sometimes it takes a painful experience to make us change our ways.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 402, 19, 22, 'Prov 20:30, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 402, 20, 22, 'We could apply to God''s chastening over our life. Sometimes that is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 402, 21, 22, 'only way for us to learn a lesson, just as we find with our own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 402, 22, 22, 'children. We have to punish them before they learn a lesson. God also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 402, 23, 22, 'finds with us that in order to chase away evil from our hearts, he has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 402, 24, 22, 'to give us a punishment that hurts us. When God wants us to change our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 402, 25, 22, 'ways in some area, and he has spoken to us, but we haven''t heard him or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 402, 26, 22, 'obeyed what he''s told us, then he gives us a painful experience - maybe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 402, 27, 22, 'a sickness, maybe a trial, maybe testing us in our home, maybe some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 402, 28, 22, 'painful experience. That''s exactly like a father disciplining his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 403, 1, 22, 'children in such a way that it hurts. Our Father is chastening us with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 403, 2, 22, 'the intention that we might change our ways.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 403, 3, 23, 'Chapter 21 Chapter 21');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 403, 4, 23, 'Just as water is turned into irrigation ditches, so the Lord directs the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 403, 5, 23, 'king''s thoughts. He turns them wherever he wants to.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 403, 6, 23, 'Prov 21:1, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 403, 7, 23, 'This is speaking about the sovereignty of God over all people. It refers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 403, 8, 23, 'to the king because in those days, the king was the most powerful person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 403, 9, 23, 'in a country. It says here that the Lord can make even the most powerful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 403, 10, 23, 'person in a country change his thoughts just like water is turned in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 403, 11, 23, 'irrigation ditches. When a farmer wants to irrigate his land, usually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 403, 12, 23, 'there is a canal flowing nearby, and he makes a little irrigation ditch');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 403, 13, 23, 'connecting to that canal so that he can make that water flow into any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 403, 14, 23, 'part of his farm - north, south, east, or west. He slopes the irrigation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 403, 15, 23, 'ditch in such a way that the water will come, and it says just as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 403, 16, 23, 'easily, the Lord can make powerful people in the world change their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 403, 17, 23, 'decisions. He controls their thoughts, and he can turn them wherever he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 403, 18, 23, 'wishes. I don''t know whether there''s any verse in the whole bible which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 403, 19, 23, 'speaks of the absolute sovereignty of God over the world authorities as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 403, 20, 23, 'definitively and powerfully as this verse. And when we are in living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 403, 21, 23, 'connection with such a God, this truth eliminates all fear from our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 403, 22, 23, 'hearts completely. God can do amazing things with your boss in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 403, 23, 23, 'office who is much smaller than a king, or with the landlord, or anyone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 403, 24, 23, 'else. We must have faith in a living God - in a loving father who has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 403, 25, 23, 'control over all these things. He can remove people from power, put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 403, 26, 23, 'people in power, and turn people''s opinions and decisions. This is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 403, 27, 23, 'God we worship. This is what makes us more than conquerors in all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 403, 28, 23, 'situations.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 404, 1, 23, 'There are many instances of this in the Old Testament: how God made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 404, 2, 23, 'Pharaoh release the Israelites from Egypt, or how he made the Persian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 404, 3, 23, 'king in the book of Esther turn his decision so that the Jews'' lives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 404, 4, 23, 'were spared, and many, many other instances. I''ve also read about the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 404, 5, 23, 'history of the second world war. At different points in the war, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 404, 6, 23, 'worked in answer to prayer to turn the armies of Hitler, that demon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 404, 7, 23, 'possessed man, into defeat. God worked in all these situations and made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 404, 8, 23, 'them take foolish decisions so that they would lose. It''s amazing to see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 404, 9, 23, 'God''s hand working all throughout history.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 404, 10, 23, 'Every man''s way is right in his own eyes,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 404, 11, 23, 'But the Lord weighs the heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 404, 12, 23, 'Prov 21:2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 404, 13, 23, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 404, 14, 23, 'We can justify our every deed, but God looks at our motives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 404, 15, 23, 'Prov 21:2, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 404, 16, 23, 'This verse cuts in two directions. It''s a two-edged sword. First of all,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 404, 17, 23, 'let me tell you the encouraging part of this verse: when we have done');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 404, 18, 23, 'something that seemed right to us, but someone else feels that it was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 404, 19, 23, 'not right, we can be disturbed because of the opinion of that other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 404, 20, 23, 'person. There''s no need to be disturbed. It says here that God sees our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 404, 21, 23, 'motive. Go to God and say, "Lord, those brothers don''t understand. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 404, 22, 23, 'you know with what motive I did that." Then you can be free. You don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 404, 23, 23, 'have to live in condemnation or depression anymore. That''s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 404, 24, 23, 'encouraging part of this verse. God sees the motive. Never mind what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 404, 25, 23, 'other people think about your action.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 404, 26, 23, 'The other side of the sword is a warning. That is, it''s not enough that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 404, 27, 23, 'we prove to other people from some verse or other self-justification');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 404, 28, 23, 'that there was something right in what we did. God sees the motive with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 405, 1, 23, 'which I did something, and the motive may have been bad. There may have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 405, 2, 23, 'been some corruption in the motive. So this verse cuts in both ways. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 405, 3, 23, 'I just want to say this, dear brothers and sisters, we have to be very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 405, 4, 23, 'careful in this area of motives. It is in the area of motives that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 405, 5, 23, 'sin the most. It is in the area of motives that ultimately our judgment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 405, 6, 23, 'will come.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 405, 7, 23, 'According to 1 Corinthians 4:5, in the final day, the Lord will bring to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 405, 8, 23, 'light the hidden motives of men''s hearts, and then every man will have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 405, 9, 23, 'praise from God. That man did not understand why you did something, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 405, 10, 23, 'on the final day, God will show him and everybody else that you did it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 405, 11, 23, 'for his glory. God will say, "I don''t care what your opinion is about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 405, 12, 23, 'what he did." And likewise that day will also be sad for some people -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 405, 13, 23, 'that so many things which appeared to be good before others, when their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 405, 14, 23, 'motives are finally exposed, it''ll be quite sad.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 405, 15, 23, 'I believe it will be because of their motives that many who are first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 405, 16, 23, 'will be last and many who are last in the eyes of others will be first.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 405, 17, 23, 'So we need to watch our motives at all times, particularly in matters');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 405, 18, 23, 'that we are in doubt about: is it right or is it wrong? Can I do this or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 405, 19, 23, 'can I not do this? Ask yourself, "What is my motive? Can I do it for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 405, 20, 23, 'glory of God? Can I do it in the name of the Lord Jesus?" Then you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 405, 21, 23, 'right in doing it, even if everybody else thinks you are wrong. It makes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 405, 22, 23, 'no difference to God. According to your light, you are right. Of course,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 405, 23, 23, 'as time goes on we will get greater light, but God judges us according');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 405, 24, 23, 'to the light we have at a particular moment. He does not judge me by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 405, 25, 23, 'light I''m going to have ten years from now. Praise God that he judges me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 405, 26, 23, 'today by the light I have today. And he judges you today, not by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 405, 27, 23, 'light I have but by the light you have. That''s why I cannot judge you. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 405, 28, 23, 'would be a stupid idiot if I judge you according to the light I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 406, 1, 23, 'because that may not be the light you have. That is why in matters that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 406, 2, 23, 'are not written clearly about in scripture, we have to give one another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 406, 3, 23, 'freedom. I''ve found, brothers and sisters, that so many people who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 406, 4, 23, 'pursue righteousness end up as downright pharisees. That''s the way the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 406, 5, 23, 'devil leads them astray, because they begin to judge others in areas');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 406, 6, 23, 'which are not clearly written about in scripture. Give freedom. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 406, 7, 23, 'judges that person''s motive in all such matters. This is very important.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 406, 8, 23, 'To do righteousness and justice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 406, 9, 23, 'Is desired by the Lord more than sacrifice.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 406, 10, 23, 'Prov 21:3');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 406, 11, 23, 'This is something Samuel also said: "To obey is better than sacrifice"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 406, 12, 23, '(1 Samuel 15:22). To do the will of God, to love mercy, and to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 406, 13, 23, 'righteous, kind, fair, and upright are much more important to God than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 406, 14, 23, 'all the sacrifices we give to him in the meetings. These are far more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 406, 15, 23, 'important than sacrificing time to come to the meetings or to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 406, 16, 23, 'something for the church, especially if I''m doing those things while');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 406, 17, 23, 'neglecting righteousness and fairness. For example, think of a husband');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 406, 18, 23, 'who is not righteous and fair toward his wife at home. What is the use');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 406, 19, 23, 'of him doing so many things in the church if he is not righteous and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 406, 20, 23, 'fair in considering his wife''s needs at home? The Lord wants');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 406, 21, 23, 'righteousness and fairness much more than all the sacrifice that you say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 406, 22, 23, 'you''re going to do for his church. This is very important because we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 406, 23, 23, 'have a tendency to think, "That was for the Lord I made that sacrifice,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 406, 24, 23, 'so it doesn''t matter if I''m not so righteous and fair at home." No. To');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 406, 25, 23, 'be righteous and fair is much more important. That''s what the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 406, 26, 23, 'desires more than all those sacrifices.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 406, 27, 23, 'Haughty eyes and a proud heart,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 406, 28, 23, 'The lamp of the wicked, is sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 407, 1, 23, 'Prov 21:4');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 407, 2, 23, 'Haughty eyes and a proud heart usually go together. A prideful heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 407, 3, 23, 'manifests itself in a prideful look. It also says that the lamp of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 407, 4, 23, 'wicked is sin.We saw earlier in Proverbs 20:27 that the conscience of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 407, 5, 23, 'man is the lamp or searchlight of the Lord. Here it refers to a wicked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 407, 6, 23, 'man''s conscience and the standards by which he lives which are sinful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 407, 7, 23, 'This teaches that if a man''s conscience is not educated by the word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 407, 8, 23, 'God and he doesn''t seek to bring his conscience more in line with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 407, 9, 23, 'scripture, his conscience can even lead him into sin. The lamp of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 407, 10, 23, 'wicked is sin. This is why we need to align our conscience with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 407, 11, 23, 'teaching of God''s word. This is why it''s so important to know what God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 407, 12, 23, 'word teaches on a number of subjects. All scripture is given that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 407, 13, 23, 'man of God might be perfect, thoroughly equipped for every good work.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 407, 14, 23, 'The plans of the diligent lead surely to advantage,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 407, 15, 23, 'But everyone who is hasty comes surely to poverty.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 407, 16, 23, 'Prov 21:5');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 407, 17, 23, 'Again, this is one of those repeated emphases in the book of Proverbs:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 407, 18, 23, 'hard work and wise planning that leads to prosperity, and hastiness in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 407, 19, 23, 'matters which usually leads to spiritual poverty.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 407, 20, 23, '21:6 TLB, speaks about dishonest gain. "Dishonest gain will never last.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 407, 21, 23, 'They''ll soon disappear and they will also lead you into the jaws of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 407, 22, 23, 'death');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 407, 23, 23, 'Dishonest gain will never last, so why take the risk?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 407, 24, 23, 'Prov 21:6, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 407, 25, 23, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 407, 26, 23, 'The riches you get by dishonesty soon disappear, but not before they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 407, 27, 23, 'lead you into the jaws of death.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 407, 28, 23, 'Prov 21:6, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 408, 1, 23, 'Proverbs emphasizes much on money that we make dishonestly. It will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 408, 2, 23, 'never, never bring a blessing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 408, 3, 23, 'Because the wicked are unfair, their violence boomerangs and destroys');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 408, 4, 23, 'them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 408, 5, 23, 'Prov 21:7, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 408, 6, 23, 'That which wicked people do as evil to other people, like a boomerang');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 408, 7, 23, 'finally comes back and hits them and knocks them out. Have you noticed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 408, 8, 23, 'that sometimes? Maybe you find fault with someone in some area and you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 408, 9, 23, 'judge him, and one day you find yourself doing exactly the same thing as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 408, 10, 23, 'that brother whom you previously judged? That thing has boomeranged back');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 408, 11, 23, 'on you. You judged that brother and thought you were more spiritual, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 408, 12, 23, 'then one day it boomeranged back on you. God has put you in that awkward');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 408, 13, 23, 'position where you are doing the same thing yourself. This way God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 408, 14, 23, 'teaches us not to judge others. He says, "You leave their judgment to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 408, 15, 23, 'me. It''s enough if you judge yourself." The violence of the wicked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 408, 16, 23, 'boomerangs and finally destroys them. If we don''t learn a lesson through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 408, 17, 23, 'these things, finally these boomerangs that come back and hit us will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 408, 18, 23, 'destroy us. I believe there are many who are sick because they have not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 408, 19, 23, 'judged themselves in this area. That''s something we have to be careful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 408, 20, 23, 'about: that we don''t have boomerangs of judgment coming back upon us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 408, 21, 23, 'A man is known by his actions. An evil man lives an evil life; a good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 408, 22, 23, 'man lives a godly life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 408, 23, 23, 'Prov 21:8, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 408, 24, 23, 'This, of course, is related to what Jesus said: "By their fruits you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 408, 25, 23, 'shall know them." In other words, we do not judge the inward man or his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 408, 26, 23, 'motives. A man is only known by his actions. We are to only look at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 408, 27, 23, 'fruit in a man''s life. Are they good or are they bad? NEVER are we to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 408, 28, 23, 'judge the inside and say, "I know why he''s doing that." Well, if you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 409, 1, 23, 'God, then you know why he''s doing it. But since you''re not God, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 409, 2, 23, 'don''t know why he''s doing it, and it''s good for us to humble ourselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 409, 3, 23, 'and say, "I''m not God. I don''t want to be like Lucifer who wants to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 409, 4, 23, 'God. I don''t know why he''s doing it. I''m only called to judge by his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 409, 5, 23, 'external actions, and I refuse to judge his thoughts or his motives."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 409, 6, 23, 'Take that position, brothers and sisters, and it''ll save you from a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 409, 7, 23, 'tremendous amount of evil and from a tremendous amount of boomerangs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 409, 8, 23, 'coming and ruining yourself. They will destroy your life and destroy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 409, 9, 23, 'your spiritual progress.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 409, 10, 23, 'It is better to live in a corner of a roof');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 409, 11, 23, 'Than in a house shared with a contentious woman.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 409, 12, 23, 'Prov 21:9');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 409, 13, 23, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 409, 14, 23, 'Better to live on the roof than share the house with a nagging wife.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 409, 15, 23, 'Prov 21:9, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 409, 16, 23, 'Even though it''s uncomfortable to live on the roof, particularly when it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 409, 17, 23, 'rains, the word of God says even that is preferable to living inside the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 409, 18, 23, 'house if there is a wife who is constantly nagging. This is a verse that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 409, 19, 23, 'should be a challenge to all sisters who are married in the church. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 409, 20, 23, 'should never allow their home to be like this. We saw in Proverbs 14:1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 409, 21, 23, 'how it''s a wise woman who builds her house, and since it''s a woman who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 409, 22, 23, 'is in the house more than any other member of a normal family - more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 409, 23, 23, 'than the husband and the children - it''s the woman who has a very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 409, 24, 23, 'important part in building the atmosphere of a house and ensuring that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 409, 25, 23, 'it is a place where wisdom is found. Nagging is the very opposite of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 409, 26, 23, 'wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 409, 27, 23, 'Wicked people are always hungry for evil; they have no mercy on anyone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 409, 28, 23, 'Prov 21:10, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 410, 1, 23, 'This basically means that if you want to find fault, you can find fault');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 410, 2, 23, 'with anyone in the whole world. You know that the Pharisees found plenty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 410, 3, 23, 'of fault even with Jesus. There was one person who walked on this earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 410, 4, 23, 'who was absolutely perfect, with whom even God almighty could find no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 410, 5, 23, 'fault. He said, "This is my beloved son, with whom I am well pleased."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 410, 6, 23, 'But the Pharisees were always finding fault with him, so you can imagine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 410, 7, 23, 'what religion does to people. It can make a person so cockeyed and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 410, 8, 23, 'crooked in his thinking that he can find fault with a man whom even God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 410, 9, 23, 'is happy with. It''s easy to find fault if we want to, which basically');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 410, 10, 23, 'indicates that within all of us there is an unmerciful attitude. When we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 410, 11, 23, 'find ourselves picking out faults in others easily, that is a pretty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 410, 12, 23, 'good indication of the fact that we are unmerciful. Wicked people are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 410, 13, 23, 'always hungry for evil and eager to find fault. They have mercy on no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 410, 14, 23, 'one.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 410, 15, 23, 'The wise man learns by listening; the simpleton can learn only by seeing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 410, 16, 23, 'scorners punished.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 410, 17, 23, 'Prov 21:11, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 410, 18, 23, 'This verse says there are two ways to learn: one is by hearing what God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 410, 19, 23, 'has to say about a subject and the other is by seeing scorners punished.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 410, 20, 23, 'This is why the word of God says that there is a place for public rebuke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 410, 21, 23, 'in the church. We read in 1 Timothy 5:20 that if anyone continues to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 410, 22, 23, 'sin, he should be rebuked publicly so that others also may fear. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 410, 23, 23, 'should be rebuked in the presence of everyone, it says, so that others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 410, 24, 23, 'also may be fearful of sinning. There is a place for private counsel,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 410, 25, 23, 'but if private counsel is not received by a person and he continues in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 410, 26, 23, 'sin or rebellion, then there is a need for public rebuke so that others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 410, 27, 23, 'will fear to sin in the church. This verse is referring to that. Some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 410, 28, 23, 'people learn only when they see others punished.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 411, 1, 23, 'God, the righteous one, knows what goes on in the homes of the wicked,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 411, 2, 23, 'and he will bring the wicked down to ruin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 411, 3, 23, 'Prov 21:12, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 411, 4, 23, 'The righteous one referred to here is obviously God himself, because he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 411, 5, 23, 'is the only one who understands what goes on inside the house of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 411, 6, 23, 'wicked person. This teaches us that God knows what goes on in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 411, 7, 23, 'everybody''s home. That''s what it says here, and this shows that he''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 411, 8, 23, 'interested in what goes on in our homes. God is not deceived by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 411, 9, 23, 'impression that people give to others. He knows what goes on in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 411, 10, 23, 'different people''s homes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 411, 11, 23, 'He who shuts his ear to the cry of the poor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 411, 12, 23, 'Will also cry himself and not be answered.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 411, 13, 23, 'Prov 21:13');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 411, 14, 23, 'We read about this in many portions of scripture: Blessed are the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 411, 15, 23, 'merciful for they shall find mercy (Matthew 5:7); he who has not shown');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 411, 16, 23, 'mercy will not find mercy from God (James 2:13); the measure in which we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 411, 17, 23, 'treat others is the same measure with which God treats us (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 411, 18, 23, '7:1-2). This is one of those verses that tells us that God treats us in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 411, 19, 23, 'the same way we treat other people in need who come across our path.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 411, 20, 23, 'This is something we have to bear in mind. When we find that God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 411, 21, 23, 'treating us in a particular way, it''s good for us to examine ourselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 411, 22, 23, 'and see whether we''ve treated some other human being in that same way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 411, 23, 23, 'Perhaps we''re just reaping in the same measure. God''s using the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 411, 24, 23, 'measure we used on others to measure it out to us. These are verses that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 411, 25, 23, 'should put a fear in our hearts and in our relationships with other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 411, 26, 23, 'human beings in general - not just with believers, but with human beings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 411, 27, 23, 'in general.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 411, 28, 23, 'If someone is angry with you, a gift given secretly will calm him down.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 412, 1, 23, 'Prov 21:14, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 412, 2, 23, 'This is really a very practical exhortation. This can happen even in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 412, 3, 23, 'relationship with different people. You may find that someone has sort');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 412, 4, 23, 'of cooled off toward you for some reason or the other. Obviously when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 412, 5, 23, 'somebody cools off toward you, he''s carnal or soulish; he''s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 412, 6, 23, 'spiritual. No spiritual person cools off toward any other brother.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 412, 7, 23, 'That''s clear. But carnal people, spiritual babies who don''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 412, 8, 23, 'victory, can sometimes cool off in their relationship toward us. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 412, 9, 23, 'can happen even in the church, because there are spiritual babies in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 412, 10, 23, 'church. There are also carnal people in the church, and they can tend to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 412, 11, 23, 'cool off toward others in various ways.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 412, 12, 23, 'Then it mentions a practical way, if you''re interested, to overcome evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 412, 13, 23, 'with good, and that is to give a gift. It refers to a gift given');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 412, 14, 23, 'secretly, which means not publicly. Of course, the person knows that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 412, 15, 23, 'gave it, but you don''t embarrass him by giving it publicly. In fact, all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 412, 16, 23, 'gifts should be given secretly. A gift given in secret can calm someone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 412, 17, 23, 'down and change his attitude. All people love gifts, particularly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 412, 18, 23, 'worldly people, carnal Christians, and spiritual babies. When such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 412, 19, 23, 'people receive a gift, they tend to change their attitude. This is one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 412, 20, 23, 'of those instances of using the mammon of unrighteousness to make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 412, 21, 23, 'friends for ourselves, so that we can have friends in those eternal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 412, 22, 23, 'habitations (Luke 16:9).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 412, 23, 23, 'The exercise of justice is joy for the righteous,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 412, 24, 23, 'But is terror to the workers of iniquity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 412, 25, 23, 'Prov 21:15');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 412, 26, 23, 'A righteous person is always happy when justice is done, because he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 412, 27, 23, 'loves righteousness and justice. This verse is really just referring to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 412, 28, 23, 'that. But the execution of justice is a terror to the workers of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 413, 1, 23, 'iniquity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 413, 2, 23, 'A man who wanders from the way of understanding');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 413, 3, 23, 'Will rest in the assembly of the dead.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 413, 4, 23, 'Prov 21:16');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 413, 5, 23, 'There is an assembly called the assembly of the dead. That''s obviously');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 413, 6, 23, 'Babylon - spiritual Babylon. When a person wanders away from the way of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 413, 7, 23, 'understanding, he''ll end up in spiritual Babylon. The way of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 413, 8, 23, 'understanding is called by many names in the word of God. It''s called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 413, 9, 23, 'the way of wisdom (Proverbs 4:11), the path of the righteous (Proverbs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 413, 10, 23, '4:18), the way of holiness (Isaiah 35:8), the New and Living Way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 413, 11, 23, '(Hebrews 10:20), and the way of righteousness (2 Peter 2:21). It has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 413, 12, 23, 'many titles, but they all refer to the same way. And a man who wanders');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 413, 13, 23, 'from this way, who does not take heed to the voice of the Spirit that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 413, 14, 23, 'tells him when he drifts to the left or right, will end up in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 413, 15, 23, 'assembly of the dead.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 413, 16, 23, 'He who loves pleasure will become a poor man;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 413, 17, 23, 'He who loves wine and oil will not become rich.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 413, 18, 23, 'Prov 21:17');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 413, 19, 23, 'This refers to becoming a slave to material things, to food, drink and a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 413, 20, 23, 'comfortable, easy life that involves no self denial. We can apply this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 413, 21, 23, 'spiritually by saying that self denial is the way to spiritual wealth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 413, 22, 23, 'One who denies himself is the one who really becomes spiritually rich.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 413, 23, 23, 'It also teaches us that these things which God has created are things to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 413, 24, 23, 'be used but not to be our masters. There are many pleasures that we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 413, 25, 23, 'enjoy. Here, however, it speaks about those who love pleasure, not those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 413, 26, 23, 'who merely enjoy it. God gives us pleasure in many, many things in life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 413, 27, 23, 'He has given us richly all things to enjoy, but we have to ask ourselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 413, 28, 23, 'if we love it. It says in the last days that men will be lovers of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 414, 1, 23, 'pleasure rather than lovers of God (2 Timothy 3:4). Here it speaks about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 414, 2, 23, 'loving good food. It''s not a question of eating good food, but of loving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 414, 3, 23, 'good food. Loving good food means a person has been mastered by it. Paul');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 414, 4, 23, 'said, "All things are lawful, but I will not be mastered by anything" (1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 414, 5, 23, 'Corinthians 6:12). That''s what it''s referring to here. We must not allow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 414, 6, 23, 'any of these things on the earth to master us if we want to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 414, 7, 23, 'spiritually rich.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 414, 8, 23, 'The wicked is a ransom for the righteous,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 414, 9, 23, 'And the treacherous is in the place of the upright.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 414, 10, 23, 'Prov 21:18, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 414, 11, 23, 'This is similar to what we considered in an earlier study: what the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 414, 12, 23, 'wicked does boomerangs back on him (Proverbs 21:7, The Living Bible).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 414, 13, 23, 'It''s like the Old Testament story of Haman. He prepared a gallows to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 414, 14, 23, 'hang Mordecai on, and God turned the tables in such a way that finally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 414, 15, 23, 'Haman hung on it. We can apply this to ourselves in that when we seek to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 414, 16, 23, 'do something which is not good to another person, we may find later on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 414, 17, 23, 'in life (sometimes years later) that that very thing comes back upon us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 414, 18, 23, 'For example, here''s a young person who in his zeal and lack of wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 414, 19, 23, 'criticizes an older brother or even a servant of God for something he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 414, 20, 23, 'sees and doesn''t agree with. Maybe he criticizes him for being lukewarm');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 414, 21, 23, 'or carnal or something like that, and God makes a record of it. Then,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 414, 22, 23, 'maybe five years later, that young person will find himself in exactly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 414, 23, 23, 'the same situation. If he has ears to hear, he will hear the Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 414, 24, 23, 'saying, "You are reaping what you have sown." We bring on ourselves the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 414, 25, 23, 'suffering that we try to cause good people, and criticism of others is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 414, 26, 23, 'included. That''s why it''s always safest to not be a busybody in other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 414, 27, 23, 'people''s matters and to leave them to themselves. Let God take care of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 414, 28, 23, 'them. Why do you want to criticize or find fault with someone for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 415, 1, 23, 'something? One day it''ll come back on you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 415, 2, 23, 'Another example is that a young person can criticize the way someone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 415, 3, 23, 'else brings up his children. Then ten years later, when that young');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 415, 4, 23, 'person himself is married and has children, he may find that his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 415, 5, 23, 'children are much worse than the children he criticized from that other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 415, 6, 23, 'family. He''s just reaping what he sowed in his younger years. It''s very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 415, 7, 23, 'important that we don''t sow such stupid things in our younger years and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 415, 8, 23, 'reap a harvest of sorrow and misfortune ten years later. These are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 415, 9, 23, 'unavoidable laws of God. This applies to the suffering we cause to good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 415, 10, 23, 'people in ANY way. Maybe you hurt someone by the words you speak and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 415, 11, 23, 'that person''s a good person - God can''t overlook it. One day the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 415, 12, 23, 'boomerang will take its course and come back on you. It''s really true.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 415, 13, 23, 'That''s why we need to radically repent of these things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 415, 14, 23, 'I''ve come to see more and more that the proof that I''ve repented of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 415, 15, 23, 'something is that I don''t do it again. If I do it again, that proves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 415, 16, 23, 'that I didn''t really repent. I just said words to God. Very often we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 415, 17, 23, 'find that we hear a message on something like this and we say, "Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 415, 18, 23, 'I''m sorry for all that I''ve done in the past." Then the next year I go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 415, 19, 23, 'and do the same thing all over again, which shows that I didn''t really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 415, 20, 23, 'repent. I just felt sorry that this boomerang may hit me five years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 415, 21, 23, 'later, but I wasn''t really convicted of the guilt of causing suffering');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 415, 22, 23, 'to some good person by something I said or did. We have to be very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 415, 23, 23, 'careful that we don''t cause any suffering to others by the words we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 415, 24, 23, 'speak. It''ll boomerang on us one day or the other.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 415, 25, 23, 'Better to live out in the desert than with a nagging, complaining wife.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 415, 26, 23, 'Prov 21:19, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 415, 27, 23, 'This is a further step from verse 9. We left off verse 9 with this man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 415, 28, 23, 'running off to the roof, but now we find that his wife has followed him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 416, 1, 23, 'to the roof as well. Here he''s left the house altogether and has gone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 416, 2, 23, 'off to the desert. It''s a sad thing that the poor man didn''t get peace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 416, 3, 23, 'on the roof either and had to even leave from there. This is really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 416, 4, 23, 'something which sisters should take seriously. It''s not that we''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 416, 5, 23, 'against women or that Solomon was against women or Paul was against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 416, 6, 23, 'women. A lot of people have those ideas. The Holy Spirit speaks about a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 416, 7, 23, 'nagging wife, and it''s interesting that he never speaks about a nagging');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 416, 8, 23, 'husband. There may be a few exceptions, but generally speaking, it''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 416, 9, 23, 'nagging wife who is referred to. Another verse we considered described');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 416, 10, 23, 'her as a dripping faucet. There is the possibility of making life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 416, 11, 23, 'difficult for your husband at home. He seeks for peace somewhere in some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 416, 12, 23, 'corner of the house or in the desert. Today it may not be in the desert');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 416, 13, 23, 'since there are no deserts nearby, but he may go off to some other place');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 416, 14, 23, 'and dread coming back home. It must never be like that, dear sisters.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 416, 15, 23, 'When you''re married, you have the responsibility to make your home such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 416, 16, 23, 'a place that your husband and children long to return to. It should be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 416, 17, 23, 'the most wonderful place they can ever imagine being. Think of building');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 416, 18, 23, 'a house like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 416, 19, 23, 'This verse speaks of words spoken of a nagging, complaining wife.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 416, 20, 23, 'Nagging means to constantly be after your husband for some little thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 416, 21, 23, '- not a big major thing. Usually it''s some issue here, some issue there,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 416, 22, 23, 'complaining about this, complaining about that. It''s a peculiar');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 416, 23, 23, 'temptation that comes to sisters/married women. Therefore you need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 416, 24, 23, 'ask God for grace to overcome it. Say, "Lord, make me a wise woman who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 416, 25, 23, 'can build my house so that it is a place of peace." Jesus told his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 416, 26, 23, 'disciples, "When you enter a house, first of all say, ''Peace be to this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 416, 27, 23, 'house.''" That is the fruit of wisdom, and that''s a tremendous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 416, 28, 23, 'responsibility for sisters. The book of Proverbs has much to say about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 417, 1, 23, 'women. In fact, the book of Proverbs closes with nearly a whole chapter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 417, 2, 23, 'on the virtuous woman (chapter 31), which sisters should take very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 417, 3, 23, 'seriously. Sisters should never turn their home into a place where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 417, 4, 23, 'people don''t feel happy, not even one day of their life. Take that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 417, 5, 23, 'seriously.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 417, 6, 23, 'The wise man saves for the future, but the foolish man spends whatever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 417, 7, 23, 'he gets.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 417, 8, 23, 'Prov 21:20, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 417, 9, 23, 'We can apply this in two ways: first in relation to earthly things. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 417, 10, 23, 'wise man thinks, "Well, I''m not God who knows the future." It says in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 417, 11, 23, 'James 4:14 that we don''t even know what''s going to happen tomorrow.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 417, 12, 23, 'James says, "You can''t even say, ''Tomorrow I will go to that city, and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 417, 13, 23, 'will do business and come back.''" He says you must say, ''If the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 417, 14, 23, 'wills,'' for we do not know what one day can bring forth, even believers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 417, 15, 23, 'Therefore a wise man thinks, "I may have some need tomorrow. Either I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 417, 16, 23, 'must have faith that God will provide my need, or if my faith is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 417, 17, 23, 'that great, we have to humble ourselves and say, "Lord, I don''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 417, 18, 23, 'that measure of faith. Maybe I need to save a little money so that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 417, 19, 23, 'during my time of need next month, I don''t have to rush to the brothers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 417, 20, 23, 'and sisters for help or go to some money-lender to borrow or expect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 417, 21, 23, 'somebody to come to me with a gift." All of these things are unworthy of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 417, 22, 23, 'a Christian. God has allotted to each person a different measure of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 417, 23, 23, 'faith, and he may not have allotted to you and me the measure of faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 417, 24, 23, 'that he allotted to George Muller or Hudson Taylor. Therefore, we should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 417, 25, 23, 'humble ourselves and save for the future. It can be a foolish thing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 417, 26, 23, 'spend everything I get and not have any forethought about the future.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 417, 27, 23, 'Then I will have to depend on gifts and become sort of a dignified');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 417, 28, 23, 'beggar, because I''ve been foolish. We should learn to manage our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 418, 1, 23, 'expenses within our income.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 418, 2, 23, 'I am also foolish when I compare myself with other people. It says that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 418, 3, 23, 'in 2 Corinthians 10:12 that those who compare themselves with others are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 418, 4, 23, 'foolish. We can say, "I want to live like that person," but I can''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 418, 5, 23, 'manage that level of expenditure with my level of income, and the end');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 418, 6, 23, 'result is I fall into debt. The wise man saves for the future. We can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 418, 7, 23, 'say that wisdom is to be frugal (e.g., not wasting anything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 418, 8, 23, 'unnecessarily). That is wisdom. Then we can have something in our time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 418, 9, 23, 'of need.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 418, 10, 23, 'We can also apply this verse spiritually: like the wise virgins who had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 418, 11, 23, 'reserves of oil that kept them ready to meet the bridegroom when he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 418, 12, 23, 'came. Of course, we can understand the meaning of that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 418, 13, 23, 'He who pursues righteousness and loyalty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 418, 14, 23, 'Finds life, righteousness and honor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 418, 15, 23, 'Prov 21:21');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 418, 16, 23, 'This is very similar to what Jesus said in Matthew 6:33, "Seek the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 418, 17, 23, 'kingdom of God first and his righteousness and all these other things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 418, 18, 23, 'will be added to you." And what he said in Matthew 5:6, "All those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 418, 19, 23, 'thirst after righteousness will be satisfied." In other words, it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 418, 20, 23, 'those who pursue after righteousness that get it. If you don''t pursue');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 418, 21, 23, 'after it, it''s not going to come to anyone who sits back in an easy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 418, 22, 23, 'chair expecting God to give it to him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 418, 23, 23, 'A wise man scales the city of the mighty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 418, 24, 23, 'And brings down the stronghold in which they trust.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 418, 25, 23, 'Prov 21:22');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 418, 26, 23, 'There is a similar verse in Ecclesiastes 9:16 where it says that wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 418, 27, 23, 'is better than strength. That has an application to many, many areas in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 418, 28, 23, 'life. Wisdom is able to overcome mighty walls that people have built. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 419, 1, 23, 'read in Proverbs 18:19 that a brother offended is harder to be won than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 419, 2, 23, 'a strong city. But a man of wisdom knows how to scale the walls of that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 419, 3, 23, 'city and win his offended brother back. But very few people have wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 419, 4, 23, 'They usually try to hammer against the walls which only ends up in that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 419, 5, 23, 'brother making the walls a little stronger. It''s not by strength that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 419, 6, 23, 'bring down the walls. It''s not necessarily by rebuke, but by goodness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 419, 7, 23, 'Here we see what a need we have for wisdom so that we will be able to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 419, 8, 23, 'scale the city of the mighty. It is by good that we overcome evil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 419, 9, 23, 'Wisdom is better than strength. If you have a wife who''s offended,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 419, 10, 23, 'what''s the solution to that? She''s decided she''s not going to talk to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 419, 11, 23, 'you. Well, you can tackle strength with strength and say, "Alright, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 419, 12, 23, 'won''t talk to you either. Fine. We''ll see how long this lasts." What is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 419, 13, 23, 'that? That is only folly. The woman''s a fool, and the man''s a greater');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 419, 14, 23, 'fool. No. What he needs is wisdom to scale this wall that his wife has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 419, 15, 23, 'built between him and her. "How can I scale this with wisdom? Strength');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 419, 16, 23, 'won''t do it. Wisdom is better than strength." Or it can be the other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 419, 17, 23, 'way. Think of a wise woman who can scale the wall that her husband');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 419, 18, 23, 'builds. This has many applications. A wise man can scale the city of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 419, 19, 23, 'mighty, bring down the stronghold, and build a relationship! Wonderful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 419, 20, 23, 'Keep your mouth closed and you''ll stay out of trouble.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 419, 21, 23, 'Prov 21:23, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 419, 22, 23, 'This is really true. A lot of people get into trouble just because they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 419, 23, 23, 'open their mouths. Keep your mouth shut and you''ll stay out of a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 419, 24, 23, 'trouble. I think all of us can look back at our past life, and recount');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 419, 25, 23, 'an experience in this area. Think of the different situations where if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 419, 26, 23, 'you had just kept your mouth shut, some problem would never have arisen.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 419, 27, 23, 'But because you went ahead and opened your mouth, it caused more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 419, 28, 23, 'trouble. Particularly when we are young, we need to see that even a fool');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 420, 1, 23, 'can be wise if he just keeps his mouth shut. What a lot of problems we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 420, 2, 23, 'cause just because we cannot keep our mouths shut. We lose our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 420, 3, 23, 'testimonies, we mess up things, we spoil things, we make a mess of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 420, 4, 23, 'things - all because we don''t keep our mouths shut. Keep your mouth shut');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 420, 5, 23, 'and you can stay out of a lot of trouble.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 420, 6, 23, 'Now the thing is, we can hear this but we have to be gripped by it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 420, 7, 23, 'Otherwise, we''ll still go ahead and do the same old thing. God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 420, 8, 23, 'intention is that we at least learn from our past follies so that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 420, 9, 23, 'know in the future, particularly when we are in unrest about something,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 420, 10, 23, 'to keep our mouths shut. My dear brothers and sisters, we don''t make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 420, 11, 23, 'laws in the church, but I''ll give you one simple principle to live by:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 420, 12, 23, 'when you are in unrest, KEEP YOUR MOUTH SHUT. This applies to old and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 420, 13, 23, 'young. Until you have come to rest, even if it takes one week, keep your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 420, 14, 23, 'mouth shut - particularly when you are in the presence of the person who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 420, 15, 23, 'is causing that unrest in you. Very important. It''s a simple principle,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 420, 16, 23, 'but we haven''t followed it in the past and have gotten into a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 420, 17, 23, 'trouble and ruined our lives. At least we can start doing this in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 420, 18, 23, 'future.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 420, 19, 23, 'Show me a conceited person and I will show you someone who is arrogant,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 420, 20, 23, 'proud, and inconsiderate.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 420, 21, 23, 'Prov 21:24, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 420, 22, 23, 'A conceited person is a person who thinks too much about himself, who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 420, 23, 23, 'has higher thoughts about his own spirituality and his own work than he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 420, 24, 23, 'should (which is the case with most people). This conceit is what makes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 420, 25, 23, 'him inconsiderate about the feelings and needs of other people. One of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 420, 26, 23, 'the most important principles for good relationships in the church and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 420, 27, 23, 'for wisdom in how to live with one another and get along with one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 420, 28, 23, 'another is being considerate. Consider the feelings of that person when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 421, 1, 23, 'you speak a certain way. Why is it that we find it so difficult to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 421, 2, 23, 'considerate? It''s because of conceit. That''s what this verse says. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 421, 3, 23, 'conceit that makes us inconsiderate towards the feelings of other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 421, 4, 23, 'people. There''s a certain pride in us and that''s why we don''t have light');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 421, 5, 23, 'on being considerate toward others. For example, when a few people are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 421, 6, 23, 'sitting together and one person dominates the conversation, usually that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 421, 7, 23, 'is the most conceited person in that group, because he has no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 421, 8, 23, 'consideration for others. That''s a folly that all young people should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 421, 9, 23, 'get rid of. It''s one thing if it''s someone who has wisdom to share, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 421, 10, 23, 'very often it''s just a tremendous lack of consideration. That''s just one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 421, 11, 23, 'small area, but there can be many other areas where we can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 421, 12, 23, 'inconsiderate toward the conveniences of other people. We think only in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 421, 13, 23, 'terms of our own convenience and that is purely a result of conceit. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 421, 14, 23, 'think I''m so important that other peoples'' convenience must be secondary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 421, 15, 23, 'to mine. This is conceit. It''s good to have small thoughts about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 421, 16, 23, 'ourselves where we think more about other people''s conveniences than my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 421, 17, 23, 'own. That is humility.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 421, 18, 23, 'Lazy people who refuse to work are only killing themselves; all they do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 421, 19, 23, 'is think about what they would like to have. The righteous, however, can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 421, 20, 23, 'give, and give generously.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 421, 21, 23, 'Prov 21:25-26, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 421, 22, 23, 'It is the will of God that all of us become righteous, though we may not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 421, 23, 23, 'begin righteous. In the beginning, we do not know how to give. We are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 421, 24, 23, 'dependent on other people giving to us, but we should never think that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 421, 25, 23, 'we should live in that condition all our life. We are to move out of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 421, 26, 23, 'that. Think, for example, of Ephesians 4:28 which speaks about a thief');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 421, 27, 23, 'who''s converted. Usually thieves are poor people who steal because of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 421, 28, 23, 'their poverty. There are some rich thieves but most thieves are poor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 422, 1, 23, 'When a thief gets converted and comes into the church, what should he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 422, 2, 23, 'do? It says in Ephesians 4:28, "Let the thief no longer steal, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 422, 3, 23, 'rather let him labor, doing honest work with his own hands, so that he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 422, 4, 23, 'may have something to share with anyone in need." In other words, even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 422, 5, 23, 'if a person started off coming to church as a thief, his aim should be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 422, 6, 23, 'not only to give up stealing, but to go beyond taking care of his own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 422, 7, 23, 'financial need to be able to give to someone else who has less than him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 422, 8, 23, 'This should always be our goal: to give generously. And if we say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 422, 9, 23, '"Lord, this is what scripture says. I want to make this my goal in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 422, 10, 23, 'life," then we will find that we experience the blessing which Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 422, 11, 23, 'mentioned in Acts 20:35, "It''s more blessed to give than to receive." It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 422, 12, 23, 'also speaks in this verse about the diligence necessary to achieve this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 422, 13, 23, 'goal.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 422, 14, 23, 'The sacrifice of the wicked is an abomination,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 422, 15, 23, 'How much more when he brings it with evil intent!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 422, 16, 23, 'Prov 21:27');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 422, 17, 23, 'In other words, the Lord hates it when wicked men offer him sacrifices,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 422, 18, 23, 'particularly if they are doing it with evil motives. It''s a hypocritical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 422, 19, 23, 'sacrifice when we sacrifice with a wrong motive, even if it costs us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 422, 20, 23, 'something. I can do something, for example, in the church which is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 422, 21, 23, 'sacrifice, and yet I can do the whole thing with a selfish motive for my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 422, 22, 23, 'own gain. The Lord hates it. It looks like a sacrifice that I have made.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 422, 23, 23, 'The other brothers and sisters see what I''m doing and they really think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 422, 24, 23, 'I''ve sacrificed. But the Lord who sees the inner motive and all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 422, 25, 23, 'hidden things, sees that there''s some corrupt motive even in that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 422, 26, 23, 'sacrifice that has gained the esteem of so many other brothers and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 422, 27, 23, 'sisters. The Lord hates it when people offer him sacrifices with wrong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 422, 28, 23, 'motives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 423, 1, 23, 'The testimony of a liar is not believed, but the word of someone who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 423, 2, 23, 'thinks matters through is accepted.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 423, 3, 23, 'Prov 21:28, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 423, 4, 23, 'We must not get a testimony that we are not truthful. I just want to say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 423, 5, 23, 'it''s very easy to get that testimony if we don''t hate lying in every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 423, 6, 23, 'form in our lives. The word of God says in Colossians 3:9, "Don''t tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 423, 7, 23, 'lies to one another." In other words, it''s possible to tell a lie to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 423, 8, 23, 'brother in the church by giving him the impression that I''m spiritual.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 423, 9, 23, 'Let''s say in some particular situation I say something which is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 423, 10, 23, 'one-hundred percent true. I''ve given that person a wrong impression,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 423, 11, 23, 'because I want him to think I''m spiritual. If I tell him the real truth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 423, 12, 23, 'it will put me in a bad light. It''s so easy to tell a lie which shows');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 423, 13, 23, 'that I don''t love the truth. It''s far better that I become small in that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 423, 14, 23, 'brother''s eyes and love the truth rather than remaining big in his eyes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 423, 15, 23, 'and God seeing me as a liar. That happens a lot, and if we really are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 423, 16, 23, 'honest, we will see a fantastic amount of lying even in our conduct with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 423, 17, 23, 'one another. If you haven''t seen that yet, brother and sister, I''d just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 423, 18, 23, 'say you''re not judging yourself sufficiently. Maybe that''s why you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 423, 19, 23, 'haven''t seen it. But when we judge ourselves, we discover what a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 423, 20, 23, 'fantastic amount of lying there can be in our conduct and in the words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 423, 21, 23, 'which we say to one another in the church. We need a radical cleansing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 423, 22, 23, 'from all lying because it says here the testimony of a liar is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 423, 23, 23, 'believed. Whatever testimony I give cannot have power if I have not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 423, 24, 23, 'cleansed myself from lying. "But the word of someone who thinks matters');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 423, 25, 23, 'through is accepted." The man who loves the truth, his word will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 423, 26, 23, 'accepted.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 423, 27, 23, 'A wicked man displays a bold face,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 423, 28, 23, 'But as for the upright, he makes his way sure.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 424, 1, 23, 'Prov 21:29');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 424, 2, 23, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 424, 3, 23, 'An evil man is stubborn, but a godly man will reconsider.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 424, 4, 23, 'Prov 21:29, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 424, 5, 23, 'This is a good verse to think of: to be stubborn about some decision we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 424, 6, 23, 'have taken or some thing we have done and to say, "That is right", can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 424, 7, 23, 'sometimes be the mark of an evil man. But a godly man is one who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 424, 8, 23, 'humble enough to say, "I''m not God. I may have been mistaken." Paul says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 424, 9, 23, 'in 1 Corinthians 13:12, "I don''t know myself fully. I don''t know myself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 424, 10, 23, 'perfectly." We should be willing to say, "Okay brother, I''ll think about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 424, 11, 23, 'what you say. Maybe I shouldn''t have said that. Maybe I shouldn''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 424, 12, 23, 'done that." This must always be the attitude. A godly man is willing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 424, 13, 23, 'reconsider. It says, "He makes his way sure." This means he tries to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 424, 14, 23, 'find out which is the perfect way. Every man who is not perfect must be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 424, 15, 23, 'willing to reconsider his way. None of us are perfect. To press on to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 424, 16, 23, 'perfection means to find that perfect middle path and to say, "I may be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 424, 17, 23, 'drifting - maybe only half a degree, but a little off from the center');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 424, 18, 23, 'regardless. I just want to consider that I could be wrong." Maybe you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 424, 19, 23, 'got a hard letter from someone who hates you. Take it before the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 424, 20, 23, 'because sometimes our enemies tell more truth about us than our friends');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 424, 21, 23, '- even the friends who speak straight to us. It''s good to think, "Is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 424, 22, 23, 'there some truth in that? Let me think about it before God."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 424, 23, 23, 'Human wisdom, brilliance, insight-they are of no help if the Lord is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 424, 24, 23, 'against you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 424, 25, 23, 'Prov 21:30, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 424, 26, 23, 'Think of that. All our human wisdom, all our brilliance, and all our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 424, 27, 23, 'insight - all of it is of absolutely no use if the Lord is against us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 424, 28, 23, 'We know that the word of God says God is against the proud (1 Peter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 425, 1, 23, '5:5). If I am proud, then all my brilliance and cleverness and wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 425, 2, 23, 'and everything, even spiritual wisdom and brilliance, is of no use since');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 425, 3, 23, 'God is against me. It''s far better to have God on my side than all this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 425, 4, 23, 'human cleverness and everything else.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 425, 5, 23, 'The horse is prepared for the day of battle,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 425, 6, 23, 'But victory belongs to the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 425, 7, 23, 'Prov 21:31');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 425, 8, 23, 'It says here you can get the horses ready for battle, but it''s the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 425, 9, 23, 'alone who can give you the victory. In 2 Chronicles 14:9-11, there''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 425, 10, 23, 'very beautiful story that can be an encouragement to us. There was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 425, 11, 23, 'king in the Old Testament called Asa. He was a man who started off very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 425, 12, 23, 'well but did not end very well. When he started off, he trusted in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 425, 13, 23, 'Lord. We read in 2 Chronicles 14:9 that the Ethiopian army came out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 425, 14, 23, 'against Asa with an army of one million men and three-hundred chariots.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 425, 15, 23, 'Think of that. Asa went out to meet him and in verse 11 it says, "Asa');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 425, 16, 23, 'called to the Lord his God and said, ''Lord, there is no one beside Thee');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 425, 17, 23, 'to help in the battle. So help us, O Lord, for we trust in Thee.''" Then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 425, 18, 23, 'in verse 12 the Lord defeated these one million Ethiopians and they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 425, 19, 23, 'fled. These things are written for our encouragement. Even if one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 425, 20, 23, 'million people come against us, if we humble ourselves and say, "Lord, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 425, 21, 23, 'don''t trust in my horses. I don''t trust in my chariots. I don''t trust in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 425, 22, 23, 'my influence or my power or my ability. I trust only in you. I ask you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 425, 23, 23, 'Lord, to help me." The God who helped Asa will help us too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 425, 24, 23, 'But then a little later in chapter 16, we read that when the king of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 425, 25, 23, 'Israel, who had much less than one million people, came against Asa, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 425, 26, 23, 'did not seek the Lord for help. It says he went and asked for help from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 425, 27, 23, 'the king of Syria. Then a prophet came to Asa in verse 7 and said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 425, 28, 23, '"Because you relied on the king of Syria and did not rely on the Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 426, 1, 23, 'therefore you will not be able to overcome this army. Were not the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 426, 2, 23, 'Ethiopians an immense army and yet because you relied on the Lord, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 426, 3, 23, 'delivered them into your hand." Then in this context comes the verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 426, 4, 23, 'that we''re all familiar with: "Because the eyes of the Lord run to and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 426, 5, 23, 'fro throughout the whole earth to strongly support those whose heart is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 426, 6, 23, 'completely his." When you read the context, you understand what it means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 426, 7, 23, 'to have our heart be completely his. It means those whose hearts are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 426, 8, 23, 'completely relying on his help alone and who are not depending on human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 426, 9, 23, 'help. Since Asa relied on the King of Syria, the prophet says, "But here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 426, 10, 23, 'you have acted foolishly, so from now on you''ll have wars." Then Asa did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 426, 11, 23, 'something even more stupid. It says he became angry with the prophet and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 426, 12, 23, 'put him in prison. Getting angry with the person who tells you the truth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 426, 13, 23, 'doesn''t solve the problem, but that''s how many people act even today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 426, 14, 23, 'Many preachers today have the same fate as that prophet. They go up to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 426, 15, 23, 'someone and tell him the truth, and the man gets angry instead of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 426, 16, 23, 'judging himself. But there is a lesson in this passage. It''s possible to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 426, 17, 23, 'start out like Asa, trusting in the Lord in difficult situations, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 426, 18, 23, 'then after some time, move on to the place where we lean upon the arm of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 426, 19, 23, 'flesh. There is a curse on those who lean upon the arm of flesh');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 426, 20, 23, '(Jeremiah 17:5).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 426, 21, 24, 'Chapter 22 Chapter 22');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 426, 22, 24, 'If you must choose, take a good name rather than great riches; for to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 426, 23, 24, 'held in loving esteem is better than silver and gold.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 426, 24, 24, 'Prov 22:1, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 426, 25, 24, 'It''s far better to have a good testimony in your locality than to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 426, 26, 24, 'known as a rich man. It''s far better to have a testimony in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 426, 27, 24, 'locality that you are righteous, upright, humble, good, loving, kind,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 426, 28, 24, 'and pure, rather than to have a testimony that you are wealthy and have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 427, 1, 24, 'many possessions. That''s basically what that verse means.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 427, 2, 24, 'The rich and the poor have a common bond,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 427, 3, 24, 'The Lord is the Maker of them all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 427, 4, 24, 'Prov 22:2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 427, 5, 24, 'This verse basically teaches us that all human beings are equal in God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 427, 6, 24, 'eyes. If in my thinking, I despise any human being - either because of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 427, 7, 24, 'his community or his background or his education or his intelligence or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 427, 8, 24, 'his culture or his barbarism or anything else like that, that shows that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 427, 9, 24, 'I have not understood the first thing about God. God is the one who has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 427, 10, 24, 'made all people. If I haven''t understood that, there''s not much hope');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 427, 11, 24, 'that I''ll understand anything else about God. That''s one of the first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 427, 12, 24, 'things I need to understand: that God has made all people and he''s made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 427, 13, 24, 'them all equal. There are differences of wealth, intelligence, color and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 427, 14, 24, 'culture, but in God''s eyes they''re all the same. We need to look at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 427, 15, 24, 'every single human being - particularly poor people and those who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 427, 16, 24, 'far beneath us in social level - as equal in God''s eyes. I''m not talking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 427, 17, 24, 'about our neighbors. They''re usually around the same social level. I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 427, 18, 24, 'talking about people who are much lower than us in society. That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 427, 19, 24, 'something we must always keep in mind. That person may be poor and I may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 427, 20, 24, 'be rich, but in God''s eyes, we are just the same. And one day when we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 427, 21, 24, 'stand before the judgment seat, no person will be on a higher level than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 427, 22, 24, 'another person. All are going to stand on the same level ground. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 427, 23, 24, 'good to keep that in mind always.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 427, 24, 24, 'The prudent sees the evil and hides himself,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 427, 25, 24, 'But the naive go on, and are punished for it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 427, 26, 24, 'Prov 22:3');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 427, 27, 24, 'Wisdom is to think ahead and to consider: if I go this way, there could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 427, 28, 24, 'be some snare of the devil. The prudent person sees the evil ahead and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 428, 1, 24, 'avoids it, whereas the simple person just goes on simply and falls into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 428, 2, 24, 'the pit the devil has made. Jesus said that we are to be shrewd as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 428, 3, 24, 'serpents. To think ahead and to see what will happen if I continue along');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 428, 4, 24, 'this way. What will happen if we do this? That is wisdom. Forethought is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 428, 5, 24, 'wisdom. The wise man sees the evil and avoids it. That can have many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 428, 6, 24, 'applications in our practical and spiritual lives. We should ask God to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 428, 7, 24, 'help us see what will happen if we go a certain way. What will happen if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 428, 8, 24, 'I bring up my children like this? What will happen if I run my home like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 428, 9, 24, 'this? What will happen if I continue doing this in my office or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 428, 10, 24, 'involving myself in these types of conversations? What will happen if I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 428, 11, 24, 'continue this friendship with this particular person? Where is it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 428, 12, 24, 'finally going to lead to? The wise person is the one who thinks about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 428, 13, 24, 'all these things and takes precautions beforehand. But the simple person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 428, 14, 24, 'is the one who says, "The Lord will take care of it." He has spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 428, 15, 24, 'language for his foolishness and goes ahead and falls.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 428, 16, 24, 'The reward of humility and the fear of the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 428, 17, 24, 'Are riches, honor and life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 428, 18, 24, 'Prov 22:4');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 428, 19, 24, 'Humility and the fear of the Lord are the two most important qualities');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 428, 20, 24, 'for the soil in which the fruit of the Spirit is to grow. The fruit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 428, 21, 24, 'the Spirit is love, joy, peace, long-suffering, gentleness, goodness,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 428, 22, 24, 'faith, meekness, temperance. However, in the fruit of the Spirit we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 428, 23, 24, 'don''t see humility or the fear of God. Why is that? Because humility and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 428, 24, 24, 'the fear of God are the soil on which the fruit grows. Love is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 428, 25, 24, 'greatest fruit, but it only grows in the soil of humility and the fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 428, 26, 24, 'of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 428, 27, 24, 'By humility and the fear of the Lord are all spiritual riches, all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 428, 28, 24, 'spiritual honor, and all spiritual life. We have to cultivate these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 429, 1, 24, 'qualities. This is to dig up the fallow ground (Hosea 10:12): humbling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 429, 2, 24, 'ourselves and fearing God. Then the fruit of the Spirit can grow forth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 429, 3, 24, 'in our life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 429, 4, 24, 'Thorns and snares are in the way of the perverse;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 429, 5, 24, 'He who guards himself will be far from them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 429, 6, 24, 'Prov 22:5');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 429, 7, 24, 'This verse speaks about something else that can grow up if we don''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 429, 8, 24, 'the soil of humility and the fear of God. Jesus spoke in the parable of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 429, 9, 24, 'the sower about the man in whose ground the seed brought forth fruit,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 429, 10, 24, 'but then afterwards thorns grew up. Thorns can''t grow up in a soil that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 429, 11, 24, 'has humility and the fear of God. No. It''s because of a lack of humility');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 429, 12, 24, 'and a lack of the fear of God that these thorns grow up - the lusts for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 429, 13, 24, 'so many things, the deceitfulness of riches, the cares of this world -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 429, 14, 24, 'and crush and crowd out the fruit that God is seeking to grow in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 429, 15, 24, 'lives. "Thorns and snares are in the way of the perverse, but he who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 429, 16, 24, 'guards himself will be far from them." That means a person has to guard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 429, 17, 24, 'himself in order to stay far away from these thorns. He has to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 429, 18, 24, 'proactively pull out the weeds.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 429, 19, 24, 'Train up a child in the way he should go,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 429, 20, 24, 'Even when he is old he will not depart from it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 429, 21, 24, 'Prov 22:6');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 429, 22, 24, 'This verse doesn''t tell us how many years a person is a child, but it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 429, 23, 24, 'doesn''t say train up a young man. It says train up a child. I would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 429, 24, 24, 'think it''s probably referring to the first twelve years of a person''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 429, 25, 24, 'life. The first twelve years of a person''s life, he is a child. After');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 429, 26, 24, 'that, he or she grows up to be a young man or a young woman. God gives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 429, 27, 24, 'those first twelve years to parents to discipline, teach, correct,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 429, 28, 24, 'rebuke, punish, encourage, strengthen, challenge, and to train that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 430, 1, 24, 'child in the way he should go. And even if the child drifts away for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 430, 2, 24, 'while, what we have labored and sowed in all those years will one day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 430, 3, 24, 'bring that child back to the Lord. So those early years of a person''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 430, 4, 24, 'life are very important. A father and mother who have no time to teach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 430, 5, 24, 'their children the way of the Lord in those first twelve years, who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 430, 6, 24, 'leave it to the Sunday School or the church to teach them, will have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 430, 7, 24, 'reap the consequences in later years. And that''s a sad thing we see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 430, 8, 24, 'today so often. You see situations where parents are too busy, sometimes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 430, 9, 24, 'out at work while the child is alone at home. They''re busy making money,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 430, 10, 24, 'but money is not what their child needs in the first twelve years. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 430, 11, 24, 'can do with a little less. The child needs a mother who has time to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 430, 12, 24, 'instruct him or her in those early years. Those of you who have growing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 430, 13, 24, 'children should never think that time spent with those children in those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 430, 14, 24, 'first twelve years is a waste at all. It''s the most important investment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 430, 15, 24, 'we can ever make in all of our life as parents.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 430, 16, 24, 'The rich rules over the poor,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 430, 17, 24, 'And the borrower becomes the lender''s slave.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 430, 18, 24, 'Prov 22:7');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 430, 19, 24, 'This is basically the result of getting into debt. When we get into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 430, 20, 24, 'debt, it says we become a slave, and it''s not God''s will that any of us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 430, 21, 24, 'should become slaves. That''s why the word of God says in Romans 13:8,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 430, 22, 24, '"Owe no man anything." If we are not wholehearted to take this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 430, 23, 24, 'exhortation seriously, then we shall remain slaves. It says here that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 430, 24, 24, 'the borrower is a slave to the lender. If I''m in debt, I''m a slave and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 430, 25, 24, 'have to cry out to God and say, "Lord, all my spirituality and all my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 430, 26, 24, 'knowledge is just a lot of garbage as long as I''m a slave. Help me be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 430, 27, 24, 'free from this slavery and never to be in this slavery at any time of my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 430, 28, 24, 'life." Let no one deceive himself here. Keep out of debt.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 431, 1, 24, 'There''s a sad story we read of in 2 Kings 4 - the story of the widow who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 431, 2, 24, 'came to Elisha. Elisha told her to go and borrow vessels from all her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 431, 3, 24, 'neighbors and to pour the little oil that she had into them. Leaving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 431, 4, 24, 'aside the miracle, what was her problem? Her problem was that her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 431, 5, 24, 'husband had died and left her in debt. And he was a preacher. Think of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 431, 6, 24, 'that. He was a man who spoke the word of God and he left his wife in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 431, 7, 24, 'debt. That''s a shameful thing to do. We should never do such a thing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 431, 8, 24, 'That''s why it''s very important that we never get into debt at all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 431, 9, 24, 'The unjust tyrant will reap disaster, and his reign of terror shall end.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 431, 10, 24, 'Prov 22:8, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 431, 11, 24, 'We can see this happening in many countries around the world in Asia and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 431, 12, 24, 'Africa, where some unjust tyrant dominates the people. Then finally he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 431, 13, 24, 'is assassinated and his reign of terror ends. Now, we are not in that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 431, 14, 24, 'type of danger because we are not going to rule any countries. But we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 431, 15, 24, 'can apply this to ourselves in areas where we tend to be tyrants toward');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 431, 16, 24, 'somebody else. It says here that "the rod of his fury will perish." We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 431, 17, 24, 'can look at it like this: that the time can come if I haven''t overcome');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 431, 18, 24, 'my anger in my younger days - when I''m older and physically, mentally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 431, 19, 24, 'and emotionally weaker - that this anger just overpowers and frustrates');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 431, 20, 24, 'me. In my younger days, I could explode in anger and get people to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 431, 21, 24, 'what I wanted - like a father who''s a tyrant over his children. Then I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 431, 22, 24, 'grow old and my body becomes weak, but there is still anger inside my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 431, 23, 24, 'heart that I haven''t overcome. That can be frustrating and it can make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 431, 24, 24, 'me irritable and hinder my spiritual life. It''s good to overcome anger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 431, 25, 24, 'quickly. And it''s good not to be a tyrant over anyone - not over our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 431, 26, 24, 'children, not over servants, not over anyone. We should learn to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 431, 27, 24, 'overcome our anger.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 431, 28, 24, 'He who is generous will be blessed,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 432, 1, 24, 'For he gives some of his food to the poor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 432, 2, 24, 'Prov 22:9');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 432, 3, 24, 'This is a truth we have already considered on a number of occasions.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 432, 4, 24, 'Notice that the book of Proverbs repeats some truths over and over again');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 432, 5, 24, 'for emphasis. It''s more blessed to give than to receive. There''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 432, 6, 24, 'blessing in being generous.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 432, 7, 24, 'Drive out the scoffer, and contention will go out,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 432, 8, 24, 'Even strife and dishonor will cease.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 432, 9, 24, 'Prov 22:10');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 432, 10, 24, 'Get rid of the conceited person and then there will be no more arguments');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 432, 11, 24, 'or quarreling or strife. There must be no place for a proud person in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 432, 12, 24, 'the church of the living God. All strife comes through proud people, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 432, 13, 24, 'the preaching of the word must always be of such a nature that proud,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 432, 14, 24, 'conceited people have no place in the church. That''s how we can keep the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 432, 15, 24, 'church free from strife.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 432, 16, 24, 'He who loves purity of heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 432, 17, 24, 'And whose speech is gracious, the king is his friend.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 432, 18, 24, 'Prov 22:11');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 432, 19, 24, 'There are two things here: a pure heart and gracious speech. Jesus said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 432, 20, 24, '"Out of the abundance of the heart the mouth speaks." So when our hearts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 432, 21, 24, 'are pure, there will be graciousness in our speech. And when there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 432, 22, 24, 'purity in the heart and graciousness in our speech, then the Lord, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 432, 23, 24, 'King, will be our friend.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 432, 24, 24, 'The Lord sees to it that truth is kept safe by disproving the words of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 432, 25, 24, 'liars.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 432, 26, 24, 'Prov 22:12, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 432, 27, 24, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 432, 28, 24, 'The Lord preserves the upright but ruins the plans of the wicked.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 433, 1, 24, 'Prov 22:12, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 433, 2, 24, 'God is on the side of truth, so when I speak the truth (even when it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 433, 3, 24, 'lands me into trouble here on this earth), I can have the comfort of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 433, 4, 24, 'knowing that God is on my side. When I tell a lie, it may save me from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 433, 5, 24, 'some trouble here on this earth, but I have the discomfort of knowing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 433, 6, 24, 'that God is not on my side. God sees to it that truth is kept safe by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 433, 7, 24, 'disproving the words of liars.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 433, 8, 24, 'We can also think of the scriptures - the truth of God that He has kept');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 433, 9, 24, 'safe for us through all these centuries. God has kept the scriptures');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 433, 10, 24, 'safe even when so many liars and treacherous people have tried to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 433, 11, 24, 'destroy it and take it away from God''s people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 433, 12, 24, 'The Living Bible presents another possible translation of this verse and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 433, 13, 24, 'is also something that comforts us. If we walk in uprightness, the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 433, 14, 24, 'will preserve us. But if there''s wickedness somewhere within, whatever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 433, 15, 24, 'plans we make, the Lord will see that they come to ruin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 433, 16, 24, 'The sluggard says, "There is a lion outside;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 433, 17, 24, 'I will be killed in the streets!"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 433, 18, 24, 'Prov 22:13');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 433, 19, 24, 'This is just one of the many excuses that lazy people make for not going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 433, 20, 24, 'to work. It''s an exaggeration. Of course, nobody actually says it like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 433, 21, 24, 'this, but it highlights the fact that people often make so many silly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 433, 22, 24, 'excuses for their own lack of diligence in any area - whether it is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 433, 23, 24, 'matter of diligence in the study of scriptures or any other thing. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 433, 24, 24, 'the word of God, particularly in the book of Proverbs, we see repeatedly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 433, 25, 24, 'that the sluggard, the lazy man, is put in the same category as the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 433, 26, 24, 'fool.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 433, 27, 24, 'The mouth of an adulteress is a deep pit;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 433, 28, 24, 'He who is cursed of the Lord will fall into it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 434, 1, 24, 'Prov 22:14');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 434, 2, 24, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 434, 3, 24, 'Adultery is a trap - it catches those with whom the Lord is angry.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 434, 4, 24, 'Prov 22:14, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 434, 5, 24, 'Here is the reason why people fall into adultery. It''s a very serious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 434, 6, 24, 'verse. When we hear of preachers falling into adultery, can we take it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 434, 7, 24, 'lightly? No. You have to say that the Lord must have been angry with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 434, 8, 24, 'that man. The Lord must have hated that man. That''s why he allowed that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 434, 9, 24, 'fellow to fall into that trap. If the person were humble, God would have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 434, 10, 24, 'protected him. But because he was not humble, God allowed him to fall');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 434, 11, 24, 'into adultery. Once a person falls into adultery, it''s almost impossible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 434, 12, 24, 'to recover one''s testimony completely. You can recover it to some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 434, 13, 24, 'extent, but never completely. Not even David could do it; much less');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 434, 14, 24, 'someone in the New Covenant. This is something we have to fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 434, 15, 24, 'tremendously, and when we hear it happen to someone who calls himself a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 434, 16, 24, 'Christian, remember this verse: He who is cursed of the Lord falls into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 434, 17, 24, 'that open mouth of the adulteress woman. God would have protected him if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 434, 18, 24, 'he were humble and God-fearing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 434, 19, 24, 'Foolishness is bound up in the heart of a child;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 434, 20, 24, 'The rod of discipline will remove it far from him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 434, 21, 24, 'Prov 22:15');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 434, 22, 24, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 434, 23, 24, 'Children just naturally do silly, careless things, but a good spanking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 434, 24, 24, 'will teach them how to behave.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 434, 25, 24, 'Prov 22:15, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 434, 26, 24, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 434, 27, 24, 'A youngster''s heart is filled with rebellion, but punishment will drive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 434, 28, 24, 'it out of him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 435, 1, 24, 'Prov 22:15, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 435, 2, 24, 'It''s amazing. This is the wisdom of God: that it''s only by inflicting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 435, 3, 24, 'pain - physical pain - on a child that you can remove the foolishness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 435, 4, 24, 'which is inside its heart. It says that foolishness is bound up in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 435, 5, 24, 'heart of a child, and there is no child in the world that is excluded');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 435, 6, 24, 'here. Every child in the world has foolishness in its heart, and it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 435, 7, 24, 'good for every father and mother to realize that - particularly those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 435, 8, 24, 'who think, "My child can never do anything wrong." Well, then your child');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 435, 9, 24, 'must be an exception to what is written in Proverbs 22:15, but for all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 435, 10, 24, 'other human beings this is true. Foolishness is bound up in the heart of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 435, 11, 24, 'a child, and it''s very dangerous to defend our children. That''s the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 435, 12, 24, 'we can ruin them. We have to face up to the fact that our children,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 435, 13, 24, 'however good, lovely darlings we think they are, have foolishness bound');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 435, 14, 24, 'up in their heart. Why? Because God''s word says so. Never mind what I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 435, 15, 24, 'think. Set aside my reason. God''s word says it. And God has called me as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 435, 16, 24, 'a parent to drive that foolishness out of their hearts. God says, "I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 435, 17, 24, 'appoint you, father and mother, to drive out that folly from the hearts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 435, 18, 24, 'of your children." And it says the only way is by using the rod of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 435, 19, 24, 'discipline - not the rod of anger. The rod of anger won''t drive it out.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 435, 20, 24, 'Fathers and mothers can use the rod of anger, but here it''s speaking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 435, 21, 24, 'about the rod of discipline. And fathers and mothers must also be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 435, 22, 24, 'disciplined themselves, using the rod in a disciplined way for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 435, 23, 24, 'purpose of discipline. The rod of discipline will remove foolishness far');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 435, 24, 24, 'from your child.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 435, 25, 24, 'The verse reads like this in the Good News Translation: "Children just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 435, 26, 24, 'naturally do silly, careless things, but a good spanking will teach them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 435, 27, 24, 'how to behave." Now, when a father and mother do not give that spanking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 435, 28, 24, 'to their children when they are small, the result is that the children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 436, 1, 24, 'grow up and still do silly, careless things even when they are adults.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 436, 2, 24, 'What a sad thing that parents have allowed their children to grow up and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 436, 3, 24, 'do silly, careless things even when they are grown up.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 436, 4, 24, 'It says in The Living Bible it says, "A youngsters heart is filled with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 436, 5, 24, 'rebellion..." That''s also true. There''s a spirit of rebellion because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 436, 6, 24, 'he''s unconverted in his heart, but punishment will drive it out of him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 436, 7, 24, 'We are to see even small acts of disobedience as basically');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 436, 8, 24, 'manifestations of the spirit of rebellion. And that''s why we are to take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 436, 9, 24, 'them seriously and not allow even a small disobedience to be taken');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 436, 10, 24, 'lightly. We do this because we want to help our children to be free from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 436, 11, 24, 'that spirit of Lucifer which is manifested in rebellion.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 436, 12, 24, 'He who oppresses the poor to make more for himself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 436, 13, 24, 'Or who gives to the rich, will only come to poverty.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 436, 14, 24, 'Prov 22:16');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 436, 15, 24, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 436, 16, 24, 'He who gains by oppressing the poor or by bribing the rich shall end in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 436, 17, 24, 'poverty.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 436, 18, 24, 'Prov 22:16, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 436, 19, 24, 'In James 5:4, it speaks about those who don''t pay their servants');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 436, 20, 24, 'properly. That''s a serious thing when servants work and we don''t pay');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 436, 21, 24, 'them properly. That''s to oppress the poor so that I can have a little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 436, 22, 24, 'more of a bank balance. James speaks about the judgment that will come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 436, 23, 24, 'upon people who increase their bank balance at the cost of not properly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 436, 24, 24, 'paying those who have worked for them. There will be quite a huge number');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 436, 25, 24, 'of people who will be judged just on that one verse. And they will come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 436, 26, 24, 'to poverty - to spiritual poverty. And ultimately, even financially, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 436, 27, 24, 'will make sure they suffer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 436, 28, 24, 'It also speaks of those who give to the rich. Giving to the rich can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 437, 1, 24, 'sometimes be with an end in view. Jesus spoke about inviting a person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 437, 2, 24, 'for a meal knowing that you''ll be invited back by them. Likewise, we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 437, 3, 24, 'give a gift to a person because we know that when our turn comes, he''ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 437, 4, 24, 'come back with a gift to us. That is giving a gift to the rich and it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 437, 5, 24, 'a form of bribing. We can be so afraid of bribing, but here in The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 437, 6, 24, 'Living Bible it says, "He who gains by oppressing the poor or by bribing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 437, 7, 24, 'the rich shall end in poverty." God watches these things, and it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 437, 8, 24, 'always in the realm of the motive that God sees. What is the motive?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 437, 9, 24, 'It''s not a question of whether I''m giving to a rich or a poor person,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 437, 10, 24, 'but what is the motive behind it? And here is an opportunity for us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 437, 11, 24, 'cleanse our motives in both our giving of gifts and in our paying those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 437, 12, 24, 'who work for us. It''s an opportunity to check that our motives are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 437, 13, 24, 'righteous.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 437, 14, 24, 'Listen to this wise advice; follow it closely, for it will do you good,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 437, 15, 24, 'and you can pass it on to others: Trust in the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 437, 16, 24, 'Prov 22:17-19, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 437, 17, 24, 'This section begins with similar words to Proverbs 2. And his advice is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 437, 18, 24, 'this: to trust in the Lord. That''s the advice he gives! At all times, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 437, 19, 24, 'all circumstances, under all situations, whatever may happen, trust in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 437, 20, 24, 'the Lord. Just think of having those four words as a motto for one''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 437, 21, 24, 'life. That''s basically what he''s trying to say: just take a little motto');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 437, 22, 24, 'like this with you all through life. Whatever may happen in the world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 437, 23, 24, 'around you, trust in the Lord. He''ll bring you through. He''ll lift you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 437, 24, 24, 'up. He''ll make you stand. Trust in the Lord. When things are difficult,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 437, 25, 24, 'when things look impossible, trust in the Lord. It''s a fantastic thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 437, 26, 24, 'to live by, and he''s basically summing up what he''s trying to say in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 437, 27, 24, 'this section.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 437, 28, 24, 'Have I not written to you excellent things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 438, 1, 24, 'Of counsels and knowledge,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 438, 2, 24, 'To make you know the certainty of the words of truth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 438, 3, 24, 'That you may correctly answer him who sent you?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 438, 4, 24, 'Prov 22:20-21');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 438, 5, 24, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 438, 6, 24, 'In the past, haven''t I been right? Then believe what I am telling you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 438, 7, 24, 'now and share it with others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 438, 8, 24, 'Prov 22:20-21, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 438, 9, 24, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 438, 10, 24, 'I want you to put your trust in the Lord; That is why I am going to tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 438, 11, 24, 'them to you now. I have written down thirty sayings for you. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 438, 12, 24, 'contain knowledge and good advice, and will teach you what the truth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 438, 13, 24, 'really is. Then when you are sent to find it out, you will bring back');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 438, 14, 24, 'the right answer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 438, 15, 24, 'Prov 22:19-21, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 438, 16, 24, 'We have confidence in a person when we find that what he has told us in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 438, 17, 24, 'the past has proven to be right. Then we know that person has wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 438, 18, 24, 'And that''s what the writer is saying: "In the past, haven''t I been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 438, 19, 24, 'right? Then believe what I am telling you now and share it with others:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 438, 20, 24, 'trust in the Lord." God wants the younger generation also to be wise, so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 438, 21, 24, 'that they can share this truth with others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 438, 22, 24, 'In the New American Standard Bible it says, "To make you know the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 438, 23, 24, 'certainty of the words of truth." That means to be convinced of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 438, 24, 24, 'truth of God''s word, because we have experienced its reality and its');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 438, 25, 24, 'power in our life. We are CONVINCED and certain of the truth of God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 438, 26, 24, 'word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 438, 27, 24, 'In the Good News Translation, we see that these thirty sayings are like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 438, 28, 24, 'a mini book of Proverbs in the middle of the book of Proverbs. He tells');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 439, 1, 24, 'us to take heed to these thirty different statements on various');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 439, 2, 24, 'subjects. And he sums everything up with a heading for the section:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 439, 3, 24, 'Trust in the Lord. But in practical terms, he tells us what we should do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 439, 4, 24, 'to trust in the Lord by giving us these thirty bits of advice. So let''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 439, 5, 24, 'look at these thirty bits of advice.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 439, 6, 24, '1) Don''t take advantage of the poor just because you can; don''t take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 439, 7, 24, 'advantage of those who stand helpless in court. The Lord will argue');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 439, 8, 24, 'their case for them and threaten the life of anyone who threatens');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 439, 9, 24, 'theirs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 439, 10, 24, 'Prov 22:22-23, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 439, 11, 24, 'Notice where he begins when he gives these thirty bits of advice in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 439, 12, 24, 'remaining two chapters. What is the first of all these thirty sayings?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 439, 13, 24, 'We can sum it up in two words: be merciful. Be merciful towards another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 439, 14, 24, 'person who at this particular time happens to be under your power or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 439, 15, 24, 'under your authority. Don''t try to lord it over him. Don''t take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 439, 16, 24, 'advantage of the fact that that person is under you in any way. Be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 439, 17, 24, 'merciful. That is the very first thing. In the flesh, there is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 439, 18, 24, 'tremendous lust to take advantage of those who are under us in any way,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 439, 19, 24, 'and we have to fear it. That''s why it says to work out your salvation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 439, 20, 24, 'with fear and trembling. Be merciful because you will find that the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 439, 21, 24, 'is fighting for the case of the poor. It''s dangerous to have the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 439, 22, 24, 'fighting someone''s case against me. It''s good to be merciful. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 439, 23, 24, 'interesting that this is the very first thing he says.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 439, 24, 24, '2) Don''t make friends with people who have hot, violent tempers. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 439, 25, 24, 'might learn their habits and not be able to change.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 439, 26, 24, 'Prov 22:24-25, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 439, 27, 24, 'The second statement/instruction/teaching can also be summed up in two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 439, 28, 24, 'words: avoid anger. It''s very practical. He basically says to trust in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 440, 1, 24, 'the Lord, but this trusting in the Lord works down to very practical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 440, 2, 24, 'applications of daily life. First of all, be merciful to the poor, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 440, 3, 24, 'secondly, avoid anger.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 440, 4, 24, 'It''s dangerous to be friendly with a man who doesn''t have control of his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 440, 5, 24, 'temper, because you might learn his habits and then you may not be able');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 440, 6, 24, 'to change. It''s interesting that the word of God says that. In other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 440, 7, 24, 'words, anger can be contagious. Are you afraid of going too close to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 440, 8, 24, 'someone who has leprosy? Well, be careful of being too friendly with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 440, 9, 24, 'people who have hot, violent tempers. It''s not at all a good thing. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 440, 10, 24, 'might learn their habits and you may not be able to change. God requires');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 440, 11, 24, 'first that we are merciful to others. And then God really desires that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 440, 12, 24, 'we fight and overcome this hot, violent temper that dwells in our flesh.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 440, 13, 24, 'He wants us to bring it under the control of the Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 440, 14, 24, '3) Don''t promise to be responsible for someone else''s debts. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 440, 15, 24, 'should be unable to pay, they will take away even your bed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 440, 16, 24, 'Prov 22:26-27, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 440, 17, 24, 'In other words, don''t stand as a guarantee for someone else. That is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 440, 18, 24, 'dangerous thing. As I said when we considered this earlier in the book');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 440, 19, 24, 'of Proverbs, I believe that it would be proper to stand as guarantee for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 440, 20, 24, 'a person if we have come into such a relationship where the person has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 440, 21, 24, 'really become one with us in the body of Christ. Not that he sits in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 440, 22, 24, 'same congregation, listening to the same message, believing the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 440, 23, 24, 'doctrine, but that you''ve entered into a covenant relationship in one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 440, 24, 24, 'body. Then it would be right. But otherwise, even if the person calls');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 440, 25, 24, 'himself a believer or a brother; even if he is in the same meeting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 440, 26, 24, 'place; take the word of God and don''t stand guarantee.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 440, 27, 24, 'This verse also, I think, implies that we should be wise in our giving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 440, 28, 24, 'and lending money to others. Imagine that when the writer of Proverbs is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 441, 1, 24, 'thinking of thirty important things to say, he speaks about mercy; he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 441, 2, 24, 'speaks about anger; and then, all of the sudden, he speaks about lending');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 441, 3, 24, 'money and standing guarantee. It''s one of those things which can lead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 441, 4, 24, 'people into a lot of trouble. He''s telling people, "Be wise here. Be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 441, 5, 24, 'wise in lending and giving money. It requires a lot of wisdom."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 441, 6, 24, '4) Do not move the ancient boundary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 441, 7, 24, 'Which your fathers have set.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 441, 8, 24, 'Prov 22:28');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 441, 9, 24, 'We see even today, little marking stones in empty plots of ground that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 441, 10, 24, 'mark the boundary of that plot. And in the middle of the night, you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 441, 11, 24, 'move that stone out - maybe six feet to the other side. What you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 441, 12, 24, 'done is you have gone into somebody else''s territory. This has a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 441, 13, 24, 'practical application, of course: that we don''t cheat one another in any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 441, 14, 24, 'way. But also it has an application in relation to the spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 441, 15, 24, 'boundaries that we consider often in the church. We respect the boundary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 441, 16, 24, 'that God has drawn around another person. We must not only respect a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 441, 17, 24, 'person''s physical plot of land and property, but also the boundary that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 441, 18, 24, 'God has drawn around another person. We should treat that person with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 441, 19, 24, 'respect, because God has drawn a certain boundary around them. The world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 441, 20, 24, 'is full of people who are going into people''s territories - being a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 441, 21, 24, 'busybody in other peoples'' matters. They''re always putting their nose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 441, 22, 24, 'into things which don''t concern them at all. That is to move the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 441, 23, 24, 'boundary mark. God has given that person a particular boundary.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 441, 24, 24, 'For example, let''s say you see the way someone''s children are being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 441, 25, 24, 'brought up. Is that within your boundary? It is not. It is a million');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 441, 26, 24, 'miles away from you. God has put a boundary around that father and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 441, 27, 24, 'mother and given those children to them. It is foolish for me to sit in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 441, 28, 24, 'my house and talk about how they are bringing up their children. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 442, 1, 24, 'none of my business. If they come to me for advice, then I can give it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 442, 2, 24, 'But otherwise it''s none of my business to go and move their boundary and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 442, 3, 24, 'put it on my side and act as a busybody in their matters. I should not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 442, 4, 24, 'tell them how they should bring up their children or how they should do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 442, 5, 24, 'anything in their home! If they come to you for advice and have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 442, 6, 24, 'confidence in you, give it to them. Otherwise, my dear brothers and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 442, 7, 24, 'sisters, we can save ourselves a lot of trouble, and a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 442, 8, 24, 'foolishness, and a lot of unnecessary problems, if we just respect our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 442, 9, 24, 'boundaries and respect the boundaries of other people. Don''t move them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 442, 10, 24, 'God has put them. Respect them. Simple wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 442, 11, 24, '5) Do you know a hard-working man? He shall be successful and stand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 442, 12, 24, 'before kings!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 442, 13, 24, 'Prov 22:29, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 442, 14, 24, 'Of course, we are not interested in standing before earthly kings. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 442, 15, 24, 'was a big thing in the Old Testament, because God''s promises to Israel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 442, 16, 24, 'were earthly. The earthly king was the representative of God in Israel.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 442, 17, 24, 'But today - for us in the New Covenant - we have only one king: the King');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 442, 18, 24, 'of kings, Jesus Christ our Lord. And here it tells us how we can stand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 442, 19, 24, 'before him. If we are wholehearted, like the hardworking farmer in 2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 442, 20, 24, 'Timothy 2:6, we''ll get the first share of the crops. The one who really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 442, 21, 24, 'works hard (within his own boundary according to verse 28), he will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 442, 22, 24, 'stand before the king.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 442, 23, 24, 'Consider the sons of Zadok in Ezekiel 44 - they were permitted to stand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 442, 24, 24, 'before the Lord and minister to him. There were a whole lot of other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 442, 25, 24, 'priests to whom God said, "I''ll give you a ministry, but you can''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 442, 26, 24, 'that highest ministry of standing before me. You can have a ministry of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 442, 27, 24, 'serving the people." There are different categories of ministries even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 442, 28, 24, 'in the New Testament, but the highest of all is to stand before God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 443, 1, 24, 'face. Every one of us can have that if we work hard on our flesh within');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 443, 2, 24, 'our own boundary.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 443, 3, 25, 'Chapter 23 Chapter 23');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 443, 4, 25, '6) When dining with a rich man, be on your guard and don''t stuff');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 443, 5, 25, 'yourself, though it all tastes so good; for he is trying to bribe you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 443, 6, 25, 'and no good is going to come of his invitation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 443, 7, 25, 'Prov 23:1-3, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 443, 8, 25, 'The reason we must be on guard when dining with a rich or influential');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 443, 9, 25, 'person is because there can be so many temptations there. Two things we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 443, 10, 25, 'can consider are: don''t be a slave to food and don''t be a slave to rich');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 443, 11, 25, 'people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 443, 12, 25, 'It says not to be a slave to good food. We can think of Daniel - how he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 443, 13, 25, 'was at the king''s table and he wouldn''t eat the food lest he compromise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 443, 14, 25, 'his position. Temptation came to Daniel initially through food.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 443, 15, 25, 'Temptation came to Eve in the garden through food, Temptation also came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 443, 16, 25, 'to Jesus first in the wilderness through food. It''s interesting that so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 443, 17, 25, 'many of the important temptations mentioned in the scriptures came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 443, 18, 25, 'through food. And here also it is telling us not to be a slave of food.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 443, 19, 25, 'At the same time, it speaks about being careful when we are invited by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 443, 20, 25, 'the rich. That can be a dangerous thing. Having been invited by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 443, 21, 25, 'rich, we have put ourselves in a compromising position that we have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 443, 22, 25, 'please them. There''s something we have to be careful about: that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 443, 23, 25, 'don''t place ourselves under obligation to some rich person because he''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 443, 24, 25, 'given us dinner or something else. If we really want to serve the Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 443, 25, 25, 'we have to be free from all men, so that we are not under any obligation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 443, 26, 25, 'to a single human being. Not at all. We must be free before the Lord to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 443, 27, 25, 'speak the truth to them and offend them. What an exhortation this is. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 443, 28, 25, 'Christian workers and pastors and all were taking this seriously, there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 444, 1, 25, 'would be purer churches in the world today. We are never to come under');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 444, 2, 25, 'obligation to people. Paul said in 1 Corinthians 9:19, "I am free from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 444, 3, 25, 'all men." And we must always keep ourselves like that, so that we don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 444, 4, 25, 'put ourselves under obligation to anyone - particularly to the rich who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 444, 5, 25, 'would like to control us in some way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 444, 6, 25, '7) Do not weary yourself to gain wealth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 444, 7, 25, 'Cease from your consideration of it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 444, 8, 25, 'When you set your eyes on it, it is gone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 444, 9, 25, 'For wealth certainly makes itself wings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 444, 10, 25, 'Like an eagle that flies toward the heavens.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 444, 11, 25, 'Prov 23:4-5');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 444, 12, 25, 'This verse is not against earning a living, but the pursuit of wealth -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 444, 13, 25, 'trying to get more and more money beyond what I need. It''s not speaking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 444, 14, 25, 'about earning what I need to live. "Cease from your consideration of it"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 444, 15, 25, 'means to stop thinking about making more money than you need. Because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 444, 16, 25, 'when people have begun to think about that, they finally land into all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 444, 17, 25, 'types of troubles and difficulties. It says in 1 Timothy 6:10 that those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 444, 18, 25, 'who want to be rich have pierced themselves through with many sorrows.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 444, 19, 25, 'Not only that, but it says here when you set your eyes on it, it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 444, 20, 25, 'gone. Don''t think that just because you make more, you''ll have more.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 444, 21, 25, 'Usually the people who make more end up spending more. They really don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 444, 22, 25, 'have more, "for wealth certainly makes itself wings like an eagle that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 444, 23, 25, 'flies towards the heavens." That''s what God''s word says about riches -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 444, 24, 25, 'it flies off like an eagle. Think of that. It doesn''t just slowly go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 444, 25, 25, 'away. It suddenly goes. And if my heart is set on riches, I can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 444, 26, 25, 'tremendously disappointed. So here''s practical wisdom: Don''t weary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 444, 27, 25, 'yourself. Stop thinking about becoming rich. Be content with having');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 444, 28, 25, 'enough for your needs - for yourself and your family.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 445, 1, 25, '8) Do not eat the bread of a selfish man,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 445, 2, 25, 'Or desire his delicacies;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 445, 3, 25, 'For as he thinks within himself, so he is.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 445, 4, 25, 'He says to you, "Eat and drink!"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 445, 5, 25, 'But his heart is not with you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 445, 6, 25, 'You will vomit up the morsel you have eaten,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 445, 7, 25, 'And waste your compliments.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 445, 8, 25, 'Prov 23:6-8');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 445, 9, 25, 'This is speaking of a stingy man. In other words, don''t go where people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 445, 10, 25, 'are not eager to have you. In simple words, it means that. We should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 445, 11, 25, 'really only go where people are happy and eager to have us. It is folly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 445, 12, 25, 'to visit a person even if he said, "Yeah, brother - please come." You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 445, 13, 25, 'have to sense whether he was really sincere and is eager to have you or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 445, 14, 25, 'whether he is just being courteous. There has been and there still is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 445, 15, 25, 'lot of folly among believers in this area, and it''s not just in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 445, 16, 25, 'matter of going for a meal. For example, when we go to different places');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 445, 17, 25, '(now CFC has fellowships in different parts of the country), I can think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 445, 18, 25, 'that of course other fellowships are definitely eager to have me,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 445, 19, 25, 'because I am such a brother who brings blessings wherever I go. We can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 445, 20, 25, 'have such high thoughts about ourselves, but the other person may not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 445, 21, 25, 'have the same thoughts about you. It is so easy for us to have such high');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 445, 22, 25, 'thoughts and think that everybody is eager to have us just because they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 445, 23, 25, 'sent an invitation. They may have sent an invitation, but their hearts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 445, 24, 25, 'weren''t really in it. We must not be so stupid or foolish to think that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 445, 25, 25, 'everybody who invites us is necessarily eager for our company or our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 445, 26, 25, 'fellowship. We have to sense that. If I have high thoughts about myself,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 445, 27, 25, 'then I will think, "Yes, they are really eager to have me." But if I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 445, 28, 25, 'have small thoughts about myself, I will say, "That invitation may just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 446, 1, 25, 'be out of courtesy." I have to think.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 446, 2, 25, 'We are not to make fools of ourselves and grow up with a testimony for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 446, 3, 25, 'folly in this area. Really seek God for wisdom and humility. If a person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 446, 4, 25, 'is really eager to have you, he will keep on asking you. It won''t be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 446, 5, 25, 'just once. He will really want you, and that''s the best time to go.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 446, 6, 25, 'We''ll have far more to give when people are really eager to have us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 446, 7, 25, 'somewhere, rather than if we just get a casual invitation. Since we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 446, 8, 25, 'rich and have money to travel, we jump onto a train or a bus and off we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 446, 9, 25, 'are. That is folly. We have to be careful that we don''t do such stupid');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 446, 10, 25, 'things. Be careful in accepting invitations. See that people are really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 446, 11, 25, 'eager to have you first before visiting. Let''s not thrust ourselves on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 446, 12, 25, 'people who are not so eager to have us. That''s simple wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 446, 13, 25, 'He then says, "Eat and drink." Of course, he has to be courteous, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 446, 14, 25, 'his heart is not really with you. It means he is not really sincere in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 446, 15, 25, 'what he says. Of course, it''s wrong on his part, but never mind about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 446, 16, 25, 'him. We are not to be foolish.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 446, 17, 25, '9) Do not speak in the hearing of a fool,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 446, 18, 25, 'For he will despise the wisdom of your words.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 446, 19, 25, 'Prov 23:9');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 446, 20, 25, 'This is just like what Jesus said in Matthew 7:6: "Don''t throw your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 446, 21, 25, 'pearls before swine. Don''t give that which is holy to dogs." We are to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 446, 22, 25, 'think when we speak: "These people who are listening to me, what sort of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 446, 23, 25, 'people are they?" I can''t just start off on the New and Living Way and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 446, 24, 25, 'about Christ manifest in the flesh and all types of things without a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 446, 25, 25, 'single thought about who the audience is. I mean, are these the people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 446, 26, 25, 'to whom I should be saying this? Wisdom is required. Otherwise, we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 446, 27, 25, 'fools if we think that just because we have some knowledge, we should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 446, 28, 25, 'dish it out to anyone who comes our way. No. We are not to share with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 447, 1, 25, 'those who despise the wisdom of our words. For example, this may not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 447, 2, 25, 'just be about doctrine. It can be to someone in the church. You give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 447, 3, 25, 'some advice to them, some wisdom, and they despise it. They don''t care');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 447, 4, 25, 'for it, because in their own opinion, they are wiser. If you are wise,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 447, 5, 25, 'next time you will not give them advice. Let them go and do what they''d');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 447, 6, 25, 'like. Do not speak to a fool. A fool is one who despises the wisdom of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 447, 7, 25, 'your words. You have to sense, "Do I feel that this person doesn''t think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 447, 8, 25, 'there''s any wisdom in my words? Maybe he thinks I''m a fool. Okay, fine.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 447, 9, 25, 'I''m not offended by that." But I have to make sure that I don''t go and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 447, 10, 25, 'unnecessarily trouble him with more advice in the future. Just leave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 447, 11, 25, 'him, because he''s despised the wisdom of your words. We have to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 447, 12, 25, 'sensitive and sensible here, and not just go around saying anything to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 447, 13, 25, 'everyone. This is really, really practical wisdom. If we take it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 447, 14, 25, 'seriously, we will grow up to be wise instead of foolish.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 447, 15, 25, '10) Do not move the ancient boundary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 447, 16, 25, 'Or go into the fields of the fatherless,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 447, 17, 25, 'For their Redeemer is strong;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 447, 18, 25, 'He will plead their case against you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 447, 19, 25, 'Prov 23:10-11');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 447, 20, 25, 'Here is a repetition again about moving the boundary. It''s almost as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 447, 21, 25, 'though he hasn''t had enough by saying it once. He probably knows what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 447, 22, 25, 'busybodies the children of Adam are, and so he has to repeat it. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 447, 23, 25, 'are certain things repeated in these 30 sayings that we would be wise to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 447, 24, 25, 'pay attention to.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 447, 25, 25, 'The fatherless represent a combination of the poor and the helpless.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 447, 26, 25, 'Beware of injuring the helpless. That''s basically what he''s saying.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 447, 27, 25, 'Those who are weak, those who cannot fight back, those who cannot go to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 447, 28, 25, 'court against you, those who have nobody to fight their cause for them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 448, 1, 25, 'That''s basically what it says about the fatherless - nobody to fight');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 448, 2, 25, 'their cause, weak, they are under you in some way. Beware that you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 448, 3, 25, 'go into their boundary. Respect a boundary that almighty God has placed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 448, 4, 25, 'around that human being, "for their redeemer is strong and he will plead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 448, 5, 25, 'their case against you."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 448, 6, 25, 'We can look at it another way: that is if you are one of those helpless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 448, 7, 25, 'people somebody else is taking advantage of, think of this verse. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 448, 8, 25, 'have a powerful defender (as it says in the Good News Translation) - a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 448, 9, 25, 'powerful defender who will fight your case for you, since you have no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 448, 10, 25, 'one else to fight your case. You are helpless. This is a tremendous word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 448, 11, 25, 'of encouragement to those who find themselves in some helpless situation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 448, 12, 25, 'in life. You can feel like a fatherless person in some situations.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 448, 13, 25, 'Instead of feeling sorry for yourself and ending up defiled with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 448, 14, 25, 'spirit of self-pity, you can say to yourself: "Well, it says here that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 448, 15, 25, 'if I''m helpless, then I am in a very blessed position actually, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 448, 16, 25, 'I have a mighty guardian who will fight my case for me." What better');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 448, 17, 25, 'position is there than that? That is not any cause for self-pity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 448, 18, 25, 'Self-pity is always because of UNBELIEF. Always because of unbelief.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 448, 19, 25, 'Only atheists can have self-pity. You say, "No, I''ve seen believers who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 448, 20, 25, 'have self-pity." Well, those believers become atheists at that moment.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 448, 21, 25, 'That means they don''t believe in a heavenly Father; they don''t believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 448, 22, 25, 'that God is almighty; they don''t believe that God is going to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 448, 23, 25, 'anything for them. At that moment, they''ve lost all faith, and that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 448, 24, 25, 'why they end up in self-pity. Only an atheist who doesn''t have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 448, 25, 25, 'heavenly Father can have self-pity. But one who has a heavenly Father,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 448, 26, 25, 'how can he ever have self-pity when he is in the most powerful position?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 448, 27, 25, 'The believer says, "I''m helpless, humanly speaking. But my almighty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 448, 28, 25, 'guardian is going to take care of it all." Think of a wife who is always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 449, 1, 25, 'being troubled by her husband in 101 ways. She can wallow in self-pity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 449, 2, 25, 'or she can rejoice that there''s a powerful guardian who will fight her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 449, 3, 25, 'cause. It''s the same with any other person like that who is in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 449, 4, 25, 'difficult situation. A word of encouragement.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 449, 5, 25, '11) Apply your heart to discipline');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 449, 6, 25, 'And your ears to words of knowledge.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 449, 7, 25, 'Prov 23:12');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 449, 8, 25, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 449, 9, 25, 'Don''t refuse to accept criticism; get all the help you can.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 449, 10, 25, 'Prov 23:12, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 449, 11, 25, 'In other words, when you get some criticism, what should you do? Apply');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 449, 12, 25, 'your heart to it. I heard a brother tell a story once about one time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 449, 13, 25, 'when the phone rang. He picked it up, and some person who was mad with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 449, 14, 25, 'him began to tell him all types of mean things: "You''re like this and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 449, 15, 25, 'you''re like that." And the brother thought, "I have to press the phone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 449, 16, 25, 'really close to my ear now and listen carefully to this, because this is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 449, 17, 25, 'going to help me to work out my salvation with fear and trembling."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 449, 18, 25, 'That''s a godly person. He wants to listen carefully lest he miss one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 449, 19, 25, 'word of all this criticism that''s coming over the phone. Think of that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 449, 20, 25, 'It was a godly brother who told that story. You won''t find such a person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 449, 21, 25, 'ending up as a fool, because when he hears something, he says: "I know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 449, 22, 25, 'there''s nothing good in my flesh, and here''s somebody who''s helping me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 449, 23, 25, 'to find something which I may not have found myself yet." I really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 449, 24, 25, 'believe, brothers, that we are not as wholehearted as we often think in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 449, 25, 25, 'wanting to find out what dwells in our flesh. We say, "Yes, I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 449, 26, 25, 'wholehearted. I want to find out what dwells in my flesh." Then when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 449, 27, 25, 'someone tells me what dwells in my flesh, I get all upset. That shows');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 449, 28, 25, 'I''m not really wholehearted in wanting to find out. But here was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 450, 1, 25, 'brother who was wholehearted. He wanted to find out! And the proof of it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 450, 2, 25, 'was that when somebody criticized him, he wanted to hear every word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 450, 3, 25, 'it. There we find out whether we are really wholehearted or whether we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 450, 4, 25, 'are deceiving ourselves. So, accept all the criticism you get and apply');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 450, 5, 25, 'your heart to it! The Living Bible says that this criticism is a help to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 450, 6, 25, 'us. It''s a help if we are really interested in a godly life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 450, 7, 25, '12) Do not hold back discipline from the child,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 450, 8, 25, 'Although you strike him with the rod, he will not die.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 450, 9, 25, 'You shall strike him with the rod');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 450, 10, 25, 'And rescue his soul from Sheol.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 450, 11, 25, 'Prov 23:13-14');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 450, 12, 25, 'Again, here it speaks about something the book of Proverbs repeats many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 450, 13, 25, 'times: the need for discipline for children. Think of this. What does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 450, 14, 25, 'this mean? This means that it''s quite a painful beating, not just a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 450, 15, 25, 'little tap. There''s no danger of him dying with just a little tap. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 450, 16, 25, 'he says when you beat him with a rod, he will not die. That means he''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 450, 17, 25, 'thinking of quite a severe beating. He won''t die, don''t worry. God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 450, 18, 25, 'provided sufficient flesh on that part of the body for just this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 450, 19, 25, 'purpose. That will protect him from injury and death. That''s the wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 450, 20, 25, 'of God, and he will not die. You will beat him with the rod and you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 450, 21, 25, 'deliver his soul from Hell. That''s what God''s word says. You will teach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 450, 22, 25, 'him obedience when he is small, and you will deliver his soul from Hell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 450, 23, 25, 'when he grows up. But if you are soft with him, you''ll see him grow up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 450, 24, 25, 'to go to Hell. Or if you are angry with him and beat him with the rod of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 450, 25, 25, 'anger, he may still go to Hell. But if you humble yourself and use the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 450, 26, 25, 'rod of discipline and really make him feel the pain, you can save his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 450, 27, 25, 'soul from Hell. What a need there is for us to be delivered from a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 450, 28, 25, 'foolish softness with our children.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 451, 1, 25, 'I think of the words of the father of Samson. I don''t know whether');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 451, 2, 25, 'you''ve noticed them. I believe it''s a prayer that every father and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 451, 3, 25, 'mother who have small children should pray. Particularly, as we''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 451, 4, 25, 'considered before, for children under twelve. In Judges 13, there was an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 451, 5, 25, 'angel who came to Samson''s parents and foretold them about the birth of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 451, 6, 25, 'Samson. Manoah, Samson''s father, then prayed and said, "O Lord, please');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 451, 7, 25, 'let the man of God whom you sent come again to us and teach us what we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 451, 8, 25, 'are to do with the child who will be born" (verse 8). Or as The Living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 451, 9, 25, 'Bible says, "O Lord, please let the man from God come back to us again');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 451, 10, 25, 'and give us more instructions about the child you are going to give us."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 451, 11, 25, 'And then when the man of God came, Manoah said to him in verse 12 (TLB),');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 451, 12, 25, '"Can you give us any special instructions about how we should raise the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 451, 13, 25, 'baby after he is born?" What a prayer to pray to God. "Lord, can you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 451, 14, 25, 'please give me some special instructions on how to bring up this child');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 451, 15, 25, 'when he is born?" Pray that prayer, brothers and sisters who are married');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 451, 16, 25, 'and have children. "Lord, I pray the prayer of Manoah. Please give me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 451, 17, 25, 'instructions on how to raise this child. And I will also follow your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 451, 18, 25, 'instructions which I read in Proverbs."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 451, 19, 25, '13) My child, if you become wise, I will be very happy. I will be proud');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 451, 20, 25, 'when I hear you speaking words of wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 451, 21, 25, 'Prov 23:15-16, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 451, 22, 25, 'This is a continuation of number twelve. The father has disciplined his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 451, 23, 25, 'child and saved him from Hell. And not only that - now the father''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 451, 24, 25, 'speaking to the son directly. We considered in the beginning of the book');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 451, 25, 25, 'of Proverbs that this is the older generation in the church speaking to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 451, 26, 25, 'the younger generation. They''re saying, "Son, if you become wise, I''ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 451, 27, 25, 'be really happy. I won''t be so happy if you just get a good job or get a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 451, 28, 25, 'good house or get a good wife or a good husband. These are not the main');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 452, 1, 25, 'things; but if you become wise, then I''ll be really happy. There''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 452, 2, 25, 'nothing that will delight my heart as much as you becoming wise. Even if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 452, 3, 25, 'you don''t come first in your class, if you become wise - spiritually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 452, 4, 25, 'wise - in your life, I''ll be really happy." We can see that there are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 452, 5, 25, 'very few fathers who are really eager for that. But we pray that in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 452, 6, 25, 'church we will have a generation of fathers and mothers who, even if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 452, 7, 25, 'they don''t say it, long for this in their hearts. "Son, daughter, we''ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 452, 8, 25, 'really be happy if you become wise. We''ll be proud of you when we hear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 452, 9, 25, 'you speaking words of wisdom; when we see you, our son, growing up and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 452, 10, 25, 'speaking with wisdom. Not a whole lot of stupid things that unbelievers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 452, 11, 25, 'and carnal believers talk about - but when we see you speaking with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 452, 12, 25, 'wisdom. When we see that you don''t gossip when other people around you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 452, 13, 25, 'do; when we see that you speak words of goodness and gentleness and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 452, 14, 25, 'kindness, we''ll be proud of you, our son - whatever other defects may be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 452, 15, 25, 'in you as far as the world is concerned." That is the goal we should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 452, 16, 25, 'have for our children.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 452, 17, 25, '14) Don''t envy evil men but continue to reverence the Lord all the time,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 452, 18, 25, 'for surely you have a wonderful future ahead of you. There is hope for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 452, 19, 25, 'you yet!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 452, 20, 25, 'Prov 23:17-18, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 452, 21, 25, 'When we fear the Lord, there are many things on earth that we lose. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 452, 22, 25, 'we see that evil men who don''t fear the Lord get those things by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 452, 23, 25, 'cheating and telling lies. And then, sometimes even unconsciously, a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 452, 24, 25, 'little envy can come in us, that if we did it like that we could also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 452, 25, 25, 'have those benefits. Here the word of God must come to our minds: don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 452, 26, 25, 'envy that evil man - that unrighteous man - but reverence the Lord all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 452, 27, 25, 'the time! Be in the fear of the Lord always! Live in the fear of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 452, 28, 25, 'Lord always. What an exhortation. I believe that Jesus obeyed that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 453, 1, 25, 'exhortation. It''s one of the things the bible says we must do all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 453, 2, 25, 'time: Live in the fear of the Lord all the time. We get up in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 453, 3, 25, 'morning and say, "Here is another day I must live in the fear of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 453, 4, 25, 'Lord right through from morning to night. In what I say, in what I do, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 453, 5, 25, 'have to live in the fear of the Lord. I have to live as one who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 453, 6, 25, 'recognizes that I must give an account of what I do in my body to God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 453, 7, 25, 'and I want to live in the fear of the Lord the whole day. Blessed are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 453, 8, 25, 'those who live like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 453, 9, 25, 'It goes on to say here that if you live like that: surely you have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 453, 10, 25, 'wonderful future ahead of you. And that''s absolutely true. As far as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 453, 11, 25, 'God''s concerned, there''s a wonderful future ahead of those who live in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 453, 12, 25, 'the fear of the Lord always. And there''s a wonderful little sentence at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 453, 13, 25, 'the end of this in The Living Bible: "There is hope for you yet!" That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 453, 14, 25, 'a word of encouragement for those who have failed and stumbled and done');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 453, 15, 25, 'many foolish things in the past. This word of encouragement comes: There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 453, 16, 25, 'is still hope for you! If even now you begin to live in the fear of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 453, 17, 25, 'Lord always, there is still hope for you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 453, 18, 25, '15) O my son, be wise and stay in God''s paths; don''t carouse with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 453, 19, 25, 'drunkards and gluttons, for they are on their way to poverty. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 453, 20, 25, 'remember that too much sleep clothes a man with rags.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 453, 21, 25, 'Prov 23:19-21, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 453, 22, 25, 'This is really telling us to overcome the love of food again and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 453, 23, 25, 'overcome the love of sleep. Overcome the love of food and overcome the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 453, 24, 25, 'love of sleep. We need food. We need to sleep. There''s nothing wrong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 453, 25, 25, 'with them. God gives us food to eat, and God gives us sleep so that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 453, 26, 25, 'can be refreshed. But he''s speaking about those who love it so much that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 453, 27, 25, 'they do not fulfill their responsibilities on earth or to God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 453, 28, 25, '16) Listen to your father; without him you would not exist. When your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 454, 1, 25, 'mother is old, show her your appreciation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 454, 2, 25, 'Truth, wisdom, learning, and good sense - these are worth paying for,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 454, 3, 25, 'but too valuable for you to sell.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 454, 4, 25, 'A righteous person''s parents have good reason to be happy. You can take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 454, 5, 25, 'pride in a wise child.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 454, 6, 25, 'Let your father and mother be proud of you; give your mother that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 454, 7, 25, 'happiness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 454, 8, 25, 'Prov 23:22-25, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 454, 9, 25, 'These are very good words. This speaks about a man''s relationship to his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 454, 10, 25, 'parents, and that''s another area where the book of Proverbs has much to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 454, 11, 25, 'say. Honoring your father and mother is the first commandment with a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 454, 12, 25, 'promise attached to it (Ephesians 6:1-3). It says here, "Listen to your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 454, 13, 25, 'father; without him you would not exist. When your mother is old, show');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 454, 14, 25, 'her your appreciation." Good exhortations for all of us to follow.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 454, 15, 25, '"Truth, wisdom, learning, and good sense - these are worth paying for,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 454, 16, 25, 'but too valuable for you to sell." Of course, in the context it means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 454, 17, 25, 'you receive these things from God-fearing parents. "A righteous person''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 454, 18, 25, 'parents have good reason to be happy. You can take pride in a wise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 454, 19, 25, 'child." Make your father and mother proud of you. Give your mother');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 454, 20, 25, 'happiness. These are words that we need to take seriously, because the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 454, 21, 25, 'book of Proverbs repeats them again and again and again. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 454, 22, 25, 'particularly important when we find that sometimes parents don''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 454, 23, 25, 'the same light that we have on various truths. Then we may have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 454, 24, 25, 'disagree with them on certain things. All the more reason why we have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 454, 25, 25, 'be careful to honor them in other areas, even though we have to take a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 454, 26, 25, 'stand for the truth in many areas that may cause offense. The Living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 454, 27, 25, 'Bible says in verse 22: "Listen to your father''s advice and don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 454, 28, 25, 'despise an old mother''s experience."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 455, 1, 25, 'I just want to say a word about verse 23. There''s something special here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 455, 2, 25, 'that applies not only to truth that we receive from God-fearing parents,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 455, 3, 25, 'but truth that we get in the New Covenant from the Holy Spirit. It says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 455, 4, 25, 'in the New American Standard Bible, "Buy the truth, and do not sell it."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 455, 5, 25, 'There are two things here: In order to get truth, I have to pay a price.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 455, 6, 25, 'And that price may be that I lose my reputation. I may even lose my job.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 455, 7, 25, 'I may lose friends. I may lose many things. I must say, "Lord, I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 455, 8, 25, 'willing to pay that price in order to get the truth and hold on to it."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 455, 9, 25, 'And once you get the truth, don''t sell it! Don''t compromise at any cost!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 455, 10, 25, 'It''s a fantastic verse. Don''t ever give up the truth just because you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 455, 11, 25, 'going to get a little profit here or a little gain there if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 455, 12, 25, 'compromise on the truth. Buy the truth! Pay any price to get the whole');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 455, 13, 25, 'truth of God! And once you get it, don''t ever give it up to please your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 455, 14, 25, 'wife or to please your relatives or to please anyone else. Never! Never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 455, 15, 25, 'sell it. That is the mark of a wholehearted person in one sentence. He''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 455, 16, 25, 'willing to pay any price to get the truth, and once he gets it, he will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 455, 17, 25, 'never part with it no matter what he''s going to lose. There are so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 455, 18, 25, 'things we could gain by compromising. It may not be money. It may be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 455, 19, 25, 'that I get somebody''s good pleasure if I keep quiet on something, and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 455, 20, 25, 'end up as a compromiser. Maybe you''ve sold the truth for the sake of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 455, 21, 25, 'friendship with someone. No. Stand for it at any cost.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 455, 22, 25, 'We can also look at this another way. Another aspect of not selling the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 455, 23, 25, 'truth means that we must give it freely, and not put a fee on it and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 455, 24, 25, 'charge people. That''s why we believe in preaching the gospel freely and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 455, 25, 25, 'never taking a collection in our meetings. One reason is this: because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 455, 26, 25, 'we don''t believe that anyone has to pay a charge, even ten cents in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 455, 27, 25, 'collection bag, in order to listen to the truth. He can come and listen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 455, 28, 25, 'comfortably knowing that there is no collection bag going to be passed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 456, 1, 25, 'around at any time during the meeting. No. It''s free. All are welcome to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 456, 2, 25, 'receive it freely. No collection is going to be taken. That''s how it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 456, 3, 25, 'must be - always offered freely. Never a charge for the truth. We don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 456, 4, 25, 'sell it. We give it freely.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 456, 5, 25, '17) Give me your heart, my son,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 456, 6, 25, 'And let your eyes delight in my ways.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 456, 7, 25, 'For a harlot is a deep pit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 456, 8, 25, 'And an adulterous woman is a narrow well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 456, 9, 25, 'Surely she lurks as a robber,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 456, 10, 25, 'And increases the faithless among men.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 456, 11, 25, 'Prov 23:26-28');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 456, 12, 25, 'We read in Proverbs 22:11 about our hearts and our mouths/speech. Here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 456, 13, 25, 'it speaks about our hearts and our eyes. In this context, it says that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 456, 14, 25, 'an adulterous woman is a deep pit. The problem with a deep pit is that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 456, 15, 25, 'you can''t climb out. A small pit you could climb out of, but a harlot or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 456, 16, 25, 'a seductive woman is a deep pit. Be careful, there are many deep pits');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 456, 17, 25, 'around you. In school, in college, in your place of work, there are deep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 456, 18, 25, 'pits - women who don''t dress properly, women who are flirting types.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 456, 19, 25, 'Think of them always as deep pits. You have to walk in the office or in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 456, 20, 25, 'your place of work so carefully. Think about how you would walk in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 456, 21, 25, 'place where there were deep pits all around you. You''d be an idiot if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 456, 22, 25, 'you just walked carelessly there. You have to be careful in relation to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 456, 23, 25, 'women too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 456, 24, 25, 'The adulterous woman is a narrow well, and there''s not much hope of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 456, 25, 25, 'anybody pulling you out of that either. She lurks as a robber - one who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 456, 26, 25, 'wants to rob you of your physical health; one who wants to rob you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 456, 27, 25, 'spiritually. She increases the number of unfaithful people among men.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 456, 28, 25, 'The number of men who are unfaithful to their wives is increased by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 457, 1, 25, 'these deep pits and these narrow wells. Be careful in your neighborhood,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 457, 2, 25, 'in your office, among your relatives, on the streets, everywhere. Be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 457, 3, 25, 'careful of these deep pits and these narrow wells, and don''t make a fool');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 457, 4, 25, 'of yourself. How should we protect ourselves? The Lord says, "Give me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 457, 5, 25, 'your heart, that you don''t allow your heart to think about these things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 457, 6, 25, 'And give me your eyes, that your eyes will be under my control." That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 457, 7, 25, 'it. Your heart and your eyes - give them to God. Then you need not fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 457, 8, 25, 'these deep pits and narrow wells anymore. Very practical instruction.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 457, 9, 25, 'This also applies to spiritual harlotry - those who fall into Babylon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 457, 10, 25, 'the harlot. That is also a deep pit and a narrow well, and it''s not easy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 457, 11, 25, 'to come out when we are in a harlot system. If God has delivered us, be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 457, 12, 25, 'careful that we don''t fall back into that all over again by the way we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 457, 13, 25, 'live.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 457, 14, 25, '18) Whose heart is filled with anguish and sorrow? Who is always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 457, 15, 25, 'fighting and quarreling? Who is the man with bloodshot eyes and many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 457, 16, 25, 'wounds? It is the one who spends long hours in the taverns, trying out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 457, 17, 25, 'new mixtures. Don''t let the sparkle and the smooth taste of strong wine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 457, 18, 25, 'deceive you. For in the end it bites like a poisonous serpent; it stings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 457, 19, 25, 'like an adder. You will see hallucinations and have delirium tremens,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 457, 20, 25, 'and you will say foolish, silly things that would embarrass you to no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 457, 21, 25, 'end when sober. You will stagger like a sailor tossed at sea, clinging');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 457, 22, 25, 'to a swaying mast. And afterwards you will say, "I didn''t even know it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 457, 23, 25, 'when they beat me up. . . . Let''s go and have another drink!"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 457, 24, 25, 'Prov 23:29-35, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 457, 25, 25, 'These verses speak about the evils of drink. Most of us probably don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 457, 26, 25, 'have any problem here, but it is a problem for many people. The word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 457, 27, 25, 'God speaks much about this evil of drinking. Jesus spoke in Luke 21:34');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 457, 28, 25, 'about our hearts being drunk. The heart gets drunk with worldliness, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 458, 1, 25, 'many believers get drunk in this way spoken of by Jesus - a drunkenness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 458, 2, 25, 'on worldliness. A drunkenness that comes one sip at a time. Slowly,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 458, 3, 25, 'slowly, slowly, slowly the heart gets weighed down with drunkenness. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 458, 4, 25, 'can apply these verses in Proverbs to that type of drunkenness too. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 458, 5, 25, 'little sip of worldliness at a time can gradually lead, as it says, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 458, 6, 25, 'biting like a snake and stinging like a viper. Your eyes will see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 458, 7, 25, 'strange things and your mind utter perverse things, and so on. And yet,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 458, 8, 25, 'though a person experiences this, he seems to still want to go for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 458, 9, 25, 'another drink after it all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 458, 10, 26, 'Chapter 24 Chapter 24');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 458, 11, 26, '19) Do not be envious of evil men,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 458, 12, 26, 'Nor desire to be with them;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 458, 13, 26, 'For their minds devise violence,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 458, 14, 26, 'And their lips talk of trouble.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 458, 15, 26, 'Prov 24:1-2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 458, 16, 26, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 458, 17, 26, 'Don''t be envious of evil people, and don''t try to make friends with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 458, 18, 26, 'them. Causing trouble is all they ever think about; every time they open');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 458, 19, 26, 'their mouth someone is going to be hurt.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 458, 20, 26, 'Prov 24:1-2, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 458, 21, 26, 'It''s very interesting that when it speaks about an evil person, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 458, 22, 26, 'speaks about the way he uses his mouth and the words that he speaks. As');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 458, 23, 26, 'human beings and children of Adam, our definition of an evil man is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 458, 24, 26, 'someone who is out to kill people or cheat people or harm people in some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 458, 25, 26, 'way. But the word of God says that a person who uses his mouth to say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 458, 26, 26, 'something bad about another person is an evil person. The thing is, our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 458, 27, 26, 'conscience is not sensitive enough. Sin has not become exceedingly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 458, 28, 26, 'sinful (Romans 7:13, KJV) so that we think of such a person as an evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 459, 1, 26, 'person. Most believers don''t think of a gossiper as an evil man who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 459, 2, 26, 'in the same category as a murderer. Why is that? Because sin has not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 459, 3, 26, 'become exceedingly sinful in their eyes. That''s why we think of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 459, 4, 26, 'murderer as an evil person, but one who speaks evil about others with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 459, 5, 26, 'his tongue, we don''t think of as an evil person. Sin must become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 459, 6, 26, 'exceedingly sinful in our eyes if we are to have the same understanding');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 459, 7, 26, 'as God''s word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 459, 8, 26, 'And don''t try to make friends with an evil man. Don''t envy a man who has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 459, 9, 26, 'certain advantages that you don''t have. We seek to follow the Lord, not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 459, 10, 26, 'to be friends with evil men.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 459, 11, 26, '20) By wisdom a house is built,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 459, 12, 26, 'And by understanding it is established;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 459, 13, 26, 'And by knowledge the rooms are filled');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 459, 14, 26, 'With all precious and pleasant riches.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 459, 15, 26, 'Prov 24:3-4');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 459, 16, 26, 'There are three words here: wisdom, understanding, and knowledge. We are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 459, 17, 26, 'told how a house is built. This can refer to God''s house, the church, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 459, 18, 26, 'our homes. Here we see that the most important requirement to build a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 459, 19, 26, 'home or a church is not knowledge. We can say that knowledge is like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 459, 20, 26, 'furniture. You put the furniture in after the house is built. So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 459, 21, 26, 'knowledge is needed. We need a knowledge of God''s word, but that is to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 459, 22, 26, 'fill the rooms after the rooms have been constructed. The rooms are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 459, 23, 26, 'filled with all pleasant and precious riches, which includes tables and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 459, 24, 26, 'chairs and beds and all that. We can say that a church which is built');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 459, 25, 26, 'with just bible knowledge - without the wisdom which comes from the fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 459, 26, 26, 'of God - is like a man who puts all his furniture out on an empty plot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 459, 27, 26, 'of land and is living there. No rooms, no roof, no walls, but he has all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 459, 28, 26, 'the furniture. He just keeps increasing the amount of furniture. That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 460, 1, 26, 'the danger of increasing in knowledge without wisdom. It''s a very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 460, 2, 26, 'beautiful picture. Think of a man trying to live on an open plot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 460, 3, 26, 'land, constantly increasing his furniture - buying expensive paintings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 460, 4, 26, 'and various things to beautify the house - and the whole thing''s exposed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 460, 5, 26, 'to the sun and the rain. It''s just as stupid to increase in knowledge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 460, 6, 26, 'without a corresponding increase in wisdom. The fear of the Lord is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 460, 7, 26, 'beginning of wisdom, and it says here it''s by wisdom that a house is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 460, 8, 26, 'built. Wisdom is the most important thing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 460, 9, 26, 'Another house we are building is our own personal life. For that also,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 460, 10, 26, 'the first requirement is wisdom. And wisdom is, we can say, God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 460, 11, 26, 'nature. We read in James 3:17 the different characteristics of wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 460, 12, 26, 'which are all a description of God''s nature. Then, after the house is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 460, 13, 26, 'built by wisdom, it''s by understanding that it is established. We can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 460, 14, 26, 'say that understanding is an understanding of God''s ways. We read in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 460, 15, 26, 'Psalm 103:7 that God made known his ways to Moses. To partake of God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 460, 16, 26, 'nature is wisdom and to understand God''s ways is understanding. Lastly,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 460, 17, 26, 'God''s word is knowledge. So we can say that God''s nature, God''s ways,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 460, 18, 26, 'and God''s word are how a house is built, established, and furnished,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 460, 19, 26, 'respectively. When we have a balance of all these, then we can say we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 460, 20, 26, 'have a house with walls, a roof, a floor, and furniture inside. Then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 460, 21, 26, 'that''s a place that can be used by people to live.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 460, 22, 26, '21) A wise man is mightier than a strong man. Wisdom is mightier than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 460, 23, 26, 'strength. Don''t go to war without wise guidance; there is safety in many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 460, 24, 26, 'counselors.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 460, 25, 26, 'Prov 24:5-6, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 460, 26, 26, 'When you are young, you are strong but not wise. In that strength of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 460, 27, 26, 'youth and zeal, a lot of foolish things can be done if wisdom does not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 460, 28, 26, 'accompany it. By young, I don''t mean young just in age, but young');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 461, 1, 26, 'spiritually. Wisdom is mightier than strength, and all that zeal of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 461, 2, 26, 'young people is not as good as the wisdom of a mature saint. So don''t go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 461, 3, 26, 'to war (don''t try to proceed in this Christian life which is a war)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 461, 4, 26, 'without wise guidance. If we ourselves are not wise, we need to seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 461, 5, 26, 'wise guidance from others in whom we have confidence. That''s a very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 461, 6, 26, 'important principle in the church. It''s not just a question of accepting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 461, 7, 26, 'somebody who claims to be an elder or thinks that he''s an elder, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 461, 8, 26, 'rather that we have confidence that someone has wisdom. Such a person we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 461, 9, 26, 'would go to for guidance. There is safety in many counselors. It''s good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 461, 10, 26, 'to humble ourselves and go and seek advice from those whom we believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 461, 11, 26, 'and have confidence that they have more wisdom than us. That''s the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 461, 12, 26, 'to conduct our warfare.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 461, 13, 26, '22) Wisdom is too exalted for a fool,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 461, 14, 26, 'He does not open his mouth in the gate.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 461, 15, 26, 'Prov 24:7');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 461, 16, 26, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 461, 17, 26, 'Wise sayings are too deep for stupid people to understand. They have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 461, 18, 26, 'nothing to say when important matters are being discussed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 461, 19, 26, 'Prov 24:7, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 461, 20, 26, 'This phrase "in the gate" is an Old Testament expression which indicates');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 461, 21, 26, 'the counsel of the elders. The elders always sat in the gate of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 461, 22, 26, 'city. "He does not open his mouth in the gate" means the fool doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 461, 23, 26, 'have anything to say (at least anything valuable to say). Of course, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 461, 24, 26, 'has a multitude of words by which his voice is known as a fool''s voice.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 461, 25, 26, 'But he has nothing important to say - nothing of content to contribute');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 461, 26, 26, 'when important matters are being discussed. Wisdom is too high for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 461, 27, 26, 'fool. In the beginning, we are all like that. Here is where we really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 461, 28, 26, 'need to pursue after wisdom, so that content increases in our lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 462, 1, 26, 'Then we can have things to contribute that can be of help to others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 462, 2, 26, '23) If you are always planning evil, you will earn a reputation as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 462, 3, 26, 'troublemaker. Any scheme a fool thinks up is sinful. People hate a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 462, 4, 26, 'person who has nothing but scorn for others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 462, 5, 26, 'Prov 24:8-9, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 462, 6, 26, 'This is particularly the case for people who don''t have wisdom, and yet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 462, 7, 26, 'are busy bodies in other people''s affairs or try to go around giving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 462, 8, 26, 'advice to others. Many young people are like that. Not even all those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 462, 9, 26, 'who have wisdom are careful here. It''s very easy to earn a reputation as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 462, 10, 26, 'a busy body and a nuisance and a constant source of trouble. It''s a very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 462, 11, 26, 'bad thing to earn a reputation like that. There we need to humble');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 462, 12, 26, 'ourselves and cleanse ourselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 462, 13, 26, 'It says here that this poor reputation comes through planning evil. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 462, 14, 26, 'other words, one is not cleansing oneself from the evil that is in one''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 462, 15, 26, 'flesh. It''s because a person is not living in self-judgment and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 462, 16, 26, 'self-cleansing that he or she goes around doing a whole lot of stupid');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 462, 17, 26, 'things with other people and other families. Gradually, over a period of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 462, 18, 26, 'time, that person begins to get a reputation for being a real nuisance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 462, 19, 26, 'But if we live in constant self-judgment and self-cleansing, we will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 462, 20, 26, 'never earn such a reputation. That''s because if we do a foolish thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 462, 21, 26, 'once, we won''t repeat it. The sad thing is when we keep on repeating the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 462, 22, 26, 'same foolish thing year after year after year.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 462, 23, 26, 'It says in verse 9, "Any scheme a fool thinks up is sinful. People hate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 462, 24, 26, 'a person who has nothing but scorn for others." When a fool thinks up a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 462, 25, 26, 'scheme, it''s sinful and it''s useless, because he''s not cleansing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 462, 26, 26, 'himself. It''s good for us to recognize that nothing good dwells in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 462, 27, 26, 'flesh. People hate a person who has nothing but scorn for others. That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 462, 28, 26, 'how the children of Adam are. It''s very difficult for us to find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 463, 1, 26, 'something to appreciate in others. It''s a pretty good test of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 463, 2, 26, 'spiritual condition - if, when you think of a particular brother or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 463, 3, 26, 'sister who is not so spiritual in your eyes (I don''t mean the ones who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 463, 4, 26, 'you think are more spiritual. It''s easy to think of something good to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 463, 5, 26, 'say about them), you can''t find even one good thing to say about them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 463, 6, 26, 'that''s an indication that you are in a pretty sad spiritual condition.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 463, 7, 26, 'That even applies for a carnal believer! Very sad. You only have scorn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 463, 8, 26, 'for that person. Think that Jesus has accepted that person and found');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 463, 9, 26, 'something good in them. He or she may not be perfect, but there we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 463, 10, 26, 'see how much the thinking of Adam governs our attitudes toward others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 463, 11, 26, 'Someone who only has scorn for others, such a person is a fool himself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 463, 12, 26, '24) If you are faint in the day of adversity,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 463, 13, 26, 'Your strength is small.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 463, 14, 26, 'Prov 24:10');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 463, 15, 26, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 463, 16, 26, 'You are a poor specimen if you can''t stand the pressure of adversity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 463, 17, 26, 'Prov 24:10, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 463, 18, 26, 'It''s in the time of testing and adversity that we really discover');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 463, 19, 26, 'whether we are strong or not. That''s one reason why God has to allow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 463, 20, 26, 'trials and adversity to come across our path: because that''s when we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 463, 21, 26, 'really discover whether we are spiritual or not. Most people, even among');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 463, 22, 26, 'believers, faint in the day of adversity. That means their strength is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 463, 23, 26, 'small. What should they do when they discover that? They should humble');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 463, 24, 26, 'themselves and say, "Lord, why did I faint in the day of adversity? That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 463, 25, 26, 'means that I was deceiving myself all along, thinking that I was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 463, 26, 26, 'spiritually strong when there was no pressure. When the pressure came, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 463, 27, 26, 'fainted, I got upset, I got irritated, I got into unrest. That proves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 463, 28, 26, 'that all my life that has been my spiritual state, and I just never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 464, 1, 26, 'discovered it. Thank God for that adversity and that trial which showed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 464, 2, 26, 'me my condition."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 464, 3, 26, 'Like Amy Carmichael said: "For a cup brimful of sweet water cannot spill');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 464, 4, 26, 'even one drop of bitter water, however suddenly jolted." If someone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 464, 5, 26, 'shakes us strongly, and out from our mouth comes all types of hard words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 464, 6, 26, 'and bitter words, what does that indicate? That indicates that all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 464, 7, 26, 'through my life, I was carrying a glass full of bitter water. I didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 464, 8, 26, 'know it, because nobody shook me till now, but when somebody shook me,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 464, 9, 26, 'then I discovered what was inside. So instead of getting upset with that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 464, 10, 26, 'person for shaking me and upsetting me, I should say, "Thank you, my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 464, 11, 26, 'dear brother, my dear friend, because through you I discovered what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 464, 12, 26, 'otherwise I would be living in self-deception about. I discovered that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 464, 13, 26, 'was carrying bitter water inside me all this time." We need to see it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 464, 14, 26, 'like that. If in the day of adversity, I faint and I fail, I am a poor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 464, 15, 26, 'specimen, the word of God says. God wants to show me to the angels and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 464, 16, 26, 'say, "See how this child of mine behaves - not when things are going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 464, 17, 26, 'easy, but see how he behaves when the pressure is on, in times of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 464, 18, 26, 'adversity - see how he speaks, how wisdom comes forth from his tongue."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 464, 19, 26, 'So dear brothers and sisters, we must take this very seriously. I don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 464, 20, 26, 'believe that anyone can be spiritual if he does not see what his true');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 464, 21, 26, 'condition is in the time of pressure and judge himself in light of that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 464, 22, 26, 'It''s so easy to deceive ourselves when there''s no pressure, thinking we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 464, 23, 26, 'are highly spiritual because we have so much knowledge. But the day of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 464, 24, 26, 'testing reveals our true condition, and we must be honest about it and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 464, 25, 26, 'humble ourselves. We should say, "Lord, help me so that the next time I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 464, 26, 26, 'face that type of pressure, my reaction will not be like that anymore!"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 464, 27, 26, 'That''s the person who''s really going to make progress from glory to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 464, 28, 26, 'glory.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 465, 1, 26, 'So we praise God for the day of adversity. We praise God that he allows');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 465, 2, 26, 'the evil day to come to us here on this earth, so that we don''t spend');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 465, 3, 26, 'our whole lives deceiving ourselves. Think about if we just had a smooth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 465, 4, 26, 'life. So many believers would like to have a smooth passage through life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 465, 5, 26, '- no trials, no testing, nobody backbites against them, no one says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 465, 6, 26, 'anything against them, everything is easy, no financial difficulty, no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 465, 7, 26, 'sickness, no nothing. We can live 50 years and think we are spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 465, 8, 26, 'and wake up at the judgment seat of Christ to discover perhaps that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 465, 9, 26, 'are not even converted - or if we are converted, that we are thoroughly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 465, 10, 26, 'carnal. Isn''t it good that God doesn''t allow us to be deceived for 50');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 465, 11, 26, 'years? He shakes us up after five or ten years. He allows some situation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 465, 12, 26, 'which makes us collapse into unrest and irritability and grumbling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 465, 13, 26, 'against God and against people. God is saying, "I love you. I''m just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 465, 14, 26, 'trying to show you your true condition so that you don''t deceive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 465, 15, 26, 'yourself. I''ve come to help you so that you can do something about it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 465, 16, 26, 'before you stand at the judgment seat of Christ." And we should say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 465, 17, 26, '"Thank you, Lord. Thank you for that trial. It''s helped me to see my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 465, 18, 26, 'condition. I really want to cleanse myself. I really want to make use of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 465, 19, 26, 'this opportunity so that in the days to come, before I leave this earth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 465, 20, 26, 'I''ve really partaken of your nature." Praise God for the day of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 465, 21, 26, 'adversity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 465, 22, 26, '25) Don''t hesitate to rescue someone who is about to be executed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 465, 23, 26, 'unjustly. You may say that it is none of your business, but God knows');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 465, 24, 26, 'and judges your motives. He keeps watch on you; he knows. And he will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 465, 25, 26, 'reward you according to what you do.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 465, 26, 26, 'Prov 24:11-12, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 465, 27, 26, 'God knows that you knew some person was innocent, and yet you allowed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 465, 28, 26, 'him to be judged in the court. Now he''s going out to be hanged. You know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 466, 1, 26, 'he didn''t commit the murder, but you keep quiet because the whole crowd');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 466, 2, 26, 'says he''s guilty. We can think of when Jesus was crucified, and how the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 466, 3, 26, 'whole crowd said, "Crucify him, crucify him!" Think of a mob shouting,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 466, 4, 26, '"Crucify him!" And you are one wholehearted disciple there, and you know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 466, 5, 26, 'Jesus is not guilty. Think of being able to raise a voice in the middle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 466, 6, 26, 'of that mob and say, "No! Don''t crucify him, because he''s not guilty."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 466, 7, 26, 'That mob might crucify you if you do that. It''s not easy to take a stand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 466, 8, 26, 'for something that''s unpopular. It''s not easy to take a stand when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 466, 9, 26, 'everybody else is saying something wrong. It''s not easy to be willing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 466, 10, 26, 'be unpopular for the sake of the truth. But God knows and he will reward');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 466, 11, 26, 'you according to what you do. Don''t join the crowd. Be willing to stand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 466, 12, 26, 'distinct.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 466, 13, 26, 'That''s a word for children in schools and colleges and for those working');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 466, 14, 26, 'in offices. If all the mob is saying one thing and you know it''s wrong,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 466, 15, 26, 'be willing to stand against it. Say, "No, it''s wrong to treat that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 466, 16, 26, 'person like that." We don''t have to give an opinion on everything in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 466, 17, 26, 'office or everything that''s happening under the sun. But when you find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 466, 18, 26, 'particularly that someone who is innocent is being accused and is going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 466, 19, 26, 'to be punished, there we have a right and an obligation to stand up for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 466, 20, 26, 'the truth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 466, 21, 26, 'Of course, this has many other applications regarding our willingness to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 466, 22, 26, 'be unpopular. The vast majority of Christians need to be unpopular for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 466, 23, 26, 'the sake of the truth. I do not believe God will ever use a man in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 466, 24, 26, 'service who is afraid of becoming unpopular for the sake of the truth. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 466, 25, 26, 'just want to tell you that the vast majority of Christian preachers are.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 466, 26, 26, 'They are unwilling to be unpopular for the sake of the truth. Popularity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 466, 27, 26, 'and what the crowd says means so much to them. Therefore God puts them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 466, 28, 26, 'on the shelf and says, "You can''t be my servant."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 467, 1, 26, '26) My son, honey whets the appetite and so does wisdom! When you enjoy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 467, 2, 26, 'becoming wise, there is hope for you! A bright future lies ahead!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 467, 3, 26, 'Prov 24:13-14, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 467, 4, 26, 'This verse compares wisdom to honey. Honey was the thing which was used');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 467, 5, 26, 'to sweeten foods in those days when there was no refined sugar or jam or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 467, 6, 26, 'other sweeteners. Honey was the big thing. You can imagine how much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 467, 7, 26, 'honey meant in a day when there were no chocolates or ice cream or jams');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 467, 8, 26, 'or any such things. It says our desire for wisdom should be like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 467, 9, 26, 'And when you enjoy becoming wise and say, "Lord, I don''t want to be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 467, 10, 26, 'fool. I want to become wise!"; when you really long for wisdom; when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 467, 11, 26, 'you''re willing to receive correction and you''re willing to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 467, 12, 26, 'disciplined by the Lord, then there is a beautiful promise: there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 467, 13, 26, 'hope for you! There is hope for you! A bright future lies ahead. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 467, 14, 26, 'know, we like to say there''s hope for everybody. But there isn''t hope');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 467, 15, 26, 'for everybody. There is hope for those who enjoy becoming wise - not for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 467, 16, 26, 'anybody and everybody.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 467, 17, 26, 'When it speaks about enjoying becoming wise, we must enjoy the process');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 467, 18, 26, 'by which God makes us wise and be willing to accept it. It is through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 467, 19, 26, 'the cross that God leads us to wisdom, and we must be willing to accept');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 467, 20, 26, 'it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 467, 21, 26, '27) O evil man, leave the upright man alone and quit trying to cheat him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 467, 22, 26, 'out of his rights. Don''t you know that this good man, though you trip');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 467, 23, 26, 'him up seven times, will each time rise again? But one calamity is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 467, 24, 26, 'enough to lay you low.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 467, 25, 26, 'Prov 24:15-16, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 467, 26, 26, 'This is a wonderful encouragement for those who are seeking to live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 467, 27, 26, 'before God''s face - those who are humble and who are righteous. Even if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 467, 28, 26, 'they fall seven times, they will get up. Seven is the number of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 468, 1, 26, 'perfection. We can say this verse actually means any number of times.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 468, 2, 26, 'It''s like a rubber ball which you throw down - not like a stone which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 468, 3, 26, 'you throw down and it just lies there. If you throw a rubber ball down,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 468, 4, 26, 'it doesn''t stay there. It bounces up! Again if you throw it down, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 468, 5, 26, 'bounces up. That''s how a righteous man is. In other words, he''s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 468, 6, 26, 'discouraged, he''s not depressed, he''s not down in the dumps when he has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 468, 7, 26, 'fallen. He gets up! That''s how we must be. If we''ve fallen, we must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 468, 8, 26, 'humble ourselves, repent, mourn, cry out to God for mercy and grace, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 468, 9, 26, 'bounce up! That''s the mark of a righteous man. He falls seven times or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 468, 10, 26, 'any number of times, and he rises again. But the wicked falls one time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 468, 11, 26, 'and that''s enough.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 468, 12, 26, 'We read in Psalm 37:23-24 the reason why the righteous man is lifted up:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 468, 13, 26, '"The steps of a man are established by the Lord, and he delights in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 468, 14, 26, 'way; when he falls, he shall not be hurled headlong, because the Lord is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 468, 15, 26, 'the one who holds his hand." Even this righteous man will fall. The man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 468, 16, 26, 'whose steps are established by the Lord can fall, because in some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 468, 17, 26, 'situation, he''s not so faithful. But he will not be hurled headlong.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 468, 18, 26, 'That means his head - the most sensitive part of his body - won''t crash.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 468, 19, 26, 'And in this connection he says, "I''ve been young and now I''m old, yet I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 468, 20, 26, 'have not seen the righteous forsaken." He says he has not seen a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 468, 21, 26, 'situation where the Lord did not hold a righteous man''s hand. Think of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 468, 22, 26, 'that, brothers and sisters. It''s because the Lord holds my hand that my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 468, 23, 26, 'head doesn''t crash. And that''s why it''s so important to remain in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 468, 24, 26, 'place of humility with a clear conscience, where the Lord can hold my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 468, 25, 26, 'hand. Then, even if I fall, he lifts me up. I fall and he lifts me up.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 468, 26, 26, 'Praise God for that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 468, 27, 26, 'There''s a beautiful verse in Romans 14:4. I don''t know if you''ve noticed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 468, 28, 26, 'it. Very beautiful verse/phrase. The context is judging a weaker');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 469, 1, 26, 'brother. You are a strong brother, spiritually, and you judge a weaker');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 469, 2, 26, 'brother. "Who are you to judge the servant of another?" he says. "To his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 469, 3, 26, 'own master he stands or falls; and he will stand, because the Lord is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 469, 4, 26, 'able to make him stand." That''s the same thing we read here in Proverbs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 469, 5, 26, 'That weaker brother will stand. Don''t be a fool to criticize him. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 469, 6, 26, 'Lord will make him stand one day, and you''ll look like a fool then.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 469, 7, 26, '28) Do not lie in wait, O wicked man, against the dwelling of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 469, 8, 26, 'righteous;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 469, 9, 26, 'Do not destroy his resting place;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 469, 10, 26, 'Prov 24:15');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 469, 11, 26, 'and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 469, 12, 26, 'Do not rejoice when your enemy falls,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 469, 13, 26, 'And do not let your heart be glad when he stumbles;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 469, 14, 26, 'Or the Lord will see it and be displeased,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 469, 15, 26, 'And turn His anger away from him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 469, 16, 26, 'Prov 24:17-18');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 469, 17, 26, 'What does it mean to lie in wait? It says about Jesus that the Pharisees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 469, 18, 26, 'were always waiting to catch him in his words. Who is the person who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 469, 19, 26, 'lies in wait for the righteous man to fall? Do you know that whenever a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 469, 20, 26, 'person preaches victory over sin wholeheartedly, with all of his heart -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 469, 21, 26, 'not just with a weak, timid voice, but wholeheartedly - there are many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 469, 22, 26, 'believers who don''t like it and call it heresy, because they themselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 469, 23, 26, 'are defeated. Do you know what such believers are waiting for? They are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 469, 24, 26, 'waiting for this man who preaches victory to fall. And what does the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 469, 25, 26, 'Bible, the word of God, call someone who lies in wait for a righteous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 469, 26, 26, 'man to fall? A wicked man! Is he a believer? Far from it. He''s a wicked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 469, 27, 26, 'man! Whenever you wait for someone to fall, you''re a wicked person! That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 469, 28, 26, 'can happen. You don''t like something in someone, and then he falls and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 470, 1, 26, 'you are a bit happy. You are a wicked person! Don''t call yourself a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 470, 2, 26, 'believer. You are a wicked person waiting for someone to fall.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 470, 3, 26, 'It goes on to say in verses 17-18, "Don''t rejoice when your enemy falls,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 470, 4, 26, 'and do not let your heart be glad when he stumbles; or the Lord will see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 470, 5, 26, 'it..." Do you think the Lord doesn''t see it? Do you think the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 470, 6, 26, 'doesn''t see that little spark of delight that came into your heart when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 470, 7, 26, 'someone else fell? Instead of being grieved, you were a little happy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 470, 8, 26, 'when some misfortune came upon someone with whom you didn''t have a good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 470, 9, 26, 'relationship. Beware of that, brothers and sisters. Who is our enemy in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 470, 10, 26, 'this verse? It could be a brother in the church with whom your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 470, 11, 26, 'relationship is a little bit cold. That can happen to any of us,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 470, 12, 26, 'particularly when that person has done or said something against us. Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 470, 13, 26, 'you know what we should do when that happens? This is what I do. I say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 470, 14, 26, '"Lord, help me here! Help me in my relationship with this person,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 470, 15, 26, 'because I fear that I will fall!" Take that seriously. It''s very, very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 470, 16, 26, 'dangerous when you are a righteous person and someone has done something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 470, 17, 26, 'against you. You need to cry out to God for help in such a situation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 470, 18, 26, 'that there will not even be a slight discoloration in your attitude');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 470, 19, 26, 'toward that person. That will show that you''re a God-fearing man or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 470, 20, 26, 'woman. Have you cried out like that? I''ve done that. If I heard someone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 470, 21, 26, 'had said something or did something against me, I would say, "O my God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 470, 22, 26, 'please help me now!" It''s easy to say I have nothing against him and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 470, 23, 26, 'that may be true, but I don''t fully know the corruption that dwells in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 470, 24, 26, 'my flesh. "Please help me Lord that I shall now behave like Jesus Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 470, 25, 26, 'toward that person from now on. Let me be careful to really behave like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 470, 26, 26, 'Jesus toward that particular person." Otherwise, I''ll pollute myself,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 470, 27, 26, 'I''ll corrupt myself, and I''ll just go around like a humbug and a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 470, 28, 26, 'hypocrite, having a good testimony and saying I have nothing against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 471, 1, 26, 'anybody. Humbug! It''s so easy for wrong attitudes to come and that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 471, 2, 26, 'happened in our midst, brothers and sisters. You know it''s happened to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 471, 3, 26, 'you. And why did it happen? Because you think you are strong. If you had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 471, 4, 26, 'a sense of your own weakness and cried out to God for help, God would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 471, 5, 26, 'have helped you and you wouldn''t have fallen. But you fell into a wrong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 471, 6, 26, 'attitude which eventually came out in words.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 471, 7, 26, 'When will we learn? When will we learn?! How many years have gone by and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 471, 8, 26, 'we still haven''t realized that we are so weak and so corrupt that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 471, 9, 26, 'need to cry out to God for help immediately. That was why God heard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 471, 10, 26, 'Jesus'' prayers. He was so weak that he cried out for help all the time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 471, 11, 26, 'because he feared sinning even in a wrong attitude, even in a slight');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 471, 12, 26, 'discoloration or unloving attitude toward another person. Very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 471, 13, 26, 'important. Do not rejoice when your enemy falls. Do not let your heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 471, 14, 26, 'be glad when he stumbles, lest the Lord see it. He sees it and he''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 471, 15, 26, 'displeased! With whom? The person that fell? No. Displeased with this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 471, 16, 26, 'person who is watching, who has been lying in wait. He will no longer be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 471, 17, 26, 'angry with that person for falling, but will be angry with me now for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 471, 18, 26, 'lying in wait and rejoicing when he fell.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 471, 19, 26, 'You see, this spirit of vengeance is there very deeply in our flesh.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 471, 20, 26, 'When someone has done something against me or said something against me,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 471, 21, 26, 'I need to realize how weak I am at that moment. "Lord, vengeance dwells');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 471, 22, 26, 'in my flesh. Please help me!" We won''t take revenge by killing him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 471, 23, 26, 'We''re not so crude. It''s in subtle ways. It can just be in being a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 471, 24, 26, 'little happy when he falls. It''s the same spirit as that man who commits');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 471, 25, 26, 'murder in vengeance. No different. The only thing is, we don''t go that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 471, 26, 26, 'far. We stop with just a little delight when something goes wrong with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 471, 27, 26, 'that person who''s done something against us. He who has ears to hear let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 471, 28, 26, 'him hear. He who is interested in keeping his heart clean, who wants a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 472, 1, 26, 'testimony from his conscience - not a testimony from people - let him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 472, 2, 26, 'hear. Remember this, my dear brothers and sisters: we are MOST IN DANGER');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 472, 3, 26, 'when someone has said or done something against us. We are in danger of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 472, 4, 26, 'really becoming polluted in our heart toward that person, unless we live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 472, 5, 26, 'in fear and cry out to God to help us in our weakness. Let no one think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 472, 6, 26, 'that he will stand, because on his own he will fall. Very important.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 472, 7, 26, 'This vengeance comes out in so many ways. SO MANY WAYS I TELL YOU! If we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 472, 8, 26, 'get light on it, we will see how husbands take revenge on their wives -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 472, 9, 26, 'not by killing them. You read about people who burn their wives, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 472, 10, 26, 'the wives didn''t bring dowry. We shrink back and say, "Oh, how terrible!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 472, 11, 26, 'I would never do such a thing!" But we can take revenge on our wives in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 472, 12, 26, 'so many other ways without burning them. It''s the same spirit that made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 472, 13, 26, 'that fellow burn his wife! We do it in more refined ways where the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 472, 14, 26, 'police can''t catch us. But God sees it. Why did you say that to your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 472, 15, 26, 'wife or husband? Wasn''t that revenge for what he/she did yesterday or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 472, 16, 26, 'what he/she said the day before yesterday? Revenge. Maybe you serve the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 472, 17, 26, 'food late or cold, purposefully. So many things. And of course, you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 472, 18, 26, 'excuses for it (e.g., I have so much other work to do), but you know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 472, 19, 26, 'that''s not the real reason. It''s subtly trying to hit back. The New and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 472, 20, 26, 'Living Way type of hitting back. Humbug! Hypocrisy! Deception! Brothers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 472, 21, 26, 'and sisters, ask God for light on all these things. I find that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 472, 22, 26, 'vengeance is something that doesn''t go away easily. It can manifest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 472, 23, 26, 'itself in so many subtle ways if we don''t see our weakness here and cry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 472, 24, 26, 'out for help. Against our own children we can take vengeance, and they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 472, 25, 26, 'are helpless. A wife or husband can hit back, but what about children?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 472, 26, 26, 'They can''t hit back. We can take revenge on them, because they made life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 472, 27, 26, 'inconvenient for us in some way. So many things! Or against brothers and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 472, 28, 26, 'sisters. Let not someone think that he is free from this danger. We are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 473, 1, 26, 'all in tremendous danger in this area. If we don''t realize our weakness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 473, 2, 26, 'and cry out for help, we shall fall.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 473, 3, 26, '29) Do not fret because of evildoers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 473, 4, 26, 'Or be envious of the wicked;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 473, 5, 26, 'For there will be no future for the evil man;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 473, 6, 26, 'The lamp of the wicked will be put out.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 473, 7, 26, 'Prov 24:19-20');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 473, 8, 26, 'Here we see again the same thing mentioned in Proverbs 24:1 - the danger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 473, 9, 26, 'of being envious because of another person who''s unrighteous. Let''s say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 473, 10, 26, 'somebody who''s unrighteous in the office who seems to have it easier.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 473, 11, 26, 'Life is so difficult for you, because you are righteous. You won''t give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 473, 12, 26, 'money for that Hindu festival, so life becomes a little more difficult');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 473, 13, 26, 'for you. It would be easier if you were unrighteous and gave money for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 473, 14, 26, 'that Hindu festival. Don''t be envious, because there is no future for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 473, 15, 26, 'that evil man. Finally, the lamp of the wicked will be put out. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 473, 16, 26, 'better to suffer a little and stand for righteousness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 473, 17, 26, 'Psalm 17:13-14 (The Living Bible) says, "Lord, arise and stand against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 473, 18, 26, 'them. Push them back! Come and save me from these men of the world whose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 473, 19, 26, 'only concern is earthly gain-these men whom you have filled with your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 473, 20, 26, 'treasures so that their children and grandchildren are rich and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 473, 21, 26, 'prosperous." Yes, God has allowed them, their children, and their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 473, 22, 26, 'grandchildren to be rich and prosperous. But then David says, "But as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 473, 23, 26, 'for me, my contentment is not in wealth but in seeing you and knowing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 473, 24, 26, 'all is well between us. And when I awake in heaven, I will be fully');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 473, 25, 26, 'satisfied, for I will see you face-to-face" (verse 15). Blessed is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 473, 26, 26, 'New Covenant brother who can say what that Old Covenant brother said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 473, 27, 26, 'with lesser light: never to compare our lot with the unrighteous man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 473, 28, 26, '30) Have reverence for the Lord, my child, and honor the king. Have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 474, 1, 26, 'nothing to do with people who rebel against them; such people could be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 474, 2, 26, 'ruined in a moment. Do you realize the disaster that God or the king can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 474, 3, 26, 'cause?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 474, 4, 26, 'Prov 24:21-22, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 474, 5, 26, 'This means: fear God first and submit to secular authority. It may not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 474, 6, 26, 'be the king. It may be the boss in your office. Honor him. Fear the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 474, 7, 26, 'and the king. And listen to this - a word for our day: "Have nothing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 474, 8, 26, 'do with people who rebel against God or who rebel against the boss."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 474, 9, 26, 'Don''t have fellowship with them. That''s why I say it''s very dangerous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 474, 10, 26, 'for a Christian to join a trade union if it involves the spirit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 474, 11, 26, 'rebellion against authority. This is the last statement he mentions in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 474, 12, 26, 'the thirty wise sayings: have nothing to do with the spirit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 474, 13, 26, 'rebellion. Be careful about rebellion against your parents. Your father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 474, 14, 26, 'is king in the home. Children, be careful that you don''t rebel against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 474, 15, 26, 'your father or mother. Be careful, wives, that you don''t rebel against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 474, 16, 26, 'the one whom God has placed as king over you in your house. I don''t know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 474, 17, 26, 'how many wives see their husbands as the king God has placed over them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 474, 18, 26, 'Be careful. Have nothing to do with that spirit of rebellion.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 474, 19, 26, 'Rebellion can also be found in the church. We read about Korah, Dathan,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 474, 20, 26, 'and Abiram who stood against Moses. They said, "Who does this Moses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 474, 21, 26, 'think he is? He''s not the only one through whom God speaks. God speaks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 474, 22, 26, 'through us also." Moses just kept quiet and fell on his face. And God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 474, 23, 26, 'said, "Alright, I''ll teach these fellas a lesson. I''ll teach them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 474, 24, 26, 'through whom I speak." And Moses said, "Let all the congregation of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 474, 25, 26, 'Israel stand back." And that''s the only case recorded in the Bible where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 474, 26, 26, 'a man went alive into Hell. Korah, Dathan, and Abiram. Alive into Hell.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 474, 27, 26, 'Just like how Enoch and Elijah went straight up to heaven. There''s only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 474, 28, 26, 'one case of that in the scriptures and it was the result of the spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 475, 1, 26, 'of rebellion against authority. Be careful, be careful. It''s good to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 475, 2, 26, 'humble ourselves before God. Be careful because this spirit of rebellion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 475, 3, 26, 'is spreading all over homes, schools, colleges, factories, and churches');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 475, 4, 26, 'everywhere. We have to be careful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 475, 5, 26, 'Here are some additional proverbs:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 475, 6, 26, 'It is wrong to sentence the poor and let the rich go free. He who says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 475, 7, 26, 'to the wicked, "You are innocent," shall be cursed by many people of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 475, 8, 26, 'many nations; but blessings shall be showered on those who rebuke sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 475, 9, 26, 'fearlessly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 475, 10, 26, 'Prov 24:23-25, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 475, 11, 26, 'That''s a wonderful word for those who preach the word of God: "Blessings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 475, 12, 26, 'will be showered on those who rebuke sin fearlessly." That''s our calling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 475, 13, 26, 'in the church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 475, 14, 26, 'Verse 23 in the New American Standard Bible says, "To show partiality in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 475, 15, 26, 'showing judgment is not good." It''s very easy to be partial. Just like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 475, 16, 26, 'vengeance, as I discussed earlier quite strongly, dwells very close to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 475, 17, 26, 'us in our flesh. I also want to say the spirit of partiality is very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 475, 18, 26, 'close to us in our flesh. We like certain brothers and we don''t like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 475, 19, 26, 'certain brothers. We like certain sisters and we don''t like certain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 475, 20, 26, 'sisters. And when there is conflict between those two, unconsciously we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 475, 21, 26, 'take the side of the one whom we like. Why? Because we don''t have the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 475, 22, 26, 'divine nature which is impartial. We live according to our Adamic nature');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 475, 23, 26, 'which is partial. "I like this brother, so he must be right. I don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 475, 24, 26, 'like that brother, so he must be wrong." I''ve seen that. I''ve seen that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 475, 25, 26, 'right in the midst of the church. I''ve seen a brother come and tell me a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 475, 26, 26, 'complaint against another brother. Yes, what that other brother did was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 475, 27, 26, 'wrong, but I could sense that this brother didn''t like that other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 475, 28, 26, 'brother. That''s why he was making this complaint. Then a few weeks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 476, 1, 26, 'later, I found this brother facing the same situation with another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 476, 2, 26, 'brother and then, of course, he had no complaint at all - even though a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 476, 3, 26, 'similar situation occurred. I said, "Now I know why there''s no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 476, 4, 26, 'complaint: because he likes that brother. That''s why there''s no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 476, 5, 26, 'complaint." When the first brother had done this thing, he had a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 476, 6, 26, 'complaint. But now, it''s a brother he likes who did it, so it''s alright.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 476, 7, 26, '"We have to bear with one another in love. We have to forgive," he would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 476, 8, 26, 'say. That''s an example of partiality. How long are we going to take to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 476, 9, 26, 'cleanse ourselves from it? When in the world are we going to get light');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 476, 10, 26, 'on it? If we haven''t gotten light after sitting in the church for so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 476, 11, 26, 'many years, I would say that chances are we won''t get light even in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 476, 12, 26, 'next fifty years. The light has shown pretty brightly in our midst all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 476, 13, 26, 'these years, and if we still haven''t gotten light, when are we going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 476, 14, 26, 'wake up? Take that seriously, brothers and sisters. To show partiality');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 476, 15, 26, 'is evil, and in making a judgment, it''s so easy to be partial. We have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 476, 16, 26, 'to cry out to God, "Help me, Lord, to form a right assessment here!"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 476, 17, 26, 'Verse 23 in the Good News Translation says, "It is wrong for judges to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 476, 18, 26, 'be prejudiced." To be prejudiced means to have a little more weight');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 476, 19, 26, 'toward one person than another. What would you think of a Christian who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 476, 20, 26, 'was selling vegetables or fruit in a shop, and he put a little extra');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 476, 21, 26, 'weight underneath the vegetables and fruit so that he doesn''t have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 476, 22, 26, 'sell as much? But the same brother talks about the New and Living Way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 476, 23, 26, 'He''s a humbug! Well, you are a humbug too when you have a little extra');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 476, 24, 26, 'weight toward one brother over another in forming an assessment. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 476, 25, 26, 'the same thing. That is prejudice: to have a little weight in favor of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 476, 26, 26, 'one person over another. You who tell another person that he''s a humbug,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 476, 27, 26, 'aren''t you being a humbug yourself?! There''s great safety in judging');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 476, 28, 26, 'ourselves alone and not being a busybody in other peoples'' matters.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 477, 1, 26, 'Wonderful. This is the way of salvation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 477, 2, 26, 'He kisses the lips');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 477, 3, 26, 'Who gives a right answer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 477, 4, 26, 'Prov 24:26');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 477, 5, 26, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 477, 6, 26, 'An honest answer is a sign of true friendship.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 477, 7, 26, 'Prov 24:26, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 477, 8, 26, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 477, 9, 26, 'It is an honor to receive a frank reply.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 477, 10, 26, 'Prov 24:26, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 477, 11, 26, 'Kissing the lips is used as a metaphor for intimate friendship. It means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 477, 12, 26, 'that when you speak the truth to somebody, that is the sign that you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 477, 13, 26, 'a real friend to that person. If you''re a diplomat, always beating');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 477, 14, 26, 'around the bush, never telling the person the truth, you''re not his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 477, 15, 26, 'friend at all. A real friend is one who speaks the truth straight. An');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 477, 16, 26, 'honest answer is a sign of true friendship. "Brother, do you think what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 477, 17, 26, 'I shared in the meeting was too long?" "Yes, it was too long and very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 477, 18, 26, 'boring also. You just kept repeating the same thing so many times. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 477, 19, 26, 'need to cleanse yourself from that." That''s a sign of true friendship:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 477, 20, 26, 'an honest answer. Instead of "Yeah, brother, it''s good. We appreciated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 477, 21, 26, 'it," and all this humbug. No. We need to learn to be honest with each');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 477, 22, 26, 'other and get over all this diplomacy. Walk in the light. That''s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 477, 23, 26, 'secret of fellowship.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 477, 24, 26, 'Prepare your work outside');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 477, 25, 26, 'And make it ready for yourself in the field;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 477, 26, 26, 'Afterwards, then, build your house.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 477, 27, 26, 'Prov 24:27');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 477, 28, 26, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 478, 1, 26, 'Don''t build your house and establish a home until your fields are ready,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 478, 2, 26, 'and you are sure that you can earn a living.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 478, 3, 26, 'Prov 24:27, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 478, 4, 26, 'This is a wonderful word for those who are planning to get married -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 478, 5, 26, 'particularly men. This is clear, isn''t it? In those days, the only way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 478, 6, 26, 'they earned a living was through working in fields. He says not to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 478, 7, 26, 'establish a home unless you''re sure that you can earn a living.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 478, 8, 26, 'We can say that this also could apply to the fact that we need to think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 478, 9, 26, 'of our necessities first and luxuries afterwards. To earn a living is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 478, 10, 26, 'necessity, and marriage can be a luxury. The necessity must come first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 478, 11, 26, 'so that we don''t become beggars. We seek to find support for ourselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 478, 12, 26, 'But you say, "It''s so difficult these days with so much unemployment in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 478, 13, 26, 'our country." I''ll tell you one group of people who will never have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 478, 14, 26, 'problem in this area: those who obey Matthew 6:33 which says, "Seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 478, 15, 26, 'first the kingdom of God and his righteousness and ALL your material');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 478, 16, 26, 'needs will be added to you." This applies even where unemployment is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 478, 17, 26, 'very high. That''s the solution to unemployment. Seek first the kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 478, 18, 26, 'of God and his righteousness and all your material needs will be added');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 478, 19, 26, 'to you. Then God will give you a wife as well. So that''s the way. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 478, 20, 26, 'marriage, we must be established financially first. Otherwise, we can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 478, 21, 26, 'like the man who Jesus said started to build a tower but didn''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 478, 22, 26, 'enough to finish. Some will say, "Yeah, I''ll get married and trust the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 478, 23, 26, 'Lord." This phrase, "Trust the Lord" has become so abused and devalued.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 478, 24, 26, 'Halfway through, the man could not complete the tower, and now he has to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 478, 25, 26, 'beg and borrow and he gets into all types of problems. Be wise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 478, 26, 26, 'Don''t give evidence against others without good reason, or say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 478, 27, 26, 'misleading things about them. Don''t say, "I''ll do to them just what they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 478, 28, 26, 'did to me! I''ll get even with them!"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 479, 1, 26, 'Prov 24:28-29, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 479, 2, 26, 'Here again is the spirit of vengeance - that when you''re asked to give a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 479, 3, 26, 'testimony in a court, you say, "Now is my chance to really paint it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 479, 4, 26, 'black! I won''t tell any lies, but I''ll color it in such a way that it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 479, 5, 26, 'will really put him in a difficult situation." That can happen. You may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 479, 6, 26, 'not go to court, but we can have other applications for this. Sometimes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 479, 7, 26, 'we don''t have a very good relationship with someone - you''re a bit cold');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 479, 8, 26, 'toward someone or someone is a bit cold toward you. Let''s say you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 479, 9, 26, 'called in some situation to talk to a brother, and the topic of brother');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 479, 10, 26, 'X comes up, with whom you don''t have a very good relationship. Then, of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 479, 11, 26, 'course, we point out something we saw, some stupid thing that brother X');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 479, 12, 26, 'did which we have retained in our file to bring out at the right time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 479, 13, 26, 'That''s because I want to take my vengeance, and I can''t say something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 479, 14, 26, 'good. "I''ll do to him what he has done to me." Beware of that spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 479, 15, 26, 'Beware of that demonic, evil, Luciferian spirit: "I''ll do to him as he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 479, 16, 26, 'did to me." That''s a million miles away, on the other side of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 479, 17, 26, 'universe, from the spirit of Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 479, 18, 26, 'I passed by the field of the sluggard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 479, 19, 26, 'And by the vineyard of the man lacking sense,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 479, 20, 26, 'And behold, it was completely overgrown with thistles;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 479, 21, 26, 'Its surface was covered with nettles,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 479, 22, 26, 'And its stone wall was broken down.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 479, 23, 26, 'When I saw, I reflected upon it;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 479, 24, 26, 'I looked, and received instruction.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 479, 25, 26, '"A little sleep, a little slumber,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 479, 26, 26, 'A little folding of the hands to rest,"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 479, 27, 26, 'Then your poverty will come as a robber');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 479, 28, 26, 'And your want like an armed man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 480, 1, 26, 'Prov 24:30-34');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 480, 2, 26, 'When Solomon saw this lazy man''s field, what did he do? I can tell you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 480, 3, 26, 'what he did not do: he did not criticize this lazy man. Praise God! He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 480, 4, 26, 'judged himself! He learned a lesson for himself! He reflected upon it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 480, 5, 26, 'and learned a lesson for himself. We have to learn from the follies of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 480, 6, 26, 'others. I want to say to all young people: when you see another young');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 480, 7, 26, 'brother or sister doing a stupid thing, and as a result, over a period');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 480, 8, 26, 'of time, that person loses their testimony in the church - there are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 480, 9, 26, 'weeds and thorns in their testimony and walls are broken down - what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 480, 10, 26, 'should you do? Don''t waste your time criticizing that person. Solomon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 480, 11, 26, 'didn''t criticize. There''s no use criticizing. Just sit down and think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 480, 12, 26, 'about it and say, "Lord, I have a flesh exactly like that person. Help');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 480, 13, 26, 'me that I don''t go around and become such a fool myself with weeds and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 480, 14, 26, 'thorns growing all over and walls broken down. Help me!" Reflect on it!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 480, 15, 26, 'It''s good to think about these things when we see them - to look and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 480, 16, 26, 'learn. Learn from the mistakes of others, so that you don''t make the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 480, 17, 26, 'same mistakes yourself. We can learn from mistakes, but it''s far better');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 480, 18, 26, 'if we learn from the mistakes we see other people making. Then we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 480, 19, 26, 'avoid making them ourselves. The wise person is the person who observes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 480, 20, 26, 'the blunders and follies of others and says to himself, "I don''t have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 480, 21, 26, 'make the same mistake myself, because I saw that person do it." Think of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 480, 22, 26, 'how many things we can save ourselves from. In so many areas in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 480, 23, 26, 'world, we are careful. We see somebody doing a stupid thing, and we make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 480, 24, 26, 'sure that we don''t do it ourselves. How much more careful should we be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 480, 25, 26, 'in the area of the spiritual life? It says in verse 32 in The Living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 480, 26, 26, 'Bible, "I learned…" Beautiful phrase: I learned. We can say a wise man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 480, 27, 26, 'is one who observes the follies of foolish people and learns from them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 480, 28, 26, 'And a foolish person is one who does not observe the good qualities in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 481, 1, 26, 'wise people and learn from them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 481, 2, 26, 'What are these thorns mentioned? We can say they are the lusts that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 481, 3, 26, 'overpower a person, because he''s been lazy. He''s not been wholehearted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 481, 4, 26, 'in judging himself. He''s been careless. And what''s the wall? We can say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 481, 5, 26, 'the wall represents God''s commandments - like we see with Nehemiah''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 481, 6, 26, 'wall representing the commandments of God. Many bricks make up a wall.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 481, 7, 26, 'Here is a person who has been careless in his attitude towards God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 481, 8, 26, 'commandments, and the wall is broken down. Learn a lesson. Learn a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 481, 9, 26, 'lesson from the final fate which comes upon such people - the spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 481, 10, 26, 'poverty that people finally come into. Their poverty has come upon them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 481, 11, 26, 'suddenly like a robber and violently like a bandit. Suddenly you hear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 481, 12, 26, 'someone has fallen! Suddenly you see someone flaring up and losing his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 481, 13, 26, 'temper! Poverty! Spiritual poverty! Suddenly it comes! Not slowly, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 481, 14, 26, 'suddenly. Because the person has been lazy in judging himself all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 481, 15, 26, 'through his life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 481, 16, 26, 'I remember hearing of a brother who had responsibility in one of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 481, 17, 26, 'churches in Europe, and he was much respected. But he was not working on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 481, 18, 26, 'his own salvation and one day, his folly became manifest to everybody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 481, 19, 26, 'because he publicly lost his temper. That was all. One event. One time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 481, 20, 26, 'of publicly losing one''s temper is enough for God to reveal a person''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 481, 21, 26, 'folly to everyone and to indicate to the whole world that this person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 481, 22, 26, 'was not working on his own salvation in his private life despite all his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 481, 23, 26, 'knowledge of the New and Living Way. And that brother was a man who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 481, 24, 26, 'could explain the New and Living Way better than you or me. He was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 481, 25, 26, 'teacher. He was a man who was respected and had a wonderful family with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 481, 26, 26, 'God-fearing children. He lost his testimony by flaring up once and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 481, 27, 26, 'losing his temper. What does this indicate? It''s not just a question of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 481, 28, 26, 'him losing his temper one time. It''s an indication of a serious problem');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 482, 1, 26, 'that''s been there for years! That the person was not working on his own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 482, 2, 26, 'salvation and judging himself. He had high thoughts about himself and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 482, 3, 26, 'never cleansed himself. Therefore he finally got upset and flared up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 482, 4, 26, 'publicly. God allows that to happen. And when that happens, there''s no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 482, 5, 26, 'use criticizing them. We have to think and say, "Lord, that can happen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 482, 6, 26, 'to me."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 482, 7, 26, 'When you see an old person who is irritable, bitter, cranky, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 482, 8, 26, 'demanding, we must say, "God have mercy on me so that I don''t become an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 482, 9, 26, 'old person like that." Stupid, foolish, demanding, cranky. Then you see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 482, 10, 26, 'other old people who are so wise, so gracious, so good. There''s much for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 482, 11, 26, 'us to think about when we see these things around us. To say, "Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 482, 12, 26, 'help me. I have the same flesh. Help me to grow up to be more like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 482, 13, 26, 'Jesus, so that in my old age, people will see that there''s something of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 482, 14, 26, 'wisdom instead of all the wretched nature of Adam that''s been cherished');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 482, 15, 26, 'and nourished for years." When should we start working in order to grow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 482, 16, 26, 'up and be a saint when we''re old? You have to start working probably');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 482, 17, 26, 'when you''re ten. And if we''ve crossed that age, we better hurry up and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 482, 18, 26, 'start at least now. Be wholehearted! Think of the poverty of so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 482, 19, 26, 'believers around us. Don''t criticize them. Just look and learn a lesson:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 482, 20, 26, 'that a little laziness in working out one''s own salvation, a little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 482, 21, 26, 'sleepiness in judging one''s self, being a busybody in other people''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 482, 22, 26, 'matters, and my own stone wall will be broken down and thorns will cover');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 482, 23, 26, 'my life. Here''s much opportunity for us to repent, be wholehearted, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 482, 24, 26, 'be diligent.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 482, 25, 26, 'We discussed before about how wisdom is necessary for our personal life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 482, 26, 26, 'our home life, and our church life. Therefore, these verses can be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 482, 27, 26, 'picture of a barren personal life which has neglected discipline and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 482, 28, 26, 'neglected God''s word. It can be a picture of a barren family');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 483, 1, 26, 'relationship between husband and wife which was supposed to be like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 483, 2, 26, 'garden of Eden, but has ended up like a wilderness. Or it can also be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 483, 3, 26, 'picture of a church which was meant to be the garden of the Lord, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 483, 4, 26, 'has become a wilderness. In all three areas, we can learn a lesson from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 483, 5, 26, 'what we see here.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 483, 6, 27, 'Chapter 25 Chapter 25');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 483, 7, 27, 'These also are proverbs of Solomon which the men of Hezekiah, king of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 483, 8, 27, 'Judah, transcribed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 483, 9, 27, 'Prov 25:1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 483, 10, 27, 'These are obviously Proverbs that were discovered during the revival of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 483, 11, 27, 'the time of King Hezekiah. That''s just a picture to us of how God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 483, 12, 27, 'preserves his word when we believe that God''s word is inspired. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 483, 13, 27, 'are some very precious verses in these chapters which are the Proverbs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 483, 14, 27, 'of Solomon. They were apparently lost until the time of Hezekiah which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 483, 15, 27, 'was some hundreds of years later. Yet they were God''s inspired word, so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 483, 16, 27, 'God made sure they were found so that they could be included in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 483, 17, 27, 'Bible. That''s also the way God has preserved his word through all these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 483, 18, 27, 'centuries so that we can have it in our hands. That which God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 483, 19, 27, 'intended for man to have from him, even if it is lost, God will make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 483, 20, 27, 'sure it is found.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 483, 21, 27, 'It is the glory of God to conceal a matter,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 483, 22, 27, 'But the glory of kings is to search out a matter.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 483, 23, 27, 'Prov 25:2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 483, 24, 27, 'This verse can apply to the hidden treasures in the word of God. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 483, 25, 27, 'are treasures that are hidden in God''s word which God has concealed and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 483, 26, 27, 'hidden. That''s his glory. It''s part of the glory of God to conceal a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 483, 27, 27, 'matter, because it''s when he conceals a matter that he can find out who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 483, 28, 27, 'are the ones who are diligent and not lazy. He can find out who are the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 484, 1, 27, 'ones who are wholeheartedly seeking and who will dig in order to find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 484, 2, 27, 'those treasures. And just like it is the glory of God to conceal a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 484, 3, 27, 'matter, it says it''s the glory of a king to find out that which God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 484, 4, 27, 'hidden. That should be our attitude to the word of God: that when we go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 484, 5, 27, 'to his word, we seek to find out what God has hidden so that we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 484, 6, 27, 'become rich.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 484, 7, 27, 'As the heavens for height and the earth for depth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 484, 8, 27, 'So the heart of kings is unsearchable.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 484, 9, 27, 'Prov 25:3');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 484, 10, 27, 'In other words, you don''t know the thoughts that are going through the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 484, 11, 27, 'mind of a king. We could apply this in a New Testament way to New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 484, 12, 27, 'Testament kings. In 1 Corinthians 2:15 it says, "He who is spiritual can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 484, 13, 27, 'evaluate (or appraise) all things, yet he himself cannot be evaluated by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 484, 14, 27, 'any man." A carnal person usually cannot evaluate a spiritual person,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 484, 15, 27, 'because his carnal level of thinking cannot understand the reason why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 484, 16, 27, 'that spiritually-minded person does or says certain things. That''s how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 484, 17, 27, 'this verse applies. That''s why it''s foolish to try and judge those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 484, 18, 27, 'have more wisdom than we have.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 484, 19, 27, 'Take away the dross from the silver,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 484, 20, 27, 'And there comes out a vessel for the smith;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 484, 21, 27, 'Take away the wicked before the king,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 484, 22, 27, 'And his throne will be established in righteousness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 484, 23, 27, 'Prov 25:4-5');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 484, 24, 27, 'This of course has application to Old Testament situations where wicked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 484, 25, 27, 'people in the king''s court could corrupt a king. Applying it in the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 484, 26, 27, 'Testament, we see there is a place for discipline and judgment in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 484, 27, 27, 'church. That way the testimony of the whole church is not spoiled. As we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 484, 28, 27, 'read in 1 Corinthians 5, Paul wrote to the Corinthians that there was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 485, 1, 27, 'even a need for a man to be put out of the church. That''s quite a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 485, 2, 27, 'serious thing when someone has to be put out of the church. Yet we read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 485, 3, 27, 'here in the word of God that there can even be a necessity for that, so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 485, 4, 27, 'that the church can be established in righteousness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 485, 5, 27, 'Do not claim honor in the presence of the king,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 485, 6, 27, 'And do not stand in the place of great men;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 485, 7, 27, 'For it is better that it be said to you, "Come up here",');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 485, 8, 27, 'Than for you to be placed lower in the presence of the prince,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 485, 9, 27, 'Whom your eyes have seen.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 485, 10, 27, 'Prov 25:6-7');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 485, 11, 27, 'We know from Luke 14:8-9 that Jesus repeated these words when he said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 485, 12, 27, '"When you go to a feast, don''t take the highest seat but the lower one,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 485, 13, 27, 'so that it can be said to you, ''Come up higher.''" But it''s very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 485, 14, 27, 'interesting to see that that was not something new Jesus said. We see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 485, 15, 27, 'it''s something that was written by Solomon. It was in the book of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 485, 16, 27, 'Proverbs, and Jesus had obviously read it in the book of Proverbs. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 485, 17, 27, 'he was only pointing out to those Pharisees that they were not obeying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 485, 18, 27, 'what they themselves had read in the book of Proverbs. It was written');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 485, 19, 27, 'here: "Don''t go up there to the higher seat," and yet that''s exactly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 485, 20, 27, 'what those Pharisees were doing. It''s possible to know the scriptures');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 485, 21, 27, 'like the Pharisees, and yet disobey it. That is why Jesus pointed out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 485, 22, 27, 'that it was written, and yet they were not doing it. This shows that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 485, 23, 27, 'despite their knowledge of the scriptures, the Pharisees were really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 485, 24, 27, 'quite careless about taking each word seriously. Whereas with Jesus, a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 485, 25, 27, 'word like this in Proverbs 25 was serious enough to repeat.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 485, 26, 27, 'Don''t be hot headed and rush to court. You may start something you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 485, 27, 27, 'cannot finish and then go down before your neighbor in shameful defeat.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 485, 28, 27, 'So discuss the matter with your neighbor privately. Don''t tell anyone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 486, 1, 27, 'else lest he accuse you of slander and you can''t withdraw what you said.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 486, 2, 27, 'Prov 25:8-10, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 486, 3, 27, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 486, 4, 27, 'Don''t be too quick to go to court about something you have seen. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 486, 5, 27, 'another witness later proves you wrong, what will you do then?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 486, 6, 27, 'If you and your neighbor have a difference of opinion, settle it between');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 486, 7, 27, 'yourselves and do not reveal any secrets. Otherwise everyone will learn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 486, 8, 27, 'that you can''t keep a secret, and you will never live down the shame.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 486, 9, 27, 'Prov 25:8-10, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 486, 10, 27, 'This is another thing Jesus repeated in the New Testament in Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 486, 11, 27, '25:25. The last part of Proverbs 25:7 really goes along with verse 8.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 486, 12, 27, 'Putting them together, it says, "Whom your eyes have seen, don''t go out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 486, 13, 27, 'hastily to argue your case." Or as the Good News Translation says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 486, 14, 27, '"Don''t be too quick to go to court about something you have seen." This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 486, 15, 27, 'is connected to verse 8. You''ve seen something and you want to rush to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 486, 16, 27, 'court about it. No, he says. You may start something that your neighbor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 486, 17, 27, 'proves to be wrong and then you go down in shameful defeat before him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 486, 18, 27, 'Verses 9-10 in the Good News Translation say, "If you and your neighbor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 486, 19, 27, 'have a difference of opinion, settle it between yourselves and don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 486, 20, 27, 'reveal any secrets. Otherwise everyone will learn that you can''t keep a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 486, 21, 27, 'secret and you never live down the shame." Now, there are a couple of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 486, 22, 27, 'things we can learn here. When we have a difference of opinion with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 486, 23, 27, 'someone, we have to be very careful. When we find that someone doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 486, 24, 27, 'agree with us on something, we have to be particularly careful in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 486, 25, 27, 'heart''s attitude toward that person, because we have a flesh in which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 486, 26, 27, 'dwells nothing good. We have a flesh which just does not like other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 486, 27, 27, 'people disagreeing with us. Do you know that there''s such a lust in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 486, 28, 27, 'flesh? I know there is such a lust in my flesh. I''ve discovered it. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 487, 1, 27, 'hope you have discovered it in yours because your flesh is the same. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 487, 2, 27, 'just don''t like someone disagreeing with us. That''s because, in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 487, 3, 27, 'flesh, we think we are Almighty God and that if someone disagrees with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 487, 4, 27, 'us, it''s a crime. But it''s not such a crime if somebody disagrees with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 487, 5, 27, 'us. We need to humble ourselves to realize that. Therefore, we need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 487, 6, 27, 'be particularly careful when someone disagrees with us. There''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 487, 7, 27, 'tendency to reveal something secret about that person to others which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 487, 8, 27, 'puts that person in a bad light, which we will easily do if we are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 487, 9, 27, 'very watchful and careful in our attitude toward those with whom we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 487, 10, 27, 'a difference of opinion. Don''t reveal any secrets, it says, in such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 487, 11, 27, 'case.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 487, 12, 27, 'The second thing here is that this is actually a type of revenge. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 487, 13, 27, 'person has done something or said something which has brought a little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 487, 14, 27, 'difficulty for us, and then we can take revenge on them - not in crude');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 487, 15, 27, 'ways by killing him. Just by exposing some folly of his. I can expose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 487, 16, 27, 'some folly of that person and it may be absolutely true, but the intent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 487, 17, 27, 'behind it was to get some revenge on that person who did or said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 487, 18, 27, 'something against me. We have to be very watchful here.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 487, 19, 27, 'The other thing it says here is in verse 10: If you reveal secrets,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 487, 20, 27, 'everyone will learn that you can''t keep a secret, and you''ll never live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 487, 21, 27, 'down the shame. It''s possible for us to gradually build up a reputation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 487, 22, 27, '(even in the church) as someone who is always gossiping and speaking all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 487, 23, 27, 'types of useless things. Gradually, everybody comes to know that such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 487, 24, 27, 'person is always going around talking and making themself a busybody in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 487, 25, 27, 'other peoples'' matters. Then it says you''ll never live down the shame.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 487, 26, 27, 'It''s very difficult once we have ruined our testimony before others to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 487, 27, 27, 'get rid of the shame. We need to be very cautious so that we don''t earn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 487, 28, 27, 'such a reputation in the church. You will never live down the shame.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 488, 1, 27, 'Think of that. It will be difficult for people to have confidence in you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 488, 2, 27, 'ever again. There are cases like that, so we need to be careful we don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 488, 3, 27, 'go the same way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 488, 4, 27, 'Like apples of gold in settings of silver');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 488, 5, 27, 'Is a word spoken in right circumstances.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 488, 6, 27, 'Prov 25:11');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 488, 7, 27, 'Think of giving a person a gift of a beautiful silver plate with golden');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 488, 8, 27, 'apples fixed on it. What an expensive gift that would be, costing many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 488, 9, 27, 'thousands of dollars to make. And he says here if you can give a word in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 488, 10, 27, 'the right circumstances, just a brief few words at the right time to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 488, 11, 27, 'right person, it is like presenting him with a gift of golden apples -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 488, 12, 27, 'real, solid gold - on a silver plate. It''s a very expensive gift to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 488, 13, 27, 'able to say the right word at the right time. We read in Isaiah 50:4');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 488, 14, 27, 'about Jesus: "The Lord God has given me the tongue of disciples, so that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 488, 15, 27, 'I may know how to sustain the weary one with a word. He awakens me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 488, 16, 27, 'morning by morning, he awakens my ear to listen as a disciple." Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 488, 17, 27, 'had the ability to give a word in season only because of one reason:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 488, 18, 27, 'that his spiritual antenna was always up. He was tuned to listen to what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 488, 19, 27, 'the Father was transmitting. He could receive and then he could give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 488, 20, 27, 'what he received. That was all. And that''s where we can follow him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 488, 21, 27, 'Going to a person and giving him a whole lot of exhortations and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 488, 22, 27, 'teaching from this verse, that verse and the other verse which I read in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 488, 23, 27, 'the morning, any idiot can do. But to give the right word at the right');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 488, 24, 27, 'time and not burden a person with a whole lot of verses that are flowing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 488, 25, 27, 'around in my mind, that''s quite a different thing. That requires wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 488, 26, 27, 'It requires hearing. I don''t need to hear God to dump a whole lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 488, 27, 27, 'verses on somebody. I just need to have a good memory. But to give a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 488, 28, 27, 'word in season (sometimes it could just be one sentence), that is to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 489, 1, 27, 'have the ministry of Melchizedek. Melchizedek came to Abraham, gave a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 489, 2, 27, 'few words, and disappeared. And his name is recorded throughout history');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 489, 3, 27, 'just for that one event. Think of being a part of that priesthood.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 489, 4, 27, 'A warning given by an experienced person to someone willing to listen is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 489, 5, 27, 'more valuable than gold rings or jewelry made of the finest gold.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 489, 6, 27, 'Prov 25:12, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 489, 7, 27, 'Verse 11 speaks of a gold gift as a word in season, and verse 12 speaks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 489, 8, 27, 'of words of warning/correction. Words of warning: be careful that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 489, 9, 27, 'don''t do that or go that way. That can also be like a golden ring or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 489, 10, 27, 'jewelry made of the finest gold - if we are willing to listen. It''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 489, 11, 27, 'good thing to have an ear to listen to those who have more wisdom than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 489, 12, 27, 'us. Our attitude toward them should be like someone coming to us with a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 489, 13, 27, 'very expensive gift. Consider if somebody came to you on your birthday');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 489, 14, 27, 'and gave you a word of rebuke as a gift. You''d think, "What a person he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 489, 15, 27, 'is to rebuke me on my birthday. Couldn''t he have waited for another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 489, 16, 27, 'day?" But think if a person came to you on your birthday and gave you a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 489, 17, 27, 'gift worth $1,000. It says here that a word of correction is worth more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 489, 18, 27, 'than that gift of $1,000. Think to take it like that. Why do I think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 489, 19, 27, 'that on my birthday a person shouldn''t give me any word of correction?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 489, 20, 27, 'Because I don''t think it''s a good thing. That''s why I think it''s not fit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 489, 21, 27, 'for birthdays. "That''s for other days. On my birthday, I should be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 489, 22, 27, 'happy." But it is to make us happy that a wise person gives us something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 489, 23, 27, 'which is good. A warning given by a wise person is an extremely valuable');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 489, 24, 27, 'gift, provided we have a listening ear as it says in verse 12.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 489, 25, 27, 'A reliable messenger is refreshing to the one who sends him, like cold');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 489, 26, 27, 'water in the heat of harvest time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 489, 27, 27, 'Prov 25:13, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 489, 28, 27, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 490, 1, 27, 'A faithful employee is as refreshing as a cool day in the hot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 490, 2, 27, 'summertime.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 490, 3, 27, 'Prov 25:13, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 490, 4, 27, 'Harvest time, or summertime, is a very hot time, and a drink of ice-cold');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 490, 5, 27, 'water is so refreshing in the hot summertime. In exactly the same way,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 490, 6, 27, 'it says a faithful messenger is equally refreshing to the one who sends');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 490, 7, 27, 'him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 490, 8, 27, 'In The Living Bible it says, "A faithful employee is as refreshing as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 490, 9, 27, 'cool day in the hot summertime." In the hot summertime, we know how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 490, 10, 27, 'refreshing it is when we have one cool day. And we can apply this to our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 490, 11, 27, 'own calling as messengers of the Lord. The emphasis here is not on a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 490, 12, 27, 'clever messenger. If it spoke here about a clever messenger, many of us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 490, 13, 27, 'may not be clever and then God wouldn''t use us. But it doesn''t say a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 490, 14, 27, 'clever messenger, it says a faithful messenger. In other words,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 490, 15, 27, 'according to the light you have in your life, you are to be faithful to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 490, 16, 27, 'that light. You are a faithful messenger of the light you have if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 490, 17, 27, 'take that light to others who don''t have that light. You may not be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 490, 18, 27, 'clever or be able to express it very well, but you''re faithful to pass');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 490, 19, 27, 'it on to others. Then you''re as refreshing to God as a glass of cold');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 490, 20, 27, 'water. Jesus said, "Whoever gives a cup of cold water in my name will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 490, 21, 27, 'not lose his reward." And you''re just as refreshing as a cup of cold');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 490, 22, 27, 'water to God''s heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 490, 23, 27, 'A faithful messenger is also one who proclaims the whole counsel of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 490, 24, 27, 'and doesn''t hold back any part of God''s message.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 490, 25, 27, 'Like clouds and wind without rain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 490, 26, 27, 'Is a man who boasts of his gifts falsely.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 490, 27, 27, 'Prov 25:14');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 490, 28, 27, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 491, 1, 27, 'One who doesn''t give the gift he promised is like a cloud blowing over a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 491, 2, 27, 'desert without dropping any rain.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 491, 3, 27, 'Prov 25:14, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 491, 4, 27, 'This is a very appropriate word for the days in which we live. What does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 491, 5, 27, 'it mean to boast of gifts falsely? There''s a lot of it in India and in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 491, 6, 27, 'America and many parts of the world. People claim to have a gift of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 491, 7, 27, 'healing when they don''t. Nobody wants the gift of helps because that''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 491, 8, 27, 'not so spectacular (1 Corinthians 12:28). But the gift of healing,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 491, 9, 27, 'particularly, people like to claim that they have. There are a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 491, 10, 27, 'people like that, claiming to have certain gifts. But Jesus said by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 491, 11, 27, 'their fruits you shall know them. The evidence that a person has the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 491, 12, 27, 'gift of healing is that when he prays for the sick, the sick are healed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 491, 13, 27, 'If a person prays for the sick and they''re not healed, that means there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 491, 14, 27, 'is no gift there. There can be a tremendous amount of boasting of gifts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 491, 15, 27, 'falsely. I believe there are gifts of healing in the church throughout');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 491, 16, 27, 'the world, but there are very few. But every Tom, Dick, and Harry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 491, 17, 27, 'nowadays wants to be a healer, so there is a lot of this boasting of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 491, 18, 27, 'gifts falsely. It says here that that''s like a lot of black clouds');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 491, 19, 27, 'coming over a dry parched area that hasn''t had rain for many months. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 491, 20, 27, 'say, "At last rain is coming!" You wait and then those clouds just pass');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 491, 21, 27, 'on, and there''s no rain. It''s a disappointment. I''ve seen that in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 491, 22, 27, 'healing meetings. People come with great expectations and leave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 491, 23, 27, 'disappointed. I remember once sitting in a meeting about twenty years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 491, 24, 27, 'ago, and there was an American healer, and sitting next to me was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 491, 25, 27, 'Hindu couple with two blind babies. The offering bag was passed around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 491, 26, 27, 'and naturally this couple would have put a handsome amount in the bag,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 491, 27, 27, 'because they would have thought in their Hindu minds that it was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 491, 28, 27, 'necessary to give for their children to be healed. Then, of course,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 492, 1, 27, 'those children were not healed, and I got so angry with that type of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 492, 2, 27, 'presentation of a Christ who is going to disappoint them. Clouds without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 492, 3, 27, 'rain. I think those people probably turned further away from the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 492, 4, 27, 'If there was any chance of them coming to the Lord before, that type of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 492, 5, 27, 'thing would ensure that they would never come to Christ. It''s better to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 492, 6, 27, 'be humble and not to claim that we have some ability which we don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 492, 7, 27, 'have. Be honest and humble: "Brother, I don''t have the gift of healing,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 492, 8, 27, 'but I can pray that God will bless you. If it is His will, he''ll heal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 492, 9, 27, 'you. But if not, I''ll pray that he''ll give you grace to bear it." Let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 492, 10, 27, 'those who have the gift of healing exercise their ministries. It''s good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 492, 11, 27, 'to have small thoughts about ourselves instead of ending up like clouds');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 492, 12, 27, 'with no rain, disappointing people and turning them away from the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 492, 13, 27, 'The Living Bible paraphrase teaches us as parents that particularly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 492, 14, 27, 'toward our children, if we promise to give a gift for something they''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 492, 15, 27, 'done, we must make sure that we keep our word. It''s wrong to promise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 492, 16, 27, 'something and then, when the time comes, back out of it and not keep our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 492, 17, 27, 'word. It''s far better not to promise in such cases.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 492, 18, 27, 'By forbearance a ruler may be persuaded,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 492, 19, 27, 'And a soft tongue breaks the bone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 492, 20, 27, 'Prov 25:15');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 492, 21, 27, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 492, 22, 27, 'Patient persuasion can break down the strongest resistance and can even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 492, 23, 27, 'convince rulers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 492, 24, 27, 'Prov 25:15, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 492, 25, 27, 'We are not going to get our way and accomplish what we want to by being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 492, 26, 27, 'hard, but by patience and goodness. It says here even a ruler can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 492, 27, 27, 'persuaded with patience. That''s a good word for us to bear in mind when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 492, 28, 27, 'dealing with any government authorities or with different people who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 493, 1, 27, 'hard in various ways. It''s alright for them to be hard, but we are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 493, 2, 27, 'going to accomplish anything by being hard ourselves. It''s better to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 493, 3, 27, 'patient, and with patience and goodness it says, even a ruler can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 493, 4, 27, 'persuaded.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 493, 5, 27, 'I like the phrase in the New American Standard Bible: "a soft tongue."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 493, 6, 27, 'We don''t receive a soft tongue when we are born. We are born with hard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 493, 7, 27, 'tongues. And when we are converted, our tongue doesn''t become soft all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 493, 8, 27, 'of a sudden. But think of having that as a goal in life. Say, "Lord, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 493, 9, 27, 'want those three beautiful words: a soft tongue." I want to make that my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 493, 10, 27, 'goal in life, to have a soft tongue toward all people. Very wonderful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 493, 11, 27, 'goal to have and to work towards.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 493, 12, 27, 'Never eat more honey than you need; too much may make you vomit. Don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 493, 13, 27, 'visit your neighbors too often; they may get tired of you and come to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 493, 14, 27, 'hate you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 493, 15, 27, 'Prov 25:16-17, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 493, 16, 27, 'Your fellowship with your neighbor can be just like honey. Wonderful!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 493, 17, 27, 'Very good fellowship, but if you have too much of it, and you go too');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 493, 18, 27, 'frequently to that person''s house, you''ll end up vomiting each other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 493, 19, 27, 'out. Familiarity breeds contempt. Your neighbor may grow tired of you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 493, 20, 27, 'and come to hate you and want to vomit you out, because you''re landing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 493, 21, 27, 'there all the time. This is not only in Christianity, it''s basic good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 493, 22, 27, 'manners. I mean even non-Christians understand that. It''s amazing to see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 493, 23, 27, 'how so many Christians don''t seem to have the wisdom which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 493, 24, 27, 'non-Christians have in this area. It doesn''t say, don''t visit your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 493, 25, 27, 'neighbor at all. It just says, don''t make the visits too frequent. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 493, 26, 27, 'may say, "We are good friends." That''s true, but don''t eat too much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 493, 27, 27, 'honey. That can make you vomit. It''s good to have restraint in these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 493, 28, 27, 'things. It''s good to be disciplined just like in the matter of eating;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 494, 1, 27, 'you don''t eat too much, you eat just enough. In the same way, visiting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 494, 2, 27, 'one another is a good thing. It''s like honey - true fellowship is like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 494, 3, 27, 'honey. But we must be careful in visiting one another. There is wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 494, 4, 27, 'that we need here, so we don''t act foolishly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 494, 5, 27, 'There is a verse in 1 Timothy 5:13 that speaks about younger women. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 494, 6, 27, 'says that when younger women are idle, they go around from house to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 494, 7, 27, 'house and become gossips and busybodies. That teaches us that in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 494, 8, 27, 'particular matter, sisters are more in danger than brothers. When you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 494, 9, 27, 'read something like that in the word of God, every God fearing sister');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 494, 10, 27, 'will really take it seriously and say, "Lord, I''m in greater danger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 494, 11, 27, 'here, because I''m a sister and I''m young and I have a lot of free time."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 494, 12, 27, 'If you''re a sister and you''re young and you have a lot of free time,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 494, 13, 27, 'then meditate a little while on 1 Timothy 5:13. You fall into all three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 494, 14, 27, 'categories: you''re young, you''re a sister, and you have a lot of free');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 494, 15, 27, 'time. This danger applies particularly to you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 494, 16, 27, 'Like a club and a sword and a sharp arrow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 494, 17, 27, 'Is a man who bears false witness against his neighbor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 494, 18, 27, 'Prov 25:18');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 494, 19, 27, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 494, 20, 27, 'A false accusation is as deadly as a sword, a club, or a sharp arrow.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 494, 21, 27, 'Prov 25:18');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 494, 22, 27, 'Backbiting. It often gives a false picture of the truth. What if we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 494, 23, 27, 'been the ones who have suffered from someone else''s sword or club or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 494, 24, 27, 'sharp arrow? Say somebody has backbitten against us, and it''s like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 494, 25, 27, 'club or a sword or a sharp arrow that hit us. Isaiah 54:17 says, "''No');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 494, 26, 27, 'weapon formed against you shall prosper, and every tongue that accuses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 494, 27, 27, 'you in judgment, you will condemn. This is the heritage of the servants');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 494, 28, 27, 'of the Lord and their vindication is from me,'' declares the Lord." The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 495, 1, 27, 'Lord says, "I will stand up for you and prove that you are right. Leave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 495, 2, 27, 'that to me." So we can afford to be hit by the clubs and the arrows and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 495, 3, 27, 'the swords of others and not retaliate, because we know that God will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 495, 4, 27, 'ensure that none of those weapons will ever prosper against us. That''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 495, 5, 27, 'tremendous verse.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 495, 6, 27, 'I remember reading a true story of a missionary lady in China many years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 495, 7, 27, 'ago who was faced by a band of pirates on a ship. One of the pirates');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 495, 8, 27, 'pulled out a pistol and came into her cabin on the ship and was about to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 495, 9, 27, 'fire at her, but she had such boldness. She turned around and told the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 495, 10, 27, 'man, "Put that pistol down, because it says that no weapon formed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 495, 11, 27, 'against me will ever prosper." The man was so terrified that he put the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 495, 12, 27, 'pistol down, and she came out alive from that situation. There''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 495, 13, 27, 'fantastic power in the word of God if we have faith in it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 495, 14, 27, 'Depending on an unreliable person in a crisis is like trying to chew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 495, 15, 27, 'with a loose tooth or walk with a crippled foot.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 495, 16, 27, 'Prov 25:19, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 495, 17, 27, 'This is the opposite of the faithful person we considered in Proverbs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 495, 18, 27, '25:13. This is an unfaithful person. Consider when you''re trying to chew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 495, 19, 27, 'some food and there''s a loose tooth, and it let''s you down. Or you go to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 495, 20, 27, 'put your foot down and it''s crippled. It''s just like that to be an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 495, 21, 27, 'unfaithful messenger. Someone who is trying to share the word but is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 495, 22, 27, 'unfaithful in their life is like that. God finds you like a loose tooth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 495, 23, 27, 'with which he can''t chew his food. We are not to be like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 495, 24, 27, 'Singing to a person who is depressed is like taking off a person''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 495, 25, 27, 'clothes on a cold day or rubbing salt in a wound.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 495, 26, 27, 'Prov 25:20, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 495, 27, 27, 'It''s a foolish thing to go to a person who is depressed and slap him on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 495, 28, 27, 'the back and say, "Well, praise the Lord, brother! Just cheer up!" You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 496, 1, 27, 'need to understand what he''s going through. Romans 12:15 says, "Weep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 496, 2, 27, 'with those who weep and rejoice with those who rejoice." There is no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 496, 3, 27, 'wisdom in always being a happy-go-lucky person around everyone. If a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 496, 4, 27, 'person is depressed, it''s like taking off his clothes on a cold day or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 496, 5, 27, 'rubbing salt in a wound. There''s a great need for wisdom in dealing with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 496, 6, 27, 'people who are depressed. We come across such people all the time who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 496, 7, 27, 'don''t understand victory, who have not understood how to rejoice in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 496, 8, 27, 'Lord always and how to keep the commandments. They haven''t understood');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 496, 9, 27, 'that sin will not have dominion over them which includes depression and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 496, 10, 27, 'discouragement. So we need to help them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 496, 11, 27, 'If your enemy is hungry, give him food to eat;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 496, 12, 27, 'And if he''s thirsty, give him water to drink;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 496, 13, 27, 'For you will heap burning coals on his head,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 496, 14, 27, 'And the Lord will reward you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 496, 15, 27, 'Prov 25:21-22');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 496, 16, 27, 'We know that these words were quoted by Paul in Romans 12:20-21. These');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 496, 17, 27, 'are exactly the same words which teaches us that Paul also studied');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 496, 18, 27, 'Proverbs just like Jesus did. The book of Proverbs is quoted by Jesus,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 496, 19, 27, 'Paul, Peter and James in the New Testament, teaching us that there are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 496, 20, 27, 'many things in Proverbs that are good for New Covenant believers to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 496, 21, 27, 'understand. This topic is something we''ve spoken about much in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 496, 22, 27, 'church. We don''t need to go too much into it. We are to love our enemies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 496, 23, 27, 'and seek to do good to them. If your enemy is hungry, give him food to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 496, 24, 27, 'eat. In fact, a very good thing to do when you find somebody is your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 496, 25, 27, 'enemy and somebody hates you is to pray and say, "Lord, give me some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 496, 26, 27, 'opportunity to serve him; some opportunity to do good to him in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 496, 27, 27, 'practical way." That''s what it''s speaking about here: to do good in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 496, 28, 27, 'practical way to that person and to pray that God will give you that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 497, 1, 27, 'opportunity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 497, 2, 27, 'This matter of heaping burning coals on his head - what does it mean? We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 497, 3, 27, 'can think about if somebody actually put live coals on your head, how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 497, 4, 27, 'would you feel? You''d feel very uncomfortable. That''s exactly what this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 497, 5, 27, 'means. When you show goodness to a person who has been evil to you, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 497, 6, 27, 'will "burn with shame" (v22, Good News Translation). He will feel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 497, 7, 27, 'ashamed that he''s treated you so badly, and that in his time of need,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 497, 8, 27, 'you went out to help him. He''ll think back on how he treated you and he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 497, 9, 27, 'will burn with shame. He''ll feel so uncomfortable that his relationship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 497, 10, 27, 'with you will be restored, perhaps, and the Lord will reward you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 497, 11, 27, 'The north wind brings forth rain,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 497, 12, 27, 'And a backbiting tongue, an angry countenance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 497, 13, 27, 'Prov 25:23');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 497, 14, 27, 'Most people in the world don''t have victory over sin. Most believers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 497, 15, 27, 'don''t even have victory over sin. Therefore, if you have backbitten');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 497, 16, 27, 'against someone and that person doesn''t have victory over sin, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 497, 17, 27, 'person is going to be angry with you for having backbitten against him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 497, 18, 27, 'Of course, you only have yourself to blame for that person losing his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 497, 19, 27, 'temper. That''s basically the meaning here.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 497, 20, 27, 'It is better to live in the corner of a roof');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 497, 21, 27, 'Than a house shared with a contentious wife.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 497, 22, 27, 'Prov 25:24');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 497, 23, 27, 'This is a repetition of what we saw in Proverbs 21:9. It''s interesting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 497, 24, 27, 'to see that the men of Hezekiah decided that this was one of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 497, 25, 27, 'Proverbs of Solomon that needed to be copied down once more in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 497, 26, 27, 'chapter. Even though it was already recorded, they wanted to repeat it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 497, 27, 27, 'It''s interesting to see how many times it speaks of this nagging wife');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 497, 28, 27, 'who''s driving her husband up a wall (to the roof) and into the desert');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 498, 1, 27, 'and all over the place. It''s good for us to work on our salvation so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 498, 2, 27, 'that no sister in the church ever becomes a wife like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 498, 3, 27, 'Like cold water to a weary soul,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 498, 4, 27, 'So is good news from a distant land.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 498, 5, 27, 'Prov 25:25');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 498, 6, 27, 'I''ve thought of this verse in relation to children who go away from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 498, 7, 27, 'their parents to some distant town. It''s so easy while they''re there to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 498, 8, 27, 'not think of writing even a letter to their parents. They''re selfish in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 498, 9, 27, 'a sense and enjoy their own happiness, and they don''t think of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 498, 10, 27, 'anxiety with which parents and loved ones are eager to hear news from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 498, 11, 27, 'them. Jesus spoke of giving a cup of cold water in His name. In such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 498, 12, 27, 'situation, it says here that cup of cold water given to a weary soul is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 498, 13, 27, 'just sending a letter. If any of you have to go away from your parents');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 498, 14, 27, 'in some situation, I''d advise you to give them a cup of cold water every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 498, 15, 27, 'once in a while. It''s a very good thing to do. It costs almost nothing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 498, 16, 27, 'and yet many people neglect it. It''s like not giving a cup of cold water');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 498, 17, 27, 'to a thirsty person. There''s a thirsty person waiting at the door, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 498, 18, 27, 'you won''t even give him a cup of cold water. He''s not asking for some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 498, 19, 27, 'expensive drink - just a cup of cold water. Just a postcard. That''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 498, 20, 27, 'good thing to keep in mind.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 498, 21, 27, 'Like a trampled spring and a polluted well');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 498, 22, 27, 'Is a righteous man who gives way before the wicked.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 498, 23, 27, 'Prov 25:26');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 498, 24, 27, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 498, 25, 27, 'If a godly man compromises with the wicked, it is like polluting a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 498, 26, 27, 'fountain or muddying a spring.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 498, 27, 27, 'Prov 25:26, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 498, 28, 27, 'We can say this is referring to a compromiser who gives in to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 499, 1, 27, 'pressure of some wicked person. When a godly man compromises, it''s like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 499, 2, 27, 'polluting a fountain. And that''s the reason why the waters that are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 499, 3, 27, 'flowing in so many churches today are polluted waters - dirty waters -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 499, 4, 27, 'because there''s been compromise in the leadership. And when a righteous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 499, 5, 27, 'person - one who is a leader - compromises, then the only waters that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 499, 6, 27, 'can flow out from him, whether in his home or in the church, will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 499, 7, 27, 'muddy waters. It''s not good for one who''s called to be a righteous son');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 499, 8, 27, 'of God to yield to the pressure of the wicked.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 499, 9, 27, 'Just as it is harmful to eat too much honey, so also it is bad for men');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 499, 10, 27, 'to think and to keep on thinking about all the honors they deserve!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 499, 11, 27, 'Prov 25:27, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 499, 12, 27, 'In Proverbs 25:16-17, we considered eating too much honey in the context');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 499, 13, 27, 'of visiting our neighbors. Here it''s in the context of thinking about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 499, 14, 27, 'our own honor. You know, to sit down and think about how you''ve done');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 499, 15, 27, 'something for this person and how you''ve done something for that other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 499, 16, 27, 'person; how so and so should be grateful to you for what you''ve done for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 499, 17, 27, 'them; how you helped these people here and did the other thing for those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 499, 18, 27, 'people there; to sit down and think about all this and pat oneself on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 499, 19, 27, 'the back is exactly the same as eating too much honey. Of course, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 499, 20, 27, 'public we act humble and don''t want anyone''s honor. But it''s all bogus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 499, 21, 27, 'and humbug, because when we are alone, we think of all the honor we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 499, 22, 27, 'deserve for what we have done for other people and what spiritual people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 499, 23, 27, 'we are. That''s just as bad as visiting your neighbor too often. That has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 499, 24, 27, 'to be vomited out. Vomit out all such thoughts. It''s not good to eat too');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 499, 25, 27, 'much honey.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 499, 26, 27, 'If you cannot control your anger, you are as helpless as a city without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 499, 27, 27, 'walls, open to attack.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 499, 28, 27, 'Prov 25:28, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 500, 1, 27, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 500, 2, 27, 'A man without self-control is as defenseless as a city with broken-down');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 500, 3, 27, 'walls.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 500, 4, 27, 'Prov 25:28, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 500, 5, 27, 'One of the fruits of the Spirit is self-control as it says in Galatians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 500, 6, 27, '5:23. And this teaches us that self-control is like a wall that protects');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 500, 7, 27, 'us against Satan. If I don''t have this wall around me, I''m defenseless.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 500, 8, 27, 'I can have knowledge of the bible, I can have activity, and I can do so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 500, 9, 27, 'many things for the Lord, but I''m helpless against the enemy''s attacks,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 500, 10, 27, 'because I don''t have this wall of self-control. I''m not able to control');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 500, 11, 27, 'my anger.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 500, 12, 27, 'We read in the word of God that even a mighty man like Moses, who was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 500, 13, 27, 'called the meekest man on the earth in Numbers 12, got angry with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 500, 14, 27, 'people eight chapters later in Numbers 20. One would think that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 500, 15, 27, 'should have condoned his anger because of the difficulty of taking care');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 500, 16, 27, 'of two million people for forty years with all their complaints about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 500, 17, 27, 'everything. You know how difficult it can be to organize a small picnic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 500, 18, 27, 'just for one day for a few people (or to plan a wedding - what a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 500, 19, 27, 'losing tempers can come from that). Imagine how difficult it was for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 500, 20, 27, 'Moses to manage two million people for forty years. One would think that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 500, 21, 27, 'just slipping up once would not be that bad, but God took it seriously.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 500, 22, 27, 'It only took one slip-up, and God said he couldn''t enter the promised');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 500, 23, 27, 'land. Consider that. That''s written as a warning for us. There''s much we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 500, 24, 27, 'can miss if we are not careful. God overlooks a lot of stupid thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 500, 25, 27, 'particularly when we are young, inexperienced, and foolish, but as we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 500, 26, 27, 'grow older and we receive more wisdom, more is expected from us. Then if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 500, 27, 27, 'we get irritated and lose our tempers, that''s a very serious thing -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 500, 28, 27, 'extremely serious. It''s like not having any walls at all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 501, 1, 27, 'I read in a medical book that there was an experiment on dogs and cats,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 501, 2, 27, 'and they discovered that when they removed a certain part of a dog or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 501, 3, 27, 'cat''s brain, they became very ornery. If you just touched the cat,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 501, 4, 27, 'suddenly it would scream and slash it''s tail and its hair lifted up.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 501, 5, 27, 'That was very amusing for me to read, because when a person gets angry,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 501, 6, 27, 'he''s acting like a brainless cat or dog. It''s been physically proven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 501, 7, 27, 'that when you remove part of the brain of a cat, it becomes very ornery.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 501, 8, 27, 'Just a small, little thing and it gets worked up and upset. God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 501, 9, 27, 'given us brains and no part of them is cut out, and yet we can act like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 501, 10, 27, 'that - getting so touchy and upset and irritated about small things. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 501, 11, 27, 'wants us to have walls of self-control which are not broken down.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 501, 12, 27, 'We read at the end of Proverbs 24, in verse 31, about a stone wall being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 501, 13, 27, 'broken down. Here at the end of Proverbs 25, we again see a man with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 501, 14, 27, 'walls broken down. In that case, it was due to laziness and in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 501, 15, 27, 'case, it''s due to a lack of discipline and self-control. God wants us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 501, 16, 27, 'have walls around our lives - walls of obedience to God''s word and walls');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 501, 17, 27, 'of self-control. Self-control is a fruit of the Spirit. And what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 501, 18, 27, 'encourages us is: if self-control was something we had to develop and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 501, 19, 27, 'grit our teeth to acquire, we''d say, "Lord, I don''t seem to have it even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 501, 20, 27, 'after so many years." But we praise God for that wonderful word in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 501, 21, 27, 'Galatians 5:23 which says it is fruit which the Spirit produces. So I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 501, 22, 27, 'must say, "Lord, I want it. Produce it in my life. Here is the ground:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 501, 23, 27, 'humility and fear of the Lord in my life. I offer it to you. Produce');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 501, 24, 27, 'self-control in my life! Build these walls so that I will be one who has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 501, 25, 27, 'defenses against the enemy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 501, 26, 28, 'Chapter 26 Chapter 26');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 501, 27, 28, 'Verses 1-12 are about fools. The book of Proverbs says much about fools');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 501, 28, 28, '(spiritual fools), but here in particular it says a few things about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 502, 1, 28, 'fools all together:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 502, 2, 28, 'Praise for a fool is out of place, like snow in summer or rain at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 502, 3, 28, 'harvest time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 502, 4, 28, 'Prov 26:1, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 502, 5, 28, 'To praise a fool is as out of place as snow falling in summertime or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 502, 6, 28, 'rain falling at harvest time. Snow doesn''t fall in the summertime and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 502, 7, 28, 'rain doesn''t usually fall at harvest time, but to praise a fool and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 502, 8, 28, 'give honor to a fool is just as out of place. This teaches us that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 502, 9, 28, 'must be careful about who we give honor to. Don''t be foolish and go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 502, 10, 28, 'around giving honor to people who cannot bear it, particularly to those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 502, 11, 28, 'who are young. It goes to their head and it puffs them up, and they have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 502, 12, 28, 'a spiritual fall from pride. Our giving them honor, even though it seems');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 502, 13, 28, 'like a good thing, was out of place like snow falling in the summertime.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 502, 14, 28, 'Curses cannot hurt you unless you deserve them. They are like birds that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 502, 15, 28, 'fly by and never light.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 502, 16, 28, 'Prov 26:2, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 502, 17, 28, 'Curses cannot hurt you unless you deserve them. They are like birds that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 502, 18, 28, 'fly by but they don''t settle down. Some people are afraid when somebody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 502, 19, 28, 'has cursed them or done some witchcraft on them (which is another form');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 502, 20, 28, 'of curse). "Somebody''s put some curse on me. Somebody has done some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 502, 21, 28, 'witchcraft on me," they say. But a curse can''t harm you unless you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 502, 22, 28, 'deserve it. It is like a bird that is flying over your head. It''s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 502, 23, 28, 'able to come and settle down on your head. Similarly, a curse which is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 502, 24, 28, 'made against you can accomplish nothing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 502, 25, 28, 'In 1 Samuel 17:43, when David went to fight against Goliath, Goliath');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 502, 26, 28, 'cursed David by his Philistine gods. But whatever he said, nothing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 502, 27, 28, 'happened to David. That curse just went back on Goliath. It was useless.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 502, 28, 28, 'There is a very beautiful promise in Numbers 23:23 (the reference is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 503, 1, 28, 'very easy to remember). Balaam said about Israel, "No one can do any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 503, 2, 28, 'witchcraft against Israel." There is no bad omen that others can put on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 503, 3, 28, 'God''s people. If that were true for people under the Old Covenant, how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 503, 4, 28, 'much more for those who are under Christ. That''s something that we must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 503, 5, 28, 'have confidence in: that no one can put a curse on me because Jesus has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 503, 6, 28, 'become a curse for me and I have been freed. No witchcraft can be done');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 503, 7, 28, 'on me because Jesus has overcome every single demon that exists in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 503, 8, 28, 'universe. He has overcome them all and He is my Savior and my Lord. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 503, 9, 28, 'cannot come upon my life as long as I live with a clear conscience. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 503, 10, 28, 'need not be afraid of any of these things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 503, 11, 28, 'A whip is for the horse, a bridle is for the donkey,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 503, 12, 28, 'And a rod for the back of fools.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 503, 13, 28, 'Prov 26:3');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 503, 14, 28, 'You have to whip a horse, bridle a donkey, and beat a fool. This is one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 503, 15, 28, 'reason why we have to punish children, because we have to drive folly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 503, 16, 28, 'out of their hearts. It''s interesting to see the use of the whip and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 503, 17, 28, 'bridle here. This shows us that one mark of a fool is this: a whip is to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 503, 18, 28, 'make the horse go when it''s unwilling to go. A bridle is exactly the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 503, 19, 28, 'opposite - it''s used to hold it back when it''s running off. This has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 503, 20, 28, 'always been the tendency of man, to either run off in some direction');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 503, 21, 28, 'without waiting for God to tell him to move or to not move when God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 503, 22, 28, 'tells him to do something. That''s the mark of a fool - either this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 503, 23, 28, 'extreme or the other extreme; either running off without any leading');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 503, 24, 28, 'from God and doing something, or refusing to do something even when God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 503, 25, 28, 'has spoken something clearly. That is the mark of a fool. We think of so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 503, 26, 28, 'many things which are clearly written down in the Word of God, and there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 503, 27, 28, 'are many people who don''t obey. What they need is a whip because they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 503, 28, 28, 'are like a stubborn horse which won''t move even though God has spoken.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 504, 1, 28, 'Do not answer a fool according to his folly;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 504, 2, 28, 'Or you will also be like him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 504, 3, 28, 'Answer a fool as his folly deserves,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 504, 4, 28, 'That he not be wise in his own eyes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 504, 5, 28, 'Prov 26:4-5');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 504, 6, 28, 'These are wonderful verses to stumble people who say there are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 504, 7, 28, 'contradictions in the Bible. Here are two verses which apparently say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 504, 8, 28, 'exactly the opposite. In one place it says if a fool speaks in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 504, 9, 28, 'particular way, don''t answer him. Keep quiet, otherwise you''ll be like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 504, 10, 28, 'him. And the very next verse says to answer him as his folly deserves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 504, 11, 28, 'That basically means give him some silly reply. Otherwise he will become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 504, 12, 28, 'conceited in his own eyes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 504, 13, 28, 'What does this teach us? It teaches us that to have wisdom means that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 504, 14, 28, 'don''t answer everyone in the same way. We''re in a world which is full of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 504, 15, 28, 'fools, spiritually speaking. Wisdom teaches us to keep quiet with one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 504, 16, 28, 'person and to answer another. We know that Pilot and Herod were fools.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 504, 17, 28, 'But when Jesus stood before Pilot, he answered him and when he stood');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 504, 18, 28, 'before Herod, he said nothing - not a word. That was wisdom - to know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 504, 19, 28, 'where to speak and where to stay silent and where to give a silly reply.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 504, 20, 28, 'Sometimes the Pharisees would come to Jesus with a question and he would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 504, 21, 28, 'ask them some other question in return. When they couldn''t answer it, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 504, 22, 28, 'said, "Well, neither am I going to answer your question." At other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 504, 23, 28, 'times, he wouldn''t answer at all. He just ignored them. That teaches us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 504, 24, 28, 'that following the leading of the Spirit is not just following a book of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 504, 25, 28, 'rules. ''Thou shalt always answer fools'' or ''Thou shalt never answer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 504, 26, 28, 'fools''. God has not made it like that for us. There is a time and a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 504, 27, 28, 'season for everything, and we need to hear the voice of the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 504, 28, 28, 'to know what to do in each situation. These are very wonderful verses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 505, 1, 28, 'that teach the necessity of knowing how to reply. For example, if a fool');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 505, 2, 28, 'boasts, we don''t boast. Or if a fool gets angry, we don''t get angry. At');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 505, 3, 28, 'the same time, we are willing to earnestly contend for the faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 505, 4, 28, 'If you let a fool deliver a message, you might as well cut off your own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 505, 5, 28, 'feet; you are asking for trouble.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 505, 6, 28, 'Prov 26:6, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 505, 7, 28, 'Here again is a verse about God''s need for wise messengers. A message');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 505, 8, 28, 'has to be delivered, according to this verse, by a wise person. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 505, 9, 28, 'applies spiritually in the sense that the extent which God can give his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 505, 10, 28, 'word through any of us is dependent on the level of our wisdom, not on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 505, 11, 28, 'the level of our knowledge. It is a very simple truth, but if only we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 505, 12, 28, 'can understand it, it can make a tremendous difference in our life. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 505, 13, 28, 'is the level of our wisdom that determines how much God can communicate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 505, 14, 28, 'his word through us, not the level of our knowledge. Our knowledge level');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 505, 15, 28, 'may be very high, but as far as God is concerned, he sees the level of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 505, 16, 28, 'our wisdom, and that is what determines how much God can communicate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 505, 17, 28, 'through us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 505, 18, 28, 'Like the legs which hang down from the lame,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 505, 19, 28, 'so is a proverb in the mouth of fools.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 505, 20, 28, 'Prov 26:7');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 505, 21, 28, 'In the King James Version it says "uneven legs." Legs which are not of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 505, 22, 28, 'equal length, so is a proverb in the mouth of a fool. A person may be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 505, 23, 28, 'speaking a very wise proverb, but it''s coming from the mouth of a fool.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 505, 24, 28, 'I think this refers to a person''s life which does not match the words he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 505, 25, 28, 'speaks. It says that is like a man with uneven legs, a crippled man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 505, 26, 28, 'Paul told Timothy, "Pay attention to your life and to your teaching" (1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 505, 27, 28, 'Timothy 4:16). We can say these are like two legs. When we are born, our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 505, 28, 28, 'legs are small but they are the same size. As we grow, the wonderful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 506, 1, 28, 'thing is that both legs grow together and are the same size. How');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 506, 2, 28, 'terrible it would be if one grew longer than the other. Yet, that is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 506, 3, 28, 'danger in Christianity. When we are initially converted, we have neither');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 506, 4, 28, 'knowledge nor life. Our legs are small. But as we grow up, the great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 506, 5, 28, 'tendency in the vast majority of Christians is for the knowledge leg to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 506, 6, 28, 'grow so long and the life leg to be quite small. Then, of course, we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 506, 7, 28, 'like this man with uneven legs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 506, 8, 28, '"Like one who binds a stone in a sling,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 506, 9, 28, 'So is he who gives honor to a fool."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 506, 10, 28, 'Prov 26:8');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 506, 11, 28, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 506, 12, 28, '"Praising someone who is stupid makes as much sense as tying a stone in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 506, 13, 28, 'a catapult."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 506, 14, 28, 'Prov 26:8, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 506, 15, 28, 'A stone is not meant to be bound in a sling. You don''t tie a stone in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 506, 16, 28, 'catapult. A stone must be loose in a catapult in order for it to fly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 506, 17, 28, 'out. If you tie the stone in the catapult, then however much you may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 506, 18, 28, 'stretch it, when you release the catapult the stone still sticks to it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 506, 19, 28, 'I''ve tried to think about what the meaning of this is and I look at it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 506, 20, 28, 'like this: when you give praise to a person, if he''s a wise man, he lets');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 506, 21, 28, 'the praise shoot out unto God like the stone flies out from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 506, 22, 28, 'catapult. But if the person is a fool, the praise sticks onto him and he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 506, 23, 28, 'meditates on it for the next few months. "This brother said this about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 506, 24, 28, 'me or thought that about me." The stone is stuck there and bound to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 506, 25, 28, 'catapult. That''s an indication of whether we are foolish or wise. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 506, 26, 28, 'somebody praises us, we can think whether the stone is stuck to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 506, 27, 28, 'catapult, tied up, or we are quick to let it fly out straight to God who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 506, 28, 28, 'deserves that honor. If we are wise, we won''t keep it to ourselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 507, 1, 28, 'because we don''t deserve that honor. The Lord alone is worthy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 507, 2, 28, '"A rebel will misapply an illustration so that its point will no more be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 507, 3, 28, 'felt than a thorn in the hand of a drunkard."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 507, 4, 28, 'Prov 26:9, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 507, 5, 28, 'When a drunkard gets a thorn in his hand, he doesn''t feel it because he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 507, 6, 28, 'is so drunk. In the same way a fool can listen to Proverbs and not apply');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 507, 7, 28, 'it to himself. He says, "That''s for so and so. That''s for another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 507, 8, 28, 'brother or sister." He doesn''t think it could be for him. He doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 507, 9, 28, 'feel it just as a drunkard doesn''t feel a thorn in his own hand. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 507, 10, 28, 'teaches us to be humble, that when we go to the Word we don''t misapply');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 507, 11, 28, 'it. We say, "in the volume of the book, it is written of me" (Psalm');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 507, 12, 28, '40:7). If there is a sharp point in a proverb, I feel it like a thorn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 507, 13, 28, 'getting into my hand. I am not so drunk with my own conceit that I think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 507, 14, 28, 'it''s only for other people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 507, 15, 28, '"Like an archer who wounds everyone,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 507, 16, 28, 'So is he who hires a fool or hires those who pass by."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 507, 17, 28, 'Prov 26:10');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 507, 18, 28, 'An employer who hires a fool is only hurting everybody who is concerned.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 507, 19, 28, 'Here again, we read of the necessity of using wise people as messengers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 507, 20, 28, 'Notice the repetition of this idea many times. God needs wise people to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 507, 21, 28, 'be his messengers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 507, 22, 28, '"Like a dog that returns to its vomit,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 507, 23, 28, 'So a fool who repeats his foolishness."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 507, 24, 28, 'Prov 26:11');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 507, 25, 28, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 507, 26, 28, '"A fool doing some stupid thing a second time is like a dog going back');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 507, 27, 28, 'to its own vomit."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 507, 28, 28, 'Prov 26:11, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 508, 1, 28, 'This is quoted by Peter in 2 Peter 2:21-22. To know the word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 508, 2, 28, 'righteousness and then go back from it is like a dog turning to its own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 508, 3, 28, 'vomit. In GNT, it says that a dog returning to its own vomit is like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 508, 4, 28, 'doing the same foolish thing a second time! That is the meaning.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 508, 5, 28, 'Therefore we should be wholehearted. If I do a foolish thing once and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 508, 6, 28, 'get light on it, I should say, "Lord, I never want to do that foolish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 508, 7, 28, 'thing a second time."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 508, 8, 28, 'There is a word of encouragement here for us if we look carefully. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 508, 9, 28, 'not that we never make any mistakes or do any foolish things, but that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 508, 10, 28, 'though we are foolish and do a lot of foolish things, when we get light,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 508, 11, 28, 'we avoid repeating it. Then we don''t come under the category of dogs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 508, 12, 28, 'returning to their vomit. A dog who returns to its vomit is one who does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 508, 13, 28, 'something foolish, gets light on it, vomits (which means rejects it and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 508, 14, 28, 'acknowledges it was wrong), repents and turns, and then after a little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 508, 15, 28, 'while goes right back to that foolish thing. It says in 2 Peter 2:21-22');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 508, 16, 28, 'that those who have known the way of righteousness and turned from it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 508, 17, 28, 'it is better for them that they had not known it at all. So we see that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 508, 18, 28, 'Peter also studied the book of Proverbs just like Jesus and Paul. We can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 508, 19, 28, 'apply this to our own life and see how we can grow in wisdom by avoiding');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 508, 20, 28, 'the repetition of folly on which we have received light. That should be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 508, 21, 28, 'our ambition in life. We must pray and say, "Lord help me to never do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 508, 22, 28, 'the same foolish thing twice." That''s a good prayer to pray.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 508, 23, 28, '"Do you see a man wise in his own eyes?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 508, 24, 28, 'There is more hope for a fool than for him."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 508, 25, 28, 'Prov 26: 12');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 508, 26, 28, 'Do you see a man who is conceited, who thinks much about himself? He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 508, 27, 28, 'the worst of the lot. There is more hope for a fool than for him. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 508, 28, 28, 'mentioned that the first twelve verses of chapter 26 are all about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 509, 1, 28, 'fools. Actually, having described various aspects of fools in verses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 509, 2, 28, '1-11, he finally says in verse 12 that of all the people, there is still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 509, 3, 28, 'someone who is worse than the fools described in the first 11 verses.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 509, 4, 28, 'That is the meaning of verse 12. This teaches us that conceit and having');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 509, 5, 28, 'a high opinion about ourselves and our own spirituality makes us the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 509, 6, 28, 'worst fool on the list. There''s more hope for a fool than for such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 509, 7, 28, 'person. All the stupid things that are mentioned about fools in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 509, 8, 28, 'first 11 verses are nothing compared to conceit which puts a man at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 509, 9, 28, 'top of the list as the worst fool of the lot.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 509, 10, 28, '"The sluggard says, ''There is a lion in the road!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 509, 11, 28, 'A lion is in the open square!''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 509, 12, 28, 'As the door turns on its hinges,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 509, 13, 28, 'So does the sluggard on his bed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 509, 14, 28, 'The sluggard buries his hand in the dish;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 509, 15, 28, 'He is weary of bringing it to his mouth again.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 509, 16, 28, 'The sluggard is wiser in his own eyes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 509, 17, 28, 'Than seven men who can give a discrete answer."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 509, 18, 28, 'Prov 26:13-16');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 509, 19, 28, 'These verses are about sluggards or lazy people. We can say lazy people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 509, 20, 28, 'are those who don''t have any discipline in their lives. Laziness is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 509, 21, 28, 'same as being undisciplined. Jesus and the apostles lived disciplined');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 509, 22, 28, 'lives. To be lazy is to not have any discipline in our lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 509, 23, 28, 'Verse 13 tells us about all the silly excuses people can make to get out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 509, 24, 28, 'of doing their duty. It is really a silly excuse that there is a lion in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 509, 25, 28, 'the street or that I might be killed. The writer of Proverbs takes a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 509, 26, 28, 'ridiculous statement that comes out of the mouth of a lazy man to show');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 509, 27, 28, 'there are silly excuses that people make for the reason why they don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 509, 28, 28, 'do certain things. The real reason, of course, is that they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 510, 1, 28, 'spiritually undisciplined and lazy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 510, 2, 28, 'Verse 14 in the Good News Translation says, "The lazy man turns over in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 510, 3, 28, 'bed. He gets no farther than a door swinging on its hinges." A door can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 510, 4, 28, 'keep swinging on its hinges and never make any progress in terms of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 510, 5, 28, 'distance. It says here that a lazy man is like that. There is no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 510, 6, 28, 'spiritual progress. There is movement. You can keep swinging a door on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 510, 7, 28, 'its hinges for days on end but it''s still in the same place. There''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 510, 8, 28, 'movement without progress. So it is with a spiritually undisciplined,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 510, 9, 28, 'lazy man. It is also possible to be involved in activity and increase in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 510, 10, 28, 'the knowledge of the word without spiritual progress.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 510, 11, 28, 'Verse 15 is a repetition of Proverbs 19:24. A number of these verses we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 510, 12, 28, 'have already seen in earlier chapters of Proverbs. We read that the men');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 510, 13, 28, 'of Hezekiah copied these proverbs down again. Some were copied down');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 510, 14, 28, 'again for a second time, because the Spirit of God wants to emphasize');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 510, 15, 28, 'certain things. Here the Spirit of God wants to emphasize discipline and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 510, 16, 28, 'hard work. We can apply this verse to our attitude of God''s word. Our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 510, 17, 28, 'attitude to God''s word must not be one where we are always dependent on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 510, 18, 28, 'other people spoon feeding us. Who is this lazy man who buries his hand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 510, 19, 28, 'in the dish and doesn''t bring it to his mouth? We see that sometimes in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 510, 20, 28, 'the way children eat their food. Their hand will be on the plate and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 510, 21, 28, 'they hardly ever bring it to their mouth. Half an hour or one hour later');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 510, 22, 28, 'the food is still there. Then we have to take a spoon and feed that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 510, 23, 28, 'child and we ask ourselves, "When is that child going to grow up?" We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 510, 24, 28, 'can apply that to ourselves in relation to God''s word. Spiritually it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 510, 25, 28, 'can be like this - an undisciplined, lazy attitude to God''s Word. I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 510, 26, 28, 'to be spoon fed. Each of us needs to go to God''s Word and be able to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 510, 27, 28, 'feed ourselves from it regularly. It is impossible to become spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 510, 28, 28, 'merely by listening to messages if we don''t read the Word of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 511, 1, 28, 'ourselves. Man shall not live by bread alone but by every word that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 511, 2, 28, 'proceeds from the mouth of God. We need to hear that word that proceeds');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 511, 3, 28, 'from God''s mouth so that we can live by it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 511, 4, 28, 'In verse 16, we see that the tragedy of a sluggard is that even though');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 511, 5, 28, 'he is a fool he doesn''t realize it. That is one of the greatest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 511, 6, 28, 'accomplishments of Satan, that he can keep a believer spiritually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 511, 7, 28, 'foolish but make him think he is spiritually wise. A sluggard can even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 511, 8, 28, 'think that he is wiser than seven truly wise men. That is the deception');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 511, 9, 28, 'with which the devil deceived the Pharisees of Jesus'' day. They thought');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 511, 10, 28, 'they were wise but they were absolute fools and didn''t know it. When we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 511, 11, 28, 'read this in Scripture we need to remember that it can happen to us. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 511, 12, 28, 'is possible for us to think we are wise even though we do one foolish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 511, 13, 28, 'thing after another. We can excuse ourselves saying, "That was just one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 511, 14, 28, 'slip up" and not realize these little incidents are meant to show us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 511, 15, 28, 'that we really don''t have any wisdom at all. Yet in our own opinion,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 511, 16, 28, 'because we have knowledge, we can think that we are wiser than any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 511, 17, 28, 'number of other wise people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 511, 18, 28, '"Getting involved in an argument that is none of your business is like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 511, 19, 28, 'going down the street and grabbing a dog by the ears."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 511, 20, 28, 'Prov 26:17, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 511, 21, 28, 'This basically means don''t be a busy-body in other peoples'' matters as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 511, 22, 28, 'Peter said in 1 Peter 4:15. Where there is an argument that is none of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 511, 23, 28, 'your business or a problem between two people that is none of your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 511, 24, 28, 'business, don''t get involved. To become a busybody in others'' matters is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 511, 25, 28, 'exactly like seeing a dog walking down the other side of the street and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 511, 26, 28, 'having an itch to go across the street and yank its ears. Now if they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 511, 27, 28, 'come to you for help, you need to get involved. But if they haven''t come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 511, 28, 28, 'to you for help and they are having their problems among themselves, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 512, 1, 28, 'don''t need to get involved. Do you know what will happen if you do that?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 512, 2, 28, 'The dog will turn and bite you. There are many cases of believers who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 512, 3, 28, 'have gotten into a lot of unnecessary sufferings and problems because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 512, 4, 28, 'they had an itch to go and get involved in somebody else''s problems.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 512, 5, 28, 'There''s an itch in our flesh because our flesh keeps telling us that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 512, 6, 28, 'are specialists, that we''re peacemakers, that we are the ones who have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 512, 7, 28, 'wisdom. Our flesh tells us we can go and solve that problem.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 512, 8, 28, 'Unnecessarily, a lot of believers go and do stupid things by getting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 512, 9, 28, 'involved in that which is not at all their business.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 512, 10, 28, 'We have to be particularly careful when visiting others who don''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 512, 11, 28, 'wisdom. They can tell you about their problems and this and that, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 512, 12, 28, 'it''s very easy to get involved in it. To say, ''You must do this and that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 512, 13, 28, 'and that person''s like this and the other person''s like that.'' Think of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 512, 14, 28, 'this verse then. If a dog is peacefully passing by on the other side of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 512, 15, 28, 'the road, leave it alone. You walk peacefully on this side of the road');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 512, 16, 28, 'and leave them to mind their own business. If they feel that you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 512, 17, 28, 'such a specialist in wisdom, they will come to you for help. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 512, 18, 28, 'otherwise, it is good for us not to be busy bodies in other peoples''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 512, 19, 28, 'matters and to crucify the itch to get involved with other peoples''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 512, 20, 28, 'affairs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 512, 21, 28, 'A man who misleads someone and then claims he was only joking is like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 512, 22, 28, 'madman playing with a deadly weapon.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 512, 23, 28, 'Prov 26:18-19, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 512, 24, 28, 'I trust that some of us older people will not be involved in such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 512, 25, 28, 'things. But children can do that - playing practical jokes on other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 512, 26, 28, 'people and deceiving them, and that can cause some suffering. Afterwards');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 512, 27, 28, 'we can say, ''I was only joking.'' The Bible says that such a person is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 512, 28, 28, 'madman. Older people can also do things like this in the sense that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 513, 1, 28, 'can say things to people unwisely and afterwards say, ''I was only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 513, 2, 28, 'joking.'' But the other person didn''t take it as a joke. The other person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 513, 3, 28, 'took it quite seriously and it caused them problems. That is why we need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 513, 4, 28, 'to be very careful, even if we are joking with someone, that the person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 513, 5, 28, 'realizes it was a joke and that we have a good enough relationship with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 513, 6, 28, 'that person to do so. I wouldn''t advise you to joke with people with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 513, 7, 28, 'whom you don''t have a good relationship, because they can misunderstand.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 513, 8, 28, 'Here we need some wisdom. To say something and then afterwards say we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 513, 9, 28, 'were only joking is to be a madman playing with a deadly weapon. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 513, 10, 28, 'type of joking can be a deadly weapon according to this verse. It''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 513, 11, 28, 'good thing to have humor just like it can be a good thing to have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 513, 12, 28, 'pistol. Sometimes it is useful, but it''s also a deadly weapon. We have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 513, 13, 28, 'to be careful that you don''t hurt anyone with it. This verse teaches us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 513, 14, 28, 'that it is possible to hurt people with our jokes. It can be like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 513, 15, 28, 'firebrand because we were not wise with what we said.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 513, 16, 28, '"For lack of wood the fire goes out,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 513, 17, 28, 'And where there is no whisperer, contention quiets down."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 513, 18, 28, 'Prov 26:20');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 513, 19, 28, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 513, 20, 28, '"Without wood, a fire goes out. Without gossip, quarreling stops.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 513, 21, 28, 'Charcoal keeps the ember glowing, wood keeps the fire burning, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 513, 22, 28, 'trouble makers keep arguments alive. Gossip is so tasty, how we love to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 513, 23, 28, 'swallow it."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 513, 24, 28, 'Prov 26:20-22, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 513, 25, 28, 'Is there anyone who can say that gossip is not tasty? It is. It''s tasty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 513, 26, 28, 'to the flesh to hear something about someone else. Like they say, "juicy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 513, 27, 28, 'gossip" about so and so. There''s an itch, a desire in our flesh to hear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 513, 28, 28, 'it. There are people who are specialists in provoking that itch, saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 514, 1, 28, '"I have some juicy news about someone." Then they act like they''re not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 514, 2, 28, 'going to say it until that itch gets worked up and we are eager to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 514, 3, 28, 'receive it. Gossipers are specialists in whetting a person''s appetite to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 514, 4, 28, 'receive gossip. When we realize it and see it is contrary to the law of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 514, 5, 28, 'love, we are to refuse it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 514, 6, 28, 'Do you know that the fruit on the tree of knowledge of good and evil was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 514, 7, 28, 'very tasty? It says that it was a desire to the eyes, and I''m sure it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 514, 8, 28, 'made Eve''s mouth water. Her whole being was drawn towards it. But the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 514, 9, 28, 'thing is God said not to eat it. God has said that about gossip too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 514, 10, 28, 'Whenever you think of someone coming to your house and giving you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 514, 11, 28, 'gossip, think of Eve giving Adam the fruit. To listen is to take and eat');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 514, 12, 28, 'it. You didn''t pluck it off the tree yourself. No. Eve did that. She''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 514, 13, 28, 'the gossiper. But you received it! If we can only keep this picture in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 514, 14, 28, 'our mind every time someone comes to us to gossip - I may not be like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 514, 15, 28, 'Eve plucking off the tree, but I''m like Adam receiving and enjoying it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 514, 16, 28, 'We have to see that in our flesh (in all of us, our flesh is the same)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 514, 17, 28, 'and say, "Lord, my flesh loves to hear gossip." Unless I''m willing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 514, 18, 28, 'say that first and be honest, I''ll never get victory over it. I have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 514, 19, 28, 'say, "Lord, my flesh loves to hear gossip. My flesh loves to eat of that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 514, 20, 28, 'tree which you have forbidden. But, you have said, ''No''. Therefore I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 514, 21, 28, 'will put it to death. I want to see that my heart is not interested even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 514, 22, 28, 'if my flesh is. I want to keep my heart pure."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 514, 23, 28, 'It also says that a gossiper is exactly like wood in a fire. If you want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 514, 24, 28, 'the fire to go down and die, the only way is to make sure you pull out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 514, 25, 28, 'the wood. If you keep adding wood, it''s just going to keep on burning.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 514, 26, 28, 'We have to be careful we don''t encourage people to come and add wood to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 514, 27, 28, 'the fire in our homes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 514, 28, 28, '"Like an earthen vessel overlaid with silver impurities');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 515, 1, 28, 'Are burning lips and a wicked heart."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 515, 2, 28, 'Prov 26:23');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 515, 3, 28, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 515, 4, 28, '"Insincere talk that hides what you''re really thinking is like a fine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 515, 5, 28, 'glaze on a cheap clay pot."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 515, 6, 28, 'Prov 26:23, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 515, 7, 28, 'Burning lips means lips that are full of love - burning with love. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 515, 8, 28, 'say such good words but inside the heart there is hatred. There is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 515, 9, 28, 'plenty of room here for all of us to cleanse ourselves, because as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 515, 10, 28, 'children of Adam we have learned to grow up being diplomatic and saying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 515, 11, 28, 'a lot of things which aren''t really true. Now that we''ve come to see the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 515, 12, 28, 'New and Living Way, we have to cleanse our speech from all insincerity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 515, 13, 28, 'It is just like silver gloss on top of an earthen vessel.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 515, 14, 28, '"He who hates disguises it with his lips,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 515, 15, 28, 'But he lays up deceit in his heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 515, 16, 28, 'When he speaks graciously, do not believe him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 515, 17, 28, 'For there are seven abominations in his heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 515, 18, 28, 'Though his hatred covers itself with guile,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 515, 19, 28, 'His wickedness will be revealed before the assembly."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 515, 20, 28, 'Prov 26:24-26');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 515, 21, 28, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 515, 22, 28, '"A hypocrite hides his hate behind flattering words. They may sound');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 515, 23, 28, 'fine, but don''t believe him, because his heart is filled to the brim');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 515, 24, 28, 'with hate. He may disguise his hatred, but everyone will see the evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 515, 25, 28, 'things he does."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 515, 26, 28, 'Prov 26:24-26, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 515, 27, 28, 'We see here that flattery is something we have to beware of. Whenever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 515, 28, 28, 'you find someone praising you a little too much, you can think of these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 516, 1, 28, 'verses. Think, "There is something dangerous here. Why is he saying so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 516, 2, 28, 'many nice things to me? Maybe he''s not saying so many nice things about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 516, 3, 28, 'me behind my back and that is why he''s saying so many nice things to my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 516, 4, 28, 'face." We are not to be deceived. Jesus said to be as shrewd as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 516, 5, 28, 'serpents. Don''t be deceived by all of the nice things that people say to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 516, 6, 28, 'you. Chances are they don''t say such things behind your back. A person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 516, 7, 28, 'who comes and rebukes you and tells you to your face what he thinks of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 516, 8, 28, 'you is someone who is at least honest. It is far better to keep a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 516, 9, 28, 'relationship with such people than with people who just say a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 516, 10, 28, 'nice things because that can be a cover. Underneath it there can be an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 516, 11, 28, 'insincere, unloving attitude towards you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 516, 12, 28, '"One who digs a pit will fall into it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 516, 13, 28, 'And one who rolls a stone, it will come back on him."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 516, 14, 28, 'Prov 26:27');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 516, 15, 28, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 516, 16, 28, '"People who set traps for others will get caught themselves. People who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 516, 17, 28, 'start landslides get crushed."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 516, 18, 28, 'Prov 26:27, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 516, 19, 28, 'This is what the New Testament means when it says you will reap what you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 516, 20, 28, 'sow. We know that Haman prepared a gallows for Mordecai and finally hung');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 516, 21, 28, 'on it himself. This is a law of God - that we will ultimately reap what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 516, 22, 28, 'we sow. We cannot escape it. If not in this life, then when we finish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 516, 23, 28, 'this life. Either way, we cannot escape this law that we will reap what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 516, 24, 28, 'we sow. If we have done something with an insincere attitude towards');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 516, 25, 28, 'someone else, it says here that one day it will come back on you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 516, 26, 28, 'Starting a landslide, for example. How can we start a landslide? It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 516, 27, 28, 'starts when you talk about something or some person and it multiplies.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 516, 28, 28, 'Finally, it will boomerang back on you. Those who start landslides');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 517, 1, 28, 'finally get crushed under them themselves. When we get crushed under');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 517, 2, 28, 'some landslide, it is good for us to ask ourselves, "Have I done that?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 517, 3, 28, 'Am I just reaping what I have sown?" We sow the wind and we reap the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 517, 4, 28, 'whirlwind. The trouble with a lot of believers is that when they begin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 517, 5, 28, 'to reap the whirlwind, they get upset with people instead of sitting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 517, 6, 28, 'down and thinking, "I may be only reaping what I have sown! Why should I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 517, 7, 28, 'get upset with God or with other human beings? I''m only reaping what I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 517, 8, 28, 'have sown." Therefore we need to be careful that we don''t dig pits for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 517, 9, 28, 'anyone or roll stones down on anyone, which is usually done with our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 517, 10, 28, 'tongues.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 517, 11, 28, '"A lying tongue hates those it crushes,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 517, 12, 28, 'And a flattering mouth works ruin."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 517, 13, 28, 'Prov 26:28');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 517, 14, 28, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 517, 15, 28, '"Flattery is a form of hatred and wounds cruelly."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 517, 16, 28, 'Prov 26:28, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 517, 17, 28, 'Flattery is a form of hatred. Let none of us ever be guilty of this form');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 517, 18, 28, 'of hatred. Flattery is just saying a lot of nice things about someone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 517, 19, 28, 'which we don''t really believe. We can hear in the church that we must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 517, 20, 28, 'always say nice things and honor people, and it can end up with some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 517, 21, 28, 'people as a form of flattery. It doesn''t change their heart. We must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 517, 22, 28, 'only speak what''s in our heart. If it''s not in our heart, it is far');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 517, 23, 28, 'better we don''t say it, because otherwise it becomes flattery which is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 517, 24, 28, 'evil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 517, 25, 28, 'If you''re really wise, you will beware of a flatterer. You will beware');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 517, 26, 28, 'of a person who only says a lot of nice things. That''s the stupidity of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 517, 27, 28, 'the world. The world is stupid in the sense that it appreciates those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 517, 28, 28, 'who say nice things about them and gets terribly offended with those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 518, 1, 28, 'rebuke or correct them. But if we belong to the Lord and we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 518, 2, 28, 'disciples of the Lord, it''s going to be the other way around. We will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 518, 3, 28, 'beware of those who just say a lot of nice things to us, and we''ll cling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 518, 4, 28, 'to those who love us enough to correct us and tell us the truth about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 518, 5, 28, 'ourselves as we will see further down in the next chapter.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 518, 6, 29, 'Chapter 27 Chapter 27');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 518, 7, 29, 'Do not boast about tomorrow,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 518, 8, 29, 'For you do not know what a day may bring.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 518, 9, 29, 'Prov 27:1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 518, 10, 29, 'We read in James 4:13-15, "Don''t say today or tomorrow we''ll go to such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 518, 11, 29, 'and such a city and spend a year there and make a profit, for you do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 518, 12, 29, 'know what your life is. Instead you should say, ''If the Lord wills, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 518, 13, 29, 'shall live and do this and that.''" Think of the humility of James to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 518, 14, 29, 'think that he does not even know whether he will live tomorrow. "If the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 518, 15, 29, 'Lord wills..." It''s not just if the Lord wills, I''ll go there and make a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 518, 16, 29, 'profit. If the Lord wills, I''ll be living tomorrow. Very often this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 518, 17, 29, 'passage of scripture is misunderstood as though all it means is, "I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 518, 18, 29, 'planning to go there and if the Lord wills, I''ll go. Of course there''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 518, 19, 29, 'no doubt that I''ll be living tomorrow." But notice carefully what it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 518, 20, 29, 'says: "If the Lord wills, I will be alive tomorrow...but I don''t know."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 518, 21, 29, 'Think of his humility!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 518, 22, 29, 'It really requires small thoughts about ourselves to think like that:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 518, 23, 29, '"If the Lord wills, I shall live tomorrow, and I shall do this and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 518, 24, 29, 'shall do that." It''s a form of conceit as he says in James 4:16, "As it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 518, 25, 29, 'is, you boast in your arrogance and all such boasting is evil." What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 518, 26, 29, 'right do I have to think that there''s no question that I will be living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 518, 27, 29, 'tomorrow or the day after? That is a form of high thinking according to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 518, 28, 29, 'James. "Do not boast about tomorrow," it says. It is good to walk with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 519, 1, 29, 'small thoughts about ourselves before God''s face so that we say, "If the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 519, 2, 29, 'Lord wills, we shall live." At least if we don''t say that in all our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 519, 3, 29, 'speech, it should be our attitude - that we don''t think we can do this,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 519, 4, 29, 'that and the other thing. God has hidden the future from us with a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 519, 5, 29, 'purpose: he wants us to live with a helpless dependence upon him. If God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 519, 6, 29, 'had given us an understanding of what will happen tomorrow or next week');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 519, 7, 29, 'or next year, the danger is that we would not depend so much upon him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 519, 8, 29, 'But because even the most spiritual people don''t know what is going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 519, 9, 29, 'happen tomorrow (Even James didn''t know if he would live the next day,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 519, 10, 29, 'so it is good for all of us to have that attitude), they also need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 519, 11, 29, 'lean upon God in helplessness. That is why God has hidden the future');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 519, 12, 29, 'from us, so that we can live by faith and lean more closely upon him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 519, 13, 29, 'than if we knew the whole future.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 519, 14, 29, 'Think of the Israelites who came out of Egypt. God could have given them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 519, 15, 29, 'a map of the wilderness when they came out and said, "This is the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 519, 16, 29, 'you need to go." But he didn''t do that. He gave them a pillar of cloud');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 519, 17, 29, 'and said, "You just follow that pillar of cloud." They didn''t know where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 519, 18, 29, 'the pillar of cloud would take them the next day. They didn''t know where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 519, 19, 29, 'it would take them the next week. If they''d had a map, they wouldn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 519, 20, 29, 'have needed God. But since they didn''t have a map, they needed God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 519, 21, 29, 'everyday. It''s good to be in that place of helpless dependence where we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 519, 22, 29, 'don''t know what''s going to happen tomorrow, but we know God is still on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 519, 23, 29, 'the throne and he never forsakes his own. He rules the universe. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 519, 24, 29, 'loves us. He said he will never forsake us or leave us. Therefore we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 519, 25, 29, 'have confidence in him, and our boast is not in tomorrow or in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 519, 26, 29, 'ourselves, but that we have a Father in heaven who cares for all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 519, 27, 29, 'problems that tomorrow can bring. He will not allow us to face tomorrow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 519, 28, 29, 'before he himself has gone into it. He goes ahead of us. He''s prepared');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 520, 1, 29, 'it for us. He makes sure that all things that are going to happen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 520, 2, 29, 'tomorrow will work together for our good, so we go into tomorrow with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 520, 3, 29, 'confidence in God and not in ourselves. We do not know what a day may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 520, 4, 29, 'bring forth, and even after we become more spiritual, we still don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 520, 5, 29, 'know what a day may bring forth. But we know that God knows, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 520, 6, 29, 'therefore we lean in faith upon him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 520, 7, 29, 'Let another praise you and not your own mouth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 520, 8, 29, 'Prov 27:2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 520, 9, 29, 'In Proverbs 25:27, we read, "It''s not good to search one''s own glory."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 520, 10, 29, 'These are similar words here. It''s not good to praise ourselves. Now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 520, 11, 29, 'even in the world, it''s very rare and almost impossible to find someone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 520, 12, 29, 'who crudely praises himself, saying, "This is what I''m like and this is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 520, 13, 29, 'how good I am." Nobody does stupid things like that because it looks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 520, 14, 29, 'very ugly. Everybody who does it does it in a very subtle way. It''s done');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 520, 15, 29, 'in such a way that we look humble, but at the same time we are saying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 520, 16, 29, 'something to draw peoples'' attention to ourselves. It can happen even in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 520, 17, 29, 'a testimony! Of course, nobody would get up and give a testimony saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 520, 18, 29, '"I am a very spiritual man and I''m a very wholehearted brother and have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 520, 19, 29, 'been a great blessing to the church for many years," or any stupid thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 520, 20, 29, 'like that. We''d lose our testimony immediately and we know that. So we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 520, 21, 29, 'cover it all up with humility. It''s in subtle ways! He who judges');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 520, 22, 29, 'himself can get light on this. Ask yourself: was there any part of what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 520, 23, 29, 'I said that was merely to draw attention to myself or to what I did or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 520, 24, 29, 'to how faithful I was in some situation? The intention was not to let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 520, 25, 29, 'people see how wonderful God is or what wonderful things he can do. Very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 520, 26, 29, 'subtly the intention was to get people to maybe have some confidence in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 520, 27, 29, 'me or to think I''m some great man of God or something like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 520, 28, 29, 'For example, you hear of these preachers and healers who get up and say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 521, 1, 29, '"When I was over there in the middle of Africa or somewhere in South');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 521, 2, 29, 'America, there was this lame man and this happened and the other thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 521, 3, 29, 'happened." If you look in the gospels, do you ever see Jesus talking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 521, 4, 29, 'like that? "The other day when I was walking down the road to Nain, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 521, 5, 29, 'found a widow coming out with a dead body, and I just stopped the coffin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 521, 6, 29, 'and told the boy to get up!" Can you imagine Jesus saying things like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 521, 7, 29, 'that? Or Paul? Interjecting some miracle subtly, maybe in the letter to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 521, 8, 29, 'the Corinthians saying, "You know once when I was down there in Troas,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 521, 9, 29, 'I''ll tell you something that happened. Somebody fell down from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 521, 10, 29, 'window..." and then tell how he raised him from the dead. You never find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 521, 11, 29, 'Jesus or the apostles saying such things. There are a lot of preachers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 521, 12, 29, 'going around saying things like that very subtly. They say it is to stir');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 521, 13, 29, 'up faith in people but actually it is just to praise themselves. There''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 521, 14, 29, 'a lot of it going on in very subtle ways. When we see it in others we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 521, 15, 29, 'can say, "That man has the same flesh as me. I also might be doing it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 521, 16, 29, 'perhaps. Maybe not talking about the time I went to South America');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 521, 17, 29, 'because I never went there, but in other subtle ways I may be doing it."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 521, 18, 29, 'I may say something or add something here or there just to get people to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 521, 19, 29, 'think something about me. That''s basically what this verse is talking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 521, 20, 29, 'about. Let another man praise you and not your own mouth, even in subtle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 521, 21, 29, 'ways. If a stranger sees something in you, let them speak about it, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 521, 22, 29, 'don''t try to get it all out to make people think you are somebody.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 521, 23, 29, 'A stone is heavy and the sand weighty,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 521, 24, 29, 'But the provocation of a fool is heavier than both of them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 521, 25, 29, 'Prov 27:3');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 521, 26, 29, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 521, 27, 29, 'The weight of stone and sand is nothing compared to the trouble that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 521, 28, 29, 'stupidity can cause.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 522, 1, 29, 'Prov 27:3, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 522, 2, 29, 'Think of that. To have stones fall on your head and have sand fall on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 522, 3, 29, 'your head is nothing compared to the trouble that stupid people can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 522, 4, 29, 'cause. That is why we really need to ask God to deliver us from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 522, 5, 29, 'stupidity and foolishness, so that we don''t cause trouble to other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 522, 6, 29, 'people. It''s like throwing stones and bags of sand around.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 522, 7, 29, 'Wrath is fierce and anger is a flood,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 522, 8, 29, 'But who can stand before jealousy?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 522, 9, 29, 'Prov 27:4');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 522, 10, 29, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 522, 11, 29, 'Anger is cruel and destructive, but it is nothing compared to jealousy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 522, 12, 29, 'Prov 27:4, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 522, 13, 29, 'This is a very interesting verse. Anger is one of those evil things the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 522, 14, 29, 'Bible speaks much about. But here it speaks of something worse than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 522, 15, 29, 'anger! When you listen to a man who is angry, it''s like a flood coming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 522, 16, 29, 'out of his mouth. You know what happens when a flood comes. A flood');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 522, 17, 29, 'destroys everything. It''s not easy to stop. It keeps on coming. Anger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 522, 18, 29, 'really is like a flood. But it is nothing compared to jealousy. Anger is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 522, 19, 29, 'cruel and destructive like a flood but it''s nothing compared to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 522, 20, 29, 'jealousy. Someone may say, "I got victory over anger." Good. But what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 522, 21, 29, 'about jealousy and envy? That is to feel a little unhappy that someone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 522, 22, 29, 'else has something you don''t have - maybe some spiritual gift or some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 522, 23, 29, 'confidence from other brothers or some opportunity or a more peaceful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 522, 24, 29, 'life than you. Your life is always filled with trouble, trouble,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 522, 25, 29, 'trouble, but somebody else has a very comfortable life. That can cause a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 522, 26, 29, 'little envy and irritation. Or perhaps it''s related to material things;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 522, 27, 29, 'somebody else has a better job or is getting promotions and here you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 522, 28, 29, 'struggling with your income. There can be so many causes. Watch out for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 523, 1, 29, 'jealousy. Be careful! It dwells very much in our flesh and it is worse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 523, 2, 29, 'than the flood of anger.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 523, 3, 29, 'Open rebuke is better than secret love.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 523, 4, 29, 'Prov 27:5, KJV');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 523, 5, 29, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 523, 6, 29, 'Better to correct someone openly than to let him think you don''t care');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 523, 7, 29, 'for him at all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 523, 8, 29, 'Prov 27:5, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 523, 9, 29, 'This is the verse I was telling you about earlier when we covered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 523, 10, 29, 'Proverbs 26:28. Secret love is to let a person think you don''t care for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 523, 11, 29, 'him. It is better to speak and correct someone, even openly. It''s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 523, 12, 29, 'speaking about private rebuke. Open rebuke is better than secret love. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 523, 13, 29, 'wise man understands that. A person who is not wise thinks that that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 523, 14, 29, 'love is better than open rebuke, and that if a person loves there cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 523, 15, 29, 'be open rebuke. But the word of God says it is better to correct someone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 523, 16, 29, 'openly than to let him think that you don''t care for him at all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 523, 17, 29, 'Think about when Peter said to Jesus, "Lord, you shouldn''t go to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 523, 18, 29, 'cross." Jesus could have said, "Listen, Peter. Come over here. I want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 523, 19, 29, 'tell you something privately." And he could have whispered in his ear,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 523, 20, 29, '"That was from the devil, that thought you just had." But he didn''t do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 523, 21, 29, 'that. If he had said it privately, then what Jesus told Peter probably');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 523, 22, 29, 'never would have been recorded in scripture. But he said to Peter openly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 523, 23, 29, 'in the presence of everyone, "Get behind me, Satan!" And see how much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 523, 24, 29, 'help that has been to us for two thousand years? For two thousand years,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 523, 25, 29, 'many Christians have been helped by that open rebuke of Jesus. Now we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 523, 26, 29, 'understand that to be interested in the things of man is to hear the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 523, 27, 29, 'voice of Satan. That''s why the bible says that through open rebuke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 523, 28, 29, 'others are also helped besides just that one person. If Jesus had only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 524, 1, 29, 'spoken privately to Peter, only Peter would have been helped. But now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 524, 2, 29, 'it''s not only him, but all others have been helped too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 524, 3, 29, 'Friends mean well, even when they hurt you. But when an enemy puts his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 524, 4, 29, 'arm around your shoulder-watch out!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 524, 5, 29, 'Prov 27:6, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 524, 6, 29, 'We''ve seen many times in Proverbs and in the word of God words about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 524, 7, 29, 'rebuke. Jesus said in Revelation 3:19 that those whom he loves, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 524, 8, 29, 'rebukes. So that''s how it must be in the church as well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 524, 9, 29, 'When you are full, you will refuse honey, but when you are hungry, even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 524, 10, 29, 'bitter food tastes sweet.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 524, 11, 29, 'Prov 27:7, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 524, 12, 29, 'A poor man doesn''t have so much to eat. He eats very simple food, but is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 524, 13, 29, 'very thankful because he''s only thinking about keeping his stomach from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 524, 14, 29, 'hunger. But a very rich person can be so selective: "The taste here is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 524, 15, 29, 'not so good. That has a little too much salt. This needs a little more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 524, 16, 29, 'chili here." This is a rich man who has so much. He is so particular,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 524, 17, 29, 'whereas a poor man is thankful to get something to fill his stomach.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 524, 18, 29, 'There is a danger with many of us, brothers and sisters, of not being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 524, 19, 29, 'thankful to God for small mercies. We can take so much for granted that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 524, 20, 29, 'we ruin ourselves. We need to learn to be thankful for whatever we get.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 524, 21, 29, 'We need to teach children to be thankful for whatever food is placed on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 524, 22, 29, 'the table and not to complain that it doesn''t taste good and that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 524, 23, 29, 'are having the same thing everyday. No. That''s what they did in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 524, 24, 29, 'wilderness in the Old Testament - "Everyday this wretched manna!" Have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 524, 25, 29, 'you heard that at home sometimes - children saying, "Everyday it''s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 524, 26, 29, 'same thing!"? Think about if you were getting the same old diet for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 524, 27, 29, 'forty years - three hundred and sixty-five days per year. Think that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 524, 28, 29, 'did not vary the diet from heaven. And the Bible says it was a food they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 525, 1, 29, 'were not used to (Deuteronomy 8:3). They grumbled and complained, and it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 525, 2, 29, 'says that the serpents came and bit them. We need to protect our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 525, 3, 29, 'children from being bitten by the serpents because they complain about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 525, 4, 29, 'food. A poor man is just thankful that his stomach can be filled. We are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 525, 5, 29, 'not to become those who are so particular about our food, and we are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 525, 6, 29, 'to allow our children to become like that either.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 525, 7, 29, 'We can also apply this spiritually to the messages we receive in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 525, 8, 29, 'church. It''s very easy to take spiritually rich food for granted in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 525, 9, 29, 'church and to think we deserve rich food every week. I''ve sometimes felt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 525, 10, 29, 'that people who have grown up in our midst and haven''t been to other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 525, 11, 29, 'churches need to spend six months or a year in another denomination.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 525, 12, 29, 'Then they will sufficiently appreciate the word of God that is received');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 525, 13, 29, 'in the church. Otherwise it can be just like this rich man, where even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 525, 14, 29, 'if you give him honey, he doesn''t care for it. We have to be very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 525, 15, 29, 'careful, dear brothers and sisters, that we don''t take God''s mercies for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 525, 16, 29, 'granted. We can apply this verse spiritually to ourselves and see the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 525, 17, 29, 'application it has.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 525, 18, 29, 'Like a bird that wanders from her nest,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 525, 19, 29, 'So is a man who wanders from his home (or appointed place - margin)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 525, 20, 29, 'Prov 27:8');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 525, 21, 29, 'God has an appointed place for every one of us, and it is wise to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 525, 22, 29, 'found there. It may not always be the most comfortable place; it may not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 525, 23, 29, 'always be the place where it''s very convenient to our flesh, but it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 525, 24, 29, 'the place God has appointed. I need to see the place that God has put me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 525, 25, 29, 'in the church and say, "Lord, I want to be in that place. You''ve given');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 525, 26, 29, 'me a place, and I don''t want to be like a bird wandering away from my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 525, 27, 29, 'nest. You have called me to this particular place. I want to find my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 525, 28, 29, 'salvation and my sanctification here and do the will of God. I''m not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 526, 1, 29, 'interested in looking at all the other people and seeing what they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 526, 2, 29, 'doing. That''s none of my business. You''ve given me this place. I''m so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 526, 3, 29, 'thankful you''ve given me a nest, a home, a spiritual home!" It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 526, 4, 29, 'possible, because we''ve had our spiritual home for so many years, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 526, 5, 29, 'we can begin to take it for granted and be critical of various things in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 526, 6, 29, 'the nest - "This thing is like that and that thing is like this." We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 526, 7, 29, 'have become so rich in our own self and critical and then we wander.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 526, 8, 29, 'Then we become targets for Satan. It is possible to sit physically in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 526, 9, 29, 'meeting place with other believers and be critical. I just want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 526, 10, 29, 'encourage you to beware of that spirit, because the loss will be yours.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 526, 11, 29, 'God has given to each of us a particular task, a particular place, a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 526, 12, 29, 'particular gift, and a particular calling. It''s good for us to humble');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 526, 13, 29, 'ourselves and accept it. For example, the Bible says that sisters have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 526, 14, 29, 'place in the church under the brothers. It''s good for a sister to take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 526, 15, 29, 'that place always. That''s her appointed place. If she doesn''t take that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 526, 16, 29, 'place, she''ll become like a bird who wanders from her nest. Another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 526, 17, 29, 'example is a wife who submits to her husband at home. That''s her place:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 526, 18, 29, 'submitting to her husband. If she does that, it will go well with her.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 526, 19, 29, 'If she doesn''t, she''s wandering away from the nest and she''ll become a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 526, 20, 29, 'target of the arrows of those who are hunting birds.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 526, 21, 29, 'Oil and perfume make the heart glad,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 526, 22, 29, 'So a man''s counsel is sweet to his friend.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 526, 23, 29, 'Prov 27:9');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 526, 24, 29, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 526, 25, 29, 'Friendly suggestions are as pleasant as perfume.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 526, 26, 29, 'Prov 27:9, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 526, 27, 29, 'When we get a suggestion, it''s very easy to accept it if we know that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 526, 28, 29, 'the person who is giving the suggestion is a friend. But if we are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 527, 1, 29, 'so sure that person is a friend, then it is difficult to accept that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 527, 2, 29, 'suggestion. Isn''t it like that? We can say, "This person who is giving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 527, 3, 29, 'that suggestion is a friend of mine. Okay, I''ll take it. But this person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 527, 4, 29, 'who is giving that suggestion, I''m not too sure whether he really loves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 527, 5, 29, 'me or not. I won''t take it." Isn''t that right? Yes, this applies for all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 527, 6, 29, 'worldly people and for all worldly, carnal believers. But for those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 527, 7, 29, 'are spiritually-minded, they don''t bother whether it comes from a friend');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 527, 8, 29, 'or someone who is not a friend. The only thing a spiritually-minded man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 527, 9, 29, 'asks himself is, "Is the thing which this person said right? If yes, let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 527, 10, 29, 'me take it. It doesn''t matter who said it and whether he''s my friend or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 527, 11, 29, 'not." I need to take heed to that. A person who is interested in his own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 527, 12, 29, 'sanctification is not bothered about who made the suggestion. He is only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 527, 13, 29, 'concerned about whether the suggestion can help to cleanse him and make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 527, 14, 29, 'him a more whole-hearted disciple of Jesus. That''s all he''s interested');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 527, 15, 29, 'in. We need to change our way of thinking, so that when we hear advice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 527, 16, 29, 'from someone, we don''t inwardly check, "Is this person a friend or not a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 527, 17, 29, 'friend?" We have to say, "That''s unimportant. Was the advice good or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 527, 18, 29, 'bad? That''s all that matters." That''s the spiritual man''s attitude. Here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 527, 19, 29, 'we can see how much carnality can be in us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 527, 20, 29, 'Never abandon a friend-either yours or your father''s. Then you won''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 527, 21, 29, 'need to go to a distant relative for help in your time of need.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 527, 22, 29, 'Prov 27:10, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 527, 23, 29, 'Ideally speaking, this is how it should be in the brotherhood in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 527, 24, 29, 'church. The relationship between the brothers and between the sisters');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 527, 25, 29, 'must be of such a nature that is far deeper than the relationship that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 527, 26, 29, 'we have with our own flesh and blood relatives. That is the goal toward');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 527, 27, 29, 'which God is working to make his church: that our flesh and blood');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 527, 28, 29, 'brothers are not the ones to whom we look for help as much as to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 528, 1, 29, 'fellowship in the church. We pray that it will be like that in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 528, 2, 29, 'midst.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 528, 3, 29, 'But it says here not to forsake your friend or your father''s friend. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 528, 4, 29, 'other words, it''s possible to have such a relationship only if you''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 528, 5, 29, 'cultivated spiritual friendship and fellowship with one another in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 528, 6, 29, 'church. It''s possible for us not to cultivate this type of relationship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 528, 7, 29, 'at all and then suddenly in our time of need, we expect everyone to come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 528, 8, 29, 'running to our help and we get very upset when someone doesn''t come to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 528, 9, 29, 'help us. We have to ask ourselves, "Have I ever cultivated fellowship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 528, 10, 29, 'and relationships with my brothers and sisters?" If not, then why would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 528, 11, 29, 'I expect them all to come running when a mosquito bites me somewhere?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 528, 12, 29, 'That''s just conceit and stupidity. But build up those relationships and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 528, 13, 29, 'those friendships and there will be a bond among brothers and among');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 528, 14, 29, 'sisters. Then you don''t need to go to your distant relatives for help.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 528, 15, 29, 'This is God''s will: that we build up relationships and that we can stand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 528, 16, 29, 'by one another.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 528, 17, 29, 'Be wise, my son, and make my heart glad,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 528, 18, 29, 'That I may reply to him who reproaches me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 528, 19, 29, 'Prov 27:11');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 528, 20, 29, 'We can take this as a word for ourselves. Think of God saying to each');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 528, 21, 29, 'one of us, "Be wise, my son, my daughter, and make my heart glad. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 528, 22, 29, 'way when Satan points out something in you to reproach me, I have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 528, 23, 29, 'reply to give to him." When David sinned with Bathsheba, Nathan the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 528, 24, 29, 'prophet came to him and said, "Do you know, David, that by what you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 528, 25, 29, 'done, you have given an occasion for the enemies of the Lord to reproach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 528, 26, 29, 'the Lord''s name?" (2 Samuel 12:14). "By what you have done, the enemies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 528, 27, 29, 'of the Lord have a chance to say, ''Look what this so-called man of God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 528, 28, 29, 'David, did.''" So the Lord says, "Be wise, my son, my daughter, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 529, 1, 29, 'people can''t point at you and say, ''See, this person talks about the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 529, 2, 29, 'and Living Way but look at what they do.'' Be wise, my son, and make my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 529, 3, 29, 'heart glad, so that when somebody reproaches me I will have a proper');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 529, 4, 29, 'reply to give him."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 529, 5, 29, 'Sensible people will see trouble coming and avoid it, but an unthinking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 529, 6, 29, 'person will walk right into it and regret it later.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 529, 7, 29, 'Prov 27:12, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 529, 8, 29, 'When a wise person sees trouble coming, he''ll avoid it, but a simple');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 529, 9, 29, 'person walks right into it. How does this apply to us? We know that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 529, 10, 29, 'certain things can be sources of tremendous temptation. A wise person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 529, 11, 29, 'will be careful and avoid those things. For example, if you find that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 529, 12, 29, 'you tend to become very free and humorous in your conversations with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 529, 13, 29, 'opposite sex - even more than with people of your own sex - then you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 529, 14, 29, 'need to say, "There is a danger for me there, and I can lose out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 529, 15, 29, 'spiritually. Let me be a little more careful about mingling with people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 529, 16, 29, 'of the opposite sex." Young people particularly need to be careful in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 529, 17, 29, 'this area. A wise person will see the danger and say, "I find that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 529, 18, 29, 'become very light-hearted when I am with people of the opposite sex. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 529, 19, 29, 'tend to lose that sense of seriousness." Be careful and don''t get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 529, 20, 29, 'involved too much in those types of situations. It says in the Good News');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 529, 21, 29, 'Translation that you''ll regret it later. Afterwards you''ll say, "That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 529, 22, 29, 'was a stupid thing that I did." That''s sad. 2 Timothy 2:22 says, "Flee');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 529, 23, 29, 'from youthful lusts." Be wise and avoid youthful lusts particularly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 529, 24, 29, 'Flee from temptation like the word of God tells us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 529, 25, 29, 'Take his garment when he becomes surety for a stranger;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 529, 26, 29, 'And for an adulterous woman hold him in pledge.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 529, 27, 29, 'Prov 27:13');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 529, 28, 29, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 530, 1, 29, 'Any people stupid enough to promise to be responsible for a stranger''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 530, 2, 29, 'debts deserve to have their own property held to guarantee payment.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 530, 3, 29, 'Prov 27:13, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 530, 4, 29, 'This is referring to standing guarantee for someone. It''s amazing the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 530, 5, 29, 'number of times in the book of Proverbs it says not to stand guarantee');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 530, 6, 29, 'for a stranger. And here it also speaks about a strange woman. Sometimes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 530, 7, 29, 'it can be the charm that a woman has that you can fall for. Be very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 530, 8, 29, 'careful that we are not deceived - that we don''t stand guarantee and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 530, 9, 29, 'think that it is a manifestation of love. It''s not. It is amazing how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 530, 10, 29, 'many times this is repeated in the book of Proverbs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 530, 11, 29, 'You might as well curse your friends as wake them up early in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 530, 12, 29, 'morning with a loud greeting.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 530, 13, 29, 'Prov 27:14, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 530, 14, 29, 'Think of going outside someone''s house at four-thirty in the morning and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 530, 15, 29, 'shouting out, "You''re a wonderful brother!" and praising him with a loud');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 530, 16, 29, 'voice. You''re out there early in the morning and the chap is trying to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 530, 17, 29, 'sleep. This says that is just as bad as cursing him. We have to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 530, 18, 29, 'sensible in our trying to be a blessing to others. You may want to be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 530, 19, 29, 'blessing to your neighbor by saying something good, but don''t do it at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 530, 20, 29, 'four-thirty in the morning. That''s just an example. If you want to bless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 530, 21, 29, 'a brother in some way, you have to be wise in how you do it. Go at a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 530, 22, 29, 'more sensible time and say it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 530, 23, 29, 'This has many practical applications. For example, you say, "We must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 530, 24, 29, 'help one another in the church. I''m going to be one of those zealous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 530, 25, 29, 'brothers and sisters and help others." Then you can go to someone''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 530, 26, 29, 'house and make an absolute nuisance of yourself trying to be a blessing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 530, 27, 29, 'to them. That''s right. If you go at four-thirty in the morning, you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 530, 28, 29, 'going to be a nuisance to him rather than a blessing. It''s as bad as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 531, 1, 29, 'cursing him. You''re aim is to be a blessing, but it''s done so stupidly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 531, 2, 29, 'that you might as well curse him. We need wisdom even in trying to be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 531, 3, 29, 'blessing to other people. Say, "Lord, I want to be a blessing, but don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 531, 4, 29, 'let me do it in such a stupid way that other people think of me as an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 531, 5, 29, 'absolute pest and a nuisance." If we take these simple exhortations in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 531, 6, 29, 'the word of God seriously, we can be protected from multitudes of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 531, 7, 29, 'stupidities. I''ve often said that if young people would take the book of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 531, 8, 29, 'Proverbs seriously, they can grow up without the reputation of being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 531, 9, 29, 'foolish. He who has ears to hear can hear.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 531, 10, 29, 'A constant dripping on a rainy day and a cranky woman are much alike!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 531, 11, 29, 'You can no more stop her complaints than you can stop the wind or hold');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 531, 12, 29, 'onto anything with greasy hands.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 531, 13, 29, 'Prov 27;15-16, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 531, 14, 29, 'These men of Hezekiah were really keen on repeating this again and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 531, 15, 29, 'again. Think of the illustration that when a woman gets all upset and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 531, 16, 29, 'she''s complaining about something, trying to stop her is like trying to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 531, 17, 29, 'stop the wind or trying to hold something with greasy hands. It just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 531, 18, 29, 'slips out. You can''t do it. Let me just say that this is not a verse for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 531, 19, 29, 'the brothers to go home and hit their wives on the head with. This is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 531, 20, 29, 'verse for the sisters. It is not for the brothers! The brothers can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 531, 21, 29, 'forget about this verse. This verse is for sisters to say, "Lord, help');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 531, 22, 29, 'me so that I''ll never be like this drip, drip, drip, drip, drip, drip,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 531, 23, 29, 'drip, drip, drip all the time in the house." Nag, Nag, Nag. This thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 531, 24, 29, 'or the other thing. This thing is not done and that thing is not done');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 531, 25, 29, 'and that other thing and that other thing and that other thing. Say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 531, 26, 29, '"Lord, help me that I should never be a wife like this."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 531, 27, 29, 'A friendly discussion is as stimulating as the sparks which fly when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 531, 28, 29, 'iron strikes iron.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 532, 1, 29, 'Prov 27:17, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 532, 2, 29, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 532, 3, 29, 'People learn from one another, just as iron sharpens iron.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 532, 4, 29, 'Prov 27:17, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 532, 5, 29, 'Iron sharpens iron. You can''t sharpen iron with wood. That teaches us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 532, 6, 29, 'that God wants each of us to be strong in ourselves so that we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 532, 7, 29, 'sharpen one another. When you sharpen one iron with another iron, there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 532, 8, 29, 'are some sparks, but both pieces of iron get sharpened. God wants each');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 532, 9, 29, 'of us to have convictions and to be strong in the Lord, so that we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 532, 10, 29, 'help one another and love one another enough to discuss something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 532, 11, 29, 'freely. A good question to ask ourselves is: Can you discuss something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 532, 12, 29, 'with someone who is of the complete opposite opinion as yourself and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 532, 13, 29, 'still love him? That''s a good test of whether we have understood divine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 532, 14, 29, 'love or not. Or do I find that I only like to discuss things with those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 532, 15, 29, 'who agree with me in everything? That''s the way to spiritual babyhood.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 532, 16, 29, 'That''s like iron striking against clay. Sometimes we can have one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 532, 17, 29, 'strong-minded person (man or woman) who is always going around making an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 532, 18, 29, 'impression on all the clay around. But here it is not talking about iron');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 532, 19, 29, 'and clay; it''s talking about iron and iron. They love one another. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 532, 20, 29, 'may disagree on some trivial things - that''s unimportant. But they can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 532, 21, 29, 'speak freely to one another and still love one another! And both are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 532, 22, 29, 'sharp in their love for one another at the end of it all. It''s wonderful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 532, 23, 29, 'when we can come to that maturity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 532, 24, 29, 'This is how God intends our relationships to be with one another. We can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 532, 25, 29, 'have strong convictions and be established in the Lord, and be like iron');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 532, 26, 29, 'rather than weak like clay, and yet when we come together, it''s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 532, 27, 29, 'God''s intention that we destroy one another. You can take one piece of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 532, 28, 29, 'iron and hammer another piece of iron with it and destroy it. That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 533, 1, 29, 'what happens in fellowship between a lot of brothers. The other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 533, 2, 29, 'alternative is that one man is like iron and the other man is like clay,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 533, 3, 29, 'and they stay together and call it fellowship. It''s not fellowship. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 533, 4, 29, 'just one iron putting its stamp on the clay. No. God''s intention is that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 533, 5, 29, 'both of us can be like iron and yet that we don''t destroy each other but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 533, 6, 29, 'sharpen each other. It''s a wonderful thing when we can have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 533, 7, 29, 'relationship like that, where "a friendly discussion is as stimulating');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 533, 8, 29, 'as the sparks that fly when iron strikes iron." When iron strikes iron');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 533, 9, 29, 'there are sparks, but that results in a sharpening. It''s a wonderful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 533, 10, 29, 'thing when we can be strong, yet fervently in love with one another even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 533, 11, 29, 'if we don''t see eye to eye on a whole lot of minor issues. Our love is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 533, 12, 29, 'not tested when we agree with one another, but when there are certain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 533, 13, 29, 'things we have slightly different opinions on. Then we can know whether');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 533, 14, 29, 'we love one another or not.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 533, 15, 29, 'He who tends the fig tree will eat its fruit,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 533, 16, 29, 'And he who cares for his master will be honored.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 533, 17, 29, 'Prov 27:18');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 533, 18, 29, 'There are two things here: first of all, the hardworking farmer will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 533, 19, 29, 'the first to receive his share of the crops (2 Timothy 2:6). It is only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 533, 20, 29, 'righteous of God that those who have worked hard on their lives will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 533, 21, 29, 'naturally be the first to receive. They will be the firstfruits. And he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 533, 22, 29, 'who tends the fig tree will eat its fruit. He who watches his inner life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 533, 23, 29, 'will reap the benefit of having an inner life from which rivers of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 533, 24, 29, 'living water can flow. Of course, he who neglects his inner life and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 533, 25, 29, 'only cares for his external life will not be able to eat that fruit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 533, 26, 29, 'because he also will reap what he sows.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 533, 27, 29, 'Secondly it says, "He who cares for his master will be honored." This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 533, 28, 29, 'means that we have to seek God''s honor and not our own. We "care for our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 534, 1, 29, 'master" which means that we''re not concerned about our own name but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 534, 2, 29, 'about the Lord''s name. Here again God sees the inner attitude of a man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 534, 3, 29, 'As in water, face reflects face,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 534, 4, 29, 'So the heart of man reflects man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 534, 5, 29, 'Prov 27:19');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 534, 6, 29, 'This verse teaches us that just like how in water we can see our own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 534, 7, 29, 'face reflected, what we see in another person''s heart is actually just a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 534, 8, 29, 'reflection of what is in our own heart. That is a very searching verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 534, 9, 29, 'if you think about it. We all have the tendency to have opinions as to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 534, 10, 29, 'what another person is thinking or why a certain person did something.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 534, 11, 29, 'This verse is saying that if you think that the other person is selfish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 534, 12, 29, 'in what he did, it''s because you yourself are so selfish. You think that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 534, 13, 29, 'everybody else must have some wretched, selfish motive just like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 534, 14, 29, 'yourself. Or when you feel that a person said something to hurt you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 534, 15, 29, 'it''s a reflection of the fact that in your own heart, you always have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 534, 16, 29, 'wretched attitude of trying to hurt other people. Therefore you imagine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 534, 17, 29, 'that his heart is also like your filthy heart. But it may not be true.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 534, 18, 29, 'His heart may be good. We have that tendency to always imagine that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 534, 19, 29, 'other people have the same rotten motives that we ourselves have. Just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 534, 20, 29, 'remember that the next time you think some brother or sister has a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 534, 21, 29, 'rotten motive: you''re actually looking in a mirror. You can''t imagine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 534, 22, 29, 'that anybody can be purer than you are yourself. Just like in water,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 534, 23, 29, 'face reflects face, so the heart of man reflects man. That''s a very good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 534, 24, 29, 'way, when we judge another, to get light on the condition of our own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 534, 25, 29, 'heart! If I can only humble myself when that happens and say, "Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 534, 26, 29, 'what I''m seeing is not his heart. I can''t see his heart in any case. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 534, 27, 29, 'I imagine that he has these things in his heart because that''s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 534, 28, 29, 'condition of my own heart." Then I can cleanse myself and purify myself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 535, 1, 29, 'Sheol and Abadon are never satisfied,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 535, 2, 29, 'Nor are the eyes of man ever satisfied.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 535, 3, 29, 'Prov 27:20');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 535, 4, 29, 'Sheol is the place of the dead, and Abadon is the place of judgment and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 535, 5, 29, 'Hell. This is speaking about covetousness. When 1 John 2:16 speaks about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 535, 6, 29, 'the lust of the eyes, that is different from the lust of the flesh.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 535, 7, 29, 'Fornication is a lust of the flesh. The lust of the eyes is to desire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 535, 8, 29, 'material things which we see with our eyes. The Living Bible describes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 535, 9, 29, 'it as, "the ambition to buy everything that appeals to you" (1 John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 535, 10, 29, '2:16, TLB). That is what it''s saying here. "The eyes of a man are never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 535, 11, 29, 'satisfied…" He sees something and wants it, he sees something else and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 535, 12, 29, 'wants it, he sees yet another thing and wants it - just like death and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 535, 13, 29, 'Hell are always waiting for more and more people to come into them. Hell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 535, 14, 29, 'is always waiting for more people to come and everyday Hell is receiving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 535, 15, 29, 'people by the thousands. In the same way, the eyes of man and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 535, 16, 29, 'covetousness are equated with the desire of Hell to always have more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 535, 17, 29, 'people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 535, 18, 29, 'So we see what a horrible thing covetousness is. As someone has said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 535, 19, 29, '"God provides enough for every man''s need, but not enough for the greed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 535, 20, 29, 'of even one man." The more we get, the more we feel we should have. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 535, 21, 29, 'can examine ourselves by looking back and seeing that some years ago we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 535, 22, 29, 'would have been quite satisfied with what we have today. But we may find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 535, 23, 29, 'that we are not satisfied with what we have today, because now we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 535, 24, 29, 'always longing for something more. There is a continuous dissatisfaction');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 535, 25, 29, 'in the life of the covetous person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 535, 26, 29, 'The crucible is for silver and the furnace for gold,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 535, 27, 29, 'And each is tested by the praise accorded him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 535, 28, 29, 'Prov 27:21');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 536, 1, 29, 'This says that just like we put gold and silver into the fire to test it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 536, 2, 29, '- to see whether it''s real gold or silver - you can see the genuineness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 536, 3, 29, 'of a true man of God by his reaction when people praise him. We should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 536, 4, 29, 'know this verse so that we can know who the genuinely godly people are,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 536, 5, 29, 'even if other people don''t have discernment. Of course, it''s also true');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 536, 6, 29, 'that when people criticize a godly man, that''s also a test of his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 536, 7, 29, 'spirituality. But let''s say he can pass that test (the test of being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 536, 8, 29, 'dead to the opinions of people) to such an extent that even if he hears');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 536, 9, 29, 'that someone has said something bad about him or criticized him, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 536, 10, 29, 'doesn''t disturb him. Good. But here is an even higher test than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 536, 11, 29, 'criticism and opposition: praise. It''s easier to face criticism than it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 536, 12, 29, 'is to face praise. When somebody says something good about us, and there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 536, 13, 29, 'is no flicker in our heart of a little satisfaction or a little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 536, 14, 29, 'happiness that someone has such a good opinion of me, then I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 536, 15, 29, 'overcome in this area. If there is a flicker of happiness and joy when I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 536, 16, 29, 'hear someone has said something good about me, then I know there''s still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 536, 17, 29, 'a little dross that needs to be melted away in the furnace. It''s good to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 536, 18, 29, 'judge myself and cleanse myself of that dross which made me a little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 536, 19, 29, 'happy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 536, 20, 29, 'We are to come to the place where we so die with Christ that neither');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 536, 21, 29, 'criticism nor praise produce any little flicker in our hearts. Then we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 536, 22, 29, 'are really living before the face of God. Only such people are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 536, 23, 29, 'continuously living in the most holy place before God''s face. Most of us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 536, 24, 29, 'live there now and then, but then we come back to the place where we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 536, 25, 29, 'want the praise of men. So this is a tremendous verse that tells us a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 536, 26, 29, 'man is tested - and the real value of a man is seen - by his reaction to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 536, 27, 29, 'praise. That''s something that another person cannot know. You don''t know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 536, 28, 29, 'what I feel in my heart when somebody praises me, and I don''t know what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 537, 1, 29, 'you feel in your heart when somebody praises you. So this is not a verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 537, 2, 29, 'for us to judge one another. But it is a wonderful verse to judge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 537, 3, 29, 'ourselves by if we are whole-hearted! We can say, "Lord, here''s a verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 537, 4, 29, 'by which I can find out if I''m really whole-hearted in judging and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 537, 5, 29, 'cleansing myself."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 537, 6, 29, 'Though you pound a fool in a mortar with a pestle along with crushed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 537, 7, 29, 'grain,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 537, 8, 29, 'Yet his foolishness will not depart from him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 537, 9, 29, 'Prov 27:22');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 537, 10, 29, 'A mortar with a pestle is that solid iron piece you put inside an iron');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 537, 11, 29, 'vessel to crush various bits of grain and powdered chilies and things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 537, 12, 29, 'like that. He says even if you put a fool inside there and crush him and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 537, 13, 29, 'grind him down, his folly still doesn''t depart from him. Compare this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 537, 14, 29, 'verse with Proverbs 22:15 which speaks about when this fool was a little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 537, 15, 29, 'child. Now this fool''s folly won''t depart from him even if he''s put in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 537, 16, 29, 'mortar with a pestle, but if his father had been a little more wise and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 537, 17, 29, 'used the rod a little more on him when he was a child, his folly would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 537, 18, 29, 'have departed from him long ago. When we see that young people grow up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 537, 19, 29, 'to do a whole lot of stupid, foolish things again and again, we have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 537, 20, 29, 'say we feel sorry for those young people, because the folly is with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 537, 21, 29, 'parents. The folly is with the parents who never drove out that folly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 537, 22, 29, 'when he was a little child. Now it''s too late. The fool has grown up and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 537, 23, 29, 'no matter what you say, even if you hammer him with a word in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 537, 24, 29, 'meeting, he''ll still go and do the same foolish things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 537, 25, 29, 'But praise God, if we are whole-hearted, we can humble ourselves and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 537, 26, 29, 'really ask God to discipline us and do what our parents failed to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 537, 27, 29, 'when we were young! If you''re whole-hearted, there''s hope for you. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 537, 28, 29, 'has now become our Father and he''ll take care of our discipline if we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 538, 1, 29, 'are really whole-hearted. We must come to him and say, "Lord, my parents');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 538, 2, 29, 'didn''t discipline me when I was small. They petted me and loved me and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 538, 3, 29, 'cared for me, and I grew up to be an absolute fool. Now, Lord, you take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 538, 4, 29, 'me in your hand and discipline me, so that I will not continue to be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 538, 5, 29, 'fool in the coming years." Then there''s hope for you. And this is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 538, 6, 29, 'warning for all parents that you don''t give your child a heritage of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 538, 7, 29, 'growing up to be a fool, that one day this verse has to be said about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 538, 8, 29, 'him. Let''s take this seriously as parents so that we drive that out of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 538, 9, 29, 'our children when they are young, so that we don''t give them an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 538, 10, 29, 'inheritance of foolishness. Parents are so concerned about giving their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 538, 11, 29, 'children an education. Think of a parent who is so concerned, saying, "I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 538, 12, 29, 'can''t get my child into the best school for admission." They are so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 538, 13, 29, 'bothered about that. But here is the thing which they don''t seem to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 538, 14, 29, 'so concerned about. That''s why we must take it more seriously that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 538, 15, 29, 'teach our children wisdom when they are young.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 538, 16, 29, 'Know well the condition of your flocks,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 538, 17, 29, 'And pay attention to your herds;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 538, 18, 29, 'Prov 27:23');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 538, 19, 29, 'This is a very good verse for all those who have shepherding');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 538, 20, 29, 'responsibilities. We know that in a church it''s not feasible to only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 538, 21, 29, 'have one shepherd or pastor. I believe it''s impossible for one pastor to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 538, 22, 29, 'look after more than about ten or eleven people. Jesus never tried to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 538, 23, 29, 'handle more than twelve. Jesus shepherded only twelve disciples and you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 538, 24, 29, 'have to be an absolute idiot to think you can be a pastor of a hundred');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 538, 25, 29, 'and twenty people. There are multitudes of idiots in the world who think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 538, 26, 29, 'they can be pastors of a hundred, two hundred, three thousand, five');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 538, 27, 29, 'thousand people. It''s a lot of rot. Jesus, almighty son of God, who came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 538, 28, 29, 'down to earth as a man, the perfect One who never sinned, did not try to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 539, 1, 29, 'handle shepherding more than twelve people. He preached to multitudes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 539, 2, 29, 'but shepherded only twelve so that he could really work with them. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 539, 3, 29, 'is why in the church, the body of Christ, God raises up many pastors and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 539, 4, 29, 'shepherds. They are not full-time workers. They''re in secular jobs. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 539, 5, 29, 'they are not all sixty and seventy years old. Some of them may be only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 539, 6, 29, 'twenty-two years old. Even young people can be a shepherd to those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 539, 7, 29, 'are younger than them. A shepherd is one who cares for the sheep. Do you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 539, 8, 29, 'have to wait until you are seventy years old to care for sheep? You can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 539, 9, 29, 'care for those who are younger to you when you are twenty-five. Have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 539, 10, 29, 'concern for those who are young in the Lord - to encourage them and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 539, 11, 29, 'bless them. Think if you can grow up to be a shepherd in the church and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 539, 12, 29, 'encourage some of the others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 539, 13, 29, 'This is a verse for all those who have a father''s heart and a shepherd''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 539, 14, 29, 'heart. If God has given me a few people and in some way linked them to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 539, 15, 29, 'me, let me care for them. You can say, "We don''t have a pastor in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 539, 16, 29, 'church, but God has linked up some others to me and I can care for them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 539, 17, 29, 'God has linked up that other brother to another brother in the church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 539, 18, 29, 'So I''ll let him care for that brother. We are not in competition, trying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 539, 19, 29, 'to attach people to ourselves. I''m trying to attach people to the Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 539, 20, 29, 'but since it is humanly impossible for one man to take care of a hundred');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 539, 21, 29, 'or more people, God has given me a few and that brother a few and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 539, 22, 29, 'another brother a few. Like that we can handle about ten or twelve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 539, 23, 29, 'people and encourage them and build them up." This verse is for such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 539, 24, 29, 'people. Know well the condition of your flock! If you take that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 539, 25, 29, 'responsibility, take it seriously. Don''t just know it, but know it well');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 539, 26, 29, 'it says. What is the spiritual condition of each of those brothers for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 539, 27, 29, 'whom you are taking responsibility? Do you know their spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 539, 28, 29, 'conditions? Pay attention to your herd. See how it is going with them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 540, 1, 29, 'Don''t just say, "That''s their responsibility." Of course it''s their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 540, 2, 29, 'responsibility - but if God has given you a shepherd''s heart, it''s your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 540, 3, 29, 'responsibility too!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 540, 4, 29, '1 Peter 5:2 says to those who are shepherds and elders not to take this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 540, 5, 29, 'responsibility out of necessity and compulsion. Somebody should not say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 540, 6, 29, '"Brother, why don''t you take responsibility for these brothers?" No! It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 540, 7, 29, 'says to do it voluntarily unto the Lord. Don''t be so irresponsible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 540, 8, 29, 'There are so many irresponsible people in the church. God wants those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 540, 9, 29, 'who will willingly take responsibility as a shepherd. There are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 540, 10, 29, 'multitudes of sheep walking around without a shepherd, and Jesus looks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 540, 11, 29, 'down upon them and is grieved like it says in Matthew 9:36. The harvest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 540, 12, 29, 'is plentiful but the laborers are few. There are so many sheep but few');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 540, 13, 29, 'shepherds. So what shall we do? Shall we appoint more shepherds? No!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 540, 14, 29, 'Jesus says to pray. Pray that God will send forth such shepherds into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 540, 15, 29, 'the harvest. Pray that God will stir up some of these irresponsible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 540, 16, 29, 'brothers who just drift along in the Christian life and are only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 540, 17, 29, 'interested in their own salvation and their own holiness, who just come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 540, 18, 29, 'once in a while to the meetings (or to all the meetings perhaps), but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 540, 19, 29, 'who don''t have a shepherd''s heart. They never care to say, "Well, let me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 540, 20, 29, 'at least care for a few to see how it''s going with them!" Praise God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 540, 21, 29, 'when God can find someone in a church who, without anyone appointing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 540, 22, 29, 'him, without anyone telling him anything, he just has a concern for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 540, 23, 29, 'few brothers and tries to help them. Maybe he writes to some of them who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 540, 24, 29, 'are not local because he has a concern for their spiritual development.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 540, 25, 29, 'Every such brother or sister who has a concern for other younger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 540, 26, 29, 'brothers and sisters is a shepherd. And I tell you, there is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 540, 27, 29, 'tremendous reward for all those who do that duty faithfully. Peter says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 540, 28, 29, 'there will be a crown of glory waiting for those who say, "Lord, I offer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 541, 1, 29, 'myself to you with all my weaknesses to be a shepherd to a few people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 541, 2, 29, 'who are younger than me spiritually" (1 Peter 5:4); for those who don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 541, 3, 29, 'live their life in an irresponsible way, selfishly thinking about their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 541, 4, 29, 'own salvation alone. God will accept their offering.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 541, 5, 29, 'For riches are not forever,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 541, 6, 29, 'Nor does a crown endure to all generations.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 541, 7, 29, 'When the grass disappears, the new growth is seen,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 541, 8, 29, 'And the herbs of the mountains are gathered in,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 541, 9, 29, 'The lambs will be for your clothing,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 541, 10, 29, 'And the goats will bring the price of a field,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 541, 11, 29, 'And there will be goats'' milk enough for your food,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 541, 12, 29, 'For the food of your household,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 541, 13, 29, 'And sustenance for your maidens.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 541, 14, 29, 'Prov 27:24-27');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 541, 15, 29, 'He''s talking about earthly wealth. He says, "That''s not going to last');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 541, 16, 29, 'forever." And even if you''re a king, that doesn''t guarantee your son');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 541, 17, 29, 'will be a king. There may be a coup, and your kingdom will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 541, 18, 29, 'overthrown. You may have to run out of the country altogether. That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 541, 19, 29, 'happening in many parts of the world. "A crown does not endure to all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 541, 20, 29, 'generations." But if you work in the fields, he says, when the grass');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 541, 21, 29, 'disappears, the new growth is seen. It''s not like those riches and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 541, 22, 29, 'crowns that disappear. If you have a little field and you work on it and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 541, 23, 29, 'cultivate it, you''ll get something from it. The herbs of the mountains');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 541, 24, 29, 'are gathered in. You gather in a harvest from working on your own life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 541, 25, 29, 'and you''re going to get a reward for looking after the lambs and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 541, 26, 29, 'sheep and the goats as well. Of course, it''s speaking in an Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 541, 27, 29, 'Testament way about not depending on earthly wealth. He says, "Do some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 541, 28, 29, 'work, work on your fields, look after your flocks and care for them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 542, 1, 29, 'Then you can have a return for your labors. Avoid all these risky ways');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 542, 2, 29, 'of making money like investing or winning the lottery." There are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 542, 3, 29, 'various ways of trying to make money quickly - avoid them! Be careful!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 542, 4, 29, 'It''s far better to earn your living in simple ways and learn to live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 542, 5, 29, 'within your income.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 542, 6, 30, 'Chapter 28 Chapter 28');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 542, 7, 30, 'The wicked flee when no one is pursuing,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 542, 8, 30, 'But the righteous are bold as a lion.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 542, 9, 30, 'Prov 28:1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 542, 10, 30, 'Why does the wicked man flee when no one is pursuing him? Because he has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 542, 11, 30, 'a guilty conscience. That''s why. He''s always thinking, "This chap is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 542, 12, 30, 'coming to catch me for that thing I did." A thief who has stolen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 542, 13, 30, 'something thinks every knock on the door is a policeman, and he is ready');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 542, 14, 30, 'to run out the back door, even though it may just be a friend of his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 542, 15, 30, 'coming to see him. His guilty conscience makes him run out the back');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 542, 16, 30, 'door. We''re not thieves, but we can have guilty consciences in other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 542, 17, 30, 'ways. For example, if we''re in debt to somebody, we don''t want to see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 542, 18, 30, 'their face and so we avoid them. Or maybe you have hurt someone and your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 542, 19, 30, 'conscience bothers you about it, so you don''t want to see him for a few');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 542, 20, 30, 'days. You''re fleeing from him like this verse says. Then you''re a wicked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 542, 21, 30, 'person. No one is pursuing you, but your guilty conscience is taking all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 542, 22, 30, 'the courage out of your life and making you run from people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 542, 23, 30, 'A righteous person, on the other hand, whose conscience is clear, is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 542, 24, 30, 'bold. He can face everybody squarely. If there''s anyone whom you cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 542, 25, 30, 'look straight in the eye, there''s something wrong. I''ve met some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 542, 26, 30, 'believers who, when they talk to you, are always looking down. I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 542, 27, 30, 'always weary of those people who can''t look you straight in your face.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 542, 28, 30, 'There''s something fishy about a man who can''t look straight into your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 543, 1, 30, 'face. Remember that. Cain''s face was fallen because there was something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 543, 2, 30, 'wrong in his life. The Lord asked him, "Why has your face fallen?" There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 543, 3, 30, 'was a reason. He had done something wrong. But the righteous person is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 543, 4, 30, 'bold. He can look you straight in the face. He''s not perfect, but he has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 543, 5, 30, 'a clear conscience. It''s only righteousness in our conscience that gives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 543, 6, 30, 'us boldness. God has not given us a spirit of fear but of power and love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 543, 7, 30, 'and a sound mind and discipline, so that we can have a clear conscience');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 543, 8, 30, 'and look people straight in the face. We don''t have to avoid anyone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 543, 9, 30, 'because we don''t have anything against anyone. When you have something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 543, 10, 30, 'against someone, isn''t it difficult for you to look that person straight');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 543, 11, 30, 'in the face with cheerfulness? That''s because there''s something wrong in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 543, 12, 30, 'your heart and it''s reflecting on your countenance. Praise God that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 543, 13, 30, 'can live with boldness if we have a clear conscience toward God and men');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 543, 14, 30, 'at all times. That''s how it should be.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 543, 15, 30, 'By the transgression of a land many are its princes,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 543, 16, 30, 'But by a man of understanding and knowledge, so it endures.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 543, 17, 30, 'Prov 28:2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 543, 18, 30, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 543, 19, 30, 'When there is moral rot within a nation, its government topples easily;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 543, 20, 30, 'but with honest, sensible leaders there is stability.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 543, 21, 30, 'Prov 28:2, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 543, 22, 30, 'In the Old Testament, the nation of Israel was God''s people. Today, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 543, 23, 30, 'equivalent of the nation of Israel is the church, and its government is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 543, 24, 30, 'the leadership in the church. There is stability in the church when the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 543, 25, 30, 'leadership in the church has understanding and is honest. When moral');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 543, 26, 30, 'corruption comes into a church, as it has with so many denominations,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 543, 27, 30, 'this verse tells us you can trace the problem back to the leaders.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 543, 28, 30, 'There''s no use saying, "Oh, the people are just corrupt." The people are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 544, 1, 30, 'corrupt because the leaders are corrupt in their private lives, even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 544, 2, 30, 'though you may not know it. The leaders are the ones who make the people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 544, 3, 30, 'corrupt. If only one or two people are corrupt, that''s okay, but if the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 544, 4, 30, 'whole church becomes corrupt, you can be pretty sure that the leadership');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 544, 5, 30, 'is corrupt. You can always assess the quality of the leadership of any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 544, 6, 30, 'church by looking at the general condition of the whole church. So when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 544, 7, 30, 'people say, "He''s a good pastor, but the people just won''t listen," they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 544, 8, 30, 'are deceiving themselves. It''s because there''s moral rot in the leaders');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 544, 9, 30, 'that instability has come in the situation. That''s why we have to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 544, 10, 30, 'very careful in our own life if God gives us any responsibility over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 544, 11, 30, 'others. That responsibility could just be over Sunday School or over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 544, 12, 30, 'your family. There will be instability in a family if there is moral');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 544, 13, 30, 'corruption in the father or mother.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 544, 14, 30, 'When a poor man oppresses those even poorer, he''s like an unexpected');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 544, 15, 30, 'flood sweeping away their last hope.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 544, 16, 30, 'Prov 28:3, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 544, 17, 30, 'One would expect that a rich, arrogant man would naturally oppress poor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 544, 18, 30, 'people when he comes to power, and a poor person who comes to power to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 544, 19, 30, 'understand the plight of other poor people. But that''s not always the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 544, 20, 30, 'case. We find when some poor people come to power, they behave worse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 544, 21, 30, 'than all those other tyrants who were there before them. They bully weak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 544, 22, 30, 'people. Whenever a person desires to oppress those who are weaker than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 544, 23, 30, 'them, they are unfit to be a leader - unfit to lead as a father or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 544, 24, 30, 'mother in a home, unfit to lead as a boss who has people working under');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 544, 25, 30, 'him in the factory, unfit to lead as a mistress who has a servant under');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 544, 26, 30, 'her. If your desire is to oppress those who are weak, you''re like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 544, 27, 30, 'flood that takes away their last hope and leaves no bread. This gives us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 544, 28, 30, 'light on our own spiritual poverty. We need to be meek and merciful and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 545, 1, 30, 'kind to those who are under us in any way, whether children or laborers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 545, 2, 30, 'or anyone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 545, 3, 30, 'If you have no regard for the law, you are on the side of the wicked;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 545, 4, 30, 'but if you obey it, you are against them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 545, 5, 30, 'Prov 28:4, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 545, 6, 30, 'There''s no use in a person saying, "I''m against all unrighteousness," if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 545, 7, 30, 'he doesn''t obey God''s commands. If you''re against all unrighteousness,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 545, 8, 30, 'then you must have a regard for the commandments of God. If a person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 545, 9, 30, 'says, "The commandments of God''s word are not important. We''re all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 545, 10, 30, 'clothed in the righteousness of Christ. We don''t have to bother about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 545, 11, 30, 'keeping all these little commands in God''s word," this verse says he is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 545, 12, 30, 'on the side of the wicked, whether he knows it or not! But if you obey');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 545, 13, 30, 'God''s commandments, only then can you say you''re against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 545, 14, 30, 'unrighteousness. Here we find that the vast majority of Christians are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 545, 15, 30, 'not really on God''s side against unrighteousness, because they don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 545, 16, 30, 'take God''s commandments seriously. They don''t take Colossians 3:19');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 545, 17, 30, 'seriously: "Husbands don''t be bitter against your wives," so that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 545, 18, 30, 'are never bitter. They don''t take Romans 1:29-30 seriously which says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 545, 19, 30, 'gossipers are in the same category as haters of God. They don''t take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 545, 20, 30, 'seriously that we''ll have to give an account for every idle word in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 545, 21, 30, 'day of judgment. They have no regard for God''s commandments. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 545, 22, 30, 'foolish for such people to think they are on the side of righteousness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 545, 23, 30, 'because they are not.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 545, 24, 30, 'To complain about the law is to praise wickedness. To obey the law is to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 545, 25, 30, 'fight evil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 545, 26, 30, 'Prov 28:4, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 545, 27, 30, 'If we want to fight evil, the first thing we need to do is obey the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 545, 28, 30, 'commandments. That''s what this verse says. But to complain about the law');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 546, 1, 30, 'is to praise wickedness. How do we complain about it? We say that it''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 546, 2, 30, 'burden and that we are being tested beyond our ability. It really is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 546, 3, 30, 'sad thing when a person complains about the law. God''s word says that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 546, 4, 30, 'God will not allow us to be tested beyond our ability, but we complain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 546, 5, 30, 'that it''s too much to bear. What we are really saying is that God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 546, 6, 30, 'forgotten about us altogether. That means you''re a wicked person! To');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 546, 7, 30, 'complain about the law is to praise wickedness! Complaining against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 546, 8, 30, 'God''s word is like praising all the drunkards and gamblers and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 546, 9, 30, 'murderers. It is the same thing, so we have to take this seriously. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 546, 10, 30, 'if we obey the commandments, we fight evil. We don''t fight evil by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 546, 11, 30, 'fighting against the drunkards and murderers. We obey God''s commands and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 546, 12, 30, 'fight evil in our own flesh! That is the best thing we can do for God in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 546, 13, 30, 'a world full of wickedness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 546, 14, 30, 'Evil men do not understand justice,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 546, 15, 30, 'But those who seek the Lord understand all things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 546, 16, 30, 'Prov 28:5');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 546, 17, 30, 'Evil men might be clever, but they still don''t understand. It isn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 546, 18, 30, 'cleverness that makes us understand God''s ways, but righteousness! Even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 546, 19, 30, 'if an evil man is very clever and intelligent and has a PhD, he cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 546, 20, 30, 'understand justice or righteousness. He doesn''t have discernment,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 546, 21, 30, 'because God has hidden these things from the wise and intelligent and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 546, 22, 30, 'revealed them to babies (Matthew 11:25). So we see that it is evil which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 546, 23, 30, 'prevents us from understanding God''s truth, not a lack of cleverness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 546, 24, 30, 'Let no one ever think, "I am not clever enough to understand God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 546, 25, 30, 'word." It''s better to say, "I am not whole-hearted enough against the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 546, 26, 30, 'evil in my flesh to understand God''s word. If I were a little more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 546, 27, 30, 'whole-hearted, I would understand God''s word a little more. If I fought');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 546, 28, 30, 'against sin a little more in my life, I would understand God''s word more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 547, 1, 30, '- even if I studied only up to the fourth standard."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 547, 2, 30, 'Evil men do not understand, but those who seek the Lord, whether they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 547, 3, 30, 'are clever or haven''t even been educated, understand all things. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 547, 4, 30, 'a fantastic word. "All things" doesn''t mean everything about geography,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 547, 5, 30, 'chemistry and physics. The Bible isn''t written about such subjects. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 547, 6, 30, 'has given us all things pertaining to life and godliness (2 Peter 1:3).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 547, 7, 30, 'That is what we will understand if we seek the Lord, even if we can''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 547, 8, 30, 'explain physics or chemistry. Those who seek the Lord will understand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 547, 9, 30, 'all things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 547, 10, 30, 'B etter to be poor and honest than rich and a cheater.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 547, 11, 30, 'Prov 28:6, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 547, 12, 30, 'This is repeated many times in the book of Proverbs. It is better to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 547, 13, 30, 'a poor, honest, upright man who pays his taxes correctly and does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 547, 14, 30, 'everything righteously, than to be a rich person who cheats people and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 547, 15, 30, 'takes advantage of them, deceiving people, and cheating the government.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 547, 16, 30, 'It''s not worth it. The word of God repeats this many times.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 547, 17, 30, 'He who keeps the law is a discerning son,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 547, 18, 30, 'But he who is a companion of gluttons humiliates his father.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 547, 19, 30, 'Prov 28:7');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 547, 20, 30, 'If this had spoken about being a companion of murderers, we would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 547, 21, 30, 'understand. None of us want to be a companion of murderers or thieves or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 547, 22, 30, 'liars. These are the things we think are quite serious. But here it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 547, 23, 30, 'speaks about those who are companions of gluttons. That refers to those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 547, 24, 30, 'who only think in terms of eating and eating, drinking and drinking, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 547, 25, 30, 'eating and drinking. They don''t want to kill or steal - they just want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 547, 26, 30, 'to eat and drink. Be careful of people who are only interested in eating');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 547, 27, 30, 'and drinking. They humiliate their fathers. There are even Christians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 547, 28, 30, 'like this. If we announce that we''re having chicken biryani at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 548, 1, 30, 'church, how many people do you think will show up? And if we announce');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 548, 2, 30, 'that we''re having a prayer meeting, how many people do you think will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 548, 3, 30, 'show up? You can find out very quickly that there are Christians who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 548, 4, 30, 'gluttons too - not just unbelievers. Why is it that there are more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 548, 5, 30, 'people when there is food served than when there is a prayer meeting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 548, 6, 30, 'arranged? It''s good for us to cleanse ourselves and be free from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 548, 7, 30, 'gluttony. We don''t want to judge other people, but we have to always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 548, 8, 30, 'judge ourselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 548, 9, 30, 'If you get rich by charging interest and taking advantage of people,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 548, 10, 30, 'your wealth will go to someone who is kind to the poor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 548, 11, 30, 'Prov 28:8, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 548, 12, 30, 'This is speaking about taking advantage of people when they need money.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 548, 13, 30, 'You give the money and charge interest to take advantage of that poor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 548, 14, 30, 'person. There''s a lot of this going on - not in our midst, but in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 548, 15, 30, 'world around - where poor people are exploited by these money lenders');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 548, 16, 30, 'like rent-to-own, bail bonds, and other shops lending at such high');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 548, 17, 30, 'rates. God will judge them so that one day when they die (probably');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 548, 18, 30, 'before their time), they will leave their wealth to someone else who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 548, 19, 30, 'kind to the poor. One day, the meek will inherit the earth. Therefore');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 548, 20, 30, 'all the wealth of the earth is going to be inherited by those who have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 548, 21, 30, 'learned to be kind to those who are needy. Jesus spoke much against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 548, 22, 30, 'trying to take advantage of your poor brothers. Suppose a brother');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 548, 23, 30, 'borrowed something from you and couldn''t pay it back. Forget it. Don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 548, 24, 30, 'keep stepping on his neck and oppressing him, particularly if he is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 548, 25, 30, 'poor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 548, 26, 30, 'He who turns away his ear from listening to the law,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 548, 27, 30, 'Even his prayer is an abomination.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 548, 28, 30, 'Prov 28:9');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 549, 1, 30, 'What this means is: if you hear God, God will hear you. That''s only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 549, 2, 30, 'reasonable, isn''t it? If I don''t have time to listen to God, it''s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 549, 3, 30, 'unrighteous of God to say, "I don''t have much time to listen to you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 549, 4, 30, 'either." There''s a very wonderful verse in Psalm 18:25-26 that says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 549, 5, 30, '"With the kind you show yourself kind. With the blameless you show');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 549, 6, 30, 'yourself blameless. With the pure you show yourself pure, and with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 549, 7, 30, 'crooked you show yourself astute." That means if somebody is kind to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 549, 8, 30, 'others, God is kind to him. If somebody is merciful to others, God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 549, 9, 30, 'very merciful to him. If a man really seeks to walk in uprightness, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 549, 10, 30, 'is also very upright and straightforward with him. If I''m pure, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 549, 11, 30, 'shows himself to me in purity. But with the crooked, God also shows');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 549, 12, 30, 'himself to be a bit crooked toward them. Consider that. If I try to be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 549, 13, 30, 'little crooked with some other person, I''ll find later on in some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 549, 14, 30, 'situation in life God will also be a bit crooked toward me. I may wonder');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 549, 15, 30, 'why and I''ll have to think back and say, "Who was I crooked to in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 549, 16, 30, 'last month or maybe even within the last six months? Maybe that''s why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 549, 17, 30, 'God is acting a bit crooked toward me now."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 549, 18, 30, 'If I don''t bother to hear God''s word, then when I kneel down to pray, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 549, 19, 30, 'won''t bother to hear me. Prayer is like communicating on the phone. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 549, 20, 30, 'every time God rings me up on the phone, I just put the phone down and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 549, 21, 30, 'have no time to listen to him, then one day when I want to pick up the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 549, 22, 30, 'phone and ring him up, I''ll find that he doesn''t pick up either. He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 549, 23, 30, 'crooked to those who are crooked. If I turn away my ear when God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 549, 24, 30, 'speaking through his word, God will turn away his ear when I am trying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 549, 25, 30, 'to pray to him in my need. I believe this is the reason why so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 549, 26, 30, 'prayers are not answered. We can understand when the prayers of Hindus,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 549, 27, 30, 'Muslims, Roman Catholics, and so many other unconverted people are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 549, 28, 30, 'heard even though they pray millions of prayers, but what shall we say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 550, 1, 30, 'when believers'' prayers are not heard? If I regard iniquity in my heart,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 550, 2, 30, 'the Lord will not…what? Answer me? No. He will not even hear me (Psalm');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 550, 3, 30, '66:18). He won''t even pick up the phone. He''ll say, "Oh, that call is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 550, 4, 30, 'coming from someone who regards iniquity in his heart. I don''t need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 550, 5, 30, 'pick up the phone. No need to even find out what the request is." It''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 550, 6, 30, 'serious thing to regard iniquity in our heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 550, 7, 30, 'Hebrews 5:7 says that Jesus'' prayers were heard because of his godly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 550, 8, 30, 'fear. He was so afraid of not listening when the Father was speaking. So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 550, 9, 30, 'afraid! "The Father is saying something! Let me drop everything and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 550, 10, 30, 'listen." Brothers and sisters, we can very profitably judge ourselves in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 550, 11, 30, 'this area. If I hear God''s word, then when I speak God will hear me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 550, 12, 30, 'Jesus said, "I thank you Father that you always hear me" (John 11:42).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 550, 13, 30, 'How was that possible? Because Jesus always heard the Father. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 550, 14, 30, 'exactly equal. If I listen to twenty percent of the things God tells me,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 550, 15, 30, 'he''ll hear twenty percent of the things I tell him. Then eighty percent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 550, 16, 30, 'of my prayers are falling to the ground. But we can increase that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 550, 17, 30, 'percentage just by increasing the percentage of things we listen to when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 550, 18, 30, 'God speaks to us. That''s why it''s very important to hear God''s word and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 550, 19, 30, 'receive it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 550, 20, 30, 'He who leads the upright astray in an evil way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 550, 21, 30, 'Will himself fall into his own pit,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 550, 22, 30, 'Prov 28:10');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 550, 23, 30, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 550, 24, 30, 'A curse is on those who lead astray the godly. But men who encourage the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 550, 25, 30, 'upright to do good shall be given a worthwhile reward.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 550, 26, 30, 'Prov 28:10, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 550, 27, 30, 'Jesus said, "If you stumble one of these little ones, it''s better that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 550, 28, 30, 'you hang a millstone around your neck and go and drown in the sea"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 551, 1, 30, '(Matthew 18:6). It''s like he said, "Go jump in a river with a millstone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 551, 2, 30, 'around your neck." That is what Jesus said! If a parent stumbles one of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 551, 3, 30, 'these little ones, leading them astray, it is better that they go and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 551, 4, 30, 'tie a millstone around their neck and jump into a river. Maybe a child');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 551, 5, 30, 'is very upright at the moment, but then goes astray into an evil path by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 551, 6, 30, 'some habit it sees its parents doing. There are children who have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 551, 7, 30, 'learned smoking and drinking from their parents. Some children learn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 551, 8, 30, 'evil habits like gossiping and backbiting from their parents, which are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 551, 9, 30, 'even worse than smoking and drinking. It is better that those parents go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 551, 10, 30, 'and tie millstones around their necks and jump into a river.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 551, 11, 30, 'If someone is living an upright life and is polluted by your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 551, 12, 30, 'conversation, it''s better that you go and put a millstone around your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 551, 13, 30, 'neck and jump into a river. It says you''ll fall into a pit. That''s why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 551, 14, 30, 'we are against so many preachers today who lead astray simple people in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 551, 15, 30, 'their congregation who are trying to live a godly life. The pastor or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 551, 16, 30, 'preacher who doesn''t fear God preaches things that lead them astray. For');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 551, 17, 30, 'example, he tells them there is no such thing as victory over sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 551, 18, 30, 'Sitting there are simple people who have come and are eager to hear, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 551, 19, 30, 'they are led astray. There are lots of people like that. We must never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 551, 20, 30, 'be found in that number among those who lead people astray when they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 551, 21, 30, 'trying to live a good life - especially due to something they see in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 551, 22, 30, 'life. That should bring a fear into our hearts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 551, 23, 30, 'There was a man called Balaam who was a preacher in the Old Testament.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 551, 24, 30, 'Because he was offered money, he taught the King of Moab a scheme to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 551, 25, 30, 'pollute the Israelites. God would not allow him to curse the Israelites');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 551, 26, 30, 'so he said, "I cannot curse them, because God has blessed them, but I''ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 551, 27, 30, 'tell you how you can make God himself curse them." Then in Numbers 25,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 551, 28, 30, 'he told the King of Moab to send some pretty looking Moabite girls -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 552, 1, 30, 'seductive ones - into the Israelite camp and let them tempt some of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 552, 2, 30, 'men. The Israelite men would marry the women, and then God himself would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 552, 3, 30, 'curse them. That''s how Israel was corrupted through Balaam. Of course,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 552, 4, 30, 'Balaam was killed for that. People may not be doing the exact same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 552, 5, 30, 'things today, but this is an illustration of someone who led others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 552, 6, 30, 'astray who were living an upright life. He led them astray by his own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 552, 7, 30, 'corruption and by justifying his sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 552, 8, 30, 'Let''s say I do something wrong and another brother asks me if it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 552, 9, 30, 'alright to do that. Because I want to save my reputation, I justify it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 552, 10, 30, 'instead of saying, "Maybe I need to think about that. Maybe I was wrong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 552, 11, 30, 'in what I did." That would have helped him to be upright, but since I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 552, 12, 30, 'an older brother, I justify it to prove that it was right. If I say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 552, 13, 30, '"No, brother - that was right. In such circumstances, we have to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 552, 14, 30, 'that," what have I succeeded in doing? I''ve succeeded in leading him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 552, 15, 30, 'astray! I myself have gone into some corruption and now I am justifying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 552, 16, 30, 'that corruption and leading my brother astray also. It''s very easy to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 552, 17, 30, 'that! I should make sure I don''t have any love for justifying myself. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 552, 18, 30, 'must be willing to hear that we are wrong. It''s good to be honest.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 552, 19, 30, 'The rich man is wise in his own eyes,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 552, 20, 30, 'But the poor who has understanding sees through him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 552, 21, 30, 'Prov 28:11');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 552, 22, 30, 'Notice he doesn''t say the poor man is blessed just because he''s poor. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 552, 23, 30, 'shouldn''t think that. There are a lot of poor people in the world who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 552, 24, 30, 'are not spiritual and go to Hell just like rich people. But the poor man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 552, 25, 30, 'who has understanding (or wisdom) can see through the emptiness and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 552, 26, 30, 'hollowness of this rich person who is very wise and spiritual in his own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 552, 27, 30, 'eyes. This poor, wise man sees through it. Therefore he doesn''t covet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 552, 28, 30, 'any of his riches. When we covet what somebody else has, that proves we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 553, 1, 30, 'ourselves don''t have any wisdom. We may be poor, but we are poor,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 553, 2, 30, 'foolish people just like the rich, foolish people. The point is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 553, 3, 30, 'whether we are poor or rich, but whether we have wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 553, 4, 30, 'When the righteous triumph, there is great glory,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 553, 5, 30, 'But when the wicked rise, men hide themselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 553, 6, 30, 'Prov 28:12');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 553, 7, 30, 'When the righteous triumph, there may not be glory in this world, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 553, 8, 30, 'there''s certainly great glory in God''s eyes. When a righteous person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 553, 9, 30, 'stands for righteousness, does not yield to temptation, and triumphs,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 553, 10, 30, 'there is a great glory in God''s eyes. Never mind what people think.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 553, 11, 30, 'There is great glory in God''s eyes every time I overcome a temptation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 553, 12, 30, 'We''ve all heard the story which Jesus told about the man who had a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 553, 13, 30, 'hundred sheep and lost one of them. Who did Jesus say the ninety-nine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 553, 14, 30, 'sheep symbolized? It says in Luke 15:7 that they symbolize ninety-nine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 553, 15, 30, 'righteous people who need no repentance. Think of that. Think of being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 553, 16, 30, 'so careful in your daily life, cleansing yourself and judging yourself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 553, 17, 30, 'so immediately and constantly, that there is no repentance that you need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 553, 18, 30, 'in your life. That''s a fantastic description given to those ninety-nine.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 553, 19, 30, 'When people say, "We must go for the one lost sheep," that is like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 553, 20, 30, 'evangelism. They focus on evangelism and act as though the ninety-nine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 553, 21, 30, 'sitting in the church are like these ninety-nine people who need no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 553, 22, 30, 'repentance. Far from it. Nowadays, it is more like one righteous person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 553, 23, 30, 'who needs no repentance and ninety-nine that are lost. So, we need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 553, 24, 30, 'keep that in mind: sheep who need no repentance. If we read the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 553, 25, 30, 'scriptures carefully, we see what Jesus was talking about. It is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 553, 26, 30, 'tremendous thing when the righteous triumph. It means they are living an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 553, 27, 30, 'overcoming life. But it''s sad when the wicked rise. Men hide themselves,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 553, 28, 30, 'because the wicked person has power. It is a sad thing when men cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 554, 1, 30, 'be free.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 554, 2, 30, 'He who conceals his transgressions will not prosper,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 554, 3, 30, 'But he who confesses and forsakes them will find compassion.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 554, 4, 30, 'Prov 28:13');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 554, 5, 30, 'This is a very wonderful verse in the Old Testament. Right from the time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 554, 6, 30, 'of Adam onwards, man has had the tendency to cover his transgression.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 554, 7, 30, 'The first thing Adam wanted to do after he sinned was hide. He didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 554, 8, 30, 'just hide behind a tree, he also hid behind some fig leaves that he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 554, 9, 30, 'stitched. Always trying to hide! All of false religion is basically man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 554, 10, 30, 'trying to hide his sin by giving money to the poor, going on some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 554, 11, 30, 'pilgrimage, shaving his head, doing this and that, attending meetings,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 554, 12, 30, 'singing in the choir, and doing something in order to be approved to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 554, 13, 30, 'God. It''s all trying to cover one''s sin! There will never be any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 554, 14, 30, 'prosperity that way. We try to cover up our sin by hiding it, pretending');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 554, 15, 30, 'we never did it, or if I''ve hurt someone, never going and making');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 554, 16, 30, 'restitution. If I don''t go and apologize to someone I''ve hurt, what am I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 554, 17, 30, 'actually doing? For example, let''s say I hurt my wife by what I say and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 554, 18, 30, 'I just act like it''s alright and say, "We''re good friends, aren''t we?"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 554, 19, 30, 'What am I actually doing? I am concealing my transgression! Even if she');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 554, 20, 30, 'is a very spiritual wife and just ignores it, because she''s dying to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 554, 21, 30, 'herself in order to have a good relationship with you, you shouldn''t be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 554, 22, 30, 'so stupid to think that you don''t have to apologize. You still have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 554, 23, 30, 'apologize even if you have a good relationship with her, because you did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 554, 24, 30, 'something wrong. You can''t say, "Well, the relationship is good." The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 554, 25, 30, 'relationship is good because she was whole-hearted enough to die to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 554, 26, 30, 'herself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 554, 27, 30, 'Or it could be with a brother. Even if a brother has so denied himself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 554, 28, 30, 'that he has a good relationship with you, that does not mean your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 555, 1, 30, 'transgression is clear. You have still sinned and you should not cover');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 555, 2, 30, 'it up. The only way to clear it up is by saying to that brother with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 555, 3, 30, 'whom you have an excellent relationship, "I''m sorry. I have sinned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 555, 4, 30, 'against you. Forgive me." He who conceals his transgression will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 555, 5, 30, 'prosper. I tell you, the vast majority of believers have no interest in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 555, 6, 30, 'living to this standard of Christian life. That''s why their lives are so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 555, 7, 30, 'shallow. But he who confesses - which requires humility toward God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 555, 8, 30, 'man - and forsakes his transgression by giving it up will find mercy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 555, 9, 30, 'And not only mercy, but grace also since we are in the New Covenant. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 555, 10, 30, 'the Old Covenant it was only mercy. In the New Covenant, we''ll find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 555, 11, 30, 'mercy and grace to help us in our time of need.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 555, 12, 30, 'How blessed is the man who fears always,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 555, 13, 30, 'But he who hardens his heart will fall into calamity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 555, 14, 30, 'Prov 28:14');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 555, 15, 30, 'This is connected with verse thirteen and speaks about after our sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 555, 16, 30, 'are forgiven. Why does God forgive our sins? One of the most important');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 555, 17, 30, 'verses in this respect is found in Psalm 130:4. It says God forgives us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 555, 18, 30, 'so that we may fear him. So after verse thirteen speaks about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 555, 19, 30, 'forgiveness, verse fourteen goes on to speak about fear. The devil has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 555, 20, 30, 'so many ways of keeping us from emphasizing this subject. He says, "No,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 555, 21, 30, 'we must think of God as love. There''s nothing to fear." That is why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 555, 22, 30, 'people do such a lot of wrong things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 555, 23, 30, 'The important word here is ''always''. I can fear God for a long period of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 555, 24, 30, 'time, and then in one particular moment, not fear him and do such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 555, 25, 30, 'sinful, shameful thing. In that moment, I can lose my testimony for my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 555, 26, 30, 'whole life. Isn''t that how David looked at Bathsheba? He didn''t fear God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 555, 27, 30, 'at that moment. Many other times he feared God. In fact, in Psalm 34:11');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 555, 28, 30, 'he tells people, "Come children, I will teach you the fear of the Lord."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 556, 1, 30, 'At one stage, he was the type of person who could teach people the fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 556, 2, 30, 'of the Lord. But then he just became careless and his testimony was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 556, 3, 30, 'ruined not only for his life, but for all the generations after him that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 556, 4, 30, 'know his failure. Think of Joseph - tempted again and again by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 556, 5, 30, 'Potiphar''s wife. He didn''t sin. What if he had slipped up just for five');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 556, 6, 30, 'minutes in his long life of one-hundred years? Just five minutes! What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 556, 7, 30, 'sort of Joseph would we think of today? I doubt if God would have ever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 556, 8, 30, 'made him the prime minister of Egypt. It''s possible, brothers and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 556, 9, 30, 'sisters, that we slacken off and do one stupid thing that ruins our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 556, 10, 30, 'testimony almost for our whole life. How blessed is the man who fears');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 556, 11, 30, 'the Lord always so that there is not even one moment of carelessness in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 556, 12, 30, 'his life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 556, 13, 30, 'Then it says, "But he who hardens his heart will fall into calamity."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 556, 14, 30, 'Hebrews 3:15 also says, "If you hear his voice, harden not your heart."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 556, 15, 30, 'To harden our heart is to hear God''s voice and not respond or to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 556, 16, 30, 'postpone obeying. I heard of a very well-known evangelist in India who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 556, 17, 30, 'died many years ago. He testified when he was baptized in water at a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 556, 18, 30, 'very old age that when he was a young man, the Lord spoke to him about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 556, 19, 30, 'water baptism and he did not do it. He thought he would lose his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 556, 20, 30, 'position as an evangelist in his denomination which did not believe in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 556, 21, 30, 'adult baptism. The result was that some time later, after being a mighty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 556, 22, 30, 'preacher, he fell into adultery. He realized that one little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 556, 23, 30, 'disobedience had hardened his heart which finally led to something like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 556, 24, 30, 'adultery. It''s a serious thing if we don''t take it seriously when God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 556, 25, 30, 'speaks to us about something. He who hardens his heart will fall into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 556, 26, 30, 'calamity. Of course, the man repented and confessed his sin and obeyed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 556, 27, 30, 'the Lord, but that blot was on his character.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 556, 28, 30, 'Like a roaring lion and a rushing bear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 557, 1, 30, 'Is a wicked ruler over a poor people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 557, 2, 30, 'Prov 28:15');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 557, 3, 30, 'This is also speaking about those who oppress, take advantage of, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 557, 4, 30, 'rule over others. It can be with those who work under us. We are not to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 557, 5, 30, 'be like lions and bears to them that the very sight of us brings terror');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 557, 6, 30, 'into their hearts. We are not to be like that toward our children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 557, 7, 30, 'either. That is why the Bible says we should use a rod to punish our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 557, 8, 30, 'children. We should not use our hand to hit them. For example, it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 557, 9, 30, 'most unChristian for any mother or father to slap a child on the face.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 557, 10, 30, 'The hand is not given for slapping but stroking. When you lift your hand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 557, 11, 30, 'toward your child, he or she should be one-hundred percent certain that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 557, 12, 30, 'your hand is not coming to hit but stroke in love. We''re not to oppress');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 557, 13, 30, 'others so that the sight of us brings terror into their hearts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 557, 14, 30, 'A leader who is a great oppressor lacks understanding,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 557, 15, 30, 'But he who hates unjust gain will prolong his days.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 557, 16, 30, 'Prov 28:16');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 557, 17, 30, 'If a leader or a father or an elder lords it over other people, bosses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 557, 18, 30, 'them around, and tries to control their life, we can say such a leader');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 557, 19, 30, 'is a man without wisdom. Whatever else he may have, he doesn''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 557, 20, 30, 'wisdom. In contrast, if a leader hates unjust gain, he will prolong his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 557, 21, 30, 'days. Unjust gain is seeking my own honor and profit to gain something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 557, 22, 30, 'for myself. For example, if I do something in the church and get some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 557, 23, 30, 'honor for myself, isn''t that unjust gain? If we do something in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 557, 24, 30, 'church, it must be for the glory of God. But if I do something in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 557, 25, 30, 'church in order to get some honor for myself, that is unrighteous. I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 557, 26, 30, 'taking what should go to somebody else. That honor should go to God. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 557, 27, 30, 'is unjust gain to seek anything personal for ourselves in the church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 557, 28, 30, 'For a preacher to get up and preach to get something for himself is like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 558, 1, 30, 'a man who is trying to earn money unrighteously.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 558, 2, 30, 'Now I''ll tell you something that is even more dangerous, and those of us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 558, 3, 30, 'who sing on Sundays can think of this. It''s much more difficult to sing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 558, 4, 30, 'and seek the glory of God than it is to preach and seek the glory of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 558, 5, 30, 'God. When we preach, we use our normal voice. But when we sing, we use a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 558, 6, 30, 'special type of voice and tune and melody. Those things are good, but I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 558, 7, 30, 'tell you if a person doesn''t work out his own salvation when playing an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 558, 8, 30, 'instrument, he is in fantastic danger of seeking his own honor. A person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 558, 9, 30, 'who sings or plays an instrument must live in a constant cleansing of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 558, 10, 30, 'himself. I''ve sung and played instruments, and I know from my own flesh');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 558, 11, 30, 'how easy it is to want to play a little louder than everybody else, sing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 558, 12, 30, 'a little better than everyone else, and all the other wretched');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 558, 13, 30, 'manifestations of our flesh. I''m not saying that we shouldn''t do these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 558, 14, 30, 'things. All I say is there needs to be a cleansing. It''s unjust gain. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 558, 15, 30, 'have no right to take honor for myself. It''s for God''s glory.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 558, 16, 30, 'A man who is laden with the guilt of human blood');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 558, 17, 30, 'Will be a fugitive until death; let no one support him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 558, 18, 30, 'Prov 28:17');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 558, 19, 30, 'Who do you think is likely to support a murderer? His own relatives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 558, 20, 30, 'Maybe the murderer''s father or mother or brother wants to somehow cover');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 558, 21, 30, 'it up. Basically this verse means that we shouldn''t support a guilty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 558, 22, 30, 'person, even if that person is your relative. We are not in danger of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 558, 23, 30, 'supporting all the other murderers on the streets, but if somebody in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 558, 24, 30, 'our family or a close relative has done something very wrong, I have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 558, 25, 30, 'terrific tendency to support him. Be careful. Be impartial. Be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 558, 26, 30, 'righteous. Here''s a principle that we can keep in mind.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 558, 27, 30, 'He who walks blamelessly will be delivered,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 558, 28, 30, 'But he who is crooked will fall all at once.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 559, 1, 30, 'Prov 28:18');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 559, 2, 30, 'This means that when I walk uprightly and righteously in the world, even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 559, 3, 30, 'though I am oppressed and troubled and harassed by people in the world,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 559, 4, 30, 'finally God will always deliver me! That''s for sure. But some who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 559, 5, 30, 'crooked say, "You have to be a little crooked in this world to live."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 559, 6, 30, 'I''ve heard Christian businessmen say that. "You can''t survive, brother,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 559, 7, 30, 'if you''re not a little crooked." I told one of them, "Then give up your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 559, 8, 30, 'business and do something else. You''ve earned enough. Why don''t you go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 559, 9, 30, 'and put that money in some deposit and live off the interest instead of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 559, 10, 30, 'continuing your business and always doing something unrighteous?" But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 559, 11, 30, 'they don''t want to do that. They say, "You have to be a little crooked."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 559, 12, 30, 'Well, they will fall all at once. There are a lot of people like that. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 559, 13, 30, 'tell you this: if you can''t do business righteously, it''s better not to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 559, 14, 30, 'do it. It''s better to look for something else. But those who have stood');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 559, 15, 30, 'for the Lord are delivered. The Lord provides their needs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 559, 16, 30, 'He who tills his land will have plenty of food,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 559, 17, 30, 'But he who follows empty pursuits will have poverty in plenty.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 559, 18, 30, 'Prov 28:19');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 559, 19, 30, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 559, 20, 30, 'A hard-working farmer has plenty to eat. People who waste time will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 559, 21, 30, 'always be poor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 559, 22, 30, 'Prov 28:19, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 559, 23, 30, 'Here''s a contrast between plenty of food and plenty of poverty. Of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 559, 24, 30, 'course, we want to apply this spiritually. In the New Testament, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 559, 25, 30, 'farmer is a picture of the believer. 2 Timothy 2:6 says, "The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 559, 26, 30, 'hardworking farmer is the first to receive his share of the crops." That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 559, 27, 30, 'applies to how hard we work on our own salvation. We''re also told in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 559, 28, 30, 'James 5:7 to be patient, because the farmer waits for the precious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 560, 1, 30, 'produce of the soil. This applies to us in the New Testament in terms of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 560, 2, 30, 'diligence in our own spiritual life. The opposite of diligence or the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 560, 3, 30, 'diligent farmer is described here as one who wastes his time. That can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 560, 4, 30, 'be a very bad habit among believers. When we are first converted, all of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 560, 5, 30, 'us waste a tremendous amount of time. But that is an area where all of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 560, 6, 30, 'us need to work out our salvation with fear and trembling, so that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 560, 7, 30, 'are wasting less and less and less time. That is not an easy thing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 560, 8, 30, 'do, but if you read the biographies of some of the greatest men of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 560, 9, 30, 'throughout history, you''ll find that they had learned to discipline');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 560, 10, 30, 'themselves in how they spent their time. They came to the point where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 560, 11, 30, 'they wasted very little time on useless things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 560, 12, 30, 'Now, when I talk about useless things, I don''t mean going out to relax');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 560, 13, 30, 'in the park with your children. In fact, that can be a very useful thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 560, 14, 30, 'for the physical body and for fellowship with our children. Reading the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 560, 15, 30, 'Bible and praying are not the only useful ways to spend our time. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 560, 16, 30, 'are many other useful things we can do, but we have to examine our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 560, 17, 30, 'priorities. If a man doesn''t have time to read the word and pray, then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 560, 18, 30, 'there needs to be something cut out from his life, so that he finds time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 560, 19, 30, 'for these things. There''s a tremendous amount of wasted time that we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 560, 20, 30, 'avoid if we are really diligent in asking God for grace to help us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 560, 21, 30, 'Useless conversations can be a tremendous waste of time. A lot of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 560, 22, 30, 'visiting homes can end up being a waste of time. That''s why we need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 560, 23, 30, 'discipline ourselves even in visiting one another.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 560, 24, 30, 'A faithful man will abound with blessings,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 560, 25, 30, 'But he who makes haste to be rich will not go unpunished.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 560, 26, 30, 'Prov 28:20');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 560, 27, 30, 'The blessings spoken of in the first part of this verse are all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 560, 28, 30, 'things that we need in our earthly life. Through the years, I''ve come to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 561, 1, 30, 'see one thing: if a person puts God''s kingdom first, God blesses him in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 561, 2, 30, 'earthly things. When those blessings go beyond a certain limit (e.g.,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 561, 3, 30, 'much more than what we need), they become a curse. That''s why John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 561, 4, 30, 'Wesley said that it''s good to earn all we can and save all we can, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 561, 5, 30, 'if we don''t learn to give and use what God gives us for his glory, then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 561, 6, 30, 'after a while, our accumulation of wealth, the thing which was once a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 561, 7, 30, 'blessing, becomes a curse (Use of Moneyby John Wesley). It''s a blessing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 561, 8, 30, 'when God gives us enough for our needs, and the faithful man will abound');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 561, 9, 30, 'with blessings. He has no shortage. He always has enough for his needs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 561, 10, 30, 'and his family''s needs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 561, 11, 30, 'It goes on to say that the one who is only intent on making more and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 561, 12, 30, 'more wealth will be punished. What is the punishment he''s going to get?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 561, 13, 30, 'We read in 1 Timothy 6:9, "Those who want to get rich fall into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 561, 14, 30, 'temptation and snares and many foolish and harmful desires which plunge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 561, 15, 30, 'men into ruin and destruction." That''s the punishment. It''s not talking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 561, 16, 30, 'about those who are trying to earn their living and provide for their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 561, 17, 30, 'family''s needs, but those who are in the pursuit of wealth way beyond');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 561, 18, 30, 'their needs. Those who are eager to get rich unnecessarily fall into a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 561, 19, 30, 'temptation and a trap of the devil and many foolish and harmful desires.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 561, 20, 30, 'What are the foolish and harmful desires referred to? Those who have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 561, 21, 30, 'more begin to have desires for all types of foolish and harmful things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 561, 22, 30, 'for themselves and for their children which plunge them into ruin and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 561, 23, 30, 'destruction. You see evidence of this all around. You find that children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 561, 24, 30, 'of very rich people are usually spoiled with all types of foolish and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 561, 25, 30, 'harmful things which their parents never kept from them. That''s part of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 561, 26, 30, 'the punishment. It says, "He who makes haste to be rich will not go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 561, 27, 30, 'unpunished." He sees the punishment in his own children being ruined');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 561, 28, 30, 'spiritually. He also sees the punishment in his own life. He''s caught in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 562, 1, 30, 'a trap of the devil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 562, 2, 30, 'To show partiality is not good,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 562, 3, 30, 'Because for a piece of bread a man will transgress.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 562, 4, 30, 'Prov 28:21');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 562, 5, 30, 'Partiality is one of the things James warns us of in James 2. He says if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 562, 6, 30, 'you favor the rich in the church or someone who''s a big shot and put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 562, 7, 30, 'aside someone who is poor, you are sinning. He says you are sinning when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 562, 8, 30, 'you''re partial. It''s a serious sin. He then says in James 3:17 that one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 562, 9, 30, 'of the characteristics of wisdom is being impartial. This is another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 562, 10, 30, 'thing that doesn''t go away right when we are converted. Partiality is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 562, 11, 30, 'still in us - partiality toward one child over another child in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 562, 12, 30, 'family, for example. As we get light on that, we can get victory over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 562, 13, 30, 'it. But it''s more difficult to get victory over partiality when it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 562, 14, 30, 'involves two brothers. That''s a little more difficult to get rid of. As');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 562, 15, 30, 'long as I''m partial in any area, that should be a constant indication to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 562, 16, 30, 'me that I haven''t partaken of the divine nature, because God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 562, 17, 30, 'impartial. It''s a sad thing if year after year goes by and I haven''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 562, 18, 30, 'partaken of the divine nature in this area of being impartial. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 562, 19, 30, 'doesn''t mean we won''t be drawn more to people who are more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 562, 20, 30, 'spiritually-minded. It''s that we are not to be partial based on human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 562, 21, 30, 'qualities - that someone''s temperament is the same or they''re from my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 562, 22, 30, 'community or I like someone because he''s like me in so many ways. That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 562, 23, 30, 'a human partiality which we need to cleanse ourselves from. To show');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 562, 24, 30, 'partiality is not good.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 562, 25, 30, 'When it says, "Because for a piece of bread a man will transgress," that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 562, 26, 30, 'means some people will do wrong even for the smallest amount of profit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 562, 27, 30, 'They are like a judge showing partiality for a small bribe. There''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 562, 28, 30, 'very interesting verse in the book of Micah where Micah is prophesying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 563, 1, 30, 'against the false prophets. He says, "You false prophets! You who lead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 563, 2, 30, 'his people astray! You who cry "Peace" to those who give you food and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 563, 3, 30, 'threaten those who will not pay" (Micah 3:5, The Living Bible). There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 563, 4, 30, 'were a lot of preachers like this even in Micah''s day, who when somebody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 563, 5, 30, 'gave them a handsome gift, would not rebuke or correct that person. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 563, 6, 30, 'would only say nice things and assure him that everything would be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 563, 7, 30, 'alright with him. But those who never gave a gift, they would really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 563, 8, 30, 'feel free to rebuke. Micah exposed such preachers in his day. That was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 563, 9, 30, 'partiality toward those who gave bread. Let''s say someone invites you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 563, 10, 30, 'for a meal. Would you still feel free to rebuke him? In Luke 7 we read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 563, 11, 30, 'about a man called Simon the Pharisee who invited Jesus for a meal.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 563, 12, 30, 'Before Jesus even ate the meal, he rebuked him. Jesus was never going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 563, 13, 30, 'be bribed by a meal. That''s what this verse is getting at. Some people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 563, 14, 30, 'can be bribed just by a meal. A meal is enough to make them partial.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 563, 15, 30, 'Here is where we have to become wise: that we do not allow ourselves to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 563, 16, 30, 'be bribed by gifts or food or anything, because God has called us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 563, 17, 30, 'partake of his nature which is completely impartial.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 563, 18, 30, 'Another example could be that someone who hates me does something right,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 563, 19, 30, 'and I can''t appreciate him. Or someone who loves me very much and is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 563, 20, 30, 'very kind to me does something wrong, and I find it quite easy to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 563, 21, 30, 'merciful to him. I''m partial! I don''t see right and wrong clearly. I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 563, 22, 30, 'like that man in Mark 8 whose eyes were half open, who saw men like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 563, 23, 30, 'trees walking. I don''t see right and wrong clearly. What do I see? I see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 563, 24, 30, 'who likes me and who does not like me. Brothers and sisters, as long as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 563, 25, 30, 'we are operating on that level, we have to say to ourselves, "I have not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 563, 26, 30, 'partaken of the divine nature. I''m not operating on the basis of right');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 563, 27, 30, 'and wrong like God does. I''m operating on the basis of: Do I like this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 563, 28, 30, 'brother or do I not like this brother?" That''s partiality and we have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 564, 1, 30, 'cleanse ourselves from it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 564, 2, 30, 'A man with an evil eye hastens after wealth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 564, 3, 30, 'And does not know that want will come upon him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 564, 4, 30, 'Prov 28:22');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 564, 5, 30, 'This again refers to the folly of trying to make money quickly which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 564, 6, 30, 'tempts us to make money in unrighteous ways. This type of person does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 564, 7, 30, 'not know that he will finally become poor. It also speaks here about an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 564, 8, 30, 'evil eye. The man with an evil eye is the man who has his heart set on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 564, 9, 30, 'money. Jesus said that if your eye is evil, your whole body will be full');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 564, 10, 30, 'of darkness. However much a man may believe the right doctrine, his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 564, 11, 30, 'whole body gradually becomes full of darkness if he runs after money.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 564, 12, 30, 'That''s one mark of an evil eye: hastening after wealth. Such a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 564, 13, 30, 'doesn''t believe that God will allow money to come his way. Jesus also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 564, 14, 30, 'said if your eye is clear, your whole body is full of light. That means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 564, 15, 30, 'your eye is not always coveting. It''s with our eyes that we covet what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 564, 16, 30, 'we see - what another person has, something here, something there. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 564, 17, 30, 'really need to cleanse our eyes from this type of covetousness and come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 564, 18, 30, 'to contentment. We must come to the point where we can see something and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 564, 19, 30, 'not desire it. We must be quite free from that. If God wants me to have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 564, 20, 30, 'something, he''ll give it to me. If he doesn''t, then I''m not interested.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 564, 21, 30, 'In any case, I have to seek the kingdom of God first and his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 564, 22, 30, 'righteousness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 564, 23, 30, 'He who rebukes a man will afterward find more favor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 564, 24, 30, 'Than he who flatters with the tongue.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 564, 25, 30, 'Prov 28:23');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 564, 26, 30, 'This is one of those things repeated a number of times in Proverbs: that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 564, 27, 30, 'rebuke is always better than flattery. Even though it doesn''t look like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 564, 28, 30, 'that in the beginning, in the long run, and certainly in eternity, we''ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 565, 1, 30, 'find that there was absolutely no profit that came out of flattering');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 565, 2, 30, 'people. We usually flatter people for our own gain. We want some favor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 565, 3, 30, 'from someone, or we want someone to have a good opinion of us, or we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 565, 4, 30, 'want someone to think we are very gentle or good at giving compliments.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 565, 5, 30, 'But no one will rebuke for personal gain. We really need to be free from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 565, 6, 30, 'seeking our own if we are to be free from flattery.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 565, 7, 30, 'Flattery can take various forms in our life. We might say or do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 565, 8, 30, 'something to give someone the impression that we think highly of them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 565, 9, 30, 'when underneath we have some ulterior motive. But if we seek to correct');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 565, 10, 30, 'and rebuke, it says here that afterward - not immediately - you''ll find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 565, 11, 30, 'that there''s more profit and blessing. Even if some people don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 565, 12, 30, 'appreciate you right now, at the judgment seat of Christ they will come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 565, 13, 30, 'to you and say, "Thank you brother/sister for not flattering me, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 565, 14, 30, 'telling me the truth straight to my face." If we are willing to wait for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 565, 15, 30, 'our thanks at the judgment seat of Christ, we''ll do what is right.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 565, 16, 30, 'He who robs his father or his mother');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 565, 17, 30, 'And says, "It is not a transgression,"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 565, 18, 30, 'Is the companion of a man who destroys.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 565, 19, 30, 'Prov 28:24');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 565, 20, 30, 'There can be many applications of this verse. A son or daughter can take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 565, 21, 30, 'money from his or her house without the knowledge of the parents and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 565, 22, 30, 'say, "There''s nothing wrong with that. They''re my own parents." That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 565, 23, 30, 'stealing. Why do you have to hide it from your parents if you took a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 565, 24, 30, 'little money from their purse? You''re a thief and you''ll grow up to be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 565, 25, 30, 'bigger thief! We have to teach our children this. They shouldn''t think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 565, 26, 30, 'they can just take something and think, "It''s just my own home." This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 565, 27, 30, 'verse can also apply to those who are waiting for their parents to die');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 565, 28, 30, 'so that they can get their inheritance. That attitude is the same as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 566, 1, 30, 'that of a thief. They are waiting to get something from their parents.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 566, 2, 30, 'This verse also applies in another way: Jesus told the Pharisees in Mark');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 566, 3, 30, '7:10-13, "Moses said, ''Honor your father and mother and he who speaks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 566, 4, 30, 'evil of father and mother, let him be put to death.'' But you say, ''If a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 566, 5, 30, 'man says to his father or mother, ''Anything of mine which you might have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 566, 6, 30, 'been helped by is corban (that is given to God).''" In other words, "I''ve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 566, 7, 30, 'become a full-time Christian worker. I''m sorry - I can''t help you now. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 566, 8, 30, 'have to serve the Lord and give all my money to Him, and I don''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 566, 9, 30, 'any money to give to you." Or you may be in a secular job, but you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 566, 10, 30, 'care to support your parents who need your help financially. Perhaps it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 566, 11, 30, 'is your wife''s parents who need some help, and you won''t allow her to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 566, 12, 30, 'send a single dollar home. Or your husband''s parents need some help, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 566, 13, 30, 'you won''t allow him to send any money home because you say, "Give it to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 566, 14, 30, 'God. Give it to the church." You think you''re very spiritual, but Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 566, 15, 30, 'said you''re not. You''re a Pharisee. You don''t permit your husband or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 566, 16, 30, 'wife to do anything for their father and mother. You''re invalidating the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 566, 17, 30, 'word of God. All your knowledge is a lot of garbage. It''s a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 566, 18, 30, 'rubbish. When you think you''re spiritual, you''re deceiving yourself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 566, 19, 30, 'thoroughly. You have a tradition, and you''ve made yourself think you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 566, 20, 30, 'spiritual. It''s not true. Jesus says, "You do many things like that." He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 566, 21, 30, 'exposed that type of humbug. To rob father and mother means that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 566, 22, 30, 'don''t provide for them financially in their old age when they need help');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 566, 23, 30, 'from you. God has intended for children to take care of their parents,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 566, 24, 30, 'and if you don''t do that, you''re actually robbing them. You say, "It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 566, 25, 30, 'not a sin, because I''ve given it to the assembly." Don''t give it to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 566, 26, 30, 'assembly! Take care of your needy parents. It says in 1 Timothy 5:8 that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 566, 27, 30, 'if a person does not provide for his own and especially for those in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 566, 28, 30, 'own family, he has denied the faith and is worse than an unbeliever!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 567, 1, 30, 'Think of that. What if you consider yourself to be a New and Living Way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 567, 2, 30, 'believer, but God says you''re worse than an unbeliever? Not just an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 567, 3, 30, 'unbeliever, but worse than an unbeliever. That is something we have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 567, 4, 30, 'take seriously.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 567, 5, 30, 'Greed causes fighting; trusting God leads to prosperity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 567, 6, 30, 'Prov 28:25, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 567, 7, 30, 'In the margin it says "A broad soul causes fighting." One meaning of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 567, 8, 30, '"broad soul" is a covetous soul. That''s why it''s paraphrased that a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 567, 9, 30, 'greedy man always stirs up strife. A broad soul means one who is always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 567, 10, 30, 'wanting more and more. Here we see the reason for a lot of conflict');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 567, 11, 30, 'among brothers and sisters. It is covetousness which is at the root of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 567, 12, 30, 'lot of bad relationships and fighting. We expect things from people and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 567, 13, 30, 'we don''t get them, and then we have a bad relationship with them. That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 567, 14, 30, 'not good. That shows that we''re covetous. It''s our greed that has caused');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 567, 15, 30, 'bad relationships with people. We need to die to that greed. Otherwise,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 567, 16, 30, 'we''ll always have bad relationships with those people. It could be that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 567, 17, 30, 'I have a bad relationship with someone because of some money matter. My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 567, 18, 30, 'greed is so great that I''m not willing to die to myself in the area of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 567, 19, 30, 'some material thing. Just examine yourself and see if some material');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 567, 20, 30, 'thing like money has caused a bad relationship between you and another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 567, 21, 30, 'brother or sister. Then you are a broad soul - a covetous soul - and you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 567, 22, 30, 'need to cut down your breadth a little bit and not be so broad.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 567, 23, 30, 'Another meaning of "broad soul" is a soul that is proud. Pride is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 567, 24, 30, 'another cause of broadness - to be lifted up. An arrogant man stirs up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 567, 25, 30, 'strife, but trusting in the Lord always leads to prosperity. So, greed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 567, 26, 30, 'and pride are the causes of many fights.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 567, 27, 30, 'He who trusts in his own heart is a fool,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 567, 28, 30, 'But he who walks wisely will be delivered.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 568, 1, 30, 'Prov 28:26');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 568, 2, 30, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 568, 3, 30, 'It is foolish to follow your own opinions. Be safe, and follow the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 568, 4, 30, 'teachings of wiser people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 568, 5, 30, 'Prov 28:26, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 568, 6, 30, 'A fool is basically a person who has confidence in himself - his own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 568, 7, 30, 'ability to handle a problem, his own understanding, and his own wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 568, 8, 30, 'People who reason a lot and try to argue and prove a point are ones who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 568, 9, 30, 'put a lot of confidence in their own reasoning. You find a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 568, 10, 30, 'believers like that: trying to argue and reason out a particular point.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 568, 11, 30, 'They are quite confident in themselves. The very fact that they argue');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 568, 12, 30, 'and reason so much proves that they are foolish.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 568, 13, 30, 'It contrasts this by saying, "But he who walks wisely will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 568, 14, 30, 'delivered." In other words, trusting in ourselves hinders wisdom. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 568, 15, 30, 'is why we read right in the beginning of Proverbs, "Trust in the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 568, 16, 30, 'with all your heart and do not lean on your own understanding" (Proverbs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 568, 17, 30, '3:5). If you lean on your own understanding, you''ll become a fool. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 568, 18, 30, 'are a lot of things that your reason tells you that are completely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 568, 19, 30, 'wrong. When we come to the scriptures, we can argue about so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 568, 20, 30, 'things, but it''s always good to be a little humble and say, "The bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 568, 21, 30, 'is not very clear on this subject, but this is my understanding at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 568, 22, 30, 'moment." God''s word is clear on certain things, of course. But I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 568, 23, 30, 'sometimes find that believers get so occupied and worked up and dogmatic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 568, 24, 30, 'about many small, trivial matters. They think they have the wisdom of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 568, 25, 30, 'almighty God in those subjects. That''s pure conceit and a mark of an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 568, 26, 30, 'absolute fool. They do not have the humility to acknowledge that there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 568, 27, 30, 'are so many trivial matters in which we don''t have perfect wisdom. Paul');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 568, 28, 30, 'was humble enough to say, "I don''t see everything clearly yet" (1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 569, 1, 30, 'Corinthians 13:12). Take that position. There are things Paul saw');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 569, 2, 30, 'clearly concerning the gospel, concerning Jesus Christ, concerning God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 569, 3, 30, 'and salvation and sanctification, but there were so many other things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 569, 4, 30, 'not pertaining to life and godliness which Paul acknowledged he did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 569, 5, 30, 'see clearly yet. It''s good for us to have the same humility and humble');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 569, 6, 30, 'approach in these areas.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 569, 7, 30, 'The Good News Translation says we can have our own opinions on so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 569, 8, 30, 'things, but we can be safe if we are humble enough to accept the wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 569, 9, 30, 'of wiser people. That''s why God gives us those who have more maturity:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 569, 10, 30, 'to help us when we are young, so that we can be protected and safe. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 569, 11, 30, 'have seen young people accept the advice of those they consider to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 569, 12, 30, 'wiser and be protected. They were able to grow up without getting a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 569, 13, 30, 'reputation of being foolish. I have also seen young people who think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 569, 14, 30, 'quite a lot about themselves and don''t take the advice of older people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 569, 15, 30, 'They grow up and have a reputation of doing one foolish thing after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 569, 16, 30, 'another. I want to encourage young people - those in their younger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 569, 17, 30, 'teenage years and others growing up - don''t grow up in the assembly and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 569, 18, 30, 'get a reputation of being foolish. The only reason that would happen is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 569, 19, 30, 'that you are so proud of yourself. There are a lot of people who have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 569, 20, 30, 'gotten that reputation. Don''t follow in their footsteps and be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 569, 21, 30, 'spiritual idiot yourself. Learn a lesson from them and say, "I want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 569, 22, 30, 'humble myself and live according to the wisdom that my parents give me."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 569, 23, 30, 'If you are a teenager, the person whom God has put over you is not the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 569, 24, 30, 'elder in the church. God put your parents over you so listen to them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 569, 25, 30, 'first of all. They''re wiser than you, and you''ll be saved from so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 569, 26, 30, 'stupid things if you listen to them. That''s just one simple principal:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 569, 27, 30, 'be safe and follow the teachings of wiser people. It''s foolish to follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 569, 28, 30, 'your own opinions. The book of Proverbs has a tremendous amount of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 570, 1, 30, 'wisdom to offer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 570, 2, 30, 'I say the same thing to wives: listen to your husbands and you''ll be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 570, 3, 30, 'saved from a fantastic amount of folly in your home. Humble yourselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 570, 4, 30, 'and submit to the advice of your husband - even if your clever opinion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 570, 5, 30, 'doesn''t feel that it''s absolutely right. God has given your husband as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 570, 6, 30, 'an authority over you. If you listen to him, chances are you''ll be saved');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 570, 7, 30, 'from a fantastic amount of folly in your home.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 570, 8, 30, 'He who gives to the poor will never want,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 570, 9, 30, 'But he who shuts his eyes will have many curses.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 570, 10, 30, 'Prov 28:27');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 570, 11, 30, 'What''s the opposite of a curse? A blessing. Jesus said it''s more blessed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 570, 12, 30, 'to give than to receive (Acts 20:35). A blessed man is one who has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 570, 13, 30, 'learned to give rather than receive.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 570, 14, 30, 'When the wicked prosper, good men go away; when the wicked meet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 570, 15, 30, 'disaster, good men return.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 570, 16, 30, 'Prov 28:28, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 570, 17, 30, 'This is referring to a country where good people leave when the wicked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 570, 18, 30, 'prosper. Then they return when the wicked meet disaster. We can apply');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 570, 19, 30, 'this to the church as well. When the leadership in a church is not good,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 570, 20, 30, 'the good people leave that church. Whenever we hear of people leaving a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 570, 21, 30, 'church, that should never disturb us unless they are the best people in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 570, 22, 30, 'the church. Then something is wrong. But if they are not the best');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 570, 23, 30, 'people, that''s not serious. There are a lot of people who come and go.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 570, 24, 30, 'We have sometimes received accusations because some of the best people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 570, 25, 30, 'in other congregations leave and come to our church. I say those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 570, 26, 30, 'assemblies are so stupid, because they don''t ask themselves why the best');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 570, 27, 30, 'people are leaving. If only the carnal, good-for-nothing folks are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 570, 28, 30, 'leaving, that''s not serious. That''s how it must always be: if we see the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 571, 1, 30, 'best people in a church wanting to leave and go somewhere else, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 571, 2, 30, 'should bring us down on our face in repentance. We should say, "Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 571, 3, 30, 'have mercy on us. What''s wrong with us?" But if we find those who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 571, 4, 30, 'not whole-hearted, not the most spiritual, not the most wise, not the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 571, 5, 30, 'best are the ones who come and go, that doesn''t disturb us. There will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 571, 6, 30, 'always be such visitors who come and go.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 571, 7, 31, 'Chapter 29 Chapter 29');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 571, 8, 31, 'If you get more stubborn every time you are corrected, one day you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 571, 9, 31, 'be crushed and never recover.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 571, 10, 31, 'Prov 29:1, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 571, 11, 31, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 571, 12, 31, 'The man who is often reproved but refuses to accept criticism will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 571, 13, 31, 'suddenly be broken and never have another chance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 571, 14, 31, 'Prov 29:1, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 571, 15, 31, 'This is another warning for us. God can correct us directly through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 571, 16, 31, 'discipline and also through those who he has set above us in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 571, 17, 31, 'families and in the church. But if each time you are corrected, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 571, 18, 31, 'harden yourself so that you get more and more stubborn, then finally one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 571, 19, 31, 'day it will lead to a complete crushing. You''ll just suddenly be broken.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 571, 20, 31, 'That''s why it''s always good for us to be humble and receive correction,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 571, 21, 31, 'however old we may be, however spiritual we may think we are. As long as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 571, 22, 31, 'I have not become like Jesus, I need correction. That''s a very simple');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 571, 23, 31, 'rule we can follow: as long as I have not become like Jesus, I need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 571, 24, 31, 'correction and I should want to receive it. But when people are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 571, 25, 31, 'unwilling to accept correction, it''s a very dangerous position they have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 571, 26, 31, 'come to. It''s like cancer that has spread so much that we have to say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 571, 27, 31, 'like the doctor, "There''s not much hope there. There''s not much hope for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 571, 28, 31, 'that brother/sister, because so many corrections haven''t seemed to have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 572, 1, 31, 'any effect on them."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 572, 2, 31, 'Show me a righteous ruler and I will show you a happy people. Show me a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 572, 3, 31, 'wicked ruler and I will show you a miserable people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 572, 4, 31, 'Prov 29:2, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 572, 5, 31, 'Everything that applies in the Old Testament to a country applies in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 572, 6, 31, 'New Testament to the church. In the Old Testament, the nation of Israel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 572, 7, 31, 'was God''s people, but in the New Testament it''s the church. This also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 572, 8, 31, 'applies to our families. So whenever it speaks of a king or a ruler, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 572, 9, 31, 'have to apply that to the head of the family or to the leadership in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 572, 10, 31, 'church. Show me a righteous father and I''ll show you a happy family.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 572, 11, 31, 'Show me a wicked father and I''ll show you a miserable family. The same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 572, 12, 31, 'applies to the church. The character of a church is always a reflection');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 572, 13, 31, 'of the leadership of the church according to this verse.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 572, 14, 31, 'A man who loves wisdom makes his father glad,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 572, 15, 31, 'But he who keeps company with harlots wastes his wealth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 572, 16, 31, 'Prov 29:3');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 572, 17, 31, 'We can apply this to our heavenly father: that he''s glad and delighted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 572, 18, 31, 'when he finds a child of his who loves wisdom and who longs to get it!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 572, 19, 31, 'And of course, one who loves wisdom will love correction. That''s usually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 572, 20, 31, 'the test of whether we love wisdom or not. It''s very easy for us to say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 572, 21, 31, '"Oh God, I love wisdom!" Well, the test of it is your attitude when God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 572, 22, 31, 'rebukes you or when you''re corrected. If you do something wrong and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 572, 23, 31, 'you''re corrected and you get offended, God says, "You don''t love wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 572, 24, 31, 'at all. You''re not interested in wisdom at all. You''re just saying that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 572, 25, 31, 'with your lips."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 572, 26, 31, 'Then it says, "But he who keeps company with harlots wastes his wealth."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 572, 27, 31, 'If a person is loose in the sexual area, he can lose all his wealth. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 572, 28, 31, 'the same way, if you keep company with spiritual harlots you lose out in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 573, 1, 31, 'spiritual wealth. You have to be careful, dear young brothers and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 573, 2, 31, 'sisters, of the type of friends you have. Do you know that it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 573, 3, 31, 'possible for a person to be a believer but to have the spirit of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 573, 4, 31, 'spiritual harlot? That means there''s no fear of God in that person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 573, 5, 31, 'There''s no seriousness towards sin in that person. Just a lot of foolish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 573, 6, 31, 'talking and useless conversation. And it''s possible for a person to have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 573, 7, 31, 'the spirit of a harlot and to sit in our church. That''s the tragedy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 573, 8, 31, 'When you find someone like that whose spirit is not leading you to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 573, 9, 31, 'greater fear of God or to godliness and greater sanctification, I want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 573, 10, 31, 'to urge you, young brothers and sisters specifically, to avoid such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 573, 11, 31, 'person even if that person is a member of your church. You can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 573, 12, 31, 'deceived thinking that such a person is going to help you spiritually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 573, 13, 31, 'because perhaps they know the doctrine. No. It doesn''t have to be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 573, 14, 31, 'prostitute necessarily, just one who is spiritually in harlotry, who''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 573, 15, 31, 'not whole-hearted, who knows the doctrine, but is not whole-hearted in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 573, 16, 31, 'godliness. If you find that fellowship with such a person is not leading');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 573, 17, 31, 'you to greater sanctification and holiness and godliness in your life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 573, 18, 31, 'avoid them. Otherwise, you''ll lose whatever little wealth you have. Our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 573, 19, 31, 'entire life we are supposed to be accumulating spiritual wealth. Don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 573, 20, 31, 'waste it and ruin it and lose it by keeping company with those who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 573, 21, 31, 'not also in the pursuit of acquiring more and more of the divine nature.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 573, 22, 31, 'If you listen to this advice, five years from now you''ll be very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 573, 23, 31, 'thankful. You can neglect this advice and you''ll regret it. I guarantee');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 573, 24, 31, 'you''ll regret it. Take seriously what the word of God says. Watch your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 573, 25, 31, 'company! Watch your company dear young people. Seek the fellowship of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 573, 26, 31, 'the whole-hearted; not just believers or even believers in your own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 573, 27, 31, 'church, but the whole-hearted! And if you can''t find a whole-hearted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 573, 28, 31, 'person like that, be alone. I would be alone. I would rather be alone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 574, 1, 31, 'than waste my time with those who are not whole-hearted any day. I say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 574, 2, 31, 'that to every young person here. Take this seriously. Be one of those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 574, 3, 31, 'who can make your heavenly Father glad by loving wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 574, 4, 31, 'The king gives stability to the land by justice but a man who takes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 574, 5, 31, 'bribes overthrows it. Bribery brings corruption.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 574, 6, 31, 'Prov 29:4');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 574, 7, 31, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 574, 8, 31, 'When the king is concerned with justice, the nation will be strong, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 574, 9, 31, 'when he is only concerned with money, he will ruin his country.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 574, 10, 31, 'Prov 29:4, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 574, 11, 31, 'Apply this to a father. When a father is concerned about righteousness,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 574, 12, 31, 'his family will be strong. But when a father is only concerned about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 574, 13, 31, 'making money, he will ruin his family. That''s what this verse means.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 574, 14, 31, 'It''s self-explanatory. We don''t need any explanation for this.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 574, 15, 31, 'A man who flatters his neighbor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 574, 16, 31, 'Is spreading a net for his steps.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 574, 17, 31, 'Prov 29:5');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 574, 18, 31, 'We don''t have to apply this to ourselves. I hope we are not going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 574, 19, 31, 'flatter anyone, but we must be careful when someone else comes to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 574, 20, 31, 'flatter us. Think of this verse: "Ah, why is this person saying so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 574, 21, 31, 'nice things about me now? He''s spreading a net." What do people spread a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 574, 22, 31, 'net for? What do they put a net into the sea for? To catch the fish.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 574, 23, 31, 'It''s bait to catch us for something. If a net is spread on the ground');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 574, 24, 31, 'with a big pit underneath, it''s a trap for the elephant to fall in. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 574, 25, 31, 'you are wise, you''ll always be a bit careful when you find somebody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 574, 26, 31, 'saying a lot of nice things to you. Say, "I''m not going to take that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 574, 27, 31, 'seriously."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 574, 28, 31, 'On the other hand, if you find someone rebuking you or correcting you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 575, 1, 31, 'then you can listen carefully. There''s no trap or net there. It''s going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 575, 2, 31, 'to be for your good. This is where we see the folly of worldly people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 575, 3, 31, 'who prefer flattery to correction. This is also where we see whether a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 575, 4, 31, 'believer is worldly or not. When a believer loves flattery and hates');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 575, 5, 31, 'correction, he''s a worldly believer. That''s all there is to it. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 575, 6, 31, 'amazing how much the book of Proverbs has to speak about correction and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 575, 7, 31, 'rebuke, and how much it warns against flattery.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 575, 8, 31, 'By transgression an evil man is ensnared,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 575, 9, 31, 'But the righteous sings and rejoices.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 575, 10, 31, 'Prov 29:6');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 575, 11, 31, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 575, 12, 31, 'Evil people are trapped in their own sins, while honest people are happy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 575, 13, 31, 'and free.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 575, 14, 31, 'Prov 29:6, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 575, 15, 31, 'When a person is trapped in a difficulty, it''s very often because of his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 575, 16, 31, 'own sins that he is trapped. He''s done something wrong, and he''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 575, 17, 31, 'trapped. But a person who is honest and upright is happy and free. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 575, 18, 31, 'can see in so many situations that when we find ourselves in a trap,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 575, 19, 31, 'it''s because we have done something sinful. If we were honest and pure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 575, 20, 31, 'and lived with a clear conscience toward God and man, it says here that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 575, 21, 31, 'we''d be happy. True happiness comes through godliness. The joy of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 575, 22, 31, 'Lord comes through holiness. Through holiness comes happiness. Honest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 575, 23, 31, 'people are happy and don''t find themselves in a trap. There may be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 575, 24, 31, 'difficulties, but God delivers them. They are free. The devil may put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 575, 25, 31, 'them in a tight corner, but they are free because God delivers them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 575, 26, 31, 'The righteous is concerned for the rights of the poor,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 575, 27, 31, 'The wicked does not understand such concern.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 575, 28, 31, 'Prov 29:7');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 576, 1, 31, 'Jesus always cared for the poor people who were oppressed. We must also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 576, 2, 31, 'have a concern for people who are being oppressed. That''s why Jesus was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 576, 3, 31, 'so much against the religious rulers of his day. Why? Because he had a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 576, 4, 31, 'concern for the poor Israelites who were being led astray and deceived');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 576, 5, 31, 'by all these religious rulers. I tell you, if we are like Jesus, we will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 576, 6, 31, 'also be 100% against all these so-called Christian leaders and bishops');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 576, 7, 31, 'and priests and pastors who don''t allow their people to hear the whole');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 576, 8, 31, 'truth of God to help them come into a life of victory and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 576, 9, 31, 'sanctification. It''s not enough to say, "I desire that for myself." We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 576, 10, 31, 'have to be against all these religious rulers who hinder the oppressed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 576, 11, 31, 'poor from coming to an understanding of God''s word. The righteous is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 576, 12, 31, 'concerned for the rights of the poor. Think of all the sincere believers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 576, 13, 31, 'and simple people who are sitting in so many denominations today in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 576, 14, 31, 'trap. They''re told their marriage or funeral won''t be conducted if they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 576, 15, 31, 'don''t stay there, and so therefore they''re in a trap. They''re not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 576, 16, 31, 'allowed to come to obedience to God''s word and to godliness. Jesus cared');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 576, 17, 31, 'for the oppressed poor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 576, 18, 31, 'This also means the righteous man is merciful to others, whereas the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 576, 19, 31, 'wicked person is not merciful. One manifestation of righteousness is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 576, 20, 31, 'mercy. That''s where we see that the Pharisees did not have true');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 576, 21, 31, 'righteousness. They had a counterfeit righteousness, because their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 576, 22, 31, 'righteousness didn''t have mercy in it. That''s a very good test for us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 576, 23, 31, 'apply to ourselves: that when I think I''m righteous (because I''m getting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 576, 24, 31, 'victory over the lust of my eyes, I''m righteous in paying my taxes, I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 576, 25, 31, 'not losing my temper, etc.), if mercy is not there, I have to write');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 576, 26, 31, 'across all my righteousness, "Counterfeit" and "Pharisaical". It''s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 576, 27, 31, 'the real thing! Mercy - that''s one of the characteristics of true');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 576, 28, 31, 'righteousness. A truly righteous person is concerned for the rights of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 577, 1, 31, 'the poor. Therefore he''s merciful to someone who does not have the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 577, 2, 31, 'righteousness that he has.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 577, 3, 31, 'Fools start fights everywhere but wise men always try to keep peace.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 577, 4, 31, 'There''s no use arguing with a fool. He only rages and scoffs, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 577, 5, 31, 'tempers flare.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 577, 6, 31, 'Prov 29:8-9, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 577, 7, 31, 'The one who starts a fight in a home is the fool in that home. Remember');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 577, 8, 31, 'that. The one who starts a fight in a home is ALWAYS a fool, whatever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 577, 9, 31, 'doctrine he or she may believe. One who starts a fight in a church is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 577, 10, 31, 'the fool of that church, and the one who wants to make peace is the wise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 577, 11, 31, 'man. Very simple and straightforward.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 577, 12, 31, 'Verse 9 says that it''s useless to argue with a fool. A fool is one who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 577, 13, 31, 'is self-confident, as we saw earlier, and has no sense of need in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 577, 14, 31, 'life or desire for godliness. It''s foolish to argue with such people and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 577, 15, 31, 'to reason with such people. I need to see that when I argue and try to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 577, 16, 31, 'reason with a fool, it just proves that I am a fool myself. It''s true.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 577, 17, 31, 'That''s why we need to run away from all arguments and all controversy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 577, 18, 31, '(even over doctrinal matters), because argument brings a manifestation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 577, 19, 31, 'of folly. So, let''s steer clear of that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 577, 20, 31, 'Men of bloodshed hate the blameless,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 577, 21, 31, 'But the upright are concerned for his life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 577, 22, 31, 'Prov 29:10');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 577, 23, 31, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 577, 24, 31, 'The godly pray for those who long to kill them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 577, 25, 31, 'Prov 29:10, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 577, 26, 31, 'The evil person''s and godly person''s attitudes are completely different.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 577, 27, 31, 'The evil person''s attitude towards the godly is that he hates him. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 577, 28, 31, 'believe one reason is because evil people oppose the message of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 578, 1, 31, 'sanctification. But if we are godly, our attitude towards someone who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 578, 2, 31, 'opposes us is a test of our own godliness. 1 John 3:12 says, "Cain was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 578, 3, 31, 'of the devil and he slew his brother because his own deeds were evil,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 578, 4, 31, 'and his brother''s deeds were righteous." There''s something that works up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 578, 5, 31, 'a person who is defeated by sin when he hears someone preaching about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 578, 6, 31, 'victory over sin. For example, let''s say you proclaim what it says in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 578, 7, 31, 'Ecclesiastes 7:9: "Anger dwells in the bosom of a fool"; that when you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 578, 8, 31, 'get angry, you are just manifesting and shouting to the world, "I am a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 578, 9, 31, 'fool! Did you hear that? I''m going to get angry again. I am a fool! If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 578, 10, 31, 'you didn''t hear it clearly last time, I''m telling you again today. I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 578, 11, 31, 'a fool!" When a pastor hears that who still doesn''t have victory over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 578, 12, 31, 'anger, you can be sure that he''ll oppose that message, because it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 578, 13, 31, 'showing him to be a fool in the eyes of his congregation. This is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 578, 14, 31, 'reason why the sons of Cain hate the righteous sons of Abel: because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 578, 15, 31, 'their own deeds are evil, and their brothers'' deeds are righteous. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 578, 16, 31, 'has continued from the beginning of creation. The very first two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 578, 17, 31, 'children of Adam are like two streams of humanity. That''s what we see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 578, 18, 31, 'here.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 578, 19, 31, 'But the attitude of the god-fearing person is the attitude of Jesus:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 578, 20, 31, '"Father, forgive them for they don''t know what they are doing." Or as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 578, 21, 31, 'David says in Psalm 35:11-14, "Malicious witnesses rise up against me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 578, 22, 31, 'They ask me things I don''t know. They repay me evil for good. But as for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 578, 23, 31, 'me, when they were sick, my clothing was sackcloth. I humbled my soul');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 578, 24, 31, 'with fasting. I went about as though my own friend or brother was sick.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 578, 25, 31, 'I bowed down with mourning. But when I stumbled, they rejoiced." You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 578, 26, 31, 'see, here''s the contrast between the attitude of a wicked person toward');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 578, 27, 31, 'a righteous person and the attitude of a righteous person toward a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 578, 28, 31, 'wicked person. David says, "When they were sick, when they were in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 579, 1, 31, 'difficulty, I was grieved. But when I had a problem, they rejoiced."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 579, 2, 31, 'That''s the difference. A god-fearing person says, "I am my brother''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 579, 3, 31, 'keeper." He doesn''t say like Cain, "Am I my brother''s keeper?" He''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 579, 4, 31, 'concerned. But a godless person just thinks of himself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 579, 5, 31, 'A fool always loses his temper,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 579, 6, 31, 'but a wise man pulls it back.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 579, 7, 31, 'Prov 29:11');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 579, 8, 31, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 579, 9, 31, 'Stupid people express their anger openly, but sensible people are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 579, 10, 31, 'patient and hold it back.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 579, 11, 31, 'Prov 29:11, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 579, 12, 31, 'This is what was just referred to in verses 8-9. When we feel something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 579, 13, 31, 'rising up within our flesh in a certain situation, we must remember this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 579, 14, 31, 'verse. A fool let''s it all out - like the Psychiatrists say, "Let it all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 579, 15, 31, 'out, and you''ll feel more relaxed inside." That''s the advice of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 579, 16, 31, 'devil. But the Holy Spirit says, "Now is the time to fight that lust in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 579, 17, 31, 'your flesh that''s coming up. Put it to death and die. Don''t just keep it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 579, 18, 31, 'within. Be patient, cool it, and let there be a dying in you." In the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 579, 19, 31, 'Old Testament, they couldn''t understand this matter of dying. They could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 579, 20, 31, 'only go as far as this verse and say, "A wise man holds it back." But in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 579, 21, 31, 'the New Testament we have something more. We don''t just hold anger back');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 579, 22, 31, 'and keep it inside. We bear the dying of Jesus in our bodies so that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 579, 23, 31, 'anger disappears altogether. It''s not just holding anger back. A wise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 579, 24, 31, 'man puts anger to death and it disappears.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 579, 25, 31, 'If a ruler pays attention to false information, all his officials will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 579, 26, 31, 'be liars.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 579, 27, 31, 'Prov 29:12, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 579, 28, 31, 'Here again we can apply this to the father of a family or to anyone who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 580, 1, 31, 'is in a position of authority over someone else. A ruler should not pay');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 580, 2, 31, 'attention to false information. In other words, you should not believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 580, 3, 31, 'everything you hear. If you believe everything you hear and then go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 580, 4, 31, 'around telling everyone what you heard, it proves one thing: that you''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 580, 5, 31, 'a fool. The other thing it proves is that you''re not really fit to be an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 580, 6, 31, 'older brother or older sister. You''re not fit to be an older brother or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 580, 7, 31, 'sister to any human being under the sun. You''re just a baby. Jesus did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 580, 8, 31, 'not believe everything his ears heard. He did not even believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 580, 9, 31, 'everything his eyes saw, and that''s more difficult. We can get victory');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 580, 10, 31, 'over the first part and say, "I''m not going to believe everything my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 580, 11, 31, 'ears hear. That may not be true." But to really become like Jesus, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 580, 12, 31, 'must get victory in the second area of not even believing everything I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 580, 13, 31, 'see. Even with things we see, there may be some reason behind them that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 580, 14, 31, 'we can''t explain. Jesus would not judge by his ears or by his eyes but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 580, 15, 31, 'with righteousness (Isaiah 11:3-4). He liked to listen to the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 580, 16, 31, 'Spirit and that''s the place we are to come to. Then we can truly be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 580, 17, 31, 'examples to others who are younger than us and forerunners to them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 580, 18, 31, 'Don''t listen to everything that you hear.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 580, 19, 31, 'When an older person pays attention to false information, all his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 580, 20, 31, 'ministers become wicked. We can apply this in this way: if a father pays');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 580, 21, 31, 'attention to false information, his children are going to be like that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 580, 22, 31, 'too. Think of a father and mother who sit around the table and gossip');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 580, 23, 31, 'and speak evil about others in the church. They''re going to produce a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 580, 24, 31, 'brood of children who grow up to be like that. There''s no use in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 580, 25, 31, 'father and mother being angry with their children for being gossipers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 580, 26, 31, 'They have to ask themselves, "What have we been doing at home to teach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 580, 27, 31, 'our children all that rubbish when they were sitting around with us?"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 580, 28, 31, 'Don''t blame them. That would be like a father who smokes and smokes and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 581, 1, 31, 'smokes and then his child becomes addicted to cigarettes and he gets');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 581, 2, 31, 'upset with him. Why do you get upset with your child? You''re the one who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 581, 3, 31, 'taught him how to smoke. In the same way, parents are the ones who teach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 581, 4, 31, 'their children how to gossip. You''re the ones who taught them those evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 581, 5, 31, 'habits. You''re the ones who taught them to be so selfish. It''s good for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 581, 6, 31, 'us to judge ourselves in this area.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 581, 7, 31, 'The poor man and the oppressor have this in common:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 581, 8, 31, 'The Lord gives light to the eyes of both.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 581, 9, 31, 'Prov 29:13');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 581, 10, 31, 'There''s a lot of difference in the social status of the poor man and his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 581, 11, 31, 'master (the oppressor). Sometimes masters can be oppressors to their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 581, 12, 31, 'servants. They forget who has given light to their own eyes. God gave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 581, 13, 31, 'your eyes light, and he can blind you in a moment. And God has given');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 581, 14, 31, 'light to the poor person''s eyes too. Be humble and recognize in all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 581, 15, 31, 'situations that God can judge you even if you have power over another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 581, 16, 31, 'person. Humble yourself and recognize that God can judge you very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 581, 17, 31, 'easily. Don''t be so haughty and think that you are something or someone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 581, 18, 31, 'It''s good to have small thoughts about ourselves even if we are elevated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 581, 19, 31, 'above others in the social structure of this world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 581, 20, 31, 'If a king judges the poor with truth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 581, 21, 31, 'His throne will be established forever.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 581, 22, 31, 'Prov 29:14');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 581, 23, 31, 'Judging with truth means with righteousness and without partiality. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 581, 24, 31, 'is back to the same theme we''ve considered before of not having');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 581, 25, 31, 'partiality. There should never be partiality in our judgments. And I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 581, 26, 31, 'really believe from all the experiences that I''ve had with various');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 581, 27, 31, 'denominations in India over these last twenty-six years, it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 581, 28, 31, 'partiality by which the devil has prevailed. The gates of Hell have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 582, 1, 31, 'prevailed against so many churches because of partiality. If you go to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 582, 2, 31, 'most churches and Christian organizations and see who the board members');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 582, 3, 31, 'are, you''ll always find they are the big shots in society. Or if you go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 582, 4, 31, 'to some of these Christian functions and see who is asked to open and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 582, 5, 31, 'dedicate some new hall or new building, you''ll see they always call some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 582, 6, 31, 'big shot in society. The person may happen to be a Christian also, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 582, 7, 31, 'he is not called because he is a God-fearing brother. He''s called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 582, 8, 31, 'because he is the director of this or that or some big official or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 582, 9, 31, 'secretary or police official or something like that. He''s a big shot and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 582, 10, 31, 'therefore he''s invited. Some of those big shots may not even be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 582, 11, 31, 'converted. That''s the surest way to destroy a church, because God will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 582, 12, 31, 'stay a million miles away from a church where there''s partiality. If the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 582, 13, 31, 'king judges the poor with truth, his throne will be established forever.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 582, 14, 31, 'And God will only dwell in a church where there is no respect of persons');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 582, 15, 31, '- whether it''s a person''s position or education or color of skin or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 582, 16, 31, 'community or anything! The fear of God is the only thing that is valued');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 582, 17, 31, 'in the true church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 582, 18, 31, 'The rod and reproof give wisdom,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 582, 19, 31, 'But a child who gets his own way brings shame to his mother.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 582, 20, 31, 'Prov 29:15');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 582, 21, 31, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 582, 22, 31, 'Correction and discipline are good for children. If they have their own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 582, 23, 31, 'way, they will make their mothers ashamed of them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 582, 24, 31, 'Prov 29:15, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 582, 25, 31, 'Beware of giving children their own way. Their wills have to be broken');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 582, 26, 31, 'very early in life. I think this danger of a child having its own way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 582, 27, 31, 'usually comes to the youngest child. When there''s only one child,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 582, 28, 31, 'there''s also a danger there. But when there are many children, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 583, 1, 31, 'danger is with the youngest because usually when there''s a fight for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 583, 2, 31, 'toys, the youngest gets it. Gradually that youngest child begins to have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 583, 3, 31, 'its own way in almost everything. You have to be the most careful with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 583, 4, 31, 'the youngest. Sometimes the youngest tends to be the darling as well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 583, 5, 31, 'This causes tremendous problems. If a child has its own way, one day the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 583, 6, 31, 'mother will be ashamed of that child. The other children will grow up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 583, 7, 31, 'alright, but the mother will be ashamed of that child. This puts the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 583, 8, 31, 'responsibility here on the mother. Mothers have to take this seriously.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 583, 9, 31, 'It says the shame will come on the mother. And, of course, the father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 583, 10, 31, 'too. There''s an example in the Old Testament we read about in 1 Kings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 583, 11, 31, '1:5 - "Adonijah, the son of Haggith, the son of David, exalted himself,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 583, 12, 31, 'saying, ''I will be king.''" Then it says in verse 6 that his father,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 583, 13, 31, 'David, never displeased Adonijah at any time even by asking him a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 583, 14, 31, 'question like, "Why have you done this?" Think of a father who never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 583, 15, 31, 'asked his child even once, "Why did you do this?" And that child grew up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 583, 16, 31, 'to rebel against the God appointed king, Solomon. Adonijah was Solomon''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 583, 17, 31, 'half-brother, and Solomon may have been thinking about him when he wrote');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 583, 18, 31, 'this verse. Rebellion is sown into the hearts of children by parents who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 583, 19, 31, 'don''t correct and discipline their children. Instead they allow them to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 583, 20, 31, 'have their own way. That''s a warning for all of us. Let''s take it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 583, 21, 31, 'seriously.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 583, 22, 31, 'When the wicked increase, transgression increases;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 583, 23, 31, 'But the righteous will see their fall.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 583, 24, 31, 'Prov 29:16');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 583, 25, 31, 'In some cases, we see the fall of the wicked immediately on this earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 583, 26, 31, 'In some cases, we''ll see their fall only in eternity. But one thing is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 583, 27, 31, 'sure: the righteous will one day see the fall of every wicked person. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 583, 28, 31, 'may look on this earth as though the wicked are prospering, and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 584, 1, 31, 'righteous are having a hard time. But one day, with your own eyes, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 584, 2, 31, 'will see that wicked person fall - so don''t envy him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 584, 3, 31, 'Correct your son, and he will give you comfort;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 584, 4, 31, 'He will also delight your soul.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 584, 5, 31, 'Prov 29:17');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 584, 6, 31, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 584, 7, 31, 'Discipline your children and you can always be proud of them. They will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 584, 8, 31, 'never give you reason to be ashamed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 584, 9, 31, 'Prov 29:17, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 584, 10, 31, 'Again, this is a repetition. Discipline your children. Think of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 584, 11, 31, 'number of times it says in the book of Proverbs to discipline your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 584, 12, 31, 'children, and they will never give you reason to be ashamed. We really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 584, 13, 31, 'need to take that very seriously as parents, brothers and sisters,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 584, 14, 31, 'because the spirit of rebellion is increasing in the world as we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 584, 15, 31, 'approach the end of time. Even fifty years ago in the days when some of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 584, 16, 31, 'us were in school, we don''t remember the type of rebellion against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 584, 17, 31, 'teachers that we find in schools today. I remember in my younger days');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 584, 18, 31, 'when I was in school, there was a fear of teachers. But you don''t find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 584, 19, 31, 'that in today''s ten, eleven, and twelve year-old children. It''s amazing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 584, 20, 31, 'It only proves that we''re approaching the end of time, and the devil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 584, 21, 31, 'knows his time is short. The spirit of rebellion is ripe in the world,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 584, 22, 31, 'and that''s why we need to really protect our children in the church from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 584, 23, 31, 'that spirit by disciplining them at home. Never allow them to speak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 584, 24, 31, 'rudely to older people. Never allow them to disobey father and mother.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 584, 25, 31, 'That spirit of rebellion has to be disciplined. Beware of allowing a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 584, 26, 31, 'child to have his own way. Discipline and correction will protect him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 584, 27, 31, 'and he will never give reason for us to be ashamed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 584, 28, 31, 'Where there is no vision, the people are unrestrained,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 585, 1, 31, 'But happy is he who keeps the law.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 585, 2, 31, 'Prov 29:18');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 585, 3, 31, 'This is one of the most important verses in the book of Proverbs. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 585, 4, 31, 'first part of this verse has been translated in different ways: where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 585, 5, 31, 'there is no revelation (margin), where there is no prophecy, where there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 585, 6, 31, 'is no prophet , where there is no seer, etc. It could mean any of those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 585, 7, 31, 'things. In the Old Testament, prophets were called "seers". Seers were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 585, 8, 31, 'people who had a vision of God''s will and who saw things the way God saw');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 585, 9, 31, 'them. Where there is no such vision (or revelation) or no person who has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 585, 10, 31, 'such a vision (e.g., no prophet or seer), the people are unrestrained.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 585, 11, 31, 'The second part has also been translated in various ways: the people are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 585, 12, 31, 'unrestrained or the people are scattered like sheep. When Jesus was on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 585, 13, 31, 'earth, he saw the people as sheep who were scattered because there was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 585, 14, 31, 'no vision among the leaders of God''s people. "Unrestrained" can also be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 585, 15, 31, 'translated as "they rebel" or "they perish" "they are stripped naked".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 585, 16, 31, 'When you think of all the meanings that there are in this verse, we see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 585, 17, 31, 'the tremendous importance of prophetic vision in the midst of God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 585, 18, 31, 'people - not just a head knowledge of the scriptures, but a knowledge of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 585, 19, 31, 'God. That way there is a prophetic vision of God''s purposes and of what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 585, 20, 31, 'is needed among the people of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 585, 21, 31, 'This verse was true in the Old Testament in the days of Samuel. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 585, 22, 31, 'written in 1 Samuel 3:1 that the word of the Lord was rare and visions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 585, 23, 31, 'were infrequent. And that''s the time that God raised up Samuel. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 585, 24, 31, 'a great need in the church as well. Wherever there is no prophetic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 585, 25, 31, 'vision and no revelation in the church, the people rebel, they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 585, 26, 31, 'stripped naked by Satan, and they are unrestrained. You see that in so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 585, 27, 31, 'many so-called Christian churches: where there is no prophetic word, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 585, 28, 31, 'people just do what they like (like it says in the book of Judges).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 586, 1, 31, 'There''s a wonderful statement in the book of Judges which is referring');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 586, 2, 31, 'to the time when there was no vision just before the time of Samuel. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 586, 3, 31, 'last verse in the book of judges says, "Each man did what was right in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 586, 4, 31, 'his own eyes" (Judges 21:25). That''s the condition of a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 586, 5, 31, 'Christendom and a lot of churches today. Where there is no prophetic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 586, 6, 31, 'vision, everybody does what they feel like. That''s why you find today in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 586, 7, 31, 'a lot of so-called Christian churches that the young people have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 586, 8, 31, 'virtually taken over the church. The pastor is at the mercy of the young');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 586, 9, 31, 'people, because he has to please them and he has to allow them to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 586, 10, 31, 'whatever they like in order to keep them happy. There is no prophetic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 586, 11, 31, 'vision and no revelation, and the people are stripped naked! The pastor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 586, 12, 31, 'is led by the foolishness and the folly of the young people. That''s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 586, 13, 31, 'condition of almost all Christian churches today. This is a verse we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 586, 14, 31, 'have to keep in mind - the importance of vision.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 586, 15, 31, 'We can apply this verse to the home as well. If the father, who is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 586, 16, 31, 'head of the house, does not have a clear vision of what God''s purpose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 586, 17, 31, 'for his house is, he''ll allow his wife to run the house, and when women');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 586, 18, 31, 'run the house, it''ll always go the way that it went in the garden of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 586, 19, 31, 'Eden when Eve began to run her house: paradise is lost immediately. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 586, 20, 31, 'a man doesn''t have vision, his children are unrestrained and they rebel.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 586, 21, 31, 'This is the condition of a lot of Christian homes, because the man just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 586, 22, 31, 'doesn''t know how to be the head of the house. He doesn''t have a vision');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 586, 23, 31, 'of what God''s purpose is for his home. Where there is no vision, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 586, 24, 31, 'people are unrestrained.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 586, 25, 31, 'Then it says, "But happy is he who keeps the law." This, we can say, is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 586, 26, 31, 'added on to this verse. Let''s say you are in a situation where there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 586, 27, 31, 'no revelation and no vision and no prophet and no prophecy. What shall');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 586, 28, 31, 'you do? Maybe you''re not a prophet and don''t have prophetic vision');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 587, 1, 31, 'yourself. Well, you don''t have to give up hope. You can obey the second');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 587, 2, 31, 'part of this verse. Just obey the words of God which you know. Keep the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 587, 3, 31, 'law and vision will come. It begins with simple obedience to the word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 587, 4, 31, 'God. This is a very important verse.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 587, 5, 31, 'A slave will not be instructed by words alone;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 587, 6, 31, 'For though he understands, there will be no response.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 587, 7, 31, 'Prov 29:19');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 587, 8, 31, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 587, 9, 31, 'You cannot correct servants just by talking to them. They may understand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 587, 10, 31, 'you, but they will pay no attention.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 587, 11, 31, 'Prov 29:19, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 587, 12, 31, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 587, 13, 31, 'Sometimes mere words are not enough - discipline is needed. For the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 587, 14, 31, 'words may not be heeded.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 587, 15, 31, 'Prov 29:19, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 587, 16, 31, 'It''s very interesting to see here in this verse that the Holy Spirit is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 587, 17, 31, 'so careful in what He''s written. The Spirit of God is realistic.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 587, 18, 31, 'Sometimes we can be very unrealistic. Those of us who have had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 587, 19, 31, 'experience with servants know the truth of this verse. Mere words are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 587, 20, 31, 'not enough with a servant! That''s realism. There can be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 587, 21, 31, 'super-spirituality which imagines that we can correct everything with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 587, 22, 31, 'mere words, but here it says you cannot correct a servant just by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 587, 23, 31, 'talking to him. Something more is needed. Now, when it comes to what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 587, 24, 31, 'more is needed, the Holy Spirit stops. He doesn''t tell us what more is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 587, 25, 31, 'needed. There we have to seek God for wisdom. It may be a servant in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 587, 26, 31, 'home or someone working under you in the factory or the office, and mere');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 587, 27, 31, 'words don''t solve the problem. There the Holy Spirit expects you to seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 587, 28, 31, 'God for wisdom and say, "Lord, just like this verse says, mere talking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 588, 1, 31, 'has not solved the problem here. Now give me wisdom as to what I should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 588, 2, 31, 'do."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 588, 3, 31, 'As for myself, I discovered long ago not to judge the way another person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 588, 4, 31, 'treats his servants or those working under him, because when I do that,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 588, 5, 31, 'I''m being a busybody in a matter which even the Holy Spirit gives a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 588, 6, 31, 'person freedom. We all have this tendency, like Lucifer, to think we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 588, 7, 31, 'God and decide what so and so must do and not do. Have you ever felt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 588, 8, 31, 'that? "So and so should not bring up his children like that" or "So and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 588, 9, 31, 'so should not treat his servants like that." That is the spirit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 588, 10, 31, 'Lucifer. You are being a mini-God who determines how other people should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 588, 11, 31, 'run their lives and their homes. We have to cleanse ourselves of that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 588, 12, 31, 'spirit. I''ve come to see that being a busybody in other peoples'' affairs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 588, 13, 31, 'is actually the spirit of Lucifer. It''s being a little God to other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 588, 14, 31, 'people and deciding how they should bring up their children or how they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 588, 15, 31, 'should treat their servants. We''ve all done it, so we can''t throw stones');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 588, 16, 31, 'at anyone, but we can all cleanse ourselves so that we don''t do it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 588, 17, 31, 'anymore. We can say, "God will give him wisdom on how to bring up his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 588, 18, 31, 'own children, and it may be different from the way I bring up mine. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 588, 19, 31, 'will give him wisdom on how he should treat his servants, and it may be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 588, 20, 31, 'different from how I treat mine."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 588, 21, 31, 'I''ll tell you another thing - one step further. If it involves a servant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 588, 22, 31, 'in the home and it is mostly the wife who has to deal with that servant,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 588, 23, 31, 'then it can be very easy for the husband to be a busybody. He may speak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 588, 24, 31, 'on a matter which he doesn''t necessarily have wisdom for. It''s not easy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 588, 25, 31, 'to refrain from being a busybody. We need to really seek God as to what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 588, 26, 31, 'our place is in each situation. If someone else in the home has the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 588, 27, 31, 'responsibility to deal with a servant, then we can of course discuss');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 588, 28, 31, 'matters with them, but ultimately, we have to leave the final say up to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 589, 1, 31, 'them and what God leads them to do.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 589, 2, 31, 'So, a servant will not be instructed by words alone. He may understand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 589, 3, 31, 'you, but he will pay no attention until you do something more. However,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 589, 4, 31, 'when we come to the New Testament, we find a similar verse in Ephesians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 589, 5, 31, '6:9 which tells masters how to treat their servants: "Masters, do the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 589, 6, 31, 'same things to them and give up threatening." It is true that mere words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 589, 7, 31, 'may not be enough. But when you go beyond mere words, make sure it''s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 589, 8, 31, 'with threats, because that''s forbidden by the Holy Spirit. That''s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 589, 9, 31, 'way of the world. The world says, "We''ll get the job done by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 589, 10, 31, 'threatening," but that''s not the way for God''s children since God''s word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 589, 11, 31, 'says we''re not to threaten those who work under us. When we seek God for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 589, 12, 31, 'wisdom, we can be sure that the Holy Spirit will not lead us to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 589, 13, 31, 'something contrary to what He Himself has written in the Word. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 589, 14, 31, 'very practical because we have people working for us in our homes and in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 589, 15, 31, 'our offices, and we need wisdom on how to treat them. Mere words are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 589, 16, 31, 'enough, but don''t threaten.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 589, 17, 31, 'This is also true in how God treats his servants. We know that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 589, 18, 31, 'doesn''t correct his servants merely with words. Sometimes mere words are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 589, 19, 31, 'not enough. For example, he told Jonah to go to Nineveh and preach, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 589, 20, 31, 'mere words were not enough for Jonah. He had to send a fierce storm and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 589, 21, 31, 'appoint a whale to swallow him before God was able to accomplish what he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 589, 22, 31, 'wanted. So we can be sure that we are right when we treat those under us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 589, 23, 31, 'the way God treats us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 589, 24, 31, 'Do you see a man who is hasty in his words?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 589, 25, 31, 'There''s more hope for a fool than for him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 589, 26, 31, 'Prov 29:20');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 589, 27, 31, 'Solomon has spoken about many types of fools up to this point. Since the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 589, 28, 31, 'last two chapters of Proverbs are not written by Solomon, this is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 590, 1, 31, 'last chapter that he wrote. He''s coming to the end of chapter 29 and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 590, 2, 31, 'he''s deciding to tell us who the biggest fool of the lot is in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 590, 3, 31, 'opinion (inspired by the Holy Spirit): the man who is hasty in his words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 590, 4, 31, 'and in his matters. He takes the cake as they say. He''s #1. He''s talked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 590, 5, 31, 'about a lot of fools, but this man is absolutely on the top of the list');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 590, 6, 31, '- the person who is quick to speak and quick to do everything. This man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 590, 7, 31, 'gets a letter that works him up and irritates him, and he''s quick to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 590, 8, 31, 'write back! He''s quick to decide who to marry! He''s quick to get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 590, 9, 31, 'married! Quick to do this! Quick to do that! That''s the absolute #1 fool');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 590, 10, 31, 'on the whole earth: a man who is hasty. Everything he does is hasty.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 590, 11, 31, 'Somebody says something, and immediately he must respond. "I have to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 590, 12, 31, 'something," he says. He has no time to wait on the Lord and say, "Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 590, 13, 31, 'what shall I do here?" Hasty, hasty, hasty. When it says there''s more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 590, 14, 31, 'hope for a fool than for him, that means there''s more hope for all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 590, 15, 31, 'fools Solomon has spoken of so far than for this man. Some of them may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 590, 16, 31, 'look like hopeless cases, but there''s some hope for them compared to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 590, 17, 31, 'this man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 590, 18, 31, 'In Isaiah 28:16 the Lord says, "Behold, I am laying in Zion a stone, a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 590, 19, 31, 'tested stone, a costly cornerstone for the foundation firmly placed. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 590, 20, 31, 'who believes in it will not be in a hurry " (margin). The King James');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 590, 21, 31, 'Version says, "He who believes will not make haste." We see that one who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 590, 22, 31, 'believes in the Lord will never be in a hurry. You see, when it comes to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 590, 23, 31, 'marriage, young people in particular can very easily be in a hurry. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 590, 24, 31, 'can''t get young people to wait and seek God''s will. They are afraid to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 590, 25, 31, 'wait and seek God''s will because they think, "By the time I''m done');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 590, 26, 31, 'wasting my time seeking God''s will, somebody else may go in and get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 590, 27, 31, 'married to him/her." There''s more hope for a fool than for such people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 590, 28, 31, 'who can''t believe. They are not believers - they are unbelievers. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 591, 1, 31, 'don''t believe that God can keep anything for them. They don''t believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 591, 2, 31, 'that Almighty God, who created the heavens and the earth, can keep one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 591, 3, 31, 'single thing in the world for them. They are like Jacob who feel, "If I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 591, 4, 31, 'don''t grab for myself, I''ll never get anything."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 591, 5, 31, 'The same thing applies in every area - people grabbing for property and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 591, 6, 31, 'grabbing for all types of things. They say, "If I don''t grab it quickly,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 591, 7, 31, 'I won''t get it." That''s the mark of an unbeliever! A man who has faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 591, 8, 31, 'in God says, "Almighty God will keep it for me if it is for me. If I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 591, 9, 31, 'don''t get it, that proves that God Almighty never intended for me to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 591, 10, 31, 'have it!" It''s very simple. If I can just believe this much: that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 591, 11, 31, 'Almighty is capable of keeping something for me that is meant for me. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 591, 12, 31, 'it''s not meant for me, that''s quite alright. Like we sing in the song I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 591, 13, 31, 'Worship Thee Sweet Will of God : "Ill that He blesses is our good, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 591, 14, 31, 'unbless''d good is ill; And all is right that seems most wrong, if it be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 591, 15, 31, 'His sweet will." Think of a believer who has come to that place, who can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 591, 16, 31, 'say, "All the things which are considered ''ill'' are good for me if God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 591, 17, 31, 'blesses them. And all the things which are considered good in the world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 591, 18, 31, 'are not good for me if God doesn''t bless them." When we get something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 591, 19, 31, 'from God''s hands, that''s the most wonderful thing in the world. God may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 591, 20, 31, 'have intended something or someone for us, but if we grab it, we miss');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 591, 21, 31, 'the blessing. If we had waited, we could have had it in God''s time and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 591, 22, 31, 'in God''s way. That''s a tremendous thing. Keep that in mind.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 591, 23, 31, 'Earlier, it said in Proverbs 26:12, "Do you see a man wise in his own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 591, 24, 31, 'eyes? There is more hope for a fool than for him." So the two people in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 591, 25, 31, 'Proverbs who are on top of the list of fools are those who are in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 591, 26, 31, 'hurry and those who really think they are quite spiritual. The one who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 591, 27, 31, 'is wise in his own eyes thinks, "I am quite a spiritual brother/sister.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 591, 28, 31, 'I am quite wise, spiritually." He''s wise in his own eyes, but not in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 592, 1, 31, 'eyes of others. In his own thinking, he has a high opinion about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 592, 2, 31, 'himself. He is absolutely the #1 fool and he shares the prize jointly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 592, 3, 31, 'with the man who is hasty in his words and in his matters. They win the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 592, 4, 31, 'cup jointly for the biggest fools on earth. That''s good for us to keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 592, 5, 31, 'in mind! We see how easy it is for us to be among these two categories');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 592, 6, 31, 'of fools who are on the top of the list. But we also see how easy it is,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 592, 7, 31, 'once we recognize these attitudes, to judge ourselves and cleanse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 592, 8, 31, 'ourselves from them. Then we can go down in our own estimation and cease');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 592, 9, 31, 'to be in such a hurry in the words we speak, in the letters we write, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 592, 10, 31, 'our actions, etc. We slow down a bit because we trust God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 592, 11, 31, 'This is a word particularly for young people who want to save themselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 592, 12, 31, 'from a lot of folly, particularly in their words. I''ve quoted this verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 592, 13, 31, 'often and it''s good to look at it again: Psalm 12:6. It says, "The words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 592, 14, 31, 'of the Lord are pure words as silver tried in a furnace on the earth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 592, 15, 31, 'refined seven times." That''s the purity there is in God''s words.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 592, 16, 31, 'Applying that to myself, if I''m thinking of saying something, I put it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 592, 17, 31, 'into the furnace and a little bit of the dross falls off. I see that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 592, 18, 31, 'can say it without that extra word there. Then I put it into the furnace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 592, 19, 31, 'a second time and some more dross falls off, and I can cut out something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 592, 20, 31, 'else. I put it into the furnace a third time, and just like that all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 592, 21, 31, 'way down to the seventh time. I must seek to cleanse myself in the way I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 592, 22, 31, 'speak. It doesn''t happen overnight. We slip up, we fall; God''s word says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 592, 23, 31, 'we all stumble, but the intention is that we press on to perfection and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 592, 24, 31, 'become more and more perfect in our speech as we cleanse ourselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 592, 25, 31, 'Sometimes we may say, "That wasn''t very wise. It wasn''t evil, but it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 592, 26, 31, 'wasn''t wise either." We cleanse ourselves and we purify our speech');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 592, 27, 31, 'instead of just opening our mouth and continuing to let people hear our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 592, 28, 31, 'opinions. Be very careful because you can grow up in the assembly and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 593, 1, 31, 'get a testimony that you are the #1 fool. There are young people growing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 593, 2, 31, 'up with that testimony because they just open their mouth and can''t shut');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 593, 3, 31, 'it. They have an opinion on everything under the sun. That''s a sad thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 593, 4, 31, '- it really is.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 593, 5, 31, 'If you give your servants everything they want from childhood on,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 593, 6, 31, 'someday they will take over everything you own.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 593, 7, 31, 'Prov 29:21, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 593, 8, 31, 'In those days, servants were slaves. That means you had the slave in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 593, 9, 31, 'your house from the time he was a little child. He was your slave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 593, 10, 31, 'because he was born to his father who was your slave. And the child');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 593, 11, 31, 'began to work right from a young age. Therefore, if you kept pampering');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 593, 12, 31, 'that child who was your servant, one day you''d find that he wanted to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 593, 13, 31, 'a son in the house. This teaches us another thing about being wise and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 593, 14, 31, 'that is that our love can be deceived. Love must be governed by wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 593, 15, 31, 'in everything. If our love is not governed by wisdom, we can end up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 593, 16, 31, 'suffering a lot of consequences from our own folly. Of course, this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 593, 17, 31, 'applies to our children too. If you give your son everything he wants,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 593, 18, 31, 'he''ll grow up to be a tyrant. If you give your servant everything he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 593, 19, 31, 'wants, one day he''ll virtually take over the house and he''ll be the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 593, 20, 31, 'master and you''ll be the servant submitting to his authority.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 593, 21, 31, 'An angry man stirs up strife,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 593, 22, 31, 'And a hot-tempered man abounds in transgression.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 593, 23, 31, 'Prov 29:22');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 593, 24, 31, 'People often speak of their hot temper as a weakness, sometimes even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 593, 25, 31, 'believers. That''s like saying, "I just go and commit adultery every now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 593, 26, 31, 'and again," or "I go kill a few people every week." It''s really in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 593, 27, 31, 'same category. It''s amazing how so many believers don''t have light on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 593, 28, 31, 'the fact that anger is exactly the same as murder and adultery in God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 594, 1, 31, 'eyes. No difference! And the reason they never get rid of their anger is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 594, 2, 31, 'because they think of it as a weakness and not as a sin. As long as I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 594, 3, 31, 'think of murder and adultery as sins but the violent temper I''ve had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 594, 4, 31, 'from childhood as only a temperamental weakness, I''ll have it until I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 594, 5, 31, 'die. It''ll never go away because you haven''t called it sin yet. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 594, 6, 31, 'chances are your sin of anger is not forgiven either because you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 594, 7, 31, 'call it sin, you call it a weakness. The blood of Jesus doesn''t cleanse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 594, 8, 31, 'weaknesses. It doesn''t. If your anger is just a weakness, I''m sorry but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 594, 9, 31, 'the blood of Jesus doesn''t cleanse you, and you have no place in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 594, 10, 31, 'kingdom of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 594, 11, 31, 'It says a hot-tempered man abounds in sin! Anger was a transgression');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 594, 12, 31, 'even in the Old Testament! We think it''s only a New Testament command.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 594, 13, 31, 'Well, here it is in the Old Testament. A hot-tempered man abounds in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 594, 14, 31, 'sin. It''s not just some small sin. He''s abounding, overflowing with sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 594, 15, 31, 'because of his hot temper. That''s why we must never think of our hot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 594, 16, 31, 'temper as just a weakness. Call it by its rightful name: a filthy sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 594, 17, 31, 'Be ashamed of it just like you would be ashamed of committing adultery');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 594, 18, 31, 'every day. Be just as ashamed! It''s like you fell into adultery again!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 594, 19, 31, 'Call anger sin and then I think we''ll get victory over it much quicker.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 594, 20, 31, 'I really believe lots of believers don''t get victory over some sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 594, 21, 31, 'because they haven''t seen the sinfulness of those sins. They haven''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 594, 22, 31, 'seen some of these sins for the horrible, hideous, wretched things they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 594, 23, 31, 'are in God''s eyes. So believers take them lightly and they never go away');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 594, 24, 31, 'from their lives. That''s the devil''s trick. He wants believers to end up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 594, 25, 31, 'in his lap in Hell finally, so he makes them keep on calling sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 594, 26, 31, 'weaknesses. The devil knows that those sins will never be forgiven as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 594, 27, 31, 'long as they''re called weaknesses. Finally, people wake up in Hell one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 594, 28, 31, 'day and discover that they were not weaknesses, but rather sins which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 595, 1, 31, 'would have been easily forgiven if they were called sins. But they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 595, 2, 31, 'not forgiven because they were called weaknesses. We must be honest. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 595, 3, 31, 'hot-tempered man abounds in transgression. But praise God there is grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 595, 4, 31, 'with Him to bring even this giant of a violent temper underneath our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 595, 5, 31, 'feet.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 595, 6, 31, 'A man''s pride will bring him low,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 595, 7, 31, 'But a humble spirit will obtain honor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 595, 8, 31, 'Prov 29:23');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 595, 9, 31, 'God gives his grace to the humble, but he resists the proud. That''s why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 595, 10, 31, 'a man''s pride brings him low - because God resists him! We can say God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 595, 11, 31, 'is pushing one person down and he''s pushing another person up. God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 595, 12, 31, 'constantly pushing down the man who wants to exalt himself and who''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 595, 13, 31, 'proud in his thoughts and thinks highly of himself. This is another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 595, 14, 31, 'reason why many believers do not make spiritual progress: because God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 595, 15, 31, 'always pushing them down. The poor chaps just can''t grow, because God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 595, 16, 31, 'pushing them down. The devil is already pushing them down, but God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 595, 17, 31, 'also pushing them down because of their conceit - because of their pride');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 595, 18, 31, 'and high thoughts about themselves which God sees in their heart,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 595, 19, 31, 'however humble they may appear to be on the surface. But where a person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 595, 20, 31, 'is really small in his own eyes, God lifts him up with grace. He will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 595, 21, 31, 'obtain honor in God''s eyes. Those New Testament verses which we read in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 595, 22, 31, 'James 4:6 and 1 Peter 5:5 are there in Proverbs too. It is the humble to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 595, 23, 31, 'whom God gives grace.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 595, 24, 31, 'A thief''s partner is his own worst enemy. He will be punished if he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 595, 25, 31, 'tells the truth in court, and God will curse him if he doesn''t.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 595, 26, 31, 'Prov 29:24, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 595, 27, 31, 'The whole problem arose for this person because he got himself into an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 595, 28, 31, 'alliance with a thief. How can we apply this to ourselves? We can say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 596, 1, 31, 'that this thief is a person who writes his accounts wrongly in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 596, 2, 31, 'business. Is that person called a thief in the world? Maybe not, but he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 596, 3, 31, 'is in God''s eyes. What is a man called who is stealing from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 596, 4, 31, 'government by withholding taxes that rightfully belong to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 596, 5, 31, 'government? A thief! What would you call a man who stole some of your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 596, 6, 31, 'money? A thief! That''s right. A man who enters into a business');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 596, 7, 31, 'partnership with an unbeliever or with a believer who doesn''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 596, 8, 31, 'righteous principles, he may make money, but he will get himself into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 596, 9, 31, 'trouble.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 596, 10, 31, 'I heard of a man in Kerala who was a Pentecostal. He was asked how he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 596, 11, 31, 'maintains his accounts in these corrupt days and he responded, "Well, my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 596, 12, 31, 'partner is an unbeliever, and he writes the accounts." He thought that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 596, 13, 31, 'solved his problem because he wasn''t the one cheating. He only got the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 596, 14, 31, 'profits. It''s a deception to think that God will only judge that man''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 596, 15, 31, 'partner and let him go saying, "Alright, you didn''t actually write the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 596, 16, 31, 'accounts." It''s a deception. Be not unequally yoked together with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 596, 17, 31, 'unbelievers. There we see how we could potentially come into a difficult');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 596, 18, 31, 'situation in court. If you speak the truth, you''re punished. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 596, 19, 31, 'don''t speak the truth, God will curse you. Suppose we''ve done some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 596, 20, 31, 'foolish things like that man and we have to testify in court. What shall');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 596, 21, 31, 'we do then? Shall we be punished by men or be cursed by God? We shall be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 596, 22, 31, 'punished by men and speak the truth. This verse tells us that when a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 596, 23, 31, 'tells a lie in court, even if he escapes punishment on earth because he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 596, 24, 31, 'told a lie, he will not escape God''s curse finally. When we find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 596, 25, 31, 'ourselves in such situations, in our office or elsewhere, it can feel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 596, 26, 31, 'like we''re in a tight spot. If we tell the truth, we might lose our job.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 596, 27, 31, 'What''s the alternative? If we tell a lie, God will punish us and curse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 596, 28, 31, 'us. Which one do you want? May God give us grace to say, "I''ll lose my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 597, 1, 31, 'job, but I don''t want God''s curse on my life." These types of situations');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 597, 2, 31, 'are where we find men compromise. They say, "I will tell a lie and then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 597, 3, 31, 'I will confess it. God is merciful. He''ll forgive me."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 597, 4, 31, 'The fear of man brings a snare,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 597, 5, 31, 'But he who trusts in the Lord will be exalted.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 597, 6, 31, 'Prov 29:25');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 597, 7, 31, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 597, 8, 31, 'It''s dangerous to be concerned with what others think of you, but if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 597, 9, 31, 'trust the Lord, you are safe.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 597, 10, 31, 'Prov 29:25, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 597, 11, 31, 'The fear of man is a trap. To seek honor from men is a trap! It catches');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 597, 12, 31, 'people like an elephant caught in a trap. The fear of man: what will so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 597, 13, 31, 'and so do to me or what will so and so think about me? These are usually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 597, 14, 31, 'the two fears: 1) What will so and so think about me if I say or do this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 597, 15, 31, 'and 2) what will so and so do to me if I say or do this? From childhood');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 597, 16, 31, 'these fears are there. They''re a trap that prevent us from honoring God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 597, 17, 31, 'But if we fear God alone, we''ll ask, "What will God do to me if I do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 597, 18, 31, 'this?" That''s more important than what some man will do to me. "What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 597, 19, 31, 'will God think about me?" That''s more important than what some man will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 597, 20, 31, 'think about me. Then I am free. So many believers are caught in a trap.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 597, 21, 31, 'They''re like birds with wings flapping, but who can''t fly because they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 597, 22, 31, 'are in the trap of seeking the honor of men. They''re afraid of what man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 597, 23, 31, 'will do because they do not fear God!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 597, 24, 31, 'For example, are you in some kind of relationship with an unbeliever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 597, 25, 31, 'that''s getting you into a compromising position? Listen to the word Paul');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 597, 26, 31, 'told Timothy in 1 Timothy 5:22. Just three words: "Keep yourself pure."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 597, 27, 31, 'Never mind if the other fellow is going to Hell. Don''t hold hands with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 597, 28, 31, 'him. Don''t think that you can have a business partnership with a man who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 598, 1, 31, 'does unrighteous things and is on his way to Hell, and then at the last');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 598, 2, 31, 'second you can leave his hand. No! God will say, "You held his hand on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 598, 3, 31, 'earth, you''ll hold his hand in eternity too! Where he goes, you go too."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 598, 4, 31, 'That''s why we have to be very careful in every alliance with an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 598, 5, 31, 'unbeliever which can lead us into situations where we have to do wrong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 598, 6, 31, 'things. Keep yourself pure. "He who trusts in the Lord will be exalted."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 598, 7, 31, 'That''s sure.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 598, 8, 31, 'Do you want justice? Don''t fawn on the judge, but ask the Lord for it!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 598, 9, 31, 'Prov 29:26, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 598, 10, 31, 'Do you want justice? Don''t go buttering people up for it. Go and ask the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 598, 11, 31, 'Lord. He''ll get it for you. Don''t get it by seeking the ruler''s favor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 598, 12, 31, 'Justice for a man comes from the Lord. If the Lord sees it fit that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 598, 13, 31, 'go through some injustice here on earth in order to get some spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 598, 14, 31, 'purification, say, "Fine. That''s okay." We don''t have to go flattering');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 598, 15, 31, 'and buttering people up here on earth to get justice. The world does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 598, 16, 31, 'that, but not a servant of God, a son of God, who has some dignity about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 598, 17, 31, 'him. Many, many, many people seek the ruler''s favor, but justice for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 598, 18, 31, 'man comes from the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 598, 19, 31, 'The good hate the badness of the wicked. The wicked hate the goodness of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 598, 20, 31, 'the good.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 598, 21, 31, 'Prov 29:27, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 598, 22, 31, 'The good don''t hate the wicked, they hate the badness of the wicked -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 598, 23, 31, 'just like God. God hates the badness of the wicked. And the wicked hate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 598, 24, 31, 'the goodness of good people. That is the main reason why we have such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 598, 25, 31, 'lot of opposition when we preach victory over sin. Suppose you go into a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 598, 26, 31, 'church and you preach that if a man shouts at his wife at home, he has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 598, 27, 31, 'no business to get up and preach any message to anybody. What does that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 598, 28, 31, 'man have to tell people? He has no gospel, no good news to tell anyone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 599, 1, 31, 'And suppose the pastor sitting there is a man who not only shouts at his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 599, 2, 31, 'wife but has been seen shouting at his wife by some of the other people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 599, 3, 31, 'in the congregation. Don''t you think he''ll get furious with that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 599, 4, 31, 'message? He won''t say that the reason he opposes it is because you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 599, 5, 31, 'exposed his sin. No. That would look terrible. He''ll find some other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 599, 6, 31, 'doctrinal thing, saying, "This particular doctrine that these people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 599, 7, 31, 'believe is all heresy." That''s a cover up for the real reason which is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 599, 8, 31, 'that he hates the goodness of the good! He hates people preaching that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 599, 9, 31, 'you must get victory over your lust and your anger and your love for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 599, 10, 31, 'money. That''s the real reason. Once we understand that, we can expect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 599, 11, 31, 'opposition to the message of victory over sin right until the end of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 599, 12, 31, 'days, because "he who is upright in the way is an abomination to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 599, 13, 31, 'wicked" (King James Version). Think of that. He who is upright in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 599, 14, 31, 'way is an abomination - a perpetual nuisance - to this wicked man who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 599, 15, 31, 'wants to live in sin and say, "Grace has covered me. I''m clothed with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 599, 16, 31, 'the righteousness of Christ." All that is rotten. He''s abusing the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 599, 17, 31, 'doctrine of God''s grace.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 599, 18, 31, 'This is why you find there are few who want to be upright in their way:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 599, 19, 31, 'because they don''t want to face opposition. When it comes to opposition,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 599, 20, 31, 'a lot of people who begin as upright people end up as diplomats who want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 599, 21, 31, 'to please everybody. Paul says in 2 Timothy 3:12, "All those who live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 599, 22, 31, 'godly lives in Christ Jesus will suffer persecution." You''ll find that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 599, 23, 31, 'persecution comes primarily from other Christians who don''t believe in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 599, 24, 31, 'living godly lives. If we don''t face up to that, we''ll have a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 599, 25, 31, 'surprises. But if we face up to it right in the beginning, then when we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 599, 26, 31, 'are opposed by other Christians, we will not be surprised. We''ll say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 599, 27, 31, '"That''s what God''s word says. It''s just a fulfillment of God''s word."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 599, 28, 31, 'This is the last of Solomon''s Proverbs. It''s very interesting to see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 600, 1, 31, 'that he ends on that note. He says, "Now that you''ve heard all these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 600, 2, 31, 'things from me, if you try to go out and practice them and preach them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 600, 3, 31, 'you''ll face the opposition of all those who do not want to live in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 600, 4, 31, 'way."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 600, 5, 32, 'Chapter 30 Chapter 30');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 600, 6, 32, 'The last two chapters of Proverbs were written by others besides');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 600, 7, 32, 'Solomon. As we read in the first verse of both chapters. Chapter 30 was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 600, 8, 32, 'written by a man called Agur, the son of Jakeh.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 600, 9, 32, 'The words of Agur the son of Jakeh, the oracle. The man declares to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 600, 10, 32, 'Ithiel, to Ithiel and Ucal:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 600, 11, 32, 'Prov 30:1-2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 600, 12, 32, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 600, 13, 32, 'These are the messages of Agur, son of Jakeh, addressed to Ithiel and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 600, 14, 32, 'Ucal: I am tired out, O God, and ready to die. I am too stupid even to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 600, 15, 32, 'call myself a human being!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 600, 16, 32, 'Prov 30:1-2, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 600, 17, 32, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 600, 18, 32, 'These are the solemn words of Agur son of Jakeh: "God is not with me,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 600, 19, 32, 'God is not with me, and I am helpless. I am more like an animal than a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 600, 20, 32, 'human being; I do not have the sense we humans should have."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 600, 21, 32, 'Prov 30:1-2, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 600, 22, 32, 'An oracle is just a burden. So Agur writes down the burden which was on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 600, 23, 32, 'his heart. While Ithiel and Ucal are possibly names, many Hebrew names');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 600, 24, 32, 'have meaning. So it could be that they are not names and instead their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 600, 25, 32, 'meanings make up a sentence. The Living Bible and Good News Translation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 600, 26, 32, 'paraphrases of the meaning of those names is shown above. Agur is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 600, 27, 32, 'writing this chapter at a time when he has come to his wits end. He''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 600, 28, 32, 'come to the end of himself. It''s like when the disciples tried all night');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 601, 1, 32, 'to catch fish and caught nothing; they came to an end of themselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 601, 2, 32, 'This man has also come to this point. It''s very interesting to see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 601, 3, 32, 'that''s the time when he gets wisdom to write scripture - the moment when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 601, 4, 32, 'he comes to the absolute end of himself and says, "Lord I''m exhausted."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 601, 5, 32, 'That''s the meaning of Ithiel and Ucal: "I''m tired out, O God. I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 601, 6, 32, 'exhausted."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 601, 7, 32, 'Surely I am more stupid than any man, And I do not have the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 601, 8, 32, 'understanding of a man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 601, 9, 32, 'Prov 30:2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 601, 10, 32, 'Here''s a brother whose intelligence is below average, quite below');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 601, 11, 32, 'average in fact. During his school days, he would have been among the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 601, 12, 32, 'last two or three in his class. Do you think God picks such people to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 601, 13, 32, 'write scripture? Think of what Agur says: "I''m more stupid than any man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 601, 14, 32, 'I used to come last in my class. I couldn''t understand the lessons other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 601, 15, 32, 'children grasped so quickly." Consider how God picks up such a man and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 601, 16, 32, 'leaves behind all the clever, intelligent people who can explain the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 601, 17, 32, 'doctrine. It''s a tremendous encouragement that God picks such a man to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 601, 18, 32, 'write a portion of Holy Scripture.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 601, 19, 32, 'Even if a man is intelligent, he cannot understand God''s word until he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 601, 20, 32, 'comes to this same place. In 1 Corinthians 3:18, Paul says, "Let no man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 601, 21, 32, 'deceive himself. If any man among you thinks that he is wise in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 601, 22, 32, 'age, he must become foolish, so that he may become wise." When a person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 601, 23, 32, 'is clever, he can understand the doctrine, but he has no revelation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 601, 24, 32, 'Until he really, sincerely considers himself to be absolutely stupid, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 601, 25, 32, 'can''t get revelation. Many people hear this message and say, "Yes, I''m');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 601, 26, 32, 'stupid," but don''t really believe it in their heart, and they still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 601, 27, 32, 'don''t get revelation. However, here''s someone who believed it! He said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 601, 28, 32, '"I am more stupid than any man, and I don''t have the understanding of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 602, 1, 32, 'man," and he got revelation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 602, 2, 32, 'Neither have I learned wisdom, Nor do I have the knowledge of the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 602, 3, 32, 'One.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 602, 4, 32, 'Prov 30:3');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 602, 5, 32, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 602, 6, 32, 'I can''t understand man, leave alone trying to understand God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 602, 7, 32, 'Prov 30:3 TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 602, 8, 32, 'In other words, "I can''t. I don''t know. I''m exhausted, Lord. I''ve come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 602, 9, 32, 'to the end of myself. I can''t understand. There are many things I just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 602, 10, 32, 'don''t know. I don''t have wisdom." Praise God that there''s a revelation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 602, 11, 32, 'like that in the Old Testament. One would think this would be found in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 602, 12, 32, 'the New Testament. There are many things in Proverbs which are New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 602, 13, 32, 'Testament truths. It''s almost like a New Covenant book inserted back in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 602, 14, 32, 'the Old Testament, because only the New Testament emphasizes that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 602, 15, 32, 'has no value for our human ability and cleverness. That is why Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 602, 16, 32, 'chose disciples and apostles from among the fishermen - the people who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 602, 17, 32, 'were considered unlearned and uneducated in Israel. It is also where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 602, 18, 32, 'today''s Christendom has gone completely astray - a full 180 degrees in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 602, 19, 32, 'the opposite direction from the Christianity that Jesus and the apostles');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 602, 20, 32, 'preached. Today''s Christianity has gone after clever people and educated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 602, 21, 32, 'people and has tried to give them more education in their schools and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 602, 22, 32, 'colleges, so that they pursue one degree after another. You cannot get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 602, 23, 32, 'all those degrees unless you''re really clever. Imagine if Jesus had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 602, 24, 32, 'chosen apostles like that. There would be no Christianity on the earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 602, 25, 32, 'today. It would be corrupt! It would have been corrupted right at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 602, 26, 32, 'beginning. Jesus had a different understanding from all these Christians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 602, 27, 32, 'today. That''s why he never sent his apostles to a bible school or any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 602, 28, 32, 'such thing. He needed them to learn by revelation. As Jesus told Peter,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 603, 1, 32, '"Flesh and blood has not revealed this to you. Your cleverness has not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 603, 2, 32, 'given you revelation, Peter. There are many people more clever than you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 603, 3, 32, 'in Israel." How come those others did not understand but Peter did? My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 603, 4, 32, 'brothers and sisters, we''ve heard this for so many years in the church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 603, 5, 32, 'Do you think you''ve understood it? I''ll give you my opinion: I believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 603, 6, 32, 'most of us have not understood it. We know in theory, yes, but we lean');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 603, 7, 32, 'so much on our human cleverness, and we are proud of our cleverness. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 603, 8, 32, 'may wonder how I can be so sure. Well, I can sense it in peoples''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 603, 9, 32, 'spirits. There is pride. That''s where we have to judge ourselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 603, 10, 32, 'severely. We are not among the uneducated or those with below average');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 603, 11, 32, 'intelligence. Has anyone reading this come last in your class? Maybe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 603, 12, 32, 'there are a couple, but most of us never came last in our class, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 603, 13, 32, 'some of us are quite proud that we did so well during our school days.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 603, 14, 32, 'That''s alright in the world, but woe unto us if we think we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 603, 15, 32, 'spiritual because we can understand the doctrine. We can easily get some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 603, 16, 32, 'stupid, crazy idea like that about ourselves. No. We have to come to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 603, 17, 32, 'place that this man came to in order to get revelation: "I am more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 603, 18, 32, 'stupid than any man."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 603, 19, 32, 'Who can we say is more stupid than any man on the earth? About whom can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 603, 20, 32, 'we say that? Which category of people knows nothing? Babies. Babies know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 603, 21, 32, 'nothing. They don''t even know things 6-month-old children know. We can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 603, 22, 32, 'then understand what Jesus meant in Matthew 11:25, "I praise You,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 603, 23, 32, 'Father, Lord of heaven and earth, that You have hidden these things from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 603, 24, 32, 'the wise and intelligent and have revealed them to infants." Infants are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 603, 25, 32, 'newborns who know nothing. It''s very difficult to come to that place.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 603, 26, 32, 'That''s why many believers do not receive revelation. It''s become crystal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 603, 27, 32, 'clear to me anyway that the reason why many people do not get revelation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 603, 28, 32, 'is one and only one reason: they are not infants in their own thinking.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 604, 1, 32, 'They do not acknowledge that they are more stupid than any man. If they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 604, 2, 32, 'came to that place, they would be able to say, "I do not have wisdom,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 604, 3, 32, 'but I have knowledge of the Holy One."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 604, 4, 32, 'I believe there are two revelations that are very important for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 604, 5, 32, 'spiritual growth: 1) I am the chief of sinners (1 Timothy 1:15), and 2)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 604, 6, 32, 'I''m more stupid than any man (Proverbs 30:2).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 604, 7, 32, 'We shouldn''t say these things in false humility, but when we get a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 604, 8, 32, 'revelation that both are true, there is spiritual progress. If I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 604, 9, 32, 'not gotten revelation on these two truths, I will still make progress,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 604, 10, 32, 'but it will be retarded and slow. In the world, there are mentally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 604, 11, 32, 'retarded children who can''t do things properly. It will be exactly the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 604, 12, 32, 'same way for me in the kingdom of God if I don''t have this revelation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 604, 13, 32, 'I''ll be a spiritually retarded child who can''t understand things in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 604, 14, 32, 'spiritual realm. Once God shows me that I am the chief of sinners and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 604, 15, 32, 'that I''m unable to understand wisdom on my own, then I can have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 604, 16, 32, 'knowledge.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 604, 17, 32, 'Who has ascended into heaven and descended?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 604, 18, 32, 'Who has gathered the wind in His fists?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 604, 19, 32, 'Who has wrapped the waters in His garment?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 604, 20, 32, 'Who has established all the ends of the earth?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 604, 21, 32, 'What is His name or His son''s name?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 604, 22, 32, 'Surely you know!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 604, 23, 32, 'Prov 30:4');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 604, 24, 32, 'When Agur wrote this chapter, no one had descended from heaven. It was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 604, 25, 32, 'before the days of Jesus Christ on earth. Of course, Jesus has ascended');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 604, 26, 32, 'and descended since then. Agur also asks, "What is His name or His son''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 604, 27, 32, 'name?" This question is the only place in the Old Testament where there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 604, 28, 32, 'is reference to the son of God, and that revelation was given to a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 605, 1, 32, 'who said he was more stupid than any man. Consider how it is with God:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 605, 2, 32, 'He gives grace to the lowly. Those who humble themselves are exalted.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 605, 3, 32, 'Think of it! You have to read the entire Old Testament to understand the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 605, 4, 32, 'significance of the question, "What is the name of the son of God?" No');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 605, 5, 32, 'one in the Old Testament even thought of God having a son. They only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 605, 6, 32, 'knew God Almighty. Here was a man who said something that belonged in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 605, 7, 32, 'the New Testament. Amazing. We know His name today - Jesus, the son of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 605, 8, 32, 'God. It''s wonderful to have had a revelation like this back in the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 605, 9, 32, 'Testament; Agur knew the marvelous things that God does.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 605, 10, 32, 'Every word of God is tested. He is a shield to those who take refuge in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 605, 11, 32, 'Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 605, 12, 32, 'Prov 30:5');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 605, 13, 32, 'This humble brother really does have small thoughts about himself; he is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 605, 14, 32, 'not standing up trying to teach us something, because he knows he''s more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 605, 15, 32, 'stupid than you and me. He''s someone we should listen to. When he wrote');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 605, 16, 32, 'this chapter, he probably never thought what he wrote would get included');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 605, 17, 32, 'in Scripture as part of the book of Proverbs-the same book that included');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 605, 18, 32, 'sayings from the wisest man who ever lived on the face of the earth. His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 605, 19, 32, 'writings would go alongside Solomon''s - just think of that! Agur never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 605, 20, 32, 'even considered it. He just wrote down what he thought, and God saw to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 605, 21, 32, 'it that this humble brother''s statements would be put in the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 605, 22, 32, 'category as those of Solomon, who was the wisest man who ever lived on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 605, 23, 32, 'the face of the earth. Most believers think Solomon wrote the whole book');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 605, 24, 32, 'of Proverbs, but they don''t know there was a humble brother who wrote');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 605, 25, 32, 'one chapter right at the end.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 605, 26, 32, 'God keeps every promise he makes. He is like a shield for all who seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 605, 27, 32, 'his protection.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 605, 28, 32, 'Prov 30:5 GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 606, 1, 32, 'When the Bible says every word of God is tested and proves true, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 606, 2, 32, 'means that if God has made a promise, He will keep it! Agur knew that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 606, 3, 32, 'He was more stupid than any man in Chemistry, Math, Physics, and every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 606, 4, 32, 'other subject, but when it came to the promises of God, he knew they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 606, 5, 32, 'were definite. He was not spiritually retarded even though he may have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 606, 6, 32, 'been mentally retarded. Every promise of God, He keeps. He is like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 606, 7, 32, 'shield for all those who seek his protection. Think of it; those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 606, 8, 32, 'believe God keeps every promise He makes and is a shield to all who seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 606, 9, 32, 'His protection are the ones who are great in His kingdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 606, 10, 32, 'Do not add to His words Or He will reprove you, and you will be proved a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 606, 11, 32, 'liar.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 606, 12, 32, 'Prov 30:6');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 606, 13, 32, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 606, 14, 32, 'If you claim that He said something that He never said, He will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 606, 15, 32, 'reprimand you and show that you are a liar.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 606, 16, 32, 'Prov 30:6 GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 606, 17, 32, 'This humble brother warns us to be careful. When God has said something,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 606, 18, 32, 'you better accept it just as it is. We should not be like Eve who said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 606, 19, 32, '"You must not eat from the tree or touch it." God never said that. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 606, 20, 32, 'said don''t eat of the fruit, but we read in Genesis 3:3 that Eve added');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 606, 21, 32, 'something to what God said. You know, there are some people who try to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 606, 22, 32, 'be more spiritual than Jesus. They say things Jesus never said. Whenever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 606, 23, 32, 'we begin to teach other people, "You must do it like this," and we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 606, 24, 32, 'no verse in the New Testament to justify it, we are entering into Eve''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 606, 25, 32, 'mistake of trying to be more spiritual than God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 606, 26, 32, 'What is the end result of this attitude: "Don''t eat of the tree, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 606, 27, 32, 'don''t even touch it"? You end up eating and doing everything else as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 606, 28, 32, 'well. That''s the result of super spirituality, which tries to add to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 607, 1, 32, 'God''s word. That''s how the Pharisees became Pharisees, by adding things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 607, 2, 32, 'which Moses never commanded. And there are Christians doing that today,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 607, 3, 32, 'making commands for other people that are not found anywhere in the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 607, 4, 32, 'Testament. Of course, God may lead me in a particular situation to do or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 607, 5, 32, 'not to do certain things, but I must not make it a law for other people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 607, 6, 32, 'if it''s not written in scripture, even though I may do it. For example,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 607, 7, 32, 'you may like getting up at five o''clock in the morning. That''s fine:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 607, 8, 32, 'it''s good to get up early in the morning and read the word of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 607, 9, 32, 'However, if you make it a law for others, then you become a Pharisee.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 607, 10, 32, 'There are many good things we might do that we must never make into laws');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 607, 11, 32, 'for others. It may be just for us. You say, "I have to do it." Brother,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 607, 12, 32, 'that''s fine but spirituality doesn''t come from doing that. Spirituality');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 607, 13, 32, 'comes only through God''s word. Do not add to God''s words, because He has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 607, 14, 32, 'tested them and seen what is enough for man. Don''t think you know more;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 607, 15, 32, 'we must never add. We have to be very careful here: "Don''t add to his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 607, 16, 32, 'words lest He reprove you, and you be proved to be a liar." One day God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 607, 17, 32, 'may expose us like He exposed Eve, and it will be manifest that we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 607, 18, 32, 'just liars. We have to be careful in this area.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 607, 19, 32, 'We can consider the Good News Translation in relation to prophecy in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 607, 20, 32, 'church. In Pentecostal circles, there is a tradition that every prophecy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 607, 21, 32, 'must begin with, "Thus saith the Lord..." Now this verse tells us to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 607, 22, 32, 'very careful when saying that. Make sure God has actually said it. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 607, 23, 32, 'you are exhorting others, that''s alright; you don''t have to be as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 607, 24, 32, 'careful, because they know the advice is coming from you. But when you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 607, 25, 32, 'say, "Thus saith the Lord, I want you to…," you are speaking God''s word,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 607, 26, 32, 'and you have to be really sure that God has said it. In Jeremiah 23:31');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 607, 27, 32, 'we read, "''Behold I am against the prophets,'' declares the Lord, ''who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 607, 28, 32, 'use their tongues and declare, ''The Lord declares.''" These are the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 608, 1, 32, 'people who say, "The Lord says this…," even though it wasn''t what the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 608, 2, 32, 'Lord said. There''s a lot of that in Pentecostal, charismatic circles,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 608, 3, 32, 'because they don''t have the fear of God. It''s possible for us too to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 608, 4, 32, 'enter into the Pentecostal type of prophecy, thinking we have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 608, 5, 32, 'prophesy in this way; however, there are things the Lord has said that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 608, 6, 32, 'we can safely say. For example, we can say, "The Lord says, ''I give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 608, 7, 32, 'grace to the humble.''" That''s absolutely right, because it''s found in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 608, 8, 32, 'Scripture. Or we can say that He resists the proud. These examples are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 608, 9, 32, 'clear revelations of God in Scripture, but when we go into matters not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 608, 10, 32, 'written about in Scripture and try to give God''s word for a particular');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 608, 11, 32, 'time to a particular people, we have to be very humble in thinking that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 608, 12, 32, 'the Lord is speaking through us. Here we will get more and more light as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 608, 13, 32, 'we grow up to maturity. In my younger days, I''ve done it myself, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 608, 14, 32, 'that''s how it is when we are young; we like to think God is speaking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 608, 15, 32, 'through us. But as I''ve grown up, I''ve found more and more that the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 608, 16, 32, 'is against those people in Jeremiah who say, "Thus declares the Lord,"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 608, 17, 32, 'when they''re not sure the Lord has said it. In those cases, it''s better');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 608, 18, 32, 'to say, "Not as though God is speaking, but as though I am speaking..."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 608, 19, 32, 'That is safer. Then at least, we don''t enter into the condemnation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 608, 20, 32, 'mentioned here in Proverbs 30:6, "If you claim that He said something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 608, 21, 32, 'that He never said, He will reprimand you and show that you are a liar."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 608, 22, 32, 'Therefore in the area of prophecy, we must avoid the charismatic,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 608, 23, 32, 'Pentecostal tradition, which too easily claims that God has spoken when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 608, 24, 32, 'He has not.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 608, 25, 32, 'Two things I asked of You, Do not refuse me before I die: Keep deception');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 608, 26, 32, 'and lies far from me, Give me neither poverty nor riches; Feed me with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 608, 27, 32, 'the food that is my portion, That I not be full and deny You and say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 608, 28, 32, '"Who is the Lord?" Or that I not be in want and steal, And profane the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 609, 1, 32, 'name of my God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 609, 2, 32, 'Prov 30:7-9');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 609, 3, 32, 'This verse is very wonderful. Imagine you have never read this verse and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 609, 4, 32, 'God comes to you asking, "What are the two things you want?" What would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 609, 5, 32, 'be your immediate reply? This man asked for two things:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 609, 6, 32, 'He first asked for protection from telling lies: "Keep deception and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 609, 7, 32, 'lies far from me. Lord, help me never in my life to tell a lie!" He knew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 609, 8, 32, 'he needed help. He knew that he couldn''t do it on his own. He had to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 609, 9, 32, 'pray to God, "Keep me! I can''t keep myself. Keep me from telling a lie."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 609, 10, 32, 'In the same way, we can ask God to keep us from what we understand in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 609, 11, 32, 'the New Testament to be lying-hypocrisy. Hypocrisy is a form of lying. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 609, 12, 32, 'can lie without opening my mouth by giving a certain false impression.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 609, 13, 32, 'Lord, keep me! I cannot keep myself; my flesh has such a lust to tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 609, 14, 32, 'lies. It has such a lust to be a hypocrite. Please keep me, Lord! The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 609, 15, 32, 'number one thing I ask you for, if you will listen to my request, is to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 609, 16, 32, 'keep me from being a hypocrite and from giving a false impression that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 609, 17, 32, 'deceives others. Let me be an honest, upright person about whom you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 609, 18, 32, 'say like you said about Nathanael, "There is a man in whom there is no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 609, 19, 32, 'hypocrisy." What a wonderful testimony! None of us are perfect. No,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 609, 20, 32, 'perfection is still a long way off. But there was a man in whom Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 609, 21, 32, 'said there was no hypocrisy-Nathanael. We should covet his testimony,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 609, 22, 32, 'that Jesus could say that about us too. I''ve often thought of what Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 609, 23, 32, 'said to Nathanael, and I''ve prayed, "Lord, help me have such a testimony');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 609, 24, 32, 'on this earth." The people numbered in the 144,000 have this testimony;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 609, 25, 32, 'no guile is found in them. That was Agur''s number one request.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 609, 26, 32, 'Secondly, Agur prays, "Lord, don''t let me be too poor or too rich." Now,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 609, 27, 32, 'lots of people in the world pray, "Lord, don''t make me too poor." The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 609, 28, 32, 'world is full of people praying, "Oh God, please don''t let poverty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 610, 1, 32, 'strike my family." Have you ever heard of a man who said, "Lord, don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 610, 2, 32, 'let me become rich"? Have you heard someone pray, "Don''t let riches');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 610, 3, 32, 'strike my family, Lord. Don''t let me buy a winning lottery ticket,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 610, 4, 32, 'otherwise I''ll suddenly have more money than I know what to do with.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 610, 5, 32, 'Don''t let some rich uncle of mine die and leave me a large inheritance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 610, 6, 32, 'I won''t know what to do with it. Please, Lord, if they die, let them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 610, 7, 32, 'give their wealth to somebody else rather than to me"? Think of someone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 610, 8, 32, 'who prays in this way. Agur was a humble brother who was more stupid');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 610, 9, 32, 'than any man. And he had light on telling lies and the danger of wealth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 610, 10, 32, 'All because he was humble! God opened his blind eyes to see the danger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 610, 11, 32, 'of having too much money.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 610, 12, 32, 'Agur says, "If I get too much, or if I''m full, I might deny you and say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 610, 13, 32, '''Who is the Lord?''" Wealth makes us less dependent on God. You''ll always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 610, 14, 32, 'find that. James 2:5 tells us that God has chosen the poor of the world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 610, 15, 32, 'to be rich in faith, because when we have need, we have to turn to God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 610, 16, 32, 'The poor of the world don''t know when their money will run out; they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 610, 17, 32, 'have to really trust God. The rich person doesn''t need to depend on God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 610, 18, 32, 'in the same way. Whether it''s wealth of education, of money, of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 610, 19, 32, 'personality, of talents, of gifts, or of anything else, wealth has a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 610, 20, 32, 'tendency to make a man leave God. The wealth of self-righteousness made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 610, 21, 32, 'it harder for the Pharisees to come to God than for the prostitutes and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 610, 22, 32, 'thieves. There''s a danger in wealth we must beware of. If God has made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 610, 23, 32, 'us wealthy in intelligence, money, gifts, abilities, or personality,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 610, 24, 32, 'there''s nothing wrong in that, but we must realize we''re in fantastic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 610, 25, 32, 'danger; we need to humble ourselves and live in fear. Many of us have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 610, 26, 32, 'some type of wealth, and therefore we all need to live in fear.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 610, 27, 32, 'On the other hand, Agur writes, "Lord, if I''m too poor, I may steal and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 610, 28, 32, 'disgrace the name of my God." He also says, "Feed me with the food that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 611, 1, 32, 'is my portion." Likewise, Jesus taught us to pray, "Give us this day our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 611, 2, 32, 'daily bread." Not more than we need. However, in the New Testament, Paul');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 611, 3, 32, 'said in Philippians 4:12, "I have learned how to be poor and how to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 611, 4, 32, 'rich." He came to such a height in the New Covenant, and that is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 611, 5, 32, 'height we can also reach-we don''t have to pray the same Old Testament');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 611, 6, 32, 'prayer Agur prays in Proverbs 30:8. He says, "Lord, please give me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 611, 7, 32, 'money. If I become too poor, I may steal," but I can say, "Lord, even if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 611, 8, 32, 'I''m too poor, I won''t steal. I know how to live without that." I don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 611, 9, 32, 'even have to pray, "Lord, don''t make me too rich," because I can say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 611, 10, 32, '"Lord, if you make me too rich, I''ll know how to give that money away to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 611, 11, 32, 'somebody who needs it." That''s how Paul lived. He says, "I know how to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 611, 12, 32, 'handle poverty and prosperity. I know how to get along with little and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 611, 13, 32, 'know how to get along with much, because when I have much, I''ll know how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 611, 14, 32, 'to give it away." However, there are very few people who have reached');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 611, 15, 32, 'the level of the Apostle Paul. Until we reach there, it''s good for us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 611, 16, 32, 'ask God to keep us from too much wealth, lest we lose our sense of need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 611, 17, 32, 'for Him. Until we come to the place where we have grace to know how to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 611, 18, 32, 'handle that wealth properly, we can pray Agur''s prayer. We should not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 611, 19, 32, 'too quickly say we live in the New Covenant, and therefore don''t need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 611, 20, 32, 'live by Proverbs 30:4 but rather by Philippians 4:12. Not necessarily.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 611, 21, 32, 'Living according to Philippians 4:12 is not a matter of the age you live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 611, 22, 32, 'in, rather it''s a matter of experience. Even though we live two thousand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 611, 23, 32, 'years after the New Testament was written, many Christians are still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 611, 24, 32, 'living in the Old Covenant experientially. We shouldn''t make Paul''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 611, 25, 32, 'claim in Philippians 4 if we haven''t first come to have his same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 611, 26, 32, 'attitude about money. We can''t say, "I know how to handle prosperity,"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 611, 27, 32, 'unless we have the same freedom Paul had from the love of money. If we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 611, 28, 32, 'aren''t completely free from the love of money, we can''t say that we know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 612, 1, 32, 'how to handle prosperity, because we don''t know how to yet. Instead we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 612, 2, 32, 'need to ask God for more grace so that we don''t drift away from Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 612, 3, 32, 'through wealth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 612, 4, 32, 'Do not slander a slave to his master,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 612, 5, 32, 'Or he will curse you and you will be found guilty.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 612, 6, 32, 'Prov 30:10');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 612, 7, 32, 'There is a practical application for this verse in everyday life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 612, 8, 32, 'Basically, don''t be a busybody and don''t complain about someone to their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 612, 9, 32, 'master. There is also a spiritual application. In Romans 14:4, we read,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 612, 10, 32, '"Who are you to judge another man''s servant?" When we are thinking of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 612, 11, 32, 'judging another believer, remember this verse. If we become involved in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 612, 12, 32, 'other peoples'' matters, remember the warning from the verse: "Lest he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 612, 13, 32, 'curse you and you be found guilty." How can we be found guilty? We might');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 612, 14, 32, 'have formed an opinion without properly understanding all the facts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 612, 15, 32, 'Then, we go and complain to someone else about this person, only to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 612, 16, 32, 'later discover we had not known all of the details and were ourselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 612, 17, 32, 'foolish to make such a complaint before knowing all the facts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 612, 18, 32, 'There is a kind of man who curses his father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 612, 19, 32, 'And does not bless his mother.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 612, 20, 32, 'There is a kind who is pure in his own eyes,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 612, 21, 32, 'Yet is not washed from his filthiness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 612, 22, 32, 'There is a kind-oh how lofty are his eyes!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 612, 23, 32, 'And his eyelids are raised in arrogance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 612, 24, 32, 'There is a kind of man whose teeth are like swords');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 612, 25, 32, 'And his jaw teeth like knives,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 612, 26, 32, 'To devour the afflicted from the earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 612, 27, 32, 'And the needy from among men.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 612, 28, 32, 'Prov 30:11-14');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 613, 1, 32, 'These verses describe four kinds of people. The first is the kind of man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 613, 2, 32, 'who curses his father and does not bless his mother: he is an ungrateful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 613, 3, 32, 'man who does not appreciate all that his parents have done for him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 613, 4, 32, 'Notice there is both a sin of commission and a sin of omission in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 613, 5, 32, 'verse. We are familiar with sins of commission - when we sin in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 613, 6, 32, 'actions - but we cannot forget about sins of omission. Consider the Good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 613, 7, 32, 'News Translation: "There are people who curse their fathers and do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 613, 8, 32, 'show their appreciation for their mothers." The sin of commission is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 613, 9, 32, 'cursing our father, and the sin of omission is neglecting to show');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 613, 10, 32, 'appreciation for our mother. Not showing appreciation is also a sin! The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 613, 11, 32, 'man who does not show appreciation for his mother is put into the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 613, 12, 32, 'category as the man who curses his father. He does not curse her, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 613, 13, 32, 'only remains quiet, but he is just as guilty. You ask, "How can that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 613, 14, 32, 'be?" It''s because this man commits a sin of omission, not doing what he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 613, 15, 32, 'should do. Let us not fall into either category.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 613, 16, 32, 'The second category of men is made up of those who are pure in their own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 613, 17, 32, 'eyes, meaning the self-righteous, yet are not washed of their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 613, 18, 32, 'filthiness. These men do not have light on themselves and have high');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 613, 19, 32, 'thoughts about their spirituality. Those who talk about the New and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 613, 20, 32, 'Living Way are especially at risk of being pure in their own eyes. In 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 613, 21, 32, 'John 1:8, it says, "If we say we have no sin, we deceive ourselves." We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 613, 22, 32, 'deceive ourselves if we say we have no sin, therefore it''s dangerous to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 613, 23, 32, 'be pure in our own eyes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 613, 24, 32, 'The third kind of person mentioned in this proverb is the proud man:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 613, 25, 32, '"How lofty are his eyes." Pride begins in the heart and gradually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 613, 26, 32, 'manifests itself in one''s face and eyes. There''s a haughtiness and an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 613, 27, 32, 'arrogance in the eyes of proud people. Humility will also finally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 613, 28, 32, 'manifest itself in the eyes. In this verse, the man''s eyelids are raised');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 614, 1, 32, 'in arrogance. You can make out whether there''s pride in someone''s heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 614, 2, 32, 'by the way they look. That''s what this proverb teaches us. Pride cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 614, 3, 32, 'be hidden! It is manifest even when you don''t notice it yourself; it''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 614, 4, 32, 'obvious to other people in your appearance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 614, 5, 32, 'The fourth type of man mentioned here takes advantage of those who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 614, 6, 32, 'weaker than him: "[His] teeth are like swords, and his jaw teeth like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 614, 7, 32, 'knives, to devour the afflicted from the earth and the needy from among');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 614, 8, 32, 'men."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 614, 9, 32, 'Notice all four evil types of people mentioned here. First of all,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 614, 10, 32, 'someone who is ungrateful to his earthly parents, who speaks rudely to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 614, 11, 32, 'his father, who does not show his appreciation to his mother, is an evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 614, 12, 32, 'person. Those who are self-righteous are also evil, even though they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 614, 13, 32, 'pure in their own eyes. Thirdly, the proud, who lift up their eyes in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 614, 14, 32, 'arrogance, are also evil. And finally, the fourth group consists of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 614, 15, 32, 'those who are hard and unmerciful toward those who are helpless, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 614, 16, 32, 'they are also evil. Their lack of mercy can be seen in teeth that are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 614, 17, 32, 'like knives, ready to judge someone for the wrong they have done, to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 614, 18, 32, 'harsh and hard in judgment, without mercy. In all, there are four types');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 614, 19, 32, 'of people who are particularly evil: the ungrateful, the self-righteous,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 614, 20, 32, 'the proud, and the unmerciful. Woe unto us if we ever fall into these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 614, 21, 32, 'categories.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 614, 22, 32, 'The leech has two daughters,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 614, 23, 32, '"Give," "Give."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 614, 24, 32, 'There are three things that will not be satisfied.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 614, 25, 32, 'Four things that never say, "Enough":');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 614, 26, 32, 'Sheol, and the barren womb,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 614, 27, 32, 'Earth that is never satisfied with water,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 614, 28, 32, 'And fire that never says, "Enough."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 615, 1, 32, 'Prov 30:15-16');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 615, 2, 32, 'A leech is an animal that latches onto your legs when you go through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 615, 3, 32, 'dirty water and then sucks your blood. Here Agur is speaking about a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 615, 4, 32, 'covetous attitude. The attitude of wanting only to receive carries a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 615, 5, 32, 'curse, because Jesus said it is more blessed to give than to receive.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 615, 6, 32, 'The leech has two daughters with the names, "Give Me," "Give Me." The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 615, 7, 32, 'leech has only two daughters, but Adam has millions with this same name.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 615, 8, 32, 'When Agur writes, "There are three things that will not be satisfied,"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 615, 9, 32, 'he makes four comparisons to the selfishness of wanting to receive and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 615, 10, 32, 'receive and receive from others. These four never say, "Enough":');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 615, 11, 32, 'The covetous person with the lust to receive constantly demands, "Give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 615, 12, 32, 'Me." When we have this heart towards others, it may not be gifts or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 615, 13, 32, 'money that we want, but we want other people to serve us, and we want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 615, 14, 32, 'other people to respect us. Our demand of others could be, "Give me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 615, 15, 32, 'respect. I''m offended if you don''t give me respect. Give me respect,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 615, 16, 32, 'give me honor, give me consideration, give me pity for all the things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 615, 17, 32, 'I''m going through in my life. Give me, give me, give me, give me!" The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 615, 18, 32, 'leech has two daughters who are never satisfied. How blessed it is to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 615, 19, 32, 'free from this relentless lust through the cross where we find salvation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 615, 20, 32, 'in Jesus, who has freed us from making demands of other people. Instead,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 615, 21, 32, 'we find everything we need from God: "My God will supply all your need"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 615, 22, 32, '(Philippians 4:19). God is not only able to satisfy our financial,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 615, 23, 32, 'emotional, and mental needs, but every other need as well. That''s why we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 615, 24, 32, 'don''t need to have a "Give Me" attitude toward human beings. We don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 615, 25, 32, 'want their pity, sympathy, money, respect, honor, or any other wretched');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 615, 26, 32, 'thing, because God supplies all we need.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 615, 27, 32, 'The eye that mocks a father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 615, 28, 32, 'And scorns a mother,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 616, 1, 32, 'The ravens of the valley will pick it out,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 616, 2, 32, 'And the young eagles will eat it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 616, 3, 32, 'Prov 30:17');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 616, 4, 32, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 616, 5, 32, 'The eye that mocks a father and despises a mother''s instructions will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 616, 6, 32, 'plucked out by ravens of the valley and eaten by vultures.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 616, 7, 32, 'Prov 30:17, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 616, 8, 32, 'Here is another word about our attitude toward our parents. It''s amazing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 616, 9, 32, 'to see how much the book of Proverbs has to say about the topic. Solomon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 616, 10, 32, 'refers to the subject frequently in his chapters, and Agur, who has only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 616, 11, 32, 'one chapter, repeats again, "The eye that mocks a father," which means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 616, 12, 32, 'to make fun of your father, perhaps for some peculiarity he has in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 616, 13, 32, 'old age. Likewise, you may notice some peculiarity in your mother and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 616, 14, 32, 'scorn her for it. In both instances, you are cursed, just as Ham, Noah''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 616, 15, 32, 'son, was cursed, "The ravens of the valley will pick it out and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 616, 16, 32, 'young eagles will eat it."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 616, 17, 32, 'The one who scorns his parents deserves to have his eyes picked out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 616, 18, 32, 'because he uses those eyes to scorn his father and his mother, instead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 616, 19, 32, 'of being grateful for all they have suffered while bringing him up. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 616, 20, 32, 'despises them for something he perceives to be defective in them and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 616, 21, 32, 'scorns them because he considers himself to be so much smarter, so much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 616, 22, 32, 'more clever, and so much more capable. The word of God says here that he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 616, 23, 32, 'deserves to have his eyes plucked out by the wild ravens.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 616, 24, 32, 'There are three things which are too wonderful for me, Four which I do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 616, 25, 32, 'not understand: The way of an eagle in the sky, The way of a serpent on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 616, 26, 32, 'a rock, The way of a ship in the middle of the sea, And the way of a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 616, 27, 32, 'with a maid. This is the way of an adulterous woman: She eats and wipes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 616, 28, 32, 'her mouth, And says, "I have done no wrong."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 617, 1, 32, 'Prov 30:18-20');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 617, 2, 32, 'Here we have another group of four things. I want you to notice how all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 617, 3, 32, 'of them, the first three in particular, do not leave any trace behind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 617, 4, 32, 'them. The eagle flies through the sky, but it leaves no mark behind it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 617, 5, 32, 'A bike makes tracks in the mud, but an eagle does not leave a trace in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 617, 6, 32, 'the sky. Second, a serpent glides across a rock, but when you look at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 617, 7, 32, 'the rock you would never know a serpent has gone over it, because it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 617, 8, 32, 'also has left no trace. Thirdly, a ship will make some wake in the sea,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 617, 9, 32, 'but if you look a few minutes later, there''s no hint that the ship has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 617, 10, 32, 'gone through. It moves, and the path vanishes almost immediately.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 617, 11, 32, 'An eagle in the sky, a serpent on the rock, and a ship in the sea -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 617, 12, 32, 'these three are exactly the same as a man and a woman in their mutual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 617, 13, 32, 'relationship. Agur is referencing the secret relationships between men');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 617, 14, 32, 'and women that are not moral or upright. They leave no trace behind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 617, 15, 32, 'them; all of their interactions are hidden. It might be concealed from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 617, 16, 32, 'the eyes of men, but God sees it all; nothing can be hidden from Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 617, 17, 32, 'Agur is amazed by man''s stupidity when it comes to women. He wonders how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 617, 18, 32, 'a man can be so stupid as to fall for a woman''s beauty or her enticing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 617, 19, 32, 'words and forget about the fear of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 617, 20, 32, 'In the next verse, Agur compares these four to an adulterous woman. She');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 617, 21, 32, 'eats, wipes her mouth, and says, "I have done no wrong." She leaves no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 617, 22, 32, 'trace of what she has done. She commits adultery, then goes to have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 617, 23, 32, 'bath and says, "I''m alright." She tries to cover everything up, but the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 617, 24, 32, 'word of God says all fornicators and adulterers will be judged by God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 617, 25, 32, 'one day (Hebrews 13:4). The vast majority of humanity will be judged');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 617, 26, 32, 'immediately based only on that one verse. It tells us to be extremely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 617, 27, 32, 'careful of allowing love for someone of the opposite sex to get stirred');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 617, 28, 32, 'up in our hearts without first ensuring it is under our control. Avoid');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 618, 1, 32, 'the way of a man with a maid. Do not allow those emotions to get out of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 618, 2, 32, 'hand so that you do things you later have to cover up and hide. Keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 618, 3, 32, 'your passions under control. Agur says, "It amazes me how foolishly men');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 618, 4, 32, 'allow their emotions to rule them in this area." We should take this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 618, 5, 32, 'warning seriously, especially young men.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 618, 6, 32, 'For us, the New Testament standard is much higher. We are not even to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 618, 7, 32, 'look and lust. Here again, we can apply the same principle. A man looks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 618, 8, 32, 'lustfully but leaves no trace, just like an eagle in the sky. He''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 618, 9, 32, 'sinned, but it looks as though he hasn''t! There''s no evidence of it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 618, 10, 32, 'anywhere, but God has seen and recorded it. Those who live in the fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 618, 11, 32, 'of God will wholeheartedly seek to be free of this sin as soon as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 618, 12, 32, 'possible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 618, 13, 32, 'There are four things that the earth itself cannot tolerate: a slave who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 618, 14, 32, 'becomes a king, a fool who has all he wants to eat, a hateful woman who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 618, 15, 32, 'gets married, and a servant woman who takes the place of her mistress.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 618, 16, 32, 'Prov 30:21-23, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 618, 17, 32, 'These four get what they don''t deserve. A slave doesn''t deserve to be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 618, 18, 32, 'king, and when he becomes a king, he does not remain humble. Instead, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 618, 19, 32, 'becomes arrogant. A fool gets all that he wants to eat and also becomes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 618, 20, 32, 'proud of it. Likewise, a hateful woman who finally gets married becomes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 618, 21, 32, 'a real nuisance to her husband. Finally, a girl who grows up as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 618, 22, 32, 'servant but takes the place of her mistress does not deserve the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 618, 23, 32, 'position either. We can say that this is the condition of many who have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 618, 24, 32, 'received the grace of God as well. The grace of God is something we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 618, 25, 32, 'received that we don''t deserve. The slave has become a king; the fool');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 618, 26, 32, '(which is what we were) has now been given more than enough to eat; the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 618, 27, 32, 'hateful woman and the servant girl now have the chance to be the bride');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 618, 28, 32, 'of Christ. When someone reaches this place, it''s so difficult to remain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 619, 1, 32, 'humble. That is the reason so many people who have received grace have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 619, 2, 32, 'abused it and forgotten that, once upon a time, they were slaves, fools,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 619, 3, 32, 'servant women, bitter and hateful people until Jesus picked them up. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 619, 4, 32, 'is good for us to remember our past condition. This passage refers to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 619, 5, 32, 'those who have forgotten their past condition after entering into some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 619, 6, 32, 'area of God''s goodness. It warns us to avoid the same mistake.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 619, 7, 32, 'There are four things that are small but unusually wise: Ants: they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 619, 8, 32, 'aren''t strong, but store up food for the winter. Cliff badgers: delicate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 619, 9, 32, 'little animals who protect themselves by living among the rocks. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 619, 10, 32, 'locusts: though they have no leader, they stay together in swarms. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 619, 11, 32, 'lizards: they are easy to catch and kill, yet are found even in king''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 619, 12, 32, 'palaces!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 619, 13, 32, 'Prov 30:24-28, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 619, 14, 32, 'In contrast to the four big things mentioned in verses 21-23, Agur now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 619, 15, 32, 'speaks about four small things. We can discover four wonderful New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 619, 16, 32, 'Testament truths from these Old Testament pictures.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 619, 17, 32, '1. The ant represents those who prepare for the future (that is for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 619, 18, 32, 'eternity) and realize that this world is not their home. The fool saves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 619, 19, 32, 'up only for this world, but these save up for eternity. That''s the first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 619, 20, 32, 'lesson-the ant is wise and saves up for the future. They are small, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 619, 21, 32, 'they are wise. Go to the ant and learn wisdom: store up for the future.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 619, 22, 32, 'The ant''s future is in winter, but our future is in eternity. We store');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 619, 23, 32, 'up for eternity by using our energy, time, money, resources, everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 619, 24, 32, 'in such a way that we lay up treasure for the future. That''s something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 619, 25, 32, 'we can learn from the ant.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 619, 26, 32, '2. The rock badger (or marmot) is so small it can hide in the cleft of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 619, 27, 32, 'rock. Then a lion can''t reach it, because the lion''s paw is too large to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 619, 28, 32, 'fit into the rock. The rock is a picture of Christ. The badger''s small');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 620, 1, 32, 'size enables it to hide in the rock, and it builds its home in the rock.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 620, 2, 32, 'That''s what Jesus told us: "He who hears my word and does it has built');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 620, 3, 32, 'his house on the rock" (Matthew 7:24). The wise man builds his house on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 620, 4, 32, 'the rock, which is a picture of obedience to the word of God. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 620, 5, 32, 'little badger knows when the rain comes and washes away the sand, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 620, 6, 32, 'won''t touch his house because his house is built on the rock.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 620, 7, 32, '3. The locusts: They don''t have a leader, which is a picture of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 620, 8, 32, 'church, because we don''t have an earthly leader either. Jesus is our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 620, 9, 32, 'only leader, and He''s not on earth, He''s in heaven. Yet even though');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 620, 10, 32, 'these locusts don''t have a leader, they know how to stay united. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 620, 11, 32, 'don''t fight with each other. When they attack a field, they go together.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 620, 12, 32, 'They don''t waste time fighting amongst themselves like many believers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 620, 13, 32, 'do. They know they should eat the whole crop, and they stay together.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 620, 14, 32, 'They know their strength comes from being united. The locusts have the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 620, 15, 32, 'wisdom to be united, but alas, many believers do not! Even some husbands');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 620, 16, 32, 'and wives don''t understand they are stronger if they are united.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 620, 17, 32, 'Believers don''t realize our strength against Satan comes from being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 620, 18, 32, 'united. That''s the third lesson of wisdom God has for us, and we learn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 620, 19, 32, 'it from the locusts. The three animals listed so far - the ant, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 620, 20, 32, 'badger, and the locusts - all go out in ranks, which indicates that each');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 620, 21, 32, 'one knows its position, just as in an army. They know their position');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 620, 22, 32, 'like aircrafts flying in formation do. It''s wonderful when everyone in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 620, 23, 32, 'church knows his place and accepts it joyfully in unity with all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 620, 24, 32, 'others, without jealousy and without competition. That''s the wisdom we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 620, 25, 32, 'can learn from locusts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 620, 26, 32, '4. The lizard: Agur reminds us that you can catch and kill a lizard with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 620, 27, 32, 'your hands easily, yet you find them in kings'' palaces. The lizard can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 620, 28, 32, 'go where you cannot because of its small size. We too can reach the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 621, 1, 32, 'king''s palace if we are small in our own thoughts. Big people find it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 621, 2, 32, 'difficult to get there. Similarly, a crocodile is really just a big');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 621, 3, 32, 'lizard, but you can''t find them in kings'' palaces because they''re too');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 621, 4, 32, 'big. Lizards can get into palaces because they''re small, and we also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 621, 5, 32, 'will find it easier to get into kings'' palaces when we are small in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 621, 6, 32, 'own thoughts. A lizard clinging to the ceiling, defying gravity, is an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 621, 7, 32, 'amazing picture of the power of faith. We can also live without falling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 621, 8, 32, 'when we have faith to defy the law of sin and death and hold onto the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 621, 9, 32, 'power God has given to us without anything else in our hands.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 621, 10, 32, 'There are four things that are impressive to watch as they walk: lions,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 621, 11, 32, 'strongest of all animals and afraid of none; goats, strutting roosters,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 621, 12, 32, 'and kings in front of their people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 621, 13, 32, 'Prov 30:29-31, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 621, 14, 32, 'Someone who goes in front of his people is a forerunner, and it''s as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 621, 15, 32, 'beautiful and impressive to see someone go ahead of his people. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 621, 16, 32, 'like a lion, majestic and powerful, prowling in the forest, or a peacock');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 621, 17, 32, 'with its feathers on display, or a goat climbing up rocky crags. Such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 621, 18, 32, 'person is like a king, walking in front of his people. Fathers can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 621, 19, 32, 'like that in their homes, in front of their wives and children, leading');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 621, 20, 32, 'them. Forerunners are as worthy of admiration as lions and peacocks are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 621, 21, 32, 'in their majesty.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 621, 22, 32, 'If you have been foolish in exalting yourself Or if you have plotted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 621, 23, 32, 'evil, put your hand on your mouth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 621, 24, 32, 'Prov 30:32');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 621, 25, 32, 'If you have been foolish in exalting yourself, or if you have plotted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 621, 26, 32, 'evil, put your hand over your mouth and feel ashamed. This verse speaks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 621, 27, 32, 'of two ways to be foolish: you can be proud or you can harbor an evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 621, 28, 32, 'attitude toward other believers. Then you should put your hand on your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 622, 1, 32, 'mouth and feel ashamed of yourself! You should feel ashamed of yourself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 622, 2, 32, 'that you''ve been stupid enough to be proud and to have an evil attitude');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 622, 3, 32, 'toward another human being! There''s nothing to be proud of there. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 622, 4, 32, 'should be ashamed of yourself. Agur had light on these things. He speaks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 622, 5, 32, 'about humility again and again.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 622, 6, 32, 'For the churning of milk produces butter,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 622, 7, 32, 'And pressing the nose brings forth blood;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 622, 8, 32, 'So the churning of anger produces strife.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 622, 9, 32, 'Prov 30:33');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 622, 10, 32, 'He concludes with anger: in the same way that churning milk produces');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 622, 11, 32, 'butter and ringing the nose produces blood, if you churn with anger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 622, 12, 32, 'inside, strife will ultimately result. In other words, if you let milk');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 622, 13, 32, 'sit, it won''t produce butter. It only becomes butter when you churn it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 622, 14, 32, 'over and over and over again. In the same way, if you keep ringing your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 622, 15, 32, 'nose, it will produce blood. Therefore, strife only comes because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 622, 16, 32, 'someone became angry, upset, or irritated with someone and did not rid');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 622, 17, 32, 'themselves of that anger or irritation immediately. Similarly, if they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 622, 18, 32, 'were offended by someone else and did not set aside the feeling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 622, 19, 32, 'immediately, strife would result because of the churning in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 622, 20, 32, 'spirit. Do you know what churning is? It''s to meditate on something, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 622, 21, 32, 'think about it again and again, to toss it back and forth in your mind.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 622, 22, 32, 'Just as you take milk and churn it into butter, you can take anger and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 622, 23, 32, 'roll it over in your mind, thinking about it again and again. Tomorrow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 622, 24, 32, 'you''ll think about the same thing again - maybe what some person did or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 622, 25, 32, 'what some person said. You churn it and churn it and churn it and churn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 622, 26, 32, 'it, and one day, as surely as butter will come out of churned milk,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 622, 27, 32, 'strife will break out between you and that person. It''s guaranteed, so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 622, 28, 32, 'don''t be such a fool. Don''t churn with anger! We have a more excellent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 623, 1, 32, 'way in the New Testament: to die! Bear the dying of Christ in your life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 623, 2, 32, 'so that you can overcome anger, not only strife, but anger as well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 623, 3, 33, 'Chapter 31 Chapter 31');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 623, 4, 33, 'The words of King Lemuel, the oracle that his mother taught him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 623, 5, 33, 'Prov 31:1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 623, 6, 33, 'In the history of Israel, as far as we know, there has been no such king');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 623, 7, 33, 'named Lemuel. All the names of the kings of Israel are recorded in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 623, 8, 33, 'books of Kings and Chronicles right from Saul down to the last king. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 623, 9, 33, 'you look at that list, there is no king called Lemuel. And yet the word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 623, 10, 33, '"El" is Hebrew for "God". So, he must have been a Jewish man; he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 623, 11, 33, 'couldn''t have been outside of Israel. It''s likely, perhaps, that this is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 623, 12, 33, 'another name for Solomon, because the name means "with God" or "devoted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 623, 13, 33, 'to God".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 623, 14, 33, 'If King Lemuel is Solomon, then who was his mother? Do you know?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 623, 15, 33, 'Bathsheba, the woman who was first the wife of Uriah, and later whom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 623, 16, 33, 'David committed adultery with. After committing adultery with her, David');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 623, 17, 33, 'murdered her husband and married her. The first son that she conceived');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 623, 18, 33, 'with David died as God''s judgment. When she was expecting a second baby,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 623, 19, 33, 'she must have really feared whether God would judge her again. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 623, 20, 33, 'likely that a spiritual transformation came across her life, even though');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 623, 21, 33, 'she had fallen so deeply. If Lemuel is another name for Solomon, here is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 623, 22, 33, 'a chapter in the Bible written with the words of Bathsheba. It''s amazing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 623, 23, 33, 'what grace can do to a fallen, sinful woman like that. In Chapter 4, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 623, 24, 33, 'saw what Solomon''s father taught him, and now he writes what his mother');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 623, 25, 33, 'taught him. Just like Timothy''s mother taught him the word of God, here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 623, 26, 33, 'we see Solomon received instruction not only from David, but also from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 623, 27, 33, 'Bathsheba, his mother. We see something of Bathsheba''s humility here.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 623, 28, 33, 'It''s a wonderful picture of a mother who teaches her son many things:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 624, 1, 33, 'how to rule as a king and how to choose a wife. Would that all mothers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 624, 2, 33, 'were like this.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 624, 3, 33, 'What, O my son?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 624, 4, 33, 'And what, O son of my womb?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 624, 5, 33, 'And what, O son of my vows?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 624, 6, 33, 'Prov 31:2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 624, 7, 33, 'Here was Bathsheba''s son who was born in answer to prayer - a son whom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 624, 8, 33, 'she had dedicated to the Lord from the time that she conceived him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 624, 9, 33, 'which is what we should do with all our children. What does she say?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 624, 10, 33, '"What? What? What?" Three times. In other words, she says, "I don''t know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 624, 11, 33, 'what to say. I lack wisdom." It''s wonderful that the book of Proverbs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 624, 12, 33, 'closes with Agur and Bathsheba, both of them saying, "I don''t know. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 624, 13, 33, 'have no wisdom. What shall I advise you, my son?" That''s the reason why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 624, 14, 33, 'their words have been inspired by the Holy Spirit. They recognized their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 624, 15, 33, 'lack. Think of a mother who said, "My son, I just don''t know how to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 624, 16, 33, 'teach you," and she sought God for wisdom, and God gave her such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 624, 17, 33, 'tremendous wisdom that it''s recorded in Scripture. Amazing. "If any man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 624, 18, 33, 'lack wisdom, let him ask of God," (James 1:5). "What? What? What shall I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 624, 19, 33, 'say? I don''t know!" Then she got wisdom from God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 624, 20, 33, 'Don''t give your strength to women,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 624, 21, 33, 'Or your ways to that which destroys kings.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 624, 22, 33, 'Prov 31:3');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 624, 23, 33, 'Be careful of women - that''s the first warning! What a prophetic warning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 624, 24, 33, 'to her son! The sad thing is her son did not listen to this warning for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 624, 25, 33, 'very long. He listened to it for a little while in his life, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 624, 26, 33, 'afterward fell in the very area which his mother had warned him of first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 624, 27, 33, 'of all!! That''s a warning for children to take seriously what your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 624, 28, 33, 'parents tell you. Don''t take it lightly. That may be the very area');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 625, 1, 33, 'where, if you''re not careful, you''re in danger of falling. Don''t give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 625, 2, 33, 'your strength to women. If only Solomon had taken this seriously. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 625, 3, 33, 'he wrote the book of Proverbs, he was taking it seriously. He thought he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 625, 4, 33, 'would take it seriously all his life, but he drifted away. This is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 625, 5, 33, 'warning for all of us: a man like Solomon can write such a book and then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 625, 6, 33, 'fall away into the very sins which he was trying to warn other people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 625, 7, 33, 'about!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 625, 8, 33, 'It is not for kings, O Lemuel,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 625, 9, 33, 'It is not for kings to drink wine,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 625, 10, 33, 'Or for rulers to desire strong drink,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 625, 11, 33, 'Prov 31:4');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 625, 12, 33, 'She was basically saying, "Let other people drink wine, but you control');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 625, 13, 33, 'yourself." He did not obey this exhortation either. In fact, as you read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 625, 14, 33, 'through this chapter, you find that Solomon did not obey the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 625, 15, 33, 'exhortations of his mother at all. He wrote it down, but he didn''t take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 625, 16, 33, 'it seriously later on in his life. That''s a sad thing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 625, 17, 33, 'For they will drink and forget what is decreed,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 625, 18, 33, 'And pervert the rights of all the afflicted.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 625, 19, 33, 'Give strong drink to him who is perishing,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 625, 20, 33, 'And wine to him whose life is bitter.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 625, 21, 33, 'Let him drink and forget his poverty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 625, 22, 33, 'And remember his trouble no more.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 625, 23, 33, 'Open your mouth for the mute,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 625, 24, 33, 'For the rights of all the unfortunate.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 625, 25, 33, 'Open your mouth, judge righteously,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 625, 26, 33, 'And defend the rights of the afflicted and needy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 625, 27, 33, 'Prov 31:5-9');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 625, 28, 33, 'This teaches us how serious it is to pass an unrighteous judgment on an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 626, 1, 33, 'innocent person. It''s a serious crime. This puts a great fear upon us as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 626, 2, 33, 'fathers and wherever we have responsibility in our offices or in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 626, 3, 33, 'church, that we should not be unrighteous or be so drunk with the wine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 626, 4, 33, 'of this world that we become unrighteous. We can apply this to the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 626, 5, 33, 'Testament wine of worldliness that can make us lose our sense of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 626, 6, 33, 'discernment. Our faculties lack discernment after drinking the wine of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 626, 7, 33, 'this world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 626, 8, 33, 'Then it says instead of getting drunk, speak up for the poor and needy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 626, 9, 33, 'This is a wonderful exhortation which we''ve seen before in the book of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 626, 10, 33, 'Proverbs: Open your mouth for the dumb. Be on the side of the weak.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 626, 11, 33, 'Support those who are weak and helpless, and stand up for the rights of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 626, 12, 33, 'those who are unfortunate. Fight for their rights if you are a leader.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 626, 13, 33, '"Open your mouth, judge righteously." When you see some poor, helpless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 626, 14, 33, 'person being taken advantage of, that''s not the time to keep quiet. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 626, 15, 33, 'says, "Defend the rights of the afflicted and the needy." When I think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 626, 16, 33, 'of the afflicted and the needy, I think of all the poor, sincere');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 626, 17, 33, 'believers suffering under the yolk of ungodly priests, pastors, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 626, 18, 33, 'bishops in so many denominations. It''s our responsibility to speak up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 626, 19, 33, 'for them and not be diplomatic. We have to stand up for the rights of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 626, 20, 33, 'those who are being oppressed by ungodly, so-called Christian leaders.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 626, 21, 33, 'Open your mouth and speak up for them. Those are her first exhortations');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 626, 22, 33, 'for Solomon.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 626, 23, 33, 'Then comes this tremendous passage in verses 10-31 where Bathsheba says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 626, 24, 33, 'to Solomon, "Now I''ll tell you how to choose a wife." Solomon did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 626, 25, 33, 'obey this either. He didn''t obey, as far as I can see, one single thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 626, 26, 33, 'in this whole chapter. It''s a sad thing. He took it seriously in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 626, 27, 33, 'beginning (otherwise, he wouldn''t have even written it down), but he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 626, 28, 33, 'drifted away from it. And as we come to the end of our study on the book');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 627, 1, 33, 'of Proverbs, we can think we''re wise. But let''s remember this - the man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 627, 2, 33, 'who wrote this book fell away finally. If that doesn''t put a fear in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 627, 3, 33, 'hearts, I don''t know what will. "Let him who thinks he stands, take heed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 627, 4, 33, 'lest he fall" (1 Corinthians 10:12).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 627, 5, 33, 'Verses 10-31 are advice to all young brothers on the type of wife you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 627, 6, 33, 'should choose. It''s also advice to all sisters, both young and old, on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 627, 7, 33, 'the type of woman you should be. The twenty-two verses in this passage');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 627, 8, 33, 'are an acrostic poem, each beginning with a different letter of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 627, 9, 33, 'Hebrew alphabet. The reason it was written like that is so that it could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 627, 10, 33, 'be memorized more easily. This way young people would remember, "This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 627, 11, 33, 'the type of woman I must look for in a wife."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 627, 12, 33, 'Who can find a virtuous woman?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 627, 13, 33, 'For her price is far above rubies.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 627, 14, 33, 'Prov 31:10, KJV');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 627, 15, 33, 'The first thing spoken about is that she is a virtuous woman. It doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 627, 16, 33, 'speak about her talents or her education, whether she''s a graduate or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 627, 17, 33, 'not, or her capabilities. No. A woman of virtue. Look for that. Don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 627, 18, 33, 'look for capabilities and abilities and talents. It''s not easy to find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 627, 19, 33, 'such a wife. There are not many. Don''t think there are many that we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 627, 20, 33, 'just pick and choose from. There are very few. How hard it is to find a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 627, 21, 33, 'wife like that. "Her worth is far above jewels." That means you''ll be an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 627, 22, 33, 'extremely wealthy man if you get such a wife. That''s what it says.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 627, 23, 33, 'The heart of her husband trusts in her,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 627, 24, 33, 'And he will have no lack of gain.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 627, 25, 33, 'Prov 31:11');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 627, 26, 33, 'The heart of a man safely trusts in her. He has full confidence in such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 627, 27, 33, 'a woman of virtue and character, even if she is not very educated,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 627, 28, 33, 'capable or clever. Don''t be such an idiot to go for a woman just because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 628, 1, 33, 'she''s capable, talented, educated and clever. "She''s musically minded."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 628, 2, 33, 'Oh wonderful! It''s stupidity to think that has any value in God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 628, 3, 33, 'kingdom. Look for virtue and character! Those are most important. Such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 628, 4, 33, 'husband is a lucky man. He''s a rich man. It says, "He will have no lack');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 628, 5, 33, 'of gain", which means he is so rich since he has such a wife! He doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 628, 6, 33, 'need a dowry or any stupid thing like that. When people ask for a dowry,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 628, 7, 33, 'it''s because they feel they got a pretty cheap woman, so they have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 628, 8, 33, 'make up for it with money. Don''t be so stupid to ask for money. Get the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 628, 9, 33, 'money in the woman! Get a woman of virtue. Then you won''t need any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 628, 10, 33, 'dowry. She''s the dowry herself. Another translation says, "She never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 628, 11, 33, 'lets her husband down." That''s the meaning here. She never lets her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 628, 12, 33, 'husband down, therefore the heart of her husband can trust in her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 628, 13, 33, 'completely. Her husband can always stand by her.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 628, 14, 33, 'She does him good and not evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 628, 15, 33, 'All the days of her life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 628, 16, 33, 'Prov 31:12');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 628, 17, 33, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 628, 18, 33, 'She will not hinder him but help him all her life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 628, 19, 33, 'Prov 31:12, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 628, 20, 33, 'She only does him good. She never lets him down. It says about Jesus in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 628, 21, 33, 'Acts 10:38 that he went about doing good. Here''s a woman who goes about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 628, 22, 33, 'doing only good! Not evil. And she does this not just for one or two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 628, 23, 33, 'days, but all the days of her life - consistently. Her first love never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 628, 24, 33, 'wanes or decreases. She continuously, consistently does good to her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 628, 25, 33, 'husband till the end of her life. Don''t you think such a husband is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 628, 26, 33, 'rich man? Of course he is.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 628, 27, 33, 'The Living Bible says that she will not hinder her husband. A woman can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 628, 28, 33, 'be a hindrance to her husband''s job, life and ministry. But here is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 629, 1, 33, 'woman who is a help, just like Eve was created to be a helpmeet. Think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 629, 2, 33, 'of a woman like that. You can understand why Bathsheba said it''s hard to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 629, 3, 33, 'find such a woman, but we should look for one like this. If necessary,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 629, 4, 33, 'wait. Don''t be in such a hurry and marry the wrong one. One who is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 629, 5, 33, 'help means one who adjusts her life according to her husband''s calling.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 629, 6, 33, 'That''s very difficult for a woman because when she gets married, she has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 629, 7, 33, 'to alter her whole way of life to adjust to her husband''s job and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 629, 8, 33, 'calling in life. Not many women can do that. Many women still go along');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 629, 9, 33, 'in their own way even after they get married. But it''s a blessed woman');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 629, 10, 33, 'who knows how to adjust according to her husband''s way of life, whether');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 629, 11, 33, 'her husband is poor or rich.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 629, 12, 33, 'She looks for wool and flax');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 629, 13, 33, 'And works with her hands in delight.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 629, 14, 33, 'Prov 31:13');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 629, 15, 33, 'The first thing it says after the opening general statements about her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 629, 16, 33, 'is that she uses her hands. It''s a wise man who looks at the hands and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 629, 17, 33, 'not the face. All the stupid people in the world look at a woman''s face,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 629, 18, 33, 'but the word of God says to look at a woman''s hands! It says she works');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 629, 19, 33, 'with wool and flax. So here''s a woman who knows how to stitch clothes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 629, 20, 33, 'That''s a good thing for mothers to teach their daughters. And it says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 629, 21, 33, '"She works with delight!" That means she''s not grudging and complaining');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 629, 22, 33, '- "Oh I have to do this and do this." No. It''s a joyful working with her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 629, 23, 33, 'hands. Look for a woman who knows how to work with her hands and how to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 629, 24, 33, 'do it joyfully! Don''t look for a woman who is grumbling and complaining');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 629, 25, 33, 'that she has to do so much for her husband and children. Look for one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 629, 26, 33, 'who works with delight. It''s hard to find, but pray that God will give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 629, 27, 33, 'you such a wife.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 629, 28, 33, 'She is like merchant ships;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 630, 1, 33, 'She brings her food from afar.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 630, 2, 33, 'Prov 31:14');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 630, 3, 33, 'This speaks again about her hands, but this time she is involved in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 630, 4, 33, 'cooking. This is the second thing mothers have to teach their daughters.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 630, 5, 33, 'This passage is very practical. It''s not talking about bible knowledge,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 630, 6, 33, 'saying that she can explain the New and Living Way and all that. Foolish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 630, 7, 33, 'young men go around looking for women like that. God doesn''t call a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 630, 8, 33, 'woman to be a bible teacher. It''s foolish to look for a woman based on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 630, 9, 33, 'her ability to explain doctrine. That is the height of stupidity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 630, 10, 33, 'Unfortunately, there are a lot of stupid men like that. But here it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 630, 11, 33, 'speaks about how she can stitch, cook, and work with delight. She has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 630, 12, 33, 'virtue.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 630, 13, 33, 'It says, "She is like merchant ships; she brings her food from afar."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 630, 14, 33, 'This means she is inventive in the type of meals she prepares for her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 630, 15, 33, 'family. She doesn''t think of the same drab, old stuff every day. She''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 630, 16, 33, 'inventive. She''s not wasteful in expenditure, but she thinks, "How can I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 630, 17, 33, 'make this more interesting?" When it says, "She brings her food from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 630, 18, 33, 'afar", it means she has special surprises for her family. Think of these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 630, 19, 33, 'two things that particularly relate to the hands: stitching and cooking.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 630, 20, 33, 'These are things that all young girls should learn and that all mothers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 630, 21, 33, 'should teach their young daughters.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 630, 22, 33, 'She rises also while it is still night');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 630, 23, 33, 'And gives food to her household');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 630, 24, 33, 'And portions to her maidens.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 630, 25, 33, 'Prov 31:15');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 630, 26, 33, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 630, 27, 33, 'She gets up before the sun rises to prepare breakfast for her household');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 630, 28, 33, 'and plans the day''s work for her servant girls.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 631, 1, 33, 'Prov 31:15, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 631, 2, 33, 'The virtuous woman rises before the sun comes up. She has servant girls');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 631, 3, 33, 'working for her, but she wants to plan the day''s work for her servant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 631, 4, 33, 'girls. So she wakes up the servant girls and wakes up early herself to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 631, 5, 33, 'make breakfast for her family. Here it is again - preparing food,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 631, 6, 33, 'stitching clothes, etc. Practical things. There''s some orderliness in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 631, 7, 33, 'her planning. I want you to notice that this woman is not a disorderly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 631, 8, 33, 'type of person. She plans her day - how she''s going to go about it and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 631, 9, 33, 'how her servant girls can also be productive during the day. There''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 631, 10, 33, 'orderliness in her life, not laziness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 631, 11, 33, 'She considers a field and buys it;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 631, 12, 33, 'From her earnings she plants a vineyard.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 631, 13, 33, 'Prov 31:16');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 631, 14, 33, 'She thinks, "In the future I''ll need something for my family. Here''s a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 631, 15, 33, 'good field in which I can plant something." This refers to the olden');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 631, 16, 33, 'days in Israel, but we can apply it to our own situations. It says in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 631, 17, 33, 'verse 18 in The Living Bible that she watches for bargains. That means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 631, 18, 33, 'she knows her family is not so rich, but she watches for when useful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 631, 19, 33, 'items for the family go on sale, and she gets them. She also considers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 631, 20, 33, 'the field before buying it. She''s careful in her purchases. She doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 631, 21, 33, 'see something and immediately say, "I want that." No. She thinks, "Do I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 631, 22, 33, 'need that?" She considers. For her it was a field; for us it may not be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 631, 23, 33, 'a field. It may be something else that you''re looking to buy. Think, "Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 631, 24, 33, 'I really need that in the house? Maybe I can do without it." She''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 631, 25, 33, 'careful in her expenditure. She considers first and then she buys -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 631, 26, 33, 'whatever it is. This is a principle, even if we''re not buying a field.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 631, 27, 33, 'Then it says she plants a vineyard with her own earnings. What are her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 631, 28, 33, 'own earnings? That doesn''t mean she''s going to work. We''ll find out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 632, 1, 33, 'later how she gets money without going to work outside the house. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 632, 2, 33, 'amazing that she has her own earnings to supplement her husband''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 632, 3, 33, 'income.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 632, 4, 33, 'She''s a hard worker, strong and industrious.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 632, 5, 33, 'Prov 31:17, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 632, 6, 33, 'In today''s language, we could say she has muscular arms. It''s good to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 632, 7, 33, 'see if your future wife has some muscles instead of just a pretty face!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 632, 8, 33, 'This is a good thing to look for. Watch her arms to see if there are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 632, 9, 33, 'some muscles. The pretty face won''t help when you have work to do in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 632, 10, 33, 'house. I''ll tell you that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 632, 11, 33, 'She knows the value of everything she makes, and works late into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 632, 12, 33, 'night.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 632, 13, 33, 'Prov 31:18, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 632, 14, 33, 'This is an amazing woman who gets up before dawn and works late into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 632, 15, 33, 'night. Of course, she probably does this in her younger days. When she');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 632, 16, 33, 'grows old it may be different, but her attitude in her youth was that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 632, 17, 33, 'she was not lazily lolling around in bed till late in the morning. She');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 632, 18, 33, 'would get up early and get on the job and work late into the night.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 632, 19, 33, 'She stretches out her hands to the distaff,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 632, 20, 33, 'And her hands grasp the spindle.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 632, 21, 33, 'Prov 31:19');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 632, 22, 33, 'Again, her hands! She''s working with her hands. It''s amazing. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 632, 23, 33, 'quite a contrast to what you read in Isaiah 3. The Lord says to Isaiah,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 632, 24, 33, '"These daughters of Zion walk so delicately on their toes, dancing in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 632, 25, 33, 'their steps with their earrings bobbing." We could say that is true of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 632, 26, 33, 'many ladies today who have so many inches of their midriffs showing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 632, 27, 33, 'under their blouses and all kinds of evil in the way they dress. It''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 632, 28, 33, 'talking about the daughters of Zion. Terrible. All this being delicate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 633, 1, 33, 'and such. It''s quite a contrast to what we see here in Proverbs 31.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 633, 2, 33, 'Here''s a woman who''s working with her hands at home. She''s not going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 633, 3, 33, 'around imitating the delicate type of women out in the world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 633, 4, 33, 'She extends her hand to the poor,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 633, 5, 33, 'And she stretches out her hands to the needy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 633, 6, 33, 'Prov 31:20');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 633, 7, 33, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 633, 8, 33, 'She sews for the poor and generously helps those in need.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 633, 9, 33, 'Prov 31:19-20, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 633, 10, 33, 'Why is she working so much with her hands? It''s not just for herself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 633, 11, 33, 'No. It says here she does something for the poor. She''s not working hard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 633, 12, 33, 'to earn money for selfish reasons. She''s concerned! Her hands are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 633, 13, 33, 'stretched out to help the poor. She earns all that she can, she saves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 633, 14, 33, 'all that she can, and she gives all that she can. What a wonderful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 633, 15, 33, 'woman! This is really a wholehearted, spiritual sister and, like Solomon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 633, 16, 33, 'says, a woman like this is hard to find. There are a few.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 633, 17, 33, 'She has no fear of winter for her household, for she has made warm');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 633, 18, 33, 'clothes for all of them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 633, 19, 33, 'Prov 31:21, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 633, 20, 33, 'She has foresight. She says, "Winter''s coming. I need warm clothes for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 633, 21, 33, 'the family." So she makes them with her own hands. She works with her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 633, 22, 33, 'own hands and cares for her family''s needs in the winter.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 633, 23, 33, 'She also upholsters with finest tapestry; her own clothing is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 633, 24, 33, 'beautifully made-a purple gown of pure linen.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 633, 25, 33, 'Prov 31:22, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 633, 26, 33, 'This means she has a sense of beauty about her. She gathers up all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 633, 27, 33, 'leftover bits of cloth from her stitching and stitches it all together');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 633, 28, 33, 'to make a bedspread. You would think it''s such an expensive thing, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 634, 1, 33, 'actually it''s just the bits of leftover cloth which she pulled together.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 634, 2, 33, 'Think of her attitude not to waste anything and to use everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 634, 3, 33, 'profitably and attractively. And what about her own dress? It says here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 634, 4, 33, 'that her clothing is fine linen and purple - like the clothing of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 634, 5, 33, 'bride in the New Testament. Her clothing is not gold ornaments and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 634, 6, 33, 'jewelry and all that stupid stuff. She wears fine linen; she has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 634, 7, 33, 'simplicity and modesty in her dress. She makes it herself, it says. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 634, 8, 33, 'other words, she''s careful that some stupid tailor does not stitch her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 634, 9, 33, 'clothes into the latest fashions. She might not know how to stitch');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 634, 10, 33, 'herself, so she specifically tells the tailor, "I don''t want any of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 634, 11, 33, 'these rotten, latest fashions, please, in the way you stitch my clothes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 634, 12, 33, 'I want it like this." She''s very careful about the way she gets her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 634, 13, 33, 'clothes stitched. Young men should look for this type of woman.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 634, 14, 33, 'Her husband is known in the gates,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 634, 15, 33, 'When he sits among the elders of the land.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 634, 16, 33, 'Prov 31:23');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 634, 17, 33, 'Because of the way she lives, she has relieved her husband of all his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 634, 18, 33, 'household work so that he can take care of his tasks in the office.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 634, 19, 33, 'Today it''s not the gates, it''s the office you work in. Her husband is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 634, 20, 33, 'relaxed man in the office because he doesn''t come to work with tension');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 634, 21, 33, 'on his mind, having received a yelling and a shelling from his wife in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 634, 22, 33, 'the morning. He''s relaxed and his work is so efficient because she has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 634, 23, 33, 'made it easy for him to do his work. He prospers in his work, in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 634, 24, 33, 'office, and in whatever he does. He''s a leading citizen (the gates speak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 634, 25, 33, 'of leadership in those days), because his wife has made him a leader.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 634, 26, 33, 'Behind every great spiritual leader there is a great woman. She has made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 634, 27, 33, 'her husband to be well known because of her wisdom at home. In contrast,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 634, 28, 33, 'we can say there have been many wives who have been hindrances to their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 635, 1, 33, 'husband''s ministry, unfortunately.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 635, 2, 33, 'She makes linen garments and sells them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 635, 3, 33, 'And supplies belts to the tradesmen.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 635, 4, 33, 'Prov 31:24');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 635, 5, 33, 'I told you earlier about her earnings. This is how she earns money. She');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 635, 6, 33, 'doesn''t leave the home. She makes linen garments and sells them. She');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 635, 7, 33, 'sells things from her garden, she sells the clothes she stitches, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 635, 8, 33, 'she supplies belts to the tradesmen. She supplements her husband''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 635, 9, 33, 'income, because her husband is not a millionaire. They are simple, poor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 635, 10, 33, 'people, so she knows she has to do something to make sure ends meet and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 635, 11, 33, 'they don''t become beggars or get into debt.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 635, 12, 33, 'Strength and dignity are her clothing,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 635, 13, 33, 'And she smiles at the future.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 635, 14, 33, 'Prov 31:25');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 635, 15, 33, 'She''s called here a woman of strength, even though she''s the weaker sex.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 635, 16, 33, 'A woman of strength and dignity. Her clothing is strength (e.g., inner');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 635, 17, 33, 'spiritual strength) and dignity (e.g., she doesn''t go around gossiping,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 635, 18, 33, 'chit-chatting about useless stuff, joking and jesting foolishly, etc.).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 635, 19, 33, 'There''s a dignity about her even though she''s young. This is not talking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 635, 20, 33, 'about an old, seventy year-old woman. This is talking about a young,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 635, 21, 33, 'twenty or twenty-five year-old who has some dignity about her - not like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 635, 22, 33, 'all these other loose girls who go around chatting, gossiping, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 635, 23, 33, 'cracking useless jokes. There''s a dignity about her. She''s not afraid of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 635, 24, 33, 'old age, and she''s not afraid of the future. It says, "She smiles at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 635, 25, 33, 'future." That means when she looks into the future and sees herself as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 635, 26, 33, 'an old woman, she''s not afraid because she''s lived a good life for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 635, 27, 33, 'glory of God and hasn''t wasted her younger years. She''s not afraid of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 635, 28, 33, 'growing old. She''s not afraid of anything in the future. She''s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 636, 1, 33, 'afraid of inflation or anything related to her family, because she is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 636, 2, 33, 'using each day for the glory of God. She looks to the future with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 636, 3, 33, 'confidence.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 636, 4, 33, 'She opens her mouth in wisdom,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 636, 5, 33, 'And the teaching of kindness is on her tongue.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 636, 6, 33, 'Prov 31:26');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 636, 7, 33, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 636, 8, 33, 'She speaks with a gentle wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 636, 9, 33, 'Prov 31:26, GNT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 636, 10, 33, 'or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 636, 11, 33, 'When she speaks, her words are kind, and kindness is the rule for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 636, 12, 33, 'everything she says.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 636, 13, 33, 'Prov 31:26, TLB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 636, 14, 33, 'Here''s another wonderful thing: when she opens her mouth, it''s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 636, 15, 33, 'gossip that comes out, but wisdom. The teaching of kindness is on her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 636, 16, 33, 'tongue. Wisdom and kindness are guiding all her speech. Some people have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 636, 17, 33, 'kindness, but no wisdom. It''s a wonderful thing when you have wisdom and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 636, 18, 33, 'kindness in your speech. Think of a woman who has gentle wisdom. I''ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 636, 19, 33, 'tell you something - listen carefully, young men. Usually, women who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 636, 20, 33, 'very efficient and capable are also very hard-tongued. It''s very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 636, 21, 33, 'difficult to find a hard-working, capable woman who also knows how to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 636, 22, 33, 'speak with gentle wisdom. People who are very efficient are usually very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 636, 23, 33, 'domineering. They don''t know submission. But this is not one like that!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 636, 24, 33, 'She has rough hands from working, and a soft tongue. People in the world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 636, 25, 33, 'have soft hands and a rough tongue. Don''t make the mistake of getting a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 636, 26, 33, 'woman with soft hands and a rough tongue. Look for rough hands and a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 636, 27, 33, 'soft tongue - what a blessing that is! The rule for her speech is gentle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 636, 28, 33, 'wisdom. That means there''s no nagging of the husband or children. Gentle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 637, 1, 33, 'wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 637, 2, 33, 'She looks well to the ways of her household,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 637, 3, 33, 'And does not eat the bread of idleness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 637, 4, 33, 'Prov 31:27');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 637, 5, 33, 'This means that she looks after her children. She ensures that rotten');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 637, 6, 33, 'magazines don''t get into the house, lest the children develop useless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 637, 7, 33, 'habits. She looks after the ways of her household. She''s also not lazy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 637, 8, 33, 'She''s watchful all the time, instructing her children, disciplining her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 637, 9, 33, 'children when they are using words which they''ve picked up in school');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 637, 10, 33, 'which are not proper to speak. She''s looking after the ways of her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 637, 11, 33, 'household! What a woman this is.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 637, 12, 33, 'Her children rise up and bless her;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 637, 13, 33, 'Her husband also, and he praises her, saying:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 637, 14, 33, 'Prov 31:28');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 637, 15, 33, 'One day, the children of such a mother will stand up and say, "Thank');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 637, 16, 33, 'you, Lord, that you gave me such a mother."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 637, 17, 33, '"Many daughters have done nobly,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 637, 18, 33, 'But you excel them all."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 637, 19, 33, 'Prov 31:29');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 637, 20, 33, 'Her husband will also one day rise up and say, "Of all the wives, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 637, 21, 33, 'are the best" - even if he doesn''t appreciate her value sufficiently in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 637, 22, 33, 'the beginning. I believe that every brother can say that about his wife,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 637, 23, 33, 'because God gives us what we deserve. As you listen to all this,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 637, 24, 33, 'brothers, you can think, "I wish my wife was like this." Then you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 637, 25, 33, 'it all wrong, because this is not an exhortation for you to wish your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 637, 26, 33, 'wife was like this if you''re already married. Instead, think of what you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 637, 27, 33, 'yourself could be as a husband. God has given you the type of wife you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 637, 28, 33, 'deserve, and if you didn''t get a better one, it''s because you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 638, 1, 33, 'deserve a better one. You yourself are not so spiritual, so why should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 638, 2, 33, 'God be so unrighteous to give you a spiritual wife? You have to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 638, 3, 33, 'wholehearted to get a wholehearted wife. Everybody would like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 638, 4, 33, 'wholehearted wife. There are a lot of immoral men in the world who would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 638, 5, 33, 'like a pure woman to be their wife. That''s highly unrighteous. It would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 638, 6, 33, 'be highly unrighteous for an unspiritual man to say, "Oh God, give me a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 638, 7, 33, 'really spiritual wife!" God would be very unrighteous if he answered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 638, 8, 33, 'that prayer. No. God gives us the wife we deserve.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 638, 9, 33, 'Charm is deceitful and beauty is vain,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 638, 10, 33, 'But a woman who fears the Lord, she shall be praised.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 638, 11, 33, 'Prov 31:30');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 638, 12, 33, 'What''s the secret of her life? It''s not her beauty or her charm. Charm');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 638, 13, 33, 'is deceitful and beauty is vain. Her secret is that she fears God. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 638, 14, 33, 'fear of God is the beginning of wisdom. The book of Proverbs began with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 638, 15, 33, 'the fear of God, and it ends with a woman, not a man, but a woman who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 638, 16, 33, 'fears God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 638, 17, 33, 'Give her the product of her hands,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 638, 18, 33, 'And let her works praise her in the gates.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 638, 19, 33, 'Prov 31:31');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 638, 20, 33, 'It tells us here in the closing verse to praise her publicly. She');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 638, 21, 33, 'deserves to be praised publicly in the gates. She deserves the respect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 638, 22, 33, 'of everyone. Such a wife deserves recognition and honor from people. As');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 638, 23, 33, 'you sisters look at this passage, you can see a goal here which you may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 638, 24, 33, 'not have attained to, but you can set this goal before you and say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 638, 25, 33, '"Lord, I want to read and read and reread and meditate on this passage');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 638, 26, 33, 'to see the type of woman you want me to be. All my explanation of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 638, 27, 33, 'doctrine and knowledge of the New and Living Way isn''t even accounted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 638, 28, 33, 'for in one verse in this whole section. Rather value is given to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 639, 1, 33, 'gentleness, wisdom on my tongue, and hard work with my hands, so that my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 639, 2, 33, 'hands become rough." These are the marks of a woman whom God says is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 639, 3, 33, 'worth more than all the riches of the world. Such a woman can make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 639, 4, 33, 'whoever she marries an extremely rich man. Whatever her husband earns,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 639, 5, 33, 'even if it''s very little, they''ll have no problem making ends meet,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 639, 6, 33, 'because she has wisdom. Consider this challenge, brothers and sisters -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 639, 7, 33, 'those of us who are considering marriage. Think of finding a woman like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 639, 8, 33, 'this.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 639, 9, 33, 'Share');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 639, 10, 33, 'Who Am I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 639, 11, 33, 'Our Message');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 639, 12, 33, 'Resources');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 639, 13, 33, 'Study Series');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 639, 14, 33, 'About us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_way_of_wisdom', 639, 15, 33, 'CHRISTIAN FELLOWSHIP CHURCH');
INSERT INTO books VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 'The Congregation The Club And The Church', 'Zac Poonen', 'To understand the difference between a congreation and a club and a church, read this book.', 'the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church.jpg', 32, 870, '2026-09-01T09:55:51.860Z');
INSERT INTO book_chapters VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 1, 'Chapter 1 New Wine Needs a New Wineskin', 1, 1, 3, 20);
INSERT INTO book_chapters VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 2, 'Chapter 2 The Vertical Plank of the Cross', 3, 21, 6, 1);
INSERT INTO book_chapters VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 3, 'Chapter 3 The Horizontal Plank of the Cross', 6, 2, 8, 8);
INSERT INTO book_chapters VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 4, 'Chapter 4 The Congregation', 8, 9, 12, 27);
INSERT INTO book_chapters VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 5, 'Chapter 5 The Club', 12, 28, 17, 25);
INSERT INTO book_chapters VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 6, 'Chapter 6 The True Church', 17, 26, 23, 13);
INSERT INTO book_chapters VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 7, 'Chapter 7 Building up the Church – Being a Giver', 23, 14, 25, 26);
INSERT INTO book_chapters VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 8, 'Chapter 8 Tearing Down the Church – Being an Accuser', 25, 27, 28, 13);
INSERT INTO book_chapters VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 9, 'Chapter 9 Caring for the Church – Being a Shepherd', 28, 14, 32, 2);
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 1, 1, 1, 'Chapter 1 New Wine Needs a New Wineskin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 1, 2, 1, '"New wine must be put into new wineskins" (Luke 5:38).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 1, 3, 1, 'I would like to share with you in this little book, something that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 1, 4, 1, 'Lord has been doing in my life over a period of many years. It is a way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 1, 5, 1, 'of life that has become very precious to me because, like everything of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 1, 6, 1, 'eternal value, experiencing it has involved sacrifice.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 1, 7, 1, 'If we really seek to understand the teaching and the life of Christ, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 1, 8, 1, 'will bring us to a cross - a cross where we will have to give up some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 1, 9, 1, 'cherished things that we value and we will have to make sacrifices in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 1, 10, 1, 'many areas. Then what the Lord wants to teach us will become a reality');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 1, 11, 1, 'in our lives - and we will fulfil the whole plan of God for our lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 1, 12, 1, 'Building the New Covenant Church is an area that God has made very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 1, 13, 1, 'precious to me. The path to it is, however, a very, very narrow one.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 1, 14, 1, 'The Only Thing that Matters');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 1, 15, 1, 'Jesus said that new wine must be put into new wineskins. The new wine is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 1, 16, 1, 'His life that He wants to give us through the Holy Spirit. The new');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 1, 17, 1, 'wineskin is the New Covenant Church that He wants to build through us,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 1, 18, 1, 'in which this life is to be manifested.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 1, 19, 1, 'If we sincerely seek to live this New Covenant life, we will discover');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 1, 20, 1, 'that we have to peel off many layers of selfishness (like the layers of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 1, 21, 1, 'an onion), as God shows them to us a little at a time. The same is true,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 1, 22, 1, 'when we seek to build a New Covenant Church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 1, 23, 1, 'The old wineskin is a church built on human traditions rather than on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 1, 24, 1, 'God''s Word. This also has many layers. As the Lord shows us those layers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 1, 25, 1, 'we must peel them off. Unfortunately, many Christians who seek to build');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 1, 26, 1, 'New Covenant churches stop short at some point - when there are many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 1, 27, 1, 'layers of the old wineskin still to be peeled off. They have peeled off');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 1, 28, 1, 'only some of the obvious human and denominational traditions that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 2, 1, 1, 'have grown up with. But the Lord wants us to get rid of the old wineskin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 2, 2, 1, 'completely. He wants His new wine to be contained in a totally new');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 2, 3, 1, 'wineskin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 2, 4, 1, 'For many years, I knew the teaching about the new wine and the new');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 2, 5, 1, 'wineskin and what it really meant to build the Church as the body of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 2, 6, 1, 'Christ - theoretically. But all of it was only head-knowledge,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 2, 7, 1, 'accumulated by hearing more sermons about it than others had heard.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 2, 8, 1, 'Growing up, I heard sermons about the New Covenant by my Dad every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 2, 9, 1, 'Sunday. I also heard him at home, Monday through Saturday. But all of it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 2, 10, 1, 'was still only in my head. It took many years for those truths to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 2, 11, 1, 'descend from my head to my heart, when I finally realized that this was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 2, 12, 1, 'the only way that I could serve the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 2, 13, 1, 'Jesus is the only Person for me in my life now. Every other relationship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 2, 14, 1, 'comes out of my relationship with Him. And, therefore, building the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 2, 15, 1, 'Church as the Body of Christ is the only thing for me in my service for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 2, 16, 1, 'the Lord now.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 2, 17, 1, 'Why did our Lord Jesus choose the way of the cross every single day of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 2, 18, 1, 'His earthly life? The Bible says that it was because of "a joy set');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 2, 19, 1, 'before Him" (Hebrews12:2).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 2, 20, 1, 'What was that joy set before Him?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 2, 21, 1, 'In John 14, we read Jesus'' parting words to His disciples before He went');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 2, 22, 1, 'to the cross. I really appreciate the fact that the apostle John took');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 2, 23, 1, 'five chapters to tell us the parting words of Jesus at the last supper.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 2, 24, 1, 'There Jesus said, "Arise let us go from here" (John 14:31). He was going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 2, 25, 1, 'to His crucifixion. But before saying that, He said, "That the world may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 2, 26, 1, 'know that I love the Father, and as the Father gave Me commandment even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 2, 27, 1, 'so I do" (John 14:30). That was His joy - the joy of always being in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 2, 28, 1, 'submission to His Father and thus being in fellowship with Him, as it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 3, 1, 1, 'had been for Him from all eternity. So, Jesus went to the cross first of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 3, 2, 1, 'all, out of love for His Father and submission to His command - and then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 3, 3, 1, 'out of love for us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 3, 4, 1, 'I want to emphasize this point because that is the only way we can build');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 3, 5, 1, 'His Church as well. All desire to overcome sin and to do the Lord''s work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 3, 6, 1, 'must come first from a love for the Father leading to obedience to His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 3, 7, 1, 'commands - and secondly from a love for people. We need to have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 3, 8, 1, 'compassion for people, if we are to build the Church. But before that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 3, 9, 1, 'compassion, there must be a love for our heavenly Father - a passionate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 3, 10, 1, 'love that makes us want to obey His commands.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 3, 11, 1, 'These are the two vital requirements needed to build a New Covenant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 3, 12, 1, 'Church: Love for the Father and love for others. These can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 3, 13, 1, 'represented by the two planks of the cross - the vertical plank and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 3, 14, 1, 'horizontal plank. With just one of those planks - the vertical or the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 3, 15, 1, 'horizontal alone - you don''t have a cross.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 3, 16, 1, 'In the cross, we see a beautiful picture of the two-way relationship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 3, 17, 1, 'that defines how we should carry the cross every day of our lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 3, 18, 1, 'In the subsequent chapters, I want to point out what it means to have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 3, 19, 1, 'both planks of the cross in our lives, and how these two together can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 3, 20, 1, 'help us build New Covenant Churches.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 3, 21, 2, 'Chapter 2 The Vertical Plank of the Cross');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 3, 22, 2, 'The vertical plank of the cross represents love for God our Father - and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 3, 23, 2, 'that must come first. When they built the cross on which Jesus died,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 3, 24, 2, 'they would have started with the vertical plank first. And that plank');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 3, 25, 2, 'had to be about twice the size of the horizontal plank.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 3, 26, 2, 'The symbolic meaning of that is that the vertical relationship with our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 3, 27, 2, 'Father in heaven is most important. That must come first. Only after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 3, 28, 2, 'that, must come the horizontal relationship with others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 4, 1, 2, 'Following the Example of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 4, 2, 2, 'Before Jesus carried the cross up to Calvary''s hill, He had carried an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 4, 3, 2, 'inward cross throughout His earthly life. He had carried an inward cross');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 4, 4, 2, 'every day for the 12,000-plus days of His earthly life. And He says to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 4, 5, 2, 'us, " If you want to be My disciple, you must take up your cross');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 4, 6, 2, 'everyday as well" (Luke 9:23 - paraphrase). The principle by which Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 4, 7, 2, 'lived every one of those 12000-plus days on earth was this: "My life is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 4, 8, 2, 'determined by My love for My Father first of all, and obedience to His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 4, 9, 2, 'commands; and then, by My love for others."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 4, 10, 2, 'That was why Jesus could spend 30 years in His home living in subjection');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 4, 11, 2, 'to His earthly parents. How many temptations to be disobedient and to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 4, 12, 2, 'irritated He must have had to overcome, in order to obey imperfect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 4, 13, 2, 'Joseph and Mary implicitly every day for 30 years. But He did that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 4, 14, 2, 'joyfully because of "the joy set before Him" - the joy of fellowship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 4, 15, 2, 'with His Father through obedience to His Father''s command that said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 4, 16, 2, '"Honour your father and mother".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 4, 17, 2, 'That attitude of taking up His cross and obeying His Father in every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 4, 18, 2, 'area, continued until the end of His earthly life. Jesus Himself was the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 4, 19, 2, 'first Body of Christ - and He carried the cross every day for 33½ years.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 4, 20, 2, 'Today, we, the members of His spiritual Body, must do the same.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 4, 21, 2, 'The Church of Jesus Christ must be a Church of disciples, and not just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 4, 22, 2, 'of converts. A disciple is one who denies his Self-life and carries his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 4, 23, 2, 'cross every day (Luke 9:23). So, if we want to have the new wine (the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 4, 24, 2, 'life of Jesus) in a new wineskin (a New Covenant Church), we must deny');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 4, 25, 2, 'ourselves and take up our cross every day and follow Jesus. Only then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 4, 26, 2, 'can we build the Church as the Body of Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 4, 27, 2, 'The Hidden Life of a Believer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 4, 28, 2, 'For building the Church, the vertical relationship with our Lord is most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 5, 1, 2, 'important. And this relationship with the Lord is a secret one, in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 5, 2, 2, 'private life. The devil deceives many Christians into thinking that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 5, 3, 2, 'their devotion to God is what appears on the outside. But true devotion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 5, 4, 2, 'to God is 100% inward - in the secret place. It is in our hidden life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 5, 5, 2, 'The New Covenant is primarily about inner attitudes and thoughts and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 5, 6, 2, 'motives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 5, 7, 2, 'In the sermon on the mount, Jesus spoke about the hidden life. In the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 5, 8, 2, 'New Covenant, it is no longer a question of merely avoiding adultery (as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 5, 9, 2, 'in the Old Covenant). Now, we have to hate sexually sinful thoughts as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 5, 10, 2, 'well. In the Old Covenant, what mattered was how much you gave, and how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 5, 11, 2, 'much you prayed and fasted. But Jesus came and said that we must now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 5, 12, 2, 'give and pray and fast in secret, without letting anyone know that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 5, 13, 2, 'are engaged in those activities. This is the new wine of the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 5, 14, 2, 'Covenant. If we haven''t understood the importance of hiding our inner');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 5, 15, 2, 'devotion to Christ, then we haven''t understood the fundamental principle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 5, 16, 2, 'of the New Covenant. Our devotion to Him must always be in secret.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 5, 17, 2, 'Our life must be "hid with Christ in God" (Colossians 3:3). This is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 5, 18, 2, 'wonderful way to live. The more we hide our devotion to Christ from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 5, 19, 2, 'others, the more we will learn the secrets of the Lord. We must have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 5, 20, 2, 'times of intimacy with our Bridegroom in secret that no one knows about.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 5, 21, 2, 'The best marriage is one where the husband and wife have learnt the joy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 5, 22, 2, 'of each other''s company without anybody else being with them - without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 5, 23, 2, 'anyone even being aware that they are spending time with each other.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 5, 24, 2, 'Jesus is building His Church today with people who have this spirit of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 5, 25, 2, 'devoted Bride.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 5, 26, 2, 'Once the vertical plank (our love for the Father and a fervent devotion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 5, 27, 2, 'to Christ) has been laid down, then the horizontal plank (our love for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 5, 28, 2, 'one another) can be laid across it. Then the cross is complete - on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 6, 1, 2, 'which we can joyfully lie down and be crucified!!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 6, 2, 3, 'Chapter 3 The Horizontal Plank of the Cross');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 6, 3, 3, 'If you try to hang a horizontal plank in the air, it will fall down. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 6, 4, 3, 'if you nail it to a vertical plank, then it will stand firm - and become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 6, 5, 3, 'a cross. The vertical plank, however, must come first.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 6, 6, 3, 'The churches that we build must be New Covenant churches. Such churches');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 6, 7, 3, 'can be built only by those who determine to live by this principle: "I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 6, 8, 3, 'do not want to do what I want to do. I only want to do what my heavenly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 6, 9, 3, 'Father wants me to do" .');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 6, 10, 3, 'Sadly, the vast majority of Christians do not have this attitude. My own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 6, 11, 3, 'life was also once like that. I sought my own and did what I wanted to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 6, 12, 3, 'do, while calling myself a believer! I wanted to be a part of a church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 6, 13, 3, 'that fitted with my own ideas of "church". I wanted to build fellowship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 6, 14, 3, 'with people who were like me in every way. I spent my time with people I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 6, 15, 3, 'liked. And if some brother rubbed me the wrong way, I would avoid him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 6, 16, 3, 'That was not walking the way of the cross. We can never build the body');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 6, 17, 3, 'of Christ if we hold on to that mentality. It is possible to receive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 6, 18, 3, 'excellent teaching and yet not walk the way of the cross.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 6, 19, 3, 'Who is a True Disciple of Jesus?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 6, 20, 3, 'For many years I used to think that the proof that we were disciples of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 6, 21, 3, 'Jesus was that we loved one another, because Jesus said, "By this all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 6, 22, 3, 'men will know that you are My disciples, if you have love for one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 6, 23, 3, 'another" (John 13:35). I thought that meant that I prove that I am a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 6, 24, 3, 'disciple by loving my brothers and sisters in the church that I attend.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 6, 25, 3, 'But if you read that verse carefully you will notice that it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 6, 26, 3, 'referring to the evidence that we are disciples - the way that others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 6, 27, 3, '(non-Christians) identify us as Jesus'' disciples. That is the horizontal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 6, 28, 3, 'plank of the cross.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 7, 1, 3, 'But Jesus had said earlier, that the condition for being a disciple was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 7, 2, 3, 'denying our Self and crucifying our self-will (Luke 9:23). God has to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 7, 3, 3, 'first see that you are a disciple in those areas of your life where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 7, 4, 3, 'nobody sees you - in your heart, in your inner life. When God sees that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 7, 5, 3, 'you deny yourself daily, He attests you as a " Luke 9:23 Christian" -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 7, 6, 3, 'and that is the only kind of Christian there really is . "The disciples');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 7, 7, 3, 'were called Christians" (Acts 11:26).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 7, 8, 3, 'After that , the evidence to the world around you that you are a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 7, 9, 3, 'disciple of Jesus will be that you love other disciples of Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 7, 10, 3, 'But notice, again, that the vertical plank comes first - God being able');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 7, 11, 3, 'to attest to your love for Him. So, don''t be deceived into thinking that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 7, 12, 3, 'if you love others in your local church you are a disciple of Jesus! A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 7, 13, 3, 'human love for others can deceive you into thinking that you are a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 7, 14, 3, 'disciple. If you love to be with other believers on Sundays, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 7, 15, 3, 'doesn''t prove that you are a disciple. You prove that you are a disciple');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 7, 16, 3, 'on Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday, Thursday, Friday and Saturday, when you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 7, 17, 3, 'don''t necessarily meet with other believers - by denying yourself and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 7, 18, 3, 'loving Jesus fervently. In other words, you live before His face day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 7, 19, 3, 'after day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 7, 20, 3, 'For a true disciple of Jesus, every day of the week is exactly the same,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 7, 21, 3, 'because he seeks the fellowship of his Bridegroom primarily. His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 7, 22, 3, 'fellowship with other disciples only flows out of his fellowship with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 7, 23, 3, 'his Lord. Such a disciple is never affected by who joins his church or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 7, 24, 3, 'who leaves it. The true Church can be built only with disciples for whom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 7, 25, 3, 'Jesus is the only One who matters in their lives,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 7, 26, 3, 'As I said earlier, a plank by itself is no cross, whether the vertical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 7, 27, 3, 'plank or the horizontal plank. Unfortunately, most believers and most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 7, 28, 3, 'churches fall into one of these two categories - emphasizing the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 8, 1, 3, 'vertical plank alone or the horizontal one alone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 8, 2, 3, 'There are three types of gatherings of Christians that I have seen. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 8, 3, 3, 'are:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 8, 4, 3, '1. Congregations');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 8, 5, 3, '2. Clubs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 8, 6, 3, '3. Local expressions of the true Church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 8, 7, 3, 'And the last of these three is the only one that is the new wineskin for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 8, 8, 3, 'the new wine.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 8, 9, 4, 'Chapter 4 The Congregation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 8, 10, 4, 'The Congregation is a gathering of vertical planks. Many churches that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 8, 11, 4, 'have been to are like this. In a good Congregation, the people are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 8, 12, 4, 'interested only in their personal walk with God, in Bible studies and in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 8, 13, 4, 'doctrinal purity. But they are all individual planks of different sizes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 8, 14, 4, '(different levels of devotion to the Lord). They do not build fellowship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 8, 15, 4, 'with each other - and they avoid anyone who rubs them the wrong way. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 8, 16, 4, 'myself was a Congregation member for many years. Having heard many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 8, 17, 4, 'wonderful truths for many years, I was satisfied that my personal walk');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 8, 18, 4, 'with God was alright. But, like John says " How can you claim to love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 8, 19, 4, 'God when you don''t love the brother whom you see?" (1 John 4:20). And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 8, 20, 4, 'that is a verse that people in "Congregations" don''t pay much attention');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 8, 21, 4, 'to.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 8, 22, 4, 'What John is saying there, is that you may think you have a cross just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 8, 23, 4, 'because you have a vertical plank. You have some level of outward');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 8, 24, 4, 'holiness, but you have no fellowship with others in your Congregation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 8, 25, 4, 'The "Congregation" is the Old Covenant pattern');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 8, 26, 4, 'In the Congregation pattern, people are isolated brothers and sisters');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 8, 27, 4, 'who do not seek to build fellowship with each other, even though they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 8, 28, 4, 'may have friendship with them. They do not spend time together to build');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 9, 1, 4, 'each other up in love. This is how it was under the Old Covenant in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 9, 2, 4, 'Israel.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 9, 3, 4, 'In such a system, even a husband and wife may not have much fellowship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 9, 4, 4, 'with each other, because one of them is "super spiritual"! For example,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 9, 5, 4, 'say, the wife is overburdened, taking care of the children, while the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 9, 6, 4, 'husband is busy having his "quiet time" meditating on God''s word instead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 9, 7, 4, 'of helping her! Such a man has "Congregation" mentality.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 9, 8, 4, 'I wonder whether such a person can really be called a Christian. He can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 9, 9, 4, 'imagine that he is spiritual and a disciple of Christ because he reads');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 9, 10, 4, 'the Bible, prays and gives money to the church. But, it is all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 9, 11, 4, 'self-deception. The devil has fooled many Christians like that - just as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 9, 12, 4, 'he fooled me also for many years into thinking that my external');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 9, 13, 4, '"Christian" activities made me a disciple of Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 9, 14, 4, 'This is Old Covenant religion - and the word ''congregation'' is really an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 9, 15, 4, 'Old Covenant word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 9, 16, 4, 'When Moses gave the Law to the Israelites they were a congregation. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 9, 17, 4, 'God gave them detailed commands about how they should worship when they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 9, 18, 4, 'gathered together, they were a gathering of separate individuals. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 9, 19, 4, 'were individuals whom God was inviting to live a holy life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 9, 20, 4, 'In Israel''s history, they had "solo leaders" like Moses and " solo');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 9, 21, 4, 'prophets" like Elijah. But we never see two leaders or prophets there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 9, 22, 4, 'working together or building fellowship with each other, and doing the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 9, 23, 4, 'work of God together in Israel. Such fellowship is possible only under');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 9, 24, 4, 'the New Covenant. It is the principle of " new wine in new wineskins".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 9, 25, 4, 'Under the Old Covenant, the Israelites just took care of their own lives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 9, 26, 4, 'and their families. Even if some of them were holy, they did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 9, 27, 4, 'fellowship together with others. The word "fellowship" did not exist');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 9, 28, 4, 'under the Old Covenant. They were "lone rangers" - some of whom may have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 10, 1, 4, 'loved to do things for God. But they did not long to build fellowship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 10, 2, 4, 'with one another in a "body", or work together with each other as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 10, 3, 4, 'members of one "body" - becausethey could not be a body under the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 10, 4, 4, 'Covenant. They were just a congregation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 10, 5, 4, 'The new wine and the new wineskin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 10, 6, 4, 'But now the New Covenant has been established by our Lord. When we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 10, 7, 4, 'born again we receive the life of Christ - the new wine. This life is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 10, 8, 4, 'not meant to be lived individually (in the old wineskin). If we try to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 10, 9, 4, 'fit this life of Christ into a selfish lifestyle - where we think only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 10, 10, 4, 'of ourselves and our family, without building fellowship with other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 10, 11, 4, 'born-again believers in our local church - then, as Jesus warned us, our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 10, 12, 4, 'life (the old wineskin) would burst. God fills us with His Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 10, 13, 4, '(the new wine) and wants it to be poured into the new wineskin (the Body');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 10, 14, 4, 'of Christ).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 10, 15, 4, 'I know there is hope for every one of us to enter into this, because I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 10, 16, 4, 'see what God did for me. God had mercy on me, when I was a "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 10, 17, 4, 'Congregation" Christian, and everything burst in my life and fell apart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 10, 18, 4, 'Then God told me (as it were), "Will you now let me put this new wine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 10, 19, 4, 'into a new wineskin?" The good thing about the "bursting" was that it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 10, 20, 4, 'got rid of the old wineskin! It was good that God allowed my old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 10, 21, 4, 'wineskin to burst. I realized then that I had put my faith in what was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 10, 22, 4, 'earthly, and not heavenly. I had put my faith in the traditions of men');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 10, 23, 4, 'and my own ideas about building the church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 10, 24, 4, 'Devotion to God is often merely an external thing for many Christians.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 10, 25, 4, 'They attend all the meetings of the church, they pray, they sit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 10, 26, 4, 'reverentially, and they all talk religious language. Such external');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 10, 27, 4, 'actions can make them imagine that they are spiritual. But you cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 10, 28, 4, 'talk with them about practical aspects of everyday life, because such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 11, 1, 4, 'conversation would be considered "unspiritual and worldly"! They can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 11, 2, 4, 'only talk about "religious" matters. It is a false Christianity that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 11, 3, 4, 'does not permit us to talk about ordinary, everyday matters with each');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 11, 4, 4, 'other.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 11, 5, 4, 'When Jesus spoke to His disciples and to the people around Him, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 11, 6, 4, 'wasn''t always quoting Old Testament verses to them. He did that when it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 11, 7, 4, 'was needed - for example, when He spoke to Satan or when He answered the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 11, 8, 4, 'questions of the Pharisees. But most of the time He spoke to His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 11, 9, 4, 'disciples about ordinary, everyday matters. He never acted or spoke with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 11, 10, 4, 'a false spirituality. And thereby, He has shown us what the new wine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 11, 11, 4, 'really is.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 11, 12, 4, 'Using religious language can give us the false impression that we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 11, 13, 4, 'building the church with others around us who also speak the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 11, 14, 4, 'religious language. We can quote verses to one another and share what we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 11, 15, 4, 'got from those verses in the meetings - and imagine that to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 11, 16, 4, 'spirituality. But that will only result in a soulish life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 11, 17, 4, 'The Grain of Wheat Must Fall into the Ground and Die');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 11, 18, 4, 'Think of the mega-churches nowadays, with congregations of thousands of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 11, 19, 4, 'people. Within them, there may not even be two people who have genuine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 11, 20, 4, 'godly fellowship with each other. They are drawn together by powerful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 11, 21, 4, 'soulish music and eloquent soulish preaching. That is not an expression');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 11, 22, 4, 'of the Body of Christ. These are gatherings of vertical planks who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 11, 23, 4, 'individually think of their relationship with God alone. But it is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 11, 24, 4, 'deception, because there is no horizontal plank. And so, there is no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 11, 25, 4, 'cross.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 11, 26, 4, 'Jesus said, "Unless a grain of wheat falls into the ground and dies, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 11, 27, 4, 'remains alone" (John 12:24). Genuine fruit that lasts for eternity can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 11, 28, 4, 'come only from grains of wheat dying to themselves. 10,000 individual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 12, 1, 4, 'grains can be kept in a golden showcase on display, and that will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 12, 2, 4, 'impress the world. You can see thousands of such grains of wheat,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 12, 3, 4, 'sitting next to each other in the pews of mega-churches. When I see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 12, 4, 4, 'that, I think, "If even two of those grains had been willing to die to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 12, 5, 4, 'themselves and to build fellowship with each other, God could have begun');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 12, 6, 4, 'a work among a remnant there, that could truly manifest the Body of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 12, 7, 4, 'Christ to the world around them".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 12, 8, 4, 'May God save us from ever gathering large numbers of people in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 12, 9, 4, 'church, who are all grains of wheat that are unwilling to fall into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 12, 10, 4, 'ground and die. God begins with one grain of wheat that is willing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 12, 11, 4, 'fall into the ground and die. Then He adds another to that one, and then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 12, 12, 4, 'another, and then another. This is how the Church is built as the Body');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 12, 13, 4, 'of Christ which can feed a hungry world. But, grains of wheat that do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 12, 14, 4, 'not die can only tease the hungry, needy people in the world with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 12, 15, 4, 'pretense of what they could be - pictures of bread, rather than true');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 12, 16, 4, 'bread. Jesus said that when a grain of wheat falls into the ground and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 12, 17, 4, 'dies, it will ( definitely) bear much fruit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 12, 18, 4, 'A grain of wheat is so small that if held between your fingers, you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 12, 19, 4, 'hardly see it. Even so, you may be a small unknown group of a few');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 12, 20, 4, 'believers meeting somewhere, denounced and despised by other Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 12, 21, 4, 'groups and churches. Don''t get discouraged. Other mega-churches around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 12, 22, 4, 'you may have their famous pastors who give impressive reports about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 12, 23, 4, 'their work and earn huge salaries and drive fancy cars. Let them do all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 12, 24, 4, 'of that. Don''t envy them. Our calling is to fall into the ground and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 12, 25, 4, 'die. The Lord will bring forth fruit from us that will last for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 12, 26, 4, 'eternity. That is His promise. That is the secret of building the true');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 12, 27, 4, 'Church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 12, 28, 5, 'Chapter 5 The Club');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 13, 1, 5, 'The "Club" is the opposite of the Congregation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 13, 2, 5, 'The Congregation, we saw, was these vertical planks of different sizes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 13, 3, 5, 'stacked next to each other - some of them having more devotion to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 13, 4, 5, 'Lord, and others having less. But they don''t have fellowship with one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 13, 5, 5, 'another.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 13, 6, 5, 'The Club, however, is made up of people who care for each other. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 13, 7, 5, 'perhaps a greater danger for some, because it is easy to compare');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 13, 8, 5, 'ourselves with the Congregations around us and say, "Okay, we are all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 13, 9, 5, 'going to care for one another now". So, we talk nicely to each other and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 13, 10, 5, 'think we have good fellowship with each other. It is easy, then, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 13, 11, 5, 'imagine that we are spiritual because we all think alike doctrinally, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 13, 12, 5, 'all dress similarly, etc. But we are still only wooden planks - all cut');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 13, 13, 5, 'to the same size out of the same mould!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 13, 14, 5, 'The Club is a "No-Covenant" Religion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 13, 15, 5, 'The greatest danger for us, when we have understood the importance of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 13, 16, 5, 'horizontal relationships with each other, is that we become a Club. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 13, 17, 5, 'invite others to join us, but we expect them all to be like us, to speak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 13, 18, 5, 'like us and to act like us. Thus, we become a club of people who are all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 13, 19, 5, 'exactly alike - or, as some say, "cookie-cutter Christians" - all cut in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 13, 20, 5, 'the same shape and size! Our relationship with each other is then based');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 13, 21, 5, 'on the fact that we all speak the same religious language.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 13, 22, 5, 'We may be able to get along even with people of a different community');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 13, 23, 5, 'and a different language, because they are still intellectually like us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 13, 24, 5, 'But if another brother joins our church who is not so well-educated, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 13, 25, 5, 'not so well-versed in our doctrines, then we may find it difficult to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 13, 26, 5, 'get along with him. So, we keep him at a distance, and eventually he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 13, 27, 5, 'falls away and leaves our Club. He didn''t fit into our mould. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 13, 28, 5, 'wineskin of such a Club is one without either the Old Covenant or the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 14, 1, 5, 'New Covenant. There is no covenant there at all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 14, 2, 5, 'The Congregation was based on the Old Covenant - some devotion to God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 14, 3, 5, 'but without mutual fellowship. You can react to that, however, and end');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 14, 4, 5, 'up in a life with no covenant at all. Many Christians are like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 14, 5, 5, 'They feel that God has set them free from the Old Covenant and the Law,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 14, 6, 5, 'and they end up having no covenant at all. Such people love Paul''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 14, 7, 5, 'letter to the Galatians, misunderstanding its teaching of being "free');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 14, 8, 5, 'from the law". They don''t want any covenant at all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 14, 9, 5, 'But without a covenant there can be no marriage to Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 14, 10, 5, 'When my wife and I were married, we entered into a covenant. Though');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 14, 11, 5, 'there is no rule book in marriage, there are some rules - rules based on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 14, 12, 5, 'love. For example: I will never cheat on my wife, by God''s grace. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 14, 13, 5, 'is not because of rules that I find in some rule book on marriage that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 14, 14, 5, 'says, "You shall not do this or do that once you are married". I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 14, 15, 5, 'faithful to my wife because I love her. I never want to do anything that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 14, 16, 5, 'would harm her because I love her. In our marriage to Christ too, there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 14, 17, 5, 'are some rules - on the same basis - because He loved me first, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 14, 18, 5, 'because I love Him with all my heart. My relationship with Him is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 14, 19, 5, 'based on any book of rules, but on the law of love.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 14, 20, 5, 'The Club however has many rules. If you want to be a part of the Club');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 14, 21, 5, 'you have to fulfill certain requirements - rules that go beyond God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 14, 22, 5, 'laws - mere traditions of men.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 14, 23, 5, 'When you are under no covenant with God, you have to make your own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 14, 24, 5, 'covenant in your relationship with others. " You scratch my back and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 14, 25, 5, 'will scratch yours. You treat me nicely, and I will treat you nicely.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 14, 26, 5, 'But the moment you stop treating me nicely, I am finished with you ."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 14, 27, 5, 'Many believers have this type of a relationship with others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 14, 28, 5, 'The Club, however, gives you some earthly privileges. You can attend the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 15, 1, 5, '"church conferences", your children can meet with other good children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 15, 2, 5, 'there, you can get married there - and, you can even get a decent burial');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 15, 3, 5, 'when the time comes for that!!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 15, 4, 5, 'Club-life Leads to Disaster');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 15, 5, 5, 'When believers only build friendship with each other like this, they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 15, 6, 5, 'simply a bunch of horizontal planks. Some of them may have a little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 15, 7, 5, 'devotion to Christ, but that vertical plank is very small. In most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 15, 8, 5, 'cases, the vertical plank is non-existent.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 15, 9, 5, 'Don''t wake up at the judgment seat of Christ and discover that you were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 15, 10, 5, 'just a part of a good Christian club.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 15, 11, 5, 'Did you join your "church" because your husband or wife or someone else');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 15, 12, 5, 'dragged you into it? Did you join it because you liked the "Club');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 15, 13, 5, 'atmosphere" there, where you could listen to good sermons and where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 15, 14, 5, 'others would help you when you were in need?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 15, 15, 5, 'When you listen to good teaching, you can easily deceive yourself into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 15, 16, 5, 'thinking that you are spiritual just because you understand it. And you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 15, 17, 5, 'can congratulate yourself because the teaching in your "church" is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 15, 18, 5, 'superior to that in other "churches". Yet the vertical plank of devotion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 15, 19, 5, 'to Christ may be totally missing in your life. If so, then you will have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 15, 20, 5, 'a tragic surprise at the judgment seat of Christ - when you find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 15, 21, 5, 'yourself outside God''s kingdom altogether!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 15, 22, 5, 'At the security check-point in airports, there is a conveyor belt on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 15, 23, 5, 'which passengers place their bags. Those bags go through a security scan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 15, 24, 5, 'and finally come out on the other side. I have pictured the judgment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 15, 25, 5, 'seat of Christ to be somewhat like this. But, instead of a scanning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 15, 26, 5, 'machine, it will be a big furnace! And God will send our entire life''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 15, 27, 5, 'actions one by one through that furnace. What comes out on the other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 15, 28, 5, 'side will depend on how we lived our lives here on earth. 1 Corinthians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 16, 1, 5, '3:13-15 states that for many believers, everything they did will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 16, 2, 5, 'burnt up - because it was all like wood, hay and straw. Nothing will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 16, 3, 5, 'come out on the other side. Many who sat in good "churches" for years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 16, 4, 5, 'will discover to their dismay in that day, that they had wasted their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 16, 5, 5, 'entire earthly lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 16, 6, 5, 'There will be many who attended good "churches" for many years and heard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 16, 7, 5, 'wonderful messages (in their "church" and on-line) to whom the Lord will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 16, 8, 5, 'say "Your earthly life was wasted, because you did not have a personal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 16, 9, 5, 'devotion to Me. I never ''knew'' you and you never ''knew'' Me. You never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 16, 10, 5, 'walked with Me. You never took up the cross" (Matthew 7:22-23). That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 16, 11, 5, 'will indeed be sad.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 16, 12, 5, 'Secure in the Lord or in the Church?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 16, 13, 5, 'The Church of Jesus Christ is the most enjoyable place for me on earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 16, 14, 5, 'I mean that from the bottom of my heart. The fellowship of the saints is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 16, 15, 5, 'so sweet. But that will never be greater than the fellowship I have with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 16, 16, 5, 'my heavenly Father and with the Lord Jesus. The fellowship that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 16, 17, 5, 'experience with Jesus and the Father will never be broken throughout my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 16, 18, 5, 'earthly life and will continue throughout all eternity. And it is on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 16, 19, 5, 'basis of that fellowship that I experience fellowship with God''s people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 16, 20, 5, 'even now.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 16, 21, 5, 'Those who are in the Club however, find their security in that Club and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 16, 22, 5, 'not in the Lord. They find their security in listening to godly men. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 16, 23, 5, 'may have listened to hundreds of sermons this year. But that does not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 16, 24, 5, 'make you a true disciple of Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 16, 25, 5, 'Those who are in the Club also expect to be pampered and coddled');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 16, 26, 5, 'constantly; and they get offended easily if they are not treated as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 16, 27, 5, 'someone "special". They seek for honour and approval from men. They seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 16, 28, 5, 'to be visible publicly and want to be treated nicely by others. If an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 17, 1, 5, 'elder were to give them a word of correction at some point, they would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 17, 2, 5, 'get offended immediately, and eventually leave the Club!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 17, 3, 5, 'The Lord has shown me that if I ever get offended when a godly, older');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 17, 4, 5, 'brother corrects me, that would prove that I am just a "Club" Christian.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 17, 5, 5, 'Others around me may be experiencing the true life of Christ. But I can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 17, 6, 5, 'sit among them for years and years, only to discover at the judgment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 17, 7, 5, 'seat of Christ, that I was only a good Club member. May God save us from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 17, 8, 5, 'ever getting offended by correction or rebuke.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 17, 9, 5, 'God has given us elders and godly older brothers who love us, who speak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 17, 10, 5, 'God''s word to us in love. They do not spare the rod because they know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 17, 11, 5, 'that fathers who love their children never spare the rod. Such elders');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 17, 12, 5, 'love us, as our heavenly Father loves us. If, then, you rebel or get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 17, 13, 5, 'offended with what such godly older brothers say to you, that would be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 17, 14, 5, 'sure sign that you have Club mentality.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 17, 15, 5, 'The end result will be a lack of spiritual growth. And if there is no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 17, 16, 5, 'spiritual growth in your life, you are backsliding. There is no such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 17, 17, 5, 'thing as being stationary in the Christian life. If we get offended when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 17, 18, 5, 'a godly older brother speaks a word of reproof to us, then we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 17, 19, 5, 'certainly in a backslidden condition - perhaps on our way to hell.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 17, 20, 5, 'Hebrews 12:5-8 encourages us to love the discipline of our heavenly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 17, 21, 5, 'Father, because He does it out of love for us. Likewise, the elders in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 17, 22, 5, 'the church who have the heart of a father (like Paul, in I Corinthians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 17, 23, 5, '4:15) also correct us out of love, so that we don''t backslide and become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 17, 24, 5, 'lost. If we become resentful over this correction, then we prove that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 17, 25, 5, 'have Club mentality. Eventually, we will be the losers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 17, 26, 6, 'Chapter 6 The True Church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 17, 27, 6, 'In the New Covenant, there are a number of words that are new - that are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 17, 28, 6, 'never found in the Old Covenant. One such word is "fellowship".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 18, 1, 6, 'On the day of Pentecost, when three thousand people were born again in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 18, 2, 6, 'mighty revival, they did not decide to have tent-revival-meetings for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 18, 3, 6, 'the next ten days. That is what people do nowadays! Instead, God told');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 18, 4, 6, 'those disciples to shut down the "revival meeting" and to go and build');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 18, 5, 6, 'the church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 18, 6, 6, 'We read in Acts 2:42, that "they devoted themselves to fellowship ".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 18, 7, 6, 'That is the first time that that word comes in the Bible!* It is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 18, 8, 6, 'translation of the Greek word "koinonia", which means " sharing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 18, 9, 6, 'together". (*Note: The Hebrew word translated as "fellowship" in Psalm');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 18, 10, 6, '55:14 actually means "counsel" and not "fellowship")');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 18, 11, 6, 'The Love that Flows from the Cross');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 18, 12, 6, 'This fellowship was the immediate result of those disciples being filled');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 18, 13, 6, 'with the Holy Spirit. When Christians claim to be filled with the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 18, 14, 6, 'Spirit today, they say, "I spoke in tongues", or "I prayed for a sick');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 18, 15, 6, 'person and he was healed (at least, I think he was healed!)", or "I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 18, 16, 6, 'preach eloquently now", etc.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 18, 17, 6, 'But on the day of Pentecost, when they were filled with the Holy Spirit,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 18, 18, 6, 'we read that those believers went away from the revival meeting and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 18, 19, 6, 'built fellowship with one another (Acts 2:42). That must be the primary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 18, 20, 6, 'result of being filled with the Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 18, 21, 6, 'In 1 Corinthians 12:13, we read that, " by one Spirit we are all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 18, 22, 6, 'baptized into one Body". The Church is described there not as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 18, 23, 6, 'Congregation or a Club, but as a Body. "You are Christ''s body and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 18, 24, 6, 'individually members of it" (1 Corinthians 12:27).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 18, 25, 6, 'This body is built on the basis of the cross. This wineskin is the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 18, 26, 6, 'Covenant Church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 18, 27, 6, 'The Congregation is an Old Covenant concept.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 18, 28, 6, 'The Club has no covenant at all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 19, 1, 6, 'But the true Church is built on the basis of the New Covenant.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 19, 2, 6, 'We don''t use the word covenant much nowadays. It means an agreement and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 19, 3, 6, 'a commitment among those who are building the Church of Jesus Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 19, 4, 6, 'They have made a commitment to the Lord their Bridegroom, first of all,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 19, 5, 6, 'and then a commitment to one another. There you have the two planks of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 19, 6, 6, 'the cross - the vertical and the horizontal. They love the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 19, 7, 6, 'fervently first, and then love one another.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 19, 8, 6, 'This is what is symbolized in the "breaking of bread" in a local church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 19, 9, 6, 'We state thereby that we are in fellowship with the Lord and want to die');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 19, 10, 6, 'to Self as He did (1 Corinthians 11:26-28). We also state thereby that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 19, 11, 6, 'we are in fellowship with one another as members of His Body (1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 19, 12, 6, 'Corinthians 10:16, 17). That is why there is one bread, and many of us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 19, 13, 6, 'partaking of it together.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 19, 14, 6, 'Our love for one another is not a human love for those whom we like - "I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 19, 15, 6, 'like you, you like me, we''re a happy family!" No. It comes out of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 19, 16, 6, 'love for the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 19, 17, 6, 'In the same way, it should not be our love for lost humanity that drives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 19, 18, 6, 'us to go out as a missionary to evangelize them. The love that drives us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 19, 19, 6, 'to give them the gospel must flow from our love for the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 19, 20, 6, 'It is this love for the Lord and for others that is shed abroad in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 19, 21, 6, 'hearts by the Holy Spirit (Romans 5:5).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 19, 22, 6, 'Building the True Church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 19, 23, 6, 'I have heard my Dad (Zac Poonen) use this illustration to show the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 19, 24, 6, 'difference between the Old Covenant ministry of the Holy Spirit and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 19, 25, 6, 'New Covenant ministry of the Holy Spirit: In the Old Covenant, man''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 19, 26, 6, 'heart was like a cup with a lid on it (like the veil that closed up the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 19, 27, 6, 'most holy place in the Jewish temple). The Holy Spirit was poured out on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 19, 28, 6, 'this closed lid of the cup and He flowed over it in rivers of blessing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 20, 1, 6, 'to multitudes around - as He did through Moses, John the Baptist, etc.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 20, 2, 6, 'But in the New Covenant, the lid is removed (2 Corinthians 3:12-18).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 20, 3, 6, 'This was symbolized by the veil in the temple being rent when Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 20, 4, 6, 'died, and the way into the Most Holy Place being opened up. Now, when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 20, 5, 6, 'the Spirit is poured out, Hefills the cup first - cleanses the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 20, 6, 6, 'believer''s heart first - and then flows out "from his innermost being"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 20, 7, 6, 'in blessing to multitudes, as Jesus explained in John 7:37-39. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 20, 8, 6, 'how the New Covenant Church is built.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 20, 9, 6, 'If we are still trying to use the Holy Spirit only to preach to others,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 20, 10, 6, 'then we will only build a Congregation or a Club. But if we allow God to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 20, 11, 6, 'fill us and shed abroad His love in our hearts first of all, then He can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 20, 12, 6, 'flow from our innermost being to others. Then we will build the Church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 20, 13, 6, 'with others who also have the same spirit of fellowship. Love for God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 20, 14, 6, 'and for others will overflow from our hearts, and true unity of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 20, 15, 6, 'spirit will be built through each of us taking up the cross.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 20, 16, 6, 'In reality, the true Church is built up primarily when we are away from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 20, 17, 6, 'each other. It is not built only when we gather together at our Sunday');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 20, 18, 6, 'meetings. Yes, it is built there through the gifts of the Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 20, 19, 6, 'But, it is built even more so when we are away from each other. When we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 20, 20, 6, 'are being tempted in some way - to be dishonest, or to be angry, or to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 20, 21, 6, 'lust with our eyes, etc. - that''s where you prove whether you are part');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 20, 22, 6, 'of Jesus'' Church. In these temptations, if we take up our cross, die to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 20, 23, 6, 'ourselves, preserve our devotion to the Lord, and resist sin, then we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 20, 24, 6, 'walk in the light and have fellowship with the Lord. Then, when we meet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 20, 25, 6, 'together with each other, we will have real fellowship with each other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 20, 26, 6, '(I John 1:7).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 20, 27, 6, 'Colossians 2:2 speaks about our hearts being " knit together in love". I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 20, 28, 6, 'cannot knit myself to others, in love. Only the Holy Spirit can do this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 21, 1, 6, 'work of knitting our hearts together. If, however, I try to knit my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 21, 2, 6, 'heart to yours in some human way, by giving you gifts, or by spending');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 21, 3, 6, 'time with you, etc., I will only build aClub. But God says, "Just die to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 21, 4, 6, 'yourself". When I do that, the Holy Spirit will do the work of knitting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 21, 5, 6, 'my heart in an invisible, supernatural way, with the others among whom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 21, 6, 6, 'he has placed me in a local church, who are also dying to themselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 21, 7, 6, 'Our fellowship will then become sweet - not because we believe the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 21, 8, 6, 'doctrines or sing the same songs, but because we have both fallen into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 21, 9, 6, 'the ground and died to our Self-life. We come into fellowship with each');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 21, 10, 6, 'other, thus, through the Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 21, 11, 6, 'Any unity that we have, without dying to Self, will only result in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 21, 12, 6, 'friendship, and not true Christian fellowship. Fellowship is a spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 21, 13, 6, 'thing, but friendship is an earthly thing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 21, 14, 6, 'The people in the world have friendship. The members of many worldly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 21, 15, 6, 'clubs have a lot of close friendship with each other and care for each');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 21, 16, 6, 'other deeply. But they can never have true fellowship - because that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 21, 17, 6, 'a spiritual work that only the Holy Spirit can do in our lives. When God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 21, 18, 6, 'sees any child of His " bearing the dying of Jesus in his body", He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 21, 19, 6, 'rewards him by giving him something more of "the life of Jesus" (2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 21, 20, 6, 'Corinthians 4:10,11). It is this "life of Jesus" within two believers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 21, 21, 6, 'that brings true fellowship between them. And with such people God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 21, 22, 6, 'builds His New Covenant Church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 21, 23, 6, 'When I began to see these truths, I stopped asking the Lord, "Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 21, 24, 6, 'where are the people who want to build Your true Church?" I realized');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 21, 25, 6, 'that God would find them and bring us together - if I myself was first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 21, 26, 6, 'willing to fall into the ground and die. If I refused to die, then God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 21, 27, 6, 'would not bring them to me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 21, 28, 6, 'Trying to find wholehearted believers around us is like trying to find "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 22, 1, 6, 'needles in a haystack". We could spend many years searching in the pile');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 22, 2, 6, 'of hay for those tiny needles in that pile; and perhaps find one needle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 22, 3, 6, 'after many years of effort. But the Lord says, "Don''t waste your time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 22, 4, 6, 'looking for those needles. I know where they are. Just fall into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 22, 5, 6, 'ground and die to yourself." Then the life of Jesus in you will become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 22, 6, 6, 'such a powerful magnet, that it will draw those "needles" (wholehearted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 22, 7, 6, 'disciples) out" (John 1:4, 12:32).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 22, 8, 6, 'Other believers who are also seeking to live a godly life and to build');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 22, 9, 6, 'the New Covenant Church will be drawn to you and to the message of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 22, 10, 6, 'cross that you proclaim. That is God''s way. He brings the wholehearted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 22, 11, 6, 'ones to us. "All whom the Father gives Me will come to Me", Jesus said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 22, 12, 6, 'in John 6:37. And the Father will do the same for us too. That is how we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 22, 13, 6, 'build the New Covenant Church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 22, 14, 6, 'On the Foundation of Personal Sacrifice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 22, 15, 6, 'In Jeremiah 3:14 the Lord says, "I will take you one from a city and one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 22, 16, 6, 'from a home and I will bring you to Zion and there I will give you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 22, 17, 6, 'shepherds after My own heart." What a beautiful promise that is. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 22, 18, 6, 'know you have come to the true Church when you have found shepherds');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 22, 19, 6, 'after God''s own heart. Learn to respect them and don''t get offended when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 22, 20, 6, 'they correct you, because they are seeking to lead you to godliness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 22, 21, 6, 'Ephesians 5:25 says, " Christ loved the church and gave Himself for it".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 22, 22, 6, 'There is no way to build the Church without personal sacrifice. It was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 22, 23, 6, 'great sacrifice that Jesus made when He came from heaven to earth. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 22, 24, 6, 'sacrificed comfort and ease and lived in poverty. But above all, He gave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 22, 25, 6, 'Himself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 22, 26, 6, 'Don''t ever imagine that you can build a New Covenant Church without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 22, 27, 6, 'paying a price. Those who want to build the Church, but don''t want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 22, 28, 6, 'make any sacrifice of money or personal convenience, will only build');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 23, 1, 6, 'aCongregation or a Club.The true Church cannot be built without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 23, 2, 6, 'sacrifice. Christ gaveHimself to build it. We too will have to give up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 23, 3, 6, 'our "Self" to join Him in building it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 23, 4, 6, 'The Lord can use even the smallest and most useless person to build His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 23, 5, 6, 'Church, if that person allows himself to be filled with God''s Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 23, 6, 6, 'Spirit and walks the way of the cross.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 23, 7, 6, 'If you are small in your own eyes, then God says to you today, "You are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 23, 8, 6, 'a small, insignificant grain of wheat. Go and fall into the ground and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 23, 9, 6, 'die." Then you will see the miracle that God will do through you. Your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 23, 10, 6, 'eyes cannot see today and your mind cannot imagine today what God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 23, 11, 6, 'ready to do for you and through you in the coming days (1 Corinthians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 23, 12, 6, '2:9). But, you must love Him enough to listen to His call that is coming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 23, 13, 6, 'to you through this book.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 23, 14, 7, 'Chapter 7 Building up the Church – Being a Giver');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 23, 15, 7, '"The son of Man did not come to be served, but to serve, and to give His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 23, 16, 7, 'life..." (Matthew 20:28)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 23, 17, 7, 'When Jesus lived on earth, His "church" was extremely small. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 23, 18, 7, 'consisted of twelve men, of which one became a traitor. But, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 23, 19, 7, 'remaining eleven were true disciples who had forsaken everything to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 23, 20, 7, 'follow Jesus. As a result, they would turn the world upside down after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 23, 21, 7, 'they were filled with the Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 23, 22, 7, 'Before this, however, they would often argue with each other. At one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 23, 23, 7, 'point, when Jesus told them that He was going to be crucified, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 23, 24, 7, 'disciples immediately did what any earthly-minded person would do when a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 23, 25, 7, 'leader leaves his position - they started to argue about who would take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 23, 26, 7, 'over the leadership (Mark 9:31-34). A short time later, Jesus told them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 23, 27, 7, 'again that He was going to be crucified and raised up on the third day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 23, 28, 7, '(Matthew 20:18-21). Again, the disciples, beginning with James and John,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 24, 1, 7, 'expressed their desire for positions of greatness. They saw Jesus'' being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 24, 2, 7, 'glorified as an opportunity for them also to be lifted up in front of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 24, 3, 7, 'everybody. Jesus replied to them that He " did not come to be served,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 24, 4, 7, 'but to serve, and to give His life…" (v28).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 24, 5, 7, 'Jesus was showing us that there are two types of people in the world -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 24, 6, 7, 'even among those who call themselves "Christians" - the "takers", and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 24, 7, 7, 'the "givers". Christians who have the spirit of this world (Congregation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 24, 8, 7, 'Christians and Club Christians) aretakers who are always looking for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 24, 9, 7, 'what they can get out of Christianity. Those of the true Church, on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 24, 10, 7, 'other hand, are givers. They are always looking for what they can give -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 24, 11, 7, 'first of all to God, and then to others. Jesus said that the givers are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 24, 12, 7, 'the ones who get the most blessing (Acts 20:35).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 24, 13, 7, 'The higher you rise in this world, the more you can expect to be served');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 24, 14, 7, 'by others. The rulers of the world''s governments have people constantly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 24, 15, 7, 'serving them. If you progress in the kingdom of heaven, on the other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 24, 16, 7, 'hand, you will serve others more. Jesus not only taught this, but lived');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 24, 17, 7, 'it out throughout His life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 24, 18, 7, 'In a church, takers always expect others to meet their needs. If their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 24, 19, 7, 'expectations are not met, they will eventually get offended over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 24, 20, 7, 'something or the other and leave the church. Givers, on the other hand,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 24, 21, 7, 'when they see a lack or a need, will take responsibility as members of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 24, 22, 7, 'that church family, and faithfully work with endurance to meet those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 24, 23, 7, 'needs through God''s grace.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 24, 24, 7, 'For example, if there is a lack of love between you and another person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 24, 25, 7, 'in your local church and you feel like your "love cup" is empty: You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 24, 26, 7, 'could view the problem as the other person''s fault, for not pouring');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 24, 27, 7, 'enough love into your relationship to fill up your cup. This is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 24, 28, 7, 'mentality of the taker. Instead, if you have the "giver mindset," you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 25, 1, 7, 'will bring this lack to God, and ask Him to fill your cup. He will then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 25, 2, 7, 'fill it to such overflowing that love will pour out of your life into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 25, 3, 7, 'those around you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 25, 4, 7, 'We read in 2 Corinthians 9:6-8 that God wants to pour out His grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 25, 5, 7, 'abundantly upon us. When reading this verse, it is easy to selfishly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 25, 6, 7, 'think of it as accumulating more and more for ourselves. But if you read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 25, 7, 7, 'this passage carefully, you will see that God gives us such overflowing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 25, 8, 7, 'grace so that we can be givers who do good to others (see the last part');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 25, 9, 7, 'of verse 8).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 25, 10, 7, 'Paul, who wrote this, had laboured in the church in Ephesus for three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 25, 11, 7, 'years. When he said goodbye to them the final time (Acts 20:25-35), he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 25, 12, 7, 'reminded the elders that during that entire time he had lived among them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 25, 13, 7, 'as a giver. That''s why he says that even though he would have been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 25, 14, 7, 'entitled to be financially supported by the church, he refused it. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 25, 15, 7, 'not only provided for his own needs, but also for the needs of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 25, 16, 7, 'others who were with him. He had a "maximum" attitude toward being a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 25, 17, 7, '"giver"! That was why God could use him to the maximum extent in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 25, 18, 7, 'building the Church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 25, 19, 7, 'The reason that many people don''t want to be givers is that it involves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 25, 20, 7, 'sacrifice - a "cup of suffering" - as Jesus explained later on in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 25, 21, 7, 'Matthew 20:22-23. But, the Church can only be built through sacrifice.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 25, 22, 7, 'So, as we see needs in the church around us, let us come to God as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 25, 23, 7, 'thirsty people, and ask God to fill us with His power deep in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 25, 24, 7, 'innermost being. From that innermost place will flow rivers of living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 25, 25, 7, 'water (John 7:37-38) that will water the parched ground around us and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 25, 26, 7, 'build the Church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 25, 27, 8, 'Chapter 8 Tearing Down the Church – Being an Accuser');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 25, 28, 8, 'The foolish [woman] tears [her house] down with her own hands (Proverbs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 26, 1, 8, '14:1)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 26, 2, 8, 'The Bible speaks about two ways by which a house can be torn down. One');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 26, 3, 8, 'is by storms that attack the foolish builder''s house which does not have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 26, 4, 8, 'a solid foundation (Matthew 7:26-27). The other is by a foolish person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 26, 5, 8, 'living inside the house who chips away at the house "brick by brick"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 26, 6, 8, '(Proverbs 14:1 Message) until it comes crashing down.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 26, 7, 8, 'As I observe churches throughout history and in the world today, I see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 26, 8, 8, 'that more churches have been destroyed by its own members tearing them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 26, 9, 8, 'down, than through attacks from outside. In fact, where Satan has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 26, 10, 8, 'persecuted theChurch through external forces, that has usually served');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 26, 11, 8, 'only to preserve the Church in purity. So, Satan is quite content to let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 26, 12, 8, 'Christians themselves do the work of destroying the church from within.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 26, 13, 8, 'Thus, even where God has been able to call people out ofCongregations');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 26, 14, 8, 'and Clubs to form an expression of His Church through a local body of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 26, 15, 8, 'believers, Satan can still eat away at that work from the inside out, if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 26, 16, 8, 'the members of the church are willing to do that work for him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 26, 17, 8, 'Can the Devil succeed in doing this even in a spiritual church?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 26, 18, 8, 'Certainly! He started by doing it in heaven itself - in the very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 26, 19, 8, 'presence of God - when he successfully drew away one-third of the angels');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 26, 20, 8, 'with him in rebellion (Revelation 12:4), causing them to become evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 26, 21, 8, 'spirits. The first century church also experienced this many times in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 26, 22, 8, 'the form of savage wolves (Acts 20:30), and men like Alexander the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 26, 23, 8, 'coppersmith (2 Timothy 4:14-15) and Diotrephes (3 John 1:9-10).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 26, 24, 8, 'In order to avoid this, we must identify the source of these conflicts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 26, 25, 8, 'that tear down churches. James 3:13-4:1 explains this clearly. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 26, 26, 8, 'source of such conflicts is Self-pleasing (4:1), which manifests itself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 26, 27, 8, 'in bitter jealousy and selfish ambition (3:14), and eventually spreads');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 26, 28, 8, 'throughout the church resulting in disorder and every other kind of evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 27, 1, 8, '(3:16). That''s why we are warned in Hebrews 12:15 to ensure that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 27, 2, 8, 'bitterness is dealt with when it is still a root (in the heart and in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 27, 3, 8, 'the thoughts), because if it does actually spring up, it will defile');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 27, 4, 8, 'many.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 27, 5, 8, 'It is important to note that we have only two options (based on Proverbs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 27, 6, 8, '14:1): We are either going to actively build up the church, or we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 27, 7, 8, 'going to tear it down. Actively building up a church is done through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 27, 8, 8, 'love (1 Corinthians 8:1). This means not just saying that we love each');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 27, 9, 8, 'other in the church, but actually living it out (1 John 3:18) and not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 27, 10, 8, 'being hypocritical about it (Romans 12:9). The quality of our love is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 27, 11, 8, 'tested especially in situations of disagreement or conflict, where we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 27, 12, 8, 'prove that we have true love by giving up our "Self-life" for the church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 27, 13, 8, 'like Jesus did (Ephesians 5:25). This also means interceding on behalf');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 27, 14, 8, 'of others in the church like Jesus does for us (Hebrews 7:25).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 27, 15, 8, 'In Revelation 12:10, the Devil is called the " accuser of the brethren."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 27, 16, 8, 'Tearing down a church happens when members of the church partner with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 27, 17, 8, 'him in accusing other believers. We see a picture of this in the life of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 27, 18, 8, 'Zechariah, a young prophet whose calling was to lead God''s people in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 27, 19, 8, 'rebuilding the temple in Jerusalem after their return from captivity in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 27, 20, 8, 'Babylon. In Zechariah 3:1-5, we see Joshua the high priest clothed with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 27, 21, 8, 'filthy garments, and Satan standing beside him to accuse him. Even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 27, 22, 8, 'before the Lord removes Joshua''s filthy garments, He rebukes Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 27, 23, 8, 'first. Then the Lord replaces Joshua''s filthy garments with beautiful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 27, 24, 8, 'new robes. But, why was Zechariah there? It was a test to see which side');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 27, 25, 8, 'he would take - the side of the accuser, or the side of the Intercessor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 27, 26, 8, 'Zechariah shows us what it means to be a builder of God''s house. As soon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 27, 27, 8, 'as Joshua was clothed in beautiful, new garments, Zechariah decides to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 27, 28, 8, 'make him even more glorious by asking for a turban to be put on his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 28, 1, 8, 'head.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 28, 2, 8, 'Today, we face the same test as we seek to build the Church as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 28, 3, 8, 'dwelling place for God. On the one hand, the Devil invites us to be part');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 28, 4, 8, 'of his "tearing down" ministry by allowing accusing thoughts against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 28, 5, 8, 'others to find a root in our hearts, and then spreading it through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 28, 6, 8, 'gossip against others in the church, and eventually splitting a church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 28, 7, 8, 'On the other hand, Jesus invites us to be part of his "building up"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 28, 8, 8, 'ministry in choosing to intercede for others to make them more glorious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 28, 9, 8, '- as He does constantly (Hebrews 7:25). Even where there is sin, our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 28, 10, 8, 'goal must always be to "win our brother" (Matthew 18:15). The Church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 28, 11, 8, 'where this is truly lived out, will have Jesus in its midst, and will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 28, 12, 8, 'thus have complete authority against all the powers of darkness (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 28, 13, 8, '18:18-20).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 28, 14, 9, 'Chapter 9 Caring for the Church – Being a Shepherd');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 28, 15, 9, 'He felt compassion for them because they were like sheep without a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 28, 16, 9, 'shepherd (Matthew 9:36)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 28, 17, 9, 'In Matthew 9:37-38, Jesus said that there were very few workers to reap');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 28, 18, 9, 'the plentiful harvest in the world. He then told us to pray that workers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 28, 19, 9, 'will be sent forth into the harvest fields. Many people use this verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 28, 20, 9, 'to stir people emotionally into rushing out into some evangelistic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 28, 21, 9, 'outreach work. When we read verses 36-38 together however, we see what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 28, 22, 9, 'exactly Jesus meant when He spoke about "workers".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 28, 23, 9, 'When Jesus looked out at the multitude, He saw people with no lack of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 28, 24, 9, 'preachers and teachers (for there were many Pharisees and scribes); no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 28, 25, 9, 'lack of meetings (the people met in the synagogues on the Sabbath as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 28, 26, 9, 'well as at other times); and no lack of miracles (He had already done');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 28, 27, 9, 'many miracles in their midst). What they did lack was shepherds.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 28, 28, 9, 'The same is true today as well. We live in an age where the Bible and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 29, 1, 9, 'doctrinal teachings are readily available in printed format, online, on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 29, 2, 9, 'smartphones, etc., and almost all churches hold services multiple times');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 29, 3, 9, 'during the week. But God is still looking for leaders who will allow Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 29, 4, 9, 'to break their hard Self-focused heart and replace it with a soft');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 29, 5, 9, 'shepherd''s heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 29, 6, 9, 'Way back in Jeremiah 3:14-15, God showed us two important');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 29, 7, 9, 'characteristics of His Church ("Zion"): (i) they would be a diverse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 29, 8, 9, 'people from different cities and families, and (ii) He would give them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 29, 9, 9, 'shepherds after His own heart. What, then, does it mean to be "a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 29, 10, 9, 'shepherd after God''s own heart"?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 29, 11, 9, 'Such a shepherd will have Christ''s compassion. This is more than just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 29, 12, 9, 'human sympathy. This compassion is a spiritual emotion that is motivated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 29, 13, 9, 'by seeing people "harassed and thrown down" (Matthew 9:36 margin) by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 29, 14, 9, 'Devil. This means caring more for their spiritual welfare than for their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 29, 15, 9, 'physical or emotional welfare, and being willing to boldly speak the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 29, 16, 9, 'truth in love.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 29, 17, 9, 'Such a shepherd will be willing to be inconvenienced. Throughout Jesus''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 29, 18, 9, 'life, we see that as the Father directed Him, He always went, even if it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 29, 19, 9, 'meant walking hundreds of miles, having to sleep out in the open, having');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 29, 20, 9, 'to skip a meal, etc. He cared impartially for the famous like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 29, 21, 9, 'synagogue official (Matthew 9:18-19) as well as for the poor like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 29, 22, 9, 'woman with the hemorrhage (Matthew 9:20-22). Jesus lived and died');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 29, 23, 9, '"without a thought for His own welfare" (Isaiah 53:8 Message) - and true');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 29, 24, 9, 'shepherds are those who follow His example in living this way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 29, 25, 9, 'Such a shepherd will stand for the truth uncompromisingly. When the Jews');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 29, 26, 9, 'were taken into captivity in Babylon, one young man, Daniel, purposed in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 29, 27, 9, 'his heart that he would not compromise God''s standards (Daniel 1:8). His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 29, 28, 9, 'quiet boldness shepherded his three companions also to take a bold stand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 30, 1, 9, 'with him (Daniel 1:11).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 30, 2, 9, 'Such a shepherd will partner with the Holy Spirit in being a helper to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 30, 3, 9, 'others in their joy and their faith. This is how Paul describes it:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 30, 4, 9, '"We''re not in charge of how you live out the faith, looking over your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 30, 5, 9, 'shoulders, suspiciously critical. We''re partners, working alongside you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 30, 6, 9, 'joyfully expectant. I know that you stand by your own faith, not by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 30, 7, 9, 'ours" (2 Corinthians 1:24 Message).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 30, 8, 9, 'Such a shepherd will have spiritual authority. This is something only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 30, 9, 9, 'God can attest to, and it comes from the fact that when "the prince of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 30, 10, 9, 'this world" (Satan) comes, there is no area of our lives in which he has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 30, 11, 9, 'a foothold (John 14:30).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 30, 12, 9, 'Such a shepherd will have a compulsion to preach the full gospel of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 30, 13, 9, 'kingdom of God. Many preachers like to speak on popular topics, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 30, 14, 9, 'tickle the ears of their listeners (2 Timothy 4:3-4). Such men aren''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 30, 15, 9, 'shepherds. Paul, on the other hand, took his calling so seriously that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 30, 16, 9, 'he said he would have blood on his hands if he did not declare "the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 30, 17, 9, 'whole purpose of God" (Acts 20:26-27).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 30, 18, 9, 'Such a shepherd will lay down his life for the sheep. This means that he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 30, 19, 9, 'fearlessly stays with the sheep until the end, even if it means giving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 30, 20, 9, 'up his preferences, his needs, his comforts, or his agenda. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 30, 21, 9, 'contrasted this shepherding heart with that of a hireling who, when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 30, 22, 9, 'things get inconvenient or trouble comes, leaves the sheep and flees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 30, 23, 9, 'because he is not concerned about the sheep (John 10:11-13). When Paul');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 30, 24, 9, 'examined the lives of his coworkers, he realized that all of them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 30, 25, 9, 'ultimately sought after their own interests. Only Timothy had a kindred');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 30, 26, 9, 'spirit to him in having the heart of a shepherd, because he was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 30, 27, 9, 'genuinely concerned for the welfare of the flock (Philippians 2:19-21).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 30, 28, 9, 'Who Will Go For Us?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 31, 1, 9, 'I remember many years ago, the Lord asked me who were the shepherds to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 31, 2, 9, 'whom I submitted, who watched over my soul and could give account of my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 31, 3, 9, 'life with joy (Hebrews 13:17). I saw the example in Jesus'' life who,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 31, 4, 9, 'because He faithfully submitted to every authority under whom the Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 31, 5, 9, 'asked Him to submit - especially during His first thirty years -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 31, 6, 9, 'therefore had true spiritual authority (Matthew 8:8-9). I saw that with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 31, 7, 9, 'this spiritual authority, though beaten and bleeding, Jesus could boldly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 31, 8, 9, 'stand in front of even Pilate; and when Pilate tried to scare Jesus with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 31, 9, 9, 'how much power he had, Jesus quietly said, "You would have no authority');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 31, 10, 9, 'over Me, unless it had been given you from above" (John 19:10).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 31, 11, 9, 'As the eyes of my heart were opened up to see the truth in these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 31, 12, 9, 'Scriptures, a fire was ignited in me to find Zion, the Church, where God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 31, 13, 9, 'would give me such true shepherds. I decided that no matter what the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 31, 14, 9, 'earthly cost - relatives, job, etc. - I would give myself wholeheartedly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 31, 15, 9, 'to building the Body of Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 31, 16, 9, 'As with Isaiah, after God had cleansed me also of all sin and broken me,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 31, 17, 9, 'He asked me, "Whom shall I send, and who will go for Us?" (Isaiah 6:8).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 31, 18, 9, 'I have never regretted that decision I took in 2007, regardless of what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 31, 19, 9, 'the circumstances of the work before me looked like.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 31, 20, 9, 'If you have heard the call of God today to come out from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 31, 21, 9, 'theCongregations and Clubs in Babylon and build HisChurch in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 31, 22, 9, 'spiritual "Zion", I hope your answer will also be, "Here am I. Send me!"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 31, 23, 9, 'Amen.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 31, 24, 9, 'Share');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 31, 25, 9, 'Who Am I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 31, 26, 9, 'Our Message');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 31, 27, 9, 'Resources');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 31, 28, 9, 'Study Series');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_congregation_the_club_and_the_church', 32, 1, 9, 'About us');
